#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/Items/DeadArcheologistLetter_Name_String
msgctxt "636412f7-763a-4809-b2cd-49c79d52acf6"
msgid "A Crumpled Letter"
msgstr "구겨진 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/Items/DeadArcheologistLetter_String
msgctxt "6dad4f64-dd62-4b14-8337-4913c21fab14"
msgid ""
"\"My Dear Kennoth Plamer,\n"
"With your desire to pursue a new archaeological mission in mind, I spent a "
"few hours in my library today and identified a location worthy of your "
"research. In the northeastern part of the River Kingdoms lies a region "
"called the Stolen Lands. Many antiquities can be found in such places. No "
"doubt an inquisitive researcher would be able to find old coins, significant "
"cultural remnants, and even pieces of artifacts that might be restored. "
"Naturally, you shall require the services of a specialist to evaluate your "
"findings during your travels. I've no doubt of your ability to recruit such "
"a specialist once you arrive in the Stolen Lands. Such contacts can "
"typically be made in large cities or settlements. You would not want your "
"return journey encumbered with items of scant value or interest, after all.\n"
"Before you set off, it is my obligation to warn you that this place is "
"untamed and can be perilous. Watch not only for bandits and monsters, but "
"also impassable swamps and dangerous open plains. Should you decide to visit "
"the Stolen Lands, I strongly urge you, Kennoth, to hire a professional "
"guide, and better yet — guards. It is wise to take precautions.\n"
"I should appreciate it greatly if you return with a few amusing curiosities "
"for me, as a token of our friendship.\n"
"Your true friend,\n"
"Agneth Bregan\""
msgstr ""
"\"친애하는 케노스 플라머\n"
"새로운 고고학 사명을 추구하려는 욕망을 가지고 나는 오늘 도서관에서 몇 시간을 보냈고 당신의 연구에 적합한 장소를 확인했습니다. 강의 "
"왕국들의 동북부에는 도둑맞은 땅이라 불리는 곳이 있습니다. 많은 유물이 그런 장소에서 발견될 수 있습니다. 호기심 많은 연구자가 오래된 "
"동전, 중요한 문화의 흔적, 복원될 수 있는 유물을 발견할 수 있을 것임은 틀림 없습니다. 여행 중 발견한 물건들을 평가할 전문가가 "
"필요할 것입니다. 일단 당신이 도둑맞은 땅에 도착하면 전문가를 충분히 모집할 수 있을 것입니다. 그러한 접촉은 일반적으로 대도시나 "
"정착촌에서 이루어질 수 있습니다. 가치없는 물품을 가지고 여행에서 복귀하고 싶지는 않을 것입니다.\n"
"출발하기 전에 이 장소는 길들여지지 않았고 위험한 곳임을 알려드립니다. 산적과 괴물뿐 아니라 통행할 수 없는 늪과 위험한 평야를 "
"조심하십시오. 도둑맞은 땅을 방문하기로 결정했다면 당신에게 전문 가이드 내지 경비원을 고용하기를 강력히 권합니다. 예방 조치를 취하는 "
"것이 현명합니다.\n"
"우정의 표시로 나에게 몇 가지 재미있는 물품을 보여주신다면 감사하겠습니다.\n"
"당신의 진정한 친구\n"
"아그네스 브리간 \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/Items/MadAlchemistNotesName_String
msgctxt "30858186-1b67-40f2-95e0-e1af66f03eb8"
msgid "Lab Journal"
msgstr "실험실 일지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/Items/MadAlchemistNotes_String
msgctxt "a5a60fac-f5c5-4524-8f27-695dd52e4e62"
msgid ""
"\"Went into the woods. Found many roots, pine cones, flowers — and a dead "
"squirrel. Scant little I can make of that! I must consider where I might "
"gain rarer ingredients for my experiments.\n"
"...\n"
"Some damnable racoons got into the hut while I was exploring the woods. "
"Broke all the glassware. The only things left are ten flat-bottom glass "
"tubes, five round-bottom flasks, a couple porcelain mortars, three pestles "
"and the precious spiral. — A good thing all the pots are still there. So "
"many good chemicals wasted! Shame. Need to lock everything up in the closet."
"\n"
"...\n"
"Tried to finish the experiment today, the one I started at the old lab. Used "
"the lead powder from the master's box. At the crystallization stage the "
"liquid foamed, changed color and formed a deposit. Another unsuccessful "
"experiment — and I've all but exhausted my supply of essential materials.\n"
"...\n"
"Caught a racoon with a snare trap. Didn't get the bastard to the hut in "
"time. Perhaps I should ask some hunters for help in catching experimental "
"subjects? But I must save money, and besides, I see how those bumpkins scowl "
"at me. As if I've grown horns!\n"
"...\n"
"Third attempt at the crystallization experiment. Broke the last round bottom "
"flask. — I recall my tutor calling me ham-handed and making me clean up. "
"Perhaps he was right. But he did teach me much, despite everything. But why "
"didn't he wish me to develop my abilities? Didn't he want me to learn "
"anything beyond the basic potion recipes?! Kept saying I wasn't ready, but "
"in truth he feared the student surpassing the teacher, and for good reason: "
"I shall prove this process works. I'll prove it to everyone.\n"
"...\n"
"Today an old lady came from the nearby village, asking me to make her goats "
"yield more milk. I had to help — I'm in desperate need of money. Oh, why "
"must I spend my time so?\n"
"...\n"
"Boring, boring, BORING!\"\n"
"Several pages remain empty, then the writings continue.\n"
"\"Observation day 1\n"
"Finally. I finally got a chance I can't miss. I found a dying elf in the "
"woods. She was barely breathing, and ants were swarming all over her. Who is "
"she? What happened to her?\n"
"It matters not: this is the opportunity I've been waiting for.\n"
"With great effort I managed to drag her to the hut, remove her clothes and "
"hide her behind the bags in the corner. Enough wasting my talents on trifles "
"— it's time for action.\n"
"Used the largest glass tube from the master's box, the one with the warning ("
"\"In case of contact with skin, wash off immediately\"! Ha! The dottering "
"parrot of all the standard warnings.) I spread it evenly over her body, and "
"began my observations.\n"
"Observation day 3\n"
"The subject has survived. Had to tie her up and gag her — the moaning could "
"attract unwanted attention. Her skin is changing, but… it's hard to "
"determine the precise character of these changes. The early stages of "
"festering, perhaps? The treated areas do smell faintly.\n"
"Observation day 5\n"
"The changes continue, faster and faster. The epidermis has festered away, "
"the joints are grown swollen, tough and calloused. — And the subject has a "
"fever.\n"
"Observation day 9\n"
"Over the past few days, the subject's legs became covered with mildew and "
"moss. Her fingers and toes grow long and crooked — as though she would grow "
"into the ground? I shall move the subject outside. The experiment now "
"demands sunlight.\n"
"Observation day 13\n"
"The body's changes are so significant, it's impossible to recall the "
"creature's original appearance, from the way it looks now. A seething growth "
"covers the whole body's surface. Every day I find new kinds of moss, mildew, "
"grass and other plants.\n"
"The subject attempts to move. Had to immobilize her. I try to make contact, "
"but she utters inarticulate sounds, alike to howling. Might intelligence be "
"restored at a further stage of regeneration?\n"
"Observation day 18\n"
"The subject has grown larger, several times. She is now… strangely quiet "
"these last few days. I'm beginning to worry: in the end I see I've become "
"attached to her. She will make me famous!\n"
"Observation day 25\n"
"My living experiment shows all signs of obedience. She is much like a little "
"tree — a magnificent walking tree! She is already eight feet tall, and the "
"child keeps growing! I wish to give her space, more fresh air and sunlight. "
"I suspect we shall need some fertilizer… For now, I only walk her around the "
"woods on a leash.\n"
"This is the greatest achievement of my career! Soon we'll be ready for a "
"journey to Absalom, and there… there I will present my masterpiece. I must "
"think of a name for my girl...\""
msgstr ""
"\"숲 속으로 들어갔다. 많은 양의 뿌리들과, 솔방울, 꽃, 죽은 다람쥐를 발견했다. 내가 할 수있는 것은 거의 없다! 난 실험을 위해 "
"더 희귀한 재료를 얻을 수 있는 곳을 고려해야 한다.\n"
"...\n"
"몇몇 망할 라쿤들이 내가 숲을 탐험하는 동안 오두막에 들어갔다. 부서진 유리 그릇들. 유일하게 남아있는 것들은 10개의 평평한 바닥 "
"유리관, 5개의 둥근 바닥 플라스크, 한 개의 도자기 절구, 세 개의 유봉과 소중한 나선형입니다. - 화분들이 모두 무사하다는 것은 좋은 "
"일입니다. 너무 많은 화학품이 낭비되었다. 이 얼마나 유감인가. 전부 옷장에 넣고 잠글 필요가 있었다..\n"
"...\n"
"난 오늘 실험을 끝내려, 오래된 실험실로 갔다. 주인의 상자에서 납 분말을 사용했습니다. 결정화 레벨에 액체 발포, 색상 변경 및 예금을 "
"형성했다. 또 다른 성공하지 못했던 실험 - 필수 재료 공급분을 다 써 버렸습니다.\n"
"...\n"
"달팽이 함정으로 라쿤을 잡았습니다. 오두막에 들어온 놈을 제 때 잡지는 못했지만. 사냥꾼들에게 실험 대상을 잡는 데 도움을 받을 걸 "
"그랬나? 하지만 돈을 아껴야하고, 게다가 그 범프킨이 나를 째려보지 뭐야. 나한테 뿔이 자라나기라도 한 것처럼!\n"
"...\n"
"결정화 실험에서 세 번째 시도. 마지막 단계에서 바닥 플라스크가 부셔졌다. - 가정교사가 나를 햄주먹이라고 부르면서 정리하라고 시켰던 "
"기억이 나. 그가 옳았을지도 몰라. 그러나 그는 모든 것에도 불구하고 나를 많이 가르쳤다. 그런데 그는 왜 내 능력 개발을 반대한걸까? "
"내가 기본적인 물약 제조법을 이상을 배우는 것을 왜 원하지 않았을까?! 내가 준비가 되어 있지 않다고 말했지만, 사실은 학생이 선생님을 "
"능가하는 것이 두려웠던 거고 정당한 이유였지: 나는 이 과정이 효과가 있음을 증명할 것이다. 나는 그것을 모든 사람에게 증명할 것이다.\n"
"...\n"
"오늘 한 노부인이 근처 마을에서 와서 염소를 더 많이 만들도록 요구했습니다. 나는 돈을 절실히 필요로했습니다. 왜 내 시간을 그렇게 "
"보내야하지?\n"
"...\n"
"지루하고 지루하며 보링!\"\n"
"몇몇 페이지는 비어 있고, 그 후에 쓰기는 계속된다.\n"
"\"관측 일 1\n"
"마침내. 나는 놓칠 수없는 기회를 마침내 얻었다. 나는 숲속에서 죽어가는 엘프를 발견했다. 그녀는 간신히 숨을 쉬고 있었고, 개미가 "
"그녀를 휩쓸고 지나갔습니다. 그녀는 누구인가? 그녀에게 무슨 일이 일어 났니?\n"
"중요한 것은 아닙니다. 이것이 내가 기다리고 있는 기회입니다.\n"
"큰 노력으로 나는 그녀를 오두막으로 끌고 갔고, 그녀의 옷을 벗고, 그녀를 구석에 있는 가방 뒤에 숨겼습니다. 사소한 일에 내 재능을 "
"낭비하는 것만으로도 행동의 시간입니다.\n"
"주인의 상자에서 가장 큰 유리 튜브를 사용했습니다. 경고가있는 것 ( \"피부에 닿았을 때 즉시 씻어주십시오!\"하하! 모든 표준 경고의 "
"산란 앵무새.) 나는 몸에 고르게 퍼지고, 내 관찰을 시작했다.\n"
"관찰 일 3\n"
"피험자는 살아 남았습니다. 그녀를 묶어서 개그를 댔다 - 신음 소리가 원치 않는 관심을 끌 수있었습니다. 그녀의 피부는 변화하고 "
"있지만... 이러한 변화의 정확한 특성을 파악하기는 어렵습니다. 아마도 얼간이의 초기 단계일까요? 치료 부위는 희미하게 냄새가납니다.\n"
"관찰 일 5\n"
"변경 사항은 더 빠르고 더 빠르게 계속됩니다. 표피가 떨어져 나갔고, 관절이 부어 오르고 거칠며 염증이났습니다. - 그리고 피사체에 열이 "
"있습니다.\n"
"관측 일 9\n"
"지난 며칠 동안, 환자의 다리는 곰팡이와 이끼로 덮여있었습니다. 그녀의 손가락과 발가락은 길고 구부러진 것처럼 - 마치 그녀가 땅에 "
"자라는 것처럼? 나는 그 주제를 바깥으로 옮길 것이다. 실험은 이제 햇빛을 요구합니다.\n"
"관측 일 13\n"
"몸의 변화는 매우 중요합니다. 지금 보이는 모습에서 생물의 원래 모습을 기억하는 것은 불가능합니다. 급격한 성장은 전신의 표면을 덮는다. "
"매일 나는 새로운 종류의 이끼, 곰팡이, 잔디 및 다른 식물을 찾습니다.\n"
"대상이 이동하려고합니다. 그녀를 움직이지 않게해야했다. 나는 접촉하려고 애를 씁니다.하지만 그녀는 울부 짖는 소리와 같은 비 음파의 "
"소리를냅니다. 더 많은 재생성 레벨에 지능이 회복 될 수 있습니까?\n"
"관측 일 18\n"
"피험자는 여러 번 더 크게 자랐습니다. 그녀는 지금... 지난 며칠 동안 이상하게 조용합니다. 나는 걱정하기 시작했습니다. 결국 나는 "
"그녀에게 붙어있는 것을 봅니다. 그녀는 저를 유명하게 만들 것입니다!\n"
"관측 일 25\n"
"나의 살아있는 실험은 순종의 모든 징표를 보여줍니다. 그녀는 작은 나무와 매우 흡사합니다 - 장엄한 산책 나무! 그녀는 이미 키가 8 "
"특기이고 아이는 계속 자랍니다! 나는 그녀의 공간, 더 신선한 공기와 햇빛을주고 싶다. 나는 우리가 비료를 필요로 할 것 같아. 지금은, "
"나는 가죽 끈으로 숲을 걷는다.\n"
"이것은 내 경력의 가장 위대한 업적입니다! 곧 우리는 압살롬에 갈 준비가 되어있을 것입니다. 그리고 저기에... 저의 걸작을 선물 할 "
"것입니다. 내 여자 이름을 생각해야 해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/Items/MadAlchemist_NametagOnMoundName_String
msgctxt "8a295669-575d-4239-b111-e462c9ae0c5f"
msgid "Engraved Silver Pendant"
msgstr "새겨진 은 펜던트"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/Items/MadAlchemist_NametagOnMound_String
msgctxt "2940c162-f60b-40ec-bcbe-3f92cc228ca2"
msgid ""
"A silver pendant, found tied to a branch on the shambling mound. The name "
"\"Bertha\" is engraved upon it."
msgstr "샘블링 마운드의 가지에 묶여있던 은제 펜던트입니다. \"브레다\"라는 이름이 새겨져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "ea428ed8-6b92-4ed0-9b94-25aa749f41ac"
msgid "\"Stop! What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐! 여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "900d7693-2cf5-4503-a93e-3366c0d0874b"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't wish to suffer such creatures on my future lands!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"곧 내 땅이 될 곳에서 이런 놈들에게 골치 썩기 싫다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "3993b8d3-f620-40f8-a4b7-4220f720eebe"
msgid "[Observe and do not interfere]"
msgstr "[지켜보면서 끼어들지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "1c54a18d-734e-402d-a2f4-86b21a0148d6"
msgid "\"Kobolds, tell me more about what happened.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트, 무슨 일이 있었는지 좀 더 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "5291bb87-e726-41c0-9b10-13942931a7fe"
msgid "\"You should make peace and search for the relic together.\""
msgstr "\"화해하고 함께 유물을 찾아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "fbeee0f4-dd50-49e2-be45-c3211a44d05f"
msgid "\"I side with the kobolds and Chief Sootscale.\""
msgstr "\"나는 코볼트와 그들의 족장 검댕비늘의 편을 들겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "c2b555ad-b8a4-4073-b024-523f17620b61"
msgid "\"I side with the mites and Queen Bdaah.\""
msgstr "\"나는 마이트와 그들의 여왕 브다의 편을 들겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "1ca9ca6d-152d-4d7c-bf72-f553c476af3d"
msgid "\"You are all disgusting, I don't want to help either of you.\""
msgstr "\"너희 모두 역겨워. 둘 모두 돕고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4488d421-5381-48d9-ab05-ca18fc93f71a"
msgid ""
"Decided to act as a neutral arbiter in confrontation between mites and "
"kobolds."
msgstr "마이트와 코볼트 사이의 대결에서 중립적 중재자로 활동하기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "9c8d87a7-e391-4106-bab2-2cd54088e876"
msgid ""
"\"This quarrel is your own. I have no wish to be a part of it. However, if "
"you allow me to visit your domains, I shall strive to learn the truth.\""
msgstr "\"이건 너희들의 싸움이다. 참견하고 싶지 않아. 하지만 너희 영역을 돌아다니도록 허락한다면 진실을 알아내도록 노력해볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "e7eeb8b3-7965-4115-98e3-b96e3edbde98"
msgid "\"Mites, I want to ask you a few questions.\""
msgstr "\"마이트. 너에게 몇 가지 질문을 하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "4866cb79-5d1b-4e91-98b0-44ac123124f1"
msgid "\"How do you know the relic was stolen by the mites?\""
msgstr "\"그 유물이 마이트에 의해 도난당한 것이라는 사실을 어떻게 알 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "136e1fd0-7ea6-4e8e-9a0e-e0d7d535196c"
msgid "\"What is this relic?\""
msgstr "\"이 유물은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "72683826-18f4-40c8-8be8-91c11ca9d527"
msgid "\"Did you really attack the mites?\""
msgstr "\"정말로 마이트를 공격했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "7f7eb992-8f9d-411b-a5e5-28b1c9049eb4"
msgid "\"It's clear to me now.\""
msgstr "\"이제 확실해졌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "64ca8ede-bd9e-4642-9cca-13163664518b"
msgid "\"And where is 'shaman Tartuk' now?\""
msgstr "\"이제 샤먼 타툭은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "e3947edf-b465-4888-98c3-e81f6d776620"
msgid "\"Tartuk is not a real kobold. He deceived you.\""
msgstr "\"타툭은 진짜 코볼트가 아니야. 그는 너를 속였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "faf96a96-f155-4075-9bcb-773ec2fcf616"
msgid "\"My Queen, why did you fight the kobolds?\""
msgstr "\"브다. 왜 코볼트와 싸웠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "206960a0-93ce-487a-a50f-127b647002e0"
msgid "\"Why do you need the relic?\""
msgstr "\"왜 유물이 필요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "d60447e3-e037-4031-bf2b-a493fbd620a6"
msgid "\"Why do the kobolds think the relic was stolen by the mites?\""
msgstr "\"왜 코볼트는 유물이 마이트에 의해 도난당한 것으로 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "3d3b68a2-b5c3-4910-9ccd-93dde1d4bc71"
msgid "\"Do you know where this purple-scaled shaman is now?\""
msgstr "\"보라색 피부의 샤먼이 지금 어디 있는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "a2c5b6f4-f171-48a8-960f-bd989b38cbc2"
msgid "\"Very well. I have no more questions.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나는 더 이상 질문하지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "c5523c72-0879-409f-a319-423668231ba4"
msgid "\"I would hear my companion's advice.\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 동료의 조언을 듣겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "ce7d207f-f7c1-4d5b-94bf-caacec63dc3e"
msgid "\"Ha ha! Great!\""
msgstr "\"하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "0abc035a-d5d2-430c-b801-836be59f4055"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know why Choral the Conqueror razed half of Rostland? It was for "
"puns like that!\""
msgstr "\"왜 정복자 코랄이 로스틀랜드의 절반을 파괴한지 알아? 그냥 재미삼아서 파괴한 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Answer_0104_Text
msgctxt "dbeb81ad-dd34-4576-9ec7-788a83a04d81"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b1412092-9b5a-4986-ad02-72a7df838faa"
msgid ""
"\"Why support either? Do you think they'll ever listen to you? Let us battle "
"these little ones, both groups, and be done with it!\""
msgstr "\"왜 그놈들을 돕는 거야? 그놈들이 네 말을 들을 거라 생각해? 이 쪼그만 녀석들과 싸워서 끝내버리자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "59d9da7c-7cc1-4bce-a6a1-96c654efbdca"
msgid "\"Cowardly traitorsss! Sssonsss of a pike! Return the relic!\""
msgstr "\"비겁한 배신자! 쉬익! 생선 같은 놈들! 유물을 돌려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MiteSeneschal
msgctxt "e6024655-ff93-4f20-8f85-6cc20a3f7856"
msgid ""
"\"Silly, silly kobold, go look your relic your dungeon! Look under bed, "
"under table. Ha-ha, silly kobold have no bed and no table? Search your eggs! "
"You lose relic, and blame mites! Accuse Queen!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어리석은 코볼트. 너희 던전에 유물이 있다. 가서 침대고 탁자고 찾아 보라구. 아. 코볼트는 침대나 탁자가 없지? 헛간을 찾아보든가! "
"유물을 잃어버리고 마이트를 비난하는 건 말도 안 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "71ecdad3-c70e-4f24-b1a2-0ad53589c618"
msgid ""
"\"Liesss! Chief Sssootssscale not sssilly!\" {n}The kobold leader shakes his "
"weapon at the insult.{/n}"
msgstr "\"쉬익! 거짓말! 검댕비늘 거짓말 안 한다!\" {n}코볼트 지도자는 화가 나서 무기를 허공에 휘두릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : MiteSeneschal
msgctxt "6d4874ea-b5ee-4af0-bad1-23f9148bba18"
msgid ""
"{n}The little mite jumps in place.{/n} \"Stranger! Stranger! You see, yes? "
"Silly kobold attack mite! Insult us, our magnificent Queen!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}작은 마이트가 폴짝 뜁니다.{/n} \"이방인! 이방인! 너도 봤지? 바보 같은 코볼트가 마이트 공격했다! 우리 여왕 공격했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "ac830504-00b6-4d3e-bd0a-e260443a813b"
msgid ""
"\"Liesss! Mite thief! Sssteal relic from kobold! We revenge! Help usss, "
"ssstranger!\""
msgstr "\"쉬이익! 거짓말! 마이트 도둑이다! 코볼트에게서 유물 훔쳤다! 우리 복수한다! 쉭! 우리 도와라. 이방인!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "8b99fad4-e7f2-43ea-8c34-26372d086840"
msgid ""
"\"I Chief! I name Sssootssscale. Kobold and mite live here long, live "
"peaccce! But now mite thief! Sssteal our relic!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나 족장이다! 나 이름 검댕비늘이다. 코볼트와 마이트 오랫동안 평화롭게 살았다! 이제 마이트 도둑이다! 우리 보물 훔쳤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "0765c35b-187f-446e-9017-7a3f3eada487"
msgid "\"Help kobold! Kobold ssstong, fierccce!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트 도와라! 코볼트 찌른다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "4d346258-cd8c-4ac3-b908-855b098cab31"
msgid ""
"\"Mite tricksssy! But Chief Sssootssscale is more tricksssy! I call. New "
"ssshaman come. Ssshaman Tartuk know who ssstole relic. Tartuk good!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마이트 교활하다! 쉭! 하지만 족장 검댕비늘은 왕 교활하다! 새로운 샤먼 온다. 쉬익! 샤먼 타툭 누가 훔쳤는지 안다. 타툭 좋다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "299b318e-f398-4d20-b708-40f842b1b74c"
msgid ""
"\"Sssootssscale not ssstupid! He know real kobold!\" {n}The chief puffs up "
"his chest, rejecting the insult.{/n}"
msgstr "\"쉬이익! 검댕비늘 바보 아니다! 진짜 코볼트가 뭔지 안다!\" {n}족장은 코웃음을 치며 모욕을 무시합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "56f139a6-39bb-46a6-9099-7b98892d2f17"
msgid "\"Relic key! Kobold take relic, enter sssacred hall!\""
msgstr "\"유물 열쇠! 코볼트는 유물을 가져다가 쉭, 신성한 회장에 갔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "6d63a5b3-b587-44d6-8ddd-41ef579e7613"
msgid ""
"\"Revenge! Mite coward! Kobold come, mite run! We come, take them relic, go. "
"Let they give back our relic, we give back their!\""
msgstr ""
"\"복수! 겁쟁이 마이트한테! 코볼트가 와서 마이트 도망쳐! 우리가 와서 저놈들 유물을 가져가. 저놈들이 우리 유물 돌려주면 우리도 그들 "
"유물 다시 준다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "9958a9c0-b3bd-4099-b3fa-265eda1b3397"
msgid ""
"\"Ssshaman was dungeon. Did not enter sssacred hall. Mite collapsse our "
"entranccce! Kobold wrath mite!\""
msgstr "\"쉭, 샤먼 던전에 있었다. 신성한 회장 가지 않았다. 마이트 우리 입구 부셨다! 코볼트 마이트에게 화낸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : MiteSeneschal
msgctxt "277095cd-2920-4b4b-8b86-216de5f884d7"
msgid ""
"{n}A small mite bows comically.{/n} \"I seneschal Vaggik. Here our "
"magnificent Warrior Queen Bdaah!\" {n}He points at his large companion, "
"adorned with the hide of a wolf.{/n} \"Queen defeat scary wolf battle, "
"vanquish hundred enemies, charm hundred hearts! Queen Bdaah allow you speak "
"her. May sit. We understand,\" {n}he says generously.{/n} \"Legs tremble "
"when see such beauty\"."
msgstr ""
"{n}작은 마이트가 우스꽝스럽게 인사합니다.{/n} \"나 청지기 바지크다. 여기는 우리 위대한 전사 여왕 브다다!\" {n}그는 늑대의 "
"가죽을 두른 거대한 동료를 가리킵니다.{/n} \"여왕은 무서운 늑대 이기고 백 마리 적 이기고 백 명의 마음 뺏었다! 여왕 브다가 너 "
"말해도 좋다 했다. 앉아라.\" {n}그는 관대하게 말합니다.{/n} \"미녀 만나면 다리 떨려서 앉는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "0ccdb56c-52d5-471c-9e9e-1d40bd920cdc"
msgid ""
"{n}The mite Queen shakes her head sadly.{/n} \"We live here long, kobolds "
"and mites. We live peace, friends, trade. Together hunt good shaggy animal, "
"gut it. Sweet! Long ago Chief kobold and our old King make good alliance. "
"Two branch Old Sycamore we take, charm and give each to other. This be "
"relic. Kobold have one, mite have one. Not long ago kobold come, yell we "
"thief, take our relic! Silly kobold.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마이트 여왕은 슬프게 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"우리 코볼트와 마이트는 여기서 오래 살았다. 우리는 친구로서 평화롭게 교역하며 "
"살았다. 함께 털복숭이 동물도 잡고 나눠먹었다. 달콤했다! 오래 전에 대장 코볼트와 우리의 왕이 동맹을 맺었다. 우리는 오래된 시카모어 "
"나뭇가지를 나눠가졌다. 그것이 유물이다. 코볼트와 마이트 하나씩 가졌다. 얼마 전에 코볼트가 와서 우리보고 도둑이라고 하며 우리의 유물을 "
"뺏는다. 멍청한 코볼트들.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "8dbfece9-68dd-472f-a8f1-30fe10e6fe67"
msgid ""
"\"Two relic. They key, give entrance to sacred hall. There, under Old "
"Sycamore. One key for kobold, one key for mite. Each can go hall. All fair.\""
msgstr ""
"\"두개의 유물이다. 그것은 열쇠가 되어 신성한 곳의 입구를 연다. 오래된 시카모어 나무 아래에 있다. 열쇠 하나는 코볼트에게 다른 "
"하나는 마이트에게 주었다. 둘 다 신성한 곳 갈 수 있다. 공정하게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "eeca5a0f-f4b1-4fc0-a3ea-e08cf49df2e3"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold Chief silly ugly old.\" {n}Seneschal and other mites giggle at "
"these words.{/n} \"He lose last mind, listen new shaman Tartuk. Shaman not "
"so ugly,\" {n}Bdaah smacks her lips in approval.{/n} \"But angry, tricksy, "
"say wicked mite. I catch him and make crown from his scale. Pretty crown, "
"purple!\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트 대장 멍청하고 추한 노인네다.\" {n}청지기와 다른 마이트가 그 말을 듣고 웃습니다.{/n} \"그는 미쳐서 새로운 샤먼 "
"타툭의 말 듣는다. 샤먼은 그리 못생기지 않았다.\" {n}브다는 동의의 뜻으로 침묵합니다.{/n} \"하지만 화내고 까다롭고 마이트 "
"꾀어낸다. 그를 잡아서 피부로 왕관을 만들 거다. 보라색으로 된 예쁜 왕관!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "45b725d9-00c0-43cb-9fc5-9d96c721125c"
msgid ""
"\"He prowl dungeon near our house. We see he once, but not catch. Want find "
"shaman — look under ground.\""
msgstr "\"그는 우리 집 근처의 던전을 배회한다. 우리는 그 한 번 만났지만 못잡았다. 샤먼 찾고 싶으면 지하로 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "783e1a24-3819-4883-9ac4-672995f8e17e"
msgid ""
"{n}Queen Bdaah nods with a queenly air.{/n} \"Stranger good. Fight kobold "
"with me. Win, come my chamber. We make feast, play music, throw knife in "
"furry squirrel. Sweet!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여왕 브다는 위엄있게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"이방인 착하다. 함께 코볼트와 싸운다. 이기면 내 방으로 와라. 우리 연회 열고 "
"노래 연주한다. 털복숭이 다람쥐에게 나이프 던진다. 재밌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "d9b1c61d-bf1b-4336-b245-041451ce4e66"
msgid ""
"{n}The mite Queen scratches her nose with the tip of her sword.{/n} \"We "
"accept. Stranger go peace our land. But we know truth already. Kobold must "
"pay for his stupid!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마이트 여왕은 칼끝으로 코를 긁습니다.{/n} \"우리는 받아들인다. 이방인은 우리 땅 평화롭게 해준다. 하지만 우리 진실을 이미 "
"알고 있다. 코볼트는 멍청하니 혼나야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "d7309c4f-04e2-46d9-b06f-9d64088e3c78"
msgid ""
"\"Never!\" {n}The chief hisses in animal rage.{/n} \"Deathhh to traitorsss!\""
msgstr "\"안돼!\" {n}족장은 동물처럼 분노하며 위협합니다.{/n} \"쉭, 배신자에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "8680e4bf-0807-4801-ba8f-d6c249ced0a3"
msgid ""
"{n}The mite queen swings her blade.{/n} \"We no retreat! Choose who support, "
"stranger, or enemy us all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마이트 여왕은 그녀의 칼을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"우리는 후퇴하지 않는다! 누구를 도울지 선택해라! 아니면 우리 모두와 적이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "3a687af7-0d45-48a2-994e-5ffcec39330c"
msgid ""
"\"Enough insult, silly lizard. I Bdaah, Warrior Queen, lead my mite to glory!"
"\""
msgstr "\"모욕은 충분히 들었다. 도마뱀. 나 브다. 전사 여왕은 마이트를 이끈다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "f0ecff6b-712e-49f5-9745-994b97995a2b"
msgid ""
"\"Ridiculousss! Pathhhetic thief look for deathhh! I come back with ssshaman "
"Tartuk and shhhow mite pain!\""
msgstr "\"웃기지 마라! 한심한 도둑이 죽고 싶어 한다! 나 샤먼과 올 거다! 타툭과 나, 마이트에게 고통 준다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : MiteSeneschal
msgctxt "30d210c5-f0e2-48a2-93e5-4828633180e3"
msgid "\"Protect Queen!\""
msgstr "\"여왕을 보호하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "61ab93ce-3887-40b3-8049-90212f1c939c"
msgid "\"Kobold fight! Hold ssstranger! I go my ssshaman Tartuk!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트 싸운다! 이방인 잡아라! 나는 샤먼 타툭에게 간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "c3566a60-9eb3-4741-ab26-bad7976d1f40"
msgid ""
"\"Ssstranger go. Find out mite thief! We hit mite! Hit! Hit! I call ssshaman "
"Tartuk from under ground and hit them bad!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이방인 가라. 가서 마이트 도둑 찾아라! 우리 마이트 때려눕힌다! 때려눕힌다! 나 지하에서 샤먼 타툭 불러서 세게 때릴 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "10243f04-7952-4a1b-8c28-2fc66506b0da"
msgid ""
"{n}The mite leader snarls angrily.{/n} \"We not leave! Fighters — hit "
"stranger! Hit silly kobold!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마이트 지도자는 화가 나있습니다.{/n} \"우리는 떠나지 않는다! 전사들아! 이방인을 때려라! 멍청한 코볼트도 때려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "0d381f96-cf73-4011-b5dd-f52686edbb89"
msgid ""
"{n}Chief Sootscale hisses in triumph.{/n} \"Ssstrangersss now guessst my "
"houssse! Friendsss!\""
msgstr "{n}족장 검댕비늘이 승리에 취해 쉭쉭거립니다.{/n} \"쉭! 이방인 이제 우리집 손님이다! 친구다! 쉭!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "1af7ec89-9844-4ab4-b9f6-a0ab21e4acde"
msgid "\"Sweet! Stranger, go my cave chamber, talk. Kobold, be afraid!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 이방인, 내 동굴의 방으로 가라. 가서 대화해라. 코볼트 두려워한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldWarchief2
msgctxt "c044c8bd-0811-4946-b464-e4765ab7feb5"
msgid "\"Insssult! Blood! Washhh out!\""
msgstr "\"쉭, 모욕이다! 피 흘려! 피로 씻겨내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "5b2bdd99-1582-489f-8a85-a86965fa1ab4"
msgid "\"Coward! Turn! Elic!\""
msgstr "\"겁쟁이! 돌아! 엘릭!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "ed9eb598-8f3b-44f5-a9a3-bcbb00457d81"
msgid ""
"\"Liesss! Chief! Scale!\" {n}The kobold crier diligently copies the words "
"and gestures of the chief, swinging his weapon. It seems both groups are but "
"a breath away from battle.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"쉬익! 족장! 비늘!\" {n}코볼트는 무기를 휘두르며 대장의 말과 몸짓을 따라 하려고 노력합니다. 두 집단 모두 전투에서 멀어 "
"보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "4ae8084a-b40f-4b73-b817-0bdac3ecfb2e"
msgid "\"Thief! \"Teal! Elic!\" {n}echoes the crier enthusiastically.{/n}"
msgstr "\"도둑! \"흠쳣! 유믈!\" {n}열정적인 외침이 메아리가 되어 퍼집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "386199f8-d7d8-476a-b8b5-9cb99554f5dc"
msgid "\"Tartuk! Ood! Ooood!\""
msgstr "\"타툭! 타툭!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9b91f1c8-c4a5-450e-8ddd-4fa819229f0f"
msgid "\"Oh, I can't stop laughing! He's so sweet! He repeats everything!\""
msgstr "\"아, 너무 웃겨! 쟤네 너무 귀엽지 않아요? 모든 말을 따라 하고 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "b506d0d3-35e4-4292-a8fa-e442e664b09e"
msgid "{n}The crier swells with pride.{/n} \"Peats! Verything!\""
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 자부심으로 의기양양합니다.{/n} \"따라 해! 모든 말!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "48e582d5-b921-4859-93bd-363d485a1a65"
msgid ""
"\"It's up to you, but we should remember that living among such creatures "
"could be dangerous. The kobolds and mites are aggressive, poorly organized "
"and unreliable. It's better to exile them, or not interfere, lest we're "
"entangled in their unworthy deeds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 판단에 따르겠지만, 지금 우리는 위험한 생명체 사이에 있다는 걸 유념하셔야 합니다. 코볼트와 마이트는 공격적이고 체계적이지 "
"못하며, 믿을 수 없습니다. 그들을 쫓아내거나 간섭하지 않거나 해서 불필요한 상황에 휘말리지 않는 것이 좋을 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "72c96b0f-f2ad-4b43-9d9e-43c1c0cf9d8a"
msgid ""
"\"They haven't done anything bad. We shouldn't attack them. I wish they "
"would make peace, but if this isn't possible, let's side with Chief "
"Sootscale and the kobolds! They're so funny, and they haven't the guile to "
"lie.\""
msgstr ""
"\"쟤네는 아무 짓도 하지 않았어요. 재네를 공격해선 안돼요. 그들이 화해했으면 좋겠지만 그게 불가능하다면 검댕비늘과 코볼트의 편에 "
"서죠! 저렇게 귀여운 애들이 거짓말을 할 리가 없어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6ade34b3-d577-4da3-9f7a-5a43a06cf7f4"
msgid ""
"\"I'd just kill them all: less monsters — less problems. But if you need to "
"choose, side with the mites. They are fierce, and would make fine allies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 생각엔 그냥 전부 죽여버리는 게 좋을 것 같은데. 괴물야 적을수록 더 좋잖아. 하지만 꼭 둘 중 하나를 선택해야 한다면 마이트를 "
"선택하겠어. 사나운 녀석들이라 좋은 보탬이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2a718cf6-ccdc-4dd0-8306-77473b093c4e"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal rolls her eyes.{/n} \"And so again, to be the judge. To weigh and "
"balance trivium. Decade upon decade...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 눈을 이리저리 굴립니다.{/n} \"또다시 판사가 되었군. 죄를 가늠하고 공평한 판결을 내리는 것. 수도 없이 했지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "738e0975-3934-49eb-9025-b3713b6b2c01"
msgid ""
"\"Such hubris in such small and simple creatures... But are our own monarchs "
"any better?\""
msgstr "\"이런 작고 단순한 생물체에게서 이런 오만함이라니... 하지만 우리의 군주들이라고 나은 점이 있는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a55de03e-7249-4099-bfc8-064ce326619c"
msgid ""
"\"So warlike! It's like a miniature version of the Taldan Imperial "
"Chronicles!\""
msgstr "\"너무 호전적이에요! 마치 탈도르 제국 연대기의 축소판 같아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "457aba58-0c65-422e-b07e-14500fb491a3"
msgid "\"Great! Thanks for supporting them — they're so funny!\""
msgstr "\"좋아요! 제 의견을 지지해 줘서 고마워요. 얘네 너무 재밌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8bde76fc-5593-42b4-ba10-bce98da574f3"
msgid "\"Ha, that's right! They might be small, but they fight all right!\""
msgstr "\"하하. 맞아! 작아도 싸움은 잘 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0096_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f7e03761-1693-44bf-b10f-fe3c905b94ae"
msgid "\"Heh, that's more like it! Let's cut these creeps to pieces!\""
msgstr "\"헤헤. 그렇겠지! 이 괴물들을 조각내버리자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0099_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e4dbfac3-f3ec-40c0-905f-2bd32d6888c1"
msgid "\"You know what they say... mite makes right! Ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 말하길... 마이트가 옳다고 하는군! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0d23a151-04cf-47f0-bf9b-35af8d77238b"
msgid "{n}The half-orc wears a jaunty grin.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하프 오크는 쾌활하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b089c6b3-3fd9-4eb4-a777-7cbe4e42f483"
msgid "\"Heh, that's right! He was an expert in fiery humor!\""
msgstr "\"헤, 맞아! 그는 사나운 유머의 전문가였지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "95cf355d-9975-4c99-88c3-f0b94a231b63"
msgid ""
"{n}Realizing his pun went unnoticed, Regongar grunts and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}자신의 말장난이 눈에 띄지 않고 넘어가자 레곤가르는 투덜거리며 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0108_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d9b16ae0-6339-4b8e-a9b1-602e12917b41"
msgid "\"Let us free the lands of these dangerous creatures!\""
msgstr "\"이 위험한 것들을 이 땅에서 없애버립시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KingsConversation/Cue_0109_Text_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "99aa76e0-80db-4439-96a7-e3d9812fc3b4"
msgid ""
"\"You interfere in a war you have no stake in. I hope you know what you are "
"doing.\""
msgstr "\"지금 당신은 당신과 관계없는 전쟁에 개입하고 있습니다. 스스로 무슨 행동을 하고 있는지 자각하고 있기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "0a1f06c6-3a61-4487-9244-011a429e46df"
msgid "\"Fine, I will kill the wolf leader.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나는 늑대 우두머리를 죽일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "40a5f003-5822-4970-9b86-faaa225315d8"
msgid "Killed the peaceful mites and kobolds"
msgstr "평화로운 마이트와 코볼트를 죽였습니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "1b8b54d8-da43-4114-a0cd-a777cfd8913a"
msgid "[Attack] \"You will bleed, dirty scum!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"죽어라. 더러운 녀석들아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "00ef2b7b-e98a-4987-b673-4dc0c255bc51"
msgid ""
"Tried to trick the mites and the kobolds into going straight into the hungry "
"worg's claws."
msgstr "배고픈 워그의 먹잇감이 되도록 코볼트와 마이트를 속였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "ed709d28-859e-478a-8785-b6395512c580"
msgid "\"The worg is dead. Go see for yourself.\""
msgstr "\"워그는 죽었어. 직접 눈으로 확인해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "1085cf2d-f793-49b2-a495-ba727ae23028"
msgid "\"I've dealt with the wolf leader.\""
msgstr "\"내가 늑대 우두머리를 손봐줬어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "bae23dc1-f30c-4e85-924f-5c9a14f99c40"
msgid "\"I suppose I'll go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "203e0168-f483-455b-8ef4-7f56699c53f4"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "0fbce63f-c9c7-4b75-9b1d-c0bc1372ccaf"
msgid "\"Why are you not fighting each other?\""
msgstr "\"왜 서로 싸우지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "a62e343f-3dfa-483b-b926-d1e53b8289ea"
msgid "\"What did you say about wolves?\""
msgstr "\"늑대에 대해 뭐라고 했는데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "aa06ef36-4302-4bd3-84a5-c999c9a905fa"
msgid "\"No, I have other matters to attend.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 난 다른 일이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "612615e0-6bf8-4368-a233-08431ca93d6d"
msgid ""
"{n}An oversized mite approaches you. He raises his bald blue head with "
"dignity, and his neck is decorated with taglocks and a wolf's fang pendant. "
"To his right walks a kobold, also swelling with conceit.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}대형 마이트가 당신에게 다가옵니다. 파란 대머리를 위엄있게 자랑하는 그는 목에 부적과 늑대의 송곳으로 장식했습니다. 그의 오른쪽의 "
"코볼트도 역시 자만심으로 가득 차있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "2888d7bf-3245-4abf-a64b-c9f190c7e749"
msgid "{n}The leader of the hunters nods at you solemnly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사냥꾼의 지도자는 당신에게 엄숙하게 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "717f4a36-3ae8-4a58-b0b0-acee97fe0b0d"
msgid ""
"{n}The bald mite clicks his tongue, annoyed.{/n} \"Why you not check? "
"Blockhead, now we go check... wait here, I come.\" {n}Turning to his "
"companion, he waves his hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}대머리 마이트는 짜증이 난듯 혀를 찹니다.{/n} \"너 왜 확인 못해? 돌대가리. 이제 우리는 확인하러 간다... 여기에서 "
"기다려라. 나는 간다.\" {n}그는 동료를 향해 손을 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "5ba27270-2322-4948-b921-b852cdea1583"
msgid "{n}The mite squints at you.{/n} \"No, we not go.\""
msgstr "{n}마이트가 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"아니. 우리는 가지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "fdf064c9-e601-4485-a59d-7c3eaa35c1b3"
msgid ""
"\"Hooray! Great new! Mite and kobold keep live together, no threat! Good for "
"you. Maybe you grow up big hunter, like us.\" {n}Saying this, he gives you a "
"small purse.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"야호! 좋은 소식이야! 코볼트와 마이트는 계속 같이 살아갈 수 있어. 다행이야. 어쩌면 너도 우리처럼 큰 사냥꾼으로 자랄지도 몰라.\""
" {n}그렇게 말한 뒤 그는 당신에게 작은 돈주머니를 줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "851b292f-d043-48a9-897f-facba47e84f2"
msgid ""
"\"Peaceful mite and kobold. Hunt together. Was easy — many mite, many kobold "
"hunt together. Now not.\""
msgstr "\"평화로운 마이트와 코볼트였다. 함께 사냥 했다. 많은 마이트와 코볼트가 함께 사냥하는 건 흔한 일이다. 지금은 아니지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "4f8489f2-52a5-48f7-bbc3-d4281edd9ac5"
msgid ""
"\"War — bad. Puddles blood, scream loud, mite and kobold dead, cold... Why "
"fight? Dangerous, hairy wolf around.\" {n}The mite shakes his head "
"helplessly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"전쟁은 나빠. 피 웅덩이, 시끄러운 비명, 마이트와 코볼트 죽고, 추위에 떤다... 왜 싸워? 주위에 위험한 털 난 늑대있는데.\" "
"{n}마이트는 절래절래 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "05dcb36f-b07c-40f2-9e86-55e80638e686"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome peace zone! Here no war, no one attack. Only maybe fat wolf lord. "
"He want chew us, we more sly! Who kill him — big reward.\""
msgstr ""
"\"평화지대에 온 걸 환영해! 여기는 전쟁도 없고 공격도 없어. 아마 뚱뚱한 늑대 지도자 녀석만 공격할 뿐이지. 그 녀석은 우릴 씹고 "
"싶어해. 우리는 더 교활해! 누가 그를 죽일래? 크게 보상할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHunterMelee
msgctxt "846437ec-c976-435a-ae7e-ef5cf85363f1"
msgid "\"Ward!\""
msgstr "\"상!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "d76da876-1fc2-4023-a185-4e77a4c84e47"
msgid ""
"{n}After a short pause, the mite pats his neighbor on the back:{/n} \"But we "
"no fool! Go and be friend. No want war! But miss Queen Bdaah — big beauty.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 멈춘 후에 마이트는 그의 이웃의 등을 두드려줍니다.{/n} \"하지만 우리는 바보가 아니야! 가서 친구가 되자. 전쟁은 원하지 "
"않아. 여왕 브다 그립다. 엄청 예뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "5bc99c00-8c7e-428d-a4b6-80e86d139794"
msgid ""
"\"Near long tree live pack wolf. Big angry, tell mite and kobold bad thing. "
"We maybe kill him easy, but war take hunters away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴 나무 근처에서 늑대 무리 산다. 화가 났고 마이트와 코볼트에게 나쁜 말해. 그를 쉽게 죽일 수 있지만 전쟁은 사냥 못하게 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "32d4f5c4-1626-4861-88a2-9660121aa31a"
msgid "{n}The mite shrugs nonchalantly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}마이트는 상관없다는 듯 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHunterMelee
msgctxt "ec614c66-eb38-45a8-b11f-cc409552caaf"
msgid "\"Not like thisss.\""
msgstr "\"쉭, 이 사태가 마음에 들지 않아아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHunterMelee
msgctxt "a5d44026-5ca8-4792-ab56-a45d00810cda"
msgid "\"Misss beauty?\" {n}The kobold scratches his head, baffled.{/n}"
msgstr "\"쉬익, 예에쁜 아가씨이?\" {n}코볼트는 머리를 긁으며 찡그립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHunterMelee
msgctxt "8681379e-697d-4673-8ead-b58ca89cbb73"
msgid "\"Hey! Blue head and sssnake ssskin! After me!\""
msgstr "\"야! 파랑 머리 배애앰 피이부우! 쉬이익! 나 따라와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e938249d-fe49-4b4b-bf05-21be8981c721"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, what are you saying? The worg is alive! He'll... He'll eat them!\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 너 무슨 소리야? 워그는 살아있어! 그는... 그들을 먹을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "da1d23b2-433c-4190-becc-1b24808e8a97"
msgid ""
"\"Wise words! I think many people, not just mites and kobolds, could learn "
"something from these creatures!\""
msgstr "\"현명한 말이야! 마이트와 코볼트뿐만 아니라 많은 사람들이 이 생명체들로부터 무언가를 배울 수 있겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c959f4f3-74e8-4b70-a90c-6ad0e02bfdf9"
msgid "\"Bah! Cowards!\""
msgstr "\"하! 겁쟁이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d497fd98-39cb-40fb-b098-fd1f0461b78a"
msgid "\"Great, ha ha! Well, you're done for, creeps!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 하하! 잘 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/KoboldHunters/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : MiteHunterChief
msgctxt "139530eb-5457-4e58-8d00-603d6542c548"
msgid "\"Bad, bad! You die now!\""
msgstr "\"나빠. 나빠! 너 지금 죽어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0a9bff38-de7e-4ea3-b3e7-9620ff119634"
msgid "Tried to take by force a bucket of moon radish from the kobolds."
msgstr "코볼트에게서 달 무가 담긴 바구니를 강제로 가져가려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0006_Text_1
msgctxt "afdb9c3f-1ea0-4fe9-8197-3a9fa18e1e82"
msgid ""
"\"I will take what I want, and no one will stand in my way. Understand?\""
msgstr "\"나는 원하는 것을 가져갈 것이고 아무도 나를 막지 못해. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "501f104a-d6cd-4047-9698-8dce99759aee"
msgid "Tricked the kobolds into going straight into a hungry worg's claws."
msgstr "배고픈 워그에게 잡아먹히도록 코볼트를 속였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0007_Text_1
msgctxt "32d737ac-2c02-47f1-af3e-17f69706c627"
msgid ""
"[Point towards the worg's lair] \"I have just seen mountains of the same "
"radishes right over there...\""
msgstr "[워그가 있는 곳을 가르킨다] \"저기서 무가 잔뜩 심겨진 산들을 보았어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "c531e15c-d336-4679-a308-3c865b9d5969"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "398da804-bbb6-4918-8c18-02dfaf7c61ab"
msgid "\"Why don't you join the war against the mites?\""
msgstr "\"마이트와의 전쟁에 동참하는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "58ad60fd-74cf-45e0-a96b-4bc13d89e7bc"
msgid "[Attack] \"There is no place in these lands for such creatures!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네놈들 같은 것들이 있을 곳은 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "12396da7-93e6-40ec-851b-19ac50078926"
msgid "\"I must go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "405bd0fe-c069-44d2-a794-92e1518ddc51"
msgid ""
"Suggested to share half of the moon radish you dig out with the kobolds."
msgstr "당신은 코볼트가 수확한 달 무의 반만 가져가겠다고 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "fa5533fb-faf4-480f-ab98-fcd839e18209"
msgid ""
"\"I don't need all of it. I will leave half of what I dig out for you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 전부 가져가지 않을게. 너희 몫인 절반을 남겨둘게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "34c3b4f9-1832-4edd-8934-d311c2545cf3"
msgid "\"About that radish...\""
msgstr "\"그 무 있잖아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2da91595-26f8-438a-918d-6a0cc4f96f16"
msgid "Tried to steal a bucket of moon radish from the kobolds."
msgstr "코볼트에게서 달 무 바구니를 훔쳐가려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "2f5fa2e2-37bb-47a8-a49b-a50affd34ff6"
msgid "[Leave quietly, taking a bucket of moon radishes with you]"
msgstr "[달 무가 담긴 바구니를 가지고 조용히 떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3a33a13b-a998-4bc2-8040-3a1400c922d9"
msgid ""
"Tried to convince the kobolds to respect the right of all creatures to "
"partake of nature's blessings."
msgstr "모든 생물이 자연에서 난 생산물을 사용할 권리가 있다고 코볼트를 설득하려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "f768ffcb-01a1-47ca-b2cf-8764f4fccd4c"
msgid ""
"\"There are enough radishes for everyone. You mustn't forbid others from "
"using what grows freely in the forest. I will dig out as much as I need.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이정도면 모든 사람들에게 충분한 양의 무야. 다른 사람들이 숲에서 자라는 것을 못쓰게 해서는 안 돼. 나는 필요한 만큼만 파낼 거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "a1f68037-9bb5-485a-941c-7d2bd0ec22c1"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0005_Text_1
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "340bd401-13c2-4b1b-8eb3-a4922a7b0b11"
msgid ""
"\"Chew the radishhh... sssearch for sssecret truth... sssmall in big...\" {n}"
"The kobolds who are lying nearby answer with a devout murmur — at least "
"those who aren't sleeping.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"쉬이이이익... 무를 씹어라... 진실을 찾아... 큰 것 안에 작은 것이...\" {n}주변에 누워있는 코볼트들은 잠들지 않은 "
"사람들에게 중얼 거림으로 대답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "64ce367a-2a63-4ccc-94ae-2abee89c39fb"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobolds stare at you in awe, then look at each other, whispering. "
"Finally their leader raises his hand, and they fall silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 경외심을 가지고 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 그리고 서로를 보면서 속삭입니다. 마침내 지도자는 손을 들자 그들은 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "39955e11-9925-4959-b588-8d79bf7f24c4"
msgid ""
"{n}Covering his face in terror, the kobold nods to you hastily. His brethren "
"moan sorrowfully.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}얼굴은 공포로 질려서 코볼트는 당신에게 급히 끄덕입니다. 그의 형제들은 슬픈 듯이 신음합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "fb927b5f-75de-48a2-8cd2-30539029a862"
msgid ""
"\"Ha... ha... ha! Way... stand...\" {n}The kobold suddenly grows serious and "
"stares at you, coldly blinking.{/n} \"You are dead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하... 하... 하! 거기... 서...\" {n}코볼트가 갑자기 당신을 진지하게 쳐다보며 눈을 깜박거립니다.{/n} \"넌 죽었어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "0f4184fe-5088-4931-8196-3478a5e3d1c8"
msgid ""
"\"Mite sssilly... But Sssootssscale alssso. There are more important "
"thhhings in life!\" {n}The kobold punctuates his words with a burp, and the "
"others hiss in approval.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"쉭, 마이트 멍청하다... 하지만 검댕비늘도 멍청하다. 인생에는 더 중요한 것 있다!\" {n}코볼트는 트림으로 말을 끝내고 나머지는 "
"쉭쉭대며 인정합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "d61342bb-505f-4ce9-acbc-1cdcf7040c84"
msgid "\"Our patch... our cccelessstial radishhh...\""
msgstr "\"우리의 밭... 우리의 신성한 무우...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "5abb0fb1-ef52-43be-aa36-b27642eb2f96"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobolds stop talking, surprised. Their leader's eyes light up with "
"curiosity.{/n} \"Good... Deal.\""
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 말을 멈추고 놀랍니다. 그들의 지도자의 눈은 호기심으로 반짝입니다.{/n} \"좋은... 거래다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "eaa8c1eb-30d8-4531-b115-21e4396eaf77"
msgid ""
"{n}The oldest kobold lifts his head from the ground and tries to focus his "
"eyes on you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}가장 늙은 코볼트는 머리를 땅에서 들어 올리고 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "e06c1745-41f0-4bdc-a708-422e2acd6694"
msgid ""
"{n}Finding the right moment, you quietly leave the patch with a sizable "
"bunch of radishes in your hands. The kobolds pay you no heed.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}적절한 순간을 기다리는 당신은 큼지막한 무를 한무더기 쥐어 조용히 떠납니다. 코볼트는 당신에게 신경 쓰지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "9cd5db17-b9e3-463d-81a2-6640027819ac"
msgid ""
"{n}As you touch the handle of the nearest bucket, the kobolds start "
"clambering to their feet, screaming and hissing. They sway towards you, "
"their fists raised!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 가장 가까운 바구니의 손잡이를 잡을 때 코볼트는 비명을 지르고 씩씩대며 올라오기 시작합니다. 그들은 당신에게 주먹을 휘두르기 "
"시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "411a9c97-0235-4aed-ba10-4fd95932adb9"
msgid ""
"{n}The old kobold remains silent for a time, wrinkling his forehead. "
"Finally, lifting a finger solemnly, he announces:{/n}\"You chew — and let "
"chew!\" {n}Pleased with his verdict, he turns over on his side. Other "
"kobolds break out into delighted hissing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 코볼트는 이마를 찡그리며 한동안 침묵을 지킵니다. 마침내 손가락을 엄숙하게 들어올린 그는 말합니다.{/n} \"너 씹는다! "
"그리고... 씹어라! 허락한다!\" {n}자신이 내린 평결에 만족하고는 반대편으로 돌아 눕습니다. 다른 코볼트들은 기뻐서 "
"쉭쉭댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "b16a3415-b4e6-4f38-b7da-7beab1ad1e1d"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold find — kobold dig — kobold chew. Ssstranger... ssstop drool.\" {n}"
"The kobolds make harsh hissing sounds, some rolling around on their backs "
"and grabbing their snouts with their fists. It seems that they are "
"giggling.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트가 찾는다. 코볼트가 파헤친다. 코볼트는 씹는다. 쉭, 이방인은 침 흘리지 않는다.\" {n}코볼트는 가혹한 쉿 소리를 내며 "
"일부는 자신의 코를 잡고 땅바닥을 구릅니다. 그들은 낄낄거리는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "77d1c5a5-6117-4513-9e60-54238385fca0"
msgid "{n}The kobold lowers his head on the ground with a thud.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 땅에 머리를 축 떨굽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "8556c8af-8e21-4465-b9fb-45d5324d05c5"
msgid ""
"\"Ssstrange rumour... The cccelessstial radishhh growsss only here! It wasss "
"alwaysss... We check. Sssend ssscout...\" {n}However there is no one "
"listening to the elder kobold. The others are already moving in the "
"direction you pointed — alone or tightly hugging in pairs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"쉭, 이이이상한 소문... 무우는 여기서만 자란다! 항상 그랬지... 정차알벼엉을 보내봐아....{n}하지만 늙은 코볼트의 말을 듣는 "
"사람은 아무도 없습니다. 다른 코볼트들은 이미 당신이 가리킨 방향으로 가고 있습니다. 혼자서 혹은 쌍으로 단단히 껴안고서.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "cb8e3668-9576-45bd-b93c-644c1f7a1cdd"
msgid ""
"{n}A kobold lying in the middle of the patch calls out to you. Judging by "
"the sorry state of his scales, he is the eldest of the group. His red eyes "
"squint from the light, and his throat struggles to form words.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}경작지 한 가운데 누워있는 코볼트가 당신에게 소리칩니다. 안타까운 비늘의 상태를 보았을 때 그가 가장 연장자 같습니다. 그의 붉은 "
"눈은 빛 때문에 가늘어져 있고, 그의 목은 단어를 뱉기 위해 애쓰고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "2a2bd0ad-5c1a-4d4a-b077-9cb1c31b83b7"
msgid "\"SSSTOP! Ssstop, traitor!\""
msgstr "\"쉬익, 머으음춰! 머엄춰. 반역자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0ba640e9-ae8f-40a6-88b8-bd8c44fa51b8"
msgid ""
"\"Huh... Little philosophers, aren't they? Wouldn't expect that... Wouldn't "
"expect...\""
msgstr "\"허... 작은 철학자들이군. 그렇지 않은가? 예상 밖이군... 예상 밖이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5779a17d-d54e-44fe-8169-446acd129ba4"
msgid ""
"\"Yick, radishes! We grew them back in my village. One day, while I was "
"reading a book, my pa grabbed it from me and threw it into fire! Then he "
"made me go pick radishes. It was autumn, and the ground was wet and cold, "
"and there were worms everywhere... Ugh. Filthy roots!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이익! 무! 예전에 우리 마을에서 키웠던 적이 있어요. 어느 날 책을 읽고 있었는데 아빠가 제게서 책을 빼앗아 불속에 집어던졌어요! "
"그리고 제게 무나 뽑으러 가라고 했죠. 가을이라 땅은 축축하고, 춥고, 사방에 벌레는 들끓고! 엑, 더러운 뿌리채소 같으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "840d3490-642b-499c-91d2-43ac2ba62bfd"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I've seen people willing to die for a pair of boots, but someone dying "
"for radishes, that's a new one!\""
msgstr "\"하! 장화 한켤레를 가지려고 목숨 거는 놈들을 봤지만 무에 목숨 거는 녀석들은 처음이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3449c698-336e-45fb-87a9-87dad74d9560"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar bares his fangs in a grin of approval.{/n} \"You sure can be "
"convincing!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 동의한다는 듯 자신의 송곳니를 드러내며 웃습니다.{/n} \"그러게 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3e52b4d8-62ca-4de4-9a64-9ec61fd61f90"
msgid "\"Yes! Let's give the little scoundrels a beating!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 저 쪼그만 악당들을 쥐어박아주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/MoonRadishClearing/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : MoonRadishKoboldChief
msgctxt "1cbc7115-cdd3-460a-a949-38226345f544"
msgid "\"Sssuch an atrosssity! Dessspicable!\""
msgstr "\"악독한 녀석들! 못된 녀석들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "e10cdf79-47a7-4109-98a6-e1b20a7e7a86"
msgid "\"You say we could be useful to each other?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 서로에게 유용할 수 있다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "2cb15241-31a2-4cb2-b832-670f775187c4"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "31f85af0-09af-48b1-b197-026465981ad4"
msgid "Killed an evil worg"
msgstr "사악한 워그를 죽였습니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "eccad14b-a27e-4c50-9d4d-1680fb982ada"
msgid "[Attack] \"Your words will not save you, monster!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그따위 말로 살 수 있을 거라 생각했나, 이 괴물!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "62d476a0-8413-4d1f-ae1d-1387445cb9ec"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "be6690b8-483c-4340-b7d0-65087430b374"
msgid "\"What do you know of the war between the kobolds and mites?\""
msgstr "\"코볼트와 마이트 사이의 전쟁에 대해 무엇을 아는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "ec82adcf-497a-4df0-b010-ecc95e0f9f9b"
msgid "\"No, I am not interested in this.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 관심이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5df6c869-1ad6-4c6d-978a-87b771448898"
msgid "Agreed to feed the worg"
msgstr "워그에게 먹이를 주기로 약속했습니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "9483756d-2f6d-4c69-bf55-1914e7cdefd5"
msgid "\"Fine.\""
msgstr "\"좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "ea3835d4-9fe3-4831-8378-d0b22991ee1d"
msgid "\"An old traveler, you say?\""
msgstr "\"늙은 여행자라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0052_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5c23c36f-7b30-49f1-9bdb-ad327b5c08cb"
msgid "Refused to feed the worg and break the natural balance."
msgstr "워그에게 먹이를 주어 자연의 균형을 깨는 것에 반대합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "6e3f3852-ee6c-4ccf-9379-d067348e7d94"
msgid ""
"\"If you're hungry, then hunt. I see no point in interfering with the "
"natural order of things.\""
msgstr "\"배가 고프면 사냥을 해. 내가 자연의 질서를 어지럽힐 필요는 없어 보이는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "02e639d5-db4a-4ed4-a795-3c2508a4c47f"
msgid ""
"{n}The beast before you is unusually large, and its eyes, especially angry. "
"Its menacing grin might almost be taken for a smirk.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 있는 짐승은 비정상적으로 큰데다가 그 눈에는 분노가 차 있습니다. 위협적으로 송곳니를 드러낸 것이 마치 능글맞게 웃는 "
"표정을 짓는 것 같기도 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "e280c42f-30bd-41f5-92fc-db1c0aec652d"
msgid "\"Greetings.\""
msgstr "\"안녕하신가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "1ec68b4d-dcc3-443e-86fe-21ec537c44a5"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, traveler. Before you draw your weapon, I wish to say I see no "
"reason for feuding between us. We might even be of some use to each other.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하신가. 여행자. 무기를 뽑기 전에 할 말이 있다. 우리 사이에는 싸울 이유가 없어. 우리는 서로에게 도움이 될지도 모르지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "a65fdf95-9b7b-468c-b46a-effd2acf293d"
msgid ""
"\"Only that my pack enjoys it.\"{n} The worg snorts and licks his lips.{/n} "
"\"Of course, I only eat fresh meat...\""
msgstr ""
"\"오직 내 무리만이 즐기겠지.\" {n}워그는 코를 킁킁이며 입술을 주릅하고 핥습니다.{/n} \"물론 나는 신선한 고기만 먹는다..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "e63b8fc6-ed57-41d7-ab94-157c72e1fa3a"
msgid ""
"\"You may call me Grarrukh. I've lived here far longer than the rulers of "
"those foolish tribes... I have seen much, and eaten many.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 그라루크라고 불러라. 나는 저 멍청한 녀석들이 살기도 훨씬 전부터 여기서 살았다. 경험도 많지. 많은 녀석들을 먹었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "5cb48717-bbd6-49d0-bfa0-cbda59482bfc"
msgid ""
"\"Bring me someone delicious. Three or four bodies will be enough. And I, as "
"a sign of gratitude, will tell you where an old traveler buried his chest.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나에게 맛있는 걸 데려와라. 3~4개의 시체로 충분할 거야. 나는 감사의 표시로 늙은 여행자가 상자를 묻은 곳을 말해주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "f2af6a36-e538-4470-8871-5c9fc16438e2"
msgid ""
"{n}Grinning, the worg looks straight at you.{/n}\"Deal! I'll await your "
"return.\""
msgstr "{n}워그는 활짝 웃으며 당신을 골똘히 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"좋아! 너의 귀환을 기다리겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "b57e30b2-df56-417a-8e7b-01730b15dd8e"
msgid ""
"\"Well, as you wish. But consider my offer... You may yet think of something."
"\""
msgstr "\"글쎄. 마음대로 해. 하지만 내 제안을 고려해두는 게 좋을 거다. 아직 뭔가 생각나는 게 있을 터.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "ecce3fa6-b467-4846-8b86-fefc2c57605e"
msgid ""
"\"Truth be told, I should thank you — finally, a decent meal! It is a "
"pleasure to deal with you. The chest is buried under a lonely tree to the "
"west.\""
msgstr ""
"\"솔직하게 말하자면. 너에게 감사해야겠군. 마침내 괜찮은 식사를 하게 되겠어! 거래를 하게 되서 기뻐. 상자는 서쪽의 나무 아래에 "
"묻혀있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "69cb6dcb-0fe0-43ae-85fb-7fbf730c2f69"
msgid "\"Wait, why is this wolf talking? Is it magical or something?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 왜 늑대가 말하는 거지? 뭔가 마법적인 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "ce7cbf68-aa38-443f-8f63-e4ff387a69cf"
msgid ""
"\"I am no wolf, female. I am a worg. Surprising you could live to your age "
"without learning the difference. Well, it's never too late to teach a lesson "
"to an insolent two-legged morsel...\" {n}The beast slowly licks its "
"teeth.{/n}\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 늑대가 아니다. 계집. 난 워그다. 그 차이를 배우지 않고도 그 나이까지 살 수 있다니 정말 놀랍군. 음. 두발로 걷는 "
"멍청이한테 교훈을 가르치는 것은 항상 늦지 않지... \" {n}짐승은 천천히 치아를 핥습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6cef158e-3321-44c7-a79b-ab94b0d04290"
msgid ""
"\"Who are you calling a morsel, you pelt?\" {n}Amiri glares at the beast, "
"her hand on her sword.{/n}\""
msgstr "\"누가 멍청이라고 이 자식아?\" {n}아미리는 칼을 든 채 그 짐승을 노려봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "5ca65717-a50f-4c04-a71f-8c4d4b9c21f8"
msgid ""
"\"A very old, lean and flavorless traveler.\" {n}The warg grins, almost "
"smiling.{/n}"
msgstr "\"늙고 마른 맛없는 여행자.\" {n}워그는 씨익 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8152332e-8e90-4e85-b985-8cf0b53b8cee"
msgid ""
"\"Right! We're not going to start a chat with every stray mutt we come "
"across!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 우린 똥개와 대화 따윈 하지 않을 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "951bb1cb-15ab-47be-8f04-684db34b76c9"
msgid "\"Good. I love fresh meat!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나는 신선한 고기를 좋아한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d7026a31-6137-4242-b39b-bc7846ac34c7"
msgid ""
"\"How could you agree to such a monstrous deal?\" {n}Tristian shakes his "
"head slowly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"어떻게 그런 괴물과 거래할 수가 있죠?\" {n}트리스티안은 머리를 천천히 절레절레 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6b295333-9676-444a-b81a-20f02ab3b450"
msgid ""
"\"This creature is filled with irredeemable evil. Sarenrae, guide my blade!\""
msgstr "\"이 생물은 구제불가능한 악으로 가득합니다. 서렌레이시여. 제 칼날을 인도하소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/OldSycamoreOutdoor/TalkingWorg/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1c1bb045-9bed-4183-92fa-97265f2d271c"
msgid ""
"\"We cannot leave such dangerous animals to live in our future lands. Slay "
"the beast!\""
msgstr "\"이런 위험한 놈을 곧 우리의 땅이 될 곳에 살게 내버려 둘 수는 없습니다! 이 짐승을 벱시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/Barks/DraftBark2_String
msgctxt "b9c8db62-1518-4dfb-bd63-d3abdff57132"
msgid ""
"There's an imprint on the ground near the empty chest. It looks like another "
"chest of the same size recently sat beside this one."
msgstr "빈 궤짝 근처 땅에 자국이 있습니다. 최근에 같은 크기의 또 다른 궤짝이 옆에 놓여있던 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/Barks/Draft_KoboldsBark_1_String
msgctxt "2ae499e4-56a5-40d4-bc6e-fb9e00eff24d"
msgid "\"Tartuk!\""
msgstr "\"타툭!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/Barks/Draft_KoboldsBark_2_String
msgctxt "41b9ffb7-4e7a-444e-b833-903a295b91b0"
msgid "\"Sssparkle! Dragon!\""
msgstr "\"드래곤이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/Barks/Draft_KoboldsBark_3_String
msgctxt "8a277030-ec2a-4e0d-af28-61085e1806fc"
msgid "\"Koboldsss! Glory! Glory!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트! 영광! 영광!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "36abcb2c-8e26-4f58-9979-61cff661b4b1"
msgid "Tried to uncover Tartuccio's lies for kobolds."
msgstr "코볼트에게 한 타투치오의 거짓말을 밝혀 내려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "b68ec623-71c6-47cb-b6a7-228241db99d6"
msgid "\"Stop deceiving these poor reptiles, Tartuccio.\""
msgstr "\"이 불쌍한 파충류를 속이는 걸 그만둬. 타투치오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "96e9011a-77fc-4bc7-a0d5-4cc339ff9d2f"
msgid "Mocked Tartuccio's attempts to pass as kobold."
msgstr "코볼트로 위장하려는 타투치오의 시도를 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "0c87be79-96f1-480a-bfab-975299a36d3c"
msgid ""
"\"That's one thing I never expected to see in the middle of the forest: a "
"circus show. Learning a new trade, Tartuccio?\""
msgstr "\"숲 속에서 이런 쇼를 볼 거라고 생각은 못했는데. 새로운 무언가를 시도하려는 거야. 타투치오?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "8642cdcf-f22f-4dd0-98a3-2d318fb0a48c"
msgid "[Attack] \"I grow tired of your tricks. To arms!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 네 속임수에 지쳤어. 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "181077a0-ae93-499d-8cc1-d05be7721c48"
msgid ""
"{n}A kobold with unusually purple scales stands a full head above his "
"tribesmen.{/n} \"Lisssten to me. A dragon, huge, sssparkling, flew down to "
"me from the sssky — and told me a sssecret! A great relic, that will win the "
"kobolds glory, isss hidden sssomewhere nearby. Enough of thisss pitiful "
"exissstence! Sssearch for it! Sssearch! And bring it to me!\" {n}Their "
"leader speaks in the suspiciously familiar voice of the gnome Tartuccio.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}비정상적인 보랏빛 피부의 코볼트가 다른 코볼트들 사이에서 돋보입니다.{/n} \"들어라. 거대하고 불을 뿜는 용이 하늘에서 내게 "
"왔다. 그리고 내게 비밀 말했다! 코볼트에게 영광 줄 위대한 유물 여기 어딘가에 숨겨졌다고! 찾아라! 그리고 나에게 가져와!\" {n}"
"그들의 지도자의 목소리는 노움 타투치오의 목소리와 닮았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "5485e3c8-33bc-4e36-a264-65393e88ae1b"
msgid ""
"\"Dragon! Glory! Dragon!\" {n}The voices of the kobolds rise in "
"excitement.{/n} \"We know! The mitesss under the old sssycamore! They "
"possesss the magic treasssure! Very ansssient!\""
msgstr ""
"\"드래곤! 영광! 드래곤!\" {n}코볼트의 목소리는 흥분에 가득 차있습니다.{/n} \"우리는 알고 있다! 시카모어 나무 아래 "
"마이트들! 그들이 보물 가지고 있다! 귀중한 보물!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "2fc7e33f-041e-4284-941f-90c5b07c3d4e"
msgid ""
"\"You! When will I finally be rid of you?!\" {n}The purple \"kobold\" gives "
"a start of surprise, but immediately collects himself.{/n} \"Don't lisssten "
"to {mf|him|her}, tribesssmen! This liar comesss to play tricksss on usss! "
"You and you — hold {mf|him|her} back! The ressst of you — follow me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너! 언제 끝장 내줄까?\" {n}자주색 \"코볼트\"는 놀라지만 이내 진정합니다.{/n} \"저 녀석의 말 듣지 마라. 부족들아! "
"이 거짓말쟁이 우리 속인다! 너 그리고 너 물러서라! 너희 모두 나 따라라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "3d2fdc6a-92d2-4df2-ae49-8a691af975e7"
msgid ""
"\"You, sssilly jessster!\" {n}The purple \"kobold\" does not seem surprised "
"by your appearance.{/n} \"I knew you would come, and I've prepared an "
"ambushhh for you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 멍청한 거짓말쟁이!\" {n}보라색 \"코볼트\"는 당신을 보고 놀라지 않은 것 같습니다.{/n} \"네가 올 줄 알았다. 그래서 "
"나는 매복을 준비했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "6afb4dfd-b816-460d-a75c-4a7141082811"
msgid ""
"\"Who is there?! How?!\" {n}The kobold impostor nearly jumps in the air.{/n} "
"\"Here, you fools! I mean — tribesssmen! Don't lisssten to {mf|his|her} "
"liesss! I ssshall bring you to glory, jussst help me find the relic — and "
"ssstop this trickssster!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거기 누구야?! 어떻게?!\" {n}코볼트 사기꾼은 거의 공중에 뛰어 오릅니다.{/n} \"이 멍청이들... 아니 부족들아! 저 녀석 "
"말은 듣지 마라! 너희에게 영광 줄 테니 내가 유물 찾게 도와라! 저 사기꾼 막아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "420a6a7c-645b-4304-ae6a-90de726e3de2"
msgid ""
"\"It's ssstill better than being as sssilly and foolish as you.\" {n}The "
"fake kobold's behavior is suspiciously calm, and in an instant you "
"understand why.{/n} \"While you were following my trailsss, I was preparing "
"an ambushhh. To armsss, my tribesssmen! Don't let {mf|him|her} essscape!"
msgstr ""
"\"너처럼 멍청한 것보다 낫다!\" {n}가짜 코볼트의 행동은 차분했는데 당신은 그 이유를 곧 알게되었습니다.{/n} \"네가 나를 쫓아 "
"올 때 나는 매복을 준비했다. 전투 준비! 저 녀석 도망 못가게 막아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "38dca7ec-2e2a-4e08-acd4-c205908d191a"
msgid ""
"{n}The \"kobold\" gives a start of surprise and almost drops the horse skull "
"from his head.{/n} \"No! How did you find me so quickly?! Tribesssmen, "
"protect me! Cover my essscape!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"코볼트\"는 깜짝 놀라서 머리에 말 두개골 장식을 거의 떨어뜨릴 뻔 했습니다.{/n} \"안돼! 어떻게 날 그렇게 빨리 "
"찾았어?! 부족들아. 나를 보호해라! 내가 도망치게 나를 보호해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/RadishPatch/TartukTartuccio_Dialog/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "052eaafe-d4ec-4fdb-bbbf-b8e5a94ca7b2"
msgid ""
"{n}The purple \"kobold\" greets you with mockery.{/n} \"At lassst you have "
"come! And what is thisss, you asssk? Why, it's an ambushhh!\""
msgstr "{n}자주색 \"코볼트\"가 당신을 조롱합니다.{/n} \"마침내 왔군! 그런데 이게 뭐라고 물었어? 매복이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c5379bfa-96ad-453a-a429-48fbd6ae2d6b"
msgid ""
"Persuaded bandit leutenant Akiros Insmort to surrender himself to justice."
msgstr "정의를 위해 항복하라고 아키로스 인스모트를 설득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d0eb6ded-a656-42f0-b5a9-1f7f215b4074"
msgid ""
"\"You seem a reasonable man, so you must understand — the times of "
"lawlessness and chaos in the Stolen Lands are about to pass. Lay down your "
"arms, surrender, and confess your crimes. A just sentence is far better than "
"an undignified death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 합리적인 사람처럼 보이니 이해하겠지. 도둑맞은 땅에서의 무법과 혼란의 시대는 곧 지나갈 것이다. 무기를 버리고 항복해라. 그리고 "
"네 죄를 자백해라. 무의미한 죽음보다는 판결을 받는 편이 더 낫다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1a6e66a0-36bc-48aa-a6e9-862892cb28a5"
msgid "Offered alliance and opportunity to start new life to Akiros Insmort."
msgstr "아키로스 인스모트에게 새로운 삶을 시작하고 새로운 동료를 가질 기회를 제공했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "1aa80568-52a7-4e4c-9dc6-e7e48ae254fa"
msgid ""
"\"Help me get rid of the Stag Lord. You'll gain a new chance at life and a "
"reliable ally.\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주를 죽이게 도와줘. 그러면 새로운 삶을 살고 합리적인 동료를 얻도록 도와주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "094a3b1a-0900-442f-92fd-b66c5132fc55"
msgid "[Attack] \"I came to fight, not talk.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 대화가 아니라 싸우러 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "9a01e7c9-6b65-4cd6-9dd1-97a59e2e545b"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "a21eff59-02a3-4792-b2bd-6c50d39df083"
msgid ""
"\"Since I first met you, I've wondered why a man like you would serve the "
"Stag Lord. You don't have to serve him, to die for him. We could be allies, "
"Akiros.\""
msgstr ""
"\"처음 만났을 때 왜 너 같은 남자가 수사슴 군주를 섬기는지 궁금했다. 그를 섬기고 죽음을 당할 필요가 없다. 우리는 동료가 될 수 "
"있다. 아키로스.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "914e7968-a5bc-4138-8b10-aab1faa92b76"
msgid ""
"Offered Akiros Insmort to abandon Stag Lord's service and leave unharmed."
msgstr "수사슴 군주를 섬기는 것을 포기하고 떠날 것을 아키로스에게 요구합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "3a988018-8729-458f-8054-51ab93d8b06f"
msgid "\"Leave the Stag Lord and get out. I won't follow you.\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주를 떠나라. 너를 쫓지 않으마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "63a55b1f-d426-4180-b530-baf6a93caa9e"
msgid "Offered Akiros to abandon the Stag Lord's service and leave unharmed."
msgstr "수사슴 군주를 떠나고 몸 성히 돌아가라고 조언합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "b4cc9bb6-8520-4737-9cb2-368a4da3d1db"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't the first time you've tried to speak reasonably with me, "
"Akiros. Now I'm returning the favor — this is your chance to keep your life."
"\""
msgstr "\"너처럼 합리적인 사람을 만난 것이 한두 번이 아니다. 아키로스. 내가 자비를 베풀 테니 목숨을 부지해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "e06945f0-c0a6-4b53-a9ff-47419a313839"
msgid ""
"\"I heard your voice tremble when you spoke Erastil's name. Why is a kind "
"god's servant working with bandits?\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸의 이름을 말할 때 목소리가 떨리는 것을 들었다. 왜 신을 섬기는 자가 도적질을 하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "20bd5128-c3b4-4eea-8898-b85798158eca"
msgid ""
"\"We have company!\" {n}A tall, broad-shouldered man with prematurely "
"graying hair stares at you, but he doesn't attack.{/n} \"You must be the "
"{g|Restov}Restovic{/g} envoy I've heard so much about. I don't suppose I "
"could just ask you to leave the fort in peace, in the name of Erastil or "
"whatever deity you swear by? Otherwise, let's just get this over with.\" {n}"
"Akiros raises his sword, watching you carefully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"손님이 왔다!\" {n}크고 어깨가 다부진 회색 머리의 중년이 당신을 보지만 공격하지 않습니다.{/n} \"너는 소문으로만 듣던 "
"{g|Restov} 레스토프{/g} 사절이구나. 에라스틸의 이름으로 이 요새를 버리고 평화롭게 떠나라고 해도 듣지 않을 것을 알고 있다. "
"그렇다면 이것 밖에 남지 않았군.\" {n}아키로스는 칼을 들고 당신을 신중하게 지켜 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "af8206d1-2cb7-4988-9b28-a75c8fe2734f"
msgid ""
"\"Why does this not {d|c11 Meet Akiros}surprise{/d} me?\" {n}Akiros stares "
"at you, but he doesn't attack.{/n} \"I don't suppose I could just ask you to "
"leave the fort in peace, in the name of Erastil or whatever deity you swear "
"by?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 {d|c11 Meet Akiros}놀랍지가 않지 {/d}?\" {n}아키로스는 당신을 쳐다보지만 공격하지 않습니다.{/n} "
"\"에라스틸의 이름으로 이 요새를 버리고 평화롭게 떠나라고 해도 듣지 않을 것을 알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "ae5ab7b7-98f0-4ffd-ad51-c3a5966dabe8"
msgid ""
"\"Akiros Insmort, the Stag Lord's right hand. So, are we going to stand here "
"exchanging pleasantries, or will you go back behind the wall? Or better yet, "
"back to {g|Restov}Restov{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"수사슴 군주의 오른팔, 아키로스 인스모트. 여기서 대결할 것인가 아니면 벽 뒤로 가서 숨을 것인가? 아니면 "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}로 돌아가는 건 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "e0f02d27-4238-4198-8559-86d35daa2a35"
msgid ""
"\"My little chat must have given you more food for thought than I'd "
"expected! It's true, I'm not much satisfied with my current position. An "
"alliance, huh? Fine. If you start a fight with the Stag Lord, I'll be there "
"to help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수다 조금 했다고 네게 많은 건 수를 내줬나보군. 그렇다. 나는 내 입장에 만족하지 않아. 동맹이라? 좋아. 네가 수사슴 군주와 "
"싸운다면 돕겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "7cc0172a-2372-44c8-b342-ccec1763858d"
msgid ""
"\"If you knew me better, you wouldn't want me as your ally. I'm afraid I fit "
"in a little too well with the Stag Lord. Sorry, but one of us will have to "
"die here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 나를 더 잘 알고 있다면 나를 동맹으로 원하지 않을 것이다. 나는 수사슴 군주와 너무나 죽이 잘 맞아. 우리 둘 중 하나는 "
"여기서 죽어야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "84d22d56-aefc-427b-9d7a-5410334ac9f2"
msgid ""
"{n}Akiros squints.{/n} \"So... that's it? You're letting me go? Well, I "
"certainly don't fancy dying for the Stag Lord. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아키로스는 눈을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그래서... 그게 다야? 나를 풀어주는 거야? 확실히 나는 수사슴 군주를 위해 죽고 싶지는 "
"않아. 수고해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "5718e35c-13dc-4e17-a5ec-ee4e85d7753c"
msgid ""
"\"How noble. I would have agreed, but I don't really think it'll be that "
"hard for me to get rid of you.\""
msgstr "\"정말 고귀하군. 동의할 뻔했지만 너를 없애는 게 그리 어렵지는 않아보여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "5df6e842-4646-4678-87b5-18feac3bf242"
msgid ""
"\"You have no idea what you're talking about. My crimes are more severe than "
"you can imagine...\" {n}Akiros's eyes blaze.{/n} \"I ran to {g|Stolen Lands}"
"the Stolen Lands{/g} to ESCAPE punishment. Seems I failed. Though it matters "
"little when you can't run away from yourself... Well, so be it. I'll return "
"to my homeland and surrender myself to their justice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 네가 무슨 말을 하고 있는 건 지 모른다. 내가 저지른 죄는 네가 상상할 수 있는 것보다 더 심하다.\" {n}아키로스의 눈이 "
"불타오릅니다.{/n} \"나는 처벌을 피하기 위해 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}으로 도망왔지. 하지만 실패한 거 같군. "
"자기 자신에게서 도망치지 못할 때는 모든 것이 끝난 거지... 글쎄, 어쩔 수 없지. 나는 고향으로 가서 정의의 심판을 받겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "d0d71c6e-9e31-4fa5-a9fb-6cb7b99937aa"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad to see that my good manners served me well. Farewell. I hope you "
"live to see the end of the day — perhaps you'll actually be able to bring "
"some change to these lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 행실이 바라서 정말 기쁘군. 그럼 이만. 종말의 그 날을 보기를 바란다. 아마 너는 이 땅에 변화를 가져올 수 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "1be62171-d9ed-4b00-a2fd-e12aad381a6a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry, but that just won't do. I offered you the chance to leave in "
"peace, but it seems we'll have to fight.\""
msgstr "\"미안해. 네 제안은 거절하지. 너에게 평화롭게 떠날 기회를 줬다. 하지만 우리는 싸워야 할 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "aa497708-5546-4762-946a-217ae97d71b2"
msgid ""
"{n}Akiros gives you a hard stare.{/n} \"An alliance, huh? Well... if my "
"'leader' weren't so fast to drown himself in wine, I probably wouldn't "
"listen, but... Sooner or later, the Stag Lord will get himself or all of us "
"killed, left to his own devices. All right. I'll stick around and help you "
"fight him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아키로스는 당신에게 이해하기 어렵다는 눈빛을 줍니다.{/n} \"동맹인가? 글쎄... 내 '리더'가 포도주에 익사하지는 않을 테니 "
"그 말을 듣지 말아야겠지만... 조만간 수사슴 군주는 자신은 물론 우리 모두를 죽게 하고 자기 멋대로 할 테지. 좋다. 네가 싸우는 걸 "
"돕겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "8d6e70b3-49b0-4cef-bc23-2fef4c825c02"
msgid ""
"\"I like your confidence, but I'm afraid I must disappoint you — I don't "
"just make alliances with anyone who offers.\""
msgstr "\"네 자신감이 마음에 들지만 실망시켜서 유감이군. 나는 아무하고나 동맹을 맺지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7bba64e8-b07b-4e04-abf4-4fb5a8d9d6bb"
msgid ""
"\"Wait... Did you just lure the Stag Lord's right hand over to your side? "
"Nice work!\""
msgstr "\"잠깐... 지금 수사슴 군주의 오른팔을 회유한건가요? 잘하셨습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ce8628c2-13f4-4dac-b15e-efa4b8c67d19"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! That's what I like about you. Just look at him — such a tough guy "
"before he met you, and now he's running with his tail between his legs like "
"some kind of whipped mutt!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하! 네가 그래서 좋아. 그가 너를 만나기 전까지 그는 거친 사내에 불과했지만 지금은 꼬리를 흔드는 강아지마냥 좋아하고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "89a77e62-852f-4ffe-a4d5-452159d4b76d"
msgid ""
"\"That's the spirit! What would we even talk about with these bandits? Let's "
"just chop their heads off — the conversation's over!\""
msgstr "\"바로 그거야! 왜 도적놈들이랑 대화를 해? 그냥 모가지를 따버리자고!.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "417ebd5d-119b-4a50-8356-95541768b525"
msgid "\"I hope I won't regret this decision.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 결정을 후회하지 않기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "0c2c8db8-9e7e-4d04-996a-89ba14cd0c20"
msgid "\"Then let's get down to business!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 본론으로 들어가보지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "c2c1fbf4-88cc-4a17-9c0f-9f64e9dd649c"
msgid ""
"{n}Akiros looks at the fort one last time, then turns away, never to see it "
"again.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아키로스는 요새를 다시 한 번 보았고 그 이후로는 다시는 돌아보지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "048c138e-ea78-47a2-ba9d-cff7921201c4"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps you'll succeed in bringing law to these lands after all. Maybe "
"even with your persuasion skills!\" {n}Akiros nods, a bitter smirk across "
"his face.{/n} \"Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쩌면 너는 이 땅에 질서를 가져오는 데 성공할 것이다. 아마도 나를 설득하는 정도라면 충분하겠지!\" {n}아키로스는 씁쓸한 얼굴로 "
"끄덕입니다.{/n} \"안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5235eb48-c5c0-4eba-abd3-99b5a0b81aee"
msgid ""
"\"You set a hardened criminal upon the path of law. The blood of a real "
"ruler truly runs in your veins!\""
msgstr "\"범법자를 법의 심판을 받게 하다니. 진정한 통치자의 피가 네 혈관 속에 흐르나봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "6ef3a494-507b-4ff6-a860-3a3dac539f73"
msgid ""
"{n}Akiros looks away.{/n} \"A servant of... It's been a long, long time... "
"Many years, and many atrocities ago.\""
msgstr "{n}아키로스는 먼 곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"... 오랜 세월이 지났어... 수년 동안 많은 잔학 행위가 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Akiros/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "c2119c3c-a093-4761-b000-f7e5722c9d0f"
msgid ""
"{n}After a moment of silence, the man resolutely looks you in the eye.{/n} "
"\"Tell you what... I won't be confessing my sins — believe me, they're "
"numerous and grievous — but I may still be able to contribute some good. I "
"have no hope of gaining my god's forgiveness, but if you're going to free "
"these lands from the Stag Lord, I'll help you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 침묵하고 남자는 당신을 단호하게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"나는 너에게 죄를 고하지 않을 것이다. 내 죄는 무수히 많겠지만 나는 "
"여전히 선한 일을 할 수 있다. 나는 용서를 얻을 자격이 없지만 수사슴 군주에게서 이 땅에 자유를 가져올 수 있다면 너를 돕겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "703a2daa-c879-4f3e-8ed9-06950d456591"
msgid ""
"Left alive Dovan from Nisroch, a cruel bandit, in exchange for cache with "
"his loot."
msgstr "도둑 니스로크의 도반의 목숨을 살려주는 대가로 그의 보물을 받습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "26a7242f-a830-498f-94a0-4520884c0770"
msgid ""
"\"Deal. But break your promise and I'll make you regret it, even if I have "
"to claw my way out of the Abyss to do so.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 하지만 약속을 어기면 내가 심연 속으로 빠져버리는 한이 있더라도 너를 후회하게 해줄 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "772bf291-bfd9-46d0-81f5-96b0a6dc8dae"
msgid "[Finish him] \"Hell no. I prefer you dead.\""
msgstr "[마무리한다] \"웃기지 마. 네가 죽는 게 더 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "22d98b1a-b9e1-4654-9391-9bc6de109ba9"
msgid "[Finish him] \"I like you better dead.\""
msgstr "[마무리한다] \"널 죽이는 게 더 나을 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "fe51d2c6-200d-46c1-a464-e99f73837f88"
msgid ""
"\"Stop! Listen, we can make a deal. You've probably heard things about me, "
"but I'm a reasonable man, not some insane murderer. If you let me go, I'll "
"leave these lands. In exchange for my life, I'll point you toward a cache "
"holding my share of the loot. Dovan of Nisroch always keeps his word!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만! 들어 봐. 우리는 거래를 할 수 있어. 물론 내 소문을 들어봤겠지. 하지만 나는 미치광이가 아니라 합리적인 사람이야. 나를 "
"풀어 주면 이 땅을 떠날게. 내 은닉처가 어디 있는지도 알려줄게. 니스로크의 도반은 항상 약속을 지킨다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "f7ce13e0-d648-4e84-bca7-f49d85f023af"
msgid ""
"{n}Dovan catches his breath.{/n} \"I always knew mixing with this lot would "
"do me no good. My cache is in the ditch to the left of the gate. Farewell! "
"It's nice to deal with someone who understands how to look out for "
"themselves.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도반이 숨을 죽입니다.{/n} \"나는 항상 이 많은 것을 섞는 것이 아무 소용 없다는 걸 알고 있었지. 내 은닉처는 정문 왼쪽 "
"도랑에 있어. 그럼 이만! 거래해서 즐거웠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b748f6c0-fd68-496c-9c3d-e1845afbda16"
msgid ""
"\"Even at death's door, the man is persistent in his sin... Do not let the "
"scoundrel escape unpunished!\""
msgstr "\"심지어 죽음의 문턱에서도 저 사람은 죄를 실토하지 않고 있습니다... 악당이 처벌을 받도록 해야 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a09c1eaa-3112-4ffc-adc6-1d5ee6eb9205"
msgid "{n}The priest lowers his weapon and silently turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사제는 무기를 내리고 조용히 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "3031cf4f-0b6b-4a42-91fd-c97dd196742b"
msgid "\"Curses! Then die!\""
msgstr "\"널 저주하마! 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1984228c-2d5c-4caf-88ab-f38d1bf9cf02"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes a quick death is the last mercy one can grant a dark soul.\""
msgstr "\"때때로 빠른 죽음은 어두운 영혼에게 줄 수 있는 마지막 자비입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "97b49e4c-80ff-4f76-a363-329a834180e6"
msgid ""
"\"A reasonable man who willfully embarks upon a path of atrocities is a "
"hundredfold more dangerous than any madman! You cannot let him go, {name}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"합리적인 판단으로 잔학한 행위를 하는 인간은 그 어떤 미친 사람보다 백배는 더 위험합니다. 그를 보내줘서는 안됩니다, {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "56941d0b-7b6b-4503-a0b4-00061493bc2e"
msgid ""
"\"Let us wash this dirt from the face of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}"
" with blood!\""
msgstr "\"더럽혀진 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 피로 씻겨내겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/AuchDovan/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "738ab1e0-9e0a-451f-9bf8-8199a08fbfdc"
msgid "\"Is that what your honor is worth? A fistful of bloody money?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너의 명예가 가치 있는 것인가? 피 묻은 돈 몇 푼으로?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/AkirosAfterBattle2_String
msgctxt "98e12d8a-c5ec-42a9-b9bb-561536970d86"
msgid "\"It seems the winds are changing. The winds, and perhaps more.\""
msgstr "\"바람이 바뀌고 있는 것 같아. 바람이 더 거세졌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/AkirosAfterBattle_String
msgctxt "bd44baa7-5dea-4074-b4be-9c5ab0f5c051"
msgid "\"Look around. This fortress belongs to you now.\""
msgstr "\"주변을 둘러봐. 이 요새는 이제 네 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/AkirosAllyBark_String
msgctxt "59ab006b-f55b-4e4b-955b-18f236e85f62"
msgid ""
"\"I think I'll wait for the festivities to begin. I'll be around when the "
"Stag Lord appears.\""
msgstr "\"나는 축하연이 시작되기를 기다릴 거야. 수사슴 군주가 나타나면 주변에 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/AkirosBattleBark_String
msgctxt "af571591-3f28-4855-a684-bda48f9a61c0"
msgid ""
"\"Out of my way, fools! You don't need to die for the Stag Lord, and neither "
"do I!\""
msgstr "\"길을 비켜라. 멍청이! 수사슴 군주를 위해 죽을 필요는 없어. 나도 그렇고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/AkirosBeforeBattle_String
msgctxt "24d7ffa8-ae92-4bd2-9805-041e7dac5ed2"
msgid "\"It's a good day to test our fate. Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"우리 운명을 시험해 보기 좋은 날이다. 준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/AkirosEnemyBark_String
msgctxt "586877d2-f190-4c0d-9a24-a5a49ddf5a56"
msgid "\"To me, fellows! And raise an alarm already!\""
msgstr "\"나를 따르라! 그리고 경보를 울려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/AuchBattleBark_String
msgctxt "a95b3bf9-64d9-46e5-accc-8ccd74404f48"
msgid "\"Blood! Sweet, bright blood!\""
msgstr "\"피! 달콤하고 밝은 피!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CompanionBarks/AmiriAlarm_String
msgctxt "5ab05422-d0c5-44a7-bfed-081260740d3f"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Looks like the fortress is awake! We can finally get a good fight!\""
msgstr "\"하! 요새에 난리가 난 거 같군! 좋은 싸움을 할 수 있겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CompanionBarks/HarrimNoAlarm_String
msgctxt "de1131d2-c35b-4472-828f-a0c692f83e2e"
msgid ""
"\"I like this silence. Soon it will be replaced with the sounds of battle, "
"screams of pain... We should appreciate this while we can.\""
msgstr "\"이 침묵이 마음에 든다. 곧 전투의 소리, 고통의 비명으로 바뀌겠지... 지금을 즐기라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CompanionBarks/JaethalAlarm_String
msgctxt "60edd20b-292c-454b-b161-3e0b4c0134c4"
msgid ""
"\"Looks like we got their attention. Well, the thicker the rye, the easier "
"the harvesting.\""
msgstr "\"주의를 끈 것 같다. 호밀이 두꺼울수록 수확은 쉽지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CompanionBarks/LinziAlarm_String
msgctxt "4d53054e-9d5c-4b4b-8aad-5fa9ac1936c6"
msgid "\"Oh, oh, oh! They raised the alarm! It's starting!\""
msgstr "\"오! 그들은 경보를 울렸어! 시작했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CompanionBarks/OctaviaNoAlarm_String
msgctxt "e1e6d360-f189-4b49-94ba-1090695ed22c"
msgid ""
"\"I've got goose bumps. Let's be careful, all right? Better to fight the "
"bandits one at a time, if we can.\""
msgstr "\"소름이 끼치는군. 조심하자. 한 번에 한 명씩 도둑들과 싸워야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CompanionBarks/RegongarNoAlarm_String
msgctxt "dc3deb54-6b60-4b81-9fe1-eddda4b9bc37"
msgid ""
"\"Easy, or the whole gang will show up. These idlers are best cut down one "
"by one.\""
msgstr "\"조심해. 도적들이 전부 이리로 올지 몰라. 이 게으름뱅이들은 하나씩 처리하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CompanionBarks/TristianNoAlarm_String
msgctxt "7d777e60-37b0-4288-9594-2a3fb8aeacde"
msgid ""
"\"We should take care. If they raise the alarm, bandits from all over the "
"fortress will come running.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 조심해야 해. 그들이 경보를 울리면 요새 곳곳에서 도적이 달려들 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CompanionBarks/ValerieAlarm_String
msgctxt "7bac48df-5cd8-488b-9e36-d2867872fc81"
msgid "\"That's the alarm! Close ranks — we're in for a tough battle!\""
msgstr "\"경보가 울렸다! 뭉쳐. 우리는 힘든 전투를 치를 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/FakeDuel1_String
msgctxt "3195f701-8368-4445-8aa8-4aa1d5aa7a7c"
msgid ""
"\"Does Jamandi, the wolf of Restov, think so little of me, sending such a "
"dimwit?\""
msgstr "\"레스토프의 늑대 자만디는 나를 하찮게 생각해서 이런 허접을 보내나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/FakeDuel2_String
msgctxt "f8fe914a-4551-4e5c-8da2-3ab1572cd90d"
msgid ""
"\"Did you really think I'd just fight you? Hey, idiots! Cut {mf|him|her} up!"
"\""
msgstr "\"내가 정말로 너와 싸울 것 같아? 멍청아! 저 녀석의 목을 따버려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/KressleStaglordDirect2_BoosePoisoned_String
msgctxt "ea392d02-d4d8-49dd-82f9-82c18301a94d"
msgid "\"What wretched wine did you bring me?! My stomach is twisting up!\""
msgstr "\"도대체 무슨 썩을 와인을 가져온 거야? 내 위장이 꼬이고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/KressleStaglordDirect2_I_String
msgctxt "6d5193e9-cf17-4857-a6d2-ba8a4fd367c6"
msgid "\"Oh... it's you, girl. Why have you come?\""
msgstr "\"오... 너구나. 왜 온 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/KressleStaglordDirect3_String
msgctxt "fcbc4c70-7c94-43f1-85db-b6c868ef3d99"
msgid ""
"\"You made it out to see us! Quite an achievement, for someone who claims to "
"be king of these lands!\""
msgstr "\"너는 우리를 만나러 나갔다! 이 땅의 왕이 되겠다고 주장하는 녀석에게는 괜찮은 보상이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/KressleStaglordDirect4_String
msgctxt "6016cc3a-f73d-4d29-b88f-144616c9ab3a"
msgid "\"Hold your tongue, Kressle.\""
msgstr "\"말 조심해. 크레슬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/KressleStaglordDirect5_String
msgctxt "af3323b0-a401-41fa-b225-ea0f8deb1083"
msgid ""
"\"No. I've had enough of following you like a dog. I'm here for blood, Stag "
"Lord. One of us won't see the end of this day!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 개처럼 따라다니는 건 이미 충분히 했다. 나는 피를 보러 왔다. 수사슴 군주. 우리 중 하나는 오늘 저세상에 갈 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/KressleStaglordDirect6_String_1
msgctxt "ceab7860-cb98-4010-9ef8-e32df08806e5"
msgid "\"All dogs try to bite their master eventually. They shouldn't.\""
msgstr "\"키우는 개들은 결국 주인을 물더라. 결국 고깃덩이가 되지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/CutSceneBarks/KressleStaglordDirect_String
msgctxt "60cfbd2a-c50e-4a30-b9a6-4ad76df7c800"
msgid "\"Hey, at the door! Call the Stag Lord.\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 문 앞이야! 수사슴 군주를 불러!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/DovanBattleBark_String
msgctxt "2aa3f868-3737-4975-82d0-da593e85c5f0"
msgid "\"I haven't gotten to kill anyone today... Sad!\""
msgstr "\"난 오늘 아무도 죽이지 못했다구... 우울하구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/GateKeeperBandit_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "1438b49f-5c67-472f-a571-009c585eac79"
msgid ""
"\"You lost, there? Get out of here, before I decide to wake up the commander!"
"\""
msgstr "\"미쳤나? 내가 사령관을 깨우기 전에 저리 가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/GatekeeperRecognize_String
msgctxt "35e1e066-be4f-4fff-ac45-7bc9c558dcd9"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, I know your face! You are the Aldori envoy who killed Happs' fellows "
"at the trading post!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 알아! 너는 교역소에서 햅스의 동료들을 죽인 알도리의 사절이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/IndorAndObjectBarks/NyrissaRoomBed_String
msgctxt "00c9ac24-4964-4555-9b47-0c915ade94dd"
msgid ""
"The luxurious bed is untouched. It seems that it hasn't been slept in for "
"some time."
msgstr "호화로운 침대는 손길이 닿지 않았습니다. 그것은 얼마 동안 사용을 하지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/IndorAndObjectBarks/NyrissaRoomClothes_String
msgctxt "f0867265-a556-4e23-bae4-f3b683d92230"
msgid ""
"The rich clothes in the chest seem to have been taken from robbed women. "
"They've been poorly washed, and bloodstains can be seen here and there on "
"them."
msgstr "옷장에 있는 비싼 옷들은 여성에게서 훔친 것 같습니다. 그것들은 세탁을 대충해서 핏자국이 여기저기 남아있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/IndorAndObjectBarks/NyrissaRoomFlowers_String
msgctxt "857e348a-7b47-4d5b-a4b0-b029fa05ebd6"
msgid "The flowers are almost fresh. It seems like they're changed frequently."
msgstr "꽃은 신선합니다. 자주 바꾸는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/IndorAndObjectBarks/NyrissaRoomJewelry_String
msgctxt "76246cfa-3fb4-4054-9992-afc999cf9fa2"
msgid "The previous owners of this jewelry didn't part with it voluntarily."
msgstr "이 보석의 이전 소유자는 순순히 그것을 주지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KressleAfterBattle_String
msgctxt "3ab14e1c-c8b4-49fe-800a-86cf24d51b7c"
msgid ""
"\"I believed in you so much, Stag Lord. And now... now you're just a dead "
"sack of bones.\""
msgstr "\"너를 믿었다. 수사슴 군주. 하지만 지금은... 너는 시체에 불과해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KressleBattleBark2_String
msgctxt "93a08cbe-f840-4baf-9854-b630d781e80a"
msgid "\"Enough of this! I don't serve the Stag Lord anymore!\""
msgstr "\"이젠 그만! 나는 더 이상 수사슴 순주를 섬기지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KressleBattleBark_String
msgctxt "0ab157ce-50bc-4c26-a654-4dacb043be76"
msgid "\"Let's settle it with a fight! Yes!\""
msgstr "\"싸움으로 해결하자! 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KressleBeforeBattle_String
msgctxt "4b54ced3-d847-40f0-a336-b3c6200370d1"
msgid "\"I hope you're ready!\""
msgstr "\"준비됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KresslePackAfter1_String
msgctxt "8086d00c-d851-4a6f-a549-683cb8caa5d6"
msgid "\"All dead, huh?\""
msgstr "\"모두 죽었군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KresslePackAfter2_String
msgctxt "0c6843ae-45bf-4efe-a4fb-d759630a8758"
msgid ""
"\"They called us 'traitors,' but I think 'pragmatists' is more fitting.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 우리를 '반역자'라고 불렀지만 '실용 주의자'가 더 적합하다고 생각해\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KresslePackAfter3_String
msgctxt "72e94130-de97-4b39-8883-241b8d85fe25"
msgid "\"What a fight! I'll be bragging about this in every tavern I visit!\""
msgstr "\"대단한 싸움이었어! 선술집에 갈 때마다 얘기할 거리가 생겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KresslePackBefore1_String
msgctxt "b3b12d6e-0f5e-4827-ac0a-bea95c9d86ec"
msgid ""
"\"A real fight, finally! No better feeling than cutting your ex-brethren's "
"throats!\""
msgstr "\"마침내 진정한 싸움이었어! 목을 베는 것보다 속이 시원한 건 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KresslePackBefore2_String
msgctxt "372ba58d-e2bf-48ba-8df2-c92e018df6fe"
msgid "\"Good old betrayal — I missed you so much.\""
msgstr "\"배신자. 네가 많이 그리웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/KresslePackBefore3_String
msgctxt "424988ca-5ad3-4e36-8936-918a2428e86c"
msgid "\"Well, I liked the Stag Lord, but who says I won't like him dead?\""
msgstr "\"나는 수사슴 군주를 좋아했지만 그가 시체가 되어도 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewBottlesIfPoisoned_String
msgctxt "135391dd-cc03-4449-bf90-6e14241c1dc2"
msgid ""
"Empty wine bottles cover the floor, the ones from the Thorn River bandit "
"camp among them."
msgstr "가시 강의 산적 야영지에서 나온 포도주 병이 빈병이 되어 바닥을 덮었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewBottles_String
msgctxt "86ce1dac-92cf-4cd6-a0d8-de0d816be5c9"
msgid "Empty wine bottles cover the floor."
msgstr "빈 포도주 병이 바닥을 덮었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewBuildingMaterials_String
msgctxt "edd2194e-dc57-4aed-8cdf-cf902a037019"
msgid "It seems that bandits wanted to build heavy fortifications here."
msgstr "도적들은 여기를 요새로 중무장하고 싶었나봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewCage_String
msgctxt "0ba73dac-caf9-40ff-b054-87d84688ee22"
msgid "A sloppy corral for some big animal."
msgstr "큰 동물들을 가두기 위한 느슨한 목장."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewCorpse_String
msgctxt "a3971f94-04f9-40eb-acf2-52686800c6d0"
msgid ""
"Human's corpse with signs of torture. Perhaps it was a bandit's prisoner or "
"even one of them, punished for some misdeed."
msgstr "고문의 흔적이 있는 인간의 시체입니다. 아마 벌을 받은 죄수일 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewEntrance_String
msgctxt "4e7a1367-fbfb-4fe6-93b4-76ce0367da33"
msgid ""
"This exit to fort backyard looks abandoned. It seems that bandits barely use "
"it."
msgstr "요새 뒤의 출구는 낙후되어있습니다. 도적도 거의 사용하지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewRuins1_String
msgctxt "5ede66dd-a505-4b2a-a2f0-ec86332324d9"
msgid ""
"Ancient ruins with signs of more recent, but likewise destroyed buildings. "
"It seems that someone tried to settle here before the bandits."
msgstr "비교적 최근에 헐어진 듯한 건물과 고대 유적지가 있습니다. 도적이 살기 전에 누군가 여기에 정착했던 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewRuins2_String
msgctxt "f2c2a1d1-f7ea-438d-bf7d-6770a7642952"
msgid ""
"Stone plates, supposedly gravestones. They are old, but seem to be newer "
"than surrounding ruins."
msgstr "묘비인 듯한 돌 판입니다. 낡았지만 주변의 폐허보다 새것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewSightFromHill_String
msgctxt "e5d42670-914f-4e13-b784-ed12a436a4be"
msgid ""
"The place that bandits have chosen for their fortress is possibly the best "
"to start a city. It's suitable both for life, trade and defense."
msgstr "도적이 요새로 선택한 장소는 아마도 도시를 짓는 데 가장 좋은 장소 같습니다. 주거, 무역, 방어 모두에 적합합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NewStolenGoods_String
msgctxt "53fda734-96a1-4c6b-a87d-38eda56c716a"
msgid ""
"Some of the goods are stained with blood. It's not hard to guess the sad "
"fate of their owners."
msgstr "상품 중 일부는 피로 얼룩져 있습니다. 그들의 소유자의 슬픈 운명을 짐작하는 것은 어렵지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NugrahBattleBark1_String
msgctxt "e907ab12-d956-48d2-9174-5f5fd1225ea2"
msgid "\"Stranger... Stranger wants my blood, I know!\""
msgstr "\"낯선 사람... 낯선 사람이 내 피를 원한다. 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NugrahBattleBark2_String
msgctxt "0dc6eb3c-c975-487f-93ac-1da2a93f3aa6"
msgid "\"I will not fear... I can't anymore! No fear, no fear, no fear!\""
msgstr "\"나는 두려워하지 않을 것이다... 나는 더 이상 두렵지 않아! 두려움은, 두려움은 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NugrahBattleBark3_String
msgctxt "c88fb50f-de95-4059-b329-6926ab815fac"
msgid ""
"\"I want you dead! I want to be strong, to stand over your dead body! And "
"over his dead body! He...\""
msgstr "\"네가 죽길 원해! 나는 네 시체 위에 서있을 것이다! 그도 시체가 될 것이다! 그는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/NugrahBattleBark4_String
msgctxt "e3816ec9-7cf9-403f-a1d7-fc13ef5ed271"
msgid "\"Die, die, die, die!\""
msgstr "\"죽어, 죽어라, 죽어라, 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/StagLordAlarmCutscene1_String
msgctxt "55ec9708-4400-490b-b719-538c5c8eef6c"
msgid "\"Who dares to disturb me while I'm drinking?\""
msgstr "\"감히 누가 내가 술 먹고 있는 시간을 방해하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/StagLordAlarmCutscene2_String
msgctxt "2826766d-d03a-4007-bb27-668380efbfb1"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I'll be happy to spend some time with you, Restov bootlicker. I'll "
"even make some time for your funeral.\""
msgstr "\"너와 시간을 보내고 싶군. 네 장례식에 갈 시간도 마련하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/StagLordBattleBark1_String
msgctxt "1411bc38-3715-4920-989a-4c0a75cbd172"
msgid "\"I bow to no one!\""
msgstr "\"나는 누구에게도 굴복하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/StagLordBattleBark2_String
msgctxt "85e029cb-72d4-4302-85f9-caaa9731ad0e"
msgid "\"My Dream, my Queen... grant me power!\""
msgstr "\"내 꿈, 나의 여왕... 내게 힘을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/StagLordBattleBark_String
msgctxt "1799ba46-aaa0-4e69-ac32-95562861eb2d"
msgid "\"These lands are mine! I won't let you take them from me!\""
msgstr "\"이 땅은 내 것이다. 네가 빼앗지 못하게 하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/StagLordFort_RunAway_String
msgctxt "81d06019-11e9-48db-a82d-6b73857c0d8a"
msgid "\"Alarm! Warn the Stag Lord!\""
msgstr "\"비상! 수사슴 군주에게 알려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/StartAlarm_FinalGuard_String
msgctxt "341c6303-2c2f-48a9-8840-079a79cdbeb8"
msgid "\"Alarm! Alarm! Call the Stag Lord!\""
msgstr "\"비상! 비상! 수사슴 군주에게 알려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Barks/WallAlarmBark_String
msgctxt "9b19b8f6-0bbe-4204-a949-a196adb5d6e8"
msgid ""
"Climbing over the breach proved to be more difficult than it seemed. Judging "
"by the voices coming from the fort, you've been spotted."
msgstr "그곳을 오르는 것은 생각보다 어려웠습니다. 요새에서 들려오는 목소리로 판단하건데 당신은 발견되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Interfaces/AcrobaticsCheck_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "ab363c96-b26c-41fd-b26c-c85c763780a2"
msgid "Climb over the wall."
msgstr "벽을 오른다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Interfaces/BoxesAndBarreslToClear_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "33d66302-c7e8-4c54-bc9c-4c9cb08f1c7f"
msgid "Move the boxes."
msgstr "상자를 옮긴다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Interfaces/DrippingClock_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "533c670d-3e14-4f1e-b5bc-c5adeb7b77bc"
msgid "Break Dripping Clock"
msgstr "똑딱이는 시계를 부숩니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Interfaces/GoldPileGroup_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "29a8e036-fe8b-4d54-8a88-8544ead69e0d"
msgid "Collect treasure — 1000 BP"
msgstr "보물을 챙긴다 — 1000 BP"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Interfaces/LakeDepth_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "2bbd4f42-1663-4282-860a-0c6e1b5f6c87"
msgid "Lake Depths"
msgstr "호수 심부"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Interfaces/PeltFence_SecretDoor1_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "5450d0a0-8e27-49f3-a691-53787f7a4722"
msgid "Push aside"
msgstr "옆으로 밀기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Interfaces/PhysiqueCheck_DisplayName 1_String
msgctxt "8adf5f34-e5e7-4639-9525-eff96f4e27d0"
msgid "Broaden the passage by force."
msgstr "강제로 통로를 넓힙니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Interfaces/WallBreakAfter_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "a2d34181-5303-44f5-a0de-f57228fd6dbc"
msgid "Return behind the wall."
msgstr "벽 뒤로 돌아갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Items/BrokenAmulet_Name_String
msgctxt "3e0900ca-ba1e-4e4d-8572-7e569fe51b85"
msgid "Stag Lord's Broken Charm"
msgstr "수사슴 군주의 부러진 부적"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Items/BrokenAmulet_String
msgctxt "c3b6fc94-d1f2-4023-b8d0-ffd3ccfa3d81"
msgid ""
"A charm once worn by the Stag Lord. It's smeared with blood. It probably "
"used to have something inside, but it's empty now."
msgstr "한 때 수사슴 군주가 하던 부적입니다. 피가 묻어있습니다. 아마도 내부에 뭔가가 있었지만 지금은 비어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Items/NugrahLastLetter_Name_String
msgctxt "8e41698b-0e04-4753-baad-7daa912b75ac"
msgid "Nugrah's Crumpled Note"
msgstr "누그라의 구겨진 메모"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/Items/NugrahLastLetter_String
msgctxt "0589b159-42e4-4c5f-ae5c-eb699c42b19a"
msgid ""
"\"He calls to her again — his Queen. He drinks, he calls to her, he drinks "
"again. I have no idea who she is. I can't even tell if she exists outside "
"his own drunken vision. But I know he'll call to her, and then he'll crash "
"around angrily, yelling that she didn't come. Then he'll come for me.\n"
"I obey the rules. I do as he says. I keep silent until he allows me to "
"speak. But he still beats me every time he drinks and rages.\n"
"He said he'll burn my hands in acid next time. Will I still be able to "
"write? I...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 다시 그녀를 불렀다. 그는 술을 마시고 그녀를 부르고 다시 술을 마셨다. 그녀가 누군지 알 수 없다. 그가 술을 마셔서 생긴 "
"환상이 그녀인지 알 수 없는 것이다. 하지만 그가 그녀를 부르고 그녀가 오지 않는다고 소리를 지르며 물건을 부순다. 그리고 그는 내게 "
"온다.\n"
"나는 규칙에 복종한다. 나는 그가 말한대로한다. 나는 그가 말하라고 명령할 때까지 침묵을 지킨다. 그러나 그는 술을 마시고 분노할 때마다 "
"여전히 나를 때린다.\n"
"그는 다음에 내 손을 산성 용액으로 태워버릴 거라고 했다. 그러면 나는 글을 쓸 수 있을까? 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a802e8ad-1323-4321-8178-206a33a3cca4"
msgid ""
"\"It's a bold plan and I like it. It's time to pay the Stag Lord a visit!\""
msgstr "\"대담한 계획이고 마음에 들어. 수사슴 군주에게 빚을 치룰 시간이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "8fed45a3-7b80-4528-8c6e-4f29a2ecfbd5"
msgid "\"Why did you decide to rebel against the Stag Lord?\""
msgstr "\"왜 수사슴 군주에 반기를 들기로 결심했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3091d222-dc5d-47ec-b753-bd21a0d7da23"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You'll share the same fate as the rest of the Stag Lord's "
"henchmen.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 수사슴 군주의 나머지 부하들과 같은 운명을 맞이할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "94cbc98a-39a9-4720-b01e-57d4cdfc6d6e"
msgid ""
"\"Direct attack might not be the best option. I'll look for other ways to "
"enter the fort. Stay alert and join me when you hear the sounds of fighting."
"\""
msgstr "\"직접 공격은 최선의 선택이 아닐 수도 있다. 요새에 들어가는 다른 방법을 찾아 보겠어. 싸우는 소리가 들릴 때 합류해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "3f15a702-25a9-4f86-90b1-471535159161"
msgid "\"So, what's your plan?\""
msgstr "\"계획이 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "5770a523-eff8-44f1-85ee-d7423aaf1a1c"
msgid "\"I changed my mind. Let's use your plan with direct attack\"."
msgstr "\"마음이 바뀌었다. 직접 공격으로 계획을 변경하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "a21832ca-2c4d-4d67-926a-65cd8299adce"
msgid "\"Wait here while I look around.\""
msgstr "\"내가 둘러 보는 동안 여기서 기다려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "44fc80ad-d1e2-42fa-b7ee-9e4dcca212de"
msgid ""
"\"Now, this is a surprise.\" {d|Kressle Good}Kressle{/d} {n}salutes you. She "
"seems to be focused but sullen.{/n} \"I'm on my way to pay the Stag Lord a "
"visit, and I don't expect it to be a friendly one. How about we go together? "
"I'd appreciate some help during the fight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"놀랍군.\" {n}{d|Kressle Good}크레슬{/d}이 당신에게 경례합니다. 진중한 어조지만 약간 뚱한 기색이 "
"엿보입니다.{/n} \"수사슴 군주를 만나러 가는 길인데, 그리 좋은 소식을 전하러 가는 건 아니라서. 같이 가는 게 어때? 싸울 때 "
"도와준다면 고맙겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "ccf0c1fd-56ec-4c12-bcf7-946074571b07"
msgid ""
"\"I used my head, finally.\" {n}Kressle's words sound bitter.{/n} \"I grew "
"up in {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, choking on its hypocrisy. {g|Swordlords}The "
"Aldori{/g} make like they're these brave and noble defenders of justice, but "
"they're afraid to so much as bark at {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g}. The Stag "
"Lord... He seemed different. Mighty, menacing, like a huge wave rolling "
"toward the shore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"생각이란 걸 좀 했지. 드디어 말이야.\" {n}크레슬은 씁쓸하게 말합니다.{/n} \"나는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에서 "
"자랐어. 그들의 위선은 숨 막혔지. {g|Swordlords}알도리{/g}는 자기네들이 용감하고 고귀한 수호자인 것처럼 굴지만 그들은 "
"{g|House Surtova}서토바 가문{/g}에게 짖기만 하는 겁쟁이들이였어. 수사슴 군주는... 그는 달랐어. 강하고 위협적인데 "
"마치 해안을 덮치는 거대한 파도 같았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "56d9e3c7-b7c3-4b53-a75e-4b9bdc1c8606"
msgid ""
"\"He said he'd build a new kingdom here, and anyone brave enough to fight "
"under his banner would get a new life. But now? Now he just sits in his "
"fortress drinking away and plumping the bedroom pillows for some 'queen' of "
"his, though I can't say if she's real or just a symptom of his drunken "
"delirium.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 여기에 새로운 왕국을 건설하겠다고 말했고 그의 깃발 아래서 싸울 수 있는 용감한 사람은 새로운 삶을 보장받았었어. 하지만 "
"지금은? 그는 단지 요새에 처박혀 술이나 마시고 침실에서 실제로 존재하는지도 모르는 여왕이니 뭐니 하는 것과 놀아나고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "11667a05-1f16-4bb4-b0eb-28b97aeaffa1"
msgid ""
"\"I trusted him. In his name, I almost got Svetlana killed — the only living "
"soul who's been kind to me. I was wrong, and I want to right that wrong with "
"my own hands. I WILL free these lands of the Stag Lord!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그 사람을 믿었어. 그의 명에 따라 스베틀라나를 거의 죽일 뻔했지. 내게 친절한 유일한 사람이었는데. 하지만 내가 틀렸어. 내 "
"손으로 그 잘못을 바로잡고 싶어. 나는 수사슴 군주로부터 이 땅을 자유롭게 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "7a17cc4a-f16f-430e-87b7-b6945db712ee"
msgid ""
"\"What's to plan? A fight's a fight! They'll let me and anyone with me "
"inside the fort, no questions asked. Once we're there, we call out the Stag "
"Lord and tell him it's time for him to demonstrate his 'royal' ambitions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"계획은 무슨? 싸움은 싸움일 뿐이야! 그들은 묻지도 않고 나를 요새 안으로 들여보낼 거야. 우리가 들어가면 수사슴 군주를 불러서 "
"'고귀한' 야망을 실현할 때라고 말해주자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "744e9d7b-9678-4060-a980-3d1372435510"
msgid ""
"{n}Kressle salutes you with her weapon.{/n} \"Let's go. Let the fate of {g|"
"Stolen Lands}the Stolen Lands{/g} be decided in battle!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}크레슬은 당신에게 자신의 무기로 경례를 합니다.{/n} \"가자. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 운명이 이 "
"전투에 달렸어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "5b236060-d83c-4db4-bbba-ffd7c9cbc852"
msgid ""
"{n}Kressle kicks at a small stone on the ground.{/n} \"Fine. Just don't take "
"long!\""
msgstr "{n}크레슬은 땅에 있는 작은 돌을 찹니다.{/n} \"좋아. 오래 걸리지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/KressleBeforeFort/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "f85e8c41-01bf-479f-8bcb-392d396de05b"
msgid "\"Get a nice walk in? Can we go to the fortress already?\""
msgstr "\"산책은 잘했어? 요새로 갈까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "2826be25-d879-4811-8ed4-aa460a7e77d5"
msgid ""
"\"You're waiting for new recruits, right? I was told to introduce myself to "
"the Stag Lord.\""
msgstr "\"신병을 모집하고 있지? 수사슴 군주에게 나를 소개하라고 명령받았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c3743fb6-e456-4b6d-aa46-c69c1495099b"
msgid "Challenged the Stag Lord to an honest duel."
msgstr "수사슴 군주에게 정정당당한 결투를 요청합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "94746117-f35e-4536-8dee-d76b5d42748a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm an envoy of Restov and the Swordlords. Inform the Stag Lord that I'm "
"here to fight him. If he's as fierce as rumors say, he'll accept my "
"challenge.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 레스토프와 소드로드의 특사이다. 수사슴 군주에게 내가 결투를 요청한다고 알려라. 소문처럼 그가 전투를 잘한다면 내 결투 신청을 "
"받아들일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "762364af-ae1a-4919-a0d1-f09cd4dda656"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm here to spare the Stolen Lands from your kind!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너 같은 놈에게서 도둑맞은 땅을 보호하기 위해 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "67d76eb7-75f4-4ea7-b7e1-6cd4652027d9"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"I'm just a simple traveler who lost my way! I'll leave immediately!"
"\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 길을 잃은 단순한 여행자입니다. 나는 곧 떠날 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "1c25e827-3cca-43df-9ba2-fd44708dfc88"
msgid "\"I bring a message from the river camp for Akiros!\""
msgstr "\"강가 야영지에서 아키로스에게 온 메시지를 가지고 왔어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "66bf0390-17e6-4a75-b62f-120118195ab6"
msgid ""
"\"Stop! Who's there?\" {n}A sentry calls out to you lazily, an obvious "
"demonstration of how self-assured the bandits here are.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그만! 거기 누구야?\" {n}보초가 지루함에 빠진 목소리로 당신을 부르는데 이 곳의 도적들이 자만심에 빠진 것을 알 수 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "aaa7b48f-7408-4fb8-b4f7-9652a14f8a4d"
msgid ""
"\"What, those mites steal the Stag Lord's wine again? Ugh, fine, go on and "
"give your report.\""
msgstr "\"마이트가 수사슴 군주의 와인을 다시 훔쳐? 알았어. 가서 보고해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "3dd75ad3-6703-467f-97c2-94c1fb463add"
msgid ""
"\"I don't remember him saying anything about you. He's a strict man, Akiros "
"is. He wouldn't forget to mention something like that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 너에 대해 무슨 말을 했는지 기억나지 않는다. 그는 엄격한 사람이다. 아키로스는 자신이 한 말을 잊을 사람이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "a6d64c20-dbe7-48e0-b0e5-35acdaca6d92"
msgid ""
"\"Like he's got nothing better to do than greet every flea that comes to "
"visit. Well, go on, I guess. Maybe it'll provide some entertainment!\""
msgstr "\"그가 방문하는 모든 나부랭이들에게 인사할 것 같지는 않군. 가 봐. 아마 놀림거리가 되겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "f8312dce-5eb9-4b57-85db-24efee49adda"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I know about 'recruits' like you. Get out of here, before I call my "
"commander.\""
msgstr "\"하하! 너 같은 신병들을 알고 있어. 내가 지휘관을 부르기 전에 꺼져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "f63a4bb1-1ad5-4fc0-b422-24a92162b319"
msgid ""
"{n}The sentry scratches the back of his head.{/n} \"So, what, I gotta go "
"wake up the commander? These {g|Restov}Restovic{/g} challengers just keep "
"coming... Make me run in, report to the commander, then clean up their "
"corpses... All right, fine, just wait here. I'll go talk to the commander.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}문지기는 머리를 긁습니다.{/n} \"그래서 어쩌라고. 사령관을 깨울까? {g|Restov} 레스토프{/g} 놈들은 계속 "
"오는구나... 너희 때문에 내가 계속 사령관에게 보고하고 너희 시체를 치워야 해... 좋아. 여기서 기다려. 내가 사령관에게 이야기할 "
"거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "637676ab-2971-42d6-91b1-6fa02745d03d"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha! You have to make it inside, first! Oh, but look at these brave "
"fighters here!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 들어갈 수나 있을까? 여기 용감한 싸움꾼이 있네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/MainGate/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "b66c8725-50d9-4465-8e1e-12d0dc567ac3"
msgid ""
"\"Get out of here, traveler! Count yourself lucky the commander's asleep and "
"I'm in a good mood — otherwise, I'd just call the others in to fill you with "
"feathers.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 나가! 내 기분이 좋고 지휘관이 잠든 걸 행운이라 생각해. 아니었으면 네 모가지를 날려버렸을 거니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "855b4f06-b61b-4cf3-aea6-b6595f03216d"
msgid "[Try to calm the owlbear]"
msgstr "[아울베어를 진정시키려 시도한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "30987f97-c7e3-406d-aa3a-7fda9ffcb6d0"
msgid "Showed pity and freed the owlbear that had been caught by bandits."
msgstr "도적이 잡은 아울베어를 풀어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "22b87a08-811e-44ba-b2d6-ab939c07d625"
msgid "[Open the cage and free the owlbear]"
msgstr "[우리를 열고 아울베어를 풀어준다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "6cb428b2-130d-4ec4-b2cf-0d3104d7bc1d"
msgid "[Lock the cage securely to prevent the owlbear from escaping]"
msgstr "[우리를 단단히 잠가 아울베어가 탈출하는것을 막는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "ae43ff8f-4281-4930-bec3-7cebedc0d71b"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "f819618f-f2db-420b-9cef-a1fb89df865e"
msgid "[Try to quietly kill the caged owlbear]"
msgstr "[갇혀있는 아울베어를 조용히 죽이려 시도한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "08e226e0-133c-4c75-a36a-4a586967bb3f"
msgid "Left the owlbear alive so it would help fight the Stag Lord."
msgstr "아울베어를 살려두어 수사슴 군주와 싸우는 데 도움이 될 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "d6d7ef53-881c-4208-8cf5-7588d43efb2b"
msgid ""
"[Step away from the cage] \"This owlbear will help us fight the Stag Lord.\""
msgstr "[우리를 내버려둔다] \"이 아울베어는 수사슴 군주와 싸우는 데 도움이 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "c210aa32-0df5-4eb8-858f-f1b619ff2de5"
msgid ""
"{n}The caged owlbear seems to be worried. He growls softly as you approach. "
"It looks strong enough to break the cage's door.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}갇힌 아울베어가 걱정하는 것 같습니다. 그는 당신이 접근함에 따라 부드럽게 가르랑거립니다. 케이지의 문을 부수기에 충분히 강해 "
"보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "c43dcf2f-4cc7-4499-bb9a-b6bd2c7f5f11"
msgid ""
"{n}The owlbear seems to have endured some sort of abuse recently — probably "
"at the hands of a certain druid. It's scared, angry, and wants to take "
"revenge on his offenders. It seems to understand that you're not one of "
"them, and it probably won't attack you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아울베어는 최근에 아마 어떤 드루이드의 손에 일종의 학대를 견뎌 왔던 것 같습니다. 두려워하고 화가 났으며 그의 범죄자들을 "
"복수하려고 합니다. 당신이 그들 중 하나가 아니라는 것을 이해하는 것 같습니다. 아마 당신을 공격하지 않을 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "a22f33d4-e78f-4918-910d-952444e75a1e"
msgid "{n}The owlbear is angry — that's about all you can understand.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아울베어는 화가났습니다. 그게 당신이 이해할 수있는 전부입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "b54ef928-81ee-47a8-bc63-93f29217a020"
msgid "{n}You properly secure the cage door.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}우리의 문을 제대로 고정합니오.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "0a38b8f3-d0e1-4098-86b0-e7783e708de1"
msgid ""
"{n}Your efforts don't seem to have accomplished anything — the cage door "
"still looks like it would be easy to open.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 노력은 아무것도 성취하지 못한 것 같습니다. 케이지 문은 여는 것은 여전히 쉬운 것처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "9481bf56-67b0-465e-ac0f-ef67664b9421"
msgid ""
"{n}You wait until the owlbear looks away, then kill it with one quick "
"blow.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아울베어가 다른 곳을 볼 때까지 기다린 다음 일격을 가해 죽입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "c55ce94e-7916-469e-a0bf-58e8a21ace2c"
msgid ""
"{n}You accomplish your goal, but the owlbear gives a long, roaring scream "
"before it dies.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 목표를 달성하지만 아울베어는 죽기 전에 오랫동안 소리 치며 비명을 지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/OwlbearCage/Cue_0029_Text_1
msgctxt "436b90a1-2dcd-4e5f-b5ae-a65835b3866b"
msgid ""
"{n}The cage is locked securely. The owlbear looks at you sadly from the "
"corner of the cage.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}케이지가 단단히 고정되어 있습니다. 아울베어는 케이지 구석에서 슬프게 당신을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e9754893-097e-4589-ab42-a49dfd482eb8"
msgid ""
"Told the Stag Lord that his childhood sufferings are not an excuse for the "
"crimes he commited."
msgstr "수사슴 군주에게 어린 시절에 겪은 고난은 저지른 범죄에 대한 변명이 될 수 없다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "0ee6919d-cc92-4691-a97f-aea0e2398333"
msgid ""
"\"I know of the pain you've endured in your life, but that doesn't excuse "
"the atrocities you committed!\""
msgstr "\"네가 인생에서 겪었던 고통을 안다. 그러나 그게 네가 저지른 잔학 행위를 합당하게 만들어 주지는 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cd847daa-5e41-4b4e-bc3c-e60e2d8045d8"
msgid "Told the Stag Lord that his crimes could not be forgiven."
msgstr "수사슴 군주에게 그의 범죄가 용서될 수 없다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "78d2e79f-23be-4061-b08d-dffbf95e7afa"
msgid "\"Your crimes cannot be forgiven.\""
msgstr "\"네 범죄는 용서받을 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "70bdc952-9e06-49a8-80f7-101f408e1af2"
msgid "Told the Stag Lord that you will rule his lands now."
msgstr "당신이 그의 땅을 지배할 거라고 수사슴 군주에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8b85db0e-b530-41db-9e16-f90bd1dc7b73"
msgid "\"These lands can only have one ruler. That's why you'll die here.\""
msgstr "\"이 땅에는 오직 한 명의 통치자만 있을 수 있다. 그래서 너는 여기서 죽을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d0cb70da-a430-490e-ad82-02cef20e01e7"
msgid "Mocked the fallen Stag Lord."
msgstr "쓰러진 수사슴 군주를 조롱합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "832a8dec-a5be-4796-9e8a-b0114e12fe80"
msgid ""
"[Spit on the Stag Lord] \"Ha! What a wimp! I have no idea why everyone was "
"so scared about you.\""
msgstr "[수사슴 군주에게 침을 뱉는다] \"하하! 겁쟁이! 왜 모두 너를 무서워하는지 모르겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : StagLord
msgctxt "cf16fa2b-cf50-4a33-9841-fef8aa9de21f"
msgid ""
"\"I can't... fall... After so long, I learned to stand, I...\" {n}The Stag "
"Lord clutches something resembling a charm in his bloody fingers, seemingly "
"placing the last of his hope into it. You hear a snapping sound, and then a "
"dull sigh bursts from the Stag Lord's chest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 넘어 질 수 없다... 오랫동안 나는 서있는 것을 배웠다. 나는...\" {n}수사슴 군주는 그의 피 묻은 손가락으로 부적을 "
"닮은 무언가를 움켜 쥡니다. 마치 마지막 희망을 그 안에 불어넣는 것 같습니다. 당신은 딱 소리를 듣습니다. 그런다음 수사슴 군주의 "
"가슴에서 흐릿한 한숨이 터집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : StagLord
msgctxt "f839e5ea-122f-45af-825a-d2afd94a8f06"
msgid ""
"\"Spare me your... compassion, your judgment. I... I'll sleep now. I'll wait "
"for her... my dream...\""
msgstr "\"나에게 자비를... 나는 이제... 잠들 거야. 그녀를... 꿈에서 기다릴거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : StagLord
msgctxt "d9f5ee1d-a6fa-4299-9337-06f45fe698d7"
msgid ""
"\"What do you know... about crimes? I couldn't... tolerate... I did "
"everything she...\""
msgstr "\"네가 그 범죄에 대해 아는 게 있나? 나는 인정할 수 없다... 나는 참을 수 없다... 모두 그녀 때문에...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : StagLord
msgctxt "a9942c81-71d9-4e73-b001-78b0948d2f84"
msgid ""
"\"These lands... are cursed... We'll see if you... live here longer than I..."
"\""
msgstr "\"이 땅은... 저주받았어. 곧... 알게 될 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordFort/StagLordAfterFight/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : StagLord
msgctxt "da6988ad-0e3d-4f28-8d4a-6bc59373a445"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes I... wonder that myself... Was it my own doing... or her "
"blessing...\""
msgstr "\"가끔은... 궁금하다... 지금 나 자신이... 내 의지의 결과인지... 아니면 그녀의 축복인지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/1Cutscene_1SL_String
msgctxt "7b7e6ddd-fb4e-47ed-80ac-abc5f5500054"
msgid ""
"\"Father, please! I looked for the herbs you asked for, there just weren't "
"enough to-\""
msgstr "\"아버지. 제발! 말씀하신 약초를 찾아봤지만 많지 않았...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/1Cutscene_2Nugrah_String
msgctxt "4e65dec3-d874-4961-bf22-f4374827c39c"
msgid ""
"\"Silence! Did you forget the rules? You speak when I say. You do as I say. "
"Disobedience leads to punishment. And you have disobeyed twice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"닥쳐라! 규칙을 잊었느냐? 내가 허락할 때만 말해라. 시키는 것만 해라. 불복종은 처벌받을 것이다. 그리고 너는 두 번이나 거역했구나."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/1Cutscene_3SL_String
msgctxt "9308a9ab-897c-4a65-8348-2988d481fd01"
msgid "\"But Father...\""
msgstr "\"하지만 아버지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/1Cutscene_4Nugrah_String
msgctxt "1c4fafab-1dff-4d50-9fc4-46beeea80601"
msgid "\"Three times.\""
msgstr "\"세 번.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/1Cutscene_5SL_String
msgctxt "67d9cc2a-0f7a-47fa-942b-71685e7c1c04"
msgid "\"E-enough... I c-can't... Enough!\""
msgstr "\"그... 그만... 이젠 더 이상!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/2Cutscene_1Nugrah_String
msgctxt "fe052608-89e9-4fdd-97df-478a848a67f5"
msgid ""
"\"Where have you been? I told you to prepare everything for the ritual.\""
msgstr "\"어디에 있었지? 의식을 위해 모든 것을 준비하라고 했을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/2Cutscene_2SL_String
msgctxt "78591aff-d91e-405a-86e5-4fed2147ddf6"
msgid "\"You will never give me orders again.\""
msgstr "\"다시는 내게 그 따위로 명령하지 못할거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/2Cutscene_3Nugrah_String
msgctxt "03eabc95-2cac-4f8d-b8ed-0098eb166bc5"
msgid "\"What...?\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/2Cutscene_4SL_String
msgctxt "b32b9971-6acd-4544-b08c-f93a84de5b2d"
msgid ""
"\"Well, then, summon your power! Or maybe you'd like to try the acid?! I am "
"not your slave any longer.\""
msgstr "\"네 힘을 사용해봐! 아니면 산을 뿌려볼테냐?! 나는 더 이상 네 노예가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/2Cutscene_5SL_String
msgctxt "8d0f52ae-c3ba-4759-b1cc-8129eaeb2ba4"
msgid "\"Not your toy!\""
msgstr "\"당신 장난감이 아니라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/2Cutscene_6SL_String
msgctxt "6ee3f847-9eaf-491e-b4a4-7579239aa126"
msgid "\"Not your son!\""
msgstr "\"당신 아들이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/2Cutscene_7Nugrah_String
msgctxt "95ebf2e3-c700-4b6b-85b1-150e71c2b81c"
msgid "\"Enough! I...\""
msgstr "\"그만! 내가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/2Cutscene_8SL_String
msgctxt "7b060113-4115-4123-8697-6cbb0fe0601c"
msgid ""
"\"I won't kill you. Your powers will be of use to me. From now on, you do as "
"I say. You speak when I say. Disobedience leads to punishment. Always!\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽이진 않으마. 너의 힘은 쓸모가 있을테니. 이제부터 너는 시키는 것만 한다. 내가 허락할 때만 말한다. 불복종은 처벌받을 것이다. "
"언제든지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/DraftBark_1_String
msgctxt "767cddb5-650a-40cf-983c-383319b152a8"
msgid "A wooden house, timeworn and apparently deserted."
msgstr "목재로 지어진 집. 오래되어 낡았으며 버려진 것이 분명합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/DraftBark_2_String
msgctxt "8de53c99-fe59-41c2-9e18-1e2895b42f6f"
msgid "Rotted wooden racks, long ago used for drying herbs."
msgstr "오래전에 허브를 건조하던 썩은 나무 선반입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/DraftBark_3_String
msgctxt "382c63c4-0f6d-4860-89da-d101fe4d16e0"
msgid "Bushes grow in the well — a clear sign that it was abandoned long ago."
msgstr "덤불이 우물에서 자라는 것은 오래 전에 버려졌다는 명백한 신호입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/DraftBark_4_String
msgctxt "9658744d-bc98-417c-b157-7e99f645160c"
msgid ""
"The stone altar is decorated with an eroded foliage pattern and symbols of "
"Green Faith."
msgstr "돌 제단은 침식된 단풍 무늬와 녹색 신앙의 상징으로 장식되어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/DraftBark_5_String
msgctxt "4adbdf07-c9bf-444b-b24c-41723f73515a"
msgid "The staircase decayed and collapsed long ago. It can't be climbed."
msgstr "계단은 오래 전에 썩고 붕괴되었습니다. 계단을 오를 수는 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/DraftBark_6_String
msgctxt "0d1a15a7-7abc-4b73-b0a9-fc8ad0ad26b4"
msgid "A small deserted timber shed."
msgstr "작은 버려진 목재 창고."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/GrassNearChest_String
msgctxt "71477e4c-dde7-4339-af8a-77c03e8f73fa"
msgid ""
"The ground near the chest is covered with culinary herbs. They dried out "
"long ago."
msgstr "궤짝 근처의 땅은 요리용 허브로 덮여있습니다. 하지만 오래 전에 말라버렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/NotesRuined_String
msgctxt "988e54c8-8dee-4d33-8a4c-ce0efd355b49"
msgid ""
"Between the stones lies a piece of paper, covered with scrawls. The time and "
"dampness made it unreadable."
msgstr "돌 사이에는 조각으로 휘갈겨 쓴 종이 조각이 놓여 있습니다. 시간과 습기로 인해 읽을 수 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Barks/NyrissaWelcome_String
msgctxt "d5d3e074-b4f4-4d5a-a129-4b54fc7a3bf0"
msgid "\"You are here! Please, follow me...\""
msgstr "\"왔구나! 나를 따라와...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Items/NugrahNotes1_Ruined_String
msgctxt "79a73ce8-ccd8-45ab-95d1-8874f036e393"
msgid ""
"(The notes are heavily damaged from the fog. Only bits and pieces are still "
"legible.)\n"
"\"... ... ... leav ... ... ... color as her eyes.\n"
"His, too ... ... ... with acid. It is his fault... ... ... If it was not ... "
"... ... she would still be alive.\"\n"
"\"Does not ... ... ... lo... ... ... plans something, I know, I know. I have "
"to ... ... ... my charms. ... ... ... can steal and run away. ... punch ... "
"... ... him.\"\n"
"\"... ... ... rely walk. How could he? How?! ... ... ... confront ... ... "
"... ys his name ... ... ... Stag Lord. ... ... ... will not let me die ... "
"... ... not be calling him my son.\"\n"
"\"He ... ... ... we ... ... ... leaving ... ... ... . He ... ... ... own "
"fortress. I'm hiding ... ... ... should not. I will not be able to escape.\""
msgstr ""
"(노트는 습기로 심하게 손상되어 일부분만 읽을 수 있습니다.)\n"
"\"......... 잎......... 그녀의 눈과 같은 색이다.\n"
" 그의 눈도......... 산성으로 태워... 그것은 그의 잘못이야....... 그가 아니었... 면... 그녀는 여전히 살아있었을 "
"거야. \"\n"
"\"내게 말도.................. 뭔가 계획했겠지. 나도 알아......... 부적을... 야해... 도둑질하고 도망갈 수 "
"있어.... 녀석을 패 줄.......... \"\n"
"\"......... 걸어 다녀. 어떻게 그럴 수 있지? 어떻게...?............ 안 아픈 곳이.... 어떻게 그가 그럴 수 "
"있지? 어떻게?..... 대면하지.... 하길 그의 이름.... 수사슴 군주......... 나를 죽게 내버려 두거나....... "
"아들이라고 부르지 말라고 하더군. \"\n"
"\"그는......... 우리......... 떠나............ 그에게는... 요새가 있다.,,,, 더미 속에.... 숨기고 "
"있어.........도망.... 없겠지.... 그가 가만두지 않을거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Items/NugrahNotes1_Ruined_name_String
msgctxt "145356f7-f325-4d13-8bcd-f7117a4a0e66"
msgid "Fog-Damaged Notes"
msgstr "습기로 손상된 노트"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Items/NugrahNotes1_String
msgctxt "729458cf-d4a9-4672-b233-dfbc939f74ac"
msgid ""
"\"In early spring, willows' leaves are the same color as her eyes.\n"
"His, too. I barely hold myself from burning them out with acid. It is his "
"fault. Despicable, weak. If it was not for him, she would still be alive.\"\n"
"\"Does not talk to me, looks away. Plans something, I know, I know. I have "
"to gather forest herbs and make a hiding place, hide my charms. He is a "
"coward, but he can steal and run away. I will punch it out of him.\"\n"
"\"Everything hurts. I can barely walk. How could he? How? He would never "
"bring himself to confront me on his own. ...He says his name is now Stag "
"Lord. He says he will not let me die or let me go. He says I should not be "
"calling him my son. Like I ever did...\"\n"
"\"He told me to pack my things, we are leaving soon. He now has his people "
"and his own fortress. I'm hiding the charms in the herb cache. I probably "
"should not. I will not be able to escape. He will not let me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이른 봄 버드 나무의 잎은 그녀의 눈과 같은 색깔이다.\n"
"그의 눈도 같은 색이지. 그것들을 산성 용액으로 태워버리려는 걸 겨우 참았다. 그것은 그의 잘못이다. 비열하고 약한 녀석. 녀석이 "
"없었더라면 그녀는 여전히 살아있었을텐데.\"\n"
"\"나에게 말도 걸지 않고 시선을 피했다. 무언가 계획하고 있곘지. 나도 안다, 알아. 나는 숲에서 약초를 모아 숨길 곳을 만들고 부적도 "
"숨겨야 한다. 그는 겁쟁이지만 내 것을 도둑질하고 도망갈 수있어. 그 녀석을 패 줄 거야.\"\n"
"\"안 아픈 곳이 없다. 간신히 걸을 수 있을 정도다. 어떻게 그가 그럴 수 있지? 어떻게? 그는 절대 혼자 힘으로 나와 맞서려 하지 "
"않았는데. 그가 말하길 그의 이름은 이제 수사슴 군주라고 하더군. 나를 죽게 내버려 두거나 떠나보내지 않겠다고 말했다. 자신을 아들이라고 "
"부르지 말라고 하더군. 내가 그랬던 것처럼... \"\n"
"\"그는 내 물건을 싸라고 말했다. 우리는 곧 떠날 것이라며. 그에게는 이제 자기 사람들과 자신만의 요새가 있다. 나는 약초 더미 속에 "
"부적을 숨기고 있다. 그렇게 해서는 안됐던 걸지도 모른다. 나는 도망칠 수 없을 것이다. 그가 허락하지 않을테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Items/NugrahNotes1_name_String
msgctxt "4633c3e8-1fae-4f59-ae16-0e884bd2f19c"
msgid "Nugrah's Old Notes"
msgstr "누그라의 옛 노트"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Items/NugrahNotes2_String
msgctxt "8fa09773-4452-404e-a0a4-17b961b23fea"
msgid ""
"\"I went to the old Temple of the Elk again today. Wicked, gloomy place. "
"Just like my soul — it used to shine once, and it is hollow and horrible now."
"\n"
"Did he spy on me? Maybe I should lock him up? No, let him be. What can he "
"do, the useless coward? Just whimper and hide.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘 다시 엘크의 성전으로 갔다. 사악하고 우울한 장소였다. 내 영혼처럼. 하지만 내 영혼도 한 때 빛나곤 했는데 지금은 텅 비었고 "
"끔찍하다.\n"
"그가 나를 염탐했나? 그 사람을 가둬야 할까? 아니. 그를 내버려둬. 쓸모없는 겁쟁이가 무엇을 할 수 있겠어? 그냥 질질 짜게 둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/Items/NugrahNotes2_name_String
msgctxt "a131b4e0-80f9-4150-baa4-176ea70bd34b"
msgid "Nugrah's Lost Note"
msgstr "누그라의 잃어버린 메모"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "875bf5a8-58b7-4958-b4dc-4362c446db26"
msgid ""
"\"I had a strange vision. A young man, and an old druid who tortured him — "
"then they exchanged roles.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이상한 환상을 보았어. 한 젊은이와 그를 고문한 나이든 드루이드가 역할을 바꾸더군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8d00d2d8-d4d2-417f-8603-65a4d520d987"
msgid "\"Tell me what to do next.\""
msgstr "\"다음에 무엇을 할지 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b9310760-5843-4f89-8166-66f9519768c0"
msgid "\"I'll return later. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 돌아올거야. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "0c61463d-7414-4ca5-a80c-f355222f40a9"
msgid ""
"\"I found the druid's notes. They mention a Temple of the Elk. Can this help "
"us?\""
msgstr "\"드루이드의 노트를 발견했다. 엘크 성전이 언급되었는데 이것이 도움이 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "f26f1304-b0ca-4d8c-b25c-28b9b61bf546"
msgid ""
"\"The druid's notes mention a cache he created using herbs. Do you know "
"anything about that?\""
msgstr "\"드루이드의 노트에는 약초더미가 언급되었어. 이것에 대해 아는 게 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "1fd1f9d0-95af-43c5-b861-48f780316586"
msgid "\"I have a clear goal now. I'll continue my journey.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이제 명확한 목표가 생겼어. 나는 계속 여행할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "a3ea8625-c14d-4e34-83da-4fa2c10126cc"
msgid "\"I need to ask you something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 물어보고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "5ad9a117-1ac1-4b22-b8e7-015a03f0f562"
msgid "\"It's clear now. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"이제 확실해졌어. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "b341fe33-934a-4ea5-bc1d-0533f21139e7"
msgid "\"Would you stop following me? I've no intention of helping you.\""
msgstr "\"이제 그만 좀 따라올래? 너를 도울 생각 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "92fec91b-84b9-402f-878f-cd93b6ac7fbc"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself. I would like to know more about my ally.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐. 내 아군이 누구인지 알고싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "3b18fd43-f2e6-4e55-8607-1bcb91d0885d"
msgid ""
"\"Would you be willing to share the details of your story? About these evil "
"powers, the enchanted forest, the monster?\""
msgstr "\"네 이야기를 더 자세히 말해 보겠어? 사악한 힘과 마법에 걸린 숲과 괴물에 대해서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4b72a9b6-6bcd-4d5b-85ad-ad3ffbb395da"
msgid ""
"{n}The familiar outline of the nymph appears before you.{/n} \"I have been "
"waiting for you. The flowers, birds, and wind told me you would come. Oh, my "
"poor flowers — they will perish before long in this fog...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 익숙한 겉모습이 나타납니다.{/n} \"너를 기다리고 있었어. 꽃과 새와 바람이 네가 온다고 말해줬지. 내 불쌍한 꽃. 이런 "
"안개 속에 오래 있다면 시들어버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "c49ba640-3d22-4d26-a8fb-8ef750042c88"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph lowers her head.{/n} \"Yes... Yes. The soil, water, and stones "
"here are infused with toxic pain and fear. They poison this place as we "
"speak. You have seen where your enemy's journey began. The one called Stag "
"Lord was once the victim of a cruel madman — and has since become one "
"himself. You see now how monsters are born. But what comes of regret for a "
"thing you cannot change? There is no time to be lost — we must do away with "
"the fog quickly.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"그래... 이 땅, 물, 돌에는 고통과 두려움이 깃들어있어. 말 그대로 그들이 이 장소를 "
"오염시켰지. 수사슴 군주의 기원을 보았겠지? 수사슴 군주라고 불리는 자는 한 때 미치광이의 희생자였고 지금은 그가 미치광이가 되었어. "
"그렇게 괴물이 태어난 거야. 하지만 이미 과거의 일을 바꾸지 못했다고 후회할 필요가 있을까? 우리는 잃을 것도 없어. 어서 이 안개를 "
"없애야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "5914cf34-0f44-4ec0-b8c0-fd6e641ef77f"
msgid ""
"\"Search the area around the hut, try to find anything that remained of the "
"druid who lived here. I am sure — the fog is his doing. This suffocating "
"veil is as vicious as his nature. We should learn more about the fog and the "
"ritual through which it was created. Return to me if you find anything. The "
"past may hide the answers that shape the future\"."
msgstr ""
"\"오두막집 주변을 둘러보고 여기 살았던 드루이드가 남겨둔 것을 찾아 봐. 나는 안개가 그의 소행이라고 확신해. 이 질식시키는 장막은 "
"그의 본성 만큼이나 악질적이야. 이 안개와 그것을 만들어낸 의식에 대해 더 알아 봐야 해. 무언가를 찾으면 나에게 와. 과거에 답이 "
"숨겨져 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "dd6f4765-258e-401e-a5c3-5833c86fdebd"
msgid "\"I will be waiting...\" {n}The nymph whispers.{/n}"
msgstr "\"기다리고 있을게...\" {n}님프가 속삭였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "b98b3548-a47d-4f21-8500-19558f25e7c3"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph reaches toward you.{/n} \"You come again. Did you find "
"something?\""
msgstr "{n}님프가 다가옵니다.{/n} \"왔구나. 뭔가 찾았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "baa21ee0-8d6c-44b1-814b-5cba71f01e2b"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's blue eyes flare from within her pale face.{/n} \"An ancient "
"temple, the Temple of the {g|Erastil}Stag God{/g}. Yes... Yes, that must be "
"it! The place of power where the druid created the fog. Perhaps, we'll be "
"able to cleanse it from there. The temple hides in the thicket not far from "
"here. You'll need to go there and purge the place of whatever evil still "
"lingers there, summoned by the druid's sinister ritual. Take care! You are "
"my only hope...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 파란 눈은 창백한 얼굴에서 번쩍입니다.{/n} \"고대 {g|Erastil}수사슴 신{/g}의 신전. 그래... 그럴 거야! "
"드루이드가 안개를 만든 장소야. 아마 거기에서 안개를 없앨 수 있을 거야. 신전은 여기 멀지 않은 숲에 숨겨져 있어. 거기에 가서 "
"드루이드의 불길한 의식에 의해 소환된 악을 제거해야 해. 조심해. 너는 유일한 희망이니까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "07505726-2095-4708-8b15-86e5ec2f41a5"
msgid ""
"\"I know little of the magic of people... But there is a trick we nymphs "
"love to use. Herbs and flowers can keep secrets, as well as reveal them. "
"Place an herb in a chest you wish to hide — it will conceal the treasure "
"from strangers' eyes. Place the herb there again, and it will reveal what "
"was hidden. If the druid used this trick, he probably chose simple herbs, "
"likely those that can be found nearby.\""
msgstr ""
"\"인간의 마법에 대해서는 거의 알지 못하지만... 님프가 좋아하는 속임수와 비슷해 보여. 허브와 꽃은 비밀을 밝힐 뿐만 아니라 지킬 수 "
"있어. 숨기고 싶은 궤짝 안에 허브를 두면 낯선 사람의 눈에서 보물을 숨길 수 있고, 허브를 또 다시 두면 숨겨진 것이 드러나게 되지. "
"드루이드가 이 속임수를 사용했다면 아마도 주변에서 발견하기 쉬운 허브를 사용했을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "a853f6f5-68ad-4f26-82a3-1d78fd813b62"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph stares at you sadly.{/n} \"Please hasten. I lose strength by "
"the hour, and soon I will be unable to help you...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 당신을 슬프게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"서둘러. 시간이 지나면서 힘이 사라지고 있어서 곧 너를 도울 수 없게 될 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "5e2fa794-4354-44e7-8bce-491f6f4a1c53"
msgid "\"Then hasten. Time is of the essence...\""
msgstr "\"그럼 서둘러. 시간이 가장 중요하니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e3bf6e47-8576-45b7-a359-b078d3e217c9"
msgid "\"Oh! Mysterious talk with nobody!\""
msgstr "\"오! 비밀은 세어나가는 법이 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e958c996-fedb-4491-8f69-43df88613e4f"
msgid ""
"\"Speaking to the gods is best done in private. I can look away, if need "
"be...\""
msgstr "\"신들과 대화하는 것은 되도록 남에게 보이지 않는게 나아. 필요하다면 딴 곳을 보고 있겠네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "6bd1217e-8b06-40fd-9c1f-c8535ae9a204"
msgid "{n}It seems that only you can see or hear the nymph.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}오직 당신만이 님프를 보거나 들을 수 있는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "c3de5217-c875-4b91-92e4-c5934972d20e"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph lowers her head.{/n} \"I have no one else I can ask for help. "
"But I dare not insist. Please, return if you decide to listen or find "
"yourself in need of advice.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"도움을 요청할 수 있는 사람이 아무도 없어. 하지만 억지로 도와주지 않아도 돼. 도움이 "
"필요하거나 들을 마음이 있다면 언제든지 와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "79cd20c5-a034-4634-9d12-cd9ecb4333e1"
msgid "\"Who do you talk to? I don't see anyone. Should I be worried?\""
msgstr "\"누구와 대화하고 있는 거야? 나는 아무도 안보이는데. 괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "685b1f83-6092-4ae5-b17c-0d3cd0b8e730"
msgid ""
"\"Not many have heard a voice from above... And fewer still are those who "
"followed it to a positive outcome. \""
msgstr "\"위에서 목소리를 듣는 사람은 많지 않아... 그리고 그 말을 따라 좋은 결과를 얻은 자는 훨씬 적어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d46f38f0-eb8c-45c6-9697-c4b0410c60c9"
msgid ""
"\"There was a guy in my tribe — kept walking around, listening to voices. "
"After a while, they told him to jump off a cliff. Be careful what you listen "
"to!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 부족에 어떤 남자는 목소리를 따라 계속 걸었지. 잠시 후 목소리가 절벽에서 뛰어 내리라고 했어. 너도 듣는 것을 조심해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "68f128a0-cdd6-4103-8ce7-dc8889281e5d"
msgid ""
"\"Whoever you're speaking with... If they don't want your friends to "
"overhear, maybe they aren't really looking out for you.\""
msgstr "\"누구와 이야기하고 있든 간에... 그들이 엿 듣는 것을 원하지 않는다면 너를 그리 중요하게 생각하지 않는가보다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a8f7e126-d527-44e1-bcea-5d6428d0724c"
msgid ""
"\"Be warned: unknown voices whispering to you from nowhere rarely have your "
"best interests in mind.\""
msgstr "\"조심해. 어딘가에서 들리는 속삭임은 그다지 이로운 얘기를 하지 않으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "0ab60d31-4b67-4c4e-8a4b-74c516ac2e9c"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's eyes grow cloudy.{/n} \"Do you really wish to know? Fine, "
"I'll tell you... a fairy tale. Once upon a time, there lived a young nymph. "
"She lived in an enchanted forest, where thousands of birds sung day and "
"night, where the sun often left a spark or two hanging in the tree crowns, "
"and where the starlight fell on sleepy glades like a glowing soft haze...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 눈은 흐려집니다.{/n} \"정말로 알고 싶어? 좋아. 동화 하나를 이야기해 주겠어... 옛날 옛적에 어린 님프가 살았어. "
"그녀는 마법이 걸린 숲에서 살았고 수천 마리의 새들이 밤낮으로 노래를 불렀어. 태양은 나무 사이로 비추고 별빛은 잠든 숲 위에서 부드러운 "
"빛을 내고는 했지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "421a6ca5-95ba-415e-a0a0-f540870846e8"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's voice is quiet, but clear. As you hear it, you seem to sense "
"the aroma of the forest glades, washed with the morning dew, mixing with the "
"odor of spring meadows aflood with blooms.{/n} \"The young nymph loved "
"simple things — like sitting by the stream with her friends, braiding each "
"other's hair and adorning their braids with crystals made of dew. Or "
"watching the flowers blooming. But inside her soul, the young nymph dreamed "
"of something more.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 목소리는 조용하지만 맑습니다. 당신은 그것을 듣고 아침 이슬로 씻겨진 숲과 꽃 내음이 나는 봄 초원의 냄새를 느끼는 것 "
"같습니다.{/n} \"어린 님프들은 서로 머리를 땋아 이슬로 만든 크리스탈 머리띠로 장식을 해주거나 개울가에 앉아 노는 걸 좋아했어. 할 "
"일이 없으면 그저 꽃을 보는 걸로 좋았지. 하지만 내면에는 무엇인가 부족했던 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "0cb5c5a4-819c-45fa-a4d5-cb2ad6874928"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, dreams... nothing in any world can live without them. Even a seed that "
"falls in fertile soil, cannot sprout without the dream of the Sun. The same "
"was true for our nymph — she wished to turn her enchanted forest into a true "
"fairy tale kingdom, and fill it with thousands of wonders. But plans so "
"ambitious rarely go unnoticed by greater powers...\" {n}New notes creep into "
"the aroma of the forest and meadow. — Now you smell a storm coming.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"꿈... 어떤 생물도 그것 없이는 살 수 없어. 비옥한 토양에 떨어지는 씨앗도 태양을 꿈꾸지 않고는 자랄 수 없지. 우리 님프도 "
"마찬가지였어. 그녀는 마법에 걸린 숲을 수천의 경이로움이 채워진 진정한 동화 왕국이 되기를 바랬어. 하지만 그런 큰 야심을 커다란 힘이 "
"알아차리지 못할리 없었지.\" {n}숲과 초원의 향기가 사라지고 폭풍우의 냄새가 납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "d8ca5aab-cc2e-481d-a0a7-a21f7c143825"
msgid ""
"\"Those greater powers decided to punish the nymph for her boldness. They "
"sent a horrible monster to poison the enchanted forest and kill the singing "
"birds. The nymph... was forced to flee. And finally, she found shelter here, "
"in the Stolen Lands. Here, she hoped to sprout the seeds of a new dream — "
"even as she mourned the dream she'd lost. But then the magic mist appeared, "
"killing everything that lived, and the nymph cast about, desperately "
"searching for help. So far, these are the fairy tale's final words, but I "
"hope this is not the end just yet...\""
msgstr ""
"\"님프를 발견한 위대한 힘은 그녀를 처벌하기로 결정했지. 그들은 마법에 걸린 숲을 오염시키고 노래하는 새들을 죽이기 위해 괴물을 "
"풀었어. 님프는 도망 가야했지. 그리고 마침내 그녀는 도둑맞은 땅으로 도망가게 되었어. 그녀는 잃어버린 꿈을 애도하면서도 새로운 꿈에 "
"대한 희망을 키우기 시작했어. 하지만 마법의 안개가 나타나 살아있는 모든 것들을 죽이고 님프도 죽이고 말았지. 이게 지금까지의 결말이지만 "
"아직은 끝이 아니길 바라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/StagLordOldHouse/NyrissaGhostSLOH/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "7ff28bea-2156-4605-8d53-aaac61832ddd"
msgid ""
"\"One day, perhaps… Perhaps I will tell you more. But it doesn't matter now. "
"We need to concentrate on the problems at our doorstep — the Stag Lord, the "
"druid, the mist.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언젠가는 아마도... 아마도 더 많은 것을 말해줄게. 하지만 지금은 중요하지 않아. 우리는 눈 앞의 문제들, 수사슴 군주와 드루이드, "
"안개에 집중해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/CageHarrim_String
msgctxt "699f88e2-ef50-4ae4-9003-9f152ed3eb41"
msgid ""
"\"These caves could be so calm and empty without kobolds fussing around.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트가 소란을 피우지만 않았더라고 이 동굴은 조용하고 비어있었을텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/CageJaethal_String
msgctxt "47bfa35a-c2c2-44bb-9469-48a6e98cd0a9"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder what's more disgusting — this musty dungeon or it's little ugly "
"inhabitants.\""
msgstr "\"뭐가 더 역겨운지 생각중이야. 이 곰팡이 냄새 나는 던전일지 아니면 여기에 사는 못생긴 주민들일지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/CageLinzi_String
msgctxt "3e48ec66-a555-416f-8001-151597c90c15"
msgid ""
"\"Ah-coo! I think I caught a cold! Why won't kobolds give their prisoners a "
"warm blanket?\""
msgstr "\"에취! 감기에 걸린 거 같아. 왜 코볼트가 죄수에게 따뜻한 담요를 주지 않는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/CageValerie_String
msgctxt "4b90f4c3-d85f-4c64-a248-90e53badf88b"
msgid ""
"\"Sooner or later I'll find the way out and make Tartuccio pay for his "
"dishonor.\""
msgstr "\"조만간 이곳을 빠져나가 타투치오에게 그 비열함의 대가를 치르게 해주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/AfterFinalKingBark_String
msgctxt "fe64df77-1706-4649-8dd4-afc0972dba1d"
msgid "\"Friendsss! We ressst war. Talk later!\""
msgstr "\"친구! 우리 휴전이다! 이야기 나중에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/AfterFinalQweenBark_String
msgctxt "9622124e-3e42-46ea-8bf7-821406a7aa55"
msgid "\"Ally! We rest war now, make new war soon! You come again!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 이제 전쟁을 쉰다. 곧 새로운 전쟁을 한다! 다시 와라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/BridgeBark_String
msgctxt "fcb9f7aa-742b-4f6a-848b-a09dcc7ec24d"
msgid "The primitive hoist seems to be missing a piece."
msgstr "투박한 도르래의 부품이 빠진 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/BrigadirBark1_String
msgctxt "ef20449d-f8ba-4d69-a36f-8acf31fc9aaf"
msgid "\"Fassster!\""
msgstr "\"더 빨리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/BrigadirBark2_String
msgctxt "8075a144-d620-4bca-af04-67998a559014"
msgid "\"Pusssh! Pusssh, you ssslugsss!\""
msgstr "\"밀어라! 밀어! 멍청아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/ChamberBlockerBark_String
msgctxt "e069eadc-6cab-44c3-9ad0-91080a105838"
msgid "\"You talk Queen. Queen no talk — we no let in!\""
msgstr "\"너 여왕에게 말해라. 여왕 말 안하면 우리 너 안보내줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/DoorBark_String
msgctxt "8c7dc024-0448-48f2-8116-19f9fa21181d"
msgid ""
"The tangled tree roots form a door, but there's no sign of a keyhole or "
"handle. There should be another way to open it."
msgstr "얽힌 나무 뿌리는 문을 형성하지만 열쇠 구멍이나 손잡이의 흔적은 없습니다. 그것을 열려면 다른 방법이 있어야 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/GliffBark_Amiri_String
msgctxt "59510a81-4125-4ea9-b9d5-1dc3666e87ce"
msgid "\"Never thought these burrows have chasms like that!\""
msgstr "\"이 굴에 이런 틈이 있을 줄은 몰랐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/IncubatorBark_String
msgctxt "a78ac417-0609-47eb-920c-2ebb7be0ea05"
msgid ""
"It seems that someone — or something — tried to gnaw through the frames. "
"Sometimes successfully."
msgstr "누군가 또는 뭔가가 울타리를 갉아 먹으려고 시도한 것 같습니다. 일부는 성공한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LeverBark_String
msgctxt "0345d01e-5472-4c5a-aefa-83dd8c7bc90a"
msgid "The trolley is jammed. You'll need some special equipment to move it."
msgstr "광차가 걸렸습니다. 이걸 옮기려면 특별한 장비가 필요합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LiftBoyAfterBark1_String
msgctxt "324081d9-a6cc-4c26-8e84-9cde2319255d"
msgid "\"Sssilly kobold! Break trap, usss to fix!\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 코볼트! 덫을 제거해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LiftBoyAfterBark2_String
msgctxt "9fdcfabc-a385-4efe-b798-bd116e3c5f98"
msgid "\"Why usss? Ssshould make him fix!\""
msgstr "\"왜 하필 우리야? 그가 고치게 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LiftBoyBark1_String
msgctxt "b188d763-e759-4dfc-9140-851166da30ae"
msgid "\"Break... now all break...\""
msgstr "\"부서졌어... 다 부서졌어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LiftBoyBark2_String
msgctxt "7a298f40-b3e9-4680-b0ec-9d4ac71d37c2"
msgid "\"All go... all fall… Sssorrow, sssorrow…\""
msgstr "\"모두 망했어... 끝이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_10_String
msgctxt "8f742f78-4a44-45d1-9d3b-5669bf43c063"
msgid ""
"The mites have nailed window frames to the cave walls. There are landscapes "
"painted behind some of them."
msgstr "마이트가 동굴 벽에 창틀을 새겼습니다. 창틀 안은 풍경이 그려져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_12_String
msgctxt "dcae2a5e-f319-4c8a-a44b-25d61bccb5d7"
msgid ""
"These wooden structures are a few centuries old, some even older — but "
"they've withstood the ravages of time."
msgstr "이 나무로 된 구조물은 몇 세기 혹은 더 오래되었지만 시간의 파괴를 견뎌 냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_13_String
msgctxt "6c5b6c86-e832-4f1d-9868-93ce7462155d"
msgid ""
"The trolleys were left here by human miners, long ago. The kobolds somehow "
"managed to repair them."
msgstr "광부가 오래전에 버리고 간 광차입니다. 코볼트는 어떻게든 그것을 수리할 수 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_14_String
msgctxt "0c73b7f0-981d-42fb-bd19-bc0383e58804"
msgid ""
"Paintings made with soot. It seems like they're supposed to portray dragons, "
"but most just look like cows with wings."
msgstr "그을음으로 그린 그림입니다. 그들은 용을 묘사한 것처럼 보이지만 대부분은 날개가 있는 소처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_16_String
msgctxt "569759d8-e539-4db1-a2f0-3f1798f0d98a"
msgid ""
"The kobolds have turned this skull of a dragonlike creature into an object "
"of worship."
msgstr "코볼트는 이 드래곤의 것처럼 생긴 두개골을 예배의 대상으로 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_17_String
msgctxt "60234e95-b3c3-4928-89df-d6673b01366c"
msgid ""
"Kobolds seem to be good at curing hides — and decorating their caves with "
"them."
msgstr "코볼트는 가죽을 수선하고 그것으로 자신의 동굴을 꾸미는 데 능숙한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_18_String
msgctxt "be452e46-f7b7-4c91-9ca3-bb48695aac3f"
msgid ""
"The size of this room's shelving suggests that it once served as a larder "
"for human miners, who abandoned this place long ago."
msgstr "이 방의 선반은 오래전 이 곳을 버렸던 인간 광부들을 위한 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_1_Linzi_String
msgctxt "e59706b9-dccf-4da5-b745-6c8a83e97ea1"
msgid ""
"\"The things in this pile must be five times heavier than those mites!\""
msgstr "\"이 더미들은 저 마이트보다 5배 더 무거워야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_1_String
msgctxt "3f7ecfa4-907d-40cd-a01e-d8d63cc27fe7"
msgid "This awful pile of garbage seems to be the mites' sorting center."
msgstr "이 쓰레기 더미는 마이트가 분류하려 모아논 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_3_String
msgctxt "2f83c01e-d8ce-448f-a568-28f1fd8256db"
msgid ""
"A few crudely-crafted torture instruments lie on top of an old crate, now a "
"makeshift workbench."
msgstr "조잡하게 만들어진 고문 도구 몇가지가 지금은 임시 작업대로 쓰이는 낡은 상자 위에 놓여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_4_String
msgctxt "b3f5879c-c439-4838-90e5-beabefff69bd"
msgid "Kobold remains, gnawed by centipedes."
msgstr "지네들에 의해 갉아 먹힌 코볼트의 시체입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_5_String
msgctxt "b31f3964-0ed6-4b0b-a555-d686f4da921d"
msgid ""
"A wooden suspension bridge. Perhaps it saw frequent use back in days when "
"the mites and kobolds lived in peace."
msgstr "목조 현수교입니다. 아마도 마이트와 코볼트가 평화롭게 살았던 날에 빈번히 사용된 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_6_BoatOctavia_String
msgctxt "3c6116d4-790b-497b-b856-89303bd36521"
msgid ""
"\"I hope the poor thing that owned this boat was not resting on some island "
"when mites stole it…\""
msgstr "\"이 보트를 소유했던 불쌍한 녀석들이 마이트들에게 빼앗겨 섬에 표류하지 않을까 걱정된다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_8_String
msgctxt "dbe05332-28d1-48c2-8d5e-e5498c475dc4"
msgid ""
"The mites present their queen with the most valuable loot, along with the "
"least broken junk."
msgstr "마이트는 여왕에게 가장 귀중한 전리품을 쓰레기 더미와 함께 선물합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreBark_9_String
msgctxt "d42e7b88-dadb-4a12-8116-d697d5062118"
msgid ""
"A pedestal of some sort, formed by tangled tree roots. It seems that some "
"long and narrow object rested here until recently. There's no sign of it now."
msgstr ""
"얽힌 나무 뿌리로 형성된 일종의 받침대입니다. 어떤 길고 좁은 물체가 최근까지 여기에 머문 것으로 보입니다. 지금은 그 흔적이 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/LoreMiteBark_String
msgctxt "37a84d2e-8a82-457d-980f-0ee002ef76f2"
msgid "The mites are absorbed in their work and pay you no heed."
msgstr "이 마이트는 일에 몰두해서 당신에게 주의를 기울이지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/TormentBark_String
msgctxt "2ccc841c-061a-4128-9a3f-1a8e5c122a18"
msgid "\"Ally! Come join us!\""
msgstr "\"동료들! 우리와 함께 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/TrapKoboldBark1_String
msgctxt "a5596223-c766-4bbd-a54c-6a0d4d020e3b"
msgid "\"Follow me!\""
msgstr "\"나를 따라와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/DraftBarks/TrapKoboldBark2_String
msgctxt "baf30006-3a9a-4078-9004-c19d5781ec2d"
msgid "\"Here!\""
msgstr "\"이쪽으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/KoboldGatekeeperAfter_String
msgctxt "c05d5dd9-9954-44f4-b62d-69e703dff12e"
msgid "\"I go watch. You go chief. Far!\""
msgstr "\"나는 감시하러 갈 테니 너는 대장에게 가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/KoboldGatekeeperAttacked_String
msgctxt "f45795cf-8a7b-4b8c-a8d3-7119d4cd832b"
msgid "\"Enemy! Enemy! Alarm!\""
msgstr "\"적이다! 적! 비상!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/KoboldLiftboy_String
msgctxt "9ed12b5e-cde2-4e31-a028-8bbabe2db600"
msgid "\"All go — all fall... What trouble...\""
msgstr "\"모두 가버렸어... 이게 도대체...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/KoboldPeace1_String
msgctxt "18168c03-6c3d-4606-a4e7-8d399a16f8a8"
msgid "\"Friendsss!\""
msgstr "\"친구우!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/KoboldPeace2_String
msgctxt "48b4ae0a-8696-40d0-823b-107b202f85bc"
msgid "\"Toothhh hurtsss! Why I bite that bone?\""
msgstr "\"이빨 아파아! 왜 내가 뼈를 물었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/KoboldPeace3_String
msgctxt "b9441140-10b8-4af0-a7d9-6c126cc17b49"
msgid ""
"\"I learn wordsss. Boldnesss! Ssstrengthhh! Sss... sssala... sssalatiousss!\""
msgstr "\"나는 말 배웠다. 강함! 힘! 인... 인.... 인사!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/KoboldPeace4_String
msgctxt "84e3a6ba-33ca-4cfb-a14e-1538ee4df68f"
msgid "\"Gold ssscale I want. Wishhh...\""
msgstr "\"황금 비늘 나 원한다... 원해에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/MitePeace1_String
msgctxt "87926393-8495-4e2b-97dd-bc860e959334"
msgid "\"I you know! Greeting!\""
msgstr "\"나 너 알아! 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/MitePeace2_String
msgctxt "bebc59f9-da58-4ca6-9ae6-59a98821ff30"
msgid ""
"\"Our glory hero and his riding spider fall hole and die. Poor spider pity!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 영웅과 탈 것 거미가 구멍 떨어져 죽었다. 불쌍한 거미 불쌍해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/MitePeace3_String
msgctxt "e211cd4a-49ce-4cb4-8094-633645ae1caf"
msgid "\"Two week no catch one squirrel. Maybe they all dead?\""
msgstr "\"2주간 다람쥐 한 마리 못 잡았어. 어쩌면 모두 죽었을지도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/MitePeace4_String
msgctxt "aed1ca80-b4eb-4c61-a8da-8220befbf3d2"
msgid "\"I poke hollow Old Sycamore and Queen say bad. Me punish now.\""
msgstr "\"나 텅 빈 시커모어 나무 뒤져서 여왕 화났다. 나 처벌 받는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/PeaceChief_String
msgctxt "ee108734-6f9d-49e6-b52d-5da59208df95"
msgid "\"Friend! You ssstrong, courageousss, fierccce!\""
msgstr "\"친구! 너 용기 있고 용감하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/PeaceQueen_String
msgctxt "e8c9765c-39cd-4068-b5b7-fd339a989ec4"
msgid "\"I happy see you, ally. Your visit honor mite.\""
msgstr "\"너를 보게 되어 반갑다. 너 마이트 방문했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Barks/SacredGlove_String
msgctxt "10b28471-0048-483c-8bfd-45d8b3c09dbb"
msgid "A glove you know quite well. Now it's a relic."
msgstr "당신이 꽤 잘 알고 있는 장갑. 이제 그것은 유물입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "9b474a5e-8454-43e0-8497-c33a4200a04f"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me more about the story of Tartuccio and the kobolds, and getting "
"locked in their prison.\""
msgstr "\"타투치오와 코볼트에 대해 더 얘기해줘. 그리고 놈들 감옥에 갇힌 것도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "03c52731-5590-428c-b4c7-18fb01fd86d5"
msgid ""
"\"A battle with the Stag Lord and a possible barony awaits me. I would "
"appreciate the help of someone as skilled as you, Jaethal.\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주와의 전투 그리고 남작위가 날 기다리고 있어. 너처럼 유능한 인재가 도와준다면 결코 잊지 않을 거야. 제이탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "1543beb8-6336-4eff-9f4a-4b0a1fa6ed1e"
msgid "\"Valerie, I would be happy to see you among my companions.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 나의 동료들 가운데서 너를 만나 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "d90e235d-62ec-48ba-99f0-f7102dd032a8"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim, you should join me, if you're considering where you should go.\""
msgstr "\"하림. 어디로 가야할지 고민하고 있다면 나를 따라오도록 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "4826f25e-3fe5-471d-a9a6-84a27d216d70"
msgid ""
"\"Linzi, you must see by now that I'm a more suitable leader than Tartuccio "
"ever was — and a better character for your book. Wouldn't you like to join "
"me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지. 내가 지금 타투치오보다 더 적합한 지도자라는 것을 깨달아야 해. 그리고 내가 더 괜찮은 책의 주인공이야. 나와 함께 하고 싶지 "
"않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "fee60fbf-e06b-4f8b-9eae-02a682e5aa01"
msgid "\"Well, I have to go. I hope we never meet again!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 다시는 만나지 말자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "6cdb5865-ac37-4d9c-936e-3e04a519f29e"
msgid "\"It is time to continue my journey.\""
msgstr "\"여행을 계속 할 시간이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0045_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "8551708a-4a98-4f29-b9dd-edffb2698bbc"
msgid "Told Octavia your opinion on releasing prisoners."
msgstr "옥타비아에게 죄수 석방에 대한 의견을 전했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "91c1fa42-c99f-4d3e-98c4-234b03e7c5e7"
msgid "\"Just those imprisoned unjustly.\""
msgstr "\"부당하게 갇힌 사람들이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "96c1e2ee-a61d-4adb-9a30-0f5b7241f49b"
msgid "\"I hate jails and their keepers!\""
msgstr "\"나는 감옥과 간수가 싫어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "6d2e37ab-816b-4652-ac2b-ce97d808a9a3"
msgid "\"It's probably just a coincidence.\""
msgstr "\"우연일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "39411d56-977f-43f4-b16f-9b67056e7fff"
msgid ""
"\"I don't waste valuable resources. What good would it do to leave those who "
"could work for me to rot in a cage?\""
msgstr "\"나는 귀중한 자원을 낭비하지 않는다. 왜 내가 나를 위해서 일할 수 있는 사람들을 감옥에서 썩히겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "7b1dc271-1fa7-4b5f-8e54-cad75314e687"
msgid "\"When I become a baron{mf||ess}, I'll chain everyone up myself!\""
msgstr "\"내가 남작이 되면 모두 내 동료로 만들 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "5f77d1ef-13f3-4c59-805a-9faefe58b38e"
msgid ""
"{n}While you were busy fighting, someone was busy trying to escape from the "
"kobold prison. And that attempt was a success!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 싸우느라 바쁠 동안 누군가 코볼트의 감옥에서 벗어나려고 시도했고 결국 성공했습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "506b269c-40c9-4d68-95b1-cbceab46382d"
msgid ""
"{n}Someone recently released from kobold prison attracts your attention.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}최근 코볼트 감옥에서 빠져나온 누군가가 당신의 관심을 끕니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3ced3fea-2cc5-42c6-9b5e-a99a2735797f"
msgid "\"Hooray! Freedom!\""
msgstr "\"만세! 자유다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c5667304-aa9e-4148-ae5c-d9ec42ddb64b"
msgid ""
"\"I do not know if I should even leave this dungeon. I feel such peace here, "
"though at the cost of my freedom...\""
msgstr "\"이 던전을 떠나야 할지 모르겠군. 비록 자유는 잃었지만 이곳에서 평화를 느꼈거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fa5390a1-4b2a-43e7-8e0f-7dff2f86f7ac"
msgid ""
"\"I do not imagine I'll remember these days as among my more glorious.\""
msgstr "\"최근 있었던 일들이 영광스럽게 기억되지는 못할 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7f965dad-09e5-4dd5-9201-cb4d30396095"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal straightens her clothes as if to eliminate all signs of staying "
"in the kobold prison.{/n} \"Let us strike out and forget.\""
msgstr "{n}제이탈은 코볼트 감옥에서 있었던 일을 모두 털어내듯 자신의 옷을 곧게 폅니다.{/n} \"나가서 잊어버리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "72cd9049-67e2-4e00-882e-dd4aaa19ad64"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I will devote several pages of my book to that scoundrel! He even said "
"the kobolds are more diligent and thorough servants — and he doesn't need "
"the help of us scum of society! He even tricked us into an ambush and sold "
"us to their chief. But it's all right — I already know the name of his "
"chapter. 'Tartuccio — despicable pretender and worthless hypocrite.' Or "
"maybe 'repulsive scamp?' What do you think?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 책의 일부는 그 악당을 위해 쓸 거야. 코볼트가 더 부지런하다고 말하다니. 우리의 도움도 필요로 하지 않고 말이야. 게다가 우리를 "
"속여 대장에게 팔아먹다니. 이건 옳지 않아. 나는 책의 제목을 이렇게 쓸 거야. 타투치오 - 비열한 위선자. 아니면 땅딸보 사기꾼은 어때?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "249a9d5b-57ab-44d8-a80e-3f6320ef2f5b"
msgid ""
"\"Arrogance and vanity — that is what drives Tartuccio, and this is why he "
"seeks servants equally arrogant and vain. The kobolds were easily taken in "
"by his talk of glory.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오만과 허영심은 타투치오의 원동력이네. 그래서 마찬가지로 오만하고 허영심 가득한 종들을 찾은게야. 코볼트들은 그가 떠들어대는 영광 "
"따위에 쉽게 넘어간걸세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3e016988-c756-47a7-9d9c-2e3b35d509ce"
msgid ""
"\"There is nothing to say. The gnome needed servants to seek an artifact. "
"Voiceless, diligent, and numerous.\" {n}Jaethal frowns scornfully.{/n} \"He "
"subdued the kobolds by idle talk and trickery. The despicable buffoon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"얘기할 게 없어. 그 노움은 유물을 찾을 하인이 필요했지. 말도 못하고 부지런하고 머릿수는 많은 것들 말이야.\" {n}제이탈은 "
"경멸하듯 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그는 헛소리와 속임수로 코볼트들을 구워 삶았어. 역겨운 광대 놈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b7ad7cb4-1195-42bf-84ae-1c63ba80924e"
msgid ""
"\"It is a tale of deceit and disgrace! Tartuccio deceived everyone, spying "
"for {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} and searching for an unknown relic. He used those "
"gullible creatures, and betrayed someone who might ask questions and expose "
"him — presenting them as a hunting trophy for the kobold chief.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사기꾼 녀석이군. 타투치오는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 위해 염탐꾼 노릇을 하고 우리를 속이고 유물을 찾으려 했어. 그는 단순한 "
"생물체를 이용해서 그들에게 코볼트 족장을 위한 사냥 트로피를 만든 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "04b17369-fe10-478c-bc5b-6a257d01f484"
msgid ""
"\"My sword is at your disposal. May this bring me greater honor than serving "
"the despicable liar Tartuccio!\""
msgstr "\"내 검은 당신의 처분에 달려 있습니다. 비열한 사기꾼 타투치오를 섬기는 것보다 더 큰 영광을 누리게 해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "36bc22d8-27b3-497b-974b-fb310cfe3f26"
msgid ""
"\"A battle with the so-called bandit king will entertain me. I shall follow "
"you. For now.\""
msgstr "\"산적 왕이라는 놈과의 전투는 재밌을거야. 너를 따라가지. 지금은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5b57b34c-5f4c-46b5-b7f0-3f619957b2b4"
msgid ""
"\"So be it. The same end awaits everything and everyone, and this road is no "
"worse than another.\""
msgstr "\"그러라지. 만물과 만인의 끝은 같으며 이 길이 다른 것보다 나쁘지는 않으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e12836dc-e2b5-4e6b-b225-24ce873108cb"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes! I am replete with inspiration! We'll stop somewhere soon, right? I "
"need to write down all our adventures in the dungeons! I wonder if I should "
"add a battle with a dragon... Poetic license, you know?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오! 영감이 가득해! 어딘가에서 곧 멈추겠지? 나는 던전에서 일어났던 모험담을 모두 써야 해! 용과의 전투를 추가할까? 괜찮아. "
"시적인 허용일 뿐이라구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d82039bf-be81-4246-903b-240fc097ec53"
msgid ""
"\"The dungeon sapped my strength, and the wounds I suffered from the dirty "
"kobolds have yet to heal. I will partake of Oleg's and Svetlana's "
"hospitalities that I may heal, and will be happy to join you afterwards.\""
msgstr ""
"\"던전은 내 힘을 빼앗아갔고 더러운 코볼트에게서 얻은 상처가 아직 낫지 않았어. 올렉과 스베틀라나에게 가서 치료를 하고 나서 합류하겠어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0132a028-154f-4b2c-985a-893b08a43b91"
msgid ""
"\"I must go restore my strength. I shall return to you later, in all my "
"glory.\""
msgstr "\"내 힘을 회복해야 해. 다음에 너에게 돌아가겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "90ee09c4-865f-46d5-b27c-245ace4f80bb"
msgid ""
"\"As I sat in the soothing half-light of the dungeon, I felt the closeness "
"of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. Now I feel only fatigue and pain from my wounds. "
"I must heal before I may follow you. We shall meet again soon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"던전에 새어나오는 부드러운 빛을 보았을 때 나는 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}와 가까워짐을 느꼈어. 지금은 상처로 고통과 피로만 "
"느껴져. 너를 쫓기 전에 치료를 해야겠어. 곧 다시 만나자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "502e1751-4263-4245-a100-7656b5a0fb10"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Hooray! I mean, of course! It's just that... the kobolds seem to have "
"poked a few holes in my notes. And in me as well. But I'm more concerned "
"about the notes. I should go to Oleg's and sort them out — and tend to my "
"wounds while I'm at it. But I will definitely, definitely find you later!\""
msgstr ""
"\"만세! 물론이지! 그저 코볼트가 내 노트에 구멍을 뚫어 놓은 것 같아서. 내 몸에도 몇개 뚫었지만. 하지만 내 노트가 더 걱정이야. "
"나는 올렉에게 가서 노트를 정리하고 내 상처도 돌봐야겠어. 하지만 다음에 너를 반드시 찾을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "48aae0c5-3201-4d2a-976e-fc0df9a6fc0e"
msgid ""
"\"Hell no! I can't possibly pass up this opportunity! All these feats and "
"adventures, the piercing stare of the future baron{mf||ess}... I simply must "
"see everything for myself. I'll just be around to write everything down. Pay "
"no attention to me. I'll do everything quietly — you won't even know I'm "
"there!\""
msgstr ""
"\"절대 안 돼요! 이 기회를 놓칠 순 없단 말이에요! 이 모험과 위업, 미래에 {mf||여}남작이 될 자의 불타는 눈빛... 내 눈으로 "
"직접 봐야 한다고요! 이제 막 써내려 가려했는데. 진짜 조용히 할게요. 저는 신경 쓰지 않으셔도 돼요. 있는 줄도 모르게 잘할게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "176df62b-307e-459a-8749-5cf45f6b8df5"
msgid ""
"\"I should rest in bed for a while at {g|Oleg's Trading Post}Oleg's Trading "
"Post{/g} — and get to work right away! This book will turn out great!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠시 동안 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}올렉의 교역소{/g}의 침대에서 쉬고 일하러 갈게! 책은 대단할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "58be69e8-2efc-4b31-9b28-555e492fb34a"
msgid ""
"\"As long as I've known you, you've constantly freed people from prisons and "
"chains. Is that a coincidence, or a good habit?\""
msgstr "\"어째 제가 볼 때마다 붙잡히고 갇힌 사람들을 풀어주는군요. 이건 우연인가요? 아니면 항상 그러시나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "bd3861b2-0f6b-43a7-8b32-fe3faccfce53"
msgid ""
"\"How do you know if someone's been thrown behind bars unjustly? If it was "
"up to me, I'd destroy all the prisons and set all the prisoners free! And "
"then any of them who did harm could be dealt with without chains!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가 부당하게 감옥에 갖혔는지 어떻게 알아? 나라면 감옥을 모두 부수고 죄수들을 풀어줬을 거야. 해가 될만한 녀석은 그 때 가름이 "
"나겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "51c171d8-7da3-4f66-899d-2fd918cb1fdb"
msgid "\"Me too! Hate them!\""
msgstr "\"저도요! 나쁜놈들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8895a24f-1de1-48f2-b1af-6ce270766c9b"
msgid "\"Really? Well, it's a lucky coincidence, then!\""
msgstr "\"정말요? 그럼, 참 재수가 좋은 우연이네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "13902696-d6fa-4a8c-a340-5c028b8c3feb"
msgid "\"So we're just 'valuable resources' to you? All right...\""
msgstr "\"그럼 우린 그냥 쓸모있어서 구해준 건가요? 알았어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CompaniosReleased/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "465fc713-1cf9-4f65-ba3b-db77322b2f5a"
msgid "\"That's terrible! I hope you're joking!\""
msgstr "\"끔찍하네요! 농담이길 바랄게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/LKandTartuk2_String
msgctxt "8bf8ae04-50e7-44e9-8f21-5c79ac65a081"
msgid ""
"\"A good joke is a powerful weapon. And a bad one can seal the joker's fate."
"\""
msgstr "\"좋은 농담은 강력한 무기이고 나쁜 농담은 광대의 명을 재촉하는 법이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/LKandTartuk3_String
msgctxt "3ba65cb5-4af7-4f95-a168-13b5f56a08e8"
msgid ""
"\"So be it. Rise, my unfortunate jester. Your performance is not over yet.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 해라. 일어나라, 내 불운한 광대여. 너의 공연은 아직 끝나지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/LKandTartuk_String
msgctxt "d4a67491-4728-4676-b1c1-97bde29299a7"
msgid ""
"\"What a sorry spectacle. The treacherous servant of a treacherous king, who "
"in his turn is mere servant to even greater powers. He impersonates a lesser "
"creature — and dies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"참으로 딱한 광경이구나. 반역자 신하에 반역자 왕. 그 왕조차 더 커다란 힘의 노예일 뿐이구나. 열등한 존재를 흉내내고는 그렇게 "
"죽다니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password1_String
msgctxt "bfab17f0-c285-4ca1-b075-405f61bf1173"
msgid "\"Pass-word?\""
msgstr "\"암호?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password2_String
msgctxt "f9ea19c4-bd45-44d6-8553-c8a11f67080d"
msgid "\"Blishhhfulness.\""
msgstr "\"축복.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password3_String
msgctxt "9a6f3628-dc17-406a-8821-5487b26f56bb"
msgid "\"No. Pass-word?\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 암호는?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password4_String
msgctxt "d4aa62d5-d101-4ac7-b8fc-e8c5959ab548"
msgid "\"Blissfulneshhh?\""
msgstr "\"축복?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password5_String
msgctxt "d2394686-5761-48ce-b76e-91e708019066"
msgid "\"No. Pass-word?\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 암호는?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password6_String
msgctxt "d657b76a-82b5-4a24-a2bb-63e300cef393"
msgid "\"Blishhhfulneshh?\""
msgstr "\"축복?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password7_String
msgctxt "54d0811c-b79d-46f4-a6e3-ea8d6738aab2"
msgid "\"No. Pass-word?\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 암호는?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password8_String
msgctxt "b0af8de4-6e6c-4505-a724-34c11b30a642"
msgid "\"You fool! Get lossst!\""
msgstr "\"멍청아! 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Password9_String
msgctxt "717edc98-4228-4e67-a3a8-8d24fb5030aa"
msgid "\"No. Pass-word?\""
msgstr "\"아니야. 암호는?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup10_String
msgctxt "995cb10a-945f-4c13-ac38-3b778a9be3eb"
msgid "\"My flea joke better you!\""
msgstr "\"내 벼룩이 너보다 농담을 더 잘하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup1_String
msgctxt "b72d23ea-aab3-42b1-9aaf-85956a2e0160"
msgid "\"Kobold go tunnel... and fall his own trap! Ha-ha-ha-ha!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트가 터널을 빠져나가다가 함정에 빠졌다. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup2_String
msgctxt "1ce68335-aadf-499f-885c-4ba10b45cc5f"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold go past bush. See scale tail. Poke it knife! It one more kobold!!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트는 수풀을 지나간다. 비늘 꼬리를 봐라. 칼로 찍어라! 코볼트 한마리 더 잡았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup4_String
msgctxt "f6fbca74-4ad4-4024-b1bd-c679dce8d9d3"
msgid "\"Kobold steal catapult. Not know what do. Shoot himself in wall!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트가 투석기를 훔쳤다. 어떻게 쓰는지 모른다. 투석기에 던져져서 벽에 찌그러졌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup5_String
msgctxt "12d5bc54-29b4-4b57-a946-3511ad038ebd"
msgid "\"How you know where kobold ambush? Ask: kobold, you ambusssh, yesss?\""
msgstr "\"코볼트가 매복하는 곳을 어떻게 알 수 있지? 이렇게 물어봐. 코볼트 매복했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup6_String
msgctxt "d5245511-23a1-45d5-9c64-f372b245a450"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold think — they little dragon. Dragon think — they little food. Ha-ha-"
"ha-ha!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트는 자기들이 작은 용이라고 생각해. 용은 자기들 간식이라고 생각하지. 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup7_String
msgctxt "e0385b65-86f4-4642-9384-d6192e5e4301"
msgid ""
"\"One kobold stand one more kobold, are two stupid kobold on each other! Ha-"
"ha-ha-ha!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트 한 마리에 코볼트한 마리. 그러면 두 마리 어리석은 코볼트! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup8_String
msgctxt "568d5051-5bde-4e0e-addf-59847b9e1ddf"
msgid "\"Booo!\""
msgstr "\"우우!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/CutsceneBarks/Standup9_String
msgctxt "a0b44816-6e02-4fa5-9089-f59b818b8d75"
msgid "\"Joke bad! Hit joker!\""
msgstr "\"재미없다! 저놈을 쳐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "1f0beb4d-d136-48d8-ad70-019ff826f608"
msgid ""
"[Tell the truth] \"Tartuk deceived everyone. It was he who stole the "
"Sycamore Branch from the kobolds, to make war with the mites. He attacked "
"me, and he was killed. Now I possess both sacred Branches.\""
msgstr ""
"[진실을 말합니다] \"타툭은 모두를 속였어. 그는 코볼트로부터 시카모어 가지를 훔쳐 마이트와 전쟁을 하게 만들었다. 그는 나를 공격했고 "
"지금은 죽었지. 이제 내가 두 성스러운 가지를 가지고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6b83b435-480c-46e1-b73f-62c8fe3c742b"
msgid "Lied to your allies."
msgstr "동맹에게 거짓말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f9015989-f229-4ae1-bd15-3a8cd8a9594d"
msgid ""
"[Lie] \"I haven't found Tartuk. He must have run away with the Sycamore "
"Branch.\""
msgstr "[거짓말합니다] \"나는 타툭을 발견하지 못했다. 그는 아마 시카모어 나뭇가지를 가지고 도망쳤을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d1a72ecc-6ece-4a7a-aa1d-afec0fab0660"
msgid ""
"Returned both relics to their owners, establishing peace between the mites "
"and the kobolds."
msgstr "두 유물을 주인에게 되돌려주었고 마이트와 코볼트 사이에 평화를 구축했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "1ef62dce-eb43-46bf-873d-2b1e6e368e19"
msgid ""
"[Give both Branches to their owners] \"Now that you know the truth, you must "
"give up this needless feud and live together in peace once more. The true "
"aggressor here has received his just punishment.\""
msgstr ""
"[가지를 둘 다 돌려준다] \"이제 진실을 알았으니 불필요한 싸움은 그만두고 함께 평화롭게 살아. 진짜 침략자는 정당한 응징을 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fd859c49-2664-48dd-80ba-c18062aa5415"
msgid ""
"Asked the kobold chief to show mercy towards mites, as they were accused of "
"stealing the relic falsely."
msgstr "마이트가 유물을 훔쳤다는 것은 부당한 비난이었으니, 코볼트 족장에게 자비를 보이라고 부탁했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "bdafbbc1-5b79-41ff-b0f6-31b704a22b3b"
msgid ""
"[Give one Branch] \"Chief, I ask that you show mercy and not pursue Queen "
"Bdaah and the mites. They were falsely accused.\""
msgstr "[유물을 돌려준다] \"자비를 베풀어 여왕 브다와 마이트를 처벌하지 마. 그들은 모함을 받은 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b96e41e7-5840-47a1-9265-d727b8fc42f2"
msgid ""
"Asked the mite queen to show mercy towards kobolds, as they were accused of "
"stealing the relic falsely."
msgstr "코볼트가 유물을 훔쳤다는 것은 부당한 비난이었으니, 마이트 여왕에게 자비를 보이라고 부탁했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4fb8a735-73d3-41d6-a20d-49648034b1ff"
msgid ""
"[Give one Branch] \"My Queen, I ask that you show mercy, and not pursue King "
"Sootscale and his kobolds. They only attacked you because they were deceived "
"by a traitor.\""
msgstr "[유물을 돌려준다] \"자비를 베풀어 검댕비늘 족장과 코볼트는 처벌하지 마. 그들은 사기꾼에게 속아서 공격을 했을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4ca84f74-d61b-4690-bcf9-8a95ab768f37"
msgid ""
"Honored your alliance with the kobolds and returned their relic to them."
msgstr "코볼트와의 동맹을 존중하고 그들의 유물을 돌려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "67506748-d158-462f-8e6a-df037191dc87"
msgid ""
"[Give one Branch] \"Now these dungeons belong to the kobolds. I hope our "
"alliance lasts, Chief.\""
msgstr "[유물을 돌려준다] \"이제 던전은 코볼트의 것이다. 우리의 동맹이 계속되었으면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4ecc1575-7fdf-4aaf-8c7c-54b894d00e67"
msgid "Honored your alliance with the mites and returned their relic to them."
msgstr "마이트와의 동맹을 존중하고 그들의 유물을 돌려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "38b1b908-be7f-42e8-b811-1a2c04810aa9"
msgid ""
"[Give one Branch] \"Now these dungeons belong to the mites. I hope our "
"alliance stands, my Queen.\""
msgstr "[유물을 돌려준다] \"이제 던전은 마이트의 것이다. 우리의 동맹이 계속되었으면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "57e652b8-15c2-4207-b50c-2052398c9498"
msgid ""
"Kept mite and kobold sacred relics and persuaded poor creatures to worship "
"your gloves instead."
msgstr "마이트와 코볼트에게 유물을 돌려주지 않고 이 불쌍한 생물들에게 당신의 장갑을 숭배하라고 설득했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "68a5c833-b63f-468c-b7e2-23883e2fbb6b"
msgid ""
"[Keep both Branches] \"There is no need to honor these old relics. Honor the "
"hero who opened your eyes and changed your history. Honor me! As for your "
"relics... I suppose my gloves will do.\""
msgstr ""
"[유물을 돌려주지 않는다] \"이 낡은 유물을 기릴 필요는 없다. 너희 눈을 뜨게 하고 너희의 역사를 바꾼 영웅에게 경의를 표해라. 날 "
"찬양해! 너희에게 내릴 유물로는... 아마 내 장갑이면 될 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "baf51659-da58-4bf0-9880-a9508ea716be"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Now that Tartuccio has been dealt with, it is time I deal with "
"you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"타투치오를 처리했으니 이제는 내가 너희를 손봐줘야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "ebd81278-0dd5-4d31-91c5-e3b8737db29a"
msgid "\"I am returning the remaining Branch to the mites.\""
msgstr "\"나는 나머지 유물을 마이트에게 돌려줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "6a1efa2d-eaa7-43d0-a4ce-596ea376eab5"
msgid "\"I am returning the remaining Branch to the kobolds.\""
msgstr "\"나는 나머지 유물을 코볼트에게 돌려줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "a5a9ceaf-cdba-4c89-8aeb-341f1e709086"
msgid "\"Ssscape! Mite! Ssscape!\""
msgstr "\"쉬이이익! 마이트! 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "3cb3ad88-9c84-4c56-8192-4f8076795a5b"
msgid ""
"\"You {d|c11 Neutral}promise{/d} find truth. Open it soon. You find shaman?\""
msgstr "\"너 진실 찾는다 {d|c11 Neutral}약속{/d}했지. 빨리 알려줘. 샤먼 찾았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "7cf19388-7028-4dc6-a112-4fc94313ebb9"
msgid ""
"\"War over not yet. You tell what happen treacherous shaman. You find him?\""
msgstr "\"전쟁은 아직 끝나지 않았어. 샤먼이 반란을 일으킨 걸 말하라고. 그를 찾았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0012_Text_String
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "e8e751f1-08ec-49c0-be56-480cbeb55359"
msgid "\"Treacherousss! Treassson!\""
msgstr "\"배신자! 배신이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0013_Text_String
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "c9618bf2-da1e-466f-88e0-19933e042799"
msgid "\"I know Purple Hide traitor.\""
msgstr "\"보라색 가죽 배신자인거 알았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0022_Text_String
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "2b328fa0-0d9e-41ec-bffc-82f787857341"
msgid "\"Nuisssanssse. Bad ssshaman. I sorrow.\""
msgstr "\"골칫거리. 나쁜 샤먼. 나 슬퍼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0023_Text_String
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "8003d25c-f902-460d-b75a-26f700b484e4"
msgid "\"Pity. I want make belt his scale!\""
msgstr "\"이럴수가. 그의 비늘로 허리띠 만들거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "88168994-1bcf-4c28-b488-1d9897244e85"
msgid "\"Never! We war!\""
msgstr "\"절대 안돼! 우리는 전쟁한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "b5b30d68-7f67-4d0c-af29-3eb247f2a974"
msgid "\"Friend wissse! Kobold honor you!\""
msgstr "\"친구 똑똑해! 코볼트가 너 존경한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "636a3d22-1c75-4bb6-bb37-cfdee0b888e4"
msgid "\"Friends! We alliance with you long time. Friends, feasts.\""
msgstr "\"친구들! 우리는 오랫동안 너희와 동맹을 맺었다. 친구들. 잔치한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "62d2e60d-8ae6-4102-b90d-ffbb50f6193b"
msgid "\"Unjussst! Tricksssy! Kobold fight! Fight!\""
msgstr "\"엉터리야! 속임수! 코볼트 싸운다! 싸워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0033_Text_String
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "bb9b1b66-3d12-461c-9ca5-6513d3632e73"
msgid ""
"{n}The Chief holds the sacred Branch. His eyes are full of sorrow.{/n} \"Much"
" blood isss shhhed. Not easssy forget. But we ssstruggle! No mite do evil "
"deedsss again. You, friend — welcome guessst. Alwaysss!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장은 신성한 유물을 들고 있습니다. 그의 눈은 슬픔이 가득합니다.{/n} \"피 너무 많이 흘렸다. 쉽게 잊지 못한다. 하지만 "
"노력한다! 마이트는 이제 나쁜짓 안한다! 너 친구. 환영한다 손님. 언제나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0034_Text_String
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "73485519-1daa-463d-bbc5-9f6d37894031"
msgid ""
"{n}The queen shakes her head thoughtfully.{/n} \"Was much death. Hard forget "
"bad blood. But I wise Queen, find other way. No kill kobold no more. Ally, "
"you brave and fair. Be our guest precious now always!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여왕은 생각에 잠겨 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"많이 죽었다. 흘린 피 잊을 수 없다. 하지만 나 지혜로운 여왕. 다른 길 찾는다. "
"코볼트 더 안 죽인다. 동맹. 너는 용감하고 공정하다. 우리 손님이 된다. 항상!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "474c7d38-a295-4f54-beae-739609bffd9b"
msgid ""
"\"Wissse and fearlesss! Loyal friend! You friend kobold now alwaysss. Glory!"
"\""
msgstr "\"현명하고 용감하다! 충직한 친구! 너 친구 코볼트 항상 함께 한다! 영광!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "6081dfc9-b04b-4d47-826f-68c3877622fa"
msgid "\"Thank loyal ally. You be guest mites always. Friends!\""
msgstr "\"충성스러운 동맹에 감사한다. 너 항상 마이트의 손님이다. 친구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "32e10cfa-1478-415f-b6fa-e5b8a3c33866"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold crier reaches out for a glove.{/n} \"Glove! Great relic!\""
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 장갑을 잡고 소리칩니다.{/n} \"장갑! 위대한 유물!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "5e00a3cf-ce39-4188-bd02-ba314d017bb5"
msgid "\"Friend! Alwaysss! Glory! Glory! Glory! Glory! Glory!\""
msgstr "\"친구! 영원히! 영광! 영광! 영광! 영광! 영광!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : MiteSineshal
msgctxt "c4c7769e-a7d3-442c-9afe-c0a2a723665e"
msgid "\"Mite take this gift! Honor you hero!\""
msgstr "\"마이트 이 선물 받는다! 영웅을 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "7dbba046-95fd-4071-a9a3-05ea5d6c9b25"
msgid ""
"{n}You have founded your own cult. Henceforth, your glove is treated as a "
"sacred relic in the dungeons under the Old Sycamore.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 자신만의 종교를 설립했습니다. 이제 당신의 장갑은 시카모어 나무 아래 던전의 신성한 유물이 되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "21e58f22-02be-463f-a02d-1818d6c9e607"
msgid ""
"\"You know... It looks like you may yet become a worthy ruler of this realm."
"\""
msgstr "\"음... 당신은 이곳의 훌륭한 통치자가 될 수 있을 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0048_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "debb1c52-d78f-486e-b0cb-e47dffb7c69e"
msgid ""
"\"Kobolds are so sweet! I'm so glad you were able to make friends with him!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트는 너무 귀여워! 그들과 친구가 될 수 있어 너무 기뻐요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0051_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "bad047b3-0d78-4b36-8c33-758e4594a951"
msgid ""
"\"Amazing! You managed to get them to reconcile. Good work! I thought a "
"fight was inevitable.\""
msgstr "\"놀라워요! 그들을 화해시키다니, 잘하셨어요! 전 불가능할 거라고 생각했거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0054_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "325f9bf4-3c57-4c3c-b88b-be99c934a94b"
msgid ""
"\"That's great! These mites are worthy folk! I wouldn't risk eating their "
"delicacies, though, heh.\""
msgstr "\"대단해! 이 마이트들은 가치 있는 친구들이군! 그래도 그들이 좋아하는 음식은 먹지 않을래. 헤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "518fd570-8113-463b-a9d8-c3773f7e8d22"
msgid "\"Ha ha! About time! Let's have some fun!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 시간이 됐군! 재미 좀 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "a7a130d6-7ec9-459f-888b-afa23b586703"
msgid "\"Whaaat?! Treassson! To armsss, to armsss!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?! 반역! 쉭! 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/EntranceKoboldAllianceKeeped_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "8e630696-3a42-4ab6-a1f6-cb01409033a3"
msgid ""
"\"{d|c11 Kobolds}Friend!{/d} We fight! Mitesss run away! You find Tartuk and "
"relic?\""
msgstr "\" {d|c11 Kobolds}친구!{/d} 우리는 싸운다! 마이트 도망간다! 타툭이랑 유물 찾았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/EntranceMiteAllianceKeeped_Text
#. Speaker : MiteSineshal
msgctxt "2ada8e72-ef9d-45ab-adb4-da266d842acc"
msgid ""
"\"{d|c11 Mites}Our ally{/d} brave come back! When you go, we defeat kobold.\""
msgstr "\" {d|c11 Mites} 우리의 동맹 {/d}이 용감하게 돌아왔다! 네가 가면 우리는 코볼트를 이길 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/FinalRulersDialog/EntranceNeutralReinforced_Text
msgctxt "ed166305-c781-4f3d-a5b1-6c11cdcb94c9"
msgid ""
"{n}At the exit of the Sycamore Hall you meet Bdaah, queen of the mites and "
"Sootscale, chief of the kobolds. They look askance at each other, their rage "
"barely suppressed, but they do not attack.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}시카모어 회관의 출구에서 당신은 마이트의 여왕 브다와 코볼트의 족장 검댕비늘을 만났습니다. 그들은 서로를 훑어보더니 씩씩거렸지만 "
"공격하지는 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Items/SycamoreBranch1_name_String
msgctxt "c99d6686-b5cf-4db2-a168-b7fe3fb0fa34"
msgid "Kobolds' Relic"
msgstr "코볼트들의 유물"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Items/SycamoreBranch2_name_String
msgctxt "523cf6b9-0e68-403d-8513-b62b1b66a8ec"
msgid "Mites' Relic"
msgstr "마이트들의 유물"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/Items/SycamoreBranch_description_String
msgctxt "bf954fac-ec9a-4bab-a048-048370a0a2ff"
msgid ""
"A sacred branch of the Old Sycamore is white as snow and covered with drops "
"of hardened amber resin. You can sense the magic in the relic. It opens the "
"entrance to the underground Sycamore hall. Merchants will definitely pay "
"much to resell this to the relic collectors."
msgstr ""
"오래된 시카모어의 신성한 가지는 눈처럼 희며, 굳은 호박색 진액 방울들로 덮여있습니다. 당신은 이 유물에서 마법을 느낍니다. 이것은 지하 "
"시카모어 회관의 입구를 열 것입니다. 유물 수집가들은 이것에 많은 값을 치룰 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "951e34be-eff0-486c-b3b5-947cbfd76127"
msgid "\"Where might Tartuk be now?\""
msgstr "\"타툭은 지금 어디 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "dd687953-8458-4411-b8ee-9119f63e0d29"
msgid "\"How is the war with the mites progressing?\""
msgstr "\"마이트와의 전쟁은 어떻게 되어가고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "78120ff8-8784-4397-aef3-1d9a401bb4dd"
msgid "\"How can I help you in your war?\""
msgstr "\"전쟁에서 너를 어떻게 도울 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "80487a52-1f62-4b13-ace9-6ef6d31c5f9d"
msgid "\"We will speak later. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "e7de4116-1520-4e94-9ad4-935d9f6441c6"
msgid "\"Very well. I shall deal with the mite queen.\""
msgstr "\"아주 좋아. 나는 마이트 여왕과 대화를 해 볼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "b96153bb-522c-4c98-bced-44be1fa485a3"
msgid "\"I have helped enough. You must fight without me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 충분히 도왔어. 너는 나 없이 싸워야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "a4002479-df1f-4461-8550-e7464c5bd3b3"
msgid "\"There is someone in your dungeon I wish to discuss.\""
msgstr "\"던전에서 대화하고 싶은 상대가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "8d0d9a42-f5a0-42bb-b14c-4fa877ec2c6d"
msgid "\"I may need the relic to enter the hall, if Tartuk is already there.\""
msgstr "\"타툭이 거기에 있다면 회장에 들어가기 위해 유물이 필요할 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "4efec96f-e539-4775-b98c-92b0c1eaffc9"
msgid "\"Queen Bdaah has been defeated. You have nothing more to fear.\""
msgstr "\"여왕 브다가 패배했다. 두려워 할 것이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "bb0a4b5a-3281-4578-8865-c6ce9e64b4b4"
msgid ""
"\"What need have you of this 'dumbhead', Chief? They're just taking up space "
"in your dungeon.\""
msgstr "\"이 멍청이에게 무엇이 필요해? 그들은 그저 공간만 차지할 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "374ce009-1969-4e8c-a8fb-d9e00ae4be82"
msgid ""
"\"Serves them right. A kobold prison is the proper place for Tartuccio's "
"servants.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트 감옥은 타투치오의 하인들에게 적절한 장소야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "a41acf67-cf86-4de2-9f2a-388b9559967d"
msgid ""
"\"Release them, Chief. How does holding a 'dumbhead' prisoner serve you?\""
msgstr "\"그들을 풀어줘. 대장. 멍청한 포로를 잡아둬야 뭐가 좋겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "52180ba4-c616-441c-9250-ce8c5a43542f"
msgid "[Attack] \"I need our alliance no more!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 더 이상 우리 동맹이 필요 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0046_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f4ea5935-c565-4cb5-a138-213ece1ae40e"
msgid "Showed mercy to the kobold Chief."
msgstr "코볼트 대장에게 자비를 베풀었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "a1c997d9-a30b-4d43-9d62-e00eb9753b05"
msgid "\"I won't kill you, Chief. Take your servants and leave.\""
msgstr "\"너를 죽이지 않을 것이다. 네 하인들을 데리고 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "af72ed99-4106-4b21-905a-bb6f451876cf"
msgid "[Finish him] \"Yes. Say your last goodbyes.\""
msgstr "[그의 목숨을 끝장냅니다] \"좋아. 마지막 인사를 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "d8f6c3b2-05b3-4afd-8d2c-a91aa66138c5"
msgid "\"Greetingsss, friendsss!\""
msgstr "\"안녕! 친구들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "ed3c0628-9fe0-4b49-9117-d09f7635fe83"
msgid "\"Eetingsss! Endsss!\""
msgstr "\"아녕! 치그들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "99a9204f-8276-41d9-b4f6-ee2393716437"
msgid ""
"\"We fight mitesss! Mitesss break bridge. We break wall. Now all quiet.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 마이트와 싸운다! 마이트 다리 부쉈다. 우리 벽 부순다. 우리 모두 조용하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "e6e92373-0b11-45a0-a944-70ac8ebddee1"
msgid "\"Passsage cleared. We make big attack!\""
msgstr "\"길 열렸다. 이제 공격 크게 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "85fc6028-b2f5-42fe-9157-23a8ea6d0f63"
msgid "\"Make! Big! Tack!\""
msgstr "\"열려! 크게! 공겨!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "95d882a9-6eed-4f82-af93-feba165c05ba"
msgid ""
"\"Don't know. He leave. If find relic, enter sssacred hall. Mite not go "
"thisss hall! We have mite relic,\" {n}says the chief proudly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"쉭, 모르겠다. 떠났다. 유물을 찾으면 신성한 회장에 들어가라. 마이트는 회장에 못간다! 우리 마이트 유물 가지고 있다.\" {n}"
"대장이 자랑스럽게 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "dabacf83-7c7c-40af-a3b4-57bf21ac21de"
msgid ""
"\"I asssk help. My ssshaman Tartuk go passsage under Old Sssycamore. Fight "
"mite! Sssearch relic! I afraid he can't do. Friend find ssshaman? Kobold "
"attack then!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도움 요청한다. 샤먼 타툭 시카모어 나무 아래 통로로 갔다. 마이트와 싸운다! 유물 찾는다! 샤먼 못할까 걱정된다. 친구 샤먼 "
"찾았어? 코볼트 공격한다. 그럼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "5cd07e10-55ab-411c-b29e-29dd521cb5a2"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold ssstrong, fierccce! Not afraid! But mite Queen ssstrong too.\" {n}"
"The Chief looks annoyed.{/n} \"You ssslay Queen, I give reward. Mitess run "
"away. No kobold die. Sssuccesss!\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트는 무섭다. 두려워하지 않는다! 하지만 마이트 여왕도 힘 세다.\" {n}대장은 화가 나 보입니다.{/n} \"여왕 죽여라. "
"그럼 보상 준다. 마이트 도망간다. 코볼트 죽지 않는다. 서어어엉공!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "3da17e8f-10df-4700-80ac-9b4868710a9d"
msgid ""
"\"Sssuc! Cesss!\" {n}The crier brandishes his weapon bravely, but he is "
"clearly shaken when the Queen is mentioned.{/n}"
msgstr "\"쉬이익! 성! 공!\" {n}코볼트는 고함을 외치며 무기를 휘두르지만 여왕을 말할 때 분명히 떨고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "91959ef8-b5ce-4e4b-8c48-c25986ffba58"
msgid "\"Fearlesss! I like.\""
msgstr "\"두려움이 없다! 나는 좋아한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "bb622312-8b97-4ea0-acd1-65b468bde979"
msgid "\"Ssscared.\" {n}The Chief looks disappointed.{/n}"
msgstr "\"무섭다.\" {n}족장은 실망한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "6af1f3db-d884-4ae4-b96d-fdfd22c7d2de"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk bring them. Thisss dumbhead shhhout sssilly thingsss. Call Tartuk "
"Tartuchhhio. Can't talk good!\""
msgstr "\"타툭은 그들 데려간다. 이 멍청이들 멍청한 소리 지껄인다. 타툭 타투치오라 부른다.말 잘 못한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3295a246-a805-4417-b953-085c6d4b932e"
msgid ""
"\"This dungeon does not depress me. It is as good as any place for "
"contemplating the frailty of life.\""
msgstr "\"이 감옥은 나를 약하게 하지 않네. 삶의 덧없음에 대하여 사색할 수 있는 곳이라면, 어디든 환영이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "aea50e10-4a49-4b81-9390-6a78aff03d5a"
msgid ""
"\"The little tongue-tied monster accuses me of not being able to speak. "
"Ironic,\" {n}scoffs Jaethal, contemplating her nails.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"말도 제대로 못하는 괴물이 내게 말도 하지 못하게 하는군. 이런 아이러니가.\" {n}제이탈은 손톱을 다듬으며 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "e47345e9-1d1a-4d5b-90a8-849fc4e63255"
msgid ""
"\"I always knew that honesty could get a bard behind bars! But I didn't "
"think it would happen so quickly...\""
msgstr "\"음유시인이 정직하면 감옥에 갇힐 걸 알고 있었어요! 하지만 이렇게 빨리 갇힐 줄이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e322b054-15dc-4789-bc79-cf3cae2ceebe"
msgid ""
"\"'Tis unworthy of a ruler, to stoop to insulting his prisoners! And we "
"merely tried to open your eyes, Chief.\""
msgstr "\"이 형편없는 지도자가 죄수들이 모욕하는 것을 멈추게 했다. 우리는 너의 눈을 뜨게 하려는 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "3525c8c1-c505-4dbd-b778-9735082761f7"
msgid ""
"{n}The Chief thinks for a while, scratching the back of his head with a "
"clawed finger.{/n} \"Fine. I give mite relic. You touch it door and enter! "
"Then return relic.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장은 잠시 생각하며 발톱으로 머리 뒤쪽을 긁적입니다.{/n} \"좋아. 마이트 유물 준다. 문 앞에서 두드리면 들어갈 수 있다! "
"그러고 유물 돌려줘라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "726bf6a8-86b5-4eac-a749-3ffb6d601e38"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold crier is so impressed, he speaks even before Chief Sootscale "
"can respond.{/n} \"Feated! Evil mitey Queen! Glory! Glory!\""
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 감명을 받아 족장 검댕비늘이 대답하기 전에 말합니다.{/n} \"이겼다! 악당 마이트 여왕! 영광! 영광!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "67f613ac-35f6-4d3d-8517-a75e0c15055e"
msgid ""
"{n}The Chief thumps the crier on the head.{/n} \"No ssspeak before Chhhief! "
"Friend ssstrong, fierccce! Reccceive award!\""
msgstr "{n}대장이 코볼트의 머리를 두드립니다.{/n} \"대장이 말하기 전에 말하지 마라! 친구 세다! 보상 받는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "adee0a4b-df79-4737-b2b0-6f6e0fac5fe7"
msgid "\"Agree. Ussselesss creature. Releassse!\""
msgstr "\"알았다. 쓸모 없는 생물. 풀어줘라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "c3be5bcd-7b91-4187-bac2-c04097a531fd"
msgid "\"Yes. Ussselesss. Let them go!\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 쓸모 없다. 풀어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "f37ecf48-b3a2-4c31-9c66-e1a1e5b8d46c"
msgid ""
"\"You alssso ssspeak funny.\" {n}Chief Sootscale shakes his head "
"helplessly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"재미있게 말하는군.\" {n}수트스케일은 머리를 절래절래 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "0e64d06f-9168-4784-a2b8-53caedc81027"
msgid "\"Deccceasssed... Deccceasssed is Chief and Sssootssscale tribe...\""
msgstr "\"죽었어... 수트스케일 부족 끝났다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldChief/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "7e6762bc-0fe2-4864-bf20-37d5730f7a7b"
msgid ""
"{n}The Chief clambers onto his feet, shaking from his wounds.{/n} \"I need "
"no pity. Take mite relic. Paysss for my life!\""
msgstr "{n}상처 때문에 떠는 족장은 두 발로 섭니다.{/n} \"나는 동정 필요 없다. 마이트 유물 가져가라. 내 목숨의 댓가다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldGatekeeper/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c0fa0d24-8509-485b-a47e-c63bc5c29f65"
msgid "\"Do you know where your shaman Tartuk is?\""
msgstr "\"너희 샤먼 타툭 어디있는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldGatekeeper/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a720bc09-3801-436a-b531-2253b3ed4308"
msgid "\"What lies ahead?\""
msgstr "\"앞에는 뭐가 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldGatekeeper/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7016d004-2b8e-423c-9f9d-14e3a7c5c272"
msgid "\"Very well, let's go.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldGatekeeper/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "175ba9e3-93fa-4f3a-8fc2-57786e257da6"
msgid "\"Friendsss! Chief wait! Many trapsss. Follow me!\""
msgstr "\"친구! 대장 기다린다! 함정 많다. 나 따라와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldGatekeeper/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ebf12428-0200-4724-9e90-ce74b6d637f9"
msgid "\"Don't know! Asssk Chief! Chief know all!\""
msgstr "\"몰라! 대장한테 물어 봐! 대장은 다 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldGatekeeper/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "3f8b6398-c46d-4a73-80b7-dc17bd59cb27"
msgid ""
"\"Mine!\" {n}The kobold is obviously proud of his knowledge.{/n} \"Humansss "
"make, then leave. Kobold come, live, work. Was mite passsage, no more. Mite "
"thief! Mite ambushhh attack, we break passsage, lose big chessst, goodsss. "
"Can't go deep. Ssscary. Angry mite bug, wild bug live down there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"광산!\" {n}코볼트는 분명히 그의 지식을 자랑스럽게 생각하는 것입니다.{/n} \"인간들이 만들고 떠났다. 코볼트 왔다. 코볼트 "
"여기 산다. 일한다. 마이트 지나가게 두었다. 이젠 안된다. 마이트 도둑이다! 마이트 매복 공격했다. 우리 졌다. 큰 궤짝 잃고 물건 "
"잃었다. 깊은 곳까지 갈 수 없다. 성난 마이트, 거친 마이트가 아래에서 살고 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "932fb60d-edff-4324-b4bd-a58b3a44de3c"
msgid "...tried to jam the doors, to deactivate the trap!"
msgstr "... 문을 막아서 트랩을 비활성화하려고 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b8f33a9b-4898-47ca-ae5c-0c6bd63b30c0"
msgid "...decided not to push our luck and retreated."
msgstr "... 우리의 운을 믿지 않고 퇴각하기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "6dbbad48-aba9-43d6-94b4-cf43c605ea93"
msgid "...surged forward, paying no heed to the dangers surrounding us!"
msgstr "... 우리를 둘러싼 위험에 신경 쓰지 않고 앞으로 나아갔습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "d6837d0b-6c86-4801-aaa3-89eb6e0257b2"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "77378069-712d-4351-9930-5c58ba47ff6a"
msgid ""
"\"Break... all break bad...\" We turned around and saw a kobold, sitting on "
"the ground beside a broken lever. The kobold was holding his head in his "
"hands, but sensing us, he jumped up.\n"
"\"Ssstop! You go — you fall! All go — all fall... Sssorrow, sssorrow...\" He "
"grew woeful, and lamenting he skittered down one of the passages. Then we..."
msgstr ""
"\"부서졌어... 모두 부서졌어.\" 우리는 부러진 레버 위에 앉아있는 코볼트를 보았습니다. 코볼트는 머리를 움켜쥐고 있었지만 우리가 "
"오는 것을 알아채고 벌떡 일어섭니다.\n"
"\"멈춰! 너 가면 너 떨어진다! 모두 갔어 모두 떨어졌어! 슬퍼. 슬프다...\" 그는 비참한 모습으로 슬퍼하며 한 통로로 미끄러지듯 "
"내려갔습니다. 그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "7e77c331-bf68-4b8e-8d6f-802c4e38d3df"
msgid ""
"Using equal parts wisdom and dexterity, we jammed the ominous hatch. Now we "
"could proceed without fear. Thus the darkness of the yawning abyss was "
"roundly defeated!"
msgstr ""
"지혜와 손재주를 사용하여 우리는 불길한 해치를 막았습니다. 이제 우리는 두려움 없이 나아갈 수 있습니다. 심연의 어둠은 하품만 나올 "
"뿐이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "80d56a64-c211-4e3c-b0ca-09100499f720"
msgid ""
"Our journey into the mysterious dungeon brought us by twists and turns to an "
"old mine. A huge hatch in the floor blocked our way! Its panels were half-"
"open and squeaked angrily, threatening to plunge careless adventurers into "
"the abyss below. It stretched from wall to wall, making it impossible to "
"simply walk around this deadly trap."
msgstr ""
"신비한 던전으로 가는 우리 여행은 우리를 구불구불한 길을 통해 오래된 광산으로 인도했습니다. 하지만 바닥에 있는 거대한 해치가 우리의 "
"길을 막았습니다! 바닥문의 판자는 반쯤 열려있었고 맹렬하게 삐걱대서, 부주의한 모험가들을 심연 아래로 떨어뜨릴듯 위협하고 있었습니다. "
"바닥문은 벽에서 벽까지 걸쳐져 있어서 이 무시무시한 함정을 그냥 피해 지나갈 수는 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "d4da4144-3fd3-4527-a123-ebfe2ba5faf2"
msgid ""
"Much as we hated to admit it, the crafty designs of the kobold trap-masters "
"proved too much for our efforts. After attempting to jam the panels shut, we "
"bravely stepped forward... heard a terrible squeak... and plummeted into the "
"darkness!"
msgstr ""
"인정하기는 싫지만 코볼트 함정 장인이 만든 작품을 해체하기에는 시간이 많이 걸렸습니다. 뚜껑을 막은 후 우리는 용감하게 앞으로 "
"앞섰습니다... 그리고는 삐그덕대는 소리가 들렸고 우리는 어둠으로 빨려들어갔습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/KoboldLiftboy/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "ef71ae9a-9a33-4d40-ae77-2837bc5bc301"
msgid ""
"At first the panels seemed to hold our weight. But one careless step later, "
"and they swung wide open — and we plummeted down into the darkness below!"
msgstr ""
"처음에 뚜껑은 우리의 무게를 지탱한 것처럼 보였습니다. 하지만 부주의하게 발걸음을 내딛은 우리는 뚜껑이 열리는 것을 보았습니다. 우리는 "
"어둠 속으로 빠져들었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e8dd715f-0a77-4d37-96a0-b633f858a0e2"
msgid ""
"Persuaded the mites to stop torturing the kobold prisoner and release him."
msgstr "마이트를 설득해 코볼트 죄수를 고문하는 것을 그만두고 풀어주게 하였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f1cb8d90-1cc4-4a97-9162-79c80949e22f"
msgid ""
"\"You can't use a living creature as a target — even an enemy. Let this "
"kobold go!\""
msgstr "\"살아있는 생물을 과녁으로 사용하면 안돼. 적도 마찬가지야. 코볼트를 풀어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "931a98d4-d2b4-41e3-a946-83fb80d51497"
msgid ""
"Persuaded the mites to stop torturing the kobold prisoner and execute him."
msgstr "마이트를 설득해 코볼트 죄수를 고문하는 것을 그만두고 처형하게 하였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "20076314-42e1-49c9-816c-794f113ca04e"
msgid ""
"\"You may capture or kill your enemies, but do not torment them. Finish him "
"off, and no more torture.\""
msgstr "\"적을 붙잡거나 처형할 수 있지만 고문하는 건 안돼. 고통 없이 죽이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "16ab397a-2fce-4e19-bcb6-d0eec6d31195"
msgid ""
"Joined the mites' competition using a live target — their kobold prisoner."
msgstr "코볼트 포로를 살아있는 표적으로 사용하는 마이트의 경쟁에 동참했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "648db027-b47d-4a7a-b1b5-2453a67c803f"
msgid "\"A contest? I'm in! It's always more interesting with a live target.\""
msgstr "\"맞추기 하는 거야? 나도 할래! 살아있는 과녁을 맞추는 건 언제나 즐겁지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "fc644c17-f3c2-499f-82d6-ff43d17f794d"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough. I'll endure this alliance no longer!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그만. 나는 이 동맹을 끝내겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "04734963-9e38-4d85-8d33-d647ea858929"
msgid "\"I will not take part in this. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나는 안할래. 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "a93d92d9-a567-4bef-9613-6aeb7e7df835"
msgid ""
"\"His shouts... His screams of pain... They're like music to Zon-Kuthon's "
"ears!\""
msgstr "\"그의 비명... 고통에 찬 비명... 그들에게는 음악과 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "e03e11ef-697b-4341-aaa4-988ad8a21dfd"
msgid "\"Greeting ally! We train aim! Best get reward! You play too, yes?\""
msgstr "\"안녕! 우리는 사격 훈련했다! 1등은 상 받는다! 너도 할래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "459e3d53-78cd-43f4-a36c-490b15200a02"
msgid ""
"{n}You hit the target. The kobold emits a woeful hiss, and the mites "
"cheer.{/n} \"Ahahaha! Sweet! We reward you, ally!\""
msgstr "{n}당신은 과녁을 맞췄습니다. 코볼트는 비참한 소리를 내자 마이트가 웃습니다.{/n} \"하하하! 네게 보상하겠다. 동맹!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "6016f568-de15-425a-877e-49ec49d97adc"
msgid ""
"{n}You miss. The kobold hisses. The mites cheer.{/n} \"Miss! You catch "
"kobold and train, ally!\""
msgstr "{n}빗나갔습니다. 코볼트가 한숨을 쉽니다. 마이트는 낄낄거립니다.{/n} \"빗나갔다! 코볼트 하나 잡아 연습해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "c48bf1f2-3a6c-4bf2-9bb4-d73d019ce92f"
msgid ""
"{n}The mites grumble, annoyed.{/n} \"You friend our beautiful queen. We "
"listen you. We catch other kobold anyway!\""
msgstr "{n}마이트는 불평합니다.{/n} \"너는 우리 아름다운 여왕의 친구. 네 말 듣는다. 우리 다른 코볼트 잡겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "8e885f35-0ffe-474e-b47c-a62042e2b833"
msgid ""
"{n}The mites are surprised.{/n} \"How we train aim if kobold dead? Fine. We "
"kill this and catch new!\""
msgstr "{n}마이트가 놀랍니다.{/n} \"코볼트가 죽으면 어떻게 연습해? 좋아. 죽이고 새로운 코볼트 찾는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "01c3dc0a-9932-433b-b9f7-5fab7e7e2c0b"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia winces.{/n} \"I've seen noble, rich, educated people with the "
"same tastes in entertainment. Scales and fangs would suit them far better "
"than velvet and satin.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 찡그립니다.{/n} \"나는 귀족이나 부유한 녀석들이 비슷한 취미를 즐기는 걸 봤어. 벨벳과 새틴보다는 가죽과 송곳니가 "
"그들에게 어울려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ae3144b4-2000-4325-8790-4a5af4711b4f"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, girl, cheer up! I know at least two who will never wear anything "
"again — except their fine wooden boxes!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 기운 내! 그런 녀석들에게 어울리는 건 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "be4c871f-8a0a-42fb-a78a-f431646143dc"
msgid ""
"\"Haha, 'tis true! But so many still enjoy life... I wish we could send them "
"all down here, among the mites and kobolds!\""
msgstr "\"하하. 사실이다! 인생을 즐겨야 해... 그들을 모두 마이트와 코볼트에게 보내고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "dc01cdfb-ddb8-4744-b1c8-069bcf2d4eb5"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Killing him in battle would be one thing, but like this...\" {n}"
"Octavia stops herself and waves a hand.{/n} \"Oh, who am I lecturing? They "
"probably don't even know those words. But still — thanks for stopping it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 전투에서 그를 죽이는 것과 달리 이건...\" {n}옥타비아는 멈추고 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"내가 뭘하고 있는 거지? "
"그들은 이런 말도 모를 텐데. 하지만 멈춰줘서 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteDarters/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "3a83138d-30ba-4b53-9297-b2b2ea75f4e0"
msgid "\"Zon-who? Ton-what?\""
msgstr "\"응? 뭐라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "6a252c5f-7363-48be-9ceb-4224fc2b8956"
msgid "\"What lies ahead?\""
msgstr "\"앞에는 뭐가 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "31ecceb4-394f-4b55-ad26-26c8c10e6700"
msgid "\"Do you know where the kobold shaman Tartuk is now?\""
msgstr "\"샤먼 타툭 어디있는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "15d6be4a-6bf5-4ddd-8964-cb10ae8e2aa1"
msgid "\"How do I get to this broken passage?\""
msgstr "\"이 부서진 통로에 어떻게 가야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "946006f3-feaa-491c-ae54-eead61829e4a"
msgid "[Attack] \"I am your ally no longer.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 더 이상 너의 동료가 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "f1d90f44-a719-4052-ba9d-ebabf4a77ac4"
msgid "\"Here are the mandibles you asked for.\""
msgstr "\"여기 네가 찾던 것이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "6aad7d8a-652c-4c8a-bc3d-000bc4a3baf7"
msgid "\"I must go. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "0dde435f-8233-4671-b4d3-1728d715675e"
msgid "\"That's why they're called centipedes — because of the scent!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 지네라고 부른 이유가 있었어. 냄새 때문에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "f79aeaa5-6f08-483d-8579-8e80027b7657"
msgid ""
"\"When I become a baron{mf||ess}, I'm instituting a law against puns...\""
msgstr "\"내가 남작이 되면 말장난에 반대하는 법을 제정할 거야... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "c7190ffe-4cdc-4f26-9a83-b49a6d06d883"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "04c40a88-9adc-4b67-b9eb-8b0bc48134d7"
msgid ""
"\"Daisy, come! Good girl!\"\n"
"{n}The gatekeeper notices you and her face lights up. She turns away from "
"her pet centipede.{/n} \"Greeting, ally! You come. Warrior Queen Bdaah wait "
"you.\" {n}The gatekeeper sighs in delight.{/n} \"Queen beauty as little "
"centipede!\""
msgstr ""
"\"데이지. 이리와! 옳지!\"\n"
"{n}문지기가 당신이 오는 것을 보자 얼굴이 밝아집니다. 그녀는 애완용 지네에게서 물러납니다.{/n} \"안녕. 동맹! 왔군. 여왕 "
"브다가 너를 기다린다.\" {n}문지기는 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"여왕은 작은 지네처럼 아름다워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "864ba7b2-d6f8-4ac7-9a5e-ef3b12b064ac"
msgid ""
"\"Hole under Old Sycamore, here live mite and our animal. Careful, some "
"animal still wild! There deep hole, very dangerous! Up was kobold passage, "
"but now it broken. Kobold drop stones, we lift bridge. No passage. Sad! Rich "
"chest lie passage. Big treasure. All lost now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래된 시카모어 나무 구멍 지하에서 마이트와 우리 동물이 살았다. 몇몇 동물은 거칠다! 거기에 깊은 구멍은 위험하다! 위는 코볼트 "
"통로지만 지금은 부서졌다. 코볼트 돌 떨어뜨려서 우리 다리 올렸다. 통로 없다. 슬프다! 가득한 궤짝 통로에 있다. 보물 많다. 지금은 "
"다 잃어버렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "015b4e2c-ef7d-4868-a930-54402e3cb539"
msgid ""
"\"Shaman Purple Hide? Know not! He run our hole, throw magic. Queen chase "
"him. Queen know where he.\""
msgstr "\"보라색 피부의 샤먼? 모른다! 그는 우리 구멍으로 달려와 마법 썼다. 여왕 그 쫓는다. 여왕 그가 어디있는지 안다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "a7997edf-73bd-4f62-95d9-a7ff105fd80c"
msgid ""
"\"Lower bridge bad! Kobold run away on bridge.\" {n}The gatekeeper thinks "
"for a while.{/n} \"Ally make trade, yes? You want passage. I want pretty "
"helmet. You go lower passage deep, there lie big dead spider. Our great "
"warrior hero mount it, until die. Bring me this bug jaw, I give you lever "
"for bridge. You take chest with loot, I make helmet of spider. Sweet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다리 내리면 나쁘다! 코볼트가 다리로 도망친다.\" {n}문지기는 잠시 생각합니다.{/n} \"동맹은 거래한다, 맞지? 너 통로 "
"원한다. 나 예쁜 투구 원한다. 너 아래 통로 깊숙히 가라. 거기 커다란 죽은 거미 있다. 우리 위대한 전사가 죽을 때까지 탔다. 그 "
"곤충의 턱 가져오면 너에게 다리의 손잡이 준다. 너 상자에 보물 가져라. 난 거미로 투구 만든다. 신난다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f5cde041-4809-4d7f-99b3-29a870c1d4fa"
msgid ""
"\"All good! I make fine helmet. Take lever bridge, brave ally. I say no one, "
"you take treasure.\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 나 좋은 헬멧 만든다. 레버 가져가라. 용감한 동맹. 나 누구한테도 얘기 안 해. 너 보물 가져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "7b7462e4-07a1-4817-8210-7095168efe3f"
msgid ""
"\"Need more kobold. Daisy eat them fast, then hungry... Greeting, ally!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트가 더 필요해. 데이지 코볼트 빨리 먹어서 배고프다... 안녕. 동맹!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "4c6eed73-8240-415c-87bf-41a8898e1f54"
msgid ""
"\"Would that I could banish the word 'beauty' from the maws of these filthy "
"creatures.\""
msgstr "\"이 더러운 생물들의 머리에서 아름다움이라는 단어를 지우고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "67a82473-8498-4073-a9ce-fe08d8abd32b"
msgid "\"These things are creepy! I almost... centi-peed my pants! Ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"어휴 냄새! 지네 냄새가 아주 지네! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ae396541-b284-4d20-a8d9-26bd1641a62e"
msgid "{n}Regongar laughs.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a9171a19-f764-4ae3-b414-5f2a94b23016"
msgid "\"Then I'll just go underground and start a guerilla war, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 내가 아래로 내려가서 게릴라전을 벌이지. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteGatekeeper/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f64c1530-d85d-48e3-909d-a2623f9a6a95"
msgid ""
"{n}Realizing his joke is going unnoticed, Regongar frowns and grunts.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그의 농담이 무시당한 것을 안 레곤가르는 얼굴을 찡그리고 아무말을 하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "f0e6b0a1-6e6d-4b6c-aee2-ff565511dbf0"
msgid "\"How do I get to Sycamore Hall?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 시카모어 회관으로 가지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7b9e03ff-ab10-4981-aa91-2c74702e38be"
msgid "\"How may I help in your war?\""
msgstr "\"네 전쟁에서 어떻게 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e85316fa-b08d-4516-8aba-ed0495cf2895"
msgid "\"Forgive me, my Queen, I must go.\""
msgstr "\"나를 용서해. 나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "69af7eeb-3a2a-4148-ba66-3ef7c1b41e74"
msgid "[Attack] \"It's time to put an end to this alliance.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이제는 이 동맹을 끝낼 때가 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "1872067b-2e3b-4a66-a440-2b2fa4c13c39"
msgid "\"All right. I will try to reach the Chief.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 코볼트 대장에게 말해 보겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "67352724-95b2-49e1-8058-e532c37f46d1"
msgid "\"I do not wish to do this.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이것을 원하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "563e1ad2-a349-4ba7-a64c-53608312cbe1"
msgid "\"It is done. I have defeated Chief Sootscale.\""
msgstr "\"끝났어. 나는 수트스케일을 물리쳤다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3d6e5350-969b-44f4-b35f-ae15e0b4a47c"
msgid "Spared mite Queen's life."
msgstr "마이트 여왕의 목숨을 살려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "1bf0fd25-8ec5-4e6f-aeef-eb8441647325"
msgid "\"I will not kill you, Queen. You may take your warriors and leave.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 죽이지 않을 거야. 여왕. 너는 전사들을 데리고 떠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "eca55fed-2572-40b2-96d1-1b7b88abbf79"
msgid "[Finish her] \"You will die. That is all that matters.\""
msgstr "[마무리한다] \"너는 죽을 것이다. 그 사실이 중요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MiteSineshal
msgctxt "a6619525-7db7-4f49-bb17-28374682864f"
msgid "\"Her Magicsty Warrior Queen Bdaah welcome ally her chamber!\""
msgstr "\"위대한 전사 여왕 브다는 방으로 들어온 동료를 환영합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "a514df7b-feda-4ee8-b694-0aa1955f98e4"
msgid ""
"\"Just on time, my ally. Shaman Purple Hide pass vicious magic under our "
"nose, and run sacred Sycamore Hall. He have relic-key! Kobold steal our "
"relic, we can follow not. You help us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 시간에 왔군, 내 동맹. 보라색 가죽 샤먼이 우리 코앞에서 사악한 마법을 부리고 신성한 시카모어 회관으로 도망갔다. 그가 유물 "
"열쇠를 가지고 있다! 코볼트가 우리 유물을 훔쳐가서 쫓아갈 수가 없다. 너 우리 도와?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "823bd687-1260-4bbb-a4c1-c35f5716f4a6"
msgid ""
"\"My guard let you to door. But you need relic. They are two. One have "
"Purple Hide. Where is second, I know not. Think — kobold Chief.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 경호원이 문 열게 할 거다. 하지만 너 유물 필요하다. 유물은 두개다. 하나는 보라색 가죽이 가지고 있다. 두번째 유물은 모른다. "
"아마 코볼트 대장에게 있을 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "cd8188f8-a347-4732-8c0c-87a8c78bf93c"
msgid ""
"\"You defeat Chief Sootscale, I reward you generous. Kobold fools all. "
"Without Chief, we win! I want myself cut his silly old head, but he not come "
"fight. Maybe coward. Maybe clever.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 족장 검댕비늘 물리쳤다. 너를 후하게 보상한다. 코볼트 멍청이다. 대장 없으면 우리 이긴다! 그의 머리 내가 베고 싶지만 싸우러 "
"오지 않았다. 겁쟁이 같다. 교활한 거 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "a736b732-0c3d-496d-8184-17122a963d8e"
msgid "\"Fine. Then I defeat Chief myself! And wear his hide instead wolf.\""
msgstr "\"좋다. 그러면 내가 대장 물리쳤다! 늑대 가죽 대신 그의 가죽 쓴다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "c6ec9910-5fc3-4e72-9f8c-e9ff6896af2d"
msgid ""
"\"Sweet! I reward and honor you, ally! Now I ready big attack and cut all "
"kobold! Only wait you catch Purple Hide.\""
msgstr "\"잘했다! 너 보상 받아라. 존경한다. 나 이제 공격 준비하고 코볼트 다 죽인다! 너는 보라색 가죽 잡아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "ab12323c-8476-435e-b56e-80bf321b147d"
msgid "\"Brave be fight and be not afraid to cut, torture enemy!\""
msgstr "\"용감히 맞서 싸우고 두려워 말고 적을 고문해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "810f0b74-429c-48a6-a029-7912004521c0"
msgid "\"Hit. I die honor!\""
msgstr "\"공격해. 나 명예롭게 죽는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/MiteQueen/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "a7d28ab1-a0f7-4055-a27e-09bec3eb2ee2"
msgid ""
"\"I disgrace now. We open Sycamore Hall and leave. You worthy warrior. I you "
"remember.\""
msgstr "\"나 불명예스럽다. 우리는 시카모어 회관을 열고 떠난다. 너는 가치있는 전사다. 나는 기억한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "56f8c2d4-2e29-4d7f-b3c1-691017935c84"
msgid "\"Now I am the lawful ruler of these lands.\""
msgstr "\"이제 나는 이 땅의 합법적인 통치자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "0e9edb92-1d49-4db0-8ee9-26f6d85a5024"
msgid "\"What will you do now?\""
msgstr "\"이제 무엇을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "3febf92e-e4fe-439c-ade9-7b7fe6a362e0"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you haven't been attacking the neighboring villages and "
"settlements...\""
msgstr "\"이웃 마을을 공격하지 않았으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "0497492f-a4d8-40bd-8180-3b2f5117fc19"
msgid "\"I met some other kobolds nearby.\""
msgstr "\"근처에 다른 코볼트를 만났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "48097006-9d43-4cd6-a6c4-3a3a0588a376"
msgid "\"Tartuk has appeared in my lands again. Has he come to you?\""
msgstr "\"타툭이 다시 내 땅에 나타났다. 그가 너를 찾았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "d59fc313-8a51-448d-8c60-b78b28556880"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Our alliance seems to have been a mistake. I have no wish to see "
"kobolds in my lands!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"우리 동맹은 실수였던 것 같다. 나는 내 땅에 코볼트가 있는 걸 보고 싶지 않다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "80c5100f-64ca-4a90-a422-21676949001a"
msgid "[Leave] \"Farewell, Chief!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"잘있어라.!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "b59ded75-88a7-4fcd-9e15-24d2390d360d"
msgid "\"You once asked me to deal with Queen Bdaah. I have defeated her.\""
msgstr "\"여왕 브다를 해치워달라고 부탁했지. 그녀를 물리쳤다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "66b187e8-512b-4ef0-88e6-b62035fb9c95"
msgid "\"Greetingsss, friend! Your visssit joy!\""
msgstr "\"안녕. 친구! 너 와서 기쁘다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "144efe2e-81c3-4ec7-ac18-3975dc2a3b4f"
msgid "\"Your! Sit! Oy!\""
msgstr "\"너! 앉아! 오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "0471c50f-bcb1-4b66-a36f-1d75d3488ece"
msgid "\"You become Chief? Good!\""
msgstr "\"너 대장이 되었어? 잘됐다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "61ccc62a-51d6-4556-accf-bd0705fe2fcf"
msgid "\"Come! Chief! Oood!\""
msgstr "\"대장 됐다! 와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "97e0bf6a-4fc7-4a49-b99c-2812790d2d01"
msgid ""
"\"We take mite dungeon. Much ssspace, many kobold. Niccce! Kobold power grow."
"\""
msgstr "\"우리는 마이트 던전 차지했다. 공간 많고 코볼트 많다. 좋다! 코볼트 힘 세진다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "dae70195-83bb-484a-af56-660a1f4e9fa6"
msgid ""
"\"Mite invite us feassst. Gave raw sssquirrel with hide. Mite ssstupid. If "
"we war, kobold winsss!\""
msgstr "\"마이트 잔치에 우리 초대했다. 가죽 안벗긴 다람쥐 고기 줬다. 마이트 멍청하다. 전쟁하면 코볼트 이긴다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "9681cb64-754b-4fb6-a378-1ff3c107c14b"
msgid ""
"\"We honor new sssacred thhhing! It bring luck! Kobold ssstrong, catch many "
"fisssh, ssscare human, take loot!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 새로운 제물 숭배한다! 행운 가져다준다! 코볼트 강해서 물고기 많이 잡고 인간 겁준다! 약탈한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "7f2f57f2-f13f-45a6-bf0d-71a6fc0d42f2"
msgid ""
"{n}The Chief seems absorbed in thought.{/n} \"We attack one human bandit. "
"Doesssn't count.\""
msgstr "{n}대장은 생각에 잠겨있는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"우리는 인간 도적을 공격했다. 중요하지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "3a4e6bd9-e4f2-4a49-be5e-e6c257691f26"
msgid "\"Not our tribe. We throw weaklingsss out!\""
msgstr "\"우리 종족 아니다. 우리 약한 녀석 필요 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "0cd0fb12-76e8-4953-b774-420536fa1b5c"
msgid ""
"\"Throw! Out!\" {n}The crier seems particularly excited, and repeats the two "
"words flawlessly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"필요 없다!\" {n}소리를 외친 코볼트는 흥분해서 계속해서 같은 말을 반복합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "c7816a4e-f57d-4409-85a2-d37507cc95a8"
msgid ""
"\"Hideousss liar! Sssend messsenger. Say — he king. I sssay I ssskin Tartuk!"
"\" {n}The Chief shakes his weapon angrily.{/n} \"Never let him here. No "
"ssstrange kobold!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말쟁이! 전령 보냈다. 자기가 왕이랬다. 타툭 왕이라고 했다!\" {n}대장은 화가 나서 무기를 휘두릅니다.{/n} \"여기에 "
"절대 못오게 한다. 이상한 코볼트 안됀다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldHerald
msgctxt "793ec6a3-4d29-4c6e-81c0-cb8a9544028d"
msgid "\"Let! Kobold! Trange!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트 최고다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "2a4ead29-c70f-4e57-b8fa-b65c2ac9ea73"
msgid ""
"{n}The Chief scratches the back of his head with his claw.{/n} \"You don't "
"wishhh peaccce with mite? Good. I promissse honorsss for victory over Queen —"
" I keep promissse!\""
msgstr "{n}대장은 자신의 머리를 긁습니다.{/n} \"마이트와 화해 안해? 좋아. 여왕 이겨서 명예 얻는다. 약속한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulKoboldChief/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldKing
msgctxt "626d878b-8adf-45f6-97ef-01fd3a42a08a"
msgid "\"Honorsss for victory!\""
msgstr "\"승리를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "78c20e6b-a4ae-4023-b9f9-c833c562ee9a"
msgid "\"Now I am the lawful ruler of these lands.\""
msgstr "\"이제 나는 이 땅의 합법적인 통치자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "74f1a35b-4ddf-4523-96ce-c56b760ebd87"
msgid "\"What will you do now?\""
msgstr "\"이제 무엇을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "71f544d4-eeef-482e-82a8-a48e889bfc2e"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you haven't been attacking the neighboring villages and "
"settlements...\""
msgstr "\"이웃 마을을 공격하지 않았으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3de0eee7-6cb9-412c-bf9f-5114b9aac5be"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I've changed my mind. I have no wish to see mites on my lands!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 마음이 바뀌었다. 내 땅에 마이트가 보이기를 원하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "3ebbd8fc-4fe4-4c6b-90d8-72b061519b19"
msgid "[Leave] \"Farewell, Your Majesty!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "cc1331e0-4205-48e8-b8be-13c65f208118"
msgid "\"You asked me to deal with Chief Sootscale, Queen. He is defeated.\""
msgstr "\"족장 검댕비늘을 해치워달라고 부탁했지. 그를 물리쳤다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "64b13725-d42c-458c-9c90-9949471a72b5"
msgid "\"Ally! Greeting my chamber.\""
msgstr "\"동맹! 내 방에 온 걸 환영한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "0ae93a03-b3ea-4897-ab9d-73947c5b2887"
msgid ""
"\"You now ruler? Sweet! If have many children, send one. I catch one of mine "
"and we make marriage dynasty!\""
msgstr "\"이제 통치자야? 좋다! 아이 많으면 하나만 보내라. 내 아이 하나 보내서 우리 서로 정략 결혼 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "1842d39c-083e-4e30-99fb-92a55b2c6747"
msgid ""
"\"I bored with no kobold,\" {n}sighs the Queen sadly.{/n} \"Was such fun "
"war! Fight, carnage, prisoner torture. Sweet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트 없어서 지루하다.\" {n}여왕은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"재미있는 전쟁이었어! 싸우고 학살하고 죄수 고문하고. 좋다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "297a8ea2-ae28-415c-ad01-78a0b1b010f5"
msgid ""
"\"Very bored with no war! I invite kobold feast, gut many squirrel and hare, "
"but they no eat and no fun. Ugh, silly kobold. Why we mercy them?\""
msgstr ""
"\"전쟁 없이 지루하다. 코볼트 잔치에 초대하고 다람쥐와 토끼를 많이 먹었지만 코볼트는 먹지도 않았다. 어리석은 코볼트. 왜 우리가 자비 "
"베풀어야 해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "363ce857-878f-45e8-91a6-88c1ed7fb6ee"
msgid ""
"\"I order build new Sacred Hall for new relic. Gather much bug waste to "
"decorate!\""
msgstr "\"새로운 유물을 위한 신성한 회장을 건축하라는 명령 내렸다. 장식하려고 벌레 많이 모았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "75684869-0ce5-48bb-ab3f-65a2b06bea39"
msgid ""
"\"We honor alliance, no attack. We only scare one fool, who catch fish. They "
"run and scream so fun! But we no even kill him, no-no.\" {n}The Queen "
"squints cunningly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 동맹 존중한다. 공격 안한다. 우리는 물고기 잡는 바보 겁줬다. 그들은 놀라서 도망쳤다. 재밌었다! 하지만 죽이지는 않았다. "
"안돼.\" {n}여왕은 교활하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "69197018-7d21-40ca-9f56-c1647d75d3bf"
msgid ""
"\"I know this talk peace be joke. And silly kobold believe? Poor silly "
"kobold.\""
msgstr "\"이 평화는 바보 같다. 멍청한 코볼트는 믿어? 불쌍하고 멍청한 코볼트다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "fe47066f-500d-4a36-a2f1-1a9c026f2a9b"
msgid "\"Ha-ha, get old kobold hide? Sweet! Take reward.\""
msgstr "\"하하. 늙은 코볼트 가죽? 좋다! 보상 받는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7e7d5ad7-1222-4e61-9e03-51e09e1bea4b"
msgid "\"You grow bored with no war? I can help you with that!\""
msgstr "\"전쟁이 없어 지루해? 내가 너를 도울 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/PeacefulMiteQueen/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MiteQueen
msgctxt "ada3db7d-fcd4-4eef-8b19-374fa138c799"
msgid "\"War with you? No, no! We happy bored!\""
msgstr "\"너와의 전쟁? 싫다! 싫다! 우리 지루해서 행복하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "3d6e8b97-ca23-47e2-a258-c8ff889773e6"
msgid "\"What is with this disguise, Tartuccio?\""
msgstr "\"이 변장은 뭐지. 타투치오?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "45c39cbe-0a1d-4486-97f5-fe2181488377"
msgid "\"What were you looking for here? Why did you need all this?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 무엇을 찾고 있었지? 왜 이 모든 것이 필요했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "640f556b-f16d-4ac9-9012-302fdb7342ac"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough. We will fight to settle our dispute.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"됐다. 그냥 실력으로 시비를 가리도록 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "4684de77-e0ef-4d3b-853e-7b7abd1325c2"
msgid "\"I don't think we need to fight. Let's resolve this peacefully.\""
msgstr "\"나는 싸울 필요가 없다고 생각한다. 평화롭게 해결하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "5d986976-2e87-41b7-84ea-0e6b1b51fdbc"
msgid "\"I know you are a Pitaxian spy.\""
msgstr "\"네가 피탁스의 스파이라는 것을 알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "bfbbbd11-a509-4af3-b6ef-0c868691bdca"
msgid ""
"{n}The outline of an unknown artifact disappears in the portal, and "
"Tartuccio turns to you. He still looks like a kobold, but seems to think it "
"is useless to keep pretending.{/n} \"Oh, my impromptu rival. You are late! "
"As always. A little advice: never join any races. Speed is just not for you."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}포털에서 알 수 없는 유물의 모습이 사라지고 타투치오가 당신에게 돌아섭니다. 그는 여전히 코볼트처럼 보이지만 코볼트 흉내는 더 이상 "
"쓸모가 없다고 생각하는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"오. 내 즉흥적인 라이벌이여. 늦었어! 언제나처럼. 충고 하나 할게. 절대 경주에는 "
"뛰어들지 마. 빠른건 너한테 안맞으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "fcf5eea9-015f-4e41-9734-1823503a1394"
msgid ""
"\"Do you mean the performance I put up for the kobolds? Wasn't this an "
"excellent idea? The poor folks did everything I wanted, even started a brawl "
"with their beloved neighbor mites. I did not even need to make any effort to "
"complete my mission. That is why I will always be a step ahead of you and "
"the like.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 코볼트를 위해 준비한 공연 말이야? 훌륭한 아이디어지? 이 불쌍한 녀석들은 내가 원하는 모든 것을 해냈고 사랑하는 이웃 "
"마이트와도 싸우기 시작했어. 나는 임무를 완료하기 위해 어떤 노력도 할 필요가 없었지. 그게 내가 너나 너 같은 녀석들보다 항상 앞서있는 "
"이유야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "16705d39-6b90-4f7e-9c12-d9fd41a080c2"
msgid ""
"\"Don't take me for an idiot, I am not going to tell you anything. Even "
"despite the fact I am going to kill you. By the way, did you know I am going "
"to kill you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"바보 취급 하지 마. 너한텐 아무것도 말하지 않을거야. 물론 내가 널 죽일 거라는 사실도. 그런데, 내가 널 죽일거란거 알고 있었나?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d8903fb9-dad1-499f-b54b-74c84d996a72"
msgid ""
"\"We do, dimwit, we really do. You know too much. And truth be told, I am "
"simply tired of you!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 멍청아, 정말로 그렇지. 너는 너무 많이 알고 있어. 그리고 솔직히 말하면 난 그냥 너한테 질렸어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "4ccc02bd-3c60-49e1-8d05-0ed65dbfb8f3"
msgid "\"And this is the person I nearly made the hero of my book? Ew!\""
msgstr "\"이 녀석이 내가 영웅담을 쓰려고 했던 모델이 맞나요? 으!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d06b8a4d-87c1-4971-a7c7-6870ec30cc10"
msgid ""
"\"Without a doubt, vice does have its advantages. However, in the end it "
"always — you hear me, always! — gets what it rightfully deserves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"의심의 여지없이, 악은 효율적일 수 있습니다. 그러나 결국엔... 당신 듣고 있습니까? 결국엔! 악은 그 대가를 치릅니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonFirstLvl/TartuccioDialog/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "5b884e10-cbc8-4b8b-8787-3436cfcf360c"
msgid ""
"\"But you don't know my mission. And won't ever know, because I will never "
"tell you. Even for the pleasure of seeing your discouraged face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 내 목적이 뭔지는 모르지. 내가 말 안 해주면 영원히 알 수 없겠지. 네 낙담한 얼굴을 보았을 때의 즐거움을 위해서라도 말하지 "
"않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/CentipedeAndBugCaveBarks/BossTrail_KoboldCorpse_String
msgctxt "e5a42825-539f-4cb8-9ebd-f0b814205cd5"
msgid "The kobold has literally been bitten in half."
msgstr "코볼트는 말 그대로 반 쯤 먹혔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/CentipedeAndBugCaveBarks/BossTrail_String
msgctxt "8b455e12-60f8-404e-92f4-d88a3e529d87"
msgid ""
"There's a huge serpentine trail in the dust. Something very large crept "
"through here."
msgstr "먼지 속에 거대한 뱀 모양의 흔적이 있습니다. 매우 큰 뭔가가 여기를 빠져 나갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/CentipedeAndBugCaveBarks/BugBark_String
msgctxt "1134e151-6889-4a8f-8d7f-dbb3d80c8737"
msgid ""
"The chitinous carcass of a huge spider. It still wears a curious harness, "
"and a small saddle on its back."
msgstr "거대한 거미의 흉축한 시체입니다. 여전히 신기한 안장을 등에 매달고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/BugRoomBark_String
msgctxt "3b55a4b6-ab49-440a-afda-175fc01e6064"
msgid "The dark waters of the underground lake provide no hint to their depth."
msgstr "지하 호수의 어두운 물은 깊이를 가늠할 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/ChestBark_String
msgctxt "84a96b7b-b71e-40e3-a599-f8ed3dc8fc1a"
msgid ""
"The collapsed soil dragged some buried treasure down with it. Someone is "
"going to be disappointed when they find their hoard missing."
msgstr "토양이 붕괴하면서 묻혀있던 보물을 끌고 내려왔습니다. 보물이 사라진 것을 보면 누군가는 실망할 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/Crypt/TombPlate_fail_String
msgctxt "b974a99a-fe5f-4286-977d-4b877333411f"
msgid "The gravestone doesn't budge."
msgstr "묘비는 흔들리지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/Crypt/TombPlate_name_String
msgctxt "9fbf75bc-fcc5-4d17-9805-cb571ba298ee"
msgid "A gravestone with heavily eroded carvings."
msgstr "묘비는 상당히 침식되어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/GreenCaveBark_String
msgctxt "34363107-6528-43f2-996a-598c5d5ddac3"
msgid ""
"The sunlight managed to find its way into the dungeon, creating this island "
"of life."
msgstr "햇빛이 지하로 들어와 이 생명의 섬을 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/GreenCaveFrog_String
msgctxt "9105dd3e-b212-4848-8d68-a88c68851951"
msgid "The frog watches your every step."
msgstr "개구리는 당신의 모든 걸 지켜보고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/KoboldChember_String
msgctxt "c61132d2-a25d-4ab7-bcdc-9f85894d2d56"
msgid "A secret sanctum, well hidden from prying eyes."
msgstr "비밀스러운 성소. 시선으로부터 잘 숨겨져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/MiteHermitBark1_String
msgctxt "72c92362-c090-44f5-87fc-60f8d7d4f7aa"
msgid "The mite watches you angrily and hisses."
msgstr "마이트가 당신을 화난 표정으로 바라보며 쉭쉭거립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/MiteHermitBark2_String
msgctxt "025c07b4-e564-4751-be21-627af65a4dc0"
msgid "The mite hisses again, furiously gesturing toward the exit."
msgstr "마이트는 쉭쉭거리며 출구를 향해 맹렬히 몸짓을 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/MiteKoboldBark_String
msgctxt "ae8a83da-c76f-4666-97e3-1357fed6fc8f"
msgid ""
"A great battle between kobolds and mites took place here. It seems "
"impossible to tell who won."
msgstr "코볼트와 마이트 사이의 커다란 전투가 여기에서 일어났습니다. 누가 이겼는지 알아내는건 불가능해 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/OctaviaBark_String
msgctxt "0c2c2984-0261-498c-9675-ed3a9c7bf05d"
msgid ""
"\"Look, a way to the surface! Great! I was feeling like a prisoner in these "
"caves.\""
msgstr "\"밖으로 가는 길이야! 좋아. 나는 이 동굴에 있는 동안 죄수처럼 느껴졌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/PlateBarkD_String
msgctxt "c528c98d-60c1-4445-b660-a96e14a952ab"
msgid "Click! The plate depresses."
msgstr "딸깍! 판이 눌렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/PlateBarkU_String
msgctxt "a49f4885-aa39-483c-9ff3-9fb40190cd58"
msgid "Creak! The plate lifts."
msgstr "판이 들어올려집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/PlateButtonNotOK_String
msgctxt "664c7ba6-0b8b-4d92-959d-2b132831e836"
msgid "The stone plate returns to its initial position."
msgstr "석판은 초기 위치로 돌아갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/DraftBarks/PlateButtonOK_String
msgctxt "79b29f65-5785-4b7d-9b1e-a614a80ffa12"
msgid "Clink! A hidden mechanism wakes from somewhere beneath."
msgstr "끼리릭! 아래 어디선가 장치가 움직이는 소리가 들립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/GreenAndAmberCaveBarks/AmberCaveAmber_String
msgctxt "36945e6d-87d2-4c7d-b7e8-5a755e1166d1"
msgid ""
"Old Sycamore resin, turned to amber. Inside there are bright flowers and "
"leaves, which look like no plant in the local woods."
msgstr "시카모어의 수지는 호박으로 변했습니다. 내부에는 여느 숲의 식물과는 다르게 보이는 꽃과 나뭇잎이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/GreenAndAmberCaveBarks/AmberCaveRoot_String
msgctxt "a8e23827-51eb-4243-9c0e-ce19ff750ef7"
msgid ""
"The taproot of the Old Sycamore. It was from here that the seed of the giant "
"tree once sprouted."
msgstr "시카모어의 밑동입니다. 한 때 여기서 거대한 나무의 씨앗이 돋아났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/GreenAndAmberCaveBarks/TristianBarkGreenCave_String
msgctxt "0eb80330-0cc4-4fe6-9696-b27c15a1df28"
msgid "\"Sunlight in the darkness. There's so much hope in this!\""
msgstr "\"어둠 속의 햇빛이야. 이것에 많은 희망이 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/Items/BugMandibles_String
msgctxt "04417157-d192-4566-8066-b9ce07596e08"
msgid ""
"The mandibles of a huge spider that belonged to the fallen hero of the mites."
msgstr "전사한 마이트 영웅의 것이었던 거대 거미의 아래턱입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/Items/BugMandibles_name_String
msgctxt "4b22e5e5-5b2f-46ec-8022-905d162f8f6f"
msgid "Mandibles of a Huge Spider"
msgstr "거대한 거미의 아래턱"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/Items/MiteBridgeKey_String
msgctxt "778d809b-012c-4960-a56e-c4476f4081ca"
msgid ""
"Part of a primitive mechanism, for lowering the bridge to the mites' dungeon."
msgstr "마이트의 던전으로 향하는 다리를 내리기 위한 원시적인 장치의 일부입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/Items/MiteBridgeKey_name_String
msgctxt "d481487a-3655-48e7-8e6a-e5c2cff69437"
msgid "Bridge Hoist Part"
msgstr "다리의 도르래 부분"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/Items/TaldorMineLever_String
msgctxt "3f316b06-87b5-4c31-969e-455261ce624e"
msgid ""
"This hefty iron lever might be helpful if you need to move some heavy mining "
"equipment."
msgstr "이 거대한 철제 레버는 무거운 광산 장비를 옮겨야하는 경우에 유용할 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/Items/TaldorMineLever_name_String
msgctxt "5688a8c5-6454-4136-88cb-bffedbbd6051"
msgid "Miner's Lever"
msgstr "광부의 레버"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/SecretDungeon/Dust_String
msgctxt "c0396a26-e0aa-4c4c-b67b-84abf2b23fb8"
msgid ""
"This room is surely the oldest, most forgotten place in the dungeon. The "
"layer of dust lies thick as a blanket."
msgstr "이 방은 던전에서 가장 오래되고 잊혀진 장소일 것입니다. 먼지가 담요처럼 두껍습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/SecretDungeon/WallMessage_String
msgctxt "ce51ed0d-e684-4b02-bb19-0adbadf82e52"
msgid ""
"The inscription reads: \"In praise of Taldor and the brave warriors of the "
"Fifth Army of Exploration, fallen but remembered in honor.\" Below is a date:"
" \"Year 2014, Age of Enthronement.\""
msgstr ""
"묘비에 새겨진 내용입니다. \"탈도르의 축복으로 다섯 번째 군대의 용감한 전사들이 이곳에 묻혀 명예롭게 기억될 것이다.\" 다음은 "
"날짜입니다. \"2014년. 정복의 시대\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/TaldorShrineAndCampBarks/CampBarkContainers_String
msgctxt "59cc0f3b-8ae7-4a56-83bb-fab8df0a8c44"
msgid ""
"\"Zimar\", \"Cassomir\", \"Oppara\" — fastened to the chests are metal "
"plaques, etched with the names of Taldor's cities."
msgstr "\"지마르\", \"카쏘미르\", \"오파라\"라는 탈도르 도시의 이름이 금속판에 새겨져 궤짝에 붙어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/TaldorShrineAndCampBarks/CampBarkEntrance_String
msgctxt "40f552e1-c902-46d5-9447-f105a3f30bd9"
msgid "The remains of a miners' camp, deserted centuries ago."
msgstr "수세기 전에 버려진 광부 야영지의 잔해."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/TaldorShrineAndCampBarks/CampBarkMachines_String
msgctxt "02254e40-64bb-454b-9d4a-ddf79ecfb077"
msgid ""
"The size of the structures makes it obvious they were not built by kobolds."
msgstr "구조물의 크기로 보니 코볼트가 건설하지 않았다는 것은 분명합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/TaldorShrineAndCampBarks/ShrineStatue_String
msgctxt "a93fc8e7-ee83-4b86-a45c-fdf790815e39"
msgid ""
"The statue is hewn from the rock, but with a hint of refinement. The "
"inscription reads: \"To our goddess Shelyn, whose gifts we yearn for, here "
"in the darkness.\""
msgstr ""
"조각상은 바위에서 깎아낸 것이지만 세련된 느낌을 줍니다. 비문의 내용은 다음과 같습니다. \"이곳 어둠 속에서 우리가 갈망하는 선물을 "
"주시는 여신 셸린을 위해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/TaldorShrineAndCampBarks/ShrineTombs_String
msgctxt "b8b2c649-c264-481a-bc15-02b7a965ffb9"
msgid "These graves probably belong to miners who died down here on the job."
msgstr "이 무덤은 일을 하다 여기서 죽은 광부의 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/TaldorShrineAndCampBarks/ShrineWalls_String
msgctxt "488137bc-0387-4d51-8008-510761d0b07b"
msgid ""
"The walls are traced with intricate flower patterns. It's hard to imagine "
"how much time and effort it required."
msgstr "벽은 복잡한 꽃무늬가 새겨졌습니다. 얼마나 많은 시간과 노력이 필요한지 상상하기 어렵습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/SycamoreDungeonSecondLvl/TaldorShrineAndCampBarks/ValerieShrineBark_String
msgctxt "d989fdaf-df52-418a-bd18-4a5f1241a265"
msgid ""
"\"The past seems to haunt me. I didn't expect to see a shrine to Shelyn in "
"these dungeon depths.\""
msgstr "\"과거가 저를 괴롭히는 듯 하군요. 이 던전에서 셸린의 성소를 보리라고 예상하지 못했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TatzlwyrmsDen/Barks/Boat_EmptyCoffer_String
msgctxt "763e1321-3a8a-4754-86fc-08965ac65d2f"
msgid ""
"Judging by the empty coffer, somebody was using this boat to transport quite "
"a bit of goods. But where did all the stuff go?"
msgstr "빈 상자로 판단 할 때 누군가 이 보트를 사용하여 상당량의 물건을 운반했습니다. 그러나 모든 것들은 어디로 갔을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TatzlwyrmsDen/Barks/UnknownRuins_String
msgctxt "8a30c4a7-de4e-433f-a840-0eda371ba81c"
msgid ""
"Ancient weather-worn ruins. Time has been merciless to them — it is "
"virtually impossible to tell when they were erected or who were the builders."
msgstr "낡은 고대 유적입니다. 시간은 그들에게 무자비합니다. 그들이 언제 지었는지 건축자가 누구인지를 말하는 것은 사실상 불가능합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/Barks/Companion_SaveMe_String
msgctxt "6c07276b-604b-4409-b8d4-1ac89a114582"
msgid "\"Hey! I'm here! Untie me!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 여기야! 날 풀어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/Barks/Leavers_CommandBark2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "17175807-6d2f-459f-b960-73dd14bf4b58"
msgid "\"Go out for a hunt, and bring back plenty of meat!\""
msgstr "\"사냥 가서 충분한 고기를 확보해 와라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/Barks/Leavers_CommandBark3_SharedText_String
msgctxt "f61d550e-3cc9-40b6-8393-727bbc2d54e7"
msgid "\"These slaves need food, and we're still a long way from Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"이 노예들은 식량이 필요하다. 그리고 누메리아에 도착하기엔 아직 멀었군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/Barks/Leavers_CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "8a9bae02-05e8-40bf-bcd8-15c56f43b058"
msgid "\"Hey, you! We're running short of provisions!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 너! 우린 지금 식량이 부족하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/Barks/Regongar_SaveUs_String
msgctxt "f455d220-936b-4fdd-8e41-d8a02c9912fe"
msgid "\"What is this, an escape? Untie us — we'll fight with you!\""
msgstr "\"뭐야 이건, 탈출인가? 우리를 풀어줘! 함께 싸울테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/Barks/Slave_bark_1_String
msgctxt "3b78b8dc-0f86-4d0b-977f-bd13507a0cbd"
msgid "\"Save us!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 구해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/Barks/Slave_bark_2_String
msgctxt "4e39d7b1-6a56-47f1-bad0-c70f57c10bb1"
msgid "\"Death to the Technic League!\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹에 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/Barks/Slave_bark_3_String
msgctxt "5cd910f2-5464-4990-8264-fef379c55826"
msgid "\"Freedom! Freedom!\""
msgstr "\"자유다! 자유다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f683ed1d-8f69-4393-b3ce-791d1cd3ce9a"
msgid "\"Before deciding her fate, I want to ask some questions.\""
msgstr "\"그녀의 운명을 결정하기 전에 몇 가지 질문을 하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "df5911cc-7506-42b6-b86c-499adee85542"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Technic League.\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "0382f1dd-9c61-43f8-9771-719c96bfcf6b"
msgid "\"What are you doing in this part of the world?\""
msgstr "\"이 땅에서 대체 뭘 하고 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "c48ad25e-6d2d-4980-bc2a-6160a3a6e919"
msgid "\"Why did you have these two in chains?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 두 사람을 사슬에 묶어둔 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b5032a7a-4f64-4faf-836e-4f64f7bcab59"
msgid "\"I don't have any more questions.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 질문은 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2672489d-9bef-469a-ba3f-70b97b07af50"
msgid "Allowed Regongar to kill Kalannah the slaver."
msgstr "레곤가르가 칼라나를 죽일 수 있게 두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "63ce7ead-eb70-4f38-b576-c8d951ca7208"
msgid "\"It's a right thing — to punish your tormenter. Kill her, Regongar.\""
msgstr "\"너를 괴롭혔던 자를 처벌하는 것은 옳은 일이야. 그녀를 처치해. 레곤가르.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8213980b-664a-41eb-899a-ce2f2f5749bf"
msgid "Killed Kalannah the slaver yourself because she angered you."
msgstr "그녀가 당신을 화나게 했기 때문에 노예상 칼라나를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "d1756f04-e47a-4e1f-951a-91e6c0acca8c"
msgid "\"She pissed me off. I will finish her myself.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 나를 화나게 했어. 내 손으로 그녀를 끝내겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c2dcae0e-1f44-4ed6-a057-717ebab48a3d"
msgid "Let Kalannah live."
msgstr "칼라나를 풀어줬습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "823e10fb-5d5c-44bb-9e12-a5fadefa0837"
msgid "\"I will spare her life. Go back to Numeria!\""
msgstr "\"그녀의 목숨을 남겨 두겠다. 다시 누메리아로 돌아가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "014a7e1f-7cbb-45a8-bfce-334f716ad8c1"
msgid ""
"\"Is it normal for the Technic League to grab random people from the road to "
"enslave them?\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹에서는 길에서 마구잡이로 사람들을 끌어다 노예로 만드는게 보통인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c1dd450c-5057-4ea6-a658-bb661fcf0a61"
msgid ""
"Killed Kalannah the slaver yourself, calling it training for future "
"executions."
msgstr "노예상 칼라나를 직접 죽였습니다. 앞으로 있을 공개 처형에 대한 연습으로 삼아서요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "9cc28309-ccb9-4c44-948d-7262dc1cf4ff"
msgid ""
"\"As the future lawful ruler of these lands, I want to practice carrying out "
"public executions!\""
msgstr "\"미래에 이 땅의 합법적인 통치자가 될 사람으로서, 나는 공개 처형을 연습해볼 생각이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "2dd134c3-4e0e-43a5-8e27-1c97f13bac35"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae teaches us to have mercy upon the repentant... but I see no "
"repentance in her.\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이께선 우리에게 회개하는 자에겐 자비를 베풀라고 가르치셔. 그러나 그녀가 회개한 것 같지는 않군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "c92dfefd-70e0-4914-af76-94c57f4737da"
msgid ""
"\"Shelyn teaches us to have mercy upon the repentant... but I see no "
"repentance in her.\""
msgstr "\"셸린께선 우리에게 회개하는 자에겐 자비를 베풀라고 가르치시지. 그러나 그녀가 회개한 것 같지는 않군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0046_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "aafd7366-a399-46bb-95f8-308e24a13745"
msgid "Allowed Regongar to kill Kalannah the slaver."
msgstr "레곤가르가 칼라나를 죽일 수 있게 두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "620df68e-2c78-4d73-8d04-78c37d34732e"
msgid ""
"\"Calistria teaches us to never forgive those who have wronged us. Go on, "
"Regongar — take your revenge!\""
msgstr "\"칼리스트리아는 우리를 건드는 것들을 결코 용서하지 말라고 우리에게 가르치지. 계속해, 레곤가르. 복수를 하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0048_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "95601548-226f-4767-9d9c-bc861e71cbef"
msgid "Killed Kalannah the slaver for her evil deeds."
msgstr "노예상 칼라나의 죄를 물어 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "e5af5cd6-fb3e-4bc7-b06d-e8e3b796422b"
msgid ""
"\"She's the epitome of evil, unable to repent — in the name of Iomedae, I'll "
"execute her myself!\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 뉘우칠 수 없는 악의 전형이다. 아이오메데의 이름으로 내가 직접 그녀를 처형할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "d3a4bd93-3559-4bde-8366-73c20d532c72"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalannah drops her weapon and raises her hands, which are covered in "
"blood.{/n} \"Mercy! Don't kill me!\""
msgstr "{n}칼라나는 무기를 떨어뜨리고 피가 묻은 손을 들어 올립니다.{/n} \"제발! 죽이지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "74f39420-5e19-497f-aeef-60040f99b84f"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc bares his fangs.{/n} \"That is how you talk now, wretch! "
"I've wanted to do this for so long...\" {n}He casts a spell on his "
"outstretched palm, and sparks begin dancing upon it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하프오크는 그의 송곳니를 보입니다.{/n} \"네년 입에서 그런 말이 나올 줄이야. 비참하군! 이 순간만을 기다려왔지...\" {n}"
"그가 주문을 외우면서 손바닥을 뻗자 그 안에서 불꽃이 춤을 추기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Neutral
msgctxt "d01e031d-0e9c-4836-bec4-b58cdd31ede5"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-elf puts her hand on his shoulder.{/n} \"Regongar... Come now, "
"let her go. It's one thing to kill her in battle, but executing her "
"unarmed... Why spoil the joy of being free?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프엘프는 그의 어깨에 손을 올립니다.{/n} \"레곤가르... 그녀를 놓아주자. 전투중에는 죽여마땅하겠지만 지금 이 여자는 "
"항복했잖아... 왜 자유의 기쁨을 망치는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "d7c3db1f-aacc-4a49-b0b6-796ee2e04884"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia, are you out of your mind? This filth is from the {g|Technic "
"League}Technic League{/g}! By her own hand she enchained us! And you want to "
"forgive her? Do you think she'll thank you? Ha! She'll just gather another "
"band and try to catch us again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"옥타비아, 너 제정신이야? 이 쓰레기는 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}이라고! 이 년은 우리를 노예로 만들었어! "
"그런데도 이 년을 용서하고 싶다고? 이 개년이 고마워 할 것 같아? 하아! 또 다른 따가리들을 모아서 우리를 다시 붙잡겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "edaadd17-34b5-4e15-b1e9-19149250d1ab"
msgid ""
"\"I will tell you everything! I know much! You will see. I am more use to "
"you alive than dead!\""
msgstr "\"모든 걸 말할게! 난 아는 게 많아! 두고 봐, 날 죽이는 것보다 살려두는 게 더 도움이 될거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "d0c26a56-a4d1-4b9d-917b-b95daf1f982f"
msgid ""
"\"It is an ancient alliance of wizards and scholars of the "
"{g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} wastelands and its technologies. We are the "
"mightiest organization in the whole of Numeria! We possess powers that the "
"uninitiated could only dream of, and our agents are everywhere — not just in "
"Numeria! Believe me, these are not people you want as enemies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"기술 연맹은 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 황무지의 위저드와 학자들의 오래된 연합체야. 누메리아 전체에서 가장 강력한 조직이지. "
"우리는 무식한 놈들이 꿈도 꾸지 못할 힘을 가지고 있고 우리 요원들은 누메리아뿐만 아니라 어느 곳에서나 활동하지! 진짜라니까. 적으로 "
"돌려서 좋을게 없는 단체라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "a39deb01-c5e3-4761-88d5-0008ae51f7f0"
msgid ""
"\"Because we own them! The {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} spent vast "
"sums of money on these two. We nurtured them, fed and treated them, even "
"taught them magic for many years. They cost us a fortune, and we're not "
"going to just set them free, whatever your local customs say. We are fully "
"in our rights!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 우리 소유이니까! {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}은 이 둘을 사기 위해 엄청난 돈을 썼어. 우리는 이들을 "
"키워주고, 먹여주고, 치료도 해주고, 심지어 수 년 동안 마법까지 가르쳐줬어. 엄청나게 투자했다고. 당신네들 지역 관습이 어떻든 간에 "
"절대 놓아줄 수 없어. 이건 전적으로 우리들의 권리라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "4ef8dec8-9926-407a-85bc-b8d5b0ee9d93"
msgid ""
"\"I was sent by Maestro Janush. He is a very important person and a mighty "
"wizard, who taught these two ungrateful slaves everything they know! He will "
"be furious to find out they are free, and will certainly find the one who "
"stole the {g|Technic League}Technic League's{/g} property. Believe me, he "
"does not need me for that — whether you kill me or not, he'll find you in no "
"time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마에스트로 자누시께서 날 보내셨다. 저 배은망덕한 노예들을 가르친 강력한 마법사이시지! 그분 귀에 이 둘이 도망친 사실이 들어가면 "
"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}이 뒤집어질 거야. 내가 없어도, 사유물을 훔쳐간 자를 수배하는데 문제없을 걸. 날 "
"죽이든 말든, 곧 마에스트로께서 너를 찾아낼 거라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "f91f98d2-0bbd-47bd-b450-e85d243b4b90"
msgid "\"You see now what a slimeball she is? Step aside, let me fry her!\""
msgstr "\"이제 저 년이 얼마나 역겨운 년인지 알겠지? 저리 비켜. 이제 저년을 튀길 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "48b44090-6bc3-4c6d-aa63-729848a4725c"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc bares his fangs in a grin of triumph, and raises his hand, "
"lightning sparkling.{/n} \"I zap thee with my heart\"."
msgstr "{n}하프오크는 승리의 미소를 지으며 송곳니를 드러내고 번갯불이 번쩍이는 손을 듭니다.{/n} \"마음이 통하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "571f7cdb-4e53-41ed-8aba-91fdadf128df"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc shrugs.{/n} \"Fine, fine... The victor's always right!\""
msgstr "{n}하프오크는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"좋아. 좋아... 승자는 항상 옳지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "04782253-9bcc-4d78-9fb7-a914d67d14c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar strikes Kalannah across the face.{/n} \"Get out of my sight, you "
"filth! Thank the gods that my friends are so soft!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 칼라나의 얼굴에 주먹을 날립니다.{/n} \"내 눈에서 사라져라, 이 쓰레기야! 내 친구들이 너무 무른 것을 신에게 "
"감사해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "ad05075c-8c62-4795-9655-75dd5e2d5b15"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to me. Do not make any hasty decisions. I am an important person in "
"the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}. I have connections! You will "
"benefit from such an ally!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 말 들어. 성급한 결정 내리지마. 나는 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에서 중요한 사람이야. 나에겐 인맥이 "
"있어! 그런 동맹이 있으면 너한테도 득이 될거라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "a9ad4e75-029c-4fa0-9cb2-ab08d3052bf4"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalannah shrugs.{/n} \"The {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} is so "
"strong because it is never ashamed of taking what it needs, whatever the "
"laws may say. We were missing a slave. We underestimated you. That was a "
"mistake, of course. I apologize.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼라나는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}이 강한 이유는 필요한 것이 있다면 법이 "
"어떻든 간에 취하는 것을 부끄러워하지 않았기 때문이야. 우리는 노예를 놓쳤었지. 우린 너를 과소 평가했어. 물론 그건 실수였지. "
"사과할게. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bf81553a-0859-48d5-b3a4-9ffc5b4fadb9"
msgid "\"Sounds promising...\""
msgstr "\"그럴싸하게 들리는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "71c82cd5-b325-41d1-b434-caf8cb5e6758"
msgid ""
"\"Only cowards with no honor reckon sheer power a good reason for an "
"alliance!\""
msgstr "\"명예도 없는 겁쟁이들만이 순수히 힘만 고려해서 동맹을 만들죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3d832d48-f989-48a8-af5f-8baad53a0bb9"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal rises her eyebrow, but doesn't grace Valerie with an answer.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}제이탈은 눈썹을 들어올리지만 발레리에게 대답하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "85ae5f35-c1b5-4094-8efc-bdae620ba5ed"
msgid ""
"\"Sparing a repentant sinner is a good deed, but I hear no repentance in her "
"words. She seeks impunity, not mercy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"회개 한 죄인을 아끼는 것은 선한 행위이지만 그녀의 말에는 회개가 없군요. 이 여자는 자비가 아니라 도망칠 길을 모색하고 있는 것 "
"같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bb1cc3a4-ca5a-461a-b21d-0a3aba7cd499"
msgid ""
"\"You say this magistro guy of yours will find us anyway? Then I guess we "
"don't get anything out of sparing you!\""
msgstr "\"그러니까 매지스트로인가 뭔가 하는 놈이 우릴 찾을거란거지? 그렇다면 너를 살려둘 이유가 전혀 없겠는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "ab5e0541-6aa3-47e0-8714-95b107c23a55"
msgid "\"You'd best not anger the Maestro! If you kill me, he'll be furious!\""
msgstr "\"마에스트로 자누시의 심기를 건드리지 않는 편이 좋아. 날 죽이면, 그분은 격분하시겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "37c1336b-1fa0-472e-ad01-4c89434864b0"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I'm so scared! You know, I actually like getting slavers and other "
"assholes angry with me — then I get to cut them to pieces!\""
msgstr "\"아이구 무서워! 사실 나는 노예 주인이나 밥맛인 놈들이 화내는 걸 좋아해. 그럼 내가 걔네를 조각조각 내주는거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/KalannaEnd/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "1b58cbcb-b72c-41a9-9b85-78fe1175bedd"
msgid ""
"\"I repent! I swear, I repent! As soon as I get back to "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, I'll give a fat donation to every good deity's "
"temple. {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, "
"{g|Iomedae}Iomedae{/g} — whatever you want, just let me go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"회개할게! 맹세해. 회개할게! {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아가면 모든 선신의 신전에 후하게 기부할게. "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}, {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}, {g|Iomedae}아이오메데{/g} 네가 원하는대로 말이야. "
"그냥 날 보내줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "074f4cb2-aa50-4680-bc2c-40558a5a1ead"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "93ea7bcc-1d43-4a20-ae87-4c2bc3ea03e6"
msgid "\"How did you get captured by Kalannah?\""
msgstr "\"너희들은 어떻게 칼라나에게 사로 잡힌 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "0d9ad967-ef1f-4f53-b64a-7fb345faa881"
msgid "\"What is the Technic League?\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹이 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "11ac81a2-8fae-4d3c-9e9a-7d23600c48a9"
msgid "Killed Octavia and Regongar."
msgstr "옥타비아와 레곤가르를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "e9303d17-e705-43db-ba74-6e0cfd646df5"
msgid "[Attack] \"I haven't time for games with you. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 네놈과 놀 시간 따윈 없다. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "8b0462e8-64fa-4fa7-b6a8-95b0ecab4bff"
msgid "\"You're good fighters. Want to join my group?\""
msgstr "\"너희들은 좋은 전사야. 내 일행에 들어올 생각은 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "e603d484-176c-46d7-9c08-264e27fd3e75"
msgid ""
"\"There's something we have to discuss. Go to Oleg's Trading Post. You'll be "
"safe there. I'll return there soon.\""
msgstr "\"우리끼리 논의할 게 좀 있어. 올렉의 교역소는 안전하니까 거기에 먼저 가 있어. 곧 따라갈게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "58929956-6e37-4dff-b888-258606ba0974"
msgid "\"I was happy to help. And now — farewell.\""
msgstr "\"도와줄 수 있어서 기뻤어. 그럼 이만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "8c89eea6-ef4e-4219-ad2a-62557f4dd9bb"
msgid "\"All right. Welcome to my group!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 내 일행에 온 걸 환영해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "1010ef2c-478f-4576-af4f-b64abc0b8989"
msgid ""
"\"Very well, but not now. Go to Oleg's Trading Post and wait for me there.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 하지만 지금은 아니야. 올렉의 교역소에 가서 기다리고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "dff5ac92-70a9-4115-8aa7-995c62af45b6"
msgid ""
"\"No, I have no need of you. You'd better leave the Stolen Lands quickly — "
"you're still in danger here.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 난 너희들을 필요로 하지 않아. 도둑맞은 땅에서 빨리 떠나. 너희는 여전히 위험에 처해있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Neutral
msgctxt "30ef8174-1df3-4c6c-9683-0931e1937a2a"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't mean to spoil the victory... But on the other hand, she deserved "
"it.\""
msgstr "\"승리를 망치려던 건 아니야. 하지만 한편으로 그럴 만하다고 생각은 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "43724545-69d0-4333-a81c-e9c05b15c2c1"
msgid ""
"\"You shouldn't have spared her life. On second thought... What difference "
"does it make? Either way, she'll rot in the {g|Abyss}Abyss{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그년의 목숨을 살려두지 말았어야 했어. 다시 생각해 보니... 그런다고 뭐가 달라지나? 어느 쪽이든, 그년은 "
"{g|Abyss}심연{/g}에서 썩을텐데!'\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "93968a97-befc-4eb9-a748-0809ccfa8acd"
msgid ""
"\"Ha haaa! We're free! I can't believe it! Free as the birds in the sky! "
"Phew!! Ha ha ha ha ha!\" {n}Regongar holds Octavia tight, and she laughs "
"lightly and kisses him on the lips.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하하! 우리는 자유다. 믿을 수 없어! 하늘의 새들처럼 자유로워. 휴! 하하하하!\" {n}레곤가르는 옥타비아를 꽉 껴안았고, 그녀는 "
"가볍게 웃으며 그의 입술에 키스합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Neutral
msgctxt "7775f4f5-3212-4540-8d7c-c68bba3e2ad4"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you! You've no idea how long we've tried to escape the {g|Technic "
"League}Technic League{/g}. This is a miracle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워요! 얼마나 오랫동안 우리가 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에게서 도망치려고 노력했는지 아세요? 이건 "
"기적이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Neutral
msgctxt "458ce382-0ea8-4745-833b-d08f42989906"
msgid ""
"\"A huge man-eating spider, catching all of {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} in its "
"webs! They're a secret society of arcane spellcasters, who study ancient "
"technology. They have eyes and ears throughout this land, and abroad. It is "
"said they even have Kevoth-Kul in their pocket! The very sovereign of "
"Numeria!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 거미줄을 치고 걸리는 인간들을 잡아먹는 거대 거미죠. 고대 기술을 연구하는 비전 마법사들의 "
"은밀한 사회에요. 그들은 이 땅은 물론 다른 대륙에도 눈과 귀를 가지고 있어요. 심지어 케보스 쿨까지 마음대로 할 수 있다는 얘기가 "
"있다니까요. 누메리아의 군주를요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "6f8aec63-678e-4869-96c0-ce363a418eb7"
msgid ""
"\"They also control all the slave trade in the country. I've seen many a "
"young treasure hunters' adventures end at the slave market... Ugh, may the "
"{g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} rot in Abaddon!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 놈들은 누메리아의 모든 노예 매매도 관리하고 있지. 나는 많은 젊은 보물 사냥꾼들의 모험이 노예 시장에서 끝나는 것을 보았어. "
"윽, {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}이 나락에서 썩기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "17d3e9f8-d7e9-42aa-a7fd-b9e5f395789b"
msgid ""
"\"I am Regongar, and this is Octavia. The rotten {g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} "
"held us as slaves. But we are no mere scavengers! You see the crowd they had "
"guarding us? It's because we use magic — and I'm not bad with a blade, if it "
"comes to that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 레곤가르이고 이쪽은 옥타비아야. 망할 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 녀석들이 우리를 노예로 만들었지. 그러나 우리는 단순한 "
"노예가 아니야! 우리를 지키던 이들을 봤지? 우리가 마법을 사용할 줄 알기때문에 그렇게 지키고 있던 거야. 물론 난 필요할 때는 칼솜씨도 "
"나쁘지 않지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Neutral
msgctxt "3faa1f94-0987-495c-ab3e-2574392524b3"
msgid ""
"\"I've lost count of how many times we've tried to escape. I can't name all "
"the things we have tried — but we were caught every time... And then they'd "
"just take us somewhere else. I don't know who'd want to buy us, but imagine "
"how happy we were, when we learned they were taking us to the {g|River "
"Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} where slavery is forbidden!\""
msgstr ""
"\"몇 번이나 탈출을 시도했는지 셀 수도 없어요. 도망친 이야기를 모두 이야기할 수는 없지만 매번 잡혔죠... 그 후에 그들은 우리를 "
"다른 곳으로 데려가려고 했어요. 누가 우리를 사고 싶어 할지는 모르겠지만 노예 제도가 금지된 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 "
"왕국들{/g}에 간다는 사실을 알았을 때, 우리가 얼마나 기뻤는지 상상해 봐요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "3d060537-1a43-4f90-8a01-670e83c7662d"
msgid "\"Of course! Octavia, what do you say?\""
msgstr "\"물론! 옥타비아. 어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Neutral
msgctxt "52f5aa6d-274e-44ac-9a69-86fc84bcaffb"
msgid "\"I would be happy to join you!\""
msgstr "\"너와 함께하게 되어 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "01b4143b-8b0d-4106-880b-f50bc564a95c"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed. We tried so many times to escape, yet in the end the League itself "
"brought us to the free lands! Under heavy guard, I'll grant you. If it "
"wasn't for you, who knows where we'd go next.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아. 도망 가기 위해 여러 번 노력했지만 결국 연맹 녀석들이 우리를 자유의 땅으로 데려왔어! 네게 큰 빚을 졌군. 네가 아니었다면 "
"우리가 어디로 갈지 누가 알았겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "cedc39f6-ec2c-42f0-b86e-153460f2e411"
msgid ""
"\"We will be waiting for you! But be careful you're not followed. The {g|"
"Technic League}Technic League{/g} has eyes everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"널 기다릴게! 미행당하지 않게 조심해. {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g} 녀석들은 눈이 사방에 있으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "5d4e7513-fa08-40b0-a73a-03f489c0039d"
msgid ""
"\"You're a good fighter! Is there a place for us on your team? They kept us "
"in chains for a reason — we can put up a good fight!\""
msgstr "\"너는 좋은 전사야! 우리가 들어갈 자리가 있을까? 그들이 우리를 쇠사슬로 묶어둔 이유가 있지. 우린 꽤 잘 싸운다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Neutral
msgctxt "31b0314f-b848-463a-8b0a-f96a83bb1214"
msgid "\"Great! Where are we going?\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 어디로 가는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Neutral
msgctxt "f2497f41-152d-4cf2-aa9e-5111dd01b18e"
msgid "\"Very well, as you wish. So long!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 바라는 대로. 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Neutral
msgctxt "d5a4af9f-4482-4220-9a70-b45ce557f203"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for saving us! Good luck!\" {n}Octavia blows you a kiss.{/n}"
msgstr "\"우리를 구해줘서 고마워요! 행운을 빌어요!\" {n}옥타비아가 당신에게 키스를 날립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bf99899c-95fb-4aa1-bf26-8e086b9562c2"
msgid "\"They're all right! We could use them on our team!\""
msgstr "\"괜찮은데! 우리 팀을 위해 그 힘을 쓰면 되겠구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/OctaviaRegongarRecruit/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fc535c61-b02b-4b28-b619-0aaacc7f0e88"
msgid ""
"\"There is nothing worse than a nation in which a secret criminal "
"organization has consolidated power. Even an openly cruel tyrant is better "
"than the infection that festers in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"비밀 범죄 조직이 권력을 굳힌 경우보다 나쁜 경우는 없습니다. 오히려 대놓고 잔인한 폭군이 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}를 "
"빠르게 좀먹고 있는 그 기생충들보다 나을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueEncampment/TechnicLeagueEncampment_ReleaseCompanion_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "d2a8032f-2837-4a41-908e-ac0a377b0470"
msgid "Free the prisoners"
msgstr "죄수를 풀어주기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Barks/KalannahLeavingBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "2de2954c-f37f-48a3-b2f4-28090172be0a"
msgid "\"Do not joke with the Technic League!\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹에 허튼 수작 부리지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Barks/Kalannah_Flee_String
msgctxt "421c8c22-b869-4e16-bf65-a3b884c77d69"
msgid ""
"\"You have crossed paths with the Technic League. This shall be your undoing."
"\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹과 대적하다니. 이게 네 파멸의 원인이 될것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "67134dd3-d273-4e5d-96b4-cce3131e20e3"
msgid "\"What is this Technic League?\""
msgstr "\"기술 연맹이 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "6917beae-a754-4336-ae2d-1eda652f243f"
msgid ""
"\"We can't handle this — there's too many of them. What are we going to do?\""
msgstr "\"상대하기 버겁겠는데. 적이 너무 많아. 어떻게 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "58e0842d-e7db-4ebd-9a6c-ca4167e8e25d"
msgid "Refused to forsake a companion to the Technic League."
msgstr "기술 연맹에 동료를 넘기기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "83894914-988a-43cc-9a46-26fc3443fdee"
msgid "[Attack] \"No negotiations with slavers!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"노예상과는 협상하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "949f4b50-37f5-46c2-8f0b-d03fa80b0613"
msgid "Handed a companion over to the Technic League."
msgstr "기술 연맹에 동료를 넘겨 줬습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "eab89bdb-3366-4ce0-a17c-876b58a09f11"
msgid "\"Amiri will go with you. But don't think this is over!\""
msgstr "\"아미리를 데리고 가라. 하지만 이게 끝이라고 생각하지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "b54c9446-00f8-482b-b9e4-a5381123db5b"
msgid "\"Take Harrim. But this is not our last meeting.\""
msgstr "\"하림을 데려가. 곧 다시 만나러 갈께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "298b7118-0c88-41a9-91e9-3c024ffc5e9a"
msgid "\"Linzi, go with them. We will rescue you, fear not.\""
msgstr "\"린지, 잠깐 저들과 함께 가줘. 꼭 구하러 갈테니 무서워 하지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "bc205949-bd47-4377-8eb1-d9194aed965a"
msgid "\"Valerie, you will have to be patient. We will come for you.\""
msgstr "\"발레리, 조금만 참아줘. 널 구하러 갈께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "b6262d4e-4792-4d68-900f-d6924d91b379"
msgid "\"Take Jaethal. But don't imagine you'll get far with her!\""
msgstr "\"제이탈을 데려가. 하지만 멀리 갈 생각은 하지 않는게 좋을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "5a9d8c06-67cb-46a4-95a0-519682610dc5"
msgid "\"We surrender... For now. But you'll not get away with this!\""
msgstr "\"일단 항복하지. 하지만 두고 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "8b8cce4c-de18-4268-89c1-38c92d2d5658"
msgid "\"We will fight to the end!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 끝까지 싸울 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0054_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e783538b-4796-492c-8370-284cf4d7f082"
msgid ""
"Tried to shield the companions from being captured by the Technic League, "
"appointing self instead."
msgstr "기술 연맹에게 동료 대신 자신을 데리고 가라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "a97e5dd6-4744-46c6-b826-5cdb8025acda"
msgid "\"Take me!\""
msgstr "\"날 데려가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0057_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f8edc1a0-fa51-4835-a50f-58d50a63e866"
msgid "Refused to forsake a companion to the Technic League."
msgstr "기술 연맹에 동료를 넘기기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "0f82fd98-d138-419e-9210-5c923ee65082"
msgid "[Attack] \"You sure can talk. Let's see how you fight!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너 말 참 잘하는구나? 싸움은 얼마나 잘하는지 볼까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0058_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "292a4984-8397-4a5e-b0aa-b854a468df2a"
msgid "Threatened to murder the Technic League agents horribly."
msgstr "기술 연맹원들을 끔찍하게 살해하겠다고 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "c9f977b7-a686-459f-a8b5-f4dcd8893b6f"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll make you eat your own entrails!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"직접 네 내장을 먹게 해주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : TechnoLeagueMagus
msgctxt "ee0186e0-19db-45c1-abb3-1bf6d1262ee0"
msgid ""
"{n}A group of well-armed fighters approaches. One of them raises their "
"voice, pointing at you:{/n} \"Hey you, stop right there! Kalannah, look at "
"this one! Will {mf|he|she} do?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}중무장한 전사 무리가 접근합니다. 그들 중 한 명이 당신을 가리키며 목소리를 높입니다.{/n} \"이봐, 거기 멈춰. 칼라나, 이것 "
"좀 봐! 이 녀석은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "373e07f1-ac84-4e3d-bc14-63740f89ed8a"
msgid ""
"{n}The group's leader lays her cold and watchful eyes upon you.{/n} \"This "
"one? I suppose... But I don't like {mf|his|her} snout.\""
msgstr "{n}그룹의 리더는 차갑고 경계하는 시선으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그 녀석? 음... 별론데. 코가 마음에 안들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "47a4baab-6a2f-42cf-af6c-a7ed80df38e8"
msgid ""
"{n}She studies your companions — carefully but nonchalantly, as if examining "
"goods at the market.{/n} \"Listen, you tramps! We're from the {g|Technic "
"League}Technic League{/g}. Our slave died, and we need a replacement. One of "
"you will be coming with us. The rest of you are free to go. I advise against "
"resistance — it would be a quick trick to kill every one of you. Choose now "
"the one that you will give.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 시장에서 물건을 고르는 것처럼 당신과 동료를 신중하면서도 태연하게 살핍니다.{/n} \"들어라. 우리는 {g|Technic "
"League}기술 연맹{/g}이다. 데리고 다니던 노예가 죽어서 새 노예가 필요한데, 너희 중 한 명을 데리고 갈 것이다. 나머지는 가도 "
"좋다. 저항할 생각을 하고있다면 충고 하나 하지. 너희를 죽이는건 식은 죽 먹기다. 넘길 녀석을 골라라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "ff400fa1-1905-49c5-ac79-4a37649484f6"
msgid "\"Finish {mf|him|her} off.\""
msgstr "\"어서 저 녀석을 끝내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "aa07212c-45d1-4de9-bd9f-6c068056b4ec"
msgid ""
"\"One very serious organization from {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. People with "
"whom you'd better not start a fight... And who you better not bother with "
"foolish questions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 온 강력한 단체지. 우리에게 맞서지 않는게 좋을걸. 쓸데없는 질문으로 귀찮게 하지도 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ef9c53c6-1842-4fd6-ae23-7160d8f4b6e2"
msgid ""
"\"No chains can hold me. I will go with them, break free, cut their throats "
"and return, yes? Or you can track them.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 족쇄도 나를 붙들 순 없지. 내가 가서 싹다 목을 잘라버리고 올께. 아니면 니가 구해주던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7f2f7bba-98ce-45dd-b035-b3b542f68d3f"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, {name}... I know the inevitability of death. I will sacrifice "
"myself for you, yes... Let them take me.\""
msgstr "\"내 말좀 들어보게. {name}... 나는 죽음의 필연성을 알고 있네. 나를 보내게.. 기꺼이 희생할테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "57056286-55c3-4601-bda5-de307b6fe319"
msgid ""
"\"I haven't ever been enslaved before — that would be new! Give me to them. "
"Don't worry, nothing will happen to me, I'm too lucky for that! And then you "
"can track them and set me free! What do you think of my plan?\""
msgstr ""
"\"저를 보내줘요! 한 번도 노예가 된 적은 없으니까 신선한 경험이 될 것 같아요. 괜찮을 거예요! 저는 운이 좋으니까요! 제가 "
"끌려가면, 당신이 저를 구해주는 거예요. 좋은 계획이죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2cdebb4e-4c7c-4493-9d03-89ffc9675165"
msgid ""
"\"Sacrifice me. I possess enough strength to withstand this. I know you will "
"find a way to set me free.\""
msgstr "\"제가 희생하겠습니다. 전 충분히 견딜 수 있어요. 전 당신이 절 구해낼 방법을 찾을거라고 믿습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "552153a0-3360-4ee0-a9a0-118ff7bcb2f6"
msgid ""
"\"Slavery? Hmmm. I've seen worse. Give me to these clowns — they shall "
"regret their actions when you come for me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"노예? 흠. 더 심한 경우도 겪어 봤어. 나를 저 광대 녀석들에게 넘겨. 나를 찾으러 올 때쯤엔 아마 저 녀석들은 후회하고 있을 거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "f6656832-50f8-4850-b247-8539973e5175"
msgid "\"Big mistake.\""
msgstr "\"큰 실수다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6f4da27f-6e27-4d3a-a52c-e58589cc177e"
msgid "\"I'll be back soon! And if I am not... I know you will find them!\""
msgstr "\"금방 돌아오지! 만약 내가 돌아오지 못한대도... 네가 이놈들을 찾으리라고 믿어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "db9aea5f-a18b-499f-a942-7b17df8a3a64"
msgid ""
"{n}Without even looking at you, Kalannah's henchmen clap your companion in "
"shackles and walk away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신을 보지도 않고 칼라나의 부하는 당신의 동료를 포박하고는 가버렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "27dc3a67-e34f-4d1c-957f-805ae0e27f64"
msgid ""
"\"I don't mind giving my life, yes... But I think you will somehow postpone "
"my encounter with the inevitable. This time.\""
msgstr "\"죽게된대도 상관 없지만... 아마 자네가 그렇게 놔두지 않을 것 같군. 이번에는 말일세.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "08028422-ce87-4e29-8393-c61bb69d02bf"
msgid "\"My life is in your hands. Don't let me down.\""
msgstr "\"제 목숨은 당신에게 달렸습니다. 부디 실망시키지 마시길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1db4b226-b810-4110-a610-a645967f5a07"
msgid "\"Don't worry about me! You're going to save me, right?\""
msgstr "\"너무 걱정하지 마세요! 어차피 구하러 올거잖아요. 그쵸?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0fa15b0a-49df-4aa9-9a40-72c9bd795fb0"
msgid "\"I do not say goodbye.\""
msgstr "\"작별인사는 하지 않을께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "5720b6cd-5afa-40c4-83f4-b3eddc0d11a7"
msgid ""
"\"Your time is up. Let us avoid any needless complications. Which of you "
"shall I take?\""
msgstr "\"시간 다 됐다. 불필요한 잡담은 그만 하도록 하지. 어떤 녀석을 넘길 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "3d898581-73f1-4b36-b3b9-f6b068bacfcb"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalannah casts a scornful eye on your fallen companion.{/n} \"This is "
"precisely why you should not have resisted the will of the {g|Technic League}"
"Technic League{/g}. Enough of this comedy. Hide your weapons — I shall take "
"this carrion. Pray that the rest of you will escape the same fate.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼라나는 당신의 쓰러진 동료에게 경멸적인 시선을 던집니다.{/n} \"이래서 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에 "
"대항해선 안된다는 거야. 재롱잔치는 끝났다. 무기를 내려라. 이 냄새나는 녀석은 내가 데리고 가지. 너희 나머지도 같은 운명에 처하지 "
"않게 해달라고 기도나 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "583ecb5e-5005-4786-9aef-e615359a600f"
msgid ""
"\"I can withstand this... Let them take me — and then come to my rescue.\""
msgstr "\"나는 견딜 수 있어... 일단 나를 데려가게 해. 그리고나서 날 구하러 와줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "61b37fe4-5837-40a1-be62-bbf110baf5a0"
msgid ""
"\"Let them take this frail body, while life still lingers within... Then "
"come for the remains.\""
msgstr "\"내 목숨이 다하기 전에 날 저들에게 넘기게... 나중에 시체나 찾아서 묻어주게나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5ff26c5a-f5d9-420f-b9e7-0aee3ea3d487"
msgid ""
"\"I'm fine... Ahem, almost... Best give me to them. I shall bravely await my "
"rescue!\""
msgstr "\"전 괜찮아요... 으음.. 아마두요... 저를 넘기는게 최선인거 같아요. 저 용감하게 당신을 기다리고 있을께요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "1e8e62bf-4ffa-45f1-8c69-8e125f75b2b2"
msgid ""
"\"There is no sense in all of us dying. Lay down your arms. I will go with "
"them. Return for me in force!\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두가 죽어선 안됩니다 . 일단은 항복하죠. 제가 그들과 함께 갈테니, 나중에 저를 구해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ef0fbbc0-e152-450c-9f63-fd1ff9f7d747"
msgid ""
"\"We cannot stand against them. Accept it: they have won. I shall go with "
"them. Seek me out!\""
msgstr "\"상대가 안돼. 그들이 이겼어. 내가 그들과 갈테니 나를 찾아줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "2148ae34-8297-4249-85cf-6d91362bd3e3"
msgid ""
"\"That's the spirit.\" {n}Having picked up your barely-breathing companion, "
"the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} fighters vanish.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"정신 차렸군.\" {n}간신히 숨이 붙어있는 당신의 동료를 집어들어 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 전사들은 "
"사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "e890975e-9451-4284-80ee-638b60e74a01"
msgid "\"A fatal mistake.\""
msgstr "\"치명적인 실수다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Kalannah
msgctxt "d795cda9-c17a-4aba-8c6b-88476de5076c"
msgid ""
"\"You? Hmm... No, I don't like you. I can read it in your snout — you're "
"nothing but trouble. No, choose someone else.\""
msgstr "\"너? 흠... 아니, 넌 싫어. 네 코를 보면 알 수 있지... 너는 그냥 문제 덩어리야. 다른 녀석을 선택해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/Kalannah/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "57d9908b-b8f9-4f96-989b-7a04beb768e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Your companions clench their fists with impotent rage. Their hateful "
"stares would sear Kalannah.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 동료는 분노로 주먹을 쥘 뿐이었습니다. 그들은 칼라나를 혐오스러운 눈길로 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/TechnicLeagueSE01_TechnoleagueTracks_DisplayName 1_String
msgctxt "ffed8bc0-6573-4eae-a2f9-04d58c6e2e17"
msgid "Track their footprints"
msgstr "그들의 발자국 추적"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TechnicLeagueSE01/TechnicLeagueSE01_TeleportTraces_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "2929609d-fdc5-41a3-9fd8-df10250df039"
msgid "Study any remaining traces of their teleport spell"
msgstr "텔레포트 마법의 나머지 흔적을 연구합니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/ElkFigure_String
msgctxt "9b49b14c-33e0-4a28-be48-bcfc4f8e2fe8"
msgid ""
"An ancient statue of Erastil seems to resist the ravages of time. The "
"effects of years, rain, and wind have destroyed the temple walls, but they "
"could not subdue the statue."
msgstr ""
"고대 에라스틸 조각상은 마치 세월의 풍파를 이겨낸 듯 보입니다. 오랜 시간과 비바람이 신전의 벽을 부수었지만 조각상까지 부수지는 "
"못했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Nyrissa1_String
msgctxt "3bfc8d74-c60d-4fb0-8e5f-8e8580e5bfab"
msgid ""
"\"We found the right trail! The ritual was held here. But be careful — there "
"are dangerous beasts ahead.\""
msgstr "\"제대로 온 것 같아! 의식이 여기서 열렸어. 하지만 조심해. 위험한 짐승들이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Nyrissa2_String
msgctxt "6f9302ed-97be-4cad-beac-f1daaafa1a33"
msgid ""
"\"They are both guards of this place and tokens of the druid's evil magic. "
"Please, be careful!\""
msgstr "\"드루이드가 이 신전을 지키려고 사악한 마법으로 경비병을 소환했어. 조심해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Pilgrim1_String
msgctxt "6d2792cd-e18b-426e-ac4e-26f14d875234"
msgid "\"Praised be Erastil, guardian of the old ways!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이 우리를 축복하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Pilgrim2_String
msgctxt "ec82308f-672a-496c-998d-c65f270b0811"
msgid "\"Ancient faith returned to holy walls.\""
msgstr "\"고대 신앙이 거룩한 성벽으로 돌아왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Pilgrim3_String
msgctxt "091b7570-86c7-48ae-ad63-aac290c27d4a"
msgid ""
"\"I've never seen such a huge temple of Erastil. Once we restore it, the "
"whole world will know of it!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이렇게 큰 에라스틸의 성전을 본 적이 없다. 우리가 그것을 복원해서 온 세상에 알려야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/PondCleared_String
msgctxt "76d0dc4c-00fa-472f-805d-f00516e242eb"
msgid ""
"The water is crystal clear and seems to radiate a gentle, soothing shine."
msgstr "물은 맑고 부드러운 빛을 냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/PondFogPoison_String
msgctxt "945b6593-f578-463e-b234-74bf182c5e2d"
msgid ""
"The muddy water gives off a strange, nauseating smell and emits the tattered "
"fog."
msgstr "진흙탕 물은 이상하고 구역질 나는 냄새가 나고 표면에는 연기가 자욱합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Tristian1_String
msgctxt "30468bca-de4b-444d-a2cd-c2b0d433c764"
msgid "\"Praised be Sarenrae! I am not alone! Help me, whoever you are!\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이시여, 감사합니다! 전 혼자가 아니었군요! 누구신지 모르겠지만 절 좀 도와주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Pilgrims/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ecc5fe99-c0b3-4f5c-a0f1-95025e205099"
msgid "\"Please show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Pilgrims/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6e35582a-a1e3-4293-9f02-417c77dce3d2"
msgid "\"How is the temple restoration progressing?\""
msgstr "\"성전 복원은 어떻게 진행되고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Pilgrims/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e4a685a9-e35e-45a2-a950-13458b3f485e"
msgid "\"I have no questions right now. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 질문이 없다. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Pilgrims/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "edc572b3-bb64-4246-9166-8d157f2ca618"
msgid "\"You're doing a good thing. May Erastil never abandon you.\""
msgstr "\"잘하고 있어. 에라스틸은 너를 버리지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Pilgrims/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "6b20d264-b258-42dd-9b1f-fefb999f3ba0"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a tall woman dressed in simple but rugged traveling clothes.{/n} "
"\"Greetings, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! I'm Ilga, leader of "
"these pilgrims in honor of {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}. I meet with travelers and "
"deal in the goods our small community creates. How can I be of service?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 간단하지만 견고한 여행복을 입은 키 큰 여자를 보았습니다.{/n} \"안녕. 나는 일가. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}"
"의 순례자들의 리더지. 나는 여행자를 만나 우리 마을에서 만든 제품을 거래해. 관심 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Pilgrims/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "47249c6b-fd36-49ea-9de7-6c2b0f21d9ba"
msgid ""
"\"Not quickly, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. Temples like this "
"take dozens of years to build, and I fear a full restoration won't be much "
"faster. But we're happy to be able to touch the holy shrine and do our part "
"to ensure its future greatness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간이 걸릴 거야. 이런 신전은 짓는 데에 수십년이 걸려서 완전한 복구는 더 많은 시간이 걸릴 거야. 하지만 이 위대한 작품을 "
"복원하는 데 역할을 맏는 영광을 얻는다면 기쁘겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/Pilgrims/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "da57b426-17e0-4f65-a952-540a9301c111"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! May he bless you as "
"well!\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 신께서 너에게 복을 빌어주길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a30242d6-43aa-4a95-9b54-a814af3ae5ea"
msgid "\"You're wounded. Do you need aid?\""
msgstr "\"다쳤잖아. 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ed697a58-090d-4087-bde5-f13321d7179b"
msgid "\"How did you get here?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 여기에 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5bd85896-8bc7-4413-a7f9-6502933e7cae"
msgid ""
"\"A local nymph directed me here. She thinks the enchanted fog in this "
"temple was created by the druid who serves the bandit leader here. I expect "
"defeating the beast guards should cause the fog to clear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지역의 님프가 나를 여기로 안내해 주었어. 그녀는 이곳의 도적들의 우두머리를 섬기던 드루이드가 신전에 마법의 안개를 만들었을 거라고 "
"생각해. 내 생각에 문지기 짐승을 없애면 안개는 사라질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "d2c133f9-f1f1-482d-b292-04c00fc6eac4"
msgid "\"I'll be back once I deal with the beasts. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"짐승들을 처리하고 다시 돌아올 거야. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "327f1e59-9b93-4b93-8a63-94ac86ee66f7"
msgid ""
"\"We should stick together in such a dangerous place. You could help me on "
"my journey.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 위험한 곳에서 함께해야 해. 여행 중에 나를 도운다면 좋을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "e4a503bc-d10e-4b3f-bef5-51171c825c3b"
msgid "\"The beasts are defeated. What now?\""
msgstr "\"짐승은 물리쳤어. 이제 뭘하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "a3434e3e-31da-4f88-b995-308c53d1d4a8"
msgid ""
"\"With those beasts dead, I have other matters to attend to. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"짐승들은 죽었지만 다른 문제가 생겼어. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e0be4284-4f8f-4d3e-abe2-82f85c5c46ff"
msgid "\"I would welcome your assistance.\""
msgstr "\"네가 도와준다면 환영이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "cfab4a64-652d-430d-a0e0-07e8192c5c4e"
msgid "\"I don't need your help.\""
msgstr "\"네 도움이 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "48855c37-2a5b-473e-8da2-54d7ca949925"
msgid ""
"\"The beasts have been dealt with. Are you ready to travel with me now?\""
msgstr "\"짐승들은 물리쳤어. 이제 나와 여행할 준비가 되었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a24475d8-9929-4a34-9d52-616f06a9546a"
msgid "Insisted that Tristian should repay his rescue by serving you."
msgstr "당신을 섬겨 빚을 갚아야 한다고 트리스티안에게 주장했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "f3548072-4e6c-4137-b4d7-ea268a0e3a40"
msgid "\"You owe me, priest. I expect you to repay this debt by serving me.\""
msgstr "\"너는 나에게 빚을 졌어. 사제. 날 섬겨서 빚을 갚아야할 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "d6f94210-5005-4b2e-8fdd-ac6a238537e5"
msgid ""
"\"A cleric of Sarenrae? Praised be the Everlight! We could really use her "
"help about now!\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이의 성직자? 빛의 축복이 가득하길! 이제 그녀의 도움을 받을 수 있겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "731a5986-1109-41e2-a63d-568b5557c4b1"
msgid ""
"{n}A young man wipes his hand across his brow. His face is pale and his fair "
"hair is a mess, but his gaze is steady — and grateful.{/n} \"I swear, never "
"have I been so glad to meet a stranger! Even with the power granted me by "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, I almost lost. You have my thanks. Please, allow "
"me to introduce myself. My name is Tristian.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}한 젊은이가 그의 이마를 닦습니다. 그의 얼굴은 창백하고 단정한 머리칼은 엉망이지만 그의 시선은 한결같이 정직합니다.{/n} "
"\"맹세컨데, 낯선 이를 보고 이렇게 반가웠던 적은 없었습니다! {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서 주신 힘으로도 거의 질 뻔 "
"했지요. 감사합니다. 제 이름은 트리스티안입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "35a21ecd-a69a-41e2-a368-1a9027a4f7e1"
msgid ""
"{n}A young man, severely wounded, whispers what sounds like a prayer as he "
"raises his eyes. His face is pale, but his eyes flare with determination, "
"despite his labored breathing.{/n} \"Your aid came at just the right time, "
"stranger. My name is Tristian. I'm a priest of merciful "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. Another moment, and I fear I would have been on my "
"way to her chambers — somewhat earlier than my destiny requires.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}심한 부상을 입은 청년은 눈을 들어올려 기도 같은 것을 속삭입니다. 그의 얼굴은 창백하고 호흡은 가파르지만 눈빛은 결의로 "
"불타오릅니다.{/n} \"적절한 시기에 도와주셔서 감사합니다. 저는 트리스티안이라고 합니다. 자비로우신 "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 사제지요. 당신이 아니었다면 제 운명보다 먼저 그녀에게 갔을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "a348f280-0341-470a-86ad-1aea43b59439"
msgid ""
"\"You are very kind.\" {n}Tristian looks at you thoughtfully.{/n} \"Kindness "
"to strangers is in short supply these days. But worry not — "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} priests are skilled in the healing arts. I can "
"heal myself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 친절하시군요.\" {n}트리스티안은 당신을 신중하게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"낯선 이에게 친절을 베푸는 일은 요즘 시대에 별로 "
"흔한 일이 아닙니다. 하지만 걱정하지 마십시오. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 사제는 치료에 능숙합니다. 제 스스로 치유할 수 "
"있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "c7718711-e936-41ad-a32d-1b4fbe6345d5"
msgid ""
"\"I am a priest of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, and a skilled healer. I have "
"done all I can, but it will take some time for my strength to return in "
"full. But worry not — I will make my way to the {g|Oleg's Trading Post}"
"trading post{/g} nearby and wait there as I make my recovery.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 사제이자 숙련된 치유사입니다. 가능한 조치는 모두 취했지만 제 힘이 충분히 돌아올 "
"때까지는 시간이 걸릴 겁니다. 하지만 걱정하지 마십시오. 저는 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g} 근처로 가서 "
"회복하면서 기다리고 있겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "fb4e8906-14c8-4f15-bf8d-8f3705dcc608"
msgid ""
"\"I was investigating this fog. I believe you have already discerned that it "
"is magical in nature. I serve {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, goddess of sunlight. "
"Discovering an evil magic that isolated living creatures from the sun "
"alarmed me in no small way. I was able to locate the place the fog "
"originated from, but was too presumptuous and almost got into the beasts "
"teeth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 안개를 조사하고 있었습니다. 당신께서도 이미 이 안개가 마법으로 만들어진 것이라는 걸 알고계실거라 생각합니다. 저는 빛의 여신인 "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 섬기고 있습니다. 이 사악한 마법이 태양으로부터 생명체들을 고립시키고 있다는 사실을 알고 적지 "
"않게 놀랐지요. 안개가 어디서 나오는지는 찾을 수 있었지만 주제넘게 나선 나머지 그 짐승에게 당할 뻔 했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "c32b3717-8e16-4d8f-947f-2c7a60282eba"
msgid ""
"\"I have never spoken to nymphs... but I believe your assessment is "
"accurate. The creatures occupying this temple are... far from ordinary "
"animals. The power that moved them here is related to the fog. The beasts "
"hold the fog as anchors hold a ship dancing in the waves. From what I can "
"tell, once the beasts are defeated, the fog should begin to clear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"님프와 대화해본 적은 없지만... 당신의 생각이 정확하다고 믿습니다. 이 신전을 점령하고 있는 생물들은... 평범한 동물과는 "
"다릅니다. 짐승들을 이곳으로 몰려오게 한 힘은 안개와 관련이 있습니다. 짐승들은 마치 파도 속에서 춤추는 배를 고정시켜주는 닻처럼 안개를 "
"잡고 있어요. 제가 보기에 짐승들을 물리치면 안개는 곧 사라질 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "4f39103e-537c-4aa9-9406-2c0d23baddb3"
msgid ""
"\"Praised be {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}! Now, if my knowledge serves, the fog "
"should weaken and eventually clear entirely. We need only wait...\" {n}"
"Tristian shivers slightly.{/n} \"Perhaps somewhere more hospitable?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}가 축복을 내리시길! 제 지식에 의하면, 이제 안개는 약화되고 결국에는 완전히 사라질 겁니다. "
"기다리기만 하면 됩니다... \" {n}트리스티안은 약간 떱니다.{/n} \"혹시 어딘가에 쉴 만한 곳이 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "11f9803b-c5de-4fa8-93a1-a7c80c9d189a"
msgid "{n}Tristian is waiting patiently.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 참을성있게 기다리고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "a3ae68a4-e7b3-4edd-8f92-7cdfe60a281d"
msgid "\"I will wait for you. This fog bothers me.\" {n}Tristian sighs.{/n}"
msgstr "\"당신을 기다리겠습니다. 이 안개가 저를 괴롭히는군요.\" {n}트리스티안이 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "6e8083ba-5521-49b5-b512-daf9f0a9133c"
msgid ""
"\"Please, wait! You saved my life. I have no treasures or relics, but I have "
"knowledge and the divine power of a priest. I wish to aid you in your "
"journeys.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐 기다리십시오! 당신 덕분에 목숨을 건졌습니다. 저는 유물이나 보물같은건 없지만, 사제로서의 신성력과 지식을 가지고 있습니다. "
"당신의 여정을 돕고 싶습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "1c698242-3c6c-4e2f-977c-d33873f60bda"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, my wounds won't allow me to join you right now. I will travel to the "
"{g|Oleg's Trading Post}trading post{/g}. I hope to be able to repay you for "
"my life once I recover from these wounds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아쉽게도 지금은 부상 때문에 당신과 함께 할 수 없습니다. 저는 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g}로 가 "
"있겠습니다. 상처가 회복되면 제 목숨을 구해주신 빚을 갚도록 하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "2d6b17b0-3080-4ed6-ab9a-38f9055669e8"
msgid "\"Thank you! I hope... I hope I will be of help.\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다. 제가... 제가 도움이 되었으면 좋겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "9aa1255b-9271-4ff8-9652-b9d8d688fda5"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"My heart and my faith tell me to repay "
"good with good. So just know that I will be at the {g|Oleg's Trading Post}"
"trading post{/g} — summon me, if you change your mind.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"제 마음과 신념은 선으로 보답하라고 얘기하는군요. {g|Oleg's Trading "
"Post}교역소{/g}에 있겠습니다. 마음이 바뀌면 저를 불러주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f8908d6d-d833-4e4f-864e-0e2f779cb1f8"
msgid ""
"\"A {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} fanatic! Talk about people I'd be just as happy "
"not seeing for the next thousand years...\""
msgstr "\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 광신자로군! 수천 년 동안은 저런 녀석들을 보지 않았으면 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "4007c69d-a524-42bb-84e4-3b2094763c4e"
msgid ""
"\"Not you, of course. You're probably the only one in her whole cult whose "
"brain hasn't dried in the sun.\""
msgstr "\"물론 네 얘긴 아니야. 서렌레이 신도를 통틀어 뙤약볕에 뇌가 말라버리지 않은 사람은 너뿐일 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "e56f6b76-33ca-41ce-b6e3-b0877b0c3c90"
msgid ""
"\"I promise to think about your request after you deal with the beasts. But, "
"please, allow me to catch my breath for now.\""
msgstr "\"짐승들을 퇴치하고 난 뒤에 당신의 권유를 생각해 보겠다고 약속하겠습니다. 하지만 지금은 숨 좀 돌리게 해주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "3dba8650-9a55-4a3a-8fd3-617b80235dde"
msgid ""
"\"You've saved my life and I wish to repay good with good. I will gladly aid "
"you in your journeys.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 제 목숨을 구했고, 선은 선으로서 갚고 싶습니다. 당신의 여정을 기꺼이 돕겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "a20c07b3-4fe6-4abe-97c8-049811b7c8e1"
msgid ""
"\"Let us {d|c11 Tris saved}be off{/d}! We will accomplish much good "
"together, I'm sure of it.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 {d|c11 Tris saved}함께{/d} 많은 좋은 일들을 행할 겁니다! 확신합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "f3b24f85-bd63-4c9f-8b7d-e6e91184b3c9"
msgid "\"That is... a fair enough demand, I suppose.\""
msgstr "\"그건... 충분히 공정한 요구인 듯 하군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/TempleOfTheElk/TristianTOE_Dialod/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "b7568548-e195-4a21-943f-59f59a5636b9"
msgid ""
"\"I am glad to hear it. The goddess sent me here to help those in need.\""
msgstr "\"그 말을 들으니 기뻐. 여신이 나를 여기로 보내 돕게 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0efc3ff4-77de-4c96-a59a-483b849da978"
msgid "\"And just what do you want to talk about?\""
msgstr "\"무엇에 대해 이야기하고 싶다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "81cef7ef-0970-4117-a190-ce104a5710bd"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't talk to bandits. Fight!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 도적과 이야기하지 않는다. 싸우자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "362fe58c-9507-4110-894b-d838c6cd5b44"
msgid ""
"Tried to persuade Akiros and Kressle to leave the Stag Lord's service and "
"make peace with you."
msgstr "아키로스와 크레슬을 설득하여 수사슴 군주를 떠나고 당신과 화해를 하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "e1fc38bb-16c0-40a5-aade-879e838414ec"
msgid ""
"\"Why not turn that around? No matter what you say, Akiros, the Stag Lord's "
"not some ordinary ruler of an ordinary country. He can barely control his "
"gang. And neither can you, or you wouldn't be arguing with Kressle in the "
"middle of the woods. You both seem like reasonable people who simply chose "
"the wrong leader. Leave him or help me find his fortress, and we can part in "
"peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수사슴 군주를 포기하는 게 어때? 네가 뭐라 하든 수사슴 군주는 평범한 나라의 평범한 군주는 아니야. 그는 자신의 부하를 통제하지 "
"않지. 너도 그건 불가능하고 크레슬과는 숲 속에서 말싸움하려고도 하지 않을 거야. 너희 둘은 합리적이니 누가 그릇된 지도자인지 알겠지. "
"그를 떠나고 내가 그의 요새를 찾게 도와줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7607d41d-1170-462e-b8a8-f1835b4c7b40"
msgid ""
"Told Akiros that peace with the Stag lord is not an option — not while "
"settlers of Stoten Lands suffer because of bandits raids."
msgstr "수사슴 군주와의 평화는 선택이 아니라고 아키로스에게 말합니다. 도적 습격으로 고통 받는 도둑맞은 땅의 정착민을 위해서라도요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "68e4b8a8-03d6-4a48-920c-87e2f6fb4bf3"
msgid ""
"\"Unfortunately, there can be no peace between me and the Stag Lord. I've "
"seen too much — I won't allow him to keep robbing the settlers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불행히도 나와 수사슴 군주 사이에는 평화가 있을 수 없다. 그가 정착민을 도둑질하는 모습을 너무나 많이 보았고 앞으로는 용납하지 않을 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5c6ae901-6266-4229-bcbb-17d0ba92992b"
msgid "Claimed that you'll get your barony at any price."
msgstr "무슨 수를 써서라도 당신의 남작령을 얻을 것이라고 주장합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "86cbc03a-da58-4dc2-844c-4181c3f71c8a"
msgid ""
"\"Restov promised me a barony for the Stag Lord's head, Akiros — and I "
"intend to collect it at any cost, even a bloody one.\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주의 머리를 가져오면 남작령을 주겠다는 레스토프의 제안을 받았어. 무슨 수를 써서라도 그 놈의 목을 벨 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f8f37ffe-24c1-4895-9f92-5c8ea831bfa6"
msgid ""
"Told Akiros that you are not picking any side in swordlords and bandits "
"conflict, but will follow your own goals."
msgstr "소드로드나 도적단 어느 편도 들지 않고 자신만의 목표를 추구하겠다고 아키로스에게 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "210b6f4b-a2b2-4ce2-ac7b-2f23bb53115d"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not here to take sides. But if you don't want bloodshed, I'm willing "
"to talk.\""
msgstr "\"나는 편가르려고 온 것이 아니야. 유혈사태를 원하지 않는다면 나는 대화로 풀 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "44f660b9-ac1a-4ac6-90c2-bbb9a40062f1"
msgid "Avoided bloodshed and left bandit leader Kressle alive."
msgstr "유혈사태를 피하고 도적 두목인 크레슬을 살려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "9b9eead5-0e06-4c92-a93e-2f313d4833e7"
msgid ""
"\"Easy, now. I'm not here to blanket the Stolen Lands with corpses — lower "
"your weapon, and let's talk. I won't kill anyone who leaves the Stag Lord's "
"service or is willing to help me find him. So think about it — is he really "
"a leader you're ready to die for?\""
msgstr ""
"\"진정해. 나는 도둑맞은 땅을 시체로 뒤덮으려 온 게 아니야. 무기를 거두고 대화하자. 나는 수사슴 군주를 떠나거나 그를 찾는걸 "
"도와주는 사람은 누구도 죽이지 않겠다. 생각해봐. 수사슴 군주가 정말 목숨을 바칠만한 지도자인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "3d72697c-3927-4e18-b799-fa8ac69cf952"
msgid ""
"\"I'm looking for the Stag Lord's fortress. Perhaps you'd be willing to "
"help... for a small reward?\""
msgstr "\"나는 수사슴 군주의 요새를 찾고 있어. 아마 네가 나를 도울 수 있을 텐데... 보상이 조금 있거든?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "00b43e63-67b0-47c2-aa02-93d5353bd45b"
msgid "Told Kressle that you showed mercy to her upon Svetlana's request."
msgstr "스베틀라나의 요청으로 그녀에게 자비를 보여주었다고 크레슬에게 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "2ff8af57-bf59-4681-a383-2c07e60de8ef"
msgid "\"Svetlana asked me to show you mercy. I don't know why.\""
msgstr "\"스베틀라나는 너에게 자비를 보여달라고 부탁했다. 왜 그런지 모르겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3bf84fca-9c56-42b1-b037-14a4718d6ba8"
msgid ""
"Told Kressle that you showed mercy to her because you don't want any "
"unnecessary violence."
msgstr "당신이 불필요한 폭력을 원치 않기 때문에 그녀에게 자비를 베풀었다고 크레슬에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "ff2d654a-ca2e-4d17-810b-5fc307be0721"
msgid ""
"\"Is it so hard to believe I simply might not want unnecessary bloodshed?\""
msgstr "\"불필요한 유혈 사태를 원치 않는다고 믿는 것이 그렇게 어렵나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "96880c69-dbaa-4790-ae37-b45639009fd3"
msgid "Told Kressle that your motives for letting her alive do not matter."
msgstr "그녀를 살려두는 것이 중요한 것은 아니라고 크레슬에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "5dba0f96-107a-4745-ad6e-c577edadceaf"
msgid "\"My motives are my own. Just accept that I don't want you dead.\""
msgstr "\"나의 동기는 내 자신의 것이다. 그저 네가 죽기를 원하지 않는다는 것을 받아들여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fbb0013f-3d03-4d0a-8e9a-cd898336167f"
msgid ""
"Told Kressle that your left her alive not of mercy, but with cold "
"calculation."
msgstr "그녀를 살려두는 것은 자비 때문이 아니라 냉정한 판단의 결과라고 크레슬에게 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "9371c1cf-51fd-4544-b82a-0badfd04a15a"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't kindness — it's good judgment. Your death doesn't help me in "
"any way.\""
msgstr "\"친절이라고 생각하지 마. 그저 판단일 뿐이다. 네 죽음은 나에게 도움이 되지 않으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "427e8bdc-ef59-489a-b4e0-126c6be2bee6"
msgid ""
"\"All I'm interested in talking about is the location of the Stag Lord's "
"fortress.\""
msgstr "\"내가 관심이 있는 것은 수사슴의 요새가 있는 곳 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "e4b1e754-c758-4290-b22a-4b57dae363b6"
msgid ""
"\"You can tell me everything you know about the Stag Lord and where he's "
"hiding, or you can die.\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주에 대해 모든 것을 말해. 그가 어디있는지도. 아니면 너는 죽어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "564e9683-a0ba-4634-a353-8ed51f379289"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm not here to talk. Fight and die.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"할 말 없다. 싸우다 죽을 준비나 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0048_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bc7e2417-8ee8-4712-94f8-e864a75cd804"
msgid "Told Akiros that you will stop the Stag Lord and the evil he commits."
msgstr "수사슴 군주를 막고 그의 악행을 저지할 거라고 아키로스에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "23b9ea55-d2a7-42f5-9488-7e7e4eecaa08"
msgid "\"I shall stop the Stag Lord and the evil he commits!\""
msgstr "\"나는 수사슴 군주와 그의 악행을 막을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "d73888a0-df2d-4995-abe2-31e413de8989"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a tall, broad-shouldered man with prematurely gray hair and a "
"decisive face. Everything about him — his stance, his gestures, his "
"intonations — radiates confidence.{/n} \"I'm not here to listen to your "
"complaints or your crazy plans, {d|Kressle}Kressle{/d}. We cannot fight "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g} — leave Jamandi's messenger alone and follow your "
"orders. You probably haven't even burned down that old house the Stag Lord "
"seems to hate so much.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}키가 크고 우람한 어깨를 가진 회색 머리의 사내가 결의에 찬 표정으로 다가옵니다. 사내의 자세, 몸짓, 억양, 말투가 자신감에 "
"차있습니다.{/n} \"네 생각 따윈 관심 없다, {d|Kressle} 크레슬 {/d}. 난 네가 징징거리는 꼬락서니나 보러 온 게 "
"아니란 말이다. 우린 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}와 싸울 수 없어. 자만디의 전령은 내버려 두고 네 명령이나 따라. 내 생각에, "
"당초 수사슴 군주의 명령이었던 오래된 집도 불태우지 않은 것 같은데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "822251af-6c49-4a79-ab35-fb360e235e71"
msgid ""
"\"Is the Stag Lord just going to hide in the fog forever?!\" {n}Kressle "
"hisses angrily.{/n} \"If we don't show them our strength, they'll think this "
"land belongs to them! When are we going to do something worthwhile, "
"something more than just stealing from these spineless hogs?\" {n}She stops "
"as she notices you.{/n} \"Damn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"수사슴 군주는 그저 안개 속으로 영원히 숨어들 거야?!\" {n}크레슬은 화가 나 씩씩거립니다.{/n} \"그에게 우리의 힘을 "
"보여주지 않으면 이 땅이 자신의 것이라고 생각할 거야! 이 등골 없는 돼지들을 도둑질을 언제까지 해야 가치있는 일을 하는 거야?\" {n}"
"그녀는 당신을 보자 멈춥니다.{/n} \"젠장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "0f0d782d-44f4-4344-9d6b-635e34f5c7a4"
msgid ""
"{n}The man turns to you calmly.{/n} \"Ah, you must be the guests from "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g}. Well, I always have preferred to solve things face-to-"
"face. I am Akiros Insmort, the Stag Lord's right hand. We should talk.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 남자는 침착하게 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"너는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 손님이 틀림 없군. 나는 항상 얼굴을 맞대고 "
"해결하고 싶어했지. 나는 아키로스 인스모트. 수사슴 군주의 오른팔이다. 우리는 대화가 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "c4b3a8ff-6e74-4fd4-8003-ddf8a9c24de3"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sure you've heard many stories of the Stag Lord and his people. You "
"probably think we're flesh-eating madmen. We're nothing of the sort, I "
"assure you. We essentially want the same as those who sent you — ownership "
"of this land and the right to take payment from those who live and work "
"here. {g|Stolen Lands}The Stolen Lands{/g} aren't part of "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, despite what anyone may think — my commander has as "
"much right to this land as Jamandi Aldori.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수사슴 군주와 그의 부하에 대해 많이 들었겠지. 우리가 날고기를 뜯는 미치광이라고 생각한 건가. 우리는 그런 자들이 아니다. 내가 "
"보증하지. 우리는 너를 보낸 녀석들과 같은 걸 원할 뿐이다. 이 땅의 주권을 가지고 여기에서 일하며 사는 사람들에게 자릿세를 받는 "
"것이지. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 일부가 아니다. 누구는 그렇게 생각할지도 "
"모르겠지만 우리의 지휘관은 자만디 알도리 만큼이나 이 곳에 권리가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "c02214e6-3af2-45b5-950c-6704e9a39f8b"
msgid ""
"\"I personally forbade Kressle's people from harming the owners of the {g|"
"Oleg's Trading Post}trading post{/g}. They paid on time and worked dutifully "
"— at least until you showed up and disturbed things. But despite that, does "
"this really need to end in violence? {g|Restov}Restov{/g} is too far away to "
"be able to effectively control these lands, and I don't want to lose any of "
"my people. So, please — leave the Stag Lord be, and leave in peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 개인적으로 크레슬의 녀석들이 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g}를 괴롭히는 것을 막아왔다. 그들은 네가 "
"모습을 나타나 훼방을 놓기 전 까지는 제 시간에 돈을 지불하고 부지런히 일했거든. 하지만 정말 폭력으로 끝을 봐야겠어? "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}는 이 땅을 효과적으로 통제하기에는 너무 멀고 나는 내 부하들을 잃고 싶지 않다. 부탁이니 평화롭게 "
"수사슴 군주를 내버려두어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "e7c9b84b-b794-4402-9962-7d29420dd659"
msgid ""
"{n}Something in your words seems to have impressed Kressle. She frowns for a "
"moment, then spits.{/n} \"Fine. I won't cut your throat — for now, at least. "
"But I also won't kneel to some {g|Restov}Restov{/g} upstart! Why would you "
"try to make peace? Are you just naturally kind? Or have you been listening "
"to Svetlana?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 말 속의 무언가가 크레슬에게 깊은 인상을 준 것 같습니다. 그녀는 잠시 찡그리고는 뱉어내듯 말합니다.{/n} \"좋아. 네 "
"목을 자르지 않겠어. 적어도 지금은. 하지만 나는 건방진 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 놈에게 무릎을 꿇지 않을 거야. 왜 너는 "
"평화를 이루려고 하지? 그것이 네 본성인가? 아니면 스베틀라나의 부탁을 들어서인 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "2f6e373e-3c37-4c04-9c24-26c5917f9783"
msgid ""
"{n}Akiros smiles.{/n} \"A valiant effort, but no. Just your charm and the "
"ghost of the ferocious Jamandi won't be enough to make me turn traitor. "
"Farewell! And please, think on my words.\" {n}He turns and leaves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아키로스는 웃습니다.{/n} \"노력은 가상하지만 싫다. 너의 매력과 자만디의 사나운 유령이 나를 반역자로 만들기에는 충분치 않아. "
"그럼 잘가라! 그리고 내 제안을 생각해 봐.\" {n}그는 돌아서서 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "2c0393db-dc1e-4742-a752-2dd5e7527f4e"
msgid ""
"\"A pity.\" {n}Akiros takes a quick step back.{/n} \"I'm sorry, but I'm "
"afraid I can't keep you company in this skirmish. The Stag Lord is waiting "
"for me.\" {n}He retreats to the road.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"불쌍하군.\" {n}Akiros는 신속히 한걸음 물러섭니다.{/n} \"미안해. 하지만 너를 이 교전에서 지킬 수는 없어. 수사슴 "
"군주가 나를 기다리고 있어.\" {n}그는 길을 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "fe2021e6-90a7-4cce-874a-1e5e397a33ce"
msgid "\"Let's cover him, everyone! To arms!\""
msgstr "\"그를 보호해라! 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "9cf8b6a8-cc5e-4792-8412-89b9d43b97e3"
msgid "\"One dog seeks to take a bone from another? I see...\""
msgstr "\"다른 개에게서 뼈다귀를 뺏으려는 것인가? 좋아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "ee09c14f-968c-4148-b5bb-5c3c7bfb417c"
msgid ""
"{n}Kressle's handaxe swishes through the air.{/n} \"Enough talk! You won't "
"make it to the Stag Lord, {g|Restov}Restov{/g} bootlicker!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}크레슬의 손도끼가 허공을 가릅니다.{/n} \"대화는 충분하다! 너는 수사슴 군주에게 갈 수 없을 것이다. "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 졸개야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "04a3af02-6de1-4697-a440-9fd2be32438f"
msgid ""
"\"Just what we needed... Kressle, stand down! Well, you'll do whatever you "
"wish, but know that I won't be helping you!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 필요로 했던 것은... 크레슬. 엎드려! 네가 무얼 하든 상관 없지만 내가 돕지 않을 거라는 건 알아둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "2ae81b00-ddf6-487e-bfe9-c9b7823a5f3e"
msgid ""
"\"Neutrality is not long-lived in {g|Stolen Lands}the Stolen Lands{/g}...\""
msgstr "\"{g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 중립은 오래 가지 않는군... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "fb809164-dca2-4805-94bb-35a5897b9a6f"
msgid "\"Noble intentions. How familiar...\""
msgstr "\"의도는 고귀하군. 익숙하구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "d60b442a-49c9-472d-9e7e-6d831e376081"
msgid ""
"{n}The dark-haired bandit is kicking the ground irritably. When she sees "
"you, she squares her shoulders and clenches her handaxes.{/n} \"Well, look "
"{d|Kressle}who's{/d} here!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}검은 머리의 산적이 짜증스럽게 땅을 찹니다. 당신을 보자 그녀는 어깨를 펴고 손도끼를 쥡니다.{/n} \"이런, 이게 "
"{d|Kressle}누구신가{/d}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_AkirosIsmort
msgctxt "f4c255f7-0b98-48d3-929f-9b7e0c85cc38"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt you'll get what you want from any of us. Those who would talk "
"don't know, and those who know won't talk — not even if you tortured us. So "
"perhaps I can convince you to hear me out?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 우리에게서 무얼 원하는지 모르겠군. 얘기를 하려는 자는 모를 것이고 얘기를 하지 않으려는 자는 알 것이다. 궂이 우리를 고문하지 "
"않더라도. 내 이야기를 들을 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "d8e9f83e-bc8f-4f67-a109-ee979397a80f"
msgid ""
"{n}Kressle frowns, then looks away.{/n} \"Mercy, huh? Haven't heard that in "
"{g|Stolen Lands}the Stolen Lands{/g} for a long time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}크레슬은 찡그리며 다른 곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"하, 자비를 베풀라고? {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 그런 "
"말은 못들은지 꽤 됐는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "8537ec7e-6b38-4437-852e-cdf5276c5b58"
msgid ""
"\"All right, here's my piece. The Stag Lord's been spending more time "
"keeping an eye on the bottom of his glass than on what's going on around "
"him. If he won't answer an insult from some {g|Restov}Restov{/g} crook like "
"Jamandi, then you're right — we chose the wrong leader. So go ahead, do "
"whatever you're gonna do. I won't stop you, but I won't help you, either. "
"And here... give this to Svetlana.\" {n}The bandit places a ring in your "
"hand, then leaves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 내가 아는 것을 말하지. 요즘 수사슴 군주는 주위에서 일어나고 있는 일 대신 술잔 바닥 쳐다보는데나 몰두하고 있지. 그가 "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 자만디와 같은 사기꾼에게 받은 모욕을 되갚지 않는다면, 그때는 네 말이 맞는거지. 우리가 잘못된 "
"군주를 고른 거야. 그러니 가봐. 네가 하려던 일을 해라. 나는 너를 막지는 않겠지만 돕지도 않을거야. 그리고 여기... 이걸 "
"스베틀라나에게 줘.\" {n}도적은 당신의 손에 반지를 놓고 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "746d2b06-f411-4ac5-a29f-b7051629a503"
msgid ""
"\"Y'know, life hasn't been so good to me,\" {n}Kressle replies, sullen.{/n} "
"\"Why should I trust you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"있지. 내 인생이 그렇게 쉽지만은 않더라.\" {n}크레슬이 부루퉁하게 대답했습니다.{/n} \"왜 내가 너를 믿어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "607389ef-999a-441c-ae69-d2c2e4e913e5"
msgid "\"Bah! Fine. Let's see where your 'judgment' takes you.\""
msgstr "\"하. 좋아. 네 판단의 결과가 어떤지 보자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "c17fca41-de61-42e7-874d-34c00fe2315b"
msgid ""
"\"Fine. Whatever, clam. Either way, you won't make it long in {g|Stolen "
"Lands}the Stolen Lands{/g} without getting blood on your hands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 어느 쪽이든 손에 피를 묻히지 않는 한 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 오래 머물 순 없을 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0042_Text 1_String
#. Speaker : TRC_Kressle
msgctxt "fd266f44-0915-4f9b-b6b0-31230f3f428e"
msgid ""
"\"You really think I serve him for the money?\" {n}Kressle smirks "
"bitterly.{/n} \"Enough talk. Die!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 고작 돈 때문에 그를 따르는 것 같아?\" {n}크레슬은 쓴웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"이제 대화는 끝이다. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0043_Text_String
msgctxt "4fe4c63f-bee7-47ee-8dbe-7482b0b25149"
msgid ""
"\"That so? If anyone's gonna be pushing up daisies, it won't be me!\" {n}"
"Kressle sets her stance and attacks.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그래? 무덤 속에 누울 사람이 있다면 그게 나는 아닐거다!\" {n}크레슬은 자세를 취하고 공격합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "102e0347-8578-4310-8c48-feff008e5305"
msgid ""
"\"Who would hope to find honor among thieves? It will be a pleasure to cross "
"blades with you!\""
msgstr "\"그 누가 도적들 중에 명예로운 자가 있을거라 기대하겠습니까? 그런 자와 칼을 겨뤄볼 수 있어 기쁠 따름입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/AkirosAndKressle/Cue_0050_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "da292c0a-e10e-44a8-93ae-330bb2086c4a"
msgid "\"That's right! This is how we deal with the Stag Lord's bandits!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 이것이 수사슴 군주 도적들의 대화 방식이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Barks/Cart_String
msgctxt "a5ad31da-e9ce-4eb4-8e25-473fd61069c5"
msgid "A sturdy cart with weapon marks along the sides."
msgstr "측면에 무기 자국이 있는 튼튼한 수레입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Barks/Lumber_String
msgctxt "54b55c4d-6276-42ed-b4dc-acb5b3709198"
msgid ""
"Timber. The bandits were probably planning to build defensive walls here."
msgstr "목재입니다. 도둑들은 방어벽을 건설할 계획이었을 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Barks/PileBoosePoisoned_String
msgctxt "a6562e05-1174-4115-bd7c-913cfaa080eb"
msgid "A cache of poisoned wine, intended for the Stag Lord."
msgstr "수사슴 군주를 위한 독이 든 와인 바구니입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Barks/PileBooseSmashed_String
msgctxt "8403f1d9-bf92-421e-8e4f-5421e97a5ed2"
msgid ""
"The bandits' belongings and some broken bottles of the Stag Lord's wine."
msgstr "도둑의 소지품과 수사슴 군주의 깨진 와인병입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Barks/PileIfBooseTaken_String
msgctxt "77335476-a034-4805-94a1-443f4d2057f3"
msgid "An empty cache."
msgstr "빈 바구니."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Barks/PileIfCheckFailed_String
msgctxt "b331acf2-79eb-48b2-84d3-c48faaf308d4"
msgid "A pile of clothes, blankets, and other things belonging to the bandits."
msgstr "옷 더미, 담요 등 도둑의 소지품입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Barks/Watchtower_String
msgctxt "70948522-5334-49b6-8abf-76539e90ff89"
msgid ""
"A watchtower. The bandits seem to have planned to seriously secure the area."
msgstr "망루입니다. 도둑들은 이 지역을 삼엄하게 지킬 계획이었던 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/BooseDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "78669126-c4f6-4b25-a2a6-ee290b9d9f19"
msgid "[Search the belongings for information or valuables]"
msgstr "[쓸만한 정보가 있나 소지품을 뒤집니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/BooseDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "2c42ad3a-bca4-4caf-ba89-9c5de14e7db4"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/BooseDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "41d7aab3-e4a7-490c-9cd9-9dddb55e35f3"
msgid "[Take the wine]"
msgstr "[와인을 챙긴다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/BooseDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "509bcfe8-a90a-4184-b146-e2021401d5d2"
msgid "[Poison the wine]"
msgstr "[와인에 독을 탄다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/BooseDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "6dda8ae7-ba13-4609-9f44-9ed3f2730da0"
msgid "[Break the jars and spill the wine]"
msgstr "[병을 깨고 와인을 버린다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/BooseDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "55985113-e2ca-444a-b467-cec523dd5323"
msgid "{n}The bandits' belongings are piled together in a messy heap.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}도적의 소지품은 쓰레기 더미 위에 함께 쌓여 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/BooseDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "d47d221c-3432-4965-b05f-eabc2f2af94d"
msgid ""
"{n}You find a cache under all the clothes and blankets. Opening the lid of a "
"small hollow, you find a box full of bottles. An inscription on the side "
"reads:{/n} \"Wine for the Stag Lord. Don't you dare steal it, fools! I'll "
"make sure you rot!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옷과 담요 아래에 바구니가 있습니다. 작은 구멍의 뚜껑을 열었고 당신은 병이 가득한 상자를 발견할 수 있습니다. 옆에 비문이 "
"적혀있습니다.{/n} \"수사슴 군주의 와인. 몰래 마시지 말아라. 멍청이들아! 감옥에서 썩게 만들어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/BooseDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "558e648f-d8a9-45ed-beb6-9e72ec5a7bb0"
msgid "{n}You find nothing of interest.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}관심이 갈만한 것은 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Items/StagLordBooze_Description_String
msgctxt "851b5585-a3e8-418e-9bfc-c95bc91cc603"
msgid "Bottles with wine that were supposed to be delivered to the Stag Lord."
msgstr "수사슴 군주에게 배달 될 예정이었던 와인 병."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Items/StagLordBooze_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "fbc597e0-6f4e-41f2-9f05-8755e2717ef8"
msgid "The Stag Lord's Wine"
msgstr "수사슴 군주의 와인"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Items/StagLordOrder_Text_String
msgctxt "214eff7d-8c73-4fae-8b07-7b24bf4e26ca"
msgid ""
"\"Kressle, a task. As soon as you're done with the taxes, find an old hut in "
"the woods upstream of the Thorn River — and burn it to the ground. This is "
"the Stag Lord's wish. He literally said, 'Burn! Burn!'\n"
"It was originally going to be Dovan, but he grew upset when he learned "
"nobody lived in the hut. Said burning houses with no one in them was "
"'boring.' So I said I'd send someone more reliable. It's a strange task, but "
"try to finish it quickly. And no asking 'What the-?!' or 'Why bother with "
"this trifle instead of preparing for war with Restov?!' We'll get to that.\n"
"A.\""
msgstr ""
"\"크레슬, 임무다. 세금을 걷고 나서 가시 강의 상류 숲에 있는 오래된 오두막을 찾아라. 그리고 불태워라. 이것은 수사슴 군주의 "
"뜻이다. 정확히는 '태워라! 태워버려!'라고 말하셨다.\n"
"원래 도반에게 시켰었지만 오두막에 아무도 살지 않는다는 말을 듣고는 성질을 내더군. 아무도 없는데 집을 태우는 것은 '따분'하다면서. "
"그래서 나는 더 신뢰할 수 있는 사람을 보내겠다고 말했다. 이상한 임무지만 되도록 빨리 끝내라. 그리고 '이게 뭔?!'이나 '레스토프와의 "
"전쟁 때문에 바쁜데 무슨 짓이냐?!'라고 묻지 마라. 나중에 얘기하자.\n"
"A.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Items/StagLordOrder_name_String
msgctxt "4e7bc132-7e14-4ff0-b19e-583350bca621"
msgid "Written Orders"
msgstr "명령장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Items/SvetlanaWeddingRing_Description_String
msgctxt "81c395ac-f23e-4eee-a812-1d6fe5228196"
msgid "A ring with the name \"Svetlana Leveton\" engraved inside the band."
msgstr "안 쪽에 스베틀라나 레베튼이라고 이름이 새겨진 반지입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/Items/SvetlanaWeddingRing_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "7f2dd4e3-8e2b-4e63-832c-67001a6bc258"
msgid "Svetlana's Wedding Ring"
msgstr "스베틀라나의 결혼 반지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "1cb2483c-ba4a-48fe-b650-33db99cfcd7b"
msgid "\"How did you come to be in these lands, Jhod?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 이 땅에 왔지. 조드?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "720e8682-980d-4721-8352-01ed4f78bcf7"
msgid "\"And where is this temple?\""
msgstr "\"신전은 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "19d0121c-317e-4fa7-b9c3-44c18b4d9c58"
msgid "Released Jhod in exchange for future reward."
msgstr "미래 보상에 대한 대가로 Jhod를 풀어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5aa5872a-7f40-4819-8e83-6f2682cc3a89"
msgid ""
"[Conditionally Release Jhod] \"I hope you won't forget to reward your "
"rescuer, old man!\""
msgstr "[조건부로 풀어준다] \"도와준 사람에게 보상하는 것을 잊지 않기를 바래. 영감!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0222b972-c591-49da-8a99-0bd13710aeb9"
msgid "Released Jhod selflessly."
msgstr "사심없이 조드를 풀어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "582e6385-0a80-477f-acd9-d6108a2c63a3"
msgid "[Release Jhod] \"I'm glad I could help.\""
msgstr "[풀어준다] \"도와줄 수 있어서 다행이네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ded4dcd9-99ea-47f9-b872-a13b5d8e1b83"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a dark-haired man of about forty-five, though the wrinkles on his "
"face make him look sixty at first sight. He's currently a prisoner, judging "
"from his tied hands. He slouches a bit, squinting shortsightedly at the "
"light as he moves his lips as though speaking to someone invisible. He jerks "
"his head up as he notices you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}검은 머리 때문에 45세 정도로 보이지만 얼굴에 주름이 생겨 첫인상이 환갑은 되어보이는 듯한 남자를 보았습니다. 포박된 손으로 "
"판단하건데 그는 죄수입니다. 그는 눈에 보이지 않는 사람과 이야기하는 것처럼 그의 입술을 움직이면서 햇빛을 보며 찡그립니다. 당신을 "
"알아차리자 그는 머리를 들어 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "4e78b97c-617a-4e75-adfd-9f68b9e9d31a"
msgid ""
"\"Praise {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, someone finally chased off those "
"scoundrels! Thank you, stranger. My name is Jhod Kavken. I'm a priest of "
"Erastil, from {g|Galt}Galt{/g}. Those bandits attacked me as I was crossing "
"the river, said they wanted to take me to their leader, make me heal their "
"wounds. Not a chance! The strength granted me by Erastil is meant to help "
"honest people, not robbers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 축복하셨구나. 누군가 마침내 그 악당들을 쫓아냈어! 고마워. 내 이름은 조드 카브켄이다. 나는 "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g}의 에라스틸 사제야. 저 도둑들은 내가 강을 건널 때 나를 공격했고 그들의 지도자에게 데려가 상처를 치유하도록 "
"시키겠다고 말했어. 절대 안되지! 에라스틸이 나에게 부여한 힘은 도둑이 아닌 정직한 사람들을 돕기 위한 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "704d4d12-0c5f-4562-93b7-f498450d2122"
msgid ""
"\"I was led here by visions, sent by the {g|Erastil}Elk God{/g},\" {n}Jhod "
"says with veneration.{/n} \"Erastil showed me that somewhere in this wild "
"land lies the Temple of the Elk — an ancient shrine, forlorn and desecrated. "
"I saw the ruins of the temple, and the shadows of a predator lurking in "
"sorcerous fog. I felt the echoes of the vicious rituals performed at the "
"once blessed place. I have no doubt — Erastil revealed all this to me so I "
"could stop the ungodly sorcery that's desecrating the temple!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 여기에 {g|Erastil} 수사슴 신{/g}이 보낸 비전에 이끌려 왔어.\" {n}조드는 경외심으로 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"에라스틸은 나에게 이 야생의 땅 어딘가에 버려진 엘크의 고대 신전이 있을 거라고 말했지. 나는 신전의 폐허를 보았고 마법의 안개 속에 "
"숨어있는 괴물의 그림자를 보았어. 나는 그 축복받은 장소에서 사악한 의식이 이루어진 것을 느꼈어. 의심의 여지가 없었지. 에라스틸은 이 "
"모든 것을 나에게 계시하여 신전을 모독하는 불경한 마법을 막게 하려는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "2237b569-0335-46f7-b46f-606d830be888"
msgid ""
"\"That I don't know. Visions, even divine ones, are often vague and "
"unreliable. I know only that the temple is somewhere near, in the "
"{g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}. But I'm afraid I won't be able to find it "
"myself, what with bandits lurking around every corner in this place...\" {n}"
"Jhod shakes his head sadly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그건 잘 모르겠네. 신성한 환상일지라도 종종 흐릿하고 불분명하지. 나는 그저 신전이 {g|Narlmarches} 날마치{/g} 주위에 "
"있다는 것만 알아. 도적이 주위를 서성이는데 그걸 찾을 수 있을지는 모르겠어.\" {n}조드는 머리를 슬프게 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "41f11c79-929a-4ac5-9706-cc4082ce5cd9"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod mutters a bit, rubbing his hands.{/n} \"Oh, these times — to be as "
"surprised to meet an honest {mf||wo}man as to see a manticore at a vegetable "
"stall! Thank you for your help. I've exhausted my supply of prayers, but "
"I'll gladly repay you in the future, once I've restored my strength. Come to "
"me if you ever need to be healed or blessed.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 손을 비비면서 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"오. 이런 때에 만나게 되어 놀랍군. 채소 가게에 만티코어가 들어가는 것 만큼이나 "
"희박한 확률이야. 도와줘서 고맙네. 나는 기도를 다 써버렸지만 힘을 되찾으면 나중에 빚을 갚고 싶어. 치료나 축복이 필요하면 찾아오게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "4e375028-32ef-4211-a4f2-28969afeacb1"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod shakes his head in disapproval.{/n} \"You think me some ingrate? I "
"may have exhausted my supply of prayers, but I'll be ready to heal you or "
"bless you once I've recovered my strength.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 동의하지 않는다는 뜻으로 고개를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"내가 도움이 된다고 생각해? 지금은 기도를 다 써버렸지만 내 힘을 "
"되찾으면 너를 치유하거나 축복할 수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/JhodTRC/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "0072a5d7-bfb1-4cc3-b364-00d4bed1670f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid an old fool like me won't be able to handle the mission given "
"me by {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} on my own. How can I search for the temple when "
"the bandits around here won't let me take a single step? I'll head to {g|"
"Oleg's Trading Post}Oleg Leveton's Trading Post{/g} to rest and think on "
"what to do next. Please, traveler, if you happen to discover the ruins of "
"the Temple of the Elk, come inform old Jhod! My gratitude will know no "
"bounds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나와 같은 멍청한 노인네가 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 내린 임무를 감당할 수 있을지 모르겠네. 도적이 돌아다녀 한발짝도 "
"내딛을 수 없는 판국에 어떻게 신전을 찾을 수 있겠어? 나는 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g}로 가서 무엇을 할지 "
"생각해 봐야겠네. 부탁인데 엘크의 신전 폐혀를 발견하면 나에게도 알려주게나. 너무나 고마울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "a2329238-d773-4b16-800e-f346b29a89fa"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a0ef9d43-d3b3-4728-be3f-314b7dd5059e"
msgid "\"What do you want from me?\""
msgstr "\"나한테 원하는 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c0828b8f-3e23-449d-a305-8075ff7bbc2b"
msgid "\"The Stag Lord is responsible for the fog?\""
msgstr "\"이 안개가 수사슴 군주 때문인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "da5d7205-362f-4731-8ccb-1bfa563bc1df"
msgid "\"How can I help you?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "bc5ebd6c-3308-4d7d-80a1-1d3b85add2ce"
msgid "\"All right, I understand. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 알겠다. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "564f8367-3601-440c-aba0-f178806020e0"
msgid "\"Begone, spirit! I've had enough of you.\""
msgstr "\"썩 물러가라 귀신아! 너라면 이제 지긋지긋하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "80cfc573-e90e-4ad1-b82a-acd2a49da871"
msgid "\"All right, speak up.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 말해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "0a8c493b-ddb0-42c8-9078-5d44443c330e"
msgid "\"I'll handle it on my own. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"나 혼자서 하겠어. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "9dce8c02-b7c7-4e65-a28d-cb78c8a2dacc"
msgid "\"I'm glad my adventure begins with such a beautiful sight…\""
msgstr "\"나의 모험이 이런 아름다운 광경으로 시작하게 되어 기쁘다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "0f3d25ed-3ef6-491e-8012-c3ccf5077c57"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-transparent outline of a beautiful nymph appears before you. "
"Even in this ghostly form, it's clear that she's exhausted. Her shoulders "
"are slouched, and her large blue eyes burn within her pale face.{/n} \"Hear "
"me... Please, hear me... Can you hear me? Please...!\" {n}Her voice is "
"barely more than a whisper as she reaches toward you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아름다운 님프의 모습이 반 쯤 투명하게 나타납니다. 흐릿한 형태라도 그녀는 지쳤음에 분명합니다. 그녀의 어깨는 쳐졌고 창백한 얼굴의 "
"커다란 푸른 눈은 불타오릅니다.{/n} \"내 말을 들어줘... 제발... 내 말이 들려? 부탁이야!\" {n}당신에게 손을 뻗는 그녀의 "
"목소리는 간신히 속삭이는 것처럼 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "08314409-986f-4aaa-b7d6-8b66452c85dc"
msgid ""
"\"Who am I? Just a tear, shed by the land itself. The bitter sigh of "
"nature... I am a nymph, the guardian of this area. A defeated guardian! Call "
"me the 'Guardian of the Bloom' if you wish.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 누구냐고? 나는 그저 이 땅이 흘린 눈물이야. 자연의 눈물이지... 나는 이 지역의 수호자인 님프야. 하지만 패배했어. 원한다면 "
"나를 꽃의 수호자라고 불러.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "c2118092-41cd-4bea-b0f3-d996a1140e44"
msgid ""
"\"Aid. Salvation. We have a common enemy, and long have I searched for "
"someone who can defeat him. The one you call the Stag Lord... As a storm "
"strikes ruthlessly with gusts and lightning, the Stag Lord wreaks havoc with "
"the swords of his servants. And not just in the world of people! The land "
"also suffers from the evil he brings. My forests and my flowers suffocate in "
"this fog. Soon, even I will vanish, as the last ray of light fades at dusk..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"구원. 도움. 우리는 공통의 적을 가지고 있고 나는 그를 물리칠 수 있는 자를 찾아왔어. 그 자는 수사슴 군주... 폭풍이 돌풍과 "
"번개를 무자비하게 내리칠 때 수사슴 군주는 부하들로 사람들을 괴롭혔어. 하지만 사람들 뿐만이 아니야. 그가 몰고 온 악령들로 이 땅은 "
"고통받았어. 내 숲과 꽃은 안개로 질식했지. 황혼 속에서 마지막 햇빛이 사라질 때 나는 사라질 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b90de9e7-349f-42ca-9dfd-f9a92ab7a572"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. It hides his fortress, as well as his dark deeds. But while "
"responsible, he did not create this affliction. It is the work of a powerful "
"druid, who has betrayed even himself. I know not why the powers did not "
"leave this renegade, but even I was unable to defeat him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아. 안개가 요새와 그가 저지른 사악한 짓을 숨기고 있어. 하지만 그는 안개를 만들고 내버려두었어. 강력한 드루이드가 만든 것이지만 "
"창조자도 안개에게 배반을 당했어. 왜 이런 악당이 안개를 거두지 못하는지는 모르지만 나는 그를 이길 수 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "0f575913-1ba0-40b6-9d5a-f02dc9fb070c"
msgid ""
"\"This fog... It enshrouds, entangles, suffocates... If only I could learn "
"how it was created! But my powers wane. I have barely the strength to call "
"out to you. All I know for certain is that somewhere in this forest lies an "
"old house, and it echoes with the remnants of a strange power. The Stag Lord "
"and his druid were there. The fog hides this place from me, but I can point "
"you to the bandits' camp near the Thorn Ford. Make them tell you where this "
"place is. Go there, and listen to the echo. Catch the whispers, search for "
"anything that can tell you how the fog was created. Once the fog clears, "
"nature will breathe again, and you will be able to easily find your way to "
"the fortress of our mutual enemy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 것을 뒤덮고 얽어매며 질식시키는 이 안개... 만약 이 안개가 어떻게 만들어졌는지 알 수만 있다면! 하지만 내 힘은 이미 약해져 "
"말할 힘만 겨우 남았어. 내가 확실히 아는 것은 이 숲속에 오래된 집이 있으며 그것이 이상한 힘의 잔재와 함께 공명하고있고, 수사슴 "
"군주와 그 그 사제가 거기에 있었다는 거야. 하지만 안개가 이 장소를 숨기고 있어. 우선 '가시 여울' 근처의 도적 야영지로 가서 그 "
"장소가 어디에 있는지 알아내고 그곳에 가서 메아리를 들어봐. 메아리 속에 안개가 어떻게 만들어졌는지 알 수 있는 단서가 있는지 모두 "
"수색해야 해. 안개가 사라지면 자연은 다시 숨을 쉴 수 있어. 그러면 너도 적이 숨어있는 요새를 쉽게 찾을 수 있을 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "540bd916-28f9-417d-a7ce-dff11a7b36ac"
msgid ""
"\"I don't believe in fate, stranger, but our meeting seems more than a "
"coincidence!\" {n}The nymph's whisper fades as she disappears.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 운명을 믿지 않아. 하지만 우리의 만남은 우연 그 이상인것 같아!\" {n}님프의 속삭임은 그녀가 사라지면서 함께 "
"사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "f94146c9-d78b-42e8-b4e0-47753a5d43c3"
msgid ""
"\"No, please! This fog melts my power like snow under the bright rays of the "
"sun in spring. I know not if I will have the strength to call to you "
"again... We have a common enemy. Help me, and I can help you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니야. 이 안개 때문에 내 힘이 봄 햇살을 쬐는 눈처럼 녹고 있어. 너를 다시 부를 수 있는 힘이 있는지는 모르겠지만... 우리는 "
"같은 적이 있어. 도와줘. 그러면 나도 도와줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "47feca38-93b8-4ff4-973d-8719216764d6"
msgid ""
"\"Just know that somewhere in the forest lies an old house. In it is the key "
"to the mystery of the fog and the secrets of the Stag Lord, your enemy. The "
"bandits in the camp near the Thorn Ford may know the way. It matters not "
"whether you want to help me — the answer lies there. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"숲의 어딘가에 오래된 집이 있다는 것을 알아둬. 그것이 안개와 수사슴 군주의 비밀에 대한 열쇠가 될 거야. 가시 포드 근처의 야영지에 "
"있는 도적들이 길을 알 거야. 나를 도와주지 않아도 상관 없지만 답은 그곳에 있어. 그럼 이만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "d83c0b2b-4658-4f03-8bd8-67b41575986d"
msgid "{n}It seems that only you can see or hear the nymph.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}오직 당신만이 님프를 보거나 들을 수 있는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "4a65262d-574d-4aa0-a5b5-b79d23801a1d"
msgid ""
"{n}You wake up from a nasty dream that tortured you almost all night long. "
"In it you saw a wall of unnaturally thick fog that surrounded you, slowly "
"moving closer and closer. A quick look out of the window — and you find out "
"that the fog was not a figment of your imagination, not a dream. And "
"then…{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 밤새 당신을 괴롭게하는 불쾌한 꿈에서 깨어났습니다. 꿈 속에서 당신은 자신을 둘러싼 자욱한 안개를 보았습니다. 안개는 천천히 "
"당신에게 다가갑니다. 창 밖을 보니 당신은 안개가 꿈이나 상상 속에서 만들어진 것이 아님을 깨닫습니다. 그리고...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c11/Thorn river camp/NyrissaGhost/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "d5752b83-7589-4e6a-baa3-b23232b848d4"
msgid ""
"{n}Sparks light up and fade in the nymph's huge eyes.{/n} \"Beauty is so "
"tender… it can so easily be crushed under the blows of cruel fate. But you "
"can save it from being undone...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 커다란 눈에서 빛이 나타나더니 사라집니다.{/n} \"아름다움은 부드러워... 가혹한 운명 앞에서는 부서지고 말지. 하지만 "
"네가 구할 수 있을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/Barks/DoorBark_String
msgctxt "510dee32-33fd-4960-bb3b-9d7815bba13d"
msgid ""
"The castle's sagging gate scrapes angrily across the stone floor. It hasn't "
"been used for a long time."
msgstr "성문이 천천히 열리자 돌바닥을 긁는 마찰음이 들립니다. 오랫동안 사용되지 않았음이 분명합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/Barks/TreeBarkAlone_String
msgctxt "bee4503c-89d0-4d2e-ad53-5a26db26bf8a"
msgid "The tree rustles its leaves, as if to whisper \"Hello\"."
msgstr "나무가 흔들리며 잎이 살랑거리는데 귓속말로 인사를 하는 것만 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/Barks/TreeBarkNotAlone_String
msgctxt "18b4ea2d-6edb-4faf-b1e2-192824d7fc94"
msgid ""
"The tree meets you with a welcome rustle, but the nymph does not appear, "
"perhaps because you failed to come alone."
msgstr "나무는 반갑다는 듯이 살랑거리며 당신을 맞습니다. 하지만 님프는 혼자 오지 못했기 때문에 사라지지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "41f0d016-d2fb-4c2e-a3fe-72649e46e112"
msgid ""
"Told the treacherous nymph that attacking a person who saved her is "
"dishonorable."
msgstr "은인을 공격하는 님프를 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "abc83cce-baeb-493d-b2d1-5b0c6d334148"
msgid "\"I helped you! There is no honor in attacking me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 도왔다! 나를 공격하다니 명예를 모르는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d7b105de-189f-4eb1-a854-870d35b66175"
msgid "Tried to reach an agreement with the treacherous nymph."
msgstr "당신을 배신한 님프와 계약을 맺으려고 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5b87967c-0f14-45ee-8189-444a3a2926c2"
msgid ""
"\"I cannot guess why you'd wish to feed me to a pack of monsters, but I'm "
"sure we can come to an understanding.\""
msgstr "\"왜 나를 괴물 무리에게 넘겨주고 싶지는 모르겠지만 오해를 풀 수 있을 것이라고 확신한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e4aa5b88-42ed-4c17-a1f2-eab2b362d3b0"
msgid "Met news of nymph's betrayal with a touch of irony."
msgstr "아이러니하게도 님프가 배신했다는 소식을 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "33d06fbb-5cc6-4a35-a868-69ba98123682"
msgid ""
"\"What a surprise — a lonely meeting in an isolated place, and it turns out "
"to be an ambush. At least tell me why you want me dead.\""
msgstr "\"놀랍군. 고립된 곳에서 단 둘이 만나는 것이 아니라 매복이었다니. 적어도 네가 왜 나를 죽이려고 하는지 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f16cb3ee-db9f-41db-bf5c-6949e0b003ed"
msgid "\"You will regret this betrayal!\""
msgstr "\"후회할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "df3f969f-4b13-4fc4-98b7-2ec0f73162f2"
msgid ""
"\"Was there a single word of truth in anything you told me earlier? Or was "
"every single sound a lie, and that dreamy nymph I struggled to help — a mere "
"mask?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이전에 나에게 말한 것에 진실이 하나라도 있었어? 아니면 계속 거짓말을 했던 님프를 내가 도왔던 거야? 숲을 사랑하던 님프의 모습은 "
"가면인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : AbandonedKeepNyrissa
msgctxt "392ea203-127b-4269-9633-400708380e5e"
msgid ""
"{n}The familiar outline of the nymph appears among the monsters. The smell "
"of blooming spring meadows still wafts about her, and the wind ripples "
"through her hair, but now an unkind smile masks her face.{/n} \"Oh, you did "
"come. And alone, just as I asked. Do you not know, my loyal hound, that the "
"brightest flowers are also the most poisonous?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 익숙한 모습이 괴물들 사이에서 나타납니다. 봄의 초원을 떠올리는 냄새가 여전히 그녀에게서 났고 바람이 여전히 그녀의 머리칼을 "
"날렸지만 그녀의 얼굴에는 낯선 미소가 나타납니다.{/n} \"오. 부탁한 대로 혼자 와주었구나. 내 충성스러운 사냥개야. 가장 아름다운 "
"꽃이 가장 무서운 독을 품고 있다는것은 모르고 있었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : AbandonedKeepNyrissa
msgctxt "940fe492-7e84-4528-8ddb-2bd3f891587e"
msgid ""
"\"Don't blame me, blame the coronet given you by the Aldori. If it weren't "
"for that...\" {n}The nymph grows still, seemingly listening to the rustling "
"of the leaves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나를 비난하지 마. 알도리에게 받은 너의 작위를 탓해. 만약 그렇지 않았다면...\" {n}님프의 말소리는 여전히 나뭇잎이 살랑이는 "
"것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : AbandonedKeepNyrissa
msgctxt "5d8b672c-fa62-4987-8f13-7a95f51ab129"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, if it were so easy... but the vanquished can only accept the fate "
"prepared them by the victor. Do you not know this?\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 쉬웠다면... 정복당한자의 운명은 승리자에게 달려있지. 이것도 모르고 있었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : AbandonedKeepNyrissa
msgctxt "05a2f1e6-70c9-4974-901e-e67c60bdf547"
msgid ""
"\"Even if I wanted to tell you, you wouldn't understand. And if you could "
"understand, I certainly wouldn't tell.\" {n}The nymph looks away "
"absentmindedly, but then turns to you again, her eyes blazing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너에게 말했더라도 너는 이해할 수 없었을 것이다. 만약 네가 이해할 수 있었다면 나는 말하지 않았을 것이다.\" {n}님프는 "
"공허하게 다른 곳을 보았지만 당신을 보자 다시 눈이 불타오릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : AbandonedKeepNyrissa
msgctxt "7b18f790-e52c-4287-9f2b-7b66a0f57bb1"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph smiles almost tenderly.{/n} \"I've seen so many like you — "
"newly crowned masters of castles built of sand, blind to the coming tide. "
"How quickly it will all be washed away! Die. Or run, if you can. But your "
"rule of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} has come to an end!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 부드럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"너와 같은 자는 많이 봐왔어. 모래로 지어진 성에서 왕관을 쓰고 파도가 오는 것조차 모르지. "
"어찌나 그렇게 빠르게 멸망하던지! 죽어라. 아니면 도망가. 하지만 도둑맞은 땅에서의 네 역할은 이제 끝이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : AbandonedKeepNyrissa
msgctxt "9565eddf-7ff3-4013-b083-94a466f28fb7"
msgid ""
"\"How many times have I seen countries and kingdoms arise from the dust — "
"only to fall into dust once more. Thus will it be with your barony, for what "
"is a barony without its baron{mf||ess}? This is how it must be. The {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} will remain no one's. Die or run, there is "
"nothing you can change!\""
msgstr ""
"\"국가와 왕국이 몇 번이나 생겨났다가 사라지는 것을 보았는지. 그리고 네 영지도 그렇게 되는데 남작 없는 남작령이 무슨 소용이겠어? "
"이제 그렇게 될 거야. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 누구의 것도 아니게 될 거야. 죽던지 도망쳐. 이것 말고는 네가 "
"할 수 있는 것은 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AbandonedKeepOutdoor/NyrissaAmbushDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : AbandonedKeepNyrissa
msgctxt "bdd9515f-6401-46e9-a73c-21e51338be41"
msgid ""
"\"A mask? A lie? No, no... Like a snake, wrapped in its own sloughed skin, "
"I've shown you something that is long gone. But I remember! I remember who I "
"was, I remember who I wanted to become...\" {n}The nymph stops talking, "
"distracted by the rustling of leaves. Then she raises her eyes to you, and "
"her gaze full of sudden anger.{/n} \"Why am I telling you all this? You are "
"nothing. Just another step on the ladder I must climb. You will perish, like "
"so many before you, and I'll forget you by the next dawn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"가면? 거짓말? 아니야. 그저 뱀처럼 허물을 벗은 것이다. 나는 너에게 오래 전에 사라진 것을 보여줬을 뿐이야. 하지만 기억해! 나는 "
"내가 누군지 내가 무엇이 되고 싶었는지 기억해...\" {n}님프가 말을 멈추자 살랑거리는 나뭇잎 소리가 사라진 것 같습니다. 그녀는 "
"눈을 들어 갑작스러운 분노로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"왜 내가 너에게 이런 것을 말하는 거야? 너는 아무것도 아니야. 그저 내가 딛을 "
"또 하나의 사다리 발판일 뿐이야. 너는 이전의 인간들처럼 사라질 것이고 다음 날이면 너를 잊을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AngryFeyAttack/Barks/AngryFeyBark1_String
msgctxt "f9a6b398-88b7-4524-bd66-a50d7473f69f"
msgid "\"Here you are, defiler!\""
msgstr "\"여기 있었군. 모독자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AngryFeyAttack/Barks/AngryFeyBark2_String
msgctxt "c75108ab-2de6-4203-9195-4f34f8c4345a"
msgid "\"You should've listened to us back then!\""
msgstr "\"그때 우리 말을 들었어야 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_11023_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "8e0ca18b-c819-46d1-abbd-e9cc54e8e233"
msgid "Tried to mug the traveling merchant."
msgstr "행상인을 강탈하려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_11023_Text
msgctxt "8805f4ae-a7f1-445b-ad4a-179203fe5643"
msgid "\"Excellent. Now, we'll take everything you're carrying as payment.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 이제 우리는 네가 팔려는 물건들을 모두 가져갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_18426_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "70cc0e78-d87f-4a6b-8d11-55308bb0cf6c"
msgid "Respected the traveling merchant's choice."
msgstr "행상인의 선택을 존중했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_18426_Text
msgctxt "0c3db880-fa6d-4dde-8253-923cc591e298"
msgid "\"I will respect your wishes.\""
msgstr "\"네 선택을 존중한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_20123_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3ef585d0-7499-45f0-ad0e-4c0abf985320"
msgid "Peacefully offered the traveling merchant to trade in your barony."
msgstr "당신의 영지에서 거래하도록 행상인에게 평화롭게 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_20123_Text
msgctxt "c6ac1cf7-37cb-46e2-917e-4ff9698c7c7c"
msgid ""
"\"The roads are unsafe. I would suggest you go no further than the capital, "
"and wait until the roads can be garrisoned properly — there's still plenty "
"of trade to be had elsewhere in the region.\""
msgstr ""
"\"길가는 안전하지 못하다. 길의 치안이 제대로 갖춰질 때까지는 수도 안에서 거래하기를 바란다. 수도 안에서는 많은 거래가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_21697_Text
msgctxt "76920b26-e63a-4e5b-b8bc-1a013e671289"
msgid ""
"\"I can see you're an experienced trader. Would you consider operating "
"exclusively in my barony?\""
msgstr "\"네가 경험 많은 상인이라는 것을 알 수 있다. 내 영지에서만 장사할 생각은 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_28608_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7c1312dc-58f9-4879-b36a-fb1fb947024b"
msgid "Coerced the traveling merchant to trade in your barony."
msgstr "당신의 영지에서 장사하라고 행상인에게 강요했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_28608_Text
msgctxt "784e2752-7a7d-44ea-aa32-2dc80262b5ce"
msgid ""
"\"You're right, these roads are dangerous. Trolls are the least of your "
"concerns — if you were to leave the barony, you might be killed on the road "
"by a random traveler — even one such as myself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 말이 맞아. 길가는 위험하다. 가장 덜 위험한 것이 트롤이지. 남작령을 떠난다면 너는 낯선 여행자에게서 죽을 수도 있고. 그 "
"여행자가 나일 수도 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_31870_Text
msgctxt "c25ff239-f0db-42b1-8125-ba5f9aa1f4d6"
msgid "\"You're from Mivon, you say? What is their view on this new barony?\""
msgstr "\"너는 미본 출신이야. 그렇지? 새로운 영지에 대한 감상이 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_32949_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "825c794e-ed18-45ab-8332-991b6c5b2eae"
msgid "Concealed your title from the traveling trader."
msgstr "행상인에게는 당신의 정체를 숨깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_32949_Text
msgctxt "7f2638da-3671-41f1-b43c-76fe2377fbf3"
msgid "\"We... are simple travelers from Brevoy.\""
msgstr "\"우리는... 브레보이에서 온 단순한 여행자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_34274_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fd091777-d602-40b4-8bc6-7dfabd896e16"
msgid "Stated your title to the traveling trader."
msgstr "행상인에게 당신의 정체를 밝힙니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_34274_Text
msgctxt "d76e153f-c962-4e84-9fa8-8815b04442d7"
msgid "\"Actually, I rule these lands.\""
msgstr "\"사실 나는 이 땅을 지배한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_47724_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6ca91b50-5bde-4b6a-9a02-c6ed3c22c986"
msgid "Told a mean joke to the traveling merchant."
msgstr "행상인에게 비열한 농담을 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_47724_Text
msgctxt "1d6a6c42-8592-4217-912d-d620ccbe8526"
msgid "\"Don't trouble yourself — I spoke in jest.\""
msgstr "\"하늘 나라로 가고 싶지 않겠지? 농담이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_88350_Text
msgctxt "652281a2-d5cf-450a-a521-614750182f77"
msgid "\"Good fortune to you and safe travels.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 행운이 따르고 안전한 여행이 되길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_97545_Text
msgctxt "fad99f2a-63e0-4715-bd9a-323329e5a8cf"
msgid "\"Any other dangers on the road?\""
msgstr "\"도로의 다른 위험 요소가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99762_Text
msgctxt "dfdb7d94-b251-4b30-b751-e256b1986eba"
msgid "Tell me more about this mage."
msgstr "이 마법사에 대해 더 자세히 말해봐."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99771_Text
msgctxt "566c787c-8b2d-4ec2-9d57-5462221efc56"
msgid ""
"\"You're terribly sweet when you blush. I should make you do it more often.\""
msgstr "\"얼굴이 붉어질 때 너는 정말 달콤해. 붉어진 얼굴 자주 보고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99772_Text
msgctxt "a210c57c-fb8c-4143-8981-4359f611a830"
msgid "\"No doubt.\""
msgstr "\"틀림 없이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99773_Text
msgctxt "31f3e776-9a3f-43ea-93d2-03e0379a07d3"
msgid "\"Just close your mouth.\""
msgstr "\"입 다물어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99780_Text
msgctxt "df124840-9712-440b-9748-c45b960c119b"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, I appreciate your help, but would you please stop robbing people "
"while I'm trying to talk to them?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 네 도움은 고맙지만 내가 사람들과 이야기하려고 하는 동안에는 사람들을 강탈하지 말아주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99781_Text
msgctxt "2fbba2ce-9af4-4d57-a5b0-d5999fd4baa5"
msgid "\"You heard him, Dalton. Turn out your pockets.\""
msgstr "\"들었잖아. 달튼. 가지고 있는 것을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99782_Text
msgctxt "9f62cc77-3548-45b9-9ec2-803485d8d3fb"
msgid ""
"\"Shut up and don't interrupt me. I'm the one negotiating here, not you, got "
"it?\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐. 나를 방해하지 마라. 내가 여기서 협상하는 사람이지. 네가 아니야. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99786_Text
msgctxt "c755d401-1458-417b-af62-50140a584005"
msgid "\"Octavia's right, Reg. Leave him be.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아 말이 맞아. 그를 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99795_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a2944b5f-7ede-4753-90e1-bd2c322f425a"
msgid "Stated your title to the traveling trader and accepted his criticism."
msgstr "여행 상인에게 당신의 정체를 말하고 그의 비판을 받아 들였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Answer_99795_Text
msgctxt "9b943e0c-239b-4390-9983-0f8cd41a82f1"
msgid ""
"\"I'm the baron{mf||ess} of these lands. Your words are fair — I'll do what "
"I can to make the roads safer.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이땅의 남작이다. 네 말이 일리가 있어. 나는 도로를 더 안전하게 만들 수 있는 일을 하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Barks/AttackedTrader_Tree_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "b58d8f22-8c10-4dbe-942d-282442df99ee"
msgid "A fallen tree is barring the wagon's way."
msgstr "쓰러진 나무가 마차의 길을 막고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Barks/AttackedTrader_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "1ac079bd-b3ec-4463-91f7-49aa0a54fd7b"
msgid "\"Trolls! Trolls attacking! Help!\""
msgstr "\"트롤이다! 트롤이 공격했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Barks/TraderAcidFlask_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "331115c1-f14c-4f37-8f62-2da809ead803"
msgid "\"Fire won't harm them? What the hell? Better try acid!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 불을 무서워하지 않아? 도대체 뭐야? 그럼 산성 용액을 뿌려야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Barks/TraderGuardBark_String
msgctxt "913b5ea3-e786-46ad-9b4c-f470543f9d84"
msgid "\"Thanks for saving us!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 구해줘 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_01970_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "467a52df-84f3-4d60-aeda-24ede734ccab"
msgid ""
"\"I…\" {n}Dalton frowns.{/n} \"Don't get me wrong, Your Grace, but I've "
"family in {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, so my road always must take me there. No "
"matter how dangerous the journey.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는…\" {n}달튼은 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"오해하지 마. 나는 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에 가족이 있어서 항상 이 "
"길을 지나다녀야 해. 여행이 위험하더라도 상관 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_06753_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "25ec3f96-eb04-442c-aafe-505fd667c154"
msgid ""
"\"Have you renounced your sense? The title was supposed to remain secret.\""
msgstr "\"지금 제정신이야? 정체를 밝히면 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_11147_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a0b2e667-095c-4536-b40c-7ebabec3a356"
msgid "{n}Amiri grins.{/n} \"I've never fought a hodag. Yet.\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 웃습니다.{/n} \"나는 호닥과는 싸워 본 적이 없어. 아직은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_21128_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "3164927c-2fa8-4082-9f5c-0e5405c49d64"
msgid ""
"{n}Dalton is checking his cart after the troll attack and looks about ready "
"to leave.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}Dalton은 트롤이 공격한 후 그의 짐을 확인하고 떠날 준비를 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_24777_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "a4fac878-de80-429e-bcaf-88b15d6556b7"
msgid ""
"\"Damned trolls. Almost died from the stink alone...\" {n}The half-elf wipes "
"the sweat from his brow.{/n} \"They almost had me. Since when are trolls not "
"afraid of fire? Good thing you had some acid on you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저주받은 트롤들. 냄새 때문에 죽겠군.\" {n}하프엘프는 이마에서 땀을 닦아냅니다.{/n} \"거의 잡힐 뻔했어. 언제부터 트롤이 "
"불을 두려워하지 않았지? 네게 산성 마법이 있어서 다행이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_29700_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "16be4a73-3e21-4c7c-bcdb-6602a41a299f"
msgid ""
"{n}Dalton looks shocked.{/n} \"Oh, I beg your forgiveness, Your Grace.\" {n}"
"Dalton bows politely.{/n} \"But these trolls... they're a threat to everyone."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}돌턴은 충격을 받은 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"오. 미안해.\" {n}달튼은 정중하게 인사합니다.{/n} \"하지만 이 "
"트롤들은... 모두에게 위협이 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_32253_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "19a496ed-6264-42d0-90b0-9d50c42f7924"
msgid ""
"\"Why are we robbing this poor man — on the roads of our own barony, no "
"less? Have we become bandits now?\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리는 이 불쌍한 자를 강탈하고 있는 것일까? 우리 영지 안에서 말이야? 우리 이제 도적이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_32915_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "710b6b5b-40eb-44ef-9f48-1dab3cda926c"
msgid ""
"{n}Dalton freezes and is silent for a moment. Then he nods slowly.{/n} \"Well"
", if you put the question like that... perhaps remaining in this land for "
"now is best — for everyone.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}돌턴은 얼어 붙어 잠시 침묵합니다. 그런 다음 그는 천천히 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"글쎄 그런 질문을 한다면... 아마도 이 땅에 "
"남아있는 것이 모두를 위해 최선이겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_34911_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "61e1d9b5-1156-41de-8ca8-dd1eca23da8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Dalton seems oblivious.{/n} \"I'm not afraid, I've been walking these "
"rods a long time. I'm not afraid of trolls, bandits...\" {n}He locks gazes "
"with you for a moment.{/n} \"Or anything worse.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Dalton은 불확실한 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"나는 두렵지 않아. 나는 이 길을 오랫동안 다녔어. 나는 트롤이나 도둑을 "
"두려워하지 않는다...\" {n}그는 잠시 동안 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"아니면 더 나쁜 것이 나타나더라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_42243_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "08be7a24-0438-40a1-a48c-225ee5295e60"
msgid ""
"\"Hold a moment… I didn't have a chance to reward you for your help. "
"Fortunes are best shared, after all. Safe travels.\""
msgstr "\"잠시만 기다려줘. 도움에 대해 보상할 기회가 없었다. 돈을 좀 나눠줄게. 안전한 여행이 되길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_53104_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "4f221dc1-0178-4db9-aaa3-92f8e3ab22d8"
msgid ""
"\"In that case I recommend you to make haste to the nearest garrison… if you "
"can find one. The roads are thick with trolls.\""
msgstr "\"그럴 경우 가장 가까운 수비대로 가... 찾을 수 있다면 말이지. 길은 트롤로 넘쳐나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_54497_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ad7c3095-bbea-4e2b-bd82-667e1d57a078"
msgid ""
"\"What? You are the {mf|baron|baroness} of these lands.\" {n}Tristian "
"frowns.{/n} \"Have you renounced your throne?\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구? 이 땅의 남작이었군. \" {n}트리스티안이 찡그립니다.{/n} \"왕위를 포기한 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_55715_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "88af1781-e02d-4fa0-b39c-b5dd3cc5e290"
msgid ""
"\"Oh. Oh. I am unused to lies, they are just wrong. But yes, I knew it was a "
"secret, we all did — yes?\""
msgstr "\"나는 거짓말을 하지 않았지만 그들은 틀렸어. 하지만 맞아. 이것은 비밀이었지. 우리 모두 그렇게 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_56222_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "2ca007b3-f6d9-4d8f-b071-3ca23360f907"
msgid ""
"\"Long ago, {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} was founded by the "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}, who refused to bow before the new ruler and "
"fled {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}. While not Brevans anymore, our people and the "
"people here have a lot in common, as I've heard the barony here was founded "
"by people from {g|Restov}Restov{/g}. We look upon them as distant cousins, I "
"suppose.\" {n}Dalton smiles.{/n} \"Welcome cousins, that is, not family "
"you'd rather forget.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래 전 {g|Mivon} 미본{/g}은 새로운 통치자를 섬기기를 거부하고 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}로 도망갔던 "
"{g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}에 의해 세워졌지. 여기가 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에서 온 사람들이 세운 영지라고 "
"들었는데 우리는 브레보이 사람이 아니지만 그들과 많은 공통점이 있어. 우리는 그들을 먼 친척으로 보는 셈이야.\" {n}달튼이 "
"웃습니다.{/n} \"어서 와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_71758_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "d8aeffd9-c258-4772-a879-91c2863969d4"
msgid ""
"\"If Your Grace is willing to resolve the matter, I know a mage living "
"nearby. I visit him from time to time to sell him reagents for his spells. "
"He's an expert on trolls — might know why they've suddenly become bolder. "
"And fire proof.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 문제를 해결하고 싶다면 내가 이 주변에 사는 마법사를 알아. 나는 가끔 그가 마법을 위해 시약이 필요할 때 물건을 팔러 가고는 "
"해. 그는 트롤에 대한 전문가야. 아마 왜 그들이 갑자기 더 대담해졌는지 알 거야. 그리고 화염 저항력이 생긴 것도. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_79876_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "1cbad9e5-6f15-4a04-a0b3-4a3763e5ccd1"
msgid ""
"\"They've attacked several villages, destroyed several bridges, and are "
"scaring away trade caravans. Worse than bandits, by far.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 여러 마을을 공격하고 다리를 파괴했으며 무역 캐러밴을 강탈했어. 도적보다 나쁜 녀석들이야. 훨씬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_84059_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "ef34ae77-06ea-4854-8d33-64e88fbfe11c"
msgid ""
"{n}Dalton frowns.{/n} \"If things are that bad… well, then, perhaps I shall "
"conduct my business here for a time. Very well.\""
msgstr "{n}달튼이 찡그립니다.{/n} \"상황이 그렇게 나쁘다면... 음, 그럼, 아마 여기서 당분간 사업을 해야겠어. 좋아\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_84786_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "44594246-3f6e-4cdb-b428-38bf9aeb0b38"
msgid ""
"\"Have you renounced your sense? The title was supposed to remain secret.\""
msgstr "\"지금 제정신이야? 정체를 밝히면 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_86799_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "2103d364-5409-4bd6-baf3-0f0fc8aeacf3"
msgid "{n}Dalton nods, but remains tense, watching you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}Dalton은 고개를 끄덕였지만 긴장한 채로 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_89001_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "263e6f91-4ce3-4dd2-a0a6-e68d8d130b33"
msgid "{n}Dalton nods.{/n} \"Thank you, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "{n}달튼은 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_92149_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "bce0b755-f26c-4edc-b567-8752499e0c41"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your timely rescue, friends!\" {n}Despite his confident gaze "
"his voice trembles slightly.{/n} \"A few moments more, and I would've...\" "
"{n}He frowns.{/n} \"Whoever rules this land gives little care to its safety. "
"Formerly safe trade roads are given over to trolls, and not a guard to be "
"seen… but where are my manners. I am Dalton, from {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g}, a "
"merchant by trade. Who're you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"적절한 시간에 맞춰 구해줘 고마워!\" {n}자신있는 시선에도 불구하고 그의 목소리는 약간 떨립니다.{/n} \"조금만 늦었더라도 "
"나는...\" {n}그는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이 땅을 지배하는 녀석들은 안보에 신경을 쓰지 않아. 한 때 무역로였던 곳이 트롤에게 "
"넘어갔는데 경비는 한명도 보이질 않아... 오. 내 정신 좀 보게. 나는 달튼이야. {g|Mivon}미본{/g}에서 온 무역 상인이지. "
"너는 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_92784_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "a5e1c893-ddd7-456c-bad1-3f9fc7e630f3"
msgid ""
"\"Trolls aren't enough, huh?\" {n}Dalton laughs, then frowns.{/n} \"Actually"
", I have heard a disturbing rumor… it's said a hodag has made a lair in a "
"cave south of here. Whether true or not, traders are taking no chances, "
"taking forest routes instead. Let me mark the cave on your map.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤로 충분하지 않아?\" {n}달튼은 웃으며 찡그립니다.{/n} \"실제로 나는 혼란스러운 소문을 들었어... 여기에 남쪽 어딘가 "
"동굴에 호닥이 숨어 있다고 하는군. 사실이든 아니든 상인들은 선택의 여지 없이 숲길로 가야 해. 내가 지도에 동굴을 표시해줄게. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_94854_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "52222653-8180-48d8-b628-26fc7e9f21cb"
msgid "\"Do you speak in jest? There is no honor in acts such as these.\""
msgstr "\"농담이지? 이런 행동은 명예롭지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_95179_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "9b28659f-b9cf-4069-b275-d8ee42a43ea4"
msgid ""
"\"To think I was planning to reward you!\" {n}Dalton scoffs.{/n} \"I've just "
"fought off a band of trolls…\" {n}He gauges you in disgust.{/n} \"You won't "
"be much of a fight, I promise you. My advice — leave now, while you still "
"can.\""
msgstr ""
"\" 너에게 보상할 생각이었어!\" {n}달튼 코웃음 칩니다.{/n} \"나는 방금 트롤 무리와 싸웠는데...\" {n}그는 당신을 "
"혐오스럽게 훑습니다.{/n} \"너는 싸움도 잘 못하는 것 같은데. 내가 충고하나 하지. 지금 가능하면 도망치는 게 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_96031_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "c61a20fe-f58b-447c-82c2-3c1636a8096d"
msgid ""
"\"I must press on. My family is waiting for me, and they'll be concerned "
"about my safety — I have to get to them, despite the risk. I beg to excuse "
"me, Your Grace, but I must be on my way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 계속 가야 해. 우리 가족은 나를 기다리고 있다. 나를 걱정하고 있을 거야. 나는 위험에도 불구하고 그들에게 가야 해. 그럼 "
"실례하지. 나는 가야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_98943_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "36d45d8c-e0f6-4f21-b815-ed84bd25190e"
msgid ""
"\"Since you were kind of enough to save my life…\" {n}Dalton smiles.{/n} "
"\"Some advice that might save yours. A mage lives nearby — I visit him from "
"time to time to sell him reagents for his spells. He's an expert on trolls — "
"might know why they've suddenly become bolder. And fire proof.\" {n}Dalton "
"sighs.{/n} \"And he might have some acid weapons he can sell as well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 목숨을 살려주었으니...\" {n}달튼이 웃습니다.{/n} \"그 문제를 해결하고 싶다면 내가 이 주변에 사는 마법사를 알아. "
"나는 가끔 그가 마법을 위해 시약이 필요할 때 물건을 팔러 가고는 해. 그는 트롤에 대한 전문가야. 아마 왜 그들이 갑자기 더 대담해지고 "
"화염에 저항이 생겼는지 알고 있을거야.\" 달튼은 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"게다가 산성 무기도 몇개 가지고 있을 걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99761_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "2f7fea6f-a1f1-4612-bb38-b2207d624812"
msgid ""
"\"Damned trolls. Almost died from the stink alone...\" {n}The half-elf wipes "
"the sweat from his brow.{/n} \"They almost had me. Since when are trolls not "
"afraid of fire? Good thing I had a few flasks of acid among my goods.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저주받은 트롤들. 악취만으로도 거의 죽겠군.\" {n}하프엘프는 이마에서 땀을 닦아냅니다.{/n} \"거의 당할 뻔했어. 언제부터 "
"트롤이 불을 두려워하지 않았지? 나에게 산성 용액 플라스크가 있어서 다행이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99763_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "06b9ed09-3eee-4208-adce-afd32f5d48aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Dalton scratches his head.{/n} \"Bartholomew is his name. He's not bad "
"for a human. Always so polite, so respectful. But there is something odd "
"about him. He lives alone in the middle of the woods, his house surrounded "
"by traps with a single safe road leading to it. No bandits nor trolls scare "
"him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}달튼이 머리를 긁습니다.{/n} \"바톨로뮤가 그의 이름이야. 인간 치고는 나쁘지 않지. 항상 예의가 바르고. 그는 숲 속에서 혼자 "
"사는데 덫으로 둘러쌓인 그의 집 앞에는 외길이 나있어. 트롤이나 도적은 그를 위협하지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99764_Text
msgctxt "59da393e-6e89-4322-b13b-ed66b5399564"
msgid ""
"\"And the way he looks at you, it's like he's examining you. Like he's "
"considering to crack you open to see what's inside. The chills!\" {n}Dalton "
"shivers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그가 너를 쳐다보는 방식은 마치 부검하는 것 같아. 마치 머리를 쪼개서 안에 무엇이 있는지 보는 것처럼. 오싹하지\" {n}달튼이 "
"몸서리를 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99765_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "f8b74dee-4590-4a87-8952-f3faf2883b4f"
msgid "{n}Ekun solemnly nods, staring at the ground without a word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 말 없이 끄덕이고는 시선을 아래로 향합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99768_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e9edd114-9126-4b10-a2bd-48abe9d63e0c"
msgid ""
"\"Bah! What does he think we're doing here, having a tea party?\" {n}"
"Grumbles Regongar, playing with his weapon.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 여기에 무얼 하러 왔다고 생각하는 거지? 수다라도 떨자는 건가?\" {n}레곤가르가 불평하며 자신의 무기로 장난을 "
"칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99774_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "939631b9-4d2f-4870-b08f-4d571316afc3"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian, already blushing from embarrassment, turns red as a lobster and "
"looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당혹스러움으로 마치 랍스터처럼 붉어지는 트리스티안은 시선을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99776_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5df69d4f-ccef-4075-8f57-96f50a624fc0"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, wait. Where do you think you're going? We saved you, didn't we? So we "
"deserve a reward. Get out your coin purse!\""
msgstr "\"잠깐 기다려. 어디로 가는 거야? 우리가 너를 구했어. 우리는 보상받을 자격이있어. 동전 주머니를 꺼내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99778_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0866fea6-48d6-42f2-8639-6d46c1ea45df"
msgid "\"Again, Reg? Please don't. Just leave him alone.\""
msgstr "\"이럴 거야? 레곤가르? 그를 그냥 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99783_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9f3592fa-eb28-4028-82fb-a6405cbbed5b"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, fine... I'll shut up and play dumb...\" {n}The half-orc grumbles.{/n}"
msgstr "\"좋아. 좋아... 입 다물고 순순히 굴게.\" {n}하프오크는 불평합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99784_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "75438806-0eb4-4f1f-83da-cd495e238e44"
msgid "{n}Regongar smirks at the merchant as he toys with his weapon.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 상인에게 그의 무기를 장난감처럼 휘두르며 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99785_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "75783cf5-285e-40d8-97b9-a3f38a872e17"
msgid ""
"\"Heh heh, you scared, merchant? I'm just kidding. Pay no attention to me — "
"but you'd better listen to what our chief here says!\""
msgstr "\"헤헤. 겁먹었어? 농담이야. 나는 신경쓰지 마. 그래도 우리 대장이 하는 말은 잘들어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99787_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "11811aff-f33e-41da-aa5a-e2a3294bfdb0"
msgid ""
"\"Are you going to let this savage rob someone before your very eyes?!\""
msgstr "\"이 야만인이 너의 눈 앞에서 누군가를 강탈하게 두려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99790_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "bd1b2b04-ad10-4a40-923f-e2c46eb0f5da"
msgid "{n}Valerie nods contentedly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 만족스럽게 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Cue_99793_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "09ef6b21-12a2-4321-915d-4af5c72bb633"
msgid "\"I cannot believe this...\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Trader5_KillTrader_Answer_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1390bb8e-4be6-46a8-9f86-6d6b5cf2989d"
msgid "Murdered and robbed the traveling merchant."
msgstr "행상인을 살해하고 강탈합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Trader5_KillTrader_Answer_Text
msgctxt "69237d68-48ed-47d4-a50c-99d482b3ce08"
msgid "[Attack] \"Let's put your fighting skills to the test, then.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너의 전투 기술을 테스트 해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/AttackedTrader/Trader5_StartCue_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : TraderEvent
msgctxt "c4abfd92-c8a5-4083-bd4c-140874040e15"
msgid ""
"{n}An elderly half-elf stands before you. His sun-bleached hair reveal him "
"as a seasoned traveler, and the confidence with which he holds his bow "
"reveals him to be a seasoned warrior. And his cart full of various items — "
"it seems a trader as well.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 하프엘프가 당신 앞에 서 있습니다. 태양처럼 밝은 그의 머리는 그가 노련한 여행자임을 알리고 활을 들고 있는 그의 풍채는 그가 "
"노련한 전사인 것을 보여줍니다. 그리고 그의 카트는 다양한 물품들로 가득 차 있습니다. 그는 또한 상인처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_31986_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0a2cffe2-89d9-432c-b7e1-749bfaa9697a"
msgid "Made the bandits kill their accomplice."
msgstr "도적들이 공범자를 죽이게 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_31986_Text
msgctxt "a051b302-82e3-486b-8104-c94d073592c0"
msgid ""
"\"Sure, I'll hire you... if you deal with Shortie, that is. He's... "
"distasteful.\""
msgstr "\"물론. 네가 쇼티를 처리한다면 너를 고용하겠어. 그 사람은... 불쾌해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_44264_Text
msgctxt "9215fc9d-59d6-4023-959c-d1dccbe74ff5"
msgid ""
"\"There's no place for bandits in my {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}.\""
msgstr "\"내 영지에 도둑이 들어갈 곳은 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_67663_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9342e9b1-5cd6-4f25-a75e-4fffffc24d4c"
msgid "Hired the bandits."
msgstr "도둑을 고용했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_67663_Text
msgctxt "e1df619c-dbc0-4a35-9344-d0b86fac1a77"
msgid ""
"\"All right, I'll hire you. The {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} has been "
"lacking manpower recently. But all the taxes you collect WILL go to the "
"barony treasury.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 너를 고용할 거야. 최근에는 인력이 부족했다. 그러나 네가 모은 모든 세금은 국고로 귀속될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_78806_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2a45a4f5-2d83-481d-8913-f02d2e2ba619"
msgid "Brought swift justice upon the bandits."
msgstr "도둑에게 신속한 정의의 심판을 내립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_78806_Text
msgctxt "6a77dd82-2fc4-4008-ad70-fd56b591509c"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't make deals with scoundrels.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 악당들과 거래를 하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_87008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "846b23ff-a1de-422b-8f68-788bda3f3f0e"
msgid "Exiled the bandits from the {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}."
msgstr "영지에서 도적을 추방합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_87008_Text
msgctxt "e31132fe-fc65-4a7b-a6c7-f0461d37762f"
msgid ""
"\"Leave these lands immediately. And leave your loot as well. If ever we "
"meet again, I'll kill you.\""
msgstr "\"이 땅을 즉시 떠나라. 너의 물품도 남겨라. 다시 만난다면 나는 너를 죽일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_91467_Text
msgctxt "6a9a0ea1-cc55-4146-99fb-1880c6d10ec8"
msgid "\"Who are you? What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지? 여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99001_Text
msgctxt "3e000f7d-81f6-40ed-a270-a51d2ab2d142"
msgid "\"You wish to enter my service?\""
msgstr "\"내 휘하로 들어오고 싶은건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99002_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "17ef46a3-5969-474b-9ff8-63b35746373a"
msgid "Brought swift justice upon the bandits."
msgstr "도둑에게 신속한 정의의 심판을 내립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99002_Text
msgctxt "92e30e4b-c541-4f3d-a165-23e9b48e2e1d"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't deal with scum!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 쓰레기와 말하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99003_Text
msgctxt "88808ac2-6486-473c-9783-920f9543f28a"
msgid ""
"\"You'd be wise to listen to the woman closely. She's clearly the smartest "
"among you.\""
msgstr "\"저 여자 말을 귀기울여 듣는게 현명할 거야. 그녀는 너희 중에서 가장 똑똑하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99004_Text
msgctxt "4c7a15f9-5085-451e-aa55-5d9743475735"
msgid "[Attack] \"Too late for that. I already have.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너무 늦었다. 이미 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ad9ba23b-f6a9-454f-9bca-543a86897b51"
msgid "Gave the bandits a chance to go straight."
msgstr "도적에게 갱생할 기회를 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99005_Text
msgctxt "85fcc559-9c8d-443d-9b78-59ef466d3932"
msgid ""
"\"All right, I'll hire you. But only if you promise to straighten yourselves "
"out and quit banditry.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 너를 고용하겠다. 그러나 도적을 그만두고 올바르게 살겠다고 약속해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99008_Text
msgctxt "8485e6cc-25f9-476c-a5e1-3b9d99f157f8"
msgid "\"You're hired. Just remember your promise.\""
msgstr "\"너는 고용되었다. 약속을 기억해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Answer_99009_Text
msgctxt "123f3582-3854-49ec-822d-38ec3c21ad3a"
msgid "\"And yet, I'm still not certain I can trust you...\""
msgstr "\"그래도 아직 너를 믿을 수 있는지 확신할 수 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Barks/Hail_String
msgctxt "1e18aa85-d347-46b8-86ee-ebd3d6133ab0"
msgid "\"Hurray for {mf|His|Her} {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"{name} {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_00164_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "bee8f8c0-8165-436d-87c8-1d58bbfd6c74"
msgid ""
"\"What's that, now?\" {n}The bandit leader feigns surprise.{/n} \"Always "
"been a place for us here before, but now it's up and disappeared?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 말입니까, 그게?\" {n}도적 대장은 놀랍니다.{/n} \"여기는 언제나 우리를 위한 곳이었는데 이제 아니라고요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_05141_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "cb88efd3-a69a-4a70-8b29-36505b3c28b3"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, what're ya sayin'?\" {n}Shortie shakes his head in confusion.{/n} \"If"
" that's the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, the only job {mf|he'll|she'll} "
"have for us is as noose tighteners! I say we cut {mf|him|her} down and call "
"it a day!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라구?\" {n}쇼티는 혼란스러워 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"저 녀석이 정말로 남작이라면 우리를 괴롭힐 뿐이겠지. 저 녀석을 베고 "
"집으로 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_06743_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "c197994f-02f5-49b7-b071-22bdab2df9bd"
msgid ""
"\"So now you oughta take us in, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! "
"We'd be even better with a strong leader.\""
msgstr "\"우리를 데려가면 어때요? {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 우린 강한 지도자 밑에서라면 더 잘할 수 있거든요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_11405_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "725d2960-8de7-458a-9449-f25c7f935631"
msgid ""
"\"Told ya. These {mf|barons|barons|kings|queens} always think so high of "
"themselves.\" {n}Shortie spits on the ground.{/n}"
msgstr "\"내가 말했지. 높으신 분들은 잘난척한다고.\" {n}쇼티가 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_14612_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "edd1a1a1-2309-46e0-af02-cf6a1d10f8c4"
msgid ""
"\"Aye, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, we're ready and willing to "
"serve. We'll take a pledge right now, if you want. We'll kiss your boots, "
"your ass, whatever you need! We're sick to death of hiding in the woods and "
"sleeping in the dirt. Why be bandits when we could take from traders legal-"
"like?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론입죠. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 모실 준비가 되어있습니다. 원하신다면 지금 서약을 하겠습니다. 원하신다면 주인님의 "
"장화, 엉덩이, 온 몸에 키스를 해드립죠! 더러운 숲 속에 숨는 것도 이젠 지긋지긋합니다. 합법적으로 상인들로부터 빼앗을 수 있는데 "
"우리가 왜 굳이 도적이 되겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_14734_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "e277bc97-279d-413a-9e63-c0522b5cabe3"
msgid ""
"\"As you command, boss — er, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\" {n}"
"The bandit leader's face is almost glowing with joy.{/n} \"We'll finish "
"sorting things out here, then head straight to your capital. Everyone, you "
"best thank {mf|His|Her} {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"분부대로 하겠습니다. 두목 ..아,아니 {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\" {n}도적 두목의 얼굴은 기쁨으로 빛납니다.{/n} "
"\"우리는 여기서 물건을 마저 분류한 후 바로 수도로 향하겠습니다. 자 다들, {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}께 진심으로 감사 "
"인사드려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_15224_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "d474044a-69e2-4a2e-b478-aaf995769307"
msgid ""
"{n}The bandit leader looks up and jumps with a start when he sees you, his "
"sole eye wide in disbelief.{/n} \"Shortie, you ass! You were supposed to "
"watch the road!\""
msgstr "{n}도적 대장은 당신을 보자 펄쩍 뛰어오르고 외눈이 커집니다.{/n} \"쇼티. 이 멍청아! 경계를 잘하라고 했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_18374_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "43c3697a-973c-4dd5-836a-b066ed0eec74"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, she's not bad, all right. But would ya even know what to do with her? "
"It's all ya can do to lay with me once a week, and I barely get a yawn in "
"before ya finish. I doubt ya could sit the saddle to ride her kind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 저 여자 괜찮은데, 뭐 좋아. 근데 저런 여자와 뭘 어떻게 하는 건지나 알아? 기껏해야 나랑 일주일에 한번 겨우 눕는게 끝이고, "
"그마저도 눈깜짝할 새에 끝나버리잖아. 대장이 저런 여자를 어떻게 할 수 있을꺼란 생각이 영 안드네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_19678_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "70c6c07b-dea2-44a8-9a78-70f6cb7874cd"
msgid ""
"\"Lower than vermin,\" {n}Valerie says with a grimace.{/n} \"With your "
"permission, I would happily cleanse the world of this trash.\""
msgstr ""
"\"해충보다 저질입니다.\" {n}발레리는 찡그린 얼굴로 말합니다.{/n} \"허락하신다면 이 쓰레기들을 깨끗하게 처리하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_21379_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "2210a8ee-fe1f-43a6-877c-c0f5d3573735"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|He|She} robs folk worse than us, and then has the nerve to spew all "
"this righteous crap at us.\""
msgstr "\"저 {mf|녀석은|여자는} 우리보다 더한 강도야. 그리고는 우리한테 정의 어쩌구 하면서 설교를 해댄다구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_29067_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "6bd6af37-04e5-4fee-b215-d7e4162604a0"
msgid ""
"\"Aye, and the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} himself's quite the man, too. "
"Bet he'd do more overnight than you could handle in a month!\" {n}Berta "
"glances at you.{/n} \"Say, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, would ya "
"care to take me to your fairy-tale castle?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 남작도 사람이니까. 하지만 그는 너 같으면 한달이 걸릴 일을 하룻밤만에 처리할 거야.\" {n}베르타가 당신을 "
"쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"말씀해보세요, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이시여, 저를 당신의 동화같은 성으로 데려가주시면 안될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_30126_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "9ee2c458-b01e-4a21-920f-e8e0d04e32a2"
msgid "\"Thank ya, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"고마워요. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_32458_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "4a6940af-a960-4980-ab4c-0a577f048474"
msgid ""
"\"Why, we're your loyal subjects! Honest bandits, the lot of us.\" {n}The "
"bandit leader's broad smile reveals a mouth full rotted teeth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"왜요. 우리도 {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}의 충실한 백성입니다! 우리 대부분은 정직한 도적들이라구요.\" {n}도적 두목은 "
"썩은니를 드러내며 활짝 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_33093_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c8611d6b-a9ac-4a73-be9a-3f6d19e4e796"
msgid "\"The very sight of these low-life scoundrels offends me.\""
msgstr "\"이 멍청이들을 보고 있는 것만으로도 괴롭군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_33318_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirers_Bandit
msgctxt "fc8e41ff-8c05-491b-9ec4-a92fd04f408c"
msgid "\"Heh, when have we ever mistreated you, Shortie? Heh heh.\""
msgstr "\"헤, 언제 우리가 너를 괴롭히기라도 했냐. 쇼티? 헤헤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_39396_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "285b344e-2f5b-431d-8887-fedc2e2d436b"
msgid ""
"\"Quit your whining. We always take care of our own, don't we?\" {n}says a "
"disheveled, rotund woman with a round face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그만 징징거려. 우린 항상 각자 자기 물건들을 스스로 잘 챙겨왔다구. 안그래?\" {n}부스스한 머리에 둥근 얼굴을 한 여자가 "
"말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_40991_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "b8605b7d-cf2e-41ac-8f53-0efa0e8e644b"
msgid ""
"{n}The short, ratty man, whose filthy strands of hair do little to obscure "
"his prominent bald spot, doesn't even try to watch the road. His eyes are "
"locked on the sight of his companions rummaging through their most recent "
"haul of obviously stolen loot.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}대머리 부분을 가리기엔 역부족인 지저분하게 흐트러진 머리를 한 땅딸막한 남자는 길을 경계하려고도 하지 않습니다. 그의 시선은 얼마전 "
"도적질한 물건들을 뒤지고있는 동료에게 가 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_43823_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "a6b26cd4-1a84-4896-8809-92502a2f627c"
msgid "\"Hey! You all are leavin' some for me, right?\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 내 몫은 남겨두겠지? 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_43847_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "960e0e32-6d58-45b7-b09f-3f21083070c6"
msgid "\"Ha! Right you are.\""
msgstr "\"하! 니 말이 맞아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_44649_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "ccbcba40-68f1-43aa-9e33-3565315f79bd"
msgid ""
"{n}The bandit leader glances at Valerie.{/n} \"Hey, Berta! Look at the girl "
"in the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}'s service! Clean and slick and well "
"groomed, she is. You could take a lesson or three from her, I'd say!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도적 두목은 발레리를 흘끗 봅니다.{/n} \"어이. 베르타! 저 여자를 봐! 털 정리도 잘 됐고 피부도 뽀얀데. 저 여자에게 좀 "
"배우라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_45391_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "36e86444-661b-45d7-b775-9d9778846ac9"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun raises his bow and silently nocks an arrow. Noticing your attention, "
"he nods toward the bandits.{/n} \"Worse than trolls. Bred human, choose to "
"be monsters.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 그의 활을 올리고 조용히 화살을 당깁니다. 당신의 주의를 알아 채고 그는 도적을 향해 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"트롤보다"
" 나쁜 놈들. 인간으로 자라서 괴물이 되기를 선택한 놈들.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_45560_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "aebfc366-c8e6-4297-89bc-430c62b9e5bb"
msgid ""
"\"We'd been associating with the Stag Lord's band, but since you went and "
"beat the stag out of him, we're left on our own.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 수사슴 군주 패거리와 관계를 맺고 있었지만, {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}께서 수사슴 군주를 이긴 뒤로는 우리만 남았습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_47658_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "1f48ad23-66e5-4457-990e-982e164c677e"
msgid ""
"\"Shut your trap, Shortie! I beg your pardon, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. Dumb as a doornail, he is. Just joined "
"our company but recently.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아가리 닥쳐, 쇼티! 죄송합니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 저 멍청이가 잠시 헛소리를 했습니다. 얼마전에 들어온 신입이라 "
"그렇습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_49795_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "975382a7-1cff-4c2e-890a-18dc5fd92ca3"
msgid ""
"\"Shut your trap, Shortie! We'll be leaving now, before {mf|His|Her} "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} changes {mf|his|her} mind.\""
msgstr "\"아가리 닥쳐, 쇼티! 우린 {mf|남작|남작|전하|전하}의 마음이 바뀌기 전에 떠날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_60353_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "155a5d46-9e95-499b-bab6-cd1de782a6e3"
msgid ""
"\"Just stand lookout like you were told.\" {n}The man's voice carries the "
"weight of command; he seems to be the leader of these bandits. His bushy "
"beard is matted, and remnants of the last day's meals are still evident in "
"it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"들은 대로 보초나 잘 서.\" {n}남자는 명령조로 말합니다. 그는 도적의 두목으로 보입니다. 그의 덥수룩한 수염은 끈적거리는데 "
"최근에 먹은 음식의 잔재물을 보여줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_68863_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "5dad3916-07e3-4fcf-a974-dab97b3a7440"
msgid ""
"\"Collect taxes, he means, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness},\" {n}the "
"rotund woman clarifies.{/n}"
msgstr "\"두목은 세금을 말한 겁니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\" {n}통통한 여성이 정정합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_70937_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "7f3f60b0-2488-4745-98cc-e5020a92ed7f"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|He|She} robs folk worse than us, and then has the nerve to spew all "
"this righteous crap at us. I say we get 'em!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 {mf|녀석은|여자는} 우리보다 더한 강도야. 그리고는 우리한테 정의 어쩌구 하면서 설교를 해댄다구. 저 녀석을 잡아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_71917_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "6e343edb-67df-4cc1-b373-e9416b565f39"
msgid ""
"{n}Shortie spins to face you, finally noticing your presence.{/n} \"Hey, "
"someone's comin'! Grab your blades!\" {n}he yells belatedly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}쇼티는 얼굴을 돌려 당신을 보더니 마침내 당신을 발견합니다.{/n} \"이봐! 누군가 오고 있어! 칼 들어!\" {n}그는 뒤늦게 "
"소리 지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_73049_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "547c4060-419e-4b30-bfbc-5ba9765c4769"
msgid ""
"{n}The bandit leader bows low, a smirk showing through his bushy beard. The "
"rest of the bandits clumsily repeat the gesture — all except Shortie, who "
"can only glance back and forth, unable to comprehend the situation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}도적 두목은 절을 하더니 덥수룩한 수염을 가진 입으로 웃습니다. 나머지 도적들은 서투르게 두목을 따라합니다. 쇼티만이 앞 뒤를 보며 "
"상황을 이해하지 못하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_76116_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "3c3e973a-3468-4fc4-a860-439bebd85898"
msgid ""
"\"These {mf|barons|barons|kings|queens} always think so high of themselves.\""
" {n}Shortie spits on the ground.{/n}"
msgstr "\"저 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}들은 자기들이 항상 최고인 줄 알지.\" {n}쇼티가 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_76156_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "55b49dee-69c2-42ef-a3e1-1929b461004f"
msgid ""
"\"You heard {mf|him|her}, Shortie. Sorry, but today just isn't your day.\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작님의|남작님의|전하의|전하의} 말을 들었겠지, 쇼티. 미안하지만 오늘은 너의 날이 아니구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_77508_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "e561177f-fd5f-4e88-8a50-5e4b142a2bff"
msgid "\"Ahem. Uh, thanks, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"에헴. 아, 고맙습니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_80563_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "6b7ac067-bc72-4e65-a4cc-19db30ffa07f"
msgid ""
"\"All for the glory of Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, of course,\" "
"{n}the bandit leader says with a grin.{/n}"
msgstr "\"물론 {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}의 영광을 위해서죠.\" {n}도적 두목은 미소를 지으며 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_81404_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersShortie
msgctxt "19c11377-de48-4883-a1bd-66110f3f064f"
msgid "\"Oh, screw you....\""
msgstr "\"아. 젠장...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_81980_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirers_Bandit
msgctxt "6dcf224c-35fc-4081-b554-ab4f2a6d0486"
msgid "\"Hurrah for {mf|His|Her} {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"{name} {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99000_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "1b1bdfa8-e69e-4bd1-ab88-f731dfd6577c"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, hold on, everyone,\" {n}the bandit leader says as he sheathes the "
"sword he'd drawn just a moment ago.{/n} \"And Shortie, stop your foaming. "
"Look here, this is our glorious {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} "
"{mf|himself|herself}! Come now, bow down, everyone, bow down!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 모두들 기다려.\" {n}도적 두목은 자기가 뽑은 칼을 집어넣으며 말합니다.{/n} \"쇼티. 헛소리는 그만둬. 우리의 "
"고귀하신 {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}께서 오셨다! 나와서 모두 인사드려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99006_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersLeader
msgctxt "d4815530-0fc9-4629-8aa8-216fd8c985f0"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, we'll straighten out, don't you worry! We'll turn a new leaf for sure!"
"\" {n}The bandit leader smiles, his blackened teeth showing behind his "
"beard.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오. 똑바로 살겠습니다. 걱정 마십시오! 새싹처럼 살겠습니다!\" {n}도적 두목은 웃으며 덥수룩한 수염 사이로 시커먼 치아를 드러내 "
"보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99007_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "3e6a97c6-b970-4510-9f3c-6d932703f69a"
msgid ""
"\"We promise, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. We kneel before you "
"and swear to become model citizens, you mark our words!\""
msgstr "\"약속하겠습니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 무릎을 꿇고 모범적인 시민이 되겠다고 맹세합니다. 기억해 주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99010_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAdmirersBerta
msgctxt "d78401dc-4aac-4741-a7d7-33d1e87aa5a9"
msgid "{n}The bandit woman shrugs, almost as if to say, \"Really? Why?\"{/n}"
msgstr "{n}도적 여자는 모르겠다는 듯이 어깨를 으쓱하며 말합니다. \"진짜? 왜?\"{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99011_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "59625bac-d2a9-4c0f-8342-898d84b0f623"
msgid ""
"\"Even the vilest of villains deserves mercy if they want to walk the path "
"of redemption. However... I see no remorse in these people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무리 악독한 자라도 구원의 길을 걷고 싶어한다면 자비를 베풀어야 합니다. 그러나.. 이 사람들한테는 양심의 가책이 느껴지지 않는군요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99012_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5beec660-9fb5-49fe-a17c-6cc0526047f6"
msgid ""
"\"He-he, are you serious? Who do you think I am? Holy "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}?\""
msgstr "\"헤헤. 정말이야? 내가 누구라고 생각해? {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 사제라도 된다고 생각해? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99015_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f0ae82f6-566d-46a8-810c-5a71b4304dab"
msgid ""
"\"Don't say this! You're the sweetest scoundrel on the whole "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"말하지 마! 너는 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 가장 매력적인 악당이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99017_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c074349b-66a3-462d-8f98-b9440af2a917"
msgid ""
"\"Serves them right, {Name}! So, you creeps are used to robbing anyone you "
"come across? I hope you had your fun — now we're robbing you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들에게 교훈을 깨닫게 해주자. {Name}! 그래서 너희는 너희 땅으로 온 누구든 강탈한다는 거지? 재미 좀 봤기를 바란다. 이제 "
"우리가 너희를 강탈할 거거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99019_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "23c7e9e4-2a32-4205-b0a0-305ebcb17f59"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie draws her weapon.{/n} \"Scoundrels like these are why the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} gained the reputation they have. I am glad you "
"tolerate them no more than I do.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 무기를 내립니다.{/n} \"이런 악당들 때문에 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}이 악명이 자자한 겁니다. "
"당신이 저만큼이나 그들에게 분노해 줘서 다행이군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Cue_99022_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8339747e-6d27-4f92-8fc2-a773be4c134e"
msgid ""
"\"And I'm to serve shoulder to shoulder with these people?! Maybe following "
"you wasn't as good an idea as I thought...\""
msgstr "\"그래서 이 녀석들과 어깨를 나란히 한다? 어쩌면 당신을 따라다니는 건 좋은 생각이 아니었을지도 모르겠군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/Dialogue_VS_BanditAdmirers_BanditLeader_WhatToBark
msgctxt "58ab26f9-cebb-4778-a337-25d0e54fc2b4"
msgid "\"Hurrah for {mf|His|Her} {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"{name} {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BanditAdmirers/VS_BanditAdmirers_BanditLeader_WhatToBark
msgctxt "5993dbe5-884a-447a-b7bc-d251e0b059ee"
msgid "\"Hurrah for {mf|His|Her} {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"{name} {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Dialogue_FeyTreasure_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "ee4ea1f6-8092-42ee-8488-61beb402c379"
msgid ""
"The girl's body rests here, wearing elegant dress and untouched by decay."
msgstr "소녀의 시체는 썩지 않고 우아한 드레스 차림으로 여기에 뉘여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Dorsie_dead_String
msgctxt "cc20731e-a67c-4be0-a699-373ef46453a2"
msgid "\"All is... Lost... No... Hope...\""
msgstr "\"모든 것을... 잃었어... 희망따윈... 없어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Invis_fey_1_String
msgctxt "c6ed871b-463a-4679-b05d-e1c6dadeb174"
msgid "\"Go away! Go away!\""
msgstr "\"떠나라! 떠나라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Invis_fey_2_String
msgctxt "83d2eb95-82b6-421c-bd50-7a723adeda59"
msgid "\"Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!\""
msgstr "\"하 하 하 하 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Invis_fey_3_String
msgctxt "81eeb264-ab00-4907-978b-1714ccfa8e63"
msgid "\"Do you come to meet your death?\""
msgstr "\"죽음을 맞이하러 왔니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Invis_fey_4_String
msgctxt "23432c6d-5dd6-438e-a36e-0e55a2138161"
msgid "\"So big! So silly! So mortal!\""
msgstr "\"너무나 크고! 너무나 어리석고! 너무나 짧은 인생!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Invis_fey_5_String
msgctxt "3c701992-b90a-495e-8f72-ca6952c05fd1"
msgid "\"Leave! Now!\""
msgstr "\"당장 떠나라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Invis_fey_6_String
msgctxt "ad41716c-85de-4120-9b0a-4f4fa9498480"
msgid "\"You're not welcome here!\""
msgstr "\"너는 불청객이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Invis_fey_7_String
msgctxt "e8a641a1-09af-4900-9d37-832f496be113"
msgid "\"Lose your ways, lose your minds, lose your lives...\""
msgstr "\"길을 잃고, 제정신을 잃고, 목숨마저 잃게 생겼군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Well_empty_String
msgctxt "95fdb636-18a1-40e5-996c-5d50343fa031"
msgid "Rancid stench is rising from the empty well."
msgstr "썩은 냄새가 빈 우물에서 나고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_01_String
msgctxt "0e5aa836-4aa8-4e7d-b3fe-f9b04f95db8a"
msgid "The swamp reeks of algae and stale water."
msgstr "늪에서 부패한 물이 떠오르는 냄새를 풍깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_02_String
msgctxt "f23333aa-bbef-4798-9238-1497166e6a5c"
msgid "Gnats buzz in the air."
msgstr "모기는 공중에서 윙윙거립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_03_String
msgctxt "65871d67-d5c2-4126-af0c-0a771e6067a1"
msgid "The rotten fence is sagging."
msgstr "썩은 담장이 헐었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_04_String
msgctxt "6d33c7e0-a9d9-49d3-877c-a9d669333e95"
msgid "The roof is full of holes, black windows gape like dead eyes."
msgstr "지붕은 구멍으로 가득 차 있고 창문은 죽은 사람의 눈처럼 열려있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_05_String
msgctxt "ed9ab1cd-e034-416a-95c0-cda029a5d53e"
msgid "This village has been abandoned long ago."
msgstr "이 마을은 오래 전에 버려졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_06_String
msgctxt "c0ebe3c3-7b6d-483b-9bb2-d40aea0ef735"
msgid "The trees are broken by someone's enormous claws."
msgstr "나무는 누군가의 거대한 발톱에 의해 부러졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_07_String
msgctxt "431f392e-0708-4770-8fc7-018767cfbfce"
msgid "A tiny, but well-kept garden."
msgstr "작지만 잘 유지된 정원입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_08_String
msgctxt "9b5d0375-d018-44a7-8c71-a293b2764edc"
msgid "A strong, healthy tree towers over the sickly swamp undergrowth."
msgstr "크고 건강한 나무가 더러운 늪지대 위에 세워져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_09_String
msgctxt "fe1f8ac9-53da-4119-9498-bdea455de74e"
msgid "Almost every plant here looks sick."
msgstr "거의 모든 식물이 시들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Barks/Zone_10_String
msgctxt "6ca17cbc-e6db-495e-990b-37aaeb215352"
msgid "Rustling of the branches sounds like quiet weeping."
msgstr "나뭇 가지가 흔들리는 소리는 조용한 울음 소리처럼 들립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Answer_27085_Text
msgctxt "f3b174cb-88a2-4cf2-b4f3-a590253a6056"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Answer_75729_Text
msgctxt "af8825f9-c360-4897-9162-5bcfaf91f820"
msgid "[Detect Magic] \"Let's see if this well bears any enchantments…\""
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]\"이 우물에 뭐가 있는지 보자고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Answer_75731_Text
msgctxt "217b0309-8313-4e66-b4f0-3d87bb82d1e9"
msgid "[Pry open the lid]"
msgstr "[지렛대로 뚜껑을 엽니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Answer_75732_Text
msgctxt "0286257b-6561-48b6-b9e6-2ce84ebb29b0"
msgid "[Knock on the lid]"
msgstr "[뚜껑을 두드립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Cue_40931_Text
msgctxt "8bf33c25-249e-4881-a6c5-582fb4c09a0d"
msgid ""
"{n}You suppress a shiver as you approach the well — the air around it is "
"thick with the smell of decay. As you try to identify the source, you "
"suddenly catch whispers and ragged scratching noises emanating beneath the "
"lid of the well. The rotting wooden cover has been crudely hammered shut "
"with heavy iron nails.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}우물에 접근할 때 당신은 떨림을 느꼈습니다. 주위의 공기는 부패의 냄새로 가득합니다. 냄새의 근원을 확인하려고 할 때 우물을 덮은 "
"뚜껑 아래에서 끼이익거리는 소리와 속삭이는 소리를 듣습니다. 썩어가는 나무 덮개는 무거운 철제못으로 꼼꼼하게 고정되어있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Cue_75733_Text
msgctxt "1b0e4ba3-0b97-4dbb-b7c9-90e7eca45cdc"
msgid ""
"{n}An aura of death magic hangs about the well — the aura runs strong and "
"deep, emanating from the bottom of the well itself.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}죽음의 마법의 기운이 우물 주변에서 나옵니다. 아우라는 우물 밑바닥에서 강하고 깊게 발산합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Cue_75734_Text
msgctxt "87377d7e-7807-4f9b-acde-4752415a623c"
msgid ""
"{n}A flurry of whispers erupts beneath the lid — and for a moment, you feel "
"faint, but you take a breath and focus, blocking out the whispers. Your "
"momentary disorientation subsides.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}속삭임이 갑자기 뚜껑 아래에서 터져 나옵니다. 잠시 동안 당신은 어지러움을 느끼지만 숨을 들이쉬고 집중을 하면서 귀를 막습니다. "
"순간 어지러움이 가라앉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Cue_75736_Text
msgctxt "bdb2a59e-006a-488c-9876-090df2488c61"
msgid ""
"{n}The whispers beneath the lid rise to piercing shrieks, each one like a "
"knife twisting into your skull. Covering your ears, you recoil from the "
"well.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뚜껑 아래에 있는 속삭임은 날카로운 비명 소리를 내는데 소리 하나하나가 당신의 두개골에 박혀 비틀리는 것 같습니다. 당신은 귀를 "
"막고 우물에서 물러납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Cue_75737_Text
msgctxt "380182e7-a89d-4945-8414-cb7945910f1f"
msgid ""
"{n}As you pry open the lid, it splinters away and a foul stench burst forth. "
"You feel a vicious, evil presence rushing towards you...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 지렛대를 이용해 뚜껑을 열자 뚜껑이 뜯어지며 역한 냄새가 쏟아집니다. 당신은 맹렬한 사악한 존재감을 느낍니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Cue_75739_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2d60c95a-0516-4ba2-9ae7-c050c30338aa"
msgid "\"Careful. Whatever is in there, it must be hungry.\""
msgstr "\"조심해. 거기에 뭐가 있든 굶주렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/CurseWell/Cue_75741_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "59dd6cc2-f9e5-4462-95af-7391cb504545"
msgid ""
"\"I feel anguish and crushing despair. Whatever destroyed this village is "
"somehow connected to this well.\""
msgstr "\"나는 고뇌와 절망감을 느낀다. 이 마을을 파괴 한 무엇이 이 우물과 연결되어 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_42757_Text
msgctxt "076caef5-2bea-488f-94e8-e1d3e473eff5"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_43935_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d1a1f7d1-48ef-4dc8-a6a6-9256aa127cbd"
msgid "Robbed Nyta's corpse."
msgstr "니타의 시신을 털었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_43935_Text
msgctxt "4a6ea337-78da-4fe8-ae55-dbb533346a71"
msgid "[Take the jewelry]"
msgstr "[보석을 가져갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_84724_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ab2a6a57-c9f3-436d-ac16-972baeed02ce"
msgid "Put some flowers on Nyta's corpse."
msgstr "니타의 시체에 꽃을 뿌렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_84724_Text
msgctxt "8fd109ef-973f-40f0-a860-dad1ce150d40"
msgid "[Gather some flowers and lay them near the body]"
msgstr "[꽃을 모아 시체 주위에 뿌렸습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_84738_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "36fab899-7888-4f3a-9c97-28a153668af5"
msgid "Left the Scythe Tree's ring on Nyta's corpse."
msgstr "니타의 시체에 대낫 나무의 반지를 남겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_84738_Text
msgctxt "e06cc061-4816-4bba-968e-f089bc24b071"
msgid ""
"[Take the ring you've collected at the Scythe-Tree and put it on the body]"
msgstr "[대낫 나무에서 얻은 반지를 시체 위에 올렸습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_84739_Text
msgctxt "31317437-60ea-4683-8cb1-60bff9f08410"
msgid "[Detect Magic] \"I wonder what enchantments were cast on her…\""
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]\"이 여자에게 무슨 마법이 걸렸는지 보자고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Answer_84742_Text
msgctxt "d229b862-9b13-4ec2-9533-49fd7b4a6508"
msgid "\"Who is there? Show yourselves!\""
msgstr "\"거기 누구야? 모습을 보여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_38805_Text
msgctxt "33d8c8f4-2ef5-4d27-a012-ade3b1e8b750"
msgid ""
"{n}The corpse of a beautiful girl lays in the middle of the glade. You can "
"see the black stain of caked blood on her flowing dress. Despite the years "
"that have passed since the girl's death, the body bears no signs of decay. "
"Her pale hands, clutching a white lily, are folded on her chest peacefully, "
"and a wreath of fresh flowers crowns her head. There is the glint of fine "
"jewelry on her body — a necklace, earrings, and a ring on her finger. As you "
"study the jewelry, you hear hissing voices from every direction — fey — but "
"despite the number of voices, you cannot see a single one.{/n} \"Get hence! "
"Get hence! Let our Nyta sleep or you will regret it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아름다운 소녀의 시체는 빈터의 한가운데에 놓여 있습니다. 그녀의 화려한 드레스에 검은 핏자국의 얼룩이 수놓여졌습니다. 소녀의 죽음 "
"이후로 수년이 지난 지금도 시체는 부패의 징후가 없습니다. 그녀의 창백한 손은 흰 백합을 움켜 쥐고 가슴에 평화롭게 올려져있고 신선한 "
"꽃의 화환이 그녀의 머리에 씌여져있습니다. 그녀의 몸에는 보석, 목걸이, 귀걸이, 반지가 달려 있습니다. 당신이 보석을 살필 때 당신은 "
"모든 방향에서 속삭임을 들었습니다. 그것은 요정(페이)이였지만 수많은 목소리에도 불구하고 아무 형체도 볼 수 없었습니다.{/n} \"꺼져"
"! 니타가 잠들게 두지 않으면 후회하게 해줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84722_Text
msgctxt "9e9b3f85-6911-4c13-b180-c11303c48325"
msgid ""
"{n}Ignoring the threats of the fey, you collect the gold from the body.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}페이의 위협을 무시하고 당신은 시체의 금붙이를 모읍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84726_Text
msgctxt "673ef48d-9e51-457d-86ec-43ed94552d00"
msgid ""
"{n}The ring you found at the Scythe-Tree starts to glow softly. As it does, "
"you hear the faint sound of a woman sobbing… but it's strangely removed as "
"if coming from far away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}대낫 나무에서 찾은 반지가 부드럽게 빛납니다. 그 때 당신은 흐느껴 우는 여자의 희미한 소리를 듣지만 이상하게도 멀리 떨어진 곳에서 "
"오는 것처럼 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84727_Text
msgctxt "1f6aa6c1-bccc-47e3-94f5-b75aa58825e6"
msgid "{n}You collect fresh flowers and lay them over the girl's remains.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 신선한 꽃을 모아 여자의 시신 위에 놓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84734_Text
msgctxt "849bf331-fa05-4339-a37e-010538eaecac"
msgid ""
"{n}You put the glowing ring over the girl's chest, and hear a sigh of "
"relief.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 소녀의 가슴 위에 빛나는 반지를 놓았고 어디선가 안도의 한숨을 들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84735_Text
msgctxt "9f6b4d00-005f-4a20-8989-5ed8426f6538"
msgid ""
"\"We'll find you...\"{n} — the hissing seemingly comes from the forest crown "
"itself. — {/n}\"You'll regret… You'll be sorry...\""
msgstr "\"우리가 널 찾을거야...\" {n}속삭임은는 숲에서 들려오는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"너는 후회할 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84740_Text
msgctxt "128efd08-5367-4af4-8fa9-1cbc24ed70e2"
msgid ""
"{n}The body bears a strong preservation enchantment that keeps decay at "
"bay.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}시체는 부패를 막아주는 강력한 보존 마법에 걸린 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84741_Text
msgctxt "aab54ed1-ae7b-43dd-a564-6ea7169ab366"
msgid ""
"{n}The jeers and threats of the fey become murmurs, then dissolve into "
"silence.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}페이의 위협은 중얼거림이 되어 침묵 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84743_Text
msgctxt "e9ed9373-d796-4975-a5a5-858bd361b541"
msgid ""
"{n}A flurry of giggles and a few mocking jabs (comparing you to the "
"unfavorable end of a mule) are your only answer.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}낄낄 거리는 소리와 당신을 노새의 성기에 비유하는 조롱이 유일한 대답이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84745_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "477b13c3-5997-4baf-bde6-e80a86edeb24"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, who're you laughing at? Come here, cowards, try and laugh into my "
"face!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 누가 웃고 있지? 이리 와. 겁쟁이들아. 얼굴을 맞대고 비웃으라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84747_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "851c5016-a33d-43d3-8fd8-7725d636243c"
msgid ""
"\"This is the land of the fey. Their jokes can be cruel, but their hearts "
"are not evil. Angering them is unwise.\""
msgstr "\"여기는 페이의 땅이야. 농담이 잔인할 수 있지만 그들의 마음은 악하지 않다. 그들의 화를 돋구는 것은 현명하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84748_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3267ee09-b95c-4902-81e0-613bd8f31330"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, don't you say. Do you think angering me is wise? Let me catch these "
"pests, and we'll see who laughs then!\" {n}The half-orc shakes his fists at "
"the invisible mockers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오. 설마 나를 화나게 하는 것이 현명하다고 생각해? 내가 이 버러지들을 잡으면 누가 웃는지 보자!\" {n}하프오크는 보이지 않는 "
"페이에게 주먹을 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/FeyTreasure/Cue_84751_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f9daf864-e276-4a91-8bee-e2d407e81b46"
msgid "\"So sad and romantic... Whoever she was, someone really loved her!\""
msgstr "\"슬프고 낭만적이야... 그녀가 누구든 누군가 정말 그녀를 사랑했을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78243_Text
msgctxt "c288a6eb-0622-4b8f-9a12-87b8fc94042d"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78244_Text
msgctxt "388ce9ae-ad14-41aa-b35e-7924e7fb175c"
msgid "\"Can you tell me what happened here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 무슨 일이 있었는지 말해 줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78245_Text
msgctxt "0e717b01-20ee-46c1-b170-c6f4ebf4087b"
msgid "\"Why are you a ghost?\""
msgstr "\"너는 왜 유령이 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78246_Text
msgctxt "801167de-de8c-4694-92b4-a7cdd66e30a8"
msgid "\"Dorsy said you'd sold your daughter to the fey. Is it true?\""
msgstr "\"도르시가 말하길 네 딸을 팔아넘겼다고 했다. 사실이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78250_Text
msgctxt "d7135b35-0cec-4541-8b2f-5e0886eb59d6"
msgid "\"Your daughter married one of the fey?\""
msgstr "\"네 딸이 페이와 결혼했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78252_Text
msgctxt "f0e5ed2c-238a-4f6c-b26b-edff8fc892c8"
msgid "\"I've opened the well and scattered will-o'-wisps.\""
msgstr "\"나는 우물을 열었고 그 때 위습이 흩어졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78254_Text
msgctxt "95203358-d56e-47e5-86a8-338a66ba8d0e"
msgid "[Attack] \"Undead! Kill it!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"언데드! 죽여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78255_Text
msgctxt "65c92c0a-18e7-4550-8fa2-35b639f85787"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78257_Text
msgctxt "48a1c379-8a85-4213-b0be-888a450046f6"
msgid "\"Do you remember our fight?\""
msgstr "\"우리 싸움을 기억해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78258_Text
msgctxt "c928eb9f-fb93-4fa0-aac4-e460ff7cf89c"
msgid "\"I've found some coins in the well. Here, have a look!\""
msgstr "\"나는 우물에서 동전을 몇 개 발견했다. 여기 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78260_Text
msgctxt "716a8ee7-04d3-4700-b8c8-4e1b337fa9cb"
msgid "\"What do these coins mean?\""
msgstr "\"이 동전들은 무엇을 의미할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78262_Text
msgctxt "f2e97b5e-c8da-440e-b850-7ad45e196129"
msgid "\"Whose names are on these coins?\""
msgstr "\"이 동전에 누구 이름이 새겨졌어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78263_Text
msgctxt "e2bc85ac-b4e9-406e-806c-818307777418"
msgid "\"What keeps you from your eternal rest?\""
msgstr "\"네가 영원한 안식을 취하는 걸 막는 자는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78268_Text
msgctxt "999ccb83-df9e-4de6-9ee2-f755a7963d0d"
msgid "[Put the coins on Erastil's altar]"
msgstr "[에라스틸의 제단에 동전을 올려놓는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78272_Text
msgctxt "1035bf13-ed06-4bbf-9bc0-24cf06ec32c9"
msgid ""
"\"Look at this letter. It is written by the same hand as your name on the "
"coin.\""
msgstr "\"이 편지를 봐. 그것은 동전에 새겨진 너의 이름과 같은 필체로 쓰여졌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78277_Text
msgctxt "70ba1288-23ab-4583-ad67-c9dfb26a0167"
msgid "\"That's enough about the curse, let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"저주에 대해서는 충분하다. 다른 것에 대해서 이야기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78279_Text
msgctxt "50929c76-a530-492e-831b-c9cd3677d6b6"
msgid "\"I've given the coins to put Dorsy to rest.\""
msgstr "\"나는 도르시를 안식에 들게 하려고 동전을 주었다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78281_Text
msgctxt "561beaa0-5c40-40f9-9b90-6bc69e55b03c"
msgid "\"I've given the coins to lift the curse off Dorsy.\""
msgstr "\"도르시에게 걸린 저주를 없애기 위해 동전을 주었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78296_Text
msgctxt "8a449050-c583-46a4-96c2-13471d892519"
msgid "\"Don't.\""
msgstr "\"하지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Answer_78297_Text
msgctxt "aeadd592-055e-4fa1-b323-2f11b2a8e011"
msgid "[Attack] \"Why not?\""
msgstr "[공격] \"왜 안돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78240_Text
msgctxt "8cc7c89d-ce54-4f77-98b7-326d765ed4fb"
msgid ""
"\"You want to know about me? Name's Wilber, Wilber Colton, I'm the headman "
"of this place. You're not locals, are you? Welcome...\" {n}The old man "
"gestures around the ruins and his smile fades.{/n} \"...I'm dead, right? And "
"all the rest as well? I keep forgetting. That's old age for you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나에 대해 알고 싶어? 내 이름은 윌버야. 윌버 콜튼. 나는 이 곳의 책임자지. 너는 주민이 아니지? 환영해...\" {n}노인은 "
"유적 주변을 가리켰고 그의 미소가 사라집니다.{/n} \"... 나는 죽었어. 맞지? 나머지도 모두? 나는 계속 잊는단 말이지... "
"나이가 들면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78241_Text
msgctxt "4288dcb7-ba5a-45cc-8665-9705afc13a53"
msgid ""
"{n}In front of the ruined temple you see a ghost — an old man, walking the "
"grounds. Noticing you, he smiles and nods.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}폐허가 된 성전 앞에서 유령을 보았습니다. 땅을 배회하는 노인의 유령입니다. 당신을 발견하자 그는 웃으며 얼굴을 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78247_Text
msgctxt "25c4fe4b-106a-4d0e-b4ad-e186f44bb1eb"
msgid ""
"\"Happened? Where? {n}The old man looks around, puzzled.{/n} \"Ah, the "
"village... aye, something bad happened here... Problem is, I can't remember "
"a thing! Everything was going along, just as it should — I was preparing for "
"my daughter's Nyta's wedding... and then — all went dark! I must have passed "
"on before the village was destroyed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어디서? \" {n}노인은 주변을 둘러 보며 의아해합니다.{/n} \"아. 마을... 그래. 여기 뭔가 나쁜 일이 있었다... 문제는 "
"기억이 안나! 모든 일이 잘되고 있었고 그래야만 했어... 나는 니타의 결혼식을 준비하고 있었지... 그리고는. 모든 것이 어두워졌어! "
"마을이 파괴되기 전에 나는 죽었음이 틀림 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78248_Text
msgctxt "2a464b2b-3882-4362-8f44-53c377b37a68"
msgid ""
"\"Which ghost?\"{n} The old man raises his eyes, surprised, then looks at "
"himself and sighs. {/n}\"Ah, right... Something won't let me rest in "
"peace... Did I anger {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}? No, that wasn't that...\"\n"
"{n}The old man's eyes widen, and he snaps his fingers — it makes no "
"sound.{/n} \"Ah, I remember now! It's these... lights, they're the reason! "
"They keep creeping out of the well, whispering, hissing, and ruining my "
"sleep! Aye, it's all because of them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어느 유령?\" {n}노인은 놀란 표정을 짓고 자기 자신을 보고는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"아. 맞아. 뭔가가 내가 편히 죽게 두지 "
"않았을 거야... 내가{g|Erastil} 에라스틸{/g}에게 화를 냈어? 아니. 그게 아니야... \"\n"
"{n}노인의 눈이 넓어지며 손가락을 튕기었지만 아무 소리가 나지 않습니다.{/n} \"아. 이제 기억이 난다! 이게... 이 불빛들이 "
"원인이다. 그들은 우물에서 계속 기어나와 속삭이며 내 잠을 망쳤어! 그것들 때문이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78249_Text
msgctxt "1373dd26-b69c-4fdd-b9de-17780d91a905"
msgid ""
"\"Dorsy, huh? That's the one to listen to, hah! That rascal would have some "
"tales to tell, no doubt... he was her fiancé, you see. Rich, handsome... he "
"was courting her, and then all a-sudden she changed her mind about being wed."
"\" {n}The old man sighs and gives a faint shrug.{/n} \"My Nyta went for a "
"walk in the woods and found a new love there — one of the fey! Naturally, "
"drove Dorsy into a rage, screaming the fey had charmed her away... but think "
"a moment.\" {n}He turns to you, eyebrows raised.{/n} \"What man can compare "
"with the beauty of the fey? Nyta left Dorsy of her own free will!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도르시? 허? 그것도 들어봐야 하지 허. 그 녀석에게도 분명히 할 이야기가 있을 거야... 분명 그는 그녀의 약혼자였지. 알지, "
"부유하고 잘생기고... 그는 그녀에게 구혼하고 있었는데, 갑자기 그녀가 결혼에 대한 생각을 바꾸었지.\" {n}노인은 한숨을 쉬며 어깨를 "
"으쓱합니다.{/n} \"나의 니타는 숲 속으로 걸어들어갔고 거기서 새로운 사랑을 찾았어. 바로 페이에게! 물론 도르시는 분노로 돌아버렸고 "
"그 페이가 그녀에게 매혹 마법을 걸어 데려갔노라고 고함을 질렀지... 하지만 생각해 보면...\" {n}그는 당신을 보며 눈썹을 "
"들어올립니다.{/n} \"어떤 사람이 페이의 아름다움과 비교될 수 있겠어? 니타는 자신의 의지로 도르시를 떠났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78253_Text
msgctxt "c6ab0b4f-8e55-4a01-8025-8c7d4293cc0c"
msgid ""
"\"You did? And still I can't rest… so it wasn't those lights after all... I "
"must have done something wrong, then… or maybe I had to do something, but "
"didn't? Damn it all, if only I could remember!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네들이 해낸건가? 근데 난 아직도 쉴 수가 없어... 결국 그 불빛들이 아닌게로군... 내가 뭔가 잘못했을 거야... 아니면 뭔가 "
"빼먹었던가. 젠장. 내가 기억만 할 수 있다면!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78256_Text
msgctxt "b51ba72d-0357-4679-935f-48eb51583a18"
msgid ""
"\"A fight?\"{n} The ghost echoes.{/n} \"What fight? We're peaceful folk, we "
"are! We mean harm to no one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"싸움?\" {n}유령의 목소리가 울립니다.{/n} \"무슨 싸움을? 우리는 평화로운 사람들이야. 우리는 아무에게도 해를 입히지 않을 "
"것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78259_Text
msgctxt "96a946c1-f8ed-4ee9-a9af-f90815af846b"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost studies the coins for several moments, then turns to you — his "
"face grief-stricken.{/n} \"That's what this all about. That's why I can't "
"rest… Oh, dark things, dark sins...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}유령은 몇 분 동안 동전을 살펴본 다음 당신을 봅니다. 그의 얼굴이 슬픔에 잠겼습니다.{/n} \"바로 이것 때문이야. 그래서 내가 "
"쉴 수 없었던 거야. 이 사악한 것이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78264_Text
msgctxt "3515dad3-58a1-49b7-a069-1382c899f740"
msgid ""
"\"Wilber — that's me. And I thought I had no enemies at all… and here were "
"two who wanted me gone from this world! These coins, look at them — the "
"inscription was done by different hands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"윌버는 나야. 나에겐 적이 전혀 없다고 생각했어. 근데 이 세상에서 두 명이나 나를 없애고 싶어했다니! 이 동전을 봐. 각각 다른 "
"자의 손으로 새겨졌지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78265_Text
msgctxt "d16ec1f9-cf39-4245-9405-1cd6043cd2f2"
msgid ""
"\"And the second name, the second… Callitropsia, sounds familiar... Aye, "
"right! That's the dryad, my daughter's new love! Someone must have hated her "
"so much that he was willing to doom his own immortal soul to get rid of her "
"and of me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 두 번째 이름은.... 두 번째... 칼리트롭시아는 익숙한 이름인데... 아. 맞아! 그건 내 딸이 새로 사랑하게 된 "
"드라이어드의 이름이야! 누군가 그녀를 너무나 증오해서 그가 영혼을 팔아 내 딸과 나를 제거하려 했던 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78266_Text
msgctxt "a5dc126f-09f7-4c6e-adeb-799e4713f3a4"
msgid ""
"\"They are a curse. It is a legend in these parts — it was said if you bore "
"hatred in your heart, hatred so fierce it could burn another's soul, all you "
"need do was etch your enemy's name on a coin and cast it into the cursed "
"well... it would be the end of them.\" {n}The ghost nods.{/n} \"And the end "
"of you as well — curses carry a heavy price. If you hate another more than "
"you love your own life, well — your life is forfeit already.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것들은 저주야. 전설에 의하면 마음 속에 강렬한 증오를 품는다면 다른 사람의 영혼을 태울 수 있어서 동전에 이름을 새기고 저주받은 "
"우물에 던지면 된다고 해.\" {n}유령은 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그리고 저주의 시전자도 끝장이 나지. 자기가 사는 것보다 남이 죽기를 "
"원한다면 그 삶은 이미 몰수된 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78267_Text
msgctxt "b23a35e3-5289-45c9-b0b3-9b18c190350a"
msgid ""
"\"Here they are, these coins just won't let me go… Those with my name on it —"
" they are the symbols of a curse. I was hated not by one, but by two "
"persons. Their hatred is the rope that ties me to this world and keeps me "
"awake...\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 이 동전들은 나를 놔주지 않을 거야... 내 이름이 새겨져있는 동전은 저주의 상징이지. 나는 한 명도 아니고 두 명에게 증오를 "
"받았어. 그들의 증오가 나를 묶어두는 사슬이 되어 잠들지 못하게 하는 것이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78269_Text
msgctxt "733e09a1-d70a-471d-8ce8-d06a599859ae"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost watches the coins evaporate to mist, almost in disbelief.{/n} "
"\"At last... you have my gratitude! I feel... tired.\" {n}The ghost blinks, "
"and you notice his silhouette is blurring slightly, evaporating as the coins "
"did, but more slowly.{/n} \"But I must reward you — somehow. I've got "
"nothing except for... wait, under that boulder — I hid something there years "
"ago — I have no need of it now. For me... it is time to rest...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}유령은 동전이 증발하여 연기로 변하는 것을 못미덥게 지켜 봅니다.{/n} \"마침내... 정말 고마워! 나는... 피곤하군.\" "
"{n}유령이 깜박거리고 당신은 그의 윤곽이 흐려지고 동전과 함께 천천히 증발하는 것을 느낍니다.{/n} \"나는 반드시 너에게 "
"보상해야해. 나는 아무것도 가진 게 없지만... 기다려, 저기 돌 밑에 몇 년 전에 무언가를 숨겨놓았지. 이제는 내게 필요하지 않아. "
"나에게는... 이제 쉴 시간이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78270_Text
msgctxt "798e36a1-9cfd-4025-a187-9297f8a98d16"
msgid "{n}…and with that, the ghost dissolves into thin air.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}... 그리고 유령은 허공 속으로 녹아듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78275_Text
msgctxt "a31ab477-2f87-46e3-b3d3-68e5298e27f5"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost raises his grief-stricken eyes at you. {/n}\"While I was alive, "
"I was a coward. A coward and a liar. That's how it went — on one hand, I "
"felt Dorsy was a good man, a reliable man, a much better match for my "
"daughter than some dryad. On the other hand, it would bring misfortune on "
"me... on us, the village, to refuse the fey — and my Nyta, she truly loved "
"the dryad. What was I left to do? If I gave her to Dorsy — the fey would "
"seek revenge, if I gave her to the fey — Dorsy would seek revenge.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}유령은 당신을 슬픔에 잠긴 눈으로 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 살아있는 동안 겁쟁이였어. 겁쟁이에 거짓말쟁이. 그래서 이렇게 되었지. "
"한편 나는 도르시가 일부 드라이어드보다 훨씬 더 착하고 믿음직한 남자로 내 딸과 어울린다고 느꼈어. 다른 한편으로 페이와 내 딸이 서로 "
"사랑하는 것을 막아 우리 마을에 저주가 내려진 거라고 생각해. 내가 어떻게 해야 했을까? 내 딸을 도르시에게 주면 페이는 복수하려 했을 "
"테고 내 딸을 페이에게 주면 도르시가 복수하려 했을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78276_Text
msgctxt "77ce5df0-44b8-4308-a3df-42b09003563e"
msgid ""
"\"I used to give advice, but I couldn't heed it myself. I was a fool...\" {n}"
"The ghost speaks slower, as if hearing his own story for the first time.{/n} "
"\"I... lied to Dorsy, saying the fey threatened me. Then... I lied to my "
"daughter, telling her Dorsy had pursued me... then I waited for the "
"situation to solve itself... and it did. Dorsy grew to hate me... and so did "
"my own daughter.\" {n}The ghost shakes his head and closes his eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 충고하는 데 익숙했지만 나 자신에게 주의를 기울이지 않았어. 내가 어리석었지.\" {n}유령은 자신의 이야기를 처음 듣는 것처럼 "
"느리게 말합니다.{/n} \"나는... 도르시에게 거짓말을 해 페이가 나를 협박한다고 말했어. 그리고는 도르시가 나를 부추긴다고 딸에게 "
"거짓말을 했지... 그리고는 상황이 해결되기까지 기다렸고 그렇게 되었어. 도르시와 내 딸은 나를 증오하게 되었지.\" {n}유령이 머리를 "
"흔들고 눈을 감습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78278_Text
msgctxt "96fec74b-623d-4d7d-9428-76cb8197343c"
msgid "\"Very well. What about, then?\""
msgstr "\"그럽시다. 뭐에 대해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78280_Text
msgctxt "db006313-81d7-4aa7-b163-1f4cbbcdeff5"
msgid ""
"\"What — what are you talking about? Coins? Forgive an old man, my memory is "
"not what it was… What were we talking about?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 소리야? 동전? 이 늙은이를 용서해. 내 기억은 달라... 우리가 무슨 얘기를 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78282_Text
msgctxt "0e516650-2f30-4e8c-bb97-3377133aeda3"
msgid ""
"\"Which curse? Why are you saying these horrid things? We never had any "
"curses here, {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} forbid!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저주? 왜 그런 끔찍한 말을 하는 거야? 우리는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 금지한 이후로 저주 같은 건 쓰지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78283_Text
msgctxt "58e6b917-b0b5-448f-9b48-71cebaf469ad"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know if a curse like that can be lifted... But do me a favor — put "
"the coins on the altar of {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} — it's nearby, in the "
"temple ruins. Maybe my god will take mercy on me, let me rest at last.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 저주가 풀릴 수 있는지 모르겠다. 하지만 부탁인데 동전을 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 제단에 놓아줘. 이 주변 신전 "
"유적지 안에 있을 거야. 어쩌면 나의 신이 자비를 베풀어 나를 쉬게 해줄지도 모른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78284_Text
msgctxt "584a2df7-01e0-4b13-a70c-72d4510db94d"
msgid ""
"{n}You place the coins on the altar. For a moment, nothing happens, then the "
"coins evaporate silently, steaming away to mist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 동전을 제단에 놓습니다. 잠시 동안 아무 일도 일어나지 않았지만 이내 동전들은 조용히 증발하여 연기마저 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78286_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7817b955-2b6d-432a-a6e4-3d8fd912bb8b"
msgid ""
"\"To lose both your life and mind... Disgusting. Not that this man had a lot "
"of wit to begin with...\""
msgstr "\"삶을 잃어버린다는 건... 끔찍한 일이지. 이 남자는 처음부터 재치가 많았지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78289_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f0cc8e67-7856-4bba-83ad-4990113ab8e0"
msgid "\"Don't blame yourself. You've meant to do good.\""
msgstr "\"자신을 비난하지 마. 너는 선을 행하려고 했으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78291_Text
msgctxt "446abb34-2629-41a7-8ba9-6fac8c10d1fd"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your kind words. But who cares what I've meant if in the end "
"it led to... this.\" {n}The ghost points at the ruins around him.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"친절한 말을 해주어 고마워. 근데 결국 이렇게 될 거라면 무슨 소용인가 싶어...\" {n}유령은 그 주위의 폐허를 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78292_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7bd9c4ac-7586-4bc4-8bc7-7f72e61223c6"
msgid ""
"\"So he doesn't even remember us beating him? What a fool! Should we give "
"him a reminder?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그는 우리가 그를 때린 것도 기억하지 못한다고? 그런 바보가! 그에게 알려주어야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78298_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b76b164c-485c-471e-958d-b05d5d8e7878"
msgid "\"Great! Just you wait, ghost face!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 기다려. 귀신아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78299_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2db31d8f-1c44-4cbc-bcf6-c7984b241a56"
msgid "\"It's not like he'll remember! Eh, whatever.\""
msgstr "\"그가 기억할 것 같지 않아! 뭐. 상관 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_78300_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "30c36493-3ad0-4eea-aa00-b773acfbb071"
msgid ""
"\"A daughter, laying a death curse on her father merely for being afraid and "
"confused? How hardhearted! I would like to feel sorry for her, but now I "
"simply cannot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"겁먹고 혼란스러워 아버지에게 죽음의 저주를 건 딸이라. 이런 어이 없는 경우가 있나. 그녀에게 유감의 감정이 있었지만 이제는 아니야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_Curse-truth_ghost_Text
msgctxt "e602bf3e-9cad-4646-87dd-09838a456a45"
msgid ""
"\"I guess this yobbo Dorsy was the one who'd cursed us. Her — for stealing "
"his bride, and me — for letting this happen. Nasty things, nasty sins... But "
"who else could wish me dead? I've got no slightest idea about that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 신둥부러진 도르시가 우리를 저주한 자가 분명해. 칼리트롭시아는 자기의 신부를 훔쳤기 때문에, 내 경우는 이런 일이 일어나도록 "
"내버려 두었기 때문에 이렇게 우리 둘을 저주한거야. 몹쓸 짓이야, 몹쓸 죄야... 근데 내가 죽기를 바라는 또다른 사람은 누구야? 정말 "
"전혀 모르겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_Ghost_Elga_name_Text
msgctxt "430f9083-a035-4f4a-9efb-8566a83cc4f4"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe she did — by the time of wedding I had... passed. Still, a fey "
"marriage wasn't unheard of here in the village. Fey lived close in the "
"woods, trysts happened, love bloomed, children were born... take Elga "
"Verniex, for instance — her mom conceived her in the forest, her father, a "
"satyr of all things. Elga was born with greenish skin and sharp ears... ah, "
"but so sharp, pretty, she was — wish I knew what's happened to her...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그랬을 거야. 결혼했을 때에는 나는... 죽어 있었으니까. 그래도 페이와의 결혼은 그렇게 드문게 아니야. 페이가 인근 숲 속에서 "
"사니까 짝을 이뤄 사랑이 꽃필 수도 있지... 엘가 베르닉스같은 아이도 태어났어. 그녀의 엄마도 숲에 매혹되었고 사티로스가 아버지가 "
"되었지. 엘가는 초록색 피부와 뾰족한 귀를 가지고 태어났어. 뾰족했지만 예뻤어. 어떻게 그런 귀를 달고 태어났을까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/GhostMan/Cue_truth-Nita_ghost_Text
msgctxt "8b36e4a3-868c-481b-9b79-ebff2b198d2a"
msgid ""
"{n}After reading the letter, the old man shakes his head, devastated.{/n} "
"\"Oh, Nyta, Nyta, what have you done… And what have I done, such an old "
"fool...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}편지를 읽은 후 노인은 절망스러운 표정으로 머리를 가로저었습니다.{/n} \"오. 니타. 뭔 일을 한 거냐... 난 무슨 짓을 한 "
"거지... 바보같은 노인네 같으니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Interfaces/BigNarlmarches_BearBushes_String_1
msgctxt "84384d63-5811-4972-be1c-62c03b35fbf9"
msgid "Clearing in the Bushes"
msgstr "수풀 속을 청소하기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Interfaces/BigNarlmarches_Mageshroom_String
msgctxt "0040bde5-bc3c-4a2f-8d79-57eec060758c"
msgid "Mudleaf"
msgstr "진흙잎"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Interfaces/BigNarlmarches_SwampBridge_String_1
msgctxt "9c49e241-d8a8-489d-93ff-94bd4181f668"
msgid "Swamp Trail"
msgstr "늪 흔적"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Interfaces/BigNarlmarches_Swampherb_String_1
msgctxt "5a2a956d-e54f-499a-a45f-21e373c67712"
msgid "Dizzyhead"
msgstr "현기증"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/BlackRattlecap_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "ba38f6a2-aebd-4aad-aeb3-ded529746876"
msgid ""
"This large black mushroom has a hollow cap filled with tiny hard balls of "
"spores. When shaken, it makes an unusual rattling sound."
msgstr "이 큰 검은 버섯의 머리에는 공같은 작고 단단한 포자로 채워져 있습니다. 흔들면 특이한 딸랑거리는 소리를 냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/Gloomberry_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "456b624d-ac96-4f5b-99a1-55f622ebf984"
msgid ""
"You can't find a rare swamp plant like this on a market. A knowing person "
"can give a good price for it."
msgstr "이런 희귀한 늪지 식물은 시장 같은 곳에서 쉽게 찾을 수 있는 물건이 아닙니다. 가치를 아는 사람이 좋은 값을 쳐줄 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/Mageshroom_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "556e0c43-3b6c-4466-aea1-56090bfc5268"
msgid ""
"You can't find a rare swamp plant like this on a market. A knowing person "
"can give a good price for it."
msgstr "이런 희귀한 늪지 식물은 시장 같은 곳에서 쉽게 찾을 수 있는 물건이 아닙니다. 가치를 아는 사람이 좋은 값을 쳐줄 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/Nita_letter_Name_String
msgctxt "e8c345a9-b3c5-4768-83ec-e826e102d5d0"
msgid "Nyta's Letter"
msgstr "니타의 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/Nita_letter_String
msgctxt "b471456d-70b8-46ac-960b-f38e4eb61cd7"
msgid ""
"\"My beloved Callitropsia,\n"
"Every day I spend without you seems to drag on forever! The only thing left "
"to do is to think of our coming wedding. Only you know how I long for this "
"day to finally come. Each time I close my eyes, I see us, together. I see "
"happy guests and tables set out for a feast, I smell the fragrance of "
"flowers and fine cuisine, I hear cheerful music, I feel your touch as we "
"whirl in dance. But even these dreams pale in comparison to the mere thought "
"of the eternity we'll spend together. I shall love you forever, even after "
"death, in every life after this one and across all of creation.\n"
"Only one thing disturbs my happiness. Do you know that someone tried to "
"interfere with our wedding? My former groom, Dorsy, has talked father into "
"trying to disrupt the ceremony. Picture this: father took it into his head "
"that since he is a headman of our village, he can decide my fate! But don't "
"you worry, my love — their plot has fallen apart. No gods could prevent our "
"union, for a higher force is standing behind us. A few nights ago I dreamt "
"of a mesmerizing maiden, who told me how to free myself out of my father's "
"grip. I did everything as she told — I was so angry with him! Now, of "
"course, I am beset with doubt — was it the right thing to do? Still, I "
"hardly think any of this is more than pure superstition: such silliness "
"cannot change how things are, and I could have dreamt up absolutely anything."
"\n"
"Think nothing of this, my love. Think only of me. I love you.\n"
"I cannot wait for our day!\n"
"Your Nyta\""
msgstr ""
"\"사랑하는 칼리트롭시아\n"
"너 없는 하루는 느리고 영원한 것 같아! 유일하게 남은 일은 우리의 다가올 결혼식을 생각하는 거야. 그 날이 다가오기를 얼마나 오랫동안 "
"기다려 왔는지 너만 알 거야. 눈을 감을 때마다 나는 함께 만나는 상상을 해. 행복한 손님들이 잔치 음식이 가득한 테이블에 앉는 것을 "
"보고 꽃의 향기와 훌륭한 요리 냄새를 맡고 쾌활한 음악을 듣고 춤을 출 때 너의 손길을 느껴. 하지만 이러한 꿈조차도 우리가 함께 보낼 "
"영원에 비하면 초라할 뿐이야. 나는 죽은 후 다시 살아나도 영원히 너를 사랑할 거야.\n"
"한 가지만 내 행복을 방해해. 누군가 우리 결혼식을 방해하려 했던 것을 알아? 나의 전 신랑인 도르시는 아버지에게 의식을 방해하라고 "
"이야기했어. 마을의 우두머리인 아버지가 이 말을 듣는다면 어떻게 될지 상상해 봐. 그는 내 운명을 결정할 수 있어! 하지만 걱정하지 마. "
"내 사랑. 그들의 음모는 실패했어. 어떤 신도 우리를 막을 수는 없어. 더 강력한 힘이 우리를 받쳐주기 때문이야. 며칠 전 나는 내 "
"아버지의 손아귀에서 자유로워지는 방법을 말해주는 최면술사 소녀를 만났어. 나는 그녀가 말한대로 모든 것을 했지. 나는 아버지에게 너무 "
"화가났으니까! 물론 의심의 여지가 있기는 해. 이게 올바른 일일까? 나는 이게 순수한 미신 이상의 것이라고 생각하지 않아. 그런 어리석은 "
"짓으로 무언가를 바꿀 수 없지. 그저 나는 절박할 뿐이야.\n"
"더 이상은 아무것도 생각하지 마. 내 사랑. 내 생각만 해. 사랑해.\n"
"우리가 함께할 날이 어서 오면 좋겠어!\n"
"당신의 니타 \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/OldCoinWithFianceName_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "c9f99d01-913d-4040-b03e-4dc4188feaa3"
msgid ""
"An old coin, dark from age. There's a name scribbled on it: \"Callitropsia\"."
msgstr "오래되어 색이 바래진 동전입니다. 이름이 적혔습니다: \"칼리트롭시아(Callitropsia)\"."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/OldCoinWithPriestName_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "15fedbb4-004a-4863-b27d-6cd9978bdbe3"
msgid "An old coin, dark from age. There's a name scribbled on it: \"Wilber\"."
msgstr "오래되어 색이 바래진 동전입니다. 새로운 이름이 적혔습니다: \"윌버(Wilber)\"."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/ScytheTreeRing_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "f1e6d67a-4551-49c2-a842-7a76eae91856"
msgid ""
"An elegant silver ring with a leaf ornament. Why was it hanging on a scythe "
"tree's branch?"
msgstr "잎 장식으로 우아한 은 반지입니다. 왜 대낫 나무의 가지에 매달려 있었을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/Settrex_letter_Name_String
msgctxt "879aa2ec-caf9-45a6-8315-20c828ca5c69"
msgid "A Letter from Settrex to His Daughter"
msgstr "세트렉스(Settrex)가 그의 딸에게 보내는 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/Settrex_letter_String_1
msgctxt "c479fc85-c2b8-4f18-92e3-1e1c51e01c3c"
msgid ""
"\"My dear Elga!\n"
"I'm sure you don't remember my face, but I hope you do know my name. In case "
"you don't, I'll introduce myself — my name is Settrex. I am your father. I "
"deeply regret that I never had a chance to watch you grow up, that I didn't "
"help you at times of hardship and didn't share your moments of happiness and "
"your sorrows, that you never knew how much I love you. It is unknown to me "
"what Isabel, your mother, has told you about me — whether you ever found out "
"that I'm a satyr, whether you've heard of the extraordinary place you were "
"born or of my fate after your disappearance. In this letter, however, I'll "
"try to tell you everything.\n"
"You were born in a village where humans and fey have lived in peace for "
"centuries. We were more than good neighbors – it was a close union. A union "
"so close that fey and humans built families together. Your mother and I fell "
"in love with each other, and you were the fruit of our love — the child of "
"two peoples. There wasn't a single human or fey in the village who didn't "
"like our little Elga. From early on, you knew how to conquer hearts. And I "
"loved you as well — more than anyone else in the world. Every day I would "
"look at you and admire your features, and I would feel like the happiest "
"creature in all of creation.\n"
"But my happiness wasn't meant to last. Isabel took you to far-off lands. Why "
"she did this, I do not know. Perhaps, I offended her in some way, or maybe "
"she foresaw the coming disaster. A few months later, a horrid creature "
"attacked the village and razed it to the ground. A lot of fey and humans "
"died, hundreds of houses were laid to waste, and soon those lands were void "
"of life. I looked for both of you for a long, long time, but I never found "
"you. Finally, I had nothing left to do but to return to our ruined home, and "
"live out my days in solitude.\n"
"I am grieved that Isabel didn't allow me to be with you, but I'm glad she "
"took you away and saved your life. Nowadays, I'm one of the few who still "
"live in the village ruins, hoping desperately that one day you will return "
"to your homeland. I'm too old and too lonely to leave. If I don't live to "
"see you come back, then this letter will tell you of my fate.\n"
"Forgive me, my little girl. I love you.\n"
"Settrex, your father.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사랑하는 엘가!\n"
"너는 내 얼굴을 기억하지 못하겠지만 적어도 내 이름을 알기를 바래. 모르겠다면 내 소개를 하마. 내 이름은 세트렉스다. 나는 너의 "
"아버지다. 나는 네가 자라난 것을 볼 기회가 없었고 네가 힘든 시기에 돕지 못하고 너의 행복과 슬픔의 순간을 나누지 못했고 너를 얼마나 "
"사랑하는지 알려주지 못했다는 것을 깊이 유감스럽게 생각해. 너의 어머니 이사벨이 나에 대해 말한 것이 무엇인지는 모르겠다. 네가 무엇을 "
"들었는지 몰라도 나는 사티로스이고 네가 어디서 태어났는지 혹은 네가 사라진 후에 내 운명이 어찌되었는지도 모를 것이다. 그러나 이 편지를 "
"통해 모든 것을 알려주려고 한다.\n"
"너는 인간과 페이가 수세기 동안 평화롭게 살았던 마을에서 태어났어. 우리는 좋은 이웃 그 이상이었지. 친밀한 공동체에 가까웠다. 너무나 "
"가까워서 인간과 페이는 가족을 이루기도 했다. 네 엄마와 나는 서로 사랑에 빠졌고 너는 우리 사랑의 결실이자 두 종족의 자식이었다. "
"마을에 우리의 작은 엘가를 싫어하는 사람은 한명도 없었지. 어렸을 때부터 너는 사랑받는 법을 알았다. 그리고 나는 세상의 다른 누구보다도 "
"너를 너무나 사랑했다. 매일 너를 보고 너의 모습에 감탄하고 내가 모든 생명체 중에서 가장 행복하다고 느꼈다.\n"
"그러나 나의 행복은 오래가지 않았다. 이사벨이 너를 멀리 떨어진 땅으로 데려갔다. 왜 그녀가 그랬는지 나는 모르겠다. 아마 내가 그녀를 "
"어떤 식으로든지 화나게 만들었을 지도. 아니면 그녀는 다가올 재앙을 미리 예측했던 것인지도 모른다. 몇 달 후 무시무시한 괴물이 마을을 "
"공격하여 폐허로 만들었어. 많은 페이와 인간이 죽었고 수백 채의 집이 파괴되었고 이내 그 땅은 생기가 사라져 텅 비어버렸다. 나는 너희 "
"둘을 오랫동안 찾았단다. 그러나 나는 결코 너를 발견하지 못했지. 결국 나는 할 것이 없어서 폐허가 된 집으로 돌아가 고독한 삶을 "
"살아갔다.\n"
"이사벨이 나와 함께하는 것을 허락하지 않았다는 것을 알고 슬펐지만 그녀가 너를 살렸다는 것이 기뻤다. 이제 나는 마을의 얼마 안 남은 "
"생존자란다. 언젠가 이 마을에 네가 돌아오기를 바라며 아직 남아 있다. 너를 찾으러 떠나기에는 나는 너무 늙어서 혼자서는 무리구나. 내가 "
"살아서 너를 보지 못한다면 이 편지가 내 운명을 말해 줄 거야.\n"
"나를 용서해다오. 나의 딸아. 사랑한다.\n"
"세트렉스. 네 아빠가. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Items/Swampherb_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "b27281a5-cfa7-4b94-8741-656f9240e534"
msgid ""
"You can't find a rare swamp plant like this on a market. A knowing person "
"can give a good price for it."
msgstr "이런 희귀한 늪지 식물은 시장 같은 곳에서 쉽게 찾을 수 있는 물건이 아닙니다. 가치를 아는 사람이 좋은 값을 쳐줄 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92268_Text
msgctxt "95f34470-6ac4-4043-a7c7-07af72461121"
msgid "[Attack] \"It's an undead! Kill it!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"언데드야! 죽여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92269_Text
msgctxt "f60d1b77-4b96-4ed6-bcc9-43b6997f5778"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92270_Text
msgctxt "35c62db5-be42-482d-a23f-98aac16eef4f"
msgid "\"What happened to the village?\""
msgstr "\"마을에 무슨 일이 생긴 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92271_Text
msgctxt "123762ef-7d2d-4129-80c8-0f31376ccfa0"
msgid "\"How can I help you?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92272_Text
msgctxt "7f886d48-ef4d-4164-8f8d-24b95c2c2469"
msgid "[Leave without a word]"
msgstr "[말 없이 떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92276_Text
msgctxt "01548acb-d9ac-41dc-afe0-b9e717483a43"
msgid "\"Why do you hate fey so much?\""
msgstr "\"왜 페이를 그렇게 싫어하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92277_Text
msgctxt "1d47f4f0-d99a-4455-8828-94805e064823"
msgid ""
"[Put regular gold coins over the dead man's eyes] \"Just two coins? "
"Shouldn't be too hard.\""
msgstr "[시체의 눈에 평범한 금화를 올려놓습니다] \"고작 동전 두닢? 어려운 일은 아니군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92282_Text
msgctxt "518d44e9-f055-43f6-ab87-5f127bbf34e5"
msgid ""
"\"We've found some coins at the bottom of the well. Here, have a look.\""
msgstr "\"나는 우물에 동전을 몇 개 발견했다. 여기 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92285_Text
msgctxt "e4120a91-5677-4219-96d4-70c5bc860fca"
msgid "[Put the cursed coins on the dead man's eyes]"
msgstr "[저주받은 동전을 망자의 눈에 올려놓습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92286_Text
msgctxt "83ad4482-7c9e-4561-9ca4-8aa9a798183e"
msgid "\"Was it you who cursed Wilber and Callitropsia?\""
msgstr "\"윌버와 칼리트롭시아를 저주한 사람이 너였나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92288_Text
msgctxt "b8ba24fe-723c-4c54-b70e-f0a4d93e6bf6"
msgid "\"Who else has cursed Wilber, beside you?\""
msgstr "\"너 외에 누가 윌버를 저주 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92293_Text
msgctxt "0e107286-e7cd-485a-9dcb-fb14244d1933"
msgid "\"I've got some more questions for you.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 더 많은 질문이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92295_Text
msgctxt "3decf94e-d02c-4d20-b2ea-63e6ca1b2ecd"
msgid ""
"\"We've destroyed the coins to give final rest to the ghost of old man.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 노인의 유령에 영면을 주기 위해 동전을 파괴했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92297_Text
msgctxt "dfaf5f18-e137-4c71-a54b-12d883fd6458"
msgid "\"Where did you learn to curse people?\""
msgstr "\"사람들을 저주하는 것을 어디에서 배웠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92304_Text
msgctxt "37ce25cb-768a-4e47-9fe2-fdda46c463fd"
msgid ""
"\"I mourn your terrible fate. I'll pray to Pharasma that she might grant you "
"final rest.\""
msgstr "\"너의 끔찍한 운명은 애도한다. 파라즈마에게 기도해 너에게 영면을 주도록 기도할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92305_Text
msgctxt "ce1be5fd-00fc-443b-8061-ac9ad1528042"
msgid ""
"\"Urgathoa knows best upon whom to bestow her gift of undeath — but it "
"certainly seems to be wasted on you!\""
msgstr "\"우르가쏘아는 누구에게 언데드의 선물을 줄지 가장 잘 안다. 하지만 분명히 너에게는 낭비일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Answer_92306_Text
msgctxt "d83bfea4-4def-424f-ac2b-33d64d237bee"
msgid ""
"\"I mourn your terrible fate. I'll pray to Sarenrae that she might grant you "
"final rest.\""
msgstr "\"너의 끔찍한 운명은 애도한다. 서렌레이에게 기도해 너에게 영면을 주도록 기도할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92266_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "e5ea3ba6-d33a-41ba-85a7-5721d46a92f1"
msgid ""
"{n}A dead man staggers towards you. There is a gaping hole in the middle of "
"his chest, and you can see the white of bone through the tears in his "
"decayed flesh. He speaks with a halting, gurgling wheeze. {/n}\"Living one… "
"I do not want to harm you… help me...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}죽은 사람이 당신을 향해 비틀거리며 걸어옵니다. 가슴 중앙에는 구멍이 뚫려있어 그의 찢겨진 썩은 살 속의 뼈를 볼 수 있습니다. "
"그는 삐걱거리는 소리와 함께 말합니다.{/n} \"산 자여... 나는 너를 해치고 싶지 않다. 도와줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92273_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "1b46727b-0e0a-4883-888b-e5133ed1d38a"
msgid ""
"\"The fey said… I'll reach my final rest… when two coins… serve as my "
"eyelids… give me… just two coins...\""
msgstr ""
"\"페이가 말하길... 내가 마침내 영면에 들 것이라고 했다. 두 개의 동전이... 내 눈꺼풀 위에 올려지면... 두닢만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92274_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "fed34b10-653b-40c8-b09a-07f3c9ba02b5"
msgid ""
"{n}The man groans, and you see his hands twitch and curl into fists. {/n}"
"\"Fey… Damned fey… killed everyone… every single one… hate, hate them all... "
"hate the fey, hate the headman...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 사람은 탄식합니다. 당신은 그의 손이 꿈틀거리며 주먹이 쥐어지는 것을 보았습니다.{/n} \"페이... 저주받을 페이... 모든 "
"사람을 죽였어... 페이를 증오해... 놈들 모두를 증오해... 놈들의 우두머리도 마찬가지야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92279_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "98408ffb-d5fa-41ec-954b-66ff81b05ce1"
msgid ""
"{n}You put two coins over the dead man's eyes, but they fall from his "
"sockets to the ground. The dead man hisses. {/n}\"All lies… Damned fey… "
"Damned...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}시체의 눈 위에 동전 두 개를 올렸지만 동전은 눈 구멍 위에서 땅으로 떨어졌습니다. 시체가 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"모두 "
"거짓이었어... 젠장... 젠장할 페이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92280_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "d5575ff3-dfb9-461b-8d67-58de8dfa5c04"
msgid ""
"{n}The dead man utters a helpless groan, stretching out his arms toward "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}죽은 사람은 고통스럽게 신음하고 당신에게 팔을 뻗습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92281_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "5fb07099-ab89-4f15-a7cf-c29b61b9c04e"
msgid ""
"{n}The dead man stands before you and stares at you with his dry, unblinking "
"eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}죽은 사람은 당신 앞에서 서서 썩은 눈을 깜빡이지도 않고 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92283_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "594cdf01-e590-40a8-a30d-21ba08614e6d"
msgid ""
"{n}The dead man starts to shake — either with silent laughter or with silent "
"sobs, you cannot tell.{/n} \"Yes… there… I see...\"{n} He points at two of "
"the coins.{/n} \"These… give me… these...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}죽은 사람은 조용한 웃음인지 침묵의 울음 소리인지 모를 소리를 내며 들썩입니다.{/n} \"그래... 저기... 그렇군...\" "
"{n}그는 두 동전을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"이것들... 나에게... 이걸...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92287_Text
msgctxt "c1684c9c-8a39-4bb8-8cba-5999d707534b"
msgid ""
"\"Cursed... cuuurssssed... didn't know... thought it but a tale... I didn't "
"know it would work... so it was me... I killed... that beast from the "
"forest... and my Nyta too... and her bastard of a father... the whole "
"village... and me along with it... all my fault...\""
msgstr ""
"\"저주받았나... 몰랐다... 그저 소문이라고 생각했다... 나는 그것이 효과가 있다는 것을 몰랐다. 그래 결국 나였군.. 내가 "
"죽였어.. 숲의 그 짐승도... 그리고 나의 니타도...그녀의 아버지도... 마을사람들도... 그리고 나 자신까지도...모두 내 "
"잘못이야... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92290_Text
msgctxt "2f3c7449-8ae1-4ff2-8e7a-96ee1edbc025"
msgid ""
"{n}The coins evaporate, the coins on his eyes turning to mist. The dead man "
"gives a rattling sigh, then slumps to his knees.{/n} \"Th-thank… you...\""
msgstr "{n}동전들이 증발하고 눈위의 동전들이 안개로 바뀝니다. 죽은 사람은 한숨을 쉬고 무릎을 꿇습니다.{/n} \"고마워... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92291_Text
msgctxt "4535a78f-2da7-45b8-ad83-6d2d30c6fd99"
msgid ""
"{n}The coins evaporate, the coins on his eyes turning to mist. The dead man "
"gives a rattling sigh, then slumps to his knees.{/n} \"No… I'm… not… I do "
"not deserve this…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}동전들이 증발하고 눈위의 동전들이 안개로 바뀝니다. 죽은 사람은 한숨을 쉬고 무릎을 꿇습니다.{/n} \"아니... 나는... 이럴 "
"자격이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92292_Text
msgctxt "bfe72016-8ccf-4fa4-ab9d-4181828e0989"
msgid ""
"{n}The dead man stares at the coin inscribed by another's hand.{/n} \"Don't "
"know...\""
msgstr "{n}죽은 사람은 다른 사람의 손으로 새겨진 동전을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"모르겠다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92294_Text
msgctxt "00c37f39-ab34-49a2-9ec3-1a241ecb016f"
msgid "\"Ask...\""
msgstr "\"물어 봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92296_Text
msgctxt "95ce2a50-5db7-4838-abf7-f7d883d05413"
msgid ""
"\"So… I'll never rest… never… A-a-a-aaAAAHH!\"{n} With a heart-breaking "
"howl, the dead man lunges at you. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래서... 나는 절대 쉬지 못할 거야. 절대로... 아아아!\" {n}가슴 아픈 울부 짖는 소리를 지르며 죽은 사람이 당신에게 달려 "
"들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92298_Text
msgctxt "1a815364-cc6d-4f45-b292-0ef3f34fef59"
msgid ""
"\"Nowhere… just a tale… an old one… everyone knew it… but no, hold on...\""
msgstr "\"아무데도... 그냥 이야기라고... 옛날 이야기라고... 모두들 알았지만. 아니었어. 잠깐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92299_Text
msgctxt "56eb0946-792d-4b3e-8cdc-55018d030aa4"
msgid ""
"\"I recall now… I had a dream… a maiden… she told me to inscribe the names "
"on the coins… throw them to the well... and justice will be served... I "
"thought... her a good omen...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 지금 기억한다... 나는 꿈을 꾸었다... 한 젊은 여자가... 동전에 이름을 새기라고 했다... 우물에 던지라고... 그러면 "
"정의가 실현될 것이라고... 나는 그녀가 좋은 징조라고 생각했다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92300_Text
msgctxt "e43322bf-12b5-477c-b6f6-e72234c60d2f"
msgid ""
"\"That's good… Let him rest… And for me… everything is lost… So… Destroy "
"this body...\""
msgstr "\"좋아... 그를 쉬게 해줘... 그리고 나 때문에... 모든게 없어졌어... 그러니... 이 시체를 파괴하라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92303_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "3305d892-0238-4bd0-bb94-3f8a33bc2999"
msgid ""
"\"Undead are rarely pretty... But why do they also have to be so dumb?\""
msgstr "\"언데드들은 대개 예쁘지 않아... 하지만 왜 그들은 벙어리일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92307_Text
msgctxt "df8e15fb-c1ce-4720-95aa-88b6f8c77475"
msgid ""
"\"Prayed to Erastil... when alive... God didn't save me... Didn't save...\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸에게 기도했건만... 살아있을 때... 신은 나를 구원하지 않았다... 난 구원을 얻지 못했다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_92308_Text
msgctxt "792064fd-fdce-4f4a-9908-ea7f32e7fa3d"
msgid "\"Prayed... to every god and goddess... Nobody helped... Nobody...\""
msgstr "\"모든 신과 여신에게 기도했다. 아무도 돕지 않았다. 아무도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_Dorsy_hates_Wilbur_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "aad6d856-793a-44eb-bdd3-cad10ffb0900"
msgid ""
"{n}The dead man's decayed hands sink into the edges of the huge hole on his "
"chest.{/n} \"The fey... Stole my bride... Killed her... Killed me... the "
"whole village... and the headman, the bastard... helped them... sold his own "
"daughter to the fey... Nyta, my love... evil, all of them, how I hate them..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}죽은 사람의 부패한 손은 가슴에 있는 거대한 구멍의 가장자리에 걸쳐집니다.{/n} \"페이가... 내 신부를 훔쳤다. 그녀를 "
"죽였어... 나를 죽였어. 마을 전체가... 그리고 촌장이... 그 망할 인간이... 도와 줬어. 자기 딸을 페이에게 팔았다... 니타. "
"내 사랑... 전부, 나쁜 녀석들, 내가 그들을 얼마나 싫어하는지... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_Dorsy_name_Text
#. Speaker : LonelyGhoul_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "ba1588bb-780a-4d21-b953-3bd472c9e72d"
msgid ""
"\"I was… I had a name… Dorsy… had a bride… now I'm no one, alone… less than "
"no one...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 나는 이름을 가지고 있었다.... 도르시... 신부를 가졌다... 지금 나는 아무도 아니다. 혼자 있다... 아무도 "
"아니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/LonelyGhoul/Cue_truth-Nita_ghoul_Text
msgctxt "05daad16-b807-4b09-808a-f56be4dcf055"
msgid ""
"\"I… do not deserve rest… the headman, he's… old… like me… take these coins "
"to him... give him final rest... I... I'll stay…here...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 휴식을 취할 자격이 없어... 촌장이... 그는... 나처럼 나이들었어... 이 동전을 그에게 가져 가라. 그를 마지막으로 "
"쉬게 해라. 나는... 내가 여기있을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_12202_Text
msgctxt "99169c4e-28ab-43af-98a4-62bbda41829b"
msgid "[Leave] \"Farewell.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_20577_Text
msgctxt "f9bbe302-a0ab-4b79-8edc-39750c92a30c"
msgid "[Give her the mushrooms] \"Here are your black rattlecaps.\""
msgstr "[버섯을 건네준다] \"여기 검은색 딸랑이 모자버섯이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_31627_Text
msgctxt "94bb5796-fb74-4fb7-9803-789852e83ee2"
msgid "\"How can I help you, good woman?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_39453_Text
msgctxt "d2d77d0b-67aa-493c-bcf0-40ff3f925e20"
msgid "[Give her the herbs] \"Here are your herbs, three bundles of each.\""
msgstr "[여자에게 허브를 줍니다] \"여기 각각 3묶음이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_63905_Text
msgctxt "a77f8012-f6c5-4bac-a50a-3cdf4538a50f"
msgid ""
"[Show the herb you've found at the swamp] \"This seems to be an unusual "
"herb. Can you tell me what it is?\""
msgstr "[늪에서 발견한 허브를 보여줍니다] \"이건 뭔가 보기드문 허브인 것 같아. 이게 뭔지 알려줄 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_84320_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "273722cd-2ddb-4055-a439-ce8f48f90166"
msgid "Killed the swamp witch."
msgstr "늪 마녀를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_84320_Text
msgctxt "d872ab7f-f5dd-4ccc-853c-4308d2a13a65"
msgid "[Attack] \"My lands will be safer without you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 땅은 너 없이 더 안전해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97195_Text
msgctxt "745f2364-08ef-4525-a12f-6c49c6072098"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97196_Text
msgctxt "ce9cd167-c5f2-4f0e-b226-68bbda43af20"
msgid "\"I've got a question for you...\""
msgstr "\"너에게 질문이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97207_Text
msgctxt "d002a55d-48ff-4cf2-afdf-30001316ee12"
msgid ""
"\"As far as I've heard, a daughter of a human and a fey used to live here. "
"Her name was Elga Verniex. Are you her?\""
msgstr "\"내가 들었을 때 인간의 딸과 페이가 함께 살았다고 했어. 그녀의 이름은 엘가 베르니엑스라는군. 네가 그 여자야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97208_Text
msgctxt "073ffdc5-b01d-406b-bf94-0e16e146409f"
msgid ""
"[Give her the letter] \"A dryad named Tiressia remembers you and would be "
"glad to see you again. She asked me to give you this letter.\""
msgstr ""
"[그녀에게 편지를 줍니다] \"티레시아라는 드라이어드가 너를 기억하는데 다시 만난다면 기뻐할 거야. 그녀는 나에게 너에게 이 편지를 "
"보내달라고 부탁했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97209_Text
msgctxt "5ffcfd91-f64a-4778-8598-88ca6a3833aa"
msgid "\"Take a look at these coins — we found them at the bottom of a well.\""
msgstr "\"이 동전들을 살펴봐. 우물 바닥에서 발견했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97210_Text
msgctxt "ce9f7865-7fc1-484e-a4b8-72e5ac8adf7a"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97211_Text
msgctxt "357ffdf5-32fc-422b-9823-7a6c2e1c0fce"
msgid "[Trade] \"How much for your potions?\""
msgstr "[거래] \"너의 포션은 얼마지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97217_Text
msgctxt "35ed29e4-53c7-47a0-91ec-61d79b52b281"
msgid ""
"[Tell her about the coins] \"I've learned what happened to the village, "
"slain the monster, and freed a cursed soul...\""
msgstr "[그녀에게 코인에 대해 말합니다] \"마을에 무슨 일이 일어 났는지 들어서 괴물을 죽이고 저주받은 영혼을 풀어주었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97220_Text
msgctxt "5aebc4f9-7009-4752-98a1-e1e40c8db4cf"
msgid "\"Dorsy. He was the one who cursed Wilber and Callitropsia.\""
msgstr "\"도르시. 그는 윌버와 칼리트롭시아를 저주한 사람이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97221_Text
msgctxt "df888674-d4cb-446d-b938-487093e34d32"
msgid ""
"\"Nyta. If she hadn't cast Dorsy aside, none of this would have happened.\""
msgstr "\"니타. 그녀가 도르시를 버리지 않았다면 이런 일은 일어나지 않았을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97222_Text
msgctxt "1730a26d-bd97-45b3-899a-3ba17e5c88b3"
msgid ""
"\"Wilber. He's been stalling with the decision for too long, and in the end "
"everyone started hating him.\""
msgstr "\"윌버. 그는 너무 오랫동안 그 결정으로 아픔을 겪어왔고 결국에 모두가 그를 미워하기 시작했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97223_Text
msgctxt "3e3af5c3-3541-4e84-ad89-0f378a09acec"
msgid ""
"\"Callitropsia. She's put a spell on Nyta and has stolen her from Dorsy.\""
msgstr "\"칼리트롭시아. 그녀가 니타에게 마법을 걸어 도르시로부터 니타를 훔쳐간거야\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97224_Text
msgctxt "8434541c-bb21-4841-bb4b-06963a2cb3aa"
msgid "\"Why bring this all up again? That's not important anymore.\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 이야기를 다시 꺼내는 거지? 이제는 더 이상 중요하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97232_Text
msgctxt "e0201cb7-a837-4fe3-a6aa-22906241fb1b"
msgid "\"Maybe something else has destroyed the village?\""
msgstr "\"어쩌면 다른 것이 마을을 파괴한 것일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_97237_Text
msgctxt "442e5ada-d24c-4c8b-86f7-cf2e0fc124a6"
msgid "\"What do you think?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Answer_SwampWitchNotGuilty_Text
msgctxt "102f698c-35c2-4685-933c-ec97813b6e56"
msgid "\"I'm looking for a lost child. Have you seen him by chance?\""
msgstr "\"나는 잃어버린 아이를 찾고 있다. 그를 보았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_18991_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "6adb09ca-dbe7-4dc7-8633-6dcba12643b9"
msgid ""
"{n}The old woman smells the mushrooms and takes a small bite. She chews on "
"it slowly for a moment, then grins, a gleam in her eye.{/n} \"Hah! Strong! "
"These will be good, all right!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노파는 버섯 냄새를 맡고 맛을 봅니다. 그녀는 천천히 씹고는 웃으며 눈에서 빛을 냅니다.{/n} \"하! 물건이군! 좋은 약이 될 "
"거야. 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_29059_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "f9d4d4dd-eae1-4f5f-803d-0c223fdaddc3"
msgid ""
"\"Well, now we're talking! Much better than poking around where you don't "
"belong, nattering on like a fool... here, look!\" {n}She pulls a black, "
"oddly-wrinkled mushroom from a bag on her belt — it has an odd smell about "
"it that makes your eyes tear up.{/n} \"This — this is a black rattlecap. The "
"sporepods inside — the best thing for the lungs — and the skin. Me, I use "
"them for tea. They're rare, though, but they grow thickest at the {g|Mud "
"Bowl}Mud Bowl{/g}, east of here. Get me... at least ten... yes, ten, then "
"we'll talk!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 얘기가 통하는구나! 바보처럼 여기저기 쑤시고 다니는 것보다 훨씬 나아... 여기 봐!\" {n}그녀는 검고 이상한 주름이 잡힌 "
"버섯을 가방에서 꺼냅니다. 이것에서 눈물이 날 정도로 이상한 냄새가 납니다.{/n} \"이것은 검은 딸랑이 버섯이야. 안쪽의 포자는 폐와 "
"피부에 가장 좋은 것이야. 나는 차로 우려먹지. 이건 희귀하고 동쪽의 {g|Mud Bowl} 진흙탕{/g}에서 가장 많이 나. 나에게 "
"구해다주면... 적어도 10개는 말이지. 그러면 얘기를 해 보자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_59337_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "15cd0873-512b-420a-a245-e7bc81efe5a3"
msgid ""
"{n}The old woman claps her hands and grins, revealing a row of brown, uneven "
"teeth.{/n} \"There's a good {mf|boy|girl}! Did it take a lot of time to find "
"them, eh? Give them here, I'll put them to a good use...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 여자는 손뼉을 치며 어긋나고 누런 이를 보이며 웃습니다.{/n} \"참 착한 아이구나! 찾는 데 어렵지는 않았어? 그것들을 "
"여기에 놓아. 그러면 내가 좋은 용도로 사용하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97189_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "1e645860-e1af-4346-aaab-f846977071b2"
msgid ""
"{n}She takes the herb between her bony fingers, sniffs it, then gives you an "
"approving nod.{/n} \"You've got a good eye! The herb is useful, but not by "
"itself. Look here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 앙상한 손가락으로 약초를 가져와서 냄새를 맡고 당신에게 동의하는 듯 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"너는 좋은 눈을 가졌구나! "
"허브는 유용하지만,그 자체로는 아니다. 여기 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97190_Text
msgctxt "b37630a6-3bd8-4e70-bcb4-71d2cb2e6205"
msgid ""
"\"So — what in damnation are you doing here?\" {n}The old woman squints at "
"you with disapproval. Her hair is a tangle of grey, and her wrinkled skin is "
"an unusual shade of green. Both her eyebrows and ears taper to points.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이런 빌어먹을 여기서 뭐하는 거야?\" {n}노인이 비웃음을 지으며 당신을 빤히 보았습니다. 그녀의 머리카락은 지저분한 회색이었고 "
"주름진 피부는 비정상적으로 녹색 그늘져 있습니다. 그녀의 눈썹과 귀는 끝이 가느다랗 습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97191_Text
msgctxt "5aebfcc0-678b-423a-a2c3-869292f720ee"
msgid ""
"\"You have no business prowling around here...\" {n}Her eyes narrow.{/n} "
"\"What are you — a thief? Bandit?\" {n}She studies you, then hisses in her "
"throat.{/n} \"Hell take you if you're a tax collector.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기에선 별 볼 일도 없어.\" {n}그녀의 눈은 좁아집니다.{/n} \"너는 뭐야? 도둑? 산적?\" {n}그녀는 당신을 살펴보고는 "
"위협하는 소리를 냅니다.{/n} \"세금 징수원이라면 지옥에나 가버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97192_Text
msgctxt "8774b6e2-5dc5-4bdd-9118-09f68f1395b5"
msgid ""
"\"You again? Hmph. I'd offer you tea, but I don't have any. How about a cup "
"of deathcap tincture instead?\" {n}She gives a splintered grin.{/n} \"Best "
"thing for health!\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 너냐? 네게 차를 대접하고 싶지만 지금은 없다. 대신 독버섯 약병 한 잔은 어때?\" {n}그녀는 낄낄거립니다.{/n} \"건강에 "
"좋은 거란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97197_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "ba321709-3022-4cff-8dc6-c04b2c36dcea"
msgid ""
"\"Me, eh? I'm just a harmless old woman, hoping for some peace and quiet… "
"the 'Old Beldame,' they call me, and that's fine — been called worse in my "
"life. Why are you asking? What fool's errand brings you all the way out here?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나? 나는 평온을 바라는 무해한 노파야... 나를 마귀 할멈이라고 부르지. 괜찮아 더 나쁜 소리도 들어 봤으니까. 왜 묻는 거야? "
"도대체 무슨 일로 온 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97198_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "8dc10c22-e533-4ee9-beb3-f57b698f0469"
msgid ""
"{n}The old woman frowns.{/n} \"The 'Old Beldame' they call me when they "
"aren't calling me worse — hag, witch — accusing me of fornicating with "
"demons, stealing children...\" {n}She grunts.{/n} \"Came here to be as far "
"away from gossips like that, but wasn't far enough. There's you knocking at "
"my door — and just recent, some other fool came — begged me to buy his soul, "
"can you believe it? Hnh! Is it too much to ask for some peace and quiet...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 여자가 찡그립니다.{/n} \"보통은 나를 마귀 할멈이라고 부르지. 더 심할 때는 데몬랑 짜고 애들을 납치하는 마녀라고 "
"하고...\" {n}그녀는 불평합니다.{/n} \"여기 와서 그런 소문을 듣지는 않게 되었지만 더 멀리 가야했나 봐. 너 같은 녀석이 "
"우리집 문을 두드리지 않나 최근에는 다른 바보가 와서 영혼을 사달라고 간청하질 않나. 조용하게 살 수가 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97199_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "60425dc6-5b58-42a7-a18a-ae1715bfabdd"
msgid ""
"\"A boy? What would I do with a brat, pickle him in a jar? That's rich!\" {n}"
"She gives a rattling laugh.{/n} \"Where is it written if an old woman likes "
"a little peace and quiet, she must be a child-stealing witch?\""
msgstr ""
"\"소년? 내가 항아리 안의 피클 같은 꼬마와 무슨 관련이 있겠어! 있겠다면 좋겠군!\" {n}그녀는 낄낄거립니다.{/n} \"노파가 "
"평화롭고 조용한 것을 좋아하면 아이를 납치한다는 법이라도 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97200_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "b6799244-2141-42ab-aa4e-9845a7754348"
msgid ""
"\"Just look at {mf|him|her} — {mf|he|she}'s got a question!\" {n}Her lip "
"curls in a sneer.{/n} \"What makes you think I've any answers for one such "
"as you, scrabbling at my door like a beggar? Have you done anything good for "
"me recently? You've nothing for me, and you're nothing TO me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"질문이 있으면 뭐!\" {n}그녀의 입술은 비웃음으로 구부러집니다.{/n} \"거지처럼 문 앞에서 구걸하는 너 같은 녀석에게 할 "
"대답이 있을 거라고 생각해? 내가 너에게 빚이라도 졌어? 너는 나와 아무 관련이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97201_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "daa06c43-2cbd-4878-a1b6-c45f907977aa"
msgid ""
"\"Who knows what could have snatched up a child?! Mayhap he's been eaten by "
"goblins, or lured to the swamp by the wandering lights! Or maybe his poor, "
"sobbing mother with all her false tears strangled him in his sleep, then put "
"him to bed with a shovel somewhere deep in the forest and now looks for "
"someone to mantle the blame? Go to her, squeeze answers from her, make HER "
"tell where her whelp is, but don't be bothering me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아이를 잡아 먹을 수 있는 것이 무엇인지 누가 알겠어? 고블린에게 먹혔거나 도깨비불이 떠다니는 늪에 꾀여 빠졌나보지! 아니면 거짓 "
"눈물을 흘리는 아이 애미가 잠결에 아이를 목졸라 죽이고 숲 어딘가에 파묻고는 비난할 사람을 찾는 게 아닌가? 그녀에게 가서 그녀를 쥐어짜 "
"봐. 그녀의 자식 새끼가 어디에 있는지 말하게 해. 나를 괴롭히지 말고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97202_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "8ed62eb3-aa5b-4378-9a1c-086bcb6a48f9"
msgid ""
"\"See, I've never done any harm to anyone without a good reason. Others have "
"tried to harm me... they regretted it afterwards, that's certain, but folk "
"never learn. Ohh, what should I say... \" {n}With a sour expression, the old "
"woman waves her wrinkled greenish hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 아무 이유없이 사람들에게 해를 입히지 않았다. 다른 사람들은 나를 해치려고 했지... 결국 그들은 후회할 거야. 하지만 주민들은 "
"절대 이해하지 못하지. 뭐라고 말을 해야 할까.\" {n}늙은 여인은 떫은 표정을 지으며 주름진 손으로 손사래를 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97204_Text
msgctxt "6c243f76-0473-4307-aefb-1d7c13e2d0c6"
msgid ""
"{n}She shows you three different herbs.{/n} \"This one's mudleaf. That there "
"is gloomberry. And that — that's the dizzyhead, one guess what it does. If "
"you can find three bundles of each — bring them to me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 세 가지 다른 약초를 보여줍니다.{/n} \"이건 머드리프야. 저건 글룸베리야. 이건 디지헤드야. 세가지를 한묶음씩 찾아서 "
"나에게 가져와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97206_Text
msgctxt "f14200e7-20a6-4d61-8df1-1ea1fb6d2536"
msgid "\"Good riddance!\""
msgstr "\"좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97213_Text
msgctxt "bfa557d0-1102-4a71-809f-c69fe56b7ffe"
msgid ""
"{n}Elga opens the letter, runs her eyes over it, and her expression "
"shifts... it could be either a smile or a grimace.{/n} \"So, that's how it "
"is... Well, what does it matter now...\" {n}She gives a rattling sigh.{/n} "
"\"Oh, Tiressia... I should visit her someday... yes.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘가는 편지를 열고 내용을 훑더니 표정이 바뀝니다... 웃음일 수도 슬픔일 수도 있습니다.{/n} \"그렇구나... 뭐, 이제와서 "
"다 무슨 소용일까...\" {n}그녀는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"오, 티레시아... 언젠가 그녀를 만나러 가야겠어... 그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97214_Text
msgctxt "a4229048-865c-4806-8fb7-68daddc281de"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh, foul evil that is!\" {n}She spits on the floor.{/n} \"I don't know "
"which magic is that, but it has the feel of a curse — or something even "
"something worse! Keep it away from me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"더럽고 사악한 자식!\" {n}그녀는 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"어떤 마법인지는 모르지만 저주, 아니 더 사악한 기운이 "
"느껴지는군! 나한테서 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97215_Text
msgctxt "288b2c2c-9551-47aa-a3cc-319a64291968"
msgid ""
"\"I've no idea. Used to be a village here once — good folk, well-off but not "
"so well-off to put on airs... they were at peace with the fey — even had "
"festivals, celebrated with them... but that was long ago — six or seven "
"dozen years, at least.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 모르겠어. 한때 이곳에 살았던 좋은 사람들이 있었지. 친절하지만 대놓고 친절하지는 않은 사람들... 그들은 페이와 평화롭게 "
"살았어. 축제도 같이 열고 축하도 함께 했었고... 하지만 그건 80년도 더 된 얘기야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97216_Text
msgctxt "a21f73de-fc9d-4abe-af76-66e4d85895d3"
msgid ""
"\"As for what ruined them — I don't know. Got a guess, though. In the "
"darkest nights, strange sounds come from deep in the woods — crackling and "
"moaning, as if a great tree is twisting its roots, rattling its branches "
"like bones. There's something there... a creature that drove away folk and "
"fey alike.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들을 망쳐 놓은 것에 관해서는 나는 몰라. 적어도 짐작할 수는 있어. 가장 어두운 밤에 이상한 소리가 우거진 숲 속 깊은 곳에서 "
"나와. 마치 거대한 나무가 그 뿌리를 뒤틀고 나뭇 가지를 마치 뼈처럼 덜커덕 움직이는 것 같은 소리지. 거기에 뭐가가 있어... 주민과 "
"페이를 몰아낸 어떤 생명체가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97218_Text
msgctxt "8e7a0cb6-3065-4af0-aff6-815d134c7083"
msgid ""
"{n}She listens to your tale, nodding her head.{/n} \"So, that's how it all "
"happened... A scary thing it is, this curse and all. It would seem just a "
"tall tale... but here we are — the village is gone! So who's to blame, you "
"think?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 당신의 이야기를 듣고 머리를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래서 그렇게 모든 일이 일어난 거야... 그저 긴 이야기처럼 들릴지 "
"모르겠지만... 모두 사실이고 마을이 폐허로 변했지. 이게 누구의 책임일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97226_Text
msgctxt "a09573d3-acb8-4c35-9bf6-151b173b8cf7"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe, maybe... But the hatred may be well-earned, or at least seemed to "
"be! Put yourself in his boots, see it through his eyes — fey are dragging "
"your beloved to the forest, her fool of a father helping them... the fellow "
"must have truly believed he was saving her!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쩌면 그럴지도 모르지.어쩌면..하지만 그의 증오는 충분히 그럴만 했는지도 모르지. 그가 되어 그의 눈을 통해 한번 봐봐. 페이가 "
"너의 사랑하는 사람을 숲으로 끌고가고 있어. 그녀의 바보같은 아버지는 오히려 그들을 도와주고 있고..그 녀석은 틀림없이 자신이 그녀를 "
"구할 수 있다고 진심으로 믿고 있었을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97227_Text
msgctxt "520b5f84-69ca-4d54-a722-54869223ec1f"
msgid ""
"\"The heart wants what it wants, right? A girl falls in love, then the "
"passion fades — happens all the time. The worst thing is she's cursed her "
"own father — that's wicked, true. But her love must have been fierce if it "
"gave birth to such a burning hate!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마음은 끌리는 대로 가는 것 알지? 한 여자가 사랑에 빠지고 그 열정은 곧 사라지고 — 언제나 흔하게 일어나는 일이지. 최악은 그녀가 "
"자신의 아버지를 저주했다는 거야 — 사악하지만 그게 사실이지. 하지만 그 정도로 불타는 증오를 낳았다는 건 그만큼 그녀의 사랑도 "
"뜨거웠다는 것이겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97228_Text
msgctxt "5fafb8b2-6817-4347-9a07-ddac1c049be1"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Wilber was always a coward. He didn't want to hurt anyone, but in so "
"doing, he hurt everyone and got retribution from both sides — his daughter "
"and her groom… But he wished well to everyone, right? It wasn't his hatred "
"that fueled the curse...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 윌버는 항상 겁쟁이였어. 그는 누구에게도 상처 주기를 원하지 않았지만 그것이 오히려 모두에게 상처를 주는게 되어버렸지. 결국 "
"그녀의 딸과 신랑, 양쪽 모두에게 저주를 받았지만 사실 그는 모두가 잘 되기를 바랐겠지? 저주를 부추긴 건 그의 증오가 아니었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97229_Text
msgctxt "ddb9724b-41d7-4618-aa6b-856231385fc0"
msgid ""
"\"Stolen, huh? A bride's not a sack of potatoes, she's got a mind of her own "
"— she could decide for herself whom she liked more!\" {n}She grunts.{/n} "
"\"And as for putting a spell on Nyta — I don't believe it. I've seen how "
"people act under a love-binding spell... So, though I haven't seen this "
"whole story with my own eyes, I still believe it was born from true love.\""
msgstr ""
"\"도둑맞았다고? 신부는 감자 포대기가 아니야. 그녀는 자신만의 마음을 가지고 있고 자신이 누구를 더 좋아하는지 스스로 결정할 수 있어!"
"\"{n}그녀는 투덜거립니다.{/n} \"그리고 니타에게 주문을 걸었다니 믿을 수가 없군. 내 두눈으로 보지 않았어도 훤하다. 진정한 "
"사랑에서 나온 행동이라고 나는 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97230_Text
msgctxt "5144f2a5-1ba1-4f4d-92cc-4bed95b778de"
msgid ""
"\"That's true. What's done can't be undone — those who were right and those "
"who were wrong, all got more than they deserved... you may have lifted the "
"curse, but it had done its work. No people will live here for a long time... "
"except for ones such as me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아. 이미 벌어진 일은 되돌릴 수가 없지. 누가 옳았던 잘못했던 그들은 받아야 할 것을 받았지... 네가 저주를 풀어줄 수도 "
"있었겠지만 이미 끝난 일이지. 어차피 누구도 이런곳에서 오래 살지는 못할 거야... 나 같은 사람이면 모를까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97231_Text
msgctxt "f5b5f316-3f41-4403-bd39-61ec1b972eb0"
msgid "\"So, what would you say now? Who is to blame?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너는 뭐라고 말할 거야? 누구의 탓이겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97233_Text
msgctxt "29047651-89e0-4a82-a438-99a2fa6ce367"
msgid ""
"\"Now that's clever of you — you're sharper than I took you for. You're "
"right, Dorsy wasn't a mage — why would his curse come true, and with such "
"strength?\" {n}She raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"Turning a dryad queen into a "
"monster is not a simple curse, like making neighbor's knees ache when he "
"tells a lie.\" {n}She sniffs, and her voice drops.{/n} \"'Sides, the air in "
"these parts feels wrong, like... no, no, never mind, we should speak no more "
"about it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"영리하구나. 생각보다 더 날카로워. 네 말이 맞다. 도르시는 마법사가 아니야. 하지만 왜 그의 저주가 그런 힘을 가지고 실현되었을까?"
"\" {n}그녀는 한 쪽 눈썹을 치켜올립니다.{/n} \"드라이어드 퀸을 괴물로 바꾸는 것은 거짓말을 한 이웃의 무릎을 쑤시게 하는 "
"것처럼 간단한 저주가 아니다.\" {n}그녀는 킁킁거리며 낮은 목소리 높이를 낮춥니다.{/n} \"그런데 이곳의 공기가 이상한데, "
"마치.. 아니, 아니. 신경 쓰지마. 우린 그것에 관해 더 이상 이야기하면 안될 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97235_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "a0ec17a1-2bd1-4635-9536-7aff4d6ae33b"
msgid ""
"{n}She's shaking with indignation. She's a proud woman, you can tell that "
"easily, and the fact she's breaking composure makes you sure she's telling "
"the truth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 분노로 떨고 있습니다. 그녀는 자신감 넘치는 여성이며 침착하지 않은 것을 보아 진실을 말하는 것임을 알 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97236_Text
#. Speaker : SwampWitch
msgctxt "1aa9d180-494e-45eb-911f-112b8381c153"
msgid ""
"{n}Her answer rings with indignation, but you can't tell if it is genuine or "
"not.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그녀의 대답은 분노로 울리지만 그것이 진짜인지 아닌지는 말할 수 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_97238_Text
msgctxt "2c52a581-2999-478d-a179-967b101a29c5"
msgid ""
"{n}The old woman slowly smiles and shakes her head — now, more than ever, "
"she reminds you of a fey of the forest. {/n}\"It's not up to me — judging "
"folk. Gods can judge — it's easy for them, for they know everything. The "
"young folks can judge as well — it's even easier for them, for they know "
"nothing. And I... I just keep it all in my memory.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노파는 천천히 미소지며 그녀의 머리를 흔듭니다. 그녀는 어느 때보다도 더 숲의 페이를 떠올리게 합니다.{/n} \"사람들을 판단하는 "
"것은 내게 달린 것이 아니야. 신이 판단할 일이지. 그들은 모든 것을 알고 있으니까 쉽게 판단 할 수 있어. 젊은 사람들도 판단할 수 "
"있지. 그들은 아무것도 모르니까 훨씬 더 쉽게 판단 할 수 있어. 난... 단지 기억에 다 간직하고만 있을 뿐..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_Beldame_pleased_Text
msgctxt "78e48cf9-6b3e-4d0e-bc7a-949427747f9e"
msgid ""
"{n}After her new herbs are tucked away, she seems a bit more pleasant, even "
"gives a gap-toothed smile.{/n} \"That's a proper greeting — trading favors! "
"Help me, and I help you... so what did you want to know, hm? Ask, I know the "
"area, might be able to help you on your way. Or maybe you need some potions? "
"Nothing cheap, but nothing you can't afford — and they do the trick, they do!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀가 새로운 약초를 받고난 후 그녀의 모습은 즐거워보였고 심지어 입을 헤 벌리며 웃습니다.{/n} \"적절한 인사치레구나. 거래는 "
"즐겁지! 서로 돕고 돕는 것이지... 그래서 무엇을 알고 싶다고? 나는 네가 어디로 가야 할지 길을 알려줄 수 있어. 아니면 포션이 "
"필요한가? 싼 건 없지만 모두 고급이야. 마법처럼 잘 들을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitch/Cue_Elga_name_confirmed_Text
msgctxt "492e946e-2c71-4f53-af2e-7cfaf74d21df"
msgid ""
"{n}The Old Beldame averts her eyes.{/n} \"Might be me...\" {n}She sighs.{/n} "
"\"...or might not. What's the difference… who would still remember that "
"name...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 늙은 노파는 시선을 피합니다.{/n} \"나일지도 몰라...\" {n}그녀는 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"... 아니면 아닐 "
"수도 있지. 뭔 차이가 있나... 누가 그 이름을 기억해 주겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Answer_15638_Text
msgctxt "a9bf80d9-1000-4e91-9e49-81556ffde719"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Answer_80131_Text
msgctxt "56bb6aee-c0e4-4eed-83ec-88d728687044"
msgid "[Ring the bell]"
msgstr "[종을 울린다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Answer_91390_Text
msgctxt "00f6c363-2653-4a9e-ac72-6e0e77abd4a3"
msgid "[Open the gate and enter]"
msgstr "[문을 열고 들어간다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Answer_95199_Text
msgctxt "0cd20122-ef32-4195-98c0-5911e6f5ed88"
msgid "[Gently throw a little pebble at the window]"
msgstr "[창문에 조약돌을 던져 두드린다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Answer_99529_Text
msgctxt "b617e227-e66c-4cf5-8a2c-2e976944d55f"
msgid "\"Anyone here?\""
msgstr "\"아무도 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Answer_99530_Text
msgctxt "e3f8ef28-d3b0-4cbf-9a65-30702a9b2542"
msgid "[Detect Magic] \"Let's see if there's any enchantments on this gate…\""
msgstr "[마법 탐지] \"이 문에 어떤 마법이 있는지 보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Answer_99532_Text
msgctxt "24192f3d-1352-4d16-9fee-3eb365319f8e"
msgid "[Detect Magic] \"That scarecrow looks like it might be trouble…\""
msgstr "[마법 탐지] \"허수아비가 문제가 될 것 같은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_13978_Text
msgctxt "a5caa02f-0b1a-44ed-91d8-bb2a25412ca9"
msgid ""
"{n}The pebble hits the window with a KLAK. After several moments, the door "
"creaks open and an old woman with a tangle of grey hair and greenish skin "
"steps out — her eyebrows and ears taper to sharp points. {/n}\"Who's causing "
"all this mischief?\" {n}The woman scans the porch with a baleful eye, and "
"her gaze locks on the pebble.{/n} \"Throwing rocks now?! What, you think "
"that bell hanging there is just for show?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조약돌은 창문을 때립니다. 잠시 후에 문이 삐걱거리며 열리고 회색 머리카락과 짙은 녹색 피부의 노파가 나옵니다. 그녀의 눈썹과 귀는 "
"끝부분이 뾰족합니다.{/n} \"누가 장난을 치는 거야?\" {n}여인은 베란다를 살피다 조약돌에 시선을 고정시킵니다.{/n} \"돌을 "
"던져?! 초인종은 폼으로 달고 있는 줄 아나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_44974_Text
msgctxt "89377628-a03b-4756-8343-0533272bf35a"
msgid ""
"\"What in everlasting damnation…?!\" {n}After a few moments, the door creaks "
"open and an old woman with a tangle of grey hair and greenish skin steps "
"out.{/n}"
msgstr "\"정말 시끄럽구나...\" {n}잠시 후 문이 삐걱 열리고 회색 머리카락과 짙은 녹색 피부의 노파가 걸어나옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_53527_Text
msgctxt "61f584a0-51c5-4c1c-99fe-1264c7aa9f6e"
msgid "{n}No matter how loud you shout, no one answers.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아무리 큰소리로 외쳐도 아무도 대답하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_85544_Text
msgctxt "d50fbd9a-8cf5-44ad-b49c-7e6219782a87"
msgid ""
"{n}Your aim is true, but you've put too much strength in your throw — the "
"window shatters! You hear shrill curses from inside the house.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}정확히 던졌지만 너무 많은 힘을 쏟았습니다. 창문이 부서졌습니다! 집 안으로부터 새된 저주 소리가 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_90918_Text
msgctxt "8f8f7e9a-59dd-4d19-8e0c-1440fb0bb81b"
msgid ""
"{n}This house differs from the others — it's the only one that looks "
"habitable. A low, almost-defeated fence rings it, smoke rises from the "
"chimney, and you can smell what could be a stew — heavily spiced. Even glass "
"windows, adorned with drapes, are intact. A small, dented brass bell hangs "
"near the front gate, and a well-swept path leads from the gate to the door "
"of the house. Along the side of the house lies a garden — vegetables, it "
"seems — and in the middle of the garden, you see a scarecrow with black "
"stones for eyes and a wicked grin stitched on its burlap face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 집은 다른 집과 다릅니다. 유일하게 거주할 만한 집입니다. 낮고 거의 망가진 울타리가 집을 둘러쳤고, 굴뚝에서 연기가 나오고, "
"향신료를 세게 친 스튜 냄새도 납니다. 심지어 커튼이 장식된, 온전한 유리창도 있습니다. 작은 놋쇠 종이 대문 앞에 걸려있었고, 잘 쓸린 "
"길은 대문에서 집 문까지 이어집니다. 집 옆에 정원이 있습니다. 야채가 있는 것 같습니다. 정원의 한가운데에는, 삼베로 만든 얼굴에 검은 "
"돌로 눈을 만들고 사악한 미소를 꿰맨 허수아비가 서있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_99531_Text
msgctxt "9d7ef7d7-74e9-4b3d-9ef5-96a35be4fa07"
msgid ""
"{n}The gate and the bell bear a simple enchantment that alerts the caster — "
"presumably the owner of the house — about uninvited guests.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}대문과 종은 초대받지 않은 손님들을 집 주인에게 알리는 간단한 마법을 지니고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_99533_Text
msgctxt "3220ad5c-4f6d-4787-ba4e-60769c379c60"
msgid ""
"{n}The scarecrow's aura is strong, almost like a lightning flash to your "
"senses. It is not a bundle of sticks and rags — it's a dangerous ward to "
"protect the home from trespassers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}허수아비의 기운이 번개처럼 강렬합니다. 그것은 막대기와 넝마가 아닙니다. 침입자로부터 집을 보호하는 위험한 와드입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_99535_Text
msgctxt "3df4351f-6a81-45eb-b816-6f0f1c4fafd4"
msgid ""
"{n}As you snap the gate, you hear a slow creak and the snapping of tree "
"branches — the scarecrow has stepped from its pole! Its stitched grin "
"splits, revealing a wicked row of teeth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}문을 닫을 때 당신은 나뭇가지로 두드리는 소리와 삐걱거리는 소리를 듣습니다. 허수아비가 걸어오는 것이었습니다! 그것의 꿰매어진 "
"미소는 갈라져서 사악한 이빨을 드러냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchEntrance/Cue_99537_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cd4f2820-daeb-4eef-985e-df67e3323230"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! Great throw! That smashed it to pieces! Nice!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 좋았어! 산산 조각 냈어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Answer_01985_Text
msgctxt "12d3be1b-7c86-4d20-b4e0-9c9bedbd9fca"
msgid "[Apply your knowledge of magic and try to pick the herb carefully]"
msgstr "[마법지식을 동원해 허브를 세심히 고릅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Answer_35781 1_Text
msgctxt "963102df-fec8-4e1f-9742-eed9682e7f5f"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Answer_35781_Text
msgctxt "77fee1a1-e6dc-4db5-9cd7-79aa8992317c"
msgid ""
"[Steady yourself, be patient, and keep on picking the herb until it's done "
"right]"
msgstr "[참을성있게 일이 끝날 때까지 허브를 뽑습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Answer_56940_Text
msgctxt "878658a4-5cb9-4428-9af2-aa70201eb337"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Answer_59852_Text
msgctxt "aa962efc-f492-4851-a7d8-17cba7a0e08e"
msgid "[Pick the herb]"
msgstr "[허브를 뽑습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Cue_11055_Text
msgctxt "8a905048-ae04-4d18-b696-cf5e5d522020"
msgid "[You've picked the herb]"
msgstr "[허브를 뽑았습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Cue_11903_Text
msgctxt "fbb08fd1-d2a1-4e7f-a9a0-7fa8c5124273"
msgid ""
"[You've managed to gather the right amount of herbs, but lost almost half-a-"
"day doing so. It was an excruciatingly boring — and depressing — process]"
msgstr "[당신은 필요한 허브를 모았지만 한나절이 지나가버렸습니다. 정말 지루하고 지치는 과정이었습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Cue_50541_Text
msgctxt "e7f21e29-5509-41f5-b4ce-bda7fb22dc8b"
msgid "[You failed to pick the herb]"
msgstr "[허브를 뽑는 데 실패했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Cue_53207_Text
msgctxt "9a7810b9-071b-42b9-8afd-dc95a6045c8e"
msgid ""
"[This herb is rare and delicate. If not gathered properly and carefully, it "
"loses its useful properties]"
msgstr "[이 허브는 귀하고 조심히 다뤄야 합니다. 세심히 손질하지 않았다간 가치를 잃을 것입니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Cue_53895_Text
msgctxt "542ed355-6fe1-4a9e-b4aa-f48918c4b4d8"
msgid "[You've successfully collected several bundles of the herb]"
msgstr "[당신은 필요한 허브를 모았습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Cue_85750_Text
msgctxt "5578c592-2ce4-4a36-9f4e-f3f203a25330"
msgid ""
"[This is a rare herb, some skill is needed to pick it properly so it retains "
"its magic qualities]"
msgstr "[이것은 귀중한 허브라서 마법의 효능을 잃지 않으려면 소중히 다뤄야 합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Cue_93277_Text
msgctxt "177e8f68-8187-4679-982a-7d4a124cdc2d"
msgid "[Your Nature skill is not high enough to do it]"
msgstr "[당신의 자연 스킬이 작업을 하기에 부족합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/SwampWitchHerbs/Dialogue_Herb3_Mageshroom_WhatToBark
msgctxt "6273f7ac-aab3-443a-b2e4-6c2c0f83ce80"
msgid "[You've gathered all the Mageshroom in the area]"
msgstr "[당신은 그 지역에서 모든 마법 버섯을 모았습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419112_Text
msgctxt "2af5b660-abbb-42de-8db6-9ef246927f99"
msgid "\"What is the Scythe-Tree? And why is it dangerous?\""
msgstr "\"대낫 나무라는 게 뭐지? 왜 위험한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419116_Text
msgctxt "75297584-ae0f-4daa-ab08-99b574b3734b"
msgid "\"Callitropsia? I found a coin with her name on it. Look.\""
msgstr "\"칼리트롭시아? 나는 그녀의 이름이 적힌 동전을 찾았어. 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419119_Text
msgctxt "8fb4cd04-6692-487d-b153-ece54a223690"
msgid "\"A girl from the village married a dryad?\""
msgstr "\"그 마을 출신 소녀가 드라이어드와 결혼했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419123_Text
msgctxt "db0ce313-1193-46ce-9115-f3f90bd14577"
msgid "\"Elga Verniex is back. She lives in a house outside the village.\""
msgstr "\"엘가 베르닉스는 돌아왔어. 그녀는 마을 바깥의 집에 살아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419127_Text
msgctxt "ad46f57f-1c32-4266-97b5-0439b838de2e"
msgid ""
"\"Tiressia, your cousin Melianse sends her regards — and asks for five "
"feather tokens.\""
msgstr "\"티레시아, 너의 친척 멜리안스가 안부를 전했어. 그리고 5개의 깃털 토큰을 부탁하던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419132_Text
msgctxt "20698c88-8078-4818-8dbc-7167199bcd5a"
msgid "\"Fine, I will help you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 나는 너를 도울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419139_Text
msgctxt "a5cf00b3-d2fd-47aa-b941-b0b84cff4d9d"
msgid "\"You're judging by appearances, Tristian. Love can bind anyone.\""
msgstr "\"외모로 사람을 판단하는구나, 트리스티안. 사랑은 누구에게도 이뤄질 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419140_Text
msgctxt "07d8e329-dbb2-4f35-ae14-f22d5762d145"
msgid "\"Steamy nights, of course. It's all the fey ever think about.\""
msgstr "\"찜통 같은 밤이지, 물론. 항상 페이 생각뿐이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419141_Text
msgctxt "2242593c-5c47-4a47-967c-02de4c172743"
msgid "\"It's none of our business.\""
msgstr "\"내 알 바 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419147_Text
msgctxt "a544a9f0-cc7d-463a-b0ec-81dedfc51e9d"
msgid "\"Stow your weapon, and don't draw it until I give the order!\""
msgstr "\"무기를 거둬, 내가 명령할 때까지 들지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419148_Text
msgctxt "fdeafaaa-1741-4b6a-a0f9-e0cbb5406a47"
msgid "\"Wait, I want to speak with them. But keep watch for me!\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 그들과 이야기하고 싶다. 다만 계속 지켜봐줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419149_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a603f6d0-d769-4741-9be0-0009cab15ec3"
msgid "Killed the satyr and the dryad."
msgstr "사티로스와 드라이어드를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419149_Text
msgctxt "8b489354-b51c-47aa-82f4-03cca0565ceb"
msgid "[Attack] \"Let's do it. Thrash them!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"좋아. 때려눕혀!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419156_Text
msgctxt "2edac854-407f-4bfb-997f-03de7c384857"
msgid ""
"\"I'm always ready to please Gorum with a good battle! I hope it's a real "
"monster and not just some small fry!\""
msgstr "\"나는 항상 고룸을 기쁘게 할 좋은 전투를 할 준비가 됐지. 쥐새끼 말고 진짜 괴물이면 좋겠네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419157_Text
msgctxt "30f74df4-77c9-4813-9607-96d58198fdb8"
msgid "\"Monsters everywhere... Iomedae, please help me get rid of them all!\""
msgstr "\"괴물들이 도처에... 아이오메데시여. 그들을 모두 없애도록 도와주소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_72419160_Text
msgctxt "40128ebb-a75a-4ec3-8f2d-c3b6a73bfd12"
msgid ""
"\"Asmodeus doesn't support those who work for free. What can you offer me?\""
msgstr "\"아스모데우스는 공짜로 일하는 사람을 가호하지 않아. 나에게 무엇을 줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91590_Text
msgctxt "e7bb3673-56f7-4aba-8f1d-458f39d70595"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너흰 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91591_Text
msgctxt "f5dca2ef-95d7-4168-b823-722d58d24056"
msgid "\"What happened to the village?\""
msgstr "\"그 마을에 무슨 일이 생긴 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91592_Text
msgctxt "118285d5-0b2c-4264-87d4-8342840e4bfb"
msgid "\"What were you arguing about?\""
msgstr "\"왜 말다툼을 하고 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91593_Text
msgctxt "68c7b731-749f-4fa7-9726-d020cfe085cf"
msgid "\"The Scythe-Tree is no more.\""
msgstr "\"대낫 나무는 더 이상 존재하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91594_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c90dc847-8c65-4cbb-9fe6-45039f1c8834"
msgid "Killed the satyr and the dryad."
msgstr "사티로스와 드라이어드를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91594_Text
msgctxt "8605e79b-4d79-4620-b59b-efe1d612af8d"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"The fey! That's the last thing we need — let's finish them!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"페이로군! 마침 좋은 먹잇감이야. 죽이자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91595_Text
msgctxt "6d0f2177-530b-4f63-a374-2876d8603144"
msgid "[Leave] \"I must take my leave. Farewell.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 떠나야 해. 안녕히\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91608_Text
msgctxt "6e192069-5b77-42a9-a1cd-bb9ef26553d3"
msgid "\"The Scythe-Tree? It will trouble you no more.\""
msgstr "\"그, 대낫 나무랬던가? 그건 더 이상 문제가 되지 않을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91618_Text
msgctxt "c62eac2e-3958-4c6a-891b-dae8a4e5aa50"
msgid "\"Maybe I could help… depending on what you're offering.\""
msgstr "\"네가 무얼 주느냐에 따라 내가 도울 수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91619_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "056be2b6-4d95-4188-9ea6-e06bd4637474"
msgid "Advised the satyr to ditch the dryad and flee."
msgstr "사티로스에게 드라이어드를 버리고 달아날 것을 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91619_Text
msgctxt "d427fdb5-6539-479c-b1e9-dd609bdfba95"
msgid "\"She's right, Falchos. Leave, save yourself, or you'll perish.\""
msgstr "\"그녀 말이 맞아, 팔초스. 떠나, 그렇지 않으면 너는 죽을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91620_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ca9f1f43-5b2b-44e3-88d5-ba94f9e4b46b"
msgid "Refused to help with the satyr and the dryad's woes."
msgstr "비통에 빠진 사티로스와 드라이어드를 돕는 것을 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91620_Text
msgctxt "e1ed6c56-8376-48c5-a3d1-441d31521980"
msgid ""
"\"What does it matter to me? Let the Scythe-Tree take you for all I care.\""
msgstr "\"그게 나와 무슨 상관이야? 대낫 나무가 너를 잡으면 나야 좋지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91628_Text
msgctxt "54d09bb3-3d24-44f8-a934-e6279b99d1db"
msgid "\"I won't risk my life for such a meager reward.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그런 빈약한 보상에 내 목숨을 걸지 않을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91637_Text
msgctxt "724f6dc2-a1c1-46f1-ac2e-a124889c5b9a"
msgid "\"Yes!\""
msgstr "\"좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91638_Text
msgctxt "addfaffe-df1a-4c21-bc5d-bc33438e39f1"
msgid "\"Of course!\""
msgstr "\"당연하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91639_Text
msgctxt "1fd0ad03-d2fa-4169-a74a-f18a1e161089"
msgid "\"Certainly!\""
msgstr "\"확실히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91640_Text
msgctxt "4b637b49-1bca-417d-87ac-ee74dadd79e2"
msgid "\"Sure!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91641_Text
msgctxt "496b1104-5db5-484e-aa9c-2f0437593c43"
msgid "\"With pleasure!\""
msgstr "\"당연히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91645_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ecb04f4e-8037-4479-949b-4cdbb8a80d68"
msgid "Forgave the satyr and offered him hepl."
msgstr "사티로스를 용서하고 도움을 줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91645_Text
msgctxt "2113202a-add9-4722-873d-9d2a78b40c1d"
msgid "\"Seems you're desperate. All right, I'll help you.\""
msgstr "\"절망적인 것 같군. 좋아. 너를 도울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91646_Text
msgctxt "b76a5f80-c573-4570-97e3-2e9f70066b62"
msgid ""
"\"Trying that again might get you killed. But this time — I'll forgive you.\""
msgstr "\"다음에 또 그러면 넌 죽을 수도 있어. 하지만 이번엔 너를 용서할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91648_Text
msgctxt "80910caa-2fbc-46a9-a2ec-69296a9af24b"
msgid "[Attack] \"You shouldn't have done it.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 그러지 말았어야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91649_Text
msgctxt "70e19ae7-3ff1-4e0c-9263-d075c67c2169"
msgid "\"All right, so be it. I'll deal with this Scythe-Tree of yours.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 그렇게 해. 난 너의 대낫 나무를 처리하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91650_Text
msgctxt "4a186e09-087b-4390-85d1-740fe2c409d9"
msgid "\"What was that? You've cast some spell on me?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐였지? 내게 마법을 걸었어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91653_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a9840d7e-a646-41c0-8377-a02d813edb59"
msgid "Punished the satyr."
msgstr "사티로스를 처벌했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91653_Text
msgctxt "6b10d472-618d-4f43-a29c-d3f1daa6fd02"
msgid "[Attack] \"What you did, I cannot forgive.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네가 한 일은 용서할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91654_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ebb6fda2-f46a-481f-8869-12c87fe7ee87"
msgid "Laughed at the satyr's joke."
msgstr "사티로스의 농담에 웃었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91654_Text
msgctxt "f25b61d1-3afb-4f33-bb15-887fdac6ad43"
msgid "\"It's a sin to hold grudges against kids, lunatics and fey.\""
msgstr "\"아이들과 정신병자, 페이에게 원한을 품는 건 죄악이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91655_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e90302bc-573c-4cab-ad3f-1d5b20a96462"
msgid "Forgave the satyr."
msgstr "사티로스를 용서합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_91655_Text
msgctxt "457e1462-f1c2-4b89-a71f-b60cc5161944"
msgid "\"So be it, I forgive you.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 너를 용서하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_Tiresia_WeWorkForFree_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f00801d8-2105-4124-9f29-773ba85679d2"
msgid "Offered to kill the Scythe Tree for free."
msgstr "대가 없이 대낫 나무를 없애겠다고 제안합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Answer_Tiresia_WeWorkForFree_Text
msgctxt "1ccf92a6-b40b-4a07-ba55-54555be9262b"
msgid "\"I will kill the Scythe-Tree. No reward needed.\""
msgstr "\"내가 대낫 나무를 없앨 거야. 보상은 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419113_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "ea99fe86-7dff-425d-ab19-76a1770eb517"
msgid ""
"\"Well... It's...\" {n}Tiressia curls her fingers, imitating claws, and "
"pretends to snatch up something with them.{/n}"
msgstr "\"음... 이건...\" {n}티레시아는 손가락을 구부려 발톱처럼 만들어서 낚아채는 듯한 자세를 취합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419114_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "a080e60b-b784-41b2-8439-a5a13c5292f8"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad throws a sad, knowing glance at her lover and sighs.{/n} \"You"
"'re talking of death again? Whom are you going to fight this time?\""
msgstr "{n}드라이어드는 그녀의 애인을 보며 슬픈 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"또 죽는 얘기를 하는거야? 이번에는 누구와 싸우려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419115_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "70cc85f1-7b62-491c-ac6b-a60428b57bf5"
msgid ""
"\"Right!\"{n}He laughs. {/n}\"Now we'll live in peace and quiet till we're "
"old and grey!\""
msgstr "\"맞아!\" {n}그가 웃습니다.{/n} \"이제 우리는 늙어 머리가 하얗게 셀 때까지 평화롭고 조용하게 살거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419118_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "581222df-707e-41c7-88c7-75a2dee7a159"
msgid ""
"\"So, that's what happened… the hatred must have been great to turn her into "
"a monster! I fear to imagine what happened to the one who put this curse on "
"her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서, 그렇게 된 거야... 증오가 그녀를 괴물로 바꾼 거지! 그녀에게 저주를 건 녀석에게는 무슨 일이 일어났을지 생각하기도 두려워."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419120_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "c97bfb43-5da4-44c1-b04a-6227da76ba45"
msgid ""
"{n}Tiressia smiles. {/n}\"Your world and the world of the fey are great and "
"wide, yet rarely do they touch. It is unfortunate, for when they do, great "
"joy is possible. Not simply between two souls, but more so when a third "
"arises from their love — a child either born or found.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티레시아가 웃습니다.{/n} \"너의 세계와 페이의 세계는 크고 넓지만 서로 거의 교류하지 않아. 더 원활한 교류가 이루어진다면 더 "
"행복해 질 수 있을텐데 정말 아쉬워. 사랑이 싹트고 새로운 생명이 탄생할 수도 있잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419122_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "b8da3271-73cd-401e-9732-f8d6da38b933"
msgid ""
"\"If she still lives, she's certainly forgotten all about us. Her poor "
"father missed her so much, the grief never left him. It was in his eyes when "
"he passed.\" {n}The dryad is silent for a moment, averting her eyes, then "
"turns to face you again.{/n} \"Humans and fey both love, and love strongly… "
"and we feel the same pain when we are cut off from the ones we hold in our "
"hearts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 아직도 살아 있다면 우리를 잊어버렸을 거야. 그녀의 불쌍한 아버지는 그녀를 너무나 그리워했어. 언제나 슬픈 모습이었지.\" "
"{n}드라이어드는 잠시 침묵하며 시선을 피하더니 다시 얼굴을 마주칩니다.{/n} \"인간과 페이가 서로 사랑을 하게 되면 아무도 멈출 수 "
"없어... 아끼는 사람을 보내는 건 고통스러운 일이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419124_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "615fa7c8-8ca2-40db-a322-828a75bd2715"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so? That's welcome news! Why, oh why, didn't she visit? Did she "
"really forget me? Oh, so much time wasted...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래? 반가운 소식이네! 왜, 왜 그녀가 우릴 안 찾아온 거지? 그녀가 나를 정말 잊은걸까? 너무나 오랜 시간이 흘렀어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419125_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "e12528b1-1f88-467c-9da7-cf268dce92d2"
msgid ""
"\"It is unfortunate her father didn't live to see this day… oh, but he left "
"a letter for her! Where is it? Just a moment...\""
msgstr "\"그녀의 아버지가 살아서 오늘을 보지 못하는게 안타까워... 하지만 그녀에게 편지를 남겼어! 어디 있지? 잠시만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419126_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "888b3036-a6f4-4985-97ed-681ffacb75ab"
msgid ""
"{n}After several moments of rummaging inside of her tree, the dryad brings "
"forth a roll of parchment. {/n}\"Here. Please, give her this — her father's "
"last words to her. And tell her to visit me! I would so love to see her "
"again!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 나무 안쪽을 뒤적거리고, 잠시 후 양피지 두루마리를 가져옵니다.{/n} \"여기 받아. 그녀에게 건내줘. 그녀의 아버지가 쓴 "
"마지막 편지야. 그녀에게 나를 찾아오라고 전해줘! 그녀를 다시 보고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419128_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "6649462a-b4d7-44fc-a784-5b3e9d5a8439"
msgid ""
"\"Feather tokens? Sure, that's no problem at all… But first I have to ask "
"you about something.\""
msgstr "\"깃털 토큰? 물론 그건 전혀 문제가 되지 않아... 하지만 먼저 너에게 하나 부탁하고 싶은 게 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419129_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "3f60fd76-dce5-4e4f-84b6-971c909dab31"
msgid "\"I'll always share with Melianse! Here, take them!\""
msgstr "\"나는 항상 멜리안스과 함께할 거야! 여기 가져가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419130_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "17508266-2199-4686-9667-e5a76fdfffe5"
msgid ""
"{n}Falchos jumps in.{/n} \"First, it's just a tree. Fire is not its friend — "
"and you'd best use a weapon suited to chop through its bark — not impale it."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}팔코스가 펄쩍 뜁니다.{/n} \"우선, 그건 딱 나무야. 불은 그놈에게 달갑지 않은 물건이지 - 그리고 나무껍질을 내려쳐서 벨 수 "
"있는 무기를 쓰는 게 좋아 - 찌르는 무기 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419131_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "db13f72b-197f-4678-8211-5920486e254d"
msgid ""
"\"Right! And, also, its branches are very long! Be careful, it can reach you "
"from afar!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 그리고 가지가 정말 길어! 조심해. 멀리서도 너에게 닿을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419134_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "84c6178c-618c-41e8-8315-9bf499117f47"
msgid ""
"\"The hells was that?! You think you can just charm us like this? That's it, "
"you're dead!\""
msgstr "\"도대체 그게 뭐야?! 이런 식으로 우리를 꼬드길 수 있다고 생각해? 소용없어. 너는 죽었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419136_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a76c7fc9-3223-49cb-a48a-a2437d39aa99"
msgid ""
"\"Holy kittens, look! It's fey! Real fey! Hello there!\" {n}Linzi waves her "
"hand to the couple.{/n}"
msgstr "\"이런 맙소사! 페이다! 진짜 페이가 나타났어! 안녕!\" {n}린지는 페이 커플에게 손을 흔들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419138_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "431a63b6-2091-469f-8480-30aef914fe2e"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian stares at the satyr and the dryad, astonished. He leans toward "
"you and says,{/n} \"What an amazing couple! What could bind these creatures "
"so, with them being so different?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 사티로스와 드라이어드를 빤히 보고 놀랍니다. 그는 당신을 향해 몸을 기울여 말합니다.{/n} \"정말 놀라운 "
"커플이군요! 둘이 저렇게 다른데 어떻게 맺어질 수 있었을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419142_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "81f8e4dc-f4ab-4c8d-86f7-2b99433e5862"
msgid "{n}Tristian sighs wearily.{/n} \"And not a mirror to be found...\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 지친 듯 한숨쉽니다.{/n} \"거울이 없었다거나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419143_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "609987c1-70d6-4dfe-9810-3ca62abd96da"
msgid "{n}Tristian steps away, embarrassed.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 당황하여 한발짝 물러섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419144_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "11f3bda7-d0fe-4a11-ba66-30bb98fd6284"
msgid "\"Yes. Of course.\" {n}Tristian looks at you apprehensively.{/n}"
msgstr "\"예, 물론이죠.\" {n}트리스티안은 이해한다는 듯 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419145_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "87ef2ae2-0047-48e7-8945-f5ac02464b45"
msgid ""
"\"It's an ambush, I'm telling you. I'll chop these assholes' limbs right "
"off...\" {n}The half-orc reaches for his weapon.{/n}"
msgstr "\"매복이야. 확실해. 이 녀석들의 팔다리를 잘라버려야지...\" {n}하프오크는 그의 무기에 손을 댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419150_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1523205f-e19b-4470-86d8-7d2ccfb29e77"
msgid "\"All right, all right... I'm just saying!\""
msgstr "\"알았어, 알았어. 그냥 장난이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419151_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2d1ee5fd-b230-4b99-bb31-94805752ee51"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar nods. He watches the fey closely with his hand on his weapon.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 끄덕입니다. 그는 무기를 쥔 채 fey를 지켜보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419152_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f7be091c-88b6-481d-8f38-aa67d35078dd"
msgid "\"Oh ho! Did you think you could fool us, you creeps?\""
msgstr "\"오호! 우리를 속일 수 있다고 생각했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419155_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c2f1552c-8500-432c-9c84-285c5f369172"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you think that? They seem harmless to me... Nice, even! You just "
"see enemies everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 생각해? 그들은 적이 아닌 거 같아... 그리고 친절하기까지 해! 너는 세상을 다 적으로 봐서 그런 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419158_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "430b2639-a033-4015-b761-79e3330ceac5"
msgid ""
"\"No, it's a real monster! A huge, horrible, murderous beast! Please fight "
"him — your god will be pleased!\""
msgstr "\"아니, 진짜 괴물이야! 크고 끔찍한 짐승이야! 그와 싸우면 너의 신이 기뻐할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_72419159_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "ca7d3eea-c0c7-406e-98e7-30ab18e6fdba"
msgid "\"Right! You help us, and your goddess will help you!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 우릴 도와주면 네 여신이 너를 도울 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91583_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "3a164d28-a4a8-415d-a855-14514eeb275b"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach the grove, you hear two voices in soft conversation. The "
"first is a velvet baritone, begging on the brink of tears. {/n}\"Please, "
"Tiressia, my love, don't send me away. I'd rather die than-\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 숲에 접근하던 중 부드러운 목소리의 대화소리를 듣습니다. 첫 번째는 벨벳처럼 부드러운 저음으로 슬프게 애원합니다.{/n} "
"\"제발, 티레시아, 내 사랑. 나를 멀리 떠나 보내지 마. 그러느니 차라리 죽을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91584_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "75e7db99-18c3-41c5-959e-7a662734ca1d"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad weeps softly, her head on the satyr's shoulder as he strokes "
"her hair. He turns at your approach.{/n} \"So?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드라이어드가 부드럽게 눈물을 흘리며 사티로스의 어깨에 머리를 기대자 그가 쓰다듬습니다. 그는 당신이 오자 몸을 돌립니다.{/n} "
"\"그래서 어떻게 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91585_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "84b30dcc-fd3b-4311-890e-6df2c506b42a"
msgid ""
"{n}Both satyr and dryad look at you warily, whispering to each other.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사티로스와 드라이어드는 서로에게 속삭이며 당신을 조심스럽게 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91586_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "b9bc8fd1-5712-446d-ae57-80880c667780"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr plays the reed pipe, and the dryad, laughing, accompanies him "
"by clapping her hands. As they see you, they wave. {/n}\"Welcome back!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스는 리드 파이프를 연주하고 드라이어드는 웃으며 손뼉을 칩니다. 그들이 당신을 보자 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"다시 왔구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91587_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "fc599db3-9c0b-45af-b8ef-e2042ab52572"
msgid ""
"\"I want you to live!\"{n} A girl's voice says sharply.{/n} \"Falchos, you "
"are my knight in shining armor. I love you like I've never loved anyone "
"before! But if you stay, you'll... you'll...\"{n} The girl's voice falters, "
"and she collapses into sobs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"난 네가 살았으면 좋겠다고!\" {n}소녀의 목소리가 날카롭습니다.{/n} \"팔초스, 너는 빛나는 갑옷을 입은 나의 기사야. "
"누구보다 너를 사랑해! 하지만 네가 여기 머물면...\" {n}그 소녀의 목소리는 흔들리고 흐느껴 웁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91588_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "4ae81bba-e04a-418d-8a84-9ba321e93b7a"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! There's someone here! Show yourself!\" {n}Approaching, you notice a "
"fey couple — a satyr and a dryad who watch you with an anxious look.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐! 여기 누군가가 있어! 모습을 보여라!\" {n}당신은 다가가자 페이 커플을 목격합니다. 그들은 불안한 표정으로 당신을 지켜보는 "
"사티로스와 드라이어드였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91596_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "49327526-2382-47e0-8263-96595e49f671"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Tiressia. I've lived here since my tree awoke from the earth "
"and first sought the sun. And this is Falchos from far away. We're...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름은 티레시아야. 나는 내 나무가 땅에서 깨어나 처음 태양을 만난 이후로 여기에 살았어. 그리고 이쪽의 사티로스는 팔초스야. "
"우린...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91597_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "2e866157-f698-45ba-ba7a-bd5986e60bf4"
msgid ""
"\"We are together.\" {n}The satyr nods.{/n} \"And we'll stay together till "
"death takes us.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 함께야.\" {n}사티로스는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그리고 우리가 죽을 때까지 함께 있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91598_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "8b07924e-d792-4d94-8ebe-f9c899e5e819"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad narrows her eyes at Falchos and folds her arms.{/n} \"Can't you "
"do without the 'death' part?\""
msgstr "{n}드라이어드는 눈을 가늘게 뜨고 팔초스를 쳐다보며 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"죽는다는 얘기 그만할 수 없을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91600_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "1e47b7d2-e752-447a-90db-b8a254b32e87"
msgid "\"I managed so far!\" {n}He grins widely.{/n}"
msgstr "\"지금까진 괜찮잖아!\" {n}그는 활짝 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91601_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "2e393b9b-0688-4624-9375-ad455994a2bd"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad gives a heavy sigh and closes her eyes, as if remembering.{/n} "
"\"It was a beautiful place. A human village on the edge of the real fey "
"kingdom. They lived in peace alongside the fey for generations, united by "
"friendship — sometimes even by love!\" {n}The dryad looks away.{/n} \"That "
"is... until our queen, Callitropsia, lost her heart to the headman's "
"daughter. Such a beautiful couple! But...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드라이어드는 한숨을 쉬며 눈을 감습니다.{/n} \"아름다운 곳이었어. 페이 왕국의 가장자리에 있는 인간 마을이었지. 페이와 "
"인간들은 끈끈한 우정으로 함께 평화롭게 몇 세대를 살아 왔어. 가끔은 사랑이 이루어지기도 했지!\" {n}드라이어드는 먼 곳을 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"... 우리 여왕 칼리트롭시아가 나타날 때까지는 말이야. 그녀는 촌장의 딸에게 마음을 빼앗겼어. 정말 아름다운 "
"한쌍이었지! 하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91602_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "c2e42ae7-6ad2-4c35-912d-5324229e5f11"
msgid ""
"\"It happened at their wedding day. Both humans and fey had gathered to "
"celebrate the union. No one knows what happened next, but in the midst of "
"the festivities Callitropsia suddenly transformed... she changed into a "
"monster...\" {n}The dryad's voice drops and she glances around, as if afraid "
"another might hear.{/n} \"She became the Scythe-Tree. She killed her bride, "
"her love... then destroyed the village.\""
msgstr ""
"\"결혼 날에 일어난 일인데 인간과 페이 모두가 결혼을 축하하기 위해 모였어. 그 후에 무슨 일이 일어났는지는 아무도 몰라. 하지만 축제 "
"도중에 칼리트롭시아가 괴물로 변해서... \" {n}드라이어드의 목소리가 작아지고 그녀는 누군가 들을까 주위를 살핍니다.{/n} \"그녀는"
" 대낫 나무가 되었어. 그녀는 자신의 짝을 죽이고 마을을 파괴했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91603_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "ef9fa1df-4829-4145-8c57-92aa9a6874df"
msgid ""
"\"Humans fled — or were killed. Same with fey. Our kingdom fell in a "
"heartbeat. I couldn't leave my tree, so I slept for many years.... until I "
"awoke to the sound of pipes, playing such beautiful music.\" {n}She smiles "
"at Falchos.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"인간들은 도망치거나 살해당했어. 페이도 마찬가지였지. 우리 왕국은 한순간에 무너졌고 나는 내 나무를 떠날 수 없어서 수 년 동안 "
"잠들었어... 아름다운 피리 연주소리를 듣기 전까지 말이야.\" {n}그녀는 팔초스를 보고 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91604_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "6cf4a14c-793f-47f2-a8e1-935cd483fc40"
msgid ""
"\"These lands could be beautiful again, but not as long as this monster "
"exists.\"{n} Falchos's hand curls into a fist.{/n} \"We cannot leave, we "
"must fight!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 땅은 다시 아름다워질 수 있지만 이 괴물이 있는 한은 그렇지 못할 거야.\" {n}팔초스가 주먹을 쥡니다.{/n} \"우리는 떠날 "
"수 없어. 싸워야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91605_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "3f9c1873-3851-4557-b788-8ea713699dbb"
msgid ""
"\"My sweetheart, my love...\" {n}Tiressia's voice trembles on the verge of "
"tears.{/n} \"You've tried already — and barely survived! Please, I'll... "
"endure. I'll go to sleep again. If you were to die, it will hurt me far "
"more, than if I let you go, knowing you're far away, but alive and well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 사랑...\" {n}티레시아의 목소리는 눈물이 날 것처럼 떨립니다.{/n} \"너는 이미 도전했고, 간신히 살아돌아왔잖아! "
"제발... 내가 참을게. 내가 다시 잠에 들면 돼. 네가 죽으면 내 마음은 네가 살아서 멀리 떨어져 있는 것보다 더 아플 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91606_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "1eb92e59-c7c2-4731-a4f4-b37a1f8b4149"
msgid ""
"\"Look at me, Tiressia. I'll never leave you. Never! I beg you, don't send "
"me away. Being without you… it'll kill me as surely as the Scythe-Tree "
"itself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 봐. 티레시아. 나는 너를 떠나지 않을 거야. 절대! 부탁할게. 나를 보내지 마. 너 없이는... 차라리 대낫 나무에 죽는 게 "
"나아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91610_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "c1ae7c6f-fcd1-4020-b085-d571e52b4d87"
msgid "\"You have our gratitude! We won't forget your kindness!\""
msgstr "\"고마워! 네 친절을 잊지 않을게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91611_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "4445a967-ad32-40b3-95f8-daad697a2d56"
msgid ""
"\"We thank you! Here is your reward.\" {n}Tiressia hands you a small "
"chest.{/n}"
msgstr "\"고마워! 여기 보상이야.\" {n}티레시아는 작은 상자를 건넵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91612_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "6b2f3a01-d0b9-4fd3-b106-1dcdb1f5880f"
msgid "\"Wait, hold on!\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 기다려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91613_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "38d08645-6034-409c-b26a-ba8796ac900a"
msgid ""
"\"The Scythe-Tree won't leave us be. Simply being brave is not enough to "
"defeat it, Falchos. Sooner or later it will kill you.\" {n}The dryad turns "
"to you, hopeful.{/n} \"I beg you, put an end to the creature! End our "
"suffering — and its suffering, as well. We'll find a way to reward you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"대낫 나무는 우리를 떠나지 않을 거야. 용기만으로는 그것을 이길 수 없어, 팔초스. 늦든 빠르든 싸웠다간 죽을 거야.\" {n}"
"드라이어드는 당신을 희망에 찬 눈으로 봅니다.{/n} \"부탁인데 그 생물을 죽여줘! 우리의 고통을, 그것의 고통을 끝내줘. 너에게 "
"보상할게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91623_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "e2f2fc59-dcd5-4748-87c7-a5cae4d58da2"
msgid ""
"\"You see...\" {n}The dryad speaks gently to the uneasy satyr.{/n} \""
"{mf|He|She} thinks so, too. You cannot stay, my love. My heart will miss "
"you, but it won't survive if you die before my eyes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알겠지...\" {n}드라이어드는 불안한 사티로스에게 부드럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"{name}도 동의했어. 여기 있으면 안 돼, 내 "
"사랑. 나는 너를 그리워할 거야. 하지만 네가 내 눈 앞에서 죽기라도 하면 난 정말 살아갈 수 없을 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91624_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "0b128de6-626e-466b-8f0a-3f9119e01c6c"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr frowns. {/n}\"No. I've made up my mind. Whatever happens, I "
"stay with my love — alive or dead.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스는 눈살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"아니. 나는 내 마음을 굳혔어. 어떤 일이 생기든, 죽던지 살던지 내 사랑과 함께 있을 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91625_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "4fbdf603-9053-4f9e-ac54-54c175c3c341"
msgid ""
"\"It's not much, but...\"{n} -Tiressia gets a small chest from under the "
"tree roots.{/n}"
msgstr "\"많지는 않지만...\" {n}티레시아는 나무 뿌리 아래에서 작은 상자를 꺼냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91630_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "ab66e49c-9df3-4617-bf2c-7508301d9211"
msgid ""
"{n}Falchos gives Tiressia a meaningful look and sighs.{/n} \"Too bad. Well, "
"if you think so...\""
msgstr "{n}팔초스는 티레시아에게 의미있는 표정을 보이고 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"안됐군. 네가 그렇게 생각한다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91631_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "c6fc67e0-11dd-4a4e-9434-55287c2d8e33"
msgid ""
"{n}Satyr presses the reed pipe to his lips. The strains of a beautiful, "
"touching melody wash over you — and you realize not only do the poor lovers "
"need your help, you want to help them with all your heart.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스는 갈대 파이프를 입술로 누릅니다. 아름답고 감동적인 멜로디가 당신을 감동시켰습니다. 당신은 가난한 연인들이 당신의 도움을 "
"필요로 한다는 것을 깨닫고 온 마음을 다해 그들을 돕고 싶습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91634_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "38562c2f-a44c-4d6a-96d2-071159e5f9f7"
msgid ""
"{n}Fighting with all your will, you ignore the music, and focusing, you "
"shake off the enchantment, feeling the emotions bleeding away — pity? A "
"desire to help? You've just barely avoided being enchanted! As the "
"realization comes over you, the satyr's face goes pale and he takes a step "
"back from your gaze.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}모든 의지를 담아 싸우면서 당신은 음악을 무시하고 집중하여 매혹을 떨쳐내버리려 합니다. 당신은 어떤 감정을 느낍니다. 동정일까요? "
"도와주고 싶은 마음일까요? 당신은 겨우 매혹에 걸리는 것을 피했습니다! 제정신으로 돌아오자 사티로스의 얼굴은 창백해져서 한 걸음 "
"물러섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91635_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "61208d67-1b99-40dc-b7ca-50d15652c7b0"
msgid ""
"{n}Your ears are filled with the dryad's unearthly voice — so beautiful, so "
"sweet... and so filled with suffering! {/n}\"Only you can help us. Please, "
"kill the Scythe-Tree!\" {n}You feel warm tears running down your cheeks at "
"her words.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 귓 속은 드라이어드의 소름끼치는 목소리로 가득 차 있습니다. 너무 아름답고 달콤해서 고통스럽습니다!{/n} \"오직 너만이 "
"우리를 도울 수있어. 제발 대낫 나무를 죽여줘!\" {n}당신은 그녀의 말을 듣고 뺨에서 따뜻한 눈물이 흐릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91643_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "93d19827-64ad-40cc-b0ce-e7c22d3e0117"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr, seemingly surprised at his own luck, nods quickly and hides "
"the reed pipe.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}자신의 행운에 놀란 듯한 사티로스는 빠르게 끄덕이고 갈대 파이프를 숨깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91647a_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "a31bbcf2-330f-4dfc-b1c0-454e29d0950d"
msgid ""
"{n}The dryad smiles.{/n} \"There are not enough words in the world to "
"express how grateful we are!\""
msgstr "{n}드라이어드가 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"얼마나 감사한지 말로 표현할 수가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91647b_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "20a47f2a-870e-48d5-93f9-1b05c6c58bff"
msgid "\"I'm so grateful! You are our savior!\""
msgstr "\"정말 고마워! 너는 우리의 구세주야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91651_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "107a4a53-1edd-4b80-96a8-d7108ed3e983"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr, pale, steps between you and the dryad.{/n} \"Forgive me for "
"playing this trick on you! You must understand, we need your help!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스는 창백해져서 당신과 드라이어드 사이로 걸어갑니다.{/n} \"속임수를 써서 미안해! 이해해줘. 우리는 너의 도움이 필요해!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91656_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "659844a5-1a4f-407b-8aad-d06984027e9f"
msgid "\"We won't do that again! I promise!\""
msgstr "\"다시는 이러지 않을게! 약속해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91657_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "ff2ff2de-a59e-4f90-8cef-7eb3779bf6a3"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr gives you a broad smile and nods respectfully. {/n}\"How about "
"that — the day brings not just a visitor, but wisdom as well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스가 당신에게 넓은 웃음을 짓고 정중하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"어때? 한낮은 방문객뿐만 아니라 지혜도 가져오지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91658_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "c5ea50b8-bdfd-4830-96a2-69e801fc82dc"
msgid ""
"{n}Falchos kisses Tiressia and turns away quickly, to hide his tears. Then "
"he disappears in the woods. {/n}"
msgstr "{n}팔초스는 티레시아에게 키스하고, 고개를 휙 돌리고는 눈물을 훔칩니다. 그는 숲으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_91659_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "62f50049-ede8-400e-bb02-214827710014"
msgid ""
"\"I shouldn't wake up.\" {n}The dryad says softly. {/n} \"I'll go back to "
"sleep now — perhaps forever. Thank you for persuading Falchos. It's better "
"for him to be far away, but alive. Here, take this, I don't need it anymore."
"\" {n}The dryad hands you a small chest and then, without another word, "
"vanishes into her tree.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 깨어나지 말아야 했어.\" {n}드라이어드는 부드럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"나는 이제 다시 잠을 자야 해. 아마도 영원히. "
"팔초스를 설득해줘서 고마워. 그가 살아서 멀리 가는 편이 더 나아. 이걸 받아. 나는 이제 필요 없어.\" {n}드라이어드는 당신에게 "
"작은 상자를 주고는 말 없이 나무 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_Curse-truth_Tiresia_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "f8e54b2e-5d9c-4701-82db-7917c420bb05"
msgid ""
"{n}After looking at the coin, the dryad turns deadly pale. {/n}\"This… this "
"is a curse. Someone hated our queen so much, he was ready to doom his soul, "
"but destroy her too!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}동전을 보고 나서 드라이어드는 얼굴이 창백해집니다.{/n} \"이건... 이건 저주야. 누군가 우리 여왕을 너무 싫어해서 자신의 "
"영혼을 파멸시키고 대신 그녀의 영혼도 파괴한 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_Tiresia_Charmed_Text
msgctxt "26f693e9-2004-4568-8d95-6e08a87a2912"
msgid ""
"{n}You can feel time passing, but it feels slow, dulled — even your "
"heartbeat is pulsing slowly, like the echo of a drum. The forest before you "
"seems thick with fog, and you're conscious only of your legs on an unknown "
"path, moving forward, step by step...\n"
"...until you stop, the haze clears, and you take a sharp breath. You are on "
"the the edge of a glade — a glade where you know the Scythe-Tree lives.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 시간이 지나가는 것을 느낄 수는 있지만 시간은 천천히 흘러 당신의 심장 박동마저 드럼의 메아리처럼 천히 뜁니다. 당신 앞의 "
"숲은 안개로 두꺼웠고 당신은 보이지 않는 길에 발을 뻗어 앞으로 나아갑니다...\n"
" 당신이 멈췄을 때 안개가 맑아지고 당신은 가볍게 숨을 쉽니다. 당신은 늪지의 가장자리에 있습니다. 그곳은 대낫 나무가 사는 "
"곳이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_Tiresia_Elga_name_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "a2445d59-1469-4d86-b7aa-46b0e83165ec"
msgid ""
"\"Here, for instance… when my tree and I were far younger than we are now, a "
"girl lived here — Elga Verniex. She was the daughter of the woman from the "
"village — her father, a satyr. We loved her so much, watching her grow, "
"laugh, learn...\" {n}The dryad shakes her head sadly.{/n} \"But her mother "
"took her and left.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가령... 나의 나무와 내가 지금보다 훨씬 어렸을 때, 엘가 베르닉스라는 소녀가 살았어. 마을 출신의 여자 아이였지. 그녀의 아버지는 "
"사티로스였고. 우리는 그녀를 너무나 사랑했어. 그녀가 커가며 웃고 배우는 모습을 보고...\" {n}드라이어드는 머리를 슬프게 "
"흔듭니다.{/n} \"하지만 그녀의 어머니는 그녀를 데리고 떠나버렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_Tiresia_No_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_Satyr
msgctxt "978b0e36-b337-4a07-a3e1-742b0f76ebac"
msgid ""
"{n}White as a sheet, the satyr hides his reed pipe and steps away from you — "
"just in case.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사티로스는 흰색 시트처럼 하얗게 질려서 리드 파이프를 숨기고 혹시 무슨일이 생길까 당신에게서 물러납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_Tiresia_Reported_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "759e36d2-adee-497b-97fc-71c002ddf894"
msgid ""
"{n}Falchos gives you a wide grin, while Tiressia wipes away a tear. {/n}\"May"
" you now know peace, my queen.\""
msgstr "{n}팔초스는 활짝 미소를 지었고 티레시아는 눈물을 닦습니다.{/n} \"이제 안식을 취하세요,여왕님.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigNarlmarches/Tiressia/Cue_Tiresia_Yes_Text
#. Speaker : Tiressia_BigNarlmarches
msgctxt "5f774607-2a2c-4172-ae00-3715e3445364"
msgid ""
"\"You'll find it south of here, in a large glade. Good luck! We'll wait for "
"you here!\""
msgstr "\"여기 큰 숲 속의 남쪽에서 찾을 수 있을거야. 행운을 빌어! 우리는 여기서 너를 기다릴 게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/Barks/DesertedCampsite_Adventurer_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "ffbf0463-697f-4ae2-ae10-1578ffac6311"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you! Rook would help me to my home. Everything will be fine now.\""
msgstr "\"고마워! 루크가 나를 집으로 데려다 줄 거야. 이제 모든 것이 잘 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/AbandonedCampfireBark2_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "30612333-1b4c-4a76-bac3-0de5790535e5"
msgid ""
"This camp was set by those unfortunate hunters who were teleported onto the "
"stone."
msgstr "이 야영지는 돌 위로 텔레포트한 불행한 사냥꾼들이 세웠습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/AbandonedCampfireBark_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "4eaf11a8-ddb3-4d7b-8cdb-507b1b4eb027"
msgid ""
"This camp was set up by those unfortunate hunters who were teleported onto "
"the stone. To think, you spent a night here too! It's good no teleporting "
"happened to you as well."
msgstr ""
"이 야영지는 돌 위로 텔레포트한 불행한 사냥꾼들이 세웠습니다. 생각도 할 겸 당신은 여기서 밤을 지냈습니다! 당신이 순간이동을 하지 않아 "
"천만다행입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/AncientTreeBarkFallen_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "0b7d1d2c-ea91-4eb3-8976-73cd91cd4d5b"
msgid ""
"It's a huge centuries-old oak, which has fallen because of human greed. In "
"the pit, dug underneath its roots, there is nothing except for worms and a "
"pair of mole-holes."
msgstr ""
"그것은 거대한 수세기의 오래된 참나무입니다. 그것은 인간의 탐욕 때문에 쓰러졌습니다. 구덩이에는 뿌리가 파헤쳐 있고 그곳에는 지렁이와 "
"두더지 구멍을 제외하고는 아무것도 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/AncientTreeBarkStanding_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "cd9b4762-85ff-4673-8913-5c1a9d0e568c"
msgid ""
"It's a huge, centuries-old oak. It is a real colossus, which observes from "
"above the ages passing by."
msgstr "수백년 된 거대한 참나무입니다. 흘러가는 세월들을 뛰어 넘어 관조하는 진짜 거상입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/BigOutdoorArea_BushBones_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "b3f06e82-a7d1-4893-8a66-7342cdfdb3dd"
msgid "Someone's gnawed bones gleam in the bushes."
msgstr "덤불 속에서 누군가의 씹다 버린 뼈다귀가 살짝 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/BigOutdoorArea_CrumbledWalls_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "46ec5d38-c5d8-454a-9903-890fc92c6a0f"
msgid "Once sturdy walls became decrepit and crumbled."
msgstr "한 때 튼튼한 벽은 낡아서 무너졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/BigOutdoorArea_PavingStones_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "d8415ef2-1e35-4fb3-9934-cd8ba45ebfbf"
msgid "The remains of cobbled road are barely visible."
msgstr "자갈길의 흔적은 거의 볼 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/BigOutdoorArea_RoadBush_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "9fa2217f-f2a2-4e44-9b36-ccad796b294a"
msgid "Grass has sprouted between the cobbles of the ancient road."
msgstr "고대의 도로 위에 깔린 자갈 사이에 잔디가 돋아났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/BigOutdoorArea_StoneLegs_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "9a8f53ee-23ae-41de-a2f1-8f541f3854d4"
msgid "A pair of legs sticks out from the boulder surface."
msgstr "바위 표면에서 한쌍의 다리가 불쑥 튀어나와 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/HarrimPuzzleStatueBark_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "0acc752e-197e-44c1-922d-c0ed4f5e045a"
msgid ""
"\"The traitor god… Torag priests used to set hiding places in statues like "
"that. Look closer, if you wish. You might find something.\""
msgstr ""
"\"반역자 신... 토락의 성직자들은 저런 신상들에 숨겨진 공간을 설치해 두곤 했지. 원한다면 더 가까이 봐. 뭔가 찾을 수 있을 거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/HighRock_Description_String
msgctxt "2232594d-4c5d-4306-8764-0d2726bcbd8d"
msgid "High Rock"
msgstr "높은 바위"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/LandmarkEkunBark_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "ebf73556-3399-48a2-81a3-075c8386c148"
msgid "\"Someone lived here. Long ago.\""
msgstr "\"누군가 오래전에 여기에 살았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/LandmarkHarrimBark_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "39fd0e46-e414-494d-9080-c7e5d601570d"
msgid ""
"\"These ruins… So calm and tranquil... Reconciles you with the future.\""
msgstr "\"이 폐허들... 너무 평온하고 조용해... 미래를 생각하게 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/PuzzleBookChest_Description_String
msgctxt "b99fc99d-c93a-47af-9652-f573f647266a"
msgid "Ruined Tower"
msgstr "폐허가 된 탑"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/ToragStatue_Description_String
msgctxt "fb2653d2-ba0d-40f7-8b4f-8633ce168ec9"
msgid "Torag's Statue"
msgstr "토락의 동상"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/BarksAndDescriptions/Tree_Description_String
msgctxt "892f1a2f-2404-4fd5-b548-85b07922b233"
msgid "Huge Tree"
msgstr "거대한 나무"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DeadTrader/BigOutdoorArea_DeadTrader_WhatToBark
msgctxt "b31b7e58-0949-4525-b0da-bab57a2a141a"
msgid "The Stag Lord is dead, but bandits still plague the land."
msgstr "수사슴 군주는 죽었지만 도적이 여전히 그 땅에서 창궐합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_26193_Text
msgctxt "93d40c17-ee64-47d3-ae02-e9286d97bcb0"
msgid ""
"[Knowledge: Arcana] \"Let's see if we can find the nature of this "
"disturbance...\""
msgstr "[지식: 비전] \"어디 우리가 이 혼란의 본질을 발견할 수 있을지 한 번 보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_35713_Text
msgctxt "37f3cb10-4b9a-4b89-8e0c-b7558bc5cdb1"
msgid "[Spend the night at the deserted campsite]"
msgstr "[버려진 야영지에서 하룻밤을 보냅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_39374_Text
msgctxt "02f60cbd-c373-4d86-a808-2453f4e9a00a"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"You're right. This probably isn't the best place to spend the "
"night. Let's go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"네가 맞아. 아마도 밤을 보낼 수 있는 최고의 장소는 아니겠지. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_49066_Text
msgctxt "35d02b90-9b2b-4d09-a251-ed475f27bf4a"
msgid "[Rummage through their things]"
msgstr "[그들의 물품을 뒤집니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_57201_Text
msgctxt "e86c7085-52e0-45de-b410-a07c2f1309a2"
msgid "[Check inside the pot]"
msgstr "[냄비 속을 확인한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_59372_Text
msgctxt "c543c229-7385-41fe-8780-b21626041e0c"
msgid "[Leave the campsite]"
msgstr "[야영지를 떠난다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_60580_Text
msgctxt "669444a0-0ead-4cfd-b996-185c24be5207"
msgid "[Look around carefully]"
msgstr "[주위를 자세히 살펴본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_75965_Text
msgctxt "ecf8e0f6-16af-4e05-b304-5bcc5d352d8a"
msgid "[Detect Magic] \"Let's see if there are any enchantments about...\""
msgstr "[마법 탐지] \"어떤 마법이 있는지 보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_88530_Text
msgctxt "d19cfc03-216c-4e49-84dd-b4437eb76e62"
msgid "\"If there's some real danger here, we should stay and remove it.\""
msgstr "\"여기가 정말 위험하다면 여기 머물러서 위험요소를 제거해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Answer_92419_Text
msgctxt "9844c88e-2d26-4cb8-b87b-83faa161b5d7"
msgid "[Search for traces of the hunters]"
msgstr "[사냥꾼들의 흔적을 찾습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_03598_Text
msgctxt "78fc8a22-55d9-4e43-a0c4-1e129ae8b569"
msgid ""
"{n}It looks like the barrier between two realities has become too thin. In "
"places like this, people and objects can be drawn from one world to another "
"by sheer chance. Sometimes they reappear far away from their original "
"location, and sometimes they seem to become lost forever.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}두 현실계 사이의 장벽이 너무 얇은 것처럼 보입니다. 이런 곳에서 사람들과 사물은 높은 확률로 한 세상에서 다른 세상으로 끌려갈 수 "
"있습니다. 때로는 원래 위치에서 멀리 떨어져 나타나기도 하고 때로는 영원히 사라져 버리기도 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_06287 1_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "12abfc19-7a79-4dff-82b4-4318ea37fc95"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri rubs her eyes and stares into the forest.{/n} \"Something's wrong "
"here. Some sort of witchcraft, for sure!\" {n}She takes a firmer grip on her "
"sword and looks around intently, her fierce expression letting everyone know "
"she's on guard.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 눈을 문지르고 숲을 응시합니다.{/n} \"뭔가 잘못 됐어. 어떤 요술이 걸려있어, 확실해!\" {n}그녀는 칼을 단단히 "
"쥐고 열심히 주위를 둘러봅니다. 그녀의 경직된 표정에서 모두가 그녀가 경계 태세란 걸 알 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_06287 3_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "54d2c48f-6433-4d9c-a92b-9e801d7ad230"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri rubs her eyes and stares into the forest.{/n} \"Something's wrong "
"here. Some sort of witchcraft, for sure!\" {n}She takes a firmer grip on her "
"sword and looks around intently, her fierce expression letting everyone know "
"she's on guard.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 눈을 문지르고 숲을 응시합니다.{/n} \"뭔가 잘못 됐어. 어떤 요술이 걸려있어, 확실해!\" {n}그녀는 칼을 단단히 "
"쥐고 열심히 주위를 둘러봅니다. 그녀의 경직된 표정에서 모두가 그녀가 경계 태세란 걸 알 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_06287_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a23940b0-7b1d-457b-9e3e-da50a4d061ae"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri rubs her eyes and stares into the forest.{/n} \"Something's wrong "
"here. Some sort of witchcraft, for sure!\" {n}She takes a firmer grip on her "
"sword and looks around intently, her fierce expression letting everyone know "
"she's on guard.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 눈을 문지르고 숲을 응시합니다.{/n} \"뭔가 잘못 됐어. 어떤 요술이 걸려있어, 확실해!\" {n}그녀는 칼을 단단히 "
"쥐고 열심히 주위를 둘러봅니다. 그녀의 경직된 표정에서 모두가 그녀가 경계 태세란 걸 알 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_16286_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0e89ea11-bae2-4286-8417-4727c853a4e8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, an experiment, then? With us as the subjects? A delightful idea, I "
"can't wait! Well then, I bid you all a good night, my valiant — if suicidal —"
" companions! See you all in the morning, if we're lucky!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 실험이라고? 우리를 피실험자로? 그거 즐거운 생각이군. 기다릴 수가 없네! 그렇다면 난 네게 좋은 밤을 보내라고 말해주지. "
"용기인지 만용인지 모르겠지만! 모두 아침에 살아서 보자고, 운이 좋다면!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_25645_Text
msgctxt "c69daec1-8d5a-4c57-90bb-5d3e7aaf5b49"
msgid ""
"{n}The pot contains what's left of a savory stew. There's also what seems to "
"be herbal tea left cooling in the nearby mugs, and you spot some dirty "
"plates gathered together. It looks like the people who made camp here had "
"just finished eating and were about to go to sleep.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}냄비에는 남겨진 짭짤한 스튜가 담겨있습니다. 또한 근처에는 식은 허브차가 담겨진 머그잔과 더러운 접시가 쌓여있는 것이 보입니다. "
"여기서 야영지를 한 사람들이 방금 식사를 끝내고 잠들기 시작한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_34714_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "75cc0209-ed5e-473e-83e4-ef3a10d36654"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost sniffs.{/n} \"Camping? Here? Brilliant idea! What does it matter "
"that these hunters had the same idea? Of course, they're missing now. Or "
"worse. Probably worse.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 콧방귀를 뀝니다.{/n} \"야영을? 여기에서? 완전 훌륭한 아이디어야! 여기 사냥꾼들도 같은 생각이었다는게 뭔 "
"문제겠어? 물론, 그들은 지금 사라져 버렸지. 아님 뭐 더 나쁜 일을 당했을 수도 있고. 아마도 더 나쁜 일말야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_37083 1_Text
msgctxt "e79762eb-adfe-416f-b6d8-61f62e9fc343"
msgid ""
"{n}The lack of obvious causes or dangers makes the deserted campsite seem "
"even more suspicious. You choose to leave before whatever fate befell the "
"hunters can befall you as well.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}명백한 원인이나 위험이 없기 때문에 버려진 야영지는 더욱 의심스러울 수 밖에 없습니다. 사냥꾼이 어떤 운명에 처했든 당신은 이곳을 "
"떠나기로 결정했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_37083_Text
msgctxt "e774b990-5855-4d90-b94c-b852660c6584"
msgid ""
"{n}A bonfire is dying in the middle of the grassy glade. Nearby, a cooking "
"pot is still hot, and tin mugs are scattered about. Three bedrolls have been "
"rolled out beneath the tree, but there doesn't seem to be anyone around. "
"There are no sounds of wildlife, either. The mysterious scene is oddly "
"disquieting.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}모닥불이 푸른 잔디 한가운데서 죽어 가고 있습니다. 근처에 요리 냄비는 아직도 뜨거웠고 머그잔이 흩어져 있습니다. 나무 밑에 침낭 "
"세개가 펼쳐져 있지만 주위에 아무도 보이지 않습니다. 야생 동물의 소리도 들리지 않습니다. 이 신비로운 장면은 이상하게 불안합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_65950 1_Text
msgctxt "32ea2a39-82bf-43e0-beff-c770bca0e5df"
msgid ""
"{n}This shimmering is definitely a magical effect of some sort. Judging by "
"its aura, someone may have been trying to cross the borders between the "
"worlds.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 반짝임은 분명히 어떤 마법적인 효과임에 틀림없습니다. 그 기운에 따라 판단해 볼 때 누군가는 차원의 경계를 넘으려고 했을 "
"것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_65950_Text
msgctxt "dffd5766-d5ff-44e9-95b8-9760884bff9f"
msgid ""
"{n}It's all common hunter's supplies: a flint, some clothes, a box of salt. "
"Oddly, there's only one backpack here, though there are three bedrolls and "
"three mugs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}모두 사냥꾼의 평범한 물품입니다. 부싯돌, 약간의 옷, 소금 상자가 있습니다. 이상하게도 세 개의 침낭과 세 개의 머그잔이 있음에도 "
"여기에는 배낭이 단 하나만이 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_75518_Text
msgctxt "4982d847-f60b-43d0-8c2f-9051652ad3d4"
msgid ""
"{n}Several possible explanations come to mind, both natural and magical. "
"None of them are cause for immediate concern, but it would be best to remain "
"alert.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}물리적으로 그리고 마법에 의해서 몇 가지 가능한 설명이 떠오릅니다. 그 무엇도 당장 걱정할 것은 아니지만 경계를 유지하는 것이 가장 "
"좋겠습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_76365 1_Text
msgctxt "37a1c4f2-be75-4622-bb7a-c26eff6acec4"
msgid "{n}Suddenly, you hear screaming coming from the east.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}갑자기 동쪽에서 비명소리가 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_76365 2_Text
msgctxt "86f530c5-ae53-41ef-b61d-f91211605458"
msgid "{n}It appears as though they suddenly changed their minds and left.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}갑자기 마음이 바뀌어서 그들은 떠난 것처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_76365_Text
msgctxt "4c7830cd-3c6b-4125-afad-c6a4c52073fa"
msgid ""
"{n}There's no sign of a fight. It doesn't look like the hunters were "
"abducted or scared away, either.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}싸움의 흔적은 없습니다. 사냥꾼들이 납치됐거나 겁먹어 달아난 것처럼 보이지는 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_77048 1_Text
msgctxt "40629266-d87f-4eaa-bc7b-9bb270e8b574"
msgid ""
"{n}After exploring for a while, you begin to understand what's wrong here. "
"The fire's embers glow a little too bright; the grass and trees are a bit "
"too green; the air itself is a touch too fresh. Everything looks like a too-"
"fresh painting seen through a shimmering mirage.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 탐색 후, 당신은 여기서 무엇이 잘못되었는지 깨닫기 시작합니다. 불씨가 너무 밝게 빛났습니다. 풀과 나무는 너무 짙은 "
"초록색입니다. 공기는 너무 신선했습니다. 모든 것이 신기루를 통해 본 너무 생생한 그림처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite/Cue_94734_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8a1ddb31-e981-4e8f-b454-dbfa6c4f91f9"
msgid "{n}Ekun sniffs the mugs, then shakes his head.{/n} \"Not a menace.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 머그잔 냄새를 맡고 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"위험한 건 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_03812_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "334ab0bb-5f9b-4f5a-83b4-305ad4e3a388"
msgid "Left the desperate hunters to their fate."
msgstr "절박한 사냥꾼들을 그들의 운명에 맡기십시오."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_03812_Text
msgctxt "588e8ec8-45e1-45f3-9c8d-3b218c9ee7ff"
msgid "[Leave the hunters] \"Ha, good luck up there! See you around. Maybe.\""
msgstr "[사냥꾼을 떠납니다] \"하, 행운을 빈다! 다음에 보자. 어쩌면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_22742_Text
msgctxt "d7e0fe47-7fb4-424a-ad87-cce84340b50c"
msgid "\"How many of you are there? Is anyone wounded?\""
msgstr "\"너희는 몇 명이나 있지? 부상자는 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_29072_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "04b9d08a-3fb5-4624-af36-c34c82c412e2"
msgid "Demanded more payment from the desperate hunters."
msgstr "절박한 사냥꾼들에게 더 많은 돈을 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_29072_Text
msgctxt "b6a8d907-e1f1-4fe3-9609-13e517f0527a"
msgid "\"If you could add some gold...\""
msgstr "\"금을 더 낼 수 있다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_33654_Text
msgctxt "1c44f3f3-48c3-4700-961f-4ceceb97d5c1"
msgid "\"How did you get up there?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 거기에 올라 갔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_36598_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0963af3c-e1e9-43bd-a22a-42b18a8a0f29"
msgid "Helped the desperate hunters get down from the rock."
msgstr "절박한 사냥꾼들이 바위에서 내려오도록 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_36598_Text
msgctxt "c2b12a54-e6a1-4a62-bad6-8ee8cf92284b"
msgid ""
"[Throw a rope to the hunter] \"Hold on! I'll help! You're going to be all "
"right.\""
msgstr "[사냥꾼에게 로프를 던져줍니다] \"기다려! 도와줄게! 괜찮을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_57734_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b81964b1-0c51-4d7a-b2db-6c61952bf104"
msgid "Helped the desperate hunters get down from the rock."
msgstr "절박한 사냥꾼들이 바위에서 내려오도록 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_57734_Text
msgctxt "2e9f83d4-cf7f-4b19-baba-63d8123bcc17"
msgid ""
"[Try to catch the hunters using a stretched-out cloak] \"Jump! We'll catch "
"you!\""
msgstr "[망또를 펼쳐 사냥꾼을 받아내려 합니다] \"뛰어! 우리가 너를 잡을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_60910_Text
msgctxt "df84a903-dc81-4fb6-bc20-30f415182033"
msgid "\"Sure, we can help you down — if you pay in advance.\""
msgstr "\"물론 너를 도와 내려줄 수 있지. 돈을 미리 낸다면 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_66004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "916a5050-6996-4668-b29f-34f0461096fc"
msgid "Demanded payment to save the desperate hunters."
msgstr "절박한 사냥꾼들에게 돕기 위해 돈을 지불해야 한다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_66004_Text
msgctxt "8e248fbb-2e96-43df-b6df-fec8666d2e26"
msgid "\"How much is my help worth to you?\""
msgstr "\"내 도움이 네게 얼마 짜리 가치가 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_94069_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "360d9a23-8712-4040-877b-8571df9f0fff"
msgid "Helped the desperate hunters carefully get down from the rock."
msgstr "절박한 사냥꾼들이 조심스럽게 바위에서 내려올 수 있도록 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Answer_94069_Text
msgctxt "9af42c26-c65f-4f48-a1cd-11b370a367c5"
msgid ""
"[Try to catch the hunters using a stretched-out cloak] \"We'll try to catch "
"you, but please, be careful!\""
msgstr "[망또를 펼쳐 사냥꾼을 받아내려 합니다] \"우리가 너희를 받을게! 하지만 부디 조심해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_03081 1_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "4afebb5a-f7cd-4f49-9573-8aea0ecfe008"
msgid ""
"{n}Digging through his pockets, the hunter pulls out a small purse.{/n} "
"\"Take this too, as promised. I'd give you more, but it's all I have!\""
msgstr "{n}주머니를 뒤져 사냥꾼은 작은 지갑을 꺼냅니다.{/n} \"약속대로 이것도 받아줘. 더 많이 주고 싶지만 그게 전부야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_03081_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "c219f3aa-4285-419a-a931-10ee0246ed6d"
msgid ""
"{n}Digging through his pockets, the hunter pulls out a small purse.{/n} "
"\"Take this too. Linnel and me owe you our lives, after all.\""
msgstr "{n}주머니를 뒤져 사냥꾼은 작은 지갑을 꺼냅니다.{/n} \"이것도 받아줘. 린넬과 나는 너에게 목숨을 빚졌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_05828_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "35a30f9f-d0b8-4006-b889-0e5a75b8eadb"
msgid ""
"{n}The hunter hands you a gilded metal cog.{/n} \"Here, as a reward for your "
"efforts. I found it on the corpse up there. It looks valuable.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼은 당신에게 금으로 도금된 금속 톱니바퀴를 건네줍니다.{/n} \"구해준 것에 대한 보답이야. 저기 시체에서 발견했어. "
"가치있는 물건일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_14346_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c7d4205e-70b3-4bec-a7e4-320ce523065b"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost looks back toward the camp you spent the night in. He opens his "
"mouth as if to speak, but he instead bends over and bursts into wild, knee-"
"slapping laughter. After eventually regaining control of himself, he wipes "
"his eyes dry and gives you a silent thumbs-up.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 당신이 밤을 보냈던 야영지로 되돌아갑니다. 그는 무언가 말하려고 했지만 대신 그는 몸을 구부려 무릎을 치면서 폭소를 "
"터뜨립니다. 자신을 통제한 후에 그는 눈물을 닦으며 당신에게 엄지 손가락을 치켜세웁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_33604 1_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "7552c6e0-5b15-4e51-bd86-4e9e5e277f61"
msgid ""
"\"We're just two. I'm mostly good, thank {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}. Linnel "
"here, though, she came down pretty hard. She's got some broken ribs, can "
"hardly breathe. As for Duldin... I think he's dead. I can only see his feet "
"sticking out of the rock. There's some dwarf corpse up here, too — guess he "
"got here the same way we did.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 두 사람이야. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 가호로 나는 괜찮아. 하지만 여기 린넬은 꽤 세게 떨어졌어. 갈비뼈가 "
"부러져 숨을 쉴수가 없어. 덜딘은... 아무래도 죽은 것 같아. 그의 발이 바위 밖으로 튀어 나와 있는 것만 보았어. 위에는 왠 드워프 "
"시체도 있어. 아마 우리처럼 여기로 옮겨져 왔나봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_33604 2_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "e8db24bd-7328-46e2-9df2-2adac92637f2"
msgid ""
"\"No clue! We were heading off to sleep when a dream came over us — a bright "
"one, too! All three of us were in a river, and the current was sweeping us "
"away! The trees on shore were too high — up to the sky, I tell ya! And the "
"clouds above were like mountains! We went over a waterfall and hurtled "
"down... Next I knew, we were up here on this rock, wet like drowned rats. "
"I've never seen anything like it! And I hope I never have to again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전혀 모르겠어! 우리가 잠을 잤을 때 뭔가 밝은 빛이 나타나더니 우리 모두 같은 꿈속으로 빠져들었어! 우리 셋 모두는 강물 속에 "
"휩쓸리고 있었어! 강기슭에 있는 나무는 마치 하늘에 있는것처럼 너무 높았고 그 위의 구름은 마치 산 같았어! 우리는 폭포로 흘러갔고 "
"아래로 떨어졌어... 그리고는 물에 빠진 생쥐처럼 젖은채 이 바위 위에 올려져 있다는걸 알게되었지. 이런건 정말 처음 봐! 다시는 겪고 "
"싶지 않다구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_33604 3_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "827d44fa-50de-42d3-b6c1-a4b628db286f"
msgid ""
"\"I found this funny thing on a corpse up here... It looks valuable. You "
"save us, it's yours.\""
msgstr "\"시체에서 뭔가 재미있는 것을 발견했어... 귀중한 것 같아. 우리를 구해주었으니 네 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_33604 4_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "5f8de8a6-6dd1-481b-88c5-ab6b08534169"
msgid ""
"{n}The hunter digs in his pocket and pulls out an odd object — a gilded "
"metal cog. He holds it up to give you a good view, then tosses it down to "
"you.{/n} \"There! Now, help us down, for gods' sake!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주머니를 뒤져 사냥꾼은 금 도금된 금속 톱니바퀴를 꺼냅니다. 그는 그것을 꺼내 보여주고는 당신에게 던집니다.{/n} \"여기 받아! "
"이제는 우리를 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_33604 5_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "4114d629-acc9-468e-9c42-f08e512f2fde"
msgid ""
"{n}The hunter reaches out, pleading.{/n} \"All we have is yours! Just get us "
"down from here!\""
msgstr "{n}사냥꾼이 손을 뻗으며 애원합니다.{/n} \"우리에게는 너 뿐이야! 우리를 여기서 내려만 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_33604_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "9aa9f411-d574-40e3-94a2-e64c37ed59d3"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear a voice from somewhere above you.{/n} \"You there! Help us!\" {n}"
"A man wearing simple clothes waves to you from the top of the massive "
"rock.{/n} \"Hunters, we are! We were camping in the woods, then suddenly we "
"were up here! Some weird magics or something, I guess. For gods' sake, help "
"us!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 어딘가에서 음성을 듣습니다.{/n} \"이봐 거기! 도와줘!\" {n}거대한 바위 꼭대기에서 간소한 옷차림의 한 남자가 "
"당신에게 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"우리는 사냥꾼이야! 숲에서 야영을 하고 있었다가 갑자기 여기에 오게 되었어! 이상한 마법이나 뭐 그런 "
"것 같아. 제발 우릴 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_68753 1_Text
msgctxt "560c5f72-1ef2-4ecc-b80c-9bfab2f15c7d"
msgid ""
"{n}You throw the rope up. The hunter fixes it to the rock, then slowly "
"lowers his wounded friend before climbing down himself.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 밧줄을 던져 올립니다. 사냥꾼은 그것을 바위에 고정시킨 다음 천천히 상처입은 친구를 내리고는 자신도 내려옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_68753 2_Text
msgctxt "cd78d917-3faf-4b27-880d-5f5884edc32e"
msgid ""
"{n}You manage to get a cloak stretched taut to try and catch the hunters. "
"The man above pushes his wounded friend down first, then jumps himself. You "
"catch them both without any trouble.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 사냥꾼을 잡으려고 망토를 잡아당겨 팽팽히 펼쳤습니다. 위의 남자는 상처 입은 친구를 먼저 밀어 내린 다음 그 자신도 "
"뛰어내립니다. 당신은 아무런 문제없이 둘 다 잡았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_68753 3_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "b546e74c-9bdc-4a8a-a61d-a05b2c9e16f5"
msgid ""
"{n}You manage to get a cloak stretched taut to try and catch the hunters. "
"The man above pushes his wounded friend down first, but you fail to catch "
"her. The impact kills her immediately. You manage to catch the man when he "
"jumps down, and he looks at you reproachfully.{/n} \"She... she's dead, "
"isn't she? How could you let this happen? What... what am I to do now?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 사냥꾼을 잡으려고 망토를 잡아당겨 팽팽히 펼쳤습니다. 위의 남자는 상처 입은 친구를 먼저 밀어 내렸지만 당신은 그녀를 잡지 "
"못합니다. 그 충격으로 그녀는 즉사합니다. 남자가 뛰어 내릴때는 가까스로 그 남자를 붙잡을 수 있었고 그는 당신을 당황스럽게 "
"바라봅니다.{/n} \"그녀가... 그녀가 죽었잖아. 안그래? 어떻게 이런 일을 생기게 할 수 있어? 이제 어떻게 해야하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_68753 4_Text
msgctxt "59042584-9217-458b-b501-b7d4f9cb34a4"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, you can't! We had a deal!\" {n}Ignoring their frantic cries, you "
"walk back into the woods. A moment later, you hear a scream behind you, "
"followed by a wet thud. It sounds like the unlucky hunter grew desperate "
"enough to try getting down on his own.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐 그러지 마! 우린 거래 했어!\" {n}그들의 미친듯한 외침을 무시하고 당신은 숲 속으로 걸어 들어갑니다. 잠시 후 비명 소리가 "
"들리고 둔탁한 쿵소리가 들립니다. 불운한 사냥꾼이 절망하여 스스로 내려오려다 떨어져 난 소리 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_68753 5_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "57b12ec1-e909-4ec3-80c4-d60ebca7c4b6"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim closes his eyes as if trying to hold on to the hunter's death "
"cry.{/n} \"How did I miss it before...?\" {n}he whispers.{/n} \"Death cries "
"are music, too... So beautiful...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 사냥꾼의 죽음에 대한 애도를 하는 것처럼 눈을 감습니다.{/n} \"내가 어떻게 전에는 그걸 놓쳤을까?\" {n}그는 "
"속삭입니다.{/n} \"죽음의 외침은 음악이기도하고... 너무 아름다워...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_68753 6_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ebc663ff-5edb-4985-aae9-a20a6e950f0f"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia glares at you.{/n} \"That was mean and undignified... Your Grace!"
"\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"그건 정말 비열하고 비존엄했어요... 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_68753_Text
msgctxt "84a50263-0695-49f1-833a-e726ebd3ddbf"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, don't leave! Save us!\" {n}Ignoring their frantic cries, you walk "
"back into the woods. A moment later, you hear a scream behind you, followed "
"by a wet thud. It sounds like the unlucky hunter grew desperate enough to "
"try getting down on his own.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐 떠나지 마! 우리를 구해줘!\" {n}그들의 미친듯한 외침을 무시하고 당신은 숲 속으로 걸어 들어갑니다. 잠시 후 비명 소리가 "
"들리고 둔탁한 쿵소리가 들립니다. 불운한 사냥꾼이 절망하여 스스로 내려오려다 떨어져 난 소리 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_83271_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "38546661-2792-4b58-9f60-7315af17bb0c"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for saving my life. You were paid in advance, so all's proper "
"and honest now.\""
msgstr "\"내 생명을 구해주어 고마워. 미리 내 돈을 받았으니 이제는 거래가 이루어진 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_83956_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4ccb3eb4-04ae-4ee4-9642-3b70c56e8446"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim gives a deep sigh.{/n} \"What a shame... He was just one step away "
"from his death... Such a rare chance for a most beautiful end — wasted!\" {n}"
"He shakes his head in frustration.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 깊은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"정말 수치스럽군... 그는 방근 자신의 죽음에서 한발짝 멀어진 거야... 가장 아름다운 끝을 "
"맞을 희귀한 기회를 버리다니!\" {n}그는 좌절하여 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_94061_Text
#. Speaker : DesertedCampsite_AdventurerNPC
msgctxt "d0574573-94b4-4602-ac71-76bc6cea5139"
msgid ""
"{n}The hunter hands you a gilded metal cog.{/n} \"My word's good as gold — "
"here's what I promised. Thank you for your help!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼은 당신에게 도금한 금속 톱니바퀴를 건네줍니다.{/n} \"내 약속은 금과 같지. 여기 내가 약속한 거야. 도와주어 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_94063_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a839bbec-722d-48c1-8d88-3a2e37c2a7b5"
msgid ""
"\"What?! For the sake of {g|Desna}Desna{/g}, this sounds... No-no-no, no way "
"that can be true. He must have drunken too much and seen a bad dream!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라구?! {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여... 이게 무슨... 아니. 아니. 그럴 리가 없어. 그는 술에 취해서 나쁜 꿈을 꾸었을 "
"거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Cue_94066_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a90abdc2-a577-40d6-b166-6fb325191f42"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Losers! And you're a sharp one! It's only fitting we rob the likes of "
"them!\" {n}The half-orc roars with laughter as he makes an obscene gesture "
"toward the stone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하, 패배자들! 넌 정말 예리한 친구야! 그들 같은 놈들을 강도질 하는게 딱 제격이지!\" {n}하프오크는 웃음 소리를 터뜨리며 돌을 "
"향해 외설스러운 손짓을 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Dialogue_ST_Start_WhatToBark
msgctxt "bd035c0a-c0bb-4058-bc85-a2da4741ad13"
msgid "\"Thanks again for saving us! What would we do without you.\""
msgstr "\"우리를 구해줘서 다시 한번 고마워! 그쪽 일행들이 없었다면 정말 큰일날뻔했어 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/DesertedCampsite_StuckTraveller/Dialogue_ST_Start_WhatToBark_1
msgctxt "4836bfae-d545-433c-a7ce-aab062add621"
msgid "\"I'll stay here and take care of Linnel's body.\""
msgstr "\"나는 여기 머물면서 린넬의 시신을 돌볼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/FallenTreeBark/BigOutdoorArea_FallenTreeBark_WhatToBark_1
msgctxt "189abc7f-e75c-47b5-b618-2915776d663d"
msgid "A huge tree trunk can be used to climb up or down."
msgstr "거대한 나무 줄기를 사용하여 위아래로 기어 올라갈 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_09971_Text
msgctxt "39726338-0a0b-4aef-aa3c-f6766ad13c4f"
msgid "[Detect Magic] \"Maybe there's some enchantment beneath the tree...\""
msgstr "[마법 탐지] \"어쩌면 나무 밑에 마법같은게 걸려있을지도..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_12087_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2d5b7d50-317e-48f7-abe3-f962889b80ca"
msgid "Exiled the treasure hunters."
msgstr "보물 사냥꾼을 추방합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_12087_Text
msgctxt "d57f362f-7aac-4cc0-9af5-696bed0668ad"
msgid "\"Get out of my lands! I'll dig the gold up myself.\""
msgstr "\"내 땅에서 꺼져! 내가 금을 직접 파내겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_36483_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ba926c50-7672-4bca-b09c-146d043ce264"
msgid "Calmed the treasure hunters."
msgstr "보물 사냥꾼들을 진정시킵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_36483_Text
msgctxt "9707f845-35cc-4bd9-b3a8-9e32e896ee04"
msgid "\"You're not in trouble. Just tell me everything.\""
msgstr "\"너희를 곤란하게 할 생각은 없어. 그냥 무슨 일인지 다 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_41263 1_Text
msgctxt "65b30442-ba61-4593-91ea-ee52071fa74a"
msgid ""
"\"Why aren't you worried about wandering around these lands? It can be "
"dangerous out here.\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 땅 주변을 배회하는 것을 걱정하지 않지? 여기는 위험할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_41263_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "87eb1f01-9fd7-4822-8ba1-1e26770b70fb"
msgid "Helped the treasure hunters look for gold."
msgstr "보물 사냥꾼들이 금을 찾도록 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_41263_Text
msgctxt "22214dcc-1617-4fa2-9c18-f295b0fd556f"
msgid "\"I'll help you dig the gold up. We'll share the treasure.\""
msgstr "\"금을 파내는 것을 도와주지. 그 보물을 나누자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_41964_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d31d1c23-8e98-406e-ad4e-8b208ffdc354"
msgid "Made the treasure hunters work for free."
msgstr "보물 사냥꾼들을 착취합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_41964_Text
msgctxt "01617b60-06d1-4652-8206-561ba2c0151f"
msgid ""
"\"These lands are mine or soon will be. Go ahead and fell the tree. I'll "
"wait to see what's hidden beneath it.\""
msgstr "\"이 땅은 내 것이 되거나 곧 그렇게 될 거야. 가서 나무를 쓰러뜨려. 그 아래 무엇이 있을지 궁금하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_43826_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b5169203-4940-4af7-b171-afa37dfc541d"
msgid "Scared the treasure hunters."
msgstr "보물 사냥꾼들을 겁줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_43826_Text
msgctxt "8708c74e-755b-4ca3-88b6-71fa577a88fd"
msgid "\"Tell me the truth while you can. My patience wears thin.\""
msgstr "\"말이라는 걸 할 수 있을때 진실을 말해. 내 인내심이 약해지고 있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_52206_Text
msgctxt "7855a081-f04c-409a-9370-c6734870d5e9"
msgid "\"Farewell then. Good luck in your search.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 이만. 잘 찾아 봐. 행운을 빌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_55650_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8b216d19-1f15-4f1d-b4c5-fe673fe4acf6"
msgid "Told the truth to the treasure hunters."
msgstr "보물 사냥꾼들에게 진실을 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_55650_Text
msgctxt "64a6d323-b908-4820-9453-42acedd96a7a"
msgid "\"The truth is this bard lied to you.\""
msgstr "\"진실은 그 바드가 네게 거짓말을 한거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_63138_Text
msgctxt "99032051-a4eb-4736-b929-bdbeac9994f4"
msgid "\"And what gold would that be?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 금을 말하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_76366_Text
msgctxt "da07d1ca-72f1-4462-b8a1-28ec6ba177a1"
msgid "\"Who are you? What's happening here?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지? 여기 무슨일 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_81924_Text
msgctxt "658fa9a8-c452-4851-80b4-c56e0f05e5a8"
msgid "\"Barbarians, you say? If I remember their customs correctly...\""
msgstr "\"바바리안들이라구? 내가 기억한 그들의 관습이 맞다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_96411_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e0d30dba-835f-4bb0-9196-a388345938e9"
msgid "Tricked the treasure hunters."
msgstr "보물 사냥꾼들을 속입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Answer_96411_Text
msgctxt "290c4cc4-7a48-4ce9-b00c-e7dd7680e0fb"
msgid ""
"\"The bard lied to you; the treasure's not here. I know where it really is.\""
" [Point at a random location on the map] \"I'm too busy to dig it out "
"myself...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 바드가 너에게 거짓말을 한거야. 보물은 여기에 없어. 나야말로 실제로 어디에 있는지 알고 있어.\" [지도에 아무 곳이나 "
"가리킵니다] \"나는 너무 바빠서 직접 찾을 시간이 없거든..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_10447 1_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "0ec2ad8b-3069-40e7-a4e8-6bd4963bf173"
msgid ""
"\"Right you were, Calvert. We shouldn't have told the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} about the treasure.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 칼버트. 우리는 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께 보물에 대해 말하지 말았어야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_10447 2_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer3
msgctxt "9c1bce16-182f-4fde-9496-b01165369f50"
msgid ""
"\"Time to flee this barony, I'd say. With a {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} "
"like that, we'll never get any treasure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 영지를 떠날 때가 된 거지. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 이런식이라면 우린 절대 어떤 보물도 얻지 못할거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_10447 3_Text
msgctxt "4ece0a25-4499-45f8-8b88-9179691bb4a9"
msgid ""
"{n}The old oak bears no enchantment. This doesn't exclude the possibility "
"that treasure is there, it may simply be hidden too deep, or perhaps the "
"treasure isn't magical in nature.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 오크 나무는 어떤 마법도 걸려있지 않았습니다. 그렇다고 이곳에 보물이 없을거라고 확신할 수는 없습니다. 보물이 매우 깊이 "
"숨겨져 있을수도 있고 또는 보물이 마법에 걸린게 아닐 수도 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_10447_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "dbc28b25-e5ba-4a8a-b7fd-2ed130205de6"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, {mf|m'lord|m'lady}!\" {n}The villager bows.{/n} \"See, Calvert? "
"Our {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} is kind. And you were so scared of "
"telling {mf|him|her} anything.\""
msgstr ""
"\"감사합니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\" {n}마을 주민은 꾸벅 인사합니다.{/n} \"봤어? 칼버트? 우리 "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께선 친절하시다구. 너는 뭐든 말하는걸 너무 겁내한거야 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_12148_Text
msgctxt "76d15dc4-f4d4-4e06-8d6b-fe08287472bf"
msgid ""
"{n}You can't recall anything useful about ancient barbarians roaming these "
"lands. But you're positive something interesting can be found under this "
"tree.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 고대 바바리안족이 이 지역을 돌아다녔다는것에 대해 어떤것도 기억해내지 못합니다. 하지만 이 나무 아래에서 뭔가 흥미로운 것을 "
"발견할 수 있다는 것에 긍정합니다..{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_13531_Text
msgctxt "4bd08cd3-b297-4439-99f1-da77615971bc"
msgid ""
"{n}As you recall, there were barbarian tribes that rode across these lands "
"long ago. Moreover, they buried their chieftains in cairns with all their "
"earthly possessions. However, all the known cairns are far to the east or "
"northwest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 기억으로는, 오래 전 이 땅을 횡단했던 바바리안 부족이 있었습니다. 게다가 그들은 부족 족장들과 그들의 모든 세속적인 "
"소유물들을 돌무덤에 함께 묻었다고 합니다. 하지만 알려진 바바리안 돌무덤들은 동쪽이나 북서쪽으로 이곳에서 더 멀리 떨어진 곳에 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_14331 1_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "526192ca-e391-4e73-af3c-eb95bbd6f255"
msgid ""
"\"Because we paid too little and he held a grudge! I told you. 'Don't be "
"greedy,' I said. 'Get your stash out of your boot.' And what did you do...?\""
" {n}The villager gestures frantically.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 돈을 너무 적게줘서 빈정 상했나봐! 내가 말했잔아. 욕심 내지 말라고. 신발에 숨겨놓은 비상금도 꺼내라고. 그때 넌 어떻게 "
"했지?\" {n}마을 사람은 미친 듯이 몸짓합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_14331 2_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer3
msgctxt "c24f174c-9a82-4788-a126-99b07352e79f"
msgid ""
"\"Good thing our {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} is so kind. Alick, get your "
"gold here. We wanna thank {mf|m'lord|m'lady}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 좋은 점은 친절하다는 거야. 알릭, 네 금을 좀 가져와봐. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}"
"께 고마움을 표시하고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_14331 3_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "b1489a02-e3d4-4af3-bef3-099a7db37a49"
msgid ""
"\"We'll still fell the tree and dig here, {mf|m'lord|m'lady}. Since we've "
"already started, and all.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 계속 나무를 쓰러뜨리고 땅을 파겠습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 모두들 이미 시작했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_14331_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "b26f1d6e-4c21-48d5-93cc-4b8083d1d08e"
msgid "\"L-l-lied how? Why...?\""
msgstr "\"거짓말이라구요? 왜...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_30348_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d13dd29a-0434-4aeb-bfc9-db359ecf0dae"
msgid ""
"\"That bard was too generous. If it was me, I'd have thrown them in the debt-"
"pen, but I would have managed ten gold at least.\" {n}Jubilost turns his "
"gaze to you.{/n} \"Wait, don't tell me you believe this wash about a hidden "
"treasure?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 바드가 너무 관대하네. 만약 나라면 빚을 지고 오라고해서라도 10골드는 받았을꺼야.\" {n}주빌로스트가 당신을 봅니다.{/n} "
"\"잠깐. 설마 이 숨겨진 보물 얘기를 믿는다고 말하려는건 아니지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_38355 1_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "e588e7d6-9e1e-4473-a012-8599dfb27995"
msgid "\"L-l-lied how? Why...?\""
msgstr "\"거짓말이라고? 왜...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_38355 2_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "b368c688-1379-4ba7-b68a-9216aadfb4f9"
msgid ""
"\"He couldn't have lied to us! He was honest, I could see it in his eyes. I "
"know people good, I do!\""
msgstr "\"그가 우리에게 거짓말을 했을리가 없어요! 그의 눈에서 정직함을 느꼈다구요. 나는 사람들이 선하다는걸 알고있어요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_38355 3_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer3
msgctxt "dcc0e655-6076-437a-964c-009ff65a9f12"
msgid ""
"\"Because we paid too little and he held a grudge! I told you. 'Don't be "
"greedy,' I said. 'Get your stash out of your boot.' And what did you do...?\""
" {n}The villager gestures frantically.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아무래도 우리가 돈을 너무 적게 줘서 빈정상했나봐! 내가 말했잖아. 욕심 내지 말라고. 신발에 숨겨놓은 비상금도 꺼내라고. 그때 넌 "
"어떻게 했지?\" {n}마을 사람은 미친 듯이 몸짓합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_38355 4_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "492fadec-e61e-4a1c-84ba-efc48eb1e976"
msgid ""
"\"I know which way he left! It's only been a half-day, we could still catch "
"him!\""
msgstr "\"나는 그가 어떤 길로 갔는지 알아! 반나절 밖에 안지났다고, 그를 잡을 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_38355 5_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "311ed1df-f7fd-40a1-99ff-74a1d25678f0"
msgid ""
"\"We'll get on our knees before him, empty our pockets if need be. He'll "
"forgive us, then he'll tell us where the treasure really is. Let's go! Come "
"on!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다시 바드를 찾아가서 무릎 꿇고 있는 돈 다드리자구. 그러면 아마 보물이 진짜 어디에 있는지 알려 줄 거야. 가자! 어서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_38355_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "218b50f4-7db8-4af3-b9a1-a7b6100507d9"
msgid "{n}The villager impatiently awaits your reply.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}마을 주민은 당신의 대답을 참을 수 없다는 듯이 기다리고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_53258 1_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "bf2b038b-1edc-478b-8786-dca99677828d"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing here,\" {n}the villager says, perplexed.{/n} \"What happened? Did "
"the bard lie to us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 아무것도 없어.\" {n}마을 사람이 당혹스러워 말합니다.{/n} \"이게 어떻게 된거지? 바드가 우리에게 거짓말을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_61793_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "864a67b6-447f-47ca-81df-66169e2c317e"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, {mf|m'lord|m'lady}. We'll give you your share soon as we find "
"the treasure!\" {n}The villagers, newly inspired, march eagerly in the "
"direction you indicated.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"고맙습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 보물을 찾게되면 몫을 꼭 드리겠습니다!\" {n}마을 사람들은 새로운 열정에 가득찬 "
"채, 당신이 지시한 방향으로 열렬히 걸어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_63685_Text_String
msgctxt "4cc56ffd-207c-41f9-b659-42d542b9ea5a"
msgid ""
"{n}After several hours of digging and chopping, the ancient tree finally "
"yields. The oak creaks indignantly as it's uprooted and falls aside, its "
"remaining roots dangling in the air. There's nothing under the tree but "
"several worms and a mole den.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}몇 시간 동안 땅을 파고 나무를 깎아 낸 후 마을 사람들은 드디어 고대 나무를 쓰러뜨렸습니다. 오크나무는 뿌리째 뽑혀 떨어지면서 "
"삐걱거렸고 잔뿌리가 허공에 달랑거립니다. 나무 밑에는 아무것도 없지만 벌레 몇 마리와 두더지 굴이 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_69767_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1bb01963-ceb0-42a8-9d1e-7b800f7bc959"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe we're wasting precious time because you...\" {n}Jubilost "
"trails off, then coughs.{/n} \"Actually, I know of a place where a fountain "
"of ale flows freely from the stone. I can show you — for a modest fee. Paid "
"in advance, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네 때문에 우리가 귀중한 시간을 낭비하고 있다니 믿기지가 않는구만...\" {n}주빌로스트가 말을 하다가 기침합니다.{/n} \"사실"
", 마침 나도 돌에서 에일이 흐르는 샘을 알고 있거든. 적은 비용으로 어디있는지 알려줄 수 있어. 물론 비용은 선불이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_75615 1_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "b246435d-9e53-44f3-ac2a-ee7b146035ac"
msgid ""
"\"Time to flee this barony, I'd say. With a {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} "
"like that, we'll never get any treasure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 영지를 떠날 때가 된 거지. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 이런식이라면 우린 절대 어떤 보물도 얻지 못할거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_75615 2_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "53286383-45f1-4ec1-baf5-fc9ede6b5e6e"
msgid ""
"{n}The villager smiles broadly.{/n} \"Welcome, {mf|m'lord|m'lady}! The "
"work'll go faster together. As for the gold, we dig more for fun than the "
"money anyhow.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마을 주민은 활짝 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"함께하시죠. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 함께하면 더 빨리 찾을 수 있죠. "
"원래가 금을 찾는건, 돈보다는 재미로 파는거라구요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_75615 3_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "349d0199-23bd-40f0-815f-6ddb5c497b4f"
msgid ""
"\"If you're digging for fun, the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} can have "
"your share instead.\""
msgstr "\"거 재미로 파는 거라면, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께 네 몫을 드리지그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_75615 4_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "27d1d1e0-1b59-49b4-8611-6077e9a45ce6"
msgid ""
"\"We've lived all our lives around here, {mf|m'lord|m'lady}. Got nothing to "
"be scared of.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 근처 마을에서 평생을 살아왔는걸요. 무서울 게 없습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_75615 5_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "6d0e3624-b6ab-4488-a106-d4c7e2515928"
msgid ""
"\"If we meet a kobold, we hit him hard. If we meet a wolf, we climb a tree. "
"And if a troll comes around, we run as fast as we can.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 코볼트를 만난다면 때려주면 되는거고. 늑대를 만나면 나무로 올라가면 되는거고. 만약 트롤이 오면 우리는 미친듯이 빨리 뛰면 "
"되는거죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_75615 6_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer3
msgctxt "224ed2c5-ac08-414f-ad3b-d8581dfea889"
msgid ""
"\"As for bandits, we're not afraid of them. They don't cross us because we "
"don't have two coins to scrape together.\""
msgstr "\"도적들은 딱히 두렵지 않습니다. 저희는 딱 봐도 동전 몇푼 없는데, 그런 저희를 해치거나 그러지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_75615_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "0a125d21-0aaf-4079-8093-1ec522c58866"
msgid ""
"\"Right you were, Calvert. We shouldn't have told the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} about the treasure.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 칼버트. 우리는 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께 보물에 대해 말하지 말았어야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_89086 1_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "44565f3d-d4a5-4a7f-b22b-7667e1d6942b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe we're wasting precious time because you...\" {n}Jubilost "
"trails off, then coughs.{/n} \"Actually, I know of a place where a fountain "
"of ale flows freely from the stone. I can show you — for a modest fee. Paid "
"in advance, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네 때문에 우리가 귀중한 시간을 낭비하고 있다니 믿기지가 않는구만...\" {n}주빌로스트가 말을 하다가 기침합니다.{/n} \"사실"
", 마침 나도 돌에서 에일이 흐르는 샘을 알고 있거든. 적은 비용으로 어디있는지 알려줄 수 있어. 물론 비용은 선불이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_89086 2_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "56a4dc10-e8cb-454e-8712-af93b375e55d"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe we're wasting precious time because you...\" {n}Jubilost "
"trails off, then coughs.{/n} \"Actually, I know of a place where a fountain "
"of ale flows freely from the stone. I can show you — for a modest fee. Paid "
"in advance, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네 때문에 우리가 귀중한 시간을 낭비하고 있다니 믿기지가 않는구만...\" {n}주빌로스트가 말을 하다가 기침합니다.{/n} \"사실"
", 마침 나도 돌에서 에일이 흐르는 샘을 알고 있거든. 적은 비용으로 어디있는지 알려줄 수 있어. 물론 비용은 선불이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_96413_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "fd3ff51a-21c7-4672-bf94-67a280fa1c2c"
msgid ""
"\"Shame on you! Just one misfortune, and you are ready to give up? Where is "
"your wonderlust, your taste for adventure? Were is your faith in your lucky "
"star that will lead you towards a great future?\""
msgstr ""
"\"부끄러운 줄 알아요! 단 한번의 불행으로 벌써 포기할 준비를 하는건가요? 모험에 대한 열망은 어디에 있는거죠? 성대한 미래로 이끌 "
"당신의 행운의 별에 대한 믿음은 어디에 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_96415_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "bb681880-f995-4043-bef5-7ef4870bc313"
msgid ""
"\"Huh, these were some mighty words! Here's the bard's art for you! Even "
"though you understand she's bullshiting you, the way she does it makes you "
"want to believe!\""
msgstr ""
"\"허, 이거참 언어술사같은 말들이구만! 이게 바로 바드의 예술이지! 그녀가 헛소리 하는게 뭔가 짐작가면서도 그녀의 말을 믿고 싶게만드는 "
"언어의 예술!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_96416_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "d14e9c3a-ab9f-4d1a-9ded-f04b1bcc51b9"
msgid ""
"\"How do you know it's bull? It's not just some bard from a tavern, it's "
"{mf|His|Her} {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}'s own bard! Why would our "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} lie to us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 헛소리라는 것을 어떻게 알어? 그녀는 근처 주점에서 온 떠돌이 바드가 아니라 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} 휘하의 바드라고! "
"왜 우리 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 바드가 거짓말을 하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 10_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "4c8e4a97-2e96-424f-9d12-78d9457d7369"
msgid ""
"\"Gold? Ah, nothing like that here… {mf|m'lord|m'lady},\" {n}the bravest of "
"them nods, and the others quickly do the same.{/n} \"I just… well, Edgar "
"here is too bold.\""
msgstr ""
"\"금이요? 그런거 여기 없어요..{mf|영주님|영주님}\" {n}그들 중에서 가장 용감해보이는 자가 끄덕이자 다른 사람들도 빠르게 "
"따라합니다.{/n} \"나는 그냥... 글쎄, 여기 에드가는 너무 무모해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 11_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "45597f17-2d4d-4c7c-af37-00ad532165c1"
msgid ""
"\"Alick's gonna marry Martha, you see,\" {n}the third man adds,{/n} \"so we "
"were gonna carve their names into this trunk here. I was gonna carve a "
"picture of her tits, too, but Alick said that was too bold.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아 그니까..앨릭과 마사는 결혼 할 거거든요.\" {n}셋째 사람이 끼어듭니다.{/n} \"그래서 우린 이 나무에 그들의 이름을 "
"새기고 싶었어요. 저는 그녀의 젖퉁도 그려넣고 싶었지요. 하지만 앨릭이 말하길 그건 너무 나갔다고..뭐 그런 얘기입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 13_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer3
msgctxt "ddf91f51-7f54-416c-b4a8-0e3a09a5023e"
msgid ""
"{n}The villager glances at his sullen companions.{/n} \"We're searching for "
"gold here, {mf|m'lord|m'lady}. A traveling bard spent the night in our "
"village, told us tales about big fights, and barbarians, and the chieftains "
"who led their hordes here long ago.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마을 사람은 뾰루퉁한 동료들을 힐끗 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"우리는 여기서 금을 찾고 있었습니다. 여행 중이던 한 바드가 우리 "
"마을에서 밤을 보냈는데, 아주 오래 전의 큰 전투와 바바리안 그리고 그 무리를 이끌었던 족장에 대한 이야기를 들려주었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 14_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "21a0a782-7699-4182-be20-980bae5c2ce8"
msgid ""
"\"At the end, he said he knew where the barbarian chieftain's buried, "
"promised he could show us.\""
msgstr "\"이야기 마지막에 그는 바바리안 족장이 묻힌 곳을 알고 있고 그 위치를 우리한테 알려주겠다고 하더군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 15_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "ed230509-788c-4cb0-a526-bfeb44f5fb67"
msgid ""
"\"We paid him two gold. He wanted three, but we could only gather two... He "
"told us anyway, though.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 그 바드에게 2골드를 지불했습니다. 그는 3골드를 원했지만 우린 가진게 2골드 뿐이었거든요. 어쨌든 그는 말해줬습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 1_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "0a5b0190-a471-4464-8072-5f9b3227032b"
msgid "\"I found it!\""
msgstr "\"찾았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 2_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "ab4ca04a-b89d-49d2-a02b-9c6883dc16d4"
msgid "\"What? Where? Show us!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 어디? 보여줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 3_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "cf0ca1d1-fd15-4ecf-af5c-a2aa1cdf26d7"
msgid ""
"\"Nay, wasn't nothing, just thought I did. Damned stump!\" {n}The man hits "
"the trunk of the tree with his fist, then winces and massages his hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 아무것도 아니야. 착각한 거였어. 망할 그루터기!\" {n}남자는 주먹으로 나무를 치고는 얼굴을 찡그리고 손을 "
"문지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 4_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer3
msgctxt "52dc8881-58f9-40a8-b5d0-9d259dc980bb"
msgid "\"Well, put your backs into it! I can smell the gold, I can!\""
msgstr "\"자자 힘을 내라고! 여기 분명 금 냄새가 난다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 5_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "8dd8e26f-3d43-41b2-9e6e-f1cab4a8f22d"
msgid ""
"{n}The men jump up and press their backs to the oak's massive trunk. They "
"never take their eyes off you as they lean toward each other, whispering. "
"You barely catch the words \"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}\" and \"treasure."
"\"{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}남자들은 후다닥 오크나무를 등집니다. 그들은 서로에게 조용히 속삭이면서도 당신에게서 눈을 떼지 않습니다. 속삭이는 대화 중에 "
"'{mf|남작님|여남작님|임금님|여왕님}' 혹은 '보물' 이라는 단어가 희미하게 들립니다.\"{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 6_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "24cee3a4-37df-40d3-83c7-70328327a06e"
msgid ""
"\"We're from the village nearby, {mf|m'lord|m'lady},\" {n}the bravest of "
"them answers, and the others nod along.{/n} \"We wanna cut this here tree, "
"see?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 인근 마을 출신입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님}\" {n}그들 중에서 가장 용감해 보이는 자가 대답하자 다른 사람은 따라서 "
"끄덕입니다.{/n} \"보시다시피, 여기 이 나무를 자르고 싶어서요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 7_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2
msgctxt "12cd2d20-66dc-4f72-8f6a-259a07b81f1c"
msgid ""
"\"Winter's not far off, you know. Gonna need some wood,\" {n}the second man "
"adds.{/n} \"And with this much, we maybe could build a boat, too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아시다시피 겨울이 멀지 않은데 나무가 필요해서요.\" {n}두 번째 사람이 끼어듭니다.{/n} \"그리고 이 정도 크기의 나무면 "
"보트를 만들 수도 있고..뭐..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 8_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer3
msgctxt "900d5a42-0363-4c60-bddd-91ae0df5d5dc"
msgid ""
"\"Cut it out, {mf|he|she} heard us,\" {n}the third one mutters, a quiver in "
"his voice.{/n} \"So much for our gold…\""
msgstr ""
"\"에이 다들 때려쳐. 아까 우리가 소근대는 얘기 다 들으셨다구.\" {n}세 번째 사람이 긴장된 목소리로 중얼거립니다.{/n} "
"\"이쯤하자구..금은 분명..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet 9_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "cfc052d6-eca3-4276-81d0-37ea047a9b75"
msgid ""
"{n}The men jump up and press their backs to the oak's massive trunk. They "
"never take their eyes off you as they lean toward each other, whispering. "
"You barely catch the words \"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}\" and \"treasure."
"\"{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}남자들은 후다닥 오크나무를 등집니다. 그들은 서로에게 조용히 속삭이면서도 당신에게서 눈을 떼지 않습니다. 속삭이는 대화 중에 "
"'{mf|남작님|여남작님|임금님|여왕님}' 혹은 '보물' 이라는 단어가 희미하게 들립니다.\"{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GoldFever/Cue_GF_Greet_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1
msgctxt "8f6c16a8-d767-40d3-b65c-766bda064936"
msgid ""
"{n}You see three peasants circling an ancient oak as they talk loudly among "
"themselves.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고대 오크나무를 둘러싸고는 시끄럽게 떠들고 있는 세 명의 농민이 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answ_GR_AmbushAccept_Text
msgctxt "52789c55-d2e0-47a4-ab86-22407740250a"
msgid "[Stay in ambush] \"This is a great place for an ambush. Let's wait.\""
msgstr "[매복을 합니다] \"이 곳은 매복하기에 훌륭한 장소다. 기다리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answ_GR_AmbushRefuse 1_Text
msgctxt "e376a135-3674-42ec-bf31-21deebbc67ae"
msgid "\"Well, follow me then. I hope you will not start getting in my way.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 날 따라와. 내 길을 가로막지 않기를 바라지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answ_GR_AmbushRefuse 2_Text
msgctxt "1c9928ec-8f7e-4838-b6a7-be8f023971c3"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"We will not wait for trolls to just pass by. It would be better to "
"finish off their lair as soon as possible.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"우리는 트롤이 그저 지나가기만 기다리진 않을거야. 가능한 빨리 놈들의 은신처를 끝장내는 것이 더 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answ_GR_AmbushRefuse_Text
msgctxt "4eb31bff-0ea3-4614-a72e-3eae20a9723b"
msgid "\"I would be honored to have a companion like you.\""
msgstr "\"자네 같은 동료를 얻게 되어 영광이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_00301_Text
msgctxt "6cd3979e-d071-45ab-afd2-b95337e01156"
msgid "\"I've found the trolls' lair already.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이미 트롤 소굴을 발견했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_01400_Text
msgctxt "ceacd284-3729-4229-acb0-cc9663a4ab65"
msgid "\"Tell me about the trolls attacking Bristlehill.\""
msgstr "\"브리슬힐을 공격한 트롤들에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_04809_Text
msgctxt "2d161e15-d24c-4ae7-902a-8dc28c6ef32b"
msgid "\"Where are you from? Where is your homeland?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어디 출신이지? 너희 나라는 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_05526_Text
msgctxt "1b959874-4f9d-47ac-8698-d73147bdaaaf"
msgid "\"Do you have any family?\""
msgstr "\"가족이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_06450_Text
msgctxt "baf60b3a-a5f0-4efb-90dd-7bb65c2adc0c"
msgid "\"Why are you sitting on this hill?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 언덕에 앉아 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_08492_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d7b9c34c-75d0-4b37-b46a-ac1f9d4f42f1"
msgid "Respected Ekun's choice not to talk."
msgstr "말하지 않으려는 에쿤을 존중합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_08492_Text
msgctxt "7b4d81ad-c7e0-4f13-a03d-775ede743fa2"
msgid "\"All right, if you don't want to answer, you don't have to.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 대답하고 싶지 않다면 하지 않아도 된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_15446_Text
msgctxt "2fe237dd-a754-425f-b7bc-ee43acb3991e"
msgid "[Lie] \"No, nothing special.\""
msgstr "[거짓] \"아니, 별일 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_23913_Text
msgctxt "04c80ec7-278d-4a5c-93bc-74dc563ab962"
msgid "\"Before we go, I'd like to ask you some questions.\""
msgstr "\"가기 전에, 몇 가지 질문을 하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_28543_Text
msgctxt "868c6184-8e4a-41af-bd45-cf3ace626b6c"
msgid "\"Where did you learn to use a bow?\""
msgstr "\"궁술은 어디서 배웠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_33169_Text
msgctxt "f581c912-abf4-4656-ae42-629936bc49ad"
msgid "\"Yes, I am a friend. So what are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 나는 친구다. 그래서 여기서 뭘 하고 있었다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_39566_Text
msgctxt "3a7cfd73-97f5-4eee-a5f3-f0a9e7e567f1"
msgid "\"Go to the capital, I will find you there.\""
msgstr "\"수도로 가, 거기서 널 찾을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_45092_Text
msgctxt "f1a65896-c2ba-40ce-aca1-63bf7630be8f"
msgid "\"How can a mere carpenter be chasing trolls effectively?\""
msgstr "\"일개 목수가 어떻게 트롤을 쫓을 수 있었던 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_46332_Text
msgctxt "ff5c9ffe-e3b4-46bd-befa-faa63f357400"
msgid "\"Why is your wolf whining?\""
msgstr "\"왜 너의 늑대가 울고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_47294_Text
msgctxt "6067a2af-3da3-4a7f-98c8-1a7f584fd69d"
msgid "\"Who? Can I help you?\""
msgstr "\"누구? 내가 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_47677_Text
msgctxt "c52e68ec-d8f7-4bbb-9dd3-bc0d2259d534"
msgid "\"No offense, but I don't need you. Go on your own path.\""
msgstr "\"기분나쁘게 하려는 건 아니지만, 난 네가 필요없어. 네 갈 길을 가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_48888 1_Text
msgctxt "54e38b82-6fc6-405a-a6e0-8fdc76ae87f0"
msgid "\"You're bleeding, we need to patch you up.\""
msgstr "\"피가 나는데, 우리가 치료해줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_48888_Text
msgctxt "89ba9888-af74-4ae7-a1e4-9dc171e36e50"
msgid ""
"\"I'm {name}. I'm the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} of these lands. Nice to "
"meet you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 {name}. 이 땅의 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이야. 만나서 반갑다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_49706 1_Text
msgctxt "6ae0ef5a-04ec-4b91-af56-07e81b147b68"
msgid "\"You are severely wounded, and will be a burden.\""
msgstr "\"넌 부상이 심하지, 그러니까 짐만 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_49706 2_Text
msgctxt "61525f83-f891-4985-9334-8f72eaa64cf2"
msgid "\"Well, if that's what you want, follow me.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄, 원한다면 나를 따라와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_49706 3_Text
msgctxt "fb0ab257-fcc1-47aa-946d-642b26665a45"
msgid "\"Sorry, but no. I don't need you.\""
msgstr "\"미안하지만 안돼. 나는 네가 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_49706_Text
msgctxt "0a62dc6f-5a27-4264-81e9-61f7f2e34202"
msgid "\"Well, if that's what you want, follow me.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄, 원한다면 나를 따라와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_50218_Text
msgctxt "2f02ade3-6ba7-4566-9c8f-ff1120aa0e93"
msgid "\"You swear by Torag?\""
msgstr "\"너 토락에게 맹세했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_50631_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b9712c33-89fa-40a5-b30d-f63f67d4b585"
msgid "Respected Ekun's choice not to talk."
msgstr "말하지 않으려는 에쿤을 존중합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_50631_Text
msgctxt "a45cdc4d-b459-465c-80e2-7861ddf92928"
msgid ""
"\"All right, if you don't want to talk, have it your way. Good hunting.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 대답하고 싶지 않다면 알아서 해. 사냥 잘하라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_50997_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8ae6ea2e-d0ea-486e-a8fb-e7cf4637d71f"
msgid "Respected Ekun's choice not to talk."
msgstr "말하지 않으려는 에쿤을 존중합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_50997_Text
msgctxt "73f8587d-644c-40f1-a873-a56b788509ff"
msgid "\"Deal.\""
msgstr "\"좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_51651_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c615526c-814e-4fea-9177-e38957b2e916"
msgid "Forced Ekun to talk."
msgstr "에쿤이 대답하게 강요합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_51651_Text
msgctxt "42652a78-abb2-4d0d-8047-d590582aeb48"
msgid ""
"\"I'm the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} of these lands. Answer my questions "
"or you'll get whipped.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 땅의 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이다. 질문에 대답하지 않으면 채찍질을 해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_53158_Text
msgctxt "37c53baa-a129-48b0-aef4-cbb5d758882f"
msgid "\"What's wrong with your wolf?\""
msgstr "\"네 늑대는 뭐가 문제지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_53899_Text
msgctxt "eb1f51ee-429e-4c0d-8cf4-40c505c499de"
msgid "\"Well, it was nice talking to you. Have good luck.\""
msgstr "\"너와 대화해서 좋았다. 행운을 빌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_62758_Text
msgctxt "699197b9-9c2c-490a-9355-ae2bf29f3433"
msgid "\"You're not local, are you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 이 지역 출신이 아니지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_68285_Text
msgctxt "06761f79-621b-4be9-abff-c42fc82e577e"
msgid "\"I've been in the trolls lair already, and killed this Kargadd.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이미 트롤 은신처에 갔고, 카르가드란 녀석도 죽였는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_69382_Text
msgctxt "5c2513f7-a895-452d-9a0c-3f8c5d78e64f"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, there were young trolls, Kargadd's children. They weren't dangerous "
"and I let them go.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 카르가드의 어린 트롤 자식들이 있었어. 위험하지 않아서 풀어줬지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_73686_Text
msgctxt "e96bf2ea-a863-4a0d-9b41-1e4b861a53b3"
msgid "\"Go to the capital. I will find you there.\""
msgstr "\"수도로 가. 거기서 널 찾을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_75798_Text
msgctxt "53debdca-e444-4f69-8c2c-0e4721d372be"
msgid "\"I lured him under direct sunlight, and he turned into stone.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그를 햇빛 아래로 꾀어냈고, 그는 돌로 변했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_79022_Text
msgctxt "2982b60c-ed02-43f1-b73b-06cb38c8b624"
msgid "\"I'm hunting the trolls too. Would you like to join our efforts?\""
msgstr "\"나도 트롤을 사냥하고 있어. 같이 할래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_84235_Text
msgctxt "763dd787-b3c8-454b-912f-ed71586f1c26"
msgid "\"Did you know that local trolls are not afraid of fire now?\""
msgstr "\"이곳 트롤들이 더이상 불을 두려워하지 않는다는 걸 알고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_85590_Text
msgctxt "30bb9adc-72a1-4826-853a-ed320084dd8d"
msgid "\"How did you get wounded?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 다쳤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_87770_Text
msgctxt "c47c69f6-cf7d-4a8d-a300-e6a19ed4893e"
msgid "\"Answer one, at least.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 하나는 대답해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_88927_Text
msgctxt "5d3910cc-8220-4f30-8897-16dea68170e6"
msgid "\"We slit his guts open.\""
msgstr "\"그의 배를 갈라버렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_88962_Text
msgctxt "e3a696b0-9a84-408a-8cdf-b7c6f5a14650"
msgid "\"How did you wind up in the Bristlehill village?\""
msgstr "\"브리슬힐 마을에선 어떻게 지냈어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_90565_Text
msgctxt "3cd45192-8c57-48e5-9885-b49943f30e5d"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, there were troll young, Kargadd's children. I killed them as well.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 카르가드의 어린 트롤 자식들이 있었어. 그것들도 다 죽였지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_98029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d43a94b1-7068-4e25-be78-54f41faab0de"
msgid "Attacked lonely hunter in the woods."
msgstr "숲 속의 외로운 사냥꾼을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_98029_Text
msgctxt "eddf604b-26dc-4fce-9b11-098a6003f248"
msgid "[Attack] \"I am not a friend\"."
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 친구가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_98030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "34ed7c27-2fe9-4478-a483-5f535b31d98a"
msgid "Attacked lonely hunter in the woods."
msgstr "숲 속의 외로운 사냥꾼을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_98030_Text
msgctxt "d2e061d5-2b61-4876-a149-c52e319d7abc"
msgid "[Attack] \"I am sick of homeless drifters in my lands!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 땅에 노숙자라면 지긋지긋해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_98032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "288976ca-d22d-4d5f-aa23-3dca24768338"
msgid "Suspected Ekun might need help and tried to get him to talk."
msgstr "에쿤에게 도움이 필요할 수도 있다 생각하고 그와 대화하려 해봤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_98032_Text
msgctxt "ae74b47c-3596-45de-981b-95c310aecd90"
msgid ""
"\"I don't wish to pressure you, but please answer me. I may be able to help "
"you.\""
msgstr "\"강요하고 싶지 않지만, 대답해줘. 너를 도울 수 있을지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_98033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3b36cf1b-d070-4217-999a-77f7a3c793de"
msgid ""
"Told Ekun you had a right to know something about a person you were helping."
msgstr "도움을 주려는 사람에게는 물어볼 권리가 있음을 에쿤에게 알려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Answer_98033_Text
msgctxt "f0d2bcd7-ad0c-4514-8f8f-74206eb9105a"
msgid "\"To help a person, I need to learn at least a little about them.\""
msgstr "\"누군가를 도우려면, 그 사람을 조금이라도 알아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_00609 1_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "8a2de7a5-9f95-48ae-a1de-b613ad8b4884"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun stares heavily at Harrim, who's gotten into a religious frenzy. You "
"are starting to worry the ranger will simply hit your cleric. But after "
"Harrim runs out of breath at last, Ekun just turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 종교적 광신을 가진 하림을 무겁게 바라봅니다. 당신은 그가 하림을 공격할까 봐 걱정되기 시작됩니다. 그러나 하림의 숨이 결국 "
"가빠지기 시작하자, 에쿤은 그냥 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_00609_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "742fdeab-2678-45e7-8074-71f7008d1e11"
msgid ""
"\"He blesses no one!\" {n}Harrim snaps. His face turns red as he speaks, "
"gesturing actively.{/n} \"He's left his followers to their fates! He's left "
"me — a dwarf — in the hour of ultimate need! What did he do for you, human? "
"Did he help you? How did he protect your village?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 누구도 축복해주지 않아!\" {n}하림은 손가락을 튕깁니다. 그는 얼굴이 붉어지면서 적극적으로 몸짓을 합니다.{/n} \"그는 "
"추종자들이 그들의 운명을 맞도록 남겨뒀네! 그는 드워프인 내가 도움이 필요할 때 저버렸어! 인간, 그가 자네를 위해 뭘 해줬나? 자네를 "
"도와줬나? 그가 자네의 마을을 어떻게 지켜줬지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_08408_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "74900747-5a79-4664-8f07-d02600c7cdcc"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim raises his eyes to the sky.{/n} \"One more lost soul, moaning, "
"suffering from despair. Cast away the false light of the {g|Torag}Torag's{/g}"
" forge, and see the verity in {g|Groetus}Groetus's{/g} moonlight!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 하늘을 바라보고 있습니다.{/n} \"또 하나의 절망에 빠진 영혼이구나. {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 대장간에서 나는 빛을 "
"멀리하고 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}가 뿜는 달빛을 보아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_12488_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c89e149a-8101-4d18-8479-c7b3a0b6480f"
msgid ""
"{n}At first, Harrim doesn't get that he's been asked a question. After he "
"eventually does, Ekun's already turned away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}처음에 하림은 그가 질문을 받았다는 것도 알지 못했습니다. 그가 깨달았을 때, 에쿤은 이미 돌아섰습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_15107_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "b5c50d31-05bf-418f-82ab-47bd582cbaba"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks Harrim up and down, but doesn't react to his passionate "
"speech.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 하림을 위아래로 훑지만 그의 열정적인 연설에는 반응하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_23186 2_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "ec77cc76-5d8f-4645-87a8-a0b4f01e9c12"
msgid ""
"{n}The man staggers to his feet and you notice there's blood soaking the "
"right side of his leather leggings.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}남자는 비틀거리고 오른쪽 다리의 가죽 바지 위로 피가 물들어 있는 것이 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_23186 3_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "426b59ac-b01a-4295-a75d-10ca07be18cb"
msgid ""
"{n}He's very tall and rather lanky. While he stands before you, leaning on "
"his bow, his hurt leg trembles slightly, and the right side of his leggings "
"darkens again with fresh bleeding. Nevertheless, the man doesn't reveal his "
"pain, except for a strained jaw and heavy gaze.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 매우 키가 크고 다소 느릿한 사람입니다. 활에 기대어 당신 앞에 서있을 동안, 상처 입은 다리는 약간 떨리고 바지 오른쪽에서는 "
"다시 피가 흘러 나와 검게 물듭니다. 그럼에도 불구하고 남자는 긴장한 턱 근육과 무거운 시선 외에는 고통스러워 하는 표정을 보이지 "
"않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_23186 4_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "77fe3d03-1a3a-416e-9064-e8fb5a4d5b7f"
msgid "\"Ekundayo,\" {n}the man says, looking straight into your eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "\"에쿤다요.\" {n}당신의 눈을 똑바로 바라보며 남자가 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_23186 5_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "36416d59-b9cb-4767-bb51-2588e42a2efb"
msgid "\"Wow! Sounds like a spell!\""
msgstr "\"와우! 마법주문같아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_23186 6_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e68620cb-d955-4fc7-a80b-1b51124543e0"
msgid "\"I guess you are wrong. This is his name.\""
msgstr "\"틀린 것 같은데. 이 사람 이름이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_23186 7_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "af691699-6f50-4016-a787-aee765898fe6"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia rolls her eyes and makes a sarcastic expression.{/n} \"No way! "
"Who could have guessed that?\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 눈을 굴리며 비꼬는 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"세상에! 누가 짐작할 수 있었겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_23186 8_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "54b321c6-e2f2-45e6-a68f-b833fe55fcf6"
msgid "\"It is so,\" {n}Valerie answers seriously.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그렇지.\" {n}발레리는 진지하게 대답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_23186_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "d9e23c80-e547-4310-a8e9-ddb557f1fee0"
msgid ""
"\"Whom you brought?\" {n}The man asks the wolf.{/n} \"Get lost, dog, you're "
"not needed here!\" {n}He raises his arm as if to hit the wolf, but the "
"animal doesn't even try to dodge, still whining. The man's hand goes down, "
"never finishing the blow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"누구를 데려왔지?\" {n}남자가 늑대에게 묻습니다.{/n} \"가버려. 난 개가 필요없어!\" {n}그는 늑대를 때릴 듯이 팔을 "
"들어올렸지만 동물은 피하거나, 심지어 낑낑거리지도 않습니다. 그 남자의 손은 내려가고 때리지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_56816_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "5cdf8f13-0d0a-49f3-bb1b-26d996aa4f3b"
msgid ""
"\"Was that a threat?\" {n}Ekun's voice is extremely calm and distant.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그게 위협이었나?\" {n}에쿤의 목소리는 매우 평온하고 차분합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_76112_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a0757c7a-38d2-49a6-92d8-1980ad5065ca"
msgid ""
"\"Their path is finished, their sufferings are over,\" {n}Harrim whispers, "
"loudly enough to let Ekun hear,{/n} \"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} granted them "
"peace. But hold the sorrow off your heart, for you'll join them soon enough "
"in the eternal darkness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들의 길은 끝났고 고통도 끝났네\" {n}하림은 에쿤이 들을 수 있도록 큰소리로 말합니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}가 그들에게 평화를 주었지. 그러나 슬퍼하는 감정은 가슴에서 잠시 떼어두게. 왜냐하면 곧 영원한 어둠 "
"속에서 그들을 맞이할 것이기 때문이지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 10_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "25ecfe47-d4cc-4fb0-9cd9-0f26f0504aa3"
msgid ""
"\"You — were not always a {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. Here — I was not "
"always a carpenter.\" {n}Ekun stares somewhere through you.{/n} \"Nothing to "
"lose anymore,\" {n}he adds, almost in whisper.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네가 처음부터 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}인 것은 아니였듯, 나도 항상 목수가 아니었다.\" {n}에쿤은 당신을 꿰뚫어봅니다.{/n}"
" \"더 이상 잃을 게 없다.\" {n}그는 속삭였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 11_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "c27591c6-e756-4fe7-9931-3882d0f9179f"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face is hard to read, but it seems to you he is surprised.{/n} \"No"
". Didn't. Fire arrows couldn't murder them. Now know the reason.\" {n}He "
"glances at his wounded leg.{/n} \"Had no chance here, can see it now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 표정은 읽기가 어렵지만 그는 당신에게 놀라는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"아니. 몰랐었다. 불화살은 놈들을 죽일 수 없었다. "
"이제 그 이유를 알겠군.\" {n}그는 상처 입은 다리를 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"가망이 없어보였지만, 이제 보이는 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 12_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "27e05dda-ef5b-4b2f-bc95-8b3c6d7f6056"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face gets a trifle calmer. You can see he's glad to hear your "
"offer.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 얼굴은 침착해집니다. 그는 당신의 제안을 듣게 되어 기쁜 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 13_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "a48fc4db-fe8f-4519-971d-aaabfe1c8b23"
msgid ""
"\"Wait,\" {n}Ekun stops you.{/n} \"I… am in need of assistance.\" {n}It is "
"obvious that it's hard for him to ask.{/n} \"Impossible to crush Kargadd if "
"alone. Still could murder him if not alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"기다려.\" {n}에쿤이 당신을 멈춰 세웁니다.{/n} \"나는... 도움이 필요하다.\" {n}에쿤은 힘겹게 도움을 "
"요청합니다.{/n} \"카르가드를 혼자서 죽이는 건 불가능해. 함께한다면 모를까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 15_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "14a43b56-0085-4d46-ab81-738cafe021d2"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun raises his eyebrow.{/n} \"Never been a burden. Can shoot a longbow. "
"From great distance.\" {n}He glances at his weapon.{/n} \"Also scouted the "
"place while I still could walk. Found three spots where the trolls could "
"have their lair. Will show you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 그의 눈썹을 올립니다.{/n} \"짐짝이 된 적 없다. 멀리서 장궁을 쏠 수있다.\" {n}그는 무기를 쳐다봅니다.{/n} "
"\"걸을 수 있는 동안 그곳을 조사했다. 트롤들의 은신처라고 생각되는 세 곳을 발견했다. 보여주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 16_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "ad60c4bc-f333-4df5-b57f-abef38c6ff3c"
msgid ""
"\"Will mark on your map all the places where troll feet tread the land. "
"Trolls' lair must be somewhere nearby.\""
msgstr "\"트롤이 흔적을 남긴 곳을 모두 지도에 표시하겠다. 트롤 소굴은 근처 어딘가에 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 17_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "979caa5d-8366-42c4-82b3-b580fac240ad"
msgid ""
"\"The spirit is strong, but the body falters. Will follow you wherever you "
"need. But this wound must be tended by healers in the capital. Don't want to "
"burden.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정신은 강하지만 몸이 약해졌다. 어디든 네가 필요로 하는 곳으로 널 따라갈 것이다. 그러나 이 상처는 수도에서 치료사가 돌봐야 해. "
"짐이 되고 싶지는 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 18_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "a9dea976-3de2-4719-b388-2642bc26b280"
msgid ""
"\"One more thing. Before we go.\" {n}Ekun points to the valley below the "
"hill.{/n} \"Troll feet tread this path often. Would like to stay here until "
"they appear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한가지 더. 우리가 가기 전에.\" {n}에쿤은 언덕 아래 계곡을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"트롤은 이 경로를 자주 지나다닌다. 그들이 "
"나타날 때까지 여기에 머물고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 19_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "7eb3c6bc-f7d6-4214-aa21-4697d2aec4d3"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods and turns away.{/n} \"Will be here,\" {n}he mutters in your "
"direction.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤이 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"여기 있을거야.\" {n}그는 당신 쪽을 향해 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 1_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "ae75f801-6ff2-4365-943b-f8f00b11af33"
msgid ""
"{n}The man stares at his leg as if seeing it for the first time.{/n} "
"\"Patched up already,\" {n}he answers at last,{/n} \"This wound isn't the "
"deadliest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자는 그 다리의 상처를 처음 보는 것처럼 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"이미 붕대를 감았다.\" {n}그는 마침내 대답합니다.{/n} "
"\"이 상처는 치명적이지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 20_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "8d6be206-2550-4172-a6c0-9460b77a7249"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun narrows his eyes, interested.{/n} \"Would be good to see it. Kargadd "
"awaits.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 흥미로운듯 그의 눈을 좁힙니다.{/n} \"보게 된다면 좋겠지. 카르가드가 기다리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 21_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "c2502224-3290-421c-9e02-35fbf7c6afc2"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun closes his eyes and sighs, relieved. It seems to you that a wrinkle "
"disappears from his brow.{/n} \"You've stolen my vengeance. But it's no "
"grudge to hold. You did the right thing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 눈을 감고 한숨을 쉬고는 안도합니다. 그의 주름진 이마는 사라지는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"너는 나의 복수를 가로챘다. "
"하지만 원망하고 싶지 않다. 너는 옳은 일을 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 22_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "f244da45-2b8a-47a9-8a37-0f601de29d96"
msgid ""
"\"Troll feet often followed this path.\" {n}He glances at his wound. {/n}"
"\"Can't hunt them anymore. That's why I wait. They will come here eventually."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤들이 종종 이 길을 지나갔다.\" {n}그는 상처를 흘끗 보았습니다.{/n} \"더 이상 추적할 수 없으니 나는 기다린다. 그들은 "
"결국 이곳에 올 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 23_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "9605e4d0-66e0-4dda-8533-c9a0ea5ec388"
msgid ""
"\"Will mark on your map all the places where troll feet tread the land. Need "
"to search everywhere, might be more than one lair. \""
msgstr "\"트롤이 흔적을 남긴 곳을 모두 지도에 표시하겠다. 모든 곳을 찾아 봐야 한다. 아마 한 곳 이상이 트롤 소굴일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 24_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "e69280e7-b7f4-44cf-8c50-15c5a4cd71c5"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face darkens.{/n} \"You have my respect. But the answers shall be "
"postponed. Swear by {g|Torag}Torag{/g}, the time for question will come — "
"after Kargadd's last breath is drawn.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 표정이 어두워집니다. {/n} \"나는 너를 존중한다. 하지만 대답은 다음에 하도록 하지. 토락에게 맹세하지만 질문을 위한 "
"시간이 있을 거야. 카르가드의 숨통을 끊은 후에 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 25_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "38f9bc63-d243-4cbf-b6f9-5653355bdba0"
msgid "{n}Ekun nods in gratitude.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 감사의 뜻으로 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 26_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "48c936a3-a0dd-4bde-be0e-2eef425d87d8"
msgid "{n}Ekun sighs and nods.{/n} \"One,\" {n}he says.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 한숨을 쉬고 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"하나.\" {n}그는 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 27_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "e30b54f6-d437-431c-859a-e560462d1b02"
msgid ""
"\"Not mine,\" {n}he answers. Noticing this answer doesn't satisfy you, he "
"decides to go on.{/n} \"Never wanted a pet. Never needed one. But couldn't "
"slay the trolls, defend the village. Just called for help.\" {n}Ranger "
"shifts his frowning gaze toward the wolf.{/n} \"Everything grew dark for a "
"moment. Fainted. Came back with the tongue of this...dog...on my face. \""
msgstr ""
"\"내 개가 아니다.\" {n}그는 대답합니다. 그의 대답이 당신을 만족시키지 못했다는 걸 깨닫지만 그는 계속 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"애완동물을 원한 적도 필요한 적도 없었다. 그러나 트롤을 죽이지도 마을을 지키지도 못했다. 단지 도움을 구하러 도망쳤다.\" {n}"
"레인저는 찡그린 눈을 늑대에게로 옮깁니다.{/n} \"모든 것이 잠시 동안 어두워졌다. 나는 기절했지만 곧 이 녀석이 내 얼굴을 "
"핥아서... 나를 깨웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 28_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "09294430-d8bf-4cde-8e4d-300a5fc36a2a"
msgid ""
"\"An answer was promised, and you got it. It's… hard to remember the past "
"now.\" {n}Ekun's strained face hardens.{/n} \"You'll get all the answers "
"after Kargadd's last breath is drawn. That is a promise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대답하기로 약속했고, 너는 답을 들었다. 그건... 지금 과거를 떠올리는 건 괴롭다.\" {n}에쿤의 긴장한 얼굴은 굳습니다.{/n} "
"\"카르가드가 마지막 숨을 뱉는 걸 보고 나서 모든 대답을 하겠다. 약속하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 29_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "3f61273f-e7e5-4fbc-921b-a9a19da701fc"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Thuvia}Thuvia{/g}, far south from here,\" {n}he answers. Noticing that "
"this answer doesn't satisfy you, he decides to go on.{/n} \"A desert which "
"changes the Sun Orchid into gold. Father brought me to {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}"
" when I was thirteen. Never been to my homeland since then. Roads always led "
"north of Absalom.\" {n}He shrugs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Thuvia} 튀비아{/g}는 먼 남쪽에 있다.\"{n}그는 대답합니다. 그의 대답이 당신을 만족시키지 못했다는 걸 깨달았지만, "
"그는 계속 말합니다.{/n} \"태양 난초가 황금처럼 비싼 사막이다. 아버지는 내가 열세 살 때 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}으로 "
"데려갔다. 그 이후로는 고향에 간 적이 없다. 길은 항상 압살롬 북쪽으로 이어진다. \" {n}그는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 2_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "0cacfe6d-aff6-4138-8f9e-991439906a17"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems to you that a sparkle of good humor flickers in the man's eyes, "
"but his face remains still.{/n} \"The name gave it up? Or my skin color? "
"Yes, bred and nourished up away from here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 눈빛에 살짝 번뜩이는 장난기가 들지만 얼굴은 평소와 같습니다.{/n} \"이름을 보고 알았나? 아니면 내 피부색을 보고? "
"그렇다. 다른 곳에서 자라고 길러졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 30_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "47e071e3-6d08-4090-a412-0eace9f2495e"
msgid ""
"\"When wayfaring,\" {n}he answers. Noticing this answer doesn't satisfy you, "
"he decides to go on.{/n} \"Traveled through northern lands countless times. "
"Guarded trade caravans. Those who paid with gold, dealt with the merchants. "
"Those wanting to pay with steel, dealt with me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"길을 잃을 때.\" {n}그는 대답합니다. 그의 대답이 당신을 만족시키지 못했다는 걸 깨닫지만 그는 계속 말합니다.{{/n} \"북부 "
"땅을 무수히 여행했다. 무역 캐러밴을 호위했다. 금을 내려는 자들은 상인들과 거래했다. 무기로 값을 치루려는 녀석들은 내게 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 31_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "88131cf2-e151-4b96-aaec-8030366fc752"
msgid ""
"\"Yes,\" {n}he answers. Noticing this answer doesn't satisfy you, he decides "
"to go on.{/n} \"All gods are even in the eyes of men in Abasalom... Chose "
"the one which fitted best. Though he is a dwarf god.\" {n}He shrugs and "
"glances at his longbow.{/n} \"Used to guard decent men, and craft bows. "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g} blesses both guards and crafters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래.\" {n}그는 대답합니다. 그의 대답이 당신을 만족시키지 못했다는 걸 깨닫지만 그는 계속 말합니다.{/n} \"조국에서는 모든 "
"이들에게 신들은 공평했다. 드워프 신이라도 잘 맞으면 고른다.\" {n}그는 어깨를 으쓱하고 그의 장궁을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"사람들을 "
"보호하고 활을 만들고는 했다. {g|Torag}토락{/g}께서는 경비와 장인을 축복한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 32_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "bcf9248d-0818-4eee-8c96-65935c933238"
msgid ""
"\"Got married,\" {n}he answers. Noticing this answer doesn't satisfy you, he "
"decides to go on.{/n} \"Crossed northern lands back and forth for a long "
"time. Often came to the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. Spent nights in "
"Bristlehill. Recognized Amanda there, and she recognized me. One day, "
"realized leaving was not desirable anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"결혼했다.\" {n}그는 대답합니다. 그의 대답이 당신을 만족시키지 못했다는 걸 깨닫지만 그는 계속 말합니다.{/n} \"오랫동안 "
"북쪽 국경을 오갔다. 자주 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}으로 가고는 했지. 브리슬힐에서 밤을 보냈었다. 거기서 아만다를 "
"알았고 그녀도 나를 알았다. 어느 날 떠도는 삶은 더 이상 원하지 않는다는 것을 깨달았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 33_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "81830bf5-54ee-4bb3-82b4-03d7f54d48e5"
msgid ""
"\"No,\" {n}he answers. Noticing this answer doesn't satisfy you, he decides "
"to go on.{/n} \"Mother died early. Father died later.\" {n}He keeps silent "
"for a while, than resumes.{/n} \"Wife, Amanda, and daughter, Clarissa, died "
"five days ago. {g|Torag}Torag{/g} bless their souls.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니.\" {n}그는 대답합니다. 그의 대답이 당신을 만족시키지 못했다는 걸 깨닫지만 그는 계속 말합니다.{/n} \"어머니는 일찍 "
"돌아가셨고 머지 않아 아버지도 돌아가셨다.\" {n}그는 잠시 침묵을 지키다 계속합니다.{/n} \"아내 Amanda와 딸 "
"Clarissa가 최근에 죽었다. {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 그들을 돌봐주신다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 34_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "f3a43845-458c-44da-9880-f622100e6dcb"
msgid ""
"\"They attacked at night. Slaughtered everyone,\" {n}he answers. Noticing "
"this answer doesn't satisfy you, he decides to go on.{/n} \"We all knew "
"about trolls. Never thought they would come to the village. Never believed.\""
" {n}Ekun closes his eves and shakes his head, as if in denial,{/n} \"They "
"came when the day hadn't yet dawned. They plundered houses. Killed dogs. "
"Cows. People. They ate. Then gathered everything they could and left.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 밤에 기습을 해서 모두를 학살했다.\" {n}그는 대답합니다. 그의 대답이 당신을 만족시키지 못했다는 걸 깨닫지만 그는 계속 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"우리 모두는 트롤에 대해 알고 있었지만 결코 마을을 습격하리라 생각은 못했다. 꿈에도...\" {n}에쿤은 눈을 "
"감고 거부하듯이 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"그들은 새벽이 오기 전에 집을 약탈했다. 개와 소, 사람들을 죽였다. 그리고는 먹어치우고 "
"모든 물건을 쓸어담고 떠났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 35_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "98125cb2-89d8-48bc-92bf-78f4e3e8caf1"
msgid "{n}Ekun nods in gratitude.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 감사 표시로 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 36_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "9555cb2b-a99d-4a07-86e5-0e12b18a2d08"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun stares at you closely.{/n} \"I want to know it all. Tell me how it "
"happened. Tell of him suffering.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신을 가까이서 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 모든 것을 알고 싶다. 어떻게 일어난 일인지 말해줘. 그의 고통을 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 37_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "a8d8d479-af74-46ae-9467-a3eb8e69fcb9"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks at you. For several seconds it seems to you that he'll smile, "
"but he doesn't.{/n} \"An eternity spent in stone. It's a decent end. By "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, your fame comes well-earned. But it seems there was "
"something else happening there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신을 보고 몇초 동안 그는 미소를 짓는 것처럼 보였지만 실제로 그의 얼굴은 아무렇지 않았습니다.{/n} \"돌이 된 채로 "
"영원한 시간. 걸맞는 결말이군. {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 축복하사 너의 명성은 더 유명해졌다. 그러나 뭔가 다른 일이 있었던 것 "
"같군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 38_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "0d9745c7-7f80-44b5-89ee-ce91facdf09c"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks at you. For several seconds it seems to you that he'll smile, "
"but he doesn't.{/n} \"You've freed the world off a terrible monster. By "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, your fame comes well-earned. But it seems there was "
"something else happening there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신을 보고 몇초 동안 그는 미소를 짓는 것처럼 보였지만 실제로 그의 얼굴은 아무렇지 않았습니다.{/n} \"너는 끔찍한 "
"괴물로부터 세상을 구했다. {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 축복하사 너의 명성은 더 유명해졌다. 그러나 뭔가 다른 일이 있었던 것 같군. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 39_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "b74bc946-d11e-4a4b-94b8-bc36a63e3705"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun seems surprised, then angry, then becomes contemplative.{/n} "
"\"Unknown if I have enough courage inside to {d|c21 TrollYoung Live}act{/d} "
"like this,\" {n}he says quietly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 놀라워하고는 화를 내다가 사색에 잠깁니다.{/n} \"내가 {d|c21 TrollYoung Live}그런 행동을{/d} 할 "
"용기가 있는지 모르겠다.\" {n}그는 조용히 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 3_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "7412e98d-349b-497b-b44a-6539e54f2545"
msgid ""
"{n}The man throws a glance at the wolf, who is still staring at him.{/n} "
"\"Not mine.\""
msgstr "{n}그 남자는 자신을 여전히 쳐다보고 있는 늑대에게 시선을 보냅니다.{/n} \"내 개가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 40_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "0f18da21-5629-4e8c-a8bc-bc6c02b95279"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment, Ekun seems angry, but he brushes that emotion away.{/n} "
"\"You {d|c21 TrollYoung Live}acted{/d} as you saw proper. Not going to pass "
"my judgement on you. The deed is done, and that's most important.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 동안 에쿤은 화가 난 것처럼 보이지만 이내 화를 풉니다.{/n} \"넌 네가 옳다고 생각하는 행동을 했다. 너를 판단하지는 "
"않겠다. 이미 지나간 일은 돌이킬 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 42_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "8427bd28-30f7-4250-9a84-66a689e2f111"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun winces, then nods.{/n} \"You made the right {d|c21 TrollYoung "
"Killed}choice{/d}. Young trolls will only grow into full trolls. Better for "
"everyone if they never grow at all.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 움찔하고는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"올바른 {d|c21 TrollYoung Killed}선택{/d}을 했다. 어린 "
"트롤은 결국 트롤로 자란다. 죽어있는 편이 모두에게 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 43_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "0e450b46-8aa2-4017-b613-50787a5dee62"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun looks into your eyes.{/n} \"Your deed has not been paid for still. "
"No heavy gold here to reward you. Can serve you myself, though. Would you "
"let me defend you in your travels? Or will this crossroad become the end of "
"our common path?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신의 눈을 들여다 봅니다.{/n} \"너의 행동의 대가가 아직 지불되지 않았다. 아무리 무거운 금이라도 네게 보상하지는 "
"못한다. 하지만 너를 섬길 수는 있다. 내가 너를 호위하는 것이 어떻겠나? 아니면 이 갈림길에서 우리의 동행은 끝이 되는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 4_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "074a0699-3a6a-448c-b1e9-ca0436d4d03a"
msgid "\"Sitting. Waiting.\" {n}Ekundayo shrugs.{/n} \"Hunting.\""
msgstr "\"앉아있다. 기다리고 있다.\" {n}에쿤다요는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"사냥하고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 5_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "3a8c82c4-d37c-42f6-b383-97d8d9685abc"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekundayo narrows his eyes and exhales loudly.{/n} \"Lured your curiosity. "
"Serves me right. Will start again.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤다요는 눈을 가늘게 뜨고는 크게 숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"호기심이 생겼나보군. 잘 됐다. 다시 시작하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 6_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "c8be374c-b77b-4d93-9486-ea7309347e50"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekundayo narrows his eyes and exhales loudly.{/n} \"Sorry. Our knowing "
"each other started incorrectly. Will start again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤다요는 인상 쓰며 크게 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"미안하다. 처음 서로를 알았을 때부터 잘못되었다. 다시 시작하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 7_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "a7e26729-832a-47bd-a6af-be7bd5845629"
msgid ""
"\"The name's Ekundayo, Ekun for decent ones. Used to be a carpenter in the "
"Bristlehill village. Trolls attacked. Killed everyone but me.\" {n}Ekun "
"speaks with a distant voice, looking somewhere above you.{/n} \"Will show "
"them that was a mistake.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이름은 에쿤다요. 에쿤은 막역한 이들을 위한 것이다. 브리슬힐 마을의 목수였다. 트롤이 공격했다. 나 빼고 모두 죽었다.\" {n}"
"에쿤은 희미한 목소리로 말하며 당신의 어딘가를 보고 있습니다.{/n} \"놈들이 실수했음을 보여줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 8_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "bfcbc464-87d3-4f76-9cf8-6442af62ca11"
msgid ""
"\"They all deserve death, Kargadd most of all.\" {n}Ekun grimaces as if he "
"has a toothache.{/n} \"Rock troll. He led them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 모두 죽음을 맞아야 한다. 특히 카르가드는.\" {n}에쿤은 마치 치통이있는 것처럼 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"바위 트롤. "
"그가 우두머리이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727 9_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "bbd70296-fa7c-4454-9423-22502b2d7ced"
msgid ""
"\"Have been hunting trolls until they have hunted back.\" {n}Ekun shrugs.{/n}"
" \"The wound can't stop the hunting. Just slows it down.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 복수할 때까지 트롤을 사냥해왔다.\" {n}에쿤은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"상처가 사냥을 멈추게 할 수는 없다. 그저 "
"느리게 할 뿐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_78727_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "ebf1558b-bda3-4e80-9422-72547b7fc7d7"
msgid ""
"{n}The man nods.{/n} \"Ekun for decent ones,\"{n} he says. {/n}\"Are you "
"decent?\""
msgstr "{n}남자는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"에쿤은 막역한 이들이 부르는 이름이다. 너는 친구인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_GR_Greet 1_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_NPC
msgctxt "57a84bcd-bb97-4f5b-a3d9-cf48228b06c8"
msgid "{n}Seeing you, Ekundayo nods in greeting.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신을 보고 에쿤다요는 인사로 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Cue_GR_Greet_Text
msgctxt "f3e27362-f56f-4a17-8ee0-21ecb5753bbf"
msgid ""
"{n}Following the strange wolf, you climb the top of the hill. There you see "
"a black-skinned man sitting under a spreading bush. The wolf runs up to him "
"and sits near, whimpering.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이상한 늑대를 따라가며 당신은 언덕 꼭대기를 올라갔습니다. 거기서 당신은 덤불 아래에 검은 피부의 남자가 앉아있는 것을 보았습니다. "
"늑대는 그에게 달려가 가까이서 앉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/GrimRangerStart/Dialogue_GR_Start_WhatToBark
msgctxt "5aced6a4-915b-4e3e-bc88-5c3bd39537e4"
msgid "I'm ready to travel."
msgstr "나는 여행할 준비가 되어있다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/Interfaces/BigOutdoorArea_InterfaceFallenTree_String
msgctxt "8f1c5108-b111-47b0-ad0b-c6c9f2a49b55"
msgid "Fallen tree"
msgstr "쓰러진 나무"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/Interfaces/BigOutdoorArea_InterfaceRuinedStairs_String
msgctxt "4116a630-41fd-41e7-8bf5-ea882e505bed"
msgid "Ancient stairs"
msgstr "고대 계단"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Answer_13325_Text
msgctxt "f724d8b1-fe7a-45ac-99e9-bdb1154275be"
msgid "We searched for the key among the ruins."
msgstr "우리는 폐허 사이에서 열쇠를 찾았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Answer_49788_Text
msgctxt "d164d42b-062b-4afd-a41c-97e508fff37b"
msgid "[Choose a character] We tried picking the lock."
msgstr "[캐릭터 선택] 우리는 자물쇠 따기를 시도했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Answer_61061_Text
msgctxt "89a969bc-952b-426f-b264-766c0a8095fb"
msgid "We trusted Ekun to hitch the chest."
msgstr "우리는 궤짝을 만지는 에쿤을 믿었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Answer_72869_Text
msgctxt "d0703538-7757-4ec1-b093-d1c4c66e95c6"
msgid "We left the ruined tower."
msgstr "우리는 폐허가 된 탑을 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Answer_79432_Text
msgctxt "a3e4cfa9-dfe7-4154-aa94-89149c937c18"
msgid "[Choose a character] We tried climbing up."
msgstr "[캐릭터 선택] 우리는 등반을 시도했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Answer_87321_Text
msgctxt "b677bc00-2d2c-45a8-9f1f-543c80cdd0d3"
msgid ""
"We decided to take our time and make a sturdy ladder. Fortunately, there "
"were plenty of materials in the forest."
msgstr "우리는 시간을 들여 튼튼한 사다리를 만들기로 결정했습니다. 다행스럽게도 숲에는 많은 재료가 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Answer_87354_Text
msgctxt "4d33a698-4670-48b4-995d-c8fcce86f2c8"
msgid "[Choose a character] We decided to break into the chest."
msgstr "[캐릭터 선택] 우리는 궤짝을 부수어 열기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Answer_97639_Text
msgctxt "37874561-7c5c-4aad-9e4d-05b2602c80df"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_00160_Text
msgctxt "2183da78-353c-4e61-807b-bc479285ae01"
msgid ""
"The ancient chest had outlived several generations of dwarves, but it was no "
"match for an encounter with our party. Dealing blow after blow to the chest, "
"{name} eventually smashed the lid to splinters."
msgstr ""
"고대의 궤짝은 여러 세대의 드워프들의 손을 거쳐갔지만 우리 일행의 상대는 아니었습니다. {name}은(는) 궤짝에 여러 차례 타격을 "
"가했고, 마침내 뚜껑을 박살 냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_00515_Text
msgctxt "7f9f0754-107e-4a88-9210-db528fc53945"
msgid ""
"Having tied a rope to his arrow, Ekun drew his bow and took aim. With an "
"abrupt thud, the arrow pierced the wood. The chest seemed to be heavy, but "
"the arrow held fast as Ekun pulled the chest toward the edge. \"Watch "
"yourselves!\" Ekun shouted, giving one more yank before the chest fell."
msgstr ""
"에쿤은 그의 화살에 밧줄을 묶은 뒤 그의 활을 당기고 조준했습니다. 돌연한 쿵 소리와 함께 화살은 상자를 관통했습니다. 궤짝은 무거워 "
"보였지만, 에쿤이 궤짝을 가장자리까지 당기는 동안에도 화살은 빠지지 않았습니다. \"조심해!\" 에쿤이 소리쳤고, 궤짝을 한 번 더 "
"잡아당겨 떨어뜨렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_08665_Text
msgctxt "f0f123dd-cc95-4a28-b422-d8633368a0e1"
msgid ""
"{Name} deftly climbed the stones, even as they crumbled beneath {mf|his|her} "
"feet. On the next floor, {mf|he|she} found what must have been a living room "
"centuries ago — there were even the remnants of a decomposed floor mat. The "
"chest was heavy, but it didn't take {name} much effort to push it to the "
"ledge and drop it down."
msgstr ""
"{Name}은(는) 그것들이 발을 뗄 때마다 부서지는 와중에도 바위를 손쉽게 올라갔습니다. 다음 층에서 {mf|그|그녀}는 수 세기 전에 "
"거실이었음에 틀림없는 방을 발견했습니다. 그곳에는 썩어버린 매트의 잔해도 있었습니다. 궤짝은 무거웠지만 {name}은(는) 그리 힘들이지 "
"않고 가장자리 쪽으로 밀어서 떨어뜨렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_09556_Text
msgctxt "24ee8be4-c32a-4cb2-b728-909748fdf9f5"
msgid ""
"The search turned out to be a surprising success. We found the key in a "
"small niche that had been covered with rubble. Despite its age, the dwarven "
"lock was still operational — we turned the key, and the chest's lid opened "
"with a shrill creak."
msgstr ""
"찾아보니 결과는 놀라운 것이었습니다. 우리는 잔해로 뒤덮인 작은 틈새에서 열쇠를 발견했습니다. 세월에도 불구하고 드워프의 자물쇠는 여전히 "
"작동했습니다. 우리는 열쇠를 돌렸고 궤짝의 뚜껑은 삐걱거리는 소리를 내며 열렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_20114_Text
msgctxt "89efb73f-9f02-4529-ae8d-f4a073684588"
msgid ""
"Once, long ago, a sturdy watchtower rose above the forest, ready to signal "
"an enemy's approach day or night. Now the ancient, moss-covered stones were "
"crumbling, and birds rather than warriors inhabited the place. The ground "
"floor had long been looted, but there still seemed to be some furniture left "
"on what remained of the upper floor — a rotted table, an uneven chair, and a "
"small but seemingly robust chest. Sadly, the stairs leading up had collapsed "
"long ago."
msgstr ""
"옛날 옛적에 튼튼한 망루가 숲보다 높이 솟아 밤낮으로 적의 접근을 알리기에 좋았습니다. 이제 그것은 고대의 유적이 되었고 이끼 덮인 "
"돌들은 무너져 전사가 아닌 새들이 이곳에 살게 되었습니다. 1층은 오래 전에 약탈되었지만 상층에 남아있는 가구들 썩은 탁자, 고르지 않은 "
"의자, 작지만 튼튼한 궤짝이 남아있는 것 같았습니다. 슬프게도 위층으로 향하는 계단은 오래 전에 무너졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_23481_Text
msgctxt "3bde06e2-8dc3-4790-8fd5-951921590ace"
msgid ""
"It took us some time to harvest the materials we needed and tie everything "
"together, but we ended up with a safe, stable ladder. We climbed to the "
"upper floor and dropped the chest down."
msgstr ""
"우리가 필요로 하는 재료를 수확하고 모든 것을 묶는 데는 시간이 걸렸지만 우리는 안전하고 튼튼한 사다리를 만들었습니다. 우리는 위층으로 "
"올라가 궤짝을 떨어뜨렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_24843_Text
msgctxt "eddda1e0-25d1-4ad8-9207-da4e6f5329f3"
msgid ""
"Ekun inspected the upper floor. \"Possible to climb, but risky. Stones might "
"collapse. We could use a rope to pull it down.\""
msgstr ""
"에쿤은 위층을 검사했습니다. \"올라갈 수는 있지만 위험하다. 돌들이 붕괴 될 수 있다. 우리는 궤짝을 당기기 위해 로프를 사용할 수 "
"있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_31110_Text
msgctxt "6c674357-94e3-4cac-a960-6536fcf01f56"
msgid ""
"What did the dwarves make that chest out of? Stone? Solid steel? Dragon "
"bone? {name} hit the lid over and over, even tried prying it open and "
"knocking out the hinges. It took a long time before the chest finally gave "
"in."
msgstr ""
"드워프들이 궤짝을 만들 무엇으로 만들었을까요? 돌? 단단한 강철? 용의 뼈? {name}은(는) 뚜껑을 여러번 두들겼고, 심지어 지렛대로 "
"열어 경첩을 떼어내려고도 했습니다. 궤짝이 마침내 열리기 전까지는 오랜 시간이 걸렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_32467_Text
msgctxt "d4fd2b10-f4ac-424a-8198-49134b826da5"
msgid ""
"Ekun tied a rope to his arrow, but his shots couldn't find purchase — the "
"arrow bounced off the chest's metal lid, wouldn't stick in the wood, or even "
"when it seemed to stick, it would fall out after the slightest pull. After "
"several attempts, the ranger gave up, disappointed and annoyed. \"Climbing "
"it is, then.\""
msgstr ""
"에쿤은 화살에 밧줄을 묶어 쏘았지만 화살은 좋은 곳에 맞지 못했습니다. 화살은 쇠 경첩에 맞고 튕겨져나왔고 마침내 나무에 맞았나 싶더니만 "
"살짝 당겼더니 화살이 떨어졌습니다. 몇번을 시도했지만 레인저는 포기하여 낙담하고 화를 냈습니다. \"그렇다면 올라가야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_34420 1_Text
msgctxt "d16138eb-be20-40c0-85dd-22be092de457"
msgid ""
"Jubilost kicked a mossy stone. \"If I had a tube of the necessary "
"ingredients, we wouldn't need to climb anywhere. I'd make the upper level "
"come to us itself!\""
msgstr ""
"주빌로스트는 이끼 낀 돌을 찼습니다. \"필요한 재료가 담긴 튜브가 있었다면 올라갈 필요도 없었다. 훨씬 더 쉽게 해결할 수 있었을 거야!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_34420_Text
msgctxt "0d4f5c9d-6816-406e-ae8a-e6316bb5b09e"
msgid ""
"Harrim walked around the tower slowly, running his fingers along the cracks "
"in the stone. \"I like places like this. Peaceful, quiet... Here, one is "
"bound to consider that which awaits us all, sooner or later. Yes...\" Taking "
"a seat, he lost himself in his admiration of the ruins."
msgstr ""
"하림은 천천히 탑 주위를 돌며 돌의 균열을 따라 손가락을 움직였습니다. \"나는 이런 곳을 좋아한다. 평화롭고 조용한... 우리 모두를 "
"기다리고 있는 것을 고려해야 한다. 그래...\"자리 잡고 앉아서 그는 폐허에 대한 경외심으로 넋을 잃었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_62682_Text
msgctxt "620f1254-23bc-41b2-a2f1-bd28ce8a68e9"
msgid ""
"{Name} tried to scale the wall, but it was too old — the stones crumbled "
"beneath {mf|his|her} feet, and the structure shifted. Flailing in the air a "
"moment, {Name} awkwardly fell to the stone floor — it was a miracle the "
"whole wall didn't collapse in on {mf|his|her} head!"
msgstr ""
"{Name}은 벽을 오르려고 시도했지만 벽은 너무 오래되었습니다. 발치 아래의 돌들이 부서져 떨어졌습니다. 그리고 벽이 헐었습니다. 잠시 "
"허공에 떳다가, {Name}은 어슬프게 돌 바닥으로 떨어졌습니다. 벽이 {mf|그|그녀} 머리 위에 무너지지 않은 것은 기적이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_63441 3_Text
msgctxt "d1d58172-8e42-4407-9806-a505267fa334"
msgid ""
"The old lock couldn't endure the torture. Some internal piece broke with a "
"loud click, securing the lid permanently."
msgstr "오래된 자물쇠는 고문을 견딜 수 없었습니다. 뚜껑을 평생 보호하고 있던 내부의 부품이 딸깍소리를 내며 부서졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_63441 4_Text
msgctxt "c9e4bdb0-7f2c-4dfd-a898-423a1db31a4e"
msgid ""
"After searching among the ruins, we'd discovered some gnawed bones, a broken "
"arrow, and a fragment of a leather belt — nothing of any use."
msgstr "폐허를 수색한 후에 우리는 갉아 먹은 뼈, 부서진 화살, 가죽 허리띠 조각을 발견했습니다. 모두 쓸모없는 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_63441_Text_String
msgctxt "aab42899-794c-47ac-9486-d507e22df68f"
msgid ""
"The chest fell to the stone floor with a loud thud, a huge cloud of dust "
"rising around it. The wood had darkened after years of exposure to the sun "
"and the rain. The metal siding had grown a layer of rust, and the decorative "
"carvings on the lid were barely discernible. Even so, the chest itself was "
"as robust and secure as the day it was made by some unknown dwarven master. "
"And, of course, it was still locked."
msgstr ""
"궤짝은 커다란 쿵쿵 거리는 소리를 내며 돌바닥으로 떨어졌습니다. 나무는 햇빛과 비에 몇 년 동안 노출되어 까맣게 썩었습니다. 금속은 "
"녹슬었고 뚜껑의 장식 조각은 거의 식별할 수가 없었습니다. 그렇다고 하더라도 궤짝은 알려지지 않은 드워프 마스터가 처음 만들었을 때 만큼 "
"강력하고 안전했습니다. 그리고 물론 그것은 여전히 잠겨있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_79635_Text
msgctxt "61cdcd4a-3d8a-48ae-b8d1-83a9a17412c2"
msgid ""
"The mechanism had rusted. The key had long been lost. But that matters "
"little to a skillful lockpick! After tinkering inside the keyhole for a "
"while, {name} opened the lid triumphantly."
msgstr ""
"그 장치는 녹슬었습니다. 열쇠는 잃어버렸습니다. 그러나 숙련된 도둑에게 그것은 중요하지 않습니다! 잠시 동안 열쇠 구멍 안을 쑤신 후, "
"{name}은(는) 의기양양하게 뚜껑을 열었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/PieceOfPuzzleChest/Cue_97638_Text_String
msgctxt "2649f208-e2a2-431a-9905-4430dbb7b07f"
msgid ""
"Inside, we found the simple possessions of a dwarven warrior who must have "
"once been stationed in this tower. Battle gear consisting of chainmail, a "
"helmet, a shield, and an axe. A pair of torn traveling boots and a metal "
"tankard the size of a small bucket. A pipe and a full pouch of tobacco, "
"which had petrified over the years. And lastly, a peculiar little thing — a "
"complex, red metal cog."
msgstr ""
"우리는 그 안에서 이 탑에 한때 머물러 있던 드워프 전사의 몇가지 소유물을 발견했습니다. 쇠사슬로 만들어진 갑옷, 헬멧, 방패, 도끼 "
"등이었습니다. 한 쌍의 찢어진 여행 장화와 작은 양동이의 크기만한 금속 맥줏잔이 있었습니다. 파이프와 오래된 담배 주머니가 있었습니다. "
"그리고 마지막으로 특이한 작은 것이 있었습니다. 복잡한 빨간 금속 톱니바퀴였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Answer_05151_Text
msgctxt "4ac1a206-ed2b-4d64-a5a8-267827fd9bc9"
msgid "[Try all possible combinations]"
msgstr "[가능한 것은 모두 시도합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Answer_12132_Text
msgctxt "50b24307-5c0e-44a8-ba12-0ed4658fa229"
msgid "[Try to open the panel]"
msgstr "[열려고 시도합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Answer_32263_Text
msgctxt "e9c6c6d2-4e65-41c2-ae8d-73dfa12046fb"
msgid "[Put three cogs into the mechanism]"
msgstr "[장치에 세개의 톱니바퀴를 넣습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Answer_42814_Text
msgctxt "f7668ae7-eb3b-471e-833f-c8f852acca30"
msgid "[Try to put a cog inside the mechanism]"
msgstr "[장치에 톱니바퀴를 넣습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Answer_47066_Text
msgctxt "58ad2c22-943b-48c4-b981-360303487051"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Answer_93787_Text
msgctxt "c85f49ab-f59c-40e4-80d5-96927ac2b8a0"
msgid "[Examine the statue]"
msgstr "[동상을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Answer_99508_Text
msgctxt "2a69514a-f4c5-4584-bed2-37e111367a1e"
msgid "[Try to decipher the markings]"
msgstr "[비밀을 해독하려고 합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Answer_99509_Text
msgctxt "9a3801df-e563-4fbf-8775-0dea787ca2a4"
msgid "[Pray to Torag]"
msgstr "[토락에게 기도한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_13787_Text
msgctxt "b2bd0777-ef9e-4a7d-a62a-3c3d770348c5"
msgid ""
"{n}You have all three cogs, but you're not sure how to fit them into the "
"mechanism. Maybe the arcane markings inside are a clue.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}세 개의 톱니가 모두 있지만 장치에 맞추는 방법이 확실하지 않습니다. 어쩌면 내부의 비밀 표식이 단서일 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_13968_Text
msgctxt "0728dbc8-7036-494e-80f7-557803314f96"
msgid ""
"{n}You rotate the cogs and hear a rumbling noise from the statue, followed "
"by a loud click. The panel opens, revealing the treasure stored within.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}톱니 바퀴를 돌리니 동상에서 시끄러운 소리가 들립니다. 패널이 열리고 저장된 보물이 나타납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_19669_Text
msgctxt "f21d4d17-b8c2-40f3-8b36-165c28da712f"
msgid ""
"{n}The stone panel and the mechanism keeping it shut are both sturdy and "
"effective. Neither lockpicking skills nor brute force enhanced with cursing "
"are capable of opening it. It looks like you won't get this hidden treasure "
"without a proper key.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}돌 판과 기계장치는 매우 견고하고 효과적입니다. 열쇠 따기 기술이나 저주를 이용한 힘으로는 그것을 열 수 없습니다. 적절한 열쇠가 "
"없이는 숨겨진 보물을 얻지 못할 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_39172_Text
msgctxt "2175f4e3-5c68-4ced-8bf7-60e15372ca8d"
msgid ""
"{n}Your intuition tells you this statue may be hiding something of value. "
"After several hours searching, you discover a hidden panel with a niche "
"above it. In the niche, a set of jagged grooves adorned with arcane symbols "
"seems to be connected to something deeper inside the statue. It seems that "
"access to {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} treasures will require the missing cogs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 직감은 이 동상이 가치있는 것을 숨기고 있다고 알려줍니다. 몇 시간 동안 검색한 후 당신은 위의 틈새가 있는 숨겨진 판을 "
"발견합니다. 틈 안에는 동상 안 쪽 깊숙이 무언가와 연결되어있는 마법 문양이 장식된 들쭉날쭉한 홈이 파여있습니다. 아마 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 보물들에 접근하려면 이 잃어버린 톱니바퀴들이 필요할 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_44062_Text
msgctxt "8e936d5d-899a-4b41-b89b-4c51eaeb2143"
msgid ""
"{n}This is harder than you thought. It takes some effort to place cogs into "
"and remove them from the mechanism. After several hours of failed attempts, "
"you finally find the right combination, so all of the cogs can now "
"rotate.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이것은 생각보다 어렵습니다. 톱니 바퀴를 기계 장치에 설치하고 제거하는 데 약간의 노력이 필요합니다. 몇 시간 동안의 시도 끝에 "
"당신은 마침내 올바른 조합을 찾게 되어 모든 톱니 바퀴가 회전할 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_46402_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bbddc845-567e-4a5e-abf3-b04ef9f0f8e1"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost inspects the markings closely.{/n} \"What have we here? Some "
"sort of puzzle? Interesting, let me see... Ah! Those are alchemical symbols, "
"just written in ancient dwarven script. This one is \"tin,\" so this is "
"where we place the white cog. That one's \"iron\" — red one goes there. And "
"the golden cog in the remaining space. A riddle for children, I'd suppose. "
"Dwarves are fond of such things.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 표시를 면밀히 검사합니다.{/n} \"이게 도대체 뭘까? 수수께끼일까? 재미있군. 보자... 아! 이건 고대의 드워프 "
"문헌에 나온 화학 기호다. 이것은 \"주석 \"이야. 이곳에 흰색 톱니바퀴를 놓으면 돼. 그곳은 \"철\"이니 붉은 색을. 금색 "
"톱니바퀴는 나머지 자리에 두어. 아마 유아용 놀이 같은데. 드워프들은 이런 걸 좋아한단 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_47559_Text
msgctxt "7ac8e680-b6f6-44f8-9115-ed8662d38e59"
msgid ""
"{n}No matter how you fit it, the cog won't rotate. It seems you'll need all "
"three of them to open the panel.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아무리 당신이 그것을 맞추려고 해도 톱니바퀴는 회전하지 않습니다. 판을 열려면 3개 모두가 필요할 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_50294_Text
msgctxt "3b52d936-2f71-4ad8-8cbe-9aa43ecac1bf"
msgid ""
"{n}Unfortunately, no one in your party can decipher the meaning of the "
"markings. The only option now is try all of the possible combinations.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}불행히도 당신의 일행 누구도 표시의 의미를 해독할 수 없습니다. 유일한 선택지는 가능한 모든 조합을 시도하는 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_81653_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b8556bdc-fefb-46dd-b3b1-c67e9a2c5150"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun bows his head and whispers a short prayer before the statue.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 머리를 숙여 동상에 짧은 기도를 속삭입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_82217_Text
msgctxt "496035b8-fe72-4d98-8b3c-7ff4657be7bc"
msgid ""
"{n}Unlike the timeworn watchtower, the statue of {g|Torag}Torag{/g} is in "
"perfect condition. The dwarven god's face has a stern look, almost "
"accusatory when combined with the surrounding devastation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}낡은 망루와는 달리 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 동상은 완벽한 상태입니다. 드워프 신의 얼굴은 주변의 폐허와 비교했을 때 마치 "
"만족한 듯한 표정을 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_91206_Text
msgctxt "b2a9cebe-2fb6-4134-9883-90f86a2adbd5"
msgid ""
"{n}Dwarven artisans are famous for installing clever hidden mechanisms in "
"their works. You discover a hidden panel with a niche above it. In the "
"niche, a set of jagged grooves adorned with arcane symbols seems to be "
"connected to something deeper inside the statue. It seems that access to "
"{g|Torag}Torag's{/g} treasures will require the missing cogs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프 장인은 자신의 작품에 숨겨진 기계장치를 설치하는 것으로 유명합니다. 당신은 위쪽의 움푹 파인 벽감에서 숨겨진 돌판을 "
"발견했습니다. 벽감에는 마법 문양이 장식된 들쭉날쭉한 홈이 파여있습니다. 동상 안 쪽 깊숙이 무언가와 연결되어있는 것처럼 보입니다. 아마 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 보물들에 접근하려면 이 잃어버린 톱니바퀴들이 필요할 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_93245_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "d6d52567-de64-41f9-bc45-74035697055d"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim gives the statue a long look, then spits on the ground without "
"saying a word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하림은 동상을 오랫동안 쳐다본 후 말 없이 땅에 침을 탁 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_93783_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c9add0a5-a622-4d85-bc5f-eaec6b15dc7f"
msgid ""
"\"What's the problem?\" {n}Harrim grumbles as he snatches the cogs from you "
"and places them inside the mechanism.{/n} \"This one goes here, that one "
"there... can't you see?\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐가 문제야?\" {n}하림은 당신에게서 톱니바퀴를 낚아채고 기계장치에 넣으며 불평합니다.{/n} \"이건 여기에. 저건 저기에... "
"모르겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_98204_Text
msgctxt "b10cdd90-0877-4b75-9a71-7fe70de26c97"
msgid ""
"{n}The markings seem vaguely familiar. Raking through your memory, you "
"realize these are well-known alchemical symbols, though in an ancient "
"dwarven script. The symbol for \"tin\" seems to be designed for the white "
"cog, representing tinsmiths. \"Iron\" must mean the red cog, for "
"blacksmiths, while \"gold\" is for the gold cog and goldsmiths. Having "
"placed all the cogs properly, you see they can now rotate.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}표시가 모호하게 보입니다. 기억을 긁어모아 당신은 고대의 드워프 문헌에 나온 유명한 화학 기호임을 알게 됩니다. \"주석\"의 "
"상징은 흰색 톱니바퀴를 나타냅니다. \"철\"은 대장장이를 의미한 빨간 톱니바퀴이고 \"금\"은 황금 톱니바퀴와 금 세공인을 의미한 "
"것입니다. 모든 톱니 바퀴를 적절히 배치하면 톱니바퀴가 회전할 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/ToragStatue/Cue_99510_Text
msgctxt "3c08f0cc-cbe8-4e75-a4cc-08d586c918e0"
msgid ""
"{n}As you whisper words of prayer to your god, you feel your heart fill with "
"the determination to never shrink from any obstacle.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 신에게 기도를 속삭일 때 어떤 상황에서도 결코 위축되지 않을 결의로 마음을 다잡게 됩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/BigOutdoorArea/TraderCorpse/TraderCorpseBark_String
msgctxt "80a06cc9-b979-40e4-9423-e5fce6d90577"
msgid ""
"Despite the Stag Lord being long dead, the bandits still plague these lands."
msgstr "수사슴 군주는 죽었음에도 도적이 여전히 그 땅에서 창궐합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/CandlemereTowerPortal_CheckFailBark_String
msgctxt "d433cb5b-3497-4edd-8f1d-ad5ba2155bf8"
msgid "Strange ripple fills the air."
msgstr "이상한 물결이 허공을 메웁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/CandlemereTowerPortal_CheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "e76c5c73-a140-4ac9-a787-2aae9d575aa1"
msgid ""
"There is a closed portal in the centre of the room. It seems it was used not "
"long ago."
msgstr "방 중앙에 닫힌 포털이 있습니다. 오래 전에 사용된 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/CandlemereTower_1stCampFire_Bark_String
msgctxt "c761fa3a-1a76-410b-96d0-3cd46418899d"
msgid "Coals are already cold."
msgstr "석탄은 이미 차갑습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/CandlemereTower_BoatInteractive_Bark_String
msgctxt "f58ea5a3-d9b9-47a7-b5c1-1c187677dbea"
msgid "The boat is in good condition. It looks like it was used not long ago."
msgstr "보트의 상태가 괜찮습니다. 얼마 전까지 사용된 것으로 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/CandlemereTower_Paladin_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "976eb1d9-fabe-4cd6-9e02-e38a770ad19a"
msgid ""
"A dead warrior in full armor with Irori holy symbols lies on the ground. He "
"was backstabbed."
msgstr "이로리의 신성한 문양으로 장식된 중갑옷을 입은 전사가 죽은 채로 누워있습니다. 그는 등에 칼이 찔렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/CandlemereTower_Shortcut_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "6dd0d9b5-9d55-42cc-9848-838438186c86"
msgid ""
"Somebody already tried to make a way through the dense thicket and gave up. "
"It would be hard to pass here."
msgstr "누군가 이미 이 무성한 덤불을 가로질러 길을 만들려 한 흔적이 있지만 포기한 것 같습니다. 지나가기 어려운 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/Interaction_CandlemereTower_CutWay_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "2a596c4b-e6f0-43a9-a793-9b444d1af71b"
msgid "Slash"
msgstr "베기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/Interaction_CandlemereTower_FindWay_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "8f372640-8201-4c83-8722-22ec879b7250"
msgid "Wade through"
msgstr "헤쳐 나아가기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/YogSotot_lore_01_String
msgctxt "21728f2c-3bc7-4f78-aadf-b4ffe5363ed2"
msgid "This stone is covered with drawings of jagged black spirals."
msgstr "이 돌은 구불구불한 검은 나선형의 그림으로 덮혀 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/YogSotot_lore_02_String
msgctxt "7e8b81b5-d8d2-4076-9ca0-613bb423c60d"
msgid "Ragged, meaningless scribbles."
msgstr "지저분하고 의미없는 낙서입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/YogSotot_lore_03_Fail_String
msgctxt "130c661f-37fa-446c-83b8-89a4fc7eb0f2"
msgid ""
"This weathered relief, worn down by time and the elements, bears a faint "
"inscription. The inscription is jagged and uneven, as if written by a "
"trembling hand."
msgstr "시간과 비바람에 닳아버린 비문은 희미한 각인이 새겨져 있습니다. 글씨는 떨리는 손으로 쓴 것처럼 들쭉날쭉하고 고르지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Barks/YogSotot_lore_03_Success_String
msgctxt "b5e53f2e-2da6-4427-8de0-88e8321ee1fc"
msgid ""
"This weathered relief, worn down by time and the elements, bears a faint "
"inscription. The inscription is jagged and uneven, as if written by a "
"trembling hand. \"Past, present, future, all are one in him... is the key "
"and guardian of the gate where spheres meet... N'SHOGGOGH YOG-SOTHOTH N'GHAH "
"Y'STATH.\""
msgstr ""
"시간과 비바람에 닳아버린 비문은 희미한 각인이 새겨져 있습니다. 글씨는 떨리는 손으로 쓴 것처럼 들쭉날쭉하고 고르지 않습니다. \"과거, "
"현재, 미래 모두가 그 안에 하나로 되어있다... 그것은 만남이 이루어지는 문의 수호자이자 열쇠이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Items/1stCampNote_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "31422643-76ca-4337-ab4c-efa1cd11f551"
msgid ""
"\"We came to this island at dusk. Decided to spend a night at the shore, and "
"go inland at dawn. We've seen some lights floating over the underbrush. For "
"some reason, they don't approach, keep their distance from us. Tomorrow "
"we'll head for the ruins.\n"
"The cleric and the paladin, who hired me to guide them, keep aloof. They "
"exchange whispers about something hidden in these ruins and fall silent as "
"soon as I come close. We've come here to search for treasures for a man "
"called Gunderson, but these two seem to have some plans of their own. It "
"would bother me less, if Rismel wasn't a cleric of Nethys. People say that "
"the moods and methods of his followers change as often as those of their two-"
"faced god. For now, at least, the cleric behaves nicely, except for constant "
"frantic speeches about the ruins. Anyways, Bryt is a paladin of Irori, so I "
"guess I can rely on his sense of justice.\n"
"We've heard about strange things that take place on the Candlemere Lake. A "
"few days ago, local folks saw a bright flash of light over the tower at the "
"island, and no one could explain what it was. Another strange thing I "
"witnessed myself: when we were coming to the island on our boat, I noticed "
"an old geezer on the shore — and this island is thought to be deserted. I "
"guess the geezer saw us too, because he disappeared. I would track the old "
"hermit down, but I don't dare to leave the campsite unattended. Can't help "
"thinking this island is really cursed, as locals used to say.\n"
"If the curse is just a fable, and if Rismel doesn't try any tricks, we'll "
"come back here and I'll take this note away. And if you find this note, "
"traveler, hop on your boat and go back where you came from.\n"
"Erastil, bless me.\n"
"Morry Focrey\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 이 섬에 해질 무렵에 왔다. 해안에서 밤을 보내고 새벽에 섬 안쪽으로 들어가기로 결정했다. 우리는 덤불 위로 떠있는 몇개의 "
"빛들을 보았다. 무슨 이유에선지 접근하지는 않고, 우리와 거리를 유지하고 있다. 내일 우리는 폐허로 향할 것이다.\n"
"나를 가이드로 고용한 클레릭과 팔라딘은 나를 냉담하게 대한다. 그들은 이 폐허 속에 숨겨진 뭔가에 대해 속삭이다가도 내가 가까이 다가가면 "
"침묵을 지킨다. 우리는 건더슨이라고 불리는 사람이 남긴 보물을 찾기 위해 이곳에 왔는데, 이 두 사람은 나름의 계획을 갖고 있는 것 "
"같다. 리즈멜이라는 자가 네서스의 클레릭이 아니었다면 덜 불편했을것 같다. 사람들은 네서스의 추종자들은 두 얼굴을 가진 네서스만큼이나 "
"성격이변덕스럽다고 한다. 적어도 이 클레릭은 폐허에 관해 계속해서 미친듯이 연설을 해대는 것만 빼고는 아직까진 나쁘지 않다. 게다가 "
"브라이트라는 자는 이로리의 팔라딘이니 나는 그의 정의로운 성격에 의지할 수 있을 것 같다.\n"
"우리는 캔들미어 호수에서 일어나는 이상한 일에 대해 들었다. 며칠 전, 현지 사람들은 섬의 탑에 밝은 빛이 비치는 것을 보았다고 한다. "
"하지만 아무도 그것이 무엇인지 설명할 수 없었다. 내가 직접 목격한 또 다른 이상한 일은, 우리 보트가 섬으로 왔을 때 해안에 어떤 늙은 "
"괴짜가 있는 것을 보았다. 이 섬은 사람들이 떠나간 버려진 섬으로 알려져 있는데도 말이다. 그 늙은 괴짜도 우리를 본 것이 확실한가보다. "
"그가 어느샌가 사라졌기 때문이다. 이 늙은 은둔자를 추적해 봐야겠지만 야영지를 방치할 엄두가 나지 않는다. 지역 주민들이 말하던 것처럼 "
"이 섬은 정말로 저주 받았다는 생각이 든다.\n"
"저주가 단지 우화일 뿐이고 리즈멜이 어떤 속임수도 쓰지 않는다면 우리는 여기로 다시 돌아올 것이고, 그럼 이 메모도 다시 가져가겠다. "
"만약 이 메모를 찾은 여행자가 있다면, 보트를 타고 출발한 곳으로 다시 돌아가길 바란다.\n"
"에라스틸이시여. 나를 축복해주소서.\n"
"모리 포크레이\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Items/1stCampNote_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "47940128-131d-4398-b351-788d5a475359"
msgid "Note Wrapped in an Oiled Leather"
msgstr "윤이나는 가죽으로 감싼 메모"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Items/2ndCampNote_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "abd4d3df-9392-4014-b700-7d4014aae6c8"
msgid ""
"\"I've described the plant and the wound it caused as soon as I could. I "
"hope in the future I'll be able to show these notes to some druid, to learn "
"more about this stuff. I should have known better than go into a bush "
"thicket — the slope was steep, and it was dangerous to climb here anyway – "
"even if these lights-creatures won't bother us. Rismel started to behave "
"strangely early this morning, he acted like a real madman: made me search "
"for the shortcut to the ruins, then refused to heal me when I got wounded by "
"the thorn. Damned priest constantly pushes us ahead — supposedly he had a "
"message from Nethys himself, and while his god is waiting for him in the "
"tower, the cleric has no time for petty matters. I'm starting to believe all "
"those rumors about the followers of Nethys and their unreliability were true."
"\n"
"I wanted to turn back and leave the gold where it belongs, but Bryt "
"persuaded me to keep moving forward. According to him, this Gunderson guy "
"has got the wrong meaning of the word \"treasure\". The paladin is convinced "
"that the treasure, which really is hidden in the tower, is some priceless "
"magic knowledge left there by ancient dwellers of the island, but he's not "
"sure he can get to the place through the thickets without my help. If I had "
"it my way, I'd just leave this mess as it is — I seriously doubt our client "
"is interested in some dusty old books. But this argument won't work for the "
"cleric, who worships a god of magic, and the paladin, who serves a god of "
"knowledge.\n"
"Bryt tried to heal my wound by himself. As a result, it is almost closed, "
"but still stings bitterly. I hope it's a passing side-effect. Because, at "
"least for now, I have no way back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 할 수있는 한 빨리 그 식물과 상처를 묘사했다. 미래에 더 많은 것을 알기 위해 드루이드에게 이 메모를 보여줄 수 있기를 "
"바란다. 나는 그저 덤불 속으로 들어간다고 방심해서는 안되었다. 경사면이 가파랐고 올라가기에는 위험했다. 불빛이 나는 괴물이 우리를 "
"괴롭히지 않았더라도 말이다. 리즈멜은 오늘 이른 아침부터 이상하게 행동하기 시작했다. 그는 진짜 미친 사람처럼 행동했다. 폐허로 가는 "
"지름길을 알아오라고 시키지 않나 내가 가시에 상처를 입었을 때도 나를 치료하기를 거부했다. 그 망할 사제가 계속해서 우리를 밀어붙인다. "
"그는 아마도 네서스로부터 직접 계시를 받았을 것이다. 그리고 그의 신이 탑에서 그를 기다리고 있는 동안은 이 사제는 사소한 일에 시간을 "
"할애할 시간이 없는 거겠지. 나는 네서스의 추종자에 대한 소문과 신뢰할 수 없는 것들 모두가 사실이라고 믿기 시작했다.\n"
"나는 돌아가서 금을 원래있던 곳에 두고 싶었지만 브라이트는 계속 앞으로 나아가라고 한다. 그가 말하길, 건더슨이라는 사람은 \"보물"
"\"이라는 단어의 의미를 잘못 알고 있는거라고 한다. 이 팔라딘은 그 탑에 숨겨진 보물은 고대에 섬에 살았던 거주자들이 남긴 귀중한 마법 "
"지식이라고 믿고 있지만 그는 내 도움 없이 덤불을 통과할 수 있을지 확신하지 못했다. 방법만 있었다면 이 난장판을 당장 떠나고 싶었다. "
"과연 내 고용인들이 먼지가 쌓인 오래된 책들에 관심이 있을지 의심이 가기 시작했다. 하지만 이런 얘기는 마법의 신을 믿는 사제와 지식의 "
"신을 섬기는 팔라딘에게는 먹히지 않을 것이다.\n"
"브라이트는 혼자서 내 상처를 치료하려고 했다. 결국 상처는 거의 아물었지만 아직도 심하게 따갑다. 아마 치료의 부작용이리라. 최소한 지금 "
"나는 돌아갈 수가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Items/2ndCampNote_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "88fcc587-f6b0-4fce-b352-028f6726c3a8"
msgid "Torn Damp Page"
msgstr "찢어진 페이지 덩어리"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Items/RangerNote_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "809ee4ad-56fb-4491-b095-75fa6b8a1128"
msgid ""
"Only the last page is readable.\n"
"\"…left me behind.\n"
"I begged them to stay. Rismel doesn't care — Nethys has turned the dark face "
"to him, so the cleric is lost to us. Bryt promised to come back, but it's "
"been a long time since he left, and he hasn't showed up yet. I just hope the "
"paladin survived and managed to save himself, at least.\n"
"These are the last words of my log. The wound is festering, some yellow "
"stuff oozes from it. I couldn't climb the rock and reach the ruins. Guess "
"now I won't be able even to stand: my skin burns and I barely can breathe.\n"
"I'll die on this cursed island. And no one will ever know where I've spent "
"my last hours.\n"
"left alone, but I'm not alone. damned lights in the underbrush. they are "
"closer now.\n"
"i'm not delirious. they came for my death.\n"
"lights watch\n"
"want my pain\n"
"erastil take my soul\""
msgstr ""
"마지막 페이지만 읽을 수 있습니다.\n"
"\"... 나를 두고 떠났다.\n"
"나는 그들에게 가지 말라고 간청했다. 리즈멜은 상관하지 않았다. 네서스는 검은 얼굴을 그에게 드러내었고 사제는 우리를 버렸다. 브라이트는 "
"돌아오겠다고 약속했지만 이미 떠난지 오래되었고 아직 나타나지 않았다. 최소한 이 팔라딘만이라도 살아남아 여기서 빠져나가길 바랄뿐이다.\n"
"이것이 내 기록의 마지막이다. 상처가 너덜거리고 고름이 나온다. 나는 바위를 기어올라가 폐허에 도착할 수 없다. 이제는 서있을 수도 없을 "
"것 같다. 피부가 타오르고 숨도 제대로 쉴수가 없다.\n"
"이 저주받은 섬에서 나는 죽을 것이다. 그리고 아무도 내 최후를 알 수 없겠지.\n"
"혼자 남았지만 혼자가 아니다. 덤불에 망할 불빛이 어른거린다. 그들은 이제 더 가깝다.\n"
"헛소리가 아니다. 그들은 내 죽음을 위해 왔다.\n"
"빛은 본다\n"
"내 고통을 원한다.\n"
"에라스틸이시여 내 영혼을 받으소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Items/RangerNote_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "b59c9d96-b85c-4dc0-9807-d874a0ab6f73"
msgid "Dirty Travel Log"
msgstr "더러운 여행 일지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98631_Text
msgctxt "0857a579-4b60-470c-99d9-69de21fc8499"
msgid "\"Time to die, lunatic!\""
msgstr "\"죽을 시간이다. 미치광이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98649_Text
msgctxt "9af36fa7-40ed-449c-b343-991b5f145336"
msgid "\"Are you sure you want to stay here on this island?\""
msgstr "\"정말 이 섬에 머물고 싶은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98657_Text
msgctxt "7f28ad80-b286-47ee-88f0-c89c0e7557be"
msgid ""
"\"An enchanted sanctuary, gates to other worlds… they are here? In these "
"ruins?\""
msgstr "\"마법의 성소, 다른 세계로가는 문... 그것들은 여기에 있나? 이 폐허에?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98659_Text
msgctxt "2f68097a-aa8d-4535-afad-98fb79033377"
msgid "\"Some say this place is cursed.\""
msgstr "\"몇몇 사람들은 이 곳이 저주받았다던데..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98661_Text
msgctxt "77669fb9-e655-425b-b4a9-15b445eeccf0"
msgid ""
"\"Let's assume Nethys waits beyond the portal. But what's beyond the portal "
"exactly?\""
msgstr "\"네서스가 포털 너머에서 기다리고 있다고 가정해 보자. 하지만 포털 너머에는 정확히 무엇이 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98668_Text
msgctxt "c2cf6079-a8a9-4a60-bfe3-d9af212c7b20"
msgid "\"Enough about this place.\""
msgstr "\"이 장소에 대해서는 충분히 들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98673_Text
msgctxt "cbbec06b-b34d-47b3-aa7c-5f59bcaa3948"
msgid "\"I'll leave you be. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 떠나겠어. 그럼 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98674_Text
msgctxt "c4cd8f5d-847a-47c6-b243-8c311b22c51c"
msgid "\"You're a threat to yourself — and others. I'd best kill you.\""
msgstr "\"너는 자신과 다른 사람들에게 위협이 된다. 너를 죽이는 것이 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986779_Text
msgctxt "b300c08d-0cb1-42aa-aff9-e27b6fc68951"
msgid ""
"\"Near the tower entrance lies a paladin, dead — stabbed in the back. You "
"betrayed him by giving in to your own ambition and pride. So who are you "
"after all you've done, Rismel?\""
msgstr ""
"\"탑 입구 근처에는 죽은 팔라딘이 있는데, 등을 찔려 죽었다. 너는 자신의 야망과 자존심에 굴복하여 그를 배신한거야. 이 모든 짓을 한 "
"너는 대체 누구지. 리스멜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98677_Text
msgctxt "d068705a-82ef-407d-98e8-7f5ff190a97d"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to yourself! — 'Nethys speaks to me,' 'Nethys has chosen me'... You "
"know your god does not waste his time on mortals. How long are you going to "
"lie to yourself, claiming the voice in your head belongs to Nethys?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너 자신에게 귀기울여봐! ..'네서스가 내게 말한다', '네서스가 나를 선택했다'...너의 신은 인간에게 시간을 낭비하지 않는다는 걸 "
"너도 잘 알고 있잖아. 네 머리 속의 목소리가 네서스라고 말하며 언제까지 너 자신을 속일 셈인 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986781_Text
msgctxt "3e77dc93-f5dc-421f-ab30-d8ac6f9259f2"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986782_Text
msgctxt "ea6d9551-d378-4ae1-b147-8b99b2c2b456"
msgid "\"Will-o'-wisps roam the island. How did you get past them?\""
msgstr "\"윌-오-위습들이 섬을 떠돌아다니고 있어. 어떻게 그들을 지나쳤지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986789_Text
msgctxt "c3767bad-7ee8-4c83-828c-8f89a3269d27"
msgid ""
"[Irony] \"Oh, so the great Nethys is just beyond this portal — yet the god "
"of magic can't cross over on his own? Ha!\""
msgstr ""
"[비꼽니다] \"오, 그럼 위대한 네서스가 이 포털 바로 너머에 있다는 거군. 그런데 마법의 신이 혼자서는 건너올 수는 없는 모양이군? "
"하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98678_Text
msgctxt "9840a9f2-d333-4823-863e-78a0ec809840"
msgid ""
"\"I found a corpse on the island. You know the one I speak of. He perished "
"in suffering, terrified, cursing those who'd left him to die. What did he do "
"to earn your cruelty?\""
msgstr ""
"\"섬에서 시체를 발견했어. 내가 말하는게 누구인지 알고있겠지. 그는 고통속에서, 겁에 질려, 자신을 버린 자들을 저주하며 죽어갔다. "
"그가 너에게 무슨 짓을 했길래 그런 잔인함을 당한거지 ?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986791_Text
msgctxt "f4a6e4a9-3870-4336-b24b-3bde948bba1e"
msgid ""
"\"I've come for the temple's treasures. Does anything of value remain?\""
msgstr "\"나는 성전의 보물을 찾으러 왔는데 가치있는 것이 남아 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986822_Text
msgctxt "d6a3712d-d67e-4cde-aac8-18d867e2170f"
msgid ""
"\"The man who sent me to this island claimed there were treasures here.\""
msgstr "\"나를 이 섬으로 보낸 사람은 여기에 보물이 있다고 주장했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986824_Text
msgctxt "4ec85bb0-a62a-4d7b-8d09-8f3efabac08b"
msgid "\"What do the writings say?\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고 쓰여있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986827_Text
msgctxt "57a8e19a-1e6e-4071-a8b6-ed21e221a5b0"
msgid "\"Where are the others you came here with?\""
msgstr "\"같이 온 다른 사람들은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_986828_Text
msgctxt "1bcce69a-449a-4b0b-8f92-57f5ea732766"
msgid "\"I'll find the proofs that you're wrong.\""
msgstr "\"네가 틀렸다는 증거를 찾겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98684_Text
msgctxt "2a3d6536-1bb0-402d-99a8-15beccbc4e6a"
msgid "\"I'll help you to fight the monster.\""
msgstr "\"네가 괴물과 싸울 수 있도록 도와주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98685_Text
msgctxt "35751227-53f9-4194-b15b-7ddf09b3c74c"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not sure if I'll help you or not, but I'm not done talking with you.\""
msgstr "\"너를 도울지 안도울지는 아직 모르겠다. 하지만 너와 이야기가 다 끝나지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98688_Text
msgctxt "15683710-c48d-4894-bb25-19c9f34eaaa8"
msgid "\"I'm ready to face whatever lies beyond the portal.\""
msgstr "\"포털 너머에 있는 것과 직면할 준비가 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98691_Text
msgctxt "76df68ef-7722-4238-b639-c5879ad769ef"
msgid "\"I don't have to convince you, just execute you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 납득시킬 필요가 없다. 너를 처형하면 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98695_Text
msgctxt "914411b8-eea1-4e55-ac86-58378bfd2cd4"
msgid ""
"\"We know nothing about the creature who's waiting on the other side. Give "
"me some time to get ready.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 저 편에서 기다리고 있는 생명체에 대해서는 아무것도 모른다. 준비할 시간을 좀 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98700_Text
msgctxt "a99aaefa-7c45-4acf-941e-29da9a15222e"
msgid "\"Now if your mind's clearer… tell me about this place.\""
msgstr "\"이제 정신이 좀 맑아졌다면... 이 장소에 대해 말해주겠어?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98704_Text
msgctxt "428c6a93-969d-4967-b455-9fbd39ddf67c"
msgid "\"Can you seal the portal permanently?\""
msgstr "\"포털을 영구적으로 봉인할 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98705_Text
msgctxt "a2e1f36a-b241-468c-aa15-601b690bdc03"
msgid "\"Locals claim the island is cursed.\""
msgstr "\"주민들은 섬이 저주를 받았다고 말했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98706_Text
msgctxt "647e5606-4681-4c24-8d60-c322f398e69c"
msgid "\"Thank you, I've learned all I wanted.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 궁금했던 건 다 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98711_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b2a084d2-3334-4d3f-b164-2783319eb66e"
msgid "Punished priest of Nethys for betraying his companions."
msgstr "그의 동료를 배반한 네서스의 사제를 처벌합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98711_Text
msgctxt "d155ddc8-c4dd-4f2e-ab11-43763e3c5ade"
msgid ""
"\"You betrayed those who trusted you. You left one friend to die and killed "
"another! You're a murderer and must answer for your crimes.\""
msgstr "\"너를 믿는 사람들을 배반했다. 한 명은 죽게 내버려두고 다른 사람은 죽였지. 너는 살인자이고 죗값을 치뤄야 해\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98713_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cc1cfd56-8ba7-4e22-9b73-3270f85decb3"
msgid "Eliminated priest of Nethys as a possible future troublemaker."
msgstr "말썽의 소지가 있는 네서스의 사제를 제거했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98713_Text
msgctxt "2f450635-668c-49e4-9657-88eeb13fb6a1"
msgid ""
"\"You're not in control of yourself. As soon as Nethys turns his attention "
"back to you, madness will take you again. The safest course is to kill you "
"here and now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 네 자신을 통제하지 못해. 네서스가 네게 관심을 가진다면 너는 다시 광기에 사로잡히겠지. 나는 너를 죽여야 한다는 교훈을 얻었다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98714_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8271324f-ca8e-42e0-8099-a1cf55ad06bb"
msgid "Killed priest of Nethys for causing too much trouble."
msgstr "너무 많은 문제를 일으킨 네서스의 성직자를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98714_Text
msgctxt "bd40d4e8-f78f-40ae-a541-a7542b1cbfc1"
msgid ""
"\"You've caused too much trouble. That's enough to warrant your execution.\""
msgstr "\"너는 너무 많은 문제를 일으켰다. 네 사형을 보증하기에 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_98715_Text
msgctxt "a135c286-8976-4c60-a637-e3e22ffb2fc2"
msgid "\"Forget what I said.\""
msgstr "\"내가 말한 건 잊어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Answer_CNDLMR_INIT_Text
msgctxt "611d2fdb-4a00-442a-9443-25cf11f67d37"
msgid ""
"\"Rismel… no matter if this island is cursed or not, you're not in your "
"right mind. You don't know what you're doing.\""
msgstr "\"리즈멜...이 섬이 저주에 걸렸든 아니든 간에 넌 지금 제정신이 아니야. 너는 네가 무엇을 하고 있는지 모르고있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98629_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "6f916a24-2fed-46b0-8b1b-d479b62540b2"
msgid ""
"{n}A man stands in the center of the half-ruined hall. He is motionless. His "
"eyes are closed, head tilted, as if he was listening to something inaudible. "
"He's clad in tattered black-and-white robe, though mud and dust made his "
"clothes look almost uniformly grey. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}한 남자가 반쯤 망가진 회장의 중심에 서있습니다. 그는 움직이지 않습니다. 그는 눈을 감고 무언가를 듣는 듯 고개를 기울이고 "
"있습니다. 그의 로브는 진흙과 먼지가 여기저기 묻어있어 그의 흰색 로브는 회색으로 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98630_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "76391fa5-0e98-4c7a-b109-aeb3c3a35364"
msgid ""
"{n}Hearing your footsteps, the man shudders and turns abruptly. The left "
"part of his face is covered in blood and dirt. Seeing you, he gives a low "
"growl in his throat.{/n} \"Tresspassers!\" {n}He spits on the ground.{/n} "
"\"Are you so eager to die?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 발걸음을 듣자 남자는 깜짝 놀라 뒤돌아봅니다. 그의 얼굴 왼쪽 부분은 피와 흙으로 덮여 있습니다. 당신을 보면서 그는 낮은 "
"소리로 위협합니다.{/n} \"침입자!\" {n}그는 땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"그렇게도 죽기를 원하는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98632_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "6353ec64-e1c0-47fc-b6cd-2f866ec5295f"
msgid "\"You dare?! Then feel the wrath of The All-Seeing Eye!\""
msgstr "\"감히! 그렇다면 모든 보는 눈의 진노를 느껴봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98636_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "e4f1e429-a4b8-4533-859e-b5b78c17e0c0"
msgid "\"You again?\""
msgstr "\"또 너냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98637_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "25aeafcb-1fcf-4e4d-98fc-8b7c3ee029c6"
msgid "\"Why are you here, traveler?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98641_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "001a09f9-5ffc-47cc-87b9-bccc5334638b"
msgid ""
"{n}The man stares at you for several moments. Then he suddenly grins and "
"raises his eyebrows — in mockery.{/n} \"Who am I? Oh, soon the whole world "
"will know my name.\" {n}The man straightens and raises his hands to the "
"sky.{/n} \"Two-faced Rismel! Keeper of the Gates! Harbinger of "
"{g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}! I have many names, and you shall pay fealty to them "
"all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 남자는 몇 분 동안 당신을 바라봅니다. 그리고는 갑자기 조롱하듯 웃으며 눈썹을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"나는 누구인가? 곧 온 "
"세상이 내 이름을 알 것이다.\" {n}남자는 하늘에 손을 똑바로 들어올립니다.{/n} \"두 얼굴의 리즈멜! 문의 수호자! "
"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}의 전령! 나는 많은 이름을 가지고 있으니 너희는 그 모두에게 충성의 서약을 해야하리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98650_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "b89cbd3a-7226-4620-b4aa-39fb10a71e14"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel, pale, nods.{/n} \"This is my penance. Someone must keep watch "
"over the portal. I... I won't let anyone else die here, or become enslaved "
"by temptation.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리즈멜은 창백해져서 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"이것은 내 형벌이다. 누군가 포털을 지키고 있어야 해. 나는... 다른 누구도 여기에서 "
"죽거나 유혹에 사로 잡히지 않게 하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98658_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "6b841105-376b-4407-9fdd-48e4dd2e1f76"
msgid ""
"\"Silence!\" {n}Rismel roars.{/n} \"You're too blind to see what surrounds "
"you — vibrant, bright, glorious to those who have embraced the arcane and "
"mastered its power!\"\n"
"{n}Rismel's voice drops, and his eyes become unfocused.{/n} \""
"{g|Nethys}Nethys{/g} himself led me here! His voice rings in my head, "
"calling from the portal! All these writings... all these wandering lights... "
"only the blind cannot see the coming of The All-Seeing Eye!\""
msgstr ""
"\"조용히!\" {n}리즈멜이 외칩니다.{/n} \"너는 눈이 멀어서 네 주위의 것을 보지 못해. 신비를 받아들이고 힘을 지배한 자들의 "
"빛나고 영광적인 모습을!\"\n"
"{n}리즈멜의 말소리가 줄어들고 그의 눈은 흐릿해집니다.{/n} \"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}께서 나를 여기로 인도했다! 포털 "
"안에서 나를 부르는 그의 목소리가 내 머리에 울려퍼진다. 이 새겨진 모든 문장들...이 방랑하는 빛들... 오직 눈먼 자들만이 '모든 "
"것을 보는 눈'이 오는 것을 보지 못한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98663_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "2feb013a-116a-47af-9eaa-b5c6ac70845b"
msgid ""
"\"Cursed?\" {n}Rismel bursts into hysterical laughter.{/n} \"Only fools can "
"claim this place is cursed! On the contrary, this tower, this portal — it's "
"a true blessing for those who can grasp its real greatness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저주받았다고?\" {n}리즈멜은 매우 재밌다는 듯이 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"멍청이들이나 이 곳이 저주를 받았다고 하겠지! 그 "
"반대로 진정한 위대함을 이해할 수 있는 사람들에게 이 탑과 이 문은 진정한 축복이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98669_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "a0592747-ca2d-4aac-92de-853a9c978f62"
msgid "{n}Rismel grunts — but makes no response.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}리즈멜은 불쾌한듯 하지만 아무런 대꾸가 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98670_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "5d624d36-3483-4afb-94c3-5828da82d2f9"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel shuts his eyes, then slowly opens them.{/n} \"How dare you... \" "
"{n}He hisses through clenched teeth.{/n} \"{g|Nethys}Nethys{/g} himself "
"guides me! How dare you judge a Chosen One of the All-Seeing Eye?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리즈멜은 눈을 감았다가 천천히 다시 뜹니다.{/n} \"어떻게 감히...\" {n}그는 이를 악물고 나즈막히 말합니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}가 친히 나를 인도하신다! 어떻게 네가 감히 모든 것을 보는 눈의 선택받은 자를 판단할 수 있는가?! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986786_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "dc198aeb-2087-4510-bd6e-81d7aff18f97"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel blinks his tears away and turns to the portal, as if recalling it "
"is still there.{/n} \"But the voice... The voice that urged me to open the "
"gates...\" {n}He falls silent for a moment.{/n} \"It still sounds inside my "
"head! But it is not {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}. No, no, it's not Him, it's... "
"something... else.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜은 그의 눈을 깜박이며 그것이 여전히 존재한다는 듯이 포탈을 향해 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"그러나 목소리가... 문을 열라는 그 "
"목소리...\" {n}그는 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"여전히 내 머리 속에서 들린다. 하지만 그것은 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}가 "
"아니다. 아니야. 그가 아니야... 그건... 다른 무언가야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986792_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "89eb6902-388a-4bd3-940e-3bca51968292"
msgid ""
"\"Anything of value? Look before you!\" {n}Rismel points to the portal.{/n} "
"\"Beyond is the keeper of all knowledge — {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g} himself! The "
"wisdom of All-Seeing Eye... it's of more value than your paltry mind can "
"dream of!\""
msgstr ""
"\"가치가있는 것? 네 앞에 있다!\" {n}리스멜은 포털을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"모든 지식의 수호자 뒤에 "
"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}가 있다! 모든 것을 보는 눈의 지혜가... 그것은 네가 꿈꿀 수 있는 무엇보다도 더 가치가 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986793_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "de6a992b-e2c5-4c7f-a308-bdb3e6a6f819"
msgid ""
"\"But if you seek gold, gems, and other worthless things...\" {n}Rismel "
"sneers and shakes his head.{/n} \"Then you've wasted your time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 금이나 보석 같은 쓸모없는 것들을 찾는다면...\" {n}리즈멜은 비웃으며 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"너는 시간을 낭비했다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986806_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "58175b40-5f7d-4075-bf85-577d8a100c79"
msgid ""
"\"I am the chosen one.\" {n}Rismel shakes his head.{/n} \"I knew it, always. "
"The chosen one… different from the others...\" {n}His voice falters.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 선택된 사람이다.\" {n}리즈멜은 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"나는 항상 알고 있었다. 다른 것과는 다른... 선택된 "
"자...\" {n}그의 목소리가 떨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986811_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "f7abab70-c215-49e8-b305-024ec49fef13"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel stiffens.{/n} \"But all I've done was for a greater purpose. "
"History will vindicate me.\" {n}Rismel refuses to look at you.{/n} \"Nothing "
"you say will break my faith… \""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜은 굳어버립니다.{/n} \"그러나 내가 한 모든 일은 더 큰 목적을 위한 것이었어. 역사는 나를 옹호할 것이다.\" {n}"
"리즈멜은 당신을 보지 않습니다.{/n} \"네 말은 내 신앙을 깨뜨릴 수 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986815_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "8cc24192-51ec-4b2f-a992-60db9640c292"
msgid ""
"\"Enough!\" {n}Rismel snarls.{/n} \"It was the only sacrifice I've made in "
"the name of {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}! You have nothing more to accuse me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만!\" {n}리스멜은 혼란스러워합니다.{/n} \"그것은 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}의 이름으로 행해진 유일한 희생이었다! "
"너는 나를 비난할 자격이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986823_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "14cd5bd8-138c-494c-9731-6508e52f2b83"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel gives an eloquent look to the half-ruined tower, dusty stones and "
"the grass that sprouts through the stone floor.{/n} \"I guess this man was "
"wrong.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜은 돌바닥에 잡초가 자라나고 먼지로 뒤덮인 돌이 가득한 폐허가 된 타워를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"이 사람이 잘못한 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986825_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "62317091-968c-4471-9865-daf74247a0df"
msgid ""
"{n}A shadow falls across Rismel's face. He stares at the writings at the "
"walls that shimmer with ghostly light.{/n} \"I'll find out.\" {n}He mutters, "
"but to himself.{/n} \"When He comes... when he shares his boundless wisdom "
"with me... I'll find out everything I want.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜의 얼굴이 어두워집니다. 그는 유령 같은 빛으로 반짝이는 벽의 글을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"내가 알아낼 거야.\" {n}그는 "
"자신에게 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"그분이 올 때... 나와 함께 그의 무한한 지혜를 나눌 때... 나는 내가 원하는 모든 것을 발견할 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986826_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "044a0a3c-ab16-4ea1-9bd2-c8e248591686"
msgid ""
"\"Will-o'-wisps don't devour flesh, they feed on suffering and fear. The "
"island is full of them — since the times when this temple was sanctified "
"with human blood. Besides, there was no fear in my heart — only joy and awe, "
"for I was to meet my God and Master.\""
msgstr ""
"\"위습은 육체를 삼키지 않고 고통과 두려움을 먹고 산다. 섬은 인간의 피로 물들게 된 이후로 위습으로 가득하다. 하지만 내 마음에는 "
"두려움이 없다. 기쁨과 경외심만이 있을 뿐. 나는 나의 신이자 주인을 만나기 때문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986828_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "918a3f41-db54-4cbf-aab3-42290eecf3d4"
msgid ""
"\"Who?...\" {n}Rismel ponders your words for a moment.{/n} \"Ah... You're "
"talking about those who came to the island with me. They are gone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구?...\" {n}리스멜은 잠시 당신 말의 의미를 생각합니다.{/n} \"아... 나와 함께 섬에 온 사람들에 대해 이야기하는군. "
"그들은 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986829_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "2afc7386-2a6d-489d-9817-20c8b458dae9"
msgid ""
"\"One of them gave up halfway here. I know nothing of his fate. And the "
"second... the miserable creature, he...\" {n}Rismel closes his eyes, as if "
"fighting to control his temper.{/n} \"He kept talking — how knowledge must "
"belong to everyone, wisdom should be shared, about telling others about this "
"place... he kept talking and talking.... \" {n}Rismel falls still for a "
"moment.{/n} \"So I silenced him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들 중 한 명은 여기서 중도에 포기했다. 그의 운명에 대해 아무것도 모른다. 그리고 두 번째는... 비참한 생물... 그는...\" "
"{n}리스멜은 화를 억누르려는 듯 눈을 감습니다.{/n} \"그는 계속 말했다. 지식은 모든 사람에게 속해야 하고 지혜는 공유되어야 하니 "
"다른 사람들에게 이 장소에 대해 말해야 한다고... 그는 계속해서 말하고 또 말했다.\" {n}리스멜은 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"그래서"
" 나는 그를 침묵시켰다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986835_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "ebcf9ca7-ad9f-45a1-92e7-0e83ae72d675"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel sneers.{/n} \"You've already tried to accuse me, blind one. You "
"have something to add?\""
msgstr "{n}리스멜이 비웃습니다.{/n} \"나를 비난해도 소용 없다. 할 말은 다 했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98683_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "1df408a6-c7e8-45bd-9fcc-b37085dd5fe9"
msgid ""
"{n}The man turns back to you.{/n} \"I... I would never be able to repay for "
"you help. stranger. But I must ask you about one more thing... will you help "
"me to confront the creature that waits beyond the portal? I'll be able to "
"open it and let this... thing come to {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. We have to "
"destroy it before it finds some new prey.\" {n}Rismel covers his eyes.{/n} "
"\"When we're done with this, I'll stay here and make sure no living soul "
"ever falls the victim of this island.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자가 당신을 돌아봅니다.{/n} \"나는... 난 네가 도와준 것에 절대 보답할 수 없을 거야. 이방인. 하지만 한가지 더 "
"부탁할게있어... 포탈 너머에서 기다리는 생명체와 맞설 수 있게 도와주겠어? 난 이 포탈을 열어서 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}"
"으로 들어오게 할 수 있어. 그것이 새로운 먹잇감을 찾기 전에 파괴해야만 해.\" {n}리즈멜은 그의 눈을 감쌉니다.{/n} \"우리가 "
"이 일을 끝내면 나는 여기 머물면서 살아있는 영혼이 이 섬의 희생자가 되지 않도록 하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986843_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "d57db6bc-5e9d-407d-91d7-319248c61a94"
msgid "{n}Rismel stares at you silently, his eyes narrowed.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}리스멜은 당신을 조용히 바라보고 그의 눈은 좁아졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986845_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "c50fc3fb-05b9-4bd9-8213-a2095c13530b"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel's eyes turn glassy and dull as he keeps talking, and his speech "
"becomes a stream of barely understandable words. It's impossible to "
"distinguish, which part of his ramblings is true, and which represents his "
"delirious fantasies. Nonetheless, the madman seems to lose interest in "
"attacking you right now. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}리즈멜의 눈은 계속 말을 할수록 점차 흐릿하고 둔해져 갔으며 그의 말은 간신히 이해할 수 있게 되었습니다. 어느 부분이 사실인지 "
"그의 헛된 환상인지 구별하는 것은 불가능합니다. 그럼에도 불구하고 이 미치광이는 지금 당신을 공격하는 것에 관심을 잃은 것처럼 "
"보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986847_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "5359dc30-03d8-4947-b308-a2218b6558d8"
msgid ""
"{n}As you listen to Rismel, you can't stop frowning. Something is clearly "
"not right — not just with the man, but his words. {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}, the "
"mad deity of magic and wizardry, never speaks directly his followers. His "
"followers take pride in this — for their god is much too great to lower "
"himself to such base forms of expression. Whoever or whatever Rismel heard "
"beyond the portal — it is not Nethys.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜의 말을 들으면서 당신은 얼굴을 찌푸리지 않을 수가 없습니다. 뭔가가 분명히 옳지 않습니다. 그 사람이 아니라 그의 말이 "
"그렇습니다. 마법의 미친 신인 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}는 추종자를 통해 말하지 않습니다. 추종자들은 이를 자랑스럽게 여겨 위대한 "
"신이 자신과 같은 하찮은 생물을 통해 말을 하지 않는다고 생각하기 때문입니다. 포털 너머에 있는 것이 무엇이 되었든 그것은 네서스가 "
"아닙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986848_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "4efa1a08-2335-4463-a5ad-57eb4395a3a4"
msgid ""
"{n}As you listen to Rismel, you can't stop wincing — the man's voice is so "
"convincing, his beliefs so strong, that all your doubts about his words just "
"vanish. Seems like this man really follows the path set by his god.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜의 말에 귀를 기울이자 당신은 의심을 멈추지 않을 수 없었습니다. 그의 목소리가 너무 설득력 있고 그의 신념은 강했기에 당신의 "
"모든 의구심이 사라지게 됩니다. 이 사람은 정말로 신의 길을 따르는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986851_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "ddef82e0-6f5b-4283-b8aa-78cd77bbaf3a"
msgid ""
"\"You are terribly mistaken, honorable priest. Nethys does not interfere in "
"the lives of his followers. Unlike the other gods, he does not play at being "
"a shepherd. Even if he decided, out of curiosity, to speak to you, he'd send "
"his Herald, the Arcanotheign. If you do hear a voice, it might be anyone – "
"except our god!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사제, 당신은 큰 실수를 저질렀어요. 네서스는 절대 추종자들의 삶에 간섭하지 않아요. 다른 신들과 달리, 그는 안내자처럼 행동하지 "
"않는다구요. 만약 그가 호기심으로 당신에게 말하기로 결정했다고 해도 전령인 아르카노데인을 보냈을 꺼에요. 그 목소리가 들린다면 그건 우리 "
"신이 아닌 다른 것임에 틀림 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986852_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0b4aecbf-9ed4-4b1d-a2b1-796c341029a0"
msgid ""
"\"What is this nonsense I've just heard? The great Nethys, personally "
"praising his priest, like a master praises his dog? This cannot be!\""
msgstr "\"도대체 내가 무슨 소리를 들은 거지? 주인에게 칭찬받는 강아지처럼 네서스가 사제를 찬양한다고? 말도 안된다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986855_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4d92d0da-f476-4f18-b385-f42c8c004996"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke looks astonished.{/n} \"Reward his chosen? Oh honorable priest, "
"are you sure you are not confusing Nethys with some other god?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 충격을 받은 것 같습니다.{/n} \"선택된 자에게 보상? 오, 고귀한 사제님, 정말 네서스를 다른 신과 혼동하고 있는 "
"것은 아닌가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_986856_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5f0895ed-82b6-4628-8d7a-26c0a89503db"
msgid ""
"\"Open the gates for Nethys? Do you really think that he, the omnipotent god "
"of magic, would require the help of someone like you?\""
msgstr "\"네서스를 위해 문을 연다고? 정말로 그가 마법의 전지전능한 신인 그가 너 따위의 도움을 필요로 한다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98692_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "514f5e8d-a688-4bd9-9144-d9c75c530a93"
msgid "\"Blasphemer! Feel the wrath of {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"신성 모독이다! {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}의 진노를 느껴라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98693_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "e3c3f93b-8cd4-4bb1-b7de-6bf8f6f7ccfa"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel takes a deep breath.{/n} \"Praise {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}!\" {n}He "
"turns to the portal.{/n} \"It's time to end this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜은 심호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}를 찬양하라!\" {n}그는 포털을 엽니다.{/n} \"이제 "
"끝내야 할 때다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98699_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "861ade41-0a9f-4ad1-a05d-f80b8a70ab4d"
msgid "{n}Rismel turns to you.{/n} \"I was waiting for you.\""
msgstr "{n}리스멜은 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"너를 기다리고 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98701_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "7bcf74df-4e65-4c2a-b6fd-62fb0b59f4a7"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel casts a glance at the ancient tower.{/n} \"This is the place where "
"two worlds connect. The border is razor thin, so it gave birth to a portal. "
"Now it's sealed, but...\" {n}He rubs his forehead.{/n} \"When I was "
"performing a ritual here, I noticed it's easy to open it. Someone must have "
"used this portal before — and not too long ago.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜은 고대의 탑을 훑어봅니다.{/n} \"두 곳의 세계가 연결되는 곳이다. 경계가 얇아서 문을 열 수 있게 되었어. 이제는 "
"봉인되었지만...\" {n}그는 이마를 문지릅니다.{/n} \"내가 여기서 의식을 수행했을 때 포털을 여는 것이 쉽다는 것을 알았어. "
"누군가는 이 포털을 얼마 전까지 사용했을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98707_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "53b23548-22ba-4d11-9eda-1757f1b5a559"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel shakes his head.{/n} \"Alas, I am not able to do it. The only "
"thing I can do is become a guardian of this portal till the end of my days.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리즈멜은 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"아..나는 할 수 없어. 내가 할 수 있는 유일한 일은 내 인생이 끝날 때까지 이 포털의 "
"수호자가 되는 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98708_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "695276c0-109f-496b-961f-c32420863e7f"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel winces.{/n} \"Cursed? Definitely not. The tower is full of magic, "
"but cursed...\" {n}He looks aside.{/n} \"Unless you call a clouded mind a "
"curse of sorts.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜이 당혹해합니다.{/n} \"저주받았다고? 절대 아니다. 타워에는 마법이 가득하지만 저주는...\" {n}그는 옆을 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"흐려진 마음을 일종의 저주라고 하지 않는 한..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98709_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "c7be4b0a-a222-400c-8673-29ef9ce9406e"
msgid "\"Whatever you say.\""
msgstr "\"좋을대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98710_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "51daf0e1-694a-4c5e-9b91-1d4fdac04395"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel's face darkens, and he takes a step back.{/n} \"And why is that?\""
msgstr "{n}리스멜의 얼굴이 어두워지면서 한 발 뒤로 물러납니다.{/n} \"이유가 뭔가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98716_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "092fa395-7125-4add-9920-c3f6edcf8006"
msgid ""
"\"I must fulfill my vow! Don't expect I'll let you kill me without a fight!\""
msgstr "\"나는 맹세를 성실히 이행해야 해! 싸움없이 내가 죽을 거라고 생각하지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_98724_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "bb966d8b-4862-4a38-9641-e2c04481bb3a"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel's voice drops to a hiss.{/n} \"So watch your tongue. The moment "
"nears where I open the portal and let {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g} into this world. "
"Fear my lord's wrath, for there will be no escape for blasphemers!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리즈멜의 목소리가 줄어듭니다.{/n} \"그러니 말 조심하라. 내가 포털을 열어 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}가 이 세상으로 "
"나오는 순간이 멀지 않았다. 내 주인의 분노를 두려워하라. 신을 모독하는 자에게는 도망칠 곳이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CANDLEMERE_CONVERT_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "0d30a393-cecb-4c30-adae-68b9e2cbf924"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Nethys}Great Nethys{/g}, what a nightmare is this? This can't be... I "
"failed you! Misled by illusions... darkness took my mind and I... I...\" {n}"
"Rismel utters a heartbreaking cry and buried his face in his hands. When he "
"finally lifts his head, his eyes are full of tears.{/n} \"How can I atone "
"for this? All I've done...\"{n}His voice is a choked whisper.{/n} \"It's... "
"it's not possible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Nethys}위대하신 네서스{/g}시여. 이 악몽은 무엇입니까? 이럴 수 없어... 내가 실수했어! 환상에 시달려서... 어둠이 "
"내 마음을 사로잡았고 나는... 나는... \" {n}리즈멜은 울부 짖으며 얼굴을 파묻습니다. 마침내 머리를 들었을 때 그의 눈은 눈물로 "
"가득합니다.{/n} \"내가 무얼 한 거지? 내가 한 모든 일은...\" {n}그는 속삭입니다.{/n} \"이럴 리가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_ARG1_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "5e45b331-896a-4fb1-b263-10bb60833612"
msgid ""
"\"I…\"{n}Rismel's voice trembles. {/n}\"I… but it's just...\" {n}He averts "
"his eyes and falls silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는…\" {n}리즈멜의 목소리가 떨립니다.{/n} \"나는...하지만 그건...\" {n}그는 눈을 피하고 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_ARG2_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "789beac2-bb4f-4e58-a48e-7f943684deb8"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel meets your gaze silently. After a moment, he frowns, then "
"winces.{/n} \"Morry... we should have come back for you...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜은 당신을 조용히 봅니다. 잠시 후 그는 눈살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"모리... 너를 위해 돌아갔어야 했는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_ARG3_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "ef909815-df74-4c33-90bf-c04964fb6fe0"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel crosses his arms.{/n} \"What do you want to know.\" {n}His voice "
"is dull and listless.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}리스멜은 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"무엇이 알고 싶은건가?\" {n}그의 목소리는 둔하고 무기력합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_BossNotAgree_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "b9bbb447-7040-433d-a992-e692eb1e9b5e"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel folds his hands on his chest. {/n} \"Wha do you want to know?\" {n}"
"His voice is dull and listless.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}리즈멜은 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"무엇이 알고 싶은건가?\" {n}그의 목소리는 둔하고 무기력합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_BossOk_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "cffc6964-8cad-471c-9006-dd40c2aff8db"
msgid "\"Then I'll begin the ritual now!\""
msgstr "\"그러면 의식을 시작하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_BossWait_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "2cd2aa3c-aa39-42b6-8f57-fce760bf2dbe"
msgid "\"I'll wait for you. Don't waste your time!\""
msgstr "\"너를 기다릴거야. 시간을 낭비하지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_Con_start1_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "b0d30a86-8e04-4cf8-a0c8-59c6b5fd2d29"
msgid ""
"{n}As you look at him, Rismel's face changes. The obsessive gleam in his "
"eyes gives way to astonishment and terror. He throws a haunted look at his "
"surroundings then touches his face — and stares dully at the blood and dirt "
"on his fingers.{/n} \"What... what have I done?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그를 보자, 리스멜의 표정이 바뀝니다. 그의 눈빛은 놀라움과 공포가 섞여있습니다. 그는 멍하니 자신의 주변을 둘러다보고 자신의 "
"얼굴을 만지다 손가락의 피와 먼지를 봅니다.{/n} \"뭐... 내가 뭘 한 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_Con_start2_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "55f5da46-e433-4440-a4e9-079735bc5f31"
msgid ""
"{n}As you look at him, Rismel's face changes. The obsessive gleam in his "
"eyes gives way to astonishment and terror. He throws a haunted look at his "
"surroundings then touches his face — and stares dully at the blood and dirt "
"on his fingers.{/n} \"What... what have I done?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 그를 바라보는 동안 리즈멜의 표정이 바뀌어갑니다. 그의 강박적으로 번뜩이는 눈빛은 놀라움과 공포를 느끼게 합니다. 그는 "
"주위를 향해 겁에 질린 눈빛을 던지고는 얼굴을 만지며 손가락에 묻은 피와 흙을 무겁게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"내가..내가 무슨 짓을 한 "
"거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_Con_start3_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "9b11e070-5db3-449e-ac95-6cea5b6489d8"
msgid ""
"{n}As you look at him, Rismel's face changes. The obsessive gleam in his "
"eyes gives way to astonishment and terror. He throws a haunted look at his "
"surroundings then touches his face — and stares dully at the blood and dirt "
"on his fingers.{/n} \"What... what have I done?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그를 보면서 리스멜의 표정이 바뀝니다. 그의 눈빛은 놀라움과 공포가 섞여있습니다. 그는 멍하니 자신의 주변을 둘러다보고 자신의 "
"얼굴을 만지다 손가락의 피와 먼지를 봅니다.{/n} \"뭐... 내가 뭘 한 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_Introduce_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "69786a8b-f044-4caa-aaca-53bd261a9be3"
msgid ""
"\"The All-Seeing Eye has brought me here, to this sanctuary of magic! Others "
"came, but they did not survive the trials. I am the only one who hears the "
"word of {g|Nethys}Nethys{/g} and can open the gates for Him! Then the All-"
"Seeing Eye will reward his chosen — I will become a lord in His new era!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 것을 보는 눈은 나를 이곳 마법의 성소에 데려왔다. 다른 녀석들도 왔지만 시련에서 살아남지 못했다. 오직 나만이 "
"{g|Nethys}네서스{/g}의 말을 듣고 그를 위해 문을 열 수 있다! 모든 것을 보는 눈은 선택된 자에게 보상을 할 것이다. 나는 "
"그의 새로운 시대에 군주가 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_NethysAsk_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "ad28f19e-6f67-4d4e-9d31-c78c767c1ccb"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel's jaw clenches.{/n} \"One more word, insect...\" {n}He hisses.{/n} "
"\"...and you'll witness it yourself!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리즈멜의 턱에 힘줄이 솟습니다.{/n} \"한마디만 더..이 벌레같은 놈..\" {n}그는 나지막하게 말합니다.{/n} \"... "
"그럼 직접 목격하게 될테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_SLIV_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "271af401-0b7d-46d9-a2b0-1939ef04f012"
msgid "{n}Rismel answers with contemptuous grunt.{/n} \"Just as I thought.\""
msgstr "{n}리스멜은 경멸 섞인 말투로 대답합니다.{/n} \"내가 생각한대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/CandlemereTower/Priest/Cue_CNDLMR_WritingsAsk_Text
#. Speaker : CandlemereTowerPriest
msgctxt "e016a8b9-6d5f-4402-b604-6b06a71e0cee"
msgid ""
"{n}Rismel closes his eyes and takes a breath.{/n} \"Can you feel it? No — of "
"course you can't... the whole tower bears marks of the arcane! Look around "
"you! Can you see these writings? Since ancient times, believers knew a "
"portal lay here, so they left signs heralding the arrival of "
"{g|Nethys}Nethys{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리스멜은 눈을 감고 숨을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"느낄 수 있나? 당연히 할 수 없겠지... 탑 전체가 마법의 표식을 가지고 있다! "
"주위를 둘러 봐! 이 글을 읽을 수 있나? 고대인들은 포탈이 여기에 있다는 것을 알았고 {g|Nethys}네서스{/g}의 도래를 알리는 "
"표식을 남겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Hostage_Battle_1_String
msgctxt "12cb6c33-c8d9-4d80-bbbd-522542d633e6"
msgid "\"Don't you dare touch her!\""
msgstr "\"그녀를 만지지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Hostage_Battle_2_String
msgctxt "9f15e047-fda2-4167-ab26-45ee282594cb"
msgid "\"Don't fear, my Melianse! I'll protect you!\""
msgstr "\"두려워 하지마. 멜리안스! 너를 보호할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Hostage_Idle_1_String
msgctxt "20e10ee5-3893-4a04-b398-7342e6e158b7"
msgid "\"Melianse... What a beautiful name...\""
msgstr "\"멜리안스...이 얼마나 아름다운 이름인가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Hostage_Idle_2_String
msgctxt "178e0ab7-2140-4727-91d2-a52ef41eb298"
msgid "\"My beautiful fey... How did I live without you?\""
msgstr "\"나의 아름다운 페이... 내가 너없이 어떻게 살겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Loggers_Battle_1_String
msgctxt "4697e34e-0a1c-4604-93e6-967208109d4c"
msgid "\"Kill that toad!\""
msgstr "\"그 두꺼비를 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Loggers_Battle_2_String
msgctxt "6936ce60-79bd-4eed-97c0-44c32a096a59"
msgid "\"Hold on, we'll help you!\""
msgstr "\"기다려봐, 우리가 도와줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Loggers_Idle_1_String
msgctxt "926ba02a-4bd9-48e1-a952-91a5b196b05f"
msgid "\"She has driven our people mad!\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 우리 동료들을 화나게 했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Loggers_Idle_2_String
msgctxt "d6180f66-218a-4f3b-b813-7e83ba73f4bb"
msgid "\"These woods are swarming with faeries and other monsters...\""
msgstr "\"이 숲들은 요정과 다른 괴물들로 붐비는군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Zone_01_String
msgctxt "d56e0e15-d8b6-4adc-ba92-195707ba66fb"
msgid "Such big, strong trees are a rarity."
msgstr "이처럼 크고 강한 나무는 드뭅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Zone_02_String
msgctxt "aebc8d01-c24b-436f-9a21-730c9804f491"
msgid "Judging by the year rings, this tree is more than a century old."
msgstr "나이테로 판단할 때 이 나무는 1세기 이상 되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Barks/Zone_03_String
msgctxt "30527fc9-61bc-4e52-b747-656121076dea"
msgid ""
"Shadows lurk in the depth of the lake. Water splashes sound like whispers."
msgstr "그림자가 호수 깊숙한 곳에 숨어 있습니다. 물 튀는 소리가 속삭임처럼 들립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "8a380efc-0f07-4de1-966f-3395a3be5ab5"
msgid ""
"[Use dispel magic to free the hostages] \"I've lifted the enchantment! "
"You're free!\""
msgstr "[인질을 구하기 위해 마법 해제를 사용합니다] \"내가 마법을 해제했어! 너는 자유야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "611d53ab-1460-4d67-adfb-c207c1108186"
msgid "Massacred the loggers."
msgstr "나무꾼들을 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "7dd38780-24df-4e4f-9a9e-9e3268228aa6"
msgid ""
"[Attack the lumberjacks] \"I think it would be easier to just kill you.\""
msgstr "[나무꾼을 공격합니다] \"너를 죽이는 것이 더 쉬울 것이라고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "fc0e814b-08a4-4ca5-aecb-7dcba55564e1"
msgid "\"I believe I was promised compensation for my efforts.\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 노력에 대한 보상이 있다고 믿는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "734bf041-e6cf-4cd2-b6c8-6cd5d17c86b1"
msgid "Attacked the nixie not caring about the hostages."
msgstr "인질은 상관하지 않는 닉시를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "b647ea11-a2fb-4cd6-bf27-13243cc74a6e"
msgid "[Attack Melianse] \"Fine, let's settle this another way. To arms!\""
msgstr "[멜리안스를 공격합니다] \"좋아. 다른 방법으로 해결하자. 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "6ffc1dfa-96bd-4342-a94f-88f3d7ee4919"
msgid "[Leave] \"I should go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "d6736ea9-7f1d-405f-b770-d27b0a08effc"
msgid ""
"{n}The lumberjack curses under his breath.{/n} \"Gods, what a waste... Why'd "
"you bend over backwards for that toad? Should've hung her from a tree, let "
"her dry out some!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나무꾼은 헐떡거리며 저주합니다.{/n} \"젠장. 이게 뭐야... 왜 그 두꺼비 때문에 뒤에서 굽은거야? 그녀를 나무에 매달아야 "
"했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "8e454f9b-ab3b-4ca7-a48a-d441e923470d"
msgid ""
"\"So, you get those feathers yet? Best hurry — who knows what that damned "
"snake's got on her mind?\""
msgstr "\"아직 그 깃털을 가지고 있어? 좋아. 서둘러. 그 사악한 것이 그녀의 마음을 꾈지 누가 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "6e968a5d-9ed7-4a2f-9256-076f89d2b2fd"
msgid "\"Hang on! What about the hostages?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만! 인질은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "58cd1e0d-42ed-4f2b-a7cf-d387a27368a9"
msgid ""
"\"That's more like it! Come on, people! Let's smash that toad's face in!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 서둘러! 저 두꺼비의 얼굴을 부숴버리자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "109088ac-6ee6-42da-b69f-f0fa0a9d20ce"
msgid ""
"\"Here, for you. Forgive me, but I can't give any more — we need something "
"to give to the families of the deceased.\""
msgstr "\"여기, 받으세요. 용서해주십시오. 하지만 더 이상 드릴 게 없습니다. 유가족들의 몫을 남겨놔야 하거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "eebf0594-c07d-40e1-a896-940593e4bd12"
msgid "\"I never go back on my word! Take this. Thank you for helping us!\""
msgstr "\"저는 한 번 뱉은 말은 지키는 사람입니다! 받으세요. 도와줘서 감사합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_Cue_MelianseDeadLoggersNot_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "3929b297-9d82-49d3-aefb-a6aa47a1977c"
msgid "\"Hang on! What about the hostages?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만! 인질은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_MelianseDeadLoggersToo_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "74ab51f2-b8ec-4965-812d-b7b5b18c7218"
msgid ""
"{n}The lumberjack hangs his head.{/n} \"You didn't save them. What do I tell "
"the widows? How can I look the orphans in the eyes?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나무꾼이 그의 머리를 듭니다.{/n} \"너는 그들을 구하지 않았다. 내가 과부들에게 뭐라고 말해야 하지? 어떻게 내가 고아들을 볼 "
"수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Corax/Cue_NoBloodSpilled_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "c13a435a-b650-4309-b853-453281964031"
msgid ""
"\"Well, thank you kindly! I was already thinking there was going to be blood."
"\""
msgstr "\"저기, 정말 감사합니다! 사실 피를 흘리는 일을 각오하고 있었거든요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5e05ccc5-79e4-4793-be30-7c8eed21d898"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 무슨 일이 일어난 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "103b2037-d430-473d-8c34-95299910c71a"
msgid "Massacred the loggers."
msgstr "나무꾼들을 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2c5270cb-489a-4eb0-a7fb-89806dd42ab9"
msgid ""
"[Attack the lumberjacks] \"I'll show you what comes of disrespecting the fey!"
"\""
msgstr "[나무꾼을 공격합니다] \"페이를 무시하면 어떻게 되는지 보여주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8222e165-af04-44e8-9d38-2c79dd70fbcd"
msgid "Attacked the nixie, not caring about the hostages."
msgstr "인질들에 대해 신경 쓰지 않고 닉시를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "c8e54e67-8b30-4666-b817-571cde193e4c"
msgid "[Attack Melianse] \"I'm not here to negotiate. Attack her!\""
msgstr "[멜리안스를 공격합니다] \"나는 협상하기 위해 여기 오지 않았다. 그녀를 공격하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "d5829a71-dda3-43e9-bfb1-64c344522216"
msgid ""
"[Use dispel magic to free the hostages] \"I've lifted the enchantment! "
"You're free!\""
msgstr "[인질을 구하기 위해 마법 해제를 사용합니다] \"내가 마법을 해제했어! 너는 자유야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "e50b0591-4450-4b46-92fb-3cf5d40bfeb7"
msgid "\"The forest is big. I'm sure you can find other trees to fell.\""
msgstr "\"숲이 크다. 너는 다른 나무를 벨 수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "2ffb5cb7-ec34-4f7e-a571-ae18123315ee"
msgid ""
"\"Quarreling with fey is more trouble than it's worth. You've no idea how "
"powerful — and thin-skinned — they can be.\""
msgstr "\"페이와 싸우는 것은 성가시다. 그들이 말랐어도 얼마나 강력한지 너는 물라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "00119a5c-e85d-4613-83c9-8740d2143140"
msgid ""
"\"Think of your situation, Melianse. These people are willing to leave in "
"peace — asking for much more could prove dangerous.\""
msgstr "\"너의 상황을 생각해 봐. 멜리안스. 이 자들은 평화롭게 떠나기를 원한다. 더 많은 것을 요구하면 위험할 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "85947062-1461-4e7e-b02e-efb5cdf18dd3"
msgid "\"How are we supposed to restore a tree that's already been cut down?\""
msgstr "\"이미 자른 나무를 어떻게 되살리겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "07b3cd7b-de8d-4b54-9996-05bdcb877367"
msgid ""
"\"You hear that, Corax? Just buy some feather tokens from a magic shop and "
"she'll let your people go.\""
msgstr "\"들었어, 코락스? 마법 물품 가게에서 깃털 토큰을 사오면 그녀가 쟤들을 풀어줄 거래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "ddadbe81-f621-410c-af88-0bea3f7f4fac"
msgid ""
"\"Melianse, they'll leave this place and never return. Please, release the "
"hostages now.\""
msgstr "\"멜리안스. 그들은 이곳을 떠나 다시는 돌아오지 않을 거야. 제발 인질을 풀어줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0047_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "913681d0-eb47-4230-b948-2ca1af05bac8"
msgid "Protected the nixie from the loggers."
msgstr "나무꾼들에게서 닉시를 보호했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "b3863af4-6b7d-4360-b629-6314a919f2ec"
msgid ""
"\"I'm the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} of these lands, rightful ruler of "
"the realm, and I haven't granted anyone logging rights to this forest. You "
"should leave now, or you may regret it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 땅의 남작이다. 나는 이 숲을 벌목할 권리를 누구에게도 주지 않았다. 떠나지 않으면 후회할 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0051_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "43e5da4c-6b03-4cfd-9d5a-012dd26f8b99"
msgid "Asked Melianse to spare the lives of the lumberjacks."
msgstr "멜리안스에게 나무꾼의 목숨을 살려주자고 요청했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "c3fcde19-9b2a-4ae4-8f8c-df57fbff5bf3"
msgid "\"Let them go, Melianse. These people have families.\""
msgstr "\"그들을 풀어줘. 멜리안스. 이 사람들은 가족이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0054_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "33822e45-41b5-4126-bdd5-016adb41a232"
msgid "Killed both the nixie and the loggers."
msgstr "닉시와 나무꾼을 모두 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "42433101-9def-44b0-be3d-57d7c6528d15"
msgid "[Attack everyone] \"I've no interest in any of this. Arm yourselves!\""
msgstr "[모두 공격합니다] \"나는 관심이 없다. 몸 조심해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "c28eaf74-5737-4d44-aae0-eb0309464d17"
msgid "[Try to reason with loggers] \"Listen to me, people...\""
msgstr "[나무꾼을 설득합니다] \"이봐, 친구들. 들어봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "38e9dc91-c0f0-4522-8ded-8b2f4287ac46"
msgid "[Try another approach] \"All right, here's what I'll tell you...\""
msgstr "[다른 방법을 사용합니다] \"좋아. 내 얘기를 잘 들어봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "f8146ea6-6c02-46f8-8443-2ed8a72041ae"
msgid "[Solve the problem with force] \"You know what? To hells with it...\""
msgstr "[힘으로 문제를 해결합니다] \"그거 알아? 사실은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "a091aba6-0468-47b9-b868-0bf9476a3a46"
msgid ""
"[Look for a different solution] \"Wait, wait, I'm sure we can find a way to "
"settle this...\""
msgstr "[다른 해결책을 찾아봅니다] \"잠깐. 해결할 방법을 찾아볼 수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_PlayerAgreedToBringTokens_Text_3
msgctxt "e11232b2-6bdb-4b5e-b8eb-e7a94e318301"
msgid "\"Wait here. I'll bring the feathers.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 깃털을 가져올게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_TrueNeutral_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0a191196-31f3-4fc9-b9ab-d3c1155d4d5e"
msgid "Refused to interfere in the quarrel between the logger and a nixie."
msgstr "나무꾼과 닉시 사이의 싸움에 간섭하지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Answer_TrueNeutral_Text_3
msgctxt "9a3c06bc-8408-4f7f-877e-465bf6853e82"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"I've no interest in your quarrel. Go ahead and fight if you want, "
"but keep it between yourselves.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"너희 싸움에 관심이 없다. 가던가 원한다면 싸워라. 하지만 조심해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "b84125a7-59f2-4ab2-a16b-9b04739c3648"
msgid ""
"{n}A group of hardy people with axes, most likely lumberjacks, are menacing "
"a fragile nixie. Two lumberjacks stand before her, relaxed and disconnected. "
"The lead lumberjack shakes his fist at the nixie and yells,{/n} \"Let them "
"go, you swamp freak! If you don't, I'll burn this rotten grove to the "
"ground, on my word!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나무꾼처럼 보이는 도끼 든 덩치 큰 남자들의 무리가 연약한 닉시를 위협하고 있습니다. 두 명의 나무꾼이 연약한 그녀 앞에 "
"서있습니다. 우두머리 나무꾼이 주먹을 휘두르며 소리를 지릅니다.{/n} \"그들을 보내줘. 망할 녀석아! 그렇지 않으면 이 썩은 나무를 "
"태워버리겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "8120196b-1ddd-4c64-a028-fc0d81e93d93"
msgid ""
"\"You're the freaks! And my name is Melianse, thank you very much! If you "
"keep being rude like this, I'll just drown these jumbos in the lake, "
"understand?\""
msgstr "\"이 괴물아! 그리고 내 이름은 멜리안스야. 배은망덕한 녀석아! 계속 무례하게 군다면 이 덩치들을 호수로 빠트려버리겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "e83a8e0a-8231-468b-9869-cf4a625671ed"
msgid ""
"{n}Noticing you, the lead lumberjack grins and waves.{/n} \"You, there! You "
"seem a capable sort! Interested in some coin? Name's Corax, and we're "
"loggers here in this forest. We could use your help in freeing our people "
"from this gorgon's claws!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 보자 우두머리 나무꾼이 웃으며 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"너. 거기! 싸움 좀 하는 거 같은데? 돈 좀 벌고 싶지 않아? 내 "
"이름은 코락스고 우리는 이 숲의 나무꾼이다. 이 고르곤의 손아귀에서 우리 동료들을 구하기 위해 네 도움이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "70473841-7301-4d23-b1a8-c3b8c1424c24"
msgid ""
"\"We were minding our own business, cutting trees and splitting logs, when "
"this hag shows up out of nowhere, screeches at us, then jinxes two of ours "
"and threatens to drown them. With these fey breeding like rabbits "
"everywhere, what's an honest, hard-working man to do?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 나무를 베고 있었는데 이 녀석이 갑자기 나타나서 두 녀석을 끌어내 위협을 했어. 페이들이 토끼처럼 돌아다닌다면 우리 같은 "
"정직한 나무꾼은 무얼 하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "3b673af6-649d-491f-a92a-296b17e18787"
msgid ""
"\"Stupid jumbo! You're the ones who breed like rabbits, spreading into more "
"and more space — we've lived here since forever! I've grown these trees for "
"more than a hundred years, know them down to the tiniest leaf, and then you "
"show up with your stupid axes to ruin everything!\""
msgstr ""
"\"멍청한 녀석! 돌아다니는 녀석은 너야. 우리는 여기서 계속 살아왔어! 나는 백년도 넘게 이 나무에서 살았고 나뭇잎 하나까지도 다 알고 "
"있는데 너 희 같은 멍청한 나무꾼이 나타나서 모든 것을 망치고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "8196ca88-3939-4a17-b8e8-5803c6955ce2"
msgid ""
"\"You asked for it! Hey, you two! These jumbos want to hurt me! You wouldn't "
"let something like that happen, would you?\""
msgstr "\"네가 요청했어! 이봐. 너희 둘! 이 멍청이들이 나를 해치고 싶어해. 그런 일이 생기지 않게 해줄 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "df331967-383b-49c6-b5d7-7d98e7d57139"
msgid ""
"{n}You tell the lumberjacks about a nearby grove where fine trees grow and "
"no fey have taken up residence.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 이 주변의 자라는 나무들은 fey가 살지 않는다고 나무꾼에게 말해주었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "dfb079ab-3328-465b-836c-7a2b8103ce57"
msgid ""
"\"Sure, there might be other spots with trees as fine as these, but how "
"would we find them? And what if there's another fey there, too?\""
msgstr "\"이 나무들 만큼 좋은 나무들도 많아. 하지만 어떻게 찾아야 하지? 혹시 페이가 살면 어떻게 해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "0d65256c-f8d5-4128-84b3-969faed5f7d4"
msgid "{n}The lumberjack looks at the nixie with suspicion.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}나무꾼은 닉시를 의심스럽게 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "5c1be8b3-9029-46c0-b4ac-c8f0ee59ebbb"
msgid ""
"\"So what, then? Do we just hang ourselves and be done with it? There's all "
"manner of beasts in the forests — we can't roll over for all of them! "
"Instead of giving up, we should just keep on fighting till we wipe out every "
"last one!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러면 이제 어떻게 하지? 그만두고 일을 끝내야 하나? 숲에는 엄청나게 많은 짐승들이 있어. 그 짐승들을 상대할 수는 없어! 포기하는 "
"대신 우리는 모두 쓸어버릴 때까지 싸울 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "23f70948-888b-4f8c-93f1-760f1d203ac3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, sure! And who's going to bring back my trees, then? They come in here, "
"smash everything in sight, and then just leave? No deal! Fix what you broke, "
"then maybe I'll let them go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 그래! 그러면 누가 내 나무를 다시 가져올 거야? 그들은 여기에 와서 눈에 보이는 모든 것을 박살 내고 떠났어. 거래 따윈 상관 "
"없어. 나무를 되돌려 놓지 않으면 너희를 보내지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "dacb3351-d783-472d-becc-ff2bf8e269c9"
msgid ""
"\"If you push me, I'll just retreat into the lake with these two! I can "
"breathe underwater — you think they can, too? We could find out!\""
msgstr "\"네가 나를 강요하면 이 둘과 함께 호수로 들어갈 거야! 나는 물에서도 숨 쉴 수 있지. 그들도 그럴까? 한번 알아보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "774a717e-fc81-46e7-a9fd-d3f747b3bd27"
msgid ""
"\"You humans are always like this! Destroy, destroy, destroy, and then when "
"it's time to clean up your mess, poof! Gone. Fine, then, since you're "
"clearly clueless, I'll tell you what to do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 인간들은 항상 이래! 파괴하고, 파괴하고, 파괴하고, 너희들이 어지럽힌 것을 치울 때까지 파괴하지! 흥! 사라져. 좋아. 뭘 "
"해야 할지 모르나본데 내가 알려주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "4eb46f75-9e5b-4454-a55d-d911def373f8"
msgid ""
"\"You think we just have piles of gold lying around to go throwing away at a "
"magic shop? We can barely feed our families!\""
msgstr "\"마법의 가게에 뿌려댈 금이 있다고 생각해? 우리는 겨우 가족들을 먹여살린다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "3095b3c1-10a4-477f-8fa0-79b818337edc"
msgid ""
"{n}The lumberjack gives you a long, hard look.{/n} \"If you say so... Your "
"Grace. The sovereign's word is law.\""
msgstr "{n}나무꾼은 당신을 무표정하게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"네가 그렇게 말한다면... 통치자의 말이 법이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "4cf428c6-7f52-41c5-b6f8-add2b891864a"
msgid "\"What sort of ruler protects monsters over their own subjects?\""
msgstr "\"대체 어떤 통치자가 자신의 백성으로부터 괴물을 보호하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "64816331-064b-4917-a6f9-552cbed4c446"
msgid ""
"\"You wish! Soon as I let them go, the whole lot of them will attack! If "
"these goons want to go home to their stupid families, they're going to have "
"to promise to steer clear of my grove first!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 그들을 보내주면 모두 나를 공격할걸! 이 바보들이 가족들에게 돌아가려면 내 나무를 자르지 않겠다고 먼저 약속해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "f48dbad5-2954-4fc2-bc1d-d2d06efacdb6"
msgid ""
"\"All right, all right. It's not like we were dead set on this grove in the "
"first place. If she gives us back our people, we'll leave the place in "
"peace. On my word!\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 좋아. 우선 이 나무를 자르지 않아서 다행이군. 그녀가 내 친구들을 돌려준다면 우리도 조용히 떠나겠어. 약속하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "9337ef52-8f83-4059-accc-8d8029707bfd"
msgid ""
"\"There are these magic thingies that look like little feathers. The feather "
"tokens. Throw one on the ground, anywhere, and a tree springs up. Your "
"people's mages who tread the swamps more often that the others — they can "
"make them. Buying a couple won't break your bank. My cousin Tiressia can "
"also make them — she lives in the {g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}. Either "
"way, you bring a handful of them back here, I'll let your goons go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"깃털처럼 보이는 마법 물품이 있어. 깃털 토큰이지. 땅에 던지면 어디서든지 나무가 불쑥 자라나. 너희 마법사들이 만들 수 있어. "
"두어개 쯤 산다고 주머니가 거덜나지는 않아. 내 사촌 티레시아도 만들 수 있어. 그녀는 {g|Narlmarches} "
"Narlmarches{/g}에 살지. 네가 그것을 가져오면 네 친구들을 풀어주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "bbabefca-61b0-406b-9000-f801e7b47c72"
msgid ""
"\"They'll be waiting right here. It's not like they have anything else to "
"do, right?\" {n}The nixie chuckles as she tussles one of the lumberjacks' "
"hair. He smiles up at her faithfully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 여기서 기다리고 있을 거야. 그들이 할 일은 별로 없어. 그렇지?\" {n}닉시는 나무꾼의 머리를 쓰다듬으며 깔깔 웃습니다. "
"그는 그녀에게 충실히 미소짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "7614ec14-5f1d-4838-842c-e50556a17c3c"
msgid ""
"{n}Melianse makes a scary face as she stretches her webbed hands out toward "
"Corax, wiggling her fingers.{/n} \"OoooOOOooo!\""
msgstr "{n}멜리안스는 물갈퀴가 달린 자신의 손을 코락스에게 뻗으며 위협적인 얼굴을 합니다.{/n} \"으어어어어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0063_Text_String
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "bb01ef23-17ff-4750-8462-df63a7242be0"
msgid ""
"\"Whaaat?!\" {n}The nixie stomps her dainty foot.{/n} \"So that's the way "
"you want it? Fine, I'll show you!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?\" {n}닉시는 작은 발을 쿵쿵거립니다.{/n} \"그게 니가 원하는 방식이야? 좋아. 너에게 보여주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "6f552d23-fec5-4b3c-aaa0-955d1720ecee"
msgid "{n}The loggers exchange glances, holding their hand on their axes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}나무꾼은 서로 눈길을 교환하고 도끼를 듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "f6e763a9-87b5-4f3e-ab98-71538afea9c0"
msgid "{n}Nixie gives the loggers a gloomy glance.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}닉시는 나무꾼을 우울하게 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "f8565588-fe10-44f6-9a51-f1ef319b5bfa"
msgid "{n}The situation is heating up. A battle is about to erupt.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}상황이 급박해지고 있습니다. 전투가 시작됩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "ccd68ab3-77fd-462e-92fd-261b7d6ea732"
msgid "{n}The charmed loggers look at the nixie with adoration.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}매혹된 나무꾼들은 닉시를 경외에 찬 눈빛으로 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "82246328-abcb-493a-b238-407b46d16ab2"
msgid ""
"\"You do not understand what calamities you are calling upon yourself. The "
"forest is deep, and wild, and full of terrible secrets. When the full power "
"of the fey wizardry falls upon you, you will remember this day, and ask "
"yourself if some logs were worth suffering the neverending misery, and you "
"will answer: no, of course, not, but it will be too late!\""
msgstr ""
"\"불행을 자초하시는 거예요. 헤아릴 수 없이 깊은 숲인 데다가, 자연 그대로의 모습을 간직하고 있어요. 그 속엔 끔찍한 비밀이 도사리고 "
"있다고요. 페이한테 마법으로 한 번 두들겨 맞고 나시면, '아 내가 잘못 생각했구나. 장작 좀 얻자고 이런 끔찍한 곳에 발 들이는 게 "
"아니었는데.'하고 생각하실 거예요. 하지만 그땐 이미 늦었죠. 달리 손쓸 방법도 없을걸요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "63655fe4-11c8-47d9-b677-134a8eb42b64"
msgid ""
"\"We should help her! No, them! Uh, I don't know. Why can't people and fey "
"live in peace?\""
msgstr "\"우린 그녀를 도와줘야 해! 아니 그들을! 아. 모르겠어. 왜 사람들과 페이는 평화롭게 살 수 없지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7dfaf333-ba55-464a-90af-99d3e47a481a"
msgid ""
"\"The nixie has better chances at winning.\" {n}Jaethal taps her chin, "
"amused.{/n} \"Let's find out if I'm right.\""
msgstr "\"닉시가 우승할 확률이 더 크다.\" {n}제이탈은 그녀의 턱을 만지며 웃습니다.{/n} \"내가 옳은지 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0082_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d6f03ea4-27a4-4049-a8b8-e52c649a09ae"
msgid "\"There, serves them right! Why talk to jerks?\""
msgstr "\"제대로 대해주라고! 왜 바보와 얘기하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0090_Text_String
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "84dad32a-cdb0-4b5e-93a7-2b09b13833f7"
msgid ""
"\"Are you mad?! Attacking your own people to help some freak? You're scum!\""
msgstr "\"미쳤어?! 괴물을 돕기 위해 백성을 공격한다고? 이 쓰레기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a5a015a5-bab4-4e05-ad8e-2983c5a1b821"
msgid "\"Let's just slaughter them all and be done with it!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 다 죽여서 끝내자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_LoggersAgreedToBuyTokens_Text_3
#. Speaker : Corax
msgctxt "eb09509a-9f7d-4cb2-83d0-2b3107a9b022"
msgid ""
"{n}The lead lumberjack curses under his breath, then sighs heavily.{/n} "
"\"Have it your way! I'll send some of the boys to fetch those feathers of "
"yours. I refuse to go back to talk to widows and orphans about how their dad "
"or mom was drowned in the swamp by some blue-skinned tree hugger!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우두머리 나무꾼이 저주를 중얼거리며 깊은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"알았다고! 아이들을 보내 깃털을 구해오라고 하겠어. 나는 동료의 "
"자식들과 아내에게 동료가 시퍼런 괴물에게 익사해 죽었다고 말하기 싫으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_DelicateSituation/Cue_Melianse_ScaredAway_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "eb3d780d-0463-41c8-9652-8dda7a5de06d"
msgid ""
"{n}The nixie pouts her lips.{/n} \"You mean... stinky... stupid... jumbos! "
"Bug off!\" {n}Sobbing, the fey dives into the lake.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}닉시는 입술을 삐죽 내밉니다.{/n} \"이 비열하고... 더러운... 멍청이... 꺼져!\" {n}훌쩍이며 fey는 호수로 "
"뛰어들어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0600d3ee-1b17-40b6-af96-cd0f6428826f"
msgid "Delivered feather tokens to Melianse."
msgstr "멜리안스에게 깃털 토큰을 전달했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "941ab4e2-a964-47b1-ba13-56bacb9b00d0"
msgid ""
"[Give Melianse the feather tokens] \"There. Will you free the hostages now?\""
msgstr "[멜리안스에게 깃털 토큰을 건냅니다] \"여기. 인질을 풀어주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "feae24fd-db4d-457e-a6c5-7dd4435b46ac"
msgid "Tried to hug Melianse."
msgstr "멜리안스를 안습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "27dc51c3-7585-4cf3-a1bd-008ccff74a57"
msgid "[Hug Melianse] \"Of course we can be friends!\""
msgstr "[멜리안스를 안습니다] \"물론 우리는 친구가 될 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "17d10e95-1f11-4e0f-a87f-7e13c64fbe69"
msgid "Attacked the nixie not caring about the hostages."
msgstr "인질들에 대해 신경 쓰지 않고 닉시를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "6a887587-0d14-4dc2-b8ea-d2d8a0169caf"
msgid "[Attack Melianse] \"Dealing with you was a mistake. Die!\""
msgstr "[멜리안스를 공격합니다] \"너와 협상하는 것은 실수였어. 죽어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "deab25a5-c898-484c-82f2-69be41524599"
msgid "Massacred the loggers."
msgstr "나무꾼들을 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "639ceb9c-b63a-4c8a-9fe6-e89866d30ec4"
msgid ""
"[Attack the lumberjacks] \"I'll get rid of them for you, once and for all.\""
msgstr "[나무꾼을 공격합니다] \"너를 위해 그들을 영원히 없애주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "03d52b8d-5e40-49f9-82aa-c364a7f9667b"
msgid "[Leave] \"I have to go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "b428dfd0-b480-49f7-bf91-4e0b21548686"
msgid "\"Where can I find the feather tokens, again?\""
msgstr "\"깃털 토큰을 다시 어디서 찾을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "30573ba9-6944-47b0-91da-bd6cc4fbbff1"
msgid ""
"[Use dispel magic to free the hostages] \"I've lifted the enchantment! "
"You're free!\""
msgstr "[인질을 구하기 위해 마법 해제를 사용합니다] \"내가 마법을 해제했어! 너는 자유야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "afa36402-346e-41a8-8ab4-87d4a4df8b54"
msgid "\"Well? You have my feather tokens yet?\""
msgstr "\"내 깃털 토큰은 아직이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "3756ce13-8ed5-4032-bbd8-060a9e1ec163"
msgid ""
"\"I used to think all you people were dumb and nasty, but you don't seem so "
"bad. Let's be friends!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너희 모두가 바보 같고 불쾌하다고 생각했지만 그렇게 나쁘지는 않았어. 친구가 되자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Melianse
msgctxt "d284d0f1-b075-4428-b0f8-c59997e266af"
msgid ""
"{n}Sobbing, the nixie looks at the bloody bodies splayed at her feet.{/n} \"I"
" just... I just wanted to scare them! So they'd leave me and my trees alone! "
"And you... you... I hate you, you dumb jumbos! All of you! All you know how "
"to do is fight!\" {n}Melianse dives into the lake, still crying.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}훌쩍이며 닉시는 피 묻은 시체를 보았습니다.{/n} \"나는 단지... 그들을 겁주려던 거였어! 그래서 나와 나무를 내버려두게 하려 "
"했는데... 네가... 네가 싫어. 이 멍청이들! 너희 모두 싸우게 될걸 알고 있었으면서!\" {n}멜리안스는 울면서 호수로 "
"뛰어들어갔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "bdc100e3-53b1-4917-94ce-2bc9757f42aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Chuckling, the fey pushes you away.{/n} \"Eeewwww, what are you doing? "
"Stop that, come on! Here, just take this, and hold off on that cuddly stuff, "
"all right?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}깔깔거리며 페이가 당신을 떨쳐냅니다.{/n} \"으엑, 뭐하는 거야? 그만해! 여기 이걸 받아. 껴안는 건 나중에 하자. 알겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "4eae78fc-ab35-4745-a2d8-af0c518389a3"
msgid ""
"{n}Melianse giggles.{/n} \"You people are so silly. Can't keep a thing in "
"your heads! Go find my cousin, a dryad named Tiressia who lives in the "
"{g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}. She can make some of those feather tokens. "
"Or just run off to one of the mages living in the swamps. They usually "
"collect those. Maybe they'll be in charitable mood to share!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}멜리안스가 깔깔거립니다.{/n} \"너희 인간은 바보 같아. 기억력이 나빠! {g|Narlmarches} Narlmarches{/g}"
"로 가서 내 사촌 티레시아라는 드라이어드를 찾아. 그녀는 깃털 토큰을 만들 수 있어. 아니면 늪에 사는 마법사를 잡아. 그들은 보통 "
"그것들을 수집해. 어쩌면 그들은 기분이 좋아서 나눠줄 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "654ee23b-b975-44a2-a64d-3f675a7ddbde"
msgid ""
"\"Make sure you don't get lost! You people never seem to watch where you put "
"your feet.\""
msgstr "\"길을 잘못 들지마! 너희 인간은 어디에 발을 들이미는지 모른단 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "c4859054-04dd-4b4f-b61f-bcc177506cc1"
msgid ""
"\"Whaaat?!\" {n}The nixie stomps her dainty foot.{/n} \"So that's the way "
"you want it? Fine, I'll show you!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?\" {n}닉시는 작은 발을 쿵쿵거립니다.{/n} \"그게 니가 원하는 방식이야? 좋아. 너에게 보여주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "8146dc4d-98a9-42cd-b9af-e88910f41716"
msgid ""
"\"All right, you big dunces, you may go... But bring me the feathers, no "
"cheating!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 멍청이들. 가도 좋아... 하지만 내게 그 깃털을 가져다줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Dialogue_Melianse/Cue_Melianse_pleased_Text
msgctxt "66261a55-616e-4af1-a2c3-59ea01e6ba21"
msgid ""
"\"Awww, that's more like it! Go on, hostages — I won't hold you back anymore!"
"\""
msgstr "\"그러면 더 좋지! 깔깔깔.가도 좋아, 인질들아. 나는 너희를 잡아두지 않겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/DelicateSituation/Items/FeatherTokens_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "5f4307e2-0834-495d-889e-46d1a15d527f"
msgid ""
"These feathers were enchanted by a crafty wizard. Each of them can turn into "
"a large oak."
msgstr "이 깃털들은 솜씨 좋은 마법사에 의해 마법이 걸렸습니다. 그들 각각은 커다란 오크나무로 변할 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_03602_Text
msgctxt "5a9f4fa8-1785-42f9-9967-ba9151cfbcf8"
msgid "\"Are you scared?\""
msgstr "\"너 두려워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_05343_Text
msgctxt "ec45d699-c59b-4e9c-9698-b3a8b97b9928"
msgid "\"They hoped you'd cry and run away. Yes, I remember.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 네가 울고 도망가기를 바라지. 나는 기억한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_10917_Text
msgctxt "13f01e32-5e39-49d6-ae2b-b2f84285fad0"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like this whole 'tribe' idea. I only helped you, you owe me "
"nothing.\""
msgstr "\"부족이고 뭐고 마음에 들지 않아. 그저 너를 도울 뿐이야. 너는 나에게 아무것도 빚지지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_28715_Text
msgctxt "aa20fc45-885f-4756-ae65-50939539fa7b"
msgid "\"Congratulations! So, what now? Ready to move on?\""
msgstr "\"축하해! 이제 어떡해? 계속 나아갈 준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_29138_Text
msgctxt "18f7a184-90b2-4aff-8277-95f5e50f493e"
msgid "\"Are you hurt?\""
msgstr "\"다쳤나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_29629_Text
msgctxt "f48d5360-367a-41e5-aa73-4f31e9ba2f87"
msgid "[Wait for her to continue]"
msgstr "[그녀가 계속하기를 기다립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_34845_Text
msgctxt "15197885-4191-4030-9e96-2a7b809e9aae"
msgid "[Wait for her to continue]"
msgstr "[그녀가 계속하기를 기다립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_35240_Text
msgctxt "e16ebd6f-dd91-4e14-b4c6-82eb36c62be7"
msgid "\"Are you hurt?\""
msgstr "\"다쳤나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_42098_Text
msgctxt "cc021dea-c196-464c-b870-ff8ec8731555"
msgid "\"And?\""
msgstr "\"그리고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_56748_Text
msgctxt "30626828-4393-4b0b-850a-0207fdfb6ad7"
msgid "\"Maybe we should help you after all?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 너를 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_59017_Text
msgctxt "ad7087ff-bd6c-4366-a2c2-2dd7888fc33e"
msgid ""
"\"Still, why do you want to kill this monster? Didn't you pass this test "
"back when you were with your tribe?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 괴물을 죽이려고 하지? 너 부족과 함께 있었을 때 이 시험을 통과했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_61724_Text
msgctxt "dfa4da7e-3a30-4c2e-8564-aaf8e08350d2"
msgid "\"Everything as usual? You'll go alone?\""
msgstr "\"평소대로? 너 혼자 갈 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_74590_Text
msgctxt "1ba7e3f5-4876-4543-b3c6-da74be1c66a6"
msgid "\"Are you... embarrassed? I didn't think you were capable of it.\""
msgstr "\"너... 당황했어? 네가 그럴거라 생각하지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_80054_Text
msgctxt "355dc3d0-5ebe-49ba-9448-78e3b77e33d0"
msgid "\"Congratulations! So, what now? Ready to move on?\""
msgstr "\"축하해! 이제 어떡해? 계속 나아갈 준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_87772_Text
msgctxt "1847df45-b3d8-4d4d-9ed4-9c845c3c24bc"
msgid ""
"\"I heard this custom of the northern tribes isn't just for children. If a "
"man joins the tribe, he has to pass this test as well, right?\""
msgstr "\"북부 부족의 관습이 아이들을 위한 것은 아니라고 들었다. 부족이 되려면 시험을 통과해야해. 맞지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_93331_Text
msgctxt "bc52ef6f-3291-467e-9307-373556837d9c"
msgid "\"Tell me more.\""
msgstr "\"더 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_94726_Text
msgctxt "91695865-d94c-4070-ad26-ad76fd82ffda"
msgid ""
"\"I'm honored you consider me a part of your new tribe. You're a strong and "
"valiant warrior.\""
msgstr "\"나를 너의 새로운 부족원이라고 생각하면 영광이군. 너는 강하고 용감한 전사다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_96641_Text
msgctxt "5a006c8c-ca43-43d8-9c90-90e58530fd7e"
msgid ""
"\"You don't have to prove anything to me. I already know you're brave — and "
"a skilled warrior.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 어떤 것도 증명할 필요가 없다. 나는 네가 용감하다는 것을 이미 알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Answer_96642_Text
msgctxt "993156dc-9668-418e-9f03-95b5a8eb6f14"
msgid "\"You've made Gorum proud this day!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 너는 고룸을 자랑스럽게 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Barks/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "28879815-fda6-4bd6-a4c2-af977e1fa6d4"
msgid "\"I want go alone, got it?\""
msgstr "\"나 혼자 가겠어. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Barks/HodagScriptZone_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "17dcae2e-4792-4996-8f68-ade099cfee98"
msgid "\"Why you try to help? You think I can't alone?\""
msgstr "\"왜 도우려고? 내가 혼자 할 수 없다고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Barks/VS_AmiriHodagFight_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "bd9435c2-65cb-47e5-921d-40c4a741bb74"
msgid "\"I wounded it! Come finish it off!\""
msgstr "\"상처를 입혔다! 끝내자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_05005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "de17a6d9-febf-4a62-9974-b07c7021b11d"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia laughs.{/n} \"Funny. Our boys become men in a very different way."
"\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아가 웃습니다.{/n} \"재밌네. 우리 동네 남자애들은 아주 다른 방식으로 남자가 되는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_11362 1_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "38af7baa-d7c1-4102-99f2-d1286c6856f9"
msgid "\"Enough! There's a monster, and I'm gonna kill it. Myself. Watch me!\""
msgstr "\"충분해! 괴물이있으니 내가 죽일거야. 내가 직접. 나를 봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_11362 2_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "70f78de7-8445-4840-82e9-c1ea32c79227"
msgid ""
"{n}Breathing heavily, Amiri stands over the corpse of the fallen monster.{/n}"
" \"Whatcha say? See me in action? I almost chopped his head off!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}숨을 깊게 들이마신 아미리는 괴물의 시체 위에 서 있습니다.{/n} \"뭐라고? 내가 하는 거 봤어? 대가리를 거의 쪼개버렸는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_11362 3_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9113df0a-f495-42a2-8460-27075a2f09ea"
msgid ""
"\"One more monster!\" {n}Amiri grins, flexes her shoulders, and swings her "
"sword to try it out.{/n}"
msgstr "\"괴물 한마리 더!\" {n}아미리는 웃으며 어깨를 굽히고 칼을 휘두릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_11362 4_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "90208347-03be-4087-a3dd-91c0e61479cd"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! One more down!\" {n}Amiri kicks the remains of the monster with her "
"boot and thrusts her chest out proudly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"하! 한놈 더 잡았다!\" {n}아미리는 장화로 괴물의 잔해를 차며 엄지를 가슴을 향해 자랑스럽게 찌릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_11362 5_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b8add0cb-a580-4f11-a0b7-a8038835cc1d"
msgid ""
"{n}Breathing heavily, Amiri stands over the corpse of the fallen monster.{/n}"
" \"Finished him. Both of us.\""
msgstr "{n}숨을 깊게 들이마신 아미리는 괴물의 시체 위에 서 있습니다.{/n} \"마무리지었다. 우리 둘이서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_11362 6_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e7dcfc86-32ca-4813-8f9c-4fe8cd104cce"
msgid ""
"\"That's it! Trial done! Now no one dares say Amiri is weak!\" {n}She grins "
"complacenly and thrusts her chest out.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그거야! 시험은 끝났어! 이제 누구도 아미리가 약하다고하지 않아!\" {n}그녀는 웃으며 고개를 치켜세웁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_11362_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "528c2ffa-bbea-4f3f-bc34-513f54513db2"
msgid ""
"\"Stop!\" {n}Amiri raises her hand, her eyes scanning the area.{/n} \"The "
"monster's here.\" {n}She frowns, but she makes no move forward.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"멈춰!\" {n}아미리는 손을 들어 주위를 훑어봅니다.{/n} \"괴물이 여기 있다.\" {n}그녀는 눈살을 찌푸리지만 앞으로 "
"나아가지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_11803_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ad6841c1-6b00-427a-8688-dcec5df4e303"
msgid "\"Proof?\" {n}She snorts.{/n} \"We killed it! It is enough.\""
msgstr "\"증명?\" {n}그녀는 콧방귀를 낍니다.{/n} \"우리가 그것을 죽였어! 그걸로 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_12506_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3e57cef7-b0f7-4309-8dab-2e2e15615f73"
msgid "{n}Amiri glares at you.{/n} \"We here to fight, or to flap our traps?\""
msgstr "{n}아미리가 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"우리는 여기에 싸우러 온 거야? 아니면 함정을 파기 위해 온 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_19182_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "df8cf5dd-a6f9-4135-af9b-bf1429ddf12f"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri frowns.{/n} \"I went to kill a monster too. Some of the tribe "
"tagged along, wanted to watch, they said. They lost their voices when I "
"threw the hide of a cave lion at their feet. Ha!\" {n}She gives a long, slow "
"smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 눈살을 찌푸렸습니다.{/n} \"나는 괴물을 죽이러 갔다. 부족 몇명이 따라가 지켜보고 싶어했지. 내가 동굴 사자의 가죽을 "
"그들 앞에 던졌을 때 그들은 할 말을 잃었지!\" {n}그녀는 흡족한 미소를 지었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_31080_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "49386f44-bb6b-4f79-aa23-f1b97a4a4893"
msgid "\"Scratches.\" {n}Amiri shrugs.{/n} \"Got some new scars!\""
msgstr "\"긁힌 자국이야.\" {n}아미리는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"새로운 흉터가 생겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_31793_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "53a1fdab-b0be-42af-8ab5-e5a54bc8c820"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri growls low in her throat.{/n} \"I don't get embarrassed! I'm a "
"warrior!\" {n}She grunts.{/n} \"Still, I owe you thanks. You have the heart "
"of a true chief.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 목에서 으르렁거리는 소리가 납니다.{/n} \"나는 당황하지 않아! 나는 전사다!\" {n}그녀는 앓는 소리를 "
"냅니다.{/n} \"그래도 고마워. 너는 진정한 우두머리의 자질이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_34346_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "042d8276-84a3-4883-ad5e-6600888a78df"
msgid ""
"\"You think I'm wet behind the ears? I don't need help.\" {n}She frowns "
"slightly.{/n} \"But stay close. Call you if I need you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 머리에 피도 안마른 애송이라고 생각해? 도움은 필요 없다.\" {n}그녀는 약간 찡그립니다.{/n} \"하지만 내 곁에 있어. "
"필요하면 부르겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_34733_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b62c94b4-f0fe-4bb9-9abe-c3a0eacd3e5d"
msgid ""
"\"Some local girls can be so scary, they're like real monsters themselves.\" "
"{n}Linzi laughs.{/n} \"I guess the customs of our peoples have a lot in "
"common.\""
msgstr ""
"\"일부 지역 소녀들은 겁에 질릴 수 있어. 그들은 진짜 괴물이기 때문이야.\" {n}린지가 웃습니다.{/n} \"우리 관습과 공통점이 "
"많은 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_35633_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "fc63dae3-e159-4bd9-a292-9d875397abf4"
msgid ""
"{n}The halfling raises an eyebrow at Amiri and smirks.{/n} \"From what I've "
"heard, this custom in the {g|Realm of the Mammoth Lords}Realm of the Mammoth "
"Lords{/g} is not only for the young boys. I heard that any man who wants to "
"join the tribe as an equal member must also kill a monster single-handedly.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하플링은 아미리를 향해 눈썹을 치켜올리며 웃습니다.{/n} \"내가 들은 바에 따르면 {g|Realm of the Mammoth "
"Lords}매머드 군주의 영역{/g}의 전통은 어린 소년을 위한 관습이 있어. 부족의 일원이 되고 싶다면 혼자서 괴물을 죽여야 한다고 "
"해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_37741_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ab7c08f0-0da8-4650-a4a8-ab8daf624e7a"
msgid ""
"\"I passed. So what?\" {n}Amiri grimaces.{/n} \"Such a monster downed here, "
"and all you do is rattle on about my old tribe?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 통과했어. 그래서?\" {n}아미리가 뾰루퉁한 인상을 짓습니다.{/n} \"괴물이 여기 내려왔는데 내 부족에 관한 얘기나 하고 "
"있을 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_46744_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "45b19532-5dca-42d2-8cb4-42b8d4066813"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri's face reddens.{/n} \"Well, not just pups must pass this test. If a "
"man's a newcomer to a tribe, he must bring a monster's hide. Kinda proves "
"he's not weak...\" {n}Her voice drops, then falls silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리의 얼굴이 빨갛습니다.{/n} \"글쎄. 애송이들만이 이 시험을 통과하는 건 아니야. 부족에 들어오는 신입들도 괴물의 가죽을 "
"가져와야 하지. 약하지 않다는 걸 증명하는 거야.\" {n}그녀는 갑자기 말을 멈추더니 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_48905_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7aeae534-b0a5-4827-97df-a44c7c578193"
msgid ""
"\"You bet!\" {n}Amiri thrusts her chest forward, anticipating a good "
"fight.{/n} \"But I'll call you if I need you.\""
msgstr "\"틀림없어!\" {n}아미리는 좋은 싸움을 기대하면서 의기양양하게 턱을 듭니다.{/n} \"하지만 네가 필요하면 부르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_49995_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "43a4357f-7c98-464b-8771-d693595849fd"
msgid ""
"\"Wha-? Who, me?!\" {n}Amiri blushes, then pales, then bursts out "
"laughing.{/n} \"Ha! You're funny! Am I to be scared of some lizard?!\" {n}"
"She falls silent with a smile, shaking her head.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 누가? 내가?!\" {n}아미리는 얼굴이 붉어지더니 창백해져서는 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"하! 너 재미있어! 내가 도마뱀을 "
"무서워할 거 같아?!\" {n}그녀는 미소를 지은 채 침묵을 지키며 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_54768_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c2edbfb5-851f-49ce-a1af-be8be87228c6"
msgid "\"Hunt new monsters? Ha! Was born ready!\""
msgstr "\"새로운 괴물 사냥하자고? 하! 언제나 준비 됐다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_60522_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "13b2bd83-9655-4f0d-9325-6ca970893fe8"
msgid ""
"\"What do you know?\" {n}Amiri shakes her head.{/n} \"Am wasting time "
"listening to you!\" {n}She turns away and studies the area.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네가 뭘 알아?\" {n}아미리가 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"시간 낭비하지 않겠어.\" {n}그녀는 돌아서서 그 지역을 "
"탐색합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_60837_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "843f9154-a215-46f2-9a3f-fabac72d119b"
msgid ""
"\"Just don't start this... that...\" {n}Amiri stops, trying to choose the "
"right words.{/n} \"Don't talk me about honor and valor. I know already!\" {n}"
" She frowns and turns away.{/n} \"Still, I owe you thanks. You have the "
"heart of a true chief,\" {n}she adds a moment later.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"시작하지 마라... 그...\" {n}아미리는 멈추고 올바른 말을 선택하려고 합니다.{/n} \"내 앞에서 명예와 용기에 대해 "
"이야기하지 마. 나는 이미 알고 있다!\" {n}그녀는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그래도 고마워. 너는 진실한 족장의 마음을 가지고있어.\" "
"{n}그녀는 잠시 후에 덧붙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_60842_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "716b87d0-684a-4d20-a12e-4ceda2ff0a21"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri snorts, but she still examines herself closely. After a few "
"moments, she grunts.{/n} \"Scratches.\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 킁킁 거리며 자신을 살핍니다. 잠시 후 그녀는 불평합니다.{/n} \"긁혔군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_63740_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "73d59d98-e3bc-494c-8fb6-06e218928cc0"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, tongue. One can flap one's tongue. Traps are things to be shut.\" {n}"
"The gnome's face withers under Amiri's glare.{/n} \"I... I just wanted... "
"for purely academic purposes...\" {n}He falls silent and steps behind "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"누가 입을 놀리고 있군. 그 턱을 다물게 해야 할 텐데.\" {n}노움은 아미리의 표정을 보고 시무룩 해집니다.{/n} \"나는... "
"나는 단지... 순수한 학구적 목표를 위해서...\" {n}그는 침묵하며 당신 뒤에 섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_68219_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bbf0de5a-e6a9-4585-bf39-29cbfba56ea1"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri's face reddens.{/n} \"Well, yeah. True.\" {n}She scrapes the floor "
"with her boot.{/n} \"I'm in your tribe now. Kind of.\" {n}Her voice drops, "
"then falls silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리의 얼굴이 빨갛습니다.{/n} \"글쎄. 그래. 맞아.\" {n}그녀는 장화로 바닥을 씁니다.{/n} \"나는 지금 너의 "
"부족원이라 할 수 있지.\" {n}그녀는 갑자기 말을 멈추더니 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_69723_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "29ac2072-ddc4-4185-8429-208171308905"
msgid ""
"{n}She clears her throat.{/n} \"There's a custom where I from. A boy kills a "
"monster, alone, to prove he's man.\""
msgstr "{n}그녀는 헛기침을 합니다.{/n} \"내가 사는 곳에서 전통이 있다. 소년은 괴물을 죽이고 남자임을 증명한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_85824_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0a30742f-b27b-4d54-859b-4175191de211"
msgid ""
"\"Don't interrupt me!\" {n}Amiri bursts out, as if anticipating being cut "
"off.{/n} \"I speak on, when... I speak on!\" {n}She grunts, and her eyebrows "
"narrow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"방해하지 마!\" {n}아미리는 예상이 빗나간 것처럼 외칩니다.{/n} \"내가 필요할 때 말할 테니까!\" {n}그녀의 미간은 좁고 "
"그녀는 끙끙댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_91270_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3a2358e0-f7d4-4daf-bd88-4a7466b7dfc7"
msgid "\"Hunt new monsters? Ha! Was born ready!\""
msgstr "\"새로운 괴물 사냥하자고? 하! 언제나 준비 됐다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/HodagLair/Cue_96643_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ac9c6e3f-9c26-4398-9d26-78ac5b368efc"
msgid "\"Yes! I felt {g|Gorum}Our Lord in Iron{/g} looking down on me!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 나는 {g|Gorum}철의 신{/g}께서 나를 내려다 보시는 걸 느낀다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/$ShowBark$0629885d-f6a7-49b0-9e80-39cdfe9a56c7_WhatToBarkShared_String
msgctxt "406adce2-10e9-449a-8324-18aa3d95533c"
msgid "\"Quick! Save my cart!\""
msgstr "\"서둘러! 내 카트를 구해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_02198_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "304d2e76-463a-49d2-a9ec-b5b1583de033"
msgid "Threatened Jubilost for rudeness."
msgstr "무례한 주빌로스트를 위협합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_02198_Text
msgctxt "abfc55e1-7016-497d-97b5-c9d6448ddb8d"
msgid ""
"\"You do realize you're in my lands now, so you can get arrested and "
"executed for statements like that?\""
msgstr "\"내 땅에 있다는 것을 깨달았으면 그런 말버릇을 가지면 처형받을 수 있다는 것도 알겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_08997_Text
msgctxt "a51a01fe-2f91-47bd-9808-b5fd04d752f1"
msgid "\"Ok, it was nice talking to you, but it's time to go.\""
msgstr "\"너와 대화해서 좋았다. 가야 할 시간이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_10880_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "90ad7654-442b-43e1-8060-9454fb3d103b"
msgid "Supported Jubilost's freedom of speech."
msgstr "주빌로스트가 말할 자유를 얻게 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_10880_Text
msgctxt "cb67b060-dafc-463c-bf8b-c8bf5505a883"
msgid "\"Actually, I don't mind the freedom of speech.\""
msgstr "\"사실 누구나 말할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_22348_Text
msgctxt "ae4e2370-bf5b-4dd9-80b4-c6a765421f46"
msgid "\"I don't like your manner of speaking, gnome.\""
msgstr "\"네 놈이 말하는 투가 싫어. 노움.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_33553_Text
msgctxt "19c83342-9a53-4f27-9538-4febc6be5621"
msgid ""
"\"I'm looking for the troll's lair. Maybe we're looking for the same place. "
"Let's join our efforts and start looking together.\""
msgstr "\"나는 트롤 소굴을 찾고 있다. 어쩌면 우리는 같은 곳을 찾고 있을지도 모른다. 함께 찾아보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_38549_Text
msgctxt "4f8e6a0c-8d52-4802-90d4-3df25d1d76be"
msgid "\"I didn't know you'd come.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 올 줄은 몰랐다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_39118_Text
msgctxt "89d2bca1-e312-4682-a115-6c2c8db359ca"
msgid "\"How do you know I am a {mf|baron|baroness}?\""
msgstr "\"내가 누군지 어떻게 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_44585_Text
msgctxt "f87a4876-0b5e-4bb5-bc3f-6eaf0da596ad"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, is this old dwarven outpost abandoned? Is it possible it's now "
"used by trolls as a lair, for instance?\""
msgstr "\"말해봐. 이 오래된 드워프 전초 기지는 버려졌어? 트롤이 은신처로 사용했을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_44634_Text
msgctxt "7b9826da-8b42-45c4-ae4a-ea013a4b05d7"
msgid ""
"\"You said you were famous, but I don't know you. What are you famous for?\""
msgstr "\"너는 네가 유명하다고 했지. 하지만 나는 너를 몰라. 너는 무엇으로 유명하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_44677_Text
msgctxt "57815a70-8ffc-4652-ae02-02b930d339dc"
msgid ""
"\"I've found the dwarven outpost you told me about. The trolls have found it "
"even before me.\""
msgstr "\"네가 나에게 말한 드워프 전초 기지를 발견했다. 트롤들이 나보다 먼저 발견한 거 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_61616_Text
msgctxt "bc358eb5-a91f-47e8-a0f7-acb96daba415"
msgid "\"Well, if I find this outpost, I'll let you know. Goodbye.\""
msgstr "\"내가 전초 기지를 찾으면 알려줄게. 안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_65320_Text
msgctxt "6d3bb7c4-dae6-4491-8978-bb52cdf918e0"
msgid "\"So what is such a famous person doing that far from civilization?\""
msgstr "\"그런 유명한 인물이 문명에서 멀리 떨어져 무얼 하고 있는 것이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_82699_Text
msgctxt "f2bd2149-f8a5-4fb4-99b8-997a69bdf1ce"
msgid "\"So what happened here? How did your cart end up in the river?\""
msgstr "\"무슨일이 벌어졌던거야? 어쩌다 네 마차가 강에 떨어진거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_94280_Text
msgctxt "153ae417-6a00-4b3c-916a-64b1a9e79241"
msgid "\"What is this dwarven outpost you're searching for?\""
msgstr "\"네가 찾고 있는 드워프 전초 기지는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_97003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fc6b0d75-05aa-4482-b5a3-cdf9c84a2419"
msgid "Reproached Jubilost for rudeness."
msgstr "무례한 주빌로스트를 욕합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_97003_Text
msgctxt "ae595469-4b2f-480c-bd78-5c60ca6404ac"
msgid "\"Still, I'd like you to hold back your harsh comments.\""
msgstr "\"여전히 네 거친 발언은 듣고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_98465_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4ea492b7-dbbb-42b7-9401-b72c09ece72d"
msgid "Attacked gnome adventurer on the river ford."
msgstr "강 여울의 노움 모험가를 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_98465_Text
msgctxt "557bd3f8-b975-460b-a40c-859fefa6a725"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll stuff your words back down your filthy throat!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그 더러운 말은 다시 못하게 해주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_98481_Text
msgctxt "c6bce8c4-968d-4a0f-b135-412d6f0de837"
msgid ""
"\"I guess those glasses on your nose are just there to make you look smart, "
"Jubilost.\""
msgstr "\"네 코에 걸려있는 그 안경이 너를 똑똑하게 보이게 하는 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_98483_Text
msgctxt "d2a2903b-b569-4a62-93f8-c4d92019714f"
msgid ""
"\"One more comment about my companions and you're done for, you brainless "
"stump.\""
msgstr "\"내 동료에 대해서 다시 한번 더 지껄이면 뇌를 멈추게 해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Answer_98485_Text
msgctxt "2069b057-c1be-4239-9573-297b3f405868"
msgid ""
"\"For someone who values contents so highly, you seem pretty quick to make "
"superficial judgments.\""
msgstr "\"내용을 매우 중요하게 생각하는 사람 치고는 짐작을 잘하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_06666_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "6c8e7383-ed91-4c8a-955d-469569007d6d"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost thinks this over, tilting his head. Looks like this thought "
"never occurred to him.{/n} \"Yes, you are right. I should've remembered that "
"your lands are located in the middle of nowhere and you don't get updates on "
"important things in time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 머리를 갸우뚱하며 생각합니다. 그런 생각을 전혀 안한 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"그래, 네 말이 맞아.나도 네 영토가 "
"오지에 있고 하나도 개척이 안 되어 있다는 사실을 몰랐네 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_10444_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "64ba742e-58b5-4eee-a0c8-1a4c466f5c55"
msgid ""
"\"Also, while I'm on that, I'd like make an official announcement: the roads "
"in your barony are in terrible condition. People must search for wading "
"fords to cross the rivers because no one has bothered themselves with "
"building bridges, and honest travelers have to take the risk of being "
"attacked by kobolds at any moment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 한다면 네 영지의 길은 끔찍하다고 공식적인 발표를 하고 싶어. 아무도 다리를 짓지 않았기 때문에 사람들은 강을 건널 때 배를 "
"타야만 해. 그리고 정직한 여행자는 언제든지 코볼트들에게 공격을 당할 위험을 무릅써야 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_14900_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "ec9c081c-047c-443b-94aa-3fad7e5fba18"
msgid ""
"\"So I've been explaining my position to him, being rather eloquent, too, "
"suggesting he and his so-called kingdom might as well fall into the deepest "
"sinkhole... And in the meantime, I've noticed that kobolds have already "
"started to untie my cart! Well, I called my men to keep the cart safe... "
"They couldn't guess what to do on their own, just stood there with their "
"mouths ajar... Then things heated up as the fighting started. And while we "
"were fighting, the ponies dragged the cart to the river. Stupid animals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 녀석에게 내 입장을 자세히 설명했지. 녀석과 녀석의 자칭 왕국이 가장 깊은 수렁에 빠질 수도 있다는 사실을... 그리고 그 때 "
"나는 코볼트가 이미 내 마차를 훔치고 있는 걸 알게되었지! 나는 사람들을 시켜 마차를 지키게 했어... 그들은 무얼 해야 할지 몰라 입을 "
"벌리고 서있었지... 하지만 싸움이 시작되자 분위기가 뜨거워졌어. 우리가 싸우는 동안 조랑말들은 마차를 강으로 끌고 갔다. 바보 같은 "
"동물들. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_16452_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "44892990-fe37-4308-b8aa-ede3118b7c0d"
msgid ""
"\"Unbelievable! Amazing! Its location must be mapped at once!\" {n}Jubilost "
"shouts in excitement, totally ignoring your mention of the trolls.{/n} \"I "
"definitely need to see the place with my own eyes! Lead the way! As for the "
"cart...oh, never mind, it will be ok. I will send someone for it later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿을 수 없어! 놀랍다! 그 위치를 즉시 지도에 표시해야 해!\" {n}주빌로스트는 트롤에 대한 당신의 언급을 완전히 무시하고 "
"흥분조로 외칩니다.{/n} \"나는 내 눈으로 그 장소를 봐야겠어. 길을 안내해! 카트는... 신경 쓰지 마. 내가 나중에 누군가를 "
"보내지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_17511_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "10aeb5cb-4fdc-41c7-b787-a51fd13bf260"
msgid ""
"{n}Seeing the spectrum of emotions changing on your face, the gnome softens "
"up a bit.{/n} \"I can see it's your first encounter with freedom of speech. "
"Just do what you consider right and let others discuss it. You know, not "
"everyone gets a chance to become a {mf|baron|baroness}, so discussing a "
"{mf|baron's|baroness'} actions is actually all the unlucky ones can do.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 표정이 변화하는 것을 보며 노움은 부드럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"이것이 언론의 자유와 너의 첫 만남 같아. 옳다고 생각하는 "
"일을 하고 다른 이들이 그 문제에 대해 이러쿵저러쿵 하도록 내버려둬. 알다시피 모든 사람이 너처럼 남작이 될 기회를 갖는 건 아니야. "
"그러니 남작의 행동에 대해 토론하는 것은 운 없는 사람들이 할 수 있는 유일한 불평인 샘이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_19190_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "2991b86b-ee72-4a5f-9564-eebaa030e91e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I see, the very spirit of knighthood embodied.\" {n}Jubilost eyes "
"Valerie up and down.{/n} \"So what do you propose me to do, oh bold and "
"manful sir knight? Should I lie?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 알겠어. 이게 바로 그 기사도 정신의 구현이구나.\" {n}주빌로스트는 발레리를 위아래로 훑습니다.{/n} \"그러면 내가 "
"뭐라고 말하길 제안하려나, 오 대담하고 남자다운 기사 나으리? 내가 거짓말이라고 해야 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_21352_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "0f4e8453-5d15-4e56-ab16-f157cbd3394e"
msgid ""
"\"Your ignorance is stunning. You create a barony and still you know nothing "
"about the lands you own.\" {n}Jubilost pouches his lips.{/n} \"I'll have to "
"enlighten you on the subject.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 무지는 놀라워. 너는 남작령을 만들었으면서 네 영토에 대해서는 아무것도 모르는구나.\" {n}주빌로스트가 입술을 내밉니다.{/n}"
" \"그 주제에 대해 너를 계몽시켜 줘야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_21829_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "00134bb1-541f-435b-9b5f-10baae9e3791"
msgid ""
"\"Well, now you're talking like a Chelaxian. It's all completely up to you, "
"but I must warn you — the whole world knows my whereabouts. If something "
"happens to me, neighboring states will definitely notice it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 첼리악스인처럼 말하는군. 이래라저래라 하려는 건 아니지만 그래도 경고 하나 하지. 전 세계가 나의 행방을 알고 있다. 내게 "
"변고가 생기면 이웃 국가에서 바로 알아차릴 거란 얘기지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_29257_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "6661bcda-79e7-46f0-acae-4f430f3f9056"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost Narthropple, humble servant to no one,\" {n}he introduces himself "
"and winces, touching his scratched cheek.{/n} \"Too bad Your Grace proved to "
"not be capable enough to save my cart. Well, one shouldn't expect a fast "
"reaction from the {mf|baron himself|baroness herself} — after all, it's "
"common knowledge that titled persons usually hire a bunch of advisors to do "
"all the thinking for them. So they must have some other bunch to jump in the "
"rivers and save carts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주빌로스트 나트로플. 누구에게도 겸손떨지 않는 노움이다.\" {n}그는 자신을 소개하고 긁힌 뺨을 만지며 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} "
"\"내 마차를 구할 정도로 네 실력이 좋지 않아서 아쉽군. 누군가 네 영지에서 도움을 받기란 쉽지 않을 거야. 결국 작위를 가진 자들은 "
"자신을 위해 일할 보좌관들을 고용한다는 것이 상식이야. 그래서 강에 뛰어들어 마차도 구할 수 있는 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_30432_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "bc3bd4d6-b6f1-48df-9c90-af553d7a4255"
msgid ""
"\"Wow, a {mf|baron|baroness} supporting a freedom of speech! That's news. "
"Remains to be seen, what will you say after reading my article.\""
msgstr "\"발언의 자유를 지지하는 남작이라! 대단하군. 내 기사를 읽고 나서 표정이 어떨지 궁금하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_31722_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "821891ee-6ca3-4944-97b0-11f15252d740"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost looks you up and down.{/n} \"You seem to be a capable companion, "
"but I'll pass for now. I still have to count my losses after the river took "
"my cart and all my stuff.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 당신을 위아래로 봅니다.{/n} \"너는 유능한 동료인 것 같지만 지금은 그냥 가겠어. 내 마차가 강에 빠진 후로 "
"피해를 확인해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_33849_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "0918be0c-0fcd-4ee3-a8cc-5f1aacf01b6e"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost scratches his chin.{/n} \"My party and I set up a camp on the "
"bank of this river. We'd just finished kindling the fire when that purple "
"bastard appeared.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 턱을 긁습니다.{/n} \"우리 일행은 이 강둑에 야영지를 세웠어. 그 퍼런 녀석이 나타났을 때 우리는 막 불을 지피는 "
"것을 마쳤었고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_35114_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "b81ce7a3-f295-4559-bed1-49874c8094ba"
msgid ""
"\"Why not,\"{n} Jubilost shrugs,{/n} \"Dwarves like being underground. "
"Trolls like being underground too. It's quite possible that after the "
"dwarves left, their warm and cozy place fell into the hands of less-"
"attractive creatures.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당연히 그러겠지.\" {n}주빌로스트는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"드워프들은 지하에 있는 것을 좋아해. 트롤들도 지하에 있는 것을 "
"좋아해. 드워프들이 떠난 후 그 따뜻하고 아늑한 장소는 흉측한 녀석들의 손에 떨어졌을 가능성이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_40365_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3769fcb2-3c2f-4a74-868e-6f4d5d6ee482"
msgid ""
"\"You think too highly of yourself, Sir gnome. Behave with some dignity "
"while you are on these lands!\""
msgstr "\"네 자신을 너무 높게 평가하는군. 노움 나으리. 이 땅에 온 이상 품위있게 행동하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_54456_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "08064b4a-afd1-43d0-859c-ad5b8f6a2a05"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost Narthropple, at Your Grace's service,\" {n}he introduces himself "
"and looks closely at your party.{/n} \"Your help with these kobolds and my "
"almost-drowned cart was timely indeed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주빌로스트 나트로플. 부름받고 대령했습니다.\" {n}그는 자신을 소개하고 당신의 일행을 면밀히 관찰합니다.{/n} \"코볼트 건과 "
"아슬아슬하게 잠길 뻔한 마차 건에 대한 당신의 도움은 아주 시의적절했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_58202_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "378b993a-9fc5-4fc9-9ccf-c3ae1a86ca81"
msgid ""
"\"Your problem, sir knight, is that you worry too much about form and "
"appearance. Unsurprisingly so, considering your pretty face. As for me, I "
"worry solely about the content.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 문제는 말이지. 기사 나리, 격식이나 모양에 대해 너무 걱정하는 거야. 너의 예쁜 얼굴을 생각할 때는 당연히 그렇지만. 나는 오직 "
"속을 중요하게 생각하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_61220_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "12071a7f-6f8a-4b0a-ad99-9f0325de4532"
msgid ""
"\"So what did you say your barony was called? Whatever, never mind. When I "
"draw the map of these lands, I will call them 'Maybe local "
"{mf|baron|baroness} will help.' I guess it's a fitting name.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 네 남작령이 어떻게 불리길 원해? 무엇이든지 신경 쓰지 마. 이 땅의 지도를 그리면 나는 그걸 남작이 도울 수도 있음이라고 "
"부를 테니까. 적절한 이름인 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_63814_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "8d158792-4f6e-4f1b-b963-101f7d9bbc63"
msgid "\"And I'd like you to stop telling me what to do.\""
msgstr "\"그리고 내게 이래라 저래라 하지말았음 좋겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_65943_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "cc4aa790-da81-4fec-ac9b-0cb1ad84acf9"
msgid ""
"\"So what? I don't like a lot of things.\" {n}Jubilost presses his fists "
"against his hips.{/n} \"You know what I do, when I don't like something? I "
"try to change it. For example, I don't like your barony's roads, so I've "
"reported to the authorities about it — namely you. And as for you, instead "
"of pouting, you'd better get down to business and try to resolve the trouble."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서? 나는 마음에 들지 않는 것이 많아.\" {n}주빌로스트는 손을 허리에 댑니다.{/n} \"내가 싫어하는 것이 있을 때 무엇을 "
"하는지 알아? 나는 바꾸려고 노력해. 예를 들어 네 영지의 길이 싫다면 나는 그걸 당국에 너에 대해 보고를 하지. 그렇게 되면 너는 "
"불평하는 것보다는 문제를 해결하는 편이 더 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_72100_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "f7588df3-f26b-4bc5-9f09-15b75ff6f952"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, it's you again,\" {n}Jubilost greets you in his usual semi-friendly "
"manner.{/n}"
msgstr "\"어이, 또 너구나.\" {n}주빌로스트는 평소와 같이 반 쯤 친근한 방식으로 인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_75662_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "9b62fd42-9a01-406a-a739-fb9a777ed09a"
msgid ""
"\"By the way, it's a shame no one organized a greeting party when such a "
"famous and popular person as myself arrived to your capital. I wasn't "
"expecting a red carpet covered with rose petals, but you could at least have "
"sent ahead some sort of delegation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런데 나처럼 유명한 사람이 너의 수도에 도착했을 때 아무도 초대 잔치를 준비하지 않았다니 창피하지 않나. 나는 장미 꽃잎이 덮인 "
"붉은 카펫을 기대하지 않았지만 적어도 일종의 대표단이라도 보내줄 줄 알았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_75819_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "2e4727b9-625c-447a-af66-316976ac45dc"
msgid "\"Culinary almanac of the {g|Inner Sea}Inner Sea{/g}?\""
msgstr "\"{g|Inner Sea}내해{/g}의 요리 연감은? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_76641_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "d6c8f2ae-8496-4d7f-a62c-9be7bf65d001"
msgid ""
"\"Or the most scandalous one — The Independence — describing the benefits "
"and drawbacks of governments and regimes in different states?\""
msgstr "\"아니면 가장 소란스러운 녀석은 어때? 독립이라고, 각국의 정부와 정권의 장단점을 설명하는 책인데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_76710_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "946e9d66-1daa-4559-9a3d-817bbf74c5b7"
msgid ""
"\"I would be grateful.\" {n}Jubilost nods.{/n} \"I'll stay here for a while. "
"I need to sort things out.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 고맙겠군.\" {n}주빌로스트는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"나는 잠시 동안 여기 머무를 거야. 정리할 게 있거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_77598_Text_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9d22a473-4a07-4547-8e95-99d3b2535316"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie blushes even more and turns away. It seems to you that the gnome "
"has stepped on her toes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 얼굴이 더 붉어지고는 등을 돌립니다. 노움이 그녀의 발가락을 밟은 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_84676_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "27bb9832-647a-482d-8fea-62976af19991"
msgid ""
"\"So what did you say your barony was called? Whatever, never mind. When I "
"draw the map of these lands, I will call them 'The end of all roads, dirt "
"beyond.' I guess it's a fitting name.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 네 남작령이 어떻게 불리길 원해? 무엇이든지 신경 쓰지 마. 이 땅의 지도를 그리면 나는 그걸 '모든 길의 종착지, 진창 그 "
"이상'이라고 부를 거니까. 적절한 이름인 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_88317_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "d3f2d037-3faf-4ea8-bae0-514ea730864a"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you proved to be a capable companion in case of emergency. I guess I "
"can entrust you with covering my back. Let's go! I will send someone for my "
"cart later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄, 넌 비상상황 시 유용한 동료가 될 수 있는 걸 입증했어. 네가 내 뒤를 잘 막아 줄 거라고 믿어. 가자! 내 마차를 옮길 "
"사람을 부를 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_88475_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "87cb3c2c-e666-42d2-9632-53659f96ba64"
msgid ""
"\"Hold on, wait a moment!\" {n}Jubilost stops you.{/n} \"There is one thing "
"you can help me with.\""
msgstr "\"기다려!\" {n}주빌로스트가 당신을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"네가 나를 도울 수 있는게 한 가지가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_88586_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "12cb1f2b-3b43-46f8-b89a-f65f885e5767"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome fells silent at last. He just watches you with his shifty eyes, "
"opening and closing his mouth, as if he wants to say something more, but "
"hasn't come up with anything yet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 마침내 침묵했습니다. 그는 재빠른 눈짓으로 당신을 지켜보며 무언가 말하려고 하지만 말하기를 주저하는 듯 입을 여닫기를 "
"반봅합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_90403_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "c3d08587-4353-4e01-90fa-a1abd1cdb79c"
msgid ""
"\"I've already told you I visited your capital some time ago. Weren't you "
"listening to me?\" {n}Jubilost wonders a trifle too heartily.{/n} \"And I'm "
"used to being greeted by officials when I arrive to settlements of at least "
"some importance. The glory of myself and my exploits usually precedes me. "
"And officials usually prefer to be on good terms with me.\" {n}Jubilost "
"smiles slyly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"예전에 네 수도를 방문했다는 말을 이미 했잖아. 내 말 못 들었어?\" {n}주빌로스트는 사사건건 대꾸합니다.{/n} \"나는 "
"정착촌에 도착했을 때 관리들에게 인사를 받는 데 익숙해져있어. 내가 이루어낸 업적이 여간 유명해야지. 보통 관리들은 나와 잘 지내고 "
"싶어한다고.\" {n}주빌로스트는 교활하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_93363_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "fc09cf93-ad3f-4894-9212-7e39ea2cc976"
msgid ""
"\"I pursue two objectives. The first is to write an article on this new "
"barony of yours for The Independence. The second is to draw a detailed map "
"of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. Before this barony appeared, it had "
"been too dangerous to come here, but now an opportunity has appeared. Thanks "
"to you, I must add. So, as you can see, the freedom of speech sometimes "
"grants positive comments too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 두 가지 목표를 추구한다. 첫 번째는 내가 쓴 독립이라는 책에 너의 영지에 대한 새로운 기사를 쓰는 거야. 두 번째는 {g|"
"Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 지도를 그리는 거지. 이 남작령이 등장하기 전에는 여기에 오는 것이 너무 위험했지만 지금은 "
"기회가 되었어. 그건 고마워. 너도 알다시피 언론의 자유가 때로는 긍정적인 평가를 하기도 해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_94635_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5dbea8d2-e4e3-41f3-9d43-743bf6518df9"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie blushes, but still tries to argue.{/n} \"By no means! But you "
"shall not be so blunt. I bid you to express your opinion in a more courteous "
"form.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 얼굴이 붉어지지만 여전히 논쟁을 시도합니다.{/n} \"절대로! 그렇게 뻔뻔하면 안됩니다. 조금 더 정중하게 의견을 "
"말하시길 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_96689_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "c9b2904b-85cb-4a53-b402-edf7564ece66"
msgid ""
"\"You know what he told me? He introduced himself as the king of kobolds and "
"told us he needed our clothes. Because he 'wanted to dress his subjects "
"properly', you see, since they've established the kingdom of their own.\" {n}"
"Jubilost's face gets red in resentment.{/n} \"That's literally what he said. "
"I wonder where he learned the words. Obviously I told him to buzz off. Some "
"kobold wants to strut around wearing the clothes of the great cartographer "
"Jubilost Narthropple? No way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 자식이 뭐랬는지 알아? 자기가 코볼트 왕이라면서 옷을 내놓으라더군. 백성들한테 제대로 된 옷을 주고 싶다나.\"{n}주빌로스트의 "
"얼굴이 분노로 붉어집니다.{/n}\"진짜 토씨 하나 안 틀리고 그렇게 말했어. 도대체 그런 말은 어디서 배웠는지. 나는 저리 꺼지라고 "
"했지. 코볼트 따위가 위대한 지도 제작자 주빌로스트의 옷을 빼앗아 입겠다고? 말도 안 되는 소리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98462_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "7f8dbc02-9c42-4da0-b7b6-c0911ee71f58"
msgid ""
"\"That was either a stupid and offensive joke, or a case of total ignorance. "
"The latter, I hope.\" {n}Jubilost pouches his lips.{/n} \"I'm famous as a "
"traveler, a cartographer, an alchemist and a journalist. The students of all "
"the major universities study the world using my maps. My articles for "
"different journals are well-known everywhere from {g|Andoran}Andoran{/g} to "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}. You've definitely read some issues of National "
"Alchemy, haven't you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"무식하거나 정말 멍청한 질문이군. 내 생각에는 몰라서 그런 거 같은데.\" {n}주빌로스트가 입술을 비죽 내밉니다.{/n} \"나는 "
"여행자, 지도 제작자, 연금술사이자 기자야. 대학의 학생들은 내 지도를 보고 공부하지. 다양한 내 기사들도 "
"{g|Andoran}안도란{/g}에서 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에 까지 이르기 까지 잘 알려져있어. 너는 분명히 네셔널 알케미즘을 "
"분명히 읽어보았을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98463_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "9418a68d-ad08-44b5-9163-fb91d8916836"
msgid ""
"\"At least some of my servants are still alive. Do you know how much it "
"costs to train a proper servant?\" {n}Jubilost jabbers too fast, never "
"stopping even to take a breath. You can see he's piled up some emotions and "
"just needs to get them out of his system.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"적어도 내 하인 몇몇은 아직 살아남았어. 하인을 훈련시키려면 얼마나 돈이 많이 드는지 알아?\" {n}주빌로스트가 숨도 쉬지 않고 "
"빠르게 말합니다. 그가 감정을 쌓아두었다가 한번에 비우기를 원한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98464_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "a1f9a8fe-54c5-4a64-a6dd-d0e311abf4a1"
msgid ""
"\"Too bad none of my servants made it alive. Dimwits they were, but at least "
"their service came cheap.\" {n}Jubilost jabbers too fast never stopping even "
"to take a breath. You can see he's piled up some emotions and just needs to "
"get them out of his system.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내 하인 중 누구도 살아남지 못해 아쉽군. 바보 같았지만 그래도 싼 값에 부려먹었는데.\" {n}주빌로스트가 숨도 쉬지 않고 빠르게 "
"말합니다. 그가 감정을 쌓아두었다가 한번에 비우기를 원한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98468_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "df9621a2-b8dd-4459-b946-692e381ccf3b"
msgid ""
"\"Wait... The Jubilost Narthropple? Author of the 'Fourteen and a half "
"eulogies to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}'? Oh my... Every student in the {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}Academy{/g} devoured your books — especially after king Irovetti "
"banned them, tried you in absentia and sentenced you to death!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐만... 주빌로스트 나트로플? {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 율법의 역사의 저자? 오... {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}의 학생들 중에 네 책을 읽지 않은 사람은 없을 거야. 특히 이로베티가 그 책을 금지하고 너에게 사형 "
"선고를 내린 후에 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98469_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "0addaab8-a098-43c5-bc5b-ae0630cd2e3d"
msgid ""
"\"Hm! Hm! I see, at least someone in this shabby barony has at least "
"rudimentary education... Even if they got them in such a dubious "
"establishment as the {g|Pitax City}Pitax{/g} {g|Academy of Grand Arts}"
"Academy of Grand Arts{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠! 흠! 이 초라한 영지에 최소한의 기초 교육을 받은 사람이 있군... {g|Pitax City} 피탁스{/g} {g|Academy "
"of Grand Arts} 대 예술 아카데미{/g} 같은 허접한 곳에서 받았어도 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98470_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ccb69b91-b346-4686-9b79-5cdc7b3186bc"
msgid "\"Ha! I was expelled for irreverence!\""
msgstr "\"하! 나는 불경죄로 퇴학당했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98471_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "f78c4360-ed53-4430-8678-a32969ebbe25"
msgid ""
"\"Is this so? Well, if it is true, then you just might be not beyond hope!\""
msgstr "\"그랬아? 음, 그게 사실이라면 너는 아직 희망이 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98472_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "796388bb-359d-459c-9ca4-d04a7b6680cb"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia glowers at the gnome.{/n} \"Sounds like your servants are nothing "
"but tools to you. Truly, with masters like that being a servant is not much "
"of an improvement over being a slave!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 노움을 내려다봅니다.{/n} \"너에게 하인은 도구에 불과한보군. 그런 주인의 하인이 되는 것보다는 노예가 되는 것이 "
"나아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98475_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "3651c9e2-e8c7-442f-8b2c-f75b390a7ee0"
msgid ""
"\"What's this then?\" {n}The gnome sizes Octavia up from under his glasses "
"and snorts, rolling his eyes.{/n} \"Run along, little girl, the grown-ups "
"are talking.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게 뭐야?\" {n}노움은 안경 너머로 눈알을 굴리며 옥타비아를 훑습니다.{/n} \"어린이는 빠져. 어른들이 이야기하고 있잖아. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98476_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a7ef1b60-e7e7-4732-a40e-59da8dc4e75e"
msgid ""
"\"So you're not only arrogant, but a boorish swine as well. Why am I not "
"surprised at all?\""
msgstr "\"너는 거만한데 천박한 돼지같구나. 왜 난 전혀 놀랍지도 않지?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98477_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "e35b2b7b-788c-4dc8-82ff-0a370432c8bc"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost only clears his throat, paying no attention to the fuming "
"mage.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 헛기침을 할 뿐 마법사에게 아무런 주의를 기울이지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98484_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6be01d67-1f4e-44d5-955c-ea8358b733db"
msgid ""
"\"Please, {name}! Be decent!\" {n}Valerie waves you off.{/n} \"I won't fall "
"to pieces from some nonsense blabbed by a foreigner.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{name}! 부디 품위를 지키십시오!\" {n}발레리가 손사래를 칩니다.{/n} \"저는 외부인의 말도 안되는 헛소리 정도로 "
"무너지지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98486_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "ebbcceeb-1095-4f81-b676-d5a6bd3355a3"
msgid ""
"{n}It takes Jubilost a few seconds to realize the comment was directed at "
"him, after which the gnome's mouth falls open with indignation.{/n} \"I'll "
"have you know that...\""
msgstr "{n}그 말이 자신을 향한 말이라는 것을 꺠닫자 노움은 분노로 입을 엽니다.{/n} \"분명히 말해두는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98487_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "52ce8903-9a64-47c6-aae1-840e63b04528"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, is that so? I would then deem it necessary to inform you that...\""
msgstr "\"오. 그런 거야? 나는 너에게 알려줘야겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Cue_98488_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "da7f0835-7d22-4580-95b2-34a43565d08d"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, please. Don't waste your words and time on this buffoon. "
"Especially because of me.\" {n}Valerie nods to you with a slight smile, "
"indicating her appreciation for your aid.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\" {name}. 제발. 이 허영심에 찬 녀석과 시간을 낭비하지 마세요. 특히 나 때문에 말입니다.\" {n}발레리는 미소를 지으며 "
"당신의 도움에 감사를 표시합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Dialogue_Jubilost_WhatToBark
msgctxt "d01ce95d-39e8-4d62-8e9e-4ea2dd0b122c"
msgid "\"Quick! Save my cart!\""
msgstr "\"서둘러! 내 마차를 구해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/I10_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "dfa3aa15-381b-4e1c-8159-82a5cf3d6cf6"
msgid ""
"\"You see, long ago, there was a dwarven trade route crossing these lands. "
"It connected the {g|Five Kings Mountains}Five Kings Mountains{/g} and the "
"north. The route was so important to the dwarves that they set a number of "
"outposts along it, manned with armed guardians to provide protection for the "
"traders.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옛날에 이 땅을 건너는 드워프의 무역로가 있었어. 그 길은 {g|Five Kings Mountains} 다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}과 "
"북쪽으로 연결되어있지. 그 길이 너무나 중요해서 드워프들은 전초기지를 세웠고 상인들을 보호하기 위해 경비를 고용했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/Jubilost_StartCue_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "d915017d-3969-412b-9649-cbaa4aec9870"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome that stands before you wears dirty and ragged clothes. They "
"used to look stylish and wealthy long ago, but those times are long gone. "
"His black hair is matted, a deep fresh scratch crosses his cheek. Despite of "
"this rather pathetic look, the gnome behaves with inner dignity and even "
"manages to maintain a superior manner.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 서있는 노움은 진흙투성이 넝마 옷을 입고 있었습니다. 그 옷은 원래는 세련되고 비싼 것이었지만 그런 날은 지나간 지 "
"오래입니다. 그의 검은 머리는 헝클어져있고 뺨에는 흉터가 나있습니다. 이런 애처로운 모습과 달리 그 노움은 근엄하게 행동하고 심지어 "
"그럭저럭 상급 예절에 맞게 행동하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/VS_JubilostGivesQuest_01_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "987dc1d3-887d-4f54-baab-2854b0dfc42d"
msgid ""
"\"One of these outposts must be somewhere nearby, lost and completely "
"forsaken. But nothing can avoid the watchful eye of the great cartographer "
"Jubilost Narthropple.\" {n}Jubilost thrusts out his chest.{/n} \"I will find "
"this outpost and I will mark its location on the map, you can trust me on "
"that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 전초 기지들 중 하나는 여기 어딘가에 잊혀져있을 거야. 하지만 위대한 지리학자 주빌로스트님의 눈을 피할 수는 없지.\" {n}"
"주빌로스트가 엄지로 자기 가슴을 찌르는 포즈를 취합니다.{/n} \"나는 전초 기지를 발견해서 지도에 표시할 거야. 두고 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/VS_JubilostProfession_01_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "3e607e1b-dee5-444a-b15f-d86434d6d4e7"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't read any of these? Oh well, don't answer that. I don't want to "
"spoil my impression of your barony, it's spoiled enough already. It would be "
"hard for me to write something positive otherwise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이거 안읽어 봤어? 오 그래, 대답하지 않아도 돼. 난 네 남작령에 대한 내 감명을 망칠 생각 없어. 이미 충분히 망쳤지만. 다른 "
"긍정적인 뭔가를 책으로 쓰는게 내게는 어려울 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/Jubilost/VS_JubilostProfession_02_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "79e6d2a8-5bd3-4319-beb0-71d6bb71cfba"
msgid ""
"\"Anyway, I'm almost done with this journey. My article is practically "
"ready, so is the map. All that is left to do now is to find an old dwarven "
"outpost, established here several centuries ago.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든 나는 이 여행을 거의 끝냈어. 내 기사는 송고할 준비가 되었고 지도도 그래. 남은 것은 몇세기 전에 세워진 드워프의 옛 "
"전초기지를 찾는 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_04787_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6586eff2-801d-4fe4-a285-d033755a2908"
msgid "Massacred the friendly kobolds."
msgstr "친절한 코볼트를 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_04787_Text
msgctxt "ce20184d-2475-48db-acab-68c22b2b4e74"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You bore me. Why don't we play a game? I'll try to kill you, and "
"you try to run away!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 나를 지루하게 했어. 게임을 하는 게 어때? 너를 죽일 테니 너는 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_08734_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c19b1202-fefd-409a-9aa7-50f6ca223ea5"
msgid "Massacred the friendly kobolds."
msgstr "친절한 코볼트를 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_08734_Text
msgctxt "1a01d513-d238-4ba4-9cd8-373c731c93de"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Kobolds, eh? Let's play a game — I'll try to kill you, and you "
"try to run away!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"코볼트? 게임을 하자. 나는 너를 죽일 거야. 너는 도망치라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_13475_Text
msgctxt "ae4c013f-4eaf-4103-8db8-1b904fb3b55f"
msgid "\"Why are you looking for Tartuk?\""
msgstr "\"왜 너는 타툭을 찾고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_15588_Text
msgctxt "5f0a5c87-1a15-410b-8041-a6495cac7933"
msgid "[Don't shake the kobold's hand] \"So, do you need something?\""
msgstr "[코볼트의 악수를 거부한다] \"그래 뭐가 필요해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_16386_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "11bf3530-8c65-48c2-99f4-1bc0a5fd7659"
msgid "Left the friendly kobolds alone."
msgstr "친절한 코볼트를 남겨두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_16386_Text
msgctxt "67c8ea79-d3ba-499f-bdab-94e846815290"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know where the troll's lair is or where Tartuk is hiding. I'd "
"recommend you give up the search, but that's for you to decide.\""
msgstr "\"나는 트롤 소굴이 어디에 있는지, 타툭이 어디에 숨었는지 모르겠다. 수색을 포기하는걸 추천하지. 네 결정이지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_26211_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7dcbebfb-d28b-4e97-a879-a426e541b91a"
msgid "Massacred the friendly kobolds."
msgstr "친절한 코볼트를 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_26211_Text
msgctxt "f7883e10-abdc-40e0-886e-ef9c0319aa5f"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You bore me. Why don't we play a game? I'll try to kill you, and "
"you try to run away!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 나를 지루하게 했어. 게임을 하는 게 어때? 너를 죽일 테니 너는 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_39387_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8bad9b3e-7878-443d-8877-de23f03267ea"
msgid "Played a cruel joke on the friendly kobolds."
msgstr "친절한 코볼트에게 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_39387_Text
msgctxt "e7b6a26a-31dc-4243-8ecf-a00e76102e9a"
msgid "[Point toward the hodag's lair] \"Yes, I saw Tartuk that way.\""
msgstr "[호닥의 은신처를 가리킵니다] \"그래. 저기서 타툭을 보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_41439_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5ddfe3b1-1c5a-4e65-ab59-8642016d6f99"
msgid "Exiled the friendly kobolds."
msgstr "친절한 코볼트를 추방했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_41439_Text
msgctxt "1f79f37a-d66a-4e7a-971f-b0f746246bac"
msgid ""
"\"I'm no friend to trolls. I kill them, and anyone who helps them. You "
"should return from where you came, for your own sake.\""
msgstr "\"나는 트롤들과 친구가 아니야. 그들을 죽일 꺼거든. 너도 살고싶다면 왔던 곳으로 되돌아가는게 좋을꺼야\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_42808_Text
msgctxt "4a14786f-eab3-4767-933d-7465c7be305b"
msgid "[Shake the kobold's hand] \"Greetings.\""
msgstr "[코볼트와 악수합니다] \"안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_52958_Text
msgctxt "5f5a0a20-761f-49eb-8d88-3976d6497b4b"
msgid "[Decide to shake the kobold's hand] \"All right, fine. Greetings.\""
msgstr "[코볼트와 악수하기로 결정합니다] \"알았어. 안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_63768_Text
msgctxt "3b2fc42b-a463-4713-8745-301814c3aaab"
msgid "\"All right. Let's get this sorted out.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 정리해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_63856_Text
msgctxt "a7f4e22f-5e36-4b7b-bc1b-f02c9e2a6575"
msgid "[Don't shake the kobold's hand] \"Yes, greetings to you, as well.\""
msgstr "[코볼트의 악수를 거부한다] \"그래. 안녕하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_76689_Text
msgctxt "2a647895-a0ca-4262-b43b-d2c2c417657b"
msgid "\"I've more important things to do than solve your riddles. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"네 수수께끼를 푸는 것보다 중요한 일이 있다. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_80705_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8ee59e2e-17f7-42ab-873e-5941a71d0d86"
msgid "Played a joke on the friendly kobolds."
msgstr "친절한 코볼트에게 농담을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_80705_Text
msgctxt "1b8dc14d-b70c-4760-948b-48ad60e63794"
msgid "[Point in a random direction] \"Yes, I saw Tartuk that way.\""
msgstr "[아무곳이나 가리키며] \"그래. 나는 타툭을 저기서 보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_98998_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "aba7e3b2-84e4-40fb-b3e2-8aeb0e3aeaac"
msgid "Left the friendly kobolds alone."
msgstr "친절한 코볼트를 남겨두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_98998_Text
msgctxt "8293f524-ccf6-4556-9b5c-e239d16f83db"
msgid ""
"\"I understand your plight, but I fear I can't help you. I'd only lead you "
"further astray. I hope you find what you're searching for.\""
msgstr "\"네 처지는 이해하지만 널 도와줄 수는 없어. 더 혼란에 빠지게 될꺼야. 스스로 잘 찾기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_99000_Text
msgctxt "794e8458-5d88-4f55-b4ac-4a8cbc70d4a2"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk?! What a familiar name. Tell me, do you know the story of the "
"Sootscale kobold tribe?\""
msgstr "\"타툭? 정말 친근한 이름이군. 말해봐. 검댕비늘 코볼트 부족이라고 알지않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_99002_Text
msgctxt "b24348ca-af3b-4b5b-a773-1ad3219de02b"
msgid "\"This Tartuk of yours is dead. I killed him.\""
msgstr "\"너네 타툭은 죽었어. 내가 그를 죽였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_99003_Text
msgctxt "3586cdfc-ab44-480f-ae92-2f5f3f40d486"
msgid "\"I exiled Tartuk from my lands.\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 땅에서 타툭을 추방했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Answer_99004_Text
msgctxt "e4dc6c0d-e78d-42c4-bb4a-daecaaba8b11"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk and I made a deal of sorts. He's in Trobold even now, ruling his "
"kobold kingdom.\""
msgstr "\"타툭과 나는 일종의 거래를 했다. 그는 지금 트로볼트에서 코볼트 왕국을 통치하고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Barks/KoboldsOnMarch_Fireplace_String
msgctxt "388bdfd7-549c-419f-bfe9-b16def06fc46"
msgid "Many small footprints are visible in the dirt. They seem to be recent."
msgstr "바닥에는 작은 발자국들이 많습니다. 최근에 생긴것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_00231_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Second
msgctxt "67135b21-f26a-431e-aa93-15646762ecc1"
msgid "\"Ritinsss!\""
msgstr "\"반값다아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_02707_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Third
msgctxt "0f9a8718-9a09-4e8e-be4d-faeb5ec9f861"
msgid ""
"{n}All of the kobolds are staring at you now, no blinking or movement among "
"them. It's starting to get uncomfortable.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}모든 코볼트가 당신을 쳐다보며 눈 하나 깜빡이지 않습니다. 불편해지기 시작했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_03497_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "da369307-43d0-478d-826c-7e9a0cf8427a"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk is the purple bastard who tried to abscond with my cart. And to top "
"that off, he's apparently the best of friends with some trolls.\" {n}"
"Jubilost frowns.{/n} \"It's your choice, of course, but it seems to me that "
"our best option would be to force this gang to disperse.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭은 내 카트를 가져가려는 보라색 멍청이야. 그리고 트롤의 친구이기도 하지.\" {n}주빌로스트는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"물론 네 "
"선택이지만 이 녀석들을 몰아내는 게 최선이라고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_06083_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "9118d899-b163-401c-9e13-9c5299e172d4"
msgid ""
"\"Ssslaragsss!\" {n}the old kobold hisses. The rest of the kobolds "
"immediately calm down.{/n} \"Greetingsss!\" {n}he says, addressing you and "
"sticking out his hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"쉬잇!\" {n}늙은 코볼트가 쉭쉭 소리를 내자 나머지 코볼트는 조용해집니다.{/n} \"반갑다!\" {n}그가 손을 내밀며 당신에게 "
"말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_07324_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "fbc776dc-143f-45f1-beea-09f9b05edb62"
msgid ""
"{n}The old kobold steps back in fear.{/n} \"Tartuk, king, love! Humansss, "
"koboldsss, love!\" {n}He speaks quickly, raising his hands before him as "
"though shielding himself from attack.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}나이든 코볼트는 두려움에 뒤로 물러납니다.{/n} \"타툭 왕 사랑해! 인간과 코볼트 서로 사랑해!\" {n}그는 빠르게 말하고 "
"공격을 막으려는 듯 자신의 손을 듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_09086_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "bb19cc18-3116-4690-9b30-ed45d9788d8c"
msgid ""
"\"Karasssk!\" {n}the old kobold hisses, springing away from you. His hiss is "
"echoed by the rest of the kobolds as they dash away in different "
"directions.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"카라스크!\" {n}나이든 코볼트가 위협하며 당신에게서 멀어집니다. 그의 위협은 다른 방향으로 달려가던 나머지 코볼트들에게도 "
"이어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_09086_WhatToBark
msgctxt "74398b5a-6282-4183-8c8e-f3295d944040"
msgid "\"Karasssk!\""
msgstr "\"카라스크!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_11438_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b8e1b6a0-7967-4a4d-9a43-3f488a1388ee"
msgid ""
"\"It's clear that you'd be lost without the benefit of a superior "
"intelligence. Obviously, these kobolds have lost their king, one Tartuk, who "
"just as clearly had befriended some trolls. They're asking if you've seen "
"him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너도 팀의 머리를 담당하는 이 탁월한 지능이 없으면 어찌할 바를 모를 거 아냐. 타툭과 트롤과 함께 놀아나면서 코볼트는 왕을 잃었지. "
"그래서 타툭을 봤는지 묻는 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_12517_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "6216a541-84ca-4280-b405-d95238149ed0"
msgid ""
"{n}Unable to judge the expression on his snout, you can't tell if the old "
"kobold believed you. After you answer, he turns away from you as if you "
"ceased to exist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}표정만으로 판단하기가 어려워 늙은 코볼트가 당신 말을 믿었는지는 모르겠습니다. 당신의 대답을 들은 그는 당신을 무시하며 등을 "
"돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_12667_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_First
msgctxt "78bf2925-6008-4d7c-9903-b47d0d157750"
msgid "\"Reeteensss!\""
msgstr "\"방갑다아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_16238_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_First
msgctxt "f7f7e022-a766-42d9-8150-989ea3aedfaf"
msgid "\"Trollsss, oboldsss.\""
msgstr "\"트롤, 코볼트.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_21001_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_First
msgctxt "6bb18fe9-fc54-48a9-908f-8c07e58ca16e"
msgid "\"Mensss!\""
msgstr "\"인가안!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_21263_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3a0d5cd7-5965-4c12-9719-3bee826891ef"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk is the purple bastard who tried to abscond with my cart. And to top "
"that off, he's apparently the best of friends with some trolls.\" {n}"
"Jubilost frowns.{/n} \"It's your choice, of course, but it seems to me that "
"our best option would be to force this gang to disperse.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭은 내 카트를 가져가려는 보라색 멍청이야. 그리고 트롤의 친구이기도 하지.\" {n}주빌로스트는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"물론 네 "
"선택이지만 이 녀석들을 몰아내는 게 최선이라고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_23612_Text
msgctxt "caeb0dda-a6e4-4f3e-a100-52e0ccd0a221"
msgid "{n}The kobolds quickly gather and leave into the woods.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 재빨리 모여들어서 숲으로 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_25391_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "9497c3b2-6f08-4936-a158-38b8cac765bc"
msgid ""
"{n}Over several minutes, you manage to piece together that these kobolds are "
"looking for their \"king,\" Tartuk, who's lost somewhere. After several "
"minutes beyond that, you deduce that this Tartuk somehow managed to befriend "
"some trolls.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}몇 분 동안 대화 끝에 이 코볼트들이 그들의 \"왕\" 타툭을 찾고 있다는 것을 알아냅니다. 그는 어딘가에서 길을 잃었다고 합니다. "
"그리고도 몇 분 후, 아무래도 타툭이 몇몇 트롤들과 친구가 된것 같다고 짐작하게 됩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_25982_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "18985622-55d8-47c0-a8c8-8ba6dcc02080"
msgid "{n}The old kobold continues to extend his hand as he stares at you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}나이든 코볼트는 당신을 계속 보면서 손을 내밀고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_26651_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Second
msgctxt "18a12d2f-e4ff-4047-8705-4e4302812fe7"
msgid "\"Trollsss, oboldsss.\""
msgstr "\"트롤, 코볼트.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_30767_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "51e25cb1-4b34-4e63-8321-8a36a7c34360"
msgid ""
"\"Nooo! What are you doing? They're so cute! Just leave them alone; they've "
"done nothing to you!\""
msgstr "\"뭐하고 있는 거야? 쟤들 정말 귀여워! 그들을 내버려둬. 너에게 아무 짓도 하지 않았으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_33366_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "26098919-d433-4eb0-809b-ef10f9e64885"
msgid "\"{d|Tartuk}Tartuk{/d}, king, sssearch.\""
msgstr "\"왕 {d|Tartuk}타툭{/d} 찾는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_41605_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5f193d3a-314b-4d74-b754-2bca67976dfc"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost frowns and folds his hands.{/n} \"You would do well to watch "
"these yobbos,\" {n}he mutters, teeth clenched.{/n} \"They'll try to steal "
"your cart as soon as you turn your back. That's just the way they are.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 찡그리며 손을 접습니다.{/n} \"이 녀석들을 지켜보는 것이 좋을 거야.\" {n}그는 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"네가 "
"등을 돌리자 마자 마차를 훔치려 들 테니까. 원래 그런 놈들이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_49863_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "31f1a4dc-6857-4765-82b7-9a46951d19a7"
msgid ""
"\"King,\" {n}the old kobold answers.{/n} \"Tartuk, trollsss, kobold. Love.\""
msgstr "\"왕.\" {n}나이든 코볼트가 대답했습니다.{/n} \"타툭, 트롤, 코볼트. 사랑한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_52992_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Third
msgctxt "9673149b-6847-4db0-928e-a59b98baf06a"
msgid "\"Ssssss.\""
msgstr "\"차아아앗.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_54561_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "885bfc03-efea-4890-8c2f-c43a50b6260f"
msgid "\"Tartuk, trolls, love. Sssearch, Tartuk, kobold.\""
msgstr "\"타툭, 트롤, 코볼트. 사랑한다. 코볼트 타툭 찾는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_55089_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "b1a5c84e-00d7-49b5-a5af-0116b198bd46"
msgid ""
"{n}The old kobold seems to have said his piece, so he just continues to "
"stare at you with cold, still eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}나이든 코볼트는 계속 말하는 것 같았고 그는 계속해서 당신을 차갑게 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_61889_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8bd9cc5e-b84c-4b62-9f66-f68652cb4608"
msgid "\"Aww, it seems he's in love with you!\""
msgstr "\"아이고! 당신과 사랑에 빠졌나봐요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_62468_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_First
msgctxt "b7fe34fc-161f-44de-8cde-739d5cef9bb1"
msgid "\"Tartuk! Lufff!\""
msgstr "\"타툭! 사랑한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_63278_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Third
msgctxt "332653d2-119e-45e8-8470-7e781bbe4d67"
msgid "\"Eeteesss!\""
msgstr "\"반감다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_64405_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Second
msgctxt "ba143d48-b593-40be-a623-1ece00e5ecfa"
msgid "\"Tartuk!\""
msgstr "\"타툭!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_64736_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Third
msgctxt "a5abde9b-9838-42b0-bf21-4d7775d1cc08"
msgid "\"Kobold.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_66253_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "fbef368c-f688-421e-9b96-08e7aa677b75"
msgid ""
"{n}You shake the old kobold's hand. It's slimy and cold. He continues to "
"stare, his eyes still, yellow, and emotionless.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 나이든 코볼트와 악수합니다. 그의 손은 차갑고 미끈거립니다. 그가 계속해서 감정 없는 노란 눈으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_68584_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_First
msgctxt "8a952044-2071-4b53-b58c-d482b5730801"
msgid "\"Zzzerch!\""
msgstr "\"찾는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_69496_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Second
msgctxt "7b438122-2e6f-4a79-a109-608d6a0ac59b"
msgid "\"Lufff!\""
msgstr "\"사아랑!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_70828_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Second
msgctxt "d9a3c1fd-f27a-4b61-8f1c-8f0534bb396e"
msgid "\"Sssearch!\""
msgstr "\"찾능다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_74049_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "01fd9faa-a4f5-4cab-98f3-0d18f9cb3db4"
msgid ""
"{n}Seeing you fail to understand the old kobold, Octavia touches your "
"shoulder to attract your attention.{/n}"
msgstr "{n} 나이든 코볼트를 이해하지 못한 당신을 보고 옥타비아는 어깨를 두드리며 당신을 부릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_74126_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "c39cf444-02a5-4a12-bf8b-e63eededac6c"
msgid ""
"{n}Unable to judge the expression on his snout, you can't tell if the old "
"kobold is upset by your statement. After you answer, he turns away from you "
"as if you ceased to exist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 주둥이에서 튀어나온 말을 판단할 수 없어서 당신은 그 나이든 코볼트가 화가 났는지 알 수 없습니다. 당신이 대답을 한 후에 "
"그는 당신을 무시하며 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_74245_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "80a218e9-9a21-4b11-88f2-85ca0d5796f9"
msgid ""
"\"Awww, they're so cute!\" {n}Octavia exclaims, clasping her hands "
"together.{/n} \"May I keep one?\""
msgstr "\"아이구! 너무 귀여워!\" {n}옥타비아는 손을 마주잡으며 외칩니다.{/n} \"내가 하나 가져가도 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_84765_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "74e53449-d30d-4341-ac48-65a63752e201"
msgid ""
"\"I think I understand what they're trying to say. It seems their king, "
"Tartuk, is lost somewhere, and they're looking for him. But it sounds like "
"he's become friends with trolls now, so I'm not sure it would be wise to "
"help them...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그들이 무엇을 말하려고 하는지 이해할 거 같아. 아마 그들의 왕 타툭이 사라져서 그를 찾는 거 같군. 하지만 그는 트롤과 친구가 "
"된 거 같아서 도와주는 게 좋은 건지 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_86245_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bfd73870-06b4-4a1e-a899-1d6b3ef34d39"
msgid ""
"{n}Seeing that you're unable to understand the old kobold, Jubilost exhales "
"noisily.{/n}"
msgstr "{n} 나이든 코볼트를 이해하지 못한 당신을 보고 주빌로스트는 푹푹 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_90790_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "6192d245-e7c0-4484-987c-91b5726b4272"
msgid "\"Koboldsss, humansss, love,\" {n}the old kobold says.{/n}"
msgstr "\"코볼트 인간 사랑한다.\" {n}늙은 코볼트는 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_93265_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "2b28a172-13dd-46d6-b4b4-7e240ab71d80"
msgid ""
"{n}One kobold emerges from the swarming crowd. His scales are a touch "
"lighter than those of his companions. Upon closer inspection, he seems to be "
"extremely old. His skin is dry and lifeless, and he clearly lost some of his "
"scales long ago.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}한 코볼트가 무리에서 나옵니다. 친구들과 달리 가죽이 얇습니다. 자세히 보니 굉장히 늙은 코볼트입니다. 피부는 건조하고 생기가 "
"없으며 비늘은 이미 오래전에 떨어져 나간 것이 분명합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_95219_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "a050e8e2-56ef-4876-bc57-d73a3844ad2d"
msgid ""
"{n}There's something curious about this kobold. He seems to be calm, "
"confident, and... wise?{/n}"
msgstr "{n}이 코볼트에 뭔가 궁금증이 생깁니다. 그는 평온하고, 자신감 있어 보이는데다.. 똑똑해 보이기까지 하니까요.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_97896_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "9862c46d-babf-4362-8f91-a58a7c7ef993"
msgid ""
"{n}No matter how hard you try, you can't glean anything useful from the old "
"kobold's gibberish.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아무리 노력해도 늙은 코볼트의 헛소리에서 유용한 것을 알 수는 없었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_98997_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_First
msgctxt "4633577d-91c7-4d44-bb56-cf365f8fdf36"
msgid "\"Ssserrr. Obold.\""
msgstr "\"코보트, 찾는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_98999_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "e01f4635-ee81-4eb0-af24-35410c7c4db8"
msgid ""
"{n}The old kobold continues to stare. After you answer, he turns away from "
"you as if you ceased to exist.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}늙은 코볼트가 계속해서 쳐다봅니다. 당신이 대답한 후에 그는 당신이 없는 것처럼 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/Cue_99001_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "bf74840b-036c-4805-a12e-430c74f360e8"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold seems to not understand a single word you're saying, but "
"reacts to the word 'Sootscale'.{/n} \"Sssootssscale. Bad. Not friend!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 당신이 하는 말은 한마디도 이해하지 못하는 것 같습니다. 하지만 '검댕비늘'이라는 단어에 반응합니다.{/n} \"검댕비느을"
". 나쁘다. 친구 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/KoboldsOnTheMarch/KoboldShaman_Start_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "9a41fa90-7a31-450d-b6f5-3133528c4b68"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a gang of kobolds resting around a campfire. When they finally "
"notice you, they jump up and start scuttling around, making a mess, and "
"bumping into each other, all the while muttering something in their hissing "
"language.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 캠프파이어 주위에서 쉬고 있는 코볼트 무리를 봅니다. 그들이 당신을 발견했을 때 그들은 여기저기 뛰어다니면서 서로 부딪히고 "
"그들의 알 수 없는 언어로 중얼거리며 난리를 피웁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/ChildBark_String
msgctxt "85589c4e-cba6-41ac-be9e-e1dcf3605343"
msgid "\"Thank you, good people! I gotta run to my ma now!\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 지금 엄마한테 달려가봐야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Climb_String
msgctxt "51a85cd0-df65-476b-888d-561655f26878"
msgid ""
"There's no need to climb over here now that you have access to the village "
"through the gates."
msgstr "성문을 통해 마을에 접근할 수 있게 되었으므로 여기를 오르지 않아도 됩니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Combat/Guard_String
msgctxt "6544ed97-42cb-4bc1-8e00-5b3f76bccdeb"
msgid "\"Alarm! Get spears! Kill warmbloods!\""
msgstr "\"비상! 창을 잡아라. 온혈 동물을 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Combat/KennelsMaster_String
msgctxt "99c2d0a0-665e-4500-8118-2847b75e0f3e"
msgid "\"Go, my dears! Meal time! Fresh meat today!\""
msgstr "\"가자. 아가야! 오늘은 신선한 고기다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Combat/Lizardfolk_1_String
msgctxt "ab112fbd-292b-4c6a-9aa1-ea641637a90a"
msgid "\"We make warmblood remember their place!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 온혈 동물들에게 자신들의 처지를 깨닫게 할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Combat/Lizardfolk_2_String
msgctxt "56d8ad0f-684f-413f-a8d9-91bfc74cc6f5"
msgid "\"Warmblood betray friendship? Thickskin was right!\""
msgstr "\"온혈 동물이 우정을 배반했어? 두꺼운 피부가 옳았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Combat/Lizardfolk_3_String
msgctxt "f2189228-93ac-4539-8a29-22a9a1b03852"
msgid "\"War! War! Dryskin bring war!\""
msgstr "\"전쟁이다! 전쟁! 마른 피부가 전쟁을 일으켰다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Combat/Vesket_String
msgctxt "15b57df6-7a14-4a16-8460-bbc9c3b9deb7"
msgid "\"You doom yourself, warmblood. Longtail eat you, then your kin!\""
msgstr "\"너 스스로 파멸을 자초했다. 온혈동물. 긴꼬리가 너와 네 동족을 먹을 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/KingArrivedBark_String
msgctxt "25f68572-8c27-44e7-8882-a037da9508c3"
msgid "\"Great Ancestor speaks, Longtails obey!\""
msgstr "\"위대한 조상이 말한다. 롱테일은 순종한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkGardenersBarks/Lizardfolk_GardenerBark_1_String
msgctxt "b0635884-9337-40fb-bd29-1c8c522bdb02"
msgid "\"No can do this!\""
msgstr "\"누구도 이럴 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkGardenersBarks/Lizardfolk_GardenerBark_2_String
msgctxt "b7a34e48-78a6-4e7b-9dd2-8f2e485c3792"
msgid "\"Great Ancestor order so. No can argue, do what order!\""
msgstr "\"위대한 조상이 그렇게 명령한다. 누구도 명령할 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkGardenersBarks/Lizardfolk_GardenerBark_3_String
msgctxt "8d0aa9e6-2c49-4abf-bfad-3478fc8ce0e2"
msgid "\"Stupid order! Ancestor insane!\""
msgstr "\"어리석은 명령이다! 조상이 미쳤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkGardenersBarks/Lizardfolk_GardenerBark_4_String
msgctxt "226e2534-4c8f-4437-9798-b339135a589b"
msgid "\"Ancestor wise! Ancestor know better!\""
msgstr "\"조상은 현명하다! 조상은 잘 알고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkGardenersBarks/Lizardfolk_GardenerBark_5_String
msgctxt "3547bd63-de18-4c38-aec0-cb624c93c898"
msgid "\"If Ancestor say go cut your tail, you go do it too?\""
msgstr "\"만약 조상이 너의 꼬리를 자르라고 하면 그대로 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkGardenersBarks/Lizardfolk_GardenerBark_6_String
msgctxt "2a9dcd08-b2e7-4707-b9da-aa196740cf08"
msgid "\"Stop imagine stupid! Do what Ancestor say!\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 생각은 그만해라! 조상이 하라는 대로 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkPatrolBarks/Rashor_String
msgctxt "8cfeeb33-e040-403c-9ef6-b112663e2cc7"
msgid "\"Aid me, warmblood! This Thickskin, they no mercy!\""
msgstr "\"나를 도와라. 온혈 동물! 두꺼운 가죽은 자비를 베풀지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkPatrolBarks/Thickskin_hostile_1_String
msgctxt "44ddb78d-f456-487e-962d-9feef5d842df"
msgid "\"Rssha h'att'ha! Tshe! Tshe! Tshe!\""
msgstr "\"르샤 하'트'하! 트쉬! 트쉬! 트쉬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkPatrolBarks/Thickskin_hostile_2_String
msgctxt "55caf191-f856-4878-a45a-023b6b3e5def"
msgid "\"Sharat! Warmblood filth!\""
msgstr "\"Sharat! 온혈 동물 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkPatrolBarks/Thickskin_hostile_3_String
msgctxt "bbb15a76-d847-4b86-8190-6ee0e86cd21f"
msgid "\"Warmblood! Your gods rot! Your ancestor eat mud!\""
msgstr "\"온혈 동물! 너희 신은 썩었다! 너희 조상은 진흙을 먹는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/LizardfolkPatrolBarks/Thickskin_vs_Rashor_String
msgctxt "c4fd7859-8b34-4b4f-891e-62763314ba3e"
msgid "\"Tshe tat'cha! Warmblood — death! Longtail — death!\""
msgstr "\"Tshe tat'cha! 온혈 동물에게 죽음을! 긴꼬리에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/RattlerVsWisp/RattlerVsWisp_1_String
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "5f055006-ae9c-402a-bb4f-9b6425f8e9d7"
msgid "\"Ah, and here's the old lizard now. So...\""
msgstr "\"아. 여기 늙은 도마뱀이 있네. 그래서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/RattlerVsWisp/RattlerVsWisp_2_String
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "73a46497-e453-46ea-bcd0-737dca2d1bbf"
msgid "\"Stupid chieftain! Look what you worship!\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 대장! 네가 숭배하는 것을 보아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/RattlerVsWisp/RattlerVsWisp_3_String
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "8e1f7e65-fee4-4393-b4f0-f6f76914fae4"
msgid "\"Evil spirit! Tricked Vesket, like stupid child! Never forgive it!\""
msgstr "\"악령! 베스켓을 멍청한 애처럼 속였어! 절대 용서못해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/WispBark_String
msgctxt "25348ba3-1639-4676-9e8a-a83f41534f91"
msgid "\"Die, you useless lizard!\""
msgstr "\"죽어라. 쓸모없는 도마뱀!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/WispDiesAndKillsBoy_String
msgctxt "14d34fef-7625-41f5-bfa4-9d6272406304"
msgid ""
"\"I'm... defeated? But I still have strength enough to take the boy with me!"
"\""
msgstr "\"내가 졌어? 하지만 나는 저 남자 아이를 데려갈 힘이 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_01_String
msgctxt "14b55d1b-cb3e-4332-8241-e43bce0fb777"
msgid "Every egg in the hut is broken and licked clean."
msgstr "오두막의 모든 알은 부서지고 누군가 깨끗이 핥았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_02_String
msgctxt "2cfa4e06-e0cf-4d9a-b350-f919966c17a1"
msgid "This ornate throne, made of darkened wood, is clearly centuries old."
msgstr "이 화려한 보좌는 어두운 나무로 만들어졌으며 분명히 수 세기 전의 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_03_String
msgctxt "b5936b3f-e0da-4dbc-8834-a140a138c07a"
msgid ""
"Any hunter from Brevoy or the River Kingdoms would envy a trophy like this!"
msgstr "강의 왕국들이나 브레보이의 사냥꾼이라면 이런 트로피를 부러워 할 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_04_String
msgctxt "b5f93c50-9523-444f-996b-66e2a5e96c4d"
msgid "A severely burned head of a long-tusked troll."
msgstr "심하게 타버린 긴 어금니 트롤의 머리."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_05_String
msgctxt "2e1f329c-0edb-4791-84d7-d66b0272d14a"
msgid "This head belonged to a very large lizardfolk — probably, a chieftain."
msgstr "이 머리는 아주 큰 도마뱀 인간의 것인데 아마도 족장일 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_06_String
msgctxt "f2526a20-1468-4999-b86a-c5b50ddd6710"
msgid ""
"Giant, ornate mask depicts a scary face — an evil spirit, or a benevolent "
"ancestor."
msgstr "거대하고 화려한 마스크는 무서운 얼굴을 하고 있습니다. 악한 영혼 또는 자비로운 조상을 묘사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_07_String
msgctxt "a3e2a486-e28f-46c0-b5c1-b1d89a4773ca"
msgid "Sound of this giant drum probably travels many miles."
msgstr "이 거대한 북의 소리는 아마도 수키로미터까지 들릴것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_08_String
msgctxt "ace50131-d8d0-41a2-b6fd-50b73b06c405"
msgid ""
"The pole is decorated with numerous skulls of animals, humans and lizardfolk."
msgstr "막대기에는 수많은 동물, 인간, 도마뱀의 두개골로 장식되어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_09_String
msgctxt "d9e66247-92e8-48d9-86fe-bb64bbe6a015"
msgid "Deer hides are drying on the racks."
msgstr "사슴 가죽은 건조대에 걸려있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_10_String
msgctxt "2f92d836-bdf9-4bf6-86df-80e3900839e8"
msgid "Medical herbs are growing in the little garden beds."
msgstr "의료 허브는 작은 정원터에서 자라고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Barks/Zone_11_String
msgctxt "38a17751-034f-4212-939a-90bcfe80a31f"
msgid ""
"The door is locked from the inside. Someone is watching you through the "
"crack."
msgstr "문이 안쪽에서 잠겨 있습니다. 틈새에서 누군가가 당신을 지켜보고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f002e215-6460-492f-8179-b2f9924e3395"
msgid ""
"\"There's a human child in your village. I came to trade for his release.\""
msgstr "\"너의 마을에 인간 아이가 있다. 그의 석방을 위해 협상하러 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "2fa78f41-0c1f-45b5-98a0-bc2a32b8cf5c"
msgid ""
"\"I came to take the child, and I will take him — by force, if necessary.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아이를 데리러 왔다. 필요하다면 강제로 데려갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "bd4536d2-a837-46e5-8b31-73273f655970"
msgid ""
"[Offer 10 rations] \"We come in peace. Please accept this food as a sign of "
"our goodwill.\""
msgstr "[식량 10 레이션을 줍니다] \"싸우지 말자. 이 음식을 우리의 선의의 표시로 받아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "84a7d4d5-a86e-4231-b1ab-a593b4478331"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm here to destroy you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너를 파괴하러 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "87cd8014-0e36-44c9-8159-902a29bf3873"
msgid ""
"{n}Armed lizardfolk quickly advance on you.{/n} \"Alert! Warmblood in "
"village! Why come? What want?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}무장한 도마뱀 인간은 재빨리 당신에게 나아갑니다.{/n} \"비상! 마을에 온혈 동물이 왔다! 왜 왔지? 무엇을 원하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "32297c48-1f83-40c3-b32e-b71ee2b043d4"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk sniffs the food suspiciously, then tastes it.{/n} \"If "
"want peace, why no come gates? Why sneak like thief? Strange. Must talk "
"Chieftain Vesket — he smart, he figure out. Come.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간은 의심스러운 듯 음식 냄새를 맡고 그것을 맛봅니다.{/n} \"평화를 원한다면 왜 문으로 오지 않은 거냐? 왜 도둑처럼 "
"몰래 왔지? 이상하군. 족장 베스켓과 이야기해야겠다. 그는 똑똑하니 알 거다. 이리 와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "49924bef-aa0e-44dc-87d9-e66c92b006c4"
msgid ""
"\"Trade? Yes! Tasty food, sharp knives — good! Must talk Chieftain Vesket. "
"Come.\""
msgstr "\"협상? 좋다! 맛있는 음식과 날카로운 칼은 좋다! 족장 베스켓에게 말하겠다. 이리 와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "bf8452ac-7765-4f1f-bb10-54c9cb08fdb2"
msgid "\"You want trade, come by gate! Why come like thief, like spy?\""
msgstr "\"협상을 원하면 문으로 와라! 왜 도둑처럼 오는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ba1eb945-a9a7-4f42-ab09-e9699ea491b9"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk recoils from you.{/n} \"Wait, why need force? Want take "
"child, must talk Chieftain Vesket! Come.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간은 당신에게 반발합니다.{/n} \"잠깐 왜 강제로 데려가는 거지? 아이를 데려가고 싶으면 족장 베스켓과 이야기해야 "
"한다. 따라와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "39c3a809-c8d4-4068-bf91-4ca0eb5eb176"
msgid "\"Dryskin want fight? Then we fight!\""
msgstr "\"마른 피부와 싸우고 싶어? 그럼 싸우자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "34ca5a53-8712-4630-8696-1b5f9ba5b1d6"
msgid "\"All here! Fight dryskin!\""
msgstr "\"여기 모두! 마른 피부를 지켜라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CaughtInside/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "2931dd2a-9f4d-4929-9c0a-846355d11a53"
msgid ""
"{n}Armed lizardfolk quickly advance on you.{/n} \"Alert! Warmblood intruder! "
"Fight, everyone!\""
msgstr "{n}무장한 도마뱀 인간은 재빨리 당신에게 나아갑니다.{/n} \"비상! 마을에 온혈 동물이 침범했다! 모두 싸워라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Answer_68598_Text
msgctxt "be383e69-78f3-4558-b67f-2f82616af448"
msgid "We climbed over the palisade."
msgstr "우리는 담을 기어 올랐습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Answer_73191_Text
msgctxt "069b6ac9-61a0-4c67-a478-88cfa21e9692"
msgid "We made note of the place and moved on."
msgstr "우리는 주위를 경계했고 계속 전진했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Answer_99826_Text
msgctxt "9a1b9fc7-b45d-4c80-9e12-674aaaa5040a"
msgid "Without wasting any time, we entered the hut."
msgstr "시간을 낭비하지 않고 우리는 오두막에 들어갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Answer_99827_Text
msgctxt "1e822522-fde1-4336-865c-afb7f57f2eeb"
msgid "We came out to meet the lizardfolks."
msgstr "우리는 도마뱀 인간을 만나러 갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Cue_32851_Text
msgctxt "7611202d-1503-4a45-9ebd-ec5e099e8117"
msgid ""
"The village was once surrounded by sturdy palisade, but it seems the "
"lizardfolk have had more interesting things to do than keep it in good "
"repair. The spiked poles were probably pretty menacing a long time ago, but "
"now they stand askew, half-rotted. In almost no time, we found a place where "
"we could climb over the palisade without much risk of becoming that exotic "
"but not so rare dish known as \"jerked traveler on a stick.\""
msgstr ""
"마을은 한 때 튼튼한 담으로 둘러싸여 있었지만 도마뱀 인간은 수리하는 것보다 더 재미있는 일을 했습니다. 못이 박힌 기둥은 오래 전에 꽤 "
"위협적이었을지 모르지만 이제 그들은 반쯤 썩어 구부러졌습니다. 우리는 여행자 꼬치구이가 될 위험에 처하지 않고 곧바로 올라갈 담을 발견할 "
"수 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Cue_76553_Text
msgctxt "b4178f22-f645-43c8-96bd-fe8a677492d9"
msgid ""
"Getting to the other side was easy. Our greatest worry was that the half-"
"ruined palisade might fall under our weight."
msgstr "다른 편으로 가는 것은 쉬웠습니다. 우리의 가장 큰 걱정은 반쯤 폐허가 된 담이 우리의 체중에 무너질 수 있다는 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Cue_83542_Text
msgctxt "cc1d8066-b598-44dc-9941-122039702c4e"
msgid ""
"The palisade proved to be more serious obstacle than we initially thought. "
"We managed to get over it, but we were definitely introduced to more "
"sharpened poles than we'd have liked!"
msgstr ""
"담은 우리가 처음에 생각한 것보다 더 심각한 장애물이었스브니다. 우리는 편하게 그것을 오를 수 있었지만 더 뾰족한 기둥들과 마주쳐야 "
"했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Cue_99825_Text
msgctxt "15fec369-a38d-4d5f-9f65-9acc72a6e93f"
msgid ""
"Just behind the palisade was a large sturdy hut. It didn't look to be a "
"dwelling. Judging by the intricate carvings above the entrance, which "
"depicted several very ugly muzzles, it was probably some sort of ritual "
"building, like a temple or something. The entrance was covered by a drop-"
"curtain of beads, and there were no guards. But from around the corner ("
"shoot — what do you call that kind of thing if the hut's round? Never mind!) "
"we heard clawed footsteps and hissing speech."
msgstr ""
"담 바로 뒤에는 크고 튼튼한 오두막이 있었습니다. 그것은 주거용 오두막처럼 보이지 않았습니다. 입구 위에 있는 복잡한 조각들로 판단하여 "
"여러가지 못생긴 주둥이를 묘사한 걸로 보아 신전 같은 의식을 위한 공간 같습니다. 입구는 구슬 장식으로 덮여 있었고 경비원은 없었습니다. "
"그러나 모퉁이에서 발걸음 소리와 쉭쉭거리며 말하는 소리를 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/ClimbPlace/Cue_99831_Text
msgctxt "30a57283-64ed-4319-8ba0-30694de12d9f"
msgid ""
"Seeing us, the lizardfolk raised their spears menacingly and hissed, \"Freeze"
", warmbloods! How dare you come here, to the dwelling-place of the "
"mysterious people, who, as Sigred from Oparra once wrote, might be even more "
"ancient than elves? Explain yourselves, intruders, or our reprisal shall be "
"swift and merciless!\""
msgstr ""
"우리를 보고서 도마뱀 인간들은 창을 세우고 혀를 날름거렸스브니다. \"꼼짝마! 온혈 동물! 어떻게 감히 고대 종족 오빠라의 지그래드의 "
"주거시설에 침입할 수 있지! 설명하지 않으면 침입자에게 자비는 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_10_String
msgctxt "e0431bf3-5381-45fa-a6e2-c231b1d0b244"
msgid "\"We ancient tribe. We no die easy.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 고대 부족이다. 우리는 쉽게 죽지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_11_String
msgctxt "b2820b40-85d0-4eb7-a853-e8ba10b6d859"
msgid "\"Tribe go, find new home.\""
msgstr "\"부족은 가서 새로운 집을 찾아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_12_String
msgctxt "8de96826-0912-474a-bb56-222b20b0045b"
msgid "\"Evil spirit go away. Good!\""
msgstr "\"사악한 영혼은 사라졌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_13_String
msgctxt "44ba5689-4ca3-4afd-b549-1d63c9ce4655"
msgid "\"Who become new chieftain?\""
msgstr "\"누가 새 족장이 된 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_14_String
msgctxt "8caf174d-4443-471e-b32c-8949f3e8019d"
msgid "\"Old Kagar wise, he lead us.\""
msgstr "\"늙은 현자 카가르가 우리를 인도한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_15_String
msgctxt "b39de5ed-925f-46cf-97c4-831f33aa81e5"
msgid "\"What happen to tribe now?\""
msgstr "\"지금 부족에게 무슨일이 일어난거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_16_String
msgctxt "8e02629a-96a6-429d-ac87-f8272412bb69"
msgid "\"Spooky mists, magic beasts... Why?\""
msgstr "\"유령 같은 안개, 환수들... 왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_17_String
msgctxt "b57d190c-9541-42eb-b488-d05361a350d4"
msgid "\"This world must be die soon.\""
msgstr "\"이 세상은 곧 끝날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_18_String
msgctxt "0fef77db-365d-4af1-a9b9-36f4a05323f3"
msgid "\"Great ancestor eat our souls...\""
msgstr "\"위대한 조상이 우리 영혼을 먹는다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_19_String
msgctxt "110d24fb-1b2f-455f-aedd-8943cca8d71d"
msgid "\"Rattler go. Lose the stories. Lose our past.\""
msgstr "\"딸랑이 갔다. 우리 이야기 잃어버렸다. 우리 과거도 잃어버렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_1_String
msgctxt "48d6b8bd-04f5-41a2-adcf-c411c2466b7d"
msgid "\"Thank you, warmblood.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 온혈 동물.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_20_String
msgctxt "5c6de3b8-4523-4e69-832d-c6a45363b38f"
msgid "\"All tribe like exiles now.\""
msgstr "\"모든 부족이 지금은 추방자들 처럼 살고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_21_String
msgctxt "7b296449-4e30-414c-8027-4621713ad6ea"
msgid "\"We all like sick or drunk.\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두 병들었거나 취했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_22_String
msgctxt "f8547f15-48a5-404a-bb25-07ea846d69b1"
msgid "\"We not defeat Thickskin for long. Soon they eat us.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 두꺼운 가죽을 오랫동안 이기지 못했다. 곧 그들이 우리를 먹을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_23_String
msgctxt "612eeb05-c73f-4732-aff0-8db0ccbe8ed9"
msgid "\"Dryskin in our village?\""
msgstr "\"우리 마을에 마른 피부가 오다니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_24_String
msgctxt "4a645e05-dcd3-4ae4-a584-3db4a97b76f8"
msgid "\"Look, there go warmblood! Why come in village?\""
msgstr "\"봐! 온혈 동물이다! 왜 마을에 온 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_25_String
msgctxt "1cb8592e-8309-4d05-8c3b-3e1e8adcf734"
msgid "\"Ill omen everywhere... There will be trouble.\""
msgstr "\"안 좋은 징조가 사방에 있다... 문제가 생길 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_26_String
msgctxt "2597f2cb-ad50-4f15-b3ad-76de86544b7a"
msgid "\"We old like world... Is this end?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 세상처럼 늙었다... 이제 곧 종말인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_27_String
msgctxt "2530caf1-e463-4430-a7e7-1a9d48cd60e3"
msgid "\"Scared...\""
msgstr "\"겁 먹었군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_28_String
msgctxt "7fbe610b-06c6-4856-a3b6-8ff56340d766"
msgid "\"World become old, become rotten. End near...\""
msgstr "\"세상은 늙고 썩어간다. 끝이 가까워졌어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_29_String
msgctxt "4ab43e33-6c8a-481e-b43c-8cb844032c88"
msgid "\"Great ancestor promise much, do little!\""
msgstr "\"위대한 조상이 약속은 많이 했지만 한 것이 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_2_String
msgctxt "3eca3633-6b56-4121-963b-b2bd45235683"
msgid "\"Vesket stupid! Almost kill the tribe!\""
msgstr "\"베스켓 어리석다! 부족을 거의 죽일 뻔했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_30_String
msgctxt "d772b800-c478-4d1a-bf50-eecc1afc50f1"
msgid "\"Miss old rattler! Want hear his song once again!\""
msgstr "\"늙은 딸랑이 그립다! 그의 노래를 다시 듣고 싶다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_3_String
msgctxt "3c126c7d-5c22-4277-88cd-2d6650b5ef23"
msgid "\"We stupid like children! Believe evil spirit!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 아이들처럼 어리석다! 사악한 영혼을 믿다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_4_String
msgctxt "8c99bb03-4c7a-43ad-a717-28e04c5e3778"
msgid "\"Now easy to breath, like air cleans from smoke!\""
msgstr "\"연기가 사라진 공기처럼 이제는 숨 쉬기가 편하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_5_String
msgctxt "625e6a6d-252b-422a-848b-ff357cdd96c4"
msgid "\"All fear go away.\""
msgstr "\"모든 두려움은 사라진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_6_String
msgctxt "442b50cf-29b3-4321-a4af-f9d8cdcb3521"
msgid "\"Must be, real great ancestor send you!\""
msgstr "\"진짜 위대한 조상이 너를 보냈음이 틀림 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_7_String
msgctxt "b20e9794-1bef-4ab9-af00-4c85d37c115a"
msgid "\"Longtail ready to travel.\""
msgstr "\"긴꼬리 여행 준비 됐다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_8_String
msgctxt "1287f400-0e41-40a6-83b0-c7ebdccd1476"
msgid "\"Village no save now. Must go away.\""
msgstr "\"마을은 지금 못 구한다. 가야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/CommonBarks/Lizardfolk_CommonBark_9_String
msgctxt "a70b729d-5c60-4c61-b1b9-1f02c685acdc"
msgid "\"Longtail have past again. Have future again.\""
msgstr "\"긴꼬리 다시 과거 생겼다. 미래도 생겼다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_13145_Text
msgctxt "049b9062-94a0-470e-9ad4-b2931baa3680"
msgid ""
"\"I came to take the child, and I will take him — by force, if necessary.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아이를 데리러 왔다. 필요하다면 강제로 데려갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_33137_Text
msgctxt "be78656d-051b-440e-8012-e17e75d17147"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"이곳은 어디야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_51851_Text
msgctxt "72204365-216a-417c-9fec-98d7b94a047b"
msgid ""
"\"There's a human child in your village. I came to trade for his release.\""
msgstr "\"너의 마을에 인간 아이가 있다. 그의 석방을 위해 협상하러 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_62871_Text
msgctxt "83d3da3f-091f-4727-a156-cfce31be655e"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm here to destroy you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너희를 죽이러 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_96909_Text
msgctxt "13e71aeb-9bd3-427f-a1e4-4e49ab0ffca2"
msgid "[Leave] \"I'll be back.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"곧 돌아오겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_98277_Text
msgctxt "b8d2e6f1-0721-4cb6-ac74-aaa32f387120"
msgid "\"I'm here to speak with your chieftain.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 족장과 이야기하기 위해 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_98279_Text
msgctxt "7b8f77a4-24f6-42f1-8fcd-cd6b8d5d01e0"
msgid "\"Tell me about your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"네 부족에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_98285_Text
msgctxt "ca6a080a-f554-412b-b37b-4c9e1506d70c"
msgid ""
"[Offer 5 rations] \"We come in peace. Please accept this food as a sign of "
"our goodwill.\""
msgstr "[식량 5 레이션을 줍니다] \"싸우지 말자. 이 음식을 우리의 선의의 표시로 받아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_98288_Text
msgctxt "633b99c3-0b70-4d36-a4ae-10546a2bd557"
msgid "[Attack] \"Then let the war begin.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그렇다면 전쟁을 시작하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Answer_98289_Text
msgctxt "f74fa8a9-714c-4cdf-902c-93bfc859eb12"
msgid "[Leave] \"Whatever you say.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"네가 뭐라고 말하든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_01213_Text
#. Speaker : Lizardfolk_VillagerRashor
msgctxt "14469b1b-e8e2-4376-b90a-95c39227253b"
msgid ""
"{n}Armed lizardfolk stand at the village gate. One of them seems familiar, "
"and it seems he's recognized you too.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}무장한 도마뱀 인간이 마을 문에 서있습니다. 그들 중 하나는 익숙해 보였고 그도 당신을 알아보는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_02486_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "ad2a7863-b275-415c-b83d-acb651a872d7"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk examine your gear with long, contemplative looks. Finally, "
"one of them speaks to you, trying to control his trembling voice.{/n} "
"\"Warmblood is mighty warrior, yes!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간은 당신의 장비를 꼼꼼하게 검사합니다. 마침내 그 중 하나가 자신의 떨리는 목소리를 제어하려는 듯 당신에게 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물은 용감한 전사다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_17050_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "9349c4ab-a9cb-44db-a8ce-86cc4962f33b"
msgid ""
"\"This village of Longtail tribe. Been here since long-long ago, since "
"warmbloods were wild... And before, when warmbloods were tiny like mice... "
"And before, when no warmbloods were here at all... Even then, Longtail "
"village stood here, yes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 긴꼬리 부족의 마을이다. 아주 오래오래 전부터 온혈 동물이 야생에 있었을 때부터 이곳에 있었다... 그 전, 온혈 동물이 "
"쥐처럼 작았을때도... 그 훨씬 전, 온혈 동물이 아예 존재하지 않았을때도... 그 때에도 긴꼬리 부족 마을은 이곳에 있었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_17559_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "42b7af9b-25f0-4c99-a17d-af191c4dc889"
msgid ""
"{n}A group of warlike lizardfolk guards the village gates. Noticing you, "
"they raise their weapons.{/n} \"Halt, warmblood! Why come? Friend or foe? "
"War or peace?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}호전적인 도마뱀 무리가 마을 문을 지키고 있습니다. 당신을 알아차리자 그들은 무기를 들어 올립니다.{/n} \"멈춰라! 온혈 동물! "
"왜 왔지? 친구냐? 적이냐? 전쟁이냐? 평화냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_56241_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "8c69fabc-2fa1-45e8-be51-ed8f5cfe5f70"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk at the gates salute you.{/n} \"Dryskin want peace? Come in "
"then!\""
msgstr "{n}성문에 있는 도마뱀은 당신에게 경의를 표합니다.{/n} \"마른 피부 평화 원하나? 그럼 들어와라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_60132_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "a05b6f65-5a03-4875-b8d3-701f1a9a091b"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk look you up and down before bursting into laughter.{/n} "
"\"Go back where you from, warmblood. Or we show you into village... straight "
"to roasting rack!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간이 당신을 위아래로 훑더니 폭소를 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"네가 왔던 곳으로 돌아가라. 온혈 동물. 아니면 너에게 마을 "
"보여줄 수 있다... 그 다음에는 요리해주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_77696_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "55ca32dc-e12e-46b0-bfaa-f36d02d9468b"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk exchange glances. One of them hesitantly replies.{/n} "
"\"Trade good. But child... Warmblood need speak to Chieftain Vesket. He "
"decide. We show way.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간들은 눈짓을 교환합니다. 그들 중 하나가 주저하며 대답했습니다.{/n} \"협상은 좋다. 하지만 아이는... 온혈 동물은 "
"베스켓 족장과 얘기해야 한다. 그가 결정한다. 우리는 길 알려준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_87688_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "7f3a9a9e-1dda-4c6c-900d-06b2850d5d42"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk exchange scared looks.{/n} \"Trade for child not possible! "
"Child sits in Spirit Hut, or Great Ancestor grow angry! Leave, warmblood, no "
"trade here!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간은 두려운 눈빛을 교환합니다.{/n} \"아이를 위한 협상은 못한다! 아이는 영혼의 오두막에 앉아있지 않으면 위대한 "
"조상이 화를 낸다! 떠나라. 온혈 동물. 협상은 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98275_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "ce11dc1a-b933-4b07-90c9-5de8849c8192"
msgid "\"Alarm! Warmblood bring war! All here, protect village!\""
msgstr "\"비상! 온혈 동물이 전쟁을 벌인다! 모두 모여서 마을 지켜라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98276_Text
#. Speaker : Lizardfolk_VillagerRashor
msgctxt "581de9b3-0e0e-4f13-b662-ce5a76350fbd"
msgid ""
"\"Here you are, dryskin! Rashor wait for you come! Hey, hey, look, everyone! "
"This warmblood helped Rashor kill Thickskin! Put down your spears, friend "
"comes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 있다. 마른 피부! 라쇼가 너를 기다렸다! 이봐. 모두 봐라! 이 온혈 동물이 라쇼를 도와 두꺼운가죽을 죽였다! 창을 내려라! "
"친구가 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98278_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "168c72e4-d168-4637-beb1-0050a6cee961"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk opens the gates and invites you to come in with a "
"gesture.{/n} \"Come.\""
msgstr "{n}도마뱀 인간은 문을 열고 몸짓을 하여 들어오라고 합니다.{/n} \"와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98280_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "6b03939d-5c7d-4263-b4a7-3a7f5a0d5755"
msgid ""
"\"Longtails are ancient tribe. Once owned all woods, all swamps, from big "
"water to high mountain. Now changed, warmbloods everywhere, tribe became "
"small... But we ancient, we wise. We know that who once came must once go. "
"We not fight — why war? Century or two and you die out yourselves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴꼬리 부족은 고대의 부족이다. 한 때 큰 물에서부터 높은 산 까지 모든 숲과 늪을 지배했다. 지금은 바뀌어서 온혈 동물이 어디든 "
"있다. 부족은 작아졌다... 하지만 우리는 고대부터 존재했고 현명하다. 우리는 한번 온 사람은 한번은 꼭 가야한다는 걸 알고있다. 우리는 "
"싸우지 않는다. 왜 전쟁을 하나? 100년이나 200년이면 너 죽는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98281_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "9a400058-ca0d-4b7a-a846-6eac3eb254a3"
msgid ""
"\"Longtails wise, yes. We speak warmblood tongue, we trade, we not eat "
"warmbloods unless we need. But Thickskin tribe not like us! They not speak "
"to warmbloods, they just fight! They want make great empire again. Beware "
"Thickskins, yes! They strong warriors, though weak in head.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴꼬리는 현명하다. 우리는 온혈 동물 말 할 줄 알고 협상 한다. 우리는 원하지 않으면 온혈 동물 먹지 않는다. 하지만 두꺼운가죽 "
"부족은 우리와 다르다! 그들은 온혈 동물과 말하지 않고 싸운다! 그들은 위대한 제국 다시 건헐하고 싶어해. 두꺼운가죽 조심해! 그들은 "
"머릿속은 빈약하지만 강력한 전사다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98283_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "30c45623-5cae-46c0-b9c7-608b2db96848"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost listens to the lizardfolk closely, humming under his breath, and "
"makes a few notes in his notebook.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 도마뱀 인간의 말을 가만히 들으며 노트에 몇 가지를 적습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98286_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "eced0b3a-8746-4a29-8ac5-7f0373ac6bfb"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk sniff the food, taste it, and nod, satisfied.{/n} \"Good, "
"good. Longtails always peace warmblood. Need speak with Chieftain Vesket. We "
"show way.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간은 음식 냄새를 맡고 맛을 보더니 만족해 합니다.{/n} \"좋아. 좋아. 긴꼬리는 항상 온혈 동물과 평화롭다. 족장 "
"베스켓과 대화해라. 우리가 길 알려준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98287_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "e4809d57-f963-4500-9df1-7ad91fe8a784"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk at the gates hiss menacingly.{/n} \"Warmblood, leave now, "
"yes! Leave quick, or war start!\""
msgstr "{n}문에 있는 도마뱀 인간은 쉭쉭하며 위협합니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물. 당장 떠나라! 어서 떠나지 않으면 전쟁이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98291_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6a851e2f-8b77-4b24-a5cf-64edd297a003"
msgid ""
"\"Typical for the primitive societies\"{n} whispers Jubilost.{/n} \"Visit "
"any village of three mud huts, and people will tell you they live in the "
"center of the universe from its very beginning, and gods are their "
"grandparents... Well, let's be honest: in the civilized societies people say "
"exactly the same things, just in fancier words!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전형적인 원시 사회의 형태로군.\" {n}주빌로스트가 속삭입니다.{/n} \"3개의 진흙 오두막집 중 아무 곳이나 방문해. 그러면 "
"그들이 자신들은 우주의 중심부에 처음부터 살았고 신은 조상과 같다고 말할 거야... 솔직하게 말하면. 문명 사회의 사람들도 똑같은 걸 "
"조금 화려하게 말해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98293_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "3c036e69-d07c-4064-bfab-3948751e8c9a"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk gulps, then speaks to you, trying to control his trembling "
"voice.{/n} \"Warmblood is mighty warrior, yes. We take to Chieftain Vesket's "
"hut, talk him. We show way.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간은 침을 꿀꺽삼키고는 자신의 떨리는 목소리를 제어하듯이 말합니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물은 용감한 전사다! 족장 베스켓의 "
"오두막으로 가서 대화해라. 우리가 길 알려준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98294_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9f5fc3c1-f3a1-4b6a-b4ef-3b07fe56c917"
msgid ""
"{n}With a scowl, Regongar raises his hand, sparks dancing on his fingers.{/n}"
" \"Are you having fun, lizard? Let's do it, one on one. Let's see who's "
"going to get roasted!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르의 손에서 번개가 춤을 춥니다.{/n} \"재밌냐? 도마뱀들아? 한번 해 보자고. 누가 죽는지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98298_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "65b9419a-78d0-497c-a645-49b3bc078dcf"
msgid "\"Yes, lizards... Be afraid of us. Very, very afraid!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 도마뱀들아... 우리를 무서워 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98300_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGatekeeper
msgctxt "65d721d5-07f3-49c4-853d-53492dea447b"
msgid "\"We take to Chieftain Vesket's hut — you talk him. We show way.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 족장 베스켓의 오두막에 너를 데려가겠다. 그와 대화해라. 우리는 길 알려준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Gatekeeper/Cue_98302_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ba31e961-5de3-4f25-bca5-c129b1830134"
msgid "\"Great! Hold on, scales!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 기다려. 비늘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Answer_79891_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "06448f10-7f9b-44c2-a439-bf6d2563e8a2"
msgid "Healed the wounded lizardfolk."
msgstr "부상당한 도마뱀 인간을 치료했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Answer_79891_Text
msgctxt "7ed03dee-6c34-488c-a013-85ef61191e30"
msgid "[Heal the wounded lizardfolk] \"Hold on, I can help you.\""
msgstr "[부상당한 도마뱀 인간을 치료합니다] \"잠깐. 너를 도울 수있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Answer_79895_Text
msgctxt "5b6ca0fd-d316-4b2e-82dd-f44e7312ab83"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Answer_79896_Text
msgctxt "82771b8a-950c-48c3-8854-b67b4a89ff0e"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Answer_79897_Text
msgctxt "4b525e05-3b0f-43a8-af57-689644d834c2"
msgid "\"What did you call me?\""
msgstr "\"나를 뭐라고 부른거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Answer_79899_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3c68831d-1315-46f4-8e9d-c93d01befd49"
msgid "Finished the wounded lizardfolk."
msgstr "상처 입은 도마뱀 인간을 끝장냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Answer_79899_Text
msgctxt "70939860-55c1-4d21-a8aa-2963f223e298"
msgid "[Finish the wounded lizardfolk] \"I'll put an end to your suffering.\""
msgstr "[상처 입은 도마뱀 인간을 끝장냅니다] \"나는 너의 고통에 종지부를 찍을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Answer_79905_Text
msgctxt "b1bfc28e-eb0a-4917-acee-425068f4536b"
msgid "[Leave] \"I have to go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_64819_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "0597818d-bfc9-48c8-a461-0d290b14e067"
msgid ""
"{n}Virish rises to his feet.{/n} \"Weird day, when dryskin save one of "
"tribe. Weird, but maybe not last for tribe? Maybe not time for Ashshas-ta-ha "
"take all?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}비리쉬는 일어섭니다.{/n} \"마른피부가 우리 부족을 구하다니. 이상한 일이군. 하지만 부족의 마지막이 아직 아닌걸까?. "
"아스샤스타하가 모든 것을 앗아갈 때가 아직 아닌걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_72389_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "efa94838-77fb-47c6-aa40-076481121978"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk's wound closes as he stares at you, astounded.{/n} \"You "
"no take Virish? You... dryskin? Friend?\""
msgstr "{n}그가 당신을 보는 동안 도마뱀 인간의 상처가 아뭅니다.{/n} \"너 비리쉬 안 잡아가? 너... 마른 피부? 친구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79892_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "23580b0d-c061-4526-98ea-e464d7b504f6"
msgid ""
"{n}On the floor of the hut, lying among eggshells, an old lizardfolk is "
"pressing his hand against a festering wound. Raising his head with great "
"effort, he stares at you.{/n} \"Dryskin? No, I see truth... Ashshas-ta-ha... "
"I been waiting for you, yes...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}오두막의 바닥에 달걀 껍질 사이에 늙은 도마뱀 인간이 누워 상처를 압박하고 있습니다. 그가 간신히 고개를 들며 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"
" \"마른피부? 아니. 나는 진실을 보았다... 아스샤스타하... 너를 기다렸다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79898_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "76286cad-e67d-404d-8a17-9aaaf6326010"
msgid ""
"\"Ashshas-ta-ha... Death... You have many-many faces… You can come as "
"animal, as wind, as dryskin... come and take all, everything, yes...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아스샤스타하... 죽음... 죽음은 많은 얼굴을 가지고 있다... 동물의 모습으로, 바람의 모습으로, 혹은 마른피부의 모습으로도 올 "
"수 있다... 와서는 모든 것을 앗아간다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79900_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "a68ced0f-69ad-44af-8670-9e29f700fc5b"
msgid ""
"\"Virish of Longtail tribe... Once was clutch father... Now no eggs, and "
"soon no tribe... So who Virish now? You tell me, Ashshas-ta-ha...\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴꼬리부족의 비리쉬... 한 때 부족의 아버지였다... 지금은 알이 없으니 부족도 곧 없어질 것이다... 그러면 이제 누가 비리쉬가 "
"되는 건가? 네가 말해봐라. 아스샤스타하...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79901_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "e75a03db-736f-447d-8e76-66a111b5f853"
msgid ""
"\"Great Ancestor go crazy, tell of famine come soon, children starve, so we "
"must eat eggs like every time famine come... But where is famine? Many "
"animals, many mushrooms everywhere! We could breed many children, could "
"raise many warriors, yes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"위대한 조상은 미쳐버렸다. 곧 기근이 와서 아이들 굶주릴 것이라 말했다. 우리는 매번 기근이 온 것처럼 알 먹어야 했다... 하지만 "
"기근은 어디에 있나? 동물도 버섯도 사방에 넘쳐난다! 우리는 많은 아이들을 기를 수 있었다. 많은 전사 기를 수 있었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79902_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "4a49869b-0573-47a8-826d-49863c46ab07"
msgid "\"Virish ready... Take Virish now, Ashshas-ta-ha... Take all...\""
msgstr "\"비리쉬는 준비되었다... 비리쉬 지금 데려가라. 아스샤스타하... 모든 것을 앗아가라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79903_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "e4621f09-0bb8-4609-a3c3-6246968342a2"
msgid ""
"\"Virish try save eggs, try stop tribe from eating them. Great Ancestor get "
"angry, put spell on Virish. Then Chieftain Vesket poke Virish with spear... "
"I lie and watch Longtails eat our own eggs...\""
msgstr ""
"\"비리쉬는 부족이 알을 못먹게 하려 했다. 위대한 조상은 화가 나서 비리쉬에게 마법을 걸었다. 그리곤 족장 베스켓이 비리쉬를 창으로 "
"찔렀다... 결국 나는 굴복하고 긴꼬리가 자신들의 알을 먹는 것을 지켜볼 수밖에 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79904_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "6d3ecc75-266b-4d2c-b120-0dff9aea02ff"
msgid ""
"\"Now no eggs left, no children left — where tribe get new warriors from? "
"Soon Virish die, and then tribe die, yes...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제는 남은 알도 없고 아이들도 남아 있지 않다. 새로운 전사는 어디서 얻어야 하나? 곧 비리쉬가 죽으면 부족도 죽는다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79906_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "1152d252-43b6-4013-91ff-44456b2fdd83"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk stares at you from the floor without a word, pressing his "
"hand against a festering wound.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}도마뱀 인간은 말없이 마루 바닥을 보다 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79907_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "873cfc9d-e595-40ac-867a-fd8f276a098d"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk is still weak, but his life is out of danger.{/n} \"Thank "
"you, dryskin...\""
msgstr "{n}도마뱀 인은 여전히 약하지만 그의 생명은 아직 꺼지지 않았습니다.{/n} \"고마워. 마른 피부...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79908_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "afe6f033-2ff7-42ab-b649-20f445e7e2ad"
msgid ""
"\"Virish from Longtail tribe, clutch father. When we have no eggs, we have "
"no children — tribe die out. But if ancestors help, we get new eggs, we get "
"new children!\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴꼬리 부족의 아버지, 비리쉬라고 한다. 우리에게 알이 없으면 아이들도 없다. 부족은 없어진다. 하지만 조상이 도우면 우리는 새로운 "
"알을 낳을 수 있다. 새로운 아이도 얻는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79909_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "123a515d-3c4c-4926-bddf-856d673f8505"
msgid ""
"\"What now? We lay new eggs, no? Virish know not. Maybe tribe survive, if "
"ancestors help.\""
msgstr "\"이젠 어떻게 해야하나? 계속 새로운 알을 낳아? 비리쉬는 모른다. 아마 조상이 돕는다면 부족은 살아남을 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/InjuredLizardfolk/Cue_79910_Text
#. Speaker : InjuredLizardfolk
msgctxt "668e3be2-fb88-445a-9bae-bcc844ac3f46"
msgid ""
"\"Ashshas-ta-ha. Thought you are Death. Virish lie here, wait for death come "
"and take all tribe, yes... Virish wrong. Now, Virish think maybe tribe live "
"on!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아스샤스타하. 난 네가 죽음이라 생각했다. 비리쉬는 여기 누워서 죽음을 기다리고 부족이 끝나기를 기다렸다... 비리쉬가 잘못 "
"생각했다. 이제 부족은 살아갈 수 있을꺼다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "9fe8b6e0-0155-4488-809d-6905d1042aaf"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c30fe829-4d1a-45c4-849e-f01bb65bb20e"
msgid "\"You seem to be nervous. What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"너 긴장한것 같은데. 여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "b8288f8a-3c20-44fd-ace5-467f7dd66de8"
msgid "\"I came to take the child. Is he here? Is he still alive?\""
msgstr "\"나는 아이를 데리러 왔어. 그가 여기 있나? 아직 살아있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "87056eeb-c5c6-423f-89f8-a4c74a914546"
msgid "Calmed the kennels master lizardfolk."
msgstr "사육사 도마뱀 인간을 진정시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "7bd18625-fa64-41ce-82a9-c83c698c83f3"
msgid ""
"\"I don't seek revenge on your tribe. I just want to take the child home.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 부족에 대한 복수를 원하지 않는다. 나는 아이를 집에 데려 가고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e9f5d2ee-04a5-41ee-a39d-ed9b88f3b6b4"
msgid "Terrified the kennels master lizardfolk."
msgstr "사육사 도마뱀 인간을 겁먹입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "944445ba-3daf-46fd-82bc-cc4e5064fe0f"
msgid ""
"\"You can't treat our children like that. We'll have our revenge, mark my "
"words!\""
msgstr "\"우리 아이들을 그렇게 대해선 안된다. 우린 복수할테니 명심해 둬라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "9fb6c32d-99a0-4fc3-a57e-73c4c64cd329"
msgid "[Leave] \"Farewell.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a5668b0e-69a5-437a-887f-b1ab132deab7"
msgid "Murdered the kennels master lizardfolk."
msgstr "사육사 도마뱀 인간을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "0c955ebd-4cd4-47f2-94d2-d18e395249cc"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll kill you and your monitor lizards.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너와 왕도마뱀들 모두 죽이겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "117f6d00-f66c-4889-84fe-83f9ebf3505b"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk standing near the monitor lizard holding pen recoils when "
"he notices you.{/n} \"Warmblood! Why come our village?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}왕도마뱀들 근처에 펜을 들고 있는 도마뱀 인간은 당신을 보자 소리를 지릅니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물! 왜 우리 마을에 왔나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "72e8b866-ed08-4ef9-bc44-5a5dd545de0b"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk looks at you with fear and suspicion.{/n} \"What you "
"bring, warmblood? Peace or war?\""
msgstr "{n}도마뱀 인간은 두려움과 의심으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"무얼 가져왔지. 온혈 동물? 평화냐, 전쟁이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "441455b4-5a9a-4864-bf80-1e5d4fd7af69"
msgid ""
"\"Good, good. Longtails always in peace with warmbloods, yes!\" {n}The "
"lizardfolk is obviously relieved.{/n}"
msgstr "\"좋아. 좋아. 긴꼬리는 온혈 동물과 언제나 평화롭게 지낸다.\" {n}도마뱀 인간은 안심한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "db0d0b22-7427-49b2-b331-9c9c60df9719"
msgid "\"Scared?! Longtail tribe know no fear! You want fight? Fashor ready!\""
msgstr "\"두려워?! 긴꼬리 부족은 두려움을 모른다! 싸우고 싶나? 파셔 준비됐다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "87b3ba1c-51a7-4c5c-b6d5-2aed9dad2fa6"
msgid ""
"\"Fashor is warrior of Longtail tribe. In warmblood tongue, Fashor called "
"kennel master. But monitor lizards better than dogs, yes! Monitor lizards "
"tough, enduring, and have strong jaws!\""
msgstr ""
"\"파쇼어는 긴꼬리 부족의 전사이다. 온혈 동물의 언어로 파셔는 사육사라고 부른다. 하지만 왕도마뱀들은 개보다 더 뛰어나다! 왕도마뱀 "
"거칠고 잘 견디고 강한 턱 가졌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "9cbef467-8443-476d-ac59-76e583348171"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk pets one of his monitor lizards on the head.{/n} \"Fashor "
"know all about monitor lizards. Breeding them, training them. Healing, "
"killing, and cooking them. No dog compares to monitor lizards!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀 인간은 왕도마뱀의 머리에 손을 올립니다.{/n} \"파셔는 왕도마뱀에 대해서 다 안다. 그들을 기르고 훈련시킨다. 치료하고 "
"죽이고 요리도 한다. 개 따위와 비교가 안된다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "fa7476b2-b6b5-496f-a31e-e1fd8bea9b52"
msgid "{n}Amiri grunts in approval.{/n} \"You should see a triceratops!\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 동의하면서도 투덜댑니다.{/n} \"네가 트리케라톱스를 봤어야 했는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "0140ac28-34b8-4313-a2af-61dc1e7939f0"
msgid ""
"\"Fashor know, warmblood come to take youngling... If all go in peace — that "
"good. If not... Fashor's hand steady, and Fashor's spear sharp!\""
msgstr ""
"\"파셔는 안다. 온혈 동물 새끼 데리러 왔다... 모두 평화롭게 지낸다면 좋다. 그렇지 않으면... 파셔의 손은 뾰족한 창 단단하게 "
"쥐고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "88f7d2a8-f840-4ad6-8f6b-42baf331038d"
msgid ""
"\"Fashor is warrior, Fashor know no fear...\" {n}The lizardfolk looks aside "
"and hisses.{/n} \"Many strange things in village,\" {n}he adds under his "
"breath.{/n} \"Bad things. Wrong things. Everyone afraid Great Ancestor will "
"destroy us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"파셔는 전사이다. 파셔 두려움 모른다...\" {n}도마뱀 인간은 다른 곳을 보며 쉭쉭거립니다.{/n} \"마을에 이상한 것이 많다."
"\" {n}그는 숨을 내쉬고는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"나쁜 것들. 잘못된 것. 위대한 조상이 우리를 파괴할까봐 모두 두려워한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "89ff206a-b7a1-4218-ad76-b928f99ca5d5"
msgid ""
"\"Longtails big tribe, strong tribe! Fashor wish war with warmblood start! "
"Longtails gnaw your bones!\" {n}The lizardfolk tries to look brave, but you "
"can tell he's nervous.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"긴꼬리 부족은 강하다! 파셔는 온혈 동물과 전쟁 한다! 긴꼬리는 너희 뼈 씹을 거다!\" {n}도마뱀 인간은 용기있게 보이려고 "
"노력하지만 그는 긴장한 것이 틀림 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "6be7765c-7de2-47b9-b279-9c9b806e998a"
msgid ""
"\"Youngling in Spirit Hut. When we find him, tribesmen argue. One say, 'Soft "
"tender meat, we eat him!' Other say, 'No, we take him back to warmbloods and "
"trade him for sharp knives.'\""
msgstr ""
"\"새끼들은 영혼 오두막에 있다. 우리가 그를 찾으면 부족이 화낸다. 누군가 부드러운 고기니 먹어야 한다고 말했다. 다른 녀석은 온혈 "
"동물에게 돌려주어 날카로운 무기 얻어야 한다고 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "057f78a0-a4c1-406a-9122-7ec82c263cae"
msgid ""
"\"But Great Ancestor say, 'No, youngling go to Spirit Hut! Throw him in "
"monitor lizard cage, but don't let them eat him. Take him back! Poke the "
"youngling with spears, but not really hurt him! Youngling scared, youngling "
"cry, ancestor laugh... What for? Why?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 위대한 조상은 영혼 오두막으로 아이들 보내라고 했다. 우리에 넣어 먹지 말고 감시하라고 했다. 그를 꺼내서 창으로 살짝 "
"찌르라고 했다! 아이들 두려워서 울고 조상은 웃었다... 하지만 왜? 무엇을 위해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Kennels/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKennels
msgctxt "0ba2c300-5774-40ac-927d-01c9c1b4ecfe"
msgid ""
"\"If warmblood want revenge, bring war, Fashor understand. Fashor ready to "
"fight, yes! But prefer warmblood talk to ancestor, take child and go in "
"peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"온혈 동물이 복수를 원하면 파셔는 이해한다. 파셔는 싸울 준비가 됐다! 하지만 온혈 동물은 조상과 대화하고 아이들 평화롭게 데려가라."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "d7c6fbcf-8ffd-4823-a1e2-437e8408883b"
msgid "\"What are you arguing about?\""
msgstr "\"뭐 때문에 다투고 있는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "990cfdf8-d62f-4b38-ab24-d10d7cfebdb1"
msgid "[Leave] \"I have no time for this.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이러고 있을 시간 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "efca9eb1-e0e0-4b6d-a789-791c7cd46f3e"
msgid "Convinced the gardeners lizardfolk to fear the ancestor spirits."
msgstr "정원사 도마뱀 인간을 설득해 조상의 영혼을 두려워하게 설득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "3b8bdfb9-5cab-43c6-916b-020454dbf4b9"
msgid ""
"\"You should listen to your ancestors. If you don't trust their wisdom, you "
"should at least avoid their wrath!\""
msgstr "\"조상들에게 귀 기울여야 해. 그들의 지혜를 믿지 않는다면 그들의 진노를 피할 수 없을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f15063a0-e05e-4825-bc0b-725eabc39d01"
msgid "Convinced the gardeners lizardfolk not to fear the ancestor spirits."
msgstr "정원사 도마뱀 인간을 설득해 조상의 영혼을 두려워하지 않게 설득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "e7311648-c69e-4746-a396-242da8f36ea5"
msgid "\"Tassath is right. You should think for yourself.\""
msgstr "\"태서스가 옳아. 스스로 생각하고 판단해야해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1bc54ab6-325c-479f-b39f-eeab676c5c2c"
msgid ""
"Convinced the gardeners lizardfolk to settle the dispute with a coin toss."
msgstr "정원사 도마뱀 인간을 설득해 동전 던지기로 결정하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "61ccd5b8-ba02-42c2-a613-e34573428514"
msgid "\"If you can't decide, just flip a coin.\""
msgstr "\"결정할 수 없다면 동전 던지기로 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d2b25578-33b3-442b-8a71-98bb7dea2ad7"
msgid "Murdered the gardeners lizardfolk."
msgstr "정원사 도마뱀 인간을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "b1d84e46-4768-4af5-98b5-a4a15ea5176b"
msgid "[Attack] \"You annoy me. I suppose I'll just have to kill you all.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"정말이지 짜증나는군. 아무래도 그냥 너희를 다죽여야 할것 같아 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_1
msgctxt "0bc8c8ca-11e8-4018-8437-b4aa0a310cd9"
msgid ""
"{n}Two lizardfolk stand near a small garden, arguing fiercely as they wave "
"their hands and lash the ground with their tails.{/n} \"What you say is "
"stupid, any fool understand it! Even warmblood!\" {n}The lizardfolk points "
"at you with his talony finger.{/n} \"Hey, you, warmblood! Come here and tell "
"this bonehead I speak truth!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두 마리의 도마뱀 인간은 작은 정원 근처에서 꼬리를 흔들면서 논쟁을 하고 있습니다.{/n} \"네가 하는 말은 어리석다. 바보라도 "
"그건 이해하겠다! 온혈 동물이라도!\" {n}도마뱀 인간은 발톱 달린 손가락으로 당신을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"이봐! 온혈 동물! 여기 "
"와서 이 멍청이에게 진실을 말해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_1
msgctxt "2013515b-c03f-49c7-95e0-f702f940b738"
msgid ""
"\"We two, Tassath and Shalur, make garden. Good garden, lots heal-herb. Then "
"Great Ancestor come. Tell us root out all heal-herb and plant dope-weed "
"instead! How can that be?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 둘은 타싸스와 샬루르다. 정원을 만들고 치료용 허브를 기른다. 그러면 위대한 조상이 온다. 우리에게 모든 치료용 허브를 뽑아서 "
"마약 씨앗을 뿌리라고 했다! 어떻게 그럴 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_2
msgctxt "16bc7650-ebc8-4475-aa02-591dd5ba9dd3"
msgid ""
"\"Disobey ancestor is wrong, ancestor must be respected! Ancestor wise, "
"knows better! We like small children, know nothing, yes! Must not argue, "
"must do as told!\""
msgstr ""
"\"조상에 대한 불복종은 잘못됐다. 조상은 반드시 존중받아야 한다! 조상은 현명하고 더 많이 안다! 우리는 작은 아이들 같아서 아무것도 "
"모른다! 다투지 말고 시키는 대로 해야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_1
msgctxt "7ab60a7b-b4f5-4d3b-a42c-7fb3fef2b4dc"
msgid ""
"\"Shalur maybe know nothing, but Tassath can use his head! Root out heal-"
"herb wrong — plant dope-weed wrong! Tassath think Great Ancestor eat too "
"much dope-weed himself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"샬루르는 아무것도 모르지만 타싸스는 머리를 쓸 줄 안다! 치료용 허브를 뽑는 것은 잘못됐어. 마약을 심는 것도! 타싸스는 위대한 "
"조상이 마약을 먹는거라고 생각한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_2
msgctxt "765df09c-c554-424a-ae00-2c72561acd31"
msgid ""
"{n}Tassath retracts his head apprehensively, while Shalur gives you a gloomy "
"nod.{/n} \"Here! Beware ancestor, respect ancestor! Even warmblood know it, "
"yes!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타싸스는 이해한다는 듯 끄덕이는 동안 샬루르는 당신에게 우울하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"이봐! 조상을 조심하고 존중해라! "
"온혈 동물이라도 그건 알아야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_1
msgctxt "44078aaa-cb82-4775-a9db-ffd57fa9db96"
msgid ""
"{n}Shalur mumbles, displeased, while Tassath lifts his finger in triumph.{/n}"
" \"See, yes? If ancestor tell go jump from big-big rock, you obey him too? "
"Ancestor not planted this garden, it not up to him what we do with it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}샬루르는 중얼거리며 풀이 죽지만 타싸스는 승리에 도취해 손가락을 듭니다.{/n} \"봤지? 조상이 바위에서 뛰어내리라고 하면 너는 "
"그대로 할 거야? 조상은 이 정원을 가꾸지 않는다. 그에게 달린 것이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_1
msgctxt "781c4eeb-62f0-483b-8561-eeec04191f7d"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk argue a little about who gets heads and who gets tails "
"before they finally flip a coin.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}도마뱀 인간은 누가 앞을 선택할지 서로 다투다가 마침내 동전을 던집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_1
msgctxt "71eb945f-1092-4e79-a9b2-b0c0b1a82298"
msgid ""
"\"Look, Tassath right! Coin tell the truth, yes! If ancestor want dope-weed, "
"let him plant it himself!\""
msgstr "\"타싸스가 맞다! 동전은 진실을 말한다! 조상이 마약을 원하면 그것을 심어야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkGardeners/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkGardner_2
msgctxt "823564b8-69b8-48df-9ca9-f9e7e16a0f93"
msgid ""
"\"Shalur told you, and you did not believe! Now coin tells you so! Stop "
"being stubborn and go root out your herbs, before something bad happen!\""
msgstr ""
"\"샬루르가 너에게 말했다. 너는 믿지 않았다! 이제 동전이 말한다! 멍청한 짓 그만두고 나쁜 일 생기기 전에 허브를 뽑아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "639afde0-d071-45c3-9bc7-4fcd74e3d05d"
msgid "\"Your tribe is holding a human child. I came to take him back.\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족은 인간 아이를 잡고 있어. 아이를 데리러 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9be0f782-d7c2-4aeb-a4ae-c8b123eae3fc"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "e1676fdb-b1dd-4725-8f6d-62a68163d2ba"
msgid "\"Tell me about your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"네 부족에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "843d7e91-a976-4dbf-9154-9c520e15188c"
msgid "\"Who is Stishchak?\""
msgstr "\"스티쉬차크는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "6769a808-38c0-41c4-a9dc-21e5d812f3de"
msgid ""
"\"I came for a peaceful negotiation, one chieftain to another. Your tribe is "
"holding a human child — I'm ready to pay for his return. I'd like to solve "
"this without resorting to violence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 리더 대 리더로써 평화로운 협상을 위해 왔다. 너희 부족은 인간 아이를 붙잡고 있다. 몸값은 가지고 왔다. 폭력을 일으키지 않고 "
"이 문제를 해결하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "dab01f81-51e2-44d5-99ab-f85815a26d4d"
msgid ""
"\"I've come to take our child back. Will you release him of your own free "
"will, or will I have to cut you down?\""
msgstr "\"나는 우리 아이를 다시 데리러 왔다. 너의 의지로 그를 풀어주겠나? 아니면 내가 너를 베어야 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "49819d47-cea3-47bc-b0ce-f7419b55aaf8"
msgid "[Attack] \"Your time has come, Chieftain.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너의 시간이 왔다. 족장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "dd56db92-a314-4164-b82e-f6c07ecbc18a"
msgid ""
"\"You and your tribe don't seem happy. Are you certain this Stishchak is "
"really your Great Ancestor and not some evil spirit pretending to be him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 너의 종족은 행복해보이지 않아. 시티쉬챠크가 정말로 너의 위대한 조상인게 확실한가? 혹시 위대한 조상임을 가장한 어떤 사악한 "
"영혼은 아니라고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "b8dd029d-90ec-40f0-bdb8-503dc76f6ac9"
msgid "\"Why did your tribe's rattler flee the village?\""
msgstr "\"왜 부족의 딸랑이가 마을을 떠났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "ff1bf746-275a-425e-a834-73cdd2b5ab8d"
msgid "[Attack] \"So be it.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그러면 그렇게 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "ec2048aa-0900-4e6f-9cbf-d47ce54d310c"
msgid "[Leave] \"I'm not here to fight. I'll leave.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 싸울 생각이 없다. 나는 떠날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "33a63442-af49-45f0-9195-f8d18f0c4e9f"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"I'll go to the Spirit Hut and talk to this Great Ancestor of yours."
"\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"영혼 오두막집에 가서 너의 위대한 조상과 이야기해보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "71caa76e-a487-469e-82d6-e78cf9c2fe4d"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'd hoped to settle this peacefully, but...\""
msgstr "[공격] \"평화롭게 해결하기를 바랐지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "1650b260-b175-4add-a325-b9ca4c09287d"
msgid "\"Let me ask you a question.\""
msgstr "\"질문 하나 할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "7cd3803f-c505-46ea-9fa6-e7de8b57d5be"
msgid "\"Thank you for the answers.\""
msgstr "\"답변해 주어 고맙군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_Vesket-EVIL_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fba3a103-ac17-4794-93d1-00869a5a7e61"
msgid "Scared the lizardfolk king."
msgstr "도마뱀 왕을 겁주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_Vesket-EVIL_Text
msgctxt "f4ce9500-5f14-45b9-97d0-ba6345dfcb4e"
msgid ""
"\"Listen here, Chieftain. I will cut off your hands, legs, and tail — and "
"then I'll do it to the rest of your tribe. When I'm done, I'll burn this "
"village to the ground with you still inside, and then I'll salt the earth so "
"nothing will grow here for the next hundred years.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 나는 네 팔다리와 꼬리를 잘라버릴 거야. 그런 다음 네 부족들도 똑같이 해주지. 내가 모두 끝나면 이 마을을 모두 불태워버릴 "
"거야. 그 다음에 이 땅에 소금을 뿌리면 앞으로 100년 동안 아무것도 성장하지 않을 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_Vesket-LAW_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1ac3250e-61a1-4b48-aff0-dad42210445c"
msgid "Convinced the lizardfolk king to accept help."
msgstr "도마뱀 왕이 도움을 받도록 설득했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Answer_Vesket-LAW_Text
msgctxt "dff06576-2560-496d-88f8-9d291b851922"
msgid ""
"\"You're unfit to be chieftain. The 'Great Ancestor' you've placed your "
"trust in is a monster. You're leading your tribe to ruin — let go of your "
"pride, and let me help you save your tribe before it's too late.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 족장이 될 자격이 없다. 네가 믿은 '위대한 조상'은 괴물이야. 너는 부족을 이끌어 파괴하는 거야. 자존심을 버리고 늦기 전에 "
"내가 네 부족을 도울 수 있게 해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "e8556974-2dd3-4646-8e63-a178c0987d63"
msgid ""
"{n}A sturdy lizardfolk is waiting for you in the hut. He's a head taller "
"than the rest of his tribe, and his well-muscled body is covered in scars, "
"displaying the experience of countless battles.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}튼튼한 도마뱀 인간이 오두막에서 당신을 기다리고 있습니다. 그의 머리는 부족의 나머지보다 더 크고 그의 다부진 몸은 흉터로 "
"뒤덮여있어 끝없는 전투의 경험을 보여줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "43e02bcc-1655-41ce-80ac-75d0a5f1a940"
msgid ""
"{n}It isn't easy to read the lizardfolk's body language, but his shallow "
"breathing and jerky movements are consistent with deep exhaustion. It's "
"possible the chieftain hasn't gotten a good night's sleep in a long "
"while.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}도마뱀의 바디 랭귀지를 읽는 것은 쉽지 않지만 그의 호흡과 움직임을 보니 지친 것 같습니다. 족장은 오랫동안 잠을 자지 못한 것 "
"같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "ab4e62da-44b2-4f69-ba8d-528db6f4eb53"
msgid ""
"\"What's that? Warmblood? Why you come? Vesket not call for you! Why you "
"here? Tell, quick!\""
msgstr "\"그게 뭐야? 온혈 동물? 왜 왔어? 베스켓은 너를 부르지 않았어! 왜 여기 왔지? 말해. 빨리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "6952f81e-5045-4d1a-a547-fce0de60280e"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain hisses loudly.{/n} \"You can't take warmblood youngling! "
"Great Stishchak claimed youngling for himself! You not anger Stishchak!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장은 큰 소리로 쉭쉭댑니다.{/n} \"너는 온혈 동물 새끼를 가져갈 수 없다! 위대한 스티쉬챠크는 아이를 요구했다! 너는 "
"스티쉬챠크를 화나게 하지 말아야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "a97fb82c-06cf-4740-baef-14dcc4bf533f"
msgid ""
"\"I Chieftain Vesket, king of Longtail Tribe! Warmblood not know me? Fine! "
"Soon, all know Vesket! Great Ancestor foretells I soon do great deeds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 긴꼬리 부족의 왕, 족장 베스켓이다! 온혈 동물은 나를 모르나? 좋아! 곧 모두가 베스켓을 알게 될 거다! 위대한 조상은 내가 "
"곧 위대한 일을 할 거라고 예언했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "53664178-f8ee-41ff-aaf9-bbf2bd967360"
msgid ""
"\"Longtails the greatest tribe! When world hatched from egg, Longtails first "
"to step here! The rest appeared later, from eggshell and dirt!\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴꼬리는 가장 위대한 부족이다! 알을 낳았을 때 긴꼬리가 세상에 처음 발을 들였다! 나머지 종족은 알껍질과 흙에서 태어났다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "086819b3-1600-4eab-ade3-39129c2738e4"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Stishchak is great! Too bad old Kagar not here — he sing songs about "
"him! Know this, warmblood: Stishchak hero among heroes! Earth under our feet "
"— Stishchak fish from the water and put on steady foundation! Moon rolling "
"over skies — Stishchak throw it there!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 스티쉬챠크는 대단하다! 카가르가 이곳에 없어서 아쉽군. 카가르가 그에 대한 노래를 불렀을텐데! 이건 알아둬라. 온혈 동물. "
"스티쉬챠크는 영웅 중의 영웅이다! 우리 발 밑의 대륙은 스티쉬챠크가 물에서 물고기를 낚아서 기초를 세웠다! 하늘을 굴러다니는 달은 "
"스티쉬챠크가 거기로 던졌기 때문이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "251e4ef6-20a7-42b1-a052-7c5de2682885"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain clenches his teeth and glares for a moment, silent, then "
"lowers his head.{/n} \"You are wrong about the Great Ancestor, but... "
"Chieftain Vesket submits. The youngling is in Spirit Hut, with the Great "
"Ancestor. If Great Ancestor let you, take him and leave.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장은 이를 악물고 침묵한 체 머리를 숙이고 노려봅니다.{/n} \"족장 베스켓은 항복했다. 온혈 동물은 베스켓의 멍청함으로부터 "
"긴꼬리를 구해라. 아이들은 영혼 오두막에 위대한 조상과 함께 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "75707cfb-3a11-4327-923a-1d647124dcdb"
msgid ""
"{n}Vesket can't hide the trembling in his knees.{/n} \"Youngling in Spirit "
"Hut,\" {n}he says in a hoarse voice.{/n} \"If Great Ancestor let you, take "
"him and leave.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}베스켓는 떨리는 무릎을 숨길 수는 없었습니다.{/n} \"아이는 영혼 오두막에 있다.\" {n}그는 쉰 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"위대한 조상이 너를 보내주면 그를 데려가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "460a6f21-a32a-4f0d-bab4-26e77f195240"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain frowns.{/n} \"Warmblood youngling in Spirit Hut with Great "
"Ancestor. Vesket can't give him away — not Vesket's to give. Go, talk to "
"Great Ancestor yourself. If you lucky, he give you youngling. If not, I no "
"help.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}대장은 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물 아이가 영혼 오두막의 위대한 조상과 함께 있다. 베스켓은 아이를 보내줄 수 없다. "
"베스켓은 가지 못한다. 가라. 위대한 조상과 가서 이야기해라. 네가 운이 좋다면 그가 아이를 줄 것이다. 그렇지 않다면 나는 도울 수 "
"없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "e02355c9-6129-4ccb-ac32-37dcac975fed"
msgid ""
"\"Can't. Stishchak took warmblood youngling for himself. Can't give him "
"away, can't trade him.\""
msgstr "\"할 수 없다. 스티쉬차크가 온혈 동물 아이를 데리고 있다. 아이를 보낼 수 없어서 협상할 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "138f1fd4-d064-4c03-a93e-73e635fcf834"
msgid ""
"{n}Chieftain Vesket locks eyes with you for a long time, then looks away.{/n}"
" \"Warmblood want scare me? Ha! Longtails eat a dozen warmbloods for lunch! "
"Take lousy youngling — Vesket not need him! He is in Spirit Hut. Take him "
"and leave at once, before Vesket become angry and change mind, yes!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장 베스켓은 오랫 동안 당신을 보고는 다른 곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물이 나를 겁먹이려는 건가? 하! 긴꼬리는 점심 식사로 "
"온혈 동물들을 잡아먹었다. 베스켓은 그를 원하지 않는다! 그는 영혼 오두막에 있다. 베스켓이 화가 나서 마음을 바꾸기 전에 그를 데려가서 "
"떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "839bf929-1aee-453c-a8ce-ae3a18fd893d"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain is silent for a long while.{/n} \"Old Kagar used to tell "
"that too. True, tribe scared. Could Chieftain Vesket be so wrong?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장은 오랫동안 침묵합니다.{/n} \"늙은 카가르도 그렇게 말하곤 했었다. 사실이다. 우리 부족은 겁 먹었다. 나 족장 베스켓이 "
"잘못된 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "0e34f1d4-3e11-4552-835c-7fd798726c27"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain's voice rises to a shout as he lashes the ground with his "
"tail.{/n} \"Lies! Lies! You not slander Great Ancestor!\""
msgstr "{n}대장의 목소리는 꼬리를 바닥에 내리면서 고함을 지릅니다.{/n} \"거짓말! 거짓말! 위대한 조상을 비방하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "9550bb83-9e37-42e1-8c84-feabdd4b3712"
msgid ""
"\"Old Kagar... lose mind, yes. Afraid of everyone. Tell if he stay, we kill "
"and eat him. Happens with old folks. Too bad, too bad. Kagar once know much, "
"sing ancient songs, teach whole tribe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"늙은 카가르... 미쳤다. 모두를 무서워한다. 그가 머물수 있는지 물어보면 우리는 그를 죽이고 먹겠다. 옛 주민들에게도 같은 일이 "
"일어났다. 안타깝다. 카가르는 많이 알아서 고대의 노래를 부르고 부족을 가르쳤다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "55cdfa71-d225-4878-92c6-9ecb3290557e"
msgid ""
"\"All woods, all swamps, all rivers — ours, yes! Longtail Empire own whole "
"world, from mountain roots to moon and stars!\""
msgstr "\"숲과 늪, 강은 우리 것이다! 긴꼬리 제국은 산에서 달과 별까지 세계를 지배했었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "09f6497d-9c65-4add-8ed8-abb9b0ce7e9b"
msgid ""
"\"Now, with great Stishchak back, Longtails be respected again, yes! Soon, "
"soon!\""
msgstr "\"위대한 스티쉬차크가 돌아오면 긴꼬리는 다시 존경받을 것이다..그래.. 머지않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "943ff5d5-8612-48ce-ab8d-582c088fa4b2"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain shakes his head.{/n} \"Vesket knows not who believe. Maybe "
"Vesket go crazy. Go to Spirit Hut, talk Stishchak. Learn truth yourself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장이 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"베스켓은 누구를 믿어야 할지 모르겠다. 아마 베스켓은 미쳐가는 것 같다. 영혼 오두막에 가서 "
"스티쉬차크와 이야기해라. 진실을 알아내라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "72a44715-0d3d-48d9-b793-30cfda9ba026"
msgid ""
"\"Long ago, it was... Now Longtail tribe's enemies strong. Live all over. "
"But Stishchak spirit come back! Tribe wage war on Thickskins, win easy! Joy, "
"celebration! Now, Longtails get fame again, like old days!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래 전에..긴꼬리 부족의 적은 강했다. 사방에 살고있었다.. 하지만 스티쉬챠크의 영혼이 돌아왔다! 부족은 두꺼운가죽과 싸워서 쉽게 "
"이겼다! 축하를 했다! 이제 긴꼬리 부족은 옛 시절의 명예를 다시 얻었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "e315b974-b31f-4a47-8bc4-908dfb25abfe"
msgid "\"Everyone, here! War with warmblood!\""
msgstr "\"모두 여기 와라! 온혈 동물과 전쟁이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "637440ed-ed09-4e88-937d-51a9de4e0737"
msgid "\"What else warmblood want? Go Spirit Hut. Talk Stishchak there!\""
msgstr "\"온혈 동물은 무엇을 원하지? 영혼 오두막으로 가라. Stishchak와 이야기해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "043addf1-c249-4a14-8bd6-1edf9569817b"
msgid ""
"{n}Chieftain Vesket bares his teeth.{/n} \"Warmblood threaten? Longtail "
"tribe not bow to force! Get your weapon and fight now, or leave forever!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장 베스켓은 이를 갑니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물이 위협을 하는 건가? 긴꼬리 부족은 힘에 무릎꿇지 않는다! 무기를 들고 싸워라. "
"아니면 영원히 떠나라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "9c9f4670-d8f0-4e0a-96a7-a44caa5ae2d4"
msgid ""
"\"Child stays in village. Chieftain's word stronger than rock! Leave, "
"warmblood — I not want see you anymore.\""
msgstr "\"아이는 마을에 머물고 있다. 대장의 말은 바위보다 단단하다! 떠나라. 온혈 동물. 나는 너를 다시 보지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "98e7024d-74b1-4a32-aaf9-f23af51176d1"
msgid "\"Ask. Chieftain Vesket allow.\""
msgstr "\"물어 봐라. 족장 베스켓이 허락한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "aefa14e7-1bfd-495e-a35a-eae397739363"
msgid "\"Chieftain Vesket generous today.\""
msgstr "\"오늘 족장 베스켓은 관대하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "da586fac-a9b6-4609-8410-bee21dd62200"
msgid ""
"\"It is amusing how eager some of the short-lived are to serve the dead.\""
msgstr "\"곧 죽을 것들이 죽은자를 섬기는데 저리 열심인걸 보면 참 재밌군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f638d786-5779-48ba-95a7-2d50c9098d23"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost quickly writes something down in his notebook.{/n} \"World "
"hatching from an egg... Longtail Empire... Mountain roots... Fascinating!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 노트에 무언가를 빠르게 적습니다.{/n} \"세계가 알을 부화하고... 긴꼬리 제국이... 산맥을... 매력적이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ac94482c-2d3b-4585-b6ab-cf2c35b9dc89"
msgid ""
"\"At last! I'm sick and tired of all their hissing! My hands have been "
"itching to punch that scaly mug!\""
msgstr "\"마침내! 나는 위협에 질렸다! 저 비늘 돋은 얼굴에 주먹을 날리고 싶다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cb178001-d423-4d1e-a791-b8ca58b6f59f"
msgid ""
"\"Look how brave he is, {Name}. The big chief isn't the least bit afraid of "
"us!\" {n}The half-orc inhales deeply.{/n} \"Why do I smell shit?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 얼마나 용감하지 보라고. {Name}. 족장은 우리를 두려워하지 않아!\" {n}하프오크는 깊이 숨을 들이쉽니다.{/n} \"왜 "
"똥냄새가 나는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "5f27d448-2252-4638-9f97-6feca6420b88"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk grinds his teeth.{/n} \"Chief Vesket is busy. No time for "
"talk. You want child — go take child!\""
msgstr "{n}도마뱀 인간은 이빨을 갑니다.{/n} \"족장 베스켓은 바쁘다. 이야기 할 시간 없다. 아이를 원하면 가서 찾아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkKingVesket/Cue_LizardfolkKickedOut_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "ffda2c9b-0043-4c09-bf70-733ad67fed55"
msgid ""
"\"And no come back!\" {n}Lizardfolk guards lead you out through the "
"gates.{/n}"
msgstr "\"돌아 오지마!\" {n}도마뱀 인간은 당신을 안내합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7c1a62c8-6cc3-4a7c-8837-9ab37959d8c3"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "73346472-1dd1-4220-9533-d3a833d24eaa"
msgid "\"Yes, I'm looking for a missing boy. Where is he?\""
msgstr "\"그래. 실종된 소년을 찾고 있어. 그는 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "cfdf0d39-e21b-49ca-b907-83783c24b93c"
msgid "\"Youngling? You have a human child here?\""
msgstr "\"아이? 여기 인간 아이가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "3d940ad8-7aef-47b5-bc6d-4436dfbe1b17"
msgid "\"You seem unhappy. Is something wrong?\""
msgstr "\"기분이 안좋아보이는데, 뭔가 잘못됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "6b70b6fc-5ad6-407e-8fa9-08112ffaef08"
msgid "\"Who do you believe me to be?\""
msgstr "\"너 내가 누구라고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "3293bb2b-1ecb-427e-b6c3-012c3f01d42b"
msgid "[Take Kagar to Count Shimmerglow] \"Follow me.\""
msgstr "[카가르를 쉬머글로우 백작에게 안내합니다] \"나를 따라와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "486af58a-aa40-49b2-a29b-7d7973affca4"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've killed your entire tribe. Now it's your turn!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너의 부족 모두를 죽였어. 이제 네 차례야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "f969c7d4-924f-4426-96e9-ac70ad84c0b7"
msgid "[Leave] \"Farewell.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "1e94a692-45fa-4b49-92eb-a942c6086d66"
msgid "\"Tell me about your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"네 부족에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "c763c93e-842c-4f5d-87c4-9990b953b360"
msgid "\"Why don't you go to the village? Were you banished?\""
msgstr "\"왜 마을에 가지 않아? 너 추방되었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0035_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0fa0017b-36fa-499a-9b15-ba26c42e1a86"
msgid "Delivered the lizardfolk rattler to the evil spirit."
msgstr "도마뱀 인간을 사악한 영혼에게 데려갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "4ff8f4d5-82d9-4720-8a24-395402c19363"
msgid ""
"[Take Kagar to Count Shimmerglow] \"The Great Ancestor ordered me to bring "
"you to him. Hurry.\""
msgstr "[카가르를 쉬머글로우 백작에게 안내합니다] \"위대한 조상이 너를 데려오라고 했다. 서둘러.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b2646a74-5c6c-42a4-b50c-4e0ad78e7eb2"
msgid "Helped the lizardfolk rattler to defeat an evil spirit."
msgstr "도마뱀 인간 딸랑이를 도와 악령을 물리쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "0c9a6da6-d1fd-43a9-83d1-8247e2d5d178"
msgid ""
"[Go to the Count with Kagar] \"You were right — an evil spirit is pretending "
"to be your Great Ancestor. We want to stop him — come with us!\""
msgstr "[카가르와 백작에게 갑니다] \"네가 옳았어. 사악한 영혼은 너의 위대한 조상인 척했어. 그를 막아야 해. 나와 함께 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "bbacb592-20d0-43be-81af-41c994b927a1"
msgid "[Leave] \"I have to go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "be0b74f8-ba09-4bb2-ac7c-b67ef5b3a7ad"
msgid ""
"\"People without history are like wild animals... Wise words. Like something "
"one of Irori's clerics might say in a sermon.\""
msgstr "\"역사가 없는 사람들은 야생 동물과 같다... 현명한 말이다 .이로리의 성직자가 설교에서 말한 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "ab8ae4fe-f17e-4039-b2f3-ef9cda9dadd8"
msgid "{n}An old lizardfolk is muttering something under his breath.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}늙은 도마뱀 인간은 무언가를 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "c3f44539-e015-4c53-bb47-4e8cadf406d3"
msgid ""
"{n}An old lizardfolk looks up at you with dim eyes.{/n} \"I know at once who "
"you is, warmblood. I know why you come, yes...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 도마뱀 인간은 흐릿한 눈으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"네가 누군지 단번에 알아봤다. 온혈 동물. 네가 왜 온지 알고 있어..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "1da9f8b8-29d7-4586-b041-67b7bffb048c"
msgid ""
"\"Inside village. Alive. For now. All old Kagar know. Kagar not go village "
"in long-long ago...\""
msgstr "\"마을 안이다. 살아있다. 지금은. 늙은 카가르는 모두 알고 있다. 카가르는 마을에 가지 않은지 오래되었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "34fef902-9a42-435e-82e9-9fd2603a5280"
msgid ""
"\"Kagar have no one. Kagar not go village in long-long ago. But youngling "
"there, yes. Still alive. For now.\""
msgstr "\"카가르는 아무도 없다. 카가르는 오래 전부터 마을에 가지 않았다. 하지만 거기에 아이 있다. 살아있다. 지금은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "34f3bb29-217e-425b-868e-816234a64fda"
msgid ""
"\"Old Kagar rattler. Play rattle, sing songs, tell tales. Kagar know many "
"things. Where tribe come, how live, who win...\""
msgstr ""
"\"늙은 딸랑이, 카가르라고 한다. 방울을 울리며 노래를 부르고 이야기를 한다. 카가르는 많은 것을 알고 있다. 부족이 어디서 왔고, "
"어떻게 살았고, 누가 승리했는지..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "8a6e9e1b-0727-4e03-9879-56153054b00e"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man sighs heavily.{/n} \"Around dozen moon ago, on Forbidden "
"Island in middle {g|Candlemere}Candlemere lake{/g}, bright light appear. "
"Then spirit come to Chieftain Vesket. Tell he Great Ancestor, invincible "
"hero Strishchak. Vesket believe.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 도마뱀인간은 깊은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"열 달 전쯤에 {g|Candlemere} 캔들미어 호수{/g}의 한가운데 있는 "
"금단의 섬에서 밝은 빛이 나타났다. 그리곤 한 영혼이 족장 베스켓에게 찾아왔다. 그 영혼이 말하길 자신은 위대한 조상, 무적의 영웅 "
"스트리쉬챠크라고 말했다. 베스켓은 그말을 믿었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "aba780f1-1298-449c-9ce0-017173655915"
msgid ""
"\"You look for your youngling, yes? He here. Alive. Other time, we eat him "
"long ago, but Longtail tribe gone crazy. Maybe you save him. Maybe not. "
"Maybe too late save anyone, yes...\""
msgstr ""
"\"어린 아이를 찾고 있지? 그는 여기 있다. 살아있다. 다른 때 같았으면 이미 잡아 먹었겠지만 긴꼬리 부족은 지금 미쳐있다. 네가 그를 "
"구할 수 있다. 구하지 못할 수도. 아마 구하기에는 너무 늦은 걸지도... 그래..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "7cac337e-cedd-495d-b201-4b7373d377ad"
msgid ""
"\"You Ashshas-ta-ha. Our death. You take whole tribe — take old Kagar now!\""
msgstr "\"아스샤스타하. 우리의 죽음. 너는 모든 부족을 데려간다. 늙은 카가르 지금 데려간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "0158be7f-c525-49cc-abbc-313742cc9c97"
msgid ""
"\"Wait...\" {n}the old man says as you turn away.{/n} \"Why go? Why leave "
"old Kagar alive?\""
msgstr ""
"\"기다려...\" {n}늙은 도마뱀인간은 당신이 등을 돌리자 말합니다.{/n} \"왜 그냥 가지? 왜 카가르를 살아있는 채로 두는 거야?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "7529cf0e-3548-4bb9-972a-985bc803c173"
msgid ""
"\"Not banish, no. Kagar flee on own. Evil spirit come to tribe, pretend be "
"Great Ancestor, destroy Longtails. Chieftain believed spirit — tribe "
"believed chieftain. Old Kagar only one nobody believes, yes...\""
msgstr ""
"\"추방당하지 않았다. 카가르는 스스로 도망쳤다. 사악한 영혼이 우리 부족에게 찾아와서 위대한 조상인 척 행세를하며 긴꼬리 부족을 "
"파괴했다. 대장은 영혼을 믿는다. 부족은 대장을 믿는다. 늙은 카가르만 유일하게 누구도 믿지 않는다. 그래..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "5dca60ce-ca95-48bc-bfc0-4efd261717c9"
msgid ""
"\"People without history like wild animal. One day alive, next day dead. "
"Kagar keep memory, tell stories to young.\""
msgstr ""
"\"역사가 없는 자는 야생 동물과 같다. 지금은 살아도, 내일은 죽는다. 카가르는 기억을 간직하고 이야기를 아이들에게 전한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "29ef65d5-03b4-40b5-bc6e-dbc400256a37"
msgid ""
"\"Lots to tell about Longtail tribe. Old, old tribe. Warmbloods not come "
"yet, while Longtails built great empire, yes! Warmblood come and go without "
"trace, while Longtails stay here as long as moon rides skies. Tales tell so. "
"That what Kagar sing to tribe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴꼬리 부족에 대해선 할 이야기가 많다. 아주 오래오래된 부족이다. 긴꼬리 부족이 위대한 제국을 만들던 때, 온혈인간들은 아직 세상에 "
"나오지도 않았다 . 온혈 동물들이 자취 없이 오고 갈 동안, 우리 긴꼬리 부족은 달이 하늘에 떠 있는 한 이곳에 머문다. 전해오는 "
"이야기가 그렇게 말한다. 카가르가 이 노래를 부족들에게 불러준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "1526604c-8692-403a-a7a5-c551b43a7b84"
msgid ""
"\"If tell truth, Longtails small tribe. Wage war with Thickskins for long "
"time, rarely won. If not make peace with warmbloods, if not learn their "
"language and buy their sharp iron, maybe tribe die long ago, yes...\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실을 말하면, 긴꼬리는 작은 부족이다. 두꺼운 가죽 부족과 오랜 시간동안 전쟁을 해서 좀처럼 이기지 못했다. 온혈 동물과 평화를 "
"지키지 않으면 그들의 언어를 배우지 않거나 날카로운 창을 사지 않으면 부족은 오래 전에 죽었을 것이다.. 그래..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "77b0c528-633e-468c-aad0-984a54cbc2f7"
msgid ""
"\"Spirit tell now we win everyone. True, every battle with Thickskins, they "
"freeze in place or get scared and run! Vesket say we now return old glory. "
"But spirit demand odd things. Tribe scared, not understand...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 영혼은 이제부터 우리는 모두를 이긴다고 말했다. 정말로, 두꺼운 가죽과의 모든 전투에서 그들은 얼어붙어서 겁먹고는 도망갔다! "
"베스켓은 우리에게 과거의 영광이 다시 돌아온거라고 말했다. 하지만 영혼은 이상한 것들을 원하기 시작했다. 부족은 겁을 먹었고 이해하지 "
"못했다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "f6b55b62-d050-4333-a92e-88501c216bd0"
msgid ""
"\"Old Kagar think, that not ancestor, that evil spirit. Tribe in fear, and "
"spirit eat fear, become very-very strong, yes! Eat tribe from within. But "
"Vesket trust spirit, do what spirit order. And tribe afraid but listen to "
"chieftain. How save such stupid tribe?\""
msgstr ""
"\"늙은 카가르는 그것이 조상이 아니라 사악한 영혼이라 생각했다. 부족은 공포에 질렸고, 영혼은 공포를 먹고, 아주아주 강력해졌다. "
"부족을 안에서부터 갉아 먹은 것이다. 하지만 베스켓은 영혼을 여전히 믿고 영혼이 시키는 일을 한다. 그리고 부족은 두려워하면서도 족장의 "
"말을 듣는다. 그런 멍청한 부족을 어떻게 구할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "eb39f029-72fb-4137-acc6-c5b5df91f12e"
msgid ""
"\"Now spirit call himself Great Ancestor, live in Spirit Hut, and tribe go "
"mad. Can Longtails be saved? Kagar not know...\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금은 자신 스스로를 위대한 조상이라고 부르는 한 영혼이 영혼 오두막에 살고 있다. 그리고 부족은 미쳐간다. 긴꼬리 부족이 구원을 "
"받을 수 있을까? 카가르는 알지 못한다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "2fbc049b-758d-4290-959e-babdf7bafcb5"
msgid ""
"\"Kagar know in heart that Great Ancestor is false — Kagar wish him dead! "
"Flee from village, live in woods. Walk around village, sing songs, try call "
"to tribe's wisdom... but where that wisdom?\" {n}The old lizardfolk waves "
"his hand, emphasizing his frustration.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"카가르는 위대한 조상이 거짓이라는 것을 마음 속으로 알고 있었다. 카가르는 그가 죽기를 바란다! 마을에서 도망쳐 숲에서 산다. 마을 "
"주위를 돌며 노래를 부르고 부족의 지혜를 전한다... 하지만 지혜가 어디에 있지?\" {n}늙은 도마뱀 인간은 손을 흔들며 자신의 "
"좌절감을 강조합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "786ed1e0-c910-4355-84bc-e03b07086e79"
msgid ""
"\"Kagar know magic. If come to Spirit Hut, can make evil spirit visible! But "
"spirit know too. If Kagar enter village, he not live long.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카가르는 마법을 안다. 영혼 오두막으로 온다면 사악한 영혼을 눈에 보이게 할 수 있다! 하지만 영혼도 그걸 알고 있다. 카가르가 "
"마을에 들어간다면, 사악한 영혼은 오래 살지 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "94a54356-1083-4c74-a21b-b78043a0d807"
msgid "\"Well, must be fate of tribe. Lead on, warmblood.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 부족의 운명이 되어야 한다. 안내해라. 온혈 동물.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "1947832d-c61d-473c-94f3-f69e9d59d2bb"
msgid ""
"\"Listen carefully, warmblood. When you come Spirit Hut, not be scared. Old "
"Kagar make magic there. Evil spirit become visible. Then you hit it! Main "
"thing is not be scared, yes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 들어라. 온혈 동물. 영혼 오두막에 가면 겁먹지 말아라. 늙은 카가르는 거기서 마법 쓴다. 악령이 보일 것이다. 그러면 공격해라! "
"중요한 것은 겁먹지 않는 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "79383b5d-6e35-4a56-87c3-0abfcef5b75d"
msgid "\"Well, warmblood, lead way!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 온혈 동물. 안내해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9a6fa76e-9df0-44e1-856e-3bb8062984a6"
msgid ""
"\"Your words are wise. You know I'm a rattler too! We call it a bard. Will "
"you sing me the songs of your tribe? I can sing you ours!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 현명하구나. 나도 딸랑이야! 우리는 음유시인이라고 부르지. 나에게 너희 부족의 노래를 들려줄래? 나도 노래를 불러줄 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "f79a7e37-f155-46b1-8941-c5be23a8dca5"
msgid "\"Bad time for song. Need save tribe now. Then can sing.\""
msgstr "\"노래하기에는 때가 나쁘다. 부족을 구해야 한다. 그러면 노래한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "515573fb-56e9-4a19-bca5-fb5fbe025cdd"
msgid ""
"\"Longtail no worship warmblood gods. But truth is truth, wisdom is wisdom. "
"History is history.\""
msgstr "\"긴꼬리 부족은 온혈 동물 신을 믿지 않는다. 하지만 진실은 진실이고 지혜는 지혜다. 역사는 역사다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_LizardRattlerConspire_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "1fb5aa6c-e0fa-49eb-9835-061c9d283a2f"
msgid ""
"{n}The dark lizardfolk's eyes light up.{/n} \"A-a-ah, Kagar knew! There "
"still hope for Longtail tribe!\""
msgstr "{n}어두운 도마뱀 인간의 눈은 빛납니다.{/n} \"아! 카가르는 알고 있었다! 긴꼬리 부족에게 희망은 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_LizardRattlerKill_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "ad2ffc63-6e3e-4c6f-9b9b-046536cbe933"
msgid ""
"{n}Kagar looks at you with a sneer.{/n} \"Thickskin tribe tell not trust "
"warmbloods. Tell us, you can be friends with warmbloods as much as want, but "
"they betray and destroy. Kagar not believed. Seems Thickskins were right.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카가르는 당신을 비웃는 눈으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"두꺼운 가죽 부족은 온혈 동물을 믿지 않는다고 말한다. 항상 말하길, 온혈 "
"동물과 얼마든 친구가 될 수 있지만 온혈동물들은 배반하고 파괴할뿐이라고 한다. 카가르는 믿지 않았다. 두꺼운 가죽 부족의 말이 옳았을수도."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_LizardRattlerLast_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "52a48b3b-a850-42d6-8251-d8382515974f"
msgid "{n}The old lizardfolk follows you silently and obediently.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}늙은 도마뱀 인간은 당신을 말없이 순순히 따라갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattler/Cue_Rattler-greeting_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "1c452455-5a5d-49c9-bbe8-cb28ec3e52b6"
msgid ""
"{n}An old lizardfolk is wandering outside the village walls. He stares at "
"you with shiny, beady black eyes.{/n} \"Warmblood... Old Kagar knew you "
"come, yes!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}한 늙은 도마뱀 종족이 마을 담장 밖을 배회하고 있습니다. 그가 당신을 빛나는 검은 눈으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물... "
"늙은 카가르는 네가 올 줄 알고있었다! 그래..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "9795a963-eb32-400f-98e6-d785dc8b7244"
msgid "\"What will happen to your tribe now?\""
msgstr "\"네 부족은 이제 어떻게 되는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "610482b6-f065-466f-aef7-92fe4ba578eb"
msgid ""
"\"Your tribe has taken a huge blow. If you wish, we could give you shelter "
"in one of our towns.\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족은 큰 타격을 입었다. 원한다면 우리 마을 중 하나에서 너희에게 피난처를 제공할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9503f597-c0f0-4719-9d53-09e81d33f2c0"
msgid "Killed the lizardfolk rattler."
msgstr "도마뱀 인간 딸랑이를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2a86fce0-f278-4fa7-89aa-9bbfff08125b"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I've decided not to help you after all. Far better to destroy you "
"here and now.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"생각해보니, 너희를 돕지 않기로 결정했어. 지금 여기서 너희를 싹다 죽이는게 훨씬 나을꺼같거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "9ebda15c-f926-4c34-99b0-728321cfec72"
msgid "[Leave] \"Farewell.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "4d85129e-7848-402f-8229-528c73a25172"
msgid ""
"\"Warmblood save Longtail tribe from huge evil! May sun and moon bless "
"warmblood! May {mf|his|her} ancesters smile always at {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"온혈 동물은 긴꼬리 부족을 거대한 악에서 구해내었다! 해와 달이 온혈 동물을 축복하길! 네 조상이 항상 너에게 웃음을 짓길 바란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "701c019b-ba3e-4611-b5f6-8fdc39d6cdc6"
msgid ""
"\"Kagar not know. Damage too big. We stay in village, not survive long. Need "
"go somewhere away from Thickskins, look for new place to live.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카가르는 알지 못한다. 큰 피해를 입었다. 우리는 마을에 머물지만 오래 생존은 못한다. 두꺼운 가죽을 피해 어딘가로 가서 살 곳을 "
"찾아야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "9d376f75-9bfc-4386-a602-54b458372b98"
msgid ""
"\"Warmblood done lots for Longtails. But we not take too many gifts, yes. "
"Otherwise, we lose our heart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"온혈 동물은 긴꼬리를 위해 이미 많은 일을 해주었다. 우리는 너희의 선물을 너무 많이 받아선 안된다. 그렇지 않으면 우리 마음을 "
"잃게된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardfolkRattlerThanks/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "e61a3bef-5d31-4314-a96f-12623c40df6a"
msgid ""
"\"Who we become in your big cities? Beggars? Vermin, like rats? We need find "
"our own path, yes.\""
msgstr "\"너의 도시에서 우리는 어떻게 되지? 거지? 쥐 같은 해충인가? 우리는 우리의 길을 찾길 원한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "85bd22a7-b206-411d-ab30-83450636d353"
msgid "\"Where's your village?\""
msgstr "\"네 마을은 어디있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "50db9978-80be-4757-ba48-6cf3276e03e9"
msgid "\"Why were you fighting?\""
msgstr "\"왜 싸우고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b6ec2ab4-8a64-4b7e-b729-357851be48b3"
msgid "Healed the wounded lizardfolk warrior."
msgstr "부상당한 도마뱀 전사를 치료했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "4e958449-6865-41b9-9bcc-9ab6699e31bb"
msgid "[Heal Rashor's wound] \"You're bleeding. Let me help you.\""
msgstr "[라셔의 상처를 치료합니다] \"너 피가 나. 내가 돕겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "13057e2a-2bf2-4f11-86e0-28f60f214584"
msgid "Killed the wounded lizardfolk warrior for no reason."
msgstr "아무 이유없이 부상당한 도마뱀 전사를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e81f50d6-77e9-4112-9747-c45462716658"
msgid "[Attack] \"Don't relax yet!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"아직 긴장 풀지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ba7ab4e3-dd12-4c6e-90a0-7d706f39ddec"
msgid "[Leave] \"Farewell.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Lizardfolk_Rashor
msgctxt "c3757556-68db-4261-9c75-4640515a6081"
msgid ""
"{n}Exhausted from the battle, the lizardfolk breathes heavily as a shallow "
"wound on his shoulder continues to bleed.{/n} \"Warmblood save Rashor. "
"Rashor owe warmblood his life. Have nothing to thank now. Come to village, "
"Rashor thank properly.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}전투에서 지쳐서 도마뱀 인간은 어깨의 얕은 상처에서 계속 피가 흘러 심하게 숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"온혈 동물이 라셔를 구했다. "
"라셔는 온혈 동물에게 목숨 빚졌다. 지금은 보답할 것 없다. 너희 마을에 오면 라셔가 보답하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Lizardfolk_Rashor
msgctxt "a8da1ab6-85f8-463f-9433-620ba3cb0d40"
msgid ""
"\"Near gleaming lake, where river flows... Rashor forget how warmbloods call "
"it... Where swamps are. Easy find, yes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"강이 흐르는 빛나는 호수 근처... 라셔는 온혈 동물 어떻게 부르는지 잊어버렸다... 늪지가 있는 곳이다. 쉽게 찾을 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Lizardfolk_Rashor
msgctxt "205d019f-98d8-4458-ae0c-67446bb32033"
msgid ""
"\"Longtail tribe not enemy to warmbloods. We speak your language, we trade. "
"Sometimes we eat traveler or two, but with no hate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴꼬리 부족은 온혈 동물의 적이 아니다. 우리는 너희 언어를 사용하고 무역한다. 때때로 우리는 여행자 한두명을 먹지만 싫어서 그런 것 "
"아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Lizardfolk_Rashor
msgctxt "3de49b67-8169-4fdf-a898-6a8741ccb865"
msgid ""
"\"Thickskin tribe not like us. They hate warmbloods — not speak their "
"language, raze their villages, yes! They say must eat all warmbloods and "
"lizardfolk will rule the earth as in times of old.\""
msgstr ""
"\"두꺼운 가죽 부족은 우리 좋아하지 않는다. 그들은 온혈 동물 싫어한다. 온혈 동물 언어 쓰지 않고 마을 쓸어버린다. 그들은 온혈 동물 "
"모두 잡아먹어서 도마뱀 인간이 옛날처럼 이 땅 지배하려고 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Lizardfolk_Rashor
msgctxt "d76e4758-1e34-434b-8242-841f7d92e4a8"
msgid ""
"\"Thickskin say Longtail sold hearts to warmbloods, say that why we become "
"sick and lose scales soon-soon. That why we fight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"두꺼운 가죽은 긴꼬리가 온혈 동물에게 마음이 팔렸다고 우리가 미쳐서 비늘도 떨어지는 거 아니냐고 말한다. 그래서 우리 싸운다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardmenPatrol/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Lizardfolk_Rashor
msgctxt "900d0b49-2b6d-45dd-824d-df9018e9b965"
msgid ""
"{n}The lizardfolk hisses gratefully.{/n} \"Let always be peace between our "
"two tribes, yes!\""
msgstr "{n}도마뱀 인간은 감사한 듯 쉭쉭거립니다.{/n} \"항상 우리 두 부족 사이의 평화를 보전하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardsConfrontation/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c40d5625-663e-42e9-9038-bcc69bc8f2f1"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear a loud altercation from the street. In the middle of the "
"village, Kagar the Rattler and Chieftain Vesket are yelling at each "
"other.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}거리에서 시끄러운 언쟁이 들립니다. 마을의 한가운데에서 카가르 딸랑이와 족장 베스켓이 서로에게 소리 지르고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardsConfrontation/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "0b75c03c-b8df-4a50-9d5b-22f78d399d3e"
msgid ""
"\"You don't understand, bonehead! There no Stishchak! Evil spirit trick you, "
"and you believe like stupid child! You almost destroy whole tribe!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 이해하지 못한다. 멍청이! Stishchak은 없어! 사악한 영혼이 너를 속이고 너는 바보 같이 믿는다! 너는 모든 부족을 "
"멸망시킨다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardsConfrontation/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "db3b5eed-c3df-4466-941a-15c34abec4f1"
msgid ""
"\"Stishchak lead Longtails to victory! We conquer all, and all be scared of "
"us! Just a little more, I capture all lands, build great empire. Like old "
"times! Like your song tells, from big water to high mountain!\""
msgstr ""
"\"Stishchak은 긴꼬리 부족을 승리로 이끌어 냈다! 우리는 모두를 정복하고 모두가 우리를 두려워 한다! 조금만 더 하면 나는 모든 "
"땅을 지배하고 위대한 제국 세운다. 예전처럼! 너의 노래처럼 큰 물에서 높은 산까지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/LizardsConfrontation/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "494452e3-e91e-4eb5-b094-de694a542e91"
msgid ""
"{n}Seeing you, Vesket bares his teeth.{/n} \"Traitor! You work with "
"warmblood! To kill Great Ancestor! Never forget! Revenge! Revenge!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 보자 베스켓은 이를 갑니다.{/n} \"배신자! 너는 온혈 동물과 일한다! 위대한 조상을 죽이기 위해서! 결코 잊지 마라! "
"복수! 복수!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "7787103c-809a-4ed9-b2e4-f721f3346983"
msgid "\"Who or what exactly am I talking to?\""
msgstr "\"내가 지금 누구랑 말하고 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "7a785062-33a7-4542-9e60-25c445852978"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b1cd6f2d-2325-40a0-a96c-91c7d704de51"
msgid "\"Release the child immediately!\""
msgstr "\"즉시 아이를 풀어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "d85b87ce-e0b6-4612-b62d-f23af16a1b73"
msgid "[Leave] \"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "630c3c24-78de-4c46-98c7-d0565e10edbf"
msgid ""
"[Use magic to make the spirit visible and attack] \"I don't negotiate with "
"monsters!\""
msgstr "[마법을 사용해서 영혼을 보이게 하고 공격합니다] \"나는 괴물과 협상하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "aba485d9-e921-461c-b877-d93cf90d5e40"
msgid "\"Why do you need this child?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 아이가 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "08debe37-826a-409f-a8c2-f67169d73439"
msgid "\"Why do you need the rattler?\""
msgstr "\"왜 딸랑이가 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "d31c4fa8-6532-4aa1-916a-a68019e138d8"
msgid "\"Maybe we can strike some other deal?\""
msgstr "\"우리 다른 협상을 할 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "cdd91a80-a0b2-43dd-909c-97fe9f6c4f91"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be afraid, Tig. We'll get you out of here. Your mother loves you and "
"is waiting for your return.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무서워 할 필요 없어. 티그. 우리가 너를 여기서 꺼내줄 거야. 너희 엄마는 너를 사랑하고 네가 돌아오기를 기다리고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "d71be466-8c9d-43b5-8e18-232975e1e681"
msgid ""
"\"Who are you? A ghost? Evil spirit? I need to know who I'm dealing with.\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지? 유령? 사악한 영혼? 내가 누구와 이야기하고 있는지 알아야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "7f97ea9a-51fc-4ce9-b9b2-49b61ca536eb"
msgid ""
"\"And what influential personage would that be? If you mean a god, I don't "
"know of any gods in the world matching that description.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 어떤 저명한 인사 이지? 만약 신을 의미한다면 나는 그 묘사와 일치하는 어떠한 신도 알지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "398d1715-0ce2-4728-b749-b17815ebaf13"
msgid ""
"\"Now, now, shame on you! You burst into my village, kill all my lizards... "
"Such barbarism!\""
msgstr "\"부끄러운 줄 알아! 너는 내 마을에 침입해서 모든 도마뱀을 죽였어... 이 야만인!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "83f3abbf-35b5-499a-988b-4734f1888e7b"
msgid ""
"{n}A young boy stands in the middle of the hut. He's pale, and his eyes are "
"wide and frantic, but when he opens his mouth, a much older voice emerges, "
"confident and derisive.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}어린 소년이 오두막의 한가운데에 서있습니다. 그는 창백하고 그의 큰 눈은 겁에 질렸지만 그가 입을 열자 성숙한 목소리가 "
"나옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "522d8164-969d-4b12-bff4-1ccbded5a86e"
msgid ""
"\"Kneel before your Great Ancestor, mortals! Or I'll punish yooouuu!\" {n}"
"The child bursts into spooky laughter.{/n} \"All right, enough games.\""
msgstr ""
"\"위대한 조상 앞에서 무릎 꿇어라! 필멸자여! 아니면 너를 처벌할 테다!\" {n}아이는 으스스한 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"좋아. "
"놀이는 이 정도만 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "a7365c1f-4bc0-4a65-8d48-81cb24f70448"
msgid "\"I understand you're here to take the boy?\""
msgstr "\"소년을 데려가려고 여기 온것 같군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "e4bc79c2-1903-43ef-949e-e28d8c4e4aa4"
msgid ""
"\"You can call me the Count Shimmerglow — 'Your Excellency' to my friends. I "
"own this village, and all these foolish lizards. You wouldn't want to get on "
"my bad side.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 쉬머글로우 백작이라고 한다. 편하게 각하라고 부르지. 나는 이 마을과 어리석은 도마뱀들의 주인이다. 넌 나와 적이 되는 것을 "
"원치 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "a049d2b9-d703-4db7-a378-fe4ff3b034fe"
msgid ""
"\"Enjoying myself. These gullible lizards obey my every word! And I do my "
"best to make their lives a living hell so I can feed on their fear, pain, "
"and shame — all the most delectable emotions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"즐기는 중이지. 이 잘 속는 도마뱀들은 내 말 한마디에 다 복종한다! 난 그들의 삶을 살아 있는 지옥으로 만들기 위해 최선을 다하고 "
"있다. 그래야 그들의 공포, 고통, 수치심같은 가장 맛있는 감정들을 먹고 살 수 있기 때문이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "934091a0-5bd4-44af-a92f-8815d7ee5a15"
msgid ""
"\"Before you arrived, I was enjoying myself, feeding on the pain and terror "
"of these naïve lizards. The massacre you committed was something like a "
"final banquet for me — it was plentiful, yes, but now I'm left without a "
"steady food source... except, of course, for this fine young lad!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 도착하기 전에 나는 순진한 도마뱀들의 고통과 공포를 먹으며 만족하고 있었다. 네가 저지른 대학살은 나에게는 잔치 같은 것이었지. "
"정말 많았지만 나에게는 꾸준한 영양분이 없어... 이 어린 아이를 제외하고 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "327a949b-9113-48cf-89e6-7b571c0e3a16"
msgid ""
"\"The deep, primal terror of these barbarians makes for a heavy and "
"satisfying meal, but there's no spice to it — it's too plain. You see, I'm a "
"connoisseur by nature — sometimes I yearn for something sweet, something "
"tender. And this child's fear makes for just such a delightful dessert!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 야만인들의 원초적인 공포는 영양가 높은 만족스러운 음식이지만 너무 싱거웠다. 나는 타고난 미식가이거든. 가끔 달콤하고 부드러운 "
"것이 좋아. 그리고 아이들의 공포는 맛있는 디저트와 같다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "1eb148e8-9c7e-4d97-b332-b879893467f2"
msgid ""
"\"How rude! First you raze my village, and now you try to take my last sweet "
"morsel of nourishment? Such times we live in... Well, all right. I suppose "
"we can make a deal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 무례하군! 내 마을을 불태우고는 나의 마지막 영양분을 가져가려 하는 건가? 나 때는 말이야... 좋아. 거래를 할 때가 되었군."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "02dd27d6-05ab-46dc-9e4f-9f784264e02f"
msgid ""
"\"Are you this rude to everyone you visit? All right, you want me to set the "
"boy free? It's negotiable. You'll need to provide me something of value in "
"return, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"\"방문하는 모든 사람에게 이렇게 무례한 거야? 좋아. 그 아이를 풀어달라는 거지? 협상을 하지. 그렇다면 그 대가로 나에게 가치있는 "
"것을 제공해야 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "4915a0dd-77a3-4e9f-8b42-2a478dc73acc"
msgid ""
"\"The boy was just a whim. I don't mind parting with him so long as you "
"provide me something more valuable in return... say, an old lizardfolk? A "
"rattler, they called him. He walks around outside the village regularly. "
"Bring him here — alive — and I'll release the child.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 아이는 그냥 내 변덕에 불과했다. 내게 더 가치있는 것을 준다면 이 아이와 헤어져도 상관 없다... 늙은 도마뱀 인간은 어떨까? "
"그들은 딸랑이라고 부르지. 그는 가끔 마을 밖을 돌아다닌다. 그를 산 채로 여기에 데려와라. 그러면 아이를 풀어줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "1c67695b-0ee5-4b06-aaa1-b457f919a681"
msgid ""
"{n}The boy laughs again, the same unnatural laugh.{/n} \"Frankly, I wasn't "
"planning to part with the boy without some additional offering from you, but "
"your speech before the chieftain was beyond expectation! It's been so long "
"since I last tasted such deep, primal, all-consuming terror!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소년은 다시 부자연스런 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"솔직히 너에게서 무언가 얻지 않는다면 이 아이와 헤어질 생각이 없다. 하지만 "
"대장 앞에서 한 너의 연설은 기대 이상이었다! 그렇게 깊고, 원시적인 공포를 맛보았던 것은 오래되었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "5d7775cf-6352-4bed-ab59-caa40e97d451"
msgid ""
"\"You really are an unpleasant guest, you know? That inspiring speech of "
"yours to the chieftain has alleviated almost all of the tribe's fear, and "
"now you want to take even my final delicacy from me? Tch, humans... All "
"right. I suppose there's still a chance to settle this peacefully.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 정말로 불쾌한 손님이구나. 대장에게 한 너의 연설은 부족의 공포를 완화시켰고 내 마지막 영양분인 아이를 데려가겠다고? "
"인간이란... 좋다. 나는 평화적으로 해결할 수있는 기회가 있다고 생각한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "babc69cc-0275-4983-9aa3-cc276fbdc2c0"
msgid ""
"\"I've grown tired of the old lizard and his rattle. His songs drain the "
"fear from the tribe. However, I can sense that he fears me as well! Mmm, "
"yes, that sounds tasty. I'll take great joy in feeding off his final fear!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그 늙은 도마뱀과 그의 딸랑이짓에 지쳤다. 그의 노래는 부족으로부터 공포를 빼앗는다. 하지만 그가 나를 두려워한다는 것을 느낄 "
"수있다. 맛있을 것 같구나. 그의 마지막 두려움을 맛있게 먹겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "c0c6128f-58e5-459c-b748-a28411df2fb2"
msgid ""
"\"No, no, no. You want to haggle, try the marketplace. My terms are "
"nonnegotiable. If you want the child, bring me the old rattler.\""
msgstr "\"안돼. 흥정하려면 시장에나 가라. 내 조건은 협상 불가다. 아이를 원한다면 나에게 늙은 딸랑이를 데려와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "5bc3826e-d6e4-4110-9adb-fd9a4d0e9967"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, and here's the old lizard now. Vesket? Do kill him for me, please.\""
msgstr "\"여기 늙은 도마뱀이 왔군. 베스켓? 날 위해 그를 죽여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "45f33b28-b877-45b8-ab6e-8957b1e5d3d7"
msgid ""
"\"Stop that!\" {n}The voice coming from the boy's mouth is tinged with "
"irritation, but the boy's eyes soften with relief and gratitude.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그만!\" {n}소년의 입에서 나오는 목소리는 긴장했지만 그의 눈빛은 안도와 감사로 부드럽습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "236cab58-3870-45df-a414-71fe18801a4e"
msgid ""
"\"Excellent, excellent. Well, a deal is a deal — the boy is yours!\" {n}The "
"boy gasps, and his eyes fill with tears. The old rattler falls to his knees, "
"trembling, and begins to moan.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"훌륭하다. 거래는 거래니까. 아이는 네 것이다!\" {n}소년은 헐떡였고 눈에는 눈물이 흘러 넘칩니다. 늙은 딸랑이는 무릎을 꿇고 "
"신음하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "8a5b687e-bed7-478d-bc36-e0d7a6807607"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks to you, he's the last lizard here, and I need to eat before I leave "
"this area. My choices are limited: the old lizard, or the boy. Now, you're a "
"bloodthirsty one, and I respect that, but if you're trying to save this "
"child, you'll want to restrain yourself a bit and bring the old lizard to me "
"alive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고맙다. 이곳을 떠나기 전에 나는 마지막으로 도마뱀을 먹고 싶다. 나의 선택은 제한되어있었다. 늙은 도마뱀이나 소년이었어. 네가 피에 "
"굶주린 녀석인 건 인정하지만 이 아이를 구하고 싶다면 늙은 도마뱀을 산 채로 데려와야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "4794d1d4-e701-4582-bb5a-954e62130c43"
msgid ""
"\"A pleasure doing business with you. The child is yours.\" {n}The boy takes "
"a deep, convulsive breath, almost like he'd been drowning and finally made "
"it back to shore. His eyes fill with tears.{/n} \"I want to go home...\" {n}"
"he says as he begins sobbing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"너와 거래하는 것도 즐겁군. 아이는 너의 것이다.\" {n}그 소년은 물에 빠졌다가 마침내 해변에 도착했을 때처럼 숨을 "
"깊이들이쉽니다. 그의 눈은 눈물로 가득합니다.{/n} \"집에 가고 싶어...\" {n}그는 흐느껴 울면서 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "0a4b86b9-0249-4a41-8e36-34aaac20f37b"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes, what could I be? A mystery! A secret! A delightful charade! "
"Hahaha! It's enough for you to know I'm not the last one at the court of a "
"particularly important and influential person!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 내가 과연 무엇일까? 수수께끼! 비밀! 신나는 가면놀이군! 하하하! 이 가면놀이에서 가장 영향력 있고 중요한 인물은 나뿐만이 "
"아니라는 것만 알아둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "d3a25d0d-d8c9-4f12-b875-137439916d62"
msgid ""
"{n}It's hard to detect what it is you're speaking with. A ghost? Demon? Fey? "
"Maybe something even more exotic. Regardless, it doesn't seem that he's "
"possessing the boy — it's most likely that he's standing near the boy, "
"invisible, and controlling the boy telepathically.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 무엇과 말하고 있는지 알아내기 어렵습니다. 유령? 데몬? 페이? 아니면 다른 세계의 무언가일지도 모릅니다. 어쨌든 그가 "
"소년을 소유하고 있는 것처럼 보이지 않습니다. 투명한 누군가 소년 옆에 서서 텔레파시로 통제할 가능성이 가장 큽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : LizardfolkKingVesket
msgctxt "0f13d9bf-861d-4ed1-bf35-66a47cf37a4e"
msgid "\"But... Great Ancestor... It not seem right to...\""
msgstr "\"그러나... 위대한 조상이시여... 그것은 옳지 않은 것처럼 보입니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "f9400c92-94b8-43b6-b09a-beff220871a5"
msgid ""
"\"You question your Great Ancestor? Perhaps I chose the wrong time to come "
"back and guide the tribe back to glory. Shall leave you and the tribe for "
"now, perhaps come back when smarter heads rule, Chieftain?\" {n}Chieftain "
"Vesket slowly raises his weapons. The boy runs out of the way, clearly "
"terrified.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"위대한 조상에게 질문을 했어? 어쩌면 내가 부족을 영광으로 인도할 때를 잘못 택한 것 같다. 너와 너희 부족을 떠나서 너희 머리가 더 "
"똑똑해질 때 돌아와야겠군?\" {n}대장 베스켓은 천천히 무기를 들어올립니다. 그 아이는 겁에 질려 도망갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "23450c32-f036-4edc-8856-0bf9f68da2a6"
msgid ""
"\"Farewell! Fear not, heh, you can leave through the door safely. I've "
"instructed my lizards to treat you as an honored guest!\""
msgstr "\"잘가라! 두려워 말고. 문은 안전하게 통과할 수 있다. 도마뱀에게 너를 존경하는 손님으로 대우하라고 지시했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "3b1ac782-e529-4672-9da7-a5d8deca6e7c"
msgid "\"Vesket! Your Great Ancestor has need of you! Hurry!\""
msgstr "\"베스켓! 너의 위대한 조상이 너를 필요로 한다! 서둘러!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LizardfolksVillage/Wisp/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : MissingChild_Tig
msgctxt "a19d642c-9a42-49ac-a6ad-6fe580ff0133"
msgid ""
"\"What makes you think my patron is of YOUR world? What would you, a mortal "
"waste of flesh, know of the {g|First World}First World{/g} and its gods? You "
"shouldn't even speak its name above a respectful whisper!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 내 후원자가 너의 세계에 속한다고 생각하지? 너 같은 고깃덩어리 필멸자가 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}와 신들에 "
"대해서 알아? 공손히 속삭이는 정도가 아니면 그 이름을 부를 수 조차 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/Bark/LoserAmbush_ClawsBark_String
msgctxt "5ca67e6d-e2b8-4417-a2f0-6922e703bc89"
msgid ""
"Someone struck this rock hard enough to leave claw marks across the surface."
msgstr "누군가가 이 바위를 강타하여 긁힌 흔적을 남겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/Bark/LoserAmbush_TrollMealBark_String
msgctxt "c70f50eb-ded7-44da-ad6b-f85713a80cc6"
msgid "The bloody leftovers of a troll's dinner are scattered beside the rock."
msgstr "트롤의 저녁 식사의 남은 피는 바위 옆에 뿌려져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_13995_Text
msgctxt "ff518b3e-d1b6-44c9-9358-c1c8653c97e9"
msgid "Losing no more time, we turned back."
msgstr "시간이 없어서 우리는 돌아가기로 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_14802_Text
msgctxt "3c8b31ac-3332-48fe-ac18-ce3d4ade4f52"
msgid "We turned back and went around the glade, using the creek to hide."
msgstr "우리는 되돌아와서 시냇가를 통해 숨었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_18590_Text
msgctxt "8a5ea796-ef74-42cf-a993-769e9aa2fcb0"
msgid "We went around the glade unnoticed, using the creek to hide."
msgstr "우리는 되돌아와서 시냇가를 통해 숨었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_32474_Text
msgctxt "c0b313b6-db57-4068-9f3b-995a632d1482"
msgid "We tried sneaking forward again — twice as careful this time."
msgstr "우리는 두배 더 조심해서 다시 숨으려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_33224_Text
msgctxt "758845a1-ebb3-42ce-a536-c0964e2ba959"
msgid "We took the chance and tried pushing the brave troll into the fire."
msgstr "우리는 기회를 잡아 트롤을 불 속에 던지려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_48679_Text
msgctxt "ef96744f-3c6d-435c-8f86-07054a43471b"
msgid ""
"We tried to make sense of what was happening by interpreting gestures and "
"body language."
msgstr "우리는 몸짓을 보아서 어떤 일인지 짐작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_48734_Text
msgctxt "91a0aa06-0df9-4417-b31e-3e2fcbe7c21f"
msgid "We hid in the bushes."
msgstr "우리는 수풀에 숨었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_58137_Text
msgctxt "bfe943db-c444-4be6-8429-1dcf19fb9e75"
msgid "We fled."
msgstr "우리는 도망쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_59595_Text
msgctxt "c3d1a25b-8a6f-45c2-9312-b971e19e7667"
msgid ""
"Screaming, we jumped out of the bushes and pretended to be fire spirits."
msgstr "비명을 지르며 우리는 수풀에서 뛰쳐나왔고 불의 영혼인 척했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_61370_Text
msgctxt "6d648c81-09e3-4a49-a50f-31a498a8dc78"
msgid "We decided to launch a preemptive attack."
msgstr "우리는 선제 공격을 하기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_74633_Text
msgctxt "1bc20261-c1ec-409f-88ac-6eaa537a6066"
msgid "We carefully snuck closer."
msgstr "우리는 주의 깊게 가까이 다가갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_79118_Text
msgctxt "d86e264a-e133-412a-9b2f-ea63ff8e7896"
msgid "We stealthily threw a stone at the kobold."
msgstr "우리는 은밀히 코볼트에게 돌을 던졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_89417_Text
msgctxt "fce8ad9b-568f-4f18-942a-15954e73b3d9"
msgid "We daringly charged into battle."
msgstr "우리는 대담하게 전투에 임했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_90268_Text
msgctxt "17e67e26-01ad-4043-ab57-f607ed04dabd"
msgid "We tried translating their gibberish anyway."
msgstr "우리는 어쨌든 그들의 횡설수설을 알아들으려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Answer_95249_Text
msgctxt "50205ce0-eea6-442d-86b1-e18b4af01d24"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_00799_Text_String
msgctxt "891de619-0f3f-4eb6-8ed4-d9c6cf9d9fad"
msgid ""
"Stomping his feet on the ground, the kobold screamed something that didn't "
"need translation. Worse, another group of trolls was approaching from the "
"rear, chanting \"Borba! Borba! Borba!\" as they ran. I promised myself I'd "
"find out what this \"Borba\" word meant, if we managed to survive."
msgstr ""
"땅에 발을 굴리고 코볼트는 번역하지 않아도 이해할 비명을 질렀습니다. 게다가 다른 트롤들이 근처에서 다가옵니다. 그들은 \"보바! 보바! "
"보바!\"를 외칩니다. 나는 살아남으면 보바의 의미를 알아내야겠다고 생각했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_01319_Text
msgctxt "ca88f1cb-3b94-4404-a618-d1995c946f06"
msgid ""
"Tree branches are always there to crack under your feet at the worst "
"possible time! We froze, trying to quiet our loudly beating hearts. One of "
"the trolls walked right toward us, holding a huge gnarled club at the ready. "
"Another moment and he'd surely notice us!"
msgstr ""
"나무가 당신 발밑까지 쪼개졌습니다! 우리는 얼어붙어서 두근거리는 가슴을 진정시켰습니다. 트롤 중의 하나가 거대한 곤봉을 들고 우리쪽으로 "
"걸어왔습니다. 그 순간 그는 우리를 알아챈 것 같습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_03062_Text_String
msgctxt "5e9dc620-de3a-425d-a7f6-5c69003176dc"
msgid ""
"This was not our lucky day! The trolls noticed us and exploded into shouts "
"and roars, calling to their kin for backup. \"Borba! Borba! Borba!\" Two "
"trolls jumped out onto the path, cutting off our escape route. Only one way "
"out remained — a fight."
msgstr ""
"오늘은 운이 좋은 날이 아니었습니다! 트롤들은 우리를 알아차리고 환호를 하고 포효하며 함께 \"보바! 보바! 보바!\"라고 외쳤습니다. "
"트롤 둘이 길 앞으로 뛰어들어서 길을 막았습니다. 길은 하나 뿐이었습니다. 싸움 뿐이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_10112_Text
msgctxt "2ec6ba60-041c-4d3c-ba90-be5b282f4606"
msgid ""
"We may as well have tried moving a mountain! All we managed to do was anger "
"the huge troll. We had a fierce battle ahead of us!"
msgstr "우리는 산을 옮기려고 시도했을지도 모릅니다! 우리는 거대한 트롤을 화나게 했습니다. 우리에게는 치열한 전투가 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_15791 1_Text
msgctxt "7d2bf0b9-712b-4508-a1f6-e5d1fdc86a70"
msgid ""
"Keeping our heads low, we walked through a dried-up creek to another spot "
"that was closer to the scene. We could hear the mysterious kobold's words "
"better from there."
msgstr "머리를 낮게 낮추면서 우리는 그곳과 더 가까이 있는 곳으로 나아갔습니다. 우리는 코볼트의 말을 더 잘 들을 수 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_15791_Text
msgctxt "26ae8c50-df76-4234-aef7-cfbc6c938c3a"
msgid ""
"Hiding behind the elm trees, we crept close enough to hear the mysterious "
"kobold's mumbling."
msgstr "느릅나무 뒤에 숨어서 우리는 코볼트의 말소리를 듣기 위해 조심스럽게 다가갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_16950_Text
msgctxt "2a6b504f-1337-4c24-8fb7-ecdf0bd0cf14"
msgid ""
"Bam!\n"
"The huge troll fell right into the flames, jumping out immediately and "
"running out of the glade with screams of pain and terror.\n"
"The two who remained just blinked and looked around, confused. The kobold, "
"however, was ready for battle. Calm and collected, he was already hissing "
"the magical words of his incomprehensible spells, preparing to bring their "
"power to bear against us."
msgstr ""
"빵! \n"
"거대한 트롤은 화염에 빠져 뛰어 나와 아픔과 공포로 비명을 질렀습니다. \n"
"남아있는 둘은 눈을 깜빡이고는 주위를 둘러보고 혼란스러워했습니다. 코볼트는 싸울 준비가 되었습니다. 차분해진 그는 알 수 없는 주문을 "
"외우면서 우리 앞에서 힘을 과시하려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_24518_Text
msgctxt "ffe6a963-6f0b-4931-9626-e1b99549aed7"
msgid ""
"We were aiming for the kobold, but we hit one of the trolls. We may as well "
"have been throwing a pillow! We lost the element of surprise — a difficult "
"battle lay before us."
msgstr ""
"우리는 코볼트를 목표로 했지만 우리는 트롤 중 하나를 맞췄습니다. 우리는 베개를 던지는 것과 같았습니다! 우리는 우리 앞에 펼쳐진 어려운 "
"전투를 보고 넋이 나갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_33970_Text
msgctxt "11c4486f-4ed9-4b13-8795-8ead6dbca124"
msgid ""
"The party dove between the thick ferns. As we frantically tore at the leaves "
"and covered ourselves with them, we heard a strange noise and froze — it was "
"the laughter of a troll. He thought the sight of puny humans thrashing about "
"in the shrubbery was hilarious. Grunting and squealing, he slapped his knee "
"and pointed his finger at us. We had no choice — we had to eliminate this "
"merry fellow and his allies, then live out the rest of our lives trying to "
"forget our shame."
msgstr ""
"일행은 두꺼운 양치류 사이에 있었습니다. 우리가 미친듯이 나뭇잎을 뜯어 우리를 가렸을 때 이상한 소음을 들었습니다. 트롤의 "
"웃음소리였습니다. 그는 인간들이 관목에서 갑자기 튀어나와 흥미로웠다고 생각한 것 같습니다. 불평을 하면서 그는 무릎을 치면서 우리를 향해 "
"손가락질했습니다. 우리는 선택의 여지가 없었습니다. 우리는 이 명랑한 친구들을 제거하고 우리의 부끄러운 기억을 없애야 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_36402_Text_String
msgctxt "888c5264-7bce-47cb-b5db-551b69fddda7"
msgid ""
"The kobold pointed at us with his crooked finger, yelling something that "
"didn't require translation. Whatever had been happening here, we'd put an "
"end to it. The only thing left was the fierce battle that lay ahead."
msgstr ""
"코볼트는 비뚤어진 손가락으로 우리를 가리키며 누구나 알 수 있을 외침을 질렀습니다. 여기서 무슨 일이 일어났든 끝을 내야 했습니다. "
"우리에게 남은 것은 치열한 전투였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_36719_Text_String
msgctxt "1daf957b-fe3b-4f47-a7cd-326bc0667d7b"
msgid ""
"His primitive speech was a mixture of some crude version of Common and "
"Giant, punctuated with heavy hissing and vigorous gesturing. With some "
"difficulty, we managed to figure out what he was saying, and what we heard "
"shocked us to the core.\n"
"\"Ssshame! Disssgraccce!\" The kobold hissed as he continued. \"Trollsss. "
"Cowardsss! Pathetic! Flamesss, not ssscary!\" With these words, he plunged "
"his paws into the fire. The sleeves of his tattered robes caught fire, and "
"he raised his hands in the air. \"Sssee? Flamesss! Flamesss! Flamesss!\" The "
"trolls hid behind trees out of fear, making the kobold shake with anger. "
"Hissing and groaning, he switched to an atrocious mixture of Troll and "
"Kobold speech, which was even more incomprehensible than before."
msgstr ""
"그의 원시적인 말은 위협을 하면서 몸짓을 하는 흔한 거인의 조잡한 버전이었습니다. 어렵게 우리는 그가 말하는 것을 이해할 수 있었습니다. "
"우리에게 말하는 것은 고함이었습니다.\n"
"\"부끄러운 줄 알아라!\" 코볼트는 계속하면서 위협했습니다. \"겁쟁이 트롤 녀석들! 한심하군! 화염을 받아라!\" 그 말을 하면서 "
"그는 불 속으로 뛰어들어갔습니다. 그의 손목은 불꽃이 감싸였고 그는 손을 허공에 들었습니다.\"보았나? 화염이다! 화염! 화염!\" "
"트롤들은 두려워서 나무 뒤에 숨었고 분노로 코볼트를 흔들었습니다. 위협을 하고 고통스러워하면서 그는 트롤 말과 코볼트 말을 섞어서 말했고 "
"전보다 더 이해하기가 힘들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_39499_Text_String
msgctxt "bdc0b70a-59e0-4429-a59e-fd45ecd4a8e2"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, the movements and gestures of these creatures were even less "
"comprehensible than their speech. What's worse, while we watched them, our "
"enemies noticed us as well!"
msgstr ""
"불행하게도 이 생물들의 몸짓은 말보다 더 이해하기 힘들었습니다. 더 나쁜 것은 우리가 그들을 보았을 때 우리의 적들도 우리를 주목했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_43288_Text
msgctxt "173633e0-5419-470d-82bf-a07dcde5ce73"
msgid ""
"\"You,\" the kobold hissed, pointing at the biggest troll. \"You were taken "
"into the tribe by the chieftain himself! By Hargulka!\"\n"
"Hearing the chieftain's name, the troll froze, and the kobold continued his "
"violent hissing. \"Why? You do not dessserve thisss! Coward! Disssgraccce! "
"Tartuk, the great kobold, no give brand to you!\" The kobold spat on the "
"ground. \"You ssshame the tribe. Ssshame all trollsss.\" With an angry "
"growl, the troll stepped closer to the fire."
msgstr ""
"\"너.\"코볼트가 큰 트롤을 가리키며 위협합니다. \"너는 하굴카 대장에 의해 부족으로 끌려갔을 텐데! \"\n"
"대장의 이름을 듣고 트롤은 얼어 붙었고 코볼트는 계속해서 쉭쉭거립니다. \"왜? 너는 그럴 자격이 없다! 겁쟁이! 명예롭지 못하다! 타툭 "
"너를 인정하지 않았다!\" 코볼트는 땅에 침을 뱉습니다. \"너는 부족을 욕보였다. 트롤을 욕보였다.\" 화를 내며 트롤은 불에 더 "
"가까이 다가갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_44468_Text
msgctxt "4d78d34a-e46f-406c-97cf-5f345ac13c0d"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the best strategy is to throw fortune to the wind and take "
"yourself and the world as they are.\n"
"We'd experienced hundreds of battles, and before us was just one more group "
"of enemies — a strange spell-casting kobold and three huge trolls... But "
"wait, it wasn't three — another troll, big and angry, burst out of the woods "
"to help his kin! But it was too late to change anything. We started the "
"fight, so all we could do was try to finish it!"
msgstr ""
"때로는 가장 좋은 전략은 운을 하늘에 맡기고 세상이 돌아가는 대로 두는 것입니다. \n"
"우리는 수백건의 전투를 경험했었고 우리 앞에는 또 하나의 적 무리가 있었습니다. 마법을 외우는 코볼트와 거대한 트롤 셋 말입니다... "
"하지만 셋이 아니었습니다. 크고 화가 난 트롤은 동료를 구하러 숲에서 뛰쳐나왔습니다! 하지만 그는 아무것도 바꿀 수 없었습니다. 우리는 "
"싸움을 시작했습니다. 우리가 할 수있는 일은 그것을 끝내는 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_45024_Text
msgctxt "c2d2751f-ba23-48e4-a0ff-502b719ee169"
msgid ""
"There are two types of adventurers — the quick and the dead. The troll "
"probably didn't even realize what had happened and decided not to chase "
"after us — after all, what's the point of chasing after the wind?\n"
"We were safe again soon enough... and just as clueless. We witnessed a real "
"mystery in that glade, and we'd left the answers far behind us."
msgstr ""
"모험가에는 두 가지 유형이 있습니다. 빠른 자와 죽은 자입니다. 트롤은 아마 무슨 일이 일어났는지 깨닫지 못해서 우리를 쫓지 않기로 "
"결심한 것 같습니다. 결국 허공을 쫓아 봐야 무엇합니까?\n"
"우리는 곧 안전해졌습니다... 아무런 단서도 얻지 못한 채로 말입니다. 우리는 그 틈에서 미스터리를 목격하고 답을 뒤로 한 채 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_46695_Text
msgctxt "f4452967-81f1-4106-8208-05e049e14d37"
msgid ""
"We saw something that probably no one else had ever seen before!\n"
"Beside the blazing campfire stood a kobold, who had wrapped himself in a "
"worn-out elven robe. On the far side of the clearing, three enormous trolls "
"shuffled their feet, hesitating. The kobold stretched out his calloused paws "
"and with immense gravity hissed and mumbled incomprehensibly. We could "
"barely even guess at what all this meant."
msgstr ""
"우리는 전에 누구도 보지 못했던 것을 보았습니다!\n"
"캠프파이어 옆에 낡은 엘프 겉옷에 싸인 코볼트가 서있습니다. 공터 한쪽에서 거대한 트롤 셋이 주저하고 있습니다. 코볼트는 앞발을 뻗으며 "
"위협을 했고 이해할 수 없는 말을 중얼거렸습니다. 우리는 무슨 의미인지 간신히 짐작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_49703_Text
msgctxt "158dca46-6662-4ca5-bd9a-5d02f661a013"
msgid ""
"Three trolls and a strange kobold? The things you see while out adventuring! "
"Trying not to make any noise, we retreated, never to learn what was "
"happening around that campfire."
msgstr ""
"3마리의 트롤과 이상한 코볼트? 모험을 하는 동안 처음 보는 것이었습니다! 시끄러운 소리를 내지 않으려고 노력하면서 우리는 후퇴했고 그 "
"야영지에서 무슨 일이 일어났는지 절대 알지 못했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_51919_Text
msgctxt "ced039ca-3325-46fc-9e2a-3912c88556af"
msgid ""
"Hop!\n"
"We found ourselves lying securely hidden behind the heavy fern leaves on the "
"side of the path. The club-wielding troll stood right next to us, grumbling "
"under his breath and cautiously examining his surroundings. We didn't move — "
"we didn't even breathe.\n"
"The troll carefully stepped toward us and froze, listening to the silence of "
"the forest, so close we could have reached out to pinch his filthy leg!\n"
"The birds were singing, and a snake hissed somewhere in the grass, but we "
"still didn't make a sound. At last, the torturous standoff came to an end — "
"seeing and smelling nothing out of the ordinary, the troll returned to his "
"companions. The storm had passed for now, and the coast was clear!"
msgstr ""
"홉!\n"
"우리는 길가에 거대한 고사리 잎 속에 숨었습니다. 몽둥이를 휘두르는 트롤은 우리 옆에 서서 으르렁거리며 주변을 신중하게 조사했습니다. "
"우리는 움직이지 않았습니다. 우리도 호흡조차 하지 않았습니다.\n"
"트롤은 조심스럽게 우리쪽으로 다가섰고 가만히 서서 숲의 침묵을 들었습니다. 너무나 가까워서 우리는 손만 뻗으면 그의 더러운 다리를 만질 "
"수도 있었습니다!\n"
"새들은 노래하고 있었고 뱀은 혀를 날름거리며 풀 숲을 돌아다녔지만 우리는 아무 소리도 낼 수 없었습니다. 마침내 고문 같았던 시간이 "
"끝났습니다. 아무것도 맡고 볼 수 없었던 트롤은 동료들에게 돌아갑니다. 폭풍은 지나갔고 해변은 깨끗해졌습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_58348_Text
msgctxt "abcce846-eea2-411b-bf89-d331a03a715d"
msgid ""
"Perhaps we should have practiced our grand entrance beforehand.\n"
"Unimpressed by our screaming, the trolls and the kobold met us with cold "
"resolve. We had a fierce battle ahead of us."
msgstr ""
"아마도 우리는 거대한 입구를 미리 조사해야 했습니다. \n"
"우리의 비명에 겁먹지 않은 트롤과 코볼트는 차가운 반응으로 우리를 맞았습니다. 우리 앞에는 치열한 전투가 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_58609_Text
msgctxt "a67428eb-e95d-4ca1-961c-4e1faf5dd2ae"
msgid ""
"We jumped out from behind the trees, brandishing torches and screaming gods-"
"know-what. Some of us growled, some squealed — one of us plunged a torch "
"into the dry grass, lighting it up and spreading trails of fire all around.\n"
"Hissing and grinning at us, the kobold mumbled some spells, preparing for "
"battle. And the trolls...\n"
"Well, the trolls were long gone! Their innate fear of fire and our unmatched "
"artistry had done the trick — the trolls ran away. A fight with just one "
"kobold didn't seem a difficult task, but the mystery of what had transpired "
"in that glade would shortly die with him..."
msgstr ""
"우리는 나무 뒤에서 뛰쳐나왔고 횃불을 휘두르고 신만이 이해할 비명을 질렀습니다. 우리는 으르렁거렸고 누군가는 횃불을 들고 마른 풀에 불을 "
"놓아 사방에 불을 지폈습니다. \n"
"쉭쉭 소리를 내며 씨익 웃는 트롤은 어떤 마법을 중얼거리며 싸움을 준비했습니다. 그리고 트롤들은...\n"
"트롤들은 오래 전에 없어졌습니다! 불에 대한 타고난 두려움과 타의 추종을 불허하는 예술성이 속임수를 완성했습니다. 그리고 트롤이 "
"도망쳤습니다. 코볼트 한마리와의 싸움은 어려운 일이 아니었지만 그 숲에서 일어난 미스터리는 그와 함께 묻힐 것입니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_71423_Text_String
msgctxt "bec00953-9ca8-45cd-a5c6-4920dfdd9958"
msgid ""
"Our collective linguistic skills weren't sufficient to understand what was "
"happening. Worse yet, while we listened to the kobold prattle on and on, he "
"noticed us!"
msgstr ""
"우리의 몸짓은 무슨 일이 일어났는지 이해하기에는 충분하지 않았습니다. 더 나쁜 일은 우리가 코볼트가 하는 말을 듣고 있을 때 그가 우리를 "
"발견했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_83740_Text
msgctxt "e9613f6d-3a88-457b-8a7a-43f722172903"
msgid ""
"The best defense is a good offense!\n"
"Swords slid from their scabbards, and the air trembled with magical "
"impulses. To hell with the kobold and his cryptic fire ritual! A fair fight "
"is no less exciting than discovering the secrets of some lisping lizard!"
msgstr ""
"최고의 방어는 좋은 공격입니다!\n"
"칼이 뽑혔고 공기는 마법의 충동으로 떨렸습니다. 안타깝게도 코볼트가 불의 의식을 하고 있었습니다! 공정한 싸움은 혀를 날름거리는 도마뱀의 "
"비밀을 파헤치는 것보다 흥미롭지 않았습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_85469_Text_String
msgctxt "5a371e37-2a1b-46b7-aefa-0a1085717650"
msgid ""
"The kobold stretched his arms toward the troll, his sleeves still on fire.\n"
"\"Flamesss! Flamesss! Flamesss!\" the kobold hissed menacingly in Common.\n"
"\"Flames! Flames! Flames!\" the trolls replied in their own tongue.\n"
"The brave troll stepped closer to the campfire.\n"
"We couldn't imagine a more opportune time to strike!"
msgstr ""
"코볼트는 불꽃을 두른 팔을 트롤쪽으로 뻗었습니다.\n"
"\"화염! 화염! 화염!\" 코볼트는 공용어로 날카롭게 소리지릅니다.\n"
"\"화염! 화염! 화염!\" 트롤들은 자신들의 언어로 대답했습니다. \n"
"용감한 트롤은 야영지에 더 가까이 다가갔습니다. \n"
"우리는 공격할 적절한 때가 지금이라고 생각했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_87070_Text
msgctxt "2e1ded90-4118-4ec9-924e-f3c2dfb21574"
msgid ""
"It seemed like the kobold was shaming the trolls for cowardice. Hissing and "
"grunting, he repeated \"Hargulka\" several times, causing the trolls to tuck "
"their heads and slouch a little deeper each time. It must have been the name "
"of a very important troll — a chieftain, a pack leader, someone they "
"regarded as an authority. Whatever the case, the kobold's words hit their "
"target. One of the trolls — the tallest and mightiest one — stood straight "
"and stepped forward. His enormous claw involuntarily scratched at his "
"bloodied shoulder, which held a burned-in pattern. The other trolls' "
"shoulders looked to have the same pattern, as though they'd all been branded."
msgstr ""
"코볼트가 트롤들을 겁쟁이라고 욕하는 것 같습니다. 쉭쉭거리는 소리를 내며 \"하굴카\"를 여러 번 반복하자 트롤들이 머리를 조아리고 더욱 "
"움츠러듭니다. 그것은 대장이나 우두머리 같은 권위 있는 이름이었을 것입니다. 어쨌든 코볼트의 말은 목표를 달성했습니다. 가장 크고 강한 "
"트롤 중 하나가 똑바로 서서 앞으로 나아갔습니다. 그의 엄청난 발톱이 그의 어깨에 긁혀 피가 흘렀고 화염의 모습을 떠올리게 했습니다. "
"다른 트롤의 어깨도 같은 흉터가 있는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_94965_Text
msgctxt "1a3e8bff-38c9-41a1-b46d-8ed005f01457"
msgid ""
"The rock struck the kobold right in the forehead — bam!\n"
"The spellweaver went down like a tree — it was clear he'd be out for quite "
"some time. But the trolls... The trolls were ready for battle, and they were "
"very, very angry."
msgstr ""
"바위는 코볼트의 이마를 강타했습니다. \n"
"주문을 외우던 코볼트는 나무처럼 쓰러졌습니다. 분명히 그가 잠시 동안은 정신을 잃었을 것입니다. 하지만 트롤은... 트롤은 싸울 준비가 "
"되었고 매우 화가 난 것 같았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/LoserAmbush/LoserAmbushTroll/Cue_95248_Text
msgctxt "69a9b015-833d-4bcc-8e64-1dea0030d9ac"
msgid ""
"The old creek turned out to be too shallow for us to creep up to the "
"campfire unnoticed. The kobold screamed and waved in our direction, and the "
"trolls bore their teeth — a battle was unavoidable!"
msgstr ""
"오래된 만은 우리에게 야영지에서 몰래 나오기에는 너무 얕다는 것이 밝혀졌습니다. 코볼트는 소리를 지르고 우리가 있는 방향을 손짓했고 "
"트롤은 이를 갈고 있었습니다. 전투는 피할 수 없었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_01897_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dab22b86-9a18-4757-bc81-a2a365949a99"
msgid "Threatened to kill the guest from Pitax."
msgstr "피탁스에서 손님을 죽이려고 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_01897_Text
msgctxt "c7692793-8f2d-43c9-974a-c637cf402e6b"
msgid "\"I can't let you go free after a confession like that.\""
msgstr "\"그런 말들을 들었는데, 그냥 너를 보내줄 수는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_05376_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "186833cc-1dd4-4645-8a06-f39ec072a238"
msgid "Let the guest from Pitax go in peace."
msgstr "피탁스에서 온 손님을 평화롭게 보냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_05376_Text
msgctxt "a33f90c5-0c66-4eea-822d-e8caba51a3af"
msgid ""
"\"Your honesty is welcome. Next time we meet, it could be on the battlefield."
"\""
msgstr "\"자네의 정직함은 환영하지. 다음에 우리가 만나면 그건 전장이 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_06202_Text
msgctxt "c7da1fce-4ab6-4167-a698-e132e2c64954"
msgid "\"Forget politics. I just want to gut this arrogant pig.\""
msgstr "\"정치는 잊어버려. 나는 이 오만한 돼지의 배를 가르고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_09112_Text
msgctxt "3e6cbcfb-07ca-4de6-80ec-9f8d1ed851f2"
msgid "\"Politics is politics. Defend yourself, Stefano.\""
msgstr "\"정치는 정치다. 방어할 준비해라. 스테파노.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_39149_Text
msgctxt "4194869b-2856-4ada-a270-84dabf37e0fc"
msgid "\"Leave. And never return.\""
msgstr "\"떠나라. 다시는 돌아오지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_60738_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b09d617d-6977-4bd7-a84e-ee674fb1e7ce"
msgid "Murdered the guest from Pitax in a cruel way."
msgstr "잔인한 방법으로 피탁스에서 온 손님을 살해했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_60738_Text
msgctxt "f3e8329a-82bd-4161-9ce3-8f3539448ebe"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Stefano, let's see how far can I shove your powdered head up "
"your perfumed ass.\""
msgstr "\"스테파노. 네 냄새 나는 몸통에서 머리를 얼마나 멀리 날려버릴 수 있는지 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_65126_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6d8434fc-b5ac-46c8-8dcc-c8d82c171322"
msgid "Shunned the guest from Pitax."
msgstr "피탁스에서 온 손님을 피했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_65126_Text
msgctxt "e6761657-0406-47ea-a541-901acc5098cf"
msgid "\"If I knew it was you, I wouldn't have come to help.\""
msgstr "\"너였다는 것을 알았다면 도우러 오지 않았을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_73957_Text
msgctxt "467ba971-c412-48f7-a5a0-c12d78f3d349"
msgid "\"Vassal?\""
msgstr "\"봉신?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_90260_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ec3b4094-3fac-4b8a-9456-1d66ca6b3813"
msgid "Mocked the guest from Pitax."
msgstr "피탁스에서 온 손님을 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_90260_Text
msgctxt "1f93a5c4-c2ec-4524-91a5-1bc7b4410b09"
msgid "\"Sir Stefano? I barely recognized you without all the face powder.\""
msgstr "\"스테파노 경? 얼굴에 분칠을 안하니 못 알아볼 뻔했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_93758_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "248e251b-0bba-4876-b4d0-6a01e462bf92"
msgid "Welcomed the guest from Pitax."
msgstr "피탁스에서 온 손님을 환영습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Answer_93758_Text
msgctxt "493ffa9c-d691-4895-8f1d-63a79fe6f196"
msgid "\"I'm glad I made it in time.\""
msgstr "\"너무 늦지 않아서 다행이군\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Barks/MosconiBark_String
msgctxt "44f71651-6817-4453-94dd-c5ceed1a2e41"
msgid ""
"\"I will look forward to that meeting, Your Grace, however it unfolds.\""
msgstr "\"만남을 기대하고 있을게. 벌써 만남은 시작되었지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Barks/MosconiGuardBark_String
msgctxt "f29fd406-7942-4647-8116-56d93c97716e"
msgid "\"Thank you for the help, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"도와주셔서 고맙습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_03675_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "f1c1edb2-acc6-4a48-bc35-207d9aeefb26"
msgid ""
"{n}Stefano recovers, straightening.{/n} \"Why, my lady, on the contrary. It "
"is because of gratitude, I'm being candid with you right now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}스테파노가 회복되어 얼굴을 폅니다.{/n} \"왜, 나의 숙녀여, 그 반대라면? 오히려 감사의 표시로 이렇게 솔직하게 말하는 겁니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_05184_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "480e7f62-d4ad-4f0a-b7e3-1e46a9b978d0"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie rolls her eyes.{/n} \"Ah, another suitor. I've changed my mind, "
"he's not under my protection any more. Do as you please.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 눈을 굴립니다.{/n} \"아. 또 다른 구혼자라니. 마음을 바꿨습니다. 그는 더 이상 내 보호를 받지 못할 겁니다. "
"편한대로 하십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_13871_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b673feb6-4902-4fb8-b4b8-9224d1c520bd"
msgid ""
"\"What? We've just saved this man's life to murder him a minute later? Such "
"an act is unworthy of us! I hereby take this man under my protection!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라고요? 1분 뒤에 직접 죽이기 위해 이 남자를 구한겁니까? 그런 행동은 정말 무가치합니다! 저는 이 자를 보호하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 11_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "eff9168c-debc-48b6-9596-6b4027e703cb"
msgid ""
"\"I'll show you barbarian strength.\" {n}You can hear Amiri cracking her "
"knuckles.{/n} \"First, I show you the floor.\""
msgstr ""
"\"바바리안의 힘을 보여주지.\" {n}당신은 아미리의 주먹 마디 꺽는 소리를 들었습니다.{/n} \"우선, 땅바닥부터 보여주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 1_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "93d30033-6830-45b4-a0a6-83142be7edcc"
msgid ""
"\"A proper rebuke, and well-earned.\" {n}Sir Stefano sighs.{/n} \"I may even "
"owe you an apology for my behavior when last we met.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나름 시기 적절한 질책이군. 난 받을만 하지.\" {n}스테파노 경이 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"전에 만났을 때의 행동에 대해 사과 "
"해야만 하겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 2_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "53a5f207-97bd-4792-b37f-ce0265837960"
msgid ""
"\"Gloat, whatever you want, I've earned it.\" {n}Sir Stefano sighs.{/n} \"I "
"may even owe you an apology for my behavior when last we met.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐 좋아. 당신이 뭐라 말하든 받아들이겠다.\" {n}스테파노 경이 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"전에 만났을 때의 내 행동에 대해 "
"사과할 수 밖에 없겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 3_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "0338e8d7-3651-46f7-be28-2c6eb499d25c"
msgid ""
"\"Despite the many flaws, your barony has some potential.\" {n}Sir Stefano "
"leans on his rapier wearily.{/n} \"The people here, yourself included, are "
"passionate and ready to embrace progress. Not all countries are so… open.\" "
"{n}Stefano inhales sharply.{/n} \"The people of {g|Galt}Galt{/g} might as "
"well be a mob. {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} is eating itself from within by "
"continual struggles for power. And {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} — why, it's hardly "
"a land at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"많은 결점에도 불구하고 너의 남작령은 잠재력이 있습니다.\" {n}스테파노 경은 자신의 레이피어에 지친 몸을 기울입니다.{/n} "
"\"여기 사람들은 당신 자신을 포함해서 열정적이고 진보를 포용할 준비가 되어 있어요. 모든 국가가 그렇게 개방적이지는 않지요.\" {n}"
"스테파노가 짧게 숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"{g|Galt}갈트{/g} 사람들은 폭도와 같죠. {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}는 권력 "
"싸움에 자신을 갉아먹고 있고. 그리고 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}는 국가라 부를 수가 없지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 4_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "58df5dd3-b623-45a7-ad06-a0a97099b765"
msgid ""
"\"But here I see a beginning. A beginning of something greater. Your people "
"admire you, respect you, and believe in a future with you as their leader.\" "
"{n}Stefano gives a respectful nod.{/n} \"Not all may say the same.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 저는 여기서 시작을 보았습니다. 뭔가 더 위대한 것의 시작을. 이곳 사람들은 너를 칭찬하고 존경하고 그들의 지도자로서 당신이 "
"함께할 것을 믿고있습니다.\" {n}스테파노는 존중의 의미로 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"모두가 똑같이 말할 수는 없겠지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 5_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "4c376cda-9db8-48c2-9c66-38e464ab879b"
msgid ""
"\"I will report this to my king Irovetti. Maybe, this barony is actually "
"worthy of becoming {g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} vassal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 사실을 이로베티 왕께 보고할 겁니다. 어쩌면 이 남작령은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 봉신이 될 자격이 있을지도 "
"모르겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 6_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "d01bdbd0-8dde-4609-8dcd-f526ad3e05c2"
msgid ""
"\"Yes.\" {n}Sir Stefano pauses for a moment, then looks surprised.{/n} \"What"
" did you think I would offer? Do you think us equals?\" {n}He scoffs.{/n} "
"\"If your barony were even a hint of becoming a rival to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, "
"why His Highness Irovetti…\" {n}Stefano looks flustered.{/n} \"Why, he would "
"need to deal with that threat — by vassal treaty. Or by steel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래요.\" {n}스테파노 경이 놀라서 잠시 멈춥니다.{/n} \"내가 무엇을 제안하리라 생각했나요? 우리가 동등하다고 생각했습니까?"
"\" {n}그는 비웃습니다.{/n} \"너희 남작령이 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 경쟁자가 될 약간의 조짐이라도 있다면 왜 이로베티 "
"전하가... \" {n}스테파노는 당황한 것 같습니다.{/n} \"그는 당신에게 봉신의 자격을 주어 위험에 대처하려는 거요. 아니면 칼을 "
"써야 하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 7_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "968f6492-16c9-4af6-962a-91dee1ead558"
msgid ""
"\"I will look forward to that meeting, Your Grace, however it unfolds.\" {n}"
"He salutes with his rapier.{/n} \"It has been an honor.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만남을 고대하겠습니다. 전하. 벌써 만남은 시작되었지만.\" {n}그는 레이피어로 경례를 합니다.{/n} \"영광이었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 8_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "d6cd758f-72dc-4629-b235-aa25ecea1891"
msgid ""
"{n}Sir Stefano sighs.{/n} \"I expected as much. Let's get it over with.\" {n}"
"He raises his rapier.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}스테파노 경이 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"나는 기대도 많이 했는데. 끝내자.\" {n}그는 레이피어를 듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481 9_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "8d0acd0b-216f-4cd1-8932-7796529c6e0f"
msgid ""
"{n}Blood rushes to Sir Stefano's face, his eyelid starts to twitch.{/n} \"You"
" wouldn't dare…\""
msgstr "{n}스테파노 경의 얼굴이 붉어지며 그의 눈꺼풀이 떨립니다.{/n} \"너 감히...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_23481_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "53aa38ec-6306-4679-9fbf-0330057d6631"
msgid ""
"{n}Noticing you, Stefano salutes you with his rapier — he seems genuinely "
"pleased to see you.{/n} \"We meet again! I confess, I never thought I'd be "
"glad to see you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 알아보자 스테파노는 레이피어를 들고 경의를 표합니다. 그는 당신을 만난 것이 진심으로 기쁜 듯합니다.{/n} \"다시 "
"만났군요! 솔직히 당신이 이렇게 반갑게 느껴질 거라곤 생각지도 못했어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_30986_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "65dc8bf0-07b5-4049-aa25-73b879b07f5a"
msgid ""
"\"I see gratitude is fashionably out of date in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}.\" {n}"
"Valerie's lips form a thin line, and Stefano flushes — not in anger, but "
"shame.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"감사함이란 것은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 유행이 지났나보군요.\" {n}발레리는 입을 굳게 다물었고 스테프노는 화가 아닌 "
"수치심에 얼굴이 붉어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_45420 1_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f0d57d15-3c94-424b-9e12-5c8b243e7e92"
msgid "{n}Amiri grins.{/n} \"Me first.\""
msgstr "{n}아미리가 씨익 웃습니다.{/n} \"나 먼저.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_45420_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e01e18c1-ad80-499c-aab4-7c59fbea8066"
msgid "{n}Amiri grins.{/n} \"Me first.\""
msgstr "{n}아미리가 씨익 웃습니다.{/n} \"나 먼저.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_71313_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7e52c6de-5570-4c24-a9fa-e3a4b0b73e5b"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe I'm hearing this — but perhaps it's proof that "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} facial powders do cause dementia after all. Whatever is "
"running through your head, you're in no position to threaten us, you pompous "
"ass.\" {n}Jubilost frowns.{/n} \"And that's an insult to mules everywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 말을 듣게 되다니 믿을 수 없다. 아마 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 만든 분은 치매를 유발한다는 증거이겠지. 네 머릿속에서 "
"무슨 생각을 하든 너는 우리를 위협할 처지가 아니야. 이 잘난척쟁이야.\" {n}주빌로스트는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그리고 그건 노새에 "
"대한 모욕이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_89443 1_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "e7729937-ee40-43ed-9814-def69cd2b46f"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a man who reeks of vanity — and clearly out of his element here "
"in the forest. His cheeks and forehead are generously powdered, his hair and "
"moustache waxed but bent, as if he slept poorly. His fine clothes are "
"tattered and blood-stained, and a rapier is held tightly in his hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 숲에서 길을 잃어 방황하는 남자를 만났습니다. 그의 뺨과 이마는 분이 곱게 칠해졌고 그의 머리와 콧수염은 왁스를 칠했지만 "
"잠을 제대로 못잤는지 머리가 헝클어졌습니다. 그의 좋은 옷은 너덜너덜하고 피로 얼룩졌고 그의 손에는 레이피어가 단단히 "
"쥐어져있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_89443 2_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "3ac15ba8-5daf-46e9-90c2-ea7f0fdc596b"
msgid ""
"{n}Noticing you, he salutes with his rapier.{/n} \"Thank you for your timely "
"intervention.\" {n}He adds a bow to his salute.{/n} \"I am Sir Stefano "
"Moskoni of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, close friend to king Costruccio Irovetti, on "
"my way from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} to my homeland {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 알아차리자 그는 레이피어로 경례를 했습니다.{/n} \"때 마침 와주어 고마워.\" {n}그는 허리를 숙여 인사합니다.{/n}"
" \"나는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 스테파노 모스코니 경. Costruccio 이로베티의 친한 친구이지. "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에서 고향 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}로 돌아가는 중이었어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_89443 3_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "177da81e-be19-4b1e-ac3d-0c131ec693c9"
msgid ""
"\"I recently visited your capital. Attended the official reception, in fact."
"\" {n}Sir Stefano nods.{/n} \"Frankly, at the first glance I didn't think "
"much of your barony. But now I'm pleased to tell you, I've changed my mind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 최근에 너의 수도를 방문했어. 사실 공식 리셉션에 참석했었지.\" {n}스테파노 경은 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"솔직히 네 "
"영지의 첫 인상은 그렇게 마음에 들지 않았어. 하지만 지금 다시 말하겠는데, 나의 마음을 바꿨다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_89443_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "f7023ab8-c6e8-4ec3-a4ed-419464b4365d"
msgid ""
"{n}You see Sir {d|Stefano}Stefano Moskoni{/d} from {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, he "
"looks… reduced from when you first met him. His clothes are torn and blood-"
"stained, and his waxed hair and moustache are bent at odd angles.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 온 {d|Stefano}스테파노 모스코니{/d} 경을 마주하고 있습니다. 그는 처음 만났을 "
"때에 비해 영 망가진 모습입니다. 옷은 찢어진채 피가 묻어있었고 왁스를 바른 그의 머리와 콧수염은 헝클어져 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_93757_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "f5e54b7c-87a4-4c05-9fc2-8080d03d321d"
msgid ""
"\"Do not worry, my lady. It's just politics. Though, I must say, I am "
"flattered by your defense. If I must meet my fate today, then I would be "
"glad to do so by your hand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"걱정하지 마. 그냥 정치일 뿐이야. 그래도 도와주어 고마워. 오늘 내 운명이 여기까지라면 네 손으로 끝나게 되어 기쁠 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_93759_Text
#. Speaker : NobleFromRiverKingdoms_Stefano
msgctxt "71a3f256-e349-4686-bfe8-aa93c24103b1"
msgid ""
"\"I bow to your dignity. Saving me here after our unpleasant conversation "
"back in your capital must've been... controversial. I may even owe you an "
"apology for my behavior.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 관대함에 경의를 표합니다. 당신의 수도에서 우리의 불쾌했던 대화에도 불구하고 구해주시다니... 제 행동에 대해 당신께 사과를 "
"드려야 겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_93760_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f9b3b9c2-ec47-491e-8a01-203623265dc3"
msgid "\"You're a fool to say such things out loud.\""
msgstr "\"그런 말을 큰 소리로 말하다니 멍청이구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_93761_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "2d6c92a3-9a36-49d1-a839-dfcc65ac584d"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie speaks softly — so softly that only you can hear her.{/n} \"Please"
" remain temperate. Stefano may be stupid, but dealing with him here and now "
"would bring you that much closer to the Stag Lord and his bandits.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 너무나 부드럽게 말해서 당신만이 들을 수 있었습니다.{/n} \"침착하십시오. 스테파노는 멍청이일지도 모르지만 그와 "
"상대하는 것은 당신이 수사슴 군주와 다름 없다고 볼 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_93764_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6ba49b54-971c-413e-8c76-a515acab3fdb"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie nods pensively beside you, as though to herself. You understand "
"perfectly well that her approval is meant for you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 자신에게 끄덕이듯 당신에게 끄덕입니다. 그녀의 허락이 당신에게는 큰 의미가 있다는 것을 발견했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_93766_Text_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "691ccc44-9bc7-41e6-b187-5dfd7a3c9981"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie hoods her eyes, hiding her irritation.{/n} \"I had hoped we could "
"part like civilized people...\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 시선을 아래로 향하여 화를 숨깁니다.{/n} \"우린 깔끔하게 헤어질 줄 알았습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NobleFromRiverKingdoms/Cue_93771_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f9ebc7ba-22be-4978-89f7-3fff3daa4ef4"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles with the corners of her mouth.{/n} \"You are much more "
"patient than I. I am glad I can learn from your example.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 입가에 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"당신은 저보다 인내심이 많습니다. 당신에게서 많이 배울 수 있어 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ac0e9a2f-3434-4ce4-93b1-175b5258a6d9"
msgid "\"Wait! I wish to ask you something.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐! 너한테 물어보고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "03910417-046d-4759-a07c-f2ff5d069fd3"
msgid "\"I was happy to help! I'll see you soon in the Verdant Chambers.\""
msgstr "\"도움이 되어서 기뻐! 곧 신록의 화원에서 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "bb61746e-1dcb-43f6-bfda-f62fac805e28"
msgid ""
"\"I hope I will be well rewarded for my efforts. I did save you, along with "
"all your precious flowers and bushes.\""
msgstr "\"내 노력에대한 보상받을 수 있기를 바래. 나는 너의 소중한 꽃과 수풀과 함께 너를 구했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "658f8da8-7b9b-4782-b2e2-940df3227834"
msgid "\"I don't have time to wander through some thicket.\""
msgstr "\"나는 덤불을 헤맬 시간이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "89cd4f06-fc74-4cdf-a1bc-17977475ae99"
msgid "\"I don't need any reward. Seeing you is the best reward for me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 어떤 보상도 필요 없어. 너를 보는 것이 나에게 최고의 보상이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "e5ee287a-3959-4f22-abb5-2dde9bbbbbaa"
msgid ""
"{n}The appearance of the nymph is heralded by the familiar bouquet of herbs "
"and flowers, but the creature looks at you differently now.{/n} \"I greet "
"you, my savior! You, who defeated those who nearly brought my ruin...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 등장은 허브와 꽃으로 장식된 친숙한 꽃다발로 알아차릴 수 있었지만 그녀의 시선이 전과는 다릅니다.{/n} \"안녕, 나의 "
"구원자! 너는 나를 파괴할 뻔한 악당을 물리쳐주었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f93d6629-8584-44e0-88e7-35a69cba001f"
msgid ""
"\"I see your fate has changed since last we met... Now you are the ruler, "
"who will determine the destiny of these lands. I am their living heart, the "
"whisper of the wind, the strength of rivers, the luxuriant growth of the "
"meadows. Do you wish to touch this power?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 만난 이후로 너의 운명이 바뀌었다는 것은 알고 있어... 이제 너는 이 땅의 운명을 결정할 통치자야. 나는 그들의 마음속에서 "
"바람이 되어 강물이 되어 푸른 들판이 되어 살아가고 있어. 너도 이 힘을 느끼고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "162da987-ec99-4ede-8797-d751feb54107"
msgid ""
"\"I will show you a place where we can finally meet in flesh, you and I. "
"Deep in the woods there are old mossy ruins, long abandoned, nearly "
"swallowed by the thicket. There is an old tree, growing among the stones in "
"the yard, which I remember as a seed. The shadow under its green crown I "
"call my Verdant Chambers. Visit me there, my {mf|lord|lady}, and come alone. "
"A nymph's reward awaits you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 물리적으로 만날 수 있는 장소를 보여줄게. 숲속 깊이 오래되고 이끼가 낀 폐허가 덤불에 감춰져 있어. 거기에 가면 바위 사이에 "
"오래된 나무가 있는데 내 기억으로는 씨앗이었지. 그 나무 그늘 밑의 그림자를 나는 신록의 화원이라고 불러. 꼭 혼자 와줘. 님프의 보상이 "
"너를 기다리고 있을 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "61b91fac-aea8-4bf6-8f0e-e21d9f19361f"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me. Nymphs are not made for cities. The noise and vanity of human "
"settlements vex me. I will answer all your questions — but there, in the "
"silence of my asylum...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 용서해줘. 님프는 도시를 위한 존재가 아니야. 인간이 사는 곳의 소음과 허영심이 나를 괴롭혀. 하지만 내 은신처에서라면 모든 "
"질문에 답해줄게...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "3ccccb8a-f023-4832-aae0-b6213bde7b45"
msgid ""
"\"So long! I will await you there, as the ground waits for spring under the "
"heavy winter's snow.\""
msgstr "\"정말 오랜만이야! 추운 겨울의 눈 밑에서 봄이 오기를 기다리듯 너를 기다리고 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "a837decb-d676-4c68-8501-0dbe65246730"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's eyes sparkle.{/n} \"Oh, I offer much more than you can "
"imagine, my brave protector. I only need meet you face to face, for here I "
"am weak as an apparition... Come, I will be waiting!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 눈빛이 반짝입니다.{/n} \"네가 상상할 수 있는 것보다 훨씬 많은 것을 줄게. 너는 내 보호자니까. 나는 여기에서는 "
"유령처럼 약하니까 거기서 직접 너와 만나고 싶어... 거기서 기다릴게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "f5003d60-441f-4aa0-add2-88a7ac19ccea"
msgid ""
"\"I dare not insist. But if you change your mind — go to this ruins. I can "
"only reward you in my corporeal form. Here I am but an apparition, but "
"there, in my Verdant chambers, you will see me as I truly am...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 주장하지 않겠어. 그러나 마음이 바뀌면 폐허로 가. 거기서 나는 육체를 가질 수 있으니 너에게 보상 할 수 있어. 여기서 나는 "
"유령이지만 신록의 화원에서는 진정한 내 모습을 볼 수 있을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "10e66e3c-9775-475a-8e80-079242fd2440"
msgid ""
"{n}A savory aroma of herbs and flowers is the first thing that lets you know "
"that your longtime acquaintance is here. The nymph looks at you in a strange "
"way, like she's never looked at you before.{/n} \"Hello, my savior! You "
"asked if we'd meet again, and here I am...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}허브와 꽃의 풍부한 향기 때문에 당신은 잘 알고 있는 사람이 왔다는 것을 알게되었습니다. 님프는 결코 전에 당신을 보지 않은 것처럼 "
"당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"안녕. 나의 구원자! 네가 다시 만나자고 했지... 그래서 왔어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/NyrissaCallingToGainReward/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "06b041eb-f85b-4cb2-998d-600ea97802a0"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph laughs softly.{/n} \"Then come to my chamber and be my guest. "
"We'll share stories and laughter, imagine the future, and dream…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 부드럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그러면 내 화원으로 와서 손님이 되어줘. 우리는 이야기를 나누며 웃고 미래를 상상할 거야..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RandomEncounters/Barks/RE_RoadRiverBanditsTutorial_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "4fa79a8e-6296-4628-8ca0-2b8a0e656ca0"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings to ya, good sires! So, your money or your life, whatcha say?\""
msgstr "\"안녕! 돈을 줄래? 아니면 목숨을 줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RandomEncounters/Barks/SharedBark1_String
msgctxt "e7f60f6b-d5bd-4642-8bbc-33ecdecdb3bd"
msgid "\"Cut their throats!\""
msgstr "\"목을 베어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RandomEncounters/Barks/SharedBark3_String
msgctxt "e53e0205-925d-483c-93d1-666febcf5dce"
msgid "\"Slay them like swine!\""
msgstr "\"돼지처럼 그들을 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RandomEncounters/Barks/SharedBark4_String
msgctxt "73e13238-777f-480c-8604-3d3334a99aab"
msgid "\"Cut'em up, fellas!\""
msgstr "\"저들을 도살해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RandomEncounters/Barks/SharedBark5_String
msgctxt "76b4f45f-b05a-4501-b73b-9482b1f50c94"
msgid "\"Empty your pockets!\""
msgstr "\"주머니에 있는 것 모두 꺼내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RandomEncounters/Barks/SharedBark_String
msgctxt "26b73345-71d5-4d73-9266-491e27cf4ac7"
msgid "\"Your money or your life!\""
msgstr "\"돈 아니면 목숨을 내놔라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_1_String
msgctxt "24d9f815-f3d2-4e35-96d4-54d59924a409"
msgid "Mouth-watering broth is simmering in the pot."
msgstr "맛있어보이는 육수가 단지에서 끓고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_2_String
msgctxt "0cee4df7-4b5f-4e9c-bc83-9dfc38c053d2"
msgid ""
"The cart and its content have become completely worthless. You'll have to "
"leave it to rot here."
msgstr "마차와 내용물이 완전히 쓸모 없게 되었습니다. 당신은 이것을 버리고 가야 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_3_String
msgctxt "e71ee4b9-344c-43a1-8094-079e3ee9fb10"
msgid "The cart is unbroken, almost unharmed, and ready for new journeys."
msgstr "마차는 거의 손상되지 않았고 새로운 여행을 위한 준비가 되어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_4_String
msgctxt "46029fd0-6f07-426b-af5e-d77e096af9c2"
msgid "The gnomes fought fiercely, but eventually they were outnumbered."
msgstr "노움은 격렬하게 싸웠지만 결국 그들은 수가 많았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_5_String
msgctxt "3510fa0d-3e63-4562-afb9-a040fe508499"
msgid "The camp looks habitable. It's owners must be somewhere nearby."
msgstr "야영지에 머물 수 있을 것 같습니다. 소유자가 근처 어딘가에 있을 것이 틀림 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_6_String
msgctxt "dfd28543-e19f-4123-bd0e-4074c778df9a"
msgid "Kobold's corpses are badly burned by acid and alchemical fire."
msgstr "코볼트의 시체는 산과 연금술사의 불로 심하게 불타있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_GnomesAfterBattle_1_String
msgctxt "8d128a12-9265-4648-b6b8-007a32b21dc8"
msgid "\"Ooh… We made it!\""
msgstr "\"으... 우리가 해냈어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_GnomesAfterBattle_2_String
msgctxt "fc705b17-1e66-4804-ab85-4f409f289f55"
msgid "\"Hooray! We won!\""
msgstr "\"만세! 우리가 이겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Barks/Bark_GnomesAfterBattle_3_String
msgctxt "59277a12-66c1-4e5c-ae02-074ee57ebc48"
msgid "\"Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Answer_42169_Text
msgctxt "7884ca55-5a44-4ebf-843c-cdcf9a8e5537"
msgid "[Try to calm the ponies]"
msgstr "[조랑말을 진정시키려 합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Answer_89347_Text
msgctxt "95eb584c-0861-4bb0-8ba7-bfe0c8bbfdbb"
msgid "[Leave the ponies alone]"
msgstr "[조랑말을 내버려둡니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Cue_12254_Text
msgctxt "a6f59688-962c-4c82-82be-caa15dcc9f82"
msgid ""
"{n}The ponies are soothed by your voice, but as soon as you try to touch "
"them, they shy away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}조랑말은 당신의 목소리로 수그러들었지만 당신이 그들을 만지려고 하자 손길을 피합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Cue_12569_Text
msgctxt "ab0a9a30-c935-4824-935b-360b36fd22ed"
msgid ""
"{n}The ponies are soothed by your voice, but as soon as you try to touch "
"them, they shy away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}조랑말은 당신의 목소리로 수그러들었지만 당신이 그들을 만지려고 하자 손길을 피합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Cue_28607_Text
msgctxt "0fd635fe-0554-4610-9745-a88f1d328d50"
msgid ""
"{n}Soothed by your voice, the ponies let you touch them and stroke their "
"manes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 목소리에 수그러든 조랑말은 자신의 갈기를 만지도록 허락합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Cue_33901_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "114f2b6c-dcd3-4b0e-80c6-6c169e6ec426"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, these are my ponies! Stupid animals, why did you flee the camp?\" {n}"
"The gnome glares at the ponies, who seem unperturbed.{/n} \"On the other "
"hand, if you were smart, I suppose you'd want me to pay for your services. I "
"guess it's in all our best interests that you stay stupid.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 이놈들은 내 조랑말이야! 바보 같은 동물들. 왜 야영지를 도망갔지?\" {n}노움은 혼란스러워 하는 조랑말들을 노려 "
"보았습니다.{/n} \"네가 똑똑하다면 내 돈을 받으려고 하지 않을 거야. 그냥 네가 바보처럼 있는 것이 최선이겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Cue_49082_Text
msgctxt "5698f26f-d613-42d4-9fa6-d39aa606d00b"
msgid ""
"{n}Soothed by your voice, the ponies let you touch them and stroke their "
"manes. You decide to lead them to the river to help drag the gnome's cart "
"out.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 목소리에 수그러든 조랑말은 자신의 갈기를 만지도록 허락합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Cue_62421_Text
msgctxt "97887102-e67d-4f24-8c95-c251935473ce"
msgid ""
"{n}Soothed by your voice, the ponies let you touch them and stroke their "
"manes. You decide to lead them to the river to help drag the gnome's cart "
"out.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 목소리에 수그러든 조랑말은 자신의 갈기를 만지도록 허락합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Pony/Pony_StartCue_Cue_Text
msgctxt "0472fe2e-06f4-40b8-b426-e97b70c0d05c"
msgid ""
"{n}A pair of scared ponies stands before you. They don't run away, but they "
"snort loudly and neigh as you approach. These are most likely the spare pair "
"of ponies the gnome expedition used to pull their cart. When the kobolds "
"attacked, they weren't tied to the cart, so they just pulled themselves free "
"and fled into the forest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}겁먹은 조랑말 한 쌍이 당신 앞에 서 있습니다. 그들은 도망가지 않지만 당신이 접근하자 큰소리로 웁니다. 이놈들은 노움이 마차를 끌 "
"때 몰던 조랑말 같습니다. 코볼트가 공격했을 때 그들은 마차에 묶여 있지 않았기 때문에 자유롭게 숲으로 도망쳤습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Answer_96314_Text
msgctxt "5162e481-01f5-42b2-b38e-2b5c767aefb0"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuccio, I recognize you. What is this new disguise — and why are you "
"not dead?\""
msgstr "\"타투치오. 너인지 알겠다. 왜 죽지도 않고 이런 모습을 하고 나타난 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Answer_96315_Text
msgctxt "937833da-57d7-46b4-ba21-0f24a1fb05c2"
msgid "\"Easy. Let's discuss this. No need to shed blood over some cart.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 이것에 대해 이야기를 해보자. 마차 가지고 피를 흘릴 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Answer_96316_Text
msgctxt "c2938acc-3555-4e01-ad1e-372b92595294"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've killed you once and I'll be happy to do it again!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너를 한 번 죽였고 다시 죽일 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_02679_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "5929ee4d-2cdf-4c68-a63a-abcbfaaaf13d"
msgid ""
"{n}The head of the gnome expedition wipes his brow and glares at the "
"kobold.{/n} \"This bastard was the one talking our ears off while the rest "
"of them were trying to steal our cart.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움 여행자는 이마를 훔치고 코볼트를 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"이 나쁜 녀석은 다른 녀석들이 우리에게 말을 걸었을 때 마차를 훔쳐간 "
"녀석이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_37656_Text
#. Speaker : Rival
msgctxt "4da8ad34-d12e-4937-9597-24b82b2700d0"
msgid ""
"\"Koboldsss want thisss cart! Koboldsss ssshall have it!\" {n}The horse "
"skull hides most of the kobold's face, but you see his vicious eyes glinting "
"through the empty sockets, staring at you.{/n} \"By ordersss of myssself, "
"the gloriousss King {d|Tartuk}Tartuk{/d}!\" {n}The kobold pounds his chest "
"with his fist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트는 이 마차 원한다! 코볼트 가질 거다!\" {n}말의 머리가 코볼트의 얼굴을 거의 가렸지만 당신은 그의 텅 빈 눈구멍이 당신을 "
"노려본다는 것을 알았습니다.{/n} \"{d|Tartuk}타툭{/d}에게 영광을!\" {n}코볼트가 주먹으로 가슴을 두들깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_53461_Text
#. Speaker : Rival
msgctxt "5d829d40-4947-4540-8463-76dc9a389d63"
msgid ""
"{n}There's a... purple kobold on the river bank, who looks just like your "
"old acquaintance, Tartuccio!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}강둑에 보라색 코볼트가 있습니다. 당신이 알고 있던 타투치오처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_62233_Text
#. Speaker : SecondKobold
msgctxt "bb60017f-01ce-4a1b-8b6e-93dd764a43ca"
msgid "\"Ssstupid.\""
msgstr "\"멍청이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_80087_Text
#. Speaker : FirstKobold
msgctxt "0cf394ae-aeb5-4ddc-b7f8-35794e9b9dd5"
msgid "\"Ssshirdazzz! Ssshirdazzz!\""
msgstr "\"슈슈쉬르다즈르르! 슈슈쉬르다즈르르!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_81498_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost
msgctxt "1fcb56f6-2169-43af-a237-a5cbf61626f4"
msgid ""
"\"KING Tartuk!\" {n}The gnome looks at you and winks.{/n} \"What do you say "
"to a bit of regicide?\""
msgstr "\"타툭 왕!\" {n}노움은 당신을 보고는 윙크합니다.{/n} \"할 말 있냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_87754_Text
#. Speaker : SecondKobold
msgctxt "f6e3c398-7827-44b9-a01a-fb46c6b196d5"
msgid "\"Tartuk! King!\""
msgstr "\"타툭! 왕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_96312_Text
#. Speaker : FirstKobold
msgctxt "9f9a1152-30e5-49d6-addc-9b75e34f0e65"
msgid "\"Gnome!\""
msgstr "\"노움!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Cue_96317_Text
#. Speaker : Rival
msgctxt "c5e93ab9-945b-4ab5-91e3-0211eb782333"
msgid "\"No. The gnome and hisss friendsss will sssee our rage! Shhhirdazzz!\""
msgstr "\"안돼. 노움과 다른 녀석들 우리의 분노 볼 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Rival_Continue01_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : Rival
msgctxt "699af641-325b-48f3-b01b-abc2f661d3d8"
msgid ""
"\"How dare you ssspeak like that to King? Koboldsss, attack! Ssshirdazzz!\""
msgstr "\"쉬익! 어찌 왕에게 그리 무례한 말을 하는가! 쉬익! 코볼트, 공격하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Rival/Rival_StartCue_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : Rival
msgctxt "fea22319-06f2-48df-a461-3679a1a3467b"
msgid ""
"\"Ssso, the gnome invitesss sssome of hisss friendsss. Ssstupid, ssslow, "
"sssluggish gnome.\""
msgstr "\"쉬익, 노움이 친구들을 초대했다. 멍청하고 느릿느릿한 노움.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_11866_Text
msgctxt "2f7b26a6-e7d0-4f97-9346-b02b91ddc936"
msgid "Gathering our strength, we began pulling the cart from the river."
msgstr "우리는 힘을 모아 강에서 마차를 당기기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_13669_Text
msgctxt "163e3f5c-7da5-4e7e-af3e-2aff88862a34"
msgid ""
"Why think when you have strong hands? The baron{mf||ess} decided that, if "
"the cart won't give, we just needed to pull harder."
msgstr "강한 두 손이 있는데 생각할 필요가 있을까요? 당신은 마차를 내버려둘지 더 세게 당겨야 할지 결정해야 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_23211_Text
msgctxt "fe7f3b1a-4862-4a5a-a6fe-6562e337c7cd"
msgid ""
"It seems there was little sense in wedging the lever beneath the wheel — it "
"wasn't the least bit stable, and all our efforts on it were wasted. The "
"baron{mf||ess} tried to find a better use for it."
msgstr ""
"바퀴 아래 레버를 고정하는 것은 의미가 없는 것 같습니다. 고정되어 있지도 않았고 우리의 노력은 헛수고였습니다. 당신은 좋은 방법을 "
"찾기로 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_28480_Text
msgctxt "2d166d54-9051-44b6-abf8-c04cfba95372"
msgid ""
"A huge stone on the riverbed was blocking the cart, so the baron{mf||ess} "
"tried to find it and move it out of the way."
msgstr "강바닥의 거대한 돌이 마차를 막고 있었으므로 당신은 그것을 찾아 치우려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_31946_Text
msgctxt "9acb3761-5b9d-43b4-9521-a285f942079f"
msgid ""
"The exhausted ponies had worked themselves up into a lather, and foam "
"covered the bits in their teeth. The baron{mf||ess} tried to calm and "
"reassure them."
msgstr "지친 조랑말들은 입에 거품을 물었습니다. 당신은 그들을 진정시키려고했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_55455_Text
msgctxt "c1e68862-7c62-4361-beb7-83a6e2b1250a"
msgid ""
"[Choose a character] One of us tried to jump onto the cart to untie the "
"ponies still standing in the water."
msgstr "[캐릭터 선택] 우리 중 한 명은 마차 위로 뛰어 올라 물 속에 있는 조랑말을 풀어주려고 노력했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_55856_Text
msgctxt "2b15da24-0540-4eca-9808-d0a9919fb320"
msgid "We tied a rope to the cart."
msgstr "우리는 마차에 로프를 묶었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_57142_Text
msgctxt "40243e2b-41ad-437b-9d79-bea7ff449a29"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_60040_Text
msgctxt "7d1a8703-9de6-4137-aa16-2ba4c6a30a69"
msgid ""
"Everyone was soaking wet, freezing, and exhausted. The group's initial "
"enthusiasm had all but vanished. They glared at the cart scornfully, ready "
"to give up and forget about it like it was all a bad dream. The "
"baron{mf||ess} decided it was time to raise everyone's spirits — be it with "
"a smile, a noble order, some shouting, or even a good round of swearing."
msgstr ""
"모두 젖고 추위에 떨며 지쳤습니다. 처음에 있었던 열정은 모두 사라졌습니다. 그들은 마차를 원망스럽게 바라보고 모두 나쁜 꿈이었던 것처럼 "
"잊어버리려고 했습니다. 당신은 모두의 기운을 차리게 해 줄 시간이라고 생각했습니다. 미소를 짓고 동료들에게 하나하나 시켜가며 가끔은 욕도 "
"하고 소리도 치는 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_62767_Text
msgctxt "459e5cc3-2cbf-4e59-9dd7-160c7fea2347"
msgid "We tried to pull the cart out."
msgstr "우리는 마차를 꺼내려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_80754_Text
msgctxt "060a74ab-e9c2-4cba-b246-46ff20c2a024"
msgid "We set the crowbar under the cart's wheel."
msgstr "우리는 마차의 바퀴 아래에 쇠지렛대를 박았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_84699_Text_String
msgctxt "2556b5f8-e3bc-4a88-9d6d-40eac9adc0c2"
msgid ""
"We left the cart alone for a moment, hoping to find something helpful nearby."
msgstr "우리는 무언가 근처에 도움이 될 만한 것을 찾기를 바라며 잠시 마차를 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_99110_Text
msgctxt "96c36997-8e72-415e-ab31-d90816cf55b7"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Answer_99111_Text
msgctxt "97accd24-3a49-45b1-9b43-acf60d63d929"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_05209_Text
msgctxt "1d3b40af-39f0-4a80-b099-bd87d4f978a4"
msgid ""
"\"Almost everything's still in place,\" he announced cheerfully, jumping "
"from the cart. \"It's all wet and crumpled, but at least nothing's missing. "
"Thank you, travelers. If not for your help — guided by my keen supervision, "
"of course — I'd have had to say goodbye to all my possessions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거의 모든 것이 여전히 제자리에 있다.\"그는 기쁘게 말하면서 마차 위에 뛰어 올랐습니다. \"모든 것이 젖고 구겨졌지만 적어도 "
"잃어버린 것은 아무것도 없다. 고마워. 물론 나의 뛰어난 지도력이 있었지만 너희 도움이 아니었다면 내 소지품들과 작별인사를 해야 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_07543_Text
msgctxt "a61f8baa-1a26-4cb7-92a2-d31189216d11"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you just standing around?! Go on, help them!\" The head of the "
"gnome expedition was visibly dissatisfied as he shouted."
msgstr "\"왜 그냥 서있어? 어서 도와줘!\" 소리치는 노움 원정대의 대장은 불만스러운 것 같았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_14201_Text
msgctxt "88db2342-a491-492e-931a-762a2a5ec29f"
msgid ""
"Losing no time, the head of the gnome expedition jumped inside. For a good "
"while, rattling and swearing were all that could be heard from the cart, "
"until the gnome's face finally reappeared from under the rooftop, seemingly "
"satisfied."
msgstr ""
"시간 낭비없이 노움 원정대 대장이 안으로 뛰어 들어갔습니다. 잠시 동안은 덜그럭거리는 소리와 욕하는 소리가 마차에서 들렸고 노움의 얼굴은 "
"만족한 듯 지붕에서 다시 내려왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_23886_Text
msgctxt "991ce5be-4fce-4434-ae34-2663a64e70f8"
msgid ""
"The head of the gnome expedition not only survived, he was the first to "
"regain consciousness. Barely managing to catch the cart's wheel by the rim, "
"he began struggling with it, grunting and swearing as his face went red from "
"his efforts to save the cart from drowning."
msgstr ""
"노움 원정대 대장은 생존했을 뿐만 아니라 그들 중에서 제일 먼저 의식을 회복했습니다. 그의 마차 바퀴를 잡으려고 노력하던 그는 낑낑거리고 "
"불평을 했고 물에 잠긴 마차를 구하려다 그의 얼굴은 붉어졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_34334_Text
msgctxt "3109e337-57ef-4fc8-8fa4-9bb43047b93f"
msgid ""
"The ponies twitched and neighed nervously, making the process of freeing "
"them from the cart even more difficult. Once the job was done and they "
"sensed they were finally free, they ran off into the nearby forest, and the "
"head of the gnome expedition burst into another round of swearing."
msgstr ""
"불안감에 빠진 조랑말은 마차에서 빠져나오려고 노력했지만 오히려 더 힘들어질 뿐이었습니다. 그들이 마침내 빠져나왔을 때 그들은 근처의 "
"숲으로 달려갔고 노움 원정대 대장은 또 다시 욕을 퍼부었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_36332_Text
msgctxt "4da18159-6a03-474a-944c-eb4a4fac5b1e"
msgid ""
"After everyone struggled together for a while, the cart finally made it out "
"of the muddy riverbed and rolled back onto the rocky ground of the wading "
"ford, prompting some seemingly indignant sloshes and squelches as the river "
"released its trophy and rushed along in search of easier prey."
msgstr ""
"모두가 함께 낑낑댔을 때 마차는 마침내 강바닥의 진흙에서 빠져나와 돌바닥으로 굴러갔고 강이 마차를 토해내었을 때 수레는 물에 흠뻑 젖은 "
"상태였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_41581_Text
msgctxt "298e49a2-5b07-40cf-b777-e028ef74f301"
msgid ""
"\"Ready?! Ah, my foot!\" The head of the gnome expedition yelled, his face "
"red and angry. \"With help like this, my possessions will be down the river "
"in a flash! Just... go to the camp, or find those runaway ponies, or find "
"some other way to help! Gods!\""
msgstr ""
"\"준비 됐어?! 아! 내 발!\" 노움 원정대 대장은 소리를 질렀고 얼굴을 붉히며 화를 냈습니다. \"너의 도움으로 내 물건들이 강물 "
"속으로 빠져버렸어! 야영지로 가서 도망간 조랑말을 찾던가 다른 도울 방법을 찾아봐! 젠장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_44670_Text
msgctxt "7b2ab21e-c360-44c0-8137-10cfbcbd9cb1"
msgid ""
"Valerie frowned. \"Better you should trust in our dignity than our greed, "
"sir gnome.\""
msgstr "발레리는 눈살을 찌푸렸습니다. \"우리의 탐욕보다는 존엄성을 믿는 것이 나을 것입니다. 노움.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_50266_Text
msgctxt "3aa52cce-0e5f-46ce-bfc0-8ebc30a2f98f"
msgid ""
"Set under the wheel, the crowbar wedged into position against the stones on "
"the riverbed, making the process of pulling the cart out of the river easier."
msgstr "바퀴 아래에 박힌 쇠지렛대는 강바닥에 있는 돌에 박혀 강에서 마차를 끌어내는 것을 쉽게 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_53550_Text
msgctxt "5f84b551-84e7-4dd5-ba72-1687e4b53c7e"
msgid ""
"After plunging into the cold river, the ponies immediately lost their nerve. "
"Swiveling their ears and twitching, they tried to chew through the reins and "
"throw off the load."
msgstr ""
"차가운 강으로 가라 앉은 후 조랑말들은 평정을 잃었습니다. 귀를 흔들고 씰룩거리며 노움들은 받줄을 끊어 짐을 버리려고 노력했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_56518_Text
msgctxt "df8bb2d9-1906-469e-afa5-2f722564b6b0"
msgid ""
"Now calm and tied securely to the cart, the ponies neighed quietly, awaiting "
"the order to begin pulling the cart from the river."
msgstr "차분해져서 마차에 묶인 조랑말들은 마차를 강에서 꺼내기를 조용하게 기다렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_56975_Text
msgctxt "9ba68bb9-8c78-48da-ae83-d121eda82829"
msgid ""
"The surviving gnomes, led by the head of the gnome expedition — an extremely "
"loud and crabby fellow, but not without some managerial talent — were able "
"to catch the cart before it floated away. Faces red and grunting from the "
"strain, they struggled to keep it from drowning entirely."
msgstr ""
"큰 소리만 내고 아무 능력도 없던 노움 원정대의 살아있는 노움들은 마차가 물에 떠내려가기 전에 잡을 수 있었습니다. 얼굴은 붉어지고 "
"끙끙대며 그들은 빠지는 것을 막으려고 애를 씁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_59191_Text
msgctxt "0ca6d1c0-91ba-465e-9094-37d3c7265887"
msgid ""
"Just then, a package fell into the water. With a heartbreaking splash, it "
"vanished beneath the current, only to resurface ten meters down the river. "
"\"No!\" The head of the gnome expedition moaned as he glowered at the "
"package. \"That was 'Alchemy and Life,' the latest issue!\""
msgstr ""
"그 때 상자 하나가 물로 떨어졌습니다. 그것은 애타는 첨벙 소리와 함께 수면 아래로 사라졌고, 10미터 쯤 쓸려간 뒤에야 다시 "
"떠오릅니다. \"안돼!\" 노움 원정대의 우두머리가 상자를 바라보며 절규했습니다. \"'연금술과 삶' 최신호가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_64112_Text
msgctxt "b8ec7b88-6b95-4669-b1ef-4caab0b3b333"
msgid ""
"One, two, three... and the rope was securely tied to the cart, making it "
"easier to pull out. A good lesson for every adventurer: never leave home "
"without a rope! Rope is your best friend!"
msgstr ""
"하나, 둘, 셋... 로프가 마차에 단단히 묶여있어 꺼내기가 더 쉬워졌습니다. 모든 모험가에게 좋은 교훈이 있습니다. 밧줄없이 집을 "
"떠나지 마십시오! 로프는 당신의 가장 친한 친구입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_67044_Text
msgctxt "c313e2ef-cdb5-4b42-8086-bd16fdc659f1"
msgid ""
"But that sly snake of a river decided that, if she couldn't have her trophy, "
"no one would. Instead of riding out on the ford, the cart began to lean, "
"then slowly, almost magnificently, fell on its side. The scream of triumph "
"only made it halfway before sticking in the gnome's throat."
msgstr ""
"그러나 강은 교활한 뱀처럼 자신의 트로피를 가질 수 없다면 아무도 가지지 못하게 할 것이라고 결정했습니다. 바닥에서 빠져나오기보다는 "
"마차는 기울어져서 천천히 가라앉고 있었습니다. 승리의 외침이 노움의 목에 반쯤 걸렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_77688_Text
msgctxt "7e431d6f-197b-4bfd-9e17-1eeb15ec9c8d"
msgid ""
"\"Son of a troll...\" The perplexed gnome gazed on as his collection of "
"boxes, packages, and bags slowly floated away. That gaze then came to rest "
"on us. \"Well then... Thank you, travelers, for your oh-so-invaluable help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤 같은 녀석...\"당황한 노움은 떠내려가는 자신의 상자와 짐들, 가방을 봅니다. 그 눈빛이 우리에게 향합니다. \"정말 고맙다. "
"쓸 데 없는 도움을 줘서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_79190_Text
msgctxt "ef1af4fb-a4cb-4e95-b677-8eec432e0174"
msgid ""
"The cart creaked and cracked, sounding as though it were sobbing. The boards "
"strained against the combined stress of the rushing water's pull against "
"everyone trying to pull the cart ashore. Unfortunately for the cart, both "
"sides were of equal strength. Something had to be done, or the poor cart "
"would be torn to pieces!"
msgstr ""
"마차가 삐그덕거리면서 우는 것 같은 소리를 냅니다. 마차가 물살에 휩쓸려 모두가 마차를 강가로 꺼내려는 것을 막습니다. 불행히도 마차는 "
"힘이 한쪽으로 쏠렸습니다. 무언가 하지 않는다면 마차는 조각이 날 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_79753_Text
msgctxt "2d60efce-0585-436a-a256-ace285df8649"
msgid ""
"{name} nimbly climbed onto the roof of the cart and carefully crawled toward "
"the ponies hitched up at the riverbank."
msgstr "{name}은(는) 마차의 꼭대기에 날렵하게 올라가서 조심스럽게 조랑말에게 기어가 강둑으로 몰아갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_87457_Text
msgctxt "37671c1e-f41c-4664-98fd-733b4638782f"
msgid ""
"\"If you're certain you're ready, then let's do it. But be careful! Imagine "
"the cart's full of gold, or ale, or some other thing you couldn't bear to "
"lose!\""
msgstr "\"준비가 되었다면 시작하자. 하지만 조심해! 마차가 금이나 에일 같이 소중한 것이 들어있다고 생각하고 움직여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_88776_Text
msgctxt "019d1df0-37f8-44ba-8745-8feeb216bfde"
msgid ""
"While the gnomes were busy fighting the kobolds, furiously cursing and "
"diligently punching their unwelcome guests right in their dragonish snouts, "
"the cart was all but forgotten. The unwitting cause of the fight, it was "
"being dragged away by the scared ponies when it slid down the ford, sinking "
"all the way up to the coachman's seat in the river. This was where the {g|"
"Skunk River}Skunk River{/g} flows into the {g|Tuskwater}Tuskwater{/g}, and "
"the current becomes excessively spiteful — cold, stubborn, and turbulent. "
"Having taken hold of the gnomes' cart, the Skunk River must have decided to "
"drag it down amid all the commotion, but it was caught in the act."
msgstr ""
"노움들이 저주를 퍼붓고 주먹을 날리는 코볼트와 싸우느라 바쁜 동안, 마차는 완전히 잊혀졌습니다. 싸움의 원인이었던 그 마차는 여울로 "
"미끄러지자 겁을 먹은 조랑말들이 끌어올리고 있었습니다만, 이미 마부석까지 잠긴 상태입니다. 그곳은 {g|Skunk River}스컹크 "
"강{/g}이 {g|Tuskwater}터스크워터{/g}로 흐르는 곳이며, 또한 물살이 매우 매서워지는 지점이었습니다. 차갑고, 빠르고, "
"소용돌이쳤지요. 스컹크 강은 난리통 사이에 노움의 마차를 단단히 붙들고 끌어내리려 했습니다만, 그렇게 되기 직전에 발각되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_92153_Text
msgctxt "09f248f5-bac4-40fa-830f-28b8001f2cbe"
msgid ""
"The ponies seemed to be relieved to feel a firm hand holding the reins "
"again. The calmed down at once and allowed themselves to be unhitched. In "
"just a few moments, they were standing back at the ford, ready to pull the "
"cart from the river."
msgstr ""
"조랑말은 누군가 고삐를 다시 잡은 것 같아서 안심했습니다. 침착해져서 그들은 도망가지 않았습니다. 잠시 후에 그들은 서서 마차를 꺼낼 "
"준비를 마쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_94943_Text
msgctxt "3b8373c5-398b-4e6a-bbec-7abfd6ef537c"
msgid ""
"The gnome rolls his eyes. \"For gods' sake, whatever! Just pull the cart!\""
msgstr "노움이 눈을 굴립니다. \"젠장. 어쨌든 마차를 당겨!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_97233_Text
msgctxt "52c71f79-cc39-43ca-9a22-8f0759f557fa"
msgid ""
"After resisting our efforts for a while, the cart finally began to give. "
"Squelching loudly in the mud, it jerked forward, and as the head of the "
"gnome expedition opened his mouth to let out a victory cry..."
msgstr ""
"우리의 노력에 한동안 저항한 듸, 마차가 마침내 움직이기 시작했습니다. 진흙 속에서 큰소리를 내며 마차는 앞으로 나아갔고, 노움 원정대 "
"대장은 승리의 외침을 내보내려고 입을 열었습니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/RiverFord/Wagon/Cue_99109_Text
msgctxt "3805d428-1790-44fb-b6ed-3a88bcf0d0b4"
msgid ""
"{name} tripped on the edge of the cart and fell awkwardly on the roof, "
"startling the already frightened ponies even more."
msgstr "{name}은(는) 마차 끝을 덥석 잡고 기어올라, 이미 겁에 질려있는 조랑말을 더 놀라게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_07371_Text
msgctxt "8d7a2736-bd00-4859-8174-76d3cde03f6b"
msgid "\"How's your research going?\""
msgstr "\"연구는 어떻게 되고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_08176_Text
msgctxt "9af5e915-58de-474d-a0be-51db16953703"
msgid "[Accompany Bartholomew] \"Lead the way.\""
msgstr "[바솔로뮤와 동행합니다] \"길을 안내해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_08790_Text
msgctxt "0aa7a78f-bb0a-4a1d-aa92-9d4aaafc5f94"
msgid ""
"\"We cleared out a nearby lair of trolls who were resistant to fire, "
"somehow. I'd like to be sure new ones with the same resistance won't appear. "
"Do you happen to know anything about the matter?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 불에 저항하는 트롤 소굴 주위를 깨끗이 했어. 그런 저항력을 가진 트롤이 더 생긴다면 안되겠지. 너는 그 일에 대해 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_18519_Text
msgctxt "e2630089-d1f0-4fb5-a39e-91fe1b46f2fd"
msgid "\"Those traps in the woods — are they yours?\""
msgstr "\"숲 속의 함정들은 네 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_28080_Text
msgctxt "cc2ffc4a-d7c2-4487-b7bb-130e2bc5ea97"
msgid "\"Enough about traps. I have an important question.\""
msgstr "\"함정에 대해서는 충분하다. 중요한 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_28468_Text
msgctxt "dfbb4806-36da-4f20-b9a7-0f4557a9f2bb"
msgid ""
"\"Your experiments aren't safe — stop them immediately. And kill the troll.\""
msgstr "\"너의 실험은 안전하지 않아. 즉시 멈추고 트롤을 죽여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_31208_Text
msgctxt "7412983b-b70d-46bb-b99f-e5cef382608b"
msgid "\"Well, good luck with your work.\""
msgstr "\"행운을 빈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_31758_Text
msgctxt "1a539786-8feb-4d7b-b504-a2f089803ac4"
msgid "\"You seem an educated man. What are you doing in these woods?\""
msgstr "\"너는 교육을 받은 것처럼 보이는데. 이 숲에서 뭐하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_34415_Text
msgctxt "0f6d4141-7070-466c-83b0-9ab854c6dcff"
msgid ""
"\"Could I persuade you to stay? I could use someone familiar with magic.\""
msgstr "\"여기 머물어 보겠어? 나는 마법을 사용할 줄 아는 사람이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_35787_Text
msgctxt "56553402-e75c-4a55-b59b-563f9af81eb0"
msgid "\"It's time to leave. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"떠날 시간이야. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_42362_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c904f94e-950b-46fb-80e4-191b3e304e67"
msgid "Executed Bartholomew the wizard for no reason."
msgstr "마법사 바솔로뮤를 이유 없이 처형합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_42362_Text
msgctxt "807ce49c-6492-4e8e-8a18-b8f7cd705555"
msgid "[Attack] \"I no longer require your services.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 더 이상 너의 서비스는 필요하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_44362_Text
msgctxt "27070f74-f4ea-4f6d-b508-72785160ecd3"
msgid "[Remain silent]"
msgstr "[침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_45405_Text
msgctxt "bee2072e-5a11-41a1-8190-3a4840c67fca"
msgid "\"You go ahead. We need to prepare for the battle first.\""
msgstr "\"먼저 가. 우리는 먼저 전투에 대비해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_45808_Text
msgctxt "7a400f33-a681-4555-9a9d-9188f57cfbfc"
msgid "\"The rock troll in the woods nearby — is it real?\""
msgstr "\"근처의 숲에 있는 바위 트롤은 진짜야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_46754_Text
msgctxt "64a38dcf-15c5-4392-b8fe-617ce52ae86f"
msgid "\"Have you executed my order?\""
msgstr "\"내 명령을 이행했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_68624_Text
msgctxt "3258d2be-9c89-4891-a174-6116d4026a80"
msgid "\"Packing? Are you leaving us soon?\""
msgstr "\"짐을 싼다고? 우리를 떠날 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_75879_Text
msgctxt "bc9901e9-e424-48b9-ad77-556f6046efd4"
msgid ""
"\"I'm told you're an expert on local monsters. Do you know anything about "
"the local trolls that are resistant to fire?\""
msgstr "\"네가 지역 괴물에 대해 전문가라고 들었어. 불에 저항하는 지역 트롤에 대해 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_78438_Text
msgctxt "2a798187-8f8e-42b9-9ed9-e18bd1504718"
msgid "[Leave] \"Enough, Octavia. Let's go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"충분해. 옥타비아. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_81900_Text
msgctxt "2cdc6cf3-8722-48a7-b55f-abbcf1b96044"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes even those who can read get caught in your traps. A trader by "
"the name of Waine, for instance.\""
msgstr "\"때로는 글을 읽을 줄 아는 사람도 당신의 함정에 걸려들기도 해. 예를 들면 웨인이라는 상인이라던지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_85298_Text
msgctxt "b6613a72-12c6-49c5-ab73-0020658a58e5"
msgid "\"What about local bandits? Do they bother you here?\""
msgstr "\"도적단은 어때? 그들이 너를 괴롭히나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_95194_Text
msgctxt "f7034377-77a9-4c12-a6d3-1441025e29bb"
msgid "\"A question about the traps...\""
msgstr "\"함정에 관해서 말인데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_98974_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c133775c-b88a-417c-a506-efaf64bc4da5"
msgid ""
"Persuaded Bartholomew the wizard to forgo his grievances and remain in the "
"barony."
msgstr "마법사 바솔로뮤를 설득해서 불만을 풀어주고 영지에 남게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_98974_Text
msgctxt "a0e9417a-6c6e-41a1-83d2-12febb9f4b81"
msgid ""
"\"I regret what I've done. I shouldn't intervene in your affairs. If you "
"agree to stay, I promise to never do so again.\""
msgstr "\"내가 한 일을 유감스럽게 생각한다. 너의 일에 개입해서는 안되었어. 네가 남는다면 다시는 그런 짓을 하지 않을게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Answer_Trade_Text
msgctxt "f8b156d3-438c-4a40-ba0a-d7820d4a7273"
msgid ""
"\"You promised to show me your wares. Something about 'the most modest of "
"prices,' if I recall.\""
msgstr "\"너의 제품을 보여 주기로 약속했지. 내 기억에 의하면 '가장 적절한 가격'이라고 했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/Bart_Gone_String
msgctxt "502b55f1-d360-442d-ad6c-2b8ababa9953"
msgid ""
"There is a note pinned to the door. \"Moved to Cheliax, not to return. Will "
"contact all debtors myself. Bartholomew Delgado.\""
msgstr ""
"문에 쪽지가 고정되어 있습니다.\"첼리악스로 가서 돌아오지 않는다. 내가 직접 가서 채무자들과 접촉해 보지. -바솔로뮤 델가도-\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/SadisticMage_Basement_Table_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "5cbe06f4-14d2-436c-a1ea-20e3d33ff32b"
msgid "What kinds of experiments does he conduct here?"
msgstr "여기서 그는 어떤 실험을 하는 걸까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/SadisticMage_Basement_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "d7c61b23-89a7-45ec-8904-b99ef8d77b6f"
msgid ""
"Serrated knives, stained needles, and manacles share shelves with flasks, "
"vials, and chemicals."
msgstr "톱니 모양의 칼, 녹슨 바늘이 보이고 선반 위에 플라스크와 화학 약품등이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/SadisticMage_Exterior_DeadTrader_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "3c036355-dda7-4461-ac18-5377c03661e9"
msgid "The trader's corpse is still warm. He died recently."
msgstr "상인의 시체는 여전히 따뜻합니다. 그는 얼마 전에 죽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/SadisticMage_Exterior_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "75166b09-663a-4845-8eec-b9170f80c7a7"
msgid ""
"A cozy house stands away from the main roads. An excellent place for a "
"hermit."
msgstr "큰 길에서 떨어진 아늑한 집이 있습니다. 은둔을 위한 훌륭한 장소입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/SadisticMage_Exterior_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "da2775bd-6b85-4cf5-9c4f-3143ad3fe0df"
msgid "The stone is covered with soot."
msgstr "돌은 검은 연기 자국으로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/SadisticMage_Exterior_WhatToBark 3_String
msgctxt "5b6d06c9-f4d2-46b4-9f03-b823fd2ef4b4"
msgid "The bark is charred and blackened in places."
msgstr "나무 껍질은 숯이 되었고 곳곳이 까맣습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/SadisticMage_Exterior_WhatToBark 4_String
msgctxt "9ba57629-44ba-4e3f-aae5-a66ec8e35420"
msgid ""
"The fence is low and there are no gates. The owner of this place doesn't "
"seem to be afraid of intruders."
msgstr "울타리는 낮고 문이 없습니다. 이 장소의 주인은 침입자를 두려워하지 않는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/SadisticMage_Exterior_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "00673c63-7353-4307-a068-5f0ce97f4680"
msgid "Looks like these bandits died after triggering a trap."
msgstr "이 도둑이 함정을 발동한 후 사망한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/ScaredTraderBarksCommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "f67c0a80-baf6-4b25-bc77-bc99c30895df"
msgid "\"Somebody, save me-e-e!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 나를 구해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/ScaredTraderBarksCommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "02312125-34e2-4422-97a9-cd7f382ea147"
msgid "\"He-e-e-elp!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Barks/ScaredTraderBarksCommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "5313beec-dc29-41f7-bb5d-05c0fc46e1b9"
msgid "\"HELP! HELP!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘! 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_02886 1_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "9192c579-f654-4ecc-baba-7c2a9563e906"
msgid "{n}Bartholomew pretends not to have heard the comment.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 말을 듣지 않은 척합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_02886_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "822f6337-5dae-40a4-acad-d34e8f48b3a6"
msgid "{n}Bartholomew gives a wry smile.{/n} \"Yes, that's equally valuable.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 쓴 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"맞습니다. 똑같이 가치있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_09342_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "329eddd3-6e71-49a5-94c9-4c2d46605f40"
msgid "\"I'm happy to answer to the best of my humble knowledge.\""
msgstr "\"저의 미천한 지식이라도 답이 되었다니 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_10067_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "24db44f8-39f5-4211-8354-db29ec387dcc"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt I can tell you anything of interest,\" {n}Bartholomew mutters "
"without looking you in the eye.{/n}"
msgstr "\"흥미로워할 만한 이야기가 있을런지 모르겠군요.\" {n}바솔로뮤는 당신의 눈을 보지 않으며 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_13690_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "e64eb382-ed23-45bc-9244-9973489b66b4"
msgid ""
"\"I'm simply a humble servant of my {mf|baron|baroness},\" {n}the wizard "
"answers coldly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"저는 그저 영주님의 겸손한 하인입니다.\" {n}마법사는 냉담하게 대답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_14050_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "6b9eaedf-6e09-4d1f-b2db-b8b7a7c4bb77"
msgid ""
"\"I won't lie, there's still much to be done — years of research. That's no "
"small task for me and for my... assistant. Still, one must be ready to make "
"sacrifices for knowledge!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말은 하지 않겠습니다. 아직 수년간 해야할 연구들이 많이 남아있습니다. 저에게나 저의 조수에게나 사소한 일이 아닙니다. 아직 "
"지식을 위해 희생할 준비가 되어 있어야 하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_15650_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "e390c086-e7a8-43eb-9479-c869b990a787"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes. I'm quite proud of that one, actually. You see, trolls rarely "
"perish in traps. If they manage to break free from one, their animal cunning "
"usually helps them avoid further traps. But that rock troll was trapped just "
"before dawn, so he had no way to avoid the sunrise. Now he just stands "
"there, serving as a demonstration of sorts... It's useful both for my "
"research and as a ward against unwelcome guests.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 맞습니다. 그건 사실 꽤나 자랑할만한 일이죠. 아시다시피 트롤은 덫에 걸려 죽는 일이 거의 없습니다. 만약 함정 하나에서 "
"빠져나오게 되면, 동물적 본능으로 다른 함정들도 쉽게 피해가거든요. 근데 그 암석 트롤은 마침 동트기 전에 함정에 갇혔고 해돋이를 피할 "
"방법이 없었습니다. 지금은 거기 그렇게 서서 일종의 실험체가 되었습니다. 저의 연구 재료로나 반갑지 않은 손님에게 보여줄 경고로서나 둘 "
"다 유용하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_19341_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "c785ba6a-02e2-4a0e-a8f5-9a11c4bb33f5"
msgid "\"Welcome, Your Grace! Always a pleasure to see you.\""
msgstr "\"어서오십시오, 언제나 반갑군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20149_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "17889b1a-1ab2-49f1-a76a-e3b0ad47ad6c"
msgid "{n}Octavia throws a withering glance your way.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 풀이 죽어 당신 쪽을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20544 1_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "2283c136-10ef-4860-9352-62ee50260374"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim inspects the brand closely.{/n} \"The same cursed symbol we saw "
"earlier in the ruins. This is the hammer of {g|Torag}Torag{/g} — a god "
"neglectful of even his most devoted followers. I don't know why his hammer "
"is decorated with thorns, but it suits the treacherous god well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 그 문양을 면밀히 검사합니다.{/n} \"폐허에서 이전에 보았던 것과 같은 저주받은 상징이야. 이것은 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 망치다. 가장 헌신적인 추종자들조차도 소홀한 신이지. 나는 그의 망치가 왜 가시로 장식되었는지 모르지만 "
"배신자 신에게는 잘 어울린다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20544 2_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "59130dfd-c6fc-4dc7-8604-bad8438981fc"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun touches the brand carefully.{/n} \"A hammer. The sign of mighty "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, god of artisans. No thorns should be there, though. "
"Maybe some secret symbol, or maybe deliberate blasphemy. Don't know.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 신중하게 문양을 만집니다.{/n} \"망치다. 장인의 신인 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 문양이다. 하지만 가시는 거기에 "
"없어야 한다. 어쩌면 어떤 비밀의 상징일 수도 있고 신성 모독일 수도 있다. 모르겠다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20544_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b0e866f2-8155-4a5f-9238-55088e9be1f1"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim inspects the brand closely.{/n} \"Alas, I recognize this cursed "
"symbol. This is the hammer of {g|Torag}Torag{/g} — a god neglectful of even "
"his most devoted followers. I don't know why his hammer is decorated with "
"thorns, but it suits the treacherous god well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 그 문양을 면밀히 검사합니다.{/n} \"젠장. 나는 이 저주받은 상징을 알겠군. 이것은 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 "
"망치다. 가장 헌신적인 추종자들조차도 소홀한 신이지. 나는 그의 망치가 왜 가시로 장식되었는지 모르지만 배신자 신에게는 잘 어울린다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20652 1_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "8e1c8da0-e1d2-4ef3-8ff4-2f5b14bedf82"
msgid "\"Thank you, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20652_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "8aaaae14-5231-40e4-9ac3-08d6994a88a4"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew's eyes widen — then they narrow.{/n} \"I don't dare object… "
"Your Grace.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤의 눈이 넓어지고는 좁아집니다.{/n} \"내가 어찌 반대를...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 10_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "2eecea64-6297-46d1-aa9c-5f58b2be057b"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew's face reddens. Glaring at Octavia, he raises his hands as if "
"to cast a spell.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤의 얼굴이 빨갛습니다. 옥타비아를 바라보며 그는 주문을 외우는 듯이 손을 들어올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 2_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "1d525902-0d1e-4c84-a782-6363c9e47f03"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I am,\" {n}the wizard answers curtly.{/n} \"It's become far too "
"dangerous to stay here. Besides...\" {n}He doesn't finish the thought.{/n} "
"\"Never mind. It doesn't matter.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 맞아.\" {n}마법사가 짧게 대답합니다.{/n} \"여기에 머무는 것이 너무 위험해졌어. 게다가...\" {n}그는 생각을 "
"끝내지 못합니다.{/n} \"아니다. 상관 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 3_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "3b477be2-0558-4861-925c-1d479f2ef4b0"
msgid ""
"\"I've no doubt of that.\" {n}Bartholomew sneers.{/n} \"But I'm afraid "
"you'll have to find someone else for your magical needs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"의심의 여지가 없다.\" {n}바솔로뮤는 비웃습니다.{/n} \"하지만 너의 마법에 필요한 다른 누군가를 찾아야 할 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 4_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "88bd8a30-7bc2-4ee8-abf1-7066564428e2"
msgid "\"Till we meet again, Your Grace! Thank you for all your help!\""
msgstr "\"그럼, 다시 만날 때까지 안녕히. 도움에 감사합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 5_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "78a15e62-b826-4b7c-8152-4a1954fb0ec5"
msgid ""
"{n}Without turning to face you, Bartholomew mutters something under his "
"breath while he continues to pack his things.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 당신을 보지도 않고 무언가를 중얼거리면서 짐을 쌉니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 6_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "961c690d-7670-48cb-8dcc-5d41a8893c1e"
msgid ""
"\"Is that how you speak to your {mf|baron|baroness}? Face {mf|him|her} "
"directly and say a proper farewell!\""
msgstr "\"그게 남작에게 할 말이야? 얼굴을 똑바로 보고 제대로 인사하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 7_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "51774c49-687f-45d6-bd6e-5f0b3942aeeb"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew turns and speaks through clenched teeth.{/n} \"Farewell, Your "
"Grace. Safe travels. Godspeed.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 몸을 돌려 이를 악물고 말합니다.{/n} \"안녕히 가시길. 편안한 여행 되시길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 8_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3f07a780-6984-4748-ada5-152c0f1c41e7"
msgid ""
"\"And why is your face so grim?\" {n}Octavia says sharply.{/n} \"Did you "
"study grimacing in some academy?\""
msgstr "\"왜 얼굴이 그렇게 험악해?\" {n}옥타비아는 날카롭게 말합니다.{/n} \"아카데미에서 무서운 거라도 본 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973 9_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5841817f-b35d-4089-a3d8-b0f87648b95e"
msgid ""
"\"We saved your life, and you dare turn your back on us? Come now, thank "
"{mf|His|Her} Grace for all {mf|he|she}'s done for you!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너의 목숨을 구했는데 우리에게 등 돌리기야? 이리 와서 너를 도운 영주님께 감사의 인사를 하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_20973_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "67a473bc-840f-4a80-ac75-e8757a86970e"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Grace. It's become too dangerous to stay here, even with your "
"protection. I'm going to look for somewhere safe and quiet.\""
msgstr "\"맞습니다. 당신의 보호가 있더라도 여기 머물기에는 너무 위험해졌군요. 좀 더 안전하고 조용한 곳을 찾아봐야겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_23208_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "649945ac-7c50-4223-8e71-5660d31fbcd1"
msgid ""
"\"I've never heard anything like it! If this is true, I'll have to revise my "
"defenses...\" {n}Bartholomew quickly goes silent, frowns, and closes his "
"eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그런 말은 한 번도 들어 본 적이 없군요! 만약 그말이 사실이라면 주변 방어를 수정해야 겠군요 ...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 갑자기 말을 "
"멈추더니 얼굴을 찡그리고는 눈을 감습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_25789_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "e220c74f-ac32-4406-b099-3ab6d40ea28d"
msgid ""
"\"I'm simply a humble researcher in the field of esoteric sciences, and I've "
"chosen this location to work in peace, away from the noise of the city. When "
"the environment is quiet and the air is fresh, ink just begs to be set to "
"paper!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 난해한 과학 분야의 보잘것없는 연구원일 뿐이고, 도시의 소음에서 벗어나 평화롭게 일하기 위해 이 장소를 선택했습니다. 주변이 "
"조용하고 공기가 상쾌할때가 바로 잉크와 종이가 사용해 달라고 애원할때거든요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_28796_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "57dbc8b8-8b82-4677-9d53-8d7663f131b8"
msgid ""
"\"To my utter regret, reading skill alone doesn't reflect the capacity for "
"critical thought. Waine visited several times and was warned of the traps "
"repeatedly. I pity the fellow, but his fate is his own fault, wouldn't you "
"say? It would be like if someone were to snatch a flask of acid from my "
"table and take a sip; I could hardly be held responsible for their physical "
"distress, now could I?\""
msgstr ""
"\"후회스럽지만 독서 기술만으로는 비판적 사고 능력을 반영하지 못해. 웨인이 몇번 방문해서 덫이 위험하다고 계속해서 반복했어. 그 불쌍한 "
"친구의 운명은 자기의 것이지. 누군가 산성 용액 플라스크를 가져가거나 한모금 마신 것 같아. 육체적 고통은 책임질 수 없는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_31459_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "6f176907-19b8-464c-a349-402bab4b60f1"
msgid ""
"\"What a pleasant surprise! Welcome, Your Grace. Would you like a cup of "
"tea? Something stronger, perhaps? It's a great honor for a humble hermit, "
"entertaining such an important personage. Allow me to introduce myself: I'm "
"Bartholomew Delgado, at your service. How may I be of assistance?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런 깜짝 방문이라니! 어서들 오시오. 차 한잔 어떻소? 아니면 더 센거로 다가? 이런 중요한 손님들을 접대하는것은 이 보잘것없는 "
"은둔자에겐 큰 영광이오. 내 소개를 해야겠군요. 나는 바솔로뮤 델가도. 어떤것을 도와드릴까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_35681 1_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ccdf667a-2a03-4f50-91e8-c313ed29461b"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia glares at the wizard.{/n} \"Researcher…? More like torturer!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 마법사를 노려보았습니다.{/n} \"연구원...? 심문관처럼 들리는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_35681_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "90249fdb-1673-4193-ac04-3c7b78a4f12b"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia laughs.{/n} \"And no rude neighbors to complain about explosions, "
"smoke, or ghastly screams!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아가 웃습니다.{/n} \"폭발이나 연기, 무시무시한 비명 소리가 들려도 불평하는 이웃은 없고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_37305_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "75500466-9029-4c42-b0fb-7772df55a003"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Waine... Frankly, I wonder what was going on in his brain that he'd "
"just rush into the forest, being perfectly aware of the danger. Obviously, "
"if you hadn't rescued him, I would... just a bit later. After he'd learned "
"his lesson.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 웨인.. 솔직히말해서, 위험하다는걸 완벽하게 알면서도 숲으로 달려든 그의 뇌가 어떻게 된거 아닌지 궁금하군요. 아마도 당신이 "
"그를 구하지 않았다면, 저는..조금후에 구하러 갔을겁니다. 그가 좀더 교훈을 얻은 후에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_45271_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "eb5100d4-c5f9-453a-8587-bf9ef26bcb8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew shrugs.{/n} \"Literacy is one of humanity's most significant "
"achievements! Trust me, my traps aren't even close to the worst dangers "
"threatening anyone who chooses to remain in the darkness of ignorance. "
"Though, I suppose if I ever meet a painter here, I could ask them to add a "
"picture to my warning sign.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"글을 읽을줄 아는것이야 말로 인류 최대 업적 중 하나입니다! 제말을 믿으세요. 일자무식의 "
"어둠속에 머물기로 한 사람들에게 닥쳐올 수많은 위험 중에 제 함정은 아마 약한 편에 들겁니다. 뭐, 그래도 혹시모르니 근처를 지나는 "
"화가라도 있다면 제 경고판에 그림이라도 추가해달라고 해보겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_49611_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "057d7e70-97f3-41ae-b205-c9f68cdd214d"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace, I'm afraid we must interrupt that conversation for now. A "
"moment ago, a troll was caught in one of my fire traps... and it was "
"unharmed. I suggest that giving me a chance to explore its corpse would "
"better equip me to answer your questions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대화를 중단해야 할 것 같아. 방금 내 트랩 중 하나에 트롤이 걸렸다. 그리고 무사해. 트롤 시체를 살펴볼 기회가 있다면 너에게 "
"답변을 더 잘해줄 수 있을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_50730_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "ddc9efa6-528c-4730-8a72-913976e7609f"
msgid ""
"\"Make haste if you can. It's west of here, not far. You can't miss the spot."
"\""
msgstr "\"될 수 있으면 서둘러. 여기에서 멀지 않은 서쪽이야. 바로 찾을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_54030_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "055db483-7c73-42a2-a22f-2ae2ac8cb863"
msgid "{n}Octavia smiles at Bartholomew, keeping it just short of a gloat.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 기뻐해하는 바솔로뮤에게 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_55130_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "b277b0e3-c63c-4a45-8da5-71d294f85d80"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew walks around the troll's corpse.{/n} \"At least they're still "
"vulnerable to steel and acid. Now let's look into why this creature lost its "
"respect for fire...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 트롤 시체 주위를 걷습니다.{/n} \"적어도 그들은 철과 산에 취약하다. 왜 이 생물체가 불에 대한 겁을 상실한 이유를 "
"살펴보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_63810_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "99839b26-8479-49fd-9448-1785e3f0a01b"
msgid ""
"{n}The laboratory feels emptier than before. The wizard is packing his items "
"— books, vials, manacles, and needles — carefully wrapping things in cloth "
"before placing them into crates.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}실험실은 이전보다 물건이 없어진 것처럼 느껴집니다. 마법사는 책, 병, 손수건, 바늘 등의 물건을 상자에 넣기 전에 헝겊으로 "
"조심스럽게 포장하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_64217_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "da674a35-f52c-4f17-b0b9-a1e1cd6d6170"
msgid "{n}Amiri frowns.{/n} \"So what if someone can't read?\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 눈살을 찌푸렸습니다.{/n} \"누군가 읽을 수 없으면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_64917_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "2291cd06-f5b8-45ee-886a-26404ce7c11f"
msgid ""
"\"I've never heard anything like it! I hope none of the beasts survived, "
"otherwise I'll have to revise my defenses...\" {n}Bartholomew quickly goes "
"silent, frowns, and closes his eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그런 말을 한 번도 들어 본 적이 없다! 괴물이 죽었어야 하는데 그렇지 않으면 나의 방비를 수정해야 해...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 "
"침묵하고 얼굴을 찡그리고는 눈을 감습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_65495_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "e1d9440b-c250-410a-8a42-bb42b6f952ee"
msgid ""
"\"They're mine, yes. You see, while I'm happy to welcome guests, I prefer "
"those who are capable of coherent speech. I've neither interest in nor "
"desire to waste my time with fighting off every monster that comes across my "
"dwelling. But I did leave a safe passage for those who can read. I even "
"installed a sign. You must have seen it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것들은 내 거야. 손님을 환영하게 되어 기쁘지만 나는 일관적으로 말할 수 있는 사람들을 선호한다. 나는 우리 집에 오는 모든 괴물과 "
"싸우는 사람과는 흥미가 없어. 하지만 나는 글씨가 쓰여진 팻말을 남기고 왔는데. 표지까지 만들고 왔다고. 분명히 봤을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_65560 1_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "bc17486c-fc48-4b0c-a5ff-eefb7ed47204"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Grace,\" {n}Bartholomew mutters.{/n} \"You've seen it with your "
"own eyes. At least I managed to gather some useful data from its corpse. I "
"hope you're satisfied.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래.\" {n}바솔로뮤가 웅얼거립니다.{/n} \"네 두 눈으로 그것을 보았을 거야. 나는 시체에서 유용한 자료를 수집할 수 "
"있었어. 네가 만족하기를 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_65560_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "99c9220f-ffe7-425d-b553-a97627e26ceb"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Grace,\" {n}Bartholomew mutters.{/n} \"I released the beast into "
"the woods. If you meet it, give it my regards.\""
msgstr "\"그래.\" {n}바솔로뮤가 웅얼거립니다.{/n} \"내가 숲에 괴물을 풀어두었어. 그것을 만난다면 내 안부를 전해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_66546_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "ae54a287-d55c-4595-93ed-3d9738058d98"
msgid "{n}Bartholomew nods, ready to satisfy your curiosity.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 끄덕이며 당신의 호기심을 만족시킬 준비가 되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_70453_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "5552ef12-6269-4cb0-9b61-48b3a23367b5"
msgid ""
"\"Just because someone asks me to do something doesn't mean I actually do it,"
"\" {n}Bartholomew says as he shrugs.{/n} \"Though to be honest, in these "
"parts, you can't really tell a local bandit from a peaceful hunter based on "
"looks alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가 나에게 부탁해서 오해였다고 전해줘.\" {n}바솔로뮤는 으쓱하며 말합니다.{/n} \"솔직히 이 쯤 되면 도적이나 평온한 "
"사냥꾼을 구분하기는 어려울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_80844_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "6c81e3c1-a9f8-461d-8621-bd66ecea782a"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew recites an incantation and waves his hand over the troll's "
"chest, then points at a specific spot on it. There, branded on the flesh, is "
"a symbol of a blacksmith's hammer encircled by thorn-studded vines.{/n} "
"\"Whatever that is, that's the reason its flesh didn't burn.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 주문을 외우며 트롤의 궤짝을 열었고 손가락으로 가리킵니다. 거기에 문양이 있는데 그것은 가시덩굴에 둘러쌓인 대장장이의 "
"망치 상징입니다.{/n} \"몸체가 타지 않는 이유는 이것 때문이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_86572_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "886e5ac1-71da-49d4-a529-4d51d6068fb1"
msgid ""
"\"They tried once. Now they make every effort to stay away. They only show "
"up if they don't have any other options, and even then they just politely "
"ask me to enchant their arrows.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 번 시도한적이 있습니다. 이제는 여기와 거리를 두려고 모든 노력을 기울이고 있죠. 영 어쩔수 없을 때만 근처에 나타나고, 심지어 "
"나한테 그들 화살에 마법 부여 좀 해달라고 정중히 부탁할 정도지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_89909_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "21fa1ecc-331c-4d38-a1cb-0c0f8b73017c"
msgid "\"And you're happy to help them?!\""
msgstr "\"그들을 도와 행복해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_92371_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "1340a2da-2875-42ff-a44a-76a4f0b3af71"
msgid ""
"{n}The wizard slowly makes an incision around the brand and then peels the "
"flesh off, excising the brand completely.{/n} \"I must study this. Here's "
"the key to my laboratory — wait for me there. I'll join you soon enough.\" "
"{n}Without another word, Bartholomew whispers an incantation and "
"vanishes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사는 문양 주위를 가른 다음 문양만을 벗겨냅니다.{/n} \"이걸 연구해 봐야겠어. 여기 내 연구실의 열쇠야. 거기서 기다려. "
"곧 따라갈게.\" {n}다른 말도없이 바솔로뮤는 주문을 외우고는 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98970 1_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "0c8c3599-5985-47a5-bf9b-1c6cd83e49d8"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew meets you with a long, sullen gaze.{/n} \"Good day... my "
"{mf|baron|baroness}.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 찡그린 시선으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"좋은 하루 보내길...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98970_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "171674e9-0ac0-4d11-8c33-b550fec049ec"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Always a pleasure to see "
"you.\""
msgstr "\"어서와! 너를 보는 건 항상 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98971_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "4797eeb8-04fa-4444-b128-a89fc3678fe6"
msgid ""
"\"I humbly request your protection. As recompense, I'll grant you an "
"enchanted item from my storage. I'll even trade you the other items for only "
"the most modest of prices. Please, follow me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 보호를 부탁해야겠어. 보상으로 내 창고에서 마법이 걸린 물품을 주지. 게다가 적절한 값에 다른 물품을 거래할 수 있어. 나를 "
"따라와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98972_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "e1c09849-c3d9-4e79-ab89-c7cac5917fbc"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. Please, be my guest."
"\""
msgstr "\"네가 원하는 대로. 어서 와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98973_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "392663d2-f408-4612-90c6-fcbae656f4a2"
msgid "\"I did promise, didn't I? Well, I always keep my promises.\""
msgstr "\"내가 약속했어. 그렇지? 나는 항상 약속을 지켜.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98975_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "ddbf5aaf-fdda-44a1-b919-bd5222de59ed"
msgid "\"Till we meet again. Perhaps we'll manage to get along after all.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 다시 만날 때까지 안녕. 우리는 다시 만날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98976_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "2bbb4f99-56bf-45f3-b370-da039bcbfca0"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew greets you with a short nod.{/n} \"Good day to you, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness},\" {n}he says, cold but polite.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 고개를 짧게 끄덕이며 인사합니다.{/n} \"안녕.\" {n}그는 냉담하지만 예의 바르게 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98977_Text
msgctxt "f19d488d-c293-4a33-9829-e741e43eee6c"
msgid ""
"\"Nethys' followers should never condemn achievements in magical research, "
"but I do so wish to find the crafty fool who did this to the trolls. – And "
"tear him apart! Fire-resistant trolls, can you believe it? The very thought "
"insults me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네서스의 추종자는 마법 발견들을 비난하지 말아야 하지만 나는 트롤들을 이렇게 만든 자들을 꼭 찾아보고 싶군. 그리고 그를 찢어버릴 "
"거야! 불에 저항하는 트롤이라니. 믿겨져? 그런 발상이 나에게는 모욕이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_98977_Text_1
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9fb614c9-384c-4a12-8d4c-eaa3767fd6d7"
msgid ""
"\"Nethys' followers should never condemn achievements in magical research, "
"but I do so wish to find the crafty fool who did this to the trolls. – And "
"tear him apart! Fire-resistant trolls, can you believe it? The very thought "
"insults me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네서스의 추종자는 마법 발견들을 비난하지 말아야 하지만 나는 트롤들을 이렇게 만든 자들을 꼭 찾아보고 싶군. 그리고 그를 찢어버릴 "
"거야! 불에 저항하는 트롤이라니. 믿겨져? 그런 발상이 나에게는 모욕이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_SadistMagePersuaded_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "f538668a-88c6-4940-820a-211c2eb05f00"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew's brow wrinkles, and he whispers some calculations under his "
"breath — then smiles.{/n} \"I may regret this later, but come what may, I'll "
"stay here. You've shown yourself to be a strong and generous ruler, as well "
"as an open-minded person. I suppose we may yet be useful to one another.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤의 이마에 주름이 생기고 그는 무언가 계산을 중얼거리고는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"나중에 후회할지도 모르지만 나는 여기 "
"머물러 있을 거야. 너는 강하고 관대한 통치자일 뿐만 아니라 편견 없는 사람이다. 우리는 서로에게 도움이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Cue_SadistMageReinforced_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMage
msgctxt "c6da4311-d20c-459f-b363-2b2281c57b88"
msgid ""
"{n}The mage glares at you for a moment, then slowly nods.{/n} \"After what "
"you've done, it's hard for me to trust you, {mf|Baron|Baroness}, but I'm "
"willing to give you one more chance. Since you promise to stay out of my "
"affairs, I'll stay and serve you. But I won't forget what you've done. You "
"owe me, Your Grace, and some day I'll request my due.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사는 잠깐 당신을 노려보고는 천천히 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"할 일을 끝난 후에 나는 너를 신뢰하기가 어려워. 하지만 한 번 더 "
"기회를 주겠어. 내 일에 상관하지 않겠다고 약속했으니 나는 머물며 너를 섬길 거야. 하지만 네가 한 짓을 잊지 않을 거야. 너는 나에게 "
"빚지고 있어. 언젠가 나는 이 일을 끝낼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Items/DeadTraderHeirloom_m_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "30fea7c7-07eb-414f-b439-7486e1fc0e7b"
msgid ""
"A turquoise brooch with jade ornaments, carefully wrapped in smooth cloth. "
"It looks like it was meant to be a present for someone."
msgstr "옥으로 장식한 청록색 브로치가 조심스럽게 부드러운 천으로 감싸여있습니다. 그것은 누군가를 위한 선물이 될 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Items/DeadTraderHeirloom_m_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "ef0d5881-39e9-46fc-b021-ecee4542e4ed"
msgid "Turquoise Brooch"
msgstr "청록색 브로치"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Items/DeadTraderLetter_m_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "9151fdf1-4984-4812-ac92-370c81c70849"
msgid ""
"\"My sweet Leksen!\n"
"I just received a letter from you and rushed immediately to answer — I want "
"you to get word from me as soon as you arrive in New Stetven. With all these "
"endless travels of yours I've become an expert on roads and settlements "
"myself. Little Ketri asks about his father's whereabouts every night instead "
"of a bedtime story. Then I get a map and show him: here's our Galt, and "
"these are the Stolen Lands, there's Brevoy, and this is the road our father "
"is riding on right now. Then we wish you goodnight and go to sleep.\n"
"Everything is all right here. The workers you've hired finally finished "
"painting the walls and fixing the roof. Now sitting at the very top of our "
"house is that marvelous forged weathercock you brought from Numeria. It's "
"perching up there and watching around — what's there behind the horizon? "
"Maybe the master is on his way home?\n"
"Ron the Baldhead returned recently — you'd somehow missed each other in "
"Mivon. He told a bunch of tall stories about his adventures, as he usually "
"does. Told us there is a hodag living in the woods in the southern Stolen "
"Lands. I almost fainted on the spot — that's the forest you pass by every "
"time! Maybe Ron just lies — gods know he usually does — but I beg you to "
"take care and choose the other road to skip coming near that damned forest!\n"
"I'm writing this now and can't keep my tears from running. I'm just not "
"myself without you. The only joy I have is watching little Ketri. His face "
"and yours are as like as two peas, he even frowns just like you! You always "
"bring me some presents — dresses, or shoes, now this turquoise brooch you "
"promised last time — but I need none of that! The only thing I need is you "
"by my side, safe and sound. Take care of yourself! Be back soon!\n"
"Your beloved,\n"
"Olika and Ketri\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 사랑하는 렉센!\n"
"방금 편지를 받아서 곧바로 답장을 보내는 중이야. 뉴스텟븐에 도착하는대로 나에게 소식 전해 주기를 바랄께. 당신의 끝없는 여행으로 나는 "
"도로와 정착지의 전문가가 되었어. 어린 케트리는 매일밤, 잠자리 동화가 아니라 항상 아버지의 행방에 대해 물어봐. 그러면 나는 지도를 "
"꺼내서 보여주지. 여기 우리 갈트가 있고, 저기는 도둑맞은 땅, 저기는 브레보이, 그리고 이건 지금 우리 아빠가 가는 길이라고. 그런 "
"후에 당신도 좋은꿈 꾸기를 바라며 우리도 잠에 들어.\n"
"여긴 모든게 다 괜찮아. 당신이 고용한 일꾼들은 마침내 벽을 모두 칠했고 지붕도 수리했어. 지금 우리 집 지붕 꼭대기에는, 당신이 "
"누메리아에서 사온 금속 풍향계를 달아놨어. 풍향계는 그위에 앉아 항상 주위를 둘러보고 있어. 지평선 너머에는 뭐가 있을까, 아마 "
"주인님께서 집에 오고 계시는 길일까? 하면서 말이야. \n"
"대머리 론이 최근에 돌아왔어. 당신과 미본에서 서로 길이 엇갈렸나봐. 항상 그렇듯 그는 모험에 대해 장황한 이야기를 해줬어. 도둑맞은 땅 "
"남쪽 숲에는 호다그가 살고 있다고 하더라고. 난 그말을 듣고 그자리에서 기절하는 줄 알았어. 당신이 매번 지나다니는 숲이 바로 그 "
"곳이잖아! 론이 또 그냥 거짓말하는걸 수도 있겠지. 그는 항상 그렇잖아. 하지만 부디 몸조심하고 그런 위험한 숲이 있다면 꼭 다른 길을 "
"선택해서 오기를 바랄께!\n"
"지금 편지를 쓰고 있는데 눈물이 계속 흘러. 당신 없이는 난 못살아. 나의 유일한 즐거움은 케트리를 보는 일이야. 당신과 그 아이의 "
"얼굴은 마치 완두콩 두개처럼 닮았고, 심지어 찡그린 모습마저 똑같아! 너는 항상 드레스며 신발이며 선물을 가져왔고 이제는 청록색 터키석 "
"브로치를 가져오겠다고 약속했지. 하지만 나는 아무것도 필요하지 않아! 내가 바라는 유일한 것은 당신이 안전하고 건강하게 내 옆에 있어 "
"주는 거야. 부디 몸조심해! 조심히 돌아와!\n"
"너의 사랑하는,\n"
"올리카와 케트리\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Items/DeadTraderLetter_m_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "d83a0f5f-f2b8-4ed7-a962-d0da0a51c07f"
msgid "Merchant's Letter"
msgstr "상인의 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Items/SadisticMageDiary_m_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "0c42a40a-1001-482a-9a6c-c2388a68c38c"
msgid ""
"This is the title page of a diary, covered with crudely scratched symbols. "
"There are numerous smears, worn spots, cuts and burns on it. Bartholomew "
"obviously isn't a tidy type.\n"
"The leather cover is spotted with acid burns, page edges are tattered. There "
"are four symbols carved on: the first one is \"B', three others stand "
"separately \"I&I\". If \"B\" stands for the name \"Bartholomew\", what does "
"this \"I&I\" mean? Interesting...\n"
"\"The Great Experiment, Day 104\n"
"I've burned all the previous notes — too embarrassed to remember what a "
"complete fool I was. But now that I've got the creature — I call it Dimwit — "
"everything is going to be all right. Studying the troll's ability to "
"regenerate will lead me to my ultimate goal.\n"
"The Great Experiment, Day 112\n"
"Got a reason to celebrate! While determining Dimwit's pain threshold, I "
"found out it practically has no such thing. Wounds, broken bones, "
"amputations and the rest of the perils of a warrior's or mage's life — for a "
"troll these are no threat at all. The trick is to avoid getting carried away "
"while working with fire or acid, so that impact spots will heal in several "
"days. Amazing!\n"
"Too bad I didn't dare to buy it at the very beginning of my Way.\n"
"The Great Experiment, Day 125\n"
"Staying in bed for the second day after the Incident. Serves me right! I got "
"a trifle too excited and came a bit too close to Dimwit. The beast bit my "
"arm! Then it started shouting something like \"Borba! Borba!\" I wonder what "
"that means… if anything at all.\n"
"The wounded hand is still sore. It even hurts to write this! I HATE PAIN SO "
"MUCH!\n"
"The Great Experiment, Day 127\n"
"Here I am, lying in bed and thinking about how different we are. My unique "
"intellect against its unbearable animalistic stupidity. At the same time, "
"its regeneration and some…chthonic ability…to endure tortures and heal "
"wounds against my human fragility and intolerance to pain.\n"
"It's ok. I'll find the way to get what I need.\n"
"The Great Experiment, Day 129\n"
"I got overzealous. Regeneration of three simultaneously amputated limbs "
"proved to be an extremely slow process, all the resources of the troll's "
"strength are barely enough for it to go on… And I probably shouldn't have "
"used fire. In the wild environment and without my elixirs, the creature "
"would be long dead.\n"
"I will continue my experiments in three days or so. I feel I'm close now. A "
"few more efforts and I will really become Invulnerable & Invincible.\""
msgstr ""
"이것은 일기장의 제목 페이지이며 거칠게 긁힌 기호로 덮여 있습니다. 표지에는 수많은 얼룩, 헤진 부분, 찢기고 탄 자국이 있습니다. "
"바솔로뮤는 분명히 깔끔한 인간이 아닙니다.\n"
"가죽 커버는 산성 화상으로 얼룩져 있으며 페이지 가장자리가 너덜너덜합니다. 또한 네가지 상징이 새겨졌습니다. 첫 번째는 \"B\"이고, "
"나머지 세 글자인 \"I & I\"는 약간 떨어져 있습니다. \"B\"가 \"바솔로뮤\"라는 이름을 의미한다면 \"I & I\"는 무엇을 "
"의미하는 걸까요? 흥미롭습니다...\n"
"\"위대한 실험, 104일째\n"
"나는 이전의 모든 노트들을 불태웠다. 내가 얼마나 멍청했는지 떠올리는 것이 부끄러웠기 때문이다. 그러나 이제 나는 표본을 얻었다. 나는 "
"그것을 멍청이라고 부른다. 모든 것이 잘 될 것이다. 트롤의 재생 능력을 연구하면 나의 궁극적인 목표로 이끌어 줄 것이다.\n"
"위대한 실험, 112일째\n"
"축하할 이유가 생겼다! 멍청이가 어디까지 고통을 참는지 측정하다가, 그런 것들의 의미가 없다는 것을 깨달았다. 상처, 골절, 절개, "
"그리고 전사나 마법사의 생명을 위협할 수 있는 다른 모든 고통들은 트롤에게 전혀 위협이 되지 않았다. 요점은 상처 부위가 며칠에 걸쳐 "
"천천히 회복되도록 불과 산을 사용하는 작업에 흥분하지 않는 것이다. 놀랍군!\n"
"이것들을 내 실험 초창기에 구매하지 않은 것이 너무 아쉽다.\n"
"위대한 실험, 125일째\n"
"사건 발생 후 둘째 날 침대에 누워있다. 꼴좋군! 너무나 흥분한 나머지 멍청이에게 너무 가까이 다가갔다. 그 짐승이 내 팔을 물어뜯었다! "
"계속해서 \"보바! 보바!\" 같은 소리를 지르기 시작했다. 거기에 의미가 있다면, 그게 무엇인지 궁금하다...\n"
"부상당한 손은 여전히 아프다. 쓸 때조차도 아프다! 나는 고통이 너무 싫다!!\n"
"위대한 실험, 127일째\n"
"나는 침대에 누워 우리가 얼마나 다른지 생각 중이다. 내 지능과 저것의 멍청한 지식을 비교하면서, 동시에 그들의 재생력과 몇몇... "
"어둠이 내린, 고문을 견디고 상처를 치료하는 능력을... 인간인 나의 연약함과 고통을 견디지 못하는 능력과 비교하면서.\n"
"괜찮다. 나는 원하는 것을 얻을 것이다.\n"
"위대한 실험, 129일째\n"
"너무 지나쳤다. 동시에 절단된 세 개의 사지를 재생하는 일은 매우 천천히 진행됨이 입증되었고, 트롤의 모든 힘을 써도 이걸 진행하기엔 "
"간당간당했다... 그리고 아마도 불을 쓰지 말았어야 했던 것 같다. 야생 환경이었고 내 치료제가 없었다면, 이 생명체는 오래전에 죽었을 "
"것이다.\n"
"실험을 3일 정도 더 해야겠다. 거의 끝나간다는 것이 느껴진다. 조금만 더 노력한다면 나는 정말로 무결 & 무적이 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Items/SadisticMageDiary_m_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "2cf3ced0-a70b-444e-babf-2f5057d3c071"
msgid "Bartholomew's Diary"
msgstr "바솔로뮤의 일기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4ccf0418-16e9-4a52-b43a-dbb5022526c5"
msgid ""
"{n}The wizard's clothing is soaked with blood. His face is disfigured, and "
"one of his eyes is missing. He's beyond rescue. With tremendous effort, he "
"moves his swollen, bloody lips to speak, his voice barely a whisper.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사의 옷은 피로 흠뻑 젖었습니다. 그의 얼굴은 손상되었고 그의 눈 한쪽이 사라졌습니다. 그는 구조할 수 없을 것 같습니다. "
"엄청난 노력을 하면서 그는 피가 흐르며 부풀어오른 입술로 말을 하지만 속삭임과 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "283cf581-99ac-451e-8235-17bdfc3f10fc"
msgid ""
"{n}A huge bruise covers half of the wizard's face and his clothes are "
"smeared with blood, but his life is out of danger.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}큰 타박상은 마법사의 얼굴 절반을 덮고 그의 옷에는 피가 묻어 있지만 생명은 위험하지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "6690eda8-e6ea-4f1b-ae9a-34eb4a85915f"
msgid ""
"\"What a surprise... The baron{mf||ess} {mf|him|her}self has graced me with "
"a visit... If only you came earlier... Your Grace...\""
msgstr "\"정말 놀랍군... 남작이 방문을 해주다니... 더 일찍 왔다면 좋았을 텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "9a159d11-beb8-4127-a523-909a6b63ad60"
msgid ""
"\"Too late... Your Grace... A shame... I had plans... so many plans... No "
"time now...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무 늦었습니다..영주님... 안타깝습니다...난 계획이 있었는데... 너무나 많은 계획이 있는데... 이제 시간이 없어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "b7562262-1c1d-44a5-8642-4abe50a3648f"
msgid ""
"\"You... I should've run... once it was clear... the local "
"{mf|baron|baroness} was a spineless moron... Should've... But I thought... "
"you'd protect...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너... 난 도망쳐야 했었는데... 일단 분명해지면... 그 지역 {mf|남작|여남작}은 줏대없는 얼간이였어... 했었는데... "
"하지만 난 네가 날 보호해 줄거라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "eaeed4ab-2fb1-4af3-a73e-b43dc0143eda"
msgid ""
"\"My baron{mf||ess}! You couldn't have chosen a better time for a visit. Let "
"me introduce myself: Bartholomew Delgado, an independent scholar of the "
"esoteric science. I have retreated to the wilderness, hoping to find peace "
"for my studies... How naive, ha-ha-ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕! 적절한 시기에 오지 않았어. 내 소개를 할게. 나는 바솔로뮤 델가도. 과학 분야의 연구자야. 나는 야생으로 물러가서 평화롭게 "
"연구할 기회를 찾고 있었어... 정말 순진하지! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "0b361da3-8abf-4c19-b982-2de9695d53b8"
msgid ""
"\"My {mf|baron|baroness}! You arrived just in time. I was starting to think "
"it was all over for me...\" {n}Bartholomew grimaces with pain as he kicks "
"the troll's corpse.{/n} \"Beast! Filthy monster! You stinking animal! Gods, "
"that hurts... I can't stand the pain!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 {mf|남작님|남작님}! 딱 맞춰 와주셨군요. 나는 모든 것이 끝났다고 생각하기 시작했어요...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 고통으로 "
"찡그리며 트롤의 시체를 걷어찹니다. {/n} \"이 괴물! 더러운 괴물! 냄새 나는 녀석! 제기랄, 아프군... 나는 아픈 게 싫어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "71797ee3-8539-445f-862a-670f77e68756"
msgid ""
"\"So you came after all. I guess you are capable of protecting your "
"subjects, not just stealing from them. I'll admit, I've never been so glad "
"to be mistaken about a person.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 결국 왔군요. 난 당신이 백성들을 착취할 것이 아니라 보호할 수 있을 거라 생각했어요. 인정할게요. 전 사람을 잘못 봤다는 걸 "
"이렇게 기뻐해본 적이 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "c6de51c5-c4a3-4949-8465-6d2782801002"
msgid ""
"\"They're thieves... like you... Stole a precious item... My whip. But now I "
"know... where their lair is... The map...\" {n}Bartholomew points to a "
"location on the map with his broken finger, leaving a bloody fingerprint "
"behind.{/n} \"Kill them... All of them... Or better, die there yourself...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 도둑이야... 너처럼... 귀중한 물건을 훔쳐서... 내 채찍을 훔쳤어. 하지만 지금 나는 은신처가 어디 있는지 알아... 그 "
"지도...\" {n}바솔로뮤가 부러진 손가락으로 지도의 한곳을 가리키는데 핏자국이 남습니다.{/n} \"그들을 죽여. 모두... 아니면 "
"거기서 죽는 것이 더 나아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "02f9726d-919f-4972-8bcd-5ee47cdd20be"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia spits on the floor near the wizard's corpse.{/n} \"Don't count on "
"it.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 마법사의 시체 근처 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"믿지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "ad14b5ea-f56d-4839-87c5-17a92bb94c09"
msgid ""
"\"They stole... an extremely precious item... my whip. But now I know... "
"where their lair is... The map...\" {n}Bartholomew points to a location on "
"the map with his broken finger, leaving a bloody fingerprint behind.{/n} "
"\"Since you... couldn't protect me... You could at least... avenge...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 매우 귀중한 물건을 훔쳤습니다... 내 채찍입니다. 하지만 그놈들 은신처가 어디 있는지 알아요... 지도를...\" {n}"
"바솔로뮤가 부러진 손가락으로 지도의 한곳을 가리키는데 핏자국이 남습니다.{/n} \"당신은 날 보호해주지 못했어...최소한 복수라도..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2166cf80-22c2-480f-8000-3da55e85cdad"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia spits on the floor near the wizard's body.{/n} \"Serves you right."
"\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 마법사의 시체 근처 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"꼴좋군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "e0d9678e-9074-4a94-8666-c2515184c1a4"
msgid ""
"{n}After catching his breath, the wizard limps to the table and fishes a map "
"out of the drawer.{/n} \"One of those beasts stole something important to "
"me. Fortunately, it was enchanted, so tracking the thief won't be a problem. "
"Here's the location of their lair.\" {n}He makes a mark on the map.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}숨을 들이쉬고는 마법사는 테이블에 서랍에서 꺼낸 지도를 놓습니다.{/n} \"그 짐승 중 하나가 중요한 무엇인가를 훔쳤어요. "
"다행히도 그것은 마법이 걸려있어서 추적은 문제가 되지 않아요. 여기 그들 은신처의 위치가 있어요.\" {n}그는 지도에 표시를 "
"합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "62568f83-6c2d-4fd1-be4a-8c40915be576"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid I'm in no condition to go with you. Here, take a few more acid "
"wands — they should help. And one more thing, Your Grace... The item I "
"mentioned is a whip with a bone handle — it is an item of sentimental value. "
"Return it, and I will be grateful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"유감스럽게도 당신과 같이 갈 상황이 아닙니다. 여기 산성 완드를 받아요. 도움이 될 겁니다. 하나 더... 내가 말한 물건은 뼈로 된 "
"손잡이가 있는 채찍이에요. 내가 아끼는 물건이에요. 되돌려주면 고맙겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "4eb69f89-e800-40c7-890a-a7a18e2b5a6e"
msgid ""
"\"Now, I'm aware you have little respect for private property, but if you "
"happen to recover what was stolen, I would pay for its safe return. It's a "
"whip with a bone handle. A trifle, really, but it holds good memories for me."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 사유재산에는 거의 관심이 없다는 걸 알고 있지만 도둑맞은 것을 안전히 되돌려주면 적절히 지불하겠어요. 그건 채찍이에요. 손잡이는 "
"뼈로 되어 있습니다. 하찮지만 정말, 나에게는 소중한 추억이 담겨 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_AfterAttack/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "0e75ccb0-1d10-476e-8015-5f3b99fb70fb"
msgid ""
"\"Now I must ask you to leave. I have several unpleasant procedures to "
"perform.\" {n}The wizard opens a tome and starts leafing through it "
"silently, ignoring you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이제 떠나라고 해야겠군. 해야할 몇가지 즐겁지 않은 절차들이 남았거든.\" {n}당신을 무시하며 마법사는 책을 열고 조용히 "
"넘깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "518c2bc9-2d66-4f06-a275-7171d7ed4390"
msgid ""
"\"I came from Restov. Aldori Swordlords have sent me to kill the Stag Lord\"."
msgstr "\"나는 레스토프에서 왔어. 알도리 소드로드가 수사슴 군주를 죽이라고 나를 보냈지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "fb52943a-1ec5-4921-8d08-9fa4c28607b4"
msgid "\"What do you study here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 무얼 연구하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "e736b5a0-4b71-45ea-a3e8-fdf51b5a180d"
msgid "\"Are these your traps around here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 이 덫들은 네 것이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Answer_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "05dede2f-97fc-4049-ae62-62bb3183a2f4"
msgid "\"Do you have anything for sale?\""
msgstr "\"판매할 물건이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "fc0cd4d7-3372-46d6-a167-d427aea0e616"
msgid "\"Good bye.\""
msgstr "\"안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "5d1a2f1c-5da5-4782-b677-3d9331d99145"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't like you. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너를 좋아하지 않아. 죽어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "73ca8895-9f10-4313-a640-6bc22f508eb0"
msgid ""
"{n}He looks at you with subtle revulsion, as if you were a beggar.{/n} \"Well"
", well, a new face in our back-country. Nice to meet you. I am Bartholomew "
"Delgado, an independent scholar of magic and a very busy man. And who might "
"be you? How can we be useful to each other?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 당신을 마치 거지라도 되는 냥 미묘하게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"이런, 이런, 깡촌의 새 얼굴이군. 만나서 반가워요. 나는 "
"바솔로뮤 델가도라 합니다. 혼자 마법을 연구하고 매우 바쁘죠. 그리고 당신은 누구죠? 우리가 어떻게 서로에게 도움이 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "915c8556-b0b8-4191-9f0e-80bd08597869"
msgid "\"You again? I hope you have a good reason to disturb me\"."
msgstr "\"또 당신 인가요? 날 방해할 좋은 이유가 있기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "88aa293c-bfbe-4e9f-810f-00c778733d59"
msgid ""
"\"Really? Ha-ha-ha? well... Good luck in your noble pursuit. Now, what does "
"it have to do with me? There are no quarrels between me and the Stag Lord\"."
msgstr ""
"\"정말? 하하하? 네... 고귀한 목적을 잘 이루길 바래요. 그게 나와 무슨 상관이 있죠? 나와 수사슴 군주 사이에는 아무 관계가 "
"없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "e224611c-6cdc-47eb-86f2-873baa0f2894"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid, the uninitiated would find it hard to understand... Let me put "
"it this way: these lands are home to some very unusual creatures. Kobolds, "
"wyverns... Trolls. I observe them in the wild and study their supernatural "
"abilities\"."
msgstr ""
"\"미숙한 사람은 이해하기 어려울 건데... 이렇게 설명해주죠. 이 땅은 매우 특별한 생물들의 집입니다. 코볼트나 와이번이 그들이고... "
"트롤도 그렇고. 전 야생에서 그들을 보고 초자연적인 능력을 연구하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "bd54fa65-f18d-4a8a-a428-5dbb788f8e56"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, they are mine. I don't like it when various miscreants wander around "
"my house and interrupt me while I'm working... I'm talking about the trolls, "
"of course.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 그들은 내 거요. 나는 악독한 녀석들이 내 집을 돌아다면서 나를 방해하는 걸 싫어해... 물론 그들은 트롤이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "3b7b6dfa-5202-4491-a01d-13a75b02bddc"
msgid "\"Let's see... I think I'll find something.\""
msgstr "\"어디 보자... 내가 뭔가를 찾을 것 같네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "96e7059a-3668-453c-80ef-c0f0035bbf33"
msgid "\"Have a nice trip.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 여행 되세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Before21/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "060e60f2-328a-4de5-ba57-2871e08a9358"
msgid "\"Looks like I'll have to teach you a lesson...\""
msgstr "\"당신에게 교훈을 가르쳐 줘야 될 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "54ea34ca-8a9e-46ff-94d8-d8b8a954e61a"
msgid ""
"\"We cleared out a nearby lair of trolls who were resistant to fire, "
"somehow. I'd like to be sure new ones with the same resistance won't appear. "
"Do you happen to know anything about the matter?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 불에 저항하는 트롤 소굴 주위를 깨끗이 했어. 그런 저항력을 가진 트롤이 더 생긴다면 안되겠지. 너는 그 일에 대해 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "3f75ab3b-336a-45ce-aba3-72d0cc374848"
msgid "[Accompany Bartholomew] \"Lead the way.\""
msgstr "[바솔로뮤와 동행합니다] \"길을 안내해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "154ef7c7-7311-44cb-8860-6715a3db7007"
msgid "\"You go ahead. We need to prepare for the battle first.\""
msgstr "\"먼저 가. 우리는 먼저 전투에 대비해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "dca35f2f-91fc-47f7-9fc9-25cab1a7e80c"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know anything about the local trolls who are resistant to fire?\""
msgstr "\"불에 저항하는 지역 트롤에 대해 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "c8d339bb-e739-42cf-9428-2f28af06d895"
msgid "\"You seem to be an educated man. What are you doing in these woods?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 교양 있는 사람처럼 보이는데. 이 숲에서 뭐하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "3076f029-b4de-44f5-a412-0d1ae700a468"
msgid "\"Those traps in the woods — are they yours?\""
msgstr "\"숲 속의 함정들은 네 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "3e6cb00c-39fa-48fd-971e-1e748a30f385"
msgid "\"The rock troll in the woods nearby — is it real?\""
msgstr "\"근처의 숲에 있는 바위 트롤은 진짜야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "aaef9153-d96f-4450-9dfc-bac9066e3695"
msgid "\"What about local bandits? Do they bother you here?\""
msgstr "\"도적단은 어때? 그들이 너를 괴롭히나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "7064d55c-5716-4418-8169-f58499887e04"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes even those who can read get caught in your traps. A trader by "
"the name of Waine, for instance.\""
msgstr "\"때로는 글을 읽을 줄 아는 사람도 당신의 함정에 걸려들기도 해. 예를 들면 웨인이라는 상인이라던지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "1dfc8bbc-4381-48ec-9141-573d150b1b4b"
msgid "\"Thank you for satisfying my curiosity.\""
msgstr "\"호기심을 만족시켜주어 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "de2783cf-5172-44ed-9281-9845777ff14b"
msgid "\"A question about the traps...\""
msgstr "\"함정에 관해서 말인데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "2f7ae2fc-2e61-4f59-84a0-242e5e4225a9"
msgid "\"Have you executed my order?\""
msgstr "\"내 명령을 이행했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "d8e07fec-3090-408e-b6b0-76690f928f29"
msgid "\"How's your research going?\""
msgstr "\"연구는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "42d2b699-e019-4c37-ad67-1e601f4decb3"
msgid "\"Well, good luck with your work.\""
msgstr "\"행운을 빈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "a3719dfd-1cc8-4020-895b-75766a733c4b"
msgid ""
"\"Your experiments aren't safe — stop them immediately. And kill the troll.\""
msgstr "\"너의 실험은 안전하지 않아. 즉시 멈추고 트롤을 죽여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0061_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "7ed4a091-912e-4cde-b751-a908f4ca3471"
msgid "Executed Bartholomew the wizard for no reason."
msgstr "마법사 바솔로뮤를 이유 없이 처형합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0061_Text_String
msgctxt "96e1a6ec-b711-4d43-8450-9d5b17b7de3c"
msgid "[Attack] \"I no longer require your services.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 더 이상 너의 서비스는 필요하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Answer_0062_Text_String
msgctxt "0f269d08-ff02-4e26-8d60-c588a69e08d0"
msgid "\"It's time to leave. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"떠날 시간이야. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0001_Text_String
msgctxt "45e6f647-06df-4535-96cc-e197c19c326b"
msgid ""
"{n}A middle-aged man stands before you. His clothes are not too gaudy, but "
"tasteful. Despite living in the wilderness, he looks well-groomed, even "
"dapper: his mustache is slick, and the nails on agile soft hands are "
"meticulously polished.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}중년 남자가 당신 앞에 서 있습니다. 그의 옷은 요란하지 않으면서도 우아했습니다. 야생에서 살면서도 그는 잘 차려입었고 멋스럽기까지 "
"합니다. 그의 콧수염은 매끈했고 날렵하고 부드러운 손의 손톱은 꼼꼼하게 다듬어져 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0003_Text_String
msgctxt "923da046-1cf0-47bb-9540-3a6aaa7552f8"
msgid ""
"\"What a pleasant surprise! Welcome, Your Grace. Would you like a cup of "
"tea? Something stronger, perhaps? It's a great honor for a humble hermit, "
"entertaining such an important personage. Allow me to introduce myself: I'm "
"Bartholomew Delgado, at your service. How may I be of assistance?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런 깜짝 방문이라니! 어서들 오시오. 차 한잔 어떻소? 아니면 더 센거로 다가? 이런 중요한 손님들을 접대하는것은 이 보잘것없는 "
"은둔자에겐 큰 영광이오. 내 소개를 해야겠군요. 나는 바솔로뮤 델가도. 어떤것을 도와드릴까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "cf61470c-db57-4756-bb18-50eb4a81d428"
msgid ""
"\"I've never heard anything like it! I hope none of the beasts survived, "
"otherwise I'll have to revise my defenses...\" {n}Bartholomew quickly goes "
"silent, frowns, and closes his eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그런 말은 한 번도 들어 본 적이 없군요! 만약 그말이 사실이라면 주변 방어를 수정해야 겠군요 ...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 갑자기 말을 "
"멈추더니 얼굴을 찡그리고는 눈을 감습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0005_Text_String
msgctxt "e523dd54-2aff-40e1-b149-3380df2d26fb"
msgid "\"Welcome, Your Grace! Always a pleasure to see you.\""
msgstr "\"어서오십시오, 언제나 반갑군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "0d26cb76-4e33-4ff5-90ba-b3d06c7910b6"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew meets you with a long, sullen gaze.{/n} \"Good day... my "
"{mf|baron|baroness}.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 찡그린 시선으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"좋은 하루 되시길...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "587faf63-e8fa-49f9-b197-c98673ea7bad"
msgid ""
"\"I've never heard anything like it! If this is true, I'll have to revise my "
"defenses...\" {n}Bartholomew suddenly goes silent, frowns, and closes his "
"eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그런 말은 한 번도 들어 본 적이 없군요! 만약 그말이 사실이라면 주변 방어를 수정해야 겠군요 ...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 갑자기 말을 "
"멈추더니 얼굴을 찡그리고는 눈을 감습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "e1291386-31f3-4574-80dc-c8e59679d552"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace, I'm afraid we must intermit that conversation for now. A "
"moment ago, a troll was caught in one of my fire traps... and it was "
"unharmed. I suggest that a chance to explore its corpse would better equip "
"me to answer your questions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금은 대화를 중단해야될것 같군요. 마침 방금 전 내 함정 중 하나에 트롤이 잡혔었습니다. 손상되지 않은채로요. 그 트롤 시체를 "
"살펴볼 기회가 된다면 질문에 답변 할수 있을지도 모르겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "13709b2c-099e-4642-b975-a9e6b19490b4"
msgid "\"My liege, I humbly request your protection. Please, follow me.\""
msgstr "\"보호를 부탁드려야 겠군요. 자 따라오시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "3cf69df6-47e6-49fb-ab54-36e45c3cc8d7"
msgid ""
"\"Make haste if you can. It's west of here, not far. You can't miss the spot."
"\""
msgstr "\"될 수 있으면 서두르시지요. 여기에서 멀지 않은 서쪽입니다. 바로 찾을수 있을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0020_Text_String
msgctxt "e4d5a4c6-a241-4464-a62f-4e1f1b066f04"
msgid "\"Certainly.\""
msgstr "\"확실히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "4685a877-f3f4-4850-a2a6-e9e06c3a5c36"
msgid ""
"\"I'm simply a humble researcher in the field of esoteric sciences, and I've "
"chosen this location to work in peace, away from the noise of the city. When "
"the environment is quiet and the air is fresh, ink just begs to be set to "
"paper!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 난해한 과학 분야의 보잘것없는 연구원일 뿐이고, 도시의 소음에서 벗어나 평화롭게 일하기 위해 이 장소를 선택했습니다. 주변이 "
"조용하고 공기가 상쾌할때가 바로 잉크와 종이가 사용해 달라고 애원할때거든요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "a57e2a43-98dc-4807-9e48-c4d540d87ddb"
msgid ""
"\"I'm simply a humble servant of my {mf|baron|baroness},\" {n}the wizard "
"answers coldly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"저는 단지 {mf|남작|남작}의 보잘것 없는 종일 뿐입니다.\" {n}마법사는 냉담하게 답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6c4bf65d-2744-47de-9671-9cb11b601915"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia laughs.{/n} \"And no rude neighbors to complain about explosions, "
"smoke, or ghastly screams!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아가 웃습니다.{/n} \"폭발이나 연기, 무시무시한 비명 소리가 들려도 불평하는 이웃도 없고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "618bf2d4-0a5b-41a8-8dbd-158a45c252a2"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia glares at the wizard.{/n} \"Researcher…? More like torturer!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 마법사를 노려보았습니다.{/n} \"연구원...? 고문 기술자거 더 맞는 것 같은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "4f3dd887-a6f7-4e46-b10c-99751a65b673"
msgid "{n}Bartholomew gives a wry smile.{/n} \"Yes, that's equally valuable.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 쓴 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"맞습니다. 똑같이 가치있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "4b60189e-a735-4c8b-bfa7-a5bf6dda036c"
msgid "{n}Bartholomew pretends not to have heard the comment.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 그 말을 듣지 않은 척합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "9b119752-d430-4a92-aaca-3f96b5c9465c"
msgid ""
"\"They're mine, yes. You see, while I'm happy to welcome guests, I prefer "
"those who are capable of coherent speech. I've neither interest in nor "
"desire to waste my time with fighting off every monster that comes across my "
"dwelling. But I did leave a safe passage for those who can read. I even "
"installed a sign. You must have seen it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아요, 그것들은 제 겁니다. 손님을 환영하긴 하지만, 전 논리적으로 말할 수 있는 사람들을 선호해요. 저는 제 집을 가로질러 오는 "
"모든 괴물과 싸워서 시간을 낭비하고 싶은 생각도 없습니다. 그래도 글을 읽을 수 있는 사람들을 위한 안전한 길을 마련해 두었어요. 심지어 "
"표지판도 설치해 두었죠. 당신도 분명히 봤을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "9e37cbff-eed3-4f06-89be-e8001ee33d34"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt I can tell you anything of interest,\" {n}Bartholomew mutters "
"without looking you in the eye.{/n}"
msgstr "\"흥미로워할 만한 이야기가 있을런지 모르겠군요.\" {n}바솔로뮤는 당신의 눈을 보지 않으며 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "00ce24ed-94e6-44a7-9e5c-1b54b18782ce"
msgid "{n}Amiri frowns.{/n} \"So what if someone can't read?\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 눈살을 찌푸렸습니다.{/n} \"누군가 글을 읽을 수 없는 사람은 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "c96c2ddb-5ad3-4627-894c-d56a7ab82f41"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew shrugs.{/n} \"Literacy is one of humanity's most significant "
"achievements! Trust me, my traps aren't even close to the worst dangers "
"threatening anyone who chooses to remain in the darkness of ignorance. "
"Though, I suppose if I ever meet a painter here, I could ask them to add a "
"picture to my warning sign.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"글을 읽을 줄 아는것이야 말로 인류 최대 업적 중 하나입니다! 제 말을 믿으세요. "
"일자무식의 어둠 속에 머물기로 한 사람들에게 닥쳐올 수많은 위험 중에 제 함정은 아마 약한 편에 들겁니다. 뭐, 그래도 혹시 모르니 "
"근처를 지나는 화가라도 있다면 제 경고판에 그림이라도 추가해달라고 해보겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "ee4789b7-3a05-4e50-b655-bc65dba4c667"
msgid "\"I'm always happy to help those who seek knowledge.\""
msgstr "\"지식을 찾는 사람들을 돕는건 언제나 기쁜 일이지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "e6123f84-ed7e-465b-8844-742bf1b63267"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes. I'm quite proud of that one, actually. You see, trolls rarely "
"perish in traps. If they manage to break free from one, their animal cunning "
"usually helps them avoid further traps. But that rock troll was trapped just "
"before dawn, so he had no way to avoid the sunrise. Now he just stands "
"there, serving as a demonstration of sorts... It's useful both for my "
"research and as a ward against unwelcome guests.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 맞습니다. 그건 사실 꽤나 자랑할만한 일이죠. 아시다시피 트롤은 덫에 걸려 죽는 일이 거의 없습니다. 만약 함정 하나에서 "
"빠져나오게 되면, 동물적 본능으로 다른 함정들도 쉽게 피해가거든요. 근데 그 암석 트롤은 마침 동트기 전에 함정에 갇혔고 해돋이를 피할 "
"방법이 없었습니다. 지금은 거기 그렇게 서서 일종의 실험체가 되었습니다. 저의 연구 재료로나 반갑지 않은 손님에게 보여줄 경고로서나 둘 "
"다 유용하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "df70cee4-06f9-4fa2-9e0e-fea77f3f64ed"
msgid ""
"\"They tried once. Now they make every effort to stay away. They only show "
"up if they don't have any other options, and even then they just politely "
"ask me to enchant their arrows.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 번 시도한적이 있습니다. 이제는 여기와 거리를 두려고 모든 노력을 기울이고 있죠. 영 어쩔수 없을 때만 근처에 나타나고, 심지어 "
"나한테 그들 화살에 마법 부여 좀 해달라고 정중히 부탁할 정도지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "df33dc2d-186a-4c1a-ac61-447ce2eac718"
msgid "\"And you're happy to help them?!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그들을 도와 행복해?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "dc07cd08-c6b4-4ac4-bc8d-2e84c651b59d"
msgid ""
"\"Just because someone asks me to do something doesn't mean I actually do it,"
"\" {n}Bartholomew says with a shrug.{/n} \"Though to be honest, in these "
"parts, you can't really tell a local bandit from a peaceful hunter based on "
"looks alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"단지 누군가 제게 부탁한다고 해서 제가 그걸 실제로 한다는 건 아닙니다.\" {n}바솔로뮤는 으쓱하고는 말합니다.{/n} \"솔직히 "
"이 쯤 되면 당신도 도적이나 평온한 사냥꾼을 외모 만으로 구분하기는 어려울 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "64a921fa-717a-4088-b9b3-807983afcdd2"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Waine... Frankly, I wonder what was going on in his brain that he'd "
"just rush into the forest, being perfectly aware of the danger. Obviously, "
"if you hadn't rescued him, I would... just a bit later. After he'd learned "
"his lesson.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 웨인.. 솔직히 말해서, 위험하다는걸 완벽하게 알면서도 숲으로 달려든 그의 뇌가 어떻게 된거 아닌지 궁금하군요. 아마도 당신이 "
"그를 구하지 않았다면, 저는..조금 후에 구하러 갔을겁니다. 그가 좀더 교훈을 얻은 후에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "1f0e15dc-9ba6-4332-bd77-33de84e365e7"
msgid ""
"\"To my utter regret, reading skill alone doesn't reflect the capacity for "
"critical thought. Waine visited several times and was warned of the traps "
"repeatedly. I pity the fellow, but his fate is his own fault, wouldn't you "
"say? It would be like if someone were to snatch a flask of acid from my "
"table and take a sip; I could hardly be held responsible for their physical "
"distress, now could I?\""
msgstr ""
"\"후회스럽지만 독서 기술만으로는 비판적 사고 능력을 반영하지 못해. 웨인은 몇 번 여길 방문해서 덫이 위험하다고 반복해 경고를 했었지. "
"불쌍한 친구 같으니, 그의 운명은 자기 소관이야. 누군가 모르고 내 탁자에 놓인 산성 용액 플라스크를 가져가거나 한 모금 마신 것이랑 "
"같은 거요. 내가 그들의 신체적 고통을 책임질 수 없지 않겠소. 그런데 지금이라고 될까\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "ae9ed537-e3c8-4f04-a12d-8ed258fd2528"
msgid "{n}Bartholomew nods, ready to satisfy your curiosity.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 끄덕이며 당신의 호기심을 만족시킬 준비가 되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "2b19e91e-a87d-4be4-8bae-9120800455b8"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Grace,\" {n}Bartholomew mutters.{/n} \"I released the beast into "
"the woods. If you meet it, give it my regards.\""
msgstr "\"그래.\" {n}바솔로뮤가 웅얼거립니다.{/n} \"내가 숲에 괴물을 풀어두었어. 그것을 만난다면 내 안부를 전해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "fdc642c6-4afa-4892-9d3b-a25cc086be55"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Grace,\" {n}Bartholomew mutters.{/n} \"You've seen it with your "
"own eyes. At least I managed to gather some useful data from its corpse. I "
"hope you're satisfied.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래.\" {n}바솔로뮤가 웅얼거립니다.{/n} \"네 두 눈으로 그것을 보았을 거야. 나는 시체에서 유용한 자료를 수집할 수 "
"있었어. 네가 만족하기를 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3f175e5d-71f2-4a72-8bc4-59176fbfa919"
msgid "{n}Octavia smiles at Bartholomew, keeping it just short of a gloat.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 바솔로뮤를 향해 짧게 만족감을 담은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "459f10fe-5892-4cb1-8ddc-ea019d0f0970"
msgid "{n}Octavia throws a withering glance your way.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 풀이 죽어 당신 쪽을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "e32f2312-5508-4724-b4b4-a50094b3b345"
msgid ""
"\"I won't lie, there's still much to be done — years of research. That's no "
"small task for me and for my... assistant. Still, one must be ready to make "
"sacrifices for knowledge!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말은 하지 않겠습니다. 아직 수년간 해야할 연구들이 많이 남아있습니다. 저에게나 저의 조수에게나 사소한 일이 아닙니다. 아직 "
"지식을 위해 희생할 준비가 되어 있어야 하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "b182c61a-532a-45cc-a2e5-63a333b68574"
msgid "\"Thank you, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다. 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_BeforeAttack/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "15d5db5f-3368-4f43-bf3f-a6e7e278c528"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew's eyes widen — then they narrow.{/n} \"I don't dare object… "
"Your Grace.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤의 눈이 넓어지고는 다시 좁아집니다.{/n} \"제가 어찌 감히 반대를... 전하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_CheckTheTroll/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "63cf2006-c103-4228-bd7e-b4019be35ef3"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew walks around the troll's corpse.{/n} \"At least they're still "
"vulnerable to steel and acid. Now let's look into why this creature lost its "
"respect for fire...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 트롤 시체 주위를 걷습니다.{/n} \"적어도 놈들은 철과 산에 취약하군. 왜 이 생물체가 불에 대한 겁을 상실한 이유를 "
"살펴볼까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_CheckTheTroll/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "24a0af4c-55ff-4df6-9004-7862969eb12a"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew recites an incantation and waves his hand over the troll's "
"chest, then points at a specific spot on it. There, branded on the flesh, is "
"a symbol of a blacksmith's hammer encircled by thorn-studded vines.{/n} "
"\"Whatever that is, that's the reason its flesh didn't burn.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 주문을 외우며 트롤의 가슴팍에 손을 대고 손가락으로 가리킵니다. 거기에 문양이 있는데 그것은 가시덩굴에 둘러쌓인 "
"대장장이의 망치 상징입니다.{/n} \"몸체가 타지 않는 이유는 이것 때문이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_CheckTheTroll/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0d8b4ce5-83d8-45d4-8a2c-519a6ad4bcab"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim inspects the brand closely.{/n} \"Alas, I recognize this cursed "
"symbol. This is the hammer of {g|Torag}Torag{/g} — a god neglectful of even "
"his most devoted followers. I don't know why his hammer is decorated with "
"thorns, but it suits the treacherous god well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 그 문양을 면밀히 검사합니다.{/n} \"젠장. 나는 이 저주받은 상징을 알겠군. 이것은 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 "
"망치다. 가장 헌신적인 추종자들조차도 소홀한 신이지. 나는 그의 망치가 왜 가시로 장식되었는지 모르지만 배신자 신에게는 잘 어울린다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_CheckTheTroll/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ce7986af-b8da-4105-ba67-49ed19ba4802"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim inspects the brand closely.{/n} \"The same cursed symbol we saw "
"earlier in the ruins. This is the hammer of {g|Torag}Torag{/g} — a god "
"neglectful of even his most devoted followers. I don't know why his hammer "
"is decorated with thorns, but it suits the treacherous god well.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 그 문양을 면밀히 검사합니다.{/n} \"폐허에서 이전에 보았던 것과 같은 저주받은 상징이야. 이것은 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 망치다. 가장 헌신적인 추종자들조차도 소홀한 신이지. 나는 그의 망치가 왜 가시로 장식되었는지 모르지만 "
"배신자 신에게는 잘 어울린다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_CheckTheTroll/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9ca6d2d0-7fc3-4fe7-9df1-db4ee098d9f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun touches the brand carefully.{/n} \"A hammer. The sign of mighty "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, god of artisans. No thorns should be there, though. "
"Maybe some secret symbol, or maybe deliberate blasphemy. Don't know.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 신중하게 문양을 만집니다.{/n} \"망치다. 장인의 신인 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 문양이다. 하지만 가시는 거기에 "
"없어야 한다. 어쩌면 어떤 비밀의 상징일 수도 있고 신성 모독일 수도 있다. 모르겠다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_CheckTheTroll/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "9a2ed931-4812-4126-ae6a-9bd738867220"
msgid ""
"{n}The wizard slowly makes an incision around the brand and then peels the "
"flesh off, excising the brand completely.{/n} \"I must study this. Here's "
"the key to my laboratory — wait for me there. I'll join you soon enough.\" "
"{n}Without another word, Bartholomew whispers an incantation and "
"vanishes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사는 문양 주위를 가른 다음 문양만을 벗겨냅니다.{/n} \"이걸 연구해 봐야겠어. 여기 내 연구실의 열쇠입니다. 거기서 "
"기다려요. 곧 따라갈게요.\" {n}다른 말도없이 바솔로뮤는 주문을 외우고는 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d9c9e1d1-cdad-496a-b70c-348b993c23fc"
msgid "\"What are you studying here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "99e5aabb-6281-4f4c-9a12-e6377f11480b"
msgid "\"Are those your traps in the forest?\""
msgstr "\"숲의 덫들은 네 것이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "b7ead97b-a36f-4107-b974-b0e9ce9f581f"
msgid ""
"\"Bartholomew, have you ever considered using your talents in service to the "
"public?\""
msgstr "\"바솔로뮤 네 능력을 대중을 위해 쓸 생각을 해 본적은 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "893c8ac1-60a5-424c-9ff0-2912b39b1eaa"
msgid "\"I would like to count you among my advisors in the capital.\""
msgstr "\"내 수도에 모실 나의 자문관들 중에 너도 그 한명이 될 수도 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "c182775c-db9a-4263-903a-931895963d1b"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness! It's such a pleasure to see you here! To what do I owe this "
"honor? Please let me introduce myself: I'm Bartholomew Delgado, an "
"independent scholar of esoteric science — and your humble servant. How may I "
"be of assistance?\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하! 여기서 당신을 뵙다니 정말 기쁘군요! 이 명예를 어찌 보답해야 할 지? 제 소개를 하겠습니다. 저는 바솔로뮤 델가도. 비의 "
"과학 분야의 독립 연구자이자 당신의 보잘것 없는 종입지요. 어떻게 제가 당신의 조력이 되어드릴까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "7d399601-a8bc-45f7-86de-971c5f733bae"
msgid ""
"{n}The laboratory feels emptier than before. The wizard is packing his "
"books, vials, manacles, and needles — carefully wrapping them in cloth "
"before placing them into crates.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}실험실은 이전보다 물건이 없어진 것처럼 느껴집니다. 마법사는 책, 병, 손수건, 바늘 등을 상자에 넣기 전에 헝겊으로 조심스럽게 "
"포장하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "7757df48-cb92-4cf0-aa23-b250dc2f887c"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew greets you with a deep bow.{/n} \"Welcome, Your Highness! "
"It's always a pleasure to welcome you into my humble abode!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 당신에게 허리숙여 인사합니다.{/n} \"환영합니다. 전하! 당신을 제 초라한 거처에 모실 수 있는 건 항상 기쁨입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d343bbb9-7838-4fa6-be15-834800c84b7c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, a little bit of everything... But I'm especially interested in the "
"local fauna. This realm is a home to the most peculiar creatures — with the "
"most interesting qualities!\""
msgstr "\"조금은... 나는 지역 동물 군에 특히 관심이 있다. 이 영역은 흥미로운 능력을 지닌 독특한 생물들이 사는 곳이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "27d36937-0b2d-4e91-be55-f053b6bf8aa5"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, they're mine. This wilderness is a savage place, what with all the "
"bandits and monsters poking about... I'm infinitely grateful for all your "
"efforts to protect your subjects' peaceful slumber. But even now a hermit "
"such as myself must take some measures to protect his humble hut from "
"intruders.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 그들은 내 거야. 이 광야는 도적과 괴물이 들쑤시고 다니는 야만적인 곳이야. 백성들이 평화롭게 잘 수 있게 노력해주어 고마워. "
"하지만 나 같은 은둔자도 침입자로부터 오두막을 보호하려면 조치를 취해야 했지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "74f98579-0a32-4825-aa4c-ae2a1d21c1cb"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... I should say my accounting skills are quite remarkable. — In fact, "
"science requires very careful record-keeping and attention to detail. "
"Moreover, I well know how to speak to any person — and that is the principle "
"virtue required from a diplomat... but why do you ask?\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠, 제 회계 기술이 아주 독보적이라고 말할 수 있겠고, - 사실 과학은 매우 신중한 기록 관리와 세심한 주의가 요구되지요. 게다가 "
"저는 누구와도 대화를 잘하는 법을 알고 있죠. - 그리고 그건 외교관에게 요구되는 필수적인 미덕이지요... 그런데 그건 왜 물어 보죠? "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "1326343f-05b3-4a61-a4f8-f31d4a6c3f74"
msgid ""
"{n} Bartholomew's eyes flash. {/n} \"What an unexpected and pleasant news, "
"Your Grace! Of course I accept your proposal, and stand ready to commence my "
"work immediately! Just... I'll just have to lock up the laboratory and "
"postpone my research. But I'm happy to make this sacrifice! After we finish "
"our conversation, I will prepare for my departure.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤의 눈이 반짝입니다.{/n} \"예기치 못한 기쁜 소식이군요, 전하! 물론 당신의 제안을 받아들이고 작업을 즉시 시작할 "
"준비가 되어 있습니다.! 그저... 실험실을 잠그고 제 연구를 미루면 됩니다. 하지만 전 이런 희생을 해서 기쁩니다! 대화를 마치는데로 "
"저는 출발 준비를 하겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "2d99b7b0-24ff-4ece-8933-faf1a4d8d381"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew's wide smile doesn't contain the slightest trace of "
"sincerity.{/n} \"I've already taken that role, and, to be honest, I'm "
"convinced that my advice only distracted you. I really think you need "
"another person to fill in this position.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤의 활짝 웃음에는 가장 작은 진정성도 들어있지 않았습니다.{/n} \"저는 이미 그 역할을 맡았었고 솔직히 말하면 제 충고는 "
"당신을 오직 산만하게 만들었다는 확신이 들었습니다. 당신에게는 정말로 다른 사람이 필요하다고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Final/Cue_0022_Text_String
msgctxt "c459d74b-7836-4c5d-a8b8-f2361beca137"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew wears a cold and insincere smile.{/n} \"I would if I could. "
"However, my research demands my full attention. I'm afraid I would not be "
"able to dedicate to your service the full attention you deserve.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 차갑고 불친절한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"할 수만 있다면 하겠지만. 하지만 제 연구는 많은 주의를 필요로 해요. "
"유감스럽게도 당신아 맡긴 일에 전념을 다하지 못할 거 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "051c0481-62da-43c5-9ba8-f31aad0ecc96"
msgid "Returned the whip to the wizard."
msgstr "채찍을 마법사에게 돌려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "db177271-9b4e-4568-a133-82897ea10b1e"
msgid "[Return the whip] \"Here it is. Take it.\""
msgstr "[채찍을 돌려줍니다] \"여기 있네. 가져가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6d57dade-85cb-4506-ad7b-57dd85011256"
msgid "Lied to the wizard and kept his whip."
msgstr "마법사에게 거짓말을 하고 채찍을 가집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "c7a37fb8-347b-48b8-bad3-4b6575bc2a08"
msgid "[Lie] \"You're wrong. I haven't found it.\""
msgstr "[거짓] \"네가 틀렸어. 그것을 발견하지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a167e375-f48c-49c3-a9f0-d73008a883e7"
msgid "Refused to return the whip to the wizard."
msgstr "채찍을 마법사에게 돌려주기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "48fc9ba1-c5c4-49fc-82b1-4338a8ad12cc"
msgid "\"It's really quite exquisite. I think I'll keep it!\""
msgstr "\"정말 괜찮은 물건인데. 내가 가질게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "619cdd16-bdcd-4e15-ad3a-2d3259887e5f"
msgid "\"Can I see what you have to sell?\""
msgstr "\"네가 파는 물건을 볼 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d28fb09a-e41d-4024-8399-8a7d09883c6c"
msgid "\"Packing? Are you leaving us soon?\""
msgstr "\"짐을 싼다고? 우리를 떠날 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "cb4a4a8b-5072-4aeb-8803-5ad0ad7597d5"
msgid ""
"\"Could I persuade you to stay? I could use someone familiar with magic.\""
msgstr "\"여기 머물어 보겠어? 나는 마법을 사용할 줄 아는 사람이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "43f30f9c-5bc7-4348-99eb-d3ddc9b9a148"
msgid ""
"Persuaded Bartholomew the wizard to forgo his grievances and remain in the "
"barony."
msgstr "마법사 바솔로뮤를 설득해서 불만을 풀어주고 영지에 남게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "4d0d53b1-8c44-46a8-a8e9-72750045a313"
msgid ""
"\"I regret what I've done. I shouldn't have meddled in your affairs. If you "
"agree to stay, I promise to never do so again.\""
msgstr "\"내가 한 일을 유감스럽게 생각한다. 너의 일에 끼어들어서는 안되었어. 네가 남는다면 다시는 그런 짓을 하지 않을게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1aa0a612-4fa4-419c-8875-4161536314d2"
msgid "Executed Bartholomew the wizard for no reason."
msgstr "마법사 바솔로뮤를 이유 없이 처형합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "f6c6ee29-052f-4545-98f3-d3ec692702ec"
msgid "[Attack] \"I no longer require your services.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 더 이상 너의 서비스는 필요하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "f29eed3e-4514-4558-8190-b7062572dfcc"
msgid "\"It's time I should leave. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"떠날 시간이야. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "3e640acb-61a3-4953-bffb-3d3df43c5ff5"
msgid "[Remain silent]"
msgstr "[침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "961e22ff-890e-4d07-8009-85479f7d5465"
msgid "[Leave] \"Cut it out, Octavia. Let's go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"그만해. 옥타비아. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "8ad21c51-1ddd-471c-bc23-9f6b5c7ce5b6"
msgid ""
"\"I've an offer for you: stay as one of my advisors. There are so few people "
"who see things in such a critical and rational way.\""
msgstr "\"제안 하나 할게. 내 보좌관으로 머물러. 그렇게 비판적이고 합리적인 방식으로 사물을 보는 사람들은 흔하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Barks/Bart_invite_bark_01_String
msgctxt "9ea36d04-10f2-4fc6-b84d-2f17cd8283bd"
msgid "\"I'm almost ready! I'm about to head to the capital!\""
msgstr "\"나는 준비 됐어! 나는 수도로 갈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Barks/Bart_invite_bark_02_String
msgctxt "c02f3bda-1820-495a-9639-8f14267c8a78"
msgid "\"Give me five minutes… Just five minutes…\""
msgstr "\"5분만 더 줘... 5분만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fd84a5ae-e0c9-442b-a4cc-7a4dbf628194"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew has managed to clean up the mess after the troll attack in "
"his laboratory. The wizard is packing his items — books, vials, manacles, "
"and needles — carefully wrapping his things in cloth before placing them in "
"crates. He turns as he notices you approach.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 트롤이 연구실을 공격한 후 청소를 했습니다. 실험실은 이전보다 물건이 없어진 것처럼 느껴집니다. 마법사는 책, 병, "
"손수건, 바늘 등의 물건을 상자에 넣기 전에 헝겊으로 조심스럽게 포장하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "e80a87e1-ecf7-4699-b6ea-cbbdbcbb3be4"
msgid ""
"{n}The laboratory feels emptier than before. The wizard is packing his items "
"— books, vials, manacles, and needles — carefully wrapping his things in "
"cloth before placing them in crates.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}실험실은 이전보다 물건이 없어진 것처럼 느껴집니다. 마법사는 책, 병, 손수건, 바늘 등의 물건을 상자에 넣기 전에 헝겊으로 "
"조심스럽게 포장하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "399660a2-fd06-475a-b8a5-33b6dfea7c8a"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew hums a simple tune as he unpacks his things, sorting them "
"back into their proper places.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 헛기침을 하고는 짐을 다시 풀고 물건을 다시 제자리에 둡니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "afae76f8-c641-4d7d-90d7-94f52a9ec0c7"
msgid ""
"\"Have you brought my whip?!\" {n}The wizard snaps at you.{/n} \"I can feel "
"it. It is near... Give it to me — now!\""
msgstr "\"내 채찍 가져왔어?\" {n}마법사가 손가락을 튕깁니다.{/n} \"나는 느낄 수 있어... 나에게 줘. 당장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "228f1889-351b-4c4b-b5cf-a7bb0a46df01"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Your Grace! Oh, how good to see you alive and well. Let me "
"congratulate you on yet another brilliant victory! Would you perhaps permit "
"me one small request? I sense that you've recovered something of mine...\" "
"{n}Bartholomew's voice trembles with excitement.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오! {name}! 살아서 보게 되어 얼마나 기쁜지. 또 다른 빛나는 승리를 축하합니다! 작은 부탁을 들어줄 수 있을까요? 당신이 제 "
"물건을 되찾은 걸 느낄 수 있는데...\" {n}바솔로뮤의 목소리는 흥분으로 떨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "7fd4c9c6-6227-48a3-8490-408058e35eec"
msgid ""
"\"Don't bother me with your explanations or excuses,\" {n}the wizard snaps "
"at you coldly.{/n} \"I'm already well aware that my treasure has been "
"destroyed. Such a senseless waste...\" {n}Bartholomew turns away and resumes "
"packing his flasks and vials, his hands trembling.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"변명으로 나를 귀찮게 하지 마.\" {n}마법사가 차갑게 손가락을 튕깁니다.{/n} \"나는 이미 나의 보물이 파괴된 것을 잘 알고 "
"있어. 그런 무의미한 낭비라니...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 몸을 돌려 그의 플라스크와 물건을 싸기 시작했습니다. 그의 손은 떨렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "0c8cad94-73e7-4f85-b6be-6d65c1dc191b"
msgid ""
"\"My treasure...\" {n}Perplexion cascades down the wizard's face.{/n} \"You "
"let it slip through your fingers... I know exactly where it is right now, "
"but it's no use... I'll be chasing it forever...\" {n}Bartholomew turns back "
"to his flasks and vials, his hands trembling.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나의 보물...\" {n}마법사의 얼굴에 당황스러움이 흐릅니다.{/n} \"그걸 놓치다니... 나는 그것이 지금 어디 있는지 정확하게 "
"알지만 쓸모가 없어. 나는 영원히 그것을 쫓을 거야...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 등을 돌리고 떨리는 손으로 그의 플라스크와 물건을 싸기 "
"시작했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0012_Text_String
msgctxt "906433a4-550f-40aa-93fe-55113ef017fd"
msgid ""
"{n}The wizard snatches the whip from your hands and stops just short of "
"kissing it.{/n} \"It's unharmed... Excellent, excellent!\" {n}He carefully "
"coils his treasure, wraps it in a clean cloth, and bundles the package with "
"a crisscrossed cord.{/n} \"You have my eternal gratitude!\" {n}Bartholomew "
"places a bag of coins in your hands.{/n} \"You can't imagine what that thing "
"means to me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사가 당신의 손에서 채찍을 낚아채고 그것에 잠시 키스를 합니다.{/n} \"무사하다... 훌륭해! 훌륭해!\" {n}그는 보물을 "
"조심스럽게 깨끗한 천으로 감싸고 십자 모양의 매듭으로 포장합니다.{/n} \"당신은 내 평생의 감사를 받을거요!\" {n}바솔로뮤는 "
"당신의 손에 동전 주머니를 쥐어줍니다.{/n} \"이게 내게 무슨 의미를 갖는지 당신은 상상할 수 조차 없을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0013_Text_String
msgctxt "cbc6f5d6-0aa3-41c8-b22f-e06bdf4e64d3"
msgid ""
"{n}The wizard snatches the whip from your hands and quickly hides it "
"away.{/n} \"You have my gratitude,\" {n}he says coldly as he hands you a bag "
"of coins.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사가 채찍을 당신의 손에서 빼앗아 빠르게 숨깁니다.{/n} \"고마워요.\" {n}그는 동전 주머니를 당신에게 건네면서 차분하게 "
"말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "ee977fef-dcfb-4e06-83fb-f457f3e2e6b3"
msgid ""
"{n}The wizard's face contorts with anger, but he dares not object. "
"Bartholomew turns away abruptly and resumes packing his flasks and vials, "
"his hands trembling.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사의 얼굴은 분노로 찼지만 반대할 생각을 못합니다. 바솔로뮤는 갑자기 몸을 돌려 떨리는 손으로 꾸렸던 짐을 풉니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "29778941-497d-4868-8f1f-378a2275f9bd"
msgid "\"Certainly.\""
msgstr "\"확실히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "13bfff6c-4220-4ccb-97a1-b6e51d350667"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, I am,\" {n}the wizard answers curtly.{/n} \"It's far too dangerous to "
"stay here. Besides...\" {n}He doesn't finish the thought.{/n} \"Never mind. "
"It doesn't matter.\""
msgstr ""
"\"예. 맞아요.\" {n}마법사가 짧게 대답합니다.{/n} \"여기에 머무는 것이 너무 위험해요. 게다가...\" {n}그는 생각을 "
"끝내지 못합니다.{/n} \"신경쓰지 마세요. 그건 중요하지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "15e2c835-e595-4f01-85de-47dd5457404d"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Grace. It's become too dangerous to stay here, even with your "
"protection. I'll have to find someplace safe and quiet.\""
msgstr "\"그래요. 당신의 보호 아래 있더라도 여기에 머무는 것은 너무 위험합니다. 나는 안전하고 조용한 곳을 찾을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "244f08c7-9f2f-4857-b3cc-c5d2f7d13bd5"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew's brow wrinkles, and he whispers some calculations under his "
"breath — then smiles.{/n} \"I may regret this later, but come what may, I'll "
"stay. You've shown yourself a strong and generous ruler, as well as open-"
"minded. I suppose we may yet be useful to one another.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤의 이마에 주름이 생기고 그는 무언가 계산을 중얼거리고는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"나중에 후회할지도 모르지만 저는 여기 "
"머물러 있겠습니다.. 당신은 자신이 강하고 관대한 통치자일 뿐만 아니라 편견 없는 사람이라는 것을 보여주었지요. 우리는 아직 서로에게 "
"도움이 될 거 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "8f1c2dbe-44cb-4be3-82be-aa1caa613698"
msgid ""
"\"I've no doubt of that.\" {n}Bartholomew sneers.{/n} \"But I'm afraid "
"you'll have to find someone else to fulfill your magical needs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"의심의 여지가 없군요.\" {n}바솔로뮤는 비웃습니다.{/n} \"하지만 유감스럽게도 당신은 당신의 마법적 필요를 다른 누군가에게서 "
"찾아야 할 것 같네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "d7bd27ac-f38e-480a-80eb-c87ecc3b35e8"
msgid ""
"{n}The mage glares at you for a moment, then slowly nods.{/n} \"After what "
"you've done, it's hard for me to trust you, {mf|Baron|Baroness} — but I'm "
"willing to give you one more chance. If you promise to keep out of my "
"affairs, I shall stay and serve you. But I won't forget what you've done. "
"You owe me, Your Grace, and some day I'll take my due.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마법사는 잠깐 당신을 노려보고 천천히 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"네가 한 일을 끝내고 나서 나는 너를 신뢰하기가 어려워졌어. 하지만 "
"너에게 한 번 더 기회를 주겠어. 내 일에 상관하지 않겠다고 약속하면 나는 머물며 너를 섬길 거야. 하지만 네가 한 짓을 잊지 않을 "
"거야. 너는 나에게 빚지고 있어. 언젠가 나는 빋을 받을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "bc5053d6-39bf-40d5-af42-3e8b6fcd8481"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks back and forth between you and Bartholomew, glaring.{/n} "
"\"Oh, great. This is exactly what we need...\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 너와 바톨로뮤 사이를 번갈아봅니다.{/n} \"좋아. 이게 정확히 우리가 필요로 하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "45cf49de-646d-4181-a15e-f26fdfcbd1fa"
msgid ""
"\"Until we meet again, Your Grace! Thank you for all you've done for me!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 다시 만날 때까지 안녕히. 도와주어 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "b6771a79-a01e-4385-ad30-34323316303f"
msgid "\"Until we meet again. Perhaps we'll manage to get along after all.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 다시 만날 때까지 안녕. 우리는 다시 만날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "c5ae32c5-8a12-40e3-8df4-c255b1ab6669"
msgid ""
"{n}Without turning to face you, Bartholomew mutters something under his "
"breath.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 당신을 보지도 않고 무언가를 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6da32a45-5d87-42b7-8c30-96b8353dac05"
msgid ""
"\"Is that how you speak to your {mf|baron|baroness}? Face {mf|him|her} "
"directly and say a proper farewell!\""
msgstr "\"그게 남작에게 할 말이야? 얼굴을 똑바로 보고 제대로 인사하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "4dda1ebd-c012-4379-a937-f6c7f54c4cb1"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew turns and speaks through clenched teeth.{/n} \"Farewell, Your "
"Grace. Safe travels. Godspeed.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤는 몸을 돌려 이를 악물고 말합니다.{/n} \"안녕히 가시길. 편안한 여행 되시길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "bddb6762-6bd4-4045-8c74-3a51ec925b67"
msgid ""
"\"And why is your face so grim? Did you study grimacing at some academy?\""
msgstr "\"왜 얼굴이 그렇게 험악해? 아카데미에서 무서운 거라도 본 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "33a1c37d-cf12-425f-a186-141c0b039f0f"
msgid ""
"\"We saved your life, and you dare turn your back on us? Come now, thank "
"{mf|His|Her} Grace for all {mf|he|she}'s done for you!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너의 목숨을 구했는데 우리에게 등 돌리기야? 이리 와서 너를 도운 영주님께 감사의 인사를 하라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "46de99ca-3a25-411d-a054-7374228fbd54"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew's face turns red. Glaring at Octavia, he raises his hands as "
"if to cast a spell.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤의 얼굴이 빨개졌습니다. 옥타비아를 바라보며 그는 주문을 외우는 듯이 손을 들어올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "5c30dcd0-dee0-46dc-9e4a-050539ef36e8"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew stops packing and looks at you incredulously. Then he looks "
"at the stack of books in his hands and keeps silent for a long time, "
"figuring something out in his mind. Finally, Bartholomew sighs and puts his "
"books aside.{/n} \"I cannot refuse such an offer. Of course, Your Grace, I "
"shall enter your service. — After all, it's such a rare opportunity.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 짐을 싸다 말고 당신을 의심스럽게 보았습니다. 그런 다음 그는 손에 든 책 더미를 보고 오랫동안 침묵을 지키더니 마음 "
"속으로 무언가를 결심합니다. 바솔로뮤는 한숨을 쉬고 책을 옆으로 치웁니다.{/n} \"나는 그런 제안을 거절할 수 없군요. 당신을 "
"섬기겠습니다. 결국, 그건 흔하지 않은 기회지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/NEW_SadisticMage/Barth_Packing/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "de609cbe-6b43-4585-b04c-5a092870eea1"
msgid ""
"{n}He looks around his packed bags and smirks.{/n} \"Seems all this packing "
"was unnecessary — I'll not take the laboratory with me. I'd prefer a lighter "
"journey to the capital. As soon as I pack the essentials and lock up the "
"house, I'll head straight for the city. See you there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 배낭을 보고는 비웃습니다.{/n} \"이 짐 모두 필요하지 않을 거 같군요. 저는 연구소를 가져잔 않을 겁니다. 수도에 갈 "
"때는 가볍게 하고 가는 걸 선호하죠. 필수적인 짐만 모두 싸는 데로 문을 잠그고 곧장 도시로 향하겠습니다. 거기서 뵙죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/Sign/SadisticMageSign_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "ec0a9528-bbd4-4129-aceb-8c3f00d05d09"
msgid "\"Proceed with caution! Traps ahead!\""
msgstr "\"조심해서 가! 덫을 조심하고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/TrollStoneStatue/TrollStoneStatue_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "40f86003-b02e-4370-b64a-506c944a7a3c"
msgid ""
"The troll statue is well crafted with incredible attention to detail. Who "
"would place it in the middle of the woods?"
msgstr "트롤 상은 세심한 주의를 기울여 제작되었습니다. 누가 그것을 숲 가운데 놓았을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMage/TrollStoneStatue/TrollStoneStatue_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "52c5a093-6bc6-4133-8d97-bc956c9bea06"
msgid ""
"This statue of a troll you realize is a rock troll, caught in direct "
"sunlight and turned to stone."
msgstr "이 트롤의 상은 암석 트롤이며 햇빛에 쬐여 돌이 되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageAttacked/Barks/CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "2bc3307c-7773-468f-89dd-f211d5f08c79"
msgid "\"Tortured our brother! Killed our brother!\""
msgstr "\"우리 동생을 괴롭히다니! 우리 동생을 죽였어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageAttacked/Barks/CommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "05e5590e-c6cf-4668-be59-42c868b9feb1"
msgid "\"You pay for this! You pay!\""
msgstr "\"넌 댓가를 치를 거야! 댓가를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageAttacked/Barks/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "aaf57c62-102b-453c-beba-9f506a51fc6d"
msgid "\"No forgive! No mercy!\""
msgstr "\"용서도, 자비도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageAttacked/Barks/Cue_58414 13_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "7b979693-f446-4235-b57e-d267b4554f30"
msgid ""
"\"Now I bid you to leave me. I need to perform some rather... unattractive "
"procedures.\""
msgstr "\"이제는 떠나줘. 할 일이 있으니... 별로 유쾌한 일은 아니라서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageAttacked/Barks/SadisticMage_Basement_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "c12d8f90-821b-490c-9225-6998d3de0768"
msgid "\"Assist me!\""
msgstr "\"나를 도와줘요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageAttacked/Barks/ZeroCommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "411947d1-7568-40f6-8d45-22e32164195b"
msgid "\"Like it, borba? You like it?\""
msgstr "\"그게 좋아? 보바? 너 그게 좋아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageAttacked/Barks/ZeroCommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "51478584-e68b-4e27-a010-f907fc5eb555"
msgid "\"Me run tests now!\""
msgstr "\"나 지금 시험해 본다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageAttacked/Barks/ZeroCommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "5c9bafe8-3463-41a5-bdcc-f396a669e27e"
msgid "\"You hit me? I hit you more!\""
msgstr "\"나 때렸냐? 나는 너 더 때린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_01706_Text
msgctxt "2385511f-06fb-4d6e-b580-1c264ba10f57"
msgid "\"I believe you. You may continue your experiments.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 믿는다. 너는 실험을 계속할 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_04470_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2292a3cd-1312-4436-8e87-caddb9de81e6"
msgid "Turned a blind eye to Bartholomew the wizard's experiments."
msgstr "바솔로뮤의 마법 실험을 모른 채 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_04470_Text
msgctxt "2cae3c58-7ec0-445b-8bb6-6501c33d9bbf"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care about the nature of your… experiments, so long as no harm "
"comes to my subjects.\""
msgstr "\"내 백성에게 해가 되지 않는다면 네 실험이 어떤지는 상관하지 않아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_16628_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "34f352e1-eac9-4a2e-ade0-2690694aeb90"
msgid "Listened to Octavia and ordered the wizard to free the troll."
msgstr "옥타비아의 말을 듣고 마법사에게 트롤을 풀어 주도록 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_16628_Text
msgctxt "f20a0bff-4aa4-44a8-b4f4-d1858acb9bbc"
msgid ""
"\"That doesn't concern me, but since this is so important to you — "
"Bartholomew, I order you to free the troll and cease your experiments.\""
msgstr "\"그건 나에 관한 것이 아니지만 이것이 바솔로뮤에게 아주 중요하기 때문에 트롤을 풀어주고 실험을 중단해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_32641_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "26064e46-dba7-4ab6-8a84-2bd04861fd61"
msgid "Changed your mind and ordered the wizard to free the troll."
msgstr "마음을 바꾸어 마법사가 트롤을 풀도록 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_32641_Text
msgctxt "014642c7-e583-4f96-902f-ab06a1901f32"
msgid "\"Yes, of course, you're right. Bartholomew, do as she says.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 네가 맞아. 바솔로뮤. 그녀가 말한대로 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_41692_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7e4a6432-7110-49c4-a56a-81d125896efe"
msgid "Approved of Bartholomew the wizard's experiments."
msgstr "바솔로뮤의 마법 실험을 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_41692_Text
msgctxt "f7646b4c-fa84-4081-972b-cc3346fbf6ef"
msgid ""
"\"Sounds interesting. Proceed. I look forward to hearing your results.\""
msgstr "\"흥미로운 것 같다. 진행해. 결과를 기다리지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_44970_Text
msgctxt "48fa4cbd-38c5-4b67-a087-e2b1a7e33354"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not convinced. As the ruler of these lands, I order you to immediately "
"cease all dangerous experiments and terminate that troll.\""
msgstr "\"확실하지 않아. 이 땅의 통치자로서 위험한 실험을 즉시 중단하고 트롤을 죽일 것을 명령한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_49051_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "216d961e-8a69-41a3-9ded-4486fb44d83a"
msgid ""
"Listened to Valerie, changed your mind, and let the wizard keep the troll."
msgstr "발레리의 말을 듣고 마음을 바꾸어 마법사가 트롤을 계속 관리하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_49051_Text
msgctxt "cd080a01-0625-4d67-bd0d-25932ae6fefa"
msgid "\"I'll let him continue his experiments, but only because you insist.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그가 실험을 계속하도록 허락하겠지만 네가 말해서 그런 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_68632_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "566ef70a-3645-4966-b94a-37ae4daecc45"
msgid "Ordered Bartholomew the wizard to kill the troll."
msgstr "바솔로뮤에게 트롤을 죽이라고 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_68632_Text
msgctxt "044d5a82-27cd-41ae-80df-38b4d7e030b5"
msgid ""
"\"This is reprehensible. I don't care how you acquired this creature — I "
"won't tolerate such cruelty in my lands! Kill him, quickly and humanely.\""
msgstr ""
"\"말도 안돼. 이 생물을 어떻게 얻었는지는 상관하지 않아. 내 땅에서 그런 잔인한 짓은 용서하지 않아! 그를 신속하고 인도적으로 죽여."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_75457_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a3e6542b-d893-43c2-a282-f84b913b4837"
msgid "Allowed Bartholomew the wizard to continue his experiments."
msgstr "바솔로뮤에게 실험을 계속하도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_75457_Text
msgctxt "8fb0bd9b-23ab-4138-9b77-00f04f2cd343"
msgid ""
"\"This is a disgusting practice, but it doesn't violate any laws. I can't "
"forbid you to continue your experiments.\""
msgstr "\"역겨운 실험이지만 어떤 법도 위반하지 않는다. 네가 실험을 못하도록 막을 수가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_81553_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a27268aa-3b56-4a3c-849d-7303302d831d"
msgid "Ordered Bartholomew the wizard to free the troll."
msgstr "바솔로뮤에게 트롤을 풀어주라고 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_81553_Text
msgctxt "9222f187-59e4-4be9-af86-736ba7f57e57"
msgid ""
"\"Trolls are sentient beings, not cattle to be bought and sold. What you're "
"doing is inhumane. Set him free.\""
msgstr "\"트롤은 사고 파는 가축이 아니라 감정이 있어. 네가 하는 짓은 비인도적이다. 그를 자유롭게 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_82179_Text
msgctxt "2fbc9b76-4a00-4aaa-adcd-5353bf8ae130"
msgid "\"First, explain to me why this troll is in your cage.\""
msgstr "\"우선 왜 트롤이 너의 감옥에 있는지 설명해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_92735_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f52a71f0-05f7-4c2d-a545-a8d2b1e0b2bb"
msgid "Ignored Octavia and upheld your judgment."
msgstr "옥타비아를 무시하고 당신의 결정을 유지했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_92735_Text
msgctxt "1e181f84-9e4f-4438-b5fe-dfe050e84f7b"
msgid "\"Quiet, Octavia. It's none of your business.\""
msgstr "\"조용히 해. 옥타비아. 그것은 네가 참견할 일이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_94634_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fddc486b-b1b2-42e4-badc-90cca1b62518"
msgid "Upheld the law, changed your mind, and let the wizard keep the troll."
msgstr "법을 지지하고 마음을 바꾸어 마법사가 트롤을 계속 관리토록 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_94634_Text
msgctxt "4758ff17-f00e-4b87-94ef-2bf93998ddef"
msgid ""
"\"To my deep regret, you're right. Bartholomew, you may keep the troll.\""
msgstr "\"진심으로 미안하군. 네가 맞아. 바솔로뮤. 트롤을 계속 관리하게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_96156_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a45da5a5-1281-4519-a576-8a6c5bdf915e"
msgid "Ignored Valerie and upheld your judgment."
msgstr "발레리를 무시하고 당신의 판단을 지지했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Answer_96156_Text
msgctxt "0c9d2d84-1e18-444b-b73f-953924f15317"
msgid ""
"\"Then call me a bandit chief if you will. Some things simply mustn't be "
"allowed, law or no law.\""
msgstr "\"네가 원한다면 나를 도둑놈 두목이라고 불러. 어떤 것은 법에 상관 없이 허락되어서는 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_00332_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "eae422bf-caf9-4695-9487-7a8b8c185c65"
msgid ""
"\"How could you say that, Your Grace! I couldn't bring myself to harm even "
"an animal! I've chosen this troll because they're a plague, and their "
"numbers need to be thinned.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 그런 말을 할 수 있지요, 전하! 나는 동물 하나에게 조차 해를 끼치지 못해요! 내가 이 트롤을 선택한 건 그들이 트롤이 "
"역병이고 그 숫자를 줄여야 할 필요가 있어서 였어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_01422_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "53f0717c-c1d3-4914-96cc-5df3b30537de"
msgid ""
"\"This wasn't cast by any human hand though, oh no! The brand was stamped on "
"with some artifact, which would make it possible to make trolls fire-"
"resistant in massive numbers!\""
msgstr "\"이것은 인간의 손에 의해 만들어지지 않았어! 이 문양은 아티팩트로 트롤을 불에 저항하게 만들어주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_19644 1_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "31a09480-71db-4b74-9d44-dedc62dfc6d2"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia glares at you, then turns her glare to the wizard.{/n} \"It's "
"wrong to torture a living creature! It's just not right,\" {n}she whispers, "
"turning away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신을 노려보고는 마법사에게 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"살아있는 생물을 고문하는 것은 잘못된 일이야! 그것은 옳지 않아."
"\" {n}그녀는 속삭이며고는 등돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_19644_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "17a9d829-9b9b-4fb5-81ce-030740d9de92"
msgid ""
"\"It's not the same!\" {n}Octavia turns to you for support.{/n} \"Would you "
"allow cruelty like this in your lands? Order him to set the troll free!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 같지 않아!\" {n}옥타비아는 동의의 뜻으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"당신의 땅에서 이런 잔인한 짓을 허락할 건가야요? "
"그에게 트롤을 풀어주라고 하세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_22757_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "bfcd8353-0378-4fb0-8d3f-392c32a89cc0"
msgid ""
"\"Now, now, child...\" {n}Bartholomew answers slowly.{/n} \"I would never do "
"anything like this with humans. This is a troll. A mindless man-eater. Your "
"company kills them in the dozens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자. 이제...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 천천히 대답합니다.{/n} \"나는 인간에게는 이런 일은 결코하지 않을 겁니다. 이것은 "
"트롤이에요. 사람을 먹는 미친 놈이지. 네 동료는 그들을 수십은 죽였어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_48303_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "d7100a64-77e6-4195-941b-fbf46f57dbd9"
msgid ""
"\"What's the issue? This isn't a person, it's a mindless creature who's "
"barely capable of stringing a few words together! You kill them without a "
"second thought, but you would deny me the right to experiment on it for the "
"sake of science? This is barbarism! Despotism! You have no...\" {n}The "
"wizard stops abruptly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"문제가 뭐야? 사람도 아니고 몇마디 할 줄 아는 미친 짐승인데! 너는 별다른 생각 없이 그들을 죽이지만 과학을 위한 실험을 막는 "
"거야? 이건 야만적이야! 독재자! 너는 그럴...\" {n}마법사가 갑자기 중지합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_49228_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "36216920-413f-4dc6-99ee-c0e59b160090"
msgid ""
"\"It's so refreshing to work for someone with an open mind! Believe me, Your "
"Grace, I'll prove to be a valuable ally!\""
msgstr "\"열린 마음으로 누군가를 위해 일하는 것은 상쾌하군요! 나를 믿어요. 내가 믿을 만한 동료라는 걸 증명할 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_54851 1_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "244067a7-bee1-4d05-a0a0-3a8e6cfa2fe0"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew throws a long, sullen glance your way.{/n} \"At once, Your "
"Grace,\" {n}he finally manages through clenched teeth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 길고 못마땅한 눈빛으로 당신 쪽을 봅니다.{/n} \"알겠습니다. 전하.\" {n}그는 마침내 이를 악물며 "
"말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_54851_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ff81b797-4d5b-4ee9-92cc-f498eeb319ba"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie frowns.{/n} \"These experiments are deplorable, but the law is "
"with him. If you are a {mf|baron|baroness}, not a bandit chief, you have no "
"right to interfere.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이 실험은 끔찍하지만 법이 법은 그와 함께합니다. 당신이 도적 두목이 아니라 남작이라면 간섭할 "
"권리가 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_64027_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "1e0ee3cc-982f-43e0-9dec-ac26d0471d89"
msgid ""
"\"Set it free?! So it can come back and eat you? And me too? You are insa-\" "
"{n}The wizard stops abruptly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그걸 풀어줘? 다시 돌아와서 너를 잡아먹으라고? 나도 잡아먹고? 미쳤...\" {n}마법사가 말을 하다 갑자기 멈춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_70286_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "fe26717b-9413-428d-a4e2-358c4b7a5580"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew rushes into the laboratory, waving the sample of branded "
"troll skin excitedly.{/n} \"It was simpler than I thought! This is just a "
"simple spell of fire protection — any competent wizard could cast it. The "
"unusual element was the way the spell was applied!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 실험실로 뛰어들어가 흥분하여 트롤의 피부에 붙어있던 문양의 표본을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"내가 생각했던 것보다 간단했다! "
"이것은 단순한 화염 보호 마법일 뿐이야. 능력있는 마법사라면 누구든지 쓸 수 있어. 이상한 원소가 마법에 적용된 방식이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_71115 1_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ac33bb9b-c79f-4ea6-9e87-241493266290"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia gives Bartholomew a gloatful smile.{/n} \"Understand?\" {n}Her "
"whisper is just barely audible. The wizard turns away without saying a "
"word.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 바솔로뮤에게 유쾌한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"이해했어?\" {n}그녀의 속삭임은 거의 들리지 않습니다. 마법사는 말도 "
"하지 않고 등돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_71115_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "823217a4-7d50-4e92-afaf-da7ba9787891"
msgid ""
"\"Are you both insane?!\" {n}Octavia shouts.{/n} \"Keeping a living creature "
"in a cage, torturing it... This is inhumane!\""
msgstr ""
"\"둘 다 정신 나간 거야?!\" {n}옥타비아는 소리를 지릅니다.{/n} \"살아있는 생물을 감옥에 넣어 고문하다니... 비인간적이야!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_72305_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "c6bc5102-2c17-4544-9e29-1ecb3842fc84"
msgid ""
"\"I'm pleased our... minor ideological differences are respected. We might "
"prove extremely useful to each other!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 사소한 차이를 서로 인정해주어 기쁘네요. 아마 서로에게 유용하다는 걸 입증할 수 있을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_83920_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "412f1d56-5c25-44aa-a771-bd7ddf01c462"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew bows.{/n} \"Thank you, Your Grace. You won't regret this "
"decision.\""
msgstr "{n}바솔로뮤가 인사합니다.{/n} \"고마습니다. 이 결정을 후회하지 않을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_88913 1_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "3f3bb15c-35c3-4c3e-a6d2-03d78a5f4633"
msgid ""
"\"Though you've killed all the trolls, this is still grave news. To organize "
"in such a way — ally themselves with kobolds — this speaks of some greater "
"intelligence at work. You and your kingdom may be in danger...\" {n}"
"Bartholomew pauses, then begins to rummage through his lab.{/n} \"I promised "
"you a reward, so, please, accept these acid wands — I'm afraid you may need "
"them soon...\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 그 트롤 모두를 죽였을지라도 이것은 여전히 중요한 소식입니다. 코볼트와 동맹을 맺고 조직하려면 이건 상위의 지적 존재가 작업 "
"중이란 걸 말해줍니다. 당신과 당신의 왕국은 위험에 처할 수 있어요...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 잠시 멈추고 그의 실험실을 뒤적거리기 "
"시작합니다.{/n} \"나는 너에게 보상을 약속했지요. 이 산성 완드를 받아줘요. 유감스럽게도 당신이 그것들이 곧 필요할 겁니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_88913 2_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "345528f1-5d4e-48d6-a8bf-497605910d69"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew's eyes light up.{/n} \"Oh, yes! This is the greatest project "
"of my career! I'm exploring the regenerative abilities of trolls in the "
"hopes of passing them on to humans. Can you imagine the possibilities? Pain, "
"senility, mutilations, even death itself — defeated! Oh, you weren't "
"concerned I acquired the troll illicitly, were you? Don't worry, I purchased "
"it legally. I'm not some poacher out roaming the {mf|baron|baroness}'s woods!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤의 눈이 빛납니다.{/n} \"오. 그래! 이건 내 경력 중 가장 위대한 계획이지요! 트롤의 재생 능력을 인간에게 적용하기 "
"위해 연구 중이입니다. 그 가능성을 상상할 수 있겠어요? 고통, 노쇠, 상처, 심지어 죽음도 이기는 능력이지요! 내가 트롤을 불법적으로 "
"얻었다고 염려했나요? 걱정 마세요. 나는 합법적으로 구매했어요. 나는 당신의 숲에 돌아다니는 밀렵꾼이 아니에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_88913_Text
#. Speaker : SadisticMageBefore
msgctxt "02d2868a-1c39-451b-baf6-d31832292399"
msgid ""
"\"This is grave news for us all. My fire traps are useless now, and making "
"acid traps will take time and resources... More importantly, for trolls to "
"organize in such a way, there must be some greater intelligence operating "
"behind the scenes. And if that's the case, the list of potential targets for "
"a force that formidable is a short one...\" {n}Bartholomew pauses, then "
"begins to rummage through his lab.{/n} \"I promised you a reward, so, "
"please, accept these acid wands — I'm afraid you may need them soon...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 우리 모두에게 중대한 소식입니다. 이제 내 화염 덫은 쓸모가 없고 산성 함정을 만드는 데는 시간과 자원이 필요해... 더 "
"중요한 것은 트롤들이 조직화된 방식입니다. 그들 뒤에는 틀림없이 더 뛰어난 지성체가 있어요. 그런 경우라면 가공할 군세의 잠재적 목표 "
"목록은 더 짧아...\" {n}바솔로뮤는 잠시 멈추고 그의 실험실을 뒤적 거리기 시작합니다.{/n} \"나는 당신에게 보상을 약속했어요. "
"이 산성 완드를 받아주세요. 유감스럽게도 당신은 그것들이 곧 필요해질 겁니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_96159_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e383282b-fd80-4f03-9f25-045ca4b3c306"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie gives you the slightest look of scorn.{/n} \"I cannot say I am "
"greatly disappointed in you, as my expectations were not high to begin with."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 당신에게 조금 경멸 어린 표정으로 봅니다.{/n} \"내 기대가 처음부터 높지는 않아서 그다지 실망하지는 않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_96162_Text_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "105a6ac9-216f-473c-8078-9a5f2c465d1e"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles at you sadly.{/n} \"The ruler's path is complicated, {name}"
". I admire your resolution in the face of such... dilemmas.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 슬프게 웃습니다.{/n} \"통치자의 길은 복잡합니다. {name}. 그런 딜레마에서 당신이 내린 결정이 감탄스럽습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_96165_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e27e5d5f-5754-43b3-9926-6a1d7bb531d6"
msgid ""
"\"I sometimes have trouble accepting laws that would protect lowlifes like "
"him, but he is within his rights, unfortunately.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가끔 그와 같은 자들을 보호하는 법을 반대했지만 불행히도 그는 권리가 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_96166_Text_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "755a1181-3f41-4c3a-8969-6250145f32e1"
msgid ""
"\"Unfortunately, those who prefer law over anarchy must sometimes put up "
"with such... dilemmas. It is a difficult path, but the only right one — "
"especially in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불행히도 무정부와 같은 법을 선호하는 사람들은 때로는 그러한 딜레마를 참아내야 합니다. 어려운 길이지만 그것이 {g|Stolen "
"Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 유일한 권리입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_96172_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "40902b4a-f3a1-4e58-9089-c5fc23200adc"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah clicks her tongue in approval.{/n} \"A bold plan, and potentially "
"quite profitable! – If you succeed. I wish you luck in your studies, "
"honorable Bartholomew!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 동의하는 듯이 입을 다십니다.{/n} \"대담하고 잠재적으로 이익이 되는 계획이야! 네가 성공한다면 말이지. 네 연구가 "
"성공한다면 명예를 얻겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_Troll 1_Text
#. Speaker : TrollSubjectZero
msgctxt "82396f07-598f-407e-8801-b2f1de13b53b"
msgid ""
"\"Bor-bahhha...\" {n}the troll croaks through clenched teeth.{/n} \"Kill "
"me... Enough... It hurts...\""
msgstr "\"보르바...\" {n}이빨 빠진 트롤이 말합니다.{/n} \"나를 죽여... 그만... 아파...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/SadisticMageTroll/Cue_Troll_Text
#. Speaker : TrollSubjectZero
msgctxt "480a385c-4556-410e-b89a-928446a88b30"
msgid ""
"\"Bor-ba...\" {n}A hoarse croak comes from behind the bars.{/n} \"Borrr"
"-baaaah...\" {n}The troll sitting in the cage is so thin you can see his "
"ribs through the skin. Although you see no scars, his pelt is matted with "
"dried blood, and his eyes are dull and unfocused. Various knives, saws, and "
"bloody manacles scattered about leave little doubt about what this troll has "
"suffered.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"보르바...\" {n}감옥 안에서 쉰 목소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"보르바아...\" {n}감옥에 앉아있는 트롤은 갈비뼈가 드러날 "
"정도로 말랐습니다. 흉터는 보이지 않지만 피부에 피가 말라 붙었고, 눈은 멍하니 초점이 맞지 않습니다. 주위에 다양한 모양의 칼과 톱, "
"그리고 갈퀴가 걸려있어 트롤이 어떤 고통을 겪었는지 어렵지 않게 알 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_02055_Text
msgctxt "d629aa57-700d-4bb3-9d06-246f3833a174"
msgid "\"You're welcome.\""
msgstr "\"천만에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_13653_Text
msgctxt "c726fc42-d4b4-4118-a42c-f6ebc19d5ac7"
msgid "\"Where are your boots?\""
msgstr "\"너의 장화는 어디있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_13670_Text
msgctxt "eae76d17-11d4-43f9-8238-18dc7520c624"
msgid "\"So, Waine, what happened?\""
msgstr "\"웨인. 어떻게 된 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_19801_Text
msgctxt "2fc3b693-09d4-4938-8312-85c34c5c450a"
msgid "\"I'll keep that in mind.\""
msgstr "\"기억해두지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_41308_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "081697da-2cc4-42bf-ab85-f8196ec1811c"
msgid "Drove away the scared merchant."
msgstr "겁 먹은 상인을 쫓아냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_41308_Text
msgctxt "794f667a-f4ed-4da7-aa92-9d2a0e43bd86"
msgid "\"Actually, I just wanted to watch you run. Better keep it up, or...\""
msgstr "\"사실 네가 뛰는 모습을 보고 싶었다. 달리지 않으면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_49022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "056e35ed-de36-4043-8251-607e34258bf6"
msgid "Allowed Octavia to calm the scared merchant."
msgstr "옥타비아에게 겁먹은 상인을 진정시키도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_49022_Text
msgctxt "7d366c46-8de0-4bdf-877b-dce9d39111ae"
msgid "\"All right, Octavia. Try to calm him down.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 옥타비아. 진정시켜.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_49974_Text
msgctxt "47076054-2b06-45bf-b7a4-d88e197706d7"
msgid "\"Whatever you say. Don't go anywhere.\""
msgstr "\"네가 뭐라 하든. 아무데도 가지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_50383_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "70f83f2f-84d7-4ee5-b790-c626846e2bee"
msgid "Sent the dead merchant's treasure to his family."
msgstr "죽은 상인의 보물을 가족에게 보냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_50383_Text
msgctxt "a16702b2-7f68-4fbc-9b95-ca69f415836e"
msgid ""
"\"We found Leksen — he's dead. Here's his brooch. Give it to his relatives "
"so they have something to remember him by.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 렉센을 발견했다. 그는 죽었어. 그의 브로치가 여기 있어. 그의 가족들에게 유품으로 남겨줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_50465_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3f93c7a2-ca09-4ee9-89d0-6f19b094d228"
msgid "Left the scared merchant in danger."
msgstr "겁 먹은 상인을 위험에 빠뜨렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_50465_Text
msgctxt "1bb77515-526c-478e-9585-45d141f92e83"
msgid ""
"\"You're too scared to make it to a road that's just a few steps away? Those "
"traps would be doing the world a favor.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 몇 걸음만 가면 바로 길인데 거기까지도 너무 무섭다고? 그 함정들 참 세상친절하구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_52105_Text
msgctxt "b41ff8f0-22ed-4b1e-9faf-bd3b53682c5f"
msgid "\"What's wrong with you? What happened?\""
msgstr "\"너 왜 그래? 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_57000_Text
msgctxt "196d1ba9-1228-43c1-8484-de0ee32259f8"
msgid "\"We found Leksen. He's dead.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 렉센을 찾았다. 그는 죽었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_62291_Text
msgctxt "d46ed6cd-8ff9-45e2-8e8f-bd5937d93c54"
msgid "\"So how long have you been standing there?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 거기에 얼마나 오래 서있었는데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_64387_Text
msgctxt "597941e9-a09b-4f8a-b483-cae3f314b3b7"
msgid "\"Stop yelling, or you'll regret it. Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"소리지르는 것을 멈추지 않으면 후회할 거야. 넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_69539_Text
msgctxt "08b7533c-3395-4128-a13c-e3757c6a12d2"
msgid "\"So, do you want to get back to the road?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 길로 다시 돌아가고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_76713_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fcfb2069-aaca-465d-bd80-6ac89ce3ec67"
msgid "Allowed Amiri to drive away the scared merchant."
msgstr "아미리가 겁 먹은 상인을 쫓아내도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_76713_Text
msgctxt "c4001f8f-4d3d-4060-82f2-1663932fe0f3"
msgid "\"All right, Amiri. He's yours.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 아미리. 그는 네가 알아서 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_77714_Text
msgctxt "6b25d88f-3a5a-4607-a945-d039018f01a5"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, you've been standing here screaming in fear for FOUR HOURS because "
"there might be traps around you?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 주변에 함정이 있을까봐 자그만치 4시간 동안이나 비명을 지르면서 서있었다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_84402_Text
msgctxt "0747cc30-27c8-408c-9e03-ce826bb3c213"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_87766_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "16bdead8-1d02-47aa-b9d8-f6d371c7a08e"
msgid "Helped the scared merchant make his way to safety."
msgstr "겁 먹은 상인이 안전하게 갈 수 있도록 도와주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_87766_Text
msgctxt "32225654-41a0-4321-ab19-e1db4013daef"
msgid ""
"\"The way back to the road is free of traps, Waine. We just came from there "
"after we heard you screaming. Come on, we'll make sure you get back safely.\""
msgstr ""
"\"돌아가는 길에 함정이 없어, 웨인. 네 비명 소리를 듣고 우리는 저기서부터 왔어. 이리 와, 이제 안전하게 돌아갈 수 있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_93197_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ee8af86d-a782-41ed-a91f-4608ac43f839"
msgid "Helped the scared merchant make his way to safety."
msgstr "겁 먹은 상인이 안전하게 갈 수 있도록 도와주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Answer_93197_Text
msgctxt "f451e12c-be21-49a3-9e03-af1064c7c2a8"
msgid ""
"\"How about this? You head toward the road, and I follow. You falter, I'll "
"kick you so hard you make it the rest of the way airborne.\""
msgstr "\"이건 어때? 니가 앞장서서 길까지 가. 우린 뒤따라 갈테니까. 주춤거렸다간 너를 걷어 차서 길까지 날려보내주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_09747_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "6b9c4d2a-a570-46e7-9aad-5e0bf0f3b0e3"
msgid ""
"\"Dead? That's awful! May {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} save his soul. Yes, "
"Leksen bought this brooch for his wife, said it was a birthday present. "
"Thank you. I'll make sure she gets it. And thanks again for all you've done "
"for me today.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽었다구요? 끔찍해! {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}가 그의 영혼을 구하기를. 맞아, 렉센은 그의 아내를 위해 이 브로치를 "
"샀을때 생일 선물이라고 말했었어요. 고맙습니다. 꼭 그녀에게 전하겠습니다. 오늘 일은 다시 한번 감사드립니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_11000_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "271c4f0b-f37c-4595-b785-6e05844d95cb"
msgid ""
"\"But I didn't stick to the road! I thought I saw something glittering in "
"the underbrush. Soon as I approached — BOOM! Suddenly I was flying upside "
"down.\" {n}Waine lifts his hands sharply to mimic the blast.{/n} \"When I "
"landed, I was too scared to move. So many traps around. I wouldn't survive a "
"second BOOM.\""
msgstr ""
"\"근데 길을 벗어나고 말았지뭡니까! 주변 덤불에서 뭔가 반짝이는걸 본거는 같았는데.. 근처에 다다랐을때 '펑!' 갑자기 허공으로 뒤집혀 "
"날라갔어요.\" {n}웨인은 손으로 폭발을 신랄하게 묘사합니다.{/n} \"땅에 떨어지고나니 움직이기가 너무 무섭더라구요. 주변 곳곳이 "
"함정이라구요. 아마 두번째 '펑'에서는 난 살아남지 못할꺼야\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_14026_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "802cc1a8-2b54-4eed-9e6b-016d32f86994"
msgid ""
"\"I… I… I'm… Wa… Waine,\" {n}he manages at last. His eyes are wide, so wide "
"they look like they might fall out of his sockets.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 나는... 나는... 웨인...\" {n}그가 마침내 말합니다. 그는 눈을 너무나 크게 떠서 눈이 튀어나올 것만 "
"같았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_19477_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "74f2c13a-e954-4c85-9d86-25b7e1b7ca4d"
msgid ""
"\"You could spread the word of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. Help people "
"understand the futility of existence. The sooner this agony of life ends, "
"the sooner eternal tranquility will come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 말을 전할 수 있을 거야. 사람들이 존재의 덧없음을 이해하도록 도와. 인생의 고뇌가 끝나면 "
"영원한 평온이 올 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_21123_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "72175f31-017a-4437-9260-2129e9c42db8"
msgid ""
"\"We last came a month ago, left him some supplies. We were riding back "
"today, and we wanted to stop and pick up an order he promised to complete... "
"Well, Leksen stayed to guard the cart while I went to the mage's house.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 그에게 마지막으로 물건을 넘긴건 한달 전이었어요. 그리곤 오늘 다시 와서 그에게서 받기로 약속한 걸 받으려고 했죠.. 뭐, "
"그래서 제가 마법사의 집으로 가는 동안 렉센은 카트를 지키기로 했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_22266_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "c4996c30-ecd0-4292-a065-2c175998ced2"
msgid ""
"{n}Waine contemplates your words for a moment before a new fear falls across "
"his face. But this time, instead of freezing in place, he begins sprinting "
"toward the road.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}웨인은 당신의 말을 곰곰히 생각하더니 공포스러운 표정이 스쳐갑니다. 하지만 이번에는 얼어붙지 않고 길을 향해 전속력으로 달리기 "
"시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_29431_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "8b43a244-39f8-405e-9012-0b08e46448aa"
msgid ""
"\"This mage has a bunch of traps around his house — scares off the trolls, "
"you see. He even put a warning sign up by the road, so people wouldn't get "
"hurt. You just have to stick to the road. Trolls are stupid, can't read. So "
"they get caught.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 마법사는 트롤이 겁에 질리도록 집 주변에 많은 함정을 설치해 놓고는 사람들이 다치지 않도록 길가에 경고 표지판까지 붙여놨습니다. "
"그러니 그냥 길만 따라가면 됩니다. 트롤은 멍청하니까 읽지 못하고, 놈들만 당하는거죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_35210_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "1dbf2973-4e48-4b17-a097-262624b684dd"
msgid ""
"\"HELP! HELP!\" {n}The young man yells, even though you're right in front of "
"him.{/n}"
msgstr "\"도와줘! 도와줘!\" {n}그 청년은 당신이 앞에 있어도 소리를 지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_36344_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9c4ad70a-c736-403b-8e23-2d058b305117"
msgid ""
"\"Judging by the discolorations on his pants, I'd say he spots rabbits "
"regularly.\""
msgstr "\"바지에 색이 변한 것을 보니 때때로 토끼를 잡는 것으로 보여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_38107_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "8baa3ddf-46fc-4ddd-9181-642ec8230e24"
msgid ""
"\"I have nothing to give as a reward. I never made it to the mage's house, "
"after all. And now I never will! To hell with him!\" {n}Waine sighs.{/n} "
"\"You'd best find Leksen. He's probably still waiting for me near the cart "
"on the road. Tell him I'm on my way. He'll reward you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 보상으로 줄 것이 없습니다. 난 결국 마법사의 집에 도달하지도 못했다구요. 앞으로도 가지도 않을꺼구요! 망할 녀석!\" {n}"
"웨인은 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"렉센을 찾으시면 됩니다. 아마 길가의 카트 주위에서 나를 기다리고 있을꺼거든요. 만나게되면 내가 곧 "
"도착할꺼라고 말해주세요. 그가 보상을 해드릴겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_38254_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3506d2e6-22fd-4022-9c85-91288a26b532"
msgid "\"Enough sniveling! One hit from me'll fix him.\""
msgstr "\"그만 징징대! 나한테 한대 맞으면 정신 들꺼다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_38484_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "2c1852f2-71af-4351-a452-e3212dbc523c"
msgid ""
"\"I... I... can't! I can't do it, you understand? What if I fall, or "
"stumble, or bump my head on a branch? Anything here could be a trap! No, "
"everything could be!\" {n}The panic returns to Waine's eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"난 난... 못해! 알겠어요? 내가 만약 넘어지거나 헛디디거나 나무에 머리를 부딪히면 어떻게 하죠? 여긴 어떤것이든 다 함정일 수 "
"있어! 아니, 모든게 다 함정일 수 있어!\" {n}웨인의 눈이 다시 공포로 가득찹니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_44455_Text
msgctxt "b9a8158c-56a3-48e7-a27f-37407e59996a"
msgid ""
"{n}The man goes silent and stares at you, horrified. After a moment, he "
"gulps loudly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그 남자는 잠잠해지더니 당신을 두렵게 쳐다봅니다. 잠시 후, 그는 침을 크게 소리내어 삼킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_48025_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "e60acba6-c4a3-4030-9218-3a2f624017cd"
msgid ""
"\"Traders... We... We're traders, Leksen and me! We...\" {n}Waine waves his "
"hand vaguely. As he relaxes, he starts to babble.{/n} \"We usually come to "
"visit the local mage, bring him food, and he gives us magic trinkets in "
"exchange.\""
msgstr ""
"\"상인... 우리... 렉켄과 나는 상인입니다. 우리는...\" {n}웨인은 막연하게 손을 흔듭니다. 좀 진정되자 다시 웅얼대기 "
"시작합니다.{/n} \"우리는 지역의 마법사를 방문하여 음식을 보내주고 댓가로 그는 우리에게 마법 장신구를 줍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_52589_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "512c3240-b0bf-4ec5-b711-c8cd8329c5f8"
msgid ""
"\"Dead? That's awful! May {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} save his soul. What a "
"horrible day...\""
msgstr "\"죽었어요? 끔찍하군! {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}께서 그의 영혼을 구하시길. 이런 끔찍한 날이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_56722_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4463f9a3-f5dd-490b-b410-0e65a9b735f1"
msgid ""
"\"Stop this at once, both of you! I'll not tolerate your quarrels while we "
"serve together!\" {n}Valerie stomps her foot in irritation. Surprisingly, it "
"works — Amiri and Jubilost both mutter something and turn away from each "
"other.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그만하십시오. 둘 다! 두 분이 싸우는 것을 나는 볼 수는 없습니다!\" {n}발레리는 짜증으로 발을 굴립니다. 놀랍게도 아미리와 "
"주빌로스트는 무언가를 중얼거리고는 서로 등돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_57411_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "4a09ffaf-7736-4a17-96b3-0aa465294afd"
msgid ""
"\"I... I'll try. Just... stay near, please. Maybe hold my hand. Or... could "
"you carry me? Please? Could you?\""
msgstr "\"한번..해볼게요.. 꼭 제 주변에 있으셔야 합니다. 제 손을 잡아주셔도 돼고. 아니면.. 저를 업어주실 수 있나요 혹시?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_57411_WhatToBark
msgctxt "a6503010-8ac5-4111-821f-5a672871a2aa"
msgid "Crossing his fingers, Waine walks toward the safety of the road."
msgstr "손가락을 교차하고 웨인은 안전한 길로 걸어갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_61287_Text
msgctxt "747ad368-6b30-4225-a635-28977aa731de"
msgid ""
"{n}Waine begins frantically nodding, then stops, thinks the matter over, and "
"begins frantically shaking his head instead.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}웨인은 미친듯이 끄덕이고는 멈춥니다. 일어난 일을 상관하지 않고 머리를 흔들 뿐이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_61661_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "d646d672-dc8d-422f-ac2e-ccd9b2c6e9b7"
msgid ""
"\"Everything's crumbling around me. {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}, embrace my soul."
"\""
msgstr "\"주위가 모두 무너져내린다. {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}시여 제 영혼을 품어주소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_65038_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "c49e2ce7-405b-424f-8b63-b9848cddfaff"
msgid "\"Poor thing.\""
msgstr "\"불쌍하게도..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_68964_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "131b277c-8f0a-420b-a539-dc721b22dd7c"
msgid "{n}She laughs.{/n} \"Scared him good.\""
msgstr "{n}그녀가 웃습니다.{/n} \"그를 제대로 겁줬어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_70899_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0a74a39f-29da-4f4d-bbce-52def875cd3f"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri shows off the grin that haunts her rivals to the end of their days. "
"The rivals who can run fast enough, that is. Her hand grips her sword.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 라이벌이 끝날 거라는 듯 미소를 보여줍니다. 라이벌들은 빨리 도망칠 수 있습니다. 그녀는 칼을 잡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_70899_WhatToBark
msgctxt "6754a4b2-74cb-4f39-9711-efde568bdb68"
msgid "Scared to death, Waine runs toward the safety of the road."
msgstr "죽음에 대한 공포로 웨인은 길의 안전한 쪽으로 달려 나갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_73969_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "08a6e7bf-eab7-4d83-9555-8dc347edf020"
msgid ""
"\"Horrible day, what a horrible day! {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, save my soul."
"\""
msgstr "\"끔찍한 날군. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}시여 제 영혼을 구원하소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_74212_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "40d76820-d3a8-4a98-b5f8-c4bfea721873"
msgid ""
"\"We should leave him. He was surely fated to die by this trap.\" {n}Harrim "
"strokes his beard.{/n} \"It would be wrong of us to prevent this man from "
"reaching the end of his path.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그를 내버려 두게. 그는 어차피 함정으로 죽을 운명이었네.\" {n}하림은 그의 수염을 쓰다듬습니다.{/n} \"그가 그의 길의 끝에 "
"도달하는 것을 막는 것이 우리의 잘못이라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_76454_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "11b879cb-e99a-4056-975e-2a786df50a9e"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost simply turns away from Amiri, seemingly unfazed by the menacing "
"barbarian.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 위협적인 바바리안에게 당황하지 않은 듯, 그저 아미리를 외면합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_76925_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "f1fb5adf-f860-4e98-bcbd-8b9c3509256c"
msgid ""
"\"Th-th-thank you!\" {n}Waine's teeth are still chattering, but he seems to "
"be focusing better.{/n} \"Thank you! You saved my life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"고.고맙습니다!\" {n}웨인의 이빨은 여전히 요란하게 부딪히는 소리를 내지만 정신을 차려가는듯 보입니다.{/n} \"고맙습니다. 내 "
"목숨을 구해줬어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_78353_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c3563273-7a82-4cec-80c7-5d55b9c6f849"
msgid "\"He's mad in the head. Let him rot.\""
msgstr "\"그는 미쳤어. 죽게 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_80181_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "baa3c94a-9309-42f3-9427-846e7f30bf2e"
msgid "{n}Amiri's face goes red and she reaches for her sword.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리의 얼굴은 붉어지고 그녀는 검에 손을 댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_83007_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "c73dca1b-823d-4647-a1f4-76252b78fdd5"
msgid ""
"\"Ahhh!\" {n}Waine breaks into a sprint. He stumbles, gets back on his feet, "
"and continues to run without looking back.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아아--!\" {n}웨인은 갑자기 뛰기시작합니다. 비틀거리나 싶더니 다시 일어서서는 뒤도 돌아보지 않고 계속 달려갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_83822_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "b073c096-369d-47f1-8281-8aa19317d192"
msgid ""
"{n}Waine stares at you blankly for a moment, then shrugs.{/n} \"Four hours? "
"Maybe more...\""
msgstr "{n}웨인은 잠시 당신을 멍하니 보며 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"4시간? 아마도 더...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_83944_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "ec6e548b-9fd5-41dc-b673-e017b9e6a034"
msgid ""
"\"You're evil! Pure evil! Go away! Someone will rescue me eventually! You'll "
"see!\" {n}Waine resumes his previous yelling.{/n} \"HEEEEEEELP! SAVE MEEEEE!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 나쁜 놈! 순 나쁜 자식! 저리가! 누군가 나를 결국 구출해 줄 거야! 두고봐!\" {n}웨인은 계속해서 소리지릅니다.{/n} "
"\"도와주세요! 나를 구해주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_84119_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5766826a-36b3-4323-a556-ba156b1104f8"
msgid ""
"\"We have to get him out of here! Let me talk to him. I'm sure I can calm "
"him down.\""
msgstr "\"그를 여기서 꺼내줘야 해요! 제가 말해볼께요. 그를 진정시킬 수 있을거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_87266_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "560d4ef0-f6f7-48ac-9bf4-172e84f5c4fd"
msgid "{n}Waine stares at you silently for a moment, then nods.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}웨인은 잠시 당신을 조용히 바라보고는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_87641_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9d4d069d-ec73-41c5-b8e7-99eee91500a6"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia approaches Waine and touches his hand gently. Waine looks as if "
"he's about to yank his hand away, then suddenly relaxes.{/n} \"There now, "
"nothing to be afraid of. Everything's going to be all right. I'll lead you "
"to the road. Let's go. Come on.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 웨인에게 다가가 손을 부드럽게 잡습니다. 웨인은 손을 홱 잡아빼는 것처럼 하다가도 갑자기 진정되기 시작합니다.{/n} "
"\"이제, 두려워할 것 없어. 다 잘 될 거야. 내가 길로 안내해 줄께. 가죠. 어서요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_91248_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "39464bc7-b7aa-4973-bb0b-a1aabe1fad76"
msgid ""
"\"We can't just pass by! The man's clearly in trouble. We have to help him!\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 그냥 지나칠 수는 없어! 그 남자는 분명히 곤경에 빠졌어. 우린 그를 도와야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_91384_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "a13c38e1-fb99-4799-8dc2-a58dabc3500a"
msgid "\"But... How can I go on living, if there's no sense in it?\""
msgstr "\"하지만... 감각이 없다면 어떻게 살 수 있죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_93211_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "b9b9782d-3c15-4319-b8ec-5151e5bb7333"
msgid ""
"{n}Waine looks at his feet, perplexed. He moves his toes as though trying to "
"feel out the inside of an invisible boot.{/n} \"Boom,\" {n}he answers at "
"last.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}웨인은 당황하여 발을 보았습니다. 그는 보이지 않는 장화의 안을 느끼려는 것처럼 발가락을 움직입니다.{/n} \"펑.\" {n}그는 "
"마침내 대답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_94107_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "01ea5397-d229-47ae-a23f-8a09fc902501"
msgid ""
"\"Cowards like this make me sick! He'd shit himself at the sight of a rabbit!"
"\""
msgstr "\"이런 겁쟁이들이 나를 지겹게 만들어! 토끼같이 겁이 많은 놈이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_95802_Text
msgctxt "0e616c91-59da-4c61-9781-416d9bb92afe"
msgid ""
"{n}A barefoot young man in tattered clothes stands before you. His eyes dart "
"about wildly, and his matted hair sticks up in dirty spikes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}맨발의 청년이 너덜너덜한 옷을 입고 당신을 봅니다. 그의 눈은 흔들리고 그의 머리는 헝클어졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_97427_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "22a91f6b-2bc6-4962-ab1b-34ac5aefa754"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be sad, friend. When fate deals you a blow, take it gladly. Your "
"whole life is one road to the End, and each day is but another step along "
"the way.\""
msgstr "\"슬퍼하지마. 운명이 너를 힘들게 하면 즐겁게 받아들여. 네 인생은 끝으로 가는 여정이니 하루하루가 그 끝으로 가는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_98337_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "c38281c6-1126-460f-b06e-6fef16a5648c"
msgid ""
"\"Th-th-thank you!\" {n}Waine's teeth are still chattering, but he seems to "
"be focusing better.{/n} \"Never run like that in my life. Now I see you "
"scared me on purpose, making run for my life to make it to the road.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고.고맙습니다!\" {n}웨인의 이빨은 여전히 요란하게 부딪히는 소리를 내지만 정신을 차려가는듯 보입니다.{/n} \"살면서 이렇게 "
"뛰어 본 적은 없었어요. 이제야 알것같네요. 제가 목숨 걸고 길까지 달리도록 일부러 겁을 잔뜩 준거라는걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_99127_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "47fe2b5e-8abb-4a01-9c0f-9aa80cafcf84"
msgid ""
"\"He and his senses have definitely parted ways.\" {n}Jubilost nods, then "
"glances at Amiri.{/n} \"And we have too many halfwits in our little band "
"already. I'm afraid our Madcap Inn has no room for another.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 미친게 분명해.\" {n}주빌로스트는 고개를 끄덕이며 아미리를 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"우리 동료도 많지 않은데 미친 녀석이 너무 "
"많은 것 같아. 우리 미친놈 모임에 다른 녀석의 자리가 없을까 겁나는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_99607_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "9fcee094-77e8-475e-baa1-65b466aebc09"
msgid ""
"\"HE-e-e-e-elp!\" {n}The man's scream subsides as he finally notices your "
"presence.{/n}"
msgstr "\"도와줘!\" {n}남자가 당신을 알아차리고는 비명을 멈추기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_99608_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "de29767a-dc41-4786-ac3c-94548a2bfcb0"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri freezes, stunned, then spits on the ground and turns away "
"herself.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 얼어 붙어서 멍해지고는 땅에 침을 뱉고 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/Cue_99609_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "cbe186e7-6d11-4662-8928-c78d5dabcc32"
msgid "\"Thank you for trusting me. I can get through to him, you'll see.\""
msgstr "\"믿어줘서 고마워요. 제가 그를 데리고 나갈게요. 지켜봐주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/ScaredTrader/ScaredTrader_BackToRoadIntimidationFail_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : ScaredTrader
msgctxt "1632807e-39b1-46f5-8290-0f02decc2edf"
msgid ""
"{n}Waine jumps up and breaks into a sprint, headed straight toward the "
"woods.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}웨인은 뛰어올라 숲쪽으로 곧장 달려갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Barks/CauldronWithStew_String
msgctxt "bf884f7d-1608-478f-88a5-ded8f0321ae4"
msgid ""
"It'd be better to not ascertain what — or whom — this stew is made of..."
msgstr "이 스튜가 무엇으로 만들어졌는지는 확인하지 않는 것이 나을 것입니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Barks/DeadAnimal_String
msgctxt "e8244ce7-cc9a-491a-b153-0db5b849bb6a"
msgid "The room is filled with the sickening stench of carrion."
msgstr "방은 썩은 냄새가 나는 악취로 가득 차있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Barks/PileOfTrash_String
msgctxt "a8417cb1-f892-4160-b2b7-5c21dc60f04a"
msgid ""
"The loot, taken from neighboring villages, is piled here in a heap of trash."
msgstr "이웃 마을에서 가져온 전리품이 여기 쓰레기 더미에 쌓여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Barks/PuzzleResolved_String
msgctxt "63925e6f-8b01-4767-b47b-95712c16748e"
msgid "A distinct click is audible from somewhere beneath the floor."
msgstr "바닥 아래 어딘가에서 딸깍하는 소리가 뚜렷하게 들립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Barks/StoneRubble01_String
msgctxt "5d2fab25-e85e-4989-ad2e-e8e0384c2aa7"
msgid "Solid dwarven masonry couldn't stand against troll rage."
msgstr "단단한 드워프 벽돌은 트롤의 분노를 견디지 못했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Barks/StoneRubble02_String
msgctxt "7eb649c4-73b3-43e6-97ec-a71ff3574c63"
msgid "The trolls vented their anger against dwarves on their creations."
msgstr "트롤들은 그 창조물을 만든 드워프들에게 분노했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_04430_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "82a2596c-1174-4d2b-99a0-e9dcc4479cfe"
msgid "Tried to heal the dying dwarf."
msgstr "죽어가는 드워프를 치료하려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_04430_Text
msgctxt "e2afe49e-7054-49a2-ba3f-93b735818899"
msgid "[Heal the dwarf] \"We'll try to heal him!\""
msgstr "[드워프를 치료합니다] \"그를 치료하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_31600_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e4838ef7-47fe-4d83-a27b-2bd820aa12f7"
msgid "Tried to heal the dying dwarf once again."
msgstr "죽어가는 드워프를 다시 치료하려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_31600_Text
msgctxt "bffbebbb-08a5-4772-98f5-f9525601a915"
msgid "[Try to heal the dwarf again]"
msgstr "[드워프를 다시 치료합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_36115_Text
msgctxt "bca3ef8c-1324-4a89-bd2c-ed28dcc0da57"
msgid "[Examine the dying dwarf]"
msgstr "[죽어가는 드워프를 살핍니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_60667_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "31ef60a4-5345-476d-9390-f6289f5a180f"
msgid "Ended the dying dwarf's suffering."
msgstr "죽어가는 드워프의 고통을 끊어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_60667_Text
msgctxt "1f732f78-73dd-41c7-97fc-1009e4c30fe6"
msgid ""
"[Finish the dwarf off] \"Poor sod has had enough. At least we can release "
"him from his suffering.\""
msgstr "[드워프를 죽입니다] \"불쌍한 녀석. 적어도 고통에서 벗어나게 해주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_66649_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7182d7ff-b367-42c6-8c41-436031887724"
msgid "Finished off the dying dwarf."
msgstr "죽어가는 드워프를 끝장냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_66649_Text
msgctxt "0da8c7a0-8a57-4cc2-afc0-89ed606e0d2c"
msgid "[Finish the dwarf off as quickly as possible]"
msgstr "[가능한 빨리 드워프를 끝장냅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_66826_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "facb8df4-88ee-49e9-a708-89dc574070e0"
msgid "Tried to deal with the dying dwarf."
msgstr "죽어가는 드워프와 대화합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_66826_Text
msgctxt "34e2967d-8fe7-413d-bfc6-04caa7fdef2e"
msgid "\"Stop! We don't want to harm you!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 너를 해치고 싶지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_81346_Text
msgctxt "1e07e517-9aea-4710-a530-e85bf4cd8eeb"
msgid "[Retreat towards the exit] \"Let's run! Hurry before he finishes!\""
msgstr "[출구로 후퇴합니다] \"뛰자! 그가 끝내기 전에 서두르자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_94410_Text
msgctxt "8f54ab57-9016-4a19-bd87-356df65f5564"
msgid "\"Somebody do something!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 뭔가 좀 해 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_99390_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2ef7e572-3d0b-4df5-a2b5-06c2c779cd90"
msgid "Left the wounded dwarf to die alone."
msgstr "상처 입은 드워프를 두어 혼자서 죽게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Answer_99390_Text
msgctxt "4600de31-964f-4fb1-8a98-c2ecea996e26"
msgid ""
"[Leave the dwarf to die] \"We have no obligation to him. No need to get my "
"hands dirty. Let's leave this place.\""
msgstr "[드워프가 죽게 내버려둡니다] \"우리에게는 그에게 아무런 의무도 없다. 내 손을 더럽힐 필요가 없어. 이 곳을 떠나자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Bless_Text
msgctxt "160b5412-8d9f-4cdf-8ecd-e6ef3476f46a"
msgid ""
"{n}This last effort seems to be too much for the dying dwarf. Having "
"finished, he drops his limp hand, draws one last breath and falls silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 마지막 노력은 죽어가는 드워프에게는 너무 힘겨운 것 같습니다. 그걸 끝내자 그는 팔다리가 쳐져서 마지막 숨을 내쉬고는 "
"침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_01984_Text
msgctxt "0766ad8d-af8e-4891-966c-4473df3a130f"
msgid ""
"{n}You turn away to run away as quickly as possible — out of here, to "
"another room, anywhere to be far away from this dwarf and his curse. But the "
"darkness engulfs you, the floor trembles again. You stumble and fall, "
"crushed to the ground by the dwarf's heavy, unfamiliar words.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 등을 돌려 이곳을 빠져나가 이 드워프와 그의 저주를 피할 수 있는 다른 방으로 가능한 빨리 도망칩니다. 하지만 어둠이 당신을 "
"삼키고 바닥은 다시 진동합니다. 드워프의 무겁고 익숙하지 않은 단어를 듣고는 당신은 비틀거리며 넘어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_05377_Text
msgctxt "ddb880df-16e8-43f0-8e49-171093f02dd6"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a pile of mutilated bodies, reaching nearly to the ceiling. The "
"bodies used to be humans, dwarves, cows, sheep and gods-know-what-else. Some "
"corpses look fresh, others have already started to decompose, filling the "
"passage with a heavy, sickening stench. The trolls probably use this corner "
"as a meat storage.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 거의 천장까지 닿아있는 절단된 시체 더미를 봅니다. 시체는 인간, 드워프, 소, 양, 신 만이 그 정체를 알 무엇의 "
"것입니다. 어떤 시체는 신선해 보이고 다른 시체는 이미 썩기 시작하여 악취가 납니다. 트롤들은 아마도 이 구석을 육류 창고로 사용한 것 "
"같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_12015_Text
msgctxt "0c500938-a16c-4cd2-ad1f-3f5ef6f78381"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf definitely looks like he will not make it. He has lost a lot of "
"blood, and his horrible wounds would have killed any other person long ago. "
"The fact that he still clings to life is either a miracle, or his own "
"unthinkable stubbornness.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프는 분명히 살 것 같지 않습니다. 그는 많은 피를 흘렸고 그의 끔찍한 상처는 다른 사람이라면 오래 전에 죽었을 것입니다. 그가 "
"여전히 삶에 매달리고 있다는 사실은 기적이거나 상상도 할 수 없는 고집입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_12130_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d55c81b1-6bde-4440-a368-891a3bf2c5bf"
msgid ""
"{n}Your hesitation is ended by the whoosh of a falling sword. The dwarf's "
"voice cuts off abruptly. Amiri cleans the blade of her sword with a rag and "
"throws a discontented glance towards you.{/n} \"Why did you wait? Stood "
"there with your trap wide open... witchcraft could get in!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 칼을 휘두르는 소리를 듣고 나서 끝납니다. 드워프의 목소리가 갑자기 끊어집니다. 아미리는 검의 날을 넝마로 닦고는 당신에게 "
"불만스러운 눈빛을 보냅니다.{/n} \"왜 기다렸어? 너의 함정이 아직 저기 있는데... 마법이 걸릴 수 있었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_13909_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9ecc38c9-60ab-48ef-9c9d-d45cbce4102d"
msgid ""
"\"Poor man!\" {n}Octavia wrings her hands in compassion.{/n} \"I'm afraid "
"our magic can't help him anymore. We should-\" {n}She swallows a lump in her "
"throat.{/n} \"-put him out of his misery.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불쌍한 사람!\" {n}옥타비아는 연민으로 양 손을 맞잡습니다.{/n} \" 안타깝지만 우리의 마법은 이제 이 사람을 구할 수 없어. "
"우리는...\" {n}그녀는 침을 꿀꺽 삼킵니다.{/n} \"고통을 끝내줘야 해\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_23715_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b5cd48a5-56e7-415c-bd84-d212fd3f2bdb"
msgid ""
"\"Let us grant the gift of a quick death to this unfortunate soul, and take "
"revenge to those monsters who made him suffer!\""
msgstr "\"이 불행한 영혼의 고통을 끝내주고 이 고통을 준 괴물들에게 복수해야합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_27942_Text
msgctxt "158aa1b8-cf99-4e40-8b0c-a7254c20fdfc"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf doesn't seem to hear you.{/n} \"Cyril darabosh nadzhak!\" {n}he "
"finishes, and lets out his last breath.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프는 당신 말을 듣지 않는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"시릴 다라 보쉬 나즈 삭!\" {n}그는 그 말을 하고 마지막 호흡을 "
"내쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_33162_Text
msgctxt "5cccfead-b622-4c55-bcf7-e5c6327e91ab"
msgid ""
"{n}You leave the dwarf alone, letting him meet his death in loneliness. Soon "
"he stops moving, but you do not try to find out if he's dead, or just "
"unconscious.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}신은 드워프를 홀로 남겨두고 외로이 죽게 둡니다. 그가 움직이지 않지만 당신은 그가 죽었는지 의식을 잃었는지 알아내려 하지 "
"않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_33971_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0ceec831-9e1c-4ffa-b663-31f52c4e3150"
msgid ""
"\"Let's leave this miserable sufferer alone. He's on the verge of non-"
"existence, so let him make his own last step into oblivion.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 비참한 병자는 혼자 내버려 두세. 곧 이세상 존재가 아니게 될 터인데 망각 속으로 마지막 걸음을 스스로 내딛도록 해야하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_36997_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "40764523-8a24-4f2b-99bd-168707a77476"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun pulls an arrow out of the quiver.{/n} \"Mercy,\" {n}he says, "
"pointing towards the dying dwarf.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 화살통에서 화살을 뽑습니다.{/n} \"자비를 베풀겠다.\" {n}그는 죽어가는 드워프를 가리키며 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_39298_Text
msgctxt "ac340f6b-0513-466b-9258-e6477eae199c"
msgid ""
"{n}You're ready to pass by, but suddenly you notice some weak movement near "
"the edge of the pile. Having a closer look you understand one of the corpses "
"is not exactly a corpse yet. A bare-chested dwarf moves his lips silently, "
"staring blindly at the ceiling. His chest has some bite-marks, left by a "
"huge jaw, and he has no legs — they seem to have been bitten off at the "
"knees.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 지나갈 준비가 되었지만 그 더미 근처에 약한 움직임이 있음을 알게 됩니다. 더 가까이서 보고, 당신은 시체들 중 하나가 아직 "
"살아있다는 사실을 깨달았습니다. 가슴팍이 반쯤 벗겨진 드워프는 천장을 쳐다보며 조용히 입술을 움직입니다. 그의 가슴에는 거대한 턱에 의해 "
"물린 자국이 있고 그의 무릎 밑으로는 다리가 없습니다. 다리를 통째로 씹어 먹힌 듯 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_42608_Text
msgctxt "2442d17a-c07f-4318-af51-f425276537ec"
msgid ""
"{n}Your companions are as scared as you are. While you hesitate, he says{/n} "
"\"Cyril darabosh nadzhak\" {n}and lets out his last breath.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 친구들은 당신 만큼 무서워합니다. 당신이 주저하는 동안 그는 말합니다.{/n} \"시릴 다라 보쉬 나즈 삭\" {n}그리고 "
"그는 마지막 숨을 내쉬었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_44083_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e7dcc5c8-48c6-46d2-a3ca-2a779b7b5ca7"
msgid "\"What is that? What's happening? Stop it immediately, you villain!\""
msgstr "\"저건 뭐지? 무슨 일이 일어난거야? 당장 멈추세요 이 악당같으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_46261_Text
msgctxt "502952b7-cc70-47aa-9560-7a4d993e59a5"
msgid ""
"\"I thought... you were one of them...\" {n}Dwarf coughs out clots of dark "
"blood.{/n} \"I'm... the priest of {g|Torag}Torag{/g}... have been searching "
"this ancient outpost... Found it, it seems...\" {n}He tries to laugh, but "
"instead bursts into a new fit of coughs.{/n} \"Come closer...\" {n}With an "
"immense effort, he raises his hand and whispers words of blessing — so sweet "
"and kind comparing to his prior curses.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 네가 그들 중 하나라고 생각했다...\" {n}드워프는 시커먼 핏덩이를 뱉습니다.{/n} \"나는... "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 사제다... 이 고대 전초 기지를 수색해왔다... 그리고 발견했고... \" {n}그는 웃으려 하지만 대신 "
"기침을 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"더 가까이 와...\" {n}엄청난 노력으로 그는 손을 들고 축복의 말을 속삭였습니다. 이전의 저주에 비해 "
"너무 달콤하고 친절했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_46979_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e2d695ec-fa4f-44ed-af93-a179f5d52c34"
msgid ""
"\"You've had all the fun you wanted, I hope! What are you looking at? Finish "
"him off now, before he's done casting!\""
msgstr "\"하고 싶은 거 다 해라 아주 그냥! 뭐하고 있어? 주문을 다 외우기 전에 얼른 끝장내버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_60935_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "7789e06a-d9b7-4201-9e91-afd0c509328a"
msgid ""
"{n}Your hesitation is ended with the buzz of a flying arrow. The dwarf's "
"voice cuts out abruptly. Ekun puts down his bow and gives you a silent "
"nod.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 망설임은 날아드는 화살 소리와 함께 끝납니다. 드워프의 목소리는 갑자기 끊어집니다. 에쿤은 그의 활을 내려놓고 조용히 "
"끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_73105_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9009d6a4-b547-4fee-bcc9-afc3fc0d6f5b"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim's hands clench at his beard.{/n} \"The ancient dwarven tongue! The "
"curse of {g|Torag}Torag{/g}! Oh {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}, embrace your "
"faithful servant! We all shall die now.\" {n}Harrim's voice is half scared, "
"and half excited.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하림의 손은 그의 수염을 쥡니다.{/n} \"고대 드워프 언어다! {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 저주야! 오. "
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}시여. 당신의 충실한 종을 받아들이십시오! 우리 모두 지금 죽을 거야. \" {n}하림의 목소리는 반은 "
"두려워하고 반은 흥분했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_79122_Text
msgctxt "e15f37b4-627b-48b9-afac-87e8b8cc2f96"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf dies quickly and quietly. You leave his body, hoping his soul "
"will find peace wherever it is now.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}드워프는 신속하고 조용히 죽습니다. 그의 영혼이 평화를 찾을 수 있기를 희망하면서 그의 시체를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_79912_Text
msgctxt "136d2b2c-97e5-4673-8b14-27c017d0f61a"
msgid ""
"{n}As soon as your healing kicks in, the dwarf interrupts his monologue, "
"apparently regaining awareness of his surroundings. He moves his head with "
"an immense effort and looks you up and down.{/n} \"You're… not a troll.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}치유가 시작 되자마자 드워프는 그의 독백을 멈추고 주변을 인식하기 시작합니다. 그는 엄청난 노력으로 머리를 움직이고 당신을 위아래로 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"너는... 트롤이 아니군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_86557_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "46b053a4-cc32-41e6-abb5-31b946ce1539"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia thrashes around in a panic.{/n} \"We should run! Or hide! Shut "
"him up, somebody!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 당황해서 주위를 샅샅이 뒤집니다.{/n} \"우리는 도망가야 해! 아니면 숨던가! 그를 닥치게 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_86955_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b8e98f4d-196a-4130-865f-d20082c9b511"
msgid ""
"{n}Having heard {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} name, Harrim recoils.{/n} \"I need no "
"blessings from the traitor god,\" {n}he whispers into his beard.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 이름을 듣고 하림은 움찔합니다.{/n} \"나는 배신자 신으로부터 축복은 필요 없다.\" {n}그가 "
"속삭입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_87528_Text
msgctxt "df677e95-6c60-4ede-80df-367394d3fd36"
msgid ""
"{n}Your healing efforts have an effect of sorts. The dwarf seems to come "
"halfway to life and starts talking in an unknown language.{/n} \"Karadash "
"kramr dug gadalon.\" {n}The light around you grows dim all of a sudden, and "
"the floor starts to tremble, resonating with the dwarf's voice.{/n} \"Uzmar "
"cyril nadzhak!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}치료하려는 당신의 노력은 효과가 있습니다. 드워프는 반 쯤 살아났고 알 수 없는 언어로 중얼거리기 시작합니다.{/n} \"카라다시 "
"크람이 가다 론.\" {n}갑자기 주위의 불빛이 희미해지고 바닥이 떨리고 드워프의 목소리와 공명합니다.{/n} \"우즈말 사릴 나드작!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_90758_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9358ce7c-1985-4895-9c91-19c014a25576"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri grunts in disapproval, caressing the hilt of her sword.{/n} \"It "
"feels wrong to finish him off! He fights death itself, this battle is his.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 불만에 사로잡혀 칼 손잡이를 만지작거립니다.{/n} \"그를 끝내는 것은 잘못되었어! 죽음을 이겨내려고 싸우고 있어. "
"자신만의 싸움을 하는 중이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_99455_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a9c61115-b3d7-4b37-a310-aebba097af4d"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun exhales loudly and nods.{/n} \"Right choice. It's tough, but it's "
"right.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 한숨을 크게 쉬고 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"옳은 선택이다. 힘들지만 맞다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_99456_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ad1fbb51-9bfa-404d-9a99-d01f22fea5ff"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian examines the poor fellow carefully.{/n} \"Difficult.\" {n}The "
"priest whispers faintly.{/n} \"A single healing spell will not be enough.\" "
"{n}He casts a meaningful glance at you.{/n} \"But that is no reason not to "
"try.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 그 불쌍한 친구를 주의깊게 조사합니다.{/n} \"어려워.\" {n}사제는 희미하게 속삭입니다.{/n} \"단일 치유 "
"주문으로는 충분하지 않아.\" {n}그는 당신에게 의미심장한 눈빛을 던집니다.{/n} \"그러나 시도하지 않을 이유가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_99457_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "48e3711f-5b50-4cea-a890-3d538cb5ae33"
msgid ""
"{n}Heedless of the dwarf's words, Tristian reaches out to him and chants a "
"healing spell.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}드워프의 말에 상관없이 트리스티안은 그에게 손을 뻗어 치유 주문을 외칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_99458_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "845dcc33-8d43-4758-ac39-b4327efd98be"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian casts a grateful glance at you and steps back to let you speak "
"with the dwarf.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신에게 고맙다는 듯 눈빛을 보내고 당신이 드워프와 이야기할 수 있도록 한발 물러섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Cue_99461_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7f2fbdce-d4f2-4297-9d05-44cf656914a9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you softly, but still with reproach.{/n} \"I wonder, "
"would you turn from one of us with the same disregard, without so much as a "
"quick attempt to alleviate our suffering?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신을 부드러운 눈빛으로 보지만 여전히 비난한다.{/n} \"우리의 고통을 덜어주지 않을 거라면 우리 중 하나를 무시할 "
"거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/Curse_Text
msgctxt "b9f96e33-90e8-44f5-8388-43687449aa99"
msgid ""
"{n}The silence that falls feels unnatural. Your own steps and hastily-"
"muggled cough seem far-away. It has gotten darker, too... or is it just your "
"eyes? After several long moments, the sensations fade, but you feel that the "
"ancient dwarven curse has worked.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}침묵이 부자연스럽습니다. 당신의 발걸음과 입을 가리고 하는 기침이 멀게 느껴집니다. 점점 어두워집니다... 아니면 당신의 눈에만 "
"그런 걸까요? 시간이 지나면서 그 감각은 사라지지만 고대의 드워프 저주가 효과있는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/VS_TrollLair_BloodiedDwarf_WhatToBark
msgctxt "9404a59e-a026-4457-aac3-f4e74f459556"
msgid ""
"The dead dwarf, the priest of Torag. At least he died surrounded by friends —"
" that's all you could do for him."
msgstr "토락의 사제 드워프의 시체입니다. 적어도 그는 친구에 둘러싸여 죽었습니다. 그게 당신이 그를 위해 할 수 있는 전부입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/VS_TrollLair_BloodiedDwarf_WhatToBark_1
msgctxt "ba53965b-0abe-4fee-bdd8-8f00164f56df"
msgid ""
"The mad dwarf who cast an ancient curse on you. He died immediately after "
"that."
msgstr "당신에게 고대의 저주를 건 미친 드워프입니다. 그는 그 직후에 죽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BloodiedDwarf/VS_TrollLair_BloodiedDwarf_WhatToBark_2
msgctxt "1292df93-0366-48b5-b990-68cb873d5ecd"
msgid ""
"This mad dwarf had been trying to cast an ancient curse on you. It's good "
"you managed to stop him."
msgstr "이 미친 드워프는 고대의 저주를 당신에게 걸려고 했습니다. 당신이 그를 막을 수 있어 다행입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Answer_32091_Text
msgctxt "c221a17e-4a65-4284-8d8e-036d6066f323"
msgid ""
"\"The statue was ancient, and easy to break. Don't try to see hidden signs "
"where there aren't any.\""
msgstr "\"조각상은 오래되어서 부서지기 쉬웠어. 아무것도 아닌 물건에 의미를 부여하려 하지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Answer_41730_Text
msgctxt "810c081d-84c3-4035-acba-63f17859eef4"
msgid "[Leave] \"Stop whining. Let's go, we still have a lot to do.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"징징대지 마. 우리는 여전히 해야 할 일이 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Answer_43696_Text
msgctxt "8ae73f3e-d904-44f2-a65f-33413c8c64c4"
msgid "\"It was just an old statue. What Torag has to do with it?\""
msgstr "\"이건 그냥 오래된 조각상이야. 이게 토락과 무슨 상관이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Answer_75398_Text
msgctxt "1b93226f-d26d-486c-a391-1ac56594a687"
msgid ""
"\"You confuse the reason with the consequence. Torag's worshippers left this "
"place. Their faith doesn't empower Torag any more, so he has no need to "
"protect this fortress.\""
msgstr ""
"\"원인과 결과를 혼동하고 있군. 토락의 숭배자들은 이 장소를 떠났어. 그들의 신앙은 더 이상 토락에게 힘을 주지 않아. 그러니 토락은 "
"이 요새를 지킬 필요가 없어\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Answer_87961_Text
msgctxt "95f9fc88-b550-4055-bd5d-70e24c6299b0"
msgid ""
"\"You're only half right. Sure, you can't place your trust in Torag... but "
"you can't trust any of the others, either! They're all the same!\""
msgstr "\"너는 절반만 맞아. 토락을 믿지 않을 수 있지만... 너는 다른 누구도 믿지 않아! 그들은 모두 똑같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Answer_87962_Text
msgctxt "e7600a2a-0c10-4167-9986-4d797656ebd1"
msgid ""
"\"Torag never abandons his children. They left this place, and he followed.\""
msgstr "\"토락은 절대 자신의 아이들을 버리지 않아. 그들은 이곳을 떠났고 그는 따라 갔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_06502 1_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b8558fde-2830-4f0d-958c-489a7ac1bea8"
msgid ""
"\"You've confused the god with the sculpture depicting him,\" {n}Ekun notes "
"calmly, but Harrim doesn't hear him or just doesn't care.{/n}"
msgstr "\"너는 조각과 신을 혼동했다.\" {n}에쿤은 침착하게 말하지만 하림은 그 말을 듣지 않거나 신경 쓰지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_06502 2_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7054553b-e67e-4d45-a5a4-30152e5b3648"
msgid ""
"\"You're wrong, {name}. It's not just any statue. It's a symbol. Faith feeds "
"the gods, just like food nourishes our mortal bodies. And the symbols of "
"faith are the channels through which gods communicate with faithful.\" {n}He "
"grimly looks at the pedestal, where the statue used to stand, but only the "
"stone of Torag's feet remains now.{/n} \"This symbol is destroyed. Therefore "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g} is weak, {name}. If he could protect this place, he "
"wouldn't allow such desolation to happen.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네가 틀렸어. {name}. 이것은 평범한 조각상이 아니야. 그것은 상징이다. 음식이 우리의 몸에 영양을 공급하듯 신앙은 신에게 "
"영양을 공급하지. 그리고 신앙의 상징은 신들과 믿음으로 교감하는 통로이네. \" {n}그는 조각상이 서 있던 자리를 음울하게 바라보지만 "
"지금은 토락의 다리만 남아 있습니다.{/n} \"이 상징은 파괴되었다. {g|Torag}토락{/g}은 약하다. {name}. 그가 이곳을 "
"지킬 수 있다면 이런 황폐한 일은 일어나지 내버려두진 않았을꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_06502 3_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ac5a930f-6bf3-464d-b76a-de0c71a216fb"
msgid ""
"\"You're blind. How could this statue possibly be destroyed, if "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g} was protecting this place? How could dwarves perish here "
"if Torag cared about them?\" {n}Harrim presses his lips together.{/n} \"No, "
"{name}. This whole place is an anthem for oblivion's victory over weakness. "
"The victory {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} won over Torag.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네는 장님이야. {g|Torag}토락{/g}이 이 곳을 보호하고 있다면 어떻게 이 조각상이 파괴 될 수 있지? 토락이 신경을 썼다면 "
"드워프들은 왜 이곳에서 죽음을 당한거지?\" {n}하림은 입술을 지긋이 다뭅니다.{/n} \"아니. {name}. 이 곳 전체가 나약함을 "
"극복한 망각의 승리를 느끼게 하기 위한 장소야. {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}가 토락에게 승리했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_06502 4_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "da11ab59-4cfe-43fb-a91f-9ddae2874fb0"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim opens his mouth to object, but apparently can't find any good "
"arguments. Finally, he gives up on you.{/n} \"You're so blind, {name},\" {n}"
"he says, just to fill the silence, and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 반대하려고 입을 열지만 마땅한 주장이 생각나지 않는 모양입니다. 마침내 그는 당신을 포기합니다.{/n} \"너는 눈이 "
"멀었어. {name}. \" {n}그는 침묵을 깨기 위해 말하고는 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_06502 5_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0a045133-4732-41fb-b92e-09bf4c6a516f"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf turns away from the statue and stalks behind you, staring at "
"the floor.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}드워프는 조각상에서 등을 돌리고 바닥을 보며 당신 뒤를 따라갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_06502 6_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1f0afa6f-beea-4cd9-b779-1e326aaaf2ee"
msgid ""
"{n}You throw a glance towards Ekun, expecting him to stand up for "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g}, but the ranger just shrugs instead.{/n} \"No sense in "
"over-persuading,\" {n}he says, looking at Harrim.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 에쿤이 {g|Torag}토락{/g}을 위해 나설꺼라 생각하고 그를 보지만 레인저는 그저 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"지나친 "
"설득은 의미가 없어.\" {n}그는 말하며 하림을 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_06502_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "540cf770-134c-4415-818a-46e9fa2391f7"
msgid ""
"\"You're weak, {g|Torag}Torag{/g}. Weak and pathetic. How could you, the God "
"of all dwarves, the Great Creator, be knocked down by some meager troll?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 약하다. {g|Torag}토락{/g}. 약하고 애처롭다. 어떻게 드워프의 신이자 창조의 신이 아무개 트롤에게 무너질 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_34526_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b156e4a4-d906-4747-993e-c29926cc5239"
msgid ""
"\"Also, how can the dwarves put their trust in you, you traitor god? How can "
"you protect your people if you're incapable of defending even yourself?\""
msgstr "\"드워프들이 어떻게 자네를 믿겠나, 이 배신자 신아. 자신도 방어할 능력이 없는데 어떻게 너의 백성들을 보호할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_87960_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "77312718-2945-4663-a8ea-cb57fe16d664"
msgid ""
"\"Gods are not pathetic. Those who grovel at their feet and beg for charity, "
"then cry when they receive no crumbs from the divine table, on the other "
"hand...\""
msgstr "\"신은 한심하지 않아. 엎드려 자선을 구하는 사람들은 신들에게 떡고물을 받지 못한다면 울고 말지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_87963_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "30788f99-aed4-4e7c-be23-46c908cc651d"
msgid ""
"\"'Never abandons,' {name}? Never abandons?! You only think that because he "
"has not abandoned you yet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"'결코 포기하지 말라'고, {name}? 결코 포기하지 말라고?! 그가 너를 아직 버리지 않았기 때문에 그리 생각하는게야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/Cue_87964_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "090c90ea-fb73-4c58-a785-09a456e4d7ee"
msgid ""
"\"No, {name}, no... You do not know of what you speak! I fear for your soul. "
"What if your faithless words result in you spending eternity wandering the "
"{g|Boneyard}Boneyard{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. {name}. 아니... 너는 네가 하는 말의 의미를 모르고 있어! 나는 네 정신이 걱정돼. 믿음 없는 너의 말 때문에 "
"{g|Boneyard}뼈무덤{/g}에서 영원히 방황할까봐 말이지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/BrokenStatue/VS_BrokenStatue_WhatToBark
msgctxt "dc93bf98-3feb-432b-9011-8121cc673fb3"
msgid ""
"Once majestic, now the statue of Torag has turned into pile of stones, "
"broken by the troll's blow. Its debris blocks your way, so you'll have to "
"look for some roundabouts."
msgstr "한 때는 장엄했던 토락의 조각상은 트롤의 타격으로 깨진 돌 더미로 변했습니다. 파편이 길을 막아 돌아갈 길을 찾아야 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_01771_Text
msgctxt "ced103ca-7301-42bd-ad6c-f643a3af16c5"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't talk with monsters.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 괴물과 대화하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_44821_Text
msgctxt "860f3419-9437-4841-a650-b8b824460dfa"
msgid "\"I'm guessing you're Hargulka.\""
msgstr "\"난 네가 하굴카라고 생각되는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_58158_Text
msgctxt "afbaf974-be71-4eaf-8bde-2fa31af188aa"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm tired of this. Time to finish you off!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이짓도 지겹군. 너를 끝장 낼 시간이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_58755_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f9b6c0ca-bc26-4a04-8892-38093d6bd54b"
msgid "Tried to negotiate peace with Hargulka."
msgstr "하굴카와 평화 협상을 시도했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_58755_Text
msgctxt "7ce57823-d2af-401f-bb7a-06b486bac807"
msgid ""
"\"You're the king of trolls, I'm the {mf|king|queen} of humans. Let's make "
"peace, as rulers do. Your people won't go near our villages, and in turn, we "
"will leave you be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 트롤의 왕이야. 나는 인간의 통치자이지. 지도자끼리 평화를 이루자. 너희 종족이 우리 마을에 가까이 오지 않는다면 우리도 너희를 "
"떠나겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_60833_Text
msgctxt "c07df84f-0732-4e41-b392-89f23c8ac277"
msgid ""
"\"Acid can still kill you, so you're not truly immortal. Allow me to "
"demonstrate.\""
msgstr "\"산성은 여전히 너를 죽일 수 있어. 그러니 완전한 불멸이라 할 수 없지. 내가 한번 시험해 봐도 될까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_63087_Text
msgctxt "6abac088-9101-462c-a264-93d25ed8a6f4"
msgid "\"I'd say this conversation is pointless and I'd rather leave.\""
msgstr "\"이 대화는 무의미하다고 말하고 차라리 여길 떠나겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_72490_Text
msgctxt "ef17816d-47b3-4448-952d-ed0b6b379e49"
msgid "\"Your common is exceptional.\""
msgstr "\"너희 종족은 뭔가 다른거 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_73075_Text
msgctxt "210d97a0-fc9c-492e-90f7-370e1cb902e4"
msgid "\"We just lost our way. We'll take our leave.\""
msgstr "\"방금 길을 잃었어. 우리는 떠날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_92836_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "312ac379-8edd-4f12-8e70-a74ed5361bc0"
msgid "Promised the trolls swift justice."
msgstr "트롤에게 신속한 정의의 심판을 내린다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_92836_Text
msgctxt "52711050-5f2a-4573-bc84-a622805d9da6"
msgid "\"We'll end both you and your hideous kingdom, monster!\""
msgstr "\"우린 너와 너의 끔찍한 왕국 모두 끝장내러 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Answer_95799_Text
msgctxt "b4368416-70e7-4021-8494-49759a101e81"
msgid "[Stare him up and down with contempt]"
msgstr "[멸시하듯 그를 위아래로 훑습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_00913_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "c716bb11-9de7-4929-8868-c708aeb728c5"
msgid ""
"{n}Several trolls step back in fear, but a menacing growl from Hargulka "
"makes them freeze.{/n} \"Trolls can be killed with acid, true. But humans "
"can be killed with acid, fire, steel, wood, stone, or fist. Compared to "
"humans, trolls are immortal!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}몇몇 트롤들은 두려움에 물러났지만 하굴카의 위협적인 울부짖음이 그들을 얼게 합니다.{/n} \"트롤은 산성으로 죽일 수 있다. "
"하지만 인간은 산, 불, 철, 나무, 돌 또는 주먹으로 죽을 수 있다. 인간과 비교하면 트롤은 불멸의 존재다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_03643_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "b9b719c4-2f28-448e-a565-7697cb3283f3"
msgid ""
"\"Borba silent? Borba ate {mf|his|her} tongue? Such greedy borba! Share your "
"tongue with others, borba. Hargulka wants a bit too.\" {n}He snorts loudly "
"in what might pass for a laugh, and after a moment, the trolls around him "
"join in, seemingly more out of habit than comprehension.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"보바 침묵했냐? 보바 너의 혀 먹었어? 정말 탐욕스러운 보바! 다른 사람들과 말을 공유해라. 보바. 하굴카도 조금은 원해. \" {n}"
"그는 큰 소리로 코웃음을 치고 웃다가 주위의 트롤들도 따라서 웃습니다. 대장을 이해했기 보다는 따라하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_08001_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "524b1f1a-d12b-4879-a9a3-cb67d9c71ec7"
msgid ""
"\"Puny borba comes to troll's home and wants to destroy it? Hargulka wants "
"to see borba try.\" {n}Hargulka grins viciously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"멍청한 보바 트롤의 집으로 와서 파괴하고 싶어? 하굴카는 보바 할 수 있는지 궁금해 한다.\" {n}하굴카는 악랄하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_13377_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "5add1308-da73-4b7b-9379-26093b1f0524"
msgid ""
"\"King Tartuk wants to make deals with borba. King Tartuk teaches us to not "
"eat borba. Hargulka disagrees. Borba sly. Borba not respect trolls, want to "
"fool trolls, make trolls weak. Trolls will not be borba's dogs! Hargulka "
"will conquer you, destroy your homes. Then, Hargulka and Tartuk will start "
"to make deals with you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭 왕이 보바와 거래하기를 원한다. 타툭 왕은 우리에게 보바 먹지 말라고 가르쳤다. 하굴카는 동의하지 않았다. 보바는 죽인다. "
"보바는 트롤 존중하지 않고 트롤 속이고 약하게 만든다. 트롤은 보바의 개가 되지 않을 거다! 하굴카가 너를 정복하고 너의 집을 파괴할 "
"것이다. 그러면 하굴카와 타툭은 너와 거래할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_22214_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "54ef0558-23b6-4b34-bcd9-2ade8d3ddebc"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, guests. You are standing on the threshold of the castle of Hargulka, "
"the troll king.\" {n}Each word comes out as a rasp, like steel dragged "
"across stone.{/n} \"King Hargulka not invited you, borba.\" {n}The trolls "
"surrounding him stare at you silently, hate in their eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아, 손님이군. 너는 트롤 왕 하굴카 성에 왔다.\" {n}각 단어는 철로 돌을 긁는 것처럼 들립니다.{/n} \"하굴카 왕이 너를 "
"초대하지 않았다. 보바.\" {n}그를 둘러싼 트롤들은 당신을 조용히 응시하고 그들의 눈에는 증오가 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_30124_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "f507f7c6-3c1c-419e-9239-79e482af335b"
msgid ""
"\"You not leave this place, dumb borba. Should not have come.\" {n}He rubs "
"the half-worn brand mark on his chest.{/n} \"Hargulka needs to prepare, "
"though. Find Hargulka later, if you can, stranger. Dur borba! Dur garban "
"dzarg!\" {n}Hargulka pounds the {g|Torag}Torag{/g} statue with his fist and "
"leaps into the side hallway.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"너 여기서 계속 안떠난다. 멍청한 보바. 여기 오지 말았어야한다.\" {n}그는 가슴에 반쯤 닳은 문양을 문지릅니다.{/n} "
"\"그렇다면 하굴카는 준비가 필요하다. 나중에 하굴카를 찾아와라. 두르 보바! 도르 가르반 드자그!\" {n}하굴카는 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 조각상을 주먹으로 쾅 때리고는 복도로 뛰어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_65848_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "c9bbc539-2697-48d8-9764-ee5ad0df7938"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka snorts and snuffles, evidently making fun of your attempt to "
"intimidate him.{/n} \"Trolls can be killed with acid, true. But humans can "
"be killed with acid, fire, steel, wood, stone, or fist. Compared to humans, "
"trolls are immortal!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 코웃음치고는 코를 킁킁거리는데 분명히 위협하려는 당신의 시도를 비웃으려는 것이었습니다.{/n} \"트롤은 산성으로 죽일 수 "
"있다. 하지만 인간은 산, 불, 철, 나무, 돌 또는 주먹으로 죽을 수 있다. 인간에 비하면 트롤은 불멸의 존재다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_67237_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "6cab454b-a0a5-48dc-8ea3-b39f57168719"
msgid ""
"\"You surprised King Hargulka is smart? Trolls were dumb and cowardly "
"before... but not anymore.\" {n}Hargulka grins viciously.{/n}"
msgstr "\"왕 하굴카가 똑똑해서 놀랐나? 트롤은 멍청하고 겁쟁이였지만... 지금은 아니다.\" {n}하굴카는 악랄하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_69527_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "45ad88a6-86ed-4cf7-84b7-f2cdc6e1956a"
msgid ""
"\"{d|Tartuk}Tartuk{/d} the kobold king made trolls immortal, taught us to "
"talk with borba. Now trolls are smarter than borba, stronger than borba, "
"better than borba!\" {n}Hargulka straightens up and looms over you, flexing "
"his shoulders.{/n} \"What you say, borba? What you say now, when trolls are "
"better than you?\""
msgstr ""
"\" {d|Tartuk} 타르 투크 {/d} 코볼트 왕은 트롤을 불멸로 만들었고 우리에게 보바와 이야기하는 것을 가르쳤다. 이제 트롤은 "
"보바보다 더 똑똑하고 강하고 더 낫다!\" {n}하굴카는 몸을 펴고 어깨를 풀며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"뭐라고 말할 거냐. 보바? "
"트롤이 너보다 낫다면 뭐라고 말할 거냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_70319_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "bdfe7abf-f36d-4a3d-92ba-b6cb134b9f31"
msgid ""
"\"You guess yourself? Or you have help? No, not yourself. King Hargulka gave "
"you hint. Smart borba. So smart.\" {n}Hargulka grins viciously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"혼자 생각한 거냐? 도움을 받았나? 혼자서는 아니겠지. 하굴카 왕이 힌트를 준거다. 똑똑한 보바. 똑똑하다.\" {n}하굴카는 "
"악랄하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_80479_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "faf9fdcd-1d8f-4dc3-a31d-0393c5b2e4c5"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll stands at ease beside the base of a huge fractured "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g} statue. He's not the biggest or scariest among the other "
"trolls, but there's an odd supremacy in his moves and in his eyes. Supremacy "
"both over his kin and over you. The brand mark on his pelt is almost worn "
"off. It pulses weakly in unison with his heartbeat.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}한 트롤은 {g|Torag}토락{/g}의 부서진 조각상 앞에 느긋히 서있습니다. 그는 트롤들 중에서 가장 크거나 무섭지는 않지만 "
"그의 움직임과 눈빛에는 이상한 위압감이 있습니다. 그 위압감은 당신뿐 아니라 그의 동료들도 느껴하는듯합니다. 그의 살가죽에 새겨진 문양은 "
"거의 닳아 없어졌습니다. 문양은 그의 심장 박동과 함께 약하게 진동하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_85672_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "834ae024-db25-48a3-be47-55665c443d4b"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll's ugly face grows uglier, contorting with contempt.{/n} \"Borba "
"calls troll 'monster,' but attacks first. King Tartuk wants to make deals "
"with borba, stop trolls from eating borba. But how can King Hargulka make "
"deals with monsters?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤의 못생긴 얼굴은 더욱 흉해지고 경멸로 뒤틀립니다.{/n} \"보바는 트롤을 괴물이라 부르지만 보바가 먼저 공격한다. 타툭 왕은 "
"보바와 거래하기를 원하고 트롤이 보바 먹지 않기를 원한다. 하지만 어떻게 하굴카 왕이 괴물과 거래를 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_97478_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "e9bd260f-2e9a-4ebe-bc42-f015e4de0387"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll's ugly face grows uglier, contorting with contempt.{/n} \"Weak, "
"coward borba. King Tartuk wants to make deals with borba, stop trolls from "
"eating borba. But why would King Hargulka want to make deals with weaklings?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤의 못생긴 얼굴은 더욱 흉해지고 경멸로 뒤틀립니다.{/n} \"약한 겁쟁이 보바. 타툭 왕은 보바와 거래하고 트롤이 보바 먹지 "
"않기를 원한다. 하지만 왜 하굴카 왕이 약한 녀석과 거래를 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_98897_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "75702726-ea97-4fb9-bea0-f6c62d7eaeeb"
msgid ""
"\"Odd business, trying to intimidate a troll. We ARE food for them. Imagine "
"if something you eat, let's say a chicken, attempted to intimidate you. "
"Would you take its threats seriously?\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤을 협박하려 하다니 이상한 협상을 다 보겠네. 우린 놈들한테는 음식이야. 네가 닭을 먹는다고 하는데 닭이 너를 위협한다고 생각해 "
"봐라. 진지하게 받아들일 거냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_98902_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "81a5654d-151e-4641-be4d-604a391d1a05"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun glares at the trolls around you, his eyes narrowed.{/n} \"No good "
"comes of talking with monsters. We came for their heads, not their words.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 당신 주위의 트롤을 노려보면서 눈을 가늘게 뜹니다.{/n} \"괴물과 이야기하는 것은 좋은 일이 아니다. 우리는 그들의 "
"머리를 가지러 왔지 그들과 말하려고 온 것이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_98903_Text
msgctxt "56559ea0-1531-4e28-8c59-ef8876fe47a7"
msgid ""
"{n}Without a word, the troll punches Jazon in the face. Blood splatters "
"against the stone walls and floor.{/n} \"Why brought borba? What your "
"orders? Get out my sight!\" {n}Jazon whimpers and runs away, blood dripping "
"from around the hand he's pressed to his torn face. The troll leader turns "
"to you.{/n} \"Well, since you already here... Welcome to castle of Hargulka, "
"king of trolls! What you hope to find here besides death, borba?\" {n}The "
"glares of the other trolls drill into you, silent and hateful.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}한 마디도 없이 트롤은 재즌의 얼굴에 주먹을 꽂습니다. 피가 돌벽과 바닥에 튑니다.{/n} \"왜 보바를 데려왔냐? 네가 받은 "
"명령은 뭐였지? 내 눈에서 사라져!\" {n}재즌은 훌쩍이며 도망가는데 얼굴을 막은 그의 손에 피가 흐릅니다. 트롤 지도자가 당신을 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"글쎄 네가 여기 왔으니... 트롤 왕 하굴카의 성에 온 것을 환영한다. 죽음 말고 여기에서 무엇을 찾기를 원하지. "
"보바?\" {n}다른 트롤들의 눈빛이 당신을 향하고 침묵과 증오가 가득합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_98904_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "b7cf9adb-3f98-4c55-891f-ddd8f62e34c8"
msgid ""
"\"You 'invited' us when your trolls started attacking peaceful villages.\""
msgstr "\"트롤이 평화로운 마을을 공격하기 시작했을 때 네가 우리를 초대했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Hargulka_FirstMeet/Cue_HargulkaFirstMeet_Start_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "197e5f9d-63b7-48ae-bee8-c915b7203d4d"
msgid ""
"{n}A howling crowd of trolls waits by the entrance of an ancient dwarven "
"fortress. They growl, pound the stone floor with their fists and clubs, and "
"spit curses at you. Each sound is magnified, hammering the walls like a "
"drum. Despite this display, however, the trolls do not attack, as if "
"awaiting a command — or permission.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}울부짖는 트롤들이 고대 드워프 요새의 입구에서 기다립니다. 그들은 으르렁거리고 주먹과 몽둥이로 돌 바닥을 찧고 저주를 내뱉습니다. "
"소리가 확대되어 드럼처럼 벽을 두들깁니다. 하지만 트롤들은 명령을 기다리는 듯 공격 하진 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Items/DiaryDwarf_String
msgctxt "ddff1667-618d-4fd4-9f98-0a91945a123c"
msgid ""
"The tome is made of a high-quality parchment and bound in a good leather, "
"but it's torn apart and stained with mud. Most of the pages are missing. "
"There is an inscription on the inner part of the cover, written by a steady "
"hand: \"This journal belongs to Rodvig Langebukk, the Fourth Commandant of "
"the Bronzeshield Fortress\".\n"
"\"Erastus 4498\n"
"Today my father, Unthal Langebukk, has handed me the command over the "
"Bronzeshield Fortress and headed home to the Five Kings Mountains. He said "
"he's become too old and hoped to die in his old place, in his homeland "
"mines, not in this Torag-forgotten land. He's left his post, and many of the "
"defenders disapproved, but as for me — I don't blame him. I gave him my last "
"farewells and returned to the Fortress which is mine from now on.\n"
"Lamashan 4498\n"
"Lots of carts on the road. They carry grains, vegetables, meat. Lamashan is "
"a good month: tolls this month always bring good profits, even when the year "
"is poor. Too bad that's not enough to compensate for everything we spend on "
"food during the other months, otherwise we could make the annual balance "
"zero, at least. The Road of Shields has made us bankrupt. For three hundred "
"years now, our three clans have been guarding human lives at our own expense."
"\n"
"Kuthona 4498\n"
"Even the winter is not a real winter in this god-forsaken land. When was the "
"last time I saw the snow? I mean real snow, like home, in the Five Kings "
"Mountains. Not this pathetic excuse for snow which falls here from time to "
"time. Local villagers could have gathered four harvests this year if they "
"weren't so lazy and worked a trifle harder.\n"
"The winter is too weak in River Kingdoms! Damned rivers don't freeze hard "
"enough for our road to be able to compete with them as the best trade route. "
"What was King Talhrik thinking when he ordered the construction of an "
"overland road in a place called the \"River Kingdoms\"? Well, maybe he "
"thought of fame for the dwarven people, dreaming of regaining our former "
"glory. Maybe he hoped that the locals would abandon river routes, infested "
"by pirates, for the safety of our track, with its fortresses and watchtowers."
"\n"
"At least I know for sure what our grandfathers and fathers were thinking: "
"that too many resources and too much effort had already been invested in "
"this road to just abandon the project. They were hoping something would "
"change and the gold would flow to our pockets in steady streams, just like "
"King Talhrik had promised. So, they just went on spending our money, "
"efforts, years… And lives.\n"
"Abadius 4499\n"
"Dwarves are patient, but there is a limit to every patience. The treasury of "
"the Langebukk clan is almost empty – and I know for sure that the Woradashes "
"and Skjegges are doing no better than we are. It's ridiculous and bitter to "
"recollect, that while building this fortress our ancestors had made several "
"secret rooms to store the future immeasurable treasures! It's impossible to "
"deny it: we are the last generation of the Road Shields. If some wonder "
"fails to happen in the near future, we'll have to return to the Five Kings "
"Mountains in shame.\n"
"Pharast 4499\n"
"Disturbing news comes from Rostland: hordes of barbarians plunder its lands. "
"The Swordlords beg for help no one is able to give them. We scarcely have "
"enough resources to keep garrisons at the fortresses. If Rostland falls – "
"what happens to the trade? Who in the whole world will need the Shield Road?"
"\"\n"
"The rest of the pages are missing."
msgstr ""
"그 책은 양질의 양피지로 만들어졌으며 좋은 가죽으로 묶여있습니다. 그러나 그것은 찢겨져 진흙으로 얼룩져있습니다. 대부분의 페이지가 "
"누락되었습니다. 책 겉면의 안에는 뭉툭한 글씨체로 쓰여있습니다. \"이 저널은 청동 방패 요새의 제 4 지휘관인 로드빅 랑게북크의 것이다."
"\"\n"
"\"에라스투스 4498\n"
"오늘은 나의 아버지, 운트알 랑게북크가 나에게 청동 방패 요새의 명령권을 넘겨주었고 고향인 다섯 왕의 산맥으로 돌아가셨다. 그는 자신이 "
"너무 늙었으며, 토락의 잊혀진 땅이 아닌 자신의 고향에서 죽고 싶다고 했다. 그는 자신의 요새를 떠났고, 많은 수비대원들이 나를 "
"비난했지만, 나는 그를 비난하지 않는다. 나는 그에게 마지막 작별 인사를 하고 지금부터 나의 것인 요새로 돌아왔다.\n"
"라마샨 4498\n"
"길에 많은 수레가 있다. 그들은 곡물, 채소, 고기를 나른다. 라마샨은 좋은 달이다. 올해 수익이 형편없더라도, 이 달의 통행료는 항상 "
"짭짤한 이익을 가져온다. 다른 달을 위한 식량을 전부 준비할 수 없었던 것은 나쁜 일이지만, 그렇게 했다면 올해의 잔고는 텅 비었을 "
"것이다. 우리는 방패의 길을 유지하느라 파산했다. 지금까지 삼백 년 동안, 우리 세 부족은 우리의 돈을 써서 인간을 보호했다.\n"
"쿠소나 4498\n"
"신이 버린 이 땅에서는 겨울조차 진정한 겨울이 아니다. 내가 눈을 마지막으로 본 것은 언제였지? 고향인 다섯 왕의 산맥에 내리는 것 같은 "
"진짜 눈 말이다.가끔 떨어지는 이런 한심한 눈 말고. 그들이 게으름 피우지 않고 세 배 정도 더 열심히 일한다면, 지역 거주민들은 4계절 "
"내내 수확물을 모을 수 있었을 텐데.\n"
"강의 왕국들의 겨울은 너무 약하다! 빌어먹을 강은 충분히 얼지를 않아서 최고의 교역로 자리를 두고 경쟁할 능력이 없다. \"강의 "
"왕국들\"이라 불리는 곳에 육상 도로를 만들라는 탈리크 왕의 명령은 대체 뭐지? 음, 아마도 그는 드워프들의 명성을 쌓아 이전의 영광을 "
"되찾고 싶었나 보다. 주민들이 우리가 만든 요새와 감시탑을 사용하기 위해 해적에게 점령당한 강을 따르는 뱃길을 포기하길 바랬는지도.\n"
"최소한 우리 할아버지와 아버지들의 생각은 확신할 수 있다: 이 사업을 그냥 포기하기엔 길을 건설하는데 든 자원과 노력이 너무 많았다. "
"그들은 탈리크 왕이 약속한 대로, 상황이 변하고 금화가 멈추지 않는 강물처럼 우리 주머니로 흘러들어오길 바랐을거다. 그래서, 그들은 "
"우리의 돈과 노동력과 시간을 쓰기 위해 왔다... 그리고 살아간다.\n"
"아바디우스 4499\n"
"드워프들은 참을성이 있다, 그러나 모든 인내심에는 한계가 있다. 랑게북크 일족의 국고는 거의 비었다. 그리고 나는 워라대쉬와 셰게 또한 "
"우리보다 나을게 없다는 것도 확신한다. 이제와서 찾기에는 이상하고 씁쓸한 일이지만, 어쨌든 요새를 짓는 동안 우리 조상들은 미래 가치를 "
"매길 수 없는 보물들을 저장하기 위해 몇 개의 비밀 방을 만들었다! 이 사실은 부인할 수 없다: 우리는 방패의 길의 마지막 세대다. "
"가까운 시일 내로 기적이 일어나지 않는다면, 우리는 수치스럽게 다섯 왕의 산맥으로 돌아가야 할 것이다.\n"
"파라스트 4499\n"
"로스틀랜드에서 좋지 않은 소식이 왔다: 야만인 부족이 이 땅을 약탈했다. 소드로드는 아무도 줄 수 없는 도움을 요청한다. 우리가 가진 "
"자원으로는 요새의 수비대를 유지하는 데만도 벅차다. 로스틀랜드가 망한다면, 무역망은 어떻게 변하지? 이 세상 누구에게 방패의 길이 "
"필요하게 될까?\"\n"
"나머지 페이지가 사라졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_09043_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "273d14c9-dde2-43a5-9dd7-679d22c536a1"
msgid "Praised the kobold painter's work."
msgstr "코볼트 화가가 그린 작품을 칭찬했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_09043_Text
msgctxt "9c6f0a0c-1eb5-428b-aaa3-277c3deba066"
msgid "[Leave] \"All right, go on painting. Lovely picture, by the way.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"좋아. 가서 그려라. 그나저나 그림이 예쁜데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_16151_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6907048d-9bd5-4b5a-8028-881b25deb71c"
msgid "Left the kobold painter alone."
msgstr "코볼트 화가를 혼자 내버려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_16151_Text
msgctxt "9d050a0d-c246-44e8-80c1-590eab33d1fa"
msgid "[Leave] \"Looks like you're busy. I won't bother you anymore.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"바쁜 것 같군. 너를 괴롭히지 않을게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_22777_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "057749cc-dd39-42d3-825d-ee3f6922bf1a"
msgid "Left the kobold painter alone."
msgstr "코볼트 화가를 내버려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_22777_Text
msgctxt "1d8fef53-8033-4e9f-99ef-20ab88e09737"
msgid "[Leave] \"This one doesn't seem aggressive. Let's leave him be.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이 녀석은 공격적인 것 같지 않아. 그를 내버려두자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_49573_Text
msgctxt "f794813f-1c0a-4640-ab18-c26fbc79aa95"
msgid "[Watch the kobold]"
msgstr "[코볼트를 감시합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_67343_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "16ec3052-b4bd-4b9e-bbbd-50c10b0824e4"
msgid "Killed the kobold painter."
msgstr "코볼트 화가를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_67343_Text
msgctxt "c14daff8-14ff-4fc8-825e-27bc33faf19c"
msgid "[Attack] \"Another kobold. Let's kill him quickly and be on our way.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"또 다른 코볼트군. 빨리 죽이고 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_69897_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fffef2fa-34ed-411a-8904-2040e4b55622"
msgid "Left the kobold painter alone."
msgstr "코볼트 화가를 내버려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_69897_Text
msgctxt "f86f3530-2254-4a44-9c97-e566fc35b877"
msgid "[Leave] \"This one doesn't seem aggressive. Let's leave him be.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이 녀석은 공격적인 것 같지 않아. 그를 내버려두자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_77171_Text
msgctxt "a0f0fbd9-2339-4aa0-9be0-036877c51087"
msgid "\"Ahem... can you hear me?\""
msgstr "\"에헴... 내 말 들려?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_80995_Text
msgctxt "2765094b-e35a-4ebc-9deb-65151f98014b"
msgid "\"Can you tell me about Tartuk?\""
msgstr "\"타툭에 대해 말해 줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_83184_Text
msgctxt "e02d650c-e8c9-41aa-b4f4-736a0e581cc4"
msgid "\"How can I find Tartuk?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 타툭을 찾을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_85921_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c952f603-7192-4ea2-819d-f97c92005542"
msgid "Killed the kobold painter."
msgstr "코볼트 화가를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_85921_Text
msgctxt "7e4c026d-ab51-4c71-a9a1-ef90e8f587d0"
msgid "[Attack] \"Let's kill this one quickly and be on our way.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이 녀석을 빨리 죽이고 갈 길 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_86292_Text
msgctxt "5cb80aae-89cc-48e4-ac48-ce1765b79e11"
msgid "\"Hey! Can you hear me?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 내 말 들리나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_96989_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3f1d5c1d-53f9-45f0-aabd-056ea230ccd0"
msgid "Killed the kobold painter."
msgstr "코볼트 화가를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_96989_Text
msgctxt "f642b658-1ebb-4d35-832c-dc7e28aff0bd"
msgid "[Attack] \"Another kobold. Let's kill him quickly and be on our way.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"또 다른 코볼트군. 빨리 죽이고 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_99362_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f3508d08-1bc2-44ef-beb1-b8e126196566"
msgid "Praised the kobold painter's work in Shelyn's name."
msgstr "셸린의 이름으로 코볼트 화가가 그린 작품을 칭찬했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Answer_99362_Text
msgctxt "d28f7cc8-2b85-4d23-b5cd-f9f36174c42e"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"Shelyn blesses all art, even when it's so... fragrant. It's nice "
"to see a kobold being so creative!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"셜린은 모든 예술을 축복한다. 심지어 그것이 향기로워도... 코볼트가 독창적인 것을 보는 것도 좋구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_02089_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0a114a0a-629d-439e-931c-74c548af3b0c"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost keeps silent, his cheeks flushed. He throws a dark glance toward "
"the girl.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}주빌로스트는 침묵을 지키고 그의 뺨은 붉어집니다. 그는 소녀를 향해 어두운 시선을 보냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_02288_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldArtist
msgctxt "ecab0e7d-549a-4d04-b54a-843fb15031ac"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold continues with his strokes. He doesn't seem to have noticed "
"you, or perhaps he's just too lost in his work.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 계속 붓질을 합니다. 그는 당신을 알아차리지 못했거나 아마 자신의 작품에 너무나 몰두한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_25907_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e05b1299-08a9-4265-8a77-487393a2cc68"
msgid ""
"\"Back when I was a slave, I would sometimes see my masters behave like "
"this. It seemed to happen after inhaling some kind of drug. The same slow "
"movements, incoherent muttering, drooling...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 노예 였을 때 나는 때때로 내 주인이 이런 행동을 하는 것을 보았어. 무슨 약을 하고 하는 짓 같았지. 움직임은 느렸고 아무 "
"말이나 하고 침을 흘리고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_29807_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4753c5c2-767b-4965-beff-ca4b6510dc96"
msgid "\"That sounds awful. Please accept my condolences and sympathy.\""
msgstr "\"끔찍하군. 그가 불쌍해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_29916_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3ec4be8e-c6bc-4875-9cda-35a836df142c"
msgid ""
"\"This 'Tartuk' again! It's like he's everywhere! I'm sick of hearing that "
"name. I fear I'm developing a conditioned response — every time I hear "
"'Tartuk,' I feel the need to vomit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 다시 타툭이다! 어디에서나 있구나! 그 이름을 듣는 것도 질렸어. 타툭이라는 이름을 들을 때마다 이제 이 반응이 익숙해질까 겁이 "
"나. 토가 나와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_36851_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "efb0f23e-699c-446d-9be5-d2f9c15a3c5e"
msgid ""
"\"Avant-garde at its best!\" {n}Octavia laughs.{/n} \"But, frankly speaking, "
"there were even odder... pieces of art... stored in my masters' galleries.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아방가르드 스타일인데!\" {n}옥타비아가 웃습니다.{/n} \"솔직히 말하면 내 주인의 갤러리에 저장된 예술품은... 더 끔찍한 "
"것들도 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_39567_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldArtist
msgctxt "31becdc3-8804-4937-853a-be7f91e8e241"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems the kobold has told you all he intended to. He shows no reaction "
"to your further questions.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트가 전부 말한 것 같습니다. 그는 당신의 질문에 더 이상 아무런 반응도 보이지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_42449_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldArtist
msgctxt "5f871d62-ba9a-45d3-af56-d2092c464d64"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold continues in a strange state that seems to be somewhere "
"between deep meditation and a trance. He raises his paint-smeared hands to "
"the wall, makes a small and deliberate stroke, then steps back to examine "
"his creation as a whole.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 깊은 명상과 황홀경 사이의 어딘가에 있는 이상한 상태입니다. 그는 붓을 든 손을 벽에 대고 작고 섬세한 붓질을 하고는 한 "
"걸음 물러나 자신의 창조물을 감상합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_44232_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "dae6495b-d820-414c-90c2-1d523d998022"
msgid ""
"\"What is that? 'Fine art' as performed by kobolds?\" {n}Valerie wrinkles "
"her nose in disgust.{/n} \"In the Order of {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, I was "
"taught that all art is precious. But what would my mentors say were they "
"here to see THIS? Feh.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 뭡니까? 코볼트가 만든 작품이라고요?\" {n}발레리는 찡그려 코에 주름이 생깁니다.{/n} \"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 "
"명으로 나는 모든 진귀한 예술을 배웠습니다. 하지만 내 멘토가 이걸 보면 뭐라고 할까요? 흥.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_46992_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldArtist
msgctxt "153e86f7-2826-4a86-a08a-14c27b08de90"
msgid ""
"{n}The unintelligible smears gradually resolve into a crude drawing of a "
"huge kobold striking a heroic pose. There are many smaller figures "
"surrounding him, but you can't tell who they might be.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}알 수 없는 얼룩은 점점 영웅적인 자세를 취하는 거대한 코볼트의 조잡한 그림으로 변합니다. 그를 둘러싼 많은 작은 그림이 있지만 "
"그것이 누구인지는 말할 수 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_54896_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0acddcd9-609d-44ea-800c-ed181dae961d"
msgid ""
"\"There's no need for that. I actually liked those particular times. At "
"least in that state my masters weren't able to beat me.\""
msgstr "\"그럴 필요 없다. 나는 이런 특별한 시간이 좋아. 최소한 그런 상태에서 내 스승은 나를 이길 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_74055_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldArtist
msgctxt "20b23680-01f9-4f33-9eb3-7ca0122c94be"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold slowly turns to you. You can't read the expression on his "
"snout, but he certainly doesn't seem pleased.{/n} \"Ssshibarizsssa! "
"Kasssadalar Tartuk!\" {n}The kobold points toward his painting.{/n} \"Tartuk!"
"\" {n}he repeats before turning away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트가 천천히 당신에게 향합니다. 그의 주둥이에서 나오는 말과 표정을 읽을 수는 없지만 그는 분명히 기분이 좋지 않습니다.{/n} "
"\"쉬바리즈사! 카싸달라 타툭!\" {n}코볼트는 그의 그림을 가리키고 있습니다.{/n} \"타툭!\" {n}그는 계속해서 그 말을 "
"반복하고는 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_75257_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9001731a-40b8-4b06-a09d-19235bada548"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia bursts into laughter and sticks out her tongue at the gnome.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 웃음을 터뜨리고는 노움에게 혀를 내밀었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_83342_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7e649895-0e26-4f70-b49a-b68c2dc238fb"
msgid "\"Tartuk!\""
msgstr "\"타툭!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_97840_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldArtist
msgctxt "b7cf5efb-0d7c-4153-aef0-6553e71b59ed"
msgid ""
"{n}An odd kobold sits in front of the wall. His scales, snout, and "
"especially hands are covered with something akin to a blend of tar and what "
"seems to be rancid, mud-colored filth. Occasionally the kobold plunges his "
"hand into the clay pot nestled beside him, grabs a handful of \"paint,\" and "
"slowly smears it on the wall.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이상한 코볼트가 벽 앞에 앉아 있습니다. 그의 피부, 주둥이, 특히 손은 썩은 냄새가 나는 것 같은 타르 같은 것으로 덮여 "
"있습니다. 때때로 코볼트는 손을 점토 냄비에 집어 넣고 \"페인트\"를 움켜 잡고 천천히 벽에 묻힙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_99357_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "68ccc001-de54-4453-be0c-a7d12e8771cd"
msgid ""
"\"Judging by the odor, I can tell exactly what the main ingredient in this "
"'paint' is.\""
msgstr "\"냄새를 맡아보니, 원재료가 무엇인지 짐작이 가는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_99358_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldArtist
msgctxt "90ea41b7-106a-49e0-8a61-ccb5502af0db"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold is intently focused in painting his picture on the wall.{/n} "
"\"Tartuk,\" {n}he mumbles under his breath.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 벽에 그림을 그리는 데 열중하고 있습니다.{/n} \"타툭.\" {n}그는 숨을 쉬며 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/KoboldArtist/Cue_99361_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0eeae967-4596-467e-add3-75145088e0f5"
msgid ""
"\"At least it looks better than the paintings king Irovetti awards his "
"prizes to!\""
msgstr "\"적어도 이베로티 왕이 상으로 주는 그림보다는 낫네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Korgadd/Cue_24616_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6cf7461a-3221-4f3b-aaa0-c4d8c20af041"
msgid ""
"{n}The ranger comes closer to the defeated troll and stares at the corpse "
"with contempt. His lips are pressed into a thin line, his fists clench, and "
"his knuckles are white.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}레인저는 패배한 트롤에게 더 가까이 가며 경멸어린 눈빛으로 시체를 응시합니다. 그의 입술은 가느다란 선을 그리고 그의 주먹은 꽉 "
"쥐어져 손이 하얗게 새었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Korgadd/Cue_42845_Text
msgctxt "c3ae474d-19f1-46bc-8b0f-c49a48044b9c"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll utters a hoarse sound and falls thunderously. Dark, sticky "
"blood oozes from his wounds. He tries to raise his hands to defend himself, "
"but is able only to clench his fists. He snaps his jaws in one last effort "
"to devour you. Suddenly, he goes still.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤은 쉰 소리를 내며 곧바로 쓰러집니다. 어둡고 끈적한 피가 그의 상처에서 흘러 나옵니다. 그는 자신을 방어하기 위해 손을 들려고 "
"하지만 주먹을 쥘 뿐입니다. 그는 당신을 삼키려는 마지막 노력으로 자신의 턱을 만집니다. 숨이 곧 끊어졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Korgadd/Cue_55681_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4030ecaa-81b2-4da9-a25b-e7ddc29d5e0e"
msgid ""
"\"Done,\" {n}Ekun repeats quietly, turning to you.{/n} \"Thank you, friend. "
"Your help was priceless.\" {n}He shrugs.{/n} \"From now on, your questions "
"will be answered, if you still want them. You deserve that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"끝났어.\" {n}에쿤은 조용히 반복하여 당신에게로 향합니다.{/n} \"고맙다. 친구. 너의 도움 덕이다.\" {n}그는 어깨를 "
"으쓱합니다.{/n} \"이제부터 질문에 응하겠다. 너는 자격이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Korgadd/Cue_57006_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "d50c9861-8429-49b3-8310-26d28d3ca7eb"
msgid ""
"{n}Without a word, Ekun raises his leg and delivers a great kick into the "
"side of the rock troll. This effort must have been painful for the ranger, "
"but not a single muscle moves in his face. His expression is a frozen mask "
"of rage and suffering, and the pain from the hit fades in comparison.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}말도 하지 않고 에쿤은 다리를 들어올려 바위 트롤의 옆구리에 강한 발차기를 합니다. 레인저에게는 고통스러웠을 것임에 틀림 없지만 "
"얼굴은 꿈적도 움직이지 않습니다. 그의 얼굴은 격렬한 분노와 고통을 보여주고 그 고통은 분노와 비교했을 때 아무것도 아니었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Korgadd/Cue_68601_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "093a0f54-6524-4ac0-a11f-4f5f8e1c6d0d"
msgid ""
"\"Done.\" {n}Ekun sighs, lowering his bow, and you are not sure if he's "
"talking about the troll's death, about his completed vengeance, or about his "
"own mental state. In the dim light it seems to you that Ekun's eyes lose "
"their usual spark. Several wrinkles seem to disappear from his forehead.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"끝났어.\" {n}에쿤은 한숨을 쉬며 그의 활을 내렸고 당신은 그가 트롤의 죽음을 말하는 것인지 자신의 완료된 복수에 대해 말하는 "
"것인지 자신의 기분을 말하는 것인지 알 수 없습니다. 희미한 불빛 속에서 에쿤의 눈은 평소의 불꽃을 잃어버린 것처럼 보입니다. 그의 "
"이마에서 몇 개의 주름이 사라지는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/Korgadd/Cue_85790_Text
msgctxt "a6793068-9d5b-483f-a596-7cefe6e64dea"
msgid ""
"{n}Caught in the direct sunlight, Kargadd freezes. His vile howl turns into "
"a hoarse sound, fading in his throat. His eyes dim, his skin turns to stone. "
"His bestial face is frozen forever in rage and surprise.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}직사광선에 쬐여 카르가드는 얼어 붙습니다. 그의 사악한 울부짖는 소리는 쉰 목소리로 바뀌어 사라집니다. 그의 눈은 희미해지고 그의 "
"피부는 돌로 변합니다. 그의 거친 얼굴은 분노와 놀라움으로 영원히 얼어붙었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_15391_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fa066124-274c-46f1-b876-e7c063a0e55d"
msgid "Killed the troll young."
msgstr "어린 트롤을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_15391_Text
msgctxt "89ffc319-23c7-4e55-9aaa-779136e7940a"
msgid "[Approve Ekun's attack] \"There's no place for trolls in my lands.\""
msgstr "[에쿤의 공격을 허락합니다] \"내 땅에 트롤을 위한 곳은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_18292_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f41193bb-5186-4fb5-9008-1b55ac0d8ad9"
msgid "Asked Ekun to spare the troll young."
msgstr "에쿤에게 어린 트롤을 살려달라고 요청했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_18292_Text
msgctxt "3796009a-ef77-4c42-8ae3-34a7093778c2"
msgid "[Stop Ekun] \"They are just kids. They haven't done anything wrong.\""
msgstr "[에쿤을 멈춥니다] \"그저 어린애들일 뿐이야. 그들은 아무 잘못도 하지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_27169_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "828e1e40-ca0b-4c8d-bd77-cec8afc348c9"
msgid "Spared the troll young."
msgstr "어린 트롤을 살려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_27169_Text
msgctxt "9e679308-feb3-4d31-84c8-95280eb20500"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"I will not kill you. But if I find out that you have started to "
"attack people, I will come back to get you.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 너를 죽이지 않을 것이다. 그러나 네가 사람들을 공격하기 시작했다는 것을 알면 너를 잡으러 돌아올 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_48528_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "85688836-938e-4061-b4cd-9c82155452fa"
msgid "Killed the troll young."
msgstr "어린 트롤을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_48528_Text
msgctxt "d07c0d43-092e-4688-928b-3be79774eb53"
msgid "[Attack] \"There's no place for trolls in my lands.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 땅에는 트롤을 위한 곳이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_60601_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "efd5569d-7622-404e-adac-9c2a05e40ab8"
msgid "Ordered Ekun to spare the troll young."
msgstr "어린 트롤들을 살려주라고 에쿤에게 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_60601_Text
msgctxt "83cfd22a-8af5-4fcb-a5db-5d03f2deb502"
msgid ""
"\"I command you to put the bow down, Ekun.\" [To trolls] \"You better run! "
"If I ever find out that you're attacking people, I will come back and find "
"you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"활을 내려놓을 것을 명령하겠어. 에쿤.\" [트롤에게] \"도망치는게 좋을꺼야! 만일 너희가 사람을 공격하고 있다는 것을 알게 되는 "
"날엔, 다시 돌아와서 너희를 찾을테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_72859_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1b282132-5877-4e70-bdfe-c16491e0b2cc"
msgid "Allowed Ekun to kill the troll young."
msgstr "에쿤이 어린 트롤을 죽일 수 있게 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_72859_Text
msgctxt "121cdf67-3f19-459f-9e31-494e7c98230d"
msgid "[Approve Ekun's attack] \"Guess you're right. Shoot.\""
msgstr "[에쿤의 공격에 동의합니다] \"네 말이 맞아. 쏴라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_72860_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "38020632-b8fb-4532-9506-b6e22cc5a267"
msgid "Persuaded Ekun to spare the troll young."
msgstr "어린 트롤들을 살리라고 에쿤을 설득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_72860_Text
msgctxt "7e377b10-a356-49de-a5b7-0e6aa5ab41d6"
msgid ""
"[Stop Ekun] \"Wait, Ekun! It was Kargadd who murdered your family, not his "
"children! They stand innocent before you. Killing them now will make you the "
"very thing you loathe. Lower your bow before it's too late!\""
msgstr ""
"[에쿤을 멈춥니다] \"기다려. 에쿤! 너의 가족을 살해한 것은 카르가드였어. 그의 자식들은 죄가 없어. 이 녀석들을 지금 죽이면 네가 "
"혐오하는 그 놈과 같아지는 거야. 늦기 전에 활을 내려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_72869_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "166463ff-c610-43d2-9999-27cb5e10c468"
msgid "Killed the troll young."
msgstr "어린 트롤을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Answer_72869_Text
msgctxt "1242f8d6-e947-45c3-aa97-e8785685b5bc"
msgid ""
"[Approve Ekun's attack] \"Calistria laughs when vengeance is served. Go on, "
"kill them!\""
msgstr "[에쿤의 공격에 동의합니다] \"칼리스트리아는 복수가 실현되었을 때 웃을 거야. 죽여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_04048_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildKarga
msgctxt "cfbe84a1-5a27-4d29-bdd0-45900808bc34"
msgid "\"Why kill daddy, borba?!\""
msgstr "\"왜 아빠 죽여. 보바?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_20617_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildKarga
msgctxt "a08e0d58-2629-4db8-a5f4-8d3df8bc6f48"
msgid "\"Fargh, borba here!\""
msgstr "\"보바가 여기있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_25390_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildKarga
msgctxt "4056feef-9fe9-43a4-92bf-afc44b39c24c"
msgid "\"Want kill us too, borba?\""
msgstr "\"우리도 죽이려고 보바?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_27075_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fc8a0b85-7d33-493d-8f66-ee0d2b21ee4b"
msgid "{n}Ekun winces.{/n} \"Rock trolls. Smaller than Kargadd.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 찡그렸습니다.{/n} \"바위 트롤이다. 카르가드보다 작다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_35177_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "ebb2b555-cc07-4705-a99e-22e7d7c003fd"
msgid ""
"\"Apologies, friend. We came here to kill Kargadd, and anyone else we found."
"\""
msgstr "\"미안. 친구. 우리는 카르가드와 우리를 찾은 녀석들을 죽이러 왔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_36348_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "50dcc95d-19db-47e7-8573-7bafa1dd5c5b"
msgid ""
"{n}After several strained seconds, Ekun does as commanded, if half-"
"heartedly.{/n} \"You are here to help my vengeance. Owe you,\"{n} he "
"mutters, almost as if reminding himself. {/n}\"Let's go now. Don't want to "
"see them anymore.\" {n}He nods in the direction of the rock trolls.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}긴장이 흐르는 몇 초 후에 에쿤은 싫지만 명령한 대로 합니다.{/n} \"너는 나의 복수를 돕기 위해 여기에 왔다. 너에게 빚을 "
"졌다.\" {n}그는 마치 자신에게 말하듯이 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"이제 가자. 더 이상 보고 싶지 않아.\" {n}그는 바위 트롤의 "
"방향을 보며 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_38114_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildArgadd
msgctxt "3222c29e-bfdf-48fd-baeb-b9802dc3d2fd"
msgid "\"Borba want kill daddy?\""
msgstr "\"보바는 아빠를 죽이고 싶어?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_43330_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildKarga
msgctxt "b08759c2-008e-4c06-ac1a-40234344aea7"
msgid ""
"{n}The trolls, who have just appeared seemingly from nowhere, look small. "
"Though they are small only in comparison to a mature rock troll — their "
"height equals the height of a grown man. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}어디선가 갑자기 나타난 트롤들은 작아 보입니다. 하지만 다자란 바위 트롤에 비하여 작을뿐 그들의 키는 다 큰 성인 남자의 키와 "
"같습니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_44661_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "345b5306-dc0a-42a6-9f18-47dde2410f1a"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun silently raises his bow. The trolls don't run away. Instead they "
"stare at him with offended expressions.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 조용히 그의 활을 올립니다. 트롤은 도망가지 않습니다. 대신 그들은 불쾌한 표정으로 그를 응시합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_48323_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildArgadd
msgctxt "d093739f-ba72-4463-9ff7-84c2c99ca305"
msgid "\"Borba want kill daddy! Borba garung. Borba bad.\""
msgstr "\"보바는 아빠를 죽이고 싶어한다! 보바 가룽. 보바 나쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_59891_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b63993a1-5409-4f70-bded-495231b4edfd"
msgid ""
"\"Not kids. Trolls. Monsters,\" {n}Ekun objects through the clenched teeth, "
"without putting the bow down.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아이들이 아니야. 트롤들이다. 괴물들.\" {n}에쿤은 활을 내려 놓지 않고 이를 악물고 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_65881_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "95891b10-09ac-432f-af8c-68f0cc76b620"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun shoots one of the trolls. His arrow sticks deeply in the troll's "
"gut. For a second, it seems to you that the troll going to cry, but then his "
"bestial nature kicks in. Angry trolls don't cry. They attack.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 트롤 중 하나를 쏩니다. 그의 화살은 트롤의 내장에 깊숙이 박힙니다. 잠시 동안 트롤이 울 것 같았지만, 이내 그의 본성이 "
"드러납니다. 화난 트롤은 울지 않습니다. 그들은 공격합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_72862_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "837ec3e8-82cf-4d60-804c-9567fde14501"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar clenches his fists.{/n} \"For {g|Calistria}Calistria's{/g} sake, "
"enough of this bullshit! Don't step between a man and his revenge!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 그의 주먹을 꽉 쥐었습니다.{/n} \"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}의 이름으로 개소리 하지말고! 저 남자와 "
"그의 복수 사이에 끼어들지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_72864_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "aaabead2-711c-46e9-8367-54fe19708dab"
msgid ""
"\"Do it, ranger. You've come a long path to this moment. Now kill them!\""
msgstr "\"어서 해. 레인저. 너는 이 순간까지 먼 길을 왔어. 이제 그들을 죽여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairFirstLevel/RockTrollChild/Cue_72866_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7ea58556-bf9f-4afe-b999-8a12095dc782"
msgid "\"You're right. Vengeance is a sacred cause!\""
msgstr "\"네 말이 맞아. 복수는 신성한 동기지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/ClimbDown_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "8354519a-6704-42a3-8c65-154d738f2287"
msgid "Try to climb down the wall."
msgstr "벽을 타고 내려가 봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/Cutscene_1_Jason_String
msgctxt "ab09fd5f-63f9-490f-ac80-7b7f2a5d0600"
msgid "\"Open up! See this borba? Must take to Hargulka!\""
msgstr "\"열어! 이 보바 보여? 하굴카에게 데려가야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/Cutscene_2_Guard_String
msgctxt "28ca4da5-eca2-4b69-aa61-f29654fc837f"
msgid "\"That's his lunch? Good borba, must be tasty... Can I have a bite?!\""
msgstr "\"그게 점심이야? 좋은 보바다. 맛있을 거야... 한입 먹어봐도 돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/Cutscene_3_Jason_String
msgctxt "88856483-1810-4b24-8a7e-d39c6d750f93"
msgid ""
"\"Fool! This king of all borba! Came to talk with Hargulka, to make peace! "
"Shut your trap and open door!\""
msgstr "\"멍청이! 보바들의 왕이다! 하굴카와 평화를 맺으러 왔다! 덫을 치우고 문을 열어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_Artist01_String
msgctxt "1fd90fd4-ce75-4768-bfd6-f56f18278254"
msgid ""
"The kobold is carving something on a huge bone. He holds it firmly, working "
"with great concentration."
msgstr "코볼트는 거대한 뼈에 무언가를 조각하고 있습니다. 그는 집중력으로 그것을 꽉 쥐고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_Artist02_String
msgctxt "30a5f8aa-68a4-4388-9060-b0c038ffa460"
msgid "\"Tartuk.\""
msgstr "\"타툭.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_Artist03_String
msgctxt "d03dd789-4563-4947-822f-beba19f07093"
msgid ""
"The carved bone figurine in the primitive sculptor's hands resembles a crude "
"kobold."
msgstr "원시 조각가의 손에 새겨진 뼈 조각상은 조잡한 코볼트와 흡사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_Banter01_String
msgctxt "df6b5c92-a6b3-4eca-8f03-7eaa55677e01"
msgid "\"{mf|Aron|Aronesss}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|나암작|여나암작}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_Banter02_String
msgctxt "d3fc023c-0a2a-4a53-8f0c-23c3b22607c0"
msgid "\"Ssss!\""
msgstr "\"슈슛!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_Banter03_String
msgctxt "e31a9375-5df4-40c9-9fea-b388003e9b3a"
msgid "\"Tartuk ssspeak.\""
msgstr "\"타툭 말한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_EnvironmentDeadAnimal_String
msgctxt "1d777722-60d1-4509-b677-59b473f91456"
msgid ""
"This pile of gnawed bones, tattered flesh, and broken antlers was once a "
"deer."
msgstr "갉아 먹은 뼈, 너덜너덜 한 살, 깨진 뿔의 더미는 한때 사슴이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_EnvironmentDoor_String
msgctxt "1aac215d-3a9f-455c-889d-653c6e6f7c2b"
msgid ""
"The dungeon entrance is blocked by rubble and — judging by the smell — the "
"corpses of dead trolls."
msgstr "지하 감옥 입구는 잔해에 의해 막혔고 냄새로 판단하니 죽은 트롤의 시체입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyKobold_EnvironmentTree_String
msgctxt "62693e62-745d-4b89-9bbb-97c3c5067e19"
msgid ""
"Scratches made by kobold claws are barely visible on the bark of the tree "
"trunk. It's impossible to discern what the reptiles were trying to depict."
msgstr "나무 줄기의 껍질 위에 코볼트 발톱으로 긁은 자국은 보이지 않습니다. 파충류가 묘사하려고 한 것을 식별하는 것은 불가능합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyTrolls_1_String
msgctxt "2312b907-8a02-4ecc-8a89-2a6696fbee56"
msgid "\"Hey, not-borba!\""
msgstr "\"야. 보르바!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyTrolls_2_String
msgctxt "2d4a31da-9f6b-4b5b-a00a-2a925ebc6c82"
msgid "\"Too bad kobolds left. Funny little bastards, they were.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트가 떠나서 안타깝다. 귀엽고 작은 녀석들이었는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyTrolls_3_String
msgctxt "e65a627d-070e-41ab-aa01-4ddf8191305c"
msgid "\"That was smart, what Hargulka did! Only true king can do!\""
msgstr "\"하굴카가 한 일은 현명했다! 그런 것은 진정한 왕만이 할 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyTrolls_4_String
msgctxt "2a272eb8-6f82-462d-9b53-c5b5f14395f9"
msgid "\"Trolls became just like borba now.\""
msgstr "\"트롤은 이제 보바와 같아졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/FriendlyTrolls_5_String
msgctxt "9ada7ddb-2acb-4d48-8d2f-adf5d8dd360f"
msgid ""
"\"You human {mf|king|queen}? So tiny, but still {mf|king|queen}? Must be "
"smart.\""
msgstr "\"너는 인간의 왕인가? 이렇게 작은데 인간의 왕이라고? 똑똑한가 보군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollKillsKoboldCivilians_01_String
msgctxt "095207ab-ac9a-46a1-9522-b2569c88e082"
msgid "\"Kill slimy kobolds! Kill!\""
msgstr "\"저 칙칙한 코볼트 죽여라! 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollKillsKoboldCivilians_02_String
msgctxt "02b4f658-d476-413a-a4b4-891b558ea263"
msgid "\"Borba? Borba kill!\""
msgstr "\"보바? 보바 죽여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_AmbushTroll_String
msgctxt "66341a27-d36a-43e1-a42d-e776838d54d0"
msgid "\"Dur borba!\""
msgstr "\"두르 보바!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_ClimbUp_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "853a3997-6bb5-436b-bd7d-ca5f5864a719"
msgid "Broken wall."
msgstr "부서진 벽."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_ClimbUp_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "8d4729df-e6b4-44cf-b567-14fb0487453c"
msgid "Try to climb up the wall."
msgstr "벽타기를 시도한다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_Door_String
msgctxt "b579413a-57ee-4622-a14d-82e27cc2979f"
msgid ""
"It seems this (now broken) door was too complicated for trolls to open "
"properly."
msgstr "지금 부서진 이 문은 트롤이 제대로 열기에는 너무 복잡해보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_DwarfStatue_String
msgctxt "1d1db258-3d47-4f0b-91f7-2c20e38e89b8"
msgid ""
"The stone guardian of the fortress overlooks the surrounding mess, almost "
"with reproach."
msgstr "요새의 돌 수호자는 주변의 잔해들을 비웃듯이 내려봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_Fountain_String
msgctxt "78273b12-6310-42b0-9dff-fdec2e9d199c"
msgid ""
"The fountain dried up long ago. Its bottom is covered with mud and moss."
msgstr "오래 전에 샘물이 말랐습니다. 그 바닥은 진흙과 이끼로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_JasonApproach_String
msgctxt "db4a2c31-4c26-428a-aafc-bb9b90fe9d66"
msgid "\"Hail, borba!\""
msgstr "\"환영해(Hail), 보바!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_Rock_String
msgctxt "3b3f9055-e0e0-4055-8006-b230f93fde4c"
msgid ""
"Bones, pieces of eggshell, and some other leftovers are scattered under the "
"rock."
msgstr "뼈, 달걀 껍질 조각 및 기타 남은 것들이 암석 아래에 흩어져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/TrollLair_Exterior_WallParts_String
msgctxt "21a39846-2d48-4821-8edb-bfe6d096b483"
msgid ""
"The solid dwarven stonework has been overtaken by moss and is crumbling in "
"spots."
msgstr "견고한 드워프 석조물은 이끼가 덮였고 곳곳이 부셔졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Barks/VS_TrollLairOutdoor_DwarfEntrance_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "9d19df14-31b6-46d6-945b-81c2a1f95850"
msgid ""
"The entrance to the ancient dwarven fortress has seen better days. Its gates "
"have been rent and broken by trolls. It's clearly been a long time since "
"anyone cared for this place."
msgstr ""
"고대 드워프 요새 입구는 많은 세월을 보냈습니다. 성문은 트롤들에 의해 부서졌습니다. 이 장소를 돌보지 않은 지 꽤 오래되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Entrance/Answer_68696_Text
msgctxt "a08e2684-803b-4dcc-beab-2746403e787e"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I don't look forward to reuniting with eternal emptiness just yet.\""
msgstr "\"글쎄 나는 아직 영원한 공허와 재회하고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Entrance/Answer_70687_Text
msgctxt "59b105c0-26ec-4194-a3ca-86985c16759e"
msgid "[Leave] \"You're talking rubbish. Let's move.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"너는 말하는 쓰레기야. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Entrance/Answer_78469_Text
msgctxt "2dd3cfca-ae02-4424-ae83-2a692a2821bf"
msgid ""
"\"You just overreact. Perhaps the fortress ceased to be necessary, and the "
"dwarves just left? How can we know?\""
msgstr "\"과민반응만 하는군. 요새가 필요 없어져서 드워프들이 그냥 떠났을 수도 있겠지. 우리가 어떻게 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Entrance/Cue_21184_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "be3a81fd-cb21-4cc9-9c20-192143c5f0fc"
msgid ""
"{n}He turns his gaze to you.{/n} \"Now you see, {name}. This once-proud "
"fortress has fallen, all her inhabitants long gone. Death and oblivion wait "
"for every person at the end of their path. Soon you and I will reunite with "
"the eternal emptiness too.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"자네도 이제 알겠지. {name}. 한때 자랑스런 요새가 무너졌고 모든 주민들은 오래 전에 "
"사라졌어. 죽음과 망각은 모두를 기다리고 있어. 곧 너와 나도 영원한 공허에서 다시 만날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Entrance/Cue_46126_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3de4742c-a96a-468b-8870-6d7d6faac6be"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim sighs.{/n} \"Your ignorance changes nothing. You won't miss the "
"end of the path anyway. My aim is to make you ready for that. This is the "
"will of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"자네의 무지는 변한게 없는 모양이군. 어차피 길의 끝에 다다르게 될껄세. 내 목표는 자네를 "
"준비시키는 거야. 그게 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 의지야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Entrance/Cue_52617_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "934459de-b593-4b19-b420-1d9aaa11b725"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim grimaces with displeasure.{/n} \"If you put forth such an "
"argument, you must know little about the dwarves. We are the most stubborn "
"creatures in the world. Dwarves would never abandon a fortress without a "
"proper fight.\" {n}He raises his eyes and stares at the broken statue near "
"the gates.{/n} \"Oh the cradle of sorrow, here we go...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 불쾌감으로 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그런 주장을 하려면 드워프에 대해 조금은 알고 있어야 하네. 우리는 세상에서 가장 "
"완고한 생명체야. 드워프는 제대로 된 전투가 없는한 절대 요새를 버리지 않아.\" {n}그는 눈을들어 성문 근처의 부서진 조각상을 "
"올려다봅니다.{/n} \"오 슬픔의 요람이여. 우리가 간다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Entrance/DwarfEntrance_Start_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "cd84cb0e-9045-4c60-96ff-ac859228ec4d"
msgid ""
"\"It's worse than I thought.\" {n}Harrim pulls his beard, his eyes are full "
"of suffering.{/n} \"Dwarves, where are you now? Why did you leave this "
"fortress and let it be defiled by monsters? Perhaps you were killed? And no "
"one survived to tell your families about your fate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"생각했던 것보다 더 심하군.\" {n}고통이 가득찬 눈으로 하림은 그의 수염을 잡습니다.{/n} \"드워프들이여 다들 어디로 갔는가? "
"너희는 왜 요새를 떠나 괴물들이 더럽히게 만든 거지? 괴물에게 죽임을 당한건가? 그리고 이곳엔 너희의 운명을 가족들에게 전해줄 생존자조차 "
"아무도 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "e9968a45-885b-4d06-a921-f7572d21cd72"
msgid "\"How are things in Trobold now?\""
msgstr "\"트로볼트는 지금 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "47be1c11-15fa-4f63-80c1-b8df63af9601"
msgid "\"What does the word 'borba' mean?\""
msgstr "\"보바라는 단어는 무엇을 의미하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9c579b7e-a4c9-4da3-963f-5d4fac806fbc"
msgid "\"You don't eat people anymore?\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 사람들을 먹지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e8b00231-b7a8-44b0-b95f-b59c2423027a"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ac5e189c-37d0-477f-9dfc-725daad9aa90"
msgid "\"Tell me about your people.\""
msgstr "\"너희 사람들에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fd89ff6d-f9a3-41b5-a767-7f565b67a32a"
msgid "Changed your mind and massacred the trolls of Trobold."
msgstr "마음을 바꾸어 트로볼트의 트롤을 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e720d654-4252-46ed-97bb-4ec5755fdd5a"
msgid "[Attack] \"Sparing your lives was a mistake. I'll destroy Trobold!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네 목숨을 구하는 것은 실수였다. 나는 트로볼트를 파괴할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "54fe5de7-8ece-43ba-9097-ce59f7cc4453"
msgid "[Leave] \"I have to go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "ac387bc4-5ff2-4d40-9205-57dbae752bed"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"넌 어느 나라에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "0ed680a0-f014-4d83-9c76-034593c34daf"
msgid "\"Do you have children?\""
msgstr "\"자녀가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "792e40e9-d357-47d3-809d-e8a360cb7d9a"
msgid "\"How did you become a king?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 왕이 된 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "5cb0c0ea-5e0d-45cd-bbaa-a5231111453d"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for telling me about yourself. I'd like to ask another question."
"\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해줘서 고마워. 또 다른 질문을 하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "cf2b4581-ec57-4708-ae6c-5aa9744090a8"
msgid "\"Are settlements like Trobold rare?\""
msgstr "\"Trobold와 같은 정착촌은 드물어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "3e3d4ff7-556d-450d-8f50-f0a509efe76a"
msgid "\"What's an augur?\""
msgstr "\"뭐 때문에 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "3dc2d7cf-de66-4973-84c7-e6937cac6a03"
msgid "\"Are fire and acid really the only ways to kill a troll?\""
msgstr "\"정말로 화재와 산이 트롤을 죽일 수 있는 유일한 방법이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "fbc78b83-5e28-40ab-84f7-ef79543f1aa9"
msgid "\"Do trolls worship any gods?\""
msgstr "\"트롤들은 어떤 신을 숭배하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "a1c9a4e0-dcda-4349-a7cc-d4469ae6f4fc"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for telling me about your people. I'd like to ask you about "
"something else.\""
msgstr "\"너의 사람들에 대해 이야기해주어 고맙다. 다른 것에 대해 물어보고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "4d0a1926-849e-4da0-9971-fa72e2fdb322"
msgid ""
"\"I've met Kargadd's offspring in a dungeon and sent them your way. Have you "
"seen them lately?\""
msgstr "\"나는 카르가드의 자손들을 던전에서 만났고 그들을 네게 보냈다. 그들을 보았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "700085e2-b2f1-484a-9e04-e5afd4dd7203"
msgid ""
"{n}An old troll stands near the gate of his kingdom. He looks at you with "
"respect... and perhaps a touch of fear.{/n} \"{d|c21 Hargulka Lives}Hello{/d}"
", {race}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이든 트롤은 그의 왕국 문 근처에 서있습니다. 그는 존경심으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다... 아마 두려움일 것입니다.{/n} \" {d|"
"c21 Hargulka Lives}안녕.{/d} {race}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "56288a14-4ff9-462d-b9b6-cf7fbf1052f5"
msgid ""
"{n}This question puzzles the old troll. He scratches his chin in "
"confusion.{/n} \"How's that — about my self? Hargulka stands before you. "
"What else tell?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이 질문은 나이든 트롤을 혼란스럽게 합니다. 그는 혼란스러워서 자신의 턱을 긁습니다.{/n} \"나에 대해서는 어때? 하굴카가 네 "
"앞에 있다. 할 말이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "68351f48-815e-49e0-aacc-62cb9c0e913b"
msgid ""
"\"You want know about trolls?\" {n}The troll furrows his brow in "
"contemplation and starts counting on his bony fingers.{/n} \"We strong. We "
"live everywhere. We like eat borba. We not afraid claws, teeth, iron — only "
"fire and acid are danger. That's it. Told you all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤에 대해 알고 싶어?\" {n}트롤은 고뇌로 이마를 찡그리고 자신의 앙상한 손가락으로 세기 시작합니다.{/n} \"우리는 강하다. "
"우리는 어디서나 산다. 우리는 보바를 먹는 것을 좋아한다. 우리는 발톱, 이빨, 철은 두려워하지 않는다. 단지 불과 산만 위험하다. 너에 "
"대해 모두 말했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "42b3e514-5005-493a-9d21-fc6484d77e04"
msgid ""
"\"With Tartuk gone, immortality gone too. Many left. That good — less mouths "
"to feed. Trolls not live in towns and kingdoms like bor- like humans. We "
"learn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭이 떠난 후 불멸도 사라졌다. 많은 자들이 떠났다. 좋다. 먹을 입이 더 적어졌다. 트롤은 보바... 아니 인간처럼 도시와 왕국에 "
"살지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "e5604a72-e1f4-411c-89d8-9dcf64410820"
msgid ""
"\"How you call it... The thing you eat. Deer, cow, halfling, pig, human... "
"Oh, that the word — meat. Kobold not meat, they poison. {Race} not meat too, "
"now. Hargulka forbids. Now only animals in forest are borba.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것을 어떻게 부르는지... 네가 먹는 것 말이지. 사슴, 암소, 하플링, 돼지, 인간... 그것들은 고기지. 코볼트는 고기가 아니라 "
"독이다. {Race}의 고기도 고기가 아니지. 하굴카가 금한다. 숲에 있는 동물들만 보바다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "8b005cb0-ffec-49b2-9f7e-9978f18d36f8"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka looks to the side.{/n} \"We don't. Hargulka forbids! If someone "
"from {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} attacks not-borba, Hargulka himself will eat "
"attacker. Strong word!\" {n}There's a note of uncertainty behind his "
"braggadocio.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 옆을 봅니다.{/n} \"우리는 하지 않는다 .하굴카가 금지한다! {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}의 누군가가 보바가 "
"아닌 것을 공격한다면 하굴카는 직접 그 녀석을 먹겠다. 굳게 약속한다!\" {n}그의 목소리는 볼확실한 톤입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "6278fed7-cc30-4424-8eaf-82cbbcd1b136"
msgid "\"Ask.\""
msgstr "\"물어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "52fc8340-9df6-4bdf-bbd4-8fa9a59fb1d5"
msgid ""
"\"From mountains — far away, west. Long way here — I went through woods, "
"through swamps, near big freshwater. Seen a lot, fought a lot, ate a lot. "
"Once seen a dragon. Other time fought scrag — that like troll, but lives in "
"water. Almost drowned. Another time, had to run from forest fire... Lots of "
"things happened.\""
msgstr ""
"\"산의 서쪽에서 먼 곳이야. 여기에서 멀었고 나는 숲과 큰 신선한 물이 주위의 늪지대를을 거쳐왔다. 많은 것을 보았고 싸움도 많이 했고 "
"많이 먹었다. 한때는 드래곤도 보았다. scrag와 싸우기도 했다. 트롤과 비슷하지만 물 속에서 산다. 거의 익사할 뻔했다. 언젠가는 "
"숲에서 난 불로부터 도망쳐야 했다... 많은 일을 겪었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "ecdfafe6-3dcc-4a65-b9dd-4f4de9236592"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka wrinkles his eyebrows in confusion, then grunts. {/n} \"Hargulka "
"male. Troll males not have children. Only Kargadd, but Kargadd strange, not "
"like others. Male raising children, caring about children — Hargulka never "
"seen anything like that before.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}혼란스러워 하굴카의 미간이 좁아지고 불평을 합니다.{/n} \"하굴카는 남자다. 트롤 남자는 아이 가지지 못한다. 카르가드는 "
"가능하지만 카르가드는 다른 녀석과 다르다. 남자는 아이를 기르고 보살핀다. 하굴카는 그런 녀석들을 본 적이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "921c89a7-eb56-494c-8029-bcbca4951059"
msgid ""
"\"Not like other kings. Trolls live alone or in small packs. King is one all "
"trolls respect, obey, give gifts. King can gather trolls for... how you call "
"it... when you all attack together. But trolls not live near their king.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 왕들과 다르다. 트롤은 혼자 살거나 작은 무리를 이룬다. 왕은 트롤들이 존경하고 복종하고 선물을 주는 존재다. 왕은 공격을 "
"하려고 할 때 트롤들을 모을 수 있다. 하지만 트롤은 왕 주위에서 살지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "3d434dfc-637f-4cc6-b6c7-7a22c634f9fa"
msgid ""
"\"When woman is ready to bear child, men are drawn to her smell, fight for "
"right to mate with her — women choose only strongest. Hargulka strong, won "
"often, had many children. But when done, women drive men away. Men get "
"hungry. When hungry, even children are borba.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여자가 아이를 낳을 준비가 되면 남자는 여자의 향기에 이끌리고 여자와 짝을 맺기 위해 싸울 준비를 한다. 여자는 강한 남자만을 "
"고른다. 하굴카는 강하고 싸움에 이겨서 많은 아이를 가졌다. 하지만 남자가 약해지면 여자는 남자를 쫓아낸다. 남자는 배가 고파진다. 배가 "
"고프면 아이조차 보바가 된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "86d7acff-b657-4b8f-b7e1-5a6d7bb642f0"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk made Hargulka immortal. Hargulka was with small pack of trolls "
"then. Tartuk said we live together, build {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} together, "
"become like humans. Tartuk was scary smart.\n"
"Once, at a trader's cart, he found a potion to become smart. Gave it to "
"Hargulka. Hargulka drank, and his head suddenly full of thoughts, and Tartuk "
"talked and talked and talked... until the potion wore off. Hargulka's head "
"ached whole day after. How you live like that all the time? Hargulka would "
"go crazy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭은 하굴카를 불멸의 존재로 만들었다. 하굴카는 작은 트롤 무리와 있었다. 타툭이 우리 함께 {g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g}를 "
"지어 인간처럼 되자고 말했다. 타툭은 무서울 정도로 똑똑했다. \n"
"언젠가 상인의 수레에서 그는 똑똑해지는 물약을 발견했다. 그것을 하굴카에게 주었다. 하굴카는 마셨고 머리가 생각으로 가득 차 포션이 닳을 "
"때까지 타툭과 얘기하고, 얘기하고 얘기했다. 하굴카의 머리는 하루 종일 아팠다. 어떻게 하루 종일 그렇게 살 수 있지? 하굴카는 미쳐버릴 "
"것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "35516e60-9649-4744-bacb-ff364fc27d43"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk gone now. Immortality gone. Many left and live like before. But "
"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} stays. Maybe we do like he wanted and become like "
"you. Or maybe we start fight with each other and split away. Hargulka still "
"strong, but Hargulka old. Old trolls become borba. If this year, or next "
"year, or year after that old Hargulka not eaten, that means Tartuk was "
"right. We will see.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭은 이제 사라졌다. 불멸도 사라졌다. 많은 자들이 떠나 예전처럼 산다. 하지만 {g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g}는 남아있다. "
"아마도 우리는 그가 원했던 것처럼 하고 너처럼 되기를 원한 거 같다. 아니면 우리는 서로 싸우고 서로 쪼개졌을 것이다. 하굴카는 여전히 "
"강하지만 늙었다. 늙은 트롤은 보바가 된다. 올해 혹은 내년 아니면 그 다음 해에도 늙은 하굴카는 먹히지 않을 거고 타툭이 옳을 것이다. "
"두고보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "d4abbb16-ea25-4907-8667-95bddc031cb8"
msgid ""
"\"No other settlements like {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}. Trolls are nomads. Males "
"walk alone or in small packs. Females walk with children until children "
"grow, then mother drives them away. Trobold was Tartuk's idea. Trolls not "
"live like that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g}와 같은 다른 정착지는 없다. 트롤은 유목민이다. 남자는 혼자 살거나 작은 무리를 이룬다. 여자는 "
"아이들이 자랄 때까지 함께 있다가 크면 내보낸다. 트로볼트는 타툭의 아이디어였다. 트롤은 그렇게 살지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "660a3f36-0cc2-4400-880d-bb888590153f"
msgid ""
"\"From an old augur, Hargulk heard that far away, right hand from the east, "
"there lands where trolls live in big tribe — like lizardfolk here. Augur "
"won't lie, but that hard to believe. Where they get so much borba to feed "
"the whole tribe? And why trolls in tribe not fight each other?\""
msgstr ""
"\"늙은 현자로부터 하굴카는 동쪽의 먼 곳에서 트롤이 도마뱀 인간처럼 무리를 이루고 사는 땅이 있다고 들었다. 그 늙은이는 거짓말을 하지 "
"않았지만 나는 믿기 어려웠다. 어디서 그런 많은 보바가 있어 먹일 수 있는 거냐? 왜 트롤은 서로 싸우지 않는 거냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "662773cc-4626-483e-80a0-a0852d0ab0f1"
msgid ""
"\"That name for sorcerer-trolls. They wise. They know everything, because "
"they talk with demons. They rip their own stomachs up and tell the future by "
"looking on their own guts. They are rare. Hargulka met one only once, long "
"ago, west from here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 마법사 트롤이다. 그들은 현명하다. 그들은 데몬과 이야기하기 때문에 모든 것을 안다. 그들은 자신의 위장을 찢어서 그것으로 "
"미래를 본다. 그들은 희귀하다. 하굴카는 예전에 서쪽에서 한번 만나보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "ef3d16a7-4a0d-4a43-890f-f2cb57764270"
msgid ""
"\"No. Most times, troll dies from hunger. We eat many, many borba. If there "
"no borba, troll becomes weak, wounds don't close anymore. If troll weakened "
"by hunger, even bear can kill him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니다. 대부분 트롤은 굶주림으로 죽는다. 우리는 많은 보르바를 먹는다. 보르바가 없다면 트롤은 약해지고 상처는 더 이상 아물지 "
"않는다. 트롤이 굶주려 약해지면 곰도 그를 죽일 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "83b2fe8c-2130-4282-8907-98a34cdc7894"
msgid ""
"\"Also we no live without breathing. If troll drown or strangled, he no "
"survive. Also also...\" {n}The old troll's voice goes quiet, and he leans "
"toward you and hunches down.{/n} \"Ghosts of dead. They no make wounds, just "
"touch you and take your life. You survive, you become weak and sick. Some "
"just fall and die, no scratch on their bodies. But they get ice cold, and "
"their fur turn gray.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리도 숨쉬지 않고는 살지 못한다. 트롤이 물에 빠지거나 목에 졸리면 살지 못한다. 그리고...\" {n}늙은 트롤의 목소리가 "
"조용해지고 그는 당신 쪽으로 몸을 기울여 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"죽음의 유령도 있다. 그들은 상처를 내지 않고 너를 만져 생명을 "
"빼앗아간다. 너는 살아있지만약하고 병들게 된다. 누군가 죽었지만 시체에는 상처가 없었다. 하지만 그들은 얼음처럼 차가웠고 털은 회색으로 "
"변했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "befda342-b1d7-425e-a57f-48c562201b16"
msgid ""
"\"Troll god is Urxehl, lord of storms and fires. He created trolls, gave "
"them strength to close their wounds and to hunt and eat everybody — animals "
"in the woods, and ogres, and — cough-cough!\" {n}The troll coughs abruptly — "
"and rather unconvincingly — and looks away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"트롤 신은은 폭풍과 불의 신인 Urxehl이다. 그는 트롤을 만들었고 상처가 아무는 힘을 주었고 숲의 동물과 오우거들을 사냥하고 먹는 "
"힘을 주었...\" {n}트롤은 갑자기 기침을 해서 설득력을 잃었고 그는 시선을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "02b09262-8d8a-4f01-a4d2-bcd6020b7886"
msgid ""
"\"And for the wisest trolls, Urxehl gives power to make magic and foretell "
"futures. He gives humans dreams about fires, and they set fires to their own "
"homes! Troll god is strong — the strongest!\""
msgstr ""
"\"가장 지혜로운 트롤에게 Urxehl은 마법을 만들고 미래를 예언 할 수있는 힘을 준다. 그는 인간에게 불의 꿈을 주고 집에 불을 놓을 "
"수 있다! 트롤 신은 가장 강하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "7a6c2892-816f-4485-9775-4fecff3efd1c"
msgid "\"Ask. Hargulk tells what he knows.\""
msgstr "\"물어봐 .하굴카는 알고 있는 것을 말해주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "e4936c5f-f982-4b4c-bc4a-85018e4b0dd7"
msgid ""
"\"Hargulka no understand you. You crazy! But Hargulka fight for "
"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"하굴카는 너를 이해하지 못한다. 너는 미쳤어! 하지만 하굴카는 {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}를 위해 싸운다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "9d5f568c-ddc3-48df-9cbe-919a9bdda442"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Karga and Argadd came to Hargulka. Their anger was great. They said, "
"if they catch you again, they will...\" {n}Hargulka makes a vague gesture. "
"With an anxious chuckle, he continues.{/n} \"But don't worry! Hargulka told "
"them that if YOU catch them, you will...\" {n}The gestures that follow are "
"quite emphatic, but even more vague.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래 카르가와 아르가드는 하굴카에게 갔다. 그들의 분노가 컸다. 그들이 말했는데 그들이 너를 다시 붙잡으면...\" {n}하굴카는 "
"모호한 몸짓을 합니다. 불안한 웃음과 함께 그는 계속합니다.{/n} \"걱정 마! 내가 그들에게 말했는데 네가 그들을 잡으면 너는...\""
" {n}뒤 따르는 제스처는 아주 강조되지만 더욱 모호합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "dd260c80-9fee-4534-841b-37eda500eb77"
msgid ""
"\"Now they understand and have let their anger go. They even asked me to "
"give you this. They, ughhh... found this in a cave. On their way to "
"Hargulka, yes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 그들은 이해하고 분노를 한다. 그들은 심지어 너에게 이걸 달라고 부탁했다. 그들은... 동굴에서 이것을 발견했다. 하굴카가 "
"맡았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d13ced76-77b0-4e85-92b0-6a06f1bec92e"
msgid ""
"\"Really? They must have some guts to do that, he-he-hmmm!\" {n}Regongar "
"laughs at his own pun.{/n}"
msgstr "\"정말? 그러려면 용기가 있어야 해. 하하!\" {n}레곤가르는 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/HargulkaFriendly/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f29d4794-3d9d-415a-af89-eeb719e9fbbc"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian frowns.{/n} \"I know this name... It is truly a powerful demon. "
"May {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} protect us from him and his kind!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"나는 이 이름을 안다... 그것은 강력한 데몬이야. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g} "
"그로부터 우리를 보호하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "bc1bf55b-9297-4b89-bb06-3526a2dbbd9f"
msgid "\"I'm glad you managed to reunite with your king.\""
msgstr "\"네가 너희 왕과 재결합하게 되어 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "82c0649a-835f-44f3-9c78-11e95fb0f184"
msgid ""
"\"I've never met such an old kobold before. How did you manage to survive "
"this long?\""
msgstr "\"그런 늙은 코볼트를 만난 적이 없어. 어떻게 그렇게 오랫동안 살아남을 수 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "9e0a00b6-8928-44d5-abe2-d0be2d61dcc6"
msgid "\"You're fine company, but I must be going.\""
msgstr "\"너는 훌륭한 친구지만 나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "ddbdc3bf-cce0-4344-87d6-a5ad9df9e00c"
msgid "\"How do you like your new home?\""
msgstr "\"새로운 집은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "0dd5bc1d-ecf6-4a69-8f84-436333c58980"
msgid ""
"\"You've obviously seen much in your long life. I wish you could understand "
"me.\""
msgstr "\"네 긴 삶 동안 많은 것을 보았겠지. 나를 이해할 거라 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b96fdeeb-16e7-4f43-a550-9ccbff70a03c"
msgid "Attacked kobolds after making peace with them."
msgstr "코볼트와 평화를 맺은 후에 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "b748fce2-f62c-40bd-ba61-c66d09a62d51"
msgid "[Attack] \"Don't get too comfortable! It's time to entertain me!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"편안하게 있지 말라고! 나를 즐겁게 할 시간이니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "434bb470-b46f-42d9-8516-b4c60e473b78"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a familiar face — the kobold shaman you met in the forest. He "
"stares at you with unblinking eyes as he works to speak through his sharp-"
"toothed jaws.{/n} \"Greetingsss!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 익숙한 얼굴을 봅니다. 숲에서 만났던 코볼트 샤먼입니다. 그는 눈 하나 깜빡하지 않고 당신을 보며 날카로운 이빨을 한 턱으로 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0ec5b6a7-e0f8-4df1-ae07-9a0e20c2013b"
msgid ""
"{n}A kobold much older than his surrounding kin is sitting on the ground. "
"The skin around his eyes is dry and wrinkled, and his hide is missing many "
"scales, covered with scars and strange stains. Seeing you approach, the old "
"kobold turns his head to look at you closely.{/n} \"Greetingsss!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주위의 코볼트보다 훨씬 나이가 많아보이는 코볼트가 앉아있습니다. 그의 눈 주위는 수분이 없고 주름이 져있습니다. 그의 몸집은 살이 "
"많이 빠져있고 흉터와 이상한 얼룩으로 가득합니다. 당신이 오는 것을 보자 늙은 코볼트는 머리를 돌려 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "437018f4-9d9a-47eb-8847-9711e6b1a3c8"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold shaman turns his head to look at you.{/n} \"Greetingsss!\""
msgstr "{n}코볼트 샤먼은 머리를 돌려 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "bcb4e5cc-5615-4898-926f-f3ce0366be00"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk. Home. Love.\" {n}The kobold looks at you with his strange, "
"impenetrable gaze.{/n}"
msgstr "\"타툭. 집이다. 사랑.\" {n}코볼트는 이상한 눈빛으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "5a153d13-890f-4b1d-adae-6146790590f2"
msgid "{n}The kobold continues to stare at you blankly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 계속 멍하니 당신을 쳐다보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "3e7d6a71-cac7-4c3b-9c9a-bedd4e91151f"
msgid "\"Home. Kobold. Love.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트. 집. 사랑.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldShamanFriendly/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "219c98fa-d8f4-495d-ab2d-acf7d6c0d5bc"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold simply opens his mouth as he continues to look at you. It's "
"unclear if there's any special intent to the gesture.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 계속해서 당신을 보면서 입을 벌립니다. 특별한 의도가 있는지는 확실하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "f141be5c-8d30-4c37-afac-a9efc5d9d0b5"
msgid "\"Let's trade. You give me things, and I'll give you money.\""
msgstr "\"거래하자. 너는 나에게 물건을 주고 나는 돈을 줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5cfc747d-b319-43ac-83f2-d57526f0c872"
msgid "\"Your... clothes are very fancy.\""
msgstr "\"너의... 옷은 정말 화려하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "56902ed4-f1d2-40f5-ac17-235799a611b8"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5f074698-ec0b-4838-a910-47280fd1d653"
msgid "Attacked the kobold trader to get free goods."
msgstr "무료로 상품을 얻기 위해 코볼트 상인을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "7fc67749-67c0-49cb-b69a-40130e835241"
msgid "[Attack] \"Pay? I'll take what I want!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"돈을 내? 내가 원하는 것을 가져갈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c9937e35-5941-4cd9-be90-22235d6c232a"
msgid ""
"{n}An unusual kobold stands before you, decorated with bits of trash from "
"horns to tail. He's wearing a necklace of metal shards, patches of cloth and "
"bones, and his wrists are covered with bracelets made of wire, bone, and "
"splinters of wood.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뿔에서 꼬리까지 쓰레기로 장식한 특이한 코볼트가 당신 앞에 서있습니다. 그는 금속 조각들을 이어붙인 목걸이와 천과 뼈로 된 누더기를 "
"입고 있고 손목에는 철사와 뼈 나무 조각으로 만든 팔찌를 끼고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "84b304d1-de76-4a42-bbda-a1bde0c6299e"
msgid ""
"{n}Near the kobold you see backpacks, seemingly snatched from travelers "
"unlucky enough to become a troll's lunch. Each backpack is stuffed with a "
"variety of goods — weapons, armor pieces, and potion bottles. The kobold "
"notices your gaze and tilts his head, as if asking a question about his "
"\"treasures.\"{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트 근처에서 당신은 그가 트롤의 먹이가 된 불행한 여행자에게서 가져온 물건인 듯한 배낭을 발견합니다. 각각의 배낭은 무기, "
"갑옷, 포션 병 등 다양한 물건으로 채워졌습니다. 코볼트는 당신의 눈빛을 보고는 자신의 보물에 대해 물어보려는 듯 머리를 "
"기울입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "64409e49-86bd-451e-9944-3d9cb29c1480"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold tilts his head again and opens his sharp-toothed mouth. You're "
"not certain what it means, but it seems like the reptile is satisfied with "
"your compliment.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 머리를 다시 기울이고 날카로운 이빨로 된 입을 벌립니다. 당신은 그가 무엇을 의미하는지 확신할 수 없지만 파충류가 당신의 "
"칭찬에 만족하는 것처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldVendor/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "33bce803-795e-4a85-969c-1965adac5bd3"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold trader glances at you occasionally as he rummages through his "
"collection of trophies.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트 상인은 가끔 자신의 트로피 컬렉션을 뒤적거리며 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_07384_Text
#. Speaker : TrollGatekeeper_2
msgctxt "21277170-c102-4912-8bf8-50b52b7d4022"
msgid ""
"\"Barga no speak like borba yet,\" {n}the second troll says, stepping "
"forward.{/n} \"Barga new, came a day before.\" {n}He bends down and "
"carefully touches the kobold's hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"바르가는 보바처럼 말하지 않아.\" {n}두 번째 트롤은 걸어나오며 말합니다.{/n} \"바르가는 하루 전에 새로 왔다.\" {n}"
"그는 허리를 굽혀 코볼트의 손을 조심스레 만집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_10628_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold
msgctxt "55008f67-3847-4622-877d-a87e0bbb84d6"
msgid ""
"{n}The bravest of the kobolds steps forward.{/n} \"Garasssuk! Tartuk, "
"ssshakasss. {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}?\""
msgstr "{n}가장 용감한 코볼트가 걸어나옵니다.{/n} \"가라슉! 타툭 샤카스! {g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_29099_Text
#. Speaker : TrollGatekeeper_1
msgctxt "55c743bf-d04d-402d-a00b-f30f2d466716"
msgid "\"Marda gulb. Gnarg karad.\""
msgstr "\"마르다 굴바. 그나라그 카라드.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_31487_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "9fd080e3-48ef-4a8c-90b5-0f836ad08a42"
msgid ""
"{n}You see the same kobold shaman you recently met at the forest path. It "
"looks like he and at least half of his band managed to reach the troll "
"lair.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 전에 숲길에서 만난 코볼트 샤먼을 만났습니다. 그와 그의 패거리 절반이 트롤 소굴에 거의 도착한 것 같았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_31572_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold
msgctxt "95f6cc62-36af-44ed-943a-36c9c0222832"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a group of kobolds gathered before the troll lair entrance. They "
"seem hesitant to proceed. It's typically hard to make out differences "
"between kobolds, but this group seems familiar. This seems to be the same "
"group you recently met at the forest path, though it looks like many of "
"kobolds didn't make it this far.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤 은신처 입구에 코볼트 무리가 보입니다. 그들은 들어가기를 주저하는 것처럼 보입니다. 코볼트들의 특징을 파악하기는 힘들었지만 이 "
"녀석들은 친숙합니다. 코볼트가 이렇게 멀리 왔을 것 같지는 않지만 이 녀석들은 당신이 숲길에서 만났던 무리입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_47944_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold
msgctxt "5eab648a-d8d3-4d2b-9a77-4ce36de6ef7d"
msgid "\"Eetinsss.\""
msgstr "\"엣틴드을.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_58275_Text
#. Speaker : TrollGatekeeper_1
msgctxt "90275997-cd74-4ca5-ba69-befcac2618c3"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll frowns and scratches his head. He doesn't seem to understand "
"the kobolds or have any idea what they want from him.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트롤은 눈살을 찌푸리고 그의 머리를 긁습니다. 그는 코볼트를 이해하지 못하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_70346_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold
msgctxt "dcab4e5d-308c-44bb-8623-d72187e52d3a"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a group of kobolds gathered before the troll lair entrance. They "
"seem hesitant to proceed. It's typically hard to make out differences "
"between kobolds, but this group seems familiar. This seems to be the same "
"group you recently met at the forest path.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤 은신처 입구에 코볼트 무리가 보입니다. 그들은 들어가기를 주저하는 것처럼 보입니다. 코볼트들의 특징을 파악하기는 힘들었지만 이 "
"녀석들은 친숙합니다. 코볼트가 이렇게 멀리 왔을 것 같지는 않지만 이 녀석들은 당신이 숲길에서 만났던 무리입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_75531_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "fc6dbe56-a00b-44a6-a40b-f20bbd10cac9"
msgid ""
"\"Garasssuk! Greetingsss!\" {n}The kobold extends his hand and stares at one "
"of the troll guards.{/n}"
msgstr "\"가라슈크! 안녕!\" {n}코볼트는 손을 뻗으며 트롤 경비 하나를 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/Cue_80023_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "3af9fa32-04db-4869-abdc-86899ba2c8c6"
msgid ""
"{n}You see the same kobold shaman you recently met at the forest path. It "
"looks like he and his band managed to reach the troll lair.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 전에 숲길에서 만난 코볼트 샤먼을 만났습니다. 그와 그의 패거리가 트롤 소굴에 거의 도착한 것 같았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/KoboldsOnMarch_End_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : TrollGatekeeper_2
msgctxt "6cdda2cf-03b6-4407-8608-8ee9b5727432"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold can go {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}! Home!\" {n}the troll announces, "
"letting the kobolds enter.{/n}"
msgstr "\"코볼트는 {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}로 간다! 집으로!\" {n}트롤이 말하고 코볼트를 들여줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/Kobolds/KoboldsOnMarch_Start_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : Kobold
msgctxt "fed666ac-6c0a-438b-b63d-792a6e023728"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a group of kobolds gathered around two trolls, who seem to be "
"guarding the entrance to the troll lair. The kobolds seem hesitant, but the "
"bravest of the gang — he seems to be their shaman — steps forward.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤 은신처의 입구를 지키는 트롤 경비 둘 주위에 코볼트가 모여있는 것을 당신은 보았습니다. 코볼트는 주저하지만 샤먼으로 보이는 "
"가장 용감한 코볼트가 걸어나옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_24865_Text
msgctxt "14d27479-10a8-4dd9-8aa8-56d2edc4e0b7"
msgid "[Leave] \"I've no interest in you.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"난 너희들한테 관심 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_28104_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "90db1d13-73dc-4c44-a6f7-70c790b3de3c"
msgid "Spared the leaderless kobolds."
msgstr "우두머리 없는 코볼트를 살려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_28104_Text
msgctxt "f0028c76-ab03-4ff1-8a95-31f122478207"
msgid ""
"\"I defeated Tartuk because he wouldn't live by my laws, but I let him go "
"after he repented. If you swear to stop attacking humans, I'll do the same "
"for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭은 법을 어겼기 때문에 물리쳤지만 그가 뉘우치고 난 후 놓아주었다. 인간을 공격하지 않겠다고 맹세한다면 너희도 놓아주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_28980_Text
msgctxt "2f165311-77ac-44dd-af2c-eb61f3bb0871"
msgid "\"What are you doing here? What do you want?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있는 거야? 뭘 원해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_32223_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "87ffc5ed-8c26-4dc7-870e-1058d836fde1"
msgid "Exiled the leaderless kobolds."
msgstr "우두머리 없는 코볼트를 쫓아냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_32223_Text
msgctxt "351603d2-9a9f-4160-9272-768405422a17"
msgid ""
"\"I've destroyed your home, and I can kill you just as easily. Get out of my "
"barony, and never return!\""
msgstr "\"내가 너희들의 집을 파괴했고 너희들 역시 쉽게 죽일 수 있다. 내 영지에서 나가서 다시는 돌아오지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_35540_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "05c7215f-8a22-4e0a-b1de-a36c04fd537c"
msgid "Massacred the leaderless kobolds."
msgstr "우두머리 없는 코볼트를 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_35540_Text
msgctxt "a4cfc81f-a000-4ad7-9c03-80ac4a1bf1ea"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Ah, more kobolds! And here I was worred we'd all but run out.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"아! 코볼트구나! 너희가 도망갔을까봐 걱정했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_95965_Text
msgctxt "a3173a4d-4fa0-48a9-9398-cdc73130d9b1"
msgid "\"Do any of you speak common?\""
msgstr "\"너희 중 공용어를 하는 자는 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_98828_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d7561468-6ca7-4485-8e06-90174fa7e7ad"
msgid "Left the leaderless kobolds alone."
msgstr "우두머리 없는 코볼트를 내버려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Answer_98828_Text
msgctxt "10563dec-e897-4836-a7f3-0f6768c3e47c"
msgid ""
"\"I killed Tartuk because he wouldn't live by my laws. If you want to live, "
"stop attacking humans, or you'll meet the same fate he did.\""
msgstr "\"타툭은 법을 어겼기 때문에 죽였다. 살고 싶으면 인간을 그만 공격해라. 그렇지 않으면 그와 같은 운명을 맞을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Cue_08135_Text
#. Speaker : TalkingKoboldCitizen
msgctxt "f8d68673-8919-46dd-a626-3193ce289609"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobolds remain silent, but some of them stir as if understanding — "
"but also in fear, as if afraid to answer.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트들은 침묵을 지키고 있지만 그들 중 일부는 이해한 것처럼 보입니다. 하지만 두려움에 사로잡혀, 대답하지 못하는 것 "
"같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Cue_21026_Text
#. Speaker : TalkingKoboldCitizen
msgctxt "11cea3cf-b27f-4f27-bfe5-c8e1626879ff"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobolds show no reaction to your words. It's unclear whether they "
"understood a single word you said.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 당신의 말에 아무런 반응을 보이지 않습니다. 그들이 당신이 한 말을 이해했는지 분명하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Cue_21591_Text
#. Speaker : TalkingKoboldCitizen
msgctxt "4788e402-b341-43b1-8b64-04e3abc86d15"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobolds make no sound. They simply stand and look at you, following "
"you with their unblinking eyes as though waiting for something. The kobolds "
"step away when you try to leave, making no move to block your way, but their "
"silent attention is somewhat uncomfortable.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 아무 소리도 내지 않습니다. 그들은 서서 눈을 깜빡이며 무언가를 기다리듯 당신을 바라봅니다. 당신이 떠나려 하자 코보트들은 "
"길을 막으려하지 않고 오히려 뒤로 물러서지만, 왠지 그들이 침묵하며 보인 관심은 다소 불편하게 느껴졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Cue_26013_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "093eba4c-50e5-40a5-a138-3f600003eb6f"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia touches your hand to get your attention.{/n} \"They're "
"frightened! Remember, how they used to repeat all unknown words?\" {n}She "
"shivers.{/n} \"Let's leave them be. They've suffered enough.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신의 주의를 끌기 위해 당신의 손을 만집니다.{/n} \"그들은 두려워 해! 그들이 알 수 없는 단어를 반복한 걸 "
"기억해? \" {n}그녀는 떱니다.{/n} \"그들을 보내자. 그들은 충분히 고생했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Cue_42760_Text
#. Speaker : TalkingKoboldCitizen
msgctxt "a6266e94-a02e-4200-bea1-a74e3a721b9f"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd of kobolds parts before you and closes silently behind you as "
"you pass. After several steps, you turn around and see that the kobolds are "
"drifting apart, going separate ways.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트 무리가 갈라지며 당신 앞에 길을 내어주고는 당신이 지나가자 조용히 다시 합쳐졌습니다. 몇 걸음 지나 뒤돌아 보니, 코볼트들이 "
"서로 흩어져 목적지 없이 발걸음을 옮기며 서로 다른 길을 가는 모습이 보였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Cue_60476_Text
#. Speaker : TalkingKoboldCitizen
msgctxt "68077b74-3766-4f57-ac3e-74bca70e357c"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobolds keep looking at you silently. Just when you think they may "
"not answer, one speaks.{/n} \"Kobold. Hearsss. Underssstandsss.\" {n}He then "
"falls silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 계속 조용히 바라보고 있습니다. 대답을 기대하기 어렵다고 생각들 때쯤, 그들 중 한명이 말합니다.{/n} \"코볼트. "
"들었다. 이해했다.\" {n}그리고 그는 다시 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Cue_78160_Text
#. Speaker : TalkingKoboldCitizen
msgctxt "ce42de21-7271-4a33-b369-c3e24befa21e"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobolds stay silent. Quivering somewhat, they keep their eyes on you "
"as you pass by.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트들은 침묵을 지키고 있습니다. 다소 몸을 떨면서도 눈은 당신을 계속 주시하고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/KoboldsCitizens/Cue_85641_Text
#. Speaker : TalkingKoboldCitizen
msgctxt "08c1cb70-7df4-48d9-b922-141b98c6edbb"
msgid ""
"{n}A small crowd of kobolds surrounds you. They look frail and thin, their "
"skin covered with sores and claw marks. Even the tattered skins they wear "
"are falling apart.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}적은 수의 코볼드 무리가 당신을 둘러쌉니다. 그들의 피부는 상처와 발톱 자국으로 덮여 있고, 연약하고 여위어 보인다. 심지어 그들이 "
"입은 너덜너덜한 가죽도 조각조각 떨어지고 있다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "6bfebdf8-efab-4944-b0b8-8b3aaad601f3"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0e19cdda-edb2-41a2-8aa8-f8d009186feb"
msgid "\"Aren't you mad at me?\""
msgstr "\"너 나한테 화난 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f287dbe7-2e48-492e-9221-3b697a5780e2"
msgid "\"You don't eat people?\""
msgstr "\"너는 사람들을 먹지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "6fc557c0-43ca-4338-a3bc-f1bd0dbcac81"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "009bb6e4-b106-48a1-8bdc-734c7d6d64f6"
msgid "Degraded Jazon the peaceful troll."
msgstr "평화로운 트롤 재즌을 깍아내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "75fda2a6-faa4-4155-8c32-12d83196c845"
msgid ""
"\"You're not human and you never will be! You're nothing more than a "
"disgusting parody.\""
msgstr "\"너는 인간이 아니고 앞으로도 그러지 않을 거야! 너는 역겨운 괴물일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "bcee5237-95c6-496c-a8e3-2bd8d1c434e4"
msgid "[Leave] \"Farewell, Jazon.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕. 재즌.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a01118bc-9493-46a8-95b6-0e57591e2357"
msgid "Murdered Jazon the peaceful troll."
msgstr "평화로운 트롤 재즌을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "1434dc15-40f1-41f9-802e-e5d00e3c09a9"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"A monster is always a monster. I'll free my lands from your kind!"
"\""
msgstr "[공격] \"괴물은 항상 괴물이야. 나는 너 같은 종에게서 내 땅을 구할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8dcb5e1f-f96c-4232-99b4-0f5ef8270a28"
msgid ""
"{n}At the ruined gates of {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}, you see Jazon walking "
"alone. Seeing you, he waves his hand.{/n} \"Hello, borba. Why you come here?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}의 파괴된 성문에서 당신은 혼자 걷고 있는 재즌을 만납니다. 당신을 보자 그는 손을 "
"흔들었습니다.{/n} \"안녕. 보바. 왜 여기 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "3fb87acb-4192-4f35-b0ac-f50cb0b2902e"
msgid ""
"{n}Jazon shakes his head.{/n} \"Borba killed trolls, but it wasn't borba who "
"started war. Hargulka wanted war, got what he wanted. {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} "
"fell because of its king.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌이 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"보바가 트롤을 죽였지만 전쟁을 시작한 것은 보바가 아니었다. 하굴카는 전쟁을 원했고 그가 원하는 "
"것을 얻었다. {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}는 왕 때문에 망했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "95362e87-cb90-40bf-88e9-7d6dc6be5641"
msgid ""
"\"Jazon lives here. {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} is no more, but stone walls still "
"stand. Plenty of space, plenty of food in woods. Plenty of time to think.\""
msgstr ""
"\"재즌은 여기에 산다. {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g} 더 이상은 존재하지 않지만 돌벽은 여전히 있다. 땅도 넓고 숲에 음식이 "
"가득하다. 생각할 시간이 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "f4bc6ed4-bdbe-43dd-b495-911440966be8"
msgid ""
"\"No. Jazon does as he decided. No attacking people in villages. Eats only "
"forest borba — deer, boar, but not people. Jazon wash his fur, brush his "
"fangs. {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} is no more, but Jazon is still Jazon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 재즌은 결심한 대로 행동한다. 마을 사람들은 공격하지 않는다. 사슴, 멧돼지 같은 숲의 보바만 먹는다. 재즌은 털을 씻고 "
"송곳니를 닦는다. {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}는 더 이상 존재하지 않지만 재즌은 여전히 재즌이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "005f2b3e-bdaf-461a-97ec-40ee9955a055"
msgid ""
"\"Me Jazon. Had another name before. Like other trolls, went hunting, ate "
"borba. Then Tartuk came, talked to trolls. Explained how humans live. Jazon "
"not as smart as Tartuk, but Jazon saw... humans live better. Jazon stop "
"eating humans, started wash his fur and brush his fangs. Other trolls said "
"Jazon was crazy. Now other trolls are no more. Only Jazon left.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 재즌. 이전에는 다른 이름 있었다. 다른 트롤처럼 사냥 가고 보바 먹었다. 그런데 타툭 와서 트롤에게 말을 걸었다. 인간이 "
"어떻게 사는지 설명했다. 재즌은 타툭처럼 똑똑하지 않지만 재즌은 보았다... 인간이 잘 사는 것을. 재즌은 인간 먹는 것 그만두고 털도 "
"씻고 송곳니도 닦았다. 다른 트롤들은 재즌이 미쳤다고 했다. 이제 다른 트롤들은 없다. 재즌만이 남았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "07548e0b-c7ca-4412-b787-7ee764fed21b"
msgid ""
"{n}Jazon bares his teeth and roars. For a moment, it seems like he's about "
"to charge you, but he instead pounds the nearest rock with his fist, sending "
"rock shards flying.{/n} \"Don't say so, borba! Jazon give everything to be "
"Jazon! Jazon won't go back!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌은 이를 갈고 포효합니다. 잠시 동안 그는 당신에게 달려들 것 같지만 그는 대신에 주먹으로 근처의 바위를 쳤고 파편이 "
"날라갑니다.{/n} \"그렇게 말하지 마! 보바! 재즌은 재즌이 되기 위해 모든 것 줬다! 재즌 돌아가지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/LonelyJason/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "870c1ce8-dbea-48f2-b2b4-fadf1238cac1"
msgid "\"Jazon monster? No, borba. You monster.\""
msgstr "\"재즌이 괴물이라고? 아니다. 보바. 너가 괴물이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ad0dcdc7-9c49-4224-9830-a5b76e337863"
msgid "\"How is the kobold settlement faring?\""
msgstr "\"코볼트와의 타협은 어떻게 이루어지고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f0f1a4cd-e420-4492-b52c-13799335665a"
msgid ""
"\"I still want to understand what happened to you. So you came back to life "
"and turned into a kobold, Tartuccio?\""
msgstr "\"나는 아직도 너에게 일어난 일을 이해하고 싶어. 그래서 너는 다시 돌아와 코볼트로 변한 거야? 타투치오?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a9a0c40e-d7b0-4703-80d0-15a1fb72bdf3"
msgid ""
"\"By now you should know much about kobolds. Tell me about your people.\""
msgstr "\"너는 이제 코볼트에 대해 많이 알아야 해. 너의 종족에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d381e1ed-ea9d-4135-9d87-914fd47fec9e"
msgid "\"I'd like to visit the dungeon.\""
msgstr "\"나는 던전을 방문하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a0dde89f-0417-4b4d-960f-d9c821487a71"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "b1b697f8-3193-43da-9ece-58c6911f9900"
msgid "\"Aren't you a bit, um, small to call yourselves dragonkin?\""
msgstr "\"네가... 음... 용의 친척이라고 말하기에는 조금 작지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "6b5a576e-ead8-49b8-ae78-70b55053e53e"
msgid "\"Dragons, you say? Your people have common roots?\""
msgstr "\"드래곤이라고? 너희는 같은 뿌리를 가졌다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "c759b530-310e-433b-b536-8800f0399d7a"
msgid "\"Do you worship any gods?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어떤 신을 숭배하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "65af53d1-8e27-4f86-9854-1686e510d2f3"
msgid "\"It seems like kobolds can survive anywhere.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트는 어디서든 생존할 수 있는 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "c8c17bdf-16b3-4615-8d80-719e6841f307"
msgid ""
"\"You're quite a warlike people. Couldn't even maintain your alliance with "
"the mites at the Old Sycamore. Are kobolds peaceful with anyone?\""
msgstr "\"너희는 정말 호전적이구나. 시카모어에서 마이트와도 동맹을 유지할 수 없었어. 코볼트는 누구와도 평화로운가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "8adf91ac-1e2a-4d7f-9e89-e5d751f9061d"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "4677b294-551a-46d5-a0cb-5a83104086a0"
msgid "\"There could have been something valuable in there!\""
msgstr "\"거기에 뭔가 가치있는 것이 있을 수도 있었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "fcc67429-c8dd-4718-a7d9-a32ee247cf16"
msgid "\"You did the right thing. What's done is done.\""
msgstr "\"네가 옳은 일을했다. 이미 저질러진 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "b80a8dc9-d752-4e3a-a6ea-8ed04516e9c9"
msgid "\"So, your people haven't overthrown you yet?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너희 백성들은 아직 너를 쫓아내지 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "749e2164-cdbe-4856-a8c2-68ab52c0619d"
msgid ""
"\"I hope there have been no incidents with my other subjects. If I were to "
"hear of any attacks or robberies...\""
msgstr "\"내 다른 부하들에게 사고가 발생하지 않았으면 좋겠어. 공격이나 약탈의 소식을 듣지 않으면 좋겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0048_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "911cfb99-fad2-4578-8c30-e973b89c87d6"
msgid "Attacked kobolds after making peace with them."
msgstr "코볼트와 평화를 맺은 후에 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "6e21d4fc-e965-4f68-ada5-be66597d10d4"
msgid "[Attack] \"I grow tired of you vermin!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너희 해충 같은 녀석들이 질렸어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "5a529094-0688-4eb9-a00b-ca84e989590a"
msgid "\"Does your tribe have dealings with the Sootscale Tribe?\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족은 수트스케일 부족과 거래하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1f81463a-2368-4d17-ac75-b342b4a82159"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk watches as you approach. You can see his cold eyes peering at you "
"through the sockets of his horse-skull helmet.{/n} \"Ssso. Here "
"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen} comesss.\" {n}Tartuk speaks slowly and "
"deliberately.{/n} \"How... may I... ssserve?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 다가오는 것을 타툭이 지켜봅니다. 말 두개골 투구 속에서 당신을 보는 그의 차가운 눈이 보입니다. {/n} \"좋아. 드디어 "
"왔구나.\" {n}타툭은 천천히 그리고 의도적으로 말합니다.{/n} \"어떻게... 내가... 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "18e69e2c-33a3-488f-baf9-def158dcba89"
msgid "\"Yes, Your Grac-ssse?\""
msgstr "\"응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "a0bdb750-9641-4eca-9964-6fd1bc5c7cc8"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk turns his head and watches you with a glint in his eye.{/n} "
"\"Sssplendid. Kobolds have their own plac-ssse now. Their kingdom. Silenc-"
"ssse. Darknesss. Plenty of animalsss in the foressst, and no one bothersss "
"koboldsss.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 머리를 돌려 당신을 지켜봅니다.{/n} \"대단하다. 이제는 코볼트의 장소가 있다. 왕국이 있다. 조용하고 어둡다. 숲에는 "
"동물도 많고 누구도 코볼트 괴롭히지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "11d9d762-34b5-4e1e-b35b-c59a96005def"
msgid ""
"\"Old dungeon isss gone. We collapsssed the c-ssseilingssss, dug new "
"tunnelsss. Now koboldsss dig their densss. Widen the tunnelsss. Lay trapsss."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래된 던전은 사라졌다. 우리는 예전 것을 무너뜨리고 새로운 터널을 팠다. 이제 코볼트 동굴 생겼다. 터널 넓혔다. 덫도 놨다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "b4fb74ef-fd03-4db7-8a06-9e30f833b8a5"
msgid "\"What do you wisssh to know about the dragonkin?\""
msgstr "\"드래곤의 친척에 대해 알고 싶은 게 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "1ee65868-f6d4-4ace-9a3e-11fb813fe9a2"
msgid ""
"\"Marauder? Here.\" {n}Tartuk gestures toward another nearby kobold with his "
"chin.{/n} \"He'sss asss curiousss asss you. Sssnatched much troll rubbisssh "
"from the old dungeon. Asssk him. He tradesss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"약탈자? 여기.\" {n}타툭은 턱짓으로 가까운 코볼트를 카리킵니다.{/n} \"그는 너 만큼이나 호기심이 많다. 오래된 던전에스 "
"트롤 물건 많이 얻었다. 그에게 물어봐. 그는 거래한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "7b91c6ab-e9c1-4063-879d-d40245393d71"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk lowers his head.{/n} \"We wanted a fresssh ssstart. No more "
"deathsss. Not koboldsss, nor humansss.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"우리는 새로운 시작하고 싶다. 더 이상 죽음을 원하지 않는다. 코볼트도 인간도 죽지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "ba348912-f665-45d4-9d64-9ca398bfd351"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, {name}. Many legendsss keep the memory of our creation. Let me tell "
"you one. Long, long ago, there were only two beingsss, Apsssu and Tiamat. "
"They were the anc-sssessstorsss of the godsss, and of the universsse "
"itssself. They created many deitiesss, but the greatessst of them wasss "
"Dahak the Dessstroyer, with the everburning fire in hisss heart. Where "
"othersss wanted to create, Dahak wissshed only to burn and kill. Even hisss "
"own offssspring could not avoid hisss wrathhh.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. {name}. 많은 전설이 우리가 만들어진 기억을 간직하고 있다. 내가 말해 줄께. 아주 오래 전 압수와 티아매트만이 있었어. "
"그들은 신과 우주의 조상이었지. 그들은 많은 여신들을 창조했지만 최고는 영원히 불타는 심장을 가진 파괴신 다하크였어. 다른 신들은 창조를 "
"하고 싶었지만 다하크는 파괴만을 원했지. 그의 자식도 그의 분노를 피할 수 없었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "ca7c2c2c-c3f5-48ec-90de-76c170d5cb01"
msgid ""
"\"Countlesss dragonsss fell victim to Dahak'sss wrathhh. There were ssso "
"many deathsss, Apsssu himssself dec-sssided to ssstand againssst thisss "
"madnesss and ssstop hisss own ssson. When the two dragonsss classshed, the "
"world trembled under their feet. The sssky boiled from the flapping of their "
"wingsss. The young world hasss never ssseen a battle more furiousss than "
"that of Apsssu the Creator and Dahak the Dessstroyer. Finally, asss Dahak "
"began to overpower hisss father, Apsssu fled the battle, leaving hisss "
"ssspawn in the ruinsss. He barely sssurvived.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수많은 드래곤이 다하크의 분노에 의해 희생자가 되었어. 너무나 많은 죽음이 있었고 압수 자신의 아들이 내는 광기를 멈추기로 결정했다. "
"두 드래곤이 충돌했을 때 세계는 그들의 발 밑에서 떨었어. 하늘은 그들의 날개짓으로 끓어올랐다. 초기의 세계는 창조신 압수와 파괴신 "
"다하크의 싸움 같은 것을 처음 경험했다. 마침내 다하크가 그의 아버지의 힘을 능가하자 압수는 전투에서 도망쳤고 그의 자손들을 폐허에 "
"버려두었다. 그는 살아남지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "b3d46a90-0120-4200-8456-3494e4497eab"
msgid ""
"\"The triumph of Dahak did not lassst long. When the veil of rage fell from "
"hisss eyesss, he sssaw what he had done. A ssstrange pain hit the heart of "
"the Dessstroyer — for the firssst and lassst time, he ssshed tearsss of "
"ssshame over the dead bodiesss of ssslain dragonsss. Rainbow-colored tearsss "
"fell on the ssscorched ground — and each of great Dahak'sss tearsss became a "
"kobold, whossse ssscalesss were the sssame color asss the tear that gave "
"them birthhh.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다하크의 승리는 오래 가지 못했다. 그의 눈에서 분노의 베일이 벗겨졌을 때 그는 자신이 한 짓을 보게 되었다. 이상한 고통의 파괴신의 "
"마음을 아프게 했다. 처음이자 마지막으로 그는 죽임 당한 드래곤의 시체 앞에서 눈물을 흘렸다. 무지갯빛으로 빛나는 눈물이 타버린 땅에 "
"떨어졌을 때 다하크의 눈물은 코볼트가 되었고 그래서 코볼트의 피부도 그들이 태어난 눈물과 같은 색인 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "23d9c75a-08a1-4d7a-aa33-78bf659c8b48"
msgid ""
"\"But our kin is ssso numerousss! All corners of the earthhh are digged with "
"our tunnelsss. There isss no mountain we cannot dig beneathhh. There are no "
"depthsss we can't reach!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 우리의 친척은 엄청나게 많다! 세계 곳곳에 우리가 판 터널이 있다. 우리가 파지 못하는 산은 없다. 우리가 도달하지 못하는 "
"곳은 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "617a5c0d-4828-4642-8954-58f14be5b758"
msgid ""
"\"Dragonsss themssselvesss pay tribute to our kin and bid usss ssserve them. "
"Only koboldsss have the sssacred duty of protecting and sssafeguarding "
"dragon eggsss! You may mock our sssizzze as you wisssh, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, but you mussst know — we ssshare the sssame "
"blood of our great anc-sssessstorsss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"드래곤은 우리가 그들을 섬기게 허락했다. 코볼트만이 드래곤의 알을 보호하는 임무를 가진다! 네 마음대로 비웃어도 되지만 너는 반드시 "
"알아야 한다. 우리는 위대한 조상과 같은 피가 흐른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "345a3765-8331-4c82-a6b9-83181254ed4b"
msgid ""
"\"Each tribe worssshipsss a divine patron. We? We're dessscendantsss of "
"Dahak the Dessstroyer, Father of Dragonsss, Primogenitor of Koboldsss. Our "
"tribe dedicatesss ritualsss to Dahak and Dahak only.\""
msgstr ""
"\"각각의 부족은 신적 후원자를 섬긴다. 우리? 우리는 파괴신 드래곤의 아버지 코볼트의 선조인 다하크의 후손이다. 우리 부족은 "
"다하크에게만 의식을 치룬다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "7e968be0-e4e5-4eae-b3b6-cce9f8b73604"
msgid ""
"\"There isss no plac-ssse kobolds can't sssurvive. If the sssurfac-ssse isss "
"dangerousss, we dig tunnelsss and go under. If sssomeone followsss usss, "
"they perisssh in our trapsss. If the enemy passsesss the trapsss — they die "
"becaussse of poissson in our flesssh!\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트가 살아남지 못할 땅은 없다. 지상이 위험해지면 우리는 터널을 파고 내려간다. 누군가 우리를 쫓아오면 그들은 우리 덫에 사라질 "
"것이다. 적이 덫을 지나가면 그들은 우리 살로 만든 독으로 죽는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "710dfb11-219e-416e-a209-f75bcb40df62"
msgid ""
"\"Dessscendantsss of dragonsss have no need for alliesss.\" {n}Tartuk "
"squints at you.{/n} \"Unlesss we have no other choic-sssesss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"드래곤의 후손은 동맹이 필요하지 않다.\" {n}타툭이 당신의 눈치를 봅니다.{/n} \"우리가 다른 선택의 여지가 없다면 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "da7032a8-31bc-432d-a558-48b23f7e37f4"
msgid "{n}Tartuk looks at you with unblinking eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}타툭은 눈도 깜짝하지 않고 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "19413319-f092-4338-be8e-6bbdafc312b4"
msgid ""
"\"Overthrow? Why would they? I gave them home. Essstablissshed the colony. "
"It did not work out ex-sssactly asss planned, but ssstill. Koboldsss are "
"loyal to me like never before.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전복해? 왜 그랬을까? 나는 그들 집 줬다. 식민지 짓게 해줬다. 계획대로 되지 않았지만 효과는 있다. 코볼트는 어느 때보다 더 "
"나에게 충성한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "3a95922a-cabb-40ec-ba47-1a4f2c4c14f8"
msgid ""
"\"Koboldsss remember kindnesss.\" {n}Tartuk interrupts.{/n} \"Koboldsss "
"remember merc-sssy. I promisssed to be your vasssal. I keep my promissse. "
"Koboldsss have no need to intrude on humans — woodsss and dungeonsss provide "
"enough plac-ssse for usss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트는 친절을 기억한다.\" {n}타툭이 끼어듭니다.{/n} \"코볼트는 자비를 기억한다. 나는 너의 친구가 되기로 약속했다. "
"코볼트는 인간을 침략할 필요가 없다. 숲과 던전으로 우리는 충분한 공간이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "f0129a66-e463-4bdb-bbdb-13e840f682d5"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't make an allianccce with the trolls, but you gave me a chanccce. "
"A chanccce for all the koboldsss.\""
msgstr "\"트롤들과 동맹을 맺을 수 없었지만 너는 나에게 기회를 주었다. 모든 코볼트를 위한 기회를.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TartukFriendly/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "7edce019-c637-4b70-bfb6-800f7b01aa40"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk wheezes indignantly.{/n} \"No! Chief Sssootssscale said he would "
"ssskin me as a trickssster and a traitor! Very well, I will not ssscatter "
"these nobodiesss, sssince they are your alliesss. But if they become "
"ussselesss... jussst let me know!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 화를 냅니다.{/n} \"안돼! 수트스케일 대장이 반역자가 된 내 껍질을 벗길 거라고 했어! 좋아. 이 녀석들이 너의 "
"동맹이니 이제는 쫓아내겠어. 그들이 쓸모가 없어지면... 나에게 알려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "6347f522-e094-4cc5-be59-3a00a6775d4e"
msgid "\"Trolls don't eat people anymore?\""
msgstr "\"트롤은 사람을 더 이상 먹지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "23f83078-f8a9-4b5e-8292-6b3c99f9dbae"
msgid "\"What are you doing now?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "43f3e724-f8e8-4074-b7a0-df9c3cf9fc65"
msgid "Changed your mind and massacred the trolls of Trobold."
msgstr "마음을 바꾸어 트로볼트의 트롤을 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e2c7484c-9d7a-4d42-955c-d61871f27c91"
msgid "[Attack] \"It was a mistake to let you live.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너를 살게 하는 것은 실수였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6908ac0b-1d6c-4c0f-9087-89be6c3ee98e"
msgid "\"I have to go. Have a good life here in Trobold!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 트로볼트에서 좋은 인생을 보내라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "492442f4-b5f4-4b33-a6e5-18431ec53af4"
msgid "\"How are things going in Trobold?\""
msgstr "\"트로볼트는 요즘 어떻지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "824b50f5-3709-44a4-8c33-4e8b6444ab81"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "b1841c9b-4618-48dc-a9b2-6768834ce2ff"
msgid "\"You don't eat people?\""
msgstr "\"너는 사람들을 먹지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4f9a9b2c-c48e-4b17-8c86-2f81bce47444"
msgid ""
"{n}Jazon gives you an awkward bow.{/n} \"Hello, human {mf|king|queen}. Jazon "
"happy that rulers have an agreement. No more war, no one eats no one else.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌은 당신에게 어색하게 인사합니다.{/n} \"안녕. 인간 왕. 재즌은 지도자들이 합의해서 기쁘다. 전쟁도 없고 아무도 잡아먹지 "
"않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "f72698ba-8fcc-4d49-9f1b-8815c29bcd23"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} is a mess, trash everywhere. Trolls clean up, brush "
"up, try to be like borba- humans! Me mean try to be like humans. We have "
"real town soon, just like yours!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}는 엉망이고 쓰레기가 넘쳐난다. 트롤은 청소하고 닦고 보바 인간처럼 행동한다! 내 말은 인간 "
"말이다. 우리는 너희처럼 진짜 마을도 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "a65264ab-ab5e-492d-b948-18c742f5425b"
msgid ""
"\"No! King Hargulka forbid hard! One troll brought a killed human recently, "
"and king tore off troll's arms and legs — troll still trying grow them back! "
"King keeps his promises!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안돼! 하굴카 왕이 금지했다! 트롤이 죽은 인간 가져왔고 왕은 그 트롤의 팔다리 찢어버렸다. 그 트롤은 아직도 팔다리 자라고 있다! "
"왕은 약속 지킨다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8c08f118-1022-4a8c-928f-c9ff4348c110"
msgid "\"Why?!\""
msgstr "\"왜?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "7e59f99e-bb0b-4175-a0c8-fc53df4e7a75"
msgid ""
"\"Without Tartuk, kobolds scattered. No immortality now, eating borba "
"forbidden... many trolls disliked and left too. If some trolls attack you, "
"don't be mad us, they not ours! Not much of us left, but we have plenty "
"borba around — deers, boars, sometimes lizardfolk... But never humans, no "
"one eat humans! That true! Jazon tell no lies!\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭이 없으면 코볼트가 흩어졌을 거다. 불멸자가 없는 지금 보바 먹는 것은 금지되었다... 많은 트롤들이 싫어해서 떠났다. 트롤이 "
"너를 공격하면 우리에게 화내지 말아라. 우리 아니다! 우리 중 소수가 떠났지만 주위에 사슴, 멧돼지, 가끔은 도마뱀 인간 같은 보바가 "
"여전히 많다... 하지만 인간은 아니다. 아무도 인간 먹지 않는다! 사실이다! 재즌 거짓말 안한다! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "17b524c9-bd3d-473e-9d29-92e96385c558"
msgid "{n}The troll waves farewell.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트롤은 작별 인사를 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "b9c2ba05-e3cf-4f5d-ba27-4ac26591396b"
msgid ""
"\"Me Jazon. Had another name before. Like other trolls, went hunting, ate "
"borba. Then Tartuk came, talked to trolls. Explained how humans live. Jazon "
"not as smart as Tartuk, but Jazon saw... humans live better. Jazon stop "
"eating humans, started wash his fur and brush his fangs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 재즌. 이전에는 다른 이름 있었다. 다른 트롤처럼 사냥 가고 보바 먹었다. 그런데 타툭이 와서 트롤에게 말을 걸었다. 인간이 "
"어떻게 사는지 설명했다. 재즌은 타툭처럼 똑똑하지 않지만 재즌은 보았다... 인간이 잘 사는 것을. 재즌은 인간 먹는 것 그만두고 털도 "
"씻고 송곳니도 닦았다. 다른 트롤들은 재즌이 미쳤다고 했다. 이제 다른 트롤들은 없다. 재즌만이 남았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "f1f184f0-1fdd-4291-acef-07146f14156e"
msgid ""
"\"Other trolls said Jazon was crazy. Now other trolls wash their fur too! "
"Good when there no war. Jazon happy.\""
msgstr "\"다른 트롤들은 재즌이 미쳤다고 말했다. 이제 다른 트롤들도 털을 씻는다. 전쟁이 없을 때 좋다. 재즌 행복하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "bcbbf379-c152-41d8-8d59-cfbf487da4ec"
msgid ""
"\"Other trolls said Jazon was crazy. Now they dead or fled. Jazon stayed, "
"lives with kobolds. Good when there is peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 트롤들은 재슨이 미쳤다고 말했다. 이제 그들은 죽거나 도망 갔고 재즌은 코볼트와 함께 살았다. 평화가 있을 때 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "dacde47d-44bc-46e1-911a-67251dd48492"
msgid ""
"\"Without Hargulka, trolls scattered. Became wild, like before — they run "
"around forest, kill borba. Jazon lives with kobolds. They are tiny, food is "
"plenty. Tartuk tells interesting things. Jazon listens. Helps with heavy "
"stuff. Everyone happy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하굴카 없으면 트롤들 흩어진다. 다시 거칠어져서 숲을 뛰어 다니며 보바를 죽인다. 재즌은 코볼트와 함께 살고 있다. 그들은 작고 "
"음식도 풍부하다. 타툭은 흥미로운 것을 이야기한다. 재즌은 듣는다. 무거운 물건 드는 것 도와준다. 모두 행복하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "30e32a68-19b5-4b32-ac05-876bdadd261a"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} is a mess, trash everywhere. Kobolds clean up, "
"brush up, try to be like borba- humans! Me mean try to be like humans. Jazon "
"helps them. Lifts heavy stones. We work hard. We have real town soon, just "
"like yours!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}는 엉망이고 쓰레기가 넘쳐난다. 트롤은 청소하고 닦고 보바 인간처럼 행동한다! 내 말은 인간 "
"말이다. 우리는 너희처럼 진짜 마을도 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "c247044e-2855-4628-85ec-588302d41caa"
msgid ""
"\"Also, Tartuk says humans are smart because they look at magic papers. "
"Jazon found one! Soon Jazon become smart, just like humans!\" {n}The troll "
"proudly shows off a half-torn book of children's fairy tales, thickly "
"smeared with blood.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"타툭은 인간들이 마법의 종이 봐서 똑똑하다고 말했다. 재즌도 하나 찾았다! 곧 재즌도 인간처럼 똑똑해진다!\" {n}트롤은 피가 묻고 "
"반쯤 찢어진 어린이 동화책을 자랑스럽게 보여줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyJason/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ddc66b74-55e9-4930-99b4-1c833b73407e"
msgid ""
"\"No. Jazon decided — Jazon does as decided. Deer and boar are borba. Dwarf "
"and human are not borba. Tartuk says, 'Good for you, Jazon, you get it "
"right!'\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 재즌 결정했다. 재즌 결정한 대로 행동한다. 사슴과 멧돼지가 보바다. 드워프와 인간은 보바 아니다. 타툭이 말했다. 잘했다고. "
"잘 하고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyVendor/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "3cc5358b-cd13-44da-9389-5f6bfecb90c0"
msgid "\"I've never seen a troll trader before.\""
msgstr "\"트롤 상인은 본 적이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyVendor/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "f1f8ce44-1a94-4132-a1cd-ca2caba4ac07"
msgid "[Trade] \"Show me what you have.\""
msgstr "[거래] \"네가 가진 것을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyVendor/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "57e28ee0-760b-4169-9a17-368e321e33a4"
msgid "Changed your mind and massacred the trolls of Trobold."
msgstr "마음을 바꾸어 트로볼트의 트롤을 학살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyVendor/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c0affc89-ef93-4360-9c6f-d0878e9ae5c8"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll take all your wares. For free.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 네 모든 물건을 가져갈 거야. 무료로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyVendor/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "2923dfb0-8022-4616-9e0c-c72362825f6c"
msgid "[Leave] \"Good trading to you!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"좋은 거래였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyVendor/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "256a0362-5d36-4f67-a149-05f92a67f23c"
msgid ""
"{n}A troll with an ironbound chest at his feet waves at you.{/n} \"Hey, "
"borba! No, wait, it wrong… {Race}, that right! Come here, {race}! We trade!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발에 철로 된 상자를 찬 트롤이 당신에게 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"이봐! 보바! 아니... {Race}! 맞아! 여기 와. "
"{race}! 우리 거래하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyVendor/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "3f5b80ad-ae42-4e68-8082-6e17d03bacd7"
msgid ""
"\"It Tartuk's idea. He said humans trade things for gold. He said we trade, "
"too, we get many gold. Humans then give us many pigs and sheep for gold. "
"Tartuk dead now, but Hargulka ordered us gather many things in "
"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} and sell them. No one buys till now. You my first "
"customer!\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭의 아이디어였어. 인간이 금으로 거래를 한다고 말했지. 우리도 거래를 해서 많은 금을 얻어야 한다고 했어. 인간은 우리에게 금을 "
"받고 많은 돼지와 양을 주었다. 타툭은 지금 죽었지만 하굴카는 {g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g}에서 우리에게 많은 물건들을 모으라고 "
"명령했다. 아무도 그것을 지금까지 사지는 않았다. 네가 나의 첫 고객이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollFriendlyVendor/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "b80c57c4-0c35-4863-9e62-11cdd4f5543f"
msgid "\"You have gold, {race}? Troll want gold! We trade!\""
msgstr "\"금 있냐? {race}? 트롤은 금을 원한다! 우리 거래하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_00816_Text
msgctxt "67815e47-dfab-41cd-a794-1d33cffcfe54"
msgid "\"I've heard enough of Trobold.\""
msgstr "\"트로볼드에 대해 충분히 들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_01242_Text
msgctxt "dd10395a-5cdd-4e25-af47-df0b9ad9ca43"
msgid "\"Who's Tartuk?\""
msgstr "\"타툭이 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_01520_Text
msgctxt "cd222f75-d4eb-40c8-a86e-84a3cad358ad"
msgid "\"How does Tartuk protect trolls from fire?\""
msgstr "\"타툭은 어떻게 트롤을 불에서 보호하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_05137_Text
msgctxt "755f4343-a176-4955-8016-c5ea2ba45622"
msgid "\"So trolls aren't eating people anymore?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 트롤들은 사람들을 더 이상 먹지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_07136_Text
msgctxt "b2e6b299-dde9-4fca-9add-04abdb61fc4b"
msgid "\"What do you mean, 'borba'?\""
msgstr "\"보바라니. 무슨 뜻이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_10481_Text
msgctxt "f17abbdc-668b-4ec3-b817-41e9b87880ea"
msgid "\"That's enough about food. Tell me more about Trobold.\""
msgstr "\"음식에 관해서는 충분하다. 트로볼트에 대해 더 많이 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_12752_Text
msgctxt "f8e3deea-1937-4f2f-b4a8-235807e2690d"
msgid "\"Trobold?\""
msgstr "\"트로볼트?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_22444_Text
msgctxt "312ce1d4-80df-41f3-ae5b-8c86f47f6e8b"
msgid "\"Tell me more about Trobold.\""
msgstr "\"트로볼트에 대해 더 많이 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_27877_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "10519114-7702-44a3-931a-27e1595a53af"
msgid "Let the peaceful troll go."
msgstr "평화로운 트롤을 보내줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_27877_Text
msgctxt "b4a6de88-65d4-428e-b2a9-57029b7f0665"
msgid "\"We just want to look around here. We're not here to fight.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 단지 여기를 둘러보고 싶어. 우리는 싸우러 온 것이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_30393_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0e26d867-5b67-454a-a81b-20dede240830"
msgid "Taunted the peaceful troll."
msgstr "평화로운 트롤을 괴롭혔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_30393_Text
msgctxt "6e853c2f-c62b-48ed-a356-37a0e8a58c41"
msgid ""
"\"All right, YOU don't eat people anymore. But how can you be so sure about "
"the rest of your kin?\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 너는 사람들을 더 이상 먹지 않는다고. 하지만 나머지 너희 종족들이 그렇다고 어떻게 확신할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_33202_Text
msgctxt "72a2d502-ce81-454e-a1c4-17bfabc32d42"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_34570_Text
msgctxt "6aec80e7-91cc-4ec5-9568-1828561c4586"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad to hear you don't eat people anymore. Let me ask you something "
"else.\""
msgstr "\"네가 사람들을 더 이상 먹지 않는다는 소식을 듣게 되어 기쁘다. 너에게 다른 것을 묻지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_35980_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "707dc66c-59bf-44e9-b20a-216372bf9a56"
msgid "Killed the peaceful troll."
msgstr "평화로운 트롤을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_35980_Text
msgctxt "6a37bc72-c6e8-4e0a-886c-d7c0a87d5a14"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't waste words on beasts — I kill them.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 짐승에게 시간 낭비하지 않는다. 나는 그들을 죽인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_39980_Text
msgctxt "30398cda-c845-4b55-a02e-309bde62bad0"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure you won't change your mind as soon as you run out of people "
"in your larder? You might get hungry again.\""
msgstr "\"우리에 있는 사람들을 풀어주어도 마음을 바꾸지 않을 거라고 확신해? 너는 다시 배가 고프게 될지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_53146_Text
msgctxt "5c2bba17-ef2a-4860-8e1a-e083d0c75393"
msgid "\"What else can you tell me about Trobold?\""
msgstr "\"트로볼트에 관해 나에게 무엇을 말해 줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_79264_Text
msgctxt "9682f1ef-3a6f-4a40-b1e9-d24e7c16acf2"
msgid "\"So you still eat human flesh?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너는 여전히 인간의 육체를 먹어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_81316_Text
msgctxt "5f9ee4ab-6412-410c-8c85-3f8328608de1"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, calm down. It was just a question. Trolls are friends with borba now."
"\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 진정해. 그냥 질문일 뿐이야. 트롤은 지금 보바와 친구야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_85884_Text
msgctxt "59955447-9424-4957-8ffa-37d268510a25"
msgid "\"Your Common is impressive.\""
msgstr "\"너의 공용어는 인상적이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_86777_Text
msgctxt "aa44786e-32bf-4a3a-b631-d758d77b3a7a"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I knew that would happen. A monster is always a monster, even if "
"it can talk.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 그럴 줄 알았다. 괴물은 말할 수 있을지라도 항상 괴물이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_90808_Text
msgctxt "9de858d7-bbad-4a9a-bf82-762dd4e1127d"
msgid "\"Who is Hargulka?\""
msgstr "\"하굴카는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_93651_Text
msgctxt "fcc590db-a0ff-4761-8e62-5af919539b18"
msgid "\"All right, what do you want from me?\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나한테 원하는 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_95883_Text
msgctxt "54529ff2-0bd1-4659-8c93-ad124ce7509c"
msgid "\"So what do you eat now?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 너는 이제 무엇을 먹지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_95884_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "631e4b7f-6020-4d23-86ae-3f65824f61dd"
msgid "Persuaded the peaceful troll to take you to parley with the troll king."
msgstr "평화로운 트롤을 설득하여 트롤 왕이 있는 응접실로 안내하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_95884_Text
msgctxt "e01f7b27-a7d6-459b-9fc7-f1bc0483a433"
msgid ""
"\"All right, take me to your kings and we'll see if trolls can hold a civil "
"conversation. I'm the {mf|king|queen} of the lands your Trobold stands on, "
"and as such, your kings and I have much to discuss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 나를 네 왕에게 데려다 줘. 트롤이 문명적인 대화를 나눌 수 있는지 알게 될 거야. 나는 너희 트로볼트가 서 있는 이 땅의 "
"왕이고 나와 너의 왕은 할 말이 많을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_95896_Text
msgctxt "9e23c5e8-8ae6-4cad-8742-93e5cc89b583"
msgid ""
"\"Looks like the trolls have a sense of humor! Though for some reason they "
"seem to shy away from fiery or caustic humor!\""
msgstr "\"트롤들은 유머 감각이 있는 것처럼 보이는구나! 웬일인지 불이나 산성에 관한 유머는 하지 않는 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_95897_Text
msgctxt "29ae7414-2551-4097-8cf2-002aa17230db"
msgid "\"Congratulations, you've found your audience!\""
msgstr "\"축하해. 너는 너의 청중을 찾았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Answer_95898_Text
msgctxt "3223b8cd-35b8-48eb-a68e-fa6cd980b6e9"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_00269_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "abaedcbb-b236-4ddb-8535-0a05c7e3f9e8"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost squints an eye as he listens to Jazon.{/n} \"Was that the same "
"Tartuk who attempted to steal my cart? Or is Tartuk a common name among "
"kobold spawn?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌의 말을 듣자 주빌로스트는 눈을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"내 수레를 훔친 녀석이랑 같은 타툭을 말하는 거야? 아니면 코볼트 "
"사이에서는 흔한 이름인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_01912_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "f9e63d09-70e2-4e3f-80b3-4065b38c1a60"
msgid ""
"\"King over all kobolds! Strong! Smart! Kind...\" {n}The troll chews on his "
"tongue momentarily.{/n} \"Fire killed trolls before. Tartuk protects trolls "
"from fire. So now trolls forever love Tartuk and his kobolds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트의 왕이다! 강하다! 똑똑하다! 친절하다...\"{n} 트롤은 잠깐 혀를 깨문듯 합니다. {/n} \"불은 트롤을 죽였다. "
"타툭은 트롤을 불한테 지켜줬다. 트롤은 이제 타툭과 코볼트들을 평생 사랑한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_03092_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "456bade9-14cd-47f6-bf12-264f041951ae"
msgid ""
"\"You — are borba.\" {n}The troll hesitates.{/n} \"Human, elf, dwarf. All "
"borba.\""
msgstr "\"너네 보바다\" {n} 트롤은 잠깐 머뭇했습니다.{/n} \"인간, 엘프, 드워프. 다 보바다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_03189_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4a7b74e5-1de7-4686-93ec-2b0847739505"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia touches your shoulder gently.{/n} \"You'd better be careful,\"{n} "
"she whispers.{/n} \"It seems to be a sore subject for him. I'd leave it be.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 당신의 어깨를 가볍게 칩니다.{/n} \"조심하는게 좋아요,\"{n} 그녀가 속삭입니다.{/n} \"저 트롤한텐 민감한 "
"주제인거 같아요. 냅두죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_04659_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "67529192-43f8-42b8-a8bb-953a9bf9432d"
msgid ""
"{n}He grins widely, revealing a row of long, rotten, and chipped teeth, but "
"there's no menace in it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트롤은 썩은 옥수수같은 치열을 드러내며 씨익 웃습니다. 하지만 적의는 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_07084_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "af1a32ab-2e1c-4395-a2c8-4beeaf6400ba"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun takes a breath as if about to speak, then spits on the ground "
"instead.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 마치 말하려는 듯 숨을 들이마시고는 땅에 침을 뱉어냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_10111_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "2b29df5c-3d2a-4c75-84ad-3c22ace62598"
msgid ""
"{n}You continue to talk, but Jazon doesn't seem to be listening. He hammers "
"the ground with his fists, growls, then charges.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 계속 이야기하지만 재즌은 듣고 있는 것 같지 않습니다. 그는 주먹으로 땅을 내려치고 으르렁거리고는 돌진합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_10722_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "492cdd74-03d4-4b79-9681-a400bd890230"
msgid ""
"{n}For several moments, Jazon inhales and exhales loudly, his eyes bulging "
"madly, but he then seems to regain control over himself.{/n} \"Borba and "
"troll friends.\" {n}He nods,then turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 동안 재즌은 큰소리로 숨을 쉽니다. 그의 눈은 미친 듯이 충혈되었지만 그는 자신에 대한 통제력을 다시 얻는 것처럼 "
"보입니다.{/n} \"보바와 트롤은 친구다.\" {n}그는 고개를 끄덕이며 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_12151_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7cb49cde-434a-4b5c-87d8-ed21d7ebb0bc"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie bites her lip.{/n} \"With respect, I must warn you, that was an "
"inconsiderate statement. Our duty is to our people, not these beasts.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 입술을 살짝 뭅니다.{/n} \"정중하게 경고합니다. 방금 한 말은 부주의한 말이었습니다. 우리의 의무는 짐승이 아니라 "
"사람을 위한 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_14912_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "353b1a70-8426-4b51-83b3-e53435bfcb67"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll's eyes flash.{/n} \"Borba no get it! Borba no food, Hargulka "
"said so! Borba try to get me angry on purpose...\" {n}Jazon's words become a "
"growl, then he calms himself.{/n} \"Borba. Friend.\" {n}He nods, then goes "
"silent.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤의 눈이 반짝입니다.{/n} \"보바는 이해하지 못한다! 보바는 음식 아니라고 하굴카 말했다! 보바는 나를 일부러 화나게 "
"한다...\" {n}재즌의 말은 으르렁거림으로 바뀌고 그는 진정합니다.{/n} \"보바. 친구.\" {n}그는 고개를 끄덕이고 "
"조용해집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_17827_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "f18067b7-c752-4f3f-b120-13f4413b411a"
msgid ""
"\"Me no eat borba no more!\" {n}Jazon claims proudly.{/n} \"King Hargulka "
"and King Tartuk order so. Other trolls still eat borba. They wild and dumb. "
"Soon they stop.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나 더 이상 보바를 먹지 않아!\" {n}재즌은 자랑스럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"하굴카 왕과 타툭 왕이 명령했다. 다른 트롤은 여전히 "
"보바 먹는다. 그들은 거칠고 멍청하다. 곧 멈출 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_18120_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "dd3e10c5-ce62-467f-8b96-a18d3c84684a"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll stares at you for a moment.{/n} \"Me eat,\" {n}he confesses, "
"slumping a little.{/n} \"But me no kill borba. Never again kill borba.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤은 잠시 당신을 보았습니다.{/n} \"나는 먹는다.\" {n}그는 조금 슬퍼하는 듯 고백합니다.{/n} \"하지만 나 보바를 "
"죽이지 않아. 다시는 보바를 죽이지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_19117_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "5ae7264a-194b-4c6b-8336-2e066abbe171"
msgid ""
"\"Dumb borba! Don't listen!\" {n}Jazon snarls.{/n} \"Troll no eat borba. "
"Borba friend!\" {n}Jazon stomps his feet loudly and works his jaw, spraying "
"you with stinky, sticky saliva.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"멍청한 보바! 듣지 않는다!\" {n}재즌이 으르렁거립니다.{/n} \"트롤은 보바를 먹지 않는다. 보바 친구다!\" {n}재즌은 "
"발로 바닥을 강하게 치고는 당신에게 아주 더럽고 끈적이는 침을 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_31447_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "138faa83-ac78-4b2a-8757-55887b9c3514"
msgid ""
"\"Horse. Cow. Dog.\" {n}Jazon scratches is belly.{/n} \"Dead borba too, "
"sometimes. Long dead, before Hargulka's order. No need to waste food.\""
msgstr ""
"\"말. 암소. 개.\" {n}재즌이 배를 긁습니다.{/n} \"죽은 보바도 가끔 먹는다. 하굴카가 명령하기 전에는 죽은 것도 먹었다. "
"음식 낭비하면 안된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_32105_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "c390d573-b9dd-4e23-9654-957cfe413c8f"
msgid ""
"{n}Jazon scratches the back of his head, making a loud crackling sound.{/n} "
"\"Borba better not go. Trolls still wild and dumb. Much danger.\" {n}Jazon "
"sighs — a sound you've never heard from a troll — and stomps away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌은 뒷머리를 긁적이며 벅벅 소리를 냅니다.{/n} \"보바는 가지 않는 게 좋다. 트롤은 여전히 거칠고 멍청하다. 위험하다.\" "
"{n}재즌은 한숨을 쉽니다. 트롤에게서는 들어 본 적이 없는 소리입니다. 그리고는 발을 굴립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_33686_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "728ff639-6ba1-4812-8d50-3bc9d4041bd9"
msgid ""
"\"King over all trolls! Strong! Smart! K-kind...\" {n}The troll stutters "
"slightly and pauses for a moment.{/n} \"Made all trolls together. Made "
"kingdom, like borba.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 트롤들을 다스리는 왕! 강하고 똑똑하다!\" {n}트롤은 조금은 더듬거리며 말하다가 잠시 멈춥니다.{/n} \"모든 트롤을 "
"하나로 뭉쳤다. 보바의 것과 같은 왕국을 만들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_34481_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9556aac3-d70e-47d0-8736-7a90c802d0d7"
msgid "\"Not here to talk. Arrows will speak in my stead.\""
msgstr "\"잡담이나 하러 온 것이 아니다. 내 화살이 대신 답해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_35815_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "dc8e447b-d0ab-4479-8c09-7c06a78a747a"
msgid "\"In that case, he's in for one unforgettable audience today.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면, 오늘 잊지 못할 손님을 맞이하게 될걸 .\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_36672_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "24934e8d-8db0-4df7-8068-83bc1d096107"
msgid "\"What a surprise! A polite troll!\""
msgstr "\"이럴수가! 예의 바른 트롤이라니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_37718_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "099aacb3-3bef-4a56-a1ea-503e5fe45bcc"
msgid "\"I'm glad we let him go. He seems nice!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 보내줘서 다행이야. 착해 보였는 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_40463_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "efab7c67-c763-4e9e-8dae-f716fe9180c7"
msgid ""
"\"Ours capital!\" {n}the troll exclaims, waving his hand toward the rock.{/n}"
" \"Kingdom of both troll and kobold. We live there now, in peace with borba. "
"Ours land!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 수도다!\" {n}트롤은 바위를 향해 손을 흔들며 소리를 지릅니다.{/n} \"트롤과 코볼트의 왕국이다. 우리는 지금 보바와 "
"평화롭게 살고 있다. 우리의 땅이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_42260_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "da07d25c-d840-4bb2-ab43-6a6a35389256"
msgid ""
"\"You understand, borba? Troll no more die at all. Fire is no death. Steel "
"is no death. Tartuk made troll immortal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이해했나. 보바? 트롤은 더 이상 죽지 않는다. 불은 죽음이 아니다. 쇠도 죽음이 아니다. 타툭이 트롤을 불멸로 만들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_45530_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "4d676f6f-e3db-419e-8109-464c6adb8e28"
msgid ""
"{n}Jazon looks you in the eyes.{/n} \"Many trolls wild. Eat borba. They will "
"stop soon. Peace will be!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌이 당신의 눈을 봅니다.{/n} \"많은 야생 트롤이 거칠다. 보바를 먹는다. 그들은 곧 멈출 것이다. 평화는 이뤄질 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_48431_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "5d923100-8012-4ab5-8f99-7caabc6e50c6"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk the one and only! King to kobolds, friend to trolls.\" {n}Jazon's "
"voice sounds earnest and respectful.{/n}"
msgstr "\"타툭이 유일하다! 코볼트의 왕이고 트롤의 친구다.\" {n}재즌의 목소리가 진지하고 존중이 담겨 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_49256_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d22ddf16-8162-4253-a8a0-7d65cabc2dc4"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri looks at you with confusion.{/n} \"What? What do you mean, 'we're "
"not here to fight'?\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 당신을 혼란스럽게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"뭐라구? 우린 싸우러 온 게 아니라니. 무슨 뜻이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_56910_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "deb8a360-0227-4c44-8281-8542e6aeb711"
msgid ""
"\"Yes,\" {n}the troll agrees.{/n} \"Tartuk speaks like that. Taught me borba "
"language. Told I am smart.\" {n}The troll proceeds to scratch his armpit, "
"then sniff his fingers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래.\" {n}트롤은 동의합니다.{/n} \"타툭은 그렇게 말한다. 보바의 언어 가르쳐줬다. 내가 똑똑하다고 말했다.\" {n}"
"트롤은 겨드랑이를 긁고는 손가락 냄새를 맡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_57520_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "418e8834-dfa2-460b-adfb-c7e16f08b5f0"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll makes a strange growl. You're about to draw your weapons when "
"it becomes evident that he was simply clearing his throat.{/n} \"I meet "
"borba and tell them: King Hargulka and King Tartuk ask that borba stay away "
"from {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}. It filthy, not pretty, and dangerous. We invite "
"borba later. When Kings allow.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤은 이상한 으르렁거리는 소리를 냅니다. 그가 목을 깨끗이 하려고 할 때 당신은 무기를 꺼낼 뻔했습니다.{/n} \"나는 보바를 "
"만났고 말한다. 하굴카 왕과 타툭 왕이 보바가 {g|Trobold}트로볼드{/g}로부터 떨여져 있으라고 요청했다. 트로볼드는 더럽고 "
"예쁘지 않고 위험하다. 나중에 보바를 초대하겠다. 왕들이 허락하면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_59906_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "518a6401-5fcf-4d73-9497-c76114f0f635"
msgid ""
"{n}Jazon's eyes widen and he shifts back a bit.{/n} \"Drrrabba kurga, iron "
"red and hot! Heat! Troll scream, and scream, and scream! Gudunga yrga, "
"borba. Pain.\" {n}He flails his hands in the air.{/n} \"Then, quiet. No more "
"pain. Fire no danger anymore. Troll no die from fire no more.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌의 눈이 넓어지고 그는 뒤로 조금 물러납니다.{/n} \"드라바 쿠르가. 철은 붉고 뜨겁다! 열이 난다! 트롤은 비명을 지르고 "
"비명을 지른다! 구둥가 이르가 보바. 고통.\" {n}그는 공중에 손을 펼칩니다.{/n} \"조용해. 더 이상 고통은 없다. 더 이상 "
"위험을 무릅쓰지 마라. 트롤은 더 이상 불로 죽지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_67298_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "823da0c5-7419-47d4-98b7-d2867ad439d0"
msgid ""
"\"Many troll, many kobold. Live together. Learn borba speech. Paint walls. "
"Tartuk protects trolls from fire.\" {n}Jazon's lips move silently, and he "
"looks into the distance for a moment.{/n} \"Uh, plenty food, too. Plenty "
"loot. Troll and kobold share.\""
msgstr ""
"\"많은 트롤과 많은 코볼트는 함께 산다. 보바 말 배웠다. 벽 칠했다. 타툭은 불로부터 트롤 보호했다.\" {n}재즌의 입술은 부드럽게 "
"움직였고 그는 먼 곳을 잠시동안 봅니다.{/n} \"음식도 많다. 노획품도 많다. 트롤과 코볼트 서로 공유한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_68738_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "51a6c84d-4c14-44e3-9ae8-7329ce1be163"
msgid "{n}Jazon stares at you, his tongue dangling out.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}재즌이 당신을 보고 그가 말을 뱉어냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_82614_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "bc1a0e4c-18cf-4b30-9c99-609ae4ced178"
msgid ""
"\"Jazon!\" {n}The troll pounds his chest, making a hollow thud.{/n} \"I had "
"different name before. Now, Jazon! Like borba!\" {n}He thrusts out his "
"chest, and a dribble of drool from his mouth promptly lands there.{/n} \"Me "
"talk like borba. Wash myself like borba. And no eat borba. Me is like borba "
"myself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"재즌!\" {n}트롤은 그의 가슴을 치며 울림 소리를 만듭니다.{/n} \"나는 전에 다른 이름이 있었다. 지금은 재즌이다! 보바처럼!"
"\" {n}그는 엄지로 가슴을 찌르며 그의 입에서는 침이 흘러 바닥에 떨어졌습니다.{/n} \"나는 보바처럼 말한다. 보바처럼 씻는다. "
"보바 먹지 않는다. 나는 보바처럼 행동한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_90021_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "53460e7e-66bd-4163-86d3-5256bfdccee5"
msgid ""
"\"Hail, borba!\" {n}The troll's voice is rough and gravelly.{/n} \"Welcome "
"to {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보바 만세!\" {n}트롤의 목소리는 거칠고 굵습니다.{/n} \"{g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}에 온 것을 환영한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_92390_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6f6b2a1f-044a-4ccd-b20e-73d37aa26882"
msgid "\"Sure. Now I've seen EVERYTHING.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 이것으로 이제 난 세상 모든것을 본 셈이군\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_94576_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "b838dd43-6010-47af-836c-7a1f54a3ed51"
msgid ""
"\"First city for both troll and kobold. Will be kingdom! Troll, and kobold, "
"and borba will do friendship! Troll no eat borba anymore, and borba no kill "
"troll and kobold anymore. Peace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤과 코볼트를 위한 첫 번째 도시다. 왕국이 될 것이다! 트롤, 코볼트, 보바가 우정을 나눌 것이다! 트롤은 더 이상 보바를 먹지 "
"않고 보바는 더 이상 트롤과 코볼트를 죽이지 않는다. 평화!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_95887_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2c348318-dc4b-4dbc-aa58-2fc3149589a0"
msgid "\"Yep. I think it likes you.\""
msgstr "\"응. 저게 널 좋아하는 모양이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_95889_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a56a792f-d6ef-460d-aeba-c279fc5b088c"
msgid ""
"{n}A bitter smile appears on Harrim's face.{/n} \"A proud citadel of "
"dwarves, turned into a lair for trolls and kobolds... Would it be possible "
"to humiliate {g|Torag}Torag{/g} any further?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림의 얼굴에 쓴 미소가 나타납니다.{/n} \"드워프의 자랑스러운 요새가 트롤과 코볼트를 위한 은신처가 되었다... 이보다 더 "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}에게 굴욕감을 줄 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_95892_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8b3ea633-2f58-43ac-b5d2-48e9c8642602"
msgid ""
"\"Really? A kingdom?\" {n}Regongar whistles in surprise.{/n} \"I'd certainly "
"like to see what kind of kingdom they... kobold together. Ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 왕국?\" {n}놀란 레곤가르가 휘파람을 붑니다.{/n} \"나는 확실히 어떤 왕국일지 보고싶어... 코볼트와 함께 산다니. "
"하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_95893_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "34427329-6fdf-4d5f-92de-0f5ae7196bd6"
msgid "\"Kobold... together? Bwa ha ha! A pun! Jazon understand!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트... 함께? 하하하! 귀엽지! 재즌 이해했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_95899_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d2f6450f-c7bd-438e-ad1e-830d31b36e7d"
msgid "{n}Regongar laughs uproariously at your pun, slapping his thighs.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 코볼트를 떠올리며 우렁차게 웃었고 자신의 허벅지를 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_95900_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9b17e8f4-53ac-4499-80f9-22d42c3b53b2"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar sneers, pleased.{/n} \"Who knows? The history of troll comedy "
"might start with that pun!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르가 기쁘게 웃습니다.{/n} \"누가 알겠어? 트롤 코미디의 역사는 코볼트와 함께 시작될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_95901_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "78e96b35-ddc0-4108-99e1-fa1ee2840f0a"
msgid ""
"{n}Glancing sideways at you and realizing you won't pay attention to his "
"joke, Regongar turns away resentfully.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신 옆을 보고는 당신이 그의 농담에 웃지 않는다는 것을 깨닫고 레곤가르는 화가 나서 몸을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/Cue_WalkWithJasonToTrobold_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "a9852055-df85-4717-b98e-6ef110e1d966"
msgid ""
"{n}Jazon frowns and blinks slowly. {/n} \"King said no one can enter... But "
"he never said humans have kings too... What am I to do? Hargulka hates when "
"someone disobeys his orders, always punches troublemakers in the face. But "
"if it all so complicated, if borba ruler came... Fine. Hargulka smart, he'll "
"figure it all out. And face will heal... Follow me, {mf|king|queen}, you'll "
"talk to {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} kings!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌은 얼굴을 찡그리고 눈을 천천히 깜박입니다.{/n} \"아무도 들어올 수 없다고 왕이 말했다... 하지만 인간에게 왕이 있다고 "
"말한 적이 없다... 내가 무엇을 해야 하는가? 하굴카는 누군가가 명령을 불복할 때 싫어하고 항상 그 녀석의 얼굴에 주먹을 날린다. "
"그렇게 복잡한 것이라면 보바 통치자가 왔다면... 좋다. 하굴카는 똑똑하니 다 알 것이다. 그리고 얼굴은 치유하면 된다... 나를 "
"따라와라. {g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g} 왕과 이야기해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/TrollPacifist/RuggaDialog_Start_Cue_Text
#. Speaker : Rugga
msgctxt "296cd9bf-76eb-4090-86d1-049f8f11aaf6"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll who stands before you looks different from his kin. His pelt is "
"cleaner, and his stench is almost bearable, unlike the other trolls. "
"Noticing you, he turns and slowly steps toward you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 서있는 트롤은 그의 종족과 다르게 보입니다. 그의 털은 깨끗하고 다른 트롤과는 달리 그에게서 나는 악취는 견딜 수 "
"있었습니다. 당신을 알아차리자 그는 당신을 향해 몸을 돌리고 천천히 걸어옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_02301_Text
msgctxt "8da51e82-fd70-49e6-8bde-1bea90d663c7"
msgid "\"What do you want to tell me?\""
msgstr "\"나에게 무엇을 말하고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_36868_Text
msgctxt "3837bd32-b072-4292-914c-1c2293be0041"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for telling me your story. I guess we will be able to defeat "
"Kargadd.\""
msgstr "\"너의 이야기를 해줘서 고마워. 우리가 카르가드를 이길 수 있을 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_48191_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9c3b040c-ad1c-4352-8196-72ddada8a6e2"
msgid "Refrained from asking Ekun about his family's death."
msgstr "가족의 죽음에 대해 에쿤에게 묻지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_48191_Text
msgctxt "52465285-e9dc-4d95-b127-b86349d7ab38"
msgid "\"No. I can live without this knowledge.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 몰라도 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_48382_Text
msgctxt "b554f454-957d-460a-989e-2f80ee2fae01"
msgid "\"How did you know his name?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그의 이름을 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_65277_Text
msgctxt "3c9e6d15-6b14-4585-ad08-5baefc460b78"
msgid "\"I am ready now. No need to tell me anything.\""
msgstr "\"나는 지금 준비가 되어있다. 나에게 아무 말도 할 필요가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_68514_Text
msgctxt "c375bb43-11b9-44bb-bebb-41a4adcf4da2"
msgid "\"I prefer to know everything about those I travel with.\""
msgstr "\"내가 함께 여행하는 자들에 관한 모든 것을 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_85047_Text
msgctxt "dad92bb3-8efc-4d38-9361-2cfc25d434ea"
msgid "\"So, let's sum up. What do we know about this Kargadd?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 요약해 보자. 카르가드에 대해 무엇을 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_87149_Text
msgctxt "155e8897-bba8-4d1c-9e89-c2515e4b58e0"
msgid "\"Why did the troll leave you alive?\""
msgstr "\"트롤이 왜 너를 살려두었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Answer_96499_Text
msgctxt "35bffa0f-130f-40d4-b763-408c367b1714"
msgid "\"It was Kargadd who killed your family?\""
msgstr "\"네 가족을 죽인 게 카르가드야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_08735_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e2cff247-83e8-4e51-8801-3531022418cc"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods.{/n} \"You lead us to battle, thank you. This monster must not "
"survive.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤이 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"너는 우리에게 싸울 기회를 주었다. 고맙다. 이 괴물은 살아남아서는 안된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_22116_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9730ee12-a8f2-4b32-9da7-78b97a939695"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun exhales loudly, gathering his thoughts.{/n} \"Rock trolls have more "
"strength, brutality than the regular ones. Kargadd is the strongest. We "
"fought. He crushed buildings with fists. He caught people up, tore them "
"apart. During our fight, he just swept my body aside. Like he would sweep "
"aside horse fly, annoyed but not harmed by bite. Do not be fooled by his "
"clumsiness. He can be very fast.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 큰소리로 한숨을 쉬며 자신의 생각을 모읍니다.{/n} \"바위 트롤은 보통의 트롤보다 강하고 잔인하다. 카르가드는 가장 "
"강하지. 우리는 싸웠다. 놈은 주먹으로 건물을 부술 수 있고 사람들을 들어올려 찢어버렸다. 싸우는 동안 내 몸을 내동댕이 치기도 했다. "
"놈은 말도 날려버릴 것 같았지만 물지는 않았다. 엉성해 보여도 속지 말아라. 놈은 매우 빠르다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_28769_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "6c85ed44-2b98-4cc2-a07f-793f123af758"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face twists in a painful grimace.{/n} \"Hmmm. Should you know the "
"details?\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 얼굴은 고통으로 뒤틀립니다.{/n} \"흠. 더 자세히 알고 싶나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_31096_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "42e29a29-b0f7-4558-a69c-04231bb81e0d"
msgid ""
"{n}Though it is obviously hard for him to tell this story, you hear some "
"relief in Ekun's voice.{/n} \"I'm grateful you made me tell this. Needed "
"that.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그가 이 이야기를 하는 것이 어려워 보이지만 당신은 에쿤의 목소리에서 약간의 안도감을 듣습니다.{/n} \"이 이야기를 말하게 "
"해주어 고맙다. 나는 말하고 싶었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_32043_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0ba9cff7-8505-48cf-9916-16036e908cb5"
msgid ""
"\"He swept my defenses out of the way and crushed the wall of our house. He… "
"seized my wife Amanda and.. bit off her head. Hurled her body aside. "
"Clarissa screamed. He just stomped on her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"놈은 방벽을 휩쓸고 우리 집 벽을 부숴 버렸다... 내 아내 아만다를 붙잡고... 머리를 물어뜯었다. 그녀의 시체가 내팽겨쳐지고 내 "
"딸 클라리사는 비명을 질렀다. 놈은 그녀의 몸을 짓밟았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_33862_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0d735953-47e9-4b03-8fd6-2ee3b01cfd15"
msgid ""
"\"The trolls shouted it as a war cry. As anthem. Kargadd, Kargadd, Kargadd. "
"They were yelling it when he crushed the walls of our house. When he... "
"killed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤들은 전쟁 함성을 지르듯 고함을 질렀다. 승리의 노래였다. 카르가드를 계속 외쳤다. 놈들은 우리 집의 벽을 부술 때 그렇게 "
"소리질렀다. 놈이... 사람을 죽였을 때도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_41475_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a5c4a652-e4f8-4d36-a13b-dd986de08513"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, friend,\" {n}Ekun stops you.{/n} \"Kargadd is near. Can feel it. On "
"the ground. On the grass. On those rocks. Everything is soaked with his "
"stench.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐. 친구.\" {n}에쿤은 당신을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"카르가드가 주위에 있다. 느낄 수 있다. 땅에. 잔디에. 바위에. 모든 "
"것이 그의 악취에 젖어있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_46145_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d9ef865c-2c8b-42f3-9f1b-7ee94d57752d"
msgid ""
"\"At least they didn't suffer before they died.\" {n}Octavia puts her hand "
"on Ekun's shoulder. The ranger flinches at her touch, then relaxes — with an "
"obvious effort. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"적어도 죽으면서 괴로워하지는 않았네요.\" {n}옥타비아는 에쿤의 어깨에 손을 올려놓습니다. 레인저는 그녀의 손길을 털어내고 긴장을 "
"풀려고 노력하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_54108_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "39daddca-b572-466a-bcb0-1c2d5c3b9257"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun shrugs.{/n} \"He was in a haste. The night was ending. In the light "
"of dawn, rock trolls turn to rock they originated from. Sunlight is his "
"worst enemy. Kargadd knows that.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"놈은 서둘렀다. 밤은 끝났다. 새벽이 되자 바위트롤은 바위로 변했다. 햇빛은 그의 가장 큰 "
"적이다. 카르가드는 그것을 알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_58027_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "8ace1819-0267-474b-8123-7605c8e5ad53"
msgid ""
"\"Kargadd is a rock troll, thus he has greater size and strength than "
"regular trolls. Fire and acid are not deadly to him, but still can hurt him. "
"His weakness is sunlight, he has no desire to turn stone.\" {n}Ekun "
"grunts.{/n} \"The dungeon gives him strength, the rock itself heals his "
"wounds. The battle will be held inside his home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"카르가드는 바위트롤이다. 놈은 일반적인 트롤보다 크고 힘도 세다. 불과 산성은 치명적이지 않지만 여전히 상처를 줄 수 있다. 약점은 "
"햇빛이고. 놈은 돌이 되는 것을 원하지 않아.\" {n}에쿤이 불평합니다.{/n} \"던전은 놈에게 힘을 주고 바위는 놈의 상처를 "
"치유한다. 전투는 놈의 거처에서 벌어질 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_63600_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "946e415b-b694-4ab3-b94b-e0d0d932231e"
msgid ""
"\"Must tell you about him. You need be prepared. This fight will not be easy."
"\""
msgstr "\"놈에 대해 말해야겠다. 너는 준비가 필요하다. 이 싸움은 쉽지 않을 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_76882_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3639c586-25df-4ee0-b285-12e07aaac793"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods in gratitude, but the pain in his eyes doesn't subside.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 감사해 하며 끄덕이지만 그의 눈에는 고통이 가라 앉지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_77145_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "508407fb-b344-433b-bfc5-c1eb5c2f101c"
msgid ""
"\"The atrocities committed by this monster are horrific indeed. We will "
"deliver justice!\""
msgstr "\"이 괴물이 저지른 짓은 정말로 끔찍하군. 우리가 정의를 전해주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_80446_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "a3a87e91-380e-4ac6-b875-5f68145cd6b4"
msgid "\"I envy them so much. Their agony is over, and ours lingers still.\""
msgstr "\"너무나 질투가 나. 그 여인들의 고통은 끝이 났는데 우리의 고통은 아직도 사그라들지 않다니\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Ekun/Cue_96841_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "1e18e8e9-e05e-43fd-958a-08aa9a5c4911"
msgid ""
"\"Carved in my memory: flying through air towards a fence... a hit in a "
"head... doubled vision in the eyes... Inability to stand up, inability to "
"raise a bow... A taste of blood in the mouth... Helpless.\" {n}Ekun looks "
"somewhere ahead, his gaze is still and heavy. His face looks like a mask "
"carved in stone — the same rock as the troll he tells you about.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내 기억에 새겨져있어. 방벽 쪽으로 날라갔고... 머리에 맞아서... 눈에서 보이는형체가 두겹으로 보였어... 일어설 수도 활을 들 "
"수도 없었다... 입에서 피 맛이 났다... 무력했어.\" {n}에쿤이 어딘가를 보는데 그 시선은 여전히 무겁습니다. 그 얼굴은 돌로 "
"만든 가면처럼 보입니다. 에쿤이 말한 바위트롤처럼 딱딱해 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Answer_36268_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dcb92e0a-0604-4620-82ad-2a9ceadbd18a"
msgid "Allowed Jubilost to write whatever he wants about your barony."
msgstr "주빌로스트가 당신의 영지에 대해 무엇이든 쓸 수 있게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Answer_36268_Text
msgctxt "aefee61e-6da1-4d69-96c3-30d225661bad"
msgid "\"Well, I won't interfere with whatever you're going to write.\""
msgstr "\"네가 무슨 글을 쓰든 난 간섭하지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Answer_37328_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "73773d3d-cc27-48f4-a4bd-d0402b10c153"
msgid "Reminded Jubilost of the work you do to protect the barony."
msgstr "주빌로스트는에게 당신이 남작령을 보호하기 위해 한 일을 상기시켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Answer_37328_Text
msgctxt "1f16a903-686e-4a90-b920-f11aabab3950"
msgid ""
"\"If you are so set up to be impartial, don't forget to mention that the "
"{mf|baron|baroness} of these lands tends to major problems personally, so "
"all of them will be solved in the near future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"공정한 기사를 쓰길 원한다면, 이 땅의 남작은 영지의 문제들을 잘 보살피고 있으며 가까운 장래에 모두 해결될 것이라는 점을 쓰는것도 "
"잊지말아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Answer_37839_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "434086bf-f93c-4544-a2a0-199d0326742c"
msgid "Reminded Jubilost that your barony needs heroes."
msgstr "주빌로스트에게 당신의 남작령은 영웅이 필요하다는 것을 떠올리게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Answer_37839_Text
msgctxt "041ff4b3-7ed6-42d6-ad88-547d2d9a743e"
msgid ""
"\"At least we have enough jobs for those capable of wielding a sword. "
"Monsters won't kill themselves, you know.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 우리는 검을 휘두르는 능력이 있는 사람들이 충분해. 그들이 괴물을 처치할 거고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Answer_40240_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5f8eaa42-fee9-40db-b344-3a6fd40e6c7a"
msgid "Threatened to kill Jubilost for a bad article."
msgstr "나쁜 기사를 쓰려는 주빌로스트를 죽이겠다고 협박합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Answer_40240_Text
msgctxt "b93f2e92-2da9-40b4-b4b1-a4627ad642e4"
msgid ""
"\"I offer you a simple deal. You write a positive review and I don't pull "
"your legs out right now.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 간단한 거래를 제안하지. 긍정적인 기사를 쓰면 네 다리를 당장 뽑지는 않을게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_01023_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8f3685cd-4cb5-4595-a623-07541fbaaac5"
msgid ""
"\"So that's how you see it. All right, have it your way.\" {n}Jubilost bows, "
"but his gaze is oozing with contempt.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그렇게 보는 것이구만. 좋아. 알아서 하라고.\" {n}주빌로스트는 인사하지만 그의 시선은 경멸로 가득 찼습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_27830_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c079c0be-ffc7-42df-89d5-8f069a83697a"
msgid ""
"\"I'll need some time to finish my article. Until then I'll stay at your "
"capital. I'm sure you don't mind? Great. By the way, I'd be pleased to "
"travel with you sometime, if you wanted to have a conversation with someone "
"smarter than your usual companions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 기사를 끝내기까지 시간이 필요해. 그 때까지 네 수도에 머무를 게. 괜찮지? 좋아. 그나저나 가끔 너랑 여행하는 건 즐겁겠어. "
"너도 평소에 같이 다니는 놈들보다는 똑똑한 사람과 대화하게 되어 즐겁겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_31392_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3fdd52de-b147-4f75-a633-b0639a9f6efd"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks for your understanding. After all, I work for all the inhabitants "
"of the {g|Inner Sea}Inner Sea{/g} region. By the way, your support will also "
"be mentioned in my article.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이해해줘서 고마워. 결국 나는 {g|Inner Sea} 내해{/g}의 모든 주민들을 위해 일하는 거니까 말이지. 그건 그렇고, 네가 "
"지원 해준 부분도 내 기사에서 언급하도록 할께. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_40187_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5375b35a-69a5-459d-a2ad-2d2ac1bb3cf6"
msgid ""
"\"Now all I have to do is finish my article for 'The Independence' about the "
"state of affairs in your barony.\" {n}Jubilost looks at you defiantly.{/n} "
"\"I will be honest with you, unfortunately I can't write anything too good.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 남은 건 너의 영지에 대한 비평을 '독립'이라는 기사에 내는 것 뿐이야.\" {n}주빌로스트는 당신을 거만하게 바라봅니다.{/n}"
" \"솔직하게 말할게. 안타깝지만 좋은 내용은 못 써.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_40877_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7cafdaa8-a780-4c50-937f-00f8839ae3d1"
msgid ""
"\"Jobs are plentiful, that's true. But wages are minimal — judging by your "
"guards' salaries. Thanks for reminding me of that. I'll have to mention this "
"in my article as well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"직업은 많아. 그게 사실이야. 하지만 월급은 최저야. 경비의 월급에 판단한다면 말이지. 상기시켜주어 고마워. 다음에 내 기사에 쓸게."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_42885_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b5b40922-18f3-433a-ba1d-da80530ed96d"
msgid ""
"\"Splendid! I knew you couldn't hide from me forever, you elusive dwarven "
"outpost!\" {n}Jubilost digs the map out of his pocket and makes a mark on "
"it. {/n}\"That's it. On behalf of all the institutions of {g|Inner Sea}Inner "
"Sea{/g}, I hereby thank you. As a matter of fact, I'm even qualified to "
"reward your help in hard coin.\" {n}He gets out his purse and throws it to "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"훌륭해! 아무리 꽁꽁 숨겨진 드워프 전초기지라고 해도 나한테 걸리면 누워서 떡먹기지!\" {n}주빌로스트는 주머니에서 지도를 꺼내고 "
"그 위에 표시를 합니다.{/n} \"다 됐다. {g|Inner Sea}내해{/g}의 모든 기관을 대표하여 고마워. 심지어 돈까지 주고 "
"싶다니까. \" {n}그는 지갑을 꺼내 당신에게 던졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_62733_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "657da608-316f-452a-bf59-c32e461eadc7"
msgid ""
"\"Monsters roaming the roads, minimal educational level, and a traveler "
"needs some unprecedented luck to be able to find any interesting sights or "
"landmarks. Sadly, these lands are not attractive — neither for potential "
"settlers, nor for tourists.\""
msgstr ""
"\"길가에는 괴물이 득실거리고, 열악한 교육 환경이라 괜찮은 경치와 명소를 찾아내려면 여행자에겐 엄청난 행운이 따라야 하지. 슬프게도 이 "
"땅은 그렇게 매력적이지 않아. 이주민들에게도, 그리고 관광객에게도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_90508_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "b216fbbd-0dd7-4177-b974-40959fe6d628"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem. You know, you are right. I will add a paragraph somewhere near the "
"end, telling readers that the barony is still developing and it has some "
"positive trends.\""
msgstr "\"에헴. 네가 맞아. 나는 끝 부분에 독자들에게 남작령은 여전히 개발 중이고 긍정적인 추세라고 쓸 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_90511_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "49fd01c1-5da2-43e1-b191-26e81f4b368c"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia's eyes widen.{/n} \"What?! Travel with a pompous, self-centered "
"buffoon like you? You wish!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아의 눈이 넓어집니다.{/n} \"뭐라구?! 너 같이 잘난 체하고 자기 중심적인 녀석과 같이 다니라고? 꿈 깨셔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairOutdoor/VSTrollLair_Jubilost/Cue_90512_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "09add5a3-fa75-4a5e-b5b9-6af6b5de4868"
msgid ""
"\"Well, seeing as it isn't your decision to make, I suppose you'll just have "
"to suffer living in my shadow for a while.\" {n}The gnome chuckles "
"smugly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"뭐, 결정권은 너한테 없으니까, 한동안 내 그림자에나 벌벌 떨라구 .\" {n}노움은 껄껄 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/BrandingDeviceBroken_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "adfca557-6400-4402-b6c1-41e5d9fe573b"
msgid ""
"Thanks to Harrim's efforts, the furnace is now broken. Fixing it will take a "
"lot of work, if it's even possible."
msgstr "하림의 노력 덕분에 용광로가 파손되었습니다. 문제를 해결하더라도 많은 시간이 걸릴 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/BrandingDevice_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "00151dfd-710d-49e7-91c9-47e63e19d5e9"
msgid ""
"Unlike the rest of the fortress, this ancient dwarven furnace is not in "
"ruins. A cheery fire burns inside it, inviting you to work."
msgstr "요새의 나머지 부분과는 달리 이 고대 드워프 용광로는 폐허가 아닙니다. 불이 그 안에서 타오르며 당신을 일하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "c306c02f-cacb-49af-aea0-56ba5b1c9f32"
msgid "\"Ssshhh! Karasssk! Essscape!\""
msgstr "\"쉬! 카라스크! 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/Dialogue_DwarfRune_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "518ffe24-007a-4d2f-9377-aa9cf536126e"
msgid ""
"An ancient rune is carved into the stone wall, gleaming with a bluish light. "
"Deep scratches mar its surface, and it's partially covered in mud. The "
"trolls seem to have made quite an effort to get rid of it. Beside this rune "
"are the outlines of two other runes, barely visible, almost destroyed by the "
"ravages of trolls and time."
msgstr ""
"고대 룬이 돌벽에 새겨져 푸른 빛으로 번쩍입니다. 깊은 흠집은 그 표면에 나타나며 진흙이 여기저기 덮여 있습니다. 트롤들은 그것을 없애기 "
"위해 상당한 노력을 한 것 같습니다. 이 룬 옆에는 트롤과 세월로 파괴되어 거의 눈에 보이지 않는 두 개의 다른 룬의 윤곽이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/DwarfFresco_String
msgctxt "e9411ac2-6484-43cd-ba51-1d89e222b80a"
msgid "For some reason, the trolls haven't broken this piece of dwarven art."
msgstr "왠일인지 트롤들은 이 드워프 예술 작품을 부수지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/HragulkaKillsTartukBarks/HragulkaToPlayerAtEnd_String
msgctxt "0bc5c94d-ec71-4beb-b2fa-aee31d991b25"
msgid "\"Now you turn... GRRRAARGH!\""
msgstr "\"이제 너는... GRRRAARGH!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/HragulkaKillsTartukBarks/HragulkaToPlayerAtStart_String
msgctxt "67e592cb-df7d-4472-a545-83b81b2efad8"
msgid "\"You next, borba!\""
msgstr "\"네가 다음이다. 보바!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/HragulkaKillsTartukBarks/HragulkaToTartuk1_String
msgctxt "81f3676b-ec65-4889-87a2-fdc71f3dddb9"
msgid "\"Scaly bastard! Knew you couldn't be trusted!\""
msgstr "\"나쁜 놈! 네가 믿을 수 없다는 걸 알고 있었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/HragulkaKillsTartukBarks/HragulkaToTartuk2_String
msgctxt "4fff0e61-26de-4fdd-b7d6-5ef806d7daee"
msgid ""
"\"That's it! Only trolls will rule this lands! Death to kobolds! Death to "
"borba!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 트롤만이 이 땅을 지배할 수 있어! 코볼트에게 죽음을! 보바에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/HragulkaKillsTartukBarks/TartukToHragulka1_String
msgctxt "28f0b4e8-cfa7-423b-8169-64b97674b3bf"
msgid "\"Ssstop, ssstupid! Ssstep back!\""
msgstr "\"멈춰. 멍청아! 물러서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/SunMoonPuzzle_String
msgctxt "6e98d531-db66-4af5-a9b2-c1fa0c81950d"
msgid ""
"The trolls have not been kind to these strange statues. Their purpose "
"remains unknown."
msgstr "트롤들은 이 이상한 조각상에 친절하지 않았습니다. 그들의 목적은 아직 알려지지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/TrollFlag_String
msgctxt "c10428fe-e434-4f25-8293-2d958beae91f"
msgid "Trolls rarely use flags. Their leader must be a genius for his race."
msgstr "트롤은 거의 깃발을 사용하지 않습니다. 그들의 지도자는 그 종족에 있어서 천재임에 틀림 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/TrollJunkBark_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "d4d37936-700f-4f51-a649-c920a238ac57"
msgid ""
"This troll \"treasury\" reminds you of a city dump. Broken tables, smashed "
"cupboards, doors ripped from their hinges — all taken from raids on human "
"villages."
msgstr ""
"이 트롤 \"보물창고\"는 도시 쓰레기장을 생각나게 합니다. 부서진 탁자, 부서진 찬장, 경첩에서 뜯어낸 문들, 모두 인간 마을을 "
"습격해서 얻은 것들입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Barks/TrollThrone_String
msgctxt "b5766801-2758-41bc-a4fa-ba530f876a06"
msgid ""
"The troll leader fancies himself a true king — he even made himself a throne."
msgstr "트롤 지도자는 자신을 진정한 왕으로 생각했습니다. 심지어 스스로를 왕위에 올려놓았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_02898_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d7c403ef-e441-484d-b5f5-5b60b9d8fd81"
msgid ""
"Told the trolls the reason to fight them was to protect humanity from "
"monsters."
msgstr "트롤들에게 그들과 싸울 이유는 인간을 괴물들로부터 보호하기 위한 것이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_02898_Text
msgctxt "a4d53c5b-5ed5-4de0-b23e-4dd3feed1db2"
msgid ""
"\"You monsters threaten humanity. You may seem civilized, but there's a dark "
"beast deep inside each of you, a beast that must be stopped before it bites."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 괴물들은 인간에겐 위협이야. 너흰 문명화된 것처럼 보이지만 너희 안에는 어두운 짐승이 있어서 그런 짐승은 물기 전에 멈춰야 해."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_10112_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3bea96f2-339d-4f08-ad90-c79691dc567f"
msgid "Told the trolls the reason to fight them was just coincidence."
msgstr "트롤들에게 그들과 싸울 이유는 우연인 것이라고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_10112_Text
msgctxt "0b404707-f924-46af-9190-3e80eff52846"
msgid "[Shrug] \"It just happened this way.\""
msgstr "[으쓱합니다] \"그냥 이렇게 된 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_18610_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f1b7c2be-4423-4dbe-9d24-8e2573b65c44"
msgid "Told the trolls the reason to fight them was the joy of killing."
msgstr "트롤들에게 그들과 싸울 이유는 죽이는 것이 즐거워서라고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_18610_Text
msgctxt "78ef9f58-50e6-4ed7-b931-464970595bf5"
msgid ""
"\"I just enjoy killing. Listening to trolls scream when acid touches their "
"skin... and slaughtering kobolds by the score, well, who hasn't time for "
"that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그냥 죽이는 걸 즐긴다. 산이 피부에 닿을 때 트롤이 지르는 소리와... 재미로 코볼트를 죽이는 것도... 그걸 마다할 사람이 "
"있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_49640_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6ff0ed39-0359-4934-8ef6-a64ed0ac4dc0"
msgid ""
"Told the trolls the reason to fight them was their lack of civilization."
msgstr "트롤에게 그들과 싸울 이유는 그들이 문명화되지 않았기 때문이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_49640_Text
msgctxt "a3d0870a-e62b-4500-acbc-7655a5e59bbe"
msgid ""
"\"My barony is for civilized races only. Your kind are murderers and are not "
"welcome here.\""
msgstr "\"내 남작령은 문명화된 종족만을 위한 것이다. 너희 같은 살인자 종족은 이곳에서 환영받지 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57067_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ccdbb6b4-870a-4e57-b0e6-a804922b5159"
msgid "Told the trolls the reason to fight them was to protect the barony."
msgstr "트롤들에게 그들과 싸울 이유는 남작령을 보호하기 위한 것이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57067_Text
msgctxt "faa276a0-e9cf-41d0-b1c6-d4c7fa4878b8"
msgid "\"You attacked my barony. I protect my subjects.\""
msgstr "\"너희는 내 영지를 공격했다. 나는 내 백성을 보호한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57068_Text
msgctxt "8b0671ac-f136-4285-87fc-07a71cabd117"
msgid ""
"\"I see you haven't taught your pet to heel, Tartuk. Serves you right — "
"these trolls may be strong, but the village dog has more obedience and sense "
"than they do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 애완 동물을 가르치지 않았나 보군. 너를 옳게 섬기라고 해라. 이 트롤은 강하지만 마을의 개가 차라리 복종을 더 잘하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57073_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ef9cd4cb-ca65-4ed0-a6de-24d093b1c46f"
msgid "Pitted Hargulka against Tartuk."
msgstr "하굴카를 타툭과 겨루게 했다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57073_Text
msgctxt "40812b83-3c60-49d4-886d-489228504157"
msgid ""
"\"You beg to be put on a leash, Hargulka! I'd make you my jester, and when "
"you'd bore me enough, I'd set my hounds against you — just like Tartuk is "
"setting us on you now — and I'd let your screams entertain me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아예 목줄을 채워달라고 애원하는구나, 하굴카! 널 내 장난감으로 만들어서 나를 지겹게 할 때마다 지금 타툭이 널 괴롭히는 것처럼 "
"사냥개를 풀어서 괴롭혀주지. 네 비명소리는 정말 즐거울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57074_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e0509681-da2c-4fea-a3f6-ea90274f34cc"
msgid "Pitted Hargulka against Tartuk."
msgstr "하굴카를 타툭과 겨루게 했다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57074_Text
msgctxt "14578591-7436-49b6-84d1-0ef594af30b0"
msgid ""
"\"Just listen to that kobold! 'Ally'! When did kobolds become your equals? "
"No troll would be a kobold's dog, Hargulka — even I know that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트 말을 들어봐! 코볼트가 우리와 동등해진 적이 있어? 어떤 트롤도 코볼트의 개가 되지 않아. 하굴카. 나도 알고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57078_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6829dda2-0929-45d4-a882-f32c6eb37a01"
msgid "Pitted Hargulka against Tartuk."
msgstr "하굴카를 타툭과 겨루게 했다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57078_Text
msgctxt "8a35b883-8077-4394-9984-bcd5cb3d0f2c"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, yes, Hargulka, don't listen to borba! Listen to Tartuk, sacrifice "
"yourself and pave the kobold's road to glory with troll corpses! I bet you "
"never thought of yourself, even when Tartuk sent your tribe to their deaths! "
"I wonder, is it because you were born a fool — or a slave?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 하굴카. 보바의 말을 듣지 말아라! 타툭의 말을 듣고 너를 희생해서 트롤의 시체로 코볼트의 명예를 높여라! 타툭은 너의 종족을 "
"죽게 내버려두었을 때 너는 생각도 못했을 거라고 생각해. 너는 바보나 노예 같구나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Answer_57080_Text
msgctxt "38db9e3a-b03c-47d3-890c-78c03ff5e1e4"
msgid ""
"\"I have to ask, how long are you going to pretend, Tartuccio? I know who "
"you are.\""
msgstr "\"이건 물어봐야겠군. 언제까지 숨길 거지? 타투치오? 나는 네가 누군지 알아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_57070_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "9a17bfa8-91b0-4afe-8491-ec6556279118"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll's eyes become bloodshot.{/n} \"What?\" {n}He slowly turns "
"toward Tartuk, who takes a cautious step aside.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤의 눈은 충혈됩니다.{/n} \"뭐?\" {n}그는 천천히 타툭 쪽으로 향합니다. 타툭은 신중하게 옆으로 비킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_57071_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "033f52dc-4f42-4af8-8661-39b105e2b3f8"
msgid ""
"\"Don't lisssten to {mf|him|her}, fearlesss and wissse Hargulka! "
"{mf|He'sss|Ssshe'sss} trying to trick you! Anger you! I wasss alwaysss your "
"ally!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 녀석의 말을 듣지마! 너는 겁 없고 현명한 하굴카야! 저 녀석이 너를 속이려 하는 거야. 너를 화나게 하고. 나는 항상 너의 "
"동맹이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_57077_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "3b2936f1-2a9f-4262-9ef4-20a7ef9b218c"
msgid ""
"\"Liesss, liesss!\" {n}Tartuk glares at the approaching troll.{/n} Humansss "
"are trying to ssset usss againssst each other! Can't you sssee it? Sssss! "
"Ssstupid troll! Ssstupid-\" {n}The kobold's rant suddenly falters and his "
"eyes go wide.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말. 거짓말!\" {n}타툭은 접근하는 트롤을 봅니다.{/n} \"인간은 우리를 서로 싸우게 하려는 거야! 모르겠어? 멍청한 "
"트롤! 멍청한...\" {n}코볼트는 비틀거리더니 그의 눈이 커집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_57079_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "1397afbd-0061-4527-8385-464a0b1953e1"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka glares at you, his eyes bulging with anger. A moment later, a "
"deep growl rises from his chest and seems to shake the walls around you.{/n} "
"\"Tartuk...\" {n}The enormous troll turns and takes a step toward the "
"kobold.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 분노로 눈이 충혈되어 당신을 봅니다. 잠시 후에 그에게서 으르렁거리는 소리가 들렸고 당신 주위의 벽이 흔들리는 것처럼 "
"보입니다.{/n} \"타툭...\" {n}거대한 트롤이 돌아서 코볼트를 향해 한걸음 다가옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_57081_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "067a3290-5370-43cb-a678-8b0e6c7ad4e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Hearing the word 'Tartuccio', the kobold waves his hand hesitantly. But "
"then freezes and hisses angrily:{/n} \"You know nosssing, nosssing! So? Will "
"you tell usss, why you brought usss death?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}'타투치오'라는 말을 들은 코볼트는 머뭇거리며 손을 흔들어 댑니다. 그러나 곧 가만히 멈춰서서 쉭쉭거리는 화난 소리를 냅니다.{/n}"
" \"너는 아무것도 몰라! 아무것도! 그래서? 왜 우리에게 죽음을 불러온건지 말해줄건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_Bosses 1_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "2c843cc3-7182-429b-9c12-e009661580f0"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk puts aside the iron rod he just used to finish branding the "
"troll.{/n} \"Ssstop, courageousss and ssstrong Hargulka. I wisssh to asssk.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 트롤에게 문양을 찍으려고 쓰던 쇠막대를 옆으로 치웁니다.{/n} \"멈춰. 용감하고 강력한 하굴카여. 난 이 자에게 물을 게 "
"있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_Bosses 2_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "4971c701-0597-4529-aa71-f8db1986a5c0"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka takes a deep breath, his chest rattling, then spits on the "
"floor.{/n} \"Borba kills because trolls and kobolds are unlike {mf|him|her}. "
"That's what all borba do.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 가슴을 덜컹거리며 쉼호흡을 하고는 바닥에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"보바는 트롤과 코볼드가 너희와 다르다는 이유로 살인을 "
"한다. 모든 보바가 그렇게들 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_Bosses 3_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "a506a2a8-eaca-4bf1-bd82-bedc927eecb3"
msgid ""
"\"Trollsss and koboldsss can not essstablisssh kingdom while humansss kill "
"them.\""
msgstr "\"인간이 학살을 해댄다면 트롤과 코볼트들은 왕국을 세울 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_Bosses 4_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "83a25cc2-4700-45ef-82cc-a836af73f547"
msgid ""
"\"Deathhh!\" {n}Fire burns in the kobold's eyes, bright within his horse-"
"skull helmet.{/n}"
msgstr "\"죽음!\" {n}말 두개골 투구 안에서 밝은 코볼트의 눈이 불타오릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_Bosses 5_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "a946564f-4d67-4b43-b57a-eb67af488ea8"
msgid ""
"\"Sssay me, {race}. Why are you ssslaying usss? What did we to you? Why take "
"troll and kobold livesss in their own home?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내게 말해봐라. {race}. 왜 우리를 도륙하는 건가? 우리가 너한테 무슨 짓을 했길래? 왜 자기들 집에서 잘살고있는 트롤과 "
"코볼트들의 삶을 앗아가는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_Bosses 6_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "303626fb-e302-45a5-906b-ef2773758ec5"
msgid ""
"\"Death! Dur borba!\" {n}Hargulka pounds his club on the stone floor.{/n}"
msgstr "\"죽어라!! 두르 보바!\" {n}하굴카는 그의 몽둥이로 돌바닥을 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_Bosses 7_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "833c8901-2f0c-43bb-9b78-1368f9a2589f"
msgid ""
"{n}A deafening roar erupts from Hargulka's chest.{/n} \"STUPID TROLL?! I'LL "
"KILL YOU!\""
msgstr "{n}하굴카의 가슴에서 소리가 울려퍼져 귀가 먹을 것 같습니다.{/n} \"멍청이 트롤? 나는 너를 죽일 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Bosses/Cue_Bosses_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "e2b8dce0-4d34-479e-b97a-02571b48a7eb"
msgid ""
"\"Borba! You managed to get here.\" {n}Hargulka turns from the anvil — and "
"on his chest is a brightly glowing brand mark.{/n} \"Good. Now Hargulka will "
"tear you apart with his own hands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보바! 너는 그럭저럭 여기까지 왔구나.\" {n}하굴카는 모루에서 돌아섰고 그의 가슴에는 문양이 밝게 빛납니다.{/n} \"좋아. "
"이제 하굴카가 너를 손으로 찢어 버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_01545_Text
msgctxt "2bea3db7-43eb-47c4-b182-ed9951207ecd"
msgid ""
"\"Why did you destroy this anvil? Does Groetus encourage destruction now? "
"I've always believed that Groetus does not destroy, he just waits until the "
"end comes to everything in this world?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 이 모루를 파괴했지? 그로투스가 당장 파괴하라고 부추기던가? 나는 그로투스가 파괴를 하지 않으며, 세상 모든 것이 끝날 때까지 "
"마냥 기다리는 신이라 믿어왔는데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_03856_Text
msgctxt "ba1f26c7-8efe-446d-80f3-d8ffde04f7b2"
msgid "\"Hey, don't touch the anvil! Step back!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 모루에 손대지 마! 뒤로 물러서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_07253_Text
msgctxt "0e4e9291-d014-4d43-8594-9cc79ec4228e"
msgid ""
"\"What's done is done. But in the future, I forbid you to touch anything "
"that could be… Just don't touch anything at all.\""
msgstr "\"끝난 일은 끝난 것이다. 하지만 미래에 네가 어느 것도 만지게 하지 않을 거야... 그냥 아무것도 만지지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_29659_Text
msgctxt "3082d953-cddb-4ce2-9757-a95d343d5d8e"
msgid ""
"\"You see, everything is not that bad after all! The anvil is still "
"operational. What do you say now?\""
msgstr "\"거봐. 결국 모든 것이 그렇게 나쁘게 돌아가지는 않아! 모루는 여전히 쓸 만하잖아. 이제 뭐라고 말할 셈이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_43132_Text
msgctxt "3af0078e-7d38-47a6-a928-80fcdf62e884"
msgid "\"What have you done? We could use that anvil!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 짓을 한 거야? 우리는 모루를 사용할 수 있었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_98304_Text
msgctxt "635af364-75f3-4784-ba5a-b1189e145e2f"
msgid "\"What is it?\""
msgstr "\"그게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_98306_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "30f2fd22-f8b1-4cb2-a237-be6714e49cbb"
msgid "Advised Harrim to shatter the stone found among the anvil's shards."
msgstr "하림에게 모루의 파편에 있는 돌을 부수라고 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_98306_Text
msgctxt "a7b81870-ae0d-4d44-a7ee-fff612cfcd47"
msgid "\"What are you waiting for? Break it!\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 기다려? 어서 부숴!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_98307_Text
msgctxt "b2d96e91-26bd-4fa3-b2e1-b7a2bceb2bef"
msgid "\"Give me the jewel.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 그 보석을 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Answer_98312_Text
msgctxt "a507f918-f2e4-46fc-a1dd-3f78bde47cff"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps Torag simply didn't want an apostate like yourself touching the "
"anvil he had blessed.\""
msgstr "\"아마도 토락은 그가 축복한 모루를 만지는 제자는 원하지 않았나 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 10_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "41f2ce9f-60b7-4e8f-b92b-a5e589387bd4"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia rolls her eyes and twirls her forefinger near her temple.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 눈을 굴리며 검지 손가락으로 관자놀이를 누릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 1_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "fdfb4489-1863-4bbe-84be-d093101a456f"
msgid ""
"\"This shouldn't be like that! That is just wrong!\" {n}Harrim turns around "
"and glares at the anvil with hate in his eyes. His hands clench into "
"fists.{/n} \"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}, grant me strength! I'll restore "
"righteousness!\" {n}The dwarf deals a strong blow with his fist to the anvil "
"base.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이럴리가 없어! 이건 그냥 잘못된거야!\" {n}하림은 돌아서서 증오를 품은채 모루를 쳐다봅니다. 그의 손은 주먹을 꽉 쥡니다.{/n}"
" \"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}여 나에게 힘을 주소서! 내가 정의를 되찾겠습니다!\" {n}드워프는 주먹으로 모루를 강하게 "
"타격합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 2_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f7cc9d2a-c6ed-433c-bec8-dc3383a152f4"
msgid ""
"{n}The light grows dim for a moment. A dull rumble seems to start at the "
"base of the anvil, the sound growing steadily louder, and finally filling "
"the whole room with a deafening roar. You could swear you hear the mad "
"laughter of Groetus in this roaring, or maybe it is Harrim's own laughter? "
"The anvil trembles and suddenly falls apart, as if trying to catch up in "
"time with the rest of the fortress in its state of ruin.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}빛이 순간 희미해집니다. 둔탁한 울림 소리가 모루의 바닥에서 시작되었고 소리는 점점 커지며 마침내 귀청이 터질 듯한 굉음으로 방 "
"전체를 가득 채웁니다. 이 울림 소리에서 당신은 그로투스의 웃음소리를 듣습니다. 아니면 하림의 웃음소리였을까요? 모루는 폐허가 된 "
"요새처럼 되려는 듯 떨리더니 갑자기 산산이 부서집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 3_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "63b969d6-f405-49fa-b284-3db2a5daa300"
msgid ""
"\"I've just made things right again,\" {n}Harrim sobs, a lonely tear runing "
"down his cheek.{/n} \"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} got what he wanted. Something "
"that... That was rightfully his.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 다시 옳게 만들었어.\" {n}하림은 훌쩍이며 그의 뺨에는 눈물 한방울이 흐릅니다.{/n} \"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}"
"는 원하는 것을 얻었다. 그것은... 그의 것이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 4_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "508954a5-b53e-436c-afac-290211958d1a"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim doesn't seem to hear anything you've just said. He stands frozen "
"in some kind of torpor over the destroyed anvil.{/n} \"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}"
"... has got what he wanted. My duty here is done.\" {n}His shoulders shake "
"with suppressed sobs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 당신이 방금 한 말을 듣지 않는 것 같습니다. 파괴된 모루 뒤에서 그는 얼어붙었습니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}... 그는 원하는 것을 얻었다. 내 의무가 끝났어. \" {n}훌쩍임을 참으며 그의 어깨는 "
"흔들렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 5_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8fbe7c32-cd52-40c4-ab33-70e8ee12b078"
msgid ""
"\"I've done what I had to do! This anvil should have been destroyed long "
"ago! I've just restored righteousness!\" {n}Harrim looks at you angrily, but "
"his voice trembles with sorrow.{/n} \"I had to do it. It was so hard for me, "
"{name}. Almost as hard as living itself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 내가 해야만 하는 일을 했다네! 이 모루는 오래 전에 파괴되어야 했어! 나는 방금 정의를 되찾았다!\" {n}하림은 당신을 "
"분노로 보지만 그의 목소리는 슬픔으로 떨립니다.{/n} \"나는 해야만 했다네. 나에게는 어려운 일이었어. {name}. 살아가는것 "
"만큼이나 어려운 일이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 6_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e12dd165-5254-47c0-a6f9-ef41dfce0d90"
msgid ""
"\"For all the... How can you constantly doubt the overwhelming might of "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}?\" {n}his face grows red with anger, his eyes bulge "
"and seem to almost fall from their sockets.{/n} \"How can you denounce him "
"every time you get a chance?! You're a blasphemer!\" {n}Filled with rage he "
"raises his hand to hit you, but at the last moment, he turns away and hits "
"the base of the broken anvil instead.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"모든 것을 위해... 어떻게 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 압도적인 힘을 의심할 수 있지? \" {n}그의 얼굴은 분노로 "
"붉어지고 눈은 부풀어 올랐고 거의 튀어나올 것 같았습니다.{/n} \"어떻게 기회가 생길 때마다 그를 비난할 수 있지?! 이건 신성 "
"모독이다!\" {n}분노로 가득차서 그는 손을 올려 당신을 치려고 했지만 마침내 그는 몸을 돌려 부서진 모루를 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 7_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3e3ace3b-d98e-4b0e-924e-7425992f44bb"
msgid ""
"{n}After several moments, Harrim comes to his senses.{/n} \"Forgive me, "
"{name}. Sometimes I still forget how difficult it is to follow the path of "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. I must not get angry at unbelievers. I must persuade "
"them to make their own choice of following the one true God.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 후 하림은 제 정신으로 돌아옵니다.{/n} \"용서해줘. {name}. 가끔 나는 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 길을 "
"따르기가 얼마나 어려운지 잊어. 나는 불신자들에게 분노하지 말아야 해. 나는 그들을 설득해 진정한 신을 따르게 해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 8_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8de5d1f5-533e-4b19-ab70-484914a130d5"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim's second blow shatters the remnants of the anvil. Among the "
"shards, something catches your attention — an odd red stone, definitely of "
"magical origins. It radiates heat and glitters with every shade of flame.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하림의 두 번째 타격은 모루를 모두 부숩니다. 파편 사이에서 당신은 무엇인가를 포착합니다. 마법의 힘이 담긴 오래된 붉은 "
"돌이었습니다. 그것은 열과 빛을 발산합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299 9_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9db55839-3b92-4313-b92d-703444fec7e4"
msgid "\"I don't want to upset you, my friend, but you're such an idiot.\""
msgstr "\"이봐 친구, 화나게 하고 싶지는 않지만, 넌 정말 멍청이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98299_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "88167a64-e456-49ff-ac3c-299b5564539b"
msgid ""
"{n}He finally averts his gaze from the fire and turns to you.{/n} \"The very "
"existence of this anvil is miraculous and... unnatural. So much suffering "
"and sorrow surrounds us, and yet here... hope?\" {n}Harrim shakes his beard "
"in negation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마침내 그는 불에서 시선을 돌려 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"이 모루가 아직 존재하는 것이 기적적이고.. 비정상적인거야. 너무나 많은 "
"고통과 슬픔이 우리 주위를 감싸고 있다네. 그리고 이곳에서도...느껴지는건.... 희망? {n}하림은 부인하며 턱수염을 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98302_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0c2eae17-9b6b-4306-9cd7-ea27b88630d8"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest picks up the glimmering jewel from the floor and looks at it "
"suspiciously. He nearly throws the gem against the wall, but something makes "
"him hesitate. The red reflections dance on his face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}사제는 바닥에서 빛나는 보석을 들어올리고는 의심스럽게 관찰합니다. 그는 보석을 벽에 던지려 했지만 무언가가 그를 주저하게 합니다. "
"그의 얼굴에 붉은 빛이 춤을 춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98305_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e98cccd3-f080-4218-a337-181ca34d47d9"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know, but I feel Torag's touch upon it. Maybe those who created "
"the anvil put it inside? Or... Hmm... No, no, nonsense, this cannot be. "
"Jewels don't appear from out of nowhere... But then metal isn't usually "
"broken with bare hands, right? I don't know, {Name}. I don't know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠지만 토락의 손길이 느껴져. 모루를 만든 사람들이 그걸 안쪽에 넣었을까? 아니면... 흠... 말도 안돼. 보석이 그냥 "
"나타났을리 없네... 하지만 또 금속은 보통 맨손으로 부서지지 않고, 맞나 ? 나도 모르겠네. {Name}. 모르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98308_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "c7923c6c-799a-4f62-b641-55e70345944e"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf hurls the shimmering jewel onto the floor. It shatters into "
"splinters, which vanish into the air.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}드워프는 반짝이는 보석을 바닥으로 던집니다. 그것은 파편으로 부서져 공기 중으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98309_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "80231413-be62-47d8-8ec5-d21c695ef138"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim hands you the jewel.{/n} \"There. Do as you wish with it. You can "
"sell it, throw it away, keep it as a memento... If it's {g|Torag}Torag's{/g} "
"parting gift, I have no need of it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림이 당신에게 보석을 건넵니다.{/n} \"자, 원하는 대로 하게. 그것을 팔던가 던져버리던가 기념품으로 간직하던가... "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}의 이별 선물이라면 나는 필요 없네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98310_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "1d687afc-a3ed-4d40-97a0-8b756a99a944"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim wipes the tears from his eyes.{/n} \"I shouldn't have come here. "
"What did I expect to find besides decay, dust and ash? I... Forgive me, "
"{Name}. Thank you for honoring my request and bringing me here. But now... "
"now I wish to be alone.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 눈에서 눈물을 닦습니다.{/n} \"여기 오지 말았어야 했어. 이곳에서 부패와 먼지, 재 외에 뭘 찾을 수 있을거라 "
"기대했던걸까? 나..날 용서해 주게. {Name}. 내 부탁을 들어주고 이곳에 데려와줘서 고맙네. 하지만 지금은.. 혼자 있고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_98311_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "c60fcc86-8f24-40ca-94a7-061a37d0e7e6"
msgid ""
"\"Huh! That was awesome! When did you learn to break cast iron with your "
"bare hands? You're strong!\""
msgstr "\"정말 대단했어! 언제 맨손으로 철을 깨는 법을 배웠어? 너 강하구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_InspectDevice 1_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e9e0affb-8eb7-4999-b651-8053b22c4de0"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim pets the anvil gently, without any fear of its heat.{/n} \"Once… I "
"dreamed of working with a furnace like that. I gave oaths to "
"{g|Torag}Torag{/g} that I'd craft hundreds of suits of armor. That my hammer "
"would be tireless... Oh, that was so long ago...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 열을 두려워 하지 않고 부드럽게 모루를 쓰다듬습니다.{/n} \"한번은... 이런 용광로에서 일하는 꿈을 꿨었다네. "
"{g|Torag}토락{/g}에게 수백벌의 갑옷을 만들겠다고 맹세했지. 내 망치는 지칠줄 모른다고... 아, 그건 정말 오래 전의 일이야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_InspectDevice 2_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5731d74f-7aed-4894-ab32-54854ec366c1"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim seems not to hear you, totally entranced by the fire dancing "
"before his eyes.{/n} \"Once… I dreamed of working with a furnace like that. "
"I gave oaths to {g|Torag}Torag{/g} that I'd craft hundreds of armor suits. "
"That my hammer would be tireless... Oh, that was so long ago...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 당신의 말은 듣지 않고 눈 앞에서 춤추는 불꽃에 완전히 빠져든 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"한 번은... 이런 용광로로 "
"일하는 꿈을 꿨었어. {g|Torag}토락{/g}에게 맹세를 해서 수백벌의 갑옷을 만들겠다고 했지. 내 망치는 지칠줄 몰랐지만... 그건 "
"정말 오래 전의 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/BrandingDevice/Cue_InspectDevice_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "cf88eb40-07a2-46e0-8661-f6587abb1d6d"
msgid ""
"\"An ancient anvil... Can it… Can it still work? \" {n}Harrim can't believe "
"his own eyes, so he reaches to the anvil, touches it with care. Fiery sparks "
"flit dangerously close to his beard.{/n} \"It's just... beautiful...\" {n}"
"The dwarf smiles happily.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"고대의 모루... 여전히 쓸 수 있을까?\" {n}하림은 자신의 눈을 믿을 수 없어 모루에 손을 대고 조심스럽게 만집니다. 불꽃이 "
"튀어 그의 수염 가까이 튑니다.{/n} \"정말... 아름답군...\" {n}드워프는 행복하게 미소짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Answer_29647_Text
msgctxt "fbbed95b-b28d-4c73-ab20-3ed6b2cd9e41"
msgid ""
"\"As far as I have heard, there is a big dwarven clan, the Langebukk, "
"somewhere in Druma. I guess they own some sort of trade caravan business. "
"They even own a store in Restov, supposedly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 듣기로는 드루마 어딘가에 랑게북크라고 불리는 큰 규모의 드워프 일족이 있다고 해. 그들은 일종의 캐러밴 무역 사업을 하고 있는 "
"것 같아. 심지어 그들은 레스토프에 상점도 소유하고 있는 걸로 알고있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Answer_47395_Text
msgctxt "e5190321-acbd-4a40-b639-7626de4d29d3"
msgid "\"Do you know anything about this clan?\""
msgstr "\"이 일족에 대해 알고 있는게 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Answer_48001_Text
msgctxt "9b22bd3b-a9f7-4c17-b217-b0fc4d8eae75"
msgid ""
"\"For all we know, the dwarves just left. We can't be so sure about their "
"deaths.\""
msgstr "\"우리 모두 알고 있듯이, 드워프들은 방금 떠났어. 그들의 죽음을 그렇게 확신할 수는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Answer_52092_Text
msgctxt "0e50c16f-b9b9-412f-bbb4-9a3e6d4e96f8"
msgid "[Leave] \"Yeah-yeah, so sad, let's go.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"그래그래. 참 슬프네. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Answer_82129_Text
msgctxt "47d42363-5e8d-4d17-bbdd-6c2e7c4091c7"
msgid "\"Why does this rune shine?\""
msgstr "\"이 룬은 왜 빛나고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Cue_14148_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "765a917b-b9dc-4b3c-aa30-6633b9a2a6c0"
msgid ""
"\"Dwarves like to mark the walls of their fortresses and caves. They use "
"their clan-rune for this purpose. Usually they enchant this rune to spread "
"light, so the dwarves can proudly observe it even in the total darkness.\" "
"{n}Harrim examines the rune one more time.{/n} \"Where is all your pride "
"now, oh Langebukk Clan?\""
msgstr ""
"\"드워프들은 요새와 동굴의 벽에 표시를 해놓는 것을 좋아한다네. 그들은 표시할 때 일족의 룬을 사용하지. 보통, 룬에 빛을 발하는 "
"마법을 부여해서 완전한 어둠속에서도 확연히 관찰 할 수 있게 한다네. {n}하림은 룬을 한 번 더 살펴봅니다.{/n}\"오 랑게북크 "
"일족들이여. 이제 그 자존심들은 어디갔소?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Cue_14826_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6deadaca-3528-4f14-afa7-38ddd2cd6452"
msgid ""
"\"So they didn't perish yet, after all… what a shame.\" {n}Harrim lets out a "
"discontented sigh.{/n} \"Anyway, every living creature is bound to die,\" {n}"
"he claims, but without too much certainty.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그럼, 결국 그들은 아직 죽지 않은건가... 안타까운 일이구만.\" {n}하림은 불만스러운 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"어쨌든 모든 "
"생명체는 반드시 죽게된다네.\" {n}그는 뭔가 확신에 가득차지 않은 듯 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Cue_42589_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ba7758d2-1ae6-431d-8975-48540c75fccd"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim sighs with sadness.{/n} \"We know they had left and we know they "
"have never returned to the dwarven kingdom in the South. So what do you "
"imagine could happen to them?\" {n}Harrim shakes his head resignedly, his "
"beard making a slight rustling sound while moving over his chest.{/n} \"No, "
"{name}. All your hopes are empty. As are any hopes in the world, I must "
"add...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 슬픔 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"우리는, 그들은 떠났고 남쪽 드워프 왕국으로 다시는 돌아오지 않았다는 것을 알고 있어. "
"그래서 그들에게 무슨 일이 일어났을꺼라고 생각하는건가?\" {n}하림은 채념한듯 머리를 흔들었고 수염이 가슴 위를 움직이면서 바스락거리는 "
"소리를 냅니다.{/n} \"아니. {name}. 너의 모든 희망은 텅 비어있을 뿐이네. 세상의 모든 희망이 그렇듯이 말이야. 나는 그 "
"텅빈 곳을 채워야 하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Cue_57183_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "22a3bc5b-16f6-411c-8262-cac40ca02637"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim nods with dignity, pulling his beard again.{/n} \"Dwarves have "
"long, long lives. When my father was still young, he saw the Langebukk's "
"exodus from {g|Five Kings Mountains}Five Kings Mountains{/g}. They were "
"heading to the North. Whole city had gathered then to wave goodbye to them. "
"No one ever saw them again. Now I know what horrible fate befell over their "
"poor souls...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 다시 수염을 잡으며 위엄있게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"드워프들은 수명이 매우 길다네. 우리 아버지가 아직 젊었을 때 "
"{g|Five Kings Mountains} 다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}에서 랑게북크 일족의 이주를 지켜보셨지. 그들은 북쪽으로 향하고 "
"있었어. 모든 도시의 주민이 모여 그들에게 작별 인사를 했어. 그후로 누구도 다시는 그들을 보지 못했지. 그 불쌍한 영혼들에게 어떤 "
"끔찍한 운명이 닥쳐온건지 이제 알겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Cue_97122_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5bc9a469-8e46-4eff-9828-68d9d620b44f"
msgid ""
"\"Where their path ended? I don't see a mountain of skulls below this rune. "
"Some historians have lost their diplomas for such rash conclusions and "
"sweeping generalizations!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어디가 길이 끝난 장소라는 거야? 이 룬에서 해골 무더기 같은건 느껴지지 않아. 몇몇 역사학자들은 그렇게 성급한 결론과 전반적인 "
"일반화로 학위를 잃었다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Cue_97125_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6722f1bd-5560-4f22-9e8e-b3d4b77ae4dc"
msgid ""
"\"I never tire of dwarves who consider themselves long-lived... Compared to "
"elves, you're basically mayflies.\""
msgstr "\"자신들이 오래 살았다고 주장하는 드워프를 많이 봤지... 엘프와 비교했을 때 그들은 하루살이에 불과해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Cue_97127_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7c32c50c-fb33-4494-a836-3d4f34a55dcf"
msgid ""
"\"That's it, we're done for. The old ones got started talking about age. We "
"should just set up camp right here — this'll take forever!\""
msgstr "\"그게 다야. 끝났어. 노인네가 드디어 나이에 대해 말하기 시작하는군. 여기서 야영을 하자. 밤새도록 이야기할 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/DwarfRune/Cue_Inspect_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "7d9eda4a-fa91-457b-882a-1da1a6c1435e"
msgid ""
"\"Look, this is the rune of the Langebukk clan. Their whole clan must have "
"perished many years ago. Now we know the place where their path ended. Let "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} wrap them up in his eternal emptiness.\" {n}Harrim "
"reaches his hand forwards, as if trying to touch the rune, but at the last "
"moment, he jerks his fingers away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이것봐. 이건 랑게북크 일족의 룬이로군. 그들 일족 전체가 수 년 전에 죽었음에 틀림없어. 이제 우리는 그들의 길이 끝난 장소를 알게 "
"되었군. {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}가 그들을 영원한 공허에 감싸게 두자.\" {n}하림은 룬을 만지려는 듯 손을 앞으로 뻗지만, "
"마지막 순간 손가락을 다른 데로 홱 뿌리친다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/EnterPoints/SecondLevelEntrance_Tooltip_String
msgctxt "58c74dea-59f8-41ef-8bd4-d00fca45c08e"
msgid "To the lower level"
msgstr "낮은 층으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/Items/DwarfKeepDiary2_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "3e449be2-5fa0-4eaa-be6f-6b05d79af689"
msgid ""
"This tome has no beginning and most pages are missing. Its high-quality "
"parchment is stained so thickly you can barely read it.\n"
"\"Sarenith 4499\n"
"Rostland is in flames: the barbarians brought some dragons along. Instead of "
"traders, there are crowds of hungry, tattered, wounded refugees moving along "
"the Shield Road. Thanks to us, they can at least be safe from the bandits, "
"but it can't go on like this any longer. All three clans are utter bankrupts "
"now. We're still here only because no one wants to lose face and leave first."
"\n"
"Arodus 4499\n"
"News arrived from the Silvershield Fortress: Woradashes are leaving. "
"Everyone curses them, but I'm secretly grateful. They've covered themselves "
"in shame but let the others keep face. Some try to look bold and claim "
"Skjegges and Langebukks will manage without them, but everyone knows this is "
"just empty bravado. This is the end of the Shield Road.\n"
"Torawsh 4499\n"
"We are gathering our possessions and get ready to seal the fortress — for a "
"long, long time, for centuries or even for millennia. Until the day our "
"descendants will come back here to claim what belongs to them. We must leave "
"a lot behind — well, at least we can properly use all these secret rooms!\n"
"It's especially sad to leave the Searing Palm. There's no second furnace "
"like this in the whole River Kingdoms — it wouldn't be a shame to offer "
"Torag himself to work with it. So many enchanted arrows, swords, axes we "
"have created in this furnace! So many trolls were eliminated by that "
"enchanted burning steel! Alas, we can't take the furnace with us. We can "
"only hope some trespassers won't find this fortress, and even if they do, "
"they won't be able to get inside.\n"
"We'll also have to leave behind the treasure hidden in the place near the "
"watchtower. It can only be opened by representatives of all three clans "
"together, when they unite their keys. And Woradashes took theirs with them "
"when they left. Well, they had every right to do it.\n"
"The last secret room was sealed by old Ols, master of complex mechanisms. He "
"didn't even tell me how this machinery works: just smirked like a madman and "
"mumbled something about the sun that meets guests of the keep and the moon "
"that faces the sky furnace.\n"
"Lamashan 4499\n"
"We are leaving the fortress, which had been guarded by three generations of "
"our ancestors for three hundred years. We're walking back the road, paved by "
"our great-grandfathers, the road we dedicated our lives to – Shield Road has "
"become the road of shame to us. Not everyone succumbed to disgrace: the few "
"desperadoes called themselves the Last Shields and took an oath to defend "
"the road until their last breath. They are the ones who harbor the very "
"spirit of the dwarves king Talhrik had strived to restore! Those are the "
"best among us — too bad they will have to die alone in the wilderness. The "
"young Wark is one of them — he declined blank to leave his post at the "
"watchtower. I left Langebukk's key to him — we hardly have anyone more "
"worthy to keep it. Old Gaugen Skjegge stays with him claiming he would "
"better die as an old stubborn-head than as a coward. I have nothing to "
"answer to this — we've let our king and our ancestors down.\n"
"Farewell, Bronzeshield Fortress! Sleep well and dream of the day the dwarves "
"will return.\""
msgstr ""
"이 책은 앞장이 없으며 대부분의 페이지가 없습니다. 고품질 양피지는 얼룩이 져서 간신히 읽을 수 있습니다.\n"
"\"서레니스 4499\n"
"로스틀랜드는 화염에 휩싸였다: 야만족들이 드래곤을 끌고 왔다. 상인들 대신, 굶주리고, 너덜너덜하고, 부상당한 피난민들이 방패의 길을 "
"따라 이주해왔다. 적어도 그들은 우리 덕분에 도적으로부터 안전할 수 있겠지만, 우리로선 더 이상 현 상태를 유지할 수 없다. 세 부족 "
"모두 완전히 파산했다. 우리가 아직 여기에 있는 이유는, 체면을 버리고 먼저 떠날 사람이 아무도 없기 때문일 뿐이다.\n"
"아로두스 4499\n"
"은방패 요새에서 서신이 도착했다: 워라대쉬가 떠난다. 모두 그들을 저주하지만, 나는 사실 감사한다. 그들은 수치심을 느끼겠지만 다른 "
"부족의 체면을 살려줬다. 용감해 보이려는 누군가는 셰게와 랑게북크가 저들 없이도 살 수 있다고 주장했지만, 그것이 애처로운 허세라는 것은 "
"모두가 안다. 방패의 길은 끝났다.\n"
"토라우쉬 4499\n"
"우리는 재산을 모아 요새를 봉쇄할 준비를 했다 — 긴 시간, 오랜 세월, 수 세기, 심지어 수천 년 동안 유지될 봉인을. 우리의 후손들이 "
"돌아와서 자신들의 소유를 주장하는 날이 올 때까지 말이다. 우리는 많은 재산을 남겨둬야만 한다 — 좋아, 최소한 비밀 방들을 적절하게 "
"사용할 수 있겠어!\n"
"타오르는 손바닥을 떠나는 것은 특히 슬픈 일이었다. 강의 왕국들 전역에도 이와 대등한 용광로는 존재하지 않는다 — 토락께서 이것을 "
"쓰시도록 바치는 것조차 부끄럽지 않을거다. 우리가 이 용광로에서 만들어내고 마법을 불어 넣은 화살, 검, 도끼들이 수도 없이 많다! "
"마법이 부여된 불타는 강철에 의해 멸절당한 트롤들 또한 수도 없이 많고! 아아, 우리는 용광로를 가져갈 수 없다. 어떤 침입자가 이 "
"요새를 찾지 못하기를, 발견하더라도 그곳에 닿을 수 없기를 바랄 수밖에.\n"
"또한 우리는 망루 근처의 장소에 보물을 숨겨야만 한다. 세 부족의 대표가 열쇠를 결합할 때만 열 수 있다. 그리고 워라대쉬는 떠나면서 "
"그들의 열쇠를 가져갔다. 음, 그들에겐 그럴 권리가 있다.\n"
"마지막 비밀 방은 복잡한 기계 장치 장인인 늙은 올스가 봉인했다. 그는 이 기계가 어떻게 작동하는지도 말하지 않았다. 그는 단지 미친 "
"사람처럼 손님을 맞는 태양과 하늘 용광로를 바라보는 달에 관해 중얼댈 뿐이다.\n"
"라마샨 4499\n"
"우리는 삼백 년 동안 삼 대의 조상들이 지켜왔던 요새를 떠나고 있다. 우리는 우리의 증조부가 닦은 길을 뒤로 한 채 걷고 있다. 우리의 "
"일생을 바쳤던 방패의 길은 이제 우리에게 수치의 길이 되었다. 모두가 망신에 무릎 꿇지는 않았다: 죽음을 각오한 소수의 사람들이 자신들을 "
"마지막 방패라 칭하고 죽을 때까지 이 길을 지키겠다 맹세했다. 그들은 드워프 왕 탈리크가 되찾으려 노력했던 바로 그 정신을 품은 "
"사람들이다! 그들은 우리 가운데에서도 최고다 — 그들이 광야에서 홀로 죽어야 하다니 슬프군. 젊은 왁크는 그들 중 하나였다. 그는 망루에 "
"만든 자신의 기지를 비우고 싶어하지 않았다. 나는 그에게 랑게북크의 열쇠를 넘겨줬다. 그것을 지킬 사람은 그 자 말고 없다. 늙은 가우젠 "
"셰게는 겁쟁이가 되느니 고집 센 노인네로 죽겠다면서 그와 함께 머물렀다. 나는 이 말에 대꾸할 수 없었다. 우리는 우리의 왕과 우리의 "
"조상들을 저버렸으니.\n"
"잘 있거라, 청동 방패 요새여! 잘 자거라, 그리고 언젠가 드워프들이 돌아오는 날을 꿈꾸너라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_01320 1_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldTeacher
msgctxt "f18d8bee-ecc7-49bd-91bd-4cdd1c4c80ec"
msgid ""
"{n}The shaman turns and sees you. His eyes go wide and he points his finger "
"at you.{/n} \"Dur borba! Kill meatsss!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}샤먼이 몸을 돌려 당신을 발견합니다. 눈이 커지며 손가락으로 당신을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"두르 보바! 저 고깃덩이를 죽여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_01320_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldTeacher
msgctxt "50d5bc45-054f-40e0-9a24-adab9ed000d4"
msgid "\"Borba. Meat.\""
msgstr "\"보바. 고기.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_47891 1_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldPupil
msgctxt "6423b8fa-c8b0-4507-948b-a978bba56e8f"
msgid "\"Meatsss.\""
msgstr "\"고기.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_47891_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldPupil
msgctxt "78c71d0b-cdd0-45a4-8c8e-296d79012f08"
msgid "\"Eatsss...\""
msgstr "\"먹자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_84106 1_Text
#. Speaker : TrollPupil
msgctxt "87a268cd-9b81-45ee-950e-cf260e4bb168"
msgid "\"Borba. Meat.\""
msgstr "\"보바. 고기.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_84106_Text
#. Speaker : TrollPupil
msgctxt "bd411dae-d7d4-47a7-9282-3c64e5fc8871"
msgid "\"Gulb. Eat.\""
msgstr "\"꿀꺽. 먹어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_Watch1 2_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldPupil
msgctxt "c67647f6-1b15-4fc9-bbc3-9e47bda7d582"
msgid ""
"\"Ssspeak!\" {n}The kobold student echoes shrilly, then snorts in what might "
"be a laugh.{/n}"
msgstr "\"말해라!\" {n}코볼트 학생들은 메아리 치며 소리쳤고 잠시후 코웃음들을 칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_Watch1 3_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldTeacher
msgctxt "7faa7ced-c9eb-451b-babd-4c493d0c667d"
msgid ""
"{n}The shaman stares at the student for a while, hissing wordlessly, then "
"turns to the others.{/n} \"Gulb. Eat.\""
msgstr "{n}샤먼은 한동안 학생을 쳐다보며 말없이 쉭쉭 소리를 내다가 옆의 트롤에게로 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"먹어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_Watch1 4_Text
#. Speaker : TrollPupil
msgctxt "ed03748b-9194-4b91-83fa-229c773474aa"
msgid "\"Kill meat!\""
msgstr "\"고기 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_Watch1 5_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldTeacher
msgctxt "5a17a9a5-47a8-48af-a2b4-fdaa918d023b"
msgid "\"Borba wordsss. Lisssten closssely. And ssspeak after!\""
msgstr "\"보바 말한다. 잘 들어라. 그리고 말해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/KoboldTeacher/Cue_Watch1_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldTeacher
msgctxt "907a729f-ae32-429d-a372-ca2214e91b58"
msgid ""
"{n}A kobold shaman, clad in long flowing robes, swaggers back and forth "
"before the gathered trolls and kobolds. His posture is proud, strict, and "
"imbued with dignity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}헐렁한 로브를 입은 코볼트 샤먼은 코볼트와 트롤을 모으기 전에 몸을 앞뒤로 휘청입니다. 그의 자세는 자신감이 넘쳤고 "
"엄격해보였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 10_Text
#. Speaker : ToyKoboldArguer
msgctxt "a420571f-9a45-4288-bcb2-d304cc6be4bc"
msgid ""
"{n}It's hard to say if kobold understands the meaning of these claims, but "
"all the enraged troll's shouting has absolutely no effect on him.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼드가 이 말의 의미를 이해하는것 같지는 않지만, 격분한 트롤의 고함소리는 그에게 아무런 영향도 미치지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 12_Text
#. Speaker : ToyKoboldArguer
msgctxt "ab9c3551-b38c-4ec5-818e-d2e010126921"
msgid ""
"{n}Having the bureau opened, a kobold fishes out a long black whip, raises "
"it above his head and hisses triumphantly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 전리품 더미에서 서랍을 열고는 그안에서 검고 긴 채찍을 꺼내더니 머리 위로 들며 의기양양해 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 13_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5a022619-4372-45d6-af3d-0ad2b950b336"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't that the special thing Bartholomew the wizard oh-so-wanted to "
"acquire? I'd like to have a closer look.\""
msgstr "\"마법사 바솔로뮤가 그렇게 얻고 싶어하던 것이 아닌가? 더 자세히 살펴보고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 14_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Capital
msgctxt "52c21355-755f-440d-ba76-c680bf38d2cc"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yeah! I'd have a closer look at it with you, Octavia. Hehe, ahem-m-m.\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 더 자세히 보고 싶어. 옥타비아. 헤헤, 에헴엠\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 15_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Capital
msgctxt "569929ec-c7c8-456a-bf71-1464383c8372"
msgid ""
"\"Is it the whip that weakling Bartholomew willed to retrieve? I'd like to "
"have a closer look!\""
msgstr "\"약골 바솔로뮤가 얻으려고 했던 그 채찍인가? 더 자세히 보고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 1_Text
#. Speaker : ToyKoboldArguer
msgctxt "4b48f108-0c58-4f3c-ab5e-32534cb7d048"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobolds, however, don't seem to be in any way disturbed by the threat "
"the trolls radiate. They rummage busily through the pile of stuff littering "
"the stone floor. Looks like this is the stockpile the trolls had brought "
"back from their recent raids to the neighboring villages. Among the "
"stockpiled stuff you can see some filthy rags, a broken table, a door which "
"had been torn off the hinges and a massive oak bureau.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그러나 코볼트는 트롤의 위협에 개의치 않는 것 같습니다. 그들은 돌바닥에 흩어져있는 더미들을 뒤집니다. 아마 트롤들이 최근 인근 "
"마을을 습격해서 가져온 전리품 같습니다. 쌓여있는 물건 중에는 더러운 누더기, 부서진 탁자, 경첩에서 뜯어낸 문과 거대한 떡갈나무 "
"책상서랍이 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 2_Text
#. Speaker : ToyKoboldArguer
msgctxt "6fac4209-5b7f-4920-8b01-49f7385e423b"
msgid "\"Tartuk, spoilsss, allowsss!\""
msgstr "\"타툭, 전리품, 허락했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 5_Text
#. Speaker : ToyTrollArguer
msgctxt "c4480fe4-dd72-4669-9eda-a7768250fdaf"
msgid ""
"\"Hargulka see loot first! Share later! {g|Trobold}Trobold's{/g} rule!\""
msgstr "\"하굴카가 전리품을 먼저 발견했다! 다음에 나눠준다! {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}의 규칙이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 6_Text
#. Speaker : ToyKoboldArguer2
msgctxt "9ae61fdd-2214-4726-b7a5-0c4114fdee80"
msgid "\"Lowsssss!\""
msgstr "\"허락!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 7_Text
#. Speaker : ToyKoboldArguer
msgctxt "a8e63242-6687-4d71-aa04-7a381fd6ed6f"
msgid ""
"{n}Kobold looks in the trolls eyes emotionlessly for several seconds, then "
"turns away, having lost the interest in this conversation.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}코볼트는 트롤의 눈을 몇초간 무감각하게 들여다보고는 대화에 관심 없다는듯 뒤돌아 섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 8_Text
#. Speaker : ToyTrollArguer
msgctxt "78e09474-ccde-4fde-a3fc-a36fb61ff521"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment it seems that troll will hit kobold and smash him with a "
"single blow of his huge fist. But the seconds pass, and troll still stands "
"motionlessly over kobolds who seem to ignore him completely.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}순간 트롤이 코볼트에게 거대한 주먹을 휘둘러 한 방에 때려부술 것 같았습니다. 하지만 트롤은 여전히 자신을 완전히 무시하는 듯한 "
"코볼트들 앞에 꼼짝도 하지 않고 서 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue 9_Text
#. Speaker : ToyTrollArguer
msgctxt "e362d124-ef8b-4314-925b-4d7bb810c25a"
msgid ""
"\"Hargulka will know! Hargulka and Tartuk punish you! Me tell 'em!\" {n}The "
"troll announces at last, stomping his feet indignantly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하굴카가 알게 될 것이다! 하굴카와 타툭이 너를 벌할 거다! 내가 말할 거다!\" {n}트롤이 분개하여 발을 구르며 마침내 "
"외칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyArguers/Cue_Argue_Text
#. Speaker : ToyTrollArguer
msgctxt "b085295b-1524-4fc1-b34c-d15492348624"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa! Whooa! You! Kobold! Dis troll's loot!\" {n}Two huge trolls overhang "
"the group of kobolds. They are pressing their huge fists against their hips "
"and seem irritated.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우아! 우아! 너! 코볼트! 이건 트롤의 전리품이다!\" {n}두 마리의 거대한 트롤이 코볼트들을 막습니다. 그들은 거대한 주먹을 "
"허리에 짚고 그들을 분노로 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_24429_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8bedc837-bfc9-4533-bfb8-bffa9034bd16"
msgid "Broke the wizard's whip."
msgstr "마법사의 채찍을 부수었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_24429_Text
msgctxt "b274cb62-632a-4457-816e-85e6ca3ec5fc"
msgid ""
"[Break the whip] \"This thing is detestable, unrighteous and disgusting. I "
"loath to touch it, let alone give it to you.\""
msgstr "[채찍을 부순다] \"가증스럽고 옳지 않은 혐오스러운 물건이야. 만지기도 싫고 너에게 주기도 싫어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_36376_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "971c4f4f-da54-4650-a295-a59c3e2b5bdc"
msgid "Gave the wizard's whip to Octavia."
msgstr "마법사의 채찍을 옥타비아에게 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_36376_Text
msgctxt "71a854bf-e49d-4114-9904-421c979670c6"
msgid ""
"[Give the whip] \"Sure, you can have it. But I'd like to participate in "
"testing of this thingy.\""
msgstr "[채찍을 줍니다] \"네가 가져. 하지만 나라면 이 물건을 실험해보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_45949_Text
msgctxt "25f413a4-ac72-41b5-ac3b-e08aca08caa1"
msgid "[Examine the whip] \"Let me have a closer look at this thing.\""
msgstr "[채찍을 살펴봅니다] \"더 자세히 살펴보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_46777_Text
msgctxt "4612619f-284b-4a75-8bcc-bc62783ad581"
msgid "[Detect Magic] \"Check out if there is any magic in this whip.\""
msgstr "[마법 탐지] \"이 채찍에 마법이 있는지 확인하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_52923_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c8b1b28b-ec83-46f5-a328-f277cea0c464"
msgid "Gave the wizard's whip to Octavia."
msgstr "마법사의 채찍을 옥타비아에게 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_52923_Text
msgctxt "b7338858-8957-48b3-a857-da20167ecadb"
msgid ""
"[Give the whip] \"Sure. You can have it. Just try not to make too much "
"noise, both of you.\""
msgstr "[채찍을 줍니다] \"그래. 네가 가져. 소란을 피우지는 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_82656_Text
msgctxt "537a538b-0bfa-4e39-8090-8b66df3b5220"
msgid "\"What will you do with it?\""
msgstr "\"그걸로 무엇을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_88859_Text
msgctxt "b73d7886-6379-4d26-863f-5972071f5a9f"
msgid ""
"[Take the whip for yourself] \"Give it to me. I'll decide what to do with it "
"later.\""
msgstr "[채찍을 가져갑니다] \"나에게 줘. 이걸로 할 일은 나중에 결정할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Answer_95602_Text
msgctxt "27774241-d2e8-447d-9000-d4d157642500"
msgid "\"This thing is totally evil. Maybe you shouldn't use it?\""
msgstr "\"이건 완전 사악한 물건이야. 사용하지 않을거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_31621_Text
msgctxt "ad92ba44-a355-495f-90d7-50469dccc3cf"
msgid ""
"{n}The whip is surprisingly sturdy and bears no signs of frequent use. It's "
"black handle is made of bone, wrapped in a good leather. It even still "
"smells of leather, as if it was made just recently. When you take the whip "
"in your hands, a soft warm wave of energy runs down your spine. The whip "
"practically begs you to wave it, to feel it's impact.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}채찍은 놀랍게도 튼튼하고 사용한 흔적이 없습니다. 좋은 가죽으로 싸여있는 검은색 손잡이는 뼈로 만들어졌습니다. 그것은 최근에 "
"만들어진 것처럼 여전히 가죽 냄새가 납니다. 당신이 채찍을 집을 때 따뜻한 에너지가 허리를 타고 흐릅니다. 채찍은 자기를 휘둘러달라고 "
"부탁을 하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 10_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6a5345ea-a12d-4b76-9a0f-42e9eb6d426b"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia stands in hesitation for several seconds, then shrugs.{/n} \"Well"
", I get it. No means no. Reg and I will surely figure out what to do for fun "
"— even without this thing.\" {n}She grins and winks at you slyly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 몇 초 동안 머뭇거리며 서있다가 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"이해했어. 아무 의미 없는 건 없어. 레곤가르와 나는 이것 "
"없이도 재미있는 일을 찾을 거야.\" {n}그녀는 당신을 보고 웃으며 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 11_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "00892241-e94b-45a5-8901-7d8220db0e9f"
msgid ""
"\"The chief always takes the best stuff. Even I recognize this as a law.\" "
"{n}Regongar utters a guttural sound, clearing his throat.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"대장은 항상 최선을 다 해. 나는 이것을 법으로도 알고 있어.\" {n}레곤가르는 목구멍을 깨끗이하면서 거친 소리를 냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 12_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2cd8a602-aa2b-4353-87e2-6c1b79dd4d9b"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Your Grace!\" {n}Octavia curtsies playfully.{/n} \"As for no "
"noise… I'll have to ask Reg about that.\""
msgstr "\"고마워!\" {n}옥타비아 장난스럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"아무 소음도 없으니... 레곤가르에게 물어봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 13_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "de395e8b-95f8-4f8c-bc9b-e4888c114fb4"
msgid ""
"{n}Reg's face broadens in a smile as he touches the whip.{/n} \"You have my "
"gratitude. As for the noise... I make no promises, hehe.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}채찍을 잡은 레곤가르는 웃음으로 얼굴이 넓어집니다.{/n} \"고마워. 아무 소음도 없으니... 레곤가르에게 물어봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 14_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e11aaca5-b63c-4f94-945d-21f0271d75d9"
msgid ""
"\"Mmm… You're interested too? I'd never guess!\" {n}Octavia laughs "
"seductively.{/n} \"I'll think about it. But mind the handle will always stay "
"in my, and only my hands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 관심이 있어? 생각도 못했는데!\" {n}옥타비아는 매혹적으로 웃습니다.{/n} \"생각해 볼게. 하지만 손잡이는 나에게 "
"있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 15_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a22c821d-7961-4689-8553-e600918eb0f8"
msgid ""
"\"And what role do you picture yourself in? You'll hit or take the hits? "
"Hehe-ahemmm... No, don't answer. Let it be a surprise for me.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 역할을 생각하고 있는 거야? 때릴 거야? 아니면 맞을 거야? 헤헤... 대답하지 마. 내가 놀래켜 줄 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 16_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "09e311c8-6d44-41a7-b1bc-25e8bb9c0f57"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar trifles with a whip, eyeing it with interest. His fingers caress "
"the black handle, trail along the length of the whip, his lips are parted in "
"a smile of delight.{/n} \"Splendid…\" {n}Reg whispers with the sigh of joy. "
"The whip, led by his sure hand, cuts the air abruptly, producing the "
"whooshing sound.{/n} \"Splendid...\" {n}he repeats.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 채찍을 흥미있게 봅니다. 그의 손가락은 채찍의 검은 손잡이를 만지작거리고 길이를 가늠합니다. 그의 입술은 웃음이 "
"퍼집니다.{/n} \"멋진데…\" {n}레곤가르는 즐거움의 의미로 속삭입니다. 그의 손에 있는 채찍은 허공을 갈랐고 큰 소리를 "
"냅니다.{/n} \"멋진데...\" {n}그는 반복합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 1_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9b07a42d-e8c6-4a17-9f4f-7871335185ed"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar's expression looks like the grin of a wild animal, and you just "
"can't figure out what's behind it — pure admiration for the whip itself, for "
"the Octavia playing with it, or the desire to own them both right here and "
"now.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르의 표정은 야생 동물의 미소처럼 보입니다. 당신은 그 뒤에 무엇이 있는지 알 수 없습니다. 채찍에 감탄하며 옥타비아는 채찍을 "
"가지고 장난을 칩니다. 그리고 그 자리에서 가지고 싶어하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 2_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a25c7980-c381-481f-8165-0af6c1a92e88"
msgid ""
"\"Can I have it, please? Pretty please?\" {n}Octavia makes puppy eyes at "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr "\"내가 이거 가져도 돼요? 부탁이에요?\" {n}옥타비아는 당신에게 강아지의 눈으로 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 3_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8553adcc-ccce-407e-86f4-f1867069c5b8"
msgid ""
"\"Well, what kind of question is that? You're all grown-up {mf|boy|girl} "
"already, so guess yourself\". {n}Octavia looks embarrassed, but her eyes "
"sparkle with tease.{/n}"
msgstr "\"글쎄, 어떤 질문인가요? 당신은 성인이니 잘 생각해 봐요.\" {n}옥타비아는 당황한 것 같지만 눈은 불꽃이 튑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 4_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e1858b9c-c28e-45f1-b3e9-12917ec635c0"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia sighs irritated.{/n} \"Are you going to lecture me on morals and "
"ethics? I don't harm anyone. Reg and I are just going to have some fun with "
"this thing, that's all\". {n}She softens up all at once.{/n} \"We'll just "
"play a little, nothing more. What's the harm in that? Please-please-please!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 짜증 섞인 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"제게 설교하시려고요? 남한테 피해 주는 일도 아니잖아요. 레지랑 나랑 그냥 재미 좀 "
"보려는 거예요. 그게 전부라구요.\" {n}다시 목소리를 가다듬고 부드럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"조금만 더 가지고 놀게요. 나쁠 거 "
"없잖아요? 제발, 제발, 제발 부탁이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 5_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "89a99fe5-035d-4abf-88ca-be4791510507"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment it seems to you Octavia will either hit you hard or start "
"crying. But nothing like that happens — the girl just waves her hand over "
"the remains of the broken whip.{/n} \"So be it,\" {n}she says easily.{/n} \"A"
" shame, of course, but no means no\"."
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 동안 옥타비아가 당신을 강하게 한대 치고 울려고 할 것 같습니다. 하지만 아무 일도 일어나지 않았습니다. 그녀는 부서진 채찍의 "
"잔해에게 손을 흔듭니다. {/n} \"그래. 부서지라지.\" {n}그녀는 쉽게 말합니다.{/n} \"안타깝다. 하지만 안되는 건 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 6_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ff5092ef-f843-48d2-b90d-d8f18d734045"
msgid ""
"\"If you don't know yet — you will soon. Unless you seal up your ears with "
"dirt when we set a camp next time, hehe.\""
msgstr "\"아직 모르겠다면 곧 알게 될 거야. 다음에 야영지를 설치할 때 귀에 흙이 차있지 않다면 말이야. 헤헤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 7_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a6c82b9b-cac3-49fc-a77b-7e49565db59d"
msgid ""
"\"I know a person who will own this whip with pleasure.\" {n}Regongar bares "
"his teeth in a wide grin.{/n} \"Whoo-o-o-shhhhh...\" {n}he whispers, flexing "
"his shoulders.{/n} \"She and I will have so much fun.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 채찍을 받고 싶어하는 사람을 알고 있어.\" {n}레곤가르는 넓은 미소를 지었고 이빨이 드럽납니다.{/n} \"속닥속닥...\" "
"{n}그는 속삭이며 어깨를 구부렸습니다.{/n} \"그녀와 나는 재미있게 가지고 놀 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 8_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "daefc7ec-6e42-44c3-8967-dbd334b1c171"
msgid ""
"\"You try to tell me what to do? You shouldn't. Everyone who tried it "
"before, met a bad end.\" {n}A sinister smile flickers over Regongar's face "
"and sinks in the depth of his eyes.{/n} \"Chill out. We're just going to "
"play a little with my Octavia. No one dies, I promise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭘 하라고 나에게 말하려는 거야? 그러지 마. 이전에 해 본 사람은 모두 결과가 나빴어.\" {n}불길한 미소와 눈빛이 레곤가르의 "
"얼굴에 나타납니다.{/n} \"진정해. 우리는 옥타비아와 조금 놀려는 거야. 아무도 죽지 않아. 약속할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394 9_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "20d0ee52-0ae1-4e51-a8ce-fb43ffbd385e"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity you've done so. You've deprived me of my pleasure. And I hate "
"it when someone deprives me of my pleasure.\" {n}He stares in your eyes for "
"several moments, then turns away.{/n} \"Move, nothing to do here,\" {n}he "
"drops behind his back.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네가 그랬다니 유감이야. 너는 내 기쁨을 빼앗아갔어. 그리고 나는 누군가 내 기쁨을 빼앗는 걸 싫어하지.\" {n}그는 잠시 동안 "
"당신의 눈을 쳐다보고는 등을 돌립니다.{/n} \"어서 가자. 여기서는 할 일이 없어.\" {n}그는 돌아선 채로 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_43394_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4343ba6e-dd2b-461a-aa9a-6af80748d257"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia trifles with the whip, eyeing it inquisitively. The black leather "
"and the engraved handle of the same shade seem to reflect in the girl's "
"eyes, which look somehow blackish themselves.{/n} \"Such an... exquisite "
"thing,\" {n}The girl whispers with a gasp of pleasure. She waves the whip "
"easily, listening joyfully to the whoosh her new toy produces.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 채찍을 흥미롭게 봅니다. 검은 가죽과 같은 음각으로 새겨진 손잡이가 그녀의 눈 안에 들어오고 그것들은 검은 빛을 "
"냅니다.{/n} \"정말... 흥미로운 물건이야.\" {n}그 소녀는 기쁨이 담긴 호흡과 함께 속삭입니다. 그녀는 채찍을 살랑 흔들고 새 "
"장난감이 내는 소리를 즐겁게 듣습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_51193_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "14acc11f-09c1-4050-a173-d2bf7dce16af"
msgid ""
"\"What an adorable thing.\" {n}He takes his eyes off the whip and looks "
"directly at you.{/n} \"Let me have this delightful thing!\""
msgstr "\"정말 귀여운 물건이네.\" {n}그는 채찍에서 시선을 떼고 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"내가 이 즐거운 일을 하게 해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_82469_Text
msgctxt "5727c6f5-4cf6-435b-8f9f-febfc9b10b0e"
msgid ""
"{n}The whip is definitely enchanted with several spells. You know about at "
"least one of them that allows the owner to know the location of the thing. "
"As for the others... You can feel some sort of energy and seduction in this "
"whip. The spell seems to beg you to use this whip, promising immeasurable "
"pleasures to its owner.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}채찍에는 분명히 여러 마법이 걸려 있습니다. 소유자가 물건의 위치를 알 수 있게 해주는 마법이 걸린 것은 쉽게 알 수 있습니다. "
"그리고 다른 마법은... 당신은 이 채찍에서 일종의 에너지와 유혹을 느낄 수 있습니다. 무수한 즐거움을 선사한다는 약속을 하며 이 채찍을 "
"사용하도록 유혹하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_95609_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "58c23751-fbfb-413f-9f33-834dbc4c79a5"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian remains silent, but he nods ever so slightly — it seems like he "
"doesn't even notice it himself.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 침묵을 지키고 있지만 그는 조금씩 끄덕입니다. 그는 그것을 보는 것 같지도 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_95615_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "be3848cc-88e3-412b-8344-61e20502dd35"
msgid "\"Hmm... Octavia once loved toys like that. Not anymore, though.\""
msgstr "\"흠... 옥타비아는 그런 장난감을 좋아했었지. 이제는 좋아하지도 않지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_95616_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "9f8b5db5-f0e6-42eb-8df4-53ef6e35eaee"
msgid ""
"\"There was a time when I would have found such toys entertaining. Not "
"anymore, though.\""
msgstr "\"그런 장난감을 가지고 논 기억이 있지. 이제는 그렇지 않지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/MageToyFound/Cue_TristianDisapproves_String
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "32a0ac62-8308-498d-a35b-df80da14bebf"
msgid "{n}Tristian looks away, shaking his head ever so slightly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 다른 곳을 보며 조용히 그의 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Answer_14986_Text
msgctxt "52c687c1-4a61-4b31-accb-a8b5592e24cb"
msgid "\"I didn't want to fight. They attacked me first.\""
msgstr "\"나는 싸우고 싶지 않아. 그들이 나를 먼저 공격했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Answer_23857_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "44db2b4f-3acb-486e-bb53-28aeec2021fa"
msgid "Killed the trolls for the joy of killing."
msgstr "살육의 기쁨을 위해 트롤을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Answer_23857_Text
msgctxt "02dbe384-320b-4b64-ae6c-ea0723055bc4"
msgid "\"What can I say? I just love killing.\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고 할까? 나는 살육이 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Answer_58947_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cc8a89b6-d224-4e47-9073-c4f08cb0b728"
msgid "Killed the trolls for justice."
msgstr "정의를 위해 트롤들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Answer_58947_Text
msgctxt "1980f562-df3a-46e3-bc52-5c11fbedabf1"
msgid ""
"\"You've killed many people, plundered many villages. And now, you have to "
"answer for your crimes.\""
msgstr "\"너는 많은 사람들을 죽이고 마을을 약탈했어. 자 이제, 네 죄의 댓가를 물을 시간이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Answer_58948_Text
msgctxt "6ee3015e-3bba-42b4-a956-6eaddb4d6746"
msgid ""
"\"You brought me before your king, and you saw how it turned out. I wished "
"to broker peace, but your king preferred war.\""
msgstr "\"네 왕 앞에 나를 데려왔으니 어떻게 되었는지 보았겠지. 나는 평화를 이루고 싶었지만 너희 왕은 전쟁을 더 좋아했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_05368_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldsOnMarch_Shaman
msgctxt "fb19de13-4536-442d-a785-8a030b18f813"
msgid ""
"{n}A withered kobold, clad in a stained rug, steps forward.{/n} \"Mensss, "
"Tartuk, menac-ssse,\" {n}he hisses,{/n} \"Tartuk, koboldsss, peac-ssse. "
"Mensss — deathsss!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}얼룩진 누더기를 걸친 허약한 코볼트가 한걸음 걸어나옵니다.{/n} \"인간. 타툭. 협박한다.\" {n}그는 쉭쉭거립니다.{/n} "
"\"타툭. 코볼트. 평화... 인간. 죽음!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_41322 1_Text
msgctxt "eb087ee7-e6cf-4870-99ba-8ab42538f677"
msgid "\"Deathsss! Deathsss!\""
msgstr "\"죽어라! 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_41322_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldPacifistTalker
msgctxt "5f58aa64-c340-4d6b-9ec4-cf1b525855cf"
msgid ""
"\"Mensss. Kobold. Deathsss,\" {n}one of the kobolds hisses. You realize "
"these are the remains of the kobold band you fought in the forest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"인간. 코볼트. 죽인다.\" {n}코볼트 중 하나가 위협합니다. 당신은 그들이 숲에서 싸웠던 코볼트라는 것을 알았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_58949_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRugga
msgctxt "18b1f648-9dcc-4106-bd31-2faa7fc37c72"
msgid ""
"{n}Jazon lowers his eyes. After a few moments of silence, he shakes his "
"head.{/n} \"King Hargulka gave Jazon hope that borba and troll could live in "
"peace. Now King Hargulka took that hope away. {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} dies "
"now — by your hand, but not your fault. Jazon sorry.\" {n}The troll looks to "
"his kin.{/n} \"Call Jazon coward, call him traitor — it mean nothing now. "
"Jazon will not fight.\" {n}Jazon turns his back on you and leaves along the "
"stone corridor.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}재즌은 눈을 아래로 향합니다. 침묵이 잠시 지나간 후 그는 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"하굴카 왕은 재즌에게 보바와 인간이 함께 살 "
"수 있다는 희망을 줬다. 이제 하굴카 왕은 그 희망을 가져갔다. {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}는 이제 너의 손에 의해 죽었다. "
"하지만 네 잘못 아니다. 재즌 미안하다.\" {n}트롤은 자신의 동족을 봅니다.{/n} \"재즌을 겁쟁이라고 불러라. 반역자라고 불러라. "
"아무런 의미가 없다. 재즌은 싸우지 않을 거다.\" {n}재즌은 당신에게서 등을 돌려 돌로 된 복도를 걸어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_58950_Text
#. Speaker : KoboldPacifistTalker
msgctxt "87b26e84-e981-458d-a65b-ab1cd2c7a674"
msgid ""
"{n}The silence is broken by the shrill voice of some kobold.{/n} \"Jassson "
"dessserter! {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}, menac-ssse, war!\" {n}The trolls begin "
"howling and stomping their feet so hard that the walls shake.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}침묵은 코볼트의 날카로운 목소리로 깨졌습니다.{/n} \"재즌 버렸다! {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}! 협박하고 전쟁한다!\""
" {n}트롤들은 울부짖으며 발로 바닥을 구르자 벽이 흔들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_Rugga 1_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRugga
msgctxt "986f8ad0-21a5-480b-8704-c4b9610a7104"
msgid ""
"{n}Noticing you, Jazon turns and bares his teeth.{/n} \"Borba came already. "
"You like killing troll and kobold, borba? Now Jazon kill you!\" {n}His "
"muscles bulge under his thick pelt, and his eyes are dark with anger.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 보자 재즌은 돌아서서 이빨을 드러냅니다.{/n} \"보바가 벌써 왔다. 너는 트롤과 코볼트를 죽이는 걸 좋아하지? 보바? "
"이재 재즌이 너 죽인다!\" {n}그의 근육은 두꺼운 가죽 밑에서 부풀었고 눈은 분노로 어두워집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_Rugga 2_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRugga
msgctxt "18ec7d81-452f-473f-9afd-d76b27e8b7e4"
msgid ""
"\"Borba lie! Borba came here on {mf|his|her} own! I told borba go away.\" {n}"
"The troll looks at you and snarls with contempt.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"보바 거짓말한다! 보바 스스로 왔다! 나는 보바에게 가라고 했다.\" {n}트롤은 당신을 보며 경멸하는 투로 으르렁거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_Rugga 3_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRugga
msgctxt "459bf130-6195-4777-b0b8-ffc29634c3d0"
msgid ""
"\"If borba kill borba, you punish him. You not kill his whole family.\" {n}"
"The troll looks at you and snarls with contempt.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"보바가 보바를 죽이면. 너는 그를 벌해라. 너는 그의 가족을 죽일 수는 없다.\" {n}트롤은 당신을 보고 경멸로 "
"으르렁거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_Rugga 4_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRugga
msgctxt "1a2be41c-de62-405d-8b54-7942283f152c"
msgid ""
"\"Troll no beast, borba beast!\" {n}The troll looks at you and snarls with "
"contempt.{/n}"
msgstr "\"트롤은 짐승 아니다! 보바가 짐승이다!\" {n}트롤은 당신을 보고 경멸로 으르렁거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_Rugga 5_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRugga
msgctxt "7776e6fc-a753-4d59-83e2-20494451f7a0"
msgid ""
"\"We kill you now, borba. But we no beasts anymore. We no eat your corpse. "
"We bury it in some place, let other borba come to that place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 이제 너를 죽인다. 보바. 하지만 우리는 더 이상 짐승이 아니다. 우리는 너의 시체를 먹지 않는다. 우리는 너를 어딘가에 묻어 "
"다른 보바가 너를 보러 오게 할 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_Rugga 6_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRugga
msgctxt "b7de7a8a-2372-49c6-9e53-254eac9a50b0"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold — run! Trolls! Dur borba!\" {n}The trolls roar loudly, so loudly "
"dust falls from the ceiling. Several kobolds heed Jazon and run, but the "
"rest gather beside the trolls.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트 가라! 트롤! 더르 보바!\" {n}트롤들이 큰 소리로 포효하자 먼지가 천장에서 떨어집니다. 몇몇 코볼트들은 재즌의 명령에 "
"따라 달려들었지만 나머지는 트롤 옆으로 붙었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/RuggaFinalConfrontation/Cue_Rugga_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRugga
msgctxt "234ce4e8-17fa-4459-8ae3-217c10c0753c"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a troll who looks familiar — he was the one who greeted you at "
"the lair's entrance. You believe his name was Jazon. He and some other "
"trolls are surrounded by the gang of kobolds.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}친숙한 트롤을 보았습니다. 그는 은신처 입구에서 당신을 맞이한 트롤었습니다. 당신은 그의 이름이 재즌인 것을 기억합니다. 그와 다른 "
"트롤은 코볼트 무리에게 둘러싸여 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_08284_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2918fb69-053c-4d31-98f7-39a3b29a1dbd"
msgid "Executed the troll king."
msgstr "트롤 왕을 처형했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_08284_Text
msgctxt "fc64a06c-eeb8-4b20-a8cb-d89561863367"
msgid "[Attack] \"No mercy for monsters! Prepare to die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"괴물에게는 자비 따위 없다! 죽을 준비 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_11915_Text
msgctxt "8c593888-9444-461c-8fa6-449ac41822d5"
msgid ""
"\"You weren't too eager to show mercy to us. Why should I show mercy to you?"
"\""
msgstr "\"너는 우리에게 자비를 베풀지 않았다. 왜 내가 너에게 자비를 베풀어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_24962_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "634453b7-c3e4-423e-8535-392e8072282b"
msgid "Executed the troll king."
msgstr "트롤 왕을 처형했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_24962_Text
msgctxt "476055b0-a182-4020-b096-530a7c4c1a88"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Your actions have caused numerous human deaths. It's time for you "
"to answer for your crimes.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너의 행동이 수많은 죽음을 불러들였다. 네 죗값을 치룰 차례다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_30203_Text
msgctxt "2b0fb468-76c4-411d-9594-fba5f180ac31"
msgid ""
"\"If you hadn't killed people, I wouldn't have had to destroy your home.\""
msgstr "\"네가 사람들을 죽이지 않았다면 너의 집을 파괴할 필요가 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_36553_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1b45b9b1-7b7e-4229-a938-c759c5e136d0"
msgid "Taunted the troll king before executing him."
msgstr "처형하기 전에 트롤 킹을 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_36553_Text
msgctxt "5ca6224e-a7a3-4140-889b-718a4c0b2730"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You'll die now, troll. But first, tell me — how does it feel to "
"be the sole reason for the deaths of your family, your friends, and all of "
"your kin?\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 지금 죽을거야. 하지만 먼저. 말해. 네 가족과 친구의 죽음이 유일한 이유가 되니 기분이 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_36805_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7e6a7cd9-f268-4c78-a322-44746fc3a355"
msgid "Spared the troll king."
msgstr "트롤 왕을 살려 줬습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_36805_Text
msgctxt "6a0a29dc-b09e-4eb3-a9b8-565b52133a60"
msgid ""
"\"...Leave now. And I don't want to see you again — in this life, or the "
"next.\""
msgstr "\"... 지금 당장 떠나. 너와 다시 만나고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_45074_Text
msgctxt "564470cd-538b-4d3c-a98f-df2765a7ded7"
msgid "\"What would you do if I let you go?\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 보내면 무엇을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_94097_Text
msgctxt "f3437188-d694-4486-b651-84e1df987859"
msgid "\"How did you manage to gather, let alone control, so many trolls?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 많은 수의 트롤들을 모으고 통제할 수 있었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_94102_Text
msgctxt "e380b401-7cfd-42ef-9369-d536831f905e"
msgid ""
"\"So you're just poor pariahs, cast away over a tiny flaw like the craving "
"for human flesh? You know, it's funny, but I'm feeling merciful today — "
"pledge fealty to me, swear you'll stop eating humans, and I'll let you "
"continue to live here in Trobold.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그저 인간의 육체에 대한 갈망 같은 작은 결함을 버리려고? 정말 웃기는군. 하지만 오늘은 나는 관대해. 나에게 인간을 먹는 것을 "
"중단하겠다고 약속하면 여기 트로볼트에서 살도록 내버려 둘 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_94113_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4ae4857d-64bb-4b00-96b0-38dd8d847a3b"
msgid "Allowed the trolls to stay in Trobold."
msgstr "트롤들이 트로볼트에 머물 수 있게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_94113_Text
msgctxt "4675bace-7c37-478f-af26-a00b6b4fb249"
msgid "\"Why not? You certainly wouldn't be the strangest thing in my lands.\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 땅에서 가장 강력한 생물은 아니니 괜찮아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Answer_94114_Text
msgctxt "2ed29d1e-060c-4c7f-9439-0fe058317d59"
msgid ""
"\"On second thought, I guess not. Letting you live here would be a mistake.\""
msgstr "\"다시 생각하니 아니다. 너를 여기서 살게 하는 것은 실수였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 10_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "31842c6f-07b8-49a6-b7bc-abc5cc88d89c"
msgid ""
"\"Borba… lets Hargulka go?!\" {n}His eyes widen and his eyebrows tilt "
"upward.{/n} \"Borba truly means it?!\""
msgstr "\"보바... 하굴카 보내줬어?!\" {n}그의 눈은 넓어지고 그의 눈썹은 올라갑니다.{/n} \"보바. 정말이야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 11_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "6f4b0431-f0f8-440e-a95b-45174308c7eb"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka jumps up and hurries to leave, as if you might change your mind —"
" then stops, turns, and his eyes locks with yours.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 펄쩍 뛰어올라 당신이 마음이 바뀌기 전에 어서 떠나려고 합니다. 그는 멈추고 돌아 서서 당신과 눈을 맞춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 12_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "2ffa83f7-05cc-4131-85b1-e1eb5847497e"
msgid "\"Thank you, {race}.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. {race}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 13_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "ab233915-45a6-4c75-8667-4d8b3f5eded7"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll gives a rasping chuckle.{/n} \"Dumb, dumb borba likes big "
"words, right? While you spoke, Hargulka healed his wounds.\" {n}He "
"straightens.{/n} \"If Hargulka dies now, borba dies with him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤은 껄껄 웃습니다.{/n} \"멍청한 보바가 허풍 좋아한다. 네가 말할 때 하굴카 상처 치료했다.\" {n}그가 말합니다.{/n}"
" \"하굴카가 죽으면 보바도 함께 죽는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 1_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "3aeea2ad-e45b-417e-85c2-70aa8886464d"
msgid ""
"\"Hargulka doesn't — doesn't want to fight anymore. Borba… Borba won.\" {n}"
"His voice is ragged, his breathing heavy.{/n}"
msgstr "\"하굴카는 더 이상 싸우고 싶지 않다. 보바... 보바가 이겼다.\" {n}그의 목소리는 거칠고 호흡은 무겁습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 2_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "dfa03fe0-c414-446f-afda-9c0b3deced27"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka spits blood on the floor. The aura of might and power he "
"displayed before seems to have vanished into nothing. What you see now is an "
"extremely tired, wounded, and elderly troll, his pelt worn and his face "
"wrinkled.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 바닥에 피를 뱉어냅니다. 그가 전에 보여준 힘의 아우라는 사라진 것처럼 보입니다. 지금 당신 눈에 보이는 것은 매우 "
"피곤하고 상처 입은 늙은 트롤입니다. 그의 가죽은 닳았고 얼굴에는 주름이 졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 3_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "b18c6d73-04b9-4634-b220-4f8ed06057ef"
msgid ""
"\"Don't know, borba. Hargulka would not let you go.\" {n}He shakes his head "
"slowly.{/n} \"Trolls wanted a kingdom. Home. But failed to protect it from "
"borba.\""
msgstr ""
"\"몰라. 보바. 하굴카는 너를 놓아주지 않을 거야.\" {n}그는 천천히 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"트롤들은 왕국을 원했어. 집을 "
"말이야. 하지만 보바에게서 보호하지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 4_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "35456e73-404e-4f7b-becd-10ac0a0b1b6d"
msgid ""
"\"Trolls always ate borba. Always fought borba. How stop something that was "
"always?\" {n}Hargulka speaks quietly, almost as if apologizing for the "
"generations of trolls who came before him.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"트롤들은 항상 보바를 먹었고 항상 보바와 싸웠다. 어떻게 습관을 고칠 수가 있지?\" {n}하굴카는 조상 트롤에게 용서를 구하는 듯 "
"조용히 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 5_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "387c9181-3aed-430c-84bc-52995f2ccf34"
msgid ""
"\"Dumb borba, you not understand.\" {n}Hargulka sighs.{/n} \"Hargulka "
"brought no one. Trolls came to Hargulka on their own will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"멍청한 보바. 너는 이해 못했다.\" {n}하굴카는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"하굴카는 아무도 데려 오지 않았다. 트롤들은 자신의 "
"의지로 하굴카에게 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 6_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "744ba309-3485-4698-8715-c6c495bc7763"
msgid ""
"\"Let Hargulka go?\" {n}The troll looks surprised.{/n} \"Hargulka will... "
"leave. Go far away. Far away from borba.\" {n}He rubs his neck, puzzled.{/n} "
"\"Hargulka will find other trolls. Teach them to not be afraid.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하굴카 보내줘?\" {n}트롤은 놀랍니다.{/n} \"하굴카는... 떠날 것이다. 멀리 간다. 보바에게서 멀리 떨어진다.\" {n}"
"그는 목을 문지르며 당황해합니다.{/n} \"하굴카는 다른 트롤을 발견할 것이다. 두려워하지 말라고 그들에게 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 7_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "83b5cecb-87b6-4e28-8b0c-04e218186a02"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk ordered stop eating borba. Hargulka wanted unite trolls first, "
"teach them stop eating borba later.\" {n}Hargulka glances briefly at the "
"kobold's corpse.{/n} \"Tartuk was right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭은 보바를 먹는 것을 중지했다. 하굴카는 먼저 트롤을 단결시키고 나중에 보바를 먹지 말라고 가르쳤다.\" {n}하굴카는 코볼트의 "
"시체를 잠시 봅니다.{/n} \"타툭이 옳았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 8_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "cf588b80-19b6-47cd-962d-4c84cf1cd59c"
msgid ""
"\"Hargulka was first branded by Tartuk. First be immortal. Hargulka showed "
"the trolls they could live without fear.\" {n}He looks at Tartuk's body, "
"then looks away.{/n} \"No more brand. Fear comes again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭 문양을 새긴 첫 트롤이 하굴카다. 처음으로 불멸자가 되었다. 하굴카는 트롤에게 공포 없이 살 수 있다고 가르쳤다.\" {n}그는 "
"타툭의 시신을 보고는 먼 곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"더 이상의 문양은 없지만 두려움은 다시 생겨.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855 9_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "8c652d5f-4f64-4a34-bcc8-2802e3ba3775"
msgid ""
"{n}His words come out faster, stronger.{/n} \"Yes. Yes! Hargulka will find "
"new home for trolls. Far from borba. No eat borba, because there are no "
"borba around. New home.\" {n}The troll's gaze brightens.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 말은 더 빨리 강하게 나오는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"그래! 하굴카는 트롤을 위한 새로운 집을 찾을 거야. 보바에게서 "
"멀어져있는 곳에서 보바를 먹지 않겠어. 왜냐하면 보바는 여기에 집이 없기 때문이다.\" {n}트롤의 시선이 밝아집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_84855_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "f1044403-aff4-4cbc-b7ee-63b8f2315290"
msgid ""
"{n}After Tartuk's death, the troll's strikes become slow and hesitant. "
"Finally, Hargulka drops his club and squats, clearly fatigued.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}타툭이 죽은 후 트롤의 공격이 느려집니다. 마침내 하굴카는 피곤해서 몽둥이를 떨어트립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94100_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9b22adcd-be5d-4285-8feb-f0d15b3b8674"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun winces with contempt.{/n} \"Tell me this is a trick. Tell me the "
"monster will die and devour no one else.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 경멸로 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"속임수라고 말해줘. 괴물이 죽고 아무도 잡아먹지 않을 거라고 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94101_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "93b01518-6b11-4a0b-8864-fbc8d2535749"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia gently touches your shoulder, as if to urge restraint.{/n} \"I "
"believe him. We should let him go.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 그만하라는 듯 당신의 어깨를 어루만집니다.{/n} \"나는 그를 믿어. 우리는 그를 보내줘야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94103_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "0b4683de-14b0-4ddc-b6d4-d24daaf56996"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka stares at you for a moment, his forehead wrinkling.{/n} \"Borba "
"must be joking? Or crazy? So much blood between borba and trolls, and you'll "
"let trolls live?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 잠시 당신을 보았고 그의 이마에 주름이 생깁니다.{/n} \"보바는 농담하는 거냐? 미친 거냐? 보바와 인간 사이에 "
"유혈사태가 많았는데 너는 트롤을 살려준다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94105_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "555e7062-65b6-4e96-a22c-cba7d754df2a"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure? Mercy is a virtue — but do you really believe trolls can "
"stop eating humans?\""
msgstr "\"확실해? 자비는 덕이지만 정말로 트롤이 인간을 먹지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94106_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f8e7d6ff-285d-4680-bbb7-d6397c2a81c1"
msgid ""
"\"Aha, I see, that's what your barony needs most! Forget roads, trading "
"houses, farms — a troll sanctuary is what's truly needed! Come on, surprise "
"me, cast away your state before you really start building it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"알겠어. 그게 네 영지에 가장 필요한 거구나! 길이나 교역소나 농장은 잊어버려. 트롤의 성소가 정말로 필요한 거니까! 그렇다면 어서 "
"네 남작령을 버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94107_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "8bb16b60-b4c5-4b71-a1a8-8bd1edb5f8fe"
msgid ""
"\"Sparing trolls, relying on their word of honor? Even paladins of "
"{g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} wouldn't give in to such meaningless, starry-eyed "
"idealism! Do not let the crocodile tears of these monsters fool you — "
"they'll return to their vile ways as soon as we are gone!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들의 명예에 의지하는 트롤을 살려주자는 겁니까? {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}의 팔라딘도 그렇게 의미 없는 이상에 의해 포기하지 "
"않습니다! 악어의 눈물에 속지 마십시오. 그들은 우리가 가면 다시 악행을 시작할 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94108_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "97fc129f-f5bd-498f-b754-17c23c9740fe"
msgid ""
"\"Even the troll understands you must be mad to make a troll-house in the "
"middle of the barony! Why are we still talking?! Let's finish this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 영지에 트롤의 성소를 짓다니 트롤도 네가 미쳤다고 생각할 거야! 왜 우리가 이야기를 하고 있는 거야?! 어서 끝내버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94110_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2216e72a-b312-423c-924a-677bbea77175"
msgid ""
"\"Have you gone mad?\" {n}Ekun clenches his teeth and glares at you.{/n} "
"\"Don't listen to this beast! They attacked villages, ate people alive! They "
"will do so again!\" {n}Ekun falls silent, then begins again, slowly.{/n} \"If"
"... if you let them live, I will travel with you no longer.\" {n}He steps "
"back, watching you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"미쳤어?\" {n}에쿤은 이를 악물고 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"이 짐승의 말을 듣지 마라! 그들은 마을을 공격하고 살아있는 "
"사람들을 먹었다. 그들은 다시 그렇게 할 거야!\" {n}에쿤은 침묵하고 다시 천천히 말합니다.{/n} \"그들을 살려준다면 너와 "
"여행하지 않겠다.\" {n}그는 물러서서 당신을 지켜보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94112_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "3bc35a4c-2181-45ae-99ab-590339998af1"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka stares intently at you.{/n} \"Hargulka will forbid trolls to eat "
"borba. Hargulka will pledge fealty. Will you — will you really let trolls "
"stay in {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 당신을 의도적으로 봅니다.{/n} \"하굴카는 트롤이 보바를 먹지 못하게 할 것이다. 하굴카는 충성을 맹세한다. 트롤이 "
"정말로 {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}에 살게 할 거야? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94115_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "581d4681-dc03-408b-ba6a-38924b5ffca3"
msgid ""
"\"Borba mocks trolls? Or invents some scheme for trolls, like Tartuk? "
"Hargulka not understand. Not understand at all.\""
msgstr "\"보바가 트롤을 조롱하나? 아니면 타툭처럼 음모를 꾸미는 것인가? 하굴카는 이해하지 못했다. 전혀 이해하지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94117_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "942596da-6f6e-4b47-aedc-267d0d9dc668"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's brow is furrowed… and his hand falls to his weapon. There's a "
"moment of silence between you, then he shakes his head and turns away.{/n}\n"
"\"Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 미간이 좁아집니다... 그의 손은 무기를 떨어뜨립니다. 당신과 그 사이에서 침묵이 흘렀고 그는 머리를 흔들고는 등을 "
"돌립니다.{/n}\n"
"\"작별이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94119_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "6bab2d31-9763-4f06-a956-bbde901e0b94"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka searches your face, confused.{/n} \"This never happened before. "
"But Hargulka believes it can happen.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 당신의 얼굴을 보며 혼란스러워합니다.{/n} \"이전에는 이런 일이 없었다. 하지만 하굴카는 그럴 수 있다고 믿었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94120_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "6bdaa630-84e2-4d1f-83ec-2316708c3325"
msgid ""
"\"Hargulka swears to be your friend, {race}. Hargulka swears to forbid "
"trolls eat your kin. From this day, and while {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} stands, "
"humans are not borba.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하굴카는 너의 친구가 될 것을 맹세한다. {race}. 하굴카는 네 동족을 먹지 못하게 할 것이다. 오늘부터 {g|Trobold} "
"트로볼트{/g}가 있는 한 인간은 보바가 아니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94121_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "69e66565-84da-46c6-97bb-54c45dc14338"
msgid ""
"\"Hargulka will gather those who are still alive. Tell them about what "
"happened here. You better leave now, {race}. Come back when all trolls know "
"you are a friend.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하굴카는 아직 살아있는 사람들을 모을 것이다. 그들에게 여기에서의 일을 말해라. 너는 지금 당장 떠나야한다. {race}. 모든 "
"트롤들이 네가 친구라는 것을 알면 돌아와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94122_Text_String
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d7d1a846-dccb-4c0e-85ce-21984cf3a69d"
msgid "\"We must trust in him. He deserves a second chance. Everyone does.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그를 믿어야 해. 그에게 두번째 기회를 주자. 누구나 실수는 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94124_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "51c7bb3a-d96b-49d9-9bc8-fa273d45123d"
msgid ""
"\"He was your mortal enemy, tried to kill you several times... Yet you spare "
"his life.\" {n}Octavia shakes her head thoughtfully.{/n} \"You're amazing. I "
"hope I would have the strength to do the same.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 너의 운명의 적이었고 몇번이고 너를 죽이려 했어... 하지만 그를 살려두자고?\" {n}옥타비아는 머리를 조심스럽게 "
"흔듭니다.{/n} \"너는 대단해. 나도 그런 힘이 있었으면 좋겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94126_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "638c20bf-133e-4114-84f0-e138bb76a993"
msgid ""
"\"Are you serious? You think we'll be able to live in peace with them? It "
"would be great... I hope you're not wrong!\""
msgstr "\"정말이야? 그와 평화롭게 살 수 있다고 생각해? 그렇다면 좋겠지만... 네가 틀리지 않기를 바라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94127_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ca8f8e5e-d5a3-4bf4-8187-5f140584898d"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, sure. Let's spare some man-eaters. Come on, chop his head off so we "
"can go celebrate the victory!\""
msgstr "\"오. 물론. 사람 잡아먹는 녀석을 살려두자고. 그러지 말고 저 녀석 머리를 날려버리고 승리를 축하하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94129_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "59a353d1-4ee2-47b5-b527-114749050463"
msgid ""
"\"Serves him right! Let's avenge everyone this scum ever ate... and have "
"some fun while we're at it! What's wrong, big guy? Not used to being prey, "
"huh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 이 녀석에게 먹힌 자들을 위해 복수하자... 그리고 우리도 재미도 보고! 이봐. 덩치. 어때? 먹이가 되는 게 익숙치 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94131_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6d424d58-0223-4594-9b5b-137cf349ab77"
msgid ""
"\"I hope your mercy wakes something kind in his soul.\" {n}Tristian "
"smiles.{/n} \"You seem to change everyone you meet for the better — I think "
"Hargulka will be no exception.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 자비가 그의 영혼을 일깨우길 바라.\" {n}트리스티안이 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"너는 다른 이들을 선하게 만들어. 내 생각에 "
"하굴카도 예외는 아닌 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94132_ValerieAgainst_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "eda458dc-4240-465e-bf7c-75bdb7a3c9b8"
msgid ""
"\"If you let this monster go now, it will simply sow death and terror "
"somewhere else. Do not make this mistake.\""
msgstr "\"지금 이 괴물을 놓아주면 다른 어딘가에 죽음과 공포를 뿌릴 뿐입니다. 이런 실수를 해서는 안됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94133_ValerieAngry_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b51ea650-b12d-4252-87e8-c7b852023735"
msgid "\"What untold, glaring stupidity...\""
msgstr "\"말도 안되는 어리석은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94135_ValerieAgrees_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "168dfa46-5767-4e62-85f7-9afb750cf3c1"
msgid ""
"\"Let us put an end to this madness. Peace will be restored — with iron and "
"blood, as circumstances require.\""
msgstr "\"이 광기를 끝내자. 상황에 맞게 철과 피로 평화를 되찾자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedHragulka/Cue_94138_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka
msgctxt "da929670-c1f6-4dc2-8224-ffd4c1d1f8ec"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll lets out a rasping chuckle.{/n} \"If Hargulka dies now, borba "
"dies with him.\""
msgstr "{n}트롤은 으스스한 너털웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"하굴카가 지금 죽으면 보바는 함께 죽는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_11017_Text
msgctxt "44129045-8828-4d76-ba7e-3f7bd36dbc4e"
msgid "\"Why did kobolds join forces with trolls in the first place?\""
msgstr "\"왜 코볼트들이 트롤들과 힘을 합친거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_73967_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7790885d-9417-4d46-a117-cb114dfc1250"
msgid "Executed the kobold king."
msgstr "코볼트 왕을 처형했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_73967_Text
msgctxt "544c9616-49d3-4d47-bf5e-6a9b37ed4d02"
msgid "[Attack] \"You deserve no mercy, only death!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 자비를 얻을 자격이 없다. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_83294_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c656065c-8e72-4a17-9f45-a83f579b5eda"
msgid "Spared the kobold king."
msgstr "코볼트 왕을 살려 줬습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_83294_Text
msgctxt "2618f213-eb87-4862-96ac-b88970abdfbb"
msgid ""
"\"...Leave now. And I don't want to see you again — in this life, or the "
"next.\""
msgstr "\"...당장 떠나라. 그리고 다시는 너를 만나고 싶지 않아. 이번 생에서, 혹은 다음 생에서도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_85166_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e646aace-757a-44b2-9b67-f93a37054369"
msgid "Taunted the kobold king before executing him."
msgstr "처형하기 전에 코볼트 왕을 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_85166_Text
msgctxt "4e9f14a8-04a2-4ea9-95ea-bcbdbca8c605"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You will die. But first, tell me — how does it feel to be "
"responsible for the deaths of each and every one of those who followed you? "
"Those who once saw you as a leader, not some miserable jester?\""
msgstr ""
"[공격] \"너는 죽을 거야. 그전에 한번 말해봐. 너를 따르는 자들을 위해 죽는 소감이 어때? 너를 한낱 비참한 어릿광대가 아니라 "
"지도자로 보는 녀석들을 위해서 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_87542_Text
msgctxt "acb99a96-58a3-49f4-89f1-c54d37bf3db6"
msgid ""
"\"You weren't too eager to show mercy to us. Why should I show mercy to you?"
"\""
msgstr "\"너는 우리에게 자비를 베풀지 않았다. 왜 내가 너에게 자비를 베풀어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_88316_Text
msgctxt "60dc7148-9399-454d-993b-291847f1b8ff"
msgid ""
"\"You can't just blame the trolls. You were the one who branded them, "
"convinced them of their false immortality.\""
msgstr "\"네가 트롤들만 탓할수는 없어. 그들에게 낙인을 찍어서 거짓 불멸을 믿게한 건 너였잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_91679_Text
msgctxt "d3dc8f9d-5d31-4e8e-ad5a-fc737bce24b1"
msgid "\"So what would you do if I let you go?\""
msgstr "\"내가 널 놔준다면 어떻게 할 생각이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_91858_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cf7bcecc-7e7a-4482-8e16-fc26e7357ffc"
msgid "Executed the kobold king."
msgstr "코볼트 왕을 처형했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_91858_Text
msgctxt "a874807a-3f53-4436-b430-4cfee7539915"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Uniting the trolls led to many of my people's deaths. It's time "
"to answer for your crimes.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"트롤들을 단결시켜 내 국민들을 수많은 죽음으로 몰아넣었어 . 이제 네 죗값을 물을 시간이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_91869_Text
msgctxt "c5772d16-09e9-4d93-9d04-a4c9448d3e51"
msgid ""
"\"You know what? I like you. You're strong and adventurous — like me. How "
"about I let you build your kingdom inside my barony, as my vassal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실 하나 고백하지. 난 네가 맘에든다. 너는 강하고 모험심이 있어. 나처럼 말이야. 내 영지 안에서 내 부하로서 너의 왕국을 "
"짓는다면 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_91879_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "58d50ff3-3b01-41f5-b744-16c920f95aed"
msgid "Let the kobold king found a kobold settlement in the barony."
msgstr "코볼트 왕이 영지에서 정착지를 찾게 허락합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_91879_Text
msgctxt "c447646c-e5f9-4e48-b57b-93b64d006ab5"
msgid ""
"\"Why not? I rule here — so I make the final decision. So, what do you say, "
"will you be my vassal?\""
msgstr "\"왜 안돼? 나는 여기를 지배한다. 그러니 내가 최종 결정권자야. 내 신하가 되겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_91880_Text
msgctxt "1d731027-ff80-4f66-8d10-f84a848c80b1"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps I'm being too hasty. I don't think I'm ready to share my lands "
"with kobolds.\""
msgstr "\"아마도 나는 너무 서둘렀나봐. 내 땅을 코볼트와 나눌 준비가 되지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_91889_Text_1
msgctxt "f3f02920-28b0-46fa-bd4d-c537d9fe9368"
msgid ""
"\"I'm asking you for the last time — who are you? I remember well the gnome "
"Tartuccio, who assumed the appearance of the kobold Tartuk. And I remember "
"clearly how I killed him. — How I killed you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"마지막으로 너에게 묻겠는데 넌 누구지? 나는 코볼트 타툭을 흉내내던 노움 타투치오는 알아. 그리고 그가 죽은 것도 알고 있지. 내가 "
"너를 죽였으니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Answer_TartukPitax_Text_String
msgctxt "d8be2d79-f82a-40ec-ad6e-84fa4b7b8d52"
msgid "\"What about your spy mission for Pitax?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스의 스파이 임무라는건 뭐였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 10_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "7a4a24c7-c65e-4e74-90e8-f9978a4f6729"
msgid ""
"{n}He sighs — just like a human would.{/n} \"I brought my people to deathsss."
"\""
msgstr "{n}그는 마치 인간처럼 한숨을 쉽니다..{/n} \"나는 내 백성을 죽음으로 몰아넣었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 11_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "3f0f3dbd-59b6-4847-892a-383fa2894a9a"
msgid ""
"\"You releassse me?\" {n}Tartuk studies you, his eyes narrowed in "
"suspicion.{/n} \"Not a trick? You releassse me?\""
msgstr "\"나를 풀어준다고?\" {n}타툭은 의심스러운 눈으로 당신을 살핍니다.{/n} \"속임수가 아니야? 나를 풀어준다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 12_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "3dcdf871-7414-4782-9e32-b05825d9bfc0"
msgid ""
"\"I ssshall leave, asss promisssed. No one will hear anythhhing about Tartuk "
"the kobold anymore. I wisssh to be forsssaken. I have no desssire to become "
"a reassson of ssso many deathsss anymore — not of koboldsss, not of "
"trollssss... not of humansss.\" {n}He briskly steps away, then stops and "
"glances back at you with a hollow gaze.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 약속한 대로 떠나겠어. 아무도 코볼트 타툭의 소식을 듣지 못할 거야. 나는 잊혀지고 싶다. 더이상 나로인해 많은 자들이 죽는 "
"것을 원치않아. 코볼트도. 트롤도. 인간도...\" {n}그는 성큼성큼 물러나더니 멈춰서서 공허한 시선으로 당신을 돌아봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 13_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "65f20e68-829c-42e1-8f79-c80e6d7539ad"
msgid "\"It'sss good everythhhing isss over now. Thhhank you, {race}.\""
msgstr "\"이제 모든 것이 끝나게되서 기쁘다. 고맙다. {race}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 14_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "b3bfeb9d-dc65-46cf-a719-91147325b9fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk hisses viciously, straightening up.{/n} \"I ssshall anssswer, "
"{race}. But you won't like my ansssswer. Come clossser, I've ssstored sssome "
"ssspells essspecially for you.\" {n}A magic glow encirlces his hands.{/n} "
"\"Sssince I am to die, I ssshall take you with me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 화가 나서 위협합니다.{/n} \"두고보자. {race}. 하지만 나를 보고 싶지는 않을 거야. 이리 와. 너를 위해 준비한 "
"마법이 있다.\" {n}마법의 빛이 그의 손에서 빛납니다.{/n} \"내가 죽으려고 한 이상 너도 같이 데려가겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 1_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "40e10b42-401d-4185-84dc-b471b4c65fff"
msgid ""
"\"Ussselesss. Sssenssselesss. You are victoriousss, {race}. I sssurrender.\" "
"{n}He's breathing so heavily that it's hard to make out his coarse "
"hisses.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"쓸모 없다. 의미 없다. 네가 이겼다. {race}. 나는 항복한다. \" {n}그는 거칠게 숨을 쉬어 말하기가 힘들어보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 2_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "d746532a-fd8f-4421-a0b0-a4cbcc2ee135"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk squats tiredly and looks morose. The rugs that serve him for "
"clothes are tattered. Through the holes you can see bleeding scratches on "
"his purple hide. At the moment, Tartuk looks like a severely beaten dog, his "
"masters having banished him from the coziness of home out into the pouring "
"rain.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 피곤한듯 쪼그려 앉았고 풀이 죽어 보입니다. 옷으로 쓰는 그의 누더기는 너덜너덜 했습니다. 찢어진 구멍에서 그의 보랏빛 "
"살가죽에서 피를 흘르는 상처들이 보였습니다. 타툭은 아늑한 집에서 주인에게 심하게 구타당해서 비오는 밖으로 쫓긴 강아지처럼 "
"보였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 3_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "a4f729b9-9b47-4b57-b15e-d16490744b4c"
msgid ""
"\"Koboldsss didn't wisssh war. I didn't wisssh war.\" {n}He shakes his head, "
"and his horse-skull helmet shifts askew. Tartuk slowly sets it right, then "
"throws a glance toward Hargulka's remains.{/n} \"It'sss all trollsss' fault. "
"I sssought to sssuppresss their wisssh to kill humansss. But they wouldn't "
"lisssten.\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트는 전쟁을 원하지 않는다. 나는 전쟁을 바라지 않는다.\" {n}그가 고개를 가로젓자 머리에 쓴 말 두개골 헬멧이 비스듬이 "
"흘러내립니다. 타툭은 천천히 투구를 바로 쓰고는 하굴카의 시체를 향해 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"모두 트롤의 잘못이다. 나는 인간을 "
"죽이려는 그들의 야망을 막으려고 했다. 그들은 듣지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 4_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "1e6342b1-7fa5-49be-9ed4-7355e8558616"
msgid ""
"\"I don't accussse anyone!\" {n}Tartuk bares his teeth.{/n} \"It wasss me "
"who found thisss plac-ssse, rekindled thisss anc-sssient forge, sssensssed "
"it'sss magic. I ssstarted to brand trollsss to ssshield them from fire.\" {n}"
"He glares defiantly at you.{/n} \"It wasss my missstake as much asss "
"trollsss'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 누구도 탓하지 않아!\" {n}타툭은 이빨을 드러냅니다.{/n} \"여기를 발견하고, 이 고대 대장간은 마법이 깃들어 있다는 걸 "
"감지하고는 다시 불을 지핀건 나였어. 나는 트롤들을 화염으로부터 보호하기 위해 인장을 새겨주기 시작했어.\" {n}그는 반항적으로 당신을 "
"노려봅니다.{/n} \"그건 트롤만큼이나 멍청한 실수였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 5_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "14139a4d-b406-4d14-9d7a-14a1db30f4b8"
msgid ""
"\"You cannot underssstand.\" {n}Tartuk coughs wetly, then spits some blood "
"on the ground.{/n} \"Koboldsss are sssmall. Everyone triesss to banisssh "
"them, ssstrike them, ssslay them. No one ressspects them. Sssame thingsss I "
"sssuffered in the passst... I jussst wanted ressspect for koboldsss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 이해하지 못해.\" {n}타툭은 젖은 기침을 하고는 땅에 피를 뱉어냅니다.{/n} \"코볼트는 작다. 모두들 코볼트를 추방하고 "
"공격하고 죽이려고 한다. 아무도 코볼트를 존중하지 않아. 나도 과거에 같은 경험을 했다... 난 그저 코볼트들이 존중 받기를 원했을 "
"뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 6_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "5a032ec3-3c26-421f-8e9d-d5cb3f091ca1"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold falls silent and stares at dead Hargulka for a moment.{/n} "
"\"Trollsss were lissstening to koboldsss. For the firssst time, sssinc-ssse "
"the dawn of thisss world, koboldsss were treated with ressspect.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 잠잠해져 죽은 하굴카를 잠시 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"트롤은 코볼트의 말을 들었다. 처음으로 이 세상의 새벽이 밝은 이후로 "
"코볼트는 존중을 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 7_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "f3956771-b217-4ca0-afd7-109a7f9248e1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk casts his eyes down and whispers,{/n} \"You wouldn't underssstand, "
"{race}.\""
msgstr "{n}타툭은 눈을 깔고 속삭입니다.{/n} \"너는 이해하지 못해. {race}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 8_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "42c4a29f-f12e-4fdf-ad69-15b3837b9e9b"
msgid ""
"\"You would releassse me?\" {n}The kobold stands straighter.{/n} \"I ssshall "
"go away. A long dissstanc-ssse away, ssso no one could find me. Away from "
"trollsss, from humansss... from koboldsss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 풀어주려고?\" {n}코볼트가 곧게 서 있습니다.{/n} \"나는 멀리 떠나겠다. 멀리 떨어져 있어서 아무도 나를 찾을 수 없는 "
"곳으로. 트롤도 인간도... 코볼트도 없는 곳으로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043 9_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "4077144d-03f6-4f29-91c8-ef7147bf3c7a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk slouches again, the moment passed.{/n} \"I sssought to "
"essstablisssh the koboldsss kingdom, {race}. I wissshed a plac-ssse in "
"thisss world for koboldsss, wissshed them to be acc-sssepted. Sssome home. "
"But I've lossst.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 다시 구부정하게 주저앉았고 잠시 시간이 흐릅니다.{/n} \"난 코볼트 왕국을 세우고 싶었다.{race}. 이 세상에 "
"코볼트가 있을 수있는 곳이길 바랬어, 그들이 받아들여지는 곳.. 집이라 부르는 곳...하지만 이제 잃었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_60043_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "efec68c2-fde0-4165-ba62-5a9cd699092d"
msgid ""
"{n}After Hargulka's death, the kobold's spells weaken, as though he's lost "
"his concentration. His attacks stop, and he simply defends himself. Finally, "
"he drops his hands in the middle of casting a spell, letting it "
"dissipate.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카가 죽은 후에 연결이 약해져서 코볼트의 마법은 약해졌습니다. 그의 공격이 약해졌고 그는 자신을 방어합니다. 마침내 그는 마법을 "
"쓰다가 포기합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91861_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d0a51618-74f5-44c7-b222-a85d20d2b741"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia gently touches your shoulder, as if to urge restraint.{/n} \"I "
"know he's your enemy. But now I, for some reason, believe him. You should "
"show mercy.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 그만하라는 듯 당신의 어깨를 어루만집니다.{/n} \"그가 너의 적이라는 걸 알아. 하지만 어떤 이유에선지 나는 그를 "
"믿어. 그를 보내줘야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91862_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "38610df4-10fe-406b-9118-ef4f16208de9"
msgid ""
"\"I just don't know. I think it'd be best to kill him, but... he seems to be "
"earnest. I could perhaps settle for written apologies — though I doubt this "
"bastard is literate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 모르겠어. 나는 그를 죽이는 게 가장 좋다고 생각하지만... 그는 정직해보여. 이 녀석이 글을 알지는 모르겠지만 서면으로 한 "
"사과라면 받아들일 수 있을지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91863_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "23fc5b9a-d976-4a5e-86df-709a2dd98f0f"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost sniffs with contempt and waves his hand in the general direction "
"of the kobold.{/n} \"Let him go, if you want, then. Let him get lost. I "
"never want to see this wretch again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 경멸로 냄새를 맡고 코볼트에게 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"원한다면 그를 보내. 꺼지라고 해. 나는 이 악취나는 녀석을 "
"다시는 보고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91866_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "adb61d13-f0d1-4655-af3d-bcd1fbd68a33"
msgid ""
"\"Don't forget you also tried to steal my cart, assshole!\" {n}Jubilost "
"spits on the ground.{/n} \"Dammit, even his hiss is contagious.\""
msgstr "\"너도 내 마차를 훔치려고 했다는 사실을 잊지 마!\" {n}주빌로스트는 땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"젠장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91867_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "68718e58-9176-4917-8760-880f8adcdf4f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk bares his teeth.{/n} \"I wasssn't trying to assault. I jussst "
"asssked you to give usss sssome clothesss.\" {n}His anger subsides.{/n} \"We "
"ssshouldn't attack.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 이빨을 드러냅니다.{/n} \"공격하려던 것이 아니었다. 나는 그냥 옷을 좀 달라고 부탁하려던 거였어.\" {n}그의 분노가 "
"가라앉습니다.{/n} \"공격하지 말아야했는데..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91868_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "69645d26-9312-45b2-bc2f-37cfc54f6277"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost turns to you.{/n} \"Let's cut his head off and call it a day. "
"Attempting assaults on famous cartographers should be punished severely.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트가 당신에게 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"저 녀석의 머리를 자르고 오늘은 그만하자. 유명 지도제작자에 대한 폭행 시도는 엄벌에 "
"처해야 한다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91871_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fa0244bf-f689-442c-90cf-a2ee84c8f69c"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure? I mean, I feel pity for these poor kobolds… but so many "
"people have died because of them! {mf|Baron|Baroness}, don't you think "
"you're being a bit... gullible?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말이야? 이 불쌍한 코볼트들이 안타깝다... 하지만 많은 사람들이 그들 때문에 죽었어! {mf|남작|여남작}님, 네가 조금... "
"호구 같다는 생각은 안해봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91872_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5878acc2-3d95-4967-a0b5-f5c62bb06326"
msgid ""
"\"Imagine that! A barony with no roads, guards, or even the slightest hint "
"of civilization, but hey — they have tamed and leashed kobolds! Come on, "
"surprise me, cast away your state before you really start building it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"상상해봐! 도로, 경비원, 심지어 문명의 흔적조차 없는 영지안에 코볼트가 넘치는 세상! 다들 코볼트 한마리씩 기르고 있을꺼야! 자 "
"어서, 날 놀래켜봐. 영지가 정착하기도 전에 다 걷어차 보라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91873_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3982ca2c-94b2-4279-a0b9-c28748fd5b85"
msgid ""
"\"A kobold kingdom near human settlements — what an absurdly dangerous idea! "
"Only a shortsighted ruler would let cunning beasts like these live near "
"{mf|his|her} towns and villages!\""
msgstr ""
"\"인류 거주지 근처에 있는 코볼트 왕국이라니..정말 터무니없이 위험한 생각입니다! 짧은 생각을 가진 통치자만이 이런 교활한 짐승들을 "
"마을 근처에 살게 할 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91874_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "accd35eb-943a-482a-857d-f2426fbcb7b3"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri spits on the ground and glares.{/n} \"So, making friends with "
"lizards now? They're not pets, they're roaches! And they should be smashed "
"like roaches!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 땅에 침을 뱉고 노려봅니다.{/n} \"그래서 이제는 도마뱀과 친구를 하자고? 이 녀석들은 애완동물이 아니야! "
"바퀴벌레라고! 밟아버려야 할 존재야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91875_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2724bc55-e1cf-440c-a8be-4c2b5643e137"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun frowns, shaking his head.{/n} \"Why? Why tolerate this creature? "
"What need have you for kobolds?\" {n}He shakes his head again and turns "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 머리를 흔들며 찡그립니다.{/n} \"왜? 이 생물을 받아들이는 거지? 무엇 때문에 코볼트가 필요한 거야?\" {n}그는 "
"머리를 흔들며 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91876_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "79f7a8fc-67ca-473b-b47a-6ec8c6e6b037"
msgid ""
"\"Have you gone mad?\" {n}Ekun clenches his teeth and glares at you.{/n} "
"\"Don't listen to this scaled bastard! They attacked villages, killed your "
"people! He'll betray you as soon as you look away!\" {n}Ekun falls silent, "
"then begins again, slowly.{/n} \"If... if you let them live, I will travel "
"with you no longer.\" {n}He steps back, watching you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"미쳤어?\" {n}에쿤은 이를 악물고 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"이 멍청이들의 말을 듣지 마라! 그들은 마을을 공격하고 너의 "
"백성들을 죽였어! 네가 다른 곳을 보면 배신할 거야!\" {n}에쿤은 침묵하고 다시 천천히 말합니다.{/n} \"그들을 살려준다면 너와 "
"여행하지 않겠다.\" {n}그는 물러서서 당신을 지켜보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91878_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "248d3415-cc46-4fbe-9012-f087dafd68d9"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold tilts his head, his cold reptile eyes looking straight at "
"you.{/n} \"Kingdom, yesss?\" {n}Tartuk gulps and continues, carefully "
"articulating his words.{/n} \"You offer me to ssstay and build my kingdom in "
"your landsss?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 머리를 갸우뚱하며 차가운 파충류 눈으로 당신을 똑바로 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"왕국이라고?\" {n}타툭은 침을 꿀꺽 삼키고 "
"계속해서 말합니다.{/n} \"여기서 머물면서 네 땅에 내 왕국을 만들라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91881_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "e5678132-eed3-4f83-a348-b94caff77051"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk wearily closes his eyes and hangs his head. His shoulders slump "
"under the weight of another dashed hope, like an invisible burden upon him. "
"He slouches and goes still.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 눈을 감고 머리를 숙입니다. 갑작스러운 희망의 부담으로 그의 어깨는 보이지 않는 짐이 어깨를 누르듯 쳐져있습니다. 그는 "
"움츠러든 채로 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91883_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "acae6c18-cb50-4038-a003-08bc392f5b3d"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's brow is furrowed… and his hand falls to his weapon. There's a "
"moment of silence between you, then he shakes his head and turns away.{/n}\n"
"\"Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 미간이 좁아집니다... 그의 손은 무기를 떨어뜨립니다. 당신과 그 사이에서 침묵이 흘렀고 그는 머리를 흔들고는 등을 "
"돌립니다.{/n}\n"
"\"작별이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91885_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "d6d16525-aa63-4735-94c1-ef73e8fb9850"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk hesitates. He throws another glance at Hargulka's remains — then "
"slowly straightens himself upright, adjusts the horse skull on his head, and "
"brushes the dirt off his bloodstained clothes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 망설입니다. 그는 하굴카의 시체를 다시 한번 보고는 천천히 허리를 펴고는 말 두개골 투구를 바로 썼고 피가 묻은 옷에서 "
"먼지를 쓸어냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91886_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "af29c9ee-b298-4aa4-a1cb-805663ca25aa"
msgid ""
"\"You won't regret thisss, {race}.\" {n}The kobold's voice fills the room, "
"echoing off the walls.{/n} \"I, Tartuk, ssswear my loyalty to you. Godsss "
"are my witnesssesss! Witnesssesss of the agreement between humansss and "
"dragon sssucc-sssesssorsss!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 후회하지 않을 것이다. {race}. \" {n}코볼트의 목소리가 벽을 때리며 방을 메웁니다.{/n} \"나 타툭은 너에게 "
"충성한다. 신이 나의 증인이다! 인간과 드래곤의 후손이 맺은 약속을 본 증인이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91887_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "780e213f-cc6f-4c8f-92ba-a80634935977"
msgid ""
"\"Let's leave thisss plac-ssse. Humansss mussst ssstay under the sssunlight. "
"And we ssshall build our home beneathhh the sssurfac-ssse. Under your "
"protection.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 장소를 떠나야 한다. 인간은 햇빛을 쬐며 살아야 한다. 우리는 지하에 우리의 집을 지을 것이다. 네 보호 아래서 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91892_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "0cf3520e-96af-45cd-b4f5-eff064d61a76"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold groans.{/n} \"Why are you making me remember? I don't want to "
"remember! The memory... it comesss, then goesss, then comesss again. Why do "
"you care who I am? Ssspare me or let me die, but ssstop thisss...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 신음합니다.{/n} \"왜 내가 떠올리게 하지? 나는 기억하고 싶지 않아! 그 기억은... 계속해서 찾아온다. 내가 "
"누구인지 왜 신경을 쓰는 거야? 나를 살려두던지 죽게 하던지 제발 멈춰줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91895_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "1b939bee-9dd3-4e71-8c8b-c3187eabcebe"
msgid ""
"\"You know what? You tried to make your tribe happy by ravaging and "
"torturing all your neighbors! Chief Sootscale is a worthy example — he made "
"an alliance with our baron{mf||ess} and he's living the high life with all "
"his kobolds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 네 이웃을 약탈하고 고문하여 네 부족의 배를 채웠어! 수트스케일 대장이 그런 녀석이야. 그는 우리 남작과 동맹을 맺고 코볼트와 "
"함께 살고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91896_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "b82a4eb5-f028-4fbc-a4ce-d7fd56f7240e"
msgid "\"But now it is over... You will not ssspare me...\""
msgstr "\"하지만 지금은 끝났어... 너는 나를 살려주지 않을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91898_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "46b84208-dc86-4fb4-95be-6aef6eb09fec"
msgid "\"Sure, it figures! You're willing to believe just about anyone!\""
msgstr "\"물론! 그럴 거야! 너는 누구든 믿게 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91903_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c96bb477-2e8c-43cc-9b40-5d12e347ed07"
msgid ""
"\"Generousity is a game for the very strong and very rich — you can't afford "
"it yet. Chop off the creep's head, and let's go celebrate our victory!\""
msgstr ""
"\"관대함은 매우 강하고 부유한 사람들이 가질 수 있는 것이지. 너는 아직 그럴 형편이 안돼. 괴물의 머리를 잘라버리고 우리의 승리를 "
"축하하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91905_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "72944d46-c32c-42b6-aacd-31833f51bd5a"
msgid ""
"\"Serves the scum right! If you spare your enemies, you'll soon find "
"yourself with no barony — and no head!\""
msgstr "\"쓰레기에 맞는 대우를 해줘야지! 네가 적을 살려두면 네 남작령과 네 머리도 없어질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91907_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b81fc5fc-1a8c-45ce-a253-b4498ca35db1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian turns to you.{/n} \"Your benevolence would make "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} smile. I admire your kindness.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"너의 자비가 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}에게 미소를 짓는군. 네 친절에 감탄했다. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91914_Text
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "b70361c5-75aa-451a-8f1c-8f57fab5e5e4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk hisses viciously as he straightens up.{/n} \"Come clossser — I've "
"sssome ssspells ssstored essspecially for you.\" {n}A magic glow encircles "
"his hands.{/n} \"If I am to die, I ssshall take you with me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 허리를 펴며 위협합니다.{/n} \"더 가까이 와라. 너를 위해 준비한 마법이 있다.\" {n}마법의 빛이 그의 손을 "
"둘러쌉니다.{/n} \"내가 죽으면 너와 함께 죽겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91917_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "153b4e46-6b92-4121-94ee-ad45c1814e0a"
msgid ""
"\"Think about it — you defeated him once, but he rose from the ashes and "
"managed to build his wild kingdom from nothing, with help from neither Pitax "
"nor Brevoy. He deserves respect. And that is why I'm urging you – kill him. "
"Do it now, or he'll only try to overthrow you again. And who knows – next "
"time he might succeed...\""
msgstr ""
"\"생각해봐. 너는 그를 한번 이겼지만 그는 재에서 일어나 자신의 왕국을 맨손으로 건설했어. 피탁스나 브레보이의 도움도 없이 말이야. "
"그는 존경을 받을 만해. 그래서 내가 너에게 말하는 거야. 그를 죽이라고. 지금 죽이지 않으면 그는 너를 다시 없애려고 할 거야. "
"다음에는 그가 이길지 누가 알겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91918_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1aa3f44e-54a7-4180-a1ac-980f32127502"
msgid ""
"\"We tieflings are despised outcasts in the most parts of the civilized "
"world. Maybe it's just my scarred heart speaking, but I believe Tartuk and "
"his kobolds deserve another chance. Let them live.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 티플링은 문명화된 사회에서 외부자로 미움을 받았어. 아마 내 상처받은 마음이 말하는 거 같지만 타툭과 코볼트가 다른 기회를 "
"가져야 한다고 생각해. 그를 살게 해주자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_91919_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "45fcb6c8-f8e8-43d6-90ef-9df7664e7de9"
msgid ""
"\"I'm with you. Sometimes you just need to break the established order of "
"things and show the world there's another way. Let the kobold kingdom in "
"your lands stand as an the example of this. In the end, what is Tartuccio's "
"story, if not a true wonder? And what's the harm in allowing it a happy "
"ending?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너와 함께 있어. 가끔 너는 명령을 깨고 다른 길을 보여주어야 해. 코볼트 왕국이 너의 영토 안에 세워지는 게 그것이지. 결국에 "
"타투치오의 이야기는 무엇이겠어? 그게 행복한 결말로 끝난다면 뭐가 나쁘겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_TartukPitax_Text_String
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "03650fa3-2a5b-4402-8e52-eabc4e3ae32b"
msgid ""
"{n}Kobold ponders over your question.{/n} \"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}… ssstrong "
"country, ravenousss king. He wantsss more, more power… yesss, I remember. I "
"ssserved him. The king sssaid: 'There's some ancient artifact in the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, find it and send to me!' And I did. I found "
"it in the Sycamore Hall and sssent to the king. Then fought againssst you "
"and died.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 당신의 질문에 대해 깊이 생각합니다.{/n} \"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}... 강력한 나라이고 탐욕스런 왕이 있다. "
"그는 더 많은 것과 힘을 원해... 그래. 나는 기억해. 내가 그를 섬겼다. 왕이 말했어. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}"
"에는 고대의 유물이 있으니 찾아서 나에게 보내라고! 그래서 나는 시킨대로 했어. 나는 시카모어 회관에서 발견해서 왕에게 보냈다. 그리고 "
"너와 싸워서 죽었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_Tartuk_TE2_Text_String
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "73c525a7-4c3b-4746-8da6-be51e451d97e"
msgid ""
"\"My return... was not a gift, but a curse. I became the one I pretended to "
"be. Kobold Tartuk, not gnome Tartuccio. And I ssstarted to forget. Who I "
"was. How I lived. Sssometimes I have pictures in my head. I thought they "
"were visionsss. Until I met you, my executioner.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 부활은... 선물이 아니라 저주다. 나의 가면이 내가 되었어. 코볼트 타툭이 되고 노움 타투치오는 없어진 거지. 나는 잊어버리기 "
"시작했다. 내가 누구인지. 내가 어떻게 살았는지. 가끔 머릿속에서 장면이 떠오르지만. 그것은 환상이었어. 너를 만날 때까지는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_Tartuk_TE3_Text_String
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "d28f7059-b750-46df-81ae-d3c10bd379be"
msgid ""
"\"But I must sssay... I don't know who did this to me. I don't know what "
"will happen. But I was happy. Tartuccio called everyone fools, because he "
"knew he was one too. A funny, lucklesss fellow. But as Tartuk, I was "
"different. I became a leader, I commanded respect. I created "
"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} to show everyone what I can do. I can change the "
"world. Do sssomething important.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 나는... 누가 나한테 그런 짓을 했는지 모르겠다. 나는 어떤 일이 일어날지 모른다. 하지만 나는 행복했다. 타투치오는 모두를 "
"바보라고 불렀어. 왜냐하면 그는 자신도 그 중 하나라는 것을 알고 있었기 때문이야. 정말 운이 없는 친구지. 하지만 타툭으로써 나는 "
"달랐어. 나는 지도자가 되었고 존중을 받았어. 나는 {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}를 지어 모두에게 내가 할 수 있다는 것을 "
"보여주었어. 나는 세상을 바꿀 수 있어.나도 뭔가 중요한 일을 해낼수 있어\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLairSecondLevel/SurrenderedRival/Cue_Tartuk_TE_Text_String
#. Speaker : SecondLevelRival
msgctxt "8cd24103-437b-4307-954b-864b1b83212b"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold heaves a pained sigh.{/n} \"Thisss isss… ssstrange. I "
"remember, and I don't remember... My head is a hall of doorsss, and almossst "
"all are closssed. Sssometimes I remember sssomething, but then — emptinesss."
"\" {n}Tartuk-Tartuccio's speech changes, as if two creatures are speaking at "
"once.{/n} \"Listen. I know who I was and how I died. Then something "
"happened. Power! A great power. It brought me back to life. But not the way "
"I was before.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 고통스러운 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"이건... 이상하다. 나는 기억하지만 기억이 나지 않아... 내 머리는 문이 있는 "
"방에 있었고 대부분의 문은 닫혀있었어. 가끔 나는 무언가를 기억하지만 그 다음에는 공허 뿐이야.\" {n}마치 둘이 동시에 말하려는 듯 "
"타툭과 타투치오가 번갈아가면서 말합니다.{/n} \"들어 봐. 나는 내가 누군지 어떻게 죽었는지 알아. 그리고 무언가가 일어났다. "
"힘이었어! 강력한 힘. 그것은 나를 살려주었지만 이전의 나는 없어졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLair_FirstLevel/Barks/Bark_KoboldArtistBark1_String
msgctxt "fafeb90f-f5ec-4e32-a3b9-e82502ea040e"
msgid "\"Ssslardasssk.\""
msgstr "\"스으을라다스으크\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLair_FirstLevel/Barks/Bark_KoboldArtistBark2_String
msgctxt "061ab7d0-5711-4443-baf6-7f357704fec4"
msgid "\"Paintsss.\""
msgstr "\"그리린닷.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c21/TrollLair_FirstLevel/Barks/Bark_KoboldArtistBark3_String
msgctxt "07f15fd3-be26-42a6-ae88-f019ae70238a"
msgid "\"Shhh-sss.\""
msgstr "\"슈-스슷.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "e78458a9-186a-445d-a5a6-bc1f02aa8476"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 무슨 일이 일어난 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "862c01b2-e5b0-4b62-9dbe-92f97b6185a8"
msgid "\"Clear the road and let these people pass!\""
msgstr "\"길을 비우고 이 사람들이 지나가게 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "c761164b-db02-4dab-bc62-9545cb6322bb"
msgid "\"Not a bad set-up you got here. How about you work for me?\""
msgstr "\"여기에 너희들이 자리잡은 것도 나쁘지 않아보이는군. 나를 위해 일해 보는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "e900e36d-fac2-4824-b8c0-3aa938094d55"
msgid "[Attack] \"You should have run while you could.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"도망 칠 수 있을때 도망 쳤어야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "3cb6ca7e-2110-475e-a63b-5615d984481e"
msgid ""
"\"I am the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} of this realm, and I didn't order "
"anyone to guard this bridge.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 땅의 {mf|영주|영주|왕이|여왕이}다. 난 누구에게도 이 다리를 지키라고 명령하지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "0963018e-3dc6-44d6-9677-72b2e621f99b"
msgid "\"The Stag Lord? The Stag Lord is dead. What is this nonsense?\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주? 수사슴 군주는 죽었어. 무슨 허튼 소리를 하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "e1db1c1e-242d-41f1-9ab7-35dcb2dfe216"
msgid "\"Who gave you the right to extort passers-by?\""
msgstr "\"다리를 지나는 사람들을 갈취할 권리는 누가 준거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "adeb5ebc-79ed-4807-8ff6-7fc7ac08f8e2"
msgid "\"What are these monsters you're talking about?\""
msgstr "\"네가 말하는 괴물들이란 뭘 말하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "6e0ea7e5-39e4-4c90-bca0-f45c643950d9"
msgid "\"Enough.\""
msgstr "\"충분히 들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "e2881bdc-378e-4086-91bd-f1a8dd3c817a"
msgid "\"Where is this 'Stag Lord' of yours?\""
msgstr "\"너의 '수사슴 군주'는 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "caf5b1ae-9774-4671-b3d0-f30262e9b575"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "9b6f3efe-abd0-479c-8770-ceb537d57ea0"
msgid "\"How goes your duties?\""
msgstr "\"일은 잘 되가고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "cfda97e4-ee77-4b32-a315-49c72e94f2f1"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've had enough of brigands in my lands!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 땅에서 도적들이라면 이제 지긋지긋하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "56dea9d8-6667-4709-9d9a-a589289cdea7"
msgid ""
"{n}The cutthroat in front of you is well-armed, as are the other warriors "
"behind him. He turns to face you.{/n} \"Hey, get in line! Watch where ye're "
"goin'...\" {n}The man trails off as he sees your face — he recognizes "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 서있는 이 도적은, 뒤의 다른 전사들과 마찬가지로 잘 무장되어 있습니다. 그는 당신을 향해 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"이봐. "
"줄을 서! 대체 어디 가는...\" {n}그 남자는 따라와 얼굴을 보고는, 당신을 알아봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "4ad89787-1077-4556-a169-a0e1e39be3b1"
msgid ""
"\"By the Gods! The {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! What the... what brings "
"you here?\" {n}The man glances at his companions, who look equally uncertain "
"what to do, and turns red.{/n} \"Eh, well, err... of course you can pass, "
"Yer {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!'"
msgstr ""
"\"세상에! {mf|영주님|영주님|왕|여왕님}이시잖아! 이런 젠... 여긴 무슨일로 오신겁니까?\" {n}그 남자는 어떻게 해야할지 몰라 "
"얼굴이 붉어진 동료들을 힐끗 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"어, 음, 으.. 물론 지나가셔도 좋습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "ee9a971a-bbef-4659-b38d-11b1ee58183e"
msgid "\"Yes, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}?\""
msgstr "\"네, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "e003a6cc-887a-4e76-95c3-0a686ae5616b"
msgid ""
"\"Well, now, we... we're guarding the bridge, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}"
"! From monsters and others. On the Stag Lord's orders.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게.. 지금..우리는... 다리를 지키고 있습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 괴물들이랑 뭐 그런 비슷한것들로부터 "
"말입니다. 수사슴 군주의 명령입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "3718bc54-cb46-44a0-ae90-8ad8953690a4"
msgid ""
"{n}The bandit swallows.{/n} \"It's ahhhh... like... an order's an order! "
"We're the Stag Lord's people. He says — guard the bridge, we guard the "
"bridge!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도적이 침을 삼킵니다.{/n} \"아......그러니까... 명령은 명령입니다! 우리는 수사슴 군주의 부하입니다. 그가 말하길, "
"다리를 지켜라 하길래, 우리는 다리를 지키는거죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "c4b3a2a0-dbd6-45b2-b2ee-4559749d3fe7"
msgid ""
"\"Gotta peel yer eyes, Yer {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Alive, he is! "
"See for yourself — there he is, keeping watch over us himself!\""
msgstr "\"눈이 삐셨나요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 그는 살아있습니다! 직접 보세요. 저기서 우리를 지켜보고 있잖습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "9dc6fae7-e3dc-4483-ab1d-638ec54828e5"
msgid ""
"\"We have to eat, as much as anyone else — hunger will take us if we've no "
"coin.\""
msgstr "\"우리도 남들처럼 먹고 살아야죠. 돈 없으면 배고파 죽을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "7dfcec28-3485-41ac-8d88-40e531033773"
msgid ""
"\"Why, eh... {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}... all kinds, all kinds! Not "
"long ago, a hydra popped up on the other side o' the river. Right, men?\" {n}"
"The warriors nod.{/n} \"A fat, long-fanged bastard, too! Now, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} — what happens if that thing gets it into "
"its head to feast on folk crossing the bridge? And that's not the worst of "
"it — there's goblins sneaking all about as well, snatching everything that's "
"not tied down!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어... 그러니까... {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}...온갖 종류들이죠, 온갖 종류들! 얼마 전엔 히드라가 강 건너편에서 "
"나타났었습니다. 그렇지, 친구들?\" {n}전사들은 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"뚱뚱하고 송곳니가 긴 놈이었죠! 자, "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 만약에 그 괴물이 다리를 건너는 마을 사람들을 잡아먹으면 어떻게 합니까? 아니면 고블린이 몰래 "
"기어들어와서 돌아다니는 가축을 훔쳐간다거나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "6868988a-b6d4-43ea-b85c-74bbbcd6a9d8"
msgid ""
"{n}The man falls silent. The men behind him all looking at their feet "
"uncomfortably.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}남자는 침묵합니다. 뒤에 선 사람들은 자기 발끝만 내려다보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "a6915105-cf12-4eee-81ae-9e7b5643f580"
msgid ""
"\"But, but... see...\" {n}The man takes a breath, and leans in.{/n} \""
"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}, I'm nothing, a pair of hands — I collect the "
"money, see, and let through ones that pay. It'd be better if you took the "
"matter up with the Stag Lord, have a chat with him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만... 하지만...\" {n}남자는 숨을들이쉬며 몸을 숙입니다.{/n} \"저는 그저 부하일 뿐입니다. 나는 돈을 거두고 그리곤 "
"길을 지나가게 할 뿐이에요. 이 문제는 수사슴 군주와 직접 얘기하는 게 좋겠습니다. 그와 한번 얘기해 보세요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "8a1f972a-4941-405d-a0a8-396733fa1bef"
msgid ""
"{n}The man's eyes light up — then a worried expression crosses his face.{/n} "
"\"Yer {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, me and the boys would like that, "
"we would! But, see, we already answer to the Stag Lord... maybe you should "
"have a word with him about it?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자의 눈이 밝아지더니, 곧 걱정스러운 표정이 얼굴에 교차합니다.{/n} \"나와 내 부하들도 그러고 싶습니다, "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 하지만 저와 여기 친구들은, 이미 수사슴 군주 밑으로 들어간터라... 이 문제는 그와 한번 이야기해 "
"봐주시는게 어떨까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "95a6940f-f59a-4a83-9c12-f3de037893d0"
msgid "\"There, see, right there. Go up to him, he's the one to talk to.\""
msgstr "\"저기, 보이죠? 바로 저깁니다. 그에게 한번 가보시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/BanditLeader/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : BanditLeader
msgctxt "0d6f1458-e4d5-41ac-ad48-6ba9876df92a"
msgid ""
"{n}The man gives a wide grin.{/n} \"Easy pickings, Yer "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Doing well as before, but now's it's "
"easier getting them to part with their coin now we have your blessing!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자는 밝게 웃습니다.{/n} \"식은죽 먹기죠! 전처럼 하면 되지만 지금은 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 허락했으니 돈 "
"버는게 더 쉬워졌죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Barks/Bark_PeasantsLeave_String
msgctxt "cc48e58f-656c-4ffb-b6cd-77a7dbcf2f86"
msgid "\"The road's clear! We can move at last!\""
msgstr "\"도로가 정리됐군! 드디어 움직일 수 있겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Barks/Bark_angryBridgePeasant_String
msgctxt "0679c9e3-9b5d-4a7b-b5e6-33b1dc553005"
msgid "\"Let us through! The road should be free for all!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 지나가게 해줘! 누구에게나 자유로워야 할 도로에 통행세를 받다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Barks/Bark_hungryPeasantLeave_String
msgctxt "54399f1c-b26a-4acb-93a2-979d85067e76"
msgid "\"We can afford food now. Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 이제 음식을 살 수 있어. 고맙습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Barks/Bark_hungryPeasant_String
msgctxt "a675e3d8-eb66-4638-92ec-d31eddee552a"
msgid "\"His prices are outrageous!\""
msgstr "\"가격이 너무 터무니 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Barks/Berries_LoreNature_Fail_String
msgctxt "5adfdae2-e00e-411a-8e9d-43095224e438"
msgid "Bush is covered by juicy black-and-purple berries."
msgstr "덤불은 육즙이 많은 까만 자주색 열매로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Barks/Berries_LoreNature_Success_String
msgctxt "636521a8-89a0-4e04-a373-6444eadd0ae4"
msgid "These berries are deadly — they cause almost immediate death."
msgstr "이 열매는 치명적입니다. 그것은 거의 즉각적인 죽음을 초래합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "98d6b213-e75b-4b64-bce2-250c82eee5ab"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} and rightful ruler of this realm. "
"And you are?\""
msgstr "\"{name}. 이 땅의 정당한 {mf|영주|영주|왕이|여왕이}다. 그래서 넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "1c4aeb4b-89eb-48c1-9837-603b87738a41"
msgid ""
"\"I dealt with the Stag Lord myself. You're just an impostor, and a "
"miserable one at that.\""
msgstr "\"내가 직접 수사슴 군주를 처리했다. 너는 그저 사기꾼에, 비참한 존재일 뿐이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "0d5fcb74-e708-4ce3-9ea0-089ccf3f24d4"
msgid ""
"\"You tried to take some of my lands for your own. What do you have to say "
"in your defense?\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 땅 일부를 차지하려 했어. 어떻게 변명할 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2d14bacd-3f52-44c4-9341-e8e540e49cfb"
msgid "Recruited bandits from the bridge."
msgstr "다리에서 도둑을 고용했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "d483a566-be7b-487b-9cd2-29b421c181f1"
msgid ""
"\"How would you like to keep collecting money, only as servants rather than "
"bandits? You would have to share your revenue, though — seven parts to the "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}, three to your gang.\""
msgstr ""
"\"도적이 되기 보다는 내 부하가 되어 돈을 버는 게 어때? 하지만 수익을 나누어야 해. 7대 3으로 나누자. 3은 네 몫이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "a4006a21-7697-48d0-9092-8c0c38055d72"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Here's a thought. Since I already killed one Stag Lord, what's to "
"keep me from killing another?\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 생각을 말해주지. 이미 수사슴 군주 하나를 죽였는데, 둘을 못죽일 이유가 없지않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "632add03-96ff-4d87-81de-df39584fcb1c"
msgid ""
"Kicked bandits from the bridge and returned collected money to the folk."
msgstr "다리에서 도적들을 쫓아내고 사람들에게 모은 돈을 돌려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "4dac7d0c-6485-4b7f-b7c5-c60863a085db"
msgid ""
"\"All right, Stag Boy, you're going to take that ridiculous thing off your "
"head, leave this tent, and do everything you can to ensure I never hear from "
"you or your gang again. Everything you've collected so far will be returned "
"to the people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 수사슴 꼬마야, 너는 당장 그 우스꽝스러운걸 머리에서 벗어버리고, 이 텐트를 떠나 다시는 너나 네 패거리들 소식이 내 귀에 "
"들리지 않도록 해. 네가 모은 것들은 사람들에게 돌려주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "177fbc57-6e81-437c-b568-45277ad1afac"
msgid "\"I'll come back later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 오겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "044900e1-8e77-4536-8419-763b5b0c4210"
msgid "\"How are your duties going?\""
msgstr "\"네 의무는 어떻게 되고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0046_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b022c822-fef5-46d6-a8fe-ca37b6c010fe"
msgid "Threatened bandit leader with public execution."
msgstr "공개 처형으로 도적을 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "bfc24b83-caba-47c2-acce-32ddf6bc1163"
msgid ""
"\"You'll hang in the main square as a warning to any other outlaws who might "
"dare to cross my path. The money you've collected will serve better in the "
"treasury.\""
msgstr "\"광장에 너를 목매달아 다른 범법자들에게 경고를 보내겠어. 네가 모은 돈은 국가를 위해 쓰겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0047_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e044091f-04f4-4474-a977-28163f7a2c35"
msgid "Cleared the bridge from bandits."
msgstr "다리에서 도적을 쫓아냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "42d040e9-3609-4644-85e8-a754f146089b"
msgid ""
"\"No one blocks travel in the Stolen Lands, not even to charge a toll — "
"haven't you heard of the River Freedoms? Get your people and get out. The "
"bridge will be open to all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구도 도둑맞은 땅의 여행을 막을 수 없고 통행료를 받아서는 안돼. 강의 자유라는걸 들어보지 못했어? 어서 여기서 나가. 이 다리는 "
"모든 사람들에게 개방되어야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "f164f3d2-7193-411c-b2a0-5da024a5a2ea"
msgid ""
"{n}The infamous Stag Lord looks to be a portly man somewhere in his forties. "
"His armor is at least a size too small for his bulk, and the ill-fitting "
"helmet on his head is adorned with antlers that vaguely resemble those seen "
"on the head of the previous Stag Lord, now deceased.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}악명 높은 수사슴 군주는 40대의 푸근한 중년으로 보입니다. 그의 갑옷은 몸에 비해 너무 작았고 머리에 잘 맞지 않는 헬멧은 이전 "
"수사슴 군주의 투구와 비슷하게 보이는 뿔로 장식되어있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "6cdcf005-7975-4c8b-bdce-fdb3b8508f20"
msgid "{n}The impostor shrinks from your gaze.{/n} \"What do you want?\""
msgstr "{n}사기꾼은 당신을 보자 움츠러듭니다.{/n} \"무엇을 원하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "bb974e71-9fc5-4e17-aeba-841c46c00faf"
msgid ""
"\"Who dares stumble into my headquarters without so much as a knock or a "
"bow?! Who the hell do you think you are?\""
msgstr "\"누가 감히 인사도 허락도 없이 내 본부에 불쑥 발을 디디는거지?! 너는 대체 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "ca2b4c02-88d5-497f-972e-02f7143fd98c"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}, you say? Heh, you made a huge mistake "
"coming here, then. For I am the Stag Lord, hero to the people and enemy of "
"any bureaucrats who would dare call the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} "
"their own!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 땅의 {mf|영주|영주|왕|여왕}이라고? 그럼 여기 온건 큰 실수다. 내가 바로 백성들의 영웅이자 썩은 관료들의 적, 수사슴 "
"군주다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "a278e3e2-8d39-405b-a594-9089761616f2"
msgid ""
"{n}It may be hard to see his face under his ridiculous helmet, but it's easy "
"to see the bandit leader deflate upon hearing your words.{/n} \"I... No! It "
"is I who is the Stag Lord! You... killed an impostor!\" {n}The gang leader's "
"voice quavers as he speaks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}우스꽝스러운 투구 아래에 얼굴을 보기는 힘들었지만 당신의 말에 기세가 누그러졌다.{/n} \"아, 아니! 내가 수사슴 군주다! 네가 "
"죽인 녀석은... 가짜야!\" {n}우두머리 도둑의 목소리가 떨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "74066c2c-f7f1-4289-aebb-ca5b1d95c396"
msgid ""
"\"Insolent fool! All of the surrounding lands are the property of the Stag "
"Lord and his daredevils!\""
msgstr "\"어리석은 녀석! 주변의 모든 땅은 수사슴 군주의 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "13ed8f29-3053-43b3-b8db-5698aa459cdc"
msgid ""
"{n}The bandit leader is silent for a moment.{/n} \"Work... for you? Yes, of "
"course! Rest assured, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, not a mouse "
"will pass this bridge without first paying the toll!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도적 두목은 잠시 침묵을 지킵니다.{/n} \"당신을 위해.. 일한다고? 네, 물론 하겠습니다! 안심하시죠. "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 통행세 없이는 쥐새끼 한마리도 여기를 지나가지 못하게 하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "54460542-6475-46ee-82fc-50bd85db1cb9"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your {mf|Barony|Barony|Kingness|Queenness}... I mean, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}... Of course... You're... too kind...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 이 땅은 너의 {mf|영지|영지|왕국|왕국}이죠....아 그러니까..내말은...{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} "
"땅이죠..물론.... 정말 친절하시군요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "4295b9a2-dfaa-4bcc-a6de-d57eab674db2"
msgid ""
"\"Impudent upstart! I may not be THE Stag Lord, but I can sure as hell give "
"a presumptuous wimp like you a proper beating! Get {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 풋내기! 나는 수사슴 군주가 아니지만 너 같은 멍청이는 한방 먹여줄 수 있어! 저 녀석을 잡아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "e11f3f6a-6f4b-4b55-b5d6-6e3765228a30"
msgid ""
"\"Hell no! You just want someone else to do all the dirty work for you! Get "
"in here, gang! Let's teach the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} a lesson about "
"trying to control free people!\""
msgstr "\"젠장 안돼! 누가 너 대신 더러운 일을 하기를 바라는 거야! 이봐! 모두 모여라! 이 녀석에게 교훈을 가르쳐주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "4451f312-1740-4f24-89c2-c719273b00c9"
msgid ""
"\"Get in my way again and I'll order my associates here to hang you upside "
"down on the bridge!\""
msgstr "\"다시 내 앞을 가로막는다면, 여기 있는 내 동료들에게 너를 다리 위에 거꾸로 매달라고 명령하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "a53fe575-914d-418f-84e0-b43512c1a048"
msgid ""
"\"Everything's fine and dandy, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! "
"Levyin' tributes, blocking passage — everything's as it should be!\""
msgstr "\"모든 것이 순조롭습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 평소처럼 길을 잘 막고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "1d3c6db2-43fb-40cc-a93a-68c3c5ed793d"
msgid ""
"{n}The \"Stag Lord\" awkwardly and hastily salutes you.{/n} \"What can we do "
"for you today, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}\"수사슴 군주\"는 성급하고 어색하게 당신에게 경례를 합니다.{/n} \"오늘은 무엇을 도와드릴까요? "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "988a18d0-1e64-4cdb-965f-bd4d71a1429b"
msgid "\"NO, PLEASE! MERCY!\""
msgstr "\"아니! 제발! 살려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "d65afc91-3378-42e0-84ba-0a48c27ccd56"
msgid ""
"\"That so?! Get {mf|him|her}, everyone! Let's hang the troublemaker from the "
"bridge as a warning to all who see {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"그래? 저 녀석을 잡아라! 경고의 뜻으로 저녀석을 다리에 매달아 놓자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "93c3e3ab-86b7-4e3e-8300-5931f146ea85"
msgid ""
"{n}The impostor opens and closes his mouth a few times, unable to form "
"actual words. He eventually averts his gaze.{/n} \"Then you and your {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} can go to hell! You're missing a major haul, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. If that's the way you want it, I won't "
"interfere. Let's go, everyone. We're leaving.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사기꾼은 몇 차례 입을 여닫지만 말을 하지는 못합니다. 그는 결국 시선을 피합니다.{/n} \"그럼 너와 네 {g|Stolen "
"Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 지옥에나 떨어지라고 해! 너는 실수하고 있는 거야. 너는 중요한걸 놓치고 있어. 이게 네가 원하는 "
"방식이라면, 난 간섭하지 않겠어. 모두 가자. 우리는 떠난다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : FakeStagLord
msgctxt "b75664a4-89e3-4a76-be79-dfcff01432a4"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to this idiot! Keep your damn freedoms to yourself — we're running "
"a business here! Gang, teach this 'well-wisher' a lesson!\""
msgstr "\"이 멍청이 말을 잘 들어! 네 맘대로 해도 돼지만 우리 일을 방해하지는 마! 애들아! 이 녀석에게 교훈을 가르쳐주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ff1589e4-099d-408d-926b-ec08db42ab63"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim shakes his head.{/n} \"Impersonating a dead man... What a "
"ridiculous mockery of your own mortality. Today you steal the name of a man "
"who has become dust — tomorrow, you join him...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림이 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"죽은 사람을 흉내내다니... 네 죽음을 비웃는 거나 다름 없다. 당장 오늘은 네가 먼지가 "
"되버린자의 이름을 훔칠 수 있을 지는 몰라도, 내일이 되면 그 이름의 주인과 같은 꼴이 될 터인데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2929017c-fa32-4300-9380-eb0089e02bf9"
msgid ""
"\"Well, this is just great! We were sent to get rid of the Stag Lord, and "
"you say the one we took out was just an impostor? Then I guess we're lucky "
"to finally meet the real one, aren't we?\""
msgstr "\"대단한데! 우리는 수사슴 군주를 없애기 위해 왔는데 우리가 없앤 녀석이 가짜라고? 그렇다면 진짜를 만나서 정말 다행인데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a8210c88-0817-447e-94cc-453cef0e9662"
msgid ""
"\"I see you're a master at chewing the fat — are you as good at fighting, "
"chubby? I bet if I gave you a push, you'd just roll away!\""
msgstr "\"네가 먹기는 잘한다는 걸 인정할게. 물론 싸움도 잘하겠지? 아마 내가 너를 밀어버리면 너는 굴러갈걸?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d732680b-6a33-49b8-88fa-5b8c8ba31304"
msgid "\"You? A hero? Not a chance. You're more like comic relief!\""
msgstr "\"네가? 영웅이라고? 어림도 없어. 너는 광대에 가까워 보이는걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0068_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6430a906-1c9b-4c3c-8e9f-0f8fe9728fb9"
msgid ""
"\"You got that right! It shows — a real {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! "
"Everyone pees their pants and calls for their mommies as you approach!\""
msgstr "\"잘하고 있어! 모두가 네가 오는 걸 보고 바지에 오줌을 지리고 엄마를 찾을 거 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e4eb1db3-5171-43fd-bedb-f245f70f94a1"
msgid ""
"\"Serves him right! I hope killing this asshole will be at least half as fun "
"as killing the real Stag Lord was...\""
msgstr "\"당해도 싸다! 이 녀석을 죽이는 건 진짜 수사슴 군주를 죽이는 것보다 적어도 절반은 재미있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "9ba30214-be60-461d-b1c9-ed568a230435"
msgid ""
"{n}The impostor hastily removes his helmet and throws it to the ground.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사기꾼은 서둘러 투구를 벗어서 땅에 던집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "09371aa6-c6d9-4d22-b525-6d6571481b64"
msgid "{n}The fat man jumps up and begins running.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뚱뚱한 남자가 뛰어올라 투구와 무기를 떨어뜨리고 도망가기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "14b386e5-24c5-4005-859d-8e9750d7fd81"
msgid "\"Don't expect any mercy!\""
msgstr "\"자비를 기대하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "65c472d9-eb99-49d5-a6b4-0ddceb9610a6"
msgid "\"More pointless bloodshed...\""
msgstr "\"무의미한 피를 흘리다니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0726aada-8bac-4638-b83c-896b3a13d0d9"
msgid ""
"\"What? You not only allow him to rob people, but you want to hire him?\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구요? 그를 도둑질하게 허락하는 것도 모자라 그를 고용하고 싶다는 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "588329ea-b9cd-426c-8ac6-8690af24f84a"
msgid ""
"\"If I knew what I would have to do after joining you...\" {n}Tristian "
"shakes his head.{/n}"
msgstr "\"당신과 합류한 후에 이런일을 겪을 줄 미리 알았다면...\" {n}트리스티안이 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "36ef2534-d4f3-4000-bac5-66d80e03e852"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian tries and fails to keep a serious expression on his face.{/n} \"I"
" suspect {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} would not approve of such methods of "
"rehabilitation, but their efficacy exceeds all expectations.\" {n}The cleric "
"bites his lip and chuckles softly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 심각한 표정을 지으려다 실패합니다.{/n} \"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}는 그런 방식으로 저들을 갱생 "
"시키는건 찬성하지 않겠지만, 효과는 정말 좋은것 같습니다.\" {n}사제는 입술을 물고 피식 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e3e765c5-d2a2-4fad-a67e-cf47cd8ac15c"
msgid ""
"\"You bargain for your share like some huckster! It disgusts me even to hear "
"it, not to mention participate in it, even indirectly!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 마치 상인처럼 자기몫을 흥정하는군요! 듣는 것만으로도 역겹고, 간접적으로라도 끼어들기 싫습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f14f74c1-56ae-4257-a571-3fad9aa3ee99"
msgid ""
"\"Not the most elegant expression of the will of law, but scum like this "
"probably would not understand otherwise.\""
msgstr "\"법에 대한 의지를 가장 우아하게 표현한 것은 아니지만, 이런 쓰레기는 좋게 말해서는 이해하지 못하겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f17d3383-d4b2-4ccc-8c3e-8725fcdf3f1d"
msgid ""
"\"What, for example? Bring order to the lands you're responsible for? Quiet "
"your whimpers, boy-priest!\""
msgstr "\"예를 들면? 네가 책임지는 땅에 질서를 가져오는 것? 그만 징징거려! 애송이 사제 녀석!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "bfc6cfc6-6b17-4312-b42a-74fddc64496e"
msgid ""
"\"That's a shame. A ruler should be tough and rely on {mf|his|her} loyal "
"servants, not useless lowlifes that can only hurt your good name.\""
msgstr "\"안타까운 일이군. 통치자는 이름을 먹칠하는 멍청이들에 의지할 게 아니라 자신의 부하에게 의지해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/FakeStagLord/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "00b2da3d-0199-4a94-9d53-3c592e8fcb25"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah trills with laughter.{/n} \"A hero of the people, fighting "
"against bureaucracy! I bet in ten years that's exactly how bards will tell "
"this story. And there will be many, many songs about the hero's tragic "
"death... Especially if the heartless bureaucrats hang him from the pillar of "
"a bridge today!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라가 웃습니다.{/n} \"사람들의 영웅은 관료주의에 맞서 싸워! 10년 후에는 음유시인이 이 이야기를 할걸. 그리고 영웅의 "
"비극적인 죽음에 대해서는 더 많은 노래가 나오겠지... 특히 인정 없는 관료주의자가 그를 다리 기둥에 목매단다면 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "be8f5ee0-22e6-49c2-a07b-f06e6f3607c2"
msgid "\"Who is this 'prince' you keep talking about?\""
msgstr "\"네가 계속 말하는 '왕자'라는게 대체 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b333557c-e17b-470a-9fc0-bb08e97990c1"
msgid "\"Those beads on your head — you took them from a woman on this road!\""
msgstr "\"네 머리에 있는 그 구슬들말이야, 길에 있던 여자에게서 뺏어간 것이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "c7236f55-5c68-4b9a-bb39-428285582858"
msgid "\"Are you alone here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 혼자있는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "06b1f3d0-87f7-4074-af9c-0e0047e3034f"
msgid "\"I need to go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "32c3cc5a-36dd-4375-922a-cb3a41e8462b"
msgid ""
"\"I am the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} of these lands! Do you know what I "
"do with impostors like yourself?!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 땅의 {mf|영주|영주|왕이|여왕이}다! 너 같은 사기꾼은 어떻게 처리하는 줄 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "48a72cb4-ecc1-4442-9a41-d299c40d4f1a"
msgid "Threatened \"prince\" of Kamelands."
msgstr "케임랜드의 '왕자'를 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6347587f-fd8f-4d51-a733-7960dbc2a06c"
msgid "\"Give me the beads now or taste my fist.\""
msgstr "\"지금 구슬을 주지 않으면 내 주먹 맛을 보게 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "59dd824b-b5fe-424d-8957-6a78d0d81975"
msgid ""
"\"The prince of Kamelands is content with simple beads? I heard that the "
"neighboring prince was gifted with a real crown! With rubies and emeralds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"케임랜드의 왕자가 단순한 구슬에 만족하고 있어? 이웃 왕자는 진짜 왕관을 가지고 있다고 들었어! 루비와 에메랄드로 장식되었다는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "03c45368-d93e-44ca-824e-22a8301bc1cb"
msgid "\"Fine, I'll leave you alone with your 'tribute'.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 너의 물건을 뺏지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "82223f49-a6c3-483c-894e-816440624c45"
msgid "Brought gifts to \"prince\" of Kamelands."
msgstr "Kamelands의 왕자에게 선물을 가져왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "65602767-1ab8-4044-bc44-7c1660899583"
msgid "\"Want to trade? Here, I have food.\""
msgstr "\"거래하고 싶어? 나는 음식이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "cd10f53c-d4da-4f02-9d77-821fcf2c5553"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Vile little thief! You've made a mistake coming to these lands!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이 쪼그만 도둑 새끼! 이 땅에 온 게 네 실수다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "267fa735-4d79-4505-9f96-ae2f96c078c6"
msgid ""
"\"Are you aware, Prince, that this necklace belongs Zogmugot herself — one "
"of the goblin hero-gods? See how she stares at you from each bead, as though "
"about to come out and strangle you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐 왕자님, 이 목걸이는 고블린의 영웅 신 중 하나인 조그무갓의 목걸이라는 것을 알고 있나? 조그무갓 그녀는, 네가 목걸이를 가지고 "
"있는 모습을 보면 네 목을 조를 껄!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f77df45e-36e9-484a-a6f1-4870de4eb147"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin in front of you looks... unusual. His ugly face is covered "
"with red clay — which looks to be warpaint. A string of beads is hanging "
"down from his ears, and he's wearing a dirty reed skirt.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 고블린은... 특이해보입니다. 그의 못생긴 얼굴은 붉은 점토로 칠해져서 마치 위장을 한 것 같습니다. 귀에는 구슬이 줄줄 "
"걸려져 있고, 더러운 갈대 치마를 입고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "83defee3-74f1-4227-9463-75d8fb25fb85"
msgid ""
"\"Stop! I be prince of Kameland! You be bringing presents?! I take "
"everything — shiny bits, sparkly bits, grub!\""
msgstr "\"멈춰라! 나는 케임랜드의 왕자다! 너 선물 가져왔어?! 나는 모든 걸 가져갈 거야. 반짝이는 물건, 빛나는 물건 모두!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "c391a17b-1740-4d66-9e5b-c7a180ffffee"
msgid ""
"\"I be prince! Ruler of Kameland! All you see here — it mine. That tree — "
"mine. And rock? The rock mine. And river... And...\"{n} The goblin keeps "
"listing everything he sees and pointing his finger at it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내가 왕자다! 케임랜드의 통치자야! 네가 여기서 본 모든 것은 내거야. 저 나무도 내 거야. 저 바위도 내 거야. 저 강도... "
"그리고...\" {n}고블린은 그가 보는 모든 것을 나열하며 손가락으로 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "7765791e-3025-4717-9a40-29db0d60eff2"
msgid ""
"\"Tribute to prince of Kameland! Mine!\" {n}The goblin clutches the beads "
"and steps back, baring his teeth.{/n}"
msgstr "\"케임랜드의 왕자의 물건이다! 내 거야!\" {n}고블린은 구슬을 움켜쥐고 뒤로 물러나서는 이빨을 드러냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "1054ef75-12cc-4501-a2f2-dc56af868ed4"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Baron-shmaron|Baroness-shmaroness|King-shming|Queen-shmeen}! What kind "
"of dumb word be that?\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 무슨 말이 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "5784f8bc-81fb-48dc-8851-dc9031893eef"
msgid "\"Prince be great and mighty! Prince no be scarefraid of anybody!\""
msgstr "\"왕자는 위대하고 강하다! 왕자는 누구도 겁나지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "91865997-c837-4fb8-9a1c-10410770ac45"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin leaps up angrly.{/n} \"Neighbor? What neighbor?! I prince! I "
"main goblin!\" {n}He rips the beads off his head and throws them at your "
"feet.{/n} \"Keep your trash! I go sort things out! Smash neighbor, take his "
"crown, be main goblin all around!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린이 화가 나 펄쩍 뜁니다.{/n} \"이웃? 무슨 이웃이야! 나는 왕자야! 나는 고블린을 통치한다!\" {n}그는 구슬을 "
"머리에서 뜯어 당신 발 앞에 던졌습니다.{/n} \"이 쓰레기 가져가! 나는 서열 정리한다! 이웃 때려서 왕관 빼앗아서 모든 고블린 "
"지배한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "22697b69-38f3-4414-8bda-2dd3fed4af28"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin glares at you suspiciously. Either he knows you're lying — or "
"equally possible, he doesn't know what an emerald is.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 당신을 의심스럽게 봅니다. 당신이 거짓말하고 있다는 것을 알고 있거나... 아니면 그는 에메랄드가 무엇인지 모르나 "
"봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "cbed0298-4abd-4817-8766-a3750cd0bf11"
msgid ""
"\"AAAAA! Prince wants to live! Prince be too pretty to die!\" {n}The goblin "
"rips the beads off his head and throws them at you. With an angry whine, the "
"goblin runs off, a trail of reed stalks falling from his skirt as he "
"flees.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아아아아! 왕자 살고 싶다! 왕자가 죽기에는 너무 귀엽다!\" {n}고블린은 구슬을 머리에서 떼내어 당신에게 던졌습니다. 화가 난 "
"고블린은 울면서 달려갔고, 그의 치마에서 떨어지는 갈대만이 남아있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "85a57138-7b32-4ee0-9f52-23bb0d5845d3"
msgid ""
"\"Dumb human! You be no fright-scary! Go fast and bring prince grub to gulp, "
"before I beat you up!\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 인간! 너는 무섭지 않다! 어서 가서 왕자가 시킨대로 하지 않으면 때려줄 테다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "61b76f49-a7e3-4f2e-900e-e5ad03a2f697"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin is shuffling his feet.{/n} \"There be goblins in gorge, "
"looking for greatbeast. Also be goblins in village... But not all know and "
"listen to prince yet! First time when I came, they hit me, and it hurt!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린이 발을 동동 구릅니다.{/n} \"협곡에 거대한 짐승을 찾는 고블린들 있다. 그리고 마을에도 고블린 있다... 하지만 아직 "
"다들 날 모르고 왕자 말 아무도 듣지 않는다! 내가 여기 왔을 때 그들이 나를 때렸다. 아팠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "a1711245-261a-4653-a0dc-9c136d8513a4"
msgid "\"So, you bring grub yet?\""
msgstr "\"너 음식 가져왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "bc65a519-cc6f-407c-9df4-f3a42c979946"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin eyes the food in your hand hungrily. Finally, he can help "
"himself no more — he tears the beads off his head, then snatches up the food "
"and runs off, stuffing the treat into his mouth as he does.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 당신 손에 들린 음식을 탐욕스럽게 바라봅니다. 마침내 그는 자신을 통제하지 못합니다. 그는 머리에 있는 구슬을 뜯어버리고는 "
"음식을 낚아채, 멀리 도망가 음식을 입에 꾸역꾸역 넣습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7252d3a7-5af2-4911-8df5-c12ccd4b1f99"
msgid ""
"\"The tree, it mine, the rock mine too, I rule this place, I'm telling you..."
"\" {n}Linzi hums, improvising a simple tune.{/n} \"This might make a nice "
"song! 'The Ballad of the Goblin Prince,' what do you think?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나무. 내 거다. 바위 내 거다. 나는 여기 지배한다. 정말이다...\" {n}린지는 간단한 곡을 즉석에서 연주합니다.{/n} \"좋은"
" 노래를 만들 수 있겠는데! '고블린 왕자의 발라드', 어떻게 생각해요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6d970fe4-8867-489c-a55a-807c4c7115ac"
msgid ""
"\"Would you look at that — we've got another sovereign here! There must be "
"something in the air making rulers multiply like rabbits. Soon you won't be "
"able to plant an apple tree without a king apple growing from it, declaring "
"independence, and demanding taxes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저기에 또 지배자가 있어! 어디선가 토끼처럼 지배자가 마구 만들어지는 건가? 얼마 안 가서 사과를 심을 때에도 독립을 선포하고 세금을 "
"내야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "eadf5ad0-7ebe-4f39-a19e-675d40a00157"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok's ear twitches.{/n} \"Prince? What that? Another stupid noise "
"stupid longshanks make up and vomit on goblins?\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹의 귀가 꿈틀댑니다.{/n} \"왕자? 그게 뭐야? 꺽다리가 고블린과 짝짓기하는 소리처럼 들린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinPrince/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "712e4460-2426-4173-af7e-f620e10560e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah bends in a mocking curtsy.{/n} \"Hello, your green highness!\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 배꼽을 잡고 웃습니다.{/n} \"안녕! 녹색 왕자님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE1
msgctxt "7a4c3e33-495e-46ed-8433-963a065fd6d6"
msgid "\"We found greatbeast! Chief be very pleased!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 거대한 짐승을 발견했다! 대장이 기뻐할꺼다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE2
msgctxt "9fc143b8-9726-4995-b76c-5d2330635133"
msgid "\"Chief will reward us! Give us lots of grub!\""
msgstr "\"대장이 우리에게 상을 줄 거야! 우리에게 많은 음식 줄 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE3
msgctxt "5ca52fee-6848-460c-b684-bb85051d08fe"
msgid "\"Let's go to the village, lead chief to greatbeast!\""
msgstr "\"마을에 가자. 대장을 이 거대한 짐승 있는데로 데려오자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE2
msgctxt "2da4199b-54ad-4091-a820-72348b0d86ad"
msgid ""
"\"Dumb rothead! Village be fa-a-a-r. From river be going towards sunrise, "
"then be turning by moss-stone, then be stomp-stomping through hills long "
"time! Going there and back again — pfft! -take too much time! Better we "
"bring greatbeast to chief!\""
msgstr ""
"\"멍청한 녀석! 마을은 멀어. 강에서 해가 뜨는 방향으로 가서 이끼가 낀 바위에서 방향을 틀어서 굴곡진 협곡으로 오랫동안 가야한다고! "
"거기에 갔다오는 건 너무 시간이 많이 걸려! 이 거대한 짐승을 대장에게 데려다 주는게 더 나아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE1
msgctxt "f71e9c67-2d41-4e39-8217-4d753e0a3c3b"
msgid "\"Yes, yes! Let it go there itself!\""
msgstr "\"그래그래! 스스로 그 곳으로 가도록 내버려두자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE2
msgctxt "b298b17a-aeea-4f88-b2dc-109bc00749ba"
msgid "\"Hey! Greatbeast! Come on, get up, stomp-stomp! Now!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 이리 와. 쿵쿵아! 어서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE1
msgctxt "6a4d1532-9029-4faf-ba3c-8fcb7877c686"
msgid "\"Hnh. What if greatbeast cannot hear us? Is it dead?\""
msgstr "\"흠. 거대한 짐승이 우리 말을 듣지 않으면 어떻게 하지? 죽었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "f2c95402-a3fe-44d6-a60e-75106e31bf7f"
msgid ""
"{n}The owlbear is still slumbering. The goblins fidget and glance at each "
"other.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아울베어는 여전히 잠들어 있습니다. 고블린은 웅성거리며 서로를 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE2
msgctxt "7c9d89af-f3d3-4c6c-ac3d-b877db675951"
msgid "\"Um…\""
msgstr "\"음...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE3
msgctxt "e4e41178-2deb-4323-9c3e-6efd94011760"
msgid "\"He not dead, he lazybones, don't want to go! Look, I show you.\""
msgstr "\"죽지 않았어. 그냥 게으른 녀석이야. 가려고 하지 않는거라구. 봐봐, 내가 보여주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE1
msgctxt "5539d215-cde2-41e6-8162-f9708eae53dc"
msgid ""
"\"Hey!\" {n}The goblin grabs a stick and pokes owlbear's beak with it.{/n} "
"\"You get up, lazybones! No sleep, come see chief!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐!\" {n}고블린은 막대기를 잡고 아울베어의 부리를 찌릅니다.{/n} \"일어나! 게으른 녀석아! 그만 자고 대장을 보러 가자!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE1
msgctxt "c9416d28-3b8f-40ae-a88d-290e52a035e2"
msgid "\"Look! Greatbeast be awake! Be standing up! Be mighty greatbeast!\""
msgstr "\"봐! 짐승이 일어났다! 일어선다! 강력한 짐승이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE1
msgctxt "7627e496-2090-4488-b4cc-f176649bbdf8"
msgid ""
"\"See it not dead, it awake now. Hey! No roaring! Put claws away, put-! HEY! "
"US NO EAT! NO EAT! AAAAAA! MY LEGS!\""
msgstr ""
"\"봤냐? 죽지 않았고 일어났다. 이봐! 소리지르지 마! 발톱은 다시 넣어라. 이봐! 우리는 먹는 게 아니야! 먹지 마! 아아! 내 다리!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GoblinsAndOwlbear/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinTE1
msgctxt "f737832b-81e3-4b7a-aa3c-34efeec9047f"
msgid ""
"\"Now greatbeast be listening to me! Behind us stomp-stomp! No noise! No "
"roaring! You hear, lazybones? No roaring!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 짐승은 내 말 듣는다! 우리에게는 쿵쿵이 있다! 조용히 해라! 으르렁 거리지마! 알겠어, 게으른 녀석아? 으르렁 거리지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90577_Text
msgctxt "0317acf9-56c4-4619-ac92-d4b993d21245"
msgid "\"I'd like to browse your wares.\""
msgstr "\"어떤걸 파는지 볼까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90578_Text
msgctxt "b64e9772-8785-4c18-afb4-9466d76de0dd"
msgid "\"Your prices are three times higher than those of other merchants!\""
msgstr "\"가격이 다른 상인들보다 3배나 비싼걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90579_Text
msgctxt "967aca91-54ae-4351-8d65-b2380a3829db"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90580_Text
msgctxt "58dbc113-1dd6-433c-b7bc-95df205336a3"
msgid ""
"\"What is all the commotion at the bridge? Where have all those people come "
"from?\""
msgstr "\"다리에서 무슨 소란이지? 이 사람들은 다들 어디서 온건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90585_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "79b498b2-3282-4a9e-b16e-413464879241"
msgid "Stood for poor peasants during argument with greedy merchant."
msgstr "탐욕스러운 상인과 논쟁하는 가난한 농민들 편을 들어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90585_Text
msgctxt "203a7c83-9999-40b8-bbbb-36b3f60b0577"
msgid ""
"\"If I ever catch you asking an arm and a leg for rotten turnips again — "
"I'll hang you on this bridge as a lesson to others.\""
msgstr "\"이딴 썩은 음식을 그렇게 터무니 없이 비싸게 판다면 너를 본보기로 다리 위에 매달아버리겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90587_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a00bab8f-5b82-4752-83ad-30995c079d16"
msgid "Stood for own lawful interests during argument with greedy merchant."
msgstr "탐욕스러운 상인에게 동의하지만 많은 세금을 내라고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90587_Text
msgctxt "a0739b4b-05c1-4fa4-b5d7-548e8ac539b3"
msgid ""
"\"A great idea. And now you shall pay the trade tax — two thirds of all "
"you've made from trade on MY lands. And you'd better not fleece my subjects "
"behind my back — is that clear?\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋은 생각이다. 그러면 너는 거래세를 내야 해. 내 땅에서 거래하는 금액의 삼분의 이를 지불해라. 그리고 나 몰래 내 백성들의 피를 "
"빨아먹지 않는 것이 좋을 거야. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90598_Text
msgctxt "216f2605-6f2a-4a4b-a741-ce3453140e00"
msgid ""
"[Point at the angry peasants nearby] \"Looks like you're making their blood "
"boil...\""
msgstr "[화난 농민을 가리킵니다] \"아무래도 네가 저 사람들을 화나게 하고 있는것 같은데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90600_Text
msgctxt "22300584-aa0d-40b5-89ba-e29848005510"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've had enough!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이제 충분하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90605_Text
msgctxt "8223723a-1020-4a91-ab9b-c546b7d9f1ae"
msgid "\"A bad day for trade, huh?\""
msgstr "\"장사가 영 안되나봐?.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90612_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "94307ed6-57fd-435f-90fd-5a1cf25c3ae8"
msgid "Shamed greedy merchant."
msgstr "욕심 많은 상인을 나무랍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90612_Text
msgctxt "1d9fdeb7-b439-4f22-834a-37ff569ad3bd"
msgid ""
"\"Have you no shame! These people are starving — and all you care about is "
"lining your pockets?!\""
msgstr "\"수치심도 없나! 이 사람들은 굶고 있어. 그런데 너는 네 주머니만 채울 생각을 해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90616_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e0efe598-3098-4b13-8856-633919077566"
msgid "Demanded tax from greedy merchant."
msgstr "탐욕스러운 상인에게 세금을 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90616_Text
msgctxt "dcc197a6-4208-4ee8-8dd4-15fbf140ff59"
msgid "\"Well-played. Just don't forget to pay your taxes.\""
msgstr "\"잘 했어. 세금을 내는 것만 잊지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90619_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7c1c4c46-35d3-4918-b1db-28e844bd7b2c"
msgid "Decided to let the trader to mind his own business."
msgstr "상인이 자신의 사업을 계속 하도록 내버려두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90619_Text
msgctxt "802bda72-a59d-4aea-bfec-de2c43da7935"
msgid "\"Your goods are your business.\""
msgstr "\"네가 파는 물건이니 상관 안해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Answer_90647_Text
msgctxt "f7cd3bb0-dff5-44a5-a55b-c5b4e4ca043e"
msgid ""
"\"You seem to be sitting pretty here. Asmodeus likes enterprising people "
"like you!\""
msgstr "\"여기에 꽤 오래 앉아있군. 아스모데우스는 너 같은 진취적인 사람들을 좋아한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90573_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "dfa53598-be00-4bd7-8dab-4285afcf5383"
msgid ""
"{n}The merchant, a stout man in a shabby jacket, greasy pants, and a "
"tattered beret, finally notices you.{/n} \"Ah! Welcome to the traveling shop "
"of Tigni Jusmert! The finest goods this side of the canyon, {mf|sir|my lady}!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}초라한 재킷에 기름진 바지를 입고 머리에는 베레모를 쓴 덩치 좋은 상인은 마침내 당신을 알아차립니다.{/n} \"아! 티그니 "
"주스머트의 여행 상점에 온 것을 환영합니다! 이쪽 협곡에서 가장 좋은 물품들입니다, 손님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90575_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "15236fdd-0da8-44ad-ad49-ea4932fcea47"
msgid "\"Welcome back, {mf|sir|madam}! How can I help you today?\""
msgstr "\"다시 온 것을 환영합니다, 손님! 오늘은 어떻게 도와 드릴까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90581_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "0de0ec5d-354e-442f-9da1-f128ae4e8906"
msgid ""
"\"The demand is high, {mf|sir|madam}!\" {n}The trader winks and jingles his "
"fat purse.{/n} \"No one around offers the produce I do! In fact, you won't "
"find anyone else selling in these parts, and you know people — they just "
"love to eat!\" {n}He laughs, amused by his own joke.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"수요가 매우 높거든요, 손님!\" {n}상인은 윙크를 하며 뚱뚱한 지갑을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"주변 상인 중에 저희가 파는 물품 "
"같은건 구하기 어려울겁니다. 사실, 주변엔 다른 상인이라고는 찾아보기 힘들겁니다. 그리고 저 사람들은...아시잖습니까, 저들은 그저 "
"먹는걸 사랑하는 사람들이지요!\" {n}그는 자신의 농담에 즐겁게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90589_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "0c6c897f-8b3e-4aa7-8a06-a5f96acad0d0"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni shrinks, ducks his head and backs away.{/n} \"F-f-forgive me, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! M-my sincere apologies!\" {n}He catches "
"his breath and speaks carefully, as if each word might be his last.{/n} "
"\"From now on only the lowest of prices for you and your subjects!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티그니는 움츠러들면서 머리를 숙이며 뒤로 물러납니다.{/n} \"요..용..용서해주십시오, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! "
"지..진심으로 사과드립니다!\" {n}그는 숨을 죽이고는 한마디 한마디가 마지막이 될지도 모른다는 듯, 조심스럽게 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"이제부터는{mf|영주님과|영주님과|전하와|전하와} {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 백성들에게 가장 저렴한 가격으로 팔겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90590_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "13048c8c-b858-41e7-9cf9-e91f4a0a06a0"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni shrinks, but, taking a look at his guards, he swallows and answers "
"you boldly.{/n} \"W-w-with all due respect, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, "
"I have done nothing wrong, I shall trade as I see fit! Threaten me all you "
"want — I won't budge!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티그니는 움츠러들지만 그의 경비병들을 한번 보더니 침을 꿀꺽 삼키고 대담하게 말합니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}"
", 정말 죄송하지만 저는 아무 잘못도 하지 않았습니다. 제가 정한 금액으로 거래하겠습니다! 원하신다면 얼마든지 협박하셔도 좋습니다. 저는 "
"꼼짝도 안할테니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90591_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "329a982f-108c-4ab1-a05b-d9fa3212c1c0"
msgid ""
"\"WHAT?!\" {n}Tigni gasps.{/n} \"But... but...! Damn it all!\" {n}Realizing "
"his protests are for naught, he pulls out his purse and begins counting "
"coins into your hand.{/n} \"Robbery... pure and simple...\" {n}As the last "
"coin is placed in your hand, he gives a slight, stiff bow.{/n} \"I hear you, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. I'll lower my prices.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라구요?!\" {n}티그니가 숨을 헐떡입니다.{/n} \"하지만...하지만...! 젠장!\" {n}자신의 항의가 쓸모 없다는 것을 "
"알고 그는 지갑을 꺼내 동전을 세더니 당신의 손에 떨어뜨립니다.{/n} \"강도군...완전무결한 강도야...\" {n}마지막 동전을 손에 "
"내려놓자, 그는 약간 뻣뻣하게 인사를 합니다.{/n} \"알겠습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 가격을 낮추겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90592_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "5d49f4bf-f3b4-4754-b967-4795ed4fe447"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni's face turns dark red.{/n} \"You have what you hold! Do you know of "
"the River Freedoms, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}? The one of the most "
"venerated laws of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}! So I'm afraid you're "
"mistaken, but I'm not paying any such tax, that or any other!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티그니의 얼굴이 검붉게 변합니다.{/n} \"'너의 것을 지켜라!' 강의 자유라고 아십니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}? "
"{g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 가장 존경받는 법률 중 하나죠! 뭔가 착각하시는 것 같은데 저는 그런 세금을 내지 "
"않겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90597_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "55b9cb2e-41a9-40d1-865b-f83e1d62b15d"
msgid ""
"\"Haven't you heard? The Stag Lord, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! He's "
"alive! One day he just comes back with his band, takes the bridge, and "
"starts demanding coin for safe passage! So people are piling up at the "
"bridge — after all, how can a peasant scrape up enough coin to pay the toll?!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"소문 못들으셨습니까? 수사슴 군주입니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 그가 살아있어요! 어느 날 패거리와 돌아와 다리를 "
"차지하고 통행세를 받기 시작했습니다! 그래서 사람들이 다리를 못지나가고 있죠. 어쨌든 뭐, 농민들이 통행세를 낼 정도로 돈이 있겠습니까?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90599_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "8664919b-e798-4952-a06f-003746bd13d0"
msgid ""
"\"That rabble?\" {n}Tigni looks over the peasants and sniffs.{/n} \"Those "
"beggars can say whatever they want! They may whine and grumble all they "
"wish, but they'd never dare to come out in arms against my boys.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 시끄러운 무리들 말입니까?\" {n}티그니는 농민들을 훑어보며 냄새를 맡습니다.{/n} \"이 거지들이야 아무 말이나 지껄일 순 "
"있죠! 투걸거리든 징징대든 알 바 아니지만 내 경비들한테 감히 덤비지는 못할 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90601_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "ea84f848-f348-449e-9350-6b6409f43c72"
msgid ""
"\"Some have been here for a while now. Many might've starved to death if it "
"wasn't for my willingness to help those in need! For the right price, of "
"course.\""
msgstr ""
"\"몇 명은 여기에 잠시 머무르고 있죠. 제가 저 사람들을 돕겠다는 의지가 없었다면 아마 많은 사람들이 굶어 죽었을겁니다! 물론 적당한 "
"가격선에서 도와줬죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90602_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "48c95d10-3e23-4327-bc08-a155617b0057"
msgid ""
"{n}The trader, a stout man in a shabby jacket, greasy pants, and a tattered "
"beret, seems bored. He raises an eyebrow as you approach.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}허름한 재킷에 기름진 바지를 입고 머리에는 베레모를 쓴, 이 덩치 좋은 상인은 지루해보입니다. 그는 당신이 다가오자 눈썹을 치켜 "
"올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90603_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "ea85049d-49a3-4f80-a3c6-092da524ce75"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni looks at you, frowning.{/n} \"Your wish, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}?\""
msgstr "{n}티그니가 당신을 찡그리며 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"원하는 게 있습니까, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90604_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "dd2ee9a3-00cd-4f1d-9023-4808bf80dd05"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome to the traveling shop of Tigni Jusmert. The best goods this side "
"of the canyon, {mf|sir|madam}.\" {n}Tigni looks around and sighs.{/n} \"You "
"won't find lower prices anywhere.\""
msgstr ""
"\"티그니 주스머트의 가게에 온 것을 환영합니다. 협곡 이쪽편에서 가장 좋은 상품을 판매하지요.\" {n}티그니는 주변을 둘러보고 한숨을 "
"쉬었습니다.{/n} \"어디에서도 이런 저렴한 가격을 찾지 못할 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90607_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "f0d5b0d8-d424-47cb-8dd3-1263d681d953"
msgid ""
"\"You don't say.\" {n}Tigni gives a long sigh.{/n} \"It used to be a perfect "
"spot until you brought the Stag Lord to heel. The refugees used to be held "
"up at the bridge, and they had little choice but to trade with me... and "
"now? An occasional traveler buys a piece of rye flatbread — and that's on a "
"good day!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 말 마세요.\" {n}티그니는 긴 한숨을 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 수사슴 군주를 순종시키기 "
"전까지는 완벽한 장소였죠. 피난민들은 다리에서 머무르며, 저와 거래를 하는 것 말고는 달리 할게 없었거든요... 하지만 지금은 지나가던 "
"여행자가 가끔 호밀 빵 덩어리나 사고 있어요. 그것도 운좋은 날에나 그렇죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90608_Text
#. Speaker : HungryPeasant1
msgctxt "3fdd7c31-3353-429f-a0d2-f1fa6ab64b26"
msgid ""
"\"You charge a fortune for your food and what do we get? Moldy bread and "
"rotten vegetables!\""
msgstr "\"음식 값으로 이런 거액을 받고 우리가 얻는 게 고작 이건가? 곰팡이 핀 빵과 썩은 야채!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90609_Text
#. Speaker : HungryPeasant2
msgctxt "9b0bbd82-712e-4486-9ab6-309697f0ff55"
msgid "\"Fear {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, Tigni! Your profit is someone's grief!\""
msgstr "\"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}을 두려워 해야 할 거다! 티그니! 네 이익은 누군가의 슬픔이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90610_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "d01296e9-de5b-4f7d-9e8b-ef65afb685cd"
msgid ""
"\"Out of my sight! I am the only vendor for leagues around. You eat what I "
"sell or don't eat at all!\""
msgstr "\"내 눈앞에서 사라져! 나는 이 주변의 유일한 상인이야. 내가 파는 음식을 먹든지 아니면 굶든지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90613_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "cc2a44d3-518b-43f1-8017-bb553fa8d20c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni averts his eyes in silence. Finally, he sighs.{/n} \"Very well. I "
"will lower my prices. You think I'm some cold, heartless beast?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티그니는 말없이 시선을 피합니다. 마침내 그는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"알겠습니다. 가격을 낮추겠어요. 내가 감정도 없는 "
"동물이라고 생각하는겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90615_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "fb2ca60f-c8c3-4c81-9802-a39e292548e9"
msgid ""
"\"You'll drive me to the streets with your moralizing! If they are starving, "
"they can go pick berries, catch frogs! As for me, I stand by my wares, they "
"are worth every copper!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 도덕질 때문에 나는 길바닥에 나앉으라구요? 저 사람들은 굶주리면 열매를 따거나 개구리를 잡을 수도 있잖아요! 나한텐 오로지 내 "
"물건을 파는일이 전부라고! 그만한 값어치가 있는 물건들이라구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90617_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "693eebbb-a523-486f-9f15-48fb2ea68560"
msgid ""
"\"I won't, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! I wouldn't think of "
"causing any trouble. Here's your share... I'm sorry, I meant to say, here's "
"the trade tax, as per the law.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론입니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 문제 일으킬 생각은 전혀 없습니다. 자 여기 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} "
"몫입니다...아,아니 죄송합니다. 그러니까 제말은..자 여기 법에 따른 거래세를 받으시지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90620_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "81cbe07c-0788-46b1-8aca-2806231cda44"
msgid ""
"{n}The trader gives a generous smile. {/n}\"I always felt this "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} was kind to us, the simple traders. Good "
"to see it's true.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}상인은 너그러운 미소를 지었습니다.{/n} \"저는 항상 이 {mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}이 나 같은 평범한 장사꾼에게 "
"친절하다는 것을 느꼈죠. 그게 사실이라 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90623_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "513e4b9f-2aee-45c7-92d8-e786e1f2e61a"
msgid ""
"\"This is inhumane, but he has the right to do so. On the other hand, he "
"stands on your land, and thus, he is in your hands. This is a confusing "
"situation... In this wild realm, you can seldom rely on any established law."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이건 비인간적이지만, 그에게는 그럴 권리가 있습니다. 한편으론, 그는 당신의 땅에 있으니, 결국 당신의 손에 달려 있습니다. 이건 "
"혼란스러운 상황입니다... 이런 야생 지역에서는 어떠한 법에도 의지하기 어렵습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90626_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "61cac4e4-78a2-4fb1-aa68-10aa7c38219e"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you to relent. Is a handful of coins really worth becoming a "
"murderer? Look in the eyes of these poor souls — their lives are in your "
"hands. Have you so much greed in your heart that there is no place left for "
"mercy?\""
msgstr ""
"\"진정해. 고작 금화 한줌이 정말 살인자가 될 만한 가치가 있을까? 이 불쌍한 영혼들의 눈을 봐. 그들의 삶은 너의 손에 달려 있어. "
"네 마음속은 욕심으로 가득차서 자비를 베풀 자리는 남아 있지 않은건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90628_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ed424759-3a71-4c9e-8f3c-746eeae4c33b"
msgid ""
"\"'You have what you hold,' right. Your guards sure are brave against these "
"paupers, but what do you think'll happen when WE draw our weapons? You sure "
"you'll still be holding anything — beyond maybe your own guts as they spill "
"from your ripped belly?\""
msgstr ""
"\"'너의 것을 지켜라'라는 거지? 그래. 너의 경비는 이 불쌍한 녀석들을 마음대로 해도 되겠지만 그럼 우리가 무기를 든다면 어떻게 "
"할래? 네가 아직도 힘이 있다고 생각하는 거야? 네 배는 찢어져서 힘이 나지 않을 텐데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90631_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "fae6b789-3afe-40c2-a846-d86b7d7ad683"
msgid ""
"\"What a scumbag!\" {n}Octavia turns to you resentfully.{/n} \"Do something! "
"You can't let him treat people this way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 쓰레기 자식!\" {n}옥타비아는 당신에게 화난 표정을 보입니다.{/n} \"뭔가 해봐요! 사람들을 저렇게 대우하도록 놔둬선 "
"안돼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90634_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a4ecd9d9-e789-4708-bf5b-9b6974a178df"
msgid ""
"\"That's better! We won't let you rob anyone — remember that!\" {n}Octavia "
"turns to you.{/n} \"Thank you for not letting this hack profit off other "
"people's misery!\""
msgstr ""
"\"훨씬 낫군! 네가 도둑질하지 못하게 해줄테니 기억해두라고!\" {n}옥타비아가 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"이 녀석이 다른 사람을 "
"갈취하지 못하게 해줘서 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90636_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4ebc1062-0582-407f-b326-6203cffe25cf"
msgid ""
"\"Should've done that from the start! It wouldn't be right to wet-nurse scum "
"like this. A real baron{mf||ess} demands respect!\""
msgstr "\"처음부터 그렇게 했어야 했어! 이 쓰레기를 이렇게 두는 건 옳지 않아. 진짜 남작은 존경을 받아야 한다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90642_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "62d9b527-ca8b-48cb-a538-13be402189b1"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie lowers her head.{/n} \"Because of those like him, 'protectors of "
"the offended' spring up — the very same bandits who would create their own "
"law. And yet, dealers who look for legal loopholes are still better than "
"troublemakers who think themselves above the law.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 머리를 내립니다.{/n} \"그와 같은 사람들 때문에 약자들의 보호자가 생겨난 겁니다. 자기들 마음대로 법을 만드는 "
"도적들이 있어서는 안됩니다. 하지만 법의 허점을 찾는 장사꾼이 무법자보다는 낫습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90645_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c6021abd-af99-461e-8131-f1c041f795f7"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie twists her lips, barely hiding her irritation.{/n} \"I see you "
"have mastered threatening your subjects with death for any transgression. A "
"questionable merit.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 화를 숨기며 입술을 지긋이 깨뭅니다.{/n} \"당신의 백성들을 죽음으로 위협하는 능력을 마스터하셨군요. 그게 좋은 "
"능력인지는 의문이 갑니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90646_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "78a9ee7c-71fa-4b67-86cb-159cef00e49a"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie twists her lips and shakes her head.{/n} \"I see you are second "
"to none at robbery and extortion. Certainly a worthy ruler for the {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}."
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 입술을 깨물고는 머리를 절레절레 흔듭니다.{/n} \"당신이 강도와 약탈에 있어 누구보다 뛰어나다는 것은 잘 알고있습니다. "
"분명 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 적절한 통치자일지도 모르겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90648_Text
#. Speaker : GreedyMerchant
msgctxt "e8baa536-6c5f-4381-bc25-72eb4bd1232e"
msgid ""
"\"Uhhh... T-thanks, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Both to you, "
"and to your, uh, much respected god!\""
msgstr "\"고마워! 너희 둘 모두 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90649_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "686df780-306a-4041-a4f9-a9ba572882d0"
msgid ""
"\"I know your relationships with the gods are complicated, but I'm grateful "
"to them for your existence, Valerie. It's a refreshing change to hear words "
"full of reason, rather than pointless noble gestures!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 신과의 관계가 복잡하다는 건 알지만 네가 있어주어서 고마워. 발레리. 의미 없는 우아한 몸짓이 아니라 합리적인 이유가 있다면 "
"바뀌는 것도 나쁘지는 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90650_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8e7f0bfe-3fd7-425d-981b-605015d0fe7d"
msgid ""
"\"A word of advice, if you will, {name} – don't give in to emotion. It may "
"seem now that by punishing this merchant, you will strengthen your subjects' "
"loyalty and thus solidify your position. But what of the long-term "
"consequences? Will the other merchants want to deal with you, if they fear "
"that their lawful actions might be interrupted simply because the "
"{mf|baron|baroness} likes to fall for {mf|his|her} peasants' tearful "
"complaints?\""
msgstr ""
"\"충고 하나 하지. {name}. 감정에 굴복하지 마. 이 상인을 처벌하면 백성들의 충성심을 높여서 네 위치를 굳힐 수 있어. 하지만 "
"길게 보면 어떨까? 합법적인 거래를 백성들이 힘들어한다면 다른 상인들이 너와 거래하고 싶어할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/GreedyMerchant/Cue_90651_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fbfd6e74-daf1-4fa0-8df3-93bb59996012"
msgid "\"There is so much evil and indifference in this world...\""
msgstr "\"세상에는 악이 너무 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Items/Deadman_Diary_Desc_String
msgctxt "bec4a4b5-bbf0-49b3-9545-8af640836e82"
msgid ""
"\"Never before have so many troubles beset our lands. Robbers rule the "
"roads. Peasants flee, leaving everything they own behind. And now this "
"terrible sickness: I saw with my own eyes how people got a fever, and then "
"monsters clawed their way out of them. And our most honorable baron{mf||ess} "
"is sitting on {mf|his|her} hands as {mf|he|she} wants nothing to do with "
"this. If this goes on any longer, {mf|he|she}'ll have to collect tax from "
"monsters and robbers, because there will be nobody else left.\n"
"Since no one is helping us, neither the gods nor the baron{mf||ess}, I've "
"firmly decided to rescue our lands myself. Destroying all the robbers and "
"monsters is beyond me, but at least I can restore justice.\n"
"Yesterday, grandmother Elsa lost her only hen. How did the simple folk "
"deserve all of this? Take Garald, that clueless bully: he's got a full hen "
"house, he always has enough eggs and meat. Is that at all fair? That's why I "
"decided to sneak into Garald's hen house at night and take one of his hens. "
"It won't hurt him. I put the bird in Elsa's hen house, the grandmother will "
"jump of joy in the morning. Garald's hens look nothing like the one Elsa "
"lost, but is that so important? All eggs taste the same. The important thing "
"is that justice has been restored. And our {mf|baron|baroness} can sit in "
"the castle and twirl {mf|his|her} thumbs all {mf|he|she} wants.\n"
"I never liked that grumpy Ralph was so prosperous, especially in times as "
"harsh as these. He must have at least 20 heads of cattle. He's gloating in "
"his neighbors misery, glad that their livestock didn't make it back from the "
"pastures, and sells milk to them for an arm and a leg. So I came at night "
"and took his herd to the old hut. There are meadows nearby, they won't "
"starve, and I'll take their milk to the village and give it to those in "
"need. Who knows where I'm getting it?\n"
"I successfully hid the herd, but I couldn't find it anywhere the next "
"morning. Well, I did find the horns, skins and tails. Bad luck. Well, at "
"least Ralph isn't having such a good time anymore.\n"
"Yesterday, I saw a wonderful stallion on the road, with a rare coat. It was "
"all white, with beautiful spots on its sides and so many shiny badges on its "
"saddle it hurt my eyes! I reckoned, it must be some money bag who stopped to "
"take a leak. I wouldn't have won if I were to fight him, but taking his "
"stallion — sure thing. Untied it, sprung on its back and galloped all the "
"way to the village. I quietly led the stallion into uncle Frey's shed — his "
"old mare might die ploughing the field any day now. Came by to check on him "
"today, and there was nothing but ashes left of his hut, and a lot of horse "
"tracks on the ground around it, as if from a cavalry unit. Odd.\n"
"Greedy Rickman has stuffed his barns full of grain and refuses to share it "
"with the needy. At night, I snuck into one of his barns and pulled out a "
"sack of grain. Decided to take it to aunt Lucy. The sack was heavy, but my "
"sense of justice gave me strength. I hid the sack in her barn. But come next "
"morning, that damned Rickman went all the way from his barn straight to "
"Lucy's barn, as if by smell, and made an awful scene! The scoundrel.\n"
"I am positive that once the peasants find out who's been helping them, "
"they'll write songs about me. But my heart desires even more heroic deeds. I "
"cannot stand watching the people's misery. It is time to give them back "
"their happy lives. Tomorrow I am planning to travel to the hideout of the "
"Stag Lord himself and steal all the treasure he has accrued by robbing poor "
"peasants and refugees from neighboring lands. The truth shall triumph. And "
"after that we'll get to the gold of our baron{mf||ess}. We'll see what "
"{mf|he|she} hides in those coffers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이렇게 문제가 많은 적은 없었다. 강도들이 길을 지배한다. 농민들은 가진 것을 모두 버려두고 도망쳤다. 이제는 끔찍한 병까지 돈다. "
"내 두 눈으로 사람들이 열병에 걸리고 괴물이 사람들을 죽이는 것을 보았다. 우리의 가장 고결하신 남작님께서는 그저 앉아서 아무것도 "
"해결하려고 하지 않는다. 이대로 가다가는 사람들이 남아나지 않아서 남작님께서는 괴물과 강도들로부터 세금을 징수해야 할 것이다.\n"
"신도 남작님도 우리를 돕지 않으니, 나는 직접 이 땅을 위험에서 구하기로 결정했다. 강도와 괴물을 없애는 것은 내 능력 밖이지만 적어도 "
"정의를 되찾을 수는 있다.\n"
"어제, 엘사 할머니의 마지막 남은 닭이 사라졌다. 이 불쌍한 시민들이 왜 어려움을 겪어야 하지? 차라리 제랄드 그 건달놈의 것을 가져갈 "
"것이지. 그놈은 말이 열 마리에, 닭도 많고 고기와 달걀이 많은데. 이것이 공평한가? 그래서 나는 제랄드의 닭장에 밤에 몰래 들어가 닭 "
"한마리를 훔치기로 했다. 그를 다치게 하지는 않을 것이다. 닭을 엘사 할머니 닭장에 넣으면 아침에 할머니는 기뻐서 펄쩍 뛸 것이다. "
"제랄드의 닭은 엘사 할머니가 잃어버린 것과 닮지 않았지만 그게 중요한가? 어차피 달걀은 모두 같다. 중요한 것은 정의가 회복되었다는 "
"것이다. 우리의 남작은 성에 앉아 명령만 하지만 말이다.\n"
"나는 랄프 녀석이 이렇게 힘든 때에 잘난 척하는 것이 싫었다. 그놈의 젖소가 스무마리는 될 것이다. 그런데도 놈은 이웃의 가축이 돌아오지 "
"않을 때에 우유를 터무니 없이 비싸게 팔고 있다. 그래서 나는 저녁에 찾아가 그의 소 떼를 오래된 오두막으로 몰고 갔다. 주위에는 "
"목초지가 있어서 소들은 굶주리지 않고 나는 우유를 마을로 가져가 필요한 사람에게 줄 것이다. 내가 어디에서 얻었는지 누가 알겠어?\n"
"나는 성공적으로 소 떼를 감추었지만 다음 날에 어디서도 찾을 수 없었다. 뿔과 가죽과 꼬리를 찾았을 뿐이다. 운이 없었다. 그래도 랄프는 "
"힘들어 할 것이다.\n"
"어제 나는 털빛이 고운 종마를 만났다. 털빛은 흰색이었고 아름다운 점이 몸에 박혀있었고 안장에는 빛나는 배지로 장식되어 있어 내 마음을 "
"뺏겼다! 나는 그것이 돈을 담는 가방이라고 생각했다. 내가 그와 싸우면 이길 리가 없겠지만 이 말을 훔치는 것은 괜찮을 것이다. 말에 "
"올라타서 마을을 빠져나왔다. 나는 조용히 프레이 삼촌의 마굿간으로 데려갔다. 그의 늙은 암말은 언제 죽을지 모른다. 오늘 그를 보러 "
"갔지만 거기에는 타버린 재만이 남았고 땅에는 기병대가 남긴 것처럼 수많은 말들이 남긴 흔적만 있을 뿐이었다. 이상한 일이다.\n"
"욕심쟁이 릭맨은 자신의 헛간을 곡물로 채워 자신만 가지려고 한다. 저녁에 나는 그의 헛간에 들어가 곡물 자루를 가지고 나왔다. 그것을 "
"루시 이모에게 가져가기로 했다. 자루는 무거웠지만 내 정의감은 내게 힘을 준다. 나는 그녀의 헛간에 자루를 숨겼다. 그러나 다음 아침에 "
"릭맨 녀석이 냄새라도 맡은 듯 헛간에서 루시 이모의 헛간으로 왔다! 지독한 녀석이다.\n"
"나는 한 때 자신들을 도운 사람이 누군지 농민들이 알아서 노래를 써준다면 좋을 거라고 생각했다. 하지만 내 심장은 더욱 정의로운 일을 "
"원한다. 나는 사람들의 불행을 보고 그냥 있을 수 없다. 그들에게 행복한 삶을 돌려 줄 때이다. 내일 나는 수사슴 군주의 은신처로 가서 "
"그가 불쌍한 백성들에게서 뺏은 물건을 모두 훔칠 것이다. 진실은 승리할 것이다. 그 후에 우리는 우리 남작의 금을 노릴 것이다. {mf|그|그녀}가 "
"얼마나 숨겨놓은지 알아볼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Items/Deadman_Diary_Name_String
msgctxt "5655cd6e-950f-49ff-a526-c73a4e506d59"
msgid "Dirty Notebook"
msgstr "더러운 수첩"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Items/Jaggedkey_Desc_String
msgctxt "56caf99e-6924-482a-974e-b3375d08a889"
msgid "This key was definitely often used."
msgstr "이 키는 손 때가 묻어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/Items/Jaggedkey_Name_String
msgctxt "5fe08087-ac0e-49ad-bfe5-2c5f64d8d702"
msgid "Jagged Key"
msgstr "들쭉날쭉한 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e3685f8e-01b4-4e6b-b4c9-deaf97188455"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"넌 어느 나라에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "76404123-bfb1-4ca0-b875-ed7db0c8ddb3"
msgid "\"What happened?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "48410a37-5848-4a79-95ed-706cc1eaca7a"
msgid "\"I'll try to find your missing jewels. Where were you attacked?\""
msgstr "\"너의 잃어버린 보석을 찾아보도록 해볼께. 공격 당한곳은 어디지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "ac01447c-72c1-4066-b3b4-75ec2c56db62"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "46b5e0aa-4746-4da6-9124-8764a12f515d"
msgid "\"Describe this forest monster.\""
msgstr "\"그 숲 괴물에 대해 묘사해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "722bcf91-be84-4a1b-aca2-f986f5094a7b"
msgid "[Show the pearl string taken from the goblin] \"Is this yours?\""
msgstr "[고블린에게서 가져온 진주 목걸이를 보여줍니다] \"이게 자네 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ccff2679-dd6a-47aa-a1c1-9e0377bafcee"
msgid "Returned family heirloom to its rightful owner."
msgstr "가족의 가보를 돌려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "81837e3f-94e4-44ba-9cd6-fe2be5a43c1d"
msgid ""
"\"Here are your pearls. Please be more cautious along the rest of your "
"journey.\""
msgstr "\"여기 받아. 다음에는 조심하라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2abbd4a5-f9b3-4ed7-aea2-f132cf74e5ea"
msgid "Gave refugee woman money to pay for the river crossing."
msgstr "난민 여성에게 통행세로 내라며 돈을 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "5560ca82-ecbc-45c5-a90b-fafb36e16cc0"
msgid ""
"\"Here, take this money for the toll. You should keep those Eleder pearls in "
"your family.\""
msgstr "\"자 여기, 통행세는 이 돈으로 내. 가보인 에레데르 진주는 잘 보관하도록 하고..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "7330d51f-3f82-4991-97b9-584bbb234566"
msgid ""
"\"I'll return your treasure on the condition that you turn back. I'm sure "
"your brother would take you in, and there's safety in the city. These are "
"trying times, but I'm doing all I can to stop the disease and protect the "
"people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 돌아간다는 조건으로 이 가보를 주겠어. 너의 오빠가 데려가 줄 거고 도시는 안전해. 힘든 시기지만 나는 질병을 막고 사람들을 "
"보호하기 위해 최선을 다하고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fa67dc22-29e9-48f9-80bb-050a03a80673"
msgid "Pocketed family heirloom of a peasant."
msgstr "농민의 가보를 자신이 챙겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "71fe9310-7292-45ab-9482-6d1acdf06d7b"
msgid "\"I figure that, since I found the pearls, they're mine now.\""
msgstr "\"내가 이 진주를 발견했으니 이제는 내 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "e61f19ff-a990-4ccb-af69-95f2c6ff1c7b"
msgid "\"Wait, I have something else I want to ask you.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 다른 걸 물어보고 싶은게 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "b974234d-5c5d-4ad4-a074-1aa360fbae6c"
msgid "\"You brought a priceless family heirloom along on a visit to Galt?\""
msgstr "\"갈트에 가는데 귀중한 가보를 가져가려 했다는 말이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "7eb6ceb6-dc26-4e92-9d10-734fb32796ee"
msgid "\"Are you traveling alone?\""
msgstr "\"혼자 여행하고 있는건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "4239421c-256f-4888-a83d-5d29ebeb9e2e"
msgid "\"I have something else I want to ask you.\""
msgstr "\"다른걸 묻고 싶은게 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "86567983-8640-47d4-832d-cba1a37006e1"
msgid "\"About your pearls...\""
msgstr "\"진주에 대해서 말인데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "44d4aef6-adbd-437b-9bad-ef75881707f1"
msgid "Killed peasant after pocketing her family heirloom."
msgstr "농민을 죽이고 가보를 당신이 챙겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "d1c1ba81-1392-40ab-b972-411bd212b681"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You thought you could run? Your corpse will rot in this very soil!"
"\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이 곳에서 도망칠 수 있다고 생각한건가? 네 시체라도 이 땅에서 썩게 해주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "3f413cff-53f6-42c4-aa56-78ededf692d1"
msgid "\"It seems I can't change your mind... Here, take your pearls.\""
msgstr "\"너의 마음을 바꿀 수 없는 것 같군. 자. 진주를 가져가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "c5683bae-90ba-43fb-8e3b-0560c383505e"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "d52170ea-2b77-403b-bdfb-42244155273d"
msgid "\"Good luck!\""
msgstr "\"행운을 빈다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "68ea256c-b4ff-4520-a300-359907d9850c"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you is a disheveled woman, wearing a cheap dress and a cloak "
"that's gray with dust. She covers her face as she sobs uncontrollably.{/n} "
"\"A disaster... This is such a disaster!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에는 싸구려 드레스와 먼지 묻은 회색 망토를 입은 한 헝클어진 여자가 서있습니다. 그녀는 얼굴을 가리고 걷잡을 수 없이 "
"흐느껴 울고 있습니다.{/n} \"재앙이야... 이건 정말 재앙이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "a968c58d-e628-455c-9709-52e6049313e0"
msgid "{n}The woman sobs, drying her eyes with the edge of her cloak.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}여자는 망토 자락으로 눈물을 닦으며 흐느낍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "36a2aeb8-dd20-45e0-837e-fd5ee0de1444"
msgid ""
"\"From far off.\" {n}The woman sighs.{/n} \"I promised my cousin I'd visit "
"her in {g|Galt}Galt{/g}, but now this...\""
msgstr ""
"\"먼 곳에서요.\" {n}여자는 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"저는 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에 있는 사촌에게 찾아가겠다고 약속했었죠. "
"하지만 이젠... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f1e9dbdd-3297-4ff9-bb2b-ace79a4fe988"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman raises her face, tears still streaming. Her eyes widen as she "
"recognizes you, and she shudders.{/n} \"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}! It "
"must be Providence that sent you to me! Only you can help me.\" {n}She wipes "
"her cheeks and stifles another sob.{/n} \"I was robbed by a forest monster! "
"It took my most valuable possession — my great-grandmother's pearl string!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 여전히 눈물을 흘리며 고개를 듭니다. 그녀가 당신을 알아보고는, 눈이 커지며 몸을 떨기 시작합니다.{/n} \""
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! 당신과 만난 건 신의 섭리입니다! 당신만이 저를 도울 수 있어요!\" {n}그녀는 뺨을 닦고 다시 "
"훌쩍입니다.{/n} \"저는 숲의 괴물에게 강도를 당했습니다! 그 괴물이 저의 가장 귀중한 가보인 증조 할머니의 진주 목걸이를 가져갔어요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "23c1e505-71f9-496b-9e61-fd9dc9f3757a"
msgid ""
"\"I was hoping to pay the bandits at the bridge with them. They're a family "
"heirloom — a real treasure! My great-grandfather brought the pearls all the "
"way from Eleder! I thought that would be enough to get me to {g|Galt}Galt{/g}"
", but then I was ambushed by that vile beast... I was so frightened, I "
"dropped all my belongings and ran. When I came to my senses, it was too "
"late. What am I going to do? I'm so scared of going back!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 다리에서 도적들에게 통행세를 지불하려고 했어요. 그건 저희 가문의 가보라서 정말 귀중한 보물이에요! 제 고조 할아버지가 엘더에서 "
"가져온 진주에요! 저는 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}로 무사히 갈 수 있을 거라 생각했지만 사악한 짐승에게 습격을 당했어요... 저는 "
"무서워서 제 소지품을 버리고 도망쳤습니다. 정신을 차렸을 때는 너무 늦어버리고 말았죠. 이제 어떻게 하죠? 되돌아가기엔 너무 무서워요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "751e47c7-b212-4b51-ab79-aa865611b8aa"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman frowns.{/n} \"It had greenish skin... Short, with a wide face "
"and red eyes... It jumped out of nowhere, flashing a dagger at me and "
"yelling in pidgin. It said I should give it my money, or else...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자가 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그 괴물은 녹색 피부를 가졌어요... 짧고 넙적한 얼굴에 눈은 빨갛고... 갑자기 어디선가 튀어나와 "
"저에게 단도를 들이밀면서 인간 언어로 소리를 질렀어요. 돈을 내놓으라고..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "ba118f5d-4450-4e02-aea2-fd11703cbd03"
msgid ""
"{n}The creature's description leaves little doubt — it's a goblin. Many of "
"the little pests have recently taken to lurking about the "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그 생물의 묘사는 의심의 여지 없이 고블린입니다. 최근 많은 고블린들이 당신의 영지에 숨어들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "6a2c932f-1aa2-4aa0-8e08-ae83c5f0a392"
msgid ""
"{n}You can't fathom what kind of creature it might be, but the fact that "
"it's a small beast is welcome news. A little pest like that shouldn't be too "
"dangerous.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}어떤 종류의 생물인지 짐작이 가지 않지만, 작은 짐승이라는 사실은 환영할 만한 소식입니다. 그런 작은 괴물은 위험하지 않을 "
"것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "b45a0859-15c4-4256-9e13-3db67a38d971"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, thank you so much! The beast ambushed me by the large stone along the "
"road. Follow it northeast — it's not far. But please be careful, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, I beg you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 정말 감사합니다! 그 괴물은 길을 따라 있는 큰 바위 옆에서 저를 공격했어요. 북동쪽을 따라 조금만 가시면 됩니다. 여기서 멀지 "
"않아요. 하지만 부디 조심하세요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "a7dc26b0-6666-43a3-b9ba-72c974738b59"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman presses her hands to her chest.{/n} \"{g|Erastil}Erastil's{/g} "
"mercy! You found my pearls!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 가슴에 손을 올립니다.{/n} \"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 축복했습니다! 당신이 제 진주를 찾아주셨습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "6cdf829d-f33f-41a6-94d5-c12ab2e10968"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman straightens herself and looks directly at you.{/n} \""
"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}, will you return them to me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 몸을 똑바로 세우며 당신을 똑바로 봅니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} 제 가보를 찾아주시겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "0bc39f1b-a7d5-44d8-84c0-04fa271711f4"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman takes the pearls delicately, looking at them intently as she "
"smiles gently.{/n} \"The bandits are gone from the bridge now, so there's no "
"need to pay the toll. Perhaps, with luck, I may yet be able to preserve my "
"family's memory.\" {n}She shifts her gaze to you.{/n} \"Thank you, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! May {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} forever grant you "
"strength and health!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 진주를 섬세하게 받고는 부드럽게 미소 지으며 살펴봅니다.{/n} \"도적은 이제 다리에서 사라졌으니 통행료를 지불할 필요가 "
"없어요. 운이 좋으면 우리 가족의 기억을 간직할 수 있을 꺼에에요\" {n}그녀는 당신에게 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"감사합니다 "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}! {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 당신께 영원히 힘과 건강을 주기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "984f06e7-84a4-4a87-a9a9-5ed8b0ed8675"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman is completely speechless for a moment.{/n} \"You... you're a "
"saint! May {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} preserve you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 여자는 잠시 동안 말문이 막혔습니다.{/n} \"당신은... 성자이십니다! {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 당신을 "
"지켜주실겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "8ad70a92-eeac-4faa-bdc7-5cc21235dba1"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman examines you closely.{/n} \"You know, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}... people spout all kinds of nonsense "
"about you, but I can tell you have a good heart. A heart that aches over the "
"troubles of your people!.There's nothing for me in {g|Galt}Galt{/g} — my "
"home is here! Thank you again, and farewell, Baron{mf||ess}. I'm going back "
"to the city. And I'll make sure everyone knows the kind of person you truly "
"are!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 당신을 자세히 살핍니다.{/n} \"아시다시피... 사람들은 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}에 대해 온갖 소문을 "
"퍼뜨리지만, 저는 당신이 선한 마음을 가지셨다는 걸 알고 있습니다. 고통스러운 백성을 불쌍히 여기는 마음씨 말이에요! "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g}에는 저를 위한 곳이 없습니다. 여기가 바로 제 집인걸요! 다시 한번 감사드립니다. 그리고 안녕히 가세요. 저는 "
"도시로 돌아가겠어요. 저는 당신의 진정한 모습을 사람들에게 알리겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "d928bf33-6fc3-44a7-8c6d-d4a97517505a"
msgid ""
"\"You... But...!\" {n}The woman's face reddens, and tears stream from her "
"eyes.{/n} \"It's a wonder the earth doesn't open and swallow you whole! It's "
"better than you deserve!\" {n}She starts sobbing as she walks away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"...하지만...!\" {n}여자의 얼굴이 붉어지고 눈물이 흘러 나옵니다.{/n} \"땅이 갈라져서 왜 당신 같은 자를 삼키지 않는지 "
"몰라! 당신은 그래도 싸!\" {n}그녀는 걸어 흐느껴 울며 걸어나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "9a084751-98bc-4662-906e-dd26d9155d08"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman blushes and lowers her gaze.{/n} \"Forgive me, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\" {n}Her whisper is barely audible.{/n} "
"\"It's difficult to confess, but... I'm running away. Two men in my village "
"died from the magic disease. {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} willing, I'd save "
"myself...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자의 얼굴이 붉어지고 시선을 아래로 내립니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 용서해주십시오.\" {n}그녀의 "
"속삭임은 간신히 들립니다.{/n} \"고백하기 어렵지만... 저는 이 땅을 피해 도망가고 있었습니다. 제 마을에 살던 두 남자가 마법의 "
"질병으로 죽었거든요. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 저를 살리시길 바라며...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "edd9c97a-054d-4bc2-9ab5-8d126cc45a67"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Mother died last year, and my brother moved to the city... I hope "
"that at least there he'll be safe from the disease.\""
msgstr "\"맞습니다. 어머니는 작년에 돌아가셨고 제 오빠는 도시로 이사갔어요... 적어도 그곳에선 질병으로부터 안전해야 할 텐데..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "b18a3a66-716f-46bf-8382-b90f436758cf"
msgid "\"Yes, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}?\""
msgstr "\"네, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "d223cd98-e34c-4ec8-b258-1abd491fca6b"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman slowly slides the pearls through her fingers.{/n} \"They're so "
"beautiful... It's such a pity I'll have to part with them. Perhaps it would "
"be best to cut the string, spend the pearls one at a time...\" {n}She sighs "
"and forces a smile.{/n} \"But I'll manage, Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. Thank you for your help. I'll never "
"forget what you've done!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 천천히 진주를 손가락으로 밀어 넣습니다.{/n} \"이건 너무 아름다워요... 이 진주와 헤어져야 한다니 너무 슬퍼요. "
"아마도 목걸이를 끊어서 진주 한알씩 쓰는 게 가장 좋을 것 같아요...\" {n}그녀는 한숨을 쉬며 억지로 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} "
"\"하지만 잘 이겨내겠습니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 도와주셔서 감사드립니다. 당신의 도움을 결코 잊지 않겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "884cea3b-ce03-4626-8034-d4645d8ed29c"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman hesitates, tugging at the edge of her cloak and averting her "
"eyes.{/n} \"Then keep the trinket for yourself,\" {n}she mumbles, barely "
"audible.{/n} \"My life's more important to me.\" {n}She lowers her head and "
"turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 외투 자락을 만지작거리고 시선을 피하며 주저합니다.{/n} \"그러면 그 물건은 가져가세요.\" {n}그녀의 중얼거림은 "
"간신히 들립니다.{/n} \"제 생명이 저에겐 더 중요해요.\" {n}그녀는 고개를 숙이고는 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "9e1c0df4-a24a-4562-8eda-971ebbfdcb2b"
msgid "{n}The woman stares at you anxiously.{/n} \"What is it?\""
msgstr "{n}여자는 당신을 염려하는 눈빛으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"이게 뭐죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a25f6d6b-c1da-49fd-8331-abb1ffcb9803"
msgid "\"Just robbed, let you go away alive? This is big luck.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 도둑질만 당하고 너를 살려서 보냈다고? 운이 정말 좋구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2b8f13d2-7e4a-4ec3-8a23-2b53babe3fd3"
msgid ""
"\"Pft! Afraid of some goblin are you?! You should've just given him a good "
"old kick, and he'd be done for!\""
msgstr "\"흥! 고블린이 무서워?! 그냥 녀석을 걷어차주지 그랬어. 그걸로도 놈은 끝장났을 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b777d299-b5e2-45c6-bec7-f722dbeb7819"
msgid ""
"\"Pft! Afraid of some pygmy are you?! You should've just given him a good "
"old kick, and he'd be done for!\""
msgstr "\"흥! 그런 꼬맹이가 무서워?! 그냥 녀석을 걷어차주지 그랬어. 그걸로도 놈은 끝장났을 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "82597573-4db9-44af-8e46-b3e800178176"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at the ground, clutching his holy symbol, mumbling. {/n} "
"\"Disease... This disease, everywhere...\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 그의 거룩한 상징을 움켜쥐고 땅을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"질병... 이 질병이 도처에 퍼졌군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1a2a5773-9831-4dfc-80b0-2c507db39429"
msgid "\"Your whining irritates me.\""
msgstr "\"네 징징거리는 소리가 날 짜증나게 하고있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "f62ff9d4-d7a1-4305-aad5-f385a3adb46f"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman casts a scared glance at Jaethal and tries to calm down her "
"tears, or at least to weep more quietly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그녀는 제이탈을 겁에 질린 시선으로 바라보고는, 눈물을 진정시키려 하거나 최소한 조용히 울려고 노력합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "2d790727-20c9-4b4b-8fa0-d7f242b3795e"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman glances down and gasps in terror.{/n} \"Good gods! The beast "
"from before looked just like the beast that's traveling with you! Gods have "
"mercy!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 여인은 공포에 떨며 헐떡거립니다.{/n} \"신이시여! 제 눈 앞에 있는 짐승이 아까 본 그 짐승인가요! 자비를 베푸소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/RobbedWoman/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ffbed992-0f84-4ca8-a3d0-d9bf2f7441c2"
msgid "\"Strange something. No think-thought who it could be.\""
msgstr "\"이상한 무언가가 있다. 잘 생각해 봐야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "133b5bce-9834-4c12-ae7a-781aef3a3d00"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"넌 어디에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d1c841ad-f826-44ec-9d74-e598c8b1040f"
msgid "\"Who are all those people on the bridge?\""
msgstr "\"다리 위의 사람들은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "62927b0a-aae2-4315-b681-54415d51dd18"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가봐야 겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "f7aa8aa0-1854-42b0-9167-9144e0be481e"
msgid "\"I found the berries you were talking about.\""
msgstr "\"네가 말한 열매를 발견했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "60739608-9803-43b2-9578-93f49c9dc4e7"
msgid ""
"\"I found your berries. You lied. These aren't medicine — they're poison.\""
msgstr "\"네가 말한 열매를 발견했다. 너는 거짓말했더군. 이 열매는 약이 아니야. 독약이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6b63fce6-fc45-4fd8-8086-636a404a966b"
msgid "Granted last wish of a sick old man."
msgstr "아픈 노인의 마지막 소원을 들어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "aebd2f8e-a5aa-4d37-a0e9-e0796f513209"
msgid "[Give him the berries] \"If that's really what you want...\""
msgstr "[그에게 열매를 줍니다] \"그것이 정말로 원하는 것이면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b5943449-3fda-4750-ba98-cec34f7bfde1"
msgid "Refused to help sick old man kill himself."
msgstr "병든 노인의 자살을 돕지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "d69c5c15-b61e-48cd-af34-34f48be86479"
msgid ""
"\"My goal was to help you, not kill you. You'll have to find some other way "
"to end your life if that's what you want.\""
msgstr "\"나의 목표는 너를 도우려는 것이지. 죽이는 것이 아니야. 네가 원하는 것이 죽음이면 다른 방법을 찾아야 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5f1c2f79-09cf-4d3a-9860-04a84b6035b8"
msgid "Sent sick old man to Jhod for the treatment."
msgstr "아픈 노인을 치료하기 위해 조드에게 보냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "d3914d4e-3d10-4fd0-87ff-7b4a491be573"
msgid ""
"\"Find Jhod Kavken in town. He can identify your illness and give you the "
"help you need.\""
msgstr "\"마을의 조드 카브켄을 찾아가. 그가 너의 병을 확인하고 필요한 도움을 줄 수 있을꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "8b6b96b7-1c8b-4d02-af1d-6db36049344c"
msgid "\"Why are you so sure you have the same illness?\""
msgstr "\"왜 네가 같은 병이 있다고 확신하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9049e5cc-67af-488c-9da2-0670417eb7e3"
msgid "Brutally killed old man who hoped for easy and painless death."
msgstr "편하고 고통 없는 죽음을 원하는 노인을 잔인하게 끝냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "8ced6179-2613-475a-8cd9-f15ff3530001"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"First you fool me, and now you dare beg me for yet more help? "
"Perhaps you've found your death after all!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"처음부터 나를 속이고는, 이제는 감히 더 도와달라고 하는건가? 오냐. 죽음을 내려주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ea78ebc2-bf71-49ac-b274-d21c6315fcae"
msgid "Killed old man for badmouthing."
msgstr "입버릇이 나쁜 노인을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "8c955a1b-3db0-4667-a66e-6fcda6d5b13d"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I am the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. And you're about to "
"learn how I deal with any rabble who would dare vilify me!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내가 바로 {mf|영주|영주|왕이|여왕이}다. 나를 비난하는 폭도들을 내가 어떻게 다루는지 곧 알게될꺼다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "81e5e2df-dc0e-4e84-829b-f03222d29ed4"
msgid "\"You shouldn't speak of the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} that way.\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주|영주|왕|여왕}에게 그런 식으로 말해선 안되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f31cc41f-2363-4907-8037-19ca23cdb2ef"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man who called to you looks to be in bad shape: pale face, dark "
"circles under his eyes, and his forehead glistening with sweat. There's no "
"doubt this man is very sick.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 부른 노인은 상태가 좋지 않아보입니다. 얼굴은 창백하고 눈 밑에는 다크 서클이 내려앉았고 그의 이마는 땀이 맺혔습니다. 그가 "
"매우 아프다는 것은 의심의 여지가 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "b7bdad8a-cae1-4aee-bf51-735a2e6a8e57"
msgid ""
"\"Hey... hey, {mf|lad|lass}! Would you-\" {n}The old man breaks into a "
"coughing fit.{/n} \"Would you do an old man a favor in his hour of need? "
"I've traveled far, but I somehow fell ill along the way. I know of a berry "
"that grows along the coast in these parts, though — it's supposed to be a "
"potent medicine. It will-\" {n}The old man coughs again.{/n} \"It'll put "
"anyone back on their feet!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이보게... 이봐...\" {n}노인은 갑자기 기침을 합니다.{/n} \"도움이 필요한 노인에게 호의를 베풀어주겠나? 나는 멀리 "
"여행했지만 병이 들었네. 이곳의 해안에서 자라는 베리에 대해 알고 있네. 좋은 약이지. 그게 나를...\" {n}노인이 다시 "
"기침합니다.{/n} \"누구라도 낫게 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "0daf2d7f-0e2e-4928-8edc-6b3388eb129f"
msgid ""
"\"They're black — hard to miss...\" {n}The old man bursts into more coughing "
"for a few moments.{/n} \"Black with a hint of purple. The bush is short. "
"You've strong legs and sharp eyes. Honor-\" {n}The old man coughs again but "
"quickly controls it.{/n} \"Honor an old man's wish — bring me a handful of "
"those berries.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 열매는 검은 색이야. 알아보기 쉽지...\" {n}노인은 잠시 더 기침을 합니다.{/n} \"보랏빛이 도는 검은색 열매라네. "
"나무는 키가 짧아. 자네는 잘 걷고 눈도 좋으니 찾기 쉬울...\" {n}노인은 다시 기침하지만 곧 멈춥니다.{/n} \"노인의 부탁을 "
"들어주게나. 나에게 열매 한줌만 가져다주게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "de196bc8-8def-4124-939d-8f04ede6bc4a"
msgid "{n}The old man looks at you, hope in his purblind eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}노인은 흐릿한 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "169b954f-e4ea-4109-9db4-5781d6f6b9c1"
msgid ""
"\"The outskirts of the {g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}. Used to live there "
"with my son and his wife. But when this scourge started to spread through "
"the {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} and a few people in our village "
"started falling ill, we knew it was time to run. Hated to abandon the house, "
"but what could we do? My son's little ones-\" {n}The old man lets out a few "
"wet coughs.{/n} \"We couldn't just let the little ones perish in that cursed "
"place...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g} 외곽이라네. 내 아들 내외와 함께 거기 살았지. 그러나 이 질병이 이곳에 퍼졌고 마을의 몇몇 "
"사람들이 병에 걸리자 우리는 도망가야한다고 생각했지. 집을 버리는 것은 싫지만 우리가 뭘 할 수 있었겠나? 내 손주 새끼들은... \" "
"{n}노인은 젖은 기침을 몇 번 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"우리는 그 어린 것들이 이 저주 받은 곳에서 죽게 둘 수 없었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "f2bcd6c1-109c-479b-98b5-fd447cafa8f7"
msgid ""
"\"Refugees, running from an illness that causes horrible beasts to burst out "
"of people's bodies. The rulers couldn't care less for the simple folk,\" {n}"
"the old man says, cringing slightly,{/n} \"so people run as far as they can. "
"The {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} can stay in {mf|his|her} cursed land all "
"{mf|he|she} wants, but we want to be safe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들의 몸에서 끔찍한 짐승이 튀어나오는 질병을 피해 달아난 난민들일세. 통치자는 불쌍한 백성들을 돌보지 않았어.\" {n}노인이 "
"몸을 움츠리며 말합니다.{/n} \"사람들은 최대한 멀리 도망쳤다네. 이 저주받은 땅의 {mf|영주|영주|왕|여왕}인 {mf|그는|그녀는}"
", 원한다면 이곳에서 얼마든 머물 수 있겠지만, 우리는 안전한 곳에 있고 싶었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "200bce03-1b8b-449b-a7a1-6d5303e16445"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man shifts his gaze down.{/n} \"Please don't be angry... Look, "
"I'm sick like all the others. I've seen the monsters come out of people — "
"I'd rather take my own life than wait for such a terrible end!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 시선을 아래로 내립니다.{/n} \"제발 화내지 말게... 보게나, 나도 다른 모든 사람들처럼 아파. 나는 괴물들이 "
"사람들에게서 나온 것을 본 적이 있어.. 그런 끔찍한 최후를 기다리느니 차라리 내 스스로 목숨을 끊는 편이 낫겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "df28b31d-57a3-44e6-be3d-3beeb9bee684"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man carefully examines the berries, then nods fervently.{/n} \"Yes"
"... Yes, these are the right ones. Thank you, {mf|lad|lass}.\" {n}He crams "
"the black berries into his mouth and chews vigorously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 조심스레 열매를 살펴보고는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래... 맞아. 고마워. \" {n}그는 검은 열매를 입에 넣고 "
"격렬히 씹습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "09072f8c-c8c8-4bca-8304-35fec272d80a"
msgid ""
"{n}A weak smile flickers across the old man's timeworn face.{/n} \"And so it "
"begins...\" {n}He turns his gaze to you, his eyes going glassy.{/n} \"I'm "
"sorry, my friend, but I tricked you. I don't-\" {n}The old man coughs, but "
"it's less powerful than before.{/n} \"I don't want to die to this damn "
"sickness, let some disgusting beast crawl from my body... It's... better "
"this way...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은이의 얼굴에 약한 미소가 피어오릅니다.{/n} \"이제 시작하는군...\" {n}그는 시선을 돌려 당신을 보았고 그의 눈은 "
"유리알처럼 변합니다.{/n} \"미안하지만 너를 속였어.\" \" {n}노인은 기침하지만 이전보다 약합니다.{/n} \"나는 이 빌어먹을 "
"병이 내 몸에서 끔찍한 짐승을 끄집어나오게 하지 않을 거야... 이 방식이 더 나아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "7d8f6a15-1353-476f-811c-b2a264c5d0df"
msgid ""
"\"I'm... not sure. And who's to say? But waiting to see whether some "
"horrible creature hatches out of me... I'd rather die by my own hand!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건...확실하진 않아. 누가 확실히 말해주겠어? 하지만 끔찍한 괴물이 나에게서 태어나는 것을 지켜보느니... 차라리 내 손으로 "
"죽을는게 나아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "e0b5f7bb-5e8b-4c94-bd5e-9ce84cafb3fb"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man carefully examines the berries, then nods fervently.{/n} \"Yes"
"... just what I needed...\" {n}He raises his tearful eyes to you.{/n} \"Thank"
" you, my friend. You've saved my soul... {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} bless you.\" "
"{n}He crams the black berries into his mouth and chews vigorously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 조심스레 열매를 살펴보고는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래... 내가 원하던 것이었어... \" {n}그는 글썽이는 "
"눈으로 당신을 봅니다. {/n} \"고마워... 네가 내 영혼을 구했어... 에라스틸이 너를 축복하길... \" {n}그는 검은 열매를 "
"입에 넣고 격렬히 씹습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "adf54ffc-8caf-4516-99e8-a5d9ce686e54"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man's eyes swell with tears.{/n} \"I beg of you, give me the "
"berries! Let me decide my own fate!\""
msgstr "{n}노인의 눈은 눈물로 글썽입니다.{/n} \"부탁인데 그 열매를 나에게 줘! 내가 내 삶을 끝낼 수 있게 해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "17633895-b78f-40b1-9ac5-3162cc732fcd"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man's eyes light up.{/n} \"Someone... someone could help me?\" {n}"
"A weak smile crosses his wrinkled face.{/n} \"There's still hope? Oh, "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} protect this {mf|man|woman}! Thank you! Thank you! "
"I'm leaving right now — I won't let this sickness stop me. As long as my "
"legs will carry me, I'll make it there!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노인의 눈빛이 빛납니다.{/n} \"누군가... 누군가 나를 도울 수 있다는건가?\" {n}약한 미소가 그의 주름진 얼굴에 "
"떠오릅니다.{/n} \"아직 희망이 있는건가? {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 이 자를 축복하길! 고맙네! 지금 바로 떠나겠네. 이 "
"병이 나를 막지 못하게 하겠어. 내 다리가 멀쩡한 한 그곳으로 가겠네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "b6838fca-98e5-4eb4-8f49-5c14c9129510"
msgid ""
"\"I left too — they're my family, after all...\" {n}The old man coughs a few "
"times.{/n} \"But I'm not as strong as I once was. I started lagging behind, "
"holding them back. So I said, 'Listen, son, save your wife and kids. I'll "
"make it there on my own.'\" {n}He coughs again, then goes silent for a "
"moment.{/n} \"We agreed to meet up in Drember village...\" {n}He trails off "
"as his eyes grow watery.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나 역시 떠났지. 결국 내 가족과 함께해야 하니까..\" {n}노인은 몇 번 기침합니다.{/n} \"하지만 이 노인네는 예전처럼 "
"강하지 못해서 뒤쳐지기 시작했다네. 그래서 이렇게 말했지. '아들아. 네 아내와 아이들을 먼저 구하거라. 나는 알아서 할 테니.'\" "
"{n}그는 다시 기침을 하고 잠시 침묵을 지킵니다.{/n} \"우린 드램버 마을에서 다시 만나기로 했다네...\" {n}그는 눈에 물이 "
"차오르고 마침내 흘러내립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "3d6607d8-cac9-42ed-b3c5-b05601debe7f"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man tries to say something else, but his lips are sluggishl, his "
"voice silent. Berry-tinted foam drips from his mouth as his eyes roll up and "
"he slowly sags to the ground.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 다른 말을하려고 시도하지만 그의 입술은 느렸고 그의 목소리는 조용했습니다. 열매와 같은 빛의 거품이 그의 입에서 올라왔고 "
"그의 눈은 뒤집혀 그는 천천히 땅으로 쓰러집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "7ffa2c3f-b276-466e-bb74-992f639ecfe3"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you, {mf|lad|lass} — give me the berries. This is no sin upon your "
"soul. I'd have killed myself anyway — you only helped an old man ease his "
"suffering!\""
msgstr ""
"\"부탁이야. 나에게 열매를 줘. 네가 죄를 짓는 것이 아니야. 나는 결국에 나를 죽이고 있어. 너는 그저 노인의 고통을 끝내는 것을 "
"도와주는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/BigKamelandsOutdoor/SickMan/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "ac3cb394-a12e-4f6e-9169-1ddabe3b45a3"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man waves his hand dismissively.{/n} \"I'm old. I've little "
"concern for them high lords... I just hope I don't die and none of my kin "
"get sick!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 무시하듯 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"나는 늙었어. 나는 높으신 나으리들은 별로 신경쓰지 않아... 나는 그저 죽지 않고 내 "
"가족이 병들지 않는 걸 바랄 뿐일세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/AfterFight_Leader_String
msgctxt "36e1dd27-0b94-4ffe-a247-21338bf3d8df"
msgid "\"Cursed lands! Cursed barony!\""
msgstr "\"저주받은 땅! 저주받은 영지 같으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/AfterFight_Peasant_String
msgctxt "fec92aea-97fb-4738-b6cf-f599663da7fe"
msgid "\"Great gods, what did we do to deserve this?!\""
msgstr "\"신이시여. 우리가 도대체 왜 이런 벌을 받아야 합니까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/Attacked_Leader_String
msgctxt "4aa876bb-362d-4e6d-8285-fa4003e6a4e4"
msgid "\"Erastil the great, help us!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이시여. 우리를 도와주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/Attacked_Peasant_String
msgctxt "158b5079-48fb-4418-93c6-6bc3a56e3350"
msgid "\"Help! Murder!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘! 살인이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckFailed_01_Leader_String
msgctxt "75c5ca17-d739-4dc6-be64-cf1300bc6857"
msgid "\"Go, go, Your Grace! Leave us be!\""
msgstr "\"어서 가! 우리를 떠나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckFailed_02_Peasant_String
msgctxt "6f663dad-4930-4df2-adcc-d06bc5938d25"
msgid ""
"\"We just need to reach the tavern, take a rest, then Verdrin will be just "
"fine! Right, Verdrin?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 선술집에 도착해서 쉬면 버드린은 괜찮을거야! 그렇지? 버드린? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckFailed_03_Verdrin_String
msgctxt "1d5b10dd-f926-48c2-b4a8-afde752e6406"
msgid "\"Kha... Kha...\""
msgstr "\"헉... 헉...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckFailed_04_Peasant_String
msgctxt "ab5b78b4-2fb5-422f-974e-b4d9aac73f8d"
msgid "\"Verdrin?\""
msgstr "\"버드린?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckFailed_05_Peasant_String
msgctxt "fcfd3f47-9f7c-4f62-bf00-3aa5fe620522"
msgid "\"AAAAAAAAH!\""
msgstr "\"아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckFailed_06_Leader_String
msgctxt "6a54fbdb-24bd-412e-8df0-9d64bdea6373"
msgid "\"Erastil help us!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이시여! 우릴 도와주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckSuccess_01_Verdrin_String
msgctxt "6c7c575a-d5f7-4efc-854f-e6380268cb26"
msgid "\"Don't... don't leave me!\""
msgstr "\"날 떠나지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckSuccess_02_Leader_String
msgctxt "3493ae64-37e2-4d98-a285-1fe5f254f168"
msgid "\"I am sorry, Verdrin. I have to think of others as well.\""
msgstr "\"미안해. 버드린. 나는 다른 사람들도 생각해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckSuccess_03_Verdrin_String
msgctxt "a9af7d3d-8878-4121-b940-04ee42644333"
msgid ""
"\"It's just a fever! I am not dan... khe... ger... kha... khaaaaAAAAAAARRGH!"
"\""
msgstr "\"그냥 열이야! 나는 위험... 하... 헉... 컥... 아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckSuccess_04_Peasant_String
msgctxt "9f663e86-8bc9-4101-8907-eab8a59ebd08"
msgid "\"VERDRIN!\""
msgstr "\"버드린!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/CheckSuccess_05_Leader_String
msgctxt "307b29b4-9fde-4438-a1df-0ba67b7eed24"
msgid "\"Erastil, save us all!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸께서 우리를 구해주시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/JustLeft_01_Leader_String
msgctxt "06680fe2-7444-4df3-8500-c4d4c16a341f"
msgid "\"Go, go... and we will go our own way.\""
msgstr "\"가라. 우리는 우리 길을 갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/JustLeft_02_Peasant_String
msgctxt "28d45305-712a-4ee9-9989-63cc583bac43"
msgid "\"Just hang on, Verdrin! We're almost there!\""
msgstr "\"기다려! 버드린! 거의 다 왔어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/JustLeft_03_Leader_String
msgctxt "0257488a-b26d-4f19-84a4-c0da50fe3034"
msgid ""
"\"He doesn't look good. Perhaps, we should... great gods, he's bleeding from "
"his mouth!\""
msgstr "\"그는 좋아 보이지 않아. 아마 우리는... 맙소사. 그가 입에서 피를 흘리고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/Barks/JustLeft_04_Peasant_String
msgctxt "483f2028-16d6-4785-8125-c683f81398d2"
msgid "\"AAAAAAAAAAAHHHH! Help!\""
msgstr "\"아아아! 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "9e3e113d-7fe5-4dfc-933f-11ad39f992a5"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "195a082a-e6f9-42da-87d3-02f5e0615b78"
msgid "\"This young fellow — what's wrong with him?\""
msgstr "\"이 젊은 친구는.. 무슨 문제라도 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "9b44ab43-b05e-44ff-a009-adf113d7a882"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야 겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "4aa19e44-a926-41d2-96c7-1bec35a7ec7c"
msgid ""
"\"Judging by your bags, you are not just traveling. You are on the run.\""
msgstr "\"너희 짐들을 보니 단순한 여행자들이 아니야. 너희는 도망자들이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4b742a1d-3a9c-4b3e-b4c0-86fdc5e75854"
msgid "Killed refugees on the road."
msgstr "길에서 난민들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "4f98973a-985c-4fbf-951f-374d2c4ccc35"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Let's have a little fun. Why don't you try to run to Galt, and "
"we'll see how many of you live to get there?\""
msgstr "[공격] \"재미있는 놀이나 해볼까. 어디 갈트로 도망가보지 그래? 너희 중 얼마나 살아서 도착할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "c9b643da-b192-46ed-8289-4d2caf7ab279"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing you can do for Verdrin — his signs are like the others "
"afflicted. Any moment, a monster might tear its way out of him. Keep your "
"distance!\""
msgstr ""
"\"버드린을 위해 네가 할 수 있는 일은 없어. 그 증상은 다른 감염된 사람들과 같은 증상이야. 금방이라도 괴물이 그에게서 빠져 나올 수 "
"있어. 멀리 떨어져있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0037_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "34f6ee5c-0a1b-4060-a9e7-c612ea0ecb0f"
msgid "Denied own responsibility in infected peasant's death."
msgstr "감염된 농민의 죽음에 대한 책임이 없다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "e300c5f3-3dc5-45a9-9690-b68580a491d9"
msgid ""
"\"Calm down. It wasn't me who killed your friend. What happened here was a "
"tragedy, but it is not me you should blame.\""
msgstr ""
"\"진정해. 네 친구를 죽인 것은 내가 아니야. 여기서 일어난 일은 비극이었어. 하지만 네가 비난해야 할 대상은 내가 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "4a484747-17d0-4d4d-9685-b1c76fa11e41"
msgid ""
"\"I will not be able to protect you if you leave for Galt. Turn back, and "
"inside the capital you will find protection from the beasts. You will at "
"least save those who can still be saved.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 갈트로 떠나면 너를 보호해줄 수 없어. 다시 돌아간다면, 수도 안에서 짐승들로부터 보호받을 수 있을꺼야. 넌 최소한 아직 살릴수 "
"있는 사람들을 구할 수 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0039_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a325dc39-7753-4288-8414-488572513c33"
msgid "Killed refugees on the road."
msgstr "길에서 난민들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "511e9b9b-a67d-4dd8-96ff-d8cb12edf14e"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Calm yourself — I shall send you to join your friend straight "
"away.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"진정해. 네 친구들에게 지금 당장 보내줄 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "bc430fd1-f7d1-460c-b519-538d35c5b087"
msgid "\"I should go now.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "0ebb6b12-7b18-4853-9a89-9818094db673"
msgid "[Kill the afflicted youth]"
msgstr "[감염된 청년을 죽입니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0050_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0be1c189-5dc7-4d8a-ac0d-581186192fff"
msgid "Killed refugees on the road."
msgstr "길에서 난민들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "e989d5ec-1d94-4c9d-89af-80c7dd593756"
msgid "[Attack] \"You are not stopping me!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 나를 멈추지 못해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "2cf62755-a159-4cb5-8436-befaaef20997"
msgid "\"Get away from him! A monster is about to burst out of him!\""
msgstr "\"그에게서 떨어져! 괴물이 그에게서 폭발하려 하고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "9ff80ad3-79a3-4e7a-a62a-4a1bed3034b8"
msgid "\"Fine, I shall leave.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나는 떠날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0053_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "092a0ddd-031e-445b-aac2-879077a8d7b8"
msgid "Snubbed angry peasant."
msgstr "화난 농민을 무시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "683806be-2e9f-4190-bf01-ba231e07db2e"
msgid ""
"\"Easy now! I'm doing everything I can! What, you think you'd do a better "
"job if monsters started tearing out of your citizens all across the barony, "
"huh? As a matter of fact, you — yes, you — are still alive, and I've yet to "
"hear a word of gratitude.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 진정해! 나는 할 수 있는 건 다 하고 있어! 만약 너라면 영지 전체에 걸쳐 시민들에게서 괴물들이 튀어나올 때 더 잘 할 수 "
"있을 것 같은가? 그리고 너, 그래, 너는 아직 살아있지 않은가. 그럼에도 난 아직 감사하다는 말 한마디 못들은거 같은데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0054_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "84a947e1-98d4-4af1-98b6-28481729f2c7"
msgid "Blamed angry peasant for ingratitude."
msgstr "은혜를 모르는 성난 농민을 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "327e8f7d-f063-4897-9359-f7103cf96c53"
msgid ""
"\"I protect this realm for you, I fight monsters, and all I hear in return "
"is cursing and the mewling of cowards! You ungrateful, narrow-minded fools!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 너희를 위해 영지를 보호하고, 괴물들과 싸웠어. 그런데 그 보답으로 듣는 것은 욕설과 겁쟁이들의 야유뿐인가! 이 은혜도 모르는 속 "
"좁은 인간들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "601c3091-ef23-499b-9384-af72af059b50"
msgid "\"I must leave now. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"나는이제 가봐야해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0056_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0cede960-a77b-4804-9cfb-027e1af2983e"
msgid "Killed refugees on the road."
msgstr "길에서 난민들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "bd748a37-5022-4b51-a05e-bf0ceb0f595c"
msgid "[Attack] \"You. Stay. Here.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"여기에. 머물러라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "69315a13-e641-4648-8dd3-0baa84b8222d"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0058_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "12990f6d-4c4d-4313-9a22-09a5722eee94"
msgid "Waved away peasant's accusations."
msgstr "농민들의 비난을 물리쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "6ef19286-78f5-435b-a678-ba29332ec528"
msgid ""
"\"Yell all you want. I couldn't care less about you or your family of "
"beggars.\""
msgstr "\"얼마든지 소리쳐라. 너나 너의 거지같은 가족들에겐 조금도 신경 쓰지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0059_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dc510d8e-694f-4298-933d-338af7e39ef5"
msgid "Killed the insolent peasant."
msgstr "무례한 농민을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "23d086f6-7bd1-4ebf-ba83-758081925445"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Talking back to your {mf|baron|baroness} is akin to treason.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네 {mf|영주|영주|왕|왕}에게 말대답을 하는건, 반역이나 마찬가지다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0060_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4fc8e2b3-34b6-422f-bf75-e4f7e275e80a"
msgid "Asked angry peasant for forgiveness."
msgstr "화가 난 농민에게 용서를 요청했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "fe89a3cc-68e1-4365-acd1-df3546431bfa"
msgid ""
"\"You cannot imagine the pain that fills my heart with each life lost. I am "
"doing everything in my power to save those who still can be saved. Please, "
"forgive me, for I cannot protect everyone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 명 한 명 목숨을 잃을때마다 느끼는 내 고통을 넌 상상도 못할꺼다. 최대한 많은 사람들을 구해내기 위해 난 모든 힘을 다하고 있어. "
"하지만 부디 날 용서해주기 바란다. 내가 모두를 보호할 수는 없으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0066_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f206362f-523b-4dd0-a00a-2040cd6a5d5b"
msgid "Killed refugees on the road."
msgstr "길에서 난민들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "4a049c36-e836-4bd1-aa28-4bb71cb7126b"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough! I will make you shorter by the head.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그만! 머리를 잘라서 키를 더 작게 해주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "7a7c67f0-685f-491c-800c-b7ff89b9d895"
msgid ""
"{n}A group of travelers carrying bags, satchels, and sacks full of all "
"manner of goods and chattels are shuffling their feet on the road in front "
"of you. Two tougher looking men are helping one of their companions stand — "
"a pale youth who is shivering, his face covered in sweat. As you approach, "
"the men turn to you and glare at you.{/n} \"Your Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}한 여행자 무리가 잡동사니가 든 가방과 자루를 질질 끌고 걷고 있습니다. 더 건장해 보이는 두 남자가 그들 동료 중 한 명을 돕고 "
"있습니다. 떨고있는 창백한 청년, 그의 얼굴은 땀으로 범벅이 되어 있습니다. 당신이 가까이 다가가자 남자들은 몸을 돌려 노려봅니다.{/n}"
" \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "877b3609-9d0f-429d-a2f8-f90527125158"
msgid ""
"{n}Uhrked's hands are shaking, and as he turns to face you, his voice raises "
"to a shout.{/n} \"Cursed lands! Cursed {mf|baron|baroness}! It's all your "
"fault! Verdrin died because of you! WE'RE ALL GOING TO DIE BECAUSE OF YOU!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어크헤드의 손은 떨렸고 시선을 돌려 당신을 보자 그는 비명을 지르기 시작합니다.{/n} \"저주받은 땅! 저주받은 남작! 모두 네 "
"잘못이야! 버드린은 너 때문에 죽었어! 너 때문에 우리 모두 죽을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "d4c10b19-c30a-4476-854f-d0bd7925230f"
msgid ""
"{n}The man throws a glance at his small group.{/n} \"Name's Uhrked. These "
"here are my companions. We come from the village of Lervik, and we're "
"traveling to {g|Galt}Galt{/g} in search for protection.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자는 자신의 무리를 힐끗 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"제 이름은 어크헤드입니다. 이쪽은 내 동료들이구요. 우리는 레르빅 마을에서 왔고 "
"보호를 받기 위해 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}로 가고 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "792145ee-629e-4374-ad8e-609a76bc3d94"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Verdrin, you mean? Must've eaten something. He was fine, see, then "
"felt sick, fever and all, and in the morning he began to cough blood. "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} willing, he'll make it to the border, and we'll find "
"him a healer there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 버드린 말인가요? 뭔가를 좀 먹었나 봅니다. 그는 괜찮았었어요. 근데 갑자기 열이 나면서 아파하더니 아침에 피를 토하기 "
"시작했습니다. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 허락하신다면, 국경까지 갈 수 있을 것이고, 거기서 치료사를 찾을 수 있을 겁니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "ceda8da5-ab6d-496b-bb0a-ab580a8a3e8a"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a change in Uhrked's eyes, and he gives you a cold, even wicked, "
"look.{/n} \"And if it were so, Your Grace? It's more risk to stay in the "
"barony then to go into the wilds — three folks torn to pieces in our "
"village, and even more were slain by the beasts that came out! "
"{g|Galt}Galt{/g} has to be safer, they say, and I say we go see for "
"ourselves!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어그헤드의 눈에는 변화를 보이며 당신에게 냉혹하고 심지어 사악하기까지한 눈빛을 보냅니다.{/n} \"만약 그렇다면 어쩔 "
"생각이십니까..{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}? 그땐 광야로 가는 것보다 영지에 머무는 것이 더 위험합니다. 이미 우리 마을 사람 셋이 "
"갈기갈기 찢기고 거기서 튀어나온 괴물에게 더많은 사람들이 죽었습니다! 사람들은 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}가 더 안전할 거라고들 "
"말하는데.. 저희 눈으로 직접 확인할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "80f88581-2c00-40f9-8ba4-858445aed16f"
msgid ""
"{n}Uhrked pales and looks at the others.{/n} \"Listen up!\" {n}His voice is "
"hoarse.{/n} \"All back! Back, behind the {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어크헤드는 창백해져서 다른 동료들을 봅니다.{/n} \"모두 잘 들어!\" {n}그의 목소리는 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"모두들 "
"물러서! 물러서! 버드린에게서 떨어져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "9f7d1ff3-da25-4952-990e-5d60ec79b484"
msgid ""
"{n}Uhrked frowns.{/n} \"What do you think you are doing, Your Grace? We "
"don't need you in this! It's bad enough you've left us all to hang, now you "
"come and tell me to leave one of my own behind? You better go on about your "
"business, we'll deal with this on our own.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어크헤드는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"무슨 말씀을 하시는겁니까? {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 이 일에 당신은 필요 없습니다! "
"이미 이런 사형선고나 마찬가지인 상황 속에 저희를 내버려 두는 것도 모자라, 이제는 저희 일행 한명을 버려두라는 겁니까? "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께선 하시던 일 마저 하십시오. 저희는 저희 갈 길을 가겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "926c9c0a-c232-452e-821c-f10f4018e8f2"
msgid ""
"{n}The wrath on Uhrked's face gives way to disbelief.{/n} \"Is that so? You "
"want to sweep us away from our neighbors' sight?\" {n}He wipes away "
"tears.{/n} \"'Tis all the same, no matter where we breathe our last — be it "
"away from home in a foreign land or out on the city streets, let us die in "
"peace! You hear that, lads? We turn back!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어크헤드의 얼굴에 나타난 분노는 믿지 못할 정도입니다.{/n} \"그래? 이웃들의 눈 앞에서 우리가 죽는 꼴을 보고 싶나 보군?\" "
"{n}그는 눈물을 닦아냅니다.{/n} \"어디에서 죽더라도 결국에는 똑같겠지. 먼 외국 땅이던, 도시의 길거리 위에서건 평화롭게 죽음을 "
"맞이하자! 이봐 다들 들었지? 우리는 돌아간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "d48c1727-a0c0-4d87-b4e8-293175ab88e7"
msgid ""
"{n}Uhrked glares at you, his eyes narrowing to slits.{/n} \"Lies! Twisted "
"lies! There's only death and suffering to be found in these lands! We're "
"heading straight to {g|Galt}Galt{/g}, and we are not stopping until we've "
"left this cursed barony behind our backs!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어크헤드의 눈은 가늘어지며 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"거짓말이야! 비겁한 거짓말! 이 땅에는 죽음과 고통만이 있을 거야! 우리는 "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g}로 갈 거야! 이 저주받은 남작령을 떠날 때까지 멈추지 않겠어\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "0caf8e0b-f859-42d2-8e3b-0bc38a0bc040"
msgid ""
"\"And whom should I blame? Or what?! Who is responsible for everything that "
"happens here? Shouldn't it be the so-called 'ruler'?! Who is to answer for "
"all these deaths, if not you?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 내가 누구를 비난해야 하지? 여기에서 일어나는 모든 일들은 누가 책임지는 거야? 당신이 통치자 아니신가?! 당신이 아니라면 이 "
"죽음에 대한 책임은 대체 누가 지는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "b51f707b-9acc-4a89-91c7-521e28572e1d"
msgid ""
"{n}Verdrin gives a few deep, muffled coughs. The feverish glint in his "
"bloodshot eyes, the glow in his cheeks, the distant look on his face... you "
"have seen this before — this is what the unfortunate servant looked like "
"moments before a monster erupted from his body.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}버드린은 깊은 기침을 몇번 합니다. 그의 충혈된 눈은 빛났고 그의 뺨은 붉게 변했고 그의 얼굴은... 이전에 본 것과 같습니다. "
"이전에 운 나쁜 하인의 몸에서 괴물이 튀어나왔을 때와 같은 증상입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "5d74635b-272c-4a13-9e98-83a5d405b7aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Verdrin muffles a deep cough and wipes blood from his lips with an "
"unsteady hand.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}버드린은 깊은 기침을 하고 자신의 입술에 묻은 피를 불안정한 손으로 닦습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "9e3ed483-28c8-44ad-beff-423a4720ea81"
msgid ""
"{n}Seeing your weapons, the leader of the small group puts himself in front "
"of the sick young man.{/n} \"Just what do you think you are doing?! Get, or "
"you'll have all of us to deal with!\""
msgstr "{n}당신의 무기를 보고 무리의 우두머리는 병든 아이 앞에 섭니다.{/n} \"무슨 짓이야?! 가지 않으면 후회할 줄 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "1f702ac2-bdcd-4a93-a954-2f25cc821001"
msgid "\"What do I care for your apologies... Verdrin is not coming back!\""
msgstr "\"네 사과가 어떻든... 버드린은 다시 돌아오지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "92c9fb2f-98c2-4f24-9934-c87e42418d52"
msgid "\"Why did you take the throne then if you're unable to keep up?!\""
msgstr "\"지키지 못할 거라면 왜 왕좌를 차지한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "95291498-fa1d-4b23-a663-fc7aea105ed6"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}-loyal traitor! I hope you die in a ditch, "
"'baron{mf||ess}'!\""
msgstr "\"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 반역자! 도랑에서 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "ac7ae113-c17c-468f-96c4-4f6c46f8d774"
msgid ""
"{n}Refugee clenches his teeth and shakes his fists in powerless rage.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}난민은 이를 악물고 무력함으로 주먹을 떨고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "042af565-d38d-4e71-b380-9eb607ffe329"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head slowly.{/n} \"This is not food poisoning. The "
"symptoms clearly indicate... I am sorry. I am so sorry...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 머리를 천천히 흔듭니다.{/n} \"이것은 식중독이 아니야. 증상은 분명히 그것이야... 미안하다. 미안하다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f0ed0a77-62ce-4a86-9d8e-71065f3fd611"
msgid ""
"\"Die here, or in {g|Galt}Galt{/g}... From disease, or by the sword... A bit "
"sooner, or a bit later... Our earthly lives are filled with choices, but "
"what change truly comes of them?\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기에서 죽거나 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에서 죽거나... 질병으로 죽거나 칼에 찔려 죽거나... 지금 죽거나 나중에 죽거나... "
"우리의 세속적인 삶은 선택으로 가득하지만 결국 선택으로 무언가 변화하기는 하는 걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4e6c1d0f-14f6-43c7-8cb1-09053019e5bf"
msgid "\"Your ruler is trying to save you, fools.\""
msgstr "\"너희 통치자는 너희를 구하려는 거야. 바보들.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f39e3e04-337a-4d36-be10-22841f235614"
msgid ""
"\"Typical! 'I don't want to get to the bottom of things, though I know "
"exactly who is to blame!'\""
msgstr "\"누구를 비난해야 할지 알더라도 나는 저질스러운 짓은 하고 싶지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/DiseasedRefugees/refugees_leader/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "53d0d452-92f5-4cb6-a0d8-ebeff101b8f3"
msgid ""
"\"Please, {name}, don't allow anger to guide your hand. This man has been "
"crushed by loss and fear – and he will regret his rash words!\""
msgstr "\"제발 {name}. 분노에 휘둘리지 마. 이 자는 상실과 공포로 상처받았어. 그리고 자기가 한 말에 후회를 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Barks/Environment_ArcaneCheck_Stone_Fail_String
msgctxt "c1b9f5e9-864c-49a0-9047-d7bc2b38d0c2"
msgid ""
"This strange grey stone is covered in ancient writing. It hums faintly and "
"you can feel a slight heat coming off of it."
msgstr "이 이상한 회색 돌은 고대 기록으로 덮여 있습니다. 이것은 희미하게 윙윙거리며 약간의 열기가 느껴집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Barks/Environment_ArcaneCheck_Stone_Success_String
msgctxt "cde895fb-685a-4030-9277-ebff2238b98b"
msgid ""
"The stone's surface is covered in mysterious writing… but what interests you "
"more is the stone isn't a stone at all, but a sealed portal from the looks "
"of it."
msgstr ""
"돌의 표면은 불가사의 한 글씨로 덮여 있습니다... 그러나 당신이 더 흥미를 느끼는 것은 그 돌이 아니라 그것을 봉인한 포털입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Barks/Environment_LoreNATURECheck_Body_Fail_String
msgctxt "bd75c76f-b6ae-4a46-8181-c8d951e02787"
msgid ""
"It doesn't look like the victim died peacefully — he was clearly murdered, "
"but you can't tell much more than that."
msgstr "희생자가 평화롭게 죽은 것처럼 보이지는 않습니다. 그는 분명히 살해되었지만 그 이상은 말할 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Barks/Environment_LoreNATURECheck_Body_Success_String
msgctxt "ab3dec73-3e4e-4fea-9c21-af0c0ed3e33f"
msgid ""
"This corpse looks as if it was beaten to death with clubs and hammers — it "
"has a number of broken bones and bruises, mostly on the shins and knees."
msgstr "이 시체는 마치 몽둥이와 망치로 두들겨 맞은 것처럼 보입니다. 부러진 뼈와 타박상은 대부분 무릎 주위에 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Barks/Environment_StoneAfterZzamasAway_String
msgctxt "6b8016d0-71e6-4822-820a-81e595443e85"
msgid "The cold stone doesn't move an inch."
msgstr "차가운 돌은 조금도 움직이지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Barks/Environment_Tracks_String
msgctxt "307ea6fc-7993-44de-b316-1d379898a6fe"
msgid ""
"These tracks are strange — they don't look like anything you've ever seen "
"before."
msgstr "이 길은 이상합니다. 이전에 본 길처럼 보이지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6d9051f2-d570-4d53-b24b-5416bc2fdaf5"
msgid "\"Don't be afraid, I want to talk. What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"두려워하지 마. 나는 너와 얘기하고 싶다. 여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b5bc942f-6e31-4fba-9485-ab1816eeb8fb"
msgid "\"Get out of my sight! Go on, run, or I'll cut you down!\""
msgstr "\"내 눈에서 꺼져! 어서 가! 아니면 너를 베어버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "980d8793-2e5d-4ad2-a59d-cb07fd0f3589"
msgid "Attacked peaceful goblins without warning."
msgstr "경고없이 평화로운 고블린을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "41f7cfe9-0685-4823-9131-cc355c67a31f"
msgid "[Attack] \"I had hoped to spill goblin blood today.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"오늘 고블린 피를 보고 싶어\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "5825a0e9-4979-480f-a109-be0d5c287e50"
msgid "\"I must leave.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "a6e86f8e-f181-4420-815b-41d8f22651de"
msgid ""
"[Point away from the hill] \"Hm. I saw a lot of fat spiders… I mean, "
"lotslegs… somewhere over there.\""
msgstr ""
"[언덕에서 다른 곳을 가리킵니다] \"흠. 나는 뚱뚱한 거미를 많이 봤다... 내 말은, 많은다리 말이야... 저기 어딘가야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "a8a99f47-5870-401c-9438-1c5481eac53c"
msgid "[Give the goblin three rations] \"Here. If you're hungry, eat.\""
msgstr "[고블린에게 식량을 줍니다] \"자. 배고프면 먹어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "16d116af-a5a9-41bb-a151-775f5d3f4b76"
msgid "\"What is that stone on the hill?\""
msgstr "\"언덕 위의 그 돌은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "2906a52f-b4fd-41a2-9559-c4ed8f3e601a"
msgid "\"Seen anything strange around here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐 본 거 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Attack_Goblin1_String
msgctxt "60508eda-b7e1-40ea-a112-e8a750f21276"
msgid "\"Smash the longshanks!\""
msgstr "\"꺽다리를 공격해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Attack_Goblin2_String
msgctxt "392ff2d6-cc90-4fd9-b3fe-3e3e4e4472d8"
msgid "\"Here comes the grub!\""
msgstr "\"여기에 음식이 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Attack_Goblin3_String
msgctxt "02567354-1682-47a4-8b09-0a1461b56ed1"
msgid "\"You be dead!\""
msgstr "\"너 죽었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Bluff_Goblin1_String
msgctxt "8b504992-f4a4-449d-aa56-459af3e03bce"
msgid "\"Lotslegs! Lotslegs! Leg it while they still there!\""
msgstr "\"많은다리! 많은다리! 저기 있으니까 빨리 간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Bluff_Goblin2_String
msgctxt "6e3b63bb-d646-479d-93de-c0001361974a"
msgid "\"Catch, break, skin!\""
msgstr "\"잡아서, 분지르고, 벗겨내자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Bluff_Goblin3_String
msgctxt "40c84c88-bf9b-4f23-a0c6-4936f3590486"
msgid "\"Hurry-hurry!\""
msgstr "\"빨리-빨리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Food_Goblin1_String
msgctxt "323c37a0-74b3-4295-85b9-cccded2c4954"
msgid "\"Mine! All mine!\""
msgstr "\"내 꺼야! 다 내 꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Food_Goblin2_String
msgctxt "8c1fa930-e131-40ad-bc82-2d2ea7a95359"
msgid "\"Stop! Give back!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 돌려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Food_Goblin3_String
msgctxt "459febf6-2730-4d9c-8534-2f9be4eb1f60"
msgid "\"Take away! Grub! Grub!\""
msgstr "\"조심해! 음식! 음식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Intimidate_Goblin1_String
msgctxt "888a465a-c35d-44b4-8e9c-64903e957b05"
msgid "\"Me no hit! Hit others!\""
msgstr "\"나 때리지 마! 다른 녀석 때려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Intimidate_Goblin2_String
msgctxt "4a2f2c93-1231-495f-b332-a897629929a2"
msgid "\"Leg it, leg it!\""
msgstr "\"움직여! 움직여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Barks/Intimidate_Goblin3_String
msgctxt "0fe2e650-3ee6-4161-8999-1d66259854eb"
msgid "\"Longshanks scary!\""
msgstr "\"꺽다리 무섭다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "5d7f3bee-5130-4a05-8dcd-b319d26b1887"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin is glaring at you, grasping his weapon tightly. His wide face "
"is covered in mud, while grass and twigs can be seen poking from behind his "
"ears. The goblin steps back a bit and brandishes his weapon, but half-"
"heartedly — he doesn't seem eager to fight.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린이 당신을 쳐다보며 무기를 단단히 붙잡고 있습니다. 그의 넓은 얼굴은 진흙으로 덮여 있으며 잔디와 나뭇가지가 귀에 "
"꽂혀있습니다. 고블린은 뒤로 물러나 무기를 휘두르지만 그는 싸우고 싶어하지 않은 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8cea2b35-b89a-4820-a6f4-b0be9c33d486"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin shrivels, presses his ears down and starts to back away from "
"you — only to leap even further away and tumble all the way down the hill, "
"shrieking curses.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 떨면서 귀가 쳐졌고 당신에게서 물러나기 시작합니다. 그리고는 더 멀리 떨어지려 하고 언덕 아래로 굴러떨어졌고 저주를 "
"퍼붓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "c8a49783-4b8c-4871-85d5-95121028864f"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin bares his teeth, his red eyes narrowing.{/n} \"Longshanks "
"makes threats! Longshanks pay!\""
msgstr "{n}고블린은 이빨을 드러내며 그의 붉은 눈은 좁아졌습니다.{/n} \"꺽다리가 위협한다! 꺽다리 후회할 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "c62185ae-c36d-4473-a23e-6cca4e52352b"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin glances around, then responds, his voice raspy.{/n} \"Need "
"food. I catch lotslegs. Fat, tasty lotslegs!\" {n}The goblin licks his lips, "
"smiling.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 주위를 훑어보고 즐거운 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"음식이 필요하다. 나는 많은다리를 잡는다. 뚱뚱하고 맛있는 많은다리!"
"\" {n}고블린은 입술을 핥으며 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "712e04a5-c339-4031-872b-85664d210260"
msgid ""
"\"Fat lotslegs! Never seen such fat before!\" {n}The goblin grins widely and "
"licks his lips.{/n}"
msgstr "\"뚱뚱한 많은다리! 그렇게 토실토실한 녀석은 보지 못했어!\" {n}고블린은 흡족한 미소를 지으며 입술을 핥습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "31aaf043-b72d-4f2a-b858-1229d847be2c"
msgid "{n}The goblin shrugs.{/n} \"It shine. It burn. No touch.\""
msgstr "{n}고블린은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"빛났다. 타오른다. 만지면 안된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "4bff8007-0d37-47df-8b08-fa1f01faf812"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin is yelling wildly, eyes aglow, spittle flying out of his "
"mouth.{/n} \"Halfheads, come! Lotslegs for all! Follow me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 격렬하게 외치며 눈은 빛났고 입을 죽 내밉니다.{/n} \"멍청이! 이리와! 많은다리 잡으러 가자! 나를 따라와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "f3cbd418-9a0f-4e14-bfb6-2528b5ae0d96"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin casts a sidelong look in the direction you pointed at but "
"doesn't move. He looks back at you, his eyes narrowed.{/n} \"Noooo. Lotslegs "
"be HERE. I saw one, others come out soon.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 당신 쪽을 불쾌하게 바라보았지만 움직이지 않습니다. 그는 당신을 돌아보고 그의 눈은 좁아집니다.{/n} \"안돼. 많은다리 "
"여기에 있었다. 나는 여기서 봤고 다른 것도 곧 나올 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "fdbd9406-f012-4deb-9a9b-b2794f2e011d"
msgid ""
"{n}As soon as he sees the food, he tears it all out of your hands and takes "
"off, stuffing his mouth as he runs.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그가 음식을 보자마자 당신의 손에 있는 것을 빼앗아 도망치며 입으로 쑤셔 넣습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6d4e505c-ae9b-4b3e-a8b2-09efbf33efe9"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm. Goblins are willing to eat anything, but still, how hungry does one "
"need to be to start hunting spiders?\""
msgstr "\"흠. 고블린들은 식성이 좋지만 여전히 굶주린 녀석들은 어떻게 거미를 사냥하게 되었을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "50a63549-2fa8-4040-909a-2568769c3d09"
msgid ""
"\"Awwwww, poor thing! Look how thin he is… although, goblins do look raw-"
"boned all the time... but these must be desperate if they've started eating "
"spiders.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아이구! 불쌍한 것! 정말 말랐구나... 고블린은 항상 말라보이긴 했어도... 하지만 이 녀석들은 거미를 먹은 걸로 보아 정말 배가 "
"고팠나봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "d3cb55e9-94d2-4143-b190-e25098a28a5a"
msgid "{n}The goblin is staring at you warily, clutching his weapon.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고블린이 당신을 의심스럽게 쳐다보며 무기를 움켜쥡니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "a7ab8983-1ab5-4ba8-9b4f-4b4010603f49"
msgid ""
"{n}In a heartbeat you realize the goblin is not alone on the hill — others, "
"many others, all smeared in clay and disguised with grass and moss, are "
"lying motionless on the slope. Strangely, they don't attack — they are doing "
"their best to remain still and blend in with the grass.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}순간 당신은 고블린이 언덕위에 홀로 있지 않은 것을 알게 되었습니다. 다른 많은 고블린들이 풀과 이끼, 진흙으로 위장을 하고 언덕에 "
"누워있습니다. 이상하게도 그들은 공격하지 않습니다. 그들은 여전히 남아서 풀과 섞이도록 최선을 다하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "2ffad952-b5da-41f4-9e88-8b99a05f01a0"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin looks at you, clearly waiting for you to do something.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고블린이 당신을 보고 당신이 움직이기를 기다리고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Goblins/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "314f9a9e-124c-4101-be21-2b5df0da60d3"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok tugs on your clothing and hisses in warning.{/n} \"Hey, hey! "
"Looksie carefully — many of them around!\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 당신의 옷자락을 당기며 당신에게 경고합니다.{/n} \"이봐! 잘 봐! 주위에 많아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Items/Deadman_book_Name_String
msgctxt "245b7d71-136e-41af-9f14-4d514ff2e139"
msgid "Torn Book"
msgstr "찢어진 책"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/Items/Deadman_book_String
msgctxt "5c8b51d5-556b-4c71-baa4-5724bd59074a"
msgid ""
"The book is torn and covered in mud. Very little of the text survived — just "
"a small fragment of a page spread:\n"
"\"…and this phenomenon is quite similar to what transpires in the Stolen "
"Lands, at a place the local populace refer to as the ‘Ghost Stone'. It is a "
"hill, surrounded by forest and crowned by a gigantic stone. The people say "
"that at night, the hilltop emanates bright light, while the hill itself is "
"shrouded by a thick fog swarming with eerie, sinister shadows. The stone has "
"resided at the hilltop since times immemorial; and those who could have "
"recounted its tale or read the dead language of its inscriptions have long "
"passed away. However, possessing a most intimate knowledge of the history of "
"Avistan, I can claim, with full certainty, that it is one of those places "
"where the veil separating the planes of existence grows especially thin. It "
"is for this reason that portals to other worlds open in such places, through "
"which all manner of mysterious creatures can travel. The folk tales show "
"overwhelming evidence of this: the fog, the strange shadows, the noises. The "
"Stolen Lands abound with such legends like no other part of this world, but "
"for the dangers that await the would-be explorers in this wilderness, it is "
"exceedingly difficult to investigate such accounts with due rigor.\""
msgstr ""
"책이 찢어지고 진흙으로 덮여있습니다. 글자를 거의 읽을 수 없습니다. 단지 페이지 조각의 작은 글을 읽을 수 있을 뿐입니다.\n"
"\"...이 현상은 지방 주민들이 도둑맞은 땅의 '유령 돌'이라고 부르는 곳에서 일어나는 현상과 매우 유사하다. 그곳은 숲으로 둘러싸여 "
"거대한 돌로 둘러싸인 언덕이다. 밤에는 언덕이 두터운 안개와 기이한 그림자로 가득 차고 산 꼭대기는 밝은 빛을 낸다고 사람들이 말한다. "
"돌은 고대부터 언덕 꼭대기에 있었으며 비문에 쓰여진 언어는 오래전에 사라졌고 이 장소에 관한 이야기를 하던 자들은 오래전에 사라졌다고 "
"한다. 하지만 아비스탄의 역사에 대해 가장 뛰어난 나의 생각에 이 장소는 존재의 면을 분리시키는 장막이 가장 얇아지는 곳일 것이다. 이런 "
"이유로 다른 세계로의 포털은 모든 종류의 불가사의한 생물들이 여행할 수 있게 되었다. 들려오는 전설이 많은 증거를 뒷받침한다. 안개와 "
"이상한 그림자와 소음이 그것이다. 도둑맞은 땅에 들려지는 이러한 전설들은 여행자들에게 두려움을 심어주기에 이야기를 조사하는 것은 쉽지 "
"않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "2d519ee7-1369-4b6a-bc45-73dd9ada19db"
msgid "\"Who are you? Or what are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지? 생물이 맞긴 한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "3887c4d9-8784-48c7-ba0c-0523a3a911bf"
msgid "\"Get out of my head, now!\""
msgstr "\"내 머리에서 당장 나가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "1607d642-8513-45a6-8856-3068703fd595"
msgid "\"What do you want?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 원하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "c136c9f8-f284-47af-b3bd-87c1ea8d31b0"
msgid "\"Why do you speak so strangely?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 이상하게 말하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "b5e357d9-830e-4cea-90ac-79180ceb9b30"
msgid "\"I'm not inclined to trust strange voices in my head. Show yourself.\""
msgstr "\"나는 머리 속의 이상한 목소리를 믿을 생각이 없어. 모습을 드러내라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "5e983eaf-fcba-496a-b4c4-6ef96105a2ee"
msgid "\"Where is this stone you spoke of?\""
msgstr "\"네가 말한 돌은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "482d0a63-1fe0-48ea-a0d1-70b329ded25a"
msgid "\"I think I should leave.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "e0dd1b82-9942-4dbf-92c5-c4a99729c34f"
msgid ""
"\"I'll... see what I can do. I'll go there now and take care of the "
"'predators'.\""
msgstr "\"내가 할 수 있는 것을 보겠다. 나는 지금 가서 포식자들을 상대할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "0c29e434-770d-468e-8e5a-3b31c9466e4a"
msgid "\"Reward? You will reward me if I help you?\""
msgstr "\"보상이라고? 너를 도우면 보상해줄 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "516fccd9-70c2-40a2-a0ce-0debed3bc80c"
msgid "\"Who sent you here, and why?\""
msgstr "\"누가 너를 여기로 왜 보냈지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "10cb8651-1804-4c65-bba3-df66c54389f5"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear a strange, faint humming noise, like a swarm of locusts in the "
"distance — then suddenly, the noise rises to a painful shrieking in your "
"ears!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n} 멀리서 메뚜기 떼처럼 이상하고 희미한 윙윙거리는 소리가 들립니다. 그러더니 갑자기 그 소리가 귓가에 고통스러운 비명을 "
"지릅니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "edec4f00-5f07-4415-b4f3-15f0dbb5ed4a"
msgid ""
"{n}Suddenly, you find you can make out words in the din — the words are "
"disjointed and hard to make out, but someone is clearly trying to speak to "
"you.{/n} \"Help, yes?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}문득 당신은 잡음 속에서 단어를 알아낼 수 있다는 것을 알게 됩니다. 그 단어들은 혼란스럽고 이해하기 어렵지만, 누군가가 분명히 "
"당신에게 말을 걸려고 하고 있습니다.{/n} \"도와 주겠니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "cd8eeb23-0146-4211-8ebe-f6377f53b2f6"
msgid ""
"\"Traveler. Way home. Friend. Jester. Jest. Escape. Trap. Pain. Wound. "
"Blood. Powerlessness. Blood. Cold. Heat. Darkness. Darkness. Darkness. "
"Light. Predators. Attack. Run. Loss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여행자. 집에 가는 길. 친구. 광대. 광대. 도망자. 함정. 고통. 상처. 피. 무력함. 피. 차가움. 열. 어둠. 어둠. 어둠. "
"빛. 포식자. 공격. 도망쳐. 손실.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "ea0abefb-610a-47bd-b110-52860a5636d9"
msgid "\"Wish. Home.\""
msgstr "\"그립다. 집.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "f9d09267-9573-4907-92cf-41ae4f526d89"
msgid ""
"\"Help. Help. Help. Help. Help...\" {n}The creature keeps repeating the word "
"over and over again, until it is swallowed by the painful background hum.{/n}"
msgstr "\"도움. 도움. 도움. 도움. 도움...\" {n}그 괴물은 고통스러운 목소리로 반복합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "c549c81c-7454-4b4b-886b-7f8cfb954034"
msgid ""
"\"Stone. Predators. Multitude. Powerlessness. Help. Defense. Cleanup. Path. "
"Home.\""
msgstr "\"돌. 포식자. 무리. 무력함. 도움. 방어. 정화. 길. 집.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "b1feb337-36ba-40d6-a28a-3e74b2e107e5"
msgid ""
"{n}Drawing upon your arcane knowledge, you discern that the strange being, "
"whatever it may be, has stumbled into a trap which turned out to be a "
"portal, and was injured. You are not sure what the predators are it "
"mentioned, but they must have attacked the creature while it was on this "
"side of the portal.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마법 지식을 바탕으로 당신은 그 이상한 존재가 포탈로 뛰어들어 부상당한 것을 알게 되었습니다. 당신은 포식자가 무엇을 뜻하는지 알 "
"수 없었지만 그들은 분명히 포털의 이쪽 편에 있었을 때 생물을 공격했을 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "96217ce9-23ab-4952-b816-864230576cad"
msgid ""
"{n}You are able to piece the jumbled words together with some difficultly — "
"near as you can tell, the stranger is asking you to get rid of the "
"mysterious \"predators\" that drove it away from the stone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 간신히 뒤죽박죽이 된 단어를 나열할 수 있었습니다. 그 이상한 생물은 돌에서 그것을 접근하지 못하게 하는 포식자를 당신에게 "
"없애달라고 부탁하는 것이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "bb6b5164-75ac-412a-aebe-14b0f3944e67"
msgid "\"Rescue. Predators. Banishment. Death. Reward. Presents.\""
msgstr "\"구원. 포식자. 추방. 죽음. 보상. 선물.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "98ca8ee7-eccc-4e9a-b2ce-360ac045934f"
msgid "{n}Rustling and whistling is all you hear in response.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 대답으로 살랑거리는 휘파람 소리를 듣습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "178d37e1-887b-4b1c-baa9-e7358f3e24ed"
msgid "\"Fear. Fright.\""
msgstr "\"싸움. 공포.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "11db1e61-d7c8-4ae5-afe8-fb121fef252f"
msgid "\"Straight. Hill. Top.\""
msgstr "\"곧장. 언덕으로. 꼭대기.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b660d90a-1cdd-45dd-82be-118e8df3775c"
msgid ""
"\"Who are you talking to? Me?\" {n}Octavia looks around with a raised "
"eyebrow.{/n} \"There's no one here. Are you seeing things?\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구에게 말하는 거지? 나야?\" {n}옥타비아는 눈썹을 들어올리고 주위를 돌아봅니다.{/n} \"여기에는 아무도 없어. 너는 볼 수 "
"있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fe7a2275-5d1c-4171-980c-40bb60a32179"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun freezes and watches you closely. He remains silent, but you notice "
"he is reaching for his weapon.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 얼어붙어서 당신을 가까이서 지켜봅니다. 그는 침묵을 지키지만 당신은 그가 무기에 손을 대고 있음을 알게 됩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "ddc60611-bb99-4421-9817-8862577aaa35"
msgid ""
"\"Easy there! If you've decided to act the fool and start talking to "
"yourself, at least stop shouting!\""
msgstr "\"진정해! 바보처럼 혼자서 얘기하기로 생각했다면 적어도 소리는 지르지 말라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "460b4cfe-a1b9-46ea-80a6-9ccb4f3147b4"
msgid ""
"\"What, is this a jest? I must say, you've picked a poor time to show off "
"your... Sense of humor. Drop this ridiculous charade at once.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐, 농담이라구요? 정말이지, 지금 당신의 그... 유머 감각을 자랑할 때가 아니지 않습니까. 이 웃기는 짓거리는 집어 치우죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "177930a7-836a-42f0-984b-84d516b7df95"
msgid ""
"\"Help! Help! Hill! Top! Predators! Home! Home!\" {n}The humming in your "
"head fades, then vanishes entirely.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"도와줘! 도와줘! 언덕! 꼭대기! 약탈자! 집! 집!\" {n}당신의 머리에서 윙윙거리는 소리가 서서히 그리고 완전히 "
"사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "e4368251-7d07-40b0-bbfd-eac578493312"
msgid "\"Home. Wish. Gratitude. Presents.\""
msgstr "\"집. 소원. 감사. 선물.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "bf0fcc1d-acd5-4735-933e-bde5f557f6c9"
msgid ""
"\"No idea who you were talking to just now, but seems we're in for another "
"adventure!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 지금 누구와 이야기하고 있는지 모르겠지만, 우리를 또 다른 모험에 끌어들인 것 같아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "23bd9c9f-933e-4b0a-865d-2bc3779a366c"
msgid ""
"\"Wonderful. Our fearless {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, who, mind you, has "
"not at all taken leave of any of {mf|his|her} senses, except for the "
"'common' one, has struck a deal with {mf|his|her} imaginary friends. My "
"heart may rest easy! Surely, these 'predators' are nothing more but an "
"unruly mob of meadow bunnies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"훌륭해. 우리의 용맹한 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이 정신을 아주 단단히 차리고는 있는데, 실례지만 그 정신이 '제정신'은 아닌거 "
"같군. 그녀의 상상 친구와 거래를 체결했다고 하니 말이야. 아주 마음이 놓이는 걸! 그 '포식자들'이라고 해봤자 말 안듣는 지푸라기 "
"토끼떼 정도일테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b890dabc-fa1c-423c-b425-f6f25d78b6f3"
msgid ""
"\"Don't take this the wrong way, but... have you lost your mind? You were "
"talking to yourself! Are you sure that we should do whatever it is you were "
"talking about with your... errm-m-m... invisible interlocutor?\""
msgstr ""
"\"일을 이상한 쪽으로 끌고가지 마십시오, 하지만.... 정신이 나간 건 아니죠? 자기가 자신에게 얘기를 하다니! 정말 보이지 않는 "
"상대가 얘기하는 대로 할 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "122ba075-9180-4694-85b8-7c065d6a06db"
msgid "\"Presents. Bag. Items. Multitude. Hill. Predators. Banishment.\""
msgstr "\"선물. 가방. 물품. 군중. 언덕. 약탈자. 추방.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasDialog/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "1ec5894b-d838-4820-a4d1-a113ff9edc3a"
msgid "\"Friend. Jester. Fey.\""
msgstr "\"친구. 광대. 페이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b8bda242-2b94-40dd-9330-f8e08427757d"
msgid "\"By the gods, what are you?!\""
msgstr "\"맙소사. 대체 너는 누구야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9e5e47ff-c602-4d08-b36d-0d0a2bd0fb71"
msgid "[Attack] \"Die, vile creature!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"죽어라. 사악한 생물!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "cc198962-6ef7-4b9c-afe4-f22c22e4eae6"
msgid "\"So you were the one the goblins were after?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 네가 고블린이 쫓았던 자인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "0ef86fbc-8346-4cdd-87ef-6dd76649329b"
msgid "\"Where have you come from to our world?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어느 세계에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "0cc58fc2-e660-443e-93a7-d2bed88b86e0"
msgid "\"I have helped you. Where is my reward?\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 도왔다. 보상은 어디 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "09ea6b35-5424-457e-a169-a8f088ae84ff"
msgid "[Leave] \"The path is clear. I hope you find a way back. Farewell!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"길은 분명하다. 네가 되돌아갈 길을 찾기를 바라. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "9c1a1e3b-423c-4be2-9c89-137766315347"
msgid "\"What is your name?\""
msgstr "\"네 이름은 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "635d302f-3cd1-481e-9e84-3d08f136ebdb"
msgid ""
"\"I found a corpse in the bushes! Was it you who killed that traveler?\""
msgstr "\"나는 덤불에서 시체를 발견했어! 그 여행자를 죽인 사람이 너였어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "7d1c1fb1-7356-4d1b-8d9e-0df44d30f204"
msgid "\"You're limping... are you hurt?\""
msgstr "\"너는 절뚝거리고 있다... 다쳤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "01a7cc09-79c5-43e9-837c-bce9a47b096f"
msgid "\"Help. Path. Home. Joy. Friend.\""
msgstr "\"도움. 길. 집. 기쁨. 친구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "339bd31a-23b6-4a2d-9e3e-572604d6cdfe"
msgid "\"Traveler. Passer-by. Lost. Wandering.\""
msgstr "\"여행자. 지나감. 잃음. 방랑.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "f60dfcfa-7af3-4981-9c57-2774cd02ad21"
msgid "\"Predators. Murder. Fear. Hide-and-seek.\""
msgstr "\"포식자. 살인. 공포. 숨바꼭질.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "0fc29734-db27-4c68-8520-cc45abab45d6"
msgid ""
"{n}The creature in front of you is silent for a few moments, then speaks.{/n}"
" \"Multitude. Fey. Primeval.\""
msgstr "{n}당신 앞에 있는 생물은 잠시 침묵을 지키고는 말합니다.{/n} \"무리. 페이. 원시 시대.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "b8ed0fc2-bfca-429c-950f-ff44cf0485a5"
msgid ""
"{n}The strange creature in front of you points at the bushes it emerged "
"from.{/n} \"Bag. Items. Multitude.\""
msgstr "{n}당신 앞에서 이상한 생물은 그것이 나온 덤불을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"가방. 물품. 무리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "5a491be9-9fad-4ad6-a106-9382b94c0ff3"
msgid "\"Gratitude. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"감사. 작별 인사.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "81fc6747-84b3-41a0-9be2-b49b46eed8f0"
msgid ""
"{n}The creature emits a series of sharp clicks that vary in pitch. Most "
"likely, this is its name, but you would be hard-pressed to repeat it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}이 피조물은 높낮이가 다른 날카로운 소리를 다양하게 냅니다. 이름처럼 들리지만 따라 말하기는 어렵습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "8c05fd1c-a16d-44b7-af34-088ca8b60695"
msgid "\"Past. Innocence. Fear.\""
msgstr "\"과거. 순수. 두려움.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "1757ee48-bd94-4265-95ae-b6402590a78f"
msgid "\"Agreement. Pain. Enemy. Run. Loss.\""
msgstr "\"계약. 고통. 적. 도망. 상실.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "dd380286-41f1-49a0-9f06-50769a81ea3b"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost's eyes widen. He pulls a notepad from his pocket and flips "
"through it frantically, looking between it and the creature.{/n} \"Wait, "
"where was it...? Aha! Right! I can't believe it. Do you know what this is? "
"Goblins take me, this is a phase spider, straight from the {g|First World}"
"First World{/g}! I have so many questions... Why, why did I never learn to "
"speak Aklo when I had the chance?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트의 눈이 커졌습니다. 그는 자신의 주머니에서 메모장을 꺼내 미친 듯이 넘기고는 생물과 노트를 번갈아봅니다.{/n} \"잠깐"
". 어디 있었지...? 아하! 맞아! 믿을 수가 없어. 이게 뭔지 알아? 고블린들이 나를 데려가겠군. 이건 {g|First World} "
"태초 세계{/g}에서 넘어온 위상 거미야! 나는 궁금한 게 많았는데... 기회가 있었을 때 왜 나는 Aklo 언어를 배우지 않았지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GhostStone/ZzamasEndDialog/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "920ddb11-cd44-48dc-a447-19172d29ff4a"
msgid "\"Incredible! You get to see so many wonders in these lands!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없어! 이 땅에서 수많은 경이로움을 보는구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Ambush_GoblinsAttack_01_String
msgctxt "708d3070-202b-4d6a-8735-37cd47408c83"
msgid "\"Grab the longshanks! Nok them to their knees!\""
msgstr "\"꺽다리를 잡아라! 무릎을 꿇려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Ambush_GoblinsAttack_02_String
msgctxt "22e54d61-7c30-4ff1-b926-3c5a6cc22be4"
msgid "\"Lamashtu-serving be killing, be burning!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투시여! 살육과 방화를 하게 하소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Ambush_GoblinsAttack_03_String
msgctxt "ba1f8bf5-5e9e-40d1-9a9d-869d9398c310"
msgid "\"Longshanks get in shaman's way — bring them low and make them pay!\""
msgstr "\"꺽다리가 샤먼의 길로 간다! 그들 잡아 죗값 치루게 하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Bark_GoblinShamanRun_String
msgctxt "b1c8ae8c-7f5d-4d0f-89eb-cd8718631787"
msgid "\"Guards! Kill them!\""
msgstr "\"경비병! 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/DrunkGoblins_01_String
msgctxt "5234be9f-6ce8-4cd7-8637-1ba08bc2a315"
msgid "\"Hic...\""
msgstr "\"흐엑...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/DrunkGoblins_02_String
msgctxt "52e32e4e-e6b3-4bf3-8fb1-de889fd8ef55"
msgid "\"Drink jagwart! Praise Lamashtu!\""
msgstr "\"재그와트를 마셔라! 라마슈투를 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/DrunkGoblins_03_String
msgctxt "0010a248-0168-4a35-87f8-8fe1ef6ded6b"
msgid "\"Hah! I be seeeing longshanks! Good jagwart, strooong...\""
msgstr "\"하! 꺽다리다! 재그와트 좋다, 아주 좋아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/DrunkGoblins_04_String
msgctxt "9084df4f-975f-477b-8083-0023d514f7b9"
msgid "\"Hey, why you pour me less?! Pour more, or I make you headhurt!\""
msgstr "\"나는 왜 적게 주는 거야? 더 부어! 아니면 머리를 때려줄 테다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/DrunkGoblins_05_String
msgctxt "926a5d6e-4ff5-41a0-adfd-c0d800f3d153"
msgid "\"Belly on fire! Head be stone! And ground go round — oooh!\""
msgstr "\"배에 불이 붙었어! 머리는 돌처럼 굳었고! 땅이 흔들린다! 우욱!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/EnterKesten_01_String
msgctxt "c9f38651-2f47-40ac-b3cb-8e96bfc4e42d"
msgid ""
"\"These people need help. Find some food and blankets for them. And keep "
"your eyes open!\""
msgstr "\"이 사람들은 도움이 필요해. 음식과 담요를 찾아. 그리고 지켜보고 있으라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/EnterPeasants_01_String
msgctxt "f7b5fbfa-f09d-4932-81e6-705e3e39ffef"
msgid "\"Help! Goblins are upon us!\""
msgstr "\"도와주세요! 고블린들이 공격해 오고있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/EnterPeasants_02_String
msgctxt "41d7991b-9f78-416a-9fdd-9eacc6742a7f"
msgid "\"Your Grace, make haste! Help the defenders of the camp!\""
msgstr "\"영주님, 서둘러야합니다! 어서 야영지의 수비대를 도와주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment01_Hut_String
msgctxt "e09802b4-8147-4389-a046-7709e5656c2e"
msgid "The thatched roof of this broken-backed hut smells of rot and mold."
msgstr "망가진 오두막집의 초가 지붕에서 썩은내와 곰팡이 냄새가 납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment02_Hedge_String
msgctxt "b7016f11-15ba-4acc-a78e-45b1b592489a"
msgid ""
"The crude fence is made out of splintered logs crudely tied together with "
"reed rope."
msgstr "조잡한 담장은 갈대 밧줄로 부채꼴의 형태로 통나무를 묶어논 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment03_DrinkingArea_String
msgctxt "86243be5-4103-42f9-98cf-ae278c3944a0"
msgid ""
"The ground is littered with shattered cups that reek of foul-smelling "
"alcohol."
msgstr "땅은 썩은 알콜 냄새가 나는 액체가 뿌려져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment04_BrokenCage_String
msgctxt "c5a60cd5-7c15-4fbd-85b3-9669252ebabe"
msgid ""
"The lock was torn out of the cage, and the metal bars bent out of shape."
msgstr "감옥 자물쇠가 부서졌고 쇠 창살은 구부러졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment05_DeadBody_String
msgctxt "c983bf62-f289-4c9b-89eb-79b7f6447a94"
msgid "The wounds on the man's body were left by goblin spears."
msgstr "남자 시체의 상처는 고블린 창으로 생긴 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment06_BloodOnStone_String
msgctxt "054356d9-efca-45be-a91c-2af47d6854cb"
msgid "The stone is sticky with blood."
msgstr "돌은 피로 끈적끈적합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment07_Leftovers_String
msgctxt "a18e2403-086b-49b4-8d9d-dad70568eeee"
msgid "Scattered in the dirt are bones, bits of meat, and other leftovers."
msgstr "흙에 흩어져있는 것은 뼈, 고기 조각과 같은 것들입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment08_WaterOnEarth_String
msgctxt "847fbaf5-7995-4ff3-a1d1-6daf5a8ca641"
msgid "The ground here is soaked."
msgstr "땅은 젖어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Enviroment09_Totem_String
msgctxt "e8399e1f-9ba6-4e05-9d56-cfd74961656e"
msgid "The totem is covered in blood and colorful blotches."
msgstr "토템은 피와 화려한 얼룩으로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FinalCampFight_Guards01_String
msgctxt "78839a46-07e9-4417-973a-44272f14382e"
msgid "\"Erastil have mercy on us!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이 우리에게 자비를 베풀기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FinalCampFight_Guards02_String
msgctxt "05f1edc0-0054-43bc-9d26-154a9d4994f8"
msgid "\"Protect the survivors!\""
msgstr "\"생존자를 보호하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FinalCampFight_Guards03_String
msgctxt "af3a0e27-ce78-4a70-a5a7-75c794b3ca1c"
msgid "\"Merciful gods, the baron{mf||ess} is here!\""
msgstr "\"자비로운 신이시여! 남작이 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FortFight_KingAfterWinningDuel_String
msgctxt "b589d9ed-0328-4917-a55b-7417e3a92f75"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok be beating up! This place, he know! Now the others smash-to-bits!\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹이 치고 있다! 이 곳 그가 알고 있다! 이제 다른 녀석들 부순다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FortFight_KingBeforeFight_String
msgctxt "bf989733-ccfa-48ae-8aad-0ba5ae623727"
msgid "\"Death to drenchbreeches! Smash, smash, smash!\""
msgstr "\"저녀석에게 죽음을! 부셔라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FortFight_KroonkAfterWinningDuel_String
msgctxt "dfc7ca20-7fe1-49c6-ac13-8e0a889d238d"
msgid "\"Crown be mine! Me better-be! Me be Lamashtu's favored!\""
msgstr "\"왕관은 내 거야! 내 거야! 내가 라마슈투의 축복을 받았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FortFight_ShamanAfter_String
msgctxt "f30f5c0a-03db-476f-9c9f-77ff7b4de88c"
msgid "\"Lamashtu can't be stopped... Bloom... be... soon...\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투는 멈출 수 없다... 역병이 곧...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FortFight_ShamanBefore_String
msgctxt "acce4159-f280-442e-b531-a3b78d56667a"
msgid "\"Death you seeks — death you finds!\""
msgstr "\"네가 찾던 죽음이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/FortFight_ShamanDuring_String
msgctxt "7f7a833f-dbed-49a7-aeef-6bb7a8b886c2"
msgid "\"We don't give up! Lamashtu be with us! Bread-breeders will bloom!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 포기하지 않아! 라마슈투는 우리와 함께 한다! 빵을 먹는 녀석들은 역병에 걸릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KestenPrisoners_01_String
msgctxt "c30d9d3d-9f1c-41c0-b242-3a872a8c6d8b"
msgid "\"Erastil save our souls! Your Grace, have mercy!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이 우리의 영혼을 구하길! 자비를 베풀어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KestenPrisoners_02_String
msgctxt "81616eec-3269-4204-b798-4bddc272d4ba"
msgid "\"Somebody, help!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Kesten_WhenKillingPeasants_String
msgctxt "08eab021-0265-45d1-8751-33fa7ae9cb08"
msgid "\"No, Your Grace! Stop!\""
msgstr "\"아니! 그만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KroonkKingCutscene/Dialog01_Kroonk_String
msgctxt "54e91e2e-ef30-4eb5-be7d-3b039363d7f1"
msgid "\"Hey, shatstank drench-breeches! Come out, fight — you, me!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 멍청아! 나와라, 싸우자 — 너와, 나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KroonkKingCutscene/Dialog02_Kroonk_String
msgctxt "8447a083-8d69-4568-938f-ef67d5688253"
msgid "\"We see who Lamashtu-favored here!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투가 누구를 더 좋아하는지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KroonkKingCutscene/Dialog03_King_String
msgctxt "541ba2cc-b952-40e3-bb8c-586d587f0ae1"
msgid "\"You be puny-full! No way, you swindle-try, traytor!\""
msgstr "\"너는 형편 없어! 너는 사기꾼이야, 배쉰자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KroonkKingCutscene/Dialog04_Kroonk_String
msgctxt "1f621acf-2acb-4e9e-93a9-47ab0a17c0df"
msgid ""
"\"What, you ah-fraaaaaaid? Coward! Look, look all, the king be cluck coward!"
"\""
msgstr "\"뭐야, 거어어어업먹었어? 겁쟁이! 봐라, 다들 봐, 왕은 겁쟁이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KroonkKingCutscene/Dialog05_King_String
msgctxt "564032cb-8782-4df7-a1f6-836b8ffc733a"
msgid "\"I no fear you! Shut up! I will fight, I will!\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐! 나는 네가 무섭지 않아! 싸우자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KroonkKingCutscene/Dialog06_King_String
msgctxt "f1430858-d9b7-42e0-9a1a-596d8682468c"
msgid "\"Others stay back! Only we, me-him, fight!\""
msgstr "\"다른 자들은 물러서라! 나와 그의 일대일 싸움이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/KroonkKingCutscene/Dialog07_Kroonk_String
msgctxt "0b268821-e824-4efe-8b7a-d33c67919e38"
msgid ""
"\"I nok you left, right, chin, head until that crown fly off, shatshank!\""
msgstr "\"왕관이 날아갈 때까지 왼쪽, 오른쪽, 턱, 머리를 칠꺼다, shatshank!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners1_FreedPeasant_01_String
msgctxt "60f4c7c1-cd4f-41f8-8e4e-1722915396c2"
msgid "\"Praise be to Erastil! Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸을 찬양하라! 고맙습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners1_FreedPeasant_02_String
msgctxt "849519f0-1fbb-444e-8c38-7ef290d5616e"
msgid "\"We'll make it to the camp on our own. Please, save the others!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 야영지에 직접 갈거야. 다른 사람들을 구해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners1_GoblinAttack_01_String
msgctxt "55818068-953d-470a-84a9-fe9717749c86"
msgid "\"Grab 'em! Throw 'em in cage!\""
msgstr "\"잡아라! 그들을 감옥 안에 던져라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners1_GoblinAttack_02_String
msgctxt "8c1021b1-3d4a-49b6-856b-2c19c96c1599"
msgid "\"Shaman make you all deep-drink!\""
msgstr "\"샤먼이 너에게 마실 것을 줄 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners1_Pleas_01_String
msgctxt "b4253486-d087-44f4-acc5-985249f94d0b"
msgid "\"Please, help! Break the lock!\""
msgstr "\"제발 도와줘! 자물쇠를 부셔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners1_Pleas_02_String
msgctxt "583a475e-bc15-47e2-8244-00d4bbb7387c"
msgid "\"Quick, help us before more goblins arrive!\""
msgstr "\"고블린이 도착하기 전에 빨리 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners2_GoblinAttack_01_String
msgctxt "029763fd-4cfa-4d7f-bc1c-de5bd283a196"
msgid "\"AAIIIEEEE! Enemies attack! Smash them!\""
msgstr "\"아아아! 적이 공격한다! 그들을 부숴라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners2_GoblinAttack_02_String
msgctxt "240e60de-af6e-464b-86da-2da4de1bd96b"
msgid ""
"\"Bite their hand, kick their teeth! Cut their scalps and bring to chief!\""
msgstr "\"그들의 손을 물고, 이빨을 걷어차라! 두피를 잘라 족장에게 가져가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_Narru_Before_String
msgctxt "09e8e5fd-764f-4000-b12a-9c98bc81f8f8"
msgid "\"HEY! HEY! OVER HERE! HEEEERE! LET ME OUT! LET ME OUT RIGHT NOW!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 여기야! 여기! 나를 꺼내줘! 지금 당장 꺼내줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_Narru_Freed_String
msgctxt "affc0d83-7518-41a5-abe4-e957bf6c16ea"
msgid ""
"\"At last! If I make it out of this alive, I'll never set foot in these "
"lands again!\""
msgstr "\"마침내! 내가 살아나가면 다시는 이 땅에 발을 들여놓지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_Narru_NotFreed_String
msgctxt "daa0e355-7255-4e90-8f7f-42677ecbf503"
msgid "\"WHAT?! NO! LET ME OUT! LET ME OUT!\""
msgstr "\"뭐야? 안돼! 나를 꺼내줘! 나를 꺼내줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_OthersFreed_01_String
msgctxt "63c1f54b-ced0-476b-8020-f59781ba8a9b"
msgid "\"I will survive. I have to get back to my family...\""
msgstr "\"나는 살아남을 거야. 나는 내 가족에게 돌아가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_OthersFreed_02_String
msgctxt "5da81fff-d2c5-4477-9311-6d3ed09c6941"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace, I shall pray to Erastil for you till the end of my days!\""
msgstr "\"내가 죽을 때까지 너를 위하여 에라스틸에게 기도할게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_OthersFreed_03_String
msgctxt "bc28b715-554a-455a-ae29-5f05571db297"
msgid ""
"\"Careful, Your Grace. The goblins keep prattling on about this 'Bloom'... "
"that doesn't sound good.\""
msgstr "\"조심해. 고블린들은 계속 역병에 대해 말하고 있어... 예감이 좋지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_OthersLocked_01_String
msgctxt "ed1e81ff-7dd5-4ae2-ba91-a4caa21235e6"
msgid "\"My prayers have been answered! Save us!\""
msgstr "\"내 기도가 응답되었다. 우리를 구해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_OthersLocked_02_String
msgctxt "076a469c-d5f8-4ce7-ba8c-a7cd0bf1189e"
msgid "\"Let us go before they take us up there!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 우리를 데려가기 전에 우리를 보내줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Barks/Prisoners3_OthersLocked_03_String
msgctxt "c559e3bb-7894-4b56-aeb5-51b0bbf99939"
msgid "\"Your Grace! Don't leave me!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 나를 떠나지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "8f75d11e-00d2-4e94-bf70-22c2b8f3012a"
msgid ""
"The {mf|baron|baroness} gave an impassioned speech on honor in noble duels "
"and the importance of settling disputes in a just and dignified manner."
msgstr "당신은 고귀한 결투에서 인상 깊은 발표를 했고 위엄있게 분쟁 해결의 중요성을 제시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4d6ed627-9251-4bd0-bd02-08ecbd4bcaaf"
msgid ""
"The {mf|baron|baroness} spoke to the crowd in the goblin tongue and "
"explained in single-syllable words why the king was surely done for!"
msgstr "당신은 고블린 언어로 군중에게 왜 왕이 끝났는지 간결하게 설명했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "20954d39-4d29-4cb9-b486-3b705e88a732"
msgid ""
"The {mf|baron|baroness} did not deign to speak to the assembled goblins, "
"demonstrating {mf|his|her} contempt of the undersized vermin."
msgstr "{mf|남작|여남작}은 서투른 고블린 언어를 사용해 자신이 키가 작은 괴물들을 경멸한다는 말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "54b05929-86cd-482d-9164-1ea09ac5ec3b"
msgid "...Nok-Nok hid right behind the king's back!"
msgstr "...녹-녹은 왕의 등 뒤에 숨었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "691866ac-63f9-4d95-b125-6f23abef9db7"
msgid "...Nok-Nok decided to hide right in the cauldron set over an open fire!"
msgstr "...녹-녹은 불이 붙은 가마솥에 숨기로 결정했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "5a255571-5bd0-44ee-b463-430718bc5f37"
msgid "...Nok-Nok climbed on the roof of the nearest hut."
msgstr "...녹-녹은 가장 가까운 오두막의 지붕에 올라갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "589ec334-a3ad-436f-9ebd-398a2f978f73"
msgid "...dodge the blows."
msgstr "...강타를 피했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "bf44795e-5f3b-4b4b-92d2-ccb117c93841"
msgid "...take to his heels and run around the fire."
msgstr "...불 주위를 달렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "7ef5d6fa-da16-45f6-80c7-cd3bc16e7841"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "d1b02057-ec8b-4201-9659-2f6ce3b4aeab"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "d5f73b41-0ed6-4596-9628-48bf7f8708f0"
msgid "...a wasp nest!"
msgstr "...말벌 둥지입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "7fb06786-1188-4922-9910-9c0516a1b997"
msgid ""
"He daringly ripped the crown off his adversary and placed it on his head!"
msgstr "그는 대담하게 상대방에게서 왕관을 빼앗아 머리에 썼습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "8a665681-6ca5-4295-903a-dac20f8c2d34"
msgid "...a handful of straw."
msgstr "...빨대 한줌입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "1b858704-a4d9-40c1-be08-2c81adbe382b"
msgid "...his own shoe!"
msgstr "...자신의 신발입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "bbbaece6-428c-44f0-baa8-19e59af5c6d3"
msgid ""
"He offered his adversary a chance to lower his weapons and forge a "
"friendship stronger than any feud!"
msgstr "그는 사절에게 무기를 내려놓고 우정을 쌓자고 제안했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "6d62ef18-ffc9-4954-acee-398a6c9a3f31"
msgid ""
"He leapt out from behind the goblin king's back with a wild howl, trying to "
"frighten him!"
msgstr "그는 고블린 왕의 뒤에서 뛰어나와 사나운 울음 소리로 그를 겁주려고 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "7c53de8c-3226-4b4e-aea9-5497143c1302"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "4ab5a0b8-e67c-473e-b918-d6949444117b"
msgid "...fall to his knees and beg for mercy."
msgstr "...무릎을 꿇고 자비를 구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "a30d2886-2120-4340-b174-8f474b00215b"
msgid "...began to shower the king with insults."
msgstr "...왕에게 모욕을 퍼붓기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "5984611b-2580-4aeb-b5da-9c5685d5b497"
msgid "...tried to distract the king."
msgstr "...왕의 주의를 산만하게 하려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0076_Text
msgctxt "b8dbd83a-25ed-4388-91ab-0d6d15827941"
msgid "...feigned death."
msgstr "...죽은 척했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "b8b02dd0-4819-4af7-8345-4ae94de4727d"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "8e1027bd-f8fa-4751-afef-8896bdfe4287"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "8cd0e8d8-7bfd-454e-b44f-479cf8f95b91"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "4a785593-41da-4eb3-ac4a-0268db3bd5e0"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "2af55e15-dea7-45e2-b572-b858572304ed"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0114_Text
msgctxt "b038c81a-1e33-4b59-b3d8-9453675a8d4d"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0124_Text
msgctxt "0f0dd6f0-dfc7-44a2-a23b-8445879a93ad"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Answer_0125_Text
msgctxt "ce36f8da-0f09-4c79-9ec8-0975fdeb2085"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c5c564e0-46c4-4773-8c31-14137fd9120e"
msgid ""
"And so it came to pass that we would bear witness to a true goblin duel! "
"Renowned scholars would have paid a steep price to be in our place... and "
"would have paid thrice more afterwards to be anywhere else than inside a "
"camp teeming with goblins!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 진정한 고블린 결투를 목격할 것입니다! 저명한 학자들은 이 결투를 보기 위해 많은 돈을 지불했을 것입니다... 그리고 고블린으로 "
"가득 찬 야영지 안이니 당신은 더 많은 돈을 벌었을 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "5064338d-01a4-415f-aa6b-5b661689c5c2"
msgid ""
"The news the king was going to fight the insolent intruder spread through "
"the tribe like wildfire — the goblins gathering around the fire began to "
"yell and shout so loud, it was as if they wanted {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} "
"herself to hear! The king looked impressive, but Nok-Nok, our questionable-"
"but-brave \"leader\", showed no sign of fear — on the contrary, he swelled "
"up with pride, reveling in the moment!"
msgstr ""
"왕이 오만한 침입자와 싸운다는 소식은 부족 내에 산불처럼 퍼졌습니다. 불 주위에 모인 고블린들이 큰 소리로 외쳤고 마치 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}"
"가 듣기를 바라는 것 같았습니다! 왕은 인상적이었습니다. 하지만 미심쩍지만 용감한 우리의 \"지도자\"인 녹-녹은 두려운 기색을 보이지 "
"않았습니다. 반대로, 의기양양했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "5f8e9356-2260-4129-a441-6fe0d218a1a6"
msgid ""
"Hundreds of small, red eyes instantly focused on the baron{mf||ess}! I would "
"have been at a loss in such a situation, but our ruler didn't miss the mark!"
msgstr "수백 개의 작은 빨간 눈이 즉시 당신에게 집중되었습니다! 그런 상황이라면 나는 기절했을 테지만 우리의 통치자는 멀쩡했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "3444cc43-d5b4-49fa-af79-133c3f0c1003"
msgid ""
"This speech could have marked a place for itself in the rhetoric textbooks "
"as a prime example of high public style! The baron{mf||ess} talked and "
"talked, obviously inspired by the presence of an audience... However, "
"{mf|his|her} savage, slow-thinking listeners were incapable of appreciating "
"the lofty spirit of {mf|his|her} address. A portion of the crowd stared at "
"the baron{mf||ess} with mouths wide open, others yawned and scratched their "
"noses, and a few were snoring — while standing up!"
msgstr ""
"이 연설은 수사학 교과서에 실려도 이상하지 않았을 것입니다! 당신은 청중의 존재에 영감을 얻어 얘기하고 계속해서 얘기했습니다. 하지만 "
"당신의 야만적이고 생각이 느린 청중들은 당신의 연설을 이해하지 못했습니다. 군중 일부가 입이 벌어진 채로 당신을 보았고 다른 이들은 "
"하품을 하거나 코를 후볐습니다. 일부는 서서 코를 골았습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "300af9ff-d2e7-4acd-aa15-708930ad1fe6"
msgid ""
"Where did {mf|His|her} Grace ever learn to talk like that?! Uttering "
"strange, often obscene words, slurring the endings and mixing up suffixes, "
"the baron{mf||ess} was giving a speech better than {mf|he|she} had expected —"
" not only did the goblins gaze on in rapt fascination, almost hypnotized, "
"but {mf|he|she} also caused {mf|his|her} followers to listen in horrified "
"fascination at how each word was mangled, slaughtered, yet somehow still "
"comprehensible."
msgstr ""
"연설하는 법은 어디서 배운 걸까요?! 가끔씩 이상하고, 외설적인 단어를 내뱉으며, {mf||여}남작은 예상보다 잘 해냈습니다. 고블린들은 "
"넋이 빠진 채, 거의 최면에 걸린 듯 당신을 바라보았습니다. 뿐만 아니라, 당신이 내뱉는 단어 하나하나에 충격을 받으면서도, 어째서인지 "
"이야기를 잘 따라가며 무섭도록 몰입했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "f0aea54e-c8c3-4c12-aa7b-6ee83074dfbf"
msgid ""
"The ardent speech might have gone on indefinitely, but the trance was broken "
"by a shriek from the goblin crowd.\n"
"\"Nok-Nok gone!\"\n"
"Who would have thought?! While the whole tribe was busy listening to the "
"baron{mf||ess}, our \"champion\" had vanished! The startled king came to his "
"senses and began to tear apart the area, shaking his blade and screaming "
"curses!"
msgstr ""
"열렬한 연설은 영원할 것 같았지만 그 열기는 고블린 군중 속의 비명 소리로 멈추었습니다. \n"
"\"녹-녹이 없어!\" \n"
"누가 이런 일이 일어날 거라고 생각했을까요?! 고블린들이 당신의 연설을 듣느라 바쁜 동안 우리의 \"챔피언\"은 사라졌습니다! 깜짝 놀란 "
"왕이 정신을 차렸고 주변을 칼로 휘두르며 저주를 퍼부었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "cd2a7e92-2726-4833-81e2-91fdc867003e"
msgid ""
"The king wasn't the sort to tolerate sneaking right under his nose. "
"Screaming in rage and raising his blade, he rushed at Nok-Nok!"
msgstr "왕은 자신에게 매복을 한 자를 용서하지 않는 부류였습니다. 분노에 찬 비명을 지르고 칼을 휘두르며 녹-녹에게 달려들었다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "0fdd9572-cffe-4071-894b-ecde3a10fde1"
msgid ""
"There was no time to think — Nok-Nok was standing right in front of an "
"enraged, seasoned goblin warrior eager to skin him alive! Our fearless "
"companion had nothing left to do but to…"
msgstr ""
"생각할 시간이 없었습니다. 분노하고 노련한 고블린 전사 앞에 서있는 녹-녹은 산 채로 껍질이 벗겨질 수도 있었습니다! 우리의 두려움을 "
"모르는 동료는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "b5d22b46-c1ad-4969-992b-d87b0b592d9e"
msgid ""
"Goblins are known for their ability to slip through the tiniest cracks and "
"to fit into the smallest spaces. They are also notoriously voracious and bad "
"at predicting the consequences of their actions. It shall remain unknown "
"what was the downfall of our goblin friend — the haste or the desire to "
"feast upon whatever was left in the cauldron, but it didn't affect the sad "
"outcome."
msgstr ""
"고블린은 가장 작은 균열을 통과하고 가장 작은 틈에 들어갈 수 있는 능력으로 유명합니다. 그들은 또한 탐욕으로 악명이 높고 예측할 수 "
"없는 행동으로도 악명이 높습니다. 우리 고블린 친구의 결말은 어떻게 될지 모릅니다. 솥에 있는 것이 빠른자를 축하할지 욕심있는 자를 "
"축하할지 몰랐지만 결과가 슬프지는 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "6da9984d-2ee2-4ab8-b136-47a8b07720b9"
msgid ""
"Nok-Nok's undertaking ended in a yelp of pain and an overturned cauldron, "
"whence tumbled out our scorched companion, his skin steaming and covered in "
"the foul brew."
msgstr ""
"녹-녹은 고통으로 비명을 지르며 솥을 뒤집었고 우리의 부상당한 동료는 피부에서 김이 났고 더러운 국물을 뒤집어 쓴 채 걸어나왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "bcaaec3d-b56c-47b6-93cf-98d76021a145"
msgid ""
"Indeed, our nimble little friend had somehow climbed on the roof of the "
"nearest hut and was now looking out from behind the edge — clearly, he was "
"about to throw at his enemy the first thing that came into his hand!"
msgstr ""
"실제로 우리의 민첩한 작은 친구는 결국 가장 가까운 오두막집의 지붕에 올라갔고 모퉁이에서 지켜보고 있습니다. — 그는 손에 잡히는 첫 번째 물건을 "
"적에게 던질 것이 분명해 보였습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "552f6dd9-11a1-414f-a19b-e6f05dde5af9"
msgid ""
"Doing his best not to betray his anxiety, the unsuspecting king waddled "
"straight into the trap! Nok-Nok sprang to his feet, took aim at his "
"opponent, and with a victory cry, threw..."
msgstr "자신의 배짱을 믿으며 왕은 덫으로 의심 없이 걸어갔습니다! 녹-녹은 펄쩍 뛰었고 적을 겨냥했고 승리의 함성을 질렀습니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "8ec3ecd6-2a36-4f6b-9506-9f9e0e84fce7"
msgid ""
"What fun! Nok-Nok managed to slip by the king and was now hiding right "
"behind his back, dancing silently and making rude faces! The other goblins "
"burst into laughter — or, to be precise, into cackling and snide giggling, "
"all the while pointing fingers at their king!"
msgstr ""
"웃지 못할 일이었습니다! 녹-녹은 왕을 스치며 지나갔고 그의 등 뒤에 숨어서 소리 없이 춤을 추며 우스꽝스러운 표정을 지었습니다! 다른 "
"고블린들이 웃음을 터뜨리기 시작했습니다. 정확히 묘사하자면 왕에게 손짓을 하면서 낄낄거리며 웃었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "de14a5ea-9e46-469f-8575-de4dda3a996c"
msgid ""
"Such treatment infuriated Nok-Nok's opponent even more, and he spun around "
"in rage trying to see what was the cause for all the merriment. Nok-Nok had "
"no more time for joking around!"
msgstr ""
"그런 대우에 녹-녹의 상대는 더욱 불쾌해졌고 그는 무엇이 웃음의 원인인지 알아내기 위해 화를 내며 몸을 이리저리 돌렸습니다. 녹-녹은 더 "
"이상 농담 할 시간이 없었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "c6b5d876-1d04-42cd-866c-8b03a8de5e11"
msgid ""
"Bam! The wasp nest that Nok-Nok had ripped off the edge of the roof hit the "
"king straight in the face! Even such a foul and robust goblin couldn't t "
"handle the buzzing swarm of stings — he swayed on his feet and collapsed to "
"the ground..."
msgstr ""
"녹-녹이 지붕 가장자리에서 뜯어낸 벌집은 왕의 얼굴을 때렸습니다. 사악하고 거친 고블린조차 윙윙거리는 벌집을 감당할 수 없었습니다. 그는 "
"비틀거리며 땅에 쓰러졌습니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "3c466d02-b274-4141-9b9e-d8f69197d761"
msgid ""
"The only thing Nok-Nok achieved with this attack was loss of cover! Now our "
"roguish companion had to scamper down and fight one-on-one!"
msgstr "공격으로 녹-녹은 덮개를 잃었을 뿐이었습니다! 이제 우리의 악동은 일대일로 싸워야 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "cd128d00-5cff-43bb-90cc-21cf8c7605f8"
msgid ""
"However, the tribe members were not wasting time — as soon as it sunk into "
"them they were going to be next, they scattered! In moments, no one remained "
"around the fire except for Nok-Nok, who was grumbling, frustrated by not "
"getting a chance to gloat over his opponent's defeat."
msgstr ""
"하지만, 부족원들은 시간을 낭비하지 않았습니다 — 그것이 그들에게 떨어지자 마자, 그들은 흩어졌습니다! "
"곧, 상대의 패배를 한탄할 기회를 얻지 못해 답답해 투덜거리는 녹-녹을 제외하고는 아무도 불 주변에 남아 있지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "c580546d-7629-4cfe-80ae-62b9249c1c2c"
msgid ""
"Is dry grass indeed the most dangerous thing one can find on a roof?! "
"Whatever the case, the straw caused no significant harm to the bewildered "
"king — it just stuck in his already hideous crown."
msgstr ""
"지붕 위의 마른 풀이 가장 위험한 것일까요?! 어떤 경우이던간에 지푸라기는 당황한 왕에게 큰 해를 끼치지 않았습니다. 그것은 그저 왕관에 "
"꽂혀있을 뿐이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "fd07bc9a-ce5a-4858-9cb2-2cb68c020377"
msgid ""
"We reminded Nok-Nok that the ultimate victory still lay ahead. We had to "
"face the true villain — the shaman, the one behind infecting untold numbers "
"of people and spreading the horrific disease."
msgstr ""
"우리는 녹-녹에게 아직 진짜 승리를 거두지 못했다고 알려줬습니다. 우리는 진정한 악당과 맞서야만 했습니다. 그것은 무수한 사람들을 질병에 "
"빠뜨리고 끔찍한 전염병을 퍼뜨린 샤먼이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "48624b1a-0b82-4886-9db7-5b170b3f1bd5"
msgid ""
"As the blade rose above Nok-Nok's defenseless head, the baron{mf||ess} could "
"wait no longer.\n"
"\"To arms!\"\n"
"The goblin duel was over. And even though Nok-Nok had lost, his new allies "
"weren't about to stand and watch him get killed in front of their very eyes!"
msgstr ""
"무방비 상태인 녹-녹의 머리 위로 칼날이 올라 갔을 때 남작은 더 이상 기다릴 수 없었습니다.\n"
"\"전투 준비!\"\n"
"고블린 결투는 끝났습니다. 녹-녹이 졌더라도 그의 새로운 동료들은 그가 죽는 모습을 절대 볼 수 없었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "4155e872-43e1-4ae8-98e9-9cc5c7160d46"
msgid ""
"Nok-Nok decided not to test his fate and give up. Perhaps, this might have "
"worked if he were battling someone else... but goblins are hardly known for "
"their mercy and compassion!"
msgstr ""
"녹-녹은 자신의 운명을 시험하지 않기로 결정하고 포기했습니다. 아마도 그가 다른 이와 싸웠다면 효과가 있었을 것이지만... 고블린은 "
"자비와 연민을 몰랐습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "189e2247-e04d-47ed-bdad-56662dd22fb7"
msgid ""
"All of Nok-Nok's nimbleness and craftiness evaporated in the face of the "
"dreadful king. Our poor fellow managed to dodge only a few blows before he "
"tripped over a mound of dirt and tumbled to the ground!"
msgstr ""
"두려워하는 왕의 얼굴을 본 녹-녹은 의욕을 잃었습니다. 우리의 불쌍한 동료는 그져 몇번의 강타를 피했을 뿐이었고 그는 언덕 위로 "
"뛰어오르다가 땅에 쓰러졌습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "c3c3eadc-bb19-4d7f-a4ef-afd6b616311d"
msgid ""
"Everyone has his limits — even goblins! After a while of panting and "
"stomping around pointlessly, the worn-out king stopped to catch his breath. "
"Nok-Nok, on the other hand, was still full of vim and vigor, and thus he "
"decided it was time to strike back. A frontal assault wasn't the way — he "
"needed to take the enemy by surprise!"
msgstr ""
"누구나 자신의 한계가 있습니다. 심지어 고블린도 말입니다! 헐떡거리며 주위를 방황하던 왕은 지쳐서 숨을 고르기 위해 멈췄습니다. 녹-녹은 "
"한편 여전히 활기가 넘쳐서 반격하려고 했습니다. 전면 공격이 해결책은 아니었습니다. 그는 적을 기습해야 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "fe1d9b91-528c-4db3-a5ba-adfc2b3fcfcf"
msgid ""
"I can state with full confidence — none of the long-legged witnesses of this "
"duel could have expected the deranged goblin to do what he did next. Or may "
"it be that pulling off such insane stunts is the prose of life for his folk?"
"\n"
"Without thinking twice, Nok-Nok..."
msgstr ""
"나는 완전히 확신할 수 있습니다. 다리가 긴 목격자 중에 누구도 이 결투에서 저 미친 고블린의 다음 행동을 예측할 수 없을 것입니다. "
"아니면 그런 미친 행동이 고블린들에게는 하나의 삶의 표현일까요?\n"
"두 번 생각하지 않고 녹-녹은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "7e1529b1-5e65-4da3-a674-a889e09ae9d8"
msgid ""
"To our amazement, Nok-Nok swayed on his feet, rolled his eyes, and collapsed "
"into the dust as if poleaxed! Taken aback, the audience went completely "
"still. Silence hung in the air."
msgstr "놀라서 녹-녹은 비틀거리면서 눈알을 굴리다가 힘 없이 쓰러졌습니다! 청중은 완전히 사라졌습니다. 침묵이 공기를 메웠습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0086_Text
msgctxt "7817d0bf-1666-4fe5-bb7f-a1723edd5d70"
msgid ""
"Throwing out his arm and pointing with his finger at something behind the "
"king's back, Nok-Nok cried out in sheer terror.\n"
"\"GREATMOTHER! GREATMOTHER BE FLYING!\"\n"
"Perhaps, this trick might have worked if Nok-Nok chose different words. "
"Alas, our companion had greatly underestimated the religious feelings of his "
"compatriots, who didn't take lightly to uttering {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} "
"name in such a frivolous manner."
msgstr ""
"팔을 뻣어 손가락으로 왕의 등 뒤를 가리킨 녹-녹은 공포로 비명을 질렀습니다.\n"
"\"위대한 어머니! 위대한 어머니가 난다!\"\n"
"아마도 녹-녹이 다른 단어를 선택했다면 속임수는 효과가 있었을 것입니다. 우리 동료는 동족들의 종교적 감정을 과소평가한 것 같습니다. "
"그들은 열정적으로 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}라고 말하는 것을 쉽게 받아들이지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "693a0106-38a0-4975-8f60-a0879fcae64a"
msgid ""
"It was clear — the duel was over, and the baron{mf||ess} had to defend "
"{mf|himself|herself} and the ill-fortuned goblin hero from the infuriated "
"tribe members and their triumphant, bloodthirsty king."
msgstr "그것은 분명했습니다. 결투가 끝났고 남작은 피에 굶주린 왕과 분노한 부족들로부터 자신과 운이 없는 고블린을 방어했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "46927d31-b36c-47ae-b761-9f60b4ea9cda"
msgid ""
"Nok-Nok's sudden \"death\" turned out to be an effective bluff, if not the "
"most subtle. After his unwise opponent came closer, our nimble friend sprung "
"to his feet and sunk his teeth into the king's hand — the one holding the "
"blade!"
msgstr ""
"녹-녹의 갑작스러운 \"죽음\"은 멋지지는 않았지만 효과적인 허풍이었습니다. 현명하지 못한 그의 상대가 가까이 왔고 우리의 민첩한 친구는 "
"재빠르게 뛰어올라 칼을 든 왕의 손을 물었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "cb2ada46-b924-44d5-8ba0-e83ffc2c3188"
msgid ""
"Screeching, the goblin lord started jumping around the fire, striking Nok-"
"Nok on the head with his left hand. As if that made any sense! If goblins "
"have anything truly thick and rock-solid, it's their skulls."
msgstr ""
"비명을 지르며 고블린 왕은 불 주위를 뛰어다니며 녹-녹의 머리를 왼손으로 치기 시작했습니다. 하지만 소용이 없었습니다! 고블린의 두개골은 "
"두껍고 바위처럼 단단했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "8b18d66c-3fa9-41d1-957d-7a793d4ff45c"
msgid ""
"Nok-Nok tried to berate the king, but be it due to stress, or lack of "
"inspiration, every insult came out flat, even pathetic. It wasn't enough to "
"shake the king's spirit — having come to his senses, he charged Nok-Nok and "
"bowled him over."
msgstr ""
"녹-녹은 왕을 놀리려 했지만 긴장 탓인지, 혹은 영감이 부족해서인지 모든 모욕은 밋밋하고 불쌍하기까지 했습니다. 왕의 마음을 흔들기에는 충분치 "
"못했습니다. 그가 정신을 차리자 녹-녹에게 달려들어서 던져버렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "c8c13b10-533b-4b37-8fbe-3666e55c342b"
msgid ""
"While the panting king fought to catch his breath and regain a stance more "
"befitting his royal stature, Nok-Nok took a deep breath and... no, no, no... "
"I cannot put to paper what my ears heard on that day! What if in the future "
"the chronicles of the barony will be read by children?!"
msgstr ""
"헐떡거리는 왕이 숨을 멈추고 체통을 지키는 동안 녹-녹은 심호흡을 하고는.... 하고는... 나는 차마 내가 그 날 들은 것을 책에 쓸 "
"수 없었습니다. 미래에 남작의 연대기를 아이들이 읽는다면 어떻게 하려고요?!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "dc047d72-cfc7-4447-9e98-87d951e34877"
msgid ""
"Shame! Shame like no other goblin monarch had been subjected to since the "
"Earthfall! Soon, the sneers and insults were followed by rocks and clods of "
"dirt. Without waiting for the missiles to turn into something more hefty or "
"sharp, the king retreated... slowly, then broke into a run. The crown he "
"dropped was trampled by goblins, who gave chase to their defeated chieftain."
msgstr ""
"부끄럽습니다! 이 땅이 생겨난 후로 그렇게 수치스러운 고블린 왕은 없었을 것입니다! 곧 비웃음과 모욕이 바위와 진흙 덩어리와 함께 "
"날라왔습니다. 더 큰 것이 날라오기 전에 왕은 빠져나와 달렸습니다. 그가 떨어뜨린 왕관은 고블린에게 짓밟혔고, 고블린은 패배한 족장을 추격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0105_Text
msgctxt "a01a8205-f755-4949-b6c4-e7e56aeb6884"
msgid ""
"Of course, Nok-Nok could only regret that he never got a chance to gloat in "
"his fallen enemy's misery. But the deed was done — the king had lost and ran "
"away, and his subjects, having realized that without their lord and "
"protector they'd all be next in line for a proper beating, pelted away at "
"once. In a few moments, no one remained by the fire except for the "
"{mf|baron|baroness}, {mf|his|her} companions, and Nok-Nok, who was trying to "
"dig the trampled crown out of the muck."
msgstr ""
"물론 녹-녹은 패배한 적의 불행을 감상하지 못했다는 사실만을 후회했습니다. 하지만 이미 벌어진 일이었습니다. 왕은 패배해 도망쳤고 그의 "
"백성들은 왕이 없으니 자신들이 그 다음이 될 거라는 것을 깨달았습니다. 잠시 후 {mf|남작|여남작}과 {mf|그의|그녀의} 동료, 그리고 짓밟힌 왕관을 진흙에서 파내려는 "
"녹-녹을 제외하고는 아무도 불 옆에 남아 있지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0106_Text
msgctxt "553f08ab-83fe-47a0-a5af-6f04ba8b3c21"
msgid ""
"Alas, true victory lay ahead: the {mf|baron|baroness} had yet to meet the "
"main green-skinned villain, the one responsible for spreading the disease — "
"the shaman, who was hiding somewhere in the fort. Thus, the daring heroes "
"went in search for him."
msgstr ""
"아아. 진정한 승리가 눈 앞에 있었습니다. {mf|남작|여남작}은 역병을 퍼뜨린 녹색 피부의 악당을 아직 만나지 못했습니다. 그 샤먼은 요새 "
"어딘가에 숨어있었을 것입니다. 그래서 용감한 영웅들은 그를 찾으러 수색을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0107_Text
msgctxt "bc0c224f-c5ba-401b-b7ff-f72feb707242"
msgid ""
"\"Hah! I won! I be Lamashtu-liked!\" The king leapt towards his fallen foe "
"and gleefully kicked his corpse. \"I show everyone! First this drench-knot, "
"then the shamaaaAAAAAIEEE!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 내가 이겼다! 내가 라마슈투의 선택을 받은 자야!\" 왕은 쓰러진 적에게 도약해서 기뻐하며 그의 시체를 걷어찼습니다. \"모두에게"
" 내 힘을 보여주었다! 와아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0110_Text
msgctxt "2269e6b0-4180-49a6-a574-9ad0cca8f953"
msgid ""
"In defense of the {mf|baron|baroness}, {mf|he|she} did {mf|his|her} best to "
"demonstrate {mf|his|her} oration skills, but a crowd of lowly goblins is "
"hardly the right audience! Perhaps had {mf|His|Her} Grace spoken louder, "
"{mf|he|she} would have had at least some hope of being heard... However, Nok-"
"Nok didn't get a chance to bemoan this disappointment — he was caught by "
"surprise as the goblin king suddenly rushed at him, waving his blade all "
"around!"
msgstr ""
"자신을 보호하기 위해 {mf|남작|여남작}은 연설을 하려고 했지만 멍청한 고블린들은 적절한 청중이 아니었습니다! 아마도 {mf|남작|여남작}이 더 크게 말했더라면 "
"고블린들이 듣기라도 했을 것입니다... 하지만 녹-녹은 실망할 틈도 없었습니다. — 고블린 왕이 갑자기 달려와 칼을 사방으로 휘두르자 "
"깜짝 놀랐습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0113_Text
msgctxt "768960dc-19f2-4fc7-b698-f76935cc39c3"
msgid ""
"Bam! The wasp's nest almost hit the target and shattered into pieces right "
"at the king's feet. However, that was more than enough to reach a decisive "
"victory — a swarm of enraged insects was all over the king in an instant, "
"and he broke into running, losing his crown on the go!"
msgstr ""
"말벌의 벌집은 목표물 주변에 부딪혔고 왕의 발치에 산산조각이 났습니다. 하지만 승리를 결정 짓는 것은 바로 이것이었습니다 - 격렬한 말벌 때가 "
"왕을 공격했고 그는 왕관을 버리고 도망치기 시작했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0115_Text
msgctxt "f59ba121-3503-4de4-972a-27da9bb6ccfb"
msgid ""
"Nok-Nok managed to rip the crown from the king's head, but alas! In the nick "
"of time, having caught wind of the enemy behind his back, the king "
"desperately grabbed onto his headwear! A tug-of-war ensued, the crown "
"slipped from goblin claws — it tumbled to the ground, its pieces scattered "
"across the dirt! The king couldn't bear such a disgrace — without his crown, "
"accompanied by the humiliating howling of his kin, he fled!"
msgstr ""
"녹-녹은 왕의 머리에서 왕관을 뺏었지만 적에게서 등 뒤를 잡힌 왕은 필사적으로 왕관을 잡으려고 했습니다! 줄다리기가 계속되었고 왕관은 "
"고블린 손톱에 채여 미끄러져 땅에 떨어져 조각이 났습니다! 왕은 그런 굴욕은 참을 수 없었습니다. 왕관이 없이 야유를 퍼붓는 동족들을 "
"뒤로 하고 그는 달아났습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0118_Text
msgctxt "14c2c191-b2ae-431a-bd84-f3be38c4df9e"
msgid ""
"So, how did this unusual and victorious adventure end? It ended with Nok-"
"Nok's utter triumph, who not only humiliated the despicable goblin king, but "
"was also rewarded with a well-deserved trophy — the crown that had "
"previously adorned the chieftain's head!"
msgstr ""
"그렇다면 평범하지 않은 이 모험은 어떻게 끝났을까요? 녹-녹은 승리를 외치며 고블린 왕을 모욕했을 뿐만 아니라 걸맞는 상도 받았습니다. "
"그 상은 왕의 머리를 장식하던 왕관이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0119_Text
msgctxt "2404a6ae-d819-4e65-b797-5e5a8c40c1de"
msgid ""
"What a ludicrous idea! How did it get into the head of a cunning and "
"treacherous goblin? Obviously, it didn't have a good outcome..."
msgstr "정말 이상한 생각이었습니다! 어떻게 그런 교활한 고블린의 머리에 들어갔을까요? 분명히 좋은 결과가 나타나지 않았을 것입니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0121_Text
msgctxt "153bf967-ef8d-425f-b0c7-54c8524c6d2b"
msgid ""
"An earlier flight might have saved Nok-Nok's head, but alas — in a rush, he "
"didn't notice a treacherous root, sticking out of the ground, and collapsed "
"right at his pursuer's feet."
msgstr ""
"조금 더 빨리 알아차렸더라면 녹-녹의 머리는 안전했을 테지만 그는 땅 위에 튀어나온 뿌리를 발견하지 못했고 추적자의 발 아래에 "
"쓰러졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0122_Text
msgctxt "6a350cec-82f3-4e08-8c46-c9a2a2c67f44"
msgid ""
"To the left! To the right! To the side! Back! The goblins' movements "
"resembled a bizarre and savage dance. With one exception — one of the "
"partners was constantly trying to turn the other into a bloody mess!"
msgstr ""
"왼쪽으로! 오른쪽으로! 옆으로! 뒤로! 고블린의 움직임은 기괴하고 야만적인 춤과 흡사했습니다. 파트너 중 한명이 계속해서 상대편을 "
"피투성이로 만들려는 사실을 제외하고는 그것은 춤이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0127_Text
msgctxt "66e3d351-fed3-4523-8a4f-7a9927db4703"
msgid "In fact..."
msgstr "사실..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0128_Text
msgctxt "7f309d84-3de6-4108-b438-3e759acd3ee7"
msgid ""
"The boot hit his opponent's forehead with a loud, satisfying thud, but "
"caused little harm — it only angered the king even more, for now he had been "
"made a fool twice!"
msgstr ""
"적의 이마를 발로 때리자 크고 만족스러운 타격음이 들렸지만 피해를 입히지는 않았습니다. 그것은 왕의 분노를 돋구었고 이제 그는 두 번 "
"속았습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0129_Text
msgctxt "0d225d70-574d-4bf5-a29f-e49bd83661ed"
msgid ""
"...just to jump out of his skin the next moment and flee from a swarm of "
"furious wasps, screaming wildly as he did so! Only a crown was left lying on "
"the ground — it had tumbled off the head of the fleeing coward."
msgstr ""
"...다음 순간에 뛰어서 격렬한 말벌 떼를 피해 달아났고 거친 비명을 질렀습니다! 오직 왕관만이 땅에 남았습니다. 그것은 도망가는 "
"겁쟁이의 머리 위에서 벗겨진 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0130_Text
msgctxt "010d0316-a26e-44de-bc23-d26aa8c47ced"
msgid ""
"The only thing that was left of Nok-Nok's enemy were the fragments of his "
"headgear. The \"crown\" that used to adorn the chieftain's head was now "
"lying in the dust under our feet, trampled and crushed."
msgstr ""
"녹-녹의 적에게 남겨진 유일한 것은 머리 장식 조각이었습니다. 왕의 머리를 장식하던 \"왕관\"은 먼지를 뒤집어쓰고 짓밟히고 부서져 우리 "
"발 밑에 놓여있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0131_Text
msgctxt "77577467-b5b5-4eaf-bb60-533616a0ff40"
msgid ""
"This, however, was not the end of Nok-Nok's troubles — before he even knew "
"it, the viciously grinning king rose in front of him, ready to cut him down!"
msgstr "그러나 녹-녹의 문제가 끝난 것은 아니었습니다. — 그가 알기도 전에 악의적으로 웃는 왕이 일어나 그를 베려고 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0132_Text
msgctxt "a5a31f34-ba26-406b-8957-b09be0eac7ad"
msgid ""
"\"Drench-knot! Blasphemer! Halfhead!\" The crowd got noisy and began to "
"tighten around Nok-Nok, litter and rocks were flying at the baron{mf||ess} "
"and {mf|his|her} party, and the boldest goblins were picking up the weapons "
"they had been leaning against mere moments ago."
msgstr ""
"\"멍청이!\" 군중이 웅성거리며 녹-녹 주위를 좁혀들기 시작했고 쓰레기와 돌이 남작과 그의 동료들에게 날라들었습니다. 용감한 고블린들은 "
"무기를 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0133_Text
msgctxt "e0f1b5ab-47e0-4d06-9961-83cc002e9f46"
msgid ""
"At last, having almost fallen into the open fire, the king managed to rip "
"Nok-Nok off of him. But it was too late — the surrounding goblins, who had "
"only recently been so afraid of their monarch, were now rolling on the floor "
"laughing."
msgstr ""
"마침내 싸움 직전에 이르렀을 때 왕은 녹-녹을 떼어냅니다. 하지만 너무 늦었습니다. 얼마 전까지 왕을 두려워했던 주위의 고블린들은 바닥을 "
"구르며 웃고 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0134_Text
msgctxt "9c19a1d1-8eac-493b-a911-4ab8dabda9e7"
msgid ""
"Alas! Our goblin companion was not nimble enough this day. No sooner had he "
"carried out his cunning plan, than a careless step and the crackling of dry "
"grass under his foot gave away his position — and the enemy knew where Nok-"
"Nok was!"
msgstr ""
"아아! 오늘 우리 고블린 동료는 민첩하지 않았습니다. 그가 머리를 쓰려고 한 지 얼마 되지 않아 그는 부주의하게 움직여 인기척을 내었고 "
"적은 녹-녹이 어디있는지 알게 되었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0135_Text
msgctxt "61635888-5dc8-401f-91bf-ef6592fa8a6f"
msgid ""
"Nok-Nok went down like a (small) tree, but the king didn't fall for his "
"trickery. Screaming angrily, he leapt at his helpless, prone opponent and "
"prepared to finish him!"
msgstr "녹-녹은 작은 묘목처럼 쓰러졌지만 왕은 속지 않았습니다. 분노로 비명을 지르며 그는 적에게 뛰어들었고 그를 끝내려 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0136_Text
msgctxt "0a843ed1-479c-422e-80d3-7717e6a86e3b"
msgid ""
"It seems that scornful silence was not what Nok-Nok had expected from the "
"baron{mf||ess}. However, he didn't have the time to express his grievances — "
"not waiting for the duel to officially start or for his opponent to draw his "
"weapon, the king rushed our goblin ally, waving his blade!"
msgstr ""
"경악에 빠진 침묵은 녹-녹이 남작에게서 기대했던 것이 아니었습니다. 그러나 그는 자신의 불만을 표현할 시간이 없었습니다. 결투가 공식적으로 시작되거나 "
"상대가 무기를 뽑을 때까지 기다리지 않고 왕은 우리의 고블린 동료에게 칼을 휘두르며 달려들었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0137_Text
msgctxt "8a966b17-281f-4b43-8c89-a5829c2468e9"
msgid ""
"The duelists were surrounded by an incredible number of gapers, and judging "
"by the weapons in their hands and the nonsensical rusty armor, even the camp "
"guards were summoned by the shouting. Having carefully examined the crowd, "
"Nok-Nok threw a glance at the baron{mf||ess} and solemnly announced...\n"
"\"My followers will say!\""
msgstr ""
"둘은 수많은 관중들에 의해 둘러싸였고, 그들의 무기와 말도 안되는 녹슨 갑옷으로 판단하건데 야영지의 경비는 고함을 듣고 급히 온 것 같습니다. 조심스레 군중을 "
"살핀 후 녹-녹은 남작에게 눈짓했고 엄숙하게 발표합니다...\n"
"\"내 추종자들이 말할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0138_Text
msgctxt "50164e1d-85bd-48bf-bac4-4ee3437b520c"
msgid ""
"The baron{mf||ess} exchanged glances with {mf|his|her} companions, and the "
"party stepped aside silently. Of course, a goblin duel had to start with a "
"competition in one of the most prolific goblin arts — hide-and-seek! Without "
"a doubt, Nok-Nok was lurking somewhere near — but where?"
msgstr ""
"남작은 동료와 시선을 교환하였고 일행은 조용히 비켜섰습니다. 물론 고블린의 결투는 고블린들이 가장 즐기는 예술로 시작되었습니다. 그것은 "
"숨바꼭질이었습니다! 의심의 여지 없이 녹-녹은 어딘가로 숨었습니다. 하지만 어디로 숨었을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0139_Text
msgctxt "b26a74d7-c842-4ef6-aa1c-db2aa57c419f"
msgid ""
"Nok-Nok scolded the king roundly — he lambasted his dubious ancestry, the "
"king's over-attention to cleanliness, manners, and even called him out for "
"engaging in intentional bathing and washing. So varied and manifold were the "
"insults, even the king's own subjects couldn't refrain from shouts of "
"approval, then snide chuckles, and finally — full-blown impish laughter!"
msgstr ""
"녹-녹은 왕을 꾸짖었습니다. 그는 왕의 깔끔함과 매너를 꾸짖었고 심지어 과도하게 씻는 그의 태도마저 욕했습니다. 모욕은 너무나 다양했고 "
"왕조차도 자신의 백성이 소리치는 것을 막을 수 없었습니다. 마침내 그들은 낄낄거리더니 폭소를 터뜨렸습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0140_Text
msgctxt "4a843201-f496-4364-9470-b4a928fc4f9b"
msgid ""
"The trick worked brilliantly — the king, scared to death by Nok-Nok's sudden "
"appearance, fell to the ground with a squeal. His headdress tumbled from his "
"head and slid into the mud, pieces falling off of it into a mound of junk.\n"
"\"NO! I GIVE UP! I GIVE UP!\"\n"
"A heavy silence hung over the scene... only to explode in a roar from dozens "
"of throats! The goblins were shouting, shrieking, stomping their feet and "
"the rear-ends of their weapons on the ground — all to hail the daring "
"victor! Nobody even noticed the king flee the camp without so much as "
"picking up his crown — no doubt eager to be gone before the tribe decided to "
"sacrifice the coward to their gods!"
msgstr ""
"속임수는 훌륭했습니다. 녹-녹의 갑작스런 출현으로 왕은 겁에 질려 넘어졌습니다. 그의 머리 장식은 미끄러져 진흙 속으로 빠져졌습니다.\n"
"\"안돼! 항복! 항복!\"\n"
"무거운 침묵이 흘렀고... 일부는 포효하기 시작했습니다! 고블린들은 외쳤고 발을 구르며 무기로 바닥을 두들겨 승리를 환호했습니다! 아무도 "
"왕이 왕관을 버리고 도망치는 모습을 보지 못했고 의심의 여지 없이 그는 군중의 희생양이 되기 전에 사라졌습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0141_Text
msgctxt "58596f9b-fc75-49e1-9872-11cd9d966a27"
msgid ""
"Who could have thought that respectable goblin chieftains and heroes could "
"run so fast! Leaping away from his blade-swinging adversary, Nok-Nok "
"scuttled around the cracking fire. The king was in close pursuit, swinging "
"his weapon in wide arcs and shouting out curses and threats!"
msgstr ""
"존경받는 고블린 족장들과 영웅들이 그렇게 빨리 달릴 수 있다고 누가 생각이나 했겠습니까! 녹-녹은 무기를 피하며 불 주위를 "
"뛰어다녔습니다. 왕은 무기를 넓게 휘두르며 저주를 퍼부으며 가까이 오고 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/BookEvent_MoblinKingDuel/Cue_0144_Text
msgctxt "0568e56f-502a-4261-b370-0e0615122d3d"
msgid ""
"Throwing out his arm and pointing with his finger at something behind the "
"king's back, Nok-Nok cried out...\n"
"\"HORSE! HORSE BEHIND YOU!\"\n"
"In truth, this was the oddest, most remarkable piece of mischief I ever saw "
"in my life. And it worked! With a squeal, the king spun like a top, and "
"several goblins from the crowd followed his example. However, a good part of "
"the audience weren't afraid at all — to the contrary, the spectators were "
"caught up in uproarious laughter, pointing fingers at the frightened king!"
msgstr ""
"팔을 뻣어 손가락으로 왕의 등 뒤를 가리킨 녹-녹은 비명을 질렀습니다.\n"
"\"말다! 말이 네 뒤에 있다!\"\n"
"사실 이것은 내가 지금까지 본 장난 중에서 가장 기이한 것이었습니다. 그리고 효과가 있었습니다! 비명을 지르면서 왕은 겁을 먹었습니다. "
"하지만 군중의 일부는 전혀 겁먹지 않았습니다. 반대로 관중들은 겁에 질린 왕을 손가락질하며 웃음을 터뜨리기 시작했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Answer_64642_Text
msgctxt "fe5ea9cb-279c-40e4-a361-2c6d2c0cacfa"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서들 뭐하고 있는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Answer_64646_Text
msgctxt "5237bfa5-0532-4415-a9c9-41bde55d099c"
msgid ""
"\"You haven't escaped. You were released after they've infected you with the "
"magic seeds.\""
msgstr "\"너희는 탈출한게 아니야. 그들이 너희를 마법의 씨앗으로 감염시킨 후에 풀어준 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Answer_64649_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b5d4a8cd-ccce-412b-bad3-f2fb3e58095a"
msgid "Spared and let infected peasants go."
msgstr "감염당한 농민들을 보내주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Answer_64649_Text
msgctxt "c5c911c1-c945-4093-bab9-582f7c7b11e9"
msgid ""
"\"Climb down this hill and run away. The militia headquarters are located "
"near the goblin camp — head there. Once we have freed all the prisoners, "
"we'll find a way to cure you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 언덕 아래로 도망가라. 민병대 본부는 고블린 야영지 근처에 있다. 우리가 모든 죄수를 풀어주고난 후, 너희를 치료할 방법을 "
"찾아보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Answer_64650_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b8956c09-a55a-4531-9717-27f5c3a3f3d4"
msgid "Killed infected peasants on the spot."
msgstr "그 자리에서 감염된 농민들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Answer_64650_Text
msgctxt "54b67319-a580-4e5e-a8ca-7f9d0c5a9b36"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I cannot risk my men that are waiting behind the gates. We'll "
"have to kill you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 입구에서 기다리고 있는 내 부하들을 위험에 빠뜨릴 순 없어. 우리는 너희를 죽여야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Answer_64651_Text
msgctxt "16236597-826a-492e-9651-cb23c06b2098"
msgid "\"How did you manage to hide from the goblins?\""
msgstr "\"고블린들에게서 어떻게 숨을 수 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64639_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped
msgctxt "c3884324-59ef-40c8-b589-32468531256e"
msgid "\"Aaah! {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} have mercy, you've scared us!\""
msgstr "\"아아! {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이시여! 기겁할 뻔 했잖습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64640_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped02
msgctxt "73447f15-3197-4a86-a756-640fac020770"
msgid "\"You... who are you? Have you come to rescue us?\""
msgstr "\"당신..당신은 누구지? 우리를 구해주러 온건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64643_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped
msgctxt "19e098a0-802b-4a1f-8380-c7b93fe584d6"
msgid ""
"\"Hiding. We managed to flee from the shaman... right after the ritual!\""
msgstr "\"숨어있는 중입니다. 저희는 의식이 끝나자마자 샤먼에게서 도망칠 수 있었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64644_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped
msgctxt "fc6b4037-6275-4e6a-ac5b-bffd56a3fb2d"
msgid ""
"\"That little freak almost drowned us! At first he was jumping all around us "
"and waving his crutch, but then he took a pot of water and started to pour "
"it into us! I thought, that'll be the end of us...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 작은 괴물 녀석이 우리를 거의 익사시킬 뻔 했습니다! 처음에는 그가 우리 주위를 뛰어다니면서 막대기를 흔들더니 곧 물 냄비를 들고 "
"우리에게 붓기 시작했죠! 저는 그 순간이 저희의 마지막 일꺼라 생각했죠..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64645_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped02
msgctxt "78a8eaa8-7c1f-4c25-bed0-dac916a24a19"
msgid ""
"\"And then it got weird... the goblins untied us from the column, lead us "
"away and then just forgot all about us — they were busy with the other "
"prisoners! Well, we didn't lose any time... And now we're thinking about "
"climbing down this slope and getting outta here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런데 이상하게도... 고블린들은 저희를 기둥에서 풀어주더니, 그곳에서 먼 곳으로 인도해주고는 저희에게 관심조차 두지 않았습니다. "
"그들은 다른 죄수들 신경 쓰느라 바쁘게 움직였고, 저희는 지체없이 도망쳐 나왔죠. 이제 이 비탈을 내려가서 이곳에서 멀리 벗어날 생각 "
"중이었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64647_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped02
msgctxt "e7131a05-565a-4f9e-904e-924d60e7c69b"
msgid "\"Wh... what? You mean... the water...\""
msgstr "\"뭐... 뭐라구요? 설마 물이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64648_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped
msgctxt "fd24e66e-05f0-45b7-8305-6b01befc2189"
msgid ""
"\"No, no... no! It can't be! Stop scaring us! We just need to get out of "
"this place!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 아니야! 그럴 리가 없어요! 저희를 겁주지 마세요! 우린 단지 이곳에서 빠져나가기만 하면 된다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64652_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped02
msgctxt "e9c34035-af2d-47ad-adfe-06488003eea0"
msgid "\"They... they haven't really looked for us, to be honest.\""
msgstr "\"그들은... 솔직히 우리를 찾지 않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64653_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped
msgctxt "2e226b21-09b2-41df-8789-492988211b42"
msgid ""
"\"So we just hid in these bushes and were waiting for the right moment to "
"make a run for it.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 이 수풀에 숨어서 도망칠 순간을 기다리고 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64655_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b9b2614e-6c58-4e3d-9d11-1ef2309d89ab"
msgid ""
"\"It is true. The water is contaminated. I am sorry. Please, do not panic — "
"with {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} help, we might still save you...\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이야. 물은 오염되었어. 미안해. 두려워 하지 마.{g|Sarenrae} Sarenrae 's{/g}의 도움으로 우리가 너를 도울 "
"수 있을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64657_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9b0eb929-2d25-4811-841f-cd201d60811c"
msgid ""
"\"You would do better not to waste the last minutes of your life running. "
"You cannot outrun death, after all. Let us pray to {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} "
"together. He will help you accept the inevitable.\""
msgstr ""
"\"인생의 마지막 몇 분을 낭비하지 않는 것이 좋을 거야. 죽음을 뛰어넘을 수는 없어. {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}에게 기도하자. "
"그는 너의 결말을 받아들이게 도울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64658_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3755ff10-51f2-4124-8b00-4747599ed548"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie swallows heavily and places her hand on her weapon.{/n} \"We "
"cannot let them go. For the safety of others in the camp.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 무겁게 침을 삼키고 손을 그녀의 무기에 올려놓습니다.{/n} \"우리는 그들을 놓아줄 수 없습니다. 야영지에 있는 다른 "
"사람들의 안전을 위해서입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64661_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6ab99b75-a87b-4c26-9fa5-46c8d433330e"
msgid ""
"\"Your death will be quick and painless. This is all we can do for you.\""
msgstr "\"죽음은 빠르고 고통스럽지 않을 거야. 이것이 우리가 너를 위해 할 수 있는 전부다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64662_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonerEscaped
msgctxt "defe5310-898a-4c5d-9464-98334e874bf5"
msgid "\"No! Please!\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 제발!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/EscapedPrisoners/Cue_64663_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "d3f75e58-49c2-42a1-bd27-d00dd8e839e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke turns pale.{/n} \"What a terrible choice... but it's possible "
"that they drank the water and didn't get sick. We must give them a chance, "
"despite the risk!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Kalikke는 창백해졌습니다.{/n} \"정말 끔찍한 선택이군... 하지만 그들이 물을 마시고 아프지 않을 수도 있어. 우리는 "
"위험하더라도 그들에게 기회를 줘야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/FreePrisonersOption_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "0e935d18-b00e-4c3a-8248-acef3450aa71"
msgid "Release"
msgstr "풀어주기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/FreePrisonersOption_Tooltip_String
msgctxt "095fcc04-5e19-44b1-a5e9-580b138bcb45"
msgid "Release the prisoner."
msgstr "죄수 풀어줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Answer_87025_Text
msgctxt "9807fc1f-8bc8-48d8-be63-c4bd813dfbf8"
msgid "\"What are you talking about, you madman?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 소리야? 미쳤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Answer_87026_Text
msgctxt "ab0ae812-a2b1-4922-ad50-6ae745c10773"
msgid ""
"\"What, \"will of Lamashtu\"? So she is behind the seeds and the monsters?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 라마슈투의 의지? 그래서 그 여신이 씨앗과 괴물의 배후라는 건가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Answer_87027_Text
msgctxt "3ab077bd-5dbb-4658-8a29-730a32df686e"
msgid "\"You've lost anyway, so shut up.\""
msgstr "\"너는 어쨌든 졌어. 그러니 닥쳐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Answer_87031_Text
msgctxt "70ece212-e6de-4035-afbb-598ea4c6add9"
msgid "\"Make it before what?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐가 만들어진다는 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Answer_87032_Text
msgctxt "95653f9c-1b70-40e3-8c07-0732dbe600d4"
msgid "\"Don't you dare die right now, you filth!\""
msgstr "\"지금 죽을 생각하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Cue_87023_Text
msgctxt "466c6f47-73ed-46a4-895a-b278253b7356"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, the shaman bursts into bizarre squawking. After a moment "
"it becomes clear to you: the goblin, choking on his own blood, has broken "
"into gloating laughter.{/n}\n"
"\"The {mf|baron|baroness} be too late! The will of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} "
"came true! The Bloom be happening!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하자 샤먼은 기괴한 소리를 냅니다. 잠시 후 분명하게 알 수 있었습니다: 고블린은 피를 토하며 웃음을 터트립니다.{/n}\n"
"\"너무 늦었어! {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 의지가 곧 실현된다! 전염병이 일어날 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Cue_87028_Text
msgctxt "ede3ce10-d174-4183-a16e-32375f0bcd1b"
msgid ""
"{n}The shaman's eyes, red, small and wicked, have a feverish glint to "
"them.{/n} \"And who else?! The blossom-seeds came down the stream. We drink –"
" boom! boom! Longshanks drink — boom! boom! boom! Flowers grow, greatbeasts "
"crawl out, {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} be pleased! I knew straight away what "
"goblins do-must! Go up stream, seek Greatmother!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}붉고 작고 사악한 샤먼의 눈에는 열렬한 환희가 있었습니다.{/n} \"그러면 그 외에 누가 있겠어?! 전염병의 씨앗이 강 줄기를 "
"타고 내려갔어. 그것을 마시면! 빵! 빵! 꺽다리들이 마시고! 빵! 빵! 빵! 꽃들이 자라면 짐승들이 튀어나오고 "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}가 기뻐할 거다! 나는 고블린이 해야 할 일을 확실히 알고 있었다! 강 줄기 상류로 가서 위대한 "
"어머니를 찾아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Cue_87029_Text
msgctxt "aaf2a663-ae3a-4c65-a712-4f19846a8a6f"
msgid ""
"{n}The shamans words become quieter and quieter.{/n} \"We be "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} sons... watering... seed-sowing... readying... "
"for the season… of Bloom... All together... boom... boom... boom...\"\n"
"{n}The shaman emits a long wheeze and freezes, looking straight into your "
"eyes. His dull eyes are lit by an evil flicker.{/n}\n"
"\"The season of Bloom has begun. You no stop us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}샤먼의 말은 점점 더 조용해집니다.{/n} \"우리는 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 자식이다... 물을 주고... 씨앗을 "
"뿌리고... 파종하고... 꽃이 피는 계절을 기다리고... 그러면 모두가... 빵... 빵... 빵...\"\n"
"{n}샤먼은 차가운 눈빛으로 당신을 오래 쳐다봅니다. 그의 둔한 눈은 악으로 일렁입니다.{/n}\n"
"\"개화의 계절이 시작되었다. 너는 우리를 막을 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinShaman/Cue_87030_Text
msgctxt "71484cbc-24b6-4abb-8a1d-c1533ab09e95"
msgid ""
"{n}The shaman convulsively sucks some air in and carries on with a weakening "
"voice.{/n} \"Find! {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} Womb, up the river! Home of "
"greatbeasts, seed-breedery! Leave guards so no one come in, and go back, "
"back — make the longshanks gulp! Taint more, more! Sow man-death! All seeds "
"be planted, all... make it... before...\" {n}The light in the shaman's eyes "
"is growing dim.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}샤먼은 경련을 일으키며 공기를 빨아들이고 허약한 목소리로 계속합니다.{/n} \"찾아라! {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 "
"자궁이 강 위에 있다! 거대한 짐승들의 고향이며, 씨앗이 재배되는 곳! 그곳에 경비를 두어 아무도 들어오지 못하게 했다. 꺽다리가 마시게 "
"했다! 더 많이 심어라! 인간의 죽음을 심어라! 모든 씨앗을 심고, 모든것이 만들어지기전에...\" {n}샤먼의 눈빛이 희미해지고 "
"있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2bc6f84b-8ba8-41ae-abca-57c77c8c1b19"
msgid "Let goblins infect prisoners."
msgstr "고블린이 포로를 감염시키도록 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "5da680b9-761b-4e98-9d74-4b549c21584e"
msgid "[Remain hiding and keep watching]"
msgstr "[숨어서 계속 지켜봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c38af64d-b849-40bc-83cf-16009dc859d0"
msgid "Didn't let goblins infect prisoners."
msgstr "고블린이 포로를 감염시키지 못하게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8f7a6a8c-dfc5-410a-a66f-afb6cfe2a0a0"
msgid "[Attack the goblins]"
msgstr "[고블린을 공격합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "38380ec2-4789-42d3-ae1a-93a2b9a375f4"
msgid "[Keep watching]"
msgstr "[계속 지켜봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "587580a1-3e63-4dbf-a67e-36506f6ab218"
msgid "[Attack the goblins]"
msgstr "[고블린을 공격합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "aa996afd-f1d2-4f24-b166-242d18a49dfb"
msgid ""
"{n}You are making your way through the goblin camp — a dirty, hastily-"
"erected \"settlement\" built of trash and mortared with what smells like "
"goblin waste. You catch sight of the silvery glimmer of water ahead — then "
"suddenly notice a squad of armed goblins moving towards the water as well, "
"shouting and prodding at a few scared peasants in front of them.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 고블린 야영지를 통과하고 있습니다. 더럽고 대충 세워진 \"정착지\"는 쓰레기로 만들어져 고블린 쓰레기 냄새가 납니다. "
"당신은 앞에 펼쳐진 물가의 은빛 광채를 발견하였습니다. 그때 갑자기 무장한 고블린 무리가 겁에 질린 몇명의 농민들을 앞세우고는 그들에게 "
"고함을 질러대며 물가로 이동하는 것을 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "366cc1e3-3f90-43ff-ba8c-d561becca0dc"
msgid ""
"{n}Seemingly unaware of you, the goblins push the prisoners to the water's "
"edge. One of the guards knocks the nearest captive, a decrepit old man, off "
"his feet, and he falls to his knees with a moan. The goblin throws a filthy "
"bent ladle in front of the man and points at the water.{/n} \"Drink! Fast!\" "
"{n}The old man picks the ladle with shaking hands, then stops, quivering "
"with fear.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 보지 못한 고블린들은 죄수들을 물가로 끌고 갑니다. 경비원 중 한 명은 가장 가까운 노인 포로를 발로 차서 무릎을 꿇렸고 "
"그는 신음했습니다. 고블린은 더럽고 구부러진 국자를 남자 앞에 던지고 물을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"빨리 마셔!\" {n}노인은 떨리는 "
"손으로 국자를 집어들다가 두려움에 떨며 멈췄습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "09d4a301-bc4e-426f-ad44-6b6fbbcc1a16"
msgid ""
"{n}A hail of curses and blows fall upon the shaking old man. Cringing, the "
"man finally does as ordered — he scoops water from the river and drinks it "
"hastily. The other goblins, following their leader's example, drive the "
"other prisoners to the water's edge beside the old man.{/n} \"Drink-drink-"
"drink! All drink!\" {n}After this, it falls silent... the undersized guards "
"hover over the prisoners, occasionally lifting one of the prisoner's chins "
"with a spear until the victim not only drinks — but to ensure he swallows as "
"well.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}저주와 주먹질이 떠는 노인에게 쏟아집니다. 노인은 마침내 지시대로 따릅니다. 그는 강물의 물을 떠서 급히 마십니다. 다른 고블린들은 "
"지도자의 모범을 보여주며 다른 포로들을 노인 옆에 있는 물 가장자리로 몰아넣습니다.{/n} \"마시고 마셔라!\" {n}잠시 후 침묵이 "
"이어집니다... 과묵한 경비는 죄수 주위를 걸어다니다 가끔씩 죄수의 턱을 잡고 창으로 위협하여 물을 마시고 삼키게 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "e6fad4f5-f0ae-4e99-86fa-1bb1ac12dea1"
msgid ""
"{n}Once each prisoner has drunk the water, the goblins stand the captives up "
"and lead them away, deeper into the camp. Only the damp ground reminds you "
"of what you have witnessed here.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}수감자 모두가 물을 마셨을 때 고블린들은 포로를 일으켜세워 야영지 안으로 데려갑니다. 습기찬 땅만이 여기에서 일어났던 일을 떠올리게 "
"합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "ee371d0a-31f4-4779-bb79-9c63ea9cb0cd"
msgid ""
"{n}Hearing your approach, the goblins whirl, see you, and start shrieking — "
"whether fear or battle cries, you cannot tell. In the heat of the moment, "
"one of them drops his spear, another steps on the foot of the goblin next to "
"him, and so it goes, causing a ripple of chaos to pass through their ranks. "
"The old man, startled by the noise, drops the ladle into the water — and "
"then, in the confusion, staggers to his feet and breaks into a run. The "
"other prisoners follow, leaving the hapless guards howling in anger.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하는 것을 알아채자, 고블린들은 당신을 보고 소리를 지르기 시작합니다. 두려움인지 전투 포효인지 알 수 없습니다. 순간의 "
"열기 속에서 그들 중 하나가 창을 떨어뜨리고 다른 고블린이 그를 나무라며 혼란이 일어납니다. 소리에 깜짝 놀란 노인은 국자를 물에 "
"빠뜨리고는, 혼란을 틈타 비틀거리며 일어나 도망치기 시작했습니다. 다른 죄수들도 따라나서자, 경비들은 분노로 고함을 지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "2299c457-57d5-4377-905d-fa20787d5781"
msgid ""
"{n}Hearing your approach, the goblins whirl, see you, and start shrieking — "
"whether fear or battle cries, you cannot tell. In the heat of the moment, "
"one of them drops his spear, another steps on the foot of the goblin next to "
"him, and so it goes, causing a ripple of chaos to pass through their ranks. "
"The kneeling prisoners, startled, quickly see an opportunity and spring to "
"their feet, scattering in all directions.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 오는 것을 듣자 고블린들은 당신을 보고 소리를 지르기 시작합니다. 두려움인지 전투 포효인지 알 수 없습니다. 순간의 열기 "
"속에서 그들 중 하나가 창을 떨어뜨리고 다른 고블린이 그를 나무라며 혼란이 일어납니다. 무릎꿇은 죄수들은 놀랐고 이내 도망칠 기회를 "
"찾다가 달려나가 뿔뿔이 흩어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2b9f4e8b-a84a-4842-a3a2-da2b933b518e"
msgid "\"What are you waiting for?! We have to save them!\""
msgstr "\"뭐하고 있어?! 그들을 구해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a02b300a-d43b-40d9-bfc1-3d3d68aca520"
msgid ""
"\"Do not rush to interfere. As much as we may pity these poor souls, we must "
"understand what is going on to save countless others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"급하게 간섭해서는 안됩니다. 우리가 이 자들을 불쌍히 여기는 만큼, 다른 수많은 사람들을 구하기 위해서라도 이곳에서 무슨일이 벌어지고 "
"있는지 알아내야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0c886871-ccbf-4924-8bf5-8bddb6d25559"
msgid "{n}Without a word, Ekun frowns and pulls an arrow from his quiver.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}한마디도 없이 에쿤은 찡그리며 화살통에서 화살을 뽑습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b7e32a4c-4abe-4231-a726-24e70b4f10f1"
msgid "\"I cannot just watch — we have to do something, I beg you!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 보고 있을 수만은 없습니다. 우린 뭔가 조치를 취해야 합니다. 부탁입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GoblinsRiver/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "66150f1c-fcfd-45f9-92c3-337af413a90d"
msgid "\"May {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} keep us, for our deed is good!\""
msgstr "\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}가 우리를 지켜주기를. 우리는 선행을 하려는 것이니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "19e35c7e-94e6-4bae-b697-9b407384482d"
msgid ""
"\"My, my, whom do we have here? If it isn't Tigni Jusmert, the renowned "
"merchant! Fallen on hard times, have you?\""
msgstr "\"이게 누구야? 유명한 상인 티그니 주수머트가 아닌가! 힘든 시간을 보내고 있구만?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "10b76798-7629-4568-a81b-ff7b020d428c"
msgid "\"Watch your tongue, or you'll stay in that cage forever!\""
msgstr "\"입 조심해! 아니면 감옥에서 영원히 썩을 줄 알아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f09d950d-f8fa-41c2-bc2d-24bcdfcf4265"
msgid "Freed imprisoned merchant."
msgstr "감옥에 갇힌 상인을 구해줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a676cb8d-a3aa-4e9e-9432-f499a3307779"
msgid ""
"\"I've had to deal with dozens of goblins on my way here, so a few more are "
"of little concern. Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"여기 오면서 고블린 수십을 상대해야 했어. 그러니 조금 더 조심해야겠지. 넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ceb18942-a967-429f-b194-efc9e0f60a0c"
msgid "Freed imprisoned merchant."
msgstr "감옥에 갇힌 상인을 구해줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "3171f2cf-d292-40f1-90af-4c2ac273a1a2"
msgid ""
"\"Be silent! Of course I'm setting you free — calm down and let me deal with "
"the lock, will you?\""
msgstr "\"조용히 해! 물론 너를 풀어 주겠어. 내가 자물쇠를 풀때까지 진정하고 있어. 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "75ddd6cf-9c52-4fbb-bb13-b91fdde654d5"
msgid "Asked for a reward for freeing the captured trader."
msgstr "갇힌 상인을 풀어준 것에 대한 보답을 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "cbff35c7-81e1-42f3-a7ee-e9ed1f254ba4"
msgid "\"Free you? What do I get out of it if I do?\""
msgstr "\"너를 풀어줘? 그러면 나는 무엇을 얻을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4475e296-8d4a-4f84-a46e-694cd780a0e5"
msgid "Refused to free imprisoned merchant."
msgstr "감옥에 갇힌 상인을 구해주기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "fc379d49-5ab6-4602-b03d-86bcbb6f8a19"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like you all that much. I think you should remain here, and we'll "
"let the goblins decide what to do with you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 딱히 마음에 들지 않았어. 그냥 여기에 남겨두고, 고블린의 손에 맡기겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "7b402ac8-6c9f-46d1-a1ca-7746434b782f"
msgid "\"All right, come out. I hope you can find your way out of the camp.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나와. 네가 야영지에서 나가는 길을 찾을 수 있기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f7bb3cd8-e023-4cd6-815a-2043084b3ee5"
msgid "Refused to free imprisoned merchant."
msgstr "감옥에 갇힌 상인을 구해주기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "8ee24cc1-7918-4d9b-90dd-3b3377c0c4c2"
msgid "\"Hmm... no. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"음... 싫어. 안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "326e0d32-76db-4d4e-963f-d11d67f94570"
msgid ""
"\"What, are you scared? All right, coward, I'll let you out. Then get out of "
"my sight.\""
msgstr "\"뭐야? 두려운 거야? 좋아. 너를 내보내줄 거야. 그러면 내 눈 앞에서 꺼져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "2a6f3f77-f944-48e4-92bd-00cc2776257d"
msgid "\"Oh, are you still alive? Lucky you! All right then, see you soon.\""
msgstr "\"오. 아직 살아있어? 운이 좋구나! 좋아. 다음에 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "21c004e2-0d30-40c0-a21e-6d18f75f6301"
msgid "Looked for benefits in freeing imprisoned merchant."
msgstr "감옥에 갇힌 상인에게 풀어주는 대가를 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "2b83919c-5c98-4853-90ff-efebf17a3a12"
msgid "\"Hmm... If I let you out... what do I get in return?\""
msgstr "\"흠... 내가 너를 풀어 준다면... 나는 대가로 무엇을 얻을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "a3d8266c-ba6c-4db4-893b-66b290615725"
msgid "\"What were the others talking about? Did you cheat those people?\""
msgstr "\"다른 사람들이 하는 말은 뭐지? 저 사람들을 속였나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "252826e6-3632-4d42-99be-9cf881d4fe40"
msgid ""
"\"You! Yes, you there! Let me out of here! Come on, move it, are you waiting "
"for the entire goblin horde to show?\""
msgstr "\"너! 그래. 거기! 나를 꺼내줘! 어서 움직이지 않으면 고블린들이 우리를 보겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "f9396f10-1035-43c4-a412-4254649860d8"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni's face falls at your tone. Since you last met him in "
"{g|Kamelands}Kamelands{/g}, the merchant has lost weight. His clothes are "
"torn and dirty, and he has lost his worn-out beret. He is clutching onto the "
"bars of the cage so tightly his fingers have gone white.{/n}\n"
"\"Your Grace... what a surprise... yourself, in person... {mf|sir|madam}... "
"would you be so kind as to help me out of this... ah, predicament?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티그니의 얼굴이 당신의 말투에 고개를 떨굽니다. {g|Kamelands}케임랜드{/g}에서 마지막으로 그를 만난 이후로 상인은 "
"살이 빠져있었습니다. 그의 옷은 찢어지고 더러웠으며 낡은 베레모를 잃어 버렸습니다. 그는 감옥의 쇠창살을 꽉 쥐고있어 손가락이 "
"하얘질 정도였습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"아 영주님이시군요... 이런 우연이... 여기서 직접 뵙다니... 저를 여기서 구해주지 않겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "358944f1-c8c0-4979-a78c-a5a2e5b5b6de"
msgid ""
"{n}A corpulent man in a ragged jacket and worn-out trousers is in the cage, "
"his hands tight on the bars as if trying to throttle them.{/n} \"Tigni "
"Jusmert, a free merchant! Now that formalities are out of the way, can you "
"see about setting me free?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}낡은 재킷과 닳은 바지를 입은 한 남자가 감옥 안에 있었고 쇠창살을 꽉 쥐고 있었습니다.{/n} \"나는 상인 티그니 주스머트라고 "
"합니다! 이제 소개는 끝났으니 나를 좀 꺼내주겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "fc395d22-a9c8-42ec-9e3f-a44ed1a8bc93"
msgid ""
"{n}The corpulent man in a ragged jacket and worn-out trousers hangs his "
"head.{/n} \"No, I beg of you! Don't leave me here! The goblins — they're up "
"to something horrible! I'm Tigni Jusmert, an honest trader. By the mercies "
"of {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}, please free me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}거친 재킷과 닳은 바지를 입은 이 남자는 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"제발. 부탁입니다! 저를 여기에 두고 가지 마세요! 고블린들은 "
"뭔가 끔직한 짓을 하고 있다구요! {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}시여. 저를 구해십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonersInCamp01
msgctxt "957fd72c-dcad-46e1-92ec-2a4998a999db"
msgid ""
"\"Don't let him out! He's a scoundrel — he never misses a chance to fleece "
"honest, hard-working folk, and he even shakes down the refugees! He has no "
"shame!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그를 꺼내주지 마! 그는 악당이야. 그는 정직한 백성을 항상 등쳐먹었고 난민을 괴롭힌 적도 있어! 그는 수치심 따위는 모르는 자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : PrisonersInCamp02
msgctxt "2e446dbf-e173-4bc0-bc30-4ecef571ed2a"
msgid ""
"\"You had it coming, wretch! Where are your thugs now, Tigni? Having a hard "
"time sleeping on the dung mat? Let him rot in this cage — or in a goblin's "
"belly, I don't care!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왔구나. 이 쓰레기 녀석! 네 부하는 어디에 있지? 티그니? 감옥에서 자는 기분이 어때? 그를 감옥에 썩게 내버려둬. 아니면 "
"고블린에게 먹히든지. 나는 상관하지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "d020fc2e-bb76-457d-b01a-298fea78a58b"
msgid ""
"\"No, no — don't listen to them! I've no idea what they are on about! Would "
"you let an innocent man die because of lies and gossip?\""
msgstr "\"안돼. 그들 듣지 마. 그들이 도대체 무슨 말을 하는지 모르겠어. 거짓말과 험담 때문에 무고한 사람이 죽겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "ab30e74d-abc1-45f9-85be-381197e786e5"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni's eyes widen in horror, and he licks his lips. Sweating profusely, "
"he presses his face against the bars and whispers.{/n} \"You know the bridge "
"over {g|Gudrin River}Gudrin river{/g}? Down the stream, not far from "
"{g|Tuskwater}Tuskwater{/g}? On the same side as the barony, there are bushes "
"growing near the road and the bridge. I... I buried a little something "
"there, under one of the bushes — it's yours if you let me out!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티그니의 눈은 공포로 넓어지고 그는 입술을 핥았습니다. 땀을 흘리면서 그는 쇠창살에 얼굴을 붙이고 속삭입니다.{/n} \"{g|"
"Gudrin River}구드린 강{/g}의 다리를 아십니까? 시내에서 멀지 않고 {g|Tuskwater}터스크 워터{/g}와 가까운 "
"곳입니다. 영지 쪽에 길과 다리 옆에 자란 덤불이 있습니다. 저... 저는 거기 덤불 중 하나에 무언가를 묻었습니다. 저를 꺼내주신다면 그것은 당신의 것입니다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "61c2964c-c617-43d5-b0c3-b2349fdccebe"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni's eyes widen.{/n} \"What do you get OUT of it?! WHAT DO YOU GET OUT "
"OF IT?! You'll save a living soul! NOW GET ME OUT OF THIS CAGE!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}티그니의 눈이 커졌습니다.{/n} \"네가 무엇을 얻냐고? 네가 무엇을 얻냐고?! 사람 하나 구하는 거지! 나를 제발 감옥에서 "
"꺼내줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "24bb2b88-d34b-4880-8872-ee1695c2fbf3"
msgid ""
"{n}Tigni is staring at you, his face white and his eyes wide. As you watch, "
"a bead of sweat rolls down his temple.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}티그니가 당신을 쳐다보았고 그의 얼굴은 하얗게 바랬고 눈은 커졌습니다. 보다시피 땀이 그의 관자놀이에 흐릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "9db17848-539b-40b6-b7d7-a9d9e575a261"
msgid ""
"\"Wh-what? N-no, nothing of the like! Slander and nonsense, all of it!\"\n"
"{n}Tigni shakes his head and forces a smile, but the perspiration on his "
"forehead exposes the lie.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐. 뭐라구? 그런 게 아니야! 모두 말도 안돼!\"\n"
"{n}티그니는 그의 머리를 흔들고 미소 짓지만 그의 이마에 흐르는 땀으로 거짓말인 것이 드러납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "19a8794e-0593-4d47-b659-cf5295adc371"
msgid ""
"\"What? No, nothing of the like! Slander and nonsense, all of it!\"\n"
"{n}Tigni's eyes are pleading.{/n} \"You wouldn't leave me here to be torn to "
"bits by these vermin because of gossip, would you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐. 뭐라구? 그런 게 아니야! 모두 말도 안돼!\"\n"
"{n}티그니의 눈은 절박합니다.{/n} \"그저 소문 때문에 이 고블린 들이 나를 죽이게 두겠다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/GreedyMerchant/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2a194af4-5592-4cba-aeef-c094222025b5"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha! Man, what a speech! You sound just like a preacher. 'Save a living "
"soul' my ass. Why should we care about your soul if it can't cough up "
"payment for saving it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하! 말 한번 잘하는구나! 설교자처럼 말하는구나. 사람 하나 살린다고? 너를 구해서 얻는 것이 없으면 왜 살려야 하는 건데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13112_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a14dc829-32e3-4c5a-a513-bc303cab9604"
msgid "Agreed to help goblin prisoners escape."
msgstr "고블린의 죄수가 도망가는 것을 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13112_Text
msgctxt "4365cfd2-fee1-4785-80f4-7f0189ffd570"
msgid ""
"\"I'm leaving at once. I need to free the prisoners before the goblins serve "
"them for dinner — or worse.\""
msgstr "\"바로 가보겠다. 고블린들이 죄수들을 저녁 식사로 만들기 전에 풀어주어야 겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13113_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "99f58bb2-ecda-4c7b-8a50-4643d3f6ec2e"
msgid "Refused to help goblin prisoners escape."
msgstr "고블린의 죄수가 도망가는 것을 돕지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13113_Text
msgctxt "b3e24e68-0ff2-4aff-8901-12c59a7985cc"
msgid ""
"\"To hell with the idiots who managed to get captured by goblins. I want to "
"crush their insolent chief who dares build a fort in my lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고작 고블린들에게 잡혀간 멍청한 녀석들은 지옥에나 가라고해. 감히 내 땅에 요새를 세운 건방진 고블린 대장 녀석을 박살내주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13114_Text
msgctxt "c89b04c2-9212-4982-8d2d-d66d1e5bac66"
msgid "\"The prisoners mentioned a shaman. The leader?\""
msgstr "\"죄수들이 샤먼에 대해 언급했다고 했는데, 지도자인건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13115_Text
msgctxt "e2973477-0324-47e1-ad06-c66daff17054"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13116_Text
msgctxt "beeb2c9c-0f6b-4261-b793-d74b3b2e2c79"
msgid "\"Can this goblin camp have something to do with the seeds?\""
msgstr "\"이 고블린 야영지가 씨앗과 관련이 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13122_Text
msgctxt "8fc883a7-460e-4caf-ae2b-9ec52a2e150d"
msgid "\"How are the prisoners?\""
msgstr "\"죄수들은 어떤가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13124_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "44deeb1b-06c1-4bd2-b8ce-a7fd0b7ed88c"
msgid "Killed off infected peasants to prevent appearance of new monsters."
msgstr "감염된 농민들을 죽여 새로운 괴물의 출현을 막았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13124_Text
msgctxt "31c4ca5d-3c3e-479e-9791-b0f7ed116b0c"
msgid ""
"[Attack the prisoners] \"I cannot risk other's lives — either my soldier or "
"my people — by having you run free.\""
msgstr "[죄수를 공격합니다] \"다른 사람들의 목숨을 위험에 처하게 할 수는 없어. 내 병사도 백성도. 네 맘대로는 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13125_Text
msgctxt "40482f8a-f9c0-4e8e-9b9f-2759a05fac10"
msgid ""
"\"We discovered the magic seeds are transported by water. If the shaman is "
"infecting prisoners on purpose, then anyone who has consumed the water can "
"give birth to a monster. There's no time — I have to kill them all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법의 씨앗이 물로 전염된다는 것을 알아냈다. 샤먼이 의도적으로 죄수를 감염시켰다면 물을 마신 사람한테서 괴물이 튀어 나올 수 있어. "
"시간이 없다. 죄수들을 모두 죽여야만 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Answer_13129_Text
msgctxt "51edecd5-4575-4f20-b9fd-1de3c0d79380"
msgid "\"Have it your way, Kesten.\""
msgstr "\"네 방식대로 해. 케스턴.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13108_Text
msgctxt "66516560-19b7-49cb-a691-92a85d864aa4"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten nods. His armor is covered with cuts and scratches, there is blood "
"on his gloves, but he himself is uninjured.{/n} \"You are right on time, "
"{mf|baron|baroness}. We were losing hope — no longer, now that you are here."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}캐스턴은 고개를 끄덕입니다. 그의 갑옷은 상처와 흠집으로 덮여있고 장갑에는 피가 묻어 있지만 그는 부상당하지 않았습니다.{/n} "
"\"제 때 오셨군요. 우리는 희망을 잃고 있었습니다. 하지만 이제는 영주님께서 오셨으니 반격할 시간입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13109_Text
msgctxt "611a8c4a-14cb-4342-a41b-a715298e4e30"
msgid ""
"\"Further down the path, behind a palisade lies a nest of goblins. We "
"chanced upon it while heading up-river. I've no idea when these pests "
"managed to build it and so fast — we scouted it less than a ten-day ago, and "
"there was no trace of them!\"\n"
"{n}Kesten regains his composure.{/n} \"Whatever the cause, the surrounding "
"area is thick with goblins — only one of the scouts we sent made it back. He "
"reports they have raised a fort of sorts at the top of the hill, around a "
"totem to {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}. They packed the fort with cages — with "
"prisoners inside.\""
msgstr ""
"\"길을 따라 내려갔더니 고블린의 둥지가 있더군요. 강을 따라가면서 그것을 우연히 보았죠. 이 해충들의 둥지가 언제 이렇게나 빨리 "
"만들어졌는지 모르겠습니다. 열흘 전에 정찰을 보내봤지만 놈들의 흔적은 남아 있지 않았습니다!\"\n"
"{n}캐스턴은 다시 침착해졌습니다.{/n} \"원인이 무엇이든 주변 지역은 고블린이 매우 많습니다. 우리가 보낸 정창별 중 한 명만이 "
"돌아왔지요. 그들이 언덕 꼭대기에서 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 토템 주변에 요새를 세웠다고 합니다. 요새 내부에는 죄수들이 "
"갇힌 감옥도 많습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13110_Text
msgctxt "8ce8cfb7-09a7-4400-bf34-78831dc736fa"
msgid ""
"\"We've managed to rescue a few of the captives. Others escaped and came "
"back on their own. We've questioned them — they say the shaman performs "
"rituals on the prisoners. We entrenched ourselves here to prepare for an "
"attack, but goblins keep coming at us — they're not giving us a moment's "
"peace! The way they are hounding us, we cannot protect the survivors and "
"attack the camp at the same time.\" {n}Kesten turns to face you, his eyes "
"determined.{/n} \"Only you can rescue the caged prisoners in the fort, Your "
"Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 포로 몇 명을 구출하기도 했습니다. 다른 자들도 자력으로 탈출해서 돌아왔습니다. 죄수였던 자들이 말하길, 샤먼이 죄수들에게 "
"의식을 행한다고 합니다. 저희는 공격을 준비하기 위해 이곳에 왔지만 고블린이 계속해서 몰려오는 상황이었습니다! 놈들이 계속해서 저희를 "
"쫓으면 생존자를 보호하느라 적진을 공격할 수도 없는 상황이었죠.\" {n}캐스턴은 결심하고 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"영주님만이 요새에 "
"감금 된 포로들을 구출할 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13117_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "7bf4713e-7d78-4e44-b8e2-14071844a60e"
msgid ""
"\"I wish you good fortune, Your Grace. Send the ones you rescue our way — "
"we'll protect them.\""
msgstr "\"행운을 빌겠습니다, 영주님. 생존자들을 이쪽으로 보내주십시오. 저희가 보호하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13118_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "6ab45b7d-1602-49b7-81d3-973d2c9631ca"
msgid ""
"\"You won't be able to pass the camp without a fight in any case. Save the "
"people while searching for the chief! They are your subjects, after all!\""
msgstr "\"싸움 없이는 야영지를 통과할 수 없을 거야. 대장을 찾는 동안 사람들을 구해! 그들은 결국 모두 너의 백성이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13119_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "7674b185-777b-40fc-98ea-1bfe7c452475"
msgid ""
"\"The scout mentioned seeing a large white beast at the hilltop — he thought "
"it might be a wolf. If true, the goblin king must be somewhere in the camp.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정찰병이 언덕 꼭대기에 크고 하얀 짐승 한마리를 보았다고 합니다. 늑대로 추정된다고 하더군요. 이게 사실이라면 고블린 왕이 야영지 "
"어딘가에 있을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13121_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "71837c06-cedd-4082-8e41-0c3f72e1f77e"
msgid ""
"\"The only way to find out is to get inside. You'll have to get past the "
"gates and see what's going on in there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것을 알아내는 유일한 방법은 내부에 들어가는 것뿐입니다. 요새문을 돌파해서 저 안에서 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 직접 확인하셔야 할겁니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13123_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "605056a1-5198-4bcc-9cac-a9b3ec0928e5"
msgid ""
"\"Some are injured, many are exhausted, and every one of them is terrified "
"after what they've been through. All the prisoners we've spoken to say they "
"are taken to the {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} totem to take part in the magic "
"rituals.\" {n}Kesten frowns.{/n} \"What's strange is that the shaman doesn't "
"sacrifice anyone. All he does is shriek and pray to Lamashtu, and then "
"forces victims to drink water until they start to choke.\""
msgstr ""
"\"몇몇은 부상당하고 많은 사람들이 지쳤는데 모두 무슨 일이 일어날지 두려워하고 있습니다. 죄수들의 말로는 모두 "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 토템에서 집행되는 마법 의식에 참가시킬 뿐이었다고 합니다.\" {n}캐스턴은 찡그립니다.{/n} "
"\"샤먼이 아무도 제물로 바치지 않는 것이 이상합니다. 놈은 그저 라마슈투에게 큰 소리로 기도를 올리고 죄수들한테 물만 먹인다고 하더군요."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13127_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "e7ae3ad8-e6c6-4d99-a929-9fa5ddb93902"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten turns pale.{/n} \"How... How dare you say that?! We know how to "
"save them! I refuse!\""
msgstr "{n}캐스턴은 창백해집니다.{/n} \"어떻게... 그런 말씀을?! 우린 그들을 구하는 법을 알고 있습니다! 거절하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13128_Text
msgctxt "6f319f98-2bd7-4e45-a8e6-14092cc76ac8"
msgid "\"Your Grace?\""
msgstr "\"부르셨습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/Kesten/Cue_13130_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "3252be5a-3e22-46e7-86ff-2c17806c12dd"
msgid "\"I am grateful, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "\"감사드립니다, 영주님.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79585_Text
msgctxt "b2b2ce7b-6bf1-4419-83b8-bbb249adbb4f"
msgid ""
"\"The shaman was mumbling about a 'season of Bloom.' It seems the seeds the "
"people swallowed turned into portals.\""
msgstr "\"샤먼은 '개화의 계절'에 대해 계속 중얼거렸어. 사람들이 삼킨 씨앗이 포털로 변하는 것 같다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79586_Text
msgctxt "9ecd75a7-b7c1-4006-af71-6d45d972edf3"
msgid "\"No time to deal with that now. We must rescue the survivors.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그런 얘기를 할 시간이 없다. 남은 생존자를 구해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79587_Text
msgctxt "226db2ea-22a6-45ac-b765-8f92c72f548a"
msgid "\"I'm glad you're safe, Kesten.\""
msgstr "\"네가 안전하다니 다행이야. 케스턴.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79590_Text
msgctxt "5158d3b5-56ff-49db-8a15-f4e8c79c3e94"
msgid ""
"\"The shaman mentioned a place up the stream, 'Lamashtu's Womb.' It is the "
"source of the seeds.\""
msgstr "\"샤먼은 강 줄기 상류에 있는 '라마슈투의 자궁'이라는 장소에 대해 언급하더군. 그곳이 씨앗의 근원이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79595_Text
msgctxt "3159593d-60fc-4540-981c-7ec79511248d"
msgid ""
"\"Lamashtu's Womb... This place must be crawling with monsters. You think "
"you can do it?\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투의 자궁... 이 곳에는 분명 괴물들이 득실거릴게 틀림없어. 해낼수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79597_Text
msgctxt "c0f17307-3c96-4a1b-bde0-227a6b169ac6"
msgid "\"What will become of the survivors in this camp?\""
msgstr "\"이 야영지의 생존자들은 어떻게 되는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79610_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b20561f9-e21c-4220-8716-9758464f2c5d"
msgid "Reminded Kesten about his duty."
msgstr "케스턴에게 의무에 대해 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79610_Text
msgctxt "853aa9fc-b9a4-4532-887f-3ee14ae5933d"
msgid ""
"\"Kesten, you are in my service, not to play hero-in-the-woods while my "
"subjects — the families of your militia — are being sacrificed. Now fulfil "
"your duty — gather your squad and take it to the capital!\""
msgstr ""
"\"캐스턴. 너는 나의 부하야. 네 민병대 부하들이 겁에 질려있을 때 숲에서 영웅놀이를 하면 안돼. 네 의무대로 분대를 모아 수도로 가!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79616_Text
msgctxt "8deb8669-f094-478d-8777-59d9301ecc06"
msgid "\"Do you think Kavken can hold out until my arrival?\""
msgstr "\"조드가 내가 도착할 때까지 버틸 수 있을 거라고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79618_Text
msgctxt "da00b6c3-eacf-4054-9164-12dd5f5322eb"
msgid ""
"\"Go to Lamashtu's Womb, Kesten. I'll make a decision and head out later.\""
msgstr "\"자네는 라마슈투의 자궁으로 향할수 있도록. 케스턴. 나는 결정을 내리고 이동하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Answer_79621_Text
msgctxt "134e82e1-5b2b-4d94-bd97-939360015bd7"
msgid "\"Why don't you go to the capital?\""
msgstr "\"자네도 수도로 가는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79583_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "c7bae084-2036-48c3-958d-fc5fa75e05f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten breathes heavily, looking around the bloody battlefield.{/n} \"Your"
" Grace... how can this be? The people... the prisoners from the camp... "
"they've... exploded! Just like that!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 피투성이가 된 전장을 둘러보며 거칠게 숨을 쉬고 있습니다.{/n} \"영주님....어떻게 이런 일이? 사람들이... "
"야영지의 죄수들이... 폭발했습니다! 말 그대로 폭발했다고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79588_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "8886dc85-cbb9-42ca-825a-3684ed494342"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten wipes his brow.{/n} \"If all the seeds have blossomed... "
"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} protect us, the capital is full of infected! Both on "
"the streets and in Kavken's hospital!\" {n}Kesten turns to you.{/n} \"You "
"must hurry to the capital — I will continue looking for the source of the "
"seeds.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}캐스턴은 이마를 닦습니다.{/n} \"모든 씨앗이 폭발한다면... {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}가 우리를 보호하길. 수도의 "
"사람들이 모두 감염될 겁니다! 거리와 카브켄의 병원도 위험해!\" {n}캐스턴은 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"서둘러 수도로 가주십시오. "
"저는 씨앗의 근원을 계속 찾아 보겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79591_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "401f8f97-5907-4ccd-94d0-74e46fd9eb7c"
msgid ""
"\"Then I'm gathering my men and heading out there.\" {n}Kesten brow darkens, "
"and his eyes narrow.{/n} \"I swear upon my life I will find this Womb, Your "
"Grace, and destroy the source of the disease!\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 부하들을 모아서 그곳으로 가겠습니다.\" {n}케스턴의 눈빛이 어두워집니다.{/n} \"맹세컨데 기필코 그 자궁이란 것을 찾아 "
"전염병의 근원을 파괴하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79594_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "a3a295e9-cc76-481a-ab8f-812fe270eaf0"
msgid ""
"\"But Kavken... gods be merciful, he has no one to protect him! And the "
"citizens... Will the guard be enough to halt the attack of these horrid "
"creatures?\" {n}Kesten falls silent for a moment, his brow troubled.{/n} \"No"
", I have to go up the river, make sure there are no new seeds — I must stop "
"this curse at the source!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그분은... 맙소사, 조드님을 지키고 있는 병력이 한명도 없습니다! 그리고 백성들은... 경비병들이 이 끔찍한 괴물의 공격을 "
"멈출 수 있을까요?\" {n}캐스턴은 잠시 침묵을 지켰고 그의 미간은 좁아집니다.{/n} \"아니, 저는 강 상류로 가겠습니다. 그곳에서 "
"새로운 씨앗이 생기지 않게 막겠습니다. 반드시 이 저주의 근원을 막겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79596_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "c03d2f61-ca4b-4920-bf0e-c929bded9996"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten freezes, his face becoming a mask.{/n} \"I don't know, "
"{mf|baron|baroness}. I cannot promise anything.\" {n}He gives a wry grin.{/n}"
" \"But we do not seem to have a choice.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 얼어붙어서 그의 얼굴은 꿈쩍도 안합니다.{/n} \"저도 잘 모르겠습니다, 영주님. 어떠한 것도 보증해드릴 수 없군요. \""
" {n}그는 찡그리며 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"그러나 저희는 선택의 여지가 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79598_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "34ad98e0-a549-4917-823d-1b213e0a3b68"
msgid ""
"\"Most who survived the opening of the Bloom ran. I hope they find their way "
"home — or manage to reach the main road and are found by the patrols.\""
msgstr "\"개화에서 살아남은 사람들은 도망쳤습니다. 그들이 집으로 가거나 큰 길가로 가서 순찰대에게 발견되어야 할 텐데 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79611_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "22b793f4-428c-4903-9c9c-eec65db45bee"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten freezes, then lowers his eyes.{/n} \"I am sorry, Your Grace. The "
"immediacy of the situation clouded my judgment.\" {n}He steps back and "
"bows.{/n} \"I shall head to the capital at once, {mf|baron|baroness}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 얼어붙어서 시선을 아래로 향합니다.{/n} \"죄송합니다. 상황이 급박해서 판단력이 흐려졌습니다.\" {n}그는 뒤로 "
"물러나 인사합니다.{/n} \"저는 즉시 수도로 가겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79617_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "a5a1157f-b180-4458-ac3e-5f5c420a25a9"
msgid ""
"\"If you leave for the capital now, yes. But if you head to "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} Womb...\" {n}Kesten frowns.{/n} \"Jhod is not a "
"warrior, Your Grace. He is a priest. He will shield his wards to the last — "
"but he will likely have gone to join his god if we do not reach him in time."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"영주님께서 바로 수도로 돌아가시면 괜찮을 겁니다. 하지만 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 자궁에 가실 생각이라면...\" {n}"
"케스턴은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"조드는 전사가 아니라 사제입니다. 목숨이 다하는 순간까지 병실을 지키겠지만, 영주님께서 제때 도착하지 "
"못하면 그분은 신의 부름을 받으실 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79619_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "663cd7f1-732e-4650-b712-19926058424a"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten nods.{/n} \"Do not linger, {mf|baron|baroness}. If you go to the "
"Womb, you will certainly catch up with my soldiers. If you go to the "
"capital, I hope you'll arrive in time to help the people there. "
"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} protect you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}캐스턴은 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"자궁에 가실 거라면 내 병사들을 만나실 수 있을 겁니다. 수도로 가신다면 제 때에 도착해 "
"사람들을 도울 수 있기를 기도하겠습니다. {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}께서 굽어 살피시기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79620_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "b89a954b-787d-41bf-adcb-1879a85e2a1a"
msgid ""
"\"It is for you to decide, Your Grace, where your help is more needed. Jhod "
"will defend his patients to his last. As for me...\" {n}Kesten frowns. {/n} "
"\"I'll do the same — anything to put an end to this horror, once and for all."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"어느곳이 영주님의 도움이 더 필요한 곳인지 판단하는 것은 영주님의 결정에 달려있습니다. 조드는 환자들을 끝까지 보호할 것입니다. "
"저라면...\" {n}케스턴은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"저 역시 마찬가지로 이 끔찍한 일을 모두 끝내기위해 무엇이든지 할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79622_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "55105468-2939-4b13-b0b6-85ddf284b1be"
msgid ""
"\"No, Your Grace. I must find the source of the seeds, no matter the cost. "
"This is my decision.\"{n} Kesten's face is stone.{/n} \"And the last word on "
"the matter.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아닙니다. 저는 어떻게든 씨앗의 근원을 찾을 겁니다. 이미 결정했습니다.\" {n}케스턴의 얼굴은 굳었습니다.{/n} \"그 외에는 "
"할말이 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79625_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2336ffbf-8505-41b5-8f26-35daa99c614d"
msgid ""
"\"What's wrong with you, Captain? You're going against orders! I wouldn't "
"have taken you for one of those careless adventurers, who think the chain of "
"command exists only for the sake of appearances!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도대체 왜 그래? 너는 명령을 거부하고 있어! 명령 체계를 멋으로 생각하면 나는 이 조심성 없는 모험자들을 구할 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79626_Text
#. Speaker : GoblinKingFort_Kesten
msgctxt "29312b29-bdfb-49a3-9d44-247c96d98bc9"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry if I have disappointed you, Lady Kaessi. But I will not turn "
"back. Not now, when we must do everything we can to put an end to this "
"calamity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신을 실망시켰다면 면목이 없습니다. 카에시. 하지만 저는 돌아가지 않을 갑니다. 지금은 아닙니다. 모두 끝장낼 때까지는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KestenFinal/Cue_79627_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "cd51e773-c1ad-4b79-ad9b-19ebde2d0b85"
msgid ""
"\"You have a noble soul, Kesten. Those who are ready to protect the "
"helpless, no matter to cost – they are the backbone of this world. May the "
"gods keep you safe!\""
msgstr "\"너는 책임감이 강해. 케스턴. 사람들을 구하려는 저들은 이 세계의 버팀목이야. 신들이 너를 보호하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KillPrisonersOption_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "1b6b7fcd-f5dc-45fa-8853-291dab6b62fe"
msgid "Kill"
msgstr "죽임"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KillPrisonersOption_Tooltip_String
msgctxt "f444acc2-7fa9-4489-8e24-f9e136cfacb4"
msgid "Kill the prisoner."
msgstr "죄수를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "b4053ab2-d39f-4cd3-892c-590f47a9d6b5"
msgid "\"You want to fight the chieftain?\""
msgstr "\"족장과 싸우고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "09185c80-1c0f-4d1b-906a-6e94671b5ec8"
msgid "\"Very well, Nok-Nok. Here's your chance to get even.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 녹-녹. 이제 너도 똑같이 기회를 얻었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6d6145bb-418e-4a10-98ea-d3c6f7966654"
msgid "\"No, Nok-Nok. I'll deal with the chieftain myself.\""
msgstr "\"안돼. 녹-녹. 내가 직접 족장과 상대할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "9dad2bc3-7061-4fe8-874a-4ed809d48eee"
msgid "\"How do you intend to fight him?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그와 싸울 작정이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "13249879-8b9f-486d-b614-5fe8151e19d1"
msgid "\"I hope you know what you're doing...\""
msgstr "\"네가 하고 있는 일이 뭔지 알기를 바란다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "fd9cd14a-896e-4fd3-be34-9eec7c85ecc4"
msgid "\"What should I do?\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 해야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "ddffd5ac-c7de-431c-8f12-6e6b0f7b6618"
msgid "\"Stop! Stop! I smash this shatshanks alone!\""
msgstr "\"멈춰! 멈춰! 나 혼자 shatshank를 박살낸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "bd49bd20-7462-4d7a-93a9-64078b0af1cc"
msgid ""
"\"I can't sleep knowing this ratbag wears the crown! He wanted to hit me "
"until me dead! Now I hit him and show whole tribe who "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} chooses!\""
msgstr ""
"\"쓰레기가 왕관을 쓰고 있는 것을 보고 있을 수 없다! 그는 내가 죽을 때까지 공격할 거다! 나는 그를 때려눕히고 "
"부족 전체에 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}에게 선택된 자가 누군지 보여줄 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "2f0b2d22-b851-4886-8c88-40eb9e088f06"
msgid ""
"\"Like true goblin, like goblin Hero!\" {n}Nok-Nok grins widely, showing his "
"sharp teeth.{/n} \"Fight with anything I have, anyhow I can! Bite, kick, "
"stab, stick… maybe bite again — those are rules. Watch — see for self!\""
msgstr ""
"\"진짜 고블린처럼! 고블린 영웅처럼!\" {n}녹-녹은 날카로운 이빨을 보여주며 크게 웃습니다.{/n} \"모든 것을 동원해 싸운다! "
"물고 차고 찌르고 달려들어서... 다시 물 거야. 이게 규칙이다. 지켜 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "411660b6-5ff3-47b0-ad72-76388b9f16bf"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok hisses — presumably pleased.{/n} \"Good! Cheer for me then!\"{n} "
"He pauses, then narrows his eyes at you and leans in with a whisper.{/n} "
"\"But hsst — try to speak good so they know you cheering for me. You always "
"mess up your words.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 기뻐하는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"좋아! 나를 응원해라!\" {n}그는 잠시 멈추고 눈을 조그맣게 뜨고 당신에게 몸을 숙여 "
"속삭입니다.{/n} \"하지만 말을 잘 해야 한다. 그래야 그들이 네가 나를 응원하는 것을 알지. 너는 항상 말실수 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/KroonkAsksForDuel/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "a0df3b2b-101a-4636-807d-28eb37dba300"
msgid ""
"\"Hnh! Just don't trip me up — and stay out of my way!\" {n}Nok-Nok waves "
"his hand, as if dismissing you.{/n} \"Maybe you go talk-talk with them "
"before I punch and kick crown-stealing shatshank, but after that — stay "
"away! Now enough talk, let's go — look, there — that's where shatshanks "
"hides!\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠! 방해하지말고 저리 물러나라!\" {n}녹-녹은 당신을 쫓아내듯 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"내가 shatshank를 때리고 차고 왕관을 훔치기 전에, "
"아마 네가 이야기를 할 수 있겠지, 하지만 그러고나서 — 물러나! 이제 대화는 충분하다. 가자. — 저길 봐 — 저기 shatshank가 숨어있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bd2644a2-16ab-4710-b4cc-7fff11cd873c"
msgid "Didn't let shaman infect prisoners."
msgstr "샤먼이 죄수들을 감염시키지 못하게 막습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "da511d1e-c957-4875-8d49-c7281833fde7"
msgid "[Interfere with the ritual]"
msgstr "[의식을 방해합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3ba0f12c-abb0-409f-bee4-58ac1b5057bf"
msgid "Let shaman infect prisoners."
msgstr "샤먼이 죄수들을 감염하게 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f717fcb8-7ee3-4019-918d-0c0721f8f50b"
msgid "[Stay hidden and watch]"
msgstr "[숨어서 지켜봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "0f467234-8c11-4918-aafd-595430edfb18"
msgid ""
"{n}You approach a massive totem of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} that is "
"surrounded by goblins. Despite all the noise you have made on your way here, "
"nobody pays any attention to you. Right now they are busy tying up "
"screaming, crying people to the totem. A few more goblins are standing "
"nearby, shrieking fiercely and stomping their feet to the rhythm of a melody "
"known only to them.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 고블린에게 둘러싸인 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 거대한 토템에 접근합니다. 당신이 이곳에 왔음에도 불구하고 그들은 "
"당신에게 주의를 기울이지 않습니다. 이제 그들은 비명을 지르기 시작하고 사람들에게 소리쳐 토템으로 가라고 합니다. 몇몇의 고블린들이 "
"주위에 서서 그들만이 아는 리듬으로 발을 굴리며 위협합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "6277b24e-a615-49c6-8b8a-ad0f1556c4ad"
msgid ""
"{n}The shaman emerges from behind the backs of his tribe members — a goblin "
"you already know, covered in tattoos and bedangled with amulets. This time "
"his face is painted with red clay and soot, and a necklace of sharp teeth "
"adorns his neck. The shaman is holding a crudely painted bowl above his head "
"and singing in a plangent, dismal tone that resembles a howl more so than a "
"song. The other goblins pick up the melody and give way to the shaman, who "
"is walking towards the totem.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}샤먼은 부족원들 뒤에서 나타납니다. 그 고블린은 문신으로 뒤덮여 목걸이를 주렁주렁 걸치고 있는 전에 봤던 그 녀석입니다. 이번에 그의 얼굴은 "
"붉은 점토와 검댕이 칠해졌고 날카로운 이빨 목걸이로 목을 장식했습니다. 샤먼은 조잡하게 칠한 그릇을 머리 위에 들고 노래라기 보다는 "
"울부짖음에 가까운 저질스러운 소리로 노래를 합니다. 다른 고블린은 따라서 노래를 부르며 샤먼이 토템으로 가도록 길을 비켜줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a0d0e5ab-9f64-4371-bcee-9e9eb3c3233b"
msgid ""
"{n}At the sound of your attack the goblins around the totem spring up to "
"their feet and grab their weapons. The shaman sees you and yells violently, "
"throwing the bowl of water at you. Before you have time to react, he "
"disappears in the goblin crowd — which, in turn, attacks you!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 공격하는 것을 듣고 토템 주변의 고블린들이 펄쩍 뛰어 무기를 잡기 시작합니다. 샤먼은 당신을 보고 격렬하게 소리치며 "
"물 그릇을 던집니다. 당신이 반응하기 전에 그는 고블린들 사이로 사라졌고 고블린들은 당신을 공격했습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "90000ccf-4dbb-4742-8bd5-1ce900ffd8d8"
msgid ""
"{n}As he approaches the prisoners, the shaman gives a short order. Two "
"goblins instantly leap out of the crowd and hang themselves on one of the "
"people tied to the post. One goblin grabs the prisoner by the hair and pulls "
"his head back, the other forces his jaws open — and the shaman, without "
"dropping the ritual song, pours the bowl's contents straight into the poor "
"fellow's mouth!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그가 포로들에게 접근했을 때 샤먼은 짧은 명령을 내립니다. 고블린 두마리가 무리에서 튀어나와 기둥에 묶인 한명에게 달라붙습니다. 한 "
"고블린은 죄수의 머리를 잡아 뒤로 젖혔고 다른 고블린은 강제로 그의 턱을 열었습니다. 그리고 샤먼은 의식의 노래를 부르면서 그릇의 "
"내용물을 불쌍한 인간의 입에 부었습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "44c0b87f-dfa9-49c7-ae85-a16fc5132907"
msgid ""
"{n} The strange procedure takes place again and again — the shaman doesn't "
"stop until he is sure that every prisoner has gotten his swill. At last, "
"having brought the ritual to its conclusion, the shaman turns around to face "
"the crowd — and notices you!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이상한 절차가 계속해서 반복됩니다. 샤먼은 모든 포로에게 의식을 할 때까지 멈추지 않습니다. 마침내 의식이 끝이 나자 샤먼은 군중을 "
"둘러보았고 당신을 발견했습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "371da5be-08b0-4d6e-ad4a-cf7ca96ddf22"
msgid ""
"\"LONGSHANKS! SMASH-SMASH-SMASH-SMASH-SMASH!\"\n"
"{n}The piercing shriek startles the goblins around the totem; screaming and "
"shouting, they dart towards their weapons. Before you have time to react, "
"the shaman disappears in the goblin crowd — which, in turn, attacks you!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"꺽다리다! 공격해라! 공격!\" \n"
"{n}날카로운 비명이 토템 주위의 고블린에게 퍼집니다. 비명을 지르고 고함을 외치며 그들은 무기로 달려듭니다. 당신이 반응하기도 전에 "
"샤먼은 고블린들 사이로 사라졌고 다시 당신을 공격했습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7260165b-9f2a-4112-bfad-bca92acf4877"
msgid "\"What are you waiting for? We've got to save them!\""
msgstr "\"뭐하고 있어?! 그들을 구해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "147204b0-052a-49b8-a904-f95e23315a5e"
msgid "\"This must be stopped. Please.\""
msgstr "\"이 의식을 멈춰야 합니다. 부탁합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/ShamanTotem/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d26b49e1-70fe-4f1c-b432-c6021f10c2bb"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian raises the symbol of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}.{/n} \"Sarenrae, "
"please, show us the way!\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 상징을 듭니다.{/n} \"서렌레이시여. 우리에게 길을 보여주소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Answer_18761_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6b26175a-63a6-41c5-8bfe-d153d6ab9879"
msgid ""
"Killed infected prisoners in goblin fort in order to protect others from "
"monsters."
msgstr "괴물로부터 다른 사람들을 보호하기 위해 고블린 요새에 감염된 죄수를 살해했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Answer_18761_Text
msgctxt "4571cca4-313f-4b73-aa33-031dc83ef82a"
msgid "[Attack] \"I cannot let you live and risk the lives of everyone else.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 네가 살아서 다른 사람들의 목숨을 위험에 처하게 둘 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Answer_18762_Text
msgctxt "670350b6-b902-48f8-a33c-0d8c4ef5ad0f"
msgid "[Examine the prisoners]"
msgstr "[포로를 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Answer_18763_Text
msgctxt "7e09f6ff-6aaa-41ec-b32b-0d36a408d9af"
msgid ""
"[Free the prisoners] \"The path is free. Go to Kesten and his militia — they "
"will take care of you there.\""
msgstr "[포로를 풀어줍니다] \"이제 가도 좋다. 케스턴과 그의 민병대에게 가. 그들이 너희를 돌봐줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Answer_18767_Text
msgctxt "fe0bf72f-3882-4012-8f4c-319e802a0b14"
msgid "[Leave the prisoners alone]"
msgstr "[포로들을 내버려둡니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Answer_18768_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6c45291a-9e8c-4ecd-95fe-f79dbb95aee8"
msgid "Killed prisoners in goblin fort."
msgstr "고블린 요새에서 포로를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Answer_18768_Text
msgctxt "6679202e-2773-4676-854a-9b8f5030953b"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm tired of all this rabble getting under my feet!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이런 무리들이 걸리적 거리것도 이젠 지쳤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Cue_18760_Text
msgctxt "025d3703-3c9e-43ff-9953-e021002967a7"
msgid ""
"{n}The prisoners are still chained to the totem. They look at you with "
"vacant eyes, as if they do not fully understand what is happening.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}죄수들은 여전히 토템에 묶여있습니다. 그들은 마치 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 이해하지 못한 것처럼 공허한 눈으로 당신을 "
"봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Cue_18765_Text
msgctxt "bbdddbc8-8928-405a-981d-a9ff11fc9630"
msgid ""
"{n}Simple clothes, work-worn hands, weather-beaten faces — the people in "
"front of you clearly earn their living under the sun or in the forest. Apart "
"from bruises and grazes, nobody seems hurt. An eerie, far-away look is stuck "
"on their still-wet faces.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}단순한 옷과 노동으로 닳은 손에 채찍으로 맞은 얼굴을 한 사람들이 당신 앞에서 숲 속 태양 아래 목숨을 이어가고 있었습니다. 멍과 "
"상처를 제외하고는 아무도 다치지 않은 것 같습니다. 그들의 젖은 얼굴은 여전히 섬뜩하고 멍한 표정을 짓고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Cue_18766_Text
msgctxt "afde8e33-b8a1-4a52-ac9d-23b70a11d8d6"
msgid ""
"{n}Simple clothes, work-worn hands, weather-beaten faces — the people in "
"front of you clearly earn their living under the sun or in the forest. Apart "
"from bruises and grazes, nobody looks seriously hurt. The prisoners are "
"looking at you slightly dazed, and a shadow of the horrors they've been "
"through hangs over their faces.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}단순한 옷과 노동으로 닳은 손에 채찍으로 맞은 얼굴을 한 사람들이 당신 앞에서 숲 속 태양 아래 목숨을 이어가고 있었습니다. 멍과 "
"상처를 제외하고는 아무도 심하게 다치지는 않은 것 같습니다. 포로들은 약간 멍한 표정을 짓고 있었고 그들은 아직도 공포에 "
"질려있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Cue_18771_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "874d79b6-4e53-4b54-b4fc-1ea5f295bda3"
msgid ""
"\"There is no salvation for them. Your duty is to grant them a quick, "
"painless death.\""
msgstr "\"그들을 구원할 수 없겠어. 너의 의무는 그들에게 신속하고 고통없는 죽음을 주는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Cue_18772_Text
msgctxt "e225d923-6142-4c45-adbb-7d70e0c1417f"
msgid ""
"{n}You strike several decisive blows, cutting short the prisoners' lives.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 포로들에게 치명적인 타격을 입혔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinKingFort/TotemPrisoners/Cue_18775_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c74671dd-caf5-480f-80fc-a322d070783b"
msgid "\"I hope these are the last of those little monsters' victims.\""
msgstr "\"이것이 괴물들에게 희생당하는 마지막이길 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/BagDialog/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "0080502c-8202-4c1e-9407-b9c979497af6"
msgid "[Pick up the purse]"
msgstr "[지갑을 주었습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/BagDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "adf23569-dfb3-4adf-9999-7ec5da17b4f5"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/BagDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "ab045919-5cbb-445d-85be-185a01033e06"
msgid ""
"{n}As you pick up the purse, a jubilant scream comes from the bushes, and "
"someone or something starts yanking on the rope — so hard you almost "
"stumble.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 지갑을 집어들었을 때 덤불에서 기뻐하는 비명이 들렸고 누군가 로프를 잡아당기기 시작합니다. 너무나 세게 당겨서 당신은 넘어질 "
"뻔했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/BagDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a15ea176-23c1-4c7a-aeba-24861a08f395"
msgid ""
"{n}Rather than fight it, you let go off the purse. It flies into the bushes "
"with a KRAK, followed by a howling scream. A group of goblins emerge, "
"snarling and shaking their fists.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}맞서 싸우지 않고 당신은 지갑을 넘겨줍니다. 그것은 덤불로 날아갔고 울부짖는 비명이 들렸습니다. 고블린들이 튀어나와 으르렁거리며 "
"주먹을 흔들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/BagDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "eb07556f-ec5f-4e2d-9bf9-08e38a80d459"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you can react, you're pulled to the bushes still holding the "
"purse. There, waiting for you, is a snare, surrounded by a band of goblins, "
"screaming triumphantly. They snatch up their weapons and leap to attack!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 반응하기 전에 지갑을 들고 있는 당신은 수풀로 끌려갑니다. 거기서 한 무리의 고블린들이 당신을 둘러싸 으르렁거리며 승리의 "
"비명을 지르면서 당신을 기다리고 있었습니다. 그들은 무기를 꺼내 당신에게 뛰어들었습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/BagDialog/Cue_Gobtrap-Fail_Text
msgctxt "ce0e861f-827f-4671-a4fa-134d80c791ea"
msgid ""
"{n}Whoever is holding the rope, he's strong — keeping a grip on the purse, "
"you try to keep your footing, but you're being dragged into the bushes!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}밧줄을 누가 잡고 있었는지 몰라도 힘이 정말 셌습니다. 지갑을 잡고 있던 당신은 버티고 있었지만 덤불 속으로 끌려갔습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/BagDialog/Cue_Gobtrap-Start_Text
msgctxt "4697c7b9-5510-4b72-bb9d-04924e12cf77"
msgid ""
"{n}A large coin purse lies in the middle of the road. The purse is tied to a "
"rope, awkwardly covered with dust as if to mask its presence — the rope "
"winds its way to a cluster of dense bushes nearby.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}커다란 동전 지갑은 도로의 한가운데에 놓여 있습니다. 지갑은 로프에 묶여있었고 조잡하게 흙으로 덮여있었습니다. 로프는 근처에 있는 "
"덤불에 연결되어 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/BagDialog/Cue_Gobtrap-Win_Text
msgctxt "aed82855-85fd-4368-901a-2a71f25f9359"
msgid ""
"{n}You pull the rope and there is a shout. A moment later, a band of goblins "
"leaps out from the bushes, screaming and shouting.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 밧줄을 당겼고 외침을 들었습니다. 잠시 후 고블린 무리가 덤불에서 뛰어나와 소리를 질렀습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/Barks/Bark_GoblinBush1_String
msgctxt "d49974b2-1f7d-4bd7-bf24-27752ad1455a"
msgid "\"Hee-hee-heeeee!\""
msgstr "\"히히히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/Barks/Bark_GoblinBush2_String
msgctxt "4ff004b6-9549-4d65-b8ae-dd0a2fc67dbe"
msgid "\"Look! Someone's coming, coming! Right here!\""
msgstr "\"봐! 뭔가 오고 있어! 바로 여기!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/Barks/Bark_GoblinBush3_String
msgctxt "103d4516-bb21-4536-93eb-61602a1f8831"
msgid "\"Be quiet! You all scare {mf|him|her} off!\""
msgstr "\"조용히 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "e64fbdf3-7487-4913-b867-912d8f0f1c7b"
msgid "\"LOOK OUT! GOBLINS!\""
msgstr "\"저기를 봐! 고블린이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "f5730b8a-e891-43f2-b2a5-976bf99d8c1e"
msgid "[Attack them]"
msgstr "[그들을 공격합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "81d1d10f-7335-4df9-bbb0-4baec52edba0"
msgid "[Leave unnoticed]"
msgstr "[조용히 떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "a6bd9556-daee-49c2-a9bf-555446f32cbe"
msgid "\"It was a trap? For whom?\""
msgstr "\"함정이었어? 누구를 잡기 위해서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "c7132776-a577-4807-97fd-72c36461338e"
msgid "\"Why would your shaman want to catch humans?\""
msgstr "\"왜 너희 샤먼은 인간을 잡으려 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "3c27faa5-122c-4659-aaa5-d9ce7c100c5d"
msgid "\"Have you caught anyone yet?\"\""
msgstr "\"아직 아무도 잡지 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "996d1fe9-fe92-48b9-be9f-cb6343d6af87"
msgid "\"So where is this shaman of yours?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 샤먼은 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f6782f8c-e9b4-46fc-980c-7f1bec42e06a"
msgid "Spared the manhunter goblins."
msgstr "사람 잡는 고블린을 살려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "7320356b-9e39-409d-83b1-297dd19f70d6"
msgid "\"Get out of here, now! I see you again, you'll get what you deserve!\""
msgstr "\"여기서 꺼져! 다시 보면 그 때는 후회할 줄 알아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4e7af0ba-b2be-4359-bba0-45a62d93d8a8"
msgid "Killed the manhunter goblins."
msgstr "사람 잡는 고블린을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "2b1903e0-b9a8-41e0-b84e-e8f32dc9e925"
msgid "[Attack] \"Catching humans, are you? I'll put an end to this.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"인간을 잡는다고? 이것을 끝내야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "176af719-8c71-4911-bdb2-10a72837090c"
msgid "Let the manhunter goblins keep hunting."
msgstr "고블린이 계속해서 사람을 잡도록 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "62e59a14-8332-40d6-8f46-09bf88b38028"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"Happy hunting — if anyone's fool enough to get caught in your "
"trap, they deserve what happens.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"즐거운 사냥 하라고. 어떤 바보가 너희 덫에 걸리면 그건 그들 탓이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e9e8d9ca-05ca-47e1-844f-fdd65dff0704"
msgid "Killed the manhunter goblins with cruelty."
msgstr "사람 잡는 고블린을 잔인하게 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "9cd3a903-3a2f-4656-a14b-cc57bc365417"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"And here I thought I might not get to hear some goblin death "
"screams today.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"오늘은 고블린의 비명 소리가 들리지 않을 거라고 생각했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "add82bfa-4d77-4604-a76c-f7afdbc51df3"
msgid "\"What's inside the purse?\""
msgstr "\"지갑 안에 뭐가 들어있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "b8c1aaf8-4bb9-4286-aec5-d7ca3e2ac3e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Rubbing their bruises, the goblins pick themselves up and try to brush "
"the dirt off — but their hands are so filthy, they cake on more with every "
"swipe.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}멍든 곳을 문지르며 고블린들은 일어나서 흙을 쓸어내려고 했지만 그들의 손은 너무 더러워서 계속해서 흙이 묻었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "28ec4834-1bed-440b-8c8f-c21f49d7e1a9"
msgid ""
"{n}Snarling, grimacing, and shaking their fists, the goblins approach.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}으르렁거리고 주먹을 흔들며 고블린들이 위협하며 다가옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a629ecaf-348c-45ac-aaf0-d3eeebb88b8e"
msgid ""
"{n}One of them stabs his finger at you.{/n} \"Not fair! You caught in our "
"trap! You surrender now!\""
msgstr "{n}그들 중 하나가 당신을 향해 손가락질합니다.{/n} \"공평하지 않아! 너 우리 함정에 걸렸어! 항복해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "e45332a5-61cc-4d00-bb10-d6f2dff79c6f"
msgid ""
"{n}A group of goblins is skulking in the bushes. One holds the end of a rope…"
" the other end is tied to a coin purse lying on the road. The goblins are "
"giggling to themselves and poking each other with their elbows.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린 무리가 덤불 속에서 움직입니다. 하나 로프의 끝을 잡았고... 다른 하나가 길 위의 동전 지갑을 잡고 있었습니다. 고블린들은 "
"낄낄거리면서 팔꿈치로 서로 찌르기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "9341bbd9-8fc8-4536-a309-5e681eb5b9ec"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblins are so intent on watching the road, they don't notice your "
"approach.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고블린은 길을 보는 것에 너무나 집중해서 당신이 오는 것도 몰랐습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "edd9b4bb-f7d5-41f8-84c0-05120e148973"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, a twig snaps beneath your feet — and the goblins spot "
"you. They screech, drop the rope, and scramble for their weapons. One of "
"them points his finger at you and then at the road.{/n} \"You stand wrong! "
"Trap be over there, you go there!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 다가갈 때 발 밑의 나뭇가지를 밟았고 고블린들이 당신을 발견했습니다. 그들은 비명을 지르고는 로프를 떨어뜨렸고 무기를 서둘러 "
"집습니다. 그들 중 하나가 당신을 가리키고는 길을 가리켰습니다.{/n} \"그곳에 서있으면 안돼! 함정은 저기에 있다! 저기로 가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "b7700666-2cc1-48c7-b7a5-7ed28f5d3047"
msgid ""
"{n}Caught by surprise, the goblins scatter — but in the wrong directions. "
"One of them accidentally jabs another with his dagger, while a third goblin "
"stumbles into a snare under the rope. Finally, they pull themselves together "
"and glare at you. One of them pokes his finger at you.{/n} \"Not fair! Not "
"fair! Trap be over there, why you sneak over here?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}기습에 놀란 고블린들이 흩어지지만 잘못된 곳으로 갔습니다. 놀라움에 휩싸인 고릴라는 흩어 지지만 잘못된 방향으로 빠져 나옵니다. 그 "
"중 한 명은 우연히 다른 단검으로 우연히 다른 고블린을 찌르고 세번째 고블린은 비틀거리며 걷다 로프에 걸립니다. 마침내 그들은 서로를 "
"일으켜세우고는 당신을 노려봅니다. 그들 중 하나가 당신을 손가락질합니다.{/n} \"불공평하다! 불공평해! 함정은 저기에 있는데 왜 너는 "
"여기로 몰래 온 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "76b5977b-bf5a-402f-ab9d-ea48e53ea0a0"
msgid ""
"\"For passers-by and other by-passers! They pass by back and forth, for no "
"reason at all. Shaman says — catch one or two, he find use for them!\""
msgstr "\"인간 둘이 필요했다! 그들이 아무 이유 없이 지나간다. 샤먼이 말했다. 한두놈을 잡아오라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "cd2e709a-60f4-42bb-b2d5-bca6be3fa442"
msgid ""
"\"Me not telling you! It be a secret!\" {n}The goblin scratches his head, "
"then whispers to the others.{/n} \"Any you know why shaman wanting humans? "
"He won't say? Damn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나 너에게 말 안한다! 비밀이다!\" {n}고블린은 머리를 긁으며 다른 고블린에게 속삭입니다.{/n} \"왜 샤먼이 인간 기다리는지 "
"알아? 그가 말해주지 않았다고? 젠장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "cd8d37d5-1e71-4b80-8795-82e09e212e1a"
msgid ""
"{n}Turning back to you, the goblin raises his finger.{/n} \"A secret! A very "
"big secret!\"{n} After that, as if unsure of what to do with is finger, he "
"awkwardly scratches behind his ear.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 보며 고블린은 손가락을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"비밀이다! 큰 비밀이다!\" {n}그 후에 그 손가락으로 무엇을 해야 하는지 "
"잘 모르는 것처럼 그는 귀 뒤를 어색하게 긁습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "3b724c23-fea0-4cc2-8c22-4288f46a815e"
msgid ""
"\"No way we did! We could, but you came and spoiled it all. Now shaman be "
"tearing our ears off… along with our heads!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 해냈다! 우리는 할 수 있지만 네가 와서 망쳤다. 이제 샤먼이 우리 머리에서 귀 찢어버릴 거다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "3a846bea-75e1-4873-8dc5-95369662595a"
msgid ""
"\"He be not far, in our fort by the river.\" {n}The goblin points, "
"presumably toward the fort.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그는 멀지 않은 곳에 강가 옆 요새 안에 있다.\" {n}고블린은 요새 쪽을 가리켰습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "7c94f684-d37a-42cf-aaa9-edba977a715e"
msgid "\"Nuh-uh, won't be telling you!\""
msgstr "\"너에게 말하지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "6ecfc193-4ca3-464a-b836-bb79ba096019"
msgid "{n}The goblins scream and run in all directions.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고블린은 비명을 지르며 사방으로 달립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinTrap/GoblinsFound/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "02492a19-9cb0-438c-be4b-a6e5380ee9be"
msgid "\"Stones! SMALL stones. You be expecting gold, huh? Ha, fooled you!\""
msgstr "\"돌이다! 작은 돌이다. 금을 기대했어? 속았지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_96440_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "60932a95-0a50-436d-88da-a868e75339b6"
msgid "Killed the goblins in the village for the joy of killing."
msgstr "재미로 마을 안의 고블린을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_96440_Text
msgctxt "f02621cf-dd78-4913-b26b-b9f8f87aeba0"
msgid "[Attack] \"Amusing screams — and I haven't even begun yet.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"비명소리는 즐거워. 아직 시작도 안 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97580_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "abe58517-a8c2-4c6e-a49e-c4594e142d10"
msgid "Killed the goblins in the village to protect your lands."
msgstr "당신의 땅을 지키기 위해 마을의 고블린을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97580_Text
msgctxt "490345e1-cf5b-4764-92af-3faf41d0e68f"
msgid "[Attack] \"Filthy pests! I'll purge my lands of you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"더러운 해충들! 나는 너희들로부터 내 땅을 청소할 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97582_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b78a2b4f-b851-4822-a744-9c7c699c6a3b"
msgid "Didn't bother with killing the goblins in the village."
msgstr "마을에서 궂이 고블린을 죽이지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97582_Text
msgctxt "fbaa3c6e-6ceb-45a0-bdb3-4c295b2cdc97"
msgid "[Leave] \"I won't dirty my hands on you. Leave here at once!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"내 손을 더럽히지 않겠다. 당장 여기를 떠나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97583_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "009552ee-8c49-4df5-b329-4a8abd8e0312"
msgid "Spared the goblins in the village out of mercy."
msgstr "자비롭게 마을의 고블린들을 살려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97583_Text
msgctxt "9362572a-0791-46a0-8397-df775221fca4"
msgid "[Leave] \"Fine, so be it. I'll spare your life.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"좋아. 그렇게 해라. 네 목숨을 살려주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97584_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "588c2e8f-5913-4dee-a8d2-ee7709c2ba9b"
msgid "Spared the goblins in the village to please Lamashtu."
msgstr "라마슈투를 기쁘게 하라며 마을에 있는 고블린들 살려줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97584_Text
msgctxt "3d4d93f9-1ad8-4199-9d1d-e39a1b7ce16a"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"I respect the Goddess. Praise her, for I am sparing your pathetic "
"lives.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"너희 여신을 존경한다. 한심한 너희를 살렸으니 그녀를 찬양해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97585_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "afe55c22-dbb5-4af3-9528-3f6b12402706"
msgid "Spared the goblins in the village because they were funny."
msgstr "마을의 고블린들이 우스워서 목숨을 살려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97585_Text
msgctxt "7d0720ab-2125-434f-bacc-d7db60aaffae"
msgid "[Leave] \"You're an amusing lot. Don't be frightened — we're friends!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"너희는 웃기는 재능이 있구나. 겁먹지 마. 우리는 친구야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97606_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fe235582-6929-42ba-aad6-1f540a2cd880"
msgid "Killed the goblins in the village in the name of Iomedae."
msgstr "이오메데의 이름으로 마을의 고블린을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97606_Text
msgctxt "7152d0ea-8d0f-45e5-878b-349ad2dd88b2"
msgid "[Attack] \"In Iomedae's name, I'll destroy these foul beasts!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이오메데의 이름으로 이 짐승들을 죽일 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97607_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "404124e7-3459-4354-b235-d1d9fdb60216"
msgid "Killed the goblins in the village in the name of Abadar."
msgstr "아바다르라의 이름으로 마을의 고블린을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Answer_97607_Text
msgctxt "9255fc57-16a7-48a6-b3b2-fe1b5b12320a"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I don't believe you can ever become civilized citizens — and so "
"there's no place for you in my barony. Abadar won't cry for you, and neither "
"will I.\""
msgstr ""
"[공격] \"네가 문명인이 될 것이라고 생각하지 않아. 그러니 내 영지에 너희가 있을 곳은 없다. 아바다르는 너희를 위해 울지도 않고 "
"나도 울지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_50347_Text
msgctxt "29220aff-34d8-40ef-bdcc-4eb87dc47690"
msgid ""
"{n}Huddled behind the statue of Lamashtu, a batch of goblins cast angry "
"glances at you, muttering threats and curses. One of them, apparently the "
"bravest, steps out, shaking his fist, and howls at you in a quavering "
"voice.{/n} \"You n-n-not dare c-c-come closer! We catch one of your kind "
"before, and {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} c-c-cursed him a terrible curse! She do "
"s-s-same to you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}라마슈투 동상 뒤에 숨은 고블린 몇이 저주를 퍼부으며 당신을 노려봅니다. 그들 중 하나는 용감하게 걸어나와 주먹을 흔들며 떨리는 "
"목소리로 울부짖습니다.{/n} \"가까이 오지 마! 우리는 너희 같은 녀석을 잡아서 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 저주를 "
"내렸다! 너도 똑같은 저주를 걸릴 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97587_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "b8df02ec-f407-47ff-8354-daf9967f94d6"
msgid ""
"\"Hey!\" {n}Nok-Nok pulls your sleeve.{/n} \"They might be right! They be a "
"bunch of stupid, loud, smelly and greedy worms... but if you kill them right "
"under statue of Goddess, she might get offended!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐!\" {n}녹-녹이 당신의 소매를 당깁니다.{/n} \"그들이 옳을지도 모른다. 그들은 어리석고 시끄럽고 냄새 나는 "
"욕심쟁이지만... 네가 그들을 여신의 동상 아래에서 죽이면 여신이 기분 나빠할 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97588_Text
#. Speaker : Moblin
msgctxt "e42c40d4-f23b-427d-984e-c691c7dd32ed"
msgid ""
"\"Hey!\" {n}The goblin tied to the pole shouts at you, struggling against "
"his bonds. {/n}\"Don't listen to them, you don't need them! Let them run! "
"Come here, I tell you something! Something important!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐!\" {n}기둥에 묶여있는 고블린이 묶인 줄을 흔들며 당신에게 소리쳤습니다.{/n} \"그들 말을 듣지 마라! 너는 그들 필요 "
"없다! 그들이 도망치게 둬라! 네게 할 말 있다! 중요한 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97589_Text
msgctxt "f25c65c1-9d80-4d8b-b3a0-d70ea61fb5ea"
msgid ""
"{n}He points his finger at the corpse of goblin you killed.{/n} \"See how "
"Goddess punishes the blashfeems? You run now, or she get you, too!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 당신이 죽인 고블린의 시체를 손가락으로 가리킵니다.{/n} \"여신이 신성모독자를 벌하는 것을 봤지? 도망치지 않으면 그녀가 "
"너를 잡는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97593_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "5623ad35-72b9-4e82-8e38-ca26c2ecc3e0"
msgid "\"They now want mercy. When prisoners begged them — they listened?\""
msgstr "\"그들은 자비를 원한다. 하지만 포로들이 부탁했을 때 그들이 들어주었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97594_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c943099c-b50b-4a4d-b679-e064c6049ca5"
msgid ""
"\"You must now make a choice between justice and mercy. Don't fear the wrath "
"of an evil goddess — it's not her who will judge you for this choice. This "
"will stay between your soul and your own deity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정의와 자비 사이에서 선택을 해야 한다. 악의 여신의 분노를 두려워하지 마라. 그 선택으로 여신은 너를 판단하지 않는다. 이건 너와 "
"네 여신 사이의 일이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97595_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "f2d68c56-7458-4708-a374-a5d142bdf1e4"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Yeah, now I'm scared! What will {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} do? Send "
"another owlbear for us to skin?\""
msgstr "\"하! 이제 무서운데! {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}가 무엇을 보낼까? 아울베어를 또 보내려나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97596_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3eb164f4-2d6a-4b0f-9648-e019b7ef7f75"
msgid "\"Ha-ha, these pests are funny. Let's fry them!\""
msgstr "\"이 녀석들 재미있네. 모두 튀겨주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97597_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "9c793d94-a9cc-4e53-a558-83ac90602de5"
msgid ""
"\"What are you waiting for? Kill these miscreants, and let's move on. I'm "
"fed up with this garbage heap.\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 기다리고 있어? 이 악당들을 죽이고 떠나자. 나는 이 쓰레기 녀석들이 질렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97600_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e8b4a4dc-0116-475d-9c3d-30cfd4a5ccf3"
msgid ""
"\"Great! Pray to your goddess, you little rats! She can't help you anyway, "
"ha ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"훌륭해! 여신에게 기도나 해라! 너를 돕지는 않을 테지만! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97602_Text
msgctxt "8b7e6777-9b03-40fc-b028-ad35856884c7"
msgid "\"Aaah! {g|Lamashtu}Goddess{/g}, let us sacrifice 'em to you!\""
msgstr "\"아아! {g|Lamashtu}여신{/g}이시여 그들을 제물로 바치게 하소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97603_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e29d344c-8c00-49fe-a657-340afbce6b2f"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} or not, you will be responsible for anyone these "
"vermin kill or maim. Do not press your luck — cleanse your lands of these "
"monsters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}이든 아니든 당신은 죽거나 다친 사람들을 위해 응징하셔야 합니다. 운에 맞기다가는 큰 코 "
"다치십니다. 이 괴물들을 없애십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/AttackGoblinsCivilians/Cue_97604_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "639fece4-5061-4566-a377-87951f4b1150"
msgid ""
"\"I would have said it differently, but our thoughts were essentially the "
"same.\" {n}A caustic smile touches Valerie's lips.{/n}"
msgstr "\"나는 다르게 말할 것이지만 우리의 생각의 본질은 같습니다.\" {n}미소가 발레리의 입술에 피어오릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Cordon-1_String
msgctxt "66039929-9868-4c42-bff5-23856bc3c6db"
msgid "\"Don't come closer! Or I poke you with a spear!\""
msgstr "\"가까이 오지 마라! 아니면 창으로 찌를 테다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Cordon-2_String
msgctxt "acbaf8fb-c7c4-401e-be09-7fd96489733b"
msgid "\"You can't go here! Get lost to where you came from!\""
msgstr "\"여기에 오지 마! 네가 왔던 곳으로 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Cordon-3_String
msgctxt "5d06629b-c690-4086-aa82-6462b3e1d102"
msgid "\"Come on, make yourself out! Right now, or else!\""
msgstr "\"어서 물러나! 당장 가지 않으면!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Cordon_flee-1_String
msgctxt "59c86fe1-f22c-48cf-a6ea-7e646227e9fa"
msgid "\"Show'em!\""
msgstr "\"보여줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Cordon_flee-2_String
msgctxt "ea3993f2-fc1a-4d55-b33d-48dac0987eff"
msgid "\"Come on! Hit the jumbos! I trust in you!\""
msgstr "\"어서! 저 녀석들을 혼내줘! 너를 믿어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Cordon_flee-3_String
msgctxt "1dea023a-f724-431c-b1bc-a585011e68e3"
msgid "\"Fight like heroes! We be remembering you!\""
msgstr "\"영웅처럼 싸워라! 우리가 너를 기억할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Entrance-1_String
msgctxt "6e2af043-39a0-4b72-96b6-502e30dbd93c"
msgid "\"Let's go with us, beastie… You'll like it there!\""
msgstr "\"우리와 함께 가자... 너도 좋아할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Entrance-2_String
msgctxt "cfec9ce1-83fc-4352-b33c-c1d44e80f798"
msgid "\"Friends in the village! Food, too!\""
msgstr "\"마을에 친구들이 있어! 음식도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Entrance-3_String
msgctxt "9b32d8c1-6e9b-4790-a87d-47f28cc9200e"
msgid "\"Hey, why he be roaring?\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 왜 그가 으르렁대는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Entrance-4_String
msgctxt "41c843c6-3fb2-4751-abbc-8ccc66379c6f"
msgid "\"Hey, hey, beastie! We be no food, we be friends!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 우린 음식이 아니라 친구다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-01_soldiers_String
msgctxt "cba007b0-eaa1-40f2-83cc-fc713495a54a"
msgid "\"Come here, beastie! That's a good one! Good one!\""
msgstr "\"이리온! 야수! 착하지! 착해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-02_soldiers_String
msgctxt "8895af38-4d01-43d8-b274-bb243295d762"
msgid "\"We be giving you food! Dinner! Lunch!\""
msgstr "\"너한테 음식을 줄 거야! 저녁도! 점심도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-03_soldiers_String
msgctxt "5fae4120-fa48-47eb-a4fb-58d35cc53b64"
msgid "\"Eat up that stupid Nok-Nok! It be about time!\""
msgstr "\"저 멍청한 녹-녹을 먹어버려! 지금이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-04_Kroonk_String
msgctxt "bb592e1f-6bcd-476b-ae78-63e52d53b396"
msgid "\"Fools! Nok-Nok laughs at you! Ha-ha-ha!\""
msgstr "\"멍청이들! 녹-녹은 너를 비웃는다! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-05_Kroonk_String
msgctxt "ceb026d1-e78c-4693-a1f8-8078edae9ff2"
msgid "\"Lamashtu herself protects me! You don't dare even touch me!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투가 나를 보호한다! 감히 날 건드리지 못할걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-06_king_String
msgctxt "dc421709-641f-47be-a34f-57ba9f0d213c"
msgid "\"We already touched you! And kicked you! And tied you!\""
msgstr "\"이미 건드렸다! 걷어찼다! 그리고 묶었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-07_shaman_String
msgctxt "1f5cbc11-35b3-4dbc-bdfe-7423fb98068a"
msgid ""
"\"We be seeing now how Goddess protects you! Why you stopped? Release the "
"beast at him!\""
msgstr "\"여신이 너를 어떻게 보호하는지 우리가 봐주마! 왜 멈춘거야? 저 놈에게 짐승을 풀어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-08_soldiers_String
msgctxt "6237fdf5-556a-421b-92e0-5e207d909770"
msgid "\"Come on, come on! Where be your dinner? Here it be!\""
msgstr "\"이리온, 이리온, 네 저녁이 어디 있을까? 바로 여기에 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-09_soldiers_String
msgctxt "49290987-02e1-403d-b9c5-fbc90c08ee31"
msgid "\"Not here, you stupid animal! Take your muzzle off me!\""
msgstr "\"여기가 아니야! 이 멍청한 짐승아! 그 주둥이를 내게서 치워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-10_soldiers_String
msgctxt "bff2fff9-9edc-43db-bceb-3b19301b825d"
msgid "\"You eat not me, you eat him!\""
msgstr "\"나를 먹지 말고 저 녀석을 먹어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-11_beast_String
msgctxt "d1f7c69a-caf8-4046-9a2b-9a9cbb7de926"
msgid "\"Rrrrarrrrrghhh!\""
msgstr "\"크아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-12_Kroonk_String
msgctxt "d3afb009-d782-4280-9520-555901611457"
msgid "\"He-he-he! I told ya! Told ya!\""
msgstr "\"헤헤헤! 내가 말했지! 분명 말했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-13_soldiers_String
msgctxt "e33c5b72-5e9e-45d5-bdf0-99bdf19b912d"
msgid "\"Run away!\""
msgstr "\"도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-14_soldiers_String
msgctxt "fd4f3ebc-a7ef-4078-99f4-354ce4c8b76a"
msgid "\"Lamashtu, have mercy!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투시여! 자비를 베푸소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-15_king_String
msgctxt "c568a935-4a0d-4881-91be-7ff2519d1519"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, why it be? How it be?! All, hear my orders! Strate-tactical wardrobal!"
"\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 왜 이런거야? 어떻게 된거야? 모두들 내 명령을 들어라! 일.단. 튀.어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Final-16_shaman_String
msgctxt "b2c504fc-cf55-40cf-9fc9-6a4faabf9ca7"
msgid "\"Where…? Don't leave me here!!\""
msgstr "\"다들 어디가는...? 나를 두고 가지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Manticore_run-1_String
msgctxt "42d25351-ade7-4c49-a28f-96b4e9ff4ca4"
msgid "\"Hey, why you be pushing me?\""
msgstr "\"왜 날 미는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Manticore_run-2_String
msgctxt "1d2765ba-d6e1-41ae-97b8-8e176d8fb51a"
msgid "\"Aaaaaaaah!\""
msgstr "\"아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Manticore_run-3_String
msgctxt "a0ec4439-ed8d-4abd-8da5-62ba747e1307"
msgid "\"Run, hurry, while he chows him!\""
msgstr "\"그가 씹는 동안 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Manticore_run-4_String
msgctxt "fff99097-0bbf-4c7c-a0cc-907faec1de85"
msgid "\"I be too handsome to die like that!\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 죽기에는 난 너무 잘 생겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Manticore_run-5_String
msgctxt "eaa98857-3d45-4392-99b0-6ac3aa9f391a"
msgid "\"Don't eat me! I be all elbows! I taste terrible!\""
msgstr "\"나를 먹지 마! 나는 뼈 밖에 없어! 맛도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Release_beast-1_String
msgctxt "6cb9e8be-2a86-40ca-835e-0dd1f531aeb9"
msgid "\"They come, they come! Come on!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 온다! 그들이! 어서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Release_beast-2_String
msgctxt "99495d37-8e9d-4e08-909c-1c5aed722dc0"
msgid "\"Here they be, beastie! Bite them!\""
msgstr "\"저기에 그들이 있어! 물어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Release_beast-3_String
msgctxt "64348156-7fe5-4d25-9216-3ed864b2474d"
msgid "\"Run, hurry!\""
msgstr "\"어서 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Release_beast-4_String
msgctxt "2276a8e2-735c-47a1-a32a-57f342f78988"
msgid "\"Flee!\""
msgstr "\"도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Runaway-1_String
msgctxt "bc49155e-d313-4d92-8e98-d6bae3e3a402"
msgid "\"Ouch! Enemies!\""
msgstr "\"아야! 적들이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Runaway-2_String
msgctxt "5f7634fd-aec2-4192-abb1-0ff846fdc626"
msgid "\"Don't dare touch us! Or Lamashtu curses you!\""
msgstr "\"우리에게 손 대지 마! 라마슈투가 너를 저주할 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Runaway-3_String
msgctxt "ac2393ec-9e2c-4491-990f-7d11843dd240"
msgid "\"Sword-swingers in our-village! Help! Watch out!\""
msgstr "\"마을에서 칼을 휘두른다! 도와줘! 조심해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Taunt-1_String
msgctxt "b23fa9e9-9492-46e1-a87e-3e28385be0dd"
msgid "\"Hey you, jumbo! Come here! I'll punch you hard!\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 너! 이리와봐! 세게 한방 때려주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Taunt-2_String
msgctxt "ad570823-6619-4f0c-b529-8ac92e49c97a"
msgid "\"Cluck-cluck! You stupid hulk! You lame potion-gulper!\""
msgstr "\"쯧쯧! 멍청한 인간 녀석! 포션중독자 같으니라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Taunt-3_String
msgctxt "b3907d9d-4d74-47d1-b94e-a2dda6f31794"
msgid "\"You be scared? Scared, huh? You be afraid?!\""
msgstr "\"쫄았냐? 쫄았어 어? 쫄았냐고?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Taunt-4_String
msgctxt "9ec4ba43-34ec-454d-a69d-02d5e7968d20"
msgid "\"Come here! I got something for you! Ha-ha-ha!\""
msgstr "\"이리 와봐! 너를 위해 준비한 게 있지! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Barks/Taunt-5_String
msgctxt "19efb934-fa80-457f-a072-c24ab3b0866a"
msgid "\"Ha-ha-ha! Ha-ha… Ouch...\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 하..하... 아흑...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinMiner/Answer_64988_Text
msgctxt "4e753319-4690-4bef-b8b9-36812e71d49b"
msgid "[Attack] \"You'll be dead before you know it.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나도 진짜 금방 널 죽여주마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinMiner/Answer_78798_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8d722db3-8f13-4684-bf84-ee294de2773b"
msgid "Spared the taunting goblin in the goblins' village."
msgstr "고블린 마을의 조롱하는 고블린들을 살려주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinMiner/Answer_78798_Text
msgctxt "d8ab72dc-1dc0-4fba-b8e0-16cb434d4082"
msgid "[Leave] \"Go on then, get out of my sight.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"가봐, 내 눈앞에서 사라져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinMiner/Cue_36482_Text
msgctxt "b9add543-0391-416c-8c62-b21de48e8ca9"
msgid ""
"\"Owwchh! Heh-heee... can't believe it, {mf|he|she} passed all the traps...\""
" {n}The goblin taps his fingers together, as if it helps him think — beads "
"of sweat are forming on his brow.{/n} \"What I do now, do now, do... ahhh, I "
"do know, I do!\"\n"
"{n}The goblin raises his hands, as if welcoming you.{/n} \"Gratulations, "
"'shanks! You passed my firstest test! And for that...\" {n}He begins "
"drumming his fingers again, and a bead of sweat builds, one becoming so "
"large it begins to curl his ear down.{/n} \"... for that you get a gift! "
"Wait here, wait here, I bring it right away... I be back before you know "
"it...\" {n}The goblin begins backing away, wiping his shaky hands over his "
"rags.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아이쿠! 헤헤... 믿을 수 없네. 모든 함정을 통과하다니...\" {n}고블린은 손가락을 두드리며 생각을 합니다. 그의 이마에는 "
"땀이 맺혔습니다.{/n} \"이제 어떻게 한다... 아아... 에라 모르겠다!\" \n"
"{n}고블린은 마치 당신을 환영하는 것처럼 손을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"축하한다! 꺽다리들! 너희는 내 첫 시험을 통과했어! 그리고 "
"상으로...\" {n}그는 다시 손가락을 두드리기 시작했고 이마에는 땀이 맺혔고 한방울이 귀에서 맺혀 커집니다.{/n} \"... 선물을 "
"가져와야 하니까! 여기서 기다려. 금방 갔다 올게... 진짜 금방이야...\" {n}고블린은 뒤로 물러나며 그의 날카로운 손으로 누더기를 "
"닦습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinMiner/Cue_78799_Text
msgctxt "bd382047-98ed-42a4-add0-f3dee27b29bd"
msgid "\"Aichhh! Why? Don't! A-a-a, murder! MURDER!\""
msgstr "\"아! 왜? 하지마! 살인! 살인자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinMiner/Cue_78800_Text
msgctxt "958ab068-1396-4701-9958-fe22b648e6ed"
msgid ""
"{n}Having backed away to what he deems far enough, the goblin raises four "
"fingers defiantly and spits at you, then scampers off in a run, giggling to "
"itself.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}충분히 뒤로 걸어왔다고 생각한 고블린은 도발적으로 네개의 손가락을 들고 당신에게 침을 뱉더니 낄낄거리며 단숨에 도망갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinMiner/Cue_78803_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bc726f7a-db61-43af-8469-e8d622dd1d6d"
msgid "\"Little pest! I'll cut you in half!\""
msgstr "\"요 쪼끄만 벌레 녀석! 너를 반으로 갈라줄 테다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinMiner/Cue_78805_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e3a7b5eb-dd27-4bcc-8cc5-0011f5ecc5f2"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal reaches for her weapon.{/n} \"Had your fun yet? Because it's my "
"turn now.\""
msgstr "{n}제이탈이 그녀의 무기를 꺼내려 합니다.{/n} \"충분히 즐겼어? 이제 내 차례야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_24834_Text
msgctxt "68f9f54b-7107-469b-872a-ca7038420a39"
msgid "\"Fine, open the gates.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 문을 열어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_63193_Text
msgctxt "b798f68a-0b1b-4b72-99f9-7989aafd7d31"
msgid "[Leave] \"I have no time for this nonsense.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 이런 말도 안되는 이야기를 할 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_65086_Text
msgctxt "4dc07aef-8dba-4218-ba22-d7f1cafd43a7"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll feed your beast… with your corpse, goblin.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그래, 짐승에게 먹이를 좀 줘야겠어...네 시체로 말야. 고블린.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70442_Text
msgctxt "3f5cd5e9-84d5-4775-be08-8402d63ef5a0"
msgid "[Leave] \"Feed your animals yourself.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"네 애완동물 먹이는 네가 직접 먹여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70443_Text
msgctxt "1da8b20b-4284-4390-b377-b1886472106c"
msgid "\"What did you call me?\""
msgstr "\"나를 뭐라고 부른거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70445_Text
msgctxt "d0988141-9fa9-4e12-941e-b315e5b61429"
msgid "\"Deal, I'll do it.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 내가 할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70447_Text
msgctxt "7e7a45bf-a252-4101-bde8-78d3b01e6276"
msgid "\"What is this task?\""
msgstr "\"그 임무라는건 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70452_Text
msgctxt "fdf7e564-f6ab-453c-9386-aa5818ed475a"
msgid "\"Missions require I be paid first.\""
msgstr "\"돈을 먼저 받아야 겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70454_Text
msgctxt "69446855-63e2-4765-adab-1c50c4422e08"
msgid "\"Won't this animal attack me?\""
msgstr "\"저 짐승이 날 공격하지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70456_Text
msgctxt "0316f29d-af8a-44e2-b561-ca6d3b5eccbc"
msgid "[Attack] \"Let me show you how angry I am.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내가 얼마나 화가 났는지 보여주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70457_Text
msgctxt "af4695b1-9b44-44e2-9d1c-fd21f0db8077"
msgid "[Leave] \"Why am I wasting my time on you?\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"왜 내가 너에게 시간을 낭비하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70479_Text
msgctxt "b2991cfb-8be1-4a50-9867-a14c271bb28e"
msgid "\"We can always kill him later. Let's hear him out.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 언제나 그를 죽일 수 있어. 일단 들어 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70480_Text
msgctxt "a6e01015-c911-48e8-8dc4-b521fbfd0324"
msgid "[Attack] \"Ha ha ha! Go on! Burn him!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"하하하! 그래! 그를 불태워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70481_Text
msgctxt "c4bc469f-3d7c-4fdc-953c-a0f89969a061"
msgid ""
"\"Hide your weapon and shut your mouth. I'm almost as sick of your "
"disorderly conduct as I am of your stupid jokes!\""
msgstr "\"무기를 숨기고 입 닥쳐. 네 멍청한 농담은 물론 네가 하는 짓도 질렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Answer_70483_Text
msgctxt "2036f8ee-8824-444e-af64-626835010da3"
msgid ""
"\"Put your weapon away. Why do you even need it? Your puns alone will kill "
"them!\""
msgstr "\"무기를 치워. 무기는 필요하지 않아. 네 말장난으로 그들을 죽일 거니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_10438_Text
msgctxt "ca038a45-fc0a-40f4-b6bb-518d8c71e52d"
msgid ""
"\"Hey — hey, you, potion-gulper! Like questes? Going on misshuns? I have a "
"one for you!\""
msgstr "\"이봐이봐, 너! 포션중독자! 퀘스트 좋아해? 미션하고 싶어? 내가 하나 주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_23780_Text
msgctxt "59239f8a-79f6-4ba8-9ac7-61aa7a7d1c0b"
msgid ""
"\"Awchhh! Heh-heee… no believe it, the beastie attacked? No! Who have "
"thought! Heh-heee… you not angry? Yes?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아악! 헤..헤... 믿기지 않는군. 짐승이 공격했다고? 설마! 누가 생각이나 했겠어? 헤헤... 너 화 안났지? 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_34562_Text
msgctxt "6b224ad6-e2f2-4e2e-b649-9847e96f8b85"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you real hero, I sees it! Go in, play with him, I bring food right "
"away!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 네가 진짜 영웅이다! 문을 열테니, 들어가서, 저 친구와 좀 놀아주고 있어, 내가 음식 금방 가져올테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70444_Text
msgctxt "8b6e709c-837c-4ba4-88d0-fc4b607fc30b"
msgid ""
"\"Potion-gulper! Like, sword-swinger! Like, bow-shooter! One of those who go "
"run around woods, go deep in caves, on misshuns and questes like that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"포션 중독자! 아니면, 칼 휘두르는 자 라던지! 아니면, 활 쏘는 자 라던지! 숲속을 뛰어다니고, 동굴도 깊숙히 들어가고, 그 왜, "
"미션이나 퀘스트 같은거 하는 사람들 있잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70446_Text
msgctxt "477bc97f-8f33-49c7-bb6a-6adda283b0ea"
msgid ""
"\"Really? That be great… Hey!\" {n}The goblin looks strangely indignant.{/n} "
"\"You not even ask what the misshun IS!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말? 그렇다면 좋아... 아니, 이봐!\" {n}고블린은 이상하게 화가 나 보입니다.{/n} \"너는 미션이 뭔지 묻지도 않았잖아!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70448_Text
msgctxt "e5ec4902-103c-4403-8b44-a4f5a87dde33"
msgid ""
"\"Short tale, make shorter! See — beastie in cage? My fren and I looking "
"after him. We divide work — I open gate, fren goes in, feeds the beastie. "
"Got it?\" {n}The goblin glances around, slightly irritated.{/n} \"But he be "
"lazy, go away. What I offer is open gate, you go inside — give beastie food!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"짧은 이야기를 더 간단히 하겠다! 저기 봐봐. 저 감옥안에 짐승이 보여? 내 친구와 나는 그를 돌보고 있어. 우리는 일을 분담해서 "
"해. 내가 문을 열면, 친구가 들어가서 짐승을 먹인다. 알겠어?\" {n}고블린은 약간 짜증이 난 표정으로 주위를 봅니다.{/n} "
"\"하지만 그는 게으르다. 멀리 가버렸어. 그래서 내가 주는 퀘스트는, 문을 열어줄 테니 네가 들어가서 짐승에게 음식을 주는거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70450_Text
msgctxt "17f12008-58dc-4451-8aa2-4356aca1f902"
msgid "\"PFfft! You no hero, only name hero, worst hero!\""
msgstr "\"흥! 너 영웅 아니다. 이름만 영웅이고 최악이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70451_Text
msgctxt "b8ef8092-f143-4edf-88d6-d2b1d842aa2e"
msgid "\"Change mind, huh? It good musshun, promise! You like it!\""
msgstr "\"마음을 바꿨어? 좋은 임무다! 약속해! 너는 좋아할 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70453_Text
msgctxt "ef07c81b-fddc-4409-a301-75397861f9ab"
msgid ""
"\"You be such a greedy fingers! What can give you…\" {n}The goblin glances "
"around.{/n} \"Nothing, nothing, nothing! But…\" {n}His eyes gleam.{/n} \""
"...you have an expar-ince you not unforget!\""
msgstr ""
"\"욕심 많은 녀석! 너에게 줄 것은...\" {n}고블린이 주위를 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"없어. 없다! 없다! 하지만...\" {n}"
"그의 눈빛이 빛납니다.{/n} \"... 너는 잊지 못할 경험을 하게 될꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70455_Text
msgctxt "9755d913-8858-4eba-96fb-37b77df80a98"
msgid ""
"\"No-no-no, nothing like that! He be just a pet! Like slug or spider… small "
"spider. Or grot snake!\" {n}He pauses.{/n} \"Little grot snake?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니-아니-아니 안 그래! 녀석은 그저 애완 동물이다! 달팽이나 거미처럼... 아니면 뱀처럼!\" {n}그는 멈춥니다.{/n} \"작은"
" 애완용 뱀이라고나 할까..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70459_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "74340fd7-ac25-4513-a15a-21ca2fafad46"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, now that's just the kind of language the old legends need! Just "
"imagine — 'This is the saga of Tormund, brave potion-gulper, who ran around "
"in the woods doing misshuns'... Amazing, ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저런 말을 고대 전설에서도 사용하면 재밌을꺼 같아요! 마치 이렇게요. '이 전설은 토르문트의 용감한 포션 중독자가 숲에서 미션을 깨던 "
"이야기입니다'... 이거 대단한데요. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70462_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "aeb56673-1def-45d4-b7db-d0f5717572d3"
msgid ""
"\"Are we running errands for goblins now? Please tell me you are not serious."
"\""
msgstr "\"우리 지금 고블린에게 심부름을 받는 겁니까? 제발 농담이라고 말해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70466_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d7c5f84c-53d8-4382-ae33-520f1ab0dcfa"
msgid ""
"\"You hear that? Why, he's a natural-born book publisher! You wouldn't "
"believe how many times I found myself sitting in their posh studies, "
"listening to these exact words!\""
msgstr "\"들었어? 타고난 출판 편집이라는군! 내가 연구를 하면서 그런 말을 얼마나 많이 들어 봤는지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70468_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a414b4c4-cf92-4063-9cc0-7aa2916dc358"
msgid "\"You can't be serious.\""
msgstr "\"설마 진심은 아니겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70472_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "aa7e009c-78dd-43ef-895c-4d7f081e72ab"
msgid ""
"\"Angry? At you? You're not worth my anger. You merely annoy me — and that's "
"reason enough to kill you.\""
msgstr "\"화가 났다고? 너에게? 너에게 화 낼 가치도 없어. 너는 나를 짜증나게 했고 그걸로 네가 죽을 이유는 충분해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70474_Text
msgctxt "49d56a58-b5bf-4a03-bd59-1986cbc2d59c"
msgid "\"Dooon't!\""
msgstr "\"그만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70476_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d3aa6f93-b44e-41a5-a997-d3018edd094b"
msgid ""
"\"Running missions for this freak? I'd rather chop him to pieces and... "
"gobble 'em up! Ha ha!\" {n}Regongar smirks menacingly as he reaches for his "
"weapon.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이 괴물을 위해 임무를 한다고? 차라리 이 녀석을 조각내버리고... 먹어버리겠어! 하하!\" {n}레곤가르는 무기에 손을 대며 "
"위협적으로 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70482_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "87ef3c34-ce19-4f0c-9faa-b362f7803356"
msgid ""
"\"Heh... Gobble 'em up, get it? Hmm...\" {n}Realizing no one liked his pun, "
"Regongar scowls and spits on the ground.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"헤헤... 먹어버리겠다고. 알겠어?\" {n}아무도 그의 말장난을 좋아하지 않는다는 것을 깨달은 레곤가르는 바닥에 침을 "
"뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70484_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d7a70d4f-9cc1-4dce-a74e-ad904ec58e96"
msgid ""
"{n}With a guffaw, the half-orc takes his hand off his weapon, but he keeps "
"watching the goblin menacingly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}투덜거리며 하프 오크는 무기에서 손을 때지만 그는 계속해서 고블린을 무섭게 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinOpener/Cue_70485_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c29180fd-c8a2-414c-8d92-2e0ba5f9573e"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, fine... Was it something I said?\" {n}Grumbling, the half-orc spits "
"on the ground.{/n}"
msgstr "\"좋아... 내 말이 이상해?\" {n}불평을 하며 하프 오크는 땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Answer_07939_Text
msgctxt "818fad84-eb04-48fb-a8d1-6e7ef541ed9d"
msgid "[Shake goblin's hand] \"Deal.\""
msgstr "[고블린과 악수합니다] \"좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Answer_85011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d32cb45e-8e41-4515-9534-1b5c0e42788f"
msgid "Tried to murder the goblin merchant."
msgstr "고블린 상인을 살해하려 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Answer_85011_Text
msgctxt "53ae90bc-7bd1-4cb0-a215-6da2f157b228"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't trade with goblins, I cut them down.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 고블린과 거래하지 않아. 베어버리지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Answer_85013_Text
msgctxt "0ce7ca35-cb93-4927-b3a8-f470ce8302f9"
msgid "\"What are you selling?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 팔아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Answer_85014_Text
msgctxt "c212eb94-f055-4fd2-8823-dcf71cc643bb"
msgid "\"How's the merchant trade?\""
msgstr "\"장사는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Answer_85015_Text
msgctxt "df16e6af-eec3-4a5a-9d9d-3f5368c7874b"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Answer_85021_Text
msgctxt "2ff4b40b-6b29-48f5-ae36-5ae2c6a55506"
msgid "[Leave] \"Good luck with your trading.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"돈 많이 벌어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_20645_Text
msgctxt "2f1dbbae-e0b0-49c9-aea4-78924fbfe220"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, the goblin stands, grinning with wide, yellow teeth "
"almost as sharp as his eyes are. You notice a large, dirty sack behind him, "
"which you almost mistook for a second goblin.{/n} \"Ah, an adventurer! Greet "
"and well comes! I Chwurk, a buyer! I sell, I trade — whatever you, sword-"
"swingers, need, I offer! Want to buy something? I can see it in your eyes, "
"yes, you do! Just five money-pieces! Not got that much? Ten then! No? Twist "
"my wrists I give discount — just half... half-hundred! So, have a deal? "
"Deal, deal?\" {n}He sticks out his palm, trying to shake your hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하자 고블린은 그의 눈 색깔만큼이나 노란 이빨을 드러내며 히죽히죽 웃으며 서있습니다. 당신은 그의 뒤에 크고 더러운 "
"가방을 발견하였는데, 당신은 그것이 다른 두번째 고블린으로 착각할뻔 했습니다.{/n} \"모험가! 안녕. 환영한다! 나는 츄와크. "
"장사꾼이다! 나는 팔고 거래한다. 너처럼 칼 휘두르는 자들에게 물건 판다! 살 거 있어? 네 눈을 보니 무언가 사고 싶은 것이 분명해! "
"돈 5개면 된다! 비싸지 않다고? 그럼 10개! 싫다고! 깎아주려는 내 팔을 꺾으려 하는 건가... 그럼 50개! 거래 됐어? 됐지? 응?"
"\" {n}그는 손바닥을 내밀고 악수하려 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_85012_Text
msgctxt "31669cef-ba2f-4c43-8714-f36a0e57eb80"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin's palm is covered in something sticky you can't identify — but "
"can definitely feel crawling on your skin. Oblivious, he continues to shake "
"your hand with enthusiasm — he's got an amazingly strong grip. {/n} \"Great! "
"We rich now! A deal of all time!\" {n}He slowly stops shaking your hand, and "
"you take the opportunity to unpeel yourself from his grip.{/n} \"Wait.... "
"hold on, what we dealing about now?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린의 손바닥은 알 수 없는 끈적거리는 것으로 덮여 있지만, 당신의 피부에서 확실히 뭔가 기어다니는것 같은 느낌이 듭니다. 그는 "
"열정적으로 악수를 계속합니다. 그는 손아귀가 정말 세었습니다.{/n} \"좋아! 우리는 이제 부자다! 계속 거래한다!\" {n}그는 "
"천천히 손을 흔들었고 당신은 그의 손을 놓을 기회를 얻었습니다.{/n} \"잠깐만... 우리가 무엇을 거래하고 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_85016_Text
msgctxt "73963983-2477-443f-b744-5a5f6ac92f27"
msgid ""
"\"Everything you be needing for adventures, spell-casting, sword-swinging! "
"Just look at yourself — who can you beat with metals and craftings like "
"that? Only today, only for you — bestest weapons made by goblin bestest "
"crafters! Just wait...\""
msgstr ""
"\"모험에 필요한 모든 것이 있다! 마법에 필요한 물건 칼질에 필요한 물건 있다! 네 모습을 봐. 누가 그런 쇠붙이와 조잡한 물건으로 "
"싸움을 하겠어? 오늘만 너에게 고블린이 만든 최고의 무기를 판다! 기다려라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_85017_Text
msgctxt "b4c5faa7-4cbd-4f86-8d01-32cd61710cb0"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin reaches into the sack by his side and produces... a stick with "
"a rusty nail at the end. He swings it several times with a SWSSSSH, almost "
"hitting his own ear. {/n}\n"
"\"This one — can bring whole troll down! Take it, it not be many coins. "
"Don't like it? Fine, I can sell you a hydra, if you like! It be a good "
"hydra, all teeth and claws! Just a giant-house of money-pieces — and it "
"yours!\" {n}He puts on a grim expression, as if afraid of being cheated.{/n} "
"\"Delivery — cost you though!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 옆에 있는 자루에 손을 뻗고... 못이 박힌 몽둥이를 꺼냅니다. 그는 몇번 그것을 붕붕 휘둘렀고 자신의 귀를 때릴 "
"뻔했습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"이건 트롤도 쓰러뜨릴 수 있다! 가져가라. 싸게 준다. 싫다고? 잠깐만. 네가 좋다면 히드라를 팔 수도 있다! 이빨도 있고 발톱도 "
"있는 좋은 히드라다! 집채만한 돈을 가져오면 네 거다!\" {n}그는 사기꾼을 잡을 듯한 엄숙한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"배달도 "
"해준다! 비용은 들지만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_85019_Text
msgctxt "36f14347-a3a1-468d-8ec5-71a2588da312"
msgid ""
"\"Not good. One can't trade with them! They no money, not a single slivs "
"shiny or copper circle — only teeth, rocks.\" {n}The goblin suddenly "
"brightens.{/n} \"Hey, what about you, you have money?\" {n}Just as suddenly "
"he narrows his eyes.{/n} \"But maybe you try fool me? See wares, take wares, "
"run? If so, I be seeing money first!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋지 않다. 그들과 거래 할 수 없다! 그들은 반짝이는 은이나 동으로 된 동그라미도 없다. 그저 이빨과 바위 뿐이다.\" {n}"
"고블린이 갑자기 밝아졌습니다.{/n} \"너는 어때? 너 돈있어?\" {n}갑자기 그는 눈이 작아집니다.{/n} \"하지만 나를 "
"속이려고? 물건을 보자고 해놓고 가지고 갈 거야? 그러면 네 돈 먼저 보여줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_85020_Text
msgctxt "245aa08f-f4a8-4a8c-80ea-95463e3732d2"
msgid ""
"\"Aieee, hold on! No claws!\" {n}Almost quicker than your eye can follow, "
"the goblin snatches up the sack, dives under the nearest fence — and "
"vanishes. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아이이. 기다려! 발톱은 안돼!\" {n}너무나 빠른 속도로 고블린은 자루를 낚아채더니 가장 가까운 울타리 아래로 뛰어들고는 "
"사라졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_85022_Text
msgctxt "dc834186-21e9-49f0-844b-ac81a8865e54"
msgid ""
"\"How you be doing? Killed many beasties? Need wares? Ready make deal now "
"with Chwurk? Say yes!\" {n}The goblin thrusts out his palm, trying to shake "
"your hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 지내? 짐승 많이 죽였어? 물품 필요해? 이제 츄와크와 거래할 거야? 맞다고 말해라!\" {n}고블린은 손바닥을 내밀어 "
"악수하려 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_85024_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "7cec85d1-5e7e-41df-ae09-10f3b7e53127"
msgid ""
"\"And this, ladies and gentlemen, is precisely how most merchants in "
"{g|Absalom}Absalom{/g} do business.\""
msgstr "\"이것이 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g} 상인의 장사 방식이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/GoblinTrader/Cue_85027_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a16a749b-4135-456f-95dd-dff4cda76f2e"
msgid ""
"\"Why even talk to these vermin? Just cut 'em up and forget about 'em.\""
msgstr "\"왜 이런 벌레같은 녀석과 대화를 하려는 거야? 그냥 베어버리고 잊어버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51159_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6e2ac104-9f55-497b-bea3-e367ef1bc248"
msgid "Murdered Nok-Nok the friendly goblin."
msgstr "친근한 고블린 녹-녹을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51159_Text
msgctxt "05543b19-197c-46f6-acc9-7a179732f32d"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I've heard all I need to hear — and you've said all you need to "
"say.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"필요한 건 모두 들었다. 그리고 너도 할 말 다한거 같은데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51160_Text
msgctxt "c3254210-b2d3-4463-9e11-5c4f36ea0573"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51162_Text
msgctxt "60f4bf77-bb38-43b2-bed3-3fda03fe792c"
msgid "\"Why did they want to kill you?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그들이 너를 죽이려고 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51164_Text
msgctxt "18da1a53-38e8-43a5-8d85-574db10ae230"
msgid "\"What makes you think you are the Seer of Lamashtu?\""
msgstr "\"왜 네가 라마슈투의 선견자라고 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51165_Text
msgctxt "6d3b606e-ae78-41e5-96c2-27d8ffded755"
msgid "\"What do you know about the incursion of enchanted beasts?\""
msgstr "\"마법에 걸린 짐승들의 침입에 대해 아는 것이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51167_Text
msgctxt "196a00a2-4de5-440e-9fd0-eb853311724e"
msgid "[Leave] \"Thanks for the information.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"정보 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51171_Text
msgctxt "3bdc2615-3670-4e38-8251-05acb738872e"
msgid "\"You want to go with me?\""
msgstr "\"나와 함께 가고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51172_Text
msgctxt "4bc8164f-3031-40c8-948c-2ce91634b1c4"
msgid "[Let Nok-Nok join the party] \"Why not? Join us.\""
msgstr "[녹-녹을 일행에 넣어줍니다] \"좋아! 우리 일행에 들어와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51173_Text
msgctxt "18a37926-4a1f-49bd-9533-8aec868ba509"
msgid ""
"[Leave Nok-Nok in the village] \"Maybe some other time… far, far from now.\""
msgstr "[녹-녹을 마을에 두고 떠납니다] \"다음에 보자... 아주 멀고 먼 훗날쯤에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51174_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "09a38360-d69a-49dc-8c4e-d13a24c8a326"
msgid "Murdered Nok-Nok the friendly goblin."
msgstr "친근한 고블린 녹-녹을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51174_Text
msgctxt "8610e16e-f6dc-4526-bc44-786dd316e4de"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're not going anywhere.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"넌 아무데도 못간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51179_Text
msgctxt "8d225b07-097b-41de-a264-91a026d7d8d3"
msgid "\"What should I do with your kin?\""
msgstr "\"네 동족들을 어떻게 해야할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Answer_51181_Text
msgctxt "8a1a95be-fb4f-4dae-82aa-aa85a75691ab"
msgid "\"I've killed your people. Aren't you scared of me?\""
msgstr "\"나는 고블린을 죽였어. 내가 두렵지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51156_Text
msgctxt "b0e6901a-41fd-4524-bc57-1d554a7992b2"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin, tied to the pole, has seen better days — he's covered in "
"filth, and a wide variety of burns, bruises, claw marks — even a bite mark "
"or two. Yet he's smiling widely, as if in triumph.{/n} \"Hah! The shatshanks "
"not believe Nok-Nok, poked him with words and spears and torches, bite him, "
"kick him... who be survivor now, huh? Nok-Nok, me, always me! Hail "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}기둥에 묶인 고블린은 더러운 꼴입니다. 그는 오물을 뒤집어쓰고 화상, 멍, 발톱 자국으로 상처가 나있었습니다. 심지어 한두번 물린 "
"흔적도 보입니다. 그러나 그는 마치 승리자처럼 웃고 있습니다.{/n} \"하하! shatshank가 녹-녹 믿지 않아서 욕하고 창으로 찌르고 "
"고문했다... 하지만 누가 살아남았지? 바로 녹-녹이다! 항상 나야! {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g} 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51157_Text
msgctxt "b3aa3642-17cb-4249-9751-84dbc5773d08"
msgid ""
"\"Greet and meet, heroes! Seen, how I dealt with them? They were like — 'we "
"be smashing you'… and I snarl back — 'no, I be smashing YOU!' And the beast "
"was — 'RrrrRRGH!' And bite! And bite again! Ha-ha! That's it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕! 영웅들! 봤지? 내가 그들을 어떻게 상대하는지! 그들이 나한테 '우리가 널 박살내주마'...근데 난 그걸 받아쳐서 '아니, "
"내가 널 박살내주마!' 그리곤 야수가 '크아아!' 물고 또 물고! 하하! 바로 그거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51161_Text
msgctxt "41fb862f-ed3a-42f2-9742-75152addf0dd"
msgid ""
"\"I be the ear of Lamashtu!\" {n}The goblin grins widely, then falters.{/n} "
"\"No, not that... I be... the see-er of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, that's who "
"I be! Her favorite of many! I bring Her message, She protects me, sends me "
"offerings to eat, and whatnot! I be important, very portant presson!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 라마슈투의 귀다!\" {n}고블린은 넓게 미소 짓더니 말을 더듬습니다.{/n} \"아니... 그게 아니라... 나는... "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 선견자다! 그게 바로 나다! 그녀가 가장 좋아하는 한명! 나는 그녀에게 메시지를 전달하면 그녀가 "
"나를 보호하고 먹을 것을 보내준다! 나는 중요하다! 매우 중요 인물!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51163_Text
msgctxt "72578b04-3561-4301-9163-0e9414b8a4b4"
msgid ""
"\"Ah! It be because of that halfhead shaman, bees bite his back! He be crazy "
"— something get in his way, he be snarling and poking people with fork.\" {n}"
"He huffs, then grumbles and shivers, as if trying to dodge invisible pokes "
"and prodding in his memories.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아! 그건 멍청한 샤먼 녀석 때문이야. 벌들이 그 녀석 등을 쏘았거든! 그러더니 미쳐서는, 누구건 간에 자기를 방해하면 전부 "
"으르렁거리며 찌르고 다닌다.\" {n}그는 씩식거리더니, 갑자기 으르렁 거리며 보이지 않는 창을 피하려는 듯 몸을 흔들어 댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51166_Text
msgctxt "104ef6db-bbfb-4b56-a880-0edf17b2947b"
msgid ""
"\"I had dream.\" {n}The goblin leans in as far as he can, nodding, the cords "
"creaking as he does so.{/n} \"Lama hold Nok-Nok in her big white arms, rock "
"me, let me suckle her skulls, pet my head, and sing... Who smaaartest? Who "
"braaavest? Who faaaavorite? Nok-Nok, that's who! And the next day? Proof! I "
"found nest! Untouched, with eggs.\" {n}He moves to rub his belly, but the "
"cords stop him.{/n} \"It be a sign! And bigger sign? Lama just save me — "
"right before your eyes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"꿈을 꾸었다.\" {n}고블린은 몸을 최대한 기울이며 끄덕이자, 그를 묶은 줄도 같이 삐그덕거립니다.{/n} \"라마가 커다란 하얀 "
"팔로 녹-녹을 안아서 흔들어주고, 내 머리를 쓰다듬어주고, 그리고 노래를 해줬어... 누가 제일 똑똑하지? 누가 제일 용감하지? 내가 "
"제일 아끼는건 누구지? 저요! 녹-녹이요! 그리고 그 다음 날이 되자 그 꿈은 바로 증명됐어! 내가 둥지를 찾은거야! 그것도 먹음직스러운 "
"깨끗한 알이 있던 둥지로 말야.\" {n}그는 배를 문지르려고 움직이지만, 묶인 줄이 그를 막습니다.{/n} \"이게 바로 신호야! 더 "
"대단한 신호도 있어! 방금 라마가 나를 구해준거지! 그것도 바로 네 눈 앞에서 말야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51168_Text
msgctxt "55411191-e42a-4a0c-8a54-b3d909c15437"
msgid ""
"\"Beasts?\" {n}The goblin frowns, then shakes his head.{/n} \"Lama, "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} be their mother, like all beasts, but she not birth "
"them out this way, no way! Halfhead shaman lie, to make people fear him. "
"Shatshank stride around all puffed up, everyone bows, even king won't bark a "
"word against him. He says Goddess sent us these beasties to answer HIS "
"prayers. He even made us uproot village. He says there is thing of Goddess "
"nearby... where beasts come from, called... 'womb.' And he calls me a blas-"
"phe-mer!\""
msgstr ""
"\"짐승들?\" {n}고블린은 눈살을 찌푸리더니 이내 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"라마, 그러니까 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}"
"는 모든 짐승들의 어머니이지. 하지만 그런 식으로 짐승들을 낳지않아. 절대로! 멍청한 샤먼이, 모두가 그를 두려워하게 하려고 거짓말을 "
"한거야. Shatshank는 거들먹거리며 돌아다니고, 모두들 그에게 고개숙이고, 심지어 왕조차 그에게 큰소리치지 못했어. 그 녀석은 여신이 자기의 "
"기도에 응답하기 위해 우리에게 이 짐승들을 보내는거라고 말했어. 그는 심지어 우리를 마을에서 떠나가게 만들었다구! 그 녀석이 말하길, "
"근처 어딘가에 짐승들이 나오는 곳, 여신의 '그곳'이 있다고 했어. 난 그곳을 '자궁'이라고 불렀지. 그랬더니 그 샤먼 놈은 나를 "
"신성모독자라 불렀어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51169_Text
msgctxt "5a21de83-d402-4a78-b172-bbbf85666bc0"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, hey, where you going? Wait till I untie myself, I go with you! We "
"heroes, we march together!\" {n}Nok-Nok nods fervently, as if hoping you'll "
"do the same.{/n} \"The shaman fled — I bet your hide he come back for "
"revenge! He hates you longshanks, hates your guts. Mine, too.\" {n}Nok-Nok "
"stretchs against his bonds.{/n} \"Let's follow him, then kick him hard in "
"HIS guts, teach him a lesson! We kick the king in his guts, too, while we be "
"there!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐, 이봐, 어디 가는거야? 묶인거 풀 때까지 기다려, 나도 같이 갈게! 우린 영웅들이야, 우리 함께 가자구!\" {n}녹-녹은 "
"당신도 동의하기를 바라는 듯 열정적으로 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"샤먼은 도망쳤다. 틀림없이 복수하러 돌아올 거야!! 그는 너희 꺽다리 "
"싫어한다.너희 배짱도 싫어해. 게다가 그는 나도 싫어해.\" {n}녹-녹은 속박을 풀려고 합니다.{/n} \"그를 따라가서 엉덩이를 세게 "
"차주자! 그곳에 간 김에 왕의 엉덩이도 차주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51175_Text
msgctxt "6420d173-9001-4e7e-83a2-458c8659afd5"
msgid ""
"\"See for yourself! Heroes needs muscle, right? Also need brain for plans. "
"Someone with pretty face to charm everyone. And needs leader, heart of the "
"group.\" {n}He nods, finishing his case.{/n} \"I can do all of that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자 직접 확인해봐! 영웅에겐 한 주먹하는 누군가가 필요하다. 맞지? 또한 계획을 세울 똑똑한 누군가도, 모두를 매료시킬만한 예쁜 "
"얼굴을 가진 누군가도, 그리고 그룹의 심장인 리더도 역시 필요하다.\" {n}그는 고개를 끄덕이며 자신의 말을 끝냅니다.{/n} \"나는 "
"다 할 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51176_Text
msgctxt "e6dfabe4-1b07-4450-84f3-bf04652fce84"
msgid "\"Ha-ha! Onwards, for the oddventures!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 모험을 위해 앞으로 전진!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51177_Text
msgctxt "3f3c388d-30ae-4e10-9279-7f34bf26e303"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! How can you do without me? You die fast than you say 'die'! And with "
"me coming along you won't die! When you be old and fat and smile on your "
"death-bed, you remember this day and say to self — yes, that was good "
"choice! Me die much later, happier, because of Nok-Nok, you see.\""
msgstr ""
"\"깐! 나 없이 할 수 있다고? 죽으라고 말하기 전에 네가 먼저 죽는다. 나와 함께 가면 너 죽지 않는다! 네가 늙고 뚱뚱해져서 "
"관짝에서 웃으며 잠들 때 이 날을 기억하며 말할 거다. 그래! 좋은 선택이었어! 나는 너보다 더 오래 살다 행복하게 죽는다. 녹 "
"녹이니까! 두고보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51178_Text
msgctxt "2568e270-2a65-4d2e-bc22-63bca314e52c"
msgid ""
"\"Aie! AIE! Stop killing me! {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, shatshank's killing "
"me, spill blood, kill shatshank instead!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아이! 아이! 날 죽이지 마! {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}시여 shatshank가 나를 죽여서 피가 흘러요. 저 녀석을 대신 "
"죽여주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51180_Text
msgctxt "018476ec-293c-4a71-a79b-a37fa1d70e53"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin casts an angry glance towards the other goblins, huddling "
"behind the statue of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} and hisses in disgust.{/n} "
"\"They deserve a nok across heads, all of them! Yet... hmmmm... better not-"
"nok.\" {n}The goblin becomes strangely thoughtful — perhaps reverent? "
"Oblivious, the goblin nods at the statue the goblins are hiding behind.{/n} "
"\"You see big mother idol? Shatshanks hide in her shadow so can beg and "
"whine for Lama to poison, stab, bite, kill whoever hurts goblins... don't "
"make Lamashtu mother-mad, let them live.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}상 뒤에서 역겨운 쉭쉭 소리를 내며 옹기종기 모여있는다른 고블린들을 성난 시선으로 "
"노려봅니다.{/n} \"그 녀석들은 머리를 한 대 맞아야 한다! 모두!..흠..한 대 가지고는 안돼.\" {n}고블린은 이상하게도 깊이 "
"생각합니다. 아마도 기도하는 걸까요? 마치 모든 걸 망각한 듯, 다른 고블린들이 숨어있는 석상을 바라보며 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} "
"\"거대한 어머니의 석상을 봤지? Shatshank는 어머니의 그림자에 숨어, 고블린들을 해치는 자는 누구든 독살하고, 찌르고, 물어뜯어 죽이도록 "
"어머니께 간절히 부탁할꺼야. 어머니 라마슈투를 화나게 하지말고 저들을 살려줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51182_Text
msgctxt "85370887-bfa9-4bf2-84ee-0fd22a88566a"
msgid ""
"\"Not at all! Good riddance! They shouldn't try to hurt me!\" {n}The goblin "
"lowers his voice.{/n} \"Just step quiet-careful now. They be praying to "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, even as they die — and when dying, is when Lama "
"listen close. She might not hear. But if she is, or she wake up, she might "
"be in bad mood, and when in bad mood...\" {n}He shrugs.{/n} \"...she share "
"bad mood, like gift.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전혀 아니다! 좋은 속임수다! 그들은 나를 다치게 하면 안 된다!\" {n}고블린은 목소리를 낮춥니다.{/n} \"조용히 걸어다녀라. "
"그들은 죽어서도 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}에게 기도할 거다. 그들은 죽을 때 라마가 가까이서 들을 거다. 하지만 그녀는 듣지 "
"않을 거다. 그녀가 듣거나 깨어난다면 기분이 나쁠 거다. 그녀가 기분이 나쁘면...\" {n}그는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"... "
"그녀는 다른 자들도 기분 나쁘게 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51183_Text
msgctxt "026afdf4-2186-4605-8c23-3a1eb1e9026d"
msgid ""
"\"When cursed beasts start to birth from everyone, halfhead get all proud "
"and puff-'d-up, told everyone {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} answers HIS "
"prayers... but she has NOTHING to do with his halfhead lies. I know, I be "
"her favored, she talk only to ME! So I said so to his face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저주받은 짐승이 사람에게서 태어났을 때 멍청이 샤먼이 자랑스러워하면서 모두에게 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}가 그의 기도에 "
"응답했다고 말했다... 하지만 그녀는 그 멍청이의 거짓말과 관계가 없다. 나는 내가 그녀의 애정을 받아서 그녀는 나에게만 말한다! 그래서 "
"그 녀석에게도 그렇게 말했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51184_Text
msgctxt "b16a6567-42e4-472d-aa68-abb6807c189c"
msgid ""
"\"And then...\" {n}The goblin hangs his head.{/n} \"He strike me in my ears "
"and said I can tell it to beast bellies. He do that a lot recently, to many, "
"many now in beast bellies. But not Nok-Nok, no way Nok-Nok can die! Lama "
"protects me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고...\" {n}고블린이 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"그는 내 머리를 때리며 짐승의 뱃속에서 그렇게 말해보라고 했다. 이제는 그 "
"녀석이 짐승 뱃 속에 들어갔다. 하지만 녹-녹은 아니다. 녹-녹은 죽지 않는다! 라마가 나를 보호한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51185_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "5069a7a4-4b5c-4a29-aa21-de134c4c0f4b"
msgid ""
"\"An evil little throat-cutter, and an arsonist to boot! That's exactly what "
"our company needs. Please, {name}! We can't reject this cutie!\""
msgstr "\"칼을 잘쓰는 악당이 필요해! 우리는 그런 동료가 필요해. 제발. {name}! 이 귀여운 녀석을 받아들이자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/GoblinVillage/Kroonk/Cue_51186_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "622b9853-9ca5-4d65-a8ef-ab827b2e8b6d"
msgid "\"I know goblins are evil, but this one looks so lonely…\""
msgstr "\"고블린이 사악하다는 건 알지만 이 녀석은 외로워보여...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "21d0264e-7278-40a1-817d-8f1431f5fa84"
msgid "\"You and your band had best leave while you still can.\""
msgstr "\"너희는 가능할 때 도망치는 게 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f2067858-b9ad-4852-877d-0cbde72e9b2b"
msgid ""
"[Lie] \"This is all a big misunderstanding. You seem to have confused me "
"with someone else. Trust me, I've never heard about you before. I'm just "
"passing through these lands!\""
msgstr "[거짓] \"이것은 모두 오해야. 나를 누군가로 잘못 본 것 같아. 나는 너를 처음 알았어. 나는 이 곳을 지나던 길이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "b6954794-69c1-45a2-9836-786d31db9107"
msgid "\"Who are you and what do you want from me?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야? 나에게서 원하는게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "54fc6e7d-44a4-4ed5-8d07-a28f5a3beb93"
msgid "Humiliated the Embeth Travelers."
msgstr "엠베스 여행자에게 수치심을 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "62b6f310-02d7-48a1-8906-a001479e9eda"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, yes. That was a great hunt. Your friends made for fine game. Have you "
"come to share in their fate?\""
msgstr "\"아. 그래. 좋은 사냥이었지. 네 친구들은 좋은 사냥감이었지. 너도 그 녀석들과 함께였겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "157fc0c6-ad52-4a92-921a-b204191f81ed"
msgid "Mocked the Embeth Travelers."
msgstr "엠베스 여행자를 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "131ddad7-cd1b-4636-bdfa-ca10ddb282d3"
msgid "\"Is this any reason for us to quarrel? It was just a joke!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 싸울 이유가 있나? 나는 농담한 거였어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4f394732-c29d-4350-b3f5-5220cc40c150"
msgid "Apologized before the Embeth Travelers."
msgstr "엠베스 여행자에게 사과했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "f675bfc3-fc5d-4d02-a19e-fdb27f89ca40"
msgid "\"There is no excuse for my actions. Let me redeem myself.\""
msgstr "\"내 행동에 변명의 여지가 없다. 나를 용서해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "345b57fc-9b23-426b-b5a5-b7613601e7f9"
msgid "Apologized before the Embeth Travelers."
msgstr "엠베스 여행자에게 사과했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "4882598d-555d-4a8d-88cc-6290e6b998a7"
msgid "\"My behavior was unacceptable. My sincere apologies.\""
msgstr "\"내 행동은 받아들일 수 없는 것이었어. 내 사과를 받아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "5bfb5b26-9cb5-4a5e-ad19-e3aab457f93c"
msgid "[Give 1000 gold] \"Let me pay.\""
msgstr "[1000골드를 지불했습니다] \"내가 낼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "ff349bac-7a98-4c3d-abe5-68c5d1285ba4"
msgid "\"Bring out your beast.\""
msgstr "\"네 짐승을 꺼내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "9b1b84de-beda-4200-900d-b4f6fce58779"
msgid "[Give 3000 gold] \"Give this money to the families of the deceased.\""
msgstr "[3000골드를 줍니다] \"이 돈을 고인의 가족에게 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "12f4311e-1b1a-40cc-b496-51645595c92d"
msgid "\"You are right. I am ready to accept my punishment.\""
msgstr "\"네 말이 맞아. 나는 처벌을 받아들일 준비가 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4a2a3547-3681-4b0d-90e9-1231c63de2f7"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, you there!\" {n}Armed men dressed in wandering clothes are looking at "
"you.The look upon their faces, as well as the tone of their female leader's "
"voice, do not bode well.{/n} \"Yes, you! Jamel Visser sends his regards.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐! 거기!\" {n}부랑자처럼 입은 옷에 무기를 든 남자가 당신을 봅니다. 그들의 얼굴은 여성 우두머리의 목소리 톤과 거칠지는 "
"않아보입니다.{/n} \"그래. 너! 자멜 비세르가 안부를 전했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "555639cf-0709-42c9-a6c0-80ab98031602"
msgid "{n}The huntress gives you a wicked smile.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}여자 사냥꾼은 당신에게 사악한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "bc6d0b07-0a7b-49d8-8715-1ae62a5e5a23"
msgid ""
"\"Jamel asked me to tell you — we are not murderers, judges, nor "
"executioners. We are hunters. You will be judged by the forest, just as we "
"are. Earn your right to live!\"\n"
"{n}The hunters vanish back into the foliage. With a thundering roar, a "
"hulking beast emerges from the trees.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"Jamel이 우리는 살인자도 망나니도 아니라는 말을 전해달라고 했어. 우리는 사냥꾼이야. 우리가 숲에 있으니 네가 이해해. 우리는 "
"먹고 살려고 그러는 거니까!\"\n"
"{n}사냥꾼은 숲 속으로 사라집니다. 천둥 소리와 같은 울부 짖는 소리가 들리며 숲에서 덩치 큰 짐승이 나타납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "ec117c75-da7c-484d-b940-15e28504e1da"
msgid ""
"\"Have you already forgotten about us? We remember you well. We are the {g|"
"Embeth Travelers}hunters of the Embeth Forest{/g}. Do you recall the {d|c22 "
"safari unfair}beast hunt{/d}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리를 잊어버렸어? 우리는 너를 기억해. 우리는 {g|Embeth Travelers}엠베스 여행자{/g}야. {d|c22 "
"safari unfair}짐승 사냥{/d}을 기억해? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "351c588f-230e-4b4e-af8c-80bcb9ec4e9e"
msgid ""
"{n}The righteous indignation on the huntress' face gives way to "
"embarassment. As she whispers something to one of her companions, he "
"shrugs.{/n} \"Hm... I am sorry, there was a mistake. You shouldn't loiter "
"around here. The ruler of these lands is a true gorgon if I ever saw one.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼의 화난 표정은 당황으로 변합니다. 그녀가 동료에게 속삭이자 그는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"음... 미안해. 실수가 "
"있었다. 이곳을 돌아다니면 안돼. 내가 보았던 이 땅의 통치자는 정말로 고르곤이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "9a69423e-86c3-4357-aaa6-19e214b0d018"
msgid ""
"{n}The huntress gives you a sideways grin.{/n} \"Save your breath. It is not "
"us you shall be speaking to.\""
msgstr "{n}여자 사냥꾼은 당신을 뒤돌아보며 웃습니다.{/n} \"진정해. 대화할 상대는 우리가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "3b92af25-f7ca-47ca-8e9f-b1181989e15e"
msgid ""
"\"A joke?!\" {n}The huntress' face is twisted with rage.{/n} \"Those people "
"had families! They came to aid you, and you killed them... For what? To win "
"a prize? Is that what you call joke?\""
msgstr ""
"\"농담?!\" {n}사냥꾼의 얼굴은 분노로 뒤틀렸습니다.{/n} \"그 사람들은 가족이 있었어! 그들은 너를 돕기 위해 왔지만 너는 "
"그들을 죽였어... 도대체 왜? 상을 얻기 위해서? 그게 농담이라는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "cf025d11-b728-4adf-b92e-6bc1fd857cc0"
msgid ""
"\"A joke, you say?\" {n}The huntress grins.{/n} \"Well, now it's our turn to "
"play a joke on you. You've taken the prize — now you have to earn it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"농담이야?\" {n}사냥꾼은 웃습니다.{/n} \"지금은 우리가 농담할 차례같은데. 네가 상을 가져갔으니 네가 그것을 가져올 차례야!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "9db428d4-e4c7-4033-8e6b-65a1bdfeb8c1"
msgid ""
"{n}The huntress clenches her teeth, her gaze full of hate. She spits on the "
"ground, then gives a cold smile.{/n} \"Now it's your turn to be the game!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자 사냥꾼은 이를 악물고 분노에 찬 눈길로 봅니다. 그녀는 땅에 침을 뱉고는 차갑게 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"이제 네가 "
"사냥감이 될 차례다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "a58c7c5c-b733-4a7c-b0cc-1d5ca94278e9"
msgid ""
"{n}The huntress frowns, evaluating your answer, then after a long moment, "
"speaks.{/n} \"Apologies alone are not enough. Pay for that which you have "
"taken from us... or prove that you are indeed worthy of such a reward — in "
"battle with a beast.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼은 눈살을 찌푸리고 당신의 대답을 생각하더니 오랜 시간 뒤에 말합니다.{/n} \"사과만으로는 충분하지 않아. 우리에게서 "
"빼앗은 것을 지불해... 아니면 네가 보상에 합당하다는 것을 증명해. 짐승과 전투를 해서 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "98fbd77e-e567-4acd-a970-e643a613dae9"
msgid ""
"{n}The huntress smirks.{/n} \"You won't get off so easily — apologies are "
"not enough. I hope that our prize was to your liking. Now comes the time to "
"earn it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼은 웃습니다.{/n} \"쉽게 가면 안되지. 사과는 충분하지 않아. 우리의 상을 네가 좋아하길 바라. 이제는 네가 상을 벌 "
"차례야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "6fc84a9f-a7e1-4c83-ac53-5011d0ae7f66"
msgid ""
"{n}The huntress frowns, evaluating your answer, then after a long moment, "
"speaks.{/n}\n"
"\"Those people had families. Children. What good are your apologies to them?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼은 눈살을 찌푸리고 당신의 대답을 생각하더니 오랜 시간 뒤에 말합니다.{/n}\n"
"\"이 사람들은 가족이 있었어. 사과만으로 충분하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "4de6080d-301c-4047-bf69-596e385f9c6a"
msgid ""
"\"Those people came to your aid — in return you slaughtered them for some "
"measly prize! And now you dare beg for forgiveness? You shall redeem "
"yourself once you're dead!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 사람들은 너를 도왔어. 그런데 너는 네 상을 위해 그들을 죽였어! 그런데 이제 용서를 구한다고? 네가 죽어야 용서를 받을 수 있어!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "f2fbf85c-975d-4fe5-a317-d03817c9f1ee"
msgid ""
"{n}The huntress takes the money and nods.{/n} \"The matter is closed. I "
"shall pass this on to Jamel along with your apologies.\""
msgstr "{n}사냥꾼은 돈을 받고 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"이미 끝난 문제야. 나는 자멜에게 이것과 함께 네 사과를 전달하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "4c37b7b3-fa79-4a09-a877-2da97b2bd048"
msgid "\"Good. Show us what you're made of.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 네가 만든 것을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "439ca0b3-30f5-4bc1-9c7b-ca24927885bd"
msgid ""
"\"Hm!\" {n}The huntress is surprised by the sum.{/n} \"All the coin in "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} wouldn't make up for their lives, but... have it "
"your way. I shall give them the gold and your apologies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠!\" {n}사냥꾼은 액수에 놀랍니다.{/n} \"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 돈으로는 그들의 삶을 보상하지 "
"못하지만... 좋아. 그들에게 금과 네 사과를 전달하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "d250ae01-8195-4bb1-9078-7b94b5f44fc7"
msgid ""
"{n}The hunters take a step back and vanish from sight, disappearing into the "
"forest.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사냥꾼들은 한 걸음 물러서서 숲 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "e98467a4-5977-430d-9e48-94d569682438"
msgid ""
"\"I do not believe that people like you can ever repent. I may be wrong. If "
"you survive this battle, we shall see your next move.\""
msgstr "\"너 같은 사람들이 뉘우칠 거라 생각하지 않았어. 하지만 내가 틀렸어. 네가 이 전투에서 살아남으면 너를 지켜볼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "1795d259-e2ea-4d2f-a090-92496838ddcd"
msgid ""
"\"You took that which you had not earned. We've come to give you a chance to "
"prove yourself deserving of the prize.\""
msgstr "\"너는 네 것이 아닌 것을 가져갔어. 우리는 너에게 상을 받을 자격이 있는지 볼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "3a6e48f6-2f58-45e3-aea8-cbd94b8d893e"
msgid ""
"\"You slaughtered those who came to your aid. If it were up to me, I would "
"have slit your throat in your sleep... however, even though you had no mercy "
"for your victims, Jamel insisted we give you a chance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 너를 도운 사람들을 죽였어. 나라면 네가 자는 동안 목을 그었을 거야... 하지만 네가 희생자에게 자비심이 없어도 자멜은 기회를 "
"주어야 한다고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/HunterDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "16c64cc8-fba5-40fe-8359-48da0616be8a"
msgid "\"Well said.\""
msgstr "\"잘했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/HuntersRevenge/ZoneBark/ZoneBark_Trees_String
msgctxt "d2b95c7e-138e-42e0-a270-591dbb029d6b"
msgid "The travelers disappeared without a trace."
msgstr "여행자들은 흔적도 없이 사라졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/IronstoneGully/IronOreBark_String
msgctxt "6101f0be-f0a3-4622-ae41-06d7c7d8cede"
msgid ""
"Subtle tint of red on the stone surface suggests a location of a rich iron "
"ore vein laying around."
msgstr "돌 표면에 미묘한 빨간색이 철광석이 풍부하게 묻혀있는 것을 알려줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-between_Aldori_String
msgctxt "b665ab65-69bf-4e3d-969d-afe1afad73d9"
msgid ""
"\"The huntsmen have told me about their homeland. I pray that this place "
"doesn't become like the Embeth Forest!\""
msgstr "\"사냥꾼들이 자기들의 고향에 대해 말해줬어. 이곳이 엠베스 숲처럼 되지 않길 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-between_Lebeda_String
msgctxt "6ee6090e-a264-4273-aab9-bfad3b4f57af"
msgid ""
"\"I hope they're smart enough to understand who should get the prize...\""
msgstr "\"누가 상을 받아야 할지 이해할 만큼 똑똑하기를 바라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-between_Surtova_String
msgctxt "9ede245d-4f12-4942-97c2-f3af51d612d8"
msgid "\"How did the hunt go? To your benefit, I hope?\""
msgstr "\"사냥은 어떻게 되었지? 네가 이겼어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-final_Aldori_String
msgctxt "68cfa2d9-3bae-4681-adcf-bcdf0157494e"
msgid "\"Your people are in danger. We must act without delay!\""
msgstr "\"너희 사람들이 위험에 처했어. 우리는 어서 움직여야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-final_Lebeda_String
msgctxt "f0e5e55c-8b03-4280-b568-773c8a0cafec"
msgid "\"It is becoming more and more interesting...\""
msgstr "\"점점 더 흥미로워지고 있군요..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-final_Surtova_String
msgctxt "376ca3fe-513b-4e4d-b689-5d240bb7a191"
msgid ""
"\"Could it be an attempt to assassinate you? Or, maybe... One of the guests?"
"\""
msgstr "\"너를 암살하려는 시도일까? 아니면... 손님 중 한명일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-start_Aldori_String
msgctxt "3bb63352-60dd-4706-93ff-b9064054f02a"
msgid ""
"\"These huntsmen are exceptionally interesting people. It seems to me, they "
"know much more than they tell.\""
msgstr "\"이 사냥꾼들은 흥미로운 자들이야. 그들은 말하는 것보다 훨씬 많이 알고 있는 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-start_Lebeda_String
msgctxt "f7c31f03-cca9-4c03-9ad6-d8105115afa5"
msgid ""
"\"Fortunately, none of the guests know my face. I don't want any rumors "
"regarding my whereabouts to spread.\""
msgstr "\"다행히 손님 중 누구도 내 얼굴을 몰라. 내가 어디로 가는지 소문이 퍼지지 않았으면 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Envoy-start_Surtova_String
msgctxt "1c0aa85f-61b9-4611-838b-84afd3b57679"
msgid ""
"\"My second husband loved hunting. That's how he died: he was chasing a "
"deer, but instead found a bear. Poor soul!\""
msgstr "\"두번째 남편은 사냥을 좋아했어. 그래서 그는 죽었어. 그는 사슴을 쫓고 있었지만 곰을 발견했지. 불쌍한 인간!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene01/CommandBark 10_SharedText_String
msgctxt "52f2e601-94cb-4232-98fd-b0503aa5a51e"
msgid "\"Beast be hungry! Run!\""
msgstr "\"짐승이 굶주렸을 거야! 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene01/CommandBark 11_SharedText_String
msgctxt "cd3e8fea-fe46-43fa-b3d6-7ad031a6bcf6"
msgid "\"Mercy, Lamashtu!\""
msgstr "\"악! 라마슈투님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene01/CommandBark 12_SharedText_String
msgctxt "da6e9462-7467-4495-b462-464d5b8e5c27"
msgid "\"Run!\""
msgstr "\"도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene01/CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "94fa7b24-10e5-4406-999d-5141b2451df7"
msgid "\"Praise Lamashtu!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투를 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene01/CommandBark 4_SharedText_String
msgctxt "d7aadc3f-e8f7-4e0d-96ce-aca6ff3d2b0d"
msgid "\"Oh mighty beast! Sharp be your claws!\""
msgstr "\"강력한 짐승이다! 발톱이 날카로워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene01/CommandBark 9_SharedText_String
msgctxt "dc8be00f-2a6d-42b7-bcc8-07d67d29efa1"
msgid "\"Oh mighty beast! Strong be your wings!\""
msgstr "\"강력한 짐승이다! 날개가 튼튼해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene01/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "3e90e2ba-7091-4707-b125-670d8cb89996"
msgid "\"Oh mighty beast! Deadly be your poison!\""
msgstr "\"강력한 짐승이다! 독이 치명적이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 10_SharedText_String
msgctxt "42d344ba-8d35-4923-b284-527eda1ca520"
msgid "\"Hydra no eat you?\""
msgstr "\"히드라가 너를 먹지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 11_SharedText_String
msgctxt "98e94d78-8b67-489b-9c7b-6c481c5cd6d2"
msgid "\"She definitely be!\""
msgstr "\"분명히 그럴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "9c87934c-bb0a-454b-9448-06ccdb04eec7"
msgid "\"Praise Lamashtu!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투를 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "3588fbdf-0b04-4ee0-80c7-88ccf349d7bb"
msgid "\"Hydra be so big!\""
msgstr "\"히드라가 너무 커!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 3_SharedText_String
msgctxt "9d1721a2-4946-4ac6-99be-2213546c63b5"
msgid "\"I go bring food to Hydra!\""
msgstr "\"나는 히드라에게 음식을 가져갈게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 4_SharedText_String
msgctxt "c59bb1f5-d602-4a70-b26d-7fe40da57ed7"
msgid "\"Hydra love food!\""
msgstr "\"히드라는 음식을 좋아해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 5_SharedText_String
msgctxt "ec3e8723-ef6c-4784-a7bf-cd201869af26"
msgid "\"Lamashtu be pleased!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투가 기뻐하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 6_SharedText_String
msgctxt "63ea9297-6cc0-41b3-919d-e80453358d07"
msgid "\"She might. Hydra big and scary.\""
msgstr "\"그럴 거야. 히드라는 크고 무서워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 7_SharedText_String
msgctxt "86acb86e-e49f-4b5c-98a9-c97eeb01696e"
msgid "\"Aaa! Longshanks!\""
msgstr "\"아으! 꺽다리들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 8_SharedText_String
msgctxt "d926f1f7-75b2-4c7b-ab47-6e0b91911860"
msgid "\"Dip! Skip! Leg it!\""
msgstr "\"숙여! 지나쳐! 도망가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark 9_SharedText_String
msgctxt "89999001-6a96-4796-96ab-305115f5f6ef"
msgid "\"I be scared.\""
msgstr "\"나는 무서워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/GoblinCutscene02/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "42e33d10-06be-496d-87d7-febc68009811"
msgid "\"Hydra be so strong!\""
msgstr "\"히드라가 너무 강해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Hunters-after_String
msgctxt "e6be3773-bb46-41fb-a2f8-102c7bda1df2"
msgid "\"Looks like it's worse here than we thought.\""
msgstr "\"생각한 것보다 이곳은 더 심각한 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Hunters-between_String
msgctxt "51e77107-a0a9-4320-8173-6eea4ab78c60"
msgid "\"Is everyone here? Jamel's about to announce the winner!\""
msgstr "\"모두 여기 있어? 자멜이 승자를 발표하려고 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Hunters/CommandBark 10_SharedText_String
msgctxt "952f7911-36ab-4c5f-bfd3-0e75eeb53aac"
msgid "\"We are about to get her!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 곧 그녀를 잡을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Hunters/CommandBark 11_SharedText_String
msgctxt "4ea9accc-7335-4435-88fd-3717be0bf7ff"
msgid "\"Flank her!\""
msgstr "\"그녀를 잡아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Hunters/CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "97bd1bfb-2968-4e32-88cf-35e61ea383a7"
msgid "\"Hey! Hey, you! Where you going? We are hunting here!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 어디로 가? 우리는 여기서 사냥을 하고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Hunters/CommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "c9ac99d2-47f9-4e39-91f4-2a0d0d9bf14d"
msgid "\"Step aside or you might get hurt!\""
msgstr "\"비키지 않으면 다칠 수도 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Hunters/CommandBark 31_SharedText_String
msgctxt "0a0f64e2-683c-4fce-b9d4-4d19aa106ecc"
msgid "\"Don't let her get away!\""
msgstr "\"그녀를 도망가게 하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Hunters/CommandBark 3_SharedText_String
msgctxt "31ecaae5-be3f-4150-8975-16c3a3883100"
msgid "\"Out of my way!\""
msgstr "\"비켜!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Bones01_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "56cf8110-f4a9-46d0-91e1-10a728298a3c"
msgid ""
"It's hard to tell whether these bones belonged to a human or an animal, but "
"they were definetely shattered by some mighty jaws."
msgstr "이 뼈가 인간이나 동물의 것이 었는지를 밝히기는 어렵지만 확실히 거대한 턱에 의해 부서졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Bones02_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "c3087d21-357d-4571-845c-544f6f490c36"
msgid ""
"A tattered leather armor and the hilt of a cheap sword are lying among the "
"bones."
msgstr "너덜너덜한 가죽갑옷과 싸구려 칼 자루가 뼈 사이에 놓여져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_GoblinCorpses_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "d724a4ae-052d-42f1-8bef-5536bbe8570b"
msgid ""
"The goblins were torn apart by humongous claws. Their ugly little faces show "
"horror."
msgstr "고블린들은 커다란 발톱으로 찢겨졌습니다. 그들의 못생기고 작은 얼굴은 공포에 질렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Grass01_Bark_String
msgctxt "9bf4f6ed-57c3-4b25-89e2-ed9a658a12a7"
msgid "A dung pat the size of a tower shield can be seen in the high grass."
msgstr "높은 풀이 자란 곳에서 타워실드 크기의 배설물이 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Grass02_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "037a9bf6-a9c8-478a-97fa-2952631a6a92"
msgid "Enormous clawed paw prints mark the ground."
msgstr "엄청난 발톱을 가진 발자국이 땅에 찍혔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Mud_Bark_String
msgctxt "ce0deef6-92cc-4253-8e77-0ec9f9b4bbc4"
msgid ""
"Somebody used clay to make these clumsy figurines, remotely resembling "
"owlbears."
msgstr "누군가는 찰흙으로 이 조잡한 인형을 만들었고 아울베어를 조금 닮았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Stone01_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "ade19564-5ad2-4720-a0e6-3e0c282308a8"
msgid ""
"A hydra devouring tiny human figures has been crudely etched into this stone."
msgstr "작은 인간을 먹는 히드라 형상이 이 돌에 거칠게 새겨져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Stone02_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "27c5c6e0-9055-4847-9583-3b656a6ed2cf"
msgid ""
"The stone shows a primitive charcoal depiction of a jackal's head with three "
"eyes."
msgstr "이 돌은 3개의 눈이 달린 자칼 머리를 숯을 이용해 원시적으로 묘사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Tree01_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "eb4be113-e21f-45b2-b7ab-05e76d7edc03"
msgid ""
"Someone used this tree to sharpen their claws. The marks are twice your "
"height above the ground."
msgstr "누군가 이 나무를 사용하여 발톱을 다듬었습니다. 자국은 당신의 키 두배 이상입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/KamelandsSafari_Tree02_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "aef901e3-f86a-4312-ae2e-2d68f83ec301"
msgid ""
"Someone scratched their back against this tree — which almost uprooted it."
msgstr "누군가 이 나무를 이용하여 등을 긁었습니다. 나무의 뿌리가 뽑혀있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/MasterHunter-after_String
msgctxt "28a95e02-a23f-4e83-ae62-8ba0502e07d8"
msgid ""
"\"This servant didn't just turn into a monster. The monster came out of him, "
"ripping him apart! How could that even happen?\""
msgstr "\"이 하인은 그저 괴물로 변한 것이 아니야. 괴물이 그를 찢고 나왔어! 어떻게 이런 일이 일어날 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Mivon-after_String
msgctxt "4f61b897-79ba-4270-8889-e78592a0d420"
msgid "\"How terrible! I hope it's not contagious!\""
msgstr "\"끔찍하군! 전염병이 아니기를 빌어야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Mivon-between_String
msgctxt "07ffa581-9450-4507-8c57-c1da8b8b8a2b"
msgid "\"It was a great hunt! This will make a nice story to tell at home!\""
msgstr "\"훌륭한 사냥이었어! 집에서 이야기할 것이 생겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/MivonBarks/CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "2ec3c1a9-b2c0-42b8-ac25-b0ca7bfe3a2a"
msgid "\"She almost got us!\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 우리를 거의 잡았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/MivonBarks/CommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "51fdbf1c-5fb8-4444-af41-bddc23e56c60"
msgid "\"Don't fret! We can still prevail!\""
msgstr "\"두려워하지 마! 우린 여전히 앞서갈 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/MivonBarks/CommandBark 3_SharedText_String
msgctxt "45b79643-0410-4386-a095-cbbb4a044fa7"
msgid "\"Watch your posture! Who fights like this?\""
msgstr "\"네 자세를 봐! 누가 이렇게 싸워?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/MivonBarks/CommandBark 4_SharedText_String
msgctxt "67cc9231-4be7-465f-a08c-b6224b18d499"
msgid "\"We need to run!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 도망쳐야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/MivonBarks/CommandBark 5_SharedText_String
msgctxt "f86acca5-74d3-4390-a48d-5b726c27c2bd"
msgid "\"Couldn't you find a monster a little bit smaller?\""
msgstr "\"조금 더 작은 괴물을 찾을 수는 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/MivonBarks/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "712452f8-8e6f-4538-a31f-7a777b5902c5"
msgid "\"Keep your position! Do not fall back!\""
msgstr "\"위치를 지켜! 뒤쳐지지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Pitax-after_String
msgctxt "fc386e2f-f5d3-4437-9e09-abdc4afbe2a6"
msgid ""
"\"What an unexpected twist of events! I wonder what lord Irovetti would say "
"about this...\""
msgstr "\"예상하지 못한 사건의 연속인데! 이것을 듣고 이로베티가 뭐라고 말할지 궁금하다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/Pitax-between_String
msgctxt "85879d5e-3db3-4361-997f-df746550f817"
msgid ""
"\"It's good to take a respite from the city life and have a party in the "
"wild...\""
msgstr "\"도시 생활을 잠시 쉬면서 야생에서 파티를 갖는 것도 좋겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/Barks/ServantBlowsUp_String
msgctxt "3d58efba-41a1-4f27-a87d-87a28f1cc300"
msgid "\"Argh. What's happening to me? Help!\""
msgstr "\"아! 나에게 무슨 일이 일어나는 거야? 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Answer_77842_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f965c3eb-a8b6-493a-a3e2-9e5be00892ed"
msgid "Tried to take away the Embeth Travelers' trophy."
msgstr "엠베스 여행자의 트로피를 뺏으려 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Answer_77842_Text
msgctxt "02e0dc15-491e-4946-a88d-5641d9cde5a5"
msgid ""
"\"As sovereign of these lands, I demand you give me that monster's head.\""
msgstr "\"이 땅의 주권자로서 나는 괴물의 머리를 요구한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Answer_77843_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9613c78b-4234-49ee-a207-43d2cc9f9fb6"
msgid "Murdered the Embeth Travelers."
msgstr "엠베스 여행자를 살해했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Answer_77843_Text
msgctxt "c2fbfcf4-4460-462d-9c23-f698578e1f80"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll be taking that monster's head... and yours as well!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"저 괴물의 머리는 내가 가져가겠다... 그리고 네 것도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Answer_77844_Text
msgctxt "ced9e55a-decb-4290-97fe-153511b752c6"
msgid "[Leave] \"A good hunt to you!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"즐거운 사냥되길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Answer_77853_Text
msgctxt "1bfa9a9d-8bfe-438f-b39a-9757bac0d64d"
msgid "\"The way you've handled it was amazing. Great job!\""
msgstr "\"네가 처리한 방식은 놀라웠어. 잘했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Answer_77870_Text
msgctxt "ed9f0ff2-184f-4c9f-8ca8-e8cdaddc06e7"
msgid ""
"\"You're good warriors. Gorum smiled when he saw how you dispatched that "
"monster!\""
msgstr "\"너는 훌륭한 전사야. 고룸은 네가 괴물을 죽이는 모습을 보고 기뻐할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77841_Text
msgctxt "6379ea3a-00e0-4209-b0b5-cf8172851b72"
msgid ""
"{n}The hunter lifts the wyvern's severed head in triumph.{/n} \"You see "
"that? Bang, down, it's done! Now that's how we deal with these beasts back "
"in Embeth Forest!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼은 잘린 와이번의 머리를 트로피처럼 들어올립니다.{/n} \"봤습니까? 빵 하더니 쓰러지고 끝! 우리는 엠베스 숲에 있는 "
"짐승들을 이렇게 다루죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77847_Text
msgctxt "6c19b7d3-49dc-43c3-8f46-d4afb0c9b28d"
msgid ""
"\"Hells no! That's not how this works. You may be lord, master, and almighty "
"on your lands, but this is the hunt, and a deal's a deal: anything we kill "
"is our trophy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"절대 안돼지! 이건 그런식이 아닙니다. 당신이 이땅에선 주인님, 각하, 또는 전능하신 분으로 통하겠지만 이건 사냥이고 거래는 "
"거래입니다. 우리가 죽인 녀석은 우리 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77849_Text
msgctxt "764ad83a-fb03-4bef-807e-12eaddb161c5"
msgid ""
"{n}The hunter hides the wyvern's severed head in a bag, then spits and "
"glares at you.{/n} \"What's wrong with you? How 'bout you stop getting in "
"our way and just mind your own hunt? That beast's almost fled — how 'bout "
"you give it a whistle!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼은 잘린 와이번의 머리를 가방에 숨기고 침을 뱉고는 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"너 왜그래? 우리 하는 일을 막지 말고 네 "
"사냥이나 하지 그래? 짐승이 도망칠 뻔했어. 휘파람을 왜 분 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77852_Text
msgctxt "6ad212c8-5aa1-425c-b53e-ec82dfaea8de"
msgid "\"To you as well!\""
msgstr "\"당신들도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77854_Text
msgctxt "2f3b7f85-b371-495e-887c-06a57249a860"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks for the kind words! Yeah, unfortunately, we're used to it. Our "
"homeland gives us no slack: every week there's another hungry beast to deal "
"with!\""
msgstr ""
"\"친절한 말씀 고맙군요! 불행히도, 우리는 이미 이 일에 익숙해져 있죠. 고국에서 우리에게 여유란 없습니다. 매주 우리는 굶주린 "
"짐승들을 상대해야하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77856_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9f3e5c1a-7b51-49a4-8c50-609290808d56"
msgid ""
"\"Is it like this everywhere? Is there no place left in the world where "
"people can live without fear?\""
msgstr "\"모든 곳이 이런가? 사람들이 공포에 떨지 않고 살 수 있는 곳은 없는 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77859_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b40cb4fd-dd2b-46b2-845c-4233ba096bf4"
msgid "\"You'd better just give it to us while we're asking nicely...\""
msgstr "\"우리가 부탁할 때 주는 게 좋을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77860_Text
msgctxt "018c20af-07a1-4fff-ada8-5966532861bf"
msgid ""
"\"Don't try to scare us, boy! We've faced horrors you haven't even seen in "
"your worst nightmares!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 겁주지 마! 우리는 네가 본 적도 없는 공포와 마주쳤어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77862_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "95e5d1fc-b59a-41fa-91f8-7389b8f8021a"
msgid "\"They are right. These are the terms you agreed to.\""
msgstr "\"그들이 맞습니다. 당신도 이 조건에 동의했었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77863_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "27f729af-1520-4d1b-8391-3ac9c9894487"
msgid ""
"\"You haven't seen anything unless you've been up north! You seen a mammoth? "
"It's the size of a mountain! Hair like forests! Tusks so long, each one "
"could impale a whole tribe!\""
msgstr ""
"\"북쪽에 올라와본게 아니면 아무것도 못본거나 다름없는거야! 매머드 봤어? 크기가 산만해! 털은 숲처럼 풍성하고! 어금니가 너무나 길어서 "
"부족 전체를 덮칠 수도 있다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77864_Text
msgctxt "14d0d35d-1b70-4ffa-967d-b68cbbe5e1d8"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, we know what a mammoth is. Sure, we don't have those here — but trust "
"me, we've had our share of monsters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 우리는 매머드가 무엇인지 알고있어. 물론, 이곳엔 없지만 말이지. 하지만 날 믿어, 우린 우리 몫의 괴물들이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77866_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a64021c8-29d7-429f-90ef-8ab45a5b55ed"
msgid ""
"\"Now that's something becoming of a baron{mf||ess}! What's yours is now "
"ours, losers!\""
msgstr "\"이제 남작의 차례다! 네 건 모두 우리 거다. 이 루저야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77868_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "79bb6c26-40b5-42a7-8314-1363f7092469"
msgid ""
"\"I dare not disobey Your Grace's orders... but still, this is mean and "
"despicable.\""
msgstr "\"나는 감히 당신의 명령을 거역할 수 없습니다... 하지만 이건 여전히 비열한 짓입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77869_Text
msgctxt "a6f3ae85-d681-44d4-b520-8c64cfd24c2d"
msgid ""
"\"We kill all kinds of monsters — flying ones, crawling ones... You think we "
"can't dispatch a few two-legged ones?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 모든 종류의 괴물을 죽여. 날아다니는 놈도 기어다니는 놈도... 우리가 두발 달린 짐승도 못죽일 줄 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/BountyHuntersDialog/Cue_77871_Text
msgctxt "721286fc-2cc9-435c-80f5-6eb247c17af2"
msgid ""
"\"No offense, Your Grace, but {g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} not exactly our kind of "
"deity. He wants his worshipers to fight as much as possible, while our goal "
"is to help keep actual fighting to a minimum!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오해하지 마. 하지만 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}은 우리 신과는 달라. 그는 숭배자가 싸우는 것을 원하겠지만 우리의 목표는 싸움을 "
"최소화하는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56723_Text
msgctxt "6483fdcb-229e-461d-bb8a-b9443e0c38be"
msgid "[Leave] \"Don't mention it. Take care.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"구해줘서 '감사하다'는 말은 충분히 들은거 같군. 몸 조심들 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56726_Text
msgctxt "4f6a3c33-1d78-4598-9019-f065c503d76b"
msgid ""
"\"Judging by your fight with that owlbear, Mivoni 'swordlords' couldn't best "
"one of our cooks. Would you like some lessons in swordplay from my "
"stablehand?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아울베어와 싸우는 모습으로 판단하건데, 미본의 '소드로드들'은 우리 영지 요리사들보다 검술 실력이 떨어지는 것 같더군. 내 마굿간에서 "
"칼장난이나 좀 배워보는건 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56730_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "20c35c48-158b-44c5-9cfd-385cb9176851"
msgid "Mocked the Mivoni guests."
msgstr "미본에서 온 손님을 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56730_Text
msgctxt "93067b15-ed16-4fbc-b2e8-1ef87ae9d4b4"
msgid "\"I apologize. It was a poor joke.\""
msgstr "\"사과하지. 형편 없는 농담이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56731_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c7591b73-f5c3-4d10-b7ad-80f36e9a8021"
msgid "Murdered the Mivoni guests."
msgstr "미본에서 온 손님을 살해합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56731_Text
msgctxt "0b3c23df-3b10-4580-b5bc-8ae0cbe2530d"
msgid "[Attack] \"Satisfaction? If that's your wish. Defend yourselves!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"결투? 그게 네가 바라는거라면, 자 방어해봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56733_Text
msgctxt "1ee805b7-537e-4b15-807e-4d970d9969d7"
msgid "\"It almost killed you!\""
msgstr "\"너 거의 죽을 뻔했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56743_Text
msgctxt "aeb66fff-de10-4798-b349-c211e31e7cef"
msgid "\"How are things in Mivon?\""
msgstr "\"미본은 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56745_Text
msgctxt "e78a62af-a939-4505-9402-1757db264007"
msgid "\"Mivon's public officials are determined by duels?\""
msgstr "\"미본의 공직자들은 결투로 결정되는건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56749_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "257a6fbc-ad9b-4c7a-af8b-2803d9bfcc25"
msgid "Murdered the Mivoni guests."
msgstr "미본에서 온 손님을 살해합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56749_Text
msgctxt "048f0b3b-e755-4136-9d36-7dfa91880a5d"
msgid "[Attack] \"Let's see how Mivoni swordlords fight. On your guard!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"미본의 소드로드는 어떻게 싸우는지 볼까. 방어 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56760_Text
msgctxt "01df6705-e6a3-48ab-a96e-6a0d656c9028"
msgid "\"Yes, that sounds like fun! I'll consider it.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 재미있을 것 같아! 생각해 볼게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56761_Text
msgctxt "3b4d2661-aa9c-4cc4-8ca4-9b0b9cc30e80"
msgid "\"What, you want to try taking the throne from me, Reg?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 내게서 왕위를 빼앗려는 거야? 레곤가르?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56762_Text
msgctxt "698c2d09-b5a3-49a7-af90-13d79462ae3c"
msgid ""
"\"Why would I? We have the perfect state system. I'm in charge, and you're "
"my right hand — why change anything?\""
msgstr "\"왜 내가? 우리는 완벽한 국가 체제를 가지고 있어. 나는 책임자고 너는 내 오른팔이야. 왜 바꾸려는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Answer_56765_Text
msgctxt "405a7e35-f00e-4c49-b570-2652fd9bd5db"
msgid "\"Your business is fighting, not state governance.\""
msgstr "\"네 일은 싸우는 거지 통치가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56721_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "41f7c506-aaa2-4655-8c16-f71165751357"
msgid ""
"{n}The sisters glance at each other, grimacing. Finally, Edna straightens "
"herself and speaks.{/n} \"Thank you. We owe you our lives.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자매들은 얼굴을 찡그리며 서로를 흘겨봅니다. 마침내 에드나가 자세를 올바르게 하고 말합니다.{/n} \"고마워요. 저희 목숨을 "
"빚졌군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56727_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "97465d44-bd5c-4181-8ccb-28aa9e07c188"
msgid ""
"\"Were we not your guests, I would demand satisfaction here and now!\" {n}"
"Edna hisses through clenched teeth, glaring.{/n} \"I urge you to rescind "
"your words, before I'm forced to make you do so!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 당신의 초대를 받은 손님이 아니었다면, 난 여기서 당장 결투를 요청했을 겁니다!\" {n}에드나는 이를 악물고 당신을 노려보며 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"지금 한 말을 당장 철회할 것을 촉구합니다! 강제로 그렇게 만들기 전에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56732_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "1b3d678d-2a05-4ce3-89af-ca026728eb12"
msgid ""
"\"In {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g}, that sort of joke typically ends with an "
"appointment in the square and the jester finding a few new buttonholes in "
"their shirt,\" {n}Edna responds coldly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Mivon}미본{/g}에서 그런 농담을 하면 광장에서 약속을 잡아, 셔츠에 새로운 단추 구멍을 발견하며 끝이나곤 합니다.\" "
"{n}에드나는 냉담하게 대답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56734_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Julia
msgctxt "ebd84643-0667-4f38-874f-8aae5bb21c85"
msgid ""
"\"That's because SOMEONE would happily charge a pack of dragons with their "
"bare hands, given the chance!\""
msgstr "\"그건, 드래곤 무리가 있다해도 틈만나면 맨손으로라도 달겨드는 '누구' 때문인거 같은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56735_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Julia
msgctxt "6f5ceb6f-0983-4218-98b3-c0dd6821e32d"
msgid ""
"\"Hear that, Sister? 'Take care.' As in, make sure we can actually kill a "
"monster before attacking it!\""
msgstr "\"들었어, 언니? 몸 조심하라잖아. 괴물을 공격하기전에 우리가 저 괴물을 실제로 죽일 수 있는지부터 확실히 해놓으라니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56737_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "912dcf24-f0a1-44f7-975c-b63ab52c845c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh? And here I thought it was because ONE OF US spends more time running "
"to the kitchen for cookies than training with her sword!\""
msgstr "\"아? 내 생각엔 검술 훈련이 아니라 쿠키 가지러 부엌으로 달려가는데 더 많은 시간을 보낸 '누구' 때문인줄 알았는데 !\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56738_Text
msgctxt "df0c540c-0ff6-44b1-b8ce-dee23ff1c88d"
msgid "{n}The sisters glare at each other, their teeth clenched.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}자매는 이를 악물며 서로를 노려봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56739_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "81782159-016b-44fb-b386-7bdd96807e29"
msgid ""
"\"The most dangerous monster YOU could handle is a cow — that's already been "
"butchered and deep-fried! You should make yourself a new coat of arms with a "
"fork instead of a sword on it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 다룰 수 있는 가장 위험한 괴물은 소야. 게다가 그 소는 이미 도살되고 튀겨진 녀석이지! 너는 검 대신 포크로 새롭게 무장해 놔!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56740_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "40efdb74-75f6-42cd-b67f-8dc0928423af"
msgid ""
"{n}The sisters continue to quarrel, no longer paying attention to you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}자매들은 더이상 당신에게 주의를 기울이지 않고 계속해서 서로 싸웁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56741_Text
msgctxt "094c4e3a-94b0-4a2f-aab4-aab2ef8575a1"
msgid ""
"{n}The sisters are still here, blaming each other for the fiasco with the "
"monster.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}자매들은 괴물을 두고 여전히 서로를 탓하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56742_Text
msgctxt "e295106d-7a12-4410-bbde-596811b25d54"
msgid ""
"{n}The sisters can barely manage to bid you farewell before they resume "
"their quarrel.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}자매들은 싸움을 끝내지 않고서는 당신에게 작별 인사를 할 수 없을 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56744_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "668d3a6f-73c1-4df4-882c-1bc8979bf706"
msgid ""
"\"The same as always — a total mess. As far as I can tell, "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} officials must have decided state prisons were a waste "
"of taxes, because their criminals have been fleeing to our lands by the "
"dozens. And {g|Galt}Galt{/g} is sending spies and provocateurs at us without "
"even trying to cover their tracks anymore. Add in yet another skirmish along "
"our border with {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} and... well, it's business as usual.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언제나처럼 엉망진창이죠. {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 공무원은 교도소를 짓는다고 괜히 세금만 낭비했답니다. 범죄를 저지르고 "
"미본으로 도주하는 사람들을 잡아 가두고 싶었다나? {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에선 밑도 끝도 없이 밀정과 선동가를 보내고 있어요. 이젠 "
"아예 흔적을 숨길 생각도 없는 모양이에요. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}와의 국경 분쟁은... 뭐, 항상 있는 일이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56746_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Julia
msgctxt "f0fd145f-fcb3-40bd-931e-4a8478ec779d"
msgid ""
"\"On the bright side, our uncle has finally defeated the old treasurer in a "
"duel. So now, as long as no one else tries to claim the position, it's as "
"good as his!\""
msgstr ""
"\"긍정적인 면이 있다면, 우리 삼촌이 마침내 늙은 재무관을 결투에서 이겼어요. 그러니 이제 다른 사람이 그 자리를 차지하려고 하지 않는 "
"한, 그 자리는 우리 삼촌꺼나 마찬가지죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56747_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "926ec42a-05c4-4280-8bf4-8d632a64a18d"
msgid ""
"\"It's called meritocracy — the most skilled get to rule! Anyone can gain a "
"high position in our society, provided they can defend that position in a "
"fair fight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런걸 능력주의라고 하죠. 가장 실력 좋은 사람이 통치를 하게되는 겁니다! 우리 사회에선, 결투에서 자신의 자리를 지킬 수 있다면 "
"누구나 높은 지위를 얻을 수 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56748_Text
#. Speaker : MivonNoble_Edna
msgctxt "a817f767-a0d9-449a-a1dc-94b88c29ddfc"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone duels, from lowly apprentices to high ministers. That's why "
"{g|Mivon}Mivoni{/g} swordplay is unrivaled — not by {g|Galt}Galt{/g}, not by "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, and not by the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"낮은 견습생부터 고위 장관까지 모두 결투를 합니다. 그렇기 때문에 {g|Mivon}미본{/g}의 검술은 타의 추종을 불허하죠. "
"{g|Galt}갈트{/g}나 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}, {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g} 때문이 아니에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56750_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "83631ffe-5c8b-4ec6-89e4-ab2c79d35f7f"
msgid ""
"\"It is not Edna's pride or Julia's sloth that will be their undoing — it is "
"their mutual inability to cooperate... Not that it is any of my business.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들의 실패 원인은 에드나의 자존심이나 줄리아의 게으름 때문이 아닙니다. 그들에겐 서로 협력할 만한 능력이 없기 때문이죠. 저와는 "
"전혀 상관 없는 일입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56753_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "3a0b3342-7445-4f30-a227-001db39c6c78"
msgid ""
"\"Duels... Reckless games with death, where players bet their lives to "
"satisfy their vanity and hubris. Silly, really — but are our entire lives "
"not the same?\""
msgstr ""
"\"결투... 허영심과 자만심을 채우기 위해 목숨을 거는 무모한 죽음의 게임이지. 정말 바보같지.. 하지만 우리 인생 전체가 그렇지 "
"않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56754_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e45c416a-643f-45ea-932a-e387321e31f0"
msgid ""
"\"Big deal, fencing with toothpicks! Just some entertainment for rich city "
"dwellers. In a real fight, all your stances and feints aren't worth shit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게뭐 대수라고. 이쑤시개로 펜싱이라니! 부유한 도시 사람을 위한 놀이일 뿐이야. 진짜 싸움에서 네 검술 자세와 동작들은 쓸모가 없어!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56757_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d5ac6e2a-f67f-4ed3-8afe-991bb5ee8a8e"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Mivon}Mivon's{/g} like a paradise for bards. There are duels every day, "
"and of course, the winners want songs of their victories. So bards will "
"prepare a dozen songs in advance, and then just slip the right name in!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Mivon} 미본{/g}은 바드의 낙원과도 같은 곳이에요. 매일 결투가 벌어지고 승자는 항상 바드의 노래를 원하죠. 그래서 "
"바드들은 미리 노래 열개 정도를 준비해서 이름만 끼어넣고 노래를 팔고는 해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56758_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "44d95c53-9270-40a2-8282-7adcf26f3aca"
msgid ""
"\"Fun ways they have here! Maybe we should introduce some of their rules "
"into our barony, huh?\""
msgstr "\"재미있는 방법으로 여기에 왔구나! 저들의 방법을 영지에 소개해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56763_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5d965fa4-87f2-4f3c-afe9-35faf3c78099"
msgid ""
"\"What? No way. Why would I need your throne? I just thought it would be fun."
"\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 말도 안돼. 왜 내가 네 왕좌를 필요로 하겠어? 그냥 재미있을 거라 생각했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56764_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8ea6f3df-4181-489e-9f89-e5a77d7c6fae"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha, that's right! We've got the best barony in all the {g|River "
"Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 맞아! 우리는 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}에서 최고의 남작령을 얻었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56766_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "209c7a8e-235b-4e23-a727-75604ea04c9c"
msgid ""
"\"It'd be great! You want to be a minister? Learn to swing a sword, not just "
"a pen! You want to sit in someone else's chair? Put a bear trap on it! You "
"want... Wait, no. That's just nonsense. It'd end up just like the damned {g|"
"Technic League}Technic League{/g}. To hells with it, let's just keep things "
"as they are.\""
msgstr ""
"\"괜찮을 거야! 장관이 되고 싶어? 펜만이 아니라 칼을 휘두르는 법을 배워야 해! 다른 자의 자리를 뺏고 싶어? 그러면 곰 덫을 놓으면 "
"돼! 또... 잠깐. 안돼. 그건 말도 안돼. 망할 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g} 녀석들처럼 끝날 거야. 그러니 그냥 "
"내버려두자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/MivonDialog/Cue_56767_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e4ff149f-bcdc-43ed-814d-0ed86ee4e074"
msgid "{n}The half-orc purses his lips, frowns, and looks to the ground.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하프오크는 입술을 비죽 내밀고 찡그리고는 땅을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Answer_04372_Text
msgctxt "2e9d78ec-6bf1-4737-a8f8-f2bda6f363f1"
msgid "\"How goes the hunt?\""
msgstr "\"사냥은 어떻게 되가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Answer_59981_Text
msgctxt "1702ec40-2097-4089-89c2-023d1dc7f410"
msgid "[Attack] \"Fools! You fell for my trap, and now you'll die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"바보들! 너희는 내 함정에 빠진거야. 이제 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Answer_59985_Text
msgctxt "928a6afb-c7e2-44c1-a648-4544b3e49b5a"
msgid "\"You seem to be comfortable. Not interested in hunting monsters?\""
msgstr "\"편안해 보이네. 괴물 사냥엔 관심이 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Answer_59986_Text
msgctxt "0df147bd-c424-4bb3-bcfc-908b149ac06d"
msgid "\"Is King Irovetti well?\""
msgstr "\"이로베티 왕은 잘 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Answer_59987_Text
msgctxt "1e4a975c-f5f8-49f4-bb13-d54770511e37"
msgid ""
"[Abandon the hunt and relax] \"I suppose the monsters aren't going anywhere. "
"I'll take the largest goblet you'll give me, if you please.\""
msgstr "[사냥을 포기하고 쉽니다] \"괴물들이 갑자기 어디론가 가진 않겠지. 뭐, 괜찮다면 가장 큰 잔으로 부탁해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Answer_59991_Text
msgctxt "d1ab20db-f44a-4023-bc72-b1e9a1d9bf4c"
msgid "[Leave] \"Enjoy yourself! I have to get back to hunting.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"즐거운 시간되길! 나는 다시 사냥하러 돌아가겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Answer_60010_Text
msgctxt "0c716df6-d2fc-457b-a752-2cc2846d071f"
msgid ""
"\"Your music is beautiful. You must have been blessed by Shelyn herself!\""
msgstr "\"음악이 아름다워. 네 실력은 셸린의 축복을 받은 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_44635_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "80adbfce-1e5c-440e-9b8b-1605cdcbebbe"
msgid ""
"{n}Up the hill, there's a burning bonfire. Beside it, a tablecloth's been "
"spread on the ground, with various delicacies on it. Annamede plucks at the "
"strings of her lute until she sees you and waves hello.{/n} \"Ah, the "
"{mf|host|hostess} of the hunt comes to pay us a visit! Welcome to our table!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}언덕 위에서 모닥불이 타오르고 있습니다. 그 옆에 여러 종류의 맛있는 음식이 식탁보 위에 펼쳐졌습니다. 안나미데는 류트를 튕기다 "
"당신을 발견하자 인사합니다.{/n} \"아, 사냥의 주최자께서 우리를 방문하셨어! 어서와요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59982_Text
msgctxt "bd205b08-c65b-4ba5-b042-126c0b30e681"
msgid "\"You falsehearted, treacherous...\""
msgstr "\"이 못된 나쁜...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59983_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "67bc71f4-d643-4611-b4f2-20127f82ceff"
msgid ""
"\"Excellent! The sun is warm, the wine is rich, and the company is good. I "
"couldn't dream of a better hunt!\""
msgstr "\"훌륭해요! 태양은 따뜻하고 와인도 풍족하고 좋은 친구들이 있어요. 이보다 더 좋은 사냥은 꿈에도 없을 꺼에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59989_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "44d85c78-411e-4b34-b5bc-713d9ff05fc0"
msgid ""
"\"Why should we? We're happy where we are! Please, have a seat! Can I pour "
"you some wine? {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} wines are the finest around!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 우리가 관심을 가져야 하죠? 우리는 여기에서 행복합니다! 앉아요!. 와인 좀 따라줄까요? {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 와인은 이 "
"주변에선 최고에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59990_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "cb26af54-3ec4-45a9-b680-e60cdaa17f3a"
msgid ""
"\"His Highness is healthy and vigorous! He sends you his regards. Some "
"urgent matters of state prevented him from attending this fine event, but he "
"does hope to meet with you personally in the near future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이베로티 전하께서는 건강하고 원기 왕성하세요! 당신께 안부를 전해달라고 했어요. 그분께선 국가의 긴급한 문제들로 인해 이 훌륭한 "
"행사에 참석하진 못했지만, 가까운 시일 안에 당신과 개인적으로 만나기를 희망하고 있답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59992_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "538b2b71-7d90-4d35-97a0-17fd474cf361"
msgid ""
"{n}The bard fills a goblet to the brim with fragrant wine and offers it to "
"you.{/n} \"To good relations between neighbors!\""
msgstr "{n}바드는 술잔에 향기로운 와인을 채우고 당신에게 줍니다.{/n} \"이웃 간의 좋은 관계를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59993_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "a7faed6a-8ecd-40e4-9460-90bd22c4dc51"
msgid ""
"\"A good hunt to you!\" {n}The bard flashes you a charming smile and begins "
"playing her lute again.{/n}"
msgstr "\"즐거운 사냥이 되기를!\" {n}바드는 당신에게 매력적인 미소를 짓고 류트를 다시 연주하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59995_Text
msgctxt "70149ce0-23bc-481c-9525-d4d61451b4e4"
msgid ""
"{n}The {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} wine deserves all its praise and more — it's "
"almost as sweet as Annamede's voice. You begin to understand why she enjoys "
"such immense popularity in Pitax. After several hours pass, the guests from "
"Pitax finally begin packing their things for the journey back.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 와인은 소문대로 맛이 좋았습니다. 안나메데의 목소리처럼 달콤했습니다. 당신은 그녀가 왜 피탁스에서 "
"그렇게 인기가 있는지 이제 이해했습니다. 몇시간이 지나고 피탁스의 손님은 다시 여행을 하러 짐을 꾸립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59996_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "3f28ceea-0cb8-4f8d-abcf-0b739eb3a710"
msgid "\"Your Grace! Come. Sit with us! Treat yourself!\""
msgstr "\"어서와요! {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}! 여기 우리랑 앉아서 마음껏 즐겨요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_59998_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "c30f6bec-d299-41a2-8708-42916f966021"
msgid ""
"\"Now this is my kind of hunt! Gods only know how long it's been since I've "
"had the chance to spend some leisure time in polite company. Pass me the "
"peaches, if you would.\""
msgstr "\"이게 바로 내가 좋아하는 사냥이지! 좋은 친구들과 여가시간을 보낸 게 얼마만인지 몰라. 거기 복숭아좀 건네줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_60001_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "45698d06-8324-440e-8214-dbbd19d5db69"
msgid ""
"\"What a surprise! If it isn't the estimable Jubilost Narthropple himself! "
"Your books are a blessing. Please, be so kind as to honor us with your "
"company and tell us of your adventures!\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트 나트로풀이라니! 네 책은 대단해. 여기 동료들에게 네 모험담을 들려주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_60003_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "ef5a87d0-1a3c-43a1-93ef-347a9586f16e"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, I can hardly believe my eyes! How could such a beautiful flower bloom "
"in these wild lands?\" {n}Annamede feasts her eyes upon Valerie, who steps "
"back with a scowl.{/n} \"Please, sweetheart, sit here with me. Let us enjoy "
"your company.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 눈을 믿을 수 없어! 어떻게 이런 아름다운 꽃들이 야생의 땅에서 자라나는 거지?\" {n}안나메데가 발레리를 보며 축배를 들자 "
"발레리는 얼굴을 찡그리며 뒷걸음질칩니다.{/n} \"오 자기야. 여기 나와 함께 앉아요. 함께 즐거운 시간을 보냈으면 해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_60004_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5b9228ef-b20a-418f-9686-61a379c7b7ba"
msgid ""
"\"Lady Belavarah! You probably don't remember me... We... I... You taught us "
"poetics at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, and I must say... You, "
"you're... just a delight!\" {n}Bardic eloquence abandoning her, Linzi "
"blushes and falls silent, looking at the ground. Annamede doesn't grace her "
"with an answer.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"빌라바라 님! 아마 절 기억하지 못하시겠지만... 우리는... 저는... {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 "
"아카데미{/g}에서 빌라바라 님의 시 수업을 들은 적이 있답니다... 당신을... 만나 뵙게 되어... 영광이에요! {n}바드처럼 "
"빌라바라를 찬양하던 린지는 얼굴을 붉히더니 말없이 고개를 푹 숙입니다. 한편 안나미데는 린제의 찬양에 화답할 생각이 없어 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_60005_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "834438e0-0c52-41d0-95a8-85d3bd45fb38"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie glares angrily at Annamede, then turns away to stand guard at a "
"distance, her sword at the ready. She meaningfully looks around for enemies "
"with exaggerated diligence.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 안나메데를 화가 나서 노려보고는 등을 돌려 거리를 두고 검을 듭니다. 그녀는 의미심장한 눈빛으로 적들을 하나하나 "
"봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_60008_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bfddb419-1db0-4f0c-a4c8-0a89a72ff0d7"
msgid ""
"\"People dying of a magical disease, monsters roaming the country, but here "
"you are — drinking and having fun, as though forgetting it may be the last "
"day of your lives... But that is human nature, I suppose, is it not?\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법의 질병으로 사람들이 죽고 괴물이 돌아다니지만 여기 너희들은 술을 마시고 인생의 마지막인 것처럼 즐기고 있어... 하지만 이것이 "
"인간의 본성이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_60009_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3fb94786-8700-480d-a8c0-902b5d30322b"
msgid "\"My pleasure, my pleasure!\""
msgstr "\"별말씀을! 별말씀을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafari/PitaxDialog/Cue_60011_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxGuestAnnamede
msgctxt "f90567d3-f4c7-4ea7-a712-83e0c1c9d6c3"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, Shelyn... The Eternal Rose brings inspiration to "
"many — but not to me! For that, I turn to {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} — "
"that's why my music promises not boring beauty, but true ecstasy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}이시여... 영원한 장미는 많은 사람들에게 영감을 가져다 주지만 나는 그렇지 않습니다! 그렇기 때문에 "
"나는 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}를 믿었습니다. 그래서 내 음악은 지루하지 않고 흥이 넘치는 것이지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1f8caafb-44db-4207-856c-8963961bb0de"
msgid ""
"Decided that it's dangerous to let the subjects know about the magic beasts "
"threat."
msgstr "백성들에게 환수에 대해 알려주는 것은 위험하다는 결론을 내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "84079eed-cbf1-4494-b9c7-92b40ca93554"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, telling the public would do more harm than good. Let's try to solve "
"the problem discreetly to avoid further trouble.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 대중들에게 알리는것은 득보다 실이 많을 거야. 더 문제가 생기지 않도록 이 문제를 신중하게 해결하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5dcfbe17-8aed-433d-bfe3-1eb604fbdf97"
msgid "Decided that the subjects should know about the magic beasts threat."
msgstr "백성들에게 환수에 대해 알려주어야 한다고 결론을 내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "07b28bc2-7b89-4c8d-bf50-ce45352f9b36"
msgid ""
"\"Concealing this could be disastrous. Better to warn people now then have "
"them discover it on their own later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것을 숨기는 것은 재앙이 될 수 있어. 사람들이 나중에 스스로 알아내게 되는것보다는, 지금 사람들에게 경고 해주는게 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bc29dd19-7654-4f30-82b9-958d5d3be876"
msgid ""
"Decided that the subjects have a right to know about the magic beasts threat."
msgstr "백성들이 환수에 대해 알 권리가 있다고 결론을 내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "49e97054-bc8a-4132-b5f7-8f4a7a554ea5"
msgid ""
"\"The people have a right to know what threatens them. Spread the "
"information on this event as wide as possible.\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 무엇이 자신들을 위협하는지 알 권리가 있다. 이 사건에 대한 정보를 최대한 널리 알릴 수 있도록.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d751bc8d-42b3-42eb-a5ce-3482a42f6016"
msgid ""
"Decided that the subjects have no need to know about the magic beasts threat."
msgstr "백성들에게 환수에 대해 알려줄 필요는 없다고 결론을 내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "e924ff77-bc87-4a87-a1c4-d03ce8b85399"
msgid ""
"\"Agreed. My subjects needn't know of this — such problems are for rulers to "
"solve.\""
msgstr "\"동의한다. 내 백성들이 이걸 알 필요는 없어. 이런 문제들은 통치자들이 해결해야 할 문제들이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Safari_Kassil
msgctxt "ee2112bf-093b-44a6-86bf-364a3e7aaed2"
msgid ""
"\"Simply dreadful. I'll see to it that this poor man's family receives a "
"pension... Wait, could it be that all of the monsters have appeared in this "
"manner?\""
msgstr "\"정말 끔찍하군요. 이 불쌍한 자의 가족이 보상을 받도록 하겠습니다... 잠깐. 모든 괴물들이 이런식으로 나타났던 걸까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Safari_Shandra
msgctxt "a58ccf1f-11e7-4465-9407-fc9e9246e85d"
msgid ""
"\"So that's how the magic beasts have been arriving. I had no idea such "
"spells even existed, let alone that we had enemies powerful enough to use "
"them.\""
msgstr "\"이래서 환수들이 나타나는 거였군요. 이런 마법이 존재하는지도, 이런 강력한 마법을 사용하는 적이 있는지도 몰랐습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Safari_LanderLebeda
msgctxt "c9a9b740-c9e0-49ed-a714-a7b696344f3e"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander wipes blood from the bottom of his shoe, frowning.{/n} \"Disgusting"
"! Well, at least now we know where these monsters have been coming from.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더는 구두 바닥의 피를 닦아내며 찡그립니다.{/n} \"구역질 나는군! 적어도 지금 우리는 이 괴물들이 어디에서 왔는지 알아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Cue_0004_Text_String
#. Speaker : Safari_LanderLebeda
msgctxt "a5c1bfbd-1bf9-4ef9-99ab-f239d10d9eef"
msgid ""
"\"If the public learns of this, there'll be no stopping the panic. I "
"recommend we keep this incident quiet for the time being. I'll conduct an "
"investigation without drawing anyone's attention, and in a month's time, "
"I'll inform you of the results.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대중이 이 사실을 알게 된다면 혼란을 막을 수 없을 거야. 당분간은 이 사건을 알리지 않는게 좋을 것 같아. 내가 아무도 모르게 "
"조사를 진행해서, 몇달 내에 결과를 알려주도록 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Cue_0008_Text_String
#. Speaker : Safari_LanderLebeda
msgctxt "b78397f9-eabb-467f-a5d3-c408b11865bc"
msgid ""
"\"I'll give all the necessary orders once we've returned to the capital.\""
msgstr "\"수도로 돌아가서 필요한 모든 조치를 내리지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/EnvoyMonsterAttack/Cue_0009_Text_String
#. Speaker : Safari_LanderLebeda
msgctxt "8edc19f6-d072-408e-a939-767afa2bd1a4"
msgid "\"As you say.\""
msgstr "\"분부대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "1222d1fc-e492-488f-85ef-cc3fc5051338"
msgid "[Examine the guests from Mivon]"
msgstr "[미본에서 온 손님들을 살펴봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "9feea498-2c76-42c3-8139-4fb24f5c54dc"
msgid "[Examine the guests from Pitax]"
msgstr "[피탁스에서 온 손님들을 살펴봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "997bb1dd-e267-4871-9995-b8511246d186"
msgid "\"What's in the chest?\""
msgstr "\"상자에는 뭐가 들었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "a0fea33f-1233-449d-8498-4856640a8921"
msgid "[Start the hunt] \"I'm ready.\""
msgstr "[사냥을 시작합니다] \"나는 준비됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "1b8e9084-70b0-4a24-ada4-2f38d94e331f"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Embeth Travelers.\""
msgstr "\"엠베스 여행자에 관해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "52cf7121-50eb-4c45-b6ff-cac7758acf2f"
msgid "\"How goes the hunt?\""
msgstr "\"사냥은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "52d1483b-7aae-417a-a4b9-df5fbb0b9249"
msgid "[Finish the hunt] \"Sound the horn. The hunt is over.\""
msgstr "[사냥을 끝냅니다] \"나팔을 울려라. 사냥은 끝났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "d00113f5-0feb-4f6e-b12c-9d341c8816cd"
msgid "[Leave] \"I should go. There may still be time for another trophy.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"가봐야겠어. 아직 다른 트로피를 얻을 시간이 남았을지 모르니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0035_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4907fe5a-3c41-4cca-ba95-fe58c6a70381"
msgid "Coerced the Embeth Travelers into giving you the unearned prize."
msgstr "엠베스 여행자가 당신에게 상을 주도록 강요했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "f262c8f9-cd7f-4be3-a9d1-a42411446e26"
msgid ""
"[Place your hand on your weapon] \"Are you certain? My victory seemed "
"obvious, but if you disagree, I suppose we could determine the winner with "
"one final match.\""
msgstr "[무기에 손을 댑니다] \"확실해? 내 승리가 분명하지만 네가 동의하지 않으면 최종 결승전에서 승자를 결정할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "2c15077e-7a1a-46cf-93bc-c9d8e287b451"
msgid ""
"[Leave] \"The hunt is officially over. Thank you all for your participation!"
"\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"공식적으로 사냥을 끝낸다. 모두들 참여해줘서 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "b548f3d9-7dec-4dec-9262-d69949bb88da"
msgid "\"How did our Mivoni guests fare?\""
msgstr "\"미본의 손님들의 성과는 어떻지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "77a75c18-520f-4594-a5e2-ce1c765cfb76"
msgid "\"How did our Pitaxian guests fare?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스의 손님들의 성과는 어떻지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "8c38a5d5-f1f0-401c-8540-e3ba0e095f56"
msgid "\"How did the Embeth Travelers fare?\""
msgstr "\"엠베스 여행자의 성과는 어떻지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "46f9dbd9-5d9a-4692-81ed-b9295b590431"
msgid "\"Who won?\""
msgstr "\"누가 이겼지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0062_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9d659d3a-c3f4-4219-bc3c-463c7ea66710"
msgid "Used you title to award youself the unearned prize."
msgstr "상을 받기 위해 당신의 지위를 이용합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "28becc02-7c10-496c-831c-a7776d190961"
msgid ""
"\"As these are my lands, it seems only fitting that I should judge this "
"competition. And I declare myself the winner!\""
msgstr "\"여기는 내 땅이니 내가 이 경쟁의 승자를 판단하겠어. 결과는 내가 승자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0083_Text
msgctxt "c6e61e43-b6d3-4963-a24f-8dbbbac270ba"
msgid "\"Don't be upset! You can try your luck with one of the other guests.\""
msgstr "\"화내지 마! 다른 손님에게 네 운을 시험해 볼 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Answer_0090_Text
msgctxt "8d4249c8-30fb-4012-b278-8c753ba7d73f"
msgid "\"I think you're teasing me on purpose.\""
msgstr "\"지금 나를 괴롭히는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "dc796dda-df2d-4793-bdca-ef936bf17065"
msgid ""
"{n}The leader of the {g|Embeth Travelers}travelers{/g}, a graying man with "
"strong hands and sharp eyes, greets you with a nod.{/n} \"Your Grace. Thank "
"you for hosting this hunt.\" {n}He turns toward the guests.{/n} \"Dear "
"guests, welcome! I am Jamel Visser, of Embeth Forest. I've no talent for "
"speeches, so let us proceed to business.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}회색의 머리를 하고 단단한 손과 날카로운 눈빛의 {g|Embeth Travelers}엠베스 여행자{/g}의 우두머리는 당신에게 고개를 "
"끄덕이며 인사합니다.{/n} \"이 사냥을 개최해 주셔서 고맙습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. \" {n}그는 손님쪽으로 몸을 "
"돌립니다.{/n} \"손님들, 모두 환영한다! 나는 엠베스 숲의 자멜 비세르라고 한다. 나는 연설에 재능이 없으니 바로 본론으로 들어가지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "14d7468b-1b17-43a6-b3f6-47c7bf1cc1ec"
msgid ""
"\"This is no normal hunt. Rather than hares or deer, our prey shall be "
"owlbears, hydras, and wyverns. These targets would be dangerous enough "
"anywhere, but on these grounds, we've found extraordinarily large and fierce "
"specimens. We aim to eliminate them before they can find their way to any "
"civilians.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 보통의 사냥이 아니다. 산토끼나 사슴이 아니라 우리의 사냥감은 아울베어, 히드라, 와이번 같은 녀석들이야. 이 목표물들은 "
"어디에서나 위험할 수 있지만, 우리는 이 지역에서 엄청나게 크고 사나운 녀석을 발견했어. 우리는 놈들이 도시로 접근하기전에 제거하는 것을 "
"목표로 하고있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "1f958fb8-b17a-42d1-b1c5-d1143e3b3ee5"
msgid ""
"\"To make the hunt a bit more interesting, we've decided to add an element "
"of competition.\" {n}Jamel displays a gold-trimmed chest to the gathered "
"audience.{/n} \"There are three dire monsters on the grounds. I'm willing to "
"bet my crew will gather two heads at least. But if one of the other parties "
"bests us and gathers two, or even all three trophies, they'll be rewarded "
"with a valuable prize. Don't dally, though — we won't be waiting for anyone! "
"Is everyone ready?\""
msgstr ""
"\"사냥을 좀 더 재미있게 하기 위해 경쟁 요소를 추가하기로 했다.\" {n}자멜은 모여든 청중에게 금으로 장식된 상자를 "
"보여줍니다.{/n} \"이곳 지상에는 끔찍한 괴물이 세 마리가 있다. 내 일행이 적어도 두 놈의 머리를 가져올 거라 기꺼이 장담하지. "
"하지만 다른 일행 중 하나라도 우리를 이기고 두 마리 또는 세 마리의 머리를 트로피로 가져온다면 그들은 값진 상을 받게될거다. 너무 "
"꾸물거리지들 말라구! 우리는 누구도 기다려주지 않을거니까! 모두들 준비되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "22fb82ca-56c5-495d-8614-5bfb4a40a126"
msgid ""
"{n}The two {g|Swordlords}swordlord{/g} sisters represent the "
"{g|Mivon}Mivoni{/g} Aldori. As they inspect their equipment, the elder "
"sister, Edna, can be heard scolding the younger, Julia. Julia sighs and "
"rolls her eyes, but she doesn't interrupt her sister.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}두명의 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g} 자매는 {g|Mivon}미본{/g} 알도리의 대표입니다. 그들이 장비를 점검하면서 "
"언니 에드나가 동생 줄리아를 꾸짖는 소리가 들립니다. 줄리아는 한숨을 쉬며 눈알을 굴리지만, 언니는 상관없이 계속 꾸짖습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "d127737b-59d4-4180-8b86-e645b3179a34"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede Belavarah, one of the most popular bards in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, "
"has come as an emissary of King Irovetti. She doesn't seem to have brought "
"any hunting gear.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 가장 유명한 바드 중 한명인 안나메데 벨라바라는 이로베티 왕의 사절로 왔습니다. 그녀는 사냥용 "
"장비를 가져온 것 같지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "c5a1d1f9-7ae8-4aa9-992e-7970b2d98c35"
msgid ""
"\"That's for the winner to find out! There's no prize better than surprise, "
"or so it's said.\""
msgstr "\" 그건 승자가 알아낼 겁니다! 상이란 원래 깜짝 놀라는 맛이 있어야 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "3b941ea8-3b98-402b-b944-2c2ced763169"
msgid ""
"\"Let us begin! The hunting grounds are an hour's travel from here. Don't "
"waste any time; we won't hesitate to bag all the trophies!\""
msgstr "\"시작하자! 사냥터는 여기에서 한 시간 거리다. 시간 낭비하지 마라. 우리가 모든 트로피를 챙겨올 수도 있으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "85b131eb-2600-4427-93cc-7fcf7d3c7e72"
msgid ""
"{n}The huntsman fiddles with a small spyglass.{/n} \"Can't see much from "
"here. I wish I could join the hunt a get a couple of heads myself!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼은 작은 망원경을 만지작 거립니다.{/n} \"여기서는 별로 보이지 않아. 나도 사냥에 동참해서 괴물의 머리 두어 개라도 "
"베어오고 싶군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "947a591f-94fa-4a51-b49a-982690677f5a"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm, what would be of interest...\" {n}The huntsman scratches at his "
"unshaven chin.{/n} \"Embeth Forest is a strange place, even for the {g|River "
"Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}. It teems with magic. The fey who live there "
"believe there's no place for humans. Obviously, we believe otherwise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠. 어떤 걸 관심있어 하실까...\" {n}사냥꾼은 면도하지 않은 턱을 긁습니다.{/n} \"엠베스 숲은 이상한 장소입니다. 심지어 "
"{g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}에서도 말이죠. 그곳은 마법으로 가득차 있습니다. 그곳에 사는 페이들은 인간을 위한 "
"장소는 없다고 믿고 있습니다. 당연히 우리는 그 반대로 믿고 있구요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "cccd6565-0cc8-4609-9577-37b587135ffb"
msgid ""
"\"We've been fighting them for centuries. Seen a lot in that time. But I "
"must say, the beasts you're dealing with here are new even to us. As we're "
"practically neighbors, it seemed only right to offer our help to you. "
"Especially since, if these creatures managed to eat all of you — "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} forbid! — they may just go for us as a second course."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 수 세기에 걸쳐 페이들과 싸워왔습니다. 정말 많은 것들을 봐왔습니다. 하지만 이곳에서 당신들이 상대하고 있는 짐승들은 우리에게 "
"조차 새로운 놈들입니다. 우리는 사실상 이웃이기 때문에, 당신에게 도움을 주는 것이 맞는 것 같았습니다. 게다가 만약 이 생명체들이 "
"여러분 모두를 먹어치워 버린다면 그후엔.. 놈들은 분명 두번째 요리로 우리를 택할 것이 뻔하기 때문입니다. "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}이 막아주시기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "fabf3053-86f8-4c88-b17f-741e76e0dcc3"
msgid ""
"\"Can't see much from here, but my crew wastes no time. If you don't hurry, "
"there may be no trophies left for you!\""
msgstr "\"여기서는 잘 보이지 않지만 내 동료들은 시간을 낭비하지 않습니다. 서두르지 않으면 트로피가 하나도 안남을지 모릅니다!\"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "6ecb3720-a1ff-49f8-938d-21550648e395"
msgid "\"A good hunt to you!\""
msgstr "\"즐거운 사냥되시길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "9f48cfa7-36e3-44a5-894d-7688ec721cc4"
msgid ""
"\"Our honorable guests from {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} managed to bag... a single "
"squirrel! Well, I hope they at least had a good time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 온 우리의 영광스러운 손님들은... 다람쥐 한마리를 가져왔군! 뭐, 최소한 즐거운 시간이었기를 "
"바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "7acc5bf7-9e4c-458b-9600-10d30867fc57"
msgid ""
"\"Our honorable guests from {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} fought one of the monsters, "
"but they couldn't defeat it. Their bodies are on their way home as we speak. "
"With any luck, Mivoni Aldori can afford the resurrections. Let their fate be "
"a lesson to anyone who would underestimate the threat of magical beasts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Mivon}미본{/g}에서 온 우리의 명예로운 손님들은 괴물 중 하나와 싸웠지만 놈들을 쓰러트리지 못했습니다. 그들의 시체는 "
"집으로 보내질 것입니다. 운이 따른다면 미본의 알도리는 부활할 수 있을 겁니다. 누구든 환수들의 위협을 과소평가하는 자가 있다면, "
"그녀들의 죽음이 교훈이 되길 바랍니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "88adc602-6c71-4bc5-887e-9a2d9408ca4d"
msgid ""
"\"Our honorable guests from {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} fought one of the monsters "
"but barely survived. Fortunately, {mf|His|Her} Grace's timely arrival "
"forestalled tragedy. We wish them better luck next time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Mivon}미본{/g}에서 온 우리의 명예로운 손님들은 괴물 중 하나와 싸웠지만 간신히 살아 남았습니다. 다행히 "
"{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}의 시기적절한 도착으로 비극은 막을 수 있었군요. 다음에는 더 운이 좋기를 바라겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "27c0c28c-2b56-442a-8eb8-84856276a051"
msgid ""
"{n}The {g|Embeth Travelers}travelers'{/g} faces grow dark as they put their "
"hands on their weapons, but Jamel simply shakes his head and hands the chest "
"to you.{/n} \"Your lands, your rules. But do mind, Your Grace — such "
"behavior can make it hard for one to keep their throne.\" {n}The travelers "
"leave.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Embeth Travelers}여행자'{/g}들의 얼굴이 어두워지면서 그들의 무기에 손을 대지만 자멜은 그저 머리를 흔들고는 "
"상자를 건냅니다.{/n} \"당신의 땅이니 당신의 법을 따르겠소. 하지만 명심하십시오. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 이런 행동은 "
"왕좌를 지키기 어렵게 만들 수 있습니다.\" {n}여행자들은 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "44042099-65d7-45f8-8cd7-d5e6658469f0"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish.\" {n}The huntsman opens the window and sounds the horn.{/n}"
msgstr "\"원하시는대로 하겠습니다.\" {n}사냥꾼은 창을 열고 나팔을 울립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "10475327-925c-4d20-b8d8-b1fdf5d6fcff"
msgid ""
"\"Is something wrong, Your Grace? I see you have no trophies as yet. You'll "
"lose the competition if you don't hurry!"
msgstr ""
"\"뭔가 잘못되었습니까. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}? 아직 전리품이 없으신데, 서두르지 않으면 경쟁에서 패배하실 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "8b1d847a-8c48-456d-9616-8bfe708f3145"
msgid ""
"\"You've defeated one of the dire beasts! Impressive. If you don't hurry, "
"though, you'll find the other two trophies in our hands!\""
msgstr "\"괴물 하나를 처치했군요! 인상적이네요. 그래도 서두르지 않으면 나머지 두 개의 트로피는 우리 손에 들려 있을겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "7b6f2400-0b38-4529-abe5-023a12c6174f"
msgid ""
"\"Two trophies! I'd never have guessed that you would best us like this. "
"Would you like to announce the end of the hunt, or do you hope to claim yet "
"another trophy?\""
msgstr ""
"\"두개의 트로피를 얻었군요! 당신이 우리를 이길 줄은 상상도 못했는데. 사냥을 끝내고 싶으십니까? 아니면 다른 트로피도 얻으러 "
"가시겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "272b09ec-e517-4295-9bd7-150fa57b64da"
msgid ""
"\"You defeated all three of the monsters? I'd have never thought my crew "
"would perform so poorly. Well then, shall we end the hunt now?\""
msgstr "\"괴물 세마리를 모두 잡았다고? 내 동료들이 이렇게 사냥을 못할줄이야. 그럼 이제 사냥을 끝낼까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "b5290e98-2bc2-4851-964d-c7938db89a2b"
msgid ""
"\"It seems all three beasts have been slain. Should I signal the hunters to "
"return?\""
msgstr "\"세마리의 짐승이 모두 죽은 것 같군요. 사냥꾼들에게 돌아오라고 신호를 보낼까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "e3bc0263-a11c-4d43-a8c6-e7e227fbd16a"
msgid "\"Now that the hunt's over, let's see how it turned out!\""
msgstr "\"이제 사냥이 끝났으니 결과가 어떻게 되었는지 봅시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "c33fc409-3e70-4881-a8e5-26c63e8acb50"
msgid ""
"\"Our honorable guests from {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} seem to have headed home "
"before the hunt was officially over, and without killing a single beast. "
"They must have had something urgent to attend to.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 손님들은 사냥이 공식적으로 끝나기 전에 한마리도 잡지 못하고 집으로 간 거 같군. 그들은 분명히 "
"바빴나봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "6c79b484-8c23-4aa5-a59b-ba04e15cbda4"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamel frowns.{/n} \"One of our teams hasn't returned. We're searching for "
"them now. They're experienced hunters, but during a hunt, anything is "
"possible... I hope they're all right.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Jamel은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"우리 팀 중 하나가 돌아오지 않았어. 우리는 지금 그들을 찾고 있어. 그들은 경험 많은 "
"사냥꾼이지만 사냥 중에는 무슨 일이든 일어날 수 있지... 그들이 무사해야 할 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "506ec0eb-8adf-4c49-9276-b3203cca50cb"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace was kind enough to allow us the honor of acquiring all three "
"trophies.\" {n}On the huntsman's sign, the travelers present three bags, "
"each containing the head of one of the dire monsters.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 세마리 모두 잡게 하다니 너무 관대하구나.\" {n}사냥꾼의 신호로 여행자는 자루 세개를 보여주었고 각자 위험한 괴물의 머리를 "
"담고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "cc758eb0-7889-40af-a28c-486e782bb386"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|His|Her} Grace, noble ruler of these hunting grounds, has slain one of "
"the beasts with a skill that would have made any Embeth Travelers proud — "
"but we still acquired the other two trophies.\" {n}On the huntsman's sign, "
"the Woodsmen present two bags, each containing the head of one of the dire "
"monsters.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이 사냥터의 지배자인 {name}의 실력은 엠베스 여행자도 인정할 정도였고 괴물 하나를 죽였지만 우리는 다른 두마리를 잡았다.\""
" {n}사냥꾼이 신호하자 나무꾼이 가방 두개를 보여주었고 각각은 위험한 괴물의 머리를 담고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "80019d6e-3864-4292-bf95-8b11c7fb352e"
msgid ""
"\"We defeated one of the beasts, but {mf|His|Her} Grace, noble ruler of "
"these hunting grounds, has accomplished a true feat in gathering more "
"trophies than us! Such skill deserves deep and genuine respect.\" {n}The "
"huntsman bows deeply toward you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 짐승 중 하나를 물리쳤지만, 이 사냥터의 고귀한 통치자께서는 우리보다 더 많은 트로피를 모으는 진정한 업적을 이루었습니다! "
"이런 뛰어난 실력은 깊이 존경 받을 만합니다.\" {n}사냥꾼은 당신에게 깊이 고개숙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "974d4a2a-68ec-4b91-acac-ef25bdb4126d"
msgid ""
"\"It's a rare thing for the {g|Embeth Travelers}Embeth Travelers{/g} to go "
"home empty-handed, but today is such a day! We gained not a single trophy — "
"each monster was slain by the noble ruler of theses hunting grounds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Embeth Travelers}엠베스 여행자{/g}가 빈손으로 돌아온건 매우 드문 일이지만, 오늘이 바로 그런 날입니다! "
"우리는 트로피를 하나도 얻지 못했습니다. 모든 괴물들은 이 사냥터의 고귀하신 통치자에게 죽음을 당했습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "fd5a5d2a-681c-43a8-bac6-1bf7d7c38c13"
msgid "\"No one, Your Grace! We'll hold on to the prize.\""
msgstr "\"승자는 아무도 없습니다! {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 보상은 우리가 가지고 있겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "ac8c442c-a04b-4d64-8c6f-b680c9c7e35a"
msgid "\"You, Your Grace!\" {n}The huntsman solemnly hands you the chest.{/n}"
msgstr "\"당신의 승리입니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}!\" {n}사냥꾼이 엄숙하게 상자를 건넵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "db3971a9-bd38-4081-8b3d-5d5be24d46f5"
msgid "{n}Noticing your look, the bard smiles playfully.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 얼굴을 보자 바드는 장난스럽게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "37f9b4c4-b3d9-4fee-a18e-a366c442c701"
msgid "{n}Ekun frowns.{/n} \"This is no game. People are dying.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤이 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이것은 게임이 아니다. 사람들이 죽어가고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "5d56e3f2-4275-403a-9cf4-a871c5146b6c"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa! You know who that is? It's Annamede herself! When she taught poetics "
"at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, all the guys there sent her "
"love letters... and half the girls, too!\" {n}Linzi whispers excitedly. You "
"notice a blush spread over her face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우와! 그게 누군지 알지? 안나메데야! 그녀가 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에서 시를 배울 때 "
"모든 학생들이 그녀에게 러브레터를 보냈어... 그 중에 절반은 여자였고!\" {n}린지는 흥분해서 속삭입니다. 당신은 그녀의 얼굴이 "
"붉어지는 것을 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4398c433-36e1-455b-8e63-7004ae59465e"
msgid ""
"\"Fey, big deal! We have giants!\" {n}The huntsman listens to Amiri with a "
"smile.{/n} \"And mammoths! Sabertooth tigers! And we don't complain. You "
"know what we do? We eat them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"페이, 그게 뭐 대수라고! 우리는 거인도 있다!\" {n}사냥꾼은 미소로 아미리를 경청합니다.{/n} \"그리고 매머드도 있지! "
"검치호도 있어! 하지만 우리는 평화롭게 살고있어. 우리가 어떻게 하는지 알아? 그 녀석들을 잡아먹지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "2b6d5647-b910-4939-bc48-7e98e9f3a371"
msgid ""
"\"I'm pleased for both you and your appetite. May I finish answering the "
"question now?\""
msgstr "\"자네의 식욕을 잘 채운다니 기쁘군. 이제 내가 질문에 대답하는 걸 끝내도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "00ad05a4-9ac5-4c96-bf34-da89c37be59d"
msgid ""
"\"So, you're just being your usual self! Remind me to never sit at a card "
"table with you.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너는 자기만 생각한 거야! 너와 함께 카드놀이를 할 때 같이 앉지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "484ff651-12cd-4557-b356-9c2ba9270978"
msgid ""
"\"Hunting is fun. Back in {g|Kyonin}Kyonin{/g}, I also enjoyed hunting. "
"Wasn't exactly hunting beasts, though.\""
msgstr "\"사냥은 즐거운 것이지. {g|Kyonin}쿄닌{/g}에서 나도 사냥을 즐겼다. 하지만 짐승을 사냥한 것은 아니었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "54dd5da5-7487-4cc9-b4a1-1c6e50d33616"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks at Jamel with a lingering, delighted look.{/n} \"You're so "
"brave. Maybe while they're out hunting, you and I could... take a walk in "
"the forest? You could tell me of your feats, and of monsters you defeated..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 기쁜 표정으로 자멜을 봅니다.{/n} \"당신은 정말 용감하군요. 그들이 사냥을 할 때 잠시... 당신과 함께 숲 속에서 "
"걸어도 될까요? 당신의 위업, 네가 죽인 괴물들 얘기를 듣고 싶어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "4e648894-7ace-42a4-a751-54b450b60da4"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, my lady, but perhaps another time. I'm happily married, you "
"know!\""
msgstr "\"나를 용서해. 아마도 다음 기회에. 알다시피 나는 유부남이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b14817a7-ee6d-4fc0-83ee-fb60ce955b17"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia defiantly looks you in the eyes.{/n} \"Something wrong? I'm a "
"free person, right? Or do you want to forbid me from talking to others? "
"Maybe chain me up, too?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신을 도전적으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"뭔가 잘못됐어? 나는 노예가 아니잖아? 내가 다른 사람과 대화하는 것도 "
"막으려고? 나를 사슬로 묶지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "33e69301-c04f-455a-8bb1-31afe340cd79"
msgid "\"Nah. I'm not in the mood anymore!\""
msgstr "\"말 할 기분이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3efea47f-1205-46da-a377-5e9a77f9e8fb"
msgid ""
"\"What made you think that? I'm just having fun. This is a celebration, "
"right?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 생각하는 거야? 나는 그냥 재밌게 놀려는 거야. 축하하는 거 맞잖아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : MainHunter
msgctxt "08823f02-1bf2-4bbf-aa32-c45a58e9edfa"
msgid ""
"\"Well I'll be damned... Ahem! Your Grace! Did you want to ask me something?"
"\""
msgstr "\"글쎄 별로... 에헴! 영주님! 묻고 싶은 게 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/Huntsman/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "93a9a3db-2e5a-4c87-b79c-886cbec6ae19"
msgid ""
"\"What? He doesn't want it, and that's fine. We're all free people here, "
"aren't we?\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구? 그는 그걸 원하지 않았어. 그건 괜찮아. 우린 모두 자유인이야. 안그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "29c1944d-4eb3-464f-8718-f8dc04d28395"
msgid "\"Are you all right?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d633b274-bcec-4097-a8fe-341905aca4ca"
msgid "Pitied the sick servant."
msgstr "아픈 하인을 위로했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "4a92509e-2530-40ec-a782-6ae3569277b4"
msgid "\"You don't look well. Go get some rest.\""
msgstr "\"몸이 안 좋아 보이는데. 가서 좀 쉬게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c08d6b01-d521-46cd-b1f2-b3beaed6bf05"
msgid "Scolded the sick servant."
msgstr "아픈 하인을 꾸짖었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "67eb06cb-0d58-46fa-b3ea-1d5be4f482a4"
msgid ""
"\"Get out of here immediately! I can't afford to have you infecting our "
"guests!\""
msgstr "\"여기서 당장 나가도록! 네가 우리 손님을 감염시키도록 둘 순 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "edee0e65-4bca-45ae-89ce-a3283d0d3cd4"
msgid "[Leave] \"I wish you a swift recovery.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"네가 빨리 회복되기를 바라겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3a71605f-8e23-4136-a62f-dab1fe3b612f"
msgid "Mocked the sick servant."
msgstr "아픈 하인을 조롱했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "940e6fa6-c084-436e-9218-c73074562329"
msgid ""
"\"How about we play a prank on our guests? I want you to sneeze on those "
"pompous Aldori over there!\""
msgstr "\"우리 손님들에게 장난치는 건 어때? 저기에 잘난 체하는 알도리에게 재채기를 해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "dfc2469d-2e7f-4ce1-af0f-86754359621a"
msgid ""
"{n}The servant doesn't look well — his eyes are bloodshot and his cheeks are "
"flushed. As soon as he notices your attention, he straightens himself and "
"gives you a strained smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 하인은 안색이 좋지 않습니다. 눈은 충혈되고 뺨은 붉습니다. 그가 당신이 보고 있는 것을 알자 그는 자세를 펴고 당신에게 긴장한 "
"미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "5b6557cb-ffa0-49a0-906d-be39f4a3c200"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, it's nothing, Your Grace! Just a bit of a cold I caught on the way "
"here, that's all. It'll pass soon, don't worry!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 별 거 아닙니다! {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}! 여기로 오는 길에 감기에 좀 걸렸을뿐입니다. 곧 나을 겁니다! 걱정 "
"마십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b41bffc1-4315-4c7f-8f1b-0b223b06dbe4"
msgid "\"My thanks, Your Grace! You're too kind.\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}! 정말 친절하시군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "21806289-6ae5-4720-b523-3635dce9a87b"
msgid "\"Of course, Your Grace! I'm so sorry! I'll leave immediately!\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}! 죄송합니다! 즉시 떠나겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "5bef5c6b-f699-4344-9d45-a64c4c2ee6e1"
msgid ""
"{n}The servant forces a smile.{/n} \"As you wish, Your Grace. I'll do my "
"best!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하인은 억지로 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"원하시는대로 하겠습니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 최선을 다 해보겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "712014c4-18fb-4023-8cff-c9937a824719"
msgid "\"Are you sure? You look quite unwell.\""
msgstr "\"정말인가? 몸이 꽤 안 좋아 보이는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "f2fada72-8bd1-4b06-8811-60d97753871b"
msgid ""
"\"Worry not, sir. Just pray for me, and I'll weather it. We're hardy folk "
"here, you know!\""
msgstr "\"걱정하실 필요 없습니다. 그저 기도라도 해주신다면 전 곧 괜찮아 질겁니다. 아시다시피, 우리는 강인한 사람들이잖습니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "177bc504-2358-4609-b79f-6bea772958f8"
msgid "\"May {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} protect you.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}가 너를 지켜주길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "67990f4c-ce61-4e04-8f0b-142def25805b"
msgid ""
"\"Yes... Even here, at a celebration of life, there is someone to remind us "
"all of the inevitable...\""
msgstr "\"그래... 여기서도 피할 수 없는 종말을 떠올리게 하는 사람이 있구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/KamelandsSafariHuntingLodge/SickServant/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "dd1ef2f0-e1d9-4853-aaa0-1ea7cbd6b2f1"
msgid ""
"\"Heh heh, I'd love to see the looks on their faces! I hope the poor fellow "
"gets well soon, though.\""
msgstr "\"헤헤. 그들의 얼굴을 보고 싶은데! 그 불쌍한 녀석들이 괜찮아졌으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/Barks/CultistLeader_After_01_String
msgctxt "89e070f1-707a-4ede-b577-f89d36d4cd50"
msgid "\"The will of Lamashtu is done. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투의 뜻이 끝났어. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/Barks/CultistLeader_After_02_String
msgctxt "fad04929-a3e2-4393-8d5a-770c2baf7535"
msgid "\"Lamashtu is watching you. As do we. Remember that.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투가 너를 지켜보고 있다. 우리도 마찬가지야. 잊지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/Barks/CultistLeader_Fight_String
msgctxt "34668343-3787-4028-86a0-e8a774aa760a"
msgid "\"Death to the {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr "\"남작에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "44835067-478a-454d-874d-f0d197c2a050"
msgid "Remained indifferent to Lamashtu's will."
msgstr "라마슈투의 의지는 신경쓰지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "898d5b05-0036-4ade-9789-59092127d8a0"
msgid ""
"\"I care nothing about simple, weak-minded curse of 'Lamashtu'. Do as you "
"will.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투의 단순하고 약한 저주에는 관심이 없어. 너도 마찬가지야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fee73eda-c804-4d1b-b13d-6996453f3ae7"
msgid "Declares that Lamashtu has no power over you."
msgstr "라마슈투는 당신에게 힘이 미치지 못한다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "eaf817bd-7fb6-4891-b034-ce0c70b93b75"
msgid "\"Come on, try and curse me! Your goddess has no power over me!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 나에게 저주를 걸어봐! 너희 여신은 나에게 힘이 닿지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0e78514e-0a6e-40cc-86b8-7c70837297aa"
msgid "Attacked worshipers of Lamashtu in order to destroy evil cult."
msgstr "악의 의식을 파괴하기 위해 라마슈투 숭배자를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "374aec2a-e249-4ed4-be81-065160c30b3d"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I'll stop at nothing until I destroy your cult! Prepare to die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너의 의식을 파괴할 때까지 멈추지 않겠다! 죽을 준비를 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0c3f0827-8b60-4c9a-a992-98333497d96d"
msgid ""
"Attacked worshipers of Lamashtu for manifestation of arbitrariness in barony."
msgstr "자신의 영지임을 알리기 위해 라마슈투의 숭배자를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "f24258ae-3e9b-4471-b094-fb2bc4d23111"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I won't let some minor deity to dictate me what to do in my own "
"realm!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 사이비 여신이 내 영토에서 나에게 이래라 저래라 하게 두지 않겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "1fe4f909-850d-4e23-a682-70f580219810"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "a4f7c048-9002-47da-87f0-dd9626c99412"
msgid "\"Step back, before you make me angry!\""
msgstr "\"나를 화나게 하기 전에 물러서라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0fd71640-0347-4fb0-bef2-916d135cce75"
msgid "Received Lamashtu's punishment with resignation."
msgstr "자리를 내어주며 라마슈투의 처벌을 받습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "fd429cd2-9e51-450e-8d8a-94528008d202"
msgid ""
"\"I am sorry I angered the great goddess. I'm ready to take my punishment.\""
msgstr "\"위대한 여신을 화나게 해서 미안해. 처벌을 받겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cd1dd979-ed78-4960-af27-95c5fe11397d"
msgid "Willingly received gift from evil goddess."
msgstr "악의 여신의 선물을 기꺼이 받습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "2516c87b-0dca-4159-bdce-faf0b47930a0"
msgid "\"I'm ready to take the blessing of the great goddess!\""
msgstr "\"위대한 여신의 축복을 받을 준비가 되었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b118fcbb-65f2-4448-b069-9b3e014f7e45"
msgid "Rejected Lamashtu's gift."
msgstr "라마슈투의 선물을 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "0ce074c9-bbcc-4093-b56a-05059c286c3b"
msgid "\"I reject the gift of Lamashtu. I don't want this filth to touch me!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투의 선물을 거부한다. 이 더러움이 나를 만지길 원치 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2a162f7e-2b85-46a7-bc00-da9b052d6e67"
msgid "Attacked cultists of evil goddess."
msgstr "악한 여신의 신도를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "5ab570b6-225c-4302-aeb0-13a48e94f9dd"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You offended me by suggesting I would take a gift from the evil "
"goddess! Death to cultists!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"사악한 여신의 축복을 내가 기쁘게 받아들일 것 같은가! 저자에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "632eaee5-c287-4484-8891-a8d7992e4d19"
msgid "Attacked worshipers of Lamashtu as a sigh of gratitude for her gift."
msgstr "악신의 선물에 대한 감사의 표시로 라마슈투의 숭배자를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "7be85391-166b-46a5-ad13-3da5837ac0dd"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I'll give my gratitude to Lamashtu — along with your worthless "
"lives!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네 쓸모 없는 삶을 바쳐서 라마슈투에게 고마움을 전해야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f5305305-81cd-4349-a0a8-bc0ec93050df"
msgid "Killed strangers on the road without even learning their identities."
msgstr "그들의 정체를 알지도 않고 낯선 사람을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "abe29d2a-3906-410b-a690-f3f392df7f63"
msgid "[Attack] \"No, YOUR time has come!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"아니! 너의 시간은 끝났다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "147809b3-75c3-410e-96f1-94754018bcde"
msgid "Attacked worshipers of Lamashtu out of boredom."
msgstr "지루해서 라마슈투의 숭배자를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "f0739901-18ad-4d2d-9152-9e8069d1f2ff"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Your Lamashtu is dust beneath my feet! I've proved it once and "
"can prove it again, by letting her choke on your blood!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너의 라마슈투는 내 발 아래의 먼지다. 나는 이미 입증했고 그녀의 목구멍에 네 피를 부어 다시 보여줄 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0035_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "19dd41cb-eba4-4bbf-836c-af91ca61c906"
msgid "Remained indifferent to Lamashtu's will."
msgstr "라마슈투의 의지에 관심을 주지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "235581f5-4bb8-4593-a5c7-f2fb9b53692b"
msgid ""
"\"In fact, I don't care much about your strange traditions, but if you "
"insist...\""
msgstr "\"사실 너의 이상한 전통은 신경쓰지 않아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0052_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4ff89fce-620e-40df-b506-f85e2a103388"
msgid "Attacked cultists of evil goddess."
msgstr "악한 여신의 신도를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "862d07f5-0679-4132-a352-e2a65e56f2a3"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I will eradicate your vile cult, and all that stands against what "
"is righteous and holy!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너의 사악한 숭배를 끝내고 정의와 신성함만이 남을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "13d69070-6c5b-4c26-b5bd-ac01ce122b95"
msgid ""
"{n}Several figures, clad in dark clothes, stand before you. The darkness "
"hides their bodies, and the hoods drape their features in shadow.{/n} \""
"{mf|Baron|Baroness} {name}! Know fear, for your time has come!!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어두운 옷을 입은 몇몇이 당신 앞에 서 있습니다. 어둠이 그들의 몸을 가리고, 후드가 그들의 이목구비를 그림자로 드리웁니다.{/n} \""
"{mf|남작|여남작} {name}! 너의 끝이 왔으니 두려워 하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "695bfb0e-ab88-47ba-91c9-12d74d530a67"
msgid ""
"\"In your pride you've overstepped yourself and incurred the anger of "
"Patroness of all Dark and Distorted.\""
msgstr "\"교만한 너는 선을 넘었고 모든 어둡고 왜곡된 수호자의 분노를 불러일으켰다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "f58b03cc-3092-4856-bb90-148c24912172"
msgid ""
"\"Your deeds, which opened new hearts to {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, didn't go "
"unnoticed.\""
msgstr "\"너의 악한 행동이 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 주목을 끌었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "81348f86-ad7c-4879-b7a4-549d35bca746"
msgid "\"Are you ready to bend before the will of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}?\""
msgstr "\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 의지 앞에 굴복할 준비가 되었나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "f5aebfc7-fc3b-4602-92e1-258475391afb"
msgid "\"Are you ready to accept the gift of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}?\""
msgstr "\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 선물을 받을 준비가 되었나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "8f87bf28-8b65-4c1f-9145-9dd9e44b3742"
msgid ""
"\"Great Mother, Ancestress of Monsters, {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} Herself has "
"called upon us to track you down and deal with you the way you deserve.\""
msgstr "\"위대한 어머니, 괴물들의 조상인 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}께서 너를 쓰러뜨리고 네 죗값을 물으라고 하셨다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "ce1469bd-23aa-4e28-9258-2ee584d7d912"
msgid ""
"\"Let the will of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} be done, let her dark palm deform "
"you!\" {n}The cultist raises his hands and begins an incantation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 의지가 실현되고 그녀의 마수가 너에게 닿을 것이다!\" {n}신도는 손을 들어올려 주문을 "
"외우기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "a6ec5a7c-c428-4a82-be6d-0a58c032ef62"
msgid ""
"\"Bow before Great Mother and accept her protection!\" {n}The cultist raises "
"his hands and begins an incantation.{/n}"
msgstr "\"위대한 어머니 앞에서 머리 숙이고 그녀의 보호를 받아라!\" {n}신도는 손을 들어올려 주문을 외우기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "370edf94-d3da-4739-8ea3-328d06bc3b0b"
msgid ""
"\"Then die, you traitor! Great Mother, I dedicate this sacrifice to you!\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 죽어라! 위대한 어머니시여. 당신에게 제물을 바칩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "da62c20c-9d40-4692-ab27-e0e90f65ad23"
msgid ""
"\"You've brought violence to the faithful of the Great Mother, you struck "
"them down in the shadow of Her own idol. By attacking those who sought "
"protection in the shadow of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, you've offended the "
"Great Goddess and became Her sworn enemy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 위대한 어머니의 믿음을 져버렸고 그녀의 그림자 속에 그들을 쓰러뜨렸다. {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 그림자로 보호를 "
"받는 그들을 공격했으니 너는 위대한 여신을 화나게 했고 그녀의 적이 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "cfc777b2-56c4-4f00-ad1d-81b2a661cb8c"
msgid ""
"\"The priests of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} have their own paths, unknown to "
"simple mortals like you. By interfering the cycle of worshipping and by "
"making one of the Goddess' priests leave her sacred ways, you've forever "
"covered yourself with shame in the eye of Lamashtu.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 사제들은 너희와 같은 필멸자는 모르는 그들만의 길을 간다. 숭배의 순환을 방해하고, 여신의 "
"사제들 중 한명의 신성한 길을 방해했으니 너는 영원히 라마슈투의 시선 속에서 수치스럽게 살아야 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "846750ec-eeec-4e13-9330-41aed92efeec"
msgid ""
"\"For the persecution of those under the protection of our Goddess, for your "
"crimes committed against Great Mother, you are hereby marked in Her eyes. "
"The Goddess herself revealed the punishment to us through nightmares — it "
"falls upon us to curse the heretic who has wronged Her!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 여신의 보호 아래에 있는 이들을 박해하고 위대한 어머니를 적으로 만들었으니 너는 그녀의 분노를 샀다. 여신은 악몽을 통해 "
"우리에게 징벌을 보여주었다. 이제 우리가 이교도인 너를 저주하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "32cf9e95-8d3b-4d6c-b154-d2ee2cd5e8ed"
msgid ""
"\"Your mercy for children of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} and your protection of "
"those, who bow before Great Mother, must be rewarded. The Goddess herself "
"revealed her will to us through the nightmares — we must give glory to the "
"{mf|baron|baroness}, who honors the cult of Lamashtu, and grant {mf|him|her} "
"the blessing of the Goddess!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 아이들에게 자비를 베풀어준 너는 상을 받을 거야. 여신은 악몽을 통해 우리에게 그녀의 의지를 "
"보여주었다. 우리는 라마슈투의 의식을 영광스럽게 한 남작에게 영예를 주어야 하니 여신의 축복을 내려줄 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "96bae151-ffd2-4f99-8b67-ba860046fed4"
msgid ""
"\"You trembled and stepped back before the image of Great Mother, having "
"left Her children unharmed. The Goddess graces those who fear her wrath and "
"stays their hand from Her progeny.\""
msgstr ""
"\"위대한 어머니에게서 떨어지고 그녀의 자식들을 내버려두어라. 그녀의 분노를 두려워하고 그녀의 자손에게 손을 떼는 자들을 여신이 축복한다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu02
msgctxt "818f3860-c1a2-4ed3-8b4d-89423a9d9a1e"
msgid ""
"\"You've let me go in peace, allowed me to spread my faith in these lands. "
"For that I prayed to {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} and asked her to bless you, "
"for you are a true protector of her cult!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 풀어주고 내 믿음을 퍼뜨리게 해줘. 나는 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}에게 기도하니 그녀의 의식을 보호하는 너에게 축복을 "
"내려달라고 기도할게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "62e6ebad-5a1e-47c6-b1e0-f468e22a83ea"
msgid ""
"{n}As the somber chanting continues, the darkness gathers around you, thick "
"and wet — it sticks to your clothes, your hands, and clots your hair and "
"face. The fluid gathers on your head like a crown, then flows, almost "
"molasses-like, down your cheeks and your forehead... then seeps into the "
"corner of your eyes, eagerly, hungrily. As it touches your eyes, pain "
"courses through you and your vision becomes black, then a flickering of "
"greys and whites, like a thousand tiny insects were making knife-cuts across "
"your vision.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}음침한 노래가 계속되면서 무겁고 젖은 어둠이 당신 주위에 모여 들었습니다. 그것은 당신의 옷과 손에 달라붙었고 머리칼과 얼굴에 붙어 "
"굳습니다. 그 액체는 마치 왕관처럼 당신의 머리 위에 모이더니 흘러서 당신의 이마와 뺨에 흘러내립니다... 그리고는 당신의 눈 언저리에 "
"격렬하게 스며들었습니다. 그것이 당신의 눈에 닿았고 고통이 온 몸에 펴지고 시야가 어두워지더니 회색과 흰 빛이 수천마리의 작은 곤충처럼 "
"깜빡이며 당신의 시야를 밝히기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "c7b512a4-d2d1-4196-bc04-efc5f8966290"
msgid ""
"{n}Stepping back and rubbing your eyes frantically, you open them and "
"realize now you can see in darkness — almost as if it were day! The pain in "
"your eyes subsides, leaving only slight tingling behind your eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뒤로 물러나서 눈을 급히 문지르고 다시 뜨니 당신은 어둠 속에 있는 것을 깨달았습니다. 하루가 지난 듯 했습니다! 당신의 눈의 "
"고통은 가라앉았고 오직 안구 뒤에 약간의 가려움만이 남았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "5a706d00-8995-4b2d-b615-db0ae9477964"
msgid ""
"{n}A strange paralysis shackles your body — as if an invisible hand made of "
"ice is gripping at your ribcage, trying to pry it open like a pair of double "
"doors. You fight to breathe, and you feel your skin and muscles start to "
"shift, stretch, and twist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 몸에 이상한 마비가 일어나 당신을 속박합니다. 마치 보이지 않는 얼음 손이 당신의 몸통을 쥐어 문짝처럼 가슴을 열려는 것 "
"같습니다. 당신은 숨을 쉬려고 했지만 피부와 근육이 움직이고 펴졌다가 뒤틀리는 것을 느낍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "a6e626f1-ded2-4ad2-92e3-b481cde53d26"
msgid ""
"{n}Over several moments that seem an eternity to you, the torture ends. The "
"paralysis vanishes as abruptly as it started. You touch your face, "
"terrified, and understand you didn't change a bit. Except for your skin, "
"which seems unusually smooth under your fingers, as if it has become... "
"younger.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}영원과 같던 순간이 지나가고 고통이 끝이 났습니다. 마비는 나타남과 동시에 신속히 사라졌고 당신은 두려움에 질려 얼굴을 만지고는 "
"아무것도 바뀌지 않았다는 것을 깨닫습니다. 마치 젊어진 것처럼... 평소와 다르게 너무나 부드러운 당신의 피부를 제외하고 말입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "54c30900-a6cc-4538-bb16-4c373358751f"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} is called the Mother of Monsters and Mistress of "
"Insanity for a reason. Her blessing can be far more terrible than any curse!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}가 괴물들의 어머니이자 광기의 여왕이라고 불리는 이유가 있습니다. 그녀의 축복은 어떤 저주보다도 더 "
"끔찍할 수도 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0056_Text_String
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5c951a72-0d29-4b9b-bf5d-483c2b4cbc77"
msgid ""
"\"She is treacherous and spiteful, {name}. Think twice before dealing with "
"her followers...\""
msgstr "\"그 여신은 악하고, 원념이 강해, {name}. 그녀의 추종자를 대하기 전에 다시 생각하는 것이 좋을 게야....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2139480e-0fa1-4a62-91e5-0072a2684d3c"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} is called the Mother of Monsters and Mistress of "
"Insanity for a reason. She is fond of curses. Be careful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}가 괴물들의 어머니이자 광기의 여왕이라고 불리는 이유가 있습니다. 그녀의 축복은 어떤 저주보다도 더 "
"끔찍할 수도 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0061_Text_String
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "56c2929c-7058-4ea6-9a87-fc157dcc9eb1"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}? Disgusting. Do you know the kind of worship she "
"patronizes? Kill them. And wash your hands afterward.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}? 역겨워. 그녀에게 올리는 예배를 알아? 그들을 죽여. 그리고 손을 씻으라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LamashtusResponse/PriestsDialog/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "d7228adf-4197-4a9f-b336-4500710cfb7b"
msgid ""
"\"Not only did you set the priestess of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} free — you "
"gave her an esteemed position in your court! You rely on her advice and "
"wisdom! A truly magnificent achievement for a venerated servant of the Great "
"Mother!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 여사제를 풀어주었을 뿐만 아니라 고위직을 맡기고, 그녀의 조언과 지혜를 따랐노라! 위대한 "
"어머니의 종으로서 진실로 훌륭한 일을 해냈으니 칭송받아 마땅하도다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/GraverobberLeaderAttack_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "aa3c751f-dcf0-4f0d-a371-ecc2a9b9f55a"
msgid "\"Kill 'em!\""
msgstr "\"죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/GraverobbersRunningAway_Bark_String_1
msgctxt "0935175b-c7fd-4d53-821b-da7ef5ec1a5a"
msgid "\"Move it, lads, ain't worth it\"."
msgstr "\"가자. 상대할 가치도 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LoneWarrior_Death_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "f5fa1bb9-6f54-4fee-8412-be277fc6cef9"
msgid "\"At last... free...\""
msgstr "\"마침내... 자유다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LoneWarrior_StartBattle_WhatToBark_String_1
msgctxt "9f830a81-3e4c-4983-b41e-3d5efd33eda5"
msgid "\"ARRRGHHH… DEATH TO TYRANTS! DEATH TO JAILERS!\""
msgstr "\"아아... 폭군에게 죽음을! 간수에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_AncientAcidPillar_Bark_String
msgctxt "66e6e9b7-7d1f-4510-9ba0-6b6d8a8b52d4"
msgid ""
"Crumbling column is cracked and corroded — as if an acid was poured on it."
msgstr "부서진 기둥이 균열이 생기고 부식되었습니다. 마치 산을 쏟아부은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_AncientFirePillar_Bark_String
msgctxt "53ff3924-0795-4081-a1b2-baefbaf3ed78"
msgid "Mysterious column has traces of black soot across its surface."
msgstr "신비한 기둥의 표면에 검은 그을음의 흔적이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_Column1CheckFailBark_String
msgctxt "37c90734-410c-4f21-9d4e-73c1e8c3543b"
msgid "This depicts ancient warriors in sarcophagi."
msgstr "이 석관은 고대의 전사를 묘사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_Column1CheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "a2d6ae10-c625-40a8-923f-bbcd4f2d2cee"
msgid ""
"This bas-relief depicts last minutes of a mighty barbarian and his allies, "
"sealed in the sarcophagi. They die in agony, clutching their throats and "
"scratching inner walls of their eternal prisons."
msgstr ""
"이 얕게 새겨진 문양은 석관에 봉인된 강력한 야만인과 그의 동료의 마지막 순간을 묘사합니다. 그들은 목을 움켜잡고 영원한 감옥의 벽을 "
"긁으며 고통스럽게 죽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_Column2CheckFailBark_String
msgctxt "4c2d15f8-e2b6-47a0-952d-0c2112bbfafb"
msgid "Pillar is covered with bizarre images of one-eyed people at work."
msgstr "기둥은 외눈박이 사람의 이상한 그림으로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_Column2CheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "9592f749-713a-4473-9518-fbfd2aed4cca"
msgid "An ancient bas-relief depicts cyclops, building a stone tomb."
msgstr "고대의 돋을새김은 돌 무덤을 세운 사이클롭스를 묘사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_GraverobberLeader_WhatToBark1_String
msgctxt "3b14f317-f79e-45e5-8476-1807474456c9"
msgid "\"So? Didya removed the traps?\""
msgstr "\"그래서? 함정을 제거했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_GraverobberLeader_WhatToBark2_String
msgctxt "50d4753a-6600-4f61-b595-f2b1305e9081"
msgid "\"Don't even think about stealing something!\""
msgstr "\"도둑질은 꿈도 꾸지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_GraverobberLeader_WhatToBark3_String
msgctxt "c5701f9b-f437-43b4-aea0-f2846caf8df5"
msgid "\"How long ya going to strut around here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 얼마나 오래 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_LichWall1CheckFailBark_String
msgctxt "1bb446da-6704-4d14-95d5-ccc51f35777a"
msgid ""
"This bas-relief depicts a cyclop clad in ceremonial robes. He holds an "
"amulet with a hole, in which he puts some parchments."
msgstr "이 돋을새김은 의식용 로브를 입은 사이클롭스를 묘사합니다. 그는 구멍이 난 목걸이를 쥐고 있는데 거기에 양피지를 끼려고 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_LichWall1CheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "e0f644bd-27b7-434d-a333-cc3940eb45f7"
msgid ""
"This bas-relief depicts the creation of phylactery — the storage device for "
"the soul of future lich."
msgstr "이 돋을새김은 리치의 영혼을 담는 부적을 만드는 과정을 묘사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_LichWall2CheckFailBark_String
msgctxt "98ce8a48-c514-4bd6-abec-168d2f3e3515"
msgid ""
"This bas-relief depicts a mighty mage killing countless innocent victims."
msgstr "이 돋을새김은 무수한 무고한 희생자를 죽이는 강력한 마법사를 묘사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_LichWall2CheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "4b151620-2a5c-475e-9e86-c1744e82aaf5"
msgid ""
"This bas-relief depicts lich-cyclop, incinerating dozens of tiny human "
"figures."
msgstr "이 얕은 돋을 새김은 수십 개의 작은 인간 형상을 불태우는 리치 사이클롭스를 묘사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_PuzzlePanelCheckFailBark_String
msgctxt "ffebd45c-ca8a-4c1e-ad1c-74535b27da2d"
msgid ""
"Staring at you from the bas-relief is an ugly one-eyed creature, surrounded "
"by a strange whirlpool."
msgstr "이 돋을새김을 보고 당신은 못생긴 외눈박이 괴물이 이상한 소용돌이에 휩싸인 것을 알았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Barks/LonelyBarrow_PuzzlePanelCheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "23e4e7ef-ef9c-4097-b1c9-99410bc96718"
msgid ""
"The bas-relief depicts a cyclopean mage who weaves a spell, using several "
"natural elements."
msgstr "이 돋을새김은 몇가지 자연 원소를 사용하여 마법을 만드는 사이클롭스를 묘사합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "45f33a33-2e8e-409c-b146-34816fc9a405"
msgid "[Examine carvings on the sarcophagus]"
msgstr "[석관의 문양을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "e7627ccd-d43d-4fa9-8b88-f53230c73860"
msgid "[Walk around the sarcophagus]"
msgstr "[석관 주위를 걸어다닙니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "79ebc84d-3b9e-449c-8ccf-d24f11764507"
msgid "[Step back from the sarcophagus]"
msgstr "[석관에서 물러납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "592a1588-ce72-433f-ae76-fc90fd684596"
msgid "[Slide the sarcophagus lid aside]"
msgstr "[석관의 뚜껑을 밀어서 엽니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "a28bfce7-020f-45bc-9b1c-3414d3cf3280"
msgid "[Pry off the sarcophagus lid with a crowbar]"
msgstr "[지렛대로 석관의 뚜껑을 엽니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "317e5932-2b77-4ed7-93c4-9f391524f150"
msgid "[Examine sarcophagus lid]"
msgstr "[석관의 뚜껑을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a4eaf39d-40ad-46c0-94f0-b9cf7106fa94"
msgid ""
"{n}A massive sarcophagus lies before you. In the dim light you can see the "
"edges of gleaming carvings that wind their way along the sides and up and "
"across the lid of the sepulcher.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}거대한 석관이 당신 앞에 있습니다. 희미한 불빛이 석관 뚜껑의 문양들을 비춥니다 .{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "0d10a9b1-51ac-4717-ad89-467c9db8f697"
msgid ""
"{n}The lid is made of a single slab of marble. It's covered with ancient "
"runes and looks extremely heavy.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뚜껑은 대리석을 통으로 깎은 것입니다. 그것은 고대 룬으로 덮여 있으며 매우 무겁습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "6481acd5-a248-4083-95a0-fc2bddbabc8e"
msgid ""
"{n}You step closer to take a better look at the sarcophagus lid — and "
"suddenly see deep scratches on its smooth gleaming surface. Judging by the "
"lid, it was slid aside, then slid back into place. Also, you notice rows of "
"small round holes covering the lid. Were they made to let air flow into the "
"coffin?{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 석관 뚜껑을 보다 잘보려고 가까이 다가갔고 희미하게 빛나는 표면에 기스가 나 있는 것을 보았습니다. 뚜껑을 보건데 이것은 "
"밀어서 열고 닫는 방식입니다. 그리고 당신은 석관의 표면에 작은 구멍이 줄지어있는 것을 보았습니다. 그것들은 석관에 공기를 통하게 하려고 "
"만든 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "c2ee5066-297c-4216-aaec-e58197628b1a"
msgid ""
"{n}Putting all your strength into it, you slide the marble slab aside. The "
"slab hits the ground with a great booming noise, echoing in the dark hall. "
"{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}모든 힘을 쏟아부어 당신은 대리석 판을 밀었습니다. 그 판은 쿵소리를 내며 바닥에 떨어졌고 그 소리가 어두운 방에 울립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "ed06032e-916a-4079-ae30-2c30f87cbcc6"
msgid ""
"{n}After several failed attempts to move it — and spending a good deal of "
"time catching your breath — the marble slab finally slides aside. The slab "
"hits the ground with a great booming noise, echoing in the dark hall. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}몇 차례 움직이는 데 실패하고 오랫동안 숨을 고르고 난 후에 마침내 대리석 판이 밀려납니다. 그 판은 쿵소리를 내며 바닥에 떨어졌고 "
"그 소리가 어두운 방에 울립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "3725f56b-8a30-4ae2-9ab7-a7ef55a9f13d"
msgid ""
"{n}The carvings on the coffin depict an ancient cyclopean empire. They speak "
"of a rebellion, when human tribes rose against their cyclopean masters. "
"Judging by the images, the riot was brutally suppressed, the leader of the "
"rebels was caught, and the human armies slaughtered.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}석관의 조각은 고대의 사이클롭스 제국을 묘사합니다. 그것은 사이클롭스 주인들에 대항해서 인간 부족이 대항한 것에 대해 이야기합니다. "
"그림을 판단할 때 폭동은 잔인하게 억압되었고 반란군의 지도자는 붙잡혔고 인간 군대는 도살되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "136c5d3f-900e-454e-b1b3-456cd5e28974"
msgid ""
"{n}To your horror, the sides of the coffin are raked with scratches and "
"dried blood. Someone was buried here, and they were desperately trying to "
"get out. But despite the scratch marks, there is nothing inside — the "
"sarcophagus is empty.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}으스스하게도 석관의 옆면은 긁힌 자국과 피가 말라붙은 자국이 있습니다. 누군가 여기에 묻혔고 여기에서 벗어나려고 애쓴 것 같습니다. "
"긁힌 자국에도 불구하고 내부에는 아무것도 없습니다. 석관은 비어 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "aa944fcd-1ebb-41e6-a52b-4edab380f7d6"
msgid ""
"{n}In the darkness behind you, you hear a faint rustling sound. An "
"involuntary shiver runs down your spine.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신 뒤의 어둠에서 당신은 희미한 살랑거리는 소리를 듣습니다. 무의식적으로 등골이 오싹해집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "208065d9-60d7-42f5-b0d3-c87f0b4191ad"
msgid ""
"{n}All of a sudden, the grinding of stone erupts around you — the lids of "
"the sarcophagi along the walls begin to slide open!{/n}"
msgstr "{n}갑자기 스르륵하는 소리가 들립니다. 석관의 뚜껑이 열리기 시작했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "d6079f35-a7fc-4eed-86f7-37deef1f9abd"
msgid ""
"{n}You walk around the sarcophagus, studying where it meets the floor — as "
"you do, you notice fresh tracks in the dust. Someone has been here "
"recently.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 석관 주변을 걸으며 바닥과 닿아있는 부분을 조사합니다. 당신은 먼지 속에서 최근의 흔적을 발견합니다. 누군가 최근에 여기에 "
"왔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "0f3476f0-c0c5-4c31-92b4-8f11e323ea67"
msgid ""
"{n}The carvings on the coffin are an array of strange images — one-eyed "
"giants, human (?) armies, collapsing houses… you can't make sense of it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}관에 새겨진 것은 이상한 이미지의 배열입니다. 외눈 박이 거인, 인간(?) 군대, 무너지는 집들... 당신은 그것을 이해할 수 "
"없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptySarcophagus/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "899635ae-26a5-4c56-a294-c5ceeed19e87"
msgid ""
"{n}You walk around the sarcophagus and see nothing out of the ordinary.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 석관 주변을 걷지만 특별한 것은 보지 못했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/EmptyTrap/LonelyBarrow_EmptyTrap_WhatToBark
msgctxt "a273e589-674e-4c3a-8f87-7e521864ddca"
msgid "There used to be a trap here, but it is no longer a threat."
msgstr "한 때 여기에 함정이 있었지만 더 이상 위험하지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/FireColumn/LonelyBarrow_FireColumn_WhatToBark
msgctxt "1a73c23c-223e-4206-8368-dff1d8ba8010"
msgid "You can make out old traces of searing fire on this pole."
msgstr "당신은 이 기둥에 불길의 흔적이 있는 것을 발견했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4d1299a2-a6cd-48aa-b87c-68b6de2ead12"
msgid "\"Get out, before I bury you all here!\""
msgstr "\"이 무덤에 너희를 묻어버리기 전에 나가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "196696b4-c468-4d86-baaa-700cad6088d3"
msgid "\"Who are you and what are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구며 여기서 뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "c69ed7da-a372-4415-84b8-04cff90e327e"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"이곳은 어떤 곳이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "dcda2d69-a433-45c9-a303-faafaeebbf47"
msgid "\"Forget this. I'm leaving.\""
msgstr "\"잊어버려. 나는 떠날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b09450cf-934b-4353-b430-ce12a9e7fe53"
msgid "Suggested a deal to the leader of band of murderers."
msgstr "살인자 무리의 우두머리에게 제안을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "6a208fbd-646b-4d6d-af9e-0a1eba5ebe3c"
msgid ""
"\"We can help each other. Let me go ahead and deal with the traps, and you "
"cover my back. We'll split the loot, half for me, half for you. Deal?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 서로 도울 수 있어. 내가 가서 함정을 처리할 테니 나를 도와줘. 전리품을 반씩 나누자. 알겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "39874631-a73a-4afe-a90f-17bcc4a9f378"
msgid ""
"\"You know this a plague tomb, right? All these corpses died from disease. "
"My blessings preserve me, what about you?"
msgstr "\"여기가 전염병이 돌았던 무덤이라는 건 알지? 이 시체들은 모두 질병으로 죽었어. 나는 축복으로 보호를 받지만 너는?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "e669a5ee-88a0-4ae9-9a36-6d0001130943"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You've picked the wrong tone to speak with the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. Death to grave-robbers!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"{mf|남작|남작|왕|여왕}에게 영 말투가 좋지 않구나. 무덤 도굴꾼들에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Answer_0031_WhatToBark
msgctxt "e2700e45-57d0-4057-90aa-e842f1777b6b"
msgid "\"We bury you here!\""
msgstr "\"널 묻어 버리겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "c367c263-68b9-4514-b67b-071f90d014e6"
msgid ""
"{n}In the dim light, you come across a group of armed men with swords and "
"bows — two of them are squatting near the body of a halfling. Spotting you, "
"one of the men stands up and regards you with a crooked sneer.{/n} \"Well "
"now, men, look — a corpse that don't know it's dead yet.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}희미한 불빛 속에서 당신은 칼과 활로 무장한 군대를 만납니다. 그들 중 두 명은 하플링 시체 주위에 쭈그리고 앉아있습니다. 당신을 "
"발견하자 한 남자가 일어서서 비웃음을 지으며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"자, 다들 여길 봐봐. 자기가 죽을 운명인지도 모르는 녀석이 왔어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "d01e7d2c-7742-4261-8e67-031329a6f9f4"
msgid "\"Didn't hear me the first time? Get out of here — now!\""
msgstr "\"못들었어? 여기서 당장 나가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "c6b2a136-fc03-41cf-b764-7ad2754e936d"
msgid ""
"\"What, you come to loot the place?\" {n}The leader bares his teeth.{/n} "
"\"You're too late — we were here first, and we're keeping what we found! "
"We're scholars, see, this is our find!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐야? 약탈하러 온 거야?\" {n}지도자는 이빨을 드러냅니다.{/n} \"너무 늦었어. 우리가 이곳에 먼저 왔고, 여기서 찾은 것은 "
"우리가 보관하고 있다! 우리는 학자들이야. 자 여기, 우리가 찾은 것들을 보라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "90b143cb-3831-4b29-af1a-c9a507bf11b5"
msgid ""
"\"Can't you see for yourself? Ree-surch-ass, we are! Ree-surching this crypt "
"now, everything we find? Why, we give to the poor.\" {n}The leader chuckles, "
"and the other bandits join in.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"안보여? 우린 학자들이라니까! 이 지하 무덤을 연구중이라고. 우리가 발견한 건? 가난한 사람에게 줄 거야.\" {n}지도자는 "
"껄껄거리며 웃었고 다른 도적도 따라 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "413f68af-f922-4215-aba0-e51252bdc526"
msgid ""
"{n}Gang leader stares at you, baffled.{/n} \"Why should I? We just pry the "
"door open — then we'll see who's buried there and how much gold's with them."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도적 두목은 당황한듯 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"왜 내가 말해줘야하지? 이제 우린 그냥 문만 열면 되는데 말이지. 누가 이 곳에 "
"묻혔는지, 얼마나 많은 금을 가지고 있는지 곧 알 수 있을텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "2df39c07-b40f-48f7-96a7-4085feed70b0"
msgid ""
"\"Short of it is — the crypt's our find. We'll deal with the traps ourselves "
"and start ree-surching right away.\" {n}The man nods at you, then nods at "
"the exit.{/n} \"And you'd better leave, before you catch something.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다시 말하자면. 이 무덤은 우리가 발견했어. 우리가 함정을 직접 제거하고 이제 탐색을 다시 시작할 거야.\" {n}그 남자는 당신에게 "
"끄덕이며 출구를 향해 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"뭐 얻어갈 생각하지 말고 나가는게 좋을걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "d9957bb1-327b-41e2-b539-962514545bc3"
msgid ""
"{n}The leader stares at you for a few moments, chewing his lip, then "
"nods.{/n} \"Deal. Men, let {mf|him|her} through!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우두머리는 당신을 응시하며 입술을 잘근거리다 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"거래 성립이다. 이봐! 저자가 지나가게 해 줘라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "c9fb141e-e020-4e25-b589-9c7755323997"
msgid ""
"\"What, you think we'll just let you run on ahead, take what's ours? Kill "
"{mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"네가 그냥 우리 물건을 가지고 도망가게 둘 거라고 생각해? 저 녀석을 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0035_WhatToBark
msgctxt "f4eb4ff3-1eaf-4350-894f-288f970567d1"
msgid "\"We bury you here!\""
msgstr "\"너를 여기에 묻어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "d73997b9-7a20-4639-8e84-72b9bb75c421"
msgid ""
"{n}The leader's face looks blankly at you for a moment, then the men behind "
"him begin to shuffle, whispering amongst themselves.{/n} \"Plague?\" {n}The "
"man echoes, which makes the men behind him begin to mutter prayers under "
"their breath and glance around.{/n} \"Ah… no, no we didn't know that. Seems… "
"seems we might want to get out to some fresh air. Get out of this hole.\" {n}"
"He turns to the men behind him.{/n} \"Come on, out, everyone out!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우두머리의 얼굴은 잠시 멍해졌지만 뒤의 부하들은 웅성이기 시작합니다.{/n} \"역병?\" {n}한 남자가 울부짖기 시작하더니 다른 "
"자들도 기도를 속삭이며 주위를 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"아... 우리는 몰랐어. 아마 신선한 공기를 쐬어야 할 거 같아. 여기를 벗어나자."
"\" {n}그는 뒤에 있는 사람을 봅니다.{/n} \"어서 나와! 모두 나가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "da65be3b-3b8a-4ced-a5f4-fc12c9a8bf97"
msgid ""
"\"You take me for an idiot, {race}?! Let's see how clever you are after we "
"run you through!\""
msgstr "\"내가 바보로 보이나? {race}?! 우리가 너를 혼내준 후에 네가 얼마나 영리한지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0037_WhatToBark
msgctxt "2daa2ab6-c461-4886-a6b9-e9517af8eb38"
msgid "\"We bury you here!\""
msgstr "\"너를 여기에 묻어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "bf7dabf4-8f01-4db2-9b59-1e12a498caa6"
msgid ""
"\"Wha..? Is that so?\" {n}The leader steps toward you and locks eyes with "
"you. As he attempts to stare you down, his angry expression falters, and he "
"swallows.{/n} \"Hnh — you're serious — and as mad as they come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 그렇게 나오시겠다?\" {n}우두머리는 당신을 향해 한걸음 다가가 시선을 고정합니다. 그는 당신을 내려다보지만 이내 성난 표정이 "
"흔들리며 침을 삼킵니다.{/n} \"흠. 너 진심이로군.. 꽤나 화나신 모양인데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "a98a3d20-e159-4eb1-beab-4a375072cb45"
msgid "\"Oh, is that so? We'll see who buries who!\""
msgstr "\"오. 그래? 누가 묻히는지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0039_WhatToBark
msgctxt "b1c3a7fe-5693-433d-9bcb-02174eea46f0"
msgid "\"We bury you here!\""
msgstr "\"너를 여기에 묻어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "a40e2ff0-c93b-4272-af24-cd9fcbdb9f75"
msgid ""
"\"There are some markings on the pillars over there.\" {n}The bandit points "
"toward a massive column.{/n} \"Also that halfling idiot wouldn't shut up "
"about some old book… satisfied? Now get while you still can!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저기 기둥에 몇몇 표시가 있다.\" {n}도적은 거대한 기둥을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"멍청한 하플링 녀석도 무슨 오래된 책에 대해서 "
"떠들어대더군... 이제 됐지? 너도 할 수 있을 때 해 보던가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "07a61bf0-60c8-432c-8a45-90f227a347b0"
msgid ""
"\"We're here on a job, see. This one here hired us.\" {n}The leader nods at "
"the halfling corpse on the floor.{/n} \"Needed help to get into these ruins. "
"And we were like — why not.\" He clicks his tongue sadly. \"But a shame — "
"soon as the little one showed us the way in, he became ill. Must be the "
"excitement, I bet.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 일 때문에 여기온거야. 봐, 여기 이 자가 우리를 고용했지.\" {n}우두머리는 바닥의 하플링 시체를 보고 끄덕입니다.{/n} "
"\"이 폐허에 들어가기 위해 도움이 필요했나보더라구. 그래서 우리가 좀 도와줬지.\" {n}그는 슬픈듯이 혀를 찹니다.{/n} "
"\"안타깝게도 이 자가 우리에게 길을 안내한 순간 병에 걸려버리더라구. 너무 흥분해서 그랬을 거야. 아마\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "28f0a121-ab46-4c44-be4d-89cedffe9698"
msgid ""
"\"Such villainy! You murdered a man who trusted you! And now, to cap it off, "
"you dare to utter threats against the legitimate ruler of these lands!\""
msgstr "\"그런 악행을! 너를 믿은 사람을 죽이다니! 그리고 지금은 감히 이 땅의 합법적인 지도자를 위협을 하다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0047_WhatToBark
msgctxt "ee4021af-138a-40d2-92c9-34290ce1b8f8"
msgid "\"We bury you here!\""
msgstr "\"너를 여기에 묻어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "65906a86-e790-4f84-9dbc-91f0354948de"
msgid ""
"\"He came to the house of the dead as a merry guest, but settled here "
"forever... Such is the lot of mortals, yes... But what of their murderers? "
"Will they escape their victim's fate?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 죽은 자의 집에 기뻐하며 왔지만 영원히 이곳에 머물렀어... 이런 것이 필멸자의 운명이지... 하지만 살인자들은? 그들은 "
"희생자와 달리 도망칠 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "22ebd687-be5c-402d-a51c-4e1791a87216"
msgid ""
"\"Run, run! But don't lose your pants! Ha ha! You really gave them a good "
"one. Watching them turn tail is even more fun than if we'd killed them!\""
msgstr "\"도망쳐라! 도망쳐! 하지만 바지는 입고 도망쳐! 하하! 제대로 한방 먹였군. 도망치는 모습이 죽이는 것보다 재미있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "66ce1588-f48a-4665-ad49-f17d1564261e"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, fellows, that'll be your grave now... Shouldn't have gotten tough "
"with me and the baron{mf||ess}!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 이 자식들아. 여기가 네 무덤이 될 거다... 덤빌 상대를 보고 덤볐어야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "3c883f3c-9533-4052-a970-f959c63fb46a"
msgid ""
"{n}The leader tries to save face with an uneasy chuckle.{/n} \"Well now, "
"this hole certainly isn't worth fighting over. We'll find easier pickings.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}지도자는 불안한 웃음으로 표정을 숨기려고 합니다.{/n} \"자.이 무덤 때문에 싸울 이유가 없어. 우리는 더 쉬운 건수나 찾으러 "
"갈꺼라구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "b6747637-6404-4804-94b0-5646890ab9b5"
msgid "\"We'll see who dies today...\""
msgstr "\"오늘 누가 죽는지 보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "aac20db5-7bc1-4ed4-800f-b21b114fe23e"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at the bandit, then the corpse at his feet. She reaches for "
"her weapon.{/n} \"Dirty marauders. We cannot let them go.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 도적을 보고는 발 밑의 시체를 봅니다. 그녀는 무기에 손을 댑니다.{/n} \"더러운 도적놈들. 우리는 그들을 보내줘서는 "
"안됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b8701e5a-2035-4f93-9dca-c67ed2d1781e"
msgid ""
"\"Consorting with these animals! And about what? Robbing ancient tombs!\" {n}"
"Valerie seems almost ready to spit with disgust.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이 짐승들이 하는 짓을 보십시오! 고대의 무덤을 약탈하려는 짓을!\" {n}발레리는 역겨워서 침을 뱉으려는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "39a9ea8a-e271-4eae-9d3e-8baa1d3cca81"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you trying to deceive these scoundrels? The only thing they "
"deserve is immediate payback for their pillaging!\""
msgstr "\"왜 이 악당들을 속이려고 하는 거야? 그들이 받을 것은 약탈에 대한 보복이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "cfbc3ffc-3dc4-42be-8ad0-f1ccacca3b19"
msgid ""
"\"You decided to scare them and let them escape? Those scoundrels are "
"marauders and murderers! And we should just let them go?\""
msgstr "\"그들을 겁줘서 도망가게 두려는 겁니까? 이 악당들은 약탈자에 살인자입니다! 그런데 그들을 그냥 보내주려구요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9a231c45-60bf-41e8-8dfa-d3a319feb039"
msgid "\"Let us cleanse your lands of this filth!\""
msgstr "\"이 더러운 놈들로부터 너의 땅을 정화하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4cf4041b-1ca3-4b87-8839-3aa7133a8f1e"
msgid "\"Hey, {name}! What is scolar? Like Hero? Or bad thing?\""
msgstr "\"이봐! {name}! 영구자가 뭐야? 영웅 같은 거냐? 아니면 나쁜 놈이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : GraverobberLeader
msgctxt "2e4aab5c-6d16-496b-9ad3-ee5a03f60ac8"
msgid ""
"\"Would you look at that! Quite a pet, eh? Wouldn't mind getting this one "
"myself, heh heh...\""
msgstr "\"여길 봐! 애완동물 같지 않아? 이런 녀석이 있다면 좋겠다. 헤헤...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/GraverobberLeader/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fec6d461-83a0-44d2-b496-426ee99aa3c4"
msgid ""
"\"Huh. Sounds like goblin king, all proud and aloof. Scolar thing must be "
"bad word after all.\""
msgstr "\"하. 고블린 왕처럼 말하는구나. 영구자라는 말은 나쁜 말이 분명해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Interfaces/LonelyBarrow_CyclopsLoreObject_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "6ee6066b-34ed-4a9d-b229-07301dd5f81f"
msgid "Column"
msgstr "기둥"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Item/Deadman_lexicon_Name_String
msgctxt "08301f9a-d549-43bd-a5ef-55b5bdd2561b"
msgid "Torn-out part of the book"
msgstr "닳고 낡은 책"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/Item/Deadman_lexicon_String
msgctxt "4006e610-a232-4c50-8a53-93073bebf4ad"
msgid ""
"\"The Koloran Empire once encompassed all of Casmaron, and its influence "
"even spread to the neighboring lands of Avistan and Garund. This vast "
"territory was inhabited by a multitude of wild tribes, all of which lived in "
"the shadow of the great cyclopean civilization. Even at that time the human "
"tribes tried to forge alliances, settle new lands and build large "
"settlements. However, this growth was stunted by the aggressive Koloran "
"overlords and their ever increasing demand for new slaves. The clash of "
"these two cultures gave birth to legends and myths, one of which tells of a "
"great warrior who challenged the opressors. The unnamed hero united the "
"tribes and led an uprising. Many took up arms and followed him into battle. "
"Alas, the fight was uneven, and human armies suffered a crushing defeat. "
"Since humans did not disappear without trace from Casmaron, Avistan and "
"Garund, it is evident that cyclopes decided against wiping out the whole "
"race for its defiance. Nevertheless, the casualties were enormous, as "
"evidenced by archaeological finds related to this dark period in history. "
"According to legend, cyclopes even succeeded in capturing the leader of the "
"rebellion, and he met \"a fate worse then death\". What exactly happened to "
"him, what punishment he faced for his bold challenge, remains unknown. The "
"dream of the unnamed warrior — the destruction of the cyclopean civilization "
"— came true during the Earthfall. The cataclysm allowed the human "
"civilization to rise out of the dust. Soon, the younger races forged new "
"great empires, but the memory of proud cyclopean cities of Koloran survived "
"through the ages.\""
msgstr ""
"\"콜로란 제국은 한 때 카스마론의 모든 곳을 지비했고 그 영향력은 아비스탄과 가룬트의 주변 땅까지 미쳤었다. 이 광대한 영토에 야생 "
"부족이 살았었고 그 모두는 사이클롭스 문명 속에서 숨어 살았다. 심지어 인간 부족이 동맹을 맞어 새로운 땅에 거대한 정착지를 지으려고도 "
"했다. 하지만 이 성장은 공격적인 콜로란 대군주가 새로운 노예를 얻으려고 해서 실패했다. 두 뭉명의 충돌은 전설과 신화를 만들었고 그중 "
"하나는 압제자에게 도전하는 위대한 전사에 관한 이야기이다. 이름 없는 영웅이 이 부족을 통합하고 반란을 이끌었다. 많은 자가 무기를 들고 "
"그를 따라 전투에 나섰다. 하지만 싸움은 불공평했고 인간 군대는 아픈 패배를 맛봐야 했다. 카스마론, 아비스탄, 가룬드에서 인간이 흔적이 "
"사라지지 않았으니, 사이클롭스가 이 종족을 쓸어버리지 않기로 결정한 것은 분명하다. 그럼에도 불구하고 사상자는 엄청났고 고고학적 증거가 "
"뒷받침한 대로 이것은 역사의 암흑기와 연관이 있다. 전설에 따르면 싸이클롭스는 반란군의 우두머리를 잡는 데에 성공했고 그는 죽음보다 더 "
"나쁜 운명을 맞게 되었다. 대담한 도전으로 그가 받은 형벌은 무엇인지 정확히 알려지지 않았다. 사이클롭스 문명을 파괴하려던 이름 없는 "
"전사의 꿈은 어스폴 때 실현되었다. 대격변이 인간 문명이 흙에서 번성하게 도운 것이다. 곧 그 종족은 새로운 대제국을 건설했지만 콜로란의 "
"자랑스러운 사이클롭스 도시는 시대를 뛰어넘어 기억되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "d21322bf-73b4-429a-a450-e093896a3e9d"
msgid "\"Hey, unknown voice — could you answer some questions?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 내 질문에 답해주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e3b5b430-1c4e-4998-8704-cef6e3d4d8f2"
msgid "[Examine the barrier]"
msgstr "[벽을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "aa1ceb75-c6fb-4dbd-8e96-bf63af6e2cac"
msgid "\"Tell me, door, what's locked behind you?\""
msgstr "\"문아 말해줘. 네 뒤에 뭐가 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "cf27a21e-224c-492d-9658-17ba4127c098"
msgid "\"Tell me about the monsters.\""
msgstr "\"괴물에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0007_opendoor_Text_String
msgctxt "6e51230d-7189-43f9-b867-ee4f6bba397d"
msgid "[Plunge Farnirras' key into the barrier]"
msgstr "[파니라스의 열쇠를 장벽에 던집니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "50d6ca00-69ba-47de-b2b9-da7af06eb9ab"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "e9886496-b0d1-4253-a8e9-a4ca5f8b7bad"
msgid "\"Tell me about the key.\""
msgstr "\"열쇠에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "78c1caf4-a886-4b56-bded-b5be02a07f63"
msgid "\"Who created you?\""
msgstr "\"누가 너를 창조했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "3967e3e2-5ddb-4d9e-aef6-1c819457980f"
msgid ""
"\"Farnirras is imprisoned, Farnirras is the one who created you. Maybe you "
"can explain what all this means?\""
msgstr "\"너를 창조한 파니라스가 그 너머에 갇혀있다. 이것들이 무엇을 의미하는지 설명해주지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "fb435554-6826-4a1d-a74d-439437db93f1"
msgid "\"I have no more questions.\""
msgstr "\"나는 더 이상 질문이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "a86df8a4-ee56-4fa0-b219-e594036f4bc2"
msgid ""
"\"It seems you're trying to hide something from me. This is no simple key, "
"but a much more valuable artifact.\""
msgstr "\"내게서 뭔가를 숨기려고 하는 것 같아. 이것은 단순한 열쇠가 아니고 훨씬 가치있는 유물이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "b99b2905-f3d2-4961-b649-797159462d0e"
msgid "\"Your 'key' is a lich's phylactery. What do you say to that?\""
msgstr "\"너의 '열쇠'는 리치의 부적이야. 너는 뭐라고 말할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0001_nulldoor_Text_String
msgctxt "8bdb530b-e069-4a90-8c89-02a95c1e72fc"
msgid ""
"{n}A whisper on the edge of hearing repeats the same thing again and "
"again:{/n} \"The door will open to the strongest. Defeat the monsters. Get "
"the key from the dungeon. And enter!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어디선가 귓속말이 계속해서 반복됩니다.{/n} \"문은 괴물을 쓰러뜨린 가장 강한 자에게 열릴 것이다. 던전에서 열쇠를 가져와라! "
"그리고 열어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d4e9527b-f58e-4aff-a39d-8bf9cb301087"
msgid "\"The monsters and the key. The door will open to the strongest.\""
msgstr "\"괴물과 열쇠. 문은 가장 강한 자에게 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "64b238e7-1813-4e96-a513-c88370d89522"
msgid ""
"{n}You plunge the key into the barrier and watch as waves of barely visible "
"bluish light run up and down along it. It appears that a protective spell of "
"some sort was hiding its true nature, but now it disappeared. An ethereal "
"whisper comes from the door, and distinctly pronounces the word "
"'phylactery'. You barely have time consider its meaning when the key "
"dissolves in the waves of blue light.{/n} \"It's part of a plan. The "
"imprisoned one can be free, but only by sacrificing the essence of his power."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 장벽에 열쇠를 던지고 보이지 않는 일렁거리는 빛이 물결치는 것을 보았습니다. 그것은 어떤 보호 마법이 걸려 진짜 모습을 "
"숨기는 것 같았으나, 지금은 사라졌습니다. 미묘한 속삭임이 문에서부터 들려왔고, 희미하게 '부적'이라는 단어를 발음합니다. 열쇠가 파란 "
"빛의 물결을 일렁이며 녹는 동안, 당신에게 그 의미를 생각할 시간은 없었습니다.{/n} \"이것은 계획의 일부이다. 갇힌 자는 힘의 "
"근원을 희생해야만 자유가 될 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "a81abca2-6bda-48e1-afab-d502cd58a009"
msgid ""
"\"The key is in your hands. Ages ago it was hidden in the dungeon, where two "
"rivers flow into one lake. Ages later it was drawn into the light. Defeat "
"the monsters, then give me the key — and the door will open to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"열쇠는 너의 손에 있어. 수 세기 전 두 개의 강이 흘러들어 호수를 이루는 지하 감옥에 숨겨져 있었어. 수 세기 후에 그것은 빛을 "
"보았지. 괴물들을 물리치고 열쇠를 가져다 줘. 문은 너에게 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "4c245ad8-5f43-4687-af2d-5c0d0ae1b342"
msgid ""
"\"The monsters are your trial. I will mark their lairs. Seek them out and "
"defeat them. After all of them fall, the door will open to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"괴물들은 너의 시험이야. 내가 그들의 은신처를 지도에 표시해줄게. 그들을 찾아 물리쳐. 그들 전부가 쓰러지면, 문은 너에게 열릴 거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "c58ea025-3b73-4d3c-8fb5-cc75906ee023"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems that your attempt to plunge the key into the barrier is a waste "
"of time. The shimmering surface is impenetrable.{/n} \"The monsters are not "
"defeated. Defeat the monsters and return with the key.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}열쇠를 장벽에 던지려는 당신의 시도는 시간 낭비인 것 같습니다. 빛나는 표면은 꿰뚫을 수 없습니다.{/n} \"괴물은 아직 멀쩡해. "
"괴물을 물리치고 열쇠를 가져와.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "be66877f-4801-4d52-bae2-1a130bce6b99"
msgid ""
"\"It is kept in the dungeon beneath the well. The city grows above it, the "
"lake splashing its waves abreast. You came from the city. Bring the key from "
"the dungeon. Defeat the monsters. The door will open to the strongest.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 우물 아래 던전에 있어. 도시는 그 위에 지어졌고 던전위에 호수가 있지. 너는 도시에서 왔다지. 열쇠를 던전에서 가져와. "
"괴물을 쓰러뜨리면 문은 가장 강한 자에게 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "5cc8d1c8-9bf5-4ac4-a3b1-363bcb249cf5"
msgid "\"Farnirras.\""
msgstr "\"파니라스.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "12004871-fc12-4e5a-92ad-d7bc10918138"
msgid "\"Farnirras.\""
msgstr "\"파니라스.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "29c9fc50-392b-481d-b9c9-c1647020877e"
msgid ""
"{n}Silence falls for some time, and then the monotonous whispering "
"resumes:{/n} \"The door will open to the strongest. Defeat the monsters. The "
"door will open to the strongest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}침묵은 잠시 이어졌고 단조로운 귓속말이 다시 시작됩니다.{/n} \"문은 가장 강한 자에게 열릴 거야. 괴물을 물리쳐. 문은 가장 "
"강한자에게 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "4007c2b4-0ae7-4f9b-873d-8f9501a8ee70"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, the barrier utters a deep sigh.{/n} \"The monsters are "
"defeated. The trial is passed. The door will open to the strongest. The door "
"will open to you. Will open...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하자, 장벽은 깊은 한숨을 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"괴물들이 쓰러졌다. 시험이 끝났다. 문은 가장 강한 자에게 열릴 거야. "
"문은 너에게 열릴 거야. 열릴 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "4be5533f-b80d-4936-8cae-78f673b95ac8"
msgid ""
"{n}The barrier feels slightly warm and somehow alive to the touch. Odd "
"patterns and magical symbols glimpse on its shimmering surface. Among them "
"you notice numerous pictures of various animals, monsters, and unusual "
"creatures.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}장벽은 약간 따뜻하고 이상하게도 생기가 넘칩니다. 이상한 패턴과 마법의 상징이 반짝이는 표면에 보입니다. 그것들 사이에서 당신은 "
"다양하고 수많은 동물, 괴물, 특이한 동물의 그림을 발견합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "3fe7d2eb-532c-4b6d-a233-e1e64997a0c4"
msgid ""
"\"The key is delivered and destroyed. The monsters are defeated. The door "
"opens to the strongest. Enter now!\""
msgstr "\"열쇠는 전달되었고 파괴되었어. 괴물은 쓰러졌다. 문은 가장 강한 자에게 열릴 거야. 이제 들어가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0026_60beasts_Text
msgctxt "27d76992-9341-4b20-9f5c-406978279ab4"
msgid ""
"{n}The glow of the barrier is much more intense. Its surface is like a sun-"
"warmed stone.{/n} \"The blood of the monsters is on your hands. The door "
"will open to the strongest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}장벽의 빛은 훨씬 더 강렬합니다. 그 표면은 태양으로 데워진 돌과 같습니다.{/n} \"괴물의 피가 네 손에 묻었다. 문은 가장 "
"강한 자에게 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0027_30beasts_Text
msgctxt "8b4985d0-5bb0-412d-bbab-e59851aa5dfa"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems the barrier has changed since you were last here. Now it's "
"enveloped in a barely visible glow, and the whispers have grown louder.{/n} "
"\"The door will open to the strongest. Defeat the monsters.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 여기에 왔을 때부터 장벽이 바뀐 것 같습니다. 이제는 보이지 않는 빛에 둘러쌓였고 속삭임은 더 커졌습니다.{/n} \"문은 "
"가장 강한 자에게 열릴 거야. 괴물을 물리쳐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0028_90beasts_Text
msgctxt "eadd44a3-b8cf-4b80-863e-518d474e9f5a"
msgid ""
"{n}The barrier glows, and radiates a strong heat.{/n} \"You near your goal. "
"The door will open to the strongest!\""
msgstr "{n}장벽이 빛나고 강한 열을 발산합니다.{/n} \"거의 목표를 이루었어. 문은 가장 강한 자에게 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "d28405d1-ad9a-453b-a2cb-e2a28f8591f7"
msgid ""
"{n}The monotonous voice keeps repeating:{/n} \"Will open to the strongest… "
"Only to the strongest…\""
msgstr "{n}단조로운 목소리가 계속 반복됩니다.{/n} \"가장 강한 자에게 열릴 거야... 오직 가장 강한 자에게만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "db859924-7df0-48b5-979d-640b0e94a65e"
msgid ""
"{n}The whispering subsides for a moment, and then resumes with a different, "
"intense intonation:{/n} \"Yes. The key is more than just a key. It is a "
"gage. It is part of a plan. The imprisoned one can only become free by "
"sacrificing the essence of his power.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}속삭임은 잠시 가라앉고 다른 강렬한 억양으로 다시 시작됩니다.{/n} \"그래. 이 열쇠는 단순한 열쇠 이상의 것이야. 이건 측정 "
"장치야. 이건 계획의 일부야. 갇힌 자는 오직 힘의 본질을 희생해야만 자유로워질 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "eb65c971-61b1-4a01-ab36-532d6569ad7d"
msgid ""
"\"Your goal is near. The trial is coming to an end. Defeat your final "
"enemies and the door will open to you.\""
msgstr "\"목표가 가까워졌어. 시험이 끝날 거야. 마지막 적을 물리치면 문은 너에게 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "7bdf5243-3504-44bb-a4c4-5129e558781d"
msgid ""
"\"The monsters were the trial, and the trial has been passed. The door will "
"open to you.\""
msgstr "\"괴물은 시험이었고 시험이 통과되었어. 문은 네게 열릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "95900811-80b3-4d7f-8407-78d3f2986962"
msgid ""
"\"You have vanquished many, but more yet must be defeated. The trial is not "
"yet passed.\""
msgstr "\"너는 많은 적을 쓰러뜨렸지만 더 쓰러뜨려야 할 적이 있어. 시험은 아직 끝나지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "0e18c771-029a-495f-91ad-63081f2de8a0"
msgid ""
"\"You have already met them. But more of them must be defeated, many more. "
"The trial is not yet passed.\""
msgstr "\"너는 이미 그들을 만났어. 하지만 더 많은 녀석들을 쓰러뜨려야 해. 시험은 아직 끝나지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/DoorDialogue/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "0c02ae02-9965-47b7-9755-80f6662f9c7b"
msgid ""
"{n}The closer you get to the magic barrier, the louder a whisper, just on "
"the verge of hearing, becomes. It says over and over,{/n} \"The door will "
"open to the strongest. Defeat the monsters. Get the key from the dungeon. "
"The key is hidden between two rivers falling into the same lake, on its "
"shore. Find it and come. The door will open to the strongest...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마법 장벽에 가까워 질수록 속삭임이 더 커지는 것 같습니다. 그것은 계속해서 말합니다.{/n} \"문은 가장 강한 자에게 열릴 "
"것이다. 괴물들을 쓰러트려라. 던전에서 열쇠를 가져와라. 열쇠는 두 강이 모여 호수를 이루는 곳에 있다. 그것을 찾아와라. 문은 가장 "
"강한자에게 열릴 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/Items/FornirrasDiaryPages_name_String
msgctxt "c113b727-8849-4e65-a44e-5ca632d0a9de"
msgid "The missing pages from the diary of Farnirras the Pensive"
msgstr "수심에 잠긴 파니라스의 일기장에서 유실된 페이지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/Items/FornirrasDiaryPages_text_String
msgctxt "e55666c8-eaf0-43de-8ab7-b93cb752869d"
msgid ""
"\"2.\n"
"An unfortunate incident. Yesterday some thieves managed to break into the "
"tower! They tried to free some of my test subjects. I do hate it when "
"someone encroaches on my property. I hate it even more when useful resources "
"are wasted. — The guardian golem and my protective spells killed five of the "
"thieves before I had time to intervene. The sixth is still alive, and I hope "
"he'll make it. A half-orc-sorcerer is exactly what I need for my experiments "
"— perhaps the spells will work differently on him.\"\n"
"\"4.\n"
"I've turned all the dead thieves into zombies. Then I pitted them against "
"the will-o'-wisps and watched them fight through the window. It was a bit of "
"fun, at least.\"\n"
"\"6.\n"
"One of the test subjects was killed when I was trying to artificially slow "
"the process of turning undead, with the intention of documenting all the "
"stages precisely. Everything didn't go as planned. I think I shall repeat "
"the experiment again in a week — and maybe this time I'll use the elven girl "
"as a test subject. Her longer lifespan may, in theory, affect the duration "
"of certain processes.\"\n"
"\"8.\n"
"Today my test subjects have escaped. All of them! They acted so nimbly I "
"hadn't noticed a thing when I went down to the cellar to prepare the next "
"experiment. Well, the golem is malfunctioning — that's odd but within "
"reason. But how did they manage to circumvent my whole system of protective "
"spells?! I couldn't even identify which way they went after leaving the "
"tower. It's obvious that some arcanist helped them escape — someone as "
"capable as myself. Which is outstanding in itself! But even more surprising "
"is that I didn't find him in the company of escapees, once I finally caught "
"up with them. The fools ran into a wyvern's nest and nearly all of them "
"perished. The only one I managed to save was the elven girl. She almost "
"threw herself at me in relief, but then when she looked into my eyes, she "
"shrieked and fainted.\"\n"
"\"10.\n"
"After so much effort spent saving the elven girl, it was a pity I had to "
"kill her. But time is of the essence. — After all the strange things that "
"happened in the tower, I don't want to delay the ritual of phylactery "
"creation. The last thing I need is a failure at the final stage — with two "
"dozen years of hard work and my potential immortality at stake.\"\n"
"\"12.\n"
"I must find out what's going on. It's impossible that my unknown enemy is so "
"much stronger and craftier than I!\"\n"
"\"14.\n"
"The alchemy storage was not only burned to the ground. — Many ingredients "
"were stolen before the rest was destroyed. Many artifacts were also stolen… "
"I have a good idea of what purpose these will be put to. So, you steal from "
"me, and you prepare a trap for me as well! But who are you? I'll find out. "
"I'll most certainly find out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"2.\n"
"불행한 사건이 일어났다. 어제 어떤 도둑들이 탑으로 침입했다! 그들은 내 시험체 일부를 풀어주려고 했다. 누군가 내 구역에 침범하려고 "
"했다니 정말 싫다. 유용한 자원이 낭비되었을 때 그것이 더욱 싫었다. 보호자 골렘과 보호 마법이 내가 개입하기 전에 5명의 도둑을 "
"살해했다. 여섯번째는 아직 살아있고 그가 살아남기를 바란다. 하프오크 마법사는 내 실험에 꼭 필요하다. 아마도 그 마법이 그에게는 다르게 "
"작용할 것이다. \"\n"
"\"4.\n"
"나는 죽은 도둑을 모두 좀비로 만들었다. 그런 다음 그들을 위습에게 던져버려서 그들이 싸우는 모습을 창 너머로 지켜보았다. 그래도 재미는 "
"있었다.\"\n"
"\"6.\n"
"피험자 중 한명이 언데드로 변하는 과정을 상세하게 적으려고 일부러 늦추었더니 죽었다. 모든 것이 계획대로 진행되지 않는다. 나는 일주일 "
"후에 다시 실험을 해야겠다. 이번에는 엘프 소녀를 시험체로 삼을 것이다. 이론적으로 그녀의 긴수명이 특정 단계에서 지속 시간에 영향을 줄 "
"수 있다. \"\n"
"\"8.\n"
"오늘 내 시험체가 탈출했다. 모두다 도망갔다! 내가 다음 실험을 준비하기 위해 지하실로 내려갔을 때 그들은 너무 빨리 움직여서 그들의 "
"흔적도 발견하지 못했다. 골렘은 오작동하고 있다. 이상하지만 일어날 수 있는 일이다. 그런데 어떻게 그들이 내 모든 보호 마법 체계를 "
"우회할 수 있었을까?! 그들이 타워를 떠난 후 어느 방향으로 갔는지도 알지 못한다. 어떤 녀석이 도주를 도왔다는 것은 명백하다. 그는 "
"나의 기술을 파악했다. 그 사실 자체로 그는 뛰어난 녀석임에 틀림 없다! 그러나 더 놀라운 것은 내가 마침내 그들을 따라잡았을 때 도망자 "
"중에서 그를 찾지 못했다는 것이다. 그 바보들이 와이번의 둥지로 뛰어들었고 거의 모두 죽어버렸다. 내가 구할 수 있었던 것은 엘프 소녀 "
"뿐이었다. 그녀는 내 품에 뛰어들고 안도의 한숨을 쉬었지만 내 눈을 들여다 보고는 비명을 지르고 기절했다. \"\n"
"\"10.\n"
"엘프 소녀를 구하기 위해 많은 노력을 기울였는데 그녀를 죽여야만 하다니 안타깝다. 하지만 시간은 금이다. 이 모든 이상한 일이 타워에서 "
"일어난 후로 나는 리치의 목걸이를 만드는 의식을 연기하고 싶지 않다. 마지막으로 내가해야 할 일은 마지막 단계에서 실패하는 것이다. "
"20년이 넘는 노력 끝에 영생을 얻을 기회를 눈 앞에 두고 있다.\"\n"
"\"12.\n"
"무슨 일이 일어나는지 알아내야겠다. 나의 알려지지 않은 적이 나보다 훨씬 강력하고 교묘하다니 말도 안 된다!\"\n"
"\"14.\n"
"연금술 창고가 불타버린 것 뿐만이 아니다. 불타버리기 전에 많은 재료가 도난당했다. 많은 유물도 도난 당했다... 나는 목적을 달성할 "
"좋은 아이디어가 있다. 나의 물건을 훔치고 나에게 함정을 팠겠다! 하지만 너는 누구냐? 너를 찾을 것이다. 반드시 찾아낼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/Items/StrangerMeConfession_name_String
msgctxt "668025da-a190-4f16-8200-13cba2dcf64f"
msgid "The Last Page of the Diary of Farnirras the Pensive"
msgstr "수심에 잠긴 파니라스의 일기장 마지막 페이지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/Items/StrangerMeConfession_text_String
msgctxt "7c5f7449-9603-466a-9640-27865dd44b08"
msgid ""
"\"16.\n"
"Hello, Farnirras. I'm glad to be able to talk to you at last, though only "
"via the written word. Have you already figured out who I am? I suspect you "
"have, or else you wouldn't have put so much effort into hiding the "
"phylactery.\n"
"That poor half-orc youngster cursed you, predicting you'd once meet ‘your "
"worst enemy'. And that's how I was born — from the pieces of your soul that "
"you haven't yet contaminated with evil. At first I was weak, and had barely "
"enough power to steal a moment of life from the body we shared. While you "
"slept, I rose and wandered the tower, trying to realize who I was and what "
"should I do. Your protective spells didn't harm me — nor could they, for I "
"was still you. The longer I thought about it, the more clearly I realized "
"how disgusted I was by your life and your deeds. I dreaded to contemplate "
"what you would do after you finally completed the ritual and turned undead. "
"Would you follow the example of the cyclopean tyrants, whose ruined palaces "
"serve as the foundation of Iobaria? Even the thought of it sickened me.\n"
"I started by trying to help your prisoners — a not entirely successful "
"attempt, alas. But after they died, I realized that I had to do much more "
"than that. I had to kill you… to kill both of us.\n"
"I share your curiosity, your magical powers, and your ability to invent "
"unusual solutions. But even this wasn't enough for me to rid the world of us "
"both. You've been fussing over your life too much, and your carefully "
"tangled cocoon of protective spells would save us from every sort of "
"potential danger. It would take days for me to try to untangle this web we'd "
"created with our common hands. Besides, this might have made you suspicious "
"and put you on alert — so I just had to remain undetected put my own plan in "
"motion. In the short time I was awake, I worked over every piece of this "
"magical prison, with our common phylactery being the key to it. I've "
"enchanted the door so it will destroy the key after being opened, and would "
"open only to the strongest monster-slayer. I developed a system of tests, to "
"make ensure the one who would someday open this door would be capable "
"enough. After all, he or she would have to face you in the end.\n"
"Well, my plan has worked. I've managed to lock us in here, inside this "
"ancient cyclopean barrow. Our dear Iobaria was built upon the ruins of "
"Koloran, and under these ruins, you and I will spend the upcoming years and "
"ages. Some day, everything will work out as I have planned. Someone able to "
"cut you down will enter this vault. I came to this world for one purpose "
"only — to prepare my own death. And I cannot wait for this moment to finally "
"come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"16.\n"
"안녕. 파니라스. 마침내 편지를 통해 이야기 할 수있게 되어 기쁘게 생각해. 내가 누군지 이미 알겠지? 목걸이를 숨기는 데 공을 그리 "
"많이 들이지 않은 듯하던데.\n"
"그 불쌍한 하프오크 애송이가 너를 저주했고 최악의 적을 만날 것이라고 예언했었지. 그래서 내가 태어났어. 아직 네가 악으로 물들이지 않은 "
"영혼들로부터. 처음에 나는 약해서 우리가 공유했던 시체에서 겨우 생명을 뺏을 수 있었어. 네가 자는 동안 나는 일어나서 타워를 헤매다 "
"내가 누구인지 무엇을 해야 하는지 알아내려고 했지. 너의 보호 주문은 나를 해치지 않았고 나는 여전히 너였기 때문에 나를 해칠 수가 "
"없었지. 생각할수록 네 삶과 행동이 얼마나 역겨운지 깨달았어. 네가 의식을 마치고 언데드가 된 후에 무슨 짓을 할 건지 생각하기도 "
"두려웠어. 이오바리아의 궁전을 파괴했던 사이클롭스처럼 될 거야? 그런 생각을 하는 것조차 나를 괴롭혔다.\n"
"나는 너의 죄수들을 도우기 시작했어. 하지만 그리 성공적이지는 않았고. 그러나 그들이 죽은 후에 나는 그 이상의 것을 해야 한다는 생각을 "
"했어. 너를 죽여야만 했지. 우리 둘 모두를 죽여야 했어.\n"
"나는 너의 호기심, 마법의 힘, 특이한 해결책을 떠올리는 능력을 공유해. 그러나 이것만으로도 우리 둘을 세상에서 없애기에 충분하지 "
"않았어. 너는 너무 요란하게 살고 있었고 조심스럽게 잠재적인 위험에서부터 우리를 구할 보호 마법을 만들어냈어. 우리의 손이 만들어낸 이 "
"마법을 풀어내려면 며칠이 걸릴 거야. 게다가 이 마법으로 너는 의심을 품게 되었고 조심스럽게 만들었지. 그래서 나는 내 계획대로 움직이지 "
"않고 조용히 있어야 했다. 내가 깨어있는 이 짧은 시간 동안 나는 이 마법의 감옥을 끝내려고 노력했고 우리의 목걸이가 열쇠가 될 수 "
"있었어. 내가 만들어낸 문이 열리면 열쇠는 파괴되고 괴물을 죽인 가장 강한 자에게만 열리게 될 거야. 나는 몇번의 시도를 통해 언젠가 이 "
"문을 열게 될 사람이 확실하게 문을 열 수 있게 체계를 만들어내었어. 결국 이 문을 여는 자는 너와 마주하게 될 거야.\n"
"내 계획이 효과가 있었어. 나는 고대 사이클롭스의 굴에 우리를 가둘 수 있었어. 우리의 이오바리아는 콜로란 제국의 폐허 위에 세워졌고 "
"너와 나는 무수한 세월을 이 지하에서 보내게 될 거야. 언젠가 내가 계획한 대로 일이 이루어질 거야. 누군가 너를 베어버리고 이 곳에 "
"들어갈 거야. 나는 나의 죽음을 위해서 이 세상에 왔어. 그리고 나는 이 순간이 오기를 기다리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "a386be43-9c9f-4a62-8b82-c6f2266c6d31"
msgid "\"Are you Farnirras?\""
msgstr "\"네가 파니라스야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a5e16cf7-1459-4952-983d-1485b6b09431"
msgid "\"Who imprisoned you here?\""
msgstr "\"누가 너를 여기에 감금했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f740c40e-7f8c-453a-b356-26ec812b11b0"
msgid "\"In your letter, you begged for help.\""
msgstr "\"네가 쓴 편지에서 도움을 청했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "d083e527-eb5a-46c3-a32b-7937e963e81b"
msgid "\"So, you're a lich.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너는 리치군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "43ed2ea0-5d09-4330-96ca-c6e176b0ff29"
msgid "[Attack] \"It's time for you to go to your final rest.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"마지막 휴식을 취할 때다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fdf01513-ba24-477d-8c37-024f8e62b950"
msgid ""
"{n}The figure, clad in tattered scraps of clothes, slowly turns towards you "
"and takes a few shuffling steps in your direction. From under the ragged "
"pieces of cloth, once undoubtedly bright and rich, the face of a dead man, "
"barely covered with flesh, stares back at you. His eye-sockets glow with a "
"terrifying pale light.{/n} \"I can't believe it! So, finally, someone fell "
"for the letter? I admit, it was a weak plan, but I had so little time to "
"invent it...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}너덜너덜한 누더기를 입은 형체가 천천히 당신쪽으로 발을 끌며 몇 걸음 걸어옵니다. 거친 헝겊 조각 아래에서 한 때 밝고 귀품있던 "
"남자의 얼굴이 지금은 죽어서 살이 너덜너덜한 채로 당신을 바라보고 있습니다. 그의 눈 구멍은 무시무시하고 창백한 빛으로 빛납니다.{/n} "
"\"믿을 수 없어! 마침내 어떤 사람이 편지를 받았다고? 허접한 계획이었지만 나에게는 시간이 없었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "b06b30b3-a882-4ba4-8e8b-9d22e8a9ec5f"
msgid ""
"\"It seems I hear notes of uncertainty in your voice, brave adventurer — am "
"I wrong? Yes, I am Farnirras the Pensive. Our acquaintance won't last long, "
"but nevertheless I am happy to meet you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 목소리가 확신이 서지 않는 것 같군. 내가 틀렸어? 그래, 나는 수심에 잠긴 파니라스이다. 우리의 만남은 오래가지 않을 테지만 "
"그래도 너를 만나 기쁘구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "c2c48b5a-3b58-4a7f-94d4-4ae52024266b"
msgid "\"Such remarkable powers of observation!\""
msgstr "\"놀라운 관찰력이구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "7756e244-08c6-400e-8ec5-c1bb7ee082c0"
msgid ""
"\"One extremely annoying creature — one I'll have to get rid of… right after "
"I deal with you.\""
msgstr "\"매우 귀찮은 괴물이 있어. 너와 상태한 후에... 없애버려야 할 녀석이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2c1b63be-b3c2-4905-80c4-da0855385c17"
msgid ""
"\"Such remarkable chattiness. Though wait, you've spent — how many years "
"locked alone in a dark dungeon? I suppose that explains all the awkward "
"attempts at wit and sarcasm.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 말이 많구나. 이 어두운 던전에서 얼마나 많은 시간을 보낸 거지? 재치있게 말하려는 네 어색한 말투가 그걸 증명한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "8084099b-2ffc-46f5-b70a-54945cbd09c8"
msgid ""
"\"Of course I did. People tend to become less vigilant when someone is "
"humbly begging their aid. They mistake the begging for weakness. Just think "
"about it — how many would have come to the aid if I started my letter: \"Dear"
" sirs! The allmighty lich, locked in a magic prison, desperately wants to "
"break free\"?"
msgstr ""
"\"물론 그랬지. 도움을 구걸하는 사람은 경계심을 덜 느끼는 경향이 있어. 그들은 약자에게 구걸하는 실수를 했어. 생각해봐. 강력한 "
"리치가 마법의 감옥에 갇혀있어서 누군가 구하러 오기를 기다린다고 편지를 쓴다면 누가 가겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "da083940-d0e3-442a-be1c-14c9d9824425"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, we'll definitely return to our fascinating conversation… after I kill "
"you and raise you as an undead servant. You'll become my favorite zombie-"
"slave.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 우리 대화를 마저 하자... 너를 죽인 후에 너를 언데드 하수인으로 만든 후에 말이야. 너는 내가 아끼는 좀비 노예가 될 거야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/LonelyBarrow/LichKulichLair/LichKulichDialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "47cb1f59-2b7d-49a9-b4c9-086d36b60f0e"
msgid ""
"\"Trick with the letter! He steal your think-thoughts, {name}? Or worse "
"something?\" {n}Nok-Nok backs away slowly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"편지에 속임수가 있었다! 그가 네 생각을 훔쳤어? {name}? 아니면 더 나쁜 거야?\" {n}녹-녹은 천천히 뒤로 "
"물러납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/CommandBark_DrumaEnd_String
msgctxt "18755e5a-4c6c-4257-8141-8edd2e6c21ac"
msgid ""
"\"Lived a long life, but this mess is something new. Thank you for sorting "
"everything out, {mf|baron|baroness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래 살았지만, 이런 난장판은 뭔가 또 새롭게 느껴지는구만. 모든걸 잘 정리해줘서 고맙수. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/CommandBark_PriestessStart_String
msgctxt "e5203f41-567c-4773-a838-445f40574cc2"
msgid "\"This prattle bores me! Death to the intruders!\""
msgstr "\"떠들어대는 걸 듣는것도 지치는군! 침입자들에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_BackdoorFail_String
msgctxt "65d9243d-b92b-41cc-9423-0a89dd127533"
msgid "The backdoor is blocked with some flour sacks."
msgstr "뒷문은 밀가루 자루로 막혀 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Backdoor_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "9d4a2421-8ca3-4ac0-8509-b36c511cbe9e"
msgid "Backdoor"
msgstr "뒷문"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Backdoor_String
msgctxt "8c7fbebb-d856-469e-beb8-a8f30da856b1"
msgid "The backdoor was used recently."
msgstr "뒷문은 최근에 사용되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_FireplacePlate_String
msgctxt "fb499719-e286-400d-8efb-8521f319febf"
msgid "The plaque above the fireplace is covered by soot and dust."
msgstr "벽난로 위의 액자는 그을음과 먼지로 덮여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Fireplace_String
msgctxt "e7c835df-4b76-41f9-9c0d-049c01c9daba"
msgid "The fire crackles bringing comfort to weary travelers."
msgstr "벽난로의 불이 지친 여행자에게 편안함을 줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Furniture_String
msgctxt "7ca911fb-12f7-40fc-b76c-42c65a0f050d"
msgid ""
"The shelf contains a number of bottles with faded labels. It seems, they've "
"seem better days."
msgstr "선반에는 라벨이 바랜 병이 여러개 놓여 있습니다. 사용한 지 오래된 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_HolySymbol_DisplayNameAfterUse_String
msgctxt "5e93fbf5-7be4-405b-aee6-34e41ab75af9"
msgid "Holy Symbol of Erastil"
msgstr "에라스틸의 신성한 상징"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_HolySymbol_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "a94840de-6945-4885-b4df-120ae75d204b"
msgid "Plaque"
msgstr "액자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_HolySymbol_String
msgctxt "575ab094-2281-4462-8978-2a8daf3f779c"
msgid ""
"There is Erastil's holy symbol above the fireplace. The god of the hunt and "
"family ties protects this place."
msgstr "벽난로 위에 에라스틸의 거룩한 상징이 있습니다. 사냥과 가족의 신이 이곳을 보호합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_KitchenTable_String
msgctxt "d6dc72ba-9ec3-4ac3-8ada-e1b6ca98998c"
msgid "The table is piled with dirty dishes and cold leftover food."
msgstr "테이블은 더러운 접시와 차갑게 식은 음식으로 쌓여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_PriestessEnd_String
msgctxt "b4fac102-8b8a-4375-9858-cac089d2b957"
msgid "\"Enough! I yeild!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 그만해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Resident_01_String
msgctxt "84fa2321-0212-4fc0-8e5e-679c8b16a3cf"
msgid "\"You want something?\""
msgstr "\"뭐 필요한 게 있어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Resident_02_String
msgctxt "6e863d31-5e5a-4da3-b273-8f71c34bb181"
msgid ""
"\"Either drink this foul excuse for a beer or stay outside in the moors. Not "
"much of a choice, eh?\""
msgstr "\"맥주를 마시던가 계곡 밖에서 머물러야 해. 선택의 여지가 없지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Resident_03_String
msgctxt "f7ff9f1f-14b2-4523-b818-9b61d79559db"
msgid "\"I try not to think what is in this stew I ordered\"."
msgstr "\"주문한 스튜에 뭐가 들었는지 생각하기 싫어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Resident_04_String
msgctxt "460923f1-d696-41ca-91b8-793816aec2af"
msgid ""
"\"So lucky to stumble on this place! Not a single house around — and here "
"you get food as well as a shelter!\""
msgstr "\"이런곳을 찾게되서 정말 다행이야! 주위에 집 하나도 보이지 않더니 여기엔 음식도 있고 안전하게 쉴 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Resident_05_String
msgctxt "52392e52-0e0f-42d8-baab-1e5918600aed"
msgid "\"Hostess is quite moody today. Folks say she is always that way\"."
msgstr "\"여주인이 오늘 기분이 안 좋아보이던데. 사람들 말로는 그녀는 항상 그렇다는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_DumraBed_String
msgctxt "1752f286-c59a-4968-9fcb-4db5d44f538b"
msgid ""
"The sheets on this bed look dirty. The old bedcover is sewed together from "
"the number of patches."
msgstr "이 침대의 시트가 더러워 보입니다. 오래된 침대 커버는 꿰맨 자국이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_DumraChest_String
msgctxt "e57b51a9-2abc-4660-b082-ac2c4a3f51fb"
msgid ""
"A pile of dirty clothes covers some snares. There are a few hunting bows and "
"quivers with arrows."
msgstr "더러운 옷 더미가 올가미를 덮고 있습니다. 사냥용 활과 화살이 담긴 화살통이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_DumraTable_String
msgctxt "0fdd446b-3991-4135-96d3-ffc8d073d3a3"
msgid "Receipts, shopping lists and other papers pile over Dumra's table."
msgstr "덤라의 테이블에 영수증, 쇼핑 목록 및 다른 종이들이 쌓여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_MartaBedFail_String
msgctxt "6f21fc6c-c80d-4ad6-bd17-bbc54f4cc185"
msgid "The bed's cover is flawless, the sheets are clean."
msgstr "침대 커버는 흠이 없고 시트는 깨끗합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_MartaBed_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "2d72354a-1f95-487a-8f63-550d84aebe8f"
msgid "Olika's Bed"
msgstr "올리카의 침대"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_MartaBed_String
msgctxt "e5f82c38-fb97-4a8a-8487-69c9ed9701ca"
msgid "The matress covers bloodstained cloth and bandages."
msgstr "침대는 피 묻은 천과 붕대로 덮여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_MartaChest_String
msgctxt "414c06ea-88c1-48e2-a3b0-448b47db19d9"
msgid ""
"The chest contains modest clothing, some packed leftover food, a purse with "
"herbs and other personal belongings."
msgstr "궤짝은 평범한 옷, 포장한 남은 음식, 허브와 개인 소지품을 담은 주머니가 담겨있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_MartaTable_String
msgctxt "25329892-18b2-47d5-956a-8097427a5a39"
msgid ""
"The table holds a pile of letters crossed with a ribbon. These are the "
"letters from Olika's deceased husband. It seems they corresponded often."
msgstr ""
"테이블에는 리본으로 봉인한 편지 더미가 있습니다. 올리카의 죽은 남편이 보낸 편지들입니다. 그들은 자주 편지를 주고 받았던 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_NobleBags_String
msgctxt "5923e060-1b4c-4fba-9a16-8a112650c196"
msgid "The bags contain Tedrim's clothes and personal belongings."
msgstr "가방에는 테드림의 옷과 개인 소지품이 들어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_NobleChest2_String
msgctxt "db2872dc-f236-4558-b595-39ced67836da"
msgid ""
"There are no hunting bows, arrows, snares, nor any other sign of the Tedrims "
"having any hunting on their mind."
msgstr "그곳에는 사냥용 활이나 화살, 올가미도 없었고 테드림은 사냥하려는 생각이 없었나 봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_NobleChest_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "82bd0518-af23-487f-92f9-6ddb4f466f6c"
msgid "Tedrim's chest"
msgstr "테트림의 궤짝"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_NoblesBed_String
msgctxt "a4210516-228c-49a3-b60e-41f204ae17db"
msgid ""
"The sheets are crumpled, the blanket is thrown aside. It seems someone was "
"sleeping in this bed not long ago."
msgstr "시트가 구겨졌고 담요는 옆으로 팽개쳐졌습니다. 얼마 전까지 누군가 이 침대에서 자고 있었던 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_SecondFloor_NoblesChestFail_String
msgctxt "331cd418-1a7d-48a6-8430-15066632259a"
msgid "The chest is full with Tedrim's clothes and other personal belongings."
msgstr "궤짝에는 테드림의 옷과 개인 소지품이 가득 들어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Stove_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "cc36cf70-9078-4ecc-9ed6-d649a0fa1284"
msgid "Kitchen Stove"
msgstr "부엌 화로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Stove_Fail_String
msgctxt "a0aa94bf-65b2-4eb0-8222-b5794e1f81ff"
msgid "The stove emanates comforting heat."
msgstr "화로는 안락한 열기를 뿜어냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Barks/SecludedLodge_Stove_String
msgctxt "173a3b32-15a8-4fc2-b840-b4b83989e7bc"
msgid ""
"Something is burning inside the stove. It was thrown in the fire not long "
"ago."
msgstr "화로 안에 무언가 타고 있습니다. 얼마 전에 누가 넣은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 10_SharedText_String
msgctxt "80b9e247-c889-4ce6-a5a2-498abfa03ffc"
msgid "\"We know nothing.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 아무것도 몰라요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 11_SharedText_String
msgctxt "aa8442b8-56fc-4dd0-b70a-df21b3a6daa2"
msgid "\"Yes.\""
msgstr "\"그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 12_SharedText_String
msgctxt "037cfb5c-1368-447a-b964-f62946384e98"
msgid "\"How would we know anything about Lamashtu?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 라마슈투가 뭔지 어떻게 알겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 13_SharedText_String
msgctxt "7fcbb6fe-3f44-4b38-99aa-5dceaeb6c28e"
msgid "\"Dumra, what do you say? Which of your guests came in last today?\""
msgstr "\"덤라. 할말이 있는가? 오늘 어떤 손님이 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 14_SharedText_String
msgctxt "1c7ccdb7-1779-46a5-859f-21e7768d726e"
msgid "\"Why are you asking this old woman? She may be the cultist!\""
msgstr "\"왜 저 늙은 여자에게 물어 보는 거죠? 저 여자가 사교도 일지도 모르잖아요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 15_SharedText_String
msgctxt "96ff4f9d-fb1b-4bcd-b743-9a6aa68686c5"
msgid "\"Yes!\""
msgstr "\"맞아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 16_SharedText_String
msgctxt "e5f44542-2dd0-4bf2-9efb-9460a33b5c5a"
msgid "\"Right!\""
msgstr "\"맞아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 17_SharedText_String
msgctxt "025f3bae-4d59-4317-8664-7bce5f5a339f"
msgid ""
"\"Shut up! Don't drag me into this! I've lived here for so many years and "
"haven't heard a word about Lamashtu until today!\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐! 날 끌어들이지 마! 나는 오랫동안 여기에서 살았지만 여태껏 라마슈투에 대해서는 한 마디도 듣지 못했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 18_SharedText_String
msgctxt "2245cbbd-17ab-4e0c-a24c-5d9174d201f8"
msgid "\"Why do we have to believe you?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 왜 너를 믿어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 19_SharedText_String
msgctxt "fa6a882b-7eaa-46d8-bee3-63d336a07f87"
msgid "\"A woman alone on the edge of the swamps... what are you hiding?\""
msgstr "\"늪지 가장자리에 여자 혼자서... 무엇을 숨기고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "44c9f14e-d70e-4f1d-a2d8-f364f06eda83"
msgid "\"I hope nothing happened?\""
msgstr "\"아무 일도 없었으면 좋겠는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 20_SharedText_String
msgctxt "45393ac8-6350-4560-b0e3-136502d1eff1"
msgid ""
"\"Are you out of your mind?! There, look, there is Erastil's symbol above "
"the chimney! I serve the hunter's god!\""
msgstr "\"당신 정신나갔어?! 저기봐, 난로 위에 에라스틸의 상징이 있어! 나는 사냥꾼의 신을 섬긴다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 21_SharedText_String
msgctxt "165a77e4-ebac-491e-a8a4-ac65c3e31184"
msgid ""
"\"Stop, all of you! Only I and the {mf|baron|baroness} can make accusations "
"here!\""
msgstr "\"모두 멈춰라! 판단할 수 있는 사람은 나와 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하} 뿐이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 22_SharedText_String
msgctxt "4a477089-bc1d-4e7a-bc32-0b8e23e038dd"
msgid "\"This lass came last.\""
msgstr "\"이 자가 마지막으로 왔어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 23_SharedText_String
msgctxt "497e39d2-823f-4585-af4c-24b97ab7ee9f"
msgid "\"What?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 24_SharedText_String
msgctxt "cc9784c3-00e8-4559-9da4-f7fe81f2ff58"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. I saw it. It was dark when she came. Take this one, it's her. My "
"husband can confirm my words.\""
msgstr "\"맞아요. 제가 봤어요. 그녀가 왔을 때는 이미 어두워진 후였죠. 제 말을 믿어주세요. 제 남편이 증언해 줄 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 25_SharedText_String
msgctxt "625e4590-e344-4060-81a4-91abeaf4ca35"
msgid "\"He will confirm anything! He is not a man, but a dog on a leash!\""
msgstr "\"저 남자는 무슨 말이든 할 걸! 목줄 단 개일 뿐 남자도 아니니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 26_SharedText_String
msgctxt "077919fd-efaa-4e01-9611-41a917e6f48c"
msgid "\"How dare...\""
msgstr "\"감히...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 27_SharedText_String
msgctxt "20a7d563-77a1-4c82-b4ca-02a5a686a40d"
msgid "\"Shut up, Kabron. I mean... honey, keep quiet.\""
msgstr "\"입 다물어. 카브론. 내 말은... 자기야. 조용히 해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 28_SharedText_String
msgctxt "fd6de3fb-a317-4392-931f-678546452836"
msgid "\"Aha! See?!\""
msgstr "\"아하! 봤지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 29_SharedText_String
msgctxt "da2e7fd9-f5e2-4b47-9e7f-5c1fa2572781"
msgid "\"Pushover.\""
msgstr "\"호구로구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "4044ccb3-abe9-4ada-8e4a-b2f14411bd6a"
msgid "\"Such a turmoil at this late hour...\""
msgstr "\"이 늦은 시간에 이게 무슨 일이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 30_SharedText_String
msgctxt "185c4ac2-bcdb-4312-b750-811c380aee96"
msgid "\"Stop! Stop, all of you! What do you want?! I didn't do anything!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 모두 그만해! 어쩌라는거야?! 나는 아무짓도 하지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 31_SharedText_String
msgctxt "b3d9bf4f-291f-420b-b526-6d0d863ee8e4"
msgid "\"Kabron, calm down!\""
msgstr "\"카브론! 진정해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 32_SharedText_String
msgctxt "c0ddd1cf-dc29-4de9-b57e-df8ed947a8a6"
msgid ""
"\"First this broom closet, then all these people, now the {mf|baron|baroness}"
" with the whole court! This is madness! We shouldn't have trudged to see "
"this priestess at the world's end!\""
msgstr ""
"\"처음에는 이 으스스한 산장이 괴롭히더니만, 그 다음에는 여기 모든 사람들에, 이제는 {mf|영주님과|영주님과|전하와|전하와} 그 "
"일행들까지! 모두 미쳐돌아가는군! 세상의 종말에 여사제를 보기 위해 여기로 오는게 아니었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 33_SharedText_String
msgctxt "dc6faff0-dcf9-49bf-9351-fe24b0538792"
msgid "\"Priestess? What priestess, Kabron?\""
msgstr "\"여사제? 여사제라니? 카브런?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 34_SharedText_String
msgctxt "389d1a4b-bc7f-4ef4-b1e2-50157a858a7c"
msgid "\"That is... that's not what I meant...\""
msgstr "\"그건... 내 말은 그런 뜻이 아니라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 35_SharedText_String
msgctxt "264cb584-1445-43d7-abe1-5880a6a29668"
msgid "\"You're. A damn. Idiot.\""
msgstr "\"아니긴. 빌어먹을. 멍청이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 36_SharedText_String
msgctxt "4b197a10-582f-4fe1-8bb8-3e160c4625d8"
msgid "\"ENOUGH! Stop bullying my pack!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 우릴 내버려 둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 3_SharedText_String
msgctxt "87f5e281-97e7-4ea2-b869-1eae30741e49"
msgid ""
"\"Quiet, people, calm down! The {mf|baron|baroness} vested me with authority "
"to conduct this interrogation…\""
msgstr "\"모두들 조용히! 다들 진정해라! {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 허락으로 나는 심문할 권한을 얻었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 4_SharedText_String
msgctxt "bcc4f73f-e8fc-4e18-b450-b78cff378d9d"
msgid "\"Interrogation?\""
msgstr "\"심문?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 5_SharedText_String
msgctxt "a83ae9ad-64b8-418d-a111-2aae6594de2a"
msgid "\"I know nothing!\""
msgstr "\"저는 아무것도 모릅니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 6_SharedText_String
msgctxt "4c1be2f8-6819-486d-8e69-b55a72919380"
msgid "\"It is ridiculous!\""
msgstr "\"말도 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 7_SharedText_String
msgctxt "dcacd72b-0433-41a9-8091-77b5488c07c1"
msgid "\"What interrogation?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 심문이죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 8_SharedText_String
msgctxt "b7502a32-be0e-4d06-9563-4462778ac337"
msgid ""
"\"SILENCE! A follower of Lamashtu, guilty of a serious crime, is hiding in "
"this house. As soon as we find him or her, we will leave.\""
msgstr "\"조용히 하도록! 중범죄를 저지른 라마슈투의 신도가 여기 이 집에 숨어 있다. 그 녀석을 찾는대로 우린 떠나겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark 9_SharedText_String
msgctxt "7a8099a1-1d2c-43e9-80fd-50356fef14ab"
msgid "\"You are awfully quiet.\""
msgstr "\"당신, 이상하게 조용한데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/ChaosInterrogationCutscene/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "4120d0ec-715e-450c-908e-37614d585f22"
msgid "\"What is going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이시죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "2c3fa435-eb26-4004-9270-259c47cba12a"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"여긴 뭐하는 곳이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "f00bd158-e564-4c97-a7d5-587674650eb1"
msgid "\"I'm looking for someone. Can you help me?\""
msgstr "\"누군가를 찾고 있는 중이야. 나를 도와줄 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "ef304203-141b-493a-8aa7-adbc5383dbaa"
msgid "\"Do you let everyone into your house?\""
msgstr "\"이곳에서는 누구든 들이도록 허락해주나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "9d47591a-14b3-418b-b32e-e3a4ddab08de"
msgid "\"A cultist of Lamashtu is hiding in your lodge. I have to find them.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투의 사교도가 네 산장에 숨어있어. 나는 그들을 찾아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "8abc7d3e-5ac5-4d0c-92c5-1dc49574a5c9"
msgid "\"Do you remember when they came to your lodge at least?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 적어도 사람들이 언제 이 산장에 들어왔는지는 기억하겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "fb0469e3-785c-4039-b265-6465db702104"
msgid "\"I'd like to examine your room, Dumra.\""
msgstr "\"덤라. 너의 방을 조사하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "499c444c-73ea-4bdb-a992-d2e071b42ca7"
msgid "\"How long have you been living here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 지낸지 얼마나 됐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "0442d6a5-3b25-4849-ad05-c223afc698f8"
msgid "\"This place is rather secluded for a traveler's inn...\""
msgstr "\"이 곳은 여행자 여관 치고는 한적하군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "a828e780-ce4e-433d-bc05-c7dcfa21ea1c"
msgid "\"What is the main hunter's prey in these parts?\""
msgstr "\"이 지역의 주요 사냥감은 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "6590f479-0e52-4b0d-968a-d2e01fa884ba"
msgid ""
"\"Listen… the sooner I cross you out of the suspect list, the sooner I'll "
"leave you alone. Do me a favor and give me your room key, and all this will "
"be over before you know it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"들어봐... 너를 용의자 목록에서 빨리 빼줄수록, 너도 그 만큼 빨리 이 귀찮은 일에서 벗어나는거야. 나를 도와서 방 열쇠를 주면, "
"네가 눈치채기도 전에 끝내놓을께\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "c82b949c-7949-4578-a2fe-c4b3a3b749cb"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not going to ask twice, dammit! Put that key on a table now, or you'll "
"regret talking back to your {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr "\"두번 묻지 않겠어! 젠장! 지금 당장 열쇠를 테이블 위에 올려놓지 않으면, 영주에게 말대답한 걸 후회하게 될꺼다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "b5970f2a-1c07-4ef3-8894-2b8b3a3e6570"
msgid "\"We'll return to this question later.\""
msgstr "\"이건 나중에 다시 물어보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "68513759-d676-442c-a42d-fdab5c6100cc"
msgid "\"I'd like to see your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 좀 보고 싶은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "e41b9bed-ed10-4180-8571-ede7e3947f67"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "fa5f8e5e-3378-4d40-9316-bb7a11e80576"
msgid "\"I'd like to spend a night here.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 하룻밤 묵어갈까하는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "fac4d068-07cf-45f2-aa70-eee3caa17f0d"
msgid "\"Let's go back to my other questions...\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문을 해야겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "45425540-b230-4d52-adc0-75d38d01e771"
msgid "\"A crime has happened, Dumra. I need your help to find the culprit.\""
msgstr "\"범죄가 발생했어. 덤라. 범인을 찾으려면 당신 도움이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "76e36294-f25f-4d41-9592-054651516f41"
msgid "\"Do you know who your guests are?\""
msgstr "\"손님들이 누군인지는 알고있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "3e875e5f-0181-4705-95e3-64d559510cfc"
msgid "\"There are footprints leading to your lodge...\""
msgstr "\"너의 산장으로 이어지는 발자국이 있었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "994b1e5b-927d-4137-b6b9-13f902c053d6"
msgid "\"Your lodge is the only house in the neighborhood...\""
msgstr "\"네 산장은 이 주변에서 유일하게 있는 집이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "93524084-4d43-4dfb-a2b3-224939686415"
msgid "\"Several hours walk from your lodge is a shrine of Lamashtu...\""
msgstr "\"네 산장은 라마슈투의 성소에서 몇시간 거리에 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "3ca68b7a-b685-462a-99cc-8c0fcedbd08f"
msgid "\"I'm not going to argue with you.\""
msgstr "\"너와 말싸움 할 생각은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "97fd7556-eb1b-417f-84ff-ff54e28896eb"
msgid "\"I don't like your tone, Dumra.\""
msgstr "\"말투가 마음에 들지 않는군. 덤라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "9d910e5f-f0f1-49da-9568-d1b6d1bd2f6d"
msgid ""
"\"Your guests, Dumra. Do you allow anyone who asks to spend a night here?\""
msgstr "\"손님들 말이야. 덤라. 여기서 하룻밤 보내겠다고 하는 사람은 다 허락해주는건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "7a5dfa04-a53b-4aa3-a68c-00065c1fb2bf"
msgid ""
"\"I meant that followers of Lamashtu prefer… let's say… free relationships.\""
msgstr "\"내 말은 라마슈투의 추종자들은...뭐랄까...자유로운 관계를 맺는걸 선호한다는 뜻이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "4cc5a672-dcd3-4590-ac1c-a3197515a6cd"
msgid "\"Poor choice of words. Forget what I said.\""
msgstr "\"말실수를 했어. 내가 한 말은 잊어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "60793920-b9b3-4b8a-8b48-890a604c090b"
msgid "\"You're suspiciously stubborn in your refusal to help...\""
msgstr "\"도움을 완고하게 거부하려 하다니 의심스러운데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0083_Text
msgctxt "c0beb2c7-68ec-4c34-950b-feb9b64de71c"
msgid "\"How many people are there in the lodge now, except for you?\""
msgstr "\"너를 제외하고, 얼마나 많은 사람들이 지금 이 산장 안에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "f13a4abf-cc59-4180-893f-73524e9ddf19"
msgid "\"People say you came to the hall last...\""
msgstr "\"사람들이 말하길 네가 회장에 마지막으로 왔다고 하던데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "1f34258e-5358-4a35-81e4-4d4b7f943164"
msgid "\"That's enough about your lodge.\""
msgstr "\"네 산장에 대해서는 충분히 들은거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0090_Text
msgctxt "6a3637c2-bcca-4d63-969e-0b5a9e07774d"
msgid "[Pay for the room]"
msgstr "[방값을 지불합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0091_Text
msgctxt "61e9dbc3-a3bd-49a8-9d2b-957b7b7c0d1f"
msgid "\"I have changed my mind.\""
msgstr "\"나는 마음이 바뀌었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0092_Text
msgctxt "d337fcdf-1028-491a-a846-4eca5666897e"
msgid ""
"\"Seven gold pieces?! I am a ruler of these lands — shouldn't I rest here "
"without paying?\""
msgstr "\"7골드?! 나는 이 땅의 통치자야. 무료로 숙박하면 안 되나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0099_Text
msgctxt "507037a7-b0f4-4cb2-be22-ce639a565ac1"
msgid "[Pay for the room]"
msgstr "[방값을 지불합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "b614a3ab-45d1-400c-a90b-a14269516399"
msgid "\"I see you had some hellknights as guests...\""
msgstr "\"손님으로 헬나이츠가 온 걸로 아는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "f2997929-1941-4938-9ee9-6aaf17925465"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman looks at you with caution, throwing quick glances towards your "
"companions.{/n} \"Your Grace...\"{n} She chooses the words carefully.{/n} "
"\"What an unexpected visit. I am the hostess of this place, my name is "
"Dumra. How can I help you at this hour?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 당신을 조심스럽게 바라보고는 당신의 동료들도 빠르게 훑어봅니다.{/n} \"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}...\" {n}"
"그녀는 단어를 신중하게 선택합니다.{/n} \"정말 뜻밖의 방문이군요. 나는 이곳의 주인이고 이름은 덤라입니다. 이 늦은 시간에 제가 뭘 "
"도와드리면 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "b7e14d60-fa8c-4bfd-b0b8-251433422efb"
msgid "\"Yes?\""
msgstr "\"네?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "76d8fae3-4b70-40b5-ae52-52ead2807dda"
msgid "{n}Dumra looks at you without a word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}덤라는 한마디도 없이 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "5ad45e3e-b589-4a0a-8c86-3f4932440fd9"
msgid ""
"{n}A sturdy, dour-faced dwarf stands before you, hands on her hips. Despite "
"the wrinkles on her face, she looks more than capable of handling "
"herself.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}튼튼하고, 무뚝뚝한 얼굴의 드워프가 당신 앞에 서서 그녀의 엉덩이에 손을 짚고 있습니다. 얼굴의 주름살에도 불구하고 그녀는 자기 "
"스스로를 보호할 만큼은 충분히 건강해 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "d51424c7-de53-418c-a14c-9628affeba5a"
msgid ""
"\"Can't you see for yourself?\" {n}Dumra grumbles.{/n} \"A place where "
"people can rest after the hunt, enjoy a tankard or two, and fill their "
"gullet. The nearest tavern is far, you know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보면 모릅니까?\" {n}덤라는 투덜거립니다.{/n} \"사람들이 사냥 후에 휴식을 취하며 맥주 한두잔씩 즐기고 허기를 채우는 "
"곳이죠. 가장 가까운 선술집은 여기서 멀리 떨어져 있으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "fb5ede7e-a040-4cc1-8e0b-42ac676bcd48"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra hands tighten to fists, but she keeps them on her hips. She says "
"nothing, merely stares at you defiantly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 두 주먹을 움켜 쥐었지만, 손은 그녀의 엉덩이에 그대로 두고 있습니다. 그녀는 아무말도 하지 않고, 그저 반항적인 표정으로 "
"당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "1336fce7-dfc1-4ac6-9f15-a755167697cc"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra is silent for a moment, then nods and pulls an old, age-darkened "
"key from her belt. {/n} \"Your way then.\" Her eyes narrow. \"But, have a "
"care... no digging through my undergarments, or I'll have your hands on "
"hooks, you hear?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 잠시 침묵 하더니, 고개를 끄덕이며 허리띠에서 낡고 어둡게 바랜 열쇠를 꺼냅니다.{/n} \"그러면 마음대로하시죠.\" {n}"
"그녀의 눈이 가늘어집니다.{/n} \"하지만 조심해요... 내 속옷은 뒤지지 말아요... 아니면 당신 손을 갈고리로 꿰어버릴 테니까. "
"알겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "049c0aef-4a74-4acc-a93b-a0333748bd2d"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra grunts, then her eyes narrow.{/n} \"Let's say I give you the key, "
"and you use it to pin something incrim... increm... something bad on me! I "
"won't allow it! Search the lodge up and down if you want, but stay out of my "
"room!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 그르렁거리며 눈이 가늘어집니다.{/n} \"제가 열쇠를 드린다고 칩시다. 당신은 문따고 들어가서는 이거 수상하군...저것두 "
"수상하고..이럴게 뻔한데 저한테 좋을게 뭐있습니까! 저는 허락할수 없습니다! 산장을 뒤지던 말던 마음대로 하세요. 하지만 제 방에는 "
"못들어갑니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "714208b7-0bc2-45a7-9109-b3af41cd247b"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra glares at you for several moments, then finally grunts and pulls "
"forth an old, age-darkened key from her belt. {/n} \"Have it your way... "
"{mf|baron|baroness}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 한동안 당신을 노려보다가, 투덜 거리며 마침내 허리띠에서 낡고 어둡게 바랜 열쇠를 꺼냅니다.{/n} \"마음대로 "
"하시죠...{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "74479000-2823-456f-b65a-67fd1ba3e403"
msgid ""
"\"That's how it goes...\" {n}Dumra squints.{/n} \"If anything is against "
"your liking, you just start shaking your fists and rattling your weapons. "
"Won't work with me! I'm under {g|Erastil}Erastil's{/g} protection, Your "
"Grace, and the Great Hunter will not let anyone harm me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 나온다는 거지..?\" {n}덤라가 찡그립니다.{/n} \"뭔가 마음대로 되지않으면, 당신네들은 그저 주먹이나 휘둘러대고 "
"무기나 들이밀고는 하지. 나에겐 안통합니다! 저는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 보호아래 있습니다. 사냥꾼의 신께서 누군가 저를 "
"해하도록 두지 않을 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "b97e8c67-58b2-4bab-9568-9cdaf1b78f68"
msgid "\"Can I leave now?\""
msgstr "\"이제 그만 가도되나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "e8d0bbf6-d3a1-4a82-bfe7-7c9ec3e948a9"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra stares at you for a moment, then utters a hoarse chuckle.{/n} \"One "
"of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} own? That's quite a story you've spun, Your "
"Grace. Next you'll tell me I'm holding {g|Rovagug}Rovagug{/g} down in the "
"cellar? And what's your proof that I hide cultists?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 잠깐 당신을 노려보고는 쉰 목소리로 웃습니다.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 추종자? 그것 참 대단한 "
"이야기를 지어 내시는군요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 다음에는 제가 {g|Rovagug}로바거그{/g}라도 지하 창고에 숨겼다고 "
"말하시겠군요? 내가 사교도를 숨겼다는 증거는 뭡니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "c2b61e62-04e6-40ac-8acb-3459e6a8dace"
msgid "{n}Dumra's face turns red.{/n} \"What are you hinting at, huh?\""
msgstr "{n}덤라의 얼굴이 빨갛게 변합니다.{/n} \"아니 그게 무슨 뜻으로 말하는겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "cc6e2456-80c1-4f19-aecb-639c8d2e9221"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra squints at you, searching your features.{/n} \"Many years now. I "
"know the whole neighborhood — flatlands and the swamps.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 눈을 가늘게 뜨고 당신의 모습을 훑어봅니다.{/n} \"여러해 동안이요. 주변 평지던 늪지던 모든 이웃들을 다 알고지내죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "25ff03d7-7c87-472d-8fa7-b1e45b6e2567"
msgid ""
"\"This is not an inn.\" {n}Dumra looks around the room.{/n} \"It's my home. "
"I hunt for a living and let other fellow hunters spend a night here, if they "
"find themselves too far from a tract.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여긴 여관이 아니에요.\" {n}덤라는 방을 둘러 봅니다.{/n} \"여긴 내 집이에요. 나는 먹고 살기위해 사냥을 하고, 단지 너무 "
"멀리까지 와버린 지친 사냥꾼들에게 이곳에서 하룻밤 묵게 해줄 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "b053a16f-324f-4284-bdad-3fa55444ce0c"
msgid ""
"\"On the flatlands they go for fox and deer, birds in the swamp. There's "
"always a chance of running into something more dangerous, of course.\""
msgstr "\"평지에서는 여우와 사슴, 늪에서는 새들을 잡으러 갑니다. 물론 더 위험한 일에 부딪힐 가능성은 언제나 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "41f52dca-1469-4c77-abd8-0eb937e30197"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra closes her eyes, trying to recall.{/n} \"I went to check on my "
"traps… some people arrived when I was away. So I can't tell you for sure, "
"Your Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 눈을 감고 기억을 떠올리려 합니다.{/n} \"나는 내 덫을 확인하러 갔었는데... 내가 없을때 몇몇 사람들이 도착했어요. "
"그래서 확실하게 말해드릴 수는 없을 것 같군요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "bce95e12-f950-4a43-bdc2-9854c9ae09d7"
msgid "\"What else haven't I told you?\""
msgstr "\"제가 말하지 않은게 또 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "cddb9570-da64-4c25-a814-d37461790205"
msgid ""
"{n}A sturdy, dour-faced dwarf stands before you, hands on her hips. Despite "
"the wrinkles on her face, she looks more than capable of handling "
"herself.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}튼튼하고, 무뚝뚝한 얼굴의 드워프 여성이 당신 앞에 서서 그녀의 엉덩이에 손을 댑니다. 그녀의 주름살에도 불구하고 그녀는 자기를 "
"보호할 정도로 건강해 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "d8ca19dd-cfbc-45f5-848f-7d5a9e25aaff"
msgid ""
"{n}She eyes you up and down.{/n} \"First time here, is it? House rules are "
"simple — don't trouble the other guests, clean up your own mess, and don't "
"cross me, or the sky'll be your roof. Name's Dumra — but don't call me if "
"you need anything, guests attend to themselves.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 당신을 위아래로 훑습니다.{/n} \"여기 처음이죠? 규칙은 간단해요. 다른 손님들을 괴롭히지 말고 자기쓰레기는 스스로 "
"치우기, 그리고 저를 귀찮게 하면 추방당할 겁니다. 제 이름은 덤라에요. 하지만 필요한 것이 있더라도 저를 부르지는 마세요. 손님들은 "
"스스로 알아서 하니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "175d049f-5340-48db-a818-b65dc3485797"
msgid ""
"\"So what did this culprit do wrong?\" {n}Dumra's voice becomes thick, "
"corners of her mouth curve down.{/n} \"Shot a deer in someone's lands? And "
"now the criminal has to run away as if she was an animal herself… Whatever "
"it is, leave me out of it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 이 범인이 뭘 잘못했죠?\" {n}덤라의 목소리가 두꺼워졌고 입꼬리가 내려갑니다.{/n} \"누군가가 주인인 땅에서 허락없이 "
"사슴이라도 쐈나요? 그럼 이제 그 범인은 자신이 마치 사냥감이라도 된 듯 도망쳐야 겠군요...무슨일이 일어났던간에 나는 좀 빼주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "869810e1-f6a9-49f0-bde0-3f8267867705"
msgid "{n}Dumra crosses her arms and lifts her chin.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}덤라는 팔짱을 끼고 턱을 들어올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "e34e60ca-3581-4bce-9841-e547a9e7066f"
msgid ""
"\"So what? Folk come to this lodge everyday — both from the flatlands and "
"the swamps.\""
msgstr "\"그게 어떻다는거죠? 마을 사람들은 이 산장에 매일 들립니다. 평지와 습지 사람들 모두.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "72b89001-37c5-4e77-9152-c7aa13720952"
msgid ""
"\"And?\" {n}She lifts her chin.{/n} \"Is it a bad thing — to provide shelter "
"for those who's lost?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서요?\" {n}그녀는 턱을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"길을 잃어버린 사람들에게 피난처를 제공해주는 것이 나쁜 일인가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "5053c39d-bcef-4791-96ec-4012a6f13999"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Baron|Baroness}, enough!\" {n}The dwarf clasps her hands.{/n} \"Here "
"in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} you can't swing a dead cat without "
"hitting some goblin's nest, or cursed ruins, or a shrine of something foul!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 됐습니다!\" {n}드워프는 손을 꽉 움켜쥡니다.{/n} \"여기 {g|Stolen Lands}"
"도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서는 툭하면 마주치는게 고블린 소굴, 저주받은 유적, 무슨 역겨운 사원 같은 것들입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "370d9bcb-4b59-456f-b6ef-31216d2a74f3"
msgid ""
"\"Really.\" {n}The dwarf frowns, her eyes narrowing.{/n} \"And how would you "
"react, if a mob barged into your home and started troubling you and your "
"guests? If you were expecting me to bow and scrape before you, then you're "
"mistaken!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇겠죠\" {n}드워프는 눈살을 찌푸리며 눈은 점점 좁아집니다.{/n} \"만약 폭도들이 당신 집에 들이닥쳐서 당신과 손님들을 "
"괴롭히기 시작한다면 어떻게 할 겁니까? 제가 당신 앞에서 고개 숙이며 고분고분하기를 바랬다면, 그건 착각한겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "85945186-2e73-4dd3-807f-67bd683be275"
msgid "{n}Dumra glares at you and mutters something under her breath.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}덤라는 당신을 노려보면서 낮은 소리로 중얼거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "87e7e1e9-7d62-4cd8-ad33-0038e66db3e4"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra straightens and inhales slowly, a snarl rattling in her throat.{/n} "
"\"You know what? You may be a {mf|baron|baroness}, but I'm not going to "
"listen to your filth!\" {n}She spits on the counter — then almost out of "
"habit, she immediately begins cleaning the surface with a rag. {/n} \"What "
"has my life come to when one such as you brands me as one of ill-repute?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 몸을 곧게 펴고 천천히 숨을 들이쉬자, 목에서 그릉거리는 소리가 납니다.{/n} \"이봐요. 당신이 영주 일지는 몰라도, "
"나는 당신의 그런 추잡스러운 말은 듣지 않을 거요!\" {n}그녀는 카운터에 침을 뱉습니다. 그리고는 습관적으로 바로 걸레로 닦아내기 "
"시작합니다.{/n} \"당신 같은 사람이, 나에게 그런 나쁜 평판을 낙인 찍으면 제 인생은 어떻게 되겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "d0df3326-0f85-4eb4-9518-f88852414e56"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra blinks several times, pondering your words. {/n} \"Of course, "
"everyone. What else am I expected I do — pick who gets a warm spot near the "
"fireplace and who gets left out in the rain? I've let in you and your thugs, "
"though you've put a terror in my other guests.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 눈을 깜박이며 당신이 한 말을 깊이 생각합니다.{/n} \"물론. 모두 들이죠. 밖에서 모닥불로 몸을 녹이거나 비를 맞는 "
"사람들을 그냥 보고만 있습니까? 나는 당신네 무리도 들어오게 허락 했지만, 당신들은 내 손님들을 두려움에 떨게 하고 있을뿐이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "f5a4bff2-aba7-46f2-8dea-110bf2227e20"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra shakes her head slowly.{/n} \"You may think whatever you like.\" {n}"
"She frowns.{/n} \"As for me, I just don't like those who feel the need to "
"meddle in the business of others.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 천천히 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"좋을 대로 생각하시죠.\" {n}그녀는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"내 입장에선, 다른 "
"사람들 일에 참견하는 사람을 싫어할 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "ebaf9be0-e347-4fff-a3ee-3758e1c80ee2"
msgid ""
"\"Watch yourself — there are three of them, all sitting over there.\" {n}"
"Dumra nods towards her guests.{/n} \"That one in the kitchen, guessing she's "
"the servant to these two noble folk — they look to be carrying all the coin."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"모두 세 명이 저쪽에 앉아있어요.\" {n}덤라는 손님들을 향해 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"부엌에 있는 한명은, 여기 귀족 두 "
"명의 하인인 것 같아요. 돈을 왕창 들고다니는 귀족들처럼 보이더군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "f050e348-58d8-45cf-81b1-202112b18d39"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra looks at you closely for a moment, then grunts.{/n} \"Right.\" {n}"
"She speaks slowly, as if keeping her temper.{/n} \"I went out to the kitchen "
"when this clumsy gal has knocked over some of my pots. What of it?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 잠시 당신을 유심히 쳐다보고는, 투덜거리기 시작합니다.{/n} \"맞습니다.\" {n}그녀는 화를 참는 듯, 천천히 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"저 서투른 여자가 내 냄비들을 떨어뜨렸을 때 내가 부엌으로 나갔었어요. 그게 어떻다는거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "5c985be0-bf43-4459-ab1d-6424722eb90c"
msgid "\"You need something else?\""
msgstr "\"뭐가 더 필요해요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "4309c852-9fbc-4d12-b6b4-d63b4712cfc0"
msgid "{n}Dumra doesn't change her expression.{/n} \"Seven gold pieces.\""
msgstr "{n}덤라는 표정을 바꾸지 않고 말합니다.{/n} \"7골드.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "42556b23-58bd-433c-bef3-e146dafb8b25"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra chews her lip, then answers with reluctance:{/n} \"All right. Here "
"is your key.\""
msgstr "{n}덤라는 입술을 깨물고는 마지 못해 대답합니다.{/n} \"좋습니다. 여기 열쇠 받으시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "3ea496f1-2830-4e89-a4be-71927f24daa3"
msgid "{n}Dumra narrows her eyes:{/n} \"Ten gold pieces then.\""
msgstr "{n}덤라의 눈이 작아집니다.{/n} \"그러면 10골드.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "e925a2fb-1264-4a77-aafd-1ad84aec1072"
msgid "{n}Dumra doesn't change her expression.{/n} \"Ten gold pieces.\""
msgstr "{n}덤라는 표정을 바꾸지 않고 말합니다.{/n} \"10골드.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "5088ae1b-c237-4acc-b369-e5e1d29dffdc"
msgid "{n}Dumra chuckles but says nothing.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}덤라는 너털웃음을 짓지만 아무 말도하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0100_Text
msgctxt "52d8851a-9ae8-4274-bfe1-d58716481814"
msgid "\"Here is the key. Good night.\""
msgstr "\"열쇠 받으시죠. 좋은 밤 되시길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0103_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f4cc6a8d-984f-47a1-a1e7-4651ab810002"
msgid "\"Excuse me? Who're you calling a thug?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 누구한테 깡패라고 하는 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "6b181fc3-cf1a-4cc1-bbf9-74b9a0fd1b6c"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra eyes Octavia and falls silent, then shrugs.{/n} \"You're a fair "
"lass, sure, but who knows what thoughts you have in that pretty head of "
"yours?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 옥타비아를 보고는 침묵하더니 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"좋아요. 하지만 당신이 무슨 생각을 하는지 누가 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5905bdd7-6d33-408c-9a74-9d9394643336"
msgid ""
"\"Here we go. Do you know how many times I've heard such words in the "
"Iadaran court? As a side note, most of those speaking them turned out to be "
"guilty.\""
msgstr "\"그랬군. 내가 아이어다라 법원에서 몇번이나 그런 말을 들었는지 알아? 그렇게 말한 사람들은 대부분 유죄 판결을 받더군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_0109_Text
msgctxt "c3ca499c-3c05-42cf-bec9-0bf7fff54db7"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra waves dismissively.{/n} \"Ah, blast the snots back to Hell. They "
"scare simple folk away just sitting there. Good thing you've shown them "
"what's what.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 불만인 듯 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"그런 소리는 지옥에서나 해요. 저들은 앉아서 불쌍한 사람들을 겁준다고. 그들을 혼내주는 "
"건 좋은 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_SeclLodgeDUMRAInitiate_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "b9c68612-9e82-423b-813e-c0114f0b1110"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra gives you a sullen glance. It seems she's not too happy to talk "
"with you, but she doesn't dare refuse it openly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 못마땅한 눈빛을 보냅니다. 그녀는 당신과 대화하는 것이 영 달가워 보이지 않지만, 그렇다고 감히 공개적으로 거절하지는 "
"못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Hostess/Cue_SeclLodge_HostessDoesntKnow_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "db75914c-9269-41b9-8f91-b149b48f13be"
msgid ""
"\"Why should I?\" {n}Dumra tilts her head, her eyes appraising you.{/n} \"I"
"'m not their ward. They come, they pay for a bed, they keep quiet. Why would "
"I care who they are?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 왜 그래야하죠?\" {n}덤라는 머리를 기울이고 당신을 훑어봅니다.{/n} \"나는 그들의 하녀가 아닙니다. 그들은 와서, "
"숙박비 내고, 조용히들 있는 걸요. 저들이 누군지 내가 왜 신경 쓰겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Items/Dumra_lists_String
msgctxt "7a28b268-5d41-4fd4-a22b-17b1d7fb8f04"
msgid ""
"\"Bought:\n"
"1 bot oil, 2 lvs bread, 1 bg salt, 7 eggs, 2 bgs potatoes.\n"
"2 lvs bread, 2 bgs potatoes (don't buy from one-eyed old man again), 1 bot "
"oil, 1bg tea, 1 tub honey.\n"
"1 lf bread, 1 bg potatoes.\n"
"1 bg potatoes.\n"
"2 bgs potatoes, 2 lvs bread, 1 bot oil, 10 eggs.\n"
"Sold:\n"
"3 fresh rabbit carcasses, 3 rabbit skins, half of jerked deer meat, 1 pr "
"antlers.\n"
"5 fresh rabbit carcasses, 5 rabbit skins, wyvern claws, wyvern skull.\n"
"2 rabbit skins, 2 fresh rabbit carcasses.\n"
"Weather:\n"
"< A clear day. It rained in the evening.\n"
"< A clear day.\n"
"< A clear day.\n"
"< It rained a little.\n"
"< It was raining the whole day.\n"
"< Rain.\n"
"< Rain.\n"
"< Raining again.\n"
"< The sun came out. Then it rained.\n"
"< Rain.\n"
"< Rain.\n"
"Animals:\n"
"Rabbits getting more careful, must come up with a new snare.\n"
"Less deer in the woods now. Hunters scared them all off.\n"
"Saw a wyvern eat a deer today.\n"
"Too many monsters around these parts. Hydras started attacking hunters. Hope "
"they take on goblins as well.\n"
"These monsters have scared off all game. Hungry times are coming.\n"
"Important:\n"
"Saw a goblin in the swamps.\n"
"Another goblin lurking in the swamps. There's getting too many of them.\n"
"Saw a bright flash coming from Candlemere. I don't know what it was. Didn't "
"look like lightning. Must be goblins having fun.\n"
"Everard came by today. Haven't seen him for a while. Told me a new ruler "
"showed up in the Stolen Lands. For how long.\n"
"Saw a goblin again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"장 본 것:\n"
"기름 1병, 빵 2덩이, 소금 1병, 달걀 7개, 감자 2자루\n"
"빵 2덩이, 감자 2자루(다시는 애꾸눈 늙은이에게서 사지 말것), 기름 1병, 차 1박스, 꿀 1병\n"
"빵 1덩이, 감자 1자루.\n"
"감자 1자루.\n"
"감자 2자루, 빵 2덩이, 기름 1병, 달걀 10개.\n"
"판매한 것:\n"
"신선한 토끼 3마리, 토끼 가죽 3개, 사슴 육포 반덩이, 사슴뿔 1개.\n"
"신선한 토끼 5마리, 토끼 가죽 5개, 와이번 발톱, 와이번 두개골.\n"
"토끼 가죽 2개, 신선한 토끼 2마리.\n"
"날씨:\n"
"<맑은 날이다. 어제 밤에 비가 내렸다.\n"
"<맑은 날이다.\n"
"<맑은 날이다.\n"
"<비가 조금 내렸다.\n"
"<하루 종일 비가 내리고 있었다.\n"
"<비가 내린다.\n"
"<비가 내린다.\n"
"<다시 비가 내린다.\n"
"<태양이 나왔다. 그리고는 비가 내렸다.\n"
"<비가 내렸다.\n"
"<비가 내렸다.\n"
"동물:\n"
"토끼가 더 조심스럽게 행동해서 새로운 올가미를 만들어야 한다.\n"
"지금은 숲속에 사슴이 적다. 사냥꾼들은 사슴이 모두 사라질까봐 두려워했다.\n"
"오늘 와이번이 사슴을 먹는 것을 보았다.\n"
"이곳에 너무 많은 괴물이 있다. 히드라는 사냥꾼을 공격하기 시작했다. 그들이 고블린을 잡아가기를 바란다.\n"
"이 괴물들이 모든 사냥감을 겁주어 쫓아냈다. 사냥감이 없는 시기다.\n"
"중요한 것:\n"
"늪에서 고블린을 보았다.\n"
"늪에서 숨어있는 또 다른 고블린을 보았다. 고블린의 수가 너무 많아지고 있다.\n"
"캔들미어에서 밝은 빛을 보았다. 그것이 무엇인지 모르겠다. 번개처럼 보이지는 않았다. 고블린이 장난을 치는 것이겠지.\n"
"에버라드가 오늘 왔다. 한동안 그를 보지 못했다. 도둑맞은 땅에 새로운 통치자가 나타났다고 말해줬다. 얼마만의 통치자인지.\n"
"고블린을 다시 보았다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Items/Dumra_lists_name_String
msgctxt "47c51bc1-3717-47cd-acea-2bf6d40d4bd6"
msgid "Papers from Dumra's Chest"
msgstr "덤라의 궤짝에서 나온 종이"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67385_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8c0f5779-8a11-417b-a1e7-c0203ed913f2"
msgid "Called for uncontrolled confrontation of the accused in Dumra's lodge."
msgstr "덤라의 산장에서 사람들을 무자비하게 잡아오자고 얘기했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67385_Text
msgctxt "3bb1aab3-a506-4788-94e0-e95ea0ced8dd"
msgid ""
"\"Searching, asking questions, building theories… that's too long and too "
"boring. I say bring them here all together! Let them get nervous and start "
"with protests and denials, and we'll listen.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수색하고, 질문을 하고, 가설을 세우고... 그건 너무 지루하고 시간도 오래 걸려. 그들을 모두 한곳에 모이게 할수 있도록! 그들이 "
"초조하게 내버려두면, 곧 항의와 불만을 시작하겠지. 그때 우리는 듣고 있자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67387_Text
msgctxt "e33382c6-79f6-4402-bda5-ce179e00e590"
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to look around and speak with these people. Maybe I'll find "
"something.\""
msgstr "\"먼저 이곳을 둘러보고 이 사람들과 이야기하고 싶다. 아마 뭔가를 찾을 수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67389_Text
msgctxt "9ca7bc42-a4ae-431b-87e9-e7c861e0fb89"
msgid ""
"\"I trust your instincts, Kesten. Choose the one you think the most "
"suspicious and begin with them.\""
msgstr "\"네 본능을 믿어 케스턴. 가장 의심되는 사람을 골라서 그들부터 시작해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67395_Text
msgctxt "adf7d531-80cb-4c34-9dae-f9839767c11b"
msgid "\"There is someone who seemed especially suspicious to me.\""
msgstr "\"내가 보기에 특히 의심스러운 사람이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67396_Text
msgctxt "535483f1-fae1-49cf-9200-863b20b9d32a"
msgid ""
"\"I need some time, Kesten. Don't let any of them leave, watch them — I'll "
"be back soon.\""
msgstr "\"시간이 필요해. 케스턴. 누구도 떠나게 하지 말고 감시해. 곧 돌아올게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67397_Text
msgctxt "c6c57d1b-9b03-4c9a-abe8-e33ae9b9e395"
msgid "\"Who would you interrogate first?\""
msgstr "\"누구를 먼저 심문하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67398_Text
msgctxt "b5f1cfb7-b680-4124-a4df-bc6ab9efbd3e"
msgid "\"I've changed my mind. You can handle this better than I.\""
msgstr "\"마음이 바뀌었다. 나보다 네가 이 일을 더 잘 다룰 수 있을꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67399_Text
msgctxt "1f0b6b2b-dbc3-49ce-9aab-cc6e267f6b45"
msgid "\"Get to the interrogation, Kesten.\""
msgstr "\"심문을 시작해. 케스턴.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67400_Text
msgctxt "7e3d5a12-9b89-491b-aa58-d3c13d8a3d82"
msgid "\"Wait. I want to find out something else.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 그전에 다른 걸 알아볼게 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67404_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fa7bd8d3-8cd5-49fe-ac53-f5ef178efc2d"
msgid "Called for uncontrolled confrontation of the accused in Dumra's lodge."
msgstr "덤라의 산장에서 사람들을 무자비하게 잡아오자고 얘기했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67404_Text
msgctxt "066d00b6-043b-4f1c-b0b3-a74d324960fd"
msgid ""
"\"'Searching,' 'suspects'… a waste of time. Bring them here all together. "
"Let them justify or incriminate themselves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"'수색'이니 '용의자'니... 다 시간 낭비야. 그들을 모두 여기로 잡아와. 그들에게 해명할 기회를 주거나 아니면 스스로들 유죄를 "
"만들어내게끔 냅두자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67409_Text
msgctxt "7d7122fe-cba2-466e-8a1f-a279fb8344a5"
msgid "\"Kabron Tedrim, a lawyer from Restov.\""
msgstr "\"카브론 테드림. 레스토프의 변호사지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67410_Text
msgctxt "d4b0cb29-0fd2-46c7-bd0f-85f9d73c7a9a"
msgid "\"Una Tedrim, wife of the lawyer from Brevoy.\""
msgstr "\"우나 테드림. 브레보이에서 온 변호사의 아내지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67411_Text
msgctxt "6441c978-4ce5-4c4c-aa8a-59b44583cea3"
msgid "\"Olika, a widow.\""
msgstr "\"올리카. 미망인이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67412_Text
msgctxt "1ef418e6-9863-43be-8169-be31ea9f12c5"
msgid "\"Dumra, the hostess of this lodge.\""
msgstr "\"덤라. 이 산장의 주인이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67413_Text
msgctxt "d88a89b0-ec32-4de2-b344-85dc61833aaa"
msgid "\"Tsanna, Tedrim's maid.\""
msgstr "\"산나. 테드림의 하녀야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Answer_67414_Text
msgctxt "366e19b3-3601-462c-9a86-ba086d5fa537"
msgid "\"I need more time to think.\""
msgstr "\"생각할 시간이 더 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67381_Text
msgctxt "c048bc67-cfdd-4668-abfc-6a279af53ee3"
msgid ""
"{n}The lodge is lit with only a few candles on the tables and the counter — "
"shadows lie thick around the room. A number of people are here — a well-"
"dressed couple at one of the tables, a girl in simple dress dozes near the "
"opposite wall, and at the counter is an untidy dwarf — she's wiping the mugs "
"and glaring at you. From the half-opened kitchen door, you hear the clanging "
"of pans upon metal — presumably a stove.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}산장은 테이블과 카운터의 양초 몇개만으로 빛을 밝히고 있습니다. 방 주위로 그림자가 짙게 드리워져 있습니다. 이곳엔 많은 사람들이 "
"있습니다. 한 테이블에는 옷을 잘 차려입은 커플이 있고, 평범한 옷을 입은 한 소녀는 반대편 벽 근처에서 졸고 있습니다. 카운터에는 "
"단정치 못한 드워프가 머그잔을 닦으며 당신을 노려보고 있습니다. 반쯤 열린 부엌 문에선 금속 팬이 부딪치는 소리가 들립니다. 아마 "
"화로에서 나는 소리같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67382_Text
msgctxt "c8214f15-1d0d-4212-91ea-411653b8e856"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten looks around with a heavy gaze.{/n} \"Things have gone from bad to "
"worse. We must find the cultist before they flee — and we have no idea what "
"they look like!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 무거운 시선으로 주변을 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"상황이 나빠지고 있습니다. 사교도들이 도망치기 전에 빨리 잡아야만 합니다. "
"하지만 우리는 그들이 어떻게 생겼는지조차 전혀 모르고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67383_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "c75acc90-7c30-412c-8712-07e7f135f588"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten's hand falls to his weapon.{/n} \"Your Grace, I'm ready to make an "
"arrest. But if you wish to investigate further before making a decision, "
"I'll make sure no one leaves the lodge until you give the order.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴이 무기에 손을 댑니다.{/n} \"영주님, 저는 체포할 준비가 되었습니다. 결정을 내리시기 전에 심문을 하고 싶으시다면 "
"영주님께서 명령을 내릴 때까지 아무도 여기를 떠나지 못하게 하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67386_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "6fe95587-8e5f-4cd6-8264-226586f7a695"
msgid ""
"{n}The people in the lodge look surprised and concerned. Each seems to "
"recognize you and ask themselves — what is the ruler of these lands doing "
"here at such a late hour, flanked by armed guards?{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 산장에 있는 사람들이 놀라서 걱정을 하는 것 같습니다. 각자 당신을 알아보고 서로 소곤거리고 있습니다. 이 땅의 통치자가 여기서 "
"이런 늦은 시간에 무장한 경비병과 함께 무엇을 하는 거냐고 말입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67388_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "61587c45-9fb0-4d14-b3cc-730e23c531a7"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten's brow is furrowed. He looks at you, awaiting your orders.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 미간을 찌푸리고 있습니다. 그는 당신을 쳐다보며 명령을 기다리고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67390_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "b6169974-d9c3-4e44-aef1-1910cee46e62"
msgid ""
"\"As you command, Your Grace. No one will leave this house — I'll make sure "
"of that.\" {n}Kesten looks around the hall once again.{/n} \"My advice — "
"take their room keys. Their personal belongings speak their owner's intent, "
"often more than their masters would like.\""
msgstr ""
"\"명령대로 하겠습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 여기서 아무도 나가지 못할 겁니다. 그건 제가 확실히 해 두겠습니다.\" "
"{n}케스틴은 다시 한 번 복도를 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"조언을 드리자면, 그들의 방 열쇠를 가져가십시오. 그들의 개인 소지품들은 종종 "
"그들 스스로 말하는 것보다, 물품 주인의 의도를 잘 말해줍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67391_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "5649ff29-2ffc-425a-988b-6336a88dc8e9"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten frowns and looks around once again.{/n} \"The most suspicious… "
"Hmmm...\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 찡그리고는 주변을 다시 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"가장 의심스러운 사람이라... 흠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67392_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "907dae87-820c-4478-b170-c3b6f6956ed1"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten catches the eye of the dwarf at the counter — she glares back.{/n} "
"\"The hostess isn't pleased to see us. She's obviously doesn't care for "
"soldiers — or the law. Let's begin with her.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 카운터의 드워프와 눈을 마주쳤고, 드워프도 같이 노려보기 시작합니다.{/n} \"여주인의 우리를 보는 눈이 영 달가워보이지 "
"않습니다. 그녀는 군인이나 법 같은거는 상관하지 않는 게 분명합니다. 그녀부터 시작하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67393_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "2e71ab9a-66bb-48ae-900a-a5e85621b872"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten raises his brow.{/n} \"All together?\" {n}After a moment of "
"contemplating he gives you a wry grin.{/n} \"Cunning indeed, My "
"{mf|Baron|Baroness}. Give me a moment to gather the suspects.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 눈썹을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"모두 한곳에 말입니까?\" {n}잠시 심사숙고한 후에 그는 씁슬한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} "
"\"영악한 생각이십니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 용의자를 모을 시간을 잠시 주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67405_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "b088cd2f-2aa7-4f8a-b1c6-609b9b4865cf"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten shoots a glance at the dwarf at the counter.{/n} \"The hostess has "
"been staring hate at us since we entered. Mind her.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 카운터의 드워프를 힐끗 쏘아봅니다.{/n} \"이곳 여주인은 우리가 들어온 후로 우리를 좋게 보지 않는 것 같습니다. "
"아무래도 마음에 걸리는군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67406_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "e0d26338-9547-4e77-8a5d-fc7aab49eb43"
msgid "{n}Kesten nods, tight-lipped.{/n} \"As you command, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 굳은 입술로 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"알겠습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67407_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "c7f67686-feb3-4e66-99d3-44b5d1813438"
msgid "\"Just call the name and I will interrogate that person.\""
msgstr "\"이름만 불러주시면 제가 그 사람을 심문하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67415_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "c4805453-cf56-4cfb-bef9-688c3f1756d5"
msgid ""
"\"Take your time, My {mf|Baron|Baroness}. We will keep an eye on them.\" {n}"
"Kesten adjusts the weapon on his belt.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"서두르실 필요 없습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 우리가 그들을 계속 감시하고 있겠습니다.\" {n}케스턴은 허리띠에 달린 "
"무기를 만집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67416_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "a270849b-81d7-4405-8d62-b007d2388d7b"
msgid ""
"\"I knew it!\" {n}Kesten rubs his hands.{/n} \"Now we'll bring her to light!"
"\""
msgstr "\"그럴 줄 알았습니다!\" {n}케스턴은 손을 문지릅니다.{/n} \"이제 그녀를 심문하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67417_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "050f97af-c4de-4844-9e8f-dc246cb88e56"
msgid ""
"\"The only man in the lodge...\" {n}Kesten ponders.{/n} \"All right, let's "
"figure it out. I will bring him to you at once.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 산장 안의 유일한 남자...\" {n}케스턴은 고민합니다.{/n} \"알겠습니다. 조사해보도록 하죠. 그를 즉시 데려오겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67418_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "8958a36c-a669-4b30-b057-7e966687a6d0"
msgid "{n}Kesten nods.{/n} \"I will bring her to you at once.\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그녀를 즉시 데려오겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67419_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "07c5eb37-f631-423a-bca5-4464d9b44c57"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten raises his brow.{/n} \"You think so?\" He thinks for a moment, "
"then nods. \"As you wish, My {mf|Baron|Baroness}. I'll bring her. \""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 눈썹을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"그렇게 생각하십니까?\" 그는 잠시 생각하더니, 고개를 끄덕입니다. \"원하시는대로 "
"하겠습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 그녀를 데려오겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67420_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "345f6498-7b40-4f3c-90b4-5e56db6b4997"
msgid "{n}Kesten nods.{/n} \"I'll call her here and we'll speak with her.\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"제가 그녀를 여기로 부를 테니 그녀와 얘기해보면 되겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67422_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "9b201d37-cff6-4d55-94fb-5d7951a551fe"
msgid "\"Well, Dumra… it's time to tell the truth.\""
msgstr "\"자, 덤라... 이제 진실을 말해야 할 시간이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67424_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "7688a57b-7f3b-40df-a06a-7fcbede1b26e"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra gives Kesten a gloomy look. {/n} \"What about? About what drives a "
"gang of soldiers to break into homes in the middle of the night?\""
msgstr "{n}덤라는 케스턴을 우울하게 봅니다.{/n} \"뭐에 대해? 무엇 때문에 한밤중에 병사들이 집에 쳐들어오게 됐는지 말이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67426_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "ce3d2e66-16e0-4220-a7b3-6beb92096b5b"
msgid ""
"\"Watch your tongue, cultist! Your act won't save you. Confess you worship "
"wretched {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, and maybe {mf|baron|baroness} will spare "
"you a painful execution!\""
msgstr ""
"\"말조심해라. 사교도! 그런 행동은 용서하지 않아. 사악한 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}를 숭배하는 걸 자백한다면, 아마 "
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서 고통스러운 처형은 면하게 해주실지도 모른다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67427_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "dcbc3606-5f63-43af-bfe8-c4b591249542"
msgid ""
"\"Cultist?! Are you mad?! My faith lies with {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, no "
"other!\""
msgstr "\"사교도라고?! 미쳤어?! 나는 {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}만을 믿을뿐 다른 신들은 믿지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67428_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "eda68684-706a-4f83-89e2-d1bf811c97c6"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed? Odd to hear that from the hermit who prefers to live beside the "
"monsters of {g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}! Or do you claim you know nothing "
"about the shrine of dark goddess?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말인가? {g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g}의 괴물들과 함께 사는 은둔자에게서 그런 말을 들으니 이상한데! 아니면 암흑 여신의 "
"성소에 대해서도 모른다고 말할텐가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67429_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_Hostess
msgctxt "7ada1098-c472-4236-8dc9-314b7bff7488"
msgid ""
"{n}Dumra rubs her eyes.{/n} \"Not in all my years have I been spoken to "
"such... if you won't listen, then there, look!\" {n}The woman points to a "
"grimy tablet over the fireplace.{/n} \"A bow and an arrow! Symbols of "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}!\" She takes a breath. \"As for this "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} of yours — I know nothing about her, and don't want "
"to!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덤라는 눈을 문지릅니다.{/n} \"내 살면서 그런 말은 들은 적이 없어... 듣기 싫으면 저기를 봐!\" {n}여자는 난로 위의 "
"지저분한 액자를 가리킵니다.{/n} \"활과 화살이야! {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 상징이지!\" {n}그녀는 숨을 "
"들이킵니다.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 상징은 아니야. 나는 그녀에 대해서도 모르고 알고 싶지도 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67430_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "93d4e4bf-6ff4-439a-b1b5-1769634c2c38"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten glances at the tablet.{/n} \"I admit, that's clever — "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil's{/g} symbol where everyone can see it, pretending to "
"worship the god of hunting.\" Kesten turns back to Dumra. \"This is your "
"last chance — confess, or else...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 액자를 힐끗 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"영리한데. 사냥의 신을 숭배하는 척하며, 어디서나 볼수 있는 "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 상징을 걸어놓다니.\" 케스턴은 덤라를 봅니다. \"이게 마지막 기회다. 자백하지 않으면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67431_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "9abf309b-44be-4506-abc6-6530625fdd73"
msgid ""
"{n}All of a sudden, a loud noise comes from the kitchen. Kesten turns, "
"surprised.{/n} \"What was that?\" {n}Following his warrior instinct, he "
"grabs the weapons.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}갑자기 큰 소리가 부엌에서 들립니다. 케스턴은 깜짝 놀라 뒤돌아봅니다.{/n} \"뭐였지?\" {n}전사 본능에 따라 그는 무기를 "
"움켜잡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67436_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "e40432c7-62fd-488c-80fb-00812afb265c"
msgid ""
"\"So, Kabron… the time has come for us to have a heart-to-heart. Why are you "
"here?\""
msgstr "\"그래. 카브론... 우리가 서로 마음을 터놓고 얘기할 때가 왔군. 여긴 왜 온거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67437_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "f122d795-3fdb-46e8-a551-e806bc1dfbb4"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron trembles, his voice quavering, his face pale.{/n} \"W-w-what a-are "
"you t-t-talking ab-b-bout?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카브론은 부르르 떨면서, 얼굴은 창백해졌습니다. 그는 떨리는 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"무..무..무슨.. "
"얘..얘기..를..하..하는.. 거..거..야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67438_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "6948968a-5bcf-43e3-83e2-baa6e10e1770"
msgid ""
"\"Let's cut to the chase, Master Tedrim. You don't want to keep our "
"{mf|baron|baroness} waiting, do you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"쓸데없는 수작은 집어치우고 바로 본론으로 들어갑시다. 테드림 공. 우리 {mf|영주님을|영주님을|전하를|전하를} 계속 기다리게 하고 "
"싶지는 않겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67439_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "cc42b57a-5b8c-4347-b79c-b18c71941528"
msgid ""
"\"FINE!\" {n}Kabron almost shouts now.{/n} \"I confess! I CONFESS! I didn't "
"come here to hunt! But… it's not my fault! It's because of her! Because of "
"my wife!\""
msgstr ""
"\"알았어!\" {n}카브론은 이제 거의 소리칩니다.{/n} \"자백할게! 자백한다고! 나는 사냥하러 오지 않았어! 하지만... 내 "
"잘못이 아니야! 그녀 때문이야! 내 아내 때문이라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67440_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "dce86b58-2be5-4805-8821-ccc205713b44"
msgid ""
"\"What about your wife?\" Kesten's eyes narrow. \"The truth now, all of it! "
"I've lost too much time to you and your cult already!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 아내가 왜?\" 케스턴의 눈이 가늘어 집니다. \"이제부터 사실대로 모두 말해! 이미 너와 네 사교도 숭배 때문에 시간을 너무 "
"많이 뺏겼어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67441_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "02d360cf-e25c-44bb-8e2f-c889251c84f4"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not a cultist!\" {n}Kabron's eye well up.{/n} \"It's Una! She told me "
"the priestess of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} could help us! She brought me "
"here, to this... this god-forsaken hole! She threatened that if I didn't go, "
"she'd end our marriage — and she's a great-niece of Garnet {g|House "
"Orlovsky}Orlovsky{/g}! The shame would destroy me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 사교도가 아니야!\" {n}카브론의 눈에 눈물이 맺힙니다.{/n} \"우나가 사교도야! 그녀가 "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 여사제가 우리를 도울 수 있다고 말해줬어! 그녀가 날 여기로 데려왔어...이.. 이.. 거지같은 "
"곳에! 그녀는 내가 가지 않는다면 우리 결혼은 끝이라고 위협했어. 그녀는 가넷 {g|House Orlovsky}오를로브스키{/g}의 "
"조카라구! 그런 수치심은 결국 나를 파멸로 몰고 갈꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67442_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "b7760a8d-33b3-4458-9219-e0e5426caa17"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten looks at you.{/n} \"I guess we've made a mistake.\" {n}He "
"whispers.{/n} \"This squab is guilty only of a lack of spine. But then, who "
"is-\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴이 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"우리가 아무래도 실수한 것 같습니다.\" {n}그는 속삭입니다.{/n} \"이 애송이의 유일한 "
"죄목은 겁쟁이 정도입니다. 그럼 대체 누가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67443_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "83e85ebd-564d-4fab-8d4c-badeebcd36a2"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten is interrupted by a loud noise from the kitchen.{/n} \"What was "
"that?\" {n}His hand falls to his weapon.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 부엌의 시끄러운 소리로 멈춥니다.{/n} \"뭐였지?\" {n}그는 재빨리 무기를 잡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67446_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "e23cef11-2afa-4591-950e-f79601657b30"
msgid ""
"\"Una Tedrim, we have questions for you. Answer them, and we can dispense "
"with the extreme mea-\""
msgstr "\"우나 테드림. 너에게 질문이 있다. 대답을 잘해준다면 우린 극단적인 상황은 피할 수 있...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67447_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "ff1eed57-4dd1-40e9-a610-4070c92aa745"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman's face is frozen in a sneer.{/n} \"Who are you, peasant? What "
"gives you the right to address one of the {g|House Orlovsky}Orlovsky "
"family{/g}? We are of the Great House of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, and we will "
"be treated as such!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자의 얼굴은 비웃음으로 굳어져 있습니다 .{/n} \"넌 누구지, 천민? 감히 {g|House Orlovsky}오를로브스키 "
"가문{/g}의 사람에게 말을 걸수있는 권리는 어디서 났지? 우리는 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 대 귀족 가문이다. 그에 맞는 "
"대우를 할 수 있도록!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67448_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "b931d16d-7cff-4661-8f83-0b1653de5700"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten's face reddens.{/n} \"An honor indeed — but whatever your family, "
"you're not in {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, so if you're done with your "
"pleasantries, tell me what brings you to our barony. It seems to me "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} must be involved.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴의 얼굴이 붉어집니다.{/n} \"만나서 영광입니다. 하지만 당신의 가문이 무엇이든간에, 당신은 지금 "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에 있는게 아닙니다. 그러니 이제 그 귀족식 인사치례를 다 마치셨다면, 왜 우리 영지에 오게됐는지 "
"말하시죠. 제가 보기엔 분명 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}와 관련있어 보이는군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67449_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "d25de8db-e8f8-4143-85a7-d43a2e1d2e3c"
msgid ""
"{n}Una's face whitens, but her voice is steady. {/n} \"You have no proof.\""
msgstr "{n}우나의 얼굴은 하얘지지만 여전히 목소리는 침착합니다.{/n} \"너는 증거가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67450_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "8cfcdedf-ac01-4249-9336-80df8314deb7"
msgid ""
"\"Haven't I, Lady Tedrim? The behavior of you and your husband tells me a "
"great deal.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 생각합니까? 테드림 부인. 당신과 당신 남편의 행동이 이미 많은 것을 말해주고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67451_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "97409f67-1bbb-4b98-9d4c-c8cdb4696a30"
msgid ""
"{n}Una closes her eyes.{/n} \"I stand by what I said before.\" {n}She speaks "
"slowly, accentuating each word.{/n} \"As a subject of a sovereign state of "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}, I object to your methods and demand a fair trial, "
"providing me with-\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우나는 눈을 감습니다.{/n} \"내가 말한 그대로야.\" {n}그녀는 말 한마디 한마디를 강조하면서 천천히 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"주권국가 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 시민으로서 나는 너의 심문 방식을 거부하고 공정한 재판을 요구한다. 향후 나에게 제공해야 "
"할 것은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67452_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "e31ffa8e-66c8-479b-9a08-e9bae7b98eb9"
msgid ""
"{n}Una is interrupted by a loud noise from the kitchen. Kesten's hand falls "
"to his weapon. {/n} \"What was that?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우나는 부엌의 큰 소음으로 말하던 것을멈추었습니다. 케스턴은 빠르게 그의 무기로 손을 옮깁니다.{/n} \"무슨 일이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67460_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "1d8b2e79-c133-44b7-9a9c-db587b0580c5"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten's voice softens.{/n} \"Olika… we must have the truth… You "
"understand, right?\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴의 목소리가 부드러워집니다.{/n} \"올리카... 우리는 진실을 알아야 해... 알겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67461_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "44f7afa1-9897-486e-bce6-a1f06fc7f234"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika hands her head, and her hands cover her belly, as if trying to "
"protect her unborn child. After a moment, she speaks, her voice a whisper. "
"{/n} \"I had no choice.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카는 머리에 손을 대고는 태어나지 않은 아이를 보호하려는 듯 배를 만집니다. 잠시 후 그녀는 속삭이듯 말합니다.{/n} \"선택의"
" 여지가 없었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67462_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "bd0ecedd-a100-4b94-971d-822bf1a65981"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten shakes his head.{/n} \"There is always a choice, Olika. Always...\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"언제나 선택의 여지는 있어. 올리카. 언제나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67463_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "817b5d68-d215-4c92-9936-1d4a054c0ac9"
msgid ""
"\"No!\" {n}Olika shakes her head without raising her eyes.{/n} \"No one "
"could help me but {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}! Everyone has turned their backs "
"on me and my child! What could I do? Let my child die in my womb?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니!\" {n}올리카는 시선을 떨구며 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}외에는 아무도 날 도울 수 "
"없어요! 모두 나와 내 아이에게 등을 돌렸어요! 내가 뭘 할수있죠? 내 아이가 죽게 내버려둬야 하나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67464_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "999eafc7-8f1a-47f5-8549-ed056dff0a27"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten stares at the widow, his eyes wide.{/n} \"That's why you've become "
"a priestess of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}? To give your baby over to the "
"infernal powers — to give birth to a fiend?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 눈이 커져서 미망인을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그래서 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 여사제가 된 거야? 아기에게 "
"지옥의 힘을 넘겨주려고? 악마를 태어나게 하려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67465_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "a643ed5a-0977-49f6-b685-ada414833045"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika raises her face and stares at Kesten, surprised.{/n} \"What?\" {n}"
"She blinks off the tears.{/n} \"Become a priestess? Oh no! I just wanted her "
"to perform a ritual! To save my unborn child!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카는 고개를 들어 놀란 얼굴로 케스턴을 봅니다.{/n} \"뭐?\" {n}그녀는 눈물을 훔칩니다.{/n} \"여사제라구요? 아 "
"아니야! 나는 그녀가 의식을 행하기를 바랐을 뿐이에요! 내 아이를 구하기 위해서요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67466_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "0b1eeffc-733e-4650-afdd-bd1894e31186"
msgid ""
"\"What was that?\" {n}Kesten turns, his hand falling to his weapon. {/n}"
msgstr "\"뭐였지?\" {n}케스턴은 등을 돌리고는, 무기에 빠르게 손을 갖다댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67468_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "2876ff20-643f-4459-9478-1fcc1d6371e6"
msgid "\"I think, Tsanna, you know why I've brought you here.\""
msgstr "\"산나라고 했던가. 왜 너를 여기에 데려온지 알겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67472_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "6545ab8d-6039-452c-8362-1249945bf0e6"
msgid ""
"{n}The kitchen servant casts a wary look at Kesten, then you.{/n} \"I would? "
"How? Do you jest, my lord?\" {n}She gives a half-smile, as if uncertain.{/n} "
"\"How could I know what you are thinking? I-\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주방 하인은 케스턴과 당신을 경계하듯 차례로 봅니다.{/n} \"제가요? 어떻게? 농담이겠죠?\" {n}그녀는 불확실한 듯, 미소를 "
"짓다 맙니다.{/n} \"무슨 생각을 하시는지 제가 어떻게 알겠어요? 저는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67473_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "eb80c2a2-a26f-4f9c-9cfa-0cfc52e56d1a"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten shakes his head.{/n} \"Enough. We know who you are. "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} won't help you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"그만. 네가 누군지 알아. {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}는 너를 도울 수 없어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67474_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "0233932d-6d74-4842-ab73-e76fe0dcdf47"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna is silent for a moment, then straightens like a serpent, her eyes "
"cold with contempt.{/n} \"Is that so.\" {n}Her accent has vanished, the "
"demeanor of a peasant shed like a cloak.{/n} \"Then you know little of our "
"faith, indeed.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 잠시 침묵을 지키다가, 독사처럼 몸을 곧게 펴더니 경멸이 가득찬 눈으로 차갑게 변합니다. {/n} \"그럴까.\" {n}"
"그녀의 억양은 한순간에 사라지고, 농민같던 태도는 마치 망토를 벗듯 없어졌습니다.{/n} \"그렇다면 우리의 신앙을 모르고 있는 "
"모양이로구나. 그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67478_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "e0c7675b-fb44-4cab-ba6f-5b815e0bcf5f"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten shakes his head and turns to you.{/n} \"Have you seen something "
"like that before, Your Grace? An 'innocent' woman reciting Brevoy law, as if "
"she prepared herself in advance!\" He turns back to her. \"If you are not "
"guilty, Lady Tedrim, why such a speech?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 고개를 가로지으며 당신에게 돌아옵니다.{/n} \"전에도 이런 걸 본 적이 있으십니까. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}? "
"'결백하다는' 여성이 미리 준비한 듯이 브레보이 법을 읊고 있습니다!\" {n}그는 다시 그녀에게 돌아갑니다.{/n} \"테드림 부인, "
"죄가 없다면 왜 그런 연설을 하는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67479_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "b8428977-5e4d-4c94-aa11-328c875b4344"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten grits his teeth.{/n} \"Damn it! We've made a mistake! We-\" {n}"
"Kesten is cut off by a loud noise from the kitchen.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 이를 악물고 있습니다.{/n} \"빌어먹을! 우리가 실수를 한 것 같습니다! 우리는...\" {n}케스턴은 부엌의 시끄러운 "
"소리에 멈춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67480_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "595d16be-e4d5-461b-9416-1829418c2053"
msgid ""
"\"The Great Mother is with me.\" {n}Tsanna's voice is ice.{/n} \"Prepare "
"yourself for her.\""
msgstr "\"위대한 어머니는 나와 함께 한다.\" {n}산나의 목소리가 차갑습니다.{/n} \"그녀를 맞을 준비를 하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/KestenStart/Cue_67481_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "0a593a55-ebae-4335-b691-8bc8721f1928"
msgid ""
"{n}Una Tedrim clenches her fists.{/n} \"I understand all too well you need a "
"scapegoat, but I won't allow you to cast aspirations on the Tedrim name! My "
"opinion? Interrogate my husband, he who used to defend necromancers in the "
"courts! I can bear witness to his crimes, if a real criminal is what you "
"seek!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우나 테드림이 주먹을 움켜 쥐고 있습니다.{/n} \"당신들에게 희생양이 필요하다는 것은 잘 알고있지만, 함부로 테드림의 이름을 "
"언급하는 것은 허락하지 않겠다! 내 생각을 듣고싶어? 심문할꺼면 법정에서 네크로맨서를 변호하던 내 남편에게나 해! 내가 그의 죄를 증언할 "
"수 있으니까. 당신들이 찾는게 진짜 범죄자라면 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "0d37ee6f-e0e1-4ed5-9bc2-e04c9fe8e1d1"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "6b8aa1a0-5880-4afc-838e-087af6fdb5f4"
msgid "\"I'm looking for a cultist of a dark goddess. Can you help me?\""
msgstr "\"어둠의 여신을 숭배하는 사교도를 찾고 있어. 날 도와 줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "b74566ae-64a3-48a3-b076-039cca01a81f"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "ec47a3ee-f89a-41d1-8dfa-a97bfc050856"
msgid ""
"\"Olika, why are there blood-stained undergarments in your room? Where is "
"that from?\""
msgstr "\"올리카. 왜 방에 피 묻은 속옷이 있지? 어디서 나온 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "6bb0036f-940d-4fe3-aa25-68ce8880aad7"
msgid "\"Are you planning to stay in Gralton?\""
msgstr "\"그랄튼에 머무를 계획인건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "083d48dd-08ff-4090-bdc0-52fc5cdde809"
msgid "\"Where are you from?\""
msgstr "\"넌 어느 나라에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "0135cbf3-f01b-4dcc-9e24-337c6bae48d8"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "e7bb5c04-b8e2-49bc-8109-b34d2bb2c4fc"
msgid "\"Have you seen anything suspicious tonight?\""
msgstr "\"오늘밤 의심스러운 것이 있었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "985a87c9-95d7-4c9d-8dfc-049ad4dd7eeb"
msgid "\"Do you know anyone in this hall?\""
msgstr "\"이 회장 안에 아는 사람이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "cac60995-02d6-4a41-98f4-65b73a656116"
msgid ""
"\"You see this couple at the table? They are nobles from Restov. They claim "
"you were the last one who'd come to the hall.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저쪽 테이블에 커플이 보이지? 레스토프 출신의 귀족들이야. 그들은 네가 회장 안에 마지막으로 들어온 사람이라고 얘기하던데..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "a6d2de1b-fb48-4098-8c5b-b713a2bd58cd"
msgid "\"Do you know who came to the lodge last?\""
msgstr "\"누가 마지막으로 이 산장에 들어 왔는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "432937fa-c9ef-42ce-8daf-5401659fe239"
msgid "\"It was a long journey for you.\""
msgstr "\"너에겐 긴 여정이었겠구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "acb3e1fa-edf4-4076-a15d-3359aed69d87"
msgid "\"Let's talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "3be3a559-332a-4a57-8e92-aa6f798977c2"
msgid "\"I need a key to your room.\""
msgstr "\"네 방 열쇠가 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "a835d93e-a182-4fef-80e5-11317e802684"
msgid ""
"{n}A young woman stands before you, wearing a plain dress and a hooded "
"cloak. Her belly is swollen — she is pregnant, and her time is near.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}평범한 드레스에 후드가 달린 망토를 두른, 한 젊은 여자가 당신 앞에 서있습니다. 그녀의 배는 불렀습니다. 그녀는 임신했고 출산할 "
"때가 다 되어 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "822cb11a-d6ef-44c7-806f-8348a3976305"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman manages a bow. {/n} \"I've heard other people calling you "
"{mf|baron|baroness}, Your Grace. It's an honor to be in your presence. I am "
"Olika.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 겨우 인사합니다.{/n} \"다른 사람들이 당신을 {mf|영주님이|영주님이|전하|전하}라고 부르는 것을 들었습니다. 당신 "
"앞에 서게 되어 영광입니다. 저는 올리카라고 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "bddb44c9-9ead-4ab9-80ed-3e612f5e7deb"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace! It's an honor!\" {n}The woman bows, then stares at you with "
"shining eyes.{/n} \"I thought I'd never be able to thank you in person for "
"your kindness, but gods were kind to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만나서 영광입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\" {n}여자는 고개숙여 인사를 하고는 빛나는 눈으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} "
"\"친절을 베풀어 주신 것에 직접 감사를 전할 길은 없을 줄 알았는데, 아무래도 신들께서 저를 도우시나봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "d0c3ef5f-f4e7-4fd9-b008-6b8aff289942"
msgid ""
"{n}She touches a turquoise brooch pinned to her dress — the brooch is "
"familiar to you. {/n} \"You made it possible that the last gift from my "
"husband had found its way home. There's not enough words in the world for "
"how grateful I am.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 드레스에 꽂힌 터키석 브로치를 만집니다. 브로치는 당신에게 낯익어 보입니다.{/n} \"남편이 집에 돌아오는 길의 마지막 "
"선물을 당신께서 전해주셨습니다. 제가 얼마나 감사하고 있는지는 세상 어떤 말로도 충분하지 않을꺼에요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "a7453bb9-cae5-41ad-8166-502c24e316d2"
msgid ""
"\"Do you want to ask about something else?\" {n}Olika gives you a faint "
"smile.{/n}"
msgstr "\"더 물어보실게 있나요?\" {n}올리카는 희미한 미소를 지어줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "aa36dc73-8233-4e6c-a205-42f488613ba4"
msgid ""
"\"I've got a sister in Gralton. Gods bless her — she's agreed to give me a "
"shelter in her house. So I went there — there was nowhere else to go.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그랄튼에 여동생이 있어요. 그녀가 자기 집에 제가 머무를 만한 곳을 마련해준다고 했어요. 그래서 나는 그곳으로 갔죠. 거기 말고는 갈 "
"곳이 없었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "1b6b4439-98ef-4d36-9c3a-4bc083e55fd3"
msgid ""
"\"From {g|Galt}Galt{/g}, Your Grace. I'm from a tiny village near the tract —"
" guess no one here ever heard about this place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Galt}갈트{/g}에서 왔습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 변두리 작은 마을 출신이에요. 여기에서는 아무도 이 "
"장소에 대해 들어본 사람이 없는 것 같아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "76c0cbd9-80c3-4a69-8277-df37a95ab516"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika hesitates.{/n} \"I don't know yet.\" {n}She answers.{/n} \"But if "
"things turn out well… why not?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카는 망설입니다.{/n} \"아직 모르겠어요.\" {n}그녀는 대답했습니다.{/n} \"하지만 일이 잘 풀린다면... 그래야겠죠?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "78ba4568-766b-4efc-a7d0-181d9fc2c654"
msgid "{n}Olika nods.{/n} \"Of course, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "{n}올리카는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"얼마든지요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "9a631b5f-4219-4352-b41d-3f6863db407c"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika pales.{/n} \"Cultists? That's… that's horrible! But… how can I help "
"you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카가 창백해집니다.{/n} \"사교도들? 그건... 그건 정말 끔찍해요! 하지만... 제가 어떻게 도와줄 수 있을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "6cc7b300-6e4c-4697-805e-11798c9b70ca"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika shrugs.{/n} \"I've little coin, Your Grace… So I have to beg "
"traders on the road to ride in their carts. I spend nights anywhere I have "
"to. This place is at least warm and dry.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"저는 돈이 거의 없어요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}... 그래서 길가에서 상인들의 "
"마차를 태워달라고 간청하고는 했죠. 밤은 되는대로 아무데서나 보냈구요. 이곳은 그래도 따뜻하고 아늑한 편이에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "90990657-1f43-4130-8982-79740d294db8"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika takes a step back, her eyes wide with fear.{/n} \"I… I'll explain..."
"\""
msgstr "{n}올리카는 한 발 뒤로 물러났고 그녀의 눈은 두려움으로 가득 차있습니다.{/n} \"제가... 제가 설명할게요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "8e4d1d6e-e318-4430-a225-f1a167e5f20f"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika gives you perplexed look.{/n} \"But that's not true! It's not!\" {n}"
"Her voice trembles.{/n} \"Dumra… the hostess… she... she was the last one! I "
"remember her coming through the kitchen!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카는 당혹스러운 표정을 보입니다.{/n} \"하지만 그건 사실이 아니에요! 그렇지 않아요!\" {n}그녀의 목소리가 "
"떨립니다.{/n} \"덤라... 여주인... 그녀가... 그녀가 마지막이었어요! 나는 그녀가 부엌을 통해 들어오던 것을 기억하고 있다구요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "0877785c-9007-4d25-9162-9d663d0af11f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm taking what rest I can after a long day on the road, Your Grace. I'm a "
"widow...\" {n}Olika stops short.{/n} \"I've barely had two seasons to mourn "
"my husband, and he left me with child. And in difficult times like these...\""
msgstr ""
"\"길에서 긴 하루를 보낸 후, 휴식을 취하고 있었습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 저는 미망인이에요...{n}올리카는 잠시 "
"멈칫합니다.{/n} 남편을 잃은지 반년도 되지 않았고 게다가 그는 저와 아이를 남겨둔채 떠났죠. 이렇게 어려운 시기에 말이에요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "ea718c09-6a79-401a-8055-f0a9a3f69b75"
msgid "{n}Olika shakes her head slowly.{/n} \"No… I don't think so...\""
msgstr "{n}올리카는 머리를 천천히 흔듭니다.{/n} \"아니... 못본거 같아요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "2f5e3681-9f83-470f-8a45-1564bd24c016"
msgid ""
"\"First time I've seen these people was when I'd stepped over the threshold "
"of this lodge.\""
msgstr "\"이 산장에 들어왔을 때 이사람들이 있는 걸 본 게 처음이예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "f2c9e399-0ccf-4738-a2c4-45b1d95f6d5a"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika frowns.{/n} \"I heard a noise from the kitchen… It was like "
"something fell on the floor. And then this grumpy old lady, Dumra, came out."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카는 눈살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"부엌에서 소리가 들렸어요... 무언가 바닥에 떨어지는 소리 같았죠. 그리고는 저 괴팍한 노인 "
"덤라가 나왔어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "a7d28cb0-1aa1-4829-b106-92264fe9fa3a"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika gives you several hasty nods. It seems the talk of cultists has "
"frightened her.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}올리카는 고개를 여러번 끄덕입니다. 사교도에 대한 이야기가 그녀를 겁먹게 한 듯합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "67d2f28f-f23d-4cfb-ad05-fb699bda1423"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman lowers her head and rests her hands against her belly.{/n} \"I… "
"I'm expecting a baby… But… because of the journey... or of all the "
"worries... something must have gone wrong. It hurts...\" {n}Olika closes her "
"eyes tightly.{/n} \"And I bleed.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 머리를 숙이고 손을 배에 올립니다.{/n} \"저… 저는 출산을 앞두고 있어요...하지만...긴 여행 때문에..아니면 "
"걱정거리 때문인지..뭔가 잘못됐나 봐요. 아프기 시작했어요...\" {n}올라카는 눈을 꼭 감습니다.{/n} \"그리고 피가 흘렀어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "2e29e810-751b-4fb9-8ccc-3be8170c233e"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika starts sobbing.{/n} \"I tried! I tried to find out what's wrong! To "
"heal myself! To appease the gods! The priest of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} "
"told me he couldn't help — the goddess rejected my child, said it would be "
"born dead!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카는 흐느끼기 시작합니다.{/n} \"저는 노력했어요! 뭐가 잘못된 건지 알아내려고 했다고요! 제 몸을 정화하고, 신들을 달래기 "
"위해서라면 뭐든 했죠! {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 사제에게 갔지만 도와줄 수 없다고 했어요. 여신께서 원치 않으셔서, 제 "
"아이가 죽은 채로 태어날 거라고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "9abfde57-2a76-4da2-932d-8a4a54fcf8a7"
msgid ""
"{n}You recall the location of {g|Galt}Galt{/g} and Gralton. As far as you "
"know, {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} lay aside from the places Olika had "
"named.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}와 그랄튼을 떠올립니다. 당신이 알기로 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 올리카가 "
"말했던 곳 옆에 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "536740f9-69d0-443b-8c0c-e76873a8b82f"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika straightens the folds of her dress and puts her hands over her "
"belly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}올리카는 옷의 주름을 곧게 펴고 그녀의 배 위에 손을 올려 놓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "5cfb7d42-b76d-43b9-9fc2-0ba66e2ef140"
msgid ""
"{n}Olika hesitates, then takes a key out from her cloak and hands it to you "
"without a word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}올리카는 망설이지만 망토에서 열쇠를 꺼내, 말없이 당신에게 건네줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "14c10155-7ed4-4264-8dff-65111b469340"
msgid ""
"\"But I can't... can't just accept it. I can't give up. This child... my "
"husband's child... all I have left of him...\" {n}Olika hides her face "
"behind her hands and starts to weep. You realize you'll get nothing more "
"from her at the moment.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그럴 순 없어요....저는 받아들일 수 없어요. 포기 할 수 없다구요. 이 아이는... 내 남편의 아이는... 제게 남긴 "
"남편의 유일한...\" {n}올리카는 손으로 얼굴을 가리고는 흐느끼기 시작합니다. 당신은 지금 그녀에게 아무것도 얻을 수 없다는 것을 "
"깨달았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "3b605629-8770-4b6f-8989-d3fefec66ecf"
msgid ""
"{n}A memory of Olika's letter emerges from the depths of your mind. She "
"mentioned her son in that letter, but now there is no child by her mother. "
"It's odd that Olika, who's been planning to stay at Gralton, didn't bring "
"her son with her. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}올리카의 편지에 대한 기억이 당신의 마음 속에서 떠오릅니다. 그녀는 편지에서 아들을 언급 했었지만, 지금 엄마 옆에는 아이가 "
"없습니다. 그랄튼에 머무를 계획이었던 올리카가 아들을 데리고 오지 않았다는 것은 이상한 일입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "7031a77b-2e6b-4964-9e49-7ab32e7e8ab2"
msgid ""
"\"You must have forgotten already, but… it was you who discovered my "
"{d|Leksen}husband's{/d} body. A trader, died on one of his trips. You found "
"a brooch and a letter on his body, and had it sent to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이미 잊어버렸을지도 모르지만... 내 {d|Leksen}남편의{/d} 시신을 발견한 건 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}이십니다. "
"그는 상인이었는데, 여행 중 죽음을 당했어요. 당신께서 그에게서 브로치와 편지를 발견해서 저에게 보내주셨어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/SecludedLodge_MerchantsWife_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "9f324630-101e-49ec-b50c-5e2342bc17f1"
msgid "\"My child will live!\""
msgstr "\"내 아이는 무사할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/SecludedLodge_MerchantsWife_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "1a10e84e-32b8-47df-8c95-cd2404ee5fef"
msgid "\"Joyous day!\""
msgstr "\"즐거운 하루!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/SecludedLodge_MerchantsWife_WhatToBark 3_String
msgctxt "4bdec02f-0d1b-436d-9d4c-a9a2ffacadc9"
msgid "\"I'll name the child after you!\""
msgstr "\"네 이름을 따서 아이의 이름을 짓겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/SecludedLodge_MerchantsWife_WhatToBark 4_String
msgctxt "9adfef4a-7557-462c-a837-7a725ec28718"
msgid "\"A curse upon you!\""
msgstr "\"저주나 받아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/SecludedLodge_MerchantsWife_WhatToBark 5_String
msgctxt "729ebf92-3780-488c-b7ea-ce50d49ae2b1"
msgid "\"You're cursed my child to die!\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 아이를 죽으라고 저주했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/SecludedLodge_MerchantsWife_WhatToBark 6_String
msgctxt "2426251a-2a8e-42e3-940c-40dc284ee595"
msgid "\"The blood of an innocent is on your hands, {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr "\"너는 손에 결백한 사람의 피를 묻혔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/MerchantsWife/SecludedLodge_MerchantsWife_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "124b9610-aeca-4bd8-9ca0-e0f2076e8810"
msgid "\"My {mf|Baron|Baroness}, I… I just don't know how to thank you!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}...어떻게 감사를 드려야 할지 모르겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "159c834a-ce77-429a-be74-5c76345f3e1d"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself, please.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "c3930aeb-0790-482e-b200-e79441e81259"
msgid ""
"\"A crime has taken place nearby. The one responsible may be hiding in this "
"house. Have you seen anything suspicious?\""
msgstr "\"근처에서 범죄가 발생했어. 범인이 이 집에 숨어 있을지도 몰라. 뭔가 수상한 것을 발견하진 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "8440ca77-f28d-4c38-b9a1-0903e93141c3"
msgid "\"I'll come back to you later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 올게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "73e99e36-0cc4-48ff-8e48-e4eec531967d"
msgid "\"Far from Brevoy, are you not?\""
msgstr "\"브레보이에서 꽤나 먼곳까지 왔군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "99a0fbae-b183-4d4c-b5c6-17be3660d39e"
msgid "\"Do you prefer snares? Or a bow?\""
msgstr "\"올가미를 쓰나? 아니면 활을 써?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "0634ee2c-610b-48f6-b595-02309cfece02"
msgid "\"What kind of prey do you hunt?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 종류의 동물을 사냥하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "683abec5-ddba-4556-93c2-aced5fe00f32"
msgid "\"An odd place to rest for the night.\""
msgstr "\"밤에 쉬기에는 이상한 장소군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "18d9463b-03d5-4de2-9370-da9f3851a3a8"
msgid "\"The woman in the kitchen — your cook?\""
msgstr "\"부엌에 있는 여자는 자네 요리사인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "9ff66c65-4713-41eb-a30f-be8b0e9a36f9"
msgid "\"Have you seen anyone suspicious?\""
msgstr "\"의심스러운 사람이 있었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "37226632-27d7-4682-b388-44d702136eab"
msgid "\"Do you know the hostess of this lodge?\""
msgstr "\"이 산장의 여주인을 알고있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "aa2c0689-34e9-4870-928e-db0e2b9b791a"
msgid "\"Do you recall who came to the lodge in the last hour or so?\""
msgstr "\"한시간 전쯤 누가 이 산장에 들어 왔는지 기억하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "65f2b976-31a0-4fba-8915-adff1fec171a"
msgid "\"I've been to your room. I found no hunting weapons there.\""
msgstr "\"네 방에 갔었어. 거기엔 사냥 무기가 하나도 없던데 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "c45c3644-ba00-4482-950a-df0415bf7182"
msgid "\"I need a key to your room.\""
msgstr "\"네 방 열쇠가 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "c922698a-3e25-443a-bd4b-502d6263ccd2"
msgid "\"A legalist? So you are a judge?\""
msgstr "\"법률가? 그럼 자네는 판사란 말인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "8781c986-c42a-4821-9b89-e3ea9c831dc2"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes! Of course, Kabron Tedrim! I've heard about you and your famous "
"legal cases!\""
msgstr "\"아, 그래! 카브론 테드림! 당신의 이름과 유명한 소송 사건들에 대해 들은 적이 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "37149678-285b-4dd0-8e62-4a93708e4543"
msgid "\"Let's go back to other questions.\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문을 좀 해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "69dbf164-6c72-424c-ae53-d50335874dee"
msgid ""
"\"Well, with a difficult job like yours it's impossible to get by without "
"some divine support. Whom do you address your prayers to?\""
msgstr "\"음, 그런 어려운 직업은 신의 지지가 없어서는 안되지. 당신은 누구에게 기도하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0083_Text
msgctxt "b5f2025a-629f-42fd-9ca0-35a0adba2a2c"
msgid "\"Let's go back to other questions.\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문으로 돌아가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0089_Text
msgctxt "aa3c4aea-4639-4728-baeb-36ed2b6ff79b"
msgid "\"You've recognized me at once. Do I know you?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 나를 바로 알아보던데.. 내가 혹시 아는 사람인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Answer_0094_Text
msgctxt "3dc7634d-d80d-44dd-ba4a-49d094625b8e"
msgid "\"Well, I hope you enjoy your hunting. Let's change the topic.\""
msgstr "\"그럼, 즐거운 사냥 되기를 바래. 다른 주제를 얘기해보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "89c7bde1-2f9f-4b19-8f02-b77f0a86169c"
msgid ""
"{n}A bearded, middle-aged man stands before you. He wears a massive gold "
"chain on his neck. The woman beside him gives a polite smile and a nod as "
"you approach.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}수염을 기른 한 중년 남자가 당신 앞에 서 있습니다. 그는 목에 거대한 금 사슬을 둘렀습니다. 그 옆에 있는 여인은 당신이 다가오자 "
"예의 바른 미소를 지으며 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "4060bfe8-a6d0-4920-bcf7-31888e0baad7"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, {mf|baron|baroness}\". {n}The man's voice is so low as to "
"rumble.{/n} \"Let me introduce myself — Kabron Tedrim, from "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g}.\" {n}He nods to the woman beside him.{/n} \"And this "
"is my wife, Una Tedrim. We've come to your lands to hunt — yet, I admit, we "
"did not expect to meet you in person. To what do we owe this honor?\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\" {n}그 남자의 목소리는 매우 작아서 웅얼거리는 것처럼 들립니다.{/n} \"제 "
"소개를 하겠습니다. 저는 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}에서 온 카브론 테드림이라고 합니다.\" {n}그는 옆에 있는 여자에게 고개를 "
"끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그리고 이쪽은 제 아내 우나 테드림입니다. 저희는 사냥을 하러 당신의 땅에 왔습니다. 하지만 "
"{mf|영주님을|영주님을|전하를|전하를} 직접 만날 줄은 몰랐군요. 만나게되어 영광입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "71c77cd2-2514-407e-949f-0a9fc7d5f2b2"
msgid "{n}Kabron Tedrim lowers his head.{/n} \"Your Grace?\""
msgstr "{n}카브론 테드림이 머리를 낮추었습니다.{/n} \"네, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "518f9c94-42d6-47ae-a68b-e493ab89d556"
msgid ""
"\"I'm a legalist, {mf|baron|baroness}.\" {n}Kabron hooks his thumbs into his "
"embroidered belt. {/n} \"My job is to ensure {g|Restov}Restov's{/g} laws are "
"upheld. My wife is a keeper of the hearth and my loyal companion in "
"prolonged journeys.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 법률가입니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\" {n}카브론은 엄지 손가락을 자신의 자수 허리띠에 걸었습니다.{/n} \"내"
" 직업은 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 법을 지키는 일입니다. 내 아내는 주로 가정을 돌보고 있고, 나의 동반자로써 긴 여정을 "
"함께하고 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "2f863057-ed8f-4d24-bbfd-1bda165f76ac"
msgid "{n}Una nods without a word, her gaze fixed on you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}우나는 말없이 고개를 끄덕였습니다. 그녀의 시선은 당신에게 고정되어 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "dbc63bc7-d699-43b0-8206-b0942105645d"
msgid ""
"\"You see, erm...\" {n}Kabron clears his throat.{/n} \"I've heard the "
"wildlife here are excellent sport. So I decided to see for myself — sort "
"truth from rumor, you understand. Fortunately, my fair wife was in favor of "
"the trip — so here we are.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아시다시피... 음...\" {n}카브론은 목청을 가다듬습니다.{/n} \"여기선 사냥이 훌륭한 스포츠라고 들었습니다. 그래서 그 "
"소문이 사실인지 직접 확인해 보고 싶었습니다. 다행히도 제 아내 역시 이 여행에 찬성해 주었구요. 그렇게 이곳에 오게 된겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "392c03bd-7a7f-471b-a173-75cc7e3aee1d"
msgid "\"Erm… a bow.\""
msgstr "\"음... 활입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "be2d39bb-9863-4a5a-ab82-2c6572177271"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron freezes.{/n} \"I...\" {n}He swallows.{/n} \"Cougars.\" {n}He "
"swallows again, as if fighting to take a breath.{/n} \"Magnificent "
"predators. Worthy prey. For a worthy hunter.\" {n}He gives an awkward smile. "
"{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}카브론은 얼어붙습니다.{/n} \"저는...\" {n}그는 침을 삼킵니다.{/n} \"쿠거를 잡습니다.\" {n}크는 다시 숨을 "
"참으려는 듯 침을 다시 삼킵니다.{/n} \"장엄한 포식자니까요. 사냥꾼에게 알맞는 사냥감이죠.\" {n}그는 어색한 웃음을 "
"짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "a958cd2d-d7d8-4230-9661-125a51b81d5b"
msgid ""
"\"Why, {mf|baron|baroness}!\" {n}Una gives a false smile.{/n} \"We adore "
"this… charming dwelling!\" {n}She glances around the dim hall — her smile "
"remains, but you notice she raises an eyebrow at her surroundings, as if in "
"judgment.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"왜요, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}!\" {n}우나는 거짓 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"우리는 이런... 매력적인 곳을 좋아하는 "
"걸요!\" {n}그녀는 어두운 회장 주위를 둘러봅니다. 그녀의 미소는 여전히 남아있지만, 마치 평가라도 하듯 인상을 쓰며 주위를 둘러보고 "
"있는것을 당신은 알아챕니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "c651a9be-40d1-462a-8f8f-1806b0599da4"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron nods quickly.{/n} \"Yes! We… We just can't imagine our lives "
"without Tsanna.\""
msgstr "{n}카브론은 빨리 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"맞습니다! 우리는... 산나가 없는 삶은 상상도 못합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "f5ba4cc8-edb2-4605-97b4-9c73337b9d27"
msgid ""
"{n}Una coughs delicately.{/n} \"My constitution demands a... unique diet.\" "
"{n}She studies you closely.{/n} \"A private matter, if you don't mind.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우나는 고상하게 기침을 합니다.{/n} \"제 건강상... 독특한 식단이 필요해서요.\" {n}그녀는 당신을 자세히 "
"살펴봅니다.{/n} \"죄송합니다만, 사적인 문제입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "2ab9d84f-3387-42a9-82b4-e285689fa16c"
msgid ""
"{n}The Tedrims exchange glances.{/n} \"I'm afraid, Your Grace,\" {n}Kabron "
"looks downcast.{/n} \"We won't be able to help you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}테드림 부부는 눈빛을 교환합니다.{/n} \"죄송합니다만..{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\" {n}카브론은 "
"풀죽어보입니다.{/n} \"저희는 도와드릴 길이 없군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "94ba292c-2c26-4463-bd98-317f714a3160"
msgid ""
"{n}Despite Una's cool expression, you notice a bead of sweat running down "
"her temple. As she spots your glance, her lips tighten. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}우나의 차분한 표정에도 불구하고, 그녀의 관자놀이에서 흘러내리는 땀방울이 눈에 띕니다. 그녀가 당신의 눈짓을 알아채자, 그녀의 "
"입술이 조여집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "f25a0e0e-cd99-433d-acd9-bfa0f01c7159"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron becomes white as a sheet.{/n} \"Erm… you see… well...\" {n}He "
"licks his lips, which are now trembling slightly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}카브론은 뱃짓장처럼 새하얗게 얼굴이 변합니다.{/n} \"음... 그러니까...그게...\" {n}그는 입술을 핥고는 입술이 "
"떨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "bf11c4b0-cf88-41f9-be8c-bb5192932ff5"
msgid ""
"{n}You barely hear Una's hiss. {/n} \"Get a hold of yourself, you fool. "
"You'll ruin everything.\" {n}These words seem to have the desired effect — "
"Kabron suddenly straightens and smiles.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 우나가 말하는 것을 희미하게 들을 수 있었습니다.{/n} \"정신차려. 네가 모든걸 망치고 있어.\" {n}이 말들이 꽤나 "
"효과가 있었는지, 카브론은 갑자기 허리를 펴고는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "1602e48a-1f39-456c-aad0-2c032d3c9e40"
msgid ""
"{n}His wife's gentle support have had an almost enchanting effect on Kabron —"
" he suddenly straightens and smiles as if nothing happened.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 아내가 조용히한 귓속말은 카브론에게 꽤나 효과가 있었습니다. 그는 갑자기 허리를 곧게 펴더니 아무 일도 없다는 듯 미소를 "
"짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "8c41f6d4-5fc6-4748-8885-7d6a3b8bd3ae"
msgid ""
"\"Truth be told, it's a rather embarrassing matter...\" {n}Kabron gives a "
"hollow chuckle.{/n} \"I proved a much worse hunter than I thought. Just "
"imagine — I managed to snap not one, not two, but three bow-strings in a "
"day! Infuriated, I broke my bow across my knee! It shames me to even speak "
"of it...\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실 조금 난처한 일입니다...\" {n}카브론은 너털웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"저는 생각보다 사냥을 정말 못한다는 것을 알게됐죠. "
"하루에 하나도 아니고 두 개도 아니고 활줄 세 개를 끊어버렸지 뭡니까! 화가 나서 무릎으로 활을 꺾어 버렸죠! 이거 참, 말하기도 "
"부끄럽군요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "7fa8e188-22b9-4db6-9ca6-ffbe4e6e0a2e"
msgid "{n}Una smiles gently and looks aside.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}우나는 부드럽게 미소지으며 옆을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "663e5f64-5c67-41bc-a379-0325ed2be90a"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron Tedrim freezes as if someone put a knife to his throat.{/n} \"Is"
"... is that so?\" {n}He tries to smile, but his eyes are fearful. {/n} \"I d-"
"doubt, {mf|baron|baroness}, that anything you heard concerned me... my "
"family name is a common one... I've so many relatives, I know not a quarter "
"of them...\" {n}He clears his throat.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}카브론 테드림은 누군가 자신의 목에 칼을 들이댄 듯 얼어버립니다.{/n} \"그... 그렇습니까?\" {n}그는 미소를 지으려고 "
"하지만 눈에는 두려움이 보입니다.{/n} \"그..글쎄요...{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 제 성씨는 흔한 성씨입니다... 저는 "
"친척이 하도 많아서, 저 조차 그중에 4분의 1도 모를 정도이지요...\" {n}그는 헛기침을 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "ac6d1d98-9e67-44e9-9710-08ad07013e7d"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"I doubt it, Your Grace, My legal cases "
"are not so famous to be known outside {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카브론은 눈썹을 치켜올립니다.{/n} \"거참 이상하군요. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 제 소송 사건은 "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 밖으로 알려질 만큼 유명하지 않습니다만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "2acc8e0c-9ee7-4f45-84dc-a61f67ca8d11"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron smiles slightly. {/n} \"Not exactly. I work as a legal defendant "
"in cases when a suspect's innocence must be proven. And, I admit, I have "
"moderate success in this field...\" {n}Kabron seems about to elaborate, then "
"stops.{/n} \"No need to bother you with tedious tales from the courts.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카브론은 살짝 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"그렇지는 않습니다. 저는 피의자의 무죄가 입증되어야 하는 소송에서 법정 피고인으로 일하고 "
"있습니다. 그리고 그 방면에서 꽤 나쁘지 않은 실력을 가지고 있습니다...\" {n}카브론은 자세히 설명하려는 듯하더니 이내 "
"멈춥니다.{/n} \"법정에서나 들을법한 지루한 이야기로, 당신을 더 괴롭힐 필요는 없을 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "58d6a5d7-046f-49a9-a613-f722d44081e4"
msgid ""
"\"Why, to Abadar, of course! Divine patron of law and lawyers!\" {n}Kabron "
"looks at you intently.{/n} \"Surely, you are aware of {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}, "
"are you not? You must be! No matter, no matter.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당연히 아바다르죠! 법률가와 변호사의 신성한 동료이시죠!\" {n}카브론은 열열히 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \""
"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}께서도 당연히 {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}를 알고 계시겠죠? 아무렴 당연히 아시겠죠. 모를리가 "
"있겠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "dd7369bc-bfd8-4809-90fb-713a6f704035"
msgid "\"As you wish, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "\"네. 원하는대로 하시지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "d0631736-e1ed-46f2-a106-37c62199bbe3"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron looks around the hall.{/n} \"We are not accustomed to such "
"company, {mf|baron|baroness}. Besides, from the {g|Restov}Restov{/g} "
"legalist's point of view, every person in this room is suspicious.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카브론은 회장 주위를 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"우리에겐 그런 사람들은 익숙하지 않습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 게다가 "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 법률가의 관점에서 보면, 이 방에 있는 모든 사람들이 의심스럽게 보이는군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "4d5f96cb-fb80-4647-b09d-81c55d2c89ea"
msgid ""
"\"No, I don't.\" {n}Kabron rubs his brow.{/n} \"And I must say, she doesn't "
"look forward to meeting new people either.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니오. 전 모릅니다.\" {n}카브론은 이마를 문지릅니다.{/n} \"그리고 하나 말씀드리자면, 그녀도 역시 새로운 사람들을 만나는 "
"걸 좋아하지 않아보입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "6509377d-af06-4be7-9497-0ec65792f04c"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron casts a look behind you.{/n} \"On second thought… this young woman…"
" I didn't notice exactly when she entered the room.\" He turns to his wife. "
"\"My dear, perhaps you recall? What was the name our hostess used addressing "
"her?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카브론은 당신의 뒤쪽을 봅니다.{/n} \"다시 생각하니... 한 젊은 여성이... 이곳에 들어온 모습을 본적이 없는것 같군요.\" "
"{n}그는 아내를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"여보 기억나? 여기 여주인이 그녀를 뭐라고 불렀었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "fedaf873-4bf8-4f70-8a17-dd933a17e5d3"
msgid ""
"\"Olika, sweetheart.\" {n}Una shrugs faintly.{/n} \"I cannot recall if I saw "
"her at the start of the evening.\""
msgstr "\"올리카야. 여보.\" {n}우나는 살짝 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"저녁이 되었을 때 그녀를 봤던 기억이 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "d3658285-ca3c-4097-847a-984eebb7ff27"
msgid "{n}Kabron nods.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}카브론은 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0088_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "97150bd6-d8eb-4921-9e48-6eca048709b9"
msgid ""
"{n}Una Tedrim raises her head.{/n} \"We've decided a trip was in order. My "
"husband worked long hours during the last several months, so he felt a "
"journey would be good for us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}우나 테드림이 고개를 듭니다.{/n} \"우리는 여행을 가야할 때라고 결정했죠. 남편은 지난 몇개월 간 쉬지않고 일한 탓에, "
"우리에겐 여행이 좋은 선택일 것 같았거든요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "9bd87319-0962-4b44-8b37-20b737e21e67"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt it. But news about developments within the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} — and your role in them — has traveled far. {name} — is a well-"
"known name beyond your borders.\" {n}Kabron gives a polite half-bow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄요. 아마 아닐겁니다. 그러나 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 소식과 당신의 활약은 잘 알려져있죠. {name}"
"의 이름은 국경 너머까지 잘 알려져있습니다.\" {n}카브론의 자세는 공손합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "4146a2c0-ae45-4248-a8d6-9e0390171599"
msgid ""
"{n}Kabron takes a key from his purse and hands it to you.{/n} \"As you wish, "
"{mf|baron|baroness}.\""
msgstr "{n}카브론은 그의 지갑에서 열쇠를 꺼내 당신에게 건네줍니다.{/n} \"여기있습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleFemale
msgctxt "3a9517e0-567a-4e28-8254-61e35e2bf76c"
msgid ""
"{n}Una, who was watching her husband closely, touches his shoulder "
"lightly.{/n} \"I beg your pardon, {mf|baron|baroness}.\" {n}She leans in to "
"Kabron and whispers something in his ear.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}남편을 가까이서 보고 있던 우나는 그의 어깨를 가볍게 만집니다.{/n} \"잠시.\" {n}그녀는 카브론에게 기대고는 귀에 뭔가를 "
"속삭입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_NobleMale
msgctxt "1b23df5b-b9a8-4cec-b7b6-d75c7cc72f14"
msgid "\"My pleasure.\""
msgstr "\"좋습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 10_String
msgctxt "e2e79dde-1bad-464e-96cf-c5b9541ca68a"
msgid "\"Hail {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr "\"남작 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 11_String
msgctxt "ee9c62df-a4cc-4794-ba82-4be86693973e"
msgid "\"Such joy!\""
msgstr "\"야호!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 12_String
msgctxt "a5a078c9-10ed-4285-8cfc-b5ad0f9e5169"
msgid "\"Can we really leave?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 떠나도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 13_String
msgctxt "a60177ec-e05c-4d1b-b91a-b179cdfcb23b"
msgid "\"You'll never hear about me again, I promise, {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr "\"나에 대해서는 다시 듣지 못할 거야. 약속해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 14_String
msgctxt "29f8ca0e-5a18-423e-bb55-c7f82ecfa83c"
msgid "\"We'll leave at once!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 즉시 떠날 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "07b024f1-e388-41d1-8325-eb3be4e43499"
msgid "\"Don't put me to death!\""
msgstr "\"나를 죽이지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "79449842-f94e-4e58-9077-16980b62e796"
msgid "\"This… this is unfair!\""
msgstr "\"이건... 불공평하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 3_String
msgctxt "8cc6da7a-19d8-4a30-b8e6-aa8389730829"
msgid "\"What about a fair trial?\""
msgstr "\"공정한 재판은 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 4_String
msgctxt "d7df39b4-b3f2-45c1-9708-62556fb02aba"
msgid "\"Help!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 5_String
msgctxt "675804e3-b14a-4727-bb3d-0c2a91fa2aec"
msgid "\"Mercy, I beg you!\""
msgstr "\"부탁이야. 살려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 6_String
msgctxt "bde1245e-6919-4254-a464-a06c19093d2a"
msgid "\"I cannot die like this! I cannot!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이렇게 죽을 수 없다! 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 7_String
msgctxt "73a890ec-2a2d-4840-9bb9-e71d93377f48"
msgid "\"You won't dare to sentence me to death!\""
msgstr "\"나에게 사형을 선고하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 8_String
msgctxt "092b1f3d-863c-4240-8241-8db1d1b7d099"
msgid "\"You have no authority over me!\""
msgstr "\"나에게 이럴 권리는 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark 9_String
msgctxt "0c7f05e1-bc4c-4136-907c-23a40b25a7eb"
msgid "\"{mf|My Baron|My Baroness}, you are so merciful!\""
msgstr "\"정말 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/NobleMale/SecludedLodge_NobleMale_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "4a07eede-e586-47c3-81c6-688f4dc409d2"
msgid "\"I beg you, {mf|baron|baroness}!\""
msgstr "\"부탁이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "e3f1b017-87d7-4110-8866-27e482db40fd"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "67421303-96d7-43a5-8173-a39cf3fd87a0"
msgid ""
"\"We're looking for a criminal who may have fled this way. Have you seen "
"anyone suspicious?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 이 곳으로 도망친 범인을 찾고 있다. 의심스러운 사람을 본 적이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "9b25a092-87b6-44c3-ba04-0d109d044fe0"
msgid "\"What are you cooking, Tsanna?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 요리를 하는 중이지, 산나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "c778386d-1ba8-4d7b-9256-044e03fc97f5"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가봐야 겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "46ecd708-5741-4a03-9705-6164a36ff2f8"
msgid "\"What can you tell me about your masters?\""
msgstr "\"네 주인에 대해 무엇을 말해줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "3d8cba7a-9eeb-496b-98ed-97c788594fcc"
msgid "\"Why are they here, you think?\""
msgstr "\"그들이 왜 이곳에 왔다고 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "c293274c-2908-4ce3-94a6-82182f3bc797"
msgid "[Peek into the stewpot]"
msgstr "[냄비 안을 살짝 봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "e98c2280-9410-4c29-b3fe-6d65a0e9a326"
msgid "\"All right, that's enough about the Tedrims.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 테드림 부부에 대해서는 충분히 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "7b83ceeb-4aa0-445f-a970-5ddc8fea7b44"
msgid "\"The hostess of the lodge doesn't mind you cooking at her kitchen?\""
msgstr "\"이 산장의 여주인은 네가 자기 부엌에서 요리를 해도 신경쓰지 않나 보지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "71ccf633-0bb3-4967-99b7-8975c889e8e9"
msgid "\"I've heard there was a commotion here in the kitchen.\""
msgstr "\"여기 부엌에서 소동이 있었다고 들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "0de56c1c-29d2-420b-9fec-daa194c09d99"
msgid "\"That's all I need.\""
msgstr "\"필요한 내용은 전부 들은거 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "5aeb6d86-7219-487d-a55c-2f237a000237"
msgid ""
"\"It must be difficult to please nobles like the Tedrims. I imagine they ask "
"for something new for each day's meal?\""
msgstr "\"테드림과 같은 귀족들을 기쁘게 하는 건 쉽지 않겠지. 매일 새로운 요리를 원하지는 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "c6b3f377-e1b6-4f1c-bd5b-83876d3975b0"
msgid "\"All right, I won't trouble you any longer.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 더 이상 귀찮게 하지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "56576520-e04e-4e6a-943a-fae41b621b06"
msgid "\"I need the key to your room.\""
msgstr "\"네 방 열쇠가 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "e2ef4db5-5175-4415-99e4-18976a988410"
msgid "\"Has anyone come into the kitchen recently?\""
msgstr "\"최근 부엌에 들어온 사람이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "c33363f2-0729-4fb6-a5dd-2817e922fefc"
msgid ""
"\"You! You and your minions unleashed a blight across my lands! Because of "
"you monsters overrun the barony, and honest people fear to leave their homes!"
"\""
msgstr "\"너! 너와 네 부하들이 내 땅을 더럽혔어! 네 괴물들이 내 영지에서 날뛰어서 선량한 사람들이 집을 버리고 떠났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "6d0d30ad-49fb-4c37-a65d-c6127bff5904"
msgid "\"Tell me who you are. Quick now.\""
msgstr "\"네가 누군지 말해. 지금 당장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "fd867cc4-5bb8-4fcb-80e7-e814e6c291af"
msgid "\"Tell me about the cult of Lamashtu.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투 숭배에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "24c1226f-d7d8-4531-83d3-8445bc1f60eb"
msgid "\"What kind of rituals were you performing at the shrine?\""
msgstr "\"성소에서 어떤 의식을 하고 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0096_Text
msgctxt "747e3dac-baf4-4fb9-88ba-c9b45ae193d4"
msgid "\"Where are the rest of Lamashtu cultists hiding?\""
msgstr "\"나머지 라마슈투 사교도들은 어디에 숨었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "d10922d9-cb81-4a29-9b5d-0f48975d21a9"
msgid "\"Have you allied with goblins and other creatures in the area?\""
msgstr "\"이 지역에서 고블린이나 다른 생물들과 동맹을 맺었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0098_Text
msgctxt "f3aebe8e-cc57-4d89-9cef-1d4db24095d0"
msgid "\"Enough about that.\""
msgstr "\"그 정도면 충분해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "20968fff-7cff-4b80-9992-38b36b4ee3eb"
msgid "\"All these people in the lodge — are they here because of you?\""
msgstr "\"이 산장에 있는 모든 사람들. 이들 모두 너 때문에 이곳에 있는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0106_Text
msgctxt "c1886307-7484-4866-80d6-205702f0fc55"
msgid "\"The couple from Restov — did they come to meet you?\""
msgstr "\"레스토프에서 온 부부는 너를 만나러 온건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0107_Text
msgctxt "016b7787-e455-4336-b271-13629f1081ac"
msgid "\"What's the story of merchant's widow?\""
msgstr "\"상인의 미망인은 어떻게 된 이야기지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "a12f90c6-699c-4958-9a6c-c831b7356508"
msgid "\"Is the lodge hostess involved in all this?\""
msgstr "\"여주인도 모든 일에 관여하고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0109_Text
msgctxt "a4539983-787b-4cdb-bef2-23fbfd17678d"
msgid "\"Enough.\""
msgstr "\"충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0114_Text
msgctxt "95ff44f5-718f-4a65-baae-a27fa65277ad"
msgid "\"Kesten! I have an order for you!\""
msgstr "\"케스턴! 명령을 내리겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0117_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e7e8d0d3-689d-4851-9f24-009088fe449c"
msgid "Ordered to execute Lamashtu priestess and lodge guests."
msgstr "라마슈투의 여사제와 손님들을 처형하라고 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0117_Text
msgctxt "5553f67d-5b74-45db-ae10-ef07dafa6116"
msgid ""
"\"Arrest everyone except for the lodge hostess. I want them executed by "
"morning.\""
msgstr "\"여주인을 제외한 모든 사람을 체포해. 아침까지 그들을 처형해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0118_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "31231fca-ee05-459e-9511-aeacb2acef93"
msgid ""
"Pardoned the lodge guests and ordered the execution of the Lamashtu "
"priestess."
msgstr "산장 손님들을 용서하고 라마슈투의 여사제를 처형하라고 명령합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0118_Text
msgctxt "e478d04b-a482-4d83-9d07-3bd70b98a54f"
msgid "\"Send these people home. The priestess of Lamashtu must be executed.\""
msgstr "\"이 사람들을 집으로 돌려보내. 라마슈투 여사제는 처형되어야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0119_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d1efde23-21d2-4bf1-b515-5b031cc7c5f0"
msgid "Exiled the Lamashtu priestess and pardoned the other lodge guests."
msgstr "라마슈투 여사제를 추방하고 다른 손님들을 용서했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0119_Text
msgctxt "8d5d84c9-a30e-4d49-afff-22a1c7d387b8"
msgid ""
"\"These people are innocent — let them leave. As for the priestess, she's "
"banished from these lands forever. See to it she's removed from the barony "
"at once.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 사람들은 결백해. 그들은 보내줄 수 있도록. 그리고 여사제는 이 땅에서 영원히 추방한다. 그녀가 영지에서 즉시 나가는지 잘 감시해."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0120_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "db638002-87ea-4be1-9f59-55121d247c8e"
msgid "Pardoned the Lamashtu priestess and the lodge guests."
msgstr "라마슈투 여사제와 손님들을 용서했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0120_Text
msgctxt "69265d0b-51b1-4b8f-bc55-d71e77ffc38a"
msgid "\"I forgive all these people — even the priestess. Let them go.\""
msgstr "\"여사제를 포함해서 여기 모든 사람들을 용서하겠어. 그들을 보내줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0125_Text
msgctxt "64d540b8-705b-44bb-ba51-37d28cb529ea"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, Olika. The priestess will perform her ritual for you, then Kesten "
"will follow my orders. Servant of Lamashtu, are you ready to help this woman?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 올리카. 여사제는 너를 위해 의식을 할 거고 케스턴이 내 명령을 따를 거야. 라마슈투의 하인인 너는 이 여자를 도울 준비가 "
"되었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0126_Text
msgctxt "9e8786c3-0abb-4b11-9dc5-e81da278d710"
msgid ""
"\"No, Olika. There is no place in my lands for such rituals. Kesten! Execute "
"my order!\""
msgstr "\"내 땅에는 의식을 할 장소는 없다. 케스턴! 내 명령을 이행해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0131_Text
msgctxt "15b73ddf-01a0-4b22-ac3f-508b4a3f600f"
msgid "\"No, hold a moment. I want to ask the priestess something else.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐 기다려. 여사제에게 묻고 싶은 게 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0139_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "26796026-7998-4b51-9b82-e8476926b708"
msgid "Expressed disgust to the cult of Lamashtu."
msgstr "라마슈투 숭배를 혐오한다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0139_Text
msgctxt "ff5f404d-4370-45cc-84cb-b3f137f4c361"
msgid "\"It disgusts me to listen to this.\""
msgstr "\"그 말을 들으니 역겹다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0140_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d0a1e89d-da59-473e-a1d8-e1fb50e8b41e"
msgid "Expressed interest in the cult of Lamashtu."
msgstr "라마슈투 숭배에 호기심을 나타냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0140_Text
msgctxt "6173392b-fe98-4e35-9e4c-32e65b021fb0"
msgid ""
"\"The more I hear about Lamashtu, the more I favor this goddess. What else "
"can you share with me?\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투에 관해 듣게 될수록 여신에게 호감이 가는걸. 다른 것들도 말해주겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0142_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "420b5554-29a8-44ff-adad-9b149fa2aff5"
msgid "Remained indiffirent to insinuations of Lamashtu priestess."
msgstr "라마슈투 여사제의 모욕에 무관심해 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0142_Text
msgctxt "9b822fb7-457f-4cfb-af72-0c65b75bc6f4"
msgid "\"I'm not impressed by your attempts to wound my pride.\""
msgstr "\"내 자존심을 상하게 하려는 시도 치고는 시시하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0151_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b54c5678-52b7-457d-8857-1e50d142355f"
msgid "Pardoned Lamashtu priestess in return for saving unborn child."
msgstr "태어나지 않은 아이를 구해주는 대가로 라마슈투의 여사제를 용서했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0151_Text
msgctxt "d0f3df9a-a3d5-456f-a522-69530fad9369"
msgid "\"I agree.\""
msgstr "\"나는 동의한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0152_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cf9c3e34-1868-4375-a7b2-d2731b11fdd3"
msgid "Refused to pardon Lamashtu priestess in return for saving unborn child."
msgstr "태어나지 않은 아이를 구해주어도 라마슈투의 여사제를 용서하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0152_Text
msgctxt "17cc3d4b-134a-4015-8135-4b66716de3c0"
msgid "\"I don't bargain with criminals!\""
msgstr "\"나는 범죄자들과 협상하지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0190_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cb2b162e-4ded-46ec-ab0b-aa39958d5304"
msgid ""
"Approved the actions of the Lamashtu priestess, and released her and the "
"lodge guests."
msgstr "라마슈투의 여사제의 행위를 칭찬하고, 그녀와 산장의 손님들을 풀어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Answer_0190_Text
msgctxt "a5016dc1-6b98-4c4b-8af3-f9dd89d83858"
msgid ""
"\"I have nothing against Lamashtu and her flock. Priestess, you are free to "
"go.\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투와 그녀의 신도들에게 악감정은 없다. 여사제, 자유롭게 가도 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "961efbd0-219c-44d4-8975-c9e3e3c4fb28"
msgid ""
"{n}The kitchen servant is busy, grinding herbs within a mortar. She's "
"wearing a dress, soiled with dark stains, and her hair is knotted in a bun "
"with a few stray hairs poking free.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}부엌에 있는 하인은 절구에 허브를 갈며 분주합니다. 그녀가 입은 드레스는 어두운 얼룩으로 더러워졌고 땋은 머리는 머리카락 몇가닥이 "
"삐져나왔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "c0ab3d56-3948-4ce6-9049-479cf0f6b227"
msgid ""
"{n}The kitchen servant looks at you askew and keeps on grinding the herbs in "
"the mortar.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}부엌의 하인은 당신을 갸우뚱하여 보더니 계속해서 허브를 갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "333dbe4e-ebdd-413a-8c49-cc989ffa3d2c"
msgid ""
"\"Name's Tsanna, I cook for Tedrims, nobles from {g|Restov}Restov{/g}.\" {n}"
"She wipes her hands with her apron.{/n} \"What will it be?\""
msgstr ""
"\"제이름은 산나입니다. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 귀족인 테드림 부부를 위해 요리를 합니다. \" {n}그녀는 앞치마로 손을 "
"닦습니다.{/n} \"무엇 때문에 그러시죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "5ad73477-a396-4b8b-8e5e-a63fe896e45c"
msgid ""
"{n}She throws a glance at the stove. {/n} \"That there's for tomorrow.\" {n}"
"She hesitates.{/n} \"Tomorrow's mid-day meal, it is.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 화로를 힐끗 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"내일을 준비하고 있었어요.\" {n}그녀는 주저합니다.{/n} \"내일 점심 식사에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "6e4da2f9-88e8-4f1b-aa72-71fec1def409"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna frowns.{/n} \"No quicker road to trouble — talking about masters, "
"that is.\" {n}She glances at your clothes and sighs.{/n} \"How would you "
"like it if your servants were all a-gossip about you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"제 주인에 관해 별로 할 이야기가 없습니다.\" {n}그녀는 당신의 옷을 힐끗 쳐다보고는 "
"한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"당신의 하인들이 당신에 대해 흉을 보면 어떻겠어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "3b6f7e8d-48a8-43ef-84ea-557ff80d09a9"
msgid ""
"\"None of my business. Might be they have things to do, but I wouldn't know "
"it -I mend, I cook, and I serve when, where needed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가 상관할 바가 아닙니다. 각자 맡은 임무가 다른 법이니까요. 저는 몰라요. 저는 수선하고, 요리하고, 뭐 필요하시다고 하면 가져다 "
"드릴뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "ecd2509c-6491-43c0-aa50-17b33eba8237"
msgid "{n}Tsanna doesn't react.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}산나는 반응하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "e598f5a7-0bfa-40c1-90cf-25045a5b7d36"
msgid ""
"\"What can be seen here, you say?\" {n}Tsanna snorts.{/n} \"Ask Dumra, she "
"runs the house, she does.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기서 누군가 봤냐고 물으시는건가요?\" {n}산나는 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"덤라에게 물어보세요. 그녀가 이 집을 운영하니 "
"알꺼에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "af9346a2-1cf5-448d-87b3-b0d0266adaec"
msgid ""
"\"As if she came here often herself!\" {n}She throws up her hands.{/n} "
"\"Filth piled in corners, the floor sandal-deep in dirt… had to work my "
"fingers to bones to clean the kitchen before I could start a proper meal in "
"this…\" She curls her lip. \"...this cowshed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 여기에 자주 와 보기나 해야 말이죠!\" {n}그녀는 양 손을 들어 올립니다.{/n} \"구석은 오물로 쌓여있고 바닥은 먼지가 "
"가득해요... 요리하기 전에 손가락이 닳도록 부엌을 청소해야 했어요...\"그녀는 입술을 깨뭅니다. \"...이 돼지우리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "0bbe6dd1-d843-4d49-ae76-1870b6f2a3e6"
msgid ""
"\"Wha?\" {n}She looks at you, confused for a moment, then brightens.{/n} \"Ah"
"! You meaning the pots. I knocked some off the stove. Haven't had time to "
"hang them back up — that witch Dumra stormed here at once, all thundercloud-"
"like! Howling as if I'd broken her finest crystal!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐?\" {n}그녀는 당신을 보고 잠시 혼란스러워 하더니 웃습니다.{/n} \"아! 냄비를 말하는 거야? 화로에 떨어뜨렸어. 다시 "
"걸어놔야 했는데 그 때 덤라가 시끄럽게 소리쳤어! 마치 자기 보물을 깨뜨린 것처럼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "611ff9f8-1a8b-422b-ab5b-f42cd9fd17ec"
msgid ""
"{n}She waves her hand and turns back to tend the stew boiling at the "
"stove.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그녀는 손을 흔들고 뒤돌아 화로에서 끓는 스튜를 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "c31c03e9-4d4a-4366-9622-9ab9c5b9a39c"
msgid ""
"{n}You take the lid off the pan. Some brew boils inside. It looks strange "
"and smells odd. You lean over, smell the stew...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 냄비에서 뚜껑을 들어올립니다. 국물이 안에서 끓고 있습니다. 생김새와 냄새도 이상합니다. 당신은 몸을 숙여 냄새를 "
"맡습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "60e54365-771d-41b0-9352-30987ddd6588"
msgid ""
"{n}…and immediately flinch: the acrid stink of vinegar feels like a punch in "
"the face, besides you can smell some strange spice, which would be "
"appropriate in a dessert, but not in a first course for dinner.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}... 그리고는 즉시 뒷걸음질 칩니다. 식초의 악취가 얼굴을 강타한 것 같았고, 게다가 당신은 뭔가 이상한 향신료 냄새를 맡을 수 "
"있었습니다. 이것은 굶었을 때나 먹을 만하지 저녁 만찬은 아닙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "0071c3ca-8b20-40f1-8fd5-af370d790c78"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna thinks about it. {/n} \"Yes.\" {n}She hesitates, then nods.{/n} "
"\"That's it, I s'ppose.\""
msgstr "{n}산나는 생각합니다.{/n} \"예.\" {n}그녀는 망설이고는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래요. 그렇겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "ebfb670d-d360-42fb-a907-4dc70e1e8ada"
msgid "\"You have my thanks.\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "8f24c2c0-1d39-4440-ad6b-bc4f137099e9"
msgid ""
"\"Room?\" {n}She raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"I don't have a room 'cept here in "
"the kitchen. Bed's a bench. Still — warm enough, though.\""
msgstr ""
"\"방이요?\" {n}그녀는 눈썹을 치켜올립니다.{/n} \"저는 여기 부엌 말고는 방 같은건 없습니다. 의자가 곧 침대죠. 그래도 "
"충분히 따뜻한걸요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "2f9f85b3-d552-475c-bafb-60c4fef4dfa9"
msgid ""
"\"They pay regular, not stingy with their coin. They don't yell — much. So I "
"count myself fortunate, I do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 인색하지 않아서 항상 제때 돈을 주셨어요. 소리도 많이 지르는 편은 아니구요. 그래서 저는 운이 좋은 것 같다고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "36d0542c-758e-4dff-8fa3-bd01e474216b"
msgid ""
"\"Only Dumra came.\" {n}She frowns.{/n} \"No doubt checking to see I'm not "
"palming the silver. As if there's anything worth stealing here, so there's "
"not.\""
msgstr ""
"\"덤라만 왔었어요.\" {n}그녀는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"내가 뭔가 훔치지 않는지 보러 온 게 분명해요. 여기에 훔칠만한거라도 있으면 "
"모를까, 그럴만한건 여기 아무것도 없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "26e9a37c-da9e-498c-ba02-d726216496b2"
msgid ""
"\"Stop! Stop! I surrender! I surrender!\" {n}The priestess of "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} holds her hands over her bleeding wounds, moaning "
"in pain.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그만! 그만! 항복할게!\" {n}{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 여사제는 상처를 움켜잡고 고통에 신음합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "d2713fd2-a90d-4e2f-8cd4-18d8f3ffb3ed"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} shakes her head and tries to "
"close her wounds, moaning.{/n} \"That's nonsense! I've heard the stories "
"about what's happening in your barony, {race}, but I have nothing to do with "
"this!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 여사제는 머리를 흔들고는 신음하며 상처를 감싸려고 합니다.{/n} \"말도 안돼! 네 "
"영지에서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지는 들었지만, {race}! 나는 이 일과 아무 상관이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "db63bbee-a211-4f97-9cec-f9e3f54acad4"
msgid ""
"\"The Great Mother rules the monsters of this world. But if you had truly "
"earned her wrath, your lands would be drowning in blood! No, "
"{mf|baron|baroness}, you must look elsewhere to place blame — "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} and her followers have nothing to do with your "
"troubles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"위대한 어머니는 이 세상의 괴물들을 다스리지. 하지만 당신이 정말 그녀의 분노를 샀다면, 당신의 땅은 피에 잠기게 될꺼야! 아니야, "
"{mf|남작|여남작}, 누군가에게 죄를 묻고 싶다면 다른곳을 찾아봐야 해 - {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}와 그녀의 추종자들은, 당신 땅에서 일어난 일과는 "
"아무 관련이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "f6c1adea-6c80-4ee8-b3de-077f3a88f108"
msgid ""
"\"I am the priestess of the cult of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, The Great "
"Mother, The Ancestress of Monsters.\" {n}The priestess struggles to raise "
"her chin, her voice a hiss. {/n} \"I'm not from these lands. I came because "
"of the pleas of your people, who seek the mercy of my goddess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 괴물들의 조상이자, 위대한 어머니이신 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 여사제다. {n}여사제는 고개를 치켜올리려고 애쓰며, "
"목소리는 쉰소리를 냅니다.{/n} \"나는 이 땅으로부터 온게 아니다. 나는 여신의 자비를 구하는 너희 백성들의 간청 때문에 이곳에 왔다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "1db604b1-1268-46cf-8f09-dcb32c0be7d3"
msgid ""
"\"I came to these lands in secret and hid my identity from everyone except "
"for those initiated in the mysteries of {g|Lamashtu}Great Mother{/g}. Even "
"the hostess of this lodge had no idea who I was! And those looking for "
"divine benefaction, found me on their own — and there are more than the "
"followers of {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} would believe!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 비밀스럽게 이 땅에 들어와 {g|Lamashtu}위대한 어머니{/g}를 섬기기 시작하는 사람들을 제외하고는 모두에게 나의 정체를 "
"숨겼다. 이 산장의 여주인도 내 정체를 전혀 모르고 있었어! 그리고 여신의 은총을 받아들이기 원하는 자들은 스스로 나를 찾아왔다. 이제 "
"{g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}의 숭배자보다 더 많은 사람들이 라마슈투를 믿고 있을꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "84c65fce-9e2b-4473-a2d9-8108129cfe3f"
msgid ""
"\"We are numerous and we are strong. The tribe of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} "
"followers grows every day… breeds… and spreads over the lands of "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} in search for places to create new packs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 수없이 많다. 그리고 우리는 강하다. {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 추종자들은 매일...번식하고.. 자라나고 "
"있다... 그리고 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} 전역에 퍼져나가 새로운 무리를 만들 장소를 찾고있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0099_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "7be2f6c4-9ad7-46e6-b226-af894edf2fd3"
msgid ""
"\"We prayed to {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}. We asked for new offsprings in the "
"pack. We mated like wild animals, free of stupid prejudices...\" {n}"
"Priestess' lips curve in a grin.{/n} \"I'll spare you the details, {race} — "
"those like you are unable to accept the greatness of our ancient faith.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}에게 기도했다. 우리는 새로운 자손이 생기기를 간청했다. 우리는 바보같은 편견에서 벗어나 "
"야생동물처럼 짝짓기를 했다.\" {n}여사제의 입술이 휘어지며 교활한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"자세한 이야기는 말하지 않겠다. "
"{race}. 너희같은 자들은 우리 고대 신앙의 위대함을 받아들이지 못할꺼야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0100_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "4b53cbe0-aab4-4277-99cc-1512575df1d9"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman's face turns to stone.{/n} \"You cannot make me betray the "
"children of Great Mother. Torture me if you like — {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} "
"will grant me the strength to endure any pain you inflict upon me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자의 얼굴이 돌처럼 굳습니다.{/n} \"위대한 어머니의 자녀를 배반할 수는 없다. 원한다면 나를 고문해라. "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}는 당신들이 가하는 어떤 고통도 견딜 수 있는 힘을 주실테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0101_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "c815a232-adea-4778-a2a6-c3022b0f6a05"
msgid ""
"\"No. We have the same mistress, but our paths to faith are different.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 우리에겐 같은 주인이 있지만, 믿음의 길은 모두 다르다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0102_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "edc1769d-da98-422e-881f-b06f20db0d31"
msgid "\"I held no illusions you could grasp the wisdom of my goddess.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 우리 여신의 지혜를 이해할 수 있을 거라는 환상은 어차피 갖지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "1b7fa172-80fa-44be-8e8e-92c85e6a3637"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess shakes her head.{/n} \"They were searching for the blessing "
"of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}. Other gods have denied them and they had to ask "
"Mother of Monsters for her benefaction.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여사제가 고개를 가로젓습니다.{/n} \"그들은 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 축복을 찾고 있었다. 다른 신들은 그들을 "
"버렸고, 그들은 괴물들의 어머니의 도움을 받아야 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0110_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "17f0b9b7-3c2e-402d-80f5-68d9d20563bc"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess of Lamashtu looks at Dumra in disgust.{/n} \"This "
"thoughtless thing? No. She did not see, was not smart enough to see what was "
"transpiring under her nose. I won't offend the name of "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} by calling our hostess one of Her tribe.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}라마슈투의 여사제는 덤라를 혐오스럽게 봅니다.{/n} \"저 생각 없는 것이? 아니다. 그녀는 보지 못했고, 자기 옆에서 무슨 일이 "
"일어나고 있는지 볼만큼 똑똑하지도 못하다. 나는 이곳 여주인의 이름을 불러 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 이름을 더럽히지 않겠다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0111_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "0d36a52e-ffe2-468f-9b94-032950cedd35"
msgid "{n}The priestess glares at you, hatred and contempt in her eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}여사제는 당신을 노려보았고 그녀의 눈에는 증오와 경멸이 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0112_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "2ee92fbb-97cd-4b34-9598-77aef52ec22d"
msgid ""
"\"Olika, Olika, Olika… She's a poor girl clinging to the unborn life in her "
"womb. The seed of her husband was too weak — Olika's child is doomed to "
"perish before coming to this world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"올리카, 올리카... 아직 태어나지 않은 생명에 매달리는 불쌍한 여인. 그녀의 남편의 씨앗은 너무나 약해서 이 세상에 태어나기 전에 "
"죽을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "d64f2519-ab5e-441a-9828-7c386fcfdd41"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Several years ago the lawyer defended a necromancer in a court in his "
"native city — and he won the trial. Since then all Tedrim's attempts to "
"conceive a child were doomed to fail — {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} didn't want "
"to prolong the bloodline of a man who protected those who raise the dead. "
"Una has more brains than her spineless mate, so she'd sought the support of "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}. The child, of course, will bear the mark of "
"goddess. but Tedrim's don't have much choice — Pharasma's memory is long.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 몇년 전 변호사가 법정에서 네크로맨서를 변호했다. 그리고 재판에서 이겼지. 그 후로 아이를 가지려는 테드림 부부의 모든 노력은 "
"실패할 수밖에 없는 운명이었다. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}는 죽은 자를 되살리는 자를 보호하려는 자의 후손은 원하지 않기 "
"때문이다. 우나는 멍청한 남편보다는 똑똑해서 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 도움을 원했다. 물론 태어난 아이는 라마슈투의 표식을 "
"가지고 태어나게 되지. 그러나 테드림 부부에겐 선택의 여지가 없다. 파라즈마는 기억력이 매우 좋으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0115_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "f9f47bf1-b0b9-4648-95b4-7ca65fe5be36"
msgid "{n}Kesten turns to you.{/n} \"Your Grace?\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"네, 영주님\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0121_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "68a05cb6-4057-4780-9157-3fe1bddc8415"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten hesitates.{/n} \"Your Grace... I realize these people are guilty "
"and must be punished. But I will not harm a pregnant woman. She will be sent "
"home.\" {n}Kesten's face hardens.{/n} \"That is the only resolution to this "
"matter.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 주저합니다.{/n} \"영주님... 이 사람들이 유죄이고 처벌을 받아야 한다는 건 알고 있습니다. 하지만 저는 임신한 여성은 해칠 수 없습니다. 그녀는 "
"집에 가야 합니다.\" {n}케스턴의 얼굴이 굳어집니다.{/n} \"이것이 이 문제에 대한 유일한 해결책입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0124_Text
#. Speaker : SeculdedLodge_MerchantsWife
msgctxt "0e7e05e3-e3c9-456c-91d2-42a1048cfbd1"
msgid ""
"\"Your Grace! Wait!\" {n}You can barely hear Olika's words through her "
"sobs.{/n} \"Let me ask you! No, let me beg you! Allow the priestess to "
"perform one last ritual! Let her save my child! I have no other hope except "
"for Tsanna!\""
msgstr ""
"\"영주님! 잠시만요!\" {n}당신은 올리카가 흐느끼면서 하는 말을 간신히 들을 수 있었습니다.{/n} \"하나만 물어볼게요! 아니, 부탁할게요! 여사제가 마지막으로 의식을 한 번만 "
"하게 해주세요! 그녀가 내 아이를 구하게 해주세요! 저는 산나 말고는 희망이 없어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0127_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "484b28aa-de0d-473a-9aa5-ebe854eca496"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten looks at you as if you're mad.{/n} \"Let them go? All of them?! "
"But...\" {n}He hesitates for a moment, then seems to remember his place and "
"nods calmly. {/n} \"As you command, Your Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 당신을 미친 사람보듯 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그들을 풀어 주라는 겁니까? 그들 모두를?! 하지만...\" {n}그는 잠시 "
"주저하고는 이 장소를 기억하려는 것처럼 보이더니 침착하게 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"알겠습니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0130_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "510541fd-5774-443e-9813-1368dc3ed5db"
msgid ""
"{n}She raises the hem of her skirt and starts to wipe away the blood from "
"her legs. Her right leg is covered with sores, oozing pus and yellow "
"ichor.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 치마의 자락을 들어올렸고 다리에서 흐르는 피를 닦아내기 시작합니다. 그녀의 오른 다리는 노란색 고름이 흐르는 상처로 "
"뒤덮여있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0132_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "ef5b9561-1062-4181-aed5-38c569dfb522"
msgid ""
"{n}The cultist of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} looks at you with unblinking "
"eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 사교도는 눈도 깜빡하지 않고 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0133_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "ca3b8bf0-ebb0-4576-948d-ee96ab17110b"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten throws a tired look over the lodge and rubs his chin.{/n} \"That's "
"all.\" {n}He looks around the lodge.{/n} \"We'll deal with these people as "
"you've ordered. I suppose it'll be a relief to Dumra to get rid of such "
"troubling guests.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 산장 천장을 피곤한 눈빛으로 보고는 턱을 문지릅니다.{/n} \"이제 끝이군요.\" {n}그는 산장 주위를 "
"둘러봅니다.{/n} \"영주님께서 명령하신 대로 이 자들을 처리하겠습니다. 문제가 되는 손님을 치워줘야 덤라도 안심하겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0134_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_Kesten
msgctxt "e3bc00d5-604d-4e7e-8de9-67516c124507"
msgid ""
"\"I thank you, Your Grace, for your help and for your wisdom. A pity we "
"didn't discover the true reason behind the blight, but at least we have one "
"less mystery on our hands. Have a safe journey, {mf|My Baron|My Baroness}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}, 당신의 도움과 지혜에 감사드립니다. 유감스럽게도 질병의 진짜 원인을 발견하진 못했습니다만, 최소한 "
"미스터리 하나는 줄였군요. 그럼, 안전한 여행을 하시기를, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0135_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "6e1ceb47-3990-4fb1-8109-f29c02759bd8"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman doesn't appear to notice you as she makes her way to the stove —"
" you notice she's limping badly on her right leg. Before you can speak, she "
"turns, sees you, and freezes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 화로 쪽으로 다가가면서 당신을 보지 못한 것 같습니다. 당신은 그녀가 오른 다리를 심하게 절뚝거리는 것을 알아챘습니다. "
"당신이 말 걸기전에, 그녀가 몸을 돌려 당신을 발견하고는 얼어붙습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0138_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "5f5d5ac8-b82b-4405-a6b6-a7f97b4921ea"
msgid ""
"{n}Hearing your footsteps, the woman raises her head and looks at you.{/n} "
"\"Need something, do you?\""
msgstr "{n}당신의 발소리를 듣고 여성은 고개를 들어 당신을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"뭔가가 필요해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0141_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "68de4b16-f3d4-41d8-b015-a9ad10ef3728"
msgid "\"Narrow-minded creatures, living by stupid human laws.\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 인간의 법에 의해 살아가는 편협한 생명체들.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0143_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "6e43d7c3-7900-414e-bd6d-326da2486454"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess chuckles.{/n} \"Of course, {mf|baron|baroness}. Let us sit "
"here like friends and have a heart-to-heart!\""
msgstr "{n}여사제는 웃습니다.{/n} \"물론이지. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 여기에 앉아 친구처럼 터놓고 얘기하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0144_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "86ed23fe-462b-4938-967d-1a9379e5f6c5"
msgid "{n}The priestess says nothing, her eyes filled with contempt.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}여사제는 아무말도 하지 않았고 그녀의 눈은 경멸로 가득합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0148_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "ead8bc02-2988-497b-8a50-d593c58d5ac0"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess spits at your feet. {/n} \"Then {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} "
"will enjoy the suffering of this woman to the full!\" {n}Shocked, Olika "
"steps aside and hides her face in her hands.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}여사제는 당신의 발치에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"그렇다면 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}는 이 여성의 고통을 즐길 것이다!\""
" {n}올리카는 놀라서 옆으로 비켜섰고 손으로 얼굴을 가렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0149_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c581936e-7d18-41cc-8a9e-3f618796ae9e"
msgid "Pardoned the Lamashtu priestess in return for saving unborn child."
msgstr "태어나지 않은 아이를 구해주는 대가로 라마슈투의 여사제를 용서했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0149_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "ae853709-5b7f-4dcb-94b6-f2b388e464d0"
msgid ""
"\"You may think of me whatever you like, but I have a duty to my pack. I'll "
"help Olika, and the child will be born as a symbol of "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} grace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 어떻게 생각해도 좋지만 나는 사람들을 책임져야 한다. 나는 올리카를 도와 아이가 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 은혜를 "
"받게 할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0150_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "8b440bbe-8592-4e3a-a449-c45e1d12c689"
msgid ""
"\"Only if you'll change my death sentence to banishment. Let me go — in "
"return, I'll help Olika, then after that will leave these lands forever!\""
msgstr "\"사형선고를 사라지게 할 수 있다면. 나를 살려주면 올리카를 돕고 이 땅을 영원히 떠날 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0157_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "87d59ccb-368b-4373-9f64-44f0adbf9de1"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you a merry bunch!\" {n}Octavia giggles, waving her finger "
"tauntingly at the priestess.{/n} \"But you know, {g|Calistria}Calistria's{/g}"
" faithful have a lot of fun, too — just without the risk of growing a pair "
"of tentacles in the process!\""
msgstr ""
"\"웃기시네!\" {n}옥타비아는 깔깔 웃으며 여사제를 비웃는 듯 손가락을 흔들며 조롱합니다.{/n} \"하지만 너도 알다시피 "
"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}에 대한 신앙도 웃긴 편이지만 촉수 같은 것은 몸에서 안나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0158_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "ad65265b-7ffe-4bd2-a21b-aaff941a893a"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you dare compare your frivolous goddess to ours, who's as old as the "
"world itself! Your orgies are little more than entertainment for bored "
"townsfolk. Ours are full of primordial wisdom!\""
msgstr ""
"\"감히 네 천박한 여신과 우리의 신을 비교하지 마. 우리 신은 이 세계가 생길 때부터 있었어! 네 지저분한 의식은 지루한 마을사람들을 "
"위한 오락거리에 불과하지 않아. 우리의 의식은 태초의 지혜로 가득하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0159_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "724a24d2-0f83-49fe-b821-f3948169dc3d"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie winces.{/n} \"Could we please skip the theological debate over "
"which cult has better orgies?\""
msgstr "{n}발레리가 찡그립니다.{/n} \"어떤 신의 의식이 더 난잡한지 비교하는 이론 논쟁은 다음에 하면 안되겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0162_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "dd7d0680-fec6-4143-ac89-82c615778cd9"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure about that?\" {n}The half-orc bares his fangs in a grin. "
"Sparks dance along his fingers.{/n}"
msgstr "\"확실해?\" {n}하프오크는 미소를 지으며 그의 송곳니를 드러냅니다. 그의 손가락을 따라 불꽃이 춤을 춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0166_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5239dc52-9c1f-4656-a912-24017fb8ffc3"
msgid ""
"\"The culprit has confessed her crimes. It's time to announce the verdict!\""
msgstr "\"범인은 그녀의 범죄를 자백했어. 심판을 내릴 때가 되었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0168_Text
#. Speaker : SecludedLodge_HighPriestessOfLamashtu
msgctxt "b45725c5-f146-4357-a7a9-616b1e4dc017"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna blinks and sweeps her eyes over you as if just noticing your "
"presence.{/n} \"Well then... It seems I shall serve the Great Mother in "
"these lands a little longer. If you wish to speak or ask for something, come "
"to the Shrine of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} — that is where you'll find me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 눈을 깜빡이더니 그제서야 당신의 존재를 알아차린 듯 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그렇다면... 이 땅에서 위대한 어머니를 "
"좀 더 섬길 수 있을것 같군. 뭔가 말할게 있거나 부탁할 것이 있다면 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 성소로 찾아오기를. 그곳에서 "
"나를 찾을 수 있을것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0171_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a90903c8-ec70-4651-a6c2-ed01a296303f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian moves closer to you.{/n} \"Please be merciful to these people. "
"Imagine how great their despair must be to turn to the monstrous "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} for help. Though the thought disgusts me, the "
"priestess did try to help them... in whatever way she could.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신에게 더 가까이 다가갑니다.{/n} \"이 사람들에게 자비를 베풀어 주십시오. 그들이 "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}에게 도움을 청하기까지 절망감이 얼마나 컸을지 상상해보십시오. 비록 그 생각이 혐오스럽긴 하지만 "
"여사제는 그들을 도우려고 노력했습니다. 무슨 수를 써서라도 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0181_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e11b0291-e42d-4cda-be03-a5b7bc332da3"
msgid ""
"\"You outran me, Kesten. I could hardly allow this... abomination to happen."
"\" {n}Tristian gloomily looks to the others responsible.{/n} \"Though the "
"death of the other petitioners will be a stain on your conscience, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 내 명령을 어겼어. 케스턴. 나는 이 끔찍한 일이 일어나는 것을 허락하지 않겠어...\" {n}트리스티안은 책임있는 다른 "
"사람들을 우울하게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"그들이 죽는다면 네 명성이 더럽혀지는 거지만. {name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0182_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9c2eec3c-9975-4e3d-8935-31dc8d793107"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie folds her hands across her chest and looks at you with "
"interest.{/n} \"The priestess's guilt is obvious to me. The others... not so "
"much.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 팔짱을 끼고 당신을 흥미롭게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"제가 보기엔 여사제의 죄는 명백합니다. 다른 자들은... 죄가 크진 "
"않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0185_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "062a43c9-e824-4982-8dc7-cd136170f358"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks at you like you just grew a new set of horns. Then she "
"rolls her eyes and silently turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 당신에게 뿔이 자라난 것처럼 당신을 봅니다. 이내, 그녀는 눈을 굴리더니 조용히 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_0188_Text_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7c267069-1ffc-4234-ae72-7a5e257abdcb"
msgid "\"Harsh. But fair. Befitting a true ruler.\""
msgstr "\"가혹하긴 하지만 공정하다. 진정한 통치자에 어울린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/Cue_TristianHappy_String
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "04638f93-477f-4b4f-a1c5-066ca03b9795"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you gratefully.{/n} \"I don't think the {g|Stolen Lands}"
"Stolen Lands{/g} have ever seen someone as kind and noble as you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고마운 듯 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"이 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 당신처럼 친절하고 고귀한 "
"사람을 본 적이 없을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/SecludedLodge_Priestess_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "427689b8-dc6f-4c2a-8c63-ed48063f69b5"
msgid "\"Tha... thank you.\""
msgstr "\"고... 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/SecludedLodge_Priestess_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "24befc87-990a-4daf-9408-6f2d7cd490ce"
msgid "[The priestess gives you a sullen look and remains silent]"
msgstr "[여사제는 당신을 심술궂게 보더니 침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SecludedLodge/Priestess/SecludedLodge_Priestess_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "65d1cf81-25aa-400a-9511-04aff290a8ca"
msgid "\"I'm surprised, Baron{mf||ess}.\""
msgstr "\"네가 그럴 줄은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Altar_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "d12f6e4f-b5ff-45c8-9e37-8bd6fa7c2814"
msgid "Altar"
msgstr "제단"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 10_SharedText_String
msgctxt "63cbc9c8-5413-438a-8993-67408c88862c"
msgid "\"A glorious day!\""
msgstr "\"영광스러운 날이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 11_SharedText_String
msgctxt "48774c37-0f1b-45bf-b710-aee508365e53"
msgid "\"We are here, Lamashtu!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 여기에 왔습니다! 라마슈투!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 12_SharedText_String
msgctxt "a512ba25-afa7-4e37-a7ef-d5791d089650"
msgid "\"I've seen the cub!\""
msgstr "\"내가 그 아이를 보았노라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 13_SharedText_String
msgctxt "8393f1d5-3b53-494b-9882-2b54e15cc51a"
msgid "\"Yes! At last!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 마침내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 14_SharedText_String
msgctxt "83a76912-427b-471d-b2a9-5815233c795d"
msgid "\"She has Lamashtu's mark on her body!\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 몸에 라마슈투의 표식을 지니고 있노라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 15_SharedText_String
msgctxt "134a8cb6-2ad1-4592-9105-0cc10633e7c1"
msgid "\"Tell us your bidding!\""
msgstr "\"우리에게 당신의 명령을 내려주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 16_SharedText_String
msgctxt "f96e2c18-f22b-4043-a66c-d57336a919de"
msgid "\"We honor the goddess!\""
msgstr "\"여신에게 영광을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 17_SharedText_String
msgctxt "5e1dcfd6-5f0e-4bb2-8e1a-337ac6603500"
msgid "\"We need no weaklings!\""
msgstr "\"우리에게 약한자는 필요 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 18_SharedText_String
msgctxt "bf8463f1-45b1-4ee8-a798-562ac814b2b2"
msgid "\"Glory to the Mother of Monsters!\""
msgstr "\"괴물들의 어머니에게 영광을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 19_SharedText_String
msgctxt "49bfb52a-fb9c-49c0-9c3b-31e0864b9d60"
msgid "\"Glory to Lamashtu!\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투에게 영광을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "98098a6e-931e-4301-a545-8a4c843f7a5d"
msgid ""
"\"Come to me, Lamashtu's children. Today we praise our great Mother, who "
"imbued Adela's cub with life.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 와라. 라마슈투의 아이들아. 오늘 우리는 아델라의 새끼에게 생명을 준 우리의 위대한 어머니를 찬양할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 20_SharedText_String
msgctxt "48859fd5-3f90-466b-9c35-b3453c35ced8"
msgid "\"I'll cut my hand off! Pass me the knife!\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 손을 잘라 버릴거야! 칼을 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "83bdb83c-a8f4-4bc8-8550-28a893ce40f1"
msgid "\"Praise the Mother of Beasts!\""
msgstr "\"짐승의 어머니를 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 3_SharedText_String
msgctxt "a58df367-9cc2-4ac1-9b61-188a447b5c1f"
msgid "\"Praise the sacred divine!\""
msgstr "\"신성한 신을 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 4_SharedText_String
msgctxt "bbbb5a80-59be-4463-982e-93e4f785730b"
msgid "\"Now is the best time to surprise them. Onwards!\""
msgstr "\"지금 그들을 기습할 가장 좋은 때야. 앞으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 5_SharedText_String
msgctxt "6754428b-dffe-45a9-a7e5-ac04bdef70a9"
msgid ""
"\"Lamashtu favors us! She blessed the pack with a new cub! A beautiful "
"female cub, marked by the goddess sacred touch!\""
msgstr ""
"\"라마슈투는 우리를 축복하신다. 그녀는 새로운 아이를 태어나게 했다! 아름다운 여자아이가 여신의 성스러운 손길로 징표를 얻게 된다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 6_SharedText_String
msgctxt "5c09b79d-5efb-4cad-9b17-1d790f196ce5"
msgid ""
"\"The goddess took cub mother's life as a payment. What a worthless female "
"she was, only able to bear a single child! Goddess grants, her daughter will "
"be more fertile.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여신은 대가로 아이 어머니의 생명을 가져가셨다. 그녀는 한 아이밖에 낳지못한, 쓸모없는 여자였으니! 여신께서 허락하신다면 그녀의 딸은 "
"더 많은 아이를 낳으리라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 7_SharedText_String
msgctxt "4ce00747-7ec4-4612-b019-ea3cb32a8b96"
msgid "\"Life for life!\""
msgstr "\"생명에는 생명으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 8_SharedText_String
msgctxt "43689fd2-313a-40d3-99ad-4a844811efb5"
msgid ""
"\"Praise the Mother of Monsters, the lifegiver! Attach yourselves to the "
"waters of Lamashtu, open up your veins and embelish your bodies with the "
"scars in the name of the goddess!\""
msgstr "\"생명을 주시는, 괴물들의 어머니를 찬양해라! 라마슈투의 물에 몸을 담그고, 피를 흘려 네 몸을 상처로 정화해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark 9_SharedText_String
msgctxt "2ff43e72-6c5a-4f86-851f-9fd464e1dc81"
msgid "\"I shall carve her image on my chest!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가슴에 그녀의 이미지를 새겨넣을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Arrival/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "470c47be-cfb8-48e8-ae06-b8b6bb8118fd"
msgid "\"Look, Your Grace! The cultists!\""
msgstr "\"보십시오! 영주님! 사교도들입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Kesten/CommandAction_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "9c93bb26-27c8-4275-b323-1e3dff6fe321"
msgid "\"What are you waiting for?! He's going to get away!\""
msgstr "\"뭘 기다리고 있습니까? 그가 달아나고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Kesten/CommandAction_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "021cff46-236f-46b4-9e9f-0e8fa7cc9ddf"
msgid "\"Please, hurry, I beg of you!\""
msgstr "\"제발! 서둘러! 부탁이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Kesten/CommandAction_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "6fa45ab6-c9c7-42a5-bf98-9ad1509542e1"
msgid "\"{mf|Baron|Baroness}, we need to hurry and catch the cultist!\""
msgstr "\"서둘러. 사교도를 잡아야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Kesten/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "9f93bc08-6b40-424b-b1df-d20134c9a1d3"
msgid ""
"\"Hells, one escaped! We need to catch him, otherwise another altar will "
"soon appear someplace else!\""
msgstr "\"젠장. 하나가 도망쳤어! 그를 잡지 않으면 다른 곳에 제단을 세울 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Cutscene_Runaway/CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "59a02217-10b7-4d63-af0f-219dce029162"
msgid "\"Curses upon you! Lamashtu will avenge her children!\""
msgstr "\"저주가 내릴지니! 라마슈투는 그녀의 자식들의 복수를 할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/ShrineOfLamashtu_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "a0f0e75d-f8f8-4b0e-ad41-2a4057ce6e76"
msgid "The stone is covered with strange images."
msgstr "이 돌은 이상한 그림으로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/ShrineOfLamashtu_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "66f6233f-a93f-46e2-84fa-d1575ac0768f"
msgid ""
"Statue portrays Mother of Monsters, a pregnant woman with three-eyed jackal "
"head and feathered wings."
msgstr "조각상은 괴물들의 어머니를 눈이 세개 달린 자칼의 머리를 하고 깃털 달린 날개를 한 임신한 여성으로 묘사하고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/ShrineOfLamashtu_WhatToBark 3_String
msgctxt "646ab71a-bfc0-4dab-8a85-104936d8afed"
msgid "A statue of woman with a jackal head looms over the shrine."
msgstr "여성의 석상은 자칼의 머리를 했고 성소를 내려다보고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/ShrineOfLamashtu_WhatToBark 4_String
msgctxt "e9dc092e-17aa-4fd4-91e3-069d73bf9ddc"
msgid ""
"Flat stone is covered with blood and littered with skulls and bones — all "
"that is left from nauseating rituals."
msgstr "평평한 돌은 피로 덮여 있고 두개골과 뼈들이 흩어져 있습니다. 모든 것은 구역질 나는 의식으로 생긴 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/ShrineOfLamashtu_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "db40883d-a293-4b9e-9719-1c19c9d6503b"
msgid "Stone stele is smeared with blood."
msgstr "돌 비석에 피가 묻어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Statue_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "c91eed5f-e1a5-480f-8cb9-93da9e053b28"
msgid "Statue"
msgstr "조각상"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Barks/Stone_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "2941d75a-fde8-4dcf-b34e-fc72ba36a9f7"
msgid "Stone"
msgstr "돌"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Item/Lamashtu_words_Name_String
msgctxt "7829b08e-2a49-402c-b29f-72d65d7903b7"
msgid "Bloodstained Piece of a Manuscript"
msgstr "피가 묻은 종이"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Item/Lamashtu_words_String
msgctxt "73f37f11-c94c-4c05-bcd0-af127e60fc54"
msgid ""
"\"…crushing bone. Hear me. Each word I speak shall turn to stone. The world "
"shall shudder at my word. Open your eyes and see. The world becomes "
"beautiful. Burnt forests stretching to the horizon. Mounds of bodies. "
"Blackened skies. Skulls littering the coasts like gravel. I, the one who "
"renders the flesh of her enemies, take in this beauty. All living beings "
"tremble at my sight. Bow to me. Search. Search the children of Shelyn. Tear "
"them apart. Destroy them. No. Transform them. Grant them the gift of "
"rebirth. Let them become beautiful. Befitting the beauty I shall bring into "
"this world. Oh Great Lamashtu, the eater of hearts, reveal your truth to us. "
"We hear your call. All of you shall live in a better world. Curse Pazuzu. "
"The flying worm. He shall fall in this war. Soon. Myriads of warriors under "
"my command. The mountains themselves shall crumble at our feet. Burn all. "
"Make the world beautiful. The ground thirsts for blood. I thirst for beauty. "
"Give birth to beasts. I shall...\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 뼈를 빻아라. 내 말을 들어라. 내 말은 돌처럼 굳건해질 거야. 세상은 내 말에 벌벌 떨 거야. 눈을 뜨고 보아. 세상은 "
"아름다워질 테니. 지평선 너머 숲이 불타고 있어. 시체가 산처럼 쌓였다. 하늘은 어두워진다. 해골이 해변의 자갈처럼 굴러다닐 거야. "
"그녀의 적의 살을 취하는 나는 그 모습을 감상할 것이다. 모든 생명은 내 시야 밑에서 떨 거야. 나에게 절을 할 거야. 찾아. 셸린의 "
"아이들을 찾아. 그들을 파괴해라. 그들을 찢어버려. 아니. 그들을 다시 태어나게 해라. 그들에게 아름다움을 주어라. 세상에 아름다움을 "
"퍼뜨리리라. 위대한 라마슈투시여. 심장을 먹고 우리에게 진실을 보여주소서. 우리는 당신의 부름을 듣습니다. 너희 모두는 더 나은 세상에서 "
"살 것이다. 파추추를 저주해라. 파리 같은 녀석. 그는 이 전쟁에서 곧 죽을 것이다. 수많은 전사가 내 명령을 듣는다. 산이 내 발치에 "
"무너질 것이다. 모든 것을 태워라. 세상을 더 아름답게 만들어라. 땅은 피에 목이 말랐다. 나는 아름다움이 필요하다. 짐승에게 생명을 "
"주어라. 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Answer_81489_Text
msgctxt "762ed49e-845a-4055-aa3a-93a3fdac377d"
msgid "\"Are we ready for ambush?\""
msgstr "\"매복 준비는 다 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Answer_81491_Text
msgctxt "521f68c5-4cd6-463a-a5d1-d2050b97e0e4"
msgid "\"I've received your letter, Kesten, and came as soon as I could.\""
msgstr "\"케스턴, 네 편지를 받고는 최대한 빨리 왔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Answer_81492_Text
msgctxt "1b1728a7-84d1-41db-8ff8-3055020b9df5"
msgid "\"What do you know about Lamashtu?\""
msgstr "\"라마슈투에 대해 무엇을 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Answer_81496_Text
msgctxt "e173be6e-4dc2-4dc9-b86a-791222c7f701"
msgid "\"I must leave now. Wait for me here.\""
msgstr "\"나는 지금 가야 해. 여기서 기다려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Answer_81503_Text
msgctxt "e647ff86-1773-45a3-853e-133f49618c9f"
msgid "\"I'm ready, Kesten. Let's get those cultists\"."
msgstr "\"준비됐다. 케스턴. 사교도들을 잡으러 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81484_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "1d565619-1beb-4657-8042-0b31465150ff"
msgid ""
"{n}Seeing you, Kesten nods. Under his coat you notice a suit of armor, a "
"sword hangs at his belt — the guard is ready to fight. {/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 보며 케스턴은 고개를 끄덕였습니다. 그의 코트 안에 갑옷이 눈에 띄고, 허리띠에는 검 한자루 걸쳐있는 것이보입니다. 그는 "
"싸울 준비가 되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81485_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "bbaf996e-3056-4091-9db0-3bb883a9a6ff"
msgid "\"Welcome back, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "\"어서오십시오, 영주님.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81486_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "15eed2f3-5093-45ff-8069-9496edb60def"
msgid ""
"\"I'm happy to see you, {mf|My Baron|My Baroness}. While we were waiting for "
"you, I've had enough time to choose a good place for the ambush.\""
msgstr "\"와주셔서 기쁩니다. 영주님을 기다리는 동안 매복을 하기에 좋은 장소를 골라두었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81497_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "92a006ce-466b-4199-903f-c33f4e5fdcd8"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Your Grace. I've decided you'd like to see this place with your "
"own eyes\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다, 영주님. 직접 두 눈으로 보시는 편이 이해하시기 편하실 겁니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81499_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "a192174a-3469-4a35-948b-c9dcc98e7c6d"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} shrine is on the other side of the hill. I "
"suggest we set ambush right here -the visibility is good, so we can watch "
"the cultists unnoticed and choose the right moment to strike. If you wish, "
"you can examine the location.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 성소는 언덕 반대편에 있습니다. 저희가 바로 여기에 매복을 한다면 좋을듯합니다. 이곳의 좋은 "
"시야로 인해 사교도들이 눈치채지 못한 채 공격할 기회를 잡을 수 있습니다. 원하신다면 주변을 둘러 보셔도 됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81501_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "5c8be6b7-f295-4c31-b66a-35c9cab3edfc"
msgid ""
"\"The day is right, and the time is coming. All we have to do now is wait "
"until the cultists gather to their coven. I hope you're ready to fight.\""
msgstr "\"날씨도 좋고 때가 다가오고 있습니다. 우리는 사교도가 모일 때까지 기다릴 것입니다. 영주님께서 싸울 준비가 되었길 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81502_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "7bcab38e-6e57-4d96-918f-93b4612ac433"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten shakes his head.{/n} \"Not today. Come back later, and we'll get "
"them when they least expect us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 고개를 저었습니다. {/n} \"오늘은 날이 아닙니다. 다음에 와주십시오, 놈들이 긴장을 풀 때 공격해야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81506_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "2e23efc1-662c-4a1c-846c-99a9a571525e"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten frowns.{/n} \"Not much, Your Grace, but I've heard some things. "
"Goblins, kobolds and other wild beasts worship her — she helps them to "
"breed, protects their young. As for people, the blessing of "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} is too dangerous for them — a woman can give birth "
"to something so terrible, that the villagers might decide to drive a mother "
"and a child out of from the village. Or worse.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 얼굴을 찌푸렸습니다.{/n} \"많지는 않지만 조금 들은 것이 있습니다. 고블린, 코볼트와 다른 야생 동물들도 여신을 "
"숭배한다는군요. 여신은 놈들이 번식하고 그들의 새끼들을 보호하게끔 도웁니다. 사람들에게 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 축복은 "
"매우 위험합니다. 여자들이 매우 끔찍한 생물을 낳을 수 있고 그렇게 된다면 마을 사람들이 그 여성과 아이를 쫓아내거나 더 험한 짓을 할 "
"수도 있습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81508_Text
#. Speaker : ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten
msgctxt "0f2d19ad-704f-4c36-ba89-63a4242e18ea"
msgid ""
"\"You can go down and take a look at the shrine. The scouts who've been "
"watching the cultists, told me about hideous rituals that were performed "
"here. The cultists disfigure and mutilate themselves, shriek like demons and "
"copulate in the mud.\" {n}Kesten frowns in disgust.{/n} \"I just can't "
"imagine who in the right mind, except for goblins, would ask "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} for help and agree to be part of this abomination.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내려가서 성소를 둘러보십시오. 사교도들을 감시하던 정찰병들이 그들이 벌인 끔찍한 의식에 대해 말해주었습니다. 사교도들은 자해를 하고 "
"불구가 되어서 데몬처럼 비명을 지르며 진흙속에서 교미를 한다고 합니다.\" {n}케스턴은 역겨움에 얼굴을 찌푸렸습니다.{/n} "
"\"고블린들이라면 또 모를까, 누가 제 정신으로 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}에게 이런 혐오스런 일에 동참하게 해달라고 빌지 "
"상상이 가질 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/Cue_81511_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "15d41aff-3f61-4281-9cdc-4b170e47122e"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok stomps around angrily.{/n} \"Is place to worship and praise, and "
"what we? We mess around! {g|Lamashtu}Mother of Beasts{/g} will be pissed!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 화가 나서 펄쩍 뜁니다.{/n} \"숭배와 찬양의 장소인데 우리는 뭐하는 거야? 우리가 망치고 있다! {g|Lamashtu}"
" 짐승의 어머니{/g}가 열받을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "77854a05-9849-4db8-bca1-219cd79caf7f"
msgid "\"\"What are you waiting for? He'll escape!\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 기다리고 있어? 그는 도망갈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "003f3d20-71b4-4e67-9137-236709cb21e0"
msgid "\"{mf|My Baron|My Baroness}, we have to catch the fleeing cultist!\""
msgstr "\"도망가는 사교도들을 붙잡아야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/Kesten/ShrineOfLamashtu_Kesten_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "a174d82e-c56e-4c45-88ee-2319d57fa7b1"
msgid "\"Hurry, {mf|My Baron|My Baroness} , I beg you!\""
msgstr "\"서두르십시오! 영주님! 부탁입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76084_Text
msgctxt "b947f665-56c0-4f0e-b4e7-5ea7d3f6b2ac"
msgid ""
"So our brave heroes rushed into the dark and dreary gorge, chasing the "
"runaway."
msgstr "그래서 우리의 용감한 영웅들은 어둡고 황량한 계곡으로 뛰어들어가 도망자를 쫓았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76085_Text
msgctxt "3017c072-b21e-4243-a05d-484153fa8866"
msgid ""
"After they decided to take a shortcut to catch the cultist by surprise, the "
"party started climbing up the stone ridge."
msgstr "사교도를 기습하기 위해 지름길을 택하기로 결정한 후 그들은 돌 무더기를 기어올라가기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76117_Text
msgctxt "403e043f-8f26-46c3-a5f3-40799ec80516"
msgid ""
"[Choose character] Trigger an avalanche over the runaway's head, frightening "
"him?"
msgstr "[캐릭터를 선택합니다] 도망자의 머리 위를 돌무더기로 덮쳐 겁을 줄까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76121_Text
msgctxt "a9715d92-de08-4ba5-aedf-d0caf97fe845"
msgid ""
"[Choose character] Or send the swiftest and most agile ahead down the "
"unstable slope in the hopes of cutting the runaway off?"
msgstr "[캐릭터를 선택합니다] 또는 가장 날쎄고 민첩한 자를 위험한 경사에 내려보내 도망치는 길을 막을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76170_Text
msgctxt "9e01b4d2-2730-4b6c-9ebf-2a02da2304ad"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76175_Text
msgctxt "1a9a8beb-414a-47cd-8a96-328bebd36f97"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76207_Text
msgctxt "123afb8d-c5ee-4425-b761-f2e69d71dd5b"
msgid ""
"[Choose character] Or did the strongest member of the party clear the way, "
"hurling rocks and stones aside?"
msgstr "[캐릭터를 선택합니다] 아니면 가장 힘이 센 동료가 돌과 바위를 옆으로 치우게 할까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76208_Text
msgctxt "8a83c93d-b8dc-43ce-bf00-3e17864d7894"
msgid ""
"[Choose character] Did another go still and listen, trying to hear where the "
"cultist might have fled?"
msgstr "[캐릭터를 선택합니다] 다른 동료가 사교도의 도망치는 방향을 몰래 듣도록 할까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76221_Text
msgctxt "97a46a6f-e811-4ed8-9983-ef4734578bdd"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76234_Text
msgctxt "5554ead8-0355-49ec-8855-ee2ba344ca3c"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Answer_76237_Text
msgctxt "2b5dff41-d437-470f-b56d-ac8183125486"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76081_Text
msgctxt "272a6f41-cbbf-4020-90ca-731753639bf5"
msgid ""
"The triumph over the wicked {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} cultists proved "
"incomplete — some villain... or villainess... had slipped away under the "
"cover of darkness and into a narrow gorge amongst the rocks.\n"
"Without a second thought, our brave {mf|baron|baroness}, loyal Kesten, and "
"their comrades-in-arms rushed after the fleeing figure!"
msgstr ""
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g} 사교도들을 완전히 쓰러뜨린 것은 아닌 것 같습니다. 악당 몇이 어둠 속으로 도망쳐 바위 사이의 좁은 "
"협곡으로 빠져 나갔습니다.\n"
"생각할 틈도 없이, 우리의 용감한 {mf|남작|여남작}과 충성스러운 케스턴, 그리고 그들의 전우들은 도망치는 인물들을 쫓아 달렸습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76083_Text
msgctxt "df14abf4-c57c-4b10-a141-d5fee128149b"
msgid ""
"The figure, clad in black, was barely visible in the dark — the villain had "
"gotten far ahead of us! At the last moment, the {mf|baron|baroness} noticed "
"their prey had turned aside and disappeared behind the rocks."
msgstr ""
"검은 모습은 어둠 속에서 거의 보이지 않았습니다. 그 악당은 우리를 앞질렀습니다! 마지막 순간에 당신은 그들이 방향을 틀어 바위 뒤로 "
"사라진 것을 보았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76114_Text
msgctxt "ff91d2e6-97eb-443a-b761-af83c0405b9a"
msgid ""
"As our brave heroes reached the edge of plateau, the vastness of the "
"{g|Kamelands}Kamelands{/g} opened before them, an ocean of high grass as far "
"as the eye could see... a beautiful sight, but finding our quarry in this "
"green sea? It would prove impossible!"
msgstr ""
"우리의 용감한 영웅들은 넓은 {g|Kamelands}케임랜드{/g} 고원의 가장자리에 도달했고, 당신 눈 앞에는 키가 큰 풀이 바다처럼 "
"펼쳐져 있었습니다... 아름다운 광경이지만, 이 초록색 바다에서 적을 쫓아야 하나요? 그것은 불가능할 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76122_Text
msgctxt "5a957233-ea14-4fd5-9da1-3eaf966c64fa"
msgid ""
"Soaking wet and exhausted, our heroes came upon a cabin at the edge of a "
"swamp. According to Kesten, it was a hunter's lodge, owned by Dumra, a "
"hunter who lived there alone — and was known for her great temper and little "
"patience.\n"
"It also looked as if it might be a place where the cultist would seek "
"shelter — it was unlikely the runaway would brave the depths of the "
"{g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g} in the middle of the night.\n"
"So, {mf|The Baron|The Baroness} pushed open the door and stepped inside, "
"letting a touch of the cool night air in..."
msgstr ""
"비에 몸이 젖고 지쳐버린 우리의 영웅들은 늪지 가장자리의 통나무집에 도착했습니다. 케스턴의 말에 따르면, 그곳은 혼자 살고있는 사냥꾼 "
"덤라가 주인으로 있는 사냥꾼들의 숙소라고 합니다. 그녀는 화를 잘 내고 인내심이 없는 것으로 알려졌습니다.\n"
"그곳은 마치 사교도들이 피난처를 찾을만한 장소처럼 보였습니다. 도망자는 감히 한밤중에 {g|Narlmarches} 날마치{/g}로 들어갈 "
"생각을 하지 못한 것 같습니다.\n"
"그래서 {mf|영주님은|영주님은|전하는|전하는} 문을 열어 안으로 들어갔고 차가운 밤 공기가 집 안으로 들어갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76127_Text
msgctxt "88b0e146-de67-4042-b351-f0d11d5218e6"
msgid ""
"So our heroes found themselves at the top — and just in time! The cultist, "
"barely visible in the darkness, was threading his way through the gorge "
"directly beneath them!\n"
"It seemed the cultist was so focused on finding his footing he didn't notice "
"his pursuers perched above him, giving {mf|the baron|the baroness} a chance "
"to strike! What will our heroes do next?"
msgstr ""
"결국 우리 영웅들은 딱 제시간에 맞춰 정상에 도착했다는것을 깨달았습니다! 어둠 속에서 보이지 않던 이교도는 우리 바로 아래, 구불구불한 "
"협곡 사이로 도망치고 있었습니다!\n"
"사교도는 도망치는데 너무 집중하여, 자신의 추격자들이 바로 위에 자리잡고 있다는 것을 눈치채지 못했으며, {mf|남작|남작|전하|전하} "
"일행들에게 공격할 기회를 내준것 같습니다! 우리의 영웅들은 다음에 무엇을 할까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76132_Text
msgctxt "3c162598-2269-483b-8e3b-0b690fd7c7ef"
msgid ""
"The boulders rumbling down the slope, the column of dust, and the triumphant "
"cries from above — that would be enough for Lamashtu herself to turn tail! "
"The cultist wasn't any better — he lost his footing, and his escape turned "
"into an awkward tumble, causing him to trip and stumble amongst the rocks."
msgstr ""
"비탈 아래로 구르는 돌들이 먼지 기둥을 일으켰고 큰 소리가 울려퍼졌습니다. 그 소리를 듣고 라마슈투도 도망을 쳤을 것입니다! 사교도는 "
"더이상 도망가지 못해서 비틀거리면서 바위 사이로 걸어갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76163_Text
msgctxt "f7aded02-591c-4f14-9348-d94947a7f6ed"
msgid ""
"The gorge was a din of booted feet, rattling swords, and the curses and "
"snarls of those trying to find their darkness. Still, taking the risk of "
"running into each other or losing their footing on the sharp stones, our "
"heroes chased after the runaway."
msgstr ""
"협곡에는 발소리와 칼이 부딪히는 소리, 암흑을 쫓는 소리로 가득했습니다. 서로에게 달려들거나 날카로운 바위 위에 넘어질 위험을 각오하고 "
"우리의 영웅은 도망자를 쫓았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76165_Text
msgctxt "c04508cf-3719-447a-9a44-a706892ef2d4"
msgid ""
"Climbing in the darkness is a difficult task: it's not a joke when you try "
"to catch a stable rock and hear the small stones crumble under your feet!"
msgstr ""
"어둠 속에서 기어오르는 것은 어려운 일입니다. 단단한 돌을 잡으려고 할 때 바위가 갈라지는 소리를 들으면 농담이 아니라는 것을 알 "
"것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76168_Text
msgctxt "5f1a540c-0c0b-48b4-b8eb-b98c7a188d43"
msgid ""
"Several times it seemed our heroes were out of luck, but their stubbornness —"
" and the thought of the runaway cultist gloating about eluding them — gave "
"them strength. Moments later, we were at the top!"
msgstr ""
"우리의 영웅들은 몇 번이나 운이 없어 보였지만, 모두들 고집스럽게 올라갔고, 게다가 우리를 피해 도망친 사교도들이 고소해할 것을 "
"생각하니, 힘이 솟았습니다. 잠시후, 우리는 정상에 도착했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76169_Text
msgctxt "09379c3a-28cb-4b96-aa58-8969245af86e"
msgid ""
"On second thought, the idea of hasty climbing a treacherous slope in the "
"dark was not a good one... and, um, to save the good name of the "
"{mf|baron|baroness} I'll strike out the details of how we got down from that "
"height, simply saying we arrived... tattered and bruised.\n"
"There was no choice left — we had to make a detour, and precious time was "
"lost. Our humbled band had to seek out the cultist among the rocks or at the "
"edge of the stone plateau."
msgstr ""
"다시 생각해 보니 경사진 비탈길을 어둠 속에서 오르는 생각은 좋지 않았습니다... 그리고, 음, {mf|남작|여남작}의 명성을 지키기 "
"위해 우리가 그 높이에서 어떻게 내려갔는지 설명하는 것은 미뤄두겠지만, 간단히 말해서 우리는 도착했습니다... 너덜너덜해지고 멍이 든 "
"채로요.\n"
"남은 선택의 여지가 없었습니다. 우리는 돌아가야 했고 귀중한 시간을 버렸습니다. 초라한 우리는 바위 사이 혹은 돌 고원 가장자리에서 "
"사교도를 찾아야했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76173_Text
msgctxt "6f30df3e-b043-4943-bd4e-058b755c78c6"
msgid ""
"The absence of daylight and unfamiliarity with the location didn't hinder "
"our brave souls, and they reached the edge of a stone ridge. Some had "
"already started to cheer, for the lover of dark rituals would soon be in our "
"hands…"
msgstr ""
"햇빛의 부재와 그 위치에 익숙하지 않았어도 우리는 용기를 잃지 않았고 돌의 능선의 가장자리에 도달했습니다. 어떤 사람들은 이미 우리가 "
"악당을 잡을 것이라고 응원하기 시작했습니다. . ."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76174_Text
msgctxt "82ee1079-13ab-4ea6-b20e-ffb4d13db564"
msgid ""
"Running through the unfamiliar gorge in the dark — not as easy as it sounds! "
"We didn't even get to the rock behind which the cultist had disappeared, "
"before two men in our party had already tripped over loose stones and fell "
"to the ground with a crash!\n"
"In the tales of every hero there are always a few... or sometimes many... "
"pages worth tearing off and setting on fire... might this be one of them? Be "
"what may, when we reached the place where we'd last seen the cultist, he had "
"vanished. It seemed there was nothing left for us to do except go to the "
"edge of the plateau and see if we could spot our quarry."
msgstr ""
"친근하지 않은 협곡을 어둠 속에서 뛰어 다니는 것은 말처럼 쉽지는 않았습니다! 우리는 도망자가 사라진 바위까지도 가지 못했고 먼저 간 "
"일행의 두 명은 바위에서 굴러떨어졌습니다!\n"
"영웅의 이야기에는 찢겨져서 불타버리는 페이지들이 있습니다... 아마 그들의 이야기가 아닐까요? 어찌 됐든 사교도를 마지막으로 보았던 곳에 "
"도착했을 때 그는 사라졌습니다. 고원의 가장자리로 가야한다는 것을 제외하고는 우리의 적을 발견할 방법을 찾지 못할 것처럼 보였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76187_Text
msgctxt "ed2e0df2-cff8-400a-9297-524c932af6ce"
msgid ""
"With our heads down and hopes lost, we descended to where a small streamlet "
"flowed amongst the stones. And then, there before us — good fortune! In his "
"haste, our villain had run through the high grass, leaving a trail for all "
"to see."
msgstr ""
"고개를 숙이고 희망을 잃은채, 우리는 돌들 사이로 작은 개울물이 흐르는 곳으로 내려갔습니다. 그리고 우리는 운이 좋았습니다! 그 악당은 "
"키가 높은 풀 속으로 서둘러 도망치다가, 모두가 볼 수있는 흔적을 남겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76205_Text
msgctxt "0f6e9d2a-319e-4a83-adff-ac8216a4ff28"
msgid ""
"…but there was an unpleasant surprise waiting for us! The cultist hadn't "
"fled after all — they were lying in wait right behind the ridge! I had just "
"enough time to spot his raised hands and to hear the incantations of some "
"frightening spell before darkness engulfed us!"
msgstr ""
"... 그러나 우리를 기다리고 있는 것은 불쾌한 것이었습니다! 사교도는 도망가지 않았고 능선 뒤에서 기다리고 있었습니다. 나는 어둠이 "
"우리를 빨아들이기 전에 그가 손을 들어올려 무시무시한 주문을 외우는 것을 발견했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76206_Text
msgctxt "5b988c6d-c594-4ac6-962a-2663242c90be"
msgid ""
"Finding yourself in utter darkness, when both the sense of direction and the "
"sight of your friends are lost — it does things to one's mind. Especially "
"when the darkness is almost living, breathing, hungry... when it tries to "
"swallow you, to worm its way into your eyes, to blind you FOREVER! ...at "
"least that's how your true servant felt, though to all accounts, she was "
"perhaps the only one among the band who did not surrender to panic, "
"maintaining her steel-eyed composure."
msgstr ""
"방향 감각과 친구들의 모습을 잃고 나서 당신은 완전한 어둠 속에서 자신을 찾았습니다. 누구나 그렇게 생각했을 것입니다. 특히 어둠이 "
"살아서 숨쉬고 굶주린 것 같을 때... 그것이 당신을 삼키고 눈 안에 기어들어가 당신을 영원히 눈 멀게 한다면 말입니다! 최소한 당신의 "
"하인은 그렇게 느꼈을 것입니다. 그럼에도 그녀는 아마 일행에서 겁먹어 혼란에 빠지지 않고 침착함을 유지한 유일한 사람일 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76212_Text
msgctxt "81a32a90-1ce0-4695-bab5-8c67dc80c787"
msgid ""
"Why hesitate when action is called for? That was the thought that took hold "
"{name}'s mind at that dire moment. Without warning, they plunged through the "
"darkness, smashing through anything in their way like a battering ram... and "
"with speed and strength on their side, won through and stumbled out into the "
"light!\n"
"There, {name} discovered the darkness did not blanket the area — it had its "
"limits. Once out of the dark cloud, {name} spotted the cultist trying to "
"flee into the rocks."
msgstr ""
"행동이 필요할 때 왜 주저합니까? 그 생각이 {name}의 머릿 속에서 떠나지 않았습니다. 경고 없이 그들은 어둠 속으로 뛰어 들었고 양 "
"한마리와 부딪힌 듯 몸을 강타했고... 그 힘에 부딪혀 그들은 빛 속으로 비틀거리며 걸어갔습니다!\n"
"그곳에 당신은 어둠이 그 지역을 덮지 않았음을 발견했습니다. 어두운 구름 바깥에서 당신은 사교도가 바위 사이로 도망치려는 것을 "
"발견했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76213_Text
msgctxt "92557dde-bbe8-46cc-9acd-f46a032f8447"
msgid ""
"Having decided to plunge through the darkness, {name} had forgotten one "
"important thing — besides their companions, there was the surroundings to "
"worry about as well! All we heard was the KRAK of what might have been {name}"
"'s skull hitting rock and a dull THUD as their body slumped to the ground."
msgstr ""
"어둠 속으로 뛰어들기로 결정한 후 당신은 중요한 한가지를 잊었습니다. 동료 말고도 주위를 둘러싼 것이 있었습니다! 우리가 들은 것은 돌이 "
"부딪혀 퍽하는 소리가 {name}의 두개골에서 났고 툭하는 소리와 함께 그들이 땅으로 쓰러진 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76215_Text
msgctxt "f71e3295-aafd-4111-ad73-e100b54dce2f"
msgid ""
"Closing their eyes, {name} caught the sound of running feet in the distance, "
"becoming fainter and fainter — but even that faint sound was enough! Once we "
"heard where the cultist had fled, we used the sound like a compass to guide "
"us and were soon out of the darkness easily!"
msgstr ""
"눈을 감고 {name}은(는) 먼 곳에서 발소리가 점점 희미해지는 것을 들었지만, 그 희미한 소리로도 충분했습니다! 우리가 사교도가 "
"도망치는 방향을 알았을 때, 우리는 그 소리를 나침반으로 삼아 그들을 따라갔고 어둠을 쉽게 벗어날 수 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76218_Text
msgctxt "60961752-749f-4ca6-8baa-3c866e33fdb0"
msgid ""
"{name} tried hard, very hard to discern the direction our villain fled. "
"Alas! With some shame, I admit I maaaaay have added a bit to the confusion "
"and noise that reigned inside the dark cloud. I guess, that's why {name} "
"still gives me angry glances?"
msgstr ""
"{name}은(는) 충분히 노력했지만, 악당이 도망친 곳의 방향을 알아낼 수 없었습니다. 아아! 내가 아마도 조오오오금은 어두운 구름 "
"속을 지배한 혼란과 소음을 거들었을지도 모른다고 인정해요. 그게 아니면, 왜 {name}이(가) 아직도 저를 그렇게 화난 눈빛으로 "
"쳐다보겠어요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76220_Text
msgctxt "38505e56-adcc-442e-b462-7e723514cf92"
msgid ""
"When the others were free of the darkness, the cultist was long gone. Where "
"could he have gone amongst these rocks?"
msgstr "다른 자들이 어둠으로부터 자유로웠을 때 사교도는 이미 사라졌습니다. 어느 바위 사이로 그는 사라졌을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76223_Text
msgctxt "986f64bc-954a-4b98-a173-1a7538995f07"
msgid ""
"As our brave heroes reached the end of plateau, the vastness of the "
"{g|Kamelands}Kamelands{/g} opened before them, an ocean of high grass as far "
"as the eye could see... a beautiful sight, but finding our quarry in this "
"green sea? It would prove impossible!"
msgstr ""
"우리의 용감한 영웅이 넓은 {g|Kamelands} 카멜 랜드{/g} 고원의 끝에 도달했고 당신 눈 앞에는 키가 큰 풀이 바다처럼 펼쳐져 "
"있는 것이었습니다... 아름다운 광경이지만 이 초록색 바다에서 적을 쫓아야 하나요? 그것은 불가능할 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76224_Text
msgctxt "d134d207-b04d-4ee8-879d-da505b6cad46"
msgid ""
"The party immediately set off, driven by a single desire — to capture the "
"criminal who dared to escape the punishment of the {mf|baron|baroness} and "
"had let us on this unwelcome chase.\n"
"We moved as swiftly as we could, but even the ground seemed to fight us — "
"rock gave way to mud, mud which grew deeper as we marched on and seemed to "
"grab at our boots. Even the wind began to rise, lashing at our cloaks, and a "
"foul scent filled the air — sure signs we were heading towards the "
"{g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}."
msgstr ""
"우리는 단 하나의 욕망에 이끌려 곧바로 출발했습니다. 감히 {mf|남작|여남작}의 처벌을 피해서 우리가 추격하게 만든 범인을 붙잡기 "
"위해서 말입니다.\n"
"우리는 가능한 신속하게 움직였습니다. 그러나 심지어 땅조차 우리와 싸우는 것처럼 보였습니다. 길은 진흙탕이었고 우리가 걸어갈 수록 우리의 "
"발을 잡는 것 같았습니다. 심지어 바람이 심하게 불기 시작해서 우리의 망토를 매질했고 썩은내가 났습니다. 그것은 우리가 "
"{g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g}로 향하고 있었는 얘기였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76225_Text
msgctxt "06279c7c-4b7e-45b8-9e5b-291ddda02a39"
msgid ""
"With our heads down and hopes lost, we descended to where a small streamlet "
"flowed amongst the stones. And then, there before us — good fortune! In his "
"haste, our villain had run through the high grass, leaving a trail for all "
"to see."
msgstr ""
"고개를 숙이고 희망을 잃어서 우리는 돌 사이로 흐르는 작은 시내로 내려갔습니다. 그리고 우리는 운이 좋았습니다! 그 악당은 서둘러 키가 "
"높은 풀 속으로 도망쳐서 모두가 볼 수있는 흔적을 남겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76226_Text
msgctxt "681a7ac7-d67a-4886-8f6b-41fb06b04a2f"
msgid ""
"Soaking wet and exhausted, our heroes came upon a small hut at the edge of a "
"swamp. According to Kesten, it was a hunter's lodge, owned by Dumra, a "
"hunter who lived there alone — and was known for her great temper and little "
"patience.\n"
"It also looked as if it might be a place where the cultist would seek "
"shelter — it was unlikely the runaway would brave the depths of the "
"{g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g} in the middle of the night.\n"
"So, {mf|The Baron|The Baroness} pushed open the door and stepped inside, "
"letting a touch of the cool night air in..."
msgstr ""
"몸은 다 젖고 지친채로, 우리의 영웅들은 늪지 가장자리의 집에 도착했습니다. 케스턴의 말에 따르면 혼자 사는 사냥꾼 덤라의 산장이라고 "
"합니다. 그녀는 화를 잘 내고 인내심이 없는 것으로 알려졌습니다.\n"
"그곳은 마치 사교도가 피난처를 찾을 장소인 것처럼 보였습니다. 도망자는 감히 한밤중에 {g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g}로 들어갈 "
"생각을 하지 못한 것 같습니다.\n"
"그래서 당신은 문을 열어 안으로 들어갔고 차가운 밤 공기가 집 안으로 들어갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76229_Text
msgctxt "c152c6d3-83f1-493c-ae33-ea270b0752fb"
msgid ""
"{name} appeared from the darkness like a spirit! The runaway clearly hadn't "
"been expecting that — {name} barely had time to react, when the cultist "
"burst into a sprint!"
msgstr ""
"{name}은(는) 마치 영혼처럼 어둠 속에서 나타났습니다! 도망자는 사교도가 달아나기 시작할 때 {name}에게 거의 반응할 시간이 "
"없을거라고 생각했음이 명백했죠!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76230_Text
msgctxt "6970f22b-27c5-4888-9aaf-986358e175fd"
msgid ""
"The boulders proved to be heavier than {name} thought — while {mf|he|she} "
"grunted and pushed, trying to move at least one of them, the runaway heard "
"the exertions from above and panicked, broke into a run!\n"
"Before our heroes knew it, the villain vanished into the darkness. The only "
"thing left to do was to try and follow the trail, which led towards the edge "
"of stony plateau where the flatlands stretched forth."
msgstr ""
"거대한 바위는 {name}의 생각보다 무거웠습니다. 당신이 바위 하나를 애써 밀려고 할 때 도망자는 위에서 그 소리를 들어 당황해서 "
"도망치기 시작했습니다!\n"
"우리의 영웅들이 그것을 알기도 전에 악당은 어둠 속으로 사라졌습니다. 남은 유일한 일은 흔적을 따라가면서 돌 고원 가장자리로 향한 길을 "
"따라가는 것이었습습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76231_Text
msgctxt "8f441a9b-e9b1-4337-a759-80115b795534"
msgid ""
"As soon as {mf|he|she} set a foot on the treacherous sand-and-gravel slope, "
"{name} started to slide down helplessly downwards in a cloud of dust.\n"
"No wonder, that when {mf|he|she} finally reached the bottom and the dust had "
"settled, the cultist was long gone. The only hope was that the runaway had "
"been forced to slow down at the edge of the plateau and we could catch him "
"there."
msgstr ""
"{mf|그|그녀}가 모래와 자갈이 섞인 언덕을 오르려고 하자마자, {name}은(는) 먼지 구름을 일으키며 볼품없이 미끄러져 내려가기 "
"시작했습니다.\n"
"마침내 {mf|그|그녀}가 바닥에 닿고 먼지가 가라앉았을 때, 도망자는 한참 전에 사라진 뒤였습니다. 유일한 희망은 도망자가 고원 "
"끝자락에서 속도를 내지 못하는 틈에 우리가 따라잡는 것뿐이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76233_Text
msgctxt "96142800-3688-4df2-a24d-393efbd2696d"
msgid ""
"Darkness failed to cover the peculiar way the runaway walked — the robed "
"figure was limping badly, dragging their right leg. Despite that, the "
"cultist vanished in the darkness without a trace. The party followed — to "
"the edge of the plateau, where the flatlands began."
msgstr ""
"어둠은 도망자가 지나간 곳을 숨기지 못했습니다. 로브를 입은 형체는 오른쪽 다리를 끌며 심하게 절뚝거리고 있었습니다. 그럼에도 불구하고 "
"사교도는 어둠 속에서 사라졌습니다. 우리는 평지가 시작되는 돌 고원 쪽으로 쫓기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76241_Text
msgctxt "d52b1617-ed4c-4957-92f7-d6ccf5f6e7b7"
msgid "A desperate moment, and time runs fast! What did our heroes do?"
msgstr "필사적인 순간에 시간은 빠르게 흐릅니다! 우리 영웅은 무엇을 했을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_76242_Text
msgctxt "8687b185-360b-40cc-9001-51cf9a2cb65f"
msgid ""
"The party immediately set off, driven by a single desire — to capture the "
"criminal who dared to escape the punishment of the {mf|baron|baroness} and "
"had let us on this unwelcome chase.\n"
"We moved as swiftly as we could, but even the ground seemed to fight us — "
"rock gave way to mud, mud which grew deeper as we marched on and seemed to "
"grab at our boots. Even the wind began to rise, lashing at our cloaks, and a "
"foul scent filled the air — sure signs we were heading towards the "
"{g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}."
msgstr ""
"우리는 단 하나의 일념에 이끌려 즉시 출발했습니다. 감히 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}의 처벌을 피해, 우리에게 이런 달갑지 않은 "
"추격하게 만든 범인을 붙잡기 위해서 말입니다.\n"
"우리는 가능한 신속하게 움직였지만, 마치 땅조차 우리와 싸우는 것처럼 보였습니다. 길은 진흙탕이었고 우리가 걸어갈 수록 우리의 발을 잡는 "
"것 같았습니다. 심지어 바람마저 심하게 불어오며 우리의 망토를 휘갈겼고, 공기는 악취로 가득차기 시작했습니다. 그것은 우리가 "
"{g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g}로 향한다는 얘기였습니다다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/ShrineOfLamashtu/TransitionBookEvent/Cue_ShOfLam_REVEAL1_Text
msgctxt "bdd990e0-816a-43fc-8c32-d91d37fe7316"
msgid ""
"But before the villain disappeared, {name} noticed an important detail — the "
"runaway was limping on their right leg!"
msgstr "그러나 악당이 사라지기 전에 {name}은(는) 중요한 한가지 사실을 알아차렸습니다. 도망자가 오른 다리를 절고 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Enviroment_FirstRoomWalls_String
msgctxt "cbe5b194-6b56-4bef-8969-50ca45681509"
msgid ""
"The walls are covered with gouges and claw marks in the rock — here and "
"there, these markings form crude pictures."
msgstr "절벽은 여기저기 갈퀸 자국으로 덮여있었고 그 자국이 조잡한 그림을 나타냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Enviroment_Flowers_String
msgctxt "56270be6-03f5-4a07-8732-7187ed37d5f3"
msgid "Flowers faintly gleam in the dim light of the cave."
msgstr "동굴의 흐릿한 빛 속에서 꽃이 희미하게 빛납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Enviroment_LakeWater_String
msgctxt "87c69155-23cb-4931-8b82-598df755dc0e"
msgid "The air by the water is ice-cold."
msgstr "물이 닿은 공기는 얼음처럼 차갑습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Enviroment_MoldMoss_String
msgctxt "d7861e8c-8e0d-4293-8f30-1448d8bfc61f"
msgid "The moss on the walls is so dense it reminds you of grass."
msgstr "벽에 이끼가 너무 빽빽하여 잔디처럼 생겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Enviroment_Mushroom_String
msgctxt "36143fca-3755-42b7-8aab-ce6fe7ff3177"
msgid ""
"As you come close, a huge bracket fungus puffs up and outwards, spewing out "
"a mist of spores."
msgstr "당신이 가까이 다가가자 거대한 곰팡이가 피어올라 포자의 안개를 뿜어냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Enviroment_OwlbearNest_String
msgctxt "dd0350cb-be96-4585-90c5-086e6eb656ef"
msgid ""
"The cave floor is littered with bones, broken weapons, and scraps of cloth "
"and torn hides."
msgstr "동굴 바닥에는 뼈, 부러진 무기, 천 조각과 찢어진 가죽이 흩어져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Enviroment_PlantsNearPortal_String
msgctxt "9bc39469-abe8-4491-a849-f518baa2eb28"
msgid ""
"The plant sways gently, stirred by the wind emanating from a gap in the rock "
"nearby."
msgstr "근처의 암석 틈에서 바람이 불어 식물이 흔들립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Kesten_01_String
msgctxt "b938aba6-6fbf-4aee-a90b-e0f0aded36ee"
msgid "\"We need to hurry.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 서둘러야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Kesten_02_String
msgctxt "d1d01125-5961-4d1b-ae60-1f9d6a0805b9"
msgid "\"Don't take too long, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"너무 오래 있지는 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Barks/Kesten_03_String
msgctxt "73020bdb-5f9c-4248-ba75-03e516e907e1"
msgid "\"Were you able to find anything?\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 발견했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "8eb6bc30-9478-439e-be33-703c121bd79c"
msgid "Did they look around, before rushing into the unknown?"
msgstr "그들은 알 수 없는 곳으로 달려들기 전에 한번 둘러보았을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "8892e928-7f3e-4c6b-8dbb-323e419c7eb2"
msgid "Or did they bravely step into the mysterious darkness?"
msgstr "아니면 그들은 신비한 어둠 속으로 용감하게 들어갔을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "ee99577a-e3d8-4e65-a847-79206bf6598c"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr "계속합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "153743e5-105b-4ed0-9ea1-edc3b7788163"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr "계속합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "6e757dac-388f-4496-a4b7-0480e8c9cbb5"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "38a28be2-0ef2-4e08-8fbb-f3c71dc06cc3"
msgid ""
"A long journey through the caves stretching around {g|Lake Silverstep}"
"Silverstep Lake{/g} brought our brave heroes to another large, narrow crack "
"in the wall. This time, however, the crack looked different from the "
"previous ones."
msgstr ""
"우리의 영웅은 {g|Lake Silverstep}실버스텝 호수{/g} 주위에 펼쳐진 동굴을 통과하는 긴 여정 끝에 커다랗고 좁은 균열에 "
"도달했습니다. 하지만 이번에는 균열이 이전에 보던 것과 다르게 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "b5c14348-6418-4bbb-a517-8e35aeb75f4b"
msgid ""
"We started to realize that we were nearing something mysterious and magical —"
" more and more strange vegetation appeared on the cave walls and floor. Mold "
"and lichen gave way to huge flowers, enormous mushrooms, and even some "
"bushes brimming with berries, big and bountiful!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 신비스럽고 마법적인 무언가에 가까워지고 있다는 것을 깨닫기 시작했습니다. 점점 더 많은 이상한 식물들이 동굴 벽과 바닥에 "
"나타났습니다. 곰팡이와 이끼는 커다란 꽃, 거대한 버섯, 열매로 가득한 수풀에 이어집니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "69c0380a-1105-44d3-8810-aa633eab5606"
msgid ""
"The crack itself was as odd as its surroundings. Within, it seemed pure "
"darkness, thick and deep, was roiling beyond the crack — but what space lay "
"beyond, none of us could guess. We all noticed a draft from the crack that "
"seemed to rise and fall, like breathing, stirring the dust motes within the "
"musty cave."
msgstr ""
"갈라진 틈 자체는 그 주변 만큼 이상했습니다. 그 안에는 두껍고 깊은 순수한 어둠이 균열 너머에 펼쳐졌습니다. 하지만 그 공간 너머에 "
"무엇이 있는지 알 수 없습니다. 우리는 균열에서 숨을 쉬듯 무언가가 들어갔다 나오며 곰팡내 나는 동굴 안에서 먼지를 일으키는 모습을 "
"보았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "5ad5c8dc-ba63-470f-ab81-18fee5d40e0f"
msgid ""
"One needn't be a druid to understand the plants under our feet were unusual, "
"to say the very least. They were too big and too tall, and the huge flowers "
"had unnatural shades that made the eyes hurt to look at them. Perhaps it was "
"the soil they grew in that caused them to grow in such a way — but who could "
"tell for certain?"
msgstr ""
"우리 발아래에 있는 식물들이 평범하지 않다는 것을 이해하는 데는 굳이 드루이드가 될 필요까지도 없었습니다. 그 식물들은 너무 컸고 거대한 "
"꽃들은 눈이 아플 정도로 부자연스러운 색을 가지고 있었습니다. 아마도 식물들이 자란 토양으로 인해 그런 식으로 성장했을 것입니다. 하지만 "
"누구인들 확실히 알 수 있을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "702a48a7-3e39-44cb-820f-f94ffeb45c8f"
msgid ""
"The plants blanketed not just the floor, but the walls, too — here and there "
"in the darkness we could see gleaming islands of luminescent lichen. If that "
"wasn't intriguing enough, stalks grew from the lichen, and on the ends hung "
"big multi-faceted fruits!"
msgstr ""
"식물은 바닥뿐만 아니라 벽도 덮고 있었습니다. 어둠 속에서 여기 저기 빛나는 이끼의 섬들이 보입니다. 그것이 충분히 흥미롭지 않았다면, "
"이끼에게서 줄기들이 자라나, 그 끝에는 커다란 과일들이 주렁주렁 열려있는 모습은 어떤가요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "432a1b5f-36fa-4f22-8f00-d5a709ee8127"
msgid ""
"Maybe the seeds of these strange plants had found their way here, blown by "
"the wind from the narrow fissure? After all, it was strong enough to stir "
"the motes of the cave, even part a hair or two on our fellows' heads. As if "
"on cue, we caught a faint smell of pollen from the other side of the crack — "
"perhaps beyond was the source of the strange garden?"
msgstr ""
"어쩌면 이 이상한 식물의 씨앗들이 좁은 틈새에서 불어오는 바람에 날려 여기까지 오게 된걸까요? 어쨌든 바람은 동굴의 곰팡이를 피우는 데에 "
"충분했고, 심지어 우리 동료의 머리카락도 날릴 정도로 강했습니다. 때마침 우리는 균열의 반대편에서 희미한 꽃가루의 냄새를 맡았습니다. "
"어쩌면 반대편 너머에 이상한 정원의 원천이 있는 걸까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "40e2cae1-8991-4d8b-bdf4-d5283ca7e7b8"
msgid ""
"Readying ourselves, we decided to act — the first of us started to squeeze "
"through the crack, cursing and grunting, your humble servant following right "
"behind — the {mf|baron's|baroness'} chronicler can't allow a tiniest detail "
"to escape her attention, so I had to be as close to the front as possible!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 움직이기로 결심했습니다. 우리 중 첫 번째 사람이 투덜거리며 균열 틈새로 비집고 들어가기 시작했죠. 바로 뒤를 따라 당신의 겸손한 "
"하인이 들어갔어요. 당신의 연대기 작가는 작은 세세한 묘사 하나하나까지도 놓칠 수는 없었습니다. 그래서 저는 가능한 가장 앞에 있어야만 "
"했죠!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "f14a8fe4-0fb5-4e2b-afcd-f678f248a12a"
msgid ""
"This time our path to adventure proved little to our liking! The crack in "
"the rock was narrow even for me, and led us further and further, curving and "
"twisting, until I'd quite lost my bearings. The wind from the other side "
"became stronger and blew into our faces, bringing new smells — fresh grass, "
"fragrant buds, sweet blossoms..."
msgstr ""
"이번에는 모험을 향한 우리의 길이 영 마음에 들지 않았어요! 바위의 균열은 나에게조차 좁았고, 방향을 완전히 잃어버릴 때까지 우리는 "
"계속해서 비집고 들어갔습니다. 반대편에서 불어오는 바람은 더욱 강해져, 우리들의 얼굴을 향해 새로운 향기를 풍겨왔어요. 신선한 풀, "
"향기로운 꽃봉오리, 달콤한 꽃향기들이었어요.."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "5a279d17-d7b4-47f1-ad35-7738f47480d0"
msgid ""
"...then suddenly the ground gave way — the path had become a sinkhole! Blood "
"rushed up to my head, my stomach sank to my feet, and I had the most "
"peculiar dizzying sensation — my body was pulled in two directions at once, "
"as if divided across some strange wall that separated \"here\" from \"there\""
"... until I was truly \"there\" and no longer \"here\"."
msgstr ""
"... 갑자기 땅이 무너졌습니다. 그 길은 싱크홀이 되어버렸어요! 피가 머리 위로 솟구치고, 배 속의 내장이 발로 쏠리는것 같고, "
"정말이지 이상한 현기증 증세를 느꼈어요. 마치 '이 곳'과 '저 곳'을 구분하는 이상한 벽 사이에서 제 몸은 동시에 두 방향에서 당겨지는 "
"것처럼 느껴졌습니다. '이 곳'에서 '저 곳'으로 완전히 옮겨질 때까지요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "51565376-e2b9-4c46-ae8b-883009d8f70c"
msgid ""
"I had no time to be afraid — my fall was quick and my landing was soft... we "
"fell right into a cushion of thick, high grass! Pulling myself... er, "
"herself... together, your humble servant immediately started to look around, "
"asking what happened? Where had she been whisked off to with the brave "
"{mf|baron|baroness}?!"
msgstr ""
"나는 두려워할 시간이 없었습니다. 나는 빠르게 추락했지만 부드럽게 착지했습니다... 우리는 키가 큰 풀이 쿠션 역할을 해서 안전하게 "
"떨어질 수 있었습니다! 정신을 차리자 당신의 겸손한 하인은 주위를 둘러보며 무슨 일이 있었는지 묻기 시작했습니다. 용감한 영주님 일행과 "
"저는 어디로 끌려 들어오게 된 걸까요?!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "9c0982a7-0679-48aa-a94b-2c4b00851845"
msgid ""
"I confess — even for me, it was hard to choose the right words to describe "
"what lay before our eyes..."
msgstr "고백하건데.. 심지어 저 조차도, 우리의 눈 앞에 펼쳐진 광경을 묘사하는 것은 정말 힘들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/Bookevent_Portal/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "20478f6f-d92f-431d-99e9-3d079ab7cc48"
msgid "So, what did our heroes do?"
msgstr "그래서, 우리의 영웅은 무엇을 했을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6895e30e-9a1e-42d8-b6fe-afa94dff2ff5"
msgid "[Burn the flower]"
msgstr "[꽃을 태웁니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "a4aba8c8-9353-464b-8d48-fbbc80dc78fa"
msgid "[Take a part of the flower's root]"
msgstr "[꽃의 뿌리를 뽑습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "3f2e0248-d902-438b-9f6d-339171bc7108"
msgid "[Examine the flower]"
msgstr "[꽃을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "632ccb38-381c-4c9d-ab15-c0c3b0b54ce7"
msgid "[Take a dry petal]"
msgstr "[마른 꽃잎을 가져갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "8b0a374e-465f-4e06-9e76-bd963bba439d"
msgid ""
"{n}The flower's mysterious glow fades, allowing you to take a closer look at "
"this strange thing. Once a thing of beauty and elegance, now the dried "
"flower barely clings to the wilted stalk. All the moisture abandoned the "
"plant along with its magic glow — the petals have become grey and sagging, "
"like the wings of a wounded bird. It looks like only the root, which clings "
"desperately to the cave floor, still maintains some life.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}꽃의 신비한 빛이 희미해져서 당신은 이 이상한 것을 자세히 볼 수 있었습니다. 아름답고 우아했던 꽃은 이제 말라버려 바닥에 "
"달라붙었습니다. 습기가 마법과 함께 식물에게서 빠져나와 꽃잎은 상처 입은 새의 날개처럼 쳐져서 회색을 띄었습니다. 오직 뿌리만이 "
"필사적으로 동굴의 바닥에 달라붙어 생명을 유지하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b7f1ec82-082b-41ca-a80c-ce523f07f690"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia taps her chin with her finger, pensive.{/n} \"I realize this "
"plant is an instrument of evil… but must we destroy it? All it wanted was to "
"bloom...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 손가락으로 턱을 두드립니다.{/n} \"이 식물이 악의 도구라는 것을 알고 있지만 이걸 파괴해야만 할까? 이것은 그저 "
"피어나려고 했을 뿐이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7a63fefa-2bde-41d2-b68e-2a36ce0903ea"
msgid ""
"\"Scorch this abomination, I say. This way it won't come back to life again."
"\""
msgstr "\"이 혐오스러운 것을 태어버려. 그래야 다시는 살아남지 못할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "8d00177f-7a66-407a-a6fd-1290b2f13962"
msgid ""
"\"I'd be happy to participate in researching this amazing sample... but I "
"suppose this time it might be wise to reject a potentially dangerous "
"specimen.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 놀라운 표본을 연구하게 되어 기쁘군... 하지만 이번에는 잠재적으로 위험한 이 표본을 가져가지 않는 것이 현명할 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "41d36a28-7145-4b05-9310-553a52b0399b"
msgid ""
"\"Do not delay and perform your duty, {mf|baron|baroness}. Burn this spawn "
"of another world down, to protect your people!\""
msgstr "\"지체하지 말고 해야할 일을 하십시오. 백성들을 보호하려면 다른 세계에서 온 이 생물을 태워야 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8bd518a1-082d-4e5b-a006-ce5a57211548"
msgid "\"It is time. Finish what you started. Send this flower to oblivion.\""
msgstr "\"시간이 되었어. 시작한 것을 끝내. 이 꽃을 없애버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "644b7bfb-4bb8-403a-90d7-87fc495cb0ff"
msgid ""
"\"If you let it remain like this, it will recover. The fire must be fed.\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 두면 다시 회복할 거야. 불태워야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "538f1fec-c48a-4554-826a-2c46994e22ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Once proud and bright, the plant has lost all its charms — it looks "
"wilted and beyond salvation. The only part that still maintains some signs "
"of life is a feeble root, which desperately clings to the soil.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}한 때 자랑스럽고 밝았던 이 식물은 매력을 잃어버렸습니다. 그것은 시들어 보였고 되살릴 수 없을 것 같습니다. 여전히 살아있는 "
"유일한 부분은 연약한 뿌리였고 필사적으로 토양에 달라붙었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "313ffbde-86a9-4458-abcb-0eb28f65e2bc"
msgid ""
"{n}You slice off a section of the root with some difficulty, a viscous ooze "
"bleeding from it as you do. Once severed, you wrap the root in a rag and "
"place it in your bag.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뿌리의 일부분을 힘들게 잘라냈고 그것에서 점액이 흘러나왔습니다. 잘라내고 난 후에 당신은 뿌리를 넝마에 감싸 가방 안에 "
"넣었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "f10bad8d-e48f-45fa-a369-25019116c5d5"
msgid ""
"{n}As you touch the petal, it crumbles into dust — and the dust settles to "
"the ground around the plant.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 꽃잎을 만질 때 그것은 먼지로 부서졌고 먼지는 식물 주변의 땅에 떨어졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "fcc9ab12-3f58-4683-a369-697a78a9ba7e"
msgid ""
"{n}A single spark is enough for the flower to catch fire. As if in pain, the "
"plant writhes, desperately trying to avoid the flames engulfling it. Moments "
"later, it collapses and disintegrates into ash. The flower is extinguished — "
"it will never grow again, and all that remains is a twisted, blackened "
"root.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}꽃을 불태우기 위해 하나의 불꽃으로 충분했습니다. 고통스러운 듯이 꽃이 자신을 삼키려는 불꽃을 필사적으로 피하려고 합니다. 잠시 "
"후에 그것은 재가 되었습니다. 꽃은 소멸되었습니다. 다시는 자라지 못할 것이고 남은 것은 뒤틀린 뿌리 뿐이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e6c37cb9-ccea-48ed-ac21-d074eca50d58"
msgid ""
"\"Do not waste your time, Baron{mf||ess}. Burn this offspring of evil, "
"before this tragedy repeats itself!\""
msgstr "\"시간 낭비하지 마십시오. 영주님. 비극이 반복되기 전에 이 악의 자식을 태워버립시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "206b89e4-8fda-46cf-a44a-efd097b0c7b1"
msgid ""
"\"This is the hour of your heroic deed — the one that will be sung of across "
"the ages! Do it, and I'll make sure everyone knows!\""
msgstr "\"영웅의 위용을 보여줄 차례예요. 당신의 업적이 아주 오랫동안 노래로 전해지겠죠! 어서 가요. 노래는 제게 맡기시구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "00328fe1-8933-4776-99aa-000ec4ef9d54"
msgid ""
"\"So this is where those ugly things came from. Well, what are you waiting "
"for? Burn it to Hell!\""
msgstr "\"그 추악한 것들이 나온 곳이 여기였어. 무엇을 기다리고 있어? 어서 태워버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ef4eaa60-20ed-45af-ac0c-636dca958799"
msgid "\"It is beautiful. Destroying it would be a crime...\""
msgstr "\"아름답다. 파괴하면 죄가 될 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/EverbloomFlowerDecision/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "85729f72-7c00-4cf0-9e37-47a59d658bb0"
msgid ""
"\"It wanted nothing more than to bloom! To spread seeds that rip people "
"apart from the inside! No, {name} — this 'flower' has to go. Even I "
"understand that — though it would certainly have been a fascinating specimen "
"to study.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 그저 피어나고 싶었던 거야! 사람을 찢고 나오는 씨앗을 퍼뜨리려는 거였지! {name}. 이 꽃은 없애야 해. 이것이 "
"연구하기에는 매력적인 표본일지라도 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d5ea8126-51e1-4d28-98cb-33312c6924ba"
msgid "Comforted dying Kesten."
msgstr "죽어가는 케스턴을 안정시킵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "87256a7a-85eb-4b61-a12c-c173587123ee"
msgid "\"We've defended the capital, Kesten. Rest in peace.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 수도를 방어했어. 케스턴. 편히 쉬어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "25b941fe-c595-44ab-b933-206d032aeb74"
msgid "Tried to cheer up dying Kesten."
msgstr "죽어가는 케스턴을 격려하려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "acb195ac-f280-4f01-950f-1c08bbb6bb1b"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, are you all right? Don't even think of dying on me! Come on, get up, "
"we have to go and find out where those seeds came from!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 괜찮아? 내 앞에서 죽을 생각은 하지 마! 어서 일어나. 우리는 같이 씨앗이 퍼진 곳을 찾아야 하잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "597fb054-a90d-42fa-a6f5-c360a5b1cb19"
msgid "Ignored dying Kesten."
msgstr "죽어가는 케스턴을 무시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "6e1e9480-dd5c-475a-bfb1-b99424772fac"
msgid "[Ignore the question of the dying man]"
msgstr "[죽어가는 남자의 질문을 무시했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "13e4fd64-a035-4542-acdb-a0a891b92949"
msgid "\"Report: what happened here?\""
msgstr "\"보고해. 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "4f6acea0-cf8a-4eed-9037-04bb939f5ff4"
msgid "\"Have you already searched the cave?\""
msgstr "\"동굴을 수색했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "adb04775-5af7-4be3-9d77-59d6b1b5f108"
msgid "\"Are you wounded?\""
msgstr "\"다쳤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "c14fcee7-38d9-413d-aeda-2454c7d9f571"
msgid "[Leave] \"I'll go deeper into the cave.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 동굴 깊숙이 들어갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "28042476-d62b-42ba-aba6-23450f8f31fc"
msgid "\"What do you think they were guarding?\""
msgstr "\"그들이 무엇을 지키고 있었다고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "214d9144-27a8-4b03-81fc-5c0ab3f78ff8"
msgid "\"I hope the capital will manage without us.\""
msgstr "\"우리 없이 수도가 무사하길 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "119e5a4a-4cc1-4481-9889-d659e468fc75"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten takes a deep breath, wiping sweat off his forehead.{/n} \"You "
"arrived just in time, Your Grace! We could have dealt with goblins by "
"ourselves, but not with this huge thing...\" {n}The warrior stops talking "
"and takes a closer look at the owlbear's corpse.{/n} \"I've never seen such "
"a specimen as huge as this before, even when I hunted these beasts with the "
"militia.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 깊은 숨을 들이쉬고 이마의 땀을 닦아냅니다.{/n} \"시간에 맞춰 도착했구나! 우리는 고블린을 막으려고 했지만 이 거대한 "
"녀석은...\" {n}전사는 말을 멈추고 아울베어의 시체를 자세히 관찰합니다.{/n} \"나는 민병대와 함께 사냥했을 때조차도 이렇게 큰 "
"표본을 본 적이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "69497d04-5834-45f4-aa3f-8f9c43f1b90a"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, Kesten groans and tries to raise his head. You see huge, "
"raking claw marks covering his body from the owlbear's attack — it's a "
"miracle he still breathes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하자 케스턴은 신음하고는 그의 머리를 들려고 합니다. 아울베어의 공격으로 그의 몸은 거대한 발톱 자국 투성이 였습니다. "
"그가 숨 쉬고 있는 것이 기적입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "d6037068-7f7a-49b7-a4ca-70138ce8315b"
msgid ""
"\"You… you came… capi… capital...\" {n}Kesten stares at you with feverish "
"eyes.{/n}"
msgstr "\"영주님... 수도로... 가 있어야 하실 텐데...\" {n}케스턴은 당신을 열띤 눈빛으로 쳐다보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "0c3d45bb-320b-4477-94e9-e1abb242d484"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten gives you a weary smile.{/n} \"Sorry... {mf|baron|baroness}... "
"from now on… without...\""
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 당신에게 지친듯한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"죄송합니다...영주님.. 지금부터는... 저 없이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "b0e7cba9-6428-4afb-8886-dc210bf072a9"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten closes his eyes. His face, beneath the blood and mud, looks "
"relieved.{/n} \"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g}…be praised...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}캐스턴이 눈을 감습니다. 그는 비록 피와 진흙 투성이가 되었지만, 안심한듯 합니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}시여...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "0d97c3b4-8907-40af-9062-c56f8e609e90"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten takes a ragged breath, then his head slumps to his chest and he "
"falls still. He is dead.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 호홉을 하고는 그의 머리가 축 처집니다. 그는 죽었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "98817f6d-c2bb-40f1-be0d-70e666753df8"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten tries to say something else, but all that comes out is a trickle "
"of blood from the corner of his mouth. He gives a last choking breath, then "
"falls silent forever.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}케스턴은 다른 말을하려고 시도하지만 나오는 것은 피일 뿐이었습니다. 그는 마지막 호흡을 하고 영원히 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "fa3b449c-c6e7-4690-a545-de6f8681514e"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing worthy of mentioning, just a few scratches. {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} "
"be praised, the rest are good too.\""
msgstr "\"말 할 것도 없어. 그저 긁혔을 뿐이야. {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}가 축복하니 괜찮아질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "a73c9c9d-baa7-4cf4-ab38-6a05a6b253cb"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing worthy of mentioning, just few scratches.\" {n}Kesten looks "
"around, his voice bitter.{/n} \"But many families have lost their loved ones "
"today.\""
msgstr ""
"\"괜찮아. 그저 긁힌 것일 뿐이야.\" {n}케스턴은 주위를 둘러보았고 그의 목소리는 씁쓸합니다.{/n} \"그러나 많은 가족이 오늘 "
"사랑하는 사람을 잃었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "6a5c1d33-9f33-498a-8aa8-9c6ac245e8a0"
msgid ""
"\"We came here not long before you and ran into these goblins straight away. "
"Take a look — they had surprisingly good weapons and armor — at least by "
"goblin standards. Perhaps they were… ceremonial guards?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 오기 얼마 전에 이 고블린들을 만났어. 봐. 그들은 고블린 치고는 좋은 무기와 갑옷을 가지고 있어. 아마 그들은... 의식을 "
"하고 있었던 걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "39f868f7-20f2-49d7-8942-08ba323a5a19"
msgid ""
"\"The shaman called this place the 'Womb of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}'. I "
"doubt goblins would use the name for just any cave — this must be a "
"sanctuary to the Mother of Monsters.\" {n}Kesten glances at the dead "
"owlbear.{/n} \"And I'm starting to understand why.\""
msgstr ""
"\"샤먼이 이 곳을 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 자궁이라 불렀어. 고블린이 동굴에 그런 이름을 붙일 거라고 생각해 봤어. "
"분명히 괴물들의 어머니의 성역일 거야.\" {n}케스턴은 죽은 아울베어를 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"나는 왜 그런지 이해하기 시작했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "709b8109-45c5-44c1-aa1e-23b6abbaba7a"
msgid ""
"\"No, my {mf|baron|baroness}. You came along just as we were dealing with "
"these goblin guards. I suggest you search the place yourself — if anyone can "
"find out what's going on — it's you.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 너는 우리가 고블린 경비원을 상대할 때 왔어. 이 장소를 직접 둘러봐. 무슨 일이 있는지 네 눈으로 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "21fbc11c-73d7-4574-be80-f6f11d2039a5"
msgid "\"We'll make sure no one enters the cave. Go ahead, gods bless you.\""
msgstr "\"누구도 이 동굴에 들어가지 못하게 할 거야. 먼저 가. 신이 너를 축복하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : SilverstepGrotto_Cave_Kesten
msgctxt "c94f028a-86cd-4fa2-8658-9a268d0e90d5"
msgid ""
"\"The sooner we are done with this cave, the sooner we go home.\" {n}Kesten "
"keeps his voice calm, but his brow is furrowed and he is clutching the hilt "
"of his weapon tightly..{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이 동굴을 빨리 탐색하면 집에 일찍 갈 수 있어.\" {n}케스턴은 침착하려 했지만 그의 눈썹은 떨렸고 그는 무기를 단단히 잡고 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5c20bfa9-fc34-4150-a9c8-1100473fd53a"
msgid ""
"\"That right! It a shrine, a holy place of {g|Lamashtu}Mother Lamashtu{/g}! "
"Many beasties emerge here and spread around. Shaman order warriors to guard "
"here so no other tribe take the Womb for themselves! Owner of Womb of "
"Lamashtu is owner of her love!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 여기는 {g|Lamashtu} 어머니 라마슈투{/g}의 성소야! 많은 짐승들이 여기에 나타나서 퍼져 나간다. 샤먼은 다른 "
"전사를 명령해서 다른 부족이 라마슈투의 자궁을 차지하지 못하게 하지! 이 곳의 소유자는 그녀의 사랑을 받는다는 증거니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8cb1366b-453c-4e3e-99a9-5c4612e80a18"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah scrapes her tail against the ground.{/n} \"This is not how I "
"hoped to find you, Captain Kesten! And it's all because of your stupid "
"willfulness. I wish a certain someone could see what it leads to...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라의 꼬리가 땅을 훑습니다.{/n} \"이렇게 찾기를 바라지는 않았는데. 케스턴! 모두 네 의욕 때문이야. 이 결과가 어떻게 "
"될지 누군가 밝혀낼 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_Cave/KestenCaveDialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5a506dbd-3ad9-4bbc-898c-9a9ab7dcd939"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke's eyes fill with tears.{/n} \"You gave so much to your people, "
"Kesten. Oh, why did this have to happen...\""
msgstr "{n}칼리케의 눈에 눈물이 맺힙니다.{/n} \"너는 너무나 많이 주었어. 케스턴. 왜 이런 일이 생겼는지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Anger1_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "be343ea9-aee3-4e96-8e94-98fb5ea9a24b"
msgid ""
"\"No one will ever see my tears again. Neither mortals of Golarion, nor the "
"one who cursed me!\""
msgstr "\"아무도 내 눈물을 다시 보지 못할 거야. 골라리온의 필멸자도 나를 저주한 녀석도 보지 못할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Anger2_Angel_String
msgctxt "1786f224-6dc7-41c0-89e6-41658ffea22e"
msgid "\"You wished to see me, my lady?\""
msgstr "\"부르셨습니까, 주군?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Anger3_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "4c87674b-41d4-4e53-bd17-7b5492faf244"
msgid "\"My skylark. Your song is so sad today. What troubles you?\""
msgstr "\"내 종달새야. 오늘 너의 노래가 슬프구나. 무슨 걱정거리라도 있는거니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Anger4_Angel1_String
msgctxt "e85583a3-7791-4008-af9b-89089306ac66"
msgid ""
"\"Your last order, my lady… it frightens me. The seed of an Everblooming "
"Flower is almost prepared, as you requested. But what will it bring?"
msgstr ""
"\"저번에 내리신 지시가... 저는 두렵습니다. 요청하신대로 영원히 피는 꽃의 씨앗이 거의 준비되었습니다. 하지만 이걸로 무엇을 하려고 "
"하시나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Anger4_Angel2_String
msgctxt "0f54eadd-9f5d-418a-bfef-cc1e91ceaad8"
msgid ""
"\"The Flower contains immense power — power from which immense evil can be "
"born. Monsters, erupting on Golarion by the hundreds... in a crowded street, "
"a busy tavern, near a baby's crib…\""
msgstr ""
"\"꽃에는 엄청난 힘이 있습니다. 거대한 악을 태어나게 하는 힘이. 골라리온의 수백 명에게서 괴물이 튀어나오겠죠... 길거리에서, "
"주점에서, 아기의 요람에서도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Anger5_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "9d4741dd-012f-45c9-8664-3fee3e79a30b"
msgid ""
"\"That's exactly what I need. He wanted to see kingdoms in ruins? He will!\""
msgstr "\"그게 내가 원하는 거야. 그가 왕국이 폐허가 되는 것을 보고 싶다 했지? 그렇게 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Bird_String
msgctxt "e6843edb-3708-4f94-a447-1c2477f4c971"
msgid ""
"The bird with bright, iridescent feathers sings its song and shows no fear "
"as you approach."
msgstr "밝은 무지개빛 깃털의 새는 노래를 불렀고 당신이 다가와도 무서워하지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Dais_String
msgctxt "21aa6ba2-1147-47dc-ab72-c071af15b1e1"
msgid ""
"The sight of the dais makes you uneasy. There are no bars or shackles, but "
"an air of oppressiveness hangs over it."
msgstr "연단의 광경은 당신을 불안하게 만듭니다. 쇠창살이나 족쇄는 없지만 분위기가 무겁습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/EnviromentalBark1_String
msgctxt "6784a338-818d-4e1e-9938-669f9baf3b7d"
msgid ""
"All that surrounds you — the plants, rocks, even the water — is jarring to "
"your senses — everything seems a little bit off."
msgstr "식물, 바위, 물조차도 당신에게 거슬렸고 모든 것이 약간 벗어난 것처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/EnviromentalBark2_String
msgctxt "95114f0e-a524-4f2c-af31-214b132acdea"
msgid "Flowers and leaves move, yet there is no wind."
msgstr "바람이 없음에도 꽃과 잎이 움직입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/EnviromentalBark3_String
msgctxt "b28da223-0035-447f-8d47-0b3b7da65df3"
msgid "This stone doesn't cast a shadow — it just grows from the rock."
msgstr "돌에는 그림자가 생기지 않습니다. 그림자는 바위의 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/EnviromentalBark4_String
msgctxt "113ee6f5-d8cc-471a-abcc-18a743782554"
msgid ""
"Flowers of different shapes and colors grow from a single stalk — it as if "
"the stalk holds the seeds of dozens of other plants in the stem."
msgstr "여러 모습의 꽃이 하나의 줄기에서 자랐습니다. 줄기는 다른 식물들의 씨앗을 합친 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/EnviromentalBark5_String
msgctxt "73d20b27-ac7f-4b72-b00a-9c2f5b3ed412"
msgid "The tree roots here form a complicated geometric pattern."
msgstr "여기 나무 뿌리는 복잡한 기하학적 모양을 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/EnviromentalBark6_String
msgctxt "fe1a8452-b84f-4587-8072-cb1bfa2fbe84"
msgid "The grass changes color as soon as you step on it."
msgstr "잔디를 밟자 잔디 색깔이 바뀝니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/EnviromentalBark7_String
msgctxt "12f9345b-69d0-47fd-915e-2153f0ac5a22"
msgid ""
"A line of ants marches into a puddle without fear. As each ant in the "
"forefront drowns, the ants that follow build a bridge from the corpses of "
"their kin."
msgstr ""
"개미가 줄을 지어 두려움 없이 웅덩이 안으로 갑니다. 앞 줄의 모든 개미가 물에 빠졌고 뒤따르던 개미는 동족의 시체로 다리를 짓습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/EnviromentalBark8_String
msgctxt "0094b3e9-9a46-41bf-b766-4352016d4c80"
msgid ""
"These steadily moving clouds of mist seem alive. You can hear what sounds "
"like faint sighs and whispers emanating from them."
msgstr "안개가 살아있는 것처럼 꾸준히 움직입니다. 당신은 거기에서 희미한 한숨과 속삭임을 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Flower_Awakened_String
msgctxt "3833eb3d-7749-4596-b62c-ab983d6788d4"
msgid ""
"The petals of the flower radiate a crimson glow. The air around it trembles "
"with heat — or supernatural rage."
msgstr "꽃잎이 선홍빛으로 빛납니다. 주위의 공기가 열 혹은 초자연적인 분노로 떨렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Pond_Poisoned_String
msgctxt "08a66ca7-6fe9-49bc-b933-5f947506761d"
msgid "The water has grown dark and menacing."
msgstr "물은 어두워지고 위험해졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Sorrow2_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "0ae62ff1-57ca-4844-9132-b7b5bead4ccd"
msgid ""
"\"It's so quiet here… I can't even hear my own heartbeat. Is my heart still "
"beating in my chest, or have they taken that from me too?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 너무 조용해... 내 심장 소리조차 들리지 않아. 내 심장이 아직 뛰고 있는걸까, 아니면 그들이 내 심장마저 빼앗아간걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Sorrow3_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "3a771ac2-34d7-430f-85ab-45935b5b05db"
msgid "\"Cursed, cursed… alone in silence… what am I to do? What?!\""
msgstr "\"저주받았어..저주받았어... 침묵 속에서 홀로... 이제 나는 무엇을 해야 하지? 무엇을?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Trial1_String
msgctxt "ee676eaa-2434-4f5f-8ac7-2c48cbaf2362"
msgid "\"Coming! She's coming!\""
msgstr "\"온다! 그녀가 온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Trial2_String
msgctxt "caf44983-50f9-400e-bf32-79a09812956d"
msgid "\"How dare she…\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 감히...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Trial3_String
msgctxt "55c77e71-10eb-464f-9d8c-342220b2f9b0"
msgid "\"She's lost.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 가망이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Barks/Trial4_String
msgctxt "cc14faa2-0b87-4e63-a836-0f4b85dcc084"
msgid "\"Punishment! We demand punishment!\""
msgstr "\"처벌! 우리는 처벌을 요구한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse0_wow1_String
msgctxt "4e9f1942-5887-451d-b3bb-2937e4e47c10"
msgid "\"Get ready.\""
msgstr "\"준비하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse0_wow2_String
msgctxt "caf93aab-0969-43f9-93c3-dfc963654ee6"
msgid "\"Get scared.\""
msgstr "\"두려워 하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse0_wow3_String
msgctxt "94910aed-6d23-44d9-abc4-e781953a0a50"
msgid "\"Learn.\""
msgstr "\"배워라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse0_wow4_String
msgctxt "acd26387-1122-4627-b2d8-96fad178930a"
msgid "\"Listen.\""
msgstr "\"들어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse1_LK_String
msgctxt "9a944fa1-b671-4925-8155-28f49106cf66"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to me, trespasser. You sought a kingdom, I seek something simpler — "
"an apology.\""
msgstr "\"들어라. 침입자여. 너는 왕국을 원하고있고, 나는 더 간단한걸 원하고 있다. 네 사과 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse1_wow1_String
msgctxt "d170b612-439e-4be8-b7a0-e17eb575a599"
msgid "\"Guilty.\""
msgstr "\"유죄.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse1_wow2_String
msgctxt "c4dcac40-3440-48bf-b6ce-3c4f58fb871b"
msgid "\"Doomed.\""
msgstr "\"파멸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse1_wow3_String
msgctxt "bf849838-6f8f-484a-b988-f01dc11c3dfb"
msgid "\"Lost.\""
msgstr "\"상실.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse1_wow4_String
msgctxt "9764a98e-e136-4fac-9676-ab4c626120ea"
msgid "\"Cursed.\""
msgstr "\"저주.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse2_LK2_String
msgctxt "12c12704-53c5-4755-a66e-e2dfb47acadc"
msgid "\"It will be a lengthy task, and this is how it shall be measured.\""
msgstr "\"그것은 오랜 시간이 걸릴 것이고 이것이 측정 방법이 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse2_LK_String
msgctxt "9531107e-6b3d-4f41-9f06-c2f7b103c663"
msgid ""
"\"As you sought to steal a kingdom for yourself, so must you do again, a "
"thousand times over. For a theft, a true theft, must be practiced to be "
"earned.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 자신을 위해 왕국을 훔치려고 하였으니, 그 일을 천 번 더 행해야만 한다. 도둑, 진정한 도둑이 되려면, 오직 수없는 연습만이 "
"결실을 얻게 해줄것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse2_wow1_String
msgctxt "817f718b-1dad-4476-9185-03c794a0e189"
msgid "\"Hear.\""
msgstr "\"들어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse2_wow2_String
msgctxt "929c582b-cd3b-4a1e-b3c2-57388a9a27f9"
msgid "\"Bow.\""
msgstr "\"인사해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse2_wow3_String
msgctxt "d7dd7214-1f47-4b01-8ccf-c4bbbbc98792"
msgid "\"Remember.\""
msgstr "\"기억해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse2_wow4_String
msgctxt "b3c26e73-6eee-4120-ad53-cc618c1947e6"
msgid "\"Do it.\""
msgstr "\"어서 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse3_LK_String
msgctxt "e6689c15-dfaf-4fc6-9080-da480d8f061e"
msgid ""
"\"Make ruins of kingdoms. When each is dust, the grains shall gather in this "
"vessel. When a thousand grains are gathered, bring it before us as an "
"offering so that an Eldest may sip from it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왕국을 폐허로 만드는 거야. 왕국이 먼지가 되었을 때 알갱이는 이 잔 안에 모아질 것이다. 알갱이가 천개가 되면 우리 앞에 가져와 "
"원로가 그것을 맛보게 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse3_wow1_String
msgctxt "8b8c1f32-d6c2-4e68-89d5-b9c7a28d3cdd"
msgid "\"Cinders.\""
msgstr "\"재.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse3_wow2_String
msgctxt "b24b696d-a58e-4de2-a1c9-d6c4a3d58552"
msgid "\"Ashes.\""
msgstr "\"잿가루.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse3_wow3_String
msgctxt "67327caa-f38c-487e-9a71-c587976f7f81"
msgid "\"Dust.\""
msgstr "\"먼지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse3_wow4_String
msgctxt "1aab4df4-8e7e-4d47-a828-5dbc92f1c620"
msgid "\"Eternity.\""
msgstr "\"영원.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse4_LK_String
msgctxt "4251396e-25ac-478f-83c2-1a8074f9afe6"
msgid "\"When that is done, your trespass shall be forgiven.\""
msgstr "\"그 일이 끝나면 너의 침입은 용서 받을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse5_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "57a1b308-0801-404b-afb6-6ef58e106f68"
msgid "\"Where will I find so many nations — it is…\""
msgstr "\"어디서 그런 많은 나라를 찾지...그건...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse6_LK1_String
msgctxt "08a9f7ad-c519-4bc8-ac2d-1591203519d8"
msgid ""
"\"Seek it, hunt it, lust for it. Let the emptiness inside you become your "
"deadliest weapon.\""
msgstr "\"찾아서 사냥하고 탐해라. 네 안의 공허가 너의 가장 치명적인 무기가 되게 해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse6_LK2_String
msgctxt "e1277980-cefc-4695-920b-c137e31da73e"
msgid ""
"\"It is not an impossible task. After all, what use is an apology if it "
"cannot ever be given?\""
msgstr "\"불가능한 일이 아니다. 받아들여지지 않으면 사과가 무슨 소용인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse6_LK_String
msgctxt "9f94d470-fe0d-419d-a392-2ebd0d000548"
msgid ""
"\"An impossible task? No. Let your unrequited love guide you — it guided you "
"to your first kingdom, so it shall again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불가능한 일이라고? 그렇지 않다. 네 응답받지 못한 사랑(짝사랑, unrequited love)이 널 이끌도록 해라 — 그것이 너를 "
"첫번째 왕국으로 인도했으니, 또 다시 그럴것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse6_wow1_String
msgctxt "fc297543-eb92-4be3-9b65-9ecf9f91d362"
msgid "\"Forgiven...\""
msgstr "\"용서 받았다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse6_wow2_String
msgctxt "e1db9f98-0200-420a-ab78-43bebe7e1516"
msgid "\"Cursed.\""
msgstr "\"저주 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse6_wow3_String
msgctxt "7796d225-d611-43e6-9f52-d6d325bb41c3"
msgid "\"Cursed.\""
msgstr "\"저주 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/CURSE/Curse6_wow4_String
msgctxt "4c6b6bee-9884-46dc-9c01-e855e8f0f4ca"
msgid "\"Cursed.\""
msgstr "\"저주 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Fireplace/Fireplace_String
msgctxt "db242295-b3f8-48bd-b32c-9f8aadf6bdf9"
msgid "Fireplace"
msgstr "화로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Flower/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b4c2bc14-0e69-441e-a058-ca73498245a5"
msgid "[Drop the poison from the lake on the petals]"
msgstr "[호수에서 얻은 독을 꽃잎 위에 떨어뜨립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Flower/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "720a82d5-4944-4e76-9f9f-66ac7c52ed34"
msgid "[Destroy the flower]"
msgstr "[꽃을 파괴합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Flower/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "6203ee43-d532-46c2-af19-5fd20e84aeff"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Flower/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "9d7fddac-87e6-4e49-aeec-c510baf4a381"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Flower/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "4f1de235-16d5-49d0-9d99-ec2b4c1737ef"
msgid ""
"{n}The petals of this huge flower are glowing with a soft light, and its "
"scent carries a hint of spice which you find strangely relaxing. Despite "
"this, however, you can't help but notice the sprouts and spikes of the plant "
"look… fanged, almost predatory.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 거대한 꽃의 꽃잎은 부드러운 빛으로 빛나고 그 향기는 이상하게 편안한 강렬한 향이 느껴집니다. 좋은 향기에도 불구하고 당신은 "
"식물의 가시가 육식동물의 송곳니처럼 펼쳐진 모습을 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Flower/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "9c249993-3f4e-4103-95fb-764332a82d95"
msgid ""
"{n}Whatever enchantment the flower possesses, you are still able to hack it "
"down easily, and the glow fades.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}꽃이 가지고 있는 어떤 마법에도 불구하고 당신은 그것을 쉽게 제압하였고 빛이 사라졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Flower/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "bc13565d-936b-485e-8389-6eef598945e5"
msgid ""
"{n} As soon as the poison falls on the petals, the petals blaze with a "
"bright crimson light. The air around the flower trembles — either in heat or "
"supernatural wrath.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}독이 꽃잎에 떨어지자마자 꽃잎은 밝은 진홍색 빛을 뿜으며 타오릅니다. 꽃 주위의 공기는 열 혹은 초자연적인 분노로 떨렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Flower/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "92d96cb2-8d3c-441d-be42-bc3da292921e"
msgid ""
"{n}A shining magical aura surrounds the Everblooming Flower. It seems so "
"familiar — exactly like the magic emanating from the bodies of the Bloom "
"victims, but stronger — much stronger. There's no doubt: you've found the "
"source of the disaster.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}빛나는 마법의 기운이 영원히 피는 꽃을 둘러쌉니다. 그것은 매우 익숙해 보입니다. 전염병의 희생자들에게서 나온 마법과 같은 것이지만 "
"훨씬 강했습니다. 당신은 질병의 근원을 찾았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/BirdBones_ObjectDescription_String
msgctxt "42ee18f1-2099-4393-8fa2-be38c6edc2fc"
msgid "Bones — all that's left of a beautiful bird and her songs."
msgstr "노래를 부르던 아름다운 새가 남긴 것은 뼈 뿐이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/BirdBones_ObjectName_String
msgctxt "4f1f255d-4d26-4d64-9cdd-470ec7cf99e8"
msgid "Bird Bones"
msgstr "새의 뼈"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Bird_ActionName_String
msgctxt "d326d629-1832-4f36-8852-26901299679b"
msgid "[Catch the bird]"
msgstr "[새를 잡습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Bird_ObjectDescription_String
msgctxt "2f641827-05f5-41d1-9584-f9fb65cb07a6"
msgid "A bird with bright, iridescent feathers."
msgstr "밝고 무지개 빛깔의 깃털을 가진 새입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Bird_ObjectName_String
msgctxt "e563a070-1689-46c1-858d-dff20a91878e"
msgid "Mysterious Bird"
msgstr "신비한 새"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/FirstWorldLantern_Description_String
msgctxt "dffc19f6-6ebc-4a63-bb8b-9d7cb9c2001f"
msgid ""
"The lantern shines with phantasmal blue light. It lights up or extinguishes "
"with a touch."
msgstr "랜턴은 환상적인 파란 빛으로 빛납니다. 그것은 만지면 켜지거나 꺼집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/FirstWorldLantern_ObjectName_String
msgctxt "a8059108-a439-432b-ac99-6735f24567f7"
msgid "Magical Lantern"
msgstr "마법의 등불"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Platform_ActionName_2_String
msgctxt "3e4c19ef-1848-4bcc-945e-58de13fcbab5"
msgid "[Take the bird bones from the dais]"
msgstr "[연단에서 새의 뼈를 가져갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Platform_ActionName_3_String
msgctxt "07be29bc-d397-48bd-98f9-c0273244e12a"
msgid "[Put the bird bones on the dais]"
msgstr "[연단에 새의 뼈를 올려놓습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Platform_ActionName_String
msgctxt "a1aacf3e-3ba2-4b63-b602-e09cf9c4a665"
msgid "[Place the bird on the dais]"
msgstr "[연단에 새를 올려놓습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Platform_ObjectName_String
msgctxt "4eb9a601-26c7-4cbe-81e6-7a0e765d1939"
msgid "Dais"
msgstr "연단"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Pond_ActionName_String
msgctxt "a68b2195-a5e1-41f9-af5b-0a102179fd19"
msgid "[Draw water from the pond]"
msgstr "[웅덩이에서 물을 길었습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/Pond_ObjectName_String
msgctxt "52e74f7a-0be4-41a4-bd5b-f186400007a2"
msgid "Deep Pond"
msgstr "연못"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/WaterVial_ObjectDescription_String
msgctxt "c192e4d0-9a34-43af-b7b5-359a7a2ed968"
msgid "A vial with poisoned water from the pond."
msgstr "연못에서 독이 담긴 물을 유리병에 담았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Items/WaterVial_ObjectName_String
msgctxt "1d8b4739-b396-4cc7-96d2-f4f4fa6bcb81"
msgid "Vial with Poisoned Water"
msgstr "독이 담긴 유리병"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "e5e2410a-04a4-40bb-a68d-3ca497de81ef"
msgid "\"I've solved your riddle. But what do I do next?\""
msgstr "\"네 수수께끼를 풀었어. 이제 다음으로 무엇을 해야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8a77f95c-797c-4a94-865e-04783b03e5b8"
msgid ""
"\"So, it was this 'Goddess' who created the flower, and all my troubles were "
"due to her?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 꽃을 만든 것은 이 '여신'이었고, 내 모든 문제들은 다 그녀 때문이라는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "854ae2c2-e662-41bb-bcad-9ad45f44847f"
msgid "\"I still have some business to take care of here. We'll talk later.\""
msgstr "\"아직 여기에 할 일이 남아있어. 나중에 다시 이야기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "84aadf4c-dbee-4f86-b503-76a6cd69438b"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} because of "
"circumstances."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 주변 상황에 이끌려 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "ec3bee8b-da82-41b0-8e3d-4da979fdc9fa"
msgid "\"It was just circumstances.\""
msgstr "\"어쩌다 보니 이런 상황에 놓이게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8bb3fb98-f9e9-4729-9e32-f43148f8a2ab"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} just passing by "
"& noticing swordlords were looking for one."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 당신은 지나가다가 소드로드에게 눈에 띄여 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "6153b2d7-2096-4990-84cc-48838d55d1bb"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I was just passing by and noticed a line of candidates for the "
"position of {mf|baron|baroness}.\""
msgstr "\"그냥 지나가고 있었는데 남작 후보 중의 한 명이 된 것일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d346c3de-6366-416f-b0bc-785fe6fb06a1"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} because it was "
"your duty."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 자신의 의무이기 때문에 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "ef6d1dc3-7c57-420b-8b2e-8030e008c243"
msgid "\"My duty is to make the world a better place.\""
msgstr "\"내 의무는 세상을 더 나은 곳으로 만드는 것이기 때문이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f26b43a2-ccdd-4d11-b7d0-c3de0f8598a5"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} for the sake of "
"adventures."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 모험을 즐기기 위해 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "48399443-e204-444f-88c8-b713739e1dc6"
msgid "\"Adventure! That's what I've always desired.\""
msgstr "\"모험을 하기 위해서지! 항상 내가 바라던 것이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7dc38101-3b6f-4af3-b9f0-b017edb57d96"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} because of lust "
"for power."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 힘에 대한 욕망 때문에 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "70d2c62c-cc2e-4eb9-90f8-988314998e1c"
msgid "\"A thirst for power.\""
msgstr "\"힘에 대한 갈망 때문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c77c8bb5-b415-4ec7-835c-181d50c71f56"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} for the sake of "
"suffering people."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 고통받는 사람들을 구하기 위해 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b37d85ef-4e9a-46fe-9278-8cc73aea52df"
msgid "\"To prevent the suffering of others, if I can.\""
msgstr "\"다른 사람들의 고통을 막아주기 위해서이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "78ddc347-e673-4ce9-8d7b-f7dd6535866a"
msgid ""
"\"It's time to get to it, then. Let's split up and destroy the flower in "
"both worlds simultaneously.\""
msgstr "\"그럼, 이제 시작할 시간이군. 갈라져서 두 세계의 꽃을 동시에 파괴해버리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "081e9e40-f4b1-4380-ba38-2c96100a7eb0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm here alone — I have no one with me to send to the other world to "
"destroy the flower there.\""
msgstr "\"나는 여기 혼자 왔어. 꽃을 파괴하기 위해 다른 세계에 보낼 사람이 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "567f2b75-e498-4c4b-a092-f70ef0058ee1"
msgid "\"We'll get to it a bit later.\""
msgstr "\"조금 더 가면 도착한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "2db4592e-4b66-49cd-abc0-e1bb265a9e8e"
msgid "\"Can I still get back to Golarion if I destroy the flower?\""
msgstr "\"꽃을 없애면 골라리온으로 돌아갈 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "5448aba5-238e-499f-bc74-a702e03186d3"
msgid "\"How did you do it, gnome?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 했지. 노움?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "e9bd5d96-be9d-46f4-9611-455ca8a9e7d9"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, I have no time to explain. You'll have to go through the portal "
"and destroy the flower — it looks exactly the same as this one. It is the "
"source of all our troubles.\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 설명할 시간이 없다. 포털을 지나 꽃을 파괴해. 이것과 똑같이 생겼어. 그것이 모든 문제의 근원이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0058_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "917d97a0-1847-4113-8ebf-8f940f4725d6"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} to bring order "
"to Stolen Lands at any price."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 어떤 대가를 치르고서라도 도둑맞은 땅에 질서를 세우기 위해 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "6af3c26e-36a8-46ee-8e07-e8a8ae2067d5"
msgid "\"The Stolen Lands need order — at any cost.\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅에는 질서가 필요하기 때문이지. 어떤 대가를 치뤄서라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0059_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "92beb3fc-d22e-4a41-a596-bd992dc12295"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} to rise above "
"everyone and set your own rules."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 모든 인간 위에 군림하고 당신만의 규칙을 만들기 위해 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "eeebc789-b307-4de7-8e60-6ffb48b72d28"
msgid "\"The world needs to be governed — by my rule, no other.\""
msgstr "\"세상은 통치를 받아야 할 필요가 있기 때문이지. 다른 사람이 아닌 바로 나의 규칙에 따라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0060_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "66de1152-7ec6-4251-8cf9-5452712ca190"
msgid ""
"Told strange gnome that you chose to become a baron{mf||ess} because lifes "
"and souls are no more than toys for you."
msgstr "이상한 노움에게 삶과 영혼은 당신에게 즐길 거리이기 때문에 남작이 되었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "0f3d2633-526d-487e-b5c0-c417cacab6b4"
msgid "\"Lives, destinies — they are all just toys for me to play with.\""
msgstr "\"삶과 운명. 그것들은 모두 나에게는 유희 거리지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "dd2e9865-3a1f-4cbb-8c86-2130f9afb87e"
msgid ""
"{n}A familiar silhouette emerges from the mist — it is the gnome from "
"before, walking slowly toward you. He stops before the flower and stares at "
"it for a several moments.{/n} \"Well done, child. But your work here isn't "
"finished yet.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}익숙한 실루엣이 안개에서 나옵니다. 천천히 걸어나오는 것은 이전에 보았던 노움입니다. 그는 꽃 앞에 멈춰서 한동안 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"
" \"잘했구나. 하지만 이곳에서의 너의 일은 아직 끝나지 않았단다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "ede25768-abd3-403a-a7ee-e07e412ef89c"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome is silent for a moment, then speaks.{/n} \"I cannot say yes or "
"no. The truth shifts and evaporates like a morning mist. Aren't your "
"troubles the blood spilled from the blade of your own choices?\" {n}The "
"gnome raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"These troubles that beset you... this is not "
"all. There will be many more. Know this — when you catch a fleeting shadow "
"out of the corner of your eye, and turn to look, but it's gone — it's Her "
"shadow. If you hear footsteps behind you and nothing seems there — it's Her "
"footsteps, and you hear them only because She wishes you to hear Her "
"approach. Why? It is so you know Her blade is never far from your back.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 잠시 침묵을 지키다가 곧 말을 합니다.{/n} \"예라고도 아니라고도 말할 수 없구나. 진실은 아침 안개와 같이 증발하지. "
"너의 고민은 네 선택의 칼날로 인해 흘린 피가 아니던가?\" {n}노움은 눈썹을 치켜 올립니다.{/n} \"너를 괴롭히는 이 문제는... "
"이것이 전부가 아니야. 더 많은 것이 있을 거야. 이것을 알아두렴. 도망치는 그림자를 발견해서 그것을 보려고 하면 사라질 거야. 그것은 "
"그녀의 그림자란다. 네 등 뒤에 그녀의 발자국 소리가 들리지만 아무것도 보이지 않아. 그것은 그녀의 발자국이란다. 네가 들을 수 있는 "
"것은 그녀가 들려주고 싶어서여서야. 왜냐고? 그래야 그녀의 칼날이 네 등 뒤에 꽂힐 거라는 걸 네가 알게 되니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "d62e318e-1843-413e-b13a-8ab5d6074e2d"
msgid ""
"\"Before you go your way — a question. You've seen the story of the "
"trespasser, you've seen Her fall. Love and pride brought Her to this. You "
"follow the same path, you also crave the crown. Why?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 떠나기 전에 질문하나 해야겠구나. 너는 침입자의 이야기를 들었고, 그녀의 몰락을 보았단다. 사랑(Love)과 교만(pride)이 "
"그녀에게 몰락을 가져왔지. 너도 같은 길을 따르며, 왕관 역시 원하고 있구나. 왜 그런 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "345233a4-d73c-4a56-9453-265c726449f2"
msgid ""
"\"You must extinguish the wrath, quench it with fire. But it won't be easy. "
"The flower blossoms in two worlds at the same time — here and in your "
"homeland, {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. Its existence links the two worlds and "
"cruelly casts creatures between them. If you destroy the flower in only one "
"world, it will grow back. You must kill it in both worlds at once.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 분노를 불태우고, 불로 그것을 잠재워야 해. 하지만 쉽지 않겠지. 꽃의 개화는 두 세계에서 동시에 일어난단다. 여기와 너희 세계 "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 말이야. 꽃의 존재는 두 세계를 연결하고 생물들을 나타나게 하지. 한 세계에서만 꽃을 파괴하면 "
"다시 자랄 거야. 두 세계에서 모두 죽여야만 한단다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "15e47328-e94e-4b91-a130-d41c531a9032"
msgid ""
"\"Don't worry about that. The portals, opened by the flower, will live long "
"enough.\""
msgstr "\"걱정하지 마렴. 꽃에 의해 열린 포털은 충분히 오래 지속될 것이란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "6d33de2a-a555-43ce-9940-e083f1aeb6c9"
msgid "\"A wise decision. Who will you send beyond the portal?\""
msgstr "\"현명한 선택이로구나. 포털로 누구를 보낼 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0028_Text_String
msgctxt "de187e2a-6a53-4cae-bbd7-ac1546485b22"
msgid "\"Who else?\""
msgstr "\"그 밖에 누구를?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "95b4a11a-a82a-46d9-83a2-51f0d92050d5"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, don't worry about that. I know how to solve this. Let's call someone "
"to help. Someone...\" {n}The gnome gives you a sly smile.{/n} \"…who's "
"willing to sacrifice himself to help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"걱정하지 마. 나는 해결할 방법을 알아. 누군가에게 도와달라고 부탁하자. 누군가...\" {n}노움은 당신에게 교활한 미소를 "
"지어줍니다.{/n} \"... 돕기 위해 기꺼이 자신을 희생할 사람.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "483c93a3-3930-419a-8974-c2a02d3996fb"
msgid "{n}The gnome nods.{/n} \"Let me know when you're ready.\""
msgstr "{n}노움은 머리를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"준비가 되면 알려다오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "c5aa0135-4b69-4e07-a91c-7e8bdd157973"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome gives a half-nod, then tilts his head and looks at you "
"intently.{/n} \"Words, words... words can be motes stirred by the wind, a "
"trifle, a wisp of smoke... but when they are spoken in the right time and "
"place, words can possess the power of a storm. At some point, a long time "
"hence, you'll recall this moment... and your answer.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 반 쯤 고개를 끄덕이고는 머리를 기울여 당신을 뚫어지게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"말, 말...말이란 그저 바람에 흩날리는 "
"먼지나 작은 연기 조각이 될 수도 있지만, 적절한 시간과 장소에서 사용하면 폭풍과 같은 힘을 가질 수도 있단다. 언젠가, 오랜 시간이 "
"흘러, 너는 지금 이 순간을 다시 떠올리게 될꺼란다... 지금 너의 대답과 함께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "a17abcff-a277-4949-8e3c-ff8bed56bc50"
msgid ""
"\"What… how… Your Grace? A moment ago, I was with Jhod, and suddenly I heard "
"your voice calling my name…\""
msgstr "\"어떻게... 방금까지 나는 조드와 함께 있었는데 내 이름을 부르는 네 목소리를 갑자기 들었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "53d750dd-542b-419b-b7eb-7761d6cdd15c"
msgid ""
"\"The magic of the {g|First World}First World{/g} can do many things, child. "
"The one who must be here, finds their way eventually.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}의 마법으로 많은 일이 일어날 수 있지. 여기에 와야 할 사람은 결국 자신의 길을 찾는다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "abeeb9d9-8ed9-4b5c-bfae-551fb4b8abfb"
msgid ""
"\"I'm ready.\" {n}Tristian's voice is firm.{/n} \"I'll do what I can. More, "
"if needed.\""
msgstr "\"나는 준비 됐어.\" {n}트리스티안의 목소리는 단호합니다.{/n} \"필요하다면 내가 할 수 있는 걸 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "cdb7ca9d-65fc-4d8f-a29d-507a688cc9f0"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome looks like he's fallen asleep in the sunlight. He nods abruptly "
"— either to you or to his own thoughts.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}노움은 햇빛 아래에서 잠이 들은 것처럼 보입니다. 그는 너 또는 자신의 생각에 동의하듯 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "247c87af-b418-461a-9a22-874ebdf7bbcf"
msgid "\"As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "5a8594f3-4e2b-4316-a8dc-4d316e061d0b"
msgid ""
"\"But beware. Violence breeds violence, and wrath breeds wrath. You've "
"awakened the flower for it was the only way to destroy it — but, awakened, "
"it summons all kinds of monsters, and they are filled with the same wrath as "
"that which gave life to the plant.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 조심하렴. 폭력은 폭력을 낳고, 분노는 분노를 낳는단다. 너는 이것을 파괴하는 유일한 방법이기에 꽃을 깨웠지만, 깨어난 "
"꽃은 그것에게 생명을 부여했던 것과 같이 분노로 가득찬 모든 종류의 괴물을 소환한단다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "4e2f07ae-9303-4609-8c23-b9a6d678f5d4"
msgid ""
"\"After you slay the monsters born from its seeds, burn that wonderful, vile "
"flowering blossom. Let flame consume it. But remember — the fire must happen "
"in both worlds at once. If you burn the flower only here or only on "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, it will sprout again. And again. And again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"씨앗에서 태어난 괴물을 죽인 후에는, 아름답지만 그 끔찍한 꽃을 태워야만 한단다. 불이 그 꽃을 삼키도록 두거라. 하지만 기억하렴, "
"반드시 두 세계에서 동시에 태워야 해. {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서만 꽃을 태우면 다시 싹을 피울 거야. 계속해서 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "88f5f7a9-88ce-4212-9f8d-cab65b208f1c"
msgid ""
"\"A noble motivation. But do you really know those you seek to protect…?\""
msgstr "\"고귀한 동기로구나. 하지만 네가 보호하려는 자들이 진정 누구인지는 알고있니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "56e943d1-0d32-428f-b563-e476c246bd98"
msgid "\"It's so easy and so careless, child…\""
msgstr "\"정말 조심성이 없구나, 아이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "6468e5a9-7069-4536-9590-e1735dd54109"
msgid "\"To bring order to lands branded by chaos…\""
msgstr "\"혼돈이 가득한 땅에 질서를 세우려면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "348ef11c-e5a0-46e9-9bff-3af349ee47e3"
msgid ""
"\"Circumstances? A blind chance? Sometimes everything depends on that…\""
msgstr "\"그럴만한 상황? 단순한 우연같은걸까? 때로는 모든게 그런것들에 달려있을때가 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "84b9d029-5920-44d7-94ed-8bf038d5b998"
msgid "\"You like to play games with your own fate, I see.\""
msgstr "\"네 운명으로 놀이를 하는것을 좋아하는 모양이로구나. 알겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "6809bc24-f515-4741-9960-ebe37e2e49db"
msgid ""
"\"The world has heard many claims like that, but rarely honored — by either "
"the speaker or their subjects.\""
msgstr "\"그런 말들이 가끔 나오고는 하지만 그런 말을 하는 사람이나 듣는 사람들도 존중하지는 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "ea032c00-bc78-4f36-88ce-bd0ce1cf949c"
msgid "\"The thirst that can be tamed, but not quenched...\""
msgstr "\"길들여 질 수는 있지만, 해소할 수는 없는 갈증이로구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "67104b79-c19d-4608-9a83-d25ad5eac142"
msgid "\"Sometimes children are so cruel with their toys…\""
msgstr "\"가끔 아이들은 장난감으로 잔인한 놀이를 하고는 하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LKafterFlowerDefeat/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "061bcf09-6b6b-4ffc-badf-15f66ab26040"
msgid ""
"\"Duty's path may seem straight as an arrow, but it's so easy to go astray…\""
msgstr "\"의무의 길은 화살처럼 곧게 보일지 모르지만, 길을 잘못 들어서기 아주 쉽지…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "3095258a-8a6b-44c6-bbf0-d25cd8575dd5"
msgid "\"Who are you and what is this place?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구고 여기는 뭐하는 곳이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "60b40ace-4158-467f-b2df-7ab34c3cc692"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"이곳은 어디지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "0c5c5b77-b5a5-4835-8fa8-4f36bdb79be7"
msgid "\"How can we get out of here?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 여기서 나갈 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "5818c455-4c53-4b3e-996f-e59f1b6525ab"
msgid ""
"\"I've seen something odd here. A vision of a woman — and many others — in "
"the mist — they appeared before me, then vanished.\""
msgstr "\"이곳에서 이상한 것을 보았어. 안개 속에서 한 여인과 다른 많은 사람들의 환영이 내 앞에 나타났다가 사라졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "adaf6cc6-1851-4389-8499-7c74e768abc2"
msgid ""
"\"Monsters are emerging from seed-portals into my lands. What do you know "
"about it?\""
msgstr "\"씨앗의 포털로부터 괴물들이 내 땅에 나타나고 있어. 그것에 대해 아는 것이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "87e73905-8da3-48a8-82d6-024a7aee1809"
msgid "\"Well, farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "18709f01-8535-42fe-b5b2-5725b7de576b"
msgid "\"Are we in the First World?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 태초세계에 와있는건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "48b43281-6d87-4f6f-bf71-6da959ab100d"
msgid "\"Let's stop talking about that for now.\""
msgstr "\"일단 이 얘기는 그만하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "4ce40077-08ec-4834-b88c-feafa9b82377"
msgid ""
"\"Troubling events brought me here. Maybe you know something about what's "
"happening.\""
msgstr "\"여러 문제들이 일어나 이곳으로 오게 되었어. 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는건지, 아마도 너는 뭔가 알고있을것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "e4e238dd-dfaf-4bb2-8db7-7f072ba36fd0"
msgid "\"Who's this Goddess you speak of?\""
msgstr "\"네가 말하는 그 여신은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "97f02639-6441-4f0b-b1bb-ee18f29a6f39"
msgid "\"I have to go. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"이제 가봐야겠어. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "ac761661-310e-4db7-9f72-2cc05074a842"
msgid ""
"\"Could you tell me the story of the Goddess again? The short version.\""
msgstr "\"여신의 이야기를 다시 말해줄 수 있어? 요약해서 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "f8f0590b-46bf-4f6e-a5dd-2a24c06df9fe"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "373c3c6e-e329-4acd-8436-5c904755b9b3"
msgid "\"Enough about that for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그 정도면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "0b1dd79c-cdee-4b4c-8c9a-1debbffb27dc"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Goddess again.\""
msgstr "\"여신에 대해 다시 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "9d669030-fa0b-43b2-8462-54d32389e9e1"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome looks old, worn, and is covered in a layer of dust, as if he "
"has sat here for some time without moving. His back is hunched, and as you "
"approach, he tilts his head up to you, giving an odd half-smile.{/n} \"Come, "
"child! Come closer, don't be scared! The sound of your footsteps reminded me "
"of...\" {n}The gnome dips his head and goes silent, although his lips remain "
"moving — as if he is speaking silently to himself.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 늙고, 지쳐보이며 먼지에 덮여있어, 마치 한동안 움직이지 않고 앉아 있었던 것 같습니다. 그의 등은 굽었고 당신이 접근하자 "
"그는 머리를 기울여 묘한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"이리온! 아이야! 가까이 오렴. 두려워할 필요 없단다! 네 발소리는 마치...\" "
"{n}노움은 머리를 숙이고는 침묵했지만 입술은 여전히 움직입니다. 그는 조용히 자신에게 무엇인가 말하고 있는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "551e4dec-c5fc-4b7d-8194-8aea56bbf90d"
msgid ""
"\"This is the beginning that was before all other beginnings. The echo born "
"before sound. This is the mark on the margins of sacred text, made by gods "
"when they got bored. This is the world, but unlike all other worlds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 다른 모든 시작이 있기 전보다 먼저 시작된 곳이란다. 소리보다 먼저 태어난 메아리이지. 이 곳은 신들이 지루할 때 만든 신성한 "
"글귀의 여백에 있는 표시와 같아. 이곳도 세계이지만 다른 세계와는 다르지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "bc1409e4-b4b9-46e3-b14d-0a1a0a5edec9"
msgid "\"Where else?\" {n}The gnome grins.{/n}"
msgstr "\"어디라구?\" {n}노움은 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "14d5e138-a545-4783-a3ad-bf419f9ac484"
msgid ""
"\"Dear sir, I've got one thousand one hundred and twenty-seven questions for "
"you. Approximately.\" {n}Jubilost coughs and straightens, as if trying to "
"project an air of authority.{/n} \"Do me the courtesy of answering at least "
"one! Do you know why gnomes left the {g|First World}First World{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 나는 대략 천백스물일곱개의 질문이 있어.\" {n}주빌로스트는 기침하고는 권위있게 말하려는 듯 허리를 폅니다.{/n} \"적어도"
" 하나는 말해줘! 왜 노움이 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}를 떠났는지 알아? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "9613cb96-3792-45cc-b3d3-c2785c0ff43f"
msgid "\"No.\""
msgstr "\"아니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "09bb8132-9458-47cf-bbad-f3d5b36efd0a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm just an old man, a remnant of the past in a world that cares as little "
"for time as you care about the air you breathe.\" {n}The gnome covers his "
"eyes and starts rocking back and forth.{/n} \"So many things lost... so many "
"people left...and still I'm here, here...\" {n}His voice drops to a whisper, "
"but he continues to rock back and forth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그저 늙은 노인일 뿐이란다. 네가 숨쉬는 공기만큼이나 신경쓰지 않는 세상의 과거 잔재물이지.\" {n}노움은 눈을 감고 몸을 "
"앞뒤로 흔들기 시작합니다.{/n} \"너무 많은 것을 잃었어...너무 많은 사람들이 떠났어. 그래도 난 아직 이곳에 있지. 이곳에.\" "
"{n}그의 목소리는 속삭임이 되었지만 여전히 몸을 앞뒤로 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "9761de1e-4bd2-4109-b5b3-e8b0e9881c59"
msgid ""
"\"Monsters? No, no... they are just creatures, frightened, as you and I "
"would be so far from home. They've lived here with me for time countless, "
"and were my only friends before the Bloom tore the world. It's not their "
"fault! Seal the Bloom and they will trouble your world no longer!"
msgstr ""
"\"괴물들? 아니야, 아니야... 그들은 단지 집에서 멀리 떨어져, 겁에 질려있는 생명체들일뿐이야. 그들은 무수한 시간 동안 나와 함께 "
"이곳에서 살아왔고, 개화가 세상을 파괴하기 전까지는 나의 유일한 친구들이였어. 그들의 잘못이 아니야! 개화의 근원을 봉인하면 더 이상 "
"너희 세상을 괴롭히지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "1974852c-9aad-41d9-8ca5-4703db3cf162"
msgid ""
"\"The Goddess once passed here. The proud one, the bitter one, the one who "
"fell so far, yet never has fallen to her knees. Her steps still echo — taste "
"the silence, the salt in the air is her tears. And when you blink, there's "
"something in a corner of your eye — a shadow, a vision, a memory.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 여신이 이곳을 지나간 적이 있었지. 자신감 있고, 처절했고, 실패했지만 절대 무릎 꿇지 않는 여신이었어. 그녀의 발걸음은 아직도 "
"메아리친단다. 침묵을 맛보고, 공기 중의 짠내는 그녀의 눈물이지. 그리고 눈을 깜빡이면 눈에 무언가가 들어올 거야. 그림자, 환영, "
"기억이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "e9a71beb-9774-4e73-a340-de9a395c2270"
msgid ""
"{n}A strange glow appears in the gnome's eyes.{/n} \"When you approached, "
"for a moment I thought I saw Her again. The way you walk... this power you "
"radiate… and a ghostly crown of a newborn kingdom upon your brow — it cannot "
"be seen, but I see the weight your shoulders bear carrying it. Your "
"connection with Her, with She who fell — it is stronger than you think.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움의 눈빛에는 이상한 기운이 나타납니다.{/n} \"네가 왔을 때, 그 잠깐 동안 나는 그녀가 다시 왔나 생각했단다. 너의 "
"걸음걸이... 너에게서 나오는 힘... 그리고 너의 이마 위에 있는 갓 태어난 왕국의 보이지 않는 왕관. 지금은 그것을 볼 수 없지만, "
"네 어깨가 그 왕관을 짊어지고 있는 것이 느껴지는구나. 몰락한 그녀와 너의 관계는 네 생각보다 강하단다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "1bef2f0b-e332-4ab1-b7b2-ac629610c60c"
msgid ""
"\"Just like that? 'No'? Just 'no'?! Final and absolute 'no' without any "
"nuances and explanations?!\" {n}Jubilost's face is a mix of emotions that "
"are difficult to read — he's either indignant, furious, or… very, very "
"disappointed.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그냥 아니라고 말한 거야? 아니라고?! 설명도 힌트도 없이 그냥 아니라고 말하면 돼?\" {n}주빌로스트의 얼굴은 복잡한 감정이 "
"뒤섞였습니다. 그는 화가 나고 분노가 치밀었거나... 매우 실망한 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "a1812218-189d-44a3-80bb-0601d3314037"
msgid ""
"\"If you seek a snake, don't ask her slough for direction. But I'll tell "
"you...\" {n}The gnome goes silent, as if his ears caught something, then "
"resumes.{/n} \"Those... others... They never 'left'. They never 'went' "
"anywhere. They just disappeared. Everyone disappeared.\" {n}The gnome averts "
"his eyes.{/n} \"I have nothing more to tell you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 뱀을 찾으려 한다면 그녀가 벗은 뱀허물 껍데기에게 방향을 묻지 마. 하지만 내가 너에게 말해주지...\" {n}노움은 마치 "
"무언가를 들은 것처럼 조용해지더니 다시 말합니다.{/n} \"그... 다른 자들은... 결코 떠나지 않았어. 그들은 어디에도 가지 "
"않았어. 그저 사라졌어. 모두 사라졌다.\" {n}노움은 시선을 피합니다.{/n} \"그 이상은 말할 게 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "920c1b82-18fa-4517-8bce-20722c5cdcba"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome turns away and looks at his feet for a long time, mumbling "
"under his breath. After several moments, he turns to you again.{/n} \"It is "
"possible to leave this place! Possible, yes... but to cross back, you'll "
"need to bear the brunt of Her wrath. But it is not something you can find — "
"it is something you must inspire.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 돌아서서 한참동안 자신의 발을 내려다보고는 무언가 중얼거립니다. 잠시 후에 그는 다시 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"이곳을 떠날 "
"수 있어! 가능하지... 하지만 그러기 위해서는 그녀의 분노를 받아내야 할 거야. 하지만 그건 네가 찾을 수 있는 것이 아니야. 열망을 "
"불어넣어야 가능한 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "e6d8e186-c0b4-42c7-8963-49e2c41ccbf2"
msgid ""
"\"You have to follow Her. The Goddess who fell. You have to see the world "
"through Her eyes, recognize Her voice among thousands of other voices. Go "
"down Her path, awaken Her wrath — then you'll be able to return home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀를 따라가야만 해. 몰락한 그 여신을. 그녀의 눈을 통해 세상을 보고, 수천 명의 다른 목소리들 중에서 그녀의 목소리를 "
"알아내야하지. 그녀의 길을 따라 내려가서, 그녀의 분노를 깨워. 그러면 너는 집으로 돌아갈 수 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0034_Text_String
msgctxt "dc800217-f472-4719-8f4f-9a3a55093f15"
msgid ""
"\"She wanted to become more than She was, She dared to claim something that "
"was not Hers. So powerful was the song of Her pride, and so quickly it was "
"silenced! Just a night, a single night in prison, in loneliness, in "
"anticipation of Her future fate, and Her pride became fear. And fear, it "
"burrows deep, like the worst of all poisons — desperation. Do you know how "
"such emotion tastes, child?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 본인 이상의 존재가 되길 원했고, 무모하게도 자신의 것이 아닌 무언가를 자신의 것이라 주장했지. 그녀의 자신감의 노래는 "
"너무나도 강력했고, 입을 다무는 것도 무척 빨랐어! 단 하룻밤을, 감옥 속에서, 외로움 속에서, 자기 미래에 대한 부정적인 예측 속에서 "
"보내고 나니, 그녀의 자존심은 두려움이 되었어. 그리고 두려움은 깊이 뿌리내려, 세상의 독 중에서 가장 강하다는 절망이 되었단다. 그런 "
"감정의 맛이 어떤지 아니, 아이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "9c6adff5-318a-406b-b8c1-c22da99efbb6"
msgid "\"So much meaning can be hidden in one 'maybe'… ask away!\""
msgstr "\"그 '아마도'라는 말에는 많은 의미가 있을 수 있지... 물어보렴!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0040_Text_String
msgctxt "6b9d1db6-4945-4938-867b-7ec0683ee99d"
msgid ""
"\"Don't even think about drinking this poison. Take a drop of it to the "
"place where the seeds of wrath have sprouted. When the wrath awakens and "
"fills everything around, you'll become a step closer to your home and to "
"defeating the Bloom. Follow my story! Watch everything closely, listen "
"carefully. Unknown can be hidden inside known, and much that is unusual lies "
"concealed behind the usual. Take my lantern with you — it will help you to "
"light your way. And know this — not today and not tomorrow, but you will "
"recall the Fallen Goddess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 독을 마실 생각은 하지도 말려무나. 그 대신, 분노의 씨앗이 돋아난 곳까지 가져가 그 독을 뿌리거라. 분노가 깨어나 모든 것을 "
"가득 채울 때, 너희 집으로 돌아가는 것과 개화를 물리치는 것 모두에 한 걸음 더 가까이 갈 테니. 내 이야기를 따르렴! 모든 것을 "
"자세히 살펴보고, 주의깊게 들어야해. 알 수 없는 것은 알려진 것 속에 숨겨져 있을 수 있고, 비범한 거짓말은 평범함 뒤에 더 잘 숨지. "
"내 등불을 받거라. 길을 밝히는 데 도움이 될 거야. 그리고 이걸 기억하렴. 오늘이나 내일이 아닐지라도, 너는 몰락한 여신을 떠올리게 될 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "c56745fa-0c52-4bcb-80a7-ce6b312e34e8"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome nods off, then raises his head abruptly.{/n} \"It's you again! "
"What do you wish to know, child?\""
msgstr "{n}노움은 끄덕이다가 머리를 갑자기 들어올립니다.{/n} \"또 너로구나! 무엇을 알고 싶지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "245e1e86-5637-4094-85a0-5d6eefa69e05"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome's eyes glint slyly.{/n} \"Would anyone listen to the stories, "
"if they are told quick and simple? But fine. The one that sings dies of "
"desperation in the night. The one that is dead poisons the clear waters. "
"This poison born of death is what can awaken the wrath — and awaken the path."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움의 눈은 교활하게 빛납니다.{/n} \"그저 단순히 빨리만 말한다면, 그 누가 이야기를 듣겠어? 하지만 뭐 괜찮아. 노래하는 "
"자는 한밤 중의 절망으로 죽었지. 그 죽음의 독은 맑은 물을 오염 시켰어. 죽음에서 태어난 이 독이 분노를 깨우치고, 길을 깨울 수 "
"있지.'"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "ecc24d8e-6676-42d0-81ea-707374e2b173"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! I'll tell you the story of the Goddess. It will help you, yes, it "
"will…\""
msgstr "\"기다려! 여신의 이야기를 해줄게. 너에게 도움이 될 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "fb9d7070-629b-4eaf-b0f6-a3d9c06f920e"
msgid ""
"\"You, children, are always so curious. Questions, more questions, then some "
"more questions...\" {n}The gnome shrugs.{/n} \"Which should I answer first?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아이들은 항상 호기심이 많구나. 계속해서 질문하고 또 질문하고...\" {n}노움은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"어떤 질문에 먼저 "
"대답해 줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "d888183d-88b2-4d2a-b701-c5d46b452e23"
msgid "\"As you wish, child. As you wish.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로하렴. 아이야. 원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "93c8d9da-53b7-4087-8b82-e7c30414a0cb"
msgid "{n}The gnome gives you a distracted nod.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}노움은 산만하게 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9da674e4-2d5a-4f48-9ec1-e6f40d833154"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed, you can meet my brethren in most unexpected places. Which makes "
"the expression 'unexpected places' pointless where gnomes are concerned!\""
msgstr "\"예상치 못한 곳에서 내 형제들을 만날 수 있어. 예상치 못한 장소라는 의미가 무색할 정도야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2d74063e-13f4-4775-b8e4-fcb25e1c1478"
msgid ""
"\"Poison... Wrath... This is... And that means...\" {n}Linzi frowns, then "
"cheerfully declares,{/n} \"I can't understand it at all! But I'll write "
"everything down, just in case.\""
msgstr ""
"\"독... 분노... 이것은... 그리고 그 의미는...\" {n}린지는 눈살을 찌푸린 후 기분 좋게 말합니다.{/n} \"하나도 "
"이해하지 못하겠어! 하지만 혹시 모르니 모두 쓸 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "8c752a53-a1d2-45d8-a811-a434b2b7ff25"
msgid ""
"\"You are truly old beyond measure... What holds you here in this world?\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 예측 불가구나... 도대체 너는 왜 이 세계에 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "88427ae4-b728-44b1-89dc-05ed9368d081"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing holds me but the world itself. You mortals love asking for "
"reasons, as though the world were governed by laws of cause and effect. As "
"if everything happened for a reason... Silly, stupid mortals. I am here "
"simply because I am here...\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜가 아니라 나는 세계에 있는 거야. 세상이 원인과 결과라는 법칙으로 돌아가는 것마냥 너희 필멸자는 물어보는 것을 좋아하지. 모든 "
"것이 이유가 있는 것처럼 생각을 해... 멍청하고 어리석은 필멸자들. 나는 여기에 있기 때문에 여기에 있는 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "e4d1671c-4dc9-44c8-b2c0-3f6a9daa1442"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, right, sure! The beasts aren't to blame — they were just hungry! But "
"then, I'm not really to blame either, right? I just wanted to chop their "
"heads off!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 짐승을 비난할 게 아니지. 그들은 배가 고팠을 뿐이니까! 하지만 아무도 비난하지 말아야 하나? 그들의 머리를 썰어버리고 싶은데!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/LanternKing/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "15f4f2bc-0bd6-4d78-86a6-a49b421726fd"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. No one is to blame for anything... You and they — you have much "
"in common.\""
msgstr "\"물론. 아무도 비난할 게 아니야... 너와 그들은 공통점이 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Nyrissa_SorrowBark/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld_Nyrissa_WhatToBark
msgctxt "80088a12-fb66-482b-9d0f-b4f90cc685bc"
msgid ""
"Your hand passes through her — and with a cold smile, her image vanishes."
msgstr "당신의 손이 그녀를 통과하고 차가운 미소와 함께 그녀의 모습은 사라집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "8fb43590-ad15-4c8e-883e-b7c2b277499a"
msgid "[Throw the bird's bones into the water]"
msgstr "[새의 뼈를 물에다가 던진다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "4bccabd3-c247-4bb2-a965-8e8ec9d4633f"
msgid "[Sip the water]"
msgstr "[물을 마신다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "358de6bc-6b9f-45d6-af96-39a4550197d0"
msgid "[Gaze into the water]"
msgstr "[물 안을 바라본다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3a475761-2c37-4e5c-af78-2f913ebfa1a5"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠난다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "cc7b8612-c3c9-4db5-8b24-8262e5b45b7f"
msgid "[Skip a stone across the water]"
msgstr "[돌을 던져 물수제비를 뜬다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "faf52ca8-cae0-4cf4-9ad6-6c217205eeee"
msgid "[Collect water from the pond]"
msgstr "[연못에서 물을 뜬다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fdce2797-2ed1-47ec-a775-1a662620e5a5"
msgid ""
"{n}The pond is deep and the water cold. Although the surface is still, you "
"can hear faint whispers, as if someone beneath the water is murmuring sadly "
"to themselves.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}연못은 깊고 물은 찹니다. 수면은 평온하지만 물 밑에서 그들의 슬픈 속삭임을 희미하게 들을 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b71c1c95-edd0-4ce7-b5ca-e3819a685848"
msgid ""
"{n}As you stare into the water for a time, you see something odd — a "
"reflection of a beautiful woman comes into focus, sitting on the bank, "
"weeping. But as soon as you blink, the image is gone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}물을 한동안 쳐다보자 이상한 것이 보입니다. 둑 위에 앉아 우는 아름다운 여성의 모습이 뚜렷해집니다. 그러나 당신이 눈을 깜빡이자 "
"그 모습은 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "2cf9bf91-8b56-44aa-a8df-2ad05e283cc6"
msgid ""
"{n}The stone skips on the water, leaving circles on its surface, then "
"finally disappears with a last, short splash. The pond falls silent, nothing "
"stirs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}돌은 수면에 동그라미를 남기면서 뛰어다니다가 결국 짧은 흔적만을 만들고 마침내 사라집니다. 연못은 여전히 조용하고 아무일도 일어나지 "
"않습니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "e341b9ab-29f8-4186-b587-0d1ee94b28e1"
msgid ""
"{n}The water tastes bitter, with a trace of salt — as the salt touches the "
"tongue, you feel a sharp pain in your heart, as if suddenly stabbed — not "
"with a blade, but with a painful memory of something lost.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}물은 조금 소금 맛이 나지만 쓴 맛이 납니다. 소금맛이 나면서 당신은 갑자기 심장을 찔리는 듯한 통증을 느낍니다. 칼날이 아니라 "
"잃어버린 아픈 기억에 의해서 말입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "00451732-959f-4f66-9e83-1f981014807d"
msgid ""
"{n}The bones of the bird disappear in depths of the pond… and suddenly the "
"water's surface heaves, darkens, boils. It changes color — and now looks "
"swirling, furious, menacing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}새의 뼈가 연못 깊숙히 사라집니다... 갑자기 연못의 표면이 들썩거리고 어두워지며 끓어오릅니다. 연못의 색이 변합니다. 연못은 이제 "
"소용돌이치며 분노한 듯 보이고 위협적으로 보입니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4111f7e7-af4d-4c93-818e-a1d61cb923bd"
msgid "\"What a beautiful, calm place... Can we stay here a while longer?\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 아름답고 차분한 곳이라니... 우리 여기서 길게 머무를 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "586b95a2-b836-4177-a65a-1d41b687be7f"
msgid ""
"\"This place is overflowing with the events of the past,\" {n}Linzi "
"whispers.{/n} \"If only I knew its history... If only...\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 곳은 과거의 사건으로 넘쳐 흐르고 있어요.\" {n}린지가 속삭입니다.{/n} \"그 이야기를 내가 알고 있었다면... "
"그랬다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepGrotto_FirstWorld/Pond_of_Sorrow/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "1a494ac1-e7b4-4172-8f26-5cb7ec89f03d"
msgid "{n}The water has grown dark and menacing.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}물은 어둡고 위험해졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/BanditCaveLoreBarks/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_BanditCaveLoreBarks_WhatToBark
msgctxt "73ab6677-73ed-4c93-92ec-cbf6cc6b8aa1"
msgid ""
"A great place for a bandit lair. It's hidden, has room to store loot, and is "
"accessible by boat."
msgstr "도둑이 숨기에는 좋은 장소입니다. 숨겨져 있고 전리품을 저장하고 보트로 접근이 가능합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/AngryNixie2_String
msgctxt "4d403d88-f6fe-48d4-8221-941dc9f31bd6"
msgid "\"Go away! All you bring is evil!\""
msgstr "\"꺼져! 너 때문에 되는 일이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/AngryNixie3_String
msgctxt "e99a749a-48ad-48cd-a4a7-520d397f9ef6"
msgid "\"Strangers are here again! We must protect our lands!\""
msgstr "\"이방인들이 또 왔어! 우리 땅을 지켜야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/AngryNixie_String
msgctxt "96049575-6c30-4d47-9375-eb8756870d67"
msgid "\"You've caused enough trouble already!\""
msgstr "\"너는 이미 충분한 문제를 일으켰다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/BanditTalkBeforeAttack2_String
msgctxt "0b4ab7ed-0422-43bf-b2f6-57503e69bd19"
msgid "\"No! These are new strangers!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 처음보는 낯선 놈들이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/BanditTalkBeforeAttack3_String
msgctxt "2e8207c8-539c-4077-be86-449799594d65"
msgid ""
"\"I bet they want to take away our loot! They're messing with the wrong men!"
"\""
msgstr "\"틀림없이 우리 전리품을 빼앗으려 할꺼야! 엉뚱한 우리들한테 시비를 걸꺼라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/BanditTalkBeforeAttack_String
msgctxt "67a0eef3-fa0b-4386-b6c0-b4fb1ecafd88"
msgid "\"I'll be damned! That beast again?\""
msgstr "\"이런 젠장! 짐승들이 또?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Bandit_boats_String
msgctxt "9fcb7595-97c7-44a9-aee7-9431b1372bb3"
msgid ""
"These boats were obviously pulled ashore recently. Inside them are hooks, "
"pivots, and other tools that would be needed to recover things from under "
"the water."
msgstr "이 배들은 분명히 최근에 뭍으로 끌어올렸졌습니다. 그 안에는 물속에서 배를 고치는 데 필요한 도구와 갈고리 등이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Bandit_corpse_String
msgctxt "3c458cf2-5be4-408e-8d17-bed8a0494db6"
msgid ""
"The corpse of a tall man lies torn apart on the shore. The man was probably "
"an experienced fighter in life, but it didn't do him much good in the end. "
"You notice a tuft of red fur clenched in the dead man's hand. Whoever killed "
"this man, it seems unlikely it was a tatzlwyrm."
msgstr ""
"키 큰 남자의 시체가 찢겨져 해안에 놓여있습니다. 그 남자는 경험 많은 전사 같지만 결국 좋은 결말을 맞지는 못한 것 같습니다. 당신은 "
"죽은 사람의 손에 쥐어진 붉은 모피 뭉치를 발견합니다. 이 사람을 죽인 것이 누구이던 타츨웜 같지는 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Bandit_goods_String
msgctxt "9aa67683-f4da-4e93-a658-85ef6b6b925e"
msgid ""
"Packs and crates filled with various goods obviously belonged to some "
"merchants before making their way here. Many of them are spotted with blood."
msgstr "다양한 상품으로 가득 찬 상자와 짐들은 여기에 오기 전에는 몇몇 상인들의 것이었습니다. 많은 곳에 피가 묻어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/CacheInCave_String
msgctxt "bfce9a74-628e-42ea-8787-ad4086ec4d45"
msgid ""
"There are several scraps of paper under the rock, scribbled by various "
"hands. It seems several bandits used this drop point to exchange secret "
"messages."
msgstr ""
"바위 밑에는 여러 사람들이 휘갈겨 쓴 몇 장의 종이 조각이 있습니다. 도둑들이 비밀 메시지를 교환하기 위해 이 장소를 사용한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Child_villager_String
msgctxt "e878225f-f972-44d8-ad4b-d10d6660e9fe"
msgid ""
"\"If I throw the rake into the well, Mom won't know I broke it, right?\""
msgstr "\"내가 우물에 갈퀴를 던지면 엄마는 내가 망가 뜨린 것을 알지 못할 거야. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Female_villager2_String
msgctxt "4b462f6d-ae34-4772-8213-744d4363c613"
msgid ""
"\"Always put a broom in conspicuous place. Everyone will think that you are "
"so busy!\""
msgstr "\"항상 빗자루를 눈에 띄는 곳에 두라고. 모두가 너를 바쁘다고 생각할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Female_villager3_String
msgctxt "cce537c4-78b9-4ae2-b814-05d9a3877aff"
msgid ""
"\"If only I were a sorceress! I would've invented magic that makes cauldrons "
"clean themselves then.\""
msgstr "\"내가 마법사였다면! 가마솥을 스스로 청소하는 마법을 만들었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Female_villager4_String
msgctxt "fd21df64-50d5-474d-8685-fa2286598a50"
msgid ""
"\"Tired of being a fisherwoman. Will go for a pirate. Someone's cooking fish "
"soup and here I appear: give me your soup or die!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물고기 잡는 일은 지쳤어. 해적이 되야겠어. 누군가 물고기 수프를 요리하는데 내가 여기 나타나서 이렇게 말하는거야. 수프를 내놔라 "
"아니면 죽이겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Female_villager_String
msgctxt "df1f9838-8c40-4a11-abed-ffdc454884cc"
msgid "\"My goat is such a dog, he puts the moves on the headman's mare!\""
msgstr "\"내 염소는 개나 다름 없어. 주인 말을 잘 듣거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/FishAtShores_String
msgctxt "a46e2182-1703-45f8-99b5-b70306c6332f"
msgid ""
"Some unknown power made entire schools of fish jump ashore. Some of the fish "
"are already dead, but others twitch, their eyes bulging, their mouths "
"opening and closing silently, as if out of desperation and horror."
msgstr ""
"어떤 알려지지 않은 힘으로 인해 모든 물고기들이 해변으로 뛰어올라와 있습니다. 물고기 중 일부는 이미 죽었지만 어떤 물고기는 절박함과 "
"공포에서 빠져 나온 듯, 눈알이 불룩하게 튀어 나왔고 소리 없이 입을 뻐끔거립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Fishermans_boats_String
msgctxt "a2a274a2-a3a7-40d8-af74-ab180cb4d50a"
msgid ""
"These fishing boats have seen better days. Looks like no one took them out "
"on the lake today."
msgstr "이 어선들은 원래 바쁘게 타고 다니던 흔적이 있습니다. 오늘은 아무도 배를 타고 나가지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Fishermans_tackle_String
msgctxt "4c88d74f-4bd0-41a0-8ca7-eecd947e115b"
msgid ""
"Fishing tackle is neatly packed and dry. It obviously hasn't been used "
"recently."
msgstr "낚시 도구는 깔끔하게 정돈되어 건조합니다. 최근에는 분명히 사용되지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/HunterRevengeForVillage_String
msgctxt "0807f3f8-2bd0-4ec0-9709-e7ea4beef539"
msgid "\"I feel the blood of my men on you. Die!\""
msgstr "\"너 때문에 내 부하들이 죽은 것 같구나. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/HunterTrace1_String
msgctxt "50da313d-dd8a-44e3-9792-0d7c2e683e75"
msgid "Footprints on the wet soil near the hut lead north."
msgstr "오두막 근처 습한 땅에 찍힌 발자국은 북쪽으로 이어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/HunterTrace2_perceptionCheck_fail_String
msgctxt "4a596b70-68c0-444f-93ac-5012655a2b64"
msgid ""
"The grass near the fallen tree has been flattened. It could have been a man "
"or an animal who walked here, and you cannot guess the direction."
msgstr "쓰러진 나무 근처의 풀이 누웠습니다. 여기를 지나간 것이 사람이나 동물일 수 있지만 어디로 갔는지 방향을 추측할 수 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/HunterTrace2_perceptionCheck_success_String
msgctxt "4d2ca858-b5d9-4233-b0ff-9afb5a8db171"
msgid ""
"The bark, fallen off the tree, indicates that someone ran along the trunk "
"with amazing agility. On the other side of the tree trunk, you can see human "
"footprints. They lead north."
msgstr ""
"나무에서 떨어진 나무 껍질은 누군가가 나무를 타고 빠르게 넘어다니는 것을 나타냅니다. 나무 줄기의 다른 면에는 인간 발자국을 볼 수 "
"있습니다. 그들은 북쪽으로 이어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/HunterTrace3_perceptionCheck_fail_String
msgctxt "a39c4735-3029-4e4b-8b3f-7c3635ebbea2"
msgid ""
"There's a small dent on the ground. It's unclear what may have left it, but "
"there may be more clues around."
msgstr "바닥에 작은 패인 자국이 있습니다. 무엇의 자국인지는 모르겠지만 더 많은 단서가 있을 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/HunterTrace3_perceptionCheck_success_String
msgctxt "5b2ca30b-d0e6-4d6b-bf49-ba34c3b986eb"
msgid ""
"More footprints leading north. Oddly, they look bigger now and have a "
"slightly different shape."
msgstr "더 많은 발자국이 북쪽으로 이어집니다. 이상하게도 그들은 더 커 보이고 약간 다른 모양을 가지고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/HunterTrace4_perceptionCheck_fail_String
msgctxt "baf1f62f-30c8-4ed5-944e-1dff79dd6786"
msgid ""
"On the border of the woods, there are some indistinct footprints. They could "
"be from feet or paws, but it would be difficult to track them."
msgstr "숲의 경계에는 불분명한 발자국이 있습니다. 두발로 걷는 자의 발자국이나 짐승의 발자국일 수도 있지만 추적하기는 어렵습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/HunterTrace4_perceptionCheck_success_String
msgctxt "401eb18d-a08d-4491-8128-1ddfb6e9ec75"
msgid ""
"The footprints lead to an inconspicuous animal path that leads deeper into "
"the woods."
msgstr "발자국은 숲으로 이어지는 눈에 띄지 않는 오솔길로 이어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Hunters_house_String
msgctxt "77a10dcf-4186-4755-b2bd-ac24f1898580"
msgid ""
"This house used to be neat and cozy once, but now it looks almost abandoned. "
"The door is shut tight."
msgstr "이 집은 예전에는 깔끔하고 아늑했으나 이제는 거의 버려진 것 같습니다. 문은 단단히 닫혀있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/LettersNearHouse_String
msgctxt "7ede66f0-b171-4775-abd3-3d781e1f01b0"
msgid ""
"Before you is a pile of torn sheets of paper, scribbled on in steady "
"handwriting. The text is faded and almost unreadable."
msgstr "당신은 가득 적혀진 종이 조각 더미를 발견합니다. 글자가 희미해 거의 읽을 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Random_villager1_String
msgctxt "4c36e5c9-81fe-4c0c-87c0-55993479a0a3"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not going to waste any effort remembering your name, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. You {mf|barons|baronesses|kings|queens} "
"change every six months anyway.\""
msgstr "\"당신 이름 따위는 궁금하지 않아. 지도자라는 것들은 반년마다 바뀌더군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Random_villager2_String
msgctxt "2bd840ef-d81d-4181-aa16-8d0f75c961db"
msgid "\"I'm not some boozer! That moose really said howdy to me!\""
msgstr "\"나는 멍청이가 아니야! 그 말은 정말 무례하구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Random_villager3_String
msgctxt "7bf08c89-2889-4e15-bb59-05095e54f1dc"
msgid ""
"\"Mary is beautiful, any Nyta is kind. So how can I decide which to buy a "
"goat from?\""
msgstr "\"메리는 아름다워. 니타는 친절해. 그래서 누구의 염소를 사야 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Random_villager4_String
msgctxt "bb768984-a1c5-488e-ad30-6ae4f15f1493"
msgid ""
"\"The miller is like this, the smith is like this, but the headman isn't "
"like this. Though he can be like this, if he does like that.\""
msgstr "\"농민은 이렇고. 대장장이도 이렇고. 하지만 지도자는 이렇지 않아. 지도자도 이렇게 할수 있을꺼야. 저렇게 한다면 말야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Sarcophagus_when_empty_String
msgctxt "464bd36f-446a-42cb-9790-52919de0efc8"
msgid "The sarcophagus is empty and presents no interest anymore."
msgstr "석관은 비어있어 더 이상 흥미로워 보이지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_Down_String
msgctxt "0e9086c8-0a65-4dcb-ab6c-6ac2c6d213f4"
msgid "Climb Down the Slope"
msgstr "언덕 아래로 내려갑니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_Ravine_String
msgctxt "a9705846-f91f-4c3f-b750-572853bd400d"
msgid "Cross the Ravine"
msgstr "계곡을 건넙니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_Up_String
msgctxt "67d29821-d5b2-4676-9a61-a718525ce514"
msgid "Climb the Slope"
msgstr "언덕을 오릅니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/VillagerWhenAttacked2_String
msgctxt "8b227db9-299f-434f-9d49-cccc4f7b121a"
msgid "\"Gods above, where should I run!\""
msgstr "\"신이시여! 어디로 가야 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/VillagerWhenAttacked3_String
msgctxt "cf9d60f1-3628-4d24-8b97-98c58c7b5320"
msgid "\"Help! Someone, help!\""
msgstr "\"도와주세요! 누군가 도와주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/VillagerWhenAttacked_String
msgctxt "c7a117b4-63e5-4310-a6d7-2934cd6b9977"
msgid "\"Dragon, protect us!\""
msgstr "\"드래곤이 우리를 지키길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Barks/Wyvern_feeding_place_String
msgctxt "db6e366a-531c-4b73-9937-09806e9d3c71"
msgid ""
"The rocks are moved from their usual places — as if something very huge and "
"extremely strong used to walk here. Some pieces of fish innards could be "
"seen on the ground."
msgstr ""
"바위는 다른 장소에서 옮겨졌습니다. 매우 거대하고 강한 무언가가 여기를 걸어온 것처럼 보입니다. 물고기 내장 조각이 땅에 뿌려져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/EnterPoints/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_FromCave_Tooltip_String
msgctxt "4fc307c4-5d0e-4a84-8181-e62d2cb7c9b6"
msgid "Outside"
msgstr "바깥으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/EnterPoints/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_InsideCave_Tooltip_String
msgctxt "55279cb4-66f9-4fae-a0b2-9bc1865d6604"
msgid "Into the cave"
msgstr "동굴 안으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e1e32c68-802d-441d-9928-56110bb0e42e"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "58ed8227-2eff-415f-b576-cc2f3577259f"
msgid "\"Dragon? Feast? What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"드래곤? 축제? 여기서 무슨 일이 일어난 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "636f598b-b98d-4790-81cf-ce45676eb6ba"
msgid "\"Tell me more about your fish situation.\""
msgstr "\"물고기에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "1bb3e97a-a2ef-4902-bbdb-fc2054bafb1c"
msgid ""
"\"The fish were jumping ashore thanks to an ancient sarcophagus the nixies "
"accidentally drowned in the lake.\""
msgstr "\"닉시들이 뜻하지않게 호수에 빠트린 고대 석관 덕분에 물고기가 해변으로 뛰어 오르고 있었던거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "d3404098-3b53-4d51-9b81-4ca090eef6f6"
msgid ""
"\"Do you have any idea who I am? I'm your {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}!\""
msgstr "\"내가 누군진 알고 있는건가? 난 너희의 {mf|남작|남작|왕|여왕}이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "9f7d02be-10ae-4244-9d34-627becb739ed"
msgid "\"Dragons that huge don't exist.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 거대한 드래곤은 존재하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "97fb5cc9-cc5e-4568-bdf9-abb8ffcb1001"
msgid "\"Have you ever seen this dragon with your own eyes?\""
msgstr "\"이 드래곤을 네 눈으로 직접 본 적은 있는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "fed0d020-4b71-4c68-b423-d823f6df97b8"
msgid "\"So what exactly has this dragon done to help you?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 드래곤이 너를 도우려고 무엇을 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "86e95031-d8b8-4a96-a236-c959f5b4a963"
msgid "\"The scale Ivar gave you came from a wyvern, not a dragon.\""
msgstr "\"이바르가 너에게 준 비늘은 드래곤의 것이 아닌 와이번의 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "eb58ed97-d3b2-4d95-af6f-f368763d8b7a"
msgid "\"Enough about that for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그 정도면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0050_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f55a0131-b9d3-4f0c-903b-7ba764287dda"
msgid "Killed silly fisherman."
msgstr "어리석은 어부를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "40a423e2-7383-4263-ac68-62af72b61a38"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm just here to rid the world of one more utter fool!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내가 여기온 건, 너같은 완전한 바보를 이 세상에서 없애기 위해서다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "4a2e3ef0-2ee9-4fc9-b0c2-b1c8e0fecc60"
msgid "\"Who is he?\""
msgstr "\"그는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "90680d2d-f3a1-4776-9d52-3682bd19e4df"
msgid ""
"\"Seems you didn't know him half as well as you thought. Ivar was a "
"werewolf, an evil beast — but I put an end to him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 네가 생각하는 것에 절반 만큼도 그를 모르는 것 같군. 이바르는 늑대 인간이었다. 사악한 야수이지. 하지만 내가 그를 처단했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "cbb9638d-bf42-4180-b88f-5bd5652be6b2"
msgid ""
"\"Seems you didn't know him half as well as you thought. After his family "
"died, Ivar cursed himself and became a werewolf. I spared his life, but I "
"don't think you'll see him around here anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 네가 생각하는 것에 절반 만큼도 그를 모르는 것 같군. 그의 가족이 죽은 후에 이바르는 스스로를 저주하고는 늑대 인간이되었다. "
"나는 그의 목숨을 살려줬지만 이 근방에서는 더이상 그를 볼 거라 생각되지 않는군\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "406e5860-2bfd-41e3-adf1-780860dd04c8"
msgid "\"Something terrible happened to him, didn't it?\""
msgstr "\"그에게 뭔가 끔찍한 일이 일어 났지. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "9c82c890-1371-4f3b-805d-447c38c96b6a"
msgid ""
"\"I know for a fact it was a cyclops kept in a sarcophagus under the lake "
"that caused all the strange occurrences around here. The cyclops is dead "
"now, and the village is safe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳 주변에서 이상한 사건들을 일으킨건, 사실 호수 밑 석관에 보관되었던 사이클롭스라는 걸 알아냈어. 그 사이클롭스는 이제 죽었고 "
"마을은 안전하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "28816856-1515-4105-aef6-3d3b07df1719"
msgid "\"Let's talk about this hunter — Ivar, was it?\""
msgstr "\"이 사냥꾼에 대해 이야기해 보자. 이바르, 맞나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "13e94cc0-877f-4c80-b031-a1c6cb6d9a2c"
msgid ""
"\"I need to tell you something about the fish and this dragon of yours.\""
msgstr "\"물고기와 너의 드래곤에 대해 할 말이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "ec62752f-e3ff-4802-a15c-ea1a133b7294"
msgid "\"Tell me more about this dragon of yours.\""
msgstr "\"드래곤에 대해 더 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "ad8c3d07-0982-489e-abd7-819a480796d0"
msgid ""
"\"Everything you thought you knew about the dragon proved to be false. Do "
"you still not believe me?\""
msgstr "\"네가 드래곤이라고 생각했던 그것은 드래곤이 아니었어. 아직도 나를 못믿겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "71f63d2e-f41d-4978-8afd-41d259cc3e41"
msgid "\"How about we talk about something else.\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 얘기해 보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "cbab4988-1d7a-4376-9c0a-2ed8f1af56b7"
msgid "\"That's enough about Ivar for now.\""
msgstr "\"이바르에 대해서는 이것으로 지금은 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "0b81ce95-9bc9-4e6c-b85f-d8e1e5b84f30"
msgid "\"Do you know where he is now?\""
msgstr "\"그가 지금 어디 있는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0091_Text
msgctxt "38953046-146e-48c0-bc18-9900496749d0"
msgid "\"Let's talk later. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기 하지. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0100_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cacc83ea-5bec-444e-84b6-1aaf208fe359"
msgid ""
"Lied to friendly fisherman to make him reveal strange hunter's location."
msgstr "이상한 사냥꾼의 위치를 알아내기 위해 친절한 어부에게 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "0e7c561a-d063-43da-9a35-9c3279b98d91"
msgid ""
"[Lie] \"He tried to tell me where to meet him! He said, "
"'{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}, look for me at-' but then a gust of wind "
"picked up, and I couldn't catch the last of it!\""
msgstr ""
"[거짓] \"그가 만날 곳을 말해주려고 했어. 하지만 그가 말하는 순간 돌풍이 불어 그는 날아가버렸고 나는 그를 붇잡지 못했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "63714eb8-c667-44b4-8b56-80f72e4ce346"
msgid ""
"{n}A ruddy-faced villager waves to you cheerfully.{/n} \"Hello there, "
"traveler! A good day to you — a good day to us all! The Silver Dragon "
"himself turned the day into a feast for us! And why, you might ask? All "
"because I forgot my fishing gloves at home!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}불그레한 얼굴의 한 마을 사람이 힘차게 당신에게 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"거기 안녕. 여행자! 좋은 하루야. 우리 모두에게 좋은 "
"하루지. 실버 드래곤이 매일 매일을 우리를 위한 축제로 바꾸어 놓았다구! 왜. 왜냐구 물을거지? 이 모든게 다 내가 집에서 낚시 장갑을 "
"가져오는걸 잊어버렸기 때문이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "ac9ecbd2-bf43-4541-b5eb-7603522aec8f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Aysel! A fisherman. I mean, I was a fisherman when I did fishing. I "
"don't fish now, so I guess I'm not a fisherman anymore...\" {n}Aysel frowns "
"as he thinks about that paradox.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"저는 아이셀입니다! 어부죠. 그러니까 내가 낚시를 했었을 때는 어부였어요. 저는 이제 낚시를 안 하니 더 이상 어부가 아닌 것 "
"같네요...\" {n}아이셀은 자신이 말한 역설에 대해 생각하며 눈살을 찡그립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "40173b7f-7927-4bbd-8f4e-9c4a58bbbfcf"
msgid ""
"\"I am telling you! I went fishing, but I left my fishing gloves at home. "
"So? So I blistered my hands pulling out the nets. So? So I couldn't fish "
"anymore. So? So I had to go hungry. Had to, but didn't. Because fish just "
"started jumping out of the water! So? So our great Silver Dragon took care "
"of me. He must have been watching, thinking, 'How will this poor sod Aysel "
"get by with blistered hands? How will he fish? What will he eat? How about I "
"send some fish ashore for him.'\""
msgstr ""
"\"말해줄께! 물고기를 잡으러 갔는데 집에 낚시 장갑를 두고 왔지뭐야. 그래서? 그래서 나는 그물을 당긴 손에 물집이 생겨버렸어. "
"그래서? 그래서 나는 더 이상 낚시를 할 수 없었지. 그래서? 그래서 배가 고파야 했어. 근데 배고프지 않았지. 왜냐하면 물고기들이 막 "
"물 밖으로 스스로 뛰쳐나오기 시작했기 때문이야! 그래서? 그래서 우리의 위대한 실버 드래곤이 나를 돌봐주는거 같아. 드래곤은 나를 보며 "
"이렇게 생각했을꺼야. '이 불쌍한 아이셀이 물집 잡힌 손으로 버틸 수 있을까? 어떻게 물고기를 잡지? 이제 뭘 먹으려나? 내가 물고기를 "
"좀 보내줘야겠다.'\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "62cf8bab-50c8-4b1e-9d1f-c4e37919144e"
msgid ""
"\"Now, I think I'll never bring my fishing gloves again. So? So fish will "
"always jump out of the lake on their own. It'll be great!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 다시는 낚시 장갑을 가져오지 않을 것 같네요. 그래서? 그러니까 물고기가 계속 호수에서 뛰쳐나올거란 말이죠? 잘됐네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "1b102c8a-d33c-4cc2-b786-78ba44a64ab5"
msgid ""
"\"Your nixies lied to you! They're fey, so what do you expect? But Ivar told "
"me about the dragon. Not the fish, though, just that the dragon is "
"protecting us. But I know Ivar well. Ivar doesn't lie!\""
msgstr ""
"\"닉시들이 거짓말을 한거야! 그들은 페이니까 말이지. 그들한테 뭘 기대하겠어? 하지만 아이바는 용에 대해 말해 주었어. 물고기는 그저 "
"운이었을지 몰라도, 드래곤이 우리를 보호해주고 있다고 했어. 나는 이바르에 대해 잘 알아. 거짓말을 할 녀석이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "ae7ebbf9-df58-442f-b1a1-9468e2c5eda4"
msgid ""
"\"Just go to the shore and see for yourself! They jump right out of the "
"water! We can barely keep up with collecting and salting them — we made "
"three barrels since the morning dawned. And our barrels are really big, not "
"just any normal barrels.\" {n}The fisher puffs out his chest.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"해안에서 직접 보라구! 물고기가 물에서 뛰어 오른다구! 아침부터 물고기 3통을 잡아 소금에 절여서 더 이상은 못해. 우리가 가진 통은 "
"보통의 통보다 훨씬 크다구.\" {n}어부는 뽐내며 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "0d0f8484-33c0-4747-b511-5910c04446f5"
msgid ""
"\"He's... well, he's a huge dragon! A silver one. It's why he's called the "
"Silver Dragon. He's very kind and always helps us! That lake is one of his "
"footprints, filled with water — that's how we got the lake! I've got one of "
"his scales. It's my lucky charm!\" {n}The fisher proudly holds out a scale "
"held by a string around his neck.{/n} \"Ivar gave it to me. You can search "
"around for him — maybe he'll give you one too!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는... 음, 거대한 드래곤이야! 은색 드래곤. 그래서 실버 드래곤이라고 불리는 거지. 그 드래곤은 매우 친절하고 언제나 우리를 "
"도와주지! 그 호수는 그의 발자국이었는데 물로 가득 차 호수가 되었어. 나는 실버 드래곤의 비늘 중 하나를 가지고 있어. 내 행운의 "
"부적이지!\" {n}어부는 자랑스럽게 그의 목 주위에 끈에 달린 비늘을 보여줍니다.{/n} \"이바르가 준 거야. 주변에서 그를 한번 "
"찾아봐. 비늘을 하나 줄지도 몰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "3c6858de-16df-4d97-82d2-9a35597d3f86"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe not — in other places. Maybe our dragon is one of a kind!\" {n}The "
"fisher's voice rings with pride.{/n}"
msgstr "\"다른 곳에선 그럴지도. 아마 우리 드래곤이 특별한 거겠지!\" {n}어부의 목소리는 자부심이 담겨있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "9641a480-8e97-4781-ac9e-be7a9911de3a"
msgid ""
"\"Sure did! Day before yesterday! Two months ago, too! Bervis the trader "
"says I'm a fool and it was just a thundercloud, but you shouldn't listen to "
"him!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지! 전에도 봤어! 두 달 전에도! 상인 브레비스는 그냥 천둥소리라고 말했지만 그 사람 말은 들을 필요없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "567b635a-7726-4876-89b6-5dc9686042da"
msgid ""
"\"He sent Ivar to us! Well, not sent, really — Ivar was here before. But he "
"was only a hunter, not a Dragon's Voice. When Ivar became the Dragon's "
"Voice, everything got better all at once! Most of the bandits disappeared "
"from the roads, monsters stopped attacking us in the woods, and wolves don't "
"even take our cattle anymore! And now there's the fish to top it all. Yeah, "
"the Silver Dragon is the best dragon ever!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 우리에게 이바르를 보내주었어! 그는 예전부터 여기에 살았으니 진짜로 보낸 것은 아니지만. 이전에는 드래곤의 사자가 아니라 그저 "
"사냥꾼일 뿐이었지. 이바르가 드래곤의 사자가 되었을 때 모든 일이 한번에 다 좋아졌어! 산적이 길에서 사라지고 숲 속의 괴물은 이제 "
"우리를 공격하지 않아. 늑대들은 우리 소들을 잡아가지도 않아! 그리고 이제는 물고기가 가득하다구. 실버 드래곤은 최고의 드래곤이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "a78b8bb0-a636-4f3c-a460-8c04021e88c4"
msgid "\"What a downer. I like listening to stories about the dragon...\""
msgstr "\"아 김새는군. 나는 용에 관한 이야기를 듣는 것도 좋아하거든\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "b34c9d0b-fb90-4f41-9f05-dc1ba36bc155"
msgid "\"Ivar, yes! He's a good fellow!\""
msgstr "\"이바르. 맞아! 좋은 녀석이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "330773a2-810b-4de7-8b56-461dad28d286"
msgid "\"I could talk about the dragon all day long!\""
msgstr "\"나는 하루 종일 용에 대해 말할 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "3d9556ad-8f45-44bb-b1da-a9c8830c4ad4"
msgid ""
"{n}The fisher listens intently, his face thoughtful.{/n} \"So, what then? "
"The fish won't jump ashore anymore?! That's too bad. Can we get another "
"cyclops from somewhere, then?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어부는 진지한 표정으로 주의 깊게 듣습니다.{/n} \"그러면 어떻게 되는 거에요? 물고기가 더 이상 해변으로 뛰어 오르지 않아요? "
"그건 너무 나쁘네요. 어딘가 사이클롭스를 얻을 수 있을 곳이 없을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "21a46868-4ead-43dc-977d-e7a65d6cd29f"
msgid ""
"\"Don't misunderstand, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, it's not that I think "
"you're simple,\" {n}the fisher assures you patronizingly,{/n} \"but "
"everyone's been talking about the dragon, while you're the only one talking "
"about some wyvern. You really should listen to what people say. It's just "
"common sense, really!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오해하지 마. 너를 바보라고 생각하지 않으니.\" {n}어부는 당신을 진지하게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"하지만 사람들은 용에 대해서 "
"이야기하고 있는데 너는 와이번 얘기를 하고 있다고. 다른 사람의 말을 들어봐야 해. 그게 상식이니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "06483562-136f-4862-8e8c-3207a937a604"
msgid "\"All right. You talk about fun things!\""
msgstr "\"정말 재미있게 얘기하는구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0073_Text_1
msgctxt "d5be0c99-5ddd-4653-92a3-06f4834a2c7a"
msgid ""
"\"Back again!\" {n}The fisher gives you a wide grin.{/n} \"Ask me more "
"things, would you? You're the only one who'll stay and talk with me for a "
"while!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다시 왔구나!\" {n}어부는 당신에게 활짝 웃음 짓습니다.{/n} \"나한테 좀 더 물어봐 주시면 안될까? 나랑 얘기해주는 유일한 "
"사람이거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "1ee4e2f2-2bbb-4ca3-943e-bca15eab0b73"
msgid "\"All right. Sure. Enough is enough!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 물론이지. 충분한건 충분한거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "d4ce0074-e539-4f19-887f-fe2f78470e64"
msgid ""
"\"He's the Dragon's Voice! The Silver Dragon tells him things, then Ivar "
"tells us. Like when the dragon chased the wolves from our herd — he told "
"Ivar and Ivar told us. And when he scared the monsters away so they wouldn't "
"attack us — he told Ivar that too. We get all kinds of good news from Ivar!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 드래곤의 사자야! 실버 드래곤이 이바르한테 말하면 우리에게 말을 전해주는거지. 드래곤이 우리를 덮치는 늑대를 몰아냈을 때도 "
"드래곤이 말한걸 이바르가 전해준거야. 드래곤이 더이상 괴물들이 우리를 공격하지 않도록 겁주어 쫓아내 주었을때도, 드래곤이 이바르한테 "
"그렇게 말한거래. 우리는 이바르로부터 온갖 좋은 소식을 듣고있다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "aca1a16a-cba7-44ac-a145-cf1b81a4f48a"
msgid ""
"\"So...\" {n}The fisher frowns and rubs his forehead.{/n} \"If the scales "
"aren't really the dragon's scales... and the fish aren't really the dragon's "
"fish... and Ivar isn't the Ivar I knew... I guess that means there might be "
"no dragon at all?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서...\" {n}어부는 그의 찡그리며 이마를 문지릅니다.{/n} \"비늘이 용의 비늘이 아니라면... 물고기는 용의 물고기가 "
"아닌 건데... 이바르는 내가 아는 이바르가 아니야... 그러면 드래곤이 전혀 없을 수도 있다는 것을 의미하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "6b9a7938-7bd7-438c-ac0b-36526b23eb38"
msgid ""
"\"Using a thousand-year-old undead cyclops for... for fishing! "
"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}, you need to order this village surrounded by "
"a palisade and forbid your subjects to come within three arrow-flights of "
"it. This is as bad as a plague! Stupidity can be just as infectious, you "
"know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"천 년이 넘은 언데드 사이클롭스를 사용해... 물고기를 잡으려고! {mf|남작 나리|여남작 나리|왕 폐하|여왕 폐하}, 그래서 너는 "
"이 마을을 포위하고 백성들을 가두도록 명해야 해. 이건 역병처럼 나쁜 일이야! 너도 알다시피 멍청한 것도 전염이 될 수도 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "d9de481a-3f27-48ba-a9ad-bf7b2cf042cb"
msgid ""
"{n}The fisher frowns and looks away.{/n} \"Why'd you have to remind me of "
"that! Ivar... he wasn't the Dragon's Voice before. He just used to live "
"here, in a house to the northwest. Used to go hunting and tell us all kinds "
"of stories, like a real bard would! Had a family, too. But then...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어부는 눈살을 찌푸리고 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"왜 그걸 다시 상기 시키는거지! 이바르는... 예전에는 드래곤의 사자가 "
"아니었어. 여기 북서쪽에 있는 집에서 살았었지. 사냥을 하고 우리에게 온갖 이야기를 해주었어. 마치 진짜 바드처럼! 가족도 있었지만 "
"지금은... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "d5778ad8-c7b4-41ec-b7ad-ee81e515563e"
msgid ""
"\"Well, one night his kids ran away, tried to climb to the top of the cliff "
"in the middle of the night. It was a bad night, rainy and dark... They fell "
"down. Far as anyone could tell, the boy probably slipped first, and the girl "
"tried to help him, but she couldn't... she fell too, farther away. I helped "
"search for them the next morning, then helped bury them...\" {n}The fisher "
"sighs heavily.{/n} \"Lissa, Ivar's wife, she got sick right after and never "
"recovered. And Ivar... well, he went odd. And that's when the Silver Dragon "
"started talking to him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어느 날 이바르의 아이들이 집을 나가 한 밤 중에 절벽의 꼭대기로 올라가려고 했어요. 그 날은 비가오고 어두웠죠... 그 아이들은 "
"떨어져 버리고 말았어요. 소문으로는 남자 아이가 먼저 미끄러졌고 여자 아이가 남동생을 도우려고 했지만 힘이 부족했다고 하더군요... 여자 "
"아이도 떨어져버렸죠. 다음 날 아침에 아이들을 찾는 걸 도왔고 묻는 것도 도와주었죠...\" {n}어부는 무겁게 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n}"
" \"이바르의 아내인 리사는 그 후로 병에 걸려 회복하지 못했어요. 이바르는... 이상해졌어요. 그리고 그때부터 실버 드래곤이 이바르에게 "
"말을 걸기 시작했던거에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0084_Text
msgctxt "213a2cf4-1d94-4c5a-95fc-599458f06be6"
msgid ""
"\"He probably went to the grove up north again. That's where his children's "
"graves are. Sometimes he'll disappear for several days at a time, and he "
"won't tell anyone where he goes, but I know anyway!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 아마도 다시 북쪽 숲으로 갔을 거야. 아이들의 무덤이 있는 곳이다. 때때로 그는 말 없이 며칠 동안 사라지지만 나는 어디로 "
"갔는지 알지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "5ba25482-79b0-4fc0-a502-ff80b507a96d"
msgid "\"If he didn't tell you where he was going, I won't either!\""
msgstr "\"그가 어디로 가는지 너에게 말하지 않았다면 나도 말하지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "15ffdc6e-53dd-4b60-a09b-63d31eba4145"
msgid ""
"{n}The fisher's eyes grow wide.{/n} \"How could that be?! Oh, Ivar... Such a "
"great loss! I... I need a cup of spirits to steady me... Better make it two."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어부의 눈이 넓어집니다.{/n} \"어떻게 그럴 수 있지? 오. 이바르... 그럴 수가! 나는... 술 한 잔 마셔야 겠어요... "
"아니 두 잔은 필요하겠네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "3c9569a1-57de-47cf-8cbf-253235553f29"
msgid ""
"{n}The fisher's eyes get watery, and he frowns as he looks down at his "
"feet.{/n} \"But Ivar... he was... Oh, I'll miss him so much!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어부의 눈은 촉촉해지고 그는 발치를 보면서 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"그치만 이바르... 그는... 오. 자네가 무척 그리울 "
"거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "7dc42594-941c-41d0-b427-b8297bd8b2e4"
msgid ""
"\"That's great! I think? You know what, you should talk to Ivar first. He "
"can ask the Silver Dragon's opinion on the greatness of that. Ivar's an "
"important person here, and the dragon is even more important. What if he "
"doesn't want some strange {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} "
"{mf|baroning|baroning|kinging|queening} around here?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그거 잘 됐네요! 잘된거겠죠? 저기, 먼저 이바르와 얘기해 봐요. 이바르가 실버 드래곤에게 의견을 직접 물어볼 수 있으니까요. "
"이바르는 여기서 중요한 사람이에요. 드래곤은 훨씬 더 중요하고. 만약 드래곤이 낯선 {mf|남작|남작|왕|여왕}이 여기 있는 게 "
"불편하다면 어떡하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "dd382764-6d7f-472e-967d-e61e041ccbf0"
msgid ""
"\"You solved everything so neatly! You deserve a gift for that! Us smart "
"people need to stick together and... um... kind of... help each other keep "
"being smart together!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 모든 문제를 깔끔하게 해결했다! 선물을 받을 자격이 있어! 우리 똑똑한 사람들은 서로 붙어 있어야 하고... 음... 서로... "
"똑똑해지도록 서로 도와야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "5eab07a8-dc69-4abf-bfb0-be4e3ffadf23"
msgid ""
"\"Well... well, I guess I didn't tell you all I knew about it last time!\""
msgstr "\"글쎄... 저번에 내가 아는 모든 것을 말하지 않은 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "f018c46d-7b1e-494e-bd89-96d3401e451f"
msgid ""
"\"Wow! A real {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! Not as great as the dragon, of "
"course, but still pretty impressive...\""
msgstr "\"오! 자네는 대단해! 물론 드래곤 만큼 위대하지는 않지만 여전히 인상적이야... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0102_Text
msgctxt "57291c04-a5ea-4e26-85f8-618acefd996d"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, then you need to go north! To the grove. That's where Ivar's children "
"are buried... He stays there from time to time.\" {n}The fisher sighs "
"sadly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그러면 북쪽으로 가야 해! 숲으로 말이지. 이바르의 아이들이 묻혀있는 곳이야... 그는 때때로 거기에 머물러 있다.\" {n}어부는 "
"한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0103_Text
msgctxt "447795d5-04bf-4ccf-879d-6031020372a1"
msgid ""
"\"No offense, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, but I find that pretty tough "
"to swallow... I'd best wait for Ivar to come back. And when he does, then "
"you won't need me to tell you anything anyway!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오해하지 마. 그러나 그것을 삼키기가 꽤 힘들다는 것을 알아. 나라면 이바르가 돌아올 때까지 기다릴 거야. 그가 온다면 그에게서 직접 "
"들어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/FriendlyFisherman/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "2dce9526-ba47-4c71-ba1d-be8586c53839"
msgid "{n}Ekun bites his lip.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 입술을 질끈 물었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HighCliffBarks/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_HighCliffBarks_WhatToBark
msgctxt "4fed28c1-fc03-435b-9763-4c5961cde34d"
msgid ""
"A tall cliff overlooking the lake and the village. The rocks at the base "
"look dangerous."
msgstr "호수와 마을이 내려다 보이는 높은 절벽입니다. 바닥의 암석들은 위험해 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0041_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6a4554ff-0a31-42fe-adbd-52055e84525f"
msgid "Tried to stop hunter from suicide."
msgstr "사냥꾼의 자살을 막으려 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "fc6186a3-2587-4318-b491-7b2e0b4aa0a9"
msgid "\"Stop! What are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"그만둬! 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description_1
msgctxt "5e4c81c7-63e2-4da1-8ae1-800b4ed08c6c"
msgid "Speaked ironically about hunter's intention to commit suicide."
msgstr "자살하려는 사냥꾼에게 역설적인 논리로 설득했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "292ff6a8-ed5c-4d57-8e97-e21d2f769417"
msgid ""
"\"Pondering how to make the most perfect dive to the rocks below, are you?\""
msgstr "\"뛰어내리기 가장 좋은 바위를 찾고 있는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description_1
msgctxt "1300c842-3463-4b95-b1e9-45df0abf9bc0"
msgid "Incited the hunter to commit suicide."
msgstr "자살하도록 사냥꾼을 부추깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "050092e4-bac6-4975-a066-858d0c0358d1"
msgid "\"What are you waiting for? Jump!\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 기다리고 있지? 뛰어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "56b439e3-fb3e-455f-bb39-5e9f6554fe80"
msgid "\"Care to tell me who you are?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "8e6baf95-c642-400e-896e-40c94bafc87a"
msgid "\"So you're the Dragon's Voice, right?\""
msgstr "\"네가 드래곤의 사자인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "3b9bfb9d-ef81-4af7-8a5f-a5154a4f4888"
msgid "\"You know who I am?\""
msgstr "\"내가 누군지 알고있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "c9b90f24-ca00-43f0-bf64-77099d25b463"
msgid "\"Is it your house south of here?\""
msgstr "\"남쪽에 있는 집이 너의 집인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "545d2b15-3756-4aaf-9c73-5b3aaa6c34ba"
msgid "\"Tell me, was it you who gave the villagers Silver Dragon's scales?\""
msgstr "\"마을 사람들에게 실버 드래곤의 비늘을 준 사람이 너야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "24d162c4-e437-4d76-b50d-90cb726d2824"
msgid "\"We'll talk another time. Bye!\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기 하지. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0053_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "09627680-60d8-4597-bd77-ead80942dfb5"
msgid "Attacked the hunter at Silverstep cliff."
msgstr "실버스텝 벼랑에서 사냥꾼을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "0ab8c604-2946-4370-a086-dc9fa6e427e1"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Dragon's Voice or not, this place can only have one ruler, and "
"that's me!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"드래곤의 사자이든 아니든 이 곳은 오직 한 명의 통치자만 있어야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0057_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5e658e17-1705-402a-9b04-4185f9140689"
msgid "Promised not to cause any harm to Silverstep villagers and the hunter."
msgstr "실버스텝 마을 주민과 사냥꾼에게 피해를주지 않겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "3a5c60b0-615d-4c45-8f11-8dd943ff011b"
msgid ""
"\"We have no need to fight each other. I won't harm either you or the "
"village.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 서로 싸울 필요가 없어. 너나 마을에 해를 끼치지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0058_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a57cfa0d-e78b-42b4-9bff-fe00e3f6b99a"
msgid "Threatened the hunter for his disrespectful words."
msgstr "무례한 말을 하는 사냥꾼을 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "8729e33f-baf6-4e95-b61b-0dfac629798a"
msgid "\"I am the sole ruler of these lands. Never forget it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 땅의 유일한 통치자다. 그 사실을 잊지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "00e9ba09-503c-48ff-95f2-92ed15bdf7db"
msgid "\"Watch your tongue!\""
msgstr "\"입 조심해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "c3900166-6f72-42f8-bdb7-bde4f8a15437"
msgid "\"I understand why you are suspicious.\""
msgstr "\"왜 네가 의심스러운지 이해하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "3106612b-1bcc-4946-b8a2-f86208cfef97"
msgid "\"May I have an audience with this 'Lord Dragon' of yours?\""
msgstr "\"나도 너의 주인인 드래곤의 말을 좀 들어볼 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "67c992a3-36d0-45f9-a313-a6c88ef9d7da"
msgid "\"I'm not hiding my identity — in fact, I've nothing to hide at all.\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 정체성을 숨기지 않아. 사실 전혀 숨길 것이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "09560421-ee0a-4370-aeb1-ef2c0fde3db8"
msgid "\"Was that a threat?\""
msgstr "\"방금 건 위협인건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "1cc85d5e-31eb-4ba5-9315-910789f3a256"
msgid "\"I'll take that as a compliment!\""
msgstr "\"칭찬으로 듣겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0080_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "19357332-49c4-4d51-ac40-ddcf7427e525"
msgid "Offered sympathies on hunter's loss."
msgstr "사냥꾼의 슬픔을 동정하였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0080_Text
msgctxt "9dbc06ed-9a92-419c-aea2-f740a4278b68"
msgid "\"I know about your family. I'm… sorry for your loss.\""
msgstr "\"네 가족에 대해 들었어. 정말... 유감이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0081_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6f0ee437-678a-495c-8512-1fd4499e18bd"
msgid "Said some sharp words about hunter's loss."
msgstr "슬퍼하는 사냥꾼에게 독설을 퍼붓습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "4ab87e4a-d447-41fb-ac4f-1fd7a67a8bb3"
msgid "\"I found your oh-so-inspiring letter to your poor, dead wife.\""
msgstr "\"불쌍하게 죽은 네 아내에게 쓴 그 감상적인 편지를 보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0082_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5e511c81-78e0-4ed3-b55c-d89b0ded8114"
msgid "Expressed neither sympathy nor anger to hunter's story."
msgstr "사냥꾼의 이야기에 동정이나 분노를 표출하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "88a5d526-9c44-4fc6-8aee-f5aaa67ef4d9"
msgid "\"There were some papers around the house...\""
msgstr "\"집 주변에 종이가 몇장 떨어져 있던데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "4799406e-e8d4-44f8-9aa8-df5f7b781771"
msgid "\"The tales you tell! These scales belong to a wyvern.\""
msgstr "\"네가 말한 이야기 말이지. 그 비늘은 와이번의 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "f8612a3a-bbd7-4668-82e9-6c6ce9c1ccab"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know why you keep lying to the villagers, but your lies won't work "
"with me. I know about the wyvern.\""
msgstr "\"왜 마을 사람들에게 계속 거짓말을 하는지 모르겠지만 네 거짓말은 나에게 통하지 않아. 나는 와이번을 알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0092_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1d54d889-b456-4900-9e58-75c4e57c2d03"
msgid "Disapproved hunter's lies about Silver dragon."
msgstr "사냥꾼이 한 실버 드래곤에 대한 거짓말을 부정합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0092_Text
msgctxt "a14715e9-9e90-4d01-a7e1-96d01da8a665"
msgid "\"Lies, even seemingly-harmless ones, never end well.\""
msgstr "\"겉으로 보기에 나쁜 거짓말이 아니더라도 결말은 좋지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0093_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7d1ba200-2cf2-4f18-ad23-606fdadb43b5"
msgid "Approved hunter's \"reasonable lies\" about Silver Dragon."
msgstr "사냥꾼이 한 실버 드래곤에 대한 '합리적인' 거짓말을 인정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0093_Text
msgctxt "af8dc57e-ad0b-4293-962a-23dbcac44563"
msgid ""
"\"People are gullible. Using that weaknesses to your own benefit? I respect "
"that.\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 속이기 쉽다. 그 약점을 자신의 이익에 사용했다고? 네 의도를 존중한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "8faf63c4-5f44-4cde-9174-06a8f1eb6770"
msgid ""
"\"Are you trying to tell me, that even after you've lost your family, you "
"still don't realize what damage lies can do?\""
msgstr "\"가족을 잃은 후에도 거짓말이 해롭지 않다고 내게 말하려는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "bde46540-37b3-41a2-aa37-5773f18ac1d8"
msgid "\"In any case, not every made-up story is a bad thing.\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 만들어낸 이야기가 전부 나쁜 것은 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0107_Text
msgctxt "2fa3725f-df3b-48ec-911a-63fdbf6a81bb"
msgid "\"All right then, let me ask you few more questions.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 그럼 몇 가지 질문을 더 하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0108_Text
msgctxt "de25dbbe-9d4e-4ae0-8631-729d35dd1fea"
msgid "\"Do as you wish. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"마음대로 하길. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Answer_0110_Text
msgctxt "6d4c5c36-4a54-4019-9375-400475cb116a"
msgid "\"I learned what I wanted. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"내가 원하던 것을 다 들었다. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "45956d4a-01d6-4d13-9848-5fdcf69e1e1b"
msgid ""
"{n}A tall, red-headed man dressed in hunter's clothes is balancing at the "
"brink of this cliff — one wrong move and he'll fall into the chasm.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}사냥꾼의 옷을 입은 키가 큰 붉은 머리 남자가 절벽의 경계에 서있습니다. 한걸음만 잘못 걸어도 그는 절벽 아래로 떨어질 "
"것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "b4c9bc2b-8236-4521-a93e-401a90cd22e3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no, not at all. Many would like to silence the Dragon's Voice. I won't "
"give them the pleasure.\" {n}The redhead turns around and nods.{/n} \""
"...Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 아니야. 그런게 아니야. 많은 이들이 드래곤의 사자를 침묵시키려고 해. 바라는 대로 해줄 수는 없지.\" {n}붉은 머리 남자가 "
"몸을 돌려 당신을 보더니 머리를 숙입니다. {/n} \"...{mf|남작이|남작이|전하|전하}셨군\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "75e14f40-7308-4633-b921-1db68b2ddfac"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it would be rude not to introduce myself. My name is Ivar.\" {n}The "
"red-headed man watches you closely, but makes no move to run or draw his "
"weapons.{/n} \"If you passed through the village, you must have heard rumors "
"about me. Once, I used to be a simple hunter, but now I keep the peace in "
"this region by the order of their lord, the Silver Dragon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 소개를 해야겠군. 내 이름은 이바르.\" {n}붉은 머리의 남자는 당신을 자세히 관찰하지만 도망가거나 무기를 뽑지는 "
"않습니다.{/n} \"마을을 지나왔다면 나에 관한 소문을 들었을테지. 한 때 나는 단순한 사냥꾼이었지만 지금은 이곳의 주인 실버 드래곤의 "
"명령으로 이 지역의 평화를 지키고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "7e431b28-14a4-443d-b31d-4063b601fa41"
msgid ""
"\"That's what people call me.\" {n}The red-headed man smiles slightly.{/n} "
"\"These lands are under protection of the Silver Dragon. And I'm his most "
"trusted servant.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들이 나를 그렇게 부르더군.\" {n}붉은 머리 남자가 살짝 웃습니다.{/n} \"이 땅은 실버 드래곤의 보호를 받고 있어. 나는 "
"그의 가장 신뢰받는 하인이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "bd0b1e72-92b0-4da1-99c9-84c372030c9a"
msgid ""
"\"That's exactly what every new self-proclaimed {mf|king|queen} usually says."
"\""
msgstr "\"보통 스스로를 왕이라고 말하는 자들이 그렇게 말하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "262c5397-61a9-4d1b-9f97-88d7ece4843b"
msgid ""
"{n}The red-headed man gives a crooked smile as if you've confirmed his "
"opinion, then he shrugs.{/n} \"I didn't want to offend you. But I know your "
"kind. You always want something for yourself — power, money, fame... all I "
"want is peace for these people. You and I, we're on different paths.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}붉은 머리 남자는 확신하듯 비뚤어진 미소를 지으며 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"너를 불쾌하게 하고 싶지 않았어. 그러나 나는 너 "
"같은 자들을 안다. 항상 자신을 위해 뭔가를 원하지. 권력, 돈, 명성... 내가 원하는 것은 그저 이 곳의 평화다. 너와 나는 서로 "
"다른 길을 걷고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "201f457f-3880-4c2e-92ba-dcea88c794fa"
msgid ""
"{n}The red-headed man bows his head.{/n} \"Well, forgive me for being so "
"harsh. I just wanted you to remember — these lands don't need new rulers. A "
"protector is enough.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}붉은 머리 남자가 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"무례하게 굴어 미안하군. 단지 당신이 이 땅에는 새로운 통치자가 필요하지 않다는 걸 "
"알아주기를 바랬을 뿐이야. 여기는 보호자만 있으면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "86ecea8c-e351-4c61-be77-d115cdcb4641"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be so eager to put a crown on your head! Remember, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, this village is under my protection.\""
msgstr "\"조금 겸손해지라고. {mf|남작|남작|전하|여왕}. 마을은 내 보호 아래 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "e1a80232-0e25-4760-858e-5c929c0c1c3b"
msgid ""
"{n}He smiles slightly.{/n} \"You waste your time — I cannot be bought, with "
"gold, a maiden's kiss, or magic. Even if you were to try — and you're "
"welcome to — the Dragon won't speak to anyone but me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 살짝 웃음 짓습니다.{/n} \"당신은 시간을 낭비하고 있군. 나는 금이나 여자, 마법으로 넘어가지 않아. 만약 직접 시도해 "
"본다 해도, 드래곤은 그 누구도 아닌 나에게만 말을 하신다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "c0064669-a97e-4d4a-a707-db5fbc08a6f9"
msgid ""
"\"I know everything that happens in the village and for leagues around. Of "
"course I was aware of your arrival — such a prestigious guest, striding into "
"our lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 마을에서 일어나는 모든 일을 알고 있지. 물론 당신이 도착한 것도 알고 있었어. 우리 땅을 넘어들어온 귀한 손님이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "8d08952d-9745-4b47-a5c4-2e25916dc1c8"
msgid ""
"{n}The red-headed man raises an eyebrow.{/n} \"That so? Well. Honesty is a "
"virtue, and one that's hard to find these days. Especially if we're talking "
"about kings, queens, and any who seeks to rule others. What do you want to "
"ask me about, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}붉은 머리 남자가 눈썹을 치켜올립니다.{/n} \"그래? 정직은 미덕이고 그런 사람은 요즘 찾기 힘들지. 특히 왕이나 여왕, 그리고 "
"남들을 지배하는 사람들은 더욱 그렇지. 나에게 무엇에 관해서 묻고 싶은건가. {mf|남작|남작|전하|여왕}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "f277f621-1406-42c4-aa38-bce74a8dcbd4"
msgid ""
"\"I don't waste my breath on threats.\"{n}The redheaded man is gazing at you "
"coldly.{/n} \"My way is a simple one — those who come in peace are welcome. "
"Those who threaten the village don't live long enough to regret it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 위협같은건 하지 않아.\" {n}붉은 머리 남자가 차갑게 당신을 응시하고 있습니다.{/n} \"내 방식은 간단해. 평화롭게 온 "
"사람들은 환영한다. 마을을 위협하는 사람들은 후회하며 죽게 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "d1faeba8-c680-47cd-8355-26d50d975d77"
msgid ""
"\"Just don't take it as flattery.\" {n}He scoffs, but there is no malice in "
"it.{/n} \"Boot-licking the highborn? Never one of my habits.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아첨으로 받아들이진 마시길.\" {n}그는 비웃었지만 악의는 없었습니다.{/n} \"귀족의 신발을 핥는 짓? 난 그런 사람이 아니야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "fc57b1e4-4db6-4222-a7de-ba3bb545372b"
msgid "\"It's mine. So what?\""
msgstr "\"내 집이지. 그래서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "6c98a839-04ff-4bf5-8754-046dbdbb4c8c"
msgid ""
"\"I don't look for sympathy. And don't expect it.\" {n}Ivar falls silent for "
"a moment and looks away.{/n} \"Besides… I don't deserve it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 동정은 구하지 않아. 그리고 바라지도 않아.\" {n}이바르는 잠시 침묵을 지키고 먼 곳을 봅니다.{/n} \"게다가... 나는 "
"그럴 가치가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0084_Text
msgctxt "2c50b7bd-4537-42a9-939c-152e5dd2a212"
msgid ""
"{n}Ivar frowns, and his fists clench… but he regains control almost "
"immediately.{/n} \"I should have watched over my papers more carefully... "
"Though... what difference does it make? What would it change?\" {n}He shakes "
"his head bitterly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이바르는 눈살을 찌푸리며 주먹을 움켜 쥐지만... 즉시 평정을 회복합니다.{/n} \"종이를 더 조심스럽게 지켰어야 했는데... "
"차이점이 있나? 무엇이 달라지겠어?\" {n}그는 씁슬하게 고개를 젓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0085_Text
msgctxt "0a64452f-3b46-4aa9-b91a-f56246f347be"
msgid ""
"{n}He tenses.{/n} \"It was me, yes. Who else except for the Dragon's Voice "
"would do that?\""
msgstr "{n}그는 긴장했습니다.{/n} \"나였지. 그래. 드래곤의 사자가 아니면 누가 그랬겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "d610ff2c-2690-49ef-8a0f-b768647294eb"
msgid ""
"{n}Ivar's face darkens.{/n} \"Storyteller, you say? If you only knew, what "
"price I had to pay for my stories... Yes! I lied to the villagers, but the "
"people needed something to believe in. If they need a fairy-tale dragon — I "
"give them a fairy-tale dragon.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이바르의 얼굴이 어둡습니다.{/n} \"이야기꾼이라고? 내 이야기에 어떤 댓가를 치러야 했는지 네가 알까... 그래. 나는 마을 "
"사람들에게 거짓말을 했어. 그러나 사람들은 믿을만한 것이 필요했다고. 그들이 동화에 나오는 용이 필요하다면 나는 그들에게 용을 "
"만들어주었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "de32d55a-7701-4d28-b1ff-f42d962bd823"
msgid ""
"{n}Ivar stiffens.{/n} \"Nothing gets by you, I see. Hnh. Yes! I feed wild "
"wyvern from time to time and bring her scales to the village. People need to "
"believe in something. So let them believe they live under protection of the "
"Dragon.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이바르는 긴장합니다.{/n} \"너에게 아무것도 얻지 못했어. 그래. 야생 와이번에게 가끔 먹이를 주고 비늘을 마을로 가져왔지. "
"사람들은 무엇인가를 믿을 게 필요했어. 그래서 용의 보호를 받으며 산다고 믿게 했지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "a163c285-666b-413d-b99c-50923ba561b0"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be so quick to judge, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. You may think "
"you know a lot, but every wise man knows there's always more to learn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무 빨리 판단하지 마. 네가 많이 안다고 생각할지도 모르지만 현명한 사람은 항상 배울 것이 더 있다는 것을 알고 있지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "e83ab1c7-6e61-4e94-916e-9348521d5006"
msgid "\"Not too honorable though.\"{n}Ivar smiles sadly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"영광스럽지는 않구만.\" {n}이바르는 슬프게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "c361367a-2b02-44ce-ac5e-51eafedd557d"
msgid ""
"{n}Ivar laughs, relaxing slightly.{/n} \"Luckily, people don't talk about "
"those kind of dragons yet.\""
msgstr "{n}이바르는 웃으며 약간 긴장을 풉니다.{/n} \"다행히 사람들은 아직 이런 종류의 용에 대해 이야기하지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0100_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3a1894e9-b859-4eb8-9fae-c2d5c5d3fd20"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder how would you deal with it, if, according to the legend, the "
"dragon was, let's say, a bright pink with sunflower spots!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 처리해야 할까. 전설에 드래곤은 해바라기 반점이 있는 밝은 분홍색 가죽을 가졌다고 하면 어떨까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0103_Text
msgctxt "f95808c4-71dc-4563-8e55-0f55b4cbf115"
msgid ""
"\"You want to know if I regret about telling lies to the villagers? Yes, I "
"do, but I can't find another way. So, enough about that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 마을 사람들에게 거짓말을 해서 후회하는지 궁금해? 그래. 후회돼. 하지만 다른 방법을 찾을 수는 없었어. 그러니 이제 그만해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0104_Text
msgctxt "38645912-217b-4e58-89ca-be5db011a4dd"
msgid "\"We can both agree on that, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}.\""
msgstr "\"그 점에 대해서는 우리 둘 다 의견이 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0105_Text
msgctxt "0cb130be-cfe7-4796-b51b-688f81c1e122"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you so sure that this \"another time\" will happen? I won't stay "
"here long. There's an old saying — sluggish wolf soon starves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 말한 그 '나중'이라는게 있을꺼라고 꽤나 확신하는군? 나는 여기 오래 머물지 않을 거야. 옛말에, 게으른 늑대는 굶어 죽는다는 "
"말이 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterAtCliff/Cue_0109_Text
msgctxt "b59413c4-7011-4ee0-81bc-cddd039a5427"
msgid "\"And they are?...\""
msgstr "\"이제 어떻게 할 셈인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/HunterFootprintBarks/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_HunterFootprintBarks_WhatToBark
msgctxt "6003ffdb-c0e6-4a65-9cd2-f829ba2c7099"
msgid "The hunter's tracks lead north."
msgstr "사냥꾼의 흔적은 북쪽으로 이어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Items/BanditsNotes_String
msgctxt "7d5585cd-f965-4725-98ab-a114efe78b9f"
msgid ""
"First note:\n"
"\"I'm not gonna say it out loud — the chief'd rip me a new one if he heard "
"me — but I think it's time to hit the road. Silverstep is cursed! Look, just "
"yesterday, I saw a boat sailing in the lake. A big one, kind with a big "
"sail, and there were a bunch of people onboard around some big box or chest "
"or something. All of a sudden, the steersman spins the wheel and rams the "
"boat right against the rocks! The wreck went down at that cliff not far from "
"our cave. The people jumped out and tried to swim for shore, but... they "
"just froze in place and sank under without a sound! One got close enough I "
"could see his face, a mask of terror I can't even begin to describe. Yelled "
"something about Charon, went pale, froze like the others, and — pop! That "
"was the last I saw of him.\n"
"Sure, there are plenty of nasty beasts around, but this was something else. "
"I trust my instincts, and they're screaming at me loud as can be to get out "
"while we still can. If we don't, we're all gonna die.\"\n"
"Second note:\n"
"\"Cut the whining, bud. There's a wrecked boat, and you say we should run? I "
"say we go take a look — might be there's some valuables in the wreckage.\"\n"
"Third note:\n"
"\"Now you've done it! Chief found out about the boat and the chest, and now "
"all he talks about is looking for treasure! He's gonna have the others out "
"searching for it, poking around the lake bed with hooks — and at night, of "
"all things, so the locals don't notice!\n"
"I'm telling you, no good'll come of this. These woods give me the creeps, "
"and they're even worse at night. Day before yesterday, I was on my way back "
"to the cave and heard a noise behind me. Turned around, and saw two glowing "
"eyes staring at me from the woods! Imagine it: the fir grove, in the dark, "
"and just two blazing embers in the night. I don't know what it was, and I "
"don't want to — I'm just glad it disappeared soon as I saw it!\"\n"
"Fourth note:\n"
"\"While you were busy being scared of that wolf or runaway kitty or whatever "
"it was, I found that box! It's just sitting there, all that precious "
"treasure right on the lake bed — it's not even that far from shore! We're "
"fishing it out tomorrow.\"\n"
"Fifth note:\n"
"\"Are you serious? I swear, if we don't get out of here before that box is "
"out of the water, something terrible is going to happen!\"\n"
"Sixth note:\n"
"\"Look, the beast that attacked the cave was scary, sure. But we gave it "
"hell, didn't we? And when the chief set it on fire, it ran off, didn't it? "
"Howled so loud I thought my head'd explode, but we came out fine. No, I "
"think I'm gonna stay. I bet that box is full of treasure. And as for the "
"beasts and those drowned men of yours... Well, this profession's all about "
"taking risks, right?\"\n"
"Seventh note.\n"
"\"There's risks, then there's whatever this is. No, when the chief goes out "
"to get that box, I'm gonna show my heels. Farewell, pal. Life is long — "
"maybe we'll meet again someday, if we play our cards right.\""
msgstr ""
"첫 번째 메모:\n"
"\"나는 큰 소리로 말하지 않겠다. 대장이 내 목소리를 들으면 나를 찢어 버릴 거다. 이제 길을 떠날 시간이라고 생각한다. 실버 스텝은 "
"저주 받았다! 어제 보트가 호수에 떠다니는 걸 봤어. 커다란 돛을 단 큰 배가 사람 한 무리와 커다란 상자 같은 것을 싣고 있었지. "
"갑자기 조종사가 키를 돌렸고 배는 바위와 부딪혔어! 우리 동굴에서 멀지 않은 벼랑에 배가 좌초됐지. 사람들은 뛰어내려 호숫가로 헤엄 "
"치려고 했지만 그 자리에서 얼어 붙어 소리 없이 가라앉았어! 그 겁에 질린 얼굴은 입에 담기조차 두려워. 케런에 대해 뭔가를 외쳤고 "
"얼굴이 창백해지더니 다른 사람들처럼 얼어 붙었어. 그리고 그는 사라졌어.\n"
"물론 주위에 짐승이 많이 있지만 이 경우는 달랐어. 내 본능을 믿는데 우리가 도망치는 동안 그들은 있는 힘을 다해 나에게 소리 지르고 "
"있었다. 도망가지 않았다면 우리 모두 죽었을 거야. \"\n"
"두 번째 메모:\n"
"\"그만 징징대. 배가 좌초되었는데 도망쳐야 한다고? 배에 귀중품이 있을지도 몰라.\"\n"
"세 번째 메모:\n"
"\"이제 해냈어! 대장이 배와 궤짝에 대해 알아냈고 계속해서 보물에 대해 얘기하고 있어. 그는 다른 사람들을 시켜 갈고리로 호수 바닥을 "
"훑으며 찾으라고 할 거야. 밤이라 주민들은 알아채지 못할 테지.\n"
"장담하는데 좋은 일은 일어나지 않을 거야. 이 숲은 소름끼치는데 밤에는 더 무서워. 그저께는 동굴로 돌아 오는 길에 뒤에서 소리를 "
"들었다. 돌아섰는데 숲에서 나를 바라보고 있는 두 개의 빛나는 눈을 보았다고! 상상해 봐. 어두운 전나무 숲에 밤에 타오르는 두 눈빛을. "
"그게 뭔지 모르고 알고 싶지도 않아. 그것을 보았을 때 사라져서 다행일 뿐이야.\"\n"
"네 번째 메모:\n"
"\"늑대에 겁에 질려 도망쳤을 때 나는 상자를 발견했어! 귀중한 보물은 모두 호수 바닥에 있더군. 호숫가에서 멀리 떨어져 있는 곳도 "
"아니었어! 내일 그 상자를 끌어낼 거야.\"\n"
"다섯 번째 메모:\n"
"\"진심이야? 상자가 물에서 나오기 전에 여기서 나가지 않으면 끔찍한 일이 일어날 거야!\"\n"
"여섯 번째 메모:\n"
"\"짐승이 동굴을 공격했는데 무서웠어. 하지만 우리는 괜찮겠지? 대장이 불을 놓으면 도망치니까? 어찌나 크게 울어대던지 머리가 터질 "
"지경이었지만 괜찮아졌어. 여기에 머물러야겠어. 그 상자는 보물이 가득할 거야. 그리고 짐승과 물에 가라앉은 사람들은... 우리 직업은 "
"위험한 것 같아.\"\n"
"일곱 번째 메모.\n"
"\"위험이 지나가면 무엇이든 겪게 될 거야. 대장이 상자를 가지러 가면 나는 도망칠 거야. 안녕. 인생은 짧지 않으니 우리는 언젠가 "
"만나서 카드 놀이를 할 수도 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Items/HuntersLetterStrangeText_String
msgctxt "7f92d54c-3ba0-475b-b8bd-9ddb6a6d5cb6"
msgid ""
"\"You know, Lissa, my father always used to scold me, saying, 'Ivar, you "
"shouldn't wag your tongue so much.' I never listened. Remember the Day of "
"Matchmaking? The headman's son came to you, gave you those nice boots only "
"city ladies wear, and his servants brought a barrel of honey and a crate of "
"sausages. Then Mengar the Smith came — brought an ornate door casing, "
"skillfully crafted locks, and piles of other housewares — and said he was "
"going to decorate a house for the two of you with all he crafted. I came "
"late in the evening, after all of them had left, and all I brought was a "
"bunch of wild flowers. I set them on the porch and said, 'I saw a nixie "
"crying in the forest. She'd planned to make a lantern of my heart, but she "
"found my heart was already taken! It's bad fortune to make nixies cry, so "
"Lady Lissa, would you go to the forest and give the heart you've taken to "
"anyone who may need it more than you?'\n"
"You told me I was such a fool, and then you kissed me.\n"
"For our wedding, you invited your relatives, the old miller's widow, and "
"stupid Aysel, the fisherman — out of pity, I suspect, as no one else wanted "
"to spend time around him. I invited frogs, wind, and the full moon. 'Brother "
"Moon,' I said, 'please be so kind as to share your light with everyone, for "
"my bride tires of shining over this world alone.' The frogs sang along with "
"Aysel, and you were more beautiful than the moon and more cheerful than the "
"spring wind.\n"
"Arry was about to turn five and Mika was just four, and I'd spent a month "
"dragging fish to the cliff and cursing a stupid wyvern who just wouldn't be "
"lured. When I finally lured her, I chased her through the bushes, collecting "
"her silver scales here and there after they fell. It wouldn't have been so "
"hard to decorate our garden with those scales if I hadn't done it at night. "
"Then the morning came, and our children went silent, their mouths agape — "
"hundreds of silver lights sparkled atop apple and cherry trees. I hid my "
"scratched hands in my sleeves and scoffed. 'This isn't so special — you've "
"never noticed before how the stars hide in the trees from the cunning Sky "
"Cat?' You looked at me without a word, but I could still hear your words in "
"my mind. 'You're such a fool, Ivar. I love you.'\n"
"...I don't remember how I came up with the story of the Silver Dragon. I "
"came home late with a black grouse I'd shot and said, 'It was a hard fight! "
"I just couldn't aim properly. This dragon kept peeping out from the clouds, "
"blinding me with his shiny silver wings.' 'You saw a real dragon, Dad?' 'Not "
"the whole dragon, no. You see, the only way to see the dragon is if two "
"loving souls climb up the high cliff under a new moon, hand in hand.' At the "
"time, I wasn't thinking about how dark the night was, or how steep the path "
"to the top of the cliff was — especially for little feet — or how wet the "
"rocks were after the rain. I was just looking at you, wishing it was us — "
"two loving souls, hand in hand, sneaking away up to the skies, as we did "
"when we weren't that much older than Arry and Mika.\n"
"The next morning you woke first, and it was you who found our children's "
"beds empty.\n"
"You said nothing to me then. Not then, not when we walked through the misty "
"woods, not when we found Mika's doll at the start of the path leading to the "
"cliff. You kept silent as I ascended from the chasm with Arry's body in my "
"hands. You said nothing when Aysel brought Mika's body, found further out, "
"at the lake shore near the cliff.\n"
"You're such a fool, Ivar. You wag your tongue too much. It was just a story, "
"another of your stupid fairy tales, how could it end this way?!\n"
"I'm so sorry, Lissa.\n"
"Better you'd married the smith. Or the headman's son. Or even stupid Aysel. "
"Anyone but me.\n"
"It's all my fault. Forgive me. Please.\n"
"And let me go.\n"
"Today, I'll go to the children's graves and…\""
msgstr ""
"\"리사. 내 아버지는 항상 나에게 입 조심해야 한다고 꾸짖고는 하셨지. 나는 그 말을 절대 듣지 않았어. 우리가 만났던 구혼자의 날을 "
"기억해? 촌장의 아들은 너에게 와서 도시 여자들만 신는 멋진 구두를 선물했고 그의 하인들은 꿀 단지와 소시지 상자를 가지고 와서는 네게 "
"구혼을 했어. 다음으로 대장장이 멘가르가 와서는 문에 달 장식물과 정교하게 만든 자물쇠, 집기들을 가져와서 둘만의 집을 만들어 주겠다며 "
"네게 구혼했지. 나는 다른 구혼자들이 다 떠난후 다늦은 저녁에나 도착했는데 가져온 것이라곤 야생에 피던 들꽃 한다발 뿐이었지. 나는 꽃을 "
"현관 앞에 내려놓고 너에게 이렇게 말했지. '숲에서 닉시가 울고있는 것을 보았어요. 닉시는 내 마음을 훔치려 했지만 내 마음은 이미 "
"누군가에게 빼았겨 있다는 걸 알게 되었거든요! 닉시를 울리는건 불운한 일이니, 리사, 숲에 가서 당신이 훔쳐간 내 마음을 닉시에게 전해 "
"주지 않겠어요?'\n"
"너는 바보 같다고 말하며 나에게 키스를 해주었지.\n"
"우리 결혼식 때는, 너는 네 친척들과 방앗간의 늙은 과부와 멍청한 어부 아이셀을 초대했지. 그 어부까지 부른건, 그와 같이 어울리려는 "
"사람이 없어서 동정심에 네가 부른거 같아. 나는 개구리, 바람, 그리고 보름달을 초대했지. 나는 달에게 부탁했지. '부디 세상 모두에게 "
"당신의 빛을 비춰주세요. 내 신부의 아름다움으로 혼자 세상을 비추기엔 이젠 힘들다구요.' 그때 개구리는 아이셀과 함께 노래를 불렀고.. "
"너의 모습은 보름달보다도 빛났고 봄 바람보다 더 부드러웠지.\n"
"아리는 5살이 되었고 미카는겨우 4살이 되던 때였어. 나는 와이번을 잡기위해 한 달간이나 물고기를 절벽으로 옮겨가며 미끼로 유인했지만, "
"전혀 미끼를 물지 않는 콧대 높은 와이번을 욕하며 하루하루를 보내고 있었지. 드디어 와이번을 유인해내는 것에 성공하자, 나는 놈을 따라 "
"숲으로 가면서 여기저기 떨어져있는 와이번 비늘을 줏어모았어. 빛을 반사하는 은빛 비늘이라 우리집 정원 꾸미기에 아주 좋았거든. 다음날 "
"아침이 되자 우리 아이들은 입을 벌린채 아무말도 못하고 있었어. 정원의 사과 나무와 체리 나무에 수백개의 은빛이 빛났기 때문이지. 나는 "
"비늘을 모으느라 상처 입은 손을 감추고는 코웃음을 치며 말했어. '얘들아. 뭘 이런 걸로 놀라고 그래. 하늘에서 떨어진 별들이 나무에 "
"박혀있는거 처음봐?' 그때 너는 아무 말도 하지 않고 그저 나를 바라보고 있었지만 너의 목소리가 들리는것 같았지. '너는 바보야. "
"이바르, 사랑해.'\n"
"... 어떻게 해서 실버 드래곤의 이야기를 지어냈는지는 기억이 안 나. 나는 그날, 사냥한 검은 새를 들고 집에 늦게 들어와서는 "
"가족들에게 말했어. '힘든 싸움이었다! 겨냥하기가 힘들었어. 이 드래곤은 구름 속에서 나를 훔쳐보면서 반짝이는 은빛 날개로 아빠 눈을 "
"장님으로 만들지 뭐야.' 그랬더니 아이가 '진짜 드래곤을 본거야 아빠?' 라고 물었지. 나는 대답해 주길 '모두가 드래곤을 볼 수는 "
"없단다. 드래곤을 보려면, 보름달이 떠오른 날, 사랑하는 두 영혼이 손을 꼭 잡고 높은 절벽 위로 올라가야만 해.' 라고 말했지. 나는 "
"당시엔 밤이 얼마나 어두웠는지, 절벽이 얼마나 가파랐는지, 바위가 비에 젖어 얼마나 미끄러운지 생각치도 못했어. 나는 아이들에게 한 말이 "
"아니라 리사, 당신을 두고 한말이 었어. 난 그저..그 광경이 우리 둘이였으면 하고 리사 당신을 바라보고 있었지. 사랑하는 두 영혼이 "
"손을 잡고, 하늘 가까이 올라 갔었던..우리 둘이 어렸던 그때 처럼..\n"
"다음날 아침 눈을 떴을때, 우리 아이들의 침대가 비어있는 것을 먼저 발견한 건 당신이었지.\n"
"그때 너는 나에게 아무 말도 하지 않았어. 우리가 안개가 자욱한 숲을 걸을 때도, 절벽으로 이어지는 길에서 미카의 인형을 발견했을 때도, "
"내가 아리의 시체를 절벽에서 짊어지고 올라왔을 때도, 너는 침묵을 지켰지. 아이셀이 절벽 근처의 호숫가에서 미카의 시체를 데려 왔을 때도 "
"너는 아무 말도 하지 않았어.\n"
"너의 목소리가 들리는 것 같았어 '너는 바보야. 이바르. 너는 도무지 입을 조심하질 않아. 그저 너의 바보스런 동화같은 이야기였을 "
"뿐인데, 어떻게 이런 식으로 끝날 수가 있지?!'\n"
"정말 미안해. 리사.\n"
"너는 대장장이와 결혼하는 게 나았을꺼야. 촌장의 아들이거나, 아니면 멍청한 아이셀이라도. 나만 빼고 누구던지 말이야..\n"
"모두 내 잘못이야. 용서해줘. 부디.\n"
"그리고 날 보내 줘.\n"
"오늘 나는 아이들의 무덤에 갈 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Items/SilverstepWyvernFish_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "ac433ca6-1542-4949-8aa5-e77ecd106501"
msgid "A fat, tasty looking fish."
msgstr "통통하고 맛있어 보이는 생선입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/Items/SilverstepWyvernFish_Name_String
msgctxt "7087d912-507c-4af1-918d-7e6b3eb463c0"
msgid "Fish from the Silverstep Lake"
msgstr "실버스텝 호수의 물고기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "a255a8c0-c527-4dca-9abc-1bd6fbb94f0f"
msgid "\"What's your name?\""
msgstr "\"너 이름이 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "065ddbb6-45d7-4cc3-9f95-e2abb42307cd"
msgid "\"Why are you crying?\""
msgstr "\"왜 우는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "bda1cb33-7e67-435f-8bcc-0fd8e33126a8"
msgid "\"Can you tell me what happened?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이 있었는지 말해 줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f24e1f5c-6f70-4829-a7d4-5a721401c608"
msgid "\"I'm no enemy to the fey.\""
msgstr "\"나는 페이의 적이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d62fd0a1-d4b3-4367-ae91-52a7a74b1317"
msgid "Attacked the crying nixie."
msgstr "울고 있는 닉시를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "34370d35-cf02-419a-a29f-ca32b8f2d32b"
msgid "[Attack] \"You shouldn't have threatened me, beast!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너는 나를 위협해서는 안되었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "5e5baf49-8c5a-4d1e-847f-08dd9b122b2b"
msgid "\"We'll talk again later. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "972ba846-cd5c-4cab-8e8f-2fe47bf941e2"
msgid "\"Did you drown those travelers?\""
msgstr "\"여행자들을 익사시킨 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "d2b332fd-13fa-40fd-8963-dd994b80076e"
msgid "\"That's quite a story. But what does it have to do with me?\""
msgstr "\"대단한 이야기군. 하지만 그게 나와 무슨 상관이 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "c5f81c58-5a17-4764-b968-3e8eb8fa912b"
msgid "\"What's in the box?\""
msgstr "\"상자에 뭐가 들어 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "bfbedb94-066e-45d5-9202-3e2cdf05cef8"
msgid "\"You said someone's trying to open the box again. Who is it?\""
msgstr "\"누군가 상자를 다시 열려고 했다고? 그게 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "c9332605-fb21-4e32-93f6-967008b4c21e"
msgid "\"We'll talk again later. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "98f097d3-b16a-481f-8fd5-a26ab5dcbd55"
msgid "Offered help to crying nixie."
msgstr "울고 있는 닉시를 도와주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "86d50d73-fbb3-4b76-8279-ddcb56a552a1"
msgid "\"I'll help if I can.\""
msgstr "\"가능하다면 도와줄께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "4b021c7d-1c97-46f4-b9b3-ad7203212d74"
msgid "\"Can you remind me where the box is now?\""
msgstr "\"상자가 지금 어디 있는지 말해줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "028bb60a-60e8-4d17-9631-7681ba9f46ff"
msgid ""
"\"I've thought about it, and I figure this isn't really any of my business "
"after all.\""
msgstr "\"생각해 봤는데 나와 상관이 없는 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "db2cd879-850e-45e1-a10d-125d12c4ca45"
msgid "Attacked the crying nixie."
msgstr "울고 있는 닉시를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "6e8088d5-b94e-4676-8b8e-c1ea2d40816d"
msgid "[Attack] \"Creatures like you don't deserve my help!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너 같은 생물들은 내 도움을 받을 자격이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "c6ba4f5f-b15e-4231-bd2c-9830bc90532a"
msgid "\"You know favors like that don't come free, right?\""
msgstr "\"이런 호의는 공짜가 아니라는 것은 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0041_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a3506496-1022-4ef5-851a-c0ff438d9250"
msgid "Offered help to crying nixie."
msgstr "울고 있는 닉시를 도와줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "2f52c423-c33d-4790-864f-e204080fcedc"
msgid "\"No, go ahead and keep your trinkets. No charge for this one.\""
msgstr "\"가서 네 짐을 챙겨. 대가는 바라지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c58e819e-e049-4674-99bf-087d937e750b"
msgid "Agreed to help the nixie for a reasonable reward."
msgstr "합리적인 보상을 받는 대신 닉시를 돕겠다고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "4516cfce-096b-41cf-878f-45cc5cb3a913"
msgid "\"Deal.\""
msgstr "\"좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "fc0694c1-0746-4871-90ce-11b6c1236f10"
msgid "\"No. Deal with your own problems.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 너 알아서 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "6f9e55a2-306b-4b30-a834-dd73d119ef29"
msgid "\"I can help you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 도울 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "18c533a5-438e-4f05-800a-2d59e45a536c"
msgid "\"Well, that's cleared up a few things for me.\""
msgstr "\"흠. 얘기해줘서 몇가지는 정리가 되었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0050_Text_String
msgctxt "8c1fb5fa-dec8-4ba2-8cef-c7082ce9f35b"
msgid ""
"\"The problem's solved. There was a monster in the box — a cyclops — but "
"he's dead now."
msgstr "\"문제는 해결되었어. 상자엔 사이클롭스가 있었어. 지금은 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "44d8f4b2-af38-46e7-8e6e-f6fa6a5b8726"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I won't allow some foolish nixie to drown people and not be "
"punished!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"어리석은 닉시가 사람들을 익사시키고 무사하게 둘 수는 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "480ea02f-01d7-47ba-9ad3-6763010e7bc8"
msgid ""
"{n}A nixie, slim and disheveled, is sobbing. Noticing strangers, she "
"flinches.{/n} \"Not again! What are you doing here? What do you want?! Go "
"away! If my family sees you, you're as good as dead, I promise!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}날씬하고 머리가 흐트러진 닉시는 흐느끼고 있습니다. 낯선 사람을 발견하자 그녀는 놀랍니다.{/n} \"더는 안돼! 여기서 뭐하고 "
"있는 거야? 뭘 원해? 저리 가! 내 가족이 너를 발견하면 너는 죽은 목숨이나 다름 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ff5e5cc2-4e34-43b2-a8d1-94ba78abde89"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Lykka. This lake is our home, though we've let other people live "
"around here too. Oh, we never should have done that! We should have chased "
"those foolish bumpkins away as soon as they started building their houses "
"here. Now they've brought disaster down on us all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 리카야. 이 호수는 우리집이지. 우리는 다른 사람들도 이곳에서 살게 했지만. 하지만 그러지 말아야 했어! 그들이 여기에 집을 "
"지었을 때 쫓아버렸어야 했는데. 지금은 그 녀석들이 우리에게 재앙을 퍼붓고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "d2b5695b-9a45-41f0-9b1d-a3dd97a5a7b9"
msgid ""
"\"Those men brought trouble. The ones from the big boat! They came from {g|"
"Tors of Levenies}Tors of Levenies{/g} and brought that scary box with them. "
"Even the fish in the lake could tell that box was very, very evil. But those "
"fools on the boat just laughed, bowing to the box, calling themselves "
"'{g|Charon}Charon's{/g} chosen' or something. They claimed he'd reward them "
"soon. I was the one who 'rewarded' them, though — I made them crash that big "
"boat against the foot of the high cliff and sink themselves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 사람들이 문제를 일으켰어. 큰 배에 있던 사람들 말이야! 그들은 {g|Tors of Levenies}레베니스 바위산맥{/g}에서 "
"왔고 저 무서운 상자를 가져왔어. 심지어 호수에 있는 물고기조차 상자가 매우 사악한 걸 알고 있다구. 하지만 배에 있던 그 바보들은 그저 "
"웃고는, 자기들을 {g|Charon}카론{/g}이 선택한 자들'이라고 부르면서 상자에 절하고 있었어. 카론이 자신들에게 곧 '보상'을 "
"해줄 거라고 믿고 있어. 하지만 내가 그들에게 '보상'이 아닌 '보복'을 해주었지. 나는 그 녀석들의 배를 절벽에 부딪혀 난파시켰어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "24d403b8-7f45-43bb-b4e3-ce9ebdab3764"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! That was the last anyone saw of them! The evil box sunk too.\" {n}The "
"nixie sobs.{/n} \"If I hadn't done it, they'd have opened the box, you "
"understand? Then something terrible would have happened!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래! 그때가 그들을 본 마지막이었어! 그 사악한 상자도 가라앉았고.\" {n}닉시가 흐느낍니다.{/n} \"내가 그러지 않았다면 "
"그들은 상자를 열었을 거야. 그러면 끔찍한 일이 일어났을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "eefa6502-a694-442f-bcbd-e5b008882e17"
msgid ""
"\"If you were an enemy, you'd be just a few bubbles on the lake surface by "
"now! But here I am, see? Still standing and talking with you.\" {n}The nixie "
"sobs again and rubs her eyes with her palm.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네가 적이라면 넌 지금쯤 가라앉아 호수 표면에 물방울이 되어 있었을 테지! 하지만 나는 여기에 있어. 봤지? 여기서 너와 이야기하고 "
"있다구.\" {n}닉시는 다시 흐느끼고는 손바닥으로 두 눈을 문지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "0ce6fae4-e0a4-4bbe-9c97-8d80917142f6"
msgid ""
"{n}The nixie hides her face in her hands.{/n} \"My family kicked me out. All "
"because of what I did to that stupid boat! Everyone was furious when the "
"evil box fell in the lake, but I was just trying to do the right thing!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}닉시는 손으로 얼굴을 가립니다.{/n} \"우리 가족은 나를 쫓아냈어. 내가 그 멍청한 배에 한 짓 때문에! 그 사악한 상자가 "
"호수에 떨어졌을 때 모두 화가 났지만 나는 옳은 일을 하려고 했을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "508ab7df-6be9-4e25-a8d7-67a2f96e188d"
msgid ""
"\"How should I know? I just know the box is evil — everyone but the stupid "
"humans can sense it. Fish started jumping ashore after the box fell in the "
"lake. Wolves took their hunting up north to get away from it. And the humans "
"wanted to open it! First the ones from the boat, and now these other ones "
"came for it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 어떻게 알아? 나는 단지 그 상자가 악한 것만 알고있어. 바보 같은 인간을 빼곤 모두 그걸 느낄 수 있어. 상자가 호수에 빠지고 "
"난 이후로 물고기가 호숫가에서 뛰어 올라오기 시작했어. 늑대들은 호수에서 떨어진 북쪽에서 사냥을 하기 시작했고. 그런데 인간들은 그것을 "
"열어보고 싶어했어! 처음에는 배의 사람들이 그러더니 이제는 다른 자들도 오고 있다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "7e4a2838-b463-41cb-9560-ad074224232c"
msgid ""
"\"Now the nixies are mad at all strangers. They say, 'All strangers bring is "
"trouble! First, they brought a horrible ancient thing here, and now other "
"strangers are trying to fish it out of the lake and open it! Let's drive "
"everyone but us nixies away, then we'll have peace and quiet again, like "
"before!'\" {n}The nixie sobs again.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"닉시들은 이제 이방인에게 화가 났어. 모든 이방인은 문제를 일으킨다며 말이야. 이방인들은 여기에 끔찍한 고대의 물건을 가져왔고 이제는 "
"다른 이방인들이 호수에서 그 상자를 꺼내 열어보려고 해! 닉시를 빼고 모두 쫓아내야 예전처럼 평화롭고 조용해질 수 있어!\" {n}닉시는 "
"다시 흐느낍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "d8c26394-b351-4080-a5aa-1fc9cefeb109"
msgid ""
"\"More strangers! They hid in the cave near the lake. They've been using "
"hooks and big nets to try to retrieve the box! 'It's a treasure, a treasure' "
"— that's what they say. How can that thing be a treasure? It's a huge scary "
"box that has a picture of a one-eyed skull with a coin on it. I don't know "
"where it came from, but I know it's somewhere I'd never want to visit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이방인들이 더 왔어! 그들은 호수 근처의 동굴에 숨어 있어. 그들은 상자를 꺼내기 위해 갈고리와 큰 그물을 사용했다고! 그들은 "
"보물이라며 기뻐했지. 어떻게 그게 보물일 수가 있어? 그건 외눈박이 해골 그림이 박힌 동전으로 장식된 크거 무서운 상자일 뿐이야. "
"어디에서 왔는지 모르지만 내가 결코 가보길 원하지 않는 곳에서 왔을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "5cd9435b-818a-4b8c-b619-962854c2d6f7"
msgid ""
"\"Please, wait!\" {n}The nixie looks at you timidly.{/n} \"You look really "
"strong! Can you do something about that evil box, maybe? I just wish it "
"would disappear! Then all the other nixies would forgive me and stop being "
"angry at the humans...\""
msgstr ""
"\"제발. 기다려!\" {n}닉시가 겁에 질려 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}\" 너는 정말 강해 보이는구나! 그 사악한 상자를 없애줄 수 "
"있겠어? 그러면 다른 닉시들은 나를 용서하고 더 이상 인간에게 화를 내지 않을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "504941c3-e6cb-483f-811d-dacf050aad57"
msgid ""
"\"At the bottom of the lake. But those strangers from the cave could fish it "
"out any time now — they already spent two nights searching with boats, "
"hooks, and nets. Their cave is to the northwest.\""
msgstr ""
"\"호수 바닥이야. 하지만 동굴에서 온 그 낯선 사람들은 언제든지 그것을 낚을 수 있어. 그들은 배를 타고 갈고리와 그물로 이틀 동안이나 "
"수색을 했어. 그들의 동굴은 북서쪽에 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "f1a2bdfd-2b9e-4323-b29d-c425ba44d799"
msgid ""
"{n}The nixie jumps with excitement.{/n} \"Thank you! Thank you, thank you, "
"thank you! Just be careful, please! That box is so creepy...\""
msgstr "{n}닉시는 놀라서 뛰어오릅니다.{/n} \"고마워. 고마워. 고마워. 고마워! 조심해! 그 상자는 너무 오싹해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "b2484b4a-93e0-48ce-90bd-cf7db475a710"
msgid ""
"{n}The nixie folds her hands over her chest and looks offended.{/n} \"Fine, "
"then! I'll figure something out on my own!\""
msgstr "{n}닉시는 상처 받은 듯 가슴 위에 손을 댑니다.{/n} \"좋아! 그럼 나 혼자서 알아볼 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "53021edc-8a23-4a04-a083-ad4cef30eb59"
msgid "\"Go away!\""
msgstr "\"저리가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "a6b4a96f-242c-441d-bc32-94328ec72fe6"
msgid "\"You're back! Did you take care of that box?\""
msgstr "\"왔구나! 상자를 없앴니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "dee5ea4c-76ba-4199-947f-1367772eeb6e"
msgid ""
"\"If you help me with that box, I'll give you a chest I found on the sunken "
"boat! It's not creepy like the evil box — just coins and trinkets inside.\""
msgstr ""
"\"상자를 없애준다면 난파선에서 찾은 궤짝을 줄게! 그 사악한 상자처럼 으스스하지는 않다. 그냥 동전과 장신구가 들어있는 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "65c067d2-9022-4d5c-a0bb-471412e1181e"
msgid ""
"\"But I like humans! Especially human children. They're so awkward and "
"funny! I used to play with the two kids from the house to the west, until "
"they stopped coming for some reason... But I don't want my family to fight "
"the humans!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 나는 인간을 좋아해! 특히 인간 아이들은 어리버리하고 우스워! 서쪽에 있는 집에서 두 아이와 놀곤 했는데 무슨 이유에선지 오지 "
"않아... 나는 내 가족이 인간과 싸우기를 바라지는 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "4bc1a2d0-1d82-442f-8926-1375ed9f0615"
msgid "{n}The nixie sniffles and starts to calm down.{/n} \"It's all so sad!\""
msgstr "{n}닉시는 훌쩍이며 진정하기 시작합니다.{/n} \"모든게 너무 슬퍼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "10ab5261-8f75-46fb-b9e2-46f0ae7e6fe8"
msgid ""
"{n}The nixie throws her hands up in joy.{/n} \"You did it! I have to tell my "
"family as soon as possible! Once I tell them what you did, they'll "
"understand that not all strangers are bad. A cyclops, huh? I doubt any of us "
"could have dealt with that!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}닉시는 기뻐서 손을 번쩍 듭니다.{/n} \"네가 해냈어! 빨리 내 가족들에게 말해야 해! 네가 한 일에 대해 말하면 모든 "
"이방인들이 다 나쁘지는 않다는 것을 알게 될 거야. 사이클롭스라고, 허? 우리 중 누가 그걸 처리할 수 있었을 지 의심되네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "aed0b9a7-8110-4ea1-8bca-d04a399123f6"
msgid "\"I'd say you earned yourself a reward!\""
msgstr "\"너에게 이 보상을 주고싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "6eb5af1c-2206-4788-8375-7a2047343e38"
msgid ""
"{n}The nixie looks at you timidly.{/n} \"You look really strong! Can you do "
"something about that evil box, maybe? I just wish it would disappear! Then "
"all the other nixies would forgive me and stop being angry at the humans...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}닉시가 겁에 질려 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n}\" 너는 정말 강해 보이는구나! 그 사악한 상자를 없애줄 수 있겠어? 그러면 다른 "
"닉시들은 나를 용서하고 더 이상 인간에게 화가 나지 않을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e4b38cea-9c52-4e13-987a-2bd6fd5cdb6e"
msgid ""
"\"What did you say? {g|Charon}Charon{/g}? That is bad. Very bad...\" {n}"
"Harrim frowns, tugging on his beard.{/n} \"An ancient, evil deity. I thought "
"only historians would remember him now. If he still has an active cult these "
"days... Hmmm...\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라고? {g|Charon}케런{/g}? 그건 좋지 않아. 아주 나빠...\" {n}하림은 찡그리며 턱수염을 쓰다듬습니다.{/n} "
"\"고대의 사악한 신이지. 나는 역사가들만이 그를 기억할 것이라고 생각했는데. 요즘도 그런 신을 받드는 녀석들이 있다니... 흠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SadNixie/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f6cc8e30-db45-41ab-a7a5-2fdaac094e39"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Charon}Charon{/g}? I know that name. An ancient deity of death and "
"evil. I was not aware he still had any worshipers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Charon}케런{/g}? 저도 그 이름을 압니다. 죽음과 악의 고대 신이죠. 그를 여전히 숭배하는 자가 있을 줄은 몰랐군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "697e77ab-526c-449c-b66f-612b4662fc60"
msgid "\"Can I see your wares?\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 좀 볼까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "dfe794f8-9fd2-4f1f-a5d8-41827d2e8492"
msgid "\"What's causing all the fuss around here?\""
msgstr "\"이곳에서 무슨 소동이 일어난 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "7395a4dc-49b0-4be4-b2db-b135c528d0c9"
msgid "\"Who is in charge of this village?\""
msgstr "\"이 마을의 책임자는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "10dee19c-50e5-4d9a-a540-2bfae040887c"
msgid "\"I'm surprised to see a trader in such a remote place.\""
msgstr "\"이런 외진 곳에서 상인을 만나다니 놀랍다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "354c7279-74ea-4a7d-b3c9-1e9daec6ca50"
msgid "Killed the trader for no reason."
msgstr "아무 이유 없이 상인을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "dc8a2268-6e9e-4c00-b916-57ac1da8ee34"
msgid "[Attack] \"I didn't come to talk.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 얘기하러 온 게 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "027c6fbd-5e4e-4f5d-868b-829366e2222f"
msgid "\"I'll come another time. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기하지. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "c488b337-0ca3-4db5-a3b9-0fb379ac3a10"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm, these wares don't look like hunting trophies. They remind me more of "
"some robber's loot.\""
msgstr "\"음. 이 것들은 사냥으로 얻은 것 같지 않아보이는군. 강도의 약탈품처럼 보여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0039_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2f76d2a4-7b33-40e3-8626-373ef197a716"
msgid ""
"Refused the suspicious trader's \"offering\" and insisted he tell the truth "
"about his possibly stolen goods."
msgstr "수상한 상인의 \"제안\"을 거부하고 도난당한 물건에 대해 진실을 말하라고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "882d3a89-cc40-406f-ba4a-f8de5e0480ae"
msgid ""
"\"Now you're trying to bribe me? If you ever even think of going back to "
"your old ways, you'll find yourself in some real trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금 나에게 뇌물을 주려는 거야? 만약 다시 한 번 그런 옛날 방식으로 돌아갈 생각조차 했다가는 정말 큰 후회하게 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "43277117-29b6-4c8f-afd6-5cfc54b455b8"
msgid "\"Why don't you start with where you acquired these goods of yours?\""
msgstr "\"물건을 어디서 구했는지부터 시작하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0041_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4d85601f-f57d-435f-9c02-b8d822a7edf1"
msgid ""
"Accepted the suspicious trader's \"offering\" without investigating his "
"possibly stolen goods."
msgstr "도난당한 물건에 대해 캐묻지 않고 수상한 상인의 \"제안\"을 받아들였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "c0395999-a09e-4e4a-aad0-7d884398cca1"
msgid "\"Donations are always appreciated.\""
msgstr "\"기부는 항상 환영이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "ad712902-75a3-479a-adda-20f313bf1c7d"
msgid ""
"\"Your suspicions about Ivar weren't unfounded. He wasn't some dragon's "
"messenger — he was a werewolf.\""
msgstr "\"네가 이바르를 의심한건 아주 근거없는 소리는 아니더군. 그는 드래곤의 사신이 아니라 늑대 인간이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0047_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c6d69941-6d7b-4bc6-9cde-1614a6658cec"
msgid ""
"Killed suspicious trader who was caught trading stolen goods and giving "
"bribes."
msgstr "훔친 물건을 거래하고 뇌물을 주려는 의심스러운 상인을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "43f5bf59-61ed-40ae-8e94-1d7451c5db8b"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Not only are you selling stolen wares, but now you're trying to "
"bribe your way out of justice? I can't let that go unpunished!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"도난당한 물건을 팔 뿐만 아니라 뇌물을 주기까지 해? 너는 처벌을 피할 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "4b625563-d6b3-4944-bd0c-14cf20c0e477"
msgid "\"No, I let him live.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 그를 살려두었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "733a09b7-1a77-4104-af6e-2ae3fc2e77c1"
msgid "\"Yes, and good riddance.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 속이 시원하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "3118d880-7603-4625-bc84-a16c7bf29ac6"
msgid "\"I dealt with your bandit buddies from that cave. They're gone.\""
msgstr "\"동굴의 도적 친구들을 손봐줬어. 그들은 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "f7af6f5f-9a90-4ad2-8015-e449649cfb30"
msgid "\"How I dealt with him is none of your business.\""
msgstr "\"그를 어떻게 하건 너와 상관 없는 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "61aab9f8-3ba4-4c05-af0e-099df0e7823f"
msgid ""
"\"You sent me a letter, right? About hunter named Ivar and his Silver Dragon "
"stories?\""
msgstr "\"내게 편지를 보냈지? 이바르와 실버 드래곤 이야기에 관해서 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "758c78b8-cf4b-45f5-bef1-1aab79f3df9b"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome to Brevis's Roadside Shop!\" {n}Judging from his accent and his "
"fine clothes, this trader isn't from around here.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"브레비스의 노점상에 온 것을 환영합니다!\" {n}목소리와 깔끔한 옷으로 판단하건데 이 상인은 이곳 출신 사람이 아닙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "e08d282e-1a07-471a-ab09-31eb586bb34a"
msgid ""
"{n}The trader smirks.{/n} \"Ivar. He's a resourceful one, to be sure. Made "
"the whole area believe he's some chosen one, the spokesman for the 'Silver "
"Dragon.' The idiots around here listen to everything he says and do whatever "
"he asks.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}상인은 빙그레 웃습니다.{/n} \"이바르라는 사람입니다. 확실히 그는 똑똑한 사람이긴 합니다. 온 마을을 자기가 '실버 드래곤'의 "
"대변인이라고 믿게 했어요. 여기 멍청이들은 그가 말한 것은 모두 믿고 하라는 대로 하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "35299379-8642-4d9a-a8d1-2798e24fbc0a"
msgid ""
"\"It's strange, though. After this Ivar fellow came to the village with his "
"sack of silver scales and his ridiculous stories about the Silver Dragon, "
"things in the area started to change. There was this wolf pack, used to cut "
"through the local cattle like a housewife cuts through vegetables. After "
"Ivar got here, the wolves won't even come close to the local cows. Same with "
"the monsters in the woods — they don't take step one toward the village or "
"its people. It's all pretty strange, if you ask me. Very strange, indeed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래도 이상한건, 이 이바르란 친구가 은색 비늘이 담긴 자루와 실버 드래곤에 관한 황당한 이야기를 마을로 들여왔을때부터, 확실히 이 "
"지역의 상황이 변하기 시작하긴 했어요. 늑대 무리가 손쉽게 가축을 잡아갔었는데, 이바르가 여기에 온 이후로 늑대들은 가축들에게 가까이 "
"가지도 않았죠. 숲 속의 괴물들도 마찬가지에요. 마을이나 사람들 근처에도 가까이 가지 않게 되었어요. 정말 이상한 일이긴 하죠. 정말로."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "a9ec2522-4e0d-4567-98b2-d2e6728033bf"
msgid ""
"\"You mean those fish jumping ashore?\" {n}The trader frowns.{/n} \"These "
"fools believe it's thanks to their 'patron,' the Silver Dragon. He "
"supposedly decided to provide the villagers with a feast and sent them this "
"'gift.' Idiots. I don't know the real reason those fish are jumping, but if "
"it were me, I wouldn't get too close to those fish or that lake.\""
msgstr ""
"\"호숫가에 뛰어오르는 저 물고기들을 말하는 건가요?\" {n}상인은 눈살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"여가 바보들은 마을 사람들의 "
"'후원자'이신 실버 드래곤 덕분이라고 믿고있어요. 드래곤이 마을 사람들에게 축제를 베풀기로 결심하고 이 '선물'을 보냈다고 생각합니다. "
"바보들이에요. 저 물고기들이 뛰어나오는 진짜 이유는 모르겠지만 저였다면 저 물고기나 저 호수에 너무 가까이 가지 않을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "69c2d444-7428-4e2e-827d-a23c37312050"
msgid ""
"\"I usually buy hides from the local hunters, but sometimes they come up "
"with some rather... intriguing trophies. No wonder, though, considering the "
"number of different beasts living in these woods.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 지역 사냥꾼들로부터 주로 가죽을 사오지만, 때때로 흥미로운 물건들도 구입해오고는 하죠. 이 숲속에 사는 짐승의 수를 생각해보면 "
"놀랄 일도 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "c159d6af-515c-4f2e-a728-01998e373ec5"
msgid ""
"{n}The trader's face goes blank.{/n} \"I'm sure I have no idea what you "
"mean, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}. This is all pretty standard "
"trade around these parts. You know, totally unrelated, I just realized I "
"haven't had an opportunity before to offer a donation to help support our "
"barony...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}상인의 얼굴이 멍해집니다.{/n} \"무슨 말씀인지 전혀 모르겠군요. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 제가 다루는건 이 주변에서 "
"꽤나 흔하게 거래되는 것들입니다. 갑자기 다른 얘기지만 남작령을 돕기 위해 기부금을 낼 기회가 없었다는게 방금 떠올랐습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "038a2e45-9b7f-4fef-b0f9-8cad8f4aa031"
msgid ""
"{n}The trader smiles broadly.{/n} \"Just the usual junk, Your Grace. I buy "
"it from travelers I come across here and there.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}상인은 넓은 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"그냥 평범한 물건들입니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}. 저는 여기 저기 떠돌아다니는 "
"여행자들에게서 사고는 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "58ffecd4-51a5-41e7-b0b2-1b28cb4a3318"
msgid ""
"\"So nice doing business with you, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}!\""
msgstr "\"거래하게 되어 기쁩니다! {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "805f2a19-05a4-4620-934a-74425eb6a36d"
msgid ""
"\"A werewolf! So that's who-\" {n}The trader cuts himself short, then "
"spits.{/n} \"I hope you killed the beast.\""
msgstr "\"늑대 인간! 그래서 그렇게...\" {n}상인은 말을 멈추고 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"그 짐승을 죽였기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "7e7d398c-aa8e-481e-beb1-bfb59756f074"
msgid ""
"{n}The trader glances at you suspiciously.{/n} \"All right, all right! "
"There's a cave to the north. Some... less than law-abiding fellows have "
"taken up residence there. If we're being uncharitable, you could call them "
"bandits. I sell things they've collected. But I never robbed anyone myself! "
"You've my word of honor on that!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}상인이 당신을 의심스럽게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"알겠습니다! 알겠어요! 북쪽에 동굴이 있습니다. 법이랑 친하지 않은 녀석들이 거길 "
"차지했죠. 쉽게 말하자면, 그냥 도둑이요. 물론 전 도둑질을 하지 않았습니다! 그놈들이 모아 놓은 물건을 가져다 판 것 뿐이에요! 제 "
"명예를 걸 수 있어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "b6844796-39d4-40ff-b00e-532e06b92e19"
msgid ""
"\"Sure, yes, of course!\" {n}The trader's voice rings with enthusiasm.{/n}"
msgstr "\"물론. 당연히 물론이죠!\" {n}상인의 목소리는 열정으로 가득합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "70f50cb2-fb88-4ead-a416-da2a870aa2e0"
msgid ""
"\"That was a... shortsighted decision.\" {n}The trader's voice carries a "
"tone of sarcasm, but he quickly restrains himself.{/n} \"Your "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 정말이지.. 섣부른 결정..\" {n}상인의 목소리에는 빈정거리는 어조가 담겨 있지만, 얼른 자제합니다.{/n} ..입니다. "
"{mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "af689792-8022-4366-9dd4-cfb61f976ebb"
msgid ""
"\"It's been a long time since I heard such good news! If you'll permit me, "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, I'd like to give you a gift, a sign of my "
"gratitude.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 오랜만에 이런 좋은 소식을 듣게 되었군요! 감사의 표시로 선물을 드리고 싶습니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "87a06fa9-2010-4b2c-ae28-f66063a59e24"
msgid ""
"{n}The trader's glance betrays no emotion.{/n} \"They were no buddies of "
"mine! Fewer bandits means calmer trading...\" {n}The trader trails off with "
"a grunt.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}상인의 시선은 아무 감정도 드러내지 않습니다.{/n} \"그들은 내 친구가 아니었습니다! 도둑이 적으면 거래가 더 편하기 때문에..."
"\" {n}상인은 불평하며 걸어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "8c65a8ea-e390-42c5-ab96-18a2cca848dd"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, of course! None of my "
"business at all.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다, {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 물론 입죠! 저는 신경 쓰지 않으셔도 됩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8dd85410-ff8b-4562-90e9-27b951dc5f57"
msgid ""
"\"Who are you trying to fool, you slime? H{mf|is|er} "
"{mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, me, or my blade?\""
msgstr "\"나를 바보로 만들려고? 내 칼에게도 그렇게 대답해 보지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fd2cbb4f-1566-40ce-b798-3664a7e413c3"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie meaningfully places her hand on her weapon.{/n} \"Would you like "
"to press your luck, liar?\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 의미심장하게 그녀의 손을 무기에 올려놓습니다.{/n} \"행운을 시험해 보고 싶은 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "273bb6bb-cfd9-4ffd-87a3-a6118a3860c4"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie's lips purse with disdain.{/n} \"Those like him think anything "
"can be bought — even laws and rulers.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리의 입술은 경멸로 일그러집니다.{/n} \"이런 자는 뭐든지 돈으로 살 수 있다고 생각합니다. 심지어 법과 통치자까지도요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5f6eb977-43e1-4ed2-9a65-20be6d3b1e60"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie glances pensively at you.{/n} \"Do you believe he will keep his "
"word? Though on second thought, I know how convincing you can be.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 수심가득한 눈으로 당신을 힐끗 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그가 약속을 지킬 것이라고 믿습니까? 한편으론, 당신이 얼마나 설득력 "
"있는 사람인지는 잘 알고있지만..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "071f7a0a-e6ab-4b56-a177-c5f76f2b9d98"
msgid "\"Aaaaah!\""
msgstr "\"아아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "d2846357-603a-4111-84d4-9b98443a242b"
msgid "\"And I can see you do not mind taking justice into your own hands!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 너는 정의를 앗아가려 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/SuspiciosTrader/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a1064ccf-cf34-4646-ac7d-239e55b231c6"
msgid "\"How low.\""
msgstr "\"정말 하찮다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "44e61d74-9fee-4486-9a52-e2e2dfe31fde"
msgid "[Examine the exterior of the sarcophagus]"
msgstr "[석관의 외관을 조사한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "2dea8f89-db5d-4fb2-be6b-b228716eb473"
msgid "[Use your strength to pry off the lid with a crowbar]"
msgstr "[힘을 써서 쇠지렛대로 뚜껑을 연다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "0ef37db3-630a-48e1-85d6-be447b8b831f"
msgid "[Search for a keyhole or easier means to open the sarcophagus]"
msgstr "[석관을 열 수 있는 열쇠구멍을 찾거나 석관을 열수 있는 더 쉬운 방법을 찾는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "68bb5b78-e5ba-4198-84a5-2eb55172016e"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠난다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "64a34890-f6a8-40f3-aa7f-ca0d4b3c91a0"
msgid ""
"[Open the sarcophagus by any means — even cracking it open, no matter how "
"long it takes]"
msgstr "[무슨 수를 써서라도 석관을 열려고 합니다.]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "efb838f9-e79c-4b8f-b121-0f70c5832971"
msgid "[Detect Magic] [Search for the signs of magic on the sarcophagus]"
msgstr "[마법 탐지][석관에서 마법의 흔적을 찾는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ac528682-d17d-41ea-a3f1-256a373bda08"
msgid ""
"{n}Water and sludge still drip from this huge stone block, which has "
"obviously been dredged from the lake bottom recently. Upon closer "
"examination, it looks like a huge chest... or rather, a sarcophagus. One "
"side bears an engraved symbol — a skull with a single eye-socket, and the "
"eye-socket is covered with a coin.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}거대한 돌에서 여전히 물과 진흙이 떨어졌고 그것들은 최근에 호수 바닥에 있던 것들이었습니다. 자세히 보자 그것은 거대한 상자처럼 "
"보입니다. 아니면 석관처럼 보입니다. 한쪽면에는 기호가 새겨져 있는데 외눈 구멍에 동전이 박혀있는 두개골입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "3cf5ea64-64c3-4a56-ae46-538a1427ac7c"
msgid ""
"{n}The engraving on the side of sarcophagus resembles the symbol of "
"{g|Charon}Charon{/g}, the Horseman of Death. But Charon's symbol usually has "
"two eye-sockets (each covered by a coin), while the symbol here has only "
"one. There's nothing more you can tell about the sarcophagus — except that "
"it's ancient.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}석관의 조각은 죽음의 기수인 {g|Charon}케런{/g}의 상징처럼 보입니다. 그러나 케런의 상징에는 보통 동전이 박힌 2개의 눈 "
"구멍이었고 이것은 하나뿐입니다. 석관에 대해 더 이상 말할 수있는 것은 없습니다. 고대인이라는 것 말고는.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "aa321bd3-cf95-4e17-9359-36e0ed772715"
msgid ""
"{n}The only thing about this sarcophagus you can say for certain is it was "
"made to hold a huge corpse... perhaps an ogre or giant.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}확실한 것은 이 석관은 아마 오우거나 거인과 같은 거대한 시체를 담아두었다는 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "9742c70e-b1b3-4ac2-b4b7-741a79b4cc2b"
msgid ""
"{n}With a heave, you lean into the crowbar with all your might, and there is "
"the scraping of stone as the lid shifts slightly and a waft of foul air "
"emerges from within... corpse rot.\n"
"Taking a breath, you are about to continue forcing the lid off when suddenly "
"the sarcophagus shifts from within — and a heartbeat later, a huge rotting "
"hand curls around the edge of the lid and begins to force the sarcophagus "
"open the rest of the way!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 힘을 다하여 지렛대를 누르자 뚜껑이 약간 움직이면서 돌 긁는 소리가 났고 안에서 시체의 부패한 공기가 흘러 나오게 됩니다. "
"\n"
"석관을 더 열자 당신의 심장은 빠르게 뛰었고 거대한 썩은 손이 뚜껑 가장자리를 잡고 석관을 열려고 했습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "83a853b1-1345-4284-9cac-fd33b8059d82"
msgid ""
"{n}You have no idea where the sarcophagus came from, but you know enough "
"about enchantments to know there must be an easy way to open it. "
"Experimenting with the engravings in various combinations, you discover when "
"you press your finger against the skull symbol with your hand on the lid, "
"the cover slides aside easily. Your triumph is short-lived, however — as the "
"lid slides open, there is the sound of something... something huge... "
"stirring within the sarcophagus. You hear a rattling whistle like air pushed "
"through a leaky bellows and scraps of flesh fly from the sarcophagus... "
"whatever's inside is huge, angry, and far from dead.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}석관이 어디서 왔는지는 모르지만 당신은 쉽게 열 수 있는 마법에 대해 알고 있습니다. 조각을 다양한 조합으로 맞추며 실험해 보자 "
"손으로 두개골 조각을 잡고 쉽게 뚜껑을 열 수 있었습니다. 하지만 기뻐할 틈도 잠시였고 뚜껑이 열리자 안에서 어떤 거대하고 떨리는 소리가 "
"납니다. 방울뱀과 같은 소리가 틈에서 들렸고 파리 떼가 석관에서 나옵니다. 그것은 크고 화가 나있고 죽음에서 온 무엇이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "bc97cd0c-1ddb-446f-9c4a-143cc37ce37e"
msgid ""
"{n}You struggle with the crowbar, but after several tries, it's useless — "
"the lid doesn't budge.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 지렛대로 열어보려 몇 번 시도해 보았지만 소용없었습니다. 뚜껑은 미동도 하지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "33aa8312-09f4-42c5-9008-e6ed2d8479e5"
msgid ""
"{n}After many desperate tries, a broken hammer, and a sore back and "
"shoulders, you manage to crack the lid of the sarcophagus... a horrid smell "
"wafts forth — corpse rot. But at least you've opened it. Your triumph is "
"short-lived, however — you freeze as you hear something stir within the "
"sarcophagus — something heavy. A heartbeat later, a huge rotting hand curls "
"around the crack you've made, and locks around the edge... this is quickly "
"followed by the scraping of stone as the hand begins to force the lid open "
"the rest of the way!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}망치가 깨지고 등과 어깨가 욱신거릴 정도로 많은 시도를 하고 당신은 석관의 뚜껑을 부숴 버렸습니다... 그 안에서는 시체가 부패하는 "
"끔찍한 냄새가 났습니다. 적어도 당신은 그것을 열었지만요. 그러나 당신의 승리는 오래 가지 못합니다. 석관 안에서 뭔가가 무거운 소리가 "
"들리자 당신은 얼어붙습니다. 곧 거대한 썩은 손이 부숴진 석관 뚜껑을 잡았고 이내 석관의 뚜껑을 마저 열어버리려고 합니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "a6703328-0962-4444-a4c4-72c168db558d"
msgid ""
"{n}There doesn't seem to be anything remarkable about the sarcophagus — nor "
"does there seem to be an easy way to open it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}석관은 주목할 만한 것이 없을 것 같습니다. 또한 그것을 열 수있는 쉬운 방법은 없는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/UndeadCyclopsSarcophagus/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "6f601b79-f41a-48fe-9260-ae28c7a49d1c"
msgid ""
"{n}Magic presence here is obvious. You can sense powerful necromancy "
"energies, but can't figure out the specific spells in use here.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}여기에 마법의 존재가 있는 것이 분명합니다. 당신은 강력한 사령술사의 기운을 느꼈지만 여기에 사용되는 특정 주문을 파악할 수는 "
"없었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepLake_Outdoor/VillageLoreBarks1/SilverstepLake_Outdoor_VillageLoreBarks1_WhatToBark
msgctxt "6eb969a9-1c76-4fe5-8193-1f903dd2fad8"
msgid "Nets, boats, and other useful gear for a fishing village."
msgstr "어촌에서 쓰이는 그물, 보트 및 기타 유용한 도구입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/Barks/ChildrenTombs_String
msgctxt "530aaa48-fb4f-46f0-990f-63b302165612"
msgid ""
"Two small graves hide at the foot of the rock. Wooden grave markers, "
"whittled and painted with loving care, are placed at the top of both."
msgstr "두 개의 작은 무덤이 발치의 바위에 숨어 있습니다. 나무로 깎고 조심스럽게 다듬은 나무조각이 무덤 위에 놓여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/Barks/HunterBeforAttack_String
msgctxt "bf6e9571-d86f-4ca0-b250-7ae64dbef1bf"
msgid ""
"\"Don't come closer... Don't! How can I stop it? It's too strong! Too strong!"
"\""
msgstr "\"가까이 오지 마...안돼! 어떻게 막지? 너무 강해! 너무 강하다구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "df371863-827e-4f93-9a9b-49aa0c090898"
msgid "\"Tell me the truth about what happened to you.\""
msgstr "\"너한테 무슨 일이 있었는지 사실대로 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "29af49ee-6fc8-4842-a744-b691a10f9538"
msgid "Killed Ivar the werewolf."
msgstr "늑대인간 이바르를 죽였다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "21cf469f-96e8-42f0-88a7-e6f2b2a535f1"
msgid "[Finish the hunter] \"We've no place for monsters like you!\""
msgstr "[사냥꾼을 끝장낸다] \"너 같은 괴물은 필요 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "e9df9a16-e76f-48b3-bf57-29ca4dff473c"
msgid "\"Enough, Ivar. I've heard what I need — I won't kill you.\""
msgstr "\"충분해, 이바르. 필요한 건 다 들었다. 당신을 죽이지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e526f527-1cd6-4c54-b46b-f0b4720e7d23"
msgid ""
"\"Why not work for me? Lay down the title of Dragon's Voice and become the "
"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}'s Voice for the people.\""
msgstr "\"나를 위해 일해주지 않겠나? 용의 목소리라는 칭호를 내려놓고 민중을 위한 {mf|영주|영주|왕|여왕}의 목소리가 되어줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "28143160-047c-4023-abd5-ae1856c1a50a"
msgid "\"So how exactly did you 'serve' people?\""
msgstr "\"정확히 어떻게 사람들을 '섬겼다'는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "7f489bea-d84a-4149-8450-f8399bffb329"
msgid "\"Were I to spare you, what would you do?\""
msgstr "\"만일 내가 너를 살려주면 어떻게 하겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5b4bc51f-4a88-450b-b382-6f3c592d663f"
msgid "Killed Ivar the werewolf."
msgstr "늑대인간 이바르를 죽였다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "3a7cc5fa-f020-435f-a054-e143262344f1"
msgid "[Finish the hunter] \"I'll reunite you with your family. Farewell!\""
msgstr "[사냥꾼을 끝장냅니다] \"다시 가족들과 상봉하게 해주지. 잘가시게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "296ac7fd-c1a6-4560-b9b9-c2ea9557c3ca"
msgid "\"You needn't worry about them any longer.\""
msgstr "\"더이상 그들에 대해서 걱정할 필요가 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "018a3d23-957f-4d6f-9ac4-beda346b6514"
msgid "\"Tell me about this gang.\""
msgstr "\"그 자들에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "5602d700-94c2-4023-bef7-c29346b06a0b"
msgid "\"That's enough for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그걸로 충분합니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0047_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "be27b07b-f8c9-4c6e-a629-880c87df7df5"
msgid "Gave quarter to hunter Ivar."
msgstr "사냥꾼 이바르에게 4분의 1을 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "6e09b751-896e-40e5-9b15-f5daa04c7554"
msgid "\"Go. Try to forgive yourself, if you can.\""
msgstr "\"떠나라. 가능하다면 자신을 용서하도록 해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0048_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b771a318-c105-42a8-b5b9-0da93d276594"
msgid "Exiled Ivar the hunter."
msgstr "사냥꾼 이바르를 추방했다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "ce425dd9-087d-46e9-bd73-ac8459724213"
msgid "\"Farewell. And take care to never cross my path again.\""
msgstr "\"잘가시길. 그리고 다시는 내 앞에 나타나지 말도록 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "1346d353-3522-4679-baa3-12b33a18ca25"
msgid ""
"{n}The werewolf's powerful body shrinks and contorts. The beastly features "
"transform into the face of Ivar, the hunter. There are deep wounds all over "
"his body.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}늑대 인간의 강력한 몸이 수축하고 뒤틀립니다. 짐승의 모습은 사냥꾼인 이바르의 모습으로 변합니다. 그의 몸 전체에 깊은 상처가 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "0cbbf676-9779-4507-a95f-7ee52ca98a3c"
msgid "\"So this is how it finally ends...\""
msgstr "\"결국 이렇게 끝이 나는 건가....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "d4db1b9a-2178-4dfd-a586-b20576ff2670"
msgid ""
"\"Let it be my last fairy tale, then. Once upon a time, there lived a stupid "
"young hunter named Ivar. He loved his family — his wife, his son, his little "
"daughter — very much. He also loved making up fairy tales for his children. "
"But one night, he came up with a foolish story, one about a silver dragon "
"that can only be spotted if you climb to the top of a high cliff as the new "
"moon rises. That very night, the children snuck out of the house and... "
"their bodies were found at the base of the cliff the next morning...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 이 동화가 나의 마지막 이야기가 되겠군. 옛날옛적에 이바르라는 어리석은 젊은 사냥꾼이 살았어. 그는 그의 가족, 아내, 아들, "
"딸을 아주 사랑했어. 그리고 아이들을 위해 동화를 지어주는 것도 아주 좋아했지. 그러던 어느 날 밤 그는 바보같은 이야기를 하나 생각해 "
"냈는데, 보름달이 떴을 때 높은 절벽에 기어올라가야만 볼 수 있는 실버드래곤에 관한 이야기였어. 바로 그날 밤 아이들은 몰래 빠져 "
"나왔어. 그리고... 시체가 다음날 아침 절벽 바닥에서 발견되었지... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "ef8b5eed-47d1-4127-92c0-7be1dc43dfa9"
msgid ""
"\"His poor wife's heart couldn't bear the loss. Lissa... she was gone soon "
"after. So Ivar cursed himself. Cursed his own blabbering tongue and reckless "
"mind. Standing near the graves of his family, he could only mutter to "
"himself over and over, \"I'm a monster... I'm a monster!\" Then, he felt the "
"self-inflicted curse begin to melt him from the inside — burning him, "
"turning him into a beast. He became a werewolf, swore to protect the village "
"to honor the memory of Lissa and his children. He wanted to serve people, to "
"bring them good instead of evil, at least once.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그의 불쌍한 아내의 마음은 상실감을 감당할 수 없었다. 리사... 그녀는 곧 세상을 떠났다. 그래서 이바르는 자신을 저주했다. 자신의 "
"뻔뻔한 혀와 무모한 마음을 저주했다. 가족의 무덤 근처에 서서 그는 몇번이고 중얼거릴 뿐이었어. \"나는 괴물이다... 나는 괴물이야!\""
" 그러고 나서 그는 마음 속에서 저주가 자신을 갉아먹는다는 것을 느꼈어. 그를 태우고 그를 짐승으로 바꾸었어. 그는 늑대 인간이 되어 "
"리사와 그의 아이들의 기억을 기리기 위해 마을을 보호하겠다고 맹세했어. 그는 사람들을 섬기고 싶었고 사람들에게 악 대신 선을 가져다주고 "
"싶었어..적어도 단 한번만이라도..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "2375cff2-894a-4696-8d28-d481bc17aaab"
msgid ""
"\"Sorry, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}, but no. I'm not interested in "
"working for anyone else. Besides, the village would never accept me if they "
"learned who I really am. So, please, just finish me off or let me go — the "
"choice is yours.\""
msgstr ""
"\"미안하지만 안 돼. 나는 남을 위해 일하지 않아. 게다가 마을 사람들이 내 정체를 안다면 나를 절대로 받아들일 수 없을 거야. 그러니 "
"제발 나를 끝내거나 보내줘. 선택은 너에게 달렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "1d4ac539-68d8-4249-b1b1-891ec4a22122"
msgid ""
"{n}Ivar's brow furrows.{/n} \"I stopped looking to the future long ago. "
"But... but I don't think I belong here anymore. Especially if people "
"discovered the truth. Were you to spare my life, I'd... leave. Leave, and "
"try to find a new reason to live.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이바르의 미간이 좁아집니다.{/n} \"나는 오래 전에 미래를 포기했어. 하지만... 나는 더 이상 여기에 속하지 않는다고 생각해. "
"특히 사람들이 진실을 발견한다면 말이야. 만일 나를 살려준다면... 나는 떠나겠어. 그리고 살아야 할 새로운 이유를 찾아보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "68197d9b-ebb2-4b19-aa4f-c33bb482c4a3"
msgid ""
"\"There's always someone trying to take from the villagers, be it their "
"property or their lives. Many's the villain who's become food for worms in "
"the nearby woods. The only danger I haven't gained much ground against is a "
"gang holed up in a nearby cave. I started hunting them, but it seems I've "
"run out of time to finish the job.\" {n}Ivar's tone is bitter as he looks "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"재산이던 목숨이던 항상 마을 사람의 것을 앗아가려는 사람은 늘 있는 법이지. 많은 악당들이 마을 주변 숲에서 타츨웜의 먹이가 되었지. "
"내가 아직 잡지 않은 유일한 악당은 근처의 동굴에 있어. 나는 그들을 사냥하기 시작했지만 그 일을 마칠 시간까지는 없을 듯 하군. \" "
"{n}이바르는 눈길을 돌리며 씁쓸한 목소리로 말했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "c6aada25-e98e-4f27-8d48-092b02f6ef0a"
msgid "\"Thank you, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. That lightens my burden.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 걱정이 줄어든 느낌이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "cde957ed-d4c8-4269-92a8-8e0c04f033bc"
msgid ""
"\"Planning a visit?\" {n}Ivar smirks.{/n} \"The gang's not big, but they are "
"well trained. They're very familiar with the woods around here — they've "
"made a den in one of the caves to the west, near the lake. It isn't far.\""
msgstr ""
"\"방문할 계획인가?\" {n}이바르가 능글맞게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그들은 규모가 크지는 않지만 훈련을 잘 받았다. 그들은 주변의 숲에 "
"대해 매우 잘 알고 있어. 그들은 서쪽의 호수 근처 동굴 중 하나에 아지트를 세웠어. 여기서 멀지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "6f101385-53cc-4ae4-915a-f331a7941746"
msgid "\"As you say.\""
msgstr "\"좋으실 대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "f881e190-2780-4270-9883-243184dc8ad9"
msgid ""
"{n}Ivar stands, holding the wound on his side.{/n} \"I was... not expecting "
"mercy, but I'm certainly grateful for it.\""
msgstr "{n}이바르는 옆구리의 부상을 부여잡고 서있습니다.{/n} \"나는... 자비를 기대하지 않았지만 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "01be653b-92b4-4c54-8235-2b2bddbdb8c1"
msgid ""
"\"Head forward, then take to the right. And if you're looking for work, my "
"advice would be to find a traveling circus — I'm sure you'd fit right in.\""
msgstr "\"앞으로 가서 오른쪽으로 꺾어. 일을 찾고 있다면 유랑 극단이 좋을 거야. 너는 딱 맞을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "94e42559-b553-482e-a4d0-97f322d829a5"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia is shaking slightly after all that's happened.{/n} \"Thank you "
"for giving him a chance. I... I hear there's a cure for lycanthropy. Good "
"luck to you, Ivar!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 약간 떨고 있습니다.{/n} \"그에게 기회를 주어 고마워. 나는... 늑대 인간에 대한 치유법이 있다고 들었어. 행운을 "
"빌어 이바르!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "ac932d55-48c5-49a4-9d7b-eb4dd4a97705"
msgid ""
"{n}Ivar bows slightly, then winces in pain.{/n} \"A word in parting, if I "
"may, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. Consider it my werewolf instincts "
"talking. I can tell you'll be the subject of stories and legends yourself, "
"soon, and I'm sure they'll be told far and wide across the land. Now, "
"whether they'll be tales of terror or of hope — well, that will be up to you."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이바르가 고개를 숙이며 인사하자 곧 통증에 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이별 전에 한마디 하지. 내 안의 늑대인간이 말을 하고 싶어해. "
"너는 곧 민담과 전설의 주인공이 되어 그 이야기들은 널리 전해질 거야. 그 이야기가 공포가 될지 희망이 될지는 너에게 달렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9794f976-ceb9-4cc9-935a-742a32a54cb9"
msgid ""
"\"I'll make sure of that!\" {n}Linzi smiles.{/n} \"And your story... it "
"won't be forgotten! I promise!\""
msgstr "\"확실히 기억해 두겠어!\" {n}린지는 웃습니다.{/n} \"그리고 너의 이야기... 잊지 않을 거야! 약속할께!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "08e182fc-149a-40f4-8d92-ea077acbd061"
msgid ""
"\"Shut your trap, animal!\" {n}Regongar spits at the werewolf, then looks at "
"you, grinning in triumph.{/n} \"His mane'll make a good trophy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"입 닥쳐! 이 동물놈아!\" {n}레곤가르는 늑대 인간에게 침을 뱉고는 당신을 보고 승리의 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"그의 갈기는 "
"좋은 전리품이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a4290a50-47e1-48fc-8775-37c6768cc1d4"
msgid ""
"\"And if you called yourself a pig, you'd have grown a snout! That's exactly "
"why it's so important to always think of yourself in only the best light.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약 자신을 돼지로 자칭했다면 코가 자랐을텐데 말이지! 그래서 항상 자기 자신을 긍정적으로 생각하는 것이 이렇게 중요한 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "75a33a6b-7d2f-4074-b951-52da9c93d0cc"
msgid ""
"\"Anger and pain invited a beast's soul into a human heart? Huh... When I "
"was a kid, the old crones talked about something like this. I thought it was "
"just a fairy tale, though.\""
msgstr ""
"\"노여움과 고통이 짐승의 영혼을 인간의 마음 속에 불어넣었는가? 하... 어렸을 때 이런 이야기를 듣고는 했어. 그저 동화일 뿐이라고 "
"생각했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3dd4aeb5-2231-47ea-8302-ebaf349477dd"
msgid "\"Oh, you would definitely know, being the local clown and all.\""
msgstr "\"광대가 된다는 게 어떤 건지 너는 알 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2f86a6c0-185f-4967-bbc6-125fa8941ba2"
msgid ""
"\"It's about time! Not like we've got any business chatting with wolves, "
"here!\""
msgstr "\"이제 때가 되었어! 늑대와 대화할 시간은 없는 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "22017564-6f95-4821-a230-4c99e45c8b67"
msgid "\"Well... This is what I deserve.\""
msgstr "\"음... 이게 내가 받아 마땅한 것이겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a177a256-1d89-480d-80ad-298ab280e5fe"
msgid ""
"\"You defeated him — that is enough. Stay your hand. Do not let anger "
"control you.\" {n}Tristian looks at the werewolf, sadness in his eyes.{/n} "
"\"Please. At least speak with him before passing your sentence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 그를 물리쳤어요. 그만하면 충분합니다. 그에게서 떨어지십시오. 분노에 지배 당하면 안됩니다.\" {n}트리스티안은 슬픈 "
"눈빛으로 늑대 인간을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"부탁합니다. 적어도 처형하기 전에 그와 얘기해 보세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "1839e0eb-c37f-458e-a709-61ec43bd108c"
msgid "\"How cruel!\""
msgstr "\"정말 잔인하시군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b29f2790-8c57-4cc6-bf9f-f4b864ecbafb"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"I hope you can come to terms with your "
"loss. May {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}'s light guide you.\" {n}Tristian turns to "
"you.{/n} \"Thank you for showing mercy.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"가족을 잃은 상실감을 이제 받아들이길 바라겠습니다. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}가 "
"빛으로 안내하길. \" {n}트리스티안이 당신을 향해 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"자비를 베풀어줘서 감사합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "5c369929-7a11-44bd-b424-d76b5287abad"
msgid ""
"\"Unlike your tongue, that speaks nothing but poisonous rot. How can you "
"mock someone who is defeated and helpless?\""
msgstr "\"너 답지 않게 독설을 뱉어내는군. 패배한 자를 어떻게 비웃을 수가 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "cf22dfbf-5c62-4e50-8963-5c4fb74ccd5f"
msgid ""
"\"This story breaks my heart. How can one kill with kind stories, or make "
"oneself into a monster out of sheer gloom and grief?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 이야기는 정말 가슴이 아파. 어떻게 동화 이야기가 사람을 죽게 만들고, 어떻게 순전히 암울함과 슬픔만으로 늑대 인간이 만들어 "
"졌을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "4b9888d6-62b6-4b51-9430-35da29a7f2c0"
msgid ""
"\"Almost a rebel, a high-minded rhymer, who doomed himself to the life of a "
"shapeshifter. I'd gladly to pay to publish a book featuring his story. – Let "
"the other rebel dreamers see where this road leads!\""
msgstr ""
"\"늑대인간의 삶으로 스스로를 파멸로 이끈, 고매한 이야기꾼이자 반란자라.. 이런 이야기라면 출판해서 책으로 내고 싶군. 다른 반란을 "
"꿈꾸는 몽상가들이 볼 수있게말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/SilverstepWerewolf/WerewolfDefeated/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d712cbbd-cdcb-4adf-aeea-7cd4a6ee1bb9"
msgid ""
"\"And the foolish werewolf joined his family in death, and never again "
"troubled the local people. At least it's a story with a happy ending!\""
msgstr ""
"\"멍청한 늑대 인간이 가족의 죽음에 같이 동행했고 다시는 주민들이 고통받는 일은 없었다라... 적어도 해피엔딩이 있는 이야기로군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TaldanMine/Barks/Sign_String
msgctxt "2ba0112f-cfab-47a7-90bc-4c63989ed20c"
msgid ""
"The words on the ancient stone are barely visible: \"Property of the house "
"Trestrin.\""
msgstr "고대 돌의 단어들이 간신히 보입니다. \"트래스트린의 가문의 재산.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "4569372d-29c9-4ee0-9bed-81d1419a3a6e"
msgid "\"You can return to Trobold and live there.\""
msgstr "\"트로볼트로 돌아가서 거기에서 살아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "7b72a08b-5f43-42b6-9fd2-f7f1b1e6fb4a"
msgid "\"Where will you go?\""
msgstr "\"어디로 갈 건가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9bdb9f4e-bf25-4c84-9f6a-c7e3e2fbee48"
msgid "Spared the escaping trolls."
msgstr "도망친 트롤을 살려줬습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "1d9b7c07-1c1a-4f0c-a5d9-f1928ef625ca"
msgid ""
"\"So be it, you can leave. But we meet again, I won't grant you mercy a "
"second time.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 떠나라. 하지만 우리는 다시 만날 거야. 그 때는 자비를 베풀지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "28f1e4e5-83e7-46c1-b46a-9c75728ce31d"
msgid "Killed the escaping trolls to protect the people."
msgstr "사람들을 보호하기 위해 탈출하는 트롤들을 죽였다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "27605438-4622-4b49-b877-3ab7227b0cbb"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Sparing Hargulka was my mistake. Any mercy to your kind means the "
"death of more of my people.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"하굴카를 살려준 것은 내 실수였다. 너희를 향한 자비는 내 국민의 더 많은 죽음을 의미하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3610fc1f-2106-45fa-bf29-3f6730a447cb"
msgid "Spared the escaping trolls to prevent them from joining Pitax forces."
msgstr "피탁스에 합류하는 것을 막기 위해 도망친 트롤을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "c864ce7b-0c67-4717-aa1d-3f5f7f014882"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"The King of Pitax will pit you against his neighbors — probably, "
"against me as well. I cannot allow you to go there.\""
msgstr ""
"[공격] \"피탁스의 왕은 너희를 이웃 나라의 적으로 세울 거야. 그리고 나의 적이 되기도 하겠지. 네가 거기에 가는 것을 허용할 수 "
"없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b7ffadcc-cd91-4ef3-8b1d-c39894a840aa"
msgid "Spared the escaping trolls with cruelty."
msgstr "도망친 트롤을 잔인하게 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "13be3bcd-2079-4325-b067-7cfd80af362a"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I spared Hargulka because I was feeling merciful. Now my mood's "
"more… bloodthirsty.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 기분이 썩 나쁘지 않아 하굴카를 살려주었어. 지금은... 피에 굶주려 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "a35f5265-8e10-43bf-83e1-f55b4715bf12"
msgid "\"Ha ha! Not bad!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 나쁘지 않은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "72c9a02a-18f6-4734-a6c1-ded9edb993d9"
msgid ""
"\"That's cruel, Regongar. They ask for mercy, and you decide to finish them "
"with another horrific pun?\""
msgstr "\"나쁘지 않다고? 그들은 자비를 바라는데 끔찍한 말장난으로 그들을 놀리는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "01f0ee24-deb8-41a8-86ec-9b0819567c91"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무것도 말하지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : TrollStandart
msgctxt "572549ed-f196-4234-b738-59d44a2017b8"
msgid ""
"\"Killed Kargadd, killed his children! Enemy of all trolls! Charge borba, "
"tear borba apart!\""
msgstr "\"카르가드를 죽이고 그의 아이들을 죽였다! 모든 트롤의 적이다! 보바에게 돌격해서 찢어버려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : TrollStandart
msgctxt "8c977e05-f56a-4e50-855c-ac1001962809"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! Look there, everyone! I know that borba! That's mighty and strong "
"one! Came to {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}, killed many-many trolls, we had to run!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐! 저기 봐! 저 보바를 알아! 강하고 힘 센 녀석이야! {g|Trobold} 트로볼트{/g}로 와서 수 많은 트롤들을 죽여서 "
"우리는 도망쳤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : TrollStandart
msgctxt "c770c39c-9467-4d9a-9373-27073e7ce855"
msgid ""
"\"This borba killed King Hargulka — easily, like smashing a hare! Strong "
"borba! Scary like fire! Run for your life!\""
msgstr "\"이 보바는 하굴카 왕을 죽였어. 마치 토끼를 잡는 것처럼! 강한 보바다! 무섭다. 살고 싶으면 도망쳐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : TrollStandart
msgctxt "447d021e-3eae-41cc-a3b2-5b2634a5773d"
msgid ""
"\"We know — borba spared King Hargulka. Spare us too! These borba lands, no "
"life for us here. We leave, not return!\""
msgstr "\"보바가 하굴카 왕을 살려주었다. 우리도 용서해줘! 보바들이 왔으니 여기에서 못 산다. 우리는 떠나서 돌아오지 않을 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : TrollStandart
msgctxt "c263366d-5dd8-46f4-ae75-05cac4dddfc4"
msgid "\"We thank you, borba! You'll see us no more again!\""
msgstr "\"보바! 고마워! 다시는 우리를 보지 못할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : TrollStandart
msgctxt "e37efd54-ce37-4baf-9a95-7e6976329644"
msgid "\"RrrrrRRRR! Smash borba! Rip borba to pieces!\""
msgstr "\"아르르르! 보바 쳐부순다! 보바 산산 조각낸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : TrollStandart
msgctxt "d6ad6053-9399-4068-89ba-36cb0b7fdcd5"
msgid ""
"\"No, borba. Trolls not like you, not like kobolds. Life here… life in "
"kingdom... not our way. Tartuk smart, but idea of {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}… "
"not.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 트롤은 코볼트나 너희와 다르다. 여기에서 사는 것... 왕국의 삶... 우리의 방식이 아니다. 타툭은 똑똑했지만 "
"{g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g}는... 아니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : TrollStandart
msgctxt "4cb3029b-1b83-49de-b384-61c0002f02f4"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. We heard great borba king welcome trolls there, give "
"shelter, sheep and cattle to eat. We go there, never return!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}. 우리는 위대한 보바 왕이 거기에서 트롤을 환영하고 쉼터와 양과 소를 준다고 들었다. 우리는 거기에 "
"가서 돌아오지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0ac9a1d1-049e-46b6-8a22-bd8d26bf7d45"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun shakes his head.{/n} \"When there's life for them, there's no life "
"for humans.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 머리를 절래절래 흔듭니다.{/n} \"트롤이 있는 곳은 인간이 살 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ea86855d-957c-4e7a-85a3-31c13a53c9bc"
msgid "\"Right! Today's a great day to burn someone's hide off!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 오늘은 누군가를 태워버리기 좋은 날이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "181451ce-28ab-444f-a8ad-b46867ab12c4"
msgid ""
"\"Mercy is a virtue to the weak, but a vice to the strong. You'd do well to "
"remember that.\""
msgstr "\"자비는 약자에게 미덕이지만 강자에게는 악이야. 잊지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2acfd294-1e45-465b-be9e-b05bbb2cf913"
msgid ""
"\"You're right, of course. They're monsters... but let them go. It's wrong "
"to kill someone who seeks mercy.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아. 그들은 괴물이지만... 그들을 놓아줘. 자비를 구하는 자들을 죽이는 것은 잘못된 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "18082aa1-aa6a-4f95-ba47-f1a89101d9bd"
msgid ""
"\"What a pathetic bunch. You know what they say — don't ask... for whom the "
"bell trolls! Ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"한심한 녀석들. 그들이 뭐라고 하는지 알아? 말을 말자... 멍청한 트롤들을 위해서 말이야! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "78febfff-8454-4e7f-a30a-95e4589057a4"
msgid "{n}A smug smirk spreads on the half-orc's face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}거친 웃음 소리가 하프오크의 얼굴에서 퍼집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "892dc725-e0e5-4670-9517-babbdccbea3a"
msgid ""
"\"Heh heh! Well, not like you keep me in your gang to be merciful, right?\""
msgstr "\"헤헤! 자비로워서 나를 거두어 준 게 아니군. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/TrollRefugees/TrollDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "92bbe758-745d-400c-ad9b-52b0697ba6e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Realizing no one is laughing at his joke, the half-orc spits on the "
"ground, vexed.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그의 농담에 웃는사람이 아무도 없다는것을 깨달았습니다. 하프오크는 바닥에 짜증을 내며 땅에 침을 뱉었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/WolfLairHE2/Items/Victims_note_Name_String
msgctxt "cc13a806-7162-40e1-8ecf-cba931680fc3"
msgid "Wolf Victim's Book"
msgstr "늑대 피해자의 책"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c22/WolfLairHE2/Items/Victims_note_String
msgctxt "e40fd6b1-fe84-4e3e-bcf5-895176d72be3"
msgid ""
"\"There are many goblin tribes in Avistan. These militant creatures do not "
"construct cities, instead they build their settlements in forests, ancient "
"ruins or in caves. Goblins do not farm: they collect waste, rob and loot, in "
"other words — parasitize on more developed civilizations who avoid any "
"diplomatic relations with these dangerous pests.\n"
"Goblins experience pathological fear of horses and dogs. Despite this, they "
"do not disdain the company of wolves, which they use as mounts. In battle, "
"goblin riders are terrifying: they are a striking force that breaks into the "
"enemy's formation and carries horror and death to all who happen to be "
"caught on the way.\n"
"Goblins are often accompanied by worgs — these creatures are larger than "
"ordinary wolves and have even more ferocious temper. Although worgs allow "
"goblins to ride on their backs, it's highly questionable who is the master "
"and who is the pet among those two.\n"
"Another beast, which should be known to the curious explorer of the wolves "
"and goblin tribes is a barghest. Scientists consider these monstrous "
"creatures to be related to goblins, but in appearance they are very similar "
"to wolves. Barghests are very dangerous: they are able to shape-shift, to "
"instill a feeling of boundless despair in their victims, and tear them apart "
"while they are in helpless state. For the goblins, barghests are sacred "
"creatures: they believe these monsters once initiated the goblin race.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아비스탄에는 많은 고블린 종족이 있다. 싸움을 좋아하는 이 생물은 도시를 건설하지 않고 대신 숲, 고대 유적 또는 동굴에 정착지를 "
"건설한다. 고블린은 농장을 짓지 않는다. 그들은 쓰레기를 모으고 강도와 약탈을 한다. 이들과 맞서는 것을 꺼리는 문명화된 도시에 기생하는 "
"것이다.\n"
"고블린은 말과 개에 병적인 두려움이 있다. 그럼에도 불구하고 그들은 탈것으로 사용하는 늑대를 경멸하지 않는다. 전투에서 고블린 라이더는 "
"무서운 존재다.그들은 적의 대형으로 침투하여 앞에 있는 모든 사람들에게 공포와 죽음을 전한다.\n"
"고블린에는 흔히 워그가 동반한다. 이 생물은 일반 늑대보다 크며 더 까다로운 성격을 가지고 있다. 워그는 고블린이 등에 탈 수 있게 "
"허락하지만 그 둘 사이에 누가 주인이고 누가 애완 동물인지는 알 수 없다.\n"
"늑대와 고블린 부족을 궁금해하는 탐험가에게 알려진 다른 짐승은 바게스트이다. 과학자들은 이 괴물은 고블린과 관련 있고 외관상 늑대와 매우 "
"유사하다고 생각한다. 바게스트는 매우 위험하다. 그들은 모양을 바꿀 수 있고 희생자들에게 무한한 절망감을 심어주고 무기력한 자들을 찢을 "
"수 있다. 고블린에게 바게스트는 신성한 생물이다. 그들은 이 괴물이 고블린 종족의 기원과 관련이 있다고 믿고있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "9d2b44fa-6b07-4c9c-9b4b-ed02bd8f5ee9"
msgid "\"I'm the local baron{mf||ess}. My lands aren't far from here.\""
msgstr "\"나는 남작이요. 내 남작령은 이곳에서 멀지 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "3efb9226-1bf0-43e0-aaa4-b2621fe0353b"
msgid ""
"\"Mind your tongue! I'm the local baron{mf||ess}. My lands aren't far from "
"here.\""
msgstr "\"말조심하는 게 좋을 거요! 나는 남작이오. 내 남작령은 이곳에서 멀지 않은 곳에 있소!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0057_Text_String
msgctxt "0633df1b-1a2b-4137-811c-25c3780d80fd"
msgid "\"One of your people seems to be sick. Can I help?\""
msgstr "\"당신의 백성 중 한명이 아파 보이는군. 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "843bdd90-0447-4f56-a46c-0717b1e83008"
msgid "[Leave] \"We're just travelers. We'll be on our way.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"우린 여행 중이에요. 곧 떠날 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0062_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "328964d1-5c00-4538-97fc-43259627bc71"
msgid "Offered to heal the sick barbarian for free."
msgstr "병든 바바리안을 무료로 치료합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0062_Text_String
msgctxt "41cd6e2f-872e-4a50-8a6e-8c16164eb1df"
msgid "[Heal the barbarian] \"No charge.\""
msgstr "[바바리안을 치료한다] \"돈은 필요없어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0063_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "da841fa2-8b08-47cd-a12e-8c2def2ee76d"
msgid "Healed the sick barbarian for gold."
msgstr "금을 받고 병든 바바리안을 치료했다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0063_Text_String
msgctxt "5aa5f463-6e61-409a-8d5c-59986f0aa0bd"
msgid "[Heal the barbarian] \"Pay up.\""
msgstr "[바바리안을 치료한다] \"돈 내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "6099f599-b2bf-4d6d-9ffc-aad7da25ee0e"
msgid "\"Actually, I don't think I can help you.\""
msgstr "\"사실 당신을 도울 수 없을 거라고 생각해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "ed0b995b-8c54-43f6-875c-bc8a777fa788"
msgid "\"From Numeria? You're pretty far from home.\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에서? 멀리서 왔군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0073_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "88c8ce87-7d9f-47ec-9765-c8f392622245"
msgid "Killed the barbarians without good reason."
msgstr "정당한 이유없이 바바리안을 죽였다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0073_Text_String
msgctxt "ce13186a-35c8-4a0c-b022-6a0d3fba0053"
msgid "[Attack] \"You and your kind have no business here!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너같은 놈들이 여기 있을 이유는 없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "7e99ac94-2a89-4158-844e-6c30c1af0b53"
msgid ""
"[Share food with the barbarians] \"We're not here to fight. Let's share some "
"bread and have a chat.\""
msgstr "[바바리안에게 음식을 나눠준다] \"우리는 싸우기위해 여기에 온 것이 아닙니다. 같이 식사 하면서 이야기 하시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0080_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2b84d527-6490-4b4a-ab8f-3d1e72de9589"
msgid "Healed the sick barbarian for money."
msgstr "돈을 받기 위해 바바리안을 치료했다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0084_Text
msgctxt "fa5fddb0-fe12-47b2-8326-50cdbdeffd8b"
msgid "\"What are you searching for?\""
msgstr "\"뭘 찾고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "0c7c643f-9389-4785-9409-cd7f49a3b715"
msgid "\"Are you the only group of Numerians here?\""
msgstr "\"너희들이 이곳에서 유일한 누메리아 사람들이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "e1a758d2-51f2-45d7-960e-d60a8d85c072"
msgid "\"Have you found anything interesting in the area?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 흥미로운거라도 발견했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "f7fc4028-1e8a-4727-ab92-6fb03cd66293"
msgid "\"Tell me about Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에 대해서 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "9f236cda-c6e9-4428-9f54-26280dc00467"
msgid "\"Tell me about your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 부족에 대해서 말해줘\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0090_Text
msgctxt "9bf2e308-37f0-4da8-b7e5-5062d9d7760f"
msgid "[Leave] \"Safe travels!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안전한 여행 되길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0094_Text
msgctxt "6dcee6e5-7ef0-4221-b48a-97a4e7f69438"
msgid "\"Who's Dugath?\""
msgstr "\"두가스가 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0099_Text
msgctxt "d8df65c6-b863-408a-83ed-a98767eade74"
msgid "\"You don't like technology?\""
msgstr "\"문명의 기술을 안 좋아하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "c5c3c3f0-579a-49da-80c4-f6e31fb97a99"
msgid "\"Do you know anything about the situation at Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 상황에 대해 아는게 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0102_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "f55577cb-60ed-4341-8037-293986f27ed1"
msgid "Killed the barbarians for insulting you."
msgstr "당신을 모욕한 바바리안을 죽였다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Answer_0102_Text_String
msgctxt "cfc2f36d-6b7c-4969-8601-8b520e8256c2"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You shouldn't have been so rude with me. Now you'll pay for your "
"insolence!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나한테 그렇게 무례하게 굴지 말았어야지. 이제 너의 무례함에 대한 대가를 치르게 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "ba16badb-6bf7-4e3d-9e8a-66873bc22e64"
msgid ""
"{n}A small but well-armed group moves across the flatlands. Tattoos, leather "
"and fur clothing, bone amulets at their belts — these are barbarians. "
"Kellids, to be precise, probably from neighboring Numeria, or maybe lands "
"even further north. They stop when they see you, hands on their weapons and "
"frowns on their faces.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}규모가 작지만 잘 무장한 집단이 평지를 가로질러 이동합니다. 문신을 하고 가죽과 모피로 옷을 입고 허리 춤에는 뼈 장신구를 단 "
"이들은 야만인입니다. 정확시 말하자면 누메리아나 더 먼 북쪽에서 온 켈리시드입니다. 그들은 당신을 보자 멈추고 경계하며 무기에 손을 "
"댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "5d62aa58-472d-4ee7-8348-9bc76ae704e3"
msgid ""
"\"What do you want? If you're looking for trouble, you might just have found "
"it.\""
msgstr "\"원하는 게 뭐지? 싸우러 온 거라면 얼마든지 환영이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "c4277098-b385-4fbc-8331-24c4d2b1e93a"
msgid ""
"\"Hey!\" {n}One of the barbarians shouts toward Amiri.{/n} \"You're from the "
"north, right? Which tribe?\""
msgstr "\"이봐!\"{n}바바리안 중 하나가 아미리에게 소리쳤다.{/n} \"북쪽 출신이네, 맞지? 어느 부족이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "074c0e90-a775-491a-905c-bd33b3ed64d2"
msgid "\"I'm by myself.\""
msgstr "\"부족 따윈 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "7e6af76a-4a59-4be4-85ad-547ea323cbb8"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, isn't that the gal the Six Bears kicked out? Cause they were scared "
"that if a woman touched a sword, their balls'd fall off?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 여섯 곰 부족에서 쫓겨난 여자 아니야? 걔네들은 여자가 칼에 손을 대면 지들 불알 떨어질까봐 벌벌떠는 놈들이잖아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "dac15a85-49cb-4634-8642-e17d98d49cf0"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, ha... Just let bygones be bygones. I walk with {mf|him|her} now.\" {n}"
"Amiri points at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하하, 됐어. 지난 일은 그냥 잊자고. 이제 난 {mf|그|그녀}랑 같이 다녀.\" {n}아미리가 당신을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "daaa3016-f665-44ff-82b9-d0c93dd40f35"
msgid "\"Who're you, then? What do you want?\""
msgstr "\"대체 정체가 뭐예요? 우리한테 뭘 원하는 거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "ca371b5f-dc30-4817-aa46-d0965715efd7"
msgid "\"Best stay out of the way, little one, or we might step on you!\""
msgstr "\"비키는 게 좋을 걸. 애송이. 아니면 너를 밟고 지나가주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "bcf8cae3-a70f-4151-a685-6312cf11c71e"
msgid ""
"\"Hey there, {mf|handsome|beauty}! What're you doing so far from the city? "
"If you're not careful, you might get some calluses on those tender elven "
"fingers!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 촌놈 같지는 않아 보이네! 이런 시골에서 뭐하고 있지? 조심하지 않으면 엘프에게 혼날 줄 알라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "d38e0b0b-a499-4add-a25d-b81b3fc0e412"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian examines you closely.{/n} \"So, you lead this group, then?\""
msgstr "{n}바바리안은 당신을 자세히 봅니다.{/n} \"그래서 네가 이 그룹을 이끌고 있다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "d1ccbde8-eb37-4ac6-888b-300001f0059c"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarians watch you sternly, their hands still on their weapons.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}바바리안들은 당신을 노려보며 그들의 손은 여전히 무기 위에 올려져있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "8213db03-35ec-41bd-9754-aceca0af2212"
msgid ""
"\"Really? You don't seem much like one.\" {n}The barbarian stares at you "
"incredulously.{/n} \"Well, all right... Your Baronship, then, or whatever it "
"is they call you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말? 예상 밖인데.\" {n}야만인은 놀란 듯 당신을 계속 봅니다.{/n} \"그래. 알았어... 족장. 아니 남작인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "31b9fd22-39a3-49cc-811a-9d657df2e75d"
msgid ""
"\"You're the baron{mf||ess}? You? Bah ha ha! That's funny! And I'm Kevoth-"
"Kul, the Black Sovereign of {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"남작이라고? 네가? 푸하하! 재밌군! 나는 누메리아의 통치자 Kevoth-Kul이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "d00d9ac6-995d-4147-860e-627e8f4a69a9"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, really?\" {n}The Kellid examines you closely.{/n} \"Well, all "
"right... Your Baronship, then, or whatever it is they call you.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 정말?\" {n}켈리드는 당신을 자세히 봅니다.{/n} \"그래. 알았어... 족장. 아니 남작인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalFighterMeleeHurt
msgctxt "2b4efd4e-cda7-406c-ae58-4f10fb760793"
msgid ""
"\"We don't need your help-\" {n}the Kellid starts, his voice grim, but he's "
"interrupted when one of the barbarian women begins coughing "
"uncontrollably.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 너의 도움이 필요없어.\" {n}켈리드가 무시무시한 목소리로 말하기 시작했지만 이내 주변의 여성이 기침을 하기 시작해서 "
"멈추었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalFighterMeleeHurt
msgctxt "f887cd61-1345-4b0e-8b12-7ad089f3aa82"
msgid ""
"\"If you don't need it, just shut up so I can-\" {n}The barbarian woman "
"breaks into another short coughing fit, then spits on the ground — the "
"phlegm is blue.{/n} \"I'm not gonna die for your pride. Yes, I'm sick. "
"Caught bluespit somewhere in the barrens. Don't worry, I don't think it's "
"catching. If you heal me, I can pay in gold.\""
msgstr ""
"\"필요하지 않다면 그냥 닥...\" {n}바바리안 여인은 또 다시 짧은 기침을 하고는 땅에 침을 뱉습니다. 가래는 푸른 색입니다.{/n}"
" \"나는 네 자존심 때문에 죽지 않을 거야. 그래. 나는 병에 걸렸어. 황야 어딘가에서 병에 걸렸지. 걱정 마. 옮지는 않으니. 네가 "
"치료해주면 지불해주겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalFighterMeleeHurt
msgctxt "101406a1-51f4-4e25-a75f-3d3281991475"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian woman spits more blue phlegm to the ground, "
"disappointed.{/n} \"Why even open your mouth about it, then?\""
msgstr "{n}야만인 여성은 푸른 점액을 땅에 뱉고는 힘 없이 말합니다.{/n} \"왜 입을 열고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0066_Text_String
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalFighterMeleeHurt
msgctxt "4ac8f2c8-4d73-4f29-9a5b-4db1f194c70b"
msgid "{n}The barbarian woman gives you several coins.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}야만인 여자가 동전을 몇닢을 줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0067_Text_String
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalFighterMeleeHurt
msgctxt "02d69349-0ffd-4f05-8e2a-ff6daa46f670"
msgid ""
"\"No, none of that! We're not beggars, and we're not out for charity!\" {n}"
"The barbarian woman forces several coins into your hand.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아니! 우리는 거지가 아니야. 구걸을 하는 게 아니라고!\" {n}야만인 여성은 동전 몇 개를 당신 손에 쥐어줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0068_Text_String
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalFighterMeleeHurt
msgctxt "f07647da-80fe-4061-921f-aac8def17578"
msgid ""
"{n}After you heal the woman's disease, she breathes in deeply, relishing the "
"sensation.{/n} \"Wow! Thank you! It was a nasty thing, let me tell you — "
"won't let you take breath in or let gases out!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자의 병을 고친 후에 그녀는 깊은 숨을 쉬며 안정을 찾습니다.{/n} \"고마워! 정말 귀찮은 병이었어. 숨을 쉬기도 힘들었다고!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "bcb0e7c6-c924-4e08-87d9-4b9534b7621e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Nober. We're from {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, part of the {g|Tiger Lords}"
"Tiger Lords{/g} tribe. We're just minding our own business here, not looking "
"to pick a fight. We don't want any trouble, and we're not after anyone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 노버야. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 온 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족이지. 우리는 여기에 "
"싸우러 온 게 아니야. 우리는 불화를 일으키고 싶지는 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "23983d10-876a-4ede-a3d0-81a5082ef4d8"
msgid ""
"\"Not so far. The {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} travel around a lot — from "
"the {g|Worldwound}Worldwound{/g} to {g|Iobaria}Iobaria{/g}. Hell, these "
"lands were once practically home to us — we used to clear them damned fey "
"from the {g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g} on a regular basis. Well, now we're "
"here again. That's the nomad life, you see — never know where you'll find "
"yourself tomorrow!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리 멀지는 않아. {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}는 {g|Worldwound}월드운드{/g}에서부터 "
"{g|Iobaria}이오바리아{/g}까지 많은 곳을 여행했어. 이 땅은 한 때 우리에게 고향이었지. 우리는 "
"{g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g}에서 온 페이들을 정기적으로 소탕하고는 했어. 이제 다시 여기에 왔구나. 유목민의 삶이란 그런 "
"거지. 내일은 어디로 갈지는 나도 몰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "00047d7f-3414-4e5e-9086-ace00e023265"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarians sniff the food cautiously, then taste small pieces for "
"poison. Once they're certain it's safe, they begin to eat. After swallowing "
"some of the bread, Nober wipes his lips.{/n} \"So you want a chat, huh? "
"Sure, why not.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만족들은 음식을 조심스럽게 킁킁거리며 독이 들었나 작은 조각을 맛봅니다. 안전하다고 확신하자 그들은 먹기 시작합니다. 빵을 삼킨 "
"후 노버는 입술을 닦습니다.{/n} \"그래서 나와 대화를 하고 싶다고? 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "a49d59a7-3c1e-4622-b480-997cef612282"
msgid "\"Still here, huh?\""
msgstr "\"아직 있지, 응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalFighterMeleeHurt
msgctxt "bee64f4d-7503-48f6-94ab-14a13773eb3f"
msgid ""
"{n}A barbarian woman steps forward, trying to control her heavy coughing.{/n}"
" \"That'd be welcome. I'm-\" {n}The woman starts coughing again, then spits "
"some blue phlegm on the ground.{/n} \"I caught bluespit somewhere in the "
"barrens. I can pay for the healing in gold.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인 기침을 억누르며 한걸음 다가옵니다.{/n} \"그건 환영할 만하다. 나는...\" {n}여자는 다시 기침을 시작하더니, 땅에 "
"푸른 가래를 뱉어냅니다.{/n} \"황무지 어딘가에서 블루스핏에 걸렸어. 치료비는 내가 낼 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "b94a7aee-433e-4708-b4ff-0924af712e88"
msgid ""
"\"You kidding? Of course not! Our main camp's over the hills there. If "
"you're feeling gutsy, come pay us a visit!\""
msgstr "\"농담하는거야? 당연히 아니지! 우리 야영지는 언덕 위에 있다. 기분이 언짢다면 찾아와라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0092_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "27bafb82-84ec-4428-855e-f7359f468a2c"
msgid ""
"\"I wish! We've been searching the area for days now, but all we found was a "
"cave with some grime-faced half-men. No ancient ruin, no treasures, not a "
"damned thing!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그랬으면 좋겠지! 며칠째 이 근처를 뒤지고 다녔지만, 우리가 찾은 건 얼굴에 때가 잔뜩 묻은 반인들이 있는 동굴 하나뿐이었어. 고대 유적도, "
"보물도, 빌어먹을 아무것도 없었다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "a8bbd490-0008-442a-8ecb-b9c4c10ed172"
msgid ""
"{n}The Kellid frowns.{/n} \"No idea, really. Dugath just said we should "
"search for caves and ancient ruins, and he'd tell us if it was what we were "
"looking for. You ask me, we're just wasting time out here — but chieftain "
"knows best.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}켈리드는 얼굴을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"모른다. 두가스는 단지 우리가 동굴과 고대 유적을 찾아야한다고 말했고 찾아야 할 것이 "
"있었다면 우리에게 말해주었겠지. 우리에게 물어봤자 시간낭비지만 족장은 잘 알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "62e16931-a227-4157-ac9e-111808d1ce7d"
msgid ""
"\"An old cleric. He's seen a lot, he knows a lot, and it seems like he's the "
"only one who has any idea what the hell we're looking for out here!\""
msgstr "\"나이 든 성직자다. 그는 경험도 많고 아는 것도 많아서 우리가 찾는 것이 무엇인지 잘 알고 있는 자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0096_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "7f1053c2-4930-43dd-80a8-4efa24617f97"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh, I hate this question... Well, {g|Numeria}Numeria's{/g} a hard land "
"made for hard people. Ages ago, stars rained from the sky and left a bunch "
"of chunks of sky metal across the land — some as small as your finger, "
"others big as a mountain. Lots of the chunks just sit still and do nothing, "
"and we mine them for adamantine. Others make monsters, or diseases, or "
"radiation and stuff like that... technic-ology!\" {n}Nober spits that last "
"word, almost like a curse.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"휴. 이 질문이 싫어... {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}는 척박한 곳에서 거친 자들이 모여있는 곳이야. 수백년 전에 별들은 "
"하늘에서 비내렸고 땅에 하늘색 쇳덩어리들을 잔뜩 남겼다. 일부는 손가락처럼 작았고 다른 일부는 산처럼 컸다. 많은 덩어리들이 여전히 "
"거기에 남아있고 우리는 그것들을 캐서 아다만틴으로 제련한다. 다른 자들은 괴물, 질병, 방사선이나 기술 뭐시기 같은 것들을 만들지!\" "
"{n}노버는 마지막 말을 저주하듯 뱉어냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0097_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "58e37dcc-362d-418b-81cc-315d83d4047c"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} are an ancient and glorious tribe, one "
"of the strongest in all {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. We used to own half the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} ourselves, but that was a long time ago — back "
"in the time of great Armag. But now that the spirit of Armag's been reborn "
"into the body of our new chieftain, you mark me — word of our heroic deeds "
"will spread across {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} once again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}는 고대에 영광스러운 부족이었고 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}의 아주 강한 "
"부족이었다. 우리는 예전에 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 절반을 차지했었지만 위대한 아르막이 있었던 오래 전의 "
"일이지. 하지만 이제 아르막의 영혼이 새로운 족장의 몸으로 태어났어. 우리의 영웅적인 행위가 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} 전역에 "
"다시 한번 펼쳐질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0098_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "6db23a5b-a99d-4b30-b125-6e1293f7e23e"
msgid ""
"\"Why would I? Bad enough it brings us so much trouble on its own, but it "
"also attracts villains from all over {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}, like flies to a "
"steaming pile of shit! That {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} alone... "
"Ugh!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아할 이유가 어디 있지? 기술은 많은 문제를 일으키고 있어. {g|Avistan}아비스탄{/g} 전 대륙에서 그거 때문에 악당들이 "
"들끓지를 않나. 마치 김이 나는 똥 더미에 달려드는 파리처럼! 그 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g} 녀석들은... 우웩!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0101_Text
#. Speaker : HuntingParty_VandalLeader
msgctxt "381f13ee-9284-449f-ad3d-0c1d02e0596a"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}? Never heard of it. Whatever's going on there, we "
"got nothing to do with it.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}? 들어본 적이 없다. 거기에 무슨 일이 일어나든 우리는 그것과 아무 상관이 없어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6ae1d2cf-d7f7-4046-9775-cff63f020637"
msgid ""
"\"Watch your tongue, barbarian! This is indeed the baron{mf||ess} of "
"{kingdomname}. Show respect, or you will have to deal with me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"입조심해라. 야만인! 이분은 {kingdomname}의 {mf||여}남작이시다. 예의를 갖춰라, 아니면 나를 상대해야 할 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "7d5aa133-989e-4fba-8c28-ec94edbb7e54"
msgid ""
"\"Look at that woman. I think she needs help,\" {n}Tristian whispers, "
"pointing out one of the barbarians who looks to be quite ill.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"저 여자 좀 보세요. 제 생각엔 그녀가 도움이 필요하겠군요.\" {n}트리스티안은 아주 아파 보이는 바바리안 한명을 가리키며 "
"속삭입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0111_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "3f3360ef-f3c1-4d64-96ec-ea11831e0b2e"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Numeria}Numeria's{/g} also the birthplace of countless beautiful songs "
"and heroic legends. I mean, most of them end with someone getting beheaded, "
"impaled, chopped to pieces, or burned alive... but still, they're marvelous!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}는 역시 수많은 아름다운 노래와 영웅적 전설의 발상지이기도 하지. 그들 중 대부분은 참수되고 찔려 "
"죽거나 조각이 났거나 산채로 타 죽었지만... 하지만 여전히 놀라운 일이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "528dd8ee-b06d-4964-b146-a0f899df4150"
msgid ""
"\"Now those are what I call good assistants — dutiful, prompt, and aware of "
"their own intellectual limitations. Why can't I ever get assistants like "
"that? Maybe I should have pursued a career as a barbarian chieftain...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것들이 내가 훌륭한 조수라고 부르는 것들이지. 충성스럽고 즉각적이고 자신의 지적 한계에 대해 알고 있어. 그런 조력자를 얻을 수 "
"없었던 이유는 무엇일까? 나는 야만족의 수장으로서의 경력을 쌓았어야 했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0116_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ec4b450a-6bc5-4df3-95e1-847ce81d2e42"
msgid ""
"\"There are tons of diseases in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} that you won't find "
"anywhere else. I guess they came along with those falling stars. Fungi, "
"mechanical parasites, brain-eating worms... Fun to be had at every step!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서는 다른 곳에서는 찾을 수 없는 수 많은 질병이 있어. 나는 그것들이 떨어지는 별들과 함께 "
"왔다고 생각해. 곰팡이, 기계 기생충, 뇌를 먹는 벌레들... 종류도 다양하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0126_Text_String
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f5f753e4-17a3-47f3-86c4-bcc9d5525e16"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian sighs, relieved.{/n} \"Praise {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} — this "
"affliction responds to regular magic! I would not have been surprised if "
"such strange symptoms were resistant to common methods of curing... Though, "
"had that been the case, I am certain you would have found a way to manage it!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 안도한 듯 한숨을 내쉽니다.{/n} \"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}여 감사합니다. 다행히 이 병은 일반적인 치유 마법에도 "
"반응하는군요! 이런 이상한 증상이 보통의 치료로는 듣지 않아도 전 놀랍지 않았을 겁니다... 하지만 그랬더라도, "
"당신이라면 분명 방법을 찾아냈을 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/BarbarianLeader_dialog/Cue_0127_Text_String
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "342b448b-3506-4d76-986d-885db0299582"
msgid "\"I have never seen such an unusual disease...\""
msgstr "\"난 이렇게 특이한 질병은 본 적이 없어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/Barks/Barbarian_hunters_1_String
msgctxt "8188f1ad-56a0-4a65-9456-eb856c28603a"
msgid "\"Don't go doing anything crazy...\""
msgstr "\"미친 짓좀 하지마...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/Barks/Barbarian_hunters_2_String
msgctxt "705b0f93-8f9a-40cf-816a-8922f0e0392a"
msgid "\"Whoa, living people! I thought everyone was dead for miles around!\""
msgstr "\"우와! 살아있는 사람이다! 나는 이 주변의 모두가 죽었다고 생각했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/Barks/Barbarian_hunters_3_String
msgctxt "4c9d016d-a1d9-4b63-af84-b0283ba85379"
msgid "\"Friend or foe?\""
msgstr "\"친구인가? 적인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianHuntingParty/Barks/Zone_bark_String
msgctxt "cc41055f-4bd4-4b21-955c-85e8e1fa2a32"
msgid ""
"The barbarian hunters spared no ammunition — at least a dozen arrows are "
"stuck in the deer carcass."
msgstr "바바리안 사냥꾼들은 화살이 바닥났습니다. 적어도 십여개의 화살이 사슴 시체에 꽂혀 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ddb4a432-a91f-47bc-b20a-6ba281627bb9"
msgid "\"Do you know me? How?\""
msgstr "\"날 알아? 어떻게?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "f1e78311-239e-416b-8e21-45aa1c8ab825"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "9d08521b-5e54-476a-88ce-60412afd1acf"
msgid "\"Do you know anything about what happened in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에서 일어난 일에 대해 뭐라도 아는게 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "222210b0-8d54-4e08-8f68-13ff2f4072a1"
msgid "\"What are you looking for here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭘 찾고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "10c7ab50-b5d0-4747-a065-8ffa4f9b9906"
msgid "\"Tell me about your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"네 부족에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "5279ddf3-d725-4bbe-ab48-9cd8fdaa89c8"
msgid "\"Tell me about Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에 대해서 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "368e9863-0165-4359-8c07-bf8cbcc36ecd"
msgid "\"Who's that woman?\""
msgstr "\"저 여자는 누구죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "6de5e8ee-3ec9-4a7b-86b7-74879b54dff8"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "de8547a0-4f66-428a-8761-fc5b850497e3"
msgid "\"So, how can we be useful to each other?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 서로에게 어떻게 도움을 주고 받지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "5f775853-b438-418d-b1c9-13d2849d137a"
msgid "\"How did it go? Did you find anything of interest?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 됐어? 흥미로운 것을 찾았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "b53689fe-bad8-48de-ab3c-2064efc51dc4"
msgid "\"Tell me about your chieftain.\""
msgstr "\"네 족장에 대해서 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "e720f2fe-0cc8-4378-bd91-e4eff3b6c37d"
msgid "\"Tell me about Gorum.\""
msgstr "\"고룸에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "43b29260-1495-4a90-9c42-1605caaafe4c"
msgid "\"There's a whole army of you here. How did you manage to get so far?\""
msgstr "\"너희 무리는 군대에 가깝군. 어떻게 그렇게 멀리서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "39268450-e51d-428b-ab1e-5f5289908f36"
msgid "\"What do you know about cyclopes?\""
msgstr "\"사이클롭스에 대해 무엇을 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "e9c01313-dca2-41f0-a9aa-5884a674300d"
msgid "\"Let me ask you a question.\""
msgstr "\"질문 하나만 할게요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "f43be5c5-52ea-4e8b-a054-e5409eaa17af"
msgid "\"Thank you for your answers.\""
msgstr "\"대답해줘서 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0068_Text_String
msgctxt "dba388bf-68ba-412f-bcb7-e2c17890a5ea"
msgid "\"Octavia, you should be ashamed! You're out of line!\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아. 부끄러운 줄 알아! 도가 지나치잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0069_Text_String
msgctxt "1ff0419e-2ec7-4da4-a9fa-c599a354da24"
msgid "[Raise an eyebrow silently]"
msgstr "[말없이 눈썹을 치켜올린다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "da99a976-081b-43f7-93fd-3a0c50cf58f8"
msgid "\"Don't stay in his tent for too long. We have to get going soon.\""
msgstr "\"너무 오랫동안 그의 텐트에 머무르지 마. 우리는 곧 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0078_Text_String
msgctxt "8fae6b39-cd26-4d2e-846c-697ae7e2c41f"
msgid "\"I'm sorry I overreacted. You know I love you.\""
msgstr "\"과민 반응해서 미안해. 너를 사랑하는 거 알지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0079_Text
msgctxt "4e45ee52-2b66-4306-9fd7-2fa0a5ed9b69"
msgid "\"Dugath is right, you're teasing me on purpose. Why?\""
msgstr "\"두가스가 옳았어. 너 일부러 나를 놀리는 거지. 왜 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0080_Text_String
msgctxt "7ae00fe7-49b5-48b9-ba6d-50841e6ddf48"
msgid "\"I'm only jealous of you because I love you.\""
msgstr "\"너를 사랑해서 질투가 나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0082_Text_String
msgctxt "6d9831a3-eb3f-4c6e-aef3-86bb06dd634c"
msgid "\"So what was that? Why are you teasing me?\""
msgstr "\"방금 뭐야? 왜 나를 괴롭히는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0083_Text
msgctxt "03d3eb7c-6f81-4afa-94fb-97f202935c80"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to go have fun, then go — I'm sure you can find someone here!\""
msgstr "\"재미 좀 보고 싶다면 그러던가. 여기서 누군가를 찾을 수 있을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0084_Text_String
msgctxt "e84b205d-1f58-40d5-bd17-1847b4ea55a7"
msgid "\"Don't you dare flirt with other people while I'm around!\""
msgstr "\"내가 없을 동안 바람필 생각 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0093_Text
msgctxt "00e74235-bbf3-47d1-8fd1-01459c555eae"
msgid "\"Maybe there are some other signs that are not so easy to find?\""
msgstr "\"찾기 쉽지 않은 다른 단서들이 있을지도 몰라?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0094_Text
msgctxt "6df9b449-df35-41d9-8943-5acf8559fffc"
msgid "\"Are there spells to find kindred blood?\""
msgstr "\"혈연을 찾는 주문이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "2e92eec1-a4e4-43e0-94a8-7dd8ca8d02b5"
msgid "\"Maybe there are any indirect signs?\""
msgstr "\"간접적인 징후가 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0096_Text
msgctxt "1d986d08-79f1-4ec8-ab56-be1d26f3cb53"
msgid "\"I'm afraid he's not going to help you.\""
msgstr "\"그가 당신을 도우려 하지 않아 유감이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "e07f7917-a79b-4cf9-9310-6ca68ffd647b"
msgid "\"Then let's move on. We have more important things to do.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 슬슬 움직이죠. 더 중요한일들이 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "ed46219e-3c0a-418f-bdae-124caa6192c4"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach the barbarian leader, you can't help but overhear part of "
"his conversation with a woman you recognize from the feast before. Her face "
"remains hidden, and she sounds extremely worried.{/n} \"I beg you... I "
"haven't seen my Sisters for several days! I'm afraid they may be in trouble!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 야만인 지도자에게 다가갈 때 당신은 족장과 전에 잔치에서 본 여인의 대화를 듣게 되었습니다. 그녀의 얼굴은 숨겨져 있지만 "
"말하는 것으로 보아 걱정하는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"부탁해... 며칠 동안 나의 자매를 보지 못했어! 자매들이 곤경에 처했을까 걱정이 "
"돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "923260b0-2df6-47f2-b988-14951c92f2de"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric shakes his head.{/n} \"This whole land is nothing but trouble. "
"You want me to risk my life and the lives of my people to do your dirty "
"work? Go ahead, ask Armag to give the order! Oh, but Armag stayed back in "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. Which means I'm the one making the decisions here.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"세상이 너무나 혼란스러워. 넌 나와 내 부족민의 목숨을 걸고 네 뒤치닥거리를 하기 원하는 "
"건가? 어서 해봐, 곧 아르막에게 명령도 내리겠구나! 하지만 아르막은 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에 있는 걸. 그 말은 여기서 "
"결정을 내리는 사람은 나 뿐이라는거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "dacbb13e-be38-4bf3-ac31-8f03e35c6b67"
msgid "\"But what about my Sisters? Something terrible could happen to them!\""
msgstr "\"그렇지만 내 누이들은? 누이들에게 끔직한 일이 생길 수 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "98d2224e-653f-48f6-a5fa-25dc6975736a"
msgid ""
"\"You Sisters insisted on this expedition, so it's your price to pay. With "
"your blood, not ours. Something terrible could happen, you say? It's too "
"late for that — we already lost good men on this pointless journey to "
"nowhere. Whatever Armag needs, it's not here, and it wasn't here from the "
"start. But you didn't come here for him, did you? You came for your own "
"reasons. You want some magic toy that once belonged to the ancient cyclopes. "
"Well, I'm not leading my men to their deaths for that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 자매는 이 원정을 주장했으니 그게 네가 치를 댓가야. 피를 흘리는 건 너지, 우리가 아니야. 끔찍한 일이 생길 수 있다고 네가 "
"말했지? 우리는 이미 이 목적지 없는 여정에서 좋은 전사들을 잃었어. 아르막이 필요로 하는게 무엇이든 간에 그건 여기에는 처음부터 "
"없었어. 하지만 너는 그를 위해 여기로 온게 아니야, 그렇지 않나? 너만의 이유가 있어 여기에 왔겠지. 넌 한 때 고대 사이클롭스의 "
"소유였던 몇몇 마법 장난감을 원하지. 글쎄, 난 그런 걸 위해서 내 전사들을 죽음으로 내몰진 않을 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "048e46b3-bd0d-4d2c-8ace-a5920324e605"
msgid "\"Dugath...\""
msgstr "\"두가스...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "5dfac2e2-2df8-480e-b5b8-1eeb30882a13"
msgid ""
"\"This conversation is over. You want help? Why not ask our guests to help "
"you? If you can afford their rates, that is. As for me, my single remaining "
"goal is to get my people home alive and well, and as soon as possible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대화는 끝났어. 도움이 필요해? 우리 손님들에게 도와달라고 부탁하는 것이 어때? 보상을 낼 수 있다면 그걸로 됐지. 나로서는, 내 "
"하나 남은 목표는 내 부하들이 살아서 건강하게 돌아가도록 하는 거야. 가능한한 빨리\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "260af0fa-2e7a-4064-b931-2bf8d9537cd9"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman leaves, sobbing. Dugath turns to you.{/n} \"Good morning! Well, "
"let's get down to business, shall we? Introductions aren't necessary, "
"Baron{mf||ess}, I know who you are. Let's discuss how we can be useful to "
"one another.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 흐느끼며 자리를 떠납니다. 두가스는 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"좋은 아침이네! 자, 이제 사업 이야기를 해 보자고. 소개는 "
"필요 없어, {mf||여}남작. 난 네가 누군지 알아. 우리가 서로에게 유용할 수 있는 방법을 논의하자. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "1ae0ef82-5140-4668-b581-a007f3e97b4e"
msgid ""
"\"How do you think?\" {n}Dugath grins.{/n} \"We keep an eye on everything "
"that happens in the region. It's smart to know our potential employers... "
"and our potential enemies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 생각하나?\" {n}두가스는 씩 웃습니다.{/n} \"우리는 이 지역에서 일어나는 모든 일을 주시하고 있다. 우리의 잠재적 "
"고용주들을 아는 건 영리한 거지... 그리고 잠재적 적들도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "c401f95e-3314-4997-b6ba-47fd3c38ed4c"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric frowns.{/n} \"I wish I knew. The Sisters are looking for "
"something, but they won't tell anyone what it is. I guess it's some antique "
"that used to belong to the cyclopes — some magic trinket or something. As "
"for me, the only thing I'm looking for is a good reason to quit this "
"nonsense and return to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} as soon as possible.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"나도 알았음 좋겠군. 자매는 무언가를 찾고 있었지만 그것이 무엇인지 누구에게도 말하지 않았지. 난 "
"그게 아마 사이클롭스의 유물이라고 추측해. 마법이 담긴 장신구이거나 하겠지. 나는 이 말도 안 되는 일을 어서 끝내고 "
"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 어서 돌아가고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "ad4f1083-38f8-4370-8e3a-5f469115687f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Dugath, son of Gordr and Harrith Three-Fingers, from the {g|Tiger "
"Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} tribe. My entire life I've served {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} — "
"first on the battlefield, sword in my hand, and later with prayer as well. "
"I've fought in battles all across the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}, "
"in {g|Galt}Galt{/g}, {g|Ustalav}Ustalav{/g}... My price is high, my hand is "
"steady, and my sword is deadly.\" {n}Finishing this speech, the man gives "
"you a wide grin, showing off several missing teeth.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족의 고드르와 세 손가락 해리스 사이에서 난 자식인 두가스다. 나는 평생 "
"{g|Gorum}고룸{/g}을 섬겼어. 처음은 칼을 쥐고 전장에서 그리고 지금은 기도자로서. 나는 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 "
"왕국들{/g}에서 {g|Galt}갈트{/g}, {g|Ustalav} 우스탈라프{/g}에 걸친 전투에서 싸웠다... 내 손은 단단하고 "
"무기는 위협적이니 내 몸값은 높지.\" {n}자기 소개를 마치자 그 남자는 소리없이 입을 귀까지 찢으며 웃었고 이가 빠진 구멍 여럿이 "
"보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "e31a0d35-ab33-46d7-a55d-3e479c9378ca"
msgid ""
"\"There are many tribes in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. Each does its best to "
"survive. The Black Horses sell adamantine, the Blood Pikes rob caravans, and "
"the White Scars lick the boots of the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}. "
"As for us, the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}, we're mercenaries — and the "
"best ones in this part of {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}. Remember this, "
"Baron{mf||ess}! If you keep your throne long enough, we'll meet again — "
"sooner or later. Fighting side by side, or otherwise... Who knows!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에는 많은 종족이 있어. 모두 생존을 위해 최선을 다한다. 블랙호스는 아다만틴을 팔고 블러드 "
"파이크는 캐러밴을 강탈하고 화이트스카는 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}의 뒤치닥거리를 하지. 우리 {g|Tiger "
"Lords} 호랑이 군주{/g}는 용병이다. {g|Avistan} 아비스탄{/g}의 가장 강한 용병이지. 기억해. 왕위를 오랫동안 "
"유지하고 싶다면 조만간 우리는 다시 만날 거야. 어깨를 나란히 하고 싸우거나 그렇지 않으면... 누가 알겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "d5f5fbd1-9171-4b8f-a678-f84298c6d833"
msgid ""
"\"Eons ago, stars rained down on {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. Pieces of metal, "
"both dead and living ones, fell from the sky. Since then, metal monsters "
"roam those lands, and the ground holds a wealth of adamantine, among other "
"valuable things. Weaklings don't survive there. As for us Numerian Kellids, "
"we grew up on that land — we drank its poisoned waters and breathed its "
"toxic air. Metals from its depths infused our bones and muscles. No one can "
"beat us. If there were anyone capable of bringing us down...\" {n}the cleric "
"gives you a bitter smile,{/n} \"it would be ourselves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"에온스 이전에 별의 비가 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에 내렸다. 죽은 것과 살아있는 금속 조각이 하늘에서 떨어졌다. 그 이후로 "
"금속 괴물은 그 땅을 돌아다니고 땅은 많은 아다민틴을 보유하게 되었지. 약한 녀석들은 거기에서 살아남지 못해. 우리 누메리안 켈리드는 그 "
"땅에서 자랐다. 우리는 중독된 물을 마시고 유독한 공기를 마셨다. 금속이 우리의 뼈와 근육에 스며들었지. 아무도 우리를 이길 수 없어. "
"우리를 이길 수 있는 사람이 있다면... \" {n}성직자는 씁쓸한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"그것은 우리 자신이 되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "fba6b963-7869-4713-9146-89543fb0525a"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, huh? Isn't that the village {d|Varn}Maegar "
"Varn{/d} got from the {g|Restov}Restovic{/g} {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g}? I "
"know Varn — he's not the best fighter, but also not the worst. As for what "
"happened there — I wouldn't know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}라고? 메이가르 반이 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}"
"로부터 받은 마을이 아닌가? 나는 반을 알아. 그는 최고의 전사는 아니지만 최악의 전사도 아니야. 무슨 일이 있었는지 묻는다면 나는 "
"대답해줄 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "8d078082-14b8-408d-963e-4930bdef6b02"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric utters a heavy sigh.{/n} \"Wish I knew who these witches are "
"and where they came from. Our chieftain, the great Armag — spirits bless him "
"— trusts them as if they were holy oracles. He sent us with them to these "
"dead hills, and none but the Sisters and the chieftain himself know why. Who "
"am I to confront the chieftain? So now we wander around these lands, chasing "
"the unknown.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 무거운 한숨을 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"우리도 이 마녀가 누군지 그리고 어디에서 왔는지 알았으면 좋겠어. 우리의 족장, "
"위대한 아르막은  — 혼령들이여 그를 축복하길 —그 자매가 신성한 신탁사제인 것처럼 믿었지. 그는 우리를 그들과 함께 죽은 자의 언덕으로 "
"보냈고, 그 자매들과 족장 자신을 제외하고는 아무도 그 이유를 몰라. 내가 누구라고 족장과 대립하겠어? 그래서 우리는 현재 알지도 못하는 "
"것을 좇아 이 땅을 떠도는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "c56a55a1-d4e7-4c6e-8ad5-3ddc10d9d7e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath casts a grim glance at the surroundings.{/n} \"This whole land "
"looks like one big burial ground.\""
msgstr "{n}두가스는 주변을 음침한 시선으로 봅니다.{/n} \"이 땅은 마치 커다란 매장지처럼 보인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "b6e08bd9-e800-4a42-8380-79ddd4519c57"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid we can't, at least not yet. I'd be happy to take a new job, but "
"our chieftain's orders were strict: search the location and come back with a "
"report. But if you could help us here — say, by finding whatever these witch "
"Sisters are looking for, or maybe just making them disappear forever — mark "
"my word, Baron{mf||ess}, the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} never forget "
"those who help them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"유감스럽게도 적어도 아직은 안 될 것 같아. 나는 기꺼이 새로운 일을 맡겠지만, 그러나 우리 족장의 명령은 엄격해: 그 지역을 "
"수색하고 보고를 하러 돌아가야 해. 그러나 만약 여기서 자네가 우릴 도울 수 있다면 — 말하지, 네가 자매들이 찾는 것을 우리가 찾게 "
"돕거나 그 마녀들이 영원히 사라지게 한다면 — 내 말을 새겨두게, {mf||여}남작, {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주 "
"부족원들{/g}은 절대 도움을 준 이를 잊지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "6d4d36f1-9faf-44c2-9092-5e51460af5a5"
msgid ""
"\"If we did, do you think we'd still be here now? The only thing to be found "
"in these hills is one's own death. A group of my men entered a cave that "
"turned out to be a spriggan den — they barely survived the encounter. Also, "
"we found the ruins of some old tower — ancient as the world itself and "
"useless as this expedition. There's nothing to be found here — except, like "
"I said before, for one's own death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그랬다면 우리가 지금도 여기있을 것이라고 생각해? 이 언덕에 남아있는 유일한 것은 죽음뿐이야. 내 부하들이 동굴에 들어갔더니 "
"스프리건의 소굴인걸로 판명되었어. 그들은 그 조우에서 겨우 목숨만 부지하고 돌아왔지. 그리고 우리는 아무 쓸모 없는 탑 폐허를 발견했어. "
"이 세상 만큼이나 오래되고 원정에 아무 쓰잘데기 없는 것이었다. 여기는 말 그대로 죽음을 제외하고는 찾을 수 있는 것이 없었지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "4d5d672a-8b34-4d74-96e5-32c5094c1386"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric hesitates, trying to choose the right words.{/n} \"He's a "
"strong fighter. Brave one. He says he's Armag, an incarnation of a hero from "
"the old times. Just don't ask if I believe it. Armag is smart, he knows how "
"to do business. If he'd only pay less attention to what those witches "
"whisper, he'd be a perfect chieftain.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 올바른 말을 하려고 주저합니다.{/n} \"그는 강한 전사야. 용감한 사람이지. 그는 과거의 영웅의 화신인 아르막이라고 "
"말했어. 그걸 믿냐고 묻지는 말아줘. 아르막은 똑똑하니까, 일들이 어떻게 돌아가는지 알지. 만약 그 마녀가 속삭이는 것에만 덜 신경을 "
"썼다면 완벽한 족장이 되었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "fb82e122-b0dd-4485-861f-6cda8237c556"
msgid ""
"\"Our Lord in Iron doesn't like empty talk. He's the god of those who act "
"instead of chatter. His palm blesses every sword ever crafted, and wherever "
"at least two men meet in battle, he's there with them. Even orcs worship the "
"God of Battle — and not only that, they imagine he's an orc, too! It's all "
"nonsense, of course, but there may be a grain of truth to it. For anyone can "
"aspire to be like him — a human, an orc, or even an elf... anyone who grips "
"his iron to make his enemy bleed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 쇠의 신은 쓸데없는 잡담을 싫어하지. 그는 말보다는 행동이 앞서는 분이야. 그의 손은 만들어진 모든 검을 축복하고 전투에 두 "
"사람이 싸우는 순간부터 함께한다. 오크들도 그를 숭배하는데 그를 오크라고 믿어. 말도 안되지만 모두 거짓은 아니니까. 인간이건 오크건 "
"엘프건 쇠로 만든 무기로 적을 쓰러뜨리는 자들은 모두 그의 축복을 받아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "9d93bd41-61aa-4069-84c6-2133935bdaf9"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath frowns.{/n} \"None of your business, actually... But just to "
"reassure you we weren't sneaking into your lands without permission, I'll "
"answer: it was magic. The Sisters opened some strange tunnel, and we used it "
"to get here from {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. {g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} witness my "
"words: I'm no coward, but I'd rather march for a month through all the {g|"
"River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} than use that damned tunnel again. It "
"was... strange. Wrong. Just like those witches themselves.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두가스는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"네가 알 바 아니야... 하지만 우리가 네 영토를 허락 없이 침입하지 않았다는 것을 "
"확인시켜주어야겠군. 대답하지. 그것은 마법이었어. 자매가 이상한 터널을 열었고 우리는 그것을 타고 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 "
"여기로 온 거지. {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}을 걸고 맹세해. 나는 겁쟁이가 아니야. {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}"
"을 공격할 거라면 그런 저주받은 터널을 다시 이용하느니 한 달을 걸려서라도 진군할 거야. 그 터널은... 이상했어. 잘못되었지. 그 "
"마녀들처럼. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4c766a23-7de5-441d-8b89-4c5ac7b41694"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri grins approvingly and raises her clenched fist.{/n} \"Well said, "
"old man! Truly well said! Blood for {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 맞장구치듯 웃으며 주먹을 움켜쥐고 올립니다.{/n} \"말 한번 잘했어, 노인네! 말 잘하네! {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}"
"을 위해 피를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "327bf25a-f9c3-439b-9ca7-abf5dab77070"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim opens his mouth, obviously wanting to say something, but just "
"sighs and waves his hand instead.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하림은 입을 벌려 뭔가를 말하고 싶어하려다가 한숨 대신에 손을 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "83e5a972-e149-4076-9b12-df4e1d3271ac"
msgid ""
"\"You're one of ours, right? Don't deny it, I know a Gorumite when I see one!"
"\" {n}The cleric grins.{/n} \"Perhaps sometime we'll get the chance to honor "
"{g|Gorum}Our Lord in Iron{/g} together on the battlefield, who knows...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 우리와 같은 부류지? 부인하지 마. 고룸을 섬기는 자는 내가 알아!\" {n}성직자는 웃습니다.{/n} \"아마도 언젠가 우리는 "
"전장에서 {g|Gorum}철의 신{/g}을 위해 함께 명예를 가질 거다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "caf7fecc-2778-4541-9d6d-eb44bcd77ac0"
msgid ""
"\"Not that much. Long ago, these lands were part of their empire. They were "
"a great people back then, used unbelievable magic and possessed treasures "
"beyond count. Ages passed, and their empire crumbled into dust. Cyclopes "
"became wild and forgot all about what they once used to be... But the ruins —"
" yes, the ruins remember everything.\""
msgstr ""
"\"꽤 적어. 이 땅은 제국의 일부였어. 그들은 위대한 사람들이었고 고대의 마법을 사용했고 값비싼 보물을 가지고 있었지. 시대가 지나고 "
"제국이 붕괴되었어. 사이클롭스는 사나워지고 예전의 자신들의 모습을 잊어갔지... 하지만 폐허는 모든 것을 기억하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "474413e3-bddd-4fa3-9a73-8f0a474535fb"
msgid "\"Ask away, why not! I don't promise I'll answer, though.\""
msgstr "\"얼마든 물어봐! 그래도 대답할 거라고 약속하지는 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "6db27bcc-43d5-4ae0-b033-13a610f814fa"
msgid "\"You're welcome.\""
msgstr "\"천만에요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0c07edd7-2105-4bd8-aa5e-e50ae0a6b6aa"
msgid "{n}Octavia quietly mutters:{/n} \"And some deal in the slave trade...\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 조용히 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"그리고 노예상인한테서도 일거리를 받겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "b40c4316-4c28-4912-a245-de1b898d5cbd"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, there's plenty of those too. And their numbers will never dwindle, so "
"long as the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} runs the country!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 그런 것들도 많이 있었지. 그리고 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}이 존재하는 한 그것들의 수는 결코 줄어들지 "
"않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "807bdce0-95c2-4fde-bd51-93982d1f6657"
msgid "{n}Valerie frowns.{/n} \"Is this how you serve your liege?\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이게 당신의 영주를 대접하는 태도 입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "e68812df-25ad-4e9f-828b-f8cc05bed266"
msgid ""
"\"Don't confuse our chieftains with your kings, knight. It's the chieftain "
"who swears an oath to the tribe, not the other way around! 'Liege', ha! I "
"was one of the tribe's elders when he was in his first teeth!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 족장들과 너희의 왕을 혼동하지 마라. 기사. 족장은 부족을 위해 맹세한 자다, 다른건 없어! 영주라니. 하! 나는 저 애송이가 "
"젖니를 뺐을 때부터 족장의 원로였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f84c6f64-5dfa-4c6d-bfb2-84043b9cbdaf"
msgid ""
"\"There it is, {g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} humor! For those who find gallows "
"humor too cheerful.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 식 유머라니! 교수형 농담을 하며 웃어대는 자들이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3cce6263-1cff-4a98-ba34-c2360c673bac"
msgid "\"Indeed, they remember much — if only they were more eager to share!\""
msgstr "\"그들은 정말 많은 것을 기억하고 있구나. 그들이 열심히 공유를 했다면 좋았을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e9724f32-b297-41a5-8e03-f35f936746cf"
msgid "\"'Disappear', you say? Ha ha hmmm... That can easily be arranged…\""
msgstr "\"'사라지게'라고 말했나? 하 하 흐음... 그것 참 쉽게도 정리되는군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4669ce16-8f1d-4519-a775-6e0b6f8809ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia studies Dugath's muscular body with admiration.{/n} \"You have so "
"many scars... You must have seen so much!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 두가스의 근육질 몸을 훑어보며 감탄합니다.{/n} \"흉터가 엄청 많아요... 전투를 엄청 많이 겪은게 틀림없겠네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "144a3d58-d3bb-41af-9bff-e7877ed802a9"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian's face remains nonchalant.{/n} \"More than a few, yes. I "
"just gave away my oldest granddaughter to be married. She's a little younger "
"than you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인의 얼굴은 무표정합니다.{/n} \"한두 번 싸운 것은 아니지. 나는 가장 나이많은 손녀를 시집보낸지 얼마 지나지 않았다. "
"너보다 나이가 살짝 어리지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "99f2eb92-24df-4751-bc52-16282241378b"
msgid ""
"\"M-m-m? So you have vast experience — and not just on the battlefield?\" {n}"
"Octavia casts a quick glance at your face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"음? 그래서 당신은 방대한 경험을 갖고 있군요 — 단지 전장에서 뿐만 아니라요?\" {n}옥타비아는 당신의 얼굴을 빠르게 "
"훑어봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "3c70dd0f-0c9c-471a-b3a2-9e8c22a71e54"
msgid "\"I was wondering the same thing.\""
msgstr "\"그게 궁금한가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "8026794e-b263-46e3-9471-b7715433acce"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, girl, I'm too old to fall for such tricks. If you want to tease "
"your lover, good luck. But you'll have to find someone younger than me.\" {n}"
"Dugath turns away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 나는 연애하기에는 너무 늙었어. 사랑 싸움을 하려거든 잘해 보라고. 하지만 나보다는 어린 애인을 찾아봐라.\" {n}두가스는 "
"등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "90b1e14e-29a1-40a2-ac55-5ce2eaa0d067"
msgid ""
"\"We have a saying: if you want to live long — don't stand between a mother "
"bear and her children, between a giant and his lunch, or between two lovers."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런 말이 있지. 오래 살기를 원한다면 어미 곰과 새끼 곰 사이나 거인과 점심 식사 사이에 또는 두 연인 사이에 서지 말라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "a93c6296-399d-44df-9ac2-5ed95221154a"
msgid "\"Hell no, all the beds in my tent are occupied.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 줄 침낭은 내 텐트에 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "eaab5142-8e9b-4760-b745-64768f2cf65b"
msgid ""
"{n}Anger seethes in Octavia's eyes.{/n} \"I'm out of line?! You're out of "
"line! I'm not your slave, got it? I'm a free person and I will do what I "
"want!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아의 눈에는 분노가 가득합니다.{/n} \"내가 선을 넘었다고?! 내가 아니라 너겠지! 나는 너의 노예가 아니야. 알았어? "
"나는 자유인이니 내가 원하는 것을 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3efa8715-6b1f-4a6e-8ca6-f5ae0ebb6960"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia follows the barbarian with her eyes, vexed, then looks at you. "
"She eyes you like a naughty puppy, and for a moment you feel she's about to "
"apologize, but instead the half-elf pouts.{/n} \"Fine! Go then! Hm!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 야만인을 쳐다보고는 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 그녀는 삐진 강아지처럼 당신을 보더니 잠시 후에 그녀는 입술을 죽 내민 채 "
"사과하려고 합니다.{/n} \"좋아! 그럼 가! 흥!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "52080e2d-e5a8-4986-a8cd-e282c8dcd4e2"
msgid ""
"\"Tease you? It was nothing like that! I'm just... Well... It doesn't "
"matter! Forget it.\""
msgstr "\"너를 괴롭혀? 그런 게 아니야! 나는 그저... 음... 상관 없어! 잊어버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0086_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "90a32b39-91ae-40a1-b9ea-b30403ee05c0"
msgid ""
"\"So you express your love as jealousy, is that it? If you think you can put "
"the one you love on a chain and order her around — do this, don't do that, "
"go there, wear this, don't sleep with him... Well, I don't need that kind of "
"love!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 너는 질투로 사랑을 표현하니? 사랑하는 사람에게 목줄을 달고 이래라 저래라 하려거든 부디 하지마. 이래라 저래라 시키거나 "
"마음에 드는 옷을 입히거나 누굴 만나지 말라는 둥... 나는 그런 종류의 사랑은 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0087_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2e2ba698-3d10-4adc-9e68-55f4cd778745"
msgid ""
"{n}The anger on Octavia's face is replaced with embarrassment, and she looks "
"away.{/n} \"Fine... Let's forget about it.\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아의 얼굴에 나타난 분노는 당황으로 바뀌고 그녀는 시선을 피합니다.{/n} \"좋아... 잊어버리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0088_Text_String
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3b835f9f-7dd2-43e7-bb63-a305058b7bb6"
msgid ""
"\"Or what? You'll put me on a chain? Lock me up? You know, jealousy isn't "
"love. If you want to order me around — do this, don't do that, go there, "
"wear this, don't sleep with him... Well, I don't need that kind of love!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니면 뭐야? 나를 쇠사슬로 묶을 거야? 가두겠어? 알다시피 질투는 사랑이 아니야. 나에게 명령하려거든 하지마. 이래라 저래라 "
"시키거나 마음에 드는 옷을 입히거나 누굴 만나지 말라는 둥... 나는 그런 종류의 사랑은 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "442d1adc-b415-4c5f-898f-b467bf310598"
msgid "\"Naah... I'm not in the mood any more. What a mean old geezer!\""
msgstr "\"아... 기분이 좋지 않아. 늙은 괴짜 같으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a059dfb5-c3f9-4391-bcef-e1af9849bf51"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar frowns pensively.{/n} \"So, {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}... "
"Listen up! What if, say, some tribe abandons a child... Let's say, sells him "
"to the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g}... A little snotnose, no "
"tattoos, no ritual scars. Is there any other way to find out where he's from?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 험악하게 얼굴을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"{그래, g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}... 잘 들어! 말하자면 "
"어떤 부족이 아이를 버리면 어떻게 될까? 예를 들면 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}에 판다거나... 문신도 의식으로 "
"새긴 흉터도 없이 말이야. 그런 아이의 출신을 알아내는 방법이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "9da5f69e-8a89-4a2e-bc8d-113b312be968"
msgid ""
"\"That's a hell of a question! If there are no tattoos, no scars, nothing — "
"then how would you identify him?\""
msgstr "\"그건 터무니 없는 질문이다! 문신이 없고 흉터도 없고 아무것도 없이 어떻게 그 사람을 알아보겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "f5de15ef-c647-4ac2-9f26-b078e637b9c0"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe there are — I don't know what I don't know. If so, only a very "
"powerful wizard could do it. I don't know any of those.\""
msgstr "\"아마 가능할지도. 누가 알겠어. 매우 강력한 마법사가 할 수 있을지도. 나는 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "ff315fa7-d38a-4ee2-8c8b-f2cf0af83c8a"
msgid ""
"\"Hm, you're right. Hey, boy, open your mouth...\" {n}Dugath sticks his "
"finger in Regongar's mouth, examines his teeth and then tilts his head down "
"and feels his scalp. Finally, when the examination is over, the barbarian "
"shakes his head.{/n} \"Your teeth aren't filed, and there's nothing on the "
"head. I don't know any other signs.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠, 네가 맞아. 이봐. 너. 입을 열어봐.\" {n}두가스는 레곤가르의 입에 손가락을 집어넣고 그의 이를 살피고는 그의 머리를 "
"숙이고 두피를 만집니다. 마침내 검사가 끝나자 야만인은 머리를 절래절래 흔듭니다.{/n} \"네 이는 멀쩡하고 머리에는 아무런 흔적이 "
"없어. 어느 부족인지 알 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0099_Text
msgctxt "8850facc-eed1-4012-aae1-54b61db9bb79"
msgid ""
"\"There's only one indirect sign. If the tribe really sold their child to "
"slavery — it was a tribe without honor or conscience. Only two of the larger "
"tribes could be capable of this: the Sunder Horns...\" {n}The barbarian "
"spits at his feet.{/n} \"... And the White Scars. But besides them there are "
"dozens of small tribes in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, and each of them has their "
"own customs. Some aren't just slavers, but cannibals!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다만 한 가지 간접적인 흔적은 있어. 만약 부족이 실제로 노예로 자녀를 팔면 그것은 명예와 양심이 없는 부족이야. 큰 부족 중에서는 "
"두 부족이 이런 짓을 하지. 갈라진 뿔 부족과...\" {n}야만인은 발치에 침을 뱉어냅니다.{/n} \"... 그리고 하얀 흉터 "
"부족이지. 그러나 그 외에도 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에 수십개의 작은 부족이 있다. 그들 각각은 자신의 관습을 가지고 있어. "
"어떤 부족은 노예가 아니라 식인종에게 바치기도 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0100_Text
msgctxt "37fd77da-b6a5-413b-be54-dbbd202c228d"
msgid "\"I'm sorry, friend, but what you seek...\""
msgstr "\"미안하지만 네가 찾는 건...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0102_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "94aec394-c1e7-4616-a530-470931b5eaed"
msgid "{n}Regongar turns away resentfully.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 분개하며 등돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0103_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1088718f-29f3-44db-97dc-28a7aacfd50c"
msgid "\"I didn't get my hopes up. I just thought — what if? Heh...\""
msgstr "\"아직 바라던 것을 얻지 못했어. 나는 그저 궁금했어. 헤...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6f10f138-4adb-4f95-97db-8d47fce36ea0"
msgid ""
"\"I know. I always just think — what if?\" {n}Sighing, Regongar looks at "
"you.{/n} \"Thanks for asking him, though. I never thought to ask!\""
msgstr ""
"\"알고 있어. 나는 항상 궁금했지.\" {n}레곤가르가 한숨을 쉬며 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"그래도 물어봐줘서 고마워. 나는 물어 "
"볼 생각도 못했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0107_Text
msgctxt "ab55d5e0-b44f-4172-90ca-97b4a76fcafe"
msgid ""
"\"Hard to miss someone like you, dragging that green beast around like it's "
"just another compatriot.\""
msgstr "\"너와 같은 사람을 발견 못하는 게 더 어려워. 녹색 짐승을 동료처럼 끌고 다니니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0108_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "510741cb-15cf-4ce5-b1df-dad096b1df45"
msgid ""
"\"These longshanks know Nok-Nok already! That good, fame already rising. "
"Just a little more, and Nok-Nok will be a real Hero!\""
msgstr "\"이 꺽다리는 녹-녹 알고 있다! 나 이미 유명해졌어. 조금만 더 있으면 녹-녹은 진정한 영웅이 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0109_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "2c2f387b-8dba-49cc-a6e1-6f6d7d2770d8"
msgid ""
"\"So he's three times younger than you, but has achieved more?\" {n}Kanerah "
"scoffs.{/n} \"That's why you're angry, old man.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 그가 너보다 3배는 어린데 더 많이 성취했다고?\" {n}카네라가 코웃음을 칩니다.{/n} \"그래서 그렇게 화가 났군. "
"늙은이\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0110_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "da6776c1-5f64-4428-8f11-c956090c7048"
msgid ""
"\"Very wise. It would be even wiser not to tell the {mf|lord|lady} of these "
"lands that you consider {mf|him|her} an adversary.\""
msgstr "\"매우 현명해. 하지만 네가 맞수로 생각하는 이 땅의 영주에게 말하지 않았다면 더욱 지혜로왔을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0111_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8bf62ac1-7a73-4f9a-b0ec-e7beefd6faa1"
msgid ""
"\"I understand how one could fight for justice, for something dear, for new "
"knowledge, or simply for a better future. But battle for the sake of battle? "
"Death for the sake of death?\""
msgstr ""
"\"대담한 도전이나 정의를 위해서, 새로운 지식이나 더 나은 미래를 위한 싸움을 하는 건 이해가 가. 하지만 싸움을 위한 싸움이라고? "
"죽음을 위한 죽음이라는 게 말이 돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_FirstDialogue/Cue_0112_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "11b41399-9eae-4c08-b420-75cea6e858bd"
msgid ""
"\"A waste of gold and precious lives – that's war for war's sake. I "
"understand the followers of Lamashtu better than those of Gorum!\""
msgstr "\"전쟁을 위한 전쟁은 돈 낭비에 사람 목숨만 사라져 간다. 고룸보다 라마슈투가 훨씬 낫다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "274f9fca-73e5-440a-a6b8-9ab76dba3e39"
msgid "\"She lies! I didn't kill anyone!\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 거짓말하는 거야! 나는 아무도 죽이지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "16e98652-bb2a-453d-be57-25dafb58b822"
msgid ""
"\"It's a lie! I saved two Sisters. When I found the third, she was already "
"dead!\""
msgstr "\"거짓말이야! 내가 두 자매를 구했어. 세 번째를 발견했을 때는 이미 죽어 있었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "28908b5d-a5e2-4bd7-b9df-cdb33f4fb3b6"
msgid ""
"Persuaded the barbarian leader to settle the dispute without unnecessary "
"bloodshed."
msgstr "불필요한 유혈 없이 분쟁을 해결하기 위해 야만인 지도자를 설득했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "ccd8a67a-cec7-4155-9d94-3a1ec1e08d64"
msgid ""
"\"Dugath, we have nothing to fight over. What will this battle get you? "
"Spare the lives of your people.\""
msgstr "\"두가스. 우리는 싸울 이유가 없다. 이 전투로 무엇을 얻게 될까? 부하의 생명을 소중히 하라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "c654cd40-c10c-40da-a1c4-debbe0dfe853"
msgid "\"Come and get me, if you dare!\""
msgstr "\"할 수 있다면 와 보시지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "6389510d-9134-4138-976a-14058d03753a"
msgid ""
"\"By {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}, wake up! How can you believe that lying witch? She "
"lured you all here as a sacrifice to the wicked gods of the ancient cyclopes!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"일어나! 그 거짓말하는 마녀를 어떻게 믿을 수 있지? 그녀는 고대 사이클롭스의 사악한 신들에게 너를 제물로 바치려고 유혹한 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "f01ed50d-8f9c-48f9-bd93-347728320e1e"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach the camp, you hear the noise of an agitated crowd. "
"{g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} are gathered around the Defaced Sister near the "
"camp entrance, and a loud discussion is taking place. When the Defaced "
"Sister sees you, she lifts her hand and points a finger at you. Her voice, "
"usually calm and quiet, is now menacing and accusing.{/n} \"Look there, {g|"
"Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}! Here comes the killer! An enemy! A servant of "
"evil spirits! This person aims to disrupt our exalted mission!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야영지에 다가가자 당신은 동요한 군중의 소리를 듣습니다. 캠프 입구 주위에 얼굴 잃은 자매를 누메리아인들이 둘러쌓았고 웅성거리는 "
"소리가 들립니다. 얼굴 잃은 자매가 당신을 보았을 때 그녀는 손을 들어 당신을 가리킵니다. 평온하고 조용한 그녀의 목소리는 위협과 비난으로 "
"바뀝니다.{/n} \"저길 봐! {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}! 여기 살인자가 온다! 적이다! 악령의 종! 이 사람은 "
"우리의 고귀한 사명을 혼란에 빠트릴 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "aa870546-06c3-4590-bdde-f9720aec6e02"
msgid ""
"\"As you can see, there are only {d|c31 Sisters Saved}three{/d} of us here. "
"Our fourth Sister was killed, and {mf|he|she} is the killer!\" {n}The women "
"raise their hands in perfect unison and point their fingers at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 {d|c31 Sisters Saved} 셋{/d}만 남아있다. 넷째는 {name}의 손에 의해 죽었다!\" {n}자매들은 "
"동시에 손을 들고 당신을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0003_Text_String
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "55722197-913d-4c73-a3f5-cf0006ea03f9"
msgid ""
"\"The Sisters who went to the hills in search of truth {d|c31 Tomb Murder}"
"never returned{/d}. They perished, and {mf|he|she} is the killer!\" {n}The "
"woman points a trembling finger at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"진실을 찾아 언덕으로 간 자매는 {d|c31 Tomb Murder}다시는 돌아오지 못했다.{/d} {name}의 손에 의해 죽었다!\""
" {n}여자는 떨리는 손가락으로 당신을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "c4e85ae2-da45-4dc9-b95d-828c760755b7"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath sheathes his blade.{/n} \"An enemy, you say? I don't see any {d|"
"c31 Ashman Friendly}enemies{/d} here.\""
msgstr "{n}두가스는 칼집을 잡습니다.{/n} \"적이라고? {d|c31 Ashman Friendly}적{/d}은 보이지 않는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "17ebd624-2588-47bd-99e1-853bb2b3c48a"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath raises his sword.{/n} \"You heard the Sister. {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger "
"Lords{/g}, {d|c31 Ashman Hostile}to battle{/d}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두가스는 검을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"자매의 말을 들었겠지. {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}, {d|c31 "
"Ashman Hostile}전투 준비{/d}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "757728c0-6ec4-41f1-aaad-2c26c9a60c81"
msgid "{n}Dugath hesitates, looking at you intently.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}두가스는 주저하며 당신을 골똘히 바라보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "9e7aeeb5-51fa-4e66-b004-342da5d7afe5"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath lowers his sword.{/n} \"{g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}! Haven't "
"you had enough of this witch's speeches? Me, I'm fed up with all her lies "
"and half-truths. We keep dying here, and she won't even tell us what for, "
"what we're trying to find here! If anyone wants to give their life for her "
"gibberish, go ahead. Everyone else, start packing — we go back to "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두가스는 검을 내립니다.{/n} \"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}! 마녀의 연설이 질리지 않는가? 나는 그녀의 "
"거짓말에 싫증이 난다. 우리는 여기서 계속 죽어 가지만, 그녀는 우리가 여기서 무엇을 찾는지 말해주지 않는다! 그녀의 장난질에 목숨을 "
"바치려고 한다면 마음대로 해라. 나머지는 짐을 싸라. 우리는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "0f41bc19-7989-4d78-ad4d-d949568c4e7f"
msgid ""
"\"Now listen closely, Sister. I'm tired of the constant lies, the omissions, "
"and vague prophecies. We'll kill the {mf|baron|baroness} for you, but that's "
"the end. We're done. We're going back to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. And we do "
"it today!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 들어라, 자매. 나는 끊임없는 거짓말, 누락된 진실, 흐리멍텅한 예언이 지긋지긋하다. 너를 위해 {mf|남작|여남작}을 "
"죽이겠지만, 이번이 마지막이다. 우리 관계는 끝이다. 우리는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아갈 것이다. 바로 오늘 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "cc75f7d3-ef3f-4d1a-90d9-a6dbfe469daa"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath sheathes his blade.{/n} \"Battle? And what battle would that be?\""
msgstr "{n}두가스는 검을 꺼냅니다.{/n}\"전투라고? 전투가 뭔지 알고나 하는 말이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "817e5fd3-078f-4dcf-b72c-a6e32867c4d3"
msgid ""
"\"As far as I know, all the Sisters went out into the hills, and that was "
"the last anyone ever saw of them. We waited long enough, but when none of "
"them returned, we had to head back to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} on our own... "
"Right, everyone? That's how it all happened, isn't it?\" {n}He turns around, "
"looking around at the other barbarians. Some of them stow their blades, "
"laughing, while others continue to throw dark stares in your direction.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내가 알기로 자매는 언덕으로 간 것이 마지막 모습이었어. 우리는 오랫동안 기다렸지만 아무도 돌아오지 않아서 "
"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아가야 했어... 그렇지? 이봐들. 안그래?\" {n}그는 등을 돌리고 다른 야만족을 봅니다. "
"일부는 자신의 칼을 들고 웃고 다른 자들은 조용히 당신 쪽을 바라봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "53a749b7-2605-4f79-a9b3-fc426835d028"
msgid ""
"\"Betrayal! Blasphemy! All who remain loyal to the great Armag — to battle!\""
msgstr "\"배신이다! 신성 모독이다! 아르막에게 충성하는 자들아! 전투를 준비하여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "4bd6ed43-1c2e-4c3e-9b1b-99a94a181ad8"
msgid "\"Today you die, Baron{mf||ess} {name}!\""
msgstr "\"오늘 네가 죽는 날이다, {mf||여}남작 {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "9b354d4b-39e3-4ea3-8394-cc494ea4d740"
msgid ""
"{n}Hearing your name, a black raven who'd been perched nearby and listening "
"intently flies off, cawing coarsely.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 이름을 듣자 당신 주위에 앉아있던 검은 까마귀가 그 말을 듣고 까악거리며 날아갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "6d74efa0-60db-4639-bc5d-09913cf27112"
msgid "{n}Shouting battle cries, the barbarians attack.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}전투 함성을 지르며 야만인들이 공격합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "0a9f9ec3-fbe2-4dde-b4ec-975970973dfb"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarians exchange glances with each other, look at the Sister, then "
"look at you, and finally look to Dugath, who tightens his fist around his "
"sword. They await an order from their leader, ready to charge at his "
"sign.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인들은 시선을 교환하고는 자매들을 보더니 다시 당신을 보고 마침내 칼자루를 쥐고 있는 두가스를 바라봅니다. 그들은 족장의 신호를 "
"기다리며 명령을 받으면 돌격할 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "e2250bf3-f74c-40b4-8e2a-5e3636c833f6"
msgid ""
"\"We trusted {mf|him|her}, and this is how {mf|he|she} repays us! Liar! "
"Traitor! Murderer!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 {mf|그|그녀}를 믿었다, 그리고 이것이 {mf|그|그녀}가 보답하는 방식이다! 사기꾼! 배신자! 살인자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "3761b915-af0b-4888-92db-75c9aeddc4dc"
msgid ""
"\"There were four of us. Two are already {d|c31 Dunsward Murder}dead{/d}, "
"and the third is {d|c31 Good Sister}missing{/d} — I doubt we'll see her "
"alive again. And the killer stands right before you!\" {n}The woman points "
"her trembling finger at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그건 우리 넷이었어. 둘은 이미 {d|c31 Dunsward Murder}죽었고{/d} 셋째는 {d|c31 Good "
"Sister}실종되었지.{/d} 그녀를 살아서 볼 수 있을지는 몰라. 그리고 살인자는 바로 앞에 있다!\" {n}여성은 떨리는 손으로 "
"당신을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "a4c7e212-5968-4be6-a8a2-0111f78925f0"
msgid ""
"\"One of our Sisters is slain, and the other is {d|c31 Good "
"Sister}missing{/d} — probably never to be seen again. And the killer stands "
"right before you!\" {n}The women raise their hands in perfect unison and "
"point their fingers at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리 자매 중 하나가 살해당하고 다른 하나는 {d|c31 Good Sister}실종되었어.{/d} 아마도 다시는 보지 못하겠지. "
"살인자는 바로 이 앞에 있다!\" {n}여성은 손을 들어 확신의 찬 눈빛으로 당신을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "6fa91170-1cd1-4d63-9e3a-c80592dcb8b3"
msgid ""
"\"Since we first met, you've given us nothing but lies and half-truths. You "
"wouldn't even tell me your name! You probably believed me unable to learn "
"who you are, that your name — and your crimes — would remain secret! You "
"should have known that nothing stays hidden forever!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 만난 이후로 너는 우리에게 거짓말 만을 해왔다. 네 이름조차 말해주지 않았지! 네 이름과 죄가 영훤히 비밀로 남겨질 거라고 "
"생각했나? 모든 비밀은 결국 밝혀지는 법이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_Sister_SecondDialogue/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "9e72b412-03ec-4002-9d70-ceb888fa04f9"
msgid ""
"\"The Sisters who went into the hills in search of truth {d|c31 One Murder}"
"never returned{/d}. They perished, and {mf|he|she} is the killer!\" {n}The "
"woman points a trembling finger at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"자매는 진실을 찾아 언덕으로 향했지만 {d|c31 One Murder}다시는 되돌아오지 못했다.{/d} 그들은 {name}의 손에 "
"의해 죽었다!\" {n}여성은 떨리는 손으로 당신을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "114376bc-0bf9-43b2-8f7d-59dd9df2a068"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're not going anywhere.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 어디에도 가지 못 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "aa692760-4a31-4c3e-a528-5bc5c7f45fd3"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ddb8a01a-9142-4832-be0f-1194e39e656c"
msgid ""
"{n}The old cleric lies on the ground, staring up into the low gray sky. "
"Crimson blood from numerous wounds stains the dry barren soil around him.{/n}"
" \"Come closer...\" {n}he whispers.{/n} \"I need to tell you something.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이 든 성직자는 땅에 누워 회색 하늘을 쳐다보고 있습니다. 그의 주위에 수많은 상처에서 흐른 진홍빛 피가 황량한 토양을 얼룩지게 "
"합니다.{/n} \"더 가까이 와...\" {n}그는 속삭입니다.{/n} \"너한테 말하고 싶은 게 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "b2fc8406-1f22-4129-9bbc-7309a9a6764e"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath casts a gloomy glance over the battlefield, the bodies of his "
"brethren strewn across it.{/n} \"They died meaningless deaths... I hope you "
"realize, Baron{mf||ess} — when next we meet, we'll be sworn enemies.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두가스는 전장에 우울한 눈빛을 보냈고 그곳에는 그의 형제들의 시체가 흩어져 있습니다.{/n} \"그들은 의미없는 죽음을 맞았어... "
"이것만은 알아둬라. 다음에 우리가 만날 때 우리는 적으로 만날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "93afbfcd-4ece-47ff-867f-0e6494339dc6"
msgid ""
"{n}Having passed the bloody bodies of his men, Dugath stops near the corpse "
"of the Sister.{/n} \"They died meaningless deaths... But we could be "
"friends, you and I, Baron{mf||ess}. It always ends this way — creatures like "
"her breed ill blood between people, and then good fighters die for no good "
"reason.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 부하들의 시체를 지나가고 두가스는 자매의 시체에서 멈춥니다.{/n} \"그들은 의미없는 죽음을 맞았어... 하지만 우린 친구가 "
"될 수 있다. 끝은 항상 이런 식이지. 저런 괴물 같은 년이 사람들의 피를 빨아먹으면 선량한 전사들은 이유 없이 죽는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "87cc1023-2ccd-4244-944e-11511a42355b"
msgid ""
"\"I know where to find what the Sisters were looking for. It's in the {g|"
"Valley of the Dead}Valley of the Dead{/g}. An unholy, cursed place, that "
"is... I didn't want to lead my people there. Now... it doesn't matter "
"anymore...\""
msgstr ""
"\"자매들이 찾고 있는 것이 어디에 있는지 알고 있다. 그것은 {g|Valley of the Dead} 죽은 자의 계곡{/g}에 있어. "
"그곳은 타락하고 저주받은 곳이지... 나는 내 백성을 거기로 이끌고 싶지 않았지. 이제는 중요하지 않지만... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "4fc6bbc9-47e5-47b1-8601-b9f83ec673ef"
msgid ""
"\"I'll tell you how to get there. That thing the Sisters were searching the "
"tombs for... it opens the entrance. Go there... and die there...\""
msgstr ""
"\"거기에 어떻게 도착할지 알려줄게. 자매가 무덤을 찾고 있었던 것은... 입구를 열기 위해서였어. 거기로 가... 그리고 거기서 "
"죽어라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "17e0c157-e917-4ee1-9a4d-839adc04ae9e"
msgid ""
"\"We have nothing more to do here. We'll leave. But let me tell you why we "
"came here in the first place. I've no idea what magic toy those witches were "
"looking for, but I do know where to find it. We spotted the place long ago, "
"but I didn't want to lead my people there. These incense burners from the "
"tombs are keys to the entrance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기서 더 이상 할 일이 없다. 우리는 떠날 거야. 그러나 우리가 왜 여기에 왔는지 말해 줄께. 마녀가 찾고 있는 마법의 장난감이 "
"무엇인지 모르겠지만 어디에서 찾을지는 알아. 우리는 오래 전에 거기에 갔지만 내 백성을 거기로 이끌고 싶지 않았지. 무덤에서 가져온 이 "
"향로는 입구의 열쇠다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "043a31eb-7c99-4b30-b76c-e8e4e3e1fdad"
msgid ""
"\"That place is called the {g|Valley of the Dead}Valley of the Dead{/g}, and "
"for good reason. It's an unholy land, a cursed land. If there's something "
"capable of devouring a whole city around here, that's where you'll want to "
"start looking for it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 장소는 {g|Valley of the Dead} 죽은 자의 계곡{/g}이라고 불리는 이유가 있지. 그곳은 타락하고 저주받은 "
"곳이지... 도시 전체를 먹어치울 수 있는 것을 찾으려면 거기에서 찾아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "fb1edb5f-e4b2-4d65-a9b1-caa44fc26882"
msgid "\"And now, farewell.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 작별이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "74dd3053-bf43-4a24-8b24-358f89e2c2fb"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian pulls the hood off the dead Sister's head and frowns. She "
"really has no face — instead there is a dark rough surface that resembles "
"tree bark, with a hole in place of a nose and a crack instead of a mouth.{/n}"
" \"Disgusting... Look, it's not even a human. Right, she wasn't human at all "
"— she was fey! This is who our chieftain was listening to.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 죽은 자매의 후드를 벗겨내고는 눈살을 찌푸립니다. 그녀는 정말로 얼굴이 없었습니다. 대신 나무 껍질과 같은 어두운 거친 "
"표면이 있었고 코가 있어야 할 자리에 구멍이 있고 입 쪽에 균열이 있었습니다.{/n} \"역겨워라... 인간도 아니었어. 그녀는 인간이 "
"아니야. 페이였지! 우리 족장이 이 녀석의 말을 따랐지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Ashman_final/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f994c64b-22d7-41ad-8926-1a09a706fdb3"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't want to give unwanted advice, but I don't think we should let "
"the barbarian go. He told you in all honesty that he has dark plans for you "
"and your lands. He deserves honesty in return – an honest death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불필요한 말은 하고 싶지 않지만 저 바바리안들을 보내주지 말아야겠어. 네 땅에 욕심이 있다고 말한 녀석이야. 그는 정당한 벌을 받아야 "
"해. 죽음 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_01_String
msgctxt "ff7a4656-360f-4cd6-a9d0-96db02f1124e"
msgid "\"So, baron{mf||ess}, huh? We've seen stronger!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 남작이라고? 약골처럼 보이는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_02_String
msgctxt "f1628ce5-eebb-4668-901a-176b989a0ff7"
msgid "\"This damn place gives me the creeps.\""
msgstr "\"이 빌어먹을 장소 때문에 소름이 돋네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_03_String
msgctxt "1a4841bb-f6ca-4b88-bfae-f7adb9cc2ca5"
msgid "\"Why'd the Sisters drag us here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 누이들이 우리를 여기로 끌고왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_04_String
msgctxt "252c9040-bc89-48b9-a4ad-52f0fa06c7fb"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever we're looking for, I hope we find it soon — the sooner, the "
"better.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 무얼 찾든 어서 찾으면 좋겠어. 빠를 수록 좋을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_05_String
msgctxt "462ec868-42d2-44c5-9aa4-14f26ec2736f"
msgid "\"Dugath looks gloomier every day.\""
msgstr "\"두가스는 항상 우울해 보여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_06_String
msgctxt "bc00ef8b-8ed9-4e05-8608-1d67347c7f6b"
msgid "\"Damn, my bowstring snapped! Need to find a new one...\""
msgstr "\"젠장. 내 활시위가 끊어졌어! 새로 하나 구해야겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_07_String
msgctxt "ed6823ed-afee-4ff5-ade2-89106149b327"
msgid "\"Look at those clouds... Might start raining any minute.\""
msgstr "\"저 구름들좀 봐요.. 조금 있으면 비가올지도 모르겠어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_08_String
msgctxt "85c9e0cd-0dba-4302-bcad-33046762116f"
msgid ""
"\"Just look at this place... Well, at least we don't have to deal with metal "
"monsters like in Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"저기 좀 봐... 그래도 누메리아에서 몸이 쇠로 된 괴물을 상대하는 것보다는 낫겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_09_String
msgctxt "f9e82209-9f01-4392-8eb7-0b70ef6b7cff"
msgid ""
"\"You know how many brave souls have been lost in the Stolen Lands? "
"Hundreds, at least! You think you're any luckier?\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅에서 얼마나 많은 전사가 죽은 지 알아? 적어도 수백은 된다고! 너도 그중에 하나가 될 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Barbarian_10_String
msgctxt "3630f23e-9e51-423e-a901-92c3cafea5d7"
msgid "\"They should have been back already... I hope they're all right.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 이미 돌아왔어야 해요... 그들이 괜찮길 바라요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Bolga_General_String
msgctxt "056069b9-50c5-4cd1-bb9d-582f885e19dc"
msgid ""
"\"There may be a lot of ruins here, but they were probably looted centuries "
"ago...\""
msgstr "\"여기에 폐허가 많을지 모르지만 수백년 전에 이미 털렸을걸...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Bolga_Goaway_String
msgctxt "d26c6bdc-7459-4a02-a6a8-a884fc525eea"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, it's you! So, how are those ugly things enjoying their cave? Is it "
"cozy?\""
msgstr "\"너구나! 이 못생긴 것들이 동굴에서 어떻게 지내려나? 동굴은 아늑하려나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Brag_blind_String
msgctxt "1bac3a97-19c8-4434-a539-d9c12190de16"
msgid ""
"\"The Tiger Lords never abandon their own! I'll keep on living and serving "
"the tribe!\""
msgstr "\"호랑이 군주는 절대로 동족을 버리지 않아! 나는 계속해서 부족을 섬길 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Hilla_String
msgctxt "2f946361-5b39-4753-b725-63b0f0330cf8"
msgid ""
"\"Can't I trust anyone here? This isn't an army, it's a traveling brothel!\""
msgstr "\"여기에 믿을 사람은 없는 건가? 여기는 군대가 아니라 여행자 집단 같구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Nober_String
msgctxt "37376ae1-7ecc-4fd3-a61f-b032e42c18f6"
msgid "\"Hunting's sparse around here. We're running low on meat again...\""
msgstr "\"사냥을 하기가 어려워졌어... 고기가 떨어져간다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/RavenBark_String
msgctxt "2581fa48-397d-4adf-8948-b4294b8041e4"
msgid "The raven watches you attentively."
msgstr "까마귀가 당신을 노려봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Sister_Saved_1_String
msgctxt "84f03678-d326-4591-a565-d1e8e1dc94f8"
msgid "\"The truth will be revealed to those who seek it...\""
msgstr "\"진실은 찾고자 하는 사람에게 밝혀질 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Barks/Sister_Saved_2_String
msgctxt "d97bab55-66f6-4713-8c86-53c924f5eac2"
msgid ""
"\"Few are smart enough to ask the question. Fewer yet are brave enough to "
"hear the answer...\""
msgstr "\"질문을 할 정도로 똑똑한 녀석은 없군. 대답을 들을 정도로 용감한 녀석은 아예 없는 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "4d988c90-b946-49f2-89ae-71d4d21bc2a8"
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[계속한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "90b9a7b2-13d0-4c0c-b4e5-20675eadb904"
msgid "...drained {mf|his|her} goblet to the dregs."
msgstr "...잔을 바닥까지 비웠습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "ca9e444a-f5a1-4c0b-a131-878c223a817d"
msgid "...took a small sip from {mf|his|her} goblet."
msgstr "...{mf|그|그녀}의 잔에서 한모금 마셨습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "7fddba8b-6c1f-4dfa-83ff-f26df6393d7d"
msgid "...spilled {mf|his|her} wine on the ground."
msgstr "..포도주를 바닥에 부었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "7927b1c6-f280-4099-b764-a9e26020a5a3"
msgid "...stood and proposed a toast of health to the people gathered there."
msgstr "...사람들에게 건배를 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "7ad69cf0-bbfc-4b69-98a5-490158351eac"
msgid "...placed {mf|his|her} faith in Amiri and followed her example."
msgstr "...아미리를 굳게 믿고 그녀의 모범을 따랐습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "159f1605-3b50-4d12-a9a7-f69fd4e61841"
msgid "...placed {mf|his|her} faith in Jubilost and followed his example."
msgstr "...주빌로스트를 굳게 믿고 그를 따랐습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "957a252e-eb61-4edd-a38a-5198bbc1ed1f"
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[계속한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0028_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e2c94501-97da-4d47-871b-c37f49cc3a6e"
msgid ""
"Shown compassion toward the woman sitting apart from the Numerians' revelry."
msgstr "누메리아인들과 따로 앉아있는 여성을 동정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "7735fdf0-1e4e-44d2-98e2-9d0967f5572b"
msgid "...demanded she be invited to the table."
msgstr "...그녀가 식사에 초대되어야 한다고 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "65124b47-8e3e-4c9f-a42b-2252c86f9e06"
msgid ""
"...either didn't notice her or just decided it would be wiser to ignore her."
msgstr "...그녀를 보지를 못했거나 그녀를 무시하는 것이 낫다고 생각했나 봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "d6f17e46-82e4-411c-8158-bcf57c5fe4d5"
msgid "...asked the Tiger Lords who she was."
msgstr "...호랑이 군주 부족원에게 그녀가 누구냐고 물어봤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "9bf232eb-2e41-491c-a5b6-4f789d471aaa"
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[계속한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "49a82378-6a4e-4c85-828f-9fb6dae21a89"
msgid "...the bard's song."
msgstr "...바드의 노래였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "3152a515-346c-4816-b069-ca6ef719f218"
msgid "...the tale of how we defeated the Stag Lord."
msgstr "...수사슴 군주를 무찌른 이야기였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "9bfcf78c-3474-4902-85af-0feaf6447ed6"
msgid "...a friendly sparring match."
msgstr "...친선 결투였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "bd21ecd3-16ef-4f36-9a5b-dd48bf558f54"
msgid "...a demonstration of some magic tricks."
msgstr "...마술 쇼가 시작되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "d9902a07-549b-4444-aab7-7323906b8f11"
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[계속하기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "c924910e-9fca-4abe-ae54-3a596f4c1cfc"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "452517ce-eb91-4bd3-82da-7ffcf98cf790"
msgid ""
"On the low grounds among the hills, some {g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} barbarians "
"had set up camp. While obviously set up recently as a place to rest, it was "
"thoroughly constructed. Along with the stake palisade, the Numerians had "
"reinforced their camp with a deep moat. Spotting the body of some unlucky "
"thief at the bottom, it seemed they made a good call."
msgstr ""
"언덕 사이 협곡에서 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 야만인 몇이 캠프를 지었습니다. 캠프는 꼼꼼했고 최근에 지어졌습니다. 말뚝 방벽을 "
"따라서 누메리아인들은 해자로 캠프를 둘렀습니다. 그 바닥에 운 없이 죽은 도둑의 시체는 좋은 본보기였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2066bd31-5410-46ad-b4ed-8d561e149d71"
msgid ""
"Tough fighters stood guard, watching us without a trace of friendliness. But "
"once we introduced ourselves, they invited us to enter the camp and led us "
"to see their leader."
msgstr ""
"거친 전사들이 험악한 눈빛으로 보초를 서고 있습니다. 하지만 우리들이 자기소개를 하자 그들은 우리를 캠프로 들여보내주고 우두머리를 만나게 "
"해주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "008b5a98-e6ed-412f-9e3c-be459a87c6d8"
msgid ""
"Guarding the entrance was our old acquaintance Nober, the man whose group we "
"met in the hills previously. While his greeting was none too friendly, he "
"did invite us to enter and led us to meet his leader."
msgstr ""
"입구를 지키는 것은 예전에 언덕에서 보았던 노버였습니다. 그의 인사가 그리 친근하지 않았고 우리는 그를 따라 우두머리를 만나러 갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "8859deac-6819-42fb-bafa-d5b83c4ebf88"
msgid ""
"We were led to a man named Dugath, a middle-aged Kellid with a gorgeous mane "
"— once charcoal black, now salt-and-pepper — as well as bronze skin, "
"hardened by sun, wind, and time to the point that it almost looked like oak "
"bark. Speaking with assertive tones, he invited us to dine with the {g|Tiger "
"Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} — that was the name of their tribe — and spend the "
"night in their camp. Any business we might have with the tribe, he said, "
"could be discussed in the morning, once everyone was rested and refreshed."
msgstr ""
"우리는 두가스라는 남자에게로 안내되었습니다. 이 중년의 켈리드인은 갈기머리는 예전에는 칠흑처럼 검었지만 희끗해보였고 또한 햇빛에 그을린 "
"구릿빛 피부는 이제 늙은 오크나무 껍질 같았습니다. 거친 말투로 그는 우리를 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} — 그건 "
"그들 부족의 이름입니다. — 과의 저녁만찬에 초대를 했습니다. 그리고 그들에 캠프에서 하룻밤을 묵게 되었습니다. 그는 말하길 자기 부족과 "
"결정할 사업 이야기는 일단 모두 쉬고 재충전되고 난 후 아침에 다뤄질 것이라고 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "1dbd84b9-b601-4045-ad1c-ff441fc91a1e"
msgid ""
"Not wanting to offend the barbarians, who'd proven to be commendably "
"hospitable, we accepted the invitation. Within minutes, we were seated by "
"the bonfire with goblets in our hands. As guests, our goblets were wrought "
"of skillfully decorated silver, with intricate carvings depicting scenes of "
"battle."
msgstr ""
"우호적인 야만인들의 기분을 상하게 하고 싶지 않아 우리는 초대를 받아들였습니다. 잠시 뒤 우리는 손에 술잔을 들고 모닥불 주위에 "
"앉아있었습니다. 우리의 술잔에는 은으로 솜씨좋게 전투의 장면을 묘사한 조각이 새겨져 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "cfdfee85-36aa-4209-83f0-c94ba20c3bb9"
msgid ""
"\"Do as I do,\" Amiri whisper into the baron{mf||ess}'s ear. \"They really "
"care about tradition here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 하는 대로 따라해.\" 아미리는 {mf||여}남작의 귀에 대고 속삭입니다. \"그들은 전통을 매우 중요하게 생각하니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "e7159f1c-7620-436d-98e9-bef39e5b083f"
msgid ""
"\"Be on guard,\" Jubilost whispered into the baron{mf||ess}'s ear. \"These "
"savages can be extremely touchy. Follow my example, and you may avoid "
"offending them. And an offended {g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} is a bloodthirsty "
"Numerian.\""
msgstr ""
"\"조심해.\" 주빌로스트는 {mf||여}남작의 귀에 속삭입니다. \"이 야만인들은 매우 까다로우니까. 내가 하는 대로 따라하면 그들의 "
"기분을 상하게 하지는 않을 거야. 화가 난 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}은 피를 보고 마니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "eaa9010b-e688-46a1-9d30-ee61d05b4927"
msgid ""
"The cup-bearer filled everyone's goblets with wine. When Dugath raised his "
"cup, officially starting the feast, the baron{mf||ess}..."
msgstr "시종이 모두의 잔에 포도주를 따라줍니다. 두가스가 잔을 들어 건배를 하려고 하자 {mf||여}남작은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "9d46be31-a311-4677-91e2-fbd162710d0b"
msgid ""
"The {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} reacted angrily, with accusatory glances and "
"loud shouts — all of them spilled their wine on the ground."
msgstr ""
"{g|Numeria}Numerians{/g}은 험악한 눈빛과 고성을 지르며 거칠게 반응했습니다. 그들 모두 포도주를 땅에 부었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "e8f0a95e-0f18-4a7e-a80a-f156100b3d36"
msgid ""
"The {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} listened to the toast in awkward silence, but "
"when the baron{mf||ess} stopped speaking and drained {mf|his|her} goblet, "
"they burst into angry shouting — all of them spilled their wine on the "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"{g|Numeria}누메리아인들{/g}은 어색한 침묵 속에 건배사를 듣고 있었지만 {mf||여}남작이 말하는 것을 멈추고 {mf|그|그녀}"
"의 잔을 비우자 그들은 화를 내며 소리쳤습니다. 그들 모두 포도주를 땅에 부었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "9e72b273-6068-4b5e-be2b-620a51242890"
msgid ""
"Looking at the baron{mf||ess} with respect, the {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} "
"spilled their wine, too."
msgstr "{mf||여}남작을 존중의 눈빛으로 바라보면서 {g|Numeria}누메리아인{/g}들도 포도주를 부었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "6a2c8cd6-2bf8-4853-8af9-83879f637611"
msgid ""
"To my utter surprise, our barbarian friend spilled her wine on the ground, "
"and the baron{mf||ess} followed her example. I thought the "
"{g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} would be enraged, but they all followed suit."
msgstr ""
"놀랍게도 우리 야만인 친구는 그녀의 포도주를 땅에 부었고 {mf||여}남작도 그녀를 따라했습니다. 그것은 "
"{g|Numeria}누메리안인{/g}들을 화나게 할 것 같았지만 그들도 모두 똑같이 따라했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "48152cbf-20ae-4575-84f5-dc1fbd900328"
msgid ""
"To my utter surprise, our gnome friend spilled his wine on the ground, and "
"the baron{mf||ess} followed his example. I thought the "
"{g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} would be enraged, but they all followed suit."
msgstr ""
"놀랍게도 우리의 노움 친구는 포도주를 땅에 엎질렀고 {mf||여}남작도 그를 따라했습니다. 그 행동은 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}"
"인들을 화나게 할 것 같았지만 그들도 모두 똑같이 따라했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "5f8685ab-fc4b-4cce-bfa2-e387d404ab36"
msgid ""
"It was apparently a barbarian tradition — offering the first cup to the "
"spirits. Only after the cup-bearer filled their goblets again did the "
"{g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} start to drink, and so did we."
msgstr ""
"그것은 명백히 야만인의 전통이었습니다. 첫번째 잔은 혼령들을 위한 것이었습니다. 시중이 포도주를 그들의 잔에 다시 따라주자 "
"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}인들은 마시기 시작했고 우리도 같이 마셨습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "518d3709-a1f2-4cc3-87eb-397e66c3963b"
msgid ""
"The main course, unsurprisingly, was meat. While hunting in the hills, the "
"{g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} had killed a deer and two wild boars, all now "
"roasting over an open fire. As the tribe's guests, we were offered the best "
"pieces. Fierce in battle, the Numerians were equally fierce at the table — "
"they frantically tore the meat apart with knives, bare hands, and teeth, as "
"though attacking the throats of their worst enemies rather than eating roast "
"venison. Only one camp inhabitant didn't join the dinner. Far from the "
"festivities, a slim woman wrapped in a gray cloak sat alone, her face hidden "
"behind a piece of cloth. She was so quiet and still, at first I didn't "
"realize she was a living being at all. The baron{mf||ess}..."
msgstr ""
"예상했던대로 메인 요리는 고기였습니다. 언덕에서 사냥을 할 때 누메리아인은 사슴 한 마리와 멧돼지 두 마리를 잡았고 지금은 화로에 굽고 "
"있습니다. 부족의 손님인 우리는 가장 맛있는 부위를 받았습니다. 전투에서 맹렬한 누메리아인은 식사를 할 때도 맹렬했습니다. 그들은 마치 "
"강한 적의 목을 노리듯이 미친듯이 고기를 나이프로 썰거나 손으로 뜯어서 넘겼습니다. 오직 캠프의 한사람이 만찬에 참가하지 않았습니다. "
"식사와 상관 없이 회색 망토를 두르고 앉아있는 날씬한 여인은 얼굴을 천 한장으로 가렸습니다. 그녀는 너무나 조용하고 움직임이 없어서 "
"처음에 봤을 때는 살아있는 것인지도 몰랐습니다. 그리고 {mf||여}남작은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "92521d2b-7f89-461c-ab96-1d2c81062b64"
msgid ""
"The woman just shook her head, but Dugath was furious. \"I would never share "
"a meal with that witch! Her very presence would sour the wine in an instant!"
"\" As he continued raving, one of the barbarians explained to us that the "
"woman was one of the Defaced Sisters — half priestess, half wizard. While "
"they may travel along with the {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g}, they never ate at "
"the same table."
msgstr ""
"여자는 머리를 흔들었지만 두가스는 화가 났습니다. \"나는 저 마녀와 결코 한번이라도 같이 식사를 하지 않을 것이네! 그녀가 존재하는 "
"것만으로도 포도주가 시어져!\" 그가 계속해서 화를 내자 야만인 한명이 저 여성은 반은 사제고 반은 마법사인 얼굴 잃은 자매들라고 "
"설명했습니다. {g|Numeria}누메리아인{/g}들과 여행을 할 때 그들은 한번도 식사를 같이 하지 않았던 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "0f0e0e8f-9496-4d29-bced-2a933657c725"
msgid ""
"Glancing cautiously between Dugath and the woman, one {g|Numeria}Numerian{/g}"
" explained that the woman was one of the Defaced Sisters — half priestess, "
"half wizard. While they may travel along with the Numerians, they never ate "
"at the same table."
msgstr ""
"조심스럽게 두가스와 여성 사이를 번갈아보던 누메리아인이 저 여성은 반은 사제고 반은 마법사인 얼굴 잃은 자매들라고 설명했습니다. 그들과 "
"여행을 할 때 그들은 한번도 식사를 같이 하지 않았던 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "67150229-b803-45bc-a6fb-6887f878c9e4"
msgid ""
"Judging by the tones the barbarians used when speaking of the woman, it was "
"easy to tell that none of them held any warm feelings toward these Defaced "
"Sisters."
msgstr "야만인이 저 여성을 설명하는 목소리를 듣건데 그들 중 누구도 얼굴 잃은 자매를 좋아하지 않는 것이 분명했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "b6ba10cf-15db-4670-a36f-77286afb74ef"
msgid ""
"After everyone had eaten their fill, it was time for entertainment. The "
"barbarians began singing a drawling song in their guttural language, known "
"as Hallit. Later, one of the {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} explained that it was "
"a ballad about a brother and sister who defeated a huge metal spider. The "
"song that followed was a comedic piece about the adventures of a stupid "
"werewolf. The Numerians all sang it together — it was clear that each of "
"them knew that one by heart."
msgstr ""
"저녁을 모두 먹고 난 후에 남은 것은 오락거리였습니다. 야만인은 할리트라고 알려진 그들의 언어로 노래를 부르기 시작했습니다. "
"{g|Numeria}누메리아인{/g} 중 한명이 그 노래는 거대한 강철 거미를 무찌른 남매에 관한 노래라고 설명했습니다. 이어진 노래는 "
"멍청한 웨어울프의 여행을 우스꽝스럽게 묘사한 노래였습니다. 누메리아인은 한마음이 되어 함께 노래를 불렀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "cf1150b9-8238-46d9-ba37-eac2241c12c0"
msgid ""
"Most everybody clapped to the rhythm, though some thumped their knife "
"handles on their shields, and one skilled person accompanied the song on a "
"vargan."
msgstr "대부분이 리듬에 따라 박수를 쳤지만 일부는 나이프 손잡이를 방패에 두들겼고 한사람은 악기를 능숙하게 연주했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "462cba2d-ba9f-4ed2-8ffd-610de9a22037"
msgid ""
"Almost everybody clapped to the rhythm, though some thumped their knife "
"handles on their shields, and our half-orc acquaintance Bolga accompanied "
"the song on a vargan."
msgstr "대부분이 리듬에 따라 박수를 쳤지만 일부는 나이프 손잡이를 방패에 두들겼고 우리의 하프오크는 악기를 연주하기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "498d62b9-98b6-43e2-aaae-b9340ef124cb"
msgid ""
"Most everybody clapped to the rhythm, though some thumped their knife "
"handles on their shields."
msgstr "대부분이 리듬에 따라 박수를 쳤지만 일부는 나이프 손잡이를 방패에 두들겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "4fa5d3f8-c781-4a7f-9bbf-7061592b38bd"
msgid ""
"Once the song was over, Dugath appealed to his guests, us, to surprise our "
"hosts. The baron{mf||ess} decided our best choice would be..."
msgstr "노래 한 곡이 끝나고 두가스는 손님인 우리에게 장기를 보여달라고 청했습니다. 그래서 당신의 최선의 선택은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "33e7414f-69f3-400a-9d89-b03a45ba766b"
msgid ""
"Our tale of battle and heroic deeds was just what the barbarians were "
"looking for. They listened eagerly, chimed in on each detail, and laughed "
"and clapped at the most epic moments. Even Dugath found himself smiling and "
"nodding as he listened to our story."
msgstr ""
"우리의 영웅담은 야만인들이 찾던 그것이었습니다. 그들은 귀를 기울여서 들었고 가장 흥미로운 부분에서 웃으며 박수를 쳤습니다. 두가스조차 "
"웃음을 짓고 고개를 끄덕이며 이야기를 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "f261e2a1-a6d7-496a-aaae-177cfe44e1e4"
msgid ""
"Alas, the story of our deeds wasn't as impressive as the barbarians would "
"have hoped — though the events themselves were glorious, the story "
"surrounding them proved to be boring, messy, and overcomplicated."
msgstr ""
"아아 우리 이야기는 야만인이 바라던 것 만큼은 아니었습니다. 전투는 영광스러웠더라도 그것을 묘사한 이야기는 지겹고 지저분하고 복잡했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "7b3d0353-e33a-4434-b7fc-8edd7d01ab58"
msgid ""
"The {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} have a great respect for brute force, and not "
"many things impress them more than its demonstration. I witnessed the "
"barbarians roar in delight as {Name} stood in triumph, shaking {mf|his|her} "
"fists over a defeated barbarian lying in the dust. Even Dugath nodded in "
"approval, clapping his hands after watching the fight."
msgstr ""
"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}인들은 강력한 힘을 매우 존중하며, 그들에게 인상을 주려면 실제로 보여주는것이 가장 좋습니다. "
"{Name}이(가) 바닥에 때려 눕혀진 패배자 바바리안의 위로 주먹을 흔들며 {mf|그|그녀}의 승리를 보이자 바바리안들이 열광했습니다. "
"심지어는 두가스조차 싸움을 구경한 후 고개를 끄덕이며 박수를 쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "a6ca651b-46e7-4d72-885d-ec7a173b6c74"
msgid ""
"The {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} despise weakness, even during a friendly "
"sparring match. I witnessed the audience roar in delight as the barbarian "
"stood with fists raised in triumph above {Name}, now lying defeated and "
"helpless in the dust."
msgstr ""
"{g|Numeria}누메리아인들{/g}은 친선 경기에서조차 약자를 경멸했습니다. 야만인이 {Name}을(를) 쓰러뜨리고 승리에 취해 "
"주먹을 치켜올리자 관중들이 환호했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "dca9a441-8529-4650-aae1-74a8769bae1b"
msgid ""
"If there's one thing the {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} like more than a good "
"fight, it's a good song. Though they didn't know the words, they started "
"clapping to the music. Even Dugath smiled as he listened."
msgstr ""
"{g|Numeria}Numerians{/g}이 싸움보다 더 좋아하는 것이 있다면 노래였습니다. 그들은 가사를 몰랐지만 노래에 맞춰 손뼉을 "
"쳤습니다. 두가스조차 노래를 들으며 웃음지었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "67f3b137-968d-4f86-b199-4eee485a1ff2"
msgid ""
"It was a terrible mistake. Turns out, {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} have a strong "
"distaste for magic — they would tolerate it in battle, but at the feast, it "
"just spoiled their appetites. Instead of applause, the barbarians reacted to "
"our show with boos, hissing, and angry shouts."
msgstr ""
"그것은 끔찍한 실수였습니다. 누메리아인들은 마법을 혐오했고 전투에서는 참았을지라도 연회에서는 그들의 입맛을 버렸습니다. 박수 대신에 "
"야만인들은 우리의 쇼에 야유를 보냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/BookEvent_Hospitality/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "e3012823-0624-4565-b0db-738e8642468e"
msgid ""
"Finally, the drinking and singing came to an end. Only bones remained from "
"the feast, and the bonfire had burned down to ash. Satisfied, the "
"{g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} retired to their tents."
msgstr ""
"마침내 술마시고 노래하는 것은 끝이 났습니다. 연회에 남은 것은 뼛조각들과 재가 되어버린 캠프 파이어였습니다. "
"{g|Numeria}누마리아인들{/g}은 만족하며 그들의 천막으로 돌아갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "2c0b8199-4c38-41db-b923-256b0fdde69c"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "390f75f4-5e49-41ba-b48c-2df6943e0a5c"
msgid "\"What were you and Dugath arguing about?\""
msgstr "\"왜 두가스와 말싸움을 하고 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d0d7abe5-9105-4f58-93f0-2a443f525ac6"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a82d51b4-c623-404a-a5ce-f07fe275beed"
msgid "\"Do you have any idea where your Sisters might be?\""
msgstr "\"자매들이 어디에 있는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "57778bf9-a96a-4cae-bc43-46bab049f7b9"
msgid "\"What are you looking for here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭘 찾고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "818cbc4a-dbbd-47ce-bd8d-06781d63d553"
msgid "\"You speak in riddles.\""
msgstr "\"수수께끼 같은 말을 하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "e6220616-8c52-4c5b-b18c-8b1fbdd1b193"
msgid "\"Do you know anything about what happened in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에서 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "402a8aac-1c08-4a28-b050-ce1dc5883c54"
msgid "\"What compensation can I expect for my help?\""
msgstr "\"내가 도와주면 어떤 보상을 받을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "abb39be0-a8ab-445f-a6ec-225a3ee776cb"
msgid "\"Tell me about Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에 대해서 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "a43d5e2a-048e-4a5a-8d17-0b06be2b9103"
msgid "\"Tell me about Armag.\""
msgstr "\"아르막에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "6313bc72-9e48-4df2-afc9-6e556e63fedf"
msgid "\"My name is {name}. What's yours?\""
msgstr "\"나는 {name}다. 당신은?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "d68f6baf-8515-4c94-952a-2d4585cf8919"
msgid "\"You don't need to know my name.\""
msgstr "\"내 이름을 알 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "a23fee1f-79ac-41c3-a19b-deedee55f166"
msgid "\"I found your Sister in the Forsaken Mound.\""
msgstr "\"너희 자매를 버려진 흙무덤에서 발견했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "b028d313-35d2-4f57-8ed1-668f044cf972"
msgid "\"I found your Sister in the City of Hollow Eyes.\""
msgstr "\"너희 자매를 텅 빈 눈의 도시에서 발견했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "04921c20-f3f2-4c36-b0af-fd4cc26581d0"
msgid "\"I found your Sister in the Sepulcher of Forgotten Heroes.\""
msgstr "\"너희 자매를 잊혀진 영웅들의 묘소에서 발견했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0036_Text_String
msgctxt "267164e7-6bb2-426b-9d82-081f38de264e"
msgid "\"She's alive and well. She'll return to the camp soon.\""
msgstr "\"자매분은 무사합니다. 곧 야영지에 도착할 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0038_Text_String
msgctxt "7a128974-74b2-4278-8e5e-323eafaac0dc"
msgid "\"She was already dead when I found her.\""
msgstr "\"내가 그녀를 발견했을 때 이미 죽어 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0039_Text_String
msgctxt "7c1370f0-c877-4a48-bd68-ceda2882253f"
msgid "\"I killed her with my own hands.\""
msgstr "\"내 손으로 그녀를 죽였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "8101e886-97e4-4d2a-a4d6-6f687ec7d443"
msgid ""
"\"She's alive and well, and she'll return soon. She asked me to give you "
"this incense burner.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 살아있고, 곧 돌아올 겁니다. 당신에게 이 향로를 전해 주라더군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "d6f5e7e2-32b2-4d55-9bd7-67a35c06903a"
msgid "\"You have a whole army here. How did you manage to get this far?\""
msgstr "\"전 병력이 여기에 있군. 어떻게 그렇게 멀리서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "e21520f0-e671-4708-b73f-9f88cc893858"
msgid ""
"{n}A slim figure stands eerily still, wrapped in a cloak and hiding her face "
"in her hands. If you hadn't seen her moving before, you could easily mistake "
"her for a statue. However, as you approach, she lowers her hands from her "
"face, and golden-green eyes peer at you through the holes in the cloth "
"covering her face.{/n} \"You... Our guest. The {mf|baron|baroness} of "
"{kingdomname}, am I right? I'm sorry you witnessed that unpleasant scene. If "
"I may ask, what is your name?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}날씬해 보이는 여자가 망또를 두르고 손으로 얼굴을 가린 채 으스스한 분위기를 풍기며 서있었습니다. 그녀가 움직이는 것을 보지 "
"못했다면 조각상인 줄 알았을 것입니다. 그러나 당신이 접근하자 그녀는 얼굴에서 손을 내렸고 얼굴을 가린 천의 틈 사이로 황금빛과 초록빛이 "
"섞인 그녀의 눈동자가 보입니다. {/n} \"너는... 우리의 손님이다. {kingdomname}의 지도자가 맞겠지? 불편한 장면을 "
"보여주게 되어 미안하군. 네 이름을 물어보아도 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "db3b496a-49d1-4679-be85-9797c43aefbb"
msgid ""
"{n}The Defaced Sister stands still, only her golden-green eyes follow you "
"through the holes in the cloth that covers her face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}얼굴 잃은 자매는 여전히 서있었고 그녀의 얼굴을 가린 천의 틈 사이로 황록색의 눈동자는 당신을 보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "7f6f906c-e250-42f5-8107-19407f05ef17"
msgid ""
"\"I'm one of those who call themselves the Defaced Sisters. We've rejected "
"our names and our faces in service to benevolent spirits. I'm sorry that I "
"can't reveal our true destiny to you yet — but believe me when I say our "
"mission is extremely important. Not just for us, not just for the tribe, but "
"for the entire world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 얼굴 잃은 자매들이다. 우리는 자비로운 영혼을 받들기 위해 이름과 얼굴을 버렸지. 너에게 우리의 진짜 운명을 말해주지 못해 "
"미안하다. 하지만 우리의 임무가 매우 중요한 것임을 믿어야 한다. 우리나 부족을 위한 것이 아니라 세계를 위한 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "6c8555a6-3a7f-4974-b468-46396091ab40"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman lowers her head.{/n} \"My Sisters... They each went out on "
"their own quests and never returned — not one of the three. I can understand "
"Dugath — he doesn't trust us. But by refusing to help my sisters and me, he "
"puts himself, his people, and countless innocent souls in grave danger. If "
"only I could soften his impenitent heart...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여성이 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"다른 자매는... 각자 임무를 위해 떠났지만 다시는 돌아오지 못했다. 두가스를 이해하지 못하는 "
"것도 아니다. 그는 우리를 믿지 않아. 하지만 우리 자매를 도와주지 않아서 자기 부족과 스스로를 죽음의 위협으로 몰아가고 있다. 그의 "
"고집을 꺾을 수만 있었다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "628c70aa-7c5b-4788-b69c-2ba4f8be9557"
msgid ""
"\"Do you have a map? I can provide you some direction. One of my Sisters "
"went to the {g|Sepulcher of Forgotten Heroes}Sepulcher of Forgotten "
"Heroes{/g}. Another went looking for the {g|Forsaken Mound}Forsaken Mound{/g}"
". And the third was going to visit the ruins of the {g|City of the Hollow "
"Eyes}City of Hollow Eyes{/g}. I won't lie, these places are all very "
"dangerous — but searching for lost truth always involves danger.\" {n}The "
"woman marks the locations on your map.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"지도를 갖고 있어? 내가 방향을 알려주지. 우리 자매 중 한 명은 {g|Sepulcher of Forgotten Heroes}잊혀진 "
"영웅들의 묘소{/g}로 갔다. 다른 하나는 {g|Forsaken Mound}버려진 흙무덤{/g}으로 갔어. 그리고 셋째는 {g|City "
"of the Hollow Eyes}텅 빈 눈의 도시{/g}의 폐허로 갔지. 모두 아주 위험한 장소지만 잊혀진 진실을 찾는 일은 언제나 "
"위험이 따르는 것이 사실이지.\" {n}여성은 지도에서 장소를 표시해줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "50d1759b-89c0-465c-a736-5d4b19096fc4"
msgid ""
"\"It is not yet time to answer this question. We're searching for ancient "
"ruins, the remains of structures built by the previous holders of these "
"strange lands — that's all I can tell you for now. I understand that you "
"want to know more, but have no doubt — you will in time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 질문에 대답할 시간은 아닌 것 같군. 우리는 이 이상한 대륙을 지배하던 자들이 세운 구조물과 고대의 유적을 찾고 있다. 그것이 "
"내가 말할 수 있는 전부야. 네가 궁금한 것도 이해가 가지만 머지 않아 너도 알게 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "16546dcc-06cc-4996-85d8-4ae3bbd47255"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be wary of riddles. Those wise enough to solve them eventually learn "
"much more than those who always seek straight answers.\""
msgstr "\"수수께끼를 풀어라. 그것을 푸는 자들은 구하고자 하는 답보다 많은 것을 알게될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "9dcd5edc-5e16-4449-a41b-921f69439eed"
msgid ""
"\"Dark things tend to happen in that land. I can only guess to the fate of "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}. My three Sisters know more. Help me find them, and "
"you'll get your answers — if the spirits are kind, it will happen before "
"it's too late.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 땅에 어둠이 오고 있다. {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}의 운명이 보여. 내 자매들은 더 많은 것을 알고 있다. 그들을 찾게 "
"도우면 너도 답을 얻을 것이야. 그 일이 일어나는 것은 그리 오래 걸리지 않을 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "55d92d51-696e-45b1-9d54-6121f3cf3d34"
msgid "\"With the most valuable treasure of all — truth.\""
msgstr "\"가장 가치 있는 보물은 진실이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "ba83f3e2-948f-41ae-8e71-b1b027110e88"
msgid "\"May kind spirits guide you in your travels.\""
msgstr "\"영혼이 네 여행길을 인도하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "280757b2-ae06-499c-8b03-f5509772815f"
msgid ""
"\"These are enigmatic lands — stars rain from the sky, soil bleeds fire and "
"gives birth to metal instead of grass... These are lands of mysteries and "
"nightmares — but they're destined to become the salvation of us all, for "
"that's where great Armag lived, died, and rose again, and he will bring "
"redemption for us all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 불가사의한 땅이다. 하늘에서 별이 비처럼 쏟아지고 땅은 불을 뿜어대고는 잔디풀 대신에 쇠를 만들어냈지... 이곳은 비밀과 "
"악몽이 가득한 땅이다. 하지만 결국 우리를 구원하는 곳이 될 운명이어서 아르막이 살았고, 죽었고 그리고 다시 되살아나 우리 모두에게 "
"구원을 가져올 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "a2f2ddce-1331-481b-8195-a4c039743dae"
msgid ""
"\"He's a man of great destiny. The gods themselves tried to lay him low, but "
"he came back, defied death itself, as was foretold, for that was his fate. "
"He's destined to save many, many lives, but at terrible cost to himself. I "
"would never wish a fate like that on you, Baron{mf||ess}. I would never wish "
"a fate like that on anyone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 위대한 운명을 가진 남자다. 신은 그를 쓰러뜨리려 했지만 그는 예언대로 죽음을 거부해서 운명을 거슬렀다. 그는 많은 생명을 "
"구하게 될 것이지만 그에게는 끔찍한 대가가 기다린다. 너에게는 그런 운명이 오지 않는 것이 좋겠지. 누구도 그런 운명을 가져서는 안된다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "07abada3-1635-4f9e-9a6d-ca82cc301693"
msgid ""
"\"Nice to meet you, Baron{mf||ess}. I have no name. I've rejected it to "
"serve benevolent powers — not the greatest sacrifice of those we're "
"sometimes called to make. You may call me Defaced Sister.\""
msgstr ""
"\"반갑구나, {mf||여}남작. 나는 이름이 없다. 나는 자비로운 힘을 위해 이름을 버렸지. 하지만 우리가 위대한 희생이라고 부를 만한 "
"것은 아니다. 나를 얼굴 잃은 자매라고 불러도 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "a1be2508-85f0-463e-b3be-f964385afcf2"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman nods.{/n} \"So be it. Everyone has their secrets, "
"Baron{mf||ess}.\""
msgstr "{n}여성은 얼굴을 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"좋아. 비밀이 없는 자는 없지, {mf||여}남작.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "4af29f4a-69f0-43e3-861a-17f51fdafe79"
msgid ""
"{n}After you give your name, a large raven who'd been sitting on the fence "
"nearby takes wing and flies away, cawing coarsely.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 이름을 말해주자 주위 담장 위에 앉아있던 까마귀가 날개를 펼치고 날아가며 울었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "4166ce95-f304-435b-9ff2-97ff5aa182b1"
msgid "\"I thank you. How is she? Where is she?\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 그녀는 어때? 어디에 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "eee24e5e-9a95-4de7-9265-02885c62ff95"
msgid "\"Good spirits be praised! Where is she?\""
msgstr "\"영혼이 인도를 했구나! 그녀는 어디에 있는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "0299ed3b-f435-4a3e-b7d0-e53fbbc6f3c4"
msgid "\"Thank you for your help. I hope she's all right?\""
msgstr "\"도와줘서 고마워. 그녀는 괜찮을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "073d9771-0d16-4d6b-a015-d6f119490c64"
msgid "\"I'm so glad! I knew I shouldn't lose hope!\""
msgstr "\"다행이구나! 희망을 버리지 않아서 기쁘다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "fee0344e-da86-4fe1-ade6-a1c66300dd5d"
msgid "\"Grave news, indeed. May the kind spirits save her soul.\""
msgstr "\"안타깝군. 영혼이 그녀를 받아들이길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "fe159639-9c2f-41d5-9ad3-6a1d819c2aa4"
msgid ""
"\"You... You've committed a terrible crime — and made an even more terrible "
"mistake.\""
msgstr "\"너... 너는 끔찍한 죄를 저지르는 것도 모자라 엄청난 실수를 저질렀구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "669d9883-9538-4593-9dc7-f46925c6487f"
msgid "\"I can't wait to see her again. Oh, Sister, please hurry!\""
msgstr "\"그녀를 어서 보고싶다. 어서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "21246ca5-4838-4e9a-8742-937c8126bc3b"
msgid "\"My poor Sister... I won't let her sacrifice be in vain.\""
msgstr "\"내 불쌍한 자매... 그녀의 희생을 헛되이 하지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "c9f1a814-c7b6-48a6-9cda-61e22037204d"
msgid ""
"\"How could you! You have no idea of the horrible dangers you've brought on "
"your head — on the heads of us all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"How could you! You have no idea of the horrible dangers you've brought on "
"your head - on the heads of us all!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "8c5ef7b2-0455-41a3-8bfe-eb5d13930b6a"
msgid "\"May the kind spirits guard her path.\""
msgstr "\"영혼이 그녀의 길을 인도하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "a93601ed-ed8b-44c8-924a-72e394b21ddc"
msgid ""
"\"Such a tragedy... Alas, sometimes serving the good demands the ultimate "
"sacrifice of us.\""
msgstr "\"끔찍한 일이다... 선을 받든다는 것은 때때로 희생을 요구하기도 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "a8f0efdc-4dfe-479c-b545-18987f767529"
msgid "\"Oh, spirits... You've no idea what you're doing!\""
msgstr "\"영혼이시여... 이렇게 끔찍한 일을 맞게 하다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "3940ecdd-6176-4ec6-b957-a6911b0f6982"
msgid "\"She's back already. I can't thank you enough.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 이미 돌아왔다. 고맙다는 말이 부족하구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "4ac99863-d0e4-4beb-849a-d70671d2442d"
msgid "\"You have my thanks. I was so happy to see her alive and well!\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 그녀를 살아서 보게 되어 기쁘다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "91227ae8-c2f4-49df-b19a-df0305bf8e96"
msgid ""
"\"If in your travels you meet my Sisters, please help them. And I will help "
"you in return. Remember this word: \"kheb.\" That is what the previous "
"inhabitants of these lands, the cyclopes, called darkness they so "
"worshipped... If a door, shut and lockless, bars your path — this word might "
"be your key.\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약 내 자매를 만난다면 그들을 도와줘. 그러면 보답으로 너를 도우마. 이 단어를 기억해: \"크헵\". 그것은 과거에 이 땅에 살던 "
"사이클롭스들이 숭배하던 악의 이름이다... 문이 굳게 닫힌 채로 너의 길을 막을 때 이 말이 너를 도울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "7dd8bae9-6822-437a-81d0-0734e1a87163"
msgid ""
"\"That's strange... What could keep her away for so long? I suppose it is no "
"matter. I'm just happy to know she's all right. Thank you for taking care of "
"her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상하군... 어째서 그녀는 그렇게 오래 있었지? 상관 없을 것 같다. 그녀가 괜찮은 걸로도 다행이야. 그녀를 돌봐주어 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "527a4645-a300-43f3-8adf-98a6bd6d95a9"
msgid ""
"\"Wise ones know many routes that are closed to the uninitiated... Will you "
"be able to detect them? Will you dare to walk along them? Who knows...\""
msgstr ""
"\"현명한 자는 막힌 곳과 가까운 길을 많이 알고 있지... 너는 그것들을 찾을 수 있을까? 그 길들을 피하며 갈 수 있을까? 누가 "
"알겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a34aab6e-88a6-44b7-8b2a-b1f889836b87"
msgid "\"So honorable! Do these benevolent spirits have names?\""
msgstr "\"영광스러울수가! 그 자비로운 영혼들은 이름이 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : BarbarianCamp_YoungerSister
msgctxt "e4b95472-545c-4e58-8e42-dee215362ae2"
msgid ""
"\"Do not burden yourself with idle questions, cleric. Know that all the "
"truths you are seeking for will find you — but only when you are ready for "
"them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어리석은 질문들로 자신에게 부담지우지 말아라. 성직자여. 네가 탐구하는 모든 진실들이 너를 찾게 될 것이란 걸 알아라. 하지만 네가 "
"준비되어 있을 때에만이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a7832651-b8c3-4271-bd8c-b2e191d86a19"
msgid ""
"\"How is this possible? Doesn't this army know any kind of order or "
"discipline? How do they manage to even fight in such chaos?\""
msgstr "\"그게 어떻게 가능하지? 이 군대는 명령체계가 없는 거야? 난전 속에서 어떻게 싸울지는 알고 있는 걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f3472ab1-a230-4e6d-8fed-cc345b715851"
msgid ""
"\"There are many songs about Armag, not all of them {g|Numeria}Numerian{/g}. "
"Some see his story as an inspiration, other as a warning against the dangers "
"of hubris... But I've never heard about any prophecy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아르막에 관해 많은 노래가 있지만 해석이 모두 달라. 누군가는 본받을 만한 역사로 받아들이지만 다른 사람들은 오만함에 대한 경계로 "
"해석하기도 하지... 하지만 예언에 관해서는 들은 게 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a8f887c5-8084-4c06-b3ad-708f66efe762"
msgid ""
"\"Such wise, enlightened words! People who talk like this are usually trying "
"to swindle you out of your purse!\""
msgstr "\"참 고상하기도 하지! 이렇게 말하는 사람들은 종종 네 주머니를 털려는 사람들이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Sister_FirstDialog/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2a4fb642-2fce-4893-9966-c832bc85b704"
msgid ""
"\"To challenge the {g|Pharasma}Lady of Graves{/g}, and win with no magic... "
"I guess, there are humans who deserve to be called heroes, after all.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Pharasma}무덤의 여인{/g}에게 대항하고 마법 없이 이기는 것은... 영웅이라고 불릴 만하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Vendor/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "1413125e-d2cc-48dd-9dc7-85c52dc9425e"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Vendor/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a19233d2-53fd-48c8-8821-b8d0a84e4725"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Vendor/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7fb21714-fa2a-45a6-a73d-c3cfa10a0550"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Vendor/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f6097839-ed49-45c8-b0a3-ef3d1386705a"
msgid "[Pay 23 gold] \"I'd like to spend the night here.\""
msgstr "[23골드를 지불합니다] \"여기서 숙박하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Vendor/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "5efd67d4-ab22-43d6-b39e-7762ffd1fb0e"
msgid ""
"{n}An elderly barbarian waves his hand, inviting you to come closer.{/n} "
"\"Welcome, honored guest! Would you like to buy or sell anything?\""
msgstr "{n}나이 든 야만인이 손을 흔들며 당신을 맞습니다.{/n} \"어서오게. 무언가를 팔거나 사고 싶은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Vendor/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "c56060b0-24e1-4989-bd99-cfd73814589d"
msgid ""
"\"Name's Dug. Was a hell of a fighter when I was younger, but truth, those "
"years pass before you know it. The health, too.\" {n}The barbarian raises "
"his hand, and you can see he only has two fingers left.{/n} \"So now my job "
"is equipment and provisions, along with a bit of trading from time to time.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이름은 더그다. 어렸을 때는 거친 전사였지만 그건 오래 전의 일이지. 몸도 예전 같지 않아.\" {n}야만인은 손을 들었는데 손가락이 "
"두 개 밖에 남지 않았습니다.{/n} \"지금은 장비류와 도구 등을 팔고 가끔 교역을 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BarbarianMainCamp/Vendor/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "d3f7eb0f-c87a-4236-8770-832e56567077"
msgid "{n}The aged barbarian gives you a hospitable nod.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}나이 든 야만인은 당신에게 친근하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/BloodWriting_String_1
msgctxt "4b7e153e-86af-4329-af46-dab8f96f4317"
msgid ""
"The inscription on the stone is made with blood. The text says:\n"
"\"Running is no help.\n"
"The grass betrays.\n"
"Stay with me — better die, than become food for...\""
msgstr ""
"돌에 쓰여진 글자는 피로 쓰여졌습니다.\n"
"\"도망은 도움이 되지 않는다.\n"
"풀이 배신했다.\n"
"나와 함께 죽는 것이 낫다. 먹이가 될 바에...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/DeadBarbarian_String_1
msgctxt "0fc62566-6844-4d0a-8636-340d74d63ec0"
msgid ""
"The barbarian seems to have died from massive blood loss. Horrible wounds "
"cover his body, though his hand is still clutching a knife."
msgstr "야만인은 과다출혈로 죽은 것 같습니다. 끔찍한 상처가 그의 몸을 뒤덮었지만 그의 손은 여전히 칼을 쥐고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/DeadHorse1_String_1
msgctxt "4d879418-457a-4570-b840-7ff7e9ffbd6d"
msgid ""
"It looks like this horse fell while trying to climb the rock. It must have "
"been terrified to attempt such a thing."
msgstr "말이 바위를 기어오르려다 추락한 것 같습니다. 그런 시도를 했으니 겁을 먹었을 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/DeadHorse2_String_1
msgctxt "dc72e10a-fd1c-4bdb-a166-a299752fa96b"
msgid ""
"The horse's legs are covered with deep wounds — they seem to be bite marks. "
"But the animal died by human hands — its throat has been neatly slit."
msgstr "말의 다리는 깊은 상처가 나있습니다. 그것은 물린 자국입니다. 하지만 그 동물은 인간의 칼에 의해 목을 베여 죽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/Furrow_String_1
msgctxt "f7f5b3ab-5873-4ebe-8b95-fb8220f8255d"
msgid ""
"Deep furrows mar the grass in the area, as if a huge plow had been put to "
"work here."
msgstr "누군가 커다란 쟁기로 풀밭에 깊은 밭고랑을 팠습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/Knowledge_check_passed(horse)_String_1
msgctxt "3ec049a3-c638-4b25-8ec1-783d305e4b4f"
msgid ""
"The horse died from a neatly slit throat, probably made with a sharp blade. "
"But its body is also covered with deep wounds that resemble huge bite marks. "
"That combined with the furrows on the ground leads you to one conclusion — "
"you've entered a bulette's hunting grounds. The underground monster must "
"still be somewhere nearby."
msgstr ""
"말의 목은 깔끔하게 베여졌고 아마 날카로운 칼에 죽은 듯합니다. 하지만 시체는 거대한 입에 의해 물린 자국이 보입니다. 땅에 깊게 패인 "
"자국을 따라간 후 당신은 결론을 내립니다. 당신은 bulette의 사냥터에 왔습니다. 지하에 사는 이 괴물은 여전히 어딘가에 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/Knowledge_check_passed_String_1
msgctxt "d193f915-5513-4228-922c-71d676a9ae38"
msgid ""
"The bite marks, combined with the furrows on the ground, lead you to one "
"conclusion — you've entered a bulette's hunting grounds. The underground "
"monster must still be somewhere nearby."
msgstr ""
"물린 자국과 땅에 깊게 패인 자국으로 본 후 당신은 결론을 내립니다. 당신은 bulette의 사냥터에 왔습니다. 지하에 사는 이 괴물은 "
"여전히 어딘가에 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/Sinkhole_perceptioncheck_failed_String_1
msgctxt "bd4a64fa-5d6d-485b-85e9-aa7c5a392668"
msgid "The deep hole in the ground was obviously made recently."
msgstr "최근에 만들어진 것이 분명한 깊은 구멍이 땅에 파여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BloodFurrows/Barks/Sinkhole_perceptioncheck_passed_String_1
msgctxt "bb93bc48-7175-4dbb-8fff-05a3b9ddb3a6"
msgid ""
"There's a deep hole in the ground, made recently. At the bottom, you can see "
"a pile of bloody rags that look like the remnants of some barbarian's "
"clothes."
msgstr ""
"최근에 만들어진 것이 분명한 깊은 구멍이 땅에 파여있습니다. 그 바닥에서, 당신은 어떤 야만인의 옷 조각으로 보이는 것 같은 피로 물든 "
"넝마 더미를 볼 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "fdb1b613-15b7-4e21-b9ee-e6d75c0b36b1"
msgid "We said the word given to us by the Defaced Sister."
msgstr "우리는 얼굴 잃은 자매가 알려준 말을 내뱉었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "18445dec-b798-4bbb-b8a2-498b65e22b0b"
msgid "[Enter]"
msgstr "[들어간다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3b24957d-c1c5-4b88-bdb4-348bafe36c5a"
msgid "We marked the place and left."
msgstr "우리는 장소에 표시를 하고 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "c543fa65-9a6c-43a5-be5a-8b43037b69fc"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠난다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "ecffca4a-6367-484d-a458-e9c85300b015"
msgid "...examined the body of the Sister."
msgstr "...자매의 시체를 조사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "8c539238-9af1-4add-91cd-46b70d3c1010"
msgid "...took the incense burner and left the tomb."
msgstr "...향로를 가지고 무덤을 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "5829e6cf-4b68-41b8-b667-ee07ba1f4e76"
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[계속하기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "ad0e486a-8ebf-49f2-8afe-5ece8fba9ade"
msgid "...moved ahead down the corridor."
msgstr "...복도를 따라 내려갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "1ec4887d-583f-4d9b-9ea2-bd0e04ce6a31"
msgid "...carefully examined the mold on the walls."
msgstr "...조심스럽게 벽에 핀 곰팡이를 조사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "ff817a89-d561-4e60-9f71-cfb678ea6e8f"
msgid "...checked the corridor for magic."
msgstr "...마법이 걸렸나 복도를 확인했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "037d0456-7d3f-4d4b-b24c-dfcbda09dc3c"
msgid "...tried to clean the mold off the walls."
msgstr "...벽에 핀 곰팡이를 청소했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "1fe4eee7-b2e7-4d7b-9b0c-c751c907a0aa"
msgid "...carefully searched the corridor for traps."
msgstr "...조심스럽게 복도에 덫이 있나 조사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "257cec7b-ce51-4fcb-91b7-da7e581e2510"
msgid "...read the inscription."
msgstr "...비문을 읽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "ba0cd861-98e7-47d2-8048-db56025810ba"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "4400f7ac-6ba2-42ad-be43-d474dd874c1b"
msgid ""
"...examined the crypt and the incense burner to try to understand why the "
"Sisters would need all this creepy stuff."
msgstr "...무덤과 향로를 조사하고 왜 자매들이 이것이 필요했는지 이해하려고 노력했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "ea53874f-399c-40b7-9db1-2052838f772a"
msgid ""
"The tomb, built within the hollowed rocks by ancient cyclopes, was safely "
"hidden from casual searches — the path to it was skillfully concealed by "
"lush vegetation. If we hadn't known exactly where to look, we would have "
"just passed it by, never even suspecting it was there. The entrance was "
"covered with a huge stone slab that seemed to merge with the stone wall, but "
"disheveled bushes and torn ivy shoots implied that it had been recently "
"moved..."
msgstr ""
"고대 사이클롭스에 의해 바위 속에 지어진 무덤은 안전하게 숨겨져있었습니다. 그곳으로 향하는 길은 교묘하게 덤풀로 가려져있습니다. 장소를 "
"미리 알지 못했다면 여기에 그런 장소가 있는지도 몰랐을 것입니다. 입구는 예전에 벽으로 보이던 거대한 돌로 덮여있었지만 흐트러진 덤풀과 "
"옻나무 가지들은 최근에 벽을 치웠음을 암시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "01cec5aa-f48b-442d-a140-a807e42427c3"
msgid ""
"Behind the door was a spacious corridor, obviously built for creatures much "
"larger than humans. The air smelled damp, and the stone walls, decorated "
"with bas-reliefs and carvings, were completely covered with a disgusting, "
"oily mold. We..."
msgstr ""
"문 뒤에 넓은 복도가 나타났고 그것은 인간보다 큰 생물을 위한 곳이었습니다. 공기는 습했고 조각으로 장식된 돌벽은 역겨운 곰팡이가 "
"피었습니다. 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0003_Text_String
msgctxt "ce2adf12-1651-43ce-827b-babfd9ca9f2c"
msgid "[Open]"
msgstr "[열기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e9bd3daf-646f-4d48-b034-daf9bfeeea3f"
msgid ""
"The text said:\n"
"\"ANIMAL HAS TWO EYES.\n"
"MAN HAS ONE.\n"
"DEITY HAS NONE, FOR LIVES IN DARKNESS.\n"
"DARKNESS CONTAINS ALL ANSWERS, OPENS ALL DOORS, FINISHES ALL PATHS.\"\n"
"Such jolly fellows, these ancient cyclopes!"
msgstr ""
"그 글은 이렇다:\n"
"\"동물은 두개의 눈이 있다.\n"
"인간은 하나의 눈을 가졌다.\n"
"여신은 눈이 없어서 암흑 속에서 평생을 산다.\n"
"암흑은 모든 답을 가지고 있고 모든 문이 열려 있으며 모든 길의 끝이다.\"\n"
"이 사이클롭스들은 정말 낙천적이로군요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "16e533af-431e-4599-ba29-edad5eb2b289"
msgid ""
"\"Kheb\" means \"darkness.\" It's an ancient, forgotten word from an "
"ancient, forgotten language, like a time-bleached bone from some unknown "
"beast out in the wilderness... After speaking the word, the stone slab "
"smoothly and almost soundlessly moved aside, opening the entrance to the "
"damp, musty darkness. To avoid being trapped inside, we propped the door "
"open with a large stone, which proved a smart decision — as soon as we "
"stepped inside, the door shuddered and tried to close behind us, but the "
"stone kept it in place."
msgstr ""
"\"크헵\"은 \"어둠\"을 의미합니다. 그것은 고대의 잊혀진 언어로 마치 야생에 알려지지 않은 괴수의 바래진 뼈와 같습니다... 그 "
"단어를 말하고 나자 돌벽은 부드럽게 소리 없이 옆으로 밀어졌고 축축하고 무딘 암흑으로 향하는 입구를 드러냈습니다. 갇히는 것을 피하기 "
"위해 우리는 거대한 돌로 문을 밀어두었고 그것은 현명한 결정이었습니다. 우리가 안에 들어서자 돌은 스르륵 소리를 내며 닫히려고 했지만 "
"돌이 문이 닫히는 것을 막았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "0cad2c99-4d96-4cd7-872a-6ffeaa036dca"
msgid "Despite the mold, the carvings on the stone walls were well preserved."
msgstr "곰팡이에도 불구하고 돌벽의 조각은 잘 보존되어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "a9af2fd5-293d-4b84-8f1b-09de3d73989f"
msgid ""
"Fortunately, the mold in this tomb — though sticky, smelly, and disgusting — "
"was completely harmless. Armed with this knowledge, we..."
msgstr "운이 좋게도 무덤 안의 곰팡이는 냄새나고 역겨웠지만 몸에는 해가 없었습니다. 그런 사실을 안 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "46daa7f6-d5b7-4a3f-bf8f-796c05a11086"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the fungus in a dungeon proves more dangerous than any monster. "
"So many adventurers suffocated on poisonous spores, got burned, or were "
"disintegrated on the spot, just because they never thought to open a botany "
"textbook!"
msgstr ""
"가끔은 던전 안의 곰팡이는 어떠한 괴물보다도 위험합니다. 많은 모험가들이 독성 진균류에 질식하거나 화상을 입고 혹은 즉사를 합니다. 단지 "
"식물학 사전을 펼쳐보지 않았다는 이유만으로요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "4d707938-7b53-4913-91fc-33382bf4eb69"
msgid ""
"Alas, we couldn't detect whether this specimen was dangerous. Our only "
"choice was to rely on luck. We..."
msgstr "아아 우리는 이 종이 위험한 것인지 발견하지 못했습니다. 우리의 선택은 운에 맡기는 것이었습니다. 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "3644c7fa-8c92-43f9-ac2e-cf11a5ad386f"
msgid ""
"Hidden beneath a layer of mold on the wall, something shone bright through "
"magical vision, radiating a strong Necromancy aura. It was almost certainly "
"a magical trap, like one of those signs you shouldn't look at. Taking that "
"into account, we..."
msgstr ""
"벽에 핀 곰팡이 밑에 무언가 마법으로 빛나는 것이 강력한 사령술의 기운을 풍기고 있었습니다. 그것은 마법 지뢰임에 틀림 없었고 절대 "
"들여다보지 말아야 하는 것이었습니다. 그걸 감안하고 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "36283035-b67d-4b6b-8bf0-7adc73c02726"
msgid ""
"This tomb was no exception. Sure, there weren't any pressure plates on the "
"floor or bundles of stones waiting to fall on our heads, but under the layer "
"of mold was a hidden magic sign — the kind you shouldn't look at."
msgstr ""
"이 무덤도 예외가 아니었습니다. 바닥에는 지뢰나 머리 위에서 떨어지기를 기다리는 바위도 없었고 단지 곰팡이가 덮인 마법 부호 "
"뿐이었습니다. 이런 부호는 본 적이 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "cae07279-80dd-4385-a2bc-7db8169094ae"
msgid ""
"But it seemed this tomb was an exception. We found no mechanical traps, at "
"least — no pressure plates beneath our feet, nor bundles of stones waiting "
"to fall on our heads."
msgstr ""
"하지만 이 무덤은 다른 것 같았습니다. 우리는 물리적인 덫은 발견하지 못했습니다. 바닥에 발판도 없었고 떨어지기를 기다리는 천장의 돌도 "
"없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "cc4b5e82-1629-4019-85c7-f397eb4c214b"
msgid ""
"Tombs and traps always come as a pair — like pen and ink, or barbarians and "
"rage, or officials and bribes!"
msgstr "무덤과 덫은 항상 한쌍과 같습니다. 마치 펜과 잉크, 야만인과 분노 혹은 관료와 뇌물처럼요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "ef890787-514f-4bed-ac6a-7a61c348341d"
msgid "But no matter how hard we tried, we couldn't understand what it meant."
msgstr "하지만 우리가 노력을 해도 우리는 이것이 무슨 의미인지 알 수 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "125b0d39-d699-4177-af1c-32c27974875c"
msgid ""
"We carefully scraped the mold from the walls. It didn't mind — it was one of "
"those completely harmless kinds of mold, nothing like some of the poisonous, "
"acidic, or gods-know-what-else mold species you sometimes find. Beneath the "
"mold, we found text carved into the wall, in distinct, clearly visible "
"letters from some unknown language."
msgstr ""
"우리는 조심스럽게 벽의 곰팡이를 걷어냈습니다. 그것은 몸에 무해한 곰팡이었고 독이나 산성이 있거나 오직 신만이 알고 있는 종류의 곰팡이도 "
"아니었습니다. 곰팡이 밑에는 벽에 새겨진 조각이 알 수 없는 언어로 명확하게 적혀있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "7084ef30-c504-40af-a9a2-cee5535a9c47"
msgid ""
"Of course, we stayed well away from the patch we found that was hiding a "
"magic symbol. Having finished our work, we..."
msgstr "물론 우리는 마법 문양에 붙어있던 딱지로부터 떨어져있었습니다. 우리의 일을 마치고 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "51dd0a4c-ba94-483f-90b1-33d09e0ad62a"
msgid ""
"The mold proved to be safe enough, but the wall it clung to was holding an "
"unpleasant surprise for us. After clearing one patch, we found a big, "
"clearly visible magic symbol — and though we immediately recognized it for "
"what it was, it was already too late. The symbol flashed with a magic light, "
"and our knees buckled — the magic radiated by the sign flooded us with a "
"wave of weakness. After some time, we pulled ourselves together — more or "
"less — and..."
msgstr ""
"곰팡이는 위험하지 않은 것으로 밝혀졌지만 벽에는 불쾌한 것들이 붙어있었습니다. 딱지를 제거하고 우리는 크고 선명한 마법 문양을 "
"발견했습니다. 그것이 무엇인지 바로 알아챘지만 그 때는 너무 늦었습니다. 문양은 마법으로 빛을 내며 우리의 무릎은 묶였습니다. 그 상징에 "
"의해 마법이 빛을 발했고 우리는 약화 광선을 맞았습니다. 시간이 흐르자 우리는 정신을 차리려고 했고..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "5d45459c-905e-4853-b0b0-7d0b3e81341e"
msgid "Having finished our search, we..."
msgstr "탐색을 끝내고 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "718405ea-de48-4937-ae2f-04d82542448d"
msgid ""
"A huge sarcophagus was placed in the middle of the burial chamber, its lid "
"lying on the floor nearby. Inside was a gigantic skeleton — its skull stared "
"hollowly with its single huge eye socket, and its bony fingers were clenched "
"around a small brass incense burner that also looked like a one-eyed skull. "
"Near the sarcophagus was the slim figure of a woman wrapped in a gray cloak. "
"She wasn't breathing, and it didn't take much looking to discover her cause "
"of death. The cyclopes had left a nasty surprise for anyone who dared come "
"to rob their graves — near the skeleton's head was a magical symbol of "
"death, carved directly into the sarcophagus's surface. It must have killed "
"the Sister the instant she opened the lid. Luckily for us, it was a single-"
"use trap. We..."
msgstr ""
"거대한 석관이 무덤 안 밀실 중앙에 놓여져있었고 바닥에는 얇은 석관이 놓여있었습니다. 내부는 거대한 해골이 있었습니다. 해골은 거대한 "
"눈구멍 하나로 멍하니 쳐다보고 있었고 손가락 뼈는 외눈 해골의 형상을 한 향로를 움켜쥐고 있었습니다. 석관 주위에는 회색 망토를 두른 "
"날씬한 모습의 여성이 있엇습니다. 그녀는 숨을 쉬지 않았고 그것이 죽어서였기 때문인 것 같지 않습니다. 사이클롭스는 무덤을 훔치려는 "
"자들을 기습하려고 무언가를 남겼습니다. 해골의 머리 주위에는 죽음을 상징하는 마법 문양이 석관에 조각되어있었습니다. 그녀가 석관 뚜껑을 "
"열려고 하자 죽은 것 같습니다. 다행이 그것은 일회용 덫 같습니다. 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "cd769a6a-04bb-45cf-9d86-36fb06d4ee66"
msgid ""
"When we removed the cloth from the dead woman's face, it sent a chill down "
"our spines — she literally had no face. Instead, there was a rough gray "
"surface, looking something like a roughly made clay mask — two holes instead "
"of eyes, a hole instead of a nose, a crack instead of a mouth... What power "
"could have done that do her?"
msgstr ""
"죽은 여자의 얼굴에 가려진 천을 벗겼을 때 등골이 오싹해졌습니다. 그녀는 말 그대로 얼굴이 없었습니다. 대신에 진흙으로 대충 빚은 듯한 "
"회색의 표면에 두 개의 눈 구멍과 코에 뚫린 구멍, 그리고 입에는 균열이 나있었습니다. 도대체 그녀는 어떻게 만들어진 것일까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "43131f81-52fb-4084-ad22-170619a009d1"
msgid ""
"Having examined the body, we discovered the dead woman wasn't human. She was "
"fey — most likely a nymph, deformed by some unknown magic."
msgstr "시체를 조사하자 우리는 죽은 여성이 인간이 아니란 것을 알아냈습니다. 그녀는 알 수 없는 마법으로 변형된 페이였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "fa9543cb-9648-475a-85d3-48d4c71d8ded"
msgid ""
"She had nothing of interest on her, so we took the incense burner and left "
"the tomb, which had also become the burial chamber for the very person we'd "
"been searching for."
msgstr ""
"우리는 그녀에게 관심이 없었고 우리는 향로를 가지고 무덤을 빠져나왔습니다. 그 무덤은 우리가 찾던 사람이 있던 밀실이 분명했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "12b5184d-5011-4fcc-8a07-3584822df454"
msgid ""
"Judging from the wall carvings, the builders of this gloomy place must have "
"venerated {g|Charon}Charon{/g} — the godlike archdaemon of death. Similar "
"incense burners were used in his servants' rituals. The smoke coming from "
"the eye socket was meant to symbolize a soul flying to him... Were the "
"Sisters conducting some ritual? Maybe even trying to summon Charon himself? "
"Terrible!"
msgstr ""
"벽의 조각으로 보건대 이 우울한 곳을 지은 자는 죽음의 아크다이몬 {g|Charon}케런{/g}을 숭배했음이 틀림 없습니다. 아마도 "
"향로는 그의 수하가 의식을 하는데 사용했을 것입니다. 눈 구멍에서 나오는 연기는 그에게 달려드는 영혼을 의미합니다... 자매들이 어떤 "
"의식을 했던 걸까요? 아마도 케런을 소환하려고 했던 걸까요? 끔찍하군요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "9ca04134-30e0-49cd-b5ca-2e436b01fd19"
msgid ""
"No matter how long we explored the gloomy place, we only understood one "
"thing — its builders just LOVED skulls."
msgstr ""
"이 우울한 장소를 얼마나 오래 탐험했는지와 상관 없이 우리는 이 장소를 지은 건축가가 해골을 정말 좋아했다는 것을 알게 되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/BookEventTomb/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "7bbcb6f5-1427-41b5-a080-c8f742fcbba9"
msgid "After exploring the tomb, we..."
msgstr "무덤을 조사하고 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "631dd9a2-f328-456e-b4f3-bc86c8793c15"
msgid "\"Are you a chieftain?\""
msgstr "\"네가 족장인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "47a5e047-5ac8-43e6-8f2d-52dee35eb6cf"
msgid "\"What's your chieftain known for?\""
msgstr "\"너희 족장은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "5b4093c7-ad9f-4e71-bb2c-27630d8e30d3"
msgid "\"I didn't know there were half-orcs among the Numerian barbarians.\""
msgstr "\"누메리안 야만인 중에서 하프오크가 있으리라고는 생각 못했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "aa0c2efc-a18d-452c-8e53-90c51778e013"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "de943611-1707-4705-b742-032f671959a4"
msgid "\"Do you know anything about the situation at Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 상황에 대해서 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "5227d543-e1fb-466d-82b1-a47c0621c277"
msgid "\"Have you found anything of interest?\""
msgstr "\"흥미로운 것을 찾았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "93539210-6fe0-45a9-bb5c-2edb26c33c66"
msgid "\"Where might I find Dugath and these Sisters?\""
msgstr "\"두가스와 그 자매들을 찾으려면 어디서 찾아야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "3e310a1d-c3b6-43a7-bbf3-9fbef76298fe"
msgid "\"Tell me about Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"누메리아에 대해서 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "2fde397a-97e9-407e-a1dd-d668f13b4459"
msgid ""
"[Stay the night] \"Thank you for the invitation. I'll take you up on it.\""
msgstr "[자고 갑니다] \"초대해줘 고마워. 잊지 않을게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "5c791f18-fe03-44f8-b21e-b6c71033bb73"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I don't like the looks of you — I think you're bandits, or spies!"
"\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"네 생김새가 마음에 들지 않아. 도적이나 첩자인 줄 알았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "3f89f7d0-baf8-4fc4-9420-2c21968d3de0"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "d51332f5-607a-461c-bfbf-a9f18326a9b8"
msgid ""
"\"The spriggans who lived in this cave are under my protection. Please leave "
"so they can return to their home.\""
msgstr "\"이 동굴에 살던 스프리건들은 내 보호 아래 있다. 그들에게 집을 돌려주고 떠나줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3fb84b8d-e68f-4fe0-b3c4-e6865d5ffbbc"
msgid "Pranked the barbarian in the Spriggans' lair."
msgstr "스프리건들의 은신처에 있는 야만인을 속였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "818abae0-1043-4ace-b5ec-e3c056f9a5db"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! Got you! I was just joking!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 알겠어! 농담이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "ff7ffcc5-9749-4ad1-83fb-ad84555e18ea"
msgid ""
"\"I've no time for games. Leave now, while I'm still in the mood to ask "
"politely.\""
msgstr "\"놀 시간은 없어. 정중히 부탁할 때 떠나는 게 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "3862df15-9a38-4ad8-9e71-e9e277a0a118"
msgid ""
"\"I'm quite sane. Please try to understand — when you ousted the spriggans, "
"you created a serious political issue that I need to resolve.\""
msgstr "\"나는 멀쩡해. 네가 스프리건들을 쫓아냈을 때 너는 내가 풀어야 할 심각한 문제를 주었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "73c6859a-fc6a-487f-84ec-73238c35e650"
msgid ""
"\"The spriggans will return soon, and they won't be alone. They're bringing "
"trolls, cyclopes, and giants with them. I can negotiate a peaceful solution, "
"but only if this cave is empty!\""
msgstr ""
"\"스프리건들은 곧 돌아올 거야. 그 때는 혼자가 아닐 테지. 그들은 트롤, 사이클롭스, 거인을 데려올 거야. 네가 그들과 협상할 수 "
"있지만 오직 이 동굴이 비어야만 가능해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "8e90d214-100b-4657-8ff6-1d4c080566d5"
msgid ""
"\"All right. But if the spriggans attack you again, don't expect any help "
"from me.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 만약 스프리건들이 너를 공격한다면 나에게서 도움은 기대하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "54bc2aa9-0e5e-4227-9c26-05f88e2f71f4"
msgid "[Attack] \"Then I'll just have to force you out.\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"그렇다면 너를 쫓아낼 수밖에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "299e9beb-98a9-4db7-85b0-bc2088a14ed8"
msgid "\"Who are these Sisters?\""
msgstr "\"이 자매들은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "ab45160c-45e5-4263-bca4-299ccfab922b"
msgid ""
"{n}A half-orc woman sits by the fire. Her clothes are made of leather and "
"fur, matching the rest of the barbarians. She frowns as she slides her "
"finger along a map, crudely drawn on a crumpled sheet of paper. She lifts "
"her gaze as she notices you.{/n} \"Huh, guests. Who're you? If you're a "
"friend, take a seat by the fire and let's talk. I'm Bolga, from the {g|Tiger "
"Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} tribe. I lead this group.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프오크 여성이 모닥불 옆에 앉아 있습니다. 그녀의 옷은 다른 야만인과 마찬가지로 가죽과 모피로 만들어져 있습니다. 그녀는 구겨진 종이에 "
"휘갈겨진 지도를 손가락으로 가리키며 인상을 찌푸립니다. 그러다 당신을 발견하고는 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"하. 손님이구나. 너는 누구지? 네가 "
"친구라면 모닥불 옆에 앉아 이야기를 하자. 나는 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족의 볼가다. 이 무리를 이끌고 "
"있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "52d0f59c-73c1-4be3-8a5c-84c8900b6b51"
msgid ""
"\"Me? No, no. Just seasoned enough to lead a group. Our chieftain is Armag "
"the Twice-Born!\" {n}Bolga says the name proudly, as though expecting "
"recognition or awe.{/n} \"He's back home in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} right now."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나? 아니, 아니야. 그저 잠시 무리를 이끌 만큼 노련해졌을 뿐이야. 우리 족장은 두 번 태어난 아르막이야!\" {n}볼가는 인정이나 경외심을 기대하는 듯 "
"자랑스럽게 이름을 말합니다.{/n} \"그는 지금 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}의 고향으로 돌아갔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "d1c0a020-6b18-4911-90db-349a8684222d"
msgid ""
"\"Long ago, he was the greatest of the {g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} chieftains, "
"and {g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} chosen! Armag was so strong, no mortal could strike "
"him down. It was only when {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} herself challenged him "
"to battle that he fell, and only because of her divine power. But now, Armag "
"shamed her and came back from the afterlife! Great Armag leads the {g|Tiger "
"Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} once more, now as Armag the Twice-Born — and soon, "
"word of our exploits will spread all over {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래 전, 그는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 족장들 중 가장 위대한 자였고, {g|Numeria}고룸{/g}이 선택한 자였지! "
"아르막은 너무나 강해서 어떤 필멸자도 그를 쓰러뜨릴 수 없었어. 여신인 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}가 직접 그에게 결투를 "
"신청해서 비로소 그가 패배했었다. 그리고 그것은 오직 그녀의 신성한 힘 덕분이었지. 하지만 지금, 아르막은 그녀에게 수치심을 느끼고 사후 "
"세계에서 돌아왔어! 위대한 족장, 두 번 태어난 아르막은 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}를 다시 한번 이끌 거야. 곧 "
"우리의 위업에 대한 소문이 {g|Avistan}아비스탄{/g} 전체에 퍼질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "7a6d339f-776a-4884-8a84-3671aaae4224"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian shrugs.{/n} \"The orcs have lands nearby. A lot can happen "
"between two neighboring peoples.\""
msgstr "{n}야만인은 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"오크가 주위의 땅을 차지했다. 이웃한 두 민족 사이에 많은 일이 벌어질 수 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "b695cdba-510a-4c4c-9731-c281f448ee9f"
msgid "\"I'm sure you understand as well as I do.\""
msgstr "\"네가 잘 이해했을 거라 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "022ca2d1-5d0c-4e3c-a4f9-077cf48fe098"
msgid ""
"\"We're looking for some ruins, or a cave, or something... I don't really "
"know — only Dugath knows exactly what we're looking for. He's a cleric, and "
"he's our leader on this expedition. Well, him and the Sisters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 폐허나 동굴 같은 것을 찾고 있어... 나는 잘 몰라 — 오직 두가스만 우리가 무엇을 찾고 있는지 알고 있어. 그는 성직자이고, "
"우리 탐험대의 우두머리니. 정확히는 그와 자매들이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "e1214259-5845-4829-8f5a-1d7f77214c05"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}? Where's that?\" {n}The barbarian looks down at "
"her map and finds a rough sketch of the area.{/n} \"Hmm, no. No idea. We've "
"never been there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}? 거기는 어디야?\" {n}야만인은 지도를 내려다보고는 대충 그려진 곳을 발견합니다.{/n} \"흠"
". 아니. 모르겠다. 우리는 거기에 간 적 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "17a3846c-c121-4903-a002-54f36bac6474"
msgid ""
"\"It'd be nice if we had! So far it's just dirt, crap, and monsters. Like we "
"don't get enough of that back in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}! We found this hole, "
"and the monsters that were living here — we took a beating doing it, but we "
"managed to kick them out. Then, after we searched the place, we found out "
"it's just a regular cave, nothing of note. After a day or so, we'll probably "
"head out and keep searching.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그랬다면 좋았을 텐데! 우리는 헛탕만 쳤어. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서도 그런 짓은 많이 충분히 했다고! 우리는 여기 굴을 발견하고, "
"살고 있던 괴물들을 두들겨 패서 쫓아냈어. 그 이후 이곳을 수색해보니, 아무것도 없는 그저 평범한 동굴이더군. 하루나 이틀 쯤 지나면 다시 나가서 "
"수색을 계속할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "024b697d-d026-4176-bbeb-f52cbca1b980"
msgid ""
"\"They're in our main camp, here.\" {n}Bolga points at a cross on her "
"map.{/n} \"If you're looking to hire us or have some other business, come "
"visit. It'd be much better than digging around in the dirt out here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 우리 메인 캠프에 있어.\" {n}볼가는 지도에 한 곳을 표시합니다.{/n} \"우리를 고용하거나 볼 일이 있으면 찾아오라구. "
"여기서 헛탕만 치는 것보다는 나으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "37e0d7f9-0c59-40c9-be4f-e8b93bee1e9a"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} is the land with adamantine in its soil, and its "
"people have adamantine in their hearts.\" {n}The barbarian starts solemnly, "
"then her tone shifts.{/n} \"And since we have bugger all beyond adamantine "
"and courage, we just trade what we've got!\" {n}She laughs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}는 땅에서 아다만틴이 자라고 사람들은 핏 속에 아다만틴이 흐르지.\" {n}야만인은 고요하게 "
"말하고는 계속해서 말합니다.{/n} \"우리는 용기도 있고 아다만틴도 가지고 있으니 교역을 하게 된 것일 뿐이야!\" {n}그녀는 "
"웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "55c812ca-ca08-4997-8b53-5b4226765f8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Bolga raises her gaze from the map.{/n} \"You again? You need something?\""
msgstr "{n}볼가는 지도에서 눈을 떼고 고개를 듭니다.{/n} \"또 너냐? 뭐가 필요해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "0744e41a-fe43-413b-a401-9179f123e249"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian's jaw drops in surprise.{/n} \"Wha-what? Those ugly things? "
"Are you crazy?\""
msgstr "{n}야만인은 놀라서 턱이 쩍 벌어집니다.{/n} \"뭐? 그 못생긴 것이? 너 미쳤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "ceb5862e-2f4c-45d4-a789-dbfa178e01d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Bolga slaps your shoulder, laughing loudly.{/n} \"Good one! You had me "
"going!\""
msgstr "{n}볼가는 당신의 어깨를 찰싹 때리고는 큰 소리로 웃습니다.{/n} \"좋아! 내가 가지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "357f063e-86a5-4880-9cf1-2dd8292c2553"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian shrugs.{/n} \"Well, sounds odd, but all right. We weren't "
"planning on staying long anyway. Pack up, everyone! We're leaving!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"음. 이상한 소리지만 맞는 말이군. 우리는 여기에 계속 머물 생각은 하지 않았으니까. 모두 짐을 "
"싸라! 여기서 떠난다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "5a3132e0-e3cf-4f1c-9f8f-9b194bb4c4fd"
msgid ""
"\"Sounds like your problem to deal with. No way we're leaving here after "
"dusk.\""
msgstr "\"그건 네 문제 같은데. 해가 진 후로는 떠날 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "1dbc14c3-1b84-4a7e-96c7-d8ade1bc6b67"
msgid ""
"\"That so? Sounds to me like you're just spinning tales in the hopes of "
"snatching something from us while we pack up!\""
msgstr "\"그래서? 마치 우리가 짐을 싸는 동안 우리에게서 무언가 슬쩍 하려는 속셈으로 말하는 것 같은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "839d78c3-b0b0-4960-bf8b-c4e117ae527d"
msgid ""
"\"Damn!\" {n}Bolga leaps to her feet.{/n} \"Thanks for the warning. Listen "
"up, everyone! Alarm! Pack up — now!\""
msgstr "\"젠장!\" {n}볼가는 펄쩎 뛰어오릅니다.{/n} \"경고해줘서 고마워. 모두 잘 들어! 비상이야! 어서 짐 싸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "9e78f5ac-470d-40f4-8b88-b4785593fb6f"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian stares into your eyes, but she's the first to drop her "
"gaze.{/n} \"Fine... Have it your way.\""
msgstr "{n}야만인은 당신의 눈을 바라보지만 곧 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"좋아... 그러라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "f45e4329-9ed2-4f68-9a2e-886e1197cce0"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc grins and bares her weapons.{/n} \"Well, let's see how you "
"ask rudely!\""
msgstr "{n}하프오크는 씩 웃고는 무기를 챙깁니다.{/n} \"네가 얼마나 무례하게 부탁하는지 보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "e3df41fc-8903-4de9-8086-1212426aec7a"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Let them try. We thinned their ranks plenty already — we'll just have "
"to finish what we started!\""
msgstr "\"하! 해 보라지. 그녀석들을 충분히 쓰러뜨렸어. 이제는 하던 걸 마저 해야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "1a7e1258-14e9-41c8-b5ac-a7ff3f9193a8"
msgid ""
"\"They're witches who serve Armag. They seem to know a lot about the world — "
"history, gods, even other worlds... They're pretty smart talkers — you'd "
"hardly believe the things they know! And they have these strange, "
"unimaginable spells... When Armag ordered us to pack up for this expedition, "
"we thought we'd be marching for a month. But they just waved their hands — "
"whoosh! — a tunnel of multicolored lights opened before us. The trip here "
"took us just one hour! Can you imagine it? I wouldn't be surprised if you "
"can't.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 아르막을 섬기는 마녀들이야. 이 세계의 역사, 신, 다른 세계에 대해서 많은 것을 알고 있지... 그들은 현명한 자들이야 — "
"너는 그들이 아는 것을 믿기 힘들걸! 상상할 수 없는 이상한 주문들을 알고 있어... 아르막이 탐험을 위해 우리에게 짐을 싸라고 명령했을 때, 우리는 한 "
"달 동안 행군할 거라고 생각했어. 하지만 그들이 우리에게 손을 흔드는 순간 무지갯빛 터널이 우리 앞에 열렸어. 여행은 한시간 밖에 걸리지 "
"않더군! 상상이 돼? 아무나 할 수 있는 게 아닐 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "5c87e887-4733-4189-8b50-1c22df9e966f"
msgid ""
"\"Sure, no point in denting our asses in this hole. We'll head out soon, "
"most like. Safe journey to you!\""
msgstr "\"물론. 이 곳에 엉덩이를 붙이고 있을 필요는 없지. 우리는 곧 나갈 거야. 안전한 여행 되라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "3a18eddc-ec20-48a6-bf9c-7cb7c25f0ee5"
msgid "\"I would ask you the same.\""
msgstr "\"너에게도 똑같이 묻고 싶었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5a7a045a-6a8b-48ee-8303-e611ebb970ce"
msgid ""
"\"A tunnel of many colors... Doesn't that sound familiar? Because it sure "
"sounds familiar to me!\""
msgstr "\"무지갯빛 터널이라... 친숙하지 않아? 나는 많이 들어본 것 같은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "252d849b-bc80-4444-95ce-2df01f2c4835"
msgid "\"Sure... Lots of things.\" {n}Regongar spits on the ground.{/n}"
msgstr "\"물론... 그러시겠지.\" {n}레곤가르는 땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "08a96b05-d977-4751-a1a0-724396a4a705"
msgid "\"Oh, really? Let's see you try!\""
msgstr "\"정말이야? 한번 보고 싶구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianLeader
msgctxt "e0a203c9-c563-44e1-a294-488474d9e6f9"
msgid ""
"{n}When Bolga's gaze stops on Nok-Nok, she chuckles.{/n} \"Quite a beast you "
"got there. Ones like that, we use for rags back home — their hides aren't "
"good for anything else.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}볼가의 시선이 녹-녹에게 멈추자 낄낄거리며 웃습니다.{/n} \"여기 짐승 한마리가 있구나. 고향에서는 이런 녀석을 헝겊을 만드는 "
"데 쓰지 — 가죽이 아주 형편이 없어 다른데 쓸데가 없거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "634db436-beb4-42de-a9aa-d16946336e24"
msgid ""
"\"Ones like you, I use for chowder! Meat like dung, not good for nothing "
"else.\" {n}Nok-Nok glares at the sturdy woman with a predatory look as he "
"runs a finger along the edge of his blade.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"너 같은 놈은 수프 거리로 써! 똥 같은 고기, 다른 아무짝에 쓸모없어.\" {n}녹-녹은 손가락으로 칼날 가장자리를 따라 훑으며 "
"건장한 여인을 포식자 같은 눈빛으로 노려봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/BarbarianLeader_Dialog/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "e6ea9712-c55b-4d0a-b306-8dccb5a63c78"
msgid "\"Sure.\""
msgstr "\"물론.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Barks/Guard_1_String
msgctxt "9d6079f7-4842-4c0b-88b2-da34d2dd0a8a"
msgid "\"If you're a friend, you may pass.\""
msgstr "\"네가 친구라면 가도 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Barks/Guard_2_String
msgctxt "cd1a1602-a324-45ee-8c13-4d95638f6a1c"
msgid "\"Talk to Bolga. She's inside.\""
msgstr "\"볼가에게 얘기해. 그녀는 안에 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Barks/Guard_3_String
msgctxt "c0f4bc06-5fb0-4e53-b14b-e5c25ec015da"
msgid "\"You can stay here for the night.\""
msgstr "\"하룻밤 지내고 가도 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Barks/StorageGuardBark_String
msgctxt "daa8fe9a-feeb-439b-9d89-ab214367a9c7"
msgid "\"Don't you touch anything. I'm watching you!\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 만지지 마. 다 보고 있으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "bb487527-282e-4c10-aac1-4ceac1f6ceb6"
msgid ""
"\"Stealing? How could you even think that! I was just looking for the toilet."
"\""
msgstr "\"훔쳐? 어떻게 그럴 수가 있지! 나는 그저 화장실을 가려던 것 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a5b99155-338c-4d36-b594-7c5dc4aec06a"
msgid "Killed the barbarian who caught you stealing."
msgstr "당신을 도둑으로 모는 야만인을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e85881e9-9f77-40f6-9319-0053331329c8"
msgid "[Attack] \"You should have pretended not to notice me.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 나를 봐서는 안됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9b43afc3-0558-4a43-b15b-6385b19e5a10"
msgid ""
"\"Pretend you didn't notice me, and you might survive to see tomorrow...\""
msgstr "\"나를 못 본 척하면 살아서 내일을 맞을 수는 있을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "68aa0175-881f-4b04-8a03-d9f0b3709980"
msgid ""
"[Bribe the barbarian with 100 coins] \"This is just a misunderstanding. "
"Surely we can settle this matter peacefully.\""
msgstr "[야만인에게 동전 100닢을 뇌물로 줍니다] \"그저 오해가 있었어. 우리 평화롭게 해결하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianStorage
msgctxt "7683edb6-9814-45da-a723-ad8ed04ce7f6"
msgid "\"Hey! What're you doing? You trying to steal from us?\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 뭐하는 거야? 도둑질하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianStorage
msgctxt "ea45cc54-9f71-412a-8341-f115fc412e72"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha! You townsfolk are hilarious! {mf|He|She} wants a toilet! Just go "
"outside and use the bushes!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 너희들은 정말 유쾌하구나! 그저 화장실을 가려던 거야! 그렇다면 밖으로 가서 누도록 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianStorage
msgctxt "a06e00fb-63a5-4ab9-b405-25c1a8e4639f"
msgid "\"You take me for an idiot? Bad call!\""
msgstr "\"내가 바보로 보이냐? 천만에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianStorage
msgctxt "aa152421-7050-4daa-879f-603f4396199d"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian stares into your eyes coldly, then looks aside, steps back, "
"and disappears.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}야만인은 당신을 차가운 눈빛으로 보고는 한걸음 물러나서 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianStorage
msgctxt "79e747d0-18db-4a8f-8693-9a71fc05e7fa"
msgid "\"Oh, you shouldn't have done that...\""
msgstr "\"너는 그러지 말아야 했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonBarbarianStorage
msgctxt "3d29848c-49ea-4130-a1dd-665079b85f9e"
msgid ""
"{n}With a grunt of contempt, the barbarian quickly stows the coins.{/n} \"You"
" city folk are all just thieves, just wanting to snatch and flee. Fine, "
"then, get lost before I give you what you deserve.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}콧방귀를 뀌며 야만인은 재빠르게 동전을 챙깁니다.{/n} \"너희 도시인은 모두 도둑놈이야. 훔치고 달아나는 녀석들이지. 좋아. "
"그럼. 너를 혼내주기 전에 썩 꺼져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/CaughtStealing/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "44ef4cb1-4d68-406f-9bfb-7325970ab71a"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar draws his blade, which crackles with tiny sparks of "
"lightning.{/n} \"Shut up, turn around, and walk away. Forget you ever saw "
"us. Do what I say, and maybe — just maybe — you and your worthless friends "
"will have the chance to see tomorrow. You get me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 칼을 꺼내고는 불꽃이 튀게 합니다.{/n} \"닥치고 뒤돌아서 걸어가. 우리를 본 기억은 지워. 내가 말하는 데로 하면 "
"어쩌면 너와 네 친구들은 살아남을 기회를 가질 수도 있다. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "c65e53a4-234d-4205-b4d6-2841d77a6c4f"
msgid "\"I promised to help you recover your home, and I've done just that.\""
msgstr "\"집을 되찾아주겠다고 약속했으니 그렇게 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "88717cc9-0e74-4b35-8077-2afcb7f7796d"
msgid "\"Did the barbarians do much damage to your home?\""
msgstr "\"야만인이 네 집을 망가뜨려 놓았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "3f3b0339-f2e0-43bc-b2cc-76dd13039aa1"
msgid "\"You could at least thank me!\""
msgstr "\"나에게 고맙기라도 해야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "ded68043-7103-4f0a-bd0e-7a8d8d8eab81"
msgid ""
"\"You could be a touch friendlier to the person who helped you get your cave "
"back.\""
msgstr "\"네 동굴을 되찾아 준 사람에게 친절하게 대할 수는 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "920661da-2b27-46d3-9488-90e2622f1f3e"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I wasn't expecting any gratitude, and you certainly didn't "
"disappoint.\""
msgstr "\"감사하다는 말을 기대한 건 아니지만 너는 기대를 저버리지 않는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "40ae306e-b644-461a-8067-1ebd8cfed1be"
msgid ""
"\"You spriggans are a secretive people. Would you be willing to tell me "
"about yourself and your kin?\""
msgstr "\"너희 스프리건들은 비밀이 많구나. 너와 네 동족에 대해 말해줄 수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "d7d8fc3f-e3dc-42d2-aabd-a3d24ba421f4"
msgid "\"How are you doing after everything that happened?\""
msgstr "\"여기에 무슨 일이 일어났던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "78f8ddac-7cde-4e5a-a8e7-e86f22f2584e"
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "5dc29fed-3713-4b19-bb95-0cfadb88b310"
msgid "\"Relax, it's just curiosity. I've already helped you, after all.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 그냥 궁금해서 그런 거야. 게다가 너를 도와주기도 했고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "8b561be9-8289-4813-922e-746548fcc16f"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't need to know anything about your weaknesses to kill your kin "
"before — don't try my patience again.\""
msgstr "\"네 동족을 죽일 정도로 약할 줄은 몰랐어. 별로 알고 싶지도 않은 사실이군. 내 인내심을 다시는 시험하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "b748ea5c-7913-42ec-843c-21671f426feb"
msgid "\"Don't be mad, Agai. I won't ask about it again.\""
msgstr "\"화내지 마. 아가이. 다시 묻지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "a691a6ef-14c3-44a5-a86c-1e76a3157187"
msgid "\"I have some questions about your people.\""
msgstr "\"너희 친구들에 대해 궁금한 것이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "7a5eab61-514d-4bf7-abdf-3a2bdef49b53"
msgid "\"You're related to gnomes, right?\""
msgstr "\"너는 노움과 친척이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "21e89c7c-fce8-4300-8b2e-7deb4f3692ff"
msgid "\"You and gnomes don't look much alike. Why is that?\""
msgstr "\"너와 노움은 별로 닮지 않았어. 왜 그런 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "2c7caa10-114e-4724-b7a6-3e850a0edc6b"
msgid "\"It seems like your whole life is merely fighting for survival...\""
msgstr "\"너는 생존을 위해 계속해서 싸우는구나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "53517915-4f2f-4d4c-bd17-fc2e0cdf941b"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll eliminate you before you bring even more pests!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네가 질병을 몰고 오기 전에 너를 끝내겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "d14d57de-7c70-49d0-8d49-cfc93d523b68"
msgid "\"How do you get along with other races?\""
msgstr "\"다른 종족과의 사이는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "8e622915-e189-49d0-a82e-28a31ab33dd2"
msgid "\"I'll be leaving.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "aa1f0703-cdc1-4e61-bba3-83ed6454cb02"
msgid "\"Do you have any legends or stories about your creation?\""
msgstr "\"네 종족이 태어나게 된 신화 같은 것이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "9ce6fe13-a0d5-4904-821e-b8b4b74aff64"
msgid "\"That's all I want to know for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그걸로 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Barks/Spriggan_01_String
msgctxt "324b11db-e003-4777-b86b-03d3155e4e31"
msgid "\"Agai said this one is not an enemy.\""
msgstr "\"아가이가 이 녀석은 적은 아니라고 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Barks/Spriggan_02_String
msgctxt "93310f20-8f9e-4b6a-b58e-1cdfd73c0607"
msgid "\"What do you want?\""
msgstr "\"원하는 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Barks/Spriggan_03_String
msgctxt "be42d33e-24dd-4a01-8e1d-71bc22ee008c"
msgid "\"Don't bother me!\""
msgstr "\"나를 괴롭히지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Barks/Spriggan_04_String
msgctxt "0abcd3ac-0bad-4a72-a4f5-da474e6a6c54"
msgid "\"Strangers crawl into our home again...\""
msgstr "\"이상한 녀석들이 우리 집으로 다시 들어갔어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Barks/Spriggan_05_String
msgctxt "d92b03cf-e31f-4386-a0bc-ff66b0bffac8"
msgid "\"Be on your way.\""
msgstr "\"갈 길 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "657506a6-5265-43cf-b79f-511d46f33c0f"
msgid ""
"{n}Armed with a broken-handled knife, Agai is busy whittling a stake from a "
"large stick. You see a pile of such stakes nearby, along with a coil or "
"rough rope and some chunks of wood. The spriggan barely notices you, he's so "
"consumed in his work.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}손잡이가 부서진 칼을 쥔 아가이는 나무를 깎느라 바쁩니다. 당신은 주위에 거친 밧줄과 장작 더미 그리고 쌓인 말뚝들을 보았습니다. "
"이 스프리건은 당신을 발견하지 못하고 자신의 일에 열중하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "c1d06aed-d9d4-4c06-b042-68a01e5d9f94"
msgid "{n}Agai's minding his own business, ignoring you completely.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 당신을 완전히 무시한 채로 자신의 일에 집중하느라 바쁩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "2d5754a7-3d3c-4eab-b266-79821646d809"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai glances at you briefly, then returns to his work on the stake.{/n} "
"\"Aye.\""
msgstr "{n}아가이는 당신을 슬쩍 보고는 다시 나무 깎는 일에 집중합니다.{/n} \"그러셔?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "bdcc451b-94c6-4660-b23a-10e4a002f288"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai stops whittling for a moment, staring somewhere beyond you. He "
"finally grunts, in a low voice,{/n} \"Thanks.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아가이는 나무를 깎는 것을 멈추고는 당신 뒤의 어딘가를 봅니다. 그는 마침내 불평하며 낮은 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "786f1772-7c8a-4928-9a1c-4ab62d0258f6"
msgid ""
"\"You also killed half my tribe. Left me defenseless. Had to sort out the "
"mess myself. You basically just compensated me for all the harm you've done."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 내 부족의 절반을 죽였어. 나를 무력화시켰지. 지금은 정리를 할 시간이야. 나를 이렇게 만든 걸로 만족하는 게 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "7c731a42-cc22-4dd3-a552-311273d84752"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai's face grows even grimmer, and he whittles the stick more "
"frantically. It seems your pleasure at predicting his reaction has upset "
"him.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아가이의 얼굴은 점점 험악해지더니 그는 더욱 거칠게 나무를 깎습니다. 자신의 반응을 즐기는 당신에게 화가난 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "5c1a5f3f-ae01-4dcb-a268-3c47e36c2c75"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai sniffs.{/n} \"Not too much,\" {n}he drawls.{/n} \"Stole some traps, "
"scattered the beds, threw away all our food — the dolts! — but they left "
"some useful things behind, too, so I won't hold a grudge. And it's all mine "
"now, so don't even think about taking anything!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아가이는 콧방귀를 뀝니다.{/n} \"그리 많지는 않아.\" {n}그는 계속합니다.{/n} \"덫들을 훔치고 잠자리를 망가뜨려놓고 "
"음식을 모두 버렸어! 하지만 그들은 나에게 유용한 것을 남기고 갔으니 앙심을 품지는 않겠어. 이제 모두 내 거니 뭐든 가져갈 생각은 "
"하지도 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "07244639-cb66-4f36-aa6c-17d5df5d6f65"
msgid ""
"\"I'm obviously whittling stakes to make traps. Set some by the stream, so "
"now I need more. Not many of us left — can't watch everyone's backs. When "
"I'm done here, I'll check on the others and the pitfalls they're digging.\"\n"
"{n}Agai throws you a sideways glance.{/n} \"Not telling you where the "
"pitfalls will be, so be careful walking around here. Or better yet, don't "
"walk around here at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 덫을 만들기 위해 나무를 깎고 있었다. 개울가에 몇 개 설치해뒀는데 더 필요해. 우리는 수가 많지 않아서 경계를 설 녀석이 "
"부족해. 이 일이 끝나면 다른 녀석들이 파 놓은 구덩이를 보러 가야 해.\"\n"
"{n}아가이는 당신을 슬쩍 봅니다.{/n} \"구덩이가 어디에 있는지 말해줄 수는 없으니 알아서 조심하라고. 돌아다니지 않으면 더 좋고."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "da3c0cb8-26b5-46e5-8df7-6d9eefca0a30"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai stops working and looks at you intently.{/n} \"Why should I do that? "
"You trying to get close to us? Want to learn our weaknesses?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아가이는 일하는 것을 멈추고 당신을 노려봅니다.{/n} \"왜 내가 그래야 하지? 우리와 가까워지고 싶다고? 우리의 약점을 배우고 "
"싶은 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "1c1d55c4-e6a2-4acf-a4ce-27be28a381e3"
msgid "{n}Agai sucks air in through his teeth and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 이 사이로 숨을 깊게 들이마쉬고는 내뱉습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "eb45a9ab-7eec-49df-bcf2-4cae083ec1f9"
msgid ""
"{n}The spriggan ponders for several moments.{/n} \"Fine. Ask. But I won't "
"tell you where my provisions are.\""
msgstr "{n}그 스프리건은 곰곰히 생각합니다.{/n} \"좋아. 물어봐. 하지만 덫이 어디에 있는지는 말해주지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "785184af-4286-42af-94ab-6fa63cf07f73"
msgid ""
"{n}The spriggan cringes and glares at you.{/n} \"Go on, then,\" {n}he "
"mutters through clenched teeth.{/n} \"Ask your questions.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 스프리건은 얼굴을 찡그리고는 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"그럼 그러던가.\" {n}그는 다문 이 사이로 중얼거립니다.{/n} "
"\"물어봐라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "65b8ce18-246f-4621-b936-7ab86bac1516"
msgid ""
"\"Today you help. Tomorrow you kill. I know your kind — you're all the same."
"\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 너 돕는다. 내일은 너 죽인다. 너희 같은 녀석 알고 있어. 너희는 모두 똑같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "7f1ca804-8430-453b-83d7-d563d740bcda"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai narrows his eyes menacingly as he looks at you, maintaining a stony "
"silence.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 눈을 작게 뜨고 험상궃게 당신을 보지만 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "a3a5c23a-99a3-4d8f-96b2-c8c4fa2be2a6"
msgid "{n}Agai stops working on the stake and looks at you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 나무 깎는 일을 그만두고 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "036e4280-4388-44d9-b70d-64123060fc5d"
msgid "\"Been through worse.\""
msgstr "\"쭉 더 나빠지기만 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "5887a62c-b9ed-42df-8ecf-1f58b3097a26"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai's voice lowers to contemptuous hissing.{/n} \"Those clowns? Yes, "
"we're unfortunate enough to share common blood. And that's all we share.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아가이의 목소리는 험악하지고 낮아집니다.{/n} \"그 광대들? 그래. 우리는 안타깝게도 같은 피를 타고 났지. 하지만 그게 다야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "475409be-a4d3-414f-a3ac-d0337d9a4ba9"
msgid ""
"\"I must admit, gnomes aren't too excited to have 'relatives' such as these, "
"either. Primitive creatures, devoid of any wish to improve themselves or "
"their talents — their only concern is survival!\""
msgstr ""
"\"노움은 이런 친척을 둬서 그리 기쁘지는 않아. 그 원시적인 녀석들은 능력을 개발하려는 기회를 피하고 오직 생존에만 집중하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "4eecf7a0-c5b1-465d-bc05-61c7001d25aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai scratches his head.{/n} \"Is that bad? Gnomes are noisy, restless, "
"and weak. Gotta keep a distance from them to survive. Being more like them "
"would be worse.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아가이는 머리를 긁습니다.{/n} \"그게 나빠? 노움은 시끄럽고 참을성 없는 약골이야. 살아남으려면 멀리하는 게 좋아. 그 "
"녀석들처럼 된다면 더 나빠지는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "50d94cff-4f38-4799-bde2-91bd7bd8e78d"
msgid ""
"\"So you're starting to get it. Some people think the world's full of song "
"and dance. In reality, all that stands between you and death is your ability "
"to take care of yourself — we don't waste time on frivolous nonsense.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 너는 이해하기 시작했구나. 어떤 이들은 세상은 노래와 춤으로 가득하다고 믿지. 사실 약한 녀석들이 빨리 죽지. 우리는 쓸데 "
"없는 일에 시간 낭비하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "82b1db8c-86e4-46d6-a86f-a05e56cdda41"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost clears his throat.{/n} \"Allow me, as a specialist, to share "
"some knowledge with you, my ignorant companions. The gist is thus — "
"spriggans are pathetic skeptics, obsessed with their primitive devotion to "
"'survival.' When the gnomes had just arrived in this world, some rejected "
"traveling, exploring, and seeking new knowledge. Those shortsighted fools "
"devolved into something like the poor creature you see before you, dwelling "
"in the dirt and starting at every noise.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 헛기침을 합니다.{/n} \"내가 전문가로서 너에게 한마디 하자면 말이지. 스프리건들은 멍청한 녀석들이라 생존에만 "
"집중하지. 노움이 이 세상에 나타났을 때 몇몇이 탐험이나 지식 추구를 게을리했어. 그 멍청한 녀석들이 네 앞에 있는 멍청한 생명체로 "
"바뀌어 흙구덩이 속에서 꾸역대면서 사는 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "9f30684e-56ca-4481-8f95-070cbf95e76d"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai eyes Jubilost up and down, scratching his own cheek with the point "
"of his knife.{/n} \"Your hair is fading.\""
msgstr "{n}아가이는 주빌로스트를 위아래로 훑어보면서 칼 끝으로 자신의 뺨을 긁습니다.{/n} \"네 머리는 바래가는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f02a75c8-c756-4d22-a3b3-f86e044189cc"
msgid ""
"{n}The color drains from Jubilost's face as he frantically grabs for his "
"hair. But once he realizes he's been fooled, the gnome blushes and turns "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그가 미친듯이 머리를 쥐어뜯으면서 주빌로스트의 얼굴빛은 창백해집니다. 하지만 그가 놀림 받았다는 것을 알자 노움은 얼굴이 붉어지고는 "
"등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "b172837a-97c5-4efd-9a70-4f1145475f6f"
msgid ""
"\"Further we are from them, the better. They don't bother us, we don't "
"bother them. Been like that for many years, and it works just fine.\""
msgstr "\"그들과 멀 수록 더 좋아. 우리는 서로 신경쓰지 않는 거지. 오랜 시간이 지났지만 나쁘지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "f2449806-46b3-4478-91d4-5d908de73b95"
msgid ""
"\"Where's the sense in that? Why spend time wagging tongues when we could "
"spend that time hunting?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그런 게 가능한 거지? 왜 쓸데 없는 말이나 지껄이면서 사냥은 하지 않고 시간 낭비하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "bfd554c8-286b-4576-b77d-8ff01f20d8e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai's gaze falls back on his stake as he returns to his whittling.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이의 시선은 나무로 향하고 그는 다시 나무를 깎습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "addd04d9-a534-47bc-9871-10de09a12881"
msgid "\"Good... If true.\""
msgstr "\"좋아... 그게 사실이라면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "99f1363d-65a5-4c2e-b59e-96bfb00dfc40"
msgid "\"What a disappointment... No songs either?\""
msgstr "\"실망스럽구나... 노래가 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "086104fc-7732-4a18-bedd-8ddd44a181ab"
msgid ""
"\"Songs? Who needs these? If you make noise, you're easy to find, and if "
"you're easy to find, then you don't sing anymore, because you're dead!\""
msgstr "\"노래? 노래가 왜 필요해? 시끄러우면 발견되기 쉽고 쉽게 발견되면 죽어버려서 더 이상은 노래를 못하는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3d18c508-a915-412c-973c-dfdd7e413afe"
msgid ""
"\"What? Are we killing him now? Then why even give him hope in "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g} and let him go?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 그를 지금 죽여? 왜 그럼 그를 {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}에서 살려준 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss_OldCaveDangeon
msgctxt "c10dbf9c-09ab-4390-b0c3-1b8ba8322ec2"
msgid "\"Get {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/FriendlyAgai/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6d59ed0e-4ac3-4481-b44c-3211e014a6d5"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok slowly reaches for one of the stakes. Without even looking, Agai "
"slaps the goblin's clawed little hand, which jerks back immediately.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 말뚝 중 하나에 천천히 다가갑니다. 보지도 않고 아가이는 고블린의 손을 찰싹 때렸고 고블린은 바로 손을 뺍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "bcd41c81-d54a-4162-96c2-d89cfcb5240a"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You look like regular bandits to me — and I don't waste words on "
"bandits!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 그냥 도적처럼 보이는데. 나는 도적과는 말을 섞지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "1f2e808a-78a2-421e-a752-06eb91936f3e"
msgid "\"Looks like I came to the wrong place.\""
msgstr "\"내가 잘못 온 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "9f0b458f-0618-4db5-b320-17d94a62f1f9"
msgid ""
"\"I'm the local baron{mf||ess} — I have every right to be here. And who are "
"you?\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 땅의 지배자다. 어디를 가던 내 마음이야. 너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "44c4f4c8-2cc3-4e6f-838a-950bfd3a9314"
msgid "\"This is your only warning — let me in, or I'll force my way in.\""
msgstr "\"이건 그냥 경고야. 나를 들여보내주지 않으면 강제로 들어가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "91dec554-cdf7-4174-b917-33b4fb123e29"
msgid ""
"\"I'm just a traveler looking for a safe place to spend the night. Please "
"let me in.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그냥 묵어갈 곳을 찾는 여행자야. 나를 들여보내줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "60b3daa1-95ab-45a5-9a97-4a0b462f6c84"
msgid ""
"[Bribe the guards with 500 coins] \"I really need to get in there. Can we "
"make a deal?\""
msgstr "[경비에게 500닢을 뇌물로 줍니다] \"나는 저기로 들어가야겠어. 이정도면 되겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2a5596bd-7c26-4cc3-bbef-7b629e41ce10"
msgid "Killed the barbarians for insulting you."
msgstr "당신을 모욕하는 야만인을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "4fa6ba5b-14ac-4272-88b7-74c9e060d114"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, who's that walking over there?\" {n}A barbarian standing guard at the "
"cave entrance calls over to you coarsely.{/n} \"It's dangerous to walk "
"around here. Better turn back!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 거기 누가 걸어가고 있는 거야??\" {n}야만인이 동굴 입구에서 경비를 서며 당신을 부릅니다.{/n} \"여기 주변을 "
"걸어다니는 건 위험해. 돌아가는 게 좋을걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b2a03625-6565-4ec1-a24a-c50a0278cd96"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri answers something in Hallit, the native tongue of the "
"{g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} Kellid tribes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 켈리드 부족의 할리트어로 대답합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "31aaeb90-25da-4c9f-8345-53998b5e2a2d"
msgid ""
"{n}The guards look to you with their hands on their weapons, waiting for an "
"answer.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}경비는 무기를 든 채 당신의 대답을 기다리고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "7beb2976-e108-4650-a0d0-44573ec8478d"
msgid ""
"{n}After a brief exchange in Hallit with Amiri, the guard switches back to "
"Common.{/n} \"Peace. If you want to speak with our elders or spend the "
"night, you may enter. Just don't expect a free dinner!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리와 할리트 어로 대화가 끝난 후 경비는 다시 공용어로 말합니다.{/n} \"좋아. 우리 대장과 대화하고 묵어갈 곳을 찾는다면 "
"들어가. 공짜 저녁은 기대하지 말라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "5349161e-6e33-45b9-9ee8-4fab66ae9006"
msgid "\"You again? What do you need?\""
msgstr "\"또 너냐? 뭐가 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "d0d84030-0f73-4a49-98d3-bcf30ed4df51"
msgid ""
"{n}The guard scratches his head, confused.{/n} \"You? A chieftain? Will "
"wonders never cease!\""
msgstr "{n}경비는 머리를 긁적입니다.{/n} \"네가? 족장을? 정말 놀랍구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "9ac78c1a-6d56-410b-b78c-423c635e523d"
msgid "{n}A mocking grin appears on the guard's face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}경비의 얼굴에 비웃음이 나타납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "f3a88e37-552c-4ec4-89a4-e1ed1f6ec681"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, easy now! We have a cave full of fighters, here. You want in — enter. "
"But if you're looking for trouble, it may be closer than you thought.\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 진정해! 동굴에는 전사들이 가득하니까. 들어가고 싶다고? 말썽을 부릴거면 네 기대대로 되고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "091a9038-5173-4ea2-9e86-7dcfa0f717da"
msgid "\"Looking to put your strength to the test? That can be arranged!\""
msgstr "\"네 힘을 시험해보고 싶은가? 그럼 좋다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "c299caaf-a174-45aa-896c-0a50f151bfcd"
msgid ""
"\"We're fighters from the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} tribe. We're just "
"minding our own business here — we're not looking for a fight. So long as "
"you're not looking for trouble, you may enter.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족의 전사다. 싸우러 온 게 아니라 할 일이 있어 온 거야. 말썽을 피우지 "
"않겠다면 들어가도 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "9c6c841a-beaa-4c38-9086-d1c96da698f2"
msgid ""
"\"You, a chieftain? Your elven fingers couldn't hold anything heavier than a "
"spoon! How could you lead warriors?\""
msgstr "\"네가 족장을? 네 앙상한 손가락으로는 숟가락도 못들겠다! 어떻게 전사들을 이끌 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "6e62e6b5-f4b3-46d6-a299-f1dd55a32892"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, a chieftain, are you? But you can hardly be seen down there! I could "
"crush you underfoot without even noticing!\""
msgstr "\"오. 네가 족장이라고? 내 허리 밑으로 보이지도 않는 녀석이! 보이지도 않아서 발로 채이겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "7cc20822-613b-4ad5-9646-94d6b2d2411c"
msgid ""
"\"A traveler? All right, come in — warm yourself by the fire. Just stay out "
"of storage, and don't expect a free meal!\""
msgstr "\"여행자라고? 좋아. 들어가. 불 좀 쬐서 몸을 녹이라고. 다만 창고에서 떨어져. 저녁은 기대하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "8f9fd0fe-be49-4e36-9198-586a81d42165"
msgid ""
"\"A traveler? I don't like the look of you. Go spend the night somewhere "
"else.\""
msgstr "\"여행자라고? 네 꼴이 마음에 들지 않아. 다른 데 가서 알아봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "c301030e-45f1-410a-ab66-494fe29840be"
msgid ""
"{n}After sharing the gold, the guards step aside.{/n} \"Don't know what "
"you're after in this hellhole, but when you meet our elders, you'll have to "
"explain it to them yourself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}돈을 받고 경비는 비켜줍니다.{/n} \"여기에 들어가서 무슨 짓을 하려는지 모르겠지만 우리 대장을 만나면 설명을 잘해야 할 거다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "836810b3-6cd7-490c-a181-b3293974e5b8"
msgid ""
"\"I assure you that this is indeed the baron{mf||ess} of {kingdomname}, as "
"well as my l{mf|ord|ady}. Show some respect!\""
msgstr "\"분명히 말하는데 이분은 {kingdomname}의 지배자시다. 예의를 갖춰라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "5276c17f-29d8-4be5-a73b-db91ebb941df"
msgid "\"All right, all right! A chieftain, huh. Wonders never cease!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 좋아! 족장이라고. 정말 놀랍군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9f306fda-9329-4deb-a863-aba58fe9a039"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, a brave one, aren't you? Well, come on, then. Try to give us a hard "
"time! What, are your hands sweaty already? I thought so.\""
msgstr "\"용감한 녀석이구나? 그렇다면 들어와. 어떻게 되는지 보자고! 벌써 겁먹은 건 아니지? 겁먹은 것 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0036_Text_String
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "29851659-284c-4b6c-b728-c25513af0a26"
msgid ""
"\"Heh, we're going to have some fun! I'm going to punch you so hard, your "
"arms'll fly to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, and your legs'll make it all the way "
"to {g|Katapesh}Katapesh{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"헤. 재미 좀 보자고! 내 주먹을 맞으면 네 팔은 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}까지 날라가고 네 다리는 "
"{g|Katapesh}카타페쉬{/g}로 도망갈 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "37aa11d0-394b-4d3a-b5d5-c0268bbe032b"
msgid "{n}The barbarian turns away, feigning indifference.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}야만인은 등을 돌리더니 관심을 보이지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/C31_OldCaveDungeon/Guards/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : C31_OldCaveDungeonGateM
msgctxt "29ea00bc-61d6-4cc0-8a91-c5c89b9bbd25"
msgid "\"Alert! We're under attack!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 우리는 공격을 당하고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/CompanionQuests_OctRegQ2_TechLeagueCave/Barks/Bark_TechnicLeagueCaveDoor1Closed_String
msgctxt "da8a34d3-77d8-4020-bd21-24147b15d574"
msgid "The door is locked."
msgstr "문은 잠겨있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/CompanionQuests_OctRegQ2_TechLeagueCave/Barks/Bark_TechnicLeagueCaveDoor2ClosedBeforeObj2_String
msgctxt "e02426a3-8084-4ff5-bf1a-e94d154b176e"
msgid "The door is locked from the other side."
msgstr "문은 반대편에서 잠겨있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/CompanionQuests_OctRegQ2_TechLeagueCave/Barks/Bark_TechnicLeagueCaveDoor2ClosedSaveSlaves_String
msgctxt "efa5c855-2caf-4cd1-94a3-eb4a7deca4e7"
msgid "\"Wait! We need to save these people first!\""
msgstr "\"기다려! 일단 사람부터 구하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Camp_barbarian_1_String
msgctxt "a3b5a3bc-4e49-45a6-b7ba-c051f66eaeab"
msgid ""
"\"Normal cyclopes weren't enough, no, now we have zombie cyclopes, too! "
"What's next? Ghost cyclopes? Maybe vampire cyclopes?\""
msgstr "\"사이클롭스로 모자라 좀비 사이클롭스라고! 끔찍하군! 유령 사이클롭스라도 나오려나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Camp_barbarian_2_String
msgctxt "a08738ae-46fc-4fb4-b82b-2b11032064b1"
msgid "\"If the Sister brought us here, she must have had a good reason.\""
msgstr "\"자매가 우리를 여기로 인도했다면 이유가 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Camp_barbarian_3_String
msgctxt "37daaa69-0dc1-4b19-a484-4dff3145a655"
msgid ""
"\"This place is awful. It clearly wasn't meant for humans — or the living, "
"really.\""
msgstr "\"이 곳은 끔찍해. 여기는 사람이나 살아있는 것이 살 곳이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Camp_barbarian_4_String
msgctxt "0405138e-5b45-4641-b4f0-b8eb156d4079"
msgid "\"Stay on guard. They could attack at any time.\""
msgstr "\"조심해. 그들은 언제든 우리를 공격할 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Camp_barbarian_5_String
msgctxt "57d464a6-0800-4acf-874f-2e98a4f5035a"
msgid "\"Sooner we leave this place, the better.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 곧 이곳을 떠난다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Camp_sister_String
msgctxt "8f8e9293-6cda-4b7f-87b1-1a8ee9aff358"
msgid "\"Thank you for your help. We will head to the camp immediately.\""
msgstr "\"도와줘서 고마워. 곧 캠프로 가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/VandalBattle_1_String
msgctxt "25f392b6-1349-43f8-b9cb-953a787dcf76"
msgid "\"To arms! The dead have returned!\""
msgstr "\"전투 준비! 죽은자들이 돌아왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/VandalBattle_2_String
msgctxt "15d53425-7f45-4ee4-b6be-6aeaa9f0d787"
msgid "\"Let's put them back to rest!\""
msgstr "\"그들에게 다시 안식을 주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone-Tomb_01_String
msgctxt "ce5353e8-e908-4e7d-82d7-e90944279b36"
msgid "This door cannot be opened — it's fake, just a carving on the wall."
msgstr "문은 열리지 않습니다. 그저 벽에 새긴 가짜였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone-Tomb_02_String
msgctxt "39e7d096-a710-49f4-b66c-b2344f33bc72"
msgid "A stone face gazes at you from the wall."
msgstr "벽에 돌이 당신을 응시합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone-Tomb_03_String
msgctxt "3f439e1a-80eb-41d4-a794-bad8d37ea172"
msgid ""
"The container is full of sealed clay jars, each decorated with pictures of "
"internal organs."
msgstr "내부는 봉인된 토기로 가득했고 모두 신체 장기의 그림이 그려졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_01_String
msgctxt "337b8074-f8ff-4b06-a3a6-fed4e656d3f5"
msgid "There are enormous footprints in the dirt."
msgstr "흙바닥에 거대한 발자국이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_02_String
msgctxt "857fb878-176a-475f-957a-04aac33db71d"
msgid "An old boat with a large breach is rotting on the shore."
msgstr "손상된 오래된 배가 해안가에서 썩고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_03_String
msgctxt "07521fb3-7af3-4447-a66e-6cfe9fd67a4f"
msgid "Barely legible letters are carved in the stone."
msgstr "돌에 거의 읽을 수 없는 글이 쓰여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_04_String
msgctxt "d4184ce4-d0fc-427e-a901-0c08fd3e40ff"
msgid "The ancient stone is crumbling and covered with moss."
msgstr "고대의 돌은 부서져 이끼가 껴있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_05_String
msgctxt "61b87ecb-a3b3-49e8-ba9a-979f86a8c4c0"
msgid "These steps are too large for human feet."
msgstr "이 발자국은 인간의 것이라고 하기에는 너무 컸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_06_String
msgctxt "92a14859-620c-4b87-9217-1a03cef199bb"
msgid "This poor soul's skull was crushed, and the brain was removed."
msgstr "이 불쌍한 영혼의 두개골은 부서져 속이 비어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_07_String
msgctxt "35559ed3-32a2-4afc-9732-e9a7389d2486"
msgid "It took many blows to drop this enormous undead beast."
msgstr "이 거대한 짐승을 죽이려면 엄청나게 많은 타격을 가했을 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_08_String
msgctxt "fb0815eb-d5f7-4056-a073-195c352ec4f7"
msgid "This barbarian was killed very recently."
msgstr "이 야만인은 최근에 죽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_09_String
msgctxt "33f61789-84f4-40a5-8052-76b0be810a1d"
msgid "Wolves have gnawed on the human corpses, but not the undead."
msgstr "늑대들이 아직 언데드가 되지 않은 인간의 시체를 먹고 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Barks/Zone_10_String
msgctxt "b58f0ef4-3e3e-46ae-bff5-3ee4c0633449"
msgid "The animal was killed with a single devastating blow."
msgstr "이 동물은 단 한방에 죽은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a71eaecc-5362-4a8d-a697-f52ca290513d"
msgid "\"Have we met?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 만난 적이 있던가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a774e3c7-62e8-434f-9f40-677c839883a7"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "2ff52118-f52c-4034-9856-461d1661843e"
msgid "\"So, have you found anything?\""
msgstr "\"뭐 좀 찾았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "e8385e17-5dd6-4d62-8201-b303ee10464b"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "86d9ce49-d0c2-46c3-aff9-604942f6b470"
msgid "Refused to take your share of the Dunsward treasure."
msgstr "던스워드의 보물을 나눠주기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "fffdab7e-0f79-497d-8778-9609054fe70b"
msgid "\"You keep the treasure.\""
msgstr "\"이 보물을 가지고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "40d42e4c-44af-439a-b389-43e4f64073f6"
msgid "[Take the coins] \"Congratulations on the lucky find!\""
msgstr "[동전을 집습니다] \"운이 좋구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7f7c44f3-c2f8-4a68-9d29-76b3aa39be46"
msgid "Seized the whole Dunsward treasure."
msgstr "던스워드의 보물을 모두 가져갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "f59a82dc-0bf6-4935-894d-2df8b5ce31ba"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean, 'share'? You'll give me all you've found immediately.\""
msgstr "\"나누다니 무슨 의미지? 네가 찾은 건 모두 내놔.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "f11ddee1-500a-4b0f-af20-857c5ea7d165"
msgid "\"Lucky you! You must have been kissed by Desna herself!\""
msgstr "\"운이 좋군! 데즈나 여신에게 키스라도 했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1_1
msgctxt "4e204835-6c51-4146-9b8e-b35f561db236"
msgid ""
"\"Look! It's the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}! You've got yourself pretty "
"far from the capital, haven't you?\""
msgstr "\"봐! {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}이야! 수도에서 꽤 멀리 오셨군요, 안그렇나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1_1
msgctxt "fb426d08-5b7b-447d-b53c-7244e896a68f"
msgid ""
"\"It's all thanks to you! Farewell, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness} —"
" here's hoping we see you again sometime!\" {n}Having handed you the coins, "
"the treasure hunters leave.{/n}"
msgstr "\"모두 고마워! 언젠가 다시 만나지!\" {n}당신에게 동전을 건네며 보물 사냥꾼은 떠났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2_1
msgctxt "514741bf-d30f-43c3-87f5-2a1ff34401fb"
msgid ""
"\"You don't remember us? Well, I guess you probably got too much on your "
"plate to remember everyone you happen across... We're the folk you met in "
"the {g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}! We were digging for treasure under a "
"tree, but there wasn't anything there. Then you gave us a hint on where to "
"go — without you, we'd still be stumping around that swamp, all for nothing!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리를 기억하지 못해? 뭐 우리를 기억하기에는 너무나 많은 사람을 알았을 수도 있겠군... 우리는 "
"{g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}의 주민들이야! 우리는 나무 밑을 파서 보물을 찾으려 했지만 아무것도 없었어. 네가 "
"와서 다행이야. 네가 없었다면 여전히 늪 주위를 파헤치며 헛수고나 하고 있었겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2_1
msgctxt "b3468018-0ba6-45c4-8e8c-e4891a4dd0e3"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean, what are we doing here? You were the one who {d|c21 "
"Golddiggers Random}pointed{/d} us out here toward the treasure, after all. "
"It was a long walk, but we knew if the {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} "
"{mf|him|her}self told us to come here, it just had to be true!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐하고 있냐니. 무슨 의미야? 네가 우리에게 {d|c21 Golddiggers Random}보물이 있다고{/d} 가리켜주었잖아. 오래 "
"걸렸지만 이 땅의 지배자가 말해줬으니 진실이겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1_1
msgctxt "43b08f44-ce21-4adb-9523-bd61839507c7"
msgid ""
"\"What... but... But why? Shameful... That's just shameful! And to think, "
"they call you 'Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}'!\" {n}The peasants "
"spit on the ground spitefully, but they hand over the treasure and leave "
"hastily.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐... 하지만 왜? 그럴 수가... 너무하군! 그러고도 네가 지배자인가!\" {n}농민들은 땅에 침을 뱉었지만 보물을 "
"넘겨주었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2_1
msgctxt "1a81f2f6-7a1c-4a15-b6ab-394d83aa7a62"
msgid "\"You bet we did! We really found something good! Look at this!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 해냈을 거라고 생각했군! 우리는 무언가를 발견했지! 이걸 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1_1
msgctxt "d787f72a-82dd-4441-bfce-9db6e724734e"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, you're too kind! We'll pray "
"for you every single day! Come along, fellows. Let's get out of here before "
"we end up some monster's dinner!\" {n}The treasure hunters bow and leave.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"고마워! 너를 위해 언제나 기도할게! 이봐들. 괴물의 저녁 밥이 되기 싫으면 어서 자리를 뜨자고!\" {n}보물 사냥꾼은 인사를 하고 "
"떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2_1
msgctxt "9a1aae4d-2731-473d-8122-7dc1a2d2cc29"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}, don't leave yet! I'm "
"telling you, we found treasure! The treasure you told us about. Take a look!"
"\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만! 보물을 발견했어! 네가 말하던 그 보물이야. 한번 보라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1_1
msgctxt "90e85a6a-175f-4e5b-a17c-be2f3b33f01e"
msgid ""
"{n}The treasure hunter hands you a fistful of ancient coins, with a bit of "
"soil mixed in.{/n} \"We're fair, honest folk, you know! You pointed us to "
"the treasure — this is your share!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보물 사냥꾼은 당신에게 흙이 묻은 고대 동전 한줌을 건냅니다.{/n} \"우리는 거짓말 안한다고! 네가 보물이 있는 곳을 "
"알려주었으니 이걸 나눠줄게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "2a894b76-a5ea-4738-9210-45776b1e5f8b"
msgid ""
"\"Not as far as you! How did you even get here in such... uneaten shape?\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 가까이 있다니! 어떻게 이곳까지 온 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer1_1
msgctxt "c0f5b0a6-122d-4b1a-8dfe-08bb6983f271"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, who'd want us? Nothing really to take — even our meat is probably too "
"dry!\""
msgstr "\"누가 우리를 필요로 한다고? 우린 아무것도 가진 게 없는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "222cb904-505d-4ae6-86c5-790bf88c1bb7"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose the old saying is true: luck favors the fool and the drunkard..."
"\""
msgstr "\"옛말이 맞았어. 행운은 바보와 술주정뱅이에게 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : GoldFever_Adventurer2_1
msgctxt "182d4b48-86b8-472e-8fdd-cf4ef2ba63cd"
msgid "\"Hey, we're not drunks! I haven't had a single sip in over a month!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 술을 마시지 않았어! 한달에 한잔 할 정도인데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bb2ce70a-10be-4df5-8d02-d86098c30025"
msgid "\"No, no, never mind. Certainly not drunkards. Of course.\""
msgstr "\"신경쓰지 마. 물론 아니겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b6086825-159b-4373-9752-ff809e3d9e72"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie shakes her head, smiling slightly.{/n} \"They earned every coin "
"of this treasure with the sweat of their brows. Leave these lucky ones to "
"their reward.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 고개를 흔들고는 살짝 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"땀을 흘려가며 돈을 버는 자들입니다. 이것들은 그들의 몫으로 남겨두죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c5407a3e-df29-4130-bbcc-ec6129916a38"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you have wisdom enough to handle it properly.\" {n}Valerie looks at "
"you with pride.{/n}"
msgstr "\"당신이 충분히 해결할 것이라고 생각합니다.\" {n}발레리는 자부심이 담긴 눈빛으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "14b98546-541f-440b-8ca3-2f224e067af4"
msgid "\"How can you be such an unprincipled egoist?!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그렇게 이기적일 수가 있지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "50ba404f-0b93-4026-9d36-08c1602b9934"
msgid ""
"{n}At the sight of gold, Nok-Nok's eyes gleam greedily. He begins scratching "
"his hands as though trying to satisfy an itch.{/n} \"More. All. Take all. "
"You rule — it's your right to take all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}금이 눈 앞에 보이자 녹-녹의 눈은 탐욕으로 빛납니다. 그는 머리를 긁적입니다.{/n} \"더 가져와. 전부. 다 가져간다. 네가 "
"지배하니까 가져가도 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GoldFever/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "d68f84be-c964-4767-88d5-5a4f63e8d8ac"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, we're just normal folk — it's you who's been touched by her grace! I "
"guess a bit of it just rubbed off on us!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그냥 평범한 사람인데. 그러고 보니 넌 그분의 은총을 받았지! 같이 다니니까 행운이 살짝 옮겨 붙었나 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "347ee99a-2d9e-46a0-8732-9e1e44687fbe"
msgid "[Try to decipher their speech]"
msgstr "[그들의 말을 이해하려고 합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a83d3aa8-04a1-4813-923c-0e8dc4a38927"
msgid "[Attack]"
msgstr "[공격]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9d2c5fa9-740f-4725-9a05-dbc72f5a318e"
msgid "[Move closer]"
msgstr "[가까이 다가갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f119d564-fcfe-42c1-be35-50845f438f4f"
msgid "[Leave unnoticed]"
msgstr "[몰래 떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "265a9418-dd60-4675-b402-35981ef56def"
msgid "[Try to decipher their speech]"
msgstr "[그들의 말을 이해하려고 합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "d8c24144-fad7-43a9-9ad9-464d220cbf64"
msgid "[Attack]"
msgstr "[공격]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "383d5bbe-d2de-4d74-8d04-fb14f2f37782"
msgid "[Flee]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "0cd3b451-884c-45da-b06a-206b4fc634f1"
msgid "\"What are you arguing about?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 얘기를 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "2a05dcbe-4c3d-47ea-84a4-dcfe41e181c2"
msgid "\"What makes this 'treasure' so valuable?\""
msgstr "\"이 보물이 얼마나 가치있길래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "9c42ce38-7e56-45a6-979b-6e160e3506b7"
msgid "[Inspect the stone]"
msgstr "[돌을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "9cf1949c-e0c2-491d-989b-7a7063e015e9"
msgid "[Try to puzzle out the cyclopes' behavior]"
msgstr "[사이클롭스의 행동의 원인을 밝혀냅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a879c3b6-3ed2-4494-ae3b-a1980b52a741"
msgid "Told the cyclopes to resolve their dispute in a battle."
msgstr "사이클롭스에게 싸움으로 해결하라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "b4c4271e-4194-477b-bdd7-da9bde76b4bb"
msgid ""
"\"What's the point in arguing? Just settle the matter with an honest fight.\""
msgstr "\"말싸움 해봐야 무슨 소용이겠어? 그냥 싸움 한판으로 끝내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0042_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "341daeca-9088-4a4d-83c6-6e5e73643c85"
msgid "Told the cyclopes to share the treasure between them."
msgstr "사이클롭스에게 보물을 나누라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "cc5666e9-72ef-4b83-af38-c68b894095a0"
msgid "\"Instead of fighting, you could share the treasure equally.\""
msgstr "\"싸우기보다는 보물을 공평하게 나눠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "4b0bd894-0ac8-4349-9977-7537c8839dd1"
msgid ""
"\"Treasure, you say? If you value your lives, you'll hand it over to me!\""
msgstr "\"보물이라고? 목숨이 소중하다면 내게 넘기는 게 좋을걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "b49cfd26-a086-43e5-bf9f-c409c7699dad"
msgid "\"All right. Good luck.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 행운을 빈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "7799bfa2-ba83-47ea-abcf-a200dffbb0ee"
msgid "[Attack] \"Shut up and fight!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"닥치고 덤벼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "12ea3b2e-0aba-426a-929a-d6436b366634"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 사용합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "7c794716-8dfc-4af7-a5ce-3fc2bf0bcccd"
msgid "[Use dispel magic]"
msgstr "[해제 마법을 사용합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4469ee0a-f980-4cfc-93a5-70802fa2ef6e"
msgid ""
"{n}Two cyclopes are having a heated dispute in their rough language. They "
"stomp their feet, pound their chests, sputter, and pay absolutely no "
"attention to anything else around them, yourself included.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}사이클롭스 둘이 그들의 언어로 다투고 있습니다. 그들은 바닥을 구르며 가슴을 치며 말싸움을 하고 있었고 주위에 누가 왔던 신경쓰지 "
"않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ca16c0bc-31c3-4e4d-96ca-ad4286523fc3"
msgid ""
"{n}You manage to make out some of the cyclopes' speech.{/n} \"Mine! Not "
"yours!\" {n}The cyclops is yelling and shaking his fist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 그들의 말을 이해하려고 노력합니다.{/n} \"내 거다! 니 꺼 아니다!\" {n}사이클롭스는 소리를 지르며 주먹을 "
"흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "85cf33cc-3905-438b-96af-eeb68a379d06"
msgid "{n}You can't make out any of what they're saying.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 그들이 하는 말을 이해하지 못했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "f1bd6985-a121-4e8b-bb8d-440506c6838d"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, you! Insect! What are you doing? Get out of here before we step on "
"you!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 너! 뭐하는 거야? 꺼지지 않으면 밟아버릴 테다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "554e8e7b-3b4f-4f71-9876-e1dc13ddb61b"
msgid ""
"{n}One of the cyclopes yells something at you in his language, shaking his "
"hairy fist angrily.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사이클롭스 한명이 당신에게 소리를 지르고 주먹을 거칠게 휘두릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "603da0cd-11c7-4bac-9167-2d0f7d9122e1"
msgid "{n}You manage to make out some of the cyclopes' speech.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 그들이 하는 말을 이해했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "89b0f2f3-fb1a-45c2-8f4d-3f2647740bbe"
msgid ""
"{n}The cyclopes don't give chase. They instead return to their heated "
"argument.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사이클롭스는 쫓아오지 않았습니다. 그들은 다시 말싸움에 집중합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardOutdoor_CR12_CyclopGreat02
msgctxt "70e73c01-68a3-4113-bd72-849990d6dbfc"
msgid "\"I saw it first! Go away!\""
msgstr "\"내가 먼저 봤다. 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "aadbeda4-2fe5-4ae4-a8a6-b8abb9a96c1b"
msgid "\"You go away! I'm not giving it up!\""
msgstr "\"네가 꺼져라! 나는 포기 안 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "be18c170-cb0e-481e-b04c-45e3292714e7"
msgid "{n}The cyclopes turn to you, furrowing their bushy brows.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사이클롭스의 복슬복슬한 눈썹은 찡그려졌고 그는 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "e7310fa9-1f45-4b42-84ac-306063882fe0"
msgid "\"What do you care, insect?\""
msgstr "\"네가 무슨 상관이냐. 벌레 같은 녀석.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardOutdoor_CR12_CyclopGreat02
msgctxt "d4a6e8ad-5ee6-4689-910e-2c0131e83645"
msgid ""
"\"I'm telling! Let everyone know what a dirtbag you are! I found this "
"treasure!\" {n}The cyclops slams his palm against the obelisk.{/n} \"This "
"eyesore wants to take it for himself!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 사실을 말해주지! 내가 이 보물을 발견했다!\" {n}사이클롭스는 오벨리스크를 손바닥으로 내려칩니다.{/n} \"이 멍청한 "
"외눈박이는 욕심이 너무 많아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "f1e5801e-f230-4069-b437-c73a60a7c045"
msgid "\"You found it? You?! I found it! You weren't even here!\""
msgstr "\"네가 발견했다고? 네가?! 내가 발견했다! 너는 이 자리에 없었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "2dbe984b-7485-4c25-99e6-819e09beb13b"
msgid ""
"\"Erm...\" {n}The cyclops scratches his head.{/n} \"You, uh... you wouldn't "
"understand!\""
msgstr "\"음...\" {n}사이클롭스는 머리를 긁습니다.{/n} \"네, 음...네가 이해할 수 있는게 아냐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardOutdoor_CR12_CyclopGreat02
msgctxt "0ce48c7d-add0-4e82-9628-6739081e515f"
msgid ""
"\"Right! You're not a cyclops — what would you know of treasure? My sweet, "
"precious treasure...\" {n}The cyclops tenderly pets the obelisk with his "
"huge hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 너는 사이클롭스가 아니야. 네가 보물에 대해 아는 게 뭐야? 내 소중하고 어여쁜 보물...\" {n}사이클롭스는 오벨리스크를 "
"커다란 손으로 쓰다듬습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "97dc9bd4-b643-4849-afdd-77d6ae987326"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! Paws off!\" {n}The second cyclops pushes the first away from the "
"stone.{/n}"
msgstr "\"이봐! 손 치워!\" {n}다른 사이클롭스가 그를 돌에서 밀쳐냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "dd8bd468-bc05-4a69-bae2-6490a62fbade"
msgid ""
"\"This little savage makes sense! I'll gouge out your eye an shove it so for "
"into-\""
msgstr "\"이 조그만 원숭이 말이 맞아! 네 눈깔을 뽑아버릴...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardOutdoor_CR12_CyclopGreat02
msgctxt "f95eb38e-58c1-4740-8745-f7c9ac87aaea"
msgid "\"Try it! We'll see how you do with two broken arms!\""
msgstr "\"덤벼! 네 팔이 부러지고도 그런 말을 하는지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "b2a8ed83-267f-487e-af28-a2c697ab37c1"
msgid ""
"{n}The cyclops tenderly caresses the stone's surface, completely ignoring "
"the outside world.{/n} \"Mine... It's mine! I'm rich! The richest person in "
"the world...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사이클롭스는 부드럽게 돌의 표면을 만졌고 다른 것은 전혀 신경쓰지 않는 듯합니다.{/n} \"내 거야... 내 거다! 나는 부자야! "
"세상에서 제일가는 부자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "ad779492-5386-474d-a000-602a6ea06f7b"
msgid "\"No. That would be wrong, wouldn't it? He's my brother!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 그렇지 않아. 그는 내 형제야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardOutdoor_CR12_CyclopGreat02
msgctxt "2abddc22-a1cc-475c-8aec-02026e1af7df"
msgid "\"Act like a brother, then! Give me the stone and get out of here!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 형제처럼 행동해! 내게 돌을 넘기고 당장 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "43f04b68-11b5-47d9-b92d-3311b6e1d387"
msgid "\"No, you get out of here!\""
msgstr "\"네가 꺼져라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "4569de63-5182-4cca-94d4-1dd0904353f7"
msgid "\"Forget that!\""
msgstr "\"웃기지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardOutdoor_CR12_CyclopGreat02
msgctxt "7ca26e7b-f1ca-472b-a327-259505710862"
msgid "\"Crush the little one!\""
msgstr "\"저 조그만 녀석을 뭉게버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "7023cb69-0094-40b7-8d1d-f55943bb3730"
msgid "\"Hey, this little one speaks truth. Maybe we should share it?\""
msgstr "\"조그만 녀석이 맞는 말을 한다. 나누는 게 좋지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardOutdoor_CR12_CyclopGreat02
msgctxt "2c570f80-9355-4998-b253-305cb06e9119"
msgid "\"Well, that could work... But how?\""
msgstr "\"그럴 수도 있지... 하지만 어떻게?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "36957119-c20e-467f-b693-c96f3bf668e3"
msgid ""
"\"Share? That's dumb! I'd rather pull his head off and keep the treasure "
"myself!\""
msgstr "\"나눠? 멍청한 짓이야! 저 녀석 머리를 뽑아버리고 내가 모두 가지겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "e6e9caf6-edc3-4fe5-90e0-84d5c88d45cd"
msgid ""
"\"I know! We'll drag it to camp, where we can both admire it! Give me a hand "
"here...\" {n}The cyclopes grab the obelisk and try to move it, grunting and "
"panting. The stone doesn't budge, but they keep trying.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"난 알지! 이걸 캠프로 끌고가면 둘 다 인정받을 수 있어! 와서 손 좀 보태...\" {n}사이클롭스는 오벨리스크를 쥐고는 끙끙거리며 "
"옮기려 합니다. 돌은 꿈쩍도 안하지만 그들은 계속해서 시도합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "d3509ca4-6932-447f-81d8-396765eb8111"
msgid ""
"{n}You didn't notice it at first, but there seems to be a pile of cyclopean "
"bones at the foot of the obelisk. They've been gnawed on, and it doesn't "
"seem like it was that long ago. This has the markings of a magical trap.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}처음에는 눈치 채지 못했지만 오벨리스크 바닥에는 사이클롭스의 뼈가 쌓여있습니다. 뼈에는 무언가 새겨졌고 그 흔적은 최근의 것입니다. "
"그것은 마법 덫의 표식이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "58cc0dd2-41b8-4c98-9886-cda05751d4b5"
msgid ""
"{n}The cyclopes ignore you completely. Their attention is completely focused "
"on the obelisk.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}사이클론은 당신을 완전히 무시합니다. 그들의 관심은 오벨 리스크에 완전히 집중되어 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "80d4825c-3af8-469a-91f5-0477a5f7bbf6"
msgid "{n}The stone radiates a powerful enchantment aura.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}돌은 강력한 마법의 기운을 풍깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "7fb64b08-1e94-4bc8-acfc-9d77a2a86815"
msgid ""
"{n}There doesn't seem to be anything unusual about the stone itself, but the "
"cyclopes believe it to be a great treasure... It seems reminiscent of an "
"enchantment spell. The ancient builders of this necropolis must have used "
"the obelisk to create an inconspicuous but deadly trap. Any cyclops who got "
"close enough would stay here, entranced by the obelisk, until they fell dead "
"of exhaustion or starvation. Fortunately for you, spells like this typically "
"can't target all sentient creatures, but rather need to be keyed to target a "
"specific kind of creature — for instance, cyclopes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}돌은 특별한 것이 없어 보이지만 사이클롭스는 이것이 엄청난 보물이라고 믿고 있습니다... 이것은 마법이 부여된 것처럼 보입니다. "
"네크로폴리스를 지은 고대인은 이 오벨리스크를 마법 덫으로 사용했을 것입니다. 이곳에 접근하는 사이클롭스는 죽을 때까지 굶주리게 됩니다. "
"운이 좋게도 당신은 사이클롭스와 같은 종족이 아니어서 마법에 걸리지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "f36f85fc-fefd-4f99-99ef-7ce55e222c36"
msgid "\"Uh, you know... I don't really need this rock. You can have it.\""
msgstr "\"너도 알다시피... 이 바위는 필요 없어. 네가 가져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardOutdoor_CR12_CyclopGreat02
msgctxt "672dc5b1-03f0-4d53-8398-328b8c4068df"
msgid ""
"\"Me? Why would I want it? You take it, if you want. I'm not going to drag "
"this stupid stone around.\""
msgstr "\"내가? 나는 필요 없어. 네가 가져. 이 바위 따위 들고 다니고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "42905d7b-a750-4794-8bcd-0fa894ae26fa"
msgid "\"Brother, all this arguing has made me hungry...\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 말싸움을 하니 배가 고파...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "3571fe26-f32c-483d-9efd-1d83e6ca355a"
msgid ""
"{n}Looking at you, the cyclopes lick their lips an begin moving toward "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신을 보면서 사이클롭스들은 입술을 핥고는 당신에게 천천히 접근합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "161ec630-cda6-4251-a882-8f68fb3373bc"
msgid ""
"{n}The cyclops's face falls as ecstasy gives way to disappointment. Puzzled, "
"he looks at the stone, then to you, then to the body of the second cyclops, "
"then back to you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}사이클롭스의 얼굴은 흥분하다가 급히 식어버린 표정입니다. 당황하면서 그는 바위를 보고는 다시 당신을 보고 다른 사이클롭스의 시체를 "
"보고는 다시 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "4f290bd9-d881-4fc2-8434-ef944b9301ed"
msgid "\"Little savage! This is your fault! Now you'll get what you deserve!\""
msgstr "\"조그만 쥐새끼가! 네 잘못이야! 이제 죗값을 치러라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8fde0267-8185-441d-875d-2adf09f169a3"
msgid "\"Ancient, great people, degraded into rabid animals. Pathetic.\""
msgstr "\"고대의 위대한 종족이 광견병이 걸린 동물로 퇴화했군. 안타깝다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "071e8352-99ba-46c6-b8c8-519e36982239"
msgid ""
"\"Here it is, the avarice. Two savages, among the ruins, fighting for a dead "
"rock... All who seek earthly treasures are just like this, are they not? "
"Hmmm...\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 있어. 폐허에 야만인 두 녀석이 바위 하나를 가지겠다고 싸우고 있던데... 보물을 찾는 탐욕스러운 녀석들은 모두 이런 식인가? "
"흠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "347f0535-2672-4451-ada7-1e508597eba5"
msgid ""
"\"I'm so tired of your whining! If avarice is so bad, why don't you take out "
"your last coins from your pockets and give them to those in need — to me, "
"for example? Also, be more like your god — he is just quietly whispering, "
"not giving pointless sermons to everyone around him!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 불평은 이제 질렸어! 탐욕이 그렇게 나쁘다면 왜 네가 가진 동전을 꺼내서 내게 주지 않는 거지? 설교 따위를 하려면 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "01d273ea-1466-49b1-8d23-d04e6a4e32e4"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok leans in and whispers,{/n} \"They not want you and Nok-Nok there! "
"Something brewing, I tell you!\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 몸을 기대고 속삭입니다.{/n} \"그들은 너나 녹-녹 원하는 거 아니다! 뭔가 이상하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5b64d2bf-89e4-4ea6-90f3-8a0e84671e0a"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok eyes the stone with such intensity that it seems like he's trying "
"to see right through it.{/n} \"Treasure...\" {n}His voice sounds unsure, but "
"it trembles with greed.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 바위의 정체를 알아보려고 꿰뚫어보고 있습니다.{/n} \"보물...\" {n}그의 목소리는 흐릿하지만 탐욕으로 떨리고 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/GreedyCyclops/Cue_0080_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "6eda07e0-1337-46ff-a985-11e2da573f70"
msgid "\"Yes! Our treasure!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 우리 보물!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "e332ef10-8a75-44bc-82dd-c7a8cf6d7387"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ce45ad4a-1751-4bac-b8d3-26225b3353cd"
msgid "[Attack] \"I won't let you go away alive.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너를 살려 보내지는 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "19eed344-bc82-44dc-bb20-d86b0d713cb9"
msgid "\"Your Sister has sent me. She's waiting for you in the camp.\""
msgstr "\"네 자매가 나를 보냈다. 캠프에서 기다리고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "7c951fb7-521b-4ad0-bd61-a452c9fd4309"
msgid "\"Do you know anything about what happened in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에서 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "c1da2b24-2e68-45d5-bcda-ebda5df09c25"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "95f09511-0c91-4b36-91d5-8bcc8cf059c1"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"이곳은 어디야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "9c5ccef5-6389-46ca-80cf-e5a2fe86aa6e"
msgid "\"Does the word 'Vordakai' mean anything to you?\""
msgstr "\"보다카이라는 말이 네게 무슨 의미가 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4939f45b-c7ab-4800-9fb7-724e803755c6"
msgid ""
"{n}The only breathing creature in the ancient tomb is a miniature woman, "
"wrapped in grey cloak. She looks like a ghost herself.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고대 무덤에서 살아 숨쉬는 유일한 생명체는 회색 망또로 몸을 두른 왜소한 여성이었습니다. 그녀는 귀신처럼 보였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "3afcee94-5520-465b-8021-011e516e1d8f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm one of the Defaced Sisters, a humble servant of benevolent spirits. No "
"words can express my gratitude for saving me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 자비로운 영혼의 보잘 것 없는 하인, 얼굴 잃은 자매 중의 하나이다. 나를 구해준 것에 대한 고마움을 이루 말할 수 없군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "32fb5376-67e9-4185-80cf-b6ff1a4f86bf"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}… I don't know much about the place, but ice-cold "
"winds of ill fate blow over it. If my Sisters are still alive, we can tell "
"you more together.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}… 그 장소에 대해서는 잘 모르지만 차가운 운명의 바람이 그 곳을 휩쓸었다. 내 자매들이 아직 "
"살아있다면 더 많은 것을 함께 이야기를 할 수 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "0b638057-c950-42d6-beb9-101883f3b876"
msgid ""
"\"Same as you — searching for the truth. My fate brought me here and opened "
"the door before me. I didn't know it would slam shut behind my back... If "
"the fate didn't bring you here right after me, I would soon fall asleep "
"beside the owners of this tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 같아. 진실을 찾고 있었다. 운명이 나를 여기로 이끌었고 그 문을 열어주었어. 내 등 뒤에서 그 문이 쾅 닫힐 줄은 몰랐지... "
"만약 운명이 너를 바로 데려오지 않았다면, 나는 이 무덤의 주인과 함께 잠들었을 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "882ac3a5-7e7f-4e6b-9f43-244cfcdb67a7"
msgid ""
"\"Once cyclopes used to own these lands. But their race was doomed to "
"extinction, their fortresses and palaces crumbled into dust and only tombs "
"remain.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사이클롭스는 한 때 이 땅을 지배했다. 하지만 그 종족은 멸종했고 그들의 요새와 궁전은 먼지가 되어 오직 무덤만이 남았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "1e63ba7f-2578-4be9-ac94-25b543f33eec"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. I was afraid I'd never see her again. Let benevolent spirits "
"guide you on your path, let them help you just like you helped me!\" {n}The "
"woman gives you a bow and leaves the tomb.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"고맙다. 다시는 그녀를 못 볼 줄 알았다. 자비로운 영혼들이 너를 인도하길. 자비로운 영혼이여, 이들이 저를 도왔듯이 당신도 이들을 "
"도우소서!\" {n} 여성은 당신에게 인사하고 무덤을 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6bca5748-aba2-4dc9-b3c1-153b1e0a51c6"
msgid ""
"\"Lips of mortals didn't utter this word for thousands of years... It would "
"be for the best if it remained so. Don't worry about this shadow of the past "
"— it dispersed forever the day when sky fell upon earth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수천 년 동안 필멸자들의 입은 이 단어를 말하지 않았다... 그렇게 잊혀지는 것이 최선이겠지. 과거의 이 그림자에 대해선 걱정하지 "
"마. 하늘이 땅에 떨어졌던 날 영원히 흩어졌으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/Sister_inTomb/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "30b71f5b-5a30-41e1-9ffc-b6d31e49107a"
msgid "\"Maybe such a fate would have been for the best...\""
msgstr "\"아마 그런 운명이 최선일지도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "7c7272f0-9104-47cf-913f-7a469f28609f"
msgid "[Try to pry the door open]"
msgstr "[문을 지렛대로 열려고 시도했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0a0111ba-5176-458b-81a4-0415106be9de"
msgid "[Examine the entrance]"
msgstr "[입구를 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "100229c5-78a3-4e91-87d8-7d0b7d1aac86"
msgid "[Try to break the door open]"
msgstr "[문을 부수려고 했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4b78174b-620a-42c5-b9d8-57d12fccfadb"
msgid "[Speak the word \"kheb\"]"
msgstr "[\"크헵\"이라는 단어를 말합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0c5d2a91-f942-4f4d-a885-7cf0a19026d4"
msgid "[Enter]"
msgstr "[들어갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "8a898bf7-22c3-468a-9d03-3450fbfc4cf8"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "bb2fec68-449c-41bb-9012-4e7a4b197b89"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "42b40d56-f8b6-4a9b-acb0-7cbc6ac6a407"
msgid "[Read the inscriptions on the door]"
msgstr "[문에 새겨진 주문을 읽습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "16e57d11-6106-4b4f-bada-92ce3c2106de"
msgid ""
"{n}A huge stone slab blocks entrance to the tomb. The ancient stone surface "
"is covered in worn inscriptions, barely visible beneath the moss.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}거대한 돌이 무덤 입구 바닥에 떨어집니다. 고대의 돌의 표면은 이끼에 덮인 새겨진 글씨가 쓰여있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8f1c2892-891a-4ec5-84b1-cc0411928784"
msgid ""
"{n}You examine the door closely, but you find no sign of any mechanism that "
"would open the door.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 문을 더 자세히 조사했지만 문을 열 수 있는 어떤 방법도 찾지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "dfb8429b-bf44-4833-9b6f-2ab595e12464"
msgid ""
"{n}The crumbling, ancient stone is densely covered with thick moss. Near the "
"edge of the slab, some of the moss has been torn — some unknown force must "
"have moved it aside and then replaced it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}부서진 고대의 돌은 두꺼운 이끼가 덮여있습니다. 가장자리 부분에는 이끼가 없습니다. 알 수 없는 힘이 이끼가 자라지 못하게 한 것 "
"같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "456e3037-35e6-4b2b-ad23-99585c11141e"
msgid ""
"{n}Chunks of moss fall from the slab as you strike it. There doesn't seem to "
"be any other effect.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 문을 때리자 이끼 덩어리가 가장자리에서 떨어집니다. 어떠한 효과도 없는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "d3c46c48-1447-4dd8-a415-6c0c7eaa6b81"
msgid ""
"{n}The slab slides aside, easily and noiselessly, making a crack wide enough "
"for you to enter.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}입구가 소리 없이 쉽게 옆으로 밀렸고 당신이 들어갈 만큼 충분한 갈라진 틈이 생겼습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "c6a547fc-b90c-4516-9d80-4dab5ad48161"
msgid ""
"{n}After ensuring the slab won't close itself behind you, you step into the "
"damp, cold darkness of the tomb.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문이 당신 뒤에서 덜커덩 거렸지만 닫히지 않은 것을 깨닫고 당신은 어둡고 축축한 무덤 속으로 들어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "f0c1e0ab-c2ac-4a41-81e0-c501a460de83"
msgid "{n}The door radiates a faint transmutation aura.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문은 희미한 아우라를 발산합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "c112d3f2-b1f9-4a26-bcce-0c44541fdc2b"
msgid ""
"{n}You manage to read several phrases of the ancient cyclopean language.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 고대 사이클롭스의 언어를 읽었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "9e86ab27-69b8-4c0a-b2b3-d862dd0077d7"
msgid ""
"{n}You stare at the symbols on the worn stone for a long, long time, but "
"they just won't reveal their secrets.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 닳은 돌의 상징을 오랫동안 보았지만 비밀은 풀리지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : ElderSister
msgctxt "4b2967d9-a036-4e9c-925d-babd5b985e32"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you have a chance to take a single step, a voice calls out from "
"inside the tomb.{/n} \"Wait! Do not enter! Prop the door, or it will close "
"behind you!\" {n}Unwilling to tempt fate, you move a large stone to the "
"entrance and prop the door open.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 한 발짝 다가가기 전에 무덤 안에서 목소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"잠깐만! 들어오지 마! 문에 무언가 받치지 않으면 네 등 "
"뒤에서 닫힐 거다!\" {n}갇혀 죽는 것은 싫었기에 당신은 거대한 돌을 문 옆에 두었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "744ae60b-1349-48c3-a9ff-acdb046be73a"
msgid ""
"{n}The huge stone slab that had been blocking the entrance now stands to the "
"side. The darkness within seems to almost breathe with cold and dust.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}입구를 막던 거대한 돌은 이제 옆에 치워졌습니다. 안 쪽의 어둠은 마치 냉기와 먼지를 숨쉬는 것 같았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "6a78131a-f80a-4122-92f9-f4c27c3c6e11"
msgid ""
"{n}Swearing under her breath, Amiri continues hitting the door several more "
"times. Once it's apparent that it isn't going to budge, she gives it an "
"angry kick.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}욕을 내뱉으며 아미리는 문을 계속해서 때립니다. 문이 꼼짝도 하지 않자 그녀는 화가 나서 발로 문을 찹니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "878df4ea-4592-4fb0-9b47-6207a8dac9d1"
msgid ""
"{n}Cruel and evil go into the blind darkness, while kind and merciful go "
"into even deeper darkness... impenetrable blackness... darkness opens every "
"door... wise and stupid, lewd and ascetic... there's not a single path in "
"this world that won't lead into ultimate darkness.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}잔인하고 악한 것이 눈 먼 어둠으로 들어가지만 친절과 자비는 더 깊은 어둠으로 들어간다... 꿰뚫수 없는 어둠 속으로... 어둠이 "
"모든 문을 연다... 지혜와 어리석음, 음란과 금욕... 궁극의 어둠으로 이끄는데   이 세계에 단 하나의 길만이 존재하진 않는다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9e2db9c0-b785-4be3-9149-6cb30b6af748"
msgid ""
"\"Wait a moment... I think I can understand some of this. Let me see...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만... 내가 해석을 할 수 있을 것 같아. 어디 보자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "11fb67ed-6bfd-4e1b-a8db-1606b2cb31ca"
msgid "\"Such wise, beautiful words...\""
msgstr "\"지혜와 아름다움이 담긴 글이로다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "59796ae9-a703-4fbe-8fcd-8193bf28ff96"
msgid ""
"\"Ick, what a load of nonsense! I was hoping for a legend. Or maybe a poem. "
"Or at least some sort of ancient recipe!\""
msgstr "\"이런. 아무 의미 없는 글이에요! 전설 같은 것을 기대했는데. 아니면 시라던가. 최소한 고대의 요리비법이었더라면!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "23399137-9b4e-4ba9-945a-c83dc47c15ef"
msgid ""
"\"If you had even rudimentary knowledge of ancient cyclops culture, you "
"wouldn't be so eager to see their recipes. To wit: they were cannibals.\""
msgstr "\"고대 사이클롭스 문화 지식이 조금이라도 있다면 그들의 요리비법을 싫어했을걸. 그들은 식인 풍습이 있었거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "d8081d33-b02c-4c26-b757-a9edabb7642a"
msgid "\"Blech!\""
msgstr "\"으웩!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/TombDoor/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ff9873fa-2f62-4c17-80f2-5ff879ba7f93"
msgid ""
"\"The cyclopes were fabulously rich. Why, instead of creating ageless "
"beauty, would they waste it all building monumental ugliness like this?\""
msgstr "\"사이클롭스는 풍족한 삶을 살았다는군. 왜 그들은 시대를 초월하는 아름다운 것들을 만들지 않고 이런 흉물을 지어놓았을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "ef76d7ad-86fa-4a38-9387-c70023d476af"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "4b38066b-5895-47c6-941a-cf7abb0325c5"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "3760f6f2-5188-4aca-ab92-52d48fc8a8ba"
msgid "\"Dugath sent me.\""
msgstr "\"두가스가 나를 보냈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "d1dda274-4f83-4c16-9963-ef8dfb8e23a6"
msgid "\"The Defaced Sister sent me.\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매가 나를 보냈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "927fd63b-9492-473b-8e74-bb2abf85a446"
msgid "\"I'm just a passing traveler.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그냥 지나가는 여행자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3180fb05-8cbf-42cb-ada3-4802d37beb91"
msgid "Killed the barbarians in the cyclops ruins for no reason."
msgstr "사이클롭스의 폐허에 있는 야만인들을 이유 없이 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "b1cf7a22-cfd0-4980-854f-8a46de877238"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm not here to talk.\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"나는 떠들러 온 게 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "401dc763-254a-410f-8f84-e1dd07c5018b"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "dd37bdbf-3fa7-4454-950e-c01319fa6690"
msgid "\"Do you know anything about what happened in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "5574a18f-ddff-4e99-bc7f-fbc210c403e3"
msgid "\"Cyclopes killed everyone.\""
msgstr "\"사이클롭스가 모두 죽였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "4ea04534-4582-4ca1-9c91-711251d0c947"
msgid ""
"\"Your people were killed by cyclopes. As for the Sister — I killed her.\""
msgstr "\"너희 사람들은 사이클롭스에 의해 죽었어. 얼굴 잃은 자매는 내가 죽였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0040_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6ac042a3-ca44-4402-8d39-4579f951c969"
msgid "Killed the barbarians in the cyclops ruins for no reason."
msgstr "사이클롭스의 폐허에 있는 야만인들을 이유 없이 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "f48b18ce-3dac-4d99-a1ed-7443b0ccb080"
msgid "[Attack] \"I killed them all. And I'll kill you, too.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내가 그들을 모두 죽였다. 그리고 너도 죽일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "df508eb0-84cf-4b1f-beba-0382e001381d"
msgid "Killed the barbarians in the cyclops ruins for no reason."
msgstr "사이클롭스의 폐허에 있는 야만인들을 이유 없이 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "81d77cdb-3cc5-452d-9d7e-ea03c3920a9a"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I felt like it. And right now, I feel like killing you, too.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그러고 싶군. 지금은 너도 죽이고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "8a835892-8133-4ec4-a0da-7c9e414d081f"
msgid "\"Calm down. It was on Dugath's orders.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 두가스의 명령이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "e35a7195-3b4c-488f-a1b9-ccb1bc9a06ab"
msgid ""
"\"The Defaced Sisters betrayed you. You were brought to these ruins to die.\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매는 너를 배신했다. 너는 이 폐허에 버려져 죽을 운명이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "aab1a962-1bed-4a74-a72e-fc7379f09079"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "d95a3a13-814a-403f-9560-ba9506f64e03"
msgid "[Attack] \"Give it your best shot, then!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"그럼 어디 한번 덤벼봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "9732a988-0e3c-4f92-8932-ae9744c15fb6"
msgid "\"Deal.\""
msgstr "\"좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "bf557b18-56ec-458c-a103-0ae6ca06f009"
msgid "\"Maybe. I'm not promising anything.\""
msgstr "\"아마도. 나는 어떤 것도 약속하지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "7769d196-7c90-4b6d-8607-a00fb9f0547f"
msgid "\"I don't have time for it.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "076bb74b-58a5-4441-9345-aa82bcdc8ac1"
msgid "\"Are you an aasimar?\""
msgstr "\"너는 아시마르인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : MainTravelCampVandal
msgctxt "513c1454-bae2-418a-a661-8c6798450287"
msgid ""
"{n}A huge scar crosses the face of this sturdy, silver-haired woman. An eye "
"patch hides her left eye, while right shines with silver. She raises her "
"bloody blade in a salute.{/n} \"You came just in time! We owe you one.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}은발 머리의 여성의 얼굴을 큰 흉터가 가로질렀습니다. 안대가 그녀의 왼쪽 눈을 가리고 있었지만 오른쪽 눈은 은빛으로 빛납니다. "
"그녀는 피묻은 검을 만족스럽게 들어올립니다.{/n} \"적당한 시간에 왔군! 네게 빚을 졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : MainTravelCampVandal
msgctxt "5526e07b-8e65-4116-a837-b1aefb1580c3"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian sharpens her sword and inspects the edge. She takes her "
"time as she lifts her single eye to fix an ice-cold glare on you.{/n} \"And "
"what brings you here?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 칼을 갈고는 칼 끝을 살핍니다. 그녀는 천천히 고개를 들며 차가운 눈빛으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"왜 여기에 왔지?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "fea52790-9e47-4048-b937-963de0d09cf1"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Hilla the Toothgrinder, from the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} tribe. "
"This is my war party. We're here, uh... Fighting things. As you can see.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족의 힐라다. 이 자들은 내 동료들이야. 우리는... 싸우러 왔지. 보이는 대로."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "23cacd67-3056-4cb4-a4e2-4c86bb514af7"
msgid ""
"\"What do you care? We came here, so we obviously have business here. What "
"about you? What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 상관이야? 우리는 할 일이 있어서 여기 온 것 뿐이야. 그러는 너는? 여기서 뭘 하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "15e2a8d5-8bc7-41ca-84c2-ec28dee48b9f"
msgid ""
"\"What? Why? Does the old man think we can't handle it ourselves? Huh!\" {n}"
"Hilla looks around briefly, then back to you.{/n} \"Well, to be honest, you "
"really did help us... How about helping with one more thing?\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 왜? 그 늙은이가 우리는 못 할 거라 생각했나? 흥!\" {n}힐라는 주위를 잠시 둘러본 후 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"솔직히 "
"말해서 네가 도움이 됐어... 그리고 하나만 더 도와줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "d6da3771-6a21-4aa2-b437-65b2c1edb798"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, I see. It was a good call. They may be witches, but they're smart. We "
"really needed extra hands here.\""
msgstr "\"아. 좋아. 그들은 마녀일지도 모르지만 똑똑하군. 우리는 도움이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ecfd1869-8e62-4701-afa0-6805912dfa25"
msgid ""
"\"Here's the deal — we came with one of the witches to look for some trash "
"in the tomb. We set camp, and the Sister took some of my people to the ruins "
"around dawn. Never came back. Instead, these zombie cyclopes started "
"crawling out on us from all over the place. Fun day, huh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 원하는 걸 말해주지. 우리는 무덤을 찾아온 마녀를 쫓아왔어. 우리는 여기에 캠프를 설치하고 그 자매가 해질녘에 우리 동료 몇을 "
"데려갔다. 다시는 돌아오지 못했어. 대신에 이 좀비 사이클롭스가 사방에서 기어나오기 시작했어. 재수 없는 날이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "e0faa7bc-e192-48ad-b45e-ed1357a84e69"
msgid ""
"\"You're quite the fighter for a 'passing traveler.' How'd you like to make "
"a few quick coins here?\""
msgstr "\"너는 여행자라기보다는 싸움꾼 같은데. 여기서 돈 좀 벌어보는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "8f42ac90-5fec-4eba-ac18-39ad31461729"
msgid ""
"\"My group can't afford to be separated now — we only barely fought those "
"things off. So how about this — you scout the place and look for our people, "
"find out if any of them are still alive, and I'll pay you in gold. Deal?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 지금 쯤 합류했어야 했는데. 이 녀석들과 싸우기만 했지. 내가 제안 하나 하지. 네가 우리 동료가 살아있는지 확인해주면 금을 "
"지불해주지. 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : MainTravelCampVandal
msgctxt "c302291a-4a04-437d-879a-c60a7e61b8a3"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, there you are. Good job. A shame the rest of the group is gone, but at "
"least the witch is intact. Here — for your trouble.\""
msgstr "\"오. 왔구나. 잘했어. 애석하게도 나머지 조원들은 사라졌지만 마녀는 멀쩡해. 여기 - 보상이야\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : MainTravelCampVandal
msgctxt "ef82146a-5809-44e0-b864-7abcd16cab06"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, what news? Did you find the rest of my people? How about the witch?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 소식을 가져왔지? 내 동료들을 발견했나? 마녀는?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "da218cc6-c41a-430f-b41e-09a7d544ae59"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, hold up. You don't seem like a total weakling — want to make a few "
"quick coins?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 멈춰. 너는 강해 보이는군. 돈 좀 벌어보지 않을래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "e42ffd50-3633-4970-a9ba-bec88e4dd75f"
msgid "\"We should leave now. Visit our camp sometime — we'll share a drink.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 지금 떠날 거야. 다음에 우리 캠프를 방문하면 술 한 잔 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "d1ea4cc0-3323-48ae-b739-ee8e495de76a"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}? {d|Varn}Maegar Varn{/d}'s village? No idea. "
"Varn's a weakling — I used to knock him flat on his back. All his folks, "
"too. You want real fighters, you go for {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}? {d|Varn}메이가르 반{/d}의 마을인가? 모르겠어. 반은 약한 녀석이야. 가끔 그 녀석 "
"등을 떠밀쳐서 넘어뜨리고는 했어. 그 마을 사람들도 마찬가지야. 진정한 전사를 찾고 싶으면 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 찾아봐!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "fb9c6075-79b9-4c0e-8791-21c877fc697f"
msgid ""
"\"Damn! This whole expedition's been nothing but trouble from the word go. "
"Well, guess there's nothing left for us here — we're leaving. Here's your "
"money — you earned it.\""
msgstr "\"젠장! 여행은 엉망이었어. 여기에 우리 몫은 없는 것 같군. 우리는 떠날 거야. 돈을 받아. 네 몫이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "4c8bbc9e-a3bf-4c7e-806d-3e2267052aef"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian narrows her eyes menacingly as she grips her sword.{/n} "
"\"Seems to me that you're lying. You killed them, didn't you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인의 눈이 작아지면서 그녀는 칼의 손잡이를 쥡니다.{/n} \"나에게 거짓말을 하는 것 같은데. 네가 그들을 죽였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "6d001bef-ba02-4e11-bfc5-683d084214a4"
msgid "{n}The barbarian draws her sword.{/n} \"What? Why?!\""
msgstr "{n}야만인은 칼을 뽑았습니다.{/n} \"뭐? 왜?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "1a71534b-4647-466a-8aad-d6fa214146c5"
msgid ""
"{n}Hilla sheathes her sword.{/n} \"So that's how it was. And to think I "
"trusted them. Damn! This whole expedition's been nothing but trouble from "
"the word go. Well, guess there's nothing left for us here — we're leaving.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}힐라는 칼을 집어넣었습니다.{/n} \"그렇게 된 거로군. 그들을 믿었는데. 젠장! 여행은 엉망이었어. 우리 몫은 없는 것 같군. "
"우리는 떠난다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "abec689e-86cc-4ef0-87aa-e20564846016"
msgid "\"Lying scum! Everyone, to arms! Rush {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"거짓말! 모두 전투 준비! 돌격!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "447b37db-e23b-44dc-8287-1e5c13e55129"
msgid ""
"{n}Hilla sheathes her sword with a single abrupt motion, then spits.{/n} "
"\"Dugath ordered it, huh? All right — I'm going to have a serious "
"conversation with that old fart! As for you — get out of here, before I "
"knock you out cold.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}힐라는 칼을 무뚝뚝하게 집어넣고는 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"두가스가 명령했다고? 좋아. 그 늙은이에게 가서 따져야겠군! 너는 내가 "
"때려눕히기 전에 어서 꺼져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "b5d35615-37c6-436a-a3fd-b6bc006d9862"
msgid "\"Go on, then. And hurry — I'm tired of this place.\""
msgstr "\"빨리 가. 여기는 질렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "38472dad-017f-4a10-9543-f9d36bc1d161"
msgid "\"Great.\""
msgstr "\"좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "10a36978-8b63-4ed9-9448-97a0a8f307c9"
msgid ""
"\"Fair enough. If you go there after all, the gold will be waiting for you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 네가 가면 금을 준비해두도록 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "2332492f-bd67-4612-811e-b3b151322f36"
msgid ""
"\"Do as you please. If you change your mind and go there after all, the gold "
"will be waiting for you.\""
msgstr "\"마음대로 해. 마음이 바뀌어 가겠다면 나도 돈을 준비하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "75e4ff0a-fc8d-451a-a4c3-862f232d68bf"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Hold on, {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} — let's see how brave you really "
"are!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 이봐! 우리가 얼마나 잘 싸우는지 보여줘라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "2d135da0-e51e-418c-8aba-8012c67b1ea8"
msgid "\"To arms! Rush {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"전투 준비! 돌격!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoor/VandalsAtCamp/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "f18cefd5-73aa-435a-84ed-cb45ec7ed6b0"
msgid ""
"\"What, don't I look like a celestial? Ha ha! Yes, I'm an aasimar. No idea "
"which of my great grandmothers made it with a celestial, but in my entire "
"lineage, the blood only manifested in me. I'm sure that was the plan all "
"along — it's a common custom to strengthen the bloodline with the blood of "
"orcs or whatever powerful beings come in handy. My birth was deemed a good "
"sign, and proof of the gods' blessing, but I call it bullshit. The gods' "
"blessing should be earned on the battlefield!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 천족 혈통처럼 보이지 않아? 하하! 그래. 나는 아시마르다. 내 조상중 누가 천사와 인연을 맺었는지는 모르지만 내 핏속에는 "
"천사의 피가 흐르고 있지. 오크나 강력한 종족과 피를 섞어서 혈통을 강하게 하는 것은 흔한 일이야. 내 출생은 신의 축복을 받았지만 "
"엿이나 먹으라고 해. 신의 축복은 전장에서 얻는 것이니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/Barks/Lamp_String
msgctxt "e2c5c429-724a-4136-8a9d-5d51aa5bc746"
msgid ""
"Magical lanterns endlessly shed pale light along the passages built for the "
"dead."
msgstr "마법 랜턴이 죽은 자를 위해 세워진 통로에서 끝 없이 창백한 빛을 발산합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "49d0c7da-9a4c-478c-bac2-52021ac80b15"
msgid "\"Why are you following me? What do you want?\""
msgstr "\"왜 나를 쫓아오는 거야? 원하는 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "abd50b5c-ce95-4c0b-9172-6cce65378f2f"
msgid "\"Enough. I'm leaving.\""
msgstr "\"그만. 나는 가겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "83772445-5b85-4570-9f73-8b1001263971"
msgid "\"I'm not going to answer allegations, crow! Be gone!\""
msgstr "\"나는 그런 질문에 대답하지 않겠다. 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "3c4e1f0b-9a81-42c5-8702-484611863921"
msgid "\"I'm {mf|Baron|Baroness} {name}, and I'm not hiding from anyone!\""
msgstr "\"나는 {name}다. 나는 누구에게서도 숨지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "15f448fb-04e6-4cea-8c2a-84429db1d1f5"
msgid ""
"\"My name is {name}. I came for answers about Varnhold. Do you know anything "
"about its fate?\""
msgstr "\"내 이름은 {name}다. 나는 반홀드에 대한 답을 들으러 왔다. 반홀드의 운명에 대해서 아나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "9fafb07f-0b26-4ddf-aa7c-e1ff47e68481"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "c2ceb951-fd84-4648-b832-1f0dba27e00f"
msgid "\"I tire of your insults! Get lost!\""
msgstr "\"네 욕지꺼리에 질렸어! 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "bb9c6b6e-3c6f-4adf-92c0-1fd3a7bc8945"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven makes a raking caw, as if in glee.{/n} \"I was rrright when I "
"saw you firrrst time. You're a thief, same as everrryone of your kin, {race}"
"\"."
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 놀리기라도 하는 듯 까악댑니다.{/n} \"나의 첫 인상이 맞았군. 너는 도둑이다, {race}. 네 종족 모두와 다를 바 "
"없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "cc79f616-1f30-471c-86ec-cd5bccdff819"
msgid ""
"\"You fight in dirrrt for the scrrraps of Elderrr Rrraces. You're ready to "
"tearrr open each other's thrrroats to get what you want. What did you get "
"from killing that Sisterrr? Nothing. I bet you've alrrready forgot her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 고대 종을 위해 진흙탕 속에서 싸웠다. 너는 원하는 것을 위해서라면 뭐든지 할 녀석이야. 자매를 죽여서 얻은 게 무엇이지? "
"아무것도 없을 텐데. 그녀가 기억도 나지 않을 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "48722dde-ccf7-4501-9c2a-dbc4ee51308b"
msgid ""
"\"You think you've done a rrright thing, saved a life. But all that you did "
"was help a thief take what wasn't herrrs in the firrst place. You're no "
"better than that filthy crrrreature.\""
msgstr "\"네가 옳은 일을 하고 있다고 믿나 보지. 하지만 네가 한 일은 그저 도둑질 뿐이었어. 너는 더러운 생명체에 불과해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "a2b20b26-4c2d-437e-ba6d-f613ec59dbf3"
msgid ""
"\"I have watched you. Yourrr behavior, yourrr deeds. Don't flatter "
"yourrrself thinking yourrr actions are imprrresive — you're an oddity, a "
"currriosity, a mark, nothing morrre.\""
msgstr "\"너를 지켜봤다. 네 행동들을. 네가 뭔가 다르다고 생각하지 말아라. 너는 그저 특이한 별종일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "e0af669f-8961-4fe7-ba7c-28cfb0dd8cff"
msgid ""
"\"Prrride in a pathetic crrrreature like you — you wearrr it poorrrly. And "
"your attempts to give me orderrrrs — I think not.\""
msgstr "\"한심한 생명체의 자부심이란. 불쌍하구나. 그러고도 나에게 명령을 내리려 하다니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "7cbc55af-f4f9-4253-9ad8-964ab06663e1"
msgid ""
"\"Rrrun!\" {n}The raven breaks into a raking series of caws.{/n} \"Rrrrun "
"forrr coverrr, cowerrr in your shelterrrs like verrrmin! You won't escape "
"the trrruth — wherrrreever you hide, it is always with you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도망쳐!\" {n}까마귀는 까악거리며 방해합니다.{/n} \"벌레 새끼처럼 도망쳐라! 너는 진실로부터 도망치지 못해. 어디에 숨어서도 "
"너는 진실과 함께할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "09050630-5641-4845-8ce9-95314c85bc5f"
msgid "{n}The raven flaps its wings and flies off. In moments, it is gone.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}까마귀는 날개를 퍼덕이며 날아가버립니다. 까마귀는 멀리 사라졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "f57e1da9-f2ba-4c28-bbdb-a4eb06afc3fb"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven looks at you for a moment, then takes flight. In moments, it is "
"gone.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}까마귀는 당신을 잠시 보더니 날아갑니다. 잠시 후 까마귀는 사라졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "e6d7de51-cc7e-45f8-af4a-c18b632976b3"
msgid "\"Enough. You'll learrrn all in due time, {name}.\""
msgstr "\"그만. 때가 되면 다 배울 것이다. {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardOutdoorTomb/RavenTalkThief/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "9ed7a1c1-2ad2-454a-8861-0de579cb3fde"
msgid ""
"\"Words, words, words, words, words- huuurk!\" {n}Nok-Nok retches as though "
"about to vomit.{/n} \"Nok-Nok used to longshanks talk and talk, but fat "
"tasty featherbags talk now? Soon stones start yapping too, you'll see!\""
msgstr ""
"\"말, 말, 말, 말, 말-헉! 지겹다!\" {n}녹-녹은 토하는 시늉을 합니다.{/n} \"녹-녹은 꺽다리가 말 많이 하는 것 "
"알았지만 이제는 토실토실하고 맛좋은 퍼덕이도 말하는 거냐? 이제는 돌도 지껄이겠구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/CaveInAfterChapter3_String
msgctxt "359e4c0e-6193-41c2-b77d-878b4339d97a"
msgid ""
"The passage has caved in. Whatever secrets this tomb held, they will remain "
"hidden forever."
msgstr "길은 동굴로 이어져있습니다. 무덤이 어떤 비밀을 숨겼던 그것은 영원히 비밀로 남겨질 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Dead_warrior_name_String
msgctxt "dd2cb0c7-ea6b-4912-8504-b32f9f73bf71"
msgid ""
"The broken body of a barbarian woman lies near the floor panel that opens "
"the door. She died recently — probably from massive blood loss. This must be "
"Varha."
msgstr ""
"야만인 여성의 훼손된 시체는 문짝 주위에 놓여있습니다. 아마 과다출혈로 죽은 지 얼마 되지 않은 것 같습니다. 그녀는 바하가 틀림 "
"없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Dead_warrior_noname_String
msgctxt "d88e3b6a-2687-4bd5-8150-7beb40a8d571"
msgid ""
"The broken body of a barbarian woman lies near the floor panel that opens "
"the door. She died recently — probably from massive blood loss."
msgstr "야만인 여성의 훼손된 시체는 문짝 주위에 놓여있습니다. 아마 과다출혈로 죽은 지 얼마 되지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/FloorPanel0_String
msgctxt "6b32db59-36dc-413f-9a8d-b14000650e6b"
msgid "The floor panel has returned to its initial position."
msgstr "문짝은 원래의 자리로 되돌아갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/FloorPanel2_String
msgctxt "4669784b-f8a4-4ef4-acb2-6fc23a7eece2"
msgid "*click*"
msgstr "[딸깍]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/FloorPanel4_String
msgctxt "2ca8462d-a4af-4e93-a173-04b2c4d7898c"
msgid "*click* *click*"
msgstr "[딸깍] [딸깍]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/FloorPanel6_String
msgctxt "42cf4754-f8ce-46f7-9008-00123405142c"
msgid "*click*"
msgstr "[딸깍]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Headless_barbarian_String
msgctxt "490d66f7-e778-41cf-b9f3-ad147ba97c48"
msgid ""
"The body's been horribly mutilated — it looks like a huge cyclopean palm "
"crushed the skull and removed the brain."
msgstr "시체는 심하게 훼손되었습니다. 거대한 사이클롭스의 손바닥이 두개골을 부수고 뇌를 제거한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Ornament_NoTranslation_String
msgctxt "8f978e7d-99d8-4a14-8080-3df0f31f86ad"
msgid ""
"There's an inscription on the slab, written in an ancient cyclopean "
"language. You have no idea what it means."
msgstr "석판에 고대의 사이클롭스 언어로 무언가 새겨졌습니다. 당신은 그것이 의미하는 것을 모릅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Ornament_Translated1_String
msgctxt "7f751fd2-d3d5-40a3-aa7d-43ae72321439"
msgid "\"VORDAKAI IS OUR MASTER. WE ARE HIS HUMBLE SERVANTS.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이는 우리의 주인이다. 우리는 그의 충실한 종이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Ornament_Translated2_String
msgctxt "3ff397fa-27a6-4179-b58c-2de8f623c644"
msgid ""
"\"VORDAKAI ORDERED US TO DIE. WE DIED. IF VORDAKAI ORDERS US TO RISE, WE "
"WILL RISE.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이가 우리에게 자결을 명령했다. 보다카이가 다시 일어나라고 하면 우리는 그럴 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Ornament_Translated3_String
msgctxt "340c5d65-d54b-4b42-b451-45c9f178dae6"
msgid ""
"\"VORDAKAI BE PRAISED THROUGH THE CENTURIES, FOR HE IS THE GREATEST OF THE "
"GREATEST.\""
msgstr "\"위대한 보다카이의 이름은 수백년이 지나도 잊혀지지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Ornament_Translated4_String
msgctxt "4bf94dcf-2f9a-4301-8ce8-26aa88718d5e"
msgid "\"MORTALS ARE PATHETIC. ONLY THE DEAD BECOME CLOSER TO GOD.\""
msgstr "\"필멸자는 불쌍하다. 오직 죽은 자만이 신과 가까워진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Ornament_Translated5_String
msgctxt "152d8787-5f65-4a55-9d16-46e29eb79eda"
msgid "\"REMEMBER DEATH, FOR DEATH ALWAYS REMEMBERS YOU.\""
msgstr "\"죽음이 너를 기억할 것이니 죽음을 기억하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Ornament_Translated6_String
msgctxt "1490a9ee-f02d-46f1-b6fa-c1dd58555e4c"
msgid ""
"\"CRY NOT FOR THE DEAD, FOR THEY ARE BLESSED. CRY FOR YOURSELF, FOR LIFE IS "
"SUFFERING.\""
msgstr "\"죽은 자들은 축복받았기에 그들에게 눈물 흘리지 말지어다. 생명은 고통이니 자신을 위해 울어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Ornament_Translated7_String
msgctxt "ae6618d2-89ac-4ea9-83cf-1d1db31c31c0"
msgid "\"ABYSS CALLS TO ABYSS.\""
msgstr "\"심연은 심연을 부른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Switch_Blue_String
msgctxt "90240912-eb8d-4deb-9698-2b30c10dd436"
msgid "You hear several doors open, one of them nearby."
msgstr "당신은 문 몇개가 열리는 소리를 들었고 그 중 하나는 가까이 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Switch_GreenYellow_String
msgctxt "fa5f14e7-3532-464d-9000-bf5efd699d43"
msgid "You hear the sound of stone doors opening and closing nearby."
msgstr "당신은 주위 어딘가에서 돌로 만들어진 문이 열리고 닫히는 것을 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Switch_Red_String
msgctxt "385574e1-b0a8-448b-b17a-757fc1b4c77a"
msgid "You hear the sound of doors opening somewhere deep in the dungeon."
msgstr "당신은 던전 깊은 곳 어딘가에서 돌로 만들어진 문이 열리는 것을 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Switch_ThreeColor_String
msgctxt "2871ea29-0080-43cb-8b1d-0f71912f98a4"
msgid "You hear several doors open, some nearby, and others far away."
msgstr "당신은 문들이 열리는 소리를 들었고 일부는 주위에 가까이 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Switch_Timer_String
msgctxt "fb01de38-f467-4cbe-a86a-7ef760f85866"
msgid ""
"A door opens somewhere in the dungeon. An unseen mechanism begins ticking, "
"counting seconds."
msgstr "문이 던전 어딘가에서 열렸습니다. 보이지 않는 장치가 시계 소리와 같은 것을 냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Barks/Switch_Violet_String
msgctxt "3c24c807-7c30-4d01-a1b6-53dc3e619cec"
msgid "You hear a door open somewhere deep in the dungeon."
msgstr "당신은 던전 어딘가에서 문이 열리는 것을 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "edd31037-6eb0-4d7f-a0ad-6b6ecfc5acff"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "9faa5dd4-7625-43fa-93dd-aa82364c0930"
msgid "\"What powers do you mean? Speak plainly!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 힘을 의미하는 거지? 어서 말해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "58acb8d5-6909-4df2-9ef6-11c6d410d41a"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d20a7a5e-0112-4d39-bc8d-b4be48e1ae2d"
msgid "\"Do you know anything about what happened in Varnhold?"
msgstr "\"반홀드에서 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "492a5cf5-5441-433e-8ab2-d93d67b4672f"
msgid "Killed the Defaced Sister in the Vault of the Forsaken Heroes."
msgstr "버려진 영웅의 방에서 얼굴 잃은 자매를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "97c04010-79fd-4f3f-abdc-089409452f68"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm tired of your gibberish, witch.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네 헛소리는 질렸다. 마녀야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "86360b7b-ceb6-4305-a827-ff5df5bc00cf"
msgid "\"What does the word 'Vordakai' mean?\""
msgstr "\"보다카이가 무슨 의미지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "c0198993-d1d6-493c-9d50-9dc3b48acf0a"
msgid "\"Your Sister sent me. Come, I'll get you out of here.\""
msgstr "\"네 자매가 나를 보냈다. 나와 이곳을 벗어나자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9042de43-b232-4925-af89-dd8bf8e4bd3e"
msgid "Persuaded the Defaced Sister to repent."
msgstr "얼굴 잃은 자매가 회개하도록 설득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "45039762-8474-4078-aed9-29bfae3c88ad"
msgid ""
"\"Of the entire group that accompanied you, one person survived — that "
"corridor was strewn with the bodies of people you brought here to die. What "
"is this 'exalted mission' of yours that demands such sacrifice? What do you "
"offer these people beyond suffering and death?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 함께한 이들 중에서 하나가 살아남았다. 복도에서 네가 죽게 내버려둔 자들 중 한 명이지. 이런 희생을 하면서까지 해야 할 숭고한 "
"임무가 무엇이지? 고통과 죽음을 넘어서 네가 이 사람들에게 해줄 수 있는 게 뭐냔 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "8fd9d99d-b0ff-4e6a-849b-242f105e88fc"
msgid "\"Amiri, knock it off! I need her alive!\""
msgstr "\"아미리! 그만둬! 그녀를 살려둬야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "818eeb9b-e528-404a-9f29-81c6bcdd333a"
msgid "[Attack] \"My thoughts exactly!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 생각도 그래!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "3cc55c44-484a-483f-968e-8f54e5b1d89c"
msgid "[Keep silent]"
msgstr "[계속 침묵합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "4390ca8e-365f-49bb-b272-56ab8518acc0"
msgid ""
"{n}A tiny woman wrapped in a cloak studies you through holes in the cloth "
"that hides her face. Her eyes are the green of young leaves.{/n}\n"
"\"I've been waiting for you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}키가 작고 회색 망또를 두른 여성이 얼굴을 감춘 천 사이로 당신을 응시합니다. 그녀의 눈은 떡잎과 같은 색깔입니다.{/n}\n"
"\"너를 쭉 기다리고 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ff69b8c7-43f9-4d4b-83d6-b68e2eefab5d"
msgid ""
"\"I have no name. I'm just a humble messenger of the powers that protect "
"people from evil.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이름이 없다. 나는 악으로부터 사람을 지키는 자의 심부름꾼에 불과하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "5a957492-1ef6-4272-a401-11dc14b8a51a"
msgid ""
"\"It is not yet time to answer that question... But trust me, the day will "
"soon come in which all that is hidden shall be revealed.\""
msgstr "\"그 질문에 답할 시간은 아니다... 하지만 모든 비밀이 드러날 그 날은 곧 올 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "26b30dca-a169-4847-a5d7-c3faf6f54134"
msgid ""
"\"There are times when you can't protect the living without visiting the "
"dead... In the depths of blackest darkness lie the truths that will once "
"more shine their healing light on the surface.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽은 자를 만나야 살아있는 것을 보호하는 그런 때가 있다... 가장 어두운 암흑에 놓인 진실이 언젠가는 치유의 빛을 받으며 다시 "
"드러날 날이 올 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "3470e60f-faa1-4f67-aa4a-def6d96330b9"
msgid ""
"\"Strange and horrible things happen in these ancient lands... I know of "
"what bothers you. Have no doubt: my Sisters and the powers that sent us know "
"exactly what to do. That's all I can tell you for now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상하고 끔찍한 일들이 고대의 땅에서 일어났다... 네가 무엇 때문에 괴로운지 안다. 임무를 위해 우리를 보낸 자비로운 힘, 내 "
"자매들 때문이겠지. 지금으로는 할 말이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "d8e5b073-88dd-4aed-b7fd-793ac492749c"
msgid ""
"\"It was the name of an ancient evil that once reigned in these lands. Worry "
"not over it. For centuries now, it's been little more than a word carved in "
"old stones — frightful, but powerless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 땅을 한 때 지배했던 고대 악의 이름이다. 하지만 이제는 죽었다. 수백년이 지난 지금 오래된 돌에 새겨진 그 단어는 아무런 힘이 "
"없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "0094ec05-e7d4-42e5-b9be-881d6f262746"
msgid ""
"\"I thank both you and the benevolent forces that brought you here.\" {n}The "
"Sister heads to the exit.{/n}"
msgstr "\"너를 이곳으로 보내준 자비로운 힘과 너에게 감사해야겠구나.\" {n}자매는 바깥으로 향합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "43c10f88-6d0e-4a38-b0fd-b68a0e2e02af"
msgid ""
"{n}The Defaced Sister flinches from your words as if you had hit her. With a "
"sob, she hides her face in her hands and sits on the sarcophagus. Her "
"shoulders shake as she cries.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}얼굴 잃은 자매는 마치 당신에게 한 대 맞은 듯 움찔합니다. 그녀는 손으로 얼굴을 가리고 흐느낍니다. 그리곤 석관 위에 앉습니다. "
"그녀의 어깨는 울음으로 들썩입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "204c7084-3dfd-42b9-87af-f31b681093c1"
msgid ""
"\"You're right...\" {n}The Sister wipes the tears from her green eyes.{/n} "
"\"You're right a thousand times, even if you don't realize why. But I...\" "
"{n}She takes a deep breath and begins to speak slowly and deliberately.{/n} "
"\"I am loyal to my Sisters, and to the powers that sent us here. I cannot "
"betray them. I. Just. Cannot. Do you understand?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 맞아...\" {n}자매는 초록색 눈에서 눈물을 닦아냅니다.{/n} \"네가 이유를 모르더라도 네 말이 백번 천번 맞아. 하지만 "
"나는...\" {n}그녀는 깊은 숨을 쉬고는 천천히 말하기 시작합니다.{/n} \"나는 내 자매들과 자비로운 힘을 배신할 수 없다. "
"절대로. 불가능해. 이해해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "5231b8f3-ffc8-4726-ba62-c7d97c1fe439"
msgid ""
"\"Trust us. We do not lie — not to you, and not to these barbarians. We "
"never lie about anything. We wish you only good. And the power that sent us "
"wishes... you... g-g-good too...\" {n}The woman's voice trembles, and she "
"starts to stutter.{/n} \"D-don't worry about my S-sisters. All they tell you "
"is truth, and they are n-not plotting to kill you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"믿어줘. 우리는 너나 야만인들에게 거짓말을 하는 게 아니야. 우리는 거짓을 말한 적이 없어. 우리는 항상 잘되기를 바랐으니. 그리고 "
"너를 보낸 그 자비로운 힘도... 가같은 생각이야...\" {n}그녀의 목소리는 떨리고 그녀는 말을 더듬기 시작합니다.{/n} \"내 "
"자자매들은 거걱정하지마. 그들이 네게 하는 말은 모두 진실이고, 그리고 너... 너를 죽이려는 음모를 짜고 있는게 아... 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "7e2d598d-b622-482d-81ec-e83188ddcbb7"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman hands you a brass incense burner shaped like a cyclops "
"skull.{/n} \"I came here to retrieve this. There are three of them, and all "
"three must fall into our hands, no matter the cost. As my Sister sent you, I "
"can entrust you with this one. Take it to the camp. It is very important "
"that you do give it to her. Directly to her hands. Do you understand me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 사이클롭스의 두개골처럼 생긴 향로를 당신에게 줍니다.{/n} \"이걸 가지러 왔지. 모두 세 개가 있는데 무슨 일이 있어도 "
"손에 넣어야 하니까. 너를 보낸 걸 보니 믿을 수 있을 것 같다. 이걸 캠프로 가져가야 해. 그녀에게 전달하는 것이 정말 중요한 일이야. "
"그녀에게 직접 전달해줘. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "ae0c03cc-a7c8-429a-b36d-64b8946df523"
msgid ""
"\"I have one more important thing to do. I'll return to the camp once I've "
"finished. Tell my Sisters not to worry and not to look for me.\" {n}With a "
"heavy sigh, the woman heads toward the exit.{/n} \"Farewell. May the {g|"
"Green Mother}Green Mother{/g} protect you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 한 가지 해야할 중요한 게 더 있어. 이 일이 끝나면 캠프로 돌아갈 거야. 내 자매들에게 걱정하지 말고 날 찾지 말라고 전해줘.\""
" {n}한숨을 깊게 쉬고는 그녀는 바깥으로 향합니다.{/n} \"안녕히. {g|Green Mother}초록의 어머니{/g}께서 너를 "
"보호하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "fd27908a-cd80-465d-bc52-18e9c9c235a4"
msgid "\"Powerless? Really? A whole town went missing!\""
msgstr "\"힘이 없다고? 정말? 마을 전체가 사라졌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "94c4024f-fe41-4ef5-8e11-ef1c82c9869f"
msgid ""
"\"The benevolent forces take care of everyone. Once I reunite with my "
"Sisters, you will learn the truth.\""
msgstr "\"자비로운 힘은 모두를 돌본다. 내 자매들과 다시 만나면 너는 진실을 알게 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "5e8c7068-0ab2-49a3-9043-c54d4c6b29b2"
msgid ""
"\"You are wrong. Within the depths lie only darker depths. As you descend "
"into darkness, you will find no stars. If you had truly listened to the "
"silence of the dead, you would have learned the one lesson they have to "
"teach.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 틀렸어. 암흑 깊숙한 곳에는 더 어두운 심부가 있을 뿐이다. 네가 어둠을 향해 내려가면 별은 보이지 않아. 죽은 자의 침묵에 "
"진정으로 귀기울였다면 그들이 가르치는 교훈을 배우게 될 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "81c14459-5d8c-4715-887d-f44a5846ed55"
msgid ""
"\"So glum and desperate! Have you abandoned all hope of finding the light of "
"truth?\""
msgstr "\"정말 우울하고 비관적이군! 진실의 빛을 찾는 희망은 전부 내다버린건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "4fd745a1-7737-41eb-9b9e-2ae5ae8f7a38"
msgid ""
"\"Genuine truths do not shine, Sister. They absorb all light — as well as "
"those who seek them. We only find true peace after first finding true "
"despair. You cannot see truth while you are yet blinded by the false glimmer "
"of hope.\""
msgstr ""
"\"진정한 진실은 빛나지 않는다네, 자매여. 진실들은 그것을 찾는 이들의 노력 만큼이나 모든 빛을 흡수하지. 우리는 우선 진정한 절망을 "
"찾아야 참된 평화를 얻을 수 있다네. 희망을 보려는 거짓 어스름에 눈이 먼 동안은 자네는 진실을 보지 못할 게야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "a78a385f-ae08-4eda-adce-0023019d7d8e"
msgid ""
"{n}Awkward silence fills the air. For the first time, the Sister seems to be "
"struck speechless.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}어색한 침묵이 흐릅니다. 처음으로 자매는 말문이 막힌 듯 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "8f3cc1d8-d1f6-4c27-ad76-cb302bae1392"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar breaks the silence with a loud whisper.{/n} \"I don't know about "
"you... but I have no blasted idea what the devil they're talking about!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 우렁찬 귓속말로 침묵을 깹니다.{/n} \"넌 어떨지 모르겠지만... 난 도무지 쟤들이 무슨 개소리를 지껄이는지 "
"모르겠는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "def7d2f8-d6f9-440c-a130-6a914e67eb73"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri stalks toward the Sister, fists clenched. You can hear rage "
"building in her voice.{/n} \"These people trusted you, and you brought them "
"like cattle to the slaughter. A whole squad... You'll pay for this!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 주먹을 움켜쥐고 자매들에게 향합니다. 당신은 그녀의 목소리에 쌓인 분노를 느꼈습니다.{/n} \"이 자들은 너를 믿었는데 "
"너는 그들을 도살장으로 끌려가는 가축 마냥 데려갔다. 분대가 전멸했어... 너는 죗값을 치루게 될 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "49791ab0-55f8-459c-a473-f97400b930e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri spits at the floor beneath the Sister's feet, grits her teeth, and "
"steps back.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 자매의 발치에 침을 뱉고는 이를 갈며 물러갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bd4457bd-e462-467a-8ad6-6fe6a099f5b2"
msgid ""
"\"You want to feed me some excuses? Beg for mercy? I don't care — just like "
"you didn't care about them!\""
msgstr "\"내게 변명을 하고 싶어? 용서해달라고 말이야? 네가 그들에게 한 것처럼 똑같이 해주겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "75160ea3-f119-4369-bd1b-4812b38cb43b"
msgid "\"Thank you.\""
msgstr "\"고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "098ef6c1-7a07-4b8a-93af-80ba4d4f2879"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian glances at you with admiration.{/n} \"I cannot believe it... The "
"truth in your words has stunned her to the core!\" {n}The priest turns to "
"the woman.{/n} \"Please. Tell us the truth.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 감탄하며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"믿을 수 없군요... 당신 말 속의 진실이 그녀의 마음을 울렸어요!\" {n}사제는 "
"그 여성에게로 고개를 돌립니다.{/n} \"부디. 우리에게 진실을 말해주시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DefacedSister/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f0a8ea29-98f7-4cbe-9392-388fbb312259"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri, what about 'Hurrah! Fighting! Give-me-more-monsters! Arrrgh!'? "
"Isn't that what you and your folk live for? You see, this woman took care of "
"them – by introducing them to big scary monsters!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아미리, '만세! 싸움이다! 괴물들아 몽땅 다 덤벼라! 크르릉!'은 어디로 갔어? 그게 너나 너희 족속이 사는 방식 아닌가? 너도 "
"봤지. 그녀가 그들을 괴물의 밥으로 던져주는 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "eebf1a2e-6cb5-4464-93fa-ee2ca8e5cc6a"
msgid "[Speak the word \"kheb\"]"
msgstr "[\"크헵\"이라는 단어를 말합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "78746719-b34d-4ad6-8e33-4f28ed4108e0"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠난다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e66bf31f-cd4f-4392-b17f-a3c5e73dc865"
msgid "[Search for way to unlock the door]"
msgstr "[잠긴 문을 열 방법을 찾습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "9bd5c27a-50ad-4bdc-a8ee-8d81227385d2"
msgid "[Try to force the door open]"
msgstr "[문을 강제로 열려고 시도했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "492cf9a9-ed88-4f1a-b172-f64366c5e37e"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 사용합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d1594b93-0717-4569-ad02-dbed973f28da"
msgid ""
"{n}A massive stone door blocks the entrance. It has no knobs, buttons, or "
"other signs as to how to unlock it. However, a thick patch of moss has been "
"scraped off the door's hinges, hinting that it's been opened recently.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}거대한 돌문이 입구를 막고 있습니다. 손잡이나 단추 같은 열 장치는 보이지 않습니다. 하지만 두꺼운 이끼가 문의 경첩부분에 "
"벗겨져있었고 최근에 열렸다는 것을 암시했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "9f3f6519-4e62-4d0c-b9fb-53e944141dcf"
msgid ""
"{n}You barely scratch the door. You may as well have tried forcing your way "
"through the rock face around it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 문에 흠집도 내지 못했습니다. 당신은 돌을 밀어보려고도 시도했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ca2e8dbf-b838-4d8c-b724-1c84427f2d61"
msgid ""
"{n}You can't find any physical mechanisms. It seems the door must be opened "
"through some magical means.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 어떤 장치도 발견하지 못했습니다. 그것은 어떤 마법적인 장치로 열리는 것이 분명했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "0d070fd8-888a-43b7-921c-304fb1e070b0"
msgid "{n}The door radiates a faint transmutation aura.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문은 희미한 아우라가 발하고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/DoorDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "fb11a876-b386-495d-90be-3bfd44708a3a"
msgid ""
"{n}Without a sound, the door slides to the side, revealing the passage "
"beyond.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문은 소리 없이 열렸고 길이 펼쳐졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d3c744ea-c282-4e17-8c84-d5ad8a6e9c62"
msgid "[Try to discern who is depicted on the bas-relief]"
msgstr "[조각이 무엇인지 알아내려 했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "18422696-02b1-4301-ae20-e6eae7ab6bbb"
msgid "[Step away]"
msgstr "[물러섭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "16d58fd9-7f6f-49e8-a504-9269475fd695"
msgid ""
"{n}The bas-relief depicts the image of a gigantic cyclops skeleton. Numerous "
"smaller cyclopes climb up its bony hand to enter the skeleton's hollow eye "
"socket, disappearing there forever.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}새겨진 조각은 거대한 사이클롭스 해골의 모습이었습니다. 수많은 작은 사이클롭스들이 기어오르며 해골의 눈구멍으로 들어가는 것 "
"같았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Cue_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "527d6650-849b-40df-a209-8fd1d09008a7"
msgid ""
"{n}After examining the bas-relief closely, you understand that it depicts "
"not just an allegorical image of death, but also its partial incarnation. "
"This is how the cyclopes imagined {g|Charon}Charon{/g} — the godlike "
"Horseman of Death, one of the Four Horsemen and an archdaemon of "
"{g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}. Unlike {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, who shepherds and "
"judges souls after their deaths, Charon is an extremely evil entity who is "
"believed to actively participate in the process of transferring the souls of "
"the living into the afterlife. Secret cults worshiping Charon exist to this "
"day.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}조각을 자세히 조사하자 당신은 그것이 죽음뿐만 아니라 부활도 의미함을 알아냈습니다. 그것이 사이클롭스가 상상하는 죽음의 반신인 "
"{g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 아크다이몬 {g|Charon}케런{/g}인 것 같았습니다. 죽은 이들을 심판하는 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}와 달리 케런은 살아있는 영혼을 사후 세계로 보내는 과정을 담당하는 사악한 존재를 상징합니다. 케런을 "
"숭배하는 비밀 의식이 오늘날에도 이어지고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Cue_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "32510ced-ab74-4ae8-ba4f-77b20d51c571"
msgid ""
"{n}The only obvious information is that the bas-relief depicts an "
"incarnation of Death. Perhaps that's how the ancient cyclopes interpreted "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, or maybe it's some other long-forgotten deity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 조각에서 얻어낼 수 있는 정보는 죽음의 부활뿐이었습니다. 아마도 고대 사이클롭스들이 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}를 "
"상징하거나 다른 잊혀진 신을 묘사하는 것 같았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "49ae821a-efa3-4c7d-99ce-c680ca16b92b"
msgid ""
"{n}The bas-relief depicts one of the evil deities of those who built this "
"tomb — {g|Charon}Charon{/g}, archdaemon of Death — in the form of a gigantic "
"skeleton. Numerous smaller cyclopes climb up its bony hand to enter the "
"skeleton's hollow eye socket, disappearing there forever.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}조각은 이 무덤을 지은 자들의 악의 신이자 죽음의 아크다이몬 {g|Charon}케런{/g}을 거대한 해골 형상으로 나타낸 "
"것이었습니다. 수많은 작은 사이클롭스가 앙상한 손으로 해골의 눈구멍에 들어가 사라지는 모습이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "737b62c9-93b7-4379-b0b6-c43a8d70ff67"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal touches the ancient stone.{/n} \"I know this image. This is "
"{g|Charon}Charon{/g}, the arch-daemon of Death, one of the Four Horsemen of "
"Apocalypse. He's not like {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, who just gathers souls "
"of the dead. He takes lives whenever he wants, as many as he can.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 고대의 돌은 어루만집니다.{/n} \"나는 이 그림을 알아. 이건 죽음의 아크다이몬이자 종말의 네 기수 중 하나인 "
"{g|Charon}케런{/g}이야. 그는 죽은 자의 영혼을 수집하는 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}와는 다르지. 그는 자신의 의지로 "
"산 자의 목숨을 앗아가는 존재니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "aac56e7e-3cd1-45e5-bb5f-701e571a9ac9"
msgid ""
"\"I knew {g|Charon}Charon{/g} still has his cultists today. What I didn't "
"know is that the cyclopes were worshipping him.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Charon}케런{/g}의 사교도가 아직도 존재한다는 것을 알지. 하지만 사이클롭스가 그를 숭배했는지는 모른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8dc97935-b9c9-4a89-b165-e70068527734"
msgid ""
"\"A wall carving of an archdaemon! Eww, disgusting. I'd suggest we destroy "
"this place and put everything here to the torch, but who knows... There "
"might still be some dangerous protective spells in the stones...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아크다이몬을 새긴 벽이라! 역겹구나. 이곳을 하나하나 모두 파괴하고 싶지만... 돌에 위험한 보호 마법이 걸려있을지 누가 알아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "fb344715-f2e0-4aaa-9f8f-dca434d50b1d"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke grows gloomy.{/n} \"Daemons are evil worse than devils. If "
"Varnhold's disappearance is somehow connected to these ruins, then... Those "
"poor people!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 우울해졌습니다.{/n} \"다이몬은 데블보다 더한 놈들이야. 반홀드가 사라진 이유는 이 폐허와 어떤 식으로 연결되어 있을 "
"거야... 불쌍한 사람들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament2/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a3aa05dc-8a89-41ec-a558-6aa359ebcb7e"
msgid "[Try to discern who is depicted on the bas-relief]"
msgstr "[누가 이 것을 조각했는지 알아내려 했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament2/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5f26c87a-54a5-4dea-b77d-c3d22f0af109"
msgid "[Step away]"
msgstr "[물러섭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament2/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "127f38ca-b621-45e4-81f7-fd7c51cadf4b"
msgid ""
"{n}This bas-relief depicts what looks like a cloud of smoke with two long, "
"deathly arms extended forth. Its razor-sharp claws are reaching out to grip "
"the face of a terrified cyclops.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 조각은 연기가 구름으로 이어져 앞으로 뻗어있는 무시무시한 팔을 묘사했습니다. 날카로운 손톱은 공포에 질린 사이클롭스의 얼굴을 "
"쥐려고 뻗고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament2/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "f9cf1805-bd70-46a6-b13f-c12c54658dcd"
msgid ""
"{n}This bas-relief depicts a soul eater — a supernatural creature from the "
"daemonic plane of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}. An experienced wizard could summon "
"such an entity to send against their enemies — this monster would chase its "
"target until it drains the target's soul or it perishes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 조각은 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 데몬의 차원에서 온 초자연적인 크리처 소울 이터를 묘사하고 있습니다. 숙련된 마법사는 "
"적에게 대항해 이런 생명체를 소환할 수 있습니다. 이 괴물은 목표가 죽거나 영혼이 빨릴 때까지 계속해서 추격합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament2/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "744c96b0-bc77-4670-8a7a-73de13adc6d0"
msgid "{n}You can't figure out who or what is depicted here.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 이 조각을 묘사한 생명체가 누군지 누가 조각했는지 모릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament2/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "5ff493aa-47f9-42c9-8cfe-1c733b56ac9b"
msgid ""
"{n}This bas-relief depicts a supernatural being from {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} —"
" a soul eater. It looks like a cloud of smoke with two long, deathly arms "
"extending from it. Its razor-sharp claws are reaching out to grip the face "
"of a terrified cyclops.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 조각은 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 초자연적인 존재 영혼 포식자를 묘사하고 있습니다. 그것은 무시무시한 팔이 두개 뻗어있는 "
"연기구름 처럼 생겼습니다. 날카로운 손톱을 뻗어 공포에 질린 사이클롭스의 얼굴을 쥐려 하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament3/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ea70ab35-0a2d-4956-a4f7-0b136a62fc21"
msgid "[Try to discern who is depicted on the bas-relief]"
msgstr "[조각이 무엇인지 알아내려 했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament3/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "7ec57a9b-f043-44dc-b726-c784e666e263"
msgid "[Step away]"
msgstr "[물러섭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament3/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "23c4d975-8e72-4b03-98ef-7956405ba463"
msgid ""
"{n}This bas-relief depicts an ominous figure, clad in a cloak and a hat, "
"sailing a narrow boat down a river of cyclopean skeletons.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 조각은 망또를 두르고 모자를 쓴 불길해 보이는 인물이 사이클롭스 해골의 강을 보트를 타고 내려가는 모습을 묘사했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament3/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "650f2996-2e8b-4fcc-b7c3-9f41689045f6"
msgid ""
"{n}This bas-relief depicts {g|Charon}Charon{/g} — the godlike Horseman of "
"Death, one of the Four Horsemen and an archdaemon of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}. "
"The river he sails is obviously the River Styx. Unlike "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, who shepherds and judges souls after their deaths, "
"Charon and the other Horsemen are evil deities looking to spread as much "
"death and destruction as possible. It seems the ancient cyclopes worshiped "
"him. Secret cults worshiping the Four Horsemen exist to this day.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}조각을 자세히 조사하자 사이클롭스가 상상하는 죽음의 반신인 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 고위다이몬 {g|Charon}케런{/g}"
"인 것 같았습니다. 이 강은 스틱스 강이 분명합니다. 죽은 이들을 심판하는 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}와 달리 케런은 살아있는 "
"영혼을 사후 세계로 보내는 과정을 담당하는 사악한 다이몬을 상징합니다. 사이클롭스가 그를 숭배한 것 같습니다. 케런을 숭배하는 비밀 "
"의식은 오늘날에도 이어지고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament3/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "36af2704-4a4e-42aa-9ab0-c3a760b126e1"
msgid "{n}You can't figure out who or what is depicted here.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 이 조각을 묘사한 생명체가 누군지 누가 조각했는지 모릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament3/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "c57a7158-b879-432f-8018-1ef04629b3ab"
msgid ""
"{n}This bas-relief depicts one of the evil deities of those who built this "
"tomb — {g|Charon}Charon{/g}, archdaemon of Death, in the form of a grim "
"boatman clad in a cloak and a hat. He sails the River Styx among countless "
"skeletons.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}조각은 이 무덤을 지은 자들의 악의 신이자 죽음의 아크다이몬 {g|Charon}케런{/g}이 망또를 두르고 모자를 쓴 불길해 보이는 "
"인물로서 사이클롭스 해골의 강을 보트를 타고 내려가는 모습을 묘사했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament3/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bab91c09-cdb7-4944-ab27-81e6aa0371ec"
msgid ""
"\"Not something I expected to see here... This is the River Styx, and the "
"boatman is {g|Charon}Charon{/g}, Horseman of Death and archdaemon of "
"{g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}. The cyclopes depicted him with one eye, of course — "
"they saw creatures with two eyes as nothing more than animals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 그림을 여기서 보게 될 줄이야... 이 강은 스틱스 강으로 사공은 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 아크 다이몬이자 죽음의 "
"4기수인 {g|Charon}케런{/g}이야. 사이클롭스들은 그를 외눈박이로 묘사했고 눈이 두개 달린 생명체는 짐승 취급을 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/Ornament3/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "94be0838-fd8c-47db-b3f3-cc38a1aecd4d"
msgid ""
"\"Did the cyclopes have some state cult around the Four Horsemen? If so, "
"it's little wonder their civilization collapsed.\""
msgstr "\"사이클롭스가 4 기수를 위한 의식을 치뤘었나? 그렇다면 그들의 문명이 붕괴한 이유도 예상이 가는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2cfc80c4-f267-4b6c-aaea-ffb6ae4e91e9"
msgid "Eliminated the Defaced Sister as an obstacle to reach your goal."
msgstr "당신의 목표를 이루기 위해 얼굴 잃은 자매를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "933f43b9-2e7d-45c3-bd05-7802f58fe04f"
msgid "\"She stood in the way of something I needed.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 내 길을 방해한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9987d90f-3b22-4e7d-9827-0bc45262d074"
msgid "Killed the Defaced Sister to put her out of her misery."
msgstr "그녀의 고통을 덜어주기 위해 얼굴 잃은 자매를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "8deb44b4-8beb-4def-a61e-f319af418144"
msgid "\"She had suffered enough. I spared her from further pain.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 충분히 고통받았어. 이제 고통을 줄여줘야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ac900cf3-2254-4e02-9de9-c7821a6871a5"
msgid "\"It is none of your concern.\""
msgstr "\"네 알 바 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b344d2e9-3f9c-40f8-89e3-9dc221b568c9"
msgid "Refused the idea to kill off the weak."
msgstr "약자를 죽인다는 생각을 반대합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "6f20e278-f264-44cc-98a6-6ad688a0fb45"
msgid "\"I won't ruin lives just because I can.\""
msgstr "\"죽일 수 있다고 해서 죽이지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "669ebd77-f283-4db9-aebc-dbacafc368ae"
msgid ""
"Spared the Defaced Sister since she was neither a threat nor an obstacle."
msgstr "그녀는 위험이나 방해가 되지 않기에 죽이지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "adf0c922-4c7a-41e4-b0bd-f4836daeba6c"
msgid ""
"\"She was no threat to my plans, and spilling blood needlessly often causes "
"more trouble.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 내 계획에 방해가 되지 않아. 불필요한 죽음은 더 많은 문제를 일으키지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a7e3cdf1-499c-4ad3-bd5a-04ea5d3d650a"
msgid "\"I have nothing to say to you.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 할 말 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "d7ea3409-ecbe-4c66-afd7-3b239641fbd4"
msgid ""
"\"My name is {name}! Remember it, or I swear, next time we meet will be the "
"last!\""
msgstr "\"내 이름은 {name}다! 기억해. 아니면 다음에 만날 때는 그게 네 마지막이 될 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "99eb551e-5146-4ab3-b8e7-01426ad26e8f"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "aaa46728-7b89-4978-82b9-f37793f3e353"
msgid ""
"\"My name will be known for centuries — I'm {mf|Baron|Baroness} {name}. Now —"
" who are you and why are you following me?\""
msgstr "\"내 이름은 수백년 동안 남겨질 거다. 나는 {name}다. 너는 누구고 왜 나를 쫓는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "9c5d9e02-cdc4-4e95-8b7a-c18dcda65a2f"
msgid ""
"\"If it is so, why do you keep hounding the steps of this 'lesser race'?\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 왜 이 '열등한 종'의 뒤를 계속해서 밟는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "1b032b4b-c76c-4958-9326-6deaaa98feca"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you is the same raven as before. It sits, adjusts itself, then "
"ruffles its feathers a few times as it tries to settle on its perch. "
"Finally, it cocks its head to the side and affixes you with a single eye.{/n}"
" \"Why?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 전에 본 그 까마귀가 있습니다. 그것은 자리에 앉으면서 몇번 날개를 퍼덕이고는 횃대에 앉습니다. 마침내 그것은 날개 "
"한쪽으로 머리를 가리고 한쪽 눈으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "c025646f-8871-4dbc-bcfd-5d2edd0ed778"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven flaps its wings and utters a rattling caw, as if clearing its "
"throat.{/n} \"Why kill the Sisterrr? Why walk the path of destrrrruction?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 날개를 퍼덕이고는 목을 가다듬듯 까악까악하고 웁니다.{/n} \"왜 자매를 죽였지? 왜 파괴의 길을 걷는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "3f23d427-9b14-4dba-8eb8-76cccd4d456c"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven utters a rattling caw, as if clearing its throat.{/n} \"Why "
"sparrrrre the Sisterrrr, when you could rrrid yourself of her? Why let the "
"weak surrrrvive?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 날개를 퍼덕이고는 목을 가다듬듯 까악까악하고 웁니다.{/n} \"왜 죽이지 않고 자매를 살려두었지? 왜 약자를 살려두는 "
"거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "ea7f5c7f-0e05-485b-aba0-280d86ab34a0"
msgid ""
"\"Ego. Negligence. Uncarrrring of the lives of otherrrrs. Impressive. Your "
"race has learrrned the lessons of the past.\""
msgstr "\"자아. 무지. 다른 생명체는 배려하지 않는 태도. 인상적임. 너희 종은 과거를 통해서 배운다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "0b16599f-62ed-40dc-add7-4e2de479ae14"
msgid ""
"\"A wise answerrrr it would be, if not crrrroaked from the throat of a "
"{race}.\""
msgstr "\"{race}의 입에서 나온 것치고는 현명한 답변이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "91d9f712-bf70-4c48-8d48-332cb4f8cf27"
msgid ""
"\"Is that how you rrrationalize yourrr deeds? You may use such weak tales to "
"fool those that fearrrr you, but I do not... I see you for who you arrrre, "
"{race}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 네 행동을 정당화 하는 건가? 너를 겁주는 자들을 그렇게 속일지 몰라도 나는 못 속인다... 네가 누군지 나는 알고 있다. "
"{race}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "f3d23277-f34b-4600-8669-cc2178cc4c20"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so? It never stopped you beforrre. Hypocrrrisy… why herrre? Why "
"now?\""
msgstr "\"그런가? 절대로 멈추지 않을 것이다. 위선이라... 왜 여기에 왔지? 왜 지금이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "5332ecaf-4815-4a5d-baad-3289e0e5d4d6"
msgid "{n}The raven shifts on its perch, but remains silent.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}까마귀는 횃대로 갔지만 여전히 조용합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "57be768d-bda2-43bc-83bf-bd46658f5443"
msgid ""
"\"Off with you, {race}! There are countless like you, many of the lesser "
"rrraces who breed, sufferrrr and die, little more than snuffed candles with "
"no names to be rrrememberrred by.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물러서라. {race}! 태어나서 자라고 이름도 남기지 못하고 죽는 양초 같은 삶을 사는 너 같은 열등한 종족이 수 없이 많다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "1d8db183-62ae-4861-9571-8bb09a249dc2"
msgid ""
"\"So be it…. {name}.\" {n}The raven spreads its wings and takes flight.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그러라지…. {name}.\" {n}까마귀는 날개를 펼치고는 퍼덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "9758d851-cb53-4046-8268-3f757c94a4ea"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven swivels its head to the side and stares at you with a beady "
"eye.{/n} \"You're unworthy to know my masterrrr. You may neverrr know.\""
msgstr "{n}까마귀는 머리를 갸웃거리며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"너는 내 주인을 알기에는 열등하다. 절대 알려주지 않을 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/RavenTalkMotives/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : DunswardRaven
msgctxt "3cd6bcd4-ecd2-44a0-9508-649c4ed8cf90"
msgid ""
"{n}With a shrieking caw, the raven spreads its wings and takes flight.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}한번 까악거리고 까마귀는 날개를 펼치고는 퍼덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "9ac78e0f-a787-4873-8c16-3c0954e60cb2"
msgid "\"Dugath sent us.\""
msgstr "\"두가스가 나를 보냈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b60752a3-e534-45ed-b42d-23ff7cecef17"
msgid "\"The Defaced Sister sent us.\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매가 나를 보냈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f88cbee5-6982-4e8d-bd53-acd3b364da66"
msgid "\"We're just travelers.\""
msgstr "\"우린 그저 여행자들이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fbe2d8bc-40ff-4bb0-9d57-9b0d28bcd1a7"
msgid "Finished off the wounded barbarian in the ancient cyclops tomb."
msgstr "고대 사이클롭스 무덤에 있는 부상 당한 야만인의 목숨을 끝냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3492a3cc-25bb-4812-9d63-895c66640a62"
msgid "[Finish off the barbarian] \"Whatever.\""
msgstr "[야만인을 죽입니다] \"어쨌든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "66f2b246-67d9-4931-b009-b4d59c36f01c"
msgid "[Leave without a word]"
msgstr "[말 없이 떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "1ec89916-5c52-4dc9-9a4d-32190db7f1f2"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b8b3ac11-3c4e-4c35-9277-ae01b2437958"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2c08d840-752b-4464-baea-e40c46a81051"
msgid "Offered help to the wounded barbarian."
msgstr "부상당한 바바리안을 치료해 줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "b4d39f90-4dd8-43fc-8e5d-c2c383cca1aa"
msgid "\"I'll heal you.\""
msgstr "\"치료해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "485e547e-a677-47bf-b66a-8935006c57e8"
msgid "Killed the wounded barbarian."
msgstr "부상당한 바바리안을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "980575e0-cc85-4806-bceb-eac8e621714c"
msgid "[Finish off the barbarian] \"I'll put an end to you.\""
msgstr "[야만인을 죽입니다] \"너에게 안식을 주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "a3a8c383-12ff-43cd-9e8a-f29b104457e1"
msgid "[Heal the barbarian] \"It's not yet your time.\""
msgstr "[야만인을 치료해줍니다] \"아직 죽을 때가 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f4ae8f7d-dcce-4d25-b7f3-be8567f97217"
msgid "At the wounded barbarian's request, ended his suffering."
msgstr "고통을 줄여주려 부상당한 바바리안을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "7d244d28-cd97-4c00-937b-c46774dc2d07"
msgid "[Finish off the barbarian] \"As you wish. Gorum take your soul.\""
msgstr "[야만인을 죽입니다] \"네가 원하는 대로. 고룸이 너를 인도할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "2ee2741b-1d5f-4187-9f61-2cf312f2f3cc"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "d81bca57-707f-4ec1-befd-54eafa96a49e"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무것도 말하지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "a88b52a4-9705-45e0-bce6-37a71a8d59b4"
msgid ""
"\"Shut up, Regongar! For once in your life, can you just keep your stupid "
"jokes to yourself?\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐. 레곤가르! 제발 한번이라도 좀 닥칠 수 없어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "7fecd543-0268-4299-954f-e961874f4f35"
msgid ""
"\"Right, ha ha! Better grow eyes in the back of your head! And sleep with "
"one eye open!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 하하! 뒤통수에다 눈을 달아야겠어! 아니면 잘 때 한눈은 뜨고 자던가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "647043e8-6286-4b60-9041-1d765d39eece"
msgid "\"Reg, that's not funny. A person is dying here. Now's not the time.\""
msgstr "\"레그. 재미 없어. 사람이 죽어가고 있어. 분위기 좀 봐가면서 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "6b2f62ad-4b2d-4185-ade1-2d7bfc413d4a"
msgid ""
"\"Many good warriors found their way to Gorum today. Don't weep for them — "
"they're already drinking mead in Elysium!\""
msgstr "\"많은 좋은 전사들이 고룸을 만나러 떠났다. 울지 마. 그들은 일리지움에서 술을 마시고 있을 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "121fb525-9364-4791-b587-1e510afc47b7"
msgid ""
"{n}A barbarian sits leaning against the wall, surrounded by dead bodies. He "
"seems to be barely alive. His entire face is a bloody wound, tattered scraps "
"of skin dangling from it. As he hears your footsteps, he blindly turns "
"toward the sound and raises his sword with immense effort.{/n} \"Friend or "
"foe?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인이 벽에 기대어 사방이 시체가 있는 곳에 앉습니다. 그는 죽어가고 있었습니다. 그의 얼굴은 피로 덮여있었고 피부가 "
"떨어져나갔습니다. 당신이 오는 것을 알아차리고 그는 당신 쪽을 보고는 가까스로 검을 듭니다.{/n} \"친구냐 아니면 적이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "87af5aca-4b0f-4e54-b8e0-f5c3e5a2694c"
msgid ""
"{n}The blind barbarian grips his sword with bloody hands.{/n} \"You again?\""
msgstr "{n}야만인은 피 묻은 손으로 칼을 쥡니다.{/n} \"또 너냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "e9c1f183-d325-4439-8256-e1fb636075f4"
msgid ""
"\"Dugath! Of course, the old man would never leave anyone behind... But it's "
"too late now. Only one left to save is me, and you may as well not bother. "
"I'll be joining the rest of the dead soon enough.\""
msgstr ""
"\"두가스! 물론. 그 늙은이는 아군을 버리는 법이 없지... 하지만 지금은 늦었어. 살아남은 자는 나 뿐이고 나도 곧 죽을 거야. 나도 "
"그들을 따라가겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "1f2a1c85-019d-4172-ae15-6752739ee434"
msgid ""
"\"That witch! Look, I don't know who you are, but you can't trust her! We "
"made that mistake, and look what happened!\""
msgstr "\"그 마녀가! 네가 누군지 모르지만 그녀를 믿지 말라고! 우리가 실수를 저질러 어떤 일이 일어났는지 보라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "99fb7242-cba4-4f1a-94a8-02460be6c4ea"
msgid ""
"\"If you're looking for a place to camp for the night, you may want to keep "
"moving. Not a very cozy place here, as you can see!\" {n}The barbarian tries "
"to force a chuckle, but it comes out closer to a sob.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네가 밤을 지새울 캠프 자리를 찾는다면 계속해서 움직이는 것이 좋을 거야. 여기는 보다시피 아늑한 자리는 아니군!\" {n}야만인은 "
"웃으려고 하지만 헐떡임에 가까웠습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "529d779a-5255-4c51-b419-87a71bbf8347"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! Damn... I must be delirious. Gonna die here alone, talking to stone "
"walls and corpses...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐! 젠장... 내가 미쳐가는군. 나는 여기에서 벽과 대화하다 홀로 죽을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "9c28486a-2523-4c12-9d24-d130dfcd128c"
msgid ""
"\"That cursed witch brought us here — blabbered on and on about some exalted "
"mission, promised us cyclops treasures... Well, look what we got! Soon as we "
"entered, dead cyclopes attacked us! Then there was a flash of light, and "
"everything went insane...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 저주받은 마녀가 우리를 여기로 인도했어. 사이클롭스의 보물을 주겠다며 임무를 하라고 혀를 놀리더군... 그리고는 이 꼴이 되었지! "
"입구로 들어서자 사이클롭스들이 우리를 공격했어! 그리고 빛이 번쩍였고 모든 것이 미쳐가기 시작했지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "c5437daf-d52d-411f-9141-611066d62c9e"
msgid ""
"\"It was like a red-hot nail was driven into my brain. Had an irresistible "
"urge to kill, didn't matter who. I resisted it — barely — but most of us "
"weren't so lucky... It was a slaughter, a nightmare where it was impossible "
"to tell friend from foe!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마치 내 뇌를 쑤시는 것과 같았지. 죽여야 한다는 강렬한 욕망에 사로잡혔어. 나는 저항하려고 했지만 소용이 없었고 모두 "
"미쳐갔다네... 친구와 적도 구별하지 못하는 살육의 현장이었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "8e2e4551-0ac4-4ae5-bb35-dfbbfc63247e"
msgid ""
"\"We tried to retreat, but they followed. One grabbed my head and "
"squeezed... Almost cracked me open like a walnut! My eyes... Last thing I "
"saw was his fingers... If Varha hadn't chopped off his hand and dragged me "
"out of there, I'd be dead already. She slammed the door right on their "
"noses! Oh, Varha... Haven't heard from her for a while... Probably dead, "
"now. Nice treasure-hunting trip we had, huh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 후퇴하려 했지만 그들이 따라왔어. 한놈이 내 머리를 잡고 움켜쥐었고... 내 머리는 호두처럼 부서질 뻔했지! 내 눈은... "
"그의 손가락을 본 게 마지막이었고... 바하가 그의 손을 자르고 나를 여기로 끌고 오지 않았다면 이미 죽었을 거야. 그녀는 그들 앞에서 "
"문을 박차고 들어갔어! 잠시 동안 그녀를 볼 수 없었고... 지금은 아마 죽었을 테지. 보물을 탐하다가 이렇게 되었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "989f0d38-bfe2-418e-8fa3-6553bcec4a93"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Brag, son of Verig and Dyll, of the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} "
"tribe. Came from {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. If you meet my people, tell them "
"where and how I died.\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족의 베리그와 딜의 자손 브라그다. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 왔지. "
"내 동료들을 만나거든 내가 어디서 어떻게 죽었는지 말해다오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "140707b3-9be4-402b-b58d-171e78ca002b"
msgid ""
"\"Don't bother. Who needs a blind cripple? Best to finish me — at least I'll "
"die like a fighter, sword in hand... ready to meet {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}...\""
msgstr ""
"\"상관 없어. 누가 눈 먼 불구를 원하겠어? 나를 끝내줘. 검을 든 전사로서 죽겠다... {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}을 만날 준비가 "
"되었으니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "e0c874f7-2f7f-40d7-9972-dc0431dde080"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}... I'm coming...\" {n}The whisper leaves the "
"barbarian's stiffening lips as he clings to his blade with the last of his "
"strength.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\" {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}... 내가 갑니다...\" {n}칼을 움켜쥔 그의 손이 경련을 일으키며 그의 속삭임은 "
"사라져갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "82521354-87f4-4fb2-b05d-b4dcf813cc90"
msgid ""
"\"Farewell... If you meet the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}, tell them what "
"happened to us...\""
msgstr "\"안녕히... {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}를 만나면 우리에게 일어난 일을 알려줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "f9eb34b4-b15c-471d-896e-c1f93a7dc1b3"
msgid "\"Gorum bless you.\""
msgstr "\"고룸께서 너에게 축복을 내리길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4be4a523-336f-4988-996e-0111ab0fc2be"
msgid "\"But you're still alive! Don't stop fighting!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 너는 아직 살아있어! 싸움을 멈추지 말아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6c69bf1c-69c1-4306-b5d0-4b3fe7d986dd"
msgid ""
"\"Brave in battle, humble in the face of oblivion... You are a true warrior."
"\""
msgstr "\"전투에서는 용감하고 죽기 전에는 겸손하구나... 너는 진정한 전사다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "5039d062-1e78-48d7-bc89-b4f94a92370a"
msgid ""
"\"What are you babbling about? I'm going to Elysium, to feast at "
"{g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} table with the greatest warriors of all time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"무슨 말을 지껄이는 거야? 나는 위대한 전사들과 {g|Numeria}고룸{/g}의 식탁에서 만찬을 즐기러 일리지움에 가는 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "6b2cfca9-dcde-4dc5-80c1-3634e7202465"
msgid "{n}Harrim sighs and shakes his head.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하림은 한숨을 쉬고 절래절래 고개를 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "02eefd4a-84de-4d3f-98fb-e6d918fe16b7"
msgid ""
"\"It's too late to fight. I can feel the life leaving my body with each "
"breath...\""
msgstr "\"싸우기에는 너무 늦었어. 숨을 쉴 때마다 내 몸에서 생명이 빠져나가는 것이 느껴진다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "74f1c19b-ad5c-45d4-9d40-4abbd17ea92c"
msgid ""
"\"So many good warriors left to meet {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} before their time — "
"all thanks to that witch! When I get my hands on her...\""
msgstr "\"많은 전사들이 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}을 만나러 떠났다. 모두 마녀 때문이야! 내가 그녀를 만난다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "797fa21e-fbba-48af-98ac-f9683dfc5c84"
msgid ""
"\"You'll manage! I know you will!\" {n}Octavia smiles at you gratefully.{/n}"
msgstr "\"해낼 거예요! 전 믿어요!\" {n}옥타비아는 당신을 보며 감사의 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "a21fffd4-1917-48fc-a8f9-969607fc069d"
msgid ""
"\"That's right, with all these cyclopes around... you really have to keep "
"your eyes peeled, ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 주변에 사이클롭스가 널려있으니... 항상 눈을 떼지 말아야겠지. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1bcae72a-8caf-4a8d-9c57-ea471f4f12c0"
msgid "\"Yes. Right... I'm sorry. I got carried away.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 맞아... 미안. 내가 심했군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "872d2c8c-a56d-49f3-8517-4cfa742fffe3"
msgid ""
"\"Not a problem.\" {n}The barbarian bares his broken teeth in a morbid, "
"bloody smirk.{/n} \"Joke all you want — I won't bat an eye!\""
msgstr ""
"\"별 거 아니야.\" {n}야만인은 부러진 이를 드러내며 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"네가 원하는대로 얼마든지 놀려봐. 난 눈 하나도 "
"깜빡하지 않을테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "521c3444-5664-4b14-b1b9-b8f9a9e7cbb8"
msgid "\"Fine, fine... What was that all about...?\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 좋아... 뭐였지...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "6727bd29-3e00-47c0-ae58-88ab0fe8d010"
msgid ""
"{n}Realizing no one is going to pay attention to his joke, Regongar begins "
"examining the stone walls with exaggerated indifference.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}누구도 그의 농담에 귀 기울이지 않는 것을 안 레곤가르는 무관심한 눈빛으로 돌 벽을 조사하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "09da472a-5a76-4d33-88f2-1e27e35e7c58"
msgid "\"Right! Or they'll hit you in the blink of an eye! Boom! Bull's-eye!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 아니면 그들이 눈 깜짝할 사이에 너를 떼려눕힐걸! 아. 눈이 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "a6f1a504-ac3b-49c7-9ccb-530f4b2e3fcd"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, you're quite the jokesters, aren't you?\" {n}The barbarian bares "
"his teeth in a morbid, bloody smirk.{/n} \"You should go see them for "
"yourselves — they're a real eye-popper!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하하! 정말 농담을 잘하는군?\" {n}야만인은 부러진 이를 드러내며 웃습니다.{/n} \"직접 그들을 보러 가 보라고! 여기서 "
"눈알이 빠지도록 기다려 봐야 소용 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "afa1583c-9127-4566-9da2-b9ecb580ff94"
msgid "\"Dead meat. Nok-Nok bored now. Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"죽은 고기다. 녹-녹 지겹다. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "627f9ba4-650d-43d2-90ac-413089d1c848"
msgid ""
"\"You speak truth. But still, it's a pity. So many battles left unfought — "
"so many songs unsung!\""
msgstr "\"진실을 말하는군. 하지만 불쌍하구나. 많은 전투가 남았지만 노래로 남겨지지 않다니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "784e4745-55a6-450b-a378-6d41a9aae7df"
msgid ""
"\"I wouldn't want to be in his place...\" {n}Kalikke speaks so softly, you "
"can barely make out her words.{/n} \"To lose the chance to see the world in "
"all its beauty... no, I'd rather die.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기에 머물기 싫어...\" {n}칼리케는 조용히 말해서 당신은 그녀의 목소리가 거의 들리지 않았습니다.{/n} \"세상의 온갖 "
"아름다움을 볼 기회를 잃어버리다니... 나라면 차라리 죽어버리겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "64222510-d319-47c5-987e-0cdf50a0b619"
msgid ""
"\"Went into an ancient dungeon for some easy pickings, and found monsters "
"there. What a surprise!\""
msgstr "\"쉽게 돈 좀 벌어보려고 고대 던전에 들어갔더니 괴물을 만났네. 세상에나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/DunswardTomb/WoundedBarbarian/Cue_WoundedBarbarian_Heal_Text
msgctxt "2c53da0a-eaa2-433a-9d5b-0638755e6780"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian's wounds close and his bleeding stops, but he remains blind "
"— it will take much more powerful magic to restore his eyesight. He exhales "
"with relief.{/n} \"Thank you. I'm not sure how to live on, what I'll do, "
"but... I'll figure something out.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인의 상처는 닫혀 피가 멎었지만 그는 여전히 눈이 멀었습니다. 그의 시력을 회복하려면 더 강한 마법이 필요합니다. 그는 안도의 "
"한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"고마워. 어떻게 살아나갈지 모르지만 그래도... 어떻게든 되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "a9009a6e-2185-4b7d-8bf0-b43be47897e7"
msgid "...approached carefully, trying not to reveal ourselves."
msgstr "...조심스럽게 접근하여 들키지 않으려 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "1c6eb492-f9f7-4197-9859-35919b8ad4c9"
msgid "...turned back."
msgstr "...되돌아왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f7ef9ef9-aeeb-48c1-81d1-6dfae4f7da1d"
msgid "...rushed into a fight."
msgstr "...돌격해서 싸움을 걸었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "2675ae23-073e-47ad-87a5-6a012964e327"
msgid "...bared our weapons and menacingly demanded an explanation."
msgstr "...무장한 채로 설명을 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "24449e7d-dc9a-441a-a246-80365eeb1884"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "aa90fc2a-3103-4e1d-a959-c96d814bd90f"
msgid "...hurried over there, trying to stay as quiet as possible."
msgstr "...서둘렀지만 조용히 하려고 노력했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "0b527a48-ec94-49a5-88b3-1c07f23da68a"
msgid "...stormed over there, rattling our weapons and shouting battle cries."
msgstr "...전투의 함성을 내지르고 온갖 소음을 내며 달려들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "4f870bf1-2f1a-424b-83d8-21a3db57133d"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "1f8e5fd3-2ac0-4f47-9f3a-ec73a761b639"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫기]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "acd742f7-00da-461c-9500-58b1c14c5136"
msgid ""
"While traveling through the Hills of Nomen, we noticed something worrisome — "
"crows circled the sky, much as they do upon spying a corpse to feast upon. "
"More ominous yet, clouds of smoke trailed into the sky as well. After "
"noticing that, we..."
msgstr ""
"노멘 언덕을 여행하던 중 우리는 심상치 않은 것 — 까마귀가 곧 있을 만찬을 기대하듯 하늘을 빙빙 돌고 있는 것을 발견했습니다. 더 "
"불길한 것은 하늘에 연기 구름이 피어오르는 것이었습니다. 그 사실을 알아차린 후, 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "426b98f7-b047-464d-94f7-3e4d93fc7653"
msgid ""
"After noticing us, the little bastards started to flee, leaving behind "
"everything they'd been trying to take from the body of the deceased ("
"including a hefty coin pouch — alas, in this backwater, coin proved of "
"little use)."
msgstr ""
"우리를 발견한 조그만 녀석들은 쓰러진 시체를 뒤지다 말고 도망치기 시작했습니다. 시체에는 동전이 가득한 주머니도 있었지만 이런 곳에서는 "
"쓸모가 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "a2a46107-3432-4d5e-8a90-151a37bf7570"
msgid ""
"Realizing we weren't in a playful mood, the goblins grew defensive, almost "
"pleading. \"It not us! We not killed no one! He already deaded!\" The "
"goblins' words tumbled over each other in their haste to exonerate "
"themselves — but they seemed to be sincere. \"Horse threw him, nasty thing — "
"broke his neck! Horse killed him! We not even tried eating him!\"\n"
"After hearing their story, we let the goblins go with a warning. But before "
"that, we made sure to reclaim everything they'd taken from the deceased ("
"including a hefty coin pouch — alas, in this backwater, coin proved of "
"little use)."
msgstr ""
"우리가 장난 칠 기분이 아닌 것을 알자, 고블린들은 거의 애원하듯 변명하기 시작합니다. \"우리가 아니다! 우리는 아무도 죽이지 않았다! 이미 죽어있었다!"
"\" 고블린들은 서둘러 자신들을 변명하느라 서로 뒤엉켰지만, 그것은 진심인 것 같았습니다. \"그가 말에서 떨어져서 목이 부러졌다! 말이 죽였다! 우리는 "
"그를 먹으려고 하지 않았다!\"\n"
"그들의 이야기를 듣고 우리는 경고와 함께 고블린들을 보내줬습니다. 하지만 그 전에 우리는 그들이 털어간 물건들을 되찾았습니다. "
"물건에는 동전이 가득한 주머니도 있었지만 이런 곳에서는 쓸모가 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Cue_0012_Text_String
msgctxt "80a3f333-b610-401a-8a57-e980f425beb4"
msgid ""
"Alas, the body laid before us belonged to none other than Tomin Hanvaki — a "
"noble from Gralton, the one whose brother begged us to look for him. A "
"letter in his jacket pocket, yellowed with age, confirmed his identity. It "
"was signed \"Mathian Hanvaki,\" a relative. All we could do then was take "
"the tragic news to his brother."
msgstr ""
"아아, 우리 앞에 놓여진 시체는 바로 다름 아닌 토민 한바키였습니다 — 그의 형제가 수색을 부탁한 그랄튼의 귀족이죠. 그의 "
"외투 주머니에 세월로 누렇게 변색된 편지가 신원을 확인시켜 주었습니다. 편지에는 \"마티안 한바키\"의 서명이 "
"되어있었습니다. 이제 우리는 이 슬픈 소식을 그의 형제에게 알려주어야 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Cue_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "9ee555f1-c82a-4a1a-83e4-cd383fc8868a"
msgid ""
"We soon saw what attracted the crows — a dead horse lay in the ditch, one "
"leg missing and its carcass already picked at by scavengers. Near the horse "
"was what looked to be the corpse of its former rider, a young man clad only "
"in undergarments."
msgstr ""
"우리는 까마귀의 관심을 끄는 것이 무엇인지 알게 되었습니다. 다리 하나가 없는 죽은 말이 시체 사냥꾼들에 의해 여기저기 뜯겨져나갔습니다. "
"말 주위에는 그 말을 탔던 것으로 보이는 속옷 차림의 남자 시체가 놓여있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "2924a488-ec32-4404-a834-7aa305ef5d8a"
msgid ""
"The smoke was coming from a bonfire, where a horse's leg was roasting. We "
"saw no cooks, but judging by the footprints and the high-pitched shrieks in "
"the distant hills, the camp must have formerly belonged to goblins. They "
"must have fled after hearing our shouts, leaving behind everything they'd "
"scavenged from the body of the deceased (including a hefty coin pouch — "
"alas, in this backwater, coin proved of little use). Deciding not to pursue "
"the goblins, we turned our attention to the body."
msgstr ""
"말의 다리를 굽던 모닥불의 연기가 올라오고 있었습니다. 요리사는 보이지 않았지만 언덕에 찍혔던 발자국으로 보아 그것은 고블린의 캠프임에 "
"틀림 없었습니다. 그들은 우리의 외침 소리를 듣고 시체에서 털었던 모든 것을 버리고 도망친 것이 분명했습니다. 시체에는 동전이 가득한 "
"주머니도 있었지만 이런 곳에서는 쓸모가 없었습니다. 고블린을 쫓지 않기로 하고 우리는 시체에 관심을 돌렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "918c7732-f9e5-4910-99e8-fa14ea54f727"
msgid ""
"The smoke was coming from a bonfire, around which goblins were roasting a "
"horse leg — it seemed their hunger was stronger than their fear of these "
"animals.\n"
"Other goblins were busy rummaging through the clothes of a deceased man and "
"taking whatever choice bits they could find. One goblin was strutting around "
"wearing a beret with a feather, another a velvet jacket, and two other "
"goblins, each wearing a single boot, were in the middle of a tug-of-war with "
"the dead man's trousers. When we saw this, we..."
msgstr ""
"말의 다리를 굽던 모닥불의 연기가 올라오고 있었습니다. 동물에 대한 두려움보다 배고픔이 더 컸나 봅니다.\n"
"다른 고블린들은 시체의 옷을 뒤져 물건을 챙기느라 바빴습니다. 한 고블린은 깃털 달린 베레모를 쓰고, 다른 녀석은 벨벳 외투를 "
"입고, 다른 두 녀석은 장화 한 짝씩 신고 시체의 바지를 가지고 줄다리기 하고 있었습니다. 이 광경을 보고 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "21609b93-2090-4bc5-a6f8-289c59ec5eca"
msgid ""
"The smoke was coming from a bonfire, where a horse's leg was roasting. We "
"also saw the cooks — goblins, but it was too late to give chase. They were "
"fleeing as fast as they could, clad in the clothes of a dead man — one wore "
"a beret with a feather, another a velvet jacket. A third was clutching a "
"coin pouch — equally useless for traveler or goblin in this backwater. "
"Deciding not to pursue the goblins, we turned our attention to the body in "
"the ditch."
msgstr ""
"말의 다리를 굽던 모닥불의 연기가 올라오고 있었습니다. 요리사도 보았지만 쫓기에는 너무 늦었습니다. 그들은 재빨리 달아나고 있었습니다. "
"그 중 하나는 깃털 달린 베레모를 쓰고 있었고 다른 녀석은 벨벳 외투를 입고 있었습니다. 또 다른 녀석은 자신에게는 쓸모없는 동전 "
"주머니를 짤랑거렸습니다. 고블린을 쫓지 않기로 하고 우리는 시체에 관심을 돌렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Letters/Letter_on_Noble_corpse_String
msgctxt "017ccf61-c7ec-4d76-a4c9-5ab6de3343d0"
msgid ""
"\"Penrod, my dear brother!\n"
"I hasten to share the good news! Our family's financial predicaments will be "
"happily resolved in the near future. How, you ask? Why, by the grace of the "
"cyclopes of all things!\n"
"You see, these beasts, who once used to inhabit Iobaria, will become our "
"benefactors. While studying ancient maps, I have discovered the location of "
"several of their tombs — in the Hills of Nomen! It's common knowledge the "
"cyclopes used to bury their dead with their treasures — treasures they have "
"no need of! Fortune calls, my brother — in a day soon to come, the Hanvakis "
"family coffers shall be full to bursting!\n"
"Your brother,\n"
"Duke Mathian Hanvaki\""
msgstr ""
"\"펜로드, 내 형제여!\n"
"서둘러 좋은 소식을 전하마! 우리 가족의 빚 문제는 곧 해결될 것이야. 어떻게 그게 가능하냐고? 사이클롭스 덕분이야!\n"
"이오바리아에 살았던 짐승들이 우리의 후원자가 될 것이야. 고대 지도를 연구하다가 노멘 언덕에서 그들의 무덤이 여러 개 있는 곳을 발견했어! "
"사이클롭스가 무덤에 재물을 함께 묻는 것은 상식이지 — 죽은 자들에게는 필요 없는 것이고! 운이 좋았어, 동생아 — 머지 않아 한바키 가문은 "
"부자가 될 거야!\n"
"너의 형제,\n"
"마티안 한바키 공작\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/GMBE_LostNoble/Letters/Letter_on_Undead_String
msgctxt "568882d8-3dc9-4ccd-89c0-69d52b1c9d0e"
msgid ""
"\"Mathian, my beloved brother,\n"
"Read this and heed my words: This expedition to Iobaria is the stupidest "
"idea I've ever heard of. This is pure madness. If you are lucky, you'll come "
"back empty-handed, a fool in eyes of all Gralton. But if unlucky, you won't "
"come back at all, leaving your wife a widow, your children orphans, and me — "
"Aroden forbid — the heir and head of our insane family.\n"
"I beg you by every god and their mother — forget this expedition of yours! "
"Come home!\n"
"Your brother,\n"
"Penrod Hanvaki\""
msgstr ""
"\"마티안, 내 형제여.\n"
"이것을 제발 읽어주기를. 이오바리아로 가는 여행이란 내가 들어본 아이디어중 가장 멍청한 것이었어. 순수한 광기일 뿐이네. 운이 좋다면, "
"그랄튼 사람들에게 웃음거리가 되어 빈 손으로 돌아올 수 있겠지. 하지만 그렇지 않다면, 네 아내는 과부가 되고, 네 아이들은 고아가 "
"되고, 나만이 남아 우리 미치광이 가문의 상속자이자 가주가 되겠지. 그리 되지 않도록 아로덴께서 막아주시길.\n"
"모든 신들과 신들의 어머니께 기도하니, 제발 너의 여행은 잊어라! 집으로 돌아와라!\n"
"너의 형제,\n"
"펜로드 한바키.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "8245eca8-d020-48e1-879f-4220ed2ba37e"
msgid "\"Why are you here? Going to try to kill me again?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기에 있지? 나를 다시 죽이려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "57dbd7b6-5c19-431b-9cc9-5ecb0e40df3e"
msgid "[Attack] \"I will not forgive your betrayal!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네가 한 일은 용서할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "33fe3fff-e243-4fdc-90c5-ee074aa97b7a"
msgid ""
"\"I will ask again — why are you here? Give me an honest answer. It seems "
"pointless to have a conversation of hints and hidden meanings.\""
msgstr "\"다시 묻겠다. 왜 여기로 왔지? 솔직하게 대답해. 이해하기 어렵게 말하면 소용 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "493027df-2d10-4714-8d0f-d7dbedce8b16"
msgid ""
"\"I have visited the First World and learned something about you… and about "
"your curse.\""
msgstr "\"나는 태초 세계에 가서 너에 대한 사실을 알게 되었지... 너의 저주에 대해서도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "c390ec81-7540-4151-ae95-2431000eed9a"
msgid ""
"\"So, you were the one behind the Bloom. What have I or my subjects ever "
"done to you?\""
msgstr "\"네가 전염병의 배후로군. 나와 내 백성들이 겪은 고통을 네가 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "ff1464c3-5a8e-42aa-bdea-36b9a503525c"
msgid ""
"\"If I am a {mf|moth|butterfly} caught in a spider's web, what then are you? "
"The spider?\""
msgstr "\"내가 거미줄에 걸린 나비고 네가 거미라면 어떻게 하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "dc89db3a-95cd-4510-b19c-2a6cc96b01b0"
msgid "\"How about telling me your real name?\""
msgstr "\"너의 진짜 이름을 말해주는 건 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "1b6eea62-6891-41b2-a879-f3e10dc5907d"
msgid ""
"\"You are a threat to my barony, and I will have to fight you — no matter "
"what I think of you or how I feel about you.\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 영지에 위협이 되니 싸워야겠다. 악감정은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "0263ade8-376b-47b1-a3ce-1d575be944a8"
msgid ""
"\"Sounds like you're in trouble yourself. Stop trying to kill me and my "
"subjects, and maybe I'll find a way to help you.\""
msgstr "\"문제가 생긴 것 같군. 나와 내 백성을 죽이지 않으면 너를 도와줄 수 있을지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "b35a5c96-f853-48cb-a1b5-f615b0240d1f"
msgid "\"I don't know enough yet, but I want to. Tell me. Tell me the truth.\""
msgstr "\"아직 모르지만 알고 싶어. 나에게 진실을 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "0b004b13-3d8e-4ced-85f2-24f7892632d8"
msgid "\"All you deserve is contempt.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 축복은 사치다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "d2c94422-a032-4b50-aeb2-d3aee8b51265"
msgid "\"I have nothing more to tell you. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"너에게 할 말은 없어. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "cef07885-b8b0-485c-adef-ece3947a2fb4"
msgid ""
"\"I hold no grudge against you, despite everything you've done to me and my "
"people.\""
msgstr "\"나와 내 백성이 겪은 고통이 있지만 너에게 원한은 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "6dfecd9b-d9d1-4fb3-8d21-6b1170fb8e74"
msgid "\"The trouble in Varnhold — do you have something to do with it?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에서의 일은 너와 관련이 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b3cc29fb-f944-4003-852f-f202d9794ba0"
msgid ""
"{n}The familiar silhouette of the nymph appears before you. Her face is "
"still, but you see thunderclouds in the depth of her eyes.{/n} \"Where are "
"you rushing off to, my hound? To face your own death?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}익숙한 님프의 그림자가 당신 앞에 나타납니다. 그녀의 얼굴은 전과 다름 없지만 그녀의 눈에는 걱정이 가득합니다.{/n} \"내 개 "
"주제에 어디로 도망가려는 거지? 죽음을 찾으러 가나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "712ac5b9-5d52-4acb-8524-44519d215901"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph utters a dull chuckle. Her silhouette fades and dissipates into "
"the air before your eyes.{/n} \"Foolish creature — you want to fight a "
"dream? A brave and noble cause.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 흐릿한 웃음소리를 냅니다. 그녀의 그림자는 당신 눈 앞에서 사라집니다.{/n} \"멍청한 녀석. 환영과 싸우고 싶나? 용기는 "
"가상하구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "9e4bd788-7192-45a2-a4cf-196a8a1abd3b"
msgid ""
"\"Why am I here?\" {n}The nymph repeats your question as if it had just "
"crossed her mind.{/n} \"{d|c21 Ambush}Kill you{/d}? Not today. Believe it or "
"not, but I came without evil intentions. I've been watching you, my hound. "
"You've escaped my trap, you've destroyed my beautiful Everblooming Flower. "
"Such a strong will to live — in such a fragile mortal creature... Once, long "
"ago, it hurt me to see flowers being torn apart by the wind. But today I "
"watch you thrashing like a {mf|moth|butterfly} caught in a spider web, and I "
"cannot turn my eyes away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 왜 여기에 있지?\" {n}님프는 자신에게 캐묻듯 계속해서 질문합니다.{/n} \"{d|c21 Ambush}너를 죽여{/d}? "
"오늘은 아니야. 믿거나 말거나 나는 싸우러 온 게 아니야. 나의 충실한 개인 너를 지켜보고 있었지. 내 덫을 잘도 빠져나가서 내 아름다운 "
"영원히 피는 꽃을 망쳤더구나. 약한 인간 주제에 살고자 하는 욕구가 그렇게 강하다니... 예전에 내 작품이 바람에 망가져서 가슴이 아팠는데 오늘 "
"너는 거미줄에 달려드는 나비와 같구나. 내 시선을 사로잡는걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "29aca116-a237-40c9-8c59-6d912d291030"
msgid ""
"\"I am the web itself. The moment that you took your first step on the roads "
"of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, you fell under my power.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 존재가 거미줄이다. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 발을 들인 순간 너는 내 손바닥 안에 있는 것과 다름 없어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "33607d83-de82-4c19-8719-d89d71f63783"
msgid ""
"\"Names can become weapons in capable hands. You've no need to know my name. "
"No need!\""
msgstr "\"이름을 알게 되면 불필요한 일이 생기지. 개 주제에 내 이름을 알 필요는 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "cf72f2ae-59bf-41f5-86ce-c43122bb0251"
msgid ""
"{n}Anger flashes in the nymph's eyes, but it's an odd anger with a hint of "
"bafflement.{/n} \"Why shouldn't the mistress visit her pet? Farewell, my "
"hound. You have no idea what powers you've awakened, and now you voluntarily "
"rush into their jaws. If you run your blade down their throats, I won't be "
"disappointed. If you perish — I'll have forgotten you by dawn!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 눈에는 분노가 반짝였지만 무언가 이상합니다.{/n} \"여왕이 애완 동물을 보자는데 뭐가 잘못됐지? 잘 있거라. 네가 깨운 "
"힘은 상상을 초월하고 너는 불나방처럼 달려드는 거야. 그들의 목에 칼을 들이대기라도 한다면 실망하지는 않으마. 네가 죽는다면 등을 돌아선 "
"순간 잊어버릴 거니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "c5a8add1-8878-4bed-acb7-c4093e252642"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's voice rings with feverish curiosity.{/n} \"How? ... Though "
"there's no point in asking. My untamed homeworld has many miracles to offer. "
"One can never know what it will reveal, or to whom. So, what do you think of "
"the proud, bitter, fallen nymph now, my hound?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조금 흥분한 님프의 목소리는 호기심이 깃들었습니다.{/n} \"어떻게? ... 물어봤자 소용 없겠지. 거친 나의 고향은 신비가 "
"가득하지. 어떤 일이 누구에게 벌어질지 아무도 모른단다. 이 우아하고 타락한 님프인 이몸을 어떻게 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "4cf5a8f2-2705-4d07-b0f3-0594c50656d4"
msgid ""
"\"There was a time when I used to ask myself the same question. What had I "
"and my Thousandbreaths ever done to them?... Why had I to endure this....\" "
"{n}The nymph interrupts herself.{/n} \"You're wrong to think that your "
"problems began with you. The Everblooming Flower was created long before "
"your barony was founded. I prepared my weapon long in advance, having no "
"idea what I would turn it against. Everything has a price. Thousands of "
"lives must be turned to dust for a single act of forgiveness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나에게도 같은 질문을 한 적이 있지. 나와 천 개의 숨결이 저지른 짓이 무엇일까?... 왜 내가 이런 고통을 받아야 하는걸까...\" "
"{n}님프는 말을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"네가 잘못이라고 생각한 것부터가 잘못되었지. 영원히 피는 꽃은 네 남작령이 세워지기 오래 "
"전에도 있었다. 어떤 일이 일어날지 생각하지도 않고 나는 그 무기를 오래 전에 준비했지. 모든 것은 댓가가 있는 법이야. 수천의 생명은 "
"용서한다는 단 한마디 때문에 먼지로 사라져야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "6d8b1e8a-4500-4165-9dca-5dede3530bfd"
msgid ""
"\"You want to aid the storm that strikes you and your lands? Help? Why?! "
"Though I do not want to know!\" {n}The nymph says the last phrase in "
"haste.{/n} \"You will 'help' me either way — voluntarily or involuntarily — "
"with your death...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 공격한 자를 돕겠다고? 어째서?! 하지만 나는 알고 싶지 않아!\" {n}님프는 마지막 말을 급히 말합니다.{/n} \"자의든 "
"타의든 너는 나를 도울 것이야. 너의 죽음으로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "20e023a0-7225-4924-9047-591ec0793785"
msgid ""
"\"I never expected anything else from you.\" {n}The nymph raises her eyes to "
"the sky as if forgetting you ever existed.{/n} \"Such a beautiful... land, "
"such cruel times. The sand slips through my fingers, and with it, your time "
"slips away, my hound. Soon you will fall... just as I fell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너에게서 어떤 것도 바라지 않았다.\" {n}님프는 당신은 안중에도 없는 듯 고개를 들어 하늘을 봅니다.{/n} \"정말 "
"아름다워... 그러나 힘든 시기를 겪었지. 모래가 내 손가락 사이로 흐르고 너의 시간도 이렇게 흐를 것이다. 곧 너는 어둠을 보게 될 "
"것이야... 내가 그랬듯이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "50dce578-6330-45cd-b888-fd8ea788f392"
msgid ""
"\"Looks like I was wrong. You're not a {mf|moth|butterfly} caught in a "
"spider web, but one of those who fly straight into the fire "
"{mf|himself|herself}.\" {n}The nymph's eyes flash, then her face becomes "
"somber.{/n} \"Why are you so sure I would want to talk to you, to tell you "
"'the truth'? Do not deceive yourself, my interest in you is mere curiosity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 잘못된 것 같구나. 너는 거미줄에 걸린 나비가 아니라 불에 뛰어드는 불나방이었어.\" {n}님프의 눈은 번쩍이고는 표정이 "
"부드러워집니다.{/n} \"내가 너와 대화를 한다고 확신하는 이유는 무엇이며 나는 왜 너에게 진실을 말해줘야 하는 것이지? 그저 "
"궁금하구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "08af73aa-1db9-4ed5-8e2a-b8dc339bc7ea"
msgid "{n}The nymph throws her head back and bursts into laughter.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}님프는 고개를 젖히더니 깔깔 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "33975ea6-92c6-4183-af21-c77e077b8360"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph stares at you in contemplation, as if wishing to say something "
"else. But then she just shakes her head — and disappears without a sound. "
"Only the smell of herbs and distant storms proves that she'd been standing "
"there just a moment ago.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 무언가 말하고 싶은 듯 만족스럽게 당신을 봅니다. 하지만 그녀는 고개를 절래절래 흔들고는 소리 없이 사라집니다. 멀리서 치는 "
"번개와 허브향만이 그녀가 있었다는 것을 알려줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "c6a57f76-7628-42cb-abf2-60e6a7c50922"
msgid ""
"\"How can a ruler so easily shake off the trouble that strikes {mf|his|her} "
"realm?\" {n}The nymph speaks with contempt.{/n} \"I see everything. Soon, "
"you will turn to dust, together with your whole "
"{mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지배자가 어떻게 그 전염병을 쉽게 물리칠 수가 있지?\" {n}님프는 경멸하는 말투로 말합니다.{/n} \"나는 모든 것을 보았다. "
"곧 너는 너의 남작령과 함께 먼지가 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/NyrissaSaysHiSE/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "f700a3a8-701d-42f1-952a-a8aa4e8ea206"
msgid ""
"\"I can answer, but will you believe me? I have nothing to do with it, but I "
"know who is responsible. I won't tell you, though. Run now towards your "
"death, hound. Run, hound, run! I want to see you stumble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대답할 수 있겠지만 나를 믿겠느냐? 나는 상관이 없지만 범인은 알고 있지. 그래도 너에게 말해주지는 않을 거다. 충실한 개가 되어 "
"죽음을 향해 달려가거라. 네 곤경을 보고 즐기고 싶구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "3f1e757b-bc0a-4dd6-91db-495c82f8d605"
msgid "\"Tristian? What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안? 여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "f4e0af54-1ba4-4e8f-a22b-9cc22825a980"
msgid "\"What's the matter?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8cd46468-bf5e-4654-b473-d391d2531856"
msgid "\"I'm busy.\""
msgstr "\"나는 바빠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "d2388dbf-452f-40b2-9a96-488b06c92fad"
msgid "\"I've never seen you so upset. What happened?\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 화난 모습을 본 적이 없어. 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "5852e16f-c8e3-4fda-8877-0217cc3711b9"
msgid ""
"[Push Tristian's hand off your shoulder] \"I don't know what's gotten into "
"you, but don't contradict me!\""
msgstr "[당신의 어깨에 올려진 그의 손을 뿌리칩니다] \"무슨 의도인지는 모르지만 나를 속일 생각 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "53eaaa26-c1f0-4f7e-8e04-2e5fc6292579"
msgid "\"Fine, Tristian, I will take you with me.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 트리스티안. 너와 함께 가겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "6e731ace-1506-4b34-8d07-2706478e7d93"
msgid ""
"\"We travel together, and I shall follow you to the Valley of the Dead.\""
msgstr "\"함께 여행하자, 너를 죽은 자의 계곡으로 안내하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "1ef8e47f-2a65-4e47-9398-6a099d65cd19"
msgid "\"No, Tristian. Return to the capital.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 수도로 가는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "1eceee81-f350-431a-bac4-426096f8c187"
msgid "\"I'm not sure I can take you with me. Let's see how things go.\""
msgstr "\"너와 함께 갈 수 있을지 모르겠어. 어떻게 될지 두고 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Barks/Angel_bark_String
msgctxt "e9e1b34f-a8c3-4564-b5c2-eb4e084564de"
msgid "\"As you wish. But trust me, you're making a huge mistake.\""
msgstr "\"네가 바라는 대로. 하지만 너는 큰 실수를 저지르는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0ddd180c-857e-41a0-b2cf-8bebfeb70c9d"
msgid "\"{name}, wait! We need to talk.\""
msgstr "\"{name}! 기다려! 대화 좀 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c2ae1c23-7865-4cb1-8bfe-06b72a31d17a"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, {mf|baron|baroness}. I hope that when I explain, you'll accept "
"my apology — I couldn't let you go alone.\""
msgstr "\"나를 용서해. 내가 설명하면 네가 이해해줄 거라고 믿었어. 너를 혼자 가게 두어서는 안됐는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a04383d0-1155-44e1-989a-77ca8ae1ab75"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Valley of the Dead}Valley of the Dead{/g} the raven spoke of — I "
"know it. An ancient evil is buried there, from empires since turned to dust. "
"Being cautious is not enough — if you go there, you must tread quietly, or "
"you shall awaken dark things indeed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Valley of the Dead}죽은 자의 계곡{/g}이라고 까마귀가 말하더군. 제국이 망한 후 고대의 악이 거기에 묻혔다고 "
"해. 조심하는 걸로도 모자라. 네가 거기에 가서 조용히 하지 않는다면 악을 깨우게 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "898717cf-cc2d-4286-afac-8e3f87969bae"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian grabs your shoulder.{/n} \"Please, Your Grace! Just a moment of "
"your time!\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 당신의 어깨를 잡습니다.{/n} \"제발! 조금만 기다려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/Angel_dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "76e2233b-396d-48c5-b7f9-5b0076ee3f2a"
msgid ""
"\"A tomb lies in the heart of the valley. That is where the evil sleeps. I "
"know I cannot sway you from going… but if you must go, please let me help "
"you! My faith may help when spells and steel may not.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무덤이 계곡의 심장부에 있다. 거기에 악이 잠들어있어. 네가 가는 걸 막지는 못해도... 너를 돕게 해줘! 철과 마법이 소용 없을 때 "
"나의 믿음이 도움이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "89375145-ec74-497f-91a6-198d52e17c5c"
msgid "Called Maegar Varn the only lawful owner of Varnhold."
msgstr "메이가르 반이 반홀드의 유일하게 정당한 지도자라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "d7e4f18b-8d79-4dfc-9ab7-ea8cc01d76ed"
msgid ""
"\"Maegar Varn was the ruler of these lands! Your master stole something that "
"didn't belong to him!\""
msgstr "\"메이가르 반이 이 땅의 진정한 지도자다! 하지만 너희 지도자가 그의 것을 빼았았지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "437ecda5-73f1-4337-a250-397be8220b09"
msgid "\"I'm not afraid of your master. Tell me where I can find him.\""
msgstr "\"네 주인은 겁나지 않아. 그가 어디있는지 알려줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "0004a1f3-a21c-4d71-92d6-575f6f01f0d9"
msgid "\"Your master is responsible for what happened in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에 일어난 일이 네 주인 때문인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "49a1b2fc-68cf-487b-9cf0-078345c23d6b"
msgid "\"I was there. I couldn't pass the gates.\""
msgstr "\"나는 거기에 있었어. 문을 지나갈 수가 없었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "ec554bb5-56b3-4fec-ad44-bcedfef88ad7"
msgid "\"What waits in the Valley of the Dead?\""
msgstr "\"죽은 자의 계곡에는 무엇이 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "13942224-8a8a-42f7-a9c5-becfc0dab2b2"
msgid "\"What do you mean by 'seen enough'?\""
msgstr "\"충분히 보았다니. 무슨 뜻이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0042_Text_String
msgctxt "e0d5e688-814f-4b92-b8a4-71608ec02fca"
msgid "\"I will come.\""
msgstr "\"내가 가지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0043_Text_String
msgctxt "c5abd1ed-421a-4bcb-a345-eaa0fa532134"
msgid ""
"\"I have other things that command my attention. Your master will wait.\""
msgstr "\"다른 일이 있어서. 네 주인은 기다려야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0044_Text_String
msgctxt "ff1ffdc5-9a69-40cf-823d-79b172a76e82"
msgid ""
"\"If this Vordakai truly wishes to meet with me, then he can come to me!\""
msgstr "\"보다카이가 나를 만나기를 원한다면 직접 오라고 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "7596389d-f981-4389-8960-35cb4b15fe42"
msgid "\"But what happened to Varnhold? Where did everyone go?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 반홀드에 무슨 일이 일어난 거지? 모두 어디에 갔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "f6369861-ae80-40c8-916f-3629600b41af"
msgid "\"The chosen of who again?\""
msgstr "\"누구라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "843bf786-04a2-433d-b9ba-8c02c254ef8c"
msgid ""
"{n}The familiar black bird flaps his wings and caws at you.{/n} \"I've got a "
"message forrr you, {race}.\""
msgstr "{n}친근한 그 검은 새가 날개를 퍼덕이며 웁니다.{/n} \"전할 말이 있어서 왔다. {race}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "c3865662-21d9-4338-a689-e72791956fa4"
msgid ""
"\"It's time to pull off the masks and answerrr for yourrr deeds, {race}. My "
"master has seen enough, so he summons you — come, kneel, beforrre this "
"land's trrue rrruler. Embrrrace sufferrrring, embrrrace pain, ssssurrender "
"your spirrrit to Vordakai, the Chosen of the Fourrr Horrsemen and the Keeper "
"of the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 가면을 벗고 네 행동에 대한 설명을 할 차례다. {race}. 나의 주인님이 너를 소환하고자 한다. 와서 진정한 이 땅의 "
"주인에게 무릎을 꿇어라. 고통을 끌어안아라. {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈의 수호자이자 네 기수의 선택된 자인 보다카이에게 "
"굴복해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "010dd6be-865d-41f1-9826-d8e6cb0916eb"
msgid ""
"\"{d|Varn}Maegarrr Varrn{/d} and his minions werrre impostorrrs without "
"rrrrights and honorrr. Soon the Empirrre of Vorrdakai will rrrise from its "
"thousand yearrr sleep and rrreclaim its landsss. Ones such as you will "
"ssserve this futurrre, in life orrrr in death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{d|Varn}메이가르 반{/d}과 그의 수하는 명예 없는 사기꾼이다. 곧 보다카이의 제국이 수천년의 잠에서 깨어나 원래의 땅을 "
"되찾을 것이다. 죽고 싶지 않다면 너 같은 하찮은 존재는 섬겨야 할 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "7830e688-ce18-489e-a51f-3399b792db10"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, and it was well-deserrrved punishment. One who dwelled in that town "
"stole what was not his to possess. He trespassed in the masterrr's "
"sanctuarrry, defiled it, and brrrought what he stole to the place you call "
"'Varrrnhold'. By doing so he incurred the wrrrath of my masterr.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 그건 합당한 처벌이었지. 그 마을에 산 자들이 그의 것을 훔쳤다. 그는 주인님의 성지를 침범하고 더럽혀서 반홀드라는 이름을 "
"붙였다. 그렇게 나의 주인의 분노를 사게 되었고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "546019bf-199e-427f-b872-6caec1862574"
msgid ""
"\"Go to the {g|Valley of the Dead}Valley of the Dead{/g}. Pass the gates and "
"face the challenges that await. If you surrrvive, my masterr will meet you "
"in his sanctuarrry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Valley of the Dead}죽은 자의 계곡{/g}으로 가라. 문을 지나서 시련을 맞서라. 네가 살아남는다면 우리 주인이 "
"성지에서 너를 만날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "45fb7857-9148-4973-be06-fe5d239a5583"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven bursts into loud cawing that sounds like laughter.{/n} \"Forrr "
"my master had not given you leave, {race}. Heed this, and he will perrrmit "
"you to enterrr.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 까악까악하고 우는데 마치 비웃음 같습니다.{/n} \"우리 주인님이 너를 보내주지 않았다. {race}. 오면 너는 들어갈 "
"수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "7d9f1acd-5cc5-4a09-a485-a74da25f21f8"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven tilts his head and looks at you with his glinting black eye.{/n}"
" \"The gates barrr the entrrrance to the {g|Valley of the Dead}Valley of the "
"Dead{/g}. Only the one who has the key or sacrrred knowledge, can pass!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 머리를 갸웃거리고 검은 눈을 빛내며 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"문들이 {g|Valley of the Dead}죽은 자의 "
"계곡{/g}으로 향하는 입구를 막고 있다. 오직 신성한 지식을 가진 자만이 지나갈 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "111cbeb9-78b5-4ea6-bfa1-91281450e3a2"
msgid ""
"\"I'm the eyes and the ears of my masterrr! Everything I see or hearrr, he "
"sees and hearrrs as well. All we speak of, all yourrr deeds — nothing "
"escapes my masterrr!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 주인님의 눈과 귀다! 내가 듣고 보는 것은 그분도 알게 되지. 우리가 나눈 대화와 너의 행동 모두! 주인님에게서 벗어날 수 없다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "f75f4a12-50d6-44be-bd8a-3c09f70ce1c4"
msgid ""
"\"Once my masterrr barred the Valley frrrom the outerr worrrld and the "
"lesser rrraces — such as yours. Thus, my masterrr could focus upon his "
"reesearch and rrrule the Empirrre, without the pathetic rrrebellions and "
"petty warrrs of your kind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주인님이 바깥 세계와 너희와 같은 열등한 종족으로부터 계곡을 막았었다. 그래서 그는 너희와 같은 자들의 시비와 한심한 반란 없이 "
"자신의 연구에 집중하고 제국을 지배할 수 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "787bbec5-1319-464a-9ed7-fd11ce8afc8b"
msgid ""
"\"You have a choice — find three incense burrrners, hidden in the tombs of "
"trrraitorrs, who imprrrisoned my masterr in his sanctuarrrry, or conjure "
"darrrkness, which is able to open the way to the {g|Valley of the Dead}"
"Valley of the Dead{/g}. This way, or anotherrr, you will be able to pass the "
"gates — and my masterr will seal yourrr fate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"선택해라. 향로 세개를 우리 주인을 가둔 반역자의 무덤에서 찾아내거나 {g|Valley of the Dead}죽은 자의 계곡{/g}"
"으로 향하는 어둠에 들어가거나. 어떻게 하든 너는 문을 통과하고 너의 운명은 봉인될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0045_Text_String
msgctxt "9a43c0a1-ec91-4145-9469-922c8c92450d"
msgid ""
"\"I had no doubts about that, {race}. I'll meet you in the sanctuarrry.\""
msgstr "\"의심의 여지가 없군. {race}. 성소에서 너를 기다리겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0046_Text_String
msgctxt "95ea8031-45e9-49da-933b-7ce7badf715c"
msgid ""
"\"Insolence! Keep clinging to yourrr pitiful beliefs that yourrr deeds "
"matterrr. When you finally accept yourrr fate, come to the Valley. I'll come "
"forrr you therrrre.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무식하구나! 너의 결정이 중요하다는 어리석은 믿음에 그렇게 의지하거라. 네 운명을 마침내 받아들이면 계곡으로 와라. 거기서 너를 "
"기다리겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0047_Text_String
msgctxt "fc6aca78-b82b-44f7-aeee-90ef0ee40aa9"
msgid ""
"\"When my masterrr comes, therrre will be nothing left of you or your lands… "
"no trace of the lesserrr races, only servants of Vordakai. The skies shall "
"be storms, the rivers shall run red, it will be the empire of Vordakai "
"restorred, glorrrious and pure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 주인이 오면 너에게 남은 것은 없을 것이다... 열등한 종족의 흔적은 없고 오직 보다카이의 종만 남으리라. 하늘은 번개로 가득하고 "
"강은 붉어지면 보다카이의 제국이 다시 세워진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "6dd3fa2b-aef6-4cad-8679-7f9aab916e31"
msgid ""
"\"My masterrr knowledge and powerrrr are grreat… the Oculus of "
"{g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} has grrranted him even greaterrr power! It was the "
"Oculus that brought about his rrrevenge over the impious ones.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 주인님의 지식과 힘은 상상을 초월하지... {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈으로 그의 힘은 더욱 강력해졌다! 눈을 가짐으로서 "
"그는 불경한 자들에게 심판을 내릴 수 있게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RavenVisit/RavenDialog/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "7313681a-7bfe-4439-94ab-735948cd3d28"
msgid ""
"\"The Four Horrrsemen of Apocalypse. The rrulerrrs of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}"
", arrrch-daemons, harbingerrrs of death and destrrruction. The grrreatest, "
"the Horrrseman of Death, {g|Charon}Charon{/g}, deemed Vordakai worthy, and "
"grranted him a gift — the Oculus of Abaddon.\""
msgstr ""
"\"종말의 네 기수다. {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 지도자이자 아크다이몬이자 파괴와 죽음을 가져다주는 자이지. 위대한 죽음의 기수 "
"{g|Charon}케런{/g}은 보다카이의 능력을 인정하고 나락의 눈을 내려주었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "144b8168-f350-476f-ab52-09fdec761d90"
msgid "...climb the tower."
msgstr "...탑을 오릅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5ab072cd-8018-4e97-89bc-da40a7213bf0"
msgid "...stay there for the night."
msgstr "...거기서 밤을 보냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "eb082896-f17e-4c76-a0d4-5f693e7415e6"
msgid "...turn away and leave."
msgstr "...등을 돌리고 떠납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "90f9a5cd-fcc3-433b-8aff-bcc3a381268c"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "aa9aefeb-f623-4ee5-a05f-dcc54887d3b5"
msgid "...try climbing to the top once more."
msgstr "...꼭대기에 다시 한번 올라가려 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "59149850-2f59-4050-b267-416cc13f76be"
msgid "...climb down."
msgstr "...아래로 내려갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "6823330f-2c41-4ffd-94e4-d6163117065c"
msgid "...climb down."
msgstr "...아래로 내려갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "961305db-7282-4a96-8610-eae83942087a"
msgid "...climb further."
msgstr "...탑을 더 오릅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "7b7ed960-b95e-4c77-a6e1-eb5c389d4e17"
msgid "...try to read the inscription."
msgstr "...비문을 읽으려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "b2998844-78d1-48c4-8f0d-f0ee15ad3808"
msgid "As {mf||s}he fell, {mf||s}he tried to grab onto something."
msgstr "당신은 떨어졌지만 무언가를 잡으려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "f24a65c8-8554-4192-9fa7-f4f679a8f75f"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속하기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "db2d39a5-45a8-46b4-909a-fa10a3c55ae7"
msgid ""
"The ruins of the tower loomed over the surrounding plains, like a tombstone "
"so old that time had worn away the epitaph, as well the language it had been "
"written in. Each crumbling step of the giant stairway was as tall as a grown "
"man's chest, and the huge portal where the door once stood was wide enough "
"for our entire party to walk abreast through. We decided to..."
msgstr ""
"탑의 폐허가 평야의 한 가운데에서 마치 글씨가 닳아버린 묘비처럼 서있엇습니다. 거인이 쓰던 계단 한칸의 높이는 성인 남성의 가슴팍 높이 "
"만했고 문이 있던 자리는 카니발 행렬도 들어갈 만큼 넓었습니다. 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "56bda0b8-8a61-42fd-a1a6-159b53d95964"
msgid "We walked away, leaving the stone colossus to its eternal slumber."
msgstr "그 거대한 돌의 거상을 잠든 채로 내버려두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "7d798e7c-e6e3-46ed-8c79-661b38b1d248"
msgid ""
"We apparently weren't the first to take shelter in these ancient ruins — we "
"found a fire bed containing fresh coals in the rubble. The night passed "
"quietly, disturbed by neither spirits of the past nor monsters of the "
"present."
msgstr ""
"우리가 고대의 폐허에 들어간 첫번째 사람들은 아니었습니다. 우리는 잔해에 쓰지 않은 석탄이 그대로 놓인 화로를 발견했습니다. 과거의 "
"영혼이나 현재의 괴물이 방해할 것도 없이 밤은 빠르게 지나갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "aa989adf-cc47-4708-ade2-db70fbab8b1f"
msgid ""
"It was hard to imagine how tall the building must have been before crumbling "
"under its own weight. It's possible that even the owners would have towered "
"above us, had they still been around. Even so, by using the cracks and pits "
"in the stone wall, an experienced climber would likely be able to scale the "
"tower."
msgstr ""
"무게를 버티지 못하고 부서지기 전 그 건물의 높이가 얼마나 높을지는 상상하기 어려웠습니다. 그들이 우리 주변에 있었다면 건물의 주인은 "
"우리보다 훨씬 컸을 것입니다. 벽에 생긴 균열을 손잡이 삼는다면 경험 많은 등산가라면 탑을 오를 수도 있을 것 같았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "887cbe2a-cac5-4fcd-ad4d-f0bfd28733d8"
msgid ""
"{name} spat on {mf|his|her} hands and swiftly climbed up to one of the high "
"ledges — what remained of the second floor."
msgstr "{name}은(는) 손바닥에 침을 뱉더니 재빠르게 2층으로 보이는 곳으로 오르기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "c2e78e39-9c84-4ac2-9ef1-0b5e22590eb3"
msgid ""
"Alas, {name} wasn't in top form that day. It was fortunate that {mf||s}he "
"hadn't climbed too far before {mf|his|her} foot slipped on some wet moss. "
"{mf|He|She} fell to the rocks beneath, but it hurt {mf|his|her} pride more "
"than {mf|his|her} body. Once we made sure {mf||s}he was all right, we "
"decided to..."
msgstr ""
"아아, 그 날 {name}의 컨디션은 별로 좋지 않았습니다. 젖은 이끼에 발이 미끄러지기 전에 높이 올라가지 않은 것이 다행이었습니다. "
"{mf|그|그녀}는 바위 밑으로 떨어졌지만, 상처가 아프기보다는 자존심이 더 상했습니다. 그{mf||녀}가 괜찮다는 것을 깨달은 "
"우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0020_Text_String
msgctxt "bbbefaef-d074-4f36-96b6-f8c4cc254c4c"
msgid ""
"The way down proved much less difficult. {name} rejoined the party without "
"much effort. Then we decided to..."
msgstr "내려가는 길은 훨씬 쉬웠습니다. {name}은(는) 큰 어려움 없이 무리에 다시 합류했습니다. 그리고 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "16d9a9f7-13ad-45e9-a0e1-a10b88cb2f8d"
msgid ""
"Climbing higher was no easy task. {name}'s fingers slipped on wet moss, and "
"the rocks crumbled beneath {mf|his|her} feet.\n"
"Perched atop a shelf on the opposite wall, a large black raven watched {name}"
"'s ascent intently."
msgstr ""
"더 높이 오르는 것은 쉬운 일이 아니었습니다. {name}의 손가락은 젖은 이끼를 잡아 미끄러졌고 {mf|그|그녀}가 딛은 바위가 "
"부서졌습니다.\n"
"반대편 벽의 선반 꼭대기에 커다랗고 검은 까마귀가 당신을 주시하고 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "dc0b994d-6fa4-4ba5-8a90-4d46fd9d4167"
msgid "A fire flickered in a distance: someone had set up camp there."
msgstr "먼 곳에서 불꽃이 반짝였습니다. 누군가 저기에 캠프를 지었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "a0c6536e-eceb-4f73-acb8-f949727fbb16"
msgid ""
"At the worst possible moment, the rock {name} had been holding came free "
"from the wall, sending {mf|him|her} plummeting."
msgstr "가장 안좋은 순간에, {name}이(가) 잡고 있던 바위가 벽에서 떨어졌고, {mf|그|그녀}는 추락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "7acc2a5c-dbb8-407a-91c3-af2cf972c8c9"
msgid ""
"Fortunately, {name} was able to nimbly twist {mf|him|her}self in midair and "
"caught onto the ledge {mf||s}he'd passed on the way up. After catching "
"{mf|his|her} breath, {mf||s}he decided to..."
msgstr "다행히 {name}은(는) 재빠르게 몸을 비틀어 아까 잡았던 바위를 잡을 수 있었습니다. 숨을 고른 뒤, 그{mf||녀}는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "db3f8224-c3e6-43c4-93e8-c7e222fb4b7b"
msgid ""
"{name} tried to grab the ledge {mf||s}he'd passed on {mf|his|her} way up, "
"but {mf|his|her} fingers grasped only air, and {mf||s}he fell to the stone "
"floor. The fall wrenched {mf|his|her} body painfully, but it was fortunately "
"not fatal. After helping {mf|him|her} back up, we decided to..."
msgstr ""
"{name}은(는) 아까 잡았던 바위를 다시 잡으려고 했지만, 잡히는 것은 허공뿐이었고 그{mf||녀}는 바닥으로 추락했습니다. "
"{mf|그|그녀}는 낙상의 고통으로 몸을 비틀었지만, 다행스럽게도 치명상은 아니었습니다. {mf|그|그녀}가 일어나는 것을 돕고, "
"우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "0d01e9f6-405f-48bf-a765-b97d43ce7cd4"
msgid ""
"After removing the moss from some symbols engraved into the stone, {name} "
"studied them carefully."
msgstr "{name}은(는) 돌을 덮은 이끼를 제거하고 새겨진 조각을 자세히 조사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "eee8fe75-3d76-44c7-8f90-479662110d47"
msgid ""
"{name} eventually managed to determine that the large symbols must have been "
"written in an ancient cyclopean language. Time had ravaged the symbols, "
"leaving them largely illegible, but {mf||s}he was able to make out a single "
"word — \"VORDAKAI.\" After committing the word to memory, {name} decided "
"to..."
msgstr ""
"{name}은(는) 마침내 거대한 문양이 고대 사이클롭스의 언어로 적혔다는 결론을 내렸습니다. 시간에 의해 상징은 읽을 수 없을 정도로 "
"닳았지만, 보다카이라는 글자는 읽을 수 있었습니다. 그 단어를 기억한 후 {name}은(는)..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "270dd2a0-b449-4545-8d31-9874fa9eed36"
msgid ""
"Time had ravaged the symbols — {name} couldn't even tell the inscriptions "
"from the fine netting of cracks covering the wall. With no hope of gleaning "
"anything useful, {mf||s}he decided to..."
msgstr ""
"시간에 의해 문양이 닳았기에, {name}은(는) 어느 것이 새겨진 비문이고 어느 것이 갈라진 균열인지 구분할 수 없었습니다. 어떤 "
"희망도 없다는 것을 깨달은 그{mf||녀}는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "f9660e12-d4d5-4132-afb6-676f48783be6"
msgid ""
"There, the walls had deteriorated even further. They were covered with "
"engravings — barely visible symbols of some ancient language. After catching "
"{mf|his|her} breath, {mf||s}he decided to..."
msgstr "그곳의 벽은 훼손이 더 심했습니다. 벽은 고대의 언어가 희미하게 새겨졌습니다. 숨을 가다듬고 당신은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "781b7629-d442-42c5-aadd-9ed8ee177b3e"
msgid ""
"The crumbling wall was covered with barely discernible symbols in the "
"ancient cyclopean language, among them the mysterious word \"VORDAKAI.\" "
"After catching {mf|his|her} breath, {mf||s}he decided to..."
msgstr "부서진 벽은 고대 사이클롭스의 언어가 희미하게 적혀있었고 보다카이라는 의문의 단어가 적혀있었습니다. 숨을 가다듬고 당신은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "a6f40a07-db38-4fbd-9f42-852fcfc96da9"
msgid ""
"Clinging to the signs that were carved into the wall, {name} slowly began "
"moving upwards. At last, {mf|he|she} reached the top: an uneven stub was all "
"that was left of the spire that once must have reached to the lower clouds.\n"
"Alas, there was no treasure to be found there, unless you are willing to "
"count the magnificent view of the surrounding area."
msgstr ""
"벽에 새겨진 기호을 읽느라 시간을 보낸 {name}은(는) 다시 위로 올라가기 시작했습니다. 마침내, 당신은 정상에 다다랐습니다: 한 때 "
"구름까지 닿았을 첨탑에 남은 것은 울퉁불퉁한 잔해 뿐입니다.\n"
"아아, 당신은 주변의 웅장한 경관을 즐길 생각이 아니었는데, 꼭대기에서는 어떤 보물도 찾을 수 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/RuinedTowerClimb/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "d6afc368-efc6-4e79-b036-f555c333bfb9"
msgid ""
"Finding out {mf|he|she} had seen enough, {name} carefully descended. After "
"that we decided to..."
msgstr "충분히 둘러봤다는 것을 확인한 {name}은(는) 조심스레 내려왔습니다. 그 뒤 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Barks/Bandit_alert_String
msgctxt "c851d32e-dae9-4c28-ad55-c71f6d79074c"
msgid "\"Hey, wake up! Enemies!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 적이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Barks/BarkLoreObject_gear_String
msgctxt "e5e7e68a-e5e7-49cc-8617-95cc6a416e9a"
msgid "Hooks, rope, hammers — everything one would need to scale a mountain."
msgstr "갈고리, 로프, 망치 등 등산에 필요한 도구들입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Barks/BarkLoreObject_nest_String
msgctxt "5e612e41-6bdc-4f51-b43b-a3cae557411d"
msgid ""
"Judging from the size of the nest, this bird could easily carry off a whole "
"horse."
msgstr "둥지의 크기로 보건데 이 새는 말 한마리도 쉽게 낚았을 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Barks/BarkLoreObject_ruins1_String
msgctxt "708d19fa-04b2-4648-88b9-ada7c88c613c"
msgid ""
"This fortress is younger than the cyclopes, but it's still old enough to be "
"impossible to discover who built it and why."
msgstr "이 요새는 사이클롭스의 것보다는 나중에 지어졌지만 누가 왜 지었는지 알아내기에는 오래된 건물이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Barks/BarkLoreObject_ruins2_String
msgctxt "c8118c13-afe8-428b-afff-b3b22e368139"
msgid "Insects swarm deep in the cracks."
msgstr "균열 깊은 곳에 벌레 떼가 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Barks/Leaver_bark_String
msgctxt "20236656-3077-46ac-adc4-ea333f431087"
msgid "You hear the sound of metal scraping nearby."
msgstr "당신은 주위에서 쇠가 긁히는 소리를 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Barks/PuzzleBark_f_String
msgctxt "b165503a-bc97-477c-9420-2dc3874cf371"
msgid "Thud!"
msgstr "툭!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Barks/PuzzleBark_s_String
msgctxt "92b0ec0e-2fee-4f8b-8b3a-d0604c4b1bdd"
msgid "Click!"
msgstr "딸깍!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "ebdf3887-ad84-47b7-a9a9-dbe0c55aa306"
msgid "[Hide and eavesdrop on the conversation]"
msgstr "[숨어서 대화를 엿듣습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "aec4125a-f551-4a07-8673-3ef4ebf5a2d6"
msgid "[Attack] \"Just what I was looking for!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"지금까지 싸움을 기다렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a9f7164e-a634-449c-a244-b060dc6da038"
msgid "[Continue eavesdropping]"
msgstr "[계속해서 엿듣습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "28d351dd-4e4b-46de-946a-908045968d8b"
msgid "[Continue eavesdropping]"
msgstr "[계속해서 엿듣습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "113870c4-2f03-4f31-84e0-ef05194c9fb8"
msgid "[Push the bandit off the cliff]"
msgstr "[절벽에서 도적을 밀어버립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : BanditFighterMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "e88fbefa-e8b6-4d66-a81c-92c66ca1552b"
msgid ""
"{n}Heavily armed men are seated around the fire. They chat casually and pass "
"around a flask, obviously not expecting ambush or eavesdropping in a place "
"like this.{/n} \"Damned {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} and {mf|his|her} "
"damned guards! Since that ass downed the Stag Lord, honest people got "
"nowhere to go to get themselves some coin! Just look where we ended up — "
"middle of nowhere!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}중무장한 사람들이 화로 주위에 앉아있습니다. 그들은 술병을 주고받으며 대화를 나누고 있었고 이런 장소에서 누군가 엿듣는다는 예상은 "
"못하는 것 같았습니다.{/n} \"망할 {mf|남작과|남작과|왕과|여왕과} {mf|그의|그녀의} 부하놈들! {mf|그|그녀}가 수사슴 "
"군주를 죽인 후로는 정직한 사람들이 돈을 벌 수 있는 곳이 사라졌어! 우리가 어떤 꼴인지 보라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : BanditRogueMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "3da9729e-fb97-4adb-b7ee-89de08d67bf3"
msgid ""
"\"Damn right... More traders on the roads, and what good of it? Try and "
"pluck them even a bit, and you're locked up in no time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"젠장, 맞아... 길에 상인들이 더 많아졌다한들 그게 무슨 소용이야? 저 녀석들을 도둑질 해 봐야, 우리는 즉시 갇히는 꼴이된다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAlchemistLevel9_TalonPeak
msgctxt "c9081160-4552-4ee3-be01-3bfaecbdf103"
msgid ""
"\"Enough, cut the whining! We gotta adapt if we wanna survive! This birdy'll "
"bring us more gold than any trader, and then we can sell ourselves as "
"mercenaries, or go treasure hunting... We'll get by!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만 질질 짜! 살아남으려면 적응해야해! 이곳의 새는 어떤 상인보다도 더 많은 금을 벌게해줄꺼라구. 그러면 우리는 앞으로 용병 생활을 "
"하거나 보물 사냥이라도 하면 되니까! 우리는 잘해낼꺼야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : BanditFighterMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "8480a9f1-112e-4df5-ab99-11bf2b8dfb64"
msgid ""
"\"With you in charge, we'll end up with our necks broken! Care to explain "
"what demon possessed you to make us climb up a cliff when there's a neat, "
"safe path on the other side? Why we gotta bother with all these hooks and "
"ropes?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너때문에 우리 모가지가 부러질 판이야! 저 쪽에 안전한 길이 있는데 절벽에 오르려고 하다니 데몬에게 홀렸나? 갈고리와 로프가지고 이 "
"무슨 고생을 하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAlchemistLevel9_TalonPeak
msgctxt "3350ee51-a8c7-4b3e-8d87-ca4680eb8c50"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not afraid of nothing! It's just... these damned spiders! Rather fight "
"a troll than mess with those ugly beasts!\""
msgstr "\"나는 아무것도 두렵지 않아! 망할 거미만 없다면. 이 못생긴 놈들과 싸울 바에 트롤과 싸우겠다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAlchemistLevel9_TalonPeak
msgctxt "8d5607cc-30fa-4d86-9969-e33d7d2c87d4"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, ha ha. I'm just exploding with laughter. Maybe you should become a "
"bard, huh? Better yet, head straight to the capital, ask the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen} to hire you as court jester!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 하하. 정말 웃기는군. 음유시인이라도 되는 게 어때? 아니면 수도로 가서 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}에게 궁정 광대라도 "
"시켜달라고 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : BanditRogueMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "8bab86e5-4ddb-43ff-b8bf-4297932d8c0e"
msgid "\"Someone's here! Arm yourselves, lads!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 여기에 있다! 무기를 들어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : BanditRogueMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "0b2d9f8f-d1c1-4417-b0d7-e8e6bf9856c9"
msgid "\"The {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}? Is {mf||s}he everywhere?!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}? 그{mf||녀}는 어디에나 있나?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAlchemistLevel9_TalonPeak
msgctxt "e0c2c44b-cb5d-4db2-a6c2-6b10beded60f"
msgid ""
"\"Have you SEEN that path? Spiders everywhere! Just... swarming with "
"spiders, crawling all around! Damned fat, furry beasts... I hate spiders.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저 길 봤어? 거미가 깔렸어! 떼지어 다니고, 사방에 기어다니고, 빌어먹을 그 털 많고 뚱뚱한 괴물들...난 거미가 정말 싫어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : BanditFighterMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "e199257f-a550-44e3-94ce-d8449e1b4e7c"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! Really? You're afraid of spiders?\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 정말? 거미가 무섭다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : BanditFighterMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "86b2dd3c-0382-4d39-a3c9-a2ca73480ea5"
msgid "\"Oh, watch out! There's a spider in your hair!\""
msgstr "\"조심해! 머리에 거미 붙었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : BanditFighterMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "cdcd01f8-8403-4781-a55e-89e8c54802ea"
msgid ""
"\"Did some of the Stag Lord's folks really join the "
"{mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}'s guards? Sounds like life on easy street.\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주의 부하 몇 명이 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}의 경비가 되었다는데, 사실일까? 말이 되지 않는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : BanditRogueMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "24905720-97b1-4173-adb5-757711617e51"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah, and maybe that's good for them, but I'm not cut out for bootlicking. "
"A sharp sword and a highway — that's the life for me. I'm not gonna end up "
"someone's lapdog!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러는 편이 더 좋을지도 모르지만 나는 남의 신발 밑창을 핥지는 않을 거야. 칼 한자루와 길만 있으면 돼. 그게 나의 인생이지. 나는 "
"누군가의 사냥개로 남지 않을 거라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAlchemistLevel9_TalonPeak
msgctxt "fec152a8-aac3-4597-b59c-3c5f51eae66f"
msgid ""
"\"Abyss take you all, you damn jokers! I'm gonna take a leak.\" {n}The "
"bandit stands and heads toward you on unsteady feet. Pushing him off the "
"cliff would be easy right now.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그 따위 농담을 하다니 심연이 너희를 모두 잡아갈걸! 나는 물 좀 빼고 오지.\" {n}도적은 어정쩡한 자세를 한 당신 쪽에 섭니다. "
"그를 절벽에서 밀치는 것은 지금 뿐입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : BanditRogueMeleeLevel7_TalonPeak
msgctxt "0cb754d2-3e3e-4121-a73e-c61b36e16cda"
msgid ""
"\"Just don't go through the front door — there might be spiders inside! "
"Better take a rope and scale the back wall!\""
msgstr "\"앞문으로는 가지 말아. 안에 거미가 있을지도 몰라! 로프를 잡고 벽으로 올라가는 게 좋을걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : BanditAlchemistLevel9_TalonPeak
msgctxt "c343bfc5-9a41-4fab-ba96-b8abffb5ab1d"
msgid ""
"{n}With a horrible scream, the bandit falls. His accomplices jump up and "
"grab their weapons.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}비명을 지르며 도적은 추락합니다. 그의 동료들이 놀라서 무기를 쥡니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0badc474-5f8f-4e8d-95a4-2db92671b1f0"
msgid "{n}Ekun silently nods to you and readies his weapon.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 조용히 끄덕이고는 무기를 쥡니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c0bf3959-e99d-4357-9b6e-696c5e6e879e"
msgid "\"Boo!\" {n}Regongar jumps in front of the bandit and tackles him.{/n}"
msgstr "\"짠!\" {n}레곤가르는 도적 앞에 뛰어들고는 그에게 달려들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "dea2f9dd-3d58-4122-b673-0ac47f638d6d"
msgid "{n}Octavia giggles.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아가 깔깔거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "edec5d04-f2d3-46ec-9d8c-6b9933e498bc"
msgid "\"Octavia, quiet! We're trying to ambush them!\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아 조용히 해! 기습하려는 거잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "58c1d47e-5e56-4c97-b8d3-6905150c70d7"
msgid "\"Oh! Sorry.\""
msgstr "\"오. 미안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/CutZone_dialog/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6b21dc8d-b5ee-429b-a88a-d952a3082c1a"
msgid ""
"\"Bandits...\" {n}Valerie whispers, putting her hand on her scabbard.{/n}"
msgstr "\"도적들...\" {n}발레리는 속삭이며 검에 손을 댑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Roc_zoneDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1f6e3b03-38e0-4d85-baf6-f23730d30aed"
msgid ""
"{n}As soon as you get close to the nest, a huge shadow moves across the "
"sky.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 둥지에 가까이 다가가자 거대한 그림자가 하늘로 솟습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/Roc_zoneDialog/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "bcb39497-40b1-4a10-8967-dbd3f6afbf32"
msgid ""
"{n}With a shrill shriek, a gigantic bird swoops down on you, her flapping "
"wings making a veritable hurricane as she moves to protect her nest to her "
"last breath!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}날카로운 소리와 함께 거대한 새가 당신에게 내리꽂았고 자신의 둥지를 필사적으로 지키려 새는 날개를 퍼덕이며 거대한 허리케인을 "
"만들어냈습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/StrenghtCheck/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "1fae0d7b-fa7a-43ab-b52c-76ba6768c706"
msgid "[Try to move the rock]"
msgstr "[벽에 다가가려고 했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/StrenghtCheck/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "be27281a-8608-4a03-b06a-8ad033d4fb5d"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/StrenghtCheck/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "767748bf-1bf0-437b-8797-0d177db14e06"
msgid ""
"{n}The stonework here has crumbled, leaving a huge boulder to block your "
"way. Fortunately, there's a large girder sticking out of the nearby debris. "
"It may help in removing the obstacle.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}여기에 있는 석조물이 무너져 거대한 바위가 당신의 길을 막습니다. 다행히도 근처의 잔해에서 큰 대들보가 튀어 나와 있습니다. "
"장애물을 제거하는 데 도움이 될 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/StrenghtCheck/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "19969b7d-7ed9-4459-bac7-579cffe513dd"
msgid ""
"{n}Pushing all your weight and effort against your makeshift lever, you "
"manage to shift the boulder. It falls into the chasm, rumbling loudly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}체중을 실어 지렛대를 눌렀고 당신은 바위를 밀어낼 수 있었습니다. 바위는 거대한 소리를 내며 움직입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/TalonPeak/StrenghtCheck/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "a39d5a45-db0a-467e-b444-ccef36cded5e"
msgid ""
"{n}Pushing all your weight and effort against your makeshift lever, you "
"misjudge your own strength, and the girder snaps in two. It's unlikely "
"you'll be able to move the boulder now.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}체중을 실어 지렛대를 눌렀지만 당신은 힘을 너무 주어 대들보가 조각났습니다. 지금은 바위를 움직일 수 없을 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/Barks/Enviroment_Bones_String
msgctxt "1f772fc4-627b-4a1f-83ea-a74094ad9af7"
msgid "Yellowed, ancient bones lie scattered among the sparse grass and shale."
msgstr "황색으로 바랜 고대의 뼈가 잔디와 진흙 사이에 흩어져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/Barks/Enviroment_Gravestone_String
msgctxt "4b5bf209-514d-433e-ac14-5c6b28d54213"
msgid ""
"There are faint inscriptions on the stone surface, worn away by time and "
"weather."
msgstr "바위 표면에는 시간과 비바람에 닳은 비문이 희미하게 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/Barks/Enviroment_Tracks_Fail_String
msgctxt "52c0956e-f1e6-456b-89f2-8962970db431"
msgid ""
"The ground in front of the gate looks disturbed recently, as if a group "
"passed through here."
msgstr "문의 바닥은 최근에 어떤 무리가 지나간 듯 흔적이 나있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/Barks/Enviroment_Tracks_Success_String
msgctxt "3d16f3fe-b724-4596-a183-ef8404100ddd"
msgid ""
"There are tracks in the dirt — numerous people, on foot, passed through the "
"gate into the Valley beyond not long ago."
msgstr "진흙에 얼마 되지 않은 수 많은 사람의 발자국이 나 있었고 문을 통과해 계곡으로 이어졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/Barks/Raven_after_pass_String
msgctxt "3ea2a965-715b-4b43-a670-1f12e1bb554e"
msgid ""
"\"You have overrrcome the gate! Now go to the Valley of the Dead! Go and "
"meet your fate!\""
msgstr "\"너는 문을 통과했다! 이제 죽음의 협곡으로 가라! 가서 운명을 맞아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/Items/CyclopCenser_m_DescriptionText_String
msgctxt "ac6fd308-323f-462d-beaf-2a7ec11830fa"
msgid "A soot-covered incense burner in the shape of a one-eyed skull."
msgstr "외눈박이 해골 모습을 한 향로입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/Items/CyclopCenser_m_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "47f590f4-b544-4423-b865-5f03e2973bf6"
msgid "Cyclops Incense Burner"
msgstr "사이클롭스 향로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "4d10eb39-a4da-428b-a378-38a62251d56c"
msgid "[Study the gate]"
msgstr "[문을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "57e6e965-4e33-42a5-b79a-d9fb646cd1b2"
msgid "[Examine the gate pillars]"
msgstr "[문의 기둥을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "6b04f5b1-08b5-48be-b8b8-ed8addf511b0"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "5d642b8b-463f-4574-9b16-45d1bd3af7f8"
msgid ""
"[Light the three incense burners from the tombs and hang them on the hooks "
"on the center of the gate]"
msgstr "[무덤에서 가져온 향로를 켜서 문의 중앙에 달린 갈고리에 걸었습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "18fc4fe4-19ff-4cd0-a98b-097fd97a6cda"
msgid "[Try to translate the inscriptions on the gate]"
msgstr "[문에 적힌 비문을 해석하려고 했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "83291e79-b6d2-480f-be07-11aced5b8b1d"
msgid "[Attempt to decipher the images on the gate]"
msgstr "[문에 그려진 그림을 해독하려 했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "9a5d45db-74a4-42d5-8497-0c8b39abd02b"
msgid "[Step back from the gate]"
msgstr "[문에서 물러납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0091_Text
msgctxt "453254de-ad51-45a6-b6ad-14cd6c5b08b4"
msgid "[Examine the circular protrusion]"
msgstr "[동그랗게 튀어나온 부분을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0093_Text
msgctxt "bca1047d-877a-4d68-9cda-c3b4bed75474"
msgid "[Study the hooks set into the protrusion]"
msgstr "[갈고리를 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0096_Text
msgctxt "6766bf1c-c0e6-4805-b7fd-d2a96288ec0e"
msgid "[Examine the left pillar]"
msgstr "[왼쪽 기둥을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "cec49d96-282f-4f77-ac09-4da8bd33f658"
msgid "[Study the right pillar]"
msgstr "[오른쪽 기둥을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0098_Text
msgctxt "8cbc9224-26fd-46d3-96e9-b4846a8f017c"
msgid "[Step away from the pillars]"
msgstr "[기둥에서 물러납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0102_Text
msgctxt "25250118-0e7e-41f6-a9fa-4ba1d41694bc"
msgid "[Shout out your name]"
msgstr "[당신의 이름을 외칩니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Answer_0103_Text
msgctxt "b23a3599-0a2b-4fb7-8332-c1ac2ab53c9e"
msgid "[Throw a stone at the gate]"
msgstr "[문에 돌을 던집니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "1e9667d0-6931-4bbb-9b7a-cdcaf3dd7d97"
msgid ""
"{n}A towering gate blocks your path. The pillars flanking the gate are "
"carved from the mountain itself, and both the gate and pillar rise so high "
"they are obscured by the mists above. The gate is sealed, but you see no "
"lock… not even a handle.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}거대한 문이 길을 막았습니다. 문 주위에 산에서 가져와 깎은 기둥들이 박혀있었고 매우 높아서 꼭대기는 안개로 가려졌습니다. 문은 "
"봉인되어 있지만 자물쇠나 손잡이도 보이지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "03066bb9-95b1-4dd0-8068-a30596174c0e"
msgid ""
"The raven gives a rattling caw. \"Pathetic crrreaturrre! How darrre you "
"starre at the crrreation of yourrr masterrrs with indifference! Kneel! And "
"prrray the ancients don't strrrrike you down!\""
msgstr "까마귀는 까악거립니다. \"하찮은 생물들아! 주인이 만든 창조물을 감히 쳐다보다니! 무릎을 꿇어라! 고대인에게 빌어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "0e90f25a-6ce7-4457-b7fb-0fed3dba1b4a"
msgid ""
"{n}The gate seems impregnable — you can't imagine the power needed to open "
"it, it looks like a score of battering rams would shatter against it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문은 무슨 힘을 가해도 열 수 없을 것 같습니다. 그 무엇이 문에 달려들어도 부서지지 않을 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "4c98a9b9-0618-449e-88c0-d1d477d09c4f"
msgid ""
"{n}Massive pillars rise high up into the mist. You can barely imagine the "
"power it would take to build this gigantic structure.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}거대한 기둥들이 안개를 뚫었습니다. 이런 거대한 구조물을 지으려면 얼마나 많은 힘이 들지 상상이 가지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "dd048152-cfa4-447d-aa54-1cc3c2e7314f"
msgid ""
"\"A merrre touch of my masterrrr's power… he commands arrrrmies, slaves, "
"servants, shapes mountains to his will…\" {n}The raven makes a rattling "
"caw.{/n} \"This is a monument to his reign... and his rrreign will come "
"again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 주인님께선 전능하시다... 그분은 군대와 노예를 움직여 산도 옮길 수 있다...\" {n}까마귀는 까악 거립니다.{/n} \"여긴"
" 그분께서 정복한 영토를 기념하는 곳이다... 주인님께서 곧 되찾을 영토 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "094ceda5-69b4-48d7-9413-168ab932738b"
msgid ""
"{n}Many of the words are lost to time and weather, but you make out some "
"glyphs and symbols you recognize — and from there, manage to piece together "
"the inscription:{/n}\n"
"\"IN DARKNESS, THE DOORS OPEN .\n"
"IN MURK, THE TRUTH REVEALS ITSELF.\n"
"IN GLOOM, DEATH STEPS INTO THE HALLS.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}세월과 비바람에 의해 많은 글씨들이 지워졌지만 당신은 몇몇 상징과 글을 해독했습니다. 그리고 그것들을 바탕으로 뜻을 "
"유추했습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"어둠 속에서 문은 열린다.\n"
"희미함 속에서 진실은 스스로 모습을 드러낸다.\n"
"슬픔 속에서 죽음은 복도로 걸어간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "c33e72f0-9e08-439d-be39-82230182cbda"
msgid ""
"{n}The ancient inscriptions have fallen victim to time and weather. Try as "
"you might, you cannot decipher them.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}고대의 비문은 세월과 비바람에 의해 훼손돼었습니다. 해독하려고 시도했지만 소용이 없었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "03f5cc63-c71e-4cbd-891c-9f1d127d989b"
msgid ""
"{n}The gates are covered with ancient inscriptions and disturbing depictions "
"of worship and sacrifice... but the inscriptions are far above eye level, so "
"much so you have to take a few steps back to see them. In the center, where "
"the two gates meet, there is a circular protrusion — set into it are three "
"black hooks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}문은 고대의 비문이 빼곡히 적혀있었고 숭배와 희생을 상징하는 묘사가 보였습니다... 하지만 읽을 수 있는 비문은 높은 곳에 있어 "
"몇걸음 물러나서야 읽을 수 있었습니다. 양 문이 만나는 중간에는 동그랗게 튀어나온 부분이 있었고 3개의 검은 갈고리가 "
"달려있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "05d26725-86ce-4975-bd52-ea647745e14b"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven tilts its head, affixing you with a single beady eye.{/n} \"What"
" is wrrrrit, is wrrrrit no more, for wind and time have taken their toll… "
"yet you would need masterrrry of languages grrrreater and olderrr than yours "
"to read what's therrre… and a farrr greaterrr mind than yourrrrs to "
"comprrrehend it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 머리를 돌리고는 한쪽 눈으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"여기에 쓰여있는 것은 더 이상 없다. 시간과 날씨가 지워버렸다... "
"이것을 읽으려면 너보다 현명한 자를 데려와 글을 읽게 해라... 너보다 현명한 자는 이해할 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "815b99fc-9243-411c-abfe-f9b55065871c"
msgid ""
"{n}Depicted on the gates are three cyclopes — great giants clad in "
"ceremonial garb. They stand before an image of the gate, which is open. Each "
"cyclops is holding aloft a lantern that looks to be a cyclops's skull.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}문에 새겨진 그림은 세명의 사이클롭스였습니다. 그것들은 열려있는 문의 그림 앞에 서있었습니다. 셋 모두 사이클롭스 해골 모양의 "
"랜턴을 들고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "2a03b7d6-af41-4293-809e-fee7b18a03fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Rains and winds have taken their toll on this bas-relief — all you can "
"make out are a few vague figures, each holding something aloft, but you "
"can't make out what the figures are or what they're carrying.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}비바람이 조각을 닳게 했습니다. 당신은 흐릿한 형상이 무언가를 들고 있는 그림인 것을 보았지만 그것들이 무엇인지 무엇을 들고 있는지 "
"알 수 없었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "bd3cdf02-3d8b-4d4e-91e5-01dbf5d412bc"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven makes a rattling caw.{/n} \"Nothing to see, nothing to see… the "
"storms have scourrred it away… just as my masterrr shall do with you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 까악거립니다.{/n} \"볼 거 없다. 볼 거 없다... 폭풍이 조각을 지워버렸다... 우리 주인이 너희도 그렇게 지워버릴 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "3a7ed81a-e5a1-416b-8460-7fb35d2e3372"
msgid ""
"{n}Clouds of smoke billow from the lit incense burners, streaming out "
"through the cyclops' eye sockets... You quickly realize the smoke isn't "
"rising — it's encircling you, engulfing you, until all around you is "
"darkness...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}빛나는 향로에서 사이클롭스 해골의 눈구멍으로 연기가 피어오릅니다... 당신은 연기가 솟지 않는다는 것을 눈치 챘습니다. 그것은 "
"당신을 둘러싸고 당신 주변이 어두워질 때까지 당신을 집어삼킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "283cdbee-d97e-4d4d-bd30-3e1350b097db"
msgid "{n}You step down, and once again stand in the gate's shadow.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 아래로 내려가서 다시 한번 문의 그림자 안에 섰습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "d7fc55bc-71cb-4212-8a80-ad15d838908d"
msgid ""
"{n}Your initial idea — that some ancient lock lay in the center of the gate —"
" proves wrong. The \"gate\" is sealed, a solid wall with neither lock nor "
"latch nor keyhole. Perhaps the gate was not meant to be opened — it was "
"meant to seal something inside.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고대의 자물쇠가 문의 중앙에 있을 것이라는 당신의 생각은 틀렸습니다. 문은 자물쇠나 열쇠 구멍도 없이 단단한 벽처럼 봉인되었습니다. "
"아마도 문은 열릴 것 같지 않습니다. 아마도 안에서 봉인된 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "89eb9a6d-91b7-4fe0-bc50-4591419b28f1"
msgid ""
"{n}The gate seems built for giants and their kin, but yet three small hooks "
"are set in a circular protrusion in the gate, five feet off the ground. If "
"this gate was meant for giants, it is odd they set the hooks so low. Peering "
"closer, you see the hooks bear traces of soot — and ash.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}문은 거인과 같은 종족을 위해 지은 것 같지만 바닥에서부터 보통 사람의 어깨 높이에 둥그렇게 튀어나온 부분이 있었고 갈고리 세개가 "
"달려있었습니다. 이 문이 거인을 위한 것이라면 갈고리를 그렇게 낮게 단 것이 이상했습니다. 가까이서 보니 갈고리에는 검댕이 "
"묻어있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0099_Text
msgctxt "e309a46a-ac5e-47f6-a743-79a54d86e4b9"
msgid "{n}You step back to take in the whole structure once again.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 구조물을 전체적으로 보기 위해 다시 물러났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0100_Text
msgctxt "b4f7644d-cd5a-414d-b98d-417b41ec89ce"
msgid ""
"{n}This pillar stands on the windward side, so it is more weathered than the "
"rest of the gate. You can faintly make out the remains of inscriptions that "
"once used to cover the pillar — but they are so faded by wind and the "
"elements as to be unreadable.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}기둥은 바깥쪽에 설치되어있어 문보다도 비바람에 영향을 더 많이 받았습니다. 당신은 기둥에 비문이 적혀있는 것을 간신히 알아보았지만 "
"비바람에 심하게 지워져 읽을 수 없었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0101_Text
msgctxt "e158b7fb-44ba-44a5-96ab-b2cd0fb7d88b"
msgid ""
"{n}Time and weather have failed to destroy the bas-relief that rises from "
"the foot of this pillar and winds its way up into the mist. The pillar is "
"covered with intricate geometric patterns, images of lotuses and other "
"flowers, mysterious figures performing strange rituals — the attention to "
"detail is amazing, you'd need hours to examine every image.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}세월과 비바람이 발치 부분에 있는 조각은 지우지 못한 것 같습니다. 기둥은 복잡한 기하학적 문양과 선인장과 꽃의 그림과 이상한 "
"의식을 치루는 의문의 인물들의 모습이 새겨져있었습니다. 자세히 보니 이 모든 그림을 모두 조사하려면 몇시간은 걸릴 것 같았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0104_Text
msgctxt "7405c095-e2f0-40e2-96c8-47af4a801c90"
msgid ""
"{n}The stone flies in an arc, hits the gate and thuds on the ground. You "
"wait several moments in awkward silence, but nothing happens.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}돌이 곡선을 그리며 문을 때리고는 땅에 떨어졌습니다. 당신은 어색한 침묵 속에 잠시 기다렸지만 아무 일도 일어나지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0105_Text
msgctxt "e9a3b6c2-07eb-4cad-9fdf-738c76868512"
msgid ""
"{n}Your shout echoes repeatedly off the mountains and the gate. As the last "
"echo fades, there is a moment of silence, then from the valley comes a "
"strange sound, a mixture or howling and cawing that echoes sharply off the "
"rock walls.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 외침은 메아리가 되어 산과 문을 울립니다. 마지막 메아리가 사라진 후 잠시 조용해지고는 계곡으로부터 울음 소리와 까악거리는 "
"소리가 메아리가 되어 돌 벽을 울렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0108_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "d92ffa0c-95f9-4eab-9dd4-6da716866a13"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven tilts its head forward, its tiny black eyes drilling into "
"you.{/n} \"{name}. I'll remember your name, {race}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 머리를 돌려 작고 검은 눈으로 당신을 꿰뚫어봅니다.{/n} \"{name}. 너의 이름을 기억하지. {race}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0110_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e8258aa1-9577-44ec-b467-428a6b486f8c"
msgid ""
"\"The cyclopes believed that the soul leaves the body through the eye "
"socket... The incense smoke is supposed to symbolize the souls departing to "
"the afterlife.\""
msgstr "\"사이클롭스들은 눈 구멍을 통해 영혼이 나간다고 믿었어... 향로의 연기는 사후 세계로 가는 영혼을 상징할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0112_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "29fd9839-ab27-4d5c-9ac1-e7520cb6d644"
msgid "\"Which means, right into {g|Charon}Charon's{/g} maw.\""
msgstr "\"그 말은 {g|Charon}카론{/g}의 아가리에 들어간다는 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDead/ValleyOfTheDead_DoorDialog/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "e458cc7a-77a5-4df8-bee0-7cc0f1bcdd70"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I don't like this place.. I feel like I did in Qadira, during our "
"raids on daemon worshipers. It's a very similar atmosphere.\""
msgstr "\"나는 여기가 싫어... 다이몬 숭배자들을 카디라에서 사냥했을 때 같아. 분위기가 정말 똑같으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet01Fail_String
msgctxt "4ee3c91c-1ee0-4f2f-9034-a1ab28dbbfa4"
msgid ""
"The tablet is covered with text in an ancient language. It looks like some "
"strange list."
msgstr "석판은 고대의 언어로 적혀있습니다. 무언가 이상한 것의 목록 같았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet01Success_String
msgctxt "9f74f4ec-faee-41ce-99f1-0cb43d503baa"
msgid ""
"Listed on the tablet are the names of ancient clans and families, that are "
"buried in the huge cemetery. Mysterious phrase, concluding the list, reads: "
"\"Free in life, obedient in death.\""
msgstr ""
"석판에는 거대한 무덤에 묻힌 고대 클랜과 가족의 이름들이 적혀있었습니다. 목록에는 이상한 문장이 적혀있었습니다. \"삶에서 자유로우나 "
"죽어서는 복종한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet02Fail_String
msgctxt "71163081-7f23-4d8b-8215-e8b611e33004"
msgid ""
"Nature elements and time damaged the ancient writings a great deal: it's "
"impossible to make out something of the complicated words written in ancient "
"language."
msgstr "자연과 세월이 고대의 글씨를 심하게 훼손했습니다. 고대의 언어로 적힌 복잡한 문장을 이해하는 것은 불가능했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet02Success_String
msgctxt "da0939d0-0413-4035-aeab-769c1bc691ab"
msgid ""
"The tablet is covered with the names of dead cyclopes, buried in the Valley "
"of the Dead. The list ends with a statement: \"May the Vordakai's army rest "
"in peace and ashes until it rises on His demand\""
msgstr ""
"석판에는 죽은 자의 계곡에 묻힌 죽은 사이클롭스들의 이름이 적혀있었습니다. 목록은 다음과 같이 끝납니다. \"보다카이의 군대는 평화롭게 "
"잠들었고 그들을 필요로 할 때 다시 일어나리라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet03Fail_String
msgctxt "075184ba-6309-45d8-ad6a-3f8cb7a5b579"
msgid "Ancient writings on the tablet are almost unreadable."
msgstr "석판에 적힌 글은 거의 읽을 수가 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet03Success_String
msgctxt "1c9ff6d3-58e4-4764-8816-60f9f3aab6af"
msgid ""
"\"The Master of Death will call out those who are buried under his feet. "
"Those who rejected Vordakai will become servants to Him. Great Vordakai will "
"unite sworn enemies with a common after-life goal — implementing His will.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽음의 주인이 그의 발 아래에 묻힌 자들을 불러낼 것이다. 보다카이를 거부한 자는 그의 종이 될 것이다. 위대한 보다카이는 우리 "
"모두가 죽은 뒤에도 그의 의지를 실현하여 적들을 통합할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet04Fail_String
msgctxt "62b03713-4c37-4dd5-80b4-b7a272352242"
msgid ""
"Neat writings on this tablet are worn and scrubbed off. Over the lines "
"there's a barely visible word written in ancient language."
msgstr "석판에 적힌 깔끔한 글은 닳고 벗겨졌습니다. 글은 거의 읽기가 힘들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet04Success_String
msgctxt "6d353be9-bbe6-4028-92cb-0a8cfa227569"
msgid ""
"The list of clans and families has seen better days — someone cracked the "
"tablet and scraped off carved names. You notice a word written over the neat "
"lines: it reads \"TRAITOR\"."
msgstr ""
"클랜과 가족의 목록이 잘 보이지 않습니다. 어떤 것은 균열이 가있고 어떤 것은 이름이 지워졌습니다. 당신은 어떤 이름에 선이 그어지고 "
"반역자라고 쓰여진 것을 보았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet05Fail_String
msgctxt "a70a85c9-dbd3-49f0-84ed-44c95add87f6"
msgid ""
"The part of the tablet is chipped off, so the meaning of carved writings is "
"now lost."
msgstr "석판의 일부분이 떨어져나갔고 새겨진 글의 의미를 알 수 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ValleyOfTheDeadSE01/Barks/Tablet05Success_String
msgctxt "90c18114-e524-4712-a37f-70532fbcb478"
msgid ""
"\"Thousands of thousands are buried at the feet of Vordakai. Thousands of "
"thousands will embrace the darkness and rise at Master's call. Thousands of "
"thousands will start a new age in glory of the Four Horsemen.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수백만의 영혼이 보다카이의 발 밑에 묻혔다. 수백만의 영혼이 어둠을 받아들일 것이며, 주인께서 부르시면 다시 일어날 것이다. 수백만의 "
"영혼이 네 기수의 영광 아래 새로운 시대를 시작할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/CephalLorentus_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "4f37c519-e20c-4d97-a9a5-281aebf38430"
msgid "\"Do you need anything?\""
msgstr "\"필요한 게 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/CephalLorentus_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "da18d6a6-7b02-4e60-ba57-d87c271d578e"
msgid ""
"\"Go bother Varn with all this, I have better things to do than to entertain "
"gawkers and layabouts.\""
msgstr "\"나한테 이러지 말고, 반에게나 가보시오. 나한텐, 날 멍청하게 바라보는 사람들이나 상대하는것보다 중요한 일이 있으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/CephalLorentus_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "782c5c04-5ef8-45ff-a933-6d8721f0287d"
msgid "\"Hmmmm?\""
msgstr "\"흐음?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Church_VarnholdVanished_Bark_String
msgctxt "6c87f679-2654-4c5d-8272-2e847675857f"
msgid "The temple of Erastil is empty and dark."
msgstr "에라스틸의 사원은 텅 비었고 어둠 뿐입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/CrowFisherman_VarnholdVanished_CheckPassedActions_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "cd4603eb-71e4-4a99-ad55-7727cbedc5fa"
msgid ""
"The big black bird is watching your every move. It seems it has been "
"following you ever since you left the temple of Erastil."
msgstr "거대하고 검은 새가 당신의 이동을 감시하고 있습니다. 에라스틸의 사원을 떠났을 때부터 미행한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/CrowFisherman_VarnholdVanished_CheckPassedActions_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "4d465dc2-16e2-4bc4-98ce-c31230bef287"
msgid "The big black bird is watching your every move."
msgstr "거대하고 검은 새가 당신을 감시하고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/CrowGranary_VarnholdVanished_CheckPassedActions_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "0e349ef8-cbce-4298-babf-83daaebf2f5c"
msgid ""
"The huge raven is watching you closely. It seems it has been following you "
"ever since you left the fisherman's house."
msgstr "거대한 까마귀가 당신을 가까이서 감시합니다. 어부의 집에서 나왔을 때부터 당신을 감시한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/CrowGranary_VarnholdVanished_CheckPassedActions_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "865cff4e-4df4-4b5e-984e-aab712d11d63"
msgid "The huge black raven is watching you closely."
msgstr "거대한 까마귀가 당신을 가까이서 감시합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Field01_VarnholdVanished_Bark_String
msgctxt "a1967417-87b6-406a-a08f-16f581553c02"
msgid "The hoe and the spade were left out in the field."
msgstr "괭이와 삽이 들판에 버려져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Field02_VarnholdVanished_Bark_String
msgctxt "2cea1e60-7909-413f-9d41-2cf6291701f9"
msgid ""
"Pot shards lie scattered in the middle of the road. Traces of oil can be "
"seen on the shards."
msgstr "단지의 파편이 길 한복판에 흩어져있습니다. 파편에는 기름이 묻어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Field03_VarnholdVanished_Bark 1_String
msgctxt "cfc539f1-4756-4103-942a-337fcb70b227"
msgid ""
"Left out in the open, the laundry has become grey and has started to rot at "
"the edges."
msgstr "야외에 버려진 빨래는 더러워지고 끝부분은 너덜해지고 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Fisherman_VarnholdVanished_Bark_String
msgctxt "704bbba5-eb08-4ced-8a1b-f52f1553277c"
msgid ""
"The fisherman's house has been plundered — all the fish, nets, and tools are "
"gone."
msgstr "어부의 집은 약탈당했습니다. 어구와 그물 등이 사라졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Fisherman_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "ff1323a0-2f8c-4333-80f0-3f97d3780a6c"
msgid "\"Good day!\""
msgstr "\"안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Fisherman_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "dd87d8a2-d0c1-485f-8c92-ec53f8aeb32a"
msgid "\"Would you like some fresh fish?\""
msgstr "\"신선한 물고기가 필요해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Fisherman_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "6b8a61d3-4e27-4433-b6e4-265e7eff9da1"
msgid ""
"\"You'll see — another year or two, and we'll be taking boats to Restov!\""
msgstr "\"두고 봐. 내년이나 내 후년에 레스토프로 배를 끌고 갈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/FortGuard_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "58a5dd59-640d-461f-b78e-7f02b91ccddc"
msgid "\"It's an honor to greet you, Your Grace.\""
msgstr "\"만나뵙게되어 영광입니다. {mf|남작님|남작님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/FortGuard_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "3d82699f-a700-4f76-81b5-6ed2769170a1"
msgid "\"Welcome to Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에 오신 걸 환영합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/InnTraveler01_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "cbcececa-52c1-45c0-afee-808c912cbbe9"
msgid "\"Good day!\""
msgstr "\"안녕하신가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/InnTraveler02_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "2bcae4ff-511b-47c4-a906-d3a414b7ee89"
msgid "\"How can I be of assistance?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/InnTravelers_CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "00516f92-879d-415a-9f14-0377ca7f7050"
msgid "\"Don't shout like that! My head is splitting after yesterday.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 소리 지르지 말라고! 어제부터 머리가 쪼개질것 같으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/InnTravelers_CommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "fdc813e5-7fc4-4037-874f-bf41800a57ab"
msgid ""
"\"Aye, you sure had yourself a time of it! If you forgot yourself, no "
"matter, the locals will be sure to remind you — for a long time to come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 너 아주 즐거운 시간을 보냈나보구만! 너 정신 못차리는거 같은데, 걱정마, 이곳 주민들이 곧 널 깨워줄테니까말야. 아주 "
"오랫동안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/InnTravelers_CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "b4302c12-1104-4bed-a360-cd687238df0d"
msgid "\"Just move, will you?! No messing around.\""
msgstr "\"좀 비키라구 엉?! 장난치지말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/LootedGranary01_Varnhold_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "e8da5847-777b-47a8-86b3-5000febbd069"
msgid ""
"The entrance to the granary, its door wide open, is swarming with crows."
msgstr "입구는 활짝 열렸는데 까마귀들이 바글거립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/LootedGranary02_VarnholdVanished_Bark_String
msgctxt "1b026d05-77cf-41e1-b1b3-cbdf5f8e2f58"
msgid ""
"Grain litters the ground around this former granary — the sacks that used to "
"hold supplies have been torn apart and emptied, and bones and other "
"leftovers are scattered in the dirt."
msgstr "곡물 창고 바닥에 곡물이 뿌려져있습니다. 곡물을 담던 자루는 찢겨져 비워져 있고, 뼈와 잔해들이 땅에 흝어져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/LoreHouse01_VarnholdVanished_Bark_String
msgctxt "25d08fde-8a8f-43b9-9207-7b72993b459a"
msgid "The house is empty."
msgstr "집은 비었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/LoreHouse02_VarnholdVanished_Bark 1_String
msgctxt "4c04f774-9c33-4e65-b78d-85cb53766b6f"
msgid ""
"The door to the house is ajar. The owner didn't lock it when leaving their "
"home."
msgstr "집의 문은 약간 열려있습니다. 집 주인은 떠날 때 문을 잠그지 않았나 봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/LoreHouse03_VarnholdVanished_Bark 2_String
msgctxt "c41530a1-8371-40c3-9f51-b1e9a75441d2"
msgid ""
"A table, set for a meal, can be seen through the half-open window. The "
"cutlery and the plates lie untouched and flies hover above the rotting food."
msgstr ""
"반쯤 열린 창문 너머 식사가 차려진 식탁이 보입니다. 수저와 접시는 그대로 놓여있고 파리들이 썩은 음식 위를 맴돌고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/LoreInn_VarnholdVanished_Bark_String
msgctxt "c82c6b75-ec6b-4876-9007-9917863feecc"
msgid "The entrance to the empty tavern still smells of spilt ale."
msgstr "텅 빈 주점의 입구에서 흘린 에일 냄새가 진동합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Lore_Varnhold_Bark 1_String
msgctxt "fe2c6413-b21a-4e32-a3f8-33c107260aea"
msgid ""
"Above the entrance to the temple hangs the gold-plated symbol of Erastil, "
"god of the hunt."
msgstr "사원의 입구 위에는 에라스틸의 상징이 금으로 칠해져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Lore_Varnhold_Bark 2_String
msgctxt "238782b1-da08-4d16-b1c0-163d8ecf9dd8"
msgid ""
"The high walls of the granary have been thoroughly caulked, on its door "
"hangs a massive lock."
msgstr "곡물 창고의 높은 벽은 굳게 잠겨있고 커다란 자물쇠가 달려있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Lore_Varnhold_Bark 3_String
msgctxt "8c848262-67be-4870-8228-b0a11d85b110"
msgid "The reek of fish emanates from the stocky building."
msgstr "건물에서 고기 비린내가 납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Lore_Varnhold_Bark 4_String
msgctxt "1ca652d2-add9-4197-bf5b-bcf3f7c550df"
msgid ""
"The water near the bank is teeming with fish darting about among the algae."
msgstr "둑 근처의 물에는 해조류 사이를 헤엄치는 물고기가 가득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Lore_Varnhold_Bark 5_String
msgctxt "2b768ff6-2128-41b7-8d3b-58c3ca6e64a7"
msgid ""
"The fort's walls are made of thick logs, their tops sharpened into spikes."
msgstr "요새의 벽은 통나무로 지어졌고 통나무의 끝은 뾰족하게 다듬어졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Lore_Varnhold_Bark_String
msgctxt "cdeec501-3153-43c9-bff0-87711946c3ce"
msgid ""
"Above the entrance to the tavern hangs a brightly painted plaque, depicting "
"a horse with a fish tail in place of its hind legs."
msgstr "선술집의 입구 위에는, 말의 뒷다리 대신에 물고기의 꼬리가 달려있는 말의 그림이 그려진 간판이 있다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Merchant_VarnholdVanished_Bark_String
msgctxt "2b07e4e7-5480-44f5-aa81-d53b2f5ffa9b"
msgid "The door to the merchant's house lies open. Inside is chaos."
msgstr "상점의 문은 열려있습니다. 내부는 난장판입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Peasant01_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "f31e0709-1a28-4f7d-8e77-a953c095883f"
msgid "\"Good day!\""
msgstr "\"안녕하신가요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Peasant01_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "24910385-3454-4b69-b9f5-c8868b3f0148"
msgid "\"Welcome to Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에 오신 걸 환영합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Peasant01_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "762877e8-ba44-4a12-b419-c827bc121d63"
msgid "\"See those clouds? Rain's coming, I'm telling you...\""
msgstr "\"구름 낀 것 봤나요? 비가 올 겁니다. 장담하죠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Peasant02_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "f2c8a537-0e93-4591-8ab1-5a7ddce37284"
msgid "\"Oh, it's you!\""
msgstr "\"오... 당신이군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Peasant02_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "40b1ca9f-a6b8-4d08-898b-84d3fffeb70d"
msgid "\"Have you come to see His Grace? You can find him inside the fort!\""
msgstr "\"이곳 영주님을 뵈러 왔나요? 요새 안으로 가면 만나실 수 있을겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Peasant02_WhatToBark 3_String
msgctxt "8776b305-0ebd-40e0-9081-09841d8e4956"
msgid "\"How can I help you?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요하신가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Peasant02_WhatToBark 4_String
msgctxt "6d44c671-cfbd-4a4b-bd07-176cd934f245"
msgid "\"How are you finding Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드는 좀 어떠신가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Peasant02_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "a690073c-ef3b-4ffa-a1a7-7cb97204f14e"
msgid "\"Your Grace.\""
msgstr "\"안녕하세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PeasantsChurch_CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "d6347636-0dc5-4331-aba1-3a27241cf33c"
msgid ""
"\"The farmers in the south will be slaughtered while these nobles are making "
"up their minds! They'd better send more soldiers, and soon.\""
msgstr "\"귀족들이 마음을 정하느라 시간보내는 동안, 남쪽의 농민들은 도살당할꺼야! 아마 곧 더 많은 군대를 보내야 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PeasantsChurch_CommandBark 2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "8c0ecc3e-675e-4072-9434-3baa2f3e8034"
msgid ""
"\"They're getting bold, the rascals! You just wait, the Swordlords will "
"show'em!\""
msgstr "\"그놈들 더 대담해지고 있어! 악당들같으니! 조금 기다리면, 소드로드들이 나타나줄꺼라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PeasantsChurch_CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "f2bff998-b447-401b-a45b-3506fe1bf61a"
msgid ""
"\"They say there is unrest in the north. Barbarians are raiding distant "
"villages.\""
msgstr "\"북쪽은 혼란스럽다던데. 야만인이 마을들을 약탈한다는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PeasantsGranary_CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "895d37c4-9411-43d2-8d62-55ac18b5c273"
msgid ""
"\"What a headache! It's bad enough with the crows damaging the crops, now "
"these pests as well?!\""
msgstr "\"아이고 머리야! 까마귀가 곡물을 먹는 것도 모자라 역병이 나도는건가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PeasantsGranary_CommandBark0_SharedText_String
msgctxt "649cc9a4-f7c1-4006-84e9-cd06cb7b7430"
msgid ""
"\"Rats have gotten into the grain again! How do you deal with these pests?\""
msgstr "\"쥐들이 곡물을 갉아먹고 있어! 이것들을 어떻게 처리할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PeasantsGranary_CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "704767d0-ee50-4b60-a1d7-dc1ab90638e9"
msgid ""
"\"I'll just have to ask Berton to make more traps — he'll put them around "
"the barn. See how the blighters like that!\""
msgstr "\"버톤에게 더 많은 덫을 놓으라고 해야겠어. 창고 주위에 덫을 놓을 거야. 쥐들이 어떻게 나오는지 보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PriestOfErastil_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "b8b2c700-f9fc-4c19-a2f3-ff0f5cf84d79"
msgid "\"May Erastil protect you!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸께서 지키기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PriestOfErastil_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "13c76c6e-ddfd-4fdf-a499-eeeb0daf2f88"
msgid "\"Can I help you?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요하신가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/PriestOfErastil_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "3affd482-4b7e-49ec-b870-ca4df63256a6"
msgid "\"Glad to see you.\""
msgstr "\"만나서 반갑습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Spriggans_CommandBark 1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "3027132a-16e5-4426-9623-1330f0b8cce3"
msgid "\"What can you do when it's all gone? He can get mad all he wants!\""
msgstr "\"모두 사라지면 어떻게 할 거지? 그는 미쳐버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Spriggans_CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "d9d063af-3093-4b62-8d36-e39db2fdb659"
msgid "\"Nothing's left. Agai's going to get mad.\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 남지 않았어. 아가이가 미쳐버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Spriggans_Varnhold_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "8185c1ab-cf96-45ee-b5cc-6df2628d686b"
msgid "\"Spies! Get 'em!\""
msgstr "\"첩자다! 잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Stockade_Varnhold_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "a7d8f213-5323-47a3-90c0-9f391b458479"
msgid "You hear nothing behind the fort's walls — all is silent."
msgstr "요새 벽에 귀를 대 보지만 아무것도 들리지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Stockade_Varnhold_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "9d6d39c3-7d47-4193-ad31-9f88e04c9672"
msgid "You can make out voices behind the fort's walls."
msgstr "당신은 요새 벽에 귀를 대고 소리를 들을 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Tracks_VarnholdVanished_CheckFailBark_String
msgctxt "6dd33fa3-79ea-4dac-b6a0-1cc1de4e3c4f"
msgid ""
"There are muddled tracks in the dirt of the road leading up to the fort."
msgstr "요새로 이어진 길은 진흙탕입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Tracks_VarnholdVanished_CheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "39b6c07a-7aaf-4f6f-b336-99b8bebfed23"
msgid ""
"There are numerous tracks, humanoids — both small and gigantic — to and from "
"the fort."
msgstr "요새로 드나든, 크고 작은 인간형 존재들의 수많은 발자국이 남아 있다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnMerchantCutscene_CommandBark_1_SharedText_String
msgctxt "82be7b9a-39ce-438c-bd41-2d67e1cfa44c"
msgid "\"I can't, I just can't, Your Grace. It would reduce me to poverty!\""
msgstr "\"그럴순 없습니다. 도저히 안됩니다. 영주님. 그렇게 낮추면 저는 아마 거지가 될겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnMerchantCutscene_CommandBark_2_SharedText_String
msgctxt "f44bbffa-a777-46e6-8f4f-1f8eb46fc066"
msgid ""
"\"Whom are you hoping to fool with this? You're buying the goods off the "
"weavers for much less!\""
msgstr "\"이걸 가지고 누굴 속이려고 그래? 너는 그 물건을 훨씬 더 싼값으로 사들이고 있잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnMerchantCutscene_CommandBark_3_SharedText_String
msgctxt "32859094-db00-4d7a-a052-1076f25c7966"
msgid ""
"\"You haven't been to Restov for a long time, Your Grace. The guild has "
"inflated the prices, and the guards cost much more nowadays.\""
msgstr ""
"\"레스토프에는 오랫동안 가보지 않으셨잖습니까. 영주님. 길드가 가격을 부풀리는 탓에, 요즘 경비원들 값이 훨씬 더 비싸졌습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnMerchantCutscene_CommandBark_SharedText_String
msgctxt "b3e7d121-1a29-42d7-993e-a6441541cc0b"
msgid "\"You're bleeding me dry! Lower the price!\""
msgstr "\"내 피를 빨아먹을 셈이냐! 가격을 낮춰!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdBefore_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "576b3cd9-e05e-47dc-ac07-847896c52b28"
msgid "\"Hey, don't walk on my crops!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 내 작물을 밟지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdBefore_WhatToBark 2_String
msgctxt "d2ae35de-cfa6-4e62-ba51-99aaf4be30ac"
msgid ""
"\"The River Kiravoy — it flows down the mountains and north, all the way to "
"Brevoy.\""
msgstr "\"키라보이 강은 북쪽의 산에서부터 브레보이로 흐르지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdBefore_WhatToBark 3_String
msgctxt "94fc353c-64a3-49c6-b195-3355828977c0"
msgid "\"He only killed villains\""
msgstr "\"그는 악당들만 죽였을 뿐이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdBefore_WhatToBark 4_String
msgctxt "7030d562-6edf-4232-85a3-81daf23820bd"
msgid "\"He never finished that bridge\""
msgstr "\"그는 다리를 짓는것을 결국 끝내지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdBefore_WhatToBark 5_String
msgctxt "f8bfa19a-ded4-4248-a227-bf048c980695"
msgid "\"Killed by a tree. One less fledgling woodcutter\""
msgstr "\"나무로 인해 죽다. 풋내기 나무꾼 하나가 줄었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdBefore_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "cf292cf2-0bf3-4985-a998-0b4649ed55b4"
msgid "\"Damn wanderers…\""
msgstr "\"젠장할 방랑자들…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdMerchant_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "eecf39d1-809d-42bb-b174-d75690fe1616"
msgid "\"Have a look at my wares! Best south of Restov!\""
msgstr "\"와서 물건 좀 보라고! 레스토프 남쪽에서 가장 좋은 물건이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_FarmWorkers01_String
msgctxt "5c3c05fa-0360-4bf2-8c0a-1cb33666be0c"
msgid "\"Greetings, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"여어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_FarmWorkers02_String
msgctxt "709c8182-a9fc-4e4e-8d66-c737f47fd7cc"
msgid "\"How may I help?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_FarmWorkersNear01_String
msgctxt "1bdd3215-911e-4bb1-815f-a9f4b58a8808"
msgid "\"Welcome to Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에 온 걸 환영한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_FarmWorkersNear02_String
msgctxt "841e4bae-046e-4787-9c73-1fdf6182f989"
msgid "\"Good soil in these parts, fertile and rich!\""
msgstr "\"이 땅의 토양은 비옥하구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Fisherman01_String
msgctxt "0cd1b53a-7be0-4b89-b5a0-38fe0c70f49e"
msgid "\"Would you like to see the fresh catch?\""
msgstr "\"물고기 잡는 걸 보고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Fisherman02_String
msgctxt "310600ac-6734-4bb8-b149-d5fcfb8c0878"
msgid ""
"\"I should probably fix the nets — riverbed can be treacherous around here. "
"Snags and stones everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"그물을 고쳐야겠어. 강바닥에는 돌이 많거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Granary_String
msgctxt "52bd7b96-56ad-428f-a27b-dc467c60cc55"
msgid "The granary doors are propped closed with rocks."
msgstr "곡물 창고는 돌로 막혀있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Guards01_String
msgctxt "0d77210b-35e3-4517-a4f1-d06b4f7166d8"
msgid "\"Who's there?\""
msgstr "\"거기 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Guards02_String
msgctxt "8d58b9d4-0d4a-490d-a20c-bd2662ecc4aa"
msgid "\"Keep your eyes peeled.\""
msgstr "\"눈 뜨고 다녀.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Guests01_String
msgctxt "01fb55fb-73a9-47e1-a399-8253a6e1e05b"
msgid "\"Greetings, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"여어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Guests02_String
msgctxt "52be8165-8c36-4416-9ce1-0f57134f7588"
msgid "\"How may I help?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Inn01_String
msgctxt "51caf1d8-461c-4fd5-afcf-6e6234322df0"
msgid ""
"\"What do they serve for drinks here?! The foul taste is still in my mouth!\""
msgstr "\"도대체 뭘 파는 거야? 썩은 맛이 아직도 입안에 느껴져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Inn02_String
msgctxt "4f1197f5-f41a-4e85-b9cd-c917100abc96"
msgid ""
"\"It seems the tavern keep is pouring us what's left of the former owner's "
"brew.\""
msgstr "\"여기를 버린 선술집의 주인이 술을 부은 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Inn03_String
msgctxt "16aa833b-2a18-47c0-98e7-039aedab9246"
msgid "\"The scoundrel! That rotgut must've gone foul ages ago!\""
msgstr "\"나쁜 놈들! 썩은 내가 가시질 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_MerchantBark_String
msgctxt "48a30ef7-4a16-4dd2-b40c-933ee706eb05"
msgid "\"Only the best here! Don't just walk by!\""
msgstr "\"여기가 가장 낫군! 걸어다니지만 말아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_OverseerBark01_String
msgctxt "2a1bf9bf-3a85-471a-bab2-f1d95bbeeb24"
msgid "\"Welcome to Varnhold, Your Grace!\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에 온 걸 환영한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_OverseerBark02_String
msgctxt "d39273fe-05fd-4134-84d8-603a39c019f8"
msgid "\"I follow my orders as best I can.\""
msgstr "\"나는 명령을 목숨 걸고 따른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_OverseerBark03_String
msgctxt "3f4d3ef4-9533-4e7e-92d6-96a72599a475"
msgid "\"We won't let the Varnhold nightmare repeat itself.\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 악몽이 다시 나타나지 않게 해야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Peasants01_String
msgctxt "b6158cff-ee4a-4ab2-9861-8572bc5fefc9"
msgid "\"Your Grace.\""
msgstr "\"음?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Peasants02_String
msgctxt "69fe727b-6994-451b-b55e-f6092bd0f45f"
msgid "\"Yes?\""
msgstr "\"음?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Peasants03_String
msgctxt "8f14e689-2c35-4e4c-bdcc-4fd67f28abe9"
msgid "\"An honor to meet you!\""
msgstr "\"만나서 영광이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Peasants04_String
msgctxt "ea70ec4f-73d4-475d-a9e8-88787962f2ba"
msgid "\"How may I be of assistance?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Peasants05_String
msgctxt "3df8282e-6fc2-403d-8b66-0d7ccf726d2e"
msgid "\"Do you always talk to commoners in the streets?\""
msgstr "\"항상 길거리에서 평민들과 대화를 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_PeasantsCutscene01_1_String
msgctxt "20bc6bef-21a6-4813-bcdb-d9945118b689"
msgid ""
"\"I'm so glad Thomas and I moved here! A welcome change from the Narlmarches!"
"\""
msgstr "\"토마스와 함께 여기로 이사 와서 좋아! Narlmarches보다 좋은 곳이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_PeasantsCutscene01_2_String
msgctxt "d6e20750-fe4a-4c7e-a8f7-9dcfa549ab1d"
msgid ""
"\"Right, but don't you get scared at night? You know, I just get to thinkin' "
"about what happened to the folks who lived here before…\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 하지만 저녁에는 으스스하지 않아? 여기에서 살던 주민들에게 무슨 일이 일어났을지 궁금해지던 참이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_PeasantsCutscene01_3_String
msgctxt "50a07bf9-e3dd-4d4f-a633-b05123a6161a"
msgid "\"Shut your mouth, stupid! Don't croak!\""
msgstr "\"입닥쳐. 멍청아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_PeasantsCutscene02_1_String
msgctxt "07b469a0-096f-4fdd-81f5-7d072e1e5450"
msgid ""
"\"Darin decided to join the guard. They say the governor takes anyone who "
"can hold a weapon, and pays well. You wouldn't get as much working the land."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"다린이 경비에 들어가기로 했어. 무기를 쥘 수만 있다면 두둑히 보수를 주겠다고 했거든. 땅을 일구는 것 만큼은 아닐 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_PeasantsCutscene02_2_String
msgctxt "4971af6f-527d-4029-b9ce-f4795759b7d8"
msgid "\"And what about you? Aren't you worried for your husband?\""
msgstr "\"그러는 네 남편은? 걱정되지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_PeasantsCutscene02_3_String
msgctxt "ba95efa4-afda-498d-8ffc-e2d5543b07a4"
msgid ""
"\"Worry? Only that my dear husband drinks himself blind while lounging at "
"the fort!\""
msgstr "\"걱정? 남편 놈은 요새에서 코가 비뚤어질 때까지 퍼마시지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Priest01_String
msgctxt "82cf4b35-7f1b-40a9-afd3-f38040a1961c"
msgid "\"Welcome to the temple of Erastil.\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸의 사원에 온 것을 환영하네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Priest02_String
msgctxt "7c2e318a-0172-4d16-adf5-9c5a0fe58ead"
msgid "\"Pray for the souls of those who were here before us.\""
msgstr "\"여기에 왔던 자들을 위해 기도해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdOtherPeople_Priest03_String
msgctxt "66ab09b4-5ca9-47be-9a5d-3be00e19b23f"
msgid ""
"\"The villagers say the souls of those who once lived here haunt their "
"houses still. It is hard to dispel my congregation of such superstitions.\""
msgstr "\"마을 사람들이 말하길 여기에 살았던 사람들의 영혼이 집에 아직 있다는군. 그런 미신을 잊기는 어려워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/VarnholdSign_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "b7a236c9-4778-4cbe-9e43-38d28c63e4fd"
msgid ""
"Northeast: Restov, 40 miles. Across the river: Varnhold fort. Northwest: "
"mountain pass, 12 miles."
msgstr "북동쪽: 레스토프까지 40마일. 강 건너: 반홀드 요새. 북서쪽: 산길까지 12마일."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Varnhold_GraveAdd_WhatToBark 1_String
msgctxt "e410fbe1-2fd5-4b2b-80cb-3e1a03ae2f0f"
msgid "Jond Sever, Varn's comrade at arms and stout defender of Varnhold."
msgstr "존드 세버는 반홀드의 경비대원이자 반의 전우입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Barks/Varnhold_GraveAdd_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "66f9a16f-392e-49c2-b16e-bcae8fd474cb"
msgid "Here lies Andrisha, the first among Varnhold's potters."
msgstr "반홀드에 처음 온 사람 중의 하나인 안드리샤가 누워있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Item/Gunderson_diary_Name_String
msgctxt "0790e67a-edb6-481d-bbaf-c9b5b09c6941"
msgid "Willas Gunderson's diary"
msgstr "윌라스 건더슨의 일기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Item/Gunderson_diary_String
msgctxt "d6c2602c-e52b-4320-86e3-c1bc1169a8fe"
msgid ""
"\"Ever since I left the barony ruled by {mf|His|Her} Grace {name}, I have "
"been possessed of a singular goal: to march bravely to my fate, paying no "
"heed to the naysayers that doubt my ability. The {mf|baron|baroness} is a "
"great {mf|man|woman}, and I've heard {mf|him|her} say that everyone is free "
"to do as they will. I wish to make a great discovery, take the glory and put "
"that stuck-up Narthropple in his place — and by Desna, I shall do so!\n"
"- Day One of the Grand Expedition to Tors of Levenies\n"
"I've reached Varnhold — a stronghold of civilization. Here, I shall start my "
"search for that which shall forever put my name in the annals of Golarion. "
"Long ago, ancient kingdoms flourished here, but it is unlikely anyone has "
"ever conducted a proper excavation in these wilds. I, Willas Gunderson, "
"shall right this historical oversight by carefully surveying the surrounding "
"lands, by putting points of greatest interest on the map and, finally, by "
"finding artifacts that shall become prized pieces in museums throughout the "
"world!\n"
"- Day Four of the Grand Expedition to Tors of Levenies\n"
"Tors of Levenies are almost in reach: I've already made my way around the "
"foothills, and I came dangerously close to getting lost in the plain a few "
"times. I've located a promising tomb, but something stirred inside of it, "
"and I decided against disturbing it further!\n"
"- Day Seven of the Grand Expedition to Tors of Levenies\n"
"I've scoured the vicinity. My legs are sore from all the walking, and I am "
"low on coin. If I don't find something in the next two days, I'll be reduced "
"to cleaning the floors of the Varnhold tavern.\n"
"- Day Ten of the Grand Expedition to Tors of Levenies\n"
"It seems Desna has heard my prayers! As I was returning from my latest "
"outing, the evening outpaced me, and I was forced to spend the night in the "
"hills. As I slept, I suddenly heard a voice... a majestic, proud voice that "
"could have only been the voice of the divine! It commanded me to stand up "
"and follow its call. I wandered as if in a dream, following where it led.\n"
"But the night grew darker with each step. Utterly blind, I suddenly realized "
"soil had given way to slabs of stone under my feet... searching about me, my "
"hands fell on a shattered amphora filled with gold and jewels... words fail "
"me, but as my hands touched the amphora, I felt as if I had disturbed "
"something. Consumed by fear, all I could manage was to grab a bracelet lying "
"on top of the precious heap, and flee back into the moonless night.\n"
"The sun is already rising as I am writing these words. I don't know how, but "
"I found my way back to the plain. It must have been Desna herself that led "
"me through the darkness and despair!\n"
"Oh great goddess! I beseech thee, show me the way back to civilization! "
"Otherwise all I shall ever contribute to history will be my corpse, picked "
"clean by ravens, and this wretched diary.\n"
"- Day Twelve of the Grand Expedition to Tors of Levenies\n"
"I can see Varnhold! Praise be to Desna! I feel her gaze and her blessing "
"upon me!\n"
"At last I will be able to show my find to Maegar — he knows his treasures, "
"and values those who find it! The bracelet I retrieved seems to be carved "
"from a single piece of jade — even if it wasn't a relic, it would still be "
"worth a fortune!\n"
"- Day Fourteen of the Grand Expedition to Tors of Levenies\n"
"Maegar and his arrogant wizard Cephal know nothing about the bracelet. Varn "
"is going to write someone who can help me make sense of this mystery.\n"
"I am beset by terrifying dreams. In them, I claw out my eyes and am buried "
"alive. I wake up covered in cold sweat, then fall into sleep again — only to "
"see the same thing.\n"
"Is Desna testing me? What must I do, great goddess? Send me a sign!\n"
"- Day fifteen\n"
"The dreams won't go away.\n"
"Tonight I saw a shadow outside my window. I think it was laughing at me.\n"
"This is not Desna. Goddess, deliver me from evil!\n"
"I'll hide the diary as warning. Ancient horrors not only in my head. They're "
"here\n"
"Blood coming out of my eye\n"
"it's here\n"
"[The handwriting becomes illegible, but two large letters stand out, written "
"in bold over the erratic strokes of the quill and the blurred bloodstains — "
"\"VO\".]"
msgstr ""
"\"{name}의 남작령을 떠난 이후로 나는 하나의 목표에 사로잡혔다. 내 능력을 의심하는 녀석들은 신경쓰지 않고 당당하게 내 운명을 "
"향해 걸어가는 것이다. {name}의 땅에서는 하고 싶은 것을 할 수 있다고 한다. 나는 위대한 발견을 해서 영광을 얻고 잘난 나트로플을 "
"비웃어주는 것이다.\n"
"- 레베니스 바위산맥으로 가는 위대한 여정 첫째 날\n"
"문명이 발달한 반홀드에 도착했다. 여기서 내 연구를 시작해서 골라리온의 연대기에 내 이름을 남길 것이다. 오래 전 여기에서 번성했던 "
"왕국들이 있었지만 누구도 이런 들판에서 발굴을 하지는 못할 것이다. 나 윌라스 건더슨은 주변 지형을 조사해서 지도에 기록한 후 박물관에서 "
"귀하게 여길 유물들을 발견할 것이다!\n"
"- 레베니스 바위산맥으로 가는 위대한 여정 넷째 날\n"
"레베니스 바위산맥이 가까워졌다. 나는 언덕을 갔다왔지만 평지에서는 몇번이고 길을 잃을 뻔했다. 나는 후보로 삼을 무덤 하나를 발견했지만 "
"그 안에서 무언가가 진동해서 나는 조금 더 지켜 보기로 했다!\n"
"- 레베니스 바위산맥으로 가는 위대한 여정 일곱번째 날\n"
"나는 주변을 샅샅이 뒤졌다. 내 다리는 아프고 돈은 떨어져간다. 다음 이틀 동안 무언가 발견하지 못한다면 반홀드 선술집에서 마루나 닦고 "
"있어야겠다.\n"
"- 레베니스 바위산맥으로 가는 위대한 여정 열 번째 날\n"
"데즈나님이 내 기도를 들어주신 것 같다! 최근 여행에서 나는 해가 져서 언덕에서 밤을 보내야 했다. 잠을 자는데 어떤 목소리를 "
"들었다... 그것은 웅장하고 신성한 목소리였다. 꿈을 꾸는 것처럼 나는 그것을 따라 방황했다.\n"
"하지만 걸을 수록 밤은 더 깊어갔다. 아무것도 보이지 않았고 나는 내 발치에 돌이 걸리는 것을 느꼈다... 주위를 더듬는데 어떤 항아리를 "
"밀어서 깨졌고 그것은 금과 보석이 담겨있었다... 항아리를 만지는 순간 무언가 걸리는 느낌이 들었다. 겁에 질린 나는 서둘러 금붙이 더미 "
"위에 있던 팔찌를 가지고 도망쳤다.\n"
"이 글을 쓰는 지금은 해가 떠있다. 어떻게 왔는지는 모르지만 나는 평야에 도착했다. 데즈나님이 나를 어둠 속에서 이끌어주신 것이 틀림 "
"없다!\n"
"오. 여신님! 저에게 도시로 가는 길을 보여주소서! 그렇지 않으면 내 일기장은 유물이 되고 나는 시체가 되어 까마귀밥이 될 것입니다.\n"
"- 레베니스 바위산맥으로 가는 위대한 여정 열 두번째 날\n"
"반홀드가 보인다! 데즈나님 감사합니다! 그녀의 손길과 축복이 느껴진다!\n"
"마침내 내 발견물을 메이가르에게 보여주었다. 그는 보물에 대한 가치를 아는 사람이다! 내가 가져온 팔찌에는 옥석 한덩이가 박혀있었고 "
"이것이 유물이 아닐지라도 값은 비쌀 것이다!\n"
"- 레베니스 바위산맥으로 가는 위대한 여정 열 네번째 날\n"
"메이가르와 그의 오만한 마법사 케팔은 팔찌에 대해서는 쥐뿔도 모른다. 반은 누군가에게 편지를 보내 내가 이 미스터리를 푸는 것을 도와주려 "
"하고 있다.\n"
"나는 끔찍한 악몽에 시달렸다. 나는 눈이 뽑히고 산 채로 묻혔다. 나는 식은 땀이 난 채로 일어났고 다시 잠에 들었지만 같은 꿈을 꾸었다."
"\n"
"데즈나님이 나를 시험하시는 건가? 내가 어떻게 해야 합니까? 알려주소서!\n"
"- 열 다섯번째 날\n"
"같은 꿈을 꾸고 있다.\n"
"오늘 밤 나는 창 밖의 그림자를 보았다. 그것이 나를 비웃는 것 같다.\n"
"이건 데즈나님이 아니다. 여신이시여, 악을 물리쳐 주소서!\n"
"나는 일기를 어딘가에 숨겨두겠다. 고대의 공포가 머릿속에만 있는 것이 아니다. 그것은 여기에 있다.\n"
"피눈물을 흘렸다.\n"
"그것이 여기있다.\n"
"[손글씨는 읽을 수 없을 정도였지만 \"보\"라는 한글자는 엉성하지만 힘을 주어 쓴 것이 보였습니다. 그리고 핏자국이 묻어있습니다]\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "4f6fe7e8-c7bf-40f2-b09d-5a8b634e6410"
msgid "\"What did you say?\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "3092b9af-009d-47f3-9ee3-0456b6a21dd8"
msgid ""
"\"A talking bird right in the middle of a mysteriously empty settlement. Are "
"you behind what happened here?\""
msgstr "\"말하는 새가 수상하게 텅 비어버린 정착지 한가운데에서 있다고? 도대체 무슨 일이 있던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "842e438b-17f8-476b-a5b6-cd1c27e66f90"
msgid "Threw a stone at the talking raven."
msgstr "말하는 까마귀에게 돌을 던졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "432d0c22-936d-4b62-9119-61f24e6c4c5c"
msgid "[Throw a stone at the raven]"
msgstr "[까마귀에게 돌을 던집니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "c329cf1e-ff66-4f66-ba50-a6c16a7a8fcd"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e2ccec7e-6a4d-4b3f-b66e-94200d155c0b"
msgid "Explained Agai's death with need to protect people from monsters."
msgstr "괴물로부터 사람들을 보호하기 위해 아가이를 죽였다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "8c06f783-9c26-480c-816f-426df5c42ca6"
msgid ""
"\"They were thieves and looters — a threat to the peaceful peasants. What if "
"they had come across another village?\""
msgstr "\"그들은 도둑이야. 평화로운 농민들의 위협이지. 그들이 다른 마을을 침략했다면 어떻게 되었을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description_1
msgctxt "d697d7a7-75c7-4bfc-8950-78e0be21e445"
msgid "Told the talking raven that you killed the spriggans in self-defense."
msgstr "말하는 까마귀에게 당신이 스프리건을 죽인 것은 정당방위라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "92431f60-d735-4029-b728-e667144ceb59"
msgid "\"They attacked. I responded.\""
msgstr "\"그들이 공격해서 나는 반격했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "58f31d1a-7a29-4ee4-8099-c515ec9b6648"
msgid "Explained Agai's death with breaking the law."
msgstr "아가이가 죽은 것은 법을 어겨서라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "9d303f97-f08a-468f-bbb7-58b414abb20e"
msgid "\"They have broken the law and were punished for it.\""
msgstr "\"그들은 법을 어겼고 처벌을 받았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "84926b3e-6407-4d6a-a7ca-7d4cc3cd78c6"
msgid ""
"Explained showing mercy to Agai with another chance for spriggan to start "
"all over again."
msgstr "새 삶을 시작하라고 아가이에게 자비를 베풀었다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "ee1cb4af-049d-4fb9-97aa-2b91e5642f5a"
msgid "\"That's not true. Agai still has a chance for a fresh start.\""
msgstr "\"사실이 아니야. 아가이는 새로운 삶을 살 수 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "ba75dae9-c1ec-45d4-9006-b25c8e68e6db"
msgid "\"I don't care where they go or what happens to them.\""
msgstr "\"그들이 어디를 가던 무슨 일이 일어났던 신경쓰지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7fac0cd1-9e10-4b63-a5c5-e0d7730da724"
msgid "Showed mercy to Agai in order to make him suffer even more."
msgstr "그에게 고통을 더 안겨주려 자비를 베풀었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "7ab54bae-b30c-466c-bf5c-6acd57acb89f"
msgid ""
"\"That's exactly why I let them go — so they could suffer a while longer "
"before the wilderness takes them.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 내가 그들을 보내주었지. 죽임을 당하기 전까지 고통을 받으라고 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "d351fd66-ac28-4f0f-9549-15fa3200ee0a"
msgid "\"My name is {name}. Now tell me who you are.\""
msgstr "\"나는 {name}. 네가 누군지 밝혀라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "1ba88910-1e86-49cd-9f3d-cdc92266e91f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm guessing you're new to these parts if you still don't know who I am! "
"Why don't you take to the air and ask around?\""
msgstr "\"내가 누군지 모른다면 여기 처음 온 것이 분명하겠군! 내가 누군지 다른 자들에게 물어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "d8cdfcc6-6782-4be2-99bb-9a1ae44cf642"
msgid "[Leave] \"Last thing I need is to introduce myself to a filthy crow.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"마지막으로 더러운 까마귀에게 내 소개를 하면 되겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0035_AlignmentShift.Description_1
msgctxt "48712eb0-c73c-4e3c-b98a-f5edcf3da3fc"
msgid "Reproached the talking raven for calling you a thief."
msgstr "당신을 도둑이라고 말한 까마귀에게 그것은 사실이 아니라고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "7d260377-5474-4cf5-9188-00f058962f57"
msgid "\"I stole nothing.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아무것도 훔치지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "8f0cb095-ffa7-4b4e-a949-7ddcc8311a61"
msgid "\"What do you know about the vanishing of Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드가 사라진 것에 대해 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "934f61e2-f4f5-45f1-870b-e9cc3e9cf103"
msgid "\"I'm not from Varnhold, but I will find out what happened here.\""
msgstr "\"나는 반홀드 출신이 아니지만 여기에 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알아내겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "2ec6e907-7647-4615-af3a-6ad2797ffe48"
msgid ""
"[Ignore the question] \"My, my, a talking crow! Now if you said anything "
"worth hearing, that'd be impressive indeed.\""
msgstr "[질문은 무시합니다] \"말하는 까마귀야! 재미있는 얘기를 해준다면 정말 신기할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "49b838f5-595b-4a80-9d1f-54f4a50cb0b6"
msgid "Threatened the raven for insulting a baron{mf||ess}."
msgstr "당신을 모욕한 까마귀를 위협합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "f6faaf89-7455-439b-844a-fba19462c9dd"
msgid ""
"\"I am {name}, the baron{mf||ess} of the neighboring realm! Insult me again, "
"insolent crow, and you'll regret it!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이웃 영토의 {mf||여}남작인 {name}이다! 버릇없는 까마귀야, 또다시 나를 모욕한다면 너를 구워주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "0f00e1f4-fcc8-49fd-befd-203594c9bf23"
msgid "[Hold Tristian's hand]"
msgstr "[트리스티안의 손을 잡습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "e5f49dc4-a402-4956-bdbf-f9828bc9b190"
msgid "\"Put it out of your mind. It's just an insolent bird!\""
msgstr "\"신경 꺼. 그냥 버릇 없는 까마귀야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "68a09bfa-59ff-4133-9a80-287f6ae6e76c"
msgid "\"Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "739cbde8-3f30-4540-857f-5d7b2bcfd426"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice a huge black bird sitting still on a high fence by the exit, "
"as if waiting for you. It's a raven — glistening black, and one of the "
"largest ravens you've even seen. As you approach, it tilts its head and "
"affixes you with a beady black eye.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 입구의 높은 담장에 앉아있는 거대한 검은 새를 보았습니다. 그것은 마치 당신을 기다리는 것 같습니다. 윤기나는 검은 깃털을 "
"보아하니 까마귀인데 여태껏 보았던 것 중 가장 컸습니다. 당신이 접근하자 그것은 머리를 돌려 구슬 같은 검은 눈으로 당신을 "
"응시합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "bf37265d-43a3-4dc0-8e7d-56dcba6c133b"
msgid ""
"{n}As you are about to leave, you hear a cracked voice.{/n} \"Hypocrrrite!\""
msgstr "{n}당신이 떠나려 하자, 갈라진 목소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"위서어언자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "39dae46a-0d8f-4965-80af-4c60fa0ef287"
msgid ""
"{n}As you are about to leave, you hear a cracked voice.{/n} \"Butcherrr.\""
msgstr "{n}당신이 떠나려 하자, 갈라진 목소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"도사아알자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "5870bbf8-7db3-4fc7-a13c-dca4c44a06db"
msgid ""
"\"What have these miserrrable fools done that they must pay with theirrr "
"lives?\" {n}The raven gives a ragged caw, then tilts its head and looks at "
"you, unblinking.{/n} \"Who are you to decide the fate of those whom you do "
"not rule? Why did the victims deserrrve to die?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 한심한 멍청이들이 한 짓을 치루려면 목숨을 바쳐야겠지?\" {n}까마귀는 까악거리고는 머리를 돌리고 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} "
"\"네 백성도 아닌데 왜 그들의 운명을 정한 것이지? 왜 그들을 죽인 것이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "53e6b137-4227-4629-a1b8-6c127bc417ff"
msgid ""
"\"What's the point of your false pity forrr these fools who you allowed to "
"live?\" {n}The raven gives a sharp caw, almost a bark.{/n} With no shelter, "
"no family, and no homeland, always on the run... all you did is prolong "
"their sufferrrring... and take pride in your...\" {n}The raven gives another "
"sharp caw, almost sneering.{/n} \"...'chivalry'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 값싼 동정으로 바보들을 살려주는 게 무슨 소용이지?\" {n}까마귀는 마치 외치듯 까악거립니다.{/n} \"피난처도, 가족도, 고향도 없이 "
"항상 도망칠 뿐이지... 너는 그들이 고통받는 시간을 연장했을 뿐이다... 그리고 너는 스스로 자랑스럽게 여길 뿐이지... \" {n}까마귀는 비웃듯 다시 까악거립니다.{/n}"
"\"...'기사도'.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "c5bf0094-5e9c-434a-a1c7-e4515bf260b5"
msgid ""
"\"Miserrrable hyprocrrrites. You seek to justify yourrr actions?\" {n}The "
"raven gives a series of caws, as if laughing.{/n} \"There is no "
"justification, no, no, no.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한심한 위서어언자. 네 행동을 정당화 하려들어?\" {n}까마귀는 웃음을 터뜨리듯 까악거립니다.{/n} \"부끄러운 줄도 모르는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "77d55d22-e7f9-4bd3-95d2-bbc2bf1714fb"
msgid ""
"\"Worrrms wriggling in the mud. Nothing concerns you but yourrrselves. You "
"deserve contempt, nothing morrre.\""
msgstr "\"찻잔 속의 태풍이다. 아무도 신경 쓰지 않아. 너는 하찮은 녀석일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "e8c5e78a-0eeb-4bf7-82e2-77a116be7fe4"
msgid ""
"\"The delight you take in your prrride! At least you are honest, although in "
"the end, you're just like the rest of your decrrrepit race, {race}.\""
msgstr "\"네 자부심이 우습구나! 결국 미천한 {race} 주제에 정직하기라도 하구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "1fddc860-c294-4c2a-b9c3-e7913dc3bf03"
msgid ""
"{n}Your aim is true, and the stone hits the bird's skull with a sharp crack. "
"The raven falls from its perch with a shriek.\n"
"Just before it strikes the ground, it clumsily rights itself, and, cawing "
"and losing feathers, takes flight.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 정확히 겨냥했고 돌은 새의 대가리를 맞추어 퍽하는 소리를 냈습니다. 까마귀는 울음을 내며 추락합니다.\n"
"땅으로 떨어지기 전에 까마귀는 날개를 퍼덕거리며 날아갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "50fcf92c-1f46-4b3e-afad-bbc09978b8c6"
msgid ""
"{n}The stone misses the raven. With rattling caws, the raven takes to the "
"air and flies away. In moments, it is nothing more than a speck in the sky, "
"then it is gone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}돌은 까마귀를 맞추지 못했습니다. 까악거리며 까마귀는 날아가버립니다. 잠시 후에 그것은 하늘의 점이 되더니 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "d626f57e-92a6-44b1-8605-9606e743a635"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven regards you for a moment. Finally, it flaps its wings and "
"without a sound, takes flight. Moments later, it is nothing more than a "
"speck in the sky, then it is gone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 잠시 당신을 봅니다. 마침내 그것은 날개를 퍼덕이고는 소리 없이 날아갑니다. 잠시 후에 그것은 하늘의 점이 되더니 "
"사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "f1c93da0-9b3b-42f6-8594-b17a24e96813"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven ignores the question, only echoing its last word.{/n} "
"\"Butcherrr.\""
msgstr "{n}까마귀는 질문을 무시하고 하던 말을 마저 말합니다.{/n} \"도사아알자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "cdd29826-ec73-4f1d-a20b-0e1ae80286fb"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven ignores the question, only echoing its last word.{/n} "
"\"Hypocrrrite.\""
msgstr "{n}까마귀는 질문을 무시하고 하던 말을 마저 말합니다.{/n} \"위서어언자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "41bf34e3-f1f9-4e8a-b410-8e25efab031b"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you herrre? Are you one of the thieves that lived in this "
"miserrrable settlement?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기에 왔지? 이 희망 없는 곳에 사는 도둑이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "2caafbf0-82f0-405c-9a60-467a1acecbc8"
msgid ""
"\"Liarrr. This settlement was full of thieves — they paid for their "
"crrrimes. Now only a single one rrremains — you. Who arrre you?\""
msgstr "\"거짓말. 여기는 도둑이 가득하다. 그들은 죗값을 치렀지. 이제 벌을 받지 않은 건 너만 남았다. 너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "d2f6c685-e0de-4de6-b3f0-af92951edab7"
msgid ""
"\"Only that the people of this dusty village were thieves. Thieves and "
"bandits who didn't rrrespect the law and didn't know their place. Inferior "
"beings don't dare touch that which belongs to their masterrrs. Who arrre you?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 더러운 마을에 사는 자들은 도둑뿐이다. 도둑과 강도들은 법도 모르고 주제도 모르지. 열등한 것들은 주인님의 물건을 만져서는 안 "
"돼. 너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "e3d7e954-cc56-49b4-b0d7-66eed2c3425e"
msgid ""
"\"You?\" {n}The raven gives a short, barking caw.{/n} \"What arrrogance! "
"What pride! You, thrall? Do not follow one crime with anotherrr… you will "
"sufferrr the same fate. Who arrre you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가?\" {n}까마귀는 짧게 웁니다.{/n} \"건방지구나! 노예 주제에! 너도 다른 녀석들과 같은 운명을 맞이할 것이다. 너는 "
"누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : ValleyOfTheDead_Raven
msgctxt "ad3d723f-2c13-4e49-94f9-770f63d6baab"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven bristles, its wings fluttering.{/n} \"You would do well to heed "
"my worrrds, thrall — as would all of you of the lesserrr races! You will "
"swallow your worrrds when the time comes, and the time comes for you all!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀는 날개를 푸드덕거립니다.{/n} \"노예 주제에 내 말을 무시했겠다. 열등한 종족 주제에! 그 날이 오면 너는 한마디도 "
"못하리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c70ee351-79be-4b3f-bbf8-861030d2fc63"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian follows the bird with a look of anxiety and determination. He "
"seems so absorbed in his thoughts that he forgets everything else in the "
"world.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 무언가 결심하고 불안한 표정으로 새를 따라갑니다. 그는 생각에 잠겨서 아무것도 신경쓰지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "438fbb71-9111-4c8e-a75c-5d6af6907659"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian turns back, surprised, and smiles faintly, seeing you.{/n} \"Not "
"the most pleasant omen, right?\" {n}He squeezes your fingers lightly and "
"releases them.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 등을 돌려서 놀라고는 희미하게 웃고 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"가장 불길한 징조는 아니니까. 그렇지?\" {n}그는 "
"당신의 손가락을 살며시 쥐었다가 놓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "58629780-4611-4953-b799-99e60ad8b3b9"
msgid "{n}Tristian swallows heavily and nods.{/n} \"Let's go.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 침을 삼키고 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그럼 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8e862f95-728c-4f22-a92f-c69389ba391c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shrugs.{/n} \"I'm afraid that raven is more than just a bird.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"까마귀가 보통 새가 아닌 것 같아 두려워서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e2fb6304-8568-4b28-a3a3-4bd99c825392"
msgid "\"Let's go. Let's not waste any more time.\""
msgstr "\"가자. 시간 낭비 하지 말자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "f0a672d8-4433-4b9b-88c2-fe6e493fb1c0"
msgid "\"Look! Fat tasty featherbag! Hit it with stone!\""
msgstr "\"봐! 토실토실하고 맛 좋은 새다! 돌로 맞히자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "bd7f18a2-1ebc-4ab6-849a-f737a7df0c4a"
msgid "\"Fat tasty... talky featherbag?\""
msgstr "\"토실토실하고... 맛 좋은 새?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Raven/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f0d8cb5c-3ad4-4669-8f4f-1585e05e1929"
msgid ""
"\"It can talk! Maybe it's a wizard turned into a raven? Or a charmed prince? "
"Oh, don't pay attention to me. – I've just never seen anything like it...\""
msgstr ""
"\"말도 할 줄 알아! 마법사가 까마귀로 변신한 걸까? 아니면 마법에 걸린 왕자? 왜 그렇게 봐? 저런 녀석은 본 적이 없어서 그래..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Trader/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "f7c1f773-16eb-40c3-856e-617263022083"
msgid "\"Show me what you have.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 것을 파는지 한번 볼까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Trader/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "730be24a-4a33-4b24-9b63-219e4eccf51c"
msgid "\"I must take my leave.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Trader/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1abae9fd-a087-4f3b-966c-6e34193fd2bf"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, my dear {mf|sir|lady}! Do you wish to browse my fine wares?\""
msgstr "\"어서오십시오! 판매하는 물품들을 한번 보시겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "29ab8b5b-f3d6-4f1e-b6f1-436f672167c1"
msgid "\"I would like to personally express my gratitude for all your help.\""
msgstr "\"개인적으로 고마움의 표시를 하고 싶었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "54d9744f-5aaa-4eee-ab27-b155846b786f"
msgid "\"I stumbled into a most peculiar old man on my way here…\""
msgstr "\"여기 오는 길에 정말 특이한 노인을 우연히 만났어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "8b01238f-f5e8-4574-888e-3a2ab46d29f6"
msgid ""
"\"I just couldn't help not paying a visit, especially after your invitation."
"\""
msgstr "\"당신이 초대를 해서 꼭 들려야만 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "eba5b586-056b-4d0d-8d43-35d1fd9892ea"
msgid "\"I see life in Varnhold is in full swing.\""
msgstr "\"반홀드는 한창 바뻐보이는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4392ba2e-0518-4df4-8e9f-ba95c299fd9c"
msgid "\"You have my respects, Maegar, but I have to leave.\""
msgstr "\"메이가르. 고맙지만 나는 이만 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "2a382a87-b8f4-47ce-8770-dae2b5065e71"
msgid "\"Planning future conquests, are you?\""
msgstr "\"정복 계획이라도 세우나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cd3d2c4b-f504-4e61-bf86-a672eb230dcf"
msgid "Supported Maegar Varn's desire to become good neighbours."
msgstr "좋은 이웃이 되려는 메이가르 반을 지지합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "4b56461a-0df2-45fa-b899-a99c214f6836"
msgid "\"I'm glad we see eye to eye on the issue.\""
msgstr "\"함께 문제를 해결하는 것은 좋은 일이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "63f645b9-896c-4ed4-b2b2-45c9a97242b9"
msgid "Ignored Maegar Varn's suggestion to become good neighbours."
msgstr "좋은 이웃이 되려는 메이가르 반의 제안을 무시합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "6a674824-c4b3-4de0-ba8c-d8a786440bf5"
msgid "\"Whatever you say.\""
msgstr "\"어쩌라는 것인가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4104c15d-4fe1-42e4-a5a4-63adcbafdfd9"
msgid "Washed out Maegar Varn's suggestion to become good neighbours."
msgstr "좋은 이웃이 되려는 메이가르 반의 제안을 조롱합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "de5faa48-9ac4-4239-b940-403ae805b34b"
msgid "\"Helping out competitors is a fool's errand.\""
msgstr "\"경쟁자를 돕다니. 바보군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "fb66e0f3-347e-4f22-b52c-e0f2d51d41cd"
msgid ""
"[Nod at the merchant] \"Taking the reins of government into your own hands?\""
msgstr "[상인을 보며 끄덕입니다] \"행정 통제력은 전부 손에 쥐었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "a5824ebf-5015-4640-8020-fa67d9d4a11d"
msgid "\"Let me ask you directly — who else are you allied with?\""
msgstr "\"단도직입적으로 물어볼게 있어. 당신은 또 누구와 동맹을 맺었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "ba7a2738-5530-445b-bc80-0de43bb75f4a"
msgid ""
"\"I've just remembered a treasure hunter who was on his way to Tors of the "
"Levenies. Have you heard of Willas Gunderson?\""
msgstr "\"레베니스 바위산맥으로 향하던 보물 사냥꾼이 기억나는군. 윌라스 건더슨이라고 들어봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "00342a1a-33ca-4c29-85c5-c7f4a33873fc"
msgid "\"Valerie, it was a simple compliment.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 그냥 인사야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "6fc78b87-91d8-485f-ad14-02548a2ad17b"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "b9f4929d-c6af-4e92-ac0c-a0f349cfe64a"
msgid "\"I hope the matter is closed.\""
msgstr "\"이 문제는 끝난 걸로 했으면 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "82dd1650-b321-405f-826e-81e87067738a"
msgid "\"Valerie, compose yourself.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 진정해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "67fcd2e4-3d6a-4dec-bd34-be4b40ae615e"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you is a tall, robust man. A few white scars cross his face, his "
"dark hair is gathered back in a small ponytail, and the sleeves of his "
"expensive doublet do little to hide the muscles beneath. Although irritated "
"by the argument, a wide smile lights up his face as he recognizes you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 키가 크고 몸집이 좋은 남자가 있습니다. 얼굴에 흉터 두어개가 나있고 검은 머리를 꽁지 머리로 묶은 이 남자는 비싸보이는 "
"옷 밑으로 근육이 선명하게 보입니다. 말싸움을 했음에도 불구하고 그는 푸근한 미소를 지으며 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0778506b-b44e-4767-83c1-5d74307067e1"
msgid "\"A pleasure to see you again, baron{mf||ess}!\""
msgstr "\"다시 봐서 반갑군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "05d87c8e-4c71-447c-84a4-00f5f64c8c84"
msgid ""
"\"Whom do I see! {name}, my friend! Welcome to {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}! I "
"am Maegar Varn, I run the town here. I hope you had no trouble on the roads?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게 누구신가! {name}! {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}에 온 것을 환영하네! 이 마을을 운영하는 메이가르 반이라고 하지. "
"오는 길은 불편하지는 않았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "39508271-75bd-477c-8edc-b67509ac1141"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar laughs pleasantly.{/n} \"Don't mention it, old friend! We "
"adventurers help each other out, am I right?\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 친절하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"말도 말아! 우리는 함께 도우며 여행했지. 안 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "e6986ca8-c9d6-4654-ba66-5508be047648"
msgid ""
"\"Look at this from another perspective, my friend — this is a chance to "
"survey your eastern borders and make sure you've got no one but allies here. "
"It's better to see for yourself than to rely on my words alone, am I right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 관점으로도 한번 생각해보게나. 이 기회에 자네 영지의 동쪽 국경을 조사하고, 이곳엔 동맹 외에는 아무도 없다는 것을 확인할 수 "
"있지 않은가. 내 말만 믿는것 보다는 직접 보는 게 낫지. 그렇지 않은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "ad1446d8-f10e-4c1d-98ed-a62644e28a27"
msgid ""
"\"Much remains to be done. What you see now is just the beginning. "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g} has a shining future, just you wait! By next year "
"we'll begin building a tract to your capital, and establish river trade with "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아직 할 일이 많이 남았어. 네가 본 것은 시작에 불과해. {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}는 미래가 밝으니 기다리라고! 내년 "
"쯤이면 우리는 너희 수도로 가는 길을 만들고 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}와 수상 무역을 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "b1706ab7-8ee9-4467-861f-e25bc1850ad4"
msgid ""
"\"Right now, {g|Dunsward}Dunsward{/g} is not particularly welcoming, but I "
"aim to change that. As soon as we get a foothold here, we'll begin clearing "
"the land of creatures, monsters and spriggans alike. The people must feel "
"safe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금 당장은 {g|Dunsward}던스워드{/g}는 좋은 곳이 못되지만, 나는 곧 바꿔나갈걸세. 우린 이곳에 발판을 마련하는대로, 이 "
"땅에 사는 짐승들, 괴물들, 그리고 스프리건들부터 깨끗이 치우기 시작할거야. 사람들이 좀더 안심하겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "3a3ed434-6c90-4c60-b38e-144d78b758f2"
msgid ""
"\"We've got enough on our hands at the moment! Although, in the future — who "
"knows, who knows…\""
msgstr "\"우리는 지금 사람은 충분해! 하지만 미래에는 모르지... 누가 알겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "515e122f-a799-4161-8d84-086b7cd8feb8"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar studies you for a moment in silence, then bursts into laughter.{/n}"
" \"Just don't think I'll start off by marching my guard over the mountains "
"to your doorstep! There's plenty of land east for my people to patrol "
"without tresspassing on my allies!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 잠시 당신을 쳐다보다가 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"내가 경비를 산 너머 너희 땅으로 보낸다는 생각은 말아! 동쪽에는 "
"땅이 넓어서 동맹의 땅을 침범하지 않아도 되니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "fb606fbf-a871-4d2c-98ab-6ee128a49be1"
msgid ""
"\"Hm? Ah, yes, you mean Cephal Lorentus, my wizard. Codger's hardly a "
"pleasure to talk to, but when it comes to knowledge of the arcane, he's "
"without match.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음? 아. 그래. 케팔 로렌투스 말인가. 내 마법사지. 그 영감은 대화를 즐기는 사람은 아니지만, 마법 지식 만큼은 상대할 사람이 "
"없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "dc63b689-0aa4-44d2-ab41-51597f1c2a85"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes the locals bring me curious objects — they unearth them while "
"plowing or stumble upon them while patrolling the wilderness. If the object "
"looks interesting, I send them to Cephal — let him separate the wheat from "
"the chaff.\""
msgstr ""
"가끔 주민들이 나에게 특이한 물건을 가져다주고는 하지. 밭을 갈다가 혹은 들판을 돌아다니다가 무언가 발견하고는 하니까. 흥미로운 것이라면 "
"케팔에게 보내면 그가 물건을 감별해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "206560ae-fc39-49ea-bdec-c16707517ccf"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so, baron{mf||ess}…? Well then, I'll note your opinion for the "
"future.\""
msgstr "\"그렇단 말이지? 네 말은 기억해두고있겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "37f90b78-33c8-403e-93e7-5ef6ad58f081"
msgid ""
"\"Treat your neighbor as you wish to be treated yourself — am I right?\""
msgstr "\"대접 받고 싶으면 예의를 갖춰야지. 그렇지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "66b2a6d2-6e49-423c-a174-e3fa27975b5a"
msgid "\"That's why we get along so well, my friend!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 정말 잘 맞는 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "9a651853-605b-44f4-8d75-87c246fabe4d"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar grins.{/n} \"Trying to, at least. I have to admit, conquering "
"these lands was far easier than keeping the greedy merchants in check!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르가 씨익 웃습니다.{/n} \"적어도 노력 중이라네. 이 땅을 정복하는 것이 욕심 많은 상인들을 통제하는 것보다 훨씬 "
"쉬웠다는 것을 인정해야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "afbbef30-764d-465b-942b-0ba6a42b0146"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar narrows his eyes at you, then nods.{/n} \"Cutting to the chase, "
"eh? Very well, we have more in common than you'd think…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 당신을 향해 눈을 가늘게 뜨고 나서 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"바로 본론으로 들어간다는건가? 좋아. 우리에겐 생각보다 "
"많은 공통점이 있어…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "da38e0be-5778-4c05-aa44-51bfe3e9ef1a"
msgid ""
"\"Here's the truth — I don't trust those who sit in the north. They send "
"fellows like us out to do all the dirty work. You and I share this frontier, "
"{name}, and I'd rather bet on our mutual interest as neighbors than on the "
"distant {g|Swordlords}Swordlords{/g} and their like.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자 솔직히 말하지. 난 북쪽 녀석들을 믿지 않아. 그들은 우리 같은 자들을 보내서 더러운 일들을 전부 시키고 있어. {name}, "
"자네와 나는 국경을 공유하고 있으니, 멀리 있는 {g|Swordlords}소드로드들{/g}보다는 차라리 이웃 간에 상호이익을 보는 것에 "
"내 승부를 걸고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "aedeefce-933c-4b81-82a8-7c9c6c5fd9d0"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, you bet! An energetic fellow, although a bit meddlesome. Luckily, he "
"spends most of his time prowling about in search of imaginary treasure, and "
"that keeps him occupied.\""
msgstr "\"하! 성가셔도 활기찬 친구구만. 그는 상상의 보물을 찾는데 시간을 보내느라 정신이 없었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "65477a3d-6b9d-4ec0-9bfd-eafe68561b7e"
msgid "\"Words of a worthy ruler.\""
msgstr "\"훌륭한 통치자의 발언이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "49e399a2-52d7-403b-9adb-1c37ad3c0fd4"
msgid "\"You sure about that? Watch yourself, because I'll be watching you!\""
msgstr "\"확실한 거야? 조심해. 내가 널 감시할 테니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "074995ad-8833-40d3-b5a3-f09a77914fba"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Varn}Varn{/d} jokingly lifts his hands into the air.{/n} \"Peace, "
"peace!\""
msgstr "{n}{d|Varn}반{/d}은 장난스럽게 손을 하늘로 뻗칩니다.{/n} \"평화, 평화!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "49e42582-2c55-4e98-a5cb-709581a78516"
msgid ""
"\"Oh! What a fair lady has accompanied you! It's a pleasure to meet you. "
"Such beauty is a rarity, especially in these harsh lands.\" "
"{n}{d|Varn}Varn{/d} attempts to kiss Valerie's hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오! 숙녀가 오셨군! 만나서 반가워요. 이런 미인은 특히나 이런 척박한 곳에서는 흔치 않지.\" {n}{d|Varn}반{/d}은 "
"발레리의 손을 잡고 키스합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9ef44a11-a7fc-4417-a857-316eed78ea6b"
msgid ""
"{n}Wincing, Valerie slips her hand from {d|Varn}Varn{/d}'s fingers.{/n} "
"\"Please keep your uncalled-for compliments to yourself, sir.\""
msgstr "{n}얼굴을 찡그리며 발레리는 {d|Varn}반{/d}의 손을 피합니다.{/n} \"그냥 인사만 받겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "df127c47-f867-4d57-8ed7-2b8ee7c33497"
msgid "\"My apologies! I meant no offense.\""
msgstr "\"미안하군! 기분을 나쁘게 하려는 건 아니었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9bafa489-298b-4c6d-bce7-b1a06a3935ce"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar looks at {d|Varn}Varn{/d} with a lecherous grin.{/n} \"Nice "
"muscles... How about meeting this evening to share a drink or two, hmm?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 {d|Varn}반{/d}을 보며 씨익 웃습니다.{/n} \"멋진 근육아군... 오늘 저녁에 술이나 한 두잔 같이 하는게 "
"어떻겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "284169ce-ad9e-4b36-a722-f14e73a3f86d"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha! Sorry, lad, I don't swing that way. But I'm always up for a "
"drink!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 미안한데 술을 좋아하지는 않아. 가끔은 많이 마시지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "6ee9ae60-b76c-4e7d-aad9-d68eb383d3b5"
msgid "\"Apology accepted.\" {n}Valerie looks away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"사과는 받겠습니다.\" {n}발레리는 시선을 외면합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "073f46a2-c8d8-47a5-b6b9-3da18b9491b9"
msgid "{n}Maegar awkwardly shifts from foot to foot and clears his throat.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 어색하게 이동한 후 헛기침을 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b9916fae-2356-40f6-8dd8-13d4fab6c640"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. Just like hundreds of other 'simple compliments' I hear day after day "
"from everyone — be they lords or vagrants.\" {n}Valerie gives you a sullen "
"look.{/n}"
msgstr "\"네. 그렇게 평소처럼 인사나 하는 것도 나쁘지 않지요.\" {n}발레리는 당신을 화난 눈빛으로 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "411d2e4c-dc5d-44b6-9370-447bd4da4053"
msgid ""
"\"Please, accept my sincere apologies once more! Let us change the subject.\""
msgstr "\"내 사과를 받아줬으면 하네! 대화의 주제를 바꿔보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "db46f988-56ea-4569-9fff-362f20086962"
msgid ""
"\"And my respect to you, lady...\" {n}{d|Varn}Varn{/d} stops when Valerie, "
"upon hearing his voice, turns around.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 여기 이 여성분께도 인사를...\" {n}발레리가 그의 목소리를 듣고 등을 돌리자 {d|Varn}반{/d}은 말을 멈추고 "
"맙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "fede5969-2c0e-449f-ae6e-6ab4a348e260"
msgid "\"Please have the decency not to stare at me, sir!\""
msgstr "\"저를 그만 빤히 쳐다보시고 예절을 갖춰 주셨으면 합니다. 영주님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "925a2ad8-9919-4213-9a6e-1f9571bd0f50"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie doesn't even dignify you with a look — she keeps staring off into "
"the distance.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리는 당신에게 눈길도 주지 않습니다. 그녀는 먼 곳을 보며 시선을 회피합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "64d5c170-5d5c-4759-9089-3aa3320c2cf0"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sneaks a guilty look at you and Maegar.{/n} \"Forgive me, "
"{mf|sirs|lady, sir}. I am... a touch moody today.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 죄책감이 서린 눈빛으로 당신과 메이가르를 바라봅니다.{/n} \"용서하십시오. 제 기분이 좋지 않았나 봅니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1769db90-ccf3-4089-912a-a15d406fc7fb"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, so there's only one 'fair lady' here? All right, fine... I'll be the "
"evil and unpredictable one, who burns down random houses and picket fences..."
"\""
msgstr "\"여기에 아가씨가 한명 뿐인가? 좋아. 그래... 나는 아무 집이나 불태우는 예측불허 악당이 되어주지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdBefore/Varn/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "77ca501a-f1a9-47e2-8aad-aae6169d55af"
msgid ""
"\"I know the story of spriggans. They're dangerous, but miserable creatures "
"in a way. Is it really necessary to exterminate them to live in peace and "
"happiness?\""
msgstr "\"스프리건 이야기는 알고 있어. 그들은 위험하지만 불쌍하기도 하지. 평화롭게 살기 위해 그들을 없애는 것이 옳은 일일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "2bb0a6a4-b76f-4f15-9a63-12a61bea0b6c"
msgid "\"I don't waste my breath talking to scum like you. Prepare to die!\""
msgstr "\"너와 같은 쓰레기와 말을 섞지 않겠어. 죽을 준비 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "dc7f2933-05f9-494e-b670-ad32d6e55942"
msgid "\"Forced out of your home? What do you mean?\""
msgstr "\"집에서 쫓겨났다고? 무슨 의미지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "e6b5d0d4-6e6d-4510-aa36-d53826f84367"
msgid "\"What are you on about? You attacked the citizens of Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 말이야? 네가 반홀드의 시민을 공격했잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "6d102813-4634-42c6-b05e-31680c7c0137"
msgid "\"Are you saying the city was empty before you got here?\""
msgstr "\"네가 오기 전에 도시가 텅 비었다는 말인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e2b51ad1-a553-456f-98d2-6962883001de"
msgid "Let Agai and other spriggans stay in their old lair."
msgstr "아가이와 다른 스프리건이 안식처에 머무르게 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "c1da4186-10e3-4753-9a4c-c3e2d6e23378"
msgid ""
"\"I believe that you and your kin aren't to blame for the disappearance of "
"Varnhold's citizens. I'll let you leave in peace. Just tell me where your "
"den is — perhaps I could pay you a visit and help you get your home back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 네 동족은 반홀드의 시민이 사라지는 일과 관련이 없어. 너희를 보내주겠다. 너희가 사는 곳이 어디인지만 말해라. 너에게 가서 "
"집을 되찾는 걸 도와줄 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "609469f0-28c8-445e-ae41-0c70c9e62075"
msgid "Killed Agai, ringleader of spriggan squatters."
msgstr "스프리건의 리더인 아가이를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "31407227-0459-4a74-9a55-90fb32d0190b"
msgid "[Attack] \"Time to clear the vermin from Varnhold.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"반홀드에서 해충을 박멸할 시간이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "93f2fbd9-5d66-4e81-b661-c69aa9a1ff74"
msgid "\"Where are all the locals?\""
msgstr "\"주민들은 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0028_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ccde5741-3906-405e-b06e-fbc4dde5e37f"
msgid "Spared Agai, ringleader of spriggan squatters."
msgstr "스프리건의 리더인 아가이를 살려두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "294ff5e3-4f18-4d7c-8b08-003a57cf5221"
msgid ""
"\"I'll let you go this one time. But mark my words: if you ever come to one "
"of our towns or villages again, I'll make sure you regret it!\""
msgstr "\"이번 한 번은 살려주겠다. 하지만 명심해라: 다시 도시나 마을을 침범하면 후회하게 해주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "831b56f6-d5f5-4ce7-be3b-09e6fb16de55"
msgid "\"Where's your former home?\""
msgstr "\"네 예전 마을은 어디있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "8e7bc1b1-c2da-4b1e-b575-2b6d496d79ff"
msgid "\"Last chance, Agai. Talk, or you'll regret your stubbornness.\""
msgstr "\"마지막 기회다. 아니면 고집 부린 걸 후회할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "7bd57108-cc1b-4f6b-ada1-b05bdb99556d"
msgid ""
"\"You've nothing to lose anyway, Agai, and I need to locate the missing "
"citizens of Varnhold. Our troubles may be more closely related than you "
"realize. Please, help me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 잃을 것이 없어. 나는 반홀드의 실종된 시민을 찾아야 하지. 네 생각보다 우리가 가진 어려움은 관련이 많아. 나를 도와줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "74d111c7-bfc4-40a2-96e3-ba49c2ceeacf"
msgid "\"Whatever. I'll locate the den myself.\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든 너희가 사는 곳은 찾아낼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "71726165-dad9-4746-bf0b-12e17a1f8dc4"
msgid "\"At least tell me who forced you and your kin from your home.\""
msgstr "\"누가 너희를 쫓아냈는지만 말해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "440539a0-8128-4ced-99e9-a2298033aeef"
msgid "\"What would I do without you, Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"너 없이 어떻게 하라고. 트리스티안?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "8392cd1a-71bc-4698-b68d-f9d50e49cf5d"
msgid "[Silently retrieve the map]"
msgstr "[조용히 지도를 받습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "48a860f7-e81e-4003-8028-cec9555a2ca3"
msgid ""
"{n}The biggest spriggan, scarred and beaten, bares his rotting teeth.{/n} \"I"
" guess we can't rest even here!\""
msgstr "{n}상처와 흉터가 있는 가장 큰 거대한 스프리건이 썩은 이빨을 드러내고 있습니다.{/n} \"여기서도 쉴 수 없겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "1eec6df2-3ad6-4f08-892c-1cd64b73b1c4"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai steps back, pressing his hand against his bleeding wounds.{/n} \"Well"
", you got me...\" {n}he hisses through clenched teeth.{/n} \"Go on, then! "
"Keep hounding us, pushing us back! Clearly taking all we had wasn't enough!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아가이는 뒤로 물러나 피가 흐르는 상처를 손으로 누릅니다.{/n} \"네가 이겼다...\" {n}그는 이를 악물고 말합니다.{/n} \"마음대로 "
"해라! 우리를 계속 괴롭히던가! 우리가 가진 걸 다 가져간 것만으론 부족한가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "384b29e4-90a0-4ec3-af6c-fa575642864f"
msgid ""
"\"I bet you followed our trail from our very den. Forcing us from our home "
"wasn't enough — now you've come to finish us off! Well, Agai will not make "
"this easy for you!\""
msgstr "\"굴에서부터 우리를 미행했겠지. 우리를 쫓아내는 걸로 모자라서 끝장내려고 왔구나! 아가이는 쉽게 죽지 않을 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "4a19c0ef-1296-45ae-b283-bb21e3daf35f"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai swings his blade and utters a shrill battle cry as he charges "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 칼을 휘두르고 날카로운 전투 함성을 지르며 돌격합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "b0f1c5a1-931b-4d30-9a26-db72e3b6910c"
msgid ""
"\"You think me a fool? You attacked us! In our own home! And now you've "
"followed us here to finish the job! How could we possibly bother anyone in "
"an empty city?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"날 바보로 생각하는 거냐? 네가 우리를 공격했잖아! 바로 우리의 마을에서! 그리고 이제 우리를 끝장내려고 쫓아왔잖아! 이 텅 "
"빈 도시에서 우리가 어떻게 사람들을 괴롭힐 수 있겠어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "b2b4ca94-7328-4530-9ca8-fa4f6fb4ad67"
msgid ""
"\"Who cares? We arrived, and no one else was here. We checked for traps, we "
"checked for ambushes — nothing! Totally livable.\" {n}Agai is silent a "
"moment.{/n} \"If I knew you'd follow us, I'd have taken everyone even "
"further away...\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 사정은 알 바 아니고. 우리가 왔을 때는 아무도 없었다. 덫이나 매복이 있나 확인도 했지. 아무것도 없었어!\" {n}아가이는 "
"잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"네가 미행한 것을 알았더라면, 모두 더 멀리 데려갔을 텐데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "f48221a9-c8e6-46a4-a7ee-ee5e5fc19350"
msgid ""
"\"Like you don't know! The cave to the north, where I lived my entire life "
"before your kind came! Enough — I'm done running!\""
msgstr ""
"\"시치미 떼지 마! 북쪽의 동굴은 너희들이 오기 전까지 내가 평생 살았던 곳이야! 이제 됐어 — 더 이상 도망치지 않겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "9126e2b7-a215-4322-ba1b-97dab6993ecc"
msgid ""
"\"No clue. Eaten by someone? Just gone? They left their belongings behind, "
"doors wide open — anyone could walk in and take what they like!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무 단서도 없어. 누가 잡아먹었나? 그냥 증발해 버린 건가? 짐은 그대로 두고, 문도 활짝 열려 있었지 — 아무나 들어가서 "
"마음에 드는 거 집어 갈 수 있을 정도였어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "0ab1cc82-3dbe-432a-a038-914136e3cfa2"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai stares at you, unblinking, then scoffs with contempt.{/n} \"A {race} "
"wants to help? Sure! I'll be surprised if I'm still breathing when we're "
"done. I bet you just want to fight your way in and take my cave for yourself!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아가이는 당신을 눈 하나 깜빡하지 않고 보면서 콧방귀를 뀝니다.{/n} \"{race}가 도움을 청한다고? 좋아! 일이 끝날때까지 "
"내 목숨이 붙어있을지 모르겠지만 말이지. 난 네가 그냥 싸워서 내 동굴을 뺏으려는 속셈이라는 데 걸겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "871f74e0-35e3-4754-b9eb-d3d02fed249c"
msgid ""
"\"But what do I care? If I'm lucky, you'll both just kill each other. Find "
"an old cave to the south — that's where you'll find the creeps who forced us "
"out. And if you by some chance manage to kick them out of there... I'll "
"know. Then we'll talk some more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 나랑 무슨 상관이야? 운이 좋으면 너희들끼리 서로 죽이겠지. 남쪽의 오래된 동굴을 찾아봐. 거기에 우리를 내쫓은 괴물들이 있다. "
"그들을 만약 쫓을 기회가 생긴다면... 내게 알려줘. 그 때 다시 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "205554b9-f6be-4d99-ade9-9aa5d7fd7c01"
msgid "{n}Agai glares at you with contempt and hatred.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 경멸하는 시선으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "f0b3aaf1-e362-489b-b76c-aedd45c8a6be"
msgid "{n}Agai grimaces.{/n} \"Fine. Give me your map. I'll point it out.\""
msgstr "{n}아가이는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"좋아. 네 지도를 줘. 표시해주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "a6550ca7-e441-4437-a3d5-aac7e276ce63"
msgid "{n}Agai bares is teeth instead of answering.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 대답하는 대신 이를 드러내보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "2511eafd-0e4b-4845-9a99-de7b9131d8fb"
msgid ""
"\"Not a lot to regret when you've got nothing left to lose! You want to kill "
"me? Go ahead and try. Just know you won't be getting my hide without a fight!"
"\""
msgstr "\"잃을 것이 없으면 후회할 것도 없다! 나를 죽이고 싶다고? 어서 죽여라. 싸움 없이 내 가죽을 가지지는 못할 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "f944440d-2bb0-4f6c-a45b-b3c0f3360ff7"
msgid ""
"\"None of my kin remain there, so don't go hoping to take my brethren by "
"surprise!\""
msgstr "\"내 동족 누구도 거기에 살지 않으니까 나를 기습해서 죽일 생각은 말아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "8cb0b91a-8905-46dd-8178-59d7dd1d30a5"
msgid ""
"\"People like you, but bigger. Stronger.\" {n}Agai sniffs the air.{/n} \"And "
"more fetid.\""
msgstr "\"너희 같은 녀석들이지만 크다. 힘도 세지.\" {n}아가이는 콧방귀를 뀝니다.{/n} \"그리고 냄새도 고약해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "a7349e15-ceb5-41fb-a1e2-1a4637e140dd"
msgid "\"I do not believe you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 못 믿겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "3bce657b-a116-4d35-a1d4-b56b92300c87"
msgid ""
"\"Believe what you want, I don't care! I'm not going to make up excuses for "
"the likes of you!\""
msgstr "\"믿건 말건 마음대로 해라, 나는 상관없다! 너 같은 녀석에게 할 변명 따윈 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0b6ca6eb-9180-418d-bda6-8351afc83b57"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Agai. You have no reason to like us, I understand that. But "
"something sinister is going on here in {g|Dunsward}Dunsward{/g}. So far, "
"only humans have suffered from it, but it may eventually get to your people "
"as well. Please help us stop it. We are doing this not for our own sake, but "
"for the sake of everyone living in Dunsward!\""
msgstr ""
"\"들어보세요, 아가이. 우리를 좋아할 이유가 없는 건 알아요. 하지만 뭔가 이상한 일이 {g|Dunsward}던스워드{/g}에서 "
"벌어지고 있어요. 지금은 인간들만이 고통을 받았지만 결국에는 너희 같은 녀석들도 당할 겁니다. 그것을 멈추게 도와주세요. 우리를 위해서가 "
"아니라 던스워드에 사는 모든 살아있는 종족들을 위한 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "50cc7fc8-5167-4473-9ab9-2f38080e4480"
msgid "\"What a bunch of goodies you are.\""
msgstr "\"정말 좋은 녀석이구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b2da12c2-29f2-4c93-85d1-78076e2fd268"
msgid "{n}Tristian gratefully nods to Agai, then steps back.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 아가이를 보고 감사하며 고개를 끄덕이고는 물러섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2277fef1-482f-4b52-923a-4a3ec748e3ec"
msgid ""
"\"A helpful hand opens many doors.\" {n}Tristian glances at you warmly.{/n} "
"\"You know that better than most.\""
msgstr ""
"\"도움이 있다면 더 쉽게 일을 해결하겠어.\" {n}트리스티안은 따뜻한 시선으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"그 편이 더 낫겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "0100bed4-07ef-4890-8810-82c939c54c05"
msgid "\"Well? Now what?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 맙소사.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "0648dd90-785d-4c09-954a-eabba9002beb"
msgid "{n}Agai backs away slowly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 천천히 물러섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ce4e62c8-77b1-4c5e-927c-eb3562973661"
msgid ""
"\"I think he will not risk it again — meaning he and his kin are no threat "
"to the dwellers of {g|Dunsward}Dunsward{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제 생각엔 그는 다시 위험을 감수하지 않을 겁니다. 그 녀석들은 {g|Dunsward}던스워드{/g} 사람들의 위협이 되지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "36a9decc-b664-4193-95e8-eaa6e98da84f"
msgid ""
"\"Good gods, what a stubborn creature you are! {name} grants you not just "
"life — {mf||s}he promised to retrieve your home! You could at least thank "
"the person who could have been your executioner!\""
msgstr ""
"\"선신들이여, 넌 정말 완고한 생물이구나! {name}의 호의로 너는 목숨만이 아니라 집도 되찾아 주기로 약속받은거야! 너를 죽일 수도 "
"있었지만 최소한 감사라도 해야 하는 것 아니냐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/AgaiDialog/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : SprigganBoss
msgctxt "9bca1af8-665d-4774-9fd1-c4983b0b5916"
msgid ""
"{n}Agai sizes the woman up with a hostile glare and shakes his head.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아가이는 적대적인 눈빛으로 발레리를 가늠하고는 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Agai_BattleBegins_String
msgctxt "d48e8b32-a4b5-4675-90a8-26eb1ee07a6f"
msgid "\"Tear this scum's throat out!\""
msgstr "\"이 쓰레기를 찢어죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Agai_ResumeFight_String
msgctxt "00aa884c-9f4e-4fa1-aa5b-c9c8e0293217"
msgid "\"I'll take you down with me!\""
msgstr "\"너를 쓰러뜨려주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Agai_Spared_String
msgctxt "35cc9911-e2a3-4347-af58-c2f4b897e57f"
msgid "\"Don't follow me!\""
msgstr "\"따라오지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/DrunkenSpriggan_bark1_String
msgctxt "0d17d2d9-6fd8-455a-a735-16f8865d6dfc"
msgid "\"Hic... Think we're out of booze.\""
msgstr "\"끅... 술이 떨어진 것 같네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/DrunkenSpriggan_bark2_String
msgctxt "f2dc5292-8992-42c2-9887-a9af6e2f46a8"
msgid ""
"\"Hey... hic, over there... Demons, hic! From the First World! Attack, hic!\""
msgstr "\"이봐... 딸꾹. 거기... 데몬이다! 퍼스트 월드의 데몬아! 딸꾹!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Envir_BrokenDoors_String
msgctxt "06ca47b7-a338-4785-82ea-8ba6e6859e9c"
msgid ""
"The remnants of a door lie in the dust, obviously removed through brute "
"force."
msgstr "문 앞을 막고 있던 것은 강제로 제거된 것이 분명합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Envir_Forge_String
msgctxt "557bcb76-57de-4f41-8b35-a4f053dd14e9"
msgid "The anvil and furnace are covered in a thick layer of dust."
msgstr "모루와 용광로는 두꺼운 먼지가 쌓였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Envir_Garbage_String
msgctxt "077ac62e-4043-4907-afcd-c9414a9489a8"
msgid ""
"Anything you could imagine lies jumbled in this pile — fragments of "
"kitchenware, unharmed dishes, broken furniture, broken weapons, and warped "
"arrows. Judging from the smell, there's spoiled food somewhere in there, too."
msgstr ""
"여기에 쌓여있는 쓰레기 더미들은 부엌 식기, 부서진 가구, 무기, 부러진 화살 등입니다. 냄새로 보아 썩은 음식도 있던 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Envir_PigstyPen_String
msgctxt "63cd2735-011e-443b-8ddb-e4c035e58704"
msgid "The cloying smell of manure engulfs the corral."
msgstr "썩은 내가 진동을 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Envir_Well_Fail_String
msgctxt "a846dc98-79b5-407c-8b1b-9ae5a985166b"
msgid "It's too dark in the well to see anything."
msgstr "우물 안을 보기에는 너무 어둡습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Envir_Well_Success_String
msgctxt "137fc9d5-7a7d-43bd-8fd5-2acd84bf4fd1"
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the well, half hidden underwater, lies a broken bucket tied "
"to a piece of rope — and a dead spriggan with a broken neck."
msgstr "우물 바닥은 물이 잠겨있어 불투명했고 부러진 양동이가 로프에 묶여있습니다. 그리고 목이 부러져 죽은 스프리건도 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Patrol1_bark_String
msgctxt "640a9ea7-86cf-45a3-9152-b3a5004940e3"
msgid "\"We're under attack! To battle, everyone!\""
msgstr "\"공격을 당했다! 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Spriggan_Attack01_String
msgctxt "1ba48dd4-36c2-424c-af5d-bf0568084a06"
msgid "\"Get out of my home!\""
msgstr "\"내 집에서 나가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Barks/Spriggan_Attack02_String
msgctxt "510cfaea-19d5-49c9-99ef-5bebc1461a3d"
msgid "\"They're back! Kill them before they call for more!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 돌아왔다! 더 많이 오기 전에 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Items/Letter_with_Threats_Name_String
msgctxt "b59a0eae-2bb5-47a8-92c3-0d7d8cc45a97"
msgid "A Letter with Threats"
msgstr "협박 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Items/Letter_with_Threats_String
msgctxt "d6ec9b6d-cdc9-4ab8-af32-cdc1b4f44aaf"
msgid ""
"\"Baron Maegar Varn,\n"
"I am writing to you as your ally and well-wisher. The reason for my letter "
"is the lack of foresight in your actions. You're trying so hard to become "
"friends with this {mf|baron|baroness} from {kingdomname}. You invite "
"{mf|him|her} to pay you a visit, you assure {mf|him|her} of sincerity, you "
"even send rich gifts. Have you nothing more to do in your lands? I strongly "
"recommend you to stop flirting with this upstart person and turn your gaze "
"to the affairs of the day. You are trying to cross the path with powerful "
"forces that can reach you even in your own castle. You should know your "
"place.\n"
"With wishes of good health and calm sleep,\n"
"your friend\""
msgstr ""
"\"메이가르 반 남작\n"
"너의 동맹이자 네가 잘되길 바라는 사람으로써 조언 하나 하지. 이 편지를 쓴 이유는 너를 일깨우게 하기 위함이다. {kingdomname}"
"의 {mf|남작|여남작}과 친해지려 많은 노력을 하더군. 초대를 하고, 진실하게 대하고, 심지어 비싼 선물도 주었지. 네 땅에서는 할 "
"일이 없는 건가? 그 파릇파릇한 녀석과 장난은 그만하고 다른 일을 해라. 너에게 영향력을 행사할 수 있는 자들의 심기를 건들지 마라. "
"주제를 알기를 바란다.\n"
"안녕과 평온을 기원하며,\n"
"너의 친구\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Items/Varn_unfinished_letter_String
msgctxt "57c89297-5d1c-4fb0-bb81-96064cdee39c"
msgid ""
"\"Most honorable {mf|Baron|Baroness} {name}!\n"
"I am Baron Maegar Varn of Varnhold, and I am writing to inquire about the "
"current state of affairs in your realm. I hope that no trouble or pestilence "
"have found their way to your lands. Perhaps we could arrange a neighborly "
"meeting soon to discuss things — at your leisure, of course.\n"
"I would also like to request your aid in a small matter. A few days back, an "
"adventurer by the name of Willas Gunderson retrieved a mysterious bracelet "
"from one of the ancient ruins scattered across Dunsward. Gunderson kindly "
"turned it over to my court wizard, Cephal, who continues to examine it as it "
"lies on the table before me. It may be the most peculiar thing I have ever "
"laid eyes on. The bracelet is covered in angular patterns that resemble a "
"labyrinth, and it is adorned with an inscription in an unknown language. No "
"learned man in Varnhold has been able to read this writing or deduce which "
"culture the artifact belongs to. So, I ask for your aid: please, if you have "
"an archivist with deep knowledge of the history of this region, send them "
"along to aid us in solving this mystery. I am sure that your capital has "
"plenty of such learned men and women. Perhaps one of them will succeed in "
"reading this inscription. Of course, I will return the VORDAKAI VORDAKAI "
"VORDAKAI VORDA\""
msgstr ""
"\"존경하는 {mf|남작|여남작} {name}!\n"
"나는 남작 메이가르 반일세. 그리고 난 자네 땅에서 일어나는 일에 대해 물을 것이 있어 편지를 쓰는군. 영토에 걱정거리가 없기를 바라지. "
"아마도 우린 조만간 몇 가지 토론거리로 이웃 간의 회담을 마련할 수 있을거네, 물론 자네가 바쁘지 않을 때 말이야.\n"
"사소한 문제인데 자네의 도움을 요청하고 싶네. 며칠 전 윌라스 건더슨이라는 모험가가 신비한 팔찌를 던스워드에 산재해 있던 고대 폐허들 중 "
"한 곳에서 가져왔다네. 건더슨은 친절하게도 그 팔찌를 내 궁정 마법사 케팔에게 주었고, 그가 팔찌를 조사했지. 그 팔찌는 지금 내 앞의 "
"테이블 위에 올려져 있다네. 난생 처음보는 가장 기이한 물건인지도 모르겠어. 그 팔찌는 미궁과 같은 복잡한 문양이 조각되어 있는데, 알 "
"수 없는 언어도 적혀있었어. 반홀드에는 그 언어를 아는 자가 없고 그게 어떤 문명의 물건인지도 아는 사람이 없지. 그래서 도움을 "
"청하는데. 이 지역에 관해 역사 지식이 있는 학자가 있다면 이 비밀을 풀도록 그 사람을 보내주었으면 하네. 그 쪽에는 학식이 풍부한 "
"사람이 많다고 들었는데. 그 중에 누군가는 이 비문을 읽을 수 있을지도 모르지. 물론 보답으로 보다카이 보다카이 보다카이 보다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/Items/Varn_unfinished_letter_name_String
msgctxt "90366052-fcc4-4f11-ab50-2532578df8d8"
msgid "Unfinished Letter from Maegar Varn"
msgstr "메이가르의 쓰다 만 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/OverWall/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "aa6557e4-bf6c-4a19-84a4-5ace4f44c5d0"
msgid "[Try to climb over the wall]"
msgstr "[벽을 올라가려고 했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/OverWall/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "db4a7360-0b0f-4a0f-bae8-12cb362101bf"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠난다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/OverWall/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "2214b22f-322c-490e-b55f-d7d84b448ca0"
msgid ""
"{n}This spot in the wall has been damaged by a fallen birch tree. The tops "
"of the logs used to construct the wall have been broken, and the logs "
"themselves stand askew. The thin birch tree still leans against it. A "
"dexterous enough individual could probably climb up the trunk and get over "
"the wall...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 벽은 쓰러지는 나무에 의해 일부분이 부서진 것 같습니다. 통나무의 끝부분이 부서진 벽의 부위에 걸쳐있었고 나머지 부분은 기울어져 "
"바닥에 이어져있습니다. 쓰러진 나무는 여전히 벽을 기대고 있습니다. 민첩한 사람이라면 쓰러진 나무를 타고 벽을 넘어갈 수 있을 것 "
"같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/OverWall/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "226d5f20-6008-4293-8f2e-b53d5cb9cdc4"
msgid ""
"{n}The trunk of the birch tree is slippery, and the logs of the wall shift "
"precariously under your weight, but you manage to make it over the wall.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}나무의 줄기가 미끄러웠고 통나무는 당신의 무게를 받자 조금 움직였지만 당신은 벽을 넘을 수 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VarnholdStockade/OverWall/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "f8b3f839-ed21-44c2-944c-1accb4daa9b2"
msgid ""
"{n}The moment you put pressure on the birch tree, you hear a deafening "
"creak. Jumping back just in time, you see the trunk crack in half and fall — "
"the inside had rotted through. It seems you have no choice but to go in "
"through the front door.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}체중이 나무를 누르자 당신은 갈라지는 소리를 들었습니다. 가까스로 피해서 당신은 나무가 반으로 부러지는 것을 보았습니다. 나무 "
"안쪽이 썩어있었습니다. 문으로 들어갈 수 밖에 없는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "627db021-a2cf-4c2e-91f9-1d04c75af7d5"
msgid "\"Who are you and what are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구며 여기서 뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "c97efd15-8293-4983-8404-3adebce7bed2"
msgid "\"A daemon guards the exit.\""
msgstr "\"다이몬이 출구를 지키고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "371f63dd-b037-47fd-889e-229a51278617"
msgid "\"Hold on, I have to take care of something else first.\""
msgstr "\"기다려. 먼저 해야 할 일이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "d9fc1e3d-8398-4719-bf13-89194664024d"
msgid "Freed imprisoned barbarians despite the danger they could face."
msgstr "야만인들이 위험에 처할지도 모르지만 그들을 풀어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "9c4f2ba9-6ab1-44bf-a6ea-55167b9bd4b6"
msgid ""
"[Remove the shackles] \"No one has the right to put you in chains. You are "
"free.\""
msgstr "[사슬을 풉니다] \"너희가 묶여있을 필요는 없어. 너희는 자유다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "0493e77c-c502-4c19-a6e2-eef99a739546"
msgid "\"What did you see while imprisoned here?\""
msgstr "\"갇혔을 때 무엇을 보았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3aa4f630-4645-4547-95f2-605d09a431ca"
msgid "Killed imprisoned barbarians."
msgstr "갇힌 야만인들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "55e63f6c-fded-4541-af65-e7e743c5a8f4"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"And let the guards here have the pleasure of killing you? No, "
"I'll be the one to finish you off!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"경비들이 너희를 재미 삼아 죽이게 두라고? 너희 목숨을 걷어가는 건 나다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "08706f13-9176-4aeb-ad75-4b6e04952c28"
msgid "\"This is Vordakai's tomb — have you seen him?\""
msgstr "\"여기는 보다카이의 무덤이야. 그를 보았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "abeeb9a8-6cff-4407-84dd-b28eb1eac069"
msgid "Promised prisoners to kill daemon."
msgstr "다이몬을 죽이겠다고 죄수에게 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "bda48ad3-3aff-41f9-9cfb-7a4d44fa3ad5"
msgid ""
"\"Wait here — you're in no condition to fight. I'll deal with the guard "
"daemon.\""
msgstr "\"기다려. 네 몸으로는 지금 싸울 수 없어. 내가 다이몬 경비를 처리하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "72e67673-b937-4e88-9b06-f4a2f29e02bf"
msgid "\"The daemon's dead. You're free.\""
msgstr "\"다이몬은 죽었다. 너는 자유야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Barks/Prisoner_Angel_String
msgctxt "1aa29ca3-9f66-4dcb-8dd1-07fd2a6757ab"
msgid ""
"\"There are prisoners here! But hold on — who are they? Careless victims who "
"stumbled here? Or servants of Vordakai?\""
msgstr "\"저기에 죄수가 있어! 잠깐 저들은 누구지? 아무런 죄가 없는 사람들인가? 아니면 보다카이의 하인일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Barks/Prisoner_AttackDaemon_String
msgctxt "f9dc61b9-1b17-4b7f-89bf-ba2d97b5f79b"
msgid "\"Onward! In Gorum's name!\""
msgstr "\"전진! 고룸의 이름으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Barks/Prisoner_NoDaemon2_String
msgctxt "e71c09a6-f353-41aa-a658-0982cb0b5e25"
msgid "\"We'll rest a bit, then look for a way out.\""
msgstr "\"잠시 쉰 다음 출구를 찾아보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Barks/Prisoner_NoDaemon_String
msgctxt "ea894c12-a84b-43e5-99b3-7199bb1a6eb5"
msgid "\"Farewell and good fortune — you'll need it in this cursed place!\""
msgstr "\"잘있어라. 이 저주받은 곳에서 행운이 필요할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "cd4d0bf1-af5b-4e23-bdab-efbf6e789c09"
msgid ""
"\"Who are you?\" {n}The man's voice is hoarse, almost a croak — you can "
"barely make out his gaunt features beneath the tangle of hair and filth "
"covering his face. His wrists are chained, and he looks half-starved, barely "
"able to raise his head — yet he does so, defiantly.{/n} \"I can see you're "
"neither dead nor daemon. Release us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"넌 누구지?\" {n}남자의 목소리는 거칠다 못해 쉬었습니다. 당신은 오물을 뒤집어 쓰고 머리가 헝클어진 그가 하는 소리를 알아듣지 "
"못했습니다. 그의 손목은 사슬로 묶여있었고 그는 굶주려 고개도 들지 못하는 것 같습니다. 하지만 그는 겨우 고개를 듭니다.{/n} \"네가"
" 죽은 놈인지 다이몬인지는 모르겠지만 나를 풀어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "a945ffce-dbb7-46e7-b8ad-8dcdc8609f04"
msgid ""
"\"We came from far {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. Dugath's group — have you heard "
"of him? We were scouting the foothills, found a strange gate... then "
"blackness took us. When we woke, we were here, shackled.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 왔다. 두가스와 함께 했지. 그를 아나? 우리는 산기슭을 정찰하다 이상한 문을 "
"발견했고... 어둠이 우리를 덮쳤다. 일어났을 때는 여기에 묶여있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "b5289c38-06b3-4fbd-8d50-f8791fc8fe25"
msgid ""
"\"Beasts with a single eye — dead half-giants, and dead a long time from the "
"look of them. They used to come and take one of us to who knows what hell. "
"There were many more of us just several days ago…\" {n}He pauses, then "
"frowns, his eyes wild.{/n} \"Hold on… how long have we been here...\""
msgstr ""
"\"외눈박이 거인이 죽어있었는데 죽은 지는 오래되어 보였다. 그들이 와서 우리를 한명씩 잡아갔지. 며칠 전에는 더 많은 동료가 "
"있었는데...\" {n}그는 멈추고는 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"잠깐... 여기에 얼마나 오래 있던 거지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ebc810de-77cc-4027-82e4-c4fb7ac02cfe"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian clenches his fists.{/n} \"No! Free us — and we'll fight "
"with all the strength we have!\""
msgstr "{n}야만인은 주먹을 쥡니다.{/n} \"안 돼! 우리를 풀어줘. 힘을 다해 싸우겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "c77e1771-9dda-46ef-9080-4454f4259768"
msgid "\"You're back!\""
msgstr "\"왔구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "49fe3cd4-ae75-4cef-b9c0-2ca3cc6fa7a7"
msgid ""
"\"Once...\" {n}He frowns.{/n} \"Once one of the beasts here came, a cyclops, "
"but not like the others — thinner, with clothes like a king, but half-eaten "
"through and almost no more than shreds. He ordered us to tell him who we "
"were and where we were from. I wanted to curse him, spit on him, kill the "
"foul thing twice if I could, but...\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 때는...\" {n}그는 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"왕처럼 옷을 입은 사이클롭스 하나가 여기로 왔는데 반 쯤 잡아먹혀 몸이 "
"얇았어. 그는 우리가 누군지 어디에서 왔는지를 물었다. 그를 저주하고 침을 뱉고 죽여버리고 싶었지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1a813a2e-0100-4d88-a67d-c88389603907"
msgid ""
"\"Did I complain about the undead being stupid? I changed my mind. Bring "
"back the brainless zombies and skeletons.\""
msgstr "\"내가 멍청한 언데드에게 불평을 했던가? 아니 차라리 그 뇌 없는 좀비와 해골들을 돌려보내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "190eeaa8-37b1-46e7-9665-9461f79a7bc9"
msgid ""
"\"Not to wound your pride, but there's no way you can defeat it. You'd just "
"die in vain. Let us deal with the monster!\""
msgstr "\"네 자존심에 상처를 입히려는 건 아니었지만 네가 그를 물리칠 방법은 없어. 헛되이 죽겠지. 우리가 그 괴물을 처리하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d9740e09-6ae9-437d-8398-1e78c1b1bc0d"
msgid "\"If they want freedom, let them fight to the last for it!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 자유를 원한다면 그들이 마지막까지 싸우도록 하게 두자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8d5f2043-c998-4d89-845c-3af0bdd23e16"
msgid ""
"\"You'll accomplish many more feats — once you've rested and healed your "
"wounds!\" {n}Octavia nods to you gratefully.{/n}"
msgstr "\"상처를 치유하고 나서 훌륭한 일을 하라구!\" {n}옥타비아는 당신을 보고 고맙다는 듯 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4e4378b8-3aa5-41e2-bde7-7f42775ec686"
msgid ""
"\"Right! They're not children to be kept safe against their will — "
"especially not in a cage. Let them have their freedom!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 그들은 의지에 반해서 갖혀있으면 안 돼! 감옥이라니. 그들을 풀어줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "c707f485-8cee-49e5-aad4-938dd20c1f82"
msgid "\"Free... Free, at last!\""
msgstr "\"자유다... 드디어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "7ca8dc04-1837-491a-b6a4-63b9593a8927"
msgid ""
"\"Letting them go to battle now would be as good as cutting their throats. "
"We should get rid of the daemon ourselves.\""
msgstr "\"지금 그들이 싸우게 하는 게 죽이는 것보다는 나아. 다이몬은 우리가 직접 처리하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "88670e97-3974-4a4a-a25b-b401b505e737"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your nobility, {name}. And now...\" {n}Valerie squares her "
"shoulders and grabs her weapon.{/n} \"Let us deal with our little problem at "
"the entrance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"도와주어 고맙습니다. {name}. 그리고 지금은...\" {n}발레리는 가슴을 펴고 무기를 쥡니다.{/n} \"입구에 있는 문제를 "
"해결해야 할 때이군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "32efca3d-b06e-433b-87cc-938616c9fc2c"
msgid ""
"{n}The man swallows, as though choking back his shame.{/n} \"Then, I started "
"spilling everything I knew — all I knew of {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, and "
"Dugath... everything!\" {n}The man snarls, baring his teeth.{/n} \"Beware "
"that one — he can twist your will with a word!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자는 부끄러움을 숨기려는 듯 침을 삼킵니다.{/n} \"그렇다면 아는 것을 모두 말하지. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}와 "
"두가스에 대해서... 전부!\" {n}남자는 이를 드러내며 화를 냅니다.{/n} \"저 녀석은 너를 속이려는 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "44a7a6ce-1ede-48ed-88a1-dbc615f3c4d8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm working on 'The Ultimate List of Undead Elven Noble Complaints.' "
"Stupid zombies, stupid barbarians, stupid peasants, ugly peasants, stupid "
"ugly peasants, bad wine. Poor Jaethal. Nobody respects Urgathoa's "
"Inquisition!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 언데드 귀족 엘프의 불만 명단을 만들어 봤어. 멍청한 좀비와 야만인, 멍청한 농민과 못생긴 농민, 멍청하고 못생긴 농민, 맛 "
"없는 와인이 엘프가 싫어하는 것들이지. 불쌍한 제이탈. 누구도 너를 존경하지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarbarianPrisoner/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2df6f1fb-c25d-45ad-9f5b-1af908cedad4"
msgid ""
"\"Joke all you want, gnome. The difference between you and me is that I'm "
"honest in my disdain, while you desperately try to hide it under your 'man "
"of the people' mask.\""
msgstr "\"마음대로 지껄여라 노움. 너는 위선적인 모습으로 너를 감추려 했지만 나는 당당하게 드러냈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/BeforeDescend_Angel_String
msgctxt "6acad13a-33ba-4883-b065-590b6b5063cd"
msgid "\"Go down… go deeper into this tomb, filled with ancient evil…\""
msgstr "\"아래로... 무덤 깊이 내려가면 고대의 악이 가득하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/DemonShrineBark_String
msgctxt "2d808a76-245c-4a85-a43b-799796b817b6"
msgid "The stone altar is covered with dried, black blood and soot."
msgstr "돌로 만들어진 제단에 피가 말라붙어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/LICHPUZZLE_BARK_FAIL_String
msgctxt "28626b6c-12ab-483c-a0a3-df0616d51ed4"
msgid "This bas-relief depcits cyclopes performing bloody rituals."
msgstr "이 조각은 피의 의식을 하는 사이클롭스의 모습이 담겨있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/LICHPUZZLE_BARK_SUCCESS_String
msgctxt "b70db5c1-2219-4e59-b029-25dae94182bf"
msgid ""
"This bas-relief depicts an ancient execution. A priest, a cyclops, is "
"bending over a victim's body with what looks like a jar — an ominous relic, "
"which can trap the creature's soul."
msgstr ""
"이 조각은 고대의 처형 장면을 묘사했습니다. 사제인 사이클롭스가 항아리로 보이는 불길한 유물에 희생자의 몸을 접어넣고 있습니다. 그것은 "
"희생자의 영혼을 가두는 물건이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/OculusFocusPlace/Eye_bark_fail_String
msgctxt "6fc5eb71-b8a6-40b6-a746-1a9c5b600449"
msgid ""
"The eye in the center of this bas-relief seems to be staring at you. It has "
"no pupil — instead there is a slight indentation, as if something is missing."
msgstr "이 조각의 중심에 있는 눈은 당신을 보는 것 같습니다. 그것은 눈동자가 없었고 마치 얇은 무언가가 조각에서 빠져나온 듯했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/OculusFocusPlace/Eye_bark_success_String
msgctxt "86c6c78d-df88-40f6-aa4d-b90cc808c9be"
msgid ""
"The eye in the center of this bas-relief seems to be staring at you. It has "
"no pupil — instead there is a slight indentation, an honoring place for a "
"magic artifact."
msgstr "이 조각의 중심에 있는 눈은 당신을 보는 것 같습니다. 그것은 눈동자가 없었고 마법 유물을 끼워 넣을 공간이 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/OculusFocusPlace/Floor_bark_String
msgctxt "46e174d1-e0be-42a5-a1fa-a577ced252c4"
msgid "Each step you take raises small clouds of dust."
msgstr "걸어가자 작은 먼지 구름이 일었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/OculusFocusPlace/Jubilost_bark_String
msgctxt "33830be4-7bd0-4e36-befb-243021d4ce17"
msgid ""
"\"Why, look at the walls — this is vastly different than the rest of this "
"tomb.\""
msgstr "\"벽을 봐. 무덤의 보통 벽과는 달라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/OculusFocusPlace/Octavia_bark_String
msgctxt "48aa71cc-19ad-43e7-b0b6-0f901a155018"
msgid ""
"\"This place makes my skin crawl. Let's leave at once — everything here "
"reeks of foul magic!\""
msgstr "\"여기는 오싹한 곳이야. 어서 여기를 뜨자. 여기에 있으면 더러운 마법에 걸릴 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/OculusFocusPlace/Wall_bark_String
msgctxt "7edc3719-17ad-4703-9259-4f0fc3fdaf3a"
msgid ""
"Images of disasters and cataclysms cover the walls. Here and there, among "
"seas of daemons tearing apart their victims, you can see the terrifying "
"shadows of four horsemen overseeing the chaos."
msgstr ""
"벽에는 재앙과 재난의 모습이 담겨있습니다. 여기저기 희생자의 몸을 찢어대는 다이몬 군대의 모습이 보였고 그 혼돈을 지켜보는 네 기수의 "
"공포스러운 그림자가 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/Pool_enviroment_Fish_String
msgctxt "dd41fb53-efc1-4c5e-93a6-ac1b9112d1d6"
msgid "Bones and fish scales are scattered across the floor."
msgstr "가시와 생선 비늘이 바닥에 흩어져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/PotPlace/Jubilost_reaction_String
msgctxt "69fdf3a6-378a-4932-af66-2d6d83e2c092"
msgid "\"Hmmm… curious examples of pre-historic culture.\""
msgstr "\"흠... 역사에도 없는 문화 양식이군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/PotPlace/Pot_01_String
msgctxt "344ed105-dd86-47d8-98bd-809960f2ba1a"
msgid "Black-and-white geometric patterns adorn this ceramic vase."
msgstr "흑백의 기하학적인 문양이 항아리를 장식했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/PotPlace/Pot_02_String
msgctxt "5be44541-b790-4733-8b0e-50cc006a09d9"
msgid ""
"This jar depicts cyclopes engaged in a competition — running a race, from "
"the looks of it."
msgstr "이 도자기는 달리기 경주를 하는 사이클롭스의 그림이 조각되어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/PotPlace/Pot_03_String
msgctxt "ed391bba-7ad3-41e1-a91c-45db8aa14515"
msgid "This amphora is decorated with paintings of white lotuses."
msgstr "이 항아리는 하얀 연꽃 그림이 그려져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/PotPlace/Pot_04_String
msgctxt "7359cac0-0210-4e6b-9581-78c7587b2863"
msgid ""
"The surface of this pot depicts a cyclops studying a pile of books and a "
"manuscript."
msgstr "이 단지의 표면은 책더미를 쌓아놓고 연구하는 사이클롭스를 묘사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/PotPlace/Statue_fail_String
msgctxt "2097fc9a-c0a2-4547-ba76-1029bf73b7c2"
msgid ""
"This bizarre bas-relief is covered with images of cyclopes, crafting strange "
"urns."
msgstr "이 기괴한 조각은 이상한 룬을 만드는 사이클롭스의 그림을 담았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/PotPlace/Statue_success_String
msgctxt "728a2601-88f7-43f1-a445-f07f510c5c77"
msgid ""
"This bizarre bas-relief depicts the creation of enchanted jars, used for "
"capturing stolen souls."
msgstr "이 기괴한 조각은 훔쳐진 영혼을 포획하는 데에 사용되는 마법 단지를 만드는 과정을 담았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/SC_Room/WallPanel1_Fail_String
msgctxt "534525a7-8c9d-4dc0-871a-03309600a1d0"
msgid "This bas-relief depicts four horsemen, wreathed in darkness."
msgstr "이 조각은 어둠에 휩싸인 네 기수를 묘사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/SC_Room/WallPanel1_Success_String
msgctxt "2fdacfb3-1752-45a5-a2fb-69f65f407a98"
msgid ""
"This bas-relief depicts the Four Horsemen of Apocalypse — powerful arch-"
"daemons who bring pain and ruin."
msgstr "이 조각은 종말의 네 기수를 묘사했습니다. 그들은 고통과 파괴를 가져오는 아크 다이몬입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/SC_Room/WallPanel2_String
msgctxt "e2041608-d35f-4e72-8c5a-df8ff5f91842"
msgid ""
"This bas-relief depicts a cataclysm — cracking earth, crumbling houses, and "
"the dead and dying, their hands desperately reaching towards the sky."
msgstr "이 조각은 땅이 갈라지고 집이 무너지면서 죽어가는 사람들이 하늘을 향해 손을 뻗는 재앙을 묘사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/SC_Room/WallPanel3_Fail_String
msgctxt "a6d409b2-f158-4726-8c84-c7568c4c90de"
msgid ""
"On this bas-relief, a sole horseman, surrounded by kneeling people, raises a "
"ball of light in his hand, triumphant. On the edge of bas-relief there is a "
"line of indecipherable ancient runes."
msgstr ""
"이 조각은 무릎 꿇은 사람들 한 가운데에 하얀색 구체를 들고 서 있는 한 기수를 묘사했습니다. 조각의 끝부분에는 해독할 수 없는 고대의 "
"룬이 선을 이루고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/SC_Room/WallPanel3_Success_String
msgctxt "ad21e52b-2c4f-4d52-8208-e8c80f6a9a40"
msgid ""
"On this bas-relief, the Horseman of Death, surrounded by kneeling figures, "
"raises a sphere of light in his hand, triumphant. An inscription reads: "
"\"VORDAKAI'S BLESSED. THE GIFT OF CHARON. THE OCULUS OF ABADDON.\""
msgstr ""
"이 조각은 무릎 꿇은 사람들 한 가운데에 하얀색 구체를 들고 서 있는 죽음의 기수를 묘사했습니다. 비문에는 이렇게 쓰여있습니다. "
"\"보다카이가 받은 축복. 케런의 선물. 나락의 눈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/WallPanel_Fail_String
msgctxt "1c6bfd8e-b803-4f88-839d-f6c05182c67d"
msgid ""
"On this bas-relief, a cyclops clad in ceremonial robes raises a luminous "
"sphere aloft. At his feet crawl numerous people, who kneel or prostrate "
"themselves before him."
msgstr ""
"이 조각은 의식용 로브를 입은 사이클롭스가 빛나는 구체를 들어올리는 모습을 묘사했습니다. 수 많은 사람들이 그에게 무릎 꿇었고 그는 그들 "
"사이를 걸어갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/BarksCommon/WallPanel_Success_String
msgctxt "a4eedffa-26c8-4a62-adf2-61435127096f"
msgid ""
"On this bas-relief, a cyclops clad in ceremonial robes raises a luminous "
"sphere aloft — the Oculus of Abaddon, a gift from the Horseman of Death. At "
"the feet of the cyclops crawl numerous people, who kneel or prostrate "
"themselves before him."
msgstr ""
"이 조각은 의식용 로브를 입은 사이클롭스가 빛나는 구체를 들어올리는 모습을 묘사했습니다. 죽음의 기수의 것이었던 나락의 눈입니다. 수 "
"많은 사람들이 그에게 무릎 꿇었고 그는 그들 사이를 걸어갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "3432d0ed-ba45-4cba-afe8-1a4aea2a3026"
msgid "\"I came to purge this place of evil!\""
msgstr "\"이 악에 물든 장소를 정화하러 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "528e4d90-ee7a-4af8-a7ed-619f065930a3"
msgid "\"Vordakai summoned me. I am here at his request.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이가 나를 소환했다. 나는 그의 요청으로 왔지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "2cb90a0d-8581-4557-b461-f0220fc54981"
msgid "\"Tell me who you are first.\""
msgstr "\"네가 누군지 먼저 말해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "f0955589-3ed0-4c94-8b61-818e32aa8143"
msgid "[Attack] \"Die, creature!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "e72d8b06-76df-4be8-8293-42bd2f3e734b"
msgid "\"I will take my leave.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Barks/Daemon_Attack_String
msgctxt "d30654dd-4381-47c7-ac64-dba0533f96f1"
msgid "\"You won't leave! Death to the intruders!\""
msgstr "\"넌 떠날 수 없다! 침입자에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Barks/Daemon_Peaceful_String
msgctxt "a6bc3af1-0aac-4455-928d-040db40c296e"
msgid "\"Then go to Vordakai, and make haste... your presence offends me.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 어서 보다카이에게 가라... 네 존재가 불쾌하구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : DaemonGuardian
msgctxt "1f192fb9-7b23-4d00-a9dd-2560514c4abb"
msgid ""
"{n}A figure lies shrouded in darkness in the center of the room — the stench "
"of decay emanates from it in waves, enough to make your breath catch in your "
"throat. As you choke back the urge to vomit, the figure turns to reveal a "
"misshapen skull with blazing eyes.{/n} \"Who comes?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}방 안 가운데에 어둠에 휩싸인 물체가 놓여있습니다. 죽음의 냄새가 물결쳐서 숨을 쉴 때 느껴집니다. 구역질이 나오려고 했지만 그 "
"물체는 타오르는 눈으로 두개골을 드러냅니다.{/n} \"누가 온 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : DaemonGuardian
msgctxt "099163ae-e70f-4e16-85ec-a575c7e6a7bc"
msgid ""
"\"A servant of death, a keeper of darkness... and all its victims. Now "
"answer my question lest you join them!\""
msgstr "\"죽음의 하인 어둠의 수호자... 그리고 그 희생자들이다. 이제 내 질문에 대답해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : DaemonGuardian
msgctxt "99b7b440-fd8f-4189-bdc8-fa928270ad10"
msgid "\"Trespasser! And soon… victim.\""
msgstr "\"침입자구나! 그리고 곧... 죽을 것이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : DaemonGuardian
msgctxt "705e6712-2920-416e-bb1e-5c7a4878a638"
msgid "\"Hmm… you do not belong here. Leave!\""
msgstr "\"흠... 너는 여기에 있어서는 안 된다. 나가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/DaemonGuard/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "b950f46d-7781-4d35-91d6-df9231f325dc"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah shivers and turns away, hiding a sudden pallor.{/n} \"Daemons... "
"I hate those creatures, along with everything else that crawls out of "
"Abaddon!\""
msgstr "{n}카네라는 몸을 떨고는 두려움을 감추려고 애씁니다.{/n} \"다이몬들... 나락에게서 기어나오는 모든 것들이 싫어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/EnterPoints/VordakaiTombLevel1_FromSecondLevel_Tooltip_String
msgctxt "6e323d48-7cb5-450b-85a5-7ff466955b3a"
msgid "To the upper level"
msgstr "윗층으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/InteractiveObjects/VordakaiTombLevel1_DemonShrineBowl_String
msgctxt "8da16a02-4752-43e4-9a81-b550a00f733d"
msgid "Sprinkle with Blood"
msgstr "뿌려지는 피"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/InteractiveObjects/VordakaiTombLevel1_DownwardPath_String
msgctxt "9ed98952-54c8-4a3c-a59a-6552afcbd444"
msgid "Way Down"
msgstr "아래로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/InteractiveObjects/VordakaiTombLevel1_PoolStairs_String
msgctxt "c1abac02-1f4e-44bc-b9f1-15069ce297c0"
msgid "Underwater Stairs"
msgstr "물에 잠긴 계단"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/InteractiveObjects/VordakaiTombLevel1_UpPath_String
msgctxt "2241faa1-57d4-41da-af94-9271577e2f21"
msgid "Way Up"
msgstr "위로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "07963654-40ca-4a00-ae1e-42117108f7ca"
msgid ""
"\"I was hoping you'd remain outside — must I kill you to keep you from "
"hounding me?\""
msgstr "\"너는 밖에 있기를 바랬는데. 나를 쫓아오지 않게 하려면 너를 죽여야 했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7cdd4d6b-919a-4e14-8da2-795f02e1b7e9"
msgid "Mocked the talking raven and his master."
msgstr "말하는 까마귀와 그 주인을 조롱합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "eee43d0f-1e81-4dd5-b372-1538675c3e29"
msgid "\"You and your master will find I'm full of surprises.\""
msgstr "\"너희는 정말 놀라운 녀석들이구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f9eca147-1b22-4847-8394-dd8fa0699118"
msgid ""
"\"I'll get your master even if I have to fight my way through the Hell, "
"Abaddon, and the Abyss to reach him.\""
msgstr "\"나락과 심연을 통과해서라도 너희 주인을 잡으러 갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "f654f0f2-7c51-495e-b40f-f86b105b65c7"
msgid "\"Jubilost.\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "2ebaeb68-111a-4acd-8879-569f9f14c8ed"
msgid "\"Octavia.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "20af8736-c316-4d3b-8887-c59207fddd66"
msgid "\"Regongar.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8a977693-54d8-4252-b365-1e534332a525"
msgid "\"Ekundayo.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤다요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "eb1ffbfe-cbc2-4516-9c80-7b2f62d92da8"
msgid "\"Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"발레리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "aeb9d45d-9cec-4655-9945-2b054d354b40"
msgid "\"Jaethal.\""
msgstr "\"제이탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "eb5fae51-6899-4a8b-a4b4-af2e8242f9e7"
msgid "\"...Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr "\"...녹-녹.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "dde8a68a-ab26-4857-a22d-be1bfb6ebc60"
msgid "\"Harrim.\""
msgstr "\"하림.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "e5acea9e-4154-4519-a2d3-46aacfd126de"
msgid "\"Amiri.\""
msgstr "\"아미리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "3e33f971-14af-4a31-b92c-3b501d0ae0b5"
msgid "\"Linzi.\""
msgstr "\"린지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "689f91e2-5cca-472c-9ca1-b5a50fd3ef96"
msgid "\"I have no time for your taunts and riddles, crow.\""
msgstr "\"네 장단에 맞춰줄 시간 없다, 까마귀\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "0d6cd2d7-d541-452b-97c0-9461cae10a9f"
msgid "\"Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "b27fd81e-53d3-4722-a1a4-e9621f64caa8"
msgid "\"Kaessi.\""
msgstr "\"카에시.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c063e34c-39df-45e1-8843-39a55c1a82b4"
msgid "\"I'm imprrressed, {race}... You still brrreathe!\""
msgstr "\"대단하구나. {race}... 아직 살아있다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "d5f7159b-6a20-4bba-970c-3ad2aa134a9b"
msgid ""
"\"So deterrrmined! Such pathos! Who are you trrrying to imprrress with this "
"false brrravado, {race}?\""
msgstr "\"결의가 대단하구나! 사기꾼 주제에! 네 거짓된 모습을 감추지 못할까? {race}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "42f06609-6a33-4e69-aa4d-d3eb6995aa1d"
msgid "\"Don't count on that, {race}. Don't count on that.\""
msgstr "\"그러지 않는 것이 좋을 거야. {race}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "32fbea0e-25f3-4831-ad56-c25b4b339d27"
msgid ""
"\"So rrrude and so self-rrrighteous! But wherrre is the confidence behind "
"this show of courrrage?\""
msgstr "\"무례하고 이기적이구나! 어디서 그런 용기를 가지게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "68a34a27-b400-4ce0-bc03-dabb863e829d"
msgid "\"I'll rrrememberrr yourrr name.\""
msgstr "\"네 이름을 기억해두지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0f84c138-9924-4d34-9e66-d73493c46887"
msgid ""
"\"You want to know my name, crow? I'm Jubilost Narthropple, so fly along and "
"inform your dim-witted master that the greatest explorer of "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} honors his shabby den with a visit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름을 알고 싶다고? 나는 주빌로스트 나트로플이다. 네 멍청한 주인에게 가서 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 위대한 "
"탐험가님이 방문하신다고 알려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0829d550-f81c-4385-9dfe-92de719be13e"
msgid ""
"\"I'll tell! My name is Octavia, I am {mf|baron's|baroness's} friend, and "
"your master will regret it when he stands before us at last.\""
msgstr "\"내 이름은 옥타비아다! 나는 {mf|남작|여남작}의 친구고, 너희 주인은 우리에게 맞선 걸 후회하게 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e40aad25-eeac-4dc4-aab7-ff6f16a04de1"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not afraid of you or this 'Vordakai'. I am Regongar. I'll carve it on "
"your master's forehead so he doesn't forget.\""
msgstr "\"나는 보다카이 따위는 두렵지 않아. 나는 레곤가르지. 네 주인의 머리를 밀어주어 잊지 못할 추억을 남겨주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fc47097d-0d6b-4aec-86cf-ad18ae68e2a2"
msgid "\"Ekundayo. I never deny my enemies the right to know my name.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤다요다. 적들에게 내 이름을 밝히기를 거부한 적이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "d7594afd-6993-4fe5-973b-280502165a6e"
msgid ""
"\"How much longer are you going to bother me, bird? I'm Jaethal. Take my "
"name and choke on it. Show yourself again, you'll regret it!\""
msgstr "\"나를 얼마나 더 귀찮게 할 셈이지? 나는 제이탈이다. 내 이름을 밝혔으니 꺼져라. 다시 나타난다면 후회하게 해주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "0dcf6317-e126-4870-beec-a7a3049ed0ae"
msgid ""
"\"Dispense with your mockery, raven. I am Valerie, loyal companion of the "
"{mf|baron|baroness} and {mf|his|her} protector. Now leave us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"까마귀, 조롱은 하지 않는 게 좋을 것이다. 나는 발레리. {mf|남작|여남작}의 충성스러운 심복이자 수호자이다. 이제 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "6066dcae-4cef-4e7a-b8cc-7605a6185ce4"
msgid ""
"\"Yourrr companions, perrrhaps?\" {n}The raven croaks spitefully.{/n} \"Just "
"send them home, be they not prrreparrred to meet Doom itself!\" {n}The raven "
"caws a few times, then settles on its perch.{/n} \"Orrr maybe therrre's a "
"trrrue herrro among them, one who'd agrrree to follow you into the jaws of "
"death? Come, tell me who!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 동료들인가?\" {n}까마귀는 울음을 뱉어냅니다.{/n} \"집에 가지 않으면 어둠을 맞게 될 것이다!\" {n}까마귀는 몇번 "
"울더니 횃대에 앉습니다.{/n} \"아니면 죽음으로 뛰어들 진정한 영웅이 있는 것인가? 그게 누구더냐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "d096cdf2-590a-4859-874e-43ae22dfd82d"
msgid ""
"\"I want a closerrr look at those who followed you to the sanctuarrry of my "
"masterrr.\" {n}The raven's eyes flit across your allies.{/n} \"Let's starrrt "
"with the perrrson closest to you — which of yourrr band has the honorrr of "
"being yourrr dearrrest frrriend?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 따라 내 주인님의 신성한 장소에 갈 녀석의 모습을 봐야겠다.\" {n}까마귀의 눈은 당신의 동료들을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"너와 "
"가장 가까운 친구부터 시작하지. 함께 있어 네게 영예를 안겨주는 동료는 누구냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "1c4f2775-621f-4dcd-ac23-8bd6c8beb5be"
msgid ""
"\"Do you fearrr to be shamed in the eyes of yourrr accomplices? Which of "
"yourrr band do you fearrr to disappoint most?\""
msgstr "\"동료에게 부끄러움을 살까봐 겁나는가? 어떤 동료에게 가장 좋은 모습을 보이고 싶지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Raven_FirstTalk/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "6bd0b616-7337-42d1-9a7b-1ddfd5e7d96d"
msgid "\"Don't keep my masterrr waiting.\""
msgstr "\"우리 주인을 기다리게 하지 말아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "772bae0b-5de7-4fc5-907f-e70fcab9d496"
msgid "...open the door."
msgstr "...문을 열었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "d31b0db3-166b-4f31-93a9-c4233efc704b"
msgid "...find the mechanism to disarm the trap."
msgstr "...덫을 해체할 방법을 찾았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "85fb1f2e-7a1e-4b53-9b1a-150f6d8ea8f2"
msgid "...shut the ceiling hatches."
msgstr "...천장의 뚜껑을 닫습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "bcdf3f96-24bc-40c2-abed-d32ea4b33a96"
msgid ""
"Our heroes started shouting as loud as they could, trying to scare the eel "
"off."
msgstr "우리의 영웅들은 장어를 겁주려고 있는 힘껏 소리질렀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "a43ad2d5-5eaf-4511-baaf-484c685dd9b8"
msgid ""
"Our heroes hugged the walls, trying to avoid the irritated eel's attention."
msgstr "우리의 영웅들은 화난 장어의 주의를 이끌지 않으려고 벽에 숨었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "ba83bf56-6698-4353-80a1-2d86131556f8"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "b2572b65-e0d3-42b1-b7d1-98718741909c"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "a3e086f6-a93b-4116-92d6-e9f772a78e13"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Answer_0091_Text
msgctxt "58693221-5951-416e-babe-21a66ae31893"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Barks/Ceiling_hole_success_String
msgctxt "9ee6a4ac-7288-4c2d-8f28-b7d5f90832f3"
msgid "There are several barely visible hatches on the ceiling."
msgstr "천장에는 입구 몇개가 희미하게 보였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Barks/WallCrack_String
msgctxt "071bf72a-f548-4776-8eaf-bd59cc71077d"
msgid "There is a large crack in this wall."
msgstr "벽에는 거대한 균열이 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "466058b7-84d2-4ce8-83e8-1031d9127fba"
msgid ""
"After trekking through the gloomy dungeon, we finally arrived at a heavy "
"stone door, decorated with lots of fancy carvings. As soon as we touched it, "
"though, we heard a click from within the wall, followed by a suspicious "
"noise above our heads."
msgstr ""
"우울한 던전을 헤맨 후에 우리는 마침내 화려한 장식이 된 거대한 돌문이 있는 곳에 도착했습니다. 문을 건들자 우리는 벽 안쪽에서 달칵하는 "
"소리를 들었고 머리 위에서 의심스러운 소음이 뒤따랐습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "49cc84ed-32d4-4d80-9669-9208f6b46f6d"
msgid ""
"A heartbeat later, before we even had a chance to guess what was happening, "
"some rusty hatches opened above our heads and murky water from the river "
"began flooding the room! The room filled rapidly, threatening to trap us in "
"a watery grave. Along with the water, sand and mud from the riverbed poured "
"in, as well as some of the underwater plants and some scared fish that "
"weren't fast enough to escape."
msgstr ""
"무슨 일이 일어나기도 알아채기 전에 천장에 달린 입구가 열려 흐릿한 강물이 쏟아지기 시작했습니다! 방안은 급속하게 물이 들어차 우리의 "
"무덤이 될 뻔했습니다. 물과 함께 진흙과 모래는 물론 해초류나 무서운 물고기도 같이 들어왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "4967db6c-c422-4084-8fba-9b6324585757"
msgid ""
"It can be hard to keep your cool in a situation like this, but while some of "
"us were praying to their gods or complaining about not having the time to "
"finish {g|Golarion}Golarion's{/g} next great novel, the others tried to..."
msgstr ""
"이런 상황에서 침착하기란 쉽지 않았지만 우리 중 몇은 신에게 기도를 하고 있었고 골라리온의 유명한 소설을 전부 읽지 않았다고 불평하는 "
"이도 있었습니다. 다른 동료는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "58ea60d4-b7c7-41b3-861a-8e32a98c6d3f"
msgid ""
"Our attempts to find the lock and open the door were fruitless — those "
"ancient builders had hidden the mechanisms safely inside the walls."
msgstr "자물쇠를 찾아 문을 열려는 시도는 헛수고였습니다. 이 장치를 설계한 자는 벽 안쪽에 장치를 안전하게 숨겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "2746e505-9312-4a07-904a-c65cd5e74da4"
msgid ""
"It's unlikely that anyone who'd invent such a deadly trap would be fool "
"enough to keep the control mechanisms in plain sight. Despite all our "
"efforts, we had no luck finding the mechanisms to disarm the trap — and as "
"we tried, the water kept rising!"
msgstr ""
"이런 위험한 덫을 만든 자가 잘 보이는 곳에 조종 장치를 숨겼을 리가 없습니다. 우리의 노력에도 불구하고 덫을 해제할 장치를 찾을 수는 "
"없었습니다. 우리가 시도하는 동안 물은 계속 들어찼습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "247868e1-2ec6-433e-8b21-28affd40fc1c"
msgid ""
"Closing even a single hatch against the pressure of the flooding water "
"proved not only difficult, it was impossible! The daredevils who tried were "
"risking their lives to do so — the dangling hatch lids swung perilously "
"close to their heads, and the jets of water were strong enough to bowl them "
"over and leave them battered and bruised. Fortunately, none of our heroes "
"was hurt, but the water streams were completely unstoppable."
msgstr ""
"물이 쏟아지는 압력을 이기고 열려있는 문 하나를 닫는 것은 어려울 뿐만 아니라 불가능했습니다! 목숨을 걸고 덜컹거리는 뚜껑을 닫으려는 "
"동료의 노력은 헛수고였고 쏟아지는 물길은 너무나 강력하게 그들 머리 위로 쏟아져서 동료들은 멍이 들고 나가떨어졌습니다. 다행히 아무도 "
"심하게 다치지는 않았지만 물이 들어오는 것은 멈출 수가 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "09885be2-68d3-4eb8-b669-b76609cbb840"
msgid ""
"Adding to our troubles, fate decided to give us one more thing to worry "
"about — with a loud splash, a huge electric eel fell out of one of the "
"hatches! Above the noise of falling water, we heard strange clicks and "
"crackling as our skin began tingling from slight jolts of electricity."
msgstr ""
"게다가 운명은 우리에게 걱정거리를 하나 더 주었습니다. 거대한 전기 장어가 입구에서 떨어져 빛을 반짝였습니다! 물에 떨어지는 소리를 듣고 "
"우리는 피부에서 전기가 간지럽힘을 느끼고 파지직하는 소리를 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "575b8dbb-1e63-475c-834f-f912534de0d8"
msgid ""
"The ancient architects of this place clearly weren't expecting their "
"ancestors to just try prying the door open while standing knee-deep in murky "
"water, but our heroes did just that — and succeeded! With the door open, our "
"group rushed out of the room, closing the door tightly behind them to cut "
"off the water."
msgstr ""
"이 장소를 지은 건축가들은 그들의 조상이 무릎 높이까지 물이 들어찼을 때 문을 열어야 한다는 예상은 못했을 것입니다. 하지만 우리의 "
"영웅들은 그런 상황에서 문을 열었습니다! 우리는 방에서 뛰쳐나왔고 물이 들어오지 못하게 문을 단단히 닫았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "4bfb540c-01c0-4cee-b280-db2e884691a2"
msgid ""
"We quickly searched every corner, but there was no sign of any controlling "
"mechanism. What we did discover, though, was a long, narrow crack in a side "
"bas-relief. Determined as ever, our baron{mf||ess} plunged a dagger into the "
"crack — and the wall gave in, revealing the door to a hidden room!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 구석을 재빠르게 찾아보았지만 조종 장치같은 것은 없었습니다. 우리가 발견한 것은 옆의 조각에 난 길고 좁은 균열이었습니다. 무언가 "
"결심한 듯 당신은 균열에 단검을 꽂았고 벽에서 숨겨진 방으로 가는 문이 나타났습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0062_Text_String
msgctxt "f16f66c1-cebe-49a9-973c-991497f35176"
msgid ""
"After several minutes, the noise behind the door stopped — maybe the "
"prehistoric pipes got clogged with mud, or maybe the trap just shut itself "
"off. Either way, we waited for the water to drain out through the cracks in "
"the floor before looking back into the gloomy room that almost spelled our "
"doom. That's where we found the remains of someone who hadn't been as lucky "
"as we had. As the water had sucked in mud and fish from the river, it also "
"pulled in the twisted skeleton of some drowned adventurer, still clad in "
"tattered traveler's clothes. The poor soul didn't have anything in their "
"pockets to hint at who they might have been or where they came from... but "
"we did find a pouch of coins. After one more look at that scary place, our "
"group carefully moved on, advancing further into the depths of the "
"sepulcher..."
msgstr ""
"몇분 뒤 문 뒤의 소음이 멈췄습니다. 아마도 골동품이 된 관이 진흙에 막혔거나 천장의 입구가 저절로 닫힌 것 같습니다. 그렇지 않으면 "
"그렇지 않았다면 우리가 죽을 뻔한 그 방을 뒤돌아보기 전에 물이 바닥의 틈으로 빠져나가기를 기다려야 했을 것입니다. 그래서 거기에 운 "
"없는 자의 시체가 있었던 것입니다. 물이 진흙과 강의 물고기와 함께 쏟아졌고 익사한 여행자의 해골도 같이 끌어들였습니다. 해골에는 "
"여행자의 너덜너덜한 옷이 여전히 입혀져있었습니다. 그 불쌍한 여행자는 자신이 어디에서 왔는지 알려줄 어떤 단서도 가지고 있지 않았습니다. "
"하지만 우리는 동전 주머니를 발견했습니다. 그 무시무시한 장소를 한번 더 본 후 우리는 조심스럽게 무덤의 깊숙한 곳으로 갔습니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "702c7052-9a1d-451d-8653-bc029c78be62"
msgid ""
"Those ancient architects sure knew how to build their traps, and they were "
"good at building hidden rooms, too — especially the kind you could use to "
"hide from a triggered trap! The room behind the bas-relief wasn't spacious, "
"but it was big enough to save everyone."
msgstr ""
"이 덫을 만든 고대의 설게자는 숨겨진 방을 만드는 것도 잘했습니다. 특히나 덫이 발동된 상황에서 숨기 좋은 방 말입니다! 조각 뒤의 방은 "
"넓지는 않았지만 모두가 숨기에는 충분히 컸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "f5e76726-dfa6-4370-b834-3ab934fb36d6"
msgid ""
"Even mindless river animals know better than to mess with the {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands'{/g} greatest heroes! The eel decided against staying "
"around such noisy company, choosing instead to hide at the far end of the "
"room. However, this small victory did little to help us solve our most "
"pressing problem — the rapidly rising water."
msgstr ""
"강에서 온 그 동물은 {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands'{/g}의 위대한 영웅들을 괴롭히는 것을 포기했습니다. 장어는 "
"시끄러운 동료들 옆에 있기보다는 방 구석으로 가서 숨기로 결정했습니다. 하지만 이 작은 승리는 우리가 문제를 해결하는 데에 전혀 도움이 "
"되지 않았습니다. 물의 높이는 빠르게 높아지고 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "8974eb57-9d8e-444f-9ebe-d6eb7ed6d401"
msgid ""
"Pressing ourselves against the rough walls, we tried to disappear — or at "
"least stay out of sight of the eel who was continuing to flounce about the "
"room. Lucky for us, the predator didn't notice the large potential food "
"sources hiding in the corners of the room, instead proceeding to go after "
"the stunned fish that had fallen in. Meanwhile, new prey for the eel kept on "
"coming — along with the continuing stream of water!"
msgstr ""
"거친 벽을 밀치면서 우리는 사라지려고 노력했습니다. 최소한 방에서 난동을 피우는 장어의 눈에 벗어나 있으려고 했습니다. 다행히 그 "
"포식자는 방 구석에 있는 잠재적인 음식 재료를 보지 못하고 기절한 물고기에게 곧장 갔습니다. 한편 새로운 먹이는 물이 쏟아지면서 계속 "
"들어오고 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0085_Text_String
msgctxt "39df3c0b-af65-44a3-b718-3d830fb3c555"
msgid ""
"Just when we thought our fate had been sealed, a true miracle occurred — "
"before reaching the ceiling, the water began to recede! Under all that "
"pressure, the ancient masonry gave out before our air did. After several "
"moments, the streams of water and mud pouring from the ceiling cut off, and "
"drains in the floor opened up. A minute or two later, all the water, the "
"fish, the mud, and even an irritated eel had disappeared somewhere into "
"underground pipes."
msgstr ""
"우리의 운명이 끝났다고 생각했을 때 기적이 일어났습니다. 천장에 도달하기 전 쏟아지는 물이 점점 멎기 시작했습니다. 압력으로 인해 고대의 "
"벽돌이 입구를 막기 시작했습니다. 잠시 후 쏟아지는 물줄기와 진흙은 멈추었고 나머지도 마르고 있었습니다. 몇분 후에 모든 물과 물고기, "
"진흙 그리고 심지어 화난 장어까지 지하의 관 어딘가로 사라졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0086_Text_String
msgctxt "5d593a90-ca4c-4586-a82b-6700163a80f1"
msgid ""
"This time, the door opened almost effortlessly — as though it was mocking us "
"and the trouble it had caused! Behind the stone door was a dark corridor, "
"leading to yet new dangers. Steeling themselves for the upcoming trials, our "
"heroes bravely stepped into the unknown..."
msgstr ""
"마치 우리를 조롱하기라도 하듯 문은 이번에 쉽게 열렸습니다. 돌문 뒤에는 어두운 복도가 이어졌고 우리는 새로운 위험이 있음을 "
"짐작했습니다. 다가오는 위험을 무릅쓰고 우리는 용감하게 들어갔고..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0088_Text
msgctxt "1a1a03da-322a-41a7-bb13-a0195f5a4f46"
msgid ""
"It's hard to compete with a creature that's at home in the water when you're "
"more accustomed to solid ground beneath your feet. After just two jolts, we "
"were prepared to meet a premature (and quite inglorious) end to our "
"adventures."
msgstr ""
"물에서 사는 짐승과 경쟁하기는 쉽지 않았습니다. 두어번 더 번쩍임을 보고 우리는 불명예스럽고도 허무한 우리 여행의 결말을 준비하고 "
"있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "c56493ee-b9fa-41e4-8191-b71f706a5903"
msgid ""
"Our heroes trapped, the water level rising, seemingly no way out, and now we "
"had this electric eel to deal with! Maybe it would just fry us, save us from "
"drowning... No, we needed to get rid of it, before it was too late!"
msgstr ""
"우리의 영웅들은 물이 계속 들어찬 방에 갇혀 나갈 곳은 보이지 않았는데 이제는 전기뱀장어를 상대해야 했습니다! 그것은 위험해 보였고 "
"우리는 늦기 전에 없애버려야 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "8b078869-b6ec-4ef8-a8e3-6563b79c03fc"
msgid ""
"Every attempt to shut the hatches ended in failure — nothing about the trap "
"had changed, but the hands and shoulders of our heroes were certainly "
"bruised and battered by the streams of rushing water!"
msgstr "입구를 닫으려는 모든 시도는 실패했고 우리 영웅들의 어깨와 손은 쏟아지는 물줄기 때문에 멍 투성이가 되었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "984b787f-b27e-4d4a-8bac-d19f571702e6"
msgid ""
"After brushing the mud off our clothes, we returned to the calamitous door."
msgstr "옷에서 진흙을 털어내고 우리는 문으로 돌아갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/RiverTrapBookEvent/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "e50d9aa1-ea17-4ba3-9bf6-75c95b11e91d"
msgid ""
"After recovering from the electric jolts and brushing the mud from our "
"clothes, we returned to the calamitous door."
msgstr "전기 충격에서 회복한 후 옷에서 진흙을 털어내고 우리는 문으로 돌아갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "8d4e4ee5-e9d7-4f19-bac0-e6aafb426a4a"
msgid "\"I'm ready to meet your master.\""
msgstr "\"너희 주인을 만날 준비가 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ebd6be81-e173-4f01-8fea-8f3056383ab5"
msgid "Teased the talking raven."
msgstr "말하는 까마귀를 괴롭혔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "8f763bea-23c6-4a60-9d60-13441e2ff2a4"
msgid ""
"\"After I walk through this door, I hope to never see you again, crow.\""
msgstr "\"이 문을 들어간 후에 너를 다시는 보지 않았으면 해. 까마귀야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "cc86cdce-b0df-47a6-9785-ad55146db629"
msgid "\"I've changed my mind. I have other matters to attend to first.\""
msgstr "\"마음이 바뀌었어. 해야 할 일이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Barks/DeadBarbarian_01_String
msgctxt "fe51635d-f3a0-44fe-8fcc-719a9f210701"
msgid "This dead man's face is frozen in terror."
msgstr "이 죽은 자의 얼굴은 공포로 얼어붙었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Barks/DeadBarbarian_02_String
msgctxt "bb54be88-3815-4e11-93a1-1e5832e76d0a"
msgid ""
"This corpse lies in unnatural position, his back arched, his fingers "
"clutching his throat."
msgstr "이상하게도 이 시체의 허리는 굽었고 손가락은 자신의 목을 휘어잡은 채로 죽어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Barks/GasHoles_Fail_String
msgctxt "533ef606-aafa-4f54-87c9-659b50c03213"
msgid "Strange holes — a vent, perhaps — lead somewhere underground."
msgstr "이상한 구멍은 지하 어딘가로 이어졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Barks/GasHoles_Success_String
msgctxt "7fb78a4c-9ab5-4b74-a840-af01ea347c68"
msgid "A subtle sickening smell is rising from the holes in the floor."
msgstr "미묘한 악취가 바닥에서 흘러나옵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "2727496f-8ef1-4d18-9f75-862c83568c4c"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven's gleeful caws echo off the walls.{/n}\"You came, {race}! Past "
"the ancient gate, thrrrrough the {g|Valley of the Dead}Valley of the Dead{/g}"
"... you've struck down all who stood in your path! Despite the danger "
"awaiting you, you still came! My masterrr knew you'd be a worrrthy serrrvant!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}까마귀의 울음 소리가 벽을 때립니다.{/n}\"왔구나, {race}! {g|Valley of the Dead}죽은 자의 계곡{/g}"
"을 지나, 고대의 문을 통과했다... 네 길을 막은 적들도 모두 해치우다니! 네 앞에 도사리는 위험에도 불구하고, 이곳에 도달했다! 나의 "
"주인님은 네가 충실한 종이 될 것을 알고 계셨다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ed49ceba-407b-449d-b105-5f863353f7c8"
msgid ""
"\"One morrre step, {race} — the sanctuarrry of my masterrr lies beyond! "
"Accept yourrr fate without fearrr — and Vordakai will be merrrciful! But "
"rremember — once you open the doorrr beforrre you, therrre's no turning back!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"한걸음 남았다, {race}. 이 너머에 내 주인님의 성지가 있다! 두려워 말고 네 운명을 맞이해라, 그러면 보다카이는 자비를 베풀 "
"것이다! 하지만 문을 연 후에는 돌아갈 수 없다는 것을 기억해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "a3c2e867-11cf-4371-9cd5-40f18ef76181"
msgid ""
"\"So, the cowardice of your kind overrrcame you afterrr all, {race}! Go on, "
"rrrun! Rrrun frrrom one you cannot hope to escape!\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 너희 종의 소심함에 지배당했구나, {race}! 그렇다면 도망쳐라! 빠져나갈 희망이 없는 곳으로부터 도망쳐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e2f02221-94f6-4254-a76a-9ae42540a840"
msgid ""
"\"Don't waste yourrr brrreath on foolish jests — my masterrr doesn't like to "
"wait, and you've been trrrying his patience long enough!\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 농담으로 시간을 낭비하지 마라. 나의 주인님께선 기다리는 것을 싫어한다. 너는 이미 그의 인내심을 시험했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/SepulcherRavenWarning/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6272d28a-ee92-4f13-ae8f-3fb2fda44a98"
msgid ""
"\"Go forrrth, {race}! May yourrr death be intertwined with the ecstasy of "
"sufferrring neverrrending!\""
msgstr "\"전진해라, {race}! 끝나지 않는 고통의 쾌락이 네 죽음과 함께 하리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Amiri_soul_String
msgctxt "a7aed761-64fd-4af3-adb7-87580d4c22b1"
msgid "\"Amiri... breathe... for the lassst time...\""
msgstr "\"아미리... 마지막 숨을... 쉬어라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Ekun_soul_String
msgctxt "d7c6cacc-3b62-4df5-9508-4f5ef804d4ba"
msgid "\"Ekun... die... die...\""
msgstr "\"에쿤... 죽어... 죽어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Harrim_soul_String
msgctxt "fe76b0d5-e878-4c00-aeef-327a7fb41539"
msgid "\"Harrim... embrace... the sssilence...\""
msgstr "\"하림... 침묵을... 받아들여...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Jaethal_soul_String
msgctxt "20e4a67c-29aa-49c7-9299-c95cb4a16342"
msgid "\"Oblivion awaitsss... Jaethal...\""
msgstr "\"망각이 너를... 기다린다... 제이탈...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Jubilost_soul_String
msgctxt "29bc0ac3-c390-4086-903a-35388dad6e2a"
msgid "\"Jubilossst... your time... hasss come...\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트... 너는... 끝났다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Kaessi_soul_String
msgctxt "67525dff-08cf-47ac-912d-2a7abc839d11"
msgid "\"Trickery... Treachery... There is no Kaessi here...\""
msgstr "\"사기꾼... 배신자... 카에시는 여기에 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Kanerah_scared_bark_String
msgctxt "aff8d071-844b-4230-ab56-be7e1915b9cb"
msgid "\"Soul eaters! No, please! Not them again!\""
msgstr "\"소울 이터다! 안돼, 제발! 두 번은 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Linzi_soul_String
msgctxt "de8daa41-dad6-479d-a5ed-3db015942ae2"
msgid "\"Linzi... welcome your end...\""
msgstr "\"린지... 네 끝이 왔어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/NokNok_soul_String
msgctxt "9043a34f-72b8-412a-a8fc-bbbdc2f5b49b"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok... today... you perish...\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹... 오늘... 너는 사라질 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Octavia_soul_String
msgctxt "1490c3a4-a491-4d35-8161-04dc8347db67"
msgid "\"Pray... to your goddesss... Octavia...\""
msgstr "\"네 신에게... 기도해라... 옥타비아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Player_soul_String
msgctxt "1f61bc6a-0cd8-40c5-8d15-084dff33160e"
msgid "\"{name}... The darknesss callsss to you...\""
msgstr "\"{name}... 어둠이 너를 부른다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Regongar_soul_String
msgctxt "5e343209-8c07-4240-87ad-d515632b0077"
msgid "\"Regongar... Regongar... I am your... death'sss whisssper...\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르... 레곤가르... 나는 네 죽음의... 속삭임이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Tristian_soul_String
msgctxt "94107901-da09-4247-9e12-4f258408ea86"
msgid "\"Trissstian... death whissspered your name...\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안... 죽음이 너에게 속삭인다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel1/Souleater_barks/Valerie_soul_String
msgctxt "b4f219a5-c8ef-4f27-8253-84a9378737e0"
msgid "\"Join your ancessstorsss... Valerie...\""
msgstr "\"네 조상을 보러 갈 시간이다... 발레리...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "86ba0e3c-5081-4f67-826c-866964451883"
msgid ""
"\"Don't, Tristian! As you said, evil can tempt anyone! You're stronger than "
"it — fight it!\""
msgstr "\"그러지 마. 트리스티안! 누구나 악에게 유혹 당해! 너는 강하니까 맞서야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "975bb6a0-ff90-4fb1-89c6-c43650ae603d"
msgid "\"Give me the Oculus! Now!\""
msgstr "\"눈을 내게 넘겨! 어서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "97e782a6-56e7-449f-b79d-990f5793f433"
msgid "\"I'll kill you for this, traitor!\""
msgstr "\"너는 죽을 것이다! 배신자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "f95b6cdf-6bae-4788-a502-1bf8adc87f04"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian! I don't believe you're doing this willingly! Stop it — for me!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안! 네 의지로 그러는지는 모르겠지만 멈춰! 나를 위해서라도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4a6abebd-e85a-42e6-82d2-b195999935ed"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's silhouette, holding the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}, is a "
"stunning contrast — a terrible darkness against the shining portal. The "
"cleric doesn't meet your gaze — his eyes are focused on the gateway. He "
"speaks faintly, as if lost in its light.{/n} \"I must take it. Forgive me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 쥐고 있는 트리스티안의 윤곽은 빛나는 포탈을 등진 끔찍한 어둠으로 강렬하게 대비되었습니다. "
"성직자는 당신의 눈을 마주치지 않았습니다 — 그의 눈은 관문에 고정되었습니다. 빛 때문에 정신을 잃은 것 처럼, 그는 힘 없이 "
"말합니다.{/n}\"내가 가져가야겠어. 용서해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "c9bee384-2ca2-4840-a468-a077ac305562"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian hesitates. When he turns to you, his eyes are filled with {d|c31 "
"Tris Persuade}pain{/d}.{/n} \"I... I cannot, {name}! It is not my will... "
"but I am bound by a force greater than my own, and I must bring them the "
"Oculus. But...\"{n}Tristian's voice, once despairing, suddenly takes on a "
"strange hope — realization.{/n} \"I can destroy it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 주저합니다. 그가 당신을 보았을 때 그의 눈은 {d|c31 Tris Persuade}고통{/d}으로 가득합니다.{/n} "
"\"나는... 할 수 없어. {name}! 내 의지가 아니야... 나는 강력한 힘에 속박되어서 눈을 그들에게 넘겨야 해. 하지만...\""
"{n}트리스티안의 절망스러운 목소리는 갑자기 신비한 희망이 담겨집니다. 무언가 깨달은 것이었습니다.{/n} \"이걸 부술 수는 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "2dc3b6a1-166a-4797-b687-892c1ece8765"
msgid ""
"\"No! Don't ask for something I can't give you! The force that compels me, "
"calls for me — and I must answer it!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 내가 할 수 없는 걸 부탁하지 말아줘! 나를 강제하는 힘이... 나를 불러. 어쩔 수가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "048d38dd-6076-4ecd-8d04-1322e1a18c02"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head. You can barely hear his words.{/n} \"If my will "
"was my own, I'd grant your wish. Forgive me.\"\n"
"{n}Without another word, Tristian steps into the portal and vanishes in its "
"light.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 고개를 숙입니다. 당신은 그의 목소리를 간신히 들을 수 있습니다.{/n} \"내 의지가 나의 것이라면 네 소원을 "
"들어주었겠지. 나를 용서해.\"\n"
"{n}그 말을 끝으로 트리스티안은 포털로 걸어갔고 빛 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "87818461-580f-4a32-b55d-f25265218ff2"
msgid ""
"\"I must leave. I pray to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} that you find it in your "
"heart to forgive me.\"\n"
"{n}Without another word, Tristian steps into the portal and vanishes in its "
"light.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 떠나야 해. {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}에게 기도해서 네가 나를 용서하기를 빌게.\"\n"
"{n}그 말을 끝으로 트리스티안은 포털로 걸어갔고 빛 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "16c1e708-11bf-4197-b6a1-14c4787f3354"
msgid ""
"\"The one who can't see evil will smite an entity that tempts others; the "
"messenger of good, deprived of sunlight, gains the power to dispel the "
"darkness.\" {n}Tristian casts the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} at his "
"feet and raises his hands over his head.{/n} \"Dawnflower! Healing Light! "
"{g|Sarenrae}Merciful Sarenrae{/g}, your servant and champion calls for you! "
"Grant me the power to remove the last obstacle on the path of salvation! "
"Grant me the courage to spare the world from the abominations that threaten "
"it!\" {n}A light blazes through the tomb — and Tristian's hands become "
"aflame with sunlight. He covers his eyes with his palms — and utters a blood-"
"curdling scream. Without taking his hands from his face, Tristian slams his "
"heel downwards, shattering the Oculus of Abaddon beneath his weight.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"악을 볼 수 없는 자가 다른 이들을 유혹하는 존재를 벌할 것이다. 선의의 전령, 태양빛에 버림받은 자는 어둠을 물리칠 힘을 얻을 "
"것이다.\" {n}트리스티안은 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 발 밑에 내려두고 손을 머리 위로 듭니다.{/n} \"여명의 꽃! "
"치유의 빛! {g|Sarenrae}자비로운 서렌레이{/g}시여, 당신의 종이자 사도가 당신을 부릅니다! 제게 구원의 길을 막는 마지막 "
"장애물을 제거할 힘을 주소서! 세상을 위협하는 험오스러운 존재들에게서 세상을 구원할 용기를 주소서!\" {n}빛이 무덤 속에서 빛났고 "
"트리스티안의 손은 태양의 빛으로 붉게 빛납니다. 그는 눈을 손으로 막고 고함을 지릅니다. 얼굴에 손을 떼고 트리스티안은 뒷꿈치에 힘을 "
"실어 나락의 눈을 부숩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "42e35b70-802d-404d-82ea-81c0ece6988f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian removes his hands from his face — and his blind white eyes stare "
"past you.{/n} \"Now I can't see evil... oh, {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}! The "
"price of faith is high — I shall never see your sacred light again.\" {n}"
"Tristian bursts into harsh laughter.{/n} \"The end! The end of this "
"nightmare! I'll accept punishment, any punishment, just to have it end! Only "
"one last shackle remains, and this is done!\" {n}Tristian turns and vanishes "
"into the portal.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 얼굴에서 손을 뗍니다. 그리고 그의 실명한 백안은 당신 너머를 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 악이 보이지 않는다... 오. "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}시여! 믿음의 대가는 비싸니, 나는 당신의 신성한 빛을 두 번 다시 보지 못할 것입니다.\" {n}"
"트리스티안은 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"끝이 왔다! 악몽의 끝이! 나는 악몽을 끝내기 위해 어떠한 벌도 달게 받으리라! 마지막 "
"사슬만이 남았고 이것으로 끝나리라!\" {n}트리스티안은 등을 돌려 포털 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/AngelAfterBetrayal/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "b2b43ed0-cdb5-4f22-bf95-c34ada76ea65"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian turns around and looks at you. Tears are running down his pale "
"face.{/n} \"Even now... even now you don't back away from me! I am so "
"worthless... for not even trying...\" {n}The priest looks down at the Oculus "
"of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}.{/n} \"But I will end this now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 당신을 봅니다. 눈물이 그의 창백한 얼굴 위로 흐릅니다.{/n} \"심지어 지금도... 이런 때조차 당신은 저를 "
"버리시지 않는군요! 전 쓸모없습니다... 노력조차 하지 않으니...\" {n}사제는 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 "
"내려다봅니다.{/n} \"하지만 이제 끝내야겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Angel_RandomBark_String
msgctxt "04cf856e-c565-40f6-99e6-19ad1abe2604"
msgid ""
"\"Have you heard that? Footsteps… no, sobs… Forgive me, this place plays "
"cruel tricks on the mind.\""
msgstr "\"들었어? 발걸음 소리가... 아니. 흐느낌이... 미안해. 이 장소는 사람의 마음을 혼란스럽게 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/DaemonRoom_WallPanel_String
msgctxt "88677aaf-e8d6-4f5f-8c60-097e6b96dba3"
msgid "Images of human sacrifice are depicted on the walls."
msgstr "인간의 희생을 묘사한 그림이 벽에 새겨졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/DaemonStatue_Intact_String
msgctxt "3b4bb680-6268-4106-8f27-ba55d3071902"
msgid ""
"Gemstones gleam brightly in the stone daemon's eye sockets. The jaws of the "
"sculpture are covered in dried blood."
msgstr "다이몬 석상의 눈 구멍에서 보석이 밝게 빛납니다. 조각의 턱은 피가 말라붙어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/DaemonStatue_Vandalized_String
msgctxt "762bfb34-af17-4ad5-ad8b-a78dc6a423a7"
msgid "The hollow eye sockets make the sculpture look even more disturbing."
msgstr "텅 빈 눈 구멍은 조각을 더 무시무시하게 보이게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/DemonRoom_Blocked_String
msgctxt "96fcd8a0-b02f-4775-9585-5badf537b4a4"
msgid "The passage to the next chamber is blocked with fallen stones."
msgstr "다음 방으로 이어지는 통로는 돌이 무너져 막혀있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/FeastHall_Angel_String
msgctxt "c2148c3b-4216-40a6-934d-e180b557b37f"
msgid ""
"\"It's hard to find forgiveness for any creature that does such horrific "
"things… but I doubt forgiveness would mean anything to a monster like him.\""
msgstr "\"이런 끔찍한 짓을 저지른 자를 용서하기란 쉽지 않지... 하지만 이런 괴물에게 용서가 무슨 의미일까 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/FeastHall_Body01_String
msgctxt "63c2794e-ac89-4243-8571-237acdff60eb"
msgid ""
"The top this man's skull has been brutally torn off, and his skull has been "
"hollowed out."
msgstr "이 남자의 두개골 꼭대기는 심하게 부서졌고 구멍이 뚫려있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/FeastHall_Body02_String
msgctxt "ed80963d-6ddd-4866-b9ca-2f8e7a207dce"
msgid ""
"This man's face is frozen in terror. His head has been split open and his "
"brain completely removed."
msgstr "이 남자의 얼굴은 공포로 얼어붙어있습니다. 그의 머리는 쪼개졌고 뇌가 완전히 제거되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/FeastHall_Body03_String
msgctxt "dcaf0986-4a63-4291-bf06-620ce3abde00"
msgid "This dead man wears robes a follower of Erastil."
msgstr "이 죽은 남자는 에라스틸 사제복을 입고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/FeastHall_Table_String
msgctxt "335c0dc6-2d73-4385-b529-2245c3b9ffc6"
msgid ""
"The table's surface is covered with blood, bits of brain, and bone splinters."
msgstr "이 테이블은 피와 뇌 조각 그리고 뼈 조각으로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Gunderson_before_String
msgctxt "e17fcd05-8f2c-4be7-8ddc-72095c4efe83"
msgid "\"Fools! There's no way out of here!\""
msgstr "\"멍청이! 나갈 곳은 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/HellPool_Sephal_String
msgctxt "38208bff-c167-4e90-91c9-c91256b71b62"
msgid "\"Death to the enemies of Vordakai!\""
msgstr "\"보다카이의 적에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/OculusChamber_Panel_String
msgctxt "9a23c3f7-9d59-4023-b8ee-a78026704f67"
msgid ""
"An image on the stone panel depicts a cyclops, who tore out his eye and "
"threw it on the ground. There's a ball of light in his hand, and he looks "
"like he intends to put it into his empty eye socket."
msgstr ""
"돌판에는 사이클롭스가 눈을 뽑아 땅바닥에 던지는 그림이 그려져있습니다. 그의 손에는 빛의 구가 들려있고 그는 그것을 마치 자기의 눈 "
"구멍에 넣으려는 것처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/OculusChamber_Walls_String
msgctxt "73b9a103-617c-493d-9854-c5c7716784dd"
msgid ""
"The walls are covered with the images of various disasters — war, "
"pestilence, famine, and other horrors. Featured prominently in every picture "
"is the image of a horseman."
msgstr "벽은 여러 재앙을 묘사했습니다. 전쟁, 기근, 질병 등입니다. 모든 그림에는 보란 듯이 기수의 모습이 나타납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/SoulJars01_String
msgctxt "1d3cf02e-1f6b-47fa-86ce-af6262fe7c17"
msgid ""
"These transparent, gleaming vessels are tightly sealed with some substance "
"that looks like black wax. Arcane symbols are etched on each seal."
msgstr "이 투명하고 빛나는 구체는 검은 왁스와 같은 물질로 단단히 봉인되어있습니다. 마법 문양이 각 봉인마다 새겨져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/SoulJars02_String
msgctxt "d2623730-bf90-4fc6-be11-321444f2c94c"
msgid ""
"These numerous transparent jars radiate warmth, and each emits a slight "
"vibration. A glimmer of light beats against the glass within every vessel — "
"an imprisoned soul of a living creature."
msgstr ""
"이 무수한 투명 항아리는 모두 희미한 진동과 열을 뿜습니다. 희미한 빛이 주위의 모든 항아리의 유리를 때렸습니다. 항아리는 살아있는 "
"생명체의 영혼이 가두어져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/ThroneRoom_Laboratory_String
msgctxt "13711f13-e0a1-404d-8e1b-df0719a289de"
msgid ""
"The table is piled with ancient books, stone tablets, and scrolls. Some are "
"so ancient they look ready to crumble into dust, others appear to be more "
"recent."
msgstr ""
"이 테이블은 고대 서적과 돌 판 그리고 두루마리로 가득합니다. 몇몇은 고대의 물건이어서 곧 부스러질 것 같았고 다른 것은 비교적 최근의 "
"것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/ThroneRoom_Panel_String
msgctxt "a565358a-0d74-495e-896f-9ec43f868124"
msgid ""
"The stone panel depicts the imprisonment and burial of Vordakai, performed "
"by three cyclopes who hold lanterns in their hands."
msgstr "돌 판은 손에 랜턴을 든 세 사이클롭스가 시행하는 보다카이의 구속과 매장을 묘사했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/ThroneRoom_Pool_String
msgctxt "b43ffd0e-209c-4e28-8657-f9a22cce80af"
msgid "The pool smells strongly of sulfur."
msgstr "유황의 냄새가 코를 찌릅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/ThroneRoom_Throne_String
msgctxt "797cc6d2-bf14-450c-930c-89b93e0a5e8d"
msgid "The throne is intricately crafted from human bones."
msgstr "왕좌는 인간의 뼈로 복잡하게 만들어져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/TombExitClosed_String
msgctxt "35ed9757-a90d-456b-a9ec-8b8b0db5c554"
msgid "The exit from the tomb is sealed by a powerful spell."
msgstr "무덤의 출구는 강력한 마법으로 봉인되어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Angel_Curse_01_String
msgctxt "2a2e7a6c-7a17-445a-ba19-b8ebb69963dc"
msgid ""
"\"Enough, Vordakai! Come face your death — I'm the one who will sentence you."
"\""
msgstr "\"그만. 보다카이! 네 죽음을 맞이해라. 내가 너를 심판할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Angel_Curse_02_String
msgctxt "4d982c92-9cfc-4b60-97e6-f64486b8a172"
msgid "\"From a relic of a crumbled empire, a relic I steal...\""
msgstr "\"부서진 제국의 유물로 내가 훔친 유물을...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Angel_Curse_03_String
msgctxt "f7d58fa7-1f32-4b62-8c75-a5ed135b26e1"
msgid ""
"\"Curse you, Vordakai, blinded by your faded power, I take your sight.\""
msgstr "\"너를 저주한다. 네 사라진 힘에 눈이 멀었으니 너의 눈을 가져가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Angel_Curse_04_String
msgctxt "7e45cc29-b4e4-4b58-bb60-6236a01e583a"
msgid ""
"\"Curse you, Vordakai, thriving in your blind arrogance, I claim your eye.\""
msgstr "\"너를 저주한다. 보다카이. 너의 눈 먼 오만함으로 네 눈을 가져갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Angel_Curse_05_Vord_String
msgctxt "80b37011-bcb3-41ed-b960-e2b688e2598c"
msgid "\"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!\""
msgstr "\"아아아아아아아아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Maegar_alive_01_String
msgctxt "4f6c5ab8-cf96-4ddc-b2aa-7e3e7b50b588"
msgid "\"What… where am I? How did I get here?\""
msgstr "\"뭐... 여기는 어디지? 내가 어떻게 여기로 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Maegar_alive_02_String
msgctxt "72c8738a-903c-40e4-8c76-a71e09dc93af"
msgid ""
"Maegar Varn is in a state of shock. It looks like he needs some time to come "
"to his senses."
msgstr "메이가르 반은 정신을 잃었습니다. 제 정신으로 돌아오려면 시간이 더 필요할 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Survived_01_Maegar_String
msgctxt "e8be5ab8-6015-48d1-b9fe-f98ee300d371"
msgid "\"What... what happened? Was it just... a nightmare?\""
msgstr "\"무슨... 무슨 일이지? 악몽을 꾼 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Survived_02_Vordakai_String
msgctxt "a9b5b8cb-6a26-4acd-9932-d76d543b2349"
msgid "\"Your nightmare has only just begun, mask. Silence!\""
msgstr "\"네 악몽은 이제 시작일 뿐이다. 닥쳐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_Survived_03_Maegar_String
msgctxt "839408f0-059d-4ff5-ad1c-3f9a46394e03"
msgid "\"NO!\""
msgstr "\"안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_blind_01_String
msgctxt "fd28cc23-7563-4f68-83ea-8767ece987a1"
msgid "\"Aaaaargh… Ooooohhh...\""
msgstr "\"아아아... 오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_blind_02_String
msgctxt "2ee0c91d-61f7-4d54-bff9-4cba7053db7f"
msgid ""
"\"My sight… My Eye! My gift from the depth of Abaddon! It's gone! Stolen!\""
msgstr "\"내 눈... 보이지 않아! 나락으로부터 받은 내 선물이! 사라졌다! 도둑 맞았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_blind_03_String
msgctxt "45061eef-efb9-408d-990c-146596c5866d"
msgid ""
"\"Thieves! Maggots! Wretched pathetic creatures! I'll slay you! I'LL SLAY "
"YOU ALL!\""
msgstr "\"도둑들! 이 벌레들! 하찮은 생명체들이! 너희를 죽이리라! 너희 모두 없애버릴 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Vordakai_blind_04_String
msgctxt "da976922-052b-4db0-a1f1-687bc5cdedcf"
msgid "\"Come, Horagnamon! Serve your master one last time!\""
msgstr "\"Horagnamon! 와서 네 주인을 다시 한번 섬겨라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Barks/Willas_aftertalk_String
msgctxt "1c2f5763-636f-4ac4-868c-9e788ca67457"
msgid ""
"Willas Gunderson's restless soul has turned into speechless, faded figure, "
"barely visible in the darkness."
msgstr "윌라스 건더슨의 불안정한 영혼은 말이 없어지고 흐릿해지더니 어둠 속에서 거의 보이지 않게 되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "7ab44dd1-5ad6-4d1e-888c-26f3c6885aa2"
msgid "\"Why?\""
msgstr "\"왜?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "3a91d8c5-e6f8-458a-98c9-06c0460ee335"
msgid "\"I want to look around first.\""
msgstr "\"주위를 먼저 둘러봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8ee7b76c-0d33-404e-be30-d695f2b7314d"
msgid "Brushed off Tristian's concerns."
msgstr "트리스티안의 걱정을 거절했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "704fb294-de45-4134-8958-54362bec7e7d"
msgid "\"I didn't ask for your counsel.\""
msgstr "\"상담을 요청한 적 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f8852b98-3531-4350-ad29-f530d43f3949"
msgid "\"What is the matter?\""
msgstr "\"그게 무슨 상관이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "9e52095c-ef4f-424a-b8b2-6c8a2eda51ce"
msgid "\"Very well. We'll go back and collapse this passage.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 우리는 돌아가서 이 통로를 무너뜨리겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "0f826592-e7c2-44db-b305-79dc21fbf0f1"
msgid "\"As you say, Tristian. Let's go back and collapse the passage.\""
msgstr "\"네가 말한 대로. 돌아가서 통로를 무너뜨리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d71b38e5-2f20-4935-8920-b7d4ddadddf4"
msgid "Brushed off Tristian's concerns."
msgstr "트리스티안의 걱정을 거절했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "55ca7d64-2cb3-44fb-a143-5f8dbcc5f276"
msgid "\"I will leave when I decide it's time to leave.\""
msgstr "\"떠날 때가 되면 떠나겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "90011f69-cf98-4d5f-8f64-1ae94399f9b7"
msgid "Sealed the daemon's shrine away."
msgstr "다이몬의 성소를 봉인합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "06447d60-4450-4613-9cd3-98cfd9ce105a"
msgid ""
"\"Our people's safety comes first. We'll do as you say — let's go back and "
"collapse the passage.\""
msgstr "\"내 백성들의 안전이 먼저다. 네가 말한 대로 돌아가서 이 통로를 무너뜨리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b3c662bb-437a-4846-ba5a-65cb07e06c41"
msgid "Decided to look around in daemon's shrine."
msgstr "다이몬의 성소 주위를 둘러보기로 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "5144da90-0673-43c5-ac62-ab34534df3b8"
msgid ""
"\"I want to examine this part of sepulcher, Tristian. There's nothing wrong "
"with that.\""
msgstr "\"이 흉물스러운 곳의 주위를 먼저 돌아봐야겠어. 걱정할 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fe363786-02b2-4076-a664-471f23ab3c93"
msgid "Yearned daemons' dark powers"
msgstr "다이몬의 힘을 갈망했습니다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "10909003-1065-4ddd-a1ff-b3edee97d836"
msgid "\"If there's power to be had here, I shall make it serve me.\""
msgstr "\"여기에 강력한 힘이 있다면 그것을 먼저 손에 넣겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f3987bfa-9c6c-43df-b545-fdf543ed1886"
msgid ""
"\"Let's leave this place. Now.\" {n}Tristian is silent for a moment.{/n} "
"\"And we should collapse the entrance. So no one… ever...\""
msgstr "\"이 장소를 떠나자.\" {n}트리스티안은 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"그리고 입구를 먼저 무너뜨려야 해. 영원히...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b4e0e9a7-2fd4-4c94-9f62-7cddc0054afd"
msgid ""
"\"This chamber... it...\" {n}Tristian looks at you, but doesn't seem to see "
"you — his eyes, normally calm, are troubled.{/n} \"It is the heart of the "
"evil that fills this whole tomb. Everything here bears traces of the ones "
"Vordakai worshipped.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 방은...\" {n}트리스티안은 당신 쪽을 보지만 당신을 보는 것이 아닙니다. 그의 평온하던 눈은 혼란에 휩싸였습니다.{/n} "
"\"이 방은 무덤 전체를 가득 채운 악의 중심이에요. 한 때 보다카이가 숭배했던 존재들의 흔적이 가득합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8a39b696-9c54-483e-9ad4-ff257dd2fd42"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you, let us leave this place. I don't want you to suffer Vordakai's "
"fate — you or anyone else. The powers of darkness are strong here. They can "
"corrupt even the strongest of hearts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"부탁하는데 이 장소를 떠나야 해. 네가 보다카이의 운명을 겪을 필요는 없어. 여기 악의 힘은 강해. 그들은 영웅의 정신도 오염시킬 수 "
"있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "24871d17-a048-4d8a-9e5a-c01bc8ca5245"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian steps towards you.{/n} \"I rarely insist, {name}, but you must "
"turn back!\" {n}He catches himself, and his voice drops.{/n} \"I beg you… "
"please. Turn back.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신에게 한걸음 다가갑니다.{/n} \"어서. {name}. 돌아가야 해!\" {n}그는 조용해집니다.{/n} "
"\"부탁이야... 돌아가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/DaemonRoom_Angel/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0d1ec4bc-e03b-4003-8eae-2ee262ab67e4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian keeps silent for a moment.{/n} \"So be it. But I beg you — don't "
"let the evil of this place tempt you.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"그러라지. 하지만 부탁이야. 여기 악에 넘어가서는 안 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/EnterPoints/VordakaiTombLevel2_Enter_Tooltip_String
msgctxt "83d9e048-7a9d-427e-8f4b-98a91fd514c3"
msgid "To the lower level"
msgstr "낮은 층으로"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarAfterReinforced/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c9f67b89-b317-4b5e-bbac-b5188dbe64c5"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm… this body is feeble… deprived of magic…\" {n}He takes a raking "
"breath, as if growing accustomed to breathing.{/n} \"...but it is vital "
"enough for what must be done... Until I find a more suitable vessel.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흠... 육체가 약하군... 마법을 빼앗겼어...\" {n}호흡이 거칠었던 그는 곧 숨을 고르게 쉽니다.{/n} \"...적당한 몸을 "
"찾을 때까지... 해야만 하는 일을 어서 해야 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarAfterReinforced/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "7834eba4-c51c-4018-ae1e-1b7a276bdc18"
msgid ""
"\"It is time to see this world with these new eyes...\" {n}He blinks.{/n} "
"\"Odd how you perceive the world... I may have to pluck an eye out. And that "
"smell...\" {n}He takes another breath, steadier than before.{/n} \"No "
"matter. Know that the wards at the tomb entrance are gone — I'll join you "
"there. But...\""
msgstr ""
"\"새로운 눈으로 세상을 볼 시간이다...\" {n}그는 눈을 깜빡입니다.{/n} \"세상을 그렇게 받아들이다니... 눈을 "
"뽑아버려야겠어. 그리고 그 냄새를...\" {n}그의 숨은 더 안정되었습니다.{/n} \"상관 없겠지. 무덤 앞의 워드도 사라졌다. 너를 "
"뒤쫓을 거야. 하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarAfterReinforced/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "8dbf79b6-c899-404f-9dea-aabaaf7158c0"
msgid ""
"\"First, you must decide what to do with those souls I captured. I don't "
"know what's more important to you — to preserve the lives of your servants "
"or to take advantage of the work I've done for you. That's all. Go.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우선 내가 사로잡은 영혼으로 무엇을 할지 정해라. 네 종들의 생명을 살려두는 것과 네 목표를 이루는 것 중 무엇이 중요한지 "
"모르겠구나. 내가 준비를 해 놓았다. 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarEnding/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3720a1fe-c8c3-4de8-aa3b-2254e7cafb62"
msgid ""
"{n}'Maegar' stares at you without blinking, his face like stone.{/n} \"You"
"'ve kept me waiting. In so doing, you disrespect me. And…\" {n}Vordakai "
"gives a disgusted hiss.{/n} \"I can feel this flesh slowly dying even as I "
"wait.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}'메이가르'는 눈도 깜빡하지 않고 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"나를 기다리게 했군. 이렇게 나를 실망시키는 건가. 그리고...\" "
"{n}보다카이는 불평을 합니다.{/n} \"이 신선한 공기도 점점 죽어가는구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarEnding/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "ae6e556b-2d51-446f-a15e-2c95100eb7f3"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai's eyes snap open.{/n} \"So you decided to set them free.\" {n}He "
"frowns.{/n} \"Wasteful — your kind breeds quickly, their numbers would have "
"been restored in short order.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이는 눈을 뜹니다.{/n} \"네가 그들을 풀어주었구나.\" {n}그는 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"쓸모없는 짓이다. "
"너희들은 빠르게 자라서 짧은 시간 안에 다시 수가 많아지지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarEnding/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "129c616a-92e9-4e14-9921-99751c7de503"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai's eyes slowly open.{/n} \"So you've decided to keep the jars for "
"your own needs.\" {n}He nods.{/n} \"Wise. My work on capturing these souls "
"is far more valuable than the lives within.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이는 눈을 천천히 뜹니다.{/n} \"그래서 이 항아리를 가지고 있겠다.\" {n}그는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"현명하구나. 이 "
"영혼들을 잡아두는 나의 일은 매우 중요하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarEnding/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "2b6da160-0eed-4f4e-b643-8dbcbf7555eb"
msgid ""
"\"I shall be your honored guest.\" {n}Vordakai's face twists — in what might "
"be a grin, but you're not sure.{/n} \"There, I will study your habits, your "
"books, absorb all I need... but do not fear, you and your barony shall "
"remain untouched.\" {n}He stares at you for a moment.{/n} \"For now. And "
"also, for now... farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 손님이 되어주겠다.\" {n}보다카이의 얼굴에서 웃음인지 알 수 없는 표정이 떠오릅니다.{/n} \"네 습성과 네 책들을 모두 "
"연구하겠다... 하지만 두려워 말아라. 너와 네 남작령은 건들지 않을 테니.\" {n}그는 잠시 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"지금은 작별 "
"인사를 할 때다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarEnding/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "3a978ca5-15ac-416a-8625-733d1fd7c8d7"
msgid ""
"\"Foul. I'd forgotten how skin... feels.\" {n}He shakes his head, like a dog "
"trying to throw off a collar.{/n} \"But the reason I wait... in the time "
"between then and now, what did you decide to do...\" {n}He closes his eyes, "
"as though listening to the sounds in the tomb... or to something else.{/n} "
"\"Those souls... Where are they...?\""
msgstr ""
"\"감촉을 느끼는 것을 잊어버렸었는데...\" {n}그는 개가 물기를 털어내듯 몸을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"하지만 내가 기다리는 이유는..."
"\" {n}그는 무덤 안의 소리를 들으려는 듯 눈을 감습니다.{/n} \"영혼들은... 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FalseMaegarEnding/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "1069b12a-ce78-4623-b5bf-e1e052b3a457"
msgid ""
"\"As for me, I shall assume the role of this...\" {n}He raises his hands, "
"and his face curls with contempt.{/n} \"...this '{d|Varn}Maegar{/d},' the "
"upstart ruler of {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}.\" {n}He turns to lock eyes with "
"you, and his voice grows colder, sharper.{/n} \"But know that my ambition is "
"greater than one settlement — I'll be with you, in your citadel, as befits "
"my station.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우선 역할을 정해야겠구나...\" {n}그는 손을 들더니 그의 얼굴은 경멸로 가득합니다.{/n} \"...이 "
"'{d|Varn}메이가르{/d}' 말이다.\" {n}그는 당신에게 시선을 고정하고 그의 목소리는 점점 차가워지고 날카로워집니다.{/n} "
"\"내 열망은 이전보다 더 강하다. 네 성채를 나의 기지로 삼아 너와 함께 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "9ce79b9f-a49e-49ac-bdb6-ec9feb0e8180"
msgid "\"Right. I can't wait to end this nightmare once and for all.\""
msgstr "\"좋다. 이 악몽이 어서 끝났으면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e2e42db4-fd53-4a7a-b263-faccf79d5cfe"
msgid "\"What makes you think so? Have you been here before?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 생각하는 거지? 전에 와 봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c6a5b019-cc3c-4269-9cf5-84e807b44a78"
msgid "\"What's the matter, Tristian? Frightened?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 상관이야? 겁을 먹은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "b5d8f872-a822-4395-bdd4-5d9cdd7f2eb7"
msgid "\"Enough talk, we need to move on.\""
msgstr "\"대화는 그만. 어서 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "0df090fc-6688-4b26-a9d0-51029b752a4e"
msgid ""
"\"You've been acting strangely ever since we've entered this tomb. What's "
"the matter?\""
msgstr "\"이 무덤에 들어온 후로 이상하게 행동하는데. 왜 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "8c804e06-5e7c-45be-92c5-db52ef985daf"
msgid ""
"\"You insisted on accompanying me, and now that you're here, you're acting "
"strangely — what's the matter?\""
msgstr "\"나와 함께 있어달라고 하더니 이제 와서 왜 이상하게 구는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "690990bf-2056-4f9d-ab82-6e5649de4055"
msgid "\"Is there something you're not telling me?\""
msgstr "\"나에게 말하지 않은 것 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "bc81a7aa-d73c-4ee9-9aea-7d818b016756"
msgid "\"Are you ready? What lies ahead may be the end of us.\""
msgstr "\"준비 됐어? 곧 우리 앞에 있는 것이 끝일지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d4e033f0-9d70-49d5-89bc-a7639652e026"
msgid "\"Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "a89fd5e1-bac7-40fd-babc-fb956d88fb12"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever awaits us, we will face it. This is no time for last words "
"between us.\""
msgstr "\"우리를 기다리는 것이 무엇이든 우리는 맞설 거야. 마지막 말을 준비할 시간은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "13f7ff40-3219-4d08-ade2-3068b0b7a234"
msgid ""
"Confirmed that Tristian is a friend and it would be a shame to part ways "
"with him."
msgstr "트리스티안은 친구이고 헤어진다면 아쉬울 것이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "34c48009-c676-4041-a448-e90807e19ee9"
msgid ""
"\"My last words for you? I'd say that you were my ally and my friend. I "
"could always count on your support. And if it was within my power, I'd do "
"all I could to keep you by my side.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 할 마지막 말? 너는 나의 친구였어. 네 도움은 항상 고맙다. 할 수 있다면 너를 내 옆에 두었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0d6bf02a-9626-4f98-91c8-dd0d8ecb1bf8"
msgid "Confirmed Tristian's right to choose his own path."
msgstr "자신의 길을 떠나라고 트리스티안에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "5faeff4c-2f55-49f9-9aac-b0033091ba70"
msgid ""
"\"I'd regret we had so little time together and wish you luck on your path.\""
msgstr "\"함께 있을 시간이 없어서 아쉬웠고 행운을 빈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "53fce688-5686-4f78-a995-273621f2f9f7"
msgid "Informed Tristian that he was just a useful instrument."
msgstr "트리스티안은 그저 도구였을 뿐이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "db4861a6-2ccc-4728-9036-3ea4455e2672"
msgid ""
"\"Would I spare 'last words' for a chisel, a hammer, or any other tool, no "
"matter how useful? Thus, cleric, I have none to spare for you.\""
msgstr "\"마지막 인사를 준비하려면 끌이나 망치 따위가 필요하나? 너에게 줄 시간도 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "5aaa9ac4-7388-4a9a-8f27-602115403a32"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, enough already — I need you to pull yourself together and focus."
"\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 그만. 정신 차리고 집중해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "f1843264-a5d4-4e0b-9115-406f62bff036"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's voice drops, as if he's afraid of being overheard.{/n} \"The "
"heart of the tomb. Vordakai is close now.\""
msgstr "{n}무언가 들으려는 듯 트리스티안의 목소리는 줄어듭니다.{/n} \"무덤의 심장부야. 보다카이가 가까이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9372180c-7336-4e43-9a59-20ed7086d999"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, it's time to finish this.\" {n}Tristian echoes your words.{/n} \"Once "
"and for all.\""
msgstr "\"이제 이것을 끝낼 차례야.\" {n}트리스티안은 말합니다.{/n} \"영원히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "289bd206-768c-48be-8cda-97e23d3fd0e9"
msgid ""
" \"What? No, of course not. But like all who follow "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}...\" {n}Tristian shivers, then winces, as if in "
"pain.{/n} \"...I can feel the evil in this place, thick like the stench of "
"rot and decay.\""
msgstr ""
" \"뭐라고요? 물론 안 와봤죠. 하지만 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 따르는 모든 사람들처럼...\" {n}트리스티안은 "
"고통스러운 듯 몸을 떨고 있습니다.{/n} \"...썩고 부패한 악취가 진동합니다. 악의 존재를 이곳에서 느낄 수 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "44213a3b-0c0b-4800-9a73-7b93d857545e"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"No, {name}. Though, now I think upon it, "
"I suppose I am scared. But not of what lies behind this door.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 머리를 가로저었습니다.{/n} \"아니. {name}. 약간은 두려워. 하지만 이 문 뒤의 존재 때문에 그런 건 아니야."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "91374696-2de3-41f7-87d4-ae2bbbb475da"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"It is no matter, {name}. This place... it "
"feeds on doubt, fear... loss.\" {n}Tristian raises his head and looks at "
"you, as if to steady himself.{/n} \"If we were to never see each other "
"again... would you have any last words for me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"그건 중요하지 않습니다. {name}. 이 장소는... 의심과 공포를 먹고 살죠.\" {n}"
"트리스티안은 고개를 들어 스스로 진정시키려는 듯 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"우리가 만약 다시 만나지 못한다면... 나에게 해 줄 마지막 "
"말이라도 있나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "900033f4-3c1d-4d57-a892-0c66c760a56a"
msgid "{n}Tristian nods silently, and says no more.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 소리 없이 끄덕이고는 아무 말도 하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "41ca1971-23ff-4752-bde4-44f06e2adae4"
msgid ""
"\"I have shared all I can.\" {n}Tristian smiles wearily.{/n} \"Each of us "
"has secrets and burdens we must carry alone, for the weight is not lessened "
"in sharing them. So are your secrets yours to keep and share as you decide.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 알겠어.\" {n}트리스티안은 약하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"우리 모두 비밀이 있고 짊어져야 할 비밀이 있어. 그것을 함께 안다고 "
"해도 가벼워지지는 않지. 그러니 비밀을 나누는 것은 네 결정이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "75c678cc-5d0a-4d06-bc10-baf800dd1e49"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian is still for a moment, then nods.{/n} \"Yes. I am ready. Even if "
"it means the end of us.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 잠시 말이 없다 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그래. 준비 됐어. 그것이 끝을 의미할지라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0266e1c6-53bf-41e4-b64b-3ac23567cbf7"
msgid ""
"\"Vordakai conquered these lands once, and could do so again, easily, with "
"the artifact he possesses.\" {n}Tristian's voice is level.{/n} \"I may not "
"survive this confrontation. If not, I would like to know who I was to you.\" "
"{n}Tristian meets your gaze calmly, but you feel a sudden sense of loss, as "
"if speaking to a drowning man.{/n} \"I need to know if I mattered to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보다카이가 이 땅을 지배했었고 그가 유물을 가졌다면 더 쉽게 자신의 땅을 찾을 수도 있어.\" {n}트리스티안의 목소리가 "
"차분해집니다.{/n} \"나는 되살아날 수 없을 수도 있어. 하지만 그 전에 내가 너에게 어떤 사람이었는지 알았으면 해.\" {n}"
"트리스티안은 조용히 당신을 보았지만 당신은 마치 죽은 사람에게 말하듯 상실감을 느낍니다.{/n} \"내가 너에게 중요한 사람이었을까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5c713249-0c26-4896-b09e-eb97456a0b38"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles, but it is tinged with sadness.{/n} \"Ever since I met "
"you, I have thought myself blessed to stand with a {mf|hero|heroine} such as "
"you.\" {n}Tristian pauses, his face conflicted.{/n} \"But this blessing — it "
"was not the gods, it was your strength, and for that…\" {n}Tristian stops, "
"then simply nods.{/n} \"For that, let us take faith in each other, and purge "
"the evil from this place.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 미소를 짓지만 슬픔이 깃들었습니다.{/n} \"당신을 만난 이후로, 당신과 같은 영웅과 함께 서게 되어 축복받았다고 "
"생각했어요.\" {n}트리스티안은 멈추더니 그의 얼굴은 괴로움이 나타납니다.{/n} \"하지만 이 축복은 신의 은혜가 아니라 당신의 "
"힘이었습니다...\" {n}트리스티안은 멈추더니 가볍게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그러니 서로 믿음을 가지고 이 곳에서 악을 "
"정화합시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "62f0065c-3675-4e40-bf78-d7167053c091"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian is silent for a moment.{/n} \"We each have a path, and while "
"they may intersect for a time, it is only a matter of time before they part "
"again.\" {n}He nods.{/n} \"I thank you. I am ready… we are ready... for "
"Vordakai.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"우리는 각자 길이 있고 잠시 길이 갈릴 수도 있어. 하지만 다시 만나는 것은 시간 문제이지."
"\" {n}그는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"고마워. 나는 준비가 되었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/FinalAngelTalk/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "016fb313-4ce6-448e-8818-05c178f3e9da"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods sadly.{/n} \"I thank you for your honesty — not many people "
"are free enough to speak their mind, and much harm is born from not doing "
"so. I admire your strength — and I am ready for what comes.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 슬프게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"솔직하게 말해주어 고마워. 마음 속 말을 자유롭게 말하는 사람은 많지 않아. "
"그래서 더욱 고통을 받지. 너의 힘을 잘 아니 나는 다가올 시련에 준비가 되었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "7f93df34-2598-480b-82dd-6cca97b74f7c"
msgid ""
"\"Willas Gunderson, right? Do you remember me? Once, you sought my help with "
"the island on Candlemere.\""
msgstr "\"윌라스 건더슨 맞지? 나를 기억하나? 캔들미어의 섬에서 나에게 도움을 요청했었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c05399cd-387a-4990-94ff-26f27ca399cb"
msgid "\"Why do you still remain in this world?\""
msgstr "\"왜 아직 이 세상에 남아있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f2f3d9a6-268e-4b77-8be1-4214c09f85c0"
msgid "Destroyed Willas Gunderson's ghost."
msgstr "윌라스 건더슨의 유령을 없앴습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f72e77c0-ba13-48cf-9560-881d16815f74"
msgid "[Attack] \"You attacked me first — now you'll pay!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네가 나를 먼저 공격했으니 댓가를 치르게 해주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "e67f4d69-0079-4900-b919-34a71d3c298d"
msgid "\"How did you end up here?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 여기에 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "7c537e36-1d03-4119-9e8a-3f811610d57e"
msgid "\"What happened in the tomb?\""
msgstr "\"무덤에서 무슨 일이 생긴 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "e624ad9a-8e94-4d8a-9dc7-f8e2c6ff01e7"
msgid "\"Varnhold — where are its citizens?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드의 시민들은 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "26c1f6c0-5dab-4443-902a-8cef5b222f4e"
msgid "\"Why wasn't your soul imprisoned?\""
msgstr "\"왜 네 영혼은 갇히지 않았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "801208f8-b103-4a22-a46d-3b6d1587df75"
msgid "Absolved Willas Gunderson and set him on the River of Souls."
msgstr "윌라스 건더슨을 풀어주고 영혼의 강에 보내주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "961c0ab8-d3d9-4c2d-8d98-6ccb5c6b5f46"
msgid ""
"\"You've suffered enough and paid the price for your mistakes. If before you "
"can travel the River of Souls you need forgiveness — I forgive you. Go in "
"peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 충분히 고통받았고 실수에 대한 댓가를 치루었어. 영혼의 강에 가기 전에 너는 용서가 필요할 거야. 내가 너를 용서하겠다. 편히 "
"쉬길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "06bb0ef7-311b-4cad-9345-3fade551963f"
msgid "Promised Gunderson to avenge him."
msgstr "건더슨에게 그에게 복수하겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "f88147bd-0d63-48bb-8670-df71d37ce0a7"
msgid "\"I'm sorry. I'll make Vordakai regret what he did to you.\""
msgstr "\"그것 참 안 됐군. 보다카이가 후회하게 해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fee3bcfa-cf87-4074-8908-8c0ea14fcd4a"
msgid "Blamed Gunderson for Varnhold vanishing."
msgstr "반홀드가 사라지게 한 건더슨을 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "74c053ff-5e54-4177-9e3d-ff6daaf5f4dc"
msgid ""
"\"You deserved your punishment. You caused the suffering of countless "
"innocents — this is the price you must pay.\""
msgstr "\"너는 그러한 벌을 받아 마땅하다. 수많은 무고한 자를 고통받게 했으니 그것은 네가 치러야 할 대가야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0035_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5a8bdd21-b887-4213-986c-4c9de6378356"
msgid "Left Gunderson alone."
msgstr "건더슨을 혼자 내버려두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "f09a6e8a-b8b8-4cae-90a4-0c06b99a5a1c"
msgid "\"I must go. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "dd2c3520-af86-4c3f-9103-1b7f9991748f"
msgid "\"Have you seen Vordakai? Tell me about him.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이를 보았나? 그에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "9694eba3-9abf-4796-b8f9-c918a46df0dc"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! Mercy!\" {n}The ghost's voice is faint, as if speaking from far "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"잠깐! 살려줘!\" {n}유령의 목소리는 멀리서 외치는 듯 희미했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "38dbddda-7c12-458b-b7dc-fd56e25259ea"
msgid ""
"{n}The figure before you looks... vague, indistinct, as if it could "
"dissipate into the air at any moment.{/n} \"Ba... {mf|baron|baroness}? Is "
"that you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞의 모습은... 희미하고 언제라도 공기 중으로 사라질 듯한 모습이었습니다.{/n} \"... {name}? 정말로?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "cc59be87-ba2a-4078-ac1c-ff7846b35db9"
msgid ""
"\"Flee from this place — before it's too late! This dungeon is a trap! A "
"trap!\""
msgstr "\"여기를 벗어나. 늦기 전에! 이 던전은 함정이야! 함정이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "94f5913a-c243-4cc8-b9a3-195cadf4ee9d"
msgid ""
"\"I tried! I tried to leave, but...\" {n}His voice becomes fainter.{/n} \"I "
"fear to. I did all I could to be a decent man, but... but what if it was not "
"enough? What if {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} decides to cast me down… to be "
"eaten by demons?\""
msgstr ""
"\"해 봤어! 도망가려 해 봤지만...\" {n}그의 목소리는 더 희미해집니다.{/n} \"두려웠어. 승천하려고 했지만... 그걸로 "
"부족할까 걱정되었어. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}가 나를 데몬의 먹이로 던져버릴까봐...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "dd71dfde-fb56-48ef-a8b3-19a79e730683"
msgid ""
"\"No, I'm not ready yet. I need to think. To work up my courage. I need…\" "
"{n}His voice fades, becoming nothing more than a faint, indistinct "
"whispering.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 아직 준비되지 않았어. 생각을 해 봐야겠어. 용기를 얻어야겠어. 나는...\" {n}그의 목소리는 희미하거나 흐릿한 귓속말이나 "
"다름 없었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "eeb9b1ce-5fc5-4a73-b5a4-94f1d7fb1980"
msgid "\"It's not my fault! It was a mistake! A huge, foolish mistake!\""
msgstr "\"내 잘못이 아니야! 내 실수였어! 아주 멍청한 실수였지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "312fa8e8-3521-4cc7-82b8-2f42244bcaf3"
msgid ""
"\"I was wandering through the mountains. Searching for something... "
"something that would prove my worth, make others sit up and take notice, a "
"little respect. People always used to talk that there were some ancient "
"ruins in {g|Tors of Levenies}Tors of Levenies{/g}. But all I found were pot "
"shards and rubble. So, the next morning I decided to head to "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, and from there, to {g|Restov}Restov{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 산 속을 헤매고 있었어. 무언가를 찾으러... 다른 사람들이 입을 벌리고 경이롭게 쳐다 볼 유물을 찾으러 갔어. 사람들이 거기 "
"어딘가에 {g|Tors of Levenies}레베니스 바위산맥{/g}에 유물이 있다고 하더군. 하지만 내가 찾은 것은 도자기 파편과 "
"돌덩이 뿐이었어. 그 다음 날 나는 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}로 향했고 거기서 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}로 향했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "4c6eb309-efc8-471f-a479-1dc0944a756e"
msgid ""
"\"Then something... happened. I can't tell if it was a dream or — it... it "
"was as if someone had set a compass needle behind my eyes, and it was "
"pointing me in another direction. So, I went… through the darkness... and "
"ended up at the outside of this damned tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 뭔가가... 일어났어. 그것이 꿈인지 생시인지 알 수는 없었지만... 마치 누군가 내 눈에다가 나침반을 대고, 이 방향으로 "
"움직이라 가리키는 것 같았지. 그래서 나는... 어둠 속으로 갔고... 이 망할 무덤 밖에서 죽게 되었던 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "46c1ad49-0361-4b48-8774-0c5d4160323f"
msgid ""
"\"I... just wanted to take a look! So… I know it was foolish, but I saw this "
"bracelet... entirely of jade! An entire fortune, worn on the wrist! I "
"shouldn't have taken it, but I couldn't resist — so I snatched it and fled "
"before some dead thing crawled from the tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그저 보고 싶었을 뿐인데! 바보 같은 짓이었지만 나는 그 팔찌를 발견했고... 그것은 옥석이 박혀있는 것이었지! 아주 값진 보물 "
"같아보였어! 그것을 가져가면 안 됐지만 참을 수 없어서 그것을 낚아채자 무덤에서 죽은 것들이 기어나왔고 그곳을 서둘러 도망갔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "e9f98e81-a2ce-441a-8c16-7e778c1f02e9"
msgid ""
"\"I returned to {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g} and gave the bracelet to Maegar — I "
"expected he'd pay me with a good sum of gold.\" {n}Willas is silent for a "
"moment.{/n} \"But before I could get my reward, it came for us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}로 돌아와 메이가르에게 팔찌를 주었어. 그가 돈으로 보상을 해주기를 바라면서 말이지.\" {n}"
"윌라스는 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"하지만 보상을 받기도 전에 이 사단이 일어나고 말았지\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "3db1b634-5f51-454f-af48-f7d079adafc9"
msgid ""
"\"They left. By their own free will. By the will of someone else, to be "
"precise. I was among them... I remember that... voice ringing in my head. "
"The voice, like an emperor, giving orders no one could disobey. So... I did "
"everything it demanded. And so did the others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 떠났어. 자신들의 결정으로. 정확히는 누군가의 의지였어. 나는 그들 중 하나였어... 내 머리 속에 들리던 그 목소리가 "
"기억나는군. 거스를 수 없는 황제의 명령같았지. 그래서... 나는 시키는 모든 것을 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "5fdae532-a02d-4d16-88c9-31b1474fabd0"
msgid ""
"\"That's how all of us ended up here. Vordakai... he's... evil incarnate. He "
"blamed us for stealing what was his, then tore our souls from out chests and "
"imprisoned them. As for the bodies... you'll find them in the next room, the "
"dining hall.\" {n}Willas' silhouette quavers.{/n} \"I can't bear to look "
"upon them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 여기로 오게 된 것이야. 보다카이... 그는 악의 화신이야. 자신의 것을 훔쳤다고 우리를 비난했고 가슴을 찢어 영혼을 빼앗아 "
"봉인했어. 그리고 시체는... 옆 연회실에 있을 거야.\" {n}윌라스의 그림자가 떨립니다.{/n} \"내 시체는 차마 볼 수가 없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "902afb95-6126-466b-a8af-75468d588d4e"
msgid ""
"{n}Willas is silent for so long, you begin to wonder if he's going to answer "
"at all. When he speaks again, his voice is fainter than before, as if "
"ashamed.{/n} \"Vordakai decided I deserve a harsher punishment than the "
"others. After all, I was the one who stole his bracelet, the one who drew "
"his eye. But he didn't torture my body, instead he... raked his fingers "
"through my mind, plucking out memory after memory. He made me confess every "
"bad thing I ever did, every shame, showed me how... weak I was.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}윌라스는 잠시 침묵했고 당신은 그가 대답을 해줄지 궁금했습니다. 그가 다시 말했을 때 부끄러운 듯 그의 목소리는 더 "
"희미해졌습니다.{/n} \"보다카이는 내가 다른 자들보다 더 많이 고통받아야 한다고 했어. 나는 그의 팔찌를 훔쳤으니. 내 육체는 "
"고문당하지 않았지만 그는... 내 머릿속으로 들어가 기억을 뒤집어버렸지. 나는 내가 했던 모든 나쁜 일들과 수치스러운 기억들을 자백했어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "69338193-5137-4dc2-a3c6-20379637f2e1"
msgid ""
"\"After he was finished with me, he slit my throat with his finger… but I "
"didn't die, he released my soul through the wound so that I might forever be "
"amongst those who died as a result of my weakness. So here I remain. It's "
"what I deserve for all the grief and suffering I caused in my life.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 고문한 뒤 그는 내 목을 그었지만... 나는 죽지 않았고 내 영혼은 상처 사이로 세어나와 나 때문에 죽은 자들 사이를 영원히 "
"떠돌아야 했어. 그래서 여기에 남게 되었지. 내가 저지른 잘못으로 이런 벌을 받은 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "7d60cc82-742a-4529-ad09-b66c1fc053a9"
msgid ""
"\"You… you forgive me? But... I did so much harm... yet there is still a "
"hope for me beyond this world?\" {n}Willas's eyes widen, and you notice his "
"form is fading, dissipating into the air.{/n} \"I hope the gods will be as "
"merciful to you as Your Grace was to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를... 용서해주겠다고? 하지만... 내가 잘못한 것은... 아직 이 세상에 희망이 남아있는 걸까?\" {n}윌라스는 놀란 표정을 "
"지었고 그의 형상은 공기 중으로 사라지기 시작합니다.{/n} \"네가 나에게 그랬듯 신들도 자비로웠다면 좋을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "cb10afb7-f6eb-4928-8f15-388b279cad14"
msgid ""
"{n}The ghost is barely visible in the darkness — Willas looks at you "
"warily.{/n} \"Why did you return?\""
msgstr "{n}유령은 어둠 속에서 거의 보이지 않습니다. 윌라스는 당신을 걱정스럽게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"왜 돌아왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "3c2bb536-ce7d-4c5b-be9e-2b27b36705f4"
msgid ""
"{n}Willas begins to fade, about to disappear entirely.{/n} \"I am sorry. I'm "
"truly sorry…\""
msgstr "{n}윌라스는 공기 중으로 사라지기 시작합니다.{/n} \"미안해. 정말 미안해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "1d761611-2e70-458d-852f-899663c65325"
msgid ""
"\"I thank you, Your Grace, but I ask that you save yourself. I am beyond "
"salvation.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 하지만 조심하길 바라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "029a2d29-e53b-478c-b679-d0922a6a5653"
msgid ""
"\"A lich, a cyclops... their dead emperor. He's an ancient creature... "
"perhaps the most ancient creature on all {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. He... he "
"hates humans, dwarves, elves... 'the lesser races', the slaves, he calls "
"them. He can twist our minds and crush our wills into dust. I know, for I "
"fell... victim to his power.\""
msgstr ""
"\"리치. 사이클롭스. 그들의 죽은 황제지. 그는 고대의 생물이고... 아마 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 가장 오래된 고대의 "
"생물일 거야. 그는... 인간, 드워프, 엘프들을 열등한 종족이고 자신들의 노예라고 부르고 있어. 그는 우리의 정신에 고통을 주어 의지를 "
"없앨 수가 있지. 나는 알고 있어. 그의... 희생자였기 때문에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "1670f73b-b4f9-4d6a-ac02-fd98293fb045"
msgid ""
"\"He boasts that he'll conquer the world. But you know I think... the "
"centuries have taken their toll, weakened him as he lay sleeping here in his "
"tomb. I don't believe Vordakai is all-powerful… it may be possible to defeat "
"him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 세상을 지배하겠다고 했어. 하지만 내 생각에는... 세월 때문에 그는 무덤에서 잠드는 동안 힘이 약해진 것 같아. 보다카이가 "
"전능하다는 것을 믿지는 않지만... 그를 이길 수는 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "c632742e-11b3-4755-af52-2d116fa8eda8"
msgid "\"My time has come. Thank you and farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나의 시간이 왔어. 고마워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "cfd4fb3f-bbe3-4b1d-ab0b-6cf1212d2184"
msgid ""
"\"So devouring people is not enough for this monster. It wants a crown. I "
"see.\""
msgstr "\"사람들을 잡아먹는 것으로 충분하지 않아. 그것은 왕관을 원할 거야. 반드시.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0d6855a4-e29b-4b24-82c4-34bb5b25af3e"
msgid ""
"\"As if the {g|Technic League}Technic League{/g} was not enough — here is "
"another wannabe master! Well, he's getting no slaves here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g}로 충분치 않은 것처럼 여기에 마스터가 되고 싶은 자가 또 있군! 그의 노예는 "
"사라지고 있지만 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3fccd1cd-2c12-460b-8853-313b69dfca0f"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! That's what you get for sticking your long nose and greedy fingers "
"where they don't belong! Hm-m... This is probably the way I'm going to die "
"too someday.\""
msgstr "\"하! 그래서 그렇게 욕심을 부리는 것이군! 흠... 나는 이것 때문에 언젠가 죽을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "3a533e94-b526-4491-946a-864336511ac1"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin stares at the ghost, then shakes his head violently and turns "
"away.{/n} \"Nok-Nok not know where he go when die. Not need to know. Dead is "
"dead — Nok-Nok is still alive. All good.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 유령을 보고는 머리를 심하게 흔들고는 외면합니다.{/n} \"녹-녹은 그가 언제 어디서 죽은지 모른다. 몰라도 돼. 죽음은 "
"죽음이다. 녹-녹 살아있다. 괜찮다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "544bbe3d-c0de-42e1-b5a3-ce96b1c08ea7"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah frowns.{/n} \"There's nothing good in death – you're right about "
"that. But an existence like yours isn't very joyful either...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"죽음은 좋은 것이 아니지. 네가 맞아. 하지만 너처럼 존재한다는 건 그다지 유쾌하지 않은 거 "
"같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "7e8fb9b7-5e26-4c56-b73b-12460a64827b"
msgid ""
"\"So the entire settlement died because of one careless treasure hunter? "
"I'll tell this story next time someone tries to convince me that tramps and "
"fortune-seekers are harmless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 모든 이의 죽음은 그저 보물 사냥꾼의 부주의함 때문이었던 거야? 보물 찾기가 위험하지 않다는 녀석에게 다음에 이 이야기를 "
"말해줘야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/GundarsonSurrender/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f956f02f-41c8-4cb9-9287-d9b5f710d635"
msgid ""
"\"Anger rarely visits my soul, but I'd be happy to rip Vordakai's dead heart "
"from his chest, whoever he is. But can't we help Willas? Are we really just "
"going to leave him alone in the dark like that? I could even shelter a ghost "
"at my home, so that he wouldn't wander, suffering and alone, unable to even "
"talk to anyone... It's a pity my sister wouldn't allow it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"분노가 내 영혼을 사로잡은 적은 별로 없지만 보다카이의 가슴을 찢어 심장을 꺼내서 기쁘군. 그리고 윌라스를 도와주면 안 될까? 그를 "
"어둠 속에 내버려두고 가려고? 유령이 방황하고 고통을 받으며 외롭게 지낼 바에 우리 집에 살게 해줘도 될 거 같아... 내 자매가 "
"허락하지 않아서 안타깝지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Items/DemonEyeRuby_Description_String
msgctxt "00aa4c81-8fd0-43ad-bedb-59cfb2ed7b52"
msgid "A precious gem of an unusual maroon color."
msgstr "특이한 적갈색을 띈 희귀한 보석입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Items/DemonEyeRuby_Name_String
msgctxt "9a277124-56e4-4abf-bb0c-855d0728ae7b"
msgid "Cabochon Ruby"
msgstr "카보콘 루비"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "49c0478c-d8b3-421f-8bca-0e911aeb2779"
msgid "\"Why do you say this?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그런 말을 하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "136cffa3-f7c9-4e4f-a93c-6b0dedfc018a"
msgid "\"We have no time for that.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그럴 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5e13c74e-a063-45e8-8e13-d3247a5f156c"
msgid "Condemned violence as method of achieving own goals."
msgstr "자신의 목적을 이루기 위해 폭력을 휘두르는 것은 나쁘다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "249ad166-b469-4221-a4d6-a77ee51b53f5"
msgid ""
"\"Evil's voice can be strong, fearful — sometimes seductive in its "
"corruption. But we must face it, no matter its voice, and stand against it.\""
msgstr "\"악은 타락 속에 강함과 두려움이 있고 가끔은 매혹적이기도 하지. 하지만 악을 마주하면 어떤 목소리가 들려도 맞서야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f27f625a-8d96-4021-bf83-db0f77de9d88"
msgid "Evaded answering if goals justify violent means."
msgstr "목적은 폭력을 정당화 하냐는 물음을 회피했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "ed76e543-4901-48d0-8941-aa5fe1e8f7f4"
msgid ""
"\"You never know where life's path will take you. But I would never harm "
"someone intentionally for my gain — or another's.\""
msgstr "\"인생이 어떻게 될지는 아무도 몰라. 하지만 이익을 위해 누군가를 괴롭히지는 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7ac5281c-34b1-473f-8f0a-7ec464f35b36"
msgid "Justified violence as method of achieving own goals."
msgstr "자신의 목적을 이루기 위한 폭력을 정당화했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "9310ac0a-9afa-4b88-bc96-b8b69ac370c3"
msgid ""
"\"Creating a disaster or two is a small price to pay to gain the support of "
"an arch-daemon.\""
msgstr "\"악의 도움을 받기 위해 작은 대가를 치룰 수도 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "6e9891d7-1a46-4f97-b412-2f6c5c0da798"
msgid "\"Enough with the moral lessons, Tristian. Let's move on.\""
msgstr "\"도덕 시간은 끝났어. 트리스티안. 잊어버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Barks/Panel_String
msgctxt "805f1336-8890-4845-a074-ec4f81e1dc76"
msgid "A carving of four daemonic horsemen is inscribed on this stone."
msgstr "악의 네 기수가 돌에 조각되어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Barks/Walls_String
msgctxt "6633bcec-5ba8-44ac-a41b-c1094d7311dc"
msgid ""
"The walls are covered with carvings of various disasters — war, plague, "
"famine, and other cataclysms."
msgstr "벽에는 전쟁, 역병, 굶주림 등 다양한 재앙을 조각해놓았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "189c4f39-9034-4352-b1ae-562280d07daf"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian scans the chamber, his eyes wary.{/n} \"This is… a dark place.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 방안을 둘러보고는 진지해집니다.{/n} \"이곳은... 악이 물들었군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5dc331b6-778d-420f-a578-3f34312babf4"
msgid ""
"\"These carvings on the walls… they are a chronicle of rituals. They depict "
"the worship of the most depraved of creatures — the daemonic Four Horsemen "
"of Apocalypse. Their followers serve the will of their masters — death and "
"destruction.\""
msgstr ""
"\"벽의 조각들은... 의식하는 과정을 그렸습니다. 그들이 숭배하는 다이몬인 종말의 네 기수를 묘사했군요. 그들의 추종자는 주인의 의지를 "
"따릅니다. 죽음과 파괴 말이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3363c3a2-103a-440c-80fd-7eecd22ec30d"
msgid "\"You are right. Forgive me. I'll control myself.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아. 용서해줘. 다음부터는 조심하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "91f12b44-0b2d-45d5-8597-afa54db4b0ef"
msgid ""
"\"Every disaster, every misfortune serves the Horsemen. Suffering and pain "
"are what they treasure above all else. They see life as a harvest — and even "
"knowing their nature, there are those who embrace horrific acts to gain the "
"Horsemen's favor.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 재앙과 불행은 기수에게 제공됩니다. 육체적 고통과 정신적 괴로움은 무엇보다도 그들이 소중히 여기는 것입니다. 그들은 생명을 "
"수확물로 여깁니다. 그리고 심지어 그들의 본성을 알면서도, 기수의 환심을 사기 위해 끔찍한 행위를 기꺼이 받아들이는 자들이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "35635a0d-ddbe-4b41-b25d-9d0988a333b4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian nods slightly, frowning.{/n} \"You are right. But there are "
"times where doing the right thing... it is beyond our power.\" {n}He sighs, "
"then casts a dark glance at the chamber.{/n} \"We should leave this place.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 얼굴을 찡그리며 살짝 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"당신이 맞습니다. 하지만 옳은 일을 할 때도 있어요... 그것은 우리의 "
"힘을 넘어서는 일입니다.\" {n}그는 한숨을 쉬며 어두운 표정으로 회의실을 봅니다.{/n} \"우린 이곳을 떠나야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c8bf9623-9a02-4dff-ab96-c3ebfe1b84ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks at you for a moment, then nods.{/n} \"You are right. "
"Sometimes life gives us obstacles we can't overcome without sacrificing a "
"part of ourselves.\" {n}He looks around the room again, then shakes his "
"head.{/n} \"We should leave this place.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 잠시 당신을 보더니 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"네가 맞아. 가끔 삶은 희생 없이는 넘을 수 없는 장애물을 주기도 "
"하지.\" {n}그는 방 주위를 둘러보고는 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"이 장소를 떠나야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/OculusChamberAngelTalk/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5a22ecaa-c94c-4fb7-8c97-7246cc1d0e8e"
msgid ""
"\"The price of the suffering of others always seems insignificant, until you "
"are the one thrown on the pyre for another's gain.\" {n}Tristian shakes his "
"head.{/n} \"I can already feel this place whispering to us. We should leave."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"배신을 당하기 전까지는 다른 자들이 겪는 고통은 중요하지 않아.\" {n}트리스티안은 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"이 장소가 우리에게 "
"속삭이는 걸 느꼈어. 어서 떠나자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "71eec304-67c9-43fc-8df7-be022172352e"
msgid "\"Yes. I'll put an end to this nightmare very soon.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 이 악몽을 곧 끝낼 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "8145ecec-ffd2-406f-a903-e349093129fa"
msgid ""
"\"Here is the real question — is he ready to die? For that's what awaits him "
"at my hands.\""
msgstr "\"중요한 건 그가 죽을 준비가 되었느냐야. 그가 처할 운명이기 때문이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "74ed6385-6ad0-4862-b5d9-70c1ca8c57e0"
msgid "\"Get gone from here, crow.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 꺼져.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "31916997-cad1-42d9-b88b-86bb578e80e4"
msgid "\"Jubilost.\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "fc6cf3e1-c815-4d56-b2e2-629b6729c0e1"
msgid "\"Octavia.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "cbef67bb-2671-4b35-9af2-1e5a80f5bf80"
msgid "\"Regongar.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "902ba4c9-e59f-4431-8718-5fc550236429"
msgid "\"Ekundayo.\""
msgstr "\"에쿤다요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "c4891142-700c-4772-91fb-5eb41af388d3"
msgid "\"Valerie.\""
msgstr "\"발레리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "7cab5902-e3c8-43ad-92b9-87e180040653"
msgid "\"Jaethal.\""
msgstr "\"제이탈.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "0cbaf777-2c2f-49e3-bf44-c18da091b89d"
msgid "\"Nok-Nok. Easily.\""
msgstr "\"Nok-Nok. 쉽군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8f954341-e76e-4177-9c9c-a85110aab1a9"
msgid "\"Harrim.\""
msgstr "\"하림.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "b2e611e9-8dc7-4e12-a8ac-f67e3edadc89"
msgid "\"Amiri.\""
msgstr "\"아미리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "fc52be26-e35d-45ae-98e0-7c90999c75d9"
msgid "\"Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "7e846077-5a35-4826-9878-2c90ef514837"
msgid "\"Linzi.\""
msgstr "\"린지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "bea3e401-04a6-4875-84df-964a370ffeac"
msgid "\"I have no idea what you are talking about.\""
msgstr "\"네가 무슨 말을 하는지 모르겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "099aba48-fa29-483d-b95f-d43597ac3034"
msgid "\"Kaessi.\""
msgstr "\"카에시.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d9bf5695-5893-477a-8fec-ad7a68940db3"
msgid ""
"\"Brrrace up, {race} — the throne rrroom is nearr. Arre you ready to meet "
"grrrreat Vordakai? Arrre you ready to accept the gift of serrrving my "
"masterrr?\""
msgstr ""
"\"준비해라. {race}. 왕좌의 방이 가까이에 있다. 보라카이님을 맞을 준비가 되었느냐? 주인님의 은총을 받을 준비가 되었느냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "d2afb610-9d7e-46e6-b76f-12768a347f44"
msgid ""
"\"My masterrr awaits. But beforre you enterrr his prrresence…\" {n}The crow "
"scans your band.{/n} \"Vordakai has no use for the weak, nor any who beg for "
"merrrcy… but he sees value in using such souls as herrrralds for his coming. "
"The question…\" {n}The crow makes a croak, as if sneering.{/n} \"Is who is "
"weakest among you? Who should be sent away, disrrrregarded — pick the "
"weakest among you to fly from here in fearrr and serrrve Vordakai in their "
"flight? The grrreat Vordakai will let them keep theirrr lives – but makes no "
"promises afterrr this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주인님이 기다린다. 하지만 들어가기 전에...\" {n}까마귀는 당신 동료들을 훑어봅니다.{/n} \"보다카이님은 약자나 자비를 "
"구걸하는 자를 싫어하지. 하지만 그들이 선지자로서 쓸만할 수도 있다.\" {n}까마귀는 비웃듯 까악거립니다.{/n} \"너희 중 가장 "
"약한 자는 누구지? 쫓아버려야 할 녀석은 누군지 골라라. 겁에 질려 여기서 도망가 보다카이님의 두려움을 퍼뜨릴 녀석이 누구지? 주인님은 "
"그들을 잠시는 살려줄지도 모른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "dcb23c31-7a02-46d1-8362-969764c986d2"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok, who has been strangely quiet… and now that you notice, has a "
"hungry gleam in his eye as he watches the raven… suddenly speaks.{/n} \"This "
"Vordakai is truly great? Then Nok-Nok will allow him to serve and learn to "
"be truly-truly great. Price of lesson cheap, only cost Vordakai...\" {n}He "
"studies the raven, then licks his lips.{/n} \"One raven.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이상하게 말이 없던 녹-녹은 까마귀를 보자 욕망이 찬 표정을 짓습니다. 그리고는 말합니다.{/n} \"보다카이가 위대하다고? 녹 "
"녹이 그 녀석을 부하로 삼아 더 위대하게 해주지. 배움의 대가는 싸다.\" {n}그는 까마귀를 보더니 입술을 핥습니다.{/n} \"까마귀면"
" 된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "10a2a88f-1406-4af5-a6e3-1b02ec15368a"
msgid ""
"\"Whaaat? What you trying to say, crow? My name is Amiri, and I'll kick him "
"into dust then pour him back in his coffin.\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 무슨 말을 하는 거야. 까마귀 주제에? 나는 아미리다. 너를 무덤 속으로 다시 던져주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "76f89096-eba4-4b57-b547-8a81a06f45c7"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, so this Vordakai of yours… he wants us to spread tales about him?\" {n}"
"Linzi shakes her head.{/n} \"No, no, I am Linzi, the {mf|baron's|baroness'} "
"chronicler, not this Vordakai's. No matter what your 'master' commands, he "
"won't merit a footnote in my chronicle — or any other!\" {n}Linzi's face, "
"set in a frown, suddenly relaxes.{/n} \"But — if I did, is it 'Vordakai' "
"with a 'k' 'a' 'i\" or a 'k' 'i' at the end? Details, you know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러니까 보다카이가... 자신의 이야기를 퍼뜨리고 싶다고?\" {n}린지는 고개를 절래절래 흔듭니다.{/n} \"안 돼. 나는 "
"{name}의 연대기 작가야. 보다카이의 연대기 작가가 아니야. 네 주인이 뭐라 하든 내가 쓴 연대기에 그의 업적은 넣어주지 않을 거야."
"\" {n}린지의 얼굴은 찡그려지지만 곧 누그러집니다.{/n} \"하지만 이름의 스펠링이 무엇이지? 정확하게는 써야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "766f2a24-377b-428f-9aa7-a562495564de"
msgid ""
"\"I volunteered to go with the {mf|baron|baroness}, and I will stand with "
"{mf|him|her} until the end. I am Tristian, and you may inform your master…\" "
"{n}Tristian's voice takes on an edge.{/n} \"The light of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} will soon cut through the darkness of this tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {name}의 여행을 함께 하겠다고 말했고 끝까지 함께할 것이다. 나는 트리스티안이고 네 주인에게 알려라...\" {n}"
"트리스티안의 목소리가 단호해집니다.{/n} \"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 빛이 이 무덤의 어둠을 끝낼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "df51edfe-44a7-43d2-8490-5aabfd34a2e4"
msgid ""
"\"If the death of the {mf|baron|broness} is near, my, Harrim's, duty is to "
"follow {mf|him|her} down the same path. That honor is mine, rightfully "
"earned.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|남작|여남작}의 죽음이 가까워졌다면, 나, 하림의 의무는 {mf|그|그녀}와 함께 하는 것이지. 그 영광은 정당하게 나의 "
"것이라네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Raven_SecondTalk/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "b43337ea-3696-4f8d-bb3f-363f3ad0b15e"
msgid ""
"{n}The raven makes no response — it peers at you a moment, then caws loudly "
"and takes flight into the darkness.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}까마귀는 아무 반응이 없습니다. 그것은 당신을 보더니 까악거리고는 어둠 속으로 날아갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "73fa0353-3e17-4ac9-b2a8-0e6bc24b99bf"
msgid "Rescued Varnhold inhabitants by freeing their souls."
msgstr "영혼을 풀어주어 반홀드의 주민들을 구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "20a6e8fd-6ae7-4d98-af75-32920255c455"
msgid ""
"{mf|He|She} immediately began breaking the soul jars to free the imprisoned "
"souls."
msgstr "당신은 곧장 영혼 단지를 부수어 영혼을 풀어주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5293f2bb-49eb-47ba-9a1b-574482c60206"
msgid "Condemned Varnhold inhabitants by selling their souls."
msgstr "자신의 영혼을 판 반홀드의 주민을 비난했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "2cfc71b7-5d9f-4bcf-9480-7f8d99f9bd17"
msgid ""
"{mf|He|She} ordered the soul jars to be moved to the city, where the rare "
"merchandise would be sold in secret."
msgstr "당신은 영혼 단지가 비밀리에 팔리도록 도시로 옮기게 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "0a45b9bf-ebcf-4d72-a4a5-a6b3d2550287"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "b45c410a-7a4c-4ebc-b340-42a3391eee88"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "3e56e7d3-0386-4b7e-956d-884dd9d0e887"
msgid ""
"The dark hall before us was filled with gleaming, transparent vessels. The "
"shimmering light of the souls imprisoned there dispersed the gloomy darkness "
"of the tomb. Liquid shadows danced and twisted on the stone walls with every "
"move of those bright little sparks as they beat against the interiors of "
"their elegant, translucent prisons."
msgstr ""
"우리 뒤에 있는 어두운 방은 투명한 항아리의 빛으로 가득했어요. 갇힌 영혼들이 내는 빛은 무덤의 우울한 어둠을 흩뜨렸어요. 영혼들이 "
"그들의 우아하고 투명한 감옥을 때릴 때마다 물 그림자가 돌벽에서 춤을 추며 반짝였죠."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "5a1f2a5d-c970-4dd4-9b64-a9a4c4778ab8"
msgid ""
"Our search for an answer to the mystery of {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g} was "
"coming to an end. After learning of the horrible fate that befell the poor "
"citizens of Varnhold, we headed to the final destination of our trip — a "
"dark chamber, hidden behind Vordakai's throne room. As soon as we crossed "
"the threshold, we froze, breathless."
msgstr ""
"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}의 수수께끼에 대한 진실은 밝혀졌어요. 반홀드 주민의 끔찍한 운명을 알게 된 후 우리는 여행의 마지막 "
"목적지로 향했어요. 그곳은 보다카이의 방에 숨겨진 어두운 밀실이었어요. 우린 들어갈수록 숨이 멎고 얼어붙었어요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "145e4a07-fc86-441e-be78-4638c3858e60"
msgid ""
"And what did the baron{mf||ess} do when {mf||s}he saw the cruel fate of "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold's{/g} citizens?"
msgstr "남작님이 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g} 시민의 끔찍한 운명을 보고 한 행동은 무엇이었을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "7366c732-0d6c-4302-b2d0-5cb1c5a0616f"
msgid ""
"Upon breaking the first jar, a bright flash of light heralded that the "
"imprisoned soul had regained its freedom. The bright spark flew in an arc "
"over our heads and settled on the floor, and then..."
msgstr "첫번째 항아리를 깨자 빛이 번쩍여 갇힌 영혼이 풀려났어요. 밝은 불꽃이 머리 위로 곡선을 그리며 바닥에 떨어졌어요. 그리고..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "eab7eee2-de44-49e7-a20a-ce18bc8dfac2"
msgid ""
"Well, even my talent as a writer can't do justice to what we saw then. The "
"freed soul was... resurrected! In a heartbeat, on the spot where the spark "
"landed, a man clad in dusty peasant's clothes appeared, an expression of "
"utter shock on his face. The poor man was terrified when he came to his "
"senses after that nightmare, only to find himself in the middle of an "
"ancient tomb!"
msgstr ""
"제 뛰어난 글솜씨로도 우리가 목격한 기적을 묘사할 수는 없을 거예요. 영혼이 속박에서 풀려나더니... 되살아났거든요! 밝은 섬광이 터지며 "
"갑자기 남루한 튜닉을 입은 남자가 어안이 벙벙한 표정으로 나타났죠. 불쌍한 사람, 웬 오래된 무덤에 뿅 하고 나타났으니. 주위를 "
"둘러보고는 막 악몽에서 깨어난 사람처럼 겁에 질리더구요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "7c72864d-26a3-4968-8792-44df08e90685"
msgid ""
"It took no effort at all to free the others. With each new crash of "
"shattered glass, new people appeared around us — guards, fishermen, mothers, "
"their children, farmers, drunkards, grumpy grannies, groaning gossipers... "
"Long story short, all the people who'd been abducted by the Oculus of "
"{g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} had returned! Oh, if only shattering kitchenware "
"always brought such joy and goodness!"
msgstr ""
"다른 자들을 풀어주는 것은 힘들지 않았어요. 부서진 유리 조각 하나하나와 함께 경비병, 어부, 주부, 아이들, 농부, 술주정뱅이, 노파와 "
"같은 새로운 사람들이 주위에 나타났답니다. 요약하자면 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈으로 납치되었던 사람들이 모두 나타났던 거죠! "
"역시 항아리는 깨야 제 맛이군요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "301def28-587f-4ab6-92ac-e7c8f10a4f64"
msgid ""
"Alternating between lamenting, crying, and yelling for joy, the crowd headed "
"for the tomb's exit. We followed after them, finishing yet another chapter "
"of our heroic chronicle."
msgstr ""
"울음, 연민, 절규가 기쁨으로 바뀌고 사람들은 출구로 향하기 시작했어요. 영웅적인 연대기의 한 장을 마치며 우리는 그들을 따라갔답니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "5e724c8f-ee33-4bcd-b471-96e128166120"
msgid ""
"What happened that day in the dark chamber full of soul jars is still a "
"mystery. After examining the gloomy room, the baron{mf||ess} ordered "
"everyone to leave. After that, no one heard anything about the soul jars or "
"the souls of {g|Varnhold}Varnhold's{/g} citizens that had been imprisoned "
"within them."
msgstr ""
"영혼 단지가 놓였던 어두운 방에서 있었던 일은 여전히 수수께끼였어요. 우울한 방을 살펴본 후 남작님은 모두에게 나가라고 명령했거든요. 그 "
"후 누구도 영혼 단지나 갇혔던 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g} 시민의 영혼에 관한 이야기를 듣지 못했답니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6af3e84b-8efa-4f3c-aaee-f0d0656c4db6"
msgid ""
"Any chronicle must contain dark, even tragic pages. The death of a whole "
"city is a catastrophe, and one that will be remembered for generations."
msgstr "연대기에는 꼭 암흑 시대나 참극이 등장하는 법이죠. 한 도시의 멸망 정도면, 몇 세대에 걸쳐 재앙으로 기억되겠군요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "142aca53-0cb0-404e-a2f4-b08a4eeb3076"
msgid ""
"But the living will always come to replace the dead. That's how it was, and "
"how it always will be, until the end of time. And for some reason, after we "
"found the soul jars, the baron{mf||ess}'s treasury mysteriously "
"replenished... but who am I to repeat such idle speculation?"
msgstr ""
"여하튼 산 사람은 살아야지요. 과거에나, 지금이나, 누구나 이 말에 동의할 겁니다. 왠지 모르게 남작님 창고에 금은보화가 넘쳐나는 것 "
"같지만... 혹시 영혼이 담긴 항아리와 관련이 있는 게 아닌가 하는 의심도 들지만, 뭐. 감히 제가 뭐라고 그 돈의 출처를 의심하겠어요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/SoulJars_bookevent/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "ab76b103-c579-4d8b-806e-4d16b9bfa139"
msgid ""
"But that all happened much later — for now, we made our way to the tomb's "
"exit, closing another chapter of this gloomy chronicle."
msgstr "하지만 모든 일은 훨씬 이후에 일어났어요. 이 우울한 연대기의 장을 마치며 우리는 출구로 향하기로 했어요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/TrueMaegarEnding/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "5b1acccd-3f77-4b05-b1be-ae223c36365b"
msgid "\"Your Grace! Gods be praised! You're our savior, you rescued us!\""
msgstr "\"남작! 신이 함께하길! 당신이 우리를 구했네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/TrueMaegarEnding/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "c0d0e12c-3b83-4402-a34d-762df91461d0"
msgid ""
"\"And not just me, but my people as well! Whatever can I do to show you my "
"gratitude, I...?\" {n}{d|Varn}Maegar{/d} pauses for a moment, as if lost in "
"thought, then grunts.{/n} \"Too bad Cephal didn't live to see this moment. "
"And Gunderson... he wasn't a bad sort, just... impulsive.\" {n}Maegar "
"nods.{/n} \"We'll mourn them — mourn all who'd lost their lives because of "
"Vordakai. And then...\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 모두 고마워 하고 있네! 어떻게 보답을 해야 할지...\" {n}{d|Varn}메이가르{/d}는 생각에 빠진 듯 잠시 멈추고는 "
"불편해 합니다.{/n} \"케팔이 이 순간을 보지 못해 아쉽군. 그리고 건더슨은... 그리 나쁜 자는 아니었지만 충동적이었지.\" {n}"
"메이가르는 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그들을 기려야겠네. 보다카이 때문에 죽은 자들을 위해서. 그리고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/TrueMaegarEnding/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "747256ba-3049-430a-9bc2-34ea12db9e59"
msgid ""
"\"What happened to my people... a terrible loss. Men, women, even children — "
"Vordakai spared no one! What manner of creature snuffs out the lives of the "
"innocent, it...\" {n}Maegar's fist clenches, and he steadies himself.{/n} "
"\"They will be mourned, we shall honor the fallen. And then…\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 백성들에게 일어난 일은... 끔찍한 일이었지. 남녀노소 할 것 없이 보다카이는 모두 앗아갔어! 무고한 사람들의 삶을 "
"빼앗아가다니...\" {n}메이가르는 주먹을 쥐더니 단호한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"그들은 추모를 받아야 해. 그리고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/TrueMaegarEnding/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "e44d96ea-c689-470e-9c01-0921f36bba9f"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Varn}Maegar{/d} turns to you, at attention.{/n} \"Your Grace... by the "
"debt of blood, Varnhold and I now serve you. The cowards from the North "
"didn't lift a finger to help me when I was in need — so I offer my sword to "
"the one who will.\" {n}He bows his head.{/n} \"I'll head to your castle and "
"wait for you there. A deputy will rule in {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, I'll "
"appoint someone trustworthy, don't worry about that.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Varn}메이가르{/d}는 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"{name}... 많은 빚을 졌네. 반홀드와 나는 너를 섬기겠소. 북쪽의 "
"겁쟁이들은 필요할 때는 손가락도 까딱하지 않더군. 내 검을 당신에게 바치겠네.\" {n}그는 다시 말합니다.{/n} \"나는 당신 성으로 "
"가서 기다리고 있겠네. 나는 신뢰할 수 있는 사람을 임명할 테니 걱정은 말게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/TrueMaegarEnding/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "ce5d7627-b10d-46bd-afa8-a8926160bb2e"
msgid ""
"\"As for the people of {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}… I don't think the town will "
"remain empty for long. Being in those jars…\" {n}He coughs.{/n} \"Let us say "
"that it makes one miss one's appetites... including a warm body to share "
"your bed with.\" {n}He winks.{/n} \"I expect it won't be long before "
"Varnhold doubles in size.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}의 사람들은… 마을이 오랫동안 비어있을지는 모르겠군. 이 항아리 안에 존재들은...\" {n}그는 "
"기침합니다.{/n} \"그저 그리워질 사람들이야.\" {n}그는 윙크합니다.{/n} \"반홀드의 인구가 두배가 될 날이 오래 걸리지는 "
"않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description_1
msgctxt "a9add716-86c3-4dae-a900-2f125da7efda"
msgid "Told Vordakai that you will cleanse his evil from the lands."
msgstr "보다카이에게 이 땅에서 그의 악을 정화하겠다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "43c23ed3-2323-429a-8ada-0a26d58052b2"
msgid "\"I came to cleanse your evil from these lands!\""
msgstr "\"이 땅으로부터 네 악을 정화하러 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8490d7cd-e43d-4d95-ae38-d66822f5cb37"
msgid "\"The only one who will die this day is you, Vordakai.\""
msgstr "\"오늘 죽을 녀석은 바로 너야. 보다카이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "216fb112-a4b1-4210-a531-d28bac2efad9"
msgid "\"We can resolve this peacefully, there's no need to fight.\""
msgstr "\"평화롭게 해결할 수 있어. 싸움을 할 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "320d746e-5bae-4f3d-9c4d-b41d36c4af1a"
msgid "\"Which Empire are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 제국을 말하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "c8282810-6f2e-434e-9a14-b09c9ff8fe6b"
msgid "\"You can still continue what you've started. Become my servant.\""
msgstr "\"네가 시작한 일을 계속할 수 있어. 내 부하가 되라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "098d376f-134f-4c04-9e8c-15021e236a0d"
msgid ""
"[Shatter the soul jar and set Maegar Varn free] \"Your time is at an end, "
"Vordakai. Farewell.\""
msgstr "[영혼이 담긴 항아리를 깨뜨리고 메이가르 반을 구해줍니다] \"네 시간은 끝났다. 보다카이. 잘 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "81a4d7d5-74e4-4983-9077-693c91a3ac10"
msgid "Decided to leave Vordakai alive despite the future evil he could cause."
msgstr "그가 악을 저지를 수도 있지만 보다카이를 살려두기로 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "75a48258-fcbc-4e4d-aafc-4359db281009"
msgid ""
"\"So, the driving force of all your ambitions and goals was just pride? "
"Well, you are looking for one more chance, and I'm looking for a powerful "
"advisor. Serve me — and after I die, you can try to conquer the world once "
"again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 욕망을 자극하는 원천은 자부심이라고? 너는 기회를 찾고 있고 나는 쓸만한 보좌관을 구하고 있다. 나를 섬기면 내가 죽고 나서 "
"세계를 다시 한번 지배해도 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "2f030591-fec9-4c43-a823-2fb72ba1a346"
msgid "\"Then the only option you still have is death.\""
msgstr "\"네게 남은 유일한 선택은 죽음이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0036_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "513d4d57-3d70-434d-93ca-fb4644289934"
msgid "Let Vordakai take Maegar Varn's image."
msgstr "보다카이가 메이가르 반의 모습을 취하게 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "e9229be1-ed5d-402b-a942-017d7b32566e"
msgid ""
"[Lift the soul jar with Maegar Varn's essence] \"Enough. I am ready to take "
"you outside once you disguise yourself.\""
msgstr "[메이가르 반의 영혼이 담긴 항아리를 들었습니다] \"네 모습을 숨기고 가도 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9f14136d-747f-4e09-b918-ce581dcca68b"
msgid ""
"Rejected the dream of restoring glorious ancient civilization built on blood."
msgstr "피로 지어진 고대 문명을 복원하는 그의 꿈을 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "e0fdd528-7c86-431d-8453-bd20807f7b86"
msgid ""
"\"Your empire would have been built on blood of countless innocents. That, I "
"cannot allow.\""
msgstr "\"너의 제국은 무고한 사람들의 피로 지어졌다. 그런 제국은 용납할 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0039_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "749ed7e1-1992-4941-8fe8-c5038fd3af8c"
msgid ""
"Remained indiffirent to the dream of restoring the glorious ancient "
"civilization."
msgstr "피로 지어진 고대 문명을 복원하는 그의 꿈에 관심을 가지지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "831c8c3e-f94c-4847-a54c-e44f238269bf"
msgid ""
"\"Everything has its time. Your era, for good or ill, is over. Now it's time "
"for another era.\""
msgstr "\"모두 때가 있는 법이지. 네 시대는 끝났다. 이제 새로운 시대가 온 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0040_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "47448608-9f4b-4ea8-abb4-97b3f0ba7b37"
msgid "Jeered at Vordakai and his ancient civilization."
msgstr "보다카이와 그의 고대 문명을 비웃었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "e006a4cd-be1c-4467-8fe1-de2f19cf8e8f"
msgid ""
"\"Who gives a damn about a corpse like you — and your dead empire? You have "
"submitted to others, and therefore you were once weak and pathetic.\""
msgstr "\"너 같은 시체가 지은 제국에 누가 관심을 가지겠어? 너는 다른 자에게 굴복한 약자일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "bc087d7f-5756-4124-84d1-662ca559107d"
msgid "\"Tell me now — what have you done to the people of Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"말해봐. 반홀드의 사람들에게 무슨 짓을 한 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "eb4f1920-bf70-452f-8bf4-84bae7cc7039"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't you know, mighty Vordakai, that you should not open up your soul to "
"everybody? The curse that Tristian put upon you struck your very essence: "
"arrogance and lust for power\"."
msgstr ""
"\"네 영혼을 모두에게 드러내면 안되는 걸 모르겠어? 트리스티안이 네게 내린 저주는 오만하고 힘을 갈망하는 네 영혼을 벌했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0076_Text
msgctxt "8c493371-287d-4777-931e-eca672ec62b7"
msgid ""
"\"Such power... Perhaps, when I destroy you, Urgathoa will grant me "
"something similar?\""
msgstr "\"그런 힘을... 내가 너를 파괴하는 날 우르가쏘아가 나에게 비슷한 힘을 주게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "72ca77c2-cd9d-44fd-aa8e-1e8351a6e482"
msgid "\"Tristian took... your eye?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안이... 네 눈을 가져갔다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "724fefe3-5e3b-4827-a6d4-6443f9e22b4e"
msgid ""
"{n}In the dim light, unable to disperse deep shadows in the corners of the "
"dark hall, you see a tall, angular figure. It is a giant with parchment-thin "
"skin, clad in ancient clothes... yet he pays you no notice — he is studying "
"a glowing vessel cradled in his hands.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}어두운 회랑의 구석에 드리운 짙은 그림자를 헤치지 못할 정도로 희미한 불빛 아래에서, 당신은 크고 앙상한 형상을 보았습니다. 그것은 "
"양피지 두께의 피부 위에 고대의 의복을 걸친 거인입니다... 하지만 그는 당신에게 눈길조차 주지 않습니다. 그는 자신의 손에 들린 빛나는 "
"항아리를 탐구하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "d793f92c-1ca9-4f6b-a1c7-c8d5bec54bed"
msgid ""
"{n}The giant turns to you — and your attention is immediately drawn to the "
"single eye in the center of its dried and dead face — or, rather, an "
"iridescent ball of dark shades, shimmering within the cyclops' empty eye "
"socket like Abyssal fire. In the center of the sphere is a spark of ominous "
"red that seems to cut into you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그 거인은 당신을 보았고 그의 얼굴을 본 당신의 시선은 망자의 얼굴에 말라붙어버린 외눈에 집중되었습니다. 그것은 눈이라기 보다는 "
"사이클롭스의 눈 구멍에서 검게 빛나고 있는 심연의 불꽃과도 같았습니다. 구체의 중심에는 불길한 붉은 빛이 타오르며 당신을 보고 "
"있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "e446dccd-1ab3-4c1c-839f-a19c9ee81d3c"
msgid ""
"\"Peace? A surrender. Yielding? Weakness.\" {n}The creature inhales with a "
"rasp, almost out of habit — yet the tatters of its robes stir, as if touched "
"by the wind.{/n} \"The weak serve as feast or flagstones, their bodies ever "
"prostrate in worship, their backs and blood, the roads and rivers of my "
"domain, layer upon layer, an empire of your kind, entire races crushed "
"beneath my reign, {race}. That is the peace your master brings.\""
msgstr ""
"\"평화라고? 패자가 필요하지. 굴복? 약자의 것이다.\" {n}그 생명체는 습관처럼 숨을 들이쉬었고 그의 로브 자락은 바람이라도 분 듯 "
"흔들렸습니다.{/n} \"약자는 연회의 제물이고 그들의 몸은 나를 숭배를 하고 나는 그들의 등을 밟아 길로 삼으며 그들의 피는 내 영토의 "
"강이 될 것이다. 너희 열등한 것들은 나에게 굴복할 것이다. {race}. 그것이 네 주인이 가져다주는 평화다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "dc70e92e-0801-4cd7-91cd-1c0f70cc9bb2"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai shakes his head slowly, dismissively.{/n} \"Worthless words. "
"Boasts and claims of mortals. Grovel… and you may serve me yet.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이는 거절하듯 머리를 천천히 흔듭니다.{/n} \"쓸 데 없는 말이군. 필멸자의 자랑일 뿐이다. 오만하지만... 너는 아직 "
"나를 섬길 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d4477299-c035-44e9-a7a3-485e88d20741"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai chuckles dryly, letting his teeth scrape against each other, "
"bone on bone.{/n} \"The real evil, {race}, comes from lesser races such as "
"yours, corpse-flies that feed on my ancestral lands. I've already began "
"purging the empire of your kind, and you will watch as I extinguish each, "
"one by one.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이가 뼈와 뼈를 맞대고 이를 갈며 건조하게 낄낄댑니다.{/n} \"{race}, 진정한 악이란 너희와 같은 열등한 종족에게서 "
"나오는 것이다. 나의 옛 영토에 빌붙어 먹고 사는 파리 같은 녀석들아. 나는 이미 너희 종의 제국을 정화하고 있다, 그리고 너는 내가 "
"모든 것들을 하나씩 없애는 모습을 보게 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "ff4ffc9a-d8c8-4b73-8d79-e02dd7852315"
msgid ""
"{n}Once stately, the ancient cyclops shudders and moans. Foul black liquid "
"runs down the cavities in his face and soak his tattered clothes. The "
"magical glowing vessel with {d|Varn}Maegar{/d}'s soul strikes the stone "
"floor with a hollow, tolling sound and rolls right to your feet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고대 사이클롭스는 천천히 움츠리더니 신음합니다. 검고 썩은 내 나는 물이 그의 얼굴에서 흘렀고 그의 누더기가 된 옷을 적십니다. "
"{d|Varn}메이가르{/d}의 영혼이 담긴 빛나는 항아리는 바닥으로 떨어졌고 당신 앞으로 굴러갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "8321cf6f-4588-46fa-a0f1-95822c8affb0"
msgid ""
"\"Worthless creature, proud in your ignorance... do you even realize what "
"you've done? You've doomed Vordakai to oblivion — and all the power and "
"secrets of the greatest empire ever known!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하찮은 생명체가 아무것도 모르고 날뛰는구나... 네가 무슨 짓을 한 건지 아느냐? 너는 보다카이를 죽였다. 위대한 제국의 힘과 비밀도 "
"함께 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "f91acff1-4b5a-4af1-9d9b-f2389df21550"
msgid ""
"\"About the one that flourished in this world long before you came, {race}. "
"About the one that in its greatness outshined everything ever created by "
"mortals since the beginning of times. About the empire, whose last remaining "
"son, great Vordakai was destined to restore.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 오기 전 이 세계에 번영했던 문명이었다. {race}. 시간이 존재하기 시작할 때 필멸자에 의해 세워진 모든 제국을 뛰어넘은 "
"것이었다. 보다카이가 되찾아야 할 마지막 제국이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "1426d275-a6b5-4e78-8410-da80aa85619c"
msgid ""
"\"Serve you.\" {n}The cyclops utters a strange sound, a clicking, like an "
"insect. You think he might be laughing.{/n} \"Insolence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 섬기겠다.\" {n}사이클롭스는 벌레처럼 이상한 소리를 냅니다. 아마 그가 비웃는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"오만한 녀석.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "55b7b867-8b1f-4e8c-99d8-57a65973c2b5"
msgid "\"And that is my choice, {race}. My final choice.\""
msgstr "\"그건 내 선택이다. {race}. 내 마지막 선택이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "23493334-2e2e-485c-9594-b1d8093201e8"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai is silent for a time — then finally, pronouncing each word with "
"effort, he speaks. {/n}\"You are right. I will have time to prepare. To "
"restore my strength. To master the enchantments of a new world. And then... "
"then the day will come when your descendants will answer for your decision.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이는 잠시 침묵하더니 마침내 힘주어 말합니다.{/n}\"네가 맞다. 나는 준비할 시간을 가져야 해. 힘을 회복할 시간 말이다. "
"새로운 새계의 마법을 모두 배워야 한다. 그리고... 후손들이 네 결정에 대한 답을 내놓을 날이 올 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "c534d704-eab1-48f0-b729-bd338bed01c3"
msgid ""
"\"We brought an era of enlightenment and prosperity to this primitive world. "
"We created masterpieces, ones your kind cannot even fathom. I was the one "
"who shaped this thriving empire and the one who was going to release it from "
"the prison of time — but then you came and shattered any hope of reviving "
"the greatest civilization of this world!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 이 미개한 세계에 깨달음과 번영을 가져왔다. 우리는 너희 것들이 흉내낼 수 없는 걸작들을 만들었다. 나는 이 번영했던 제국을 "
"만들었고 영원히 지키려고 했다. 하지만 나의 문명을 되찾으려는 꿈을 네가 부수었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "0727fba7-2299-4153-a464-dd779c1ba460"
msgid ""
"\"What is the blood of mortals in comparison to the greatness of the empire "
"that rises above it? You will never see it.\""
msgstr "\"필멸자의 피 위에 세워진 제국에 비교할 만한 것이 있나? 절대 없을 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "125e0564-e619-4da0-ada5-20c94ffc36f9"
msgid ""
"\"Submission and whimpering — the marks of your kind! There is no greater "
"time than the era I brought to this world — I shall not surrender it!\""
msgstr "\"복종은 너희 것들이 항상 하는 것이지! 내가 세웠던 제국이 있었던 때보다 좋았던 적은 없다. 나는 항복하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "8cfc74bb-025e-4e64-b5dc-4081fe31b241"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai gives a low, dismissive hiss.{/n} \"I have died once, {race}, "
"and my will remains unbroken. Nothing, not even death, can change it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이가 낮은 목소리로 위협합니다.{/n} \"나는 이미 한 번 죽었다, {race}. 그리고 내 의지는 확고하다. 아무것도, "
"어떤 죽음도 그것을 바꿀 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "46864593-85dc-4c7f-9760-12a755479c1f"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai touches the edge of his hollow socket with a withered finger.{/n}"
" \"Vermin, who came to my lands. Who raked the land with their ploughs, "
"pierced it with stakes to build their miserable shacks, desecrated the "
"sacred tombs. First they tore my lands from me... then broke into my "
"sanctum... and stole what was mine!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이는 손가락으로 텅 빈 눈구멍의 가장자리를 만집니다.{/n} \"내 땅에 온 벌레 녀석들. 역병을 끌고 와서 비참한 나라를 "
"세우고 내 신성한 무덤을 더럽힌 녀석들이다. 내게서 땅을 빼앗아가더니 이제는 내 성소를 침범했어... 그리고 내 것을 훔쳐갔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "22cd9bcc-c271-40e0-9d1a-4763e72d6b13"
msgid ""
"\"I was enraged when I awakened, but the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} "
"gave me the answers I needed... it calmed me, focused me. It was powerful "
"enough to seize control over all who lived in that wretched settlement. They "
"came to me, one by one, to be slaughtered. I fed upon their minds to make "
"sense of this renewed world. The thoughts they held were enough for me to "
"conclude the world is ready for my return. The world needs my return.\""
msgstr ""
"\"깨어났을 때 나는 분노했지만 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈은 내게 필요한 길을 알려주었다... 그것은 나를 진정시키고 "
"집중하도록 했다. 눈은 썩어빠진 곳에서 살던 녀석들을 통제할 강력한 힘이 있다. 그들은 하나씩 내게 다가와 도살당했다. 나는 그들의 "
"정신을 먹어치워 이 낯선 세계를 이해했다. 그들의 생각을 들여다보고 세계를 되찾을거란 결론을 내렸다. 이 세상엔 나의 귀환이 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : HoragnamonBossUnit
msgctxt "64b6f5fe-0d1d-4af2-9b45-81dfb3d987a0"
msgid ""
"\"Caw! {mf|He|She} is here, master! {mf|He|She} came, oh great Vordakai!\""
msgstr "\"까악! {mf|그|그녀}가 여기 있습니다, 주인님! {mf|그|그녀}가 왔습니다, 위대한 보다카이시여!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "eadc92b8-ad0d-41bf-aa9b-93441509be6e"
msgid ""
"\"I was pondering what to do with this pathetic creature, {d|Varn}Maegar "
"Varn{/d}. This fool dared to claim the lands that belong to me.\" {n}"
"Vordakai raises gleaming vessel, showing you the wisp inside, clawing at the "
"interior.{/n} \"Can you see his soul? This emptiness of this vessel is all "
"he rules now. The same fate awaits you. I kept {d|Varn}Maegar's{/d} body, "
"because I thought he might prove a servant... but no... your corpse, "
"kneeling before me, will be of more use.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 불쌍한 녀석으로 무엇을 할지 생각해보았다. 이 바보는 감히 내 땅을 자기것이라 했더군.\" {n}보다카이는 빛나는 구체를 들어올려 "
"당신에게 그 안에 있는 위습을 보았습니다.{/n} \"그의 영혼이 보이는가? 이 구체가 지금 이 녀석이 지배하는 영역이지. 너에게도 같은 "
"운명이 기다리고 있다. 내 종이 될 수 있을 것 같으니 나는 {d|Varn}메이가르{/d}의 몸을 가져갈 것이다. 하지만 네 시체는... "
"더 많은 쓸모가 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "6dfc8134-1bb1-4f8a-b154-df9f92f17d1c"
msgid ""
"\"You dare pronounce judgment on me?\" {n}Vordakai hisses, the skin peeling "
"back from his bared teeth... then as swiftly as it came, his features fall "
"still.{/n} \"Though there is truth in your words. Curses strike harder if "
"you empower them with the piece of essence of the one being cursed. And I "
"put my very self in my name — the name of a ruler and a vanquisher! The name "
"I was cursed with…\n"
"I was blind back then, more blind than I am now. And I lost the greatest "
"gift I ever received from my patrons — the daemons. Will I have to pay for "
"such negligence?\""
msgstr ""
"\"감히 나를 판단해?\" {n}보다카이는 피부가 벗겨져 드러난 이로 쉭쉭 소리를 냈습니다... 계속해서 빠르게 그의 이목구비가 "
"흘러내립니다.{/n} \"너의 말에도 옳은 점이 있다. 저주는 본질에 힘을 줄수록 강력해진다. 그리고 나는 지배자 그리고 정복자의 이름을 "
"내게 부여했지! 내가 저주 내린 이름...\n"
"그땐 눈이 멀었었지 지금보다도 더. 결국 나는 후견자 다이몬들로부터 받은 최고의 권능을 잃어 버렸다. 고작 실수 따위로 이런 대가를 "
"치러야 한다고? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "81028a7a-db8d-4d8d-ad01-98f1c1e545d2"
msgid ""
"{n}Freed from the prison, a soul flies up in a flash of light and rushes "
"towards lifeless body of {d|Varn}Maegar Varn{/d}. In the light of the "
"released soul, Vordakai collapses on the floor and falls still... as you "
"watch, cracks begin to worm through his dried body, and his bones begin to "
"crumble — powerful enchantments, that held his life within its shell, lose "
"their battle with time... in moments, Vordakai is dust.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}감옥에서 자유로워진 영혼이 빛을 반짝이며 {d|Varn}메이가르 반{/d}의 생기 없는 시체에 달려듭니다. 영혼이 풀려나자 "
"보다카이는 바닥에 쓰러집니다. 그의 마른 시체에서 살은 녹아내리기 시작했고 그의 뼈는 부스러지기 시작합니다. 그의 껍데기에서 생명을 "
"유지하던 강력한 마법이 시간과의 싸움에서 패배했습니다... 곧 보다카이는 가루가 됩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "3538578c-12eb-47c6-9a5a-5ad4729d026f"
msgid ""
"\"You look at me as if I committed some blasphemy. Hardly. They defiled my "
"lands, so I defiled them in turn. Although, I didn't want to limit my "
"revenge — their souls await fate inside the same jars, as does the soul of "
"their arrogant leader.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 신성모독이라도 저지른 듯이 보는구나. 그렇지 않다. 그들은 내 영토를 황폐화했고 나도 그들을 황폐화 한 것 뿐이다. 그래도 나는 "
"복수를 멈출 생각이 없었다. 그들과 오만한 지도자의 영혼은 항아리 속에서 운명을 기다리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5ccb888e-6bb9-40f0-b2e3-21d4b7e7dda6"
msgid "\"Serves it right!\""
msgstr "\"반항하지 말아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f52e12fe-c813-4e48-923a-501cd115d09d"
msgid ""
"\"He's kind of right... No, of course, I'm glad we've stopped his bony "
"majesty's plans — but just imagine what an invaluable source of historical "
"knowledge we are about to destroy! Perhaps we can somehow secure and contain "
"him for science? For example in one of these magical jars?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 옳아... 물론 그의 계획을 막아서 기쁘지만 가치를 매길 수 없는 역사적인 지식을 우리가 파괴한다고 생각해봐! 아마도 그를 "
"과학적인 목적으로 보존하면 어떨까? 이 마법의 항아리에 담는 것은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "82fd9009-10b9-4350-a84e-8adacb34122e"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, Vordakai, this is the fate of every empire and every ruler... Your "
"hubris helped you to persist much longer than you were supposed to — and "
"yet, the time has come for you too to face oblivion.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아. 보다카이. 이것은 모든 제국의 운명이다... 네 몸은 예상보다 더 오래 버텼다. 하지만 시간은 너의 파멸을 가져왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "16ad51dc-44f9-4af5-917f-f182840af4bf"
msgid "\"What a power... But what a stench!\""
msgstr "\"대단한 힘이군... 하지만 썩은내가 나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "d969c45b-a429-437d-8fe9-991fcbdec7cc"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed\". {n}Vordakai stands up and lifts his hands.{/n} \"Break the soul "
"jar in your hands. Now.\""
msgstr "\"그래.\" {n}보다카이는 일어서더니 양 손을 듭니다.{/n} \"네 손의 영혼이 담긴 항아리를 부수어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d05cc43e-ef81-4e8b-9b33-1225e5565022"
msgid ""
"\"Are you kidding me?! Good grief, we'd be better off putting you in a jar — "
"and making sure to leave it here!\""
msgstr "\"장난해?! 너를 항아리 안에 넣는 게 낫겠어. 그리고 여기에 두고 떠나겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "62d8566d-0fbb-454b-a409-0d55f290f59b"
msgid ""
"\"Are you out of your mind? He's a monster! An evil the likes of which the "
"world hasn't seen in ages! He'll devour us in the night, and in the blink of "
"an eye, the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} won't be your realm, but his!\""
msgstr ""
"\"미쳤어? 그는 괴물이야! 수백년 동안 이런 악은 없었다고! 그는 한밤중에 우리를 집어삼키고, 눈 깜짝할 사이에 {g|Stolen "
"Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 집어삼킬 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "f44cc24b-69d6-4a48-a16a-ca69214539a1"
msgid ""
"\"That's right! You're just some garbage who somehow crawled out of the "
"scrapyard of history, but we'll be sure to put you back!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 너는 역사에서 기어나온 흉물에 불과하니 우리가 다시 집어넣어주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "74094aa8-d4ab-4909-8d11-24919c0f7035"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai chuckles dryly, letting his teeth scrape together, bone on "
"bone.{/n} \"You expect gifts from gods, little {race}? You are but dust "
"beneath my feet. Still... you may serve me yet.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이는 이를 갈며 감정 없이 웃습니다.{/n} \"신으로부터 선물을 기대했나? {race}? 너는 그저 내 발 밑의 먼지에 "
"불과해. 하지만... 나를 여전히 섬기게 해주마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "d6e8c98b-8792-4d1e-b84c-eb030a2c004a"
msgid ""
"\"An interruption?\" {n}The creature's voice echoes, as though speaking "
"across several chambers at once — or perhaps through many different selves. "
"As the reverberations cease, the dead figure answers its own question — and "
"the answer sounds like a death sentence.{/n} \"So, what disturbs my "
"meditations?\""
msgstr ""
"\"방해인가?\" {n}그 생물의 목소리는 울렸고 마치 여러 방에서 동시에 말하는 것 같았습니다. 혹은 여러 명의 분신이 말하는 것 "
"같았습니다. 울림이 끝나고 시체는 질문에 대답했습니다. 대답은 마치 사형 선고와 같았습니다.{/n} \"내 명상을 방해하는 것이 무엇인가?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "4ef105e8-cfea-4065-9b8b-13a7b768f04b"
msgid ""
"\"After all I've done... After all I've achieved...\" {n}Vordakai's fingers "
"claw at the floor, and he turns, as though searching for you.{/n} \"After "
"all the trials... still I fell... and to what?\" {n}He bares his teeth, "
"ichor and miasma running from his mouth.{/n} \"To a pathetic thing like you!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 목적을 이루고... 모든 것이 끝난 후에...\" {n}보다카이는 바닥을 손가락으로 긁었고 몸을 돌려 당신을 보려는 것 "
"같습니다.{/n} \"모든 시험이 끝났는데... 나는 여전히 죽는다... 무엇 때문이지?\" {n}그는 이를 드러내며 거친 숨을 "
"쉽니다.{/n} \"너처럼 하찮은 녀석에게 죽다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "a2e933fc-d26f-44e7-af16-cfd81a48f2c4"
msgid ""
"\"But...\" {n}Vordakai's teeth click, like a death rattle, and the "
"desiccated flesh around his empty eye socket constricts.{/n} \"But this will "
"take time. Perhaps too much. Your sons and daughters may be nothing more "
"than dust when my empire dawns over {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만...\" {n}보다카이는 이를 갈았고 그의 썩은 살은 녹아내립니다.{/n} \"하지만 시간이 걸릴 것이다. 오랜 시간이 걸릴 "
"것이다. {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}을 내 손에 넣은 순간 네 후손들은 먼지가 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "829ecd73-849f-4438-a8da-d2004ae20610"
msgid ""
"\"You didn't even realize what your sidekick stole... The Oculus of "
"{g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} is not some eye. It's a dark creation having "
"tremendous power. Given to me by the mercy of a Horseman of the Apocalypse, "
"the Oculus is capable of seeing the unseen, revealing the future to its "
"holder and dominating over mere mortals. Your pathetic settlement was so "
"close to sharing the fate of {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 부하가 무엇을 훔쳤는지도 모르는군... {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈은 특별한 보물이다. 엄청난 힘을 담은 어둠의 "
"피조물이지. 종말의 네 기수가 자비를 베풀어 나에게 하사한 그 눈은, 보이지 않는 것을 보고, 들고 있는 자에게 미래를 보여주며, 한낱 "
"필멸자들의 위에 군림하도록 만드는 유물이다. 네 하찮은 영지도 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}와 같은 것이 될 운명이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "68117977-4bfb-4a91-abbe-b30454bece42"
msgid ""
"\"An excellent move, even if risky. We need to shake as much useful "
"information from that dead chatterbox as possible. We can finish him off any "
"time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"위험했지만 훌륭한 시도였다. 우리는 가능한 이 시체에게서 많은 정보를 가져가야 한다고. 이 녀석은 언제든 끝낼 수 있으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0086_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a62786ab-9489-4bc0-9480-d011a7ea9aab"
msgid ""
"\"So the little traitor has stolen an artifact of divine power? What a "
"delightful end to our arduous expedition into this lair of dead monsters!\""
msgstr "\"이 반란자 녀석이 신성한 힘이 담긴 유물을 훔쳐? 우리의 여행이 이런 시체들의 무덤에서 끝나게 되다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/VordakaiTombLevel2/Vordakai_FinalDialogue/Cue_0087_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "9746fb5d-c9fe-4b3d-b1eb-322479301361"
msgid ""
"Why would he, supposedly a follower of virtuous Sarenrae, seek an artifact "
"that's the center of all evil? His treason doesn't surprise me, but I don't "
"understand what it could mean, or what he could hope to achieve.\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이를 따르는 선의 추종자가 악의 힘이 담긴 유물을 가져가려고 하지? 그 녀석이 배신한 건 놀랍지도 않지만 왜 그랬는지 이해가 "
"되지 않는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ZombieLair/Button_A_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "7d7e9f3b-e832-4e59-9a3e-b81b80b62c17"
msgid "Toggle Plate"
msgstr "딸깍거리는 판"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ZombieLair/Button_A_DisplayName_String_1
msgctxt "4130a0fe-7944-43ef-958d-1805f788044e"
msgid "Toggle Plate"
msgstr "딸깍거리는 판"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ZombieLair/GasSwitcher_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "8988d510-8e7a-4027-b1c8-316b911d3a6b"
msgid "Strange Mechanism"
msgstr "이상한 장치"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ZombieLair/Pillar_CheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "900323ec-2323-45e2-ad5c-fe4cf5641d43"
msgid "The air around the column vibrates with negative energy."
msgstr "기둥 주위의 공기는 음의 에너지로 진동합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ZombieLair/ZombieLair_GasSwitcher_CheckFailBark_String
msgctxt "6e8dfa50-5a64-4d38-bf73-31168ab1eea3"
msgid "The mechanism is completely jammed."
msgstr "장치는 완전히 고장났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c31/ZombieLair/ZombieLair_GasSwitcher_CheckPassedBark_String
msgctxt "df1623de-916c-4e7f-b90e-0867a4e711c8"
msgid "A soft click comes from within the mechanism."
msgstr "장치 안에서 기계가 작동하는 소리가 들립니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A1 - BrokenPortals_Fail_String
msgctxt "84ae332e-1c8e-4378-ad96-0577225f2ae8"
msgid "There are strange dark marks on the ground."
msgstr "땅에는 이상한 어둠의 표식이 그려졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A1 - BrokenPortals_Success_String
msgctxt "a04417c7-28af-4aed-b85b-ceb207c71a76"
msgid ""
"Dark stains on the ground mark the spots of failed attempts to open the "
"portal."
msgstr "바닥에 포털을 열려고 하다 실패해서 생긴 어두운 얼룩이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A1 - DryFlower_String
msgctxt "d34ed0c1-55eb-4c07-bd2c-ed0e536e9eb0"
msgid ""
"Large, wilted flowers lie throughout the area — they look almost exactly "
"like the flowers from the cave beneath Silverstep Lake."
msgstr "거대하고 시든 꽃이 흩어져있습니다. 실버스텝 호수의 동굴에서 본 꽃과 똑같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A2 - Library_Jubilost_String
msgctxt "9ffe49ca-a843-446a-824c-6ce7383912bd"
msgid ""
"\"Look at this! These books are newer than the ones on the other shelves. Is "
"this someone's idea of a joke?\""
msgstr "\"봐! 이 책들은 다른 책장의 것보다 최근의 것이야. 누가 장난을 친걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A2 - Library_Octavia_String
msgctxt "8e044cd8-128a-440e-8388-636941162585"
msgid "\"Look, there are children's books here!\""
msgstr "\"봐. 저기에 아이들의 책이 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A2 - Library_Valerie_String
msgctxt "43a1f182-dd74-4eec-bbe1-0bb0f70330a0"
msgid ""
"\"Strange… I used to have this textbook — just like the one on this shelf!\""
msgstr "\"이상하군... 이 책은 내 것이었는데. 이 책장에 있는 것과 똑같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A2 - Shelves with drawings_String
msgctxt "524d2acc-8181-40e2-a87b-2a66cdb3f785"
msgid ""
"Crude drawings cover the side of the bookcase. Someone also began carving a "
"word but never finished, so all you can read now is \"AR\"."
msgstr ""
"책장의 옆면에는 무언가 그려져있습니다. 누군가 글자를 새기기 시작했지만 끝내지 못했고 당신은 '아'라는 글자만 읽을 수 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A2 - Shelves_String
msgctxt "3e44fdd5-4ccf-427a-8913-971c93734743"
msgid ""
"An old bookcase crammed with dusty tomes. Many of books have been ruined by "
"mildew and water."
msgstr "오래된 책장은 먼지로 덮인 책으로 가득합니다. 많은 책은 이슬과 습기로 훼손되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A3 - Kid Drawings 2_String
msgctxt "2fb7a6ae-1e05-47f3-aa12-7ad87f8334a1"
msgid ""
"This crumpled piece of paper is covered with a charcoal sketch of a gloomy "
"building with a huge lock on the gate."
msgstr "이 종이의 찢어진 조각에 거대한 자물쇠가 달린 문과 함께 어두워 보이는 건물의 그림을 숯으로 그려놓았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A3 - Kid Drawings_String
msgctxt "0fdf34fc-47a3-4957-9474-cca88f2b5f90"
msgid ""
"On a damp sheet of paper there are pictures of sun, trees, and a glade "
"filled with flowers — all drawn by a child's hand."
msgstr "축축한 종이에는 태양과 나무 그리고 꽃으로 가득한 들판의 그림이 그려져있습니다. 모두 아이가 그린 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A3 - Torag Altar Fail_String
msgctxt "1b60a821-3a91-495d-bd51-22e775129c8c"
msgid "Gorum's sanctuary, placed on an ancient pedestal."
msgstr "고룸의 성소는 고대의 판 위에 위치해있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A3 - Torag Altar Success_String
msgctxt "5a606020-139d-4692-bb44-4b442b4f2aac"
msgid ""
"A crude altar to Gorum has been erected on the remains of Torag's temple."
msgstr "고룸의 투박한 제단은 토락의 사원 잔해 위에 세워졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A3 - Toy_String
msgctxt "acf47f8d-3df7-4035-8475-7d0b08d3736d"
msgid "A broken children's toy, covered with mold."
msgstr "부서진 아이의 장난감은 이끼가 덮였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A3 - Under bed_String
msgctxt "202cf3a2-83ad-4248-bb7c-0a95f5967f44"
msgid ""
"Someone hid a pillowcase beneath the sheets. It's rotten and stuffed with "
"various things."
msgstr "누군가 종이 밑에 필통을 숨겨놓았습니다. 그것은 여러 물건이 담긴 채 썩어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - AfterSister_01_Sister_String
msgctxt "43ec5def-ba35-4c80-b728-105d4674e5a7"
msgid ""
"\"The time has come! Your lives in exchange for the mercy of my sister!\""
msgstr "\"때가 되었다! 내 자매의 목숨을 위해 네 목숨을 가져가겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - AfterSister_02_Tristian_String
msgctxt "4a5c2f32-043f-4cb3-be7b-91321987e02c"
msgid "\"I… I won't let you!\""
msgstr "\"나는... 너를 놓아주지 않겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - AfterSister_AngelReinforced_01_Sister_String
msgctxt "61bc03f0-971c-4bec-b033-44f7a3ec63d7"
msgid "\"Enough! Skylark won't hear you…\""
msgstr "\"그만! 종달새가 네 목소리를 듣지 못해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - AfterSister_AngelReinforced_02_Tristian_String
msgctxt "2a14264b-8cf8-42c2-9259-bda2d998dfc2"
msgid ""
"\"Enough! Enough with all the lies and constraints! Enough with the tricks "
"and deceptions! You won't lay a finger on my friends, you witch!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 거짓말은 그만해! 속임수도 그만해! 내 친구의 털 끝도 건들지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - AfterSister_AngelReinforced_03_Sister_String
msgctxt "37ac3290-8ef2-4de2-8fa2-084cb13bd245"
msgid "\"What?! But... Sarenrae rejected you! So why do you still...\""
msgstr "\"뭐?! 하지만... 서렌레이는 너를 거절했어! 왜 너는 아직도...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - AfterSister_AngelReinforced_04_Tristian_String
msgctxt "b13755c9-e6bd-4446-b914-9141bc5bec08"
msgid ""
"\"Sarenrae does not answer my prayers, but she still grants me power! "
"Healing Light, save the world from this plague!\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이는 내 기도에 응답하지 않지만 그녀는 여전히 내게 힘을 주었지. 치유의 빛이여 이 역병으로부터 세상을 구하소서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - AfterSister_AngelReinforced_05_Sister_String
msgctxt "20f670c4-cdbf-4d0d-926a-153a3d911253"
msgid "\"NOOOOOOO! AAAAAAAHG!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼! 아아악!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - AngelProtects_String
msgctxt "fb312374-9b9a-4950-99d7-43ed90b69ede"
msgid "\"Enough! You won't lay a finger on them!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 그들을 건들지 말아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - Angel_LastBark2_String
msgctxt "c12a9f6b-8b3b-47ac-94cb-eb545dcdd955"
msgid ""
"\"I'll answer all your questions later, I promise. Just let me feel the "
"warmth of the sunlight on my face first.\""
msgstr "\"네 질문은 다음에 대답하겠어. 내 얼굴에 쏟아지는 햇빛의 따스함을 느끼게 해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - Angel_LastBark_String
msgctxt "ecbbae91-9c5c-46ee-acc0-2f68d06cba0c"
msgid "\"Let's leave this place, I beg you. I can't stay here any longer.\""
msgstr "\"이 장소를 떠나자. 부탁이야. 더 이상 머물지 못하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - Angel_Prayer_01_String
msgctxt "56549ef5-69a1-4508-babf-3cdb0d4f6185"
msgid ""
"\"Merciful Sarenrae, heed my prayer… burn my heart, purify me by your fire, "
"save me from evil…\""
msgstr "\"자비로운 서렌레이시여... 내 기도에 응답하여 내 심장을 태워 정화하소서. 악으로부터 나를 구원하소서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - Angel_Prayer_02_String
msgctxt "15603ae8-8304-47cd-8641-1e1ecd4a05c2"
msgid ""
"\"Your faithful servant calls to you… heed my prayer, Sarenrae… I beg you, "
"hear me…\""
msgstr "\"신실한 종이 당신을 부릅니다... 내 기도에 응답하소서. 서렌레이여... 청하건데 내 음성을 들으소서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - Laboratory_String
msgctxt "b5d0f61b-0a2b-43f1-999d-a4eab87ff75f"
msgid ""
"Among the glassware and damp paper notes there are cut flowers, buds, petals "
"and leaves."
msgstr "유리 그릇과 축축한 종이 노트 사이에 잘려진 꽃과 풀잎이 흩어져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - NerissaLeaving_NerissaBark_String
msgctxt "7cf9e21c-586a-45e9-967d-2f0f3a2d61b8"
msgid "\"Sister! Wipe the traces I left, and I'll let you follow me!\""
msgstr "\"내가 남긴 흔적을 지우면 나를 따라와도 좋다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - Shelves_String
msgctxt "8319ca80-91a6-4f5d-9f32-6c04360b281c"
msgid ""
"Vials and flasks are lined up neatly on the shelves. The fluids inside them "
"have darkened and turned to sludge."
msgstr "플라스크와 유리관이 선반에 가지런히 놓여있습니다. 내부의 액체는 어두워지더니 걸쭉해집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/A4 - Tristian_exit_String
msgctxt "c299029e-60ca-4e11-8ba8-0b679a5c65fd"
msgid "\"There is a secret door… there, in the corner…\""
msgstr "\"비밀 문이 있어... 저기 구석에...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/B1 - AngelSleepingMagicCircles_Fail_String
msgctxt "66aa7488-c21f-4ed3-9969-b14a8e0c68e6"
msgid ""
"These magic circles look recent, much newer than the rest of the interior."
msgstr "이 마법 원은 내부 구조에 비해 최근의 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/B1 - AngelSleepingMagicCircles_Success_String
msgctxt "60139bf2-2847-43a6-a4bd-a8c0d101a20a"
msgid ""
"This magic circle was created to maintain a spell. Someone has wiped away "
"some of the inscriptions recently."
msgstr "이 마법 원은 마법을 작동하기 위해 그려졌습니다. 누군가 원의 일부를 최근에 지운 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/B1 - Lock_String
msgctxt "789d4e03-e113-46f3-b3c5-3dbc7ccdea34"
msgid "This door has a rusty lock that was recently broken."
msgstr "이 문의 녹슨 자물쇠는 최근에 누군가 부순 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/B2 - Plants_String
msgctxt "bb9cbeff-3875-4815-83a9-fe01cedfd318"
msgid ""
"Plants have grown up through the stone as if the floor was nothing more than "
"rotten wood."
msgstr "바위 틈으로 식물이 자라났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/B3 - Sleeping bags_String
msgctxt "59b7f0f9-31e2-4e24-9056-4218fd6b27fe"
msgid ""
"Coarse canvas sleeping bags, much newer than the rest of the items in the "
"room."
msgstr "거친 캔버스 침낭은 방 안의 다른 물건들보다 최근의 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/B4 - Entrance_String
msgctxt "ffd94c4a-3f26-4724-add5-7914fdc75c4a"
msgid "A collapsed ceiling has blocked this passage."
msgstr "무너진 천장이 길을 막았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/Golem - Agressive_String
msgctxt "c24da874-9295-4bf7-97f3-70553a4c42f1"
msgid "\"Training fight mode activated.\""
msgstr "\"전투 훈련 모드 작동.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/Golem - Defensive_String
msgctxt "814db4f7-8006-4667-aeec-c48b0d7a7380"
msgid "\"Master protection mode activated.\""
msgstr "\"마스터 보호 모드 작동.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/Magic_Fails_String
msgctxt "56aa352f-99a3-46d3-b6db-828ca4eedb41"
msgid ""
"This place is brimming with a wild, unpredictable force that makes your skin "
"tingle. Using any kind of magic here might prove a real challenge."
msgstr ""
"이 장소는 당신의 피부를 자극하는 거칠고 예측할 수 없는 힘이 흘러나오고 있습니다. 여기서 마법을 사용한다면 정말 힘들 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/S1 - Candles_String
msgctxt "9bd792a8-06f1-4457-9ba4-f65e85acbc2d"
msgid "You can see melted magic inscriptions on the unlit candles."
msgstr "꺼진 양초 위에 녹아내린 마법의 비문이 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/S1 - Magic cirlces_String
msgctxt "82c844d9-316f-4142-8049-ec2420aa4083"
msgid ""
"The floor is covered with magic circles with their inscriptions hurriedly "
"erased."
msgstr "바닥의 마법 원은 누군가 성급히 지웠습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/S3 - Stone Rat Fail_String
msgctxt "fc318e89-6638-4f41-9939-92bcc8de492f"
msgid "Broken stones of odd shapes."
msgstr "이상한 모습의 돌이 부서져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/S3 - Stone Rat Success_String
msgctxt "38eedcc5-297b-4308-b138-d0ba84b9ca45"
msgid ""
"The odd-shaped stones are petrified rats, shattered into pieces by someone "
"or something."
msgstr "이상하게 생긴 돌은 마비된 쥐가 어떤 힘에 의해 부숴진 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/S4 - Map on wall_String
msgctxt "b45f9f77-62a9-4c37-b6ce-e98ce0c247b3"
msgid "Detailed map of Numeria, covered with markings."
msgstr "누메리아의 지도에 표시가 되어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Barks/Training Room - Dummies_String
msgctxt "037dab3f-a8c2-4b5d-a101-18e9dd8511ca"
msgid ""
"Training dummies, covered with marks made by what looks to be a wooden sword."
msgstr "나무칼에 맞은 흔적이 훈련용 허수아비에 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0002_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "69c02ffb-797e-4047-96f3-f2b76eaea2c5"
msgid "Told Tristian to destroy the Oculus of Abaddon."
msgstr "나락의 눈을 부수라고 트리스티안에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "fd0f6cdd-eac3-44e5-a406-c09c6219f05d"
msgid "\"Destroy it, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"파괴해. 트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "5a6640c2-49ca-43e4-b530-b141e8c0d73d"
msgid "\"I want to smash this damned artifact myself!\""
msgstr "\"이 망할 유물을 내 손으로 부숴버리겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ea02bd96-bda8-46ee-a4e4-0d06d6e3dbbb"
msgid "\"Do not touch it. The Oculus of Abaddon belongs to me.\""
msgstr "\"손대지 마. 나락의 눈은 내 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "fb4ca13a-1285-4c8e-a1af-1bb460addefa"
msgid "[Watch silently]"
msgstr "[조용히 지켜봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1608fa47-47c7-454a-a3c6-a7cc4731b232"
msgid "Told Tristian to destroy the Oculus of Abaddon."
msgstr "나락의 눈을 부수라고 트리스티안에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "7030f1da-5bf8-451c-9c32-776c21531e8f"
msgid "\"Fine. Let's destroy it.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 파괴하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "90393a37-13d5-4bef-8410-590c8243b67c"
msgid "\"I'll take the Oculus, one way or another!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게든 내가 눈을 가질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "5d346110-0f44-4901-88c9-3d281af80a55"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You're wrong — the Oculus won't bring you down, but I will!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네가 틀렸어. 눈은 너를 쓰러뜨리지 못하겠지만 나는 가능하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4d00922b-7489-4cf6-9603-25718e4a6f75"
msgid "Forgave Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안을 용서합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "0dd19da9-2995-42b1-ba37-87842d41b6c1"
msgid "\"No more suffering. You're forgiven, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"고통은 끝났어. 너를 용서하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f217d115-7588-4e24-b1f1-89af1939d2af"
msgid "Banished Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안을 쫓아냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "05c73b89-e07b-4025-9e56-8d1c5ac196ff"
msgid ""
"\"I can't trust you — and will never be able to trust you again. Leave my "
"lands. Forever.\""
msgstr "\"너를 믿을 수 없어. 다시는 너를 믿지 못할 거야. 내 땅을 떠나라. 영원히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ccf196dc-820d-4a2a-9d79-9ed6b34dc7db"
msgid "Killed Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "b5a236c0-9de6-4ac9-9036-f038facb473f"
msgid "[Attack] \"You've no excuses!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너도 예외는 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "eee45a83-04eb-4e47-af3e-596745a38c78"
msgid "Let Tristian stay."
msgstr "트리스티안이 머물게 둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "769b070a-acf7-4f8c-8552-d41d0f881123"
msgid ""
"\"I'll try to find forgiveness for you in my soul. You can stay in my lands."
"\""
msgstr "\"너를 용서하려고 노력하겠어. 내 땅에 머물러도 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "d0bcc1b9-2eac-4f26-90f1-967a8db84df6"
msgid "\"Wait! I want to ask…\""
msgstr "\"잠깐! 묻고 싶은 게 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "18f2508c-3dfa-472a-85d8-9a090c0bd8a4"
msgid "\"I've made up my mind about what to do with you…\""
msgstr "\"너와 해야 할 일을 정했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "5c42a3e4-db08-4fc7-ae7c-8c2db20f86f4"
msgid "\"Tristian… who are you?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안... 대체 넌 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "5ee6fc1a-5d74-4f70-96b9-1536b9591abc"
msgid "\"Who is Nyrissa?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "4dac2069-fb2a-49c0-8b5a-87c20d462bbc"
msgid "\"What did Nyrissa want the Oculus of Abaddon for?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 나락의 눈을 왜 원하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "4ffd8648-3a5c-4f01-869e-cfc5e82ed442"
msgid "\"The Sister mentioned some lies about sacred gift and mortal body…\""
msgstr "\"자매가 필멸자의 몸과 신성한 선물에 대해 거짓말을 했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "a2c315b8-dbb5-4754-bfc8-2f66b7a62718"
msgid ""
"\"Those cultists from the Kingdom of the Cleansed who tried to kill me — "
"were you involved in that, too?\""
msgstr "\"정화된 자들의 왕국에서 온 사교도들이 나를 죽이려고 했었지... 너도 관련이 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "e558b19a-0365-4439-bd8d-a8a0db92d5a9"
msgid "\"What is this Everblooming Flower you're talking about?\""
msgstr "\"도대체 이 영원히 피는 꽃은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "99c2538c-9360-425d-b4eb-6796e82bb1c1"
msgid "[Hold Tristian] \"Let me take you home.\""
msgstr "[트리스티안을 잡습니다] \"집으로 보내 줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Answer_0078_Text
msgctxt "098bb6ec-f1e6-46c7-bff2-d3cf3e7eae5d"
msgid "\"Tell me about Nyrissa's search for the Oculus.\""
msgstr "\"나락의 눈을 찾으려는 나이리사에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "71636176-9dd1-4b4d-922a-1e88ca74f1c6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's eyes are affixed on the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}, "
"gleaming in the eye of the Defaced Sister. His lips move, but you have to "
"strain to hear his words.{/n} \"The one, who doesn't see evil, will destroy "
"the thing that seduces others... power that can disperse the darkness... "
"evil incarnate must be destroyed...\" {n}Without looking at you, Tristian "
"reaches for the Oculus.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 눈은 얼굴 잃은 자매의 눈에 비친 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈에 집중되어있습니다. 그는 입술을 움직였지만 당신은 "
"겨우 그의 말을 들을 수 있었습니다.{/n} \"악을 보지 않는 자는 유혹하는 것을 파괴할 것이며... 악을 물리치는 힘은... 되살아난 "
"악은 반드시 파괴된다...\" {n}당신을 보지 않고 트리스티안은 나락의 눈에 손을 뻗습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "92b563ba-421b-46cb-96bd-cfbe29732f6a"
msgid ""
"\"No!\" {n}Tristian, deadly pale, turns to face you.{/n} \"No! The Oculus "
"was created to bring suffering to mortals, to multiply grief and misery! "
"Change your mind, {name}. It must be destroyed.\" {n}Tristian falls silent "
"for a while.{/n} \"I've lost everything because of this Oculus. Let me "
"destroy it before it brings down someone else.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안 돼!\" {n}창백해진 트리스티안은 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"안 돼! 나락의 눈은 슬픔과 절망을 깊게 해서 필멸자에게 고통을 "
"줘! 그러지 마. {name}. 그것은 파괴되어야 해.\" {n}트리스티안은 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} \"나락의 눈 때문에 나는 모든 "
"것을 잃었어. 다시 누군가가 쓰러지기 전에 그것을 파괴해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "c0b49a38-43c0-45b8-bde2-57cc60e0b7c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tears well in Tristian's eyes, but his features harden, his expression "
"determined.{/n} \"Forgive me for what I do now.\" {n}He clenches his fists, "
"and suddenly, blinding fires flare in his eyes!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 눈에 눈물이 고였지만 그의 표정은 확고하고 말투는 단호합니다.{/n} \"나를 용서해줘.\" {n}그는 주먹을 쥐고는 "
"갑자기 그의 눈에 불꽃이 일었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "cd109201-34e2-4e10-9c93-9fdef2460a7a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"No… there is one way… but not for you...\""
" {n}He sighs and kneels down beside the Sister's body.{/n} \"This is my "
"duty, {name}. I will pay the price.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"안 돼... 오직 방법은 하나야... 하지만 너는 아니야...\" {n}그는 한숨을 쉬고는 "
"자매의 시체 옆에 무릎을 꿇습니다.{/n} \"이건 내 의무야. {name}. 내가 대가를 치르겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "19f32b92-ec99-4d85-ba30-e0e2efeb4458"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian reaches down and takes the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} from "
"the Sister's eye socket. Then he steps back, raises his hand to his eyes, "
"while raising the other hand, with the artifact firmly clenched in it, to "
"the sky and sun, hidden behind the stone masonry.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 손을 뻗어 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 자매의 눈에서 빼냅니다. 그리고 한걸음 물러서 손을 눈에 대고 다른 "
"손으로 유물을 쥐고 하늘 높이 들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "4ebf7585-a11c-412e-81aa-5b00fc4c4895"
msgid ""
"\"Merciful {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}! Dawnflower! Hear the prayer from your "
"apostate! I am powerless to fix what I've done, but I can prevent others "
"from following the same road! Grant me courage and light my way in the "
"eternal darkness that awaits!\"\n"
"{n}For a moment, the dim room is brightly illuminated — a flower, made of "
"blinding light, blooms in Tristian's palm. The cleric utters a last sigh — "
"and presses his palm engulfed in sacred fire, to his eyes. With his other "
"hand, he releases the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}, and it falls to "
"shatter on the ground.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"자비로운 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}시여! 당신의 사도의 기도를 들어주소서! 내가 저지른 일을 되돌릴 수는 없으나 다른 "
"이들이 같은 길을 걷지 않게 할 수는 있습니다! 내게 용기를 주고 영원한 어둠 속에서 빛의 길을 걷게 하소서!\"\n"
"{n}잠시 동안 어두운 방은 빛이 났고 눈부신 꽃이 트리스티안의 손바닥에 놓여있습니다. 성직자는 한숨을 쉬고는 신성한 불꽃이 타오르는 "
"손바닥을 눈에 댑니다. 그의 다른 손은 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 떨어뜨려 바닥에 깨뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "b53cda41-6c01-492a-ad6f-74002667405d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian turns towards you, his face tortured.{/n} \"{name}? Let me tell "
"you something before you decide my fate. Nyrissa is gone — she cannot keep "
"me silent any longer.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신을 고통스러운 눈빛으로 봅니다.{/n} \"{name}? 내 운명을 결정하기 전에 한마디만 할게. 나이리사는 "
"사라졌어. 이제 그녀 때문에 침묵하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "73f9617d-c70c-4a5d-b351-d7b4dc0c8357"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian takes his palm from his face, covered in tears of pain and "
"relief — his eyes are white, blinded.{/n} \"The destruction of the Oculus in "
"exchange for eternal darkness...\" {n}He chuckles bitterly.{/n} \"There's no "
"worse punishment for {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} servant than to be deprived "
"of her light forever — but it is fitting for all I have done.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 손바닥으로 고통과 안도의 눈물을 흘리는 얼굴을 덮습니다. 그의 눈은 다시 불투명합니다.{/n} \"영원한 어둠을 대가로 "
"나락의 눈을 파괴했습니다...\" {n}그는 씁쓸하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 종에게 그녀의 빛을 "
"빼앗기는 것보다 더 큰 처벌은 없을 테지만, 제가 저지른 모든 일들에 맞는 처벌이겠죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "650960cb-0210-4a97-8a93-14d122a319c6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's lips tremble, and he answers you faintly.{/n} \"Thank you.\"\n"
"{n}The cleric takes a deep breath, as if gathering himself, and his voice "
"rises.{/n} \"I'll leave you and head for the city. A walk will help me to "
"figure out how can I make my amends for... for everything.\" {n}He nods in "
"farewell.{/n} \"Till we meet again, {name}\"."
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 떨리는 입술로 힘 없이 대답합니다.{/n} \"고마워.\"\n"
"{n}성직자는 진정하려는 듯 깊은 한숨을 쉬었고 그의 목소리에 힘이 돌아옵니다.{/n} \"여기를 떠나 도시로 향할 거야. 걷다 보면 내 "
"죄를 어떻게 갚을지 생각하기 쉽겠지.\" {n}그는 작별의 인사로 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"다시 만나길, {name}\"."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "50c492f8-7510-4868-b233-d4fd8879629c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian drops his head — either in shame or in agreement with your "
"words.{/n} \"Forgive me, {name}.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신의 말에 동의할 수 없어서인지 부끄러워서인지 손을 늘어뜨립니다.{/n} \"나를 용서해. {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "f7fbb61d-8a28-421f-949c-35f2ae9ba868"
msgid ""
"\"Later. Everything — later. Let me do this — let me save the world from "
"this evil…\""
msgstr "\"다음에. 지금은 아니야. 나를 보내줘. 내가 악으로부터 세상을 구하게 해줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "4d6c5318-aadb-44db-90f1-912d20f66ad8"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems to you that a shadow of fear crosses Tristian's face, but he "
"keeps silent.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}공포의 그림자가 트리스티안의 얼굴에 지나갔지만 그는 침묵합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "b014f1f2-708f-41b9-9b7e-07f91fd97597"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"I am a deva... once a sacred servant and "
"messenger of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} herself. Once it was my calling to "
"heed mortals' prayers and to deliver them to other servants of the goddess. "
"That was before I fell into a trap set by Nyrissa.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"나는 한 때 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 충실한 종이자 전령인 데바였어. "
"필멸자의 기도를 듣고 여신님의 다른 종에게 그 기도를 전하는 것이 내 사명이었지. 나이리사의 덫에 걸리기 전까지는 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "594fcc12-73c5-45e7-8eeb-a02b6f843c94"
msgid ""
"\"She took from me my powers and severed my bond with my goddess. At least… "
"that's what I had thought.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 내 힘을 빼앗아가고 여신님과 멀어지게 했지. 그게... 내가 기억하는 전부야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "9e4324bb-2550-4be4-bedb-6f2e47f4d664"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa threatened that if I didn't serve her, she'd never return my wings "
"and I'd never speak to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} again. She made me... she..."
"\" {n}Tristian trails off, and his face darkens.{/n}\n"
"\"I'm lying to you again, {name}. If it wasn't for my cowardice, Nyrissa "
"would never have broken me to her will. But I... I was afraid to remain "
"mortal!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사는 자기를 섬기지 않으면 내 날개를 돌려주지 않고 다시는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}를 볼 수 없게 하겠다고 "
"위협했고. 그녀는 내게...\" {n}트리스티안은 말이 없어지더니 그의 얼굴이 어두워졌습니다.{/n}\n"
"\"너에게 다시 거짓말을 하는군. {name}. 내가 겁에 질리지 않았다면 나이리사는 나를 부수지 못했을 거야. 하지만 나는... "
"필멸자가 되는 것이 두려웠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "3aa48fcb-fe1b-4677-b3a1-5ef3881e4c68"
msgid ""
"\"A nymph. One of the most beautiful of all creatures. Most wicked of all "
"monsters. But who she is — what she wants, I do not know.\""
msgstr "\"님프다. 아름다운 생명체지. 가장 매혹적인 괴물이기도 해. 하지만 그녀가 누구인지 무엇을 원하는지는 나도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "92fa4a5c-b37c-4d7e-93db-efa0a7c95ccb"
msgid ""
"\"I ran across her while traveling through the negative energy plane. A "
"strange wound — like something had pierced time and space. In my pride, "
"confident in my powers, I followed its path to this world.\" {n}Tristian "
"shakes his head.{/n} \"She dealt with me in a heartbeat.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 음의 에너지 세계를 통과할 때 그녀와 마주쳤어. 마치 시공간이 내 몸에 상처를 입히는 것 같았고. 내 자존심과 자부심을 따라 이 "
"세계로 오게 된 거야.\" {n}트리스티안은 고개를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"그녀가 나를 쓰러뜨리는 데는 1초도 걸리지 않았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "f9edeb17-af38-4622-ab7a-78d855be6f39"
msgid ""
"\"Before I could flee, she had entrapped me, filling my mind with horrible "
"nightmares... and when I awoke, I was mortal. I... I had no choice.\" {n}"
"Tristian's voice rises, becoming desperate.{/n} \"No choice at all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"도망가기 전 그녀는 내게 덫을 놓았고 나는 끔찍한 악몽으로 사로잡혔어... 그리고 깨어난 후에 나는 필멸자가 되어있었어. 나는... "
"선택의 여지가 없었어.\" {n}트리스티안의 목소리는 커지더니 절망적으로 변합니다.{/n} \"어떤 선택의 여지조차.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "bd63f96f-a6ed-4fb8-abac-f0211e2d0cd8"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know. After I failed her...\" {n}Tristian interrupts himself.{/n} "
"\"After I failed to destroy you, she became angry with me. The only way to "
"regain her favor was to find the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} and bring "
"it to her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠어. 그녀를...\" {n}트리스티안이 말을 바꿉니다.{/n} \"너를 파괴하지 못하고 그녀는 나에게 화가 났지. 그녀의 호의를 "
"다시 되찾는 방법은 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 찾아 가져가는 것이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "5b504155-820c-40fb-8caf-21b6456969a1"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know why she wants it, only that she will destroy anything in her "
"path to possess it — including you. I beg you, {name}, be careful — she "
"never forgets any who dare challenge her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 왜 그것을 원하는지는 모르겠지만 너를 포함해 그녀의 길을 막는 자들을 파괴하려고 했던 것 같아. 부탁이야. {name}. 제발 "
"조심해. 그녀는 한번 기억한 적은 잊지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "155afd86-d600-4c14-b51e-bcae2ebc46c0"
msgid ""
"\"When I awaked from Nyrissa's enchantments, I was mortal, no longer a deva. "
"Nyrissa said she'd taken my gift of immortality and severed my bond with my "
"goddess... but... according to what the Sister said...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 나이리사의 마법에서 깨어났을 때 나는 필멸자가 되어있었어. 더 이상 천사가 아니었지. 나이리사가 나의 불멸과 여신과의 연결을 "
"빼앗아갔다고 하더군... 하지만 자매의 말은 달랐어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "d7bd1531-c448-47e2-b68a-65440c39f20c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian takes a deep breath and raises his head.{/n} \"I don't "
"understand what's true anymore and what is not. Before this, I thought "
"Nyrissa stood between me and {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. But it seems like... "
"seems like she was lying.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 깊은 숨을 쉬고는 고개를 듭니다.{/n} \"무엇이 진실이고 거짓인지 모르겠어. 이 전에는 나이리사가 나와 "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g} 사이를 막는다고 생각했어. 하지만 지금은... 그녀가 거짓말을 하는 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "97c86b00-de92-4847-8887-b285d0f81ce0"
msgid ""
"\"I'm tired of lies and deception. Our meeting wasn't a coincidence... It "
"was Nyrissa who sent me to the {g|Temple of the Elk}Temple of the Elk{/g}. "
"She conjured that fog and sent Jhod a vision of the place. Since then I've "
"been watching you, waiting for a time to act. For Nyrissa.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 거짓과 기만에 질렸어. 우리의 만남은 우연이 아니었어... 나를 {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 신전{/g}에 보낸 "
"것은 나이리사였어. 그녀가 안개를 만들고 조드에게 환상을 심어주었지. 그 이후로 나는 너를 지켜보며 때를 기다렸어. 나이리사를 위해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "cbc6ebe4-9798-4ce0-86bc-a80e0836b06a"
msgid ""
"\"But that's... that's not all. I helped her create and plant the unwilting "
"flower that almost destroyed your barony. As you can see...\" {n}Tristian "
"shakes his head.{/n} \"Everything that happened in Vordakai's tomb was but "
"one of my many crimes.\" {n}Tristian falls silent for a moment.{/n} \"That "
"is all. Deal with me however you think best.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 그것은... 그게 전부가 아니야. 나는 네 영지에 역병이 퍼지는 것도 도왔어. 너도 알다시피...\" {n}트리스티안은 고개를 "
"흔듭니다.{/n} \"보다카이의 무덤에서 일어난 일은 내가 저지른 일 중의 하나일 뿐이야.\" {n}트리스티안은 잠시 침묵합니다.{/n} "
"\"그게 다야. 나를 원하는 대로 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "248fa40f-a66d-42bc-9fbf-03d0a4ccbb32"
msgid ""
"\"Partly. Nyrissa charmed the First Faithful, promised him and all his "
"followers a paradise in exchange for your head. My job was to lure you to "
"the trap.\""
msgstr ""
"\"일부분은 맞아. 나이리사는 선지자를 매혹해 네 머리를 가져오면 천국으로 인도해주겠다고 신도들을 속였지. 내 일은 너를 유인하는 "
"일이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "62872d63-894c-4dfa-9f5b-8341b17d3c05"
msgid ""
"{n}A shadow of smile crosses Tristian's face.{/n} \"But Nyrissa ordered me "
"only to lure you to the trap. She never forbade me to protect you. That's "
"why I fought by your side in that battle.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 얼굴에 그림자가 드리운 웃음이 나타납니다.{/n} \"하지만 나이리사는 내게 너를 유인하라고만 명령했었어. 너를 지키지 "
"말라고는 안 했지. 그래서 전투에서 너와 함께 싸운 거고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "f998b738-ebe3-460f-9580-12b910c4960a"
msgid ""
"\"This was Nyrissa's creation — a strange plant with seeds that bring death "
"to the mortals and open gates to the {g|First World}First World{/g}. I don't "
"know much else... all I've done was use my knowledge of the planes to root "
"the flower in two worlds simultaneously.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 나이리사의 창조물이었지. 필멸자를 죽게 해 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}로 가는 문을 여는 이상한 식물은. 모두 "
"아는 것은 아니지만... 내 지식을 이용해 두 세계를 동시에 연결하는 꽃을 심는 것이 내 일이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "7db43db7-968c-4bb3-b515-05e0f69748a7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian winces.{/n} \"What Nyrissa did was deplorable... but I am not "
"blameless. {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} as my witness, I didn't want it to "
"happen as it did. But in my fear of losing her divine light, my resolve "
"crumbled... so I did what I was ordered to do.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"나이리사가 한 일은 끔찍하지만... 내가 비난할 처지는 아니지. "
"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}가 보고 계시는데 그런 일을 저지르게 두고 싶지 않았어. 하지만 그녀의 신성한 빛을 잃을 거라는 "
"두려움과 내 믿음이 흔들려... 나이리사의 명령대로 한 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "18b2b609-65ab-4de1-be6a-8c4249d60872"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian returns your embrace awkwardly. You feel that his heart, which "
"was just pounding like mad, has already begun to beat more slowly, as the "
"tension leaves the deva's body.{/n} \"I will never be able to fully thank "
"you, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 서투르게 당신을 안습니다. 당신은 그의 심장박동을 느꼈고 그것은 미친 듯이 뛰었지만 이내 천천히 뛰기 시작했습니다. "
"걱정이 천사의 몸에서 떠난 것 같습니다.{/n} \"너에게 고맙다는 말도 모자라. {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "79180baf-c4b8-432a-89ff-83495f1883e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Sighing, Tristian pushes you away softly.{/n} \"But please, allow me some "
"time for thought. I will get back to the capital on my own. I need... to "
"think about many things. So long, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}한숨을 쉬며 트리스티안은 당신을 천천히 밀어냅니다.{/n} \"내게 생각할 시간을 줘. 혼자 수도로 갈게. 나는... 생각할 것이 "
"많아 안녕히. {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "88d06b6f-0fa9-42f5-9b10-d6808446d14f"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sighs heavily.{/n} \"Only you can decide, but... I would never be "
"able to trust a traitor. Never.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 깊은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"당신만이 결정할 수 있지만... 저라면 배신자는 다시 믿지 않을 겁니다. 절대로요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b84e0159-3e25-4d45-a4e2-545e0d94d928"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you will find a new home in other lands, Tristian. I am sorry it "
"turned out like this. And now — farewell.\""
msgstr "\"다른 곳에서 너의 새로운 집을 찾기를 바란다. 트리스티안. 이렇게 되어서 정말 유감이야. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "625eea14-91c7-4141-8b39-f2e5502cc835"
msgid "\"Poor you, it must have been so hard! It's worse than slavery...\""
msgstr "\"불쌍하구나. 정말 힘들었겠어! 노예보다 지독한 생활이었겠군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "a006f3a2-0475-4063-83b3-3ee2d4151a82"
msgid ""
"\"So we have a warrior of the divine armies of light here! To put it nicely, "
"I suspected that Tristian wasn't honest with us, but I never assumed "
"something like that...\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 신성한 빛의 천사와 함께 했었던 거군! 트리스티안이 무언가를 숨기고 있다고 생각은 했지만 이런 사실을 숨겼을 줄이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "0cb9b259-ad46-4892-9b32-8674aca8945a"
msgid ""
"\"And I was very wrong about you, Tristian. I just can't decide, whether I "
"should begin to respect you as a mighty creature from other spheres... or "
"despise thrice as hard because you managed to lose even this divine power of "
"yours?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 내가 잘 못 알고 있었네. 트리스티안. 너를 다른 차원에서 온 전능한 생명체로 존중해 줘야 할지... 신성한 능력마저도 잃어서 "
"세 배로 멸시해야 할지 결정을 못 내리겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "23f9321e-c72c-47bc-a14c-f9c0349d2ac2"
msgid ""
"\"A slave, if he has at least some bravery, will make every effort to "
"escape. And this one? A witch wagged a finger at him, and he went and did "
"what she said. And betrayed his friends, too. Ugh!\""
msgstr "\"노예나 다름 없구나. 용기도 없어서 탈출도 못하다니. 게다가 마녀가 하라는 대로 움직이다니. 그리고 친구도 배신했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "fa4155fb-af74-4655-9fcb-75bedc85d3d7"
msgid "\"I begin to admire this nymph.\""
msgstr "\"그 님프는 정말 놀랍군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8f07f88c-076f-4f06-b039-10732a97d3e6"
msgid ""
"\"No, just look at him! He's been lied to.\" {n}Amiri says, her voice "
"dripping with sarcasm.{/n} \"And how about lying to your friends with whom "
"you sit by the fire and fight shoulder to shoulder?! I haven't seen such "
"nastiness in a long time. And he pretended to be this goody-goody!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 그는 계속 거짓말을 했어.\" {n}아미리의 목소리에는 비꼼이 담겨있습니다.{/n} \"어떻게 화롯불에 같이 휴식하고 함께 "
"싸우던 동료를 배신할 수가 있지?! 이런 역겨운 녀석은 처음이야. 그러고도 착한 척이나 하고 있다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "918cabd0-0d41-4978-b5f7-7898c38939d9"
msgid "\"Aaah! Stop talk-talking! Head hurts!\""
msgstr "\"아아아! 말- 말하는거 그만! 머리 아파!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "513fbb33-02eb-47ee-9a46-7175df5fad8a"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa discovered an ancient power awakening beneath the {g|Tors of "
"Levenies}Tors of Levenies{/g}. She knew of Vordakai, and she also knew of "
"the oculus. What she did not know is the location of his tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사는 {g|Tors of Levenies}레베니스 바위산맥{/g} 아래에서 고대의 힘을 발견했어. 그녀는 보다카이와 나락의 눈에 "
"대해 알고 있었지. 단지 무덤의 위치만 몰랐을 뿐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "a6616ca6-2006-4e1d-a980-d2407f7405f7"
msgid ""
"\"The Defaced Sisters and the {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} barbarians serving them "
"were dispatched to search for the tomb's entrance. But you found it first, "
"and you would have acquired the Oculus if it were not for... me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"얼굴 잃은 자매와 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}의 야만인은 무덤의 입구를 찾기 위해 보내졌어. 하지만 네가 먼저 발견했고 내가 "
"아니었다면... 나락의 눈을 차지했겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "a371d4ca-b41b-4ed1-863c-adff1a85896d"
msgid ""
"\"Not just a follower of Sarenrae, but her celestial messenger. And not just "
"a hypocrite – but a traitor, guilty of taking many innocent lives. Now I see "
"that my heart was right, when it told me to keep away from you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"서렌레이의 추종자일 뿐만 아니라 천사였군. 위선자이자 무고한 사람들을 죽인 죄가 있는 배신자이고. 너를 처음 볼 때부터 마음에 들지 "
"않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "8fad8d8a-a823-4699-9591-dff9812692dc"
msgid ""
"\"What was the point of leaving Qadira if even in faraway lands fate "
"delivers me not only a follower of Sarenrae, but her loyal – or not so loyal "
"– deva!\""
msgstr "\"카디라를 떠났던 서렌레이의 추종자가 천사였다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "bef59ca6-ddda-4af4-8492-aec975295f4b"
msgid ""
"\"We saved him from a smug fey sorceresses from the First World. We helped "
"him figure out the truth. We don't owe him anything. Let him go his way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그를 사악한 페이 마법사로부터 구했어. 트리스티안이 진실을 찾게 도와줬다고. 그에게 빚진 것은 없으니 자신의 길을 가게 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_ANGEL/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ab04accc-51f5-4792-acce-51793efaa84b"
msgid ""
"\"I don't believe in beautiful tales of atonement and awakening. He who has "
"betrayed once, will betray again. And what can be worse than a servant or "
"companion who you can't trust?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 깨달음을 주는 아름다운 이야기 따위는 믿지 않아. 그는 우리를 한번 배신했고 다시 배신할 거야. 믿지 못하는 동료보다 나쁜 게 "
"어디 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0a77b3a6-b158-4241-902a-c25290c68748"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "49e91792-711e-4de7-9919-39ed2b1b68a5"
msgid ""
"Told the Defaced Sister that you would let her live if she left Tristian "
"alone."
msgstr "얼굴 잃은 자매에게 트리스티안을 두고 간다면 목숨을 살려주겠다고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "68169063-e500-445d-9130-eb7b1456ebd9"
msgid ""
"\"I came for Tristian. Give him to me, and we'll go our separate ways.\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안을 찾으러 왔다. 그를 건네라. 그러면 길을 막지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "ea993b88-9c5f-4812-a526-065de6aeb466"
msgid "\"Enough. Tell me, where did Nyrissa go!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나이리사가 어디로 갔는지 말해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "0fdd3aca-3861-4561-9e1f-9514d2baa425"
msgid "\"I have met others like you. Tell me: who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너같은 녀석은 뻔해. 네가 누군지 밝혀!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "40505003-4b01-4320-8c22-0d2815b6c5cc"
msgid "\"What sister are you talking about?\""
msgstr "\"자매들이 네게 무슨 말을 한 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "887e1e93-64b8-44b7-9fa3-b0816558ecf1"
msgid "\"Tristian, can you hear me? Wake up!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 들려? 일어나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fe393ff4-cbb8-4588-be9c-6c56545861b2"
msgid "Supported Tristian in his decision to confront the Faceless Sister."
msgstr "트리스티안을 도와 얼굴 잃은 자매를 맞서는 것을 도왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "47e27fd2-7ced-4703-9263-f51f9edd9baa"
msgid ""
"\"Did you hear that, Tristian? Whatever Nyrissa told you, it was lies! You "
"can still free yourself from her control!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안. 나이리사가 네게 무슨 말을 했던지 그건 거짓말이야! 너는 그녀의 통제에서 벗어날 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "244b328c-10e4-4a57-b566-5a53e1df1652"
msgid "\"Wait! That's not all I wish to know!\""
msgstr "\"기다려! 더 알아야 할 게 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "61dd772a-f51f-46ac-ada8-d0a64d9572a9"
msgid "[Attack] \"Prepare to die, creature!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"죽을 준비 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "fb9e538c-7649-4314-945e-d3efdb9ab365"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly what was destined to happen.\" {n}The Defaced Sister points at the "
"Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}.{/n} \"My mistress granted me a boon few of "
"my kind could hope for. My body and my soul became a vessel of a great "
"power\"."
msgstr ""
"\"결국 그 일이 일어날 것이다.\" {n}얼굴 잃은 자매는 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"우리 여왕님은 "
"나 같은 것에게 큰 상을 주셨다. 내 몸과 영혼은 위대한 힘의 그릇이 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "74bd6e44-e69c-4f9a-b15c-5f9d02f4d0fe"
msgid ""
"\"I won't do that. Besides — why would you need someone who lied to you "
"every step of the way, concealing his true goals and his true self? Look at "
"him! Did you know he was once one of my kind — a creature from the outer "
"planes? Now all that remains of the sacred servant of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} is a husk.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 하지만 자신의 목표와 본모습을 숨기고 너를 계속 속여왔던 자를 원하는 거야? 내 말은... 이 녀석이 나처럼 다른 차원에서 온 "
"존재라는 걸 알고 있었어? 이제 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 천사에게 남은 것은 껍데기 뿐이로군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "aa865078-f888-4569-a93a-af0c0c3ad3f7"
msgid ""
"\"You see, these lands were our home long before you appeared. These walls "
"witnessed another mortal, who, like you, serves Nyrissa's goals now. We "
"taught him. We showed him the way. We told him what to believe — and whom to "
"serve.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 땅은 네가 나타나기 전부터 우리의 땅이었다. 이 벽들은 너와 같은 녀석들이 나이리사의 목표를 이루는 것을 지켜보았지. 우리가 그를 "
"가르쳤다. 그에게 길을 알려주고 무엇을 믿고 섬겨야 할지 알려주었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "54d8c5dc-51e7-4a53-a8b7-d8d6f6084ee4"
msgid ""
"\"An emissary from the {g|First World}First World{/g}. A servant to the "
"power that came to these swamps against her will. My duty is a heavy one, "
"but I bear it without faltering — I shall not bow, not before destiny, not "
"before my enemies, and not before creatures such as you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|First World}태초의 세계{/g}로부터 온 사절이자, 그녀의 의지에 맞서는 녀석들을 처리하는 하인이지. 내 막중한 의무에 "
"어떠한 의문도 품지 않는다. 나는 내 적들이나 운명에 굴하지 않을 거고 너 같은 녀석에게 무릎 꿇지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "3bc93be5-a4e3-46c9-9fc2-cadbd6be3e11"
msgid ""
"\"She went after what the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} revealed to her — "
"she will not return. She has ordered me, the most loyal of all Sisters, to "
"remain here and ensure nothing leaves these chambers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈이 보여주는 것을 찾으러 떠났다. 그녀는 돌아오지 않을 테지. 그녀는 여기에 남아 누구도 "
"이곳을 떠나지 못하게 하라고 명령했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "543843fa-678b-46b2-8ca8-2ec932b8ef4b"
msgid ""
"\"The wounded skylark hurried to his mistress to tell about his failure in "
"person!\" {n}The Sister sneers at the kneeling Tristian.{/n} \"This "
"sanctimonious fool proved incapable of carrying out a simple order — because "
"of you! Now our mistress wants to search for what the Oculus was meant to "
"show her, and I...\" {n}The woman twists her fingers.{/n} \"I remained "
"behind to rid my lady of those who have outlasted their usefulness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"상처 입은 종달새가 직접 그가 실패한 일을 보고하러 여왕님에게 갔구나!\" {n}자매는 무릎 꿇은 트리스티안에게 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"이 멍청이는 단순한 명령도 듣지 못함을 증명했다. 너 때문이다! 우리의 여왕은 나락의 눈이 보여주는 것을 원한다. 그리고 나는...\""
" {n}여자는 말합니다.{/n} \"나는 여기에 남아 더 이상 쓸모없는 녀석들을 없애라는 주인님의 명령을 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "8d5ebfde-dc14-4826-8dd8-b19e32246bf5"
msgid ""
"\"She left. Where and why is not your concern. I remained only to remove any "
"trace of her and her servants left behind.\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 떠났다. 어디로 왜 갔는지는 네가 알 바가 아니야. 나는 여기에 남아 그녀를 위해 여기를 청소해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "4304e2d4-a1d6-4533-bdb8-9af366bb7ea0"
msgid ""
"\"She's the queen of this horizon and horizons unseen. She's the mistress of "
"dreams and the embodiment of all mortal desires. She is wrath, and she will "
"crush these lands to dust.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 이승과 저승의 여왕이시다.그녀는 꿈의 지배자이자 모든 인간의 욕망의 구현체이다. 그녀는 분노이며 이 땅을 먼지로 만들 것이다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "68301b5f-fc24-4fc0-ad21-1550febb619b"
msgid ""
"\"I serve Nyrissa, mortal.\"\n"
"{n}When you hear this name, a chill crawls down your spine — a supernatural "
"coldness freezes your shoulders for a moment, but then the feeling "
"passes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 나이리사님을 섬긴다. 필멸자여.\"\n"
"{n}당신이 그 이름을 들었을 때 등골이 섬짓함을 느낍니다. 초자연적인 추위가 잠시 당신의 몸을 관통했지만 그 기분은 곧 "
"사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "8bc5d9a2-91a6-4e80-8b69-82890de1bd32"
msgid ""
"\"My elder sister, Nyrissa... she is the mistress of half-truths, exploiting "
"hopes and weaknesses of others with her words. All it took to control Armag "
"was some books and legends about his 'great destiny'. All it took to control "
"Tristian was deceiving him into thinking it was Nyrissa who deprived him of "
"his holy gift, she who cursed him with a mortal body...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사님은... 필멸자의 희망과 약점을 파고 드시는 꿈의 여왕이지. 아르막은 그의 책에 나오는 위대한 전설을 믿고 움직인다. "
"트리스티안은 나이리사님이 자신의 신성력과 날개를 가져가고 필멸자로 만든 장본인이라는 거짓말을 믿고 따르는 녀석이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "9e08f000-cf15-4d43-8da5-34179df389de"
msgid ""
"{n}The Defaced Sister before you moves like a broken puppet — her feet are "
"unsteady, and she sways slightly back and forth, as if attached to invisible "
"strings. Her hands dangle limply from the wrist, and her clothes are smeared "
"with blood. Instead of an eye, the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} rests "
"within her eye socket, the artifact gleaming with a wicked red light.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}얼굴 잃은 자매는 부러진 인형처럼 움직입니다. 그녀의 발은 불안정하고 마치 보이지 않는 실에 움직이듯 몸이 앞뒤로 흔들립니다. 그녀의 "
"손은 덜렁거리고 옷은 피로 물들었습니다. 눈 한쪽에는 {g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈이 박혀있었고 그것은 사악한 붉은 빛으로 "
"빛납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "543d0200-85d7-4710-933f-ee0a68afb5ca"
msgid ""
"{n}The Defaced Sister turns to you. From under the hood hiding her face, "
"angry gray eyes glint at you.{/n} \"It was you! You robbed my sister of "
"hope! You prolonged her suffering and our suffering, as well!\" {n}She stops "
"to catch her breath, then adds, almost indifferently.{/n} \"For that, you'll "
"die.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}얼굴 잃은 자매는 당신을 봅니다. 후드 아래에 숨겨진 그녀의 얼굴에는 회색 눈이 분노로 빛납니다.{/n} \"너였구나! 네가 내 "
"자매의 희망을 빼앗았어! 네가 그녀가 고통받게 하고 우리에게도 고통을 주었어!\" {n}그녀는 잠시 멈추더니 차갑게 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"그러니 너는 죽을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "333d56c2-146a-4330-9a0b-0744987c64ba"
msgid ""
"\"My elder sister left… you're late…\" {n}The woman turns to you.{/n} \"The "
"Oculus of Abaddon gave me the power to foresee the path to my sister's "
"desire. She is already on her way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 언니가 떠났다... 너는 늦었어...\" {n}여자는 당신을 돌아 봅니다.{/n} \"나락의 눈이 나의 자매가 원하는 길을 "
"예견할 힘을 주었어. 그녀는 이미 길을 떠났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "fc330f4c-64f7-42b1-9c10-848befba9700"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} doesn't even turn toward you: he's "
"immersed into desperate prayer to his goddess.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 성직자는 당신을 보지도 않습니다. 그는 여신에게 절망적으로 기도하고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "c010853a-7e0c-4ad2-8979-0d85a718a47c"
msgid ""
"\"Save your breath — this skylark has broken his wings and now he's useless. "
"I'll rid myself of him after I'm finished with you.\""
msgstr "\"이 종달새는 날개를 잃어 쓸모가 없어졌다. 너와의 일이 끝나면 그를 없앨 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "73b89598-72f8-4b3a-bf90-72657c12c79e"
msgid ""
"{n}As if awakened from a nightmare, Tristian winces and raises his head.\""
"{/n} \"Lies?... So that was all lies?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}악몽에서 깨어난 듯 트리스티안은 얼굴을 찡그리고는 고개를 듭니다.\"{/n} \"거짓이라고?... 모두 거짓말이었던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "4106bfad-0393-40e3-ae7c-88211e91bb86"
msgid ""
"\"...and all it took to control you, upstart {mf|baron|baroness} — was a "
"lure, the promise of your own lands to 'rule'. And you bought it. All of you."
"\" {n}The Sister straightens her shoulders.{/n} \"Enough. You are a thing of "
"the past, and I must rid this place of you — and Tristian. Get ready for "
"oblivion.\""
msgstr ""
"\"...모두 너를 조종하기 위한 것이었다. 네 땅을 다스리기 위한 약속은 미끼였지. 그리고 너는 속은 거야. 너희 모두.\" {n}"
"그녀는 어깨를 핍니다.{/n} \"그만. 너는 쓸모가 없으니 여기서 너와 트리스티안을 없애야겠다. 망각을 맞이할 준비를 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d3ce7c3f-a1cf-4ca1-a285-1760f229b595"
msgid "\"Why do we want to save him? He is our friend, that's why!\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리가 그를 구해야 하냐고? 그는 우리의 친구이기 때문이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7d08791d-35ae-4924-9d9a-426b6c84c9cd"
msgid ""
"\"And maybe we should really leave him to this faceless carrion? Why do we "
"need a traitor and a wuss in a team? Maybe just to tie him up and throw to "
"monsters as bait.\""
msgstr "\"아마도 그를 얼굴 없는 흉물에게 남겨놓고 가야하나? 왜 배신자를 거두려 해? 그냥 죽여버리고 괴물 밥으로 던져버리자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2e736faf-1d34-4238-ab5a-52af0bc9548d"
msgid ""
"\"Too bad you are unlikely to agree to give me an interview, dear. I spent "
"years studying the {g|First World}First World{/g}, but I think it's the "
"first time I see a case of such remarkable expansion to the {g|Material "
"Plane}Material Plane{/g}. The last event that can compare in the scale was "
"the gnomes' exodus.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내게 말 할 기회를 주지 않아 안타깝군. 나는 {g|First World}태초의 세계{/g}를 수년 동안 연구했지만 {g|"
"Material Plane}물질계{/g}로 영역을 확장하는 것은 최초인 것 같아. 노움 대탈출 이후로 최고의 사건이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "cec42e8e-b7b5-4173-9540-f4d5d5ccf109"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian, my sister's skylark, betrayed you. He used you to infiltrate "
"Vordakai's lair and bestowed my sister's curse upon him. He stole his "
"treasure — the Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g}, an artifact capable of "
"revealing that which is hidden. The Oculus showed me the hiding place of...\""
" {n}The Sister stops, her face stern.{/n} \"No, that is enough. Though your "
"death is assured, such knowledge can wait.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안이 너를 배신했다. 그는 나이리사님의 저주를 받아 보다카이의 무덤을 찾기 위해 너를 이용했지. 그는 "
"{g|Abaddon}나락{/g}의 눈을 훔쳤고 그것이 숨겨진 곳을 보여줄 수 있는 물건이었지. 나락의 눈이 내게 장소를 보여주어...\" "
"{n}그녀는 말을 멈추었고 표정은 굳었습니다.{/n} \"아니. 이걸로 충분하다. 네가 죽는 것은 확실하지만 이런 정보는 말하지 않는 "
"것이 좋겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_FACELESS_SISTER/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "4eae6d01-609d-4519-982f-812273994074"
msgid ""
"We are not like you, heartless fey. As Nethys is my witness, Tristian is not "
"my friend and never will be. But leaving him in your hands is inhuman.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 너처럼 감정 없는 페이가 아니야. 트리스티안은 내 친구도 아니었고 앞으로도 그럴 일은 없어. 하지만 그를 네 손에 버려두는 "
"것은 비인간적이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1e433cd2-a44d-4243-b18b-734c73d3f489"
msgid "\"I've seen you before. Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너를 본 적이 있어. 넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "c4848f84-952a-40b7-bd20-ead30a4f562b"
msgid "\"What did you do to the Defaced Sister?\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매에게 무슨 짓을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "14150ce7-618a-4898-8b2d-36ae82929621"
msgid "Insisted that Nyrissa should leave Tristian alone."
msgstr "나이리사가 트리스티안을 내버려두어야 한다고 주장했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "23f02c40-c639-4bba-8ca1-8bb785c15bcb"
msgid "\"Don't touch Tristian!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안을 건들지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "a9e94791-45b1-4b19-9395-501bab683f95"
msgid "\"So, it was you who sent Tristian to me?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안을 내게 보낸 게 너냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "03e56957-c35c-43a8-aba1-f6e1c4356ad4"
msgid "\"That's enough. I'll stop you — here and now.\""
msgstr "\"그만. 여기서 너를 막아야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "a9787ae3-1931-4a5f-87bf-14492b0338ac"
msgid "\"Why are you telling me all this?\""
msgstr "\"왜 나에게 모두 말해주는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "92285c7c-f7d5-40d6-b2ce-827c916da3de"
msgid "\"I'm not your hound, watch your tongue!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 개가 아니다. 입 조심해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "d8a82ea3-950c-4a57-9e78-b2f1de0f71de"
msgid ""
"\"You know, I'm not one to be easily manipulated. Wasn't that the reason you "
"were watching me so closely?\""
msgstr "\"나는 쉽게 넘어갈 사람이 아니야. 그래서 나를 그렇게 가까이서 관찰했던 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "5f26f00e-fa86-4d43-89ca-ba73495bd5e0"
msgid ""
"\"Could this be the real you? I've seen another version of you. Proud, "
"unbroken, and never so cruel.\""
msgstr "\"너는 이런 모습이 아니었는데. 자신감 있고 고고하고 잔인함을 모르는 친구였는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "92fd8cb9-4b68-4f12-a2d5-62459375739f"
msgid "\"I'm sick and tired of your empty talk. Enough!\""
msgstr "\"네 공허한 말은 질렸어. 그만해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "e06b229d-a84c-4623-94ae-9374ed6f8831"
msgid ""
"\"Our paths have crossed again. Perhaps this time you'll finally tell me who "
"you are…\""
msgstr "\"우리의 길이 다시 교차되는군. 아마도 네 정체를 말하는 게 좋을 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "efdc03c5-2728-4ec5-9856-7090d70ab5b4"
msgid ""
"\"What did the Defaced Sisters and the Numerian barbarians seek in Dunsward?"
"\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매와 누메리안 야만인들이 던스워드에서 무엇을 찾고 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "44c1d3d7-95f7-4225-bacf-7a2cdc3882b3"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems the air itself rings with a frenzied scream. It comes from a "
"slim figure, kneeling on the stone floor — one of the Defaced Sisters — but "
"this time, unmasked.\n"
"But above the Sister stands a nymph, the outline of her features shifting "
"slightly, as if she stands beneath in a slow-moving waterfall. The nymph's "
"quiet words, barely a whisper, cut through the screams of the woman at her "
"feet.{/n} \"Become my eyes, defaced one. Reveal to me the vision granted by "
"the {d|c31 Oculus Stolen}Oculus{/d}. Tell me where my heart's desire lies "
"hidden.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주위는 광기에 찬 괴성으로 가득합니다. 그것은 날씬한 모습의 얼굴 잃은 자매가 가면을 벗고 돌 바닥에 무릎을 꿇고 비명을 지르는 "
"것이었습니다.\n"
"하지만 자매를 님프가 내려다보고 있었고 그녀의 모습은 천천히 떨어지는 물살 아래에 서 있는 것처럼 조금씩 일렁입니다. 님프는 소리 없이 "
"속삭이며 발치에 있는 여성의 비명을 멈춥니다.{/n} \"내 눈이 되거라. 내게 나락의 {d|c31 Oculus "
"Stolen}Oculus{/d}이 보여주는 환상을 보여다오. 내 숨겨진 보물이 어디에 있는지 말해다오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0bbfa26c-38e2-44f5-b81e-19c2fe54fe3b"
msgid ""
"{n}Waves of anger stream from the nymph in the center of the room.{/n} "
"\"Pathetic creature! Tell me — is there any reason I should not torture you "
"for your {d|c31 Oculus Destroyed}apostasy{/d}?\" {n}The nymph raises her "
"hand menacingly — whether to strike or cast a spell, you cannot tell.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}방 한가운데에서 님프가 지르는 분노의 괴성이 퍼집니다.{/n} \"한심한 녀석! 네 {d|c31 Oculus Destroyed}"
"멍청한 짓{/d}을 용서해야 할 이유가 있느냐?\" {n}님프는 손을 들었지만 마법을 쓰려는 건지 공격을 하려는 것인지 알 수 "
"없었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "74405661-af9c-4344-b04d-3b8175314e7d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian, despite the angry words of the nymph, seems oblivious to his "
"surroundings. His face is pale and turned upwards, beads of sweat glint on "
"his forehead. His lips move, as if reciting a prayer.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 님프의 분노에도 불구하고 관심이 없는 것 같았습니다. 그의 얼굴은 창백했고 이마에는 땀이 맺혔습니다. 그의 입술은 "
"기도를 읊 듯 천천히 움직입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : AbandonedKeepSister
msgctxt "dab7e0bc-6d9a-4bc9-bd54-1d5eba430359"
msgid "\"I see… I see…\""
msgstr "\"알겠어... 알겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "330e7fbc-413b-4cd6-ba67-78cae7faf430"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph leans over her kneeling victim.{/n} \"Speak, defaced one. What "
"do you see?\" {n}The Sister, shuddering, chokes out an answer, her pained "
"voice a whisper — you cannot make out her words, but the nymph listens "
"eagerly, then gives a slight smile.\n"
"As the Sister on the floor utters a last, anguished moan, the nymph "
"straightens, almost regally — and the Sister falls silent. The nymph regards "
"the corpse before her and holds her breath for a minute — and the time "
"within the room stops.{/n} \"Finally...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 무릎 꿇은 자를 내려다 봅니다.{/n} \"말 해라. 뭐가 보이지?\" {n}자매는 몸을 떨면서 숨이 막힌 듯 속삭여 당신은 "
"무슨 말을 하는지 몰랐지만 님프는 경청하며 작은 미소를 짓습니다.\n"
"바닥에 무릎 꿇은 자매가 마지막으로 고통에 찬 신음을 하자 님프는 고개를 들었고 자매는 침묵합니다. 님프는 그녀 앞의 시체를 아무 말 "
"없이 보았고 그렇게 시간이 멈춘 듯했습니다.{/n} \"마침내...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "c60c9d4f-7e8b-409e-8846-a0b37b4e86e2"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph stares at Tristian for a long moment. Then, instead of "
"striking, her hand reaches out and clasps his face, turning it to meet her "
"gaze.{/n} \"What happened to you, my skylark?\" {n}The nymph's voice is "
"sharp and sickly sweet.{/n} \"Your heart couldn't bear my anger? So be it. I "
"was bored with your songs anyway — perhaps the snapping of your bones shall "
"entertain me.\" {n}She raises her hand over the Tristian's head once again — "
"then stops as she suddenly notices you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 계속 트리스티안을 보았습니다. 공격하는 대신 그녀는 손을 뻗어 그의 뺨을 때렸고 그와 시선을 맞춥니다.{/n} \"무슨 일이 "
"일어난 거냐?\" {n}님프의 목소리는 날카로왔고 달콤했습니다.{/n} \"내 분노를 무시하겠다? 그러라지. 네 지저귐은 이제 질렸다. "
"이제 네 뼈가 부러지는 소리를 즐겨야겠구나.\" {n}그녀는 트리스티안의 머리 위로 손을 듭니다. 그 순간 그녀는 당신을 "
"발견합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "64260b44-8ace-41f0-915a-b59acd2620c5"
msgid ""
"\"We have guests.\" {n}The nymph turns to you with a slight smile, her eyes "
"sparkling.{/n} \"A hound, following my skylark's trail. You have done well, "
"you've uncovered my old sanctuary — but it is one I shall never return to "
"again. So now that you are here... what do you intend to do?\""
msgstr ""
"\"손님이 있었군.\" {n}님프는 얇은 미소를 지으며 당신을 쏘아봅니다.{/n} \"내 종달새를 따라오는 사냥개로구나. 내 옛 성소를 "
"발견하다니 잘 했다. 하지만 이것은 네게 돌려주지 않을 것이다. 네가 여기에 왔으니 묻지 않을 수 없구나. 무엇을 찾으러 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b089312c-a710-48df-922f-61ca0484cd36"
msgid ""
"{n}Gravel crunches under your feet, but the nymph isn't startled at the "
"sound, she merely turns her head slightly.{/n} \"I can smell you, hound. "
"Your kind always reeks of fear, subservience — it's unmistakable. Why are "
"you here?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 발에서 자갈이 긁히는 소리가 들렸지만 님프는 그 소리에 놀라지 않고 그저 고개를 조금 들 뿐이었습니다.{/n} \"네 존재를 "
"알고 있다. 사냥개야. 너희의 존재는 숨길 수가 없지. 왜 여기로 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "1379e8f2-741a-43f9-9704-0806cce7e255"
msgid ""
"\"Stop me?\" {n}She laughs faintly, her eyes sharp.{/n} \"A hound cannot "
"best a dragon, nor bar its path. My goal is near — I can already hear its "
"song, leading my heart to my final triumph. Nothing can stop me now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 멈춰?\" {n}그녀는 희미하게 웃었고 그녀의 눈은 날카로워집니다.{/n} \"사냥개는 드래곤이 될 수도 드래곤의 뒤를 쫓을 "
"수도 없지. 내 목표가 다가왔다. 나의 승리가 온 것이 내 심장이 이끌리는 것이 느껴진다. 나를 막을 수 있는 것은 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "0542ee76-621a-48d7-89c0-1714d3fe1168"
msgid ""
"\"Your world is but a shadow of my home plane. I am the first and forever "
"queen of these lands. And this sanctuary… is where whispers of the past "
"live, and where I planted the seeds of the future. Here I raised a wolf cub, "
"who eventually became the feared leader of {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}. I watched "
"him rise to power, butchering any who stood against him. And from this place "
"I shall hear of his fall — the last howl of a dying animal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 세계는 나의 세계의 그림자에 불과하지. 나는 이 땅의 처음이자 영원한 여왕이다. 이 성소는... 과거의 속삭임이 살았고 미래의 "
"씨앗을 심은 곳이다. 여기서 늑대 새끼를 키워 그것이 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}의 지도자가 되었지. 그가 성장하며 자신을 "
"가로막는 자를 도살하는 것을 지켜봤다. 그리고 그곳에서 그의 죽음을 들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "23ebd628-1a1e-4045-91f2-dd74f83790be"
msgid ""
"\"Now a hound comes to replace the wolf cub. Should I crush your skull and "
"watch your life bleed from your body? Perhaps... but wouldn't it be more fun "
"to observe whom you'd chase next? Whatever you choose, you'll be serving me. "
"Like the skylark. Like the wolf cub. Like all who placed their trust in the "
"illusion of freedom.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제는 사냥개가 늑대 새끼를 대신하러 왔구나. 네 머리를 쪼개서 몸에서 생명이 흘러나오게 해줄까? 재밌을 지도 모르지... 하지만 "
"네가 다음에 쫓을 자가 누구인지 지켜보는 게 더 재미있을 거야. 네가 무슨 선택을 하던 너는 나를 섬길 것이다. 이 종달새 녀석처럼 "
"말이다. 늑대 새끼처럼 말이다. 자유라는 망상으로 물든 녀석들 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "ec015438-142c-41f5-82af-6cab49ec113e"
msgid ""
"\"Why, to watch the light of hope drain from your eyes and to see your "
"dreams shatter into pieces. Loneliness has consumed me for too long — so now "
"every upstart who dared to bring war to another's lands brings joy to my "
"heart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 눈에서 희망의 빛이 사라지고 꿈이 산산조각나는 모습을 볼 것이야. 오랜 시간 동안 지겨웠다. 전쟁을 일으키려는 녀석들은 나에게 "
"기쁨을 가져다주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0020_Text_String
msgctxt "5c1ac0b9-ec55-42d2-807f-e570bbecc568"
msgid "\"Farewell, my faithful hound. Someone will take care of you.\""
msgstr "\"잘 가거라. 내 충실한 사냥개야. 너를 돌봐주는 자가 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ff7ab97b-32dc-4428-9d15-d88a3202fabd"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, and {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} messenger was a great servant, wasn't "
"he? Deformed by reflection in a thousand mirrors, fallen into shadows born "
"of his own light, a righteous deva with blood-stained hands. What is it? Do "
"I really see surprised expression on your face?\" {n}The nymph goes silent, "
"then gives a faint laugh.{/n} \"Can it be you still don't understand?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 전령은 충실한 종이었지, 그렇지 않니? 수 천 개의 거울로 모습이 일그러지고, 자신의 빛으로 "
"생긴 그림자 속으로 추락한, 피로 손을 물들인 정의로운 데바 말이야. 우습구나. 이것으로 놀라다니.\" {n}님프는 침묵하고는 희미하게 "
"웃습니다.{/n} \"아직도 이해하지 못하겠느냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "6c8f5b35-6fdb-49ea-85ab-2be09537b708"
msgid ""
"\"Now, we both know the skylark belongs to me — just as a butterfly belongs "
"to the day it's born and the day it's destined to die.\""
msgstr "\"이제 종달새가 내 것이라는 것은 분명해졌지. 나비가 태어난 날에 죽게되는 것처럼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "c8b3bb75-31ef-42dd-b3bd-512e37304d9c"
msgid ""
"\"One of the eye sockets of this creature was good enough to fit the Oculus "
"of Abaddon — the one Tristian stole from under your nose. Sister used its "
"power to reveal my path. That is all you need to know.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 녀석의 눈에 나락의 눈이 잘 맞을 것이다. 네 코 앞에서 트리스티안이 훔친 것 말이지. 자매가 이것을 이용해 내 길을 밝히려 "
"했다. 그 이상은 말해주지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "f766b82c-ce74-4bd4-b746-fc75aadb35c6"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph throws back her head and utters a laugh that makes your skin "
"crawl.{/n} \"You seek to give a name to nature itself? Why should a servant "
"seek to know the name of his mistress, when all you need do is play the role "
"you have been given? Well...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 고개를 젖히고 소름이 돋는 웃음을 터뜨립니다.{/n} \"자연에 이름을 붙이겠다고? 미천한 종 주제에 여왕의 이름을 알려 "
"하다니. 네 주제에 맞게 살아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "b81750da-487c-4c10-87d8-2b63d0d0763f"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph straightens and her gaze locks with yours.{/n} \"I am Nyrissa.\""
" {n}At the name, an echo rolls across the room, like a wave.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 고개를 들어 당신과 시선을 맞춥니다.{/n} \"나는 나이리사다.\" {n}그녀의 목소리는 파도처럼 방 안을 울립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "1d112a1f-ada8-4a91-b631-1b758fcb4954"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's lips curve in a charming and frightening smile.{/n} \"You "
"dare challenge your mistress? The one who has shown the way to hundreds... "
"thousands of creatures such as you — filthy beasts who don't even know the "
"face of their queen?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 입술은 매혹적으로 구부러지더니 무서운 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"여왕에게 도전하려고? 너와 같은 수백 수천의 생명에게 길을 "
"인도한 나에게... 주인의 얼굴도 몰라보는 더러운 개 주제에 건방지구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "51f56346-b527-4582-af94-001661df40a4"
msgid ""
"\"You are my faithful hound, and Tristian is my silver-tongued skylark. Both "
"of you serve my will, so how should I call you, if not by your true names?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 나의 충실한 사냥개다. 트리스티안은 은방울 같은 목소리를 가진 종달새지. 너희 모두 내 의지를 따르니 사냥개라고 부르지 않을 "
"수가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "ed85b358-e87d-4238-9934-fe79b84c3d0d"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian was the proud servant of {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} herself, the "
"personification of kindness and mercy. After I caught him in my nets, I "
"couldn't resist the urge to take his wings — so that he might sing for me "
"and me alone. As he followed you, he spoke with me in his dreams, his true "
"mistress. Now he's done as I asked, I could let him go... but I don't like "
"to share my toys, even if they are broken.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안은 친절과 자비의 화신인 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 충실한 종이었지. 그를 붙잡았을 때 날개를 빼앗지 않을 수가 "
"없었다. 그러면 내게만 노래를 불러줄 테니까. 그가 너를 따르면서 자신의 꿈과 진정한 여왕이 누군지를 나에게 말했다. 이제 그는 끝났으니 "
"보내줄 것이다... 하지만 내 장난감이 부서져도 누구에게도 주지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "7452374b-1aea-47a5-8c7c-a9b6ab1aa996"
msgid ""
"\"Stop me? Do not think yourself my equal. Your interference has slowed me "
"for a time, that is all — I shall find my heart's desire and find my purpose "
"again. Even the loss of the Oculus can't stop me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 멈춘다고? 네가 나와 같다고 생각하지 말아라. 네가 방해해서 조금 시간이 늦어졌고 그 뿐이다. 나는 나의 물건을 찾고 목적을 "
"다시 이룰 것이다. 나락의 눈을 잃어도 나는 멈추지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "e130d3c6-771c-46c5-9257-00f74b45d9a9"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph tilts her head.{/n} \"In you I see my reflection. But no, "
"that's utter nonsense! How can one such as I even for a single moment feel "
"kinship with a creature born to become dust in my Apology cup? You are but a "
"toy, a mere hound. A useful tool, no more!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 머리를 갸웃거립니다.{/n} \"너에게서 내 모습을 보았다. 하지만 그건 말도 안 되지. 나의 잔에 담길 재 주제에 어떻게 "
"내가 친밀감을 느낀 거지? 너는 그저 장난감이고 사냥개에 불과해. 유용한 도구 그 이상도 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "0ae97778-3baa-4222-9a49-dfea65a3b689"
msgid ""
"{n}Fire blazes in the nymph's eyes.{/n} \"So bold, so self-confident... so "
"familiar that it pains me to see. Yes, I've been watching you, and it seems "
"that in doing so I've awakened the shadows of bitter memories from the "
"faraway past, forever lost. So now it's time for me to recall how confidence "
"is broken, and boldness is reduced to dust!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 눈에 불꽃이 타오릅니다.{/n} \"대담하고 자신감이 넘치고... 너무나 익숙한 모습이어서 보기가 괴로워. 그래. 너를 "
"지켜봐왔지. 그래서 먼 과거의 잃어버린 씁쓸한 기억의 그림자가 나를 깨운 것 같군. 이제는 네 자신감과 용기가 무너져 가루가 되는 모습을 "
"지켜볼 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "d25f873b-144c-487c-880b-2ba007da8cc9"
msgid ""
"{n}Bitter anger flashes in the nymph's eyes.{/n} \"You've seen nothing and "
"you know nothing! My past is a fire that blinds those who stare. I've left "
"it behind and accepted the fate that was designed for me. I...\" {n}Her "
"sudden outburst fades to nothing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 눈에 고통에 찬 분노가 빛납니다.{/n} \"너는 아무것도 몰라! 내 과거를 본 자는 모두 눈이 멀었다. 나는 내 과거를 "
"묻어두고 내 운명을 받아들이기로 했어. 나는...\" {n}그녀의 외침은 침묵으로 변해갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "f5e3fe00-5e4e-43e3-8f8f-2f576659d6ce"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph smiles — almost tenderly.{/n} \"You can bark at your mistress "
"however you want, hound. But you can't shed the collar and the leash.\""
msgstr "{n}님프는 부드럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"네가 무엇을 원하든 주인에게 짖어라. 하지만 너는 사냥개에 불과해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "777243c7-ac76-4143-877f-570844ffa5cf"
msgid ""
"\"You're trying so hard to glimpse into my soul… are you not you afraid of "
"what you might find? Very well, have it your way, hound. I'll share a little "
"part of my darkness and my pain with you. I'll share with you my name.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 안을 들여다 보려고 엄청난 노력을 하는구나... 네가 그것을 감당할 수 있을까? 좋다. 마음대로 해라. 너에게 내 어둠과 고통을 "
"아주 조금 나눠주마. 나의 이름을 알려주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "09e2e1e3-67a6-4c14-ae38-8ffb0839a4b3"
msgid ""
"{n}Gravel crunches under your feet, but the nymph doesn't seem startled by "
"your arrival. — She just turns her head slightly, as if she long expected "
"you to come.{/n} \"So, you're here, my hound. I'm not surprised.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 발에서 자갈 소리가 들렸지만 님프는 놀라지도 않은 것 같습니다. 그녀는 머리를 조금 들어 당신이 온 것을 미리 알았다는 듯 "
"보았습니다.{/n} \"드디어 왔구나. 사냥개야. 알고 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "17b67d6a-79fb-443a-8f84-ac0d4a004004"
msgid ""
"\"An ancient power awakened in the mountains. A power capable of revealing "
"that which was taken from me. By my order, the Sisters scoured the land for "
"the Oculus. My wolf cub sent his barbarians to help them. But you outpaced "
"all my servants. All but one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고대의 힘이 산 속에서 깨어났다. 그 힘은 나에게서 빼앗아간 것이 어디에 있는지 알려줄 수 있지. 나의 명령으로 자매가 나락의 눈을 "
"찾으러 갔다. 내 늑대 새끼는 야만인을 보내 도왔지. 하지만 너는 다른 종들을 모두 제쳤다. 다름아닌 네가 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/FINAL_NERISSA/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "748f1534-c1fc-4614-8182-7af48c141f7c"
msgid ""
"\"When a seed falls upon fertile ground, it bears fruit for the landowner to "
"harvest. The seed of betrayal grew strong, and I reaped its fruits.\""
msgstr "\"씨앗이 비옥한 토양에 떨어지면 수확할 수 있는 열매를 맺게 되지. 배신의 씨앗은 점점 강해졌고 나는 그것을 맛보았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Golem/Answer_0003_Text_String
msgctxt "13a5b8d6-0798-4173-8c0a-51dacb2407c8"
msgid "[Say the word from the engineer's diary]"
msgstr "[엔지니어의 일기에서 본 것을 말했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Golem/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c6269040-b084-4a49-8ad2-b60df9897ffe"
msgid "[Examine the golem]"
msgstr "[골렘을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Golem/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f525e090-e11d-489a-8f3c-fc95100fb89b"
msgid "[Strike the golem with a weapon]"
msgstr "[골렘을 무기로 때립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Golem/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "17bba9ec-fc2f-4f15-b25e-386233bf4610"
msgid "[Step away from the golem]"
msgstr "[골렘에게서 물러섭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Golem/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "7a768857-0802-4290-984d-9fabeff11b62"
msgid ""
"{n}An iron golem, darkened by time, towers over you — it's massive, created "
"by unknown masters. Its huge arms seem capable of snapping you in two, but "
"it remains still.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}시간에 잊혀졌던 무쇠 골렘이 당신 앞에 섭니다. 그것은 누군가 창조한 거대한 골렘이었습니다. 거대한 팔은 당신을 두조각 낼 수 있을 "
"것 같았지만 움직이지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Golem/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "9dd3ec35-aa0d-47d2-9290-ef23e53adeee"
msgid ""
"{n}Mighty armored plates protect the mechanisms that can set the massive "
"figure into motion. This golem was obviously built for fighting.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}절대 부서질 것 같지 않은 단단한 판이 장치를 보호해 거대한 몸체를 움직이게 합니다. 이 골렘은 분명히 전투 목적으로 "
"제작되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Golem/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a179017c-3984-416c-95d5-b6c4cb33d01f"
msgid "{n}The weapon leaves no mark.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}무기에는 아무 표식도 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Golem/Cue_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "32eda579-eaff-4262-95b6-cbe5c87b0863"
msgid ""
"{n}As the word is spoken, the iron golem comes alive — the mechanism that "
"was still a moment ago starts to tremble, its hinges creak, and the golem "
"begins to move...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그 말을 마치자 무쇠 골렘이 살아납니다. 장치는 떨리며 작동하기 시작했고 기계음이 들리자 골렘이 움직이기 시작합니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "a7ea89ee-7b82-4a74-b69e-903d62b05ad5"
msgid "\"We've met in a tomb, in Dunsward.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 던스워드의 무덤에서 만났었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "088d03fa-1ea4-4cb5-896b-73d30c64a3b2"
msgid "\"I need answers.\""
msgstr "\"나는 답변을 원해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ca473372-5304-4ebc-b184-d34e830c866c"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "7a36e66e-bd62-4620-ae7d-23d1f912c8bf"
msgid "\"I have more questions.\""
msgstr "\"질문이 더 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "1974f084-4bbc-4838-91c3-a2fc6fbbdedf"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "545db4f8-cf67-4c31-9782-5d792c2a535e"
msgid "\"Whom do you serve?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구를 섬기지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "1b53aa38-3d83-4357-8963-2bc58035ce8c"
msgid "\"What are you trying to achieve?\""
msgstr "\"네 목적은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "c4db007a-9d52-4b10-bcc6-615369d484a0"
msgid "\"So, I was one of her toys from the beginning?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 나는 처음부터 그녀의 장난감이었던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "0f5d9c23-1360-467d-9e2a-2b96a94233fb"
msgid "\"Is there a way to free you?\""
msgstr "\"너를 자유롭게 할 방법이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "dc4343e9-9050-49f5-a982-6c0e1d07fd83"
msgid ""
"\"I'll take your blessing. Thank you. Your sacrifice will not be forgotten.\""
msgstr "\"네 축복은 고맙게 받지. 네 희생은 잊혀지지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "580451f7-18e4-4cb3-a687-6485948d71ad"
msgid "\"You don't have to sacrifice your life for me.\""
msgstr "\"네 목숨을 희생할 필요는 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "91b4671e-fe70-4038-ad1e-bf7b93d1f1b4"
msgid "\"Thank you for answering my questions.\""
msgstr "\"질문에 대답해주어 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "375cbd2b-00b8-46a0-be04-3fe3c0861203"
msgid "\"What did she do to Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 트리스티안에게 무슨 짓을 한 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "355b03b2-436f-43cd-aeca-f47b3c6d0b45"
msgid "\"What is her curse?\""
msgstr "\"그녀의 저주는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "8f3b325e-3647-4fa5-9b3b-f0f6e7a30f87"
msgid "\"So why did she send you?\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 왜 너를 보냈지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0058_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9db36413-541a-4138-8d12-fe7b1988fd96"
msgid "Persuaded the Sister to hide in the magical underground prison."
msgstr "그녀에게 지하에 있는 마법 감옥에 숨으라고 설득했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "7f1f8e40-84f3-40ab-95b7-87d7bab1f4ed"
msgid ""
"\"I've a better idea. Use this spell on yourself. It is a faint hope, but a "
"hope nevertheless. A day shall come when her curse dissolves, then you will "
"be free.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이 있어. 이 마법을 써. 성공할 수 있을지는 모르겠지만. 그녀의 저주가 끝나는 날 너는 자유가 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "c508e0a7-6036-4969-b50a-b4ded91c0edc"
msgid "\"Why won't you target this spell against the one who enslaved you?\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 왜 너를 노예로 만든 자들에게 이 마법을 쓰지 않은 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0062_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c5cf3e05-5386-4408-871b-fb456f63a80b"
msgid "Attempted to take the stone along with the Sister's finger."
msgstr "자매에게서 돌을 가져가려고 시도했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "916901d9-c7c8-4b44-9df6-ec92744cc95b"
msgid ""
"\"This stone is a powerful weapon, you'd better give it to me. If it comes "
"with your finger, so be it.\""
msgstr "\"이 돌은 강력한 무기니 나에게 주는 게 좋을걸. 네가 가지고 있겠다면 상관 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "a3f40f94-3277-4670-8eb6-e27b7d1b3c12"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2b14e8af-11e9-49a6-84eb-2fd5bc848baf"
msgid ""
"{n}A slim figure clad in grey cloak is nestled in the shadows. Through the "
"holes in the veil that covers her face, eyes stare out at you — sharp green, "
"like emeralds.{/n} \"You have found this place... I knew you'd come. I was "
"afraid to meet you here, yet still hoped you would come.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}회색 망토를 걸친 날씬한 인물이 어두운 그림자 속에 있습니다. 가려져있는 그녀의 얼굴에서 에메랄드처럼 빛나는 초록 눈은 당신을 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"나를 찾아왔군... 네가 올 줄 알았지. 너를 여기서 보지 않기를 바랬지만 그래도 네가 오기를 기대했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "f25e6c92-33c1-487c-92be-fb0f10a75c56"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. {d|c31 Good Sister}Your words{/d} made me remember who I once used to "
"be. They gave me hope — no matter how false, no matter how short-lasting — "
"that once I would be able to free myself from the service.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. {d|c31 Good Sister}네 덕분에{/d} 내가 누구였는지 기억이 나는군. 그들은 잘못되고 얼마 가지 않았을지라도 "
"희망을 주었어. 그 순간 나는 자유로울 수가 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "fc893446-9dc7-4949-bcb8-c343382ccc0b"
msgid ""
"\"Ask away. But you should know: the one I serve has put a spell on me. If I "
"try to play against her, I will die. There are some questions, answering "
"which will kill me faster than I finish talking.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물어봐. 하지만 내가 섬겼던 자가 내게 마법을 걸어놓았어. 그녀의 의지에 반한다면 나는 죽을 거야. 이 대화가 끝나기도 전에 질문을 "
"답하다가 죽을지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "dfbbbf1f-7076-46f0-8965-198aa381a79f"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! Before you leave, I'd like to help you. The spell, I am bounded "
"with, won't spare my life... But my death will be my only independent "
"decision in many ages. Please, take my blessing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"기다려! 떠나기 전에 너를 돕고 싶어. 나에게 걸린 마법으로 나는 죽겠지만... 내 죽음은 내가 할 수 있는 유일한 결정이라고 "
"생각해. 제발 나를 죽게 해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "5208cfc4-d71c-4d63-9850-2e6de7d7d616"
msgid ""
"\"Let me help you. Trust me, the life I live now isn't something worth any "
"regrets.\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 도울게. 지금의 삶은 후회가 너무 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "4484165e-63d7-45f7-afbf-90ecc1825237"
msgid "\"Ask.\""
msgstr "\"물어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "52a0c0fa-6130-4dff-8729-efddcffaae52"
msgid ""
"\"I can only guess on what she has planned. And... I'm not even sure she has "
"a plan at all. Maybe it is simply some game that lasts for thousands of "
"years, the rules beyond my comprehension. Or perhaps she does what she does "
"to amuse herself, a distraction from her own pain.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 무엇을 꾸미는지는 추측만 할 수 있어. 그리고... 그녀가 계획이 있는지조차 모르겠군. 아마도 수 천 년동안 이어져 온, 내가 "
"이해할 수 없는 규칙을 가진 놀이일 수도. 아니면 고통에서 벗어나기 위해, 혹은 그저 재미로 했을지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "8f99937b-2b0f-4a5c-a928-5d53a2c6e401"
msgid ""
"\"Century after century, she does the same thing. First, she finds within "
"her lands something she calls an 'empire'. It may be a village led by strong "
"chieftain, or outlaws that terrorizes the roads, or even caves of trolls and "
"kobolds... any center of authority in these lawless lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수 백 년동안 그녀는 항상 같은 일을 반복했지. 자신의 영토 안에 어떤 족장이나 도적 떼의 우두머리가 다스리는 마을이나 혹은 트롤과 "
"코볼트의 동굴을 제국이라고 불렀어... 이 무법지에 권력이 있는 곳이면 모두 그렇게 불렀지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "2c0c5269-90de-4283-aa8e-0d04d0960416"
msgid ""
"\"She helps this new 'empire' flourish... only so she might destroy it. "
"Lies, violence, magic, blades of her new favorites — this is her arsenal she "
"uses to destroy dreams, hopes, and the very lives of those she formerly "
"nurtured and protected.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 제국이라고 부르는 것이 번성하게 도우면 그 다음은 제국을 파괴했어. 거짓, 폭력, 마법과 검 등이 그녀가 키워주고 보호하던 "
"자들의 꿈과 희망을 파괴하는 데 사용하는 도구들이었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "b1e1fdd9-0097-45d7-bd81-08b5deb402e5"
msgid ""
"\"Yes. You've defeated the Stag Lord, Tartuk and Hargulka, dealt with "
"Vordakai… Now the time has come for her to destroy you as well.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 수사슴 군주와 타툭, 하굴카, 보다카이를 네가 물리쳤지... 이제는 그녀가 너를 없애러 올 것이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "498f2eac-e4c3-4cbb-851c-8fc29f0ac5ea"
msgid ""
"\"Our name must be the only piece of truth among all our lies. We really are "
"sisters — the nymphs from the {g|First World}First World{/g}, bounded by "
"blood with the one, who turned the ties of our blood into shackles. We truly "
"are defaced — when she shared her curse with us, she deprived us of our "
"freedom, our names, and our beauty.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 이름은 수많은 거짓들 중에서 오직 진실이 될 것이야. 우리는 진실로 피를 나눈 자매들이다. {g|First World}태초 "
"세계{/g}에서 온 님프이며, 피로 맺은 연결을 족쇄로 바꾸었지. 우리는 진실로 얼굴이 없다. 그녀가 우리와 함께 저주를 나눴을 때, "
"우리의 자유, 이름, 그리고 아름다움을 가져갔기 때문이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "05f0bf43-4c0f-4d09-85ad-0f1cc27fd3de"
msgid ""
"\"I doubt that. To do it, I'd need a mage stronger than she — or a cleric, "
"who would be able to ask their deity for a true miracle. My shackles are "
"solid. I'll be free from the curse only the day when she herself is freed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄. 나는 그녀보다 강력한 마법사나 혹은 자신의 여신에게 진정한 기적을 기도할 수 있는 성직자를 원했지. 내 족쇄는 강력한 "
"것이었으니까. 그녀가 자유로워지는 날 나는 저주로부터 풀려날 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "4fbfe8f8-3933-4d0a-ba68-d89ebf14ac18"
msgid ""
"\"Once she was our sister... the most powerful, the most beautiful of the "
"nymphs of the {g|First World}First World{/g}. Then she was cursed and "
"banished — I know not why. We followed her into exile, hoping to give "
"comfort... but she changed. As cheerful, wise, and gentle she had been back "
"home, she became arrogant, wicked, and cruel in these mortal lands. You can "
"see for yourself what she's done to us — but it is not the worst thing she "
"has done, believe my words.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 온 님프 중 가장 강력하고 아름다운 존재였다. 그리고 그녀는 저주를 받아 "
"사라졌지. 이유는 모르겠다. 우리는 안식을 바라며 그녀를 따라 도망쳤지만... 그녀는 결국 변했어. 필멸자들의 세계로 온 뒤, 쾌활하고, "
"지혜롭고, 상냥했던 그녀는 오만하고, 사악하고, 잔인한 존재가 되었지. 그녀가 우리에게 한 짓도 그렇지만, 그것보다 더 사악한 일을 "
"저지르기도 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "9439cab1-f5cc-46e8-a5af-af0c3656e61a"
msgid ""
"{n}The Sister raises her hand and starts to cast a spell. With every word "
"her voice becomes weaker, her fingers tremble, but she persists. After the "
"last word of the spell is spoken, the Sister collapses, dead.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}자매는 손을 들어 마법을 외우기 시작합니다. 주문을 외우면서 그녀의 목소리는 약해지고 손가락은 떨리지만 그녀는 견딥니다. 주문의 "
"마지막 단어를 외웠을 때 그녀는 쓰러져 죽었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "8198443f-04ae-4506-b068-df019b76ef50"
msgid "\"I am glad I can do something for you.\""
msgstr "\"내가 뭐라도 할 수 있어 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "0493be28-13bb-4fa6-9158-c2696982dbda"
msgid ""
"\"He's like us — our stepbrother in misery. You must know already he's not a "
"regular man. He is a child of Higher Planes, {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae's{/g} "
"deva, who fell into my sister's trap and was forced to serve her. His task "
"was to aid your ascension — and your fall. But his will was strong enough to "
"fight her commands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 우리와 비슷하다 — 절망에 빠진 의붓형제이니. 그가 평범한 사람이 아닌 건 알고 있을 테지. 그는 더 높은 차원의 자손으로, 내 "
"자매의 덫에 걸려 억지로 그녀를 받들게 된 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 데바다. 그의 임무는 네가 왕좌에 오르기를 돕는 것, "
"또한 너의 몰락이다. 하지만 그의 의지는 강하기에 나이리사의 명령에 저항할 수 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "779b08c0-5afd-4dbf-ac1a-e59e07c01372"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you to forgive his betrayal. There is no hope left for me, but he… "
"everything is not lost for him. Not yet.\""
msgstr "\"그의 배신을 용서해줘. 나에게 희망은 없지만 그는... 그가 모든 것을 잘못한 건 아니야. 아직은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "6e10b962-f56f-4168-833b-91623590fd92"
msgid ""
"\"All I know she eagerly shares it with the others. A canopy of curses looms "
"over the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} — a web so dense, that sometimes a "
"single careless word, spoken in anger is enough to tap into its energies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 아는 것은 그녀가 다른 자들과 나눴다는 거지. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 드리운 어둠은 너무나 깊어서, "
"가끔 부주의한 말 한마디만으로도 영향을 받고는 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "4be4a411-abe3-4ffa-ada1-a4debf1cff83"
msgid ""
"{n}A weak sigh comes from under the veil.{/n} \"My life is over now. Do you "
"really think that the one I serve hasn't learned of my betrayal? If she "
"didn't want us to meet, this encounter wouldn't have happened. The only "
"freedom that remains is the freedom to choose my own death. I do not wish to "
"die by her hand, and I won't do what she's sent me to do.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}베일 속에서 약한 한숨 소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"내 생명은 여기서 끝이야. 나이리사가 나의 배신을 보고도 아무 준비도 하지 "
"않았을까? 그녀가 우리를 만나기를 원하지 않다면 이 만남은 이뤄지지 않을 거야. 내게 남은 유일한 자유는 죽을 자유가 되었지. 그녀의 "
"손에 죽지도 않을 거고 그녀의 명령도 따르지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "28999e71-c325-4cdd-9849-07527065fb60"
msgid ""
"{n}The Sister raises her hand. Instead of a fingernail, a bright tourmaline "
"lies embedded in her finger tip, encrusted with caked blood.{/n} \"This "
"stone holds a powerful spell of Imprisonment. A touch, a single secret word —"
" and you'll disappear underground, outside time, trapped forever between "
"life and death. But I'd rather die than curse you so.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 손을 듭니다. 손톱에 있어야 할 자리에는 굳은 피가 묻어있었고 돌이 쥐어져 있습니다.{/n} \"이 돌은 구속의 힘이 담긴 "
"돌이야. 주문 한마디면 시간도 존재하지 않는 삶과 죽음의 사이에서 영원히 갇히게 되지. 나는 너를 저주하지 않고 죽음을 택하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "f8005a27-b84a-4e29-b519-632caa73b8bd"
msgid ""
"\"But… By the {g|Green Mother}Green Mother{/g}, you're right! She won't find "
"me underground. Thousands of years shall pass before her curse dissolves. It "
"may never happen. But still... It's hope. Thank you. And — farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만... {g|Green Mother}초록의 어머니{/g}시여, 네가 맞군! 그녀는 감옥에서 나를 찾지 않겠지. 그녀의 저주는 수 "
"천 년동안 이어질 거야. 끔찍한 일이지. 하지만... 희망은 있어. 고마워. 그리고 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "a053699c-16a2-45ff-be30-14f4ca83618c"
msgid ""
"{n}After giving you one last emerald glance, the Sister shuts her eyes, "
"whispers the secret word and presses the jewel against her chest. For a "
"moment she is still, then disappears into the ground without a trace.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신을 한번 보고는 그녀는 눈을 감고 알 수 없는 주문을 외우고 보석을 가슴에 놓습니다. 잠시 후 그녀는 흔적도 없이 "
"사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "21823498-1e1c-4111-8ce5-9c98fdc2a890"
msgid ""
"\"I thought about that. But… this is all just idle dreams. She'll know my "
"intentions long before I build up my courage, and she'll kill me before I "
"come anywhere near her.\""
msgstr "\"생각해 봤어. 하지만... 모두 헛된 꿈이야. 그녀는 내가 마음 먹기도 전에 알아차리고는 나를 죽일 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "ea4a6c91-f1ce-4ebf-9091-dfe4e289e1a0"
msgid ""
"{n}The Sister recoils from you, putting her mutilated finger with the "
"glinting stone forward. She whispers hoarsely,{/n} \"Do not disappoint me.\""
msgstr "{n}그녀는 웅크리고는 빛나는 돌을 잡은 손을 뻗습니다. 그녀는 힘 없이 속삭입니다.{/n} \"나를 실망시키지 말아줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9d49dcef-72b2-48e2-89e0-8b6109bee352"
msgid ""
"\"Burial in the depths as the only way to escape a trap... Truly an amazing "
"finale. I am pleased to have been witness to the act. Perhaps one day I "
"could turn such a spell on myself in reverse, leave the world without fuss..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"땅에 묻히는 것이 덫을 피하는 유일한 지름길이라... 정말 멋진 결말이로군. 이런 모습을 지켜볼 줄은. 언젠가 내게도 이런 주문을 "
"외워 이 세상에서 흔적도 없이 사라지는 날이 오지 않을까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "02971497-5c0c-426b-9f67-0065570a9046"
msgid ""
"\"Sorry, no. A little lying or caving in to a higher power could be "
"forgiven, but stabbing your friends in the back? Not a chance!\""
msgstr "\"미안하지만 안 돼. 나보다 강한 자에게 거짓말을 하는 건 용서받을 수 있지만 친구를 배신한다고? 말도 안 되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5824c5ca-ea23-4ad1-ba36-a3326a0d9d5f"
msgid ""
"\"Tristian has a good heart! I don't believe for a moment that he seriously "
"wanted to harm us!\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안은 악하지는 않아! 그가 우리를 해치려 한다는 생각은 잠시도 한 적이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "223d0048-0920-4f3a-8519-580ede68b656"
msgid ""
"\"If Tristian was an honest spy, serving for money or ideals, I could "
"forgive him. He fooled us honestly, did his job — he's a good spy! But the "
"righteous asshole tried to play himself off as being good and pure, then "
"just turned on us when some witch told him to — then he even 'rebels' "
"against her! Ugh.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안이 돈을 받거나 신념이 있어 첩자 행위를 했다면 그를 용서할 수 있어. 그리고 우리를 속이고 임무를 완수했지. 하지만 이 "
"정의로운 멍청이는 고고한 천사로 남아있으려고 우리를 배신한 거고. 그리고는 다시 그녀에게 반기를 들었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Good_Sister/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "49df0701-b4db-40bd-9e8c-b1d2b808ff75"
msgid ""
"{n}A strong magic aura surrounds the woman's figure. It seems that the spell "
"that caused it belongs to the abjuration school of magic, and its creator is "
"a much more powerful spellcaster than the Defaced Sister herself.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}강력한 마법의 아우라가 여자의 몸을 감쌌습니다. 이 주문은 아마 업저레이션 주문 같은데, 얼굴 잃은 자매보다 위대한 마법사가 만든 "
"것인 듯했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/AbandonedKeep_PrisonKey_m_DisplayNameText_String
msgctxt "7cc95acb-1690-44c5-8927-698614a47a91"
msgid "Prison Key"
msgstr "감옥의 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/Armag_Child_Book_Name_String
msgctxt "8e88cba7-9d9b-426d-b4a8-4700f0687f4a"
msgid "Torn Children's Book"
msgstr "찢어진 아이의 책"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/Armag_Child_Book_String
msgctxt "8e97bf9f-8bdc-4654-9842-dca625d07574"
msgid ""
"A thin hand-bound book, filled with bright pictures, is torn and ink-"
"stained. After you thumb through several soiled pages, you find a part you "
"still can make out:\n"
"\"K — Kellid\n"
"That's how we call barbarian heroes from the cold country.\n"
"Kellids are brave and strong.\n"
"Kellids live in Numeria.\n"
"The ruler of kellids is Kevoth-Kul, the Black Sovereign.\n"
"L — Linnorm\n"
"Linnorm is a wingless dragon.\n"
"Linnorm can't cast spells.\n"
"Linnorms live in the Lands of the Linnorm Kings.\n"
"Linnorms like gold. Linnorm has lots of treasures!\n"
"M — Mammoth\n"
"Mammoth is mighty and woolly.\n"
"Mammoths can never get cold.\n"
"Mammoths like snow and cold. Mammoths live in Numeria.\n"
"People would have had a hard time without mammoths! Mammoths give us milk "
"and meat.\n"
"N — Numeria\n"
"Numeria is a land of kellids.\n"
"In Numeria kellids are on the watch.\"\n"
"The rest of the book is unreadable."
msgstr ""
"밝은 그림으로 채워진 얇은 책은 잉크가 얼룩져있고 찢어졌습니다. 찢어진 몇페이지를 넘겨보니 읽을 수 있는 부분이 있었습니다.\n"
"\"켈리드\n"
"이것이 바바리안 영웅들의 이름이다.\n"
"켈리드는 강하고 용감하다.\n"
"그들은 누메리아에서 산다.\n"
"켈리드의 통치자는 검은 영토의 케보스쿨이다.\n"
"린놈\n"
"린놈은 날개 없는 드래곤이다.\n"
"린놈은 마법을 쓸 수 없다.\n"
"그들은 린놈 왕의 땅에 산다.\n"
"린놈은 금을 좋아하고 많은 보물을 가지고 있다.\n"
"매머드\n"
"매머드는 거대하고 털이 많다.\n"
"매머드는 추위를 타지 않는다.\n"
"그들은 눈처럼 차갑고 누메리아에서 산다.\n"
"매머드가 없었다면 사람들은 생활하기가 힘들었을 것이다. 매머드에게서 고기와 우유를 얻기 때문이다.\n"
"누메리아\n"
"누메리아는 켈리드의 땅이다.\n"
"누메리아의 켈리드들은 감시한다.\n"
"나머지 부분은 읽을 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/BookAboutArmagTomb_Name_String
msgctxt "a5144d0f-60a4-4884-ab7e-7ef5b3cc85a5"
msgid "\"Secrets of Numeria\" by Robert Armone"
msgstr "\"누메리아의 비밀\" 로버트 아모네 씀"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/BookAboutArmagTomb_String
msgctxt "c7a7fb55-add0-427c-9dbd-7df5388ed738"
msgid ""
"\"Prologue\n"
"Numeria is a stern land in northwestern Avistan, full of unsolved mysteries. "
"It's a fruitless wasteland, almost untouched by civilization, but it's not "
"without a particular somber beauty. Throughout these lands in which only the "
"strongest survive, cold rivers rush from the north to the south, veritable "
"arteries of water for several nomadic tribes, and at the northeastern "
"border, the waters of the Lake of Mists and Veils sparkle.\n"
"Numeria is encompassed by dangerous regions. Ustalav lies to the west, "
"swarming with undead; the black Worldwound lies to the north, filled with "
"demons; and the endless internal wars of the River Kingdoms seethe to the "
"east. The noble families of Brevoy and the daring defenders of Mendev would "
"give a much to be rid of their Kellid neighbors. You, dear reader, can learn "
"about these various lands and regions from other scientific works — on these "
"pages, I will teach you about Numeria. Let us begin our journey with its "
"greatest legends.\n"
"Starfall\n"
"Barbarians have lived in the territory of Numeria dating back to ancient "
"times, long before it received its name — even before the dwarves' Quest for "
"Sky. From generation to generation, the legend of Starfall has passed down "
"among the Kellids — an immense calamity that struck Golarion in the distant "
"past. Their oral traditions brought us vivid descriptions of this "
"catastrophe. One night, a huge flaming ball appeared in the sky, radiating "
"waves of heat as it plummeted toward the ground. On the way, it split into "
"many fragments that fell across various areas of Numeria, wreaking terror "
"and destruction. The largest fragment that fell kicked up a huge cloud of "
"dust and dirt when it hit. Once the cloud settled, the surviving nomads saw "
"a huge, strange mountain in the impact zone. A city later grew near it, "
"eventually becoming the country's capital. It was named Starfall in "
"commemoration the legendary event. The Silver Mountain itself became sacred "
"to the Kellids, and to this day scientists and explorers are entranced by "
"the mystery of its origin, not to mention the secrets stored inside.\n"
"The Great Warlord Armag\n"
"Among the ancient Kellid barbarians, there lived a warlord named Armag, "
"unmatched in battle. A huge tribe known as the Tiger Lords followed him, "
"defeating any enemies the encountered along their way. Like a ruthless force "
"of nature, this horde crossed Numeria, bringing war to the south and the "
"east in regions such as Rostland and Iobaria. The power and valor of Armag "
"were so great that mighty Gorum, the god of war himself, bestowed the hero "
"with his attention and benevolence. But the pride of the great warlord "
"failed him: blinded by victories, Armag said he would live forever and death "
"itself had no power over him. The boast reached Pharasma, the goddess of "
"birth and death, who deemed it an insult. She sent her servants to help "
"Armag's mortal adversaries accomplish a single goal — kill the impudent man "
"and send his soul to Pharasma's Boneyard. Becoming a pawn in the feud "
"between Gorum and Pharasma, Armag fought to his last drop of blood, but he "
"fell while battling a great red dragon. His soul still didn't go to the "
"Boneyard, however — Gorum took it and fused it into Armag's own sword. That "
"is how Armag's boast came true: his soul never left this world, and the fame "
"of his victories endured throughout the ages, making the Tiger Lord's name "
"immortal.\n"
"Armag, defeated only by the goddess Pharasma, plays a special role in the "
"myths of Numerian barbarians. According to legends, Armag's sword has great "
"power, and he who finds it will bring the world to its knees. Not only "
"Numerian priests, but historians from all over the world argue over exactly "
"where his remains and his soul, trapped in steel, rest. According to stories "
"and research, Armag's tomb is hidden somewhere in Numeria or the adjacent "
"lands — an unassailable crypt guarded not only by barbarians, but by myriad "
"traps and even immortal guardians placed there by Gorum himself. The tomb "
"has been sought by many honored scientists, such as Curtis Corvarraum and "
"Tonahold Arintan, but their findings didn't provide any exact locations. "
"Ancient chronicles describe a place between two dried rivers; the Silver "
"Mount and the bed of the Sellen River are named among possible matching "
"locations.\n"
"You can learn more about these famous explorers' expeditions and where they "
"think the grave is hidden in the extensive and comprehensive works of "
"Corvarraum, Arintan, and their colleagues — \"The Legend of Armag,\" \"Lost "
"Artifacts of Avistan,\" and \"The History of Numerian Barbarian Tribes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"프롤로그\n"
"누메리아는 아비스탄 북서쪽에 위치한 황량한 땅이고 풀리지 않은 비밀로 가득하다. 그곳은 수확도 할 수 없는 땅이고 문명의 손길도 닿지 "
"않았지만 매력있는 곳이다. 이 땅은 강한 자가 살아남는 곳이고 차가운 강이 북쪽에서 남쪽으로 흐르고 있어 몇 유목 민족에게 필요하다. "
"북쪽 국경에는 안개와 베일 호수가 있다.\n"
"누메리아는 위험한 영역과 이웃하고 있다. 서쪽에는 언데드가 우글거리는 우스탈라브가 북쪽에는 데몬이 가득한 검은 세계의 상처 지역이, "
"그리고 동쪽에는 내전이 끊이지 않는 강의 왕국들이 있다. 브레보이의 귀족과 멘데브의 수호자들은 켈리드를 없애려고 많은 노력을 했다. 이 "
"책을 읽고 있는 당신도 다양한 영토에 대해서 정보를 얻을 수 있을 것이다. 나는 누메리아에 대해 알려주겠다. 위대한 전설에 대한 "
"여행으로부터 시작하자.\n"
"스타폴\n"
"야만인은 고대에서부터 누메리아 지역에 살았고 드워프의 하늘 탐험 이전에도 살았다. 세대에 걸쳐 스타폴의 전설은 켈리드에게 전해졌다. 그 "
"내용은 먼 과거에 골라리온에 큰 재앙이 내려졌다는 내용이다. 어느 날 밤 거대한 화염구가 하늘에서 나타났고 물결치는 열이 땅으로 "
"쏟아졌다고 한다. 그 도중 불은 여러 개로 나뉘어졌고 누메리아의 여러 지역에 쏟아졌고 공포와 파괴를 일으켰다. 가장 큰 조각이 떨어져 "
"거대한 먼지 구름을 일으켰다. 그 구름이 가라앉고 살아남은 유목민은 거대하고 이상한 산이 분화구 중심에 있는 것을 보았다. 그 후 그 "
"주변에 도시가 세워졌고 마침내 국가의 수도가 되었다. 도시의 이름은 전설을 기리기 위해 스타폴이 되었다. 실버 마운틴은 켈리드에게 신성한 "
"지역이 되었고 오늘 날 비밀을 파헤치는 과학자들과 탐험가들에게는 불덩이에 관한 미스터리의 입구가 되었다.\n"
"위대한 전쟁 군주 아르막\n"
"고대 켈리드 야만인 중에서 아르막이라고 하는 무적의 전쟁 군주가 있었다. 타이거 로드라고 불리는 큰 부족은 그를 따랐고 그들의 길을 막는 "
"적들을 물리쳤다. 강력한 힘을 가진 이 무리는 누메리아를 통과해 남쪽의 로스틀랜드와 동쪽의 이오바리아에 전쟁을 일으켰다. 아르막의 용맹과 "
"힘은 위대해서 전쟁의 신 고룸은 그를 영웅으로 인정했다. 하지만 위대한 전쟁 군주의 자존심 때문에 그는 패배했다. 승리에 눈이 멀어 "
"아르막은 죽지 않고 영원히 살 것이라고 자랑했다. 그 말이 파라즈마의 귀에 들어갔다. 생명과 죽음의 여신인 그녀는 부하를 보내 그를 "
"죽이고 그의 영혼을뼈무덤에 가져오도록 했다. 아르막은 숨이 다 할 때까지 싸웠지만 그는 레드 드래곤과 싸울 때 죽게 되었다. 그의 영혼은 "
"뼈무덤에 가지 못했고 고룸은 그의 영혼을 아르막의 검에 불어넣었다. 그래서 아르막의 말은 실현되었다. 그의 영혼은 이 세상을 떠나지 않고 "
"그의 승리의 영광은 세대에 걸쳐 이어졌고 타이거 로드의 이름은 영원해졌다.\n"
"파라즈마에게 패배한 아르막은 누메리안 야만인 신화에서 특별한 역활을 한다. 전설에 따르면 아르막의 검은 위대한 힘을 가지고 있고 그것을 "
"가진 자에게 세계를 지배할 힘을 준다고 한다. 누메리안의 사제 뿐만 아니라 역사가들도 그의 영혼이 담긴 검이 어디에 있는지 찾고 있다. "
"이야기와 연구에 따르면 아르막의 무덤은 누메리아나 그곳과 인접한 어딘가에 있다고 하고 그 주위에는 야만인 뿐만 아니라 수많은 덫과 고룸이 "
"남긴 불멸의 수호자들도 있다고 한다. 무덤은 많은 커티스 코바라움이나 토나홀드 아린탄과 같은 영예로운 과학자들이 찾았지만 그들도 무덤이 "
"정확히 어디인지 밝혀내지 못했다. 고대 연대기에 따르면 말라버린 두 강 사이에 있다고 했고 실버마운틴과 셀렌 강 바닥이 가능성이 있는 "
"지역으로 여겨진다.\n"
"이 유명한 탐험가들의 여행과 \"아르막의 전설\" \"아비스탄의 잃어버린 유물\" 그리고 \"누메리안 야만 부족의 역사\"와 같은 "
"서적들을 읽으며 무덤이 어디에 숨겨졌는지 함께 고민해 보길 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/MageNote_Name_String
msgctxt "bf871c90-71fb-4c5d-8156-2392a93e35d3"
msgid "Message for Guard Captain"
msgstr "경비 대장의 메시지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/MageNote_String
msgctxt "844d65a6-9c16-4b78-9254-d15d8957adcc"
msgid ""
"\"I have checked and reinforced all the protective spells I could. They may "
"not be not enough. I remind you again that the criminal is cunning and very "
"strong. I recommend changing the guards every six hours. Wardens should "
"receive a thorough briefing, including recommendations on maintaining the "
"magic barriers, and they should be well-rested and ready for anything. In "
"the case of the prisoner's apparent death, they must remain vigilant: even "
"after death, this creature can find a new incarnation and continue to bring "
"evil into the world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가능한 모든 보호 마법을 보완했네. 그걸로 충분하지 않을 거야. 그 범죄자는 교활하고 강한 놈이니까. 6시간마다 경비를 교체하는 것이 "
"좋을 거야. 경비 대장은 브리핑을 받고 마법 방어막을 유지하며 어떤 사태에서도 준비될 수 있게 잘 쉬어야 할 거야. 죄수가 죽어도 "
"경계해야 할 거야. 이 생명체는 다시 살아날 기회를 찾으며 세상에 악을 가져올 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/NoteWithOrders_Name_String
msgctxt "ac26d607-4da6-4291-a803-4a4047b0bef2"
msgid "Note with Orders"
msgstr "명령장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/Items/NoteWithOrders_String
msgctxt "6d314d12-eb7d-41ab-a61b-6b69c5a3e240"
msgid ""
"\"Clarify situation with supplies, report at 9 o'clock.\n"
"Check on sick prisoner. If symptoms grow worse, come find me and the prison "
"healer.\n"
"At midnight change the guard at forbidden cell. ATTENTION: changing of the "
"guard should be conducted in the presence of additional wardens. Under no "
"circumstances is the prisoner to be unsupervised.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보급품을 정리하고 9시에 보고하라.\n"
"아픈 죄수가 있는지 확인해라. 증상이 악화된다면 나에게 알리고 치료사에게 가라.\n"
"자정에는 독방의 간수를 교대해라. 교대를 할 때에는 경비 대장이 한명 더 있어야 한다. 어떤 상황에서도 죄수를 감시해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "9a728458-8087-4b1f-b0cf-33501bde0a43"
msgid "We hurried to explore the bookshelves."
msgstr "우리는 서둘러 책장을 뒤졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "4705f59b-e110-4c19-82c9-f4f0369b87cf"
msgid "The dusty table by the far wall didn't escape our notice."
msgstr "두껍게 먼지가 쌓인 테이블은 우리의 시선을 사로잡았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "f1e00245-f7ae-423c-a7a6-5a43dd507a39"
msgid ""
"It was impossible to ignore the piles of papers, scrolls, and files on top "
"of the bookcases."
msgstr "종이와 스크롤과 책이 쌓여있는 모습을 지나치기란 불가능했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "ea662fba-a5d7-46bc-b388-9157be5b8473"
msgid ""
"Having decided not to bother the ghosts of the past any more, we left the "
"ancient tomes alone and returned to the library."
msgstr "과거의 유령을 괴롭히지 않기로 하고 우리는 고대의 책을 남겨두고 도서관으로 되돌아갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "554d1e57-d89f-447c-b327-28c23d13dc89"
msgid ""
"Behind the mysterious door (that opened with a loud and creepy groan) there "
"was a dark room, far less spacious than the main hall. Along the walls there "
"stood densely-packed bookshelves filled with musty tomes, and frail scrolls, "
"and centuries upon centuries of dust."
msgstr ""
"크고 기괴한 신음 소리를 내는 비밀스러운 문 뒤에는 어두운 방이 있었고 아주 작았습니다. 벽에는 책장에 먼지 쌓인 책과 부서질 것 같은 "
"스크롤이 수백년에 걸쳐 쌓인 먼지와 함께 빼곡히 꽂혀있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "a520ada3-a620-4445-8028-c81853667fb7"
msgid ""
"Whoever was that ominous medusa who encountered us in the library, neither "
"she nor any other ruin-dwellers ever had gotten to this corner. We got an "
"opportunity to be the first people in many years to peruse these bookcases!"
msgstr ""
"이 도서관에서 마주친 메두사가 누구였든지 이 구석에는 누구도 오지 못했을 것입니다. 우리는 수백년 동안 묵혀진 이책들을 본 첫 사람들이 "
"되었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "3d877343-e418-4145-a4fb-1af280e807fb"
msgid ""
"The silence within the secret room was thick, almost ominous — no, in fact "
"it was really ominous! Now did our heroes dare to disturb the peace of this "
"dusty archive?"
msgstr ""
"비밀 방은 조용했고 심지어 불길했습니다. 사실 전혀 밝아보이지 않았습니다! 우리의 영웅들은 이 먼지가 쌓인 책장을 감히 뒤질 수 있을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "8d8f387c-32b6-4eb9-a417-9adf8607bd48"
msgid ""
"Seems like the ancient dwellers of this fortress tried to get rid of book-"
"moths using the same chemicals people use today for torturing — and as soon "
"as the acrid dust touched the skin, it burnt like acid! It took us several "
"minutes to wipe off the acid and return to the exploration of the bookcase — "
"more carefully this time."
msgstr ""
"이 요새에 살았던 거주자들은 오늘날 고문에 사용하는 같은 화학물질을 사용해 책벌레를 퇴치했나 봅니다. 산이 섞인 먼지가 피부에 닿았고 "
"피부가 따끔거리기 시작했습니다! 산을 지우려고 몇분을 소비했고 당신은 다시 책장으로 돌아갔습니다. 이번엔 더 신중하게 행동했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "6f54ec06-3ef5-454d-a161-7de057abdc10"
msgid ""
"Ignoring the dust, we continued to explore the shelves. True heroes cannot "
"be stopped by a little dirt and grime, or even residue five times older than "
"us!"
msgstr "먼지를 무시하고 우리는 계속해서 책장을 뒤졌습니다. 진정한 영웅은 먼지 따위는 신경쓰지 않는 법입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "ea3d5864-ca5a-4b25-886f-1b650e1e3d08"
msgid ""
"The search ended with unexpected success — among the rotting books and old "
"scrolls we found a heavy tome in good condition. It described the art of "
"engineering, emblazoned with the marks of the ones who constructed this "
"fortress! It was a true guide on dwarven fortifications — an excellent "
"source of knowledge for our own projects."
msgstr ""
"탐색은 예상치 못한 성공을 거두었습니다. 썩어가는 책과 오래된 두루마리에서 우리는 상태가 좋은 두툼한 책을 발견했습니다. 이것은 공학에 "
"관한 설명을 담고 있었고 이 요새를 지었던 사람의 서명이 화려하게 쓰여있었습니다! 이것은 드워프 요새를 짓는 진정한 가이드였습니다. 우리 "
"계획에 좋은 자원이 될 지식이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "28de281e-66d0-4015-bafa-3ab98cbb3e3c"
msgid ""
"As soon as we reached for the book on the top shelf, the pile of papers, "
"disturbed by awkward hand, started to shift, then slid, faster and faster! "
"All we could do was try to avoid the paper avalanche from the heights of the "
"bookcase!"
msgstr ""
"책장에 있는 책에 손을 뻗을 때 종이가 움직이기 시작하더니 쏟아지기 시작했습니다! 우리가 할 수 있는 것은 책장에서 쏟아지는 종이들을 "
"피하는 것 뿐이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "22f222bc-010c-42c8-8122-7e7704a028bd"
msgid ""
"It seems the top shelf of the bookcase was used as a storage — the piles of "
"papers seemed to be heaped there without any thought! Carefully holding the "
"huge clumps of papers and helping each other to set them down, we managed to "
"clear the contents of the shelf and explore it more carefully."
msgstr ""
"책장은 창고이기도 한 것 같았습니다. 종잇더미가 마구 쌓여있었습니다! 종이 뭉치를 조심히 정리한 우리는 책장의 내용물을 정리하고 조심히 "
"내용물을 살폈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "01a0084c-847b-49bd-9430-224bf0b5ebc0"
msgid ""
"Even if there was something of value on the top shelf, it was not our "
"destiny to discover it — after falling from their 'pedestal', the fragile "
"tomes, scrolls, and notes had collapsed to dust."
msgstr ""
"부서지기 쉬운 책들과 두루마리와 종이들이 받침대처럼 쌓여있는 것을 치운 후에는 귀중해 보이는 것들이 있었지만 그것이 우리의 목표는 "
"아니었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "cc9d5838-16ad-4970-8efe-ce7cb03e029b"
msgid ""
"Among the rotting books, we found several spell scrolls in good condition. I "
"wonder: who could hide magic scrolls in this gloomy fortress? Alas, some "
"mysteries defy being solved!"
msgstr ""
"썩어가는 책들 중 우리는 상태가 좋은 마법 주문서를 몇개 발견했습니다. 이 음침한 요새에 누가 이런 마법 주문서를 숨겼을까요? 이런 "
"비밀들은 쉽게 밝혀지지 않지요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "3aca88ec-7e1d-4ea9-bd25-926c74f335fa"
msgid ""
"After we were done with the makeshift 'storage', we went back to exploring "
"the secret room."
msgstr "이 창고와 같은 책더미들을 본 후 우리는 비밀 방을 더 찾으러 갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "4087030a-a36d-4bfb-ba69-6d3be1b88736"
msgid ""
"We started sorting through the old books, trying to find something of use. "
"But the attempt to disturb history without incident failed: as soon as we "
"removed the first tome off the shelf, an avalanche of dust came down upon us!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 오래된 책들을 정리하며 무언가 쓸만한 것을 찾기 시작했습니다. 책장에 있는 책 한권을 치우자 먼지가 우리에게 쏟아졌습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "d524025a-d8b2-43a4-8750-9627d54f8ace"
msgid ""
"Whoever used to work at this table, they weren't neat — the wooden desk was "
"buried under piles of papers, scrolls, and notes. Some of them crumbled into "
"dust at a touch. Others were in better condition, but proved to be rather "
"boring and useless."
msgstr ""
"이 테이블을 누가 썼는지는 몰라도 깔끔한 사람은 아니었을 것입니다. 나무 테이블은 종이와 두루마리 더미로 쌓여있었습니다. 그들 중 몇은 "
"손을 대자 부스러졌습니다. 다른 것은 상태가 좋았지만 지루하고 쓸모없는 것이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "8bffffd9-5dd2-43d1-8296-f3df036cf100"
msgid ""
"However, under the pile of papers we found something curious — a thick "
"notebook, filled with notes in small handwriting and strange diagrams. The "
"illustrations depicted an iron golem — a huge and powerful war machine, "
"created to protect the fortress. Looks like these notes were made by the "
"creator of this mechanism!"
msgstr ""
"하지만 종이 더미 아래에서 우리는 신비한 것을 발견했습니다. 손글씨로 빼곡히 쓰고 이상한 도형들이 그려진 두꺼운 책이었습니다. 그 그림은 "
"무쇠 골렘을 묘사한 것이었습니다. 그것은 거대하고 강력한 전투 기계로 요새를 보호하기 위한 것이었습니다. 이 책은 이 기계 장치를 만든 "
"사람의 것이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "7709a521-7641-4680-9ff1-7ad276e365dc"
msgid ""
"As it turned out, someone's sleepless nights over books weren't a waste! "
"After carefully examining the notes, it became clear the dwarven master was "
"describing his mechanism in detail, with the intention to pass on these "
"instructions to others — guards, perhaps. Turned out, controlling the golem "
"was extremely easy — all you had to do was uttering the words 'KAASOR GHET!' "
"in loud voice."
msgstr ""
"밤을 새워 책을 찾는 것은 시간 낭비가 아니었습니다! 책을 살피자 드워프 장인이 자신의 기계 장치에 대한 자세한 설명을 적어놓았고 "
"경비병과 같은 사람들을 위한 글들도 발견되었습니다. 골렘을 조종하는 것은 매우 쉬웠습니다. 당신은 그저 KAASOR GHET라고 큰 "
"목소리로 외치기만 하면 되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "ac0589b8-284d-46ce-84b9-004475522554"
msgid ""
"Endless words-words-more words... someone obviously had too much time and "
"little idea of how else to spend it! We paged through the notebook, but it "
"was impossible to decipher the author's handwriting and language. However, "
"we did notice a phrase in red ink: 'KHAR GHET\". Perhaps there was some "
"special meaning to these words?"
msgstr ""
"글들이 당신의 눈에 쏟아졌습니다... 이것을 읽으려면 수 많은 시간이 필요할 것 같습니다! 우리는 책을 살폈지만 작가의 손글씨와 언어도 "
"이해하지 못했습니다. 하지만 우리는 붉은 글씨로 KHAR GHET라고 적힌 것을 발견할 수 있었습니다. 아마도 이 단어에 특별한 의미가 "
"숨겨진 것일까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "a53b25b2-b7cb-4efb-adf2-4f46d3a87468"
msgid ""
"After we shut the notebook and sorted through other papers one more time, we "
"stepped back from the table."
msgstr "책을 덮고 우리는 종이들을 정리하기 시작했고 테이블에서 한걸음 물러났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "972fef43-5907-4273-9006-f49414d04e60"
msgid ""
"After sorting through the rest of the books to make sure we didn't miss "
"anything of value, we left the bookcase alone."
msgstr "나머지 책들을 정리하고 우리는 쓸모 있는 것은 모두 찾았다고 생각하고 책장을 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "56aee900-41c6-4ad8-bb7b-6db946756180"
msgid ""
"Nothing else proved worthy of our attention. So we gave it one last nod and "
"a glance, then left the mysterious place."
msgstr "쓸 만한 것이 발견되지 않았습니다. 우리는 눈길 한번 주고는 이 비밀의 장소를 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AbandonedKeep_Interior/LibrareBE/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "e3bbbc9b-2c8b-4887-83dc-caa4ccd4481d"
msgid "Unfortunately, we couldn't find anything else worthy of our attention."
msgstr "불행히 우리는 쓸만한 것을 찾을 수 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Barks/AngryDruid_2Cutscene_String
msgctxt "fd4224ba-8aa5-4308-bdd9-cc6ec092d3a2"
msgid "\"What?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Barks/AngryDruid_Cutscene_String
msgctxt "e1381a27-435b-4284-8577-ce771dc5b4ad"
msgid ""
"\"Here's the message… I've been waiting for you for a long, long time…\""
msgstr "\"여기 메시지가 써있어... 너를 아주 오랜 시간 동안 기다렸다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Barks/Angry_Druid_String
msgctxt "edd182f6-49ca-48c0-ac4c-b24185b9d48c"
msgid "\"You've chosen a bad time to pay a visit!\""
msgstr "\"좋지 않은 때에 찾아왔군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Barks/EvilTree_Click_String
msgctxt "2627acb1-ba80-4335-a5e7-9e6fe687ba94"
msgid ""
"At first glance, this bush looks normal, but you notice the air surrounding "
"it is colder and the shadows are darker."
msgstr "겉으로 보아서 이 덤불은 평범해 보이지만 주변의 공기가 차갑고 주위가 그림자가 져있는 것이 보였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "49d0ec76-fbbf-4f18-a800-a46bbd91a9d3"
msgid "[Take the envelope off the branch]"
msgstr "[봉인을 제거합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "381e1b2f-39a9-4207-b5bc-8c4462bc7e4b"
msgid "[Try to figure out how enchanted seal works]"
msgstr "[이 마법 봉인이 어떤 마법을 담고 있는지 찾아봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "44aa5db0-4dc7-4d8e-a0dd-739ac971c5f0"
msgid "[Leave the envelope alone]"
msgstr "[이 봉인을 두고 떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "2ee6f692-8512-428d-9e05-39600f818051"
msgid "[Carefully remove the seal without touching the envelope]"
msgstr "[조심스럽게 봉인을 제거합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "2108c254-9fb6-4c5f-a410-f4965818c16a"
msgid "[Detect Magic] [Check the envelope for enchantments]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법][봉인에 걸린 마법을 확인합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b1aae085-3fc9-4694-ad0f-f13e2d2ccc2e"
msgid "[Examine the envelope closely]"
msgstr "[봉인을 가까이서 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "9266678f-ceb0-4599-975e-23b56d00e5a2"
msgid ""
"{n}As you search, you notice an envelope inside the bush. It is hanging from "
"a branch by a fine chain that runs through the envelope's black wax seal. "
"The seal is in a shape of a skull, and the chain runs through its eye "
"sockets.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}조사를 한 후 당신은 덤불 안에 봉인이 있는 것을 발견했습니다. 가지에 쇠사슬이 걸려있었고 가운데에는 검은 왁스로 덮인 봉인이 "
"있었습니다. 이 봉인은 해골처럼 생겼고 눈 구멍을 사슬이 통과했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "92b99dd9-96e5-480a-a747-322aa73c565a"
msgid ""
"{n}The seal itself is enchanted, and will react on any attempts to either "
"dispel the enchantment or break the seal. If the envelope is touched by "
"anyone other than the designated recipient, it will crumble to dust. "
"However, if you remove the seal without touching the envelope...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 봉인은 마법이 걸려있었고 해제 마법에 반응하게 되어있습니다. 누군가 봉인을 건들면 안에 든 것은 먼지가 될 것입니다. 하지만 "
"당신은 봉인을 조심스럽게 제거할 수 있었습니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "9d5f6473-0535-4035-a926-a50bea1ce351"
msgid "{n}You're unable to decipher how the enchanted seal works.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 봉인이 어떻게 작동하는지 알아내지 못했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "dda4fa82-5f36-474e-ac6f-3231c8b0b338"
msgid ""
"{n}As soon as you touch the envelope, cracks begin to spread across its "
"surface with a faint crackling noise, spreading from the seal outwards. The "
"envelope turns black and disintegrates in your hands. Moments later, all "
"that remains of the letter is a tiny scrap in your hands.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}봉인을 건들자 표면에 균열이 생겼고 희미하게 갈라지는 소리가 들렸습니다. 봉인은 검게 변하더니 당신의 손 안에서 부수어진 채로 "
"남았습니다. 잠시 후 봉인의 잔해는 얇은 조각 뿐이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "c684afef-7304-480f-87a8-8093cffd24bd"
msgid ""
"{n}After some time and with the help of simple tools at hand, you manage to "
"remove the seal. The envelop darkens, and its lower half disintegrates with "
"a low rustling sound, but you manage to preserve three quarters of the "
"letter.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}간단한 도구를 쓰고 난 후 당신은 봉인을 제거했습니다. 봉인이 어두워지더니 소리를 내며 부서졌지만 당신은 편지를 얻었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "62b2807e-8768-4bc7-a84a-a361dbf2f401"
msgid ""
"{n}An ominous seal on the envelope bears the traces of magical influence.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}불길해 보이는 봉인은 마법을 담고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Cue_0016_Text_1
msgctxt "919529db-5f7a-4159-86a3-b9c119e4c34d"
msgid ""
"{n}Taking a closer look, you realize the seal isn't simply black — it seems "
"to absorb the light. There are faint dark circles inscribed on the envelope "
"around the seal.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}자세히 보니 봉인은 그저 단순한 검은색이 아니었습니다. 이것은 빛을 흡수했습니다. 희미한 검은 원이 장식되어있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Dialog/Cue_0017_Text_1
msgctxt "40bdc2de-327e-416e-ae7b-00ff2b5c1834"
msgid ""
"{n}An envelope swings lightly with the wind. The skull on the seal "
"indifferently looks up at the sky.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}봉인이 흔들립니다. 표면의 해골은 무관심한 듯 하늘을 바라보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Items/Long_Letter_Description_String
msgctxt "ea7ada43-0ca3-462e-bad3-4ef72883e79f"
msgid "Mysterious Letter"
msgstr "신비한 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Items/Long_Letter_String
msgctxt "53a7e98c-dc10-45f9-8b1c-b0fb660442b1"
msgid ""
"\"Fronidius,\n"
"Your craftsmanship is improving, and your zeal has not gone unnoticed in "
"Nidal. We are pleased by your success, and this means Zon-Kuthon is pleased "
"as well. The Umbral Court requires a new agent in the Stolen Lands. By "
"Eloander's insistence, the circle of druids recommended you. Be proud, for "
"this is a great honor — but it must yield results, for if you don't glorify "
"the Midnight Lord with your deeds, you will exalt him with your death as you "
"writhe on the rack.\n"
"You are tasked with observing the barony, ruled by {name}. Though young the "
"state of {mf|his|hers} may seem, it is significant in that it has survived "
"so long... especially when measured against the countless other kingdoms "
"that sought to rise in the Stolen Lands and now lie in ruin. This barony's "
"persistence has attracted attention of many in Avistan, and Nidal cannot "
"afford to lag behind its rivals.\n"
"The {mf|Baron's|Baroness'} court is still too small to infiltrate without "
"risk of exposure. Instead, watch from a distance and pass along any "
"information you can about events within the barony's borders.\n"
"Your second objective is the search for an artifact, created by fey magic in "
"times before memories. The Umbral Court has been searching for it for a long "
"time, and our... \""
msgstr ""
"\"프로니디우스,\n"
"네 솜씨는 점점 나아지고 있고, 네 열정은 니달에서 주목받는구나. 우리는 네 성공에 만족하고 있으며, 존 쿠손께서도 기뻐할 것이다. "
"그림자 궁정은 도둑맞은 땅에 새로운 자가 필요하다. 엘론더의 말에 따르면 드루이드 회의에서 너를 추천했다는군. 이것은 엄청난 영광이니 "
"자랑스러워 하거라. 그러나 반드시 결실을 거둬야만 할 것이다. 밤의 제왕을 영예롭게 하지 못한다면 너는 형틀에 묶여 죽음으로 그를 기쁘게 "
"해야 할테니.\n"
"너는 {name}이 통치하는 남작령을 관찰하는 임무를 받았다. 그 녀석의 영토는 오래된 것이 아니고 그리 오래가지 못할 거라 "
"생각된다... 도둑맞은 땅에서 생겨나고 폐허가 된 수 많은 왕국들과 비교해 보면 더더욱 그렇다. 이 남작령이 살아남았기 때문에 아비스탄의 "
"많은 자들이 관심을 가지기 시작했으니, 니달 또한 경쟁자들에게 뒤쳐지면 안될 것이야.\n"
"{mf|남작|여남작}의 궁전은 여전히 작기 때문에 들킬 위험을 감수하지 않고는 침입할 수 없다. 그러니, 거리를 유지한 채 남작령 내에서 "
"일어나는 사건들에 대해 빠짐없이 보고하도록.\n"
"네 두번째 목표는 오래 전 페이 마법으로 만들어진 유물을 찾는 것이다. 그림자 궁정은 그것을 오랫동안 찾아왔고, 우리는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Items/Short_Letter_Description_String
msgctxt "1ac31cc5-efca-4298-a06d-034af9ef045e"
msgid "Fragment of a Mysterious Letter"
msgstr "신비한 편지의 조각"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/AngryDruidLair/Items/Short_Letter_String
msgctxt "b57a9ca1-9d00-4eb6-8f7d-6d5a08f21cde"
msgid ""
"\" …your zeal has not gone unnoticed in Nidal. We are pleased by your "
"success, and this means Zon-Kuthon is pleased as well. The Umbral Court "
"requires a new agent in the Stolen Lands. By Eloander's insistence, the "
"circle of druids recommended... \""
msgstr ""
"\"...네 열정은 니달에서 주목받는구나. 우리는 네 성공에 만족하고 있으며, 존 쿠손께서도 기뻐할 것이다. 그림자 궁정은 도둑맞은 땅에 "
"새로운 자가 필요하다. 엘론더의 말에 따르면 드루이드 회의에서 너를...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Armag/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Armag
msgctxt "ac8352a6-5ea8-4aae-88e4-67447c92bba5"
msgid ""
"{n}The great chieftain's tomb reeks of death. Not the ancient death of the "
"chieftain himself, but recent death — dismembered bodies are scattered "
"around the room, the blood staining and pooling on the floor. You barely "
"even recognize the remains as human — they were once members of the {g|Tiger "
"Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}, the barbarians who followed their leader to this "
"tomb, only to fall by his hand. Armag himself stands in the center of the "
"room, clenching a bloodstained sword. He breathes heavily, like a hunted "
"animal, his eyes wild and aimless. His voice is hoarse as he shouts at a "
"slim woman in a gray cloak in short, abrupt phrases. The woman's yellow eyes "
"are fearless as she watches the chieftain through the holes in the veil that "
"covers her face.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}위대한 족장의 무덤에서 죽음의 악취가 납니다. 족장의 죽음 때문이 아니라 방 주위에는 최근에 죽어 조각난 시체들이 흩어져있고 "
"핏자국과 피가 웅덩이를 이루었습니다. 그것이 인간의 시체인지도 알아내기 어려웠습니다. 그들은 한 때 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 "
"군주{/g}의 일원이었지만 그들의 대장에 의해 죽임을 당했습니다. 아르막은 방 한 가운데에 서서 피로 물든 검을 쥐고 있었습니다. 그는 "
"쫓기는 동물처럼 거칠게 숨을 쉬고 있었고 그의 눈빛은 거칠고 눈에는 초점이 없었습니다. 회색 망토를 입은 날씬한 여성에게 소리칠 때 그의 "
"목소리는 쉬어있었습니다. 얼굴을 감싼 베일 속에서 여성의 노란 눈은 두려움이 없었고 족장을 쳐다보고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Armag/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Armag
msgctxt "2e2ccb3f-d002-4fd1-a270-9af515fb9b75"
msgid ""
"\"Lies... Armag's entire life, a lie! Armag is not Armag! The sword says IT "
"is Armag! The sword — it calls Armag an impostor! What now? What?! What to "
"do? Who is Armag now?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말... 아르막의 삶은 거짓이다! 아르막은 아르막이 아니다! 이 검이 말한다! 아르막은 사기꾼이라고 말한다! 지금은 뭐지? "
"무엇인가?! 무엇을 해야 하는 것인가? 아르막은 이제 무엇인가?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Armag/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : ArmagsTombDefacedSister
msgctxt "c636fdbc-f8f9-4bd3-a94b-c9938f1fb8f1"
msgid ""
"\"Hush, my boy. Calm. You really are Armag — there have been no lies. But "
"your soul has slept in this sword for so long... it just doesn't recognize "
"you! It will soon, though, and everything will be all right. You know you "
"are a hero, a great chieftain — the greatest of all chieftains ever born "
"into this world. Remember that, hold to it. Great deeds await you. Soon, "
"very soon...\""
msgstr ""
"\"진정해. 너는 아르막이 맞으니. 그것은 사실이다. 하지만 네 영혼은 이 검에서 오랫동안 잠들었지... 그래서 너를 알아보지 못하는 "
"것이야. 곧 괜찮아 질 거다. 너는 영웅이자 위대한 족장이다. 이 세계에서 가장 뛰어난 족장이지. 그 사실을 기억하고 검을 쥐어라. "
"뛰어난 업적이 너를 기다리고 있다. 그 날은 멀지 않았다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Armag/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Armag
msgctxt "40067d39-17c3-417a-9b44-b1b685b9a46d"
msgid ""
"\"Stop. Lying! Armag is not even Armag anymore! Was never Armag in the first "
"place! Armag is like the eight mothers now — no name, no tribe... no "
"destiny! What's left now? What? Only REVENGE!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말은 그만! 나는 이제 아르막이 아니야! 처음부터 아르막이 아니었지. 아르막은 이제 여덟 어미와 같다. 이름도 없고, 부족도 "
"없고... 운명도 없다! 이제 무엇이 남았지? 무엇이? 오직 복수뿐이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "3428e654-fc1a-4451-b4ab-ba03fd1c66f8"
msgid "\"Stand. We need to talk.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 대화를 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "cb347a7f-9d50-45e4-a5be-477f69243bb9"
msgid "[Finish Armag off] \"This is the end.\""
msgstr "[아르막을 처치합니다] \"이제 끝이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "a7e93d88-2a27-4590-8faf-8125cac9e848"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "63c6388f-fa01-4cd4-8ebc-9783f3b4cae9"
msgid "\"Why did you kill the Sister?\""
msgstr "\"왜 얼굴 잃은 자매를 죽였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "130e1d2a-f112-47c0-9855-e1b5641bea23"
msgid "\"Why did you kill your people?\""
msgstr "\"왜 네 부하를 죽였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "fae8fb9d-c6d6-499c-8cb0-cc3977f7cc40"
msgid "\"Why did you attack Brevoy?\""
msgstr "\"왜 브레보이를 공격했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "690ed7f8-2d86-4ced-afa8-aa408d61b6a8"
msgid "\"What will you do if I let you live?\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 살려주면 무엇을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "208ac8a5-4374-41bc-bfcb-4e22163c70a6"
msgid "[Finish Armag off] \"Die.\""
msgstr "[아르막을 처치합니다] \"죽어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "bc4879b7-fad7-4080-ac40-c8b9a49b8b85"
msgid "\"Wait! Before you die, I need to ask you something...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐! 네가 죽기 전에 묻고 싶은 것이 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "2bb32ad5-6017-4733-87ba-4275dfa93e12"
msgid "[Finish Armag off] \"I'll finish you myself.\""
msgstr "[아르막을 죽입니다] \"내가 너를 직접 끝내주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "64b9914c-35c4-4847-b361-ca22ca41592f"
msgid "Encouraged Armag to fight for his own destiny."
msgstr "아르막에게 자신의 목적을 위해 싸우라고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "d3a6ff4f-a892-4ce5-bc32-8d45fbe7e691"
msgid ""
"\"That's a coward's death! You whine and complain that you're not Armag, "
"that you have no destiny — you should be thankful! The Armag of old didn't "
"have some destiny, he made it himself! And you can, too. Pull yourself "
"together, show this ancient ghost who's really a great chieftain... but do "
"it yourself, without some witch's trickery!\""
msgstr ""
"\"겁쟁이의 죽음이군! 질질 짜면서 목적도 없다고 자신이 아르막이 아니라고 하지만 감사하며 살아라!아르막은 자신의 목적이 있었다! 너도 "
"그렇게 할 수 있어. 정신 차리고 고대의 유령에게 누가 위대한 족장인지 보여줘... 하지만 속임수 없이 직접 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5179ced7-776b-4233-ac02-4246c7722022"
msgid "Encouraged Armag's heroic suicide."
msgstr "아르막에게 영웅적인 죽음을 맞으라고 부추겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "75524c40-9e40-4859-ba81-bad2591742cf"
msgid ""
"\"Do it. You may not be the real Armag, but you can still have a heroic "
"death.\""
msgstr "\"자결해. 네가 아르막이 아닐지라도 영웅적인 죽음은 맞을 수 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "5efd8ad2-d60a-407e-a711-c0f5cacd7463"
msgid "\"I want to ask you something else...\""
msgstr "\"물어보고 싶은 다른 것이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "33c8aaf3-115f-43d8-b75d-0d8d6b771d98"
msgid "Spared Armag's life."
msgstr "아르막의 목숨을 살려줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "5bb0ba71-cd4f-4767-b047-e398ed68e78c"
msgid "\"You're free. Go, make your own destiny.\""
msgstr "\"너는 자유다. 가서 네 목표를 위해 살아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "6e3b0e1b-7c75-4706-9002-7b54d8eab896"
msgid "[Finish Armag off] \"Your destiny ends here.\""
msgstr "[아르막을 죽입니다] \"네 운명은 여기서 끝이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "bd78c71b-313e-450b-8dc0-8c5f04998299"
msgid "[Fraternize with Armag] \"Brother{mf|s| and sister}.\""
msgstr "[아르막과 의형제를 맺습니다] \"너는 내 형제다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "7c0b1198-2a2e-4445-9e9e-9fe3d84c7674"
msgid "\"No need. Go, Armag. You're free.\""
msgstr "\"필요 없어. 아르막. 너는 자유야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "8b1fa6e4-ac7d-462b-8ca6-d2f9f3453b74"
msgid "\"Who are these Defaced Sisters?\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "0a7f56f4-552f-439e-a847-fa9403debf4a"
msgid ""
"{n}The exhausted barbarian falls to one knee, the blood seeping from his "
"wounds falling to stain the floor. He doesn't look at you. His gaze wanders "
"around the room until it stops on the bodies of his tribesmen.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}지친 야만인은 무릎을 꿇고 얼굴에 흐르는 피를 맛봅니다. 그는 당신을 무시합니다. 그는 방 주위를 둘러보다 부족의 시체에서 시선이 "
"멈춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "c55e48ae-81ab-4096-b700-a33ed29ddbdf"
msgid "{n}You raise your hand and deal the final blow.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 손을 들어 최후의 일격을 가했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "413357f7-8202-477a-a423-17c3306ae014"
msgid ""
"{n}With great difficulty, the barbarian regains his feet. His bloodshot eyes "
"dart about nervously, studying you from head to toe.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}가까스로 그는 일어섭니다. 충혈된 그의 눈이 당신을 머리부터 발끝까지 훑습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e16b0773-37f3-4b34-9b5d-9ba670f05826"
msgid ""
"\"Armag, the great chieftain of the past, was buried here. Armag, the great "
"chieftain of the present, was born again. He had to return here to reunite "
"with his soul, the one sleeping within the sword. To become whole again. To "
"restore his power. To reign over the land again. To challenge the gods "
"again. That's what the eight mothers told Armag. They lied. They were lying "
"all along!\""
msgstr ""
"\"과거 위대한 족장인 아르막이 여기에 묻혔다. 하지만 그는 다시 태어났다. 그는 다시 돌아와 영혼과 그의 검을 되찾아야 했다. 다시 "
"완전체가 되기 위해서였지. 힘을 되찾기 위해서. 땅을 되찾기 위해서 말이다. 신들에게 다시 도전하기 위해서였지. 그것이 여덟 어미가 "
"아르막에게 한 말이야. 그들은 거짓을 말했다. 모두 거짓말이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "7fa8a06b-fff9-4d36-95a5-4e5668b8d054"
msgid ""
"\"Armag took the sword and spoke to Armag's soul. The sword said Armag was "
"not Armag, but just an impudent brat! Ancient Armag's rage blazed like a "
"torch in the night! All that was hidden was unveiled at once — everything! "
"The eight mothers raised Armag, and since childhood, they kept saying Armag "
"was a great man with a great destiny... Lies, lies, and more lies! Armag is "
"not Armag! Armag is just a toy for eight witches! But no more. Armag's life "
"is over, but at least he dies free from all the lies!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아르막은 검을 뽑아 자신의 영혼에게 말했다. 검은 아르막을 부정했다. 아르막의 분노는 횃불처럼 타올랐다. 숨겨져왔던 분노가 한번에 "
"드러났다! 여덟 어미는 아르막을 키우면서 위대한 목표를 가진 남자가 되라고 했다... 모두 거짓말이었지. 아르막은 아르막이 아니다. 그저 "
"여덟 마녀의 장난감이었어. 하지만 이제는 아니다. 나의 삶은 거짓말로부터 자유롭고 나서야 시작될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "c508eada-3b1b-42b9-a52b-7c3dc0be80c9"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian stares at the bloodstained sword in his hand, raising the "
"shining blade to see his own reflection in its surface. His voice grows dull "
"and hoarse.{/n} \"Ancient Armag, great chieftain of the past... Invincible "
"hero, {g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} champion... He served only Gorum. Not his people, "
"no — only Gorum. When he killed, it was not to feed his people, not to gain "
"glory, not for wealth, not for power... No, it was the other way around. He "
"fed his people to make them better killers.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 피로 물든 검을 보고는 그것을 들어올려 빛에 반사시킵니다. 그의 목소리는 둔하고 거칩니다.{/n} \"과거의 위대한 족장 "
"아르막... 무적의 영웅이자 {g|Numeria}고룸{/g}의 용사... 그는 오직 고룸만을 섬겼지. 자신의 백성이 아니라 고룸만을 "
"위해서. 그가 죽임을 당할 때 그들의 백성은 영광을 얻거나 부나 힘을 얻기 위해 키워지지 않았다. 그는 백성들을 살육자로 키우려고 했지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "14283f3d-80f3-4b4b-be9f-506a417f3834"
msgid ""
"\"The blade was thirsty. It quenched its thirst on the blood of Armag's "
"fellow tribesmen. Ancient Armag was a great warrior, that much is true. But "
"he was a bad chieftain. He would send his people to their deaths for no good "
"reason. Armag wasn't a hero. Armag was a kinslayer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"검은 피에 굶주렸다. 그것은 아르막의 부족민들의 피를 맛보았다. 아르막은 위대한 전사다. 하지만 그는 훌륭한 족장은 아니었다. 그는 "
"자신의 백성을 아무 이유 없이 죽게 했다. 아르막은 영웅이 아니다. 그저 동족 살해자일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "460b1615-cdd5-4e09-a1d1-b450ccff88f2"
msgid ""
"\"The eight mothers used to say that today's Armag is a great chieftain, "
"just like ancient Armag. He would defeat anyone he wanted as soon as he "
"could find his soul. They said all he needed to do was find the tomb, then "
"he could conquer {g|Restov}Restov{/g} — conquer all of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}. "
"Just find the tomb... But did ancient Armag need some stupid tomb? No! He "
"just fought and won! If Armag was really Armag, he would be bound to win!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여덟 어미는 아르막이 위대한 족장이라고 했다. 그가 영혼을 되찾으면 누구든 이길 수 있었다. 아르막이 무덤만 찾으면 "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}뿐만 아니라 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 전부를 지배할 수 있다고 그들이 말했다. 무덤만 "
"찾으면... 하지만 아르막이 멍청한 무덤을 찾아야 하다니. 아르막은 전사다! 아르막은 싸워서 이겨야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "9063ee4c-3f67-4555-84f5-de380111ff18"
msgid ""
"\"But this Armag is not that Armag. He led his people into a trap. Realized "
"too late that he won't be able to take {g|Restov}Restov{/g}. And that's when "
"the eight mothers told him they had found the tomb. Armag entered the tomb "
"to become stronger, to save his people, to bring them glory and riches! But "
"all he found was death. Ancient Armag and present Armag have that in common."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아르막은 과거의 아르막이 아니다. 그는 사람들을 함정으로 몰았다. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}를 차지 할 수 없다는 것을 "
"깨달았을 때는 이미 늦었다. 그 때 여덟 어미가 무덤을 찾아야 한다고 말했다. 아르막은 더 강해지기 위해 백성들을 구하고 영광과 부를 "
"되찾기 위해 무덤으로 갔다! 하지만 그가 찾은 것은 죽음 뿐이었다. 과거의 아르막이나 지금의 아르막 모두 죽음만을 찾을 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0020_Text_String
msgctxt "eb9414bd-df37-413e-93c9-dbc90f7c5326"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian slowly lowers his sword.{/n} \"The soul trapped in this "
"sword... his power became his curse. But the sword's curse brought Armag "
"power, too. His rage burned away all lies, burned away false destiny. Armag "
"sees things clearly now. Armag will create his own destiny. A living soul is "
"{d|c41 Tomb InTime}stronger{/d} than any ancient dead man! The ghost in this "
"sword can whisper whatever he likes — he will never dominate Armag again!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 천천히 검을 내립니다.{/n} \"이 검에 갇힌 영혼은... 그의 힘은 저주가 되었다. 하지만 검의 저주는 아르막에게 힘도 "
"가져다 주었다. 그의 분노가 모든 거짓을 태우고 잘못된 운명을 태울 것이다. 아르막은 이제 모두 보인다. 아르막은 자신의 운명을 만들 "
"것이다. 살아있는 영혼은 고대의 죽은 그 어떤 자들보다 {d|c41 Tomb InTime}강하다{/d}! 이 검의 유령이 속삭인다. "
"하지만 아르막을 다시는 지배할 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "1923c97d-8733-4753-82ad-34a0756a995c"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian presses the tip of the sword against his broad chest.{/n} "
"\"Nothing. This sword is cursed. It {d|c41 Tomb Late}controls{/d} the hand "
"that wields it. If Armag is freed, he'll kill again, just as in the past. "
"Not for glory, not for riches — just killing for the sake of killing. This "
"cannot be. Armag must be buried in Armag's tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 칼 끝을 가슴에 대고 살짝 누릅니다.{/n} \"아무것도 없다. 이 검은 저주 받았다. 이것은 휘두르는 자를 {d|c41 "
"Tomb Late}조종한다{/d}. 아르막이 자유로워지면 그는 다시 과거처럼 살육할 것이다. 영광이나 부를 위해서가 아니라 살인을 위한 "
"살인을 말이지. 그래서는 안 된다. 아르막은 반드시 무덤에 다시 묻혀야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "84fd5e88-b944-42d4-be87-7776125ec5b4"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian lowers his sword. His eyes avoid you, wandering around the "
"room until they rest on the bodies scattered on the floor.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}야만인은 검을 내립니다. 그는 당신을 무시합니다. 그는 방 주위를 둘러보다 부족의 시체에서 시선이 멈춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "987eab08-7aa0-4f2c-a470-c54d7448fc84"
msgid ""
"{n}Armag nods to you, plunges the blade deep into his chest, and silently "
"falls to the floor.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아르막은 끄덕이고는 검을 향해 뛰어들었고 바닥에 소리 없이 쓰러집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "5579f677-ab54-4085-b23a-0ed1142b5858"
msgid "\"Ask. Armag will answer.\""
msgstr "\"물어라. 대답해 줄 것이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "f1d5c613-d192-49d0-9a49-7a823d527743"
msgid ""
"\"The one holding Armag's life in {mf|his|her} hands didn't take it. This "
"cannot be forgotten! Let us fraternize! Become sworn brother{mf|s| and "
"sister}!\" {n}Armag draws Ovinrbaane's edge across his palm, then extends "
"his bleeding hand to you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아르막의 목숨을 쥐고 있어도 목숨을 뺏지 않았다. 잊을 수가 없구나! 나와 의형제가 되지 않겠나?\" {n}아르막은 오빈르베인의 날로 "
"자신의 손바닥을 베었고, 피가 흐르는 손을 당신에게 내밀었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "c77f9d0c-715e-41ab-84d2-e149a3cafb6b"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian lowers his hand.{/n} \"Friends, then. Should we meet again, "
"Armag will not forget.\""
msgstr "{n}야만인은 손을 내립니다.{/n} \"친구여. 다시 만나세. 아르막은 잊지 않겠네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "11044955-cd0c-4745-8dec-460e7ec819a9"
msgid ""
"{n}You run your palm along the blade of the ancient sword and shake Armag's "
"hand. For the first time, he looks directly into your eyes.{/n} \"Brother"
"{mf|s| and sister}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 고대의 검날에 손바닥을 그은 뒤, 아르막과 악수합니다. 처음으로 그는 당신과 눈을 마주칩니다.{/n} \"형제"
"{mf||자매}여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "7c0c2db2-2a35-4312-a4ff-cccbb336dc94"
msgid "{n}Armag sheathes Ovinrbaane and leaves the tomb.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아르막은 오빈르베인을 집어넣고 무덤을 떠났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "60d6211f-158a-42d3-99a6-1f268ef7d39a"
msgid ""
"\"The eight mothers fed Armag, raised him, taught him everything he knows. "
"Since he was born, Armag knew no other family and no other tribe. They told "
"Armag of his great past and his even greater future... And every word was a "
"lie. Armag was just their trained dog! He jumped when told, growled, tore "
"their enemies to pieces... He had no idea for what or why he was fighting!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여덟 어미는 아르막을 길러주고 가르쳤다. 태어날 때부터 아르막은 가족이나 부족이 없다는 것을 알았다. 그들이 아르막에게 위대한 과거와 "
"앞으로 있을 위대한 미래에 대해 말해주었고... 그것은 모두 거짓이었다. 아르막은 그저 훈련된 개에 불과할 뿐이었어! 그들이 시키면 나는 "
"으르렁 거리고 적들을 조각내는 것이었지... 왜 싸워야 하는지 무엇을 위해 싸워야 하는지 몰랐던 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "57fa3cce-a1ec-4026-b64a-8b707c2f8321"
msgid ""
"\"One more thing... Once, Armag heard them talk about another Sister. The "
"one they all serve. When he asked, they lied, said there was no ninth "
"Sister, that Armag had misheard them. He should have understood then that "
"they weren't to be trusted. Those who lie once are not to be believed twice!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"하나 더... 한 때 아르막은 그들이 다른 자매에 관해 이야기하는 것을 들었다. 그들이 섬기던 여자라더군. 아르막이 물어봤을 때, "
"다른 자매는 존재하지 않으니 아르막이 잘못 들었을 거라고 거짓말했지. 그들이 거짓말을 한다는 것을 알았어야 했다. 한 번 거짓말 한 자는 "
"두 번 다시 믿을 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e6266336-c889-409b-831c-8c65ce1a2fc1"
msgid ""
"\"Be merciful to the enemy, even as cruel as this savage. Stop his suffering "
"— here and now.\""
msgstr "\"아무리 잔인하다고 해도 적에게 관대해야 해. 그의 고통을 멈추어줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b240c5b9-03ee-48f1-b66e-f0f741548477"
msgid "\"That's it.\" {n}Valerie sighs and her shoulders relax.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그게 전부군요.\" {n}발레리는 한숨을 쉬고 몸에 힘을 풉니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "a7138153-d181-42de-8dc4-4f330376e6c8"
msgid ""
"{n}The chieftain of the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} silently falls to the "
"floor beside the bodies of his tribesmen, joining the corpses of those he'd "
"slain.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}의 족장은 소리 없이 자신의 부족들 옆에 쓰러졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "b789ab6b-0b9b-4537-b831-bcf1430e2afd"
msgid ""
"\"We always only achieve death. Even presumed success in mortal matters is "
"actually just one more step toward the grave.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 항상 죽음을 추구했다. 예측된 성공조차 죽음을 위한 또 다른 단계에 불과했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "60f93076-3ca4-4b83-ae68-de4e0d091aef"
msgid ""
"\"So much blood was shed in vain, and yet compassion for this person stirred "
"in my heart. A bitter lot — treason of those you thought were your family.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무나 많은 피가 헛되이 흘려졌지만 이 자의 자백은 내 머릿속에 아직 남아있어. 가족이라고 생각했던 자들이 배신을 하다니 씁쓸하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2a13d7d9-d642-4733-b63c-3cd1a9c8681d"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri spits glumly.{/n} \"This ancient Armag was a scum, if what you say "
"is true. And some just love to venerate some dead wretch!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"그의 말이 사실이라면 이 고대의 아르막은 그저 쓰레기에 불과해. 그저 죽음만을 숭배하는 "
"멍청이였군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "7bdcf790-2f35-4ed4-aae5-541e176ed847"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I think I shed a tear from my left eye! It's all emotions! Such a "
"beautiful finale of the story, I can't wait to write it down!\""
msgstr "\"오, 눈물이 날 것 같아! 정말 감상적이야! 이토록 아름답게 끝나는 이야기라니, 어서 적어야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0c373463-03ca-43f3-9f33-1beced1a04b1"
msgid ""
"\"Turning an enemy into a friend and giving him hope... I believe "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} herself smiled at your deeds today, {name}\"."
msgstr ""
"\"적을 친구로 만들고 희망을 주다니... {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서도 당신의 선행을 보고 미소 지으실 겁니다, "
"{name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9adfffb7-499a-4384-9e8d-4f9377723bd8"
msgid ""
"\"A lie is what Nyrissa and her servants live. And I was part of that lie..."
"\" {n}Tristian's voice holds a bitter note.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사와 그녀의 종들은 거짓말쟁이였습니다. 그리고 저도 그 거짓말에 도움을 주었죠...\" {n}트리스티안의 목소리는 씁쓸하게 "
"들렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/ArmagAfter/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "663667ef-221f-464e-92ec-c33932b42811"
msgid ""
"\"The grave of the first Armag will accept the body of the second. I see a "
"special dispensation in this. They were both devoured by anger, but now both "
"are dust and peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아르막의 무덤이 두번째 시체를 받을 거야. 엄청난 분노였어. 그들은 분노에 사로잡혔지만 이제 모두 평화롭게 먼지가 되었군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a1ff7853-a5d2-48fa-94ee-605a64ebfc37"
msgid ""
"\"There wasn't even really a battle. The armies just stood staring at each "
"other for a while, then the barbarians turned to head back to Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"이건 전투도 아니었어. 이 군대는 그저 서로 노려다보고는 야만인들이 누메리아로 돌아갔지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "2aa27069-05ff-4c24-896b-a8a985bffba4"
msgid ""
"\"The barbarians defeated the Brevans, but they took heavy losses. Lacking "
"the forces to push into Restov, they turned back toward Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"야만인이 브레보이인들을 이겼지만 피해가 컸어. 레스토프로 쳐들어갈 힘이 없으니 누메리아로 돌아간 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4d74eccd-e12d-4945-a669-8ef67abe6f03"
msgid ""
"\"Rumor has it the barbarian chieftain left his men in the middle of a "
"battle, so they turned their backs on him and returned to Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"야만인 족장이 싸움 도중에 부하들을 버리고 달아났다던데 그래서 그들은 족장을 버리고 누메리아로 돌아갔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "23f3d793-1a68-41ee-9dc0-ba04e7141df9"
msgid "Lied to the barbarians about the battle on the Glenebon Uplands."
msgstr "Glenebon Uplands의 전투에 관해 야만인들에게 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6eb7cb14-00b6-47eb-aa85-5fd94c18f42e"
msgid "[Lie] \"Sorry to disappoint, but I know nothing of the battle.\""
msgstr "[거짓말] \"실망스럽겠지만 나는 전투에 관해 아는 게 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "4c10371d-e774-41c6-9b64-7ea163aa35f8"
msgid "[Attack] \"We beat back the barbarians. Let me show you how!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"우리는 야만인들을 무찔렀지. 너는 어떻게 하나 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "27b561fa-4387-48b6-b117-be0cbb244d36"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"이 장소는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "3cba23a4-3862-4f08-bdf4-685a4bf258f0"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "16a74506-f6f1-4f6b-ae5d-7e9034524d10"
msgid "\"Is it possible your chieftain's dead?\""
msgstr "\"너희 족장이 죽는 것이 가능한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "77b7bd4c-f8cd-48e4-b35d-3aec7f6d1e42"
msgid "\"Good luck to you!\""
msgstr "\"행운을 빈다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "ebcb80dc-c5f6-4925-9702-8601d4209627"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're not going anywhere.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"아무데도 가지 못할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "379513c9-74f3-4fdf-aeca-a2b9ce5140be"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you fed up with this Sister? I'd have finished her off long ago.\""
msgstr "\"그 자매들에게 질리지도 않아? 예전에 끝내버렸어야 했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "866b5043-6bf9-4b13-8a23-4f47bc8d4da4"
msgid "\"I'm going into the tomb.\""
msgstr "\"나는 무덤으로 들어갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "f3dcc42c-8209-4c38-b9f4-f7de439c05a3"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "cbca77bd-8f8a-4e82-addb-0dadd21def88"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I've learned all I needed. Now I'll deal with you once and for "
"all.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"필요한 것은 모두 알았다. 이제 너를 끝내주마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "e970da5d-8c9b-4c38-b81a-2b2d240d1ee7"
msgid ""
"\"There was a riot in the Tiger Lords' camp. The barbarians deposed their "
"chieftain and returned to Numeria.\""
msgstr "\"호랑이 부족 캠프에서 반란이 일어났다. 야만인이 족장을 버리고 누메리아로 돌아갔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "6973b00b-ed59-4a0e-85f5-079e41fdf440"
msgid "\"No matter how many you explore, there's always syca-more!\""
msgstr "\"네가 탐험을 얼마나 했든 세상은 넓어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "7f133479-7737-479b-a676-3d329a042198"
msgid ""
"\"If they come crashing down on our heads, at least the world will be saved "
"from your sense of humor.\""
msgstr "\"그들이 우리 머리를 노리러 온다면 최소한 너의 유머 감각 때문에 세상은 안전하겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "3b405d4d-9d61-44ec-adb4-2222bc6b5e63"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무것도 말하지 않는다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "c1134322-ab0c-4b03-8b07-6acfd006ecd0"
msgid ""
"{n}Some grim barbarians are sitting near the bonfire, speaking in low voices "
"and casting sidelong glances toward the tomb entrance. Noticing you, one of "
"them reaches for his weapon out of habit, but he catches himself and instead "
"pats the space on the log beside him.{/n} \"Greetings, traveler! Come, have "
"a seat! Don't suppose you've heard anything about the battle between the {g|"
"Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} and {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, have you? Who won? How "
"did it go?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}몇몇 무시무시한 야만인이 화롯불 주위에 앉아 낮은 목소리로 얘기하며 무덤 쪽을 곁눈질로 보고 있습니다. 당신을 발견하고는 한명이 "
"습관적으로 무기를 꺼내려 했지만 진정하고는 자신의 옆자리를 손바닥으로 두드립니다.{/n} \"반갑네. 여행자여! 와서 앉게! {g|"
"Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}와 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 전투에 대해 들었나? 누가 이기고 어떻게 되어 가는지 알아?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "6adf05cc-f626-47d9-9ca2-70519d665186"
msgid ""
"\"Still here? You should head out. This place is bad. If not for our orders, "
"we'd be long gone ourselves.\""
msgstr "\"아직도 여기에 있나? 어서 가. 여기는 좋은 장소는 아니야. 명령만 아니라면 우리도 도망쳤을 거라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "135fadcf-796e-49c1-af2b-4b4b3acc29cc"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian slams the log with his fist.{/n} \"Damn... I knew it!\""
msgstr "{n}야만인은 주먹으로 통나무를 내려칩니다.{/n} \"젠장... 그럴 줄 알았지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterMelee
msgctxt "15582ce2-5b98-47cb-bfd4-4968becdf9b9"
msgid ""
"\"Good riddance, I say! It was long overdue! That man was crazy, anyone "
"could see.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 속임수구나! 오래 전의 일이지! 그 자가 미쳤다는 걸 모르는 사람이 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterRanged
msgctxt "f67e843c-fe43-4006-9830-447af64248d9"
msgid ""
"\"Keep your voices down! That Sister's still strutting around over there. "
"What if she hears you?\""
msgstr "\"목소리를 낮춰! 자매가 아직 저기에 있다고. 그녀가 들으면 어쩌려고 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "7d8d028c-c38e-45df-bae0-d0442fe034d7"
msgid ""
"\"Well, no helping if you don't know. We've been sitting here out in the "
"middle of nowhere for weeks, you see, and we've been wondering what happened "
"to our tribesmen. We're also bored out of our minds.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모른다면 도움이 되지 않는군. 우리는 이런 곳에 와서 몇주 동안을 기다렸고 우리 부족에게 무슨 일이 일어났는지 궁금했지. 지루해서 "
"미칠 지경이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "5dbfe8e6-b6ea-464c-a247-5814db791ccb"
msgid ""
"\"So that's what happened... Well, maybe it's for the best. We couldn't have "
"conquered {g|Restov}Restov{/g} anyway, and this way at least we didn't lose "
"our fighters' lives figuring it out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 된 것이군... 그게 최선일지도 모르지. 우리는 {g|Restov}Restov{/g}를 지배하지 못했으니 그렇게 해야 우리 "
"전사들이 죽지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "7f9074a5-1dd6-4150-87bd-d9c9dc875854"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian shakes his head in dismay.{/n} \"So much blood — all for "
"nothing. Damn that Armag, what a crappy chieftain — someone should jab a "
"spear up his...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 절망적으로 고개를 젓습니다.{/n} \"너무 많은 피가 헛되이 흘렀어. 젠장할 아르막. 미친 족장 같으니. 그 녀석 머리에 "
"창을...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterRanged
msgctxt "c064d6c9-7b19-4f5e-b6be-28e805dd1ef1"
msgid "\"Shush, quiet! The Sister's still here! What if she hears you?\""
msgstr "\"쉿. 조용히! 자매가 아직 저기에 있어! 그녀가 들으면 어쩌려고 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "c4c28a3f-7eb8-41db-a1fa-29e075779414"
msgid ""
"\"The tomb of peerless Armag, great chieftain and invincible fighter... damn "
"his hide!\""
msgstr "\"위대한 족장 아르막의 무덤이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "e67e03ef-288d-4e69-8fe0-19e761da6660"
msgid ""
"\"Our chieftain brought us here. He took several of us into the tomb with "
"him and told the rest to wait outside. No one's left the place since, and "
"we've been sitting here for weeks!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 족장이 우리를 여기로 이끌었지. 그는 몇몇을 데리고 무덤 안으로 들어갔고 나머지는 여기에서 기다리라고 했어. 누구도 이곳을 "
"떠나지 않았고 몇주 동안을 기다렸지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "662fb5d6-0e70-4482-b59c-07e507a81579"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe... but what if he isn't? The Sisters always claimed that once he "
"exited the tomb, he'd be the mightiest fighter {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} ever "
"saw! Maybe they were lying... but what if they weren't? I'd certainly hate "
"to be the one who disobeyed his orders!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마도... 하지만 그가 아니라면? 자매는 항상 그가 무덤을 빠져나왔다고 했고 그는 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 가장 "
"강한 전사라고! 그들이 거짓말을 한다면... 하지만 진실이라면 어떻게 하지? 그의 명령을 어기고 싶지는 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "f6332ce5-8f52-4572-88f4-2aa8e7beedd8"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarians gather around the Sister's bloody body.{/n} \"So, that's "
"it... The witch is gone. There's no turning back now — Armag won't waste any "
"time investigating, he'll just tear our heads off.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 피범범이 된 자매의 시체 주위로 원을 그리며 서있습니다.{/n} \"그래서 그렇게 된 것이었군... 마녀가 사라졌어. "
"이제는 돌아갈 길이 없어. 아르막은 시간 낭비하지 않고 우리의 머리를 날려버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterMelee
msgctxt "9c333050-b797-4477-9e45-40d5760affd8"
msgid ""
"\"To the {g|Abyss}Abyss{/g} with him! Are we supposed to wait here for him "
"until we're old and gray? He's a traitor, not a chieftain! First he takes us "
"to conquer {g|Restov}Restov{/g} without any proper scouting, like sheep to "
"the slaughter, and then he leaves his forces right before a huge battle to "
"go digging around in some hole in the ground... Other chieftains have been "
"deposed for far less!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Abyss}심연{/g}으로 가라지! 우리가 그냥 늙어가며 여기서 기다려야 하는 건가? 그는 족장이 아니라 배신자야! 우리를 "
"도살을 기다리는 양처럼 적절한 정찰도 하지 못하게 해서 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}를 점령하지 못하게 했고 자신의 부하들을 큰 "
"위험이 도사리는 전투가 기다리는데 버리고 갔어... 우리의 족장은 쓰레기야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterRanged
msgctxt "478eaaf6-74ec-4dc2-ae29-d4b26741b5c5"
msgid ""
"\"Right! Enough is enough! I say, whether he's alive or dead, we go back to "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}! We'll tell the elders everything, and they can "
"choose a new chieftain!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞아! 이제는 끝이야! 그가 살았든 죽었든 우리는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아간다! 우리는 장로들에게 모든 것을 말하고 "
"새로운 족장을 뽑게 하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "b8c1b19c-7b77-470e-90a6-44d799871582"
msgid ""
"\"Good luck to you, too!\" {n}The barbarians quickly pack up and leave.{/n}"
msgstr "\"행운을 비네!\" {n}야만인은 짐을 싸고 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "45514615-cad4-4061-bfc4-bf23b458437e"
msgid ""
"\"There's a Sister standing guard at the entrance. She's a mighty witch, and "
"she's crazy as a bat. She won't just let you in.\""
msgstr "\"입구에 자매가 서있다. 그녀는 강력한 마녀고 미쳐있지. 그녀가 너를 들여보내지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterMelee
msgctxt "86d2ce85-a41e-4ffb-82a8-8e9ed28a4b5a"
msgid "\"And even if she did, there are a lot of traps down there.\""
msgstr "\"그녀가 보내준다고 해도 아래에는 수많은 덫이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterRanged
msgctxt "f9f5c681-0be5-4f5b-9393-a8c6ff4dff44"
msgid ""
"\"And if you make it past the traps, there's still Armag to deal with. He'll "
"kill you.\""
msgstr "\"덫을 지나왔다고 해도 너는 아르막을 상대해야 할 거야. 그가 널 죽일 거고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "a5e02c8d-78d3-4339-89a6-ae40a3164b16"
msgid "\"But, hey, you're welcome to try!\""
msgstr "\"하지만. 시도는 해 보라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterRanged
msgctxt "763f0969-012c-484c-a8c3-1f2a55abdd59"
msgid "\"It's kind of scary. She's a witch, after all!\""
msgstr "\"무시무시하지. 그녀는 마녀라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "1d69d736-d769-4632-9e42-8df1ce7a63e6"
msgid ""
"\"No way! There'd be a riot! The chieftain would tear our heads off for that!"
"\""
msgstr "\"절대 안 돼! 반란이 있을 거야! 족장은 우리의 머리를 날려버릴 거라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "7ef8f3a0-6702-4c4b-b394-20442cd261e2"
msgid ""
"\"Look at him, downright scared! No, you're right — it's long past time to "
"rid ourselves of these witches, and our crazy chieftain, too! Hey, everyone! "
"Get the Sister! Down with Armag!\""
msgstr ""
"\"보라고! 완전히 겁에 질렸군! 네가 맞아. 오래 전에 마녀와 미친 족장을 없애야 했어. 이봐 모두들! 자매를 잡아라! 아르막을 잡으러 "
"간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "3390b898-b0b7-45bb-a42e-dc63fbe1e3cc"
msgid "\"Have a safe journey! Wish we could get out of here, too.\""
msgstr "\"안전한 여행 보내라고! 우리도 여기를 빠져나가고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalLeader
msgctxt "4aa331a1-59bf-4212-8d10-aae90da60941"
msgid "\"Really? Then what are we sitting around here for?\""
msgstr "\"정말이야? 그렇다면 우리는 왜 여기에 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Tomb_VandalFighterMelee
msgctxt "b9922d77-1548-45a5-8d3d-f6c4bf1b2173"
msgid ""
"\"Quiet! {g|Numeria}Numeria's{/g} far away, and he's still very close!\""
msgstr "\"조용해! {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}는 멀고 그는 아직 가까이에 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "047b7da7-6fa3-4cce-b6a0-351b62fdd880"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh, another dusty underground tomb. I'm so... sycamore and tired of them, "
"heh heh!\""
msgstr "\"먼지 가득한 지하 무덤이로군. 나는 무덤이라면 질렸어. 헤헤!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "0810c479-42a8-4d38-9d22-89e2e09ca3a9"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha! Good one! All right, I'm ready to crawl into another underground "
"hole for your sense of humor!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 좋아! 지하로 들어가 볼까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e749f78e-dc5f-4df1-83da-3ca6a9120a3b"
msgid ""
"\"That's fine. In a thousand years, someone will dig them up again, and then "
"my jokes will come back to enslave all of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아. 수천년 안에 누군가 무덤을 파헤치면 내 농담이 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에 퍼질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/BarbariansWaitingOutside/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "10aa23b5-00ed-4b17-baed-8d569f984fb5"
msgid ""
"{n}When no one pays attention to his pun, Regongar grunts and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그의 말장난에 아무도 관심을 가지지 않자 레곤가르는 불평하며 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/ArmagsTomb_DefacedSister_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "a298d67f-dfee-4b1c-b30a-d9b660bca374"
msgid "\"You again?! I will not allow you to defile this place as well!\""
msgstr "\"또 너야?! 이 장소를 더럽히게 두지는 않겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/ArmagsTomb_Devourer_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "bafd160b-4634-4ffc-a41f-1ba4ede398a0"
msgid ""
"You hear a low, barely audible whisper. It seems like listening just a bit "
"more would let you understand the words..."
msgstr "당신은 속삭임을 들었습니다. 조금만 더 듣는다면 무슨 말인지 이해할 것 같았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/ArmagsTomb_TrapTrialEnd_Level2_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "55b33e70-9d25-4977-939b-a10912397a89"
msgid ""
"You hear a soft clicking sound from the corridor behind you. It seems the "
"traps won't trouble you on the way back."
msgstr "당신은 당신 뒤의 복도에서 딸깍거리는 소리를 들었습니다. 뒤에 있는 덫이 문제가 되는 것 같지는 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark001_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "baa91ab8-c23b-424c-8e92-3ff2a1734d48"
msgid "The tent is dirty and untidy."
msgstr "텐트는 더럽고 지저분합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark002_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "28da41f8-6d08-4b15-832a-8290aae5dd71"
msgid ""
"The tomb entrance is simple and inconspicuous. It seems Armag, like his god, "
"wasn't one for ostentation."
msgstr "무덤 입구는 단순해 보이고 눈에 띄지 않습니다. 아르막의 신은 과장을 좋아하지 않는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark003_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "a4f6c001-6874-4eea-bfcd-6d4aeafe3fd6"
msgid ""
"Fresh footprints are easily visible along the dusty floor, which hadn't seen "
"guests in many years."
msgstr "더렁누 바닥에 발자국이 선명히 찍혀있고 수년 전에 생긴 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark004_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "d5779ce5-3dc2-4a25-a1d4-602b70eecd27"
msgid "A cold chill emanates from the room."
msgstr "방에서 차가운 기운이 흘러나옵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark005_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "908be593-202f-4c59-a4d1-5970363ebff8"
msgid ""
"A centuries-old layer of dust covers the floor of this passage. No one has "
"walked here in many years."
msgstr "수백년 동안 쌓인 먼지가 통로 바닥을 덮었습니다. 그 동안 누구도 여기를 오지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark006_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "af50c747-8adf-4957-8cec-c3fa2845c9c5"
msgid ""
"These poor fools came in search of Armag's resting place, but they found "
"their own deaths instead."
msgstr "이 멍청이는 아르막의 안식처를 찾으러 왔지만 불행히 죽고 말았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark007_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "bd13b5a6-0d70-42e5-a360-50977a703c3f"
msgid "You smell incense in the stale air."
msgstr "당신은 낡은 공기에서 향기를 맡습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark008_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "02f9c5ef-3330-45d7-985a-2386741b0901"
msgid ""
"These barbarians placed their trust in their great chieftain — and fell by "
"his hand."
msgstr "이 야만인들은 위대한 족장을 믿었지만 그의 손에 죽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark009_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "b0804011-a941-45db-aeed-489ea52b2690"
msgid ""
"Instead of peace and calm, tension and anxiety prevail in this tomb. You can "
"sense that this place wasn't meant for the great Armag's eternal rest, but "
"rather just a nap while he awaited new battles."
msgstr ""
"평화와 안정 대신 긴장과 불안이 이 무덤에 차있습니다. 이곳은 아르막의 평온을 위한 곳이 아니라 그의 다음 전투를 위한 일시적인 "
"휴식처였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Bark010_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "cd5f3e2a-1bc4-4ce5-872f-0003204fdc19"
msgid ""
"Armag took a great deal of trophies to his rest. Now they're all yours by "
"right!"
msgstr "아르막은 전리품을 무덤에 두었습니다. 이제는 모두 당신 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Cutscene_TrapTrial_CommandAction_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "849cc7ae-fda0-451c-b202-d0f5e244c462"
msgid ""
"Ancient machinery clanks and clatters as it comes to life somewhere "
"underground..."
msgstr "고대의 기계 장치가 소리를 내며 지하 어딘가에서 작동합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark001_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "2b1f4e86-9e07-44c5-90ad-df4129640a57"
msgid "The walls are made of rough stone and have almost no decorations."
msgstr "벽은 거친 돌로 지어졌고 아무런 장식도 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark002_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "eddb0384-b5d8-42d0-8555-0cf937e39097"
msgid "The ceiling collapsed. The passage is barred by the pile of stones."
msgstr "천장이 무너졌습니다. 통로는 돌 무더기로 막혔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark003_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "1fc20148-b99c-42bd-b74e-af1a475f9721"
msgid "There are fresh traces of blood and soot on the floor by the door."
msgstr "핏자국이 복도에서부터 문까지 선명하게 남아있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark004_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "7dfbde0b-cd13-4a60-97d5-6a67d61d9136"
msgid ""
"Judging by the traps installed here, the creators' cruelty was matched only "
"by their ingenuity."
msgstr "여기에 설치된 덫으로 보건데 이곳을 지은 자의 잔인함은 천재성과 비례할 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark005_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "ec4136d4-9be6-4301-879a-a5e066d34e09"
msgid "Not all of Armag's trophies are on display..."
msgstr "아르막이 가진 전리품의 전부는 아닙니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark006_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "7e416640-be44-47b7-b38f-d72a446977b7"
msgid "Hidden treasure is the reward for a perceptive eye."
msgstr "숨겨진 보물은 노련한 자에게 주는 보상입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark007_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "738d2dc3-a0bf-4e5c-9aba-b4c4c8648929"
msgid ""
"Judging by the footprints in the dust, a battle raged in this room just "
"recently. One of the statues decorating the room is caked with blood."
msgstr "먼지에 찍힌 발자국으로 보건데 최근에 여기에서 전투가 벌어졌습니다. 조각상 하나가 피로 물들어있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark008_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "2a835388-ece7-4b08-a51d-8ed2dba7bae8"
msgid "A hidden door opens into a room full of treasures."
msgstr "숨겨진 문이 열려 보물이 가득한 방을 보여줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark009_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "2c3534ce-36f9-4f37-b5ca-849108478723"
msgid ""
"Judging by the footprints in the dust, the barbarians explored this room in "
"search of hidden entrances, but it seems they didn't find anything and "
"turned back."
msgstr "먼지에 찍힌 발자국으로 보건데 야만인이 이 숨겨진 입구를 지나쳤지만 아무것도 찾지 못해 돌아간 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Barks/Level02_Bark010_WhatToBark_String
msgctxt "103109d3-c984-4f36-9509-2480ab70b14c"
msgid ""
"The barbarians set up a camp here. It seems like they were preparing for a "
"serious battle."
msgstr "야만인이 여기서 캠프를 설치했습니다. 그들은 큰 전투를 준비한 것 같았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0011_Text_1
msgctxt "db18af29-f0ec-4c5d-be81-1b76569b6b4e"
msgid ""
"\"Armag didn't lie to you — the ancient chieftain's spirit really did live "
"in his body. Still, he fell by my hand.\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 너에게 거짓말하지 않았다. 고대의 족장의 영혼은 그의 몸 안에서 살고 있지. 그리고 내 손에 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "62a9f266-3028-4541-bb20-accb4acfbfb8"
msgid ""
"\"Armag was a madman and a kinslayer. He led your tribe to its destruction. "
"But I defeated him and his witches!\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 미치광이이자 살육자였지. 그는 네 부족을 파멸로 이끌었어. 하지만 그와 마녀를 내가 무찔렀다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0013_Text_1
msgctxt "d16816d2-2ecc-4345-9d2e-8167fb5a4e43"
msgid ""
"\"Armag was a coward and a piece of scum, unworthy of his name. He fled the "
"battlefield, hid underground, and died like a filthy rat, groveling at my "
"feet!\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 겁쟁이에 쓰레기였지. 이름에 걸맞지 않게 그는 전투에서 도망쳐 지하에 숨었고 더러운 쥐새끼처럼 쓰러져 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0019_Text_1
msgctxt "a4ca1ac7-7655-417c-81d3-85577a34be4f"
msgid "\"Who are they?\""
msgstr "\"그들은 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0020_Text_1
msgctxt "9284464a-5892-41bd-90b7-8c66797a757a"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 무슨 일이 일어난 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "7fd0f031-fe3f-4c79-84f9-a6116030ca31"
msgid "\"These seem like Tiger Lords affairs. What help would I be?\""
msgstr "\"호랑이 부족의 일인 것 같군. 내가 어떻게 도움이 되겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "55490ec1-e9b9-4258-bd64-f5eb55dc8db1"
msgid ""
"\"Armag was a pathetic madman. He died in the tomb, unable to pass the "
"trials!\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 한심한 미치광이였지. 그는 무덤에서 죽었고 시험을 통과하지 못했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "497415a6-2734-4b4c-bda7-c9df023bacdc"
msgid ""
"\"Why are your quarrels my affair? Go back to Numeria and do whatever you "
"like. Leave me out of your feud.\""
msgstr "\"왜 내 일을 방해하는 거야? 누메리아로 돌아가서 네 마음대로 해. 나는 내버려둬.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "c1a24f28-1fff-46ea-ac6c-ac6f914b22bd"
msgid ""
"\"All right, I'll take in any Tiger Lords who wish to leave their tribe and "
"live on my lands — provided they swear an oath of fealty first.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 부족을 떠나고 싶은 호랑이 부족 녀석을 내 땅에 살게 하겠다. 우선 충성 서약부터 먼저 해야겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "f3f004f0-ebd4-4d4a-b28e-22ef031fa099"
msgid ""
"\"There's no need to change chieftains. Let Armag remain your leader — he's "
"a hero and a personal friend.\""
msgstr "\"족장을 바꿀 필요는 없어. 아르막은 너희 대장이 될 것이다. 그는 영웅이자 친구야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "b9fc9b44-476a-4225-bb86-ab113c558ad1"
msgid ""
"\"There's no need to change chieftains. Let Armag remain your leader — he's "
"a hero and my sworn brother.\""
msgstr "\"족장을 바꿀 필요는 없어. 아르막은 너희 대장이 될 것이다. 그는 영웅이자 나의 의형제야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "0dd903ce-5d2c-448a-90a7-92388db8d897"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri fought Armag — she would have won, if not for the Sister's dirty "
"tricks. She's worthy of being your leader.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아미리는 아르막과 싸웠다. 그녀가 이길 수 있었지만 자매의 더러운 속임수 때문에 그러지 못했지. 그녀는 너희 족장이 될 가치가 있다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "68d8c323-3417-48e8-a6df-3581e39315b5"
msgid "\"Dugath is wise and valiant. He'll make a fine leader.\""
msgstr "\"두가스는 현명하고 용감하다. 그는 훌륭한 지도자가 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "1d497d8c-27f6-4006-b3bd-cf83b4999814"
msgid ""
"\"Gwart is young, but he's brave and smart. In time, he'll make a true "
"chieftain.\""
msgstr "\"그워트는 어리지만 용감하고 똑똑하지. 곧 그가 진정한 족장이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "3017e6cd-aadb-4eec-90db-e23fb019cf96"
msgid ""
"\"I've changed my mind. You'll bring me nothing but trouble if you stay. "
"Return to Numeria and deal with your problems yourselves.\""
msgstr "\"마음을 바꾸었어. 너는 나를 방해하기만 할 거야. 누메리아로 돌아가서 스스로 문제를 해결해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "55ad704e-5692-408d-aec9-859524effe5a"
msgid ""
"\"You heard me — leave. If I find you in my lands again, you'll be greeted "
"with fire and steel!\""
msgstr "\"안 들려? 떠나라고. 내 땅에서 너를 만난다면 가만두지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0002_Text_1
msgctxt "9c5e33e4-b373-49fc-9d77-f560842eb417"
msgid ""
"{n}It's noisy at the tomb's exit — many {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} "
"tribesmen have gathered here. They're arguing and bickering, and the "
"discussion is so heated that some participants have began punching their "
"opposition or drawing weapons, while more level heads work to calm them "
"down.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}무덤 출구는 시끄러웠습니다. 많은 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족민이 모여있었습니다. 그들은 서로 말싸움을 했고 "
"토론에 열기가 더해져 몇몇은 상대편에게 주먹을 날리고 무기를 뽑기 시작하였지만 다른 이들이 진정시키려고 노력했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0003_Text_1
#. Speaker : Armag
msgctxt "20ff762a-696e-48e9-bd5c-5dcb18a63b68"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd is greatest around Armag. The deposed chieftain's escort holds "
"their hands on their weapons, throwing nervous glances toward their "
"tribesmen.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아르막 주위에 사람이 가장 많았습니다. 죽은 족장의 경비들이 무기를 들고 불안한 눈빛으로 부족민들을 보고 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0004_Text_1
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "bb28eab4-20cd-40cc-8939-1cebda8fc046"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri stands apart from the crowd, contemplating something intensely. Her "
"arms are crossed over her chest, and she's biting her lip.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 군중에서 떨어져 무언가 계속해서 생각하고 있었습니다. 그녀는 팔짱을 끼고 입술을 깨물고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0005_Text_1
#. Speaker : ArmagsTombs_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "2a6730f1-4564-42d3-a229-14a15db1d7f5"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Ashman}Dugath{/d} is here too. Noticing you, he stops speaking and "
"gives you a warm smile.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}{d|Ashman}두가스{/d}도 여기 에있었습니다. 당신을 본 그는 말을 멈추고 당신에게 따뜻한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0007_Text_1
#. Speaker : ArmagsTombs_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "6163deeb-d28e-41a5-967f-8d7c9de0cd24"
msgid "{n}{d|Ashman}Dugath{/d} is here too. Noticing you, he turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}{d|Ashman}두가스{/d}도 영웅이었습니다. 당신을 본 그는 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0008_Text_1
msgctxt "05dcc2f3-1dad-4b96-bf2a-ba870e84160d"
msgid ""
"{n}As you step forward, the crowd surrounds you. The {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger "
"Lords{/g} bombard you with questions about the fate of their deposed "
"chieftain.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 한걸음 다가가자 군중은 당신을 에워쌉니다. {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 사람들은 당신에게 그들의 족장에 "
"관해서 질문을 쏟아냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0009_Text_1
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "564d65a1-7434-4fe6-90ae-5f74ecdbc84a"
msgid ""
"\"It's good you're here. As you can see, the tribe's on the verge of "
"collapse. Maybe you can help us work things out without resorting to "
"fratricide.\""
msgstr "\"여기에 오다니 잘됐어. 너도 보다시피 부족은 흩어지기 직전이야. 형제를 죽이지 않게 네가 우리를 도왔으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0014_Text_1
msgctxt "3e36b120-a54b-4e48-b115-c7303976e482"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarians all fall silent, stunned. A moment later, the arguing "
"breaks out once more.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}야만인은 침묵하더니 충격에 빠집니다. 잠시 후 말다툼 소리가 터져나옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0015_Text_1
msgctxt "dd2720b3-4751-4109-bdc6-64a7a7d58d95"
msgid ""
"{n}Your words spur a new wave of controversy. As some barbarians cheer, "
"others angrily defend their hero.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 말은 새로운 논쟁의 물결을 일으켰습니다. 몇몇 야만인은 환호하지만 다른 야만인은 자신들의 영웅을 변호합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0016_Text_1
msgctxt "bb12745d-a5eb-4576-b33b-6a975337d404"
msgid ""
"{n}Your words cause a wave of outrage. For a while, the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger "
"Lords{/g} forget about their dispute and instead yell at you, demanding "
"proof and accusing you of lying. However, it doesn't take long for them to "
"begin arguing among themselves again.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 말은 그들의 분노를 일으켰습니다. 잠시 동안 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 사람들은 무엇을 논쟁했는지 잊고 "
"당신에게 소리를 지르며 증거를 대라고 하며 당신을 거짓말쟁이라고 했습니다. 하지만 그들끼리 다시 싸우는 것은 얼마 걸리지 "
"않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "0cff1d16-a3b5-4faa-a2f3-48db8dcc5da8"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Gwart}Gwart{/d}, Dugath's apprentice, pushes his way to you through "
"the crowd of arguing barbarians.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}두가스의 제자인 {d|Gwart}그워트{/d}는 군중 사이를 뚫고 당신에게 옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "ec81c697-251e-4737-99a6-80442784bc9c"
msgid ""
"\"It's a tribal council of sorts. Once word spread about the location of "
"Armag's tomb, elders and other influential tribesmen hurried to come here. "
"Armag's actions have split the tribe in two — some call him a hero, while "
"others consider him a criminal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"부족 회의 같은 거야. 아르막의 무덤의 위치에 관한 이야기가 퍼져나간 후에 장로들과 다른 영향력있는 부족민들이 서둘러 여기로 오고 "
"있어. 아르막의 행동은 부족을 둘로 갈랐지. 일부는 그를 영웅이라 부르지만 다른 이들은 그를 범죄자라고 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "51a9a348-b874-4c29-bbbb-8047d9a770cf"
msgid ""
"\"Your army forced us to retreat. You defeated our chieftain in an honest "
"fight. What's more, you've achieved what no one before you could — you "
"delved into Armag's tomb and proved yourself worthy to enter his resting "
"chamber! And if that weren't enough, the land where the tomb is located is "
"yours, or soon to be yours. Everything hinges upon your decision.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 군대가 우리를 후퇴하게 부추겼어. 우리 족장을 정당한 싸움에서 이겼지. 게다가 아르막의 무덤을 발견하고 그의 방에 들어가 네 "
"자신을 입증했고! 무엇보다 무덤이 위치한 자리는 네 영토니 곧 너의 것이 될 거야. 모든 것이 네 결정에 달렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "73e74c4c-6507-4616-b6d8-2a4f8fd983f8"
msgid ""
"{n}Your words just add fuel to the fire. Some barbarians cheer, others "
"demand proof, and some just stare at you, stunned, unable to believe the "
"fall of their hero.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 말은 불에 기름 붓는 격이었습니다. 몇몇 야만인은 화호했지만 다른이들은 증거를 요구하며 자신의 영웅이 죽은 것을 믿지 "
"못하겠다는 듯 멍하니 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "66c18333-5eaf-4a14-90db-c948faf55e06"
msgid ""
"\"Our elders, clerics, bards, and strongest fighters have gathered here... "
"Everyone important enough to have a voice in the matters of our tribe. And "
"as you can hear, they're more than happy to continue using those voices. "
"With the fate of our tribe at stake, I can only pray that great "
"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} holds his hand and allows us to resolve it without "
"bloodshed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 장로들과 성직자와 음유시인과 전사들이 여기 모였다... 모두 부족에서 힘이 있는 자들이지. 너도 들었다시피 그들은 자신들의 "
"권력을 기꺼이 사용하려고 한다. 우리 부족의 명운이 걸렸으니 나는 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}에게 기도해서 우리가 유혈사태 없이 이 일을 "
"해결하기를 바라겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "7927e77b-dded-4322-9e51-3b415a9eb9f9"
msgid ""
"\"Armag's death failed to mend the wounds his life inflicted on the tribe. "
"Quite the contrary, in fact.\""
msgstr "\"아르막의 죽음은 자신이 부족에 입힌 상처를 치유하지 못했다. 사실 그 반대지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "9f532559-e9fe-449f-bf0f-4c69bfff96a9"
msgid ""
"\"Those who curse Armag for sending his tribesmen to senseless deaths also "
"won't tolerate those who praise him as a great chieftain.\""
msgstr "\"자신의 부족을 죽음으로 몰아간 아르막은 족장의 자격이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "0e87e15b-8f77-41e8-b6bc-4280494a7e91"
msgid ""
"\"You're well within your rights, but please consider the wisdom of this "
"decision. We live quite close to your lands, and most river kings would be "
"eager to have us as their friends and allies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 결정할 일이니 신중하게 생각해줘. 우리는 네 땅과 가까운 곳에 살고 있고 강의 왕국의 왕은 우리를 자신들의 친구이자 동맹으로 "
"삼으려 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "05f26325-044a-4f21-bbb8-8af959f03098"
msgid ""
"{n}This time there is no yelling, no bickering. After a short, intense "
"debate, one of the elders addresses you.{/n} \"We gratefully accept your "
"offer. With your permission, we'll settle here, keeping the peace of Armag's "
"tomb as well as the peace of your borders.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이번에는 고함도 말싸움도 없었습니다. 잠시 격렬한 논쟁이 있더니 장로 한명이 당신에게 말을 겁니다.{/n} \"네 제안에 감사하다. "
"네가 허락하면 우리는 여기에 정착하고 아르막의 무덤과 너희 국경에 평화를 가져오고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "f9c9dea4-fe2c-495e-a87b-27626a297830"
msgid ""
"\"There is one more issue we must discuss. Who will lead the "
"{g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}? While it may no "
"longer be your concern, those who make their homes in your lands will need a "
"leader. And this person will need to be respected by the tribe but also hold "
"your trust. If you nominate an appropriate candidate, we'll heed your "
"decision.\""
msgstr ""
"\"반드시 얘기해야 할 것이 있어. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}는 누가 이끌지? 네 "
"땅에 살게 될 자들의 우두머리를 정하는 일이야. 그 자는 부족에게 존경받지만 네 신뢰도 받아야겠지. 네가 누군가를 추천한다면 네 결정을 "
"생각해 보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Armag
msgctxt "24dbd047-0956-4af9-9856-7dd78cbcd235"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd breaks into shouting, both of agreement and of outrage. Raising "
"the sacred sword, Armag steps forward. His gaze wanders over the crowd, "
"finally rising to the skies.{/n} \"Armag was wrong. He believed the witches' "
"lies. He spilled the blood of his kin for no reason. But that's all in the "
"past! Before the eyes of {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}, on this sacred blade, Armag "
"swears to devote his life to the tribe! To bring the tribe glory and riches, "
"like in ancient times! No, better than ancient times!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}동의하는 군중과 분노하는 군중 모두 소리를 지릅니다. 신성한 검을 들어올린 아르막은 앞으로 걸어갑니다. 그는 군중을 둘러보고는 "
"마침내 하늘을 올려다봅니다.{/n} \"아르막이 틀렸다. 그는 마녀의 거짓말을 믿었다. 그는 이유 없이 동족의 피를 흘렸다. 하지만 "
"그것은 모두 과거의 일이다! {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 보시니 이 신성한 검에 대고 아르막은 목숨 바쳐 부족을 이끌겠다! 부족에게 "
"영광과 부를 가져다 주겠다! 과거보다 더 많은 영광과 부를 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : ArmagsTombs_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "109269c9-df28-4582-a7e2-1eb866efe347"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric nods with dignity and steps forward.{/n} \"{g|Tiger Lords}"
"Tiger Lords{/g}! We can't let this rivalry split our tribe. We're still "
"brothers and sisters, and if trouble comes, we'll unite and fight it "
"together. But for now, {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} calls for us to go our separate "
"ways for a while. Return to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, choose a new chieftain, "
"and lead the tribe to wealth and glory. We will remain here, by the tomb of "
"our ancient leader. Farewell, brothers and sisters!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 끄덕이고는 앞으로 걸어나옵니다.{/n} \"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}여! 이 다툼으로 부족을 나눌 수는 "
"없다. 우리는 여전히 형제 자매들이고 문제가 생긴다면 하나가 되어 함께 싸운다. 하지만 지금은 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 우리에게 "
"잠시 다른 길을 가라고 하신다. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아가 새로운 족장을 고르고 부족에게 영광과 부를 안겨다 주어라. "
"우리는 여기 고대 지도자의 무덤에 남겠다. 형제 자매여. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "e85e8843-8b28-4c8e-a3d1-298ce11016bf"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri is surprised by your words, but the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} "
"noisily express their approval. The crowd pushes her forward, practically "
"carrying her on their shoulders, as everyone gathers around her, waiting for "
"her to answer.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 당신의 말에 놀랐지만 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족은 동의한다는 뜻을 요란하게 알립니다. 군중은 "
"그녀를 앞으로 나오도록 어깨를 밀었고 그녀 주위에 둘러서서 그녀의 대답을 기다립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : ArmagsTombs_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "f0ca2667-2515-4395-b740-c1ce1e4113ce"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric's lips tighten into a thin line. He shakes his head and "
"answers in an ice-cold voice.{/n} \"I appreciate the honor, but I cannot {d|"
"c31 Ashman Hostile}accept{/d}. I'll be returning to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자의 입술은 굳게 다물어집니다. 그는 고개를 저으며 차가운 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"감사하지만 나는 {d|c31 "
"Ashman Hostile}받아들일 수 없어{/d}. 나는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "4ccbeef1-9824-4541-9ecb-bfeaf1323b43"
msgid ""
"{n}Your suggestion opens a new wave of debates, but everyone soon calms down "
"— no one can propose a better candidate for leader. Reluctantly, the {g|"
"Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} finally agree with you. The young man steps "
"forward.{/n} \"Brothers and sisters, Your Grace... Thank you. I won't fail "
"you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 제안은 새로운 논쟁을 일으켰지만 곧 모두 조용해집니다. 아무도 더 나은 지도자를 제안하지 못했기 때문입니다. 어쩔 수 없이 "
"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족은 마침내 당신의 말에 동의합니다. 어린 남자가 앞으로 걸어나옵니다.{/n} \"형제 "
"자매여. {name}... 고마워. 실망시키지 않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "389a66ec-4d95-4135-b607-b4eaedd875a1"
msgid ""
"\"So be it. The gods bore witness — we were ready to extend you the hand of "
"friendship.\" {n}Cursing under their breath and throwing angry glances your "
"way, the barbarians leave.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 해. 신들이 보고 있다. 우리는 너와 친구가 될 준비가 되어있다.\" {n}낮은 목소리로 저주하며 분노의 눈빛을 당신에게 "
"보내는 야만인들은 떠났습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Armag
msgctxt "53645241-953d-469e-88d5-2df0f154bcb7"
msgid ""
"{n}The last words of the chieftain's speech are drowned in the cheers of his "
"supporters. His opponents turn and leave one by one. Armag approaches you "
"and shakes your hand, to great applause.{/n} \"The {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger "
"Lords{/g} will roam this realm. If anyone dares violate its borders and head "
"toward the capital, they'll first have to step over Armag's dead body!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}족장의 마지막 말은 환호 소리에 묻혔습니다. 그를 반대하는 자들은 등을 돌리고 하나 둘씩 떠나갑니다. 아르막은 당신에게 다가와 "
"악수를 하며 말합니다.{/n} \"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족은 이 지역을 떠돌 거야. 국경을 침범하는 녀석이 "
"있다면 아르막의 시체를 먼저 넘어야 할 테지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : ArmagsTombs_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "a3750044-fd03-4360-b56d-8cb088152abf"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarians nod grimly as the cleric speaks. Once his speech is over, "
"some of them remain, and the others bid farewell to their tribesmen as they "
"leave. Dugath approaches you and shakes your hand.{/n} \"That's how it goes, "
"Baron{mf||ess}. Truth be told, when first we met, I was sure "
"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} would eventually pit us against one another on the "
"battlefield. I'm glad that was not the case. We'll roam this area, and if "
"any enemies approach your borders, they'll have to deal with us first!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 성직자가 말하자 무섭게 끄덕입니다. 그의 연설이 끝나자 일부는 남았고 다른 이들은 떠나면서 작별 인사를 합니다. 두가스는 "
"당신에게 다가가 악수를 합니다.{/n} \"이렇게 되었군. 솔직히 우리가 처음 만났을 때는 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 마침내 우리를 "
"전투에서 만나게 할 것이라고 생각했지. 그렇게 되지 않아 다행이야. 우리는 이 곳을 떠돌 것이고 국경을 넘는 녀석들과 싸울 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "8882b844-5e12-4f99-9796-c4237e9dc9ed"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}! I'm, erm... I may not be from your tribe, "
"but... Well, long story short, I just want to say, the {g|Stolen Lands}"
"Stolen Lands{/g} is a place where... Um, it's odd. Everyone who manages to "
"survive here — they're exiles, but they're like family to each other. It's "
"crap that your situation made you turn on each other, but here, in these "
"lands, we all have a chance for a new start. Whatever your Armag did... "
"Together, we'll find glory! Mark my words, I won't fail you!\" {n}The "
"barbarians greet Amiri's inconsistent speech with applause. Then the time "
"for farewells comes — some Tiger Lords remain at the tomb with their new "
"leader, while the rest begin their journey back to "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족이여! 나는. 음... 너희 부족 사람이 아니지만... 간단히 말하자면 {g|"
"Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 말이지... 음... 이거 이상하군. 여기에서 생존한 자들은 모두 추방자이지만 서로에게 "
"가족과 같아. 상황이 나빠 서로 등을 돌리고 있지만 여기 이 땅에서는 모두 새로운 시작을 할 기회를 가질 수 있어. 아르막이 무엇을 "
"했든... 함께 우리는 영광을 찾자! 너희를 실망시키지 않겠어!\" {n}야만인은 아미리의 연설을 듣고 박수를 칩니다. 그리고 작별의 "
"시간이 왔습니다. 호랑이 군주 부족 몇은 새로운 우두머리와 함께 무덤에 남았고 나머지는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아가기 "
"시작했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3bd192ab-5364-435f-a7ca-5d65428a62c5"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri approaches you, seemingly still unable to wrap her head around what "
"happened.{/n} \"You amaze me! Could have given some warning, or something! "
"It's all right, though, it's not like I can complain! Ha ha! But I hope you "
"don't expect to get rid of me that easy. I guess I'll just have to figure "
"out how to manage my time traveling with you alongside leading my new tribe. "
"But I can do it, don't you doubt! The {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} will "
"roam this area near your borders. If some enemy drags his ass here, he'll "
"regret ever being born!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 당신에게 다가왔지만 여전히 자신에게 무슨 일이 일어났는지 모르는 것 같았습니다.{/n} \"나를 놀라게 하는군! 경고를 "
"하거나 미리 알려주면 좋았을 텐데! 그래도 좋아. 내가 불평할 일은 아닌 거 같으니까! 하지만 나를 그렇게 쉽게 없앨 거라 생각하지 마. "
"나는 곧 내 새로운 부족들과 어떻게 할지 생각해낼 거니까. 하지만 걱정하지 마! 나는 할 수 있으니까! {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 "
"군주{/g} 부족은 너희 영토 내 국경 주위를 떠돌 거야. 적들이 네 땅에 침범하면 태어난 걸 후회하게 해 줄 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "a5636dee-defd-46fe-b65c-27685948ee12"
msgid ""
"{n}The young cleric shakes your hand.{/n} \"I thank you for giving us "
"shelter. Our tribe will roam this area. If enemies come, have no doubt, "
"we'll stop them!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어린 성직자는 당신과 악수합니다.{/n} \"은신처를 제공해주어 고마워. 우리 부족은 이 지역을 떠돌 거야. 적들이 오면 의심의 "
"여지 없이 그들을 막겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "7ef36777-c928-417e-bc19-ed796fd9a827"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarians listen to Gwart attentively but with little enthusiasm. "
"After he finishes his speech, it's time for farewells — some {g|Tiger Lords}"
"Tiger Lords{/g} remain near the tomb with their new leader, while the rest "
"begin their journey back to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 그워트의 말을 집중해서 듣지만 열정적이지 않았습니다. 그가 연설을 마쳤고 이제는 작별의 시간이 다가왔습니다. {g|"
"Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족 일부는 무덤 주위에서 새로운 우두머리와 함께 남았고 나머지는 "
"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아갔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "fa6e342f-5ba0-438d-8cdd-6f9cff028333"
msgid ""
"{n}After the new chieftain finishes his speech, the time comes for "
"farewells. Some barbarians exchange hugs and shake their tribesmen's hands "
"with teary eyes, while others simply clench their fists and spit on the "
"ground, muttering curses. Finally, those who decided to return to "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} leave your lands, and the rest surround their "
"leader.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}새로운 족장이 연설을 마쳤고 이별의 시간이 다가왔습니다. 일부 야만인은 포옹과 악수를 나누며 눈물을 흘렸고 다른 이들은 주먹을 "
"쥐고는 땅에 침을 뱉으며 낮은 목소리로 저주했습니다. 마침내 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}로 돌아가기로 결정한 이들은 당신의 땅을 "
"떠났고 나머지는 그들의 우두머리와 함께 남았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5b268564-6dfa-461e-8081-295f26b71a9b"
msgid ""
"\"Amazing, no?\" {n}The elf looks at the crowd of barbarians with "
"pretentious indifference.{/n}"
msgstr "\"놀랍군.\" {n}엘프는 야만인 군중을 무관심하게 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "78b8f840-07d9-439f-a920-9640efb99edd"
msgid ""
"\"Chaos and a rift — how else could this story end? Armag may not have been "
"the best chief, but in trying to overthrow him, you only kindled the flames "
"of a feud.\""
msgstr ""
"\"혼돈과 다툼이라. 어떻게 이 이야기가 이렇게 끝날 수 있지? 아르막은 최고의 족장이 아니었지만 그를 넘어서려고 하다가 너는 불에 "
"기름을 부었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "1026cb33-3680-4ef8-adb4-748e9feb0555"
msgid ""
"\"Friendship? This rabble has quite the high opinion of themselves. They're "
"uncontrollable and unpredictable — not fit to be servants or allies.\""
msgstr "\"우정? 이 자들은 자존심이 너무 세. 그들은 예측 불가능한 막무가내들이야. 동맹이나 부하가 될 수 없는 녀석들이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "c203b5d2-02df-460f-a103-ca513f6ff6d9"
msgid ""
"\"A murderer who settles next to the family of his victim brings only chaos "
"and grief. The {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} have no place beside us. Do "
"not change your mind, {name} — let them go.\""
msgstr ""
"\"희생자의 가족과 살인자가 이웃하면 혼란을 가져올 뿐이지. {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}에게 줄 자리는 없다. 마음을 "
"바꾸지 마. {name}. 그들을 보내줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "b8ec71f7-7f94-4596-8c81-93dfc08e5d4c"
msgid ""
"\"This is a chance to show mercy and vision, {name}. These people may be "
"lost, but they can still be brought to the right path. Stop this rift in "
"their tribe from forming — stop them from suffering further bloodshed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자비와 비전을 그들에게 보여줄 때야. {name}. 이 자들은 길을 잃었지만 옳은 길을 갈 수 있어. 더 이상의 유혈 사태는 막아야 "
"해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : ArmagsTombs_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "f5df16b6-f576-4976-9545-fbaf0391c22b"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric's lips tighten into a thin line. He shakes his head and "
"answers in an ice-cold voice.{/n} \"That won't happen. I despise what has "
"become of this tribe.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자의 입술은 굳게 다물어집니다. 그는 고개를 저으며 차가운 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"그런 일은 일어나지 않을 거야. 이 "
"부족이 경멸스러워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ec567ef4-4de7-4f35-b0a9-a94473b92e19"
msgid ""
"\"I say we'd better root them out. But if, for some reason, you don't want "
"to do it, then give them a weak chief, or someone you can control. "
"Otherwise, in ten or twenty years they'll return to your lands, to try their "
"luck once more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들을 뿌리뽑는 게 좋을 거야. 너는 그걸 원하지 않는 것 같으니 그들에게 네가 통제할 만한 약한 족장을 따르게 해. 그렇지 않으면 "
"십년 후에 그들이 네 땅에 다시 쳐들어 올 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Elders/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "282898e1-faa9-4cfc-9dc3-52c66dccb273"
msgid ""
"\"These people bring only chaos and death. The best solution would be to "
"send them back home, and never let them look upon the borders of this land "
"again.\""
msgstr "\"이 자들은 혼돈과 죽음을 가져왔지. 최고의 해결책은 그들을 집에 보내고 다시는 이 땅의 국경을 넘게 해서는 안 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "023caba1-166b-4923-adf8-f5f3e8926642"
msgid "\"Why are you here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "79bde1ef-cc66-40c8-a5ab-b8b4e28323c9"
msgid "\"Yes, I killed them. Will you seek revenge?\""
msgstr "\"그래. 내가 그를 죽였어. 너는 복수를 하고 싶은 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a21563e5-f53f-48be-b7c9-7a063db8885c"
msgid "Lied to Gwart about the fate of his fellow Tiger Lords."
msgstr "그워트에게 호랑이 군주 부족의 죽음에 관해 거짓말을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "fcee1339-137c-40af-bf9c-27b3237b7088"
msgid "\"You're wrong. They were already dead when I arrived.\""
msgstr "\"네가 틀렸어. 내가 도착했을 때 그들은 죽어있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e6f5ac79-2728-4ad2-a0fa-934a6007bdbc"
msgid ""
"\"The Tiger Lords split up? Are you sure a new chieftain couldn't reunite "
"them?\""
msgstr "\"호랑이 군주 부족이 갈라져? 새로운 족장이 그들을 통합시킬 수 없다는 게 사실이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "805fbbd7-12be-4ff0-8c49-b5e267de0ebb"
msgid "\"I see. Go. Speak with your god.\""
msgstr "\"알겠어. 가. 너희 신과 대화나 나누시지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "65703097-66d5-47b3-bb4b-5e407bad694e"
msgid "Killed the friendly cleric of Gorum."
msgstr "고룸의 성직자를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "3b0d8da7-45e5-437b-bb75-50ff2b49444b"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll send you to your god right now!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너희 신에게 바로 보내주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "f876b573-9029-48c8-8d15-d267b62007e1"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Gwart}Gwart{/d} stands at the entrance to the tomb, surrounded by the "
"bodies of the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} you've slain.{/n} \"So, this is "
"the tomb of the great chieftain. Would have been better if it had remained "
"lost forever.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Gwart}그워트{/d}는 당신이 살해한 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족의 시체가 모여있는 무덤 입구에 "
"서있습니다.{/n} \"이 무덤은 아르막의 무덤이군. 영원히 잊혀졌으면 더 좋았을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "3779fd76-1a26-49aa-808a-f9f6a719c3ee"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} himself guided me here. I didn't understand why he "
"considered me worthy, until I saw the bodies. It wasn't Armag, was it? It "
"was you.\""
msgstr ""
"\" {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 나를 여기로 인도했다. 왜 그가 나를 아끼는지는 시체들을 보고나서야 알았지. 그들을 죽인 건 아르막이 "
"아니었지? 바로 너였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "db25a32e-55e8-4970-ac6a-68ebbd2f4946"
msgid ""
"{n}The young cleric takes a deep breath.{/n} \"This place was once sacred to "
"the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} — the final resting place of our greatest "
"chieftain. Now it's just some hole in the ground, and the Tiger Lords are no "
"more. There was a riot. It led the tribe to split. Armag sowed the seeds of "
"fratricide, and the harvest we reap is discord. Our once great tribe has "
"broken into several rival clans.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}어린 성직자는 깊은 숨을 들이쉽니다.{/n} \"이 곳은 한 때 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족에게 신성하게 "
"여겨지는 장소였다. 위대한 족장의 마지막 안식처였으니까. 이제는 그냥 던전일 뿐이고 호랑이 군주 부족은 없어. 반란만이 있을 뿐이지. "
"그것이 부족을 갈라놓았어. 아르막은 형제들을 죽이고 우리는 고통받았다. 우리의 위대한 부족은 갈갈이 찢어졌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "8d97b4d6-9996-44df-85a2-f29962344320"
msgid "\"No. I have no interest in revenge.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 복수에 관심은 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "7d5f31be-cb53-4814-822f-b144a072923f"
msgid "\"As you say. It matters little now. I didn't come for revenge.\""
msgstr "\"네가 말하는 대로. 지금은 중요하지 않아. 나는 복수하러 온 게 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "dde1572d-e48e-413d-ae00-d436a6c53543"
msgid ""
"\"I don't want to see my brothers and sisters killing one another. I want to "
"take part in it even less. That isn't why I swore loyalty to "
"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}. I came to this defiled sacred place of a broken tribe to "
"spend some time alone with my god and think about all that's happened.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 형제 자매들이 서로 죽이는 모습을 보고 싶지 않아. 나는 화해를 원해. {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}도 원하지 않을 거야. 나는 "
"더럽혀진 신성한 장소에서 무슨 일이 일어났는지 생각해 보고 싶었을 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "9e107183-5ab1-4844-b16e-5c67f428c988"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sure. The blood's been shed. Now each part of the tribe calls for "
"vengeance — there's no thought of reunion. This is the end of the {g|Tiger "
"Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}. Soon, other tribes will divide our lands among "
"themselves, and we'll be scattered across {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"확실해. 유혈 사태가 벌어졌어. 이제 부족들은 복수를 원하겠지. 통합을 생각하지는 않을 거야. 이것이 {g|Tiger Lords}"
"호랑이 군주{/g} 부족의 끝이군. 곧 다른 부족이 우리 땅을 갈라 먹고 우리는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에 흩어질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "b23d9da1-66b6-4eaf-b969-f431b76d7441"
msgid ""
"{n}With a nod of farewell, Gwart disappears into the depths of the tomb.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}끄덕이며 작별 인사를 한 그워트는 무덤 속으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "deff9513-72cb-4015-89e2-3ad7741081b2"
msgid "\"Even better, then.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 더 좋지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Gwart-final/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart
msgctxt "6178bc9d-f49e-40f2-87a2-e250387455ae"
msgid ""
"\"All that has occurred is the direct consequence of following the ways of "
"your god. The fussy, proud god of war. But no matter how self-confident "
"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} may be, all wars end the same way — with full burial "
"mounds and the silence of abandoned tombs. In the end, {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}"
" ultimately triumphs — and only {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 신을 따른 결과가 이렇게 되었다. 전쟁의 신 말이야. 얼마나 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}을 자랑스러워 하는지 몰라도 모든 전쟁의 "
"결말은 같아. 봉분들과 버려진 무덤의 침묵 뿐이지. 결국은 {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}가 승리할 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "1af20381-423a-4201-b88f-eb3619f079f8"
msgid "\"So, how does it feel to be chieftain?\""
msgstr "\"족장이 되니 기분이 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "cde6d439-d91d-43fb-8553-ebb61b88537f"
msgid "Massacred the friendly barbarians from the Tiger Lord tribe."
msgstr "호랑이 군주 부족의 야만인들을 말살했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f4b66ba3-f232-4c40-a84f-4b6543a930cc"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've no more need of you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너희는 더 이상 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6b8cd69e-e657-45c5-8157-ff0f7c16ab27"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9c999688-6052-45cc-83f7-264f83598574"
msgid "\"How do you manage the ghost in your sword?\""
msgstr "\"검 안의 유령은 어떻게 통제하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "af00771e-9355-4327-aa86-ae35e28958d3"
msgid "\"How's the tribe doing?\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족 상황은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1a43687a-fdd7-402f-bc49-5ff37aaeb7d2"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}! Look who it is! A {d|c41 Chief "
"Armag}friend{/d} to Armag, a friend to the whole tribe! A friend who's "
"always welcome here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}! 누가 왔는지 봐라! {d|c41 Chief Armag}아르막의{/d} 친구는 모든 "
"부족의 친구다! 친구는 항상 환영이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "de13817e-93df-4c3d-a970-eac45638718e"
msgid ""
"{n}Armag's wandering eyes stop on your face for a moment, and he firmly "
"shakes your hand.{/n} \"{d|c41 Chief Armag}Greetings{/d}, "
"{mf|brother|sister}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르막은 당신 앞에서 눈알을 굴리더니 당신과 악수를 합니다.{/n} \"{d|c41 Chief Armag}안녕하신가{/d}. 형제여."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "371de973-18af-4868-909a-8485f4ca9c0a"
msgid "\"Traitor! Armag will never forgive this!\""
msgstr "\"배신자! 아르막은 절대 포기하지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "d2c42335-ea5a-4717-a14a-0a07e0df6df9"
msgid ""
"\"Armag failed his brothers and sisters, but they took him in again. Armag "
"would rather die than betray their trust again. And they know it.\""
msgstr "\"아르막이 형제와 자매를 저버렸지만 그들은 다시 받아주었다. 아르막은 배신하느니 차라리 죽겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "23f41e4c-54e7-4ae5-8676-5fd792ed674e"
msgid ""
"\"It fills Armag's days with doubts and his nights with nightmares. Each day "
"is a battle, when it is around. It is Armag's curse, but it also gives Armag "
"the strength to win. The dead man will never prevail again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"의심과 악몽으로 가득한 나날이었다. 하루하루가 전투였지. 아르막의 저주지만 또 아르막에게 힘을 주기도 한다. 죽은 자는 이길 수 "
"없으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Armag/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "800fd0a5-7fd8-4d8a-a7da-498a5c95047f"
msgid ""
"\"The tigers are licking their wounds. Much time will pass before the tribe "
"can regain its former power and glory. But that day will come!\""
msgstr ""
"\"호랑이 군주 부족은 상처를 회복하고 있다. 부족이 예전의 힘과 영광을 찾으려면 많은 시간이 필요할 거야. 하지만 그 날은 온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Dugath/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "756d0985-fbef-4f0d-b3bd-86103fc7cb8e"
msgid "\"How does it feel to be chieftain?\""
msgstr "\"족장이 되니 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Dugath/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ef0eeb6b-9a4a-4e08-bd38-c93aef37bd26"
msgid "\"How's the tribe doing?\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족 상황은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Dugath/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a198072f-3fa4-4a3a-b0a0-e230d3a8978d"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've no more need of you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너희는 더 이상 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Dugath/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "9927bc55-9fd2-4978-96ff-4aa6dc3e1557"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Dugath/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c7280b4b-f9b1-43ed-8715-4f05e89616d2"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings. I'm glad you found time to visit your {d|c41 Chief "
"Ashman}allies{/d}.\""
msgstr "\"안녕. 너희 {d|c41 Chief Ashman}동맹{/d}을 방문하게 되어 기쁘군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Dugath/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "d4ee8c91-e791-4a1f-bc34-df5b384e1f4f"
msgid ""
"\"I have some experience leading people. Before the tribe split, I used to "
"command armies that were bigger than the whole tribe is now.\""
msgstr "\"나는 사람들을 이끌어 본 경험이 있어. 이 부족이 갈라서기 전까지 나는 이 부족보다 더 큰 군대를 지휘했었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Dugath/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "84d1f120-ad43-49f9-b35d-6d37ba3fb63f"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} doesn't grant us glorious fights these days. We use "
"this time to restore our strength before the next war breaks out. As I'm "
"sure you're aware, there's nothing more fleeting than a period of peace.\""
msgstr ""
"\" {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}은 우리에게 영광스러운 전투를 전해주지 않았다. 우리는 다음에 있을 전쟁을 대비해 힘을 회복할 거야. "
"너도 알다시피 평화로운 때가 가장 도망치기 좋지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Dugath/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "62824981-35c8-4d3d-977f-e195bd35d0ad"
msgid "\"I knew you weren't to be trusted!\""
msgstr "\"네가 신뢰받을 수 없다는 걸 알고 있었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Gwart/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "b7bf5542-2017-490a-beeb-ab3d586cecfa"
msgid "\"How does it feel to be chieftain?\""
msgstr "\"족장이 되니 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Gwart/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "89ca32d2-8c3c-420f-bfcd-3552d1c7e2e9"
msgid "\"How's the tribe doing?\""
msgstr "\"너희 부족 상황은 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Gwart/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "61c2e673-7bd5-4143-923e-7e35fed79885"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've no more need of you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너희는 더 이상 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Gwart/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "46af03e7-3841-47e3-90a4-a6a539a250fe"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Gwart/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "006cac3b-39c2-4f0c-af11-fb7cf2b3613f"
msgid ""
"\"Warmest greetings! You're always a welcome {d|c41 Chief Gwart}guest{/d} of "
"the tribe.\""
msgstr "\"안녕한가! 너희는 항상 부족의 {d|c41 Chief Gwart}손님{/d}이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Gwart/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "cc420ba7-06eb-4646-a07d-55a8755b2512"
msgid ""
"\"It isn't easy, I must confess. Many tribesmen claim I'm too young to lead. "
"Every day, I have to prove to the tribe that I'm worthy of this position. "
"But {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} doesn't abandon me. Mark my words — soon, their "
"doubts will disappear!\""
msgstr ""
"\"쉽지 않았던 것을 고백해야겠어. 많은 부족이 내가 부족을 이끌기에는 어리다고 생각했거든. 매일 나는 부족에게 나의 가치를 입증해야 "
"해. 하지만 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}은 나를 버리지 않으셨어. 내 말을 명심해. 의심은 곧 사라질 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Gwart/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "9d333751-3ad9-4055-a4f1-5c3676097c8d"
msgid ""
"\"Armag dealt us a heavy blow. We're trying to recover, restore our "
"strength... But truth be told, it will take a long time for us to return to "
"what we once were.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아르막이 우리에게 한방 먹였어. 우리는 힘을 회복하려고 하고 있지... 하지만 사실 예전으로 돌아가려면 많은 시간이 걸려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/NewChief_Gwart/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "376c5b4b-243f-44b9-b631-e749f75c1ef8"
msgid "\"What? But why?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 하지만 왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "fcfd0cd2-654f-4321-a9ec-b9a3082b1088"
msgid "...press the first plate with their palm."
msgstr "...첫번째 판을 눌렀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "2f326933-31f4-416a-be1a-87d544e55dc4"
msgid "...disarm the first plate's mechanism."
msgstr "...첫번째 판의 기계 장치를 해제했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b5772cec-42fb-4453-85c8-1e767cec8d7d"
msgid "...strike the first plate as hard as possible."
msgstr "...첫번째 판을 있는 힘껏 내리쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "c11f39b6-7ccd-44c4-918f-39158d768de2"
msgid "...press the second plate with their palm."
msgstr "...두번째 판을 눌렀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "d91ef146-89c2-4e69-aaaa-4d4b592db095"
msgid "...disarm the second plate's mechanism."
msgstr "...두번째 판의 기계 장치를 해제했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "38b4aa97-891d-45be-8fa5-da8145146f36"
msgid "...strike the second plate as hard as possible."
msgstr "...두번째 판을 있는 힘껏 내리쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "1bea6cf7-8e4b-4366-83af-dcf914998fc1"
msgid "...press the third plate with their palm."
msgstr "...세번째 판을 눌렀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "0d66d3ae-8983-411d-8396-fce7baaa7737"
msgid "...disarm the third plate's mechanism."
msgstr "...세번째 판의 기계 장치를 해제했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "132393f5-678d-4fdb-a856-50fea5469ce1"
msgid "...strike the third plate as hard as possible."
msgstr "...세번째 판을 있는 힘껏 내리쳤습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0037_Text_String
msgctxt "bc331e01-8542-42c9-b4be-53900ff69c36"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "80d16d2c-7b1c-4e77-9d88-ea3afd7dc4af"
msgid ""
"...step away from the wall — we decided to postpone this trial for later."
msgstr "...벽에서 떨어집니다. 우리는 이 시험을 잠시 연기하기로 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "03af2a90-26b1-4492-a934-3765d21e3732"
msgid ""
"Three palm-size pressure plates were installed by the heavy locked door. One "
"was covered in ice crystals, one had tiny sparks running across it, and the "
"last had smoke rising from it. The inscription above the plates read \"TRIAL "
"BY PAIN.\""
msgstr ""
"손바닥만한 크기의 판이 굳게 잠겨진 문에 설치되어있습니다. 하나는 얼음 조각으로 덮여있었고 두번째는 전기가 파지직 튀기고 있었고 마지막 "
"것은 연기를 뿜고 있었습니다. 판 위에는 이렇게 적혀있습니다. \"고통의 시험\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "41ee809e-e39c-4363-b55e-db8f063e96f7"
msgid ""
"As the ice-encrusted plate slowly sank into the wall, {Name} clenched "
"{mf|his|her} teeth against the cold and pain as icy needles pierced "
"{mf|his|her} palm. When the pressure plate stopped moving with a loud click, "
"{Name} yanked {mf|his|her} hand back from the niche and began rubbing it and "
"breathing on it for warmth."
msgstr ""
"얼음으로 덮여있는 판이 천천히 눌리자, {Name}은(는) 얼음이 손바닥을 송곳처럼 쑤시는 고통을 겪어 이를 악물어야 했습니다. 압력판이 "
"커다란 딸깍 소리와 함께 멈추자, {Name}은(는) {mf|그|그녀}의 손을 빼고 손바닥을 비비며 김을 불었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "ab4a3a1e-2377-4ced-be08-e053bf47a5e8"
msgid ""
"The cold plate slowly sank into the wall. {Name} clenched {mf|his|her} teeth "
"as {mf||s}he endured the icy jaws of frost that gnawed at {mf|his|her} "
"fingers for as long as possible, but the pain became unbearable. {mf|He|She} "
"yanked {mf|his|her} hand away, and when {mf||s}he did, wind blew out with "
"hurricane force, throwing myriad sharp ice crystals out with it. The wind "
"was so strong, in fact, it made {Name} fall flat on {mf|his|her} back. "
"Afterward, a loud click was heard from the niche as the pressure plate "
"stopped moving somewhere inside the wall. The ice crystals that had "
"surrounded the niche melted."
msgstr ""
"차가운 판이 천천히 눌리고, {Name}은(는) 얼음같은 아가리가 당신의 손가락을 물어 뜯는 것을 이 악물고 견뎠지만, 그 고통은 참을 "
"수 없었습니다. {mf|그|그녀}는 손을 뺐고, 그와 함께 태풍처럼 강력한 바람이 불면서 수많은 얼음 송곳을 쏘았습니다. 바람이 너무나 "
"강했기에, {mf|그|그녀}는 뒤로 넘어지고 말았습니다. 그 뒤, 압력판이 벽 너머 어딘가에서 움직이는 것을 멈추며 커다란 딸깍 소리가 "
"들렸습니다. 틈새를 둘러싸고 있던 얼음 조각은 녹아내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "69f78659-e1af-4792-833e-d40d34126f36"
msgid ""
"Why should anyone have to endure any pain when we had a true trap specialist "
"with us? After {Name} tinkered with the mechanism for a bit, the pressure "
"plate sank into the depths of the niche on its own, ice crystals crunching "
"along the way."
msgstr ""
"진정한 덫 해체 전문가와 함께 있는데 왜 고통을 참아야 하나요? {Name}이(가) 잠시 장치를 조작하자, 압력판은 자기 자리를 찾아 "
"들어갔고, 얼음 조각은 떨어져 나갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "b534f4c5-9603-48f2-b985-3fbed27166bf"
msgid ""
"{Name} tried tinkering with the mechanism, but it just wasn't {mf|his|her} "
"lucky day. With a clank, the pressure plate shattered, and hurricane-force "
"wind blew out of the niche, throwing myriad sharp ice crystals out along "
"with it. Nevertheless, a loud click was heard from the niche as the pressure "
"plate stopped moving somewhere inside the wall. The ice crystals that had "
"surrounded the niche melted."
msgstr ""
"{Name}은(는) 장치를 조작하려 했지만, 오늘은 운이 없었습니다. 철컹거리는 소리와 함께 판이 쪼개졌고, 틈새에서 강력한 바람이 불며 "
"작고 많은 얼음 조각을 쏟아냈습니다. 그럼에도 불구하고, 압력판이 벽 너머 어딘가에서 움직이는 것을 멈추며 커다란 딸깍 소리가 "
"들렸습니다. 틈새를 둘러싸고 있던 얼음 조각은 녹아내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "91333462-888c-4c16-86dc-2bd3ff1bc1fb"
msgid ""
"The pressure plate shattered beneath the blow, and a hurricane-force wind "
"blew out of the niche, throwing myriad sharp ice crystals out along with it. "
"The wind was so strong, in fact, it made {Name} fall flat on {mf|his|her} "
"back, bleeding from numerous tiny wounds. Nevertheless, the ice crystals "
"that had surrounded the niche melted."
msgstr ""
"펀치와 함께 판이 눌렸고 강력한 바람이 불어 작고 많은 얼음 조각을 쏟아냈습니다. 바람이 너무나 강해서 {Name}은(는) 바닥에 "
"넘어지고 말았고, 수많은 상처를 입었습니다. 그럼에도 불구하고, 틈새를 둘러싸고 있던 얼음 조각은 녹아내렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "a3e3ac02-a2a2-4577-9d36-101d7330ea88"
msgid ""
"{Name} hissed in pain as {mf||s}he pressed the plate and it slowly sank into "
"the wall. Tiny bolts of lightning crawled along {mf|his|her} hand as it "
"moved, and the air took on the scent of a thunderstorm. When the pressure "
"plate stopped moving with a loud click, {Name} yanked {mf|his|her} hand away "
"from the niche and collapsed to the stone floor, exhausted."
msgstr ""
"{Name}은(는) 고통에 신음하며 판을 눌렀습니다. 적은 전류가 당신의 손에 흘렀고, 공기는 번개가 치는 날의 냄새를 풍겼습니다. "
"딸깍거리는 소리와 함께 판이 멈추자 {Name}이(가) 손을 빼냈고, 지친 채로 돌바닥에 쓰러졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "1ee7320e-e753-4962-aff1-a63cb35ad045"
msgid ""
"{Name} gritted {mf|his|her} teeth in pain as {mf||s}he pressed the plate and "
"it slowly sank into the wall. Tiny bolts of lightning crawled along "
"{mf|his|her} hand as it moved, and the air took on the scent of a "
"thunderstorm. Unable to bear the pain any longer, {Name} yanked {mf|his|her} "
"hand away, and when {mf||s}he did, a bright bolt of lightning struck out "
"from the niche, throwing {Name} against the opposite wall. Meanwhile, a "
"clicking sound was heard from the niche as the plate stopped moving. The "
"tiny bolts of lightning disappeared from the plate's surface."
msgstr ""
"{Name}은(는) 이를 악물며 판을 눌렀습니다. 적은 전류가 당신의 손에 흘렀고 공기는 번개가 치는 날의 냄새를 풍겼습니다. 고통을 "
"참지 못한 {mf|그|그녀}는 손을 빼냈고, 갑자기 밝은 전기구 하나가 반대편의 벽에서 {Name}을(를) 향해 날아왔습니다. 그동안, "
"압력판은 딸깍거리는 소리를 내며 멈추었습니다. 작은 전류들이 압력판의 표면에서 사라졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "38f36c62-792b-46e1-bb0e-3b0d1fe8e078"
msgid ""
"If anyone or anything ever offers to let you take part in an event called "
"\"Trial by Pain,\" I'd say it's in your best interest to decline. Once {Name}"
" had studied the plate closely, {mf||s}he applied {mf|his|her} tools to the "
"task and the plate sank into the niche, crackling with harmless jolts of "
"electricity."
msgstr ""
"누군가 당신에게 고통의 시험이란 것을 참가하라고 한다면, 당신은 분명히 거절했을 것입니다. {Name}이(가) 판을 자세히 조사하고 "
"도구를 사용하여 해제하자, 판이 철컹거리는 소리를 내며 제자리를 찾았고, 아주 약한 전류를 흘려보냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "5c7a2128-3487-4fe0-8cec-8ae56f6919a6"
msgid ""
"After studying the plate from every angle, {Name} went to work to disable "
"it, but something went wrong. The plate cracked and shattered, and a bright "
"bolt of lightning struck out from the niche, throwing {Name} against the "
"opposite wall. The stale air of the dungeon took on the scent of a "
"thunderstorm. Nevertheless, {mf|his|her} efforts had not been in vain — the "
"tiny bolts of lightning disappeared from the plate's surface."
msgstr ""
"여러 방향에서 덫을 살펴 본 후, {Name}은(는) 그것을 해체하려고 했지만 무언가 이상했습니다. 판에서 철컹거리는 소리가 들리면서 "
"틈에서 번개의 구가 {Name}에게 달려들었습니다. 공기는 번개가 치는 날의 냄새를 풍겼습니다. 그럼에도 불구하고 {mf|그|그녀}의 "
"노력은 헛되지 않았습니다. 작은 전류가 판의 표면에서 사라지기 시작합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "4ca874c7-7c7d-4dc9-a77a-9fdc4b53edc4"
msgid ""
"Sometimes brute force really is the best option. {Name} struck the plate as "
"hard as {mf||s}he could, and sparks flew through the air as the stone "
"fragments fell to the floor. Perhaps the creator of this trial thought "
"desperate courage was to be rewarded... or perhaps we just got lucky."
msgstr ""
"가끔 강한 충격이 효과가 있기도 합니다. {Name}이(가) 판을 세게 때렸고, 공기 중으로 전기가 튀면서 돌 파편이 바닥으로 "
"떨어졌습니다. 아마도 이 덫을 만든 자는 필사적인 시도를 하는 자에게 상을 주려고 했나 봅니다... 혹은 우리가 운이 좋았거나요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "962fc630-0922-4685-8b46-063037330700"
msgid ""
"{Name} pressed on the plate, and beads of sweat appeared on {mf|his|her} "
"brow as the air took on the scent of burning meat, but {mf||s}he continue to "
"press. When the pressure plate stopped moving with a loud click, {Name} "
"yanked {mf|his|her} hand away from the niche and began blowing on "
"{mf|his|her} burned fingers."
msgstr ""
"{Name}은(는) 판을 눌렀고, 공기에서 고기 타는 냄새가 나기 시작하며 {mf|그|그녀}의 이마에 땀이 맺혔습니다. 하지만 당신은 "
"계속해서 눌렀습니다. 압력판이 딸깍 소리를 내며 멈춘 뒤, {Name}은(는) 손을 빼내고는 데어버린 손가락을 후후 불었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "d8c4d983-c4be-4846-b052-b656bed2438b"
msgid ""
"{Name} pressed on the plate, and beads of sweat appeared on {mf|his|her} "
"brow as the air took on the scent of burning meat. Unable to endure the "
"pain, {mf||s}he yanked {mf|his|her} hand away, and as {mf||s}he did, a "
"mighty jet of flame shot out of the niche. {Name} fell to the floor and "
"began rolling, attempting to extinguish {mf|his|her} burning clothes. "
"Meanwhile, the plate kept sinking into the wall until it stopped with a loud "
"click. The smoke that had been rising from the plate disappeared."
msgstr ""
"{Name}은(는) 판을 눌렀고, 공기에서 고기 타는 냄새가 나기 시작하며 {mf|그|그녀}의 이마에 땀이 맺혔습니다. 고통을 참지 못한 "
"{mf|그|그녀}는 손을 빼내었고, 그와 동시에 불길이 틈에서 솟구치기 시작합니다. {Name}은(는) 바닥에 넘어져 구르면서 불을 "
"끄려고 했습니다. 그동안, 판은 계속해서 벽 속으로 가라앉았고, 이내 커다란 딸깍 소리와 함께 멈췄습니다. 판에서 나오는 연기는 "
"사라졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "9c9ec199-830b-4ea0-83b8-bff44268bb04"
msgid ""
"Putting one's hand into a furnace isn't the sort of entertainment I'd "
"recommend to any adventurer! Fortunately, we were with {Name}, so there was "
"no need — once {mf||s}he applied {mf|his|her} skills, the plate receded into "
"the niche on its own in a cloud of smoke."
msgstr ""
"위험해 보이는 판에 손을 데는 것은 별로 유쾌한 일이 아닙니다! 운 좋게도, 우리는 그럴 필요가 없었습니다. {Name}과 함께 "
"있었으니까요! 그{mf||녀}의 솜씨를 좀 보여주자, 판이 연기 구름 속에서 제자리를 찾을 때까지 밀려났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "6a762b84-1a70-4b33-bc5f-5a4ce8a52073"
msgid ""
"{Name} tapped the wall around the plate, examining the mechanism closely "
"before setting to work. Alas, {mf|his|her} skills weren't up to the task — "
"the plate cracked and shattered, and a jet of roaring flame shot out of the "
"niche. To avoid becoming a living torch, {Name} fell to the floor and began "
"rolling, attempting to extinguish {mf|his|her} clothes. On the bright side, "
"the smoke that had risen from niche disappeared. This part of the trial was "
"over."
msgstr ""
"{Name}은(는) 판 주위의 벽을 두드리며 장치를 조사하기 시작했습니다. 아아, {mf|그|그녀}의 기술은 그 일에 적합하지 않았습니다 "
"— 판에 금이 가더니 부숴졌고, 불길이 구멍에서 솟았습니다. 타 죽기 싫었던 {Name}은(는) 바닥을 구르며 옷에 붙은 불을 끄기 "
"시작했습니다. 다행히 판에서 흘러나오는 연기는 사라졌습니다. 시험은 끝이 났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "73402a5f-b601-4aaf-981e-69e94233df0f"
msgid ""
"Sometimes brute force is the best option, and sometimes it's not. As soon as "
"{Name} struck the plate, it struck back. Like the breath of a dragon, a "
"mighty jet of flame shot out of the niche. It was definitely too hot for "
"{Name}, who fell to the floor and began rolling, attempting to extinguish "
"{mf|his|her} burning clothes."
msgstr ""
"가끔 강한 충격이 효과가 있기도 하지만 항상 그런 것은 아닙니다. {Name}이(가) 판을 세게 때리자 드래곤 브레스처럼 강력한 불길이 "
"솟았습니다. 그것은 {Name}에게 너무나 뜨거웠고, {mf|그|그녀}는 바닥을 구르며 옷에 붙은 불을 끄기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "8d633c81-0ce6-4c58-9f91-674be3e412b6"
msgid ""
"We'd dealt with the first plate — only two more remained. We asked one of "
"our companions to..."
msgstr "우리는 첫번째 판은 해제했고 이제는 두개가 남았습니다. 우리는 다른 한명이 시도하도록 시켰습니다. 그 자는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "64710bed-21fc-4196-9f69-9dbacb2a3d37"
msgid ""
"Two plates down, one to go. We chose one of our companions, who decided to..."
msgstr "두개의 판이 눌러졌고 하나가 남았습니다. 우리는 다른 한명이 시도하도록 시켰습니다. 그 자는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "b25de2f1-aecb-4327-a896-69e5414f1a25"
msgid ""
"There it was, the last plate. We'd passed the Trial of Pain. The stone door "
"moved aside, opening the path to new trials and new pains..."
msgstr ""
"마지막 판이 눌러졌습니다. 우리는 고통의 시험을 통과했습니다. 돌문은 옆으로 열리며 새로운 시련과 고통으로 향하는 길을 보여주었습니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "b186b403-3f23-448b-a577-3c251d55f0d6"
msgid "We chose one of our companions, who decided to..."
msgstr "우리는 다른 한명이 시도하도록 시켰습니다. 그 자는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfPain/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "936a972a-c8cf-4655-a5c1-8be88f94fa11"
msgid ""
"As we stepped away from the wall, all of the plates returned to their "
"starting positions. We could afford to spend time recovering, but when we "
"returned, we'd have to start over from the beginning."
msgstr ""
"우리는 벽에서 한걸음 물러섰고 모든 판들이 원래대로 복구되었습니다. 우리는 회복할 시간이 있었지만 우리가 돌아왔을 때는 처음부터 다시 "
"시작해야 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "6514a3e6-c089-4344-aefe-3ec0bf706a55"
msgid "...tried to pick the lock on the door."
msgstr "...문의 자물쇠를 따려고 시도했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "26e4ec3d-b0cb-4adc-97fa-ad4ee683e189"
msgid "...explored the labyrinth in search of the right path to the center."
msgstr "...옳은 길을 찾으려 미궁을 탐험했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "deb7e1e8-3fa0-42aa-8437-04fda53d381f"
msgid ""
"...started pushing the statue in random directions without wasting time "
"exploring the labyrinth."
msgstr "...미궁을 탐험하지 않고 아무 조각상이나 누르기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a2cb2158-58a5-4bdc-9e10-20bd6a29e0e4"
msgid "...started pushing the statue along the marked path."
msgstr "...표시된 길의 조각상을 누르기 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0006_Text_String
msgctxt "d24ecb63-3310-40b1-80f3-e2fc6be8efe9"
msgid "...kept pushing the statue along the marked path."
msgstr "...표시된 길의 조각상을 계속해서 눌렀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "e8acafc8-9177-4537-be2a-a80a88d6c0eb"
msgid "...tried to cheat by standing on the pressure plate ourselves."
msgstr "...눌림 장치가 있는 곳에 올라가는 꼼수를 부렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "ac2b01f7-03b7-497e-ac9a-aac2f26adf71"
msgid "...ignored the potential danger and stood on the pressure plate."
msgstr "...잠재적인 위험을 무시하고 눌림 장치 위에 올라갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "95c61f59-a556-418e-b545-36ad97cf9d3a"
msgid ""
"...started breaking through the walls to make a straight path to the center "
"of the room."
msgstr "...길을 내려고 벽을 부수었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "ce64f20c-bcea-491a-a61d-16f9f55fd8b8"
msgid "...kept breaking walls and pushing the statue toward the center."
msgstr "...계속해서 벽을 부수었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "0e41438c-9e8b-4f04-915f-19ab7b4d9fb0"
msgid "...decided to find another solution rather than take any chances."
msgstr "...기회를 잡기보다는 다른 시도를 하기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "5bb22c5a-18c5-4465-bbf0-ec38bcebda67"
msgid "...exited the room to warm up a bit."
msgstr "...잠시 휴식을 취하러 방을 나갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Answer_0061_Text_String
msgctxt "45518f74-2ea5-426e-98a6-653a19527942"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "35bbd9c2-9538-4cf9-acf6-10fc3343a015"
msgid ""
"Just one quick glance at the door was enough for us to realize that even the "
"best lockpick in the world wouldn't be enough here. Even if the door wasn't "
"covered in a thick layer of ice, we couldn't find any trace of a mechanism "
"to work on! It seemed this door would only open by using the pressure plate "
"in the center of the room."
msgstr ""
"문을 슬쩍 보기만 해도 자물쇠는 절대 딸 수 없었을 것 같았습니다. 문이 두꺼운 얼음으로 덮여있어서 우리는 기계장치가 어디에 있는지도 "
"몰랐습니다! 문은 방 중앙에 있는 판을 눌러야 열릴 것 같았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "9fdc76e3-56ba-4236-ad72-19ca531bcd85"
msgid ""
"A thick layer of ice covered the door, but that didn't discourage us — we "
"kept looking for a mechanism to open the door anyway. But alas, our efforts "
"resulted in nothing more than frostbitten fingers from probing the cracks "
"and fissures in the surface of the ice. It seemed the pressure plate in the "
"center of the room was the only way to open the door."
msgstr ""
"문이 두꺼운 얼음으로 덮여있었지만 우리는 포기하지 않았습니다. 우리는 문을 열 수 있는 장치를 계속해서 찾았습니다. 하지만 장치를 찾으려 "
"얼음의 표면을 만지느라 손가락은 곱아버렸습니다. 아무것도 찾지 못한 우리는 방 중앙의 판을 누르는 것만이 유일한 방법임을 깨달았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6039f1e1-fe80-4e91-b39c-19b20e92c70b"
msgid ""
"The labyrinth was complex, with numerous turns and dead ends. No easy "
"task... for an eight-year-old! We found the right path in a heartbeat and "
"left signs marking the way along the ice walls. The hard part was still "
"ahead — we had to drag the ice statue through the maze without losing any "
"limbs to frostbite!"
msgstr ""
"미궁은 복잡했고 구불구불한 길과 막힌 길이 많았습니다. 80살 먹은 자에게는 전혀 쉬운 일이 아니었습니다! 우리는 옳은 길을 바로 찾았고 "
"얼음 벽 사이에 표시를 해놓았습니다. 하지만 여전히 쉽지 않았습니다. 우리는 팔다리에 동상에 걸리지 않고 얼음 조각상을 끌고 가야 "
"했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "0b767716-b5ab-47e9-a533-77159e3e9ab9"
msgid ""
"Those ancient barbarians could really construct a labyrinth! We almost froze "
"to death before we figured out all the forks, dead ends, and turnabouts. We "
"did finally manage to find the right path, leaving signs along the ice walls "
"to mark the way. All that was left was to drag the ice statue along the path!"
msgstr ""
"고대의 야만인은 완벽한 미궁을 지어놓았습니다! 우리는 길을 헤매느라 얼어 죽을 뻔했습니다. 우리는 마침내 옳은 길을 찾았고 얼음 벽에 "
"표시를 해놓았습니다. 남은 것은 얼음 조각상을 옮기는 것이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "9a7fc30c-77b2-4bf7-8669-76b6e28d5ac2"
msgid ""
"The statue wasn't heavy at all. It slid easily along the floor — the problem "
"was none of us knew which direction it should slide in! We lost a lot of "
"time wandering the nooks and crannies of the labyrinth before eventually "
"finding ourselves and the ice tiger in a dead end. It was then that we "
"realized we wouldn't be able to rely on pure luck — we'd need to find "
"another solution."
msgstr ""
"조각상은 전혀 무겁지 않았습니다. 그것은 쉽게 미끄러졌지만 문제는 어느 방향으로 밀어야 할지 모른다는 것이었습니다! 우리는 미궁을 "
"헤매느라 시간을 많이 소비했고 마침내 얼음 호랑이를 막다른 길에 가져다 놓았습니다. 그 순간 우리는 그저 운에 맡기는 것은 불가능하다는 "
"것을 깨달았고 우리는 다른 해결책을 찾아야 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "1a344d5c-6f3f-49b4-82f1-a48f811b0d92"
msgid ""
"The ice statue barely moved along the stone floor, and the cold it radiated "
"bit our fingers through even the thickest gloves. We nearly froze to death "
"dragging it back and forth around the labyrinth before we were exhausted and "
"found ourselves in a dead end. Acting haphazardly wouldn't be an option — we "
"needed a plan."
msgstr ""
"얼음 조각상은 돌바닥에서 거의 움직이지 않았고 조각상에서 나오는 차가운 기운은 두꺼운 장갑을 뚫었습니다. 우리는 그것을 미궁 속에서 밀고 "
"다니느라 얼어 죽을 뻔했고 마침내 막다른 길에 도착했습니다. 위험한 행동은 불필요했습니다. 우리는 계획이 필요했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "c498482c-44b2-43f2-aafc-ec9cb8c16c7f"
msgid ""
"It certainly wasn't easy dragging that ice tiger along the stone floor, but "
"at least we didn't have to fight any real tigers!"
msgstr "얼음 조각상을 돌바닥 위에서 밀고 다니는 것은 쉽지 않았지만 진짜 호랑이와 싸우는 것보다는 나았습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "a657d245-337f-49af-a554-400597430d0f"
msgid ""
"The ice tiger merrily ran through the labyrinth — pushing it was much easier "
"than expected. But the labyrinth itself was extremely tricky — sometimes, to "
"get five steps closer to the center, we had to make a loop longer than the "
"whole room's perimeter!"
msgstr ""
"얼음 호랑이는 미궁 속을 달렸습니다. 조각상을 미는 것은 생각보다 쉬웠습니다. 하지만 미궁은 정말 복잡했습니다. 가끔 중앙으로 아주 "
"가까이 왔지만 우리는 한참을 돌아가야 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "51e1a7dd-8308-45e8-b211-ec5ccdb0f0cd"
msgid ""
"The ice tiger barely moved through the labyrinth — pushing the heavy statue "
"along the rough stone floor was no picnic. And the labyrinth itself wasn't "
"helping — it was so tricky that sometimes, to get five steps closer to the "
"center, we had to make a loop longer than the whole room's perimeter!"
msgstr ""
"얼음 조각상은 돌바닥에서 거의 움직이지 않았고 무거운 얼음 호랑이를 미는 것은 놀이가 아니었습니다. 미궁이 있어 정말 힘들었습니다. "
"가끔은 너무나 복잡해서 가끔 중앙으로 아주 가까이 왔지만 우리는 한참을 돌아가야 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "5826f0fe-c66c-456e-979b-5f3a452c6d57"
msgid ""
"We kept pushing that ice tiger right in its broad rear end, moving it ever "
"forward — it wasn't too hard, all told."
msgstr "우리는 얼음 호랑이의 넓찍한 엉덩이 쪽을 밀고 앞쪽에서 끌었더니 마침내 움직였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "900f19f2-b9f9-487e-9a75-2ae8342134fc"
msgid ""
"Exhausted, shaking from the cold, we tried to breathe warmth into our frozen "
"fingers while spitting curses through chattering teeth as we kept pushing "
"that damned tiger in its broad rear end."
msgstr "우리는 망할 호랑이의 엉덩이를 밀면서 추위에 떨며 이를 부딪혔고 우리는 얼어붙은 손가락을 후후 불어야 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "4c333254-04fa-429d-9057-2f0c3bc9c505"
msgid ""
"Pushing the heavy ice tiger along the rough floor was a thankless job. "
"Fighting a real tiger would have been easier, I'd bet! The cold radiated by "
"the magical ice gnawed at us every bit as much as real tiger fangs."
msgstr ""
"무거운 얼음 호랑이를 미는 것은 전혀 쉽지 않았습니다. 진짜 호랑이와 싸우는 것이 훨씬 나았을 것입니다! 얼음 호랑이의 아가리는 냉기를 "
"계속해서 우리에게 뿜었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "548d4acd-443c-4876-9f17-8088ceec5c11"
msgid ""
"If you want to pass a barbarian trial, you have to think like a barbarian! "
"The inscription over the door was clear — the trial was meant to prove "
"strength, not mental prowess or puzzle-solving skills! So we went with a "
"barbarian approach and began breaking through ice walls, making a path "
"straight to the center."
msgstr ""
"야만인의 시험을 통과하고 싶다면 진짜 야만인이 되어 생각해야 합니다! 문에 적힌 비문의 내용은 명료했습니다. 시험은 정신력이나 퍼즐을 "
"푸는 지혜가 아닌 힘을 증명하는 것이었습니다! 그래서 우리는 야만인처럼 얼음 벽을 부수어 중앙으로 가는 길을 만들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "ecfd4cdb-ebac-427b-9564-005d03098618"
msgid ""
"As we stepped on the pressure plate, it was like some sort of gate to hell "
"opened beneath us! A roaring pillar of flame erupted from underground, and "
"in the next moment, we found ourselves rolling on the floor screaming in "
"pain. When we finally got back on our feet, we saw that both the labyrinth "
"and the statue had melted, and the door was open. The labyrinth's builders "
"may have punished us harshly for cheating, but at least they left us with a "
"way forward."
msgstr ""
"눌림판 위에 올라섰을 때 우리 밑에 지옥문이 열리는 것 같았습니다! 불기둥이 지하에서 뿜어졌고 우리는 비명을 지르며 바닥을 굴러야 "
"했습니다. 우리가 마침내 일어섰을 때는 미궁과 조각상이 모두 녹아 문이 열린 것을 보았습니다. 미궁의 설계자는 우리를 압박해서 속임수를 "
"쓰게 했지만 그래도 그들은 앞으로 가는 길을 놓아주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "8b72e082-cf99-4b3f-b5b9-8f852879766d"
msgid ""
"Having come to the pressure plate, someone chanced to look up and noticed a "
"huge spot of black soot on the ceiling above it. The labyrinth's builders "
"must have anticipated our plan and arranged something special for anyone "
"trying to cheat their way through. Taking that into consideration, we..."
msgstr ""
"눌림판 위에 가자 누군가 위에서 거대한 검은 점이 천장에 물들어있는 것을 보았습니다. 미궁의 설계자는 우리의 계획을 알아차리고 속임수를 "
"쓰려는 자에게 특별한 무언가를 준비한 것이었습니다. 생각에 잠긴 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "df6b79f2-e71b-4ffa-8ec5-808c6b66abcf"
msgid ""
"The ice tiger obviously didn't want to enter the labyrinth — no matter how "
"hard we pushed, the statue barely moved and had to be squeezed through the "
"mending gaps in the walls. Once, when we were careless enough to leave it "
"too long in the middle of a gap, we ended up having to cut it free from the "
"ice wall that tried to consume it. The cold that radiated from the magical "
"ice tore at us like real tiger claws. But finally, we downed the last wall "
"and pushed the tiger onto the pressure plate."
msgstr ""
"얼음 호랑이는 미궁에 들어가기 싫어하는 것 같았습니다. 아무리 세게 밀어도 조각상은 움직이지 않았고 고정되었습니다. 한번은 우리가 그것을 "
"계속 방치하고 나니 우리는 얼음 벽은 녹아내려 자유로워졌습니다. 뿜어져나오는 냉기는 호랑이처럼 매서웠습니다. 하지만 마침내 우리는 마지막 "
"벽에 도착하고 호랑이를 눌림판 위에 올렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0044_Text_String
msgctxt "8ec6c4e8-1f27-4e88-a425-ef7a8c77f927"
msgid ""
"Before the biting frost could turn us into icicles, we began breaking the "
"ice walls and pushing the statue through the gaps, moving ever closer to the "
"center. Finally, the last wall fell, and we pushed the ice tiger onto the "
"pressure plate."
msgstr ""
"냉기가 우리를 얼리기 전에 우리는 얼음 벽을 부수었고 우리는 얼음 조각상을 중앙으로 밀고 갔습니다. 마침내 마지막 벽이 무너졌고 우리는 "
"얼음 호랑이를 눌림판 위에 두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "108e5bf7-b41f-4211-8935-92a2051f2ca3"
msgid ""
"After the frost of the labyrinth, the cool dungeon seemed practically warm "
"and cozy. But as soon as we crossed the threshold, the magical ice instantly "
"disappeared — all our efforts had been in vain. I shuddered at the thought "
"of having to return to that frozen place, but there seemed to be no other "
"way."
msgstr ""
"미궁의 냉기를 겪고 나니 차가운 던전은 따뜻하고 안락했습니다. 하지만 우리가 임계점을 넘었을 때 마법의 얼음은 곧 녹았습니다. 우리의 "
"노력은 헛되었습니다. 나는 떨면서 다른 길은 없으니 그곳에 다시 돌아가야 한다는 생각을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "8d31ad46-e7a2-42fb-9331-353f60795160"
msgid ""
"We felt a cold breeze as soon as we entered the room. Ice shards appeared on "
"the walls and floor, and a labyrinth of thick ice walls grew up around us. "
"The walls were waist-high to a human, but they were head-high to me! The "
"center of the room had a pressure plate on the floor, while the entrance to "
"the labyrinth had a massive pedestal carrying a tiger statue made of ice. "
"The exit was at the far end of the room — locked, of course — and the "
"inscription above it read \"TRIAL OF STRENGTH.\""
msgstr ""
"우리는 차가운 바람을 방에 들어서자 느꼈습니다. 고드름이 벽과 바닥에 보였고 미궁은 사방에 두꺼운 얼음 벽이었습니다. 벽은 허리춤만한 "
"높이였지만 나에게는 너무나 높았습니다! 방의 중앙은 눌림판이 바닥에 있었고 미궁의 입구에 얼음으로 만들어진 호랑이 조각상이 거대한 "
"받침대에 놓여있었습니다. 출구는 방의 구석에 잠겨있었습니다. 출구에 적힌 비문은 힘의 시험이라고 쓰여있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "60929b31-07c7-4532-87b9-cd892451afef"
msgid ""
"The air in the room was cool, and the temperature dropped with each passing "
"moment. It seemed like the magic was stealing all warmth from the room bit "
"by bit. Wasting no more time, we..."
msgstr "방안의 공기는 차가웠고 걸어갈 수록 기온이 떨어졌습니다. 마법이 옴기를 빼앗는 것 같았습니다. 시간 낭비할 것 없이 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "433be61d-1bf3-4b26-b26f-970080d2a49b"
msgid ""
"The temperature kept dropping. The magical cold penetrated our clothes like "
"cruel fingers clawing at our flesh. Our teeth were chattering. We..."
msgstr ""
"온도는 계속해서 떨어졌습니다. 마법의 추위가 우리의 옷을 뚫고 잔인하게 우리의 살을 파고들었습니다. 우리는 이를 부딪혔습니다. 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "16a389ba-1f22-4c76-aab2-dc35f640e1e0"
msgid ""
"The frost that engulfed the room made our noses and cheeks tingle. Our "
"fingertips went numb, and goose bumps rose on our skin. We needed to figure "
"out this puzzle as soon as possible. We..."
msgstr ""
"방에 들어선 추위는 우리의 코위 뺨을 붉게 물들였습니다. 우리의 손끝은 감각이 없어졌고 살에는 닭살이 돋았습니다. 우리는 이 퍼즐을 곧 "
"풀어야 했습니다. 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "b663572f-2112-406e-a816-321f8d653f9f"
msgid ""
"Our breath fogged from our mouths, condensing into shards of ice on our "
"eyebrows and hair. We needed to solve this puzzle as soon as possible if we "
"wanted to avoid becoming decorative ice statues ourselves. Keeping that in "
"mind, we..."
msgstr ""
"우리의 입에서 김이 나왔습니다. 고드름이 눈썹과 머리에 생기기 시작했습니다. 얼음 조각상이 되기 싫다면 우리는 이 퍼즐을 곧 풀어야 "
"했습니다. 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "a23d0ff8-7bf4-4bb1-8b12-b1879364bd25"
msgid ""
"The frost was unbearable. We'd lost feeling in our fingers, and our skin "
"started to turn blue. The magical ice seemed to suck more than just warmth "
"from us — it was like it was sucking the life from our bodies. No longer "
"just a puzzle, the labyrinth had become a deadly trap. With our strength "
"almost gone, we..."
msgstr ""
"추위는 버틸 수 없었습니다. 우리의 손은 감각이 없어졌고 피부는 파랗게 질렸습니다. 마법의 추위가 우리의 온기를 빼앗는 것 같았습니다. "
"마치 우리의 몸에서 생명을 빼앗는 것 같았습니다. 미궁은 퍼즐이 아닌 죽음의 덫이었습니다. 힘이 빠진 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "ad84d7d3-0dc6-45ac-a4b3-dee07b727ce4"
msgid ""
"It proved harder than we'd thought — the walls were thick, and the magical "
"ice radiated a cold that could penetrate our thickest clothes. On top of "
"that, once we made it halfway to the center of the room, we looked back and "
"saw that the gaps in the walls were slowly mending themselves with new "
"layers of ice. We reopened the gaps again so we could push the ice tiger "
"through, and we started to think on what to do next — it seemed there were "
"still a lot of walls ahead of us."
msgstr ""
"생각보다 어려웠습니다. 벽은 두꺼웠고 마법의 추위는 우리의 옷을 뚫었습니다. 우리가 방 중앙으로 길을 만들었을 때 우리는 벽이 새로운 "
"얼음의 벽을 만드는 것을 보았습니다. 우리는 다시 벽을 부수어 얼음 호랑이를 밀었고 다음에 무엇을 할지 계속해서 생각했습니다. 여전히 "
"많은 벽이 우리 앞에 있는 것 같았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "3f26fa58-68a0-45b1-b3cd-35ac4ac6cf1a"
msgid ""
"The inventive folks who created this labyrinth must have been trying to mock "
"anyone who underwent this trial — one moment, the right path led us almost "
"to the center, and the next it led us in the opposite direction, almost out "
"to the edge of the room. But we didn't give up, taking heart in the thought "
"that Armag must have had to do the same."
msgstr ""
"이 미궁을 만든 똑똑한 친구는 이 시험을 풀려는 사람을 엿먹이고 싶었을 것입니다. 거의 방 중앙으로 가게 되었을 때 우리는 반대편으로 "
"가야 했고 거의 방의 구석으로 가게 되었습니다. 하지만 아르막도 똑같이 해야 했다는 것을 생각하니 우리는 포기하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "abc64319-b35d-4a33-8685-5ae1b52c537b"
msgid ""
"Our path took us through a wide loop and a long, curving passage, which "
"brought us closer to the center before taking us far away from it and back "
"again, but we finally managed to push the statue into the center of the "
"room, right onto the pressure plate."
msgstr ""
"우리의 길은 너무나 길고 구불구불해서 중앙에 가까이 간다고 생각했을 때는 중앙으로부터 멀어졌지만 우리는 마침내 조각상을 방 중앙의 눌림판 "
"위로 밀었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/TestOfStrength-NEW/Cue_0063_Text_String
msgctxt "e8b7e875-3fe2-471d-834f-d61caec02381"
msgid ""
"The pressure plate trembled beneath the statue's weight, and then a roaring "
"pillar of flame erupted all the way to the ceiling! The ice tiger evaporated "
"in a heartbeat, along with the entire labyrinth! The room warmed rapidly, "
"even becoming a bit hot. The stone door opened, and the path was clear."
msgstr ""
"눌림판은 조각상의 무게로 떨렸고 불기둥이 쏟아나와 천장까지 솟았습니다! 얼음 호랑이는 미궁과 함께 순식간에 녹아내렸습니다! 방은 갑자기 "
"따뜻해졌고 조금은 더워졌습니다. 돌 문은 열렸고 길이 보였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "194b628d-1503-4674-9f53-04faa3311b23"
msgid "\"I'd like to ask you some questions.\""
msgstr "\"몇 가지 질문을 하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f8a1aa4c-4d87-4d5d-a192-32fbffa17182"
msgid "\"Let me tell you of my deeds — they'll make my worth clear.\""
msgstr "\"내가 한 일을 말해주지. 내 가치를 입증해 줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f126dccf-514f-4127-9759-032610e481d5"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm always ready to prove myself in an honest battle!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 항상 전투에서 나를 입증할 준비가 되어있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "c05f880f-b933-4ada-94ed-18efa5a8a573"
msgid "\"I'll prove myself worthy, but let me prepare first.\""
msgstr "\"내 가치를 입증하겠다. 하지만 먼저 준비를 해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "eacebeff-b5d4-4639-ad3e-28eca14771dd"
msgid "\"Where's Armag now?\""
msgstr "\"지금 아르막은 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "d1ac58f0-db7d-4726-acd0-8e7ff2a536e0"
msgid "\"Tell me about ancient Armag.\""
msgstr "\"고대 아르막에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "0e344805-c1cc-4dee-91f5-a600d53ae9ba"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"넌 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "df89620f-0ef5-461d-a648-ff898f35380c"
msgid "\"Thank you for your answers.\""
msgstr "\"대답해주어 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "5a0971bf-2ab0-43c1-aedd-42e9e4f84312"
msgid ""
"\"I killed the Stag Lord, leader of a large bandit gang, and took his fort!\""
msgstr "\"나는 도적 집단 두목인 수사슴 군주를 죽이고 그의 요새를 빼앗았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "695205d5-b929-499c-b630-e3dd77d00c87"
msgid ""
"\"I killed Hargulka and Tartuk — a troll king and a kobold king respectively "
"— and destroyed their city!\""
msgstr "\"나는 트롤 왕 하굴카와 코볼트 왕 타툭을 죽이고 그들의 도시를 파괴했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "52ba9f0b-4dfc-4a9d-ac3f-523d8286cb8f"
msgid "\"I plundered Trobold, the underground monster city!\""
msgstr "\"나는 지하 괴물의 도시인 트로볼트로 쳐들어갔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "c9287165-8c6b-41d5-a4d7-1591f014a673"
msgid "\"I killed Vordakai, ancient necromancer and ruler of the cyclopes!\""
msgstr "\"나는 고대의 사령술사이자 사이클롭스 지배자인 보다카이를 죽였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "4f9a8a70-12c8-4484-92c5-21392dbef6b7"
msgid "\"I defeated Vordakai, ancient necromancer and ruler of the cyclopes!\""
msgstr "\"나는 고대의 사령술사이자 사이클롭스 지배자인 보다카이를 물리쳤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "e575b1a2-eb12-4dd9-a268-f9bc8023b3c5"
msgid "\"I decimated the Longtails, a might lizardfolk tribe!\""
msgstr "\"나는 강력한 도마뱀 부족의 긴꼬리를 처형했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "0af69fbb-afdc-4ca3-95df-439e7682c2f0"
msgid ""
"\"I destroyed a whole battle party of mighty Tiger Lords, led by the cleric "
"known as Dugath!\""
msgstr "\"나는 호랑이 군주 부족 전투원 모두와 성직자로 알려진 두가스를 물리쳤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "6a428f50-b8c1-45cf-928d-cddd47b0296f"
msgid "\"I serve Gorum myself — all I do is in his name!\""
msgstr "\"나는 고룸을 섬기고 그를 위해 일한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "a50e8d0e-7c21-42aa-82f3-3aa398c89e82"
msgid ""
"\"I'm the ruler of the Stolen Lands! No one dares doubt my glory! You can "
"clearly see I'm worthy to enter, cleric — step aside!\""
msgstr "\"나는 도둑맞은 땅의 지배자다! 누구도 나의 영광을 의심하지 못한다! 내가 들어갈 자격이 있다는 것을 알았겠지. 비켜라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "500b8447-7e16-4e82-ad8d-ff9942f6a5d1"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0085_Text
msgctxt "eaa610fc-f6b3-4005-904c-bb3d46b1f3dd"
msgid "\"I'm ready. Listen well.\""
msgstr "\"나는 준비됐다. 말해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "34d022f1-61eb-407f-bdfb-504ac8272bdb"
msgid "\"Hold on — I must prepare myself first.\""
msgstr "\"기다려. 우선 준비를 해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "9603c069-bad8-4f59-86af-92a2e81b2ec8"
msgid ""
"\"The villagers of Lake Silverstep disrespected me, so I killed them all!\""
msgstr "\"실버스텝 호수 마을 사람들이 나를 모욕해서 그들을 모두 죽였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0092_Text
msgctxt "ea935cf9-e0ba-4651-96f4-4ce69281f74b"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I tire of idle talk. Let me show you my worth in an honest fight!"
"\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 수다는 질렸어. 정당한 싸움으로 내 가치를 입증하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0099_Text
msgctxt "44042331-c434-44c8-a2ef-f5bd7b69c71e"
msgid "\"Regongar! Shut up, put away your weapon and stand down!\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르! 닥쳐. 무기를 치우고 가만히 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "965584b4-de88-4c92-a13f-891b484f1b41"
msgid ""
"\"Patience, Reg. I want to punch him too, but first I have a few questions.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 레곤가르. 나도 저 녀석에게 한방 먹여주고 싶지만 먼저 질문을 해야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0101_Text
msgctxt "635eafbc-bd95-4783-ab09-81d4af262db8"
msgid "[Attack] \"He's pissing me off too. Attack!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"짜증나는 녀석이군. 공격!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Answer_0109_Text
msgctxt "7c7db654-c838-4558-89c6-e5710d64f3fe"
msgid "[Lie] \"I serve Gorum myself — all I do is in his name!\""
msgstr "[거짓말]\"나는 고룸을 섬기고 그를 위해 일한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "b7bfb9cc-d805-478b-9586-d7b042e5d514"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian who stands before you is old but not decrepit — his tanned, "
"muscular body seems to be made of bronze. His eyes have no whites, no iris — "
"just black metal, and reflections of invisible fire dance upon their shining "
"surfaces.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 서있는 야만인은 나이가 들었지만 약해 보이지는 않은 것 같습니다. 그의 근육질 몸은 구릿빛입니다. 그의 눈은 흰자가 없이 "
"검은 색이었고 표면에는 보이지 않는 불길이 춤을 추는 모습이 반사됩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "b446c2df-bd9c-4f7b-9a38-166b5407cd0d"
msgid ""
"\"I greet you in the temple of {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}. I'm Zorek, keeper of this "
"tomb. If you've come this far, you certainly have potential... But the time "
"has come to determine if you're worthy to enter the inner sanctum!\""
msgstr ""
"\" {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}의 사원에 온 것을 환영한다. 나는 무덤지기인 조렉이다. 여기까지 왔다면 너는 강하겠지... 하지만 우선 "
"네가 성소에 들어갈 만한 가치가 있다는 것을 입증해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "877cc93d-2e99-4793-a60e-e1082de9d42d"
msgid "\"Take as long as you need. I'm in no hurry.\""
msgstr "\"충분한 시간을 가져라. 서두르지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "4d1ebe56-57d2-471e-88f0-d5a8562d301b"
msgid ""
"\"When I was young, as you are now, I also craved knowledge. It was only "
"after serving Our Lord in Iron for some time that I realized that all the "
"world's knowledge is but smoke on the water and dust in the wind. I can "
"indulge your curiosity, but you should know that words can bear no true "
"wisdom. Such wisdom is only found in the clashing of metal, the roaring of "
"fire, and the crunching of bone!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너처럼 젊었을 때 나도 배우는 것에 욕심이 많았지. 쇠의 신을 섬긴 직후 나는 모든 세계의 지식은 물위의 연기이자 바람 속의 "
"먼지 뿐이라는 것을 깨달았지. 네 호기심을 만족시켜줄 수 있지만 말에는 지혜가 없다는 것을 알아야 해. 그런 지혜는 검을 부딪히고 불의 "
"고함과 부서지는 뼈 소리에서만 들을 수 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "58d93a79-aed0-469d-b93d-629c436e5ebf"
msgid "\"No need to thank me. Nothing I told you will help you in battle.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 고마워 할 필요는 없어. 전투는 스스로 하는 것이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "8fcc36c0-d2a0-4abf-9000-313396bb4a1d"
msgid ""
"\"The same place he's been all these ages — in his burial chamber, inside "
"the sacred sword in which {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} placed his soul. Or were you "
"asking after the bold boy who dared take the great chieftain's name? That "
"one proved his worth in an honest fight, so I let him enter. I know not what "
"happened to him after taking the sword, but he never came back.\""
msgstr ""
"\"수 백 년동안 그는 같은 곳에 있었다. 이 무덤에, 또한 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 그의 영혼을 불어넣은 신성한 검 속에. 아니면 "
"위대한 족장의 이름을 감히 가져가려 한 소년을 묻는 것이냐? 전투에서 힘을 증명했기에 그를 보내주었다. 그 검을 취한 이후로 그에게 무슨 "
"일이 일어났는지 모르지만 그는 오지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "91a8bb8c-3b3f-42d5-84cb-7458693daf19"
msgid ""
"\"I never expected the great chieftain's glory would be forgotten among "
"mortals! Listen well, then — Armag was a mighty berserker, and a valiant "
"warlord who led our tribe from one victory to another. Undefeated, he grew "
"too proud and began bragging that even Death herself was unable to lay him "
"low. His words offended {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, so she sent her servants "
"against him. {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} wouldn't accept that and chose to challenge "
"the goddess of death. While Armag fought armies of monsters on earth, the "
"two deities fought each other over his soul. And though Armag's wounds were "
"too horrible for him to survive, Gorum wouldn't let Pharasma take him — "
"instead, he placed Armag's soul into his sacred sword, Ovinrbaane, the very "
"sword that's held in this tomb.\""
msgstr ""
"\"족장의 영광이 필멸자 사이에서 잊혀졌을 줄은 몰랐군! 잘 들어라. 아르막은 우리 부족을 끝없는 승리로 이끈 강대한 광전사이자 용맹한 "
"군주였소. 한 번도 진 적이 없었기에 자만심이 생겼고, 죽음의 여신조차 자신을 죽일 수 없을거라 자랑하고 다녔다네. 그의 말은 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}에겐 치욕적이었을 테지, 그래서 그녀는 하수인들을 보내 아르막을 추격했고. {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}"
"은 그것을 받아들일 수 없어 죽음의 여신에게 도전했지. 지상에서 아르막이 괴물의 군세와 전투를 벌이던 동안, 두 신들 또한 그의 영혼을 "
"두고 싸웠다. 결국 아르막의 상처는 그가 살아남기엔 너무나도 깊었음에도, 고룸은 파라즈마가 그를 거두어가도록 놔두지 않았지. 대신, 그는 "
"아르막의 영혼을 그의 신성한 검 오빈르베인에 불어넣어 바로 이 무덤에 묻었소.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "bf038021-596e-4e4a-bb4b-49541d4cc9a8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Zorek, cleric of {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} and advisor to the great chieftain "
"Armag. I stayed with him as he ascended to his glory. I saw every step on "
"his path. I fought beside him in each of his battles! When I was slain "
"beside him on the bloody field of his final battle, Gorum made me Armag's "
"guardian. My god ordered me to build this tomb and keep my chieftain's peace "
"until the day when a mighty warrior would arrive, one worthy to wield the "
"sacred sword that holds Armag's soul. Few people have entered this tomb over "
"the centuries, and none have exited. That boy was the first to manage to "
"pass me — do you think you can be the second?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 조렉이고 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}의 성직자이자 아르막의 보좌관이었지. 나는 영광을 위해 그의 곁에 머물렀다네. 그가 걸어온 "
"길을 모두 알고 있지. 나는 그의 곁에서 항상 싸웠어! 내가 피가 난무하는 마지막 전투에서 죽음을 당할 때 고룸이 나를 아르막의 수호자로 "
"만들어주었지. 나의 신은 나에게 명령해 무덤을 짓고 위대한 전사가 도착하여 아르막의 영혼이 담긴 신성한 검을 휘두를 날을 위해 그의 곁을 "
"지키라고 했지. 수 백 년 동안 이곳에 들어간 자는 몇 되지 않았고 누구도 빠져나오지 못했다. 저 애송이가 처음으로 날 통과했는데, "
"자네는 두 번째로 지나갈 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "482fb59f-fcc8-4db1-a1f6-3a1fe3477bd4"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I'm listening. But don't think to defile your lips and my ears with "
"lies! I can see your thoughts as clear as I'll see your guts if you don't "
"speak true!\""
msgstr "\"오, 듣고 있다. 하지만 거짓말로 네 입과 내 귀를 더럽히지는 마라! 거짓을 고해봤자 네 잔꾀정돈 훤히 보이니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "3066e345-8280-463b-9e72-a09976dcb54b"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, the words of a true fighter! Let {g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} will be done!\""
msgstr "\"진정한 전사로군! {g|Numeria}고룸{/g}의 의지가 이루어지길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "80894f2f-7720-4b2b-9ad6-8b2f3cf6f686"
msgid ""
"\"So, this Stag Lord terrorized the area, and the Brevans bestowed the title "
"of baron on you for his head?\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주가 그 지역 사람들을 겁에 질리게 만들었고 브레보이의 사람들은 그의 목을 가져온 네게 남작의 지위를 주었다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "1542ac45-b11d-4778-8f43-152db1b1f6ef"
msgid ""
"\"Simple bandits? Any merchant in the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} "
"has fought them at least once!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도적 조무래기들을? {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 장사꾼 누굴 데려와도 한 번쯤은 도적과 싸워 본 적이 있을걸!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "2f3330cc-cfce-41b0-89f5-077f6c6e9859"
msgid "\"You felled two monster kings at once?\""
msgstr "\"두 명의 괴물 왕을 한 번에 물리쳤다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "eb52a166-7160-4f6d-96ae-add12bec49f2"
msgid ""
"\"Trolls and kobolds... Can you even call them monsters? You talk about "
"these beasts as though you'd slain a dragon!\""
msgstr "\"트롤과 코볼트라... 그것들을 괴물이라 칭하는게 맞는가? 짐승들에 대해 마치 드래곤이라도 물리친 양 말하고 있구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "3a1bcd47-6abc-400f-9751-2035b2891d80"
msgid ""
"\"What glory is there in plundering a city if you spared the life of their "
"king?\""
msgstr "\"도시를 쳐들어가 봤자 그들의 왕을 죽이지 못하면 무슨 소용이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "207ad0f9-ee34-40ec-8c92-a720cdea6007"
msgid ""
"\"Mages, giants, and undead — three of the world's most disgusting things!\""
msgstr "\"마법사이자 거인이자 언데드라. 세상에서 가장 역겨운 것들이로구만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "28219bff-4740-432a-8a5d-3fdfa1980e4f"
msgid ""
"\"He was old and dried up — barely held any magic left in his bones! A "
"simple poke of the finger, and he crumbled to dust!\""
msgstr "\"그는 늙고 야위었지. 몸에는 마법이 남아있지도 않았을테고! 손가락 하나로만 찔렀어도 가루가 되었을걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "98f58ae7-0d99-44fb-bf41-9addb7b6979f"
msgid ""
"\"Defeated — and let live! You allowed that abomination to continue defiling "
"the world with his presence!\""
msgstr "\"승리했지만 살려두었다고? 그 흉악한 것들이 세계를 더럽히게 두었다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "528ae583-9f38-4759-8eef-97d70ed81b6d"
msgid ""
"\"Lizardfolk! A cruel people, with thick hides and razor-sharp teeth! Rumors "
"say they eat each other more often than they eat other people!\""
msgstr "\"도마뱀 부족이라! 잔인하고 두꺼운 가죽과 날카로운 이빨을 가진 녀석들이지! 그들이 인간을 먹기보다는 서로 잡아먹는다는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "d7fbae49-b997-40eb-b29f-055dcb743528"
msgid ""
"\"Those ugly swamp creatures are barely a step above animals. Killing them "
"isn't a battle, it's a hunt!\""
msgstr "\"그 못생긴 늪지 괴물들은 동물만도 못한 것들이지. 그들을 죽이는 것은 전투가 아니라 사냥일 뿐일세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "6e639084-08b7-49c2-98be-90de6786c07d"
msgid "\"You defeated fighters from my own tribe?\""
msgstr "\"내 부족의 전사들을 물리쳤다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "0ccd8aae-0d5a-487a-81cb-01a7890aa363"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} these days aren't the same as in my "
"day. They've grown weak and soft — they can be beaten by anyone!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족은 예전 같지 않네. 그들은 약해지고 순해졌지. 누구와 싸웠더라도 졌을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "d303ffab-42bb-4216-97ad-ed5561d7c8bd"
msgid ""
"\"I'm always happy to meet a {mf|brother|sister} in faith — in peaceful "
"conversation or on the field of battle. Hail to Our Lord in Iron!\""
msgstr "\"나는 전투에서나 평화로울 때나 항상 내 형제를 만나 기뻤을 거야. 철의 군주는 영원하리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "2e2557f8-46e2-4554-aa4a-4b4d844a5070"
msgid ""
"\"Your faith alone doesn't make you worthy. Beyond idle prayers, what have "
"you done in {g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} name?\""
msgstr "\"네 믿음으로는 네 가치를 입증하지 못해. {g|Numeria}고룸{/g}의 이름으로 무엇을 한 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "4abf078e-e71e-4da4-854d-ab8abce9f3f0"
msgid ""
"\"A soft coward like you isn't capable of worthy deeds. Enough talk! If you "
"want to prove yourself, draw your weapon!\""
msgstr "\"너 같은 겁쟁이는 가치를 입증하지 못해. 대화는 됐다. 네 자신을 입증하고 싶다면 무기를 꺼내라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "7ee748b9-b6a0-4ff4-8961-f430e0aaf213"
msgid ""
"\"Not just anyone can boast of such exploits! I, Zorek, declare before the "
"face of {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} that you truly are a great chieftain, worthy to "
"enter Armag's inner sanctum!\" {n}The cleric bows his head and steps out of "
"your way.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아무나 그런 업적을 가지지 못하지! 나, 조렉은 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 보는 앞에서 네가 위대한 족장이며, 아르막의 성소에 "
"들어갈 자격이 있음을 선포한다!\" {n}성직자는 머리를 숙이고 길을 비켜줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "86ab9dd2-a4b2-486f-9298-58563f828252"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know what the rule of the strongest is? It's the right to take "
"anything you want without a fight. It's the right to go without proving your "
"strength at every turn, because everyone already knows it. Perhaps no one in "
"your lands doubts your power, but that's not the case here! If you want to "
"enter, then prepare yourself for battle — show me the true extent of your "
"power!\""
msgstr ""
"\"강한자는 어떤 대우를 받는지 아나? 싸움 없이 원하는 것을 얻을 수 있지. 자신의 힘을 일일히 입증하지 않아도 다른 이들이 알아주니. "
"아마도 네 땅의 누구도 네 힘을 의심하지 않았겠지만 여기서는 통하지 않아! 들어가고 싶다면 지금 싸움을 준비해라. 나에게 네 힘을 "
"증명해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "e9850853-9911-4abd-958f-90a21d75208f"
msgid ""
"{n}The old barbarian looks at you with indifferent black eyes, sparks of "
"unearthly flame dancing across them.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}나이든 야만인은 무관심한 눈빛으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "46a90b81-63d7-4b57-942b-d63e7d24b111"
msgid "\"I greet you in {g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} temple, worthy one!\""
msgstr "\"{g|Numeria}고룸{/g}의 사원에 온 것을 환영하네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "af0f040d-ab8a-4bea-a2c9-4b120ba6e328"
msgid "\"Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"준비 됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "4b67d2e1-4046-4830-ba45-5ec96e874fc9"
msgid "\"May {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g} help you in the hour of battle.\""
msgstr "\" {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 너를 돕기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "608359a0-260d-4c94-a910-c07fa8b33c95"
msgid "\"Tell me something worthwhile!\""
msgstr "\"쓸 만한 이야기 좀 해 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "c69661fa-1206-4baf-a292-df81426af64b"
msgid "\"Yes! That's something to be proud of. What else can you boast?\""
msgstr "\"그래! 그건 인정하지. 또 다른 이야기가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "de3ba1c7-b07d-4f1e-af60-8b98b7863a94"
msgid ""
"\"Old man, you must be out of your mind! I'll swear on red-hot iron if you "
"want — there isn't another fighter like {mf|him|her} in all of "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}! Quit flapping your mouth and just step aside so "
"{mf||s}he can accomplish yet another feat in {g|Gorum}Gorum's{/g} name!\""
msgstr ""
"\"늙은이가 미쳤군! 원한다면 붉고 뜨거운 내 쇠에 대고 맹세하지. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 전체를 통틀어도 {mf|그|그녀}"
"만한 전사는 찾을 수 없어! 입은 그만 나불대고, 그{mf||녀}가 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}의 이름으로 또 다른 업적을 달성할 수 "
"있게 비키지 그래!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Zorek
msgctxt "ca74d06a-39e2-491c-bc65-4ff93876f0f2"
msgid ""
"\"I like your spirit, girl. Yes, I can see it now — you aren't the kind of "
"people who would disgrace {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"네 용기는 마음에 드는구나. 그래. 너는 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}의 이름을 더럽힐 녀석이 아니겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a5ca30ea-6296-4c03-8ad4-58c0147b826b"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I remember now! In the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}academy{/g}, we used "
"to study a song about Armag. Though, heh, it wasn't so much about his "
"prowess in battle as his prowess in bed... According to the song, "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} was mad at him because he... heh, well, it's all "
"lies, of course! I mean, probably.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제야 기억이 난다! 우리는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}에서 아르막에 관한 노래를 연구했었어. 그는 "
"전투에서보다는 침대에서 벌였던 무용담에 관한 노래였는데... 노래에 따르면 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}는 그를 질투했고... "
"헤헤. 모두 거짓말이야! 내 말은. 그럴 수도 있다는 거지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "13a55eb6-1447-40d4-88fd-4359e95e1a9c"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe so, but such speeches are sacred — they're like battles themselves. "
"Once you start talking, I won't let you stop the story and leave without a "
"fight. Are you ready?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다고 해도 그런 이야기는 신성한 것이지. 전투에 관한 거니까. 그런 이야기를 듣는다면 싸움은 됐고 계속해서 듣고 싶다. 준비 됐어?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "24fa34b6-82fb-482e-9620-7435b2b99075"
msgid ""
"\"Prepare as long as you like. Unlike you, I have the whole of eternity "
"ahead of me.\""
msgstr "\"충분히 시간을 갖기를. 너와 다르게 나에게는 시간이 아주 많으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "21525bdf-bd86-4b12-bd25-d7ad006364dd"
msgid ""
"\"I see you don't tolerate disrespect. And rightfully so — the price for "
"insults must be blood!\""
msgstr "\"불명예는 참지 못하는 것 같군. 물론 모욕에 대한 대가는 피가 되겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "ceb0d10b-111f-4c7c-babf-a970a2dba0db"
msgid ""
"\"You brag of slaying a few villagers? How is that a great deed? To a great "
"warrior, villagers aren't proper enemies — they're like deer in the woods!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마을 사람 몇 죽인 것 가지고 자랑을 해? 그게 어떻게 위대한 업적이지? 위대한 전사에게 마을 주민은 적이 아니다. 그들은 그저 숲의 "
"사슴에 불과해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "bc5d611e-a104-4076-8edc-0402c3904792"
msgid "\"It's about time!\""
msgstr "\"때가 되었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0095_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "bdac302e-980e-4fc7-9249-0ce87168244d"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, old geezer! Who the hell are you to test us? What are you, the oldest "
"and wisest guy around? One swift kick and you'd turn to dust with all your "
"wisdom!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 늙은이! 누구를 시험하려는 거야? 늙었다고 자랑하는 건가? 나이도 많은데 조심하라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "8165d262-e850-4c52-a80a-2b1f5aa92550"
msgid ""
"\"You are young, hot and reckless. Sometimes those like you grow up to be "
"heroes. But they rarely live long enough to get the chance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 성질은 불같고 참을성은 없구나. 가끔 너 같은 녀석들이 영웅이 되고는 하지. 하지만 오래 살아야 그런 것도 가능한 법이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0102_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7af5b745-f61a-4dfa-b268-1e120bd6e41d"
msgid "{n}Grumbling resentfully, the half-orc obeys.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}불평하지만 하프오크는 인정합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0103_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "09429644-1dc7-44d1-a109-cb1fb8ad8a45"
msgid "\"Fine, fine...\""
msgstr "\"그래. 그래...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0104_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f4c94d57-208e-4f47-a7cf-dbf3634280bb"
msgid ""
"\"Shut up, old man! Oh, I'm so pissed off by all these wise ancient ghosts "
"and the other dusty weaklings! Come here, you — I'm going to...\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐. 늙은이! 유령 나부랭이가 고릿적 이야기를 하는 건 질렸어! 덤벼. 너를 그냥...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4cac0616-8dae-4d89-8c9a-3dd2fa8257bd"
msgid ""
"\"You're a dead man! You wanted to test us? Now we're going to test you. "
"When we're done with you, there won't even be any dust left!\""
msgstr "\"너는 죽었어! 우리를 시험하려 들어? 이제 너를 시험해주지. 너를 먼지로 만들어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "aba4f4e9-4a59-4287-bb5d-8fd7cab8fde5"
msgid ""
"\"I hear... the echo of tragedy. Whatever happened to Armag, his meeting "
"with the spirit of the ancient Armag might bring woe. But for whom? Him... "
"or us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래... 비극적이군. 아르막에게 무슨 일이 일어났던 아르막의 영혼과 만남은 불행을 가져올 수 있어. 그게 누구에게 좋을까? "
"그일까... 아니면 우리일까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ArmagsTomb/Zorek/Cue_0111_Text
msgctxt "fec94c20-0737-40e8-b75b-dd6d4a6c58ec"
msgid ""
"\"Lies! Did you think to deceive me? Do you so fear to fight me that you "
"resort to lying?\""
msgstr "\"거짓말! 나를 속이려 해? 나와 싸우는 게 겁나 거짓말을 하는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/1BarkBeforeDialogue_Brek_String
msgctxt "6f642c0f-1108-4502-b220-072e50ca1166"
msgid ""
"\"There's nowhere to sleep in this stupid hole! My back aches for the fourth "
"day in a row because of the cold…\""
msgstr "\"이런 곳에서 머물고 싶지 않아! 나흘되는 날부터 등골에 한기가 서리기 시작했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/2BarkBeforeDialogue_Grug_String
msgctxt "427ecde3-195e-49e2-bb94-5d389c70a4bc"
msgid ""
"\"Shut your mouth, Brek. If you sleep on grass, by the bonfire, villagers "
"will find you and slit your throat while you sleep.\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐. 브렉. 모닥불옆에서 자면 마을 사람들이 너를 찾아서 잘 동안에 네 목을 그을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/AshesClickFail_String
msgctxt "0ff06962-8347-44b5-9555-b8e22fb18005"
msgid ""
"These are coals. It's impossible to say, when and why someone would make a "
"fire here."
msgstr "이것은 석탄입니다. 왜 언제 여기서 불을 피웠는지는 알 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/AshesClick_Success_String
msgctxt "df2e8cb6-606a-48c2-b521-92f9aaf9a67e"
msgid ""
"These coals look like remains of a bonfire. You notice some charred bones, "
"too — looks like someone was cooking something here several days ago."
msgstr "이 석탄은 모닥불의 잔해처럼 보입니다. 타버린 뼈들을 보아 누군가 며칠 전 여기에서 요리를 한 것을 알 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/BarkAfterDialogue_ClickBrek_String
msgctxt "888f56a3-6cd6-4bd8-b327-843fd4b6e8ff"
msgid "\"Eh-heh-heh!\""
msgstr "\"헤헤헤!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/BarkAfterDialogue_ClickGrug_String
msgctxt "a3399c08-6dc4-4992-9978-5f3c7ed4c4bc"
msgid "\"Get lost before we change our mind!\""
msgstr "\"마음을 바꾸기 전에 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/BarkAfterDialogue_UnnamedGiant_String
msgctxt "3fc3285f-601d-40a8-957f-dd4d36cbca9d"
msgid "The giant looks at you with a perplexed smile."
msgstr "거인은 난처한 미소를 지으며 당신을 봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/Giants_Fight_String
msgctxt "1d09af0c-2ebd-463f-afe9-318386495a2f"
msgid "\"I'll pound you into the ground!\""
msgstr "\"너를 땅에 꽂아주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/Giants_PlayerReturn_String
msgctxt "6c90ab83-f7d4-4b36-928f-b534d8add6b9"
msgid "\"Liar! We've been to south, it's no better than here!\""
msgstr "\"거짓말! 우리는 남쪽으로 가고 있었고 그곳은 여기와 다르지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/TombClick_Fail_String
msgctxt "e6bc3fd4-dfca-471b-9858-a0bf62d05a79"
msgid ""
"Judging by the cracked lid, someone has already opened this sarcophagus."
msgstr "금이 간 뚜껑을 보건데 누군가 이 석관을 이미 열었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/TombClick_Success_String
msgctxt "15c4f0fa-9ba1-489e-a09e-58de6ab85413"
msgid ""
"Looks like this sarcophagus served for an altar for barbarian shamans. "
"Judging by the cracked lid, someone has already opened it."
msgstr "석관은 야만인 샤먼의 제단에 쓰인 것 같습니다. 금이 간 뚜껑을 보건데 누군가 이 석관을 이미 열었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/WallReliefClick_Fail_String
msgctxt "3936526c-1f80-4eaa-9d2d-60bbf48a1992"
msgid ""
"Judging by the patterns and carvings on the stone walls, this natural cave "
"was expanded and shaped into a tomb by barbarian tribes."
msgstr "돌벽에 새겨진 패턴과 조각을 보건데 이 자연 동굴은 야만인 부족이 내부를 넓히고 다듬은 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Barks/WallReliefClick_Success_String
msgctxt "587a4361-8b0e-4c05-8510-743070ef511c"
msgid ""
"Judging by the patterns and carvings on the stone walls, this natural cave "
"was expanded and shaped into a tomb by ancient kellids. Centuries ago, these "
"proud people used to inhabit all of Avistan."
msgstr ""
"돌벽에 새겨진 패턴과 조각을 보건데 이 자연 동굴은 고대 켈리드가 내부를 넓히고 다듬은 것 같습니다. 수백년전 그 부족은 아비스탄 전역에 "
"거주했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/BoxesAndCrates_Dialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "7fe13c94-3bc3-4345-a269-4322c93f6010"
msgid "[Search through the boxes]"
msgstr "[상자를 뒤집니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/BoxesAndCrates_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "cc03c4ff-0ca8-4987-9b14-9714effa563e"
msgid "[Step away from the boxes]"
msgstr "[상자들에게서 물러섭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/BoxesAndCrates_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f08608b1-0f1d-4745-aced-4236c2dbb26f"
msgid ""
"{n}Someone gathered and brought here countless boxes, barrels, packs and "
"crates. Judging by the dust, no one touched most of these for months. The "
"floor between the crates is scattered with items — clothing, weapons, "
"provisions. Examining everything will take several hours.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}몇몇이 모여 여기에 수많은 상자와 나무통들을 옮겼습니다. 흔적으로 보건데 손이 타지 않은지 몇달 되지 않았습니다. 상자 주위의 "
"바닥은 옷과 무기 그리고 보급품들이 흩어져있습니다. 모두 조사하려면 몇시간은 걸릴 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ddc275d1-aefa-4b03-a1da-62873285dbe6"
msgid "Tried to lie to the giants."
msgstr "거인에게 거짓말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "fbbbf82d-3720-4f21-a01d-bd9c8f626e89"
msgid "\"I am an agent on a secret mission!\""
msgstr "\"나는 비밀 임무를 수행하는 요원이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "8015ddf4-31e6-43d2-8ef5-0585921b2753"
msgid "\"I'm {name}, I was just passing by.\""
msgstr "\"나는 {name}. 그냥 지나가고 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "fe7f34bf-999f-4fab-b85e-0d87a14957db"
msgid "[Attack] \"Die, monster!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"죽어라! 괴물!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "3adf5ad3-e938-41c0-8b6f-8d83d5fd7284"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "c246989d-875e-4a06-b63d-8929787842f5"
msgid ""
"\"I was hired to exterminate all the goblins in the surrounding woods!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 숲의 고블린들을 모두 적이라는 명령을 받았지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "bb6cde2a-cc57-4019-9e9e-a2ebbc588260"
msgid ""
"\"Local ruler sent me to spy around the Kingdom of eternal summer, where "
"people have never seen snow!\""
msgstr "\"이 지역의 지배자가 영원한 여름 왕국 주위를 염탐하라고 나를 보냈지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "03e5d32c-28fc-4bb0-b2e4-dbcd9281bf82"
msgid ""
"\"I act as an ally of orcs in their struggle against the powerful sorcerer!\""
msgstr "\"나는 강력한 마법사를 상대하는 오크와 동맹으로 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "513fc316-d5da-47d4-86f5-50488b4dd7fd"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! And if you pay me, I'll send you a guide, who'll show you the "
"shortest way!\""
msgstr "\"물론! 나를 고용하면 네게 경호를 붙여주어 길을 알려주겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "4474069b-2c57-40c0-a3aa-ef67e17fd4f0"
msgid "[Attack] \"No, idiot, I'm fooling you! Prepare to die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"바보야! 너를 속이고 있었어! 죽을 준비 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "1179d7ff-a28c-400d-b91c-7583099bdd21"
msgid "\"You need to go south, always south.\""
msgstr "\"남쪽으로 계속 가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "3b9627ad-b15d-4ee9-870a-341832043283"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've changed my mind. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"마음을 바꿨다. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "2350130f-c875-49c4-a97d-d88cbf9737a1"
msgid "\"I need to think about it. While I am, I'll go about my business.\""
msgstr "\"생각해 봐야겠어. 나는 내 일을 하러 가보겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "29fec6eb-74db-4e8d-84eb-d39fd4f7bdca"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! And if you let me go, I'll explain how can you get there!\""
msgstr "\"물론! 나를 보내주면 가는 길을 알려주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "80be652c-f938-496d-93fb-60945f31eade"
msgid ""
"\"Great! I'm going home now, and then I'll send my best ranger to you. He'll "
"arrive tomorrow morning.\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 나는 집에 가서 최고의 레인저를 네게 보내주지. 그는 내일 아침에 도착할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "ab9d0a46-bb3e-4d3e-9442-d904390b0e3e"
msgid ""
"{n}With their mouths open, three hill giants stare at you, puzzled. Finally, "
"after a long pause, one of them points his finger at you.{/n} \"You...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}세명의 언덕 거인은 당황하여 당신을 봅니다. 마침내 긴 침묵이 끝나고 그들 중 하나가 당신을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"너...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "970ad1d8-c6e6-471f-881e-fe7ef92e212c"
msgid "\"Where do you think you're going?\""
msgstr "\"어디로 가는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Brek
msgctxt "37033d85-c742-4fb4-97c4-45d037803f34"
msgid "\"Ask {mf|him|her}, Grug!\""
msgstr "\"놈에게 물어봐! 멍청아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "9c0efbb9-e5e2-4fa9-b3dc-dff1f2f78839"
msgid "\"SHUT UP, BREK!\""
msgstr "\"닥쳐. 브렉!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn
msgctxt "9e9d1745-7027-49d9-9e78-12d72cd28988"
msgid ""
"{n}The third giant has been silent all this time. Judging by his expression, "
"he seems to be trying to figure out what's going on.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}세 번째 거인이 계속 말 없이 서있습니다. 그의 표정을 보건대 그는 무슨 일인지 이해하려고 하는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Brek
msgctxt "e37a515b-e6af-46d1-8fd8-0c65f1aec801"
msgid ""
"{n}Brek licks his lips with his huge, sore-covered tongue.{/n} \"Let's eat "
"them, Grug! We'll eat them, right?\""
msgstr "{n}브렉은 거대하고 부루퉁퉁한 혀로 입술을 핥습니다.{/n} \"저녀석들을 잡아먹자 그러그! 맛있겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "3985ca29-7ea8-4435-bdd4-ec0b12010472"
msgid "{n}Grug answers with a menacing smile.{/n} \"What do YOU think?\""
msgstr "{n}그러그는 위협적인 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"대체 뭔 생각을 하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "ed96187b-8e33-4fad-b02b-bfc1d82f2c39"
msgid ""
"{n}Grug and Brek exchange looks. The third giant scratches his head and "
"looks at them expectantly.{/n} \"What mission?\""
msgstr "{n}그러그와 브렉은 서로 눈빛을 교환합니다. 세번째 거인은 머리를 긁고는 그들을 봅니다.{/n} \"무슨 임무?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Brek
msgctxt "6e0dfecd-0b1b-4864-ba63-21ca6df96856"
msgid ""
"{n}Narrowing his eyes, Brek glares at you.{/n} \"It seems to me {mf|he|she}"
"'s lying, Grug! For {mf|him|her}, lying is as easy as breathing.\""
msgstr "{n}눈을 가늘게 뜨고 브렉은 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"나에게 거짓말을 하는군. 그러그! 이 녀석은 말마다 거짓말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "435ed89e-5957-4b6e-96c7-9d7045fb7721"
msgid "\"I agree, Brek.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 브렉.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Brek
msgctxt "0c616f59-4e24-45e5-b84a-5c2687e5b6fb"
msgid "\"Grug! I've never tasted a goblin before.\""
msgstr "\"그러그! 고블릿 맛이 궁금해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "8081df18-eb2e-436a-a777-8b32f0fac863"
msgid "\"So what? I don't care what you tasted and what you didn't.\""
msgstr "\"그래서? 네가 맛을 못 본 게 무슨 상관이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Brek
msgctxt "10f5b4db-8062-46c6-af80-3b6361f96e36"
msgid "{n}Brek spits on the ground, irritated. Then his gaze falls on you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}브렉은 화가 나서 땅에 침을 뱉습니다. 그는 당신을 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "6e2407d3-9ce8-4365-9008-2bd851dba246"
msgid ""
"{n}Grug's face twists in thought, then he grunts dismissively. It looks as "
"if he doesn't care about orcs and sorcerers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그러그는 얼굴을 찌푸리고 생각에 잠겨있었고 곧 불평합니다. 그는 오크나 마법사에 대해서는 신경쓰지 않는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "000b3de7-c8ab-42b1-8e33-48b49bc3fdbf"
msgid ""
"{n}Grug's thunderous laughter almost deafens you.{/n} \"No, this won't work "
"with us!\""
msgstr "{n}그러그의 웃음소리로 당신의 귀가 먹을 것 같습니다.{/n} \"우리에게는 소용 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Brek
msgctxt "c257809e-b4b0-43a2-a28a-6bd1332f27bf"
msgid ""
"{n}Brek's eyes light up.{/n} \"You say it's always warm there? With soft "
"grass all around?\""
msgstr "{n}브렉이 관심을 보입니다.{/n} \"거기는 항상 따뜻하다고? 풀도 자라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "a421c6d0-d2c8-4b93-b5b1-05f5b5f2d536"
msgid "{n}Clearing his throat, Grug turns back to you.{/n} \"Who're you?\""
msgstr "{n}기침을 하며 그러그는 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Brek
msgctxt "17b959a9-647d-4b0c-ae04-b40c7e5892fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Brek rubs his stomach and looks at Grug pleadingly.{/n} \"Grug, come on…\""
msgstr "{n}브렉은 배를 쓰다듬으며 그러그를 봅니다.{/n} \"어서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "321a68fe-7d51-447e-b2a2-53b3320d3943"
msgid "{n}Grug clicks his tongue, annoyed.{/n} \"Don't even start!\""
msgstr "{n}그러그는 혀를 차며 말합니다.{/n} \"꿈도 꾸지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Brek
msgctxt "67a4fd52-9c0c-41b4-b487-0eca18b126fe"
msgid ""
"\"Grug... remember when I let you have that juicy lamb? You said you'd owe "
"me if I gave it to you! You promised!\" {n}Brek leans forward to whisper in "
"Grug's ear, but the giant's 'whisper' echoes throughout the cave.{/n} \"After"
" he shows us the way, we can do with this guide whatever... we... like...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러그... 내가 준 육즙 많은 양은 기억 나지 않아? 나에게 양 한마리를 빌렸을 텐데! 내게 돌려준다고 했어!\" {n}브렉은 "
"그러그의 귀를 대고 속삭이지만 거인의 속삭임은 동굴을 울립니다.{/n} \"저 녀석이 길을 알려준다고 했으니 말이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "c78f7c4c-5356-4600-a3bf-55300907acd7"
msgid ""
"{n}Grug sighs.{/n} \"Damn you… Fine, here's your money, little one. When "
"will this guide of yours arrive?\""
msgstr "{n}그러그는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"젠장... 여기 돈 가져가. 네 경비는 언제 오지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : HillGiant_BarbarianCairn_Grug
msgctxt "dd0893e0-9cc6-4432-8bd6-c861a83cb513"
msgid ""
"{n}Grugs looks at you suspiciously.{/n} \"No, first you tell us! Spit it out!"
"\""
msgstr "{n}그러그는 당신을 의심스럽게 봅니다.{/n} \"안 돼. 우선 우리에게 말해! 어서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "32837b9e-53e0-4f64-9673-b9f6677122c4"
msgid ""
"\"How about that? Soon as I got bored of not fighting, a fight came and "
"found us!\""
msgstr "\"이러면 어때? 내가 싸우고 싶으면 싸우는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f06e6dfb-a9f2-4057-9c11-8ef8f7d69ba2"
msgid ""
"\"Eaten by a giant... Is that a good end, oh {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}? I must "
"consider the matter.\""
msgstr "\"거인에게 잡아먹히면... 그건 좋은 결말인가? 오 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}시여, 저는 다른 방법이 좋습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BarbarianCairn/Giants_Dialogue/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "9a5135f9-79e2-4f4e-b8b9-c39e4e0d9110"
msgid ""
"{n}With violent giggling, Nok-Nok bares his weapon.{/n} \"These good "
"enemies! Big enough for Hero Nok-Nok!\""
msgstr "{n}낄낄거리며 녹-녹은 무기를 쥡니다.{/n} \"좋은 적이다! 녹-녹이 쓰러뜨린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "47e8cd06-c080-4ffd-9a92-6b95dcbf119a"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't need your permission!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네 동의는 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "5d76ade0-b358-46c6-a602-1cb1a3543788"
msgid ""
"\"What makes you think I'm not allowed? For all you know, I got permission "
"from Armag himself!\""
msgstr "\"내가 안 되는 이유는 뭐지? 나는 아르막에게 허락을 받았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "909576df-6ad9-4b7b-8404-b704e24e0219"
msgid ""
"\"Shut your trap and let me pass before I punch your teeth down your throat!"
"\""
msgstr "\"입 닥치고 네 강냉이를 털어버리기 전에 비켜!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "c139e444-31c2-4271-bf8d-64526a13ff04"
msgid "\"I got a, erm... an urgent message! From Armag himself!\""
msgstr "\"서둘러야 해! 아르막이 직접 보낸 메시지를 가져왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "8ca09968-1f50-416a-be86-961ad1c44283"
msgid ""
"\"Right, the Sister's just who I need! I saw her pass by you recently!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나는 그녀만 있으면 돼! 그녀가 지나가는 것을 봤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "3a72d1fd-32ef-4ef7-95ef-6cf820a9d854"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, Nilak of the Six Bears is in there. She's like a sister to me. "
"Armag ordered her captured, fine. But I'm not leaving her alone with those "
"witches! They'll kill her without a trial, you hear? Please, just let me "
"pass!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여섯 곰 부족의 닐락이 저기에 있어. 그녀는 나에게 자매와 같지. 아르막이 그녀를 잡아오라고 했다. 하지만 나는 그녀를 마녀들에게 "
"넘겨주지 않을 거야! 그들은 그녀를 죽일 거니까. 나는 지나가야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "af17b554-f8e1-4d91-b4f1-114e5af7f417"
msgid ""
"\"You haven't heard? The Tigers have no chieftain! The Sisters control Armag "
"like a puppet. Those witches will be the doom of us all! Let me pass. After "
"I break their necks, everything will be all right again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안 들려? 호랑이 군주 부족은 족장이 없어! 얼굴 잃은 자매들이 아르막을 조종하지. 그 마녀들은 재앙이 될 거야! 나는 지나가야겠어. "
"그 녀석들 목을 분지르면 모든 게 끝나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "d4a66a41-e95e-43ef-9295-dcf560ea1bf6"
msgid ""
"\"I'm going to free Dugath before those crazy Sisters cut him down. Don't "
"you get it? Those witches aren't our friends! They'll doom us all!\""
msgstr "\"그 미친년들이 두가스를 쓰러뜨리기 전에 가야겠어. 모르겠어? 그 마녀들은 우리의 친구가 아니야! 그들은 재앙이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "81042350-c5a8-4c1f-a979-36971947b6f7"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, where are you going? That's the chieftain's tent — you're not allowed "
"in there!\""
msgstr "\"어디로 가는 거야? 거기는 족장의 천막이야. 거기에 들어가면 안 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "16659e4e-5ccc-42c8-9608-7bff89e1f3fa"
msgid ""
"\"If you were permitted, someone would have told me! Armag said no one but "
"the Sisters can pass when he's not around, and you definitely don't look "
"like one of them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가로부터 허락을 받았다면 내가 알았어야 해! 아르막은 얼굴 잃은 자매들만 지나가도 좋다고 했다. 하지만 너는 그들이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "053b82f1-5414-452c-9ad7-692422d90510"
msgid ""
"\"Urgent, huh? Fine — pass. You can explain it to the Sister yourself!\""
msgstr "\"급하다고? 좋아. 지나가. 얼굴 잃은 자매들에게 네가 설명해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "e99969f5-e18e-4fe3-9ca5-b5caadce6963"
msgid ""
"\"You take me for a fool? Get lost before I take you in there myself, only "
"tied up like that crazy bard!\""
msgstr "\"내가 바보인 줄 알아? 너를 꽁꽁 묶어 혼내주기 전에 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "d11cd9ed-aaad-4715-afdc-b037d1c36564"
msgid ""
"\"Whoa, easy! Why didn't you just say it was so urgent? Go on, I won't keep "
"you!\""
msgstr "\"어렵지 않군! 급하다고 말하지 그랬어? 어서 가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "a55d0401-0cda-458f-b9c1-2aa334139fc2"
msgid ""
"\"Are all you Bears crazy, or just half? Hey, everyone, we've got a rioter "
"here! Tie her up!\""
msgstr "\"너희 여섯곰 부족은 미친 건가? 여기에 미친 녀석이 있다! 포박해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "8493cfda-7108-4c91-862d-5d01aab49b07"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care what you need! My orders were clear — no one's allowed! Just "
"wait here for her, I'm sure she'll be back soon.\""
msgstr "\"네가 뭘 원하든 신경쓰지 않아! 내 말은 간단해. 너는 권한이 없어! 여기서 기다려. 그녀는 곧 온다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "41e57e3b-4945-4374-a9fc-90745b2fad3e"
msgid ""
"\"But Armag... Damn it! Yes, you're right — the Sisters give me the creeps "
"too. And that girl was yelling the same thing when they tied her up... Ugh, "
"fine! Go protect your sister. But watch out — Armag will return soon. If he "
"captures you too, don't complain to me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 아르막은... 젠장! 네가 맞아. 얼굴 잃은 자매는 오싹한 년들이지. 그리고 그녀도 얼굴 잃은 자매들에게 묶일 때도 같은 말을 "
"했어. 좋아! 가서 그녀를 보호해. 하지만 아르막은 곧 돌아올 거야. 그가 너를 붙잡아도 내게 불평하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "65dfc0f7-321d-4ab3-b403-ec0689bb61ab"
msgid ""
"\"You know, that bard was screaming the same thing when they tied her up... "
"Damn it! Could Armag really be those witches' lapdog? Damn those Sisters... "
"Fine, go. But be quick, and tell no one I let you pass!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 음유시인이 얼굴 잃은 자매들이 미쳤다고 하더군... 아르막이 그 마녀들의 꼭두각시였나? 망할 년들... 좋아. 가라. 하지만 "
"서둘러. 나는 너를 보내주지 않은 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "ada21928-1871-4309-9ebf-25208fc1d8db"
msgid ""
"\"You too? You Bears are all crazy! We got a battle on us, and all you do is "
"plot and scheme! Hey, everyone, we've got a rioter here! Get her!\""
msgstr "\"그래? 너희 곰 부족 녀석들은 미쳤지! 우리는 전투가 있었고 너희들은 속임수를 잘 쓰더군! 이봐! 저 녀석을 포박해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriDiplomacy/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "d020d44b-f969-45e9-b14a-a1bd0dc82f3a"
msgid ""
"\"I can't really argue... And when they tied him up, old Dugath did say the "
"Sisters wouldn't let him live. That bard of yours was screaming the same... "
"Is it possible that the Sisters have betrayed us? Ah, crap... Fine, go! Save "
"the old man — he's a wise one, he'll know what to do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 모르겠군... 그가 포박당할 때 두가스는 자매들이 그를 살려두면 안 된다고 했더군. 너희 음유시인도 같은 말을 했고... 얼굴 잃은 "
"자매들이 우리를 배반한 건가? 젠장... 좋아. 가서 두가스를 구해. 그는 현명하니 무슨 일을 해야 할지 알 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "2e45d1df-1a2a-4f31-9024-93f8cbf2d5f2"
msgid "\"Why are you unhappy with Armag?\""
msgstr "\"왜 아르막 때문에 고통스러워 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "29f19627-c273-464a-be5a-b0bc4c9b8682"
msgid "\"What's the plan?\""
msgstr "\"계획이 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "388e9dd2-89b1-4821-beb6-cf1d958d4bcc"
msgid "\"If you get rid of Armag, who will be your new chieftain?\""
msgstr "\"네가 아르막을 제거하면 족장은 누가 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "0cc4021e-f13b-4bb5-b7ec-5cd988ed486c"
msgid "\"We're ready.\""
msgstr "\"준비 됐다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "e72a8faf-52b4-41b3-acaf-626435553fae"
msgid "\"Wait here. I need to prepare.\""
msgstr "\"여기서 기다려. 준비해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0027_Text_String
msgctxt "89866b6d-98af-4be1-af54-2a0bfae31c8b"
msgid "\"Yes. Let's go.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "6886aa30-fa33-4405-a493-ccc2eed2edee"
msgid "\"No, wait. We have to take care of something else first.\""
msgstr "\"기다려. 우리는 준비할 것이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "e4150933-74f7-4f89-ab3d-5622ce7cf302"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe we should all sneak into the camp together. Are you sure you can "
"deal with Armag on your own?\""
msgstr "\"캠프로 몰래 들어가야겠어. 아르막을 혼자 상대해도 괜찮겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "05db9c4f-21ef-47c9-957a-833ddfd8a707"
msgid "\"Is that all? I feel like you're keeping something from me, Amiri.\""
msgstr "\"그게 전부야? 네가 나를 무언가에게서 멀어지게 하는 거 같은데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "827aad01-a13b-4c5d-a0ea-943b4ff2b15d"
msgid "Answered the barbarian's question about power and loyalty."
msgstr "힘과 충성에 대한 야만인의 질문에 대답합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "82512d2e-0f1d-4681-881b-a23878620beb"
msgid ""
"\"If my commander orders it, I'll jump. But I won't force my people to "
"follow. This is about personal choices — theirs and mine.\""
msgstr "\"내 지휘관이 명령하면 나는 따른다. 하지만 나는 부하들에게 강요하지 않아. 그건 개인적인 선택이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "bfe0094e-1cea-4a57-9bc9-4a92d16b5a5a"
msgid ""
"\"A leader like that should be thrown off the cliff instead, before he kills "
"all his people!\""
msgstr "\"그런 지도자라면 부하들을 죽이기 전에 절벽에서 밀어야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "c80abae1-8b7e-4e36-93b6-04e2b0fdd7a4"
msgid ""
"\"A commander's orders are not debatable. If someone I've sworn to obey "
"gives such an order, they must have a good reason. These are my principles, "
"and I expect the same principles from my subjects.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지휘관의 명령은 논할 것이 아니야. 지휘관이 그런 명령을 내린다면 이유가 있겠지. 그건 내 원칙이야. 내 부하들도 내 원칙을 따라야 "
"한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "0f8f578e-2fe9-460d-8235-e8a6c4343fdc"
msgid "\"What? He can go straight to the Abyss, with orders like that!\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 그런 명령이라면 지옥에나 가라고 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "7ea4890e-1786-4947-bbf4-a5f60aa22463"
msgid ""
"\"I'd send my men in first while I tried to figure out the situation — maybe "
"it wouldn't be necessary for me to jump as well.\""
msgstr "\"상황을 파악하는 동안 우선 부하를 보내야겠다. 급히 움직이지 않는 게 좋을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "249211a5-9547-49a3-b635-4e8f8a9c44db"
msgid ""
"\"It's hard to say. Maybe he's right, maybe he's not. All the circumstances "
"would need to be taken into consideration.\""
msgstr "\"설명하기 어려워. 그가 맞을 수도 틀릴 수도 있어. 모든 것을 생각해 봐야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "42b758ef-ed10-4943-813b-e2d4c75cddc1"
msgid "\"I thought your goal was to seize and plunder Restov.\""
msgstr "\"네 목표는 레스토프를 손에 넣는 것이라고 생각했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "2a100c1e-9acc-402e-9386-a3410d2069ba"
msgid ""
"\"Numeria's pretty far away from here. How did you find yourselves near "
"Rostland borders?\""
msgstr "\"누메리아는 여기서부터 상당히 멀어. 어떻게 로스틀랜드 국경을 찾아갔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0061_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e9fe010b-d176-417b-a525-c579c38743fe"
msgid "Incited the Tiger Lords tribe to riot against Armag."
msgstr "호랑이 군주 부족에게 아르막에게 대항하라고 부추깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "dcc9a89b-09bb-4032-a2be-b7f218ab3561"
msgid ""
"\"You make me sick. Are you barbarians, or scared seamstresses? You want to "
"sneak around because you don't have the guts for an open riot! Armag's right "
"to treat you like dirt — you deserve it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"짜증나게 하는군. 너희 야만인 맞아? 대항할 용기도 없어서 살금살금 기어다니고 싶은 건가! 아르막이 너희를 깔보는 것도 당연해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1fba6ce7-3494-480d-a29e-7ab708d793a8"
msgid ""
"\"You're here, great! It's {d|c41 Follow Amiri}about time{/d}. The battle "
"hasn't started yet — we may still have enough time to pull this off.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 왔구나! {d|c41 Follow Amiri}때가 되었어{/d}. 전투가 아직 시작되지는 않았어. 아직 시간은 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "346fbe75-911a-49d8-a1d4-171f8892e821"
msgid ""
"\"I've been growing old {d|c41 Follow Tristian}waiting{/d} for you! The "
"battle's already started — there are streams of blood everywhere! I don't "
"know if we'll have enough time to save anyone at this point!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 {d|c41 Follow Tristian}기다리느라{/d} 늙는 줄 알았다! 전투가 이미 시작되었어. 온통 피바다가 될 거야! "
"지금 우리가 시간이 충분한지는 모르겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "a8f6a912-e723-4d7f-97eb-698281d9c74a"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian raises his empty hands into the air.{/n} \"Peace, "
"Baron{mf||ess}, peace! We've been waiting to speak with you. I'm Gwart, of "
"the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} — a cleric of {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}, and "
"wise {d|Ashman}Dugath's{/d} apprentice. We've come with an offer for you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인은 허공에 손을 듭니다.{/n} \"진정해! 너와 대화하기 위해 기다렸다. 나는 그워트이고 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 "
"군주{/g} 부족이다. {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}의 성직자이고 {d|Ashman}두가스{/d}의 제자이지. 너에게 제안을 하러 "
"왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "88590b33-bda8-4495-b56c-e91058193d3d"
msgid "\"So, everyone's ready?\""
msgstr "\"모두 준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "ffb1bc47-9496-40a1-9aca-91ffa4933871"
msgid "\"Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9d921391-0128-46cf-b33e-be5fb3d073ba"
msgid ""
"\"Here, meet Gwart of the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}. He's "
"{d|Ashman}Dugath's{/d} apprentice, and a cleric, too. A really smart one! "
"They're on our side, and the two of us have an agreement... Just... just "
"listen to him. He'll explain things.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족의 그워트를 만나봐. 그는 {d|Ashman}두가스{/d}의 제자이고 성직자이지. "
"아주 똑똑하기도 하고! 그들은 우리의 편이 되었고 우리 둘은 그의 이야기를 들어 보기로 했지. 그가 설명할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "b0ac7fca-283c-4d73-95f9-900490fc45f6"
msgid ""
"\"I don't wish to waste your time, so I'll be brief — we're sick and tired "
"of Armag and his crazy witches. You want to help the Brevans, and we want to "
"pull our kin out of this senseless slaughter. Our interests coincide.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간 낭비하기는 싫다. 우리는 아르막이나 마녀들은 지긋지긋해. 너는 브레보이 사람들을 돕고 싶고 우리는 무자비한 도살자를 끌어내리고 "
"싶어하지. 우리는 서로 도울 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "0731e877-568e-4bab-8cd0-b08324f0cf39"
msgid ""
"\"A chieftain's job is to fight for the wealth and glory of his tribe, not "
"to cram vague bullcrap about some great future down the throats of his "
"tribesmen! The real Armag once made all of {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} tremble "
"before the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}. What has this Armag done? Sent "
"our people to their deaths for no reason — and he'll continue to do so in "
"the future. Why should we even fight the Brevans, for goodness' sake? Is "
"anyone going to pay us for it? Will the Sisters? Dream on! We're tired of "
"being used as pawns in a game we don't even understand!\""
msgstr ""
"\"족장의 일은 부족의 영광과 부를 위해 뛰는 것이지 부족 사람들에게 환상을 심어주는 사기를 저지르는 것이 아니야! 진짜 아르막은 "
"{g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 전역을 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족 앞에 떨게 했다. 하지만 가짜는 어떤가? "
"우리 부족을 보내 이유 없이 죽게 하고 앞으로도 죽게 하겠지. 우리가 왜 브레보이 사람들과 싸워야 하는 거지? 우리에게 보상해주기라도 "
"하는 건가? 얼굴 잃은 자매들이 보상을 해줄 건가? 꿈 깨! 우리는 알지도 못하는 놀음에 놀아나는 것도 지쳤어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3c7826ff-4697-40de-ab27-a5478c79b0ce"
msgid ""
"\"In short, with a little help I can sneak into the camp and set Dugath "
"free. Then we'll find Armag and kill him and the Sisters. In my opinion, "
"it's a pretty solid plan!\""
msgstr ""
"\"간단히 말해서 조금만 도와주면 내가 캠프에 몰래 들어가 두가스를 풀어줄 수 있다는 거야. 그러면 우리는 아르막과 얼굴 잃은 자매들을 "
"죽일 거고. 내가 보기엔 정말 완벽한 계획이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "4a8b7580-fa82-4acc-a245-badda27143ad"
msgid ""
"\"Long story short, with a little help I can sneak into the camp. I'll find "
"Armag and the Sisters and rip their heads off. It's a great plan!\""
msgstr ""
"\"간단히 말해서 조금만 도와주면 내가 캠프에 몰래 들어가겠어. 그리고 아르막과 얼굴 잃은 자매들을 찾아 머리를 베어버릴 거야. 완벽한 "
"계획이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "63afcd67-1ed0-4731-92b0-2447b552c400"
msgid ""
"\"We'll go to the camp and start a riot! Once we explain that they're being "
"sent into the grinder without even being paid for it, the camp will be "
"behind us, and we can try to kill Armag and the Sisters!\""
msgstr ""
"\"캠프로 가서 폭동을 벌이자! 돈도 못받고 사지로 가는 그들의 처지를 설명해주면 캠프는 우리가 손에 넣게 되고 아르막과 얼굴 잃은 "
"자매들을 죽일 수 있을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "32bc1cae-8b6a-4979-9b40-bfb86f28147d"
msgid ""
"\"{d|Ashman}Dugath{/d}, I suppose. But that's not important right now.\""
msgstr "\"{d|Ashman}두가스{/d} 같아. 하지만 그건 중요하지 않지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "21b31500-4d1a-40c7-a916-2722ca34bb87"
msgid ""
"\"Have you prepared yourself? Once we start, there's no turning back. It "
"could be a while before you have a chance to take care of any other matters."
"\""
msgstr "\"준비했어? 시작하면 되돌릴 수 없어. 아직 시간이 조금은 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "190b1564-50ee-4951-b9b7-65aacaae2c3a"
msgid "\"We'll find someone. That's not important right now.\""
msgstr "\"누군가 찾자. 지금은 중요하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "44fbcc7f-47ae-4d00-a5f6-795a785999a8"
msgid ""
"\"Our main objective is to take out Armag. Even a mindless baby would be a "
"better chieftain than this madman who obeys those harpies' every word and "
"destroys his own tribe!\""
msgstr "\"우리 주요 목표는 아르막을 죽이는 거야. 아무것도 모르는 꼬마라도 마녀들에게 복종하는 미치광이 족장보다는 나을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a017add8-2f47-45ef-a213-bc1cc28f1ae0"
msgid "\"What? I'll...\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 나는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "b2cd06a5-23f7-4227-aaae-fb69da63f006"
msgid ""
"\"Sneaking into the camp together isn't an option. Amiri is from the Six "
"Bears, so she can easily pass as one of our people. That trick won't work "
"with you, though. Besides, you have an army to lead. Without that, the whole "
"plan will be pointless.\""
msgstr ""
"\"캠프로 몰래 들어가는 것은 선택이 아니야. 아미리는 여섯곰 부족이고 쉽게 들어갈 수 있을 거야. 속임수는 네게 통하지 않겠지. 너는 "
"이끌어야 할 군대가 있어. 군대가 없으면 모든 계획은 쓸모가 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "ae4ca28e-7a91-4c0c-9f64-59aad404c4c8"
msgid ""
"\"In the meantime, you take your reinforcements to the Brevans. The sight of "
"your army and news of Armag's deposition should be enough to convince our "
"brothers and sisters to retreat.\""
msgstr "\"너는 브레보이 사람들을 데리고 와. 네 군대가 모습을 드러내고 아르막의 정체가 탄로나면 우리 부족을 후퇴시킬 수 있으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "29f18a8a-49d1-46bc-9b8e-6faa3d80dd9e"
msgid "\"All right. But don't waste any time — we don't have much to spare.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 하지만 시간 낭비하지는 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "861d7902-f697-40a6-a41e-6280fd0d7657"
msgid ""
"\"Is it that obvious? Crap, I'm such a bad liar... Fine, here's the thing — "
"I have one more thing to do there. My tribe, the Six Bears, is at the {g|"
"Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords'{/g} campsite. Normally, I'd just say screw them "
"all, but... Well, they have Nilak with them. And I won't let anyone hurt "
"her. Got it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말인가? 나는 거짓말쟁이가 되었군... 좋아. 아직 할 일이 하나 남았어. 여섯곰 부족은 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 "
"군주{/g} 부족의 캠프에 있어. 그들이 마음에 들지는 않지만... 그들은 닐락과 함께 있어. 그리고 닐락이 다치게 두지는 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "fd166cc2-7ac2-4690-9553-ead09e74cce0"
msgid ""
"\"Let's use you as an example — perhaps you're not the most important person "
"in the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}, but you're certainly not an "
"enemy to yourself or your people, right? Now put yourself in our shoes. "
"Imagine your chieftain calls on you and orders you to take all your people "
"and jump off a cliff, all because some old crone foretold that it was your "
"destiny. What would you do?\""
msgstr ""
"\"예를 하나 들어 보지. 아마 너는 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}에서 가장 중요한 사람은 아닐지라도 너는 백성들의 "
"적은 아니지? 우리의 입장을 생각해봐. 너희 대장이 늙은 미친놈의 예언을 들어 너희들을 절벽에서 뛰어내리라고 명령했다고 생각해 보라고. "
"너라면 어떻게 하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "bd1cade5-3627-4f0e-bcf4-1c4399b695c6"
msgid "\"We've had enough of Armag, and enough of the Sisters.\""
msgstr "\"아르막과 얼굴 잃은 자매는 이제 끝이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "fbb99f03-513c-4783-807f-20ff22f71817"
msgid ""
"\"Wow, I guess you're really a good person. Too bad there aren't more people "
"like you around — they often don't live long enough. Our ways are a bit "
"different.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 정말 좋은 사람 같군. 너같은 녀석이 없어서 아쉽다. 그런 자들은 오래 살지 못하지. 우리의 길은 조금 다른 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "5c43a095-ef03-400e-bcac-414b4d98bff9"
msgid "\"Exactly! That's just what we thought!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 우리도 그렇게 생각했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "5a9fda7a-5019-42b7-bcb9-685af2977cc0"
msgid ""
"\"Well, maybe that's how things go in your parts, but our ways are a bit "
"different.\""
msgstr "\"너희는 그렇게 생각하겠지만 우리는 조금 달라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "a7dba866-a21e-40cb-a7ca-0f103ea80587"
msgid ""
"\"You have the mind of a fox, don't you? Prefer to have other pull chestnuts "
"from the fire for you? Maybe that's how barons do things, but our ways are a "
"bit different. We're all family to each other — we stand for each other. And "
"we expect the same from our chieftain!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 교활하군. 불난 집에 부채질하는 거야? 남작이라면 그럴지 몰라도 우리는 달라. 우리는 서로에게 가족이야. 족장도 우리를 가족처럼 "
"생각해야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "1e83a8f7-9eac-4aa7-ba06-0d4184d3396f"
msgid "\"And we did, and we decided we don't need a chieftain like that!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 쓰레기같은 족장은 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "c5ab7cb7-350a-474a-a4e1-640c4fa3e63f"
msgid ""
"\"If you call yourself a chieftain, you should care for your tribe. And if "
"you can't — you can go straight to the {g|Abyss}Abyss{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"너 스스로를 족장이라고 한다면 부족을 보살펴야지. 그렇지 못한다면 죽어 마땅해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "b6eabcfe-bf04-4e57-adf7-14c32559f457"
msgid ""
"\"That's what Armag said, but he underestimated the size of "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy's{/g} army — he said their forces would be one third the "
"size, and they haven't even received your reinforcements yet! Our today's "
"enemies are just a fraction of Brevoy's forces. It's crystal clear to us "
"that, with those forces and their walls, {g|Restov}Restov{/g} is too much "
"for us. All we could achieve would be to weaken the "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords'{/g} army. I'm sure the {g|House "
"Surtova}Surtovas{/g} would be happy with that, but what's in it for us? The "
"Surtovas won't be paying, because we dragged our butts here of our own "
"accord!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 아르막은 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 군대를 과소평가했어. 그는 군대가 실제보다 삼분의 일에 지나지 않다고 했고 네 "
"지원군도 오지 않았다고 했지! 오늘 우리의 적은 브레보이 병력의 일부에 불과해. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 병력과 성채는 "
"우리에게는 도전하기 힘들어. 우리가 할 수 있는 것은 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}의 군대를 약화시키는 것일 뿐이야. {g|"
"House Surtova}서토바{/g}는 좋아하겠지만 우리에게도 좋은 걸까? 서토바는 돈도 들이지 않았지만 우리는 피해가 크다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "a70ffd7b-5076-458c-8444-085f47629f73"
msgid ""
"\"We traveled through {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. Why King Irovetti let us through "
"is a mystery to us, though. There were rumors among the fighters that he was "
"the one who hired us to attack {g|Restov}Restov{/g}, but now we know for "
"sure that no one's even paying us for this expedition! I hate getting caught "
"in a charade like that, but more than that, I hate any chieftain who would "
"put on such a charade for their people!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 여행했어. 이로베티 왕이 우리에게 시련을 준 것은 여전히 알 수 없어. "
"{g|Restov}레스토프{/g}를 공격한 병사들 중에서 소문이 돌았었지만 이제 우리가 돈을 받지 못한다는 것은 뻔해! 나는 이런 식으로 "
"힘든 일을 겪기는 싫지만 부족들을 보살피지 않는 족장은 최악이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "ccb93e36-0b8f-40d7-ab06-51bacb36248b"
msgid "\"But we can't just...\""
msgstr "\"하지만 우리는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "ebedc984-aee6-4f9a-8d78-55591500b487"
msgid ""
"\"Why not? We can do it, easy! Come on, Gwart, don't be such a wuss! Let's "
"start a riot against Armag!\""
msgstr "\"어때? 그렇게 어렵지 않을 거야! 그워트. 생각해봐! 아르막에게 대항하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "29124eb8-8db9-479e-9a74-7e3588c76eeb"
msgid ""
"\"By {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}, you're right! What's holding us back? Onward!\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞아! 우리에게 남겨진 것은 없지. 공격하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5bfb5180-30b4-4b43-8a60-605a88889c34"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia frowns.{/n} \"Are you serious? I hope that was just a stupid "
"joke...\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아가 눈을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"정말이야? 그냥 멍청한 농담인줄 알았는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "73c4d72e-c030-4281-9bd2-a5e78cffa631"
msgid ""
"\"We leave Amiri alone for just a little while, and she goes and starts a "
"rebellion! Sounds about right!\""
msgstr "\"잠시 아미리를 혼자 두면 가서 반란을 일으킬 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "b8761df3-f971-4d35-99c8-e2f99f07e3c8"
msgid ""
"\"I hear the voice of greed, not honor and valor. The only thing between "
"these people and violence is lack of payment. If someone paid for it, they'd "
"gladly take up arms against a peaceful village.\""
msgstr ""
"\"명예가 아닌 욕망의 소리를 들었어. 사람들과 폭력 사이에 남은 유일한 것은 먼지 뿐이지. 누군가 돈을 지불한다면 그들은 평화로운 "
"마을도 공격할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "6d79f4c3-7c8b-48c2-9718-f65d693a24c2"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, easy! We're fighters — we fight with other fighters, not plow-pushing "
"weaklings!\""
msgstr "\"진정해! 우리는 전사다. 우리는 전사와 싸우지 약한 녀석들을 공격하지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "fabd8a91-1cbb-42d9-a5f8-6e139aa19a02"
msgid "\"I'm not convinced.\""
msgstr "\"확신이 서지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "be7566f9-6585-47c3-80af-f7440cccfdb9"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal speaks softly so the barbarians won't hear her.{/n} \"Bad. This "
"Dugath thinks too highly of himself. He's proud and uncontrollable. Better "
"to give this horde to another chief — a more... convenient one. Of course, "
"nothing prevents us from agreeing to their plan now and changing our minds "
"later.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 조용히 말해서 야만인은 듣지 못했습니다.{/n} \"두가스는 자신을 너무 높이 평가했군. 그는 통제 불가능한 녀석이야. 이 "
"군단은 다른 족장이 어울려. 물론 그들의 계획을 따르고 마음을 바꾸는 것도 불가능한 것은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0082_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "86a63537-7ffe-4a2d-a805-25d4e888eeeb"
msgid ""
"\"They are ready to start chaos in their ranks. They worry not in the least "
"for the consequences, not even the identity of their new chief. This is a "
"deadly mindlessness, bordering on insanity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 계급간의 혼돈이 발생하기 시작했어. 그들은 정복을 하지 못하거나 새로운 족장의 정체를 알지 못해서 걱정하는 것이 아니야. "
"광기가 가장 큰 적이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "913463a5-fb77-4f7c-b54d-dd2c46a8382f"
msgid ""
"\"The voice of reason? I certainly didn't expect that here. I suppose even "
"{g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} barbarians can be capable of looking for 'boring "
"peace' over a good round of carnage!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이성의 목소리? 나는 그다지 기대하지 않았어. {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g} 야만인들은 학살로 평화를 가질 거라고 생각했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "9c0f4e1b-3138-4662-a772-5914b2e72117"
msgid ""
"\"I'm looking at this, and I don't know whether to laugh or cry. With such "
"lack of discipline and jumbled ideas, the barbarian horde will splinter into "
"small groups and slaughter each other sooner or later. Poor, poor Armag – "
"it's not easy to rule such subjects as this!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 생각하기에는 울어야 할 지 웃어야 할 지 모르겠어. 훈련도 없고 전략도 없는 상태라면 야만인 군대는 찢어져서 서로를 죽일 거야. "
"불쌍한 아르막. 백성들을 통치하는 것도 쉽지 않구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/AmiriFirst/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "eb869759-0615-40fd-a0b0-2feca2c60fad"
msgid ""
"\"A stubborn priest of Gorum commanding a wild horde? What's in it for us? "
"After five years he'll decide it's high time to deliver his god another "
"bloody sacrifice, and he'll march this army out again to butcher his "
"neighbors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고룸의 사제가 야만인 군대를 지휘한다고? 무슨 생각이지? 몇년 되지 않아 그는 부족을 희생하고 이웃 국가를 약탈하려 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "76ed2c87-26f2-4348-9c5c-a400445f783c"
msgid ""
"\"You blind, old man? I'm one of the Tiger Lords, I'm supposed to be here! I "
"walked by just a little while ago!\""
msgstr "\"미쳤어? 나는 호랑이 군주 부족의 일원이야. 여기에 있어야 한다고! 나는 방금 여기에 왔어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "fefc210a-176f-4626-9131-f66f03364766"
msgid "\"I'm from the Six Bears. My name is, erm... Rimi, yeah.\""
msgstr "\"나는 여섯곰 부족 출신이야. 내 이름은... 음... 리미야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "eb831b7c-e277-4900-9434-2f5043763706"
msgid ""
"\"I came from far, far north. I'm from... hmm, who's up there... Ice Chasm. "
"My name is... Imari! I mean, I'm Imari, from Ice Chasm Following.\""
msgstr "\"나는 멀리서 왔어, 먼 북쪽. 나는... 얼음 계곡 출신이야. 내 이름은... 이마리! 얼음 계곡 에서 온 이마리야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "8a87b4d3-931c-4a5f-999e-3fdecfad9cf7"
msgid "\"Dugath's here too?\""
msgstr "\"두가스도 여기에 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "2185b104-65c5-4ae9-8af8-06400fae75c3"
msgid "\"Where's Armag now?\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 지금 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "f4a08293-3daf-4211-8660-5369e9bd0b6f"
msgid "\"Are there any Sisters here in the camp?\""
msgstr "\"캠프에 얼굴 잃은 자매가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "d4407e3b-041e-42db-ab1b-74570ac4e9bc"
msgid "\"Nilak? Why'd she stay?\""
msgstr "\"닐락? 왜 그녀가 여기에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "aa3841c7-5794-42cb-9160-4199a98aa8ac"
msgid "\"Why are you just sitting here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기에 앉아있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "4079f4bb-1ba5-468e-910f-ffdb7e3e4221"
msgid "\"Dugath's a traitor?\""
msgstr "\"두가스가 배신자라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "11342567-02ff-44de-b682-07e36a708d58"
msgid "\"Whose?\""
msgstr "\"누구?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "cd499570-8e35-43d9-ab7f-f73fc4b3b937"
msgid "\"Whose ass will he stick his tongue up?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 자식의 혀가 잘릴거라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "0ca6ca0c-78c1-406b-80dc-f385187f6738"
msgid "\"Well, time to go. I've wasted too much time yapping here with you.\""
msgstr "\"가 봐야겠어. 여기서 너와 떠드느라 시간을 너무 많이 낭비했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "9e88da5c-6d99-4920-ac39-7a484bee350c"
msgid ""
"\"Relax, it was a joke. I'm Rimi, of the Six Bears. Just looking for my "
"tribesmen.\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 농담이야. 나는 여섯곰 부족의 리미야. 내 부족을 찾으러 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "420a9fcb-b232-4341-9c99-2f401eaf1db9"
msgid ""
"\"Listen, graybeard — don't piss me off, or there won't even be pieces of "
"you left to pick up. Now tell me, are the Six Bears here?\""
msgstr "\"회색 수염. 잘 들어. 나를 열받게 하면 혼날줄 알아. 여섯곰 부족은 지금 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "a1e2e6fe-35e9-4a8a-bdff-7d907b3b7dbd"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You shouldn't have said anything. If you'd kept your mouth shut, "
"you'd have lived longer.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 아무말도 하지 마. 그렇게 입을 닥치고 있으면 오래 살았을 텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ea722262-e345-4902-a918-550fc8295b00"
msgid ""
"{n}A gray-haired, heavily scarred barbarian sits by the tent. He seems to be "
"nodding off, but as soon as Amiri approaches, he gives her a close look.{/n} "
"\"Well, good day to you, beauty! Can't say I recognize you, unfortunately. "
"Where are you from?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}큰 흉터가 얼굴에 나 있는 회색 머리의 야만인 남자는 천막에 앉아있습니다. 그는 조는 것 같지만 아미리가 접근하자 아미리를 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"예쁜 처자구만! 말을 걸지 않을 수가 없지. 아가씨는 어디에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "a2c146ee-ecb8-4cc6-9b0e-37f80a51127b"
msgid ""
"\"You're really far from home! And at a bad time, too. We got a war going on "
"here, if you hadn't noticed. Why, for all I know, you could be a spy!\""
msgstr "\"정말 먼 곳에서 왔구만! 그리고 나쁜 시기에 오기도 했어. 여기는 전쟁이 벌어졌지. 잘못하면 첩자로 몰릴 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "394093e8-e763-4579-92a0-7db874f4fc64"
msgid ""
"\"Aaah, Bears. You're late, kiddo. Get lost, did ya? Your tribe headed out "
"long ago with one of the Sisters. Only some mischief maker remained, "
"whatchacaller... {d|Nilak}Nilak{/d}, yes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여섯곰 부족이라. 너무 늦게 왔어. 도망쳤나? 너희 부족은 오래 전에 얼굴 잃은 자매 하나와 함께 갔어. 한 명의 이름이 "
"기억나는데... {d|Nilak}닐락{/d}이라던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b57f249e-feb8-4e1a-b378-767d5e431ac2"
msgid ""
"\"Blind? No, thank {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}, my eyes're still good. Good as my "
"memory for faces! Speaking of, can't say I've seen you around here before.\""
msgstr "\"미쳤냐고? 아니. 나는 멀쩡해. 기억력도 나쁘지 않다고! 하지만 너는 보지 못한 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "a5738a1d-bb86-4fee-867a-169766838dd4"
msgid ""
"\"Not sure 'stay' is the right word — she was left behind. They trussed up "
"her hands and legs and left her by Armag's tent. She was too smartass for "
"her own good, and too bold for her age. Tried to talk us into rioting. Once "
"Armag's back, he'll decide what to do with her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 버려졌지. 그들이 그녀의 팔다리를 묶고 아르막의 텐트에 두고 갔어. 그녀는 너무 똑똑하고 용감하더군. 우리에게 반란을 "
"일으키라고 하더군. 아르막이 돌아오면 그녀를 처리할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "d0d19764-c0cb-407a-b671-73b7c38c4e46"
msgid ""
"\"Why, where else should he be, the traitor! He's sitting by Armag's tent, "
"all tied up! Just waiting till the chieftain comes back to cut off his lying "
"tongue and stick it up his ass!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜, 반역자가 어떻게 되든 뭔 상관이야! 그는 꽁꽁 묶인 채로 아르막의 천막에서 기다리는 중이야! 족장이 돌아와서 놈의 거짓말쟁이 "
"혀를 잘라 똥구멍에 꽂아주기만을 기다리고 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "e1ccadab-0fe4-4674-a2ab-66e482e0d142"
msgid ""
"\"There was one walking around somewhere, I think... Ask around, I'm sure "
"you'll find her in no time. And she'll let you know where to go and what to "
"do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 주변에 걸어다니는 자가 있었어. 내 생각에는... 곧 그녀를 찾을 수 있을 거야. 그녀가 어디로 가서 무엇을 해야 할지 알려줄 "
"거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "af2802ec-de49-4a7a-a962-8c13b00fd02c"
msgid ""
"\"How should I know? He's the chieftain, and we're at war — I'd guess he's "
"out commanding his army!\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 알아? 그는 족장이고 지금은 전쟁 중이야. 아마 명령을 불복종했겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "e83a7752-4814-4219-b4f5-69621b4e8d4c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, kiddo, my fighting days are long past. No sword could bring me down, "
"no arrow could pierce me, but the teeth of time gnaw at me all the same, as "
"you can see. Not much good for the battlefield now, but I can sit here and "
"guard the entrance — at least this way I can still make myself useful.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 꼬마야. 나는 오랫동안 싸워왔다. 어떤 검과 화살도 나를 쓰러뜨리지 못했지만 시간이 나를 갉아먹었을 뿐이지. 지금은 싸울 나이가 "
"아니지만 여기에 앉아서 입구를 지킬 수는 있어. 그렇게라도 쓸모가 있어야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "d93d7514-2b84-49b5-ba3c-1b14386e3e69"
msgid ""
"\"You hadn't heard? The rascal killed four Sisters, then tried talking us "
"into rioting! Well, you don't change horses midstream, is what I say. With a "
"huge battle just around the corner, he starts plotting and scheming behind "
"the chieftain's back? If he were a decent man, he'd have waited till we'd "
"won, then challenged the chieftain to an honest fight! The man's scum, I "
"tell ya.\""
msgstr ""
"\"못들었어? 그 녀석이 얼굴 잃은 자매 넷을 죽이고 우리에게 반란을 일으키라고 했어! 곧 큰 전투가 벌어지는데 그가 족장의 뒤에서 음모를 "
"꾸몄지. 그가 멀쩡했다면 우리가 이길 때까지 기다리고 그 후에 족장에게 정당한 싸움을 청했어야지! 그 자는 쓰레기야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "c01f50bd-627a-477f-be87-b6aecd5eab30"
msgid "\"What?\""
msgstr "\"뭐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "76fea0a9-0482-432a-841e-8103b5764b8b"
msgid ""
"\"Dugath's, of course! Not his own, that's for sure! Or maybe one of the "
"Sisters'? Course, who knows with these witches and their strange rules...\""
msgstr "\"물론 두가스의 혀지! 그가 직접하는건 아니야! 아마 자매들중 하나가 할지도? 그 마녀들이 하는 짓을 누가 알겠어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "a0c6a0b7-1fff-4ff0-9ed5-38a89efc215c"
msgid ""
"\"What do you need, Rimi? Take your time, have a seat here — the Sister will "
"be by soon, and she can explain everything for you.\""
msgstr "\"뭐가 필요하지? 천천히 생각해. 얼굴 잃은 자매가 곧 올 테니 너에게 모두 설명해 줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "02cf4473-8a5a-4a7e-8153-e5fcb2d5feb5"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, hold on! Where you think you're going? Stop there, if you want to "
"keep your hide! You got no idea how angry our dogs are! They don't normally "
"bother locals, but soon as they smell your kind, anyone from Bears, they "
"charge instantly and go straight for the throat! You'd best just take a seat "
"here beside me. The Sister will be by soon, and she can explain everything "
"for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 기다려! 어디로 가는 거야? 가죽이 벗겨지고 싶지 않다면 멈춰! 우리 개들이 얼마나 사나운지 모르는군! 그 녀석들은 보통 "
"사람들을 물지 않지만 여섯곰 부족 출신인 네 냄새를 맡으면 달려들어서 목을 물 거야! 내 옆에서 기다리라고. 얼굴 잃은 자매가 곧 오면 "
"모두 설명해 줄 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "3bf4684c-4e90-4e23-8e10-5ac67d17bf6b"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man doesn't even try to grab is sword. He instead fills his chest "
"with air and yells as loud as he can,{/n} \"Help! We're under attack!\""
msgstr "{n}나이든 남자는 무기를 잡지도 않습니다. 그는 숨을 들이키더니 큰 소리로 외칩니다.{/n} \"도와줘! 공격이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "cbc7ab6a-92a2-44c2-9101-cf7f1f4c96d9"
msgid ""
"\"A joke, at a time like this! Us at war, and she tells jokes! Well, your "
"Bears aren't here. They left with one of the Sisters. Except this one piece "
"of work, whatchacaller... Nilak, yes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이런 때에 농담이라니! 우리는 전쟁 중인데 말이야! 너희 여섯곰 부족은 여기에 없어. 그들은 얼굴 잃은 자매 한명과 떠났다. 한명 "
"빼고. 누구더라... 닐락이었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "9df21d67-0f77-4344-bef2-896b671f107d"
msgid ""
"\"Joking, you say? Well, I've heard jokes like that before...\" {n}The old "
"man squints menacingly and quickly yells out,{/n} \"Hey! Everyone, over "
"here! We got a spy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"농담이라고? 그런 농담은 들어 봤는데...\" {n}나이든 남자는 헛기침을 하고는 고함을 지릅니다.{/n} \"이봐! 여기다! 첩자다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "3cd9616b-a91b-435e-bc7e-c950acdbc7e8"
msgid ""
"\"Fine, I didn't say a thing, don't fret! But you're pretty late, child. "
"Your Bears headed out long ago with one of the Sisters. Except this one "
"piece of work, whatchacaller... Nilak, yes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아. 나는 아무 말도 하지 않을게. 그만! 하지만 너는 너무 늦었어. 너희 곰부족은 오래 전에 얼굴 잃은 자매들과 함께 갔다. 한명만 "
"빼고... 누구더라... 닐락. 그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Amiri_inCamp_Welcome/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "03668e06-5c4d-4308-9236-af865c7eb17b"
msgid ""
"{n}Instead of answering, the old man squints menacingly and quickly yells "
"out,{/n} \"Hey! Everyone, over here! We got a spy!\""
msgstr "{n}답변하는 대신 늙은 남자는 헛기침을 하고 고함을 지릅니다.{/n} \"이봐! 여기다! 첩자다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e9d3335f-2004-4104-9129-9a92f01dbae8"
msgid "\"My name's Amiri, and I'm here to kill you, Armag!"
msgstr "\"내 이름은 아미리야. 너를 죽이러 왔다. 아르막!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "4aaa450b-ff85-4704-bd9e-1b67403b70b3"
msgid "\"Your witch killed Nilak! You'll pay, Armag! You'll pay in blood!\""
msgstr "\"너희 마녀가 닐락을 죽였어! 네가 대가를 치를 거다! 피로 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "68fbddb2-6708-458d-961a-c3a9d0b9c0c7"
msgid ""
"\"Your witch wanted to kill Nilak like cattle, without even a charge or "
"trial! I'm gonna make you answer for that!\""
msgstr "\"너희 마녀가 닐락을 재판도 없이 소처럼 죽이고 싶어 했다! 내가 너가 그에 대한 대답을 하게 해주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "b2ff3c5c-5f1e-4ca7-a566-c7d9c6822a38"
msgid "\"You're not chieftain anymore, Armag! You've been deposed!\""
msgstr "\"너는 더 이상 족장이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "d74e8367-8d83-42e3-801b-a8563009a29d"
msgid ""
"{n}Slowly, methodically, a huge barbarian with a bushy beard approaches the "
"tents. His bloodshot eyes wander over the campsite. His booming voice "
"rumbles, addressing no one in particular,{/n} \"Smells like blood... Yes, "
"blood! Who dares shed blood here without first calling Armag?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}천천히 거대한 야만인은 천막으로 접근합니다. 그의 충혈된 눈은 캠프를 둘러봅니다. 그는 으르렁거립니다.{/n} \"피 냄새가 "
"나... 그래. 피다! 누가 아르막의 허락 없이 여기서 피를 흘렸지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "65fab1ff-db3b-4033-bbcc-caa30fb0cd1a"
msgid ""
"{n}Armag's gaze crosses over Amiri without stopping on her.{/n} \"The girl "
"thinks to match Armag? Bold! The Six Bears should be proud of such a fighter!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르막의 눈빛은 아미리의 뒤를 향합니다.{/n} \"아르막과 대결하고 싶은 계집이라고? 용감하군! 여섯곰 부족은 용감한 전사를 "
"가졌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "e7943c53-501e-4b33-bfb2-eb198db0bad3"
msgid ""
"{n}Armag's eyes cross over Amiri before settling on the bodies spread across "
"the ground.{/n} \"Armag didn't order the bard's death... A shame, such a "
"shame. The Sister's act was low, and she paid for it!\" {n}Armag's voice "
"rises in anger, and saliva hangs from his beard.{/n} \"But the girl wants "
"blood payment? She'll have to TAKE what she wants!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르막의 눈빛은 아미리를 너머 널부러져있는 시체들에 고정됩니다.{/n} \"아르막은 음유시인을 죽이라고 명령하지 않았다... "
"부끄러운 일이다. 얼굴 잃은 자매의 행동은 비열했고 대가를 치르게 할 것이다!\" {n}아르막의 목소리는 분노가 가득했고 수염에는 침이 "
"흘렀습니다.{/n} \"하지만 그 계집이 피의 대가를 원한다고? 그렇다면 그렇게 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "13f8ddc0-5fd9-405d-8556-1baf7ffb1317"
msgid ""
"\"So be it! Armag and the girl will fight before the eyes of "
"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}, like in ancient times! One-on-one! Everyone, gather now! "
"Draw the circle so we may fight! Blood for blood!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋다. 아르막과 계집은 {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이 보는 앞에서 싸울 것이다! 모두 모여라! 우리 주위로 원을 만들어라! 피는 피로 "
"갚는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "1efa260a-37fc-424b-a555-d20efe7217cd"
msgid ""
"{n}As Armag's gaze wanders over the campsite without resting on anything in "
"particular, he notices Amiri, Nilak, and the Sister's body lying on the "
"ground.{/n} \"The Six Bears crawled to Armag, on their bellies, begging for "
"his protection! And this is how they repay the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger "
"Lords'{/g} hospitality?! The girl killed the Sister — Armag demands payment "
"in blood!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르막의 시선이 어딘가에 머물지 않고 캠프를 이리저리 옮겼고 그는 아미리와 닐락 그리고 바닥에 누운 얼굴 잃은 자매의 시신을 "
"봅니다.{/n} \"여섯곰 부족은 아르막에게 보호해달라고 빌었지! 그리고 이것이 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족이 "
"호의에 보답하는 방식인가? 얼굴 잃은 자매를 죽인 계집의 피를 취하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "01c1bb95-f3ac-49d3-9632-edf03e14878e"
msgid ""
"{n}Slowly, methodically, a huge barbarian with matted hair and a bushy beard "
"approaches the tent. Blood spatters cover his face, chest, hands, and boots. "
"His bloodshot eyes wander over the campsite. His booming voice rumbles, "
"addressing no one in particular,{/n} \"Is this... a riot? Worms... Scum! A "
"riot against who? Against Armag?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}천천히 수염이 덥수룩한 거대한 야만인은 천막에 접근합니다. 그의 얼굴은 피로 범벅되었고 가슴과 손 그리고 장화에도 피가 묻었습니다. "
"그의 충혈된 눈은 캠프를 둘러봅니다. 그는 으르렁거립니다.{/n} \"반란인가? 벌레 녀석들... 쓰레기 새끼들! 감히 누구에게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "9fbbb82e-1d45-4349-986c-9769026368ac"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian's huge, muscular body shakes with laughter.{/n} \"Armag, "
"not chieftain? Then who is?\" {n}His gaze wanders over the campsite again, "
"then raises to the sky, as if anticipating enemies from above as well. "
"Without looking down to Amiri, he continues,{/n} \"The {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger "
"Lords{/g} know how one becomes chieftain!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}야만인의 근육질 몸은 웃음으로 들썩입니다.{/n} \"아르막이 족장이 아니라고? 그럼 누구지?\" {n}그는 캠프 주위를 둘러보다 "
"하늘에서 적이 쏟아지는 것을 기대하는 듯 하늘을 몹니다. 아미리를 무시한 그는 말합니다.{/n} \"{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 "
"군주{/g}는 누가 족장이 될지 알고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/ArmagDuelStart/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "0a6d9974-d776-43f9-9913-aa135c5dec25"
msgid ""
"\"In the circle! One-on-one! Before the eyes of {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}!\" {n}"
"Armag's voice grows louder and more frantic with each word. His eyes go red, "
"and drops of saliva hang from his beard.{/n} \"Armag accepts this challenge! "
"To the circle! The circle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"원을 만들어라! 일기토다! {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}의 눈 앞에서!\" {n}아르막의 목소리는 커지고 점점 광기로 변합니다. 그의 "
"눈은 충혈되었고 입에서는 침을 흘립니다.{/n} \"아르막이 도전을 받아들인다! 원을 만들어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheating_Sister_String
msgctxt "8f36b4fe-2c49-443f-85ce-661d7c83a4ca"
msgid "\"Enough of this foolishness...\""
msgstr "\"멍청한 짓은 이만하면 됐다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_Barbarian_1_String
msgctxt "508fb642-dd6f-4fe8-8b96-e474bc966129"
msgid "\"Hey, girl! Can you even lift a sword?\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 검은 뽑을 줄 아나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_Barbarian_2_String
msgctxt "9f4c8dcf-eda5-4f53-af98-cac73d1f1888"
msgid "\"Ar-mag! Ar-mag! Ar-mag!\""
msgstr "\"아르막! 아르막! 아르막!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_Barbarian_3_String
msgctxt "098d554c-bdd7-41da-8833-4998dc70393c"
msgid "\"Come on, Chieftain! Bring her down!\""
msgstr "\"족장! 저 년을 쓰러뜨려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_Barbarian_4_String
msgctxt "ef633c47-9ff4-4fd5-8785-a51d588bbd85"
msgid "\"Booooo!\""
msgstr "\"우우우!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_Barbarian_5_String
msgctxt "979eab9b-caab-45a9-b2f0-24043d0c2c0f"
msgid "[Shrill whistling]"
msgstr "[날카로운 휘파람 소리]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_Barbarian_6_String
msgctxt "2495b279-ce23-4a37-9c90-e181f1034d6f"
msgid "\"Punch her till she understands!\""
msgstr "\"고분고분해질 때까지 패버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_for_Amiri_1_String
msgctxt "276407c1-0e67-4f41-88f3-b45e4e00e82e"
msgid "\"Gorum help her!\""
msgstr "\"고룸이 그녀를 돕기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_for_Amiri_2_String
msgctxt "3446ea04-c438-4e61-9f3f-2210657a6128"
msgid "\"Hit him! Harder!\""
msgstr "\"공격해! 더 강하게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_for_Amiri_3_String
msgctxt "badbd45d-d9b5-4419-8c5a-62b7d41c7422"
msgid "\"Give him hell!\""
msgstr "\"지옥으로 보내버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_for_Amiri_4_String
msgctxt "96addd22-2ad7-4cb6-982a-5af5aa4768ed"
msgid "\"Booo! Armag's a traitor!\""
msgstr "\"우우! 아르막은 배신자다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_for_Amiri_5_String
msgctxt "e47c5153-3235-48db-a855-41f4702642dd"
msgid "\"You're dead, Armag!\""
msgstr "\"너는 죽은 목숨이다. 아르막!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_Duel/Cheering_for_Amiri_6_String
msgctxt "7efecffa-d5da-4464-a6a8-15d30b2f9ca7"
msgid "\"A-mi-ri! A-mi-ri!\""
msgstr "\"아미리! 아미리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_cutscene/Armag_cutscene_1_fail_String
msgctxt "c35cd295-1625-4826-8703-e8539ae488df"
msgid "\"Weak! Pathetic! Worthless!\""
msgstr "\"약하고 한심하군! 벌레 같은 녀석!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_cutscene/Armag_cutscene_1_win_String
msgctxt "448d803a-62ad-4829-9025-be7609691c59"
msgid ""
"\"Who dares defile the sanctity of the duel?! Shame! Armag will find — Armag "
"will kill!\""
msgstr "\"누가 감히 신성한 결투를 더럽히는 거지? 부끄러운 줄 알아라! 아르막이 찾아 그 녀석을 죽일 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_cutscene/Armag_cutscene_2_String
msgctxt "d4f3bdd4-c1c7-40ef-97ea-1a6d1829e627"
msgid ""
"\"Tie the girl. She'll be executed after the battle so everyone can see what "
"happens to those who stand in Armag's way!\""
msgstr "\"계집을 묶어라. 그녀는 모두가 보는 전투가 끝나고 처형될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_cutscene/Armag_cutscene_3_String
msgctxt "78baaea3-1f30-430f-a138-2911b94a6711"
msgid ""
"\"Now... Continue the battle. Armag must leave... No one dares object! It's "
"important — the most important thing in the world!\""
msgstr "\"이제... 계속해서 전투를 하겠다. 아르막은 떠나야 한다... 누구도 감히 거절하지 말아라! 가장 중요한 일이니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Armag_cutscene/Barbarian_cutscene_0_String
msgctxt "f95f10cf-1e55-4daa-8f2c-562525b36dc3"
msgid ""
"\"Warlord, we've captured an enemy spy! Let's kill her in Gorum's name!\""
msgstr "\"족장. 적의 첩자를 잡았어! 고룸의 이름으로 이 녀석을 죽이자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Brevoy_Soldier_1_String
msgctxt "8199bdea-f947-499f-acf8-674e286751b0"
msgid "\"Get ready, people! They're coming!\""
msgstr "\"준비해! 그들이 온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Brevoy_Soldier_2_String
msgctxt "e16ebb36-4924-4c11-9c9e-bdd6bef334cf"
msgid "\"The barbarians are still a way off, but I can smell them already!\""
msgstr "\"야만인은 먼 곳에 있지만 그들의 냄새가 나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Brevoy_Soldier_3_String
msgctxt "0c5a0eac-5037-468f-a620-ba5dc1caa575"
msgid "\"Doesn't matter how many of them there are — they'll all die here!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 수가 많은지는 중요하지 않아. 그들은 모두 여기서 죽는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Brevoy_Soldier_4_String
msgctxt "dbffa026-02f8-453b-a172-71520f055260"
msgid "\"I bet I'll kill at least a dozen!\""
msgstr "\"내가 적어도 열놈은 죽일 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Brevoy_Soldier_5_String
msgctxt "de0bfa95-1e56-45d1-b822-0af8d6f0ecd5"
msgid "\"They shouldn't have come here!\""
msgstr "\"그들은 여기에 오지도 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Brevoy_Soldier_6_String
msgctxt "3ebee48d-b863-4ccf-bcfe-d658055128b2"
msgid "\"We'll bury them here!\""
msgstr "\"그들을 묻어버리자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Brevoy_Soldier_7_String
msgctxt "b103542a-b9b9-4a46-86bb-47cc932f53a7"
msgid "\"Have no fear! Bring the heat to this pantless scum!\""
msgstr "\"두려워 마! 이 쓰레기들에게 본때를 보여주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Brevoy_Soldier_8_String
msgctxt "2e2b22f9-2f3a-42af-ba6d-b761f9dbde70"
msgid "\"This will be a glorious fight!\""
msgstr "\"영광스러운 전투가 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/Kassil_alive_String
msgctxt "2cf6c968-3a4c-44be-91d4-5565a941992d"
msgid "\"I'm glad to see you again! Now we'll win without a doubt!\""
msgstr "\"너를 다시 보아 기쁘다! 이제 우리는 이길 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/LeaderGiant1_String
msgctxt "a963d3e5-9316-45ae-a4c8-533f5ca5c2ba"
msgid "\"Too much fight. Too little food. Not what tiny allies promised!\""
msgstr "\"너무나 많은 싸움이 있었어. 식량은 없었고. 동맹도 거의 없었지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/LeaderGiant2_String
msgctxt "3a67e6bb-555e-4c19-baee-cc2d880a6f3f"
msgid "\"Go away, tiny thing. Byrk no want to fight. Byrk no want to talk.\""
msgstr "\"꺼져. 꽹이. 나는 싸우고 싶지 않아. 혼자 있고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/LeaderGiant3_String
msgctxt "bc1b8d50-4850-4302-b9b3-96c0d126c160"
msgid "\"Away! Byrk getting angry.\""
msgstr "\"꺼져! Byrk 화난다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/LeaderGiant4_String
msgctxt "2e3f56c0-126a-4886-97e5-e710e8295cdd"
msgid "\"Annoying little thing die now!\""
msgstr "\"짜증나는 새끼는 죽어버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/RandomGiant1_String
msgctxt "4bb493e3-d18a-44c7-8f62-af832af13aa1"
msgid "\"I no talk to strangers. Go talk to Byrk!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이방인과 대화하지 않아. Byrk에게 말해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_early/RandomGiant2_String
msgctxt "106eeb67-40cd-4002-a535-4462a00134dd"
msgid "\"Byrk leads us. Talk to Byrk.\""
msgstr "\"Byrk가 우리를 이끈다. Byrk에게 말해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Barbarian_1_String
msgctxt "22b243c3-5507-4364-97e0-57857332dbcf"
msgid "\"For Gorum!\""
msgstr "\"고룸을 위하여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Barbarian_2_String
msgctxt "56e6a14d-a0ee-465f-804d-44a1dde786b2"
msgid "\"Blood! I thirst for blood!\""
msgstr "\"피! 피가 고프다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Barbarian_3_String
msgctxt "bdb95972-b7ff-495e-856e-b14d4d1a0448"
msgid "\"Cut them!\""
msgstr "\"죽여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Barbarian_4_String
msgctxt "ef4a4980-45f5-4dae-9a19-8d56c90659f5"
msgid "\"Rrraaarrr!\""
msgstr "\"으아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Barbarian_5_String
msgctxt "63506b29-7384-4d7c-955c-3f7743f6e006"
msgid "\"Smash! Kill!\""
msgstr "\"공격! 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Barbarian_6_String
msgctxt "e4745367-e4f2-4400-9ecc-a18ba85b7a63"
msgid "\"Hail Armag!\""
msgstr "\"아르막 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Barbarian_7_String
msgctxt "9563dd19-3432-4cf4-b5fa-0abefb00c90e"
msgid "\"Gorum! Take them as sacrifice!\""
msgstr "\"Gorum! 저들을 바칩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Barbarian_8_String
msgctxt "8970347b-dd94-4335-b6bd-cb4b6adb773d"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Brevoy_1_String
msgctxt "1ef86b03-ec83-4c16-9b0b-eeb56c54f2af"
msgid "\"Giants! Where did they get giants?!\""
msgstr "\"거인들이다! 어디서 거인을 몰고 온 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Brevoy_2_String
msgctxt "6b76d8e3-d81f-4f10-971f-5ae58fbd5c65"
msgid "\"This is the end!\""
msgstr "\"끝이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Brevoy_3_String
msgctxt "2a4b64d8-7541-4bac-a498-bb745c5d36bb"
msgid "\"Fear not! This battle isn't over yet!\""
msgstr "\"두려워 마! 이 전투는 아직 끝나지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Brevoy_4_String
msgctxt "e3387ff4-c17d-4155-9c84-a3e31a8154dd"
msgid "\"Hold the line! Drive them back!\""
msgstr "\"전선을 사수하라! 그들을 몰아내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Brevoy_5_String
msgctxt "fe3232e9-edb4-43df-9a79-126966a03101"
msgid "\"All is lost...\""
msgstr "\"다 끝났어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Brevoy_6_String
msgctxt "26ad4293-4adf-4ed5-a220-4de180a73c24"
msgid "\"You won't take me so easily!\""
msgstr "\"나를 쉽게 물리치지는 못할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Brevoy_7_String
msgctxt "b427f396-c5b4-4e2b-b7de-51c767ee3fdd"
msgid "\"For Restov!\""
msgstr "\"레스토프를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Brevoy_8_String
msgctxt "248909a9-3c24-4ac6-8fed-338a00046786"
msgid "\"Don't give up!\""
msgstr "\"포기하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/Kassil_dead_String
msgctxt "9cb5875b-1888-4446-a778-072f7990085c"
msgid "Kassil Aldori protected Lady Jamandi with his life."
msgstr "카실 알도리는 목숨을 걸고 자만디를 지켰습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/LeaderGiant_late_3_String
msgctxt "63a04908-5f92-4e4d-9f7c-254ae2878377"
msgid "\"What you want, tiny thing? We fought long this day. Want rest.\""
msgstr "\"뭘 원하는 거지? 오늘은 오래 싸웠으니 쉬어야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Battlefield_late/LeaderGiant_late_4_String
msgctxt "2446e85a-d595-497b-92ef-49a42be741c4"
msgid "\"No more fight. We tired. We go!\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 싸움은 그만. 우리는 지쳤어. 가야겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Loyal_1_String
msgctxt "18128638-e8d5-4153-ac86-4218384e9abf"
msgid "\"What are you doing?! We're on your side!\""
msgstr "\"뭐하는 거야? 우린 네 편이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Loyal_2_String
msgctxt "312e9d04-70e6-4496-b4aa-59cc866309df"
msgid "\"Treachery! Over here, everyone!\""
msgstr "\"반역이다! 여기! 어서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Loyal_3_String
msgctxt "c2e4d823-9a36-42c8-a4b9-552127584f24"
msgid "\"Death to traitors!\""
msgstr "\"반역자에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Loyal_4_String
msgctxt "d7b8d508-f22f-4b7d-ab7b-bdad0fb00b6f"
msgid "\"You kill your own kin!\""
msgstr "\"동족을 살해하다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Loyal_5_String
msgctxt "31a9b6ea-a532-454a-bf3a-41edf62165a4"
msgid "\"For Armag!\""
msgstr "\"아르막을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Loyal_6_String
msgctxt "4ff8a9c3-c16c-4562-9883-93496ba39af5"
msgid "\"Armag will flay you!\""
msgstr "\"아르막이 너를 벌할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Loyal_7_String
msgctxt "d8aab28a-ba8e-4169-947d-18e9613d7c34"
msgid "\"We'll feed you to the wolves!\""
msgstr "\"너를 늑대 먹이로 주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Loyal_8_String
msgctxt "0d7fbd4f-6b52-4d71-a26b-89ab4dffae70"
msgid "\"You leprous hyena spawn!\""
msgstr "\"썩은 하이에나 같은 새끼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Rebel_1_String
msgctxt "87e792e5-dc84-40f8-ad7a-6897a88693c5"
msgid "\"Drop your weapons and you'll be spared!\""
msgstr "\"무기를 내리면 목숨을 살려주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Rebel_2_String
msgctxt "250d14cd-e0fe-44be-a210-dff9e5a9a71f"
msgid "\"You were deceived!\""
msgstr "\"너는 속았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Rebel_3_String
msgctxt "0becab92-bc08-454f-b36b-aff7c771fad9"
msgid "\"Fight the Sisters, not us!\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매를 죽여! 우리가 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Rebel_4_String
msgctxt "5a997d1e-35e0-4aa4-9b5e-434c64fb321a"
msgid "\"Armag's a traitor!\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 배신자다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Rebel_5_String
msgctxt "50694688-cc64-4edb-bb22-cb6dcc7d706e"
msgid "\"Armag abandoned us!\""
msgstr "\"아르막이 우리를 배신했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Rebel_6_String
msgctxt "bd8b9e51-98fb-47db-af84-2bb49c217040"
msgid "\"The Sisters put a spell on Armag to doom us all!\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매가 아르막에게 마법을 걸었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Rebel_7_String
msgctxt "ff6bea07-cb85-4a48-acbb-708147f1cd20"
msgid "\"Armag's not chieftain anymore!\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 더 이상 족장이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Rebel_8_String
msgctxt "acd27387-823d-42f3-8c87-4848a6de0d3b"
msgid "\"This fight's a trap!\""
msgstr "\"이 싸움은 덫이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Surrender_1_String
msgctxt "108cd8eb-a469-46ab-86db-7ec0754e115b"
msgid "\"I yield! No more!\""
msgstr "\"항복이야! 그만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Surrender_2_String
msgctxt "90c4663c-99e0-42cc-bc8c-f34b3e2833ed"
msgid "\"Stop swinging! Just explain what's going on!\""
msgstr "\"그만! 무슨 일이 일어났는지 설명해봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Surrender_3_String
msgctxt "cd91c50c-1cb7-4553-8b62-cd81101f966c"
msgid "\"Peace, peace! Hold your weapons!\""
msgstr "\"진정해! 무기를 내려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Attack/Surrender_4_String
msgctxt "29445f6a-150b-4222-ad72-de4f5999dc5a"
msgid "\"Armag, a traitor?! That scum!\""
msgstr "\"아르막이 배신자라고?! 쓰레기 자식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Agressive_1_String
msgctxt "c5bdc26c-fc13-450b-90a5-639dcdc1d622"
msgid "\"Tie her up!\""
msgstr "\"저 여자를 묶어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Agressive_2_String
msgctxt "88988c67-f830-4ac5-b402-da75fdb3c683"
msgid "\"She's crazy!\""
msgstr "\"미친 여자다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Agressive_3_String
msgctxt "4b79af77-b5b3-48ad-bee3-081b94df5145"
msgid "\"These Six Bears have frostbite in their brains!\""
msgstr "\"여섯곰 부족은 머리가 돌아버렸군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Agressive_4_String
msgctxt "a61b3d25-2265-4439-b065-ca866a9dcc86"
msgid "\"Get her to the ground!\""
msgstr "\"저 여자를 잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Agressive_5_String
msgctxt "e6669ed0-70c6-4efc-a857-6e07d85db399"
msgid "\"Flank her! Surround her!\""
msgstr "\"공격해! 포위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Idle_1_String
msgctxt "faca22ce-ad82-4708-ab1a-858fb323562f"
msgid "\"Brevans! Ha! Are they even really fighters?\""
msgstr "\"브레보이인들이여! 전사는 없는 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Idle_2_String
msgctxt "acf0e8e5-626a-49d1-a91d-3cb7f562243d"
msgid "\"We'll crush them and return to Numeria as rich men!\""
msgstr "\"저들을 쳐부셔 약탈하고 누메리아로 돌아갈 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Idle_3_String
msgctxt "3ac689bf-8bfc-4c19-9264-1098b05ddaed"
msgid "\"We'll do well with Armag leading us!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 이끄는 아르막과 함께 할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Idle_4_String
msgctxt "af5b4f89-d0de-4950-8302-2882302ffd9c"
msgid "\"Damn... My belt broke!\""
msgstr "\"젠장... 내 허리띠가 부서졌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Barbarian_Idle_5_String
msgctxt "32d17bfe-cf89-47e2-81ab-bfad56fcffd2"
msgid "\"Hey, has anyone seen my shield?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 내 방패 본 사람 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Hound_1_String
msgctxt "adde7206-832e-4214-a569-2a325c6878e6"
msgid "\"Who's there? Show yourself!\""
msgstr "\"거기 누구야? 모습을 드러내라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Hound_2_String
msgctxt "aeb5c056-d4e0-4078-84e1-b25c598b00fc"
msgid "\"Who's there...? Hmm, was probably nothing...\""
msgstr "\"거기 누구야...? 아무것도 아닌가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Camp_Stealth/Hound_3_String
msgctxt "6aa985af-8ff2-4943-bb8a-152de10413a5"
msgid "\"Why are we patrolling here, of all places? Who'd want in here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기를 돌아다니는 거지? 누구를 찾는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Dead_Dugath_String
msgctxt "99bf8874-7f00-4056-930e-32d442bf2d48"
msgid "Dugath, a true follower of Gorum, was slain by a vile backstab."
msgstr "두가스는 잔인하게 뒤에서 기습당해 죽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Dead_Nilak_String
msgctxt "ffca4588-6e23-4297-b215-ece6bc0ed0fc"
msgid "Nilak's throat has been slit."
msgstr "닐락의 목이 베어져있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Welcome_zone/Hilla_String
msgctxt "98c1c809-19ca-4636-bb9e-8b809da2e76d"
msgid "\"That Armag! Son of a witch!\""
msgstr "\"아르막! 나쁜 자식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Welcome_zone/Nameless_barbarian_1_String
msgctxt "56468e98-08e1-47af-88a0-6525c88ed2ad"
msgid "\"He promised us wealth and glory — and what did we get?!\""
msgstr "\"그가 우리에게 부와 영광을 약속했는데 우리는 무엇을 얻었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Welcome_zone/Nameless_barbarian_2_String
msgctxt "9a53d125-29d3-46f5-bc09-c49b67f0c982"
msgid "\"I never liked those Sisters!\""
msgstr "\"얼굴 잃은 자매를 증오해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Welcome_zone/Nameless_barbarian_3_String
msgctxt "b926deb9-1005-4852-ac68-02328958a3a7"
msgid "\"Armag can no longer be trusted!\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 더 이상 믿을 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Barks/Welcome_zone/Nober_String
msgctxt "2c89bf6b-141a-4e25-a1ec-cba4a6c28a6f"
msgid "\"I trusted my chieftain... I would have followed him anywhere!\""
msgstr "\"우리 족장을 믿었는데... 어디든 따라가고 싶었는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a177f8d7-736f-4425-83ba-eed38d35ef6a"
msgid ""
"...tried to kill the Sister swiftly, hoping no one in the camp would notice "
"her."
msgstr "...얼굴 잃은 자매를 캠프 안에서 누가 보지 못하게 신속히 죽이려고 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "33efefb9-811a-4466-93e0-20e8c5fbf5db"
msgid "...turned away and pretended to mend a tent."
msgstr "...등을 돌려 천막을 고치는 척합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d89e3daa-3d50-43f6-8819-6a7fb482cdc9"
msgid ""
"...walked by calmly, hoping the Sister wouldn't recognize her after all."
msgstr "...얼굴 잃은 자매가 그녀를 보지 못하기를 바라며 조용히 걸어갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "42fda50a-7cf9-48d0-b314-950fc564ea6e"
msgid "...darted down a side passage, hoping to avoid the Sister's notice."
msgstr "...얼굴 잃은 자매의 시선을 피하려 길가에 엎드려 숨습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0025_Text_String
msgctxt "ee927bab-abd4-433c-b8c7-1b8fe87df31f"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e3a87b96-981b-492c-8ac8-15204d30cc53"
msgid ""
"Hoping no one in the camp would notice, Amiri attacked the Sister from "
"behind."
msgstr "캠프의 누구도 보지 않기를 바라면서 아미리는 얼굴 잃은 자매를 뒤에서 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "1e0a3e36-58ed-4893-9c49-2fd9b9479e55"
msgid ""
"Trying to look busy, Amiri followed the Sister, hoping the guards wouldn't "
"question her."
msgstr "경비들이 말을 걸지 못하도록 얼굴 잃은 자매를 따라가며 바쁜척을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "da5332f5-3f7f-4418-aad3-ac2f39ab2bd2"
msgid ""
"Hoping to overhear something interesting, Amiri followed the Sister "
"unnoticed."
msgstr "무언가 흥미로운 얘기를 듣기를 기대하며 아미리는 얼굴 잃은 자매를 몰래 따라갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "916edb3c-d2fa-4ba5-8176-3014536df0bc"
msgid ""
"Waiting for the Sister to move out of sight, Amiri then continued to move "
"forward."
msgstr "얼굴 잃은 자매가 지나가기를 기다리고는 아미리는 계속해서 움직입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "c024d275-edc0-4c0a-8363-c3a860efe875"
msgid ""
"While sneaking around the camp, Amiri spotted a familiar cloak nearby. One "
"of the Defaced Sisters was approaching! Amiri was sure the sorceress would "
"recognize her and raise a fuss if she was spotted. What was she supposed to "
"do in this situation? Amiri..."
msgstr ""
"캠프 주위를 살금살금 걸어가면서 아미리는 익숙한 망토를 입은 자를 발견합니다. 얼굴 잃은 자매 중 하나가 접근하고 있었습니다! 아미리는 "
"마법사가 자신을 보았다고 생각했습니다. 아미리는 어떻게 해야 할까요? 아미리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "f0086cb7-d82e-4633-9a85-4b128711b3d6"
msgid ""
"The Sister's neck cracked easily in Amiri's muscular grip. The slender body "
"fell to the ground like an autumn leaf. A heartbeat later, the barbarian "
"heard a scream — one of the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} was yelling and "
"pointing straight at her. Armed fighters began swarming from the tents. "
"Amiri cursed her luck and gripper her sword — it was going to be a hard "
"fight."
msgstr ""
"얼굴 잃은 자매의 목은 쉽게 부러졌습니다. 날씬한 몸은 바닥에 힘 없이 쓰러집니다. 곧 야만인이 비명 소리를 듣습니다. {g|Tiger "
"Lords}호랑이 군주{/g} 부족 중 한명이 소리를 치며 그녀를 가리킵니다. 무장한 전사들이 천막에서 쏟아져나오기 시작합니다. 아미리는 "
"자신의 신세를 한탄하며 무기를 쥡니다. 힘든 싸움이 될 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "5a6e13f3-57a0-4ff3-8f07-b374105fc962"
msgid ""
"Subduing her fight-or-flight response, Amiri turned away from the Sister and "
"knelt down by one of the tents, attempting to fix its stakes. The witch "
"passed by without a second look."
msgstr ""
"싸울 지 도망갈 지 생각하다가 아미리는 자매로부터 등을 돌려 천막 앞에서 무릎을 꿇고 말뚝을 고치는 척합니다. 마녀는 그저 지나갑니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "11b69566-5f38-472c-b908-209dc9a78b30"
msgid ""
"Feigning indifference on her face while her heart pounded madly, Amiri "
"walked right past the witch. The Sister didn't even notice her. Only when "
"the sorceress was behind her did Amiri dare to breathe. She'd done it!"
msgstr ""
"가슴이 미친듯이 뛰지만 아무렇지 않은 척하며 아미리는 마녀를 지나칩니다. 얼굴 잃은 자매는 그녀를 보지 못했습니다. 마녀를 지나쳤을 때 "
"아미리는 한숨을 내뱉습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "3858b3c6-682c-4ae9-84ae-6db5daf0ab16"
msgid ""
"Feigning indifference on her face, Amiri walked right past the witch. As "
"soon as she though the danger had passed, the Sister turned back to her. "
"\"Hold on! The fighter from the Six Bears? What are you doing here?\" "
"Realizing the jig was up, Amiri charged the sorceress."
msgstr ""
"아무렇지 않은 척하며 아미리는 마녀를 지나칩니다. 그녀가 위험을 무릅쓸 때 얼굴 잃은 자매는 등을 돌려 그녀를 봅니다. \"기다려! 여섯곰 "
"부족의 전사인가? 여기서 뭐하고 있지?\" 정체가 탄로난 아미리는 마법사에게 달려듭니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "7dbfc3e8-5462-48ca-ad8a-2ebecaf1b8af"
msgid ""
"Amiri dashed out of the Sister's path — in one leap, she was able to take "
"cover behind a tent. A passing barbarian threw her a surprised glance, but "
"he just grunted something about crazy Bears and continued on his way. In the "
"meantime, the Sister continued along her way. The immediate danger had "
"passed!"
msgstr ""
"아미리는 얼굴 잃은 자매의 길에서 벗어납니다. 한번의 도약으로 그녀는 천막 뒤에 숨습니다. 지나가는 야만인이 놀란 눈길로 보았지만 그는 "
"여섯곰 부족에 대해 불평을 하며 가던 길을 갔습니다. 한편 얼굴 잃은 자매는 지나쳤습니다. 위험한 순간은 피했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "562c89a3-ee2d-43eb-be51-d4d45c74ada1"
msgid ""
"Amiri dashed out of the Sister's path — and though she was fast, she was "
"none too delicate. Stumbling on one of the tent's guy ropes, she brought the "
"tent down with a clamor. The Sister looked at her and frowned. \"You're not "
"a Tiger Lord... What are you doing here?\" Realizing the jig was up, Amiri "
"charged the sorceress."
msgstr ""
"아미리는 얼굴 잃은 자매의 길에서 벗어납니다. 그녀는 빨랐지만 허둥댔습니다. 천막의 로프가 걸려 천막이 벗겨졌습니다. 얼굴 잃은 자매는 "
"그녀를 보고는 얼굴을 찡그립니다. \"너는 호랑이 군주 부족이 아니야... 여기서 뭐하고 있지?\" 정체가 드러난 아미리는 마녀에게 "
"달려듭니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0024_Text 1_String
msgctxt "12a5d482-6379-4785-b3e6-0295b56c8797"
msgid ""
"Amiri fought angrily and desperately to the end, like a bear fighting off a "
"pack of dogs. But no one can defeat an entire army by themselves. Her "
"bloodstained sword slipped from her fingers, her knees buckled, and an "
"avalanche of men fell upon her. \"Tie her up!\" someone shouted, and Amiri "
"felt a rough rope immobilize her hands and feet. Then they dragged her off, "
"kicking and punching her along the way..."
msgstr ""
"사냥개들에게 둘러쌓인 곰처럼 아미리는 분노하며 끝까지 싸웠습니다. 하지만 수가 많으면 이길 수 없습니다. 그녀의 손가락에서 피가 검을 "
"타고 흘렀고 그녀가 무릎을 꿇자 남자들이 몰려와 그녀를 덮칩니다. \"저 여자를 묶어라!\" 누군가 소리쳤고 아미리는 자신의 손과 발에 "
"로프가 감기는 것을 느꼈습니다. 그들이 그녀를 끌어내는 동안 계속해서 주먹질과 발길질을 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0024_Text_String
msgctxt "b44c1500-cbe9-47dc-af56-f6e8aa3b3293"
msgid "The uneven fight began, and Amiri was eventually captured."
msgstr "불공평한 싸움이 시작되었고 아미리는 잡혔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0034_Text_String
msgctxt "93087302-0c41-406e-9d40-ed0f93afe337"
msgid "Realizing her disguise had failed, she killed the Sister."
msgstr "변장이 실패한 걸 깨달은 그녀는 얼굴 잃은 자매를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "5745cebc-5eb1-4c64-9842-f68aed3775a6"
msgid ""
"Amiri didn't make it very far — without talking to anyone, the Sister walked "
"right past the guards and into Armag's tent. \"Well,\" the barbarian "
"thought, \"even better! Now I won't have to chase her.\""
msgstr ""
"경비에게 말을 걸지 않은 채 자매는 아르막의 천막으로 들어갑니다. 야만인은 생각합니다. \"다행이군! 따라가지 않아도 되겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "bda8d566-9619-41b6-bd00-a849badecd17"
msgid ""
"The Sister passed the guards and headed exactly where Amiri was going — "
"toward Armag's tent. \"Well,\" the barbarian thought, \"even better! Now I "
"won't have to chase her.\""
msgstr ""
"경비를 지나친 얼굴 잃은 자매는 아미리를 가 들어갔던 아르막의 천막으로 들어갑니다. 야만인은 생각합니다. \"다행이군! 따라가지 않아도 "
"되겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "714a31bb-5ce0-4c62-b717-51cd0cfe0271"
msgid ""
"Amiri followed the Sister, thoroughly pretending she had every right to be "
"there. The guards bought her act — they let her follow the Sister without "
"question. The barbarian smiled, satisfied. Her goal was near!"
msgstr ""
"아무렇지 않은 척하며 아미리가 얼굴 잃은 자매를 따라갔습니다. 경비는 눈치 채지 못했고 그들은 아미리를 들여보내줍니다. 야만인은 웃고 "
"있습니다. 아미리의 목표가 눈 앞에 있습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterBookEvent/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "19db02bb-32b2-4b2b-b40e-ba3d84cb4573"
msgid ""
"Amiri followed the Sister confidently, thoroughly pretending she had every "
"right to be there. Alas, the guards proved more vigilant than expected — "
"they let the Sister enter without question, but they stopped Amiri. She "
"cursed to herself — why now, with her goal so close?!"
msgstr ""
"아무렇지 않은 척하며 아미리가 얼굴 잃은 자매를 따라갔습니다. 아아. 경비가 예상보다 눈치가 빨랐습니다. 그들은 얼굴 잃은 자매는 "
"들여보냈지만 아미리는 막았습니다. 아미리는 속으로 욕을 퍼부었습니다. 성공이 눈앞에 있는데 하필?!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterDuel/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : DefacedSister3
msgctxt "211d10e3-f727-4e6a-b165-76455745fdc3"
msgid ""
"{n}Near Armag's tent, Amiri spots a familiar figure clad in a gray cloak. "
"The Sister stands over Nilak, who's bound and helpless. A dagger gleams "
"faintly in the Sister's hand.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아르막의 텐트 근처에서 아미리는 회색 망토를 두른 익숙한 형체를 발견했습니다. 자매는 무력하게 묶여있는 닐락옆에 서 있었습니다. "
"자매의 손에 들린 단검이 희미하게 빛납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterDuel/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9215a6e4-f153-4a46-bb9b-8cb1f6949eb1"
msgid ""
"{n}A dense red fog clouds Amiri's eyes as a roar of anger bursts from her "
"chest. Her body rushes forward, seemingly of its own accord. Her head is "
"empty but for a single ringing thought — kill. Kill. KILL!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}짙은 붉은 안개가 아미리의 눈에 서리면서 동시에 그녀의 심부로부터 분노의 표호가 터져 나온다. 그녀의 몸은 자연스럽게 앞으로 "
"뛰쳐나갔다. 그녀의 머릿속에는 다른 아무것도 없이 오직 하나만이 울려 퍼진다 - 죽인다. 죽인다. 죽인다! {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/DefacedSisterDuel/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : BrevoyBorderlands_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "ad2d623f-5164-47f2-af33-925c220d431a"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath sits nearby — with his hands and legs tied up and his mouth "
"gagged, he stares at the witch with eyes full of hate.{/n}"
msgstr "{n} 두가스는 손과 발이 묵이고 입에는 재갈이 물린채 옆에 앉아있다. 그는 증오에 찬 눈으로 그 마녀를 노려보았다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "bddf0a1f-3688-46ad-ab6d-6c18b6804c7a"
msgid ""
"\"What's going on, Lander? Decided to participate in the battle? You're a "
"bit late, I'm afraid!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이지, 랜더? 전투에 참가하기로 했나? 조금 늦었군, 유감스럽게도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "aa0894b8-ca98-4b6f-8042-67c8d3cbac7e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, a beautiful punch line! And how long did you rehearse that in front of "
"your mirror?\""
msgstr "\"오, 멋진 펀치 라인이야! 거울 앞에서 얼마나 연습한거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0efde3e7-1627-40bd-b309-a217cdbbabae"
msgid "\"You dirtbag! Decided to stab me in the back, did you?!\""
msgstr "\"이 더러운 자식! 날 뒤에서 찌르려고, 그런거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "4238ad14-b736-402c-a372-c7e3eae82232"
msgid "\"What is it you want?\""
msgstr "\"네가 원하는 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "c6a81b9c-f247-4925-b4e3-fd0dbe7c8e63"
msgid ""
"\"Even if you succeed in killing me, do you really think my lands will be "
"yours?\""
msgstr "\"네가 날 죽이면, 정말로 내 땅이 네 것이 된다고 생각하냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "702f8aaa-ec69-4dfb-baca-9281aa992dea"
msgid "\"So you think you can handle me, you little snot?\""
msgstr "\"네가 날 당해낼 수 있을거라 생각하는 모양이지, 애송아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "16555d2e-c838-48ef-915a-4d3717814977"
msgid ""
"\"So that's how it works among nobles? I'm starting to regret taking the "
"title of baron{mf||ess}.\""
msgstr "\"그래, 그게 귀족들의 방식인건가? 남작 작위를 가진게 슬슬 후회되는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "17870ef5-6f23-4fa2-860d-62b4f32e5c02"
msgid ""
"\"If you're so smart, why come to kill me in person? Why tell me your plans?"
"\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 똑똑하다면 직접 날 죽여보시지? 왜 나에게 계획을 말하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "207c8b54-a9d1-4c22-b78d-a256e13693ce"
msgid "\"Enough idle talk. You want my life? Come take it!\""
msgstr "\"개소리 집어치워. 내 목숨을 원하나? 와서 가져가 봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "9fa57d76-845e-4a45-a9b8-b3a7704b94fe"
msgid "\"Lander, Lander... And here I thought we were friends!\""
msgstr "\"랜더, 랜더... 우리가 친구라고 생각했는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2dd9935f-1aa8-4996-9bd8-9268145847ae"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander {g|House Lebeda}Lebeda{/g} smiles at you from behind his group of "
"thugs. He raises a hand in mocking salute.{/n} \"Greetings, brave conqueror "
"of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}! Allow me to congratulate you — "
"today's the day your name enters the history books!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더 {g|House Lebeda}레베다{/g}가 당신을 향해 웃습니다. 그는 도적 떼의 뒤에서 조롱 섞인 거수 경례를 "
"합니다.{/n} \"반가워, {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 용감한 정복자! 너에게 축하해줄 일이 있어. 오늘은 네 "
"이름이 역사책에 쓰여질 날이거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "2d29e99b-58f6-455a-aa11-c06f0f40e9ac"
msgid ""
"\"I'd say I appeared just in time — time enough, in fact, to inform Lady "
"Aldori of your heroic death battling the barbarians!\""
msgstr ""
"\"난 내가 제 시간에 왔다 생각하는데 - 자만디 알도리에게 네가 바바리안과 싸우다 영웅답게 죽었다는 걸 알려주기에 딱 좋은 시간이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "34aeeb43-6b0d-4f36-8633-08950f8e9bd8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you've no idea. I've practiced it since the first day the two of us "
"crossed the border of my future lands!\""
msgstr "\"오, 당신은 짐작도 못할꺼야. 훗날 내 남작령이 될 곳의 국경에서 우리 둘이 처음 만났을 때부터 연습해왔지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "4eba91bc-3cf6-4d13-a476-327c152ba74b"
msgid ""
"\"How rude! Do you really want your last words to be some nasty cursing? "
"Well, when I eventually write my memoirs, I suppose I'll just have to hire "
"some scribe to write a more proper final speech on your behalf!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 무례하군! 역겨운 모습이 되기 전에 할 말은 없나? 내 이야기를 쓰게 된다면 당신 대신 더 적절한 사람을 고용하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "a71c73fd-ae84-4555-8dd8-96ff076e35be"
msgid ""
"\"It's not obvious? Your lands, of course. I'm about to claim the rights of "
"heirloom of {g|House Lebeda}House Lebeda{/g}. It's time we think about "
"expanding our lands, increasing our glory! Ten years from now, everyone will "
"know it was Lander Lebeda who heroically tamed the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g}. Only historians will know anything about {Name}, Lander's general "
"who died fighting the barbarians. But don't worry — I'll be sure they write "
"about you in the most flattering terms. Perhaps I'll even hire a bard to "
"write a ballad of your heroic death!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아직도 모르겠어? 당연히 네 땅이지. 나는 {g|House Lebeda}레베다 가문{/g}의 소유권을 주장하러 왔어. 지금이 우리 "
"땅도 넓히고 명성도 쌓을 적기거든! 10년 후에는 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 영웅적으로 길들인 랜더 레베다를 "
"모르는 이가 없겠지. 역사가들이나 {Name}에 대해 알거야. 그 사람은 나의 장군이었고 야만인들과 싸우다 죽었지. 하지만 걱정 마, "
"그래도 멋지게 묘사해줄 테니까. 음유시인이라도 고용해서 네 죽음을 노래로 남겨야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "fb3dff66-122d-495a-9f12-6210a9b6e6f4"
msgid ""
"\"Who else's? As far as I'm aware, the baron{mf||ess} of {kingdomname} has "
"no heirs. I'll catch the banner as it falls from your hands. And if any of "
"my subjects tries to complain... Well, I haven't exactly been sitting idle "
"all this time. How many of your people are still loyal to you, I wonder. And "
"how many do you think are already in my service?\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 누가 있지? 내가 알기로는 {kingdomname}의 남작은 상속자가 없는데. 네 손에서 떨어진다면 내가 가져가겠어. 그리고 내 "
"부하 누구라도 불평한다면... 나는 게으르게 앉아있기만 하지 않았어. 얼마나 많은 사람이 너에게 아직도 충성하겠어. 얼마나 많은 이들이 "
"내 부하가 됐을 거라고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "4a38c4e6-d09a-40f1-ab97-58974bfb7644"
msgid ""
"\"You really shouldn't underestimate me. You think my age somehow makes me "
"inferior to you? Only rootless commoners — like you! — bother measuring "
"worth just in their own years lived. The worth of a noble must count the "
"centuries their families have lived as well!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 과소평가하지 말라고. 너보다 내 나이가 적다고 생각하는 거야? 뿌리도 없는 너 같은 평민이나 나이가 중요하다고 생각하지. 귀족의 "
"자질은 가문이 몇 세기나 유지했는지가 중요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "13440604-defc-4193-91aa-d817fef2232c"
msgid ""
"\"'Among'?\" {n}Lander laughs loudly.{/n} \"You really think yourself a "
"noble? Do you believe your so-called title holds any weight? Perhaps your "
"great-great-grandchildren could have earned the right to enter beyond my "
"House's kitchens... if you'd lived long enough to leave any heirs!\""
msgstr ""
"\"중에서?\" {n}랜더가 웃는다.{/n} \"아직도 네가 귀족이라 생각하는 거야? 아직도 네 명성에 무게감이 있다고 믿어? 아마도 네 "
"위대하고 위대한 손자가 내 집 부엌 뒷문에 들어갈 수나 있겠지... 만약 네가 어느 상속자든지 떠나도록 오래 산다면 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "2b655598-35b2-4a5c-a2ad-e0f9319d802f"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know my House's motto? 'Success through Grace.' A knife in the "
"back, poison in a cup, thugs in a dark alley... that's how the {g|House "
"Surtova}Surtovas{/g} deal with their problems. No, this is my first major "
"victory. I wanted to see it all personally, to see your eyes as you breathe "
"your last, knowing I'll be the one who benefits from all you've achieved!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 집안 가훈이 뭔 줄 알아? '성공은 영광을 통해 나온다.' 등에 칼을 꽂고 잔에 독을 타고 으슥한 길에서 암살자를 보내는 건 "
"{g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}녀석들이나 하는 짓이라고. 이건 내 첫 승리야. 내 눈으로 직접 네 눈동자를 보면서 마지막까지 "
"숨을 쉬는 모습을 보고는 네가 이룬 모든 것을 빼앗았다고 생각하겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "060a5275-1e0e-41aa-9352-df79ae91b09a"
msgid ""
"\"Such spirit! Frankly speaking, I'll miss you — truly. When I hire new "
"commanders, I hope to find candidates like you — brave like you, and "
"gullible like you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"용감하군! 솔직히 말하면 네가 정말 보고싶어질 거야. 내가 새로운 사령관을 임명하면 너 같이 용감하고 순진한 지원자를 뽑을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "b176d039-0f3f-418c-83e7-0015e409d79f"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander gives you a sad smile.{/n} \"We really were friends. But, you see, "
"friends are the first thing you sacrifice when it comes to power. I like "
"you, I really do. But you wouldn't have held the throne long anyway, with "
"your love of dangerous adventures! And this way, at least your lands will "
"serve the interests of {g|House Lebeda}House Lebeda{/g}... Believe me, I'll "
"miss you deeply.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더가 슬픈 미소를 짓는다.{/n} \"우리는 진정한 친구였어. 하지만 친구란 너도 알다시피 권력을 가질 때 제일 먼저 희생하는 "
"존재이지. 나는 네가 좋아, 정말로. 하지만 위험한 모험을 사랑한다면 너는 오랫동안 왕좌를 차지하지는 못할 거야! 이런 방식이라면 최소한 "
"네 땅은 {g|House Lebeda}레베다 가문{/g}의 흥미는 얻을 거야... 정말로 네가 그리울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0cdf4892-0947-46bc-b3f6-47991b20d5f2"
msgid ""
"\"Do you think Linzi should have a chapter in her book titled 'Idiots and "
"the Process of Converting Them into Dead Idiots'? I mean, just look at all "
"the material she has!\""
msgstr ""
"\"린지가 '멍청이들과 그들을 죽은 멍청이로 바꾸는 방법'이라는 내용을 한 챕터 할해해서 책에 넣어야 되지 않을까? 내 말은, 눈 앞에 "
"있는 이 풍부한 사료들을 보라고! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "72e38025-3024-4fde-89c5-525af7e261c3"
msgid ""
"\"Question! What sounds better — 'a stupid windbag,' or 'a smug moron'?\""
msgstr "\"질문! '멍청한 질문을 한 녀석'과 '잘난 체하는 멍청이' 중 어느 게 더 좋게 들려?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "691597e5-c057-4afc-b683-6be12fbc4d49"
msgid ""
"\"If only you knew, young Lander, how much I'll miss you when you "
"unexpectedly lose your head over this stupid prank. In all the barony, you "
"were the only person who drew more irritation than I did!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어린 랜더, 그런 멍청한 결정을 내린 머리통이 예고도 없이 날라간다면 네가 얼마나 그리울지. 모든 영지에서 나보다 더 짜증을 일으키는 "
"사람은 네가 유일할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "54cbfbb7-4458-45ec-9b1c-e54326e2838c"
msgid ""
"\"Heh. I liked you, lad... I'm almost sorry to kill you, but I have to do it."
"\""
msgstr "\"음? 네가 좋지만... 미안하지만 죽어줘야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "765af15b-8f1d-4444-8488-f7846ef88dc5"
msgid ""
"\"Such sad, deeply misconstrued nobility. You should have sought glory and "
"honor with your actions, Lander — not paraded your ancient lineage about, "
"disgracing its reputation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저런. 귀족 나리, 뭔가 심하게 오해하고 있는 모양인데. 영광과 명예는 네 행동으로 쟁취해야하는거야, 랜더 - 네 고대 혈통을 줄줄 "
"읖거나 명성에 먹칠을 하는게 아니라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/EvilLebedaComes/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "290a8848-ffef-43cc-98db-72452029df0a"
msgid ""
"\"What?\" {n}Nok-Nok swivels his head and stares at you, at a total loss.{/n}"
" \"But you alive! And he say you...\" {n}The goblin falls silent as delayed "
"realization dawns on his face.{/n} \"Ohhh...\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐?\" {n}녹-녹이 머리를 저으며 당신을 넋이 빠진 채로 바라본다.{/n} \"살아있었군! 그가 너는...\" {n}그 고블린은 "
"침묵에 빠지고는 이내 놀라움을 나타낸다.{/n}\"오....\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "7ed33704-ef46-4d62-9ade-85c8916ba6d0"
msgid "\"Greetings, Gwart. Was your riot a success?\""
msgstr "\"반가워, 그워트. 선동은 성공적인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4277b73b-47f4-41ef-8243-c0310316b28b"
msgid "\"Amiri, are you all right?\""
msgstr "\"아미리, 괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "591bfbb2-9082-4d04-b86e-b665bf9c783c"
msgid "\"Dugath! I knew we'd meet again.\""
msgstr "\"두가스! 다시 만날 줄 알고 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "1bb87154-2894-453a-b4a2-063daab16c6b"
msgid "\"So Armag's on his own now?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 아르막이 멋대로 하고 있다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "1524654f-cf6f-4f2e-9ce3-e0ec4adc6734"
msgid "\"We have to stop this madman.\""
msgstr "\"이 미치광이를 막아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "0bb3de13-9e47-489c-be96-5d98e85b5e3a"
msgid "\"Nilak, what will happen to your tribe now?\""
msgstr "\"닐락, 네 부족에게 무슨 일이 일어날까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "d21e0ca2-7225-49e8-a52c-22512d074867"
msgid ""
"\"Farewell, then. I'll do all I can to stop Armag. I hope you can talk some "
"sense into your tribesmen.\""
msgstr "\"잘가라고. 아르막을 막을 수 있는 모든 방법을 동원할테니. 네 부족을 잘 설득해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "58a394a1-89db-45ee-b461-a0e2e27955da"
msgid "\"Where did he go?\""
msgstr "\"그가 어디로 갔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "f2d1d946-a805-4381-916d-22f7cdf79b3a"
msgid "\"Where's his tomb?\""
msgstr "\"그의 무덤은 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "dc2c8863-e611-40d1-8ef4-b8215b926614"
msgid ""
"{n}You find Gwart near Armag's tent. When he notices you, he raises his hand "
"to greet you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 그워트를 아르막의 텐트 주위에서 찾는다. 그가 당신을 보자 그는 손을 들며 인사한다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "d744008c-7345-424c-ab06-b76ec6974b3f"
msgid ""
"{n}He unties Amiri and Nilak. Both women rise to their feet, rubbing their "
"numb wrists, and exchange smiles of triumph.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그가 아미리와 닐락을 풀어준다. 두 여성은 일어서고는 저린 손목을 주무르고 승리의 미소를 서로 교환한다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "3500f5f2-7aa8-453b-bf3d-6aa2b7377229"
msgid ""
"{n}He unties Amiri. The barbarian rises to her feet, rubbing her numb wrists "
"and looking down in silence.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그가 아미리를 풀어준다. 그 야만인은 일어서고는 저린 손목을 주무르고 침묵하며 시선을 떨군다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : BrevoyBorderlands_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "9579f160-53eb-45c2-ae60-0418ce5a1fda"
msgid "{n}Dugath greets you with a curt nod.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}두가스가 퉁명스럽게 고갯짓을 하며 인사한다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d981aac4-e31c-4a54-8822-44de0c962c1c"
msgid ""
"{n}With a sour expression, Amiri shows you the hilt of her broken sword.{/n} "
"\"Armag was really strong, the dirty piece of crap. But I survived, so hail "
"{g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}, I guess. As for Armag, I'm still going to get him!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}씁쓸한 표정으로 아미리는 당신에게 부서진 칼집을 보여준다.{/n} \"아르막은 정말로 강한 더러운 개자식이야. 하지만 나는 살아남아 "
"{g|Gorum}고룸{/g}에게 충성을 바치지. 아르막은 내가 잡을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "1f94ff65-076a-493f-bc69-1e40282e65c4"
msgid "{n}Without raising her eyes, Amiri silently shakes her head.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}눈을 뜨지 않고 아미리는 조용히 머리를 흔든다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : BrevoyBorderlands_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "344f5754-e462-4fc7-bb61-8751790d7785"
msgid ""
"\"Heh heh heh, that's {d|c31 Ashman Friendly}right{/d}! Old Dugath's not so "
"easy to kill! I'd ask you to share a drink or two with me again, but as you "
"can see, now's not the best time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"헤헤헤 {d|c31 Ashman Friendly} 좋아! {/d}! 늙은 두가스는 쉽게 죽지 않아! 술 한두 잔을 나에게 다시 나눠 "
"줄 것을 요청 하겠지만, 당신이 볼 수 있듯이, 지금은 좋은시기가 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : BrevoyBorderlands_ShamanAshman
msgctxt "2e248263-bc31-4cb1-be2b-5e17ea92c95a"
msgid ""
"{n}The old cleric nods with restraint.{/n} \"So, the battle rages {d|c31 "
"Ashman Hostile}again{/d}, and your people continue killing mine... but I owe "
"you my life. The gods like to play cruel jokes on mortals.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 성직자는 자제하며 고개를 끄덕인다.{/n} \"그래서 전투가 {d|c31 Ashman Hostile} 다시 {/d} 일어났군. "
"그리고 너의 사람들이 내 것을 계속 죽이고...하지만 나는 네게 빚 졌어. 신들은 필멸자들에게 잔인한 농담을 하는 것을 좋아하는군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "8d273537-efd9-489a-a731-40c0d8fd854b"
msgid ""
"\"Yes and no. Armag's still alive — mad or not, he's still one of the "
"strongest fighters in all {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. But that's not important "
"right now. He abandoned his army in the middle of battle — no one here will "
"recognize him as chieftain after that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞지만 아니기도 해. 아르막은 미쳤건 아니건 간에 아직 살아 있고 그는 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 여전히 가장 강력한 "
"전사 중 하나다. 그러나 그것은 지금 중요하지 않아. 그는 전투 중 자신의 군대를 버렸지. 그 후 아무도 그를 수장으로 인정하지 않을 "
"것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "ea408fa9-6a47-4e74-b97b-e6e9acfe67e3"
msgid ""
"\"Not at all! There's still an entire army of our brothers and sisters back "
"in {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, ready to obey his every word. They'd rather call "
"us traitors than give up the dream of great Armag once more leading them to "
"glory! We can try appealing to their reason, but... I fear this will end "
"with the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} splitting into two separate tribes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전혀 그렇지 않아! {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에는 우리 형제 자매의 군대가 여전히 그의 모든 말에 순종 할 준비가 되어 "
"있어. 그들은 오히려 위대한 아르막의 꿈을 한 번 더 포기하지 않고 우리를 반역자로 불러 영광으로 이끌 걸! 우리는 그 이유를 호소 할 "
"수는 있지만... {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}가 두 개의 부족으로 나뉠까 겁나. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "83f6f158-e6e5-4409-9fa4-ffb13f007163"
msgid ""
"\"Exactly — and you should be the one to do it, because we can't stay any "
"longer. We're retreating to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} before another battle "
"with the Brevans can start. So listen to me carefully — find the tomb. Find "
"Armag and kill him. If you don't, he'll be back soon enough with a new army —"
" and then {g|Restov}Restov{/g} will fall, not to mention your barony!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 더 이상 머물 수 없으므로 그 일을 해야 해. 우리는 브레보이와의 전투가 시작되기 전에 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 "
"물러나야 해. 그러니 잘 들어. 무덤을 찾아 아르막을 죽여. 그렇지 않으면 그는 곧 새로운 군대로 돌아오게 돼 - 그러면 너의 남작령은 "
"말할 것도 없고 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}가 멸망해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "4342be04-2a26-492d-aac8-273c24ea071d"
msgid ""
"\"An evil spirit still haunts us. We won't survive on our own. We're going "
"back to {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} with Gwart and the others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"악이 여전히 우리를 괴롭힌다. 우리는 스스로 살아남지 못하겠지. 우리는 그워트와 다른 사람들과 함께 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}"
" 로 돌아가야 해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "12538cdc-f786-47cb-9358-d617ba8b0a32"
msgid ""
"{n}Having exchanged farewell handshakes, the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g} "
"leave the camp.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}작별 인사를 교환 한 후 {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}는 야영지를 떠난다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "b0183634-99fb-4bbf-a1b7-f98a3a7abf1a"
msgid ""
"\"Go. I'll catch up to you later,\" {n}Amiri says, her voice hoarse.{/n} \"I "
"must... bury Nilak. And this useless piece of scrap, too.\" {n}The barbarian "
"looks to the hilt of her broken sword in her hands, then turns away.{/n} \"Go"
". Go, I said!\""
msgstr ""
"\"가. 나중에 따라갈게.\" {n}아미리의 목소리는 쉬었다.{/n} \"나는 닐락을 묻어야 해. 그리고 이것도 쓸모 없게 되었어.\" "
"{n}그 야만인은 그녀의 손에 칼집을 보고는 등을 진다.{/n} \"가라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "a5dc9486-9c76-4fb2-84fa-958fc0f0df92"
msgid ""
"\"That's the creepy part. Our Armag spent a lot of time searching for the "
"tomb of ancient Armag, the hero of the past, whose incarnation he believes "
"himself to be. I don't know if it's true, but I heard rumor that he finally "
"found it. He took a small squad with him, the Sisters opened a portal for "
"them, and that's the last we saw of him. I'd guess he's inside the tomb "
"already, and what he's looking for there could make him terribly powerful. "
"More powerful than any of us can imagine!\""
msgstr ""
"\"섬뜩하군. 아르막은 자신의 환생이라고 생각하는 과거의 영웅 고대 아르막의 무덤을 찾기 위해 많은 시간을 보냈어. 나는 그것이 "
"사실인지는 모르겠지만, 그가 마침내 그것을 발견했다고 해. 그는 작은 부대를 끌고 갔고 자매들이 그들을 위해 포털을 열었어. 그게 우리가 "
"마지막으로 본 것이지. 나는 그가 무덤 안에 이미 있다는 것을 짐작할 수 있어. 그리고 그가 찾고 있는 것은 그를 대단히 강력하게 만들 "
"수 있어. 우리 중 누구보다도 강력하겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : VandalLeader_Gwart_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "96f26634-896e-4cf8-82a8-54206800288c"
msgid ""
"\"Only Armag and the Sisters know! You'll have to find it on your own.\""
msgstr "\"아르막과 자매들만이 알고 있어! 스스로 찾아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "84cba1c2-ed19-4c8f-9f73-498a9dcb679f"
msgid ""
"\"Amiri... thanks for saving me. {g|Desna}Desna{/g} be my witness, I didn't "
"deserve it. After all I said...\""
msgstr "\"아미리... 구해줘서 고마워. {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}가 내 증인이고 나는 자격이 없어. 결국 내가 말했듯이... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "701c4a24-9287-4f4b-b203-6ec631e4ba0f"
msgid ""
"\"Don't talk rubbish, sis. You think I'd let you die here? I, erm... said a "
"lot of stupid stuff back then, too. Sorry.\""
msgstr "\"쓸데 없는 소리 마. 네가 여기서 죽게 내버려 둘 거라 생각해? 음 .. 나도 바보 같은 말을 많이 했군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "7e42c26b-49c3-4198-89d7-b60fd8cb01de"
msgid ""
"\"I know you don't want to see our tribe anymore, but at least visit us one "
"more time. Many things have changed. We should talk — even if it's just one "
"last time.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 우리 부족을 보고 싶지 않겠지만 적어도 한 번 더 우리를 방문해줘. 많이 바뀌었어. 한 번 만이라도 대화하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0f23c23f-944d-4950-be26-6f804e9f5194"
msgid ""
"\"Well, if you say so... Fine. I'll come. But if anyone tries to send me to "
"the women's hut again, I won't be held responsible for what happens!\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄 네가 그렇게 말하면... 좋아. 갈게. 하지만 누군가 나를 여자 움막으로 다시 보내려 하면, 무슨 일이 일어날 지 책임지지 않을 "
"거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Nilak
msgctxt "f1cb1a1e-440b-4c61-93e2-022f18102824"
msgid ""
"\"I'll wait for you.\" {n}Following the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}, "
"Nilak leaves the camp.{/n}"
msgstr "\"나는 기다릴게.\" {n}{g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}인 닐락은 야영지를 떠난다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "75115d4a-bbab-4f1f-a9dc-34ee0142c9d8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Amiri... How many times have I told you that disobeying orders and "
"acting on a whim can lead to nothing good? I am glad to see you alive, "
"though.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 아미리... 명령을 어기고 변덕스럽게 행동하면 좋을 게 없다고 몇 번이나 말했어? 그래도 살아 있으니 기쁘게 생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e6a670a4-05e3-4d84-9eda-c285fd920157"
msgid ""
"\"No one to blame but yourself. No one else called your people to bring "
"their swords to these lands.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 아닌 너 자신이 비난 하겠지. 아무도 네 사람들을 불러 이 땅에 칼을 가져 오게 하지 못했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "952479d2-1729-43dd-911e-b266435d7d2a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian sighs heavily.{/n} \"I... I feel her grief. You should not have "
"wasted time helping me back then, {name}. Then perhaps this tragedy could "
"have been avoided...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 한숨을 깊게 쉬었다.{/n} \"나는... 나는 그녀의 슬픔을 느껴. 나를 돕기 위해 시간 낭비 하지 마,{name}. "
"그랬다면 이 비극은 피할 수 있었겠지... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7a2c8887-4544-4019-b7eb-a5f1e62ea647"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri looks up and glares unkindly at Tristian for a moment, but she says "
"nothing.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 잠시 동안 고개를 들어 트리스티안을 불친절하게 바라보지만 아무 말도 하지 않았다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e8dcdf4e-fca2-4660-abc1-7026662d5d8b"
msgid ""
"\"Appalling irresponsibility! Such a person cannot be trusted with an army.\""
msgstr "\"무책임하군! 그런 사람은 군대에서 신뢰할 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Final_Barbarians/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "4860c7ab-e530-4cd9-b7c7-688e8359b223"
msgid ""
"\"You hear that? A valuable lesson for the baron{mf||ess}. If you're a hero "
"for even an hour, whatever you do later, you'll always have companions — "
"people who will find it easier to accuse the whole world of lying rather "
"than admit they were wrong about you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"들었어? {mf||여}남작에게 아주 귀중한 교훈이 되겠군. 세상에는 너를 영웅으로 치켜세우느니, 사기꾼으로 몰아가겠다는 사람도 있어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "4f817ee2-5360-48bf-8826-c0961022d25c"
msgid ""
"[Relay your meeting with the barbarians] \"There's a chance to cut our "
"losses.\""
msgstr "[바바리안들과의 협의에 대해 설명합니다] \"우리의 손실을 줄일 수 있는 기회가 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "ab95abe5-b84b-4d23-a20d-e90486778bb0"
msgid "\"What's the situation?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 상황이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "0eb65fa9-4115-4800-9d49-3f2d4069b058"
msgid "\"How did barbarians recruit giants into their army?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 야만족이 거인을 군대에 모집 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "98d437c1-eb9e-4525-ad60-065e81316624"
msgid "\"How do we proceed?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 진행하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0034_Text_String
msgctxt "f933849b-18b3-490b-915f-2030817e186b"
msgid "\"I see. I'll move out immediately.\""
msgstr "\"알았어. 곧장 갈게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "27b204e2-5b15-4e85-9e8a-4a35a3a10746"
msgid "\"At least I managed to save you.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 나는 너를 구했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "296af127-672b-410c-809c-f03fdc358e76"
msgid ""
"[Relay your meeting with the barbarians] \"Not all is lost. There's still a "
"chance to cut our losses.\""
msgstr "[바바리안들과의 협의에 대해 설명합니다] \"모든 것을 잃지는 않았어. 우리의 손실을 줄일 수 있는 기회가 여전히 남아있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "b6493f01-a4f0-4ea4-b8c4-a28441e0a60c"
msgid "\"How do we proceed?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 진행하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "2d853513-5b05-4271-a0cb-ade462745fa6"
msgid "\"How was the battle?\""
msgstr "\"전투는 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "22a4c845-2d12-43ab-b6ff-2f1a2569ef8d"
msgid "\"How did the barbarians recruit giants into their army?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 야만족이 거인을 군대에 모집 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Answer_0055_Text_String
msgctxt "3731c5b3-af2d-493a-b068-91f351d58855"
msgid "\"Is it your army?\""
msgstr "\"네 군대야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "27dbd3f0-73e3-47c0-b612-15b2019792e5"
msgid ""
"{n}A half-elf woman, clad in armor, folds the spyglass she was using to "
"watch the battlefield and shakes your hand firmly.{/n} \"I knew I could {d|"
"c41 Follow Amiri}count on you{/d}! The battle's about to begin, and I won't "
"lie — without your reinforcements, this battle would be hard on us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}갑옷 입은 하프엘프 여성은 전장을 보기 위해 사용하고 있던 망원경을 접고 당신의 손을 굳게 흔든다.{/n} \"나는 내가 할 수 "
"있음을 알았어. {d|c41 Follow Amiri} 너 자신을 믿어. {/d}! 전쟁이 시작 되려 하고 나는 거짓말하지 않겠어. 당신의 "
"증원이 없다면 이 전투는 우리에게 어려워져. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Kassil_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "f98f283b-07eb-47aa-a70d-3e0d1d7145aa"
msgid ""
"{n}Kassil salutes you with his sword.{/n} \"I'm glad to see you again! Now "
"we'll win without a doubt!\""
msgstr "{n}카실이 칼을 받들어 경례한다.{/n} \"다시 만나게 되어 기쁩니다! 이제 우리의 승리는 확실합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "b3b59db0-7c71-44e5-aaba-c7badd003297"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi listens intently, frowns, and rubs her chin.{/n} \"You tell a "
"strange tale. Who are these Sisters? Why did the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger "
"Lords{/g} attack us in the first place? This sounds less like a conditional "
"war than a bloody hecatomb. It's like the true reason behind this battle is "
"to sacrifice as many people as possible, on both sides, in the name of some "
"grim deity...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 귀기울여 듣고 찡그리고는 턱을 문지른다.{/n} \"이상한 이야기를 하는군. 그 자매는 누구지? {g|Tiger Lords}"
"호랑이 군주{/g}가 왜 우리를 먼저 공격 했지? 이것은 피투성이 아수라장과 다름 없는 선전포고야. 이 전투의 진정한 이유는 서로가 "
"가능한 한 많은 사람들을 희생시키는 것 같아. 어떤 잔인한 신의 이름으로... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "37fd8207-76dc-49eb-952f-828be44d3453"
msgid ""
"\"I'm glad you're an adventurer first and a ruler second, in this instance. "
"Perhaps with the information you've obtained we'll be able to avoid a "
"slaughter.\""
msgstr "\"이 상황에선 당신이 원래 모험가였다 통치자가 된게 다행이군. 아마도 그 정보로 살육행위를 피할 수 있을 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "aea79dba-5f5a-4a1d-8733-7e55424ad357"
msgid ""
"\"It couldn't be worse... Well, no, things can always get worse. But the "
"barbarians outnumber us, and they have giants in their ranks. They've broken "
"their force into several groups, forcing us to spread our defenses thin. I "
"really can't guess how many of my people will see another dawn...\""
msgstr ""
"\"상황이 이보다 악화 될 수는 없어... 아니, 안 좋은 일은 언제나 더 심해질 수 있어. 그러나 야만족은 우리보다 많으며 또한 거인도 "
"수하로 두고 있어. 그들은 우리를 분산하여 우리의 방어를 약하게 하려 하지. 나는 얼마나 많은 사람들이 내일 새벽 하늘을 보게 될지 "
"짐작할 수 없어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "96ed1478-dfff-471f-8d21-693fcf02183b"
msgid ""
"\"To the best of my knowledge, {g|Numeria}Numerians{/g} adopt giants when "
"they're young and raise them as fighters. These giants are usually quite "
"strong but poorly organized. However, under the leadership of a capable "
"commander, they're threefold the danger.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 알기로는 {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}인들은 어린 거인을 입양하고 전사로 키워. 이 거인들은 보통 강하지만 잘 조직되어 "
"있지 않지. 그러나 유능한 지휘관의 지도 하에 그들은 3 배 더 위험해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "03ef46d3-39e5-4ec7-9f15-a8e935cb4fa5"
msgid ""
"\"Cautiously. I'll draw my forces to yours and begin a slow advance against "
"the enemy. If your contacts spoke true, they should retreat.\""
msgstr "\"주의해. 나는 네 병력을 이끌어 적에게 천천히 진격하겠어. 만약 네 정보통이 사실이라고 말하면 그들은 퇴각 할거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "0ccca6b1-1a4d-4958-98ad-05ff8c0bab14"
msgid ""
"\"As for you, your best option is to return to their main camp. If all went "
"as planned, you'll find Armag's body there. If not... then bring that "
"adventurer's instinct to the fore and improvise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"최선의 선택은 메인 야영지로 돌아가는 것이지. 모든 것이 계획대로 진행 되었다면 아르막의 시체를 찾을 수 있어. 그렇지 않다면... "
"모험가의 본능을 이끌어내 어떻게든 해결해야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "f45c6b9c-364c-4659-ab67-6cbc513fa209"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} guide you! Do your best. I'd really like to see you "
"again... In this world, I mean.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}가 너를 인도하길! 최선을 다해. 나는 이승에서 다시 너를 보고 싶어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "03bd5f60-88cc-4639-bea9-32a0bca9f1be"
msgid "\"Get going. Time is of the essence.\""
msgstr "\"어서 가. 시간은 금이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "7f8a99e7-23e8-4b1b-8bc4-d2793f7072f2"
msgid ""
"{n}A half-elf woman, clad in broken and dented armor, sets a healing potion "
"to her bloodied lips. Leaning on her jagged sword, she stands and looks over "
"the battlefield, the corpses of friends and foes alike strewn across it.{/n} "
"\"Dead... Everyone is dead.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}부서지고 너덜해진 갑옷을 입은 하프엘프 여성이 치유 물약을 피묻은 입술에 흘린다. 휘어진 검에 기대어 그녀는 서서 전장을 바라보고 "
"전우와 적의 시체는 똑같이 흩어져 있다.{/n} \"죽었어... 모두 죽었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "a75adfc5-c7a9-4e40-9749-3bc301183c94"
msgid ""
"{n}She turns to you, her blood-smeared face distorted with rage.{/n} \"Where "
"have you {d|c41 Follow Tristian}been{/d}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 당신에게 눈을 돌린다. 그녀의 피 묻은 얼굴은 분노로 일그러졌다.{/n} \"{d|c41 Follow Tristian}어디에 "
"있었어{/d}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "c9fbd72a-f29c-4411-aafc-c4ace2764aeb"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi shakes her head, wiping her hand across her face.{/n} \"No, it "
"doesn't matter. Don't bother answering, I've no interest in your excuses. "
"You're late, and it's all over. My army's been destroyed, and the way to "
"{g|Restov}Restov{/g} is unprotected. Your reinforcements won't make any "
"difference now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 얼굴을 손으로 닦았다.{/n} \"아니, 그건 중요하지 않아. 억지로 대답하지 마. 너의 변명에 관심이 없으니. 너는 "
"늦었고 모든 것은 끝났어. 내 군대는 파괴되었고 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}로 가는 길은 안전하지 않아. 네 증원군은 지금 아무런 "
"도움이 되지 않아. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "aa896bc4-6422-45e7-a688-4dbdc1ec8066"
msgid ""
"\"Should I thank you for that? What good is a commander with no army? Now "
"I'll just die a few days later attempting to defend {g|Restov}Restov{/g} "
"proper from these barbarians. So, great. Thanks.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 그것을 감사해야 하나? 군대가 없는 지휘관은 무엇을 할 수 있을까? 나는 이제 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}를 이 "
"야만족들로부터 방어하려고 시도하다 며칠 후에 죽겠지. 최악이야. 너 때문이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "77715f40-1b64-4acd-a38d-0751bab67e32"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi throws her sword to the ground with a curse.{/n} \"Do you even "
"comprehend what this means? We were double-crossed! All this... All these "
"deaths... All for nothing!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 욕을 지껄이며 그녀의 검을 땅에 던진다.{/n} \"이게 무슨 상황인지 모르겠어? 우리는 모략에 빠졌어! 이 "
"모든...군대가 헛되이 죽었어...!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "d096af9a-9476-4cb9-9ca8-7239235645ba"
msgid ""
"\"I'll find the ones responsible — hunt them to the ends of "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} if I have to! And if it turns out the {g|House "
"Surtova}Surtovas{/g} were behind it all — gods help them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나라면 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 끝까지 그들을 찾아 사냥할 책임감 있는 사람들을 찾겠어! 그리고 모든 것의 배후에 {g|"
"House Surtova}서토바{/g}놈들이 있었다면 신이 그들을 벌하겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "346f1c84-dc96-4d27-953d-06021e15581d"
msgid ""
"\"Follow through on your agreement with the barbarians. Go to their main "
"camp — it's not far. In the meantime, I'll try to save whatever remains of "
"my army.\""
msgstr "\"야만족들과의 합의에 따라 주요 야영지로 가. 멀지 않은 곳이야. 그 동안 나는 남은 내 군대를 구할테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "8498db89-95dd-4090-8610-8c87fc9fa2be"
msgid ""
"\"How do you think? The barbarians outnumbered us, and with giants at their "
"sides. It was a slaughter. We killed many of them on the battlefield, but my "
"army was decimated in the process.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 생각해? 야만족이 우리보다 수가 많고 거인도 거느렸어. 학살이 시작되겠지. 우리는 전쟁터에서 그들을 다수 죽였지만 내 군대는 "
"그 과정에서 괴멸당했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "9e9c8a8e-8528-4c27-a564-7c292d3d79cc"
msgid ""
"\"How should I know? Probably picked them up as children in "
"{g|Numeria}Numeria{/g}, and raised them to fight. Giants are dangerous "
"enough on their own, but under the command of an experienced warlord...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 어떻게 알아야 하지? {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 그들은 전사로 길들여졌어. 거인은 충분히 위험하지만 경험 많은 "
"지휘관의 밑에서라면... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "ba7e3b21-bd74-48eb-8fbb-ed5b9d4fb520"
msgid ""
"\"Go. Too much blood's been shed this day — but perhaps we can still save "
"someone.\""
msgstr "\"어서 가. 너무 많은 희생이 있었지만 아마도 우리는 여전히 누군가를 구할 수있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "8d740a57-a384-482f-a609-c036e76efb49"
msgid "\"Are you still here?\""
msgstr "\"아직도 여기 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0056_Text 1_String
msgctxt "f326b2fb-f581-489c-81fd-5f89b93ded0b"
msgid ""
"\"It has many squads joined together: my fighters, other "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords'{/g} forces, {g|Restov}Restov{/g} militia, "
"mercenaries. Restov is surely a free city, but it always relied on us Aldori "
"to protect it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 전사들과 {g|Swordlords} 소드로드{/g}, {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 민병대, 용병 등 많은 분대가 합류했어. "
"레스토프는 분명히 자유 도시지만 항상 보호를 위해 알도리에 의존했어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0056_Text_String
msgctxt "f81a8650-4909-4425-a178-b91203d4c3ae"
msgid ""
"\"It has many squads joined together: my fighters, other "
"{g|Swordlords}Swordlords'{/g} forces, {g|Restov}Restov{/g} militia, "
"mercenaries. Restov is surely a free city, but it always relied on us Aldori "
"to protect it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 전사들과 {g|Swordlords} 소드로드{/g}, {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 민병대, 용병 등 많은 분대가 합류했어. "
"레스토프는 분명히 자유 도시지만 항상 보호를 위해 알도리에 의존했어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiCamp/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "88fbc636-7863-4a24-91a5-647c4fda07b8"
msgid ""
"\"Such a tragedy... O {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, how many children became "
"orphans today and won't see their father or mother any more... I...\" {n}"
"Tristian stops, his lips clenched and twitching.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그런 비극이... 오, {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}시여, 오늘 얼마나 많은 자녀가 고아가 되어 자기 부모를 다시는 보지 "
"못하게 되었습니까? 저는...\" {n}트리스티안은 멈추고 입술은 떨리고 이를 악물었다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0046_Text_String
msgctxt "c02ab1b2-3ea5-40c3-8936-8047ebdd2a44"
msgid "\"Thank you. I would be much obliged.\""
msgstr "\"고맙소. 신세를 졌군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0047_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "ac15e8e5-6e41-4eab-84ba-607d7498bbed"
msgid ""
"Demanded apologies and ransom money for Lander's body from the house Lebeda."
msgstr "레베다의 가문에게서 랜더의 시체에 대한 몸값과 사과를 요구한다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0047_Text_String
msgctxt "eb954e71-100e-448f-8cb3-5d6517d76a24"
msgid ""
"\"House Lebeda insulted me gravely. If they want their heir back, they'll "
"have to pay a ransom.\""
msgstr "\"레베다는 나를 모욕했소. 그들이 후계자를 돌려받길 원한다면 몸값을 지불해야 하오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0048_Text_String
msgctxt "6ed5afaa-1c72-46bc-9b54-618b986e7c1f"
msgid ""
"\"No, no resurrection for him. I won't forgive Lander for his betrayal. Let "
"him stay dead.\""
msgstr "\"아니, 되살리지 마시오. 나는 그의 배신을 용서하지 않을 거요. 죽은 채로 내버려 둡시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0057_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "70c44c19-113d-445e-a2ea-468e8410707a"
msgid "Refused to return Lander Lebeda's body to his family for resurrection."
msgstr "랜더 레베다의 시신을 되살리기 위한 그의 가족의 요청을 거부한다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0062_Text_String
msgctxt "3fc900a5-6d2d-4246-bdfb-6d9f2140bf69"
msgid ""
"[Don't bow] \"Brevoy is experiencing some hard times right now. Internal "
"feuds threaten to bring real disaster. My kingdom and I are ready to act as "
"a guarantor of peace.\""
msgstr ""
"[Don't bow] \"브레보이는 지금 힘든 시기를 겪고 있어. 내적인 불화가 재앙이 되려 해. 나의 왕국과 나는 평화의 보증인으로 "
"행동 할 준비가 되어있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "f7190827-1783-4090-a495-ae71b4898a78"
msgid ""
"\"Temper your tone. Did you really expect me to always place your interests "
"before my own?\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 정말로 내 자신보다 먼저 네 관심사에 몰두하기를 기대 했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "4be5f6b0-24eb-4a35-9610-f95d72d148e4"
msgid "\"It would seem unwise to be issuing threats in your position.\""
msgstr "\"네 입장에서 위협하는 것은 현명하지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "8ebde4c6-0947-4295-b1fa-6c263946299b"
msgid "\"You can't blame me for your defeat. I arrived as soon as I could.\""
msgstr "\"패배로 나를 비난 할 수는 없어. 나는 최대한 빨리 도착했으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0086_Text
msgctxt "35acce2f-59d4-404c-a48a-3f388b4600a9"
msgid ""
"[Kiss Natala's hand] \"I would be honored to take the crown from your hands. "
"Allow me to pledge my eternal loyalty. I've no doubt our alliance will bear "
"beautiful fruit!\""
msgstr ""
"[나탈라의 손에 키스한다] \"당신의 손에서 왕관을 가져가는 것은 내 영광입니다. 영원한 충성을 맹세하도록 하겠습니다. 우리 동맹이 "
"아름다운 열매를 맺을 것이라는 데는 의심의 여지가 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "c0e1a5e9-df57-4c6d-b4f7-6a3bd62c248a"
msgid ""
"\"You think to honor me by proposing I take the crown from your hands? I "
"don't require your recognition or anyone else's to be crowned!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 손에서 왕관을 가져가라 하면 제가 좋아할거라 생각합니까? 저는 당신의 인정도, 왕관을 씌워줄 다른 누군가도 필요 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0088_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "d4d1b252-b14d-4668-925d-1e54acdfb4bb"
msgid "Maintained neutrality between House Surtova and the Aldori Swordlords."
msgstr "서토바 가문과 알도리 소드로드 사이에서 중립을 유지한다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "ccf48926-60d2-436d-913a-747b941535cd"
msgid ""
"[Bow slightly to both ladies] \"Brevoy is experiencing some hard times right "
"now. Internal feuds threaten to bring real disaster. My kingdom and I are "
"ready to act as a guarantor of peace.\""
msgstr ""
"[두 여성에게 고개를 숙여 인사한다] \"브레보이는 지금 힘든 시기를 겪고 있어. 내적인 불화가 재앙이 되려 해. 나의 왕국과 나는 "
"평화의 보증인으로 행동 할 준비가 되어있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "4237c60f-d88c-4b6f-b04e-8a6332986fcd"
msgid ""
"[Extend your hand to Jamandi] \"Let's leave our quarrels in the past. Today, "
"Restov and the Swordlords need allies more than ever!\""
msgstr "[자만디에게 손을 내민다] \"과거의 싸움은 잊자. 오늘 레스토프와 소드로드는 그 어느 때 보다 동료가 필요하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0110_Text
msgctxt "c99ecac6-a248-4f9a-a790-8e48e5fe5c15"
msgid "\"Don't mention it. I simply performed my duty as your ally.\""
msgstr "\"비행기 태우지 마십시오. 나는 당신의 동맹국으로서의 의무를 수행했을 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0111_Text
msgctxt "4d97871f-1df4-4e9c-b1b3-fd0f61456156"
msgid ""
"\"I don't fight for glory. My reasons are much more substantial than that.\""
msgstr "\"나는 영광을 위해 싸우지 않아. 나의 동기는 그것보다 훨씬 더 중요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0112_Text
msgctxt "44cec2f0-60f6-44fe-ad5b-e52af1ab07f7"
msgid ""
"\"In time? Stag Lord, Hargulka, Vordakai... I've already earned more glory "
"than several generations of some families!\""
msgstr "\"이제 되었나? 수사슴 군주 하굴카, 보다카이... 나는 몇 세대의 조상보다 더 많은 영광을 얻었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0122_Text
msgctxt "a2a74afb-95bb-4ad8-a57a-fcbdc8444cea"
msgid ""
"[Shake Jamandi's hand] \"Being your ally is a great honor to me. Trust me "
"when I say I won't forget all you've done for me.\""
msgstr "[자만디와 악수한다] \"그대와 동맹을 맺는 것은 큰 영광입니다. 저를 위해 해주었던 모든 일은 잊지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0123_Text
msgctxt "206c64b5-1e77-4914-8fde-55ce38753e05"
msgid ""
"[Bow before Natala] \"I would be honored to take the crown from your hands. "
"Allow me to pledge my eternal loyalty.\""
msgstr "[나탈라 앞에서 절하며] \"당신의 손에서부터 왕관을 받는 것이 영광입니다. 영원한 충성을 맹세하도록 허락해 주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0124_Text
msgctxt "69388c3c-1499-4122-a208-0031502aac5e"
msgid ""
"\"You think to honor me by proposing I take the crown from your hands? I "
"don't require your recognition or anyone else's to be crowned!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 손에서 왕관을 가져가라 하면 제가 좋아할거라 생각합니까? 저는 당신의 인정도, 왕관을 씌워줄 다른 누군가도 필요 없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0125_Text
msgctxt "e4850904-c996-41c1-a18f-f5bf407d485d"
msgid ""
"[Bow slightly to both ladies] \"Brevoy is experiencing some hard times right "
"now. Internal feuds threaten to bring real disaster. My kingdom and I are "
"ready to act as a guarantor of peace.\""
msgstr ""
"[두 여성에게 고개를 숙여 인사한다] \"브레보이는 지금 힘든 시기를 겪고 있습니다. 내적인 불화가 재앙이 되려 하죠. 저와 제 왕국은 "
"평화의 보증인으로서 행동할 준비가 되어있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0138_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f7d59eac-ba57-4965-b1d1-fa1b953d691a"
msgid "Used the chance to annex Nivakta's Crossing from the Aldori Swordlords."
msgstr "알도리 소드로드에게서 니박타의 교차로를 할양받게 되었다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Answer_0138_Text
msgctxt "3504aa18-6d3c-4cfd-aae8-2f4c1aa1a82f"
msgid ""
"[Kiss Natala's hand] \"Crowned or not, I'll always remain your loyal ally. "
"And if the Restovic Swordlords are failing to protect Brevoy's borders, my "
"army and I stand willing and ready to defend their lands.\""
msgstr ""
"[나탈라의 손에 키스한다] \"왕관을 받지 않아도 나는 항상 당신의 충성스러운 동맹으로 남아있을 것입니다. 레스토빅 소드로드가 브레보이의 "
"국경을 지키지 못하면 저의 군대와 저는 그들의 땅을 기꺼이 방어 할 준비가 되어 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "8a018731-77f3-4114-90fc-4c39a948bc2c"
msgid ""
"\"Well, Your Highness, it's time to get ready for the coronation. You'll "
"probably want to restore order within your lands first. As I'm sure you'll "
"agree, it would certainly be odd to hold a celebration with monsters roaming "
"the land and a crazed barbarian chieftain still at large. Once these issues "
"are resolved, I'll be happy to see the region once known as the {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} become a full-fledged country, led by a truly noble "
"sovereign!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하. 대관식 준비를 해야 할 때입니다. 영토 안에서 권력을 되찾고 싶을 것입니다. 전하도 분명히 동의 할 것인데 괴물들과 아직 "
"건재한 미친 야만족의 수장이 영토 안을 돌아다니는데 축하연을 하는 것은 확실히 이상 할 것입니다. 일단 이 문제가 해결되면, 한 때 {g|"
"Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}이라 불린 이 지역이 참으로 고귀한 주권에 다스려지는 본격적인 국가가 될 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "41ad9fa6-babb-4df6-aa0f-5751255e417b"
msgid ""
"\"One more thing. I've been informed of young {g|House Lebeda}Lebeda's{/g} "
"escapade. If you wish, I can attempt to avert a scandal by discreetly "
"returning his body to his family for a resurrection. Your name will never "
"come up.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 가지 더. 나는 어린 {g|House Lebeda} 레베다{/g}의 탈선 행위로부터 배운 것이 있다. 원한다면 나는 부활을 위해 "
"그의 시신을 조심스럽게 그의 가족에게 돌려 주어 스캔들을 막으려고 시도 할 수 있어. 네 이름은 절대 언급되지 않을 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "a457a3e2-db32-408b-801a-d39694a798f8"
msgid "\"Don't mention it. And now, I must return to my army.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 말하지 마. 이제 나는 내 군대로 돌아가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "d5b433fe-f037-483a-85b6-bd66c781cdf2"
msgid ""
"\"Now that's daring! Well, if you're bold enough to willingly infuriate {g|"
"House Lebeda}House Lebeda{/g}, all I can do is wish you good luck.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제야 대담하군! 네가 자발적으로 {g|House Lebeda} 레베다 가문{/g}을 도발하려는 용기가 있다면 나는 행운을 빌 수 "
"밖에. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "fc972106-05fc-4ef7-b071-b3bf6bb148b0"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you've every right to feel that way. But if {g|House Lebeda}House "
"Lebeda{/g} learns of it... Well, you can imagine their reaction.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 생각할 수도 있지. {g|House Lebeda}레베다 가문{/g}이 바보가 아니라면... 그들의 반응은 뻔해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "4964ef64-7048-4fa6-b18e-0a44430dcb8b"
msgid "\"Till we meet again at your coronation!\""
msgstr "\"대관식에서 또 뵙겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "7150b20b-db0f-4832-9908-9ca076b5078a"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, yes, there's one more thing. I've been informed of the trick young "
"Lander Lebeda played on you. I would assume you don't want a feud with his "
"{g|House Lebeda}great house{/g}. I'm willing to organize the process of "
"returning his body to his family for resurrection — without disclosing your "
"role in the matter, of course. As for Lander himself, I wouldn't worry about "
"him mentioning you. I'm sure he'll try to take revenge on you someday, but "
"he'll never tell the story of his failure to anyone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 한가지 더 있어. 어린 랜더 레베다가 네게 한 장난에 대해 알려주었지. 나는 네가 {g|House Lebeda}그 잘난 "
"집안{/g}과 언쟁을 일으키길 원하지 않으리라 생각해. 당연히 네 역할을 공개하지 않고 부활을 위해 그의 시신을 그의 가족에게 돌려 "
"보내는 과정을 기꺼이 도울 의향이 있어. 렌더가 너를 언급할 부분에 대해 걱정하지 않을 거야. 언젠가는 그가 네게 복수하겠지만 누구에게도 "
"자신의 실패에 대한 이야기는 하지 않겠지 \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "33f59a0a-151c-4b0b-af53-10ed39a24173"
msgid "\"It's really no trouble for me.\""
msgstr "\"나에게는 정말로 문제가 되지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "57193c31-2bdd-4fb5-ac8c-4ec13cc6dd68"
msgid ""
"\"Well, let me bid you farewell for now. We'll meet again at the celebration "
"of your long-awaited — and quite well-deserved — coronation!\""
msgstr "\"이제 작별 인사를 하자. 오랫동안 기다려온 그리고 치러야 할 대관식을 축하하기 위해 다시 만나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "44ff83f9-185e-4123-a453-455c3001e2a7"
msgid ""
"\"You continue to amaze me! Well, if you wish to play with fire, that's your "
"right. You know the stakes.\""
msgstr "\"계속 나를 놀라게 하는군! 불장난을 원한다면 마음대로 해. 위험성은 네가 알테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "baeb93da-9471-4eb7-a7fe-51277fa83f0e"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala shakes her head, her lips pursed.{/n} \"If that is your decision, "
"I won't intervene.\""
msgstr "{n}나탈라는 절래절래 흔들고 불만스럽게 말한다.{/n} \"그것이 네 결정이라면 나는 개입하지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0063_Text_String
msgctxt "e7afa57a-cb59-4f61-ac3e-f325fab79e31"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala looks you up and down with an icy gaze. She's clearly taken aback, "
"her expression a mix of equal parts disdain and surprise. But then she "
"simply nods.{/n} \"I suppose that would be best for us all.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라는 차가운 시선으로 당신을 위아래로 본다. 그녀는 경멸과 놀라움이 섞인 표정을 숨기지 못했다. 하지만 그녀는 단순히 고개를 "
"끄덕였다.{/n} \"그것이 우리 모두에게 최선이겠지\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0064_Text_String
msgctxt "38001ef2-7c19-44d8-88dc-05b957591b1b"
msgid ""
"\"I'm inclined to agree. You're taking on a heavy burden — but you've "
"already proven yourself a highly capable person.\""
msgstr "\"나는 동의하고 싶어. 너는 무거운 짐을 지고 있을 테지만 너는 이미 자신을 유능한 사람으로 증명했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "493a21c7-4357-42bf-86fe-7e0f1c2989a5"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Natala}Natala{/d} {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} greets you with the "
"satisfied smile of a snake who's just swallowed a living meal and has "
"settled in to enjoy it.{/n} \"Here's to our savior! The barbarians are "
"routed. Congratulations on your glorious victory!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Natala}나탈라{/d} {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}가 살아있는 뱀을 삼킨 듯 만족스러운 미소로 당신을 "
"환영한다.{/n} \"여기 우리 구세주가 왔군! 야만인들은 갔어. 영광스러운 승리를 축하해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "601d2b28-7a04-4e97-813f-7d097483bba0"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi Aldori glares at you sullenly. Her voice is dull as she "
"speaks.{/n} \"Yes, a truly heroic deed. Believe me, I won't forget it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디 알도리는 당신을 냉담하게 본다. 그녀의 목소리는 둔탁하다.{/n} \"그래 진실로 영웅적인 행위지. 이 빚은 잊지않겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "43cf8377-9e09-43f3-9031-787e4ce4e640"
msgid "\"I'm well aware of my position, thank you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 입장을 잘 알고 있어. 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "85085f3e-fe3e-4134-a434-18e6c2f33001"
msgid ""
"\"So that's the reason! Yes, I'm sure your personal interests are most "
"sacred to you. So, how much were you offered for the deed?\""
msgstr "\"그런 이유였군! 그래, 그렇겠지. 내게 얼마나 이익되느냐가 가장 중요한 것 아니겠어. 그래서, 얼마를 제안받았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "76dd9eb9-c215-44aa-9e54-066a4b4e7db4"
msgid "\"What was it that kept you, then?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 뭐 때문에 바로 오지 않은 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "b7814c5e-bb8d-4c49-bda4-3af0f68e0ba7"
msgid ""
"\"For goodness' sake! You may be accustomed to dealing with mercenaries, but "
"greed isn't the only thing that motivates people. No one offered anything to "
"the baron{mf||ess}, {mf||s}he acted in accordance with {mf|his|her} state's "
"interests — as any true ruler should.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맙소사! 너는 용병은 많이 다뤄봤는지 몰라도 다른 건 모르는구나. 사람들은 탐욕 외에 다른 동기로 움직이기도 해. 누가 {mf||여}"
"남작에게 다른 제안을 했을까? 아니. {mf||여}남작은 진정한 통치자가 으레 그러하듯, 자기 영지에 이익이 되는 방향으로 행동했을 "
"뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "f09a001b-de30-4e74-a2c2-8499eef57d2a"
msgid ""
"\"That's enough. This is no time to argue. We won — that's the important "
"thing! Today, the baron{mf||ess} proved {mf|him|her}self not just a capable "
"general, but also a wise ruler.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만. 논쟁할 시간 없어. 우리가 승리했다는 게 중요하지! 오늘 {mf||여}남작은 자신이 유능한 장군일 뿐만 아니라 현명한 "
"통치자이기도 함을 증명했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0079_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "dbc5ceed-1259-4154-9993-76d286b31966"
msgid ""
"\"I would even go so far as to say {name} has shown wisdom beyond "
"{mf|his|her} station — not just that of a baron{mf||ess}, but that of a true "
"{mf|king|queen}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {name}이(가) {mf||여}남작의 지위를 넘어 진정 {mf|왕|여왕}이라 불릴 만한 지혜를 보여주었음을 인정한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0081_Text
#. Speaker : Shandra_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "1af02625-16a1-41b0-a314-7c97cdfd0dc1"
msgid "\"I'm so glad you listened to the voice of reason.\""
msgstr "\"이성에 귀 기울이니 정말 기쁘군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0083_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "70ef6ad8-16c0-4a9e-b975-94cedbcb5132"
msgid ""
"\"Am I hearing you right? Are you ready to acknowledge {mf|him|her} as your "
"equal?\""
msgstr "\"내가 제대로 들은 게 맞나? {mf|그|그녀}를 너와 동등한 지위로 인정하겠다고? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "3b8503d4-c663-4313-876c-06b90194d76f"
msgid ""
"\"Well, as YOUR equal at least, {g|Swordlords}Swordlord{/g}...\" {n}Natala "
"{g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} turns to you and looks you in the eye.{/n} \"So"
", what do you say? Can you bear the burden of the crown?\" {n}She lifts her "
"pale hand toward you slightly, palm down.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄, 적어도 너와는 동등하겠지, {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}...\" {n}나탈라 {g|House "
"Surtova}서토바{/g}는 눈을 돌려 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"난 대답이 듣고 싶은데? 왕관의 무게를 감당할 수 있겠는가?\" "
"{n}나탈라는 당신을 향해 살짝 창백한 손을 들어 올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0089_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "ec0ae5ea-796d-40c9-bf15-f43a6f5ddb97"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you can be certain of that. Alliances with {g|House Surtova}House "
"Surtova{/g} always bear plentiful fruit. The only question is who works to "
"grow the fruit and who eventually gets to taste it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그 점은 확신해도 좋아. {g|House Surtova}서토바 가문{/g}과의 동맹은 언제나 달콤한 결실을 맺지. 과즙을 맛보는 "
"이는 네가 아닐지도 모르지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "ce8d2d5b-7c65-45be-89da-2234986c2c8c"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala raises her eyebrows but restrains herself. A smile returns to her "
"face.{/n} \"Now these are the words of a true {mf|king|queen}, not some "
"vagabond! With an approach like that, I've no doubt you'll achieve much!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라는 올라가는 눈썹을 바로 하고는 얼굴에 미소를 띱니다.{/n} \"마침내. 방랑자로서가 아니라, 진정한 {mf|왕|여왕}처럼 "
"말하는군! 그렇게만 하면 앞으로도 많은 업적을 이룰 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "6054fae8-9a20-4967-bc9f-07db8ab44337"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala looks you up and down with an icy gaze. She's clearly taken aback, "
"her expression a mix of equal parts disdain and surprise. But then she "
"simply nods.{/n} \"I suppose that would be best for us all.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라는 차가운 시선으로 당신을 아래위로 훑습니다. 나탈라는 경멸과 놀라움이 섞인 표정을 숨기지 못하다가, 일단은 고개를 "
"끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그편이 모두에게 최선이겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0093_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "038aef30-cffd-4842-84e8-a4073bf11c43"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it's time I returned to what's left of my army. I wish you luck, "
"Your Highness. There's an old proverb in our lands — before giving orders, "
"one must learn to take them. You've proven quite adept at the former. Let's "
"see how you do at the latter!\" {n}Jamandi Aldori turns and leaves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이제 남은 병력에게 돌아갈 때가 되었군요. 행운을 빕니다, 전하. 우리나라에는 이런 속담이 있습니다. 명령은 받는 자의 입장해서 해야 "
"한다죠. 명령을 내리셨으니, 이제 아랫사람의 입장을 얼마나 잘 헤아렸는지 알게 되겠지요!\" {n}자만디 알도리가 돌아서서 떠난다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0094_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "ef664850-e5ae-446a-8be6-e5d6de7c8b76"
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations, Your Highness! Your prior actions proved you capable of "
"seizing power, but today is the day you proved yourself able to keep it. Go "
"ahead and order the ceremonial vestments for you coronation! And while "
"they're being prepared, you should finish what you started — find the "
"barbarian chieftain and expel the barbarians from your lands. Establish "
"peace in the region. And take steps to ensure no magical beasts randomly "
"appear within your lands again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"축하드립니다, 전하! 지금까지는 권력의 정점을 향해 쉼 없이 달려왔으나, 오늘은 이미 가진 것 또한 지킬 수 있는 자임을 증명했군요. "
"대관식을 위한 예복을 주문하세요! 예복이 준비되는 동안, 시작한 일을 끝내야겠죠? 야만족 수령을 찾아 전하의 영토에서 추방하세요. 또 "
"괴물들이 영토를 침범하지 않도록 확실한 조치를 취하시고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0096_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "1d71b376-33cf-403f-954c-c82e4e742011"
msgid ""
"{n}Your hand hangs in the air — it seems Jamandi isn't going to shake it.{/n}"
" \"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} save me from such allies — I'll deal with my enemies "
"on my own.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}내민 손이 허전합니다. 자만디는 악수할 생각이 없는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"당신의 도움은 필요 없습니다. "
"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}시여, 이 동맹으로부터 저를 구하소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0097_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "900b062e-8562-42c5-afcc-56029790de7f"
msgid "{n}Natala's poisonous smile widens.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}나탈라의 음흉한 미소가 짙어진다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0099_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "a1745165-72d1-435c-9c2e-0a7875f8d25d"
msgid ""
"\"Well... Your Highness... Let me bid you farewell. Do enjoy your coronation "
"as much as you can — a ruler's life gives so few occasions for such joy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 전하... 작별 인사를 하게 허락해 주십시오. 가능한 한 대관식을 즐기십시오. 통치자의 삶은 그러한 기쁨을 위한 기회가 거의 "
"없습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0100_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "943b5bf1-aa44-4f3c-8f00-2d3e3a2dbf4e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm inclined to agree. You're taking on a heavy burden — but you've "
"already proven yourself a highly capable person.\""
msgstr "\"나는 동의하고 싶어. 너는 무거운 짐을 지고 있을 테지만 너는 이미 자신을 유능한 사람으로 증명했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0102_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "e702ea1c-5064-413d-bed9-6fc83d3bdab9"
msgid ""
"{n}With a slight smile of farewell, Natala {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} "
"ceremoniously leaves.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}작별 인사로 살짝 웃은 뒤, 나탈라 {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}는 격식을 갖추고 떠난다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0103_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "016af040-dbc8-4a11-aff6-d05c3a827e27"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi Aldori greets you with a firm handshake.{/n} \"The barbarians "
"have retreated! Congratulations, my friend, you've managed the best kind of "
"victory — a bloodless one!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디 알도리는 당신의 손을 굳게 쥐고 악수한다.{/n} \"야만족들이 퇴각했습니다! 경사스럽군요. 무혈입성이라는 가장 이상적인 "
"승리를 이루어 냈습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : Kassil_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "764b56de-590f-4ef1-8a4d-7891a59313c1"
msgid ""
"{n}Kassil Aldori bows before you.{/n} \"You've saved many lives today, Your "
"Grace. I thank you on behalf of the entire army.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카실 알도리는 당신 앞에서 머리를 숙인다.{/n} \"당신은 오늘 많은 생명을 구했습니다. 군대를 대표하여 감사드립니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0108_Text
#. Speaker : Shandra_BrevoyBorderlands
msgctxt "5fe984c7-e414-4f73-b029-5ff83862be33"
msgid ""
"\"You've made a bold decision, Baron{mf||ess}! Only time will tell whether "
"it was a good one...\""
msgstr "\"당신은 대담한 결정을 했습니다, 남작! 그것이 좋은 것인지 아닌지는 시간만 알 수 있습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0109_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "3d51de1c-f969-44d1-a30c-2ea3bdcb0826"
msgid ""
"\"A brilliant victory, Baron{mf||ess}. {d|Natala}I've{/d} no doubt that the "
"noble house you'll found will in time gain great glory, and bards will sing "
"its praises in every tavern!\""
msgstr ""
"\"화려한 승리입니다, 남작. {d|Natala}저는{/d} 당신이 세울 가문이 시간이 지나면 큰 영광을 얻을 것이며, 시인은 모든 "
"선술집에서 그 찬양을 노래하게 될 것이라 확신합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "60f13355-12f9-4fbb-88ec-be14151e87d2"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I haven't the slightest doubt of that! I wonder what it cost the "
"Aldori to receive such services...\""
msgstr "\"오, 나는 그다지 의심할 여지가 없었어! 알도리가 비용을 얼마나 들였을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0114_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "a0008f21-3e2e-4d93-8aa0-9e0cd0237491"
msgid ""
"\"An ally's duty is such a funny thing. One who seemed to be your ally just "
"yesterday may easily refuse to honor such debts tomorrow. And sometimes "
"allies can become enemies due to the tiniest of disagreements...\""
msgstr ""
"\"동맹국의 의무는 너무나 우스운 일이 되었어. 어제 당신의 동료가 될 것처럼 보이는 사람들은 내일 이러한 부채를 기꺼이 받들기가 쉽지 "
"않을 테지. 그리고 때로는 동맹국들은 가장 작은 의견 차이로 인해 적이 될 수 있어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0115_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "cb0b4ee0-d82e-4b12-aa11-d5e55768f93b"
msgid ""
"\"So you believe yourself some knight of legend, or perhaps a heroic monster "
"slayer? That's adorable! It would be heartless of me to dissuade you.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 네가 전설의 어떤 기사나 영웅적인 괴물 사냥꾼이라고 믿어? 정말 앙증맞구나! 너를 만류해서 마음이 아프다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0116_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "908f2317-2ac9-4015-8723-17157377a55f"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps for those who consider 'honor' to be an empty word and confuse "
"real nobility with the length of their family history. Some people are "
"willing to bow before any scoundrel, so long as that scoundrel's lineage is "
"long enough. But a person's actions are what show if someone is truly noble."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"명예를 공허한 말로 간주하고 가문의 역사가 길어야 진정한 귀족이라 혼동하는 사람들이 있지. 어떤 사람들은 괴물의 계보가 충분히 길면 "
"먼저 기꺼이 괴물에게 굴복해. 어떤 사람이 진정으로 고귀한 사람이라면 행동으로 보여줄 수 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0117_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "a9f4f354-0138-4c79-9efc-6a631f67585c"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe you hear coins jingling behind every interaction, like "
"some pathetic shopkeeper. Have you been a ruler for so long that you only "
"see others as servants? Maybe try reading through your family's chronicles "
"sometime — the concept of honor once meant something to your ancestors!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 불쌍한 상점 주인처럼 모든 행동 뒤에서 이익을 계산하는 것을 나는 믿을 수 없군. 오랫동안 통치자가 되어서 다른 사람들을 "
"하인으로 볼 수 밖에 없어? 조상들에게 소중했던 가문의 연대기를 언젠가는 읽어봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0118_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "2bfc7722-f3d8-4d1c-a7aa-3636ca1ab072"
msgid ""
"\"The only difference between legendary heroes and us is the time we live "
"in. The baron{mf||ess}'s deeds speak for themselves. But all legendary "
"heroes had to deal with the jealousy of others — history just never keeps "
"record of the covetous fools.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전설적인 영웅들과 우리 사이의 유일한 차이점은 삶을 살아가는 방식이야. 남작의 행동은 그들을 대변하지. 그러나 모든 전설적인 영웅은 "
"다른 이들의 질투도 다루어야 했어. 역사는 절대로 바보들을 기록하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0119_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "ef2e1b7f-3c42-482d-961f-5918b3d64f71"
msgid ""
"\"The deeds of the baron{mf||ess} in {mf|his|her} lands are already worthy "
"of legend. {mf|He|She} has proven {mf||s}he has the virtues necessary to be "
"not just a baron{mf||ess}, but to be a true {mf|king|queen}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 영토에서 {mf|남작|여남작}의 업적은 이미 전설이 되었습니다. 이분은 남작뿐 아니라 진정한 {mf|왕|여왕}이 될 미덕 또한 "
"갖추셨습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0120_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "930318ef-1c7a-42bd-a625-3e1a85f82d18"
msgid ""
"\"Things just keep becoming more interesting with you. So, near "
"{g|Restov}Restov's{/g} border, where once only impenetrable woods, monster "
"lairs, and bandit dens were found, a real kingdom is emerging? I confess, "
"you've surprised me... Well, I won't object. It will be entertaining to see "
"how that turns out.\""
msgstr ""
"\"상황이 계속해서 더 재미있어지고 있군. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 경계 부근에서 꿰뚫을 수 없는 숲, 괴물의 둥지, 도적 "
"소굴이 발견되었는데 진정한 왕국이 탄생했다? 나를 놀라게 하는군... 글쎄, 나는 반대하지 않겠어. 그 사실이 어떻게 드러나는 지 볼 "
"테니. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0126_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "943d96d2-f13d-404f-81af-eb4ba4f57e84"
msgid ""
"{n}Natala gives you a contemptuous smile.{/n} \"Don't bother. You've already "
"shown your true loyalties. No words can belie you actions.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나탈라는 당신에게 경멸적인 미소를 짓는다{/n} \"귀찮게 하지 마. 너는 이미 네 충성심을 보여주었어. 어떤 말도 네 행동이 "
"거짓임을 드러내지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0127_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "6e732969-0d6e-4379-9de5-f66338ad2034"
msgid "{n}Jamandi shakes her head, smirking.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}자만디는 히죽이며 머리를 흔든다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0128_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "a2abb9e6-cab4-43eb-936b-d902a1f91db1"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi raises her eyebrow.{/n} \"Is that so? I hadn't expected such "
"boldness from you. But, the choice is yours. With an approach like that, "
"you'll certainly be a great addition to whatever passes for high society in "
"the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 그녀의 눈썹을 들어 올린다.{/n} \"그랬단 말이지? 나는 너의 그런 담대함을 기대하지 않았는데. 그러나 선택은 너의 "
"것이야. 그런 접근 방식은 분명히 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}에서 귀족 사회에서 통할 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0129_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "feffe3b3-c3f8-4737-83aa-cc3a9c2b6eea"
msgid "{n}Jamandi firmly shakes your hand.{/n} \"The feeling is mutual!\""
msgstr "{n}자만디가 손을 굳게 잡으며 악수한다.{/n} \"서로 이해가 일치하는군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0130_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "d9c51ed0-ad22-4d91-a41b-388776532d6b"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi thinks for a long moment, her eyes searching your face, then she "
"nods.{/n} \"You take upon yourself a heavy and thankless burden, but I "
"believe you're up to the challenge.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 오랜 순간 당신을 보며 얼굴을 탐색하며 생각하고는 고개를 끄덕였다.{/n} \"너는 묵묵하게 네 일을 해왔지만 네가 그 "
"도전에 부합한다고 믿어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0131_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "be16db66-3c1e-429b-8564-686ff84844a7"
msgid "\"I agree. I suppose that would be best for us all.\""
msgstr "\"동의해. 그것이 우리 모두에게 최선이겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0132_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "cfe1decf-afe5-4a7f-8b0d-5041304996d8"
msgid ""
"\"And now let me bid you farewell. I was truly happy to meet you face-to-"
"face once more. With all my heart, I wish your young kingdom great "
"prosperity, and I hope your newly established noble family will have a long "
"and glorious history!\" {n}Natala {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} turns and "
"leaves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이제는 작별 인사를 해야겠어. 다시 한 번 얼굴을 마주하게 되어 정말 기뻤어. 내 마음을 다해서 너의 젊은 왕국이 번영하길 바라고 "
"새로 생긴 너의 고귀한 가문이 오래 번영하고 영광스러운 역사를 쓰기를 바라!\" {n}나탈라 {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}"
"는 몸을 돌려 떠난다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0134_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "1f1c6a2a-4f3e-4a01-9da0-fb568a1c5c94"
msgid "\"I hope you know what you're doing.\""
msgstr "\"네가 하는 일이 뭔지 알고 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0136_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "7935d438-17b4-459c-a0a1-a0fb5a0e45bc"
msgid ""
"{n}After a farewell handshake, Jamandi leaves, her fighters following close "
"behind.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}작별인사로 악수를 하고 자만디가 떠나고 그녀의 전사가 뒤를 따라 간다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0139_Text
#. Speaker : Surtova
msgctxt "2902ef47-d4fe-4bbb-aa1c-2006fbf19f43"
msgid ""
"\"You bring up an excellent point. With {g|Restov}Restov's{/g} army "
"defeated, {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} has little left to protect it from its "
"numerous enemies. Yes, I believe you'll render invaluable service to Brevoy "
"if you station your army... let's say, at {g|Nivakta's Crossing}Nivakta's "
"Crossing{/g}. What do you say, {g|Swordlords}Swordlord{/g}? Or would you "
"prefer I garrison soldiers from {g|House Surtova}House Surtova{/g} there? "
"I'm fine with either solution, really.\" {n}Natala savor's Jamandi's "
"expression as though it were some exquisite wine.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"훌륭한 지적이야. {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}의 군대는 패배했고, {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}는 수많은 적들로부터 그들을 "
"보호할 수 있는 여지가 거의 없어. 그래, 당신이 병력을 배치해주면 브레보이에게 값을 매길 수 없는 도움이 될거야... 어디보자, {g|"
"Nivakta's Crossing}니박타의 교차로{/g}가 좋겠군. 뭐라고 할거지, {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g}? 아니면 "
"내가 {g|House Surtova}서토바 가문{/g}의 병사들을 배치하면 좋아할까? 나는 어느 쪽이라도 좋아.\" {n}나탈라는 "
"자만디의 표정을 마치 향이 깊은 와인처럼 음미한다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0140_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "fb1008f6-b75d-40ef-a780-7742e77bf9af"
msgid ""
"{n}Jamandi grows pale with rage and humilation. Her hand reaches for her "
"blade, but she restrains herself as she hisses through clenched teeth,{/n} "
"\"As you wish. {mf|His|Her} troops will suffice.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}자만디는 분노와 수치로 창백해진다. 그녀의 손은 그녀의 칼에 닿지만 그녀는 이빨을 악물으며 지껄인다.{/n} \"네가 원한다면. "
"{mf|그의|그녀의} 군대는 충분할 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/JamandiSurtovaThanks/Cue_0141_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_Borderlands
msgctxt "39cd9291-381d-42f6-b6a2-fd70a589b09f"
msgid ""
"\"I haven't the slightest doubt that {name} will become one of the best "
"{mf|king|queen}s the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} have ever known!\" "
"{n}Jamandi extends her open palm to you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"저는 {name}님께서 {mf|왕|여왕}이 되어 {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 정점에 서게 되실거라 믿어 "
"의심치 않습니다!\" {n}자만디는 당신에게 악수를 권한다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "491995bc-48b1-4dc9-a972-1c966898b98e"
msgid "\"We could ask the Tiger Lords.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 호랑이 군주들에게 물어볼 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b02785aa-16e0-4653-b6e1-96fedeb825a6"
msgid ""
"\"I have scouts we can send to Glenebon Uplands. They can scour out the "
"location for us!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 글레네본 고지대에 정찰병을 보낼 수 있어. 그들은 우리를 위해 탐색할 수 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2e45113c-c3e0-42d4-9f1c-9fe6e08f95e4"
msgid "\"What's this idea of yours? Go ahead and share — it can't hurt.\""
msgstr "\"너의 생각은 어때? 염려 말고 말해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f3c536f4-f1b1-40ca-9ac2-f0c59822373d"
msgid "\"I will give the orders.\""
msgstr "\"내가 명령을 내릴게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "89c186cb-8801-4d8c-8b45-edfd34d57142"
msgid ""
"\"What do you mean, 'how'? The same way we always do — we pack our things "
"and go find it!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게라니 무슨 의미야? 짐을 싸고 찾으러 가야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f22467f7-79e6-4d7e-b1e7-06ea311f65ef"
msgid ""
"\"Imagine that! {mf|King|Queen}! You know, I always believed in you. You "
"keep it up, and who knows? In a couple years, you might even become an "
"emperor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"상상이 가시나요! {mf|왕|여왕}이라니! 결국엔 엄청난 일을 해내실 줄 알았다니까요! 이 기세라면, 혹시 알아요? 몇 년 안에 황제 "
"폐하가 되실지도 몰라요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f5f2c3ec-e078-4688-88f1-4e4510654d13"
msgid ""
"\"But that Armag... He and those creepy Sisters barely managed to find the "
"tomb. How are we going to find it? I mean, I suppose I have a bit of an "
"idea, but... I'm not sure.\""
msgstr ""
"\"근데 아르막이... 그와 오싹한 자매들이 겨우 무덤을 찾았어요. 우리는 어떻게 발견 할 수 있을까요? 저는 조금 생각이 있긴 "
"한데... 확신 할 수 없어요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "1218d869-b969-4f1a-a15b-432f137afd9a"
msgid ""
"\"Sorry, but that's a dead end. I already chatted them up a bit, and they "
"know about the same as we do — the tomb is somewhere in {g|Glenebon}Glenebon "
"Uplands{/g}. And Glenebon is, well, you know... big. Like, really big.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죄송하지만 그건 막다른 길이에요. 저는 이미 그들과 약간의 대화를 나눠봤는데, 그들은 우리처럼 무덤이 {g|Glenebon}글레네본 "
"고지대{/g} 어딘가에 있는 것을 알고있어요. 그리고 글레네본은 알다시피 너무 크고요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "f2ab008e-0392-4f97-841a-2da7f7b913f9"
msgid ""
"\"Seriously? You have your own scouts? Well, I don't know why I'm so "
"surprised — you're soon to be {mf|king|queen}! Fine, then, let them search!\""
msgstr ""
"\"진짜로요? 정찰병이 있다고요? 이런! 제가 왜 그리 놀랐을까요. 곧 있으면 당신은 {mf|왕|여왕}인데 말이죠! 좋아요, 그럼 찾도록 "
"시켜요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "f0ed575c-6df1-4db5-a026-8b08bafba744"
msgid ""
"\"We're not the first to live in these lands. Countless other people were "
"here before us! Maybe they knew something about the tomb. If we could find "
"some archives from previous inhabitants of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} — like the dwarves, maybe... Truth be told, I don't really know "
"where to look for them, but these lands are swarming with ruins! There must "
"be an archive or two left somewhere. I mean, maybe. Hopefully...\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 이 땅에서 처음으로 살고 있는 사람은 아니에요. 수많은 사람이 예전에 살았었죠! 아마도 그들은 무덤에 대해 알고 있을지도 "
"몰라요. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 이전 거주자들인 드워프의 기록보관소를 발견할 수 있다면... 솔직히 말하면 "
"저는 그들을 어디에서 찾을 지 정말로 모르겠지만 이 땅은 폐허가 무리지어 있잖아요! 어딘가 하나 또는 두 개의 기록 보관소가 남아 "
"있을걸요. 제 말은 아마도 희망을 가지면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "2196c022-2090-4be9-a044-67199ef2548c"
msgid ""
"\"Remember that forsaken dwarven fortress where the Sisters had holed up? "
"There's a huge library there. Hundreds of ancient books, maybe thousands! I "
"bet there's something about Armag's tomb in there somewhere! But who's going "
"to read through it all? You'd need to hire a whole army of scholars!\""
msgstr ""
"\"얼굴 잃은 자매를 만났던 버려진 드워프 요새 기억하시죠? 거대한 도서관이 있던 곳이요. 오래된 책이 수백 권은 돼 보였죠. 수천 권일 "
"수도 있구요! 아르막의 무덤에 관한 책도 있을 거예요. 그런데 누가 일일이 확인하죠? 고고학자들을 죄다 불러 모아야겠네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "94f16305-d6d0-4ddd-b715-ccd787e67923"
msgid ""
"\"The tomb's well hidden. Over the centuries, no one but Armag has found it —"
" and it took him forever! If we go wandering around without a clue, we could "
"still be looking till the end of time! Before we go, we need some leads.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무덤은 잘 숨겨져 있어요. 수세기 동안 아르막을 제외하고 아무도 그것을 발견하지 못했고 영원히 그의 것이에요! 단서 없이 주위를 돌아 "
"다니면 우리는 여전히 시간이 끝날 때까지 볼 수 없겠죠! 우리가 가기 전에 몇몇 단서가 필요해요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/Linzi_Ending/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "a3adb8e5-c8de-4b7f-95e0-3692d21759ae"
msgid ""
"\"Let's do it, then! Let's find the tomb! We have to hurry — who knows what "
"Armag might do, given enough time there!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 시작하죠! 어서 무덤을 찾자구요! 서둘러야 해요. 빨리 가지 않으면, 그 사이 아르막이 무슨 음모를 꾸밀지 몰라요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7e831f18-49cd-4dae-8489-f36c48ad3117"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"당신 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3437d438-1955-4f43-baed-218117f0c8a6"
msgid "\"Which deity do you serve?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어느 신을 섬기지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4ad89513-12d6-4dab-83e8-8c900ab914bc"
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c08a76d8-0d70-40b8-8a27-8c429d7cebb7"
msgid "\"Good luck in the battle!\""
msgstr "\"전투에서 행운을 빌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "0a86d86b-b744-4106-b08f-16db8420f5d7"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"당신 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "79ea66a9-1d64-4e79-9a21-7c8ad2807909"
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "1b8493d5-bf41-4f52-9d92-e83315846b9a"
msgid "[Pass by]"
msgstr "[지나친다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "5da8de51-1302-460a-808b-545b884c78ad"
msgid ""
"\"That sounds like a dark deed... Wouldn't your deity punish you for that?\""
msgstr "\"그건 악한 행동 같아. 신이 너를 벌하지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0bb0a50d-9a6c-4e8d-b619-49b66a1bb37d"
msgid "Advised the destroyed army's priest not to waste his life in vain."
msgstr "괴멸한 군대의 사제에게 인생을 허비하지 말라고 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "5eef4dac-0eb3-4435-a3ea-a9a2fce9dec7"
msgid ""
"\"Idiot! While you're conducting this weird ritual, wounded people are "
"bleeding to death at the camp! They need your help, not your heroic corpse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"바보야! 이 이상한 의식을 하는 동안 상처 입은 사람들이 야영지에서 피를 흘리고 있어! 네 영웅적 시체가 아니라 네 도움이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "45e41c1c-529f-4173-9fac-dc741206de9f"
msgid "Advised the destroyed army's priest not to waste his soul in vain."
msgstr "괴멸한 군대의 사제에게 인생을 허비하지 말라고 조언했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a91d777d-a35a-4715-84df-697d8a464ef5"
msgid ""
"\"Are you really willing to be cursed by your goddess just to kill a few "
"barbarians?\""
msgstr "\"단지 몇 명의 야만족을 죽이기 위해 당신의 여신에게 저주 받을 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a3e2adf5-2fbc-482c-839e-64ff9cea5b12"
msgid "Encouraged the destroyed army's priest to sacrifice his life."
msgstr "괴멸한 군대의 사제에게 자신의 목숨을 희생하라고 부추겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0024_Text_String
msgctxt "f58c056f-e065-4412-8dc0-f9526759f0fd"
msgid ""
"\"That's the spirit of a true soldier. Allow me to fight by your side!\""
msgstr "\"그것은 진정한 군인의 정신이지. 네 편으로 싸울게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0025_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bcd9647a-4b31-473b-9cf5-39a64f79d70a"
msgid "Decided not to interfere with the destroyed army's priest."
msgstr "괴멸한 군대의 사제를 방해하지 않기로 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "9fb2de11-5cd9-46df-83e4-757b5acc986f"
msgid "\"As you wish. I'm not here to tell you what to do.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로 나는 네게 무엇을 해야 할 지 말하려 여기에 있는 것이 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5d6d4ac3-d09b-4af0-a070-bcf45bebd9f6"
msgid "Encouraged the destroyed army's priest to sacrifice his soul."
msgstr "괴멸한 군대의 사제에게 자신의 영혼을 희생하라고 부추겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0028_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "592f7462-2006-4f00-8d09-89c8ad938f00"
msgid "Mocked the destroyed army's priest."
msgstr "괴멸한 군대의 사제를 비웃었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "4697941c-41a1-4824-a6a3-8fe95a3919a6"
msgid ""
"\"They all died because of me, you know. I could have brought the "
"reinforcements sooner, but I left you to fend for yourselves instead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알다시피 그들은 모두 나때문에 죽었어. 나는 증원군을 더 빨리 데려 올 수 있었지만 대신 네가 스스로를 지키게 내버려두었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "c329b228-3a43-49b0-b6cb-45dc7c599df7"
msgid "Murdered and robbed the destroyed army's priest."
msgstr "괴멸한 군대의 사제를 죽이고 약탈했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "cb512893-8631-48dd-ba97-7e770141892c"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Those stones look valuable... I think you should give them to me."
"\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"이 돌들은 가치 있는 것 같아. 나에게 당연히 주어야지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0047_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "f5cf4dde-3169-4794-b4c0-ef4580fe7dbc"
msgid "Attacked an allied squad of Restovic warriors."
msgstr "동맹군인 레스토프 전사들을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "1e9e19da-7272-4a56-8c1d-a2e71ace79e8"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't like you...\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"나는 너희들을 좋아하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "432f8efc-e5a2-4c82-9ede-fea06adc4aad"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, these are our allies. We don't cut open our allies' muzzles, even if "
"we really want to.\""
msgstr "\"레그. 그들은 우리 동맹이야. 우리가 진정으로 원한다고 해도 그들의 총구를 자르지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "b0d011b6-9552-410f-b6a1-98ed83523554"
msgid ""
"\"Put away your weapons, or I'll personally hand you over to Jamandi to hang!"
"\""
msgstr "\"무기를 버리지 않으면 자만디에 직접 넘겨 교수형에 처하게 해줄거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "d44836c2-cefa-422a-be98-4a36e33a6f57"
msgid "[Attack] \"Let's do it!\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"죽여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "c96f5872-dec9-476c-9480-c46e4bcdbcb9"
msgid ""
"\"Reg, these are our allies. We don't kill our allies even if we don't think "
"they're being serious.\""
msgstr "\"레그, 이들은 우리의 동료야. 우리가 그들을 진중히 대하지 않더라도 우리는 동맹국을 죽이지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "21d97dfb-58ff-42a0-b8c4-a6e547f23b1f"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe I should cut you instead? When will you learn that we're not a gang "
"of bandits?\""
msgstr "\"어쩌면 내가 너를 대신 죽여볼까? 우리가 도적단이 아니라는 것을 언제 깨달을래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "fba2af4a-c5f0-479f-8009-693898aefb98"
msgid "[Attack] \"My thoughts exactly!\""
msgstr "[공격한다] \"내 생각과 일치하는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Answer_0075_Text
msgctxt "d27d71be-3abc-49cc-8794-0fe49b9c0986"
msgid ""
"\"Don't vex Pharasma. The cost of such a pointless feat is your eternal soul!"
"\""
msgstr "\"파라즈마를 괴롭히지 마라. 그런 무의미한 공적의 비용은 너의 영원한 영혼이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3ae84add-7070-41cf-9a54-7c7859c69ace"
msgid ""
"{n}You see a group of {g|Restov}Restovic{/g} soldiers giving you disturbed "
"glances. A gnome who seem to be their leader waves around a holy symbol of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}.{/n} \"At easy, people! They are on our side! "
"Sheath your weapons!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 {g|Restov} 레스토프{/g} 군인들이 혼란에 빠진 것을 목격한다. 그들의 지도자로 보이는 놈이 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 상징을 휘두른다.{/n} \"진정해! 우리 편이잖아! 무기를 거두어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "cdf87656-b816-4708-81f3-e0f40980e3c7"
msgid ""
"{n}Soldiers' corpses litter the area. A gnome in dented armor moves hastily "
"between the bodies. Ignoring the blood oozing from his wounds, he places "
"shiny black onyx gems on the dead soldiers' chests.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}병사들의 시체가 이 지역에 널브러져 있습니다. 찌그러진 갑옷을 입은 노움은 시체들 사이를 분주하게 움직입니다. 그의 상처에서 흘러 "
"나오는 피를 무시한 채 죽은 병사들의 가슴에 반짝이는 검은색 오닉스 보석을 놓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "be841c9a-ed97-4513-91f3-2b5f60054e1f"
msgid ""
"\"Can't you tell? We're angels from the sky, come to judge this sinful "
"world! Come, mortal, kneel and pray!\" {n}The gnome strikes a pose as the "
"rest of the soldiers laugh boisterously.{/n} \"What do we look like? These "
"toughs are {g|Swordlords}Swordlord{/g} Jamandi's fighters, and I'm Dallirun "
"Myrnas, their commander and regimental cleric!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모르겠어? 우리는 이 죄 많은 세상을 심판하려 하늘로부터 온 천사들이다. 필멸자여, 무릎 꿇고 기도하라!\" {n}나머지 병사들이 "
"박장대소하자 노움은 자세를 바로잡습니다.{/n} \"우리가 특이해 보여? 이 녀석들은 {g|Swordlords}소드로드{/g} 자만디의 "
"전사들이고, 나는 그들의 사령관이자 연대 성직자인 달리런 머나스야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "b1129441-1f4b-45e9-afb9-7b1f0fa0e624"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, Lady of Graves and Mistress of the "
"{g|Boneyard}Boneyard{/g}. She's the only goddess no one can avoid meeting — "
"not you, not me, not anyone. My lady's always busy when there's a war on.\""
msgstr ""
"\"무덤의 여인이자 {g|Boneyard}뼈무덤{/g}의 여주인인 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}는 그 누구도 피할 수 없는 유일한 "
"여신이다. 나도, 너도, 다른 누구도 결국에는 그녀를 만나야만 하지. 나의 여신께서는 전쟁이 일어난 장소에서 항상 바쁘시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "98b94170-5167-4088-9373-d8cb0d9874f7"
msgid ""
"\"And you must be the baron{mf||ess} of {kingdomname}? Report said you'd be "
"bringing reinforcements soon. You're just in time! Now we'll give them what "
"they deserve!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 너는 {kingdomname}의 남작이지? 네가 곧 증원군을 데려 올거라는 보고를 들었지. 제 시간에 왔군! 이제 우리는 "
"그들이 받을만한 것을 그들에게 줄테야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ad039202-f665-4100-b738-fdb8fc83b637"
msgid ""
"\"Huh, what ARE we doing here? Maybe some kind of open-air picnic? No, I "
"don't see enough food for that. Maybe a traveling circus show? That doesn't "
"seem likely — sure there are plenty of clowns and trained horses around, but "
"I don't hear a band playing... Oh, I know! We must be Lady Jamandi's "
"reserve, ready to engage on the sound of her horn! What with being at war "
"and all. Yes, of course! Why didn't I see it straight away?\""
msgstr ""
"\"허, 우리 여기서 뭐하는거야? 야외 소풍인가? 난 그걸 위한 음식이 충분하지 않아. 서커스 쇼가 있을지도 몰라. 그럴 것 같지 않아. "
"광대들도 많고 훈련된 말들도 있지만 악단의 연주는 안 들려... 오, 알았다! 우리는 자만디의 예비군이 되어 그녀의 경적 소리에 맞춰 "
"싸울 준비가 되어 있어야 해! 내가 왜 그것을 바로 보지 못했을까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "95122324-635a-42b7-8ef9-0afef9299b47"
msgid ""
"\"I'm preparing the greatest blasphemy — I'm going to raise my fighters for "
"one last attack. We lost the battle. We were betrayed — no one came to help "
"us, and we were slaughtered like livestock. But I'm a cleric. I have some "
"powers... I'll make the dead fight one more time. At least we can take some "
"of those damned barbarians to the afterlife with us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 가장 위대한 신성 모독을 준비하고 있어. 나는 마지막 공격을 위해 전사를 모을 것이야. 우리는 전투에서 패했어. 우리는 배반 "
"당했어. 아무도 우리를 도와주지 않았고, 우리는 가축처럼 도살되었지. 하지만 성직자인 나는 힘을 가지고 있지... 나는 죽은 자들을 한 "
"번 더 싸우게 만들 거야. 최소한 우리는 그 저주 받은 야만인 중 일부를 우리와 함께 내세에 데려 갈 수 있겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "bde227a0-3416-4aad-90ba-6cf486e1e7dd"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome slowly raises his dull eyes to you.{/n} \"I'm Dallirun Myrnas, "
"regimental cleric... Or I used to be. No regiment anymore. And I'm running "
"out of time myself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 천천히 자신의 둔한 눈을 들어 올린다.{/n} \"나는 달리런 머나스야, 연대 성직자... 였지. 내 연대는 파멸했어. "
"나에게도 남은 시간이 많지 않고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "8b38e2b1-c9f2-47ef-86bc-b3ac9fa87c58"
msgid ""
"\"Of course she would. The undead are abominations in the eyes of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} — raising them is the greatest blasphemy I could "
"perform. Best case, she'll reject me. Worst, she'll smite me. It's not "
"important. Who cares what happens to me next?\""
msgstr ""
"\"당연히 그녀는 그러겠지. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 눈에 언데드들은 혐오물이야. 그들을 일으키는 것은 내가 수행할 수 "
"있는 가장 위대한 신성 모독이지. 최선의 경우라면 그녀는 나를 파면할 거야. 최악의 경우, 그녀는 나를 징벌하겠지. 중요한 것은 아니야. "
"다음에 나에게 무슨 일이 생길지 누가 걱정하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "01c1f1d6-3ada-4feb-a925-a3fadeaa001c"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome looks at you, blinking, not seeming to comprehend your words. "
"Then his gaze clears.{/n} \"What am I doing? You're right, a hundred times "
"right — I've been an idiot! Here, take these and keep them out of harm's way!"
"\" {n}The gnome presses some onyx gems into your hands and runs toward the "
"Brevans' camp.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 눈을 끔뻑이며 당신을 바라봅니다. 당신의 말을 이해하지 못하는 것 같습니다. 곧 그의 시선이 또렷해집니다.{/n} \"내가 "
"뭘하고 있지? 네 말이 백번 옳아. 나는 바보였어! 여기 이걸 가져가서 해가 되지 않게 해줘!\" {n}노움은 오닉스 보석을 당신 손에 "
"놓고 브레보이의 진영쪽으로 달려갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "3c076ed0-2929-492d-97d8-6a1f1bb8a68f"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome lowers his eyes to the holy symbol of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} "
"in his hands.{/n} \"No. No... of course not. A thousand times no. Forgive "
"me, my lady... I was on the verge of committing the worst act of my life.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 시선을 내려 그의 손에 들린 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 거룩한 상징을 바라봅니다. {/n} \"아니, 아니... "
"물론 아니지. 천 번은 틀렸어. 용서해주세요 여신님... 나는 내 인생에서 최악의 행동을 저지르기 직전이었어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "9685ef36-6d9b-4e1d-8237-3aadb52e1c59"
msgid ""
"\"Sure.\" {n}A crooked grin appears on the gnome's face.{/n} \"Everything's "
"more fun with friends — even dying and going to the {g|Abyss}Abyss{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론.\" {n}노움의 얼굴에 비뚤어진 미소가 나타난다.{/n} \"친구와 함께라면 모든 것이 더 재미있어. 심지어 죽어서 "
"{g|Abyss}심연{/g}에 떨어지는 것조차도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "f15b59a5-4330-46ef-9796-3ebb7f7cafe5"
msgid "{n}The gnome grumbles an incoherent answer as he resumes his work.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}노움이 일관성 없는 대답 웅얼거리고는 일을 다시 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "4e41050c-16c1-467c-abc7-334ee3e650ea"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome stares at you with dull eyes for several moments, as though "
"trying to wrap his head around your words. He then starts to pray, clutching "
"his holy symbol in white-knuckled hands.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 당신의 말을 머리에 담으려고 하는 것처럼, 몇 분 동안 둔한 눈으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 이윽고 그는 덜덜 떨리는 손으로 "
"거룩한 상징을 움켜쥔 채 기도하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "85f6dc98-556f-45f2-b104-389e65795acf"
msgid ""
"{n}Impaling you with his dull eyes, the gnome clenches his teeth and "
"charges.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}둔한 눈으로 당신을 쏘아보더니, 노움이 이를 악물고 달려듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "6d6a82a0-b200-4c3c-a38d-77a36901f792"
msgid ""
"\"Same to you! Show that pantless scum they should have stayed out of "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"너와 똑같아! 바지도 없는 저 쓰레기들에게 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}에 얼씬도 말아야 할 이유를 보여주러 왔지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "f686c1b2-67fc-4f1b-83ea-fb58cd4131d3"
msgid "{n}The gnome continues, ignoring you completely.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}노움은 계속해서 당신을 무시합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "98ebbdbd-8cd1-47ee-9860-2b9f0f92b854"
msgid "\"What do you know? Get out of here!\" {n}He waves you away.{/n}"
msgstr "\"네가 무엇을 알아? 나와!\" {n}그는 당신을 쫓아낸다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "011bbf7c-1f2b-4e70-8efc-a5838899916c"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome raises his hand to the sky, holy symbol of "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} in hand, and whispers a prayer. As he utters the "
"last word, his holy symbol cracks and falls to pieces. The gnome falls to "
"his knees, and his dead brothers-in-arms open their eyes and slowly rise on "
"unsteady feet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 하늘을 향해 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 거룩한 상징을 잡은 손을 들고 기도문을 속삭입니다. 그가 마지막 말을 "
"마치자 그의 거룩한 상징은 부서졌고, 조각난 채 떨어집니다. 노움은 무릎을 꿇었고, 그의 죽은 전우들은 눈을 뜨고 천천히 불안정한 발로 "
"일어섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "acc56841-f2e4-4995-b5ca-7ba03f3d0fa5"
msgid ""
"\"Follow me, fellows. Follow me one last time. We'll have our revenge!\""
msgstr "\"나를 따라와라 친구들이여. 마지막까지 나를 따라와라. 우리는 복수할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "2b033e6d-33b3-4a85-9d09-2203924fbbc6"
msgid ""
"\"Take these and keep them out of harm's way. As for me... I hope there are "
"at least a few survivors left from our army. If so, they need my help now.\" "
"{n}The gnome presses some onyx gems into your hands and runs toward the "
"Brevans' camp.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"여기 이걸 가져가서 해가 되지 않게 해. 나에 관해서는... 적어도 우리 군대 몇 명의 생존자가 남아 있기를 바래야지. 그렇다면 지금 "
"그들은 내 도움이 필요해.\" {n}노움은 오닉스 보석을 당신 손에 쥐어주고 브레보이 진영 쪽으로 달려갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "87c6c1da-a42c-40b9-a165-18d05eaa3b8b"
msgid ""
"{n}As he utters the last word, the holy symbol of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} "
"cracks and falls to pieces. The gnome falls to his knees, and his dead "
"brothers-in-arms slowly rise on unsteady feet and groan as they start "
"walking toward you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그가 마지막 말을 마치자 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 거룩한 상징은 부서지며 조각난 채 떨어집니다. 노움은 무릎을 "
"꿇었고, 그의 죽은 전우들은 불안정한 자세로 일어나서, 신음하며 당신에게 걸어옵니다{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "b377915c-655d-4755-a524-1c47be9d0e21"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, what are you doing? Are you crazy? We're on the same side — we're "
"from {g|Restov}Restov{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"이봐 뭐하고 있어? 미쳤어? 우린 같은 편이야. 우리는 같은 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g} 출신이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "761d1845-65ee-4f20-b635-69188c1ad806"
msgid ""
"\"Amazing... He was desperate, at the edge of death — and you returned to "
"him the will to live! You're a miracle!\""
msgstr "\"놀라워... 그는 죽음의 끝에서 절망에 빠져있었어. 그리고 너는 그에게 살아야 할 의지로 돌아왔어! 너는 기적이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "35dc3a3c-56d3-43dc-9157-0dc554afdadf"
msgid "\"Cheeky, isn't he? Can I cut open his muzzle?\""
msgstr "\"건방진. 그렇지 않아? 주둥이를 따버릴까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f057acc7-aa1c-4315-ac0e-4895eb7bd0e3"
msgid "\"Hehehe... Hold on, you scum!\""
msgstr "\"헤헤헤... 이녀석 기다려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "67182af3-3106-4060-b8b2-2ca09bbdf7a0"
msgid ""
"\"Politics is complicated! Fine, you're in charge, you know better who to "
"cut and who to let off. But his tongue will get him into trouble sooner or "
"later!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정치는 복잡하지! 좋아 너도 책임이 있으니. 누구를 베고 누구를 풀어줘야 하는지 너도 알겠지. 하지만 그 세치 혀가 조만간 그를 "
"곤경에 빠뜨릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "4f0c4d7b-fa77-4697-8ac9-f71e40290ee8"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, easy! It was only a suggestion. We don't have to if you don't want to!"
"\""
msgstr "\"이봐 진정해! 단지 제안 일 뿐이니까. 원한다면 하지 않아도 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "56401f3b-f271-46f5-b292-bf904f37cdd3"
msgid ""
"\"This guy can't be serious. How about we just cut him and take the gems?\""
msgstr "\"이 녀석 심각하지 않군. 베어버리고 보석을 가져갈까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fc9a3bb6-09bf-4bb9-ae70-5a2c86b229fb"
msgid ""
"\"Politics is complicated! Fine, you're in charge, you know better who to "
"cut and who to let off. Too bad about the gems, though — it's a shame to "
"waste them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정치는 복잡하지! 좋아 너도 책임이 있으니. 누구를 베고 누구를 풀어줘야 하는지 너도 알겠지. 보석을 포기하기에 아깝지만 어쩔 수 "
"없지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cdcb41a7-9b55-4bad-a674-7174dfec7f4c"
msgid ""
"\"All right, all right, fine with me... Bandits, barons — what's the "
"difference? The title has made you so stuck up!\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 좋아 나는 괜찮아... 산적과 남작의 차이점은 무엇이지? 지위 때문에 너는 너무 갇혔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0069_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "db463484-1874-4351-84ff-d9e99fb16a4c"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha! Well, I'm your right hand for a reason! Hey, shortie, give me "
"the gems!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 나는 네 오른손이야! 어이 꼬맹이, 나에게 보석을 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "1cd357aa-a130-4062-8d30-ee645bd52e72"
msgid ""
"\"In every scream of 'unlife is disgusting!' I hear an unsaid 'given a "
"reason, I'd give everything for the opportunities it provides.' And this is "
"material evidence. If you want to see a hypocrite, just look for a "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasmin{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\" 밑바닥 인생은 구역질 나지!' 나는 이유가 비밀을 들었지. 나는 그것이 제공하는 기회에 대해 모든 것을 줄 거야. 그리고 이것은 "
"물질적 증거야. 위선자를 보고 싶다면 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}를 봐. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0070_Text_1
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "644fa0b3-1338-4751-b53b-1e8167601db2"
msgid ""
"\"In every scream of 'unlife is disgusting!' I hear an unsaid 'given a "
"reason, I'd give everything for the opportunities it provides.' And this is "
"material evidence. If you want to see a hypocrite, just look for a "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasmin{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\" 밑바닥 인생은 구역질 나지!' 나는 이유가 비밀을 들었지. 나는 그것이 제공하는 기회에 대해 모든 것을 줄 거야. 그리고 이것은 "
"물질적 증거야. 위선자를 보고 싶다면 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}를 봐. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0073_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ee80e173-5ecb-44d5-b2b8-1c0f0b5e6ec7"
msgid "\"I fully support this wonderful proposition.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 훌륭한 명제를 전적으로 지지한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0074_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "6811bd03-b879-439c-81ab-a5618b4d3925"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal keeps her distance, cold as usual. But hearing the priest's "
"words, she lets out a crooked smirk.{/n} \"I could argue over the "
"inevitability of meeting {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, but why waste time "
"enlightening silly fanatics?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이살은 평소와 같이 차가움을 유지한다. 그러나 사제의 말을 듣고 비뚤어진 웃음을 보인다.{/n} \"나는 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}를 만나야만 하는 필연성에 대해 논쟁 할 수 있지만 바보 같은 광신자를 계몽하려 시간을 낭비하는 "
"이유는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/BrevoyBorderlandsOutdoor/TrivialEvent_Patriot/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "28e6e410-e2ab-47d5-88bc-a80edde53745"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome looks down at the symbol of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} in his "
"hand.{/n} \"My goddess... She would never forgive such sacrilege. I almost "
"made the stupidest mistake of my life!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 상징을 내려다 본다.{/n} \"여신이시여... 그녀는 결코 그런 짓을 용서하지 않을 "
"것이다. 나는 내 인생의 가장 어리석은 실수를 저질렀어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "81ebda0c-bf42-446e-93d7-b2de78662cc6"
msgid "\"I had to find you.\""
msgstr "\"너를 찾아야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0176b4f4-a4ff-4be2-8448-b19c8f23d503"
msgid "\"I want answers, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"나는 대답을 원해, 트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6c4b766e-b720-47b3-a9be-39a813c9f551"
msgid "\"I should break your neck, traitor!\""
msgstr "\"네 목을 부러뜨리겠다, 배신자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6ff55818-5334-43bf-8a45-34c522aecbc2"
msgid "\"Give me what you took from Vordakai.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이에서 가져간 걸 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ed0aa18c-1eed-4bc2-b7ed-5ebb9dc7db40"
msgid "Gave Tristian another chance."
msgstr "트리스티안에게 또 다른 기회를 줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "f1113980-7f03-4c8c-98d5-d227318d2ef9"
msgid ""
"\"All who have erred deserve a second chance — isn't that what Sarenrae "
"teaches us? Let's talk, you and I.\""
msgstr "\"실수한 모든 사람은 두 번째 기회가 있어. 그것이 세레네께서 우리에게 가르치는 것이 아닌가? 당신 나와 이야기해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "2481fb2d-bb7e-432c-8624-a68f386df3df"
msgid "\"Surrender the Oculus of Abaddon! Now!\""
msgstr "\"Abaddon의 눈을 당장 포기해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "dec33335-ef96-4995-a388-2c4724c136c5"
msgid "\"Who is your true mistress?\""
msgstr "\"너의 진정한 여주인은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "a424887d-0d1d-45c4-a652-c8bbe9c6711a"
msgid "\"Fine, keep the Oculus. Let's just talk!\""
msgstr "\"좋다. Abaddon의 눈은 가져라. 협상하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "19e2b99e-4372-431a-92ca-d25bb54fa221"
msgid "\"Enough idle talk, Tristian!\""
msgstr "\"쓸모 없는 이야기였다. 트리스티안!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "9e517139-f4e0-4d7b-b1eb-e8fb72aeeebc"
msgid "\"It brought me to you.\""
msgstr "\"그것이 나를 너에게 데려왔지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "b09c1463-f97c-46e8-b39f-40c2eb50b42a"
msgid ""
"\"Why are you trying to run away? The Oculus is broken, Vordakai defeated. "
"Stop fleeing and let's talk!\""
msgstr "\"도망치려는 이유가 무엇이지? Abaddon의 눈은 부서지고 보다카이가 패배했어. 도망가지 말고 이야기하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "1e4bcf5f-141e-4e4b-9b9e-a2122d11c935"
msgid "\"Where are you fleeing to? To whom? Who sent you to me?\""
msgstr "\"어디로 도망가? 누구에게? 누가 너를 나에게 보낸 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0cf61ae5-b671-458a-830a-56cf12b5690c"
msgid "Gave Tristian another chance."
msgstr "트리스티안에게 또 다른 기회를 주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "245f6200-71a8-46e2-acdf-d56c6705b796"
msgid ""
"\"All who have erred deserve a second chance — isn't that what Sarenrae "
"teaches us? Let's talk, you and I.\""
msgstr "\"실수한 모든 사람은 두 번째 기회가 있지. 서렌레이께서 우리에게 가르치는 것이 아닌가? 나와 이야기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0022_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "696c2fef-60fd-43d3-bd0f-252993d51269"
msgid "Threatened Tristian with a death."
msgstr "죽음으로 트리스티안을 위협합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "6187fc0c-8eb8-4dd3-a46c-9bf1f198ef8a"
msgid "\"I'm tired of your pathetic words. Prepare to die.\""
msgstr "\"네 한심한 말에 질렸다. 죽을 준비나 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "87af50a8-535f-42e2-b87f-31220190302b"
msgid ""
"\"In Vordakai's tomb I saw... something odd. What were those wings that "
"appeared behind your back, Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"보다카이의 무덤에서 나는 이상한 것을 보았어. 네 등 뒤에서 나타난 날개는 무엇이었지 트리스티안?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_BF_Reinforced1_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e197b079-affd-4a30-b771-22531ff6888a"
msgid "Sharply rebuked Tristian for causing so much grief to innocent people."
msgstr "무고한 사람들에게 너무 많은 슬픔을 안겨 주었기 때문에 신랄하게 트리스티안을 책망합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_BF_Reinforced1_Text
msgctxt "4d0ddd14-b9b9-4bdd-a68e-f818a0e840bf"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, are you satisfied? Satisfied with the suffering to countless "
"innocents by opening those portals? Answer!\""
msgstr "\"내게 말해줘. 만족해? 그 포털을 열어 무수한 무고한 사람들에게 고통 주어 만족했어? 대답해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Answer_BF_Romantic1_Text
msgctxt "09863da6-ecd4-4f25-8634-f0518add4a60"
msgid "\"Thank the gods you're alive! I was so afraid for you!\""
msgstr "\"네가 살아있음을 신에게 감사해! 너를 너무 걱정했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "15cf60cd-f5d6-46f8-b907-4d21717cdbbe"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian raises his head as you approach. His face is a mask of grief and "
"desperation.{/n} \"Why did you come here, {name}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근 할 때 트리스티안은 머리를 듭니다. 그의 얼굴은 슬픔과 절망의 서려있습니다.{/n} \"너는 여기에 왜 왔어 "
"{name}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "6652ea75-ff33-467c-81ab-e9e2c7f54697"
msgid ""
"{n}The cleric averts his eyes.{/n} \"This is no answer to my question. Why? "
"To kill me? To try and make things right? It's too late, {name} — there's "
"nothing you can change. Just as I couldn't.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 그의 눈을 피합니다.{/n} \"이것은 내 질문에 대한 대답이 아니야. 왜? 나를 죽이려고? 어긋난 일을 고치려고 노력하는 "
"것인가? 너무 늦었어 {name}. 네가 바꿀 수 있는 건 없어. 내가 할 수 없는 것처럼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2ac1ea4a-ef6d-48e5-b71c-6ababff74bb2"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's face turns grey.{/n} \"No.\" {n}He gulps and shakes his "
"head.{/n} \"The Oculus of {g|Abaddon}Abaddon{/g} is an evil artifact, "
"capable of revealing what is hidden. I would destroy it once and for all. "
"But I... I can't do it. My mistress demands it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 얼굴이 회색으로 변합니다.{/n} \"아니.\" {n}그는 머리를 흔들고 침을 삼킵니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Abaddon}나락{/g} 의 눈은 숨겨진 것을 밝힐 수 있는 사악한 유물이야. 나는 그것을 한번에 완전히 파괴 할 거야. "
"하지만... 나는 할 수 없어. 내 여주인이 거부했으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ef69628b-7028-4f63-8b21-60a541e745f9"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, {name}. The force that has enslaved me will do the same to "
"you. I've already put you in terrible danger, and I won't let you suffer any "
"longer. Save yourself and those you hold dear — forget me, forget the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"용서 해줘 {name}. 나를 노예로 만든 힘은 너에게도 똑같이 적용할 거야. 나는 이미 너를 끔찍한 위험에 빠뜨렸고 나는 너를 더 "
"이상 괴롭히지 않을 거야. 너와 네가 사랑하는 사람들을 구해라. 나와 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 잊어 버리고. 잘 "
"가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "95727527-594f-4083-ad47-132465a4eb76"
msgid ""
"{n}A slight smile lightens Tristian's face.{/n} \"Curious, as always. Was it "
"that that brought you to the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} in the first "
"place? And to the {g|Temple of the Elk}Temple of the Elk{/g}, where we first "
"met?\" {n}His smile fades.{/n} \"If so, your curiosity leads you to your "
"death.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}약간의 미소가 트리스티안의 얼굴을 밝게합니다.{/n} \"언제나 처럼 호기심이 많군. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}"
"에 처음 왔을 때부터 그랬어? 그리고 {g|Temple of the Elk} 엘크의 신전{/g}에서 우리가 처음 만났을 때부터? \" "
"{n}그의 미소가 사라집니다.{/n} \"그렇다면 호기심이 너를 죽음으로 인도할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2686a5b8-8647-432b-9416-d19261eb6c3a"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian recoils, as if struck.{/n} \"You are right. I am a traitor. I "
"don't expect forgiveness or understanding from you, but trust me — if I had "
"a chance to change what happened, I would. But I can't. I can't stop now, "
"and I can't look into your eyes.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 마치 강타 당한 듯 흠칫 놀랍니다.{/n} \"네가 맞아. 나는 배신자야. 너에게 용서와 이해를 기대하지는 않지만 나를 "
"믿어. 내가 일어난 일을 바꿀 기회가 있다면 그럴 거야. 하지만 나는 그럴 수 없어. 나는 지금 멈출 수 없어. 나는 네 눈을 들여다 볼 "
"수 없어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "77fcb7ca-1711-4c60-a205-864a918f1832"
msgid ""
"\"No, I beg you, {name}… hold your weapons still. I have one thing I must "
"finish first. Please... stop following me. The powers you seek to confront "
"are too great — you can't hope to defeat them. Save yourself and take those "
"you hold dear and flee the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니 나는 너에게 간청할게 {name}... 무기를 계속 잡아라. 나는 먼저 해야 할 일이 있어. 제발 .. 날 따라오지 마. 네가 "
"직면하고자 하는 힘이 너무 커 - 그들을 물리 칠 수는 없어. 네가 사랑하는 사람들을 데리고 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 "
"땅{/g}을 떠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5130e551-2629-48ec-9c88-815e7006d556"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"No. You don't need to know that, {name}. "
"Neither you nor any mortal can confront the one that controls me. Your only "
"chance to survive is if flee now, and leave the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g} behind. This is all I can do for you now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"아니. 그것을 알 필요가 없어 {name}. 당신이나 어떤 필멸자도 나를 통제하는 사람과 "
"마주 치지 못해. 도망 가려면 생존 할 수 있는 유일한 기회는 지금이야. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 떠나. 이것이 "
"내가 지금 너를 위해 할 수 있는 전부야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "21c94a8e-e0ea-4e39-a7a3-2f72fd983d6c"
msgid ""
"\"You've always put your trust in me, {name}. And I repaid you with "
"betrayal. I beg your forgiveness, though my actions are unforgivable. Return "
"home. Or better, do not return... flee the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. "
"Don't let the power that enslaved me destroy you and those you hold dear.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 항상 나를 신뢰했지 {name}. 그리고 나는 배신으로 갚았어. 내 행동은 용서할 수 없지만 용서를 구할게. 집으로 돌아가. "
"괜찮다면 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g} 떠나서 돌아오지 마... 피한다. . 나를 노예로 만든 힘이 너와 너를 소중히 "
"여기는 사람을 파멸시키게 하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ebf973ee-a23d-44e4-959a-1b7507af32f1"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head — a gesture of either denial or regret.{/n} "
"\"Forgive me. I've caused you great trouble, so let me give you the only "
"thing I can still give — my advice. Forget the Oculus. Stop chasing me. "
"Better, flee the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. Save yourself and those "
"you still can.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 거절 혹은 후회하는 듯 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"용서해. 너에게 큰 곤경을 일으켰어. 내가 줄 수 있는 유일한 것은 "
"충고야. Abaddon의 눈은 잊어 버려. 나를 쫓지 말고. 괜찮다면 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 떠나. 너 자신과 "
"아직 구할 수 있는 사람들을 구해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "37d631e7-c232-4355-933e-95ec4b82d2a7"
msgid ""
"{n}Deathly pale, Tristian opens his mouth to answer, but pauses, then gives "
"a heavy sigh.{/n} \"There is no answer for what I did, {name}. I shall carry "
"this weight until the end of my life. Perhaps...\" {n}Tristian raises his "
"head in alert.{/n} \"Perhaps there is still a chance to change one last "
"thing...\" {n}Tristian's face collapses and becomes downcast.{/n} \"No. I'm "
"only lying to myself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}얼굴에 치명적인 창백함이 서린 트리스티안은 입을 열어 대답하지만 잠시 멈추고 무거운 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"내가 한 것에 대한 "
"해답이 없어 {name}. 나는 이 생애가 끝날 때까지 이 무게를 질 거야. 어쩌면...\" {n}트리스티안은 머리를 번쩍 듭니다.{/n}"
" \"아마도 마지막 한 가지를 바꿀 수 있는 기회가 남아있을 거야...\" {n}트리스티안의 얼굴이 일그러져 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} "
"\"아니 거짓말일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "51656822-496a-45c0-b060-123775c1bf82"
msgid "\"Forgive me, {name}... Please forgive me.\""
msgstr "\"용서해줘 {name}... 제발 용서해줘. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5046e52b-d85a-469c-af00-35c43cc3f1bc"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian drops his head.{/n} \"An apostate and a weakling. Betrayer of "
"everything that is pure. I'm nothing… no. I'm, less than nothing, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"변절자 한 사람과 약한 사람. 순수한 모든 것을 배반 한 사람은 나야. 나는 아무것도 "
"아니야... 쓸모 없는 놈은 나야 {name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9b30d6a0-b90b-40b4-8455-67d698671ba4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian freezes. A shadow of a smile appears on his face.{/n} \"I... I'm "
"so happy to hear your voice again... even if it's for the last time.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 얼었습니다. 그의 얼굴에는 미소가 그늘집니다.{/n} \"나는... 네 목소리를 다시 듣게 되어 너무 행복하다... "
"마지막일지라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "30812dd1-d41a-44e0-aae3-cfbfad053b81"
msgid ""
"\"Look how our quiet priest is talking. Like it's not us who came to ask for "
"an answer for his treason, but he is.\""
msgstr "\"조용한 사제가 어떻게 이야기하는지 보자. 우리는 반역에 대한 답변을 구하러 온 것 같지 않아 보여도 그는 반역자야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "203a4f35-c683-4586-bd60-235178f7f94d"
msgid ""
"\"Who do I see in front of me? A friend who made a mistake or an enemy, "
"slipping on a mask of a friend?\""
msgstr "\"내 앞에 있는 게 누구지? 친구의 가면을 벗어 실수를 저지른 바보였나? 아니면 적이었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7d6a571a-bea2-45f3-a625-b17ba42e00b8"
msgid ""
"\"Please, Tristian, tell us the truth! I don't want to believe that you "
"deceived us from the very beginning, just waiting for a moment to strike us "
"in the back!\""
msgstr "\"제발 트리스티안 진실을 말해줘! 나는 처음부터 네가 뒤에서 공격 할 순간을 기다리며 우리를 속였다고 믿고 싶지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "a3f07add-b739-4789-9cf6-b71091ba3580"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, boy-priest, how about a bit of public penance? You owe us at least an "
"hour's show, full of tears and stories about how you didn't want to do it, "
"weren't going to, and how you're really not guilty at all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐 애송이 사제. 고행을 한번 다녀오는 게 어때? 한 시간 동안 하고 싶지 않아했다고 죄가 없다고 질질 짜느라 우리가 얼마나 "
"고생했는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/AngelCandlemere/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "97853377-3635-4c8b-85df-a2e9207a3ff4"
msgid ""
"\"I've seen do-gooders doing bad things often enough. It shouldn't surprise "
"me, but still I look at you and I don't understand. Why, Tristian? Why did "
"you betray us? Why are you running from us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 착한 이들의 가면을 쓰고 나쁜 짓을 하는 녀석들을 많이 봐왔지. 놀랍지도 않지만 여전히 나는 이해가 가지 않는군. 왜 그랬지 "
"트리스티안? 왜 우리를 배신한 거야? 왜 우리에게서 도망갔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/Barks/Enviroment_01_String
msgctxt "3547c8e5-cdaf-4d68-844b-9d372bfb26ff"
msgid "Huge claw prints lie in the dirt."
msgstr "거대한 발톱 자국이 흙에 나 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/Barks/Enviroment_02_String
msgctxt "66cd65fa-88f6-44a7-a4cf-b35cd5f6a7a1"
msgid ""
"These tree branches are broken — it looks like something big smashed through "
"here."
msgstr "이 나무가지들은 부서졌는데 큰 무언가가 여기를 밟고 지나간 것처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/Barks/Portal_String
msgctxt "aeec66a4-7353-4fa1-889a-2a428326f13b"
msgid ""
"As you approach, the portal starts to close. The last thing you see on the "
"other side is a tall statue with a stag's head, with ancient stairs visible "
"behind it."
msgstr "당신이 접근하면서 포털이 닫힙니다. 다른 쪽에서 마지막으로 보이는 것은 고대 계단 너머 수사슴 머리를 한 큰 동상입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/Barks/Rismel_evil_String
msgctxt "7ec9ec01-9209-4198-90d8-9f9e899f1381"
msgid ""
"\"Kneel, worm! The herald of Nethys will smite those who won't submit to the "
"great god!\""
msgstr "\"무릎 꿇어라 벌레! Nethys의 전령이 위대한 신에게 복종하지 않을 자들을 벌하리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/Barks/Rismel_good_after_String
msgctxt "a0f00407-cd77-40a0-83af-b3256bb25034"
msgid "\"We've repelled the attack. Thank you — you've saved my life again.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 공격을 격퇴했어. 고마워. 너는 내 목숨을 다시 구했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/CandlemereTower/Barks/Rismel_good_combat_String
msgctxt "8ecc0450-360c-4015-b05b-541cf9706d1b"
msgid "\"The portal has opened again! Help me!\""
msgstr "\"포털이 다시 열렸어! 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/Barks/LinxiaEscapes_String
msgctxt "0ab12cf3-b1d9-40ef-837d-f8a7a6570907"
msgid "\"Damn! This is not the end! Hellknights, cover my back!\""
msgstr "\"젠장! 아직 끝나지 않았어! 헬나이트여, 나를 엄호하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "cbc5e2ff-de06-437e-8f80-8ca095c9fbea"
msgid "\"I don't need your money!\""
msgstr "\"네 돈은 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b229f191-c490-4d8f-8d00-4b12dd7f46ed"
msgid "\"You set me up! Now Linxia thinks we're accomplices!\""
msgstr "\"나를 속였군! 이제 린시아는 우리가 공범이라고 생각할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "6c14796a-6919-48e5-ab7b-b6cc3acf49eb"
msgid "\"Linxia was right about you. You belong on the rack!\""
msgstr "\"린시아가 옳았어. 너는 형틀에 묶어야 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f8f34298-6e1b-48b8-a3e3-345af44daf33"
msgid ""
"\"Get out of my {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom} at once! — And don't let "
"me catch you around here again!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}에서 당장 나가라. 다시 여기에서 내가 너를 붙잡아 두게 하지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "cf5f2077-5150-4cc9-9f76-396313f6d5e2"
msgid "[Attack] \"Death to the traitor!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"반역자에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "47a7c0cb-7ff2-4131-a8e1-17a9ed309a6a"
msgid "\"Explain yourself then. I'm listening.\""
msgstr "\"변명해 봐. 들어나 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "6c20dbf4-4c05-4b7b-8bee-41b318f1a90e"
msgid "\"Tell me once again about your deal with Mammon.\""
msgstr "\"마몬과의 거래에 대해 다시 한번 말해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "53ee1335-7e54-4f28-adb2-bdd9f47a361c"
msgid "\"Remind me — how did you make a pact with Mammon?\""
msgstr "\"잘 말해봐. 어떻게 마몬과 계약을 맺었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "e1d91269-cb80-44bd-855d-e2b40d8ee270"
msgid "\"I've heard enough.\""
msgstr "\"충분히 들었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "ea28e9cf-6393-4abb-bb8c-0071ba2cf579"
msgid "\"What was the point of your pact with Mammon?\""
msgstr "\"마몬과의 계약 내용은 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "05f719bd-d3eb-4976-968e-ca4d1fb79a34"
msgid "\"So, this means you want to become a king?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 이건 네가 왕이 되고 싶다는 것을 의미하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0031_Text_String
msgctxt "192805f1-4c7c-4b22-9353-a8921de4c116"
msgid "\"What do you want from me?\""
msgstr "\"나한테 원하는 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "f5fd87cd-adb6-4576-a5e6-b6affe191b73"
msgid "\"I'll take your deal.\""
msgstr "\"너의 일을 맡지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "92b5fe53-6d76-459d-b950-5afad8c8a7c6"
msgid "\"I don't care to help you. You're on your own.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 돕지 않을 거야. 네 몫은 네가 알아서 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "023474ca-6246-4be6-b6e2-5f137bd0c312"
msgid "\"What amount of 'gratitude' can I expect?\""
msgstr "\"내가 어느 정도의 '감사'를 기대할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4b35fcc6-1449-41c7-a26e-e9e0c4c4fd00"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Darven}Darven{/d} turns to you and graces you with a shining smile.{/n}"
" \"I thank you for your help! Without you, I'd never have been able to deal "
"with this fanatic. I hope you'll forgive me for the little show I took the "
"liberty of putting on? After all, the results weren't bad, wouldn't you "
"agree?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|darven}다르벤{/d}은 몸을 돌려 빛나는 미소로 당신에게 인사합니다.{/n} \"너의 도움에 감사를 표하지! 너가 "
"없었다면 나는 결코 이 광신도들을 쓰러뜨리지 못했을 거야. 방금 전에 찬물을 끼얹은 건 사과할게. 놀랬지? 어쨌든, 결과는 나쁘지 않네. "
"그렇지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "b8a8b104-0671-46b5-bc42-9cc299a81ed1"
msgid ""
"\"But it's yours.\" {n}Darven shrugs dismissively.{/n} \"Give it to the "
"poor, throw it away, or dump it in the river if you really can't be bothered."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 이건 네거야.\" {n}다르벤은 오만하게 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"진짜 귀찮은 게 싫다면 가난한 사람들에게 줘 버리거나 "
"강에 버려.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "1e5c54ae-2a89-46f7-a1af-b7be3aefda84"
msgid ""
"\"I regret if I've caused you any discomfort. I hope that the sound of "
"golden coins jingling in your purse will help you forget this unfortunate "
"episode.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신에게 불편함을 느끼게 했다면 미안해. 당신의 지갑에서 금화 소리가 울려 퍼지면 그 불행한 일을 잊을 수 있기를 바라지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "af82d2fd-1607-40e4-920a-deb3ab31e99b"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven sighs.{/n} \"Things are unfolding in a most regrettable way. I "
"should have offered {mf|him|her} more money…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}다르벤은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"상황이 가장 유감스럽게 전개되고 있습니다. {mf|그|그녀}에게 더 많은 돈을 드렸어야 했는데…"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "d4ea92a9-2fe5-410a-a673-6289f3cd77ef"
msgid ""
"\"Anyhow, it seems I owe you an explanation. — Again! That's beginning to "
"become a habit! Ah, but before I forget, please accept this modest reward. "
"You've earned every bit of it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어쨌든 다시 한번 당신에게 설명해 줘야겠네. 또! 습관이 되겠구만. 아 하지만 잊기 전에 이 작은 선물을 받아줘. 넌 받을 자격이 "
"있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "eda0c1c4-c4c1-4720-b98d-6400c76d578b"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven laughs in reply, but his eyes glint with caution.{/n} \"The rack "
"has been waiting for me for a long time. Sadly, I'm just too busy to waste "
"my time on it. Besides, to tell you the truth, the rack is not my type of a "
"date.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}다르벤은 대답대신 웃습니다. 그러나 그의 눈은 주의를 기울입니다.{/n} \"선반은 오랫동안 나를 떠나고 있었습니다. 슬프게도 나는 "
"너무 바빠서 내 시간을 낭비 할 수 없습니다. 한편 진실을 말하자면 선반은 내 취향이 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6b69e792-b324-4959-b00d-a9b24220b2dc"
msgid ""
"{n}Then, all of a sudden, Darven's voice grows serious.{/n} \"If by any "
"chance you decide to... facilitate my meeting with this missus — then you'll "
"fail. I'll escape again. So let's just talk instead, without threats. Like "
"civilized people.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}갑자기 다르벤의 목소리가 진지해집니다.{/n} \"어떤 기회에 당신이...나를 이 부양관과 만나게 결심했다면 당신은 실패 할 "
"것입니다. 나는 다시 도망 갈 것입니다. 그러니 대신 문명인들처럼 위협 없이 대화를 나누지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "855ae488-72ec-4dd4-9edd-82eeec2b4fcc"
msgid ""
"\"You do remember the whole story I told you earlier, right? About the duel "
"with the {g|Cheliax}Chelish{/g} noble and the rebellion which followed his "
"death? You see, that whole story has one little additional piece.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 전에 해줬던 이야기를 기억해? {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g}귀족의 죽음으로 일어난 반란 이야기를? 보시다시피 이 이야기에는 "
"한 조각이 더 빠져 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "3a707fb1-8934-4c70-838e-b2daf3259601"
msgid ""
"\"Well, not so little, to be precise.\" {n}Darven grins.{/n} \"His name is "
"{g|Mammon}Mammon{/g}, and he's one of the Archdevils — 'the Ardent Prince', "
"or so I've been told. He's made a pact with me, and I'm having trouble "
"upholding my side of the bargain. — And his patience is growing thinner by "
"the day.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐, 그렇게 거창한 이야기는 아니야.\" {n}다르벤이 웃습니다.{/n} \"{g|Mammon}마몬{/g}이라는 데블은 고위데몬 중 "
"하나야. - '열정의 왕자'라는 별명이 있지. 내가 계약을 맺은 데블인데, 지금 그 계약이 꽤나 아슬아슬한 상황이야. 그래서 마몬의 "
"인내심이 한계에 가까워지고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "a2cc2c4e-bba8-4a9c-8644-02a079bd88c7"
msgid ""
"\"That {g|Cheliax}Chelish{/g} noble had a pact with {g|Mammon}Mammon{/g} too "
"— which I expect is commonplace for the Chelish nobility. And the noble was "
"in no hurry to fulfill his end of the deal, either. By killing him, I earned "
"Mammon's gratitude, and he offered me a similar pact. A handsome sum of "
"gold, and my cherished dream come true — that's what he promised. So how "
"could I say no?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g} 귀족도 {g|Mammon}마몬{/g}과 계약을 맺었어 나는 첼리악스 귀족들에게는 흔한 일인가 "
"봐. 계약을 빨리 끝내려고도 하지 않는 그 귀족한테 마몬은 넌더리가 났는지, 내가 놈을 죽이니까 감사를 표하더라고. 그렇게 놈이랑 같은 "
"계약을 맺게 된 거지. 엄청난 부와 내가 꿈꾸던 것을 이루어준다고 하더라고. 이런데 내가 어떻게 거절을 할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "f21cac30-2438-4cef-a099-446ea87fe51c"
msgid "\"With pleasure!\""
msgstr "\"기쁘군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "cc2bfe78-d9cd-44f8-be30-207f01ab266b"
msgid "\"So what do you say? Will you accept my offer?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 대답은? 내 제안을 받아 들일 수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "d67b0855-20f0-4687-ac85-dd46bf8bec13"
msgid ""
"\"I'm to become a king. No more, no less.\" {n}Darven grins, but this time "
"his grin is joyless.{/n} \"The subjects of my kingdom are supposed to "
"worship {g|Mammon}Mammon{/g} as their official deity, and pay taxes to his "
"temples.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 왕이 된다고. {n}다르벤은 웃습니다. 그러나 이번에는 그의 미소는 기쁨이 아닙니다.{/n} \"나의 왕국의 백성들은 "
"{g|Mammon}마몬{/g}을 공식적인 신으로 숭배하고 마몬의 사원에 세금을 내야한다고. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "5a0cc222-2c5a-4a39-be53-7dd4ae745257"
msgid ""
"\"It's not so difficult a task, I suppose — especially if you have enough "
"money. The only problem is Linxia. The moment I lay my kingdom's first "
"cornerstone, I'll become an easy target. She'll instantly find me and "
"promptly introduce me to all her torture devices.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어려운 일은 아니야. 특히 돈이 충분하다면 말이지. 문제는 린시아야. 내가 왕국의 첫 초석을 놓을 때 나는 취약해지지. 그 년이 즉시 "
"나를 찾아서 온갖 고문을 할 거라는 사실은 불보듯 뻔했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "c16199d9-a99b-4d1a-8981-0e9eb08dd7e4"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes. It was my dream ever since I was sailing the {g|Inner Sea}Inner "
"Sea{/g} as a part of the {g|Taldor}Taldorian{/g} merchant fleet. I even came "
"up with a name for my kingdom — Brineheart. Ah, fond memories of those "
"careless times, when I had neither crazy zealots nor offended Archdevil "
"chasing me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그래. 내가 {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}의 상인 함대에 올라타 {g|Inner Sea}내해{/g}를 항해하고 나서 부터 "
"꿈이었지. 심지어 내 왕국 이름을 브라인하트라고 지을 생각도 했다니까. 아, 그 천진난만하던 시절이 그리워. 왠 미치광이 광신도랑 분노한 "
"아크데블이 나를 쫓을 줄이야 누가 상상이나 했겠어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "f5c7c36d-bf73-4655-afb1-c837d0f441a9"
msgid ""
"\"However, I fear that soon I'll have to take the risk and establish my "
"kingdom nevertheless. {g|Mammon}Mammon{/g} is growing restless. And in the "
"end I'd rather risk facing Linxia than challenge him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 나는 곧 위험을 감수해 내 왕국을 건설해야 한다는 것을 두려워졌어. {g|Mammon}마몬{/g}은 미친듯이 성장하고 있었어. "
"그리고 결국 나는 그에게 맞서기보다 린시아와 싸우는 게 낫겠다 생각한 거지."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0032_Text_String
msgctxt "f391eb54-0777-4e80-9334-c96432407b22"
msgid ""
"\"Help me get rid of Linxia. Once and for all. Of course, your help will be "
"amply rewarded. I can be very grateful.\""
msgstr "\"린시아를 없애도록 도와줘. 물론 그에 마땅한 보상을 줄게. 도와준다면 엄청 고마울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "62415232-625d-47d8-9ad8-2d0e57eabc92"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven's habitual grin grows sad.{/n} \"Unfortunately, you can't just "
"retreat from all this. I have an obligation to establish a kingdom, so that "
"is what I must do. I have nowhere to run. After I make my whereabouts known, "
"Linxia will come for me. This is inevitable.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}다르벤의 평범한 미소는 점점 슬픔으로 변합니다.{/n} \"유감스럽게도 이 모든 것들로부터 퇴각 할 수는 없습니다. 나는 왕국을 "
"세울 의무가 있으므로 해야 할 일을 해야 합니다. 나는 도망 칠 곳이 없습니다. 나의 행방을 알게 된 후 린시아가 나를 찾아올 것입니다. "
"불가피하지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "f79d8ba6-144d-4034-99be-accea5a76257"
msgid ""
"\"The only open question is — what role will you play in our confrontation. "
"I suppose all I can do about that is to wait and see. Until then — farewell."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"유일한 미결 문제는 당신이 우리의 대결에서 어떤 역할을 할 것인가 입니다. 내가 할 수 있는 모든 일은 결론을 기다려야 한다는 "
"것입니다. 그때까지는 잘 지내십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "466a7230-6b5f-495d-a813-af6467a17816"
msgid ""
"\"Excellent! In that case I'll establish my capital immediately. It will be "
"a thriving trading hub, and its king will count himself in your debt. You "
"won't be disappointed, you have my word on that. And I always keep my "
"promises.\""
msgstr ""
"\"훌륭해! 그럴 경우 나는 즉시 수도 건설에 착수할게. 수도는 번성하는 무역의 허브가 될 거고 왕인 이 몸은 너에게 빚을 졌네. "
"실망하지 않을 거야. 약속해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "53f18a25-b133-4cb3-b49a-f06b17f0eb1c"
msgid ""
"\"I hope same can be said about you.\" {n}Darven smiles disarmingly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"너도 나를 실망 안 시켰으면 좋겠네.\" {n}다르벤은 순수하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "46c94292-8c2a-415f-bfa9-a3352df31aea"
msgid ""
"\"My finances are growing thin. I'm afraid I can't afford to offer you more "
"than 10000 gold coins.\" {n}Darven's smile looks guilty.{/n} \"But in "
"addition, I offer good neighborly relations and common trade routes "
"established between our two countries.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 재정은 점점 줄고 있어. 나는 10000 금화를 제공 할 여유가 없다고.\" {n}다르벤의 미소가 죄책감으로 보입니다.{/n} "
"\"하지만 우리 두 나라 사이의 굳건한 동맹과 무역을 약속하지\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b70b1d21-4482-47d8-98f0-7695ceb98622"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie folds her hands across her chest.{/n} \"I cannot say which is "
"worse — the lies and manipulation, or the sincere belief that the righteous "
"wrath they caused can be bought off!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 손을 교차해 가슴에 포갭니다.{/n} \"나는 거짓말과 조작 또는 그들이 야기한 의로운 진노가 매수 될 수 있다는 확신 중 "
"어느 것이 더 나쁜지 모르겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d3b87636-fc72-425c-8fbf-529734cf119d"
msgid ""
"\"You shouldn't swing your purse around like that, handsome. What's keeping "
"us from just taking you out first in the name of good and just robbing you? "
"It'd be a bitter misunderstanding, indeed!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 식으로 돈을 쓰면 안됩니다. 선의 이름으로 당신을 먼저 꺼내는 것과 당신을 강탈하는 것을 막는 것이 무엇일까요? 정말로 "
"오해였습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "96c8e176-84d0-4abf-9c2e-a9c3b0602ce0"
msgid ""
"\"Such a beautiful story! And the name! It reminds me of my favorite pirate "
"books! Oh, so many stories are swarming in my head...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 아름다운 이야기가 있을까요! 그리고 그 이름도요! 내가 좋아하는 해적 이야기 책을 생각나게 하는군요! 너무 많은 이야기들이 내 "
"머리 속에서 떠오르고 있어요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "80d6e16b-9b96-47c0-a8c7-add05fd2e80b"
msgid ""
"\"Considering the questionable motives of honorable Darven, here, I would "
"typically advise you to decline. But then, considering the personality of "
"his adversary, I would recommend you agree! No organization in the world "
"does more harm than the {g|Order of the Rack}Order of the Rack{/g}. And I'm "
"not even saying this just because they've targeted my treatises for years..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"존경스러운 다르벤의 의심스러운 동기를 고려할 때 나는 일반적으로 당신에게 거절을 권고합니다. 하지만 적의 성격을 고려할 때 나는 "
"당신이 동의하는 것이 좋겠습니다. {g|Order of the Rack}형벌 기사단{/g}보다 세상에 해를 끼치는 조직은 없지요. 그리고 "
"저는 그들이 저의 논문을 몇 년 동안 표적으로 삼았기 때문에 이것을 말하는 것이 아닙니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e94ff1a9-4b1c-4f30-ac11-c88e5cf0a76c"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia laughs musically.{/n} \"How romantic! I would be curious to see "
"Brineheart, if you're ever lucky enough to turn it from dream into reality..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 감미롭게 웃습니다.{/n} \"어쩜 이리 낭만적일까! 네 꿈이 현실로 이루어진다면 나도 브라이언하트라는 나라를 보고 "
"싶네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/DarvenAfterFight/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "fc207042-23e9-4c05-ad89-a3e614b02c56"
msgid ""
"\"Give them to me. Nok-Nok knows what do with them. No tell you — don't ask."
"\""
msgstr "\"나에게 넘겨. 녹-녹은 그들 자신에게 무엇을 하는지 알고 있어. 말하지도 말고 묻지도 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0b84379e-edef-43d0-b392-afbaa07fb8b3"
msgid "\"Tell me more about the investigation.\""
msgstr "\"알아낸 것을 더 얘기해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ada13e75-4f50-4df4-aad3-9e6816a0a305"
msgid "Told Linxia the truth."
msgstr "린시아에게 진실을 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0006_Text_String
msgctxt "96ec97aa-3cbc-4c3d-9e91-74b1086c6ec4"
msgid "\"Darven told me where to look for you.\""
msgstr "\"다르벤은 당신을 찾을 곳을 말했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "30b50d06-29e8-4eca-93f7-dc73518d2103"
msgid "Attempted to lie to Linxia."
msgstr "린시아에게 거짓말을 시도합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "94af6837-5fe8-4b73-a820-e133a023d059"
msgid "\"I stumbled across this place by pure chance.\""
msgstr "\"나는 돌아다니다 이 곳을 우연히 발견했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "a9232242-342f-4f6d-a7b1-c40453c07cc0"
msgid "\"I don't have to explain anything to you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신에게 아무것도 설명할 필요가 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "9b7a00f3-881d-4186-b9fe-cdf09c52695c"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f9a17309-7e68-4248-ae7a-433098d00819"
msgid "Attempted to lie to Linxia."
msgstr "린시아에게 거짓말을 시도합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a26f16d5-1b53-48f6-b9bc-21dc357f52f9"
msgid "\"He asked me to get rid of you.\""
msgstr "\"그는 나에게 당신을 없애달라고 부탁했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "f2249b02-a285-4e92-9501-1dcc4e7649f8"
msgid ""
"\"He asked me to get rid of you. I lied to him and said I'd try to help.\""
msgstr "\"그는 나에게 당신을 없애달라고 부탁했어. 나는 돕겠다고 거짓말했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "012edad5-76d5-44b2-96ba-3fa6fc15e16e"
msgid "\"He asked me to get rid of you. I chased him away.\""
msgstr "\"그는 나에게 당신을 없애달라고 부탁했어. 나는 그를 쫓아내었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "a9887253-bff3-48ae-a198-b444ff6febd9"
msgid ""
"\"He asked me to get rid of you. I attacked him but he managed to flee.\""
msgstr "\"그는 나에게 당신을 없애달라고 부탁했어. 하지만 그는 도망갔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "6bc81fa6-1a3a-4dfa-96a8-99f3d4873d18"
msgid ""
"\"Darven is a dangerous and cunning opponent. You've been chasing him for "
"many years, and still you've failed to capture him. You shouldn't "
"underestimate him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다르벤은 위험하고 교활한 상대야. 당신은 수년 동안 그를 쫓아 왔지만 여전히 그를 잡아 내지 못했지. 그를 과소 평가해서는 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "acaeb0a2-5f2b-40bc-96f6-9893e2ec00b3"
msgid ""
"\"He spoke with me through an illusion. I didn't stand a chance of catching "
"him.\""
msgstr "\"그는 교활하게 말했어. 나는 그를 붙잡을 기회가 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "a2c329d3-f492-4457-b114-c8ba6238bcd1"
msgid "\"Hold your tongue, Linxia. Remember who are you speaking to.\""
msgstr "\"말조심 해 린시아. 당신이 누구와 이야기하는지 기억하라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c584a91d-be0f-4ea3-bc68-6fa4b036b80b"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}? It's such a pleasure to see you here.\" "
"{n}{d|Linxia}Linxia's{/d} voice is emotionless as ever.{/n} \"The "
"investigation is well underway. We'll soon find Darven. But I would like to "
"know — how did you find this place?\""
msgstr ""
"\" {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}? 여기에서 당신을 만나게 되어 정말 기쁘군.\" {n}{d|린시아}린시아{/d}의 목소리는 언제나 "
"처럼 감정이 없습니다.{/n} \"수소문을 하고 있어. 곧 다르벤을 만날 테지. 하지만 나는 어떻게 네가 이 장소를 찾았는지 알고 싶어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f2adaced-e6fe-4eb8-8b15-390f92982b8a"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Baron|Baroness|King|Queen}? How did you get here? Who told you about "
"this place? {d|Linxia}I{/d} demand answers!\""
msgstr "\" {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}? 어떻게 여기에 왔지? 누가 이 장소에 대해 말했어? 어서 대답해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "c6e72528-ca62-4d10-b2ba-6080ad679cf6"
msgid ""
"{n}Linxia shrugs.{/n} \"We've interrogated the capital's population, but no "
"one proved to have any solid clues. Now we move our investigation to the "
"neighboring villages. I'll find Darven, whatever it takes. Today, tomorrow, "
"in a week, or in a year. He won't escape me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린시아 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"우리는 수도의 사람들을 심문했지만 아무도 단서가 없다는 것을 증명했어. 이제 조사를 이웃 "
"마을로 옮길 거야. 다르벤을 무슨 수를 써서라도 찾을 테야. 하루 일주일 또는 일년이 걸리더라도. 그는 도망가지 못해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "84c5a055-670d-46b5-be19-08a8549decbe"
msgid "\"But you never answered my question. How did you get here?\""
msgstr "\"하지만 내 질문에는 결코 대답하지 않았어. 어떻게 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "1c8ebf70-5ce2-4b7d-975f-13ba4c4d7a1a"
msgid ""
"\"What?!\" {n}Linxia's hand twitches towards her sword, and freezes at its "
"hilt.{/n} \"How did this happen? When? Where is he now?\""
msgstr "\"뭐?!\" {n}린시아의 손이 검을 향하고 칼자루에 붙는다.{/n} \"어떻게 된거야? 언제? 지금 그는 어디 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "794fd414-6f19-452b-a83e-590d0d33de88"
msgid ""
"{n}Linxia takes a deep breath and regains her self control.{/n} \"That is... "
"true. I ask you to forgive my reckless words.\""
msgstr "{n}린시아는 심호흡하고 그녀의 자기를 통제합니다.{/n} \"그건 사실이야. 너에게 내 무모한 말을 한 나를 용서하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "9cc48943-cf27-4cdb-85d0-f9762fcf60f2"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not so easy to deceive, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}.\" {n}Linxia "
"glares at you with narrowed eyes.{/n} \"I don't believe you. I strongly "
"recommend you tell me the truth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 기만하기가 쉽지 않아. {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}.\" {n}린시아는 작은 눈으로 당신을 뚫어지게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"나는"
" 너를 믿지 않아. 진실을 말해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "521c69cd-fb31-4a8f-9161-233cd0538676"
msgid ""
"\"Not this time. The interests of the {g|Order of the Rack}Order of the "
"Rack{/g} demand a straight answer to my question. And I will have it — the "
"easy way or the hard way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이번엔 아니야. {g|Order of the Rack}형벌 기사단{/g}은 내 질문에 대한 직접적인 대답을 요구해. 그리고 나는 "
"그것을 어떻게든 얻을 것이고. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "6c800933-d240-4685-8b08-5cfdff4b58e3"
msgid ""
"{n}Linxia grabs her sword.{/n} \"Oh no. You won't avoid the question so "
"easily. {g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}! To battle!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린시아는 칼을 움켜잡습니다.{/n} \"아니. 내 질문을 그렇게 쉽게 피하지는 못해. {g|Hellknights}헬나이트{/g}! "
"전투준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "38bf0dcd-f283-4069-8823-84f09c753993"
msgid ""
"\"Great job, my friend! I doubt anyone else could have managed to distract "
"Linxia for so long. Now all that's left is to finish her off.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘했어, 친구! 그 누구도 린시아의 경계를 산만하게 만들 수는 없을 거라 생각했었는데. 이제 이 년을 끝장내는 것만 남았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "5e18d289-9e65-4259-8baa-cfa3549086ad"
msgid ""
"\"You should have executed the criminal, not engaged him in conversation! It "
"was your duty as the ruler of these lands! Or do you have something to hide? "
"I think I'll just have to sort it out personally. "
"{g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}! To battle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 범죄자를 처형하고 그가 대화에 참여하지 않도록 해야 했어! 그것은 이 땅의 통치자로서의 의무였어! 아니면 뭔가 숨기는 것이 "
"있나? 그냥 내가 직접 널 처리해 주지. {g|Hellknights}헬나이트{/g}여! 전투준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "d47b7d93-3c0a-4632-a26f-cbc372b39437"
msgid ""
"\"So you lied to him, promising your help, and then you just let him go? Why "
"didn't you kill him when you had the chance? If you truly stood firmly on "
"the side of the law, Darven would be dead by now!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그에게 도움을 약속하는 거짓말을 하고 그 사람을 풀어 줬어? 기회가 있을 때 그를 죽이지 않은 이유는 무엇이지? 당신이 진정으로 법의 "
"편에 서 있으면 지금 다르벤은 죽었을 테지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "726a823e-e93c-473d-bce0-c010b3c65cba"
msgid ""
"\"Half-measures! The law demands criminals be punished, not chased off! I'm "
"starting to doubt which side you're really on.\""
msgstr "\"어중간하게 일을 처리했군! 법은 범죄자들을 쫓지 말고 처벌해야 한다! 나는 당신이 정말로 어느 편인지 의심하기 시작했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "b8578175-f7b1-4852-8f5c-912e0fc8b76a"
msgid ""
"{n}Barely hidden contempt glints in Linxia's eyes.{/n} \"So, he escaped. As "
"might be expected from the ruler of such a backward country. With all due "
"respect.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린시아의 눈에는 간신히 숨겨진 경멸이 반짝입니다.{/n} \"그래서 그는 도망 쳤군. 그런 후진국의 통치자가 하는 일이 뻔하지. "
"형편없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "bbaa08f5-9d1d-4a62-95e1-f233f3bef15b"
msgid ""
"\"So, you just fell for a primitive trick? It would seem that even an infant "
"could fool you with ease.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 허접스러운 속임수에 빠졌나? 유아조차도 쉽게 당신을 속일 수 있겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "49bfdf08-850a-45af-9420-44145f1f248f"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I remember perfectly well who I am speaking to. I'm speaking to the "
"ruler who is unable to catch a single criminal. Or is it not unable, but "
"unwilling? We'll find out soon enough. {g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}! To "
"battle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 내가 누구에게 말하고 있는지 완벽하게 잘 기억하고 있어. 나는 단 한 명의 범인을 잡지 못한 통치자에게 말하고 있지. 아니면 "
"불가능하지는 않지만 꺼리는 것이 아닌가? 곧 발견 할 것이다. {g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}! 전투준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "3a759557-5e6a-4184-a8f1-8f7de694f2a8"
msgid ""
"\"Treason! To battle, {g|Hellknights}hellknights{/g}! Keep Darven alive, but "
"kill all the rest!\""
msgstr "\"이 반역자! 전투를 준비하라 {g|Hellknights}헬나이트{/g}여! 다르벤은 살려 두고 나머지는 모두 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "dc56982a-7367-4268-ab17-da27ee51d886"
msgid ""
"\"Do we really need to talk to this person? The kindest words I could give a "
"member of the {g|Order of the Rack}Order of the Rack{/g} would be an epitaph."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말로 이 사람과 이야기해야 하나? {g|Order of the Rack}형벌 기사단{/g}에게 해줄 가장 친절한 말은 묘비명뿐일 "
"거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a5d0ea19-2eb3-47e7-8bb2-6535b2d6dd3d"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi self-righteously turns away from Linxia.{/n} \"Ooh, book burner!\""
msgstr "{n}린지는 린시아로부터 몸을 돌립니다.{/n} \"책을 태우는 나쁜 녀석!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "74670096-d6cd-4015-a19d-732513ee411b"
msgid "\"So much ardor. So few results.\""
msgstr "\"너무 열정적이었지만 결과는 적군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "aa3bf718-605a-4f72-ad66-972a216adc81"
msgid ""
"\"I see the worst of myself in you, Hellknight Linxia. A noble ardor that "
"has lost its soul.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너에게서 나 자신의 최악을 본다. Hellknight 린시아. 그 영혼을 잃은 고귀한 열정.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevilSE/LinxiaBeforeFight/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "c2b1667d-0de6-4ca4-b26a-2d4f4976fee7"
msgid ""
"\"Why she talk like that to you? She importanter than you?\" {n}Nok-Nok "
"looks back and forth between you and Linxia, as though comparing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"왜 그녀가 너에게 그런 말을 하는 거야? 그녀가 너보다 지위가 높아?\" {n}녹-녹은 당신과 린시아를 비교하는 것처럼 둘을 번갈아 "
"봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/BrinePeaceful/BrineCitizen1_String
msgctxt "cce9bd62-9fcb-4f68-b043-f641756fbe31"
msgid "\"Praise Mammon!\""
msgstr "\"마몬을 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/BrinePeaceful/BrineCitizen2_String
msgctxt "43fa51b5-c39f-41fd-8756-74e02575c1ec"
msgid ""
"\"The trade is booming, the taxes are bearable. Darven is a fine ruler.\""
msgstr "\"무역이 호황을 누리고 세금은 견딜 만하다. 다르벤은 훌륭한 통치자입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/BrinePeaceful/BrineCitizen3_String
msgctxt "e24ab901-e4f5-45e1-85ce-bdbdf482c307"
msgid "\"Are you the one who helped Darven protect Brineheart? Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"다르벤이 브라인하트를 보호하도록 도운 사람이 당신입니까? 감사합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/BrinePeaceful/BrineCitizen4_String
msgctxt "56d33605-cc59-4a1e-b9e5-0a9168856657"
msgid "\"Brineheart is thriving! Darven knows how to rule the city.\""
msgstr "\"브라인하트 번성하고 있습니다! 다르벤은 도시를 통치하는 법을 알고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/BrinePeaceful/BrineCitizen5_String
msgctxt "ec16e91b-7aea-4bbf-89ee-be8ea4178e7f"
msgid "\"People say our ruler used to be a pirate. But I don't believe that!\""
msgstr "\"사람들은 우리의 통치자는 과거에 해적이라고 말했지만 나는 그것을 믿지 않습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/BrinePeaceful/BrineCitizenFemale_String
msgctxt "d0eba334-8725-41e3-aa8b-ec68d4705b0f"
msgid "\"I like Darven very much. Just don't tell him I told you!\""
msgstr "\"나는 다르벤을 아주 좋아해요. 내가 말했다고 알리지 말아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/DarvenStays_String
msgctxt "4112141c-33ab-498a-8d61-b4dd20e441e9"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks for your help, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your "
"Highness}.\""
msgstr "\"도움을 주셔서 감사합니다. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Devil_angry1_String
msgctxt "c9576d88-df04-4659-81bb-bcccfefefb87"
msgid "\"What's promised must be fulfilled!\""
msgstr "\"약속된 것은 성취되어야 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Devil_angry2_String
msgctxt "1ad08613-102f-4da0-bba8-28ee186ff71b"
msgid "\"Contracts are unbreakable!\""
msgstr "\"계약은 깨지지 않습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Hellknight_angry1_String
msgctxt "68c7c084-8dc6-4cc5-bd1b-2486575d1e2e"
msgid "\"Death to the traitors!\""
msgstr "\"반역자에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Hellknight_angry2_String
msgctxt "dde9a19a-329a-4b0e-973e-f47730907a94"
msgid "\"Burn {mf|him|her} at the stake!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|그|그녀}를 화형에 처해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Hellknight_angry3_String
msgctxt "406e0b3d-d03f-459a-9653-0ca4c7b351d8"
msgid "\"For the hellknights! For Linxia!\""
msgstr "\"hellknights을 위하여! 린시아을 위하여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Hellknight_happy1_String
msgctxt "c3c0eb1e-96b1-4e40-bc21-4a6e2085df3b"
msgid "\"Supporting us was a wise decision.\""
msgstr "\"우리를 지지하는 것은 현명한 결정이었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Hellknight_happy2_String
msgctxt "0874a947-3b94-4420-a4d9-710b6ef5a7cd"
msgid "\"Darven will pay for everything!\""
msgstr "\"다르벤이 모든 것을 지불할 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Hellknight_happy3_String
msgctxt "26d57bfe-c529-4746-8ec7-ca07bf800dc4"
msgid "\"Together we'll bring order to these lands!\""
msgstr "\"함께하면 우리가 이 땅에 질서를 가져올 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Mercenary_angry1_String
msgctxt "a97f45a1-7501-48af-8b45-6ef0c4f2f4b7"
msgid "\"For Darven!\""
msgstr "\"다르벤을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Mercenary_angry2_String
msgctxt "084930e2-75d9-4fda-81dc-c8a9945ddac2"
msgid "\"Darven will pay extra for your head.\""
msgstr "\"다르벤은 너의 머리에 여분의 돈을 낼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Mercenary_angry3_String
msgctxt "2d2f30fc-7bb3-4661-861f-04dc80ff5ddb"
msgid "\"Darven sends his regards, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}.\""
msgstr "\"다르벤이 안부를 전한다. {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Mercenary_happy1_String
msgctxt "f1669b4a-2d5a-42ce-9fb5-44931069f4d3"
msgid "\"Ha! Now we'll definitely win!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 이제 우린 확실히 승리할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Mercenary_happy2_String
msgctxt "6b49889d-f24e-4f05-aa9c-19d76c2d8f06"
msgid "\"Darven must pay real good if he managed to hire even you.\""
msgstr "\"심지어 당신을 고용 할 수 있다면 다르벤은 정말로 돈을 많이 지불 할 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/Barks/Mercenary_happy3_String
msgctxt "0b58d8b9-7899-42b3-8f70-b2ee44fedbd6"
msgid "\"Let's send Linxia to hell!\""
msgstr "\"린시아를 지옥에 보내자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "544b7272-1a5c-4459-aacd-83463d3aa999"
msgid "Stayed true to the alliance with Darven."
msgstr "다르벤과 동맹을 맺었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "1983f2ec-45d5-49e7-b012-216577a466ba"
msgid "\"Let's finish her off, Darven!\""
msgstr "\"그녀를 끝내죠 다르벤!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "15d1ad6c-2dda-41f0-9444-21be4b80f79a"
msgid "Betrayed Darven."
msgstr "다르벤을 배반합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "bd33975d-b718-48c6-8c70-93e34448186e"
msgid "\"I'll help you, Linxia!\""
msgstr "\"당신을 도울 거예요 린시아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ca4cbfb0-6259-442e-9f47-58da5c69df01"
msgid "\"I don't want to get involved in this.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 문제에 개입하고 싶지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d576b999-6b22-4576-888a-5cf3a94e3984"
msgid "Tried to reconcile Linxia and Darven."
msgstr "린시아와 다르벤을 화해시킵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "ad9d0a67-3b57-46b1-a8bd-e6c3f3c1efe7"
msgid "\"Stop now! It's not too late to resolve this peacefully.\""
msgstr "\"이제 그만! 이 문제를 평화적으로 해결하기에는 아직 늦지 않았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8983ad8b-92a4-46a2-927f-88698b8e227e"
msgid "Tried to reconcile Linxia and Darven."
msgstr "린시아와 다르벤을 화해시킵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dc9b6203-ac98-490b-a5bf-7a9858e442f0"
msgid "Stayed true to the alliance with Linxia."
msgstr "린시아와 동맹을 맺었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "daa9bf5e-6437-4d97-91ec-cae50564fcdb"
msgid "\"Go, Linxia! Let's kill this criminal together!\""
msgstr "\"린시아! 이 범죄자를 함께 처치하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8338fd5d-ef30-428f-b4f7-886b43e9df26"
msgid "Betrayed Linxia."
msgstr "린시아를 배신합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "0deb0de9-10d2-4cf0-b03f-e4edaf57a7b8"
msgid "\"Earn some gold, huh? Why not! Let's finish her off, Darven!\""
msgstr "\"금을 좀 벌어야지 응? 그녀를 끝내자구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "a77299a4-2874-4620-b0f1-e8243437335c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you're just in time! To be honest, {d|Darven}I'd{/d} started to worry "
"that you'd be late. Couldn't delay the show any longer.\""
msgstr "\"어이, 기다렸다고! 솔직히 말해 {d|Darven}나는{/d} 니가 늦는줄 알았어. 더 이상 쇼를 연기 할 수는 없잖아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "1f7f3195-573c-46e0-be62-5f910847f27a"
msgid ""
"\"So you decided to show up, after all! Just in time – {d|Linxia}I{/d} may "
"require reinforcement!\""
msgstr "\"결국 나타나기로 결심했군! {d|린시아}나는{/d} 지원이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "892712ee-94c3-448e-ad51-29fc810b6e5b"
msgid ""
"\"The criminal has summoned the traitor for help. I shouldn't be surprised.\""
" {n}{d|Linxia}Linxia's{/d} lips tighten into a thin line.{/n} \"Then I'll "
"just have to kill the both of you. Saves me time later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"범죄자가 반역자를 소환하여 도움을 청했군. 놀랍지도 않다.\" {n}{d|린시아}린시아{/d}의 입술은 굳게 다물어집니다.{/n} "
"\"그러면 나는 둘 다 죽여야 할 것이다. 나중을 위해 시간을 절약해야겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "801cd728-7b47-4539-8699-15ba6d3fecbd"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! So, you've come all this way just to share with us this valuable piece "
"of information?\""
msgstr "\"그럼 이 값진 정보 조각을 우리와 함께 나누기 위해 여기까지 오셨나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "baffa995-6edb-4384-8423-b9ace6c5d559"
msgid ""
"\"I've been waiting for this moment for so long!\" {n}Darven's smile looks "
"wolfish.{/n}"
msgstr "\"나는 오랫동안 이 순간을 기다리고 있었다!\" {n}다르벤의 미소가 늑대처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "6a5b0c08-5726-47a1-b22d-971be0f1f980"
msgid ""
"\"Coward! Both of you are cowards and scum! {g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}, "
"charge!\""
msgstr "\"겁쟁이! 너희 둘 모두 겁쟁이로군! {g|Hellknights}헬나이트{/g}들이여, 돌격하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "17ad548c-57c8-4b4e-860f-f788846e06f5"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, really? You've finally been stirred by your duty to act?\" {n}Linxia "
"raises her eyebrow in surprise.{/n}"
msgstr "\"오 정말로? 당신의 의무에 마침내 자극받았나?\" {n}린시아는 놀라움으로 그녀의 눈썹을 올립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "29bcd84d-5a58-4ad7-8840-93c2dc31abbe"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, a final betrayal at the very end of the story. I would applaud were I "
"not the betrayed party.\" {n}Darven spits on the ground.{/n} \"But you won't "
"take me so easily. Mercenaries, into formation! Time to work for your gold!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마지막 순간에 결국 배반하는군. 배신하지 않았으면 박수를 보냈을 텐데.\" {n}다르벤은 땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"하지만 나를 "
"그렇게 쉽게 잡지 못할 걸. 용병은 위치로! 돈값을 할 시간이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "c3aa9100-bd2c-464e-a8b7-1af2b521d72c"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, a final betrayal at the very end of the story. I would applaud were I "
"not the betrayed party.\" {n}Darven spits on the ground.{/n} \"We had a "
"deal, didn't we, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}? Well, I'll teach you a "
"lesson about keeping promises. {g|Mammon}Mammon{/g}! I call upon you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마지막 순간에 결국 배반하는군. 배신하지 않았으면 박수를 보냈을 텐데.\" {n}다르벤은 땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"하지만 우린 "
"계약을 했죠, {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}? 약속을 지켜야 한다는 교훈을 드리죠. {g|Mammon}마몬{/g}! 그대를 소환하나니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "ef8575ff-d974-42b4-a1eb-939ed662304c"
msgid ""
"\"Well this is an unlucky twist. Unless...\" {n}{d|Darven}Darven{/d} "
"grins,{/n} \"… you'd like to earn a little gold instead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"재수 없이 꼬였군요. 그렇지 않으면...\" {n}{d|darven}다르벤{/d}은 씨익 웃습니다.{/n} \"...돈을 벌고 싶지 "
"않으신가요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "3bca4cf0-79a3-4136-9f15-784d302d8447"
msgid ""
"\"What is this? Cowardice or betrayal? Clearly I should not have relied on "
"your honesty. {g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}, charge!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 비겁함인가 배신인가? 너의 정직에 의지해서는 안되겠군. {g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g} 돌격하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "cf65d9c5-0c6b-4efe-bc60-3ac40c347671"
msgid "\"Kill?\" {n}Linxia grins.{/n} \"Sure. We'll do that. If he's lucky.\""
msgstr "\"죽인다고?\" {n}린시아는 웃습니다.{/n} \"그래. 우리가 죽일 거야. 운이 좋다면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "4b2ce156-1ca3-495c-b382-07f95e2ff90d"
msgid ""
"\"I am ready to die. Are you?\" {n}Darven spits on the ground.{/n} \"You "
"won't defeat me so easily. Mercenaries, into formation! Time to work for "
"your gold!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 죽을 준비가 되어있습니다.\" {n}다르벤은 땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"당신은 나를 쉽게 물리 칠 수 없을 것입니다. "
"용병은 위치로! 금을 위해 일할 시간입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BeforeFight/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "868acfb6-6a3b-4856-8e64-3fd98180d9cb"
msgid ""
"\"I am ready to die. Are you?\" {n}Darven spits on the ground.{/n}\"We had a "
"deal, didn't we, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}? Well, I'll teach you a "
"lesson about keeping promises. {g|Mammon}Mammon{/g}! I call upon you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 죽을 준비가 되어있습니다. 당신은요?\" {n}다르벤은 땅에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"하지만 우리는 계약을 했지요 "
"{mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}? 약속을 지켜야 한다는 교훈을 드리죠. {g|Mammon}마몬{/g}! 그대를 소환하나니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "73ade55c-3ff0-48d3-9268-8a80baa22099"
msgid "\"Tell me your story.\""
msgstr "\"당신 이야기가 궁금해요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0e7dc482-d5eb-4cde-8588-2dc5e8bf19c1"
msgid "\"Start from the very beginning.\""
msgstr "\"처음부터 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "3e11a75d-070e-41d0-a5ee-cd7af9804334"
msgid "\"So, what did this Chelish noble do to make you so angry?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 Chelish 귀족이 당신을 왜 화나게 했지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "fd0dde72-e77c-44d9-bb55-9ca93827397b"
msgid "\"Remind me, how did you make a pact with Mammon?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 마몬과 협정을 맺었어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "17ebf227-3789-4f02-aac0-a05017710789"
msgid "\"What's the essence of your pact with Mammon?\""
msgstr "\"마몬과 협상의 요지는 뭐지요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "e105c3bf-a843-4cf2-ba25-24a224d0cf75"
msgid "\"Have you always dreamt of becoming a king?\""
msgstr "\"항상 왕이 되는 꿈을 꾸었습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "c61a8c32-592e-4439-b11a-6c8cb7c2a27c"
msgid "\"I have some other questions.\""
msgstr "\"다른 질문이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "0d980036-2262-480d-9692-959e44351a1e"
msgid "\"Goodbye, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히 계세요, 전하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "d5ceeb1e-b048-4bbc-a20b-7055ef40596c"
msgid "\"How are things going in Brineheart?\""
msgstr "\"브라인하트는 어떻습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "7efd0c52-8135-400f-93b1-5cffc0c71c0c"
msgid ""
"\"Aren't you worried that the Hellknights will show up here once again?\""
msgstr "\"Hellknights가 다시 여기에 나타날까 걱정되지 않나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4848759d-f0ea-4ead-b1c9-0dbd18f5a2c1"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome to Brineheart! As you can see, we're settling in nicely. Let me "
"once again express my gratitude for helping to drive Linxia from my city. "
"That woman just won't take a hint.\" {n}{d|Darven}Darven's{/d} grin shines "
"with joy.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"브라인하트에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 보시다시피 우리는 잘 정착하고 있습니다. 린시아를 제 도시에서 몰아내는 데 도움을 준 것에 대해 "
"다시 한 번 감사드립니다. 그 여성은 힌트를 얻지 못할 것입니다.\" {n}{d|darven}다르벤{/d}의 웃음은 기쁨으로 "
"빛납니.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "4dc61c5b-16a2-4400-a08b-48cc6b2f593c"
msgid "\"Welcome to Brineheart!\" {n}Darven gives you a hospitable smile.{/n}"
msgstr "\"브라인하트에 오신 것을 환영합니다!\" {n}다르벤은 상냥한 미소를 지었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "df412c7c-89e6-4cd4-9f13-f01e17386abb"
msgid ""
"\"I'll be happy to tell you again. Or maybe you're interested in some "
"particular part of it?\""
msgstr "\"다시 말하게 되어 행복할 겁니다. 아니면 그 중 일부분에 관심이 있습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "f8f49535-5ac9-42d7-a1ef-5a65cadcf089"
msgid ""
"\"You see, that whole story about the duel and the {g|Cheliax}Chelish{/g} "
"noble had one more little addendum to it.\""
msgstr "\"결투에 관한 모든 이야기와 {g|Cheliax}Chelish{/g} 귀족에 관해 조금 더 많은 이야기가 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "1d655ece-e8d8-4142-b703-650991ba086e"
msgid ""
"\"Well, not so little, to be precise.\" {n}Darven grins.{/n} \"His name is "
"{g|Mammon}Mammon{/g}, and he is one of the Archdevils – the Ardent Prince. "
"And he made a pact with me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄 정확하지는 않습니다.\" {n}다르벤이 웃습니다.{/n} \"그의 이름은 {g|Mammon}마몬{/g}이며 그는 고위 데블 중 "
"하나입니다. - '열정의 왕자'라고 들었습니다. 그는 나와 협정을 맺었지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "a3cf1e2c-d3b2-40ad-8ccb-32f61638cae0"
msgid ""
"\"That {g|Cheliax}Chelish{/g} noble had a pact with {g|Mammon}Mammon{/g} too "
"– which I expect is commonplace for the Chelish nobility. And the noble was "
"in no hurry to fulfill his end of the deal, either. By killing him, I earned "
"Mammon's gratitude, and he offered me a similar pact. A handsome sum of "
"gold, and my cherished dream come true – that's what he promised. So how "
"could I say no?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g} 귀족은 {g|Mammon}마몬{/g}과 협정을 맺기도 했고 나는 Cheliax 귀족에게는 "
"평범한 것이라 생각했습니다. 그리고 그 귀족도 서둘러 거래를 끝내지 못했습니다. 그를 죽임으로써 나는 마몬의 감사를 얻었고 그는 나에게 "
"비슷한 협약을 제안했습니다. 골드와 내 소중한 꿈이 실현되는 것이지요. 그것이 그가 약속 한 것입니다. 그러면 내가 어떻게 안된다고 말할 "
"수 있겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "df6196b4-faab-4fab-88cc-fc47a5c8f4d9"
msgid ""
"\"I was supposed to become a king. No more, no less.\" {n}Darven smiles.{/n} "
"\"The subjects of my kingdom were supposed to worship {g|Mammon}Mammon{/g} "
"as their official deity, and pay taxes for his temples.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 더도 말고 덜도 말고 왕이 되려 했습니다. {n}다르벤은 웃습니다.{/n} \"나의 왕국의 사람들은 {g|Mammon}마몬{/g}"
"을 그들의 공식적인 신으로 숭배하고 그의 사원에 세금을 내야 합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "befcf5d4-cdd3-442d-88ca-34a9a4133eae"
msgid ""
"\"Not too difficult a task – especially if you have enough money. The only "
"problem was Linxia. The moment I laid the first cornerstone of my kingdom, "
"I'd have become an easy target. She would have instantly found me and "
"introduced me to all her torture devices.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어려운 일이 아닙니다. 특히 돈이 충분하다면 말입니다. 문제는 린시아입니다. 내가 왕국의 첫 번째 초석을 놓을 때 나는 쉬운 대상이 "
"되었습니다. 그녀는 즉시 나를 찾아 갖가지 고문 도구를 소개 할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "b61a1aaf-ea3c-4694-8811-3222eb58f74b"
msgid "\"Thanks to you, I managed to avoid this ignominious fate.\""
msgstr "\"당신 덕분에 나는 이 불명예스러운 운명을 피할 수 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "c120147e-e3d7-4ba5-9984-038e5a1aec2e"
msgid "\"I'll be happy to answer every one of them.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그들 모두에게 기꺼이 대답 할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "c6563a33-d85d-461b-b07f-66e9e0033012"
msgid ""
"\"Farewell, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. Feel "
"free to come back anytime – you're always welcome here!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히 가십시오. {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 언제든지 다시 오셔도 좋습니다. 언제나 환영합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "824b2bb0-f97a-4604-8feb-11c8ba0091f8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes. It was my dream even back when I still was sailing the {g|Inner "
"Sea}Inner Sea{/g} as a part of the {g|Taldor}Taldorian{/g} merchant fleet. "
"It was back then that I came up with the name – Brineheart. In fond memory "
"of those careless days when the salty spray settled in my hair as to the "
"sound of creaking rigging and the cries of gulls.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 그래요. 내가 {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}의 상인 함대로 {g|Inner Sea}내해{/g}를 항해할 때 내 꿈 이었지요. "
"나는 심지어 나의 왕국 이름을 브라인하트라고까지 생각해 냈습니다. 삐걱거리는 뱃소리와 갈매기들의 울음소리가 들리고 내 머리에는 소금기가 "
"절어있었을 때 이런 부주의한 추억이었지요. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "37170b23-fd23-4f3e-a543-46f1255aa4f1"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing could be better! Under my rule, trade is booming. The taxes are "
"reasonable, so it didn't take much time for the caravan masters to figure "
"out the best place to sell their goods, establish their storage or just "
"spend the night. I crewed a trading vessel before I became pirate, so I have "
"a pretty good understanding of how to do business.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 통치에 따라 무역이 호황을 누리고 있습니다. 세금이 합리적이기 때문에 캐러밴 마스터들이 물건을 팔거나 저장고를 세우거나 밤을 보낼 "
"수 있는 최고의 장소를 찾아내는 데 많은 시간이 걸리지 않습니다. 나는 해적이 되기 전에 무역선을 운영해서 사업하는 방법을 잘 알고 "
"있습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "33d73578-6f35-4d0b-969c-3df21916e176"
msgid ""
"\"Let them come. I've already hired decent guards, and I have reliable "
"neighbors.\" {n}Darven bows.{/n} \"Besides, I've got informants in "
"{g|Cheliax}Cheliax{/g}. So it's highly unlikely these "
"{g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g} will take me by surprise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들을 들이시죠. 나는 이미 괜찮은 경호원을 고용했고 신뢰할 수 있는 이웃이 있습니다.\" {n}다르벤이 인사합니다.{/n} \"게다가"
" 나는 {g|Cheliax} Cheliax{/g}에 정보원이 있습니다. 그래서 {g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}가 "
"기습해서 나를 데려 갈 확률이 희박합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineDarven/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "121ac574-0307-4b5f-be84-1e0f995c2e67"
msgid ""
"\"People see an example of a good ruler in me. I see no point in dissuading "
"them. There's almost no opposition left.\" {n}Darven grins.{/n} \"A smile "
"will get lots of doors open before you. But a smile and a sharp knife will "
"get you even further.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사람들은 내 안에 좋은 통치자의 면를 보았습니다. 나는 그들을 단념시킬 의미가 없습니다. 반대파가 없지요.\" {n}다르벤이 "
"웃습니다.{/n} \"미소는 당신에게 많은 문을 열어 줄 것입니다. 그러나 미소와 날카로운 칼은 더 많은 문을 열 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineTrader/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c623015f-8a44-42ae-9e24-8bc74341a9f9"
msgid "\"Show me what you've got.\""
msgstr "\"가진 것을 보여주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineTrader/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "caeb7adb-55e7-4c20-afc7-2cb2e21dea24"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"잘 가십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineTrader/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a1b924c5-82aa-4272-95af-355e349c9475"
msgid "\"How's the trade going?\""
msgstr "\"무역은 어땠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineTrader/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3a928820-515d-4853-a997-17b3dab767db"
msgid "\"Welcome to Brineheart! Would you like to take a look at my goods?\""
msgstr "\"브라인하트에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 내 물건을 살펴 보시겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/BrineTrader/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "8b125fe5-272d-4de2-b10f-583bd8ede7a3"
msgid ""
"\"Everything is excellent! Darven is a wise ruler. Trade caravans come every "
"day, the taxes are low. — Our city thrives!\""
msgstr "\"모든 것이 훌륭합니다! 다르벤은 현명한 통치자입니다. 무역 캐러밴이 매일 오고 세금이 낮습니다. 우리 도시가 번창합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "d5b33afe-8d35-41a9-a897-6785aa18d6c3"
msgid ""
"\"Stay. Together, we'll be able to protect Brineheart from any enemies to "
"come.\""
msgstr "\"함께 머물지요. 우리는 모든 적들로부터 브라인하트를 보호할 수 있을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "effa0d9d-f313-496a-a778-df164862f9f7"
msgid "\"Where are you heading now?\""
msgstr "\"지금 어디로 가고 있습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9d3d1433-0426-4bad-bab3-00da3917daab"
msgid "Parted ways with Darven on a friendly note."
msgstr "다르벤과 친숙한 분위기에 헤어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "65181cb6-79f4-4679-ad64-b089ba0446d1"
msgid "\"Have a safe journey, Darven.\""
msgstr "\"안전한 여행을 하기를 다르벤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f38f57a8-d819-4ea8-81bc-fc62172ac597"
msgid "Eliminated Darven."
msgstr "다르벤을 쫓아냅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "2e2fe6ed-e505-4885-9dc9-e2955d0ec5de"
msgid "\"Get lost. I don't want to see you ever again.\""
msgstr "\"꺼져. 너를 다시는 보고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "84705dac-42e7-4744-a4cc-f3a1b83ae7c3"
msgid "Betrayed Darven."
msgstr "다르벤을 배반합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "7422e210-0dbe-42c5-b7b8-19bffd73fa1d"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're not going anywhere!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다]\"네놈은 아무 데도 못 간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "06e78fc0-243f-4bf1-ab11-f46c45ec5f9b"
msgid "\"Aren't you afraid of Mammon's wrath?\""
msgstr "\"마몬의 분노가 무섭지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "9c4bc079-f603-429e-a706-11b520f6c24d"
msgid ""
"\"I'll most certainly be taking you up on that invitation. And for now — "
"farewell.\""
msgstr "\"언제든 초대에 응하지. 그럼 이만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fd0e7fe4-be1b-43ca-9a1f-a76eb43ba152"
msgid "Betrayed Darven."
msgstr "다르벤을 배반합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "b63677de-e93d-4688-b715-b8937cfb72a5"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't need neighbors like you.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너 같은 이웃은 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "8c41eef7-eb12-4a53-b869-c7a9f09d05b3"
msgid "\"So, you're no longer afraid of Mammon's wrath?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 너는 더이상 마몬의 분노가 무섭지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "5352c622-7b84-4dfb-b621-ec6e9ce1d613"
msgid "\"I'm glad that I helped your dream come true.\""
msgstr "\"당신의 꿈이 실현되도록 도와 준 것을 기쁘게 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "43d05acd-8b24-4437-8b9e-1d1d30d4149c"
msgid "Executed Darven for his past crimes, and for worshipping Mammon."
msgstr "과거 범죄와 마몬을 숭배한 사실로 다르벤을 처형합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "398d17e9-f23d-4cdb-8ef8-5d6fc2a4dfd0"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You are a criminal and a devil-worshipper. I cannot leave you "
"alive. Accept your punishment with honor, if you can.\""
msgstr ""
"[공격합니다] \"당신은 범죄자이며 데블 숭배자입니다. 나는 살려 보내지 않을 수 없습니다. 가능한 한 영광으로 형벌을 받아들이십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "cdfac9b1-914e-40b2-b0b3-6eb09760e20f"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven stands over Linxia's body in silence, an expression of deep "
"contemplation frozen on his face. A few moments later, he's grinning and "
"brushing his hair with his fingers.{/n} \"You know, I've dreamt of this "
"moment so many times, all my feelings seem burnt out.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}다르벤은 린시아의 시체를 보며 그의 얼굴에는 깊은 묵상과 침묵이 나타납니다. 잠시 후 그는 씨익 웃으며 손으로 머리를 "
"빗습니다.{/n} \"알다시피 나는 이 순간을 여러 번 꿈꿨는데 내 감정은 모두 불타 버린 것 같아\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "2dfc9ee2-472c-4cfa-a1e0-6b6e3d6e61fc"
msgid ""
"\"After so many years, my hunter is finally dead — and I stand over her dead "
"body, making speeches full of pathos, melodramatic wisdom and self-praise. "
"But you know what, she deserves none of it. She who lived so wickedly cannot "
"die an honest death.\" {n}Darven turns calmly away from the dead Linxia, as "
"if he's forgotten she ever existed at all.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오랜 세월이 지난 후에 사냥꾼은 마침내 죽었어. 이 모습을 보라고, 이 년의 시체 위에서 연설에 빠져들고 의기양양하게 지혜를 뽐내는 "
"내 모습을. 이제 이 년은 그 무엇도 아니야. 그렇게 사악하게 살았는데 꽤 좋은 죽음을 맞이했군.\" {n}다르벤은 마치 그녀가 존재하는 "
"걸 잊어 버렸던 것처럼 죽은 린시아에게서 차분하게 몸을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "0bbba65d-4e3f-4634-8df3-c0f2c97e99ac"
msgid ""
"\"You made a deal with me, and remained true to your word to the end. In "
"this regard, we are similar. I also keep my bargains by any means necessary. "
"I've promised you a reward, and I shall keep my promise. This is all I have "
"for now. Except for Brineheart, of course.\" {n}Darven winks playfully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"넌 나와 거래를 했고 끝까지 자기 말을 지켰어. 우리 꽤 닮았군. 무슨 일이 있어도 약속을 지키는 게 내 원칙이거든. 나도 너에게 "
"보상을 약속했으니 지켜야겠지. 지금 당장 내가 가지고 있는 모든 돈을 줄게. 물론 브라인하트는 제외하고.\" {n}다르벤은 장난스럽게 "
"윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "c6927144-28a2-42d5-b1bd-5b7820ec09a7"
msgid ""
"\"You never promised to help me, and never offered me an alliance, yet still "
"you came and helped me. It's difficult for me to understand you.\" {n}Darven "
"looks at you with narrowed eyes, then sighs.{/n} \"But any help must be "
"repaid. Please, take this modest sum as a compensation for your efforts. "
"Alas, I cannot offer more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 절 도와주겠다고 약속 한 적이 없으며 동맹을 제의 한 적이 없었습니다. 그러나 여전히 당신이 와서 도와주었습니다. 당신을 "
"이해하는 것이 어렵습니다.\" {n}다르벤은 당신을 흘겨보고 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"그러나 어떤 도움도 갚아야 마땅합니다. 이 소정의 "
"금액을 당신의 노력에 대한 보상으로 삼으십시오. 더는 제공 할 수 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "d737717f-b9cf-4e98-8a11-1005d114bcff"
msgid ""
"\"First you strike a deal with me, then you betray me, and finally you help "
"me again. I just can't understand you.\" {n}Darven looks at you with "
"narrowed eyes, then sighs.{/n} \"But any help must be repaid. Please, take "
"this modest sum as a compensation for your efforts. Alas, I cannot offer "
"more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"처음에 당신은 나와 협상을 하고서는 나를 배반하고 마침내 나를 다시 돕는군요. 나는 당신을 이해할 수 없습니다.\" {n}다르벤은 "
"등신을 흘겨보고 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"그러나 어떤 도움도 갚아야 마땅합니다. 이 소정의 금액을 당신의 노력에 대한 보상으로 "
"삼으십시오. 더는 제공 할 수 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "534ce473-7f1d-4ffb-bb81-d153d9d5d738"
msgid ""
"\"And with that I shall bid you farewell. Unfortunately, I cannot establish "
"Brineheart under such circumstances. Alas, my dream of having my own kingdom "
"will have to remain but a dream — at least for the moment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 나는 당신에게 작별 인사를 해야겠습니다. 불행히도 그런 상황에서 브라인하트를 설립 할 수는 없습니다. 아아아. 내 자신의 "
"왕국을 갖고 싶다는 나의 꿈은 한순간이었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "57bacee1-ac14-4ac1-ad98-75d6d52c2675"
msgid ""
"\"With a neighbor like you I need not be afraid of "
"{g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}. Besides, I wouldn't expect them to dare "
"venture this way any time soon. Just give me a couple of days, and I'll fill "
"this city with traders and merchants. And come back any time — don't be shy. "
"You'll always be welcome in my city.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 나는 {g|Hellknights}헬나이트{/g}를 두려워 할 필요가 없어. 게다가 놈들은 감히 이런 식으로 곧장 습격하지는 않을 "
"거야. 며칠 만 주면 상인들과 상인들로 이 도시를 채울 예정이야. 그리고 언제든지 다시 와. 부끄러워하지 마. 내 도시에서 너는 항상 "
"환영받을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "707dfaf1-199f-499f-b609-f1b74b8f1076"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you see...\" {n}Darven speaks slowly, carefully choosing the words.{/n}"
" \"{g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g} are extremely serious adversaries, and I "
"could not dare to oppose them without a reliable ally. And you are... shall "
"we say, a mystery to me. I cannot understand your motives, or predict the "
"course of your actions. That is why I must thank you for your offer, but "
"regretfully decline.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아...\" {n}다르벤은 천천히 말하고 조심스럽게 단어를 선택합니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g}는 극도로 심각한 적입니다. 나는 신뢰할 수 있는 동맹국 없이 그들을 대적 할 수 "
"없었습니다. 그리고 당신은... 나에게는 미지의 존재입니다. 나는 당신의 동기를 이해할 수 없으며 당신의 행동 과정을 예측할 수 "
"없습니다. 그래서 나는 당신의 제안에 대해 당신에게 감사해야 하지만 유감스럽게 거절합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "63f82a87-ff60-4814-83bf-9703469554f8"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven shrugs.{/n} \"West. Or perhaps south. Somewhere warm, where the "
"sea waves can lap at my feet. Perhaps I'll become captain of a pirate ship "
"again... Who knows?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}다르벤은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"서쪽 또는 아마도 남쪽이겠죠. 어딘가에 따뜻한 바다 파도가 내 발을 적시겠죠. 아마도 나는 "
"해적선의 대장이 될 것입니다. 누가 알겠습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "f1b1c090-0dd4-4b41-8df3-7d7deea548d4"
msgid ""
"\"You take care too, {mf|baron|baroness|king|queen}. Maybe we shall meet "
"again.\""
msgstr "\"몸조심하세요 {mf|남작|여남작|왕|여왕}. 어쩌면 다시 만나겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "2bf23f18-3c98-4615-85d1-8c63c00c55fb"
msgid ""
"\"Goodbye, {mf|Your Grace|Your Grace|Your Highness|Your Highness}. Hope to "
"see you soon!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히 {mf|영주님|영주님|전하|전하}. 곧 당신을 만나기를 바랍니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "23cb9cdd-274f-481a-b36b-d9f3092c9994"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven nods.{/n} \"I will do as you command. Too bad we couldn't become "
"friends.\""
msgstr "{n}다르벤은 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"당신이 명령하는대로. 우리가 친구가 될 수 없어 아쉽습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "c0c00b9e-8cd2-4687-a6dd-d7fb3d9d22c6"
msgid "\"You saved me from Linxia only to kill me yourself? But… why?\""
msgstr "\"고작 나를 죽이려고 린시아한테서 구해준 거야? 하지만... 어째서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "38afe440-f943-4ca8-ba04-23e33473a939"
msgid ""
"\"The Archdevil is angry with me, this is true. I failed to build Brineheart "
"in time, and thus incurred {g|Mammon}Mammon's{/g} wrath. Well... let's wish "
"him luck in his search. Linxia's been chasing me for years, and only managed "
"to catch up with me only because I stopped to wait for her. I'm even "
"slightly curious — how would an Archdevil manage the task?\""
msgstr ""
"\"고위 데블은 나에게 화가 났습니다. 사실 브라인하트를 제 시간에 지어 만들지 못했고 이로 인해 {g|Mammon}마몬{/g}의 격노를 "
"샀습니다. 흠... 그의 수색에 행운이 있기를 바랍니다. 린시아는 몇 년 동안 나를 쫓아 왔고 나는 그녀를 막지 않았기 때문에 그녀가 "
"나를 따라 잡을 수 있었습니다. 나는 약간 궁금해지는군요. 어떻게 고위 데블이 일을 관리합니까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "b44d9c2a-e9fd-46c8-afea-1af23c2639ee"
msgid ""
"\"The Archdevil values contracts above all else. I managed to establish "
"Brineheart before the deadline, and my city will become a stronghold of "
"{g|Mammon}Mammon's{/g} faith. A small price to pay for all that power, "
"wouldn't you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"고위 데블은 무엇보다도 계약을 중히 여기지. 나는 마감 전에 브라인하트를 설립 할 수 있었고 내 도시는 {g|Mammon}마몬{/g} "
"신앙의 요새가 될 거야. 그 모든 힘에 비하면 작은 대가라고 할 수 있겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "71154fcb-7d86-488b-aefe-b6ad9ba165f5"
msgid ""
"\"And you earned a decent sum of money while you did!\" {n}Darven gives you "
"an understanding smile.{/n} \"But, if we're talking seriously, I'm thrilled "
"to have my lifelong dream come true. And it makes me doubly happy to realize "
"that it's you who will be my neighbor.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 값진 돈을 벌었습니다!\" {n}다르벤은 당신에게 이해한다는 듯 미소를 줍니다.{/n} \"그러나 우리가 진지하게 이야기한다면 "
"내 평생 꿈꾸는 꿈이 이루어져 기쁘게 생각합니다. 내 이웃이 될 당신이라는 것을 깨닫게 되어 갚절로 기쁩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/DarvenWins/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "ab7b0b17-6d2e-493c-a839-eb3ef676f8fa"
msgid ""
"\"If you ever decide to write a memoir, please send me a copy! It must be "
"terribly interesting!\""
msgstr "\"회고록을 쓰기로 결정했다면 저에게 사본을 보내주십시오! 정말 재미있을 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "91ccdc6f-fd1a-44ed-8904-903b7a408e26"
msgid "\"What awaits Darven in Cheliax?\""
msgstr "\"첼리악스에서 다르벤을 기다리는 것은 무엇일까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "52be5cd2-9357-410f-b70e-6faf9aed04aa"
msgid "Wished Darven a swift justice."
msgstr "다르벤을 신속히 처형하라 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "57a374e7-4c7e-4e09-a0a2-d4c8d24433b7"
msgid "\"Execute the criminal here and now.\""
msgstr "\"지금 범죄자를 처형하십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "774e381e-78b8-4206-9fdd-d575be4cf519"
msgid "Advised to set Darven free."
msgstr "다르벤을 풀어달라고 조언합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "cdf41f4d-0a5e-4920-8bb0-a005fb9dafed"
msgid "\"Let him live. Mammon will punish him, one way or another.\""
msgstr "\"그를 살려두십시오. 마몬은 어떤 방식으로든 그를 처벌 할 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c37e53b4-9ccb-432e-a35c-118cfdc9fa4d"
msgid "Abstained from making a decision concerning Darven's fate."
msgstr "다르벤의 운명에 관한 결정을 하지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f4787cd8-ae73-4320-bb92-bdfbf3d7db55"
msgid "\"Do as you will.\""
msgstr "\"뜻대로 하십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c27a3a4d-dc54-45bd-b7a5-827fb0661f75"
msgid "Wished to witness Darven's execution."
msgstr "다르벤의 처형을 목격하고 싶다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "afbb249e-6329-404c-81ca-f09912ddf010"
msgid "\"An exemplary execution? Too bad I can't go with you to watch it.\""
msgstr "\"본보기 처형입니까? 함께 볼 수 없어 아쉽군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8ec13792-9847-4365-aa9e-7d481e16f380"
msgid "Accepted an alliance with the Hellknights."
msgstr "Hellknights와 동맹을 맺습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "25dbe504-2574-41c8-b82b-dd6d9de2755d"
msgid ""
"\"I accept your offer. The Hellknights of the Order of the Rack will always "
"be welcome guests in my lands.\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신의 제안을 받아들입니다. 형벌 기사단의 헬나이트는 항상 내 땅에서 환영받는 손님이 될 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5f12d59a-5848-4887-848d-3e37dd2a99e0"
msgid "Ordered Linxia to release Darven and withdraw from the Stolen Lands."
msgstr "린시아에게 다르벤을 석방하고 도둑맞은 땅에서 철수하도록 명령합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "8d5e0cf8-e7f5-4234-a134-ef1328b86958"
msgid "\"Leave Darven alone and get out of my lands.\""
msgstr "\"다르벤은 내버려두고 내 땅에서 나가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f814550b-0926-4362-9aba-51b83f95f047"
msgid "Ordered Linxia to leave the Stolen Lands."
msgstr "린시아에게 도둑맞은 땅에서 철수하도록 명령합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "06d2b3e4-92e0-4a22-86fc-580e72e8c6cc"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not afraid of you. Come and bring your hellknights with you. I'll wait."
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 두려워하지 않는다. 너의 기사들과 같이 와라. 나는 기다릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2af0c88c-9e22-4517-a643-46f54faee322"
msgid "Attacked Linxia."
msgstr "린시아를 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "107800d9-6297-4963-92d5-29b2682358b6"
msgid "[Attack] \"You've tested my patience for too long.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"당신은 너무 오래 내 인내심을 테스트했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0027_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "930b3bc0-c369-4469-b292-4580eb71caba"
msgid "Parted ways with Linxia in peace."
msgstr "린시아와 평화롭게 헤어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "11d24e38-d357-4238-8160-91714930e9af"
msgid "\"Just leave. I don't want to see you anymore.\""
msgstr "\"가주세요. 더 이상 보고 싶지 않군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "3b6433c0-fd90-40d4-9937-8ab18207e2bf"
msgid "\"I've helped you to catch Darven. Where's my reward?\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신을 도와 다르벤을 잡았어요. 내 보상은 어딨죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "a92ca3b2-e85c-47c7-8bc7-1688b957529a"
msgid ""
"\"So, what now, Darven? Where's all your arrogance gone? What do you say "
"now, laying in a pool of your own blood?\" {n}Linxia's eyes sparkle with "
"pleasure. Her sword swings lazily from side to side, close to Darven's "
"throat.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이제 어떡하지 다르벤? 그 오만함은 어디 갔어? 이제 당신 말대로 자신의 피 웅덩이에 누워 있나?\" {n}린시아의 눈은 기쁨으로 "
"빛납니다. 그녀의 칼은 다르벤의 목구멍 가까이에서 좌우로 느리게 흔들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "3eb24042-f556-4c3c-9027-34546d8e32cc"
msgid ""
"{n}Without taking his eyes from the Linxia's blade, Darven makes an effort "
"to spit out blood.{/n} \"Well, I know what an honorable defeat means. "
"{g|Mammon}Mammon's{/g} been waiting for me for a long time now. So do me a "
"favor, kill me now and let's be done with it.\" {n}An attempt of false "
"bravado fails to make his dull voice sound more lively.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}린시아의 칼날에서 눈을 떼지 않고 다르벤은 피를 뱉어 내기 위해 노력합니다.{/n} \"글쎄 나는 명예로운 패배가 무엇을 의미하는지 "
"안다.{g|Mammon}마몬{/g}은 오랫동안 나를 기다리고 있었다. 그러니 나한테 은혜를 베풀어 지금 나를 죽이고 그걸로 끝내자.\" "
"{n}허풍이 들통나자 그의 둔한 목소리는 선명하지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "92e6937a-24f3-467c-9023-2546f21e01a6"
msgid ""
"\"Kill you now? Simple as that? After so many years of chasing you across "
"all of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}? Oh no, no way. We're taking you back to "
"{g|Cheliax}Cheliax{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금 죽이라고? 그 만큼 간단히? 몇 년 동안 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}을 뒤지며 당신을 쫓아 다녔는데? 오 안되, "
"안되지. 우리가 다시 너를 {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g}로 데려 갈거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "298b0757-2063-4b5c-86a9-0c04b1d04a50"
msgid ""
"\"That's exactly what I'm going to do. Now, as for you...\" {n}Linxia eyes "
"you up and down.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그게 내가하려는 일이다. 자 이제 너는...\" {n}린시아가 당신을 위아래로 훑습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "b6b72454-4460-4795-9243-a7692b200dc2"
msgid ""
"\"The fire, or perhaps the chopping block. The rack, perhaps the stocks. But "
"before all that — an honest trial.\""
msgstr "\"화형 또는 아마도 참수형이겠군. 고문을 하던가 아마도 형구를 채우겠지.하지만 그 전에 정직한 재판이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "9e419f73-d4e3-434e-a7c9-1f88d5d3a332"
msgid "\"A trial so honest that you already know the outcome.\""
msgstr "\"재판은 솔직하니 너는 이미 그 결과를 알고 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "f67d3558-41b5-47cf-843d-1d6ba9f28dfd"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, we have an admirer of the art! Trust me, when it comes to torture, "
"Linxia is a true master. It's really sad that you're going to miss it all.\""
msgstr "\"아. 우리는 예술에 경의를 표한다! 나를 믿어. 고문에 직면할 때 내가 잘 대해주지. 네가 다 잊어 버리는 것이 슬프다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "d48106ae-cb73-437d-9076-97c6fcfccba6"
msgid ""
"\"At least you won't be missing anything, Darven.\" {n}Linxia's face winces "
"in contempt.{/n} \"Now, as for you...\" {n}Linxia eyes you up and down.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"적어도 너는 아무것도 놓치지 않을 거야 다르벤.\" {n}린시아의 얼굴 경멸로 찡그립니다.{/n} \"자 이제 너는...\" {n}"
"린시아가 당신을 위아래로 훑습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "f588d10a-5305-494f-af3f-58f574779d9c"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't ask for your opinion. The life and death of Darven are the sole "
"concern of the {g|Order of the Rack}Order of the Rack{/g}. Now, as for you..."
"\" {n}Linxia eyes you up and down.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네 의견은 묻지 않았어. 다르벤의 생사여부는 {g|Order of the Rack}형벌 기사단{/g}이 정한다.\" {n}린시아의 "
"얼굴 경멸로 찡그립니다.{/n} \"자 이제 너는...\" {n}린시아가 당신을 위아래로 훑습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "d4f30cc7-26dd-49d8-b180-46cf32ea117b"
msgid ""
"\"You are… an adequate… ruler.\" {n}Each of Linxia's words comes with "
"tremendous effort.{/n} \"I admit, I… didn't expect… a stronghold of law and "
"order could appear in these backwaters. You have my… apologies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 적절한... 통치자이지.\" {n}린시아는 단어를 엄청난 노력과 함께 말합니다.{/n} \"나는 인정한다. 나는... 법이 "
"다스리는 성채를 기대하지 않았지만 질서가 이 벽지에 확립될 수 있지. 내가 사과하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "a722c1cf-f074-43e2-baa5-b02d9753d891"
msgid ""
"\"You are… an unworthy ruler.\" {n}Linxia makes no effort to hide her "
"contempt.{/n} \"Though I wouldn't expect anything else from a bandit lord.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 합당하지 못한 통치자이다.\" {n}린시아는 그녀의 경멸을 숨기려고 노력하지 않습니다.{/n} \" 도둑놈 왕에게서 다른 것을 "
"기대하지는 않았지만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "978350b0-4990-4009-a738-9681fb6f9322"
msgid ""
"\"On behalf of the {g|Order of the Rack}Order of the Rack{/g}, I would like "
"to offer you our hand in friendship. Let us join our efforts in fighting "
"lawlessness and dissidence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Order of the Rack}형벌 기사단{/g}을 대신해서 우호의 손길을 내밀고 싶다. 불법과 불화와의 전쟁에 함께 동참하자."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "e88fbc5e-714a-4c6c-9226-0f94e9d5c79c"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you.\" {n}Linxia gives you an awkward smile.{/n} \"I have high "
"expectations of our alliance.\""
msgstr "\"고맙군.\" {n}린시아가 당신에게 어색한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"나는 우리 동맹에 대해 높은 기대를 가지고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "b12db730-0045-4e1d-bac5-fba5b638f33c"
msgid ""
"\"Sooner or later, the {g|Hellknights}Hellknights{/g} will deal with your "
"lands and bring order here. Pray to your gods that you're dead by then.\""
msgstr ""
"\"조만간 {g|Hellknights}헬나이트{/g}가 너의 땅을 관리하고 여기에서 명령을 내릴 것이다. 네가 그 때에는 죽길 바란다고 "
"너의 신에게 기도해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "ba04b567-3a30-49f2-ba46-6ef6bcad6485"
msgid "{n}Linxia throws a withering glance at you and turns away.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}린시아는 당신의 기를 죽이고는 돌아서 가버립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "68f75a84-3131-4a94-8719-507ac366c050"
msgid ""
"\"I was expecting something like this! I'm glad to be reminded that I'm an "
"excellent judge of character — especially when it comes to the ones I put to "
"death.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이런 일이 있을 것을 예상하고 있었다. 내가 사형 판결을 내릴 때는 뛰어난 재판관임을 상기하게 되어 기쁘군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Linxia
msgctxt "cd26a7f4-e457-40fe-a772-ff07a771397f"
msgid "\"Seeing justice served is reward enough in itself!\""
msgstr "\"정의가 실현됨을 보는 것은 그 자체로 충분한 보상이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Darwen
msgctxt "23331cff-0ba5-4398-8e95-774f25f22377"
msgid ""
"{n}Darven tries to laugh, but bursts into a cough instead.{/n} \"If you "
"expected a reward, you obviously picked the wrong side.\""
msgstr "{n}다르벤은 웃으려 하지만 대신 기침을 합니다.{/n} \"당신이 보상을 기대했다면, 분명히 틀린 쪽을 골랐습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "9d14be2f-2a9a-4e12-b20d-ed7c6d11e146"
msgid ""
"\"A fair requirement. Law must be law, and justice must be justice. Neither "
"is meant to indulge your own sordid feelings or be entertainment for a crowd."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"공정한 요구에요. 법률은 반드시 법률이어야 하며 정의는 정의이어야 하죠. 자신의 냉소적인 기분에 빠지거나 관중들에게 흥미거리를 "
"제공하는 것이 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "5b7d9aa7-8ef8-462c-8d13-289c94c3bba0"
msgid ""
"\"We could gain some benefits from this proposition. And it would be wrong "
"not to get anything from the order, after all the trouble its zealous "
"follower put us through.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 이 제안에서 약간의 이익을 얻을 수 있지. 그리고, 이 모든 문제들을 일으킨 장본인인 열성 추종자들에게서 아무것도 받아내지 "
"않는것도 잘못된 일이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "9e02d72c-8b70-437a-82f8-aa6a3732f455"
msgid ""
"\"Just in case, I feel I must remind you — the {g|Order of the Rack}Order of "
"the Rack{/g} is a cult of narrow-minded fanatics who persecute scientists "
"and artists alike. They hate technology, hate books and songs, and "
"especially hate freedom and the right to speak one's mind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"혹시 모르니, 네가 그들에 대해 기억하도록 해줘야겠군. {g|Order of the Rack}형벌 기사단{/g}은 과학자와 예술가를 "
"박해하는 심성이 뒤틀린 광신도들이다. 그들은 기술을 싫어하고, 책과 노래를 싫어하며, 특히 자유와 자기 생각을 말할 권리를 싫어하지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "0ebde975-d260-4da6-bc3a-970dce988965"
msgid ""
"\"For once, I actually agree with Jubilost. Look in Linxia's eyes — there is "
"nothing but the desire to exterminate and subdue! Besides, I like Darven... "
"Regardless of his behavior, no good would come of leaving him in her hands..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이번에는 주빌로스트에게 동의해요. 린시아의 눈을 보면 제압하고 싹을 자르려는 욕망 이외에는 아무것도 없어요! 게다가 나는 다르벤을 "
"좋아해요... 그의 행동에 상관없이, 그를 그녀의 손에 맡겨서 좋을 게 없을 것 같고요... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "487a84c0-2a4e-4488-859a-6d1b02ffbd4e"
msgid ""
"\"So, what, now I have to hide all my books and manuscripts in a locked "
"chest? What's keeping them from breaking in and burning everything down as "
"soon as I turn around?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서, 이제 내 모든 서적과 원고를 잠긴 궤짝에 숨겨야 할까요? 왜 제가 뒤돌자마자 그들이 모든것을 부수고 태워버리는걸 허락하는데요?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "757ac5df-1712-448f-a3e6-e948cb601a30"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri casts a lazy glance your way.{/n} \"Can I punch her teeth out?\""
msgstr "{n}아미리는 게으른 눈빛을 당신에게 던집니다.{/n} \"한 대 쳐서 저 여자 이빨을 뽑아버릴까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/DealWithDevil_Brinewall/LinxiaWins/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "99f1c7aa-84af-4448-9ac8-a6bfdd5fab83"
msgid ""
"\"No, that's too much! We didn't help her just to have her threaten us now!\""
msgstr "\"안 돼 너무 심해! 우리는 그녀에게 지금 협박 당하지 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/Barks/CartClickBark_String
msgctxt "54de7bb1-3623-4192-9faa-1c28d839124d"
msgid ""
"A cart that was shrunk to a size of a toy. Judging by the pool of blood "
"under it, someone was unlucky enough to be inside the cart when it shrunk."
msgstr ""
"수레가 장난감 크기로 수축합니다. 그것 밑에 피가 쌓여있는 것으로 판단 할 때 운 나쁜 누군가가 수레가 수축할 때 카트 안에 있었나 "
"봅니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/Barks/NereidBarks_Farewell_String
msgctxt "9c2334ca-cd8b-40c7-abc0-e9b35e5f6563"
msgid "\"Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/Barks/NereidBarks_Return_String
msgctxt "0090b906-25e2-4fd5-9ca2-fe163be1cf5f"
msgid "\"You shouldn't have done that!\""
msgstr "\"넌 그러지 말았어야 했어\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/Barks/PonyClickBark_String
msgctxt "2b4129a0-8128-42fc-847a-168f6efbe039"
msgid ""
"If not for the distinct smell of paint, you would have thought this horse "
"really was magical. However, this doesn't explain its gigantic size…"
msgstr "페인트의 뚜렷한 냄새가 아니라면 이 말은 마술이라고 생각됐을 것입니다. 게다가 이것은 그것의 거대한 크기를 설명하지 않습니다…"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/Barks/TowerClickBark_String
msgctxt "49ac754f-75f2-43e5-bfaa-632163505361"
msgid ""
"Some unknown force erected this tower by balancing crates and barrels atop "
"one another. It's impossible to predict how long this unreliable "
"construction will remain standing."
msgstr ""
"어떤 알려지지 않은 힘이 꼭대기에 상자와 배럴의 아귀를 맞게 해 이 타워를 세웠습니다. 이 불안정한 건축물이 얼마나 오래 서 있을지 "
"예측할 수는 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/Barks/TraderBark_nodialog_String
msgctxt "b142fc06-6d50-4db2-b3f2-968a4cc1357f"
msgid "\"Thank you!\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/Barks/TraderBarks_help1_String
msgctxt "7801e374-cc8a-4db2-bbc2-995743a16cf8"
msgid "\"Help!\""
msgstr "\"도와주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/Barks/TraderBarks_help2_String
msgctxt "11f00e35-e194-46d8-bce0-39f8bd2ea5a2"
msgid "\"Someone! Help!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 도와 줘요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "4ff424b9-e7fa-4fed-9dff-3f841ed11c19"
msgid ""
"\"There's nothing amusing in making others suffer. Can't you see that?\""
msgstr "\"다른 사람의 고통을 보는 것은 재미 없어. 그렇게 생각하지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "67fa6d9c-6c7b-421d-bb60-2ff3779dc8e2"
msgid "[Attack] \"There's nothing to talk about. Prepare to die!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"할 말 없다. 죽을 준비나 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "95ed3c7a-5ef2-4b2d-9782-1160bbeb5cc9"
msgid "Reprimanded the nereid for her cruelty."
msgstr "잔인한 네레이드를 꾸짖었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "ba2979fa-8499-4771-8ddc-fbee8299cd74"
msgid ""
"\"The things you've done cannot be justified. What did these poor souls do "
"to deserve the suffering you put them through?\""
msgstr "\"네가 해온 일들은 정당화 될 수 없어.이 불쌍한 영혼들은 네가 준 고통을 받을 자격이 있었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0023_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0852992a-1882-4155-b47b-ff98eef70a52"
msgid "Demanded the nereid to restore order."
msgstr "네레이드에게 질서를 복구하라고 요구했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "a65291e7-37d4-470c-bdc4-823368ebd762"
msgid ""
"\"I am ruler of these lands, and your acts are against our laws. You must "
"provide reperations, or be brought to justice!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 땅의 통치자다, 그리고 너의 행위는 우리의 법에 위배된다. 넌 배상금을 지불하던지 정의의 심판을 받아야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "c0c4331c-233c-4f04-9836-792bdef86234"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "cbe0a45d-0d25-4b8e-9bd8-4311af1b888c"
msgid "Urged mercy from the nereid."
msgstr "네레이드에게 자비를 요청했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "28d975c2-3f48-403d-aa9c-06546c73f508"
msgid ""
"\"This doesn't mean you should multiply suffering without a good reason. "
"Life is cruel enough as it is. What will this world come to if we aren't "
"merciful to each other?\""
msgstr "\"합당한 이유 없이 고통을 키워서는 안돼. 삶은 그대로 잔인하지. 우리가 서로 자비롭지 않으면 이 세상이 무엇이 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0039_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "453afca9-5558-4188-b6f3-ee038ab1e8c3"
msgid "Suggested the nereid to come up with less cruel jokes."
msgstr "잔인한 장난을 치는 네레이드를 설득했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "aaa1bdec-9f08-43a2-a1ea-c75ea8fe79a1"
msgid ""
"\"Pain, blood, screams for help, smashed bodies... this is no humor, this is "
"unjustified cruelty. Real jests, true humor brings joy. Have you seen any "
"joy on the faces of those unlucky enough to cross your path?\""
msgstr ""
"\"고통, 피, 도움을 청하는 소리, 박살난 시체... 이것은 장난이 아니야. 이것은 부당한 학대야. 진정한 농담, 진정한 유머는 기쁨을 "
"가져다 주지. 너의 길을 지나던 불행한 사람들이 기뻐하는걸 본 적 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "4e39aee1-5775-4bc7-a497-2d6ba5f88e14"
msgid "\"I came to praise you on your fine jest! I found it truly amusing.\""
msgstr "\"네 장난을 칭찬하러 왔어! 정말 흥미롭군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "51a742c8-a224-4f3e-91aa-f91ed750db0d"
msgid "\"That's a... curious point of view.\""
msgstr "\"정말... 특이한 견해로군\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "5c03e781-5782-4384-9e25-3aced3ae77a5"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"If a mark of suffering is what you wish, then prepare yourself.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"고통의 흔적이 원하는 것이라면 준비해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "a9db777e-069a-4cfd-9c16-7f6312c22cf4"
msgid "\"Who are you and what are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구며 여기서 뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "e3969947-59fa-46e3-986f-f0f38a33e1c2"
msgid "\"In your world?\""
msgstr "\"그것이 네 입장인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "1b5a7549-5d9e-4d09-adc7-806e3e9cf84f"
msgid ""
"\"It comes and goes? In our world, if death comes, there's no turning back. "
"You can build towers and paint horses as much as you want, but why should "
"you be so cruel to people?\""
msgstr ""
"\"주고 받는 거라고? 우리 세계에서 죽음은 완전한 끝이야. 원하는 만큼 타워를 만들고 말도 색칠할 수 있지, 하지만 왜 사람들에게 "
"그렇게 잔인하게 구는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "0c7b60b6-5362-48d2-8e82-8623ce40b40f"
msgid ""
"\"So that's who spoiled our fun and killed the guardians we left to watch "
"over our new friend. We didn't invite you to participate in our game, but "
"still you intervened and ruined everything. Why?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 장난를 망치고 우리가 새로운 친구를 감시하기 위해 남겨둔 수호자들을 죽인 게 너 구나. 게임에 초대하지도 않았는데, 네가 "
"끼어들어 다 망쳐버렸어. 왜지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "58686b0c-c797-45b8-9f38-c4ebab9ca646"
msgid ""
"\"Suffering comes and goes. If someone played a trick like that on me, I "
"wouldn't hold a grudge for long... though I'd repay the giver with a joke of "
"my own. The only things of value are those able to leave a mark.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고통은 오고 간다. 만약 누가 날 속이더라도, 나는 오랫동안 원한을 품지는 않아... 그 녀석에게 내 장난을 되갚아주긴 하지만. "
"유일하게 가치있는 일은 표식을 남길 수 있는 것들이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "968236b1-ee5a-4d0a-bba7-cb8a6a6958a5"
msgid ""
"{n}Nereid's face remains indifferent, but you can see some caution in her "
"eyes.{/n} \"Well, if you insist…\""
msgstr "{n}네레이드의 얼굴은 무관심하지만 그녀의 눈에는 경계심이 서려있습니다.{/n} \"글쎄, 네가 말한다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "47fe26e8-322f-41c8-a3fd-e09b98c37a43"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid's careless laughter is clear and fluid, like a swift-running "
"stream.{/n} \"You're as funny as all the others in this world. I knew it was "
"a good idea for us to go on this trip! But anyway, I have little time for "
"your silly threats... you interfered in our game, quite rudely, and now you "
"must pay for that!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드의 부주의한 웃음은 마치 신속하고 유동적인, 빠르게 흐르는 개울과 같았습니다.{/n} \"너는 이 세상의 다른 모든 "
"사람들처럼 재밌구나. 나는 우리가 이 여행을 떠나는 것이 좋은 생각이라는 것을 알고 있었어. 그러나 어쨌든 너의 어리석은 위협을 받아줄 "
"시간이 없어... 너는 우리 놀이를 무례하게 방해했고, 이제 너는 그 대가를 치러야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "258dad8c-1f5b-4e0d-892d-0ae842e0f946"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid gives you a charming smile.{/n} \"No, we won't let you go so "
"soon.\""
msgstr "{n}네레이드는 당신에게 매력적인 미소를 지어 줍니다.{/n} \"아니. 우리는 너를 그렇게 빨리 풀어주지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "b5b701fa-0091-44cc-8415-44fd39d58041"
msgid ""
"{n}From the hill's summit, a slim and miniature woman with dark hair and "
"pale, almost moon-lit skin, is regarding you curiously. There is a light "
"smile on her lips, but her eyes are like the cold depths of an ocean. "
"Judging by her appearance, she can only be a nereid.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}언덕 꼭대기에서 어두운 머리카락과 창백하고 거의 달빛으로 빛나는 피부를 가진 날씬하고 체구가 작은 여성이 당신의 호기심을 사로 잡고 "
"있습니다. 그녀의 입술에는 밝은 미소가 있지만 그녀의 눈은 바다의 차가운 깊이와 같습니다. 그녀의 외모로 판단 할 때 그녀는 네레이드일 "
"수 밖에 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "d321dcee-ab62-4616-b002-d4f75fc3848b"
msgid ""
"\"Well met, stranger. I was told in confidence that our new friend was "
"talking with somebody, and I wanted to see who it was. Did he have time to "
"tell you about the fine joke we played on him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"반갑구나, 이방인. 우리 새 친구가 누군가와 대화하고 있다는 비밀을 듣고 그 사람이 누구인지 알고 싶었어. 우리가 그에게 했던 농담에 "
"대해 말할 시간이 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "5baa7a2b-add8-4a5c-b33c-de5768e2b132"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid gives you a puzzled look.{/n} \"I… never thought about it from "
"that perspective.\""
msgstr "{n}네레이드는 당혹스러운 눈치로 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"나는... 그런 관점에서 생각해보지 않았어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "f80a2ed7-1fdb-4de0-8928-c7556b5ac17f"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid gives you a charming smile.{/n} \"Well, then we won't waste "
"time and continue our trip. But I must warn you — if you lay a finger on "
"this tower, I'll know about it. And I shall be very, very upset. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드는 당신에게 매력적인 미소를 지어 줍니다.{/n} \"그렇다면, 우리는 시간을 낭비하지 않고 여행을 계속할거야. 그러나 나는 "
"당신에게 경고해야 겠어. 이 탑에 손가락 하나만 대도, 나는 알 수 있어. 그러면 난 매우, 매우 화낼거야. 잘있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "e1e6135d-5c49-46e9-bb87-ba287f1ec865"
msgid ""
"\"Unbelievable! And here I thought no one here could appreciate humor. It's "
"nice to know I was wrong.\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없어! 여기는 아무도 유머 감각을 느낄 수 없다고 생각했는데. 내가 틀렸다니 기뻐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "9f9d4fc7-ee2e-47f0-9abc-a32d0623a761"
msgid ""
"\"The only thing that cannot be 'justified' is a brute who destroys "
"something {mf|he|she} didn't build, then starts to lecture and preach until "
"the listener — me — is bored to tears. Now enough talking!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정당화 될 수 없는 것은 {mf|그|그녀}가 스스로 만들지 않은 무언가를 파괴하고는, 청자— 내 —가 질려서 울때까지 강의랑 설교를 "
"하는 짐승 이겠지. 이제 대화는 끝났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "09fce1ec-a0b0-4e61-90f5-3f0ef41968ae"
msgid "\"So be it. I'll fix what can still be fixed.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 하자. 내가 고칠 수 있는건 고칠게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "297a5978-ca13-4806-8cfa-60fb0e7c4685"
msgid "\"It's quite popular in my world.\""
msgstr "\"내 세계에서는 꽤 인기가 있는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "b0cd16a7-cd57-4d32-b000-7dccc0ad000d"
msgid ""
"\"My name will mean nothing to you, and it's unlikely that you'll find a "
"path to my home... In my world, paths change directions too often, Not so "
"long ago my kin was afraid of traveling to your lands. Here we could — "
"hahaha! — die forever, you imagine? However, the Bloom changed everything — "
"death has no more power over us in the places where it appears.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름은 너에게 아무 의미도 없을 거야, 그리고 내 집으로 가는 길을 찾을것 같지도 않고... 길이 너무 자주 방향을 바꾸는 내 "
"세상에서는, 얼마 전까지만 해도 내 친척들이 너희의 땅으로 여행하는 것을 두려워 했어. 여기서 우리는 영원히 죽을 수 있으니까. 하하하! "
"하지만 개화가 모든 것을 바꿔 놓았어. 그것이 나타나는 곳에서, 죽음은 더 이상 우리를 해치지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "e8c4abab-0879-4ce7-818f-03dd597d48c0"
msgid ""
"{n}She laughs softly.{/n} \"Yes. Perhaps you'd like to see it? Well, maybe "
"you will. The barriers between our worlds have become thinner of late… but "
"you can't expect I'll help you travel there, you'll need to find your own "
"way.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 부드럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그래. 아마도 너는 그것을 보고 싶겠지? 아마도 너는 원할 거야. 우리 세계 사이의 장벽은 "
"점점 더 가늘어졌어...하지만 네가 거기 여행하는 것을 내가 돕지는 않아. 너의 길은 네가 찾아야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "5a8f13f4-2b63-4409-82c0-8085ffc3cae7"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid looks at you in astonishment, then confusion.{/n} \"I… I "
"didn't know that…\""
msgstr "{n}네레이드는 놀라움으로 당신을 바라본 다음 혼란을 겪습니다.{/n} \"나는... 그걸 몰랐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "dc902556-8b57-4c13-a12b-f9ce4e71a5c5"
msgid ""
"\"So I decided to come and check out personally, is it true that everything "
"here is so... permanent. In the world of constant changes it's impossible to "
"make a real change — whatever you do, after some time all that remains is "
"memories. Here, on the other hand...\" {n}The nereid goes silent, "
"contemplating.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 나는 개인적으로, 그 모든 것들이.. 영원할지 확인하러 온거고. 끊임없이 변화하는 세상에서, 진정한 변화를 이루는 것은 "
"불가능해. 무엇을 하더라도 얼마 지나면 기억으로만 남아. 다른 한편으로는...\" {n}네레이드는 침묵을 지키며 고민합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "cadc282e-11f7-4684-8429-56b7409f0130"
msgid ""
"\"You were on the right path, but you walked toward the wrong goal! 'Dying "
"for good' — that is what you should strive for! You admit that constant "
"change and all this fuss means nothing? Then repent, reject your vicious "
"curiosity, and admire the world moving toward its end!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자네는 옳은 길을 가고 있었지만, 잘못된 목표를 향해 걸어갔다네! '선하게 사는것' — 이것이 자네가 매진해야 하는 것이지! 끊임없는 "
"변화와 이 모든 싸움은 아무 의미도 없다는 것을 인정하는가? 그러면 회개하라, 악의적인 호기심을 버려라, 세상이 그 끝을 향해 나아 "
"간다는 것을 찬양하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/NereidDialog/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9c124d19-25e8-4bd0-b600-063dc7d7bdc4"
msgid ""
"\"What are you doing, you old fool? That's a fey! Look at her face — she "
"takes everything you say at face value! What if she takes your 'dying for "
"good' idea to some neighboring villages? Then what'll you do?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너 뭐하니 바보야? 그건 페이야! 그녀의 얼굴을 봐. 네가 말한 그대로 똑같잖아! 만약 '영원히 죽는 것'이라는 네 생각을 그녀가 "
"이웃들에게 준다면? 어떻게 할래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "faf5e5df-0534-4632-80f3-b55dca30c657"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4b5907f0-34c0-439f-b950-6cab89e8d871"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "4b5bbf21-9819-4260-bb95-46de3bcebdd9"
msgid "\"I helped you. What about the reward?\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 도왔어. 보상은 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "9d27e2d8-212f-43f4-99fa-eb17a6fd4095"
msgid "\"Hold on, I'll help you.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 너를 도울게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "11f2da44-6261-460a-9d3f-95059499af17"
msgid "\"Well, I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "a46165ce-2da5-4514-9f42-f63ca2c6bc46"
msgid "\"I'll take you down if you pay me.\""
msgstr "\"나한테 돈을 준다면 너를 구해주지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "21e40e21-b835-4ccb-bb5e-d0d7389f98dd"
msgid "\"Wait here, I'll be back soon.\""
msgstr "\"기다려. 돌아올게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f40013c7-71f5-43f9-8d75-facf1d3ec09b"
msgid ""
"Decided to scare the trader stuck on top of a pillar of barrels and crates."
msgstr "배럴과 상자를 쌓은 곳 위에 붙어있는 상인을 겁줬습다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "58c265f3-f4c1-41fc-9933-24e83bd58df1"
msgid "[Lie] \"AAAAAH, A DRAGON! EVERYBODY HIDE!\""
msgstr "[거짓말합니다] \"으아아악!! 드래곤이다!!! 모두 숨어!!!!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0030_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "93dc10fc-e1fd-4074-830e-506d417ec67e"
msgid ""
"Threw a stone at the trader stuck on top of a pillar of barrels and crates."
msgstr "배럴과 상자를 쌓은 곳 위에 붙어있는 상인에게 돌을 던졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "e9f4996a-8bae-4143-9167-aece23eb10be"
msgid "[Throw a stone at the trader] \"Catch!\""
msgstr "[돌을 던집니다] \"맞았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3638a535-8b80-432c-a2de-435c5e54d85f"
msgid ""
"Collapsed the pillar of barrels and crates while the trader was still stuck "
"on top of it."
msgstr "상인이 붙어있는 배럴과 상자를 쌓은 더미를 무너뜨렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "3995bb7e-dd44-4938-9247-01bc8301d72b"
msgid ""
"[Collapse the tower] \"Why should I help you down? I'd prefer to watch you "
"fly!\""
msgstr "[탑을 무너뜨립니다] \"왜 내가 너를 도와야 하지? 네가 떨어지는 꼴을 보겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "045968e8-d054-4781-ac02-6845f881af80"
msgid ""
"Decided to spot for the trader stuck on top of a pillar of barrels and "
"crates."
msgstr "배럴과 상자를 쌓은 곳 위에 붙어있는 상인을 받아냈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "79c0185a-2f17-4c85-9e4d-7acd2434a1b4"
msgid "\"Jump, I'll catch you!\""
msgstr "\"뛰어! 내가 너를 잡을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7e2febf9-7f7c-470f-b878-6e1a6389acb9"
msgid ""
"Decided not to help the trader stuck on top of a pillar of barrels and "
"crates."
msgstr "배럴과 상자를 쌓은 기둥위에 갇힌 상인을 돕지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "c1428fe3-1263-47ea-8346-9fb7e425f489"
msgid ""
"\"Ha-ha, that's spectacular! I'll leave everything as it is, I don't want to "
"ruin such a beauty!\""
msgstr "\"하하 정말 멋지군! 나는 모든 것을 그대로 두고 그런 아름다움을 망치고 싶지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "0a49d144-f503-4fcd-ba0c-bee7942f116f"
msgid "\"Wait a bit, I have to think about it.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 생각 좀 하고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "3aa9be6e-b4a1-4c06-bfe5-27ca78d5dfd2"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "dc068d92-b037-4c95-ad0f-e577f4b7aa90"
msgid "\"What exactly happened here?\""
msgstr "\"정확히 여기서 무슨 일이 있었던 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0059_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f1e19c22-b7f4-41e5-9b45-5ef69dba0f6c"
msgid "Extorted money from the desperate trader."
msgstr "필사적인 상인에게서 돈을 갈취했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "c9256816-d0f3-43cf-8ec7-96337b399f3b"
msgid ""
"\"I'll give you a chance to think it all over and to give me the right "
"answer. Where. Is. My. Money?\""
msgstr "\"나는 너에게 모든 것을 생각하고 정답을 말할 기회를 줄 거야. 내 돈은 어디에 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "5cb1b579-be9a-4ed0-a716-c6b73721e090"
msgid "\"Where can I find the fey who did this?\""
msgstr "\"이런 짓을 한 페이는 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "1412eecf-5ba3-41da-ab56-a0aac0238b3e"
msgid "\"I should go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "e4fda6d4-d0c8-4948-885c-c176bfcd3cf9"
msgid "\"So how did they call this tower, Tamrath?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그들은 이 탑을 뭐라 불렀어, 탐라스?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "a4c7f022-caa3-49ea-9971-10b82d666544"
msgid ""
"{n}A stout middle-aged man is fighting to keep his balance on top of the "
"creaking tower. He's terrified and sweat is running down his face, so much "
"so it's soaked his shirt through.{/n} \"For the sake of all gods, take me "
"down before I break my neck!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}뚱뚱한 중년의 남자가 삐걱 거리는 탑 꼭대기에서 균형을 유지하기 위해 안간힘을 다하고 있습니다. 그는 겁에 질렸고, 그의 얼굴에서 "
"너무 많은 땀이 흘러내려 셔츠까지 흠뻑 젖어 버렸습니다.{/n} \"맙소사. 내 목이 부러지기 전에 나를 내려주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "358187a4-0adb-4f0d-88b0-9065e58520e7"
msgid ""
"\"I'm Tamrath, a paint vendor! I'll be happy to tell you the story of my "
"life after you help me down!\""
msgstr "\"나는 염료 상인 탐라스입니다! 저를 내려가게 도와 주시고 나면 제 사정을 기꺼이 말하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "2cbc861c-af46-4faf-ae3e-d2ff02fc4d30"
msgid ""
"\"Damned fey and their pranks, that's what happened! They sprang from the "
"woods, hexed my horse and cart, killed my coachman, stole my paints, then "
"put me up here…\""
msgstr ""
"\"망할 페이가 장난을 쳐서 이렇게 되었습니다! 숲 속에서 뛰쳐나와 내 말과 짐에 마법을 부리고, 내 마부를 죽이고, 내 염료를 "
"훔치고는, 나를 여기로 올려놓았어요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "311b998a-93ad-402e-a0ae-03be8c9a214c"
msgid ""
"\"Garland just couldn't stop rearing, he was so scared. And Avim couldn't "
"take it anymore... he loved Garland so much.\" {n}The vendor is silent for a "
"moment, his face pained.{/n} \"Avim, oh Avim, we've been through so much "
"together…\""
msgstr ""
"\"가랜드는 너무 커졌고, 그는 겁에 질렸었어요. 그리고 아빔은 더 이상 그를 감당할 수 없었죠... 그는 가랜드를 너무나 사랑했어요.\""
" {n}상인은 잠시 침묵을 지켰으며 그의 얼굴은 고통스러워 보입니다.{/n} \"아빔, 오 아빔. 우리는 많은 것을 함께했었는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0018_Text_String
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "1b05cc7f-d710-4fc5-8317-5f9d6b4d3aaf"
msgid ""
"{n}Tamrath tries to steady himself and prepares to jump — as he does, the "
"makeshift tower begins to sway dangerously. With a yelp, Tamrath leaps as "
"the tower begins to tumble down, crates falling everywhere. You extend your "
"arms forward to catch him...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}탐라스는 자신을 안정시키고 점프 할 준비를 합니다. 그가 뛰려고 할 때, 임시 탑이 위험하게 흔들리기 시작합니다. 비명과 함께 "
"탐라스가 도약했고, 동시에 탑이 무너지기 시작합니다. 당신은 팔을 뻗어 그를 잡으려 합니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "ae3c1ab1-8fc6-43cf-ad34-2d645efbc42a"
msgid ""
"\"Thank the gods, I'm saved! Thank you, too! If only poor Avim was as "
"lucky...\" {n}The vendor throws a glance at the blood pooling beneath the "
"miniature cart.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"신이시여, 감사합니다. 난 살았어! 당신도 감사합니다! 불쌍한 아빔도 운이 좋았더라면...\" {n}상인은 소형 수레 아래에 있는 "
"피웅덩이를 쳐다 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "9ab7a554-5a2d-401c-8dc0-737912b928ea"
msgid ""
"{n}Suddenly you hear branches rustle and noise from the nearby bushes, "
"becoming louder and louder.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}갑자기 당신은 가지가 움직이는 소리와 덤불 속의 소리가 커지는 것을 듣습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "824cdb40-62ca-457c-b121-254c94085047"
msgid "\"I'll pay, I'll give you everything I have, just get me down!\""
msgstr "\"내가 지불하겠습니다. 내가 가진 모든 것을 주겠어요. 그냥 내려 주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "dc617684-3f00-4730-a499-ebc2aed11e02"
msgid "\"{g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} be praised, finally!\""
msgstr "\"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}시여 감사합니다. 마침내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "6d88fa26-d22b-448f-9ae7-4b23047762b9"
msgid "\"What are you doing? Don't! AAAAA!\""
msgstr "\"뭐하는 거죠? 그러지 말아요! 으악!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "fca96097-9316-4e90-9204-ab0e00de53c9"
msgid ""
"{n}The vendor screams, startled, and covers his head with his hands. After a "
"moment, realizing he's been fooled, he desperately tries to regain his "
"balance.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}염료 상인은 비명을 지르고 깜짝 놀란 채 손으로 머리를 감쌉니다. 잠시 후 그는 자신이 속았다는 것을 깨닫고 필사적으로 균형을 "
"되찾으려고 노력합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "7152403c-bd93-428b-9877-46cc5f789ffd"
msgid "\"You really mean it?!\""
msgstr "\"이러기에요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "6f6a3e38-ea86-4d53-b4cf-a7aee8bb60d8"
msgid ""
"{n}The stone flies straight and true and hits the vendor on the shoulder. "
"With a scream, the man loses his balance and looks about to fall.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}돌은 똑바로 날아 염료 상인 어깨를 때립니다. 비명을 지르면서 남자는 균형을 잃고 넘어지기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "dc3afb18-3e4e-4317-9c30-ec51c079730e"
msgid ""
"{n}The vendor dodges your badly-aimed throw and manages to keep his balance "
"on the top of the tower. His eyes are wide with terror.{/n} \"Are you mad?! "
"Is that the best you could come up with?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}염료상인은 나쁘게 던진 돌을 피하고 탑의 정상에서 그의 균형을 지킵니다. 그의 눈은 공포와 함께 넓어집니다.{/n} \"미쳤어? "
"그게 당신이 할 수 있는 최선이야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0042_Text_String
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "e8841c33-e730-4002-8cf6-8097ce7f6900"
msgid ""
"\"Oh...\" {n}Man's face becomes paler with every passing second.{/n} \"All "
"right, Tamrath, pull yourself together… One… two… three!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오...\" {n}남자의 얼굴은 매 순간 더 창백해집니다.{/n} \"좋아. 탐라스. 정신을 가다듬고... 하나... 둘... 셋!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "a96d467f-3753-454a-ae49-071ed59ae1b6"
msgid "\"For goodness sake, think faster!\""
msgstr "\"세상에. 빨리 생각해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "42488070-3e19-4bfe-b5d8-b1f294195597"
msgid ""
"{n}…and he falls to the ground awkwardly. Rubbing his shoulder and wincing, "
"the merchant gets to his feet.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}... 그리고 그는 어설프게 땅에 떨어집니다. 어깨를 문지르며 움찔거리는 상인은 일어섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "a3c11041-0fbc-4e4d-91dc-69f8268762b2"
msgid "\"Don't go! Please, don't leave me alone here!\""
msgstr "\"가지 말아요. 제발 여기에 나를 내버려 두지 마세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "ddec764e-17a8-4cac-8e13-f78f2316697f"
msgid ""
"{n}Deathly-pale and horrified, the vendor gets to his feet and stands "
"silently, staring at his shoulder that now looks… crooked. It seems he's "
"broken his collarbone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}소름 끼치게 창백한 얼굴에 공포심이 어려 염료 상인은 조용하게 일어서서 그의 비뚤어진 어깨를 빤히 쳐다 보았습니다... 그의 쇄골이 "
"부러진 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "500a4e8a-7f8c-4926-85ec-83ef5977f6ff"
msgid ""
"\"You could have helped me down more gently... though beggars can't be "
"choosers! Gods be witness, I'm luckier than poor Avim...\" {n}The vendor "
"throws a glance at the blood pooling beneath the miniature cart.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"좀 더 조심스럽게 도와주시지... 하긴, 내 처지에 무슨! 신께서 보셨 듯 나는 불쌍한 아빔보단 운이 좋습니다...\" {n}상인은 "
"소형 수레 아래에 있는 피웅덩이를 쳐다 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "cfd4c5dc-efb7-46b9-a714-6cce45453d03"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. I'm Tamrath, from {g|Galt}Galt{/g}, and I make my living "
"selling paints — I buy them in the city and then travel to villages in the "
"area, selling them. Everybody wins — the peasants don't have to travel to "
"the city, and I provide for my family.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋아요. 나는 탐라스입니다. {g|Galt}갈트{/g}에서 왔고 염료를 판매하며 삽니다. 나는 도시에서 염료를 사서 지역의 마을로 "
"여행하며 염료를 팔지요. 농민들은 도시로 여행 할 필요가 없으며 나는 가족을 부양하니 모두가 이익입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "159600c6-dd2e-4245-aef0-13aa88d4747b"
msgid ""
"\"I was carrying my wares to the neighboring village. I've heard strange "
"stories of odd happenings on this road, but I didn't listen, the old fool "
"that I am. My coachman Avim and I were barely halfway to the village when a "
"crowd of fey sprang out of the woods, laughing and encircled us... and... we "
"didn't stand a chance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이웃 마을로 물건을 싣고 가던 중이었습니다. 이 길 주변에서 일어나는 소문들을 들었지만, 나는 바보 같은 말들이라 치부했었죠. "
"마부 아빔과 내가 마을까지 반절도 채 가기 전에 페이 한 무리가 숲에서 뛰쳐나오더니, 깔깔대면서 우리를 둘러쌌습니다... 그리고... "
"우리에겐 가망이 없었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "bc1b62ad-d205-486b-8ff7-e64a15e2e88c"
msgid ""
"\"They started to rummage through the cart. Then... I could scarcely believe "
"it... they began building this ridiculous tower, arguing about what they "
"should call it. But while they were building it, one of the crates fell and "
"cracked open... and the paints, they were fascinated by them. But... they "
"couldn't find a canvas, so they decided to paint our poor horse, Garland — "
"they made him huge with their magic and started to color him — each in their "
"own way...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 수레를 뒤적거리기 시작했습니다. 그러더니... 나는 그것 거의 믿을수 없었어요, 그들은 이 터무니없는 탑을 짓기 시작했고, "
"그것을 뭐라고 부르는지에 대해 논쟁했습니다. 그러나 그걸 만드는 동안, 한 상자가 떨어지면서 부서져 열렸고... 그들을 염료에 "
"매료되었습니다. 하지만... 그들은 캔버스를 찾을 수 없었죠. 그래서 그들은 우리 불쌍한 말 가랜드를 칠하기로 결정했어요. 그들은 내 "
"말을 마법으로 거대하게 만들더니, 자기 방식대로 색칠하기 시작했습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "142f0b64-c177-4bc3-b8f5-4ee723cb9649"
msgid ""
"\"Long story short, Avim broke free and tried to drive the fey away. That's "
"when Garland fled. The fey were ready to kill poor Avim where he stood, but "
"the woman who led them proposed 'a joke' instead... before I knew it, they "
"had put me on top of the tower, so I couldn't disturb them. And then they "
"stuffed poor Avim into the cart with the remainder of the boxes... and then "
"shrunk the cart...\" {n}Tamrath swallows.{/n} \"...but not Avim.\""
msgstr ""
"\"요약하자면, 아빔은 자유를 되찾자마자 페이를 쫓아내려 했습니다. 그 순간 가랜드가 도망갔어요. 페이는 아빔을 죽일 준비가 되어있지만, "
"대장으로 보이는 것이 동료들에게 '장난'을 제안했습니다... 내가 깨닫기도 전에, 그들은 탑 꼭대기에 나를 올려두었고, 나는 그들을 막을 "
"수 없었죠. 그리고 그들은 나머지 상자와 함께 불쌍한 아빔을 수레에 가두었습다... 그리고는 수레를 축소시켰어요...\" {n}탐라스는 "
"침을 삼켰습니다.{/n} \"...아빔만 빼고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "3b1afc5b-3cdc-4387-8c8f-78b3061d6b28"
msgid ""
"{n}Tamrath smiles uncertainly.{/n} \"You see, all my goods were shrunk with "
"the cart... but if you help me dispel the enchantment on the cart, I'll "
"reward you right away, and generously, too.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}탐라스는 머뭇거리며 웃습니다.{/n} \"보시다시피 모든 물품이 수레와 함꼐 축소되었습니다... 하지만 수레에 걸린 마법을 풀도록 "
"도와준다면, 즉시 후한 보답을 드리겠습니다..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "6ac76803-ea08-4716-aaa7-f3cfc5640013"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you to have mercy on me! You can't leave me to this horrible fate! "
"Please, help me down!\""
msgstr "\"나에게 자비를 베풀어 주세요. 나는 이 끔찍한 운명에 나를 버려 둘 수 없어요! 제발 나를 도와줘요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0064_Text_String
msgctxt "c491f173-921d-4c3a-8bfa-6027211dfb36"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you to have mercy on me! You can't leave me to this horrible fate! "
"Please, help me down!\""
msgstr "\"나에게 자비를 베풀어 주세요. 나는 이 끔찍한 운명에 나를 버려 둘 수 없어요! 제발 나를 도와줘요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "148aae86-2a01-4cd8-b36a-d9bc5e408745"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you! I dread to imagine what could have happened to me, if not for "
"you. Please take this as a sign of my gratitude!\""
msgstr "\"고맙습니다! 당신이 아니라면 내게 일어날 수 있는 일을 상상하기도 싫군요. 내 감사의 표시로 이것을 받아주세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "3e512a99-7054-4ec9-84c2-b0c78f94e064"
msgid "{n}The vendor winces.{/n} \"Temple of Solitary Contemplation.\""
msgstr "{n}염료 상인이 움찔합니다.{/n} \"고독한 묵상의 사원.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "4fc0ffc2-e81c-4072-a09b-5370b4e41e56"
msgid ""
"\"Besides, after the fey were gone, this ring appeared in my pocket… I guess "
"you deserve it more than I.\""
msgstr "\"게다가, 페이가 떠난 후에 이 반지가 내 주머니에 나타났습니다... 당신이 이것을 마땅히 받아야 한다고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "87feaa04-8e00-47d2-91ad-e22a818049e1"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok's jaw drops as he eyes the tall construction with a puzzled look. "
"A moment later, he bursts out laughing, pointing his finger and stomping "
"fitfully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 턱이 떨어지고 큰 건축물을 당황하는 눈빛으로 봅니다. 잠시 후 그는 손가락으로 가리키고 바닥을 치며 폭소를 "
"터뜨립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_AcrobatBluffSuccess_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "26e92016-c895-42cb-8a54-e743413ed723"
msgid ""
"{n}…and you succeed. Struggling with the effort, you set the vendor on the "
"ground as best as you can.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}... 당신은 성공합니다. 노력해서 당신은 최대한 조심스레 땅에 상인을 놓았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_AcrobatFail_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "eacff487-64c7-4fcd-8dc8-f87d9aa5c48d"
msgid ""
"{n}…but the vendor proves too heavy, and you collapse on the ground with "
"him. Despite the awkward landing, it looks like Tamrath is safe and sound. "
"With a relieved sigh, he gets to his feet and brushes off his clothes, then "
"turns to you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}...행상인이 너무 무겁다는 것을 증명하듯, 당신은 그와 함께 땅에 쓰러집니다. 어색한 착륙에도 불구하고 탐라스는 안전하고 건강한 "
"것처럼 보입니다. 안도의 한숨과 함께 일어나 그의 옷을 털고 당신을 돌아봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_BrokeTower_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "013908e1-e82a-4115-9ca0-241c7b8734c4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tumbling through the air, the vendor hits the ground, landing on his "
"elbow with a crack.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}공중에서 구르면서 상인는 착지하면서 팔꿈치가 깨집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/FeyPranksters/TraderDialog/Cue_TowerFall_Text
#. Speaker : PoorTrader
msgctxt "b3d321a4-259e-4382-9787-41c5407d26c0"
msgid ""
"{n}The tower sways and starts to collapse. Crates and barrels tumble down, "
"shattering and scattering their contents across the ground. With a cry, the "
"merchant falls as well...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}탑이 흔들리고 붕괴하기 시작합니다. 상자와 배럴은 땅에 떨어지면서 내용물이 산산조각 나고 여기저기 튑니다. 외침과 함께 상인도 또한 "
"떨어집니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemIronLair/CowardDiary_name_String
msgctxt "1a607624-a1ad-4fdc-8ba5-d0b3d3c1d21b"
msgid "Dead Man's Note from the Charred Ruins"
msgstr "까맣게 그을린 유적지에서 죽은 사람의 메모"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemIronLair/CowardDiary_text_String
msgctxt "b9a5810c-affc-437d-80be-cab34f54d4dd"
msgid ""
"\"I need to name the golem. If I'm destined to die here with it, I'd like to "
"at least have the illusion that I won't be alone in my hour of death.\n"
"It's quiet outside. Maybe the creature left? Or is it just waiting?\n"
"It came at night. Its black scales blended in with the starless darkness. No "
"one noticed anything until the darkness moved and brought a cloud of "
"suffocating acid mist down on us. I thought I was the smart one when I ran "
"away and locked myself in the dungeon instead of fighting. This dungeon was "
"built to endure dangerous magical experiments – it can stand up to anything, "
"even a dragon attack. But it looks like I was just fooling myself. I'm "
"locked inside an extremely safe dungeon within the ruins of a building that "
"was destroyed by the dragon lying on top of it. Even with the golem's help, "
"clearing the debris would take at least a month. I'll die of thirst long "
"before that.\n"
"We knew there was a powerful female black dragon somewhere in these lands. "
"She used the entirety of the River Kingdoms as her hunting grounds, and she "
"wreaked death wherever she appeared. I even know her name: Ilthuliak. I "
"think the scary stories I was told as a child must have been about her. I'll "
"actually die because of a magical monster — how poetic!\n"
"I'm tired of writing. All right, golem, I'll call you Ilth. Let's try to "
"clear out this heap. It's my only chance, I suppose.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 골렘의 이름을 지어야 한다. 만약 내가 여기서 죽을 운명이라면 적어도 내가 죽는 내 시간에는 혼자가 되지 않는다는 환상이라도 "
"갖고 싶다.\n"
"밖은 조용하다. 어쩌면 그 생물은 떠났을까? 아니면 그냥 기다리고 있나?\n"
"그것은 밤에 왔다. 그 검은 비늘은 칠흑빛과 섞여있다. 어둠이 찾아오고 우리를 질식시키는 산성 미스트의 구름을 이 올 때까지 아무도 눈치 "
"채지 못했다. 내가 싸우지 않고 도망 가 지하 감옥에 나를 가두었을 때 나는 스스로를 자랑스러워했다. 이 지하 감옥은 위험한 마법 실험을 "
"견뎌 내기 위해 만들어졌다. 그것은 무엇이든 용의 공격까지 견딜 수 있다. 그러나 이는 단지 자신을 속이는 것처럼 보인다. 나는 그 위에 "
"용이 누워 파괴 된 건물의 폐허가 된 매우 안전한 지하 감옥 안에 갇혀 있다. 골렘의 도움을 받더라도 잔해를 청소하는 데 적어도 한 달은 "
"걸릴 것이다. 나는 오래 전에 그 갈증으로 죽을 것이다.\n"
"우리는 이 땅에 어딘가 강력한 암컷 검은 용이 있다는 것을 알았다. 그녀는 강의 왕국들 전체를 사냥터로 사용했으며 그녀가 나타난 곳마다 "
"죽음을 선사했다. 나는 심지어 그녀의 이름이 일수리악임을 알고 있다. 나는 내가 어린 시절 들은 무서운 이야기가 그녀에 관한 것이 틀림 "
"없다고 생각한다. 나는 마법의 괴물 때문에 죽을 것이다. 얼마나 시적인지!\n"
"나는 글쓰기가 지겨워졌다. 골렘을 일쓰라 불러야겠다. 이 더미를 치우자. 내 유일한 기회니까. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemIronLair/GolemAttack_bark_String
msgctxt "51a17dba-5367-4fab-b57f-154b968760f3"
msgid "\"Priority task: guard master's possessions.\""
msgstr "\"우선 과제: 마스터의 소지품을 지킨다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemIronLair/Skeleton_infobark_String
msgctxt "cf615c9b-2d79-4ed0-a751-1fff69c3e0e1"
msgid "These bones belong to someone dead for more than a hundred years."
msgstr "이 뼈는 백 년 이상 죽은 사람의 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemStoneLair/HorseBones_bark_String
msgctxt "d9dd4cd0-496d-4a8b-a567-92058056f61e"
msgid "Wolves got to the poor horse, harnessed to the cart as it was."
msgstr "늑대는 수레를 짊어진 말에게 달려듭니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemStoneLair/MageCorpse_bark_String
msgctxt "d8ea9481-cbf5-4a57-80e5-08f35f3051be"
msgid ""
"The dead wizard looks strangely peaceful. You see no wounds or bites on the "
"body."
msgstr "죽은 마법사는 이상하게 평화로워 보입니다. 몸에 상처나 혈흔이 보이지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemStoneLair/MageLetter_name_String
msgctxt "4e0efe00-594b-4184-a771-a3fc50896f42"
msgid "Unsent Letter"
msgstr "보내지 않은 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemStoneLair/MageLetter_text_String
msgctxt "7a7302ab-60ea-4ffc-825d-016a0cb8313d"
msgid ""
"\"My darling! I'm writing this while taking a rest stop in the Glenebon "
"wilderness. Don't be surprised, but I finally decided to get out of Pitax. "
"I'll miss the 'magical' potion dear Kharne Vereel sells, but that's fine – I "
"brought a supply of it with me! It'll come in handy when we celebrate our "
"reunion.\n"
"As for my homeland... things are getting worse and worse there. Irovetti's "
"appetites grow, the guards are fighting with the thieves' guild, the old "
"Trade Houses keep making new schemes, and even the Academy of the Arts has "
"been said to have some new free-thinkers appearing from time to time. I'm "
"sure that pot will boil over sooner or later, and I'd prefer not to be there "
"when it does. I also look forward to seeing you! In the meantime...\"\n"
"The letter cuts off here."
msgstr ""
"\"내 사랑! 글레네본 황야를 지나며 이 글을 남겨요. 놀라지 말아요, 마침내 나도 피탁스에서 벗어났답니다! 칸 베릴이 판매하는 '약'이 "
"그리워지겠지만 괜찮아요. 여분을 가져왔거든요! 다시 만나거든 이 '약'으로 함께 축하하기로 해요.\n"
"조국은... 상황이 점점 악화되고 있어요. 이로베티의 야욕 때문이죠. 도시 경비는 도둑 길드와 사사건건 대립하고, 옛 무역 회사는 "
"언제나처럼 악랄한 계략을 꾸며요. 이로베티의 광대라는 예술 아카데미조차도 자유사상가가 생겨나고 있대요. 정말, 무슨 일이 터져도 이상하지 "
"않은 상황이죠. 나 같은 사람도 사고의 중심에 놓이는 일만은 피해야겠다는 생각이 들더라고요. 여하간 당신을 만날 날이 기대되네요! "
"그때까지... \"\n"
"편지가 여기서 끊어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/GolemStoneLair/WolfCorpse_bark_String
msgctxt "f4bc6634-828c-4891-9f04-bec84aa65861"
msgid ""
"It looks like the wolves wanted to eat the wizard's body, but they couldn't "
"make it past the golem."
msgstr "늑대들이 마법사의 시체를 먹고 싶어했으나 골렘을 지나칠 수는 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclop/Barks/DeadRobel_Click_String
msgctxt "9a77cc7b-8567-4b1e-895e-b6056960c8a3"
msgid ""
"This poor lad was smashed against the stone with tremendous force. Whatever "
"killed him, it was much larger and stronger than a wolf."
msgstr "이 가난한 청년은 엄청난 힘이 실린 돌에 박살났습니다. 그를 죽인 것은 무엇이든 그것은 늑대보다 훨씬 크고 강했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclop/Barks/DeadSoldier_Click_String
msgctxt "65a7a9a5-544f-4661-8b27-ced4f71f2ff3"
msgid ""
"This lad couldn't have been much past sixteen. His bloodstained face is a "
"mask of horror."
msgstr "이 젊은이는 16 세를 넘지 못했습니다. 그의 피 묻은 얼굴은 공포에 질렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclop/Barks/DeadSoldiers_Click_String
msgctxt "749ef046-aaea-49d6-82b1-2e63e283b3bb"
msgid ""
"It seems these poor sods met their deaths as they tried to escape. Their "
"armor and weapons are in poor condition."
msgstr "이 불쌍한 녀석들은 도망치다 죽은 것처럼 보입니다. 그들의 갑옷과 무기는 망가졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclop/Items/Letter_OnDeadSoldier_Name_String
msgctxt "130e18f6-4895-4003-bccc-1a754d02ce13"
msgid "Bloodstained Letter"
msgstr "피 묻은 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclop/Items/Letter_OnDeadSoldier_String
msgctxt "993f42aa-6f33-46c3-aa74-2c25eec804d7"
msgid ""
"\"Robel,\n"
"You made it through selection! By this letter, I appoint you headman of the "
"'Alazar Wolves.' Congratulations!\n"
"We've just received new orders: herdsmen from local villages held a whip-"
"round for money and hired us to kill the cyclops that's been ravaging their "
"herds for the last several years. It's not much money, but this is a good "
"and proper deed. Our key advantage lies in our numbers, so we should engage "
"the cyclops on open ground. We can't let him hole up in his lair.\n"
"Your objective is simple — gather the rest of recruits near the cave in the "
"Narlmarches. Draw out the cyclops and lead him to the meadow, where our main "
"forces will surround and neutralize him. I'll brief you on the details when "
"we meet. I'm counting on you!\n"
"Captain Alazar\""
msgstr ""
"\"로벨,\n"
"당신은 선발을 통과했습니다! 이 편지를 통해 당신을 '알라자르 늑대'의 우두머리로 임명합니다. 축하합니다!\n"
"우리는 방금 새로운 명령을 받았습니다: 시골 마을의 목동들이 돈을 모아 우리를 고용해 지난 몇 년 동안 그들의 양떼를 약탈한 싸이클롭스를 "
"죽여달라고 합니다. 그것은 많은 돈이 아니지만 이것은 훌륭하고 적절한 행위입니다. 우리의 핵심 이점은 우리의 머리수에 있어서 우리는 "
"싸이클롭스를 넓은 평야에 참전시켜야 합니다. 우리는 그의 은신처에서 그가 숨게 하면 안됩니다.\n"
"당신의 목표는 간단합니다. 날마치의 동굴 근처에서 나머지 신병들을 모으십시오. 싸이클롭스를 끌어 와서 그를 초원으로 인도하십시오. 여기서 "
"우리의 주력이 그를 둘러싸고 제압할 것입니다. 우리가 만날 때 나는 당신에게 세부 사항에 대해 간단히 설명 할 것입니다. 나는 당신을 "
"믿습니다!\n"
"대장 알라자르\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Barks/Alazar_String
msgctxt "d22ea98e-5e98-4890-92b6-6829fff01f87"
msgid ""
"A well-dressed and well-armed man. His pale face still holds an expression "
"of surprise and fear."
msgstr "잘 차려 입고 잘 무장 한 남자입니다. 그의 창백한 얼굴에는 아직도 놀라움과 두려움의 표정이 남아 있다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Barks/BrokenCyclopColumn_Click_String
msgctxt "b34d415f-471a-4d55-a30c-56cfbe37ac3a"
msgid ""
"It seems the cyclops smashed the pillar, trying to hit the workers. The "
"pillar's base has a picture of a giant with a ram's head, a swarm of flies "
"breaking out of its single gouged eye."
msgstr ""
"싸이클롭스가 기둥을 박살 내고 노동자들을 공격하려는 것 같습니다. 기둥의 하부에는 거대한 숫양의 머리를 그려 놓았고 그 일그러진 눈에서 "
"파리 떼가 벗어납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Barks/BrokenCyclopsColumn_ClickCheckSuccess_String
msgctxt "97cd29fb-8be0-4f90-906c-86ec9f4c10a7"
msgid ""
"It looks like this pillar is unfixable. The head of a ram is engraved on it, "
"with a swarm of flies breaking out of its single gouged eye. This represents "
"the Horseman of Pestilence — the archdaemon who sits on the Throne of Flies "
"and one of the four rulers of Abaddon."
msgstr ""
"이 기둥은 고칠 수 없어보입니다. 숫양의 머리 부분이 그 위에 새겨져 있으며 파리 떼가 하나의 일그러진 눈에서 빠져 나옵니다. 이는 "
"역병의 기수를 상징합니다 — 아바돈의 4명의 통치자 중 한 명이자 파리의 왕좌에 앉은 자이며 아크다이몬입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Barks/Cart_Traces_String
msgctxt "47cbde36-b69a-4261-b08c-23203f627485"
msgid ""
"Cart wheel tracks. By the look of them, the cart was leaving in a hurry."
msgstr "카트 바퀴 자국. 보아 하니 카트는 서둘러 떠나고 있었다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Barks/CaveEntrance_Click_String
msgctxt "160f87b3-a06f-4d93-a3e7-55ae57889b04"
msgid ""
"Bones, skulls, rotten hides... There's nothing of interest in this tiny cave."
msgstr "뼈, 두개골, 썩은 가죽...이 작은 동굴에는 별게 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Barks/Cyclop_Battle_String
msgctxt "173d1c70-d788-49bc-b689-5c7d511db7fc"
msgid "\"Thieves! Go! Go away! My pillar!\""
msgstr "\"도둑들! 저리가! 내 기둥!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Barks/DeadWorker_Click_String
msgctxt "5b377430-6aa5-476a-a1cb-de93e9dfb1d9"
msgid "These workers didn't stand a chance."
msgstr "이 일꾼들은 가망이 없다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Items/List_AlazarName_String
msgctxt "57b400a5-2753-4993-aff2-46d3bc23c951"
msgid "Crumpled Sheet of Paper"
msgstr "구겨진 종잇장"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/LoneCyclopCave/Items/List_Alazar_String
msgctxt "f11d74d6-d4e9-4679-bab9-984b34cfc75b"
msgid ""
"\"EXPEDITION ESTIMATE\n"
"Money Received:\n"
"From Tikhur, collector of antiquities — 500 silver coins\n"
"From local herdsmen to kill the cyclops — 50 silver coins\n"
"Total — 550 silver coins\n"
"Estimated Expenses:\n"
"Pillar transportation to Tikhur\n"
"5 handymen — 5 silver coins per day\n"
"Cart and driver — 2 silver coins per day\n"
"Guards\n"
"10 professional mercenaries (full advance payment) — 10 silver coins per "
"day\n"
"Compensation for equipment loss — 25 silver coins\n"
"Compensation to families of the deceased — 70 silver coins (each!)\n"
"Or...\n"
"10 villagers -\"recruits\" (only small advance) — 1 silver coin per day\n"
"10 wooden poles — 0!\n"
"1 town simpleton -\"headman\" (only small advance) — 2 silver coins per day\n"
"1 short spear — 10 silver coins\n"
"At first when Tikhur approached me, I was going to refuse this unprofitable "
"job. However, if I save on guards, I'll be able to keep a pretty sum. No "
"reason to pay for professional monster hunters if common recruits can draw "
"the cyclops far enough — then the workers can dig and load the pillar in the "
"cart. And the payment from the herdsmen is small, but a nice addition!\n"
"I have no idea why that savage would be so attached to his Koloran thing. "
"Indistinct recollections of the former glory of his race? Rudimentary "
"aesthetic perception of the world? Or maybe he just recognized himself in "
"the bas-relief?\""
msgstr ""
"\"견적서\n"
"받은 돈:\n"
"유물 수집가 틱쿠르에게 — 은화 500개\n"
"사이클롭스를 죽여달라는 지역 목동에게 — 은화 50개\n"
"총계 — 은화 550개\n"
"예상 비용:\n"
"틱쿠르에게 기둥 배달\n"
"가사 도우미 5명 — 일당 은화 5개\n"
"수레꾼 — 일당 은화 2개\n"
"경비원\n"
"10명의 전문 용병 (선급 일시불) — 일당 은화 10개\n"
"장비 손실 보상 — 은화 25개\n"
"고인의 가족에 대한 보상 — 은화 70개 (각각!)\n"
"아니면...\n"
"10명의 마을 주민 — \"신병\" (선급 일부 지불) - 일당 은화 1개\n"
"나무 기둥 10개 — 0!\n"
"얼간이 1명 — \"대장\" (선급 일부 지불) —일당 은화 2개\n"
"짧은 창 1개 — 은화 10개\n"
"틱쿠르가 처음 나에게 왔을 때, 나는 이 무익한 일을 거절하려 했다. 그러나 경비원에 들어가는 돈을 줄이면 꽤 많은 이익을 얻을 수 "
"있다. 일반 신병으로 싸이클롭스를 충분히 끌어낼 수 있다면 전문 괴물 사냥꾼에게 돈을 지불 할 이유가 없다 —그러면 노동자는 땅을 파고 "
"수레에 기둥을 적재 할 수 있다. 목동들로부터 지불은 작지만, 여전히 짭짤하다!\n"
"나는 왜 그 야만인이 콜로란의 물건에 그렇게 빠져 있는지 전혀 모른다. 그의 종족이 누린 예전 영광에 대한 불명확한 회상인가? 세계에 "
"대한 기초적인 미적 인식인가? 어쩌면 얕은 돋을새김에서 자신의 이름을 발견했을지도?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/ForGlobalMap_Puzzle45_description_String
msgctxt "1c5956fc-6de8-46a5-8bad-89bbc1089d44"
msgid "A group of megaliths with strange symbols seems to be long abandoned."
msgstr "이상한 상징을 가진 거석 무리는 오랫동안 버려진 것처럼 보인다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/ForGlobalMap_Puzzle45_name_String
msgctxt "b51e2d73-a791-402c-ab92-1f88602c7af7"
msgid "Mysterious Shrine"
msgstr "신비한 성소"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/Puzzle45_EnviromentalBark_1_String
msgctxt "dc691089-e41b-408f-8ee7-735e4a9e5a00"
msgid ""
"The nearly erased inscription reads: \"The night is dark, my queen. Dark as "
"your heart. Dark as the despair that consumed our lives when we killed you.\""
msgstr ""
"거의 지워진 글의 내용: \"밤은 어둡습니다 여왕님. 당신의 마음만큼이나 어둡습니다. 우리가 당신을 죽였을 때 우리의 삶을 좀먹었던 "
"절망만큼이나 어둡습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/Puzzle45_EnviromentalBark_2_String
msgctxt "c49d6549-d813-4b99-9110-61f9d6da56b5"
msgid ""
"The nearly erased inscription reads: \"Sleep well, my queen. Rest in your "
"endless sleep, and let us, the betrayers, have dreams in your stead.\""
msgstr ""
"거의 지워진 글의 내용: \"편히 잠드십시오, 여왕님. 영원한 잠에서 휴식을 취하시고, 우리를, 배신자들을 당신에 자리에서 꿈꾸게 "
"해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/Puzzle45_EnviromentalBark_3_String
msgctxt "4f53e627-8baf-4eb2-bd12-ba04a2af1a75"
msgid ""
"The nearly erased inscription reads: \"Time erases the blood spilled here, "
"but our grief lives on, my queen.\""
msgstr "거의 지워진 글의 내용: \"시간이 피가 쏟은 자리를 지우지만, 우리의 슬픔은 살아있습니다. 여왕님..\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/Puzzle45_EnviromentalBark_4_String
msgctxt "722a3528-462f-482f-beef-b1d2af59443d"
msgid ""
"The nearly erased inscription reads: \"You won't forgive us, my queen. "
"Neither will we.\""
msgstr "거의 지워진 글의 내용: \"우리를 용서하지 못하시겠지요, 여왕님. 우리도 마찬가지입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/Puzzle45_EnviromentalBark_5_String
msgctxt "4a11c051-13e0-4d88-9476-08c3d9c0b15f"
msgid ""
"The nearly erased inscription reads: \"Farewell, my queen. Death was the "
"best gift we could give you.\""
msgstr "거의 지워진 글의 내용: \"안녕히 계십시오, 여왕님. 죽음은 우리가 줄 수 있는 최고의 선물이었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/RavenaDies_String
msgctxt "bacd798a-568d-4802-a30b-8d83a38919c4"
msgid "\"Don't even hope you've gotten rid of me.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 나를 없앴다고 믿기조차 싫어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/RavenaStartBark_1_String
msgctxt "622607e4-d432-456e-8b28-f111ad25acce"
msgid ""
"\"Don't leave! The megaliths… They must be placed in the correct order. This "
"will loosen my chains.\""
msgstr "\"가지마! 거석이... 올바른 순서대로 배치되어야 해. 그러면 내 족쇄가 느슨해 질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/RavenaStartBark_2_String
msgctxt "6eb1ed31-e870-4706-a7f6-967bb0eab692"
msgid "\"I was betrayed by my faithful. Now I seek help from a stranger.\""
msgstr "\"나는 부하들에게 배반 당했어. 이제는 낯선 사람에게서 도움을 구하는 처지야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/Ravena_UnitName02_String
msgctxt "51ee0379-622c-48d2-9d8a-63acf2616d6c"
msgid "Queen Ravena"
msgstr "여왕 라브나"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Barks/Ravena_UnitName_String
msgctxt "b63a1299-4b51-425f-addb-fe983bb04394"
msgid "Ghost of Queen Ravena"
msgstr "여왕 라브나의 유령"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaArmor_FlavorText_String
msgctxt "95e60ab1-d962-423b-9548-2ad58bb93781"
msgid ""
"This armor was created centuries ago by a half-elven armorsmith, Queen "
"Ravena's bastard-born brother. He called the armor \"Ravena's Embrace\" in "
"memory of his childhood, when his elder sister used to hug him as if trying "
"to protect him from all danger.\n"
"When Ravena succumbed to evil and began worshiping five cruel demon lords, "
"her loyal knights plotted against her, luring the queen into a trap and "
"murdering her. Her brother was among the murderers."
msgstr ""
"이 갑옷은 수세기 전에 라브나 여왕의 이복 동생인 하프 엘프가 만들었습니다. 그는 자신의 큰누나가 모든 위험으로부터 보호하듯 안아주었던 "
"어린 시절을 회상하며 이 갑옷을 \"라브나의 포옹\"이라 불렀습니다.\n"
"라브나가 악에 굴복하고 5명의 잔인한 데몬 로드를 숭배하기 시작했을 때, 그녀의 충성스러운 기사는 여왕을 함정에 끌어 들여 그녀를 "
"살해했습니다. 그녀의 동생은 살인자들과 함께 있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaArmor_name_String
msgctxt "c391f5c3-daeb-42c2-a281-780b052d615f"
msgid "Ravena's Embrace"
msgstr "라브나의 포옹"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaCape_FlavorText_String
msgctxt "42366c9a-423f-46b8-afc1-1fad1051cdfc"
msgid ""
"This cape belonged to Warrior Queen Ravena, who succumbed to evil and was "
"betrayed and murdered by her loyal knights afterward."
msgstr "이 망토는 악에 굴복했다가 결국 그녀의 충직한 기사들에게 배신 당하고 살해된 전사 여왕 라브나의 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaCape_name_String
msgctxt "3ecf5f0e-e04e-48b9-aae3-984d64a8da43"
msgid "Ravena's Shadow"
msgstr "라브나의 그림자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaHelmet_FlavorText_String
msgctxt "3c6bee69-887e-4759-859f-9acdfb71eb1b"
msgid ""
"This helmet belonged to Warrior Queen Ravena. The queen used to say it was "
"uncomfortable to wear a crown under the helmet, but it was also silly to put "
"it on top. That was why she never wore an actual crown, calling her helmet "
"one in jest."
msgstr ""
"이 투구는 전사 여왕 라브나의 것입니다. 여왕은 투구 아래에 왕관을 착용하는 것이 불편하다고 말하곤 했지만, 맨 위에 올려 놓는 것 또한 "
"어리석은 일이었습니다. 그래서 그녀는 투구를 농담삼아 왕관이라 부르며 진짜 왕관을 쓰지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaHelmet_name_String
msgctxt "a5f20159-327d-4c7a-8728-35c1f0cc4f3e"
msgid "Ravena's Crown"
msgstr "라브나의 왕관"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaShield_FlavorText_String
msgctxt "e7726075-37fb-4e66-9c2a-edeaec922505"
msgid ""
"This shield belonged to Warrior Queen Ravena and received its name from the "
"queen's famous faithfulness to her word. Neither this shield nor the queen's "
"oath could be broken. This turned out to be true in a way, but the queen's "
"faithfulness did not stop her from becoming an evil demon worshiper, and her "
"shield's strength did not save Ravena when she was betrayed and assassinated "
"by her own knights."
msgstr ""
"이 방패는 전사 여왕 라브나의 것이며 여왕의 명령으로 그녀의 가장 유명한 충신이 이름 지었습니다. 이 방패와 여왕의 맹세 모두 깨질 수 "
"없었습니다. 이는 대체로 사실입니다만, 여왕의 충신은 그녀가 사악한 데몬 숭배자가 되는 것을 막지 못했고, 그녀의 방패는 자신의 기사들이 "
"배신하고 그들에게 암살당했을 때 라브나를 지키지 못했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaShield_name_String
msgctxt "86f34592-5d2c-4322-abcc-0d7ab319a1dc"
msgid "Ravena's Oath"
msgstr "라브나의 맹세"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaSword_FlavorText_String
msgctxt "bf5d252a-5e7d-4f05-821e-25c4cbfa5726"
msgid ""
"With this sword, the demon-worshiping Queen Ravena knighted five of her most "
"loyal warriors, who later betrayed and murdered her. Her fury and their "
"guilt still live within this sword, filling it with power."
msgstr ""
"데몬을 숭배한 여왕 라브나는 이 칼로 그녀의 가장 충성스러운 전사 다섯을 기사로 임명했습니다. 후일, 그녀는 이들에게 배신당하고 "
"살해되었습니다. 그녀의 격노와 그들의 죄책감은 여전히 이 칼 안에 살아서 힘을 부여합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/Items/RavenaSword_name_String
msgctxt "bd95666c-741a-4bc8-9f08-55742b4b1e76"
msgid "Ravena's Kiss"
msgstr "라브나의 입맞춤"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "42f96598-a66b-4abd-9b58-adb43993f342"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "fe506326-51a4-4cf4-8e6c-da18659d4940"
msgid "\"You mentioned something about 'revenge'...\""
msgstr "\"너는 '복수'에 대해 언급했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "af4e36ee-6221-4a90-a54a-39f64e5cd824"
msgid "Freed Ravena."
msgstr "라브나를 풀어줬습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d624f344-6667-44ac-b2f2-b800d811078b"
msgid "\"Farewell then, and good luck with your revenge.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 작별 인사를 하고 복수에 행운이 함께하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fea4052a-ca97-4980-b40c-cd29981192cc"
msgid "Attacked Ravena."
msgstr "라브나를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "e47272c9-0b1f-463e-b6e1-b4ad8d911e55"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're evil incarnate. I can't let you go free.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너는 악의 화신이다. 너를 풀어줄 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f9440f94-2910-4b6d-96ad-93a01d1bfba0"
msgid "Allowed Ravena to pursue her revenge."
msgstr "라브나가 그녀의 복수를 하도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "dfa27bea-e2dc-4154-8c0d-8acc97bace52"
msgid ""
"\"Calistria approves of your lust for revenge. You're free to leave, with "
"her blessings and mine.\""
msgstr "\"칼리스트리아께서 복수에 대한 너의 욕망을 인정하시는군. 나와 신의 축복 속에 자유롭게 떠나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "69ca2cfc-3078-4acd-ac9f-617e5849e1ca"
msgid ""
"{n}A moan echoes around you, full of old pain and deep relief, as you move "
"the last megalith into place. A woman appears before you — the same woman "
"whose ghost you saw when you discovered these ruins. Her shoulders tremble "
"slightly, but her posture displays strength and authority.{/n} \"Alive "
"again... Finally...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막 거석을 제자리로 옮길 때 낡은 고통과 깊은 안도감으로 가득 찬 신음 소리가 당신 주위에 들립니다. 이 유적을 발견했을 때 본 "
"귀신과 똑같은 여자가 당신 앞에서 나타납니다. 그녀의 어깨는 약간 떨리지만 그녀의 자세는 힘과 권위를 보여줍니다.{/n} \"되살아났어"
"... 마침내...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "2f8d8f21-8ddd-4198-b5e3-ac8365a4c362"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman turns to you.{/n} \"I can barely find the words to express my "
"gratitude, stranger. Those who betrayed me, they did oh so much to prevent "
"me from returning to this world. And yet, here I am — and it is thanks to "
"you. I would like to reward you before I leave to take my revenge.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자는 당신을 돌아봅니다.{/n} \"고맙다는 말로도 부족하구나 이방인이여. 나를 배신한 사람들은 내게 이 세상으로 돌아가지 못하게 "
"모든 수를 써서 막았다. 그러나 아직 나는 여기 있고 네 덕분이다. 내 복수를 떠나기 전에 너에게 보상하게 해다오. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "568ec6fe-e0fa-47de-b364-ecf1f05f36ce"
msgid ""
"\"My name is Ravena. Queen Ravena, once, but with my kingdom lost to the "
"dust of centuries, there is little sense in this title. These lands were "
"previously mine... until my beloved knights betrayed me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 이름은 라브나, 여왕 라브나이다. 그러나 나의 왕국은 수 세기 전에 먼지가 되어 사라졌으니, 이 칭호는 의미가 없군. 이 땅은 "
"본래 나의 것이었다... 사랑했던 나의 기사들이 날 배신하기 전까지는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "15b3b2c8-ecbc-49cf-be44-109c6df5316e"
msgid ""
"\"It is a long story, and I would prefer not to waste any time. But as you "
"were the one who rescued me, you deserve at least a brief explanation. Long "
"ago, I ruled these lands with the help of my five most trusted knights. We "
"were close, like a sister and her brothers... perhaps even closer. And it "
"was those five beloved souls who betrayed me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴 이야기이니 시간 낭비하고 싶지는 않다. 그러나 너는 나를 구출 한 사람이니, 적어도 간단한 설명은 들을 자격이 있다. 오래 전, "
"나는 내가 가장 신뢰한 다섯 기사들의 도움과 함께 이 땅을 다스렸다. 우리는 마치 형제자매처럼 가까운 사이였지... 아마도 더 "
"가까웠을지도. 또한 나는 내가 사랑했던 다섯 영혼들에게 배신당했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "3fd86c60-38b8-44fe-bec3-daa5c5168261"
msgid ""
"\"I promised you a reward, stranger. I was often called blackhearted and "
"insane, but no one ever called me ungrateful. Take my armor and weapon — may "
"they serve you better than they served me. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너에게 보상을 약속했다, 낯선 이여. 나는 종종 불쾌하고 미친 사람이라고 불렸지만, 아무도 나를 배은망덕한 사람이라 부르지는 "
"않았지. 나의 갑옷과 무기를 가져 가라, 나보다는 너에게 더 쓸모가 많을테니. 그럼 잘 가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "3778026d-ec71-447f-bbe1-e3be3004339b"
msgid ""
"\"Sad, but expected. Oh, lords of the Abyss, your daughter calls upon you!\""
msgstr "\"슬프지만 예상했다. 아아, 심연의 왕이시여, 당신의 딸이 부르노니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "a385e1cb-2447-44b2-8280-f59cb441a719"
msgid ""
"\"They knew all my secrets. They knew the locations of my shrines and their "
"purpose. They also knew that my patrons, the demon lords, would never let me "
"die in peace. That is why my knights changed the order of the megaliths in "
"my shrines — severing my ties with the Abyss so I could not call upon the "
"demon lords to rescue me. And so it happened: the blades of the betrayers "
"pierced my heart, and my spirit was locked within this shrine... until you "
"set me free.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 내 모든 비밀을 알고 있었다. 내 성소의 위치와 목적을 알고 있었다. 또한 나의 후원자인 데몬 로드가 절대로 나를 곱게 죽게 "
"놔두지 않을거란 사실도 알았지. 그래서 나의 기사들은 내 성소에 있는 거석들의 순서를 바꿨다. 나와 심연과의 연결이 끊겼기에, 데몬 "
"로드에게 나를 구해달라 부를 수 없었지. 그래서 이렇게 되었다: 배신자의 칼날이 내 심장을 꿰뚫었고, 내 영혼은 이 성소에 갇혔지... "
"네가 풀어주기 전까지는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/Puzzle45/RavenaDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "1c4d7072-32f0-4b87-949a-70b12e0f809d"
msgid ""
"\"Sadly, centuries have passed — my five brave knights are long dead. I "
"can't look into their eyes, can't ask them the questions that have burned "
"within me all this time. And yet, their offspring still live in this world. "
"I will find them. I will make them mine. Their great-grandfathers so feared "
"serving a demon-worshiper that they betrayed me, the one they swore on their "
"lives to protect. Their great-grandchildren, the blood of their blood, will "
"either become demon-worshipers... or demon prey. That will be my revenge.\""
msgstr ""
"\"슬프게도, 수 세기가 지나갔다. 나의 용감한 다섯 기사는 오래 전에 죽었다. 나는 그들의 눈을 들여다 볼 수 없고, 이제껏 내 속을 "
"불 태워 버린 질문을 할 수 없다. 그러나, 그들의 자손은 여전히 이 세상에 살고 있지. 나는 그들을 찾을 것이야. 그들을 내 것으로 "
"만들겠다. 그들의 증조부들은 나를 보호하겠다 맹세했지만, 데몬 숭배자를 받들자니 겁에 질렸고 결국 나를 배신했지. 그들의 혈통을 이어받은 "
"증손자들은 데몬 숭배자가 되거나 데몬의 먹이가 될 거야. 그것이 나의 복수다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "4a88b618-331f-4cb6-80dc-4684278adc18"
msgid "\"I got tired of chasing you across the barony.\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신을 남작령을 돌아다니며 쫓아 다니는 것에 지쳤어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "7197c5a0-163d-4ae5-8061-cd1790d4cf67"
msgid "\"Looks like opening portals isn't an easy task.\""
msgstr "\"포털 열기는 쉬운 일이 아닌 듯 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a5757657-cb59-4081-a932-d79cb6be01b2"
msgid "Promised to kill Tristian with your own hand."
msgstr "직접 트리스티안을 죽일 것을 약속합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8518ea06-260f-40df-bbee-5f2bef2e9441"
msgid "\"I'll finish you off, Tristian! Do you hear me? By my own hand!\""
msgstr "\"너를 내손으로 끝내겠어 트리스티안! 내 말 듣고 있어? 내 손으로 끝낼 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b8a3c0ee-871a-49e0-95c7-5e59cb456314"
msgid "\"I still want to speak with you, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"나는 여전히 너와 이야기하고 싶어 트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "3d985b66-4957-433a-8a68-5d59b924aa80"
msgid ""
"[Take a step toward Tristian] \"Why did you return here, to the Temple of "
"the Elk?\""
msgstr "[트리스티안에게 다가갑니다] \"왜 여기 Elk 신전으로 돌아 왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "e61e14c7-5b7b-4b7d-9246-8f29df2078cc"
msgid ""
"[Take a step toward Tristian] \"Back on the island you said I was in danger. "
"What did you mean?\""
msgstr "[트리스티안에게 다가갑니다] \"섬으로 돌아가면 내가 위험하다고 했지. 무슨 의미야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "67eacae7-308e-4fbf-91fa-5497007286b7"
msgid "\"Let's finish this. Give me what you have taken.\""
msgstr "\"끝내자. 네가 가져간 것을 돌려줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "38d82652-dcc5-4331-85d0-4ac6fa417d48"
msgid "[Take a step toward Tristian]"
msgstr "[트리스티안에게 다가갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "10811f77-6e18-4c17-89e3-497869d7e001"
msgid "Tried to be honest with Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안에게 정직해 집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "9b7d198b-b41f-4c18-9ed7-19bffb9fd698"
msgid ""
"[Approach Tristian openly] \"No tricks, Tristian, no games. I came here to "
"talk.\""
msgstr "[트리스티안에게 솔직히 말합니다] \"속임수가 아니야 트리스티안 거짓은 없어. 나는 여기 와서 이야기하려고 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "291136b9-5667-4b94-8e04-451ffa6f7153"
msgid "\"How long will this escape last?\""
msgstr "\"이 탈출은 얼마나 오래 지속될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "13f3f62a-4387-42a3-b582-f110fd5014e8"
msgid "Attacked Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안을 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "8f2d4270-953f-4022-8899-c1a0e54fccd4"
msgid "[Attack] \"You shouldn't have trusted me, traitor!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너는 나를 믿어서는 안되었어 배신자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "eabac926-7e0a-428f-9613-8eedea876d8f"
msgid "[Take another step towards Tristian] \"Tell me about the First World.\""
msgstr "[트리스티안에게 한 발 더 다가갑니다] \"태초 세계에 대해 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "0e46b2ba-1a5b-4d5c-abf1-98730cd5a010"
msgid ""
"[Remain where you are] \"All right, let's talk like this. What are you doing "
"here?\""
msgstr "[움직이지 않습니다] \"좋아 이러지 말자. 여기서 뭐하고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "b9c7815e-4209-4eec-ac17-84f1cc4658be"
msgid "\"Where will you go, Tristian?\""
msgstr "\"너 어디 갈 거야 트리스티안?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f9ee6fe1-f74e-4044-893f-79a888252626"
msgid "Attacked Tristian."
msgstr "트리스티안을 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "4516e047-abca-47d3-aadd-21c68ba6da16"
msgid "[Attack] \"You'll never leave this place!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너는 이 곳을 떠나지 못할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_BF_Reinforced2_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5cf4b65d-bbf5-46b2-9ebb-5b52d498a735"
msgid "Blamed Tristian for being a coward."
msgstr "겁쟁이 트리스티안을 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_BF_Reinforced2_Text
msgctxt "05f2c2ed-25fc-4adb-9edd-501d12356d72"
msgid ""
"\"I still want answers, Tristian. Are you satisfied with what you've done? "
"Do you accept what you've become, or will you at least try to change? Your "
"goddess gives everyone another chance — surely she has enough mercy for you "
"as well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 아직도 대답을 원해 트리스티안. 너는 네가 한 일에 만족해? 너는 지금의 너를 받아들이는 거야? 아니면 너는 적어도 변하기를 "
"바래? 너의 여신은 모두에게 기회를 줘. 틀림없이 너에게도 자비가 충분하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Answer_BF_Romantic2_Text
msgctxt "949b9d92-7500-4c95-bbc0-84003dd36715"
msgid "\"Did you really think I'd just leave you alone?\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 그냥 내버려 둘 것 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "00d92aeb-d7ab-4eef-b6d7-40741af1bcb6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian looks exhausted — his face is deathly pale, his eyes are dull, "
"with dark circles around them, and his hands tremble.{/n} \"You… again…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 지쳐 보입니다 - 그의 얼굴은 죽은 사람처럼 창백하고 그의 둔한 눈 주위에 다크 서클이 있으며 그의 손은 "
"떨립니다.{/n} \"너... 다시…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "06cd53ea-4593-403d-9eae-a82e71a6d169"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head sadly.{/n} \"You hope for a way to make things "
"right. It's not possible.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 그의 머리를 슬프게 흔듭니다.{/n} \"너는 일을 올바르게 하기 위한 방법을 원했지. 그건 불가능해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "47ef04d1-b488-463b-a670-197bb9422b43"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian shakes his head.{/n} \"Don't reduce yourself to idle threats. I "
"must finish what I've started. Before that happens… you won't be able to "
"stop me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안이 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"위험에 빠지게 네 선택을 줄이지 마. 내가 시작한 일을 끝내야 겠어. 그런 일이 일어나기 "
"전에 너는 나를 멈출 수 없을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "ac0b9b04-b043-4c91-aa67-0f324899ec83"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian closes his eyes.{/n} \"This is… hard. I need to rest. That's the "
"only reason you were able to catch me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 그의 눈을 감았습니다.{/n} \"힘들어. 나는 쉬어야 겠어. 그것이 나를 붙잡을 수 있었던 유일한 이유야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "005664b7-8620-4a7e-830a-dbe9dfcd41d6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian tilts his head.{/n} \"I asked you to stop pursuing me. You waste "
"your time… and you've placed yourself in danger.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 머리를 기울입니다.{/n} \"나를 쫓지 말라고 부탁했어. 너는 시간을 낭비하는군... 그리고 자신을 위험에 빠뜨렸어."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "ea372b9a-469b-4bbf-8857-b08e44300f16"
msgid ""
"\"This is impossible, {name}. Please don't ask me to do it again. Oculus of "
"Abaddon should serve to the power that compels me and reveal the path to "
"it's goal. Otherwise...\" {n}Tristian shudders.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이건 불가능 해 {name}. 다시 해달라고 부탁하지 마. Abaddon의 눈은 나를 강요하는 힘에 봉사하며 목표를 향한 길을 "
"밝히지. 그렇지 않으면...\" {n}트리스티안이 몸서리칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "d0037794-34fb-481a-b88a-bb4260bc1ac1"
msgid ""
"{n}Lost in his thoughts, Tristian doesn't notice you step closer.{/n} \"You "
"don't believe me? Indeed, why should you after all that has happened? If you "
"think I exaggerate the danger you're in, you're mistaken.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 생각에 빠져서 당신이 다가오는 것을 보지 못합니다.{/n} \"나를 믿지 않아? 왜 그래야만 했어? 너의 위험성을 내가 "
"과장했다고 생각하면 그건 착각이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "0f04ea9c-7258-441d-b508-46d90aee6f09"
msgid ""
"\"Please, don't move! If you wish, we can talk, but I beg you once again — "
"stop pursuing me!\""
msgstr "\"제발 움직이지 마! 원한다면 얘기 할 수 있겠지만 다시 한번 부탁해. 나를 설득하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "ccd5931c-5580-4a41-a3a8-1a6a5c522b1e"
msgid "\"I hope… I hope everything will be over soon.\""
msgstr "\"나는 곧... 모든 일이 끝나기를 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "89d63a38-a28e-4d1a-baf6-e9eb0e66b350"
msgid ""
"\"If you persist, a real storm awaits you, {name}. A storm called the {g|"
"First World}First World{/g}. Even you can't defeat an enemy like that. Even "
"you have just one chance to survive it — if you flee!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 지속하면 큰 폭풍이 너를 기다릴 거야 {name}. {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}라고 불리는 폭풍 말이지. "
"심지어 그런 적은 물리 칠 수 없어. 도망간다면 살아남을 기회는 하나뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "216681b3-b0d3-4eae-88cf-23f64321706b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian steps back.{/n} \"No… no! Get away from me! Get away from the "
"portal!\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 물러섭니다.{/n} \"아니... 안돼! 나에게서 멀리 떨어져! 포털에 다가오지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "9bbbeaec-b7dd-4fe5-b5a4-cc579b6534f7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian drops his head, but not before you catch his eyes welling up.{/n}"
" \"I... I will find a way to make amends. Even if it costs me my life. Even "
"if my goddess remains deaf to my prayers. But now... Now I must leave.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 그의 머리를 떨구지만 당신은 그의 눈물을 발견합니다.{/n} \"나는... 나는 보상을 할 길을 찾을 거야. 내 여생을 "
"바칠 지라도. 여신이 내 기도를 듣지 않더라도. 하지만 이제는 떠나야만 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "3f8eef24-e03e-4674-88b2-221a5386e437"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian backs away.{/n} \"I've already told you more than I should have. "
"Now I beg you… leave!\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안이 물러납니다.{/n} \"몇 번이나 더 말해야 겠어. 이제 간청할게. 떠나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "f30694e8-f396-4753-952f-cf2290d3654d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian covers his face with his hand.{/n} \"I can't stand driving you "
"away. But I must — to save you! But before I go... I swear, I'll find a way "
"to make it up to you. Forgive me. I must go.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 손으로 얼굴을 가립니다.{/n} \"나는 너를 몰아 세울 수 없어. 하지만 너를 구해야만 해! 하지만 가기 전에... "
"나는 맹세코 너에게 보상할 방법을 찾을 거야. 용서해. 나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5f096661-62d9-4e6b-a027-4596ae5a16ab"
msgid ""
"\"Now THAT'S interesting. Better than your usual whipped-up stories about "
"life in {g|Kelesh}Kelesh{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"정말 흥미롭군. {g|Kelesh}Kelesh{/g}에서 지냈던 지겨운 이야기 보다 나아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "47183bd3-ddae-46d5-ac88-5aee8b96a311"
msgid ""
"\"With nagging like yours, of course escape's the only way! Not for us, "
"though. We're not cowards or traitors.\""
msgstr "\"네가 잔소리처럼 말했듯 탈출이 유일한 길이야! 우리를 위해서가 아니라도 말이야. 우리는 겁쟁이나 반역자가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "97281fb1-315e-4250-a821-13a5c66b70a1"
msgid ""
"\"A lie.\" {n}Ekun's face is serious, almost solemn.{/n} \"Despair blinded "
"you. Now you try to blind us, to sow fear and doubt.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말.\" {n}에쿤의 얼굴은 심각하다 못해 엄숙합니다.{/n} \"절망이 너를 눈 멀게했어. 이제 너는 우리를 눈 멀게하고 "
"두려움과 의심을 뿌리려고 하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Angel_Dialogue/Cue_TristianExplainsPortals_Text_String
#. Speaker : TempleOFTheElkTristianChapter4
msgctxt "c0d2a075-f774-4a88-be76-db22fbdb9554"
msgid ""
"\"This is merely a stop along the way. I don't choose these places, {name}. "
"An island on {g|Candlemere}Candlemere lake{/g}, the {g|Temple of the Elk}"
"Temple of the Elk{/g}... Long ago before remembering, portals from the {g|"
"First World}First World{/g} were opened here. Years passed, and "
"superstitious people, attracted by strange omens, founded temples near these "
"places. One of these portals has brought me here. I'll leave through one as "
"well.\""
msgstr ""
"\"단지 도중에 멈추는 거야. 나는 이 장소들을 선택하지 않았어 {name}. {g|Candlemere}캔들미어 호수{/g}에 있는 섬, "
"{g|Temple of the Elk} Elk의 신전{/g}... 기억할 수도 없는 오래 전에 {g|First World} 태초 "
"세계{/g}의 포털이 여기에 열렸어. 몇 년이 지나고 이상한 예언에 끌려 미신에 빠진 사람들이 이 근처에 신전을 세웠어. 이 포털 중 "
"하나가 나를 여기에 데려왔지. 나는 역시 하나를 타서 빠져 나갈 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Guardian_Alive_Bark_String
msgctxt "8bf73aa2-8b9f-4049-a346-3b1906316c15"
msgid "\"Help! These creatures are everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘! 괴물이 도처에 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Guardian_Dead_Bark_String
msgctxt "72eb64b6-32e0-48c4-9b59-465be3e6a08a"
msgid "This man's corpse is covered with huge claw marks."
msgstr "이 시체는 거대한 발톱 자국으로 덮여있다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/TempleOfTheElk/Barks/Tristian_Attacked_String
msgctxt "32599f0d-39b2-46d0-ad33-e4f13c23adc8"
msgid "\"I must finish what I've started!\""
msgstr "\"내가 시작한 것을 끝내야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ThanadaemonLair/1Thanadaemon_bark_String
msgctxt "6531aa40-6d65-45fd-8826-ae27b987b7fc"
msgid ""
"\"I see no offering worthy of me. You wouldn't summon a daemon without "
"preparing an appropriate sacrifice, would you?\""
msgstr "\"나와 동등한 가치의 제물이 보이지 않는군. 적절한 제물이 준비되지 않았으면 다이몬을 소환하지 말았어야지, 그렇지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ThanadaemonLair/2Cultist_bark_String
msgctxt "f99e0df1-b9a6-474f-bfa7-860fb32b188e"
msgid ""
"\"We serve the great Charon, Horseman of Death! Bow before us, creature!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 죽음의 기수인 위대한 케런을 섬긴다! 무릎을 꿇어라, 미천한 것아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ThanadaemonLair/3Thanadaemon_bark_String
msgctxt "128f758e-740a-4cd1-a81c-ccfac4b9605c"
msgid "\"I see.\""
msgstr "\"알겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ThanadaemonLair/CultistDiary_name_String_1
msgctxt "55acc880-0546-473d-a7c7-5d6d7f82bdb6"
msgid "Page from a Cultist's Diary"
msgstr "사교도가 쓴 일기장의 일부"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ThanadaemonLair/CultistDiary_text_String_1
msgctxt "eccce592-39b5-4ab4-9054-76bb42637cd9"
msgid ""
"\"I wonder how bad it is that I managed to translate only half of the scroll "
"for the ritual... Unfortunately, time's running out — I'll just have to sort "
"things out on the fly!\n"
"These simpletons won't know any better, after all. Oh, Pax Groometra... I'll "
"soon rip your soul from those daemons' paws, I promise!\""
msgstr ""
"\"의식의 두루마리를 절반이라도 번역할 수 있다면 얼마나 끔찍할지 궁금하군... 불행히도 시간이 얼마 남지 않았어. 나는 즉시 그것들을 "
"정리해야 해! \n"
"결국 이 멍청한 것들은 더 잘 알지 못할 거야. 오, 팍스 그루메트라... 너의 영혼을 다이몬의 발톱이 찢어 버리리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c41/ThanadaemonLair/CultistRunning_bark_String
msgctxt "77801119-4277-4f68-9b8f-751946716d49"
msgid "\"I'll definitely succeed next time!\""
msgstr "\"다음 번에는 확실히 성공할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/Bandit1_String
msgctxt "214222f5-6812-48c7-8196-740495058008"
msgid "\"Ha, the loot just falls into our laps!\""
msgstr "\"전리품은 우리 손아귀에 떨어진다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/Bandit2_String
msgctxt "fceae067-f0a3-4cec-aa08-d8e0c3b15ae8"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, look! If it isn't the {mf|king|queen} {mf|him|her}self! Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"이봐!{mf|왕|여왕}{mf|그|그녀}가 아니라면! 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/Bandit3_String
msgctxt "580e6637-4b00-4ba8-94f9-fa3c1e5f2db8"
msgid "\"Look who's here!\""
msgstr "\"이게 누구야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/BanditRE1_String
msgctxt "77443606-e2fa-42f0-8305-0dba1c41c8e7"
msgid "\"Irovetti sends his regards!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티가 안부를 전합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/BanditRE2_String
msgctxt "e72b8748-a01a-4dc6-b697-c1911d617bb0"
msgid "\"Your Highness is in trouble now!\""
msgstr "\"전하는 이제 곤경에 처해 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/BanditRE3_String
msgctxt "bf6e9ab6-6647-4d7a-a9ac-59f7cc7ff174"
msgid "\"Surround them!\""
msgstr "\"그들을 포위해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/Dovan_c51_AssassinCamp_String
msgctxt "4c10e074-aa8f-42cd-8911-75dd40347f00"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, it's you! You remember good old Dovan, don't you? Spared my life back "
"at the Stag Lord's place... but I won't be making the same mistake! Ha ha ha!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"오 당신이군! 친절한 Dovan씨를 기억해? 수사슴 군주의 집에서 내 목숨을 구해줬어. 하지만 나는 똑같은 실수를 하지 않을 거야! "
"하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/LootTrader_Bandit_String
msgctxt "35c720d3-beb4-40be-83be-8a368b975afa"
msgid ""
"\"They're just peasants, you knucklehead. What else to do you expect them to "
"have? Silverware? Fine mahogany furniture, perhaps? Some nice Taldan "
"paintings?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 농민일 뿐이야 바보야. 그들이 무엇을 하기를 기대해? 은제 식기? 좋은 마호가니 가구? Taldan의 멋진 그림들?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/LootTrader_Trader_String
msgctxt "014e0d04-6e82-499e-af51-540b6c553eac"
msgid ""
"\"It's just old rubbish here! Pots, axes, spinning wheels... Couldn't you "
"find something valuable?!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 쓰레기잖아! 냄비, 도끼, 바퀴... 뭔가 귀중한 것을 찾을 수 없겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/PoisonHalfling_Bandit1_String
msgctxt "97dce65a-ac9d-4b2a-bb91-25159a55bcac"
msgid "\"Crap, how did they notice us?!\""
msgstr "\"젠장 어떻게 그들이 우리를 알아차렸지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/PoisonHalfling_Bandit_String
msgctxt "ad551a1b-435d-403f-a964-f546e5cb4126"
msgid "\"No time to surround them! Attack!\""
msgstr "\"그들을 포위할 시간이 없어! 공격해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Barks/PoisonHalfling_BattleBark_String
msgctxt "f42728a0-7802-438d-9b60-0e1d6419b1dc"
msgid "\"Your death will bring glory to Norgorber!\""
msgstr "\"너의 죽음은 Norgorber에게 영광을 가져다 줄 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "99b6a6ae-ad64-4475-b8c6-ed091b5cd35b"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ef2f9d8d-a582-42dd-ba31-b5eb00ecf01b"
msgid "\"What was your role in the camp?\""
msgstr "\"야영지에서 너의 역할은 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "311d50c6-7e9d-48d6-9140-3123ff16e2e3"
msgid "Killed Ilora Nuski out of boredom."
msgstr "지루해서 일로라 누스키을 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5879084c-59f4-4c7d-95df-93c38984bf61"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Such a sad story... Sadder yet, it doesn't touch me in the least. "
"Maybe your death will stave off my dreadful boredom?\""
msgstr ""
"[공격합니다] \"슬픈 이야기군... 슬프지만 적어도 나를 감동시키지 않아. 아마 네 죽음은 나의 지독한 지루함을 덜어 줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f849a013-c0ec-40ca-924f-0538ecd9da1e"
msgid "Spared Ilora Nuski's life."
msgstr "일로라 누스키의 목숨을 살려줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9f059eb2-815a-44f0-ac2f-159f8ad9e931"
msgid "\"I'll spare your life, but don't expect such leniency next time.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 살릴 것이지만 다음에 그러한 관용을 기대하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "147d13bd-0f53-4d2e-a32a-f08ea8412eb9"
msgid "Killed Ilora Nuski as punishment for her wrongdoings."
msgstr "그녀의 잘못에 대한 처벌로 일로라 누스키를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4a459ff7-6695-43c2-af37-07fffea4f4fd"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"The atrocities you committed are unforgivable. You obeyed a "
"tyrant's will and brought death and ruin upon countless innocents. Prepare "
"to die.\""
msgstr ""
"[공격합니다] \"네가 저질렀던 잔학 행위는 용서할 수 없어. 너는 폭군의 뜻에 순종했고 무수한 무고한 사람들에게 죽음과 파멸을 가져 "
"왔어. 죽을 각오나 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "5764ecdd-1411-43c0-b692-4412fe04d87a"
msgid "\"Are you saying Irovetti philandered with you?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 이로베티가 너를 성희롱했다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "dab2b4bd-91b3-47a7-bee2-1a741e609ac8"
msgid "\"You're not from the thieves' guild?\""
msgstr "\"도둑 길드 출신이 아니야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "cb9bf36c-fc86-49a2-bef8-28932cf473cf"
msgid "\"I give! I give. Please don't kill me!\""
msgstr "\"항복할게. 제발 날 죽이지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "4ab0b28b-e0bc-44b3-aacb-80762fb71592"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not interested in dying for Irovetti. Let the dirty creep get someone "
"from his fancy thieves' guild in here, see how they like this job... or the "
"way he gets handsy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이로베티를 위해 죽는 것에 관심 없어. 그 추잡한 자식은 자기가 아끼는 도둑 길드원이나 여기로 보내야 해, 이딴 일을 누가 "
"좋아하겠어.... 게다가 몸을 더듬기나 하고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "fc5df76b-ab33-47cb-8ef3-7f7785115af8"
msgid ""
"\"My name's Ilora Nuski, Chief of the River Razors... or what's left of us, "
"between you and Irovetti. The scoundrel found us, pinned us down, and gave "
"us a choice — he could kill us all, or we could take our chances fighting "
"your kingdom. We did what he said, of course. It at least gave us a chance "
"to survive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 강의 칼날의 두목인 일로라 누스키야. 지금은 너와 이로베티 사이에 남아있는 아무개지... 그 악당이 우리를 발견하고 제압 하고는 "
"선택권을 주었어. 그가 우리 모두를 죽이거나 너의 왕국과 싸우는 것이지. 우리는 그가 말한 대로 했어. 적어도 우리는 생존할 기회를 "
"얻었으니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "4359b580-ebfb-4c97-b811-0b3c739bf7d7"
msgid ""
"\"You have a good soul... and you fight like a wolf. I'm glad Irovetti will "
"have more trouble to deal with. Maybe we'll meet again.\""
msgstr "\"너는 좋은 영혼을 가졌군. 늑대처럼 싸우고. 이로베티가 대처하는 데 어려움을 겪게 되어 기쁘군. 다시 만나자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "99df60f7-408b-4a3a-98a0-73f02d0b0f9e"
msgid ""
"\"The usual — gathered information from scouts, planned out attacks, "
"recruited and trained new members... But fighting a war is way different "
"than day-to-day banditry along a river or highway! Our gang dwindled by the "
"day — Irovetti just wanted to throw us into this bloodbath so we could "
"damage you as much as possible before dying.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정찰병이 정보를 모으고 전략을 짜고 신병 모집하고 훈련하고... 전쟁을 치르는 것은 강이나 대로에 일상인 도적질과는 다르다! 우리 "
"도적단은 날로 줄어 들었어. 이로베티는 네가 죽기 전에 가능한 한 피해를 줄 수 있도록 우리를 이 피바다에 던지려고 했지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "b6887ddf-5c33-42e4-9b5d-abc4bf68be76"
msgid ""
"{n}The bandit wipes blood from her lips with the back of her hand.{/n} \"I "
"have no grudge against you. Irovetti just didn't give me a choice!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도적은 손등으로 입술의 피를 닦아 냅니다.{/n} \"나는 너에게 원한이 없어. 이로베티는 나에게 선택권을 주지 않았다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "8ddeea8d-d002-4488-bd4c-074a5dd0ca6c"
msgid ""
"\"To put it mildly! He hounded me like he had a swarm of wasps in his pants. "
"Last time I was in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, he'd gone crazy! I was just walking "
"down a palace hallway when I met him, and he was holding this strange wooden "
"sword — I have no idea where he got it from, but he's manic about it now. "
"When he got close, he touched me with the sword, I think by accident. But he "
"turned immediately and tried to pin me against the wall! I pushed him away "
"and was ready to knock him one, but I stopped myself — he could have had me "
"killed for that. Since getting that wooden stick, it's like he's completely "
"lost his mind.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 약과야! 놈은 바지에 말벌이 들어간 것처럼 나를 괴롭혔어. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 있었을 때 그는 미쳤었지! 그를 "
"만났을 때는 궁전 복도를 걸어 내려 갔을 때였어. 그는 이 이상한 나무 칼을 들고 있었지. 그걸 어디에서 가졌는지 모르지만 그는 지금 "
"그것 때문에 미쳤어. 그가 가까이 갔을 때 칼로 나를 우연히 건드렸어. 그러나 그는 즉시 돌았고 나를 벽에 붙이려고 했어! 나는 그를 "
"밀쳐 냈고 두들겨 줄려고 했지만 멈추었어. 그렇게 했다간 살해당할지도 모르니까. 그 나무 막대기를 얻은 이후로 그는 마치 이성을 완전히 "
"잃은 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "59156c57-e3f1-40b1-a676-466dfb72c36b"
msgid ""
"\"No, we have our own gang, good as any... Well, had. Irovetti promised the "
"guild exclusive rights to all the orders in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}... not that "
"his word is worth anything.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니, 우리 조직은 꽤 크지.... 지금은 아니야. 이로베티는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 대한 모든 명령권을 도둑 길드에게 "
"주겠다고 약속했어... 말뿐인데 효력이 있을리가. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "de033295-b0ba-4247-a9a6-6ab780057993"
msgid "\"You really know how to turn enemies into allies!\""
msgstr "\"너는 적을 동맹으로 만드는 법을 잘 알고 있군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e7038f8e-f031-46ff-86ef-ed24251da46f"
msgid "\"Another life saved. Another chance for a new start.\""
msgstr "\"또 다른 생명이 구해졌어. 새로운 출발을 위한 또 다른 기회군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f61cf5e0-a3e6-4993-9ff9-5dba42cc2fbb"
msgid ""
"\"Had no choice! The favored excuse of bandits everywhere when faced with "
"the consequences of their sins. Do not believe her, {name}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"선택의 여지가 없었다라! 도적들은 벌을 받기 직전에는 항상 입바른 변명을 합니다. 이 년을 믿지 마십시오, {name}님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "bb29b459-8706-4d4e-bafb-57c382196165"
msgid "\"We'll see who walks out alive!\""
msgstr "\"누가 살아남아 걸어 나올지 보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "3be946c5-1ee2-4c01-9bc8-a73e4a2c00db"
msgid "\"Death to enemies of the {mf|barony|barony|kingdom|kingdom}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|남작령|남작령|왕국|왕국}의 적에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/IloraNuski_Dialogue/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "674d37f2-e6e7-4a42-a79d-5c6bf73c1043"
msgid ""
"\"She fought bravely, and with great skill! Maybe we shouldn't end her. If "
"she attacks us again, then we'll have another good fight! And if not, all "
"the better — we'll have a strong ally.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 용감하게 싸웠고 실력도 좋았어! 우리는 그녀를 죽이면 안돼. 그녀가 다시 우리를 공격한다면 또 다른 좋은 싸움을 할 거야! "
"그렇지 않다면 최고지... 우리는 강한 동료를 가질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Items/IloraNuskiLetter_Description_String
msgctxt "d92f0ad3-a21f-4877-bc2f-45ad9b119bbb"
msgid "Crudely Written Letter"
msgstr "휘갈겨 쓴 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/Items/IloraNuskiLetter_String
msgctxt "bf7d2005-b6d8-4a1e-9865-d434896779a0"
msgid ""
"\"Heya, Dogbee!\n"
"So, finally decided to suckle from our Pitaxian teat, huh? Good for you! "
"Maybe you're not the half-wit you seem. Read this carefully, and do as "
"you're told to — if anything goes wrong, I'll know… and I'll certainly give "
"you something to cry about.\n"
"Pillaging {name}'s lands won't be enough. You have to leave scorched earth "
"behind you. Whatever you can't take, you burn or break. Set fire to homes, "
"stables, barns, sheepfolds... anything with food or livestock. Ruin their "
"smiths, weavers, potters — anyone capable enough to use tools. Maybe even "
"salt the earth while you're at it!\n"
"Your reward is whatever you can snatch. Keep an eye on your men — don't let "
"them be greedy pigs. And don't overstuff your carts, or they'll get stuck in "
"the mud. I figure Pitaxian gawks like you won't know where to fence their "
"loot, so I made a deal with the local tallymen — they'll take the goods "
"straight from the camp. You can find us using the map I left you.\n"
"A few days ago, a poisoner from Galt arrived. She looks like a normal "
"halfling, like you could smash her with a thumb, but her eyes are like two "
"unearthed graves. I bet she's murdered more living souls than the both of us "
"combined. I've heard a thing or two about her kind, worshipers of "
"Blackfingers — Norgorber's avatar that oversees making poisons. Rumor has it "
"they're all half-crazed thugs. She'll provide you poison for the wells, "
"though no one's stopping you from coating your blade in the stuff, as well — "
"just watch you don't get any on you.\n"
"Do as you're told, and wait for new orders. Trust only our inner circle, "
"don't expose your throat, and sleep with one eye open.\n"
"I.N.\""
msgstr ""
"\"귀염둥이 녀석!\n"
"그러니까, 뭐냐. 같이 피탁스 꿀 빠는 사이가 된 건가? 잘됐네! 완전 얼간이는 아닐 것 같더라니. 편지 잘 읽고, 하라는 대로만 하면 "
"돼. 그대로 안 하면 말이지, 내가 바로 아는 방법이 있거든. 후회하기 싫으면 알아서 해.\n"
"{name}의 영토에서 약탈 좀 한다고 되는 게 아냐. 그 땅에 있는 건 죄다 못 쓰게 해야지. 챙길 건 다 챙기고, 못 챙기겠는 건 다 "
"부숴 놔. 집, 마구간, 헛간, 목초지... 그 안에 있는 식량, 가축. 다 아작을 내버려! 대장장이, 직공, 도공 비슷한 놈 보이면 "
"죽여버리고, 소금 있으면 땅에 소금도 뿌려!\n"
"보상은 따로 없어. 대신 자기 몫 챙기는 것까진 뭐라 안 할게. 너무 욕심 부리다간 알지? 부하 중에 멍청한 짓 하는 놈이 없나 잘 "
"감시해. 수레가 가득 차면, 진흙탕에 바퀴가 처박히는 법이니까. 피탁스 녀석들은 우리가 뭘 따로 챙기고 할 머리가 안 된다고 생각하는 것 "
"같던데, 내가 거래하는 중개인이 있거든? 위치를 알려줄 테니까 중개인한테 부탁해서 우리 야영지로 곧장 물건 가져와.\n"
"며칠 전에 갈트 출신 독술사도 여기 도착했지. 엄지 손가락 하나로 이길 수 있을 것 같이 생겼는데, 요만한 하플링 주제에 눈깔이 완전히 "
"죽어있더라고. 사람 깨나 죽여본 것 같던데, 아마 바다 건너 노르고버의 화신인지 뭔지 하는 독술사 숭배 집단인가 봐. '검은 "
"손가락'이라나 뭐라나. 막 나가는 사이비 집단이란 소리가 있던데. 아무튼, 이 사람이 우물에 풀 독약을 전달할 거야. 남으면 칼날에 "
"발라도 돼. 말리진 않을게. 실수로 베이기라도 하면 생사는 장담 못하지만.\n"
"자, 여기까지. 알아들었으면 그대로 진행하고, 얌전히 다음 명령을 기다려. 곁에는 아주 가까운 측근만 두고, 머리통 잘 간수하고 있어라. "
"잘 때도 한 눈은 뜨고 자!\n"
"I.N.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "1bfe79e5-6c2d-4b7b-b65b-289d35781321"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "2b98b8e0-35de-46ba-ae33-b72afc33ec6c"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "57fba88a-195d-438b-9a36-351fe2562a18"
msgid "Attacked a \"civilian\" in the bandit camp."
msgstr "도적 야영지의 \"민간인\"을 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "846a6edd-4027-4e12-8ece-ac86edcae559"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've no interest in your excuses. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"나는 너의 변명에 관심이 없다. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1e52cae1-56dc-44a7-bf0b-90596f228fc5"
msgid "Spared the life of a \"civilian\" working in the bandit camp."
msgstr "도적 야영지에서 일하는 \"민간인\"을 살려줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "16fd42ea-d8de-4705-9805-48bf54b972e9"
msgid "\"Fine. Live. I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 잘 살아라. 나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "84096448-1a05-4622-9453-933ffef9bdff"
msgid "[Attack] \"To arms! They're surrounding us!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"전투 준비! 그들은 우리를 포위했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Poisoner
msgctxt "0994b8cf-0bfb-40c8-802c-468ad9886db2"
msgid "\"Wait, don't attack. I just work here — I wish you no harm.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐 공격하지 마세요. 나는 여기서 일합니다. 나를 해치지 마세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Cue_0002_Text_String
msgctxt "ce03aeb9-b9a1-4bd3-acaf-59f7be04d831"
msgid ""
"\"Name's Urtenea. I'm an alchemist from Vyre. Irovetti contracted me to work "
"for {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, promised me my own laboratory, access to rare "
"ingredients... The conditions aren't quite what he promised, but it's better "
"than working as an apprentice till my hair goes gray! Do you know how hard "
"it is to save up for your own glassware set?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이름은 얼테니아입니다. 나는 바이어의 연금술사죠. 이로베티와 계약해 나는 내 실험실과 희귀 재료를 사용 권한을 제공받고 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 일하기로 했습니다. 그가 약속 한 조건은 그리 좋지 않지만 내 머리가 회색이 될 때까지 도제로 일하는 "
"것보다 낫죠! 실험용 유리 그릇 세트를 마련하려면 얼마나 힘든지 아시나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "9c1d4246-e43f-4e1c-bb62-3f4caeda0e8a"
msgid ""
"\"I mainly make poisons. Don't look at me like that! It's a job — I need to "
"eat, too, you know! I'm not killing anyone — the ones using my poisons are "
"to blame. Sometimes I cook up healing potions too — it's just a different "
"recipe to me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 주로 독극물을 만듭니다. 나를 그렇게 보지 마세요! 일이니까요. 나도 먹고 살아야죠! 난 아무도 죽이지 않았어요. 독극물을 쓰는 "
"사람을 탓해야죠. 때로는 회복 물약을 만들기도 합니다. 나에게는 단지 다른 제조법일 뿐입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "607a5453-96ae-437d-b5a9-fb4b16dc6cc9"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman's expression suddenly shifts.{/n} \"Couldn't have chatted a few "
"more minutes, you devil?! All right, fellows, out of the bushes — we'll "
"fight in the open!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자의 표정이 갑자기 바뀝니다.{/n} \"몇 분만 더 수다를 떨어줄 수 없었냐, 이 악마야?! 좋아, 친구들, 수풀에서 나와. 다 "
"까고 싸워보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "84567d6a-81cc-476d-93f8-903c6033cc01"
msgid ""
"{n}A ferocious grin spreads across the woman's face.{/n} \"Ha, we shut the "
"trap! Bit of advice for the future — don't drop your guard in an enemy camp, "
"or you might get surrounded. Grab them, fellows!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사나운 미소가 여자의 얼굴에 퍼집니다.{/n} \"함정에 걸렸군! 미래를 위해 충고 하나 하지. 적진에서는 네 방어를 풀지 마라, "
"아니면 포위당할 테니까. 이 녀석들 잡아, 친구들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AssassinCamp/PoisonHalfling_Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "e19fe49f-28d9-4444-a824-d87c365ee552"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok's ears perk up, and he readies his weapon.{/n} \"Others come! "
"Hear steps!\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹이 귀를 쫑긋 세우면서 무기를 준비합니다.{/n} \"다른 사람들이 온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AstradaemonLair/AstradaemonBark_String
msgctxt "94858096-0c7d-4ccb-b05a-775bc31c0878"
msgid "\"Amateurs! Who taught you to hold the ritual like this?\""
msgstr "\"아마추어들! 누가 의식을 이딴 식으로 하라고 가르쳤지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AstradaemonLair/CultistDiary2_text_String_1
msgctxt "c54ddc49-695b-476a-b66a-a3fa6effe269"
msgid ""
"\"What won't I do for you, the unparalleled Pax Groometra! Pretending to be "
"a cultist of Charon, just to get them to help me. To be honest, all I know "
"about the deity is his symbol — a skull with coins covering the eye sockets. "
"I made the logical assumption that it was somehow related to death and "
"started mumbling something about death and fate at the coven meeting — and "
"they just took me for one of their own! Three years studying at the Academy "
"of the Arts — can't take that away! Even if most of my time there was more "
"revelry than studying. Unfortunately, Charon's followers aren't really of "
"much help. Daemons serve their deity, but these dumb cultists don't know how "
"to make the daemons obey their summoner! And I can't just tell them 'a "
"daemon stole the soul of my favorite writer, and I need to get it back or "
"I'll never know who the murderer in the last issue of \"Shadows of Absalom\" "
"was!' I have to constantly improvise and make things up as I go, but at "
"least I'm good at that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"유일한 팍스 그루메트라시여, 내가 당신을 위해 못할 것이 무엇이겠습니까? 케런의 사교도인 척하면서, 그들이 나를 돕게 했을 뿐입니다. "
"솔직히 말하면, 내가 알고 있는 것은 그 신의 상징 뿐입니다. 눈에 동전이 올려져 있는 해골이지요. 나는 그것이 죽음과 어떻게든 관련되어 "
"있다는 논리적인 추론을 했고, 비밀 집회에서 죽음과 운명에 대해 중얼거렸습니다. 그랬더니, 그들 중 하나가 나를 끌고 갔습니다! 예술 "
"아카데미에서의 공부 3년치도 함께였습니다! 물론 대부분의 시간이 공부 대신 음주였지만요. 불행히도 케런의 추종자들은 별로 도움이 되지 "
"않았습니다. 다이몬들과 같은 신을 섬기지만, 이 바보 같은 이교도들은 다이몬들을 순종시키는 방법을 모릅니다! 그리고 나는 그들에게 '한 "
"다이몬이 내가 가장 좋아하는 작가의 영혼을 훔쳐갔고, 다시 돌려받아야만 하며 그렇지 않으면 \"압살롬의 그림자\" 마지막 편의 살인자가 "
"누구인지 알지 못할 것이다'라고 말할 수 없었어요! 나는 끊임없이 이야기를 지어내고 임시변통을 부려야 하지만, 최소한 그런 것들은 내 "
"특기입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/AstradaemonLair/CultistRunning_bark_String
msgctxt "01be5157-da4e-4761-9b3d-5202bc4e30eb"
msgid "\"Next time, things will definitely go as planned!\""
msgstr "\"다음 일은 분명히 계획대로 진행될 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsLearning1_String
msgctxt "63df7c2a-79b3-485f-b579-34ec2605f41d"
msgid ""
"\"Truth be told, Trebricent's pamphlet is pretty banal. It's a shame we have "
"to work with him.\""
msgstr "\"사실 트레브리센트의 전단지는 매우 진부합니다. 우리가 그와 함께해야 한다는 사실은 부끄러운 일입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsLearning2_String
msgctxt "2a3454f8-1654-4fb1-88f8-b1a6a92d721a"
msgid ""
"\"There's no way I'm putting my name on this! Label it as a folk song!\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 이름을 절대 올리지 않을 거예요! 차라리 민속노래를 써 넣던지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsLearning_String
msgctxt "b4064c98-f672-41dc-9efb-2fed6ab84a1e"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti... Confetti... Damn it all, why does he have such a difficult "
"name?!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티... 콘페티... 젠장 왜 그처럼 어려운 이름을 가지고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsOnStreets1_String
msgctxt "c551660f-bafb-48f9-9de4-d245d62530eb"
msgid ""
"\"Theirs is a bear, and ours — a teddy!\n"
"Just hand the crown to Irovetti already!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저기에 곰이 있고 우리 것은 곰인형입니다! \n"
"어서 이로베티에게 왕관을 건네줘요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsOnStreets2_String
msgctxt "297c93f5-1ca3-4b1a-8a5a-bc0a2dc2ec10"
msgid ""
"\"To you, my {mf|king|queen}, I give advice,\n"
"And pray it meets your ear:\n"
"Give up the throne and run away,\n"
"Or get thrown out of here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|왕|여왕} 나는 조언을 할게요. \n"
"그리고 만족스럽길 바랍니다.\n"
"왕좌를 포기하고 도망쳐요.\n"
"아니면 쫓겨나던가요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsOnStreets3_String
msgctxt "a63151e8-6826-4d89-a5a7-0ba47e5b1589"
msgid ""
"\"None can challenge his charm or wisdom,\n"
"The Sage of Pitax should rule this kingdom!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무도 그의 매력이나 지혜에 도전 할 수 없습니다. \n"
"피탁스의 현자는 이 왕국을 지배해야 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsOnStreets4_String
msgctxt "0c68ce81-bf82-479f-a1b0-86fbb01842f5"
msgid ""
"\"His reign be just, and strong his hand -\n"
"King Irovetti should rule this land!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그의 통치는 정당하고 강해야 합니다. \n"
"이로베티 왕이 이 땅을 지배할 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsOnStreets_String
msgctxt "942ec5ad-b229-4d2f-a239-1315880c0dc5"
msgid ""
"\"None can rival his wit or might!\n"
"King Irovetti shall end our plight!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무도 그의 재치나 능력에 필적 할 수 없습니다! \n"
"이로베티 왕께서는 우리의 곤경을 끝낼 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsRunningAway1_String
msgctxt "c2d899e2-3def-4b5f-bee5-a2561b843371"
msgid "\"I'm too young to die!\""
msgstr "\"나는 죽기에는 너무 젊어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsRunningAway2_String
msgctxt "a53fd8e8-ff90-4064-b2fa-1a12e69eba5d"
msgid "\"Aaaaah!\""
msgstr "\"아아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsRunningAway3_String
msgctxt "03f86f65-71d2-4b5c-9795-74ffba396003"
msgid "\"You won't intimidate us!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 협박하지 마세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BardsRunningAway_String
msgctxt "27cc668a-21f7-48eb-bd08-95356ef5536b"
msgid "\"Every man for himself!\""
msgstr "\"자기 자신을 위해 사십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BattleBards1_String
msgctxt "ada30363-8d5d-418a-9b8f-ed47032c1097"
msgid "\"Death to the bloodthirsty tyrant!\""
msgstr "\"피에 굶주린 폭군에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BattleBards2_String
msgctxt "0194de4c-a46f-4bef-8ead-b38b96c379d4"
msgid "\"Have at you!\""
msgstr "\"한 방 먹여주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BattleBards3_String
msgctxt "dbc6d819-b61d-4116-adb7-c6ddf4a0cff0"
msgid "\"For Irovetti!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티을 위하여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/BattleBards_String
msgctxt "767d8082-e6a4-4a79-a9d2-77a6fb3122de"
msgid "\"To glorious battle!\""
msgstr "\"영광스러운 전투가 되리라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/Ivar_Helps_String
msgctxt "14ebc04f-2258-49d1-b0f0-ac295e741125"
msgid "\"Hold, {name}! I'm with you!\""
msgstr "\"멈춰요 {name}! 함께 할게요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/Ivar_RunsAway_String
msgctxt "888eb66b-5c6c-425a-98d7-adadd95807dc"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, {name}. You were merciful to me, but I'm not ready to kill for "
"you... Farewell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"용서 해주세요 {name}. 당신은 나에게 자비를 베풀었지만 나는 당신을 위해서 죽일 준비가 되어 있지 않아요. 그럼 이만. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/OurBattleBards1_String
msgctxt "26a153c4-98ea-45e8-b1ed-f982b79ca722"
msgid "\"Ha! Been a while since we had ourselves a brawl!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 싸움을 한지 오랜만이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/OurBattleBards2_String
msgctxt "abdd8695-5e21-433f-a8b3-af0cce77fa32"
msgid "\"{name}! {name}!\""
msgstr "\" {name}! {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/OurBattleBards_String
msgctxt "94090fc5-537f-4511-8c4d-bf1fe4de8ae4"
msgid "\"Away with Irovetti! Hail freedom!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티이 없었다면! 나에게 자유를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/PrintingPress_Bard1_String
msgctxt "95f5c09a-930c-424f-bf10-df78830675ac"
msgid ""
"\"This is the last pamphlet delivery from the academy. They won't print any "
"more for us.\""
msgstr "\"이것은 아카데미에서 온 마지막 전단지입니다. 더 이상 인쇄 할 수 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/PrintingPress_Bard2_String
msgctxt "80d02ad9-7810-45d1-8e17-0be24d72e05d"
msgid ""
"\"Well, we'll have to make do. This should at least last us a while...\""
msgstr "\"글쎄 우리가 해야 할 것 같아요. 적어도 우리와 좀 더 함께해야 해요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/Trebricent1_String
msgctxt "f69a2fcd-baa6-494d-863d-6bee3b07f6d7"
msgid "\"Amid the whirl of steel and blood, a warrior finds peace!\""
msgstr "\"강철과 피의 소용돌이 속에서 전사는 평온합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/TrebricentDying_String
msgctxt "c88afb4d-6f63-448a-bb5f-4aa931a2fdeb"
msgid ""
"\"My limbs grow cold... Pharasma opens her doors to me, ready to place a "
"laurel on the poet's bloody brow... Oh, cruel fate...\""
msgstr "\"팔다리가 춥고... 파라즈마가 나에게 문을 열어 시인의 이마에 월계관을 올릴 준비가 되었습니다. 오 잔인한 운명이여...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Barks/Trebricent_String
msgctxt "fe57089a-ab26-4b37-9c49-0ecf58986a3b"
msgid ""
"\"No music is more pleasing to a man's ear than the sounds of fierce battle!"
"\""
msgstr "\"어떤 음악도 치열한 전투의 소리보다 기쁘지 않습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Items/Flyer_Description_String
msgctxt "eb8013c5-680d-4307-92ec-9451ce7d1965"
msgid ""
"\"A Discourse by Trebricent of Cordelon on Trueborn versus Self-Proclaimed "
"Rulers, or the Pitaxian Lion and the Flea of {kingdomname}.\n"
"... Shall I compare them to a lion and a flea? The former is strong, noble, "
"and wise, his temper calm and his manner unhurried, for he is aware of his "
"own grandeur. But one shouldn't stand in his way — his mere roar instills "
"awe, and one blow of a clawed paw can smite anyone. Nature itself placed a "
"crown upon his brow, urging other nations to surrender!\n"
"The other brings to mind a bug who can't see beyond its nose — a {mf|flea "
"king|flea queen}, having spent some time at the court of a monkey ruling in "
"Restov, rubbed against her skin and tasted her blood, {mf|he|she} imagines "
"{mf|him|her}self worthy of a crown because {mf|his|her} belly is full of "
"that which flows in veins of kings. And the monkey, who herself rules due to "
"a misunderstanding, granted {mf|him|her} a title, appointing {mf|him|her} "
"owner of a patch of uninhabited wasteland!\n"
"Printed out in Trebricent's Printshop, Littletown\""
msgstr ""
"\"코델론의 트레브리센트 저, 진정한 통치자와 자칭 통치자의 담화, 또는 피탁스의 사자와 {kingdomname}의 벼룩.\n"
"... 그들을 사자와 벼룩이라 비교해도 되겠습니까? 전자는 자신의 웅장함을 알고 있기 때문에 강하고 고귀하며 지혜로우며 서두르지 "
"않습니다. 누구도 그의 앞을 막아서는 안됩니다. 그의 단순한 포효감은 경외감을 불러 일으키며 발톱은 누구든 징벌할 수 있습니다. 자연은 "
"그의 이마에 왕관을 씌웠고 다른 나라들에게 항복을 촉구했습니다!\n"
"다른 하나는 눈 앞의 일만 볼 수 있는 벌레를 생각나게 합니다. {mf|벼룩 왕|벼룩 여왕}은 레스토프 통치령의 원숭이 의회에서 시간을 "
"보냈고, 그 피부 위에서 손을 빌고 혈액을 맛 보았으며, {mf|그의|그녀의} 뱃속에 왕의 피가 흐른다고 {mf|그|그녀}가 왕위에 "
"합당한 자라고 상상합니다. 그리고 그 원숭이는 무지로 통치하고, {mf|그|그녀}에게 작위를 주었으며, {mf|그|그녀}를 아무도 살지 "
"않는 황무지의 주인으로 임명했습니다!\n"
"리틀타운, 트레브리센트의 인쇄소에서 인쇄 \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Items/Flyer_String
msgctxt "8d45d073-f868-40f3-a200-e3077778b5a8"
msgid "A Pamphlet Printed on Cheap Paper"
msgstr "저렴한 종이에 인쇄된 팜플렛"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "567d4d45-122e-4d80-bee4-47dba3dcb3ef"
msgid "\"I didn't expect to see you again. What brought you here?\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신을 다시 볼 것으로 기대하지 않았습니다. 왜 여기로 다시 왔어요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "13601770-04bf-44c7-a8c9-e16402694839"
msgid "\"What happened here in Littletown?\""
msgstr "\"리틀타운에서 무슨 일이 있었던 거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8c0100be-5213-486d-80bd-5fc8b008a640"
msgid "\"You're still a werewolf... How do you live with it?\""
msgstr "\"당신 아직도 늑대 인간이군요... 어떻게 그렇게 산 거죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5fe71488-7d4c-4af7-a375-95490a578523"
msgid "\"What will you do next?\""
msgstr "\"다음에는 어떻게 할 것인가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "debc5afe-d074-4dab-b1c3-4e2889f05b7f"
msgid "[Attack] \"Sorry, but you're still a danger. You have to die.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"미안하지만 아직도 당신은 위험해요. 죽어줘야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c2fc7190-e8cd-4ca9-8fc6-0df8939e141e"
msgid "\"Thank you for your help. Farewell. Maybe we'll meet again sometime.\""
msgstr "\"도와줘서 고맙습니다. 안녕히. 언젠가 다시 만날 수 있겠지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b7d3e264-64c7-4381-b14a-23843d0e5f1b"
msgid ""
"\"Hello again, {name}!\" {n}Ivar, human once more, catches his breath.{/n} "
"\"I can't say your appearance was unexpected, but it was certainly "
"impressive.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕, 다시 만났군, {name}!\" {n}다시 인간이 된 이바르는 숨을 고릅니다.{/n} \"당신이 올거라곤 예상했지만, 확실히 "
"인상적이구만.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "9c090d6a-23f0-406c-9fb9-bf5476365b7a"
msgid ""
"\"That's a long story. After we parted ways at {g|Silverstep}Lake "
"Silverstep{/g}, I went seeking a way to control my curse — both my curses, "
"really. My drivel could also be considered a curse of sorts, or maybe a just "
"dangerous gift... Well, I failed to oust the beast from inside me, but I "
"thought I could try to at least do something of use with my tales. So I "
"enrolled in {g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy of Grand "
"Arts{/g}. I thought it would be a suitable place to learn to control my "
"words.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴 이야기입니다. 우리가 {g|Silverstep}실버스텝 호수{/g}에서 작별을 나눈 후에 나는 저주를 통제하는 방법을 찾으러 "
"갔어요. 내 저주. 내 증상은 일종의 저주 또는 어쩌면 단지 위험한 선천적 능력으로 간주 될 수도 있습니다. 나는 내 안에서 짐승을 "
"축출하지 못했지만, 적어도 내 이야기에 사용하기 위해 노력할 수 있다고 생각합니다. 그래서 나는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에 등록했지요. 나는 그것이 내 말을 통제하는 법을 배울 수 있는 적절한 "
"장소라고 생각합니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "a1e29be8-a063-4f99-bb0e-ac48c4fb928c"
msgid ""
"\"And it was, to an extent. But I also saw how words could be weapons. My "
"family was killed due to my stupidity and a deadly accident,\" {n}Ivar says "
"bitterly.{/n} \"The bards in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and especially here in "
"{g|Littletown}Littletown{/g}, are learning to direct those skills toward "
"murder and manipulation. And I'm afraid they really seem to know what "
"they're doing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 어느 정도까지는 그렇습니다. 그러나 나는 또한 언어가 무기가 될 수 있는 방법을 보았어요. 나의 어리석음과 치명적인 사고로 "
"가족들이 죽었습니다.\" {n}이바르는 고통스러워 하며 말합니다.{/n} \"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}, 특히 여기 "
"{g|Littletown}리틀타운{/g}의 음유시인들은 살인과 속임수를 배우고 있습니다. 그리고 저는 그들이 정말로 그들이 무얼 하는지 "
"모를까 겁이 나요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "0205cc92-3edc-42e0-a69c-c8f8c9ce33b0"
msgid ""
"\"All kinds of sordid things.\" {n}Ivar frowns.{/n} \"At first, they "
"wouldn't tell us where we were being sent. But once we were there, things "
"began in earnest — there were lectures, general meetings, we wrote pamphlets "
"and songs... Whether the topic was love or war didn't matter, so long as at "
"least one of the lines was used to smear you, {name}. I quickly realized "
"what was going on, but I decided to stay anyway. I figured sooner or later "
"the ardent {mf|king|queen} would show up, and I'd get a chance to thank "
"{mf|him|her} for sparing my life and teaching me a valuable lesson.\""
msgstr ""
"\"온갖 종류의 끔찍한 것들입니다.\" {n}이바르는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"처음에는 우리가 어디로 가는지 그들은 알려주지 않았어요. "
"우리가 거기에 있게 되면 강의, 총회가 있고 우리는 글쓰기와 노래를 합니다. 주제가 사랑이든 전쟁이든 간에 최소한 가사 한 줄은 당신을 "
"비방하기 위해 사용됩니다, {name}. 나는 무슨 일이 벌어지는지 깨달았지만 어쨌든 나는 머물기로 결정했습니다. 조만간 {mf|왕|여왕}"
"께서 오시어 내 삶을 구해주고 귀중한 교훈을 가르쳐 준 {mf|그|그녀}에게 고마워할 기회가 생겼습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "0bd6c06a-993a-4d28-92dc-266fb400f49b"
msgid ""
"\"The priests I consulted about lifting the curse couldn't help me. Maybe it "
"was because I... because I'm not ready to forgive myself. Not yet. But "
"something has changed.\" {n}Ivar rubs the bridge of his nose pensively.{/n} "
"\"I didn't hide who I was from the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy's{/g} "
"bards. And they weren't afraid of me. They didn't like me much, but they "
"weren't afraid.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 저주를 풀려고 조언을 구했던 성직자들은 나를 도울 수 없었습니다. 아마도 나 자신을 용서할 준비가 안되어 있기 때문일 수도 "
"있습니다. 아직은 아닙니다. 하지만 뭔가 달라졌어요.\" {n}이바르는 그의 코를 가볍게 문지릅니다.{/n} \"나는 내가 누구인지 {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}의 시인들에게 숨기지 않았습니다. 그리고 그들은 나를 두려워하지 않았습니다. 그들은 "
"나를 많이 좋아하지 않지만 두려워하지 않았습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ffc67618-7976-4d47-ac36-24b6f1689ec7"
msgid ""
"\"To them, my ability to assume an animal appearance just seemed like "
"another kind of natural gift, dangerous though it may be — not so different "
"from the gift of magic to them. Once I began thinking about it, I realized "
"that... now that I didn't have to lie and hide, it became easier for me to "
"control my transformations. I know who I am. I know I can bring death and "
"misery. But I can handle it, and maybe I can help those in need. It was... "
"an interesting lesson.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들에게 동물의 모습을 드러내는 내 능력은 다른 종류의 타고난 선물처럼 보였습니다. 위험할 수도 있겠지만 그들의 마법적 재능과 크게 "
"다르지는 않습니다. 이제는 내가 거짓말하거나 숨을 필요가 없었기 때문에 변형을 통제하는 것이 더 쉬워졌습니다. 나는 나 자신을 알고 "
"있습니다. 나는 죽음과 불행을 가져올 수 있다는 것을 알고 있습니다. 그러나 나는 그것을 통제하고 아마도 사람들을 도울 수 있을 "
"것입니다. 그것은... 흥미로운 교훈이었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "01f0e076-8196-4565-804a-8af4f2e66c67"
msgid ""
"\"Travel. The further the better. My debt to you is paid, but now Irovetti's "
"people will have cause to wish me dead. The world is huge and full of new "
"discoveries to be made... I'll find my own way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여행을 가야지요. 더 멀수록 더 좋습니다. 당신에 대한 나의 빚은 지불되지만 이로베티의 사람들은 나를 죽이기 원할 것입니다. 세상은 "
"거대하고 새로운 발견이 가득합니다. 나는 내 길을 찾을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "bd55a21c-c5b0-47a9-a5af-2c19f3ecb476"
msgid "\"Really? Well, I won't beg for mercy...\""
msgstr "\"정말입니까? 나는 자비를 구걸하지 않을 겁니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "5845e28f-a5ee-43d1-acb7-3477424d7bde"
msgid ""
"\"Farewell to you as well, my {mf|king|queen}. May your legend continue!\""
msgstr "\"작별 인사해야 겠군요 {mf|왕|여왕}. 전설이 계속되기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/IvarFinalDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "0e997211-ad9a-43d0-b617-f91c6c052b2e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Ivar! You should have talked to us! The {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}academy{/g} is the last place you should have tried to learn what you "
"needed! I mean, there are a few good courses and teachers there... Lady "
"Belavarah, for example... but generally, it's a horrid place, really!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 이바르! 우리에게 얘기했어야지요! {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}는 당신이 필요한 것을 "
"얻으려고 노력해야 햇던 유일한 장소였을 거에요! 내 말은, 몇몇 좋은 교육 과정과 레이디 빌라바라 같은 분이 있다는 뜻이죠... "
"그렇지만, 보통은 거긴 정말 무시무시한 장소 맞아요, 진짜로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fd315d29-0813-42a7-b4c8-e22a62853f53"
msgid "Offered to let Trebricent and his bards surrender peacefully."
msgstr "트레브리센트와 그의 음유시인들에게 평화롭게 항복하도록 권유했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "62c53b81-0d17-44dc-aee6-ccca290fe6fc"
msgid ""
"\"Trebricent, enough with your pretentious bravado. You know what will "
"happen if you don't surrender peaceably. You have a chance to prevent "
"bloodshed, if you'll just lay down your weapons.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트레브리센트, 같잖은 허세는 충분하다. 당신이 순순히 항복하지 않으면 어떻게 되는지 잘 알 거야. 무기를 내려 놓으면 피는 흘리지 "
"않을 수도 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "674cab26-30c6-4da2-b56e-4590d247a92d"
msgid "\"A familiar face! Ivar, it's been a long time! How are you?\""
msgstr "\"친숙한 얼굴이군! 이바르, 오랜만이야! 잘 지냈나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2e2dc061-0de7-4502-a07b-109b29de1662"
msgid ""
"\"You seem to be having a nice time. I'll just go — I wouldn't want to "
"bother you.\""
msgstr "\"즐거운 시간 보내고 있는 것 같군요. 나는 그냥 갈 거예요. 방해하지 않을 게요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5380501b-87fc-4582-a676-7e78a5a0cc6b"
msgid "Called on the bards to fight for freedom against Irovetti's oppression."
msgstr "이로베티의 억압에 맞서 자유를 위해 싸우도록 음유시인들에게 부탁 받았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "3b371d2d-68b8-47d2-b185-f393efafe330"
msgid ""
"\"Free singers and poets of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! How much longer will you be "
"oppressed by Irovetti, he who gags all discontent, lets only his favorites "
"perform, and chokes art while pretending to be its patron! Stand beside me "
"and fight — not for me, but for freedom!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 자유로운 음유시인들이여! 당신들의 친구인 척하며, 사람들의 불만을 묵인하고, 그가 원하는 행위만을 "
"허락하고, 후원자를 빙자해 예술을 목조르는 이로베티의 억압에 얼마나 오래 시달렸는가! 내 편에 서라 — 나를 위해서가 아닌, 자유를 위해 "
"싸우자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bd815768-b691-4ee2-8250-b0d00a138868"
msgid ""
"Killed all of Irovetti's bards — both those working for him willingly and "
"those who were forced to."
msgstr "이로베티의 모든 음유 시인들 - 기꺼이 그를 위해 일하는 사람들과 강요된 사람들 모두를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "79bc6a17-6d07-410f-9a67-4b40da283015"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You should've thought twice before dragging my name through the "
"mud... None of you leaves here alive.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"내 명예를 더럽히기 전에 다시 한 번 생각했어야지... 아무도 살아서 걸어나가지 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8bbc2863-64a8-4227-9f7c-c21c9caea498"
msgid "Offered to let Trebricent's bards work for you."
msgstr "트레브리센트의 음유시인들에게 당신을 위해 일하도록 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "ba1db34f-767f-430b-8319-7eed88fb8439"
msgid ""
"\"Bards of the academy, whether you're here because you believe me a "
"worthless {mf|king|queen} or for the money and laurels promised by Irovetti, "
"I say you should judge me by my deeds rather than speculative rumors. To the "
"former, I say visit my kingdom, see my people, and then you may decide what "
"kind of ruler you believe I am. To the latter, I say come serve me instead — "
"bear witness that my treasury is abundant and my courtiers are free to speak "
"their minds. Decide for yourselves for whom you work and about what you wish "
"to sing — I guarantee safety to anyone who accepts my offer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아카데미의 음유시인들이여, 내가 쓸데없는 {mf|왕|여왕}이라고 생각하거나 이로베티가 제공하는 월계관이나 돈을 위해 여기에 왔다고 "
"생각할지 모르겠지만, 나를 특정 소문이 아닌 나의 행동으로 판단해야 한다고 말한다. 내가 쓸모 없다고 생각한다면 내 왕국을 방문하여 내 "
"백성을 보고 내가 어떤 사람인지 결정하길 바란다. 나를 오해하는 자들은 대신에 나를 섬기라. 내 금고가 풍부하고 내 신하들이 자유롭게 "
"마음을 말할 수 있음을 증거한다. 너희가 원하는 일과 부르고 싶은 노래를 스스로 결정하라. 나의 제안을 받아들이는 사람 누구에게나 안전을 "
"보장하겠다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "1dfb9261-8ff9-4aee-8fe3-2424d563f93b"
msgid ""
"{n}Finally, after emptying his glass, the half-elf notices you.{/n} \"Good "
"gods! Look, my brothers and sisters! Look who it is! Is that not {name} "
"{mf|him|her}self? Did you come in your dirty boots and tattered hand-me-"
"downs to spoil our feast with that gloomy, hungry look? Tell you what, if "
"you abdicate the throne and swear allegiance to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, I'll "
"find a bone to throw you!\"\n"
"{n}Some of the dinner guests roar with laughter, while others look at you "
"with interest, maybe even hope. Everyone stops talking and watches you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막으로 유리잔을 비운 후에 하프엘프가 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"신들은 자비로우시군! 보라 내 형제 자매들아! 누가 왔는지 "
"보라! {name}{mf|그|그녀} 아니신가? 더러운 신발과 옷가지를 걸치고서 울상을 지으며 구걸하며 우리의 잔치를 망치러 왔나? 만약에 "
"왕위를 포기하고 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 충성을 맹세한다면 너에게 던질 뼈를 찾아보지!\"\n"
"{n}저녁 식사 손님들 중 일부는 웃음 소리를 질렀고 다른 사람들은 흥미롭게 어쩌면 희망을 품은 눈으로 봅니다. 모두가 말을 멈추고 "
"당신을 지켜 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "47df5921-bea2-4625-8856-e3cbf4a2b2c4"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha, really? Soon as {mf||s}he noticed our merry company, the "
"cowardly impostor decides to run away? Stow your glasses and lutes, my "
"friends — this dastard needs to be taught a lesson!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하하 정말이야? 그{mf||녀}가 우리의 명랑한 동료를 보자마자 그 비겁한 사기꾼이 도망을 칠까? 안경과 류트를 담게나 친구들이여. "
"이 자식은 교훈을 배워야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : CR9_SilverstepWerewolf
msgctxt "82a7d719-8471-4724-b0b8-60c9f76a4bd9"
msgid ""
"\"{d|c22 Ivar Nice}Better{/d}, now that you're here! It's nice to see an "
"honest face — I didn't realize just how tired I'd grown of Irovetti and his "
"hangers-on. And you've become the {mf|king|queen} glorified in legends, just "
"as I foretold. Well, perhaps there'll be room in that legend for me!\""
msgstr ""
"\" {d|c22 Ivar Nice}좋아{/d}, 이제 여기에 왔군요! 정직한 얼굴을 보니 반갑습니다. 나는 이로베티와 그의 아첨꾼들에게 "
"얼마나 싫증나게 될지 깨닫지 못했습니다. 그리고 당신은 내가 딱 예언한 것 대로 전설에서 칭송받는 {mf|왕|여왕}이 될 겁니다. 아마도 "
"그 전설에는 나를 위한 자리도 있겠죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "3aff6c30-82d8-4f8a-b688-7591ee1694da"
msgid ""
"\"Did you hear that, friends?! This beast, this monster, whose muzzle is "
"caked with innocent blood, whose eyes burn with hellfire, breaks into our "
"home and dares threaten us in the name of good intentions! But we're not so "
"easily cowed — truth is on our side! Follow me, disciples of Irovetti! The "
"gods are with us — we're in the right, and our enemy's in the wrong!\""
msgstr ""
"\"들었습니까? 입에 죄 없는 자들의 피로 칠하고 눈은 불길로 타는 이 짐승이 우리의 집에 침입하고 감히 선의의 뜻으로 우리를 "
"위협합니다. 우리는 겁먹지 않습니다. 진실은 우리 편입니다! 이로베티의 제자들이여 나를 따르시오. 신들이 우리와 함께합니다. 우리는 옳고 "
"적은 잘못되었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "a11985fe-20f2-42a8-8657-d0421c7773f2"
msgid ""
"\"By the gods, what am I hearing? Would you sell your own father for a "
"fistful of pork and gravy? Your thankless heart is darker than night. I'm so "
"overcome with indignation that I can barely speak! Take up your swords, my "
"friends — such a disgrace can only be cleansed with blood!\""
msgstr ""
"\"신이시여. 내가 듣고 있는 것은 무엇이지? 당신은 돼지 고기와 재물 한줌에 자신의 아버지를 팔 것입니까? 감사를 모르는 마음이 밤보다 "
"어둡군요. 나는 거의 말할 수 없는 분개로 치가 떨리는군요! 칼을 드시오 내 친구들. 그런 불명예는 피로만 깨끗해질 수 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "cf07f3ef-19c6-4992-866c-92085410e21d"
msgid ""
"{n}The audience is confused — some exchange wary looks, while others look "
"down, embarrassed. Yet others begin to sulk. No one dares say a word.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}청중은 혼란스럽습니다. 몇몇은 걱정스레 서로를 쳐다보고 몇몇은 당황해서 시선을 내립니다. 그러나 다른 사람들은 비웃기 시작합니다. "
"아무도 감히 말을 하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : CR9_SilverstepWerewolf
msgctxt "2cdd2a4d-0190-496a-b538-f31f4145f438"
msgid ""
"\"Can't complain, {name}... I didn't {d|c22 Ivar Rude}expect{/d} to see you "
"here. I hope no trouble comes to your kingdom.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저에게 항의하지 말아주세요, {name}... 나는 당신이 여기 오리라 {d|c22 Ivar Rude}생각하지{/d} 못했으니까요. "
"당신의 왕국에 아무런 문제가 없기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "3b870ecd-b535-4379-84aa-bf4a28f67aee"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! They put a mirror before a crowned donkey, and in a fit of rage, "
"{mf||s}he looks to break it! But you won't silence us — to arms, my friends! "
"I seethe with a thirst for battle. Let's show this enraged tyrant that a "
"poet can wield a sword as well as a quill!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하! 그들은 왕관 쓴 당나귀 앞에 거울을 두었고, 분노에 넘친 그{mf||녀}는 그것을 깰 것처럼 보이는군요! 그러나 당신은 우리를 "
"침묵시키지 못할 것입니다. 무기를 드시오 친구들이여! 나는 전투를 갈망합니다. 시인이 펜을 다루듯 칼을 쓸 수 있다는 것을 이 격분한 "
"폭군에게 보여 줍시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 1
msgctxt "b984f68b-faa4-4007-933a-e5328380f710"
msgid ""
"{n}The soft murmur that began running through the hall during your speech "
"swells into a roar.{/n} \"I won't write to dictation any longer! Down with "
"Irovetti — long live {name}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}연설 중 허공에 퍼지기 시작한 부드러운 잡음은 포효로 부풀어 오릅니다.{/n} \"나는 더 이상 연설을 받아쓰지 않을 것이다! "
"{name} 만세! 타도 이로베티!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 4
msgctxt "c3eba7f9-ebcc-4a45-a016-db407aa877a1"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Trebricent, I so want to stay and see how {name} and company pluck "
"those peacock feathers of yours. But alas, I've other things to attend to. "
"Say hello to your family for me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 트레브리센트. 나는 머물러 {name}와 동료들이 당신들의 공작 깃털을 뽑는 모습을 보고 싶습니다. 그러나 슬프게도 나는 다른 "
"일이 있습니다. 당신의 가족에게 안부 인사 전해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : CR9_SilverstepWerewolf
msgctxt "8ef5b0e9-6af0-40d0-9e08-606052c98072"
msgid ""
"{n}But what's this? Your friend {d|Ivar}Ivar{/d} sits with a long face, "
"picking at a hunk of meat with his fork! The speaker raises his voice once "
"more, and Ivar winces.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하지만 이게 누구죠? 당신의 친구 {d|Ivar}이바르{/d}가 우울한 얼굴로 자리에 앉아 포크로 고기 한 덩이를 찍는군요! 화자가 "
"그의 목소리를 한 번 더 높이자, 이바르는 움찔합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 2
msgctxt "04ee9ad2-7013-43c1-a36d-84cffa1b7312"
msgid ""
"{n}People around the room begin whispering, and the noise slowly grows "
"louder until a sonorous male voice says,{/n} \"I've wanted to travel for "
"quite a while. The pay's not very good here, anyway... and the food's little "
"better than slop.\" {n}Laughter and cries of approval sound from around the "
"room.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}방 주위의 사람들은 속삭이기 시작하고, 웅성거리는 소리는 천천히 커져갔습니다. 이내 한 남성이 낭랑한 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"나는 꽤 오랫동안 여행하고 싶어했습니다. 여기는 급여가 별로 좋지 않고, 게다가... 음식은 쓰레기보다 그나마 조금 나아요.\" {n}"
"동조하는 웃음과 울부짖는 소리가 실내에서 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "4829799e-bd5e-47a0-b604-c648e6845fc9"
msgid ""
"\"What?! Do you hear that? Pygmies and epigones complain that they're not "
"allowed to slander a giant among men, our protector, Irovetti! My spirit "
"seethes, friends. Let's show these vile traitors the bright flame held in "
"our loyal hearts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라고요! 지금 뭐라 했는지 들으셨습니까? 난쟁이 모방꾼이, 군계일학이자 우리의 보호자인 이로베티 전하를 비난하는 것이 자신에게 "
"허락되지 않았다고 불평하고 있습니다. 내 영혼이 끓는군요, 친구들. 이 무시무시한 반역자들에게 우리의 충직한 마음 속에 타오르는 밝은 "
"불꽃을 보여 줍시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "338f2e53-1a8b-4b15-b074-df284cb288f5"
msgid ""
"\"...So let's raise our cups, my brothers-in-arms and drinking comrades! "
"Here's to the most enlightened monarch of our times, who brought prosperity "
"and culture to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! That skillful commander, famous the world "
"over for his military genius! To the ladies' man who's broken so many hearts "
"with his humble charm and aloof attitude! To that {d|c51 Atalia "
"Info}patron{/d} of the arts, that philanthropist, whose generosity is "
"matched only by his wisdom and taste! In short — here's to Irovetti!\" {n}A "
"chorus of voices repeats the toast. Many drink up... but far from "
"everyone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"... 그럼 잔을 듭시다. 전우들과 술친구들이여! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 번영과 문화를 가져온 우리 시대의 가장 계몽된 "
"군주에게 건배합시다! 그는 천재적인 전략과 세계적으로 유명한 숙련된 사령관이지요! 그의 겸손한 매력과 고상한 태도는 숙녀분의 마음을 "
"어지럽혔습니다! 예술의 {d|c51 Atalia Info}후원자{/d}이자 그의 지혜와 감각에 어울리는 관대함을 가진 박애주의자에게 "
"건배합시다! 여기 이로베티를 위하여!\" {n}건배를 외치는 목소리가 울려 퍼집니다. 많은 사람들이 술을 마시지만 전부는 아닙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "0773641f-8927-40c1-8424-4d0f16a3e64e"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems no one noticed your entrance over the bustling noise of the "
"tavern. A young half-elf with long, slicked-back hair and a delicately "
"curled mustache and beard is making a solemn speech. He drawls and "
"flourishes with his hands, and his pretentious red face makes it obvious "
"that he's enjoying everyone's attention. Laughter and shouts of approval can "
"be heard from the main table. Many other guests aren't participating in the "
"gaieties, however — some are yawning, while others aren't even listening to "
"the speaker as they focus on their meals.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}선술집의 떠들썩한 소란에 당신의 입장을 아무도 눈치 채지 못했던 것 같습니다. 길고 매끈한 머리카락과 섬세하게 말려진 콧수염과 "
"수염을 기른 젊은 하프엘프는 엄숙한 연설을 하고 있습니다. 긴장 풀린 목소리와 손을 흔드는 모습 그리고 허세에 찬 붉은 얼굴은 그가 모든 "
"사람의 관심을 즐기고 있음을 보여줍니다. 동조의 웃음과 외침은 메인 테이블에서 들려옵니다. 그러나 다른 많은 손님들이 장례식에 참가하지 "
"않고 있습니다. 일부는 하품을 하고 다른 일부는 식사에 집중할 때 연사의 말을 듣지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "7dd2bcac-d98f-4518-a0b6-d73e00b6cfeb"
msgid ""
"\"You can't confuse us, {name}! We'll remain faithful to Irovetti to our "
"final breaths, our last drops of blood, the last beats of our pure, burning "
"hearts! To arms, my friends — let's rip this slanderer's filthy tongue from "
"{mf|his|her} throat!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 우리를 혼란스럽게 할 수 없습니다. {name}! 우리는 우리의 마지막 숨결, 마지막 피 한방울, 우리의 순수하고 불타는 "
"마음의 마지막 박동까지 이로베티에게 충성할 것입니다! 무기를 드시오 친구들이여. 이 협잡꾼의 목에서 더러운 혀를 뽑아버립시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Trebricent
msgctxt "9d543652-9995-4656-aedc-53d683357069"
msgid ""
"\"Traitor! What else should we expect from a changeling, though — beasts "
"know no loyalty!\""
msgstr "\"배신자! 바꿔치기를 통해 무엇을 기대해야 합니까? 짐승은 은혜를 알지 못합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 2
msgctxt "f84f483b-ab89-4e48-8e19-49822b6e44c6"
msgid ""
"\"You fight these cutthroats yourself if you want, you arrogant snob. Gods "
"be with you — you won't see me here again!\""
msgstr "\"원한다면 이 살인자들과 싸우십시오. 오만한 사기꾼. 신들이 당신과 함께하길. 다시는 나를 보지 못할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 1
msgctxt "df25fc95-6eed-468f-89e8-43dd391b7c4e"
msgid "\"What a farce! His melodramatic eulogies are nauseating!\""
msgstr "\"무슨 소용입니까! 그의 멜로 드라마 같은 찬사는 구역질이 납니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 2
msgctxt "c2d0e4ea-3112-4780-a817-8e6d0cbd11c5"
msgid "\"Ssh! He'll hear you and make a scene again, just like last time...\""
msgstr "\"쉿! 그는 당신의 말을 듣고 다시 같은 장면을 만들 겁니다, 지난번 처럼 말이오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 3
msgctxt "f39fe57e-59e4-4c23-b91c-6fc0d613c05d"
msgid "\"Deplorable, Trebricent... The things you'll say to get a reaction!\""
msgstr "\"대단하군요 트레브리센트... 호응을 얻기 위해 해야 할 말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 4
msgctxt "58eb35bd-7b21-4273-8492-a7b4643a02d3"
msgid "\"Poetry is my life, but I respect a good fight too!\""
msgstr "\"시는 내 삶이지만 나는 선한 싸움을 존중합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : CR9_SilverstepWerewolf
msgctxt "e8eb35bc-23d0-4930-9776-b61d6c66777d"
msgid "\"You've left me no choice, {name}...\""
msgstr "\"당신은 나에게 선택의 여지를 남기지 않았어요. {name}...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 4
msgctxt "73a2d0ff-86e3-436d-af17-3ce29781c6a8"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha, I don't think so! Judging by {mf|his|her} looks, {name} is no "
"joke... and I'm not going to test that. Farewell and good luck, Trebricent!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하 나는 그렇게 생각하지 않아요! {mf|그의|그녀의} 외모를 보건데 {name}는 농담할 자가 아닙니다... 나는 그것을 시험하지 "
"않을 것입니다. 작별 인사를 하지요. 행운을 빕니다. 트레브리센트!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : IrovettiBard 3
msgctxt "6ed9d1fe-3a8c-42ad-872b-3ee2394755a8"
msgid "\"Looks like it's time to get going...\""
msgstr "\"이제 가야 할 때가 된 것 같습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "14df343c-ad2a-480d-8bc8-9175a23e3586"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie is pale, and her silence could melt iron. The squeal of metal on "
"metal indicates that she must be gripping her weapon, but she isn't rushing "
"to draw it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 창백하고 그녀의 침묵은 철도 녹일 수 있습니다. 금속의 마찰음은 그녀가 무기를 쥐고 있다는 것을 의미하지만 그녀는 "
"서두르지는 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "56fc8466-07ad-4e65-bcd4-aac2c4e0395d"
msgid ""
"\"You are noble to offer this scum a chance to live, but I do not think them "
"capable of using the offer.\""
msgstr "\"이 쓰레기에 살 기회를 제공하는 것은 고귀한 일이지만 나는 그들에게 과분하다고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "379afc65-9626-4792-9eea-52da658b1daf"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha, hoo! That has to be one of the most childish, tasteless, awkward "
"rebukes I've heard in my life! Yes, definitely top of the list!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 내 인생에서 들었던 가장 유치하고, 무미건조하고, 어색한 꾸짖음 중의 하나군! 손에 꼽을 정도야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BardCamp/Tavern_Dialogue/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "71deec55-ba7c-4343-bbc7-4a9ae0eb068d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok, who started falling asleep and even snoring while listening to "
"the speeches, shudders at the sound of laughter and seizes his blade.{/n} "
"\"Talk-talk-talk over? Stab time now?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}연설을 듣자 잠들기 시작하고 코골이를 하던 녹-녹은 웃음 소리를 지르며 무기를 잡습니다.{/n} \"나불거리는 건 끝났어? 이제 "
"칼싸움 할 시간인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/BlakemoorEnd_String
msgctxt "063d68a5-4217-4f08-a6aa-c9bfe338a41d"
msgid ""
"\"It's such a relief to finally start working on something new… I think this "
"time it will be a tract on the philosophy of ogres. With autobiographical "
"remarks.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭔가 새로운 일을 시작하는 것은 정말 다행이군... 이번에는 자전적 요소가 가미된 오우거 철학이 주제가 될 것이라 생각되네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/Blakemoors_garbage_1_String
msgctxt "8a170f6e-1ac9-42dc-b29e-9e76187f7bd8"
msgid ""
"A pile of crumpled pages covered with impeccable but unrecognizable "
"calligraphic writing."
msgstr "구겨진 페이지의 더미는 흠 잡을 데는 없지만 알아볼 수 없는 필체 제목이 쓰여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/Blakemoors_garbage_2_String
msgctxt "27b2d913-5bb5-40f3-9f52-91251716ab55"
msgid "A rusty metal… thing."
msgstr "녹슨 금속의... 무언가."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/Blakemoors_garbage_3_String
msgctxt "4c76b435-7670-4c80-9bed-ec281b4894d0"
msgid "An extremely natural-looking stuffed animal."
msgstr "생생히 살아있는 듯한 박제 동물."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/Blakemoors_garbage_4_String
msgctxt "1da84495-4314-4ba9-867a-6cb95422a874"
msgid "A weird magical thing, obviously of faraway origin."
msgstr "먼 나라 어딘가에서 온 이상한 마법이 걸린 물건."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/Blakemoors_garbage_5_String
msgctxt "872da008-3fca-47b9-aad6-609d971e0b36"
msgid "Something you can't recognize, bearing the marks of rat teeth."
msgstr "쥐가 파먹어서 당신이 알아볼 수 없는 무언가."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/DevilIncoming2_String
msgctxt "9b3e2156-076f-45c4-b691-45f184a9b00f"
msgid ""
"\"The grimoire that will open this word's gates to devils! – It must belong "
"to me! Give me the book and perhaps I'll spare your life!\""
msgstr "\"데블에게 이 세계로 향하는 문을 열어줄 흑마법서! 반드시 내가 가져야만 한다! 나에게 책을 주면 네 목숨은 살려주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/DevilIncoming3Blakemoor_String
msgctxt "52aeca1c-0dc1-4333-92d5-9e1a3c3a999d"
msgid ""
"\"Did you leave the door unlocked?! No! I've spent too much time writing it! "
"Get out, Siroket! Help me, my furious squirrels!\""
msgstr ""
"\"들어올 때 문 안잠갔어?! 안 돼! 이걸 쓰느라 얼마나 많은 시간을 보냈는데! 나가라, 시로켓! 날 도와다오, 분노의 다람쥐여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/DevilIncoming_String
msgctxt "2b8b8379-ab94-4615-80a7-b03b85850df0"
msgid ""
"\"So you've finally completed your work, Blakemoor! Unfortunately, you'll "
"never have a chance to collect the reward from your master!\""
msgstr "\"마침내 임무를 완수했군, 블레이크무어! 불행히도, 네 주인에게서 보상받을 기회는 없을것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/ServantSiroketAttack1_String
msgctxt "ca2a4347-891f-4fe3-921d-5df278fbf428"
msgid ""
"\"The mistress ordered me to get the book and to kill the pathetic mage! Get "
"out of my way, I'm not going to a punishment cell!\""
msgstr "\"여주인께서 나에게 한심한 마법사를 죽이고 책을 찾아오라는 명령을 내렸지! 물러서라, 나는 감방에 갈 생각이 없으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/ServantSiroketAttack2_String
msgctxt "8115baee-d823-4e41-a8dd-8230142d27e9"
msgid "\"I haven't tasted fresh blood in so long… Quench my thirst.\""
msgstr "\"나는 오랫동안 신선한 피를 맛 보지 못했어... 목을 좀 축여야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/ServantSiroketAttack3_String
msgctxt "23a1f05a-1086-4ae5-ad9d-67247cdeb231"
msgid ""
"\"Slaughter! Massacre! Death! Genocide and destruction – oh, it's just so "
"much fun!\""
msgstr "\"도살! 학살! 죽음! 대량 학살과 파괴 – 아아, 너무 재미있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/ServantSiroketAttack4_String
msgctxt "4d5097e1-c937-4eb8-81a2-318bbf10b254"
msgid "\"Beg for mercy, mortal worm! I'll make a rattle-toy from your bones!\""
msgstr "\"자비를 구해라 필멸자 벌레야! 네 뼈로 딸랑이 장난감을 만들어주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Barks/SiroketAttack_String
msgctxt "d605229c-2a25-42f5-88f0-80cf7ce2e50e"
msgid ""
"\"The verdict is out. You are doomed. Bow your head and humbly await your "
"execution.\""
msgstr "\"판결이 나왔다. 네 인생은 끝났다. 머리를 숙이고 겸허하게 처형을 기다려라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "7c929053-5db4-4e32-9a7f-5d1df8d857b3"
msgid "\"Captain Martyn sent me.\""
msgstr "\"마르틴 선장이 나를 보냈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6d03cb69-be69-4b22-ae65-6cade30d1450"
msgid "\"Erm… I'm a fan.\""
msgstr "\"음... 나는 팬인데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ccebf94c-173f-4270-a54c-b9efb1317787"
msgid "\"I'm someone you'd better treat with more respect!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 더 존경스럽게 대할 사람이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "4eea26a2-0fcb-493b-8dc3-d7dbec22530c"
msgid "\"Perhaps it's time to finish the grimoire?\""
msgstr "\"아마도 흑마법서를 끝내야 할 때가 아닐까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "06ceb0e8-36ea-4961-98f8-98f5ae9d224e"
msgid "\"Why do you stay here? Are you hiding from someone?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기에 있지? 누구로부터 숨어 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "dcd51e80-c8e0-400c-8282-7f1ea2fd4c28"
msgid "\"Have you ever been to the First World?\""
msgstr "\"너는 태초 세계에 가본 적이 있니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "84efecd8-b7a1-47d4-aff2-fd7b365b35f7"
msgid "\"How did you wind up in Katapesh?\""
msgstr "\"카타페쉬에서 어떻게 되었어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "f074f8e9-3f08-4ba5-8cd3-4cd115c02a38"
msgid "\"What did you do in the North?\""
msgstr "\"북쪽에서 무엇을 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "80f6adc9-c035-4085-a078-4c5f6ed7a79e"
msgid "\"It's time for me to go.\""
msgstr "\"이제 갈 시간이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "85837014-33d5-41ab-abf2-7a0b79c98e24"
msgid "\"That won't do. Give me the book immediately!\""
msgstr "\"그럴 수 없다. 책을 즉시 내놔!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "c75fcdff-e721-4050-a636-1a69d5365942"
msgid ""
"\"It's important to be able to accept closure. Perhaps it's time to put a "
"period on it?\""
msgstr "\"종결을 받아 들일 수 있는 것이 중요해. 아마도 시간을 정해야 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "bef393e7-f21c-4b05-bcd7-4003d897e54d"
msgid "\"Maybe I can help you finish the book?\""
msgstr "\"내가 책을 끝내도록 도와 줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "b7ef2751-97f7-4eeb-a882-a4fa3ab23f20"
msgid "\"I don't dare argue.\""
msgstr "\"감히 끼어들 수 없겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "deb940c6-d428-42c6-bb5f-499bd42e693b"
msgid "\"How did you meet Captain Martyn?\""
msgstr "\"마르틴 선장은 어떻게 만났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "260ea8f0-efab-49c0-88ac-091d263d6ef0"
msgid "\"But there are more important things to discuss...\""
msgstr "\"그러나 더 중요한 것들을 논의해야 한다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "a320a9c0-7579-4755-becf-46179ebaaee8"
msgid "\"I'm in need of a wise adviser. Would you like to work for me?\""
msgstr "\"나는 현명한 보좌관이 필요하다. 나를 위해 일하겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0091_Text
msgctxt "7050eacd-7c8f-490a-8419-bb18f565e400"
msgid "\"I'd like to learn more about you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너에 대해 더 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0092_Text
msgctxt "284a4826-2973-420a-adcd-e758681a3434"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're useless to me alive.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너를 더 이상 살려둘 이유가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0094_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fed66557-5668-4e32-9444-8d33a6cb7499"
msgid "Attacked Blakemoor without reason."
msgstr "블레이크무어를 이유 없이 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0094_Text
msgctxt "e955c29f-f6cb-4221-bda3-8f2f79094e57"
msgid "[Attack] \"Your death.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너의 죽음을 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0095_Text
msgctxt "8cf4e623-13be-47a9-8972-21c363cc8f1c"
msgid "\"No one. Sorry to trouble you.\""
msgstr "\"아무도. 방해해서 미안하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0097_Text
msgctxt "dda6d6bc-fd0d-4e0a-aedd-cc45082234ff"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0100_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "4b7d9adf-0a75-441b-bb4c-f956b72107e8"
msgid "Attacked Blakemoor to rob him of his grimoire."
msgstr "흑마법서를 강탈하기 위해 블레이크무어를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "e1f2f577-fa3b-4ec1-b2b6-875f5daa391f"
msgid "[Attack] \"No more excuses. I'm taking the book.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"더 이상 변명의 여지가 없어. 나는 책을 가져갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fb5485c0-c60c-4b3c-9f29-070c4c66df11"
msgid ""
"{n}A large and broad man turns to you, trying to smooth his thick, tousled "
"hair. His deep voice could have belonged to a giant.{/n} \"Hey, who are you?!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}덩치 큰 남자가 두껍고 뻣뻣한 머리카락 빗으며 당신을 향합니다. 그의 깊은 목소리는 거인의 것이었습니다.{/n} \"이봐, 넌 "
"누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "1ff209ed-fe14-43cb-90b7-c0dd33b61e4e"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment the man stares at you blankly, then smiles and heaves a sigh "
"of relief.{/n} \"Oh yes, Captain Martyn! By all means, welcome to the "
"dwelling of Blakemoor the Wizard.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 동안 그 남자는 당신을 멍하니 응시하더니 미소를 짓고 안도의 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"오, 맞아. 마르틴 선장! 마법사 "
"블레이크무어의 집에 온 것을 환영하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "521e212a-502a-4809-b0cb-8312c9ae649a"
msgid "\"Get out, robber!\""
msgstr "\"나가라! 강도자식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "41fb2d40-242b-4c16-b5e8-6b96eb1e1af7"
msgid ""
"{n}The man heaves a heavy sigh.{/n} \"Ugh, another fan. You fans are the "
"bane of my existence. And of course you're here seeking stories of the "
"legendary Blakemoor the Wizard.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 남자는 무거운 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"아. 또 다른 팬이로군. 너같은 팬들은 내 존재에 골칫거리지. 그리고 물론 당신은 "
"전설의 마법사 블레이크무어의 이야기를 찾으러 왔을테고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "001b380e-c4cb-4b69-8c52-51ca3c053297"
msgid ""
"\"So, someone important has come to visit good old Blakemoor? Well, I shall "
"be a most gracious host!\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 중요한 누군가가 착하고 늙은 블레이크무어를 방문했다고? 그러면, 내가 가장 호의적인 집주인이 되야겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "2d43c203-06d8-4b91-8bd1-53e198f4fec5"
msgid "\"How can I help you?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "214781d2-b227-4559-82fa-48c1eb20ce3c"
msgid ""
"\"Only from my numerous fans. My enemies are terrified of me, even the "
"mighty devils! Once, thanks to a certain vile entity, I ended up in "
"{g|Hell}Hell{/g}. Took the wrong portal... Long story short, I found myself "
"in Hell – and it was open season on my head! The devil Siroket was chasing "
"me. And all I had to fight her off was a sack of low-quality tobacco, the "
"Flute of the Hundred Sea Winds, a deaf-mute kobold servant, and the sulfur "
"which laid in such abundance all around. But that's more than enough to "
"trick some clueless devils!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 수많은 팬들에게서. 내 적들은 내게 두려운 존재고, 심지어는 강력한 데블도 있지! 한 번은 어떤 비열한 단체 덕분에, "
"{g|Hell}지옥{/g}에서 도달했었네. 잘못된 포털을 탄 덕분이지... 결론만 말하자면, 지옥에 있는 나 자신을 발견했지. 그리고 내 "
"머릿속이 환해졌어! 데블 시로켓이 나를 쫓고 있었거든. 그리고 내가 그녀에게 대항할 수단은 오직 싸구려 담배 주머니, 일백 바닷 바람의 "
"피리, 벙어리 코볼트 하인, 그리고 모든 곳에 풍성하게 쌓인 유황뿐이었지. 그러나 그것은 우둔한 데블을 속이기엔 충분했네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "dd20e246-525e-4f64-9ca8-ec87eaef987b"
msgid ""
"{n}Blakemoor stares at the scattered pages with ill-concealed yearning.{/n} "
"\"The book is almost finished. It's a phenomenal piece of work. All it needs "
"is a couple of alterations. Everything must be perfect.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}끔찍하고 은밀한 열망으로 블레이크무어는 흩어져 있는 페이지를 쳐다보고 있습니다.{/n} \"이 책은 거의 끝났다네. 경이로운 "
"작품이지. 몇 줄만 바꾸면 끝난다네. 모든 것이 완벽해야만 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "14ffd2a6-5fbb-4b58-9299-ab85c6a15378"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, where should I start? I am Blakemoor the Wizard. I've seen many things "
"and been to many places – from the northern {g|Realm of the Mammoth Lords}"
"Realm of the Mammoth Lords{/g} to hot {g|Katapesh}Katapesh{/g}, and even to "
"more exotic places, such as the {g|First World}First World{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하. 어디서부터 시작할까? 나는 마법사 블레이크무어네. 나는 많은 것을 보았으며 여러 곳을 방문했지 – {g|Realm of the "
"Mammoth Lords}매머드 군주의 영역{/g} 북쪽부터 뜨거운 {g|Katapesh}카타페시{/g}, 심지어 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}처럼 더 특이한 장소까지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "5a9e15bf-8cff-4c79-87fa-3379b9b83c64"
msgid ""
"\"I got into the {g|First World}First World{/g} by chance. But in spite of "
"that, it was easy for me to find a job there. I was soon substitute rector "
"at a rather remarkable academy, which was located on the back of an elephant "
"with three eyes and numerous tusks. Actually, the elephant had served as the "
"former rector, before he caught a rare elephantine disease. I moved on once "
"he recovered.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 우연히 발을 들였지. 하지만 그럼에도 불구하고, 거기서 일자리를 찾는 것은 "
"쉬웠네. 나는 세 개의 눈과 수많은 엄니를 가진 코끼리의 등 위에 세워진 화려한 아카데미에서 교장 대리를 했다네. 사실, 그 코끼리는 "
"선대 교장이 희귀한 코끼리 질병에 걸리기 전까지 그를 받들고 있었지. 그가 회복되자마자 나는 떠났네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "84522e05-8ae3-4cdb-9caa-2de05709a4a0"
msgid ""
"\"I wound up in {g|Katapesh}Katapesh{/g} by pure chance. I was planning to "
"sail further, but seasickness had overtaken me. Katapesh is an amazing "
"place, but I had little chance to enjoy it. In the heat of an argument, my "
"then-sweetheart decided to teach me a lesson, so she drugged me and sold me "
"to a traveling nightmare circus. There I earned my keep as a sword-swallower "
"– and the crowd was just crazy about me! And it wasn't such a hard a job to "
"learn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 순전한 우연으로 {g|Katapesh}카타페시{/g}에 방문했지. 나는 더 멀리 항해 할 계획이었으나, 뱃멀미 때문에 고생을 "
"했었으니까. 카타페시는 놀라운 장소였다만 즐길 기회가 없었지. 논쟁의 열기 속에서, 당시 내 연인은 나에게 교훈을 가르치기로 결심했고, "
"나에게 약을 먹여 나를 여행 악몽 서커스에 팔았다네. 거기에서 나는 칼을 삼키는 일을 하며 돈을 벌었소. 관객이 정말 좋아하더군! 그리고 "
"그렇게 배우기 어려운 일도 아니었고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "a8214da8-18d2-4c36-9b3a-fcc0502b6148"
msgid ""
"\"While taking part in an expedition, quite contrary to my intentions, I "
"found myself hunted by some barbarians. While trying to escape, I climbed up "
"into the mountains – so high that the barbarians had to abandon their quarry "
"to the mercy of icy winds and avalanches. So I plodded across the highlands "
"until I spotted a little light in the darkness. It turned out to be a "
"tavern, where a celebration was underway. The highlanders weren't too happy "
"to welcome an intruder, but they agreed to give me shelter if I beat them in "
"a challenge.\""
msgstr ""
"\"원정대에 참여하는 동안, 내 의도와는 정반대로, 야만족들에게 사냥당하는 자신을 발견했지. 탈출을 시도하면서 나는 산을 올랐네. 어찌나 "
"높던지 야만인들조차 강풍과 눈사태를 우려하여 사냥을 포기해야만 했지. 그래서 나는 어둠 속에서 작은 빛을 발견 할 때까지 고지대를 "
"가로질렀고. 마침내 도달한 곳은 축하 행사가 진행중인 선술집이었지. 고지 사람들은 너무 행복해서 침입자를 환영할 정신도 없었지만, 그들과 "
"싸워 때려 눕히는데 성공하면 은신처를 주겠다고 약속했다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "f3b1d04e-78a5-41fa-98f5-eddeab26a93a"
msgid "\"My doors are always open to you!\""
msgstr "\"내 문은 항상 너에게 열려 있지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "bd10de89-19a3-44fa-b93c-3d2a5c03aa1b"
msgid ""
"{n}Blakemoor hands you the book and turns away, bitterly offended and "
"grumbling.{/n} \"Oh, just take it. What should I care? Ruffians. Breaking "
"in, making threats…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}블레이크무어는 끔찍한 불쾌감과 불평을 토해내더니, 이내 당신에게 책을 건네주고 돌아섰습니다.{/n} \"오. 그냥 가져 가게나. "
"어쩔수가 있나? 불한당이 무단 침입하고, 위협을 가하는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "2c089692-1640-40e8-b04d-7df0bd5b61b4"
msgid ""
"{n}Blakemoor puts his fists on his hips.{/n} \"Are you mad? I have to tell "
"you to behave, here in my own dwelling?!\""
msgstr "{n}블레이크무어는 팔짱을 낍니다.{/n} \"미쳤나? 내 집이니 마음대로 하지 말라고 일일히 말해야되나?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "dbcc0165-8522-4161-8347-66469fe2fb42"
msgid ""
"{n}Blakemoor opens his mouth to argue, but then just sighs and waves his "
"hand.{/n} \"Yes, you're right. Perfection is always impossible...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}블레이크무어는 입을 열어 논쟁하려 하지만 이내 한숨을 쉬고 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"당신이 맞네. 완벽은 항상 불가능하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "251ce361-463b-4a70-bc33-95a5741647be"
msgid ""
"{n}Blakemoor's tone grows aloof.{/n} \"Art cannot tolerate half-measures. "
"You've much to learn before you're capable of discussing serious matters "
"among artists.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}블레이크무어의 음색이 굵어집니다.{/n} \"예술은 어준간함을 용납하지 않지. 예술가들 사이에서 심각한 문제를 논의 하려면 많은 "
"것을 배워야 한다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "34658dd8-afd9-4262-9d95-0456f0599aed"
msgid ""
"{n}The light of hope flashes in Blakemoor's eyes.{/n} \"An excellent idea! "
"Let's try!\""
msgstr "{n}블레이크무어의 눈에는 희망의 빛이 번쩍입니다.{/n} \"훌륭한 아이디어군! 시도해보지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "2645a63c-6e1d-43e3-a348-b1aee7594a83"
msgid ""
"{n}Blakemoor scoffs.{/n} \"Well, of course, here's foolish me sitting and "
"wracking my mind day and night! But here you come – a renowned author, no "
"less! For you it's just a piece of cake! You'll finish everything in five "
"minutes!\" {n}Blakemoor frowns, offended.{/n} \"You shouldn't underestimate "
"me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}블레이크무어 콧방귀를 낍니다.{/n} \"뭐, 당연하지. 여기 앉아서 밤낮으로 머릿속을 어지럽히는 어리석은 내가 있다네! 하지만 "
"여기, 저명한 작가인 당신이 왔지. 당신에겐 누워서 떡먹기일테지! 5분 안에 전부 끝낼 수 있을걸세!\" {n}블레이크무어는 눈을 "
"찡그리며 성냈습니다.{/n} \"나를 과소평가해서는 안되지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "6aa819d9-235d-49eb-9693-5eed3f579c4c"
msgid ""
"\"Don't worry, I won't let you down! Come back in a week – my door will "
"always be open!\""
msgstr "\"걱정하지 말게나. 실망시키진 않을테니! 일주일 후에 다시 오게. 내 문은 항상 열려있을거네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "cab767bf-1724-44ba-9e91-b371592f96c2"
msgid ""
"\"The Prestigious gave me transport after one encounter. Once time I woke up "
"in the middle of the night and went to look for... the head, I think they "
"call it. So, I went down into the bilge – and suddenly came face to face "
"with eleven banshees – screaming ghosts! They were preparing to devour my "
"soul, when I stopped them and offered to indulge them with conversation "
"prior to the bloodbath. You won't believe it, but they proved to be most "
"pleasant characters to converse with!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우연히 만난 권위자호가 나를 태워줬소. 한밤중에 잠에서 깨어났는데, 눈 뜨자마자 본게... 머리였지. 그것을 머리라고 부르는 것 "
"같았네. 그래서 나는 배 밑바닥으로 갔는데, 갑자기 비명 지르는 유령인 밴시 11명을 마주쳤다네! 그들이 내 영혼을 먹어치울 준비를 하는 "
"동안, 내가 그들을 멈추고 피로 목욕하기 전에 대화로 화제를 돌렸지. 믿을 수 없겠지만, 그들은 대화기에는 가장 유쾌한 이들이었다네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "ee0e82d8-33cc-46a9-bf03-b6e08d9d822e"
msgid ""
"{n}A note of resentment rings in Blakemoor's voice.{/n} \"Yes… Very well.\""
msgstr "{n}블레이크무어의 목소리에 억울함이 서렸습니다.{/n} \"그래... 맞네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "b0b35069-fe2b-4757-aba7-6a5033ef9b8f"
msgid ""
"\"That was unexpected! But we managed! That was Siroket, by the way. – The "
"same devil I met in {g|Hell}Hell{/g}! Did you see that face? Ha ha! That was "
"one tough lady! Thank you for your help, and please give this grimoire to "
"Captain Martyn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 예상치 못했네! 하지만 우리가 해냈지! 그나저나, 그건 시로켓이었소. 내가 {g|Hell}지옥{/g}에서 만났던 그 데블! 얼굴 "
"봤소? 하하! 거친 숙녀였지! 도와줘서 고맙네. 그리고 마르틴 선장에게 이 흑마법서를 전해주게나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "68f81eb8-6342-42c3-bb20-5a8d956ac6eb"
msgid ""
"{n}After many hours, you and Blakemoor stare at your creation. The Grimoire. "
"Finished. Perfect.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}몇 시간이 지난 후에 당신과 블레이크무어는 당신의 창조물을 봅니다. 흑마법서는. 완성되었습니다. 완벽하게.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "5661c3ed-b9b1-4e4a-a4c5-34f70e24695a"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! I've been an advisor once already, and I don't want to do it again. I "
"once served one of the merfolk kings. My service went on quite successfully, "
"until I got into an affair with the princess, the king's daughter. Though "
"her virtue was guarded day and night, and anyone who dared approach stood "
"under threat of execution, my feelings overtook me, and we managed to run "
"away together. But on the third day they caught up with us – the whole "
"merfolk army. My death was imminent, but of course I had a brilliant "
"solution in hand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 나는 이미 보좌관 일을 해봤고, 다시는 그런 일을 하고 싶지 않다네. 나는 머포크 왕들 중 한 사람을 섬겼었지. 왕의 딸인 "
"공주와 바람날 때까지는 아주 순조로웠어. 비록 경비가 그녀를 밤낮으로 지키고 있었고, 감히 접근하는 사람은 처형의 위협에 처해졌지만, 내 "
"감정이 이성을 앞질렀고, 눈이 맞아 함께 도망갔다네. 그러나 사흘 째 되던 날 그들이 우리를 따라잡았지. 머포크 군대 전체였어. 내 "
"죽음은 임박했으나, 당연히 나는 훌륭한 해결책을 가지고 있었다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "dbfea095-4398-44f5-9a94-27d197c32160"
msgid ""
"\"After the merfolk soldiers captured us, I entertained myself with card "
"tricks. The merfolk were mesmerized by my talents and demanded that I teach "
"them. So, I suggested a wager. We'd play cards. If I lost, I had to teach "
"them my card tricks before they executed me. But for the next three days I "
"couldn't lose. I won all their money, armor, weapons, their dolphin mounts, "
"their funny bone things they like to put in their ears, and even their Flute "
"of the Hundred Sea Winds, which used to belong to their general.\""
msgstr ""
"\"머포크 병사들이 우리를 체포 한 뒤 나는 카드 속임수로 그들을 즐겁게 했네. 머포크는 나의 재능에 매료되었고 가르쳐달라고 요구하기 "
"시작했지. 그래서 나는 내기를 제안했어. 우리는 카드 놀이를 했지. 내가 지면, 그들이 나를 처형하기 전에 카드 속임수를 가르쳐야만 "
"했지. 하지만 다음 사흘 동안은 질 수가 없었어. 나는 그들의 돈, 갑옷, 무기, 돌고래 탈것, 그들이 귀에 하던 우스운 뼈 물건, "
"심지어 그들의 장군 소유였던 일백 바닷 바람의 피리까지 손에 넣었다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "61556b8b-d23b-48cc-bb59-9b3f59dc8eba"
msgid ""
"\"After three days I'd become quite rich. Then the general ordered his "
"fighters to execute me with their bare hands. But at just that moment my "
"princess arrived! All this time she'd been looking for a way for us to "
"escape, and she'd finally found something. It was a pirate ship! We climbed "
"aboard, I blew the Flute of the Hundred Winds, and our sails nearly burst, "
"taking us away. Unfortunately, things didn't work out between me and the "
"princess. She turned out to be quite... unpleasant company. But she "
"discovered some new talents, and now she's a successful circus fortune-"
"teller!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사흘이 지나고, 나는 꽤 부자가 되었네. 장군은 병사들에게 맨손으로 나를 처형하도록 명령했지. 그러나 그 순간 나의 공주님이 "
"도착했어! 그동안 그녀는 우리가 도망 갈 길을 찾고 있었고, 그녀는 마침내 무언가를 발견했지. 해적선이었어! 우리는 배에 타서, 일백 "
"바닷 바람의 피리를 불렀으며, 그리고 우리의 돛이 거의 부서질 정도로 빠르게 나아갔다네. 불행히도, 나와 공주님 사이에는 일이 잘 풀리지 "
"않았지. 그녀는 아주... 불쾌한 친구로 밝혀졌어. 하지만 그녀는 새로운 재능을 발견했지, 이제 그녀는 성공한 서커스 점쟁이라네!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "011ba903-d0c7-4af9-a731-bd127e64d9f1"
msgid ""
"\"I noticed a sturdy fellow with a simple face, wrapped in a cloak, so I "
"picked him to be my rival. The competition – gluttony. The savage snatched "
"my backpack, turned it inside out and started to cram all my equipment into "
"his mouth. In a short moment, the greedy highlander had swallowed all my "
"stuff, the backpack too – and gobbled down my axe for dessert. The "
"barbarians were already making bets how long I would last out in the cold. "
"Then I tore the mammoth's skull from the wall, broke off its tusk, and "
"rushed for the huge barrel of beer that comprised the entire wall.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 무표정한 채 망토를 감싼 사람을 발견했고, 그 사람에게 도전하겠다 지목했다네. 그 경합은 폭식이었지. 야만인은 내 가방을 꺼내 "
"뒤집고는, 내 장비를 입 속으로 밀어 넣기 시작했어. 짧은 순간에, 욕심 많은 고지 사람이 내 물건과 배낭을 모두 삼켜 버리고, 후식으로 "
"내 도끼를 먹었지. 야만인들은 이미 내가 추위 속에서 얼마나 버틸지 내기를 하고 있었다네. 나는 벽에 걸린 매머드의 두개골을 쪼개버렸고, "
"그 엄니를 부순 다음, 벽을 가득 채운 거대한 맥주통들을 향해 달려 들었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "9ba754d3-1887-419b-8399-3d19d43a066d"
msgid ""
"\"I kicked out the cork put the tusk under the rushing stream of beer. I "
"filled it up like a drinking horn, and started to gulp. My memories of the "
"next hours are hazy. I vaguely remember the highlanders being extremely "
"angry at me for drinking all their beer. I remember how they started to turn "
"into great beasts – and my rival became a wolf with blazing eyes. He charged "
"me, but I caught him by his ears, shoved the mammoth's tusk in his mouth "
"like a bit, and tied my mustache to both ends, to form reigns.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 코르크 마개를 발로 차고 흐르는 맥주의 강에 엄니를 놓았어. 마치 뿔잔인 양 그것을 가득 채웠고, 벌컥벌컥 마시기 시작했지. "
"다음 순간의 기억은 흐릿하다네. 맥주를 싹 다 비워버렸다는데 고지 사람들이 길길이 날뛰었다는 것만 간신히 기억나지. 그래도, 어떻게 "
"그들이 커다란 짐승으로 변하기 시작했는지부턴 기억난다네. 내 적은 불타는 눈을 가진 늑대가 되었지. 그는 나에게 달려들었지만, 나는 그의 "
"귀를 잡은 뒤 매머드의 엄니를 그의 입에 넣었고, 내 콧수염의 양 끝을 묶어 분위기를 압도했지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "f527d131-27be-4871-8e1e-595587aea413"
msgid ""
"\"Enraged, the wolf rushed out into the night – with me firmly planted on "
"his back. We ran through the blizzard, and the vile dog whined in anger and "
"humiliation. In the morning he stopped running and fell, exhausted. I looked "
"around and realized there was not a single snowflake around. In the wild "
"race, we'd crossed the borders of {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} and entered an "
"amazing place, the ancestor of all other worlds. I took pity on the wolf and "
"let him go. He ran away at once. As for me, many adventures and exploits "
"still lay ahead.\""
msgstr ""
"\"격노한 늑대는 밤하늘 아래 달려 나갔네. 그의 등짝에 단단히 박힌 나와 함께 말이지. 우리는 눈보라를 뚫고 나왔고, 그 끔찍한 개는 "
"분노와 굴욕에 깽깽거렸네. 아침이 되자 개는 달리기를 멈추고 지쳐 쓰러졌지. 나는 주변에 눈송이가 하나도 없다는 것을 깨달았다네. 자연을 "
"달리던 중, 우리는 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 경계를 지나 다른 모든 세계의 조상인 놀라운 장소로 들어온걸세. 나는 늑대를 "
"불쌍히 여겨 그를 풀어 줬지. 즉시 도망치더군. 내 모험과 위업은 여전히 진행중 이라네. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "7f7446a7-db1b-411e-8076-88d5da807652"
msgid ""
"\"Once, all of them were elven virgins, captured and enslaved by an evil "
"slave-trading necromancer. The necromancer eventually perished, but the "
"tormented souls of his tortured captives were bound to his ship's "
"figurehead. Later, The Prestigious took this figurehead as a trophy. I felt "
"pity for the banshees and decided to help them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 때, 그들은 모두 엘프 처녀였고, 사악한 노예상 네크로맨서에게 붙들려 노예가 되었지. 결국 네크로맨서는 죽었지만, 고문을 당한 "
"포로들의 고통받는 영혼은 뱃머리 조각에 묶여 있었어. 나중에, 권위자 호가 이 조각을 전리품 삼았지. 나는 밴시를 불쌍히 여기고 그들을 "
"돕기로 결심했다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "72682e39-d16e-4726-8d27-1188ea31e9ac"
msgid ""
"\"I called upon one of the numerous sailors' deities of death, and amid the "
"storm he brought, I performed a sad song, written by myself, hoping to touch "
"his dead heart. And it's worth noting that none of the snoring pirates even "
"woke up! The weeping deity set the banshees free, and they all turned into "
"glowing ghostly maidens. To this day, they sing in a world-famous choir, "
"taking the guise of simple mortals.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 죽음과 관련된 수많은 선원들 신 중 하나를 불러냈고, 그가 불러온 폭풍의 한가운데에서, 그의 죽은 심장에 닿기를 바라며 내가 "
"작곡한 슬픈 노래를 불렀지. 어이없게도 코골아대던 해적들은 한 놈도 깨어나지 않았지! 감돔한 신은 밴시들을 자유롭게 만들었고, 그들은 "
"모두 빛나는 유령 처녀로 변했다네. 오늘날, 그들은 단순히 필멸자의 모습을 취한 채 세계적으로 유명한 합창단에서 노래하고 있다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "08833fb1-e844-4038-8cc8-631460b3d414"
msgid ""
"\"Though it made things a bit more complicated that I had to use real combat "
"swords. I traveled with the circus until I got a chance to escape. A well-"
"known captain, the Hurricane King, came to see one of our performances. He "
"accused me of being a fake, and challenged me to swallow his magnificent "
"rapier, a weapon he cherished more than life itself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 진검을 사용해야 하는 상황이 되자 조금 더 복잡해졌지. 탈출할 때까지는 서커스단과 함께 여행했다네. 그러다가 유명한 선장인 "
"태풍왕이 우리 공연 중 하나를 보려 왔지. 그는 날더러 가짜라고 비난했고, 그러면서 자기 생명보다 더 소중한 무기인 명검 레이피어를 "
"삼키라 시켰지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "36b36bc0-2216-454f-81ae-6aadede4a305"
msgid ""
"\"As the audience applauded, I performed the trick. It ended with my "
"spectacular disappearance in a cloud of smoke. When the reprobate came to "
"his senses and hurried to find me and his cherished rapier, I'd already sold "
"it to an unscrupulous vendor and was heading north, to flee his revenge. "
"That's why I try to stay away from the southern lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 관중들이 박수 갈채를 보내는 동안 속임수를 썼다네. 연기 구름 속에서 화려하게 사라졌지. 그 죄인이 제 정신을 차리고 급하게 "
"자신의 소중한 레이피어를 찾는 동안, 나는 이미 파렴치한 행상인에게 그것을 팔아치운 뒤 복수를 피하기 위해 북쪽으로 향하고 있었고. 그 "
"뒤로 나는 남쪽으로 가지 않으려 노력하게 되었다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0081_Text
msgctxt "226f1478-9dc6-4f7f-abaf-9d6c16cabf48"
msgid ""
"\"Chronomistress Shyka always carefully avoided meeting herself, and she'd "
"been jumping all over the timeline, like the water strider across the "
"surface of the pond – because the Lantern King was assuming her form to "
"trick her. After I revealed the game, I earned his unwanted attention, and "
"it was time I left the {g|First World}First World{/g} for good. As a gesture "
"of thanks, {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} opened a portal for me, but after I stepped in "
"it, I saw that Shyka's appearance had changed, and in her place stood the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}! It was not {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} on the "
"other side of that portal, but a far more dangerous place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간의 여주인 샤이카는 항상 조심스럽게 자기 자신과의 만남을 피했으며, 연못 표면을 가로 지르는 물수제비처럼 시간대를 뛰어 넘었지 – "
"등불왕이 그녀의 모습을 추리해서 그녀를 속이려 했기 때문이라네. 내가 그의 음모를 파헤친 뒤, 나는 그의 원치 않는 관심을 얻었고, 그 "
"때가 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 떠날 때라고 생각했어. 감사의 뜻으로 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 나를 위해 "
"포털을 열어줬어. 그러나 내가 거기에 들어서고 나서, 샤이카의 모습이 바뀌는걸 보았지. 그리고 그녀의 자리에는 "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 서 있었고! 포털의 반대편은 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}이 아니라, 그보다 훨씬 "
"위험한 곳이었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "0ac7c420-17ec-4fd3-93bf-9eb1f09be819"
msgid ""
"\"Seeking new purpose, I wound up at the Sinmarket, where I made a bargain – "
"and came away with a fair amount of dangerous curiosity, and on top of that, "
"a sack of tobacco, generously mixed with dirty thoughts, four to one. A "
"horrible mixture to smoke. But my purchases didn't make me happy. Soon "
"after, my curiosity, together with a swarm of my good friends – the "
"squirrels – helped me discover that one of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}, was playing a dirty trick on another Elder, "
"{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}, by assuming her form and visiting her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"새로운 목적을 추구하며 죄악의 시장에 도착했고, 거기서 거래를 시작했지. 거기서 나는 충분한 양의 위험한 호기심을, 그리고 그 "
"꼭대기에 더러운 생각과 4 대 1로 섞은 담배 한 자루를 얹어 떠났다네. 피우기에는 너무 끔찍한 혼합물이었지. 그러나 내가 구입한 것들은 "
"나를 행복하게 하지 않았고. 머지 않아, 나의 호기심과 나의 좋은 친구인 다람쥐 무리가 함께 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}인 "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}을 찾는걸 도왔는데, 그 당시 그는 또 다른 원로 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}의 모습을 추측하고 "
"찾아가는 식의 더러운 장난을 치던 중이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "60157470-30b2-4a50-ae0f-9865d3e39377"
msgid ""
"\"When Siroket came for me, I used my gloomiest voice to recite a spell in a "
"language I'd only just invented. On my signal, the kobold ignited the "
"tobacco, the whole sack of it, and clouds of stinky smoke filled the air. I "
"pretended to go into a fit. That was the second sign, and kobold started to "
"play his flute. Have you ever heard a deaf-mute kobold play the flute? The "
"winds have truly gone wild. The final hurricane is descending – the end of "
"all times! And the squirrels, my loyal friends – the squirrels start "
"screeching in different voices, from their hiding places behind the rocks. "
"The overall effect was terrifying, I must admit.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시로켓이 나를 찾았을 때, 나는 가장 낮은 목소리를 사용해 막 지어낸 언어로 주문을 외웠지. 내 신호에 맞춰서, 코볼트는 모든 담배 "
"자루에 불을 붙였고, 냄새 나는 연기 구름이 공기를 가득 채웠지. 나는 발작하는 척했네. 그게 두 번째 신호였고, 코볼트가 피리 연주를 "
"시작했지. 벙어리 코볼트가 플루트 연주를 하는 걸 들어본 적 있나? 바람이 매우 거칠어졌지. 마침내 폭풍이 생겼고, 이제 끝낼 시간이었 "
"다네! 내 충성스러운 친구인 다람쥐들은 바위에 숨어서 서로 다른 높이로 찍찍대기 시작했지. 그것들을 종합한 효과는 내가 인정할 만큼 "
"무시무시했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0084_Text
msgctxt "9c3eae2a-2483-4545-b55b-0edae9f81d69"
msgid ""
"\"As for me, I spun a bit of magic, to make the clouds of smoke look like "
"the devil lord. With a booming voice, the illusory figure praised me for my "
"efforts and 'gave me another task' – to create a grimoire, which would act "
"as a gateway for devils into my world. Then the winds subsided, and the "
"smoke cleared out. After that, Siroket didn't dare to lay a finger on me, "
"fearing my 'Master's' revenge. Devils are extremely stupid, after all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는, 연기의 구름을 데블 로드처럼 보이게 하기 위해 약간의 마법을 썼소. 우렁찬 목소리로, 그 환영은 내 노력을 치하했고, 내게 "
"'또 다른 과제'를 주었지 – 바로 데블이 우리 세계로 올 통로로 기능할 흑마법서를 만들라는 지시였소. 그 뒤, 바람이 가라 앉았고, "
"연기도 사라졌지. 그 후로 시로켓은 내 '주인님'의 복수를 두려워하여 감히 내게 손을 대지 않았지. 결국, 데블들은 아주 어리석다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "f79e1e0b-d321-4f58-9f8c-e04af84c1175"
msgid ""
"{n}The man interrupts you with a gesture.{/n} \"Now, just a moment. I don't "
"believe in coincidence. As you're already my guest, let's at least get to "
"know each other. My name is Blakemoor.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남자가 몸짓으로 당신을 방해합니다.{/n} \"잠깐. 나는 우연의 일치를 믿지 않는다네. 당신이 이미 내 손님인 만큼, 적어도 "
"서로를 알아가야겠지. 내 이름은 블레이크무어네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0101_Text
msgctxt "9f7861ff-4df9-42c1-b5ec-63e71c9e4bd9"
msgid ""
"\"This humble dwelling is my workshop. It's where I'm creating my "
"masterpiece – the scienmajistik grimoire, a calligraphic work of art. The "
"client who ordered it is my good friend, Captain Martyn... Oh, he must be "
"getting so impatient by now. I'm so far behind schedule. I just want the "
"grimoire to be perfect, you see?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 누추한 곳은 내 작업장이야. 여기서 내 걸작을 만드는 중이라네 – 마도과학적 흑마법서이자, 서예 작품이지. 이걸 주문한 의뢰인은 "
"내 친한 친구, 마르틴 선장이라네... 오, 지금쯤이면 그의 참을성이 바닥났겠군. 계획했던 것보다 훨씬 늦었으니. 나는 그저 마법책이 "
"완벽해지길 바랄뿐이네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0102_Text
msgctxt "29aaaae1-8630-4318-a4c4-979b39762a63"
msgid ""
"{n}Blakemoor's voice trembles.{/n} \"But if you could come back in a week, "
"the book should be ready by then… I have almost no doubt about it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}블레이크무어의 목소리가 떨립니다.{/n} \"하지만 일주일 후에 다시 온다면, 책은 준비가 되어 있을거야... 내가 장담하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0105_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "80759cfd-5a59-413e-afd8-bdb082c88b32"
msgid ""
"{n}As Jubilost listens to the story, he opens his mouth to interrupt, but "
"then he closes it as he realizes the futility of the attempt. When Blakemoor "
"finishes, the gnome just sighs.{/n} \"{g|Desna}Desna{/g} help me sort out "
"this mess! Half the story seems to be made of reliable facts, while the "
"other half sounds like unmitigated bullshit! Even in relation to the {g|"
"First World}First World{/g}, which is already insane by nature!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 이야기를 듣고 끼어들기 위해 입을 열었지만 시도의 무의미함을 깨닫고 입을 닫습니다. 블레이크무어가 말을 끝내자 노움은 "
"한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"{g|Desna}데즈나{/g}시여, 이 엉망진창을 정리하도록 도와주십시오! 이야기의 절반은 믿을만한 사실로 "
"만들어졌고 다른 절반은 그 자체로 거짓이야. 심지어는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}와 관련한 이야기는 본질적으로 말도 "
"안되는 것들 뿐이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0108_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "505db21f-7ad3-42a8-bbb1-352f1d866029"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri listens to the story with suspicion, but in the end, she roars with "
"laughter.{/n} \"So that's who drank all the beer in that tavern! Our tribe "
"liked to stay there, but there was that one time they had no beer and a "
"mammoth's tusk was broken. But the thing about the werewolf owners... that's "
"a lie. They're not werewolves — I should know!\" {n}Amiri looks back at you "
"hesitantly, as though seeking support.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 의심스럽게 이야기를 듣지만 결국 그녀는 웃음 소리를 냅니다.{/n} \"그 술집에 있는 모든 맥주를 마셨던 자가 밝혀졌군! "
"우리 부족은 거기서 머물곤 했는데, 맥주 한 방울도 안남고 매머드의 엄니도 부러져 있던 때가 있었어. 그러나 늑대 주인에 관한 것은... "
"거짓말이야. 그들은 늑대 인간이 아니야. 알아챘어야 했는데!\" {n}아미리는 도움을 바라는 것처럼 주저하며 당신을 뒤돌아 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0111_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "f8bcd6d6-c521-4b3a-8a0d-31b389c61363"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim shakes his head, almost admiringly.{/n} \"Please allow me to visit "
"you on occasion, honorable Blakemoor. I have never met a more stunning "
"example of wasted words, madness, and pride incarnate. I must see the day "
"these things bring you to a sad end.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 거의 감탄하듯 고개를 저었습니다.{/n}가끔씩 당신을 방문 할 수 있도록 허락해 주시게. 블레이크무어. 나는 이런 무용담을 "
"들은 적이 없다오. 나는 이 일들의 결말이 슬프게 끝나는 것을 보아야만해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0112_Text
msgctxt "d9aad5e9-09b5-444e-84a5-f9a41bb0613b"
msgid ""
"\"With great pleasure, honored dwarf! And do remind me to tell you of my "
"meeting with {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. I have to admit, I was almost charmed "
"by him — who'd have thought the god of the End Times would have such an "
"excellent sense of humor!\""
msgstr ""
"\"대단히 기쁘다네. 고귀한 드워프여! 그러면 내가 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}와 만났던 이야기를 해줄까. 나는 그로투스에게 거의 "
"빠져들뻔했다는 사실을 인정해야겠지. 어느 누가 종말의 신에게 그런 훌륭한 유머 감각이 있을거라 생각하겠나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Blakemoor/Cue_0113_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "026e4d6b-7bb8-4533-808b-cf5fbf36e8f6"
msgid ""
"{n}Kalikke listens closely to Blakemoor's story, her eyes wide open, then "
"claps her hands.{/n} \"What a story! So what is this 'Sinmarket' – and could "
"you really buy a curiosity there? And your squirrel friends — are they "
"magical, talking squirrels? Are they fluffy and nice? Oh wise and honorable "
"Blakemoor, forgive me if I'm bothering you, but could you please, please "
"tell us more of your adventures?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}칼리케는 블레이크무어의 이야기를 주의 깊게 들으면서 눈을 동그랗게 뜨고는 손뼉을 칩니다.{/n} \"정말 대단하네요! 그래서 "
"'죄악의 시장'은 무엇인가요? 거기서 호기심을 산다는 게 사실인가요? 그리고 당신의 다람쥐 친구들은 말을 할 줄 아는 마법의 생물인가요? "
"복슬복슬하고 귀여운가요? 블레이크무어씨는 똑똑하고 멋지네요. 실례가 안된다면 당신의 모험담을 조금만 더 들려주실 수 없나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Answer_0004_Text_String
msgctxt "8c30984d-a8b1-46fa-9675-b91a19ebccdb"
msgid "[Knock politely]"
msgstr "[정중히 노크합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Answer_0005_Text_String
msgctxt "b141d1a1-4665-4add-b1d4-6cbd1a4128ce"
msgid "[Break the door down]"
msgstr "[문을 부숩니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Answer_0006_Text_String
msgctxt "5634cdb2-1be0-49fc-a7df-d7c263d67bae"
msgid "[Pick the lock]"
msgstr "[자물쇠를 땁니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Answer_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "ebd7245a-f59c-4268-bbd4-c452c41e5560"
msgid "[Open the door with Blutmond's key]"
msgstr "[블러트먼드의 열쇠로 문을 엽니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3b2aa541-f0cb-4981-80ec-d3576faf6550"
msgid "\"Well, I guess that means we'll have to come back some other time!\""
msgstr "\"글쎄. 우리가 다른 시간에 다시 와야 할 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "c580401a-cbf4-45c1-a9f4-9f2ba73b7489"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "195dbf6d-05ec-4f78-8761-c1845976a119"
msgid ""
"{n}A solid door blocks your entrance. The owner clearly doesn't care for "
"uninvited guests.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문이 굳건히 닫혀있습니다. 주인은 초대 받지 않은 손님을 들이지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "a52053fc-8242-4276-a2b2-7bc1aa31c914"
msgid ""
"{n}The door seems even more solid than before. Apparently, someone put a lot "
"of effort into reinforcing it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문은 이전보다 훨씬 견고합니다. 외관상 누군가 그것을 강화하기 위하여 많은 노력을 했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "2f1fb5e1-b31f-49ca-8e84-1f6a7df40771"
msgid "{n}Nothing happens.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아무 반응이 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "5a5baa9b-88cd-4d9f-ac4f-e1ad0811b187"
msgid ""
"{n}Something makes a crunching sound – either the door, or your shoulder – "
"but the lock gives way, and the door quietly swings open.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}무언가가 으드득하며 소리를 냅니다. 문일 수도, 혹은 당신의 어깨에서 나는 소리일 수도 있습니다. 그러나 잠금이 풀려서 문이 조용히 "
"열립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "af8ec258-72cc-4824-8da8-9ac6b2eb0453"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems like you hear a note of mockery in the creak of the door's "
"hinges. All your efforts are in vain.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문 경첩이 삐걱거리는 소리가 들리는 것 같습니다. 모든 노력은 헛수고였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e2b9369f-40dc-4806-9017-6c4a60248a12"
msgid ""
"{n}You've got a feeling that there's a stone wall right behind this door. "
"Breaking it down would seem impossible, even for a true giant.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 문 바로 뒤에 돌담이 있다는 느낌이 들었습니다. 진짜 거인이라 할지라도 그것을 무너뜨리는 것은 불가능해 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6544916d-e6d5-4c90-b638-ef0886860e5c"
msgid "{n}The keyhole is sealed with lead.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}열쇠 구멍은 납으로 봉인되어 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "29c6cc77-7b46-4176-9bfc-c8ae3664b907"
msgid ""
"{n}The simple lock didn't stand a chance. The door quietly swings open.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}간단한 자물쇠는 제 역할을 못했습니다. 문이 조용히 열립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "8c38cbe8-fa9e-406b-a0a5-be375e5e8e35"
msgid ""
"{n}You hear metal crunch, and only a half of a lockpick remains in your "
"hands. From inside the keyhole you hear the sound of metal chomping.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}금속 마찰음이 들리고 손에는 잠금 장치를 풀 철사의 절반만 남습니다. 열쇠 구멍 안쪽에서 금속이 달그락거리는 소리가 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "421a374d-1476-493f-ba1c-e8014d67162e"
msgid "{n} The door quietly swings opens.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}문이 조용히 열립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Door/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "4de92516-71ef-4318-9b26-f8c22af59218"
msgid ""
"{n}The door literally shines with dozens of magical auras. It's impossible "
"to see any pattern in this mess. It seems like the spells were thrown on the "
"door occasionally and chaotically rather than created in an elaborate "
"order.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}문은 문자 그대로 수십 개의 화려한 아우라로 빛납니다. 이 혼란 속에서 어떠한 패턴도 볼 수는 없습니다. 정교한 순서로 만들어졌기 "
"보단 산발적이고 무질서하게 문위로 던져진 주문 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Items/Grimoire_Description_String
msgctxt "8f9b5e66-585d-4eca-a36b-3956984a214b"
msgid ""
"An extremely thick tome, consisting of hundreds of pages. There's an "
"embossed golden cherub on its cover. The pages are inscribed with archaic "
"writings, and images of various bizarre creatures and landscapes, drawn in a "
"classical style. The text is confusing and full of logical twists. You feel "
"your head swimming and quickly become lost if you try to read more than a "
"page at a time. It would take a very long time to read the whole thing."
msgstr ""
"수백 페이지로 구성된 매우 두꺼운 책입니다. 그것의 덮개에 양각으로 황금 아기천사가 새겨져 있습니다. 이 페이지에는 고대 문자가 새겨져 "
"있으며 기괴한 생물과 풍경의 이미지가 고전적인 스타일로 그려져 있습니다. 텍스트가 혼란스럽고 논리적인 왜곡으로 가득 차 있습니다. 한 "
"번에 한 페이지 이상을 읽으려 하면 머릿속이 헤엄 치다 길을 잃은 것처럼 느낄 수 있습니다. 모든 것을 읽는 데는 아주 오랜 시간이 걸릴 "
"것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/BlakemoorHideOut/Items/Grimoire_String
msgctxt "5ef53fc8-2ebc-4f6a-b65d-8a65d6018afe"
msgid "Blackemoor's Grimoire"
msgstr "블레이크무어의 흑마법서"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "2f432db1-631f-4d27-b137-89f1ebc504a4"
msgid "...taking off!"
msgstr "...벗어납니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "1f990049-0d38-48c3-a49b-66d1696cc477"
msgid "...making someone their minion with the power of their mighty mind!"
msgstr "... 그들의 위대한 정신력은 누군가를 그들의 미니언으로 만들었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "b3caab73-3a49-4f49-967b-3967a8d9a145"
msgid "...breathing fire!"
msgstr "...불을 뿜습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "b5827305-f3e1-4263-bc1d-85fb6664a402"
msgid "...changing reality!"
msgstr "...모습을 바꿉니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "e696cb95-9151-4b98-998f-4b17e99efd6b"
msgid "...making thousands of flowers bloom!"
msgstr "...꽃 수천송이를 피웁니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "58a90e1c-0313-4528-a728-f89edf7f0c81"
msgid "...charming an attractive being!"
msgstr "...매력적인 존재를 유혹합니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "d80b83e2-29a6-4a83-8796-a1efe4ff1dab"
msgid "...building a stairway to the sky!"
msgstr "...하늘로 향하는 계단을 만듭니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "2ab8039e-9d56-4b98-9f67-46ac00fd9537"
msgid "...dropping a lake from the mountain!"
msgstr "...산에서 호수가 아래로 흐르게 합니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "e3de0491-1c5a-49b0-95d9-8bc3a199ed0a"
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[계속합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "36bd766b-a546-4a64-aee4-ac484dd4cb5c"
msgid "\"So, is this your realm?\""
msgstr "\"그래서 여기가 당신 땅인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "ff36943f-6d3d-4bcf-a616-0d6ec48a4d5f"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm tired of your games, Nyrissa!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너의 장난에 질렸어 나이리사!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "fa0249bc-dae8-44a3-aede-3c6b4f3fb773"
msgid "\"This is a crazy plan. Give it up, or you'll lose everything.\""
msgstr "\"이것은 미친 계획이야. 포기하지 않으면 모든 것을 잃을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "7d96b7be-5983-486f-827a-0554770fd267"
msgid "\"It's a good idea. Too bad this is all just a dream.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이다. 단지 꿈이어서 아쉬울 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "be7c9280-4eae-48c8-b492-978a1c8fd050"
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[계속합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "d591f2d3-1d7f-4d14-b7c8-22a570d7ef2e"
msgid "\"Yes. You deserve your fate.\""
msgstr "\"그래. 네 운명을 받아들여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "a661f16d-5e7c-4626-b610-0db5bdf225de"
msgid ""
"\"No. Don't succumb to evil and despair. Only then will you have a chance.\""
msgstr "\"아니, 악과 절망에 굴복해서는 안돼. 기회는 생길 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "f55785d5-676c-4318-8ef3-24c9d9d99f6d"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "2f3b89fd-d467-4c5f-8ea6-c21c9b353c80"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_0077_Text
msgctxt "130b2e09-ac5d-44c3-9e25-f6fd7d68e0f2"
msgid "[Continue]"
msgstr "[계속합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_GiantLinzi_Text
msgctxt "af37e42c-e38a-47ac-a4c0-1cbebf593d18"
msgid "...a shaggy giant with a huge club!"
msgstr "...거대한 곤봉을 든 털복숭이 거인입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_InkpotLinzi_Text
msgctxt "001d840d-e213-4f96-b9b8-70380e032dd8"
msgid "...a flying inkwell!"
msgstr "...날아다니는 잉크병입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_NormalLinzi_Text
msgctxt "dae4f638-6ed2-446c-9d7c-589f9074b0fa"
msgid "...an unknown but very fluffy creature!"
msgstr "...미확인 털복숭이 생물입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_dragon_Text
msgctxt "fc252f82-cf9a-4914-a703-c214781818fb"
msgid "...a magnificent and powerful dragon!"
msgstr "...거대하고 강력한 드래곤입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_fey_Text
msgctxt "95c63be8-3d04-4755-9553-1759ab420b1b"
msgid ""
"...{mf|a fossegrim — a regal and handsome representative of the fey people|"
"an oceanid — a mysterious and seductive representative of the fey people}!"
msgstr "... {mf|포세그림 — 장엄하고 멋진 페이 종족의 대리인|오케아니드 — 신비하고 매혹적인 페이 종족의 대리인}입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Answer_tree_Text
msgctxt "c15ef005-4e4e-40ca-bc7e-4755ec870d29"
msgid "...a tall, slender, sprawling tree!"
msgstr "... 크고, 날씬하고, 거대한 나무입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "69b1414c-c9f3-4d05-9744-f3245524e346"
msgid ""
"...In the eerie silence following the {mf|king|queen}'s last words, we heard "
"a strange, melodic chime. The world around us began melting into a colorful "
"whirlwind. The insidious nymph Nyrissa was gone. The visions of her servants "
"faded away like candle smoke. I instantly realized what was happening — we "
"were being drawn to the deepest level of the dream! In \"places\" like "
"these, secret memories and desires could be hidden, sometimes not even known "
"to their owner. What incredible luck to make it there! But... would we be "
"able to return?"
msgstr ""
"... {mf|왕|여왕}의 마지막 주문과 함께 무서운 침묵이 흐르고 이상하고 감미로운 소리를 들었습니다. 우리 주변의 세계는 다채로운 "
"회오리 바람에 녹기 시작했습니다. 교활한 님프 나이리사는 사라졌습니다. 그녀의 하인들의 환영은 촛불 연기처럼 사라져 버렸습니다. 나는 "
"무엇이 일어나고 있는지 즉각 깨달았습니다. 우리는 꿈의 가장 깊은 수준으로 이끌렸습니다! 이와 같은 \"장소\"에서 은밀한 기억과 욕구가 "
"감추어지기도 하고 때로는 주인조차 알지 못할 수도 있습니다. 여기에 오는 것은 얼마나 놀라운 행운입니까! 하지만 .. 우리가 돌아올 수 "
"있을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "f68b9b03-832b-456a-8830-7ef6e1c5def6"
msgid ""
"We found ourselves in a flat area among glistening, pale-green rocks. The "
"areas of lush vegetation spotting the rocks were easily recognizable as "
"flowers of the {g|First World}First World{/g}. Beneath the cliffs, a forest "
"of white trees with sky-blue leaves could be seen. In the distance, the "
"sharp spires of an ornate castle reached into colorful clouds. As we "
"watched, the castle trembled and very slowly began moving away — it was "
"built on the back of a huge, huge, enormously huge three-eyed elephant with "
"branching tusks! I turned and realized that we had also changed our shapes, "
"obeying the laws of the dream. Our {mf|king|queen} had turned into..."
msgstr ""
"우리는 반짝이는 옅은 녹색의 바위 사이에서 평평한 지역에 있는 것을 발견했습니다. 무성한 초목이 수놓은 암석은 {g|First World}"
"태초 세계{/g}의 꽃을 발견하는 것 만큼 흔합니다. 절벽 아래 하늘색 나뭇잎이 있는 흰 나무 숲이 보였습니다. 멀리서 화려한 성곽의 "
"날카로운 첨탑이 화려한 구름에 닿습니다. 우리가 보자 성은 떨리면서 매우 천천히 움직이기 시작했습니다 - 그것은 매우 거대한 3눈박이에 "
"엄니가 무수히 난 코끼리의 등에 지어졌습니다! 나는 꿈의 법칙에 순종하면서 우리의 모습을 변화 시켰음을 깨달았습니다. 우리의 "
"{mf|왕|여왕}은 바뀌기 시작합니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "2ffdd71d-b003-4093-ac0c-8066c2fc9b25"
msgid ""
"But what had I become? The {mf|king|queen} met my gaze and said, \"Linzi, "
"you look exactly like...\""
msgstr "그러나 나는 무엇이 되었습니까? {mf|왕|여왕}와 시선이 마주쳤습니다.\"린지 너 모습이 마치...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "61a14732-697d-4442-bc63-69b4c9df5778"
msgid ""
"The sun blazed across the golden scales of a dragon, reflecting thousands of "
"sunspots all around!"
msgstr "태양은 하늘에서 비추어 수천 개의 흑점이 용의 황금 비늘에 반사됩니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "508e78e7-9364-4800-9ba3-f135c4eaaaee"
msgid ""
"The wind blew the long white hair of the {mf|fossegrim king|oceanid queen}, "
"{mf|his|her} sea-blue eyes shining with an incredible light."
msgstr ""
"바람은 {mf|포세그림 왕|오케아니드 여왕}의 긴 흰 머리카락을 날려 버리고 {mf|그의|그녀의} 바다 같이 파란 눈은 믿을 수없는 "
"빛으로 빛납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "192feac0-9602-4684-9052-50b4b4896b9c"
msgid ""
"Drops of dew sparkled off the copper leaves of a tall tree, its thick shadow "
"falling to the ground in a complex pattern."
msgstr "이슬 방울은 키가 큰 나무의 구리 잎에서 반짝 빛납니다. 잎의 두꺼운 그림자는 복잡한 패턴으로 바닥에 떨어졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "cbe886bc-6d6b-437f-8283-e59990e8c0b2"
msgid ""
"Love can make flowers bloom and take root under the most unexpected "
"circumstances! An astonishing aspen was lovestruck by the tall, copper-"
"leaved stranger. After spending some time in conversation filled with "
"intriguing queries and unspoken promises, the aspen had to leave on urgent "
"business. \"Our meeting was unforgettable!\" — those were its last words. "
"The {mf|king|queen} was thoughtfully silent. And then {mf||s}he tried..."
msgstr ""
"사랑은 꽃을 피우고 가장 뜻밖의 상황에서 뿌리를 내릴 수 있습니다! 놀라운 사시나무는 키가 크고 구리 잎의 이방인에 의해 사랑에 "
"빠졌습니다. 흥미로운 질문과 무언의 약속으로 가득한 대화로 시간을 보낸 후에 사시나무는 급히 떠나야 했습니다. \"우리의 만남은 잊을 수 "
"없었습니다!\" - 그것이 마지막 말이었습니다. {mf|왕|여왕}은 신중하게 침묵했습니다. 그리고 {mf||s}은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "70519402-a1cd-4c31-8968-9950fb69b5a4"
msgid ""
"The {g|First World}First World{/g}, from what the legends say, is a special "
"place in which those who possess enough strength and imagination can alter "
"the reality there to their liking. Our {mf|king|queen}, of course, was one "
"of those so gifted!\n"
"Concentrating, {mf||s}he easily changed the color of the leaves on the "
"nearest aspen bright purple! After that, it was time for a more ambitious "
"task..."
msgstr ""
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}는 전설에 의하면 충분한 힘과 상상력을 가진 사람들이 자신의 취향에 맞게 현실을 바꿀 수 있는 "
"특별한 장소입니다. 우리의 {mf|왕|여왕}는 당연히 능력자 중 하나였습니다!\n"
"집중하면서 {mf||s} 그는 가장 가까운 사시나무의 잎을 밝은 자주색깔로 쉽게 바꾸었습니다! 그 후에는 더 야심 찬 일을 할 "
"시간이었습니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "5661e005-4871-4ecf-8005-98459b52fffb"
msgid ""
"After several attempts, the {mf|fossegrim king|oceanid queen} had built a "
"fancy stairway out of rainbow and adorned it with waterfalls on either side, "
"falling right out of the sky!"
msgstr ""
"여러 번 시도한 후에 {mf|fossegrim king|oceanid queen}는 무지개로 멋진 계단을 만들고 양쪽에 폭포로 장식하여 "
"물이 하늘에서 떨어졌습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0039_InkLoot_Text
msgctxt "f7622f82-4c3b-4b70-be05-f01d76e92f15"
msgid ""
"After some practice with puddles and pebbles, the {mf|king|queen} formed a "
"real lake in midair above our heads. Fish swam in it, and the wind moved "
"waves along its surface... across all its surfaces! Then the {mf|king|queen} "
"sent the lake sailing through the air and \"dropped\" it over the cliff! It "
"fell to the bottom and flooded out with a deafening splash. What a sight to "
"behold!"
msgstr ""
"웅덩이와 자갈로 연습한 후에 {mf|왕|여왕}는 우리 머리 위 허공에 진짜 호수를 만들었습니다. 물고기가 수영했고 바람은 그 표면을 따라 "
"파도를 만들었습니다... 모든 표면에서 말입니다! 그런 다음 {mf|왕|여왕}는 허공에 호수를 띄워 보냈고 절벽 위로 \"떨어뜨렸습니다\""
"! 그것은 바닥으로 떨어졌고 소리 없이 물이 튀며 넘쳐 흐르게 되었습니다. 놀라운 광경이로군요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0040_Nyr_Text_String
msgctxt "a7e23564-0fa8-4758-be72-ef2c8a370977"
msgid ""
"...A melodic laugh suddenly rang out of nowhere — not offensive, but "
"rather... inspiring. It seems someone was watching the {mf|king|queen}'s "
"attempts!"
msgstr ""
"...흥겨운 웃음 소리가 어디선가 갑자기 울려 퍼졌습니다. 악의 없지만 흥미롭습니다. 누군가 {mf|왕|여왕}의 마법을 지켜보는 것 "
"같습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "5f9ca4a9-1e45-4a56-9aa3-109f17e64046"
msgid ""
"Feeling the full power of {mf|his|her} new guise, the {mf|king|queen} "
"immediately tried..."
msgstr "자신의 새로운 모습에 전능감을 느끼면서 {mf|왕|여왕}은 곧바로..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "0a7c3bad-9752-497b-ada8-3d3ad364cd27"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, games with reality turned out to be a bit beyond the "
"{mf|king|queen}'s current power. With a bunch of practice, {mf||s}he would "
"have surely produced the desired result. But for now, instead of shaking the "
"foundations of the world or erecting a castle in the clouds, {mf||s}he "
"turned {mf|him|her}self into a tree. A very tall and slender tree. Covered "
"with flowers."
msgstr ""
"불행히도 현실을 바꾸는 놀이는 {mf|왕|여왕}의 힘에는 조금 힘겨운 것으로 밝혀졌습니다. 많은 연습으로 {mf||s} 그는 분명히 "
"원하는 결과를 얻을 수 있을 것입니다. 그러나 지금은 세계의 기초를 흔들거나 구름에 성을 세우는 대신에 {mf||s} 그는 "
"{mf|그|그녀} 자신을 나무로 바꿉니다. 매우 크고 날씬한 나무입니다. 꽃으로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "3e9ba3bb-8dfc-4d74-b4f4-46e3deee93dc"
msgid ""
"It was none other than Nyrissa herself approaching! But something in her "
"appearance was strikingly different from the insidious, cold-blooded villain "
"we'd come to know — there was no shadow of arrogance or anger in her face, "
"just cheerful sparkles in her bright blue eyes. \"I am glad to meet new "
"guests in my domain. Greetings!\" She didn't seem to recognize us at all!"
msgstr ""
"다른 누구도 아닌 나이리사가 다가 오고 있었습니다! 하지만 그녀의 모습은 우리가 아는 냉담하고 냉혈한 악당의 모습과는 확연하게 "
"달랐습니다. 그녀의 얼굴에 오만이나 분노의 그림자는 없었고, 밝은 청색의 눈동자 속에는 쾌활한 반짝임 뿐이었습니다. \"내 영역에서 "
"새로운 손님을 만나게 되어 기쁘군요. 안녕하세요!\" 우리를 전혀 눈치채지 못 한 것 같습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "3ae300a2-cea6-4a8f-9bb7-97b207e3dd9d"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes!\" The nymph pointed to the forest below with an elegant gesture. "
"Obeying her will, all the trees immediately changed their colors, turning "
"from white and blue to red and gold, then to an elegant green. \"I am "
"Nyrissa. This is my Thousandbreaths.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그럼요!\" 님프는 우아한 손짓으로 아래 쪽의 숲을 가리킵니다. 그러자 그녀의 의지에 따라, 모든 나무들이 순식간에 색을 "
"바꾸었습니다. 흰색과 파란색에서 빨간색과 금색으로, 그러고 나서는 근사한 녹색으로. \"저의 이름은 나이리사. 이곳은 제 천 개의 "
"숨결이랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "80072702-b8ce-49e1-be41-6e6d777982df"
msgid ""
"She smiled dreamily and ran up the steps of our heavenly stairway. \"I see "
"you have already begun settling yourself within my realm. Fine work!\""
msgstr "그녀는 꿈을 꾸듯 웃었고 천상의 계단을 뛰어 올라갔습니다. \"나라 안에서 벌써 자리를 잡아가고 있군요. 좋은 활약이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "18e6ef1e-8db5-4572-8828-207dcceb18c2"
msgid ""
"She scooped up the fire still burning in places after the dragon's breath "
"and rolled it in her hands, turning it into a flower — a wild rose with "
"glowing petals. Before our eyes, the flower took root and spread across the "
"nearest rock."
msgstr ""
"그녀가 드래곤의 브레스가 닿았던 자리에서 계속해서 타오르고 있는 불을 퍼 올렸습니다. 그녀가 손 안에서 화염을 굴리자 그것은 한 송이의 "
"꽃으로 변합니다. 은은한 빛을 내는 잎을 가진 야생 장미로요. 우리의 눈 앞에서 꽃은 뿌리를 내렸고 제일 가까운 바위를 뒤덮었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "20a758d6-0676-406e-b3b4-c55747772588"
msgid ""
"She picked up one of the flowers that had fallen from the branches of the "
"{mf|king|queen}-tree, and with a sly smile placed it in her hair."
msgstr "그녀는 {mf|왕|여왕} 나무에서 피고 떨어진 꽃을 집어 들었어요. 그리고 교활한 미소를 지으며 그녀의 머리카락에 꽂았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "1510e314-d16a-4f8b-97dd-e54ecae35453"
msgid ""
"\"I like you, stranger. Will you stay with me? Soon, I will become something "
"much more than I am now. Soon, my domain will become larger, more beautiful, "
"its borders open to the bravest, most wonderful creatures, all with blazing "
"souls. Together we will create a dreamland unlike any the {g|First World}"
"First World{/g} has ever known.\" Silence fell for a moment, before the "
"{mf|king|queen} finally replied..."
msgstr ""
"\"나는 네가 좋아. 낯선 사람. 나와 함께 있어 줄래? 곧 나는 지금보다 훨씬 더 많은 것이 될 거야. 곧 내 영역은 더 커지고 더 "
"아름답게 될 것이며 그 경계는 용감하고 가장 멋진 생물에게 열릴 거야. 우리는 이제까지 알고 있던 {g|First World}태초 "
"세계{/g}보다 더 꿈 같은 세계를 만들 거야. \"침묵은 잠시 동안 이어지고 {mf|왕|여왕}이 마침내 대답했습니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "caa3968d-6b13-4e19-8204-c03ac852bcc9"
msgid ""
"For a moment, doubt flashed in the beautiful eyes of the nymph, but then she "
"spoke with an unprecedented ardency, as though trying to convince the "
"{mf|king|queen}, or perhaps herself. \"I will not give up! Not a chance! "
"Even a simple drop of water lives a more interesting life than we children "
"of the {g|First World}First World{/g}. A drop may ascend and fall, freeze "
"and melt, dance with lightning in the storm, or create a rainbow. We are "
"capable of much more, but we live out each day without trying to change "
"anything in the world, or in our destiny. I want more — I will achieve more. "
"I will become one of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. I will create the realm of my "
"dreams.\"\n"
"...As Nyrissa spoke, the scene blurred in a mosaic of colors, and her voice "
"began sounding more distant, fading away. For a moment, there was darkness, "
"and we..."
msgstr ""
"잠시 동안 님프의 아름다운 눈에 의심이 빛이 깃들었지만 {mf|왕|여왕} 또는 자신을 설득하려는 듯 그녀는 전례 없는 열렬한 태도로 "
"말했습니다. \"나는 포기하지 않을 거야! 한발의 양보도 없어! 물 한 방울이라도 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 아이들인 "
"우리보다 더 흥미로운 삶을 살아. 물방울은 올라가거나 떨어지고 얼거나 녹기도 하고 폭풍우와 번개에 맞춰 춤을 추고 무지개를 만들 수도 "
"있어. 우리는 훨씬 더 많은 일을 할 수 있지만 우리는 세상에서나 우리의 운명에서나 아무것도 변화시키지 않고 매일 매일을 살아가. 나는 "
"더 많이 성취하고 원해. 나는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 될 거야. 내 꿈의 영역을 만들 거야. \"\n"
"... 나이리사가 말하면서 눈 그 장면은 모자이크 색으로 흐려지고 그녀의 목소리는 점점 더 멀어져 사라져갔습니다. 잠시 동안 어둠이 "
"있었고 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "c3da29c0-1fbd-4dd1-b2a3-8b12133b65d7"
msgid ""
"\"A dream?\" The nymph showed no understanding of what we meant, but she "
"smiled warmly, if a bit teasingly. \"Let it be so, then — one day, this "
"dream will become reality. We children of the {g|First World}First World{/g} "
"are gifted with the ability to change reality, so we are free to fulfill any "
"dream. We are often too timid to do this, expecting punishment from our "
"{g|Eldest}self-proclaimed gods{/g}. But I for one am not afraid! How about "
"you, stranger?\"\n"
"Her words sounded progressively quieter as the world around us was subsumed "
"in a multicolored fog. Before the {mf|king|queen} could reply, the vision "
"faded. Then we..."
msgstr ""
"\"꿈?\" 님프는 우리가 의미하는 바를 전혀 이해하지 못했지만 약간은 어색하고 따뜻하게 미소를 지었습니다. \"괜찮군. 언젠가는 이 "
"꿈이 실현 될 거야. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 자손인 우리는 현실을 바꿀 수 있는 능력을 지니고 있어서 우리는 "
"자유롭게 꿈을 이룰 수 있지. 우리는 종종 너무 소심해서 {g|Eldest}신이라고 우기는 녀석들{/g}에게 처벌을 받을 까 겁나. "
"하지만 나는 두려워하지 않는다! 너는 무섭지 않아? 이방인?\"\n"
"우리 주변의 안개가 여러 색의 안개로 덮이면서 그녀의 말은 점점 조용해졌습니다. {mf|왕|여왕}이 대답하기 전에 주변 모습이 "
"사라집니다. 그리고 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "85eafe97-e60e-40ca-8e58-92afe59435c5"
msgid ""
"...found ourselves in a completely different place! But it seemed vaguely "
"familiar. The stone platform with a pedestal in the middle — that was "
"something we'd already seen in the {g|First World}First World{/g}, back when "
"we were looking for a way to get rid of the Everblooming Flower. As in that "
"old vision, Nyrissa sat on the pedestal, her head bowed low... just a shadow "
"of the proud and powerful nymph we'd spoken with but recently! The place she "
"sat literally emanated an intense pressure and a feeling of stiffness — my "
"guess is it was some sort of magical prison!\n"
"As we approached, Nyrissa raised her head, and she spoke in a muffled voice, "
"\"You... I remember you...\""
msgstr ""
"... 완전히 다른 곳에서 우리 자신을 발견했습니다! 그러나 그것은 막연하게 친숙한 것처럼 보였습니다. 중간에 받침대가 있는 석재 제단 —"
" 그것은 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}에서 영원히 피는 꽃을 없애려고 할 때 우리가 이미 본 것입니다. 아까의 주변과 "
"같이 나이리사는 받침대에 앉아 있었고 그녀의 머리를 조아렸습니다... 우리가 말했던 자랑스럽고 강력한 님프의 그림자였습니다. 그녀가 "
"그대로 앉아 있었던 장소는 강렬한 기운과 완고한 느낌을 발산했습니다 — 나의 추측에는 일종의 마법 감옥입니다!\n"
"우리가 다가갔을 때 나이리사는 그녀의 머리를 올렸고 그녀는 죽은 목소리로 말합니다. \"당신을 기억해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "e3b491a5-36b7-4a4c-afd4-b8d0ada2b5c6"
msgid ""
"\"Our meeting is the last of my bright memories... the evanescent dream. "
"Afterward... there was the battle. My sisters, slain by the monster with "
"such ease, like wind extinguishing candles... Defeat and pain. Why have you "
"come? To relish in my despair?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 만남은 나의 밝은 기억의 마지막이었어. 덧없는 꿈이었지. 그 후... 전투가 있었어. 나의 자매는 바람에 꺼지는 양초처럼 괴물에 "
"의해 죽임을 당했어.... 패배와 고통 뿐이었어. 왜 온 거야? 내 절망을 음미하기 위해서?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "254817e4-c8b4-4861-a984-a1842ee0ba16"
msgid ""
"Something strange shone in the nymph's eyes. It was as if the words of the "
"{mf|king|queen} had been imprinted somewhere deep in her soul.\n"
"With these final words, the vision faded, taking us back to where we had "
"entered this crazy world of melting dreams..."
msgstr ""
"님프의 눈에서 이상한 빛이 났습니다. 그것은 마치 {mf|왕|여왕}의 말이 그녀의 영혼 깊숙한 곳에서 각인되는 것 같습니다.\n"
"마지막 말이 끝나자 주변이 흐릿해지고 아련하고 혼란한 꿈의 세계로 되돌아갑니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "4c192f9b-2411-43ab-960e-897d28a3a04b"
msgid ""
"The nymph shook her head in disgust. \"I know not how you know my name or "
"why you wish to harm me. I do not wish to kill you, stranger, but I fear I "
"must teach you a lesson. Defend yourself!\""
msgstr ""
"님프는 머리를 혐오의 표현으로 흔들었습니다. \"당신이 어떻게 내 이름을 아는지 왜 나를 해하려 하는지 나는 알지 못한다. 나는 너를 "
"죽이고 싶지 않아. 이방인. 내가 너에게 교훈을 가르쳐야 한다는 사실이 두렵구나. 그럼 공격한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "493f9fb5-f1f5-417f-8bfd-cc4123cd80cb"
msgid ""
"The powerful nymph and the formidable dragon engaged each other in an epic "
"battle, melting rocks and causing the sky itself to tremble!"
msgstr "강력한 님프와 용감한 용이 펼치는 서사적인 전투는 암석을 녹이고 하늘 자체를 떨게 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "d1ef5b26-994f-4217-94c3-68a6bb54d2c9"
msgid ""
"The two living elements, the nymph and the {mf|fossegrim|oceanid}, engaged "
"each other in battle, using the very fabric of reality as their weapons!"
msgstr "두 개의 살아있는 비바람인 님프와 {mf|포세그림|오케아니드}는 무기로 현실의 기본 구조를 사용하여 서로의 전투를 수행했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "6a2446ba-a6fb-4d97-bcc8-b89cfed0c131"
msgid ""
"The mighty tree and the powerful nymph met each other in a duel, rapidly "
"attacking each other and gracefully deflecting the other's attacks!"
msgstr "거대한 나무와 강력한 님프는 결투에서 만났고 서로를 빠르게 공격하고 상대방의 공격을 우아하게 빗겨나갔습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "fd2f6ccb-68c1-40f7-b48d-78533a8b7bd4"
msgid ""
"But alas, no one would bear witness to the result of this confrontation. The "
"world around us began to fade and darken — the vision disappeared, and once "
"more we found ourselves at the place this incredible journey had begun!"
msgstr ""
"그러나 슬프게도 아무도 이 대결의 결과에 증인이 되지 않을 것입니다. 우리 주변의 세계가 점점 어두워지기 시작했습니다. 시야가 사라지고 "
"다시 한 번 우리는 이 놀라운 여행이 시작된 곳에서 우리 자신을 발견했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "96fe58ab-5258-41dc-a645-b053eb1065db"
msgid ""
"She glanced at the remains of the lake below us and smiled. \"Perhaps I "
"should provide you a site for experimentation, in case you decide to try "
"dropping something more devastating from the sky.\""
msgstr ""
"그녀는 우리 아래의 호수 유적을 흘끗 보고 미소 지었습니다. \"아마도 네가 하늘에서 더 파괴적인 것을 떨어뜨리기 전에 실험을 위한 "
"공간을 제공해야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "9e624173-9afa-4e22-b4bf-f3a895d988e7"
msgid ""
"The golden dragon froze for a moment before exhaling a cone of blistering "
"flame! It blossomed along the rocks like a thousand fire-colored flowers, "
"and the magical crystal cliffs of the {g|First World}First World{/g} "
"reflected them like a mirror!"
msgstr ""
"황금용이 타오르는 불을 뿜기 전 잠시 숨을 들이쉽니다! 그것은 수천 개의 불그스레한 꽃처럼 바위를 따라 피었고 {g|First World}"
"태초 세계{/g}의 마법의 크리스탈 절벽은 거울처럼 그것을 반사합니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "042e2376-339b-4172-b74d-89272b9205ac"
msgid ""
"But coping with such incredible power isn't so easy, even if you're a "
"dragon! The fiery breath came out more like a fiery sneeze. A few nearby "
"bushes did burst into flames, though it may have been out of courtesy."
msgstr ""
"그러나 당신이 용이더라도 그런 믿을 수없는 힘을 극복하는 것은 그렇게 쉽지 않습니다! 불 같은 호흡은 불길한 재채기처럼 더 많이 "
"나타났습니다. 주변의 약간의 수풀은 삐죽 튀어나와 보기 흉했지만 화염에 빠져 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "df493a5a-df1c-40e0-aa28-45b96236ca9a"
msgid ""
"Of course, an expert in questions of nature such as our {mf|king|queen} "
"could easily handle — or maybe bramble? — such a challenge! Flowers of every "
"conceivable color, beautiful as any plants in the {g|First World}First "
"World{/g}, began blossoming all over the tree!"
msgstr ""
"물론 자연 문제에 대한 전문가인 {mf|왕|여왕}도 쉽게 처리 할 수 있을까요? 아니면 망칠까요? 놀라운 도전입니다! 상상할 없을 정도로 "
"많은 꽃이 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 나무처럼 도처에 피기 시작했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "fd0e387f-6973-464b-bb57-11ad1a87d55b"
msgid ""
"Not everything works out the first time, even for someone as outstanding as "
"our {mf|king|queen}! Five or six flowers grew on the tree... half of which "
"immediately wilted. However, there were also some orange cones, some thorns, "
"and a few lemons — those didn't wilt at all!"
msgstr ""
"누군가 {mf|왕|여왕}처럼 뛰어나더라도 실수를 할 수 있습니다. 나무에 5 ~ 6 개의 꽃이 피고... 그 중 절반은 즉시 시들어 "
"갔습니다. 그러나 일부 오렌지색의 솔방울과 가시와 레몬도 피었습니다. 전혀 시들지 않았습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0082_InkLoot_Text_String
msgctxt "c216dc71-0712-4299-8f2b-5b49a5932940"
msgid ""
"I hurried to record the first steps of the {mf|king|queen} in {mf|his|her} "
"new, brilliant appearance. I managed to use earth, leaves, and even some "
"steep rocks as a canvas. Honestly, being a flying inkwell wasn't half bad!\n"
"...While reflecting on a particularly precise metaphor, from our height I "
"noticed that, in the middle of the sun-dappled forest of summer, there was a "
"small island of winter! Amid the snow and ice, a small flock of little fey "
"were hiding something that resembled a sparkling casket. In case it ended up "
"being important, I took the liberty of sketching the place and committing it "
"to memory.\n"
"Meanwhile, the {mf|king|queen} decided to try..."
msgstr ""
"{mf|그의|그녀의}의 새롭고 빛나는 모습으로 {mf|왕|여왕}이 첫걸음을 떼자 나는 서둘러서 기록했습니다. 나는 흙, 나뭇잎, 심지어는 "
"가파른 바위를 캔버스로 사용했습니다. 솔직히 날으는 잉크통이 되는 것은 나쁘지 않았습니다!\n"
"... 정확한 은유를 표현하는 동안 나는 허공에서 햇볕이 피는 여름 숲 한가운데에 겨울의 작은 섬이 있음을 발견했습니다. 눈과 얼음 "
"속에서 작은 페이가 반짝이는 상자와 같은 무언가를 숨겼습니다. 그것이 중요한 경우에 대비해 나는 장소를 스케치하고 그것을 기억에 맡기려 "
"명상을 취했습니다.\n"
"한편 {mf|왕|여왕}이 시도하기로 결정한 것은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0083_GiaLoot_Text_String
msgctxt "b5c7f069-7fd8-4faa-9c2f-3d9fa5464ec9"
msgid ""
"Inspiration took me, and I immediately rushed to try writing a new chapter "
"in the {mf|king|queen}'s chronicle detailing {mf|his|her} adventures in this "
"new guise — which ended up being a particularly difficult task as a clumsy "
"giant, who had only a huge club instead of proper writing utensils!\n"
"...But being tall has its advantages, too! Looking out from behind the "
"cliff, I noticed several fey dragging a nice-looking casket in a remarkably "
"snowy glade in the middle of the sun-dappled forest of summer! I didn't know "
"if it would come to any use, but I committed the place to memory to be safe!"
msgstr ""
"영감은 나를 사로잡아 나는 즉시 {mf|그의|그녀의}의 새로운 모습을 그린 {mf|왕|여왕}의 연대기의 새로운 장을 쓰려고 노력했습니다. "
"결국에는 거대한 곤봉만 들고 다니는 거인이 펜을 잡아 쓴 작품처럼 난해하게 끝나버렸지만요!\n"
"... 그러나 키가 크다는 건 장점도 있었습니다! 절벽 뒤에서 바라 보았을 때 나는 몇몇의 페이가 멋지게 생긴 상자를 끌고 여름의 햇살이 "
"드리워진 숲의 한가운데 눈 덮여 특이하게 보이던 공터로 가는 모습을 보았습니다. 나는 그것이 어떤 용도로 사용 될지 몰랐지만 그 장면을 "
"머릿속 안전한 장소에 두었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0084_NorLoot_Text_String
msgctxt "1983ae08-9c57-4625-b91a-6b02f853dd33"
msgid ""
"I really wanted to write a few notes about the {mf|king|queen}'s incredible "
"adventures, but in my new guise, it was pretty difficult! Besides, how does "
"someone even take notes out of a dream? All I could really manage was "
"hopping around happily!\n"
"But during a particularly high jump, I saw something interesting! A snow-"
"covered glade in the middle of the sun-dappled forest of summer, and a flock "
"of fey was hiding an alluringly shiny casket. I decided to commit the place "
"to memory in case it ever came in handy!"
msgstr ""
"나는 정말로 {mf|왕|여왕}의 엄청난 모험에 대해 몇 가지 메모를 쓰고 싶었지만 나의 새로운 모습으로는 꽤 어려웠습니다! 게다가 누군가 "
"어떻게 꿈에서 메모를 꺼내나요? 내가 정말로 할 수 있었던 것은 행복하게 기도하는 것 뿐이었습니다!\n"
"그러나 그렇게 높이 비행하는 동안 나는 흥미 있는 무엇을 보았습니다! 태양이 비치는 여름 숲의 한가운데 있는 눈 덮인 공터와 한 무리의 "
"페이가 매혹적인 반짝이는 상자를 숨기고 있었습니다. 나는 이 장면을 담을 기억에 남을 곳을 만들기로 결심했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "9893cc67-648c-4114-afde-c0196e5a2e9f"
msgid ""
"{mf|Picking the most picturesque waterfall along the cliffs, the fossegrim "
"king sat near its streams and began playing a captivating melody on his "
"harp.|The oceanid queen sat on the edge of a cliff and began combing her "
"beautiful blond hair.} Attracted by the {mf|sound and the |}scene, some "
"intrigued inhabitants of the {g|First World}First World{/g} began gathering "
"around — a young satyr, two adorable dryads, a forest king, and a giant "
"squirrel who introduced herself as a princess. They all stared at the "
"{mf|king|queen} in silent admiration, and they didn't leave for quite a long "
"time. It's a good thing this was all happening in a dream rather than "
"reality, or many hearts would have been broken!"
msgstr ""
"{mf|절벽의 가운데 폭포가 떨어지는 그림 같은 장면을 담고 포세그림 왕은 개울 주변에 앉아 하프를 뜯으며 매혹적인 연주를 시작했습니다.|"
"오케아니드여왕은 절벽 끝에 앉아 그녀의 아름다운 금발을 빗기 시작했습니다.} 그 {mf|소리와 |}장면에 홀린 호기심 많은 {g|"
"First World}태초 세계{/g}의 원주민이 모여들기 시작했습니다. 어린 사티로스, 아름다운 드라이어드 두 명, 숲의 왕, 자신을 "
"공주라 소개하는 거인 다람쥐들 말입니다. 그들은 벙어리가 되어 경외의 눈빛으로 {mf|왕|여왕}을 쳐다 보았고 오랫동안 떠나지 "
"않았습니다. 이것이 현실보다는 꿈에서 일어나는 게 좋은 편입니다. 그렇지 않으면 많은 이들의 마음이 상처받았을 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "ab7353d3-fedb-433f-8631-005eb4a8ab60"
msgid ""
"However, it seems not all hopes can prove true! Before the {mf|king|queen} "
"could even wink at any of the {g|First World}First World{/g} creatures that "
"appeared, a creaky old treant crawled out from behind some rocks and drove "
"us away, yelling that it wasn't pollination season yet, and that young "
"people should find something useful to do!"
msgstr ""
"그러나 모든 희망이 사실로 밝혀지지는 않습니다! 전에는 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}에 나타나는 생물들 누구라도 "
"{mf|왕|여왕}에게 윙크 할 수 있었습니다, 바위 뒤에서 기어 나와 삐걱거리는 늙은 나무 정령이 우리를 몰아내면서, 아직 번식의 계절이 "
"아니니 젊은 것들은 뭔가 유용한 것을 해야 한다고 소리치기 전까지는요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "c40b4fb3-2378-4538-9292-61dd2777db61"
msgid ""
"Alas, all the surrounding trees were absolutely deaf... er, blind... uh, "
"insensitive to the beauty and charm of our copper-leaved {mf|king|queen}! "
"Not one of them even waved a branch!"
msgstr ""
"아. 주위의 모든 나무들은 완전히 귀머거리가 되었습니다... 또한 눈도 멀었습니다. 구리 잎이 난 {mf|왕|여왕}의 아름다움과 매력에 "
"감각이 마비되었습니다! 그들 중 누구도 가지를 흔들어 인사하지 못했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "8961558e-6e08-4364-a59d-f2ccaf33dccd"
msgid ""
"What's impossible or unlikely on {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} is easy in the {g|"
"First World}First World{/g}! Waving {mf|his|her} branches like wings, the "
"tree gracefully soared into the air, performed a few pirouettes and loops, "
"then landed back on the ground."
msgstr ""
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서는 불가능하거나 있을 법하지 않은 일입니다! "
"날개처럼 가지를 흔드는 나무는 우아하게 하늘로 솟아 빙그르르 돌고 재주를 넘고는 땅에 다시 착지했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "380faa2f-c327-4d34-9533-ea58f6a2a6d8"
msgid ""
"But not every skill can be mastered on the first try. Waving {mf|his|her} "
"magnificent wings, the dragon flew a bit, but {mf||s}he quickly flapped back "
"and made a clearing among the vines and flowers."
msgstr ""
"그러나 모든 기술이 첫 시도에서 완성될 수 있는 것은 아닙니다. {mf|그의|그녀의}의 웅장한 날개를 흔들며 드래곤은 조금 날아 갔지만 "
"그{mf||녀}는 빨리 뒤로 물러섰고 덩굴과 꽃 사이에 개간합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "28ed4559-832d-4b00-946c-89f6517f92d8"
msgid ""
"I am deeply convinced that trees in the {g|First World}First World{/g} can "
"fly! But... not necessarily all of them. Some only seem to be able to drop "
"off cliffs... like the {mf|king|queen} did."
msgstr ""
"나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 나무는 날 수 있다는 사실에 설득 당했습니다! 그러나... 모두가 날 필요는 "
"없습니다. {mf|왕|여왕}이 그러했듯이 몇몇은 절벽에서 떨어질 것처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "dd1afc14-71eb-45cc-b7dd-5392286589fd"
msgid ""
"Once again, I was convinced that everyone, deep in their hearts, wants to "
"admire and serve a dragon — even other dragons! A few flocked over to hear "
"the {mf|king|queen}'s speech, listening in rapt admiration."
msgstr ""
"다시 한 번 나는 모든 사람들의 마음 깊은 곳에는 드래곤을 존경하고 섬기기를 원한다는 것을 확신했습니다. 몇 명은 {mf|왕|여왕}의 "
"연설을 듣기 위해 몰려 들었고 감탄을 뱉으며 경청했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0099_Text
msgctxt "99a1deaa-4461-4795-ac33-9b027667a78a"
msgid ""
"It was impossible to resist the {mf|king|queen}'s charms, especially in such "
"a brilliant guise! Soon, a small crowd of admirers gathered around to "
"listen, including several kinds of fey folk."
msgstr ""
"{mf|왕|여왕}의 매력은 저항 할 수 없었습니다. 특히 그럴듯한 겉모습이 말입니다! 얼마 지나지 않아 여러 종류의 페이 주민들을 "
"포함하여 소규모의 관중들이 모여 경청했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0100_Text
msgctxt "3a6d42d0-34f5-4850-a888-76291e7da5da"
msgid ""
"The {mf|king|queen} delivered a speech to a dryad, a couple of nixies, and a "
"colony of ants, but none of them seemed to be terribly impressed. No matter, "
"though! We can try again in the real world, with kobolds! The hardest part "
"will be finding a way to become a dragon again."
msgstr ""
"{mf|왕|여왕}은 드라이어드, 닉시 커플에게 심지어 개미 식민지에서도 연설을 했지만 그들 중 누구도 몹시 감명을 받은 것처럼 보이지는 "
"않았습니다. 상관 없습니다! 우리는 코볼트와 함께 실제 세계에서 다시 시도 할 수 있습니다! 가장 어려운 부분은 다시 드래곤이 될 길을 "
"찾는 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0101_Text
msgctxt "180dabb2-fa5a-4d28-8701-a8ec6466470a"
msgid ""
"Alas, no one decided to become the {mf|king|queen}'s loyal follower... In "
"fact, a couple of dragons appeared and tried to eat us!"
msgstr "안타깝게도 누구도 {mf|왕|여왕}의 뒤를 따르려 하지 않습니다... 사실, 드래곤 한 쌍이 나타나 우리를 잡아먹으려 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0102_Text
msgctxt "8cccc56c-2abf-4766-90c8-f1c2f0d80f93"
msgid ""
"Enjoying {mf|his|her} strength and newfound wings, the golden dragon soared "
"skyward, made a couple circles over the rocks, lounged about on some clouds —"
" I didn't even know dragons could do that! — and then easily landed back on "
"solid ground."
msgstr ""
"{mf|그의|그녀의} 힘과 새로 발견 된 날개를 즐기면서 골드 드래곤은 하늘로 날아 오르고 바위 위에 떠있는 구름에 몇 개의 동그라미를 "
"만들었습니다. 나는 용이 그런것도 할 수 있는지조차 몰랐습니다! - 그리고 나서 단단한 땅에 쉽게 착륙했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0103_Text
msgctxt "44640936-69ce-4fbb-9b15-008c93bb17f9"
msgid ""
"I must say, I was no slouch myself! As a flying inkwell, I managed to follow "
"the dragon, repeating all the twists and turns, all without even splashing "
"much ink!"
msgstr ""
"나는 게으름 따위는 피지 않았습니다! 날으는 잉크병으로서 나는 많은 잉크를 튀지 않고도 모든 꼬임과 회전을 반복하면서 용을 따라갈 수 "
"있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0104_Text
msgctxt "337a1ae0-3e87-44c2-a29a-84170d44eb49"
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, the {mf|king|queen} in {mf|his|her} new treelike appearance "
"didn't have a suitable hollow for me, but it wasn't a big problem! Clinging "
"to a branch with my fluffy paws, I delightedly observed our surroundings "
"from quite a height!"
msgstr ""
"불행히도 {mf|그의|그녀의}의 새로운 나무 형태는 {mf|왕|여왕}이 나를 위한 적당한 구멍을 가지지 않고 있었습니다. 그러나 그것은 "
"큰 문제가 아니었습니다! 내 솜털 발로 나뭇가지에 매달려 아주 높은 위치에서 우리 주변을 즐겁게 관찰했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0105_Text
msgctxt "df396936-7ee6-4d27-8dad-ee50382436c0"
msgid ""
"...I caused a few problems as an awkward giant walking around with a big "
"club, but honestly, all the poking, kicking, and falling from boulders "
"happened on accident!"
msgstr ""
"...나는 어색한 거인으로서 큰 몽둥이를 들고 걸어 다니자 약간의 문제를 일으켰지만 솔직히 말해서 문제라고는 바위에서 떨어지고 땅을 "
"파고, 발로 차는 등 우발적으로 발생했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0106_Text
msgctxt "3c9faabd-f491-4428-93b7-81f9e07780e1"
msgid ""
"I think I might have crushed a couple. And possibly dropped the club on "
"someone's foot. Well, I mean, it was a dream, after all — and not even mine!"
msgstr ""
"나는 한 두 사람을 뭉개 버린 것 같습니다. 그리고 누군가의 발에 몽둥이를 떨어 뜨렸을 수도 있습니다. 뭐. 그것은 결국 꿈이었고 심지어 "
"내 것도 아니었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0107_Text
msgctxt "27931a85-fa53-4d82-9a22-09590f799bd9"
msgid ""
"Also, a clumsy giant who was until recently just a halfling bard was able to "
"fly around!"
msgstr "또한 최근에 하플링 음유시인에 불과했던 거대한 거인은 날아 다닐 수 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0108_Text
msgctxt "b10a79e0-00c9-42cf-936a-604ac9f704ea"
msgid ""
"One of them tried to eat me, but it was fine! I'm good at jumping and "
"hiding, even when turned into something that was previously unimaginable!"
msgstr ""
"그들 중의 1 명은 나를 먹으려 했습니다만 그것은 괜찮았습니다! 뛰어다니거나 숨는 것도 좋았지만 이전에는 상상조차 할 수 없었던 무언가로 "
"바뀌었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/EvanescentDreamBE/Cue_0109_Text
msgctxt "e459d704-a7bd-427c-a547-5d7bb6cf6fbe"
msgid "After these adventures, the {mf|king|queen} decided trying..."
msgstr "이 모험들 후에 {mf|왕|여왕}이 하기로 결정한 것은..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/LinziComments/1LinziDreamscape_String
msgctxt "36b35527-51c6-44c8-8f6b-8f341bbc8af1"
msgid "\"Wow! It worked. We did it!\""
msgstr "\"와우, 효과가 있었어. 해냈어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/LinziComments/2LinziDreamscape_String
msgctxt "1c3c050c-f283-474b-bc55-80fecec4c647"
msgid ""
"\"We should be careful. Dreams are already full of monsters — I dread to "
"think what we might find in Nyrissa's head!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 조심해야 해요. 꿈은 이미 괴물들로 가득 차 있어요. 나이리사의 머리에서 무엇이 득실거릴지 상상도 못하겠어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/LinziComments/3LinziDreamscape_String
msgctxt "827cb675-0c7d-4d0c-b6fc-ce3dcffa37c9"
msgid ""
"\"We're coming up. I mean, closer. I mean... we're approaching the real "
"Nyrissa!\""
msgstr "\"거의 다 왔어요. 그러니까, 코앞이에요. 그러니까.... 우리가 진짜 나이리사에게 접근하고 있다는 뜻이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "64043cf0-6eab-4e86-8018-f29f41b17245"
msgid "\"What have you done to your 'sisters', Nyrissa?\""
msgstr "\"네 자매들에게 무슨 짓을 한 거야, 나이리사?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "d6cf14b6-33a7-4268-92e4-2b5c21a2eab3"
msgid "\"What 'realm' were you talking about? Why did they call you queen?\""
msgstr "\"네가 얘기한 '영역'이란 뭘 말하는거야? 왜 그들은 당신을 여왕이라고 부르는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "ee6546aa-5b74-46eb-8350-9b439ace3720"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I don't know if I can kill you in a dream, but I'm itching to try!"
"\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"꿈에서 너를 죽일 수 있는지 모르지만 시험해 보고 싶군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Barks/Sister1_String
msgctxt "647438ad-4e12-4ee9-8bcd-3625b5d8ac0e"
msgid "\"Our sister!\""
msgstr "\"우리 자매!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Barks/Sister2_String
msgctxt "e32dbf45-0405-4b74-89c5-15cbb5e1710b"
msgid "\"Our mistress!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 주인님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Barks/Sister3_String
msgctxt "18ddc799-1623-4e46-8a61-d302c8df775d"
msgid "\"Our queen!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 여왕님!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : NotYetDefacedSister01
msgctxt "5a0dbd04-7e8a-446d-a7ca-c12032fea4b0"
msgid "\"Hail to our queen!\""
msgstr "\"여왕님을 위하여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_Dreamscape
msgctxt "ebaa64bb-26a6-42f9-9eb1-d15d119195d7"
msgid ""
"\"Stop calling me that!\" {n}The nymph's voice rings with laughter.{/n} \"In "
"the darkest hours and the brightest days, you simply called me 'Sister' — I "
"need no other title. Your songs and laughter accompanied me in my happiest "
"moments — I would rather not shift them to honorifics. The time of my "
"triumph is nigh, Sisters! I want to share it with you, as I have always "
"shared my secrets, my sorrows, and my joys. Even after I become an "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, I shall not abandon you. My realm will be the kingdom "
"of spring, love, and life — and you will all be most welcome there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 그렇게 부르지 마!\" {n}님프의 목소리는 웃음과 함께 울립니다.{/n} \"가장 어두운 시간과 가장 밝은 날, 너는 나를 "
"그저 '자매'라고 불렀어. 다른 칭호는 필요하지 않아. 너의 노래와 웃음은 가장 행복한 순간에 나와 함께 했어. 나는 그들을 우호적으로 "
"바꾸지 않을 거야. 내 승리의 시간은 거의 다가왔어! 언제나 나의 비밀, 슬픔, 그리고 기쁨을 함께 했던 것처럼 승리도 나누고 싶어. "
"내가 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 되어도 너희를 버리지 않을 거야. 내 영역은 봄, 사랑, 삶의 왕국이 될 거고 너희는 그곳에서 가장 "
"환영받을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : NotYetDefacedSister01
msgctxt "7d0947eb-7dfb-40fa-b2b4-c6ec32101344"
msgid "\"Be happy, Sister!\""
msgstr "\"행복해야 해! 자매여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : NotYetDefacedSister02
msgctxt "1295057b-e6b1-4347-b90b-27985fb0c280"
msgid "\"Be victorious, Sister!\""
msgstr "\"승리하자! 자매여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Dreamscape_NereidEvindra
msgctxt "3bcf10cd-65ee-4f96-b6d6-601fc22be69e"
msgid ""
"\"Be careful, Nyrissa. You have always been the bravest of us, and none "
"deserve to be an {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} more than you, but these ambitions may "
"come with a steep price.\""
msgstr ""
"\"조심해. 나이리사. 너는 항상 우리 중에서 가장 용감하고 너보다 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에 걸맞는 사람은 없지만 이 야심은 비싼 "
"대가를 치를 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_Dreamscape
msgctxt "6dfea8d5-7daf-4298-b698-2fa686497aaf"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa takes Evindra's hand, her eyes bright with laughter.{/n} \"Perhaps"
" I have always been the bravest, Evindra, but you have always been the "
"grumpiest! We are blessed with eternal life, but we keep living out each day "
"abiding by rules we had no hand in creating! My plan is daring, you say? "
"Well then, so be it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 환하게 웃고 있는 에빈드라의 손을 잡습니다.{/n} \"언제나 가장 용감한 건 나였을거야, 에빈드라, 하지만 넌 언제나 "
"가장 까다로웠어! 우리는 영원한 생명으로 축복 받았지만, 한편으론 창조를 하면 안된다는 규칙에 얽매어 매일을 살아가고 있어! 내 계획이 "
"대담하다고? 그럴지도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Dreamscape_NereidEvindra
msgctxt "e7724e63-a66e-4855-bd0e-0b2c6f50d822"
msgid "\"I simply pray we do not end up paying a price we cannot bear...\""
msgstr "\"나는 그저 우리가 감당할 수 없는 대가를 치르지 않았으면 해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "27065018-ec51-498e-b415-c02afe9e2640"
msgid ""
"{n}The cheerful voices of the nymphs fade away, and the vision seems to "
"freeze. A ghostly Nyrissa stands before you, her eyes seeming to see you "
"without noticing you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}님프들의 쾌활한 목소리는 사라지고, 환상은 얼어붙는 것 같습니다. 유령 같은 나이리사가 당신 앞에 서 있지만, 그녀의 눈은 당신을 "
"인식하지 못하고 보는 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_Dreamscape
msgctxt "01aa0bd6-975d-499a-a4c8-8a059c24e7eb"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's beautiful face twists with a flash of anger.{/n} \"What I did "
"to them is paltry compared with what was done to me! But you cannot "
"understand... No one can... Just go away!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 아름다운 얼굴은 순간 분노로 일그러집니다.{/n} \"내가 그들에게 한 짓은 내가 당한 것에 비하면 보잘 것 없다! 하지만 "
"너는 이해할 수 없겠지... 그 누구도... 그냥 가버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_Dreamscape
msgctxt "c997ce0d-1762-4bf7-ba0a-a62777305234"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa tilts her head, as though listening to something barely "
"audible.{/n} \"Can you hear them? A thousand voices... I can hear them... "
"They call to me... but not the way I wanted, no! I should have been a queen. "
"Instead, I reduced kingdoms to dust. And did you not help me with that? Why "
"are you not yet among the fallen?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 간신히 듣는 것처럼 머리를 기울입니다.{/n} \"그들의 목소리가 들려? 천 개의 목소리... 나는 들려... 그들이 "
"나를 불러... 그러나 이건 내가 원하는 방식이 아니야! 나는 여왕이 되었어야 해. 대신 나는 왕국을 가루로 만들었지. 그리고 너는 "
"도와주지도 않았지? 왜 너만 타락하지 않은 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_Dreamscape
msgctxt "4036645b-efc4-4f52-babc-9f0e4080de80"
msgid ""
"\"These dreams are absurd... Why should I worry about your threats, when "
"they pale in comparison to my regular nightmares? Begone!\""
msgstr "\"이 꿈들은 어리석은 짓이야... 왜 내가 너의 위협이 내 악몽보다 형편 없는 걸 걱정해야 하는 이유는 뭐야? 사라져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Affection(Sisters)/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "254429e8-035f-4aa7-a662-3ed435c3db79"
msgid ""
"\"Wow! We're inside her dream! Maybe we should try talking to her. She may "
"not quite be the 'real' Nyrissa, but that's kind of the point — in her "
"dreams, she can let out the things she would never say in the real world!\""
msgstr ""
"\"대단해요! 우리는 그녀의 꿈 속에 있어요! 그녀와 이야기를 시도해야 해요. 진짜 나이리사가 아닐지도 모르지만 중요한 일이에요. "
"꿈속에서는 현실 세계에서는 결코 말하지 않을 것들을 들을 수 있다구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Battle(Cutscene)/1Nyrissa_JabberwockBattle_String
msgctxt "f303ac8c-f615-47f3-8b6d-164b17f8c698"
msgid "\"Finish me, scum. I will not bow my head!\""
msgstr "\"끝내라. 쓰레기. 난 머리를 숙이지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Battle(Cutscene)/2Nyrissa_JabberwockBattle_String
msgctxt "18d817f9-6fbc-4324-8032-5315ec632258"
msgid ""
"\"What? Can the self-proclaimed queen not fight off a mere animal of the "
"kennel?\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 자기를 여왕이라 칭한 자가 하찮은 동물과도 싸울 수 없나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Battle(Cutscene)/3Nyrissa_JabberwockBattle_String
msgctxt "cd4e2178-a5a8-4b1b-828d-4581bacb073d"
msgid ""
"\"I come not to kill you. A trial awaits you, trespasser. I shall simply "
"make sure you get there... without getting lost along the way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너를 죽이러 오지 않았다. 재판이 너를 기다리고 있다, 침입자여. 단지 너를 안내하러 왔을 뿐이다... 네가 길을 헤메지 않도록."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Battle(Cutscene)/Barks/Jabberwock_bark_String
msgctxt "f6aab8dd-e98d-4271-9d13-c56677b75d13"
msgid "\"I was sent by the Eldest.\""
msgstr "\"원로가 나를 보냈다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Battle(Cutscene)/Barks/Nyrissa_bark_String
msgctxt "e8684d4c-b030-4b79-b01e-56cea6a87bf7"
msgid "\"I cannot lose!\""
msgstr "\"나는 질 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3a9e3b63-2292-4352-9f3d-2482c360c80c"
msgid "Blamed Nyrissa for following her judge's cruel directions."
msgstr "판결의 잔인한 지시를 따른 나이리사를 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f92b9fdf-7af3-41c3-9817-ab58d09663a1"
msgid ""
"\"You could have refused to comply with their demands, to commit those evil "
"deeds. But you agreed to it, and so you are also guilty.\""
msgstr "\"너는 그들의 요구를 거절하고, 이 사악한 행위들을 거부할 수 있었다. 하지만 너는 그러지 않았지. 너는 유죄다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dfdce72b-7a92-4afd-b552-5c88b31a891d"
msgid "Blamed Nyrissa's judge for causing Nyrissa to destroy innocent lives."
msgstr "무고한 생명을 앗아간 나이리사의 판결자를 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "7ce80924-66dc-4766-ba82-4d8aca98cfa7"
msgid ""
"\"You were ordered to destroy kingdoms, bringing unbearable suffering and "
"pain to so many people. No matter what you have done, those who came up with "
"this 'punishment' are clearly no better!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 왕국을 파괴하라는 명령을 받았고, 많은 사람들에게 견딜 수 없는 고통을 안겨주었다. 분명 네가 한 짓이지만, 이 '처벌'을 "
"생각해 낸 사람들에게도 반드시 그 책임을 물어야 할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6213c6b9-c83a-4caa-b248-a4c00d2d1d8e"
msgid ""
"Showed no concern for the lives and kingdoms Nyrissa had ruined, blaming her "
"only for foolishness."
msgstr "나이리사가 망쳐 버렸던 삶과 왕국에 대한 염려는 하지 않고 그녀의 어리석음만을 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9231d81a-2025-469b-84f0-85c9af1e8431"
msgid ""
"\"You messed with an enemy more powerful than yourself. That is why you're "
"undoubtedly guilty — guilty of foolishness.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 자신보다 더 강력한 적과 싸웠습니다. 그래서 당신은 의심할 여지없이 유죄이며 어리석군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "91af5061-2ce9-41fa-a6d6-6392bbb15d69"
msgid ""
"\"It breaks my heart to see what this curse turned you into, in the end...\""
msgstr "\"저주로 인해 변해버리고만 네 모습을 보고 있자니 내 마음이 아프군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_Dreamscape
msgctxt "ab0873cc-98ee-4f4d-b35d-ed7df68e7edf"
msgid ""
"\"Cursed... cursed... cursed...\" {n}the nymph whispers.{/n} \"Did I truly "
"deserve all this...?\""
msgstr "\"저주를 받다니... 저주... 저주...\" {n}님프는 속삭입니다.{/n} \"나는 마땅히 저주를 받아야 했나요...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Curse/NyrissaCurse_Dialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_Dreamscape
msgctxt "650d9d42-7694-4dc6-af55-87c10da21dcb"
msgid ""
"\"So many wish to judge me... For someone who cannot comprehend the burden "
"of the curse, you assume far too much! Burn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무나 많은 사람들이 날 심판하려 하고 있어... 저주의 짐을 이해하지 못하는 너같은 사람들 주제 넘게 나서는구나! 불 태워라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/Barks/Minion1_String
msgctxt "0393b244-2436-48ba-8ed5-212ee0f438e5"
msgid "\"This search will get us killed.\""
msgstr "\"이 수색은 우리를 죽일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/Barks/Minion2_String
msgctxt "99b454e9-c955-43c4-bcec-7edf60a4cb23"
msgid "\"Briar is lost forever.\""
msgstr "\"찔레은 영원히 없어졌습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "cbd70203-803a-4bf6-a287-e61ca7b32a02"
msgid "\"Your kindness? Your soul?\""
msgstr "\"당신의 친절? 당신의 영혼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "470aecd3-ea0c-4053-93ea-8e1dd7e49217"
msgid "\"What exactly were you looking for?\""
msgstr "\"정확히 무엇을 찾고 있었습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "968f0d18-baff-44f4-be3f-eae8133a187d"
msgid "\"The only thing that seems to have left you is your mind!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 미쳤습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "33201263-1a71-4ff5-a4f4-effb28d64f1a"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever the others did to you, we're each responsible for our own crimes."
"\""
msgstr "\"다른 사람들이 당신에게 무엇을 했든 우리 모두는 자신의 범죄에 책임이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Answer_GoodRE_DreamscapeTE_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1c00d13c-ff44-45d5-b5dc-992afab2759d"
msgid "Showed sympathy for Nyrissa, telling her that all was not lost for her."
msgstr "나이리사에 동정을 보여 주면서 그녀에게 모든 것이 사라지지 않았다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Answer_GoodRE_DreamscapeTE_Text
msgctxt "4e3e86f7-2bbe-428d-99da-6e54fdfdcc2c"
msgid ""
"\"I don't believe the soul can be irreparably damaged. Perhaps not all is "
"lost for you after all.\""
msgstr "\"나는 영혼이 돌이킬 수 없을 정도로 손상 될 수 있다고 생각하지 않습니다. 결국 모든 것이 없어지지는 않을 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2a125162-9073-4e2c-ad8d-eba09ca1c1e1"
msgid ""
"\"I told them to stop! No, I told them to search... It is pointless. Why do "
"I need this?\" {n}Nyrissa turns to you.{/n} \"Do you see now? Do you see? "
"They ripped my heart out and threw it into your world! And something else "
"was torn out with it...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그들에게 멈추라고 말했어! 아냐, 그들에게 수색하라고 했어... 이건 무의미해. 왜 이게 필요하지?\" {n}나이리사는 당신에게 "
"돌아섭니다.{/n} \"이제 알겠어? 보여? 그들은 내 심장을 잡아 뜯어서 너의 세계로 던져버렸어! 그리고 뭔가 다른 게 찢겨져 "
"나갔고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "dce37731-a432-4484-83d3-9f73a47ecfbe"
msgid ""
"\"No, no... Something deeper... brighter, I suppose. I only know the sound "
"of this word, but not its meaning. A burning word. A stupid word. 'Love.'\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 아니... 좀 더 깊고... 밝은 거 같아. 나는 이 단어의 소리만 알지만 그 의미는 알지 못한다. 불타는 단어. 어리석은 "
"단어. 사랑 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "0d94e73b-2e35-428d-b1af-a93cfdf68b8f"
msgid ""
"\"Something that was stolen from me. Do you believe the aim of my curse was "
"the destruction of your pathetic kingdoms? No, that was merely a path toward "
"redemption. The curse... it deprived me of a part of my soul. The most "
"important part. Ripped from me — crippled, mutilated, and turned into an "
"artifact. Briar.\" {n}The nymph nearly spits the last word out with seeming "
"hatred.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내게서 훔쳐간 물건. 내 저주의 목적이 겨우 네 한심한 왕국의 파괴라고 믿나? 아니지, 그건 단지 구원을 위한 길이었을 뿐이야. "
"저주가... 내 영혼의 일부를 박탈했다. 가장 중요한 부분이 찢겨져 나갔어. 잘리고, 변질되고, 결국엔 유물로 변해버렸다. 찔레로.\" "
"{n}님프는 증오를 담아 마지막 단어를 뱉어냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "6b956ecd-b124-433c-a0dc-0da36fe666ad"
msgid "\"Your insolence tires me. Enough!\""
msgstr "\"너의 오만함이 나를 지치게 하는군. 그만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "0dc304bf-c83c-4992-92c2-71a56b0966f1"
msgid "\"Do you enjoy watching my agony? Allow me to see yours in return!\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 고뇌가 즐거워? 너의 고뇌도 봐야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/BriarDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "ae9aa5ed-6533-4c95-b968-654866571d53"
msgid ""
"{n}Your words resound with an unexpectedly loud echo. Seemingly influenced "
"by them, the surrounding world begins to change...{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 말은 예기치 않게 큰 소리로 울려 퍼집니다. 당신의 말로 영향을 받은 주변 세계가 변화하기 시작합니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/FindBriarCutsceneBarks/1BriarSearch_bark_String
msgctxt "3ffa906f-ee29-40af-bcb4-548078b1cdb8"
msgid ""
"\"My lady, there's nothing we can do. The power of those who've hidden Briar "
"exceed our own in many ways.\""
msgstr "\"여왕님. 우리가 할 수 있는 일은 없습니다. 찔레를 숨긴 사람들의 힘은 여러 면에서 우리를 능가합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/FindBriarCutsceneBarks/2BriarSearch_bark_String
msgctxt "a213a81d-a4d8-4cd7-8b3b-70c531283e86"
msgid ""
"\"...Why search for that which has ruined me? He said... he said, 'Let your "
"unrequited love guide you.'\""
msgstr "\"... 왜 나를 망쳐 놓은 것을 찾으려 하지? 그가 말했지... '네 조건없는 사랑을 따라가라'고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/FindBriarCutsceneBarks/3BriarSearch_bark_String
msgctxt "cdf914f5-5fd2-4abb-9eae-6226140610cf"
msgid ""
"\"...To the doomed kingdoms. No, I will not search any longer. But... but I "
"must find it! Come now, start searching! It must be here in the Stolen Lands!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 저주받은 왕국으로 말이야. 아냐, 나는 더 이상 찾지 않을거야. 하지만... 하지만 그걸 꼭 찾아야 해! 어서 수색을 시작해! "
"그것은 반드시 여기 도둑맞은 땅에 있을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/FindBriarCutsceneBarks/BriarFound1_String
msgctxt "3e1ca11f-1e0a-447a-aaf5-572b5ff2f0bb"
msgid "\"Thousands of years searching. And for what?\""
msgstr "\"수천년 동안 찾았어. 무엇을 위해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/FindBriarCutsceneBarks/BriarFound2_String
msgctxt "5f9c5738-4298-487f-bea4-f586c3bb8395"
msgid "\"You were a part of me. What are you now?\""
msgstr "\"너는 나의 일부였다. 지금은 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_FindBriar/FindBriarCutsceneBarks/BriarFound3_String
msgctxt "20806817-e3fd-406b-a913-7762fd5dd0fb"
msgid ""
"\"Once a branch has broken off, it cannot be reattached! How could I be so "
"foolish...\""
msgstr "\"일단 나뭇가지가 부서지면 다시 붙일 수 없다! 내가 어떻게 이렇게 어리석지...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/Barks/Angel_bark_String
msgctxt "2ebbeccf-179f-4090-8d8c-c6617ed62955"
msgid "\"My lady, your order frightens me.\""
msgstr "\"여왕님. 당신의 명령에 놀랐습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/Barks/Armag_bark_String
msgctxt "5146b586-273b-480f-b7d7-aafbbf83ca73"
msgid "\"I was reborn. Reborn for glory.\""
msgstr "\"나는 다시 태어났어. 영광을 위해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/Barks/Irovetti_bark_String
msgctxt "d9c6e0d0-a32e-4ce5-91eb-459c94153328"
msgid ""
"\"You won't find a more loyal servant — or one more deserving to be a king!\""
msgstr "\"당신은 충성스러운 종을 찾지 못할 겁니다. 혹은 왕이 될 종을 말입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/Barks/PC_bark_String
msgctxt "3dccbe8c-64a0-42f1-8200-927482d14e1c"
msgid "\"Who, if not me?\""
msgstr "\"내가 아니라면 누구죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/Barks/StagLord_bark_String
msgctxt "2d4e682a-6f30-43c9-9a2e-2f05a5d5b186"
msgid "\"My dream... I will await your return.\""
msgstr "\"내 꿈은... 당신이 돌아올 때까지 기다리겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/LoyaltyCutsceneBarks/1Loyalty_ToAngel_String
msgctxt "67022991-5224-4420-ba5a-eb35cfdb90ff"
msgid "\"My skylark, your song is sad today. What has happened?\""
msgstr "\"나의 종달새. 너의 노래가 오늘 슬프다. 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/LoyaltyCutsceneBarks/2Loyalty_ToStagLord_String
msgctxt "57efe760-ac11-4839-a5a4-7f55ec21d3e8"
msgid ""
"\"Once young deer has barely grown their antlers, they face their fathers in "
"fierce combat. Have you ever seen it?\""
msgstr "\"아기 사슴이 사슴 뿔을 간신히 길렀는데 그것이 치열한 전투에서 아비 사슴에게 겨눠졌습니다. 이 이야기가 궁금한가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/LoyaltyCutsceneBarks/3Loyalty_ToStagLord_String
msgctxt "5de8a2d0-489e-4670-8e42-d08daaa7cc14"
msgid ""
"\"The time has come. You are a stag now, not some defenseless fawn. Go. Go "
"and fight!\""
msgstr "\"이제 때가 되었단다. 너는 무방비 상태의 아기 사슴이 아니라 어엿한 사슴이 되었어. 가서 맞서 싸우렴!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/LoyaltyCutsceneBarks/4Loyalty_ToArmag_String
msgctxt "bcdbd205-3520-470a-84ee-7295beefcbcd"
msgid "\"You were born for glory, my wolf cub!\""
msgstr "\"너는 영광을 위해 태어났다. 나의 어린 늑대!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/LoyaltyCutsceneBarks/5Loyalty_ToIrovetti_String
msgctxt "6a2ed0f4-4889-4274-b3f2-74077b2abdce"
msgid ""
"\"There is room in this world for all sorts of different birds. Some sing "
"sweetly, while others screech proudly. But the peacock displays bright "
"feathers to outshine them all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 세상에는 온갖 종류의 새들이 있다. 어떤 것은 달콤하게 노래하고 또 다른 것은 자랑스럽게 울지. 하지만 공작은 모두에게 밝게 "
"빛나는 깃털을 뽑내지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/LoyaltyCutsceneBarks/6Loyalty_ToIrovetti_String
msgctxt "828af599-7b4f-4153-95c7-3c0003c7f216"
msgid ""
"\"Be my peacock. Shine. You will become a king whose glory shall overshadow "
"all within the River Kingdoms.\""
msgstr "\"내 공작이 되어라. 빛나거라. 너는 왕이 되어 그 영광이 왕국의 모든 곳에서 덮일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/LoyaltyCutsceneBarks/7Loyalty_ToPC_String
msgctxt "909161e9-4b09-4eb5-b80b-c60b7d0f87f7"
msgid "\"If you lose, my heart stops along with yours.\""
msgstr "\"네가 지면 내 마음도 너와 함께 멈춘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/NyrissaLoyalty_Dialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "8cb71b15-1be1-42f5-a073-38c30b145fb8"
msgid ""
"\"Armag, Tristian, the Stag Lord, Irovetti... all turned against me because "
"of you.\""
msgstr "\"아르막, 트리스티안, 수사슴 군주, 이로베티... 모두가 당신 때문에 나에게 등돌렸었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/NyrissaLoyalty_Dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5fea2a7d-6264-453d-86a5-544832ae08a3"
msgid "\"Just what kind of zoo have you set up here?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 종류의 동물원을 여기에 설치한거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/NyrissaLoyalty_Dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "77d0f5e4-11f6-4cc7-a92f-3c86322db28a"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Let's skip the talking. If you want to pit more ghosts against "
"me, just go ahead!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"이야기는 그만하지. 당신이 계속 유령과 나를 붙이고 싶다면 마음대로 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/NyrissaLoyalty_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4cefd3d8-8ddf-4026-924d-e5eeeba1a0d2"
msgid "\"So easily trapped... stags and wolves, skylarks and peacocks...\""
msgstr "\"이렇게 쉽게 덫에 걸리는 사슴, 늑대, 종달새와 공작새라니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/NyrissaLoyalty_Dialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "a546850a-2d96-4cf3-85ee-d248427e44a1"
msgid ""
"\"Does it not please you, my hound? I gave you so much prey to chase! But "
"what I have done matters little when compared to why I have done it... I "
"have already lost track of so much time... For so many centuries, I sought "
"out those like you — the ambitious and bold, those who believe they can "
"change the world, or at least rule it. I seek them, grant them power, lead "
"them to triumph — and then push them into the abyss!\""
msgstr ""
"\"기쁘지 않느냐? 내 사냥개야? 나는 네가 쫓게 될 먹이를 너무 많이 주었다! 그러나 이유는 비교할 동안 결과는 중요하지 않다. 나는 "
"이미 너무 많은 시간을 잃어 버렸다. 수세기에 걸쳐 나는 너와 같이 야심적이고 대담하고, 세상을 바꿀 수 있다고 믿거나 적어도 그것을 "
"지배하는 사람들을 찾았다. 나는 그들을 찾아 권력을 부여하고, 승리로 인도하고는 마침내 심연으로 이끌지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/NyrissaLoyalty_Dialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "de6b3601-ea62-4653-8cc9-84021f905337"
msgid ""
"\"This is just a small part of it. A tiny taste, so to speak. For thousands "
"of years, I have kept the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} beneath my thumb, "
"and for thousands of years, blind tools of my will ascend just to be thrown "
"down again. And again. And again. And you shall take your place among them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 단지 작은 부분일 뿐이다. 맛보기에 불과하지. 수천 년 동안 나는 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}을 내 손바닥 "
"안에 넣었고 수천 년 동안 나의 뜻을 따르는 꼭두각시가 흥망하기를 반복했다. 너도 그들 중 하나가 될 거고!.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_Loyalty/NyrissaLoyalty_Dialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "be46c56e-678f-429b-af1e-c58bbd815c0d"
msgid ""
"\"I was there with you from the very first steps you've made in the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. I created a nice cage of magical fog around "
"you, sent you my skylark, helped you kill my stag, and guided you through "
"dreams and visions. I pitted my wolf cub and my peacock against you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 네가 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 첫 발을 들였을 때부터 너와 함께 있었다. 나는 네 주위에 마법의 안개가 "
"자욱한 멋진 새장을 만들었고, 내 종달새를 보내 내 수사슴을 죽일 수 있게 도와주었으며, 꿈과 환상을 보내 너를 인도했다. 나는 너에게 "
"늑대 새끼와 공작새를 던진 샘이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d7d9a3a8-6966-4a7b-8024-04b501319d56"
msgid "\"You're insane. Stop this, before it's too late!\""
msgstr "\"미쳤어. 늦기 전에 그만 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d0225124-df79-48ac-b4a3-daa4b150f410"
msgid "\"You don't understand what you're doing.\""
msgstr "\"너는 네가 하는 일을 이해하지 못하는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4d57ff77-2465-41eb-b492-a1183b11118c"
msgid "\"I'll stop you, one way or another.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 막을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "654c704f-b34e-43d9-a0df-4a39e8087e06"
msgid "\"Fine. I'll go. Let us see the worth of your words.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나는 가겠어. 네가 맞는지 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "516219a4-e681-4fa2-87e6-c586feec55cf"
msgid ""
"\"Another ambush? It seems like you take me not for a hound, but for some "
"foolish chicken.\""
msgstr "\"또 다른 매복인가? 내가 당신의 사냥개가 아니라 어리석은 닭으로 여기는 것처럼 보이는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8439aae2-e169-4fe5-abd1-bb72c84a43cc"
msgid "\"Don't get your hopes up. I won't dance to your tune.\""
msgstr "\"꿈도 꾸지 마라. 나는 장단에 춤추지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "4172d65c-7932-46e7-bfe4-b588ba2337f5"
msgid ""
"\"I know your story now, Nyrissa. Unfortunately, what I don't know is how to "
"help you overcome the curse...\""
msgstr "\"당신의 이야기를 알았습니다. 나이리사. 불행히도 내가 모르는 것은 당신이 저주를 극복하는 것을 돕는 방법입니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Barks/NyrissaCup1_String
msgctxt "f594bd3b-2b63-4aff-b833-944e1fab15c1"
msgid "\"One more... grain... And another... grain...\""
msgstr "\"티끌 하나 더... 그리고 또 다른 티끌...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "533ed92e-0c41-4b39-9dec-24f79e3f0d07"
msgid ""
"\"One more... grain... And another... grain... This one took a hundred years "
"to obtain. And that one was just a week. The first bears the blood of three "
"generations, burned in war. The second... just two well-chosen words and one "
"little betrayal...\""
msgstr ""
"\"티끌 하나 더... 그리고 또 하나... 결실 하나를 얻는 데 백 년이 걸렸다. 그리고 다른 하나는 일주일이 걸렸다. 첫 왕국은 삼 "
"대에 걸쳐 피를 흘렸고, 전쟁으로 불태워졌다. 두 번째... 잘 선택된 두 단어와 한 번의 작은 배신...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "fb5c3575-bfc7-4615-b321-78f1c02a6407"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's face suddenly flashes with anger as she clutches her cup.{/n} "
"\"This will never end! Never!\" {n}She drops her head, silent for a long "
"while, before she lifts her gaze to you with an odd, almost dreamy smile.{/n}"
" \"Do you see this cup? It has a name, you know — the Apology. Within it is "
"the Stag Lord, and his crazy dream to become a king and take me as his "
"queen. And Armag, and his never-born barbarian empire. Who will fall in "
"next? {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and its peacock king? Or you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잔을 움켜 쥐며 님프의 얼굴이 갑자기 일그러졌습니다.{/n} \"이것은 결코 끝나지 않을 것이다! 결코!\" {n}그녀는 당신을 "
"이상한 눈빛으로 쳐다보고 꿈결 같은 미소를 지으더니 고개를 떨구고 한동안 침묵했습니다. {/n} \"이 잔이 보여? 이름은 사죄라고 "
"하지. 그 안에 있는 수사슴 군주는 왕이 되어 나를 여왕으로 삼으려는 미친 꿈을 꾸었지. 아르막은 야만인의 제국을 꿈꿨고. 다음은 누가 "
"떨어질까? {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}와 공작새 왕? 아니면 당신?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "e4fb1e30-2e68-4feb-a173-236ca0035027"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa's gaze goes cold and hard.{/n} \"What is this — a dream? Or is "
"someone actually playing games with me?!\""
msgstr "{n}나이리사의 시선은 차갑고 매섭습니다.{/n} \"이게 뭐야. 꿈이야? 아니면 누군가 나와 실제로 게임하는 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "60080c2d-d246-4d6f-97fd-0b772b10e6e7"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa — seemingly the real Nyrissa, conscious rather than dreaming — "
"looks at you with curiosity and approval.{/n} \"So... this IS a dream. But "
"you have entered it from reality. Exquisite. Very reminiscent of the methods "
"I typically use. For a thousand years, none have come so close to me... and "
"I assure you, none ever will again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}겉으로 보기에 진짜인 나이리사는 꿈보다 의식이 있습니다 - 호기심과 긍정적인 눈길로 당신을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"그래... 이건 "
"꿈이구나. 하지만 너는 현실에서 들어온 거고. 내가 일반적으로 사용하는 방법을 연상케 하는군. 천 년 동안 아무도 그렇게 가까이 오지 "
"않았어... 그리고 이제 다시는 그렇게 놔두지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "4863011c-4990-4606-a4ee-2ccbf206befa"
msgid ""
"\"But you... I like you more and more, my hound. Perhaps I have no need of "
"that stupid peacock anymore. I could let you tear him apart, if you wish. I "
"know where a tool lies that will let you clip his wings — the evidence of "
"his crimes. Something he's been hiding from his {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} "
"allies... but he could not hide it from me. Remember this name: {g|Whiterose "
"Abbey}Whiterose Abbey{/g}. That is where Irovetti would usually meet with "
"me, in the past — and the place where you will find your tool against him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 너... 점점 더 네가 좋아진다. 사냥개야. 어쩌면 나는 그 어리석은 공작이 더 이상 필요하지 않을 지도. 네가 원하면 놈을 "
"찢어 발길 수 있게 해주마. 범죄의 증거인 놈의 날개를 꺾을 도구가 어디에 있는지 알아. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 동맹 중 하나에게 "
"숨겼지...하지만 내게 그것을 숨길 수는 없었다. 이 이름을 기억해라. {g|Whiterose Abbey}백장미 수도원{/g}. 바로 "
"그곳에서 이로베티가 과거에 나를 종종 만났고 이로베티에게 대항할 너의 무기를 발견 할 곳이기도 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "bfaa0a2d-6918-45d3-9b74-c6dd56f78893"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you can always refuse. Then, the peacock will simply peck you to death "
"and gain your kingdom for his own. And I still gain another grain for the "
"Apology.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 언제나 거절 할 수 있다. 그러면 공작은 너를 쪼아 죽이고 너의 왕국을 얻게 될 것이다. 그리고 나는 사과를 위해서 또 다른 "
"티끌을 얻을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "16f02765-259c-4b2a-9324-56f48f337341"
msgid "\"My brave, brave hound... We will get along nicely, I daresay.\""
msgstr "\"내 용감하고 용감한 사냥개여... 우리는 잘 지낼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "771c5c3b-9fba-4e5c-b281-a4549eb7d6de"
msgid ""
"\"So cranky. It is not like I demand you go alone. Take along your silly "
"servants, if you wish.\""
msgstr "\"너무 까다롭구나. 나는 네가 혼자 갈 것을 요구하는 것이 아니다. 바란다면 네 바보 같은 종들을 데려가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "1595d1ce-e1d0-4e05-b3b7-5d246c32baf9"
msgid ""
"\"I have had strange dreams recently... of times before the curse... and a "
"meeting that never occurred...\""
msgstr "\"나는 최근에 이상한 꿈을 꾸었다... 저주에 걸리기 전... 결코 이뤄지지 않은 만남의...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Dreamscape/Nyrissa_NoEnd(Cup)/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "1a58bc79-1fad-40d3-905e-4e072468ccaf"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa's gaze goes cold and hard.{/n} \"What is this — a dream? Or is "
"someone actually playing games with me?! Speaking words that pierce like "
"arrows, teasing me with the hope of salvation beyond my reach...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사의 시선은 차갑고 매섭습니다.{/n} \"이게 뭐야. 꿈이야? 아니면 누군가 나와 실제로 게임하는 거야?! 닿을 수 없는 "
"곳에서 화살처럼 꿰뚫는 목소리로 누군가 구원해주겠다며 나를 괴롭히는 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "afac6d14-3629-4f7f-b4df-96b37f085202"
msgid "\"Let me see your wares.\""
msgstr "\"네 물건을 보게 해 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e3b82510-8823-4334-ba2c-e31bf6842be7"
msgid "\"Hey, this is my throne!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 저건 내 왕좌야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "74cae802-9cdb-4429-b312-a894783fbcbd"
msgid ""
"[Pay 100 gold] \"Here is your money. Just take it back to where it belongs.\""
msgstr "[100골드를 지불합니다] \"여기 돈이 있습니다. 그냥 다시 제자리에 돌려 두시죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "6ab79a6f-0bb5-41c0-940b-6c5d5039747b"
msgid ""
"\"Are you crazy?! This is my royal throne! How can you demand gold for that "
"which is rightfully mine?\""
msgstr "\"제정신이야?! 내 왕좌라고! 내 것을 돌려받는데 왜 너한테 돈을 줘야 해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "0fb58bdc-1db5-4aa5-a0bc-b5ce30c9a25f"
msgid ""
"\"You will return my throne this instant before I hang you from the nearest "
"tree!\""
msgstr "\"가장 가까운 나무에 널 교수형에 처하기 전에 내 왕좌를 돌려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "b8847ccf-f317-42e6-a26f-1e241274e4e0"
msgid "\"I can do without this junk. I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 쓰레기가 없다면 뭐든 하겠어. 나는 가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "bac88d3e-d599-4691-b5be-f414da0dbed4"
msgid ""
"[Pay 200 gold] \"Here's your money, you robber. Now return the throne to "
"where it belongs!\""
msgstr "[200골드를 지불합니다] \"순 도둑이군. 원래의 자리로 왕좌를 다시 돌려 놓으세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "cdfd052f-d443-4cb9-9295-68bfe4290d2c"
msgid "\"Hey, Chwurk, we've met already! Remember me?\""
msgstr "\"이봐, 츄와크. 우리 만난 적 있잖아! 나를 기억해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "c635e606-4493-4220-9cd0-bca8c0be9c94"
msgid "\"How's goes the trading?\""
msgstr "\"거래는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "c6715e81-db8f-48d1-a2c3-d60507a8ac3d"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "21c2feb0-682c-44de-ad45-92bc2cbd419d"
msgid "\"How did you manage to get it in the first place?\""
msgstr "\"처음에 어떻게 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0028_Text_String
msgctxt "3f620e19-a31b-4b4c-9a4b-5043307b52d5"
msgid ""
"[Pay 100 gold] \"Fine, you've convinced me. But you'll have to return it to "
"the place you've taken it from. Will you find the way?\""
msgstr "[100골드를 지불합니다] \"좋아. 나를 설득 했군. 하지만 네가 가져간 곳으로 돌려 두어야 해. 그 길을 찾아줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "0ccc9da0-8c8c-49a3-9ab9-ae168a982c0f"
msgid ""
"\"For this piece of junk? What should I do with it? Carry it on my back and "
"entertain people? You keep it!\""
msgstr "\"이 쓰레기 때문에? 내가 그걸로 무엇을 하지? 그것을 등 뒤에서 가지고 다니며 사람들을 즐겁게 하나? 네가 가져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "03922652-b94e-43ca-bb99-5451e46dc29c"
msgid ""
"[Pay 50 gold] \"Fine, you convinced me. But you have to put it back where "
"you found it. Do you know the way?\""
msgstr "[100골드를 지불합니다] \"좋아. 나를 설득 했군. 하지만 네가 발견한 곳으로 돌려 두어야 해. 그 길을 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "519a562f-e428-4350-b020-c5e609a4ee2c"
msgid ""
"\"You think I'm an idiot?! I'll find another chair, newer and shinier! And "
"you can keep dragging this thing around — you'll be the fool of goblins "
"everywhere!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 바보라고 생각해? 나는 더 새롭고 더 빛나는 의자를 발견 할 것이다! 그리고 너는 이 물건을 끌고 다녀. 너는 모든 곳에서 "
"고블린 바보라 불릴 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "6914bf5b-e157-4b4d-a282-07555df6ca50"
msgid "\"Fine, I'll help you out as a friend. Give me this throne.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 친구로서 도와주지. 나에게 이 왕좌를 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "487b9168-6d42-4d99-9df9-8f6fd82ad2bc"
msgid "\"It's your own fault! Come on, get lost!\""
msgstr "\"그건 네 잘못이야! 어서 사라져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "e199292f-bd22-49c7-944a-ccc28ac2af3e"
msgid "[Attack] \"Prepare to die, creature!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"죽을 준비나 해라! 이 괴물아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "6efe8f44-0a77-46d0-bab8-1cb602fe724a"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll take this throne if I have to gut you to get it!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"내가 너의 목을 취해야 한다면 왕좌는 나의 것이겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Barks/Companion_Bark_Throne_String
msgctxt "10ed58a0-e44e-4fa4-8268-c0d2c6f0b409"
msgid "\"Isn't... isn't that your throne?\""
msgstr "\"네 왕좌가 아닌가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Barks/Throne_Bark_String
msgctxt "a647eb91-8b33-47fb-acd8-ef469bc6cee5"
msgid ""
"The backrest is stained with something slimy, but otherwise this throne is "
"exactly the same as that stolen from the castle."
msgstr "등 받침은 끈적끈적한 무엇인가로 얼룩져 있지만 않았다면 성에서 도난당한 것과 다름이 없었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f2730f7d-76bc-4efd-872c-7bf8982a8a9e"
msgid ""
"{n}As you come closer. the goblin gives a wide grin and waves at you. A "
"ramshackle cart beside him is sagging under the weight of the junk within. "
"Amidst the trash, however, you notice the glinting of gold and what seems to "
"be hints of fine cloth — seems like only the owner of the cart can sort "
"through this mess.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 가까이 옵니다. 고블린은 넓은 미소를 짓고 손을 흔듭니다. 그의 옆에 쓰레기 수레 안에는 쓰레기가 담겨 처져 있습니다. "
"그러나 쓰레기 속에서 금의 반짝임과 고급 천으로 보이는 것을 목격합니다. 수레의 소유자는 정돈을 잘 하지 못한 것처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "5c854e31-b030-4d11-8f7e-4de61e14e29e"
msgid ""
"\"Hail, travelers! Welcome to the Chwurk's cart-around shop! I be having "
"all! Pokers, glinters, clothers — choose what you like if you have money!\" "
"{n}Chwurk appraises you with greedy eyes, as if sizing up how much coin you "
"have on you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이봐, 여행자! 츄와크의 노점상에 온 것을 환영한다! 나는 다 가지고 있지! 부지깽이, 번쩍이는 물건, 옷 — 돈만 있다면 골라 봐!"
"\" {n}츄와크는 탐욕스러운 눈으로 당신이 얼마나 많은 금화를 가졌는지 평가합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "38f86153-6683-4714-aaca-c72804df3b58"
msgid ""
"\"You again? We trade! I be having all, just say yes!\" {n}The goblin points "
"at his cart, packed to the brim with a heap of trash and treasure.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"또 너야? 거래하자! 나는 모두 가졌으니 어서 보라구!\" {n}고블린은 쓰레기와 보물 더미가 가득 쌓여 포장된 수레를 "
"가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "175f17dd-582a-4e26-aca3-ced5e924befa"
msgid ""
"\"Eh? Ah, this chairy! It be good chairy, sturdy! Ornamenties on sides, soft "
"seat, fine back! I be giving it off for hundred money! You be not regretting "
"it! Why you staring at me like that? Is that a deal stare?\""
msgstr ""
"\"응? 이 의자! 이 의자는 좋은 의자야. 튼튼해! 양쪽면 장식품이 달렸고 부드러운 자리에 등받이는 튼튼하지! 금화 100개 주면 "
"너에게 팔겠다! 후회하지 않을 거야! 왜 그렇게 쳐다 보지? 깎아달라고 째려보나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6a7f2a2b-84ce-4a38-bd0a-ec3d46c3bdca"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, stop! Don't beat me no more! Take it, take it, big deal! I be no "
"stealing no more, I promise!\" {n}Chwurk leaps away from you and cowers "
"behind the throne.{/n} \"Me be taking it back where I took it, just don't "
"hit me in the head no more!\""
msgstr ""
"\"야, 그만해! 더 이상 나를 때리지 마! 가져가! 거래 성사! 나 더 이상 훔치지 않을 거야. 약속 해!\" {n}츄와크는 당신에게서 "
"달아나며 왕좌 뒤에서 웅크려 숨습니다.{/n} \"내가 그것을 훔친 곳으로 다시 가져갈 테니, 머리는 그만 두들겨!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "98ca1a28-54f3-445b-a5b7-87fd0d839d2e"
msgid ""
"{n}Chwurk is still, trying to wrap his head around what you've said.{/n} "
"\"That true?\" {n}He scratches his ear.{/n} \"Right! Me be asking too "
"little! It be worth two hundred money!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}츄와크는 여전히 당신이 말한 것을 머리에 입력하려고 노력하고 있습니다.{/n} \"그 말이 맞아?\" {n}그는 귀를 "
"긁적입니다.{/n} \"맞아! 내가 너무 조금 달라고 했어! 200 금화는 줘야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "2aa94121-6b2f-442c-b766-3a219e46b3b3"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, why you be like that? I die of hunger if I be giving my goods for "
"free! You give me money!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 왜 그래? 내가 물건을 무료로 주면 나는 굶어 죽는다. 나에게 돈을 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "fbb6bee5-8bd8-4c0d-83f1-a6c6c8d8163b"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin sorts the coins greedily.{/n} \"Money! Trureal money! First "
"time I be holding it!\" {n}Chwurk hastily tucks the coins into one of the "
"purses around his waist and starts to mount the throne on the cart. {/n} \"I "
"be getting this chairy back in a heartbeat! You watch me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 동전을 탐욕스럽게 분류합니다.{/n} \"돈! 진짜 돈이야! 나는 처음으로 쥐어 봐!\" {n}츄와크는 서둘러 동전을 허리 "
"둘레의 지갑에 넣더니 왕좌를 수레에 싣기 시작합니다.{/n} \"나는 이 의자를 당장 돌려 놓을 거야! 두고 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "2ab850eb-f1e1-42cc-83e8-20514eb77531"
msgid ""
"{n}Chwurk screeches and drops to his knees.{/n} \"Have mercy, adventurer! I "
"be mistaken, I be not doing it never again!\" {n}Chwurk wrings his hands.{/n}"
" \"You want bribe? I be giving you bribe! Many valuables I be giving you! "
"And take chairy back! Just don't hit me no more!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}츄와크는 무릎을 꿇고 떨기 시작합니다.{/n} \"모험가, 자비를 베풀어줘! 내가 잘못했어. 다시는 그러지 않을 거야!\" {n}"
"츄와크가 빕니다.{/n} \"뇌물을 원해? 뇌물을 줄게! 많은 귀중품을 줄게! 그리고 의자를 가져가. 더 이상 나를 때리지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "26cc4fd7-0b29-4d8d-b43a-ad2d88dcafdd"
msgid ""
"\"Look, what I have!\" {n}The goblin digs a wand out of the depths of his "
"cart.{/n} \"It be doing WHOOSH and doors go open! I be entering, taking all "
"good stuff and leaving!\" {n}Chwurk hastily tucks the wand back.{/n} \"I be "
"having some other whoosh-thingies, but I no showing them to you, they are "
"mine and not for sale!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 가진 걸 봐!\" {n}고블린은 지팡이를 그의 수레 깊숙한 곳에서 꺼냅니다.{/n} \"이건 슈웅하고 문을 열어! 내가 "
"들어가고, 좋은 물건들을 전부 가지고, 떠난다!\" {n}츄와크는 급하게 지팡이를 허리춤에 넣습니다.{/n} \"나는 다른 슈웅하는 "
"물건을 가지고 있다. 그러나 나는 그것을 보여주지 않겠어. 그것은 내 것이고 판매용이 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "181e96ac-f370-45d8-9012-909e978795f0"
msgid ""
"\"How so? What about deal? Just hundred money! Come on! It be a good chairy, "
"you no find this nowhere else! What you say?!\" {n}The goblin makes several "
"steps towards you, obviously unwilling to let you go until you make a "
"purchase.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 된거 ? 거래는 어떡하고? 금화 100개 밖에 안 돼! 고민하지 마! 이 좋은 의자를 아무 곳에서도 못찾을 걸! 뭐라구?!\" "
"{n}고블린은 저벅저벅 당신에게 다가오는데 당신이 구매할 때까지 보내주지 않을 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "7609d5b5-1c99-4507-87c3-69bbfc9f671b"
msgid ""
"\"Stop! Stop!\" {n}Desperation rings in Chwurk's voice.{/n} \"Let it be "
"fifty money! You take this!\" {n}He turns towards the throne warily, as if "
"expecting trouble from it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그만! 그만!\" {n}츄와크의 절망스러운 목소리가 들립니다.{/n} \"50골드에 쳐줄게! 가져가!\" {n}그는 해코지라도 당할까 "
"봐 왕좌를 향해 조심스레 돌아봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "16a6b509-a382-47ed-ba92-0fc648ab3450"
msgid ""
"{n}Grimace of offence appears on Chwurk's face.{/n} \"Why me be having this "
"chairy! You take it! No money! Just no leave it to me! It be scaring other "
"customers from me! It be ruining my reputashun! Take it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}츄와크의 얼굴이 일그러져 험악합니다.{/n} \"왜 내가 이 의자를 가져야 하지! 네가 가져가! 돈은 필요 없어! 제발 가져가! "
"다른 고객이 겁먹을 거란 말이야! 내 평판을 망칠 거야! 가져가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0036_Text_String
msgctxt "e5ccf94c-444c-44d7-9a70-15840ad93fff"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you have time to say anything else, Chwurk grabs the handles of "
"his cart and disappears in a cloud of dust.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신이 다른 말을 하기 전에 츄와크는 수레의 손잡이를 잡고 먼지 구름을 일으키며 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "9ed9cf87-33df-4258-8426-1b2eaf634651"
msgid ""
"{n}Chwurk bursts into tears.{/n} \"Nooooo! You have piiiity on meeee! Don't "
"leave me be with this cursed chairyyyy! Take it! No, I be taking it wherever "
"you say! Just don't leave it to me!\"\n"
"{n}Chwurk dives into his cart, grabs a pile of trash and thrusts it into "
"your hands.{/n} \"You take these too! I be doing everything you want, just "
"don't leave me with this chairyyyy! Shame, such shame, me be mocked to "
"deeeeeath! Me not waaant! Me never take other's trash no mooooore! Neveeeeer!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}츄와크는 울음을 터트렸습니다.{/n} \"안돼애애애! 제발 용서어해 줘! 이 저주받은 의자를 나와 함께 두지 마! 가져가! 아니지, "
"네가 말하면 어디에든 가져다 놓을게! 나에게 주지 마!\"\n"
"{n}츄와크는 수레 더미로 뛰어들어, 쓰레기 더미를 가져오더니 당신 손에 밀어 넣습니다.{/n} \"이것들도 가져가! 시키는 모든 것을 "
"할테니, 이 의자를 두고 가지 마! 수치스러워 죽을 거 같아! 네가 가져가! 나 절대로 다른 사람의 쓰레기를 가져 가지 않을게에에! "
"절대애애애!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "724c4004-5536-4c17-9272-5b3e161dbcb3"
msgid ""
"{n}Chwurk looks you up and down with indifferent expression.{/n} \"You "
"adventurers be all the same! Dirty, skinny, why I should be remembering your "
"kind. But if you be buying stuff...\" {n}Chwurk thinks for a moment, then "
"shakes his head sadly, as if confirming his memory of you is lost.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}츄와크가 무관심한 표정으로 당신을 위아래로 봅니다.{/n} \"네놈과 같은 모험가들은 모두 같아! 더럽고 말라비틀어졌지. 왜 내가 "
"네놈들 같은 족속들을 기억해야 하지? 하지만 물건을 사면...\" {n}츄와크는 잠시 생각하더니, 당신을 본 기억을 더듬는 듯 머리를 "
"슬프게 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "2f182ab1-3834-4c96-85c8-b4d295718047"
msgid ""
"\"Since goblinking be downed, it be too bad. Me be self-riding roads and "
"wandering around villages. No one be giving money, all just come to watch "
"and pointfinger…\""
msgstr "\"고블린왕이 끝장난 후 상황이 나빠졌어. 나는 마을을 떠돌아 다녔지. 아무도 돈을 주지 않고 손가락질 했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "3ac83a90-c81b-4f7c-83bf-43c5640cca63"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you have time to do something, a magic wand appears in Cwurk's "
"hands. He waves it — and the world around you flashes with blinding lights "
"that dance before your eyes, making you sick. Through the noise of blood "
"pumping in your ears, you hear the goblin giggling and the wheels of cart "
"squeaking as it moves away from you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}뭔가를 할 틈도 없이 츄와크의 손에 마술 지팡이가 나타납니다. 그는 그것을 흔듭니다. 그러자 당신 주변의 세계가 눈 앞에서 "
"번쩍여댔고, 당신은 어지러워졌습니다. 귀 속이 멍한 상태로, 고블린이 낄낄거리는 소리와 수레가 삐걱거리며 당신에게 멀어지는 소리가 "
"들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "3484dd75-2724-43cc-90aa-34fa9c1d73b9"
msgid ""
"{n}When your sight returns to normal, Chwurk and his cart are gone. You "
"start to wonder if the strange goblin was just a hallucination.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}시야가 정상으로 돌아오자, 츄와크와 그의 수레는 사라지고 없습니다. 이상한 고블린이 그저 환각인지 궁금해지기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "6f1c8c42-a64e-4833-b7d1-bc1389b40899"
msgid ""
"{n}Chwurk takes a deep breath, obviously relieved.{/n} \"That's right, you "
"be taking it! I can even drag this chairy myself — not be a problem for me! "
"Now, now...\" {n}The trader hastily mounts the throne atop his cart, covers "
"it with some rugs, then looks around cautiously.{/n} \"Me never be taking no "
"things without permission! No want get in trouble like that again!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}츄와크는 안도의 숨을 깊게 쉽니다.{/n} \"맞아. 네가 가져가! 나도 이 의자를 끌고 갈 수 있고 내게 문제가 되지 않아! "
"지금...\" {n}상인은 서둘러 수레 꼭대기에 왕좌를 올려 놓고 몇 개의 양탄자로 덮은 다음 신중하게 둘러 봅니다.{/n} \"허락 "
"없이는 아무것도 가져가지 않을 거야! 다시는 그런 곤경을 원하지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "112480c5-b5bd-438b-ab16-510b6525179e"
msgid "\"Told you not to bargain!\" {n}Nok-Nok sighs.{/n}"
msgstr "\"흥정하지 말라고!\" {n}녹-녹은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "65bf3fa2-ac08-4f5c-a1b2-06df9b4d5b33"
msgid ""
"\"Listen what I say. No bargain with him. Nok-Nok knows sure, Nok-Nok tried. "
"No do it.\""
msgstr "\"내가 말하는 것을 들어. 그와 협상하지 말라고. 녹-녹은 확신했어. 녹-녹은 해 봤어. 하지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "3e5259c9-8c1d-467d-a895-25b71b5c7b43"
msgid "\"I be going new dungeon, have new goods! I sell, you buy!\""
msgstr "\"나 새 던전 가고, 새 물건 얻는다! 나 팔고, 너 산다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Items/GoblinMace_Description_String
msgctxt "d28d5f77-4322-4bbb-a402-c9bb6d9f89fc"
msgid "A brilliant example of famed goblin weaponsmithing."
msgstr "유명한 고블린 무기 제작자의 훌륭한 작품."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/GoblinTrader/Items/GoblinMace_Name_String
msgctxt "c9ae677b-a47a-48e9-9f41-ef9ff1c18edf"
msgid "Fearsomeful Mace of Chwurk"
msgstr "츄와크의 무시무시한 메이스"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/Blacksmith_Anvil_String
msgctxt "55dd4d96-ff62-4480-9530-dbaf8e7db95a"
msgid ""
"It is a rare town that has a blacksmith capable of making an anvil of this "
"size."
msgstr "그만한 크기의 모루를 만들 수 있는 대장장이가 사는 희귀한 마을입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/Blacksmith_ArmorStandFailOrAfterBoss_String
msgctxt "c9f9e3ee-1a0b-43ec-9468-3d01aba76785"
msgid ""
"Huge iron spaulders, enormous breastplates, massive vambraces the size of a "
"small shield... this looks like a troll suit of armor!"
msgstr "거대한 어깨 갑옷, 거대한 가슴 판, 작은 방패만한 육중한 완갑... 이것은 한 벌의 갑옷처럼 보입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/Blacksmith_ArmorStandSuccess_String
msgctxt "c925606d-f6e0-4a2d-8f30-4f9591ca276a"
msgid "This armor cannot be used until it is repaired."
msgstr "이 갑옷은 수리 될 때까지 사용할 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/Blacksmith_HugeHammer_String
msgctxt "1580611b-5be7-4aaa-a7a5-68c99f8f67ef"
msgid "No one could lift such a hammer… except perhaps a troll."
msgstr "아마 트롤을 제외하고 아무도 그런 망치를 들 수 없습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/Blasksmith_Dwarf1_String
msgctxt "66433b0d-69c9-411c-a009-144783c74b23"
msgid "\"Droskar almighty, what have I done to deserve this?!\""
msgstr "\"전능하신 드로스카르여 제가 이럴 자격이 있나이까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/Blasksmith_Dwarf2_String
msgctxt "06f922c3-652d-4011-9533-2a68d249c3fb"
msgid "\"Dimwits! Fools! Why did I agree to work here?!\""
msgstr "\"바보! 멍청이들! 왜 내가 여기서 일하기로 동의한 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/Blasksmith_Dwarf_String
msgctxt "6264d8c8-132d-4c5b-9755-e1b509f74498"
msgid ""
"\"Idiots! Halfwits! Another breastplate ruined! Even a goblin has more "
"brains than a troll!\""
msgstr "\"바보 녀석! 어리석은 녀석! 또 다른 흉갑이 망가졌어! 고블린도 트롤보다 더 똑똑하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/TeleportRoom_Nyrd 1_String
msgctxt "77412d2f-2ba2-44f5-82bb-333e4f72ab30"
msgid "\"Heh heh... Well... where should we throw this batch?\""
msgstr "\"헤 헤... 어디다 펼쳐야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/TeleportRoom_Nyrd_String
msgctxt "58b0a264-20cc-43a2-b985-38026e4fcf7c"
msgid ""
"\"You, trollsnout! Stay inside the circle! Pah — what does he care if he "
"loses a few toes, though? He'll grow new ones... Yeah, stand as you want, no "
"worries! He-he... Well... Where should we throw this batch...\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤 같은 녀석! 동그라미 안에서 움직이지 마! 파 - 그가 발가락 몇 개를 잃어봤자 상관 없겠지? 새로운 발가락이 날 테니... "
"그래. 걱정 말고 원하는 곳에 서있으라고. 헤헤... 음... 어디에 펼쳐야 할까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/WyvernCave_DeadDwarf_String
msgctxt "c4617e03-36e8-4252-931d-4c58f403cbda"
msgid "This dwarf looks to have been eaten alive."
msgstr "이 드워프는 산 채로 먹힌 것처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/WyvernCave_DeadMan_String
msgctxt "e5a23bd1-3789-48eb-b2f6-367ab1d5a070"
msgid "The man's tongue is black from poison."
msgstr "이 남자의 혀는 독약으로 검게 변해 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/WyvernCave_DeadWoman_String
msgctxt "286730bf-c664-4301-b7f7-b8555292583e"
msgid "The bloody face has a vacant, saddened expression."
msgstr "피 묻은 얼굴은 공허하고 슬퍼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/WyvernCave_Floor_String
msgctxt "dc4e7e29-628b-4aaf-b4f2-140c4b32e84d"
msgid ""
"The uneven floor is covered with dried wyvern feces and bones, picked clean."
msgstr "고르지 않은 바닥은 말라 붙은 와이번의 대변과 살이 발라진 뼈로 덮여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/WyvernCave_InsideDoorToTeleportRoom_String
msgctxt "99b39de0-9d69-4579-a330-4d932023ab84"
msgid ""
"This door doesn't have a handle or a latch. Looks like it only opens from "
"the outside."
msgstr "이 문에는 손잡이나 걸쇠가 없습니다. 외부에서 열리는 것처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/Barks/WyvernCave_OutsideDoorToCorridor_String
msgctxt "9c4ba9a1-83ba-4aef-b48a-e7b46e19d2aa"
msgid ""
"Munching and crunching noises can be heard from behind the massive iron "
"door. A foul stench is emanating from the cracks."
msgstr "거대한 철제 문 뒤에는 우적우적 씹히는 소리가 들릴 수도 있습니다. 틈에서 악취가 나고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "45518c72-7be8-44e0-a07e-02303a1befdd"
msgid "\"Are you the one sending monsters to my lands?\""
msgstr "\"네가 내 땅에 괴물을 보냈냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8ff52a70-1a1d-4778-a6de-ea39c2e3747a"
msgid "Proposed a peaceful agreement to Nyrd Zottenropple."
msgstr "니르드 조텐로플에게 평화 협정을 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "3bcec188-fa53-427e-9c60-d29502d2e7ac"
msgid "\"I don't want to fight with you. Let's make a deal.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너와 싸우고 싶지 않다. 협상을 하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "bb267e9b-0216-495e-a52c-8f29f86161fc"
msgid "[Attack] \"It's time to pay. Prepare to die.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"빛을 갚을 시간이다. 죽을 준비 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f4ffc5b0-92af-4955-88ed-ade97b6a5c51"
msgid "\"I'd better go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "865fdb32-3836-4bbb-bbf3-77a7759d7846"
msgid "\"Why did you agree to work for Irovetti?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이로베티를 위해 일하기로 동의 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3b64d22e-cf4c-4913-aa1b-8fcfc5b034b5"
msgid "Joked about Nyrd Zottenropple being affected by the Bleaching."
msgstr "백화의 영향을 받는 것에 대해 니르드 조텐로플에게 농담을 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "ad359163-1df1-4d36-bd15-ae1835b8b045"
msgid ""
"\"You know, I'm looking at this withered straw pile hiding under your helmet "
"and I don't think all these efforts are helping your Bleaching much...\""
msgstr "\"너도 알다시피 네 헬멧 아래에 튀어나온 시든 짚 더미는 백화를 감추는데 도움이 된다 생각하지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "5a799f4a-ebf4-4d93-81f2-8b751d319ff0"
msgid ""
"\"How many times do I have to say it? Don't bother me, when I...\" {n}The "
"sorceress turns and cries out in surprise when she sees you. Bleak, nearly "
"gray hair sticks out from under her ridiculous leather helmet. An insane "
"light gleams in her bloodshot eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"몇 번이나 말해야 하지? 나를 귀찮게 하지 마.\" {n}마법사는 당신을 보았을 때 깜짝 놀라며 소리칩니다. 거의 회색으로 탈색된 "
"머리카락이 우스꽝스러운 가죽 헬멧 아래에 삐죽 튀어나왔습니다. 그녀의 벌건 눈에서 광기가 서려있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f04c928c-9f83-4e43-8096-cf8b0dd1ee8a"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, here you are, {name}! I've been waiting for you for some time. "
"Irovetti was afraid you would find us immediately... but he obviously "
"overestimated your abilities, he-he-he.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기 있군. {name}! 나는 얼마 동안 기다리고 있었다. 이로베티는 네가 즉시 우리를 찾을 까봐 두려워했어...하지만 그는 분명히 "
"너의 능력을 과대 평가했어. 하하하. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "5552ce69-19f1-4a60-b3d5-6bf9e593717f"
msgid "\"Ah ha ha ha! You're a joker too, {name}?\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 너도 웃기는구나. {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0009_AttackNyrdMosterCamp_Text
msgctxt "03809d6e-f137-4a8d-a65c-0019b36ae549"
msgid "\"Guards, to me! And release the wyverns!\""
msgstr "\"경비원! 나에게 와라! 그리고 와이번을 풀어 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "a0c76276-97c7-4050-b998-119fe9f97e60"
msgid ""
"\"WHAT?! Where is your armor, you fools?! And where are the wyverns?! Damn "
"it... Don't just stand there, attack!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구? 갑옷은 어디 있어? 이 바보들아?! 와이번은 어딨어? 젠장... 그냥 거기 서 있지 말고 공격해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "ce2d618f-4f7a-40e0-a654-2bdd5d210236"
msgid ""
"\"WHAT?! Where is your armor, you fools?! Damn it... Don't just stand there, "
"attack them!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라구? 갑옷은 어디 있어? 이 바보들아?! 젠장... 그냥 거기 서 있지 말고 공격해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "230011da-1584-4abb-a0e3-e0f7f074601c"
msgid ""
"\"Devil take them, where are all the wyverns?! By all the... Don't just "
"stand there. To arms! Attack!\""
msgstr "\"죽어도 싼 녀석들. 와이번은 어딨어? 젠장... 그냥 거기 서 있지 말아. 전투 준비! 공격해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "56aa6a79-65bd-4b98-9fe7-63fc2fcdf44b"
msgid ""
"\"Of course it's me! The great and terrible Nyrd Zottenropple, the most "
"feared sorceress in these lands and every other — and the mistress of "
"teleportation — at your service!\" {n}The woman sneers and gives a mocking "
"bow.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론 나지! 대단하고 끔찍한 니르드 조텐로플이자 이 땅에서 가장 두려운 마법사 이자 순간 이동의 여주인이지!\" {n}여자는 비웃고 "
"조롱하듯 인사합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "c3d3d392-b6f6-4149-aaa4-16158edcdb3f"
msgid "\"Feh, how low. Are you a {mf|king|queen} or a haggler?\""
msgstr "\"쳇. 치사하군. 너 {mf|왕|여왕} 이야 아니면 사기꾼이야? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "441de223-a0b2-4d46-8a55-ac357515e53a"
msgid ""
"\"Praise {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}! I was looking at you, pouting your lips "
"in righteous indignation, and feared you would lecture me, like your classic "
"paladin...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}를 찬양하라! 나는 의로운 분노로 입술을 다물고 당신을 마주하며 성기사처럼 나를 가르치는 "
"것에 경외합니다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "a1bfba4f-8629-44a6-86de-84290efb8c02"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I don't care about your Irovetti, that lewd snotrag! But you can't "
"argue with the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}... You'd turn to anyone, when your "
"hair starts to lose color, and the skin — to fade and wrinkle! But just look "
"at what he helped me build here. Even you must appreciate it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너의 음침한 이로베티에 관심이 없다! 너는 하지만 {g|백화}노화{/g}에 대해 언급할 수 없어... 머리카락이 색을 잃기 "
"시작하고 피부가 - 퇴색하고 주름살이 생길 때 누구든 모습이 바뀔 거야! 그러나 그가 나를 도와 여기에서 내가 한 것을 봐. 심지어 너도 "
"감사해야 할 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "c558cc6e-4c87-4008-ba1c-6330eba27825"
msgid ""
"{n}The face of the sorceress turns red, and a vein bulges on her forehead. "
"Her fury echoes through the cave.{/n} \"Silence, you boneheads!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마술사의 얼굴이 붉어지고 이마에 정맥이 부풀어 오릅니다. 그녀의 분노는 동굴을 통해 울립니다.{/n} \"닥쳐라! 이 멍청이 같은 "
"녀석!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d8a8293f-a8b6-41b3-9e00-6d4f91c15297"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost looks sincerely upset.{/n} \"I wanted to help you during the "
"debate, Lady Nyrd! Yes, despite your love of silly pranks. But the creature "
"I see before me now simply cannot be saved.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Jubilost는 진심으로 화가 나 보입니다.{/n} \"논쟁 중에 도우려고 했어. Nyrd! 어리석은 농담에 대한 너의 사랑에도 "
"불구하고 말이지. 하지만 지금 내 앞에 있는 생물은 구원받을 수 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : CR10_TrollGuard
msgctxt "2500ffee-29c4-49d6-8a0c-9cda6b42a8fa"
msgid "\"Bwa ha ha ha...\""
msgstr "\"하하하...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "33cef16a-db93-421d-8c9d-adb1754cbcf5"
msgid ""
"\"What could you possibly know about the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, {race}? "
"You would never understand this quiet, crawling terror.\""
msgstr "\"네가 {g|백화}백화{/g} 대해 뭘 알아? {race}? 이 조용하고 스며드는 공포를 너는 결코 이해할 수 없을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "c48f1794-4149-4d89-89a5-0e8e0ee977d5"
msgid ""
"\"Then again, I'm sure for some reason you won't last long, "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} or no Bleaching, {name}... he-he.\""
msgstr "\"{g|백화}백화{/g}가 되었든 않았든 간에 네가 오래 가지 못할 거라 확신해. {name}... 헤헤.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5a59dcc9-3ebb-4060-be95-cb8100b03f38"
msgid ""
"\"If I ever Bleach and turn into something like this, please kill me. Just "
"kill me.\""
msgstr "\"만약 내가 노화되면 제발 날 죽여줘. 그냥 죽여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "c7041aea-6102-410c-a3a1-c21d9b67bec9"
msgid ""
"\"Find a system of underground caves and clear it of all the critters! "
"Create a gigantic teleportation circle, capable of transferring whole hordes "
"of monsters! Breed and train huge uncontrollable beasts... then hurl them "
"wherever you wish! Hurl them at naked guards at a bath-house, onto a bed of "
"a merchant couple, to your privy even... Or to a tower roof, ah-ha-ha! And "
"then watch them try to get down from there through a magic ball! Or better "
"yet — drop them into a lake. Think of the splash! Ha-ha-ha-hah!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지하 동굴을 뒤져 모든 동물의 흔적을 깨끗이 해라! 괴물들의 무리를 옮길 수 있는 거대한 순간 이동 마법진을 만들어라. 통제 할 수 "
"없는 거대한 동물을 번식시켜 훈련 시켜라. 그리고 어디든 원하는 곳에 그들을 던져라! 목욕탕 벌거벗은 가드들에게, 상인 부부의 침대에, "
"심지어는 너의 사적인 곳으로... 아니면 타워 지붕으로 던져! 아하하! 그리고 그곳에서 마법의 공을 통해 내려 오는 것을 보라고! 아니면 "
"그들을 호수에 떨어뜨려 봐. 물이 많이 튀겠지! 하하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "e109a6c6-d7eb-4e42-b5f1-cb557bb03318"
msgid ""
"\"Who else? The great and terrible Nyrd Zottenropple, the world-famous "
"wizard and master of teleportation! I liked playing with you very much, "
"{name}. Without you there, the Inconsequent Debates would have been mortally "
"boring! Mortally boring, ah ha ha! Nicely put, eh?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나 말고 누가 있지? 대단하고 끔찍한 니르드 조텐로플는 세계에서 가장 유명한 마법사이자 순간 이동의 대가이지! 나는 너와 놀고 "
"싶어졌다. {name}. 거기에 참석하지 못하면 비논리 토론회는 죽을 만큼 지루했었을 거야! 죽을 만큼 지루하다고! 아 하하! 유행어가 "
"되겠는걸?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "39c5d183-88ed-4078-ba1e-777ad92789b1"
msgid ""
"\"How many times must I say it? Don't bother me when I...\" {n}The wizard "
"turns to you and cries out in surprise. It's none other than {d|Nyrd}Nyrd "
"Zottenropple{/d}, the prank-loving participant at the Inconsequent "
"Debates.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"몇 번이나 말해야 하지? 귀찮게 하지 마.\" {n}마법사가 당신에게 돌아서서 갑자기 울음을 터뜨립니다. {d|Nyrd} 니르드 "
"조텐로플{/d}은 비논리 토론회에 장난치기를 좋아하는 참가자였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0b4f9cc5-d932-4cd2-97fd-9a036be84226"
msgid "\"Likewise.\""
msgstr "\"마찬가지로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "fb233dc2-94c8-4d97-a63c-e839d1cdc276"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrd pouts.{/n} \"I didn't think you'd be such a bore! It's a shame to be "
"let down by a fellow gnome!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Nyrd가 뾰루퉁해졌습니다.{/n} \"나는 네가 그런 지루한 녀석일 줄 몰랐어. 동료 노움에 의해 실망 당하는 것은 수치스럽다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "4b407e5c-2b67-430a-bf85-9ade9e59ec40"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, {name}, you brought your charming friend with you. Why don't you come "
"a little closer, Sir Jubilost? I have a few delightfully fun spells in stock "
"just for you!\" {n}Nyrd winks. Her words seem careless and fun, but there's "
"a creepy undertone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오. {name}. 매력적인 친구를 데려왔군. 좀 더 가까이와 보지. Jubilost? 너를 위해 몇 가지 재미있는 주문을 보여줄게!"
"\" {n}Nyrd가 윙크합니다. 그녀의 말은 부주의하고 재미있지만 음흉함이 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "303b518a-35ea-421a-ba50-ec9f004f6bb7"
msgid ""
"\"An unexpected encounter at an unexpected place.\" {n}Jubilost frowns.{/n} "
"\"I fear your pranks have gone too far, Lady Zottenropple.\""
msgstr ""
"\"예기치 않은 곳에서 예기치 않은 만남을 가졌군.\" {n}Jubilost는 찡긋합니다.{/n} \"네 장난이 도를 지나쳤다고 생각해. "
"Zottenropple.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bf9792f8-2bf7-41a9-820d-456c0cdff97a"
msgid ""
"\"It started with turning random passers-by into frogs. It ended in the mass "
"murder of innocent citizens by monsters. And I'm sure it was all just a mad "
"game, in a head tormented by the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 무작위 통행인을 개구리로 바꾸는 것으로 시작했다. 결국 무고한 시민들의 괴물에 의한 대량 학살 사건으로 끝났지. 그리고 그것은 "
"{g|백화}백화{/g}되어 머리가 돌아버린 노움의 장난이었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "ba4118e9-77ad-4b21-8f99-ec6767017c62"
msgid ""
"\"Unreasonable creature. You should have accepted the "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} as a great gift, submitted to it quietly, avoided "
"the agony of being. By fighting it, you only prolong your suffering.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불합리한 생물이야. {g|백화}백화{/g}를 큰 선물로 인정하고 조용히 받아들여 존재의 고통을 피해야 해. 그것과 싸우면 고통만 "
"늘어나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "55d3bcb4-0b68-4f18-aa88-22e09a7d138a"
msgid "{n}Ekun grips his weapon.{/n} \"This insanity must be stopped.\""
msgstr "{n}에쿤은 그의 무기를 잡습니다.{/n} \"이 광기는 멈춰야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/NyrdZottenripple/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "712568f9-10da-480a-86fb-53df9b054ade"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, a familiar face! Where are your frog brothers? Are they going to jump "
"out from around the corner?\""
msgstr "\"오. 친숙한 얼굴이군! 개구리 형제는 어디 있지? 모퉁이에서 뛰어 내릴 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Answer_0003_Text_String
msgctxt "47a98093-975e-42da-9932-dd19919b8212"
msgid "[Try to find a weakness in the armor]"
msgstr "[갑옷의 약점을 찾습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "906d073c-d347-412c-a80f-8f53e06ef710"
msgid "[Grab the forging hammer and try to break the armor]"
msgstr "[대장장이 망치를 들어 갑옷을 부숩니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "ace892f8-f6aa-436d-b39f-0932946271e6"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "55ce271b-8d6a-422d-959a-450f25f264bf"
msgid ""
"{n}Huge iron spaulders, enormous breastplates, massive vambraces the size of "
"a small shield... Is this a troll suit of armor?{/n}"
msgstr "{n}거대한 어깨 갑옷, 거대한 가슴 판, 작은 방패만한 육중한 완갑... 이것은 트롤의 갑옷 한벌일까요?{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "eb2744b6-85d9-45ee-8f29-0b4c14dbe652"
msgid ""
"{n}Parts of the armor are riveted together or connected by thick leather "
"straps. Pull out the rivets using tongs that lie nearby, cut the straps — "
"and the armor will fall apart! You set about it, and soon the troll armor is "
"no more.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}갑옷의 일부는 두꺼운 가죽 띠로 연결되어 있습니다. 근처에 있는 집게를 사용하여 고정못을 당기고 끈을 자르면 갑옷이 떨어져 "
"나옵니다! 당신은 바로 시작하고 갑옷은 더 이상 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "fdcc14b2-b7a9-4ca7-872d-8eb887927273"
msgid ""
"{n}You examine one of the suits of armor thoroughly, but you fail to find a "
"way to damage it.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}갑옷의 양복 중 하나를 철저히 검사하지만 손상을 입히는 방법을 찾지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "bf6e9cdb-096e-437b-99f0-133f43dddb68"
msgid ""
"{n}Your forehead is sweating, your face is red... little by little, the "
"armor starts to give in under the heavy blows. Soon, the troll armor is just "
"a heap of crumpled metal. Fortunately no one was drawn here by the noise — "
"most likely because it was coming from the smithy.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이마에서 땀을 흘리며 얼굴이 붉어집니다... 조금씩 갑옷이 강력한 매질에 구겨집니다. 곧 갑옷은 구겨진 금속 덩어리에 지나지 "
"않습니다. 다행스럽게도 아무도 소음 때문에 여기에 오지 않았습니다. 대장간에서 나온 소리이기 때문인 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "02fa612e-4c9a-488c-a045-402de988e3f0"
msgid ""
"{n}The armor is crude, but forged to last. No matter how hard you try, you "
"fail to make a dent.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}갑옷은 거칠지만 마감이 잘 되었습니다. 아무리 열심히 노력해도 흠집내지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollArmor/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "008540dc-05c9-48c9-a4df-8f260a915905"
msgid ""
"\"You know what goblins are good at? Ruining stuff! Watch — just need to cut "
"this strap, that bind...\""
msgstr "\"고블린이 잘하는 것을 알고 있어? 물건을 망치는 것이다! 조심해.이 끈을 자르면 된다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1d46de11-8e52-4f08-b5bf-ec4d30b1f833"
msgid "Tried persuading Kargadd's offspring to start a new life with Hargulka."
msgstr "하굴카와 함께 새로운 삶을 시작하기 위해 카르가드의 후손을 설득하려고 노력했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a14e2c92-09db-4a20-a74c-049232c28bbb"
msgid ""
"\"Hargulka is alive — he still rules. Go to him, and you will never have to "
"be hungry or lonely again. You'll be able to have your own children.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하굴카는 살아있다. 그는 여전히 지배자이지. 그에게 가면 배고프거나 외롭지 않아도 될 거야. 자식을 가질 수도 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "04d7ae6a-bab2-4f2b-b83b-913fb72f4f6b"
msgid "Tried to resolve the conflict with Kargadd's children peacefully."
msgstr "카르가드의 후손들과 평화롭게 갈등을 해결하려고 노력합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6600045e-834c-4ab5-abc6-41c9c207f2fd"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't want his death... Kargadd gave me no choice. We don't need to "
"fight. I spared you once — let's part in peace this day, too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그의 죽음을 원하지 않았다... 카르가드는 나에게 선택의 여지를 주지 않았다. 우리는 싸울 필요가 없어. 나는 너를 한 번 살려 "
"줬다. 오늘도 평화롭게 지내자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "d4f79286-c12f-4569-9e5a-c1261b33731f"
msgid "\"It was nice seeing you. I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"너를 보는 것이 좋았다. 나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "156bceb3-3729-47bb-acc1-4383ba7e4675"
msgid "Decided to kill Kargadd's children to protect the innocent."
msgstr "무고한 사람들을 보호하기 위해 카르가드의 후손을 죽이기로 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "c863770e-3d9d-4c10-8500-b9bd6a3c78f5"
msgid ""
"\"I gave you a chance, but you didn't take it. Only by killing you can I be "
"sure you won't harm innocents... to arms!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너에게 기회를 주었지만 너는 그것을 받아들이지 않았다. 너를 죽이는 것 만으로도 무고한 이를 해끼치지 않을 것임을 확신 할 수 "
"있다... 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f099734d-237b-4909-948e-999ca085c707"
msgid "Decided that being merciful toward Kargadd's children was a mistake."
msgstr "카르가드의 후손에게 자비를 베푸는 것은 실수임을 받아들입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "209c19bb-0ce1-4778-8ccb-f1518698d386"
msgid "\"Letting you live was a mistake. Death to trolls!\""
msgstr "\"너를 살려 두는 것은 실수였다. 트롤에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildKarga
msgctxt "e9d47b86-0559-4270-a8dd-05c26b34241a"
msgid "\"We know you, borba!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너를 안다! 보바!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildArgadd
msgctxt "6831f22b-b547-4691-b57b-dd06262e9078"
msgid "\"We see you before. Borba kill father Kargadd.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너를 전에 보았다. 보바는 아버지 카르가드를 죽인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildArgadd
msgctxt "735f0940-eb1e-4969-a241-da1896ce6919"
msgid "\"No. You kill Kargadd... And Karga and Argadd kill you.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 카르가드는 네가 죽이고... 그리고 카르가와 아르가드는 너를 죽인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9815daf2-0ab4-4acc-8789-b0153e8f0c32"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face becomes cold. Only his narrowed eyes show what is going on in "
"his soul.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}에쿤의 얼굴은 굳습니다. 그의 가늘게 뜬 눈만이 그의 영혼 속에서 일어나는 일을 보여줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildKarga
msgctxt "321a22d2-38d0-4df4-ab0c-0ba3bc5314d5"
msgid ""
"\"No peace. You don't kill Kargadd, he kill you. You don't kill us then — we "
"kill you now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"평화는 없다. 너는 카르가드를 죽이지 않고 그가 너를 죽인다. 너는 우리를 죽이지 않는다. 그러면, 우리는 지금 너를 죽인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "0e51e82e-3e15-4cd2-b3e2-161ed1d2c847"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun takes an arrow out of the quiver. His soft voice is painfully "
"distinct in the sudden silence.{/n} \"And still I was right.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 화살통에서 화살을 꺼냅니다. 그의 부드러운 목소리는 갑작스러운 침묵 속에서 고통스럽고 뚜렷합니다.{/n} \"그리고 여전히 "
"나는 옳았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "163b3053-ce13-4567-be96-5abdc0dc2652"
msgid ""
"\"Borba are for eating. We kill you, kill your other borba, then kill "
"everyone...\""
msgstr "\"보바는 먹기 위해 있는 거야. 우리가 너를 죽이고 너의 다른 보바를 죽이고 모두를 죽여서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildArgadd
msgctxt "6da03ee8-f611-458f-80ed-3cd297c38043"
msgid "\"Death to borba!\""
msgstr "\"보바에게 죽음을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildKarga
msgctxt "2116e645-9263-422d-9bcf-cc94c3646775"
msgid "\"We be alone long time. Hungry, wait, search. Now borba be here.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 오랫동안 혼자였다. 배고프고, 기다리고 수색한다. 지금 보바는 여기에 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0024_TrollKidsSparedAgain_Text
#. Speaker : RockTrollChildArgadd
msgctxt "793e143b-039e-41d1-b8ab-5ee065885eef"
msgid ""
"{n}The silence seems to last forever. Tiny troll eyes are hungrily peering "
"at you — obviously craving your blood. Finally, one of them speaks.{/n} "
"\"Good, borba. All right.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}침묵은 영원히 지속되는 것 같습니다. 작은 트롤의 눈은 당신을 먹잇감 보듯 봅니다. 분명히 당신의 피를 갈망하고 있습니다. "
"마지막으로 그들 중 하나가 말합니다.{/n} \"좋아. 보바. 좋아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/MonsterCamp/TrollChildren/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "efb15307-7710-4236-bf5e-aa974d61b7b1"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun clenches his fists.{/n} \"By sparing them you doom innocents to die. "
"I do not understand why.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}애쿤은 그의 주먹을 꽉 쥡니다.{/n} \"그들을 살려두면 너는 무고한 사람들을 죽이게 되는 것이다. 나는 왜 그런지 이해하지 "
"못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/PitaxTown/Barks/Bark_Bark_C51-LinziQ3_Rebel2_String
msgctxt "289cd0b2-bf95-40a5-987b-92f67686d2b7"
msgid "\"Death to the tyrant's lackeys!\""
msgstr "\"폭군의 부족에 대한 죽음!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/PitaxTown/Barks/Bark_Bark_C51-LinziQ3_Rebel3_String
msgctxt "86bc9a41-212b-4708-8dde-10c34ec8aa95"
msgid "\"Burn it down!\""
msgstr "\"불 태워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/PitaxTown/Barks/Bark_C51-LinziQ3_Rebel1_String
msgctxt "ece38249-b51f-49f3-b4a0-77d818803953"
msgid "\"Burn the academy!\""
msgstr "\"아카데미를 태워라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c6b0bb05-d310-4a7d-92fc-da1dcf89cc93"
msgid "\"You seem to really hate Irovetti. Why is that?\""
msgstr "\"너는 정말 이로베티를 싫어하는 것 같아. 왜 그런거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "202e3fd2-496d-4c88-857a-82e6601ee84d"
msgid "\"What do you want from me?\""
msgstr "\"나한테 원하는게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "311a7f90-ef18-4b39-aaef-1e68bcd4107f"
msgid "\"I will think about your proposal.\""
msgstr "\"제안을 생각해 보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "23d7a402-f43a-43af-b057-39a3b9c49d5f"
msgid "\"I will not make any deals with you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너와 어떤 거래도 하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "0b2fab91-3fbe-45c5-b6cb-e010d3d63b88"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "3f5a7c0e-f009-48f5-9cfa-b393799e496e"
msgid "[Attack] \"Do you know what I do to turncoats?\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"내가 변절자를 어떻게 하는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "9c1adb90-a59c-4637-b1aa-dd337fa735dc"
msgid "\"What artifact?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 유물?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "ec1b88c9-ee50-4407-a319-2ea13e138a13"
msgid ""
"\"Deal. Help me rouse the bards to rebel against Irovetti, and I'll make you "
"the Academy's new headmaster.\""
msgstr "\"좋다. 내가 음유시인들을 부추겨 이로베티에게 반기를 들도록 하게 도와주면 너는 아카데미의 새로운 교장이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "fe7c2263-b3dc-4abd-8470-3d6143992c98"
msgid ""
"\"Until now you served Irovetti loyally, working against me, just like "
"Atalia. Why should I trust you now?\""
msgstr "\"지금까지 너는 Atalia처럼 나에게 맞서기 위해 충성스러운 이로베티를 섬겼다. 왜 지금 너를 믿어야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "c5aeded4-4988-4a10-8444-4647e2f372bd"
msgid "\"How are things at the Academy?\""
msgstr "\"아카데미에서 어떻게 지내?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "e79a47cd-e7fa-4217-ae8f-2175a5f21604"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "e0bdbb11-3942-4c91-ae7a-9ee0c89e81db"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Annamede}Annamede{/d} Belavarah, the most celebrated of all "
"{g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} bards, approaches you with a sweet smile.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 가장 많은 찬사를 받는 {d|Annamede}안나미데{/d} 빌라바라가 미소와 함께 당신에게 "
"접근합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "c051c22f-d460-4269-a87f-7175f953eb18"
msgid ""
"\"For the same reason he is hated by every {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} girl or boy "
"unlucky enough to catch that stinking pig's eye! He doesn't take 'no' for an "
"answer. The whole city is his personal harem!\""
msgstr ""
"\"운 나쁘게도 그 냄새나는 돼지의 눈을 피하지 못한 모든 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 소년 소녀들이 같은 이유로 그를 싫어하죠! "
"그는 '아니'라는 대답을 무시해요. 도시 전체가 그의 개인 하렘이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "0ed4c33d-c098-49eb-b73c-f0cb69647ca7"
msgid ""
"\"When he failed to seduce me, he tried to buy me. And when he failed to buy "
"me, he tried taking me by force. When he failed at that too, he tried to put "
"a spell on me using a strange artifact. Praise {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}, "
"the magic didn't work, but... I swear by the Goddess, what I wouldn't give "
"to have my revenge! For myself and for countless others less fortunate!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 나를 유혹하지 못했을 때, 그는 나를 매수하려고 했었죠. 그리고 그가 나를 사지 못하자, 그는 나를 강제로 데려가려고 했어요. "
"그것도 실패하니, 이번에는 이상한 아티팩트를 사용해서 나에게 마법을 걸려고 했죠. 오, {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}시여. "
"마법은 효과가 없었지만... 여신에게 맹세코 나는 내 복수를 하지 못했어요! 나와 무수한 다른 사람들은 운이 없구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "c1f10706-80e7-4544-ba57-b1cb52eeb3e9"
msgid ""
"\"I have a business proposal for you. I have influence in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}"
". If I rouse the students of the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} to "
"rebel against Irovetti, no one will listen to that old hag Atalia. It's a "
"few hundred healthy boys and girls, many of whom wield magic. Trust me, "
"you'd prefer them fighting for you, not against you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제안을 하나 하죠. 나는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 영향력이 있어요. {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}"
" 학생을 부추겨 이로베티를 상대로 반란을 일으킬 수 있죠. 그렇게 되면 늙은 아탈리아는 문제도 아닐 거예요. 생각해 봐요. 아카데미 학생 "
"수백 명이 당신 편에 서겠죠. 그중에 마법을 못하는 학생이 드물 텐데, 굳이 적으로 돌릴 필요가 있을까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "7cda1292-3ed8-4050-a585-5a4a48faadb4"
msgid ""
"\"And in return... In return I ask that you keep the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g} open after you win the crown, and make me its new "
"headmaster. Deal?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 그 보답으로... 당신이 왕이 되면 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g} 문을 열어두고, 나를 새로운 "
"교장이 되게 해줘요. 어떤가요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "2a0b89ef-f563-40f6-8bc8-1ed9a9deefae"
msgid "\"Wait!\""
msgstr "\"기다려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "2c2df651-280f-41b5-a97f-98835ee87ee8"
msgid ""
"\"Think quickly. The clouds have gathered. The storm will soon be upon us!\""
msgstr "\"빨리 생각해봐요. 구름이 모여 들었어요. 곧 폭풍우가 몰아치겠죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "bdfe7eb3-6bf2-43fc-993c-07b266a9bb75"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish, Your Highness. I'm afraid you will regret this decision...\""
msgstr "\"당신 뜻대로, 전하. 이 결정을 후회하실까 걱정되네요...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "fa60152b-6abf-46e1-b861-a1c8e292db24"
msgid "\"Big mistake!\" {n}Annamede vanishes into thin air.{/n}"
msgstr "\"큰 실수군요!\" {n}안나메데가 허공으로 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "622794d1-5749-4bc9-85bd-19a253552692"
msgid "\"Well, Your Highness? Did you make your decision?\""
msgstr "\"글쎄. 결정은 했나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "952dc42b-9df1-4f2a-a354-103d4da4bcba"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know. It was like a piece of driftwood, or perhaps a wooden "
"sword... I really don't want to talk about it, forgive me. But in a "
"nutshell, the pig invited me to another romantic dinner, snuck up on me from "
"behind and poked me in the back with this stick. I don't know what he "
"expected, but it didn't work. I immediately realized he was trying to put a "
"spell on me, and I was consumed by such rage as I've never felt in my whole "
"life. I'm ashamed to recall the scene I made — I screamed, flipped over the "
"table, splashed him with wine... Ha-ha, you know what? I'm not ashamed at "
"all! The look of his unshaven snout dripping wine — it's my only pleasant "
"memory of the whole evening!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 몰라요. 유목이나 나무 칼 같았죠... 그것에 대해 말하고 싶지 않아. 미안. 하지만 그 돼지는 또 다른 낭만적인 저녁식사에 "
"나를 초대하고는, 뒤에서 나를 붙들고 그 막대기로 내 등을 찔렀어요. 나는 그가 무엇을 기대했는지 몰라요. 그러나 그것은 효과가 없었죠. "
"나는 즉시 그가 나에게 마법을 쓰려고 한다는 것을 깨달았고, 내가 평생 동안 느낀 적이 없는 분노에 사로잡혔죠. 나는 그 기억을 회상하는 "
"것조차 부끄러워요. 비명을 지르고 테이블을 뒤집어 엎어 포도주를 뿌렸죠. 하하, 그거 아세요? 사실 전혀 부끄럽지 않아요! 와인을 흘리는 "
"그의 주둥이 모양은 내가 유일하게 기억하는 추억이거든요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "f512eebd-f108-48f6-a7eb-e2543096eec8"
msgid ""
"\"Just listen to her! Imagine — loyal to her king for so many years, but "
"when his throne starts to wobble, her conscience magically wakes up!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그냥 들어봐! 상상해 봐. 오랫동안 그녀의 왕에게 충성을 다했지만, 그의 왕좌가 흔들리기 시작하자, 그녀의 양심도 마술처럼 깨어났도다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "cee063f1-0f3c-42bd-b835-afd1ae605349"
msgid ""
"\"Just listen to her. How loyal she is to her protector! How much she and "
"her students owe to him! It's disgusting to hear this spineless creature "
"crawling to her master!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀 말을 들어봐요. 그녀가 얼마나 그녀의 보호자에게 충성스러운가! 그녀와 그녀의 학생들이 얼마나 그에게 빚졌는가! 그 줏대 없는 "
"녀석이 그녀의 주인에게 기어들어가는 소리를 듣게 되다니 역겹네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "2e95b598-bac5-4cf8-8fa4-06aaa3444f42"
msgid ""
"\"I have a business proposal for you. Allow me to lead the rebellion of the "
"{g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} students against Irovetti. I'll handle "
"it far better than this spineless old hag, who hasn't touched a sword in her "
"life. I will lead the bards to battle — and I'll convince them that you are "
"their patron, a true tower of strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제안 하나 하죠. 내가 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g} 학생을 모아 이로베티에 대항하는 반란을 이끌게요. "
"살면서 칼 한 번 만져본 적 없는 아탈리아보단 잘할 자신 있어요. 내가 음유시인을 이끌고 전투에 나서죠. 우리의 후원자이자, 참된 "
"권력자인 당신을 찬양하는 노래가 전장에 울려 퍼질 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "f3f839f4-c494-48fa-9e85-374c9dac834d"
msgid ""
"\"You won't regret it! We shall meet you in front of the palace. And now I "
"must speak with the students.\""
msgstr "\"후회하지 않으실 거예요! 궁전 앞에서 뵙지요. 그럼 이만, 학생들에게 소식을 전하러 가봐야겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "0714158c-60bf-4f9c-907e-2dc76789ae0c"
msgid ""
"\"There's no such thing as 'loyalty'. I should know — after all, it was us, "
"bards, who invented it. It's a fairy tale that rulers tell naive fools, to "
"make them work for free and die for someone else's interests, all with happy "
"smiles on their faces.\""
msgstr ""
"\"충성심 따위는 없어요. 결국, 우리 음유시인이 지어낸 거죠. 통치자가 순진한 바보들에게 얘기하는 동화에요, 그들이 함박 웃음을 지으며 "
"공짜로 일하거나 다른 누군가의 이익을 위해 죽게 만드는.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "86b02303-d78d-4bb0-9fce-95aa2481d1cf"
msgid ""
"\"The deal I'm proposing puts me out on a limb, not you. I rarely make such "
"an offer — to do a job in advance without any guarantee on your part, aside "
"from your word of course. It's a terrible risk — but I'm ready to take it "
"for a chance at revenge. You, on the other hand, risk nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 제안하는 협상은 당신이 아니라 나에게 불리해요. 나는 이런 제안을 거의 하지 않죠 — 당신이 지킬거라는 어떤 근거도 없이 일먼저 "
"해야 하는 종류의 제안이요. 끔찍하게 위험하죠. 하지만 나는 복수할 기회를 얻을 준비가 됐어요. 반면에, 당신은 아무런 부담이 없고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "a178c030-7f13-48c4-87fa-cad7113be2ed"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, Your Highness! How good of you to remember your loyal subjects! To "
"what do we owe the pleasure?\""
msgstr "\"전하! 충성스러운 신하를 기억해 주셔서 얼마나 기쁜지! 어떻게 이 기쁨에 보답해야 하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "cf8dc925-2e62-4317-99de-8e14e1bb2f8c"
msgid "\"Have a safe journey, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"안전한 여행 되세요. 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "fb4860e2-5560-4c5d-a4a9-8de5440a4b94"
msgid ""
"\"More fun in some respects, but a bit more disciplined in others. I threw "
"out the talentless sycophants that the previous king loved so much. Of "
"course, the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} wouldn't be itself without "
"its flatterers, but I only kept those who know other arts besides "
"bootlicking. I hired artists who know how to entertain, and not just "
"eulogize their rulers.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 면에서는 더 재미있었지만, 다른 면에서는 좀 더 교훈적이었죠. 나는 이전 왕이 너무나 좋아했던 무능한 아첨꾼을 내쳤어요. 물론 "
"{g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}는 그런 아첨꾼 없이 존재할 수 없었겠지만, 나는 사탕발림 외에 다른 예술을 "
"아는 사람들만을 지켰어요. 나는 그들의 통치자를 칭찬하는 것이 아니라, 즐겁게 하는 법을 아는 예술가를 고용했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "30aa4433-e40b-451f-9553-5a79621f6d56"
msgid ""
"\"You're right to think we'd need such allies! Not everyone would have the "
"guts to stake everything on revenge. You've got my respect, Maestro! May "
"{g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} aid you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 그런 동료가 필요하다고 생각할 수 있어! 모두가 복수에 모든 것을 걸 용기는 없을 거야. 넌 내가 존경하는 사람이야! "
"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}가 너를 도우길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "71bd942c-0481-4397-9ea6-9d9bea46dca2"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede smiles, pleased.{/n} \"'Revenge is above justice, for he who "
"renders justice serves everyone, but he who wreaks vengeance — just "
"himself'... What, you don't recognize it? It's from 'The Book of Joy,' our "
"{g|Calistria}Lady{/g}'s sacred scriptures.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아나미드는 기쁘게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"복수는 정의를 넘어서는 것이에요. 정의를 구현하는 사람은 모든 사람들에게 봉사하지만, "
"복수하는 사람은 바로 그 자신에게 봉사하하죠. 뭐, 몰랐다고요? 우리의 {g|Calistria}여신님{/g}의 신성한 경전인 '기쁨의 "
"책'에서 나온 말이랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ca8b2472-8f27-45f2-8c30-be72d3010e64"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not much of a reader, really. I studied our {g|Calistria}Lady{/g}'s "
"teachings more firsthand, you could say.\""
msgstr "\"나는 책을 많이 읽지 않아. {g|Calistria}여신님{/g}의 가르침을 먼저 공부했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "1a0ecc87-2603-4fb7-8c03-722445008ae6"
msgid "\"Also worthwhile. Well, may she not leave us when the storm strikes!\""
msgstr "\"또한 가치가 있죠. 폭풍이 치는 동안 그녀가 우리를 떠나지 않길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "27f139ce-53df-43c0-af55-29b923981eed"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's piercing eyes never leave the bard.{/n} \"Wearing colorful "
"feathers and singing sweet songs doesn't change a cobra's nature. Don't "
"listen to that song. Don't let her infatuate you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤의 꿰뚫는 눈은 결코 음유시인을 떠나지 않습니다.{/n}\"화려한 깃털을 치고 달콤한 노래를 부르더라도 코브라의 본성은 바뀌지 "
"않는다. 그 노래를 듣지 마라. 그녀가 너를 괴롭히지 않게 하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "97107e05-307b-45b7-9d1c-ce9b583cd6c2"
msgid ""
"\"Clever, ambitious, attractive, and understands the balance of power... I "
"like her, as well as her proposal. Do consider, {name} — it's much more "
"beneficial to do business with those like Annamede than more stubborn "
"idealists like Atalia Gitaren.\""
msgstr ""
"\"영리하고, 야심 차고, 매력적이며, 권력의 균형을 이해한다... 나는 그녀 뿐만 아니라 그녀의 제안도 좋아해. 잘 생각해. {name}"
". 아탈리아 지타렌과 같은 완고한 이상주의자들 보다 안나메데 같은 이와 협력하는 편이 훨씬 유익해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "e99715f7-f53b-4b8f-96e2-c916fee4978c"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie chuckles.{/n} \"Loyalty was made up by bards, you say? I suppose "
"those with the gift of weaving words often think themselves the masters of "
"hearts, but if they knew the true dangers of battle and the true price of "
"loyalty and camaraderie, they would not sing of their power so confidently.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 비웃었습니다.{/n} \"충성이 음유시인들에 의해 만들어졌다고? 나는 달콤한 단어를 만드는 재능을 가진 사람들이 종종 "
"자신을 마음의 주인이라고 생각할거라 추측하지만, 만약 그들이 전투의 진정한 위험과 충성심과 우애의 진실된 가치를 알게 되면, 그들의 힘을 "
"뽐내며 노래하지 않을 거라 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "6d78ffa3-2e87-4a29-9259-e46deb9cc9f7"
msgid ""
"\"I enjoy her songs so much. There's fire and laughter in them, that you can "
"feel, smell – and almost touch. But Annamede herself scares me. She has a "
"cold heart, and a merciless soul…\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그녀의 노래를 많이 즐기지. 가사에는 불과 웃음을 느끼고 향기를 맡고 심지어 만질 수도 있어. 하지만 안나메데는 무섭더군. "
"그녀는 냉혈한에 자비란 없는 자야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "c8edd212-3555-4731-b8ed-52bb66586842"
msgid ""
"\"Ah ha ha! If your subjects aren't loyal, that simply means you've failed "
"to train them properly. Nothing more, nothing less.\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 네 신하가 충성스럽지 않다면 그건 그들을 제대로 교육하지 못했다는 의미지. 그 이상도 그 이하도 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "1d27b4a1-aba3-4bd8-baa4-70da2031c368"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah watches the bard with undisguised hostility.{/n} \"I wonder what "
"price you will ask, when you sell your loyalty to the next one to claim the "
"crown. Don't make any deals with her, {name}. The scaffold is the proper "
"stage for bards and poets.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카네라는 음유시인을 노골적이고 적대적으로 응시합니다.{/n} \"네 충성심을 다음 왕에게 바칠 때 네가 부를 값이 궁금해지는군. "
"그녀와 거래는 하지 마. {name}. 음유시인 녀석들은 교수대에 보내야 마땅해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "378b31b3-398c-49fd-8068-67b6fc61687c"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "35c2ee85-df07-4e58-b8dc-c2cb817f87fa"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti is a dirtbag and you know it. Aren't you disgusted to work for "
"him?\""
msgstr "\"이로베티는 쓰레기야. 너도 알잖아. 그를 위해 일하는 게 역겹지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0ab5b558-c624-49c5-8b4a-656c11a2fe63"
msgid ""
"Persuaded the academy Headmaster, Atalia Gitaren, to turn against Irovetti."
msgstr "아카데미 교장인 Atrovia Gitaren에게 이로베티에게 등을 돌리라고 설득합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "54245a17-8d65-4dcc-9c9e-84a83181bbc4"
msgid ""
"\"It's easy to do good when someone else is paying for it! You know the "
"price your students pay for the Academy — but you look the other way so you "
"can keep playing your lute in peace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 누군가가 비용을 지불하면 일을 잘할 수 있지! 학생들이 아카데미에 지불하는 금액을 알고 있겠지. 하지만 다른 방법을 사용하면 "
"안심하고 악기를 연주할 수 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "2efd7342-39db-4c16-8a0d-acdd29599c28"
msgid ""
"\"If you knew what I know about Irovetti's business, you wouldn't be serving "
"him.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티의 사업에 대한 것을 네게 말해주면 너는 그를 섬기지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "d5712f2c-c234-4620-9043-3fe7143a77ff"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I will destroy Irovetti and all his servants — starting with you!"
"\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"이로베티와 그의 모든 수하들을 멸할 것이다! 네가 첫 번째야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "3cebef31-f19d-4fa4-8d2f-23d4ccd41e96"
msgid "\"How are things at the Academy?\""
msgstr "\"아카데미에서 어떻게 지내?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "301be5db-a642-4593-861a-d1837ea57663"
msgid "\"How are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"잘 지내?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "44bdd226-1ac9-455c-852f-7dba0365d399"
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "864f38c9-7d46-4c33-84b0-9f18bbd319ea"
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "569c6419-e069-4191-a73e-4b0dee3f7ab1"
msgid ""
"\"So, you've come to give your crown to Irovetti after all. Don't you worry, "
"His Highness will take good care of your lands.\""
msgstr "\"결국 당신은 왕관을 이로베티에게 주려고 왔군요. 걱정하지 마십시오, 전하께서 너의 땅을 잘 통치하실 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "961b3995-5c8a-4514-8d29-e9dd721f0561"
msgid ""
"\"Atalia Gitaren, head of the {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} {g|Academy of Grand Arts}"
"Academy of Grand Arts{/g}. His Highness has given me, and dozens like me, a "
"chance to do what we love.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g} {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}의 교장 아탈리아 지타렌입니다. "
"전하께서 저와, 저와 같은 이들에게 저희가 좋아하는 것을 할 기회를 주셨죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "4df0ae27-680e-4838-9dd2-1fed117c1e4b"
msgid ""
"\"I... Would lie if I told you I've never had to compromise my conscience. "
"But the good he does for the city and my students is incomparably greater "
"than the harm. Irovetti is no role model, but he created the {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}Academy{/g} — and in merely doing that he's atoned for a great "
"many of his wrongdoings. And I, as head of the Academy, have a chance to "
"further diminish the evil he does.\""
msgstr ""
"\"제가... 양심의 가책을 결코 느껴 보지 못했다고 말하면 거짓말이겠죠. 하지만 그가 도시와 학생들을 위해 한 좋은 일은 그의 악행보다 "
"훨씬 많습니다. 이로베티는 본받을 만한 사람이 아니지만, 그는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}를 만들었습니다 "
"— 그리고 그 일 만으로도 그는 많은 죄를 용서받을 수 있습니다. 또한, 아카데미의 교장인 저는 그가 저지른 악행을 더 줄여줄 수도 "
"있지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8ca3cce3-9174-4192-845c-2647b9a2fee1"
msgid "\"Really? And what do you know?\""
msgstr "\"정말입니까? 그러면 무엇을 알고 계시죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "cfa49d28-5114-486f-87af-d9de9abb3de5"
msgid ""
"\"So that's where all my best students are! This means he created the {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} not for the love of the arts, but to train "
"a new branch of the military? What an outrage!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 그곳이 내 최고의 학생들이 있는 곳이군요! {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}를 예술을 사랑해서가 "
"아니라, 새로운 병과를 훈련시키려 만들었다니? 어떻게 그럴 수가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "26c8c9df-394a-4f79-9f22-f3f526c6da3f"
msgid ""
"{n}Atalia shrugs.{/n} \"So? If Irovetti uses monsters instead of soldiers, "
"then fewer citizens will die in battle! I think it's a wonderful idea.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아탈리아는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n}그래서? 이로베티가 군인 대신에 괴물을 사용한다면, 더 적은 시민들이 전투에서 죽겠죠! 좋은 "
"생각 같은데요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "d3e190b9-4667-4f6e-ac72-57b2fab8c931"
msgid ""
"\"I suspected as much. But the war between Irovetti and the trade houses "
"doesn't concern me or my students. The {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} "
"wasn't founded by the old families. I'm not beholden to them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 많은 것을 의심했습니다. 하지만 이로베티와 무역 회사 사이의 전쟁은 저 또는 제 학생들 관련이 없죠. {g|Academy of "
"Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}는 오래된 가문이 설립하지 않았습니다. 저는 그들에게 빚진 게 없다는 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "943b24ad-ac85-4559-b010-ff1963d3fdbd"
msgid ""
"\"So what? This is {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. Every other person here is connected "
"to pirates in some way or another.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게 어때서요? 여기는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}입니다. 여기 있는 모든 사람은 어떤 방식으로든 해적과 연결되어 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "380ae35c-5e5d-4f46-9252-a2e9f7ca1647"
msgid ""
"\"I think you're wasting your time. Rather than stirring up rebellion, "
"surrender to His Highness Irovetti.\""
msgstr "\"당신이 시간을 낭비하고 있다고 생각합니다. 반란을 일으키기보다는, 이로베티 전하께 항복하세요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "4df4afec-9d94-4eb4-b8af-f521be42f681"
msgid ""
"{n}Atalia covers her face with her hands.{/n} \"You... You are right. No "
"matter how wonderful the art created at the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g} may be, all of it is tainted by Irovetti's crimes. Come "
"what may, if you stand against Irovetti, I shall bring the students to the "
"streets on your side. I only pray to {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} that you are more "
"merciful than he is.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아탈리아는 손으로 얼굴을 가립니다.{/n} \"너... 당신의 말이 맞습니다. {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}아카데미{/g}에서 만들어진 예술이 얼마나 훌륭한지 상관없이, 모든 것이 이로베티의 범죄에 의해 오염 되었을 겁니다. 무슨 일이 "
"있더라도 이로베티와 맞서시겠다면, 학생들을 당신 쪽 거리에 배치하겠습니다. 이로베티보다 당신이 더 자비롭길 {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}"
"께 바랄 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "d729ba2a-3df9-4f41-8799-ddbbacfaba7b"
msgid "\"Please leave. I have nothing to discuss with you.\""
msgstr "\"떠나세요. 더 이상 당신과 나눌 말이 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "b3a74850-7344-4e44-9962-4d88da0b828c"
msgid ""
"\"What you've told me is troubling. But... It's between me, His Highness and "
"my own conscience. You won't persuade me to betray my patron. This "
"conversation is over.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 말한 것은 문제가 있습니다. 하지만... 그건 전하와 제 양심의 문제입니다. 제 후원자를 배반하라고 설득하지 마세요. 이 "
"대화는 끝내죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "9a943116-07c3-492e-8d44-6154333cf4f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Atalia grabs the magical staff hanging from her belt. Before you manage "
"to attack, she becomes invisible.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아탈리아는 그녀의 허리띠에서 매달려있는 마법의 지팡이를 붙잡습니다. 당신이 공격하기도 전에 그녀는 투명해졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "1cb0474e-d3f0-44fb-a9a7-1284ef08e93c"
msgid "\"And now you must leave! We cannot be seen together!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 이제 떠나! 우린 함께 있는 걸 들키면 안 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "23e903b4-25bf-48fd-9688-7b0a6fec26ae"
msgid "\"Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "3a268a0b-aa00-4f68-9e7e-349489a4e1e0"
msgid ""
"{n}Atalia takes a low bow.{/n} \"Your Highness. Welcome to your {d|c51 "
"Atalia Rules}loyal{/d} {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아탈리아가 절합니다.{/n} \"전하. {d|c51 Atalia Rules}충성스러운{/d}{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 오신 "
"것을 환영합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "81a97e5a-f890-4d8a-aee9-85e3623344f7"
msgid "\"Hello, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까. 전하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "7840abbc-5476-4c76-98a9-2ef15cfad21f"
msgid ""
"\"We grieve for the students who died in the riot. Theirs is an irreparable "
"loss. But since you've become the ruler of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, we enjoy much "
"greater artistic freedom. The art at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}"
" flourishes more than it ever could have under Irovetti.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저희는 폭동으로 죽은 학생들에게 애도를 표합니다. 그 사람들은 돌이킬 수 없습니다. 그러나 당신이 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 "
"통치자가 된 이후로 우리는 훨씬 더 예술적 자유를 누립니다. {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}의 예술은 "
"이로베티 치하 때보다 훨씬 더 번성합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "ac782fc0-3871-4018-83a8-13a5a68ad428"
msgid "\"Goodbye, Your Highness. May {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g} keep you safe.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히 가세요. 전하. {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}께서 당신을 안전하게 지키시길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "42162791-f0e7-436c-8bfc-108f0b58f6c6"
msgid ""
"\"Not so bad, Your Highness. I lost my job when the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g} was closed. Praise {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, my grateful "
"students didn't let me starve to death... But I have had to forget about art."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 나쁘지 않습니다. 전하. {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}가 닫혔을 때 저는 직업을 잃었습니다. "
"{g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}이 축복하시어, 고마운 학생들은 저를 굶어 죽게 내버려 두지 않았습니다. 그러나 저는 예술에 대해 잊어야 "
"했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "843f7926-a1b1-42dc-989f-484eac326ceb"
msgid ""
"\"Probably even better than when I headed the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g}. Their new management... Whatever else I might think of "
"them, they do keep up with their responsibilities. And I... I have time for "
"my own art now. I earn a living by giving private lessons. It's enough to "
"get me by.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아마 제가 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}로 향할 때 보다 훨씬 좋을 것입니다. 새로운 경영진은... "
"내가 그들을 어떻게 생각하든 그들은 책임을 계속 수행하겠죠. 그리고 저는... 이제 제 자신의 예술을 위한 시간을 가집니다. 나는 개인 "
"교습으로 생계를 유지합니다. 그 수입으로 그럭저럭 살 수 있지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "14e4a0ca-a450-4fcc-aebf-be1bd7900360"
msgid ""
"\"I am a lawful subject of His Highness Irovetti. Do you think I would read "
"a book that was forbidden by his personal order?\""
msgstr "\"나는 이로베티 전하의 공식 신하야. 전하가 금한 책을 내가 읽을 것이라고 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "225448d4-31b6-4765-8151-092445deed51"
msgid ""
"\"As far as I know, this book consists of dirty slander against our King and "
"incitement to riot. However, I also heard the authors focused on the king "
"himself, and at least {d|Linzi Book Gloss}didn't{/d} repeat... popular "
"accusations against our other respected citizens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 아는 한 이 책은 우리 왕에 대한 더러운 중상 모략과 폭동에 대한 선동으로 구성되어있어. 그러나, 나는 또한 저자가 왕에게 "
"집중했으며, 최소한 우리의 존경받는 다른 시민들에 대한 공개적 비난을 반복하지는 {d|Linzi Book Gloss}않았다고{/d} "
"들었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "5f815e11-b190-4f42-8e9c-87ad560d8fe6"
msgid ""
"\"As far as I know, this book {d|Linzi Book True}consists{/d} of dirty "
"slander and groundless insults against our respected citizens — and direct "
"incitement to riot against our lawful King. I wouldn't touch it even if it "
"weren't forbidden!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 아는 한 이 책은 우리의 존경받는 시민에 대한 더러운 비방과 근거 없는 모욕 그리고 합법적인 왕에 대한 직접적인 선동으로 {d|"
"Linzi Book True}구성되어 있다고 들었어{/d}. 비록 금지되지 않았더라도 나는 만지지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "ba086ccf-39d9-4b4c-85c4-a9cc1998bfcb"
msgid ""
"\"But anyway, you've no time to discuss books, even such... popular ones. "
"You came to see His Highness, did you not? Well then, go and speak with him. "
"Perhaps you'll have time to discuss literature after you finish your "
"business with him.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 어쨌든, 너는 책에 대해 토론 할 시간도 없겠지. 심지어... 인기 있는 책이라도 말이야. 전하를 뵈러 왔지? 그럼 가서 그와 "
"이야기해. 아마도 그와 용무가 끝나고 나면 문학에 대해 토론 할 시간이 있을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "cf3bdf92-7686-412a-a508-72b0541c39e9"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi steps forward with a triumphant smile on her face.{/n} \"Headmaster "
"Gitaren, have you read the book? You know... THE book? About the {g|Academy "
"of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, Irovetti and so on? An "
"amusing little work, wouldn't you say?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 얼굴에 승리의 미소를 지으며 앞으로 나아 갑니다.{/n} \"지타렌 교장님, 책 읽어봤어? 있잖아... 그 책 말이야? {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}, {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}, 이로베티 등등이 쓰여 있는거? 읽어보면 소소한 "
"재미가 있다고 말할걸?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "fc04ad95-34e8-4644-9e87-2193c21808ba"
msgid "\"Ha! We'll talk! Don't you worry, we have something to say to him!\""
msgstr "\"하! 얘기 좀 할 거야! 걱정 마. 우리는 그에게 말할 게 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "4a9f5230-f856-4540-a551-77bb98c2e427"
msgid ""
"\"You got that right! I hate people like her so much! She talks a good game, "
"avoiding whatever conflicts come her way... which is why she also lets "
"scoundrels like Irovetti feast at their leisure! I'll take an obvious "
"villain over do-gooders like that any day!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 맞아! 그녀와 같은 사람들을 너무 싫어해. 그녀는 자기 길을 막는 모든 것을 피하면서, 명승부였다 말하지... 그래서 그녀가 "
"이로베티 같은 악당이 재미를 보게 내버려두는 거야! 나는 언제든지 그 악당이 심판 받게 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "8db19135-fc74-4ab7-984b-2a178d69413d"
msgid ""
"\"A noble hypocrite. What a familiar sight.\" {n}Kalikke turns away in "
"disgust.{/n}"
msgstr "\"위선자 같으니. 이젠 익숙할 줄이야.\" {n}칼리케는 혐오스러워 등을 돌립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Commoners_BeforeShowdown/Commoner_1_String
msgctxt "dadbd766-7d38-4829-ad73-113b08e5af7c"
msgid "\"Look, it's the {mf|King|Queen} of {kingdomname}!\""
msgstr "\"봐. {kingdomname}의 {mf|왕|여왕}이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Commoners_BeforeShowdown/Commoner_2_String
msgctxt "81f2f862-bece-45b2-a3e7-1cdc1f6ec854"
msgid "\"Today is a historic day!\""
msgstr "\"역사적인 날이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Commoners_BeforeShowdown/Commoner_3_String
msgctxt "fd9cd7ec-e7b1-44a8-876e-b163646ff5c5"
msgid ""
"\"Will {kingdomname} really become part of Pitax? Can you imagine what "
"possibilities that would open?\""
msgstr "\"{kingdomname}가 정말 피탁스의 일부가 되는 거야? 어떤 가능성이 열려 있는지 상상할 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Commoners_BeforeShowdown/Guard_1_String
msgctxt "9324c396-6a24-4bc8-a117-bc0fff17e0ab"
msgid "\"Don't even think about starting any riots.\""
msgstr "\"폭동을 일으킬 생각조차하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Commoners_BeforeShowdown/Guard_2_String
msgctxt "b64da617-2ace-409f-87ff-71f38e0c517b"
msgid "\"I hope you and Irovetti can settle your dispute without bloodshed?\""
msgstr "\"너와 이로베티가 유혈 사태 없이 분쟁을 해결할 수 있기를 바라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Commoners_BeforeShowdown/Guard_3_String
msgctxt "98aa06f1-9735-49ff-a99e-08c4c89b1776"
msgid "\"I get the feeling it's going to be a hard day today...\""
msgstr "\"오늘 힘든 하루가 될 것 같은 느낌이 들었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/AnnamedeBelavarah_Backstab-1_String
msgctxt "4f5285f7-db93-41b1-8ff2-aca22c5e098e"
msgid "\"I stab thee with mine own heart... Bitch!\""
msgstr "\"부끄러운 줄 알아라... 개자식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/AnnamedeBelavarah_Backstab-2_String
msgctxt "6eb46944-b3a5-4be6-bb13-3d276de655ce"
msgid ""
"\"Listen to me, students! Today we'll be rid of that old buzzard! For "
"{mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "\"내 말 좀 들어 봐! 오늘 우리는 오래된 얼룩을 없앨거야! {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/AtaliaGitaren_Friendly_String
msgctxt "754b057f-82a9-4554-8a6e-ebe2e9e09662"
msgid ""
"\"Students of the Academy! We've suffered enough under Irovetti's tyranny! "
"For {mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "\"아카데미 학생들아! 우리는 이로베티의 폭정으로 고통 받았다. {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/AtaliaGitaren_Hostile_String
msgctxt "1020f37a-68f1-41c6-9616-dfccc84963a6"
msgid ""
"\"Students of the Academy! It's time for us to protect our benefactor! For "
"King Irovetti!\""
msgstr "\"아카데미 학생들아! 이제는 우리의 은인을 보호해야 할 때이다! 이로베티를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/DreyYarnes_Friendly_String
msgctxt "a96cab97-a09f-4bc5-816e-58ba6754f101"
msgid ""
"\"May Calistria damn Irovetti, the blasphemous usurper! Temple guards, to "
"battle! For {mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "칼리스트리아께서 불경한 살인마 이로베티를 벌하길! 신전 경비대여! 싸워라! {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/DreyYarnes_Hostile_String
msgctxt "b0ce1a5e-7e50-4ea8-9270-bd34a63f70f2"
msgid ""
"\"May Calistria bless the King! Temple guard, to battle! For His Highness "
"Irovetti!\""
msgstr "\"칼리스트리아께서 왕을 축복하길! 신전 경비대여! 싸워라! 이로베티 전하를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/GasperreLiacenza_Bonus_String
msgctxt "9029efd8-59ed-4abe-8870-765a5b63eeee"
msgid ""
"\"Old families, founders of Pitax! Today is the day of our reckoning! "
"Destroy Irovetti! For {mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"피탁스의 설립자이자 유서깊은 가문이여! 오늘은 심판의 날이다! 이로베티를 파괴하라! {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/GasperreLiacenza_Normal_String
msgctxt "d431b6a9-9a60-472c-83ff-fa6ed1e16b2a"
msgid ""
"\"Liacenza family! Today is the day of our reckoning! Destroy Irovetti! For "
"{mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "\"리아첸자 가문이여! 오늘은 심판의 날이다! 이로베티를 파괴하라! {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/IloraNuski_String
msgctxt "82def2bf-81e5-49e1-834f-02faada26692"
msgid ""
"\"River Blades, there he is! Go — get Irovetti! For {mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "\"강의 칼날단, 저기 있다! 이로베티를 잡아라! {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/Irovetti_End_String
msgctxt "e97e37bf-1d1c-4abb-b5c1-a8223d30e9cb"
msgid ""
"\"Traitorous scum! After we snuff out this riot, I'll have every one of your "
"heads!\""
msgstr "\"배신자 쓰레기! 우리가 이 폭동을 진압한 후에 너희 머리를 모두 취하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/Irovetti_Mosconi-betrayer-answer_String
msgctxt "d63c919d-d31c-4c2f-b72c-bd7c5675780d"
msgid ""
"\"You too, Moskoni? You too have betrayed me? You won't get away with this!\""
msgstr "\"모스코니, 너마저? 너 또한 나를 배신했는가? 너는 이 혐의를 벗지 못할거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/Irovetti_Start_String
msgctxt "167c4b8e-2954-4a02-82bb-f9f31f4ac83f"
msgid "\"Everyone who remains loyal to your king! To battle! For Pitax!\""
msgstr "\"너의 왕에게 충성스러워하는 모든 자들이여! 싸워라! 피탁스를 위해서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/IrseiCaelysse_Friendly_String
msgctxt "ee4fc79d-c5f0-4608-aac7-242663a614db"
msgid ""
"\"City guard! Normally, politics is none of our business — unless the King "
"is destroying the city! Arrest Irovetti!\""
msgstr "\"도시 경비대! 일반적으로 정치는 우리가 관여할 일이 아니다. 하지만 왕이 도시를 파괴한다! 이로베티를 체포하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/IrseiCaelysse_Hostile_String
msgctxt "559b97ac-d951-4fa8-9ed1-1c03e8d4e516"
msgid "\"City guard! Suppress this riot! Protect King Irovetti!\""
msgstr "\"도시 경비대! 이 폭동을 진압하라! 이로베티 왕을 보호하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/KharneVereel_Friendly_String
msgctxt "6133fa64-80df-47c8-8cf4-018ded8002c9"
msgid "\"Thieves guild! Irovetti has betrayed us! Let's take his head!\""
msgstr "\"도둑 길드! 이로베티가 우릴 배신 했어! 그의 목을 베자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/KharneVereel_Hostile_String
msgctxt "ca5f4302-9c02-48f0-afee-2ccdca51c1f8"
msgid ""
"\"Thieves guild! If {mf|King|Queen} {Name} wins, we'll all be hanged! Bring "
"me {mf|his|her} head!\""
msgstr ""
"\"도둑 길드! {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}가 이기면 우리 모두 교수형에 처해질 거야! 나에게 {mf|그|그녀}의 머리를 가져와라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/StefanoMoskoni_Betrayer_1_String
msgctxt "5fdeee8f-952f-4e08-b9b1-e7e9a25b1618"
msgid ""
"\"What?! But... Your Highness, don't listen to {mf|him|her}! I'm still loyal "
"to you!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고요?! 하지만... 전하. {mf|그|그녀}의 말을 듣지 마소서! 나는 여전히 충실합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/StefanoMoskoni_Betrayer_2_String
msgctxt "86f024ce-3b2a-4117-a3fb-818046b5491c"
msgid "\"You know what? Screw it! For {mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "\"이봐? 집어치워! {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Barks/Showdown/StefanoMoskoni_Normal_String
msgctxt "8611c7e4-5de5-4190-9f87-8cad92c97347"
msgid "\"Your Highness! I won't let them near you!\""
msgstr "\"전하! 그들이 전하께 가까이 가게 두지 않을 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "6ff3f2b4-5409-4c83-869d-9b8e33843019"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "fad0d0b1-319e-426e-b625-99f7bbaecc89"
msgid "\"If I oppose Irovetti, will you support me?\""
msgstr "\"만약 내가 이로베티를 반대한다면 너는 나를 지지할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0012_Text_String
msgctxt "478bb4d6-5aa4-4fdf-9aaf-c672b87992c4"
msgid "\"To avenge all the lives he trampled!'"
msgstr "\"그가 짓밟은 모든 것들의 복수를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0013_Text_String
msgctxt "cbee8868-d604-412d-9989-ba2668b1c100"
msgid ""
"\"How can this man be a king if he can't even master his own darker impulses?"
"\""
msgstr "\"자신의 어두운 충동조차 억제할 수 없다면 이 사람은 어떻게 왕이 될 수 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0033_Text_String
msgctxt "a80c508a-db2f-4253-8155-202022d08b57"
msgid "\"To clear the city of drug dealers!\""
msgstr "\"마약상으로 넘치는 도시를 깨끗이 하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0037_Text_String
msgctxt "b9f6e31c-5d68-4afc-9c51-db2279793e29"
msgid "\"This man is a walking disgrace to our Goddess.\""
msgstr "\"이 사람은 우리 여신을 모욕하는 자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "1f5bb917-c4d5-40ef-a45c-8e33916b7b05"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "52eca8aa-23e1-4f36-a79e-03a958ab8e86"
msgid "[Attack] \"You are Irovetti's servant, and that makes you my enemy!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너는 이로베티의 종이니 나의 적이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "b997eda2-f0b3-4e73-b59b-f7210eedee0d"
msgid "\"How fares things in the city?\""
msgstr "\"도시에서 운임은 어떻게 되지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "ebfd32ee-ab0f-4116-94a8-92f8e7eb89a1"
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "56676d80-3c34-4c83-95a4-83b82e65e14d"
msgid "\"How is Baron Drelev feeling?\""
msgstr "\"드렐레프 남작은 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3d093d5b-a0bd-46e8-9612-42b68736dde9"
msgid ""
"\"There you are. Well, what kind of performance are we to expect today? The "
"capitulation of {mf|King|Queen} {Name} in face of the luminous Irovetti? "
"Or... Something else?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왔군. 오늘 우리가 기대하는 성과는 뭐지? 발광하는 이로베티의 얼굴에 {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}의 항복 문서를 던져주는 것? 또 "
"다른 것이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "f542eb6e-964d-4e1a-adde-bc62905cd13e"
msgid ""
"\"I am Drey Yarnes, High Priest of {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}, the patron of "
"this city. I also command the temple guard.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 드레이 얀스. {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}의 고위 사체이자 이 도시의 후원자이지. 나는 또한 신전 경비대를 "
"지휘한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "9aad19b5-f3ee-4e31-aeba-0cc778e6f072"
msgid ""
"\"Why? Irovetti prays to {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} himself, and donates "
"generously to the temple. With him in charge, the city has become much more "
"cheerful than it used to be. Why would I wish to see him deposed?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜? 이로베티는 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}께 기도하고, 관대하게 성전에 기부한다. 그가 도시를 책임진 뒤, 도시는 "
"예전보다 훨씬 더 번성했다. 내가 왜 그가 체포당하는 걸 보고 싶겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0014_Text_String
msgctxt "82d08693-4546-408d-9930-385bac4b736e"
msgid ""
"\"Ilora? So what? I've dealt with her from time to time myself. The girl is "
"very competent in her trade.\""
msgstr "\"일로라? 그래서? 나는 그녀와 때때로 거래했다. 그녀는 무역에서 유능했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0015_Text_String
msgctxt "62dc78c3-451e-4a79-99e5-8cbdcf94ecd1"
msgid ""
"\"So he did kill them? That does change things... But not for me. Irovetti "
"has been much more generous to our temple than any of the trade houses ever "
"were!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 그가 그들을 죽였다? 그것은 변화를 일으키겠지만 나는 아니다. 이로베티는 우리 성전에 무역 회사보다 훨씬 더 관대했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0017_Text_String
msgctxt "8823dbe5-571c-4ec9-aed2-bdd12c26fc51"
msgid "\"This is true.\""
msgstr "\"사실이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0019_Text_String
msgctxt "c6989808-909e-4a69-999e-a2702a1cbdc1"
msgid ""
"\"Revenge... Oh yes. The {g|Calistria}Goddess{/g} is patient, but sooner or "
"later the bill must come due.\""
msgstr "\"복수... 오. 그래. {g|Calistria}여신{/g}께서는 인내심이 있지만, 조만간 대가는 치루어져야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0020_Text_String
msgctxt "6a375d07-e422-49d7-9df0-011bc8914b0e"
msgid ""
"\"Those harmed by Irovetti can avenge themselves. Myself, I have seen "
"nothing but generosity from him.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티에 의해 해를 입은 사람들은 스스로 복수 할 수 있다. 나는 그에게서 관대함을 보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "3b657762-1fdd-4ffc-a404-df6135560b42"
msgid ""
"\"So he hasn't been nursing that gang of freeloaders for nothing! Good for "
"him!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그는 공짜로 그 거지들을 보살피지 않았군! 잘한 일이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0022_Text_String
msgctxt "099143ed-5b34-4b89-b86c-79d4ba4b2dae"
msgid ""
"\"Oh? That is quite like him! Yes, many in the city would be enraged if they "
"found out... Many — but not me!\""
msgstr "\"오? 정말 그 답군! 그래. 도시에서 많은 사람들이 분노 할 테지... 그러나 나는 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0034_Text_String
msgctxt "7d2781c8-1fcb-4f8f-8672-c3da34f734a0"
msgid ""
"\"And why should I concern myself with what the thieves' guild is doing? "
"Truth be told, I think the bloodbrush extract is no more harmful than well-"
"aged wine!\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 내가 도둑 길드가 하는 일을 염려해야 하지? 진실을 말하면, 나는 핏자루 추출물이 잘 숙성된 와인보다 해롭지 않다고 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0038_Text_String
msgctxt "9671ec84-9781-4cbd-8664-f679f82a66fa"
msgid "\"Yes, you are right, my {mf|brother|sister}.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞다. {mf|형제여|자매여}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "8b747bb1-3639-4433-9df8-f9e7391a2e73"
msgid ""
"\"No, that's no reason to rebel. Think about it — why should I incite a riot?"
"\""
msgstr "\"아니. 그건 반역할 이유가 아니야. 생각해 봐. 왜 난 폭동을 일으켜야만 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "d3d92963-2f7e-4f18-8d5b-fcbe4730cbf7"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Calistria}Savored Sting{/g} allows much, but what he's doing is "
"unacceptable. I'm ashamed of accepting money tainted by his dirty crimes. I "
"shall wash my hands in his blood!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Calistria}감미로운 독침{/g}께서는 많은 것을 허용하지만, 그가 하고 있는 일은 받아 들일 수 없다. 나는 그의 더러운 "
"범죄로 더럽혀진 돈을 받아들이는 것이 부끄러워졌다. 나는 그의 피로 손을 씻을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "c6091307-02e9-4b71-8071-aeafc50e1556"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid you have nothing to offer me, Your Highness. If you oppose "
"Irovetti, I will protect him. Now you'd better leave — there are spies "
"everywhere.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 제공할 것이 없을까 걱정되는군. 이로베티에 대항한다면, 나는 그를 보호하겠다. 이제 가라. 사방에 첩자가 깔렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "617e1411-95b6-4992-8586-2d0ca5b711cb"
msgid ""
"\"Go now, and carry out your plan. We shouldn't be seen together — there are "
"spies everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"어서 가서 계획을 실행해라. 우리는 눈에 띄면 안 돼. 이제 가. 사방에 첩자가 깔렸으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "5361cca1-e5db-46f9-bacf-e931b78fff6c"
msgid "\"Go, Your Highness. Today, the fates of many hang in the balance.\""
msgstr "\"어서 가. 오늘 많은 사람들의 운명이 바뀔 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "58b29d96-7534-4309-bd14-da7dfd339862"
msgid ""
"\"Don't say another word. There are spies everywhere. Your fate awaits you "
"on the palace steps. — Go now and face it!\""
msgstr "\"다른 말은 하지 마. 모든 곳에 스파이가 있어. 너의 운명은 궁전 계단에 있어. 어서 운명을 마주해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0054_Text_String
msgctxt "2059f443-70c8-462a-86e6-3d1c4511d29e"
msgid "\"An extremely short-sighted decision, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"매우 근시안적인 결정이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "08ce71df-9a6b-459b-a4ba-ecf1e6b8380d"
msgid "\"Hello, Your Highness. May the goddess smile upon you.\""
msgstr "\"안녕. 너에게 여신님이 미소 지어주시길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "8c43a2e1-f56b-40f8-bf62-c566fd907ea2"
msgid ""
"\"Not much has changed for the temple. Whoever may rule {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, "
"the city has but one divine patron — and everyone seeks her grace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"성전은 별로 변하지 않았다. 누구든지 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 지배할 수 있지만, 도시에는 신적 후원자가 한 명뿐이고 모든 "
"사람들이 그녀의 은혜를 구하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "fcad7588-f022-45ab-99eb-3bbf0702b64d"
msgid "\"May your journey be safe!\""
msgstr "\"안전한 여행 되길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/DreyYarnes/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "6676f906-4316-49c7-82a5-b19b1d2404df"
msgid ""
"\"Who? Oh, that {d|Drelev}poor fellow{/d} who thought he was dead? Luckily, "
"his insanity was easily cured. The baron quickly recovered, and his strength "
"was so well restored that he even charmed one of the temple priests. They "
"got married and left together — for Daggermark, I believe.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구? 오, 자기가 죽은 줄 아는 그 {d|drelev}불쌍한 녀석{/d}? 다행히 그의 정신 이상은 쉽게 치료되었다. 남작은 빨리 "
"회복되었고 그의 힘이 너무 잘 회복되어 심지어 성전 사제 중 한 명을 매료시키더군. 그들은 결혼해서 대거마크로 떠났을 거야\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f43e2019-48fe-48b0-8c2a-ba4bc5357eb1"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "cb73e90b-62e2-48e6-b21e-5aaea97bb954"
msgid "\"Assuming I oppose Irovetti, will the old families support me?\""
msgstr "\"만약 내가 이로베티를 반대한다면 오래된 가문들이 나를 지지할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "aed8a155-fef2-4571-9290-7bd4c2d8af1b"
msgid "\"I have proof that Irovetti intentionally bred monsters.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티가 의도적으로 괴물을 키웠다는 증거가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "bf9daae5-fdc4-46d3-b693-318cfbca7ff6"
msgid ""
"\"What I'm going to tell you will persuade the other trade houses to join "
"the rebellion.\""
msgstr "\"나는 다른 무역 회사를 반란에 가담하도록 설득 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0016_Text_String
msgctxt "40f6337f-c6c7-4e11-b028-0af9ede7927d"
msgid "\"A pirate gang led by Ilora Nuski worked for Irovetti.\""
msgstr "\"일로라 누스키가 이끄는 해적 갱단은 이로베티을 위해 일했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "8fb1a6a3-134b-44ed-b2bb-77dc82c47b16"
msgid "\"I need to find out something else.\""
msgstr "\"나는 찾을 것이 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0020_Text_String
msgctxt "c8998c98-ecd9-4b54-9ae2-bd5df0999a82"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti brought a whole army of bards to Littletown, and used them to "
"crush his enemies.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티는 리틀타운에 모든 음유시인 부대를 몰고 와서, 적들을 부수는데 썼어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "97e5aefa-129d-4ac4-b700-adaefa222de7"
msgid ""
"\"All the members of old families kidnapped by Irovetti are dead. Their "
"bones lie at the bottom of the underground pond at Whiterose Abbey.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티에 의해 납치된 모든 오래된 가문의 구성원들은 죽었어. 그들의 뼈는 백장미 수도원의 지하 연못 바닥에 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "f0d5ca20-5036-41fa-86d4-58c7395e3b21"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Pitax will be mine. I will cut down all of its elite... Starting "
"with you!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"피탁스는 내 것이 될 거야. 나는 엘리트들은 모두 죽일 거야. 너부터 시작하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "53e945ce-a645-42e0-9255-2decd8480362"
msgid "\"I have to go. Keep your eyes open.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 한눈 팔지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "8fb97676-1b59-4d34-9043-bc4fa915d396"
msgid "\"How are things in Pitax?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스는 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "eca61457-1ceb-485b-a351-5fbedafc0c44"
msgid "Murdered Gasperre Liacenza."
msgstr "가스페레 리아첸자을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "981e3007-4cff-42e6-8748-e1b6d8d51f79"
msgid "\"So long.\""
msgstr "\"안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "c43fb781-588f-45fa-a589-b3fbd2d5260b"
msgid ""
"\"And I suppose CASTRUCCIO Irovetti's least favorite joke is the one about "
"his name?\""
msgstr "\"카스트루치오 이로베티가 가장 싫어하는 농담은 그의 이름에 관한 것이 아닐까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "2bb58bae-44e9-40e7-b1cb-a505ab6a3ee2"
msgid ""
"\"If that's the kind of comedy they teach at the Academy of Grand Arts, then "
"I'm not surprised Linzi has no desire to return there...\""
msgstr "\"이것이 바로 그들이 예술 학원에서 가르치는 희극의 종류라면 린지는 그곳으로 돌아갈 의사가 없다는 사실이 놀랍지 않군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "2b4a00a1-7391-4bd8-87ef-c1de44c75793"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "e2ac052b-e56e-466a-acf8-5fb2fb6649a4"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar, we're having a serious discussion. Can you tone down the "
"buffoonery?\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르. 우리는 진지한 토론을 하고 있어. 농담 좀 하지마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d825986b-661b-492a-b484-5b687f3fc2a7"
msgid ""
"\"There you are, Your Highness. Irovetti is expecting you to bend the knee. "
"But I suspect you have other plans...\""
msgstr "\"여기 오셨군요, 전하. 이로베티는 당신이 무릎을 꿇을 것을 기대하고 있습니다. 하지만 당신께는 다른 계획이 있겠죠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "13cc3474-c9ed-4f68-8f1a-d78cc61752b5"
msgid ""
"\"I am the head of the Liacenza family and the Iron Fox Trade House. We "
"ruled {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} not long ago, before that scoundrel Irovetti seized "
"the crown — and most of our property. Now the old families hold but a sliver "
"of their former influence. But we still live on... Quietly hoping for "
"revenge...\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 리아첸자 가문과 강철 여우 무역 회사의 대표입니다. 저희는 얼마 전까지 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 지배했었죠, 악당 "
"이로베티가 왕관과 대부분의 재산을 취하기 전까지는요. 여전히 오래된 가문들은 남아있지만 이전의 영향력은 희박합니다. 하지만 저희는 여전히 "
"살아있습니다... 조용하게 복수를 바라면서...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "0bcf7911-4512-4f94-8ca3-9d845dfb1646"
msgid ""
"\"You can count on help from the Liacenza family. But regarding the other "
"trade houses... I've tried to unite them many times, but the stubborn fools "
"would sooner die alone than triumph united. I have no idea what might bring "
"them into line.\""
msgstr ""
"\"리아첸자 가문의 도움은 기대하실 수 있습니다. 그러나 다른 무역 회사는... 여러 번 그들을 단결시키려 노력했지만, 그 완고한 "
"바보들은 힘을 합쳐 승리하기보다 혼자서 죽는게 훨씬 빠를겁니다. 그들을 어떻게 끌어들어야 할 지 모르겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "61f5a21f-3ecb-44de-a6a0-e7cd3920b3fb"
msgid ""
"\"Of course this is sickening, but I don't think any of the old families "
"would be sufficiently outraged by this to oppose Irovetti openly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당연히 역겨운 일입니다, 그러나 저는 오래된 가문 어디도 이로베티에게 공개적으로 맞설 정도로 분노할거라는 생각이 들지 않는군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e0f57557-e806-4da3-8e01-1669e3c3e7e0"
msgid "\"I am all ears.\""
msgstr "\"듣고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "6315cc5b-2416-4940-a702-cc26a8430576"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid this is nothing shocking. Every family has had business "
"partners of that sort.\""
msgstr "\"별로 놀랍지도 않군요. 모든 가문이 그런 사업 관계를 갖고 있으니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "27c653a6-835a-4374-93c0-bb48f3cf0c28"
msgid ""
"\"If you can find some dirt that will convince the other families to unite, "
"then victory is in our pocket!\""
msgstr "\"다른 가문들을 하나로 뭉칠 수 있을만한 더러운 진상을 발견하신다면, 승리는 따 놓은 당상입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "e8697eda-76d5-4342-b7fa-7e32ae60b866"
msgid ""
"\"By the gods... This is unheard of! I will immediately dispatch my people "
"to the Abbey and the other families. If this is true... then Irovetti will "
"face blood vengeance from all the families!\""
msgstr ""
"\"신이시여... 이건 전례가 없는 일입니다! 즉시 사람을 수도원과 다른 가문에게 파견하겠습니다. 사실이라면... 이로베티는 모든 "
"가문들에게 피의 복수를 당할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "575c818e-c9b3-46c4-89ae-84fcfeefb2ab"
msgid ""
"\"Interesting! So he didn't create the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} "
"for his love of the arts, ha ha... But what does this have to do with the "
"trade houses?\""
msgstr ""
"\"흥미롭군요! 그래서 그는 예술에 대한 사랑 때문에 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}를 만든 것이 "
"아니었다니, 하하... 하지만 이것이 무역 회사와 어떤 관련이 있죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "6efab205-df02-46f4-bd0f-ed9efd15a2d2"
msgid ""
"\"The forces of all the old families are at your side. We are ready to march "
"on your command!\""
msgstr "\"오래된 가문 전부가 당신의 편입니다. 저희는 명령대로 행진할 준비를 끝냈습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "f2b3d11f-42d4-442b-86a0-21db7b0fa6f8"
msgid ""
"{n}Gasperre greets you with a polite bow.{/n} \"Your Highness. My family is "
"deeply in your debt, as is all of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}가스페레는 당신을 예의 바르게 맞이합니다.{/n} \"전하, 저희 가문이 당신께 큰 빚을 졌습니다. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}도 "
"마찬가지고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "7e53c225-7427-42fe-8a10-6004566d56a5"
msgid ""
"\"Hello, Your Highness.\" {n}Gasperre's voice is polite, but a little "
"cold.{/n}"
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까.\" {n}가스페레의 목소리는 공손하지만 약간 차가웠습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "b19775ca-c51d-49cd-bc9d-b009f410712e"
msgid ""
"\"It's quiet in the city — if such a word could ever be used to describe "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. The old families have retrieved their property – with "
"little trouble. The guild is quiet, and there are fewer drugs on the "
"streets. It's almost like the good old times, before Irovetti!\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약 그런 말이 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 퍼졌다면 도시가 시끄러웠을 겁니다. 오래된 가문들은 거의 문제없이 재산을 "
"회수했습니다. 도둑 길드는 조용하고, 거리에는 마약 유통이 적어졌죠. 이로베티 이전의 좋았던 시절과 거의 같습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "08f48be1-a406-4f8b-a475-a762494b6b21"
msgid "\"So long, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "b32c9463-431d-49d5-95dc-a0031dd89cd5"
msgid "\"Long live Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"전하 만세!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "fbd3f09e-9f71-4ee4-b5cc-79ebabf47b5c"
msgid ""
"\"Well... things are worse than they were under Irovetti... The thieves' "
"guild is running wild – with your permission, no doubt. They take what they "
"want and murder any who object, or oust them from the city. The streets are "
"drowning in bloodbrush extract, which is now sold on every corner. It wasn't "
"like this under the old families — we knew where to draw the line!\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄요... 이로베티 때보다 상황이 더 나빠졌습니다. 도둑 길드는 활개를 치고 있죠 – 의심 할 여지없이, 당신이 허락하셨을 테지만. "
"그들은 원하는 것을 취하고 반대자를 살해하거나, 도시에서 내쫓고 있습니다. 이제는 도시 구석구석 핏자루 추출물이 팔리지 않는 곳이 "
"없고요. 오래된 가문의 지배 하에선 이런 일이 없었습니다. 저희는 최소한 선은 넘지 않았었다고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "4ad50fef-b238-40b3-8ad9-e12eef375438"
msgid ""
"\"Not so well. There's fighting in the back streets, docks, and alleys – "
"quiet, but ferocious. Assets change hands every day. The old families, the "
"thieves' guild, new adventurers — everyone wants a piece.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리 좋지 않습니다. 뒷골목, 부두, 골목길에서 싸움이 일어납니다 – 적막하지만 살벌하죠. 지배자는 매일 바뀝니다. 오래된 가문, "
"도둑 길드, 새로운 모험가들. 그들 모두가 자기 몫을 챙기길 원합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "50a85b11-0257-4dee-b4bb-a81261e4a798"
msgid ""
"\"Horrible. I'll be honest with you, Your Highness. The first kings were no "
"fools. — They created the city guard for a reason. Today, all that they "
"tried to avoid is now happening in the city: everyone is fighting everyone "
"else. The old families, the thieves' guild, and a whole crowd of new "
"adventurers — all killing each other in the middle of the street. Not a "
"night passes without a fire. You've made a tremendous mistake, Your "
"Highness, and I'm not sure it can ever be fixed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"끔찍합니다. 솔직하게 말해야겠네요. 첫 번째 왕은 바보가 아니었습니다. 어떤 이유 때문에 도시 경비대를 만들었죠. 오늘날, 그들이 "
"피하고자 시도했던 모든 일들이 도시에서 일어나고 있습니다: 모든 사람이 다른 모든 사람과 싸우고 있죠. 오래된 가문, 도둑 길드, 새로운 "
"모험가 무리까지, 이들 모두가 거리 한가운데서 서로 죽고 죽입니다. 밤에 불이 없는 곳은 지나다니지도 못합니다. 당신은 엄청난 실수를 "
"했습니다, 전하. 저는 이를 고칠 수 있을지도 확신하지 못하겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ceb173f6-073b-4875-acbc-92070160af69"
msgid "\"Must be hard doing business in a place called 'Pay-Tax,' ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"'세금 지불'이라는 곳에서 열심히 일해야 겠군. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "2133672a-097e-4ea8-86a2-dd2e6b34c984"
msgid ""
"{n}Gasperre chuckles.{/n} \"Don't think you're the first to come up with "
"that pun! I've even heard it's one of Irovetti's favorites!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}가스페레가 킬킬 웃습니다.{/n} \"그 말장난을 처음으로 생각한 것이 너라고 생각하지 마! 심지어 이로베티도 그 농담을 좋아했다지!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "fa8a2b74-aa52-4f73-b8d2-650822520f52"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! It's a gold mine of jokes!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 농담의 금광이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "08ffdd13-0088-4562-a666-148547b733d4"
msgid "\"Exactly!\""
msgstr "\"그러게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "f83aebb5-96cc-492f-baef-8cf3694f83c5"
msgid ""
"\"Heh heh! Once we've taken care of Irovetti, maybe I'll go there to give "
"lectures. With a special course on gallows humor!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 일단 우리가 이로베티를 돌봐 주면 강의를 해야겠어. 교수형 유머를 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c5661d87-6235-4171-80ae-9c55d8323adf"
msgid ""
"{n}Realizing you're not paying attention to his joke, Regongar starts to "
"examine the street around him with a long face.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}자신의 농담에 신경 쓰지 않는다는 것을 깨달은 레곤가르는 시무룩한 얼굴로 주위의 거리를 탐색하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "efa23ed6-3dda-4a3f-af8f-64b621e66f55"
msgid "\"Fine, fine... I'll be quiet. It was just a joke...\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 좋아... 조용히 할게. 농담 이었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "1461749d-aa85-435c-acf9-22d3372fcd07"
msgid "\"How are things in the city?\""
msgstr "\"도시는 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "22e46424-64c8-4761-ac17-be9066254ecb"
msgid "\"I was just passing by. Good work!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 지나가던 길이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "d4f9152b-ad22-408c-80f0-70f1e47e77d0"
msgid "\"I demand to be allowed in!\""
msgstr "\"나는 들어갈 것을 요구한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "c7c7adbd-5bfd-4db4-9a73-ac2c5e0dfa6d"
msgid "\"I will be back!\""
msgstr "\"곧 돌아올 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "978431cb-34b1-43b0-988f-d6a2886732ea"
msgid "\"Let me into the city immediately!\""
msgstr "\"날 즉시 도시로 들여 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "241bf952-7308-4a84-84f6-2f1b13df03f6"
msgid "\"I changed my mind. I'll come back later.\""
msgstr "\"나는 마음이 바뀌었어. 나중에 다시 올 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "feca326c-cfdb-4b28-aea1-6e258fe15cb4"
msgid ""
"\"Look, it's {mf|King|Queen} {Name}! Forgive me, Your Highness, but you "
"can't go in there! Irovetti's orders!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}{Name}이군! 용서해. 하지만 당신은 거기에 갈 수 없어! 이로베티의 명령이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "75f03d4e-eeab-4395-ad71-e57b1f7d423c"
msgid ""
"\"Look who's here! {mf|King|Queen} {Name}! Is {mf|he|she} really going to "
"give up the crown just like that?\""
msgstr "\"이게 누구야! {mf|왕|여왕}{Name}이군! {mf|그|그녀}는 정말 그렇게 왕관을 포기할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "bb62b2d7-c76a-4e5e-95ae-8bf86d14187b"
msgid "\"Good day, Your Highness! Welcome to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"안녕! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 온 걸 환영해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "4a587db6-dfd6-47c7-b5d6-fb9944084847"
msgid "\"All is quiet, Your Highness! Couldn't be better!\""
msgstr "\"아주 조용해. 이보다 더 나아질 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "b7407ae9-afbb-43fc-83fa-3b0224d86e05"
msgid "\"At your service!\""
msgstr "\"당신을 위해서라면!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "ca15cde8-ce61-4698-9969-c8408655cdbf"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive us, but we can't! His Highness Irovetti gave strict instructions!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 용서해. 그러나 우리는 할 수 없다! 전하 이로베티는 엄격한 지시를 했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "5a66ac68-bd23-4211-814d-c8ce51c04544"
msgid ""
"\"What's keeping you? The gate is open! Come in, Your Highness — His "
"Highness has been expecting you, Your, um... Highness!\" {n}The guard "
"scratches his head, confused with the 'highnesses'.{/n}"
msgstr "\"왜 그러고 있는 거야? 문이 열려있어! 들어와. 전하께서 너를 기다리고 있어.\" {n}가드는 머리를 긁적입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "575ce735-f313-4cb4-984f-1cd91b23964b"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! Of course! The moment our King invites you — please return "
"right away!\""
msgstr "\"알겠어! 우리 왕이 당신을 초대하는 순간이니 돌아와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Guards/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "32cdfd1e-7058-4aff-8f64-573d25ef5f45"
msgid "\"As you wish. But King Irovetti is expecting you!\""
msgstr "\"바라는 대로 해. 하지만 이로베티 왕이 너를 기다리고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c9154a00-3656-4cab-867e-187e46d80edd"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, Ilora. I will need every sword. In this battle everything is at "
"stake.\""
msgstr "\"고맙다. 일로라. 나는 모두의 도움이 필요할 것이다. 이 전투에 모든 것이 걸려있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "9032d547-3cef-4dff-919a-36f996e26e18"
msgid "\"I have no need of you. Take your people and leave.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 필요 없어. 너의 부하를 데리고 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "fc436567-9756-4234-ba76-1d3e3845c590"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't trust you, pirate. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"나는 너를 믿지 않는다. 이 해적아. 죽어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "0164726f-e880-4697-a84c-db49b9370fbc"
msgid "\"None of your business. Get out while you still can!\""
msgstr "\"네가 할 일이 아니다. 어서 나가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "3e5ef204-e06f-4858-9f42-01b29390380c"
msgid ""
"\"I changed my mind. We'll keep to our arrangement. Prepare for battle.\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 마음을 바꿨다. 우리는 자리를 지킨다. 전투를 준비하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "a528d941-732e-4a49-a6c2-847203ed4a44"
msgid "\"I'm leaving. Keep your eyes open.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가겠다. 한눈 팔지 말라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b447e804-27ba-4db8-91ec-c9883c1b4581"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, here you are. Came to do away with the scoundrel, right? I gathered "
"what's left of {d|c51 Ilora Lives}the River Razors{/d}. We are few, but "
"every one of us dreams of gutting Irovetti! We will commence on your signal!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 여기 있군. 그 악당은 버리고 왔겠지? {d|c51 Ilora Lives}강의 칼날단{/d} 잔당을 모았다. 수는 거의 없지만, "
"우리 모두는 이로베티의 통통한 배를 가르길 꿈꾸고 있다! 우리는 너의 지휘를 기다릴 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "19f03704-6af8-4e0e-8b74-8f8ff2be9ea2"
msgid "\"Huh? What? Why?\""
msgstr "\"흠? 왜지? 왜?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "8b05b03e-4e41-497f-a728-06d07d469446"
msgid "\"Pff. Crazy, are you? Well, whatever you say!\""
msgstr "\"쳇. 미쳤어? 너니? 뭐라 하던 간에 신경 안 쓴다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "9112637a-37ca-4b35-8991-b741d9debeeb"
msgid "\"You're a strange one.\""
msgstr "\"너는 이상한 사람이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "9691bd96-6425-40a8-a112-0afc515deb5b"
msgid ""
"\"I know, I know. Heads will roll today, and with Hanspur's blessing, they "
"won't be ours!\""
msgstr "\"알아, 알아. 오늘은 머리통이 굴러다닐 날이지. 한스퍼의 축복이 있으니 우리 머리가 떨어지진 않을거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "ce8a7776-8227-4cfd-829f-118fa7975c6d"
msgid "\"You skunk!\""
msgstr "\"이 나쁜 자식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "73360083-ce31-4edc-be4b-c5a1b4892830"
msgid "\"So long!\""
msgstr "\"안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IloraNuski/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "caf800a7-0e7e-4905-acf2-7ee13ac63e7c"
msgid "\"Well, are you ready? My fellows are gathering near the palace.\""
msgstr "\"준비 됐어? 내 동료들이 궁전 근처에 모여있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f791dbdd-5b69-4a53-a6d8-520619f9de00"
msgid ""
"[Give Irovetti the crown] \"I surrender at the discretion of the wiser ruler."
"\""
msgstr "[이로베티에게 왕관을 넘깁니다] \"나는 현명한 통치자의 재량에 항복한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "9bbad24e-71a5-4f93-8253-945939408cb9"
msgid ""
"\"No, Irovetti, I didn't come to give you my crown. I came to take yours!\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 너에게 내 왕관을 주러 온 것이 아니다. 너의 것을 가지러 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d2ceadfb-c660-4a9e-b239-25a8a5166229"
msgid "Turned Stefano Moskoni against King Irovetti."
msgstr "스테파노 모스코니가 이로베티에게 맞서도록 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0975ff66-8d01-4cb8-bcd8-7bbc8aab7cd7"
msgid ""
"\"Moskoni! Attack him as we planned! Bring me Irovetti's head, and I'll make "
"you governor!\""
msgstr "\"모스코니! 우리가 계획한 대로 그를 공격하라! 이로베티의 머리를 가져와라. 너를 총독으로 만들어 주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b350b002-644e-4d8c-9655-4189f7504951"
msgid ""
"{n}Irovetti towers over you, standing proudly on the steps of his palace. He "
"greets you with a condescending smile.{/n} \"Well, hello, {mf|King|Queen}! "
"I'm glad to see that despite your utter failure as a ruler, you did listen "
"to the voice of reason and made the only right decision. Give me your crown "
"and swear allegiance to me. I promise, I shall rule your lands wisely and "
"mercifully!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이로베티는 궁전 계단에 자랑스럽게 서서 당신보다 커 보입니다. 그는 거들먹거리는 미소로 인사합니다.{/n} \"안녕한가. "
"{mf|왕|여왕}! 통치자로서의 네 완전한 실패에도 불구하고 이성의 목소리에 귀를 기울여 옳은 결정을 했더군. 네 왕관을 주고 나에게 "
"충성을 맹세해라. 너의 땅을 현명하고 자비롭게 지배해 주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "995543fd-0004-4ccc-93be-0600f642767a"
msgid ""
"\"So, henceforth I shall be the King of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} as well as the "
"{g|Shrike}Shrike Hills{/g}, {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, and the adjacent "
"territories. Here is my first order... For {mf|his|her} multiple crimes, the "
"deposed {mf|King|Queen} {Name} is sentenced to death. The sentence will be "
"carried out immediately! Guards, take {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼 이제부터 나는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}뿐만 아니라, {g|Shrike}슈라이크 구릉지{/g}, "
"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}, 그리고 그 인접 지역의 왕이 될 것이다. 여기 내 첫 명령이다. {mf|그의|그녀의}의 여러 범죄를 "
"이유로 폐위된 {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}의 사형을 선고한다. 선고는 즉시 시행 될 것이다! 경비원. {mf|그|그녀}를 체포해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "5ba7f9ee-ad37-49ce-a95c-af27a8ecccb8"
msgid ""
"\"Citizens of free {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! Our city is in danger! The enemy is "
"at the gate! To arms! For our freedom! For your King!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 자유 시민들이여! 우리 도시가 위험하다! 적들이 문 앞에 있다! 무기를 들어라! 우리의 자유를 위해 "
"싸우자! 너의 왕을 위해 싸워라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxTownNoDialogue_Stefano
msgctxt "88b80f77-b651-4083-aaa5-c78952973cd8"
msgid "\"Um... What?!\""
msgstr "\"음... 뭐야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "0b7c0cdd-1593-4301-a1b8-479db5da5a79"
msgid "\"What?!\""
msgstr "\"뭐?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "74f4903f-6808-42a1-9c3b-d583f232a43e"
msgid ""
"{n}Irovetti stands proudly on the steps of his palace, looking down on you "
"with noble indignation.{/n} \"This is how you {d|c51 Attack "
"Pitaxians}repay{/d} me for my kindness!? After you've proven your utter "
"ineptitude as a ruler, I generously offer to free you of the unbearable "
"burden of the crown. I open the gates of my capital to you — and you bring "
"carnage to my streets!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이로베티는 귀족의 분노로 당신을 내려다 보며 그의 궁전 계단에 자랑스럽게 서있습니다.{/n} \"이것이 내 친절에 대한 {d|c51 "
"Attack Pitaxians}보답{/d}인가!? 통치자로서 너의 기량부족을 입증한 후에 나는 너에게 왕관의 견딜 수 없는 짐을 자유롭게 "
"해줄 것을 제안하노라. 나는 너에게 수도의 문을 열었는데 너는 내 도시에 대학살을 가져다 주다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Irovetti_Showdown/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ff3574e7-2db6-4c31-8ce3-70c0447512b4"
msgid ""
"\"That's a lesson to all those you've tricked into betraying me... Yes, I "
"know all about it! Now everyone can see that this so-called {mf|king|queen} "
"can't be trusted? But I am kind. I forgive everyone who gave in to "
"{mf|his|her} lies and false promises. There's no time for faction! — We must "
"protect our city from this treacherous usurper! To arms, my loyal subjects! "
"For {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 배반하도록 속임수를 쓴 모든 사람들에 대한 교훈이다... 나는 모두 알고 있었다! 이제는 모두가 소위 {mf|왕|여왕}말하는 "
"것을 신뢰할 수 없겠지? 그러나 나는 친절하다. {mf|그의|그녀의}의 거짓말과 거짓 약속에 속은 모든 이를 용서하노라. 파벌 싸움할 "
"시간은 없어! 우리는 이 위험한 살인마로부터 우리 도시를 보호해야 한다! 내 충실한 신하들이여 무기를 들라! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}"
"를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0c32a624-997c-4cb1-a775-595344642283"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "962abc4b-a1ae-462a-8b54-ef532bbb004c"
msgid "\"What advice do you want to give me?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 충고를 해주고 싶니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4abd753e-238c-4fb7-baa9-05e8b013fe47"
msgid "\"Perhaps what I have to say will make you change your mind.\""
msgstr "\"아마 내가 해야 할 일은 너의 마음을 바꾸는 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e657349b-9715-4d7c-b600-4c1eb122b3e3"
msgid ""
"\"I know it's the city you're loyal to, not the king or his cronies. Well, I "
"am your only chance of saving Pitax from the thieves' guild and the drug "
"trade.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 왕이나 그의 왕관이 아니라 이 도시에 충성하는 건 알아. 내가 도둑 길드와 마약 거래에서 이 도시를 구할 유일한 기회를 줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "760eefcc-1277-496a-8f3f-68addcc1ad4f"
msgid "[Attack] \"Irovetti's henchman! You will die first!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"이로베티의 첩자! 네가 먼저 죽을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "3c740f96-3638-4946-ae1a-bd0d4a3f8171"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "c66a3f60-8afc-4e53-90c5-aecc60edf056"
msgid "\"How are things in Pitax?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스는 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "5ec98c8e-0a8f-4273-8158-6dd9a25fd427"
msgid "\"Goodbye.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "64148c86-c1bc-41fc-9cc2-f5645b9b10a2"
msgid "\"Good day, Your Highness — for the moment at least.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 날입니다, 전하. 최소한 지금은 말입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "459bab04-921c-4b2b-a2d2-143474c4f7f8"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't expect you to show your face here. Will you allow me to give you "
"a piece of advice?\""
msgstr "\"이곳에서 당신을 볼 줄은 몰랐습니다. 조언 하나만 올려도 될까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "a16ed49e-aa74-4187-95a8-b44a61aea4fc"
msgid ""
"\"There are two possibilities. Either you've come to surrender to Irovetti, "
"hoping for his mercy, or you're here to start a bloodbath in the streets, "
"thinking that my guard won't stop you. My advice is the same in either case."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"두 가지 가능성이 있겠군요. 당신이 자비를 바라고 이로베티에게 항복하기 위해 왔거나, 아니면 경비대가 당신을 막지 않을거라 생각하고 "
"거리를 피로 물들이러 왔거나. 어떤 경우라도 제 조언은 다르지 않습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "dc67464c-d509-46df-9b63-ac20b45d906b"
msgid "\"Run.\""
msgstr "\"도망가십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "e4277560-db8f-4fb9-adf8-6e8d928fa28d"
msgid ""
"\"Irsei Caelysse, captain of {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} guard. I'm the one "
"responsible for keeping trouble off the streets — including struggles for "
"power.\""
msgstr ""
"\"얼세이 케일리시, {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 경비대장입니다. 저는 거리의 문제를 해결할 책임이 있는 사람입니다 — 거기엔 권력 "
"투쟁도 포함되죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "39a82eda-3703-477b-b700-4bafbb4bd646"
msgid "\"Perhaps. But I wouldn't count on that.\""
msgstr "\"아마도요. 하지만 별로 기대하진 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "301e6e5c-bd7e-4c20-b322-9f2460c217ce"
msgid ""
"\"Hmm... For some reason I believe you. Fine! I only pray this won't be the "
"biggest mistake of my life.\""
msgstr "\"흠... 이유는 몰라도 믿음이 가는군요. 좋습니다! 이 일이 제 인생의 가장 큰 실수가 아니길 기도해야겠군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "037a7f6f-6827-49ae-98ed-0b931279442f"
msgid ""
"\"Promises, promises. Where's the guarantee that after you gain the crown "
"you won't get in bed with the thieves' guild? No, Your Highness, I'm not "
"playing these games.\""
msgstr ""
"\"약속, 약속. 왕관을 얻은 후에도 도둑 길드와 협력하지 않을 것이라는 보장은 어디 있죠? 아뇨, 전하. 저는 이 장난을 받아들이지 "
"않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ab9bad7e-0eb8-4eee-96c0-15dc264421c9"
msgid ""
"\"Monsters. Bred them. So this is how far it's gone. His Highness breeds men-"
"eating monsters in his own kingdom. I suppose he expects that this time it "
"won't end as it usually does, and they won't devour the entire city — and "
"him with it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"괴물들이라. 그들을 키우다니. 그래서 이렇게 된거군요. 전하께서 자기 왕국에서 인간을 먹는 괴물을 길렀다니. 그가 평소처럼 되지 "
"않을거라, 또한 도시 전체를 — 그리고 자기 자신을 먹어 치우지 않을거라 생각했나 보군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "53e13fd3-c0b6-4cc2-ba86-2e38a1a88f40"
msgid ""
"\"Show me a single person in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} who has no connection with a "
"gang!\""
msgstr "\"갱단과 관련 없는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}인 한 명이라도 데려와보시죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "247fb09e-e01c-4d96-aed8-21c4cd229d2c"
msgid ""
"\"That's fine with me. If he took all the other students from the city, then "
"the streets would be that much safer!\""
msgstr "\"제겐 좋은 소식입니다. 만약 그가 다른 모든 학생들을 도시에서 데려 간다면 거리가 훨씬 더 안전해질 테니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "b9e6408e-0fc0-4a73-ab40-7f5e792100bc"
msgid ""
"\"This is very bad... But you'd better keep it to yourself. If the old "
"families found out, there would be real trouble — and that's the last thing "
"I need in the city.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아주 나쁜 소식이군요... 그러나 당신은 단속을 더 잘해야 할겁니다. 만약 오래된 가문이 발견했다면 진짜 문제가 터지겠죠 — 그리고 "
"그것은 도시에 제가 필요한 마지막 일이고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "8a7dc7e6-b195-4c41-a494-6d97da270ec4"
msgid "\"All you need to know is where the city's exit is.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 도시 출구가 어디있는지만 아시면 됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "21e4af71-aa28-49b1-ac9e-944d5706723e"
msgid ""
"\"If you fight Irovetti, the city guard will be on your side. But you didn't "
"hear this from me. Now go, before someone hears us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티와 싸우면, 도시 경비대은 당신의 편에 설겁니다. 그러나 당신은 제 말을 듣지 않은겁니다. 누가 말을 듣기 전에, 어서 "
"가십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "b96d4759-d095-4de7-9905-cd02301c4d8f"
msgid ""
"\"Listen. I have nothing against you personally, but you are a walking "
"straight into trouble. Leave while you can. Or I'll have to arrest you for "
"disturbing the peace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"들어보십시오. 개인적으로 당신을 반대하는 것은 아니지만, 당신은 제 발로 사지에 들어가는 겁니다. 갈 수 있을 때 떠나십시오. 아니면 "
"평화를 방해한 죄로 당신을 체포하겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "399ec2e0-0884-45a5-b9ec-75c0c3d435c3"
msgid ""
"\"Well... I admit, you're right. Irovetti has crossed the line. This is "
"worse than just flirting with the thieves' guild. It's a direct threat to "
"the very existence of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄... 당신이 맞다고 인정하죠. 이로베티는 선을 남었습니다. 도둑 길드와 노는 것보다 더 나쁘군요. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}"
"의 존망이 걸린 문제가 되었네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "93530083-ad6b-413e-81ea-973d353417a8"
msgid "\"Keep away from me, or I'll have to arrest you.\""
msgstr "\"물러나십시오. 아니면 체포하겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "dcbb1a3f-6611-4e84-8355-bf1a8568c20d"
msgid ""
"\"That's right, Your Highness. You do. In fact, you've had to go for a while "
"now.\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 사실 너는 잠시 동안 자리를 피해야만 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "702afddf-c257-4522-a09e-2c47b63a2433"
msgid "\"That's a very big mistake. Guards!\""
msgstr "\"그건 아주 큰 실수입니다. 경비대!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "31c49c30-0704-4118-bc2a-411124b3a942"
msgid "\"Good day, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "e0c19b1b-5183-4214-8083-b156076395f0"
msgid ""
"\"Almost like the good old times. The trade houses vie for power, but it's "
"nothing we've not seen before. We can't entirely expel the thieves' guild "
"and their poison from the city, but at least there's much less of that trash "
"on the streets. And of course, it's much easier to maintain order in the "
"city when there's not a crowd of lawless cutthroats getting in the way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋았던 옛날 같군요... 무역 회사가 권력을 장악하고 있지만, 전에 보지 못했던 장면은 아닙니다. 도둑 길드와 독을 도시에서 완전히 "
"추방할 수는 없지만, 적어도 쓰레기는 훨씬 적어졌습니다. 그리고 물론, 거리에 무법자가 돌아다니지 않으면 도시 질서를 유지하는 것이 훨씬 "
"쉽죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "0814c56e-fb47-43b9-82d0-6a7a100fdd74"
msgid ""
"{n}Irsei shakes his head.{/n} \"Not good. There's not much open fighting in "
"the streets, but a quiet war boils beneath the seeming calm. The old houses "
"and the thieves' guild — and a million other scoundrels — are fighting each "
"other for the scraps of Irovetti's heritage. They all seem certain that now "
"is the time to make their fortune and found a new dynasty. And there's so "
"much bloodbrush extract on the streets — far more than we had under "
"Irovetti. Truth be told, Your Highness, it would be better if that old "
"rascal still sat on his throne.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}얼세이는 고개를 저었습니다.{/n} \"거리에서 싸움이 벌어지지는 않지만, 평화로운 수면 아래에서 조용한 전쟁이 끓고 있습니다. "
"오래된 가문과 도둑 길드, 백만 명의 다른 악당들이 이로베티 유산의 떡고물을 차지하기 위해 서로 싸우고 있죠. 그들 모두가 이제는 자신의 "
"재산을 만들고 새로운 왕조를 건설할 시간이라고 확신하죠. 그리고 거리에는 너무나 많은 핏자루 추출물이 있습니다 — 우리가 이로베티 통치 "
"하에 있었던 때보다 훨씬 많죠. 진실을 말하자면, 그 불량배가 왕위에 있을 때가 더 나았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "9d665649-dbb0-4832-ac7f-76a8bd7e1594"
msgid "\"All the best, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"전하, 몸조심하시길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "6c9a1464-c8a0-4cb0-aa22-f17a188e5b06"
msgid ""
"{n}Irsei winces as if his teeth ached.{/n} \"The same as it was under "
"Irovetti, but fewer merry festivals and more sad funerals. Because of you, "
"the city belongs to the thieves' guild and its henchmen. They take whatever "
"they want. Nearly half the city is using their poison — our young ones "
"mostly. I hope you are happy.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}Irsei는 그의 이가 아픈 것처럼 찡그립니다.{/n} \"이로베티 때와 같았지만 즐거운 축제는 더 적었고 슬픈 장례식은 더 "
"많았다. 너 때문에 도시는 도둑 길드와 그 끄나풀들의 손에 들어갔다. 그들은 원하는 대로 가져간다. 도시의 거의 절반이 독약을 사용하고 "
"있다. 젊은 사람들 대부분이고. 이렇게 되니 행복한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "59862f2a-8059-4bd8-9037-95079dc29414"
msgid ""
"{n}Kanerah watches the elf with interest.{/n} \"I like him. Though I'd like "
"him even more if he were dead…\""
msgstr "{n}카네라가 엘프를 흥미롭게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"나는 그가 좋아. 시체라면 더 좋았겠지만…\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "2ea6770e-490f-4430-b9be-107e00b2d754"
msgid ""
"\"Listen carefully. I am going to the palace to gut Irovetti. What I do with "
"you after that depends on whose side you fight on.\""
msgstr "\"잘 들어. 나는 이로베티의 목을 베기 위해 궁전에 간다. 그 이후에는 내 편이 누구냐에 따라 무얼 할지 결정되겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "f9ee0671-9384-4999-8541-cd9bb627cd67"
msgid "\"How are things in Pitax?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스는 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "89d068f5-0ea2-4068-bbca-31b6ba5a9ee6"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I didn't like your sleazy muzzle since the first time I laid eyes "
"on you. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"내가 처음 너를 봤을 때부터 너의 천박한 주둥이가 마음에 들지 않았다. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "af3d365a-174f-4cbb-976f-01a15158c0d8"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1d1da785-b4c5-4562-a955-99d302b7f030"
msgid ""
"Offered to let Kharne Vereel start trading bloodbrush extract in your "
"kingdom."
msgstr "칸 베릴이 핏자루 추출물을 당신 왕국에서 거래하도록 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "639798b3-84b2-4e5e-a8a9-345c3bf7ab0d"
msgid ""
"\"Help me kill Irovetti, and I will allow you to sell your poison in my "
"kingdom.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티를 죽일 수 있도록 도와주면 나의 왕국에서 너의 독약을 팔 수 있게 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "68f5dade-c594-4209-aa86-9c99d59700e1"
msgid "\"Listen to me...\""
msgstr "\"들어 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "cb9fd87c-5d57-4e1d-b350-f262b8ad4106"
msgid "\"I'm leaving, I'm leaving!\""
msgstr "\"나는 떠날 거야. 갈 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "a690b74a-f43b-4f79-b446-7c15b8937c96"
msgid "\"Have we met? Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 만난 적이 있나? 당신은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0047_EvilReinforce_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "54aaf03e-417b-4330-8eeb-fad687982803"
msgid ""
"Proposed an open-ended deal that would allow Kharne Vereel to have shady "
"dealings in your kingdom."
msgstr "칸 베릴이 당신의 왕국에서 음산한 거래를 하도록 허락하는 개방형 거래를 제안합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Answer_0047_EvilReinforce_Text
msgctxt "12ecc903-58ee-4cf7-9c5b-a93ce27b952e"
msgid ""
"\"What do you gain from supporting Irovetti? I can give you so much more — "
"more ways to spread your poison, theft, raids, you name it. Support me, and "
"you support your future. We can discuss the price later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티를 지원함으로써 무엇을 얻지? 나는 너에게 독약, 도둑질, 습격 등을 퍼트릴 수 있는 더 많은 방법을 허락할 수 있다. "
"약속하지. 나를 지지하면 너의 미래는 보장될 것이다. 협상은 나중에 이야기하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f9a3630c-20c6-4183-afe0-443c25789b0b"
msgid ""
"{n}Gripping the handle of his dagger, the gnome sizes you up with his dim, "
"shifty eyes.{/n} \"You! You!!! What are you doing here?! We can't be seen "
"together! Don't come any closer or I'll slit your throat!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 단도 손잡이를 잡고 노움은 자신의 어둑한 눈으로 찔리는 데가 있는 듯 당신의 눈치를 살핍니다.{/n} \"너! 너!!! 너 "
"여기서 뭐하고 있어? 우린 함께 있으면 안 돼! 더 가까이 오면 네 목을 베어버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "1109ae9d-d2a3-45c6-825e-db5048ecdb54"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome is shivering. His eyes shift and his teeth chatter. Finally he "
"nods.{/n} \"Good. Good! The thieves' guild is on your side.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 떨고 있습니다. 그는 눈알을 굴리며 이빨은 딱딱 부딪힙니다. 마침내 그는 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n} \"좋아. 도둑 길드는 "
"너의 편이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "76fe37a8-e0b7-4a43-8332-4533246cf77d"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome grins.{/n} \"No way — no way! No one can scare Kharne Vereel! "
"They're frightened of me, but I'm not afraid. I'm scared of no one — no one!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 웃습니다.{/n} \"절대 안돼! 아무도 칸 베릴을 겁줄 수 없다! 그들은 나를 두려워하지만 나는 두려워하지 않는다. 나는 "
"아무도 두려워하지 않아. 아무도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "65813f56-477d-4169-aa64-9e4900ce8eef"
msgid ""
"\"Stay away from me. We can't be seen together. Remember — we don't know "
"each other!\""
msgstr "\"나와 떨어져. 우리는 함께 있으면 안 돼. 기억해. 우리는 서로를 알지 못한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "bb390f5e-6732-48ec-ac87-bacecb73b293"
msgid ""
"\"Oh-h-h! Your Highness! Happy, happy to see you! What brings you to your "
"loyal city — to your loyal governor?\""
msgstr "\"아! 너를 보니 기쁘다. 너의 충성스러운 도시와 충성스러운 총독에게 무엇을 가져다 주려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "dade1690-b872-4c42-b09d-c5c0eb731fb4"
msgid "\"Always, always happy to see you! You should visit more often!\""
msgstr "\"언제나 만나서 기쁘군! 더 자주 방문해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "582a9970-227e-4d23-81f1-24a6b560a8ef"
msgid ""
"\"Moving along, Your Highness, moving along... Trade is thriving! The old "
"families keep wriggling, though. Still trying to claw back pieces of their "
"former wealth... But let them claw all they like. This city is ours now!\""
msgstr ""
"\"비켜... 무역이 번창하고 있다고! 오래된 가문은 계속해서 곤두박질쳤어. 아직도 과거의 재산을 깎아먹고 살지. 그러나 그들의 모든 "
"것을 뱉어내게 하자. 이 도시는 지금 우리의 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "f63b995b-8cca-4329-a2c7-c81f586e706b"
msgid "\"Ha! When Irovetti has your kingdom, he'll allow the same anyway!\""
msgstr "\"하하! 이로베티가 네 왕국을 가질 때처럼 그는 똑같이 허락할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "68e89b89-9290-4045-801a-0ea0f664438f"
msgid ""
"\"Now leave! There are spies everywhere. And don't even think you can trick "
"me! My people are watching you!\""
msgstr "\"이제 떠나! 첩자가 도처에 있다. 나를 속일 수 있다고 생각조차 하지 마라. 내 부하가 너를 보고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ac2fc60f-3819-417b-b128-3c5085a87656"
msgid "\"Get out! We have nothing to discuss!\""
msgstr "\"나가! 아무것도 할 얘기가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "ffa8982b-05d7-4b78-a148-a6d4c304e705"
msgid "\"What can you say to me? I don't believe a single word you say!\""
msgstr "\"내게 뭐라고 말할 수 있어? 너의 말 한 마디도 믿지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "4ecb8edb-f47e-4a0c-ad06-8ddd291c64c2"
msgid "\"Good! And don't come back!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 다시는 돌아오지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "f674c553-2933-4f22-99cb-ffea0af97d3c"
msgid ""
"\"Not today!\" {n}The gnome dives somewhere under your feet and vanishes.{/n}"
msgstr "\"오늘은 아니야!\" {n}노움은 당신의 발 아래 어딘가로 뛰어들어 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "f5d4f1fc-a5d4-48b3-8398-9e1a77944e1e"
msgid "\"So what? What do I care about these singers?\""
msgstr "\"그래서? 나보고 이 가수들을 어떻게 하라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "fb9a395a-12b2-42a2-9d56-3433742c5cf1"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome flashes a rotten grin.{/n} \"That's no news... I can even guess "
"where your bones will soon lie!\""
msgstr "{n}노움은 썩은 미소를 터뜨렸습니다.{/n} \"그건 소식도 아니야... 나는 네 뼈가 어디에 놓일지 추측할 수도 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "0cb1e8af-4a31-448c-b3db-5964db103e13"
msgid ""
"\"What? What are you saying? Ilora? How could she, how could she... Did he "
"hire her cutthroats? Hers — and not mine? Why? Why, why, why...\""
msgstr "\"뭐? 무슨 소리야? 일로라? 어떻게 그녀가? 그녀가 암살자를 고용했나? 내 부하가 아니라? 왜? 왜...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "502d7808-3a94-40b0-829b-4e79e1a2fa70"
msgid "\"Ha ha — sounds like a fine idea! So what of it?\""
msgstr "\"하하 — 좋은 생각 같아! 그래서 뭐라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "e507f97b-6be6-4ae8-ae8c-628e11ec5eca"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome's red eyes roll wildly, and he anxiously cracks his fingers.{/n}"
" \"If Irovetti believed in me, he would have sent the thieves' guild to get "
"you. Instead he hired Ilora, without even whispering a word to me. What "
"could this mean? It means I'm next! That's what! After he deals with you, "
"he'll send Ilora to come for me! He'll drown me in the river and seize the "
"guild for himself!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움이 빨간 눈을 부라리며 손가락을 물어뜯습니다.{/n} \"이로베티가 나를 믿는다면 그는 너를 잡으러 도둑 길드를 보냈을 거야. "
"대신 그는 일로라를 고용했는데 내게 한 마디도 하지 않았다. 이것이 의미하는 바는 무엇일까? 그것은 내가 다음 차례라는 것을 의미해! "
"그가 너를 처리하면 일로라를 나에게 보낼 거야! 그는 강에서 나를 익사시키고 길드를 차지할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "2563cf02-0ce2-4009-bef9-33b3c9b45adc"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome grinds his teeth.{/n} \"I am one foot in the grave, and you — "
"you warned me. Fine! Good! If you oppose Irovetti, the thieves' guild will "
"take your side!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 이를 갑니다.{/n} \"사지에 제 발로 걸어 들어갔군. 충고는 받아두지. 좋아! 이로베티에 반대한다면 도둑 길드는 너의 "
"편을 들어줄 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "f7e0a431-a046-4540-a426-b58b87b1e6a2"
msgid ""
"\"We haven't and we shouldn't! I'm a plain honest trader! What do you want "
"from me?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그러지 않았고 그렇게 해서는 안 돼! 나는 평범하고 정직한 상인이야. 나에게 무엇을 원해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "4d6cd7a5-aee9-443e-a43c-e0dec571d4cc"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome's dim, reddish eyes are anxiously scanning the faces of passers-"
"by. Noticing you, he draws his dagger.{/n} \"You?! I don't know you! Don't "
"come any closer. I have no business with you! Get away or I'll cut you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그놈의 희미하고 붉은 눈은 고통스레 행인의 얼굴을 살핍니다. 당신을 알아 채고 그는 단도를 뽑습니다.{/n} \"너? 난 너를 "
"몰라! 더 가까이 오지마. 너와 아무런 일도 없어! 가지 않으면 베어버리겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "f7005534-c150-4f35-ba74-335e8e9a06ee"
msgid "\"You, Your Highness? What brings you here?\""
msgstr "\"여긴 왜 온 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "fa7146a0-1029-4a23-9459-3b5c92bc6b86"
msgid ""
"\"It's bad! The trade houses, devils take them, they've seized hold of "
"everything! The guards are off the leash! Not a day goes by without new "
"losses. Your Highness, you won't let honest people run their business!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안타깝군! 무역 회사는 데블이 차지하면서 모든 것을 빼앗었어! 경비원은 해산하고! 하루도 손실이 없는 날이 없다. 정직한 사람들이 "
"그들의 사업을 운영하게 하지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "d6cf9e18-77f5-48d4-a6b2-c30057a14300"
msgid ""
"\"Well... It's almost the same as it was with old Irovetti at the helm. The "
"trade houses take a pinch from us, we take a pinch from them, someone new "
"rolls into town... It's not like a real war, but not three days go by "
"without a new body floating around the docks. It's not easy, of course, but "
"business never is!\""
msgstr ""
"\"글쎄... 옛날 이로베티가 통치하던 때와 거의 같다. 무역소는 우리를 경계하고 그들은 우리를 경계하면서 새로운 자들이 굴러들어왔어. "
"진짜 전쟁과는 달랐지만 부두 주위에 피가 뿌려진 날이 3일 째야. 물론 쉽지는 않지만 사업은 결코 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "a4b0fa76-53c4-4944-bac9-22e11ee46ad2"
msgid ""
"\"It's war, Your Highness — war on the streets! It's true, I hated those "
"guards too! — But it wasn't like this with them. Every day there's blood in "
"the streets, warehouses burning, clients running, business suffering... "
"Losses all around!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 전쟁이야. 거리에서의 전쟁이야! 나는 경비원들도 싫어! 하지만 그들과는 달라. 매일 거리에 피가 흘렀고 창고에 불이 났고 고객이 "
"도망가고, 사업은 고통받았어. 도시가 피폐해지고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "ba6e9d15-3b1f-4f5d-b26c-df4b1733ab87"
msgid "\"Have a good day!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 하루 보내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/KharneVereel/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "173150cb-8a2d-4916-8338-a37c34dd4ffa"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome's red eyes roll about wildly, and he anxiously cracks his "
"fingers.{/n} \"A deal, huh? Sounds like a good deal, yes, good deal! You "
"have my support. Don't you betray me, though, you hear?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움이 빨간 눈을 부라리며 손가락을 물어뜯습니다.{/n} \"거개라고? 좋은 거래 같군! 내가 지원해 주지. 나를 배신하지 말라고. "
"알아들어?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "1a91741a-87f8-4978-9610-1cd7fdcc6f4e"
msgid "\"If I am found guilty, what happens?\""
msgstr "\"내가 유죄 판결을 받으면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "7b7a75bd-6535-4da4-b241-cf7690cc7022"
msgid "Refuted Walsh's accusations."
msgstr "월시의 비난을 반박합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "7486b24b-4217-4020-823b-ccb33105e5f5"
msgid "\"I am innocent, and I refute your accusations.\""
msgstr "\"나는 결백하다. 당신의 고소를 논박하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "446d9546-a7b1-46ea-862a-049747b4e8a7"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! I am innocent. Any crimes I have committed were a result of Eimar's "
"deception.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐! 나는 결백하다. 내가 범한 모든 범죄는 이마르가 속여 일어난 결과였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4e9710bb-c827-4df9-b93b-a3e68584b89e"
msgid "Accepted the guilt for attacking the Riversong convoy."
msgstr "리버송 호송대를 공격한 건에 대해 유죄를 인정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "f71670eb-175a-4adf-b83c-18a6ae2ea544"
msgid ""
"\"Nobody else is guilty here. I accept full responsibility for what has "
"happened.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 유죄가 아니다. 내가 일어난 일에 대해 전적인 책임을 진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ce3619a3-d2fe-4d16-be06-ba8ac2ae95bf"
msgid "Refused to be judged by the magistrate, and attacked."
msgstr "치안 판사의 심판을 거절하고 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "74b13bf1-ad99-496b-9db3-e8a423744d30"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I am not accountable to you flimsy justice. Stand aside, or I "
"shall make you stand aside.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"나는 너와 같이 얄팍한 정의론자에 책임이 없다. 옆으로 비켜서지 않으면 너를 공격할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "30721c13-78e5-4b4d-92bf-79a63a6c4972"
msgid ""
"\"The playwright Eimar Deschamps asked me to attack the Vascari convoy, "
"though he misinformed me about my targets' identity.\""
msgstr "\"극작가 이마르 데샹이 목표에 대한 그릇된 정보를 알려주며 바스카리 호송대를 공격하라고 나에게 요구했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "6fe356da-7d73-4797-9c45-d848ae1cddff"
msgid ""
"\"You told me of the so-called pirates, Judge Celvoway. What could you have "
"to gain by painting your own people as outlaws?\""
msgstr "\"나를 소위 해적이라고 불렀지. 켈보웨이 판사. 네 국민을 무법자로 몰아세움으로써 얻는 건 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "b402a12e-a89c-4782-b5c8-29718165e828"
msgid ""
"\"You warned Renshala Vascari of an impending attack, not from pirates but "
"from me. It's as though you had hoped I would attack her and incriminate "
"myself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 린샬라 바스카리가 해적이 아니라 나에게 공격을 당할거라 경고했지. 마치 내가 그녀를 공격하고 나를 범죄자로 만들길 바라는 것 "
"같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "056e9bbe-e929-436a-9909-5f3dfda786fb"
msgid ""
"\"The Vascaris have long been a thorn in your side. You stood to gain from "
"their fear, especially if you got someone else to do your dirty work.\""
msgstr ""
"\"바스카리는 오랫동안 너의 편에게 가시였다. 특히 더러운 일을 대신 해줄 다른 누군가가 있는 경우, 너는 그들의 공포심으로부터 이득을 "
"취할 수 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0032_Text_String
msgctxt "41992bf7-e97c-4628-aa83-72503e968761"
msgid ""
"\"I have presented my evidence. Surely now the people can see that I am not "
"guilty.\""
msgstr "\"나는 증거를 제시했다. 분명히 사람들은 내가 유죄가 아니라는 것을 알 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "3b3a6334-172e-48a9-bc70-2242b9fba5e6"
msgid "\"Tell them who made you do this.\""
msgstr "\"누가 너를 시켰는지 말해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "7812c479-590b-4c18-bbe7-e8a296024b36"
msgid "\"Thank you, Eimar. That is all.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 이마르. 그게 다야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "2288d125-5b56-48f8-937e-8c36f3b064d5"
msgid "\"Whatever. Now get lost before I lose my patience.\""
msgstr "\"어쨌든. 내 인내심을 잃기보다는 혼란하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0058_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "227bf56e-fda6-49e9-9d85-15eca04658db"
msgid "Refuted Walsh's accusations."
msgstr "월시의 비난을 반박합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "3d9bbb94-fa3d-4144-bb0e-a6b0b35d5f27"
msgid "\"You are the one behind all this and I can prove it!\""
msgstr "\"네가 이 모든 것의 배후에 있는 사람이고 그것을 증명할 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0063_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "639a420f-71bc-4f58-b55d-a124e7c9e843"
msgid "Made Talwyn obey the orders and imprison his husband."
msgstr "탈윈이 명령에 복종하게 하고 남편을 감옥에 수감합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "19147fee-c729-4593-8afa-a123bcbdaf94"
msgid ""
"\"You heard the magistrate, sergeant. Remember the oaths you swore to the "
"city.\""
msgstr "\"치안 판사의 말을 들었지. 상사. 네가 한 맹세를 기억해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "cd6517e6-9dc3-49bf-99e7-87176c7edef0"
msgid "\"Talwyn, think about what's happening. Is this really justice?\""
msgstr "\"탈윈. 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 생각해 봐. 이게 정말 맞는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "7276614d-578f-4998-a790-f0adc480a287"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0073_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "89548743-36df-4283-96f5-84b353c219fa"
msgid "Helped Talwyn fight against the Pitax guards."
msgstr "탈윈이 피탁스 경비병과 싸울 수 있게 도와줍니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "896498f0-2ff9-4ab6-be2b-8950a8d1c0f9"
msgid "[Attack] \"I shall fight alongside you, Talwyn.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"나는 너와 같이 싸울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0074_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9b5d1bc1-536f-414e-9f3f-7afe821db24e"
msgid "Decieved Talwyn into betraying his duty and left him to die."
msgstr "탈윈이 자신의 의무를 배반한 것에 대해 낙담하게 두고 죽게 내버려둡니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0074_Text
msgctxt "9c310ea5-2513-4f67-9245-5b3ee8445fd5"
msgid "\"You're on your own, sergeant.\""
msgstr "\"너 알아서 해. 상사.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "8dba91e1-13ec-4ab7-9d31-e0c86bac66aa"
msgid "[Attack] \"You will not escape that easy.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"그렇게 쉽게 빠져나가지 못할 걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Answer_0083_Text
msgctxt "d3a33da0-6811-4dd9-b4c4-5e555c160939"
msgid "\"Run like a coward you are!\""
msgstr "\"겁쟁이처럼 도망가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Pitax_EimarDeschamps
msgctxt "9ed1a1bf-810a-4488-80a2-2d1a69671bc2"
msgid ""
"{n}The playwright {d|Eimar}Eimar Deschamps{/d} looks up from a script he's "
"revising while casually people-watching.{/n} \"Ah, how fares your war on "
"piracy? I still hear tales that the vagabonds are at large, so I encourage "
"you to intercept them downriver around {g|Littletown}Littletown{/g}. Once "
"you have triumphed, I shall be here to record every detail.\"{n} He glances "
"at his script before looking back to you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}극작가 {d|Eimar}이마르 데샹{/d}이 보통 사람들이 보듯 대본을 고치고는 고개를 듭니다.{/n} \"아. 전쟁 중 당신의 "
"해적 행위는 어떻게 대가를 치르지? 나는 아직도 유랑인이 많다는 이야기를 들어서 {g|Littletown}리틀타운{/g} 하구 주위에서 "
"그들을 약탈하는 것을 권한다. 일단 승리를 거둔다면 나는 여기 모든 세부 사항을 기록 하겠어.\" {n}그는 당신을 다시 보기 전에 그의 "
"대본을 훑어 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Pitax_EimarDeschamps
msgctxt "dc751035-46e0-4431-bca8-7f22740aff3b"
msgid ""
"{n}Gone is the confident and well-groomed {d|Eimar}playwright{/d} who "
"approached you at the Rushlight Tournament. Eimar Deschamps, who sent you to "
"defeat the river pirates, is pale and wane, as though he had not slept for "
"days. He shakily runs a hand through his hair as you approach.{/n} \"It's a "
"terrible mistake. I've — I owe you an apology. And an explanation.\" {n}He "
"holds up a hand as if to request patience or ward off a blow.{/n} \"Walsh "
"Celvoway, the magistrate, knows that I have a way with words — wouldn't "
"think that now that I'm stumbling over myself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}지나간 사람은 러시라이트 토너먼트에서 당신에게 접근했던, 자신감 있고 잘 꾸민 {d|이마르}극작가{/d}입니다. 강가 해적들을 "
"물리치기 위해 당신을 보냈던 이마르 데샹은 하루는 잠들지 못한 듯 창백하고 약해져 있습니다. 당신이 접근하자, 그는 떨리는 손으로 그의 "
"머리를 빗었습니다.{/n} \"그건 끔찍한 실수였습니다. 나는 — 저는 당신께 사과드립니다. 해명도 하겠습니다.\" {n}그는 잠시 "
"멈춰달라는 듯, 타격을 피하려는 것처럼 손을 듭니다.{/n} \"집정관인 월시 켈보웨이는 저더러 입심이 좋다고 했죠. 지금은 제가 제 "
"발에 걸려 넘어졌으니, 그런 생각은 안합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Pitax_EimarDeschamps
msgctxt "d683e3e0-f2f5-4846-9a99-dc80f5cde892"
msgid ""
"\"He may be cruel, but he's devious. I think he wanted to test my loyalty "
"and eliminate rivals at the same time, so he recruited me as a spy. It "
"seemed natural, what with my husband in the guards. I couldn't just refuse — "
"that would make me look like a threat to the state. The king is already "
"putting the squeeze on the city guard hard enough, so that would threaten my "
"Talwyn too. Now I've concocted a story to get you to attack someone on the "
"pretense of piracy, knowing that it wasn't true.\" {n}Eimar withers with "
"shame.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그가 잔인한지는 확실치 않지만, 사기꾼임은 확실합니다. 그는 제 충성심을 테스트하는 동시에 경쟁자를 제거하기를 원했으며, 때문에 저를 "
"첩자로 고용한 겁니다. 경비대인 제 남편까지 있으니 금상첨화였을 테죠. 단지 거절할 수 없었을 뿐입니다. 국가에 대한 위협처럼 "
"보였으니까요. 왕은 이미 도시 경비대를 쥐어짜고 있었기에, 나의 탈윈 또한 위협을 받았습니다. 그래서, 사실을 알면서도 해적이라고 속여 "
"당신이 공격하도록 이야기를 날조한겁니다.\" {n}이마르는 수치심에 기가 죽습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Pitax_EimarDeschamps
msgctxt "845fa50b-4913-45a4-8794-f57278b08713"
msgid ""
"{n}He nervously looks around.{/n} \"You need to get out of here before "
"there's more trouble. I'm going to do what I can to make this right, though, "
"faster than you can say-\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그는 불안스러워 하며 주위를 둘러 봅니다.{/n} \"더 많은 문제가 있기 전에 여기에서 나가셔야합니다. 당신이 말한 것보다 더 "
"빨리 이 일을 바로잡겠습니-\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "08b5304c-ea2a-4598-a4de-526316ebbc32"
msgid ""
"\"{name}!\" {n}shouts an approaching woman, her voice silencing all of the "
"other conversations for a hundred feet. It is Renshala Vascari, who had "
"overseen the convoy you attacked, and she proudly wears light blue clothing "
"embroidered with the heron insignia of the Riversong Trade House.{/n} \"You "
"have the gall to show your face in Pitax after what you {d|c51 Renshala "
"Rude}did{/d} to me? A brazen attack on this kingdom's river against one of "
"its eminent trade houses, and now you gallivant about while snubbing justice!"
"\"{n} Several of her personal guards array themselves behind her, watching "
"grimly. At the same time, onlookers begin gathering to see what's "
"happening.{/n} \"You attacked my shipments, my family, and my crewmembers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{name}!\" {n}다가오고 있는 여자가 소리치자, 그녀의 목소리는 주위의 모든 대화를 삼켰습니다. 그것은 당신이 공격했던 "
"호송대를 감독했던 린샬라 바스카리였으며, 그녀는 리버송 무역 회사의 왜가리 휘장을 수놓은 밝은 파란색 옷을 자랑스레 입고 "
"있었습니다.{/n} \"{d|c51 Renshala Rude}그런 짓{/d}을 하고도 뻔뻔하게 피탁스에 얼굴을 드러내? 저명한 무역 회사 "
"중 하나에 맞서 왕국의 강을 파렴치하게 공격하기도 모자라, 이제는 정의를 무시하고 떳떳하게 돌아다니다니!\" {n}그녀의 개인 경비원 중 "
"몇 명이 뒤에 서서 무섭게 쳐다봅니다. 동시에 구경꾼은 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 보기 위해 모입니다.{/n} \"너는 내 선적, 내 "
"가족, 그리고 내 선원들을 공격했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "3dd83722-12ee-44e7-b13c-9156baf896f1"
msgid ""
"\"{name}!\"{n} shouts a steely-faced man, his voice silencing all of the "
"other conversations for a hundred feet. {/n}\"I am Jhofre Vascari, head of "
"the Riversong Trade House whose convoy you attacked near the {g|Pitax River}"
"Pitax River{/g}. You have the gall to show your face in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} "
"after what you {d|c51 Renshala Killed}did{/d} to my sister and my shipments? "
"A brazen attack on this kingdom's river against one of its eminent trade "
"houses, and now you gallivant about while snubbing justice!\"{n} Several of "
"his personal guards array themselves behind him, watching grimly. At the "
"same time, onlookers begin gathering to see what's happening.{/n} \"You "
"attacked my shipments, my family, and my crewmembers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{name}!\" {n}강한 인상의 남자가 외쳤고, 그의 목소리는 주위의 모든 대화를 삼킵니다.{/n} \"나는 네가 공격했던 {g|"
"Pitax River}피탁스 강{/g}변의 호송대를 이끄는 리버송 무역 회사의 대표 조프리 바스카리다. 내 누이와 선적에 {d|c51 "
"Renshala Killed}그런 짓{/d}을 하고도 뻔뻔하게 {g|Pitax}피탁스{/g}에 얼굴을 드러내? 저명한 무역 회사 중 "
"하나에 맞서 왕국의 강을 파렴치하게 공격하기도 모자라, 이제는 정의를 무시하고 떳떳하게 돌아다니다니!\" {n}그의 개인 경비원 중 몇 "
"명이 뒤에 서서 무섭게 쳐다봅니다. 동시에 구경꾼은 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 보기 위해 모입니다.{/n} \"너는 내 선적, 내 가족, "
"그리고 내 선원들을 공격했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "f09ade38-2e28-4ec5-878a-aac19f433832"
msgid ""
"\"Eimar Deschamps!\" {n}shouts an approaching woman, her voice silencing all "
"of the other conversations for a hundred feet. It is Renshala Vascari, who "
"had overseen the convoy you attacked, and she proudly wears light blue "
"clothing embroidered with the heron insignia of the Riversong Trade "
"House.{/n} \"You have the gall to show your face in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} after "
"your slander and treachery? Who do I have to blame for this heinous {d|c51 "
"Renshala Nice}attack{/d} on my shipments, my family, and my crewmembers?\" "
"{n}Several of her personal guards array themselves behind her, watching "
"grimly. At the same time, onlookers begin gathering to see what's happening. "
"{/n}\"It is this miserable actor! And who lines your pockets, I wonder? Who "
"would stand to profit from my family's misfortune by hiring assassins?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이마르 데샹!\" {n}다가오고 있는 여자가 소리치자, 그녀의 목소리는 주위의 모든 대화를 삼켰습니다. 그것은 당신이 공격했던 "
"호송대를 감독했던 린샬라 바스카리였으며, 그녀는 리버송 무역 회사의 왜가리 휘장을 수놓은 밝은 파란색 옷을 자랑스레 입고 "
"있었습니다.{/n} \"나에게 모략질과 배반을 하고도 뻔뻔하게 {g|Pitax}피탁스{/g}에 얼굴을 드러내? 내 선적, 내 가족, 내 "
"선원에 대한 극악무도한 {d|c51 Renshala Nice}공격{/d}을 계획한 녀석이 누구야?\" {n}그녀의 개인 경비원 중 몇 "
"명이 뒤에 서서 무섭게 쳐다봅니다. 동시에 구경꾼은 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 보기 위해 모입니다.{/n} \"그건 바로 여기있는 비참한 "
"연기자였지! 누가 네 주머니에 뒷돈을 꽂아 넣었지? 암살자를 고용해 내 가족을 공격해서 이득을 얻은 자가 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "75f9e71e-aaaa-422c-8a8b-d57bf77b7159"
msgid ""
"\"Stand aside! Make way for the king's magistrate!\" {n}The honorable{/n} "
"{d|Walsh}Walsh Celvoway{/d} {n}makes his way to the conversation with a "
"squad of Pitax's guards in tow.{/n} \"Sergeant {d|Talwyn}Talwyn Halmarion{/d}"
", keep the peace as I handle these miscreants.\" {n}He tugs irritably on his "
"sash before looking at you. {/n}\"As for you, it is convenient that you have "
"spared us the trouble of arresting you for sentencing. How dare you show "
"your face in Pitax after launching an unprovoked attack on the Riversong "
"Trade House, lifeblood of our city and pride of our kingdom? You have slain "
"our people and threatened the prosperity of every citizen gathered here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물러서! 왕의 치안 판사에게 길을 내어라!\" {n}영예로운 {d|Walsh}월시 켈보웨이{/d}가 피탁스 경비대 분대를 이끌고 "
"대화에 나섭니다.{/n} \"상사 {d|Talwyn}탈윈 할마리온{/d}, 내가 이 악당들을 처리하는 동안 평화를 지켜라.\" {n}그는 "
"당신을 보기 전에 자기 허리띠를 거칠게 당깁니다.{/n} \"선고를 위해 너를 체포하는 어려움을 덜어주어 고맙구나. 어떻게 감히 우리 "
"왕국의 자존심이자 생명줄인 리버송 무역 회사를 이유없이 공격해 놓고 피탁스에 나타났는가? 당신은 우리 국민을 죽였고, 여기 모인 모든 "
"시민들의 번영을 위협했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Pitax_EimarDeschamps
msgctxt "08a2b668-eee3-4c05-a2e7-e3fc1e4cbcbb"
msgid ""
"\"It was not {mf|his|her} fault,\"{n} declares Eimar as he steps forward. "
"{/n}\"I accept responsibility for-\""
msgstr "\"그건 {mf|그|그녀}의 잘못이 아니야.\" {n}이마르가 앞으로 나서며 선언합니다.{/n} \"나는 책임을 지겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "fae388a8-822d-453e-8bf8-34d646395eaf"
msgid ""
"{n}The magistrate interrupts.{/n} \"Listen! Now this villain has begun "
"poisoning the minds of our people, using doubt and venom to make us see "
"ourselves as fiends when the mastermind stands before us!\"{n} He points "
"accusingly at you.{/n} \"Yes, proud citizens of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. From "
"this foreign miscreant stems all of these ills.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}치안 판사가 방해합니다.{/n} \"보아라! 지금 이 악당은 우리 국민들의 마음에 독을 풀고 있다, 의심과 맹독을 사용해 우리 "
"자신을 악마로 보도록 만든 흑막이 우리 앞에 서 있다!\" {n}그는 당신을 가리키며 비난합니다.{/n} \"그렇다. 자랑스러운 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 시민들이여. 이 모든 병폐가 이 외국인 악당 때문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_TalwynHalmarion
msgctxt "e55735e7-bee2-48dc-8b22-3e145f1d73d7"
msgid ""
"{n}Sergeant Talwyn seems baffled by what's happening, looking for guidance "
"from Eimar. The latter looks back with sad resolve.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}탈윈 상사는 이마르로부터 보호를 요청하면서 무슨 상황인지 당황합니다. 이마르는 슬픈 결심으로 돌아봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "9c732206-ad8f-4443-be21-34d4a6a9bc46"
msgid ""
"\"But we are a civilized and high-minded people,\"{n} declares Walsh "
"Celvoway. {/n}\"Let us hear from the accused.\" {n}Smugly, he turns to you "
"and awaits your response.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 우리는 문명인이고 고결한 사람들이다.\" {n}월시 켈보웨이는 선언합니다.{/n} \"피고인의 의견을 듣자.\" {n}그는 "
"의기양양하게 당신에게 향했고, 당신의 반응을 기다렸습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "127b7bec-9c0c-4c89-bfcd-686f4a99d943"
msgid ""
"\"This man, the playwright. He betrayed us. He hurt Renshala. He made us "
"into bandits. Let him take the blame for his mistakes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"극작가의 짓이다. 그는 우릴 배반했다. 그는 린샬라를 상처를 입혔다. 그는 우리를 도적떼로 만들었다. 그의 잘못을 반성하게 만들자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "50ce1742-0004-439f-a6ad-61c500c33365"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks worriedly at Talwyn.{/n} \"Look at him, {name}. That's "
"love. If we don't keep Eimar safe, we'll have broken these two apart. I "
"don't think I can sleep with that on my conscience.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 탈윈을 걱정스럽게 봅니다.{/n} \"봐요, {name}. 이게 사랑이죠. 우리가 이마르를 보호하지 않으면, 두 사람이 "
"생이별을 하게 되겠죠? 혹시라도 그렇게 되면, 저는 양심에 찔려 잠도 못 잘 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "4db326ea-587a-4925-b211-3b6236a1e1b4"
msgid ""
"\"We may not be wholly to blame, but Eimar is not entirely guilty. Others "
"lives hang in the balance. It is only right that we accept the blame to "
"shield those who would otherwise suffer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 모든 책임을 질 수는 없지만, 이마르는 전적으로 유죄가 아닙니다. 나머지 사람들은 아직 중립적입니다. 고통 받았을 사람들을 "
"보호하기 위해 우리가 책임을 받아들여야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "6c1d5dd8-21de-4b7c-b32f-be3ad2e9f89b"
msgid ""
"\"You are the head of a foreign state,\"{n} the magistrate admits with "
"disdain. {/n}\"Although putting you under arrest is not within my humble "
"power, you shall be reviled as a treacherous murderer and scoundrel "
"throughout the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 외국의 수장이다.\" {n}치안 판사는 경멸하지만 인정합니다.{/n} \"내 작은 힘으로는 너를 체포할 수 없지만, 너는 {g|"
"River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g} 도처에서 위험한 살인자이자 악당으로 비난받아 마땅하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "c64f852d-5175-4d92-a771-d1956c7bb33b"
msgid ""
"{n}A cruel sneer cracks Judge Celvoway's face.{/n} \"Ah, the red-handed "
"criminal questions the judicial system? Very well, how do you refute the "
"state's accusations?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잔인한 비웃음이 켈보웨이 판사의 얼굴에 떠오릅니다.{/n} \"아. 범법자가 사법 제도에 의문을 제기하는군? 좋아. 어떻게 국가적 "
"혐의에 대해 논박하려고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "5b53e573-5ef8-4163-9741-943480cf3bb5"
msgid ""
"{n}Although the crowd still seems moved by Judge Celvoway's rhetoric, a "
"muttering minority begins questioning his narrative.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}군중은 여전히 판사 켈보웨이의 설득에 의해 움직이는 것처럼 보이지만 중얼거리는 소수는 그의 서사에 의문을 품기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "021dcac4-17fc-4ad0-9b7e-c9fddcd99635"
msgid ""
"{n}As you continue making your case, the crowd voices its doubts of Judge "
"Celvoway and his accusations. As he tries to regain order, some guards jeer "
"and boo him. You have not yet won the crowd's approval, but neither has the "
"magistrate.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 계속해서 설득하자, 군중들은 켈보웨이 판사와 그의 고소에 대한 의구심을 표명합니다. 그가 질서를 되찾으려고 하자, 몇몇 "
"경비원이 그를 조롱하고 야유합니다. 당신은 아직 군중의 승인을 얻지 못했지만, 어느 쪽도 치안 판사의 편이 아닙니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "b62a4468-b9dd-410e-b49c-79ce227e95bd"
msgid ""
"\"Typical of a northern barbarian,\"{n} Judge Celvoway snarls. {/n}\"Guards! "
"To arms!\""
msgstr "\"북부 야만족의 전형이로군.\" {n}켈보웨이 판사가 낮은 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"경비대! 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "b45e6bd9-4d0c-42be-be0c-4601a52f475c"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd shouts with accusations and displeasure as you admit guilt. The "
"magistrate smiles cruelly and motions for everyone to be quiet.{/n} \"People "
"of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, remember that we are a kingdom of law. We shall "
"record this foreign leader's crimes for all to remember, and it shall be "
"justice enough for everyone to remember and spread word of {name}'s heinous "
"crimes!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}군중들은 당신이 죄를 인정할 때 비난과 불만으로 소리칩니다. 치안 판사는 잔인하게 웃으며 모두가 조용히 하라고 손짓합니다.{/n} "
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 국민이여. 우리는 법의 왕국임을 기억하라. 우리는 이방인 지도자의 범죄 모두를 돌아볼 수 있게 기록할 "
"것이고, {name}의 가증스러운 범죄는 모든 사람들이 기억하고 퍼뜨림으로써 충분한 처벌을 받을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0040_Text_String
msgctxt "8c6b297f-3553-492c-8519-e77abf29183f"
msgid ""
"{n}Eimar seems unable to find the right words to say.{/n} \"I was at fault. "
"I was ready to accept the blame, but you never blamed me for anything. I "
"don't... I don't understand. But I'm grateful. You could have abandoned me "
"to suffer for my wrongdoings, yet you shielded me. I won't forget this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르는 말할 적절한 단어를 찾지 못한 것 같습니다.{/n} \"제가 잘못했습니다. 저는 비난을 받아 들일 준비가 되어 있었지만, "
"당신은 저를 비난하지 않았죠. 저는... 저는 이해가 가지 않습니다만, 감사합니다. 당신은 저를 버려 제 실수에 대한 처벌을 줄 수 "
"있었지만, 당신은 저를 보호해 주셨습니다. 저는 이를 잊지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0041_Text_String
msgctxt "d4184f86-ab3c-45df-a28c-f463a191569f"
msgid ""
"{n}Sergeant Talwyn approaches and puts a comforting hand on his husband's "
"shoulder.{/n} \"I don't understand all of what just happened,\"{n} he "
"admits. He gives Eimar a scolding look before adding,{/n} \"But I'm sure my "
"husband will be happy to explain it to me later. I can tell that he was in "
"trouble, and you stepped in to protect him where I might not have been able. "
"I appreciate that so much, and I want you to know that we, the guards, are "
"outraged with King Irovetti and his ever-crueler policies. I think Walsh "
"might have wanted to provoke me to revolt, and use it against the guard... "
"Anyway, please take this. Before I donned the uniform of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, "
"I wore this as a sellsword.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}탈윈 상사는 남편의 어깨에 위로 손을 얹어 놓습니다.{/n} \"저는 지금 막 일어난 일 모두를 이해하지 못했습니다.\" {n}그는 "
"인정합니다. 덧붙이기 전, 그는 이마르에게 꾸짖는 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"하지만 저는 남편이 나중에 설명할 수 있게 되어 기뻐할 "
"거라 확신합니다. 그는 곤경에 빠졌었고, 제가 할 수 없었던 일을 대신해 당신이 그를 보호했죠. 저희 경비대는 이로베티 왕과 그의 잔인한 "
"정책에 분개하고 있습니다. 월시는 제가 반란을 일으키도록 유도하고, 그것을 경비대 상대로 이용하고 싶었을 겁니다. 어쨌든, 이걸 "
"받아주십시오. 저는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 제복을 입기 전, 용병일 때 이걸 입었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Pitax_EimarDeschamps
msgctxt "953b3484-bf23-4b16-8e2d-5c7e6243944a"
msgid ""
"\"It's true,\"{n} Eimar proclaims, eliciting a gasp from Talwyn.{/n} \"I "
"concocted a story to get {name} in trouble. We would not be here now were it "
"not for my deception.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이다.\" {n}이마르가 실토했고, 탈윈은 헉 소리를 냈습니다.{/n} \"나는 {name}을 끌어들이기 위해 이야기를 꾸며냈어. "
"내 속임수가 아니었다면 우리는 지금 여기 없었을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : Pitax_EimarDeschamps
msgctxt "12ab5e07-5448-43b8-a207-7ab3910f2375"
msgid ""
"{n}The playwright squares his shoulders before pointing at the "
"magistrate.{/n} \"Walsh Celvoway approached me, demanding that I trick {name}"
" into attacking the convoy... for the good of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! What I "
"thought was a service to the kingdom has endangered our people and the "
"innocent {mf|man|woman} before us!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}극작가는 치안 판사를 가리 키기 전에 어깨에 힘을 줍니다.{/n} \"월시 켈보웨이가 나에게 접근하여 {name}을 속여 호송대를 "
"공격하라고 시켰다... 모두 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 위해서였다! 왕국에 대한 충심이 우리 국민과 여기 이 무고한 "
"{mf|남성|여성}을 위험에 빠뜨렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "68619079-1413-412d-b58d-4c24bf0ef7f8"
msgid ""
"\"Lies and slander!\"{n} explodes the magistrate. {/n}\"How easy it must be "
"for a playwright to spin such a web of falsehoods to confuse the listener "
"and betray his neighbors! No, good people of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, Eimar "
"Deschamp was born not in our fair nation but in {g|Taldor}Taldor{/g}, where "
"intrigue and backstabbing are second nature. It should come as no surprise "
"that he would find a kindred spirit in {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓과 모략이다!\" {n}치안 판사가 폭발합니다.{/n} \"극작가가 헛소문을 퍼뜨려 청중을 혼란시키고 이웃을 배반하기가 얼마나 "
"쉬운 일인가! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}시민과 이마르 데샹은 우리 국가에서 태어난 것이 아니라 음모와 역습이 천성인 "
"{g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}출신이다. {name}이(가) 비슷한 부류임은 놀랄만한 일이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "0ebe0b3e-2b1f-48cb-a9a3-0ad5cdc1b116"
msgid ""
"\"Of course I warned against pirates,\" {n}Judge Celvoway responds "
"indignantly.{/n} \"King Irovetti's soldiers patrol our territory to ensure "
"the safety of all, yet there are those who would exploit the River Freedoms "
"to attack our merchants.\" {n}He looks at you for a moment before turning to "
"crowd.{/n} \"Clearly, our king was right to worry about foreign powers "
"preying upon our people!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 해적들에 대해 경고했다.\" {n}켈보웨이 판사는 분개하며 반응합니다.{/n} \"모든 이의 안전을 지키기 위해 이로베티 왕의 "
"군대가 우리의 영토를 순찰하지만, 그럼에도 상인들을 공격하기 위해 강의 자유를 곡해하는 사람들이 있다.\" {n}그는 군중들을 돌아보기 "
"전에 잠시 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"분명히 우리 왕은 우리 국민을 잡아먹는 외국 세력에 대해 걱정할 권리가 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "90706ea5-37e3-40cc-8bdb-3c3de240418f"
msgid ""
"\"I was prepared to condemn you for theft and murder, yet it is no trouble "
"for me to add forgery to the counts against you.\"{n} Judge Celvoway peers "
"at the page for a moment before adding, {/n}\"And even so, it is my sacred "
"duty to protect the people against the foreign pretenders and predators from "
"your lawless land.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 도둑질과 살인 혐의로 너를 비난 할 준비가 되었지만, 거기에 위조죄를 추가하는 것은 아무런 문제가 되지 않지.\" {n}켈보웨이 "
"판사는 무언가 적기 전에 책을 봅니다.{/n} \"게다가 너희 무법 땅에서 사기꾼과 약탈자로부터 사람들을 보호하는 것은 나의 신성한 "
"의무이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : RenshalaVascari
msgctxt "5a028c94-f498-49f5-b875-ec84b0d3a799"
msgid ""
"{n}Renshala Vascari steps forward.{/n} \"Forgery? You sent this letter "
"directly to me, your honor. You warned me about {name}, and I have received "
"at least ten letters from you before. The writing and the seal match. Why "
"would the accused forge a letter that incriminates {mf|himself|herself}? No, "
"you are blustering because you worked with this playwright to attack me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린샬라 바스카리는 앞으로 나섭니다.{/n} \"위조? 네가 이 편지를 나에게 직접 보냈지. {name}에 대해 내게 경고한 편지를 "
"10통은 받았다. 편지와 봉인은 일치하고. 왜 {mf|그|그녀}를 유죄 판결한 편지의 위조죄가 성립하지? 아니. 너는 이 극작가와 함께 "
"작당하여 나를 협박하고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0051_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "91e38ddd-d7f9-416f-b4c0-a3d274900db6"
msgid ""
"{n}Walsh Celvoway sneers.{/n} \"Your defense is that the people of "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} are petty and treacherous? No, the Riversong Trade House "
"has always been an honored part of the community. It has nothing to fear so "
"long as it has King Irovetti's protection.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}월시 켈보웨이는 비웃습니다.{/n} \"당신의 변론은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 시민이 이기적인 배신자라는 얘기인가? 리버송 "
"무역 회사는 항상 지역 사회에서 존경 받는 곳이다. 그곳은 이로베티 왕의 보호를 받는 한 두려워 할 것이 없다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : RenshalaVascari
msgctxt "8ba22cf0-4885-499c-9fbf-49691247c396"
msgid ""
"{n}Renshala Vascari speaks up.{/n} \"It's no secret that the Riversong Trade "
"House and the king have disagreed about his policies. His agents have put "
"additional pressure on us to support him, and now we have this threat of "
"foreign attacks to make us come crawling to the king for protection.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린샬라 바스카리가 말했습니다.{/n} \"리버송 무역 회사와 왕이 그의 정책에 합의하지 않는다는 것은 비밀이 아니다. 그의 대리인은 "
"그를 지지하기 위해 우리에게 추가 압력을 가했고, 이제 우리는 왕의 보호를 빌게 만들 목적으로 꾸며낸 외세의 공격을 받았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "a6dd965f-9b64-4343-950b-22e4291ee071"
msgid ""
"\"Do not forget that {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} is a land of law and justice — the "
"king's justice! As appointed magistrate and defender of the people, it is my "
"job to declare you... guilty!\" {n}Judge Celvoway sneers in grim triumph "
"before staggering back at the crowd's outburst. Clearly he was hoping for "
"the grudging support of the onlookers. Rather than hate you for attacking "
"the Vascari convoy, most people present seem to sympathize with you and "
"blame Walsh Celvoway for framing you. He tugs at his sash so hard it nearly "
"tears before spinning to leave.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 법과 정의가 성립하는 나라임을 잊지 말아라 — 바로 왕의 재판이다! 집정관과 국민의 변호인으로써 "
"너에게 유죄를 선언하겠다!\" {n}판사 켈보웨이는 군중의 폭발에 놀라기 전까지 승리의 비웃음을 지었습니다. 분명히 그는 구경꾼들의 "
"마지못한 지지를 기대하고 있었습니다. 바스카리 호송대를 공격한 건에 대해 당신을 미워하기보다는, 대부분의 사람들이 당신에게 공감하는 "
"것처럼 보이며 월시 켈보웨이가 당신에게 누명을 씌운 것을 비난합니다. 그는 그의 허리띠를 너무 세게 잡아 당겨서 돌아서 떠나기 전에 "
"눈물을 흘립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "a90f6972-6f50-4aef-837c-b4ab4ee2432d"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd shouts with accusations and displeasure. The magistrate smiles "
"cruelly and motions for everyone to be quiet.{/n} \"People of "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, remember that we are a kingdom of law. We shall record "
"this foreign leader's crimes for all to remember, and it shall be justice "
"enough for everyone to remember and spread word of {name}'s heinous crimes!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}군중들은 당신이 죄를 인정할 때 비난과 불만으로 소리칩니다. 치안 판사는 잔인하게 웃으며 모두가 조용히 하라고 손짓합니다.{/n} "
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 국민이여. 우리는 법의 왕국임을 기억하라. 우리는 이방인 지도자의 범죄 모두를 돌아볼 수 있게 기록할 "
"것이고, {name}의 가증스러운 범죄는 모든 사람들이 기억하고 퍼뜨림으로써 충분한 처벌을 받을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "7df88c36-4932-4070-a18a-5a3306543e72"
msgid "{n}The magistrate gives you a contempted look before leaving.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}치안 판사는 떠나기 전에 당신에게 경멸의 눈빛을 보냅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Pitax_EimarDeschamps
msgctxt "1df76ac8-bf56-4eb6-ade9-17e52fd625a7"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd erupts into offended chatter in response to your blaming these "
"events on Eimar Deschamps, but the playwright projects his voice over the "
"onlookers.{/n} \"It's true,\"{n} Eimar proclaims, eliciting a gasp from "
"Talwyn.{/n} \"I concocted a story to send {name} to attack the Vascaris. We "
"would not be here now were it not for my deception.\"{n} Judge Celvoway is "
"about to interject, but Eimar continues.{/n} \"I, Eimar Deschamps, accept "
"full responsibility for what followed — the bloodshed, the loss of property, "
"and the stain on {g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} pride.\" {n}Eimar looks to you sadly "
"before facing the magistrate.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}군중들은 당신이 이마르 데샹에게 일어난 사건을 비난한 것에 대한 불쾌함을 표현하지만 극작가는 구경꾼을 향해 말합니다.{/n} "
"\"사실이다.\" {n}이마르는 탈윈에게 놀라며 실토합니다.{/n} \"나는 {name}을 끌어들이기 위해 이야기를 꾸며냈어. 내 "
"속임수가 아니었다면 우리는 지금 여기 없었을 거야.\" {n}켈보웨이 판사가 개입하려 했지만 이마르는 계속합니다.{/n} \"나 이마르 "
"데샹은 유혈 사태, 재산 손실, {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 명예 훼손에 대한 완전한 책임을 인정한다.\" {n}이마르는 치안 판사를 "
"보기 전에 당신을 슬픈 듯이 봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "c2073b2b-4265-4d22-bc9b-4d578d7cf31d"
msgid ""
"{n}Walsh Celvoway seems conflicted, glancing with indecision between you and "
"Eimar. He then looks back to Eimar's visibly distraught husband, Sergeant "
"Talwyn before grinning mischievously.{/n} \"Very well, Eimar Deschamps. The "
"court hears your guilty plea and has decided not to pursue any further "
"punishment against {name} for the worst of {mf|his|her} crimes. For his "
"treachery, the playwright shall rot in the dungeons and await the king's "
"justice.\" {n}The judge looks to the crowd with fierce eyes.{/n} \"As you "
"can see, there are citizens who would threaten the peace with their "
"treachery, and we must all remain vigilant to root them out before they "
"bring ruin upon us all! If there are any other traitors among us, let this "
"man's fate be a reminder of what awaits them.\" {n}Walsh Celvoway's last "
"remark seems as though it's intended for the sergeant. With cruel authority, "
"the judge issues one more command.{/n} \"Sergeant Talwyn, arrest this man.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}월시 켈보웨이는 당신과 이마르 사이에서 망설이며 힐끗거립니다. 그는 장난스럽게 미소 짓기 전에 흥분한 탈윈 상사를 돌아봅니다.{/n}"
" \"이마르 데샹. 좋다. 법원은 너의 유죄 항변을 듣고 {name}가 범죄를 저지른 악행에 대해 더 이상의 처벌을 추구하지 않기로 "
"결정했다. 반역자 극작가는 지하 감옥에 유배되어 왕의 판결을 기다려라.\" {n}판사는 날카로운 눈빛으로 군중을 바라봅니다.{/n} "
"\"너희도 볼 수 있듯이 배반으로 평화를 위협하는 시민들이 있으며, 그들이 우리를 파멸시키기 전에 그들의 행위를 근절해야 함을 명심해야 "
"한다! 우리 중 다른 반역자가 있다면 이 사람의 운명을 기다리고 있는 것이 무엇인지 알 것이다.\" {n}월시 켈보웨이의 마지막 발언은 "
"상사를 위한 것 같습니다. 잔인한 권한으로 판사는 명령을 한 번 더 내립니다.{/n} \"탈윈 상사, 이 자를 체포하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_TalwynHalmarion
msgctxt "3ee30ed9-56bc-407f-82c9-e29facf16279"
msgid ""
"{n}Talwyn stands rigid with shock, his body quivering as he looks from the "
"magistrate to Eimar to the other guards and then to you. Eimar is nodding to "
"him sadly, but it's clear that the sergeant is struggling with his "
"professional duty and Eimar's sorrowful acceptance of what's happening. "
"Talwyn's close enough for you to speak out.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}탈윈은 충격으로 굳어 그의 몸은 치안 판사에게서 이마르와 다른 경비원을 바라 보았을 때 떨립니다. 이마르는 그에게 슬픈 듯이 "
"끄덕입니다. 그러나 상사가 그의 직업적 의무와 이마르가 무슨 일이 일어나는지 슬프게 받아들이는 데 어려움을 겪고 있음은 분명합니다. "
"탈윈는 무언가를 당신에게 말하려 합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_TalwynHalmarion
msgctxt "70d314a0-4bcc-4613-9a5a-c07878a5e223"
msgid ""
"{n}Clenching his jaw, Talwyn nods and advances on Eimar. The two share a "
"tearful look before Talwyn announces,{/n} \"Sir, you are under arrest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 턱에 힘줄이 솟아 탈윈는 끄덕이고는 이마르에 다가갑니다. 탈윈이 발표하기 전에 두 사람은 눈물짓습니다.{/n} \"당신은 "
"체포당했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0067_Text_String
msgctxt "9e607986-f79c-4ab1-9bfc-e0016e37372e"
msgid ""
"{n}The guards lead off Eimar, as Judge Celvoway flashes you a sinister smile "
"and purrs, {/n}\"Thank you for your cooperation, {name}. Justice is served.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}경비원은 이마르를 데려가고 판사 켈보웨이는 당신에게 불길한 미소를 지으며 기분 좋게 말합니다.{/n} \"협력해주어 고맙다. "
"{name}. 정의는 실현되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "b7fb7364-f12a-4517-86a5-18812a30c0bf"
msgid ""
"{n}As the guards and magistrate depart, Renshala approaches you.{/n} \"We "
"may not have met under the best circumstances, yet I think I understand why "
"your people respect you. What you just witnessed was King Irovetti's idea of "
"justice. I don't care for it at all. Please, take this amulet. It will let "
"the others of my family know that you are a friend.\" {n}She gives you a "
"shallow bow and then departs for the docks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}경비원과 치안 판사가 떠나고 린샬라가 당신에게 접근합니다.{/n} \"최악의 상황에서 만났을 지 모르지만 네 사람들이 왜 너를 "
"존경하는지 이해할 수 있을 것 같아. 네가 목격 한 것은 이로베티 왕의 정의였어. 나는 그것을 전혀 신경 쓰지 않는다. 이 목걸이를 "
"받아줘. 우리 가족의 일원들이 네가 친구라는 것을 알게 될 거야.\" {n}그녀는 당신에게 가벼운 인사를 하고 부두로 출발합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_TalwynHalmarion
msgctxt "92293a8f-c8e1-4604-82fe-ebd746fd4ba1"
msgid ""
"{n}Talwyn blinks several times as he considers your words, then he turns to "
"Judge Celvoway and announces,{/n} \"I refuse to arrest this man. What you "
"demand is not justice, Walsh.\" {n}The crowd buzzes with alarm and "
"excitement as the magistrate's jaw hangs open and flexes angrily. The other "
"guards stand confused by Talwyn's disobedience.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}탈윈은 당신의 말을 되씹듯 여러 번 깜박이고는 켈보웨이 판사에게 몸을 돌려 선언합니다.{/n} \"나는 이 남자를 체포하기를 "
"거부한다. 네가 요구하는 것은 정의가 아니다. 월시.\" {n}화가 나 치안 판사의 입이 벌어지고 입술이 떨린 모습에 군중은 경악과 "
"흥분으로 웅성입니다. 다른 경비원들은 탈윈의 불복종으로 혼란스러워합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : RiverPiratesCamp_WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "a707dc1b-7043-4e34-b5d3-87ecaf6d1385"
msgid ""
"{n}At last Celvoway regains his composure and shouts,{/n} \"Then we are "
"arresting two men today: one for treachery and one for treason! Guards! "
"Subdue this miscreant!\" {n}The sergeant draws his sword and looks to you "
"for assistance.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마침내 켈보웨이는 그의 평정을 되찾아 소리칩니다.{/n} \"오늘 우리는 두 명의 남자를 체포한다. 하나는 배신자고 다른 하나는 "
"반역자이다! 경비원! 이 악당들을 추격하라!\" {n}상사는 칼을 뽑고 당신의 엄호을 요청합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0075_Text_String
msgctxt "42bb69f2-9296-4f42-b406-7d31208c1b92"
msgid ""
"{n}Walsh Celvoway looks at Talwyn and Eimar with disappointment.{/n} \"Ah, "
"behold the traitors that can hide in our midst, people of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}"
". Remember always that King Irovetti's forces are here to protect you "
"against villains like these two. Go about your business — justice is served."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}월시 켈보웨이는 탈윈과 이마르를 실망스럽게 바라봅니다.{/n} \"아. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 백성 가운데 숨어있는 "
"배신자들을 보아라. 이로베티의 군대가 이 두 사람과 같은 악당들로부터 우리를 보호하기 위해 항상 존재한다는 것을 잊지 말아라. 임무를 "
"수행해라. 정의가 실현되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0078_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9344aa6e-ab1f-45f0-9915-5fd8a9270683"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar smiles appreciatively.{/n} \"You tricked this sucker into "
"betraying {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} and then let him be beaten by his own men? Now "
"that's a clever move if I've ever seen one! Keep up the good work, you "
"magnificent bastard!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 감사한 듯 웃습니다.{/n} \"너는 이 녀석을 속여서 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 배신하게 하고 자기 부하들에게 "
"공격 당하도록 두어? 내가 이제까지 본 것이 그것이라면 영리한 행동이었다! 하던 일 계속해라. 개자식아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0084_Text
#. Speaker : JhofreVascari
msgctxt "3a1918ce-8493-42a7-8ef6-2c8eec57fda1"
msgid "\"{mf|He|She} may let you leave, but I do not. For the Riversong!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|그|그녀}가 너를 보내줄 지도 모르지만 나는 그렇지 않아. 리버송을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0085_Text
#. Speaker : RenshalaVascari
msgctxt "0161b89d-7596-4fe4-b8c4-73ca0e5f2335"
msgid "\"{mf|He|She} may let you leave, but I do not. For the Riversong!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|그|그녀}가 너를 보내줄 지도 모르지만 나는 그렇지 않아. 리버송을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0086_Text
msgctxt "71352da2-d698-4be0-9c81-5aadc5c72227"
msgid ""
"\"You call this justice, Walsh? Fine. I will comply.\" {n}Jhofre looks you "
"in the eye.{/n} \"I hope we'll never see each other again. For your own sake."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이걸 정의라 부르는 거야? 월시? 좋아. 따르지.\" {n}조프리는 당신 눈을 봅니다.{/n} \"우리가 서로를 다시는 볼 수 없길 "
"바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "23e3bbf7-0db9-4aaa-9bac-8a93192fdcdf"
msgid ""
"\"You call this justice, Walsh? Fine. I will comply.\" {n}Renshala looks you "
"in the eye.{/n} \"I hope we'll never see each other again. For your own sake."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"이걸 정의라 부르는 거야? 월시? 좋아. 따르지.\" {n}린샬라는 당신 눈을 봅니다.{/n} \"우리가 서로를 다시는 볼 수 없길 "
"바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0090_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "e68a63fd-f886-481f-8016-9ba76d9391e7"
msgid ""
"\"Familiar rhetoric. Take care, {Name} — when it comes to juggling with "
"words, judges are the best. He'll do anything to smear you and use the law "
"as a shield.\""
msgstr ""
"\"익숙한 수사학이군. 조심해. {Name}. 말만 늘어놓는 일은 판사가 가장 잘하지. 그는 법을 방패로 사용하고 너를 치기 위해 "
"무엇이든 할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Cue_0091_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "0f866ed9-e8c5-486e-8ea6-368a3c904a9f"
msgid ""
"\"The traitorous poet should be escorted to the gallows, with a loop in the "
"noose for every lie. That's the sort of show I'd gladly watch from the front "
"row!\""
msgstr "\"반란자 시인 녀석은 거짓말이 들통나서 목에 올가미를 매고 교수대로 가야 해. 나는 맨 앞 줄에서 구경하고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Items/BardBattlePamphlet_name_String
msgctxt "b9f0257f-f4d5-4ca6-aca4-c35445f5efbf"
msgid "\"Bard Battle of the Century!\""
msgstr "\"세기의 음유시인 대결입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Items/BardBattlePamphlet_text_String
msgctxt "91e17bb3-58df-48f7-a573-70e17117ca59"
msgid ""
"\"Bard Battle of the Century!\n"
"Unrivaled Annamede Belavarah to share stage with two foreign stars!\n"
"Annamede's adversaries:\n"
"Maestro Ranunculus, the silver-tongued heart-stealer from faraway lands! "
"Performs love lyrics and historical sketches.\n"
"K.R., the towering troll bard from across the sea! Performs a set of ballads "
"about his travels in mysterious, ancient dungeons.\n"
"Event sponsored by Pitax City's esteemed magistrate. For tickets, contact "
"your town hall representatives.\""
msgstr ""
"\"세기의 음유시인 대결입니다! \n"
"비교할 수 없는 안나메데 빌라바라는 2명의 이방인 음유시인과 무대를 나눈다! \n"
"안나메데의 적수:\n"
"머나 먼 곳에서 와 세치의 혀로 마음을 훔치는 마에스트로 라눈쿨루스! 애정을 담은 가사와 장엄한 서사에 탁월합니다. \n"
"K.R.은 바다 건너에서 온 음유시인입니다! 신비한 고대 던전에서의 여행을 이야기로 담은 노래를 연주합니다. \n"
"피탁스 도시의 존경하는 치안 판사가 후원하는 행사입니다. 표는 시의회 담당자에게 문의하십시오. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Items/FalseJustice_desc_String
msgctxt "42587837-4556-4a01-a7b2-2719521828b1"
msgid "Favorite weapon of Walsh Celvoway, the notorious Pitax magistrate."
msgstr "악명 높은 피탁스의 치안 판사인 월시 켈보웨이가 가장 좋아하는 무기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Items/FalseJustice_name_String
msgctxt "946c7202-2fac-4b00-8ade-aa9e0f998ae4"
msgid "False Justice"
msgstr "거짓 정의"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Items/RiversongAmulet_desc_String
msgctxt "1ce4668a-4a2e-4b41-b594-97d8766a8ae9"
msgid "An elegant amulet that belonged to the Vascari Trade house."
msgstr "바스카리 무역소의 일원임을 증명하는 우아한 목걸이."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Items/RiversongAmulet_name_String
msgctxt "c48be29c-cf3d-4efe-b3ea-4a5c15da8452"
msgid "Riversong Amulet"
msgstr "리버송 목걸이"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Items/TalwynArmor_desc_String
msgctxt "4635365f-6880-4ff4-b82d-d6e7cfe59027"
msgid "The armor Talwyn was wearing before he became a Pitax guardsman."
msgstr "탈윈이 피탁스 경비원이 되기 전에 입고 다녔던 갑옷."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Items/TalwynArmor_name_String
msgctxt "7a1a6a36-af0c-4d29-a07f-7d8af8a53497"
msgid "Talwyn's Armor"
msgstr "탈윈의 갑옷"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Redemption_WalshDead/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "0b5637d7-de88-4bb6-b441-705925b5f355"
msgid ""
"{n}As Eimar and Talwyn depart, Jhofre approaches you.{/n} \"I would be "
"overjoyed if not the deaths of my people, and my sister. However, thanks to "
"you, justice was served. This makes us even.\" {n}He gives you a shallow bow "
"and then departs for the docks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르와 탈윈이 떠나고 조프리가 당신에게 접근합니다.{/n} \"국민과 여동생의 죽음이 아니었더라면 더할 나위 없었겠지만 네 덕분에 "
"정의가 실현되었다. {n}그는 당신에게 가벼운 인사를 건네며 부두로 출발합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Redemption_WalshDead/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "4938fde8-735b-4b47-868b-9b36f1211bcf"
msgid ""
"{n}As Eimar and Talwyn depart, Renshala approaches you.{/n} \"We may not "
"have met under the best circumstances, yet I think I understand why your "
"people respect you. What you just witnessed was King Irovetti's idea of "
"justice. I don't care for it at all. Please, take this amulet. It will let "
"the others of my family know that you are a friend.\" {n}She gives you a "
"shallow bow and then departs for the docks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르과 탈윈가 떠나고 린샬라가 당신에게 접근합니다.{/n} \"최악의 상황에서 만났을 지 모르지만 네 사람들이 왜 너를 존경하는지 "
"이해할 수 있을 것 같아. 네가 목격 한 것은 이로베티 왕의 정의였어. 나는 그것을 전혀 신경 쓰지 않는다. 이 목걸이를 받아줘. 우리 "
"가족의 일원들이 네가 친구라는 것을 알게 될 거야.\" {n}그녀는 당신에게 가벼운 인사를 하고 부두로 출발합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/Redemption_WalshDead/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "3c2d8794-6675-4a88-86bb-9589c46da853"
msgid ""
"{n}As Eimar and Talwyn depart, Renshala approaches you.{/n} \"I would be "
"overjoyed if not the deaths of my people. However, thanks to you, justice "
"was served. This makes us even.\" {n}She gives you a shallow bow and then "
"departs for the docks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르와 탈윈이 떠나고 린샬라가 당신에게 접근합니다.{/n} \"우리 국민의 죽음이 아니었더라면 더할 나위 없었겠지만 네 덕분에 "
"정의가 실현되었다. {n}그는 당신에게 가벼운 인사를 건네며 부두로 출발합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/RedemtionBarks/EimarEscapes_String
msgctxt "b3e4324b-de27-4bd9-b7fa-b1de32858274"
msgid "\"Talwyn, forgive me. What have I done!\""
msgstr "\"탈윈 내가 한 짓을 용서해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/RedemtionBarks/RenshalaJhofreAttack_String
msgctxt "2a4d734d-133b-4fbe-b63f-c5ac02153055"
msgid "\"To me, Riversong!\""
msgstr "\"리버송이여 내게 오라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Redemption/RedemtionBarks/WalshAttack_String
msgctxt "b027d8d6-8a1d-4d44-b53f-c064453e6b54"
msgid "\"Guards! Protect me!\""
msgstr "\"경비원! 나를 보호해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ecf19f08-bf23-4b81-ad32-9f0c9f9fc0e3"
msgid "\"Looks like it. Irovetti has played me.\""
msgstr "\"그런 것처럼 보이네. 이로베티가 나를 속였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "80b6c8c9-6cf9-42d7-88ab-a31507c9e40a"
msgid ""
"\"You're right about one thing. Only one monarch will hold their crown by "
"day's end. But it won't be Irovetti!\""
msgstr "\"한가지는 맞았군. 오늘이 지나면 오직 한 명의 군주만 남을 것이다. 그러나 그것은 이로베티가 아닐테지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "77b64bfa-c307-4ce4-86eb-c7687bd60e1a"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I don't understand why you're still alive. It's time to fix that "
"mistake!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"왜 네가 아직 살아 있는지 이해하지 못하겠군. 내 실수를 바로 잡을 때구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "eff275cf-8800-4d20-84fb-fd3768f65ad4"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "590e9425-763f-4ce7-bfd5-e3842d0b97bd"
msgid "\"How are things in Pitax?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스는 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "7e98ec78-b2c9-4e7a-bb32-314457bfb8a0"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "907c037e-0840-4ba9-9d5d-db44d151cdc8"
msgid "\"How are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"잘 지내?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "87b5a457-4346-4775-ae16-19211681b77a"
msgid ""
"\"If you knew what I know, you wouldn't stay loyal to Irovetti for long. Let "
"me tell you something...\""
msgstr "\"내가 아는 것을 네가 알면, 더 이상 이로베티에게 충성하지 못할거다. 그래서 말인데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "9fe99fa0-3fa3-473a-befb-bcbb3b5c129a"
msgid ""
"\"So, we reach the climax of your tale at last. Admitting {mf|his|her} "
"failure, the brave, but alas, inept ruler delivers {mf|his|her} crown into "
"the hands of {mf|his|her} wise old friend... At least that's how they'll "
"write about it in the chronicles – and we both know that's the only thing "
"that matters. You aren't the first — and you won't be the last — to lose all "
"you possess to my master. But I must admit, you were a worthy adversary.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 마침내 이야기의 절정에 이르렀군. 용감한 {mf|그|그녀}의 실패는 인정하겠지만, 아아, 부적절한 통치자가 {mf|그|그녀}의 "
"왕관을 {mf|그|그녀}의 현명한 오랜 친구에게 넘기는구나... 최소한 그들은 연대기에 이렇게 쓰겠지 – 그리고 우리 모두 그것이 "
"중요하다는 것을 알고 있네. 나의 주인에 의해 자기가 가진 모든 것을 잃는 사람은 당신이 처음이 아니지, 그리고 마지막도 아닐거야. "
"하지만 나는 당신이 훌륭한 적수였음을 인정하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "6bab3ef1-43e0-465f-9cc2-81bb3435e3b5"
msgid "\"Go, now. My King is waiting.\""
msgstr "\"가라. 왕께서 기다리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "baaca7ce-740e-44c1-9b91-ead48066fe11"
msgid ""
"\"You simply won't give up, even to the bitter end. How amusing. Well, we "
"shall see who prevails!\""
msgstr "\"결말이 나빠도 쉽게 포기하지 않는구나. 재미 있군. 누가 우승하는지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "498901f3-b39d-4902-92f9-02965b299504"
msgid ""
"\"There is nothing shameful about admitting defeat. On the contrary, it "
"shows true wisdom!\""
msgstr "\"패배를 인정하는 것은 부끄러운 일이 아닙니다. 오히려 지혜를 보여주죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "5200633b-a5a7-4363-85a3-39d7f95e7777"
msgid "\"Waste no more time talking to me. His Highness Irovetti is waiting!\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 시간 낭비하지 마라. 이로베티 전하가 기다리고 계신다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "07b9c3bb-930f-4859-af2a-6393c403cbf6"
msgid ""
"{n}Moskoni has gained much weight, and his clothes look more lavish than "
"ever. He's twirling his slick mustache with a contented look, and greets you "
"with a formal bow.{/n} \"Your Highness! Welcome to loyal {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}모스코니는 더 살이 쪘고, 그의 옷은 그 어느 때 보다 호화로워 보입니다. 그는 만족스러운 표정으로 매끈한 콧수염을 꼬으며 공식적인 "
"인사를 합니다.{/n} \"전하! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 오신 것을 환영합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "3d4ac1dc-c11e-4d94-bd49-8b8d001684eb"
msgid ""
"{n}Moskoni has lost some weight, and his suit looks rather less lavish than "
"before. But his face is still impeccably powdered, and mustache and hair "
"properly slicked down. He greets you with a friendly chuckle.{/n} \"My "
"{mf|King|Queen}! I never thought I'd address anyone so, besides Irovetti, "
"may he rest in peace!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}모스코니는 약간 살이 빠졌고, 그의 옷은 이전보다 덜 호화로워 보입니다. 그러나 그의 얼굴은 완벽하게 분칠이 되어있고, 콧수염과 "
"머리카락은 적절하게 매만졌습니다. 그는 당신에게 친절하게 웃으며 인사합니다.{/n} \"{mf|왕|여왕} 전하! 제가 이로베티가 아닌 "
"사람에게 인사할 줄은 몰랐습니다. 삼가 고인의 명복을 빕니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "3b9fe229-0588-4893-b39a-dd317e177dd2"
msgid ""
"\"Surprisingly quiet. I managed to settle the property disputes between the "
"old families and the thieves' guild. No one came out happy, but no one was "
"offended enough to start a riot either. Of course, many assets are yet to "
"change hands, and many will be found floating in the bay, or never found at "
"all... But in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} that's the way of things.\""
msgstr ""
"\"놀랍게도 조용합니다. 나는 오래된 가문과 도둑 길드 사이의 재산 분쟁을 해결했습니다. 아무도 행복하지 않았지만 폭동을 일으킬 만큼 "
"불편한 사람은 없었습니다. 물론 많은 자산은 아직 처리해야 하고 상당량이 돌려받지 못하거나 되찾지 못할 겁니다... 그러나 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서는 그것이 옳은 방식입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "9fcd3d06-9e2f-40ef-9a09-9b7801538d02"
msgid ""
"\"A sharp mind and a steady hand will always profit in this city! Praise the "
"goddess, in my work for Irovetti I gained not only enemies, but also "
"friends... By the way, you fooled us all so brilliantly! Who else could have "
"defeated Irovetti at his own game?\""
msgstr ""
"\"날카로운 정신과 부지런한 손길은 항상 이 도시에서 이익을 가져다 줄 것입니다! 신께서 보우하사, 이로베티를 위해 일하면서, 저는 적뿐 "
"아니라 친구도 얻었습니다... 그건 그렇고, 넌 우리 모두를 아주 잘 속였어! 그 누가 이로베티의 판 위에서 그를 물리칠 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "3f6cafbb-da70-49bb-9597-929e0aba39f5"
msgid "\"Have a safe journey, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"안전한 여행을 보내십시오. 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "0fc9f816-1702-4d5f-80c1-858198a6aab0"
msgid "\"You wish to duel? I'm happy to oblige!\""
msgstr "\"결투하고 싶나? 기꺼이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "be5b1cfe-73f5-4dcf-a5bc-c8c574204d51"
msgid ""
"\"Don't waste your breath. I already know everything that you know, and more "
"besides. You can't convince me to join you, with flattery or threats, or any "
"shocking scandal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간 낭비하지 마라. 나는 이미 네가 알고 있는 것보다 많이 알고 있다. 너는 아첨이나 협박, 충격적인 스캔들로 너와 함께하도록 설득 "
"할 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "fef149b4-3af9-4643-9ca1-9c85b0567108"
msgid ""
"\"Almost like in the old days, before Irovetti laid his hands upon the city —"
" may he rest in peace. The old families retrieved their former property "
"almost peacefully, and the thieves' guild went deep underground. It's as if "
"everyone has recovered from their hangover after a years-long party, and "
"they're now trying to start their lives over.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티가 도시에 마수를 뻗기 전, 그 옛날과 거의 같습니다. 그가 평온히 쉬길. 오래된 가문들은 예전의 재산을 피흘리지 않고 "
"되찾았고, 도둑 길드는 지하 깊숙히 숨었습니다. 몇 년간의 잔치로 인한 숙취가 풀리는 것처럼, 이제 그들의 삶을 시작하려고 애 쓰고 있죠."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "2ac1a801-a2e1-41a3-8d4e-22fb7f409a86"
msgid ""
"\"Kharne Vereel is a strange fellow, of course, but he's a fine businessman —"
" especially when he takes a break from his poison for a day or two. The "
"thieves' guild brought down the old families for good, and have achieved "
"fabulous profits. But of course you know all that — you take the lion's "
"share. Though the city pays a heavy price. Alas, especially the young. "
"They're simply incapable of withstanding the temptation. Even "
"{g|Starfall}Starfall{/g} seems to use fewer bloodbush extract than "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"칸 베릴은 물론 이상한 동료이지만 훌륭한 사업가이기도 합니다. 특히 하루나 이틀 동안 독으로부터 휴식을 취할 때 말이지. 도둑 길드는 "
"옛 가문들을 제압했고 엄청난 이익을 가져갔습니다. 물론 당신께선 모두 알고 계시겠죠 — 가장 큰 몫을 챙기셨으니. 도시 전체가 값비싼 "
"대가를 치렀더라도 말입니다. 아아, 특히 젊은 사람이 그렇죠. 그들은 유혹에 견딜 수 없습니다. 심지어 {g|Starfall}스타폴{/g}"
"이 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}보다 더 적은 핏자루 추출물을 사용하는 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "1039f6d4-8a53-4c16-9a3a-2e2c592325e1"
msgid ""
"\"I won't lie to you, Your Highness, things are very bad. In disbanding the "
"guard you did terrible harm to the city. It will take years to form a "
"replacement that's loyal to you, and there's already open war in the "
"streets, to say the least. The trade houses and the thieves' guild are "
"slitting each other's throats. We see explosions, fires, fights — that's "
"daily life now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말은 하지 않겠습니다, 전하. 상황이 매우 나쁩니다. 경비대 해산으로 인해, 당신은 도시에 끔찍한 해를 끼쳤습니다. 충성스러운 "
"수하를 만드는 데 수 년이 걸릴거고, 이미 거리에서 열린 전쟁은 빙산의 일각이죠. 무역 회사와 도둑 길드가 서로를 죽이고 있습니다. "
"폭발, 화재, 싸움은 이제 일상이고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/DrunkPirate_1_String
msgctxt "914ca197-7fea-4f2f-a885-80c7e1efed07"
msgid ""
"\"Where's that tavern keeper?! I'll get... He'll get... Oh, never mind...\""
msgstr "\"선술집 주인은 어디 있지?! 나는 가질 거야... 그도... 아, 신경 쓰지 마...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/DrunkPirate_2_String
msgctxt "f3becb35-6bd4-42c9-b1e2-9a8d0b1dcdb3"
msgid "\"Why's the deck so slanted? Brothers, it's a storm!\""
msgstr "\"갑판은 왜 그렇게 기울어져 있지? 폭풍이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/DrunkPirate_3_String
msgctxt "dc7c397d-e47f-49b5-bf82-57552e42c7ff"
msgid ""
"\"I'll board this bottle! I don't take prisoners! Beware of Calis, the most "
"dangerous pirate of all the seas!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 배에 탈 것이다. 나는 포로를 잡지 않는다! 모든 바다에서 가장 위험한 해적인 칼리스를 조심하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/DrunkPirate_4_String
msgctxt "bed2e55f-6332-4262-80d5-5aba8013ef97"
msgid ""
"\"All the rum is stored behind that locked door. Let's bring in a cannon "
"from the ship. A single shot, and the rum is ours!\""
msgstr "\"모든 럼은 잠긴 문 뒤에 보관되어 있다. 배에서 대포를 가져와라. 한 발 쏘고 나면 럼은 우리 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/DrunkPirate_5_String
msgctxt "02b4b757-f961-4729-b132-fa467a9c4486"
msgid ""
"\"Let me show you a trick. I need a sword, four candles, an apple and a "
"monkey. Hey, Babarm, bring in the monkey!\""
msgstr "\"너에게 속임수를 보여주지. 검, 양초, 사과, 원숭이가 필요해. 이봐. Babarm. 원숭이 가져와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/DrunkPirate_6_String
msgctxt "3e180c77-395e-41d4-a6be-d339a09dc782"
msgid ""
"\"Brothers, where's Blutmond? We've lost Blutmond! The guards got him! "
"Prepare to breach the prison! Oh… there he is.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 블러트먼드은 어디있어? 블러트먼드를 잃어 버렸어! 경비원이 그를 잡았구나! 교도소 털 준비해라! 오... 저기 있군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/PirateFight_1_String
msgctxt "d4108d76-95ac-4680-8ffd-8169a0804416"
msgid "\"Damned landlubber! I'll show you how we sailors fight!\""
msgstr "\"망할 땅개들! 선원들이 어떻게 싸우는지 보여주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/PirateFight_2_String
msgctxt "437832e1-a122-4ffa-a9c1-70d96aad8dbf"
msgid "\"Shagnak, come here! Cover my back!\""
msgstr "\"샤그낙. 이리와! 엄호해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/PirateFight_3_String
msgctxt "73d6b386-9462-4a9b-b4c7-09158f89b04e"
msgid "\"Chaaaaarge! For gold and adventure!\""
msgstr "\"돌겨어억! 금과 모험을 위해서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Barks/PirateFight_4_String
msgctxt "6307fea0-c88a-4443-bee4-7be9b7f7c9c1"
msgid "\"Dump them overboard. Give the sharks something to chew on!\""
msgstr "\"배 밖으로 던져 버려. 상어밥으로 줘버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "707368a3-08c3-4fd2-9d00-7e39cf43145d"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "2ccc35d2-b751-441a-8e69-84e6a4f1326b"
msgid "\"Why are you sitting here alone?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기 혼자 앉아 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "fd34afc5-34ad-41cf-8988-a3a4f7240746"
msgid "\"What do you think of your stay ashore?\""
msgstr "\"해변에 머무르는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f41a2f88-be92-47ab-a659-a185492d934c"
msgid ""
"\"You talk about Blakemoor with such confidence – do you know him well?\""
msgstr "\"어디서 그런 확신으로 블레이크무어에 대해 이야기하지? 그를 잘 아나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "71628840-1d43-4433-b807-1be16fa9e1ac"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b5aa3e9f-c6d3-4cee-bb10-6943b4169ef8"
msgid "\"Because I will help you set sail again.\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 다시 항해할 수 있게 도와줄 테니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "b7897405-8873-46cc-9508-cb26d95b641c"
msgid "\"Because otherwise I'll turn you in to Wellar.\""
msgstr "\"그렇지 않으면 나는 너를 웰라에게 넘길 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "afffbcb0-cb93-44fd-9880-31d0943c21ce"
msgid "\"Because my gold is looking for a new owner. Ten thousand coins.\""
msgstr "\"내 금이 새로운 주인을 찾고 있기 때문이지. 동전 일만개다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "e623fee4-27ab-47a1-b8bd-addfd863a40f"
msgid "\"Where does he live?\""
msgstr "\"그는 어디에서 살지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "5a029c9e-617f-4940-b16b-8685e0e61c62"
msgid "\"Give me the key.\""
msgstr "\"열쇠를 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "61d825f5-a1bf-4a93-b4ad-8a29dd2d7a24"
msgid "\"Because you don't want to die of old age in this tavern.\""
msgstr "\"주점에서 늙어 죽고 싶지 않을 테지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "5399d60c-48bd-482a-8af3-539b3d66be7a"
msgid ""
"\"Because the crew is drunk and they won't notice if I break your neck.\""
msgstr "\"선원이 술에 취해있고 너의 목을 부러뜨리면 그들은 눈치 채지 못할 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "fc3655d5-e6cb-4fde-8dc7-fecf9d556168"
msgid "\"I'm ready to pay. Ten thousand.\""
msgstr "\"나는 지불 할 준비가 되어있다. 동전 1만개 받아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "d5970d8e-3966-4b5a-8768-41906b179a63"
msgid "\"Understood.\""
msgstr "\"이해했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "9abe966d-b1af-4194-9417-e754087e121a"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're insolent. And you'll pay for that.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"건방지구나. 대가를 치르게 해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Answer_0046_Text_String
msgctxt "abe8be72-9e0b-48e9-91c4-a1e99e907894"
msgid "\"We'll return to this later.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 나중에 이것으로 돌아갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "bd51b4bc-4b35-4bb2-88d5-d046575b1631"
msgid ""
"{n}A grim man with long brown hair and an unpleasant face is drinking in the "
"corner, alone. He doesn't seem to be pleased with your attention.{/n} \"What "
"do you want, {mf|mister|missy}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}긴 갈색 머리와 불쾌한 얼굴을 가진 음침한 사람은 혼자서 마시고 있습니다. 그는 당신의 관심에 기뻐하지 않는 것 같습니다.{/n} "
"\"무엇을 원하지? {mf|아저씨|아가씨}?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "e26946fc-29d5-46fb-9fda-854ac0719f37"
msgid ""
"\"And who are you? I'm a pirate. A sailor on the Prestigious. Just a sailor. "
"Sailor Blutmond, if it pleases you. Satisfied?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 너는 누구냐? 나는 해적이다. 권위자 호의 선원이지. 그래 그냥 선원이야. 선원 블러트먼드라고. 됐냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "01922f57-9dc3-4b1b-ad16-3a6b58603bb6"
msgid ""
"\"Because I don't need company. That's a hint, in case you didn't notice.\" "
"{n}The sailor sighs heavily.{/n} \"Why is it, that when a person drinks "
"alone, everyone wants to join him? Over there, there's a whole crew of "
"sailors, eager to share their tales...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 동료가 필요 없기 때문이지. 눈치 채지 못했을 까봐 말해주는 거다.\" {n}선원은 무겁게 탄식합니다.{/n} \"왜 사람이 "
"혼자서 술을 마실 때 모두 합류시키려 안달이지? 그곳에는 선원들 전체가 그들의 이야기를 나누고는 했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "030a905f-13c8-4b9c-80fd-dbaad8d7b1c7"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha! We should never have relied on Blakemoor's punctuality. He's a "
"special person, that one. But never expect him to know what time it is. As "
"for me, I don't care so long as there's enough beer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하! 우리는 블레이크무어의 시간 관념에 의지해서는 안된다. 그는 특별하고 유일한 사람이지. 하지만 그 사람이 시간을 알고 있기를 "
"결코 기대하지 마라. 나에게는 충분한 맥주가 있는 한 신경 쓰지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "4bc91873-193a-4ad7-94c1-bbdd9ffb7949"
msgid ""
"{n}Blutmond winces, realizing that he's said more than he intended.{/n} \"By "
"the kraken! Okay, just stop yelling ... please lower your voice, "
"{mf|mister|missy}. I'll tell you, but it's just between the two of us, okay? "
"I was Blakemoor's apprentice after I replaced his former servant – a deaf-"
"mute kobold. I used to visit him. He even gave me the key to his hideout. "
"But now some of them, mostly First Mate Wellar, are angry with Blakemoor. If "
"they find out that I'm friends with him, they'll pay him a visit and take "
"that stupid book. And Blakemoor... he very much dislikes intrusions.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}블러트먼드는 그가 의도한 것보다 더 많이 말했습니다.{/n} \"크라켄에게 말이지! 그만 소리질러... 목소리를 낮춰. "
"{mf|아저씨|아가씨}. 비밀을 말할게. 하지만 우리 둘 사이에 비밀이야. 알았지? 나는 이전의 도제인 귀머거리 불구 코볼트 대신에 "
"블레이크무어의 도제를 했지. 나는 그를 가끔 방문했어. 그는 나에게 아지트 열쇠를 주었고. 하지만 동료가 몇으로 늘어났고 일등 항해사 "
"웰라는 블레이크무어에게 화가 나있어. 내가 그와 친구라는 것을 알게 되면 그에게 가서 그 바보 같은 책을 가져갈 거야. 그리고 "
"블레이크무어는... 침입을 매우 싫어하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "5d505b1c-7361-4b06-8066-598df9475077"
msgid "{n}Blutmond takes the gold with a lazy gesture.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}블러트먼드는 게으른 몸짓으로 금을 가져갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "2092e3d1-a701-47c2-94b5-2f6cafa332bb"
msgid ""
"\"That's quite an offer! You rarely meet a stranger who cares so much about "
"your own concerns.\" {n}In the blink of an eye the sailor pulls out a map "
"and pokes it with his finger{/n} \"It's here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대단한 제안이군! 너의 관심사에 대해 신경 쓰는 낯선 사람을 거의 만날 수 없을 걸.\" {n}눈 깜짝 할 사이에 선원은 지도를 꺼내 "
"손가락으로 짚습니다.{/n} \"여기 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "61d0bf79-d8aa-452b-b603-54354848797e"
msgid "\"Nah. It's not bad in here. Plus, the stormy season is coming soon.\""
msgstr "\"쳇. 여기도 나쁘진 않아. 폭풍이 올 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "49b89cb3-57d6-4941-a9e5-5e5821f692ab"
msgid "\"Ah, yes.\""
msgstr "\"아. 그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "bd0b0d33-20e6-4d9d-b6ab-e1c6f2ff2620"
msgid ""
"\"And why should I tell you? Like I just said – Blakemoor doesn't like "
"guests.\""
msgstr "\"내가 왜 너에게 말해야 하지? 내가 방금 말했듯이 블레이크무어는 손님을 좋아하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "de25b0d2-c097-4bec-bbeb-4cc15f274567"
msgid "\"This is my key. Why would I give it to you, oh curious one?\""
msgstr "\"이건 내 열쇠야. 내가 왜 이걸 너한테 줘야하지?, 이 수상한 자식아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "f6977018-39a2-4d52-b1ef-7b7d5a015abb"
msgid "\"Oh, you're a clever one. Now can I drink my beer in peace?\""
msgstr "\"오. 너 참 똑똑하구나. 이제 맥주 좀 마시게 비키겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "9f93b039-bc32-4ec3-83e6-ab5ffe7208f6"
msgid ""
"{n}In a single movement, Blutmond manages to take your money and leave the "
"key in its place, though a second ago his hands were quite empty.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}한 번의 움직임으로 블러트먼드는 돈을 가지고 그 자리에 열쇠를 남겨 두었습니다. 그러나 그의 손에는 아무것도 없었는데 "
"말입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "1c165c78-1ee4-4344-86c1-6df96131b6bb"
msgid ""
"\"That's an interesting argument. It's true, I'd prefer to die at sea.\" {n}"
"Blutmond gives you the key.{/n}"
msgstr "\"흥미로운 논쟁이다. 사실 나는 바다에서 죽고자 하지.\" {n}블러트먼드가 당신에게 열쇠를 줍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "783dc0f4-0e3e-46c9-a751-7217df180a16"
msgid ""
"\"I was told by circus fortune-teller that I would die at sea, during a "
"storm. It's calm today. So I'll live for now.\""
msgstr "\"서커스 점쟁이가 나는 폭풍우에 바다에서 죽을 것이라는 말을 했지. 오늘은 평화로운 날이야. 그래서 지금은 살 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "26dc34e3-8789-42d0-99e2-637e136df1d4"
msgid ""
"\"And I'll tell the captain that you're looking for Blakemoor so you can "
"take that crappy folio for yourself. I'm sure he'll be delighted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 나는 선장에게 네가 블레이크무어를 찾고 있다는 것을 알려줄 테니 너는 진절머리 나는 Folio를 가져가. 나는 그가 기뻐할 "
"것이라고 확신해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "fe9f7d47-b698-4e72-b992-792b2200170a"
msgid ""
"{n}Blutmond pulls out a map again, and insistently points at it with an "
"unclean fingernail.{/n} \"I already showed you, it's here. You want me to "
"draw an X? Or a skull and cross-bones?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}블러트먼드는 도를 다시 꺼내어 더러운 손톱으로 굳게 지목합니다.{/n} \"나는 이미 너에게 보여줬다. 여기 있다. 내가 X를 "
"그려줄까? 아니면 해골을 그려달라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "9edd264b-91ab-4583-9927-a1c490855620"
msgid "\"Hey! Guys! We're under attack! Stand your ground!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 우리는 공격 받고 있다! 자리를 지켜!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0047_Text_String
msgctxt "9963878b-c677-4b91-9f11-56031b3b4793"
msgid "{n}Blutmond shrugs.{/n} \"I don't think anything will be different.\""
msgstr "{n}블러트먼드는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"나는 다른 무엇이 될 것이라고 생각하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Blutmond/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "34e9e792-34d2-498a-a4cd-58cef6b91a44"
msgid "\"Whatever you say. We aren't going anywhere soon.\""
msgstr "\"네가 뭐라 하든. 우리는 조만간 아무데도 가지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ebe1477f-9210-4aaf-863d-99da149be55d"
msgid "\"I've never heard of you. Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 소문을 들어본 적이 없어. 너 누구냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "88807303-6333-4c2f-8f00-672c29c11f18"
msgid "Told Captain Martyn about Wellar's mutiny."
msgstr "웰라의 반란에 대해 마르틴 선장에게 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0eb0e352-ea06-4ca6-81b1-91173001bad6"
msgid "\"Your First Mate, Wellar, is planning a mutiny.\""
msgstr "\"네 일등 항해사 웰라가 반란을 계획하고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "7af49a14-23b5-42d0-96ca-e7a2fe46dc0e"
msgid "\"Tell me about your crew.\""
msgstr "\"선원에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "2140f6e4-f00b-4598-81b3-fa0e20c73b76"
msgid ""
"\"You're a coward, not a captain. How long have you been sitting here "
"ashore? Is this what a real captain would do?\""
msgstr "\"너는 겁쟁이야. 선장이 아니라. 얼마나 오래 해변가에 머물러 있었지? 그러고도 진짜 선장인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "745b3315-b804-4ec8-94ce-0821dbafe313"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! You're just an idiot in a stupid hat! A true captain must be stern and "
"bloodthirsty, and you're just a loud mouth.\""
msgstr "\"하하! 너는 바보 같은 모자를 쓴 바보야! 진정한 선장은 억세고 피에 굶주려 있어야 하지만 너는 입만 큰 바보야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "da4754e0-5006-462c-8681-b782e1560109"
msgid ""
"\"I think it's Wellar who does the real captain's work here. You just "
"pretend to be the leader – and take all the credit for it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 진짜 선장은 웰라라고 생각한다. 너는 단지 리더가 되는 척하고 모든 공로를 앗아가지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "2cda37ee-5ab6-4314-bcef-21140fa46d0f"
msgid ""
"[Lie] \"Who are you trying to fool? Everybody knows that you're pocketing "
"the best part of the booty! Wellar told me everything!\""
msgstr ""
"[거짓말을 합니다] \"누구를 바보로 만들려고 하는 건가? 모두 네가 전리품의 가장 좋은 부분을 챙기고 있다는 것을 알고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "2eda3b94-3697-4465-92cf-4e6fe3d43609"
msgid ""
"\"What kind of booty are you talking about? Compared to the Free Captains "
"and the Andoran Corsairs, you look like real beggar.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 종류의 전리품을 말하는 거지? 자유 선장과 안도란 해적과 비교하면 너는 거지처럼 보인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "c5c007c5-fb2f-4494-b5c9-68cb2fe9eaf3"
msgid ""
"\"But you're much better dressed than they are. And the drink in your glass "
"is not the same vinegar your crew drinks!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 너는 훨씬 좋은 옷을 입고 있는데? 그리고 마시는 것도 너의 선원들이 마시는 식초 같은게 아니고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "092fbf09-c429-4b66-ae63-dac1f3b7bf03"
msgid ""
"\"Best not cross swords with me. Whoever touches Wellar is a dead man.\""
msgstr "\"나와 칼을 맞대지 않는 게 좋을 걸. 웰라를 건드리는 자는 누구든 죽은 사람이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "b05750fa-5910-4e96-bc65-9cb4338c77df"
msgid ""
"\"See how you've pushed your crew to the edge, Martyn! To the edge of "
"bloodshed and strife! They're prepared to kill each other because of you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 선원을 사지로 밀어 넣은 걸 봐라. 마르틴! 유혈과 투쟁이 난무하는 사지로! 그들은 너 때문에 서로를 죽일 준비가 되어있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "88387ac0-ebef-45a3-b385-ffef999cedf9"
msgid ""
"\"You spit upon your crew and the Pirate Code when you call that ship yours. "
"She belongs to the crew! Am I right?\""
msgstr "\"그 배를 네 것이라 불렀을 때 너는 네 선원과 해적의 명예에 침을 뱉었다. 배는 선원의 것이다! 내가 틀렸나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "87d525f1-a042-445c-b13c-69a7b71898bc"
msgid "\"That was a joke.\""
msgstr "\"농담이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0051_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "24d402a9-c869-4cd7-a9b4-18c4b1561c4b"
msgid "Picked a fight with the pirates in the Pitaxian tavern."
msgstr "피탁스 주점에서 해적들과 싸움을 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "a74237b6-c171-4ee1-b6a2-65091221aee2"
msgid "[Attack] \"You'll find out when I take that stupid hat off your head!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"네 머리에서 그 멍청한 모자를 벗길 때 알게 될 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "231ff97d-889a-4b6e-b14b-c0e2efdf6e97"
msgid "\"I have the grimoire. Take it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 흑마법서를 가지고 있다. 가져가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "4783de22-14cb-4a26-bfde-0eb7f02d1c85"
msgid ""
"\"I have the grimoire. And you may as well sail away. I'm not giving it to "
"you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 흑마법서을 가지고 있다. 그리고 너는 멀리 항해 할 수 있지. 나는 너에게 그것을 주지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "02eb32f5-dded-4469-9362-0d90911811ae"
msgid "\"On second thought, I don't really need this book.\""
msgstr "\"다시 생각해도 나는 이 책이 필요 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "f4f4b339-44b0-457e-8cb5-f5357943e1e7"
msgid "\"Take your gold, buy yourself a new hat.\""
msgstr "\"금을 가지고 가서 새 모자를 사라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0065_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ac131ded-82ef-4578-810d-76388e1cc614"
msgid "Stole the grimoire and picked a fight with the pirates."
msgstr "흑마법서를 훔쳤고 해적들과 싸웠습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "a785bfa3-ce80-477a-9ec7-510496bb5de1"
msgid "[Attack] \"You shouldn't have addressed me like that.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"너는 내게 모욕감을 줬어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0081_Text
msgctxt "556984fb-7275-40e3-8917-09f69d4bf840"
msgid "\"Forget it. It was just a stupid joke.\""
msgstr "\"잊어 버려. 그냥 바보 같은 농담이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0082_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fa71aa23-8e5a-4f59-885c-3c9bc33e66d5"
msgid "Picked a fight with the pirates in the Pitaxian tavern."
msgstr "피탁스 주점에서 해적들과 싸움을 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0082_Text
msgctxt "6a917196-57b3-4e42-a1d8-38b08af570c0"
msgid "[Attack] \"I was just looking for a good fight.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"나는 싸움을 찾고 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0087_Text
msgctxt "9ebacaf4-707c-4162-bfc1-fedf435c4ec6"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0088_Text
msgctxt "2d9270da-d43d-460e-b537-2e8583c590c9"
msgid "\"I have a question for you, as a ship captain and seafarer.\""
msgstr "\"선장과 선원으로서 네게 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0089_Text
msgctxt "a1d061ea-2ebd-4382-add8-6aac9bfa1c7b"
msgid "\"Get out of the city immediately.\""
msgstr "\"즉시 도시에서 나가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0090_Text
msgctxt "16150995-e924-4328-9c34-db2b769c81e9"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0092_Text
msgctxt "1280645e-d2cf-4f0e-86e6-8f804b772ae9"
msgid "\"Hand over command to Wellar before the crew hangs you.\""
msgstr "\"선원이 너를 교수형에 처하기 전에 지휘권을 넘겨라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0099_Text
msgctxt "e42e0f5f-189e-481d-903a-e22396cad5fa"
msgid "\"I'll listen to your stories later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 이야기를 듣지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0100_Text
msgctxt "466eb976-cb9d-496e-8e7e-9a812f81e64f"
msgid "\"Tell me about your travels.\""
msgstr "\"네 여행에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Answer_0111_Text
msgctxt "ca32ced7-45c2-46c6-aac4-accde3431835"
msgid ""
"\"I paid Blakemoor a visit. I don't think you'll see your grimoire any time "
"soon.\""
msgstr "\"나는 블레이크무어를 찾아갔다. 네 흑마법서를 다시는 보지 못할 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "cb92beeb-4b51-4786-81e5-a4f7c53309cb"
msgid ""
"{n}A tall, confident man stands before you, wearing a fancy hat and a "
"charming smile.{/n} \"Ah, visitors! And whom do I have the pleasure of "
"addressing? My name is Captain Martyn! There have been so few new faces in "
"the tavern recently... For some reason.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}멋진 모자를 쓰고 매력적인 미소를 지으며 키가 크고 자신감 있는 사람이 당신 앞에 서 있습니다.{/n} \"아. 방문객이군! 나를 "
"기쁘게 하는 너는 누구지? 내 이름은 마르틴 선장이다! 최근에 선술집에 새로운 얼굴이 거의 없었어... 사건이 있었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "d35f4aa4-cbb1-4aa5-907c-1f21afb01489"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, it's you again! What's the purpose of your visit? Would you like to "
"see the world as a crewmember aboard our humble vessel?\""
msgstr "\"아. 또 너군! 방문 목적은 무엇이지? 내 누추한 배에 타서 선원으로 세상을 보고 싶나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ae7c8d56-0e83-47c4-bc1f-4469322c431f"
msgid ""
"\"Haven't you heard? Perhaps you're not interested in art! I am the famous "
"Captain Martyn, commander of the pirate ship Prestigious! We are masterpiece "
"hunters, art thieves and welcome guests in the houses of collectors and "
"connoisseurs of beauty. I admit, King Irovetti himself hosted me at the "
"palace more than once, and he's always been satisfied with my gifts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"듣지 못했나? 아마도 너는 예술에 관심이 없나 보군! 나는 해적선 권위자 호의 선장 마르틴이다! 우리는 수집가들의 집과 귀중품 "
"애호가들을 도둑질하는 예술품 도둑이자 보물 사냥꾼이다. 이로베티 왕이 한 번 이상 궁전에서 나를 접대했고 그는 항상 내 선물에 만족하지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "3312e804-3a80-4f52-96c6-a982b932d5e8"
msgid ""
"\"We have a rendezvous with a most outstanding artist. But he... He's rather "
"late. My crew needs a way to blow off some steam, or their bloodthirst will "
"get the better of them. Is there any way you can help me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 가장 뛰어난 예술가와 만남을 가졌다. 하지만 그는... 그는 늦었어. 내 선원은 화를 풀지 않으면 피를 부를 거야.나를 "
"도와주겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "ebd292ce-9ad2-4288-9fa2-8f7de39eb311"
msgid ""
"\"That's a serious accusation. We take those quite seriously on the high "
"seas. Wellar! Get out here on the bridge!\""
msgstr "\"그건 심각한 비난이군. 우리는 그것들을 공해상에서 심각하게 받아 들인다. 웰라! 다리에서 나와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : FirstMateWellar
msgctxt "446e1599-c8ff-4414-850c-c709c47902e4"
msgid ""
"{n}Wellar looks at the captain, then at you, and his face darkens.{/n} \"You "
"blabbed? I thought I could trust you! Well, Captain, I'll stand and say that "
"you, bloody fishbone, are about to let the ship sink. The crew is getting "
"drunk while we sit doing nothing, and meanwhile the bottom of the ship is "
"getting covered in barnacles. I'm tired of this! I quit, Captain! I'm tired "
"of you, tired of your ship, tired of your crew, and tired of piracy all "
"over. I'll stay in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} and become an artist! Soon you'll see "
"that I was right, but then it'll be too late! Mark my words – we're living "
"in an age of decline and decadence!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}웰라는 선장을 보고 그 다음에는 당신을 보고는 얼굴이 어두워 집니다.{/n}\"말해버렸어? 너는 믿을 수 있다고 생각 했는데! "
"선장. 내가 말하건데 너 같은 개뼉다구는 배를 가라앉힐 거야. 우리가 아무것도 하지 않으면서 앉아 있을 때 선원은 술에 취했고 배 "
"밑바닥은 따개비로 지저분하게 덮였다고. 나는 지겨워! 나는 그만두겠어! 너도 지겹고 네 배도 지겹고 선원들도, 해적질하는 것도 모두 "
"지겨워. 나는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 정착해서 예술가가 되겠어! 곧 내가 옳았다는 것을 너는 알게 될 것이지만 그때는 너무 "
"늦었을 것이다! 내 말을 잊지 마. 우리는 쇠퇴하고 타락한 시대에 살고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "c9bd9780-21dd-489b-99a6-d1cb168dcfc3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you stinking bag of octopus guts! If you ever step foot on the deck of "
"The Prestigious again – I'll haul you under the keel, savvy?\" {n}The "
"captain turns to you, smiling, as if nothing had happened.{/n} \"Thank you "
"for reporting the insurgency. Interested in the position of First Mate? No? "
"Well, that's too bad! Then you must accept this modest gift – it's Wellar's "
"share for the grimoire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"냄새나고 비린 녀석! 만일 권위자 호의 갑판에 다시 발을 들인다면 너를 용골 아래에 묶어 놓을 거야! 알겠어?\" {n}선장은 "
"당신에게 돌아서며 아무 일도 없었던 것처럼 웃습니다.{/n} \"반란에 대한 정보를 주어 고맙다. 일등 항해사를 할 생각은 없나? "
"없다고? 어쩔 수 없지! 그렇다면 이 겸손한 선물을 받아줘. 흑마법서에 대한 웰라의 몫이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "ccef0b33-9007-4d89-95ff-f95836f64ec5"
msgid ""
"\"Well, farewell then! You can always find me again on this drunken sandbar. "
"Of course, until the east wind spirits us away! Ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 작별 인사하지! 술취한 모래톱에서 나를 언제든 만날 수 있어. 물론 동풍이 우리를 데려갈 때까지는 말이지! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "ab18fc67-0bc1-414d-9112-ba9c557e7bc9"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, our crew is a team of extraordinary ladies and gentlemen! Calis, that "
"elf, who was picking a fight so gracefully when you entered – he's a true "
"master of boarding fights. The senior sailor Shagnak is quite funny and "
"witty fellow like no one else. Of course, sometimes his orc half prevails, "
"and his tricks start posing a danger to others ... But everyone has some "
"flaws, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 우리 선원은 특별한 신사 숙녀지! 네가 들어 왔을 때 우아하게 싸우고 있던 엘프는 칼리스야. 그는 갑판 싸움의 진정한 대가이지. "
"선임 선원 샤그낙은 아주 재미 있고 재치있는 동료야. 물론 때로는 그의 오크 본능이 발동하면 다른 사람들이 위험해 지지기 시작하지... "
"그러나 사람들은 모두 몇 가지 결점이 있어. 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "023bd881-f82f-4921-a43c-b6e4eaadde58"
msgid ""
"{n}The pirates smile ravenously – your words have piqued their interest.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}해적들은 무서운 미소를 짓습니다. 당신의 말이 그들의 관심을 자극했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : CaptainMartyn
msgctxt "b91ddeb6-8750-4458-b7eb-47f80130ef3b"
msgid ""
"\"You think to turn my own crew against me? You will fail in that! Ahoy, sea "
"wolves, didn't I always look after you? Didn't I always make sure we get "
"glorious booty?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 선원이 나를 배반하도록 설득할 생각이었나? 너는 실패 할 거야! 이봐, 내가 항상 너희를 돌보지 않았나? 금은보화가 부족한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "6703f31b-6806-483d-8a88-127d2b4fb117"
msgid "{n}The pirates begin to murmur, looking angrily at the captain.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}해적들은 선장에게 화를 내며 불평하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "1c5148f9-ee25-46b0-bc01-2b5eab58bc51"
msgid ""
"{n}Martyn freezes, not knowing what to say. Silence falls for a moment, and "
"then one of the pirates hisses an incomprehensible sailor's swear through "
"his teeth. Martyn looks at the seamen around him, bewildered. The First Mate "
"makes a sign, and the captain – apparently now former-captain – is carted "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마르틴은 무엇을 말할 지 몰라 얼어 붙습니다. 침묵은 잠시 이어지고 해적들 중 한 명이 이빨 사이로 알아들을 수 없는 선원의 맹세가 "
"흘러나옵니다. 마르틴은 주위의 선원들을 보고 놀랍니다. 일등 항해사가 신호를 보내자 선장은 감금당합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : FirstMateWellar
msgctxt "5b4b5c66-3d4e-4dd1-84db-eb710ca54d07"
msgid ""
"{n}First Mate... now Captain Wellar shakes your hand emotionally.{/n} \"You"
"'ve saved The Prestigious! Now we can finally set sail like normal "
"pirates... Hold on, I remember what I promised. We'll put an end to our "
"careers as sea dogs, and become an honest merchant vessel. The Prestigious "
"will sail henceforth under your banner.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이제 선장이 된 일등 항해사 웰라는 기쁨을 감추지 못하고 당신의 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"네가 권위자 호를 구했다! 이제 우리는 "
"정상적인 해적처럼 항해 할 수있게 되었다... 나는 약속 한 것을 기억한다. 우리는 해적질을 끝내고 정직한 해상 무역인이 되겠다. 권위자 "
"호는 앞으로 너의 깃발을 달고 항해 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : CaptainMartyn
msgctxt "07b92a4b-ef25-41d7-bd4f-b3cd3739ee2a"
msgid ""
"{n}The pirates cast glances at you, gripping their weapons. Wellar looks at "
"you with a tragic expression. Martyn's voice is tense, and his hospitality "
"has disappeared.{/n} \"What was that? Would you like to explain yourself "
"before blood is shed?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}해적들이 당신을 쳐다 보며 무기를 쥡니다. 웰라는 비참한 표정으로 당신을 봅니다. 마르틴의 목소리는 긴장하며 환대가 "
"사라졌습니다.{/n} \"그게 뭐야? 설명하지 않으면 피를 볼 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0052_Text_String
msgctxt "d6f184f4-a423-43bf-b2e8-34b13fa611f0"
msgid ""
"{n}Captain Martyn draws his weapon with a spectacular flourish.{/n} \"Let's "
"fight, gentlemen!\""
msgstr "{n}마르틴 선장은 과장된 동작으로 칼을 뽑습니다.{/n} \"싸우자! 해적들아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "f383d475-710c-4caa-8a02-09cc1f9f48fd"
msgid ""
"{n}Silence falls for a few seconds, then the sailors explode in laughter. "
"The captain laughs louder than anyone.{/n} \"Ha! I love, I just love jokes "
"like that! On the tip of the knife, right? Walking on the edge! And Wellar "
"played along so well... The old devil! I've known you for so many years, and "
"I still don't know you well enough. I believed you, I confess! But don't do "
"it again!\" {n}Martyn threatens you with a finger.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}침묵이 몇 초간 흐르면서 선원들은 웃음이 터집니다. 선장은 누구보다 더 크게 웃습니다.{/n} \"하! 나는 그런 농담을 좋아해! "
"줄타기를 타듯 말이야. 가장자리를 걷는 것이지! 그리고 웰라 너도 말이야... 사악한 녀석! 나는 너를 오랫동안 알고 있었지만 아직도 "
"너를 잘 모르겠군. 나는 너를 믿었었어! 그러나 다시는 그러지 마라!\" {n}마르틴이 당신을 손가락으로 위협합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "16c7275b-405c-40c2-b7c3-087ba8089154"
msgid ""
"\"Finally! I simply don't know how to thank you! Please, accept this weapon "
"as a token of my gratitude! Of my twelve blades, this one is by far the "
"best, and my most cherished! Now it's time for us to meet new adventures. "
"First Mate, all hands on deck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마침내! 너무나 고맙군! 감사의 표시로 내 무기를 받아둬! 내 열 두개의 칼 중에서 이 칼이 가장 좋았고 내가 가장 소중히 여겼다! "
"이제 새로운 모험을 만날 차례다. 일등항해사와 전원 갑판으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "c1f5f1b4-3bb3-4486-8244-012dcc98c3ee"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, no. I have already spent too much time on this, so it'll be going my "
"way: you can buy the book on my terms, for a hundred thousand gold – or hand "
"the grimoire over, right now!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안돼. 이미 너무 많은 시간을 들여서 내 방식대로 진행할 거야. 내 조건에 따라 10만 골드에 이 책을 사거나 흑마법서를 넘겨!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "a80e4f42-4ff3-4fe7-9977-4f5c20f2b846"
msgid ""
"{n}The captain winks at you.{/n} \"A wise decision. I'm glad to have met "
"you. Thank you for the book. And as for a reward – I'll forgive your "
"impudence and let you live!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}선장이 당신에게 윙크합니다.{/n} \"현명한 결정이군. 만나서 기쁘게 생각한다. 책을 가져가 주어 고맙다. 보상으로 네 뻔뻔함을 "
"용서하고 살려 보내주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "6026ebe2-b883-4f60-be0a-112d0e2eb2fe"
msgid ""
"\"Great! Well, seamen! I told you we'd be rewarded handsomely for this book! "
"All aboard! I'm going to find another tavern and drink some of that gold! In "
"a land across the sea!\" {n}The sailors cheer the captain with an approving "
"roar.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"좋아! 이봐! 이 책으로 우리가 훌륭하게 보상받을 것이라고 말했지! 모두 탑승해라! 다른 주점을 찾아 술을 마실거야! 바다 건너 "
"땅에서!\" {n}선원들은 동의의 의미로 포효하며 선장을 응원합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "eed33375-e6c3-4318-8141-4cac28b5fe08"
msgid ""
"\"I'll always be grateful to you for revealing that bilge rat Wellar. How "
"could he betray me after so many years of robbery?\""
msgstr "\"쥐새끼 웰라의 정체를 밝혀줘 고맙다. 어떻게 그렇게 오랫동안 도둑질해서 나를 배신할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : FirstMateWellar
msgctxt "de157350-4038-4b6b-867e-83e785b6b10e"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Sir|Ma'am}! You saved The Prestigious! Now we can finally embark!\" {n}"
"Wellar looks at the happy Martyn and whispers.{/n} \"And I beg you, please "
"forget about my ridiculous request regarding our captain. That was the voice "
"of despair.\""
msgstr ""
"\" {mf|선생|부인}! 권위자 호를 구했다! 이제 우리는 마침내 상륙할 수 있어!\" {n}웰라는 행복한 마르틴을 바라보고 "
"속삭임입니다.{/n} \"부탁하건데 우리 선장에 관한 우스운 요청에 대해 잊어 버려. 절망에 빠져 한 소리였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "6edd853a-dc9a-45e0-8b1b-5ce36882effb"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, Wellar's not here any more... Are you quite certain you don't want to "
"be my First Mate?\""
msgstr "\"웰라는 더 이상 여기에 있지 않아... 일등 항해사를 하지 않겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "323e216c-e8fc-48f8-ac96-c37751eb8fb8"
msgid ""
"\"Finally! I simply don't know how to thank you! Wait... are these blood "
"stains? Oh, well, never mind! Please, accept this weapon as a token of my "
"gratitude! Of my twelve blades, this one is by far the best, and my most "
"cherished! Now it's time for us to meet new adventures. First Mate, all "
"hands on deck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"마침내! 너무나 고맙군! 잠깐... 이건 핏자국인가? 신경 쓰지 마! 감사의 표시로 내 무기를 받아둬! 내 열 두개의 칼 중에서 이 "
"칼이 가장 좋았고 내가 가장 소중히 여겼다! 이제 새로운 모험을 만날 차례다. 일등항해사와 전원 갑판으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : CaptainMartyn
msgctxt "ee2abb03-8319-4f26-9833-fee7f9b1d509"
msgid ""
"{n}Martyn puts his hand on his weapon.{/n} \"You'll stop making plans on my "
"ship, {name}. Stop this mutiny! Crewmen – arrest Wellar!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마르틴은 손을 그의 무기에 얹습니다.{/n} \"내 배에서 음모는 그만 꾸며. {name}. 이 반란을 멈춰라! 웰라를 잡아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "4ad269a0-dca1-4fdc-b7ce-901f0b7bc39f"
msgid ""
"\"You see, not so long ago I commissioned a wizard named Blakemoor to create "
"a grimoire. It should be an amazing book, a masterpiece of calligraphy and "
"fine art. Blakemoor is a phenomenal genius, and... author of some mighty "
"tall tales.\""
msgstr ""
"\"얼마 전 블레이크무어라는 마법사에게 흑마법서를 만들어달라 의뢰했다. 서예와 고급스럽게 장신된 걸작이 될 거야. 블레이크무어는 경이로운 "
"천재이자 놀라운 작가이지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "3477193a-1f39-41bb-8e77-82e09a145180"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, punctuality is not one of his virtues. He's not much good with "
"people at all. Blakemoor has lived too long a hermit. In fact, we don't know "
"where he lives... But if you ever cross paths with him, and you can somehow "
"bring back the grimoire to us, my gratitude would be immense. And of course, "
"we'll immediately set off without disturbing the peace of these good "
"citizens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간 엄수는 그의 덕목이 아니야. 그는 사람들과 별로 좋지 않아. 블레이크무어는 너무 오랫동안 은둔 생활을 했다. 사실 우리는 그가 "
"사는 곳을 모른다... 그러나 당신이 그와 함께 길을 건너 간다면 어떻게든 우리에게 흑마법서를 가져와 나의 거대한 보상을 받을 것이다. "
"그리고 우리는 이 좋은 시민의 평화를 위협하지 않고 즉시 출발 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "544c69ff-f10a-47fb-b7bf-2b4453a0ec0b"
msgid "\"Hmm... sounds tough. You want to fight? Just say the word.\""
msgstr "\"흠... 어려운 조건이군. 싸우고 싶나? 얘기만 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "05db1688-8329-4a72-9818-5c32f401624d"
msgid ""
"\"Quite right. But don't worry, it's only sailors that have a real sense of "
"humor.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다. 하지만 유머 감각 있는 선원일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "33a57be9-1f36-4929-b156-58fdb0d34102"
msgid ""
"{n}The captain adjusts the rapier on his belt with a swaggering gesture.{/n} "
"\"Our ship has visited every single port in the world. I know a few things "
"that'll surprise you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}선장은 경쾌한 몸짓으로 레이피어를 허리띠에서 조절합니다.{/n} \"우리 배는 세계의 모든 항구를 방문했다. 그리고 너를 놀라게 할 "
"몇 가지 사실을 알고 있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0098_Text
msgctxt "08e7bcd6-0f4a-4779-bd3f-e0b38698bd1f"
msgid "\"Can I be of any use to you?\""
msgstr "\"내가 좀 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0102_Text
msgctxt "a8cdef5b-3043-4064-85a9-c25830b7f19b"
msgid ""
"\"That would be a long story. I can say without exaggeration – there's no "
"sea in the world we haven't sailed. I've traded with the "
"{g|Kelesh}Keleshites{/g}, talked with the sages of {g|Absalom}Absalom{/g}, "
"traded gorgeous carved masks from the {g|Garund}Garund{/g} aborigines – for "
"rum! Fought off Ulfen raiders, who come in the middle of the night, howling "
"like wolves.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴 이야기다. 과장하지 않고 말하지. 우리가 항해하지 않은 바다는 어느 세계에도 없다. 나는 {g|Kelesh} 켈레쉬{/g}와 "
"교역했고 {g|Absalom}압살롬{/g}의 현자들과 이야기하며 럼주로 {g|Garund}가룬드{/g} 원주민의 화려한 새겨진 가면을 "
"얻었지! 한밤중에 쳐들어와 늑대처럼 울부 짖는 울펜 침입자들과도 싸웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0103_Text
msgctxt "db832870-3503-42a8-9f93-76f1904a3a70"
msgid ""
"\"I participated in the regatta organized by the Aspis Consortium, taking "
"honorable second – and only because of the dishonest ploys of my rival. The "
"Hurricane King himself, Captain Kerdak Bonefist, leader of the Free Captains "
"and Ruler of the Shackles, gave me that magnificent rapier, as a gesture of "
"respect.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 아스피스 컨소시엄이 주최한 보트 경주에 참가하여 명예로운 2 위를 차지했다. 그 이유는 내 라이벌의 반칙 때문이었지. "
"태풍왕이라고 자기를 소개한 케르닥 본피스트 선장은 섀클스의 통치자이자 자유 선장의 우두머리였고 나에게 존경의 의미로 레이피어를 선물했다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0104_Text
msgctxt "c8a5e1fd-32d9-4a65-add0-cb672656250a"
msgid ""
"\"Babarm is a true dwarf, and a natural born ship's treasurer. His budget "
"always squares with the treasury... Although one time he strangled a sailor "
"because the treasury couldn't cover his salary – but in the end, his budget "
"was spot on! Over there, in the corner, that's Blutmond. I've never met a "
"more gloomy and rude man. They say he was once a crewman on the ship of the "
"damned, but I wager that's all just a tall tale.\""
msgstr ""
"\"바밤은 타고난 해적 드워프이지. 그의 재산은 항상 보물의 양에 비례했어... 한때 벌어들인 보물보다 받는 봉급이 형편 없어서 다른 "
"선원의 목을 졸라 봉급을 타냈지! 저기 구석에 있는 녀석은 블러트먼드야. 나는 저녀석보다 우울하고 무례한 녀석을 만난 적이 없지. 그는 "
"한때 저주받은 배에 타고 있던 선원이었다고 하지만 그건 빙산의 일각일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0105_Text
msgctxt "e0230ed0-8bf8-44dd-a29a-f0417b2118ab"
msgid ""
"\"And, of course, let's not forget my First Mate Wellar. He's my right hand. "
"A man of impeccable loyalty. And, don't tell anyone I told you, but he's a "
"great fan of art. It's a pity he hides his passion, though we all know about "
"it, of course.\" {n}Martyn winks conspiratorially at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"물론 일등 항해사 웰라를 잊지 말라구. 녀석은 내 오른손이야. 충성심을 가진 남자지. 그리고 남에게 말하지 마. 그는 예술 작품의 "
"팬이야. 그가 열정을 숨기는 것은 유감이지만 우리는 물론 그것에 대해 알고 있지.\" {n}마르틴은 다 안다는 듯 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0106_Text
#. Speaker : FirstMateWellar
msgctxt "3ca69d8c-2a3b-4f33-84b1-3a86d70250c6"
msgid ""
"{n}Martyn smiles uncomprehendingly, and you hear Wellar's footsteps "
"behind.{/n} \"Sir, let's do this without bloodshed. Give up your command. "
"You'll be the death of the crew.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마르틴은 예기치 않게 미소 지었고 웰라의 발자취가 뒤에서 들립니다.{/n} \"선장. 피흘리지 말고 끝내자. 통제권을 포기해. "
"아니면 죽은 선원이 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0107_Text
#. Speaker : CaptainMartyn
msgctxt "33a71130-7cdd-4232-a6d6-d6f4d69354cd"
msgid ""
"\"Wellar, is this... a mutiny? You're kidding me! My crew would never betray "
"me! I'm the best captain in all the seas! Right, crew?!\""
msgstr "\"웰라. 반란인가? 너 농담하는 거지! 내 선원은 날 배신하지 않을 거야! 나는 모든 바다에서 최고의 선장이야! 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0110_Text
msgctxt "91c9680b-1222-4468-b576-359bf9803fc8"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you will not regret it! I am a true master of tales... Not a master "
"like Blakemoor, but an artist still!\""
msgstr "\"후회하지 않을 것이다! 나는 이야기꾼이니... 블레이크무어와 같지는 않지만 기대해도 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Capitan Martyn/Cue_0112_Text
msgctxt "b9b78f5d-42c4-4747-bd16-970e6edc8137"
msgid "\"That's what you think! I have patience on my side – I can wait.\""
msgstr "\"그게 네 생각이었군! 나는 인내심이 있으니 기다리지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "2855ac6f-fda5-45fa-bc58-b94566c31b3e"
msgid "\"What's your problem?\""
msgstr "\"무엇이 문제야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "c1d85584-0fa3-48c6-8bfb-48714e6611a7"
msgid "\"Tell me about your ship, The Prestigious.\""
msgstr "\"당신 배 권위자 호에 대해 말해 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "0a27e0f7-01ff-4b8a-a78d-8ea497265f9c"
msgid "\"Aren't you worried that I might reveal your plans to the captain?\""
msgstr "\"선장에게 너의 계획을 밝힐까봐 걱정 되나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "d116829f-7962-41b9-8e03-f77171ce5d0a"
msgid "\"Blakemoor has asked for one more week to finish his grimoire.\""
msgstr "\"블레이크무어는 흑마법서을 끝내려면 한 주를 더 기다려야 한다고 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4829451a-9725-48b3-884f-cdb24e258c2e"
msgid "\"I have the grimoire.\""
msgstr "\"나는 흑마법서를 가지고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "60123b54-043f-4d16-adad-78e250c93a52"
msgid "\"How did you become a pirate?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 해적이 된 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "aba42e97-dba8-4ec2-9cd5-85c966f50d2b"
msgid "\"Let's leave that for now. We've more important thing to discuss.\""
msgstr "\"지금 당장은 신경쓰지 마. 우리는 더 중요한 얘기를 해야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "4b228a6f-4f1f-4523-ae0b-f6bf790cb920"
msgid "\"I've no more questions.\""
msgstr "\"나는 더 이상 질문이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "8f851936-de3a-479b-b87a-f42dfa16c463"
msgid "\"Answer me this about Blakemoor and the grimoire.\""
msgstr "\"블레이크무어와 흑마법서에 관해 대답해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "4f6b2c7d-58cc-4cc5-91f9-c288291c0e78"
msgid "\"I've got a question about your line of work.\""
msgstr "\"네 일에 대해 궁금한 점이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0051_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "15585b21-5d56-4c99-a833-92c02af75059"
msgid "Killed the pirates in Pitax tavern to keep Pitax citizens safe."
msgstr "피탁스 시민을 안전하게 지키기 위해 피탁스 주점에서 해적을 살해합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "8844c818-460e-4ab6-8224-5477e2500fda"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"The citizens of Pitax will breathe a sigh of relief when I finish "
"you once and for all.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네가 죽으면 피탁스 시민들은 안도의 한숨을 쉬겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "86421e07-f636-46e5-825a-41eb78c8179f"
msgid "\"We'll talk later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "1abe930c-c0d9-41e9-a0ca-fb8ff00ac4f0"
msgid "\"Tell me about the grimoire.\""
msgstr "\"흑마법서에 관해 대답해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "4abb3002-50c4-423a-9c28-2286d8bdfebf"
msgid "\"Who is this Blakemoor?\""
msgstr "\"블레이크무어가 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1f2980ca-02c0-4cc3-ad7d-2641c8380fb4"
msgid ""
"{n}A dark-haired middle-aged man with a sailor's gait, trimmed beard and a "
"grumpy face is blocking your way.{/n} \"{mf|Sir|Ma'am}, my name is Wellar, "
"and it is my honor to serve as First Mate aboard the pirate ship called The "
"Prestigious. I'd like to ask you for a favor. Help me save my merry crew of "
"sea dogs from drowning in the bottoms of their bottles.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}해적처럼 걷는 흑발의 중년은 턱수염과 심술 궂은 얼굴로 당신의 길을 막습니다.{/n} \" {mf|선생|부인}. 내 이름은 웰라이며 "
"일등 항해사로 권위자 호라는 해적선에 탑승했다. 부탁을 하고 싶어. 내 유쾌한 해적 동료들이 배에서 익사하지 않도록 도와줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "8cac003a-1d8b-4d3f-8c9f-97040e941504"
msgid ""
"{n}First Mate Wellar looks at you with the mix of hope and despair in his "
"eyes.{/n} \"Greetings, Your {mf|Grace|Grace|Highness|Highness}! Have you... "
"had a chance to consider my request?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}일등 항해사 웰라는 희망과 절망이 섞인 눈으로 당신을 보고 있습니다.{/n} \"안녕, {mf|남작|남작|전하|전하}! 내 이야기 "
"한 번 들어줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "7caaf7ce-a89d-42d1-9e51-cda66c597b52"
msgid ""
"{n}Wellar grimly points at the drunken pirates.{/n} \"There. Our crew has "
"placed an order: a wizard named Blakemoor agreed to create a grimoire for us "
"– a book, but more, a masterpiece of art. We're supposed to meet him at this "
"tavern two... or three... well, several days ago. But he hasn't shown up. "
"Worse, we have no idea where we should look for him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}웰라는 음침한 손짓으로 술취한 해적을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"저기야. 우리는 의뢰를 맡겼지. 블레이크무어라는 마법사는 우리를 위해 "
"흑마법서를 만들 것에 동의했다. 책이지만 예술의 걸작이지. 이틀... 혹은 사흘 전 이 주점에서 그를 만나기로 되어있었다... 그러나 "
"그는 나타나지 않았지. 게다가 우리는 그를 어디에서 찾아야 할지 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f64a5267-bf56-4ce4-a412-e6cf28e6b09f"
msgid "\"Crew, to arms! Drop your bottles and grab your weapons!\""
msgstr "\"선원! 무장하라! 병을 버리고 무기를 가져와!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "afc8afc8-8e3e-408c-873c-f2d29c1f50a9"
msgid ""
"\"You won't find a more glorious pirate ship anywhere. We're not some "
"pathetic bandits, who attack fishermen and cargo ships full of cabbages. The "
"Prestigious chases only art. Pieces of art, I mean. I was never a big "
"admirer of art, but when I learned how much the nobles are willing to pay "
"for it, their aesthetics and beauty just overwhelmed me. Usually we've been "
"selling most of our loot to the King Irovetti.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어디에서도 이보다 더 영광스러운 해적선을 찾지 못할 거야. 우리는 어부나 배추를 실은 화물선을 공격하는 한심한 좀도둑이 아니야. "
"권위자 호는 예술품만 추구하지. 예술품만을 해적질한다는 얘기야. 나는 예술에 흥미가 없었지만 귀족들이 예술품에 기꺼이 돈을 지불 할 때 "
"예술품의 미적 감각과 아름다움에 압도당했어. 보통 우리는 이로베티 왕에게 대부분의 전리품을 팔았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ab65a674-b4b0-4a9d-b67d-84a73d7fda81"
msgid "\"I'm counting on you. Fair winds.\""
msgstr "\"너를 믿고 있어. 순풍아 불어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "7d21cc8d-cb7b-45f1-b472-893b994ec583"
msgid ""
"\"Have you seen him? Have you spoken to him? And you didn't take the book?! "
"Oh no! I'm sure he's long gone by now! You should have taken that damned "
"book away from him! Where will we find him now... Everything is lost.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그를 봤어? 말을 걸어 봤어? 그리고 책을 가져가지 않았다고?! 오. 안돼! 그는 이미 가버린 것이 틀림 없어! 너는 그 저주받은 "
"책을 그에게서 빼앗았을 거야! 어디에서든 그를 찾아도... 얻을 것이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "615d3032-6acb-4ac6-acec-d0ee6582a57c"
msgid ""
"{n}Usually grumpy, the face of the First Mate lights up with a smile.{/n} "
"\"Thank the gods! Now give that damned book to the captain, and we can leave "
"this rat hole. And there won't even have to be a mutiny! By the merfolk's "
"gods, you've saved me and my entire crew!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보통 심술 궂은 표정을 짓는 일등항해사의 얼굴에는 미소가 가득합니다.{/n} \"다행이군! 그 망할 책을 선장에게 주면 우리는 이 "
"빌어먹을 곳을 떠날 수 있어. 그리고 반란도 없을 거야! 머포크의 신들의 축복으로 네가 우리 선원을 구했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "45309ce9-4769-4d8b-9e51-4b2df884d73e"
msgid ""
"\"No, I'm not. For many years I've kept this crew afloat. Both our ship and "
"our business. If I don't overthrow the captain, in a few weeks there won't "
"be any crew left.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 나는 아니야. 나는 수 년동안 선원들을 묶어두었어. 내가 선장을 잡지 않으면, 몇 주 안에 선원이 모두 도망갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "bbf2d7ba-304c-435d-bb82-a19cda772e3c"
msgid ""
"{n}First Mate Wellar stares at the scene of the massacre in utter "
"confusion.{/n} \"Holy Kraken... But... This wasn't what I wanted! I wanted a "
"mutiny. For the ship. With the crew... But you've killed the whole crew! "
"What good is the ship now?! Phew, let's go, brothers! It's true that "
"landlubbers have butts instead of heads!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}일등 항해사 웰라는 학대의 현장을 완전히 혼란스럽게 바라보고 있습니다.{/n} \"맙소사... 이건 내가 원했던 게 아니야! 나는 "
"반란을 원했어. 배를 위해서 말이야. 선원들과 함께... 하지만 너는 모든 선원을 죽였어! 지금 배가 어떻게 된 거야?! 젠장. 가자! "
"풋내기들 어깨 위에 달린 건 장식이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "5846b9bb-7268-49f0-b5e4-3b9e0461ae9e"
msgid ""
"\"It's a long story. Once I was a yeoman in {g|Rostland}Rostland{/g}. But "
"when House Rogarvia... when all those things happened with {g|House Rogarvia}"
"House Rogarvia{/g}, I raised anchor and took off in an instant. I could feel "
"upheaval coming, just like I can feel the wind shift north-west at midnight. "
"Back in Deadbridge, I met captain Martyn, who was recruiting a new crew.\""
msgstr ""
"\"긴 이야기야. 나는 {g|Rostland}로스틀랜드{/g}의 농민이었지. 하지만 로가비아 가문이... {g|House Rogarvia}"
"로가비아 가문{/g}의 모든 일이 시작되었을 때, 나는 즉시 닻을 올리고 떠났어. 자정에 풍향이 북서풍으로 변하리라 느낄 수있는 것처럼, "
"나는 격변이 올 것이라는 것을 느낄 수 있었지. 데드브릿지로 돌아와서, 나는 새로운 선원을 모집하는 마르틴 선장을 만났지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "e2bc6175-6176-49d0-bb3c-d5a7ef71f740"
msgid "\"Whatever you say. I'm always at your service.\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고 하든. 기꺼이 돕겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "f0cad049-f287-4a80-9f2c-f317439ca876"
msgid ""
"\"Blakemoor is an extraordinary man full of amazing stories. But he's "
"jealous of his solitude. In truth, if the whole crew stays here drinking, "
"waiting for him for days upon days, and if it goes on like that – why, we'll "
"lose our image as honest pirates. What respected client would want to hire "
"us then? It's long past time for us to set sail, but captain Martyn will "
"hear nothing of it: he won't leave without the book.\""
msgstr ""
"블레이크무어는 놀라운 이야기를 하는 특별한 사람이야. 하지만 그는 고독함을 갈망하지. 사실 선원 모두가 술을 마시며 며칠 동안 그를 "
"기다리고 그렇게 계속되면 우리는 정직한 해적으로서의 이미지를 잃어 버릴 거야. 존중받는 고객은 우리를 고용하고 싶을까? 항해를 안한 지 "
"오래되었지만 마르틴 선장은 아무것도 듣지 않을 것이다. 그는 책 없이 떠나지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "b22e0138-3407-45d8-a840-1944712d2eb9"
msgid ""
"\"I need your help. I have to overthrow the captain and take command. But "
"I'm not the most popular man in the crew. If Martyn is like an amusing and "
"irresponsible father for the sailors, I'm the strict mother ready to put her "
"rolling pin to use. I need someone who can persuade the sailors to take my "
"side. There aren't many who support me now – just those who want to fill our "
"sails with southern winds. It's true, we live in an age of decline and "
"decadence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 도움이 필요해. 반란을 일으켜 명령권을 뺏어야 해. 하지만 나는 선원들에게 가장 인기있는 사람은 아니다. 마르틴이 재미있고 "
"무책임한 선장이라면 나는 밀대를 든 엄격한 어머니 같은 존재지. 선원들이 나의 편을 들도록 설득 할 수있는 누군가가 필요해. 지금 나를 "
"지지 해주는 사람들이 많지 않아. 그들은 우리의 돛에 남쪽 바람을 채우기를 원하는 사람들은 소수이지. 쇠퇴와 타락의 시대가 되어버렸어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "5e6586e5-e6f4-4a21-82e0-36f44b308c79"
msgid ""
"\"Speaking of which, Blakemoor's grimoire was commissioned by Irovetti too.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 말인데 블레이크무어의 흑마법서는 이로베티도 의뢰했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "5f0d4e2e-eabb-4010-8339-e1ce5c0fb4ed"
msgid ""
"\"Speaking of which, Blakemoor's grimoire was commissioned by Irovetti too. "
"Now that contract has lost its force, but the captain believes we still have "
"a deal with Blakemoor, so we have to collect the book anyway. The stubborn, "
"decadent herring!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 말인데 블레이크무어의 흑마법서는 이로베티도 의뢰했다. 이제 계약은 효력을 잃어버렸지만 선장은 우리가 여전히 블레이크무어와 "
"거래를 한다고 생각해서 책을 무슨 일이 있어도 가져야 해. 썩어빠진 고집불통 생선 대가리 같으니라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "a6bc0f40-22c1-42b5-8517-ad9d9fa23701"
msgid ""
"\"I'd wager you're curious what you'll stand to gain? I'll answer you. "
"Robbing raids are a thing of the past for this ship and her crew. We'll "
"dedicate ourselves to trading elite art pieces. This is a highly profitable "
"business, and that's just as true for anyone drawing taxes from our vessel. "
"If you help me, then after I become captain, I'll pursue this business under "
"your banner. But this will only work if I'm captain – I can't speak for "
"Martyn. He's always preferred robbery over honest trade.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 얻을 수 있는 보상이 궁금하겠지? 대답해 주지. 이 배와 선원들에게 해적질은 과거 일이다. 우리는 고급 예술품을 파는 데 헌신 "
"할 거야. 이득이 매우 높은 사업이고 우리 선박에서 세금을 징수하는 사람에게도 마찬가지고. 나를 도와주면 선장이 된 후에 너의 깃발 "
"아래서 이 사업을 추진할 것이다. 하지만 내가 선장이 될 경우에만 가능해. 나는 마틴에게 말할 수 없어. 그는 항상 정직한 무역보다는 "
"해적질을 선호하거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "cad6665a-fb89-4e14-80f9-ba67d37c8a4f"
msgid "\"I hope this information will be enough for you to help us.\""
msgstr "\"이 정보가 도움이되기를 바라지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0047_Text_1
msgctxt "23a3664f-9a8f-4ede-a678-957cce1a8796"
msgid ""
"\"The crew soon grew to believe that it was my responsibility to... Well, to "
"arrange things. To manage everything. The captain is good at strategic "
"planning, but he's not so skilled in questions of discipline. On The "
"Prestigious I listen to the captain, and the crew listens to me. But it only "
"works so long as I don't contradict Martyn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"선원은 곧 내 책임이라고 생각할 거야... 일을 정리하기 위해서지. 관리하기 위해서이기도 해. 선장은 전략에 능숙하지만 그는 훈육에 "
"익숙하지 않아. 권위자 호에서 나는 선장과 선원의 가교 역할을 맡았어. 그러나 마르틴과 의견이 일치되어야만 가능해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "56ab5d29-1159-410e-8f79-2c67d54397d0"
msgid "\"What exactly would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"정확히 알고 싶은 게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "6541ed1b-0a6c-4d29-8b63-08c895bfe76e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm ready to tell you whatever you wish, if it helps you to… erm… to help "
"us!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 원하는대로 말해 줄 준비가 되어있다... 네가 우리에게 도움이 된다면 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "a4c6d0eb-35f4-45cf-bdfb-37ee722161ef"
msgid ""
"{n}Wellar spits grimly.{/n} \"Not much to be told. It's a book, it's big and "
"beautiful. Covered with calligraphy. Knowing Blakemoor, I'd bet it's full of "
"magical surprises. But its main value lies in the perfection of the visual "
"aesthetics.\" {n}Wellar smirks.{/n} \"I sound like an artist, don't I? As "
"you can see, throughout the years I've become well-versed in matters of art. "
"I've practically grown to love it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}웰라가 험악하게 침을 뱉었습니다.{/n} \"알 거 없어. 크고 아름다운 책이지. 멋진 글자가 새겨졌고. 블레이크무어가 쓴 책인데 "
"놀라운 이야기로 가득차 있지. 하지만 그 가치는 시각적인 미학의 완성에 있어.\" {n}웰라는 웃었습니다.{/n} \"내가 예술가처럼 "
"말하나? 너도 알듯이 나는 몇 년 동안 예술에 정통했어. 이제는 예술을 사랑하게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "87a2e479-da6c-4ac6-890f-8562218403bc"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard many accounts, and I don't believe any of them. Let's just say "
"Blakemoor is a living phenomenon. If you listen to him for five minutes, "
"you'll hear the most impossible stories any dreamer's mind could ever "
"produce. But at the same time, he's an extraordinarily gifted wizard and a "
"skilled artist. I can attest to that personally, I'm pleased to say.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 많은 이야기를 들었고 그 중 어떤 것도 믿지 않는다. 블레이크 무어가 살아있는 전설이라고 해두자. 5분 동안 그의 말을 듣는다면 "
"꿈꾸는 이들이 생각할 수 없는 믿을 수 없는 이야기를 들을 수있어. 그러나 동시에 그는 뛰어난 재능을 지닌 마법사이자 숙련된 예술가이다. "
"나는 그것을 개인적으로 증명할 수있어서 기쁘군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "2dc1ce18-880d-4953-8587-34a0cd530eee"
msgid ""
"\"Can I count on your help? Without you, my crew will drown in drunkenness "
"and decadence.\""
msgstr "\"나좀 도와주겠어? 네가 없으면 내 선원들은이 음주와 타락에 빠져 죽을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "4974ff26-2a29-4a84-a827-ea7d7a0a6bd8"
msgid ""
"\"What's he babbling about? I thought pirates were tough fighters. You know, "
"feisty guys on ships. These are just drunks and rattlebrains.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 뭐라 지껄이는 거야? 해적들은 거친 전사들이라고 생각 했는데. 배 위의 싸움꾼 처럼 말이야. 이녀석들은 그냥 술주정 뱅이들 "
"뿐이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0064_Text_1
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "2a88daed-1d40-486e-9b29-880bf75c4aee"
msgid ""
"\"What's he babbling about? I thought pirates were tough fighters. You know, "
"feisty guys on ships. These are just drunks and rattlebrains.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 뭐라 지껄이는 거야? 해적들은 거친 전사들이라고 생각 했는데. 배 위의 싸움꾼 처럼 말이야. 이녀석들은 그냥 술주정 뱅이들 "
"뿐이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "8614ae2b-830c-4ef0-8262-758bad8eb18a"
msgid ""
"\"A pirate names himself such from the start, then has the audacity to ask "
"for help! Life in the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} is insane. They "
"really need a change.\""
msgstr ""
"\"해적은 처음부터 그렇게 불렀고 대담하게 도움을 청했지! {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 삶은 미친 짓이었어. "
"그들은 정말로 변화가 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/First Mate Wellar/Cue_0065_Text_1
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "f385f3d9-5245-4ea8-990c-69cc27b63116"
msgid ""
"\"A pirate names himself such from the start, then has the audacity to ask "
"for help! Life in the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} is insane. They "
"really need a change.\""
msgstr ""
"\"해적은 처음부터 그렇게 불렀고 대담하게 도움을 청했지! {g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 삶은 미친 짓이었어. "
"그들은 정말로 변화가 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Items/B-Key_Description_String
msgctxt "49593824-00c6-4149-a699-063e5bcb12e1"
msgid ""
"A key inscribed with the letter B, written in a strange, elongated cursive "
"script you don't recognize."
msgstr "문자 B가 새겨져 있는 열쇠는 당신이 알지 못하는 이상하고 흘려 쓴 필기체가 쓰여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Items/B-Key_String
msgctxt "9c555e7a-cac3-4516-a16e-e2480dfed866"
msgid "A Key Inscribed with the Letter B"
msgstr "문자 B가 새겨져 있는 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Items/Capitan_Sword_Description_String
msgctxt "11488185-c81d-4f3c-a46d-ce6b150d4dfa"
msgid ""
"This deadly weapon was forged specially for Kerdak the Bonefist, Lord of the "
"Pirates of the Shackles, the Hurricane King.\n"
"Its creator, Mulliktar the Transparent, was a deep merfolk, a great master "
"of evil, who grew pearls and crystals in the depths of the ocean. When "
"Kerdak crossed swords with the ruler of Mulliktar's tribe, the Hurricane "
"King ordered the hulls of several of his own ships breached – ships full of "
"screaming captives. Then the necromancers that Kerdak hired, immediately "
"transformed the sinking ships into bombs full of undead monsters. The "
"remains of the ships fell upon the palaces of the merfolk, sweeping them "
"away. And from the wreckage the undead rose, tearing to shreds the whole "
"tribe – except for Mulliktar himself, who bought his life by submitting "
"himself to slavery.\n"
"Kerdak ordered him to forge the greatest weapons the seas had ever seen. "
"Thus Mulliktar raised a black crystal in the form of a rapier, from the "
"tears of hundreds of enslaved merfolk, whom Kerdak took as prisoners during "
"his raids, and forced to work until they fell dead from fatigue or despair. "
"Usually Mulliktar's crystals were transparent and perfect, but the anger of "
"the slaves poisoned this one, making it black as onyx. The crystal weapon "
"sits perfectly in the hands of its owner, as if begging to let someone "
"bleed. The bite of its black blade injures not only the body, but also the "
"soul, filling the hearts of its victims with all the pain and malice of the "
"poor underwater slaves. If you sink the rapier into any water, it will "
"darken from the hatred of the merfolk, and become salty like their tears.\n"
"By turns, the rapier was boldly stolen from the pirate lord, by a wandering "
"circus, found once again by the Hurricane King on the other side of the "
"world, recovered, and afterwards, presented to the pirate captain Martyn as "
"a sign of respect."
msgstr ""
"이 치명적인 무기는 족쇄의 해적단 왕인 태풍왕, 뼈주먹 케르닥을 위해 만들어졌습니다.\n"
"이 무기의 창조자인 투명인 물릭타르는 바다의 깊숙한 곳에서 진주와 수정을 키우는, 악의 우두머리인 딥 머포크였습니다. 케르닥이 물릭타르 "
"부족의 통치자와 칼을 맞대었을 때, 태풍왕은 비명을 지르는 포로들로 꽉 찬 자신의 배 몇 척의 함체에 균열을 만들도록 명령했습니다. "
"그리고 케르닥이 고용한 네크로맨서가 즉시 침몰하는 배들을 언데드 괴물들로 가득 찬 폭탄으로 바꾸었습니다. 배의 잔해가 머포크의 궁전에 "
"떨어지면서 그들을 휩쓸어 버렸습니다. 그리고 난파선으로부터 언데드가 일어나 모든 부족을 갈가리 찢어버렸습니다 – 노예가 되기로 하여 "
"자신의 목숨을 건진 물릭타르 자신만 제외하고요.\n"
"케르닥은 바다가 본 것 중 가장 위대한 무기를 만들 것을 명령했습니다. 물릭타르는 케르닥이 습격 중에 포로로 잡은 수백 명의 노예들이 "
"피곤과 절망으로 죽을 때까지 일하도록 강요당하며 흘린 눈물에서 흑색 수정을 키워 레이피어 하나를 만들었습니다. 보통 물릭타르의 수정은 "
"투명하고 완벽했지만, 노예의 분노가 이것을 더럽혀 오닉스처럼 검게 만들었습니다. 수정 무기는 주인의 손에 완벽하게 잡혀 누군가가 피를 "
"흘리기를 애원합니다. 검은 칼날에 물린 것은 몸뿐 아니라 영혼도 손상시켜, 불쌍한 수중 노예들의 모든 고통과 악의로 희생자들의 마음을 "
"채웁니다. 만일 당신이 레이피어를 아무 액체에 담그면, 인어의 증오로 물이 까맣게 되고 눈물처럼 짠 맛이 납니다.\n"
"차례대로, 레이피어는 유랑 서커스 단원이 해적 왕에게서 훔쳤고, 세상의 반대 편에서 발견한 태풍왕이 다시 되찾았으며, 그 뒤 존경의 "
"의미로 선장 마르틴에게 선물되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Items/Capitan_Sword_String
msgctxt "c7aa138a-8733-4182-9d8d-231b5b57035a"
msgid "Black Salt Rapier"
msgstr "검은 소금 레이피어"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "81b37af5-99db-45c2-9cf9-48bfc369bbd5"
msgid "\"How are you doing? Your guests behaving themselves?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 지내? 손님들이 난동은 안 부리나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b6ba9072-f55f-481f-9d8b-258d075be47a"
msgid "\"How are things going in the city?\""
msgstr "\"도시는 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "10055554-5549-40f1-a417-a9cd780fe380"
msgid "\"I need some supplies for the long road.\""
msgstr "\"먼 길을 떠나야 하니 보급이 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "161a00ab-9455-4939-9ef8-9586b339727b"
msgid "\"We'll talk next time.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 다시 이야기 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "31f89a71-45cf-4be9-934e-34e5348c7e12"
msgid "\"Can I rest here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 묵을 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "916ff127-ca06-4f23-ae14-497c306efa05"
msgid "[Pay for the room]"
msgstr "[방값을 지불한다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "b1a40217-4015-48ae-972c-0b9bd5804536"
msgid "\"I've changed my mind.\""
msgstr "\"생각이 바뀌었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "55ab2adf-87a1-4f76-9fd2-e24bbef2207c"
msgid ""
"{n}A grumpy halfling tavernkeeper stares at you gloomily. His voice sounds "
"indifferent, as he recites his memorized greeting.{/n} \"Greetings from the "
"best tavern in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. How may I help you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}심술궂은 술집 주인 하플링이 당신을 우울하게 바라봅니다. 그의 목소리는 무심하게 들리며 암송한 인사말을 건넵니다.{/n} \""
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 최고의 주점에서 인사드립니다. 어떻게 도와 드릴까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "6c1bef97-4e2a-4ef4-bc64-1ff2f6a4bcfc"
msgid ""
"{n}The tavernkeeper mocks regret.{/n} \"Come back again. Good riddance.\""
msgstr "{n}술집 주인은 슬퍼하는 척 합니다.{/n} \"다음에 봬요. 속이 시원하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "2a285895-4c04-438a-acc1-6a2ebc563603"
msgid "\"Welcome, if you've got some coins in your pockets.\""
msgstr "\"주머니에 동전이 있다면 환영합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "3467fa37-ed9e-4401-91da-4f235c54017c"
msgid ""
"\"How can they go? King Irovetti rules, painters paint, sailors drink, "
"travelers roam the streets, bards compose their trifles. Everyone finding "
"something to do – all to avoid doing anything.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 어떻게 할 수 있습니까? 이로베티 왕이 통치하고 화가는 그림을 그리고 선원은 술을 마시고 여행자는 거리를 떠돌아 다니고 바드는 "
"사소한 일을 작곡합니다. 모두가 자기 일을 찾아요. 아무 일이나 하지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "6b697ae3-505d-41fd-b60f-fe782bc5df2e"
msgid ""
"{n}The tavernkeeper winces.{/n} \"Great. King Irovetti is dead, long live "
"the {mf|King|Queen} {name}. A whole new life. Except for the same old "
"thieves. And the same drinking. And refusing to work. Otherwise, everything "
"is just grand.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}술집 주인이 움찔합니다.{/n} \"좋아요. 이로베티 왕은 죽었고 {mf|왕|여왕} {name}이 통치하지요. 완전히 새로운 "
"삶이에요. 도둑놈은 여전하지요. 그리고 술도. 그리고 일을 안하는 것도요. 그렇지 않았다면 모든 것이 잘 되었을 거예요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "863a4a9a-2447-4d35-bb46-0ed422f7387e"
msgid ""
"\"Has my {mf|good sir|dear lady} tragically lost {mf|his|her} eyesight? "
"Can't you see what's going on? The pirates will soon tear this tavern apart, "
"board by board. – And the guardsmen don't dare come in here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|귀공|여사님}은 눈이 안 좋으신가? 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 안 보여요? 해적들이 선술집을 곧 찢어버릴 것입니다. 경비원은 "
"감히 여기에 오지 않아요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "8e29f287-e47a-4dfe-8d72-a6a84fd97d10"
msgid "\"Thank the gods everything is quiet. That's a rarity nowadays.\""
msgstr "\"아무 일도 없어 고맙게 생각합니다. 요즘은 드문 일이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "21645366-95eb-4c2b-83c0-74d70d32a3a0"
msgid ""
"\"Fair enough. As I understand it, you were the one who helped those river "
"rascals find their way out of here?\" {n}The tavernkeeper utters a deep "
"sigh, and tries to place a note of gratitude in his voice.{/n} \"This "
"establishment is deeply grateful to you for your help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"충분히 이해할 수 있습니다. 내가 알기론 당신이 강가의 악당들을 여기로 빠져 나가게 도왔다죠?\" {n}술집 주인은 깊은 한숨을 내며 "
"감사의 말을하려고 합니다.{/n} \"우리 술집은 당신의 도움에 깊은 감사를드립니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "4c6b994a-3fbb-4c33-a2d1-64593a7d5788"
msgid ""
"\"You can, if you have coin. If you don't – well, I'm not running charity "
"here! Ten gold.\""
msgstr "\"안될 것 없지, 동전을 좀 가졌다면 말이야. 없으면 - 글쎄, 난 여기서 자선 사업을 하는 게 아니야! 금화 열 개.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Tavern/Tavernkeeper/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "3fc06e04-f65c-44df-a5e7-5004ced5a53e"
msgid ""
"\"Suit yourself. If you change it again, the price will be the same. Don't "
"even try to haggle!\""
msgstr "\"좋을대로 하시오. 마음을 다시 바꿔도 가격은 똑같을 거야. 흥정하려고도 하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Trader/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "1d369beb-0dfd-422e-a509-35e44f829436"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Trader/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5b2c877f-ebae-4d42-9973-19a2984f2581"
msgid "\"Not now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 안돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Trader/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "aa86d13d-f891-411b-ab64-0b0403466150"
msgid ""
"\"Best wares in all the {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g}! Don't ask me "
"where I get them — just ask me how much!\""
msgstr "\"{g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}의 최상품이지! 어디서 구했는지 묻지마. 가격 흥정만 해줄 테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Viceroy/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "692c735d-5e77-429d-ac2a-067e6ead7ad0"
msgid "\"How are things in Pitax?\""
msgstr "\"피탁스는 요즘 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Viceroy/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "c4624bc7-a688-4b9e-b893-0f015d244ea3"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Viceroy/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ce0695fe-cb92-4177-8f69-970a97857726"
msgid ""
"{n}The governor greets you with an oily smile.{/n} \"Your Highness! Welcome "
"to your loyal {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}!\""
msgstr "{n}총독은 느끼하게 웃으며 인사합니다.{/n} \"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 온 걸 환영해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Viceroy/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "557751c2-a180-4bf0-8884-b0293e6f370d"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for honoring us with your presence! It is always a great honor "
"for us to see you here!\""
msgstr "\"당신이 여기 와서 영광입니다! 우리가 여기에서 당신을 만나는 것은 항상 영광입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Viceroy/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "f13cb407-38c3-4c8d-b376-c119db7e22d1"
msgid ""
"\"Things are very well! Peace, law, and order took roost in the city after "
"you so bravely overcame the usurper. Its citizens, tormented under the heel "
"of the tyrant, are glad to see you as their {mf|King|Queen}, and tirelessly "
"praise your wisdom and kindness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"상황이 아주 좋습니다! 당신이 용감하게 권력자를 이기고 나서 평화, 법, 질서가 도시에 자리를 잡았습니다. 폭군의 압제에 고통받던 "
"시민들은 당신의 지혜와 친절함을 칭송합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_City/Viceroy/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "65d3ef4f-cea7-447a-ae44-c13d35d3a85d"
msgid ""
"\"All is well. There are some problems with crime — it's not very easy to "
"keep the city in order without guards. But please don't worry, I'm working "
"on putting a new guard in place — more competent than the old one, and more "
"loyal to you personally!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 것이 원활합니다. 범죄와 관련하여 몇 가지 문제가 있습니다. 경비원 없이 도시를 지키기란 쉽지 않습니다. 하지만 걱정하지 "
"마십시오. 당신에게 더 충성하는 유능한 놈들로 새로운 경비원을 배치하고 있습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Alarm_String
msgctxt "ba974b03-235f-484f-ad3c-9ee7999cb7f0"
msgid ""
"A melodic sound like a hundred tiny bells rings from under the floor, from "
"the walls, and even from the ceiling. It seems you've activated a magical "
"alarm."
msgstr "수백 개의 작은 종소리 같은 선율이 바닥 아래와 벽, 심지어 천장에서도 울립니다. 마술 경보를 발동한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Battle/Alasen_battlestart_String
msgctxt "827a3301-ef73-474f-b3db-3526dc7a2149"
msgid "\"You shouldn't have come here, weaklings!\""
msgstr "\"약한 녀석은 여기 와서는 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Battle/Avinash_battlestart_String
msgctxt "42e6f36f-a776-4e21-aa92-1da10852b821"
msgid "\"Enough of this folly. Your fatuous revolution ends here.\""
msgstr "\"어리석은 짓은 이걸로 충분해. 너의 치명적인 혁명은 여기서 끝난다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Battle/Soldier_fighting_1_String
msgctxt "dc98e78f-666a-4866-8f2a-e81e27b4b7f8"
msgid "\"For Irovetti!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티을 위하여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Battle/Soldier_fighting_2_String
msgctxt "066e7528-0881-4f33-9d1b-63f15ac30bb0"
msgid "\"Attack {mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}{Name}을 공격하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Battle/Soldier_fighting_3_String
msgctxt "92832c38-0b12-45f0-a60e-7b74e000f39f"
msgid "\"Oh gods... I should have stayed out of this battle...\""
msgstr "\"세상에... 나는 이 전투에서 빠져 나왔어야 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Engelidis/Engelidis_Charmed_01_String
msgctxt "16471485-8741-4280-bfd7-3cc0d10824a6"
msgid "\"Get your hands away from my love!\""
msgstr "\"내 사랑에게서 그 손 치워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Engelidis/Engelidis_Charmed_02_String
msgctxt "2a9dcad7-8054-48ec-88d5-49298e13ac11"
msgid "\"My love! I will devour all your enemies!\""
msgstr "\"내 사랑! 나는 모든 적들을 삼킬 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Engelidis/Engelidis_Charmed_03_String
msgctxt "3fb55131-c0a9-489c-9b12-f9d6dd97c79e"
msgid "\"Look at me, Irovetti! I do this in the name of our love!\""
msgstr "\"나를 봐! 이로베티! 나는 사랑의 이름으로 이러는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Engelidis/Engelidis_Charmed_dies_String
msgctxt "44e302a5-5a20-47f4-bfd6-97aa054c1df9"
msgid "\"Forgive me, my love... I couldn't...\""
msgstr "\"용서해. 내 사랑... 나는 할 수 없어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Engelidis/Engelidis_Enraged_01_String
msgctxt "e10d945f-628a-408d-9140-badb3e72e064"
msgid "\"Two-legged! Two-faced! Heartless!\""
msgstr "\"무정한 녀석! 양심도 없구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Engelidis/Engelidis_Enraged_02_String
msgctxt "f93f9e40-7107-4bb1-a36c-e25e2a8370f5"
msgid "\"I will bite off your arms and legs!\""
msgstr "\"네 팔다리를 물어 뜯을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Engelidis/Engelidis_Enraged_03_String
msgctxt "3bb7d77e-dd88-4c66-b4a0-35f5c2acd5ed"
msgid "\"I hate you! How I hate you all!\""
msgstr "\"네가 싫어! 너를 증오해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Engelidis/Engelidis_Enraged_dies_String
msgctxt "ce8ce4b5-1020-497c-9461-ce50c1a1409b"
msgid "\"Be damned, all you two-legged monsters...\""
msgstr "\"사람 같지도 않은 빌어 먹을 녀석들...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Gedovius/Battle-start_1_String
msgctxt "90dfcd95-71cb-4704-9855-b5348127d771"
msgid "\"Guests, at last! My talons were craving meat!\""
msgstr "\"마침내 손님이군! 나의 발톱은 고기를 갈구하고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Gedovius/Battle-start_arena_String
msgctxt "1f1a10f7-835d-4f8f-9bdc-a3d43eef32c0"
msgid "\"New toys to sharpen my talons? At last!\""
msgstr "\"내 발톱을 날카롭게하는 새로운 장난감인가? 마침내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Gedovius/Clippings_1_String
msgctxt "b522a1d7-fc56-4ea9-a612-4efc8a9ef2d2"
msgid ""
"Newspaper clippings with urgent headlines decorate the wall: \"Terrible "
"Murder at the Port!\", \"New Victims of the Port Ripper!\", \"Gargoyle "
"Suspected!\", \"Guards Helpless to Stop Murderer!\""
msgstr ""
"속보가 담긴 소식지입니다. \"항구에서의 끔찍한 살인 사건!\", \"항구 살인마의 새로운 희생자들!\", \"가고일로 추정됨!\", "
"\"살인자를 막을 수 없는 경비원들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Gedovius/Clippings_2_String
msgctxt "f026d822-b0d6-4358-9e79-7cec058fce5b"
msgid ""
"There are newspaper clippings on the wall: \"Port Ripper Stopped?\", "
"\"Murders Stopped... For How Long?\", and \"Unsolved Secret of the Ripper\"."
msgstr ""
"속보가 담긴 소식지입니다. \"항구 살인마는 사라졌나?\", \"연쇄 살인이 멈추다... 얼마나 오래갈지?\", \"항구 살인마의 풀리지 "
"않은 비밀!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Gedovius/Clippings_3_String
msgctxt "20d2e935-5e06-4ba1-8418-c1aac83a1d0e"
msgid ""
"A newspaper article titled \"THE TRUTH ABOUT THE RIPPER!\" is hanging on the "
"wall. It reads: \"... However, against the claims of the guards, our "
"informant (who asked not to be named) claims that the Port Ripper is still "
"alive, and lives at the King's palace, serving as Irovetti's personal "
"executioner...\""
msgstr ""
"\"살인마에 대한 진실!\" 이라는 제목의 신문이 벽에 걸려있습니다. 내용은 이렇습니다: \"... 그러나, 경비대의 주장에 대한 "
"반박으로, 우리의 제보자 (익명을 요구함)는 항구 살인마가 아직 살아있으며, 왕의 궁전에서 이로베티의 개인 처형인으로서 생활하고 있다 "
"주장합니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Ghost/Ghost_finger_1_String
msgctxt "cc60adcc-d8e2-4ec4-ade5-93f6d35ba092"
msgid "\"There, there...\""
msgstr "\"저기, 저기...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Ghost/Ghost_finger_2_String
msgctxt "36142bf6-ec31-4918-ab59-751c87838306"
msgid "\"Oh... The door... Woe is me...\""
msgstr "\"아... 문이... 슬프군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Ghost/Ghost_magicmouth_1_String
msgctxt "34da5b56-9b3a-45e2-b7dd-a9ed5569d2f9"
msgid "\"Door, door... Open the door!\""
msgstr "\"문, 문... 문 열어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Ghost/Ghost_magicmouth_2_String
msgctxt "e98ee908-bcf1-4670-b33f-7298acc7cf66"
msgid "\"Anyone... Open the door, I beg you!\""
msgstr "\"누구든지... 문 열어. 부탁이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Golem/PuzzleGolemNotActive_Bark_String
msgctxt "ce2ae9f6-6f5e-42b1-9f03-3f7814a17a5c"
msgid "\"Who are you? What right have you to talk to me?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야? 무슨 말을 하려는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Golem/PuzzlePostament_ItemNeeded_String
msgctxt "3c74c66d-89ca-48c9-a13f-c8555bd58534"
msgid ""
"There is a noticeable dent in the pedestal. Some object is obviously "
"supposed to stand there."
msgstr "받침대에 눈에 띄는 움푹 들어간 곳이 있습니다. 어떤 물건이 거기에 있었음이 분명합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Irovetti/Irovetti_battle_1_String
msgctxt "d18445f8-3d2d-41f7-9a4e-cb66d71ea919"
msgid "\"I'll write you a beautiful eulogy!\""
msgstr "\"너에게 아름다운 추도를 써 주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Irovetti/Irovetti_battle_2_String
msgctxt "e9bf22a8-b604-4479-8944-dfc56e4f87af"
msgid "\"Face Irovetti himself? Worst idea of your life!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티를 만난다고? 인생 최악의 결정이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Irovetti/Irovetti_battle_3_String
msgctxt "81cac45c-57dc-4793-9235-49dafc184f64"
msgid "\"Another mediocrity I'll sweep away!\""
msgstr "\"내가 쓸어버릴 또 다른 일반인이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Concubines_1_String
msgctxt "e49fdd4f-958b-45c6-94e4-e13162fcc2b3"
msgid "\"What's going on? What time is it? When is the next party starting?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야? 몇 시지? 언제 다음 잔치가 시작하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Concubines_2_String
msgctxt "f5b935a1-8467-4834-bbc6-c07de8b9bdd2"
msgid "\"So loud out there... His Highness knows how to have fun!\""
msgstr "\"소란스러워... 전하는 즐길 줄 아시는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Concubines_3_String
msgctxt "63487c96-5303-494a-a573-314f024224f0"
msgid "\"My head hurts after last night... someone give me some wine!\""
msgstr "\"어젯밤 일로 머리가 아팠어... 누군가 포도주를 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Concubines_4_String
msgctxt "ae3e9714-12a6-4d40-bc45-928681b43eb7"
msgid "\"Let's go look in the pantry!\""
msgstr "\"식품 창고를 찾아보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Marauders_1_String
msgctxt "70b2dca8-8355-48d6-92a9-753396ec7431"
msgid ""
"\"Quickly, quickly! Stop fussing – just grab everything! We'll decide what's "
"valuable later!\""
msgstr "\"빨리, 빨리! 소란 피우지 마. 보이는 것은 모두 챙겨! 쓸모 있는 것은 나중에 골라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Marauders_2_String
msgctxt "d4a2d37f-2b34-42b7-a9ce-6981d12027f4"
msgid "\"I think someone is coming!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 오는 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Marauders_3_String
msgctxt "f99d51ec-d9d7-4949-8bea-2e7ad050ec66"
msgid ""
"\"Um... Good day! We're, uh... guarding His Highness' treasures! Yes, from "
"anyone who might steal them!\""
msgstr "\"음... 안녕! 우린... 어... 전하의 보물을 지키고 있었어! 도둑질하는 사람에게서 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Marauders_4_String
msgctxt "de6e10c2-1b4b-40c7-a2a9-bf75340b8f2d"
msgid "\"Stop, they aren't allies! They are invaders! Attack them!\""
msgstr "\"그만. 그들은 아군이 아니다! 그들은 침략자이다! 공격하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Servants_1_String
msgctxt "bd09507a-a820-4714-86e4-779bc90ad4a6"
msgid "\"Don't hit me! I'm not a soldier, I just mop the floors!\""
msgstr "\"때리지 마! 나는 병사가 아니야. 나는 그저 하찮은 녀석이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Servants_2_String
msgctxt "2d18d707-8f09-41a9-a1e8-4808cbf1dbdd"
msgid ""
"\"And I'm... I'm a cook! This isn't a sword, it's just a kitchen knife!\""
msgstr "\"그리고 나는... 나는 요리사야! 이건 칼이 아니야. 부엌칼일 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Servants_3_String
msgctxt "e8039508-d4b3-46fa-a08c-7fb663dbd175"
msgid "\"Don't touch us! See? We are leaving!\""
msgstr "\"건들지 마! 알았지? 우린 떠날게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Soldiers_Too_Brave_1_String
msgctxt "9d990b67-e429-4287-9759-b00900e3ca34"
msgid "\"Look! It's {mf|King|Queen} {Name}!\""
msgstr "\"봐! {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Soldiers_Too_Brave_2_String
msgctxt "cb952ec8-20c9-4197-9b12-88ba11c5615c"
msgid ""
"\"What a coincidence! Do you know how much Irovetti promised for {mf|his|her}"
" head?\""
msgstr "\"정말 우연의 일치로군! 당신은 이로베티가 {mf|그의|그녀의} 머리에 걸은 현상금이 얼마인지 알고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Soldiers_Too_Brave_3_String
msgctxt "8547e236-3c8e-4737-a3f8-f9298f2231d8"
msgid ""
"\"Can we handle {mf|him|her}? {mf|He|She} doesn't look {mf|he'll|she'll} go "
"down easy.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 {mf|그|그녀}를 처리할 수 있을까? {mf|그|그녀}는 쉽게 쓰러지지 않을 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Little_Scenes/Soldiers_Too_Brave_4_String
msgctxt "350f91fe-f560-499a-b9f6-5fe152ec4ff2"
msgid ""
"\"Don't be a coward, we'll manage! Hey you! In the name of King Irovetti, "
"surrender!\""
msgstr "\"겁먹지 마. 우리가 알아서 할 거야! 이봐! 이로베티 왕의 이름으로 항복해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Servants/Servant_1_String
msgctxt "19f5241d-89ac-40ea-aa0d-4b3927479382"
msgid "\"Please don't kill me! I'm just a dishwasher!\""
msgstr "\"제발 날 죽이지 마. 나는 접시닦이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Servants/Servant_2_String
msgctxt "774a3150-127d-481a-be99-3f8d7158089e"
msgid ""
"\"What a week! First the pie burned, then the pipes clogged, now a "
"revolution!\""
msgstr "\"대단한 한주로군! 먼저 파이가 타오르고 파이프가 막히더니 이제 혁명이 일어났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Servants/Servant_3_String
msgctxt "88090a3c-bf29-42ae-9a2c-ffc55f263e31"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! When you catch Irovetti, give that ass a couple of kicks for me!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 이로베티를 잡을 때 그 녀석을 걷어차게 허락해 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Big_bed_String
msgctxt "03f54f24-447d-45ee-9379-9e1cb5984fd3"
msgid "Your whole party could fit in this bed."
msgstr "네 일행 전체가 이 침대에 잠들 수 있어."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Candle_String
msgctxt "b71e8438-fd66-4ed4-8cb1-9a6d4e7bbd73"
msgid ""
"This candlestick seems made of gold, but on closer examination it turns out "
"not even to be gold-plated, only charmed with a magical illusion."
msgstr "이 촛대는 금으로 만들어졌지만 더 자세히 살펴보면 금박을 입히지 않고 마법의 환영으로 빛나고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Chair_String
msgctxt "c8ed9eed-4906-4b39-8a17-9c0c7254c157"
msgid ""
"The armchair is covered with lots of stains – from wine, sauce and something "
"else."
msgstr "이 안락 의자는 와인, 소스 등의 얼룩으로 범벅되어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Door_latched_String
msgctxt "883c99e1-0f15-4ba3-a1ca-21ef010d4d98"
msgid "The door is locked from the other side."
msgstr "문이 다른 쪽에서 잠겨 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Door_no_knob_String
msgctxt "58258796-0c9a-4f6c-86ae-5b16da088bff"
msgid "The door is locked, with no knob or lock in sight."
msgstr "문은 잠겨 있으며 손잡이나 잠금 장치가 보이지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Engelidis_lake_String
msgctxt "4a6e70a4-13a2-4f6d-90e7-18f852cc1bc9"
msgid "Someone's bleached bones lie at the bottom of the cold underwater lake."
msgstr "차가운 호숫가 한가운데 새하얀 뼈가 가라앉아 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Fake_door_1_String
msgctxt "a796dea1-1823-4c02-b0fa-04a48e175c45"
msgid "This door doesn't lead anywhere."
msgstr "이 문은 어느 곳으로도 이어지지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Fake_door_2_String
msgctxt "a59ecc2a-df7e-44a2-a880-a50d69176b98"
msgid "A decorative door with a wall behind it."
msgstr "너머에는 벽 뿐인 장식 문입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Fountain_String
msgctxt "52542286-1e01-4747-be71-821a43be686d"
msgid "The water in the fountain smells like wine."
msgstr "분수의 물에서 포도주 같은 냄새가 납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Instruments_String
msgctxt "fff2f60b-6b42-44e3-a03d-f8b763a75702"
msgid ""
"Artfully crafted instruments with Irovetti's monogram are covered with "
"greasy fingerprints."
msgstr "이로베티의 문양이 그려져 예술적으로 제작된 악기는 기름진 지문으로 덮여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Irovettis_bed_String
msgctxt "f96df3b0-fa0e-498f-8523-7cf767cbaf02"
msgid "The bedsheets and the carpet are soiled with gross stains."
msgstr "침대 시트와 양탄자는 심하게 얼룩이 묻어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Painting2_String
msgctxt "dd8048c3-7bb2-4d5a-9b0d-3ab3d4c705f8"
msgid ""
"Antique paintings have been ruined by some talentless painter who glammed "
"them up to appease Irovetti's taste."
msgstr "재능 없는 화가는 이로베티의 취향을 달래기 위해 오래된 그림을 망쳐 놓았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Painting_String
msgctxt "ebe06f9e-2ec1-4fe3-91a0-16c4c83ed9de"
msgid ""
"The creator of this painting clearly lacked taste, but possessed plenty of "
"imagination."
msgstr "이 그림의 창조자는 분명히 감각이 부족했지만 상상력이 풍부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Statue_CheckFailed_String
msgctxt "035b0eb8-34a6-428b-b23d-1e183af4a686"
msgid ""
"A massive statue of King Irovetti, made of pure gold and inlaid with gems. "
"It looks much more handsome than the king in real life."
msgstr "이로베티 왕의 거대한 동상은 순금으로 만들어지고 보석으로 상감 세공이 되었습니다. 실제 왕보다 훨씬 잘 생겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Statue_CheckPassed_String
msgctxt "e6e20308-329d-4823-ace9-59a55b261335"
msgid ""
"This massive statue of King Irovetti appears to be made of pure gold, and "
"inlaid with gems. Closer examination reveals that it's made of bronze, and "
"decorated with an illusion spell."
msgstr ""
"이로베티 왕의 거대한 동상은 순수한 금으로 만들어지고 보석으로 상감 세공이 되었습니다. 더 자세히 조사해 보면 청동으로 만들어졌으며 환상 "
"마법으로 장식되어 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Table_food_String
msgctxt "b0c440e9-4481-490e-804f-e33ad3afa226"
msgid "Untouched delicacies are getting cold on the table."
msgstr "테이블에 손길이 닿지 않은 음식은 식고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Throne_String
msgctxt "078c8c21-3227-4b06-869c-54279c76be65"
msgid "The antique throne is soiled with greasy stains from spilled gravy."
msgstr "골동품 왕좌는 엎질러진 육즙의 기름기로 얼룩져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Barks/Zone-barks/Troll_room_String
msgctxt "0a63cb5e-5e41-4ec0-be97-e362342ec252"
msgid "This room reeks of carrion doused with perfume."
msgstr "이 방에는 썩은 냄새를 향수로 덮은 냄세가 납니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Books/Biography_lies-name_String
msgctxt "b33a2304-680e-4b4c-b01f-1299dce44990"
msgid "\"The Path of Splendid Glory\""
msgstr "\"화려한 영광의 길\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Books/Biography_lies_String
msgctxt "3de5b2dc-45e2-408c-a36c-ab5f81800ee3"
msgid ""
"Author: Ingevord the Golden Quill, Professor of the Academy of Grand Arts of "
"Pitax\n"
"\"... and what country, what city had the honor of being birthplace of our "
"magnificent king, the unparalleled Castruccio Irovetti? This question is "
"more difficult than it seems. It's commonly believed that he comes from "
"Numeria – Starfall is usually named as his homeland. But his noble features "
"point to a relationship with the Taldan nobility. We theorize that his true "
"homeland is Oppara, the ancient capital of the great empire. Little "
"Castruccio once ran upon its granite pavements, feasting his eyes upon the "
"golden spires and domes, taking in the spirit of royal grandeur...\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 피탁스의 대 예술 아카데미 교수, 황금 깃펜 잉게볼드\n"
"\"... 어떤 나라, 어떤 도시에서 우리의 장엄한 왕이신 카스트루치오 이로베티가 태어났습니까? 이 질문의 답은 보이는 것보다 더 "
"어렵습니다. 일반적으론 누메리아 출신인 것으로 알려져 있습니다 – 스타폴이 일반적으로 그의 고향으로 여겨집니다. 그러나 그의 고귀한 "
"모습은 탈도르 귀족과의 관계를 가리킵니다. 우리는 그의 고향이 대제국의 고대 수도 오파라라는 이론을 세웠습니다. 어린 카스트루치오는 한때 "
"왕실의 위엄을 되찾아 화강암 포장 도로를 달리고 황금 첨탑과 돔을 바라 보았습니다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Books/Biography_true-name_String
msgctxt "1303acbe-ac30-4462-a697-a49be9001733"
msgid "\"Crown of the Card-sharper: the Dirty Secrets of King Irovetti\""
msgstr "\"카드놀음 사기꾼의 왕관: 이로베티 왕의 더러운 비밀\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Books/Biography_true_String
msgctxt "602fdc21-c044-44fc-947d-c679148f7897"
msgid ""
"Author: Scoffing Anonym\n"
"\"... the life and rule of his royal highness Irovetti has been called a "
"mystery hidden in a riddle. This is not exactly true – it would be more "
"precise to call it a mudpile buried under a mountain of manure. Irovetti "
"spreads incredible tales of himself, the kind you wouldn't believe no matter "
"where you heard them. Even his official biography offers six (!) versions of "
"his birthplace. So let's introduce some clarity: Castruccio Irovetti was "
"born in Numeria, in the city of Hajoth Hakados, in the noble, but not "
"terribly wealthy family of Bellander. At birth he was named Mandalarucio – a "
"name he had to shed after an unpleasant evening with some Technic League "
"agents, a load of rare artifacts and a stacked deck. But we'll get back to "
"that later...\""
msgstr ""
"저자: 무명의 조롱꾼\n"
"\"... 고귀한 왕 이로베티의 삶과 통치는 수수께끼라고 불리었다. 정확히는 사실이 아니다. 거름의 산 밑에 묻혀있는 똥덩어리라고하는 "
"것이 더 정확할 것이다 .이로베티는 자신에 관한 놀라운 이야기를 전하는데 들어본다면 믿음이 가지 않을 그런 이야기이다. 그의 공식 전기는 "
"그의 고향에 관한 것만도 여섯 개(!)를 제공하기 때문에 명확하게 소개하겠다. 카스트루치오 이로베티는 누메리아에 있는 하조스 하카도스 "
"시에서 태생이며, 귀족이지만 썩 부유하지는 않은 벨란더 가문 출신이다. 출생시 그는 만달라루치오라는 이름을 가졌는데, 기술 연맹 요원과 "
"희귀 유물의 쌓여있는 곳에서 불쾌한 저녁을 보내며 이름을 밝히게 되었다. 하지만 우리는 나중에 다시...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Books/Irovetti_diary_text_String
msgctxt "fc57c25c-0e96-4821-91a8-f1065dd43b03"
msgid ""
"\"So, this is it. The magic chunk of wood that N. needs so much. Out of "
"everyone I sent to procure it, that lame Tartuccio was the one to get lucky. "
"The rascal politely died, sparing me the need of paying... But to hells with "
"him. This odd piece of wood is what's important. E. said it was called "
"'Briar'. What's so special about it? Why's it so important for N. – and more "
"importantly, what's in it for me?\n"
"***\n"
"Started with the basics: tried to examine the piece of wood using magical "
"detection. Simple, right? My eyes nearly popped out. This thing has a "
"stunning aura. It's a major artifact – maybe even belonged to one of the "
"gods. Or an Eldest perhaps? N. is a fey – probably swiped it from someone in "
"the First World. Congratulations, Irovetti, you've hit the jackpot! Just "
"figure out fast what to do with it, before they take it away!\n"
"***\n"
"Artifacts, especially major ones, are deceptive. Hold it by the wrong end, "
"and a shitbucket of curses will shower down upon you. So before "
"experimenting with it myself, I gave it to my Engie-girl and told her to "
"poke Drelev with it. Nobody's ransom for him, and he's too proud to either "
"serve me or warm my bed – so let him be a test subject. It ended badly – the "
"poor fellow lost his mind. Well… That's a result too!\n"
"***\n"
"Engie-girl is like a totally different creature. She used to hiss at me and "
"threaten to bite something off unless I soothed her with a few spells. And "
"now she coaxes me, assumes the most seductive poses, whispers tender things. "
"She's fallen in love with me head over heels, and I haven't used any spells "
"on her for days! Looks like I somehow activated the wooden thing's witchery… "
"But how? Why wasn't it Drelev who fell in love with her, but she with me? I "
"need to continue these experiments...\n"
"***\n"
"I've got it! Touching the Briar causes the subject to fall in love with its "
"owner – that's me! Drelev's insanity doesn't fit into this, but we'll deal "
"with that later. As for now, I should try this artifact on… Hmm, whom? There "
"are so many opportunities – I don't know where to begin!\n"
"***\n"
"I used the Briar on A. B. – I couldn't lure that column of ice into bed "
"without divine intervention! At first I thought she went mad too. That "
"foolish woman started screaming, throwing plates, splashed wine on me – "
"acting more like a stallkeeper than a bard! But in a couple days my people "
"reported that she came to her senses – and was seeking revenge! Ha, ha, ha. "
"But still, what does it mean? How does this Briar work? There must be some "
"purpose!\n"
"***\n"
"I tested it on I. N. – same result, an ugly tantrum out of the blue. Ha, "
"Irovetti! You have everything – talent, wealth, power, but no luck in love – "
"none whatsoever!\n"
"***\n"
"Fun is fun, but I need to do something with the Briar, and soon. If N. finds "
"out I've been hiding her toy all this time, I'll be in trouble. But what "
"tragic comedy. – I hold this incredible power in my hands, but don't have "
"the key to use it! And I've no one to ask for advice – there's not a single "
"intelligent spellcaster nearby. I should have opened a school of magic "
"instead of an Academy of Grand Arts!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래, 바로 이거야. N이 그토록 원하던 이 나무로 만든 마법 덩어리. 이걸 얻으려 내가 보낸 사람 중에서 허술한 타투치오가 운이 "
"좋았던 사람이었어. 그 불량배는 얌전히 죽어서 내가 지불할 돈을 아끼게 해주었지...하지만 지옥에나 가라고 해. 이 이상한 나무 조각이 "
"중요해. E는 그것을 '찔레'라고 불렀어. 왜 그렇게 특별한 거지? N에게 그렇게 중요한 이유는 뭘까? 그리고 더 중요한 것은, 그 안에 "
"무엇이 있을까?\n"
"***\n"
"기초부터 시작하자. 마술 탐지기를 사용하여 나무 조각을 검사하자. 간단하지? 눈이 튀어나올 정도군. 이 물건에는 놀라운 아우라가 뿜어져 "
"나와. 이것은 주요 아티팩트야. 어쩌면 신들 중 하나가 가졌던 물건일 수도 있어. 아니면 원로의 것인가? N은 페이니까, 아마도 태초 "
"세계의 누군가에게서 그것을 훔쳐 갔을 테지. 축하해. 이로베티. 대박을 터트렸군! 그들이 빼앗기 전에 빨리 그것으로 무엇을 할지 빨리 "
"생각해둬!\n"
"***\n"
"아티팩트, 특히 주요 아티팩트들은 기만적이야. 거꾸로 쥐면 저주를 뒤집어 쓰겠지. 그래서 나는 실험하기 전에 그것을 소녀 엔지에게 주었고 "
"드렐레프를 찌르라고 말했다. 아무도 그에게 몸값을 지불하지 않았고, 나에게 봉사하거나 내 침대를 덥혀주는 것을 과하게 자랑스럽게 여겨. "
"그러니 그를 시험 대상으로 삼자고. 결과는 끔찍했어. 불쌍한 녀석은 미쳐버렸어. 뭐... 그것도 결과니까!\n"
"***\n"
"소녀 엔지는 완전히 다른 창조물과 같아. 그녀는 나에게 소리를 지르는 데 익숙해져 있고 나는 그녀에게 몇 가지 주문을 외우지 않으면 "
"무언가를 물었지. 지금은 그녀는 나를 끌어 들여 가장 매혹적인 자세와 부드러운 귓속말로 나를 유혹해. 그녀는 나와 사랑에 빠졌고, 나는 "
"며칠 동안 그녀에게 어떤 주문도 사용하지 않았어! 이 마법적인 나무 조각이 어떻게든 작동한 거 같은데... 그런데 어떻게 작동했지? 왜 "
"드렐레프가 그녀와 사랑에 빠지지 않고 나와 사랑에 빠졌을까? 실험을 계속해야겠어...\n"
"***\n"
"알아냈다! 찔레를 만지면 하수인은 주인과 사랑에 빠지게 된다. 그게 바로 나이고! 드렐레프의 광기는 이 문제에 적합하지 않으니 나중에 "
"다룰 거야. 당분간 이 아티팩트를 시험해 봐야겠다. 흠. 누구에게? 너무 많은 기회가 있어서, 어디서부터 시작해야할지 모르겠어!\n"
"***\n"
"나는 A-B에게 찔레를 사용했다. 나는 신성한 마법 없이 그 목석을 침대에 끌어들일 수 없었어! 처음에 나는 그녀가 화를 냈다고 "
"생각했다. 그 어리석은 여자가 비명을 지르며 접시를 던지고 나에게 포도주를 뿌렸어. 음유시인이기보다 노점상같았지! 그러나 며칠 뒤 "
"사람들이 그녀가 정신을 찾았고, 복수하려 한다고 알려주었어! 하하하. 하지만, 그것은 무엇을 의미하는 거지? 이 찔레는 어떻게 작동하는 "
"걸까? 어떤 용도가 있을 거야!\n"
"***\n"
"나는 I-N에게도 시험해봤어 – 같은 결과였지, 갑자기 못난 울화를 터뜨렸어. 하. 이로베티! 너는 재능, 부, 권력 모든 것이 있지만 "
"사랑에는 운이 없구나. 뭐, 상관없지! \n"
"***\n"
"재미는 재미지, 하지만 나는 찔레로 뭔가를 해야 해, 반드시. 만약 N이 내가 그녀의 장난감을 내내 숨기고 있다는 것을 알게되면 나는 "
"곤경에 빠질 것이다. 하지만 인생은 비극적인 코미디구나. 나는 이 놀라운 힘을 손에 쥐고 있지만, 그것을 사용하기 위한 단서가 없어! "
"그리고 조언을 구할 사람도 없다. 주변에 머리 좋은 마법사가 하나도 없어. 대 예술 아카데미 대신 마법 학교를 열었어야 했는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Books/Irovetti_diary_title_String
msgctxt "46d5309a-f97c-41c2-b1cb-dc1995ec39aa"
msgid "Irovetti's Notebook"
msgstr "이로베티의 일기"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "e5cbd634-9721-42c6-b814-eddd198f4e3c"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "266e17d5-941d-40f0-864b-17e3ecd1281c"
msgid "\"How did you die?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어떻게 죽은 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "13110bd7-6c00-4c4a-af65-f774325fc09d"
msgid "\"Now that I freed you, can you rest in peace?\""
msgstr "\"이제 너를 풀어줬으니 안식을 가질 수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e9ed6246-988a-460f-bd46-6273b53ac7fb"
msgid "\"Why does this palace have such strange architecture?\""
msgstr "\"이 궁전에는 왜 이런 이상한 건축이 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "0691cbc3-c8ef-4dc9-87ec-001671763f77"
msgid ""
"{n}You see the translucent form of an old man in dirty work clothes. His "
"gray hair is tousled, and his eyes wander madly. There's a piece of chalk "
"behind his ear.{/n} \"Free at last, at last! So many years... So many years "
"I've waited for someone to open that damn door!\" {n}Shrieking with rage, "
"the old man stamps his foot.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 더러운 작업복을 입은 노인의 반투명 형태를 보았습니다. 그의 회색 머리는 헝클어졌고 그의 눈은 미친 듯이 방황합니다. 그의 "
"귀 뒤에 분필 조각이 있습니다.{/n} \"마침내 자유다. 마침내! 오랜 세월... 그렇게 오랜 세월 동안 그 누군가를 기다렸지.\" "
"{n}분노에 떨며 노인은 바닥을 찹니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "7d258d47-7376-4f86-8f03-89c1c83b82d0"
msgid ""
"\"Who am I? Who am I? How can you not know me? Shame! Shame and disgrace! I "
"am Reaford Tabulus Vallersteil junior, the greatest architect among wizards "
"and the greatest wizard among architects! Who do you think built all this "
"grandeur? All these hallways, the halls, the arches... And doors, doors, "
"doors! It's all me, all me! My work!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구냐고? 누구냐니? 어떻게 나를 알지 못할 수 있지? 수치스럽군! 수치스럽고 불명예스러워! 나는 마법사 중에서 가장 위대한 "
"건축가이며 건축가 중에서 가장 위대한 마법사인 레포드 타불루스 발러스테일 2세다! 누가 이 장엄한 건축물을 지었다고 생각하나? 이 "
"회관들, 복도들, 아치들... 그리고 문, 문, 문들 말이다! 모두 나야, 나! 내가 만들었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "b5bea535-de07-4b1f-be4c-5e3d80f25b06"
msgid ""
"\"I was ruined by my own genius and other people's greed. I built this "
"exquisite palace for the queen of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, Delpina Liacenza... "
"The queen, that's right! A covetous, smug bandit queen! She was unworthy of "
"even washing the windows in my palace! Of course I wouldn't let her in. "
"People like her mustn't live in palaces, but watch them respectfully from "
"afar! She killed me, she did! Smeared these sacred walls with blood of their "
"creator! But even dead I refused to abandon my creation.\n"
"She entombed me here, in this little room. Killed me, then locked me away, "
"bricked me in... And closed the door!"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 내 천재성과 다른 사람들의 탐욕에 파멸되었다. 나는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 델피나 리아첸자 여왕을 위해 이 정교한 "
"궁전을 지었다... 그 여왕이야. 맞아! 탐욕스럽고 멍청한 산적 여왕! 그녀는 내 궁전의 창문조차 닦을 가치가 없다! 물론 나는 그녀를 "
"들여 보내지 않을 것이야. 그녀와 같은 사람들은 궁궐에 살면 안되지, 그저 멀리서 보며 손가락이나 빨라고 해! 그녀가 나를 죽였어! 이 "
"신성한 성벽을 창조주의 피로 물들였다! 그러나 죽어서도 나는 내 창조물을 버리기를 거부했다.\n"
"그녀는 이 작은 방에 나를 여기에 안치했어. 나를 죽이고, 나를 가두어 버리고 벽돌에 처 넣었어... 그리고 문을 닫았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "948aa974-33bd-47b9-8b65-221e82533160"
msgid ""
"\"Rest? By the nine circles, no! I've only started to live, you might say... "
"Well, not exactly live, but you take my meaning. You know, as I sat here "
"trapped, I've seen so many so-called kings and queens... Ordinary bandits, "
"all of them! These walls have never seen a true monarch! No one, positively "
"no one, has ever been worthy of living in this palace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"휴식? 아홉 구덩이에 맹세코, 절대 안된다! 나는 이제야 살기 시작 했어. 뭐, 정확히 살아 있는 건 아니라 하겠지만... 내 말 "
"뜻을 알겠지. 내가 여기 갇혀 앉아 있는 동안, 나는 자칭 왕과 여왕이라는 자들을 수도 없이 봐 왔다... 죄다 평범한 도적놈들이더군! "
"이 성은 진정한 군주를 보지 못했다! 아무도, 아무도, 이 궁전에 살 가치가 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "721636a2-2ae3-471c-b2f5-d2d8da30b0d4"
msgid ""
"\"But do you know who would be worthy of living here? Well, not living "
"exactly, but... it doesn't matter, doesn't matter! I mean me, of course! I "
"will be King of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}! We can have a true ghost kingdom! And "
"you... I will make you general of my ghost army as a reward for rescuing me! "
"You do want to be the king's general, right? Of course you do, of course! "
"Come, then!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 여기에 살만한 사람이 누군지 아나? 정확히 살지는 못하지만, 상관 없어. 상관 없다고! 물론 나다! 나는 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 왕이 될 것이다! 나는 진정한 유령 왕국을 가질 수 있다! 그리고 너... 나를 구해준 보상으로 내가 너를 "
"유령 군대 장군으로 삼아주지! 너는 왕의 장군이되고 싶지, 그렇지? 당연히 물론 그렇겠지! 이리 오너라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "2626c4df-af9c-4fa1-b293-ce89cf87d770"
msgid ""
"\"Strange? Strange you say? You don't understand! No one understands!? "
"Philistines! Narrow-minded fools! For you, a house is four walls and a roof "
"to keep the rain out! What do you know of hallways, doors, the poetry of "
"space? An architect's labor is sacred, like the deeds of the gods "
"themselves! Building a house is creating a world in miniature! This palace "
"is my confession, my treatise on the mystery of being, my poem of grief and "
"love... And no one, no one in the whole world is capable of reading it! None "
"of you is worthy of even approaching the threshold of my palace!\" {n}The "
"ghost is not talking but screaming, shaking his crooked finger in rage.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이상한가? 이상하게 들리나? 너는 이해하지 못한다! 아무도 모른다! 속물들 같으니라고! 속좁은 멍청이들! 너에게, 집이란 네 개의 "
"벽과 비를 막아주는 지붕에 불과하는군! 네가 복도, 문과 공간의 미에 대해 무엇을 알아? 건축가의 노동은 신들의 행위처럼 신성하다! 집을 "
"짓는 것은 세상을 만드는 것의 축소판이야! 이 궁전은 내 고백, 존재의 수수께끼에 대한 저서, 슬픔과 사랑의 시이다... 그리고 아무도, "
"온 세상의 아무도 그것을 읽을 능력이 없다! 세상 누구도 내 궁전 문턱에 다다를 가치가 없다!\" {n}유령은 말하지 않고 그저 비명을 "
"지르며 분노로 비뚤어진 손가락을 흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Ghost/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "01df9c8e-cd27-4a93-ae45-01e39475ffa1"
msgid ""
"\"Has this creature finally finished his avalanche of words? Even death did "
"not open his eyes to the transience of existence and the fires of pride. "
"Should we not fix that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 창조물이 마침내 언어의 눈사태를 끝내었는가? 죽음조차도 존재의 일시성과 긍지의 불길에 눈 뜨지 못했다. 그것을 고쳐야 하지 않겠나?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ede187ac-ab36-4a94-bb43-3729cd69c36a"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "dc72346b-2026-4705-a00f-89b9e3db2049"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "d5a433d1-154a-47bd-88d1-28e27bdb6423"
msgid "[Attack] \"Prepare to die!\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"죽을 준비나 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "d26c416b-dec2-49be-9200-01e5ae7eb195"
msgid ""
"\"Did you see the ghostly figure in the hallway? I think there are ghosts in "
"this palace!\""
msgstr "\"복도에서 유령을 보았어? 이 궁전에 귀신이 있는 거 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "55f69a45-9ef9-42ff-9b50-10e43330e5fa"
msgid "[Leave] \"Good-bye!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "c0b825b2-eaba-4738-a793-ff368aa2c87a"
msgid "\"Nyrd? I thought we killed you?\""
msgstr "\"Nyrd? 우리가 널 죽인 줄 알았는데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0051_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "dbe1c00a-dfbb-4a04-9070-7983321e42f7"
msgid ""
"Attacked Nyrd Zottenropple and her brothers, although they were not hostile."
msgstr "그들은 적대적이지 않았지만 니르드 조텐로플과 그녀의 형제들을 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "85473b14-61b0-4594-b109-ec0062213828"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"How many times do I have to kill you before you actually die?\""
msgstr "[공격] \"정말로 죽기 전에 몇 번이나 죽여야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "c4173b94-91f5-41b5-9bac-6194d5984ebc"
msgid "\"Why don't you leave this palace while you still can.\""
msgstr "\"가능하면 이 궁전을 떠나지 그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "acbb6576-2577-4eae-9a2f-a2b7aa733b14"
msgid "\"How did you manage to survive the Bleaching?\""
msgstr "\"백화에서 어떻게 살아남았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "13d3f684-449a-4bdf-8824-916ed60b2b0e"
msgid ""
"{n}These gnomes don't look too well: gray hair, pale skin and dim eyes say "
"they're suffering a serious case of the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}. But "
"their vitality certainly hasn't left them yet. Bickering busily, the gnomes "
"are searching the bookshelves, stuffing one volume after another into their "
"bags.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이 노움들은 썩 건강해 보이지 않습니다. {g|백화}노화{/g}로 인한 회색 머리, 창백한 피부, 희미한 눈으로 인해 심각하고 "
"끔찍한 고통을 겪고 있습니다. 그러나 그들의 활력은 아직 그들을 떠나지 않았습니다. 바쁘게 논쟁하면서 노움들은 책꽂이를 찾아 가방을 "
"하나씩 채우고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "88364c03-2340-4907-9d19-c9f818d2688f"
msgid "\"Look what I found! Look, look! We need to take this!\""
msgstr "\"내가 뭘 찾았는지 봐! 보라고! 이걸 가져 가야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "99f312c4-432a-4609-89d2-e3545bebe88a"
msgid ""
"\"What? 'Heat of the Forbidden Embrace'? Are you out of your mind? Forget "
"that filth, we're looking for magic books!\""
msgstr "\"뭐라고? '금단의 뜨거운 포옹'? 너 정신 나갔어? 그 더러운 책은 잊어. 우린 마법의 책을 찾고 있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "7df1193c-7373-49b8-81d6-1b9c3b96f001"
msgid "\"What do you know?! It's a rare book!\""
msgstr "\"네가 뭘 알아? 그것은 드문 책이라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "db2831b9-758e-4201-bc61-d410677b868f"
msgid ""
"\"Well, then, give me that... 'The elven king thought he ruled the whole "
"world – but who ruled the king's heart? Everything changes, when a young orc "
"boy stands in his way...' Oh, we'll be taking that – definitely!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐. 그럼. 줘 봐... '엘프 왕은 그가 온 세상을 다스리고 있다고 생각했지만 왕의 마음은 누가 다스렸을까요? 젊은 오크 소년이 "
"길을 나서면 모든 것이 바뀝니다.' 오. 우리는 이걸 반드시 가져가야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "b456c1c5-674c-4c7b-b87c-430155adab38"
msgid ""
"\"What do you think? Irovetti's finished! We're stuffing our bags and "
"leaving – and we recommend you do the same!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 생각해? 이로베티는 끝났다! 우리는 우리 가방을 채우고 떠날 거야. 그리고 너도 우리를 배우라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "b6ebcf9e-45eb-4a90-8c04-2810571b16f5"
msgid ""
"\"Just stuff them somewhere else! You can take the silverware or "
"candlesticks... But don't touch the books – the books are ours!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 다른 곳에 넣어둬! 은제품이나 촛대를 가져갈 수는 있지만... 책은 만지지 마라. 책은 우리 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "b7a6f3b9-7f8e-4a49-a64a-f59932376954"
msgid "\"You can take the one about hot, forbidden embraces.\""
msgstr "\"너도 뜨겁고 금지된 포옹을 가져가라구.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "d17da918-300f-4069-909f-77243867c552"
msgid "\"Don't even dream! I'm not giving it up!\""
msgstr "\"꿈도 꾸지 마라! 나는 포기하지 않을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "546f2576-5ef4-4a0d-8dca-f80f9d9ee013"
msgid ""
"\"I am Vyar Zottenropple, the most skilled wizard this side of the {g|Inner "
"Sea}Inner Sea{/g}! And here with me is... Someone who keeps trying to "
"piggyback on someone else's glory...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 비야르 조텐로플. {g|Inner Sea}내해{/g}의 이 구역에서 가장 숙련된 마법사이다! 그리고 여기 나와 함께 온 "
"녀석은... 다른 사람의 영광에 이득을 보려는 아무개이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "510531a1-fbc6-4863-bcd7-2cf48b89da2d"
msgid ""
"\"Brother, how you always thrust yourself forward! Don't listen to his "
"mumbles. I am Luar Zottenropple – the most skilled wizard on this AND THE "
"OTHER side of the {g|Inner Sea}Inner Sea{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 어떻게 그렇게 항상 나대는 거야! 내 형제의 말을 듣지 마. 나는 루아르 조텐로플이야. {g|Inner Sea}내해{/g}와 "
"그 밖의 다른 구역에서도 가장 숙련된 마법사이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "5a2fc567-bb04-436d-9360-cce8d7663017"
msgid ""
"\"And I am the great and horrible Nyrd Zottenropple, the most skilled wizard "
"on any side of any sea, and besides that, a master of teleportation!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 이몸은 위대하고 끔찍한 니르드 조텐로플이다. 어떤 바다에서도 어느 구역에서도 가장 숙련된 마법사이며 텔레포트의 마스터지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "b6020373-b32d-48cf-a555-f1706d1b2d26"
msgid "\"Wait, who are you? And why are we talking to you?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 너는 누구지? 왜 우리는 너와 얘기하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "e4683366-6783-4d0f-961c-4a3514bd8121"
msgid "\"Of course there are! Well, not ghosts – just one. But a real one!\""
msgstr "\"물론이지! 나는 유령이 아니라 한명의 노움이라구. 가짜가 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "8018fbd6-921b-4811-b95c-f5607a5def62"
msgid ""
"\"They say it's the ghost of the wizard who built this palace for the Queen "
"of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and then refused to let her inside! He said she was "
"unworthy of living in such a beautiful palace! She had to, you know...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 여왕을 위해 왕궁을 지은 것은 마법사의 유령이고 그들이 그녀를 안으로 들여 보내기를 거부했다고 "
"하는군! 그는 그녀가 이 아름다운 궁전에서 살 가치가 없다고 말했어. 그녀는 궁전에 살아야만 했지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "d3abd15a-1c2b-4b6e-be06-c2b2c359aaf7"
msgid ""
"\"They also say she didn't just kill him, but immured him alive somewhere in "
"the palace, in a room with countless treasures! We've been meaning to find "
"it, but never got around to it... And just now we're a bit busy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 여왕이 또한 자신을 죽이지 않고 궁전 어딘가 무수한 보물이 있는 방에 살려두었다고 말했어! 우리는 그것을 발견하려고 했는데 "
"아직까지 발견하지 못했지... 그리고 지금 우리는 조금 바쁘거든!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "47578e45-55b8-488a-975b-b823a3b2b561"
msgid "\"Yeah, right! Prepare yourself!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 맞아! 준비해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "2e78e61e-3677-44f0-87ac-a9e127bebb12"
msgid ""
"\"When we're done with you, everything that's left will fit into my hat!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 너와 볼일이 끝나면 남은 것 모두 내 모자에 넣을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "c667b593-e36c-43c7-a5bd-a26c5961710d"
msgid "\"We'll show you what it means to mess with the Zottenropples!\""
msgstr "\"Zottenropples이 벌이는 난장판이 무엇을 의미하는지 보여주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "b9bcf0c5-ab3a-42f7-b66b-0b843147f839"
msgid "\"Silly, why do you want a hat full of ashes?\""
msgstr "\"어리석군. 왜 재를 가득 채운 모자를 원하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "2f1d34c3-029a-4561-909a-6ceadd2cdb84"
msgid "\"I don't, I'm just saying! I don't even have a hat!\""
msgstr "\"아냐. 그냥 말 뿐이야! 나는 모자조차 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "6f1580eb-3bb1-4701-a3ae-1d645b14d2d9"
msgid "\"Wait, wait... I know your face! Have we met before?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐... 너를 본 적이 있어! 우리 전에 만난 적이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "a2927ae5-5f61-48f3-8a08-5eb85b18a558"
msgid ""
"\"Hey! I know h{mf|er|im}! That's {Name}, {mf|King|Queen} of... What's that "
"place called... Oh, right, {kingdomname}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이봐! 나는 이 녀석을 알고있어! {Name}인데 어디의 {mf|왕|여왕}라고 했지... 어디더라... 아. 맞아. "
"{kingdomname}였지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "c3a8d4c8-cb71-42c9-9eda-5bfd33156cfb"
msgid ""
"\"Seriously? That's {mf|king|queen} {Name}? Well, don't just stand there, "
"grab {mf|him|her}! Irovetti promised a fortune for {mf|his|her} head! Hey, "
"Highness, surrender or die!\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말이야? {mf|왕|여왕}{Name}라고? 꼼짝말고 {mf|그|그녀}를 잡아! 이로베티는 {mf|그의|그녀의}의 머리에 현상금을 "
"걸었어! 이봐. 전하! 항복하거나 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "d20cff46-f167-4b20-a702-ef4e3650ec0b"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|King|Queen} {Name}! It was {mf|him|her} that killed our {d|c51 Nyrd "
"Dies}sister{/d}! You scoundrel! We'll fry you alive for Nyrd!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{mf|왕|여왕}{Name}! 우리 {d|c51 Nyrd Dies}자매{/d}를 죽인 {mf|그|그녀}잖아! 이 악당 녀석! "
"Nyrd를 위해 산 채로 볶아주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "c7018a6a-6b8e-47e9-b8c3-256a790b9210"
msgid "\"{mf|He|She} doesn't recognize us, {d|Luar}Luar{/d}! Ha ha!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|그|그녀}는 우리를 알아보지도 못해. {d|Luar}루아르{/d}! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "f96459f4-efc0-45fc-a838-2042f50bd325"
msgid ""
"\"Of course not. We were frogs when we met at the Inconsequent Debates!\""
msgstr "\"물론 못 알아보지. 비논리 토론회에서 만났을 때 우리는 개구리였으니까!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "63ff4d80-a9c3-4d11-8aaf-b8c67f4b379d"
msgid "\"Glad to see you again, {name}! We had fun last time, didn't we?\""
msgstr "\"다시 만나서 반갑군. {name}! 지난 번에 재미있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "c7775aab-338f-4e69-86e8-e31568128e57"
msgid "\"Wait... You're {name}, and {name} is you?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐... {name}라고. {name}이 네 이름이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : LuarCottenrople
msgctxt "e1401764-40d5-47cb-b289-99205b544374"
msgid ""
"\"So {name} from Inconsequent Debates is the {mf|King|Queen} {name} from "
"{kingdomname}? Oh thick skull of mine, I should've figured it out earlier!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 비논리 토론회의 {name}은 {kingdomname}의 {mf|왕|여왕}{name}이라고? 왜 진작에 알아차리지 못했지. "
"나도 정말 멍청하군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "a324e22c-a152-4823-a483-38c0a50ec7ee"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, you fools! No one killed me! I mean, they did... but not quite!\""
msgstr "\"잠깐, 이 멍청이들아! 아무도 날 안죽였다고! 그러려고 했던 것 같긴 하지만...확실한건 아냐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "3a755621-a578-4c20-a544-573a5067a2a5"
msgid "\"Ny-yrd? Sister? But how?!\""
msgstr "\"Nyrd라고? 자매라고? 그런데 어떻게?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_NoBleaching_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "7048da56-2968-40ed-87e2-5d369ca6f20c"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome appears out of nowhere, laughing happily. Were it not for her "
"brother's reaction, it would be difficult to recognize the former Nyrd "
"Zottenropple. The wizard's hair is bright teal now, her eyes a piercing "
"green, and the insanity caused by the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} flared in "
"them no longer. {/n} \"What, didn't expect me? I'm all safe and sound, and "
"not even bleached any more!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 허공에서 나타나 행복하게 웃습니다. 그녀의 형제의 반응이 아니었더라면 이전의 니르드 조텐로플을 알아보는 것이 어려울 "
"것입니다. 마법사의 머리카락은 이제 짙은 청록색이며 그녀의 눈은 이지적인 녹색이며 {g|백화}백화{/g}로 유발한 광기가 더 이상 보이지 "
"않습니다.{/n} \"뭐야. 내가 나타날 줄 몰랐어? 나는 무사하고 게다가 노화도 진행되지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_NoBleaching_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "5bdecadb-c221-44b6-ac1c-d93c471d1880"
msgid ""
"\"Of course you did! I was about to go to {g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} "
"judgment, then I opened my eyes and where was I of all places? – The {g|"
"First World}First World{/g}! And the Host stood in front of me, that "
"monstrosity from the Inconsequent Debates. He... She... They... said, 'Nyrd, "
"Jubilost says hello! By his mercy you are granted {d|Jubilost "
"Nyrd}salvation{/d} from the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} and even something "
"approaching immortality – if you stay in the {g|First World}First World{/g}"
".' Of course I'd be happy to stay! But first I figured I'd go get my stupid "
"brothers! And here you all are.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 네가 한 거야! 나는 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 심판을 받으려고 했는데 그 때 눈을 떠보니 거기가 어디였게? {g|"
"First World} 태초 세계{/g}였어! 그리고 비논리 논쟁의 괴물이었던 날 초대한 자가 내 앞에 있었지. 그들이 이야기 하길 "
"'Nyrd. 주빌로스트가 안부를 전합니다! 그분의 자비로 당신은 {g|백화}노화{/g}에서 {d|Jubilost Nyrd}구원{/d}받아 "
"{g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}에 한해서 불멸에 가까워졌습니다.'고 했어. 물론 나는 머무르고 싶었지! 하지만 우선 내 "
"바보 같은 형제에게 가야겠다고 생각했어! 그리고 여기 너희들을 만나게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "0a0196ef-25e9-4b9a-b13b-83251f03cf53"
msgid ""
"\"Aha! That's the 'random gnome' who received the gift of the "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}!\""
msgstr "\"아하! {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}에게 선물을 받은 그 '노움'이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_NoBleaching_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "2d5fbb7c-ebb0-451f-9691-7aae48320ecc"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you so much. I liked you from the very moment we met.\" {n}Nyrd "
"winks at Jubilost.{/n} \"I'd ask for an autograph, but I already have about "
"eight books signed by you, which I stole from different places...\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 고마워. 만난 순간부터 널 좋아 했어.\" {n}Nyrd는 Jubilost에게 윙크합니다.{/n} \"나는 사인을 요청하고 "
"싶지만 나는 이미 다른 장소에서 훔친 8여권의 책에서 네 서명을 발견했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "95741845-94a2-4841-9eae-dc549a76f6b1"
msgid "\"Where are we headed now, Nyrd?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 어디로 향하고 있어? Nyrd?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_NoBleaching_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "7dd55898-8570-4d32-9001-85a79cd23b81"
msgid ""
"\"To the {g|First World}First World{/g}! I'll show you the way. It's so much "
"fun, brothers – there's more than enough to keep you from the "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} for two ages. And just think, you can throw your "
"favorite sister from a rock, ha ha ha, and it will do nothing to me! All "
"right, let's go. Just bring some books for me. I'm not taking you without "
"them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}야! 내가 그 길을 보여줄게. {g|백화}백화{/g}로부터 200년은 벗어날 수 있는 "
"재밌는 장소가 있다고. 생각 해봐 네가 가장 좋아하는 여동생을 바위에서 던질 수 있다고. 하하하. 그리고 나한테 아무 짓도 하지 "
"않을거야! 좋아. 가자. 그저 내게 책 좀 가져와. 책 없이 너희를 데려 가지 않을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : NirdCottenrople_IrovettiPalace
msgctxt "d4238b27-16b7-4982-93c7-e17371ac1951"
msgid ""
"\"I hope you haven't forgotten me — the great and terrible\n"
"{d|Nyrd}Nyrd Zottenropple{/d}, greatest magician on any side of any sea!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 잊지 않았으면 좋겠다. 어떤 바다, 어느 구역에서도 가장 위대한 마법사이자 위대하고 끔찍한 \n"
"{d|Nyrd}니르드 조텐로플{/d}을 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : VyarCottenrople
msgctxt "6b00fca6-b1bb-40ec-87fd-38c0adf96d96"
msgid ""
"\"I remember Nyrd saying that Irovetti put a fortune on {mf|his|her} head! "
"Poor Nyrd died to the{g|bleaching}Bleaching{/g} before her prime – but we'll "
"claim that fortune in her memory! So, Your Highness! Surrender or die!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티가 {mf|그의|그녀의}의 머리에 현상금을 걸었다고 Nyrd가 말한 걸 기억해! 불쌍한 Nyrd은 꽃을 피우기 전에 "
"{g|백화}백화{/g}로 죽었지만 그 유산은 기억 속에 남을 거야! 그러니 전하! 항복하거나 죽으시지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "eb580531-e00f-4a86-855a-c8411b261337"
msgid "\"Wait, you fools! I didn't die! I mean, I did... but like that!\""
msgstr "\"기다려. 이 멍청이들아! 나는 죽지 않았어! 죽었지만... 이렇게 살아있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Gnomes/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "5a4aea2c-598e-4bce-890b-4a3d3f653514"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't survive – it killed me! I was about to go to "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma's{/g} judgment, but then I opened my eyes and where was "
"I of all places? – The {g|First World}First World{/g}! And the Host stood in "
"front of me – you remember, that monstrosity from the Inconsequent Debates. "
"He... She... They... said, 'Nyrd, Jubilost says hello! By his mercy, you are "
"granted {d|Jubilost Nyrd}salvation{/d} from the {g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g}, "
"and even something approaching immortality – so long as you remain in the {g|"
"First World}First World{/g}.' Naturally I'd be happy to stay! But first I "
"figured I'd go get my stupid brothers! And here you all are.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 살아남지 못하고 죽었었지! 나는 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 심판을 받으려고 했는데 그 때 눈을 떠보니 거기가 "
"어디였게? {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}였어! 그리고 비논리 논쟁의 괴물이었던 날 초대한 자가 내 앞에 있었지. 그들이 "
"이야기 하길 'Nyrd. 주빌로스트가 안부를 전합니다! 그분의 자비로 당신은 {g|백화}백화{/g}에서 {d|Jubilost "
"Nyrd}구원{/d}받아 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}에 한해서 불멸에 가까워졌습니다.'고 했어. 물론 나는 머무르고 "
"싶었지! 하지만 우선 내 바보 같은 형제에게 가야겠다고 생각했어! 그리고 여기 너희들을 만나게 되었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "be0b48d5-6471-41a0-b569-c13a07d5aadd"
msgid "\"Castruccio.\""
msgstr "\"카스트루치오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a3acb173-2e5f-485e-9521-3c1378c93558"
msgid "\"Vasaccio.\""
msgstr "\"바사치오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e2e8467a-e9d3-48ae-8c03-a2b2288aeb12"
msgid "\"Irovetti.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "860ef82b-1baa-49df-ae63-f286fdddb4b3"
msgid "\"Mandalarucio.\""
msgstr "\"만달라루치오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "3ad35890-9cff-4b83-a91c-facbcb079a57"
msgid "\"{Name}.\""
msgstr "\"{Name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "b56299df-9843-46e6-ba33-fe4010f099f1"
msgid "[Attack] \"This is my answer!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이것이 내 대답이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "e9756f0b-a672-48c2-b268-0b11c5dd46c2"
msgid "[Leave] \"I don't have time for your questions.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"네 질문을 답할 시간이 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "2e8760e4-7380-4a22-b65d-0cadf1f10e4a"
msgid "\"Irovetti.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "e3e98fae-c4fc-44f9-a879-4843ee6524ed"
msgid "\"Liacenza.\""
msgstr "\"리아첸자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "eff12672-2482-41fb-9472-7587907ee065"
msgid "\"Bellander.\""
msgstr "\"벨란더.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "3a176acb-da2b-4186-970a-8bbabcc71ad8"
msgid "\"Vitruzzi.\""
msgstr "\"버트루치.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "60225a63-18c3-4970-a6d0-30496362b8af"
msgid "\"Aldori.\""
msgstr "\"알도리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "e498f80a-c985-4312-ae55-e67143ec0885"
msgid "\"Pitax.\""
msgstr "\"피탁스.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "172fee70-577c-4676-a32f-04e76153f8fc"
msgid "\"Oppara.\""
msgstr "\"오파라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "c9cbdab8-c77b-403b-90c1-7f43bed3d663"
msgid "\"Starfall.\""
msgstr "\"스타폴.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "48e4c444-2629-4a30-9367-bbf8b2f49704"
msgid "\"New Stetven.\""
msgstr "\"뉴 스텟븐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "6138defb-fa37-447f-a350-b05249b1b06b"
msgid "\"Hajoth Hakados.\""
msgstr "\"하조스 하카도스.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "5604ab3f-0432-4498-9e47-6457c94b8366"
msgid ""
"{n}The golem's head is polished so well that you see your reflection in "
"place of its face. It asks in a lifeless mechanical voice, {/n} \"What is my "
"name?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}골렘의 머리가 윤택이 나 얼굴이 비춥니다. 그것은 생명이 없는 기계적 목소리로 묻습니다.{/n} \"나의 이름은 무엇입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "d20aedd0-2142-4326-8e5c-9cca61a60713"
msgid "\"I hear. What is my surname?\""
msgstr "\"알겠습니다. 내 성은 무엇입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "3153ebfe-3071-4324-bedc-c80b20c33cba"
msgid "\"I hear. Where am I from?\""
msgstr "\"알겠습니다. 내 고향은 어디입니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "f5ef9af8-4347-45db-adfb-7b0136b0afa5"
msgid "\"I hear.\""
msgstr "\"알겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "775d1733-7810-41c3-82f2-989870be4b6d"
msgid ""
"\"You are me. I am you. Everything mine is yours.\" {n}The golem points at "
"the wall where a small niche opens.{/n}"
msgstr "\"당신은 나입니다. 나는 당신입니다. 내 전부는 당신의 것입니다.\" {n}골렘은 작은 틈새가 열린 벽을 가리킵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Golem/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "29358885-27ad-4972-8491-d2d714881d77"
msgid "\"You are not me. I am not you. Get out.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 내가 아닙니다. 나는 당신이 아닙니다. 나가십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fd3a94fd-7e43-4d62-a849-c0661ba45957"
msgid "Promised Irovetti to rule Pitax benevolently."
msgstr "이로베티에게 피탁스를 자비롭게 지배할 것을 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b3679153-42b3-4d9c-8a90-f4931ec74f9f"
msgid ""
"\"Better than you, that's for sure! I'll rule wisely and fairly, for the "
"good of my people.\""
msgstr "\"너보다는 나을 거야. 확실해! 나는 국민의 이익을 위해서 현명하고 공평하게 통치하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c1774ace-890f-4c83-8ae3-9a516d2ed545"
msgid "Promised Irovetti to let Pitax's people govern themselves."
msgstr "이로베티에게 피탁스 국민이 스스로 통치하게 두겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "66d844c3-6e12-4f43-b95e-5e71e275b889"
msgid ""
"\"They've never been your lands. Pitax belongs to its citizens – and I shall "
"return it to them.\""
msgstr "\"그곳은 너의 땅이 아니었다. 피탁스는 국민의 것이다. 나는 피탁스를 그들에게 돌려 줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0a2e3c2b-704b-4b9d-9f47-04a827835f3e"
msgid "Promised Irovetti to erase all memory of him."
msgstr "이로베티에게 그가 세운 모든 흔적을 피탁스에서 지우겠다고 약속했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "057239e4-0bb4-45a6-8a48-6c19ee2fa7f3"
msgid ""
"\"I will destroy everything you created and bury your name in oblivion!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 만든 모든 것을 파괴하고 너의 이름을 망각에 묻을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8409f492-ce46-409d-908a-badca29fc47b"
msgid "Promised Irovetti to rule Pitax like a tyrant."
msgstr "이로베티에게 폭군처럼 피탁스를 지배할 것을 약속합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "febe05da-d39c-4b47-884d-cd43dc3b564d"
msgid ""
"\"I will drain them dry. They will remember you as a wise and gentle king!\""
msgstr "\"나는 그들을 수탈할 것이다. 그들은 너를 지혜롭고 온유한 왕으로 기억할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "f52e83af-429a-4f22-bd69-486c4ead05f7"
msgid "\"First, tell me: what did you really send Tartuccio to do?\""
msgstr "\"우선 말해 봐: 타투치오를 보내서 시킨 일이 정확히 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "eada8a6f-0879-4ec4-a65b-b30282a99475"
msgid ""
"{n}The king greets you with a cup of wine in his hand.{/n} \"Well, here is "
"the finale. Irovetti's greatness. Irovetti's triumph. Irovetti's death. "
"Three acts, just as they teach at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}"
"... Ah, screw the Academy! I'm a bard myself – and not the worst one at "
"that! I know better than most that glory and grandeur last no longer than "
"bubbles in a glass of fizzy wine.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}왕은 손에 포도주를 채운 잔을 들고 당신을 반깁니다.{/n} \"그래, 마침내 대단원이로군. 이로베티 위대함. 이로베티의 승리. "
"이로베티의 죽음. {g|Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}에서 가르치는 세 개의 작품... 아, 아카데미는 "
"집어치우지! 나는 음유시인이고, 최악의 음유시인은 아니었으니! 나는 영광과 위엄이 와인 한 잔의 거품보다 오래가지 않는다는 것을 누구보다 "
"잘 알지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "4823c83d-7a65-4ab2-9483-11c17acdbe9d"
msgid ""
"\"You know, I didn't really want to fight you. Still, the fates of rulers in "
"these lands are written not by you or me, but by a certain fey we both know. "
"It's for her that fools like us stage our performance age after age. We "
"rise, win, and die at her pleasure! I tried to outwit her, but in the end "
"everything turned out just like the old crow wanted. Well... at least I "
"tried!\""
msgstr ""
"\"있잖아, 나는 정말로 너와 싸우고 싶지 않았다. 그러나, 이 땅의 통치자들의 운명은 너나 내가 쓰는 것이 아니다, 우리 모두가 알고 "
"있는 페이가 결정하는 것이지. 그녀에게 우리는 수 세기에 걸쳐 무대에서 연기하는 바보에 지나지 않아. 우리는 그녀의 즐거움만을 위해 "
"성장하고, 승리하고, 죽는다! 나는 그녀를 앞서려고 노력했지만, 결국 모든 것은 늙은 까마귀가 원하는 대로였다. 글쎄... 적어도 나는 "
"노력했으니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "1bfc926e-73ec-4205-862e-6ed297100277"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, {Name}... Oh, no, {mf|KING|QUEEN} {Name}! Ruler of the {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, and now, if you get out of "
"here alive – {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} as well! Tell me, your Royal Highness!...\" "
"{n}Irovetti takes a deep, mocking bow.{/n} \"When you are done with king "
"slaughter and wipe my blood from the floor – how are you going to rule my "
"lands?\""
msgstr ""
"\"말해봐라. {Name}... 오, 아니지. {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}! {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}, "
"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}의 지배자, 그리고 여기서 살아 나간다면 – {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}도 마찬가지겠군! 분부만 "
"내려주십시오. 고귀한 분이시여!...\" {n}이로베티는 조롱의 뜻으로 큰 절을 합니다.{/n} \"네가 왕을 도살하고 바닥에서 내 피를 "
"닦고 나면, 너는 어떻게 내 땅을 다스릴까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "9985b053-9487-4519-8658-b29fdf5c0571"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! Well, not bad. That will do for a legacy!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 음. 나쁘지 않은데. 그건 나중에 물려줄 때 써야지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "58ec4cd5-6285-4528-8064-5a12c049460c"
msgid ""
"\"Aww... how sweet! And when they start complaining, blame everything on the "
"tyrant's burdensome legacy!\""
msgstr "\"오... 귀엽기도 하지! 그들이 불평하기 시작할 때 폭군의 유산을 비난할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "4df1576f-e3f4-47f4-bdfc-124ac0b34ae4"
msgid "\"How noble! As long as they remember to pay taxes, right?\""
msgstr "\"품격있군! 세금을 내는 것을 잊지 않는 한에서 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "94e0b704-e769-4070-bb82-189a5ad6ce87"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no. That's the one thing you could never do. Kill me, grind my statues "
"to dust, forbid anyone even mention my name – in hundreds of years, "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} will still remember Irovetti! As for you? Who knows!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니지. 그건 네가 결코 하지 말아야 할 행위중 하나다. 날 죽이고, 내 동상을 가루로 만든 다음, 내 이름을 언급하는 사람은 쥐도 "
"새도 모르게 잡아가 봐라. 수백 년이 지나도 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 여전히 이로베티를 기억할 테니! 너는 어떻겠냐고? 누가 "
"알겠나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "8b7e816b-baf4-4bdb-80ce-7945c6001e1a"
msgid ""
"\"All right, enough talk. Our lady demands an outcome. Let's give her a show!"
"\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 잡담은 그만하지. 우리의 숙녀분이 결과를 요구하니. 그녀에게 쇼를 보여주자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "72015881-c88a-4962-9cfa-e68ff3803b38"
msgid ""
"\"Why do you care so much about that runt? Certainly, I'll tell you, why "
"not? The assault on the mansion was his own idea. The only thing he had to "
"do was infiltrate your group and use it to find a certain artifact in the {g|"
"Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. You see... just like you, I am the plaything "
"of a certain lady. She's been searching for that artifact for hundreds, "
"perhaps thousands of years. And who found it? You guessed it — our purple "
"friend! All these centuries, and that magic chunk of wood was hiding under "
"the roots of the Old Sycamore. I guess the whole tree grew from it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 그 난쟁이를 그렇게까지 신경 쓰지? 물론, 내가 말해주지. 왜냐고? 저택 공격은 그의 생각이었어. 그가 해야만 했던 일은 너의 "
"집단에 침투하여 조종해서 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 유물을 발견하는 것이었지. 너도 알다시피... 너처럼 나는 그 "
"여자의 장난감 말이야. 그녀는 수백 년, 수천 년동안 그 유물을 찾고 있었어. 누가 그것을 발견했을까? 추측해보라고. 우리의 보라색 "
"친구였지! 수백 년동안 그 마법이 담긴 나무 덩어리는 오래된 시카모어의 뿌리 아래에 숨어 있었다. 내 생각에 나무 자체가 그것으로부터 "
"자라났던 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "657f3adb-dccf-49ec-8466-909f572fd39e"
msgid ""
"\"You and I, we are alike. Her twin marionettes, both dreaming of cutting "
"the strings. I never told her I have the artifact. Instead I've studied it, "
"hoping to use it against her. I can't say I've made a lot of progress — the "
"only thing I've learned is that it can be used to throw people into love, or "
"madness... Well, if you win this battle, consider the magic stick a part of "
"my legacy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 나. 우리는 비슷하다. 그녀의 쌍둥이 마리오네트는 둘 다 줄을 자르는 꿈을 꾸고 있지. 나는 그녀에게 내가 유물을 가지고 있다고 "
"말한 적이 없다. 대신 나는 그것을 연구하여 그녀를 상대로 그것을 사용하기를 바라. 나는 많은 진전을 보았지. 내가 배운 것은, 그것을 "
"사람들이 사랑이나 광기에 빠지게하는 데 사용할 수 있다는 것 뿐이다. 이 전투에서 네가 이기면 그걸 내 유산이라고 생각해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_BeforeBattle/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "47292306-63f3-4b98-89d5-a9c9c1b5705e"
msgid ""
"\"I have answered your questions. Now it's your turn. Tell me — how are you "
"going to rule my lands?\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 질문에 대답했다. 이제 너의 차례다. 어떻게 내 땅을 지배할 테냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d061f4fc-324a-4742-9608-8cc2ade6725e"
msgid "Killed Irovetti without excessive words."
msgstr "말없이 이로베티를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "0baf734d-b29a-4d49-9d02-c7ae9d67ad5b"
msgid "[Finish Irovetti] \"Your words mean nothing now.\""
msgstr "[이로베티를 끝장냅니다] \"너의 말은 지금 아무 의미가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "2d055b97-b999-4aea-a42c-c6b4fd5fc3e5"
msgid "Offered Irovetti a just trial."
msgstr "이로베티에게 재판 받을 것을 명령했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8f2f4e3b-713c-438a-9a89-228d90dc5926"
msgid ""
"\"You'll have plenty of time to explain, when you're judged before all Pitax!"
"\""
msgstr "\"피탁스 시민 앞에 심판 받기 전에 네 죄를 변호할 충분한 시간을 주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1afec924-a0f4-4b59-8773-0b38b61ca67d"
msgid "Offered to make Irovetti an advisor."
msgstr "이로베티에게 보좌관이 되라 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "1a0d937a-ccf9-428d-9dec-cd0dc5b71899"
msgid "\"You don't need to die. Would you like me to make you my advisor?\""
msgstr "\"너는 죽을 필요가 없다. 내 보좌관이 되겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d211728e-777e-430f-a65a-40f88c239698"
msgid "Offered to make Irovetti a court jester."
msgstr "이로베티가 궁정 광대가 되도록 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "32f751c8-3f8c-42e9-ad43-05bc5c120d1b"
msgid "\"I won't kill you. You'll be a jester at my court!\""
msgstr "\"너를 죽이지는 않으마. 내 궁정의 광대가 되어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "54568103-56e3-4a52-971e-62bdf08798c8"
msgid "Offered Irovetti mercy."
msgstr "이로베티에게 자비를 베풀었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "f5738c3a-28a0-4fa3-9fca-b2e5b8391e4e"
msgid ""
"\"I don't wish to dirty my hands with your blood. Leave and never return!\""
msgstr "\"나는 네 피로 손을 더럽히고 싶지 않다. 떠나서 다시는 돌아오지 말아라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0015_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a049f808-9d40-4957-bb49-75492b1ef217"
msgid "Killed Irovetti while mocking him."
msgstr "조롱하면서 이로베티를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "458451ea-e5e6-4e2d-9f49-8ce88c27157c"
msgid ""
"[Finish Irovetti] \"Here are my words: It'll be my pleasure to finally smash "
"your arrogant mug against the floor!\""
msgstr "[이로베티를 죽입니다] \"한 마디 해주지: 네 거만한 낯짝을 부수게 되어 기쁘구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0964299f-beec-4641-ab63-f7e525fd3037"
msgid "Killed Irovetti and had your vengeance."
msgstr "이로베티를 죽이고 복수했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "90e78f3c-b6c9-4e76-8d48-5eb88b60a744"
msgid ""
"[Finish Irovetti] \"You're a Calistrian too, right? You know the saying when "
"we get our vengeance — I stab thee with my heart!\""
msgstr ""
"[이로베티를 죽입니다] \"너도 칼리스트리아의 신도야. 그렇지? 우리가 복수 할 때 하는 말을 알겠지 — 내 심장으로 너를 찔렀다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "20d8fafb-b3e3-4418-b67f-6087efd2953e"
msgid ""
"{n}There's a cynical smile on Irovetti's face, though it's covered in "
"blood.{/n} \"Well... I was sure I could defeat you. I didn't even compose "
"any final words. Ah well – you'll have to think of something for me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이로베티의 얼굴에는 피로 덮여 있지만 냉소적인 미소가 떠릅니다.{/n} \"글쎄... 나는 너를 이길 수 있다고 확신했다. 나는 "
"어떤 유언도 생각해두지 않았다. 아, 그렇지. 네가 나를 위해 하나 만들어 주면 되겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "bd56ccc9-db12-430e-a91d-cd8f00d249c2"
msgid ""
"\"Hell no. I won't give you this pleasure. This farce ends here and now.\""
msgstr "\"젠장. 너에게 즐거움 따위는 주지 않을 것이다. 이 광대짓은 여기에서 끝이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "94e430bd-7493-4d55-83ee-98ad50c42726"
msgid ""
"{n}Irovetti takes a flask from his belt and salutes with it in a jesting "
"toast.{/n} \"To you, {Name}. Now {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} is your pain in the ass, "
"and so is that fey slut. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이로베티는 그의 허리띠에서 플라스크를 꺼내 농담으로 축배를 듭니다.{/n} \"너를 위해 축배를 들지. {Name}. 이제 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 네 골칫덩어리다, 페이 창녀에게도 그렇게 되길. 잘 있거라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "38e88d1d-6537-4f0f-8c18-e17500a1982b"
msgid "{n}He takes a sip from the flask, and drops dead.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}그는 플라스크에서 한 모금을 마시고 죽었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "643f0266-000b-4511-93de-16252ccf761b"
msgid ""
"\"Ha, ha, ha! Even if I agreed to become servant where I was once king... We "
"both know that's not what she wants. This scene has been written. Only one "
"of us leaves here alive. And it looks like it's not going to be me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하, 하, 하! 한때 왕이었던 내가 하인이 되기로 했다 하더라도... 그녀가 원하는게 아니라는걸 우리 모두가 알고 있다. 각본은 이미 "
"쓰여졌어. 우리 중 한 명만이 살 수 있다. 이제 그건 내가 아닌 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "e6ea7c74-65c0-4ddf-92ea-bbd48f062f88"
msgid ""
"\"What an uncultured barbarian I'm leaving my kingdom to. Truly a disgrace!\""
msgstr "\"미개한 야만인에게 내 왕국을 맡기고 떠나야 한다니. 정말 불명예스럽군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "465dd1d6-9892-40e6-a3b5-64aee3a3c55d"
msgid ""
"\"I've been a jester all this time. A puppet in her hands. Now that place is "
"yours. Enjoy the throne while you can! As for me...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 여지껏 광대였을 뿐이다. 그녀의 꼭두각시 어릿 광대. 자, 이제 여기는 너의 땅이다. 즐길 수 있을 때 즐겨두라고! 나처럼..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "3f6f81d4-5c11-4da8-b1eb-f2791fe9214e"
msgid ""
"\"It's a bit too late for that, Your Highness. I know how much blood there "
"is on your hands! As for my own blood... Our lady has decided it shall be "
"shed today. Let's not disappoint her!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너무 늦었어. 네 손에 얼마나 많은 피를 묻혔는지는 나도 안다! 보아라. 내 피도 똑같지 않은가... 모두 그분께서 오늘이 나의 "
"마지막 날이라 결정하셨기 때문이다. 그분을 실망시키지 말자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "b6dd0896-00c1-4fcd-bfde-5804e8960f07"
msgid "\"Not bad – for a grotesque villain!\""
msgstr "\"악당에게 당하는 것도 나쁘지 않은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Irovetti_Dies/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "c439f3b8-a6e0-4867-8431-4258772c5744"
msgid "\"Ah, classic. See you later, then, at Her table!\""
msgstr "\"아. 멋지군. 나중에 보자. 그녀의 식탁에서!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Items/FakeBriar_description_String
msgctxt "64dc8fc6-25c1-4155-b447-86879ef91a08"
msgid ""
"A sophisticated replica of a powerful relic, with potent illusion spells "
"covering its useless nature."
msgstr "강력한 유물의 정교한 복제본은 실제와 같은 환상 마법이 걸려 가짜임을 숨깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Items/FakeBriar_name_String
msgctxt "c98f61ae-c61b-4857-b1a6-acba4340a34e"
msgid "Fake Briar"
msgstr "가짜 찔레"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Items/Secret_key_description_String
msgctxt "936b16c2-0bf7-4c73-8cfc-c534923a0100"
msgid "A small key found on Irovetti's body."
msgstr "이로베티의 시체에서 발견된 작은 열쇠."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Items/Secret_key_name_String
msgctxt "dd05be2a-ef91-4b8a-a817-1a9df1b32e12"
msgid "Gilded Key"
msgstr "도금한 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ea855d36-c513-4579-9619-4ce5d8b2e11e"
msgid "\"Baron Drelev?I didn't expect to see you here!\""
msgstr "\"드렐레프 남작? 너를 여기에서 볼 지는 기대하지 않았는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d6e1c515-8669-4a21-949e-eb6e7d0d8e5a"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "359ca72d-83a8-4521-8293-f62ee1b8b46a"
msgid "[Finish the baron] \"I will end your suffering.\""
msgstr "[남작을 죽입니다] \"너의 고통을 끝내주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "23a4d0b6-9fda-4fb9-a9d3-bcaf61d6a280"
msgid "\"Are you dead?\""
msgstr "\"너 죽은 사람이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a51de47b-e9ee-430f-acff-dc12991ab57f"
msgid "\"If you're dead, how can you be talking to me?\""
msgstr "\"네가 죽었다면 어떻게 나와 이야기할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "87dce911-0341-4958-9659-2e39eca3058d"
msgid "\"How did you die?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어떻게 죽은 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "f34cf8e6-4202-4053-b62b-649565ca164a"
msgid "\"What are you doing in Irovetti's prison?\""
msgstr "\"이로베티의 감옥에서 뭘 하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "7e3889c2-51c7-4baa-afc3-2852a8de2757"
msgid "\"Are you out of your mind? It looks like you're alive and well.\""
msgstr "\"너 제정신이야? 너 정말 생생히 살아있는 것 같다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5381c471-adef-4b76-b878-e2a90cded463"
msgid "Sent the mad Baron Drelev to a priest for help."
msgstr "미친 드렐레프 남작을 제사장에게 보내 도움을 요청합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "186efb25-b05a-4a88-af17-789ffb67534b"
msgid ""
"[Open the cage] \"There's no reason for you to stay in this cage, whether "
"you are dead or alive. By the way, if you wish to be brought back to life, "
"go outside and find the cleric Drey Yarnes. Tell him {Name} sent you and you "
"need help.\""
msgstr ""
"[감옥 문을 엽니다] \"살아있든 죽었든 네가 감옥에 있을 이유가 없어. 다시 살고 싶다면 나가서 성직자 드레이 얀스를 찾아. "
"{Name}이(가) 너를 보냈으며 도움이 필요하다고 전해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "4f6efd92-86df-4e69-ad5e-fccee37a46e4"
msgid "\"If you're dead, does that mean a priest can resurrect you?\""
msgstr "\"네가 죽었다면 사제가 너를 부활시킬 수 있단 말인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "f2c3dbd0-17d6-457e-9971-c9b7662d786e"
msgid "\"I have a few questions for you.\""
msgstr "\"몇 가지 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "3b3af216-17f7-47ef-bfc8-0b5a91d52d2c"
msgid "\"Thank you for your answers.\""
msgstr "\"답변해 주어 고맙군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "e7070b0c-0fd7-460c-a5f4-30d7fe7be3fa"
msgid "[Use detect magic] \"Let's see what we have here...\""
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]\"여기에 뭐가 있는지 보자고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "04bd83dc-e3b0-434c-9a4c-9b8fd4c414c8"
msgid ""
"{n}You barely recognize the man sitting in the cell. He's changed much over "
"the years since you saw Baron {d|Drelev}Hannis Drelev{/d} at the formal "
"reception in Restov. Once muscular arms are now thin, his skin is pale, his "
"eyes sunken. He's sitting on the floor, staring at his hands.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 감옥에 앉아있는 남자를 간신히 알아볼 수 있습니다. 레스토프의 공식 연회에서 {d|drelev}하니스 드렐레프{/d} 남작을 "
"본 이후로 그는 수 년동안 많이 바뀌 었습니다. 일단 근육질의 팔이 얇아졌고 그의 피부는 창백해 그의 눈은 쳐져 있습니다. 그는 바닥에 "
"앉아서 손을 쳐다보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "8815c5f8-3c73-43bc-9a27-a9123cd198c6"
msgid ""
"{n}The baron gives you no notice. He just remains sitting, looking down.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}남작은 당신에게 눈길도 주지 않습니다. 그는 앉아서 바닥을 내려다 보고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8b07f645-26e7-4224-96c8-27e2ed3f295a"
msgid ""
"{n}Baron Drelev submits meekly to death by your hand. He doesn't even lift "
"his gaze.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}남작 드렐레프는 온순하게 당신의 손에 의해 죽음을 받아들입니다. 그는 심지어 눈길조차 주지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "394af933-4978-45b8-8bfa-7395b958513c"
msgid ""
"{n}The baron's lips begin to tremble, but he doesn't lift his eyes from his "
"hands. Just when you begin to sense you won't be getting an answer, he "
"speaks softly,{/n} \"You are too late. Baron Hannis Drelev is dead. This is "
"only a corpse.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}남작의 입술이 떨리기 시작하지만 그의 손에서 시선을 때지 않습니다. 당신이 대답을 얻지 못할 것이라는 것을 느끼기 시작할 때 그는 "
"부드럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"너는 너무 늦었다. 하니스 드렐레프 남작은 죽었다. 이것은 시체일 뿐이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "a85e870f-42ee-4cf8-8ba1-c62b3f965fd6"
msgid "{n}The baron shrugs ever so slightly.{/n} \"I don't know.\""
msgstr "{n}남작은 약간 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"나는 모른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "2de3431c-ac7a-49d3-a718-6c086cc8417a"
msgid "{n}After a long pause, Hannis speaks softly and simply.{/n} \"Yes.\""
msgstr "{n}오랜 침묵이 흐른 후, 하니스는 부드럽고 간단하게 말합니다.{/n} \"그래.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "4ff0a2bf-7006-4386-990b-4edc4520a3eb"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti keeps a monster as a servant. A pet naga. It assumes different "
"shapes for him... But that's not important. He gave her a weapon. A wooden "
"sword. Probably magic. He told her to pierce Drelev with it. She did. And "
"Drelev died.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티는 괴물 하나를 하인으로 기른다. 애완용 나가지. 그에게는 다르게 보이는 듯 하다... 그러나 그것은 중요하지 않다. 그는 "
"그녀에게 무기를 주었다. 나무 칼이야. 아마도 마법이 걸렸겠지. 그는 그녀에게 드렐레프를 꿰뚫어 보라고 말했다. 그녀는 그 말을 따랐고, "
"드렐레프는 죽었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "313c2d8f-8909-43e6-90d7-6e8c27ad1361"
msgid ""
"{n}Drelev interlocks his fingers.{/n} \"The baron left {g|Restov}Restov{/g} "
"for {g|Glenebon}Glenebon{/g}. Stumbled into an ambush. Irovetti slaughtered "
"his people, and captured him. No one paid a ransom for Baron Hannis Drelev. "
"Then Irovetti killed him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드렐레프는 그의 손가락을 교차합니다.{/n} \"남작은 {g|Glenebon}글레네본{/g}을 위해 {g|Restov}레스토프{/g}"
"를 떠났다. 그리고는 매복에 빠져 들었다. 이로베티는 그의 백성을 학살하고 그를 잡았다. 하니스 드렐레브 남작의 몸값은 아무도 지불하지 "
"않았지. 그 때 이로베티는 그를 죽였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "9e8c6c5f-c605-484b-acd0-c2b6abaa9215"
msgid ""
"\"Look closer.\" {n}Drelev lifts his hand, and probes the skin on his cheek "
"with his trembling fingers – it's pale, but quite healthy.{/n} \"You see? "
"The skin peels away. Fingers, rotten to the bone. This corpse has no eyes, "
"no heart, no stomach... Nothing. Smell it. It stinks of dead flesh.\""
msgstr ""
"\"자세히 살펴 봐.\" {n}드렐레프는 손을 들어 올리고 떨리는 손가락으로 뺨의 피부를 만집니다. 창백하지만 건강합니다.{/n} \"보여"
"? 피부가 벗겨졌어. 손가락은 문드러져 뼈가 드러났다. 이 시체는 눈이 없고 심장도 없고 위도 없어... 냄새를 맡아봐. 시체 냄새가 나."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "2179feab-89b5-4c32-bc48-887ac64ec8ce"
msgid ""
"{n}Drelev doesn't react to your words, and keeps looking down at his "
"hands.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}드렐레프는 당신의 말에 반응하지 않고 그의 손을 계속 주시합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "11626fb3-1775-4bb7-ab9f-73492ff7458d"
msgid ""
"\"Drey Yarnes, a priest. A priest... Can resurrect Drelev?\" {n}Hannis "
"stands up with effort and leaves the cell, swaying unsteadily on his "
"feet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"드레이 얀스 사제. 사제... 드렐레프를 부활시킬 수 있을까?\" {n}하니스는 가까스로 일어나서 휘청거리며 감방을 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "7a53ffc0-d4fa-41da-8593-3c2c74e2a873"
msgid "\"This... These questions make no sense.\""
msgstr "\"이...이 질문은 말이되지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "e082c266-f6ef-4cbb-b89e-dbf03d518f39"
msgid ""
"\"A priest?\" {n}Hannis moves his lips silently.{/n} \"Yes, a priest... Do "
"priests resurrect the dead? Yes... Perhaps a priest can help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사제?\" {n}하니스는 조용히 입술을 움직입니다.{/n} \"그래. 사제... 사제는 죽은 사람을 부활 시키나? 그래... 사제가 "
"아마 도와 줄 수 있겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "e0f197dc-e5b9-45a8-bfb5-6dbac28454d4"
msgid "{n}Baron Drelev pays no attention to you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}드렐레프 남작은 당신에게 신경 쓰지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "009dab8b-2fdb-4c0c-bf1a-3c3c70c92bd0"
msgid ""
"\"This Drelev is a real scumbag. He wouldn't have spared you — and yet you "
"saved him anyway. I hope he doesn't blow this shot at a new life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"드렐레프 이 사람은 진짜 쓰레기네요. 그는 너를 살려주지 않았지만, 어쨌든 당신은 그를 구해주셨죠. 저는 그가 새로운 삶에서 이 "
"기회를 날려버리지 않기를 바래요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "94971a27-2f26-4025-a7a2-345b7ca1b63a"
msgid ""
"\"He died alive — and will return to life, thanks to you. You granted him "
"another chance at life... as you did once for me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 죽다 살아났고, 당신 덕분에 일상으로 돌아갈겁니다, 감사합니다. 당신은 그의 인생에 또 다른 기회를 주었습니다... 저에게 하신 "
"것처럼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "5d20baed-398c-4692-bbfe-1a81080f0c4e"
msgid ""
"{n}Hannis raises his face with difficulty and looks at you.{/n} \"Thank you, "
"{Name}. Perhaps Baron Drelev will live again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하니스는 어렵게 얼굴을 들어 당신을 보았습니다.{/n} \"고맙다. {Name}. 어쩌면 남작 드렐레프는 다시 살아날 수 있을 "
"것이다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mad_Drelev/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "d00bfbb1-3969-45ac-93db-6e0cfe76fdce"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems that there are no active spells on Drelev. However, you notice "
"some traces of a strange magical aura. It reminds you of the one that filled "
"the chamber under the Old Sycamore where you fought Tartuccio. One could "
"assume that these traces were left by some powerful artifact, but there's no "
"guarantee of that.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}드렐레브에는 활성화된 주문이 걸리지 않은 것으로 보입니다. 그러나, 이상한 마법의 흔적을 발견합니다. 그것은 당신이 오래된 시카모어 "
"지하에서 타투치오와 싸웠을 때 그 방을 채웠던 무언가와 비슷합니다. 이 흔적은 강력한 아티팩트에 의해 남겨졌다고 추측할 수 있지만, "
"보장은 할 수 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "161d269b-a662-4281-867c-06acb5dc949a"
msgid "Allowed Irovetti's soldiers to desert."
msgstr "이로베티의 병사들이 탈영하도록 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "ceb69867-b002-4474-92ac-86bad3497fa5"
msgid ""
"\"Those who don't wish to die for Irovetti may go. The others – to arms!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티를 위해 죽기를 원하지 않는 자들은 가라. 그렇지 않으면 무기를 들어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c2cd35c5-f361-4326-954b-959a6627b54d"
msgid "Killed Irovetti's soldiers who tried to desert."
msgstr "탈영하고자 하는 이로베티의 병사들을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "25751926-e764-49c3-80ef-b7da3300315f"
msgid "\"So, the tyrant's henchmen! You're all guilty, and you will all die!\""
msgstr "\"그래, 폭군의 하수인들! 너희는 모두 유죄이니, 모두 죽어야겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "84d9cf2e-0e18-4dbd-8970-a8fb5054bc8b"
msgid "Cruelly killed Irovetti's soldiers who tried to desert."
msgstr "탈영하려는 이로베티의 병사들을 잔인하게 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "10ce6aca-c0df-4796-abd2-38de6c27d50b"
msgid "\"No one leaves here alive! I'll smash you against the walls!\""
msgstr "\"아무도 살아서 나가지 못한다! 벽에 짓이겨 주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxWardenMelee_MessHallDialogue
msgctxt "4a82576c-d64e-4627-a5d8-3814998ebe9c"
msgid ""
"{n}It's noisy in the canteen: Irovetti's guards are vigorously discussing "
"the ongoing battle.{/n} \"The old families have started to riot. Street "
"fights are springing up all over the city! We can't hold down the uproar! "
"Irovetti's lost his grip, it's clear as day!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}식당이 시끄럽습니다. 이로베티의 경호원은 현재 진행 중인 전투를 격렬하게 논의하고 있습니다.{/n} \"오래된 가문이 폭동을 "
"일으키기 시작했다. 도시 곳곳에서 거리 싸움이 일어나고 있어! 우리는 소동을 억제 할 수 없다고! 이로베티는 권력을 잃었고 날이 갈수록 "
"분명해지고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : PitaxWardenRanged_MessHallDialogue
msgctxt "dc8127aa-a50b-4fee-9f1d-9093d2c13738"
msgid ""
"\"And that {Name}! Did you see {mf|him|her} handle Villamor? You think we "
"stand a chance against {mf|him|her}? {mf|He|She}'s almost here! Let's run "
"for it while we still can!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 {Name}! {mf|그|그녀}이(가) 빌라모르를 손봐주는 거 봤어? {mf|그|그녀}에게 맞선다고 우리가 이길거라 생각해? "
"{mf|그|그녀}는 거의 도착했어! 될 수 있으면 도망가자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Gaetane
msgctxt "27e94973-2737-4467-9c23-c84614ae8670"
msgid ""
"{n}The wererat shows its crooked teeth in a fierce grin.{/n} \"Cowardly, "
"useless fools! Did you eat the royal food? Drink his wine? Stuff your "
"pockets with his gold? Now you'll stay and fight for him! I'll eat the face "
"of anyone who tries to escape!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}쥐인간은 비뚤어진 이빨로 날카로운 미소를 보여줍니다.{/n} \"겁 많고 쓸데없는 바보들! 왕실의 음식을 먹었지? 그가 하사한 "
"와인도 마시고? 네 주머니에 채운 그분의 금화는? 이제 그를 위해 싸워라! 도망치는 녀석은 얼굴을 뜯어 먹어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Gaetane
msgctxt "4e126e96-45cf-4a6a-856d-40407800d680"
msgid ""
"\"{Name}! I will eat your liver! Gnaw out your guts! Suck the marrow from "
"your bones!\""
msgstr "\"{Name}! 네 간을 먹어주마! 너의 내장도 갉아줄 테다! 뼈에서 골수를 뽑아 먹어주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b9f3357f-3b8c-4dd5-b8ea-0c22421c1df8"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Run, run! Ha ha ha! Hold on to your pants!\" {n}Octavia smiles at you "
"broadly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그래! 도망가라! 하하하! 바지 벗겨질라!\" {n}옥타비아는 당신을 향해 크게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/Mess_Hall/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "cd0f4265-a39a-470a-9ff5-ae56bc49ccd9"
msgid "\"Guilty, not guilty... What's the difference?\""
msgstr "\"유죄, 무죄... 그 차이점은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/1_Irovetti_String
msgctxt "21b6c5a7-b34c-41ce-aeb5-02b86f5876f6"
msgid "\"Engelidis! Where are you? Come here, quickly!\""
msgstr "\"엥겔리디스. 어디 있느냐? 빨리 오너라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/2_Irovetti_String
msgctxt "ca8dcc8e-3e59-4d23-bfd5-9a2b6218b830"
msgid "\"I and Briar in my hand command you: kill {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"나와 내 손의 찔레가 명령한다. {mf|그|그녀}를 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/3_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "ddcbba33-3a15-4abf-b4c2-29ea9eb72507"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, my beautiful peacock! You can't tell love from gold. You sell and you "
"buy, you rob and steal...\""
msgstr "\"아, 내 아름다운 공작새야! 금에게 사랑을 말할 수는 없어. 너는 팔고 사고, 훔치고 강탈할 뿐이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/4_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "bed928f2-1023-4d05-801d-5cbc6a47d516"
msgid ""
"\"But whatever you stole can be stolen from you. With what will you pay, "
"when everyone sees that the gold in your hands is but glimmer?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 네가 훔친 것은 무엇이든지 도난 당할 수 있지. 네 손에 금이 아니라 반짝이만 남아있는걸 모든 사람이 알게 된다면, 너는 무얼 "
"지불할거냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/5_Irovetti_String
msgctxt "7f60cb1a-281b-49a6-8caa-fdf4d3efff36"
msgid "\"My lady? I was just going to give it to you...\""
msgstr "\"여주인? 당신에게 그걸 주려고 했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/6_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "82075a8e-6933-4056-afb5-20ef534d5396"
msgid ""
"\"My self-assured peacock. Did you think you could hide from me something "
"that used to be a part of me?\""
msgstr "\"자존심 강한 공작새야. 내 것이었던 것을 내게서 숨길 수 있다고 생각했느냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/7_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "d7471545-b6b0-4456-9d6d-89de5fae1c9b"
msgid ""
"\"Don't bother explaining yourself to me. Save it for your little snake. I "
"say only this – farewell!\""
msgstr "\"변명하느라 고생하지 마라. 너의 작은 뱀을 위해 남겨두렴. 내 마지막 말이란다 – 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/8_Engelidis_String
msgctxt "8f29d655-d796-4ff4-9d1c-f02c9e006912"
msgid "\"Irovetti! Now you're going to pay for everything!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티! 이제 모든 대가를 치룰 차례다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/FakeBriar/9_Irovetti_String
msgctxt "6cd662b8-a739-4f77-b6d5-84c8d92dd0bd"
msgid "\"No, no, no. Engelidis, my love... Don't!\""
msgstr "\"안돼, 안돼, 안돼. 엥겔리디스, 내 사랑... 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/RealBriar/1_Irovetti_String
msgctxt "b7161f7c-9aca-4ed0-a849-ee1f13d47fb8"
msgid "\"Engelidis! Where are you? Come here, quickly!\""
msgstr "\"엥겔리디스. 어디 있느냐? 빨리 오너라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/RealBriar/2_Irovetti_String
msgctxt "9947f7e5-022b-410b-8d28-d47e424e9fe1"
msgid "\"I and Briar in my hand command you: kill {mf|him|her}!\""
msgstr "\"나와 내 손의 찔레가 명령한다. {mf|그|그녀}를 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Pitax_IrovettiPalace/MidBattle/RealBriar/3_Engelidis_String
msgctxt "ddb665e7-f86e-4f8f-b54a-336b52c7d1c0"
msgid "\"Oh, yes, my love... I won't let anyone harm you. Anyone!\""
msgstr "\"오. 그래. 내 사랑. 아무도 너를 해치게 두지 않을게. 아무도!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Barks/RenshalaAppears_String
msgctxt "24b0abce-f701-44c1-8a1b-d95a4d51c277"
msgid "\"What is going on here?! Who dares attack my camp?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야? 누가 감히 내 진영을 공격했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Items/WalshLetter_String
msgctxt "5993661e-a0aa-490f-b705-c5cb587ca065"
msgid ""
"\"Renshala of the Riversong House,\n"
"Your trade house remains one of Pitax's prides, bringing wealth and traffic "
"to our noble city. While your independence is admirable, the River Kingdoms "
"are no longer a place where free spirits and a fast blade are enough to "
"ensure the safety of so prosperous a family. Twice you have spurned His "
"Highness King Irovetti's offers of protection, and as his agent, I extend "
"that offer once more — with a warning. The hordes of {name} grow "
"increasingly restless, and tales of that monarch's ruthless savagery are "
"confirmed more every day. As {mf|his|her} gaze turns south to Pitax, we "
"would do well to stand together. Set aside any quarrels you may have with "
"the king, and accept his guiding hand in these troubled times.\n"
"Ever the servant of Pitax and its people,\n"
"Magistrate Walsh Celvoway\""
msgstr ""
"\"리버송 가문의 린샬라.\n"
"당신의 무역 회사는 고귀한 도시에 부와 교통을 가져다주는 피탁스의 자부심 중 하나입니다. 당신의 독립은 감탄스럽지만, 강의 왕국들은 더 "
"이상 자유로운 영혼과 재빠른 칼만으로 번성한 가문의 안전을 보장받는 곳이 아닙니다. 당신은 이로베티 왕의 보호 제안을 두 차례 "
"거절했으며, 그의 대리인으로써 나는 그 제안을 경고와 함께 한 번 더 연장합니다. {name} 떼거리가 끝도 없이 불어나고 있으며, 그 "
"군주의 무자비한 야만스러움이 매일 더 유명해집니다. {mf|그|그녀}가 시선을 남쪽에서 피탁스로 돌렸으니, 우리는 함께 하는것이 "
"나을겁니다. 왕과의 분쟁을 제쳐두고, 어려운 시기임에도 내미신 왕의 인도를 받아들이십시오.\n"
"피탁스와 그 백성의 종,\n"
"치안 판사 월시 켈보웨이\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Items/WalshLetter_name_String
msgctxt "bdf32fc9-afb2-44d5-a837-b5aade143599"
msgid "Note From Celvoway"
msgstr "켈보웨이가 쓴 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "1e41fceb-f8a6-4847-9d4d-deebd5ecd798"
msgid ""
"We slipped into the river, swimming up to the camp to take cover behind the "
"boats."
msgstr "우리는 보트로 몸을 가리며 강에서 야영지까지 수영했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "c614afc6-46c2-4b30-ab70-b59a089134d2"
msgid "We began our approach by picking our way through the swamp."
msgstr "우리는 늪지를 선택하여 접근하기로 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0ce1048e-dbae-44a3-b4b6-25b5dc05820e"
msgid ""
"We circled around to approach from the woods, seeking some game trail or "
"other path that could lead us through the undergrowth."
msgstr "우리는 숲에서 둘레길을 통해 접근하여 사냥할 때 가는 길이나 덤불을 통과 할 수 있는 길을 찾습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "8a737399-6f18-47cc-93e8-a1c2baf92e11"
msgid ""
"On reviewing the situation, our leader elected to return at a later time."
msgstr "상황을 검토하면서 우리의 지도자는 나중에 돌아오기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1d5ba632-01f5-42d0-a8f4-6beea6313dee"
msgid "We threw the caution to the winds and approached the camp."
msgstr "우리는 바람을 주의하며 야영지에 접근했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "ec1116fd-94a0-4448-a1fa-66d813eefa1e"
msgid "There was no time to waste. We burst from hiding with weapons drawn!"
msgstr "낭비할 시간이 없었습니다. 우리는 은신을 풀고 무기를 꺼내들었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "4a680aa2-74ac-40ea-bf29-9b232a7ab7e3"
msgid ""
"We made a rustling near the boats, hoping to lure and subdue a few sentries."
msgstr "우리는 보트 근처에서 돌아다니며 감시병 몇을 꾀어내 진압하기를 시도합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0017_Text_String
msgctxt "5758964a-707c-4f1d-8828-70953f34d097"
msgid "We sneaked closer, hoping to launch a surprise attack."
msgstr "우리는 기습 공격을 하기를 바라면서 몰래 접근합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "57bc349a-2e18-49ca-88f2-90bd671fe100"
msgid ""
"That's when our leader set fire to the boats, sowing chaos in the camps "
"before we launched our attack!"
msgstr "그 때 우리 지도자가 공격을 시작하기 전에 야영지의 보트에 불을 질러 혼란을 야기합니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0024_Text_String
msgctxt "f97d26a8-2c67-4bde-9317-416afb7c25ab"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "ad800270-0cef-4dc2-b8e8-8da20754bf49"
msgid ""
"We made a rustling near the reeds, hoping to lure and subdue a few sentries."
msgstr "우리는 갈대숲 근처에서 돌아다니며 감시병 몇을 꾀어내 진압하기를 시도합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "ed037433-2264-401d-b8d9-5b60ffa116b9"
msgid ""
"Our travels brought us to the {g|Littletown}Littletown{/g} surroundings in "
"pursuit of the dastardly river pirates who have preyed on innocent merchants "
"and travelers. It would have been nice to march in, knock some skulls "
"together, and call it a day, but rumors suggested we were heavily "
"outnumbered. Even worse, the villains had set up their camp in a defensible "
"position in sight of their boats, protected by the river on one side, a "
"thick forest on another side, and a sticky swamp on the third. Add in a "
"bunch of sentries watching for intruders, and we were in trouble. Thank "
"goodness our fearless leader had a plan!"
msgstr ""
"우리 여행은 {g|Littletown}작은 마을{/g} 인근에 다다랐고 무고한 상인들과 여행자들을 먹이로 삼는 강가 해적을 쫓아왔습니다. "
"당당하게 걸어가 해골을 부딪히며 하루를 마무리했다면 좋았겠지만 소문은 우리보다 빨랐습니다. 더 나쁜 것은 악당들이 강 반대편을 차지해 "
"양쪽에 우거진 숲과 끈적이는 늪으로 배에서 방어하기 유리하다는 것입니다. 침입자를 감시하는 보초 무리가 늘어나자 우리는 곤경에 "
"빠졌습니다. 우리의 두려움을 모르는 지도자가 계획을 가지고 있다는 사실에 감사할 뿐입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "4e10a3ef-5ec7-47f0-8921-21341b8bc0c9"
msgid ""
"The {g|Pitax River}Pitax River{/g} may have looked gentle, but it was fast, "
"deep, and dangerous. The current dragged us downriver, slamming several of "
"us into a submerged tree before we could reach calmer water. What an "
"exhausting swim!"
msgstr ""
"{g|Pitax River}피탁스강{/g}의 잔잔하게 보였을 지 모르지만 수심이 깊고 빠르고 위험했습니다. 강에 휩쓸려 우리는 하류로 "
"떠내려갔고 우리 중 몇명은 잔잔한 물가에 닿기 전에 깊숙히 빠졌습니다. 지긋지긋한 수영입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "56c11bf6-d340-456f-8e8e-b86b434870c5"
msgid ""
"Shivering from the cold, we clambered onto the beach and began spying from "
"behind the boats. From there we could see that there wasn't one camp — there "
"were two! The second was several hundred feet away, judging by the "
"campfires, which meant that we could vanquish the pirates in one camp before "
"the other could respond!"
msgstr ""
"추위에 몸을 떨며 우리는 강가에 기어올라 보트 뒤에서 감시하기 시작했습니다. 거기에서 우리는 야영지가 한개 이상이라는 것을 알 수 "
"있었습니다. 총 2개가 있었습니다! 모닥불로 근거했을 때 두 번째 야영지는 수백미터 떨어져 있었고 다른 야영지가 알아차리기 전에 한 "
"야영지에서 해적들을 해치울 수 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "a8eb3911-b20e-4eeb-92f6-491450b767b8"
msgid ""
"It was exactly the plan you read about in dashing tales, but rather than "
"fall into our trap, the sentries alerted their friends. Before we knew it, "
"we were fighting a far larger group than we had intended!"
msgstr ""
"그것은 정확하게 근사한 이야기에서 읽은 계획이었지만 보초가 함정에 빠지기는 커녕 동료들에게 경고했습니다. 알아차리기도 전에 우리는 "
"의도했던 것보다 훨씬 큰 그룹과 싸우고 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "eeb562d9-eb29-4615-9b73-aaddf59b65ed"
msgid ""
"It was exactly the plan you read about in dashing tales, and our enemies "
"fell right into our trap! We quietly dispatched the sentries before "
"launching our attack on the remaining pirates!"
msgstr ""
"그것은 정확하게 근사한 이야기에서 읽은 계획이었지만 적들은 함정에 정확히 걸려들었습니다! 남은 해적들을 공격하기 전 우리는 보초를 "
"해치웠습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "4d324f9a-b067-4e9b-8364-ebb8bdf3acce"
msgid ""
"Gravel beaches might be great for mooring boats, but they're terrible for "
"sneaking. All the cargo in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} can't cover the sound of you "
"tripping over cobbles. The pirates launched a volley of arrows at our hiding "
"place before closing in to attack!"
msgstr ""
"자갈이 깔린 강가는 보트 계류에 아주 좋을 수도 있지만 몰래 하기에는 끔찍합니다. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 어떤 화물이라도 자갈 "
"소리를 가릴 수는 없습니다. 공격을 하기 전에 해적들이 우리가 숨어있는 곳에 응사를 시작했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "f17f5424-1e73-410e-a52d-1e04d661320b"
msgid ""
"Boats and cargo gave us lots of cover as we made our approach, launching a "
"surprise attack. Before the pirates could respond, we had already felled "
"several of them!"
msgstr ""
"보트와 화물은 우리가 접근하며 기습을 시작할 때 가림막이 되어주었습니다. 해적들이 대응하기 전에 우리는 이미 그들 중 몇몇을 "
"쓰러뜨렸습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "e37928ea-cdd5-47d0-a166-8675f1a9f08b"
msgid ""
"In retrospect, trying to navigate the wetlands while trying to keep quiet "
"might not have been as easy as we had hoped. The sucking mud tore at our "
"boots and tripped us several times. In short order, we were filthy, bruised, "
"and feeling less than heroic."
msgstr ""
"되돌아 보면 조용히 하려는 동안 습지를 항해하려고 시도하는 것은 우리가 바라는 만큼 쉬운 일이 아니었을 것입니다. 빨아 들이는 진흙은 "
"우리 몇번이고 넘어뜨렸습니다. 얼마 안가 우리는 더럽혀지고 멍이 들어 영웅 같은 느낌이 적었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "7b67ebc4-d508-4c9f-a6d0-e037c21fdee8"
msgid ""
"Before long, we emerged from the swamp, our gear dripping with stagnant "
"water. From there we could see that there wasn't one camp — there were two! "
"The second was several hundred feet away, judging by the campfires, which "
"meant that we could vanquish the pirates in one camp before the other could "
"respond!"
msgstr ""
"이윽고 우리는 늪에서 나왔지만 우리 장비는 늪지 물이 흘러 내렸습니다. 거기에서 우리는 야영지가 한개 이상이라는 것을 알 수 있었습니다. "
"총 2개가 있었습니다! 모닥불로 근거했을 때 두 번째 야영지는 수백미터 떨어져 있었고 다른 야영지가 알아차리기 전에 한 야영지에서 "
"해적들을 해치울 수 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "de6ad182-1750-46f1-bd26-9a61ee6b0c68"
msgid ""
"The swamp helped us approach the camp, but our mud-filled boots squished "
"loudly as we clambered out of the reeds. What a mess! The pirates launched a "
"volley of arrows at our hiding place before closing in to attack!"
msgstr ""
"늪지 덕에 야영지에 접근하는 것이 쉬웠지만 진흙으로 채워진 장화는 갈대를 부러트리면서 큰 소리를 내었습니다. 엉망진창입니다! 공격을 하기 "
"전에 해적들이 우리가 숨어있는 곳에 응사를 시작했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "9485e449-250a-4312-b626-30eb1654404c"
msgid ""
"Reeds and tents gave us lots of cover as we made our approach, launching a "
"surprise attack. Before the pirates could respond, we had already felled "
"several of them!"
msgstr ""
"갈대와 텐트는 우리가 접근하며 기습을 시작할 때 가림막이 되어주었습니다. 해적들이 대응하기 전에 우리는 이미 그들 중 몇몇을 "
"쓰러뜨렸습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "48234824-056f-40e2-914d-ee5ecc2312d4"
msgid ""
"Our leader ably found an animal trail and led us deeper into the woods and "
"toward the camp. We confidently followed, not knowing quite what had cleared "
"the path. It soon became all too apparent when our leader's foot lodged in a "
"large burrow, eliciting a menacing growl from beneath the earth. What "
"followed was a brief and terrifying farce involving a family of badgers, low-"
"hanging poison ivy, and some very choice words. I'll note that choosing this "
"route was not my idea."
msgstr ""
"우리는 오솔길을 발견하고 숲 속 깊숙히 그리고 야영지 쪽으로 다가갔습니다. 우리는 무엇이 길을 만들었는지 모른 채 자신있게 우리의 "
"지도자를 따라갔습니다. 우리 지도자의 발이 거대한 구덩이를 디뎠을 때 땅 아래에서 위협적인 으르렁 거리는 소리가 들렸고 이내 모든 것이 "
"명백해졌습니다. 오소리 가족이 간결하고 위협적인 울음소리를 내었고 주위에는 옻나무가 지천에 깔려 할 수 있는 말은 욕짓거리 밖에 "
"없었습니다. 이 길을 선택하는 것은 내 생각이 아님을 여기서 밝힙니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "94bf4d37-3d0a-4a12-80bc-67800c4a36ce"
msgid ""
"We picked burrs from our cloaks as we reached the edge of the clearing. From "
"there we could see that there wasn't one camp — there were two! The second "
"was several hundred feet away, judging by the campfires, which meant that we "
"could vanquish the pirates in one camp before the other could respond!"
msgstr ""
"개간지 경계에 다다르자 우리는 망또에서 털을 골라내었습니다. 거기에서 우리는 야영지가 한개 이상이라는 것을 알 수 있었습니다. 총 2개가 "
"있었습니다! 모닥불로 근거했을 때 두 번째 야영지는 수백미터 떨어져 있었고 다른 야영지가 알아차리기 전에 한 야영지에서 해적들을 해치울 "
"수 있었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "01584a8f-300e-474e-84d2-83932ff99989"
msgid ""
"The forest had covered our approach, but the sound of snapping twigs and "
"rustling leaves alerted the sentries. The pirates launched a volley of "
"arrows at our hiding place before closing in to attack!"
msgstr ""
"숲이 우리의 접근을 가려주었지만 나뭇 가지가 부러지고 나뭇잎이 쓸리는 소리가 보초를 알려줍니다. 공격을 하기 전에 해적들이 우리가 "
"숨어있는 곳에 응사를 시작했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/PirateCampBookEvent/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "c0c63b6f-46e9-432a-934a-5a5a2a310e50"
msgid ""
"Undergrowth and tents gave us lots of cover as we made our approach, "
"launching a surprise attack. Before the pirates could respond, we had "
"already felled several of them!"
msgstr ""
"덤불과 텐트는 우리가 접근하며 기습을 시작할 때 가림막이 되어주었습니다. 해적들이 대응하기 전에 우리는 이미 그들 중 몇몇을 "
"쓰러뜨렸습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f7331f97-10aa-4b20-ae7b-3d716d987884"
msgid "[Recall what you can about this woman's heraldry]"
msgstr "[이 여성의 유창한 말에 반박할 말을 떠올립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "7fc5da26-0de4-4f2e-a79f-8919b365c5d2"
msgid "\"Wait, who are you?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "bb1bd2aa-50b1-4151-8971-cae712693647"
msgid "\"This is all a terrible mistake!\""
msgstr "\"이것은 끔찍한 실수였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "ab9ea66c-204c-49b0-a224-14f64c402d93"
msgid "[Attack] \"I have nothing to say that a sword can't say better.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"칼이 최고의 의사소통 수단이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d466bc60-f740-4e9b-b303-6d1bbfaf035b"
msgid ""
"\"We heard that a powerful band of pirates was camped here, and we were "
"going to chase them off.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 강력한 해적단이 여기 야영을했다는 소식을 들었고 그들을 쫓는 중이었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "0b7e8b49-b0ed-4775-828a-5f3f518c8579"
msgid ""
"\"A playwright convinced us to hunt pirates in order to win the adoration of "
"Pitax's common folk.\""
msgstr "\"극작가는 우리가 피탁스의 일반 대중의 호감을 얻기 위해 해적들을 사냥하도록 설득했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "6b94bb10-ef92-42aa-8a63-8215b8d7c7e1"
msgid ""
"\"I was acting in good faith to chase off pirates, and I would never have "
"attacked a Riversong convoy. Someone provided me misinformation, likely "
"because they stood to profit if we killed each other.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 해적들을 쫓아 내려고 선의로 행동했으며 결코 리버송 호송대를 공격하지 않았다. 누군가 나에게 서로를 죽이면 이익을 얻는다는 "
"잘못된 정보를 제공했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3bc768c8-b029-4bdb-aa37-7dfd8303b293"
msgid "Lied to Renshala."
msgstr "린샬라에게 거짓말을 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "695b0d2f-2147-4417-94b4-5179b9044469"
msgid ""
"[Lie] \"We received these orders from King Irovetti himself. Here, take a "
"look.\""
msgstr "[거짓] \"우리는 이로베티 왕에게 직접 명령을 받았다. 여기 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "671c7dc8-bed7-4b2a-9601-5ede56282760"
msgid "[Strike her while she's distracted]"
msgstr "[그녀의 시선을 이끌었을 때 그녀를 공격합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "2af8e383-26a8-46c7-8a6f-c461e5b2d778"
msgid "\"Oh, I must have been confused.\""
msgstr "\"혼란의 여지가 있었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "f8f4af2f-5d37-4ac0-9b76-d2ce82a6b5a1"
msgid "\"The playwright Eimar Deschamps told us about the camp.\""
msgstr "\"극작가 이마르 데샹이 야영지에 대해 말해주었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "92448841-de9c-416f-8591-b54218e2e80e"
msgid ""
"\"Actually, the magistrate Walsh Celvoway insisted there were pirates "
"preying on travelers here.\""
msgstr "\"사실 행정 장관 월시 켈보웨이가 여기에 여행자를 먹이로 삼는 해적이 있다고 주장했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "29b4f15d-6cce-4a12-89a0-4f52375b883d"
msgid ""
"\"This is clearly a set up, but I have nothing more to add. Either you "
"believe me or not. Make your choice.\""
msgstr "\"이것은 분명히 음모지만 나는 더 할말이 없다. 나를 믿든 안 믿든 선택해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "a1ad2962-ef7b-4a45-a571-3a96dbbd5e33"
msgid ""
"\"Judge Celvoway? I spoke with him directly, and he insisted that your group "
"were the pirates.\""
msgstr "\"켈보웨이 판사? 나는 그와 직접 대화를 나눴고 너희는 해적이라고 주장했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "c27e8c1a-01b6-46c5-a8a5-7b8e64f7c27f"
msgid ""
"\"If he knows you travel with so many guards, maybe he hoped I would die "
"during the attack.\""
msgstr "\"네가 많은 경비원과 함께 여행한다는 것을 그가 알고 있었다면 어쩌면 그는 내가 공격 중에 죽기를 바랐을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "2a4b549c-ac0a-49d9-9420-4728a0d1b527"
msgid "\"Can you think of something he'd gain from your death?\""
msgstr "\"네가 죽을 때 그가 얻을 이익을 생각해 봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "c8c301b7-044f-4b42-942e-dbf7688a6fc4"
msgid "\"I'd rather ask him personally.\""
msgstr "\"차라리 그에게 개인적으로 묻겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0056_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "69a065ab-3875-442f-800d-e83b8bf78d0c"
msgid ""
"Suggested to Renshala to forget about the incident and go each own ways."
msgstr "사건에 대해 잊어버리고 각자의 길을 가도록 린샬라에게 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "21364c54-11a6-4309-8420-3d1c656a85a8"
msgid "\"We pretend this never happened, and I leave.\""
msgstr "\"아무 일이 일어나지 않은 것처럼 행동하라고. 나는 떠날 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0057_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1106f5c7-e206-4347-84e7-db091e6a5124"
msgid "Argued for uncovering the truth behind the set up."
msgstr "음모 뒤에 있는 진실을 밝히자고 주장했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "1ceb1dea-aea9-420c-b6e6-f3e1c01e1d66"
msgid "\"We join forces to uncover the truth.\""
msgstr "\"진실을 밝히기 위해 힘을 합치자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0058_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "046a048a-68de-49e1-a541-ca109c777ae5"
msgid "Attacked Renshala to rob her."
msgstr "린샬라를 공격하고 물건을 뺏습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "67d43b6e-431b-4a67-bd7f-d6ecffd11d8b"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I kill you, take whatever's in those crates, and claim it was "
"self-defense.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너를 죽여 그 상자에 든 것을 빼앗은 다음 정당방위라고 주장하겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "30713bb5-1188-4faa-a7e6-e99a74f028b5"
msgid ""
"{n}A voice cuts through the din, roaring with such indignation that the "
"fighting momentarily stops.{/n} \"What is going on here?!? Who dares attack "
"my camp?\" {n}The speaker is a suntanned woman wearing light blue traveling "
"cloths with high boots, and an embroidered heron adorns one of her "
"sleeves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}불쾌하고 우렁찬 함성이 싸움을 일시적으로 멈춥니다.{/n} \"여기서 뭐하고 있는 거야?! 누가 감히 내 진영을 공격하는 거야?\" "
"{n}고함을 친 자는 가벼운 푸른색 여행자 옷과 장화를 신고 소매에는 왜가리 자수가 달린 상의를 입은 구릿빛의 여성이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "79fde8e2-916f-4a4b-b6c5-18eca9b2dfe6"
msgid ""
"{n}She draws her weapon and takes a menacing step forward.{/n} \"I don't "
"know who you are, and any patience I have to hear your excuses is as short-"
"lived as you are. If you have something to say, make it good.\" {n}Behind "
"her, you can see more combatants approaching, but you have a few moments "
"before they arrive.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 무기를 꺼내 위협적으로 다가섭니다.{/n} \"나는 네가 누군지 모르며 너의 변명을 듣지 않고 네 짧은 인생을 끝낼 정도로 "
"인내심이 짧다. 할말이 있다면 공손히 말해.\" {n}그녀 뒤에 당신은 더 많은 전투원이 다가오는 것을 볼 수 있지만 도착하기 전에 "
"시간을 벌 수 있을 것 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "1198233c-73b8-4811-b5c4-1eb01c8ae203"
msgid ""
"{n}She seems ready to say more when she notices the bright blaze along the "
"shore.{/n} \"My boats! You soft-stomached jackals, what have you done?!\" {n}"
"Her mouth moves as if trying to form more words, but she has difficulty "
"enunciating past her anger.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 강가를 따라 밝혀진 불길을 주목하고는 말할 준비를 마친 것 같습니다.{/n} \"이런! 내 배가! 굶주린 자칼 새끼들 "
"같으니! 무슨 짓을 한 거야?!\" {n}그녀의 입안은 마치 더 많은 단어를 형성하려고하는 것처럼 움직이지만 그녀는 분노가 지나쳐 "
"말하기가 어렵습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "c266200d-18d7-4263-b482-7e1002cba6c9"
msgid ""
"{n}A grin splits Nok-Nok's face.{/n} \"If we die, I just wanna say burning "
"the boats made me happy. Good leadership.\""
msgstr "{n}녹-녹의 얼굴에 미소가 떠오릅니다.{/n} \"우리가 죽으면 보트를 불타버린다면 좋겠어. 대장.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d9a6a9ce-e187-4220-a280-c864cadc9376"
msgid ""
"\"Well this throws some sand in the clockwork. The blue outfit and heron "
"insignia indicate this is an important member of the Riversong Trade House "
"in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, not a pirate. In fact, I'd say that makes us look "
"like the pirates, now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간을 아끼게 되었군. 푸른 복장과 왜가리 휘장은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 리버송 무역소의 중요한 회원임을 나타낸다. 해적이 "
"아니야. 사실, 그 말 때문에 되려 해적처럼 보일 수는 있겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "11ee6f6c-0ccb-46e6-b6fc-294338d73935"
msgid ""
"{n}The blue outfit and heron insignia indicate this is an important member "
"of the Riversong Trade House of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, possibly a member of the "
"controlling family. Jhofre Vascari leads trade house, and this might be his "
"sister, Renshala Vascari. As you look down at the enemies you've slain, it "
"seems you haven't attack pirate; you've killed influential merchants!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}푸른 복장과 왜가리 휘장은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 리버송 무역 회사의 중요한 회원임을 나타내며, 아마도 가문의 일원일 수도 "
"있습니다. 조프리 바스카리가 무역 회사를 이끌고 있으니 아마도 그의 여동생인 린샬라 바스카리로 보입니다. 당신이 죽인 적을 내려다 보니 "
"해적을 공격하지 않은 것처럼 보입니다. 당신은 영향력 있는 상인들을 죽였군요!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "1ab22864-cea3-4351-a58b-75b6e7fc6f48"
msgid ""
"{n}The woman's face wrinkles with disdain.{/n} \"I was prepared to kill "
"thieves, but it looks like I'll have to kill idiots instead. If you don't "
"know, explaining it's not worth the breath.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여자의 얼굴은 경멸로 주름집니다.{/n} \"나는 도둑들을 죽일 준비가 되어 있었지만 바보들을 죽여야하는 것인가. 모르고 있었다면 "
"너는 숨 쉴 가치도 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "a059951d-a213-4310-ba6c-69f7593b4455"
msgid "{n}The well-dressed woman glowers at you.{/n} \"Explain. Quickly.\""
msgstr "{n}잘 차려 입은 여인이 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"해명해. 짧게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "6906dfc7-7558-4f27-a6d8-31e640cd0bd8"
msgid ""
"{n}You never received any such documents, but the woman approaches to "
"investigate the random papers you produce. She peers over them for a moment "
"before squinting and remarking,{/n} \"These aren't royal orders. You are "
"trying my patience.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그런 서류는 절대로받지 못했지만 여자는 당신이 임의로 만든 서류를 조사합니다. 그녀는 잠깐 동안 서류를 훑어 보고는 찡그리며 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"이것은 왕의 명령이 아니다. 나의 인내심을 시험하는 것이냐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "5e4cb1a2-cc1b-418e-8318-ded32c6d0d60"
msgid ""
"\"You're a terrible liar,\" {n}she remarks, smirking as she notices that "
"your failed deception bought her remaining forces enough time to arrive.{/n} "
"\"Now you'll be a dead one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 끔찍한 거짓말쟁이군.\" {n}그녀는 당신의 실패한 속임수가 그녀의 남은 군대가 올 시간을 벌기에 충분하다는 것을 알고는 "
"찡그리며 말합니다.{/n} \"이제 너는 죽은 목숨이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "9ee1d872-9651-463b-a18b-33e50a73a3ef"
msgid "\"What kind of trickery is this?!\" {n}She steps back.{/n}"
msgstr "\"무슨 속임수가 이래?\" {n}그녀는 뒤로 물러납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "677b6996-fd09-4d1c-9bc7-5b64d35ed7b2"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|River Kingdoms}River Kingdoms{/g} have a reputation for banditry,\" "
"{n}she admits, lowering her weapon slightly.{/n} \"Still, it's irresponsible "
"to have attacked us as you did. I am Renshala Vascari of the Riversong Trade "
"House — no pirate. Who put you up to this?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국들{/g}은 산적에 대한 명성이 있다.\" {n}그녀는 무기를 약간 내리고 인정합니다.{/n}"
" \"그래도 우리를 공격한 것은 무책임한 일이다. 나는 리버송 무역 회사의 린샬라 바스카리다. 해적은 없어. 누가 이 일을 시켰지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "05f39c22-d387-4169-885a-14fc91bd5494"
msgid ""
"{n}Renshala makes a disgusted sound.{/n} \"That man writes overblown dramas "
"for a living, and you trusted him? What kind of fool would you have to be "
"to...\" {n}She trails off and peers at you more intently.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}린샬라는 듣기 싫은 소리를 냅니다.{/n} \"그 남자가 지어낸 허무맹랑한 이야기를 듣고 놈을 믿었다고? 너 바보 아니야?\" {n}"
"목소리가 잦아들더니 그녀는 당신을 더 열심히 째려봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "b096c44d-6936-4f60-a67d-c386773ecb3c"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, are you {name}? I was warned that you might try something like this!"
"\" {n}She extracts a scroll from a tube and unrolls it for you to see. It "
"clearly warns the Vascari family that raiders sent by you would soon "
"threaten her shipments.{/n} \"Judge Celvoway may be a bastard at times, but "
"he sure knew you would attack my convoy. Give me a good reason I shouldn't "
"throw your corpse to the eels?\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐. 네가 {name}인가? 나는 네가 이런 식으로 공격 할 수 있다고 경고 받았어!\" {n}그녀는 두루마리를 꺼내 펼쳐 봅니다. "
"바스카리 가문은 당신이 보낸 습격대가 곧 그녀의 선적을 위협 할 것이라고 경고를 받았습니다.{/n} \"켈보웨이 판사는 때때로 "
"개자식일지도 모르지만 네가 내 호송대를 공격 할 것이라는 것을 확실히 알고 있었다. 내가 네 시체를 뱀장어에 던져서는 안되는 좋은 이유를 "
"알려줘야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "46683a74-b209-41ef-86f1-6dc1450d0550"
msgid ""
"\"Did he now?\" {n}Renshala taps a finger to her chin in thought.{/n} "
"\"Certainly he has the means, but does he have the motive? Bringing any harm "
"to me would just foment chaos in the region, and Celvoway's a servant of "
"King Irovetti through and through. Do you have a theory?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 그랬다고?\" {n}린샬라는 생각에 잠겨 그녀의 턱에 손가락을 두드립니다.{/n} \"그는 수단을 가지고 있지만 그에게 동기는 "
"있나? 나에게 해를 입히면 이 지역에 혼란이 일어날 것이고, 켈보웨이는 머리부터 발끝까지 이로베티 왕의 종인데. 너는 짐작 가는 데가 "
"있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "8ee3c7d9-5e95-4409-ac70-9ebee69d5743"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, at last a hint of wisdom. Yes, you're right.\" {n}She thinks for a "
"moment before continuing.{/n} \"Perhaps I was hasty to dismiss you as "
"anything but dim-witted brigands. I am Renshala Vascari of the Riversong "
"Trade House — not a pirate. Who provided you this misinformation?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 떠올랐어. 네 말이 맞아.\" {n}그녀는 계속하기 전에 잠시 생각합니다.{/n} \"아마도 너를 멍청한 강도로 여기는 것이 "
"성급한 것일 수도 있겠군. 나는 해적이 아니라 리버송 무역 회사의 린샬라 바스카리다. 누가 너에게 잘못된 정보를 제공했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "c1f04d0d-c221-4a71-b383-45c889335ffb"
msgid ""
"\"You understand how appallingly stupid that sounds, yes?\"{n} She rocks "
"back on her heels, looks skyward, and mutters something exasperated under "
"her breath before looking back at you.{/n} \"I am Renshala Vascari of the "
"Riversong Trade House — not a pirate. Be more specific. Who put you up to "
"this?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 소리가 얼마나 어리석어 보이는지 알지?\"{n}그녀는 발 뒤꿈치에 체중을 싫어 하늘을 보고는 한탄을 하며 중얼거리더니 당신을 다시 "
"돌아봅다.{/n} \"나는 리버송 무역 회사의 린샬라 바스카리다. 해적이 아니라. 더 구체적으로 말해라. 누가 이 일을 시켰지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "80df1526-7495-4f23-b69a-5b16b089c0ae"
msgid ""
"\"It's clear you are a fool,\"{n} she remarks, smirking as she notices that "
"your clumsy explanation bought her remaining forces enough time to arrive. "
"{/n}\"For killing my employees, now you'll be a dead one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 멍청하다는 사실이 드러났군.\" {n}그녀는 당신의 서투른 설명이 그녀의 남은 군대가 올 시간을 벌기에 충분하다는 것을 알고는 "
"찡그리며 말합니다.{/n} \"이제 너는 죽은 사람이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "d24480f4-d912-46da-b0af-86dd5310d7ba"
msgid ""
"\"That's a little too convenient for my tastes. I don't like the sound of "
"your story, and frankly, neither do my men,\" {n}she remarks, smirking as "
"she notices that your clumsy explanation bought her remaining forces enough "
"time to arrive.{/n} \"I shall consider your deaths justice for those you've "
"slain.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 입맛에 하나도 맛지 않는 불편한 이야기로군. 네 이야기는 솔직히 듣기 거북하고 내 부하들도 그렇다.\" {n}그녀는 당신의 서투른 "
"설명이 그녀의 남은 군대가 올 시간을 벌기에 충분하다는 것을 알고는 찡그리며 말합니다.{/n} \"네가 사람을 죽인 것은 죽음으로 갚아 "
"마땅하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "155acfb8-aa8e-47e1-9f40-6ccd9e3ff64c"
msgid ""
"{n}Renshala considers your arguments.{/n} \"No matter how much I may want "
"you dead now, it wouldn't be justice. I suspect there's more going on that I "
"need to understand first. Here,\"{n} she hands you the scroll from the "
"magistrate. {/n}\"Use this to solve your mystery. Whether it leads you to "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} or {g|Hell}Hell{/g}, I care not. For now, leave me space "
"to bury the dead, and should I see you again, may the gods show you more "
"mercy than you've shown today.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린샬라는 당신의 주장을 고려합니다.{/n} \"내가 너를 죽이길 원해도 그것은 정의가 아닐 것이다. 내가 먼저 이해할 필요가 있는 "
"사실이 더 많다. 여기 받아라.\" {n}그녀는 치안 판사가 준 두루마리를 건네줍니다.{/n} \"이걸 이용해서 실마리를 풀어라. 이것이 "
"{g|Pitax}피탁스{/g}로 이끌든 {g|Hell}지옥{/g}으로 이끌든 나는 신경 쓰지 않는다. 나는 죽은 부하들을 묻어 주겠다. "
"그리고 우리가 다시 만난다면... 네가 오늘 보인 자비보다는 신들께서 더 많은 자비를 보이시길 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "8ac3fcbc-e4ca-466a-a498-6d2beaf53604"
msgid ""
"\"That's certainly a possibility. You must be flattered to have such "
"powerful enemies.\""
msgstr "\"그건 가능할 수 있다. 그렇게 강력한 적을 만난다면 네가 잘난 줄 알겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "8dcd4203-e73e-4b2d-9135-e3ee1c91cfee"
msgid ""
"{n}She grits her teeth and nods.{/n} \"It's true that we Vascaris haven't "
"kowtowed to King Irovetti as much as the Liacenzas and the Strocalles have, "
"yet we control most of the river trade. What better way to bring us in line "
"than crush us with foreign agents or scare us into swearing fealty?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀는 이빨을 갈고는 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"바스카리가 리아첸자와 스트로칼리 만큼이나 이로베티 왕에게 협조적이지 않은 것은 "
"사실이지만 우리는 강가 무역의 대부분을 장악하고 있다. 외국 요원들로 뭉개버리거나 충성 서약을 맺도록 겁주는것 보단 우리를 포섭하는게 더 "
"나은 방법일 텐데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "de277524-084c-4cbd-9829-eff1810c5976"
msgid "\"Well then, what do you propose?\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 네가 제안하는 것은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "1126cb03-0c0d-4f79-8fc4-ad5ed208de35"
msgid ""
"\"I regret that I've lost friends and colleagues, but I agree that you're "
"not entirely to blame. Go. Get out of my sight. If you want the truth, here!"
"\" {n}She chokes back an angry sob and hands you the scroll from the "
"magistrate.{/n} \"Use this to solve your mystery. Whether it leads you to "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} or {g|Hell}Hell{/g}, I care not. For now, leave me space "
"to bury the dead, and should I see you again, may the gods show you more "
"mercy than you've shown today.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 친구와 동료들을 잃어버린 것에 대해 유감스럽지만 전적으로 너를 비난하지는 않겠다. 가라. 내 눈에서 사라져. 진실을 원하면 이걸 "
"봐라!\"{n}그녀는 울음을 참으며 당신에게 치안 판사의 두루마리를 건네줍니다.{/n} \"이걸 이용해서 실마리를 풀어라. 이것이 너를 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스g}로 이끌든 {g|Hell}지옥{/g}으로 이끌든 나는 신경 쓰지 않는다. 나는 죽은 부하들을 묻어 주겠다. "
"그리고 우리가 다시 만난다면... 네가 오늘 보인 자비보다는 신들께서 더 많은 자비를 보이시길 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "6b5badad-c628-4757-abce-e5d18b97430c"
msgid ""
"{n}Renshala's smile grows slowly as if she's contemplating devious "
"possibilities.{/n} \"Very well. I will return to the city, and when you are "
"ready to confront others about what transpired here, I will join you.\" {n} "
"She hands you the scroll from the magistrate. {/n}\"Piece together your "
"case, and get to the bottom of this mystery. For now, though, give me space "
"to bury the dead.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}음모를 꾸미는 것처럼 린샬라는 천천히 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"아주 좋아. 나는 도시로 돌아갈 것이고 네가 다른 사람들과 여기에서 "
"일어났던 일에 대해 대면 할 준비가되면 너와 합류할 것이다.\"{n}그녀는 치안 판사의 두루마리를 건네줍니다.{/n} \"사건을 한데 "
"모아 음모의 밑바닥을 파헤쳐라. 지금은 시체를 묻어야 하니 비켜.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "0f54a819-166b-4931-9e96-7a9be58c98ae"
msgid ""
"\"That...\" {n}She hesitates.{/n} \"You're a dangerous individual and have "
"slain my people. I cannot bind my house's fate to your decisions. If you "
"want the truth, here!\" {n}She chokes back an angry sob and hands you the "
"scroll from the magistrate.{/n} \"Use this to solve your mystery. Whether it "
"leads you to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} or {g|Hell}Hell{/g}, I care not. For now, "
"leave me space to bury the dead, and should I see you again, may the gods "
"show you more mercy than you've shown today.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건...\" {n}그녀는 주저합니다.{/n} \"너는 위험한 사람이고 내 사람들을 죽였다. 내 집안의 운명을 네게 맡길 수는 없어. "
"진실을 원하면 이걸 봐라!\" {n}그녀는 울음을 참으며 당신에게 치안 판사의 두루마리를 건네줍니다.{/n} \"이걸 이용해서 실마리를 "
"풀어라. 이것이 너를 {g|pitax}피탁스g}로 이끌든 {g|Hell}지옥{/g}으로 이끌든 나는 신경 쓰지 않는다. 나는 죽은 "
"부하들을 묻어 주겠다. 그리고 우리가 다시 만난다면... 네가 오늘 보인 자비보다는 신들께서 더 많은 자비를 보이시길 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/RiverPirateCamp/Renshala/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "75994252-d91b-4e9b-ae96-a95e84e9ef8d"
msgid "\"How convenient. Care to elaborate?\""
msgstr "\"정말 쉽게 하는군. 정성을 다하고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "674fe73d-1927-4a50-abc2-f1329b1f2065"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "c3072150-8aa7-4614-b22a-237512bc435a"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Rushlight tournament.\""
msgstr "\"러시라이트에 관해 대답해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "a3662a38-3db4-4421-92cb-d64803085829"
msgid "\"Who might you recommend I meet here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 누구와 만나야 할지 추천해 줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0013_Text_String
msgctxt "55f3422d-faf1-4bc4-a202-15a994f5826e"
msgid "\"What can you tell me about King Irovetti?\""
msgstr "\"이로베티 왕에 대해 말해줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "ea6ebb0d-5266-41ff-b610-9476ccb802a2"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "7d180427-20bb-48c2-94fc-6fbd5ed78061"
msgid "\"Does the king have any enemies?\""
msgstr "\"왕에게는 적들이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "966ebc88-c1cf-4412-a2d7-3ecfa602ed28"
msgid "[Attack] \"You won't get away this time!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이번에 도망가지 못할 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "2213b659-7805-472c-a039-b038f78cdc25"
msgid "[Attack] \"You look like a spy to me. Prepare to die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 스파이처럼 보이는데. 죽을 준비 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "e827c8a8-0364-420c-bb08-ee88b7ccf868"
msgid "\"I've heard King Irovetti can be too persistent in his flirtations.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티 왕이 집요하게 불장난을 한다던데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "a97c7e3d-1325-49c3-b737-82a382c37623"
msgid "\"I believe Linzi had a question for you...\""
msgstr "\"린지가 너에게 질문할 게 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "fff8397b-f6b4-49d4-86da-b6706bbc7b5d"
msgid ""
"\"If Irovetti didn't banish Eobald, then why did he send those cutthroats "
"after him?\""
msgstr "\"만약 이로베티가 이오발드를 추방하지 않았다면 왜 그가 암살자를 보냈을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "66702bbd-4a0e-42d3-a640-8a54428149e8"
msgid "\"Why did Atalia expel Eobald?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이탈리아가 이오발드를 추방했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "9a1c5f7f-7299-4a43-b91f-bc787aa29507"
msgid "\"Why would Atalia hide the circumstances around Eobald's dismissal?\""
msgstr "\"왜 이탈리아는 이오발드의 해고를 둘러싼 상황을 숨겼지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "8aead85c-2e8f-4ddf-b2d5-c47f687e3f77"
msgid "\"Thank you for telling us the truth.\""
msgstr "\"진실을 말해주어 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Answer_0073_Text
msgctxt "17873b5e-0aa3-4098-9437-27ea620d4e9e"
msgid ""
"\"Tell me, are the songs you compose for Irovetti as bold as the ones you "
"sang at my capital?\""
msgstr "\"이로베티를 위해 작곡한 노래는 네가 나의 수도에서 노래한 것 만큼 대담한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "86883ab5-4ab3-48cd-b567-7ce15930e98d"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, {name}, the famed baron{mf||ess} — no, excuse {d|Annamede}me{/d}, the "
"{mf|King|Queen} of {kingdomname} now — has come to visit us! It is such a "
"delight to see you here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. {name}. 그 유명한 남작님이시군요 — 아니지, {d|Annamede}실례{/d}합니다, {kingdomname}의 "
"{mf|왕|여왕}이 드디어 우리를 보러왔군요! 여기서 만나게 되어 기뻐요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "0f59eb43-c145-4310-9c9e-dec8a2275eb1"
msgid ""
"\"Our visit with you was quite a celebration — though it did end on a sad "
"note. I hope there won't be any unpleasant surprises this time.\""
msgstr "\"너와 함께한 방문은 대단한 축하연이었어. 슬픈 말로 끝났지만. 이번에는 불쾌한 일이 없기를 기대할게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "d29fb42a-bdf4-4959-a688-63615f9ea9d3"
msgid "\"How do you like the celebration?\""
msgstr "\"축하연은 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "4b0e1b41-e60c-4629-8eb4-fd63f5862d41"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard tales of your feats. It's a pleasure to finally meet you!\""
msgstr "\"나는 당신의 업적에 관한 이야기를 들었어요. 마침내 만나게 되어 기뻐요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "020121b9-9eda-40e2-8671-252580f5f167"
msgid ""
"\"Your hospitality was a bit lacking during our last encounter... but no "
"hard feelings. Welcome!\""
msgstr "\"마지막으로 만났을 때 당신의 환대는 조금 부족했었죠... 하지만 나쁜 감정은 하나도 없죠. 환영해요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ff4f1517-065c-449f-b9e2-4f3264b58de1"
msgid ""
"\"You could have easily asked any of my admirers who Annamede Belavarah is. "
"That'd be about three quarters of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} — and the rest are all "
"my haters, ha ha! You don't get to be the best among a city of poets and "
"musicians without gathering a few enemies along the way. But why should I "
"concern myself with hacks and soreheads?\""
msgstr ""
"\"안나메데 빌라바라가 누구인지는 내 추종자들에게 물어는게 더 쉬울걸요. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}인 4분의 3정도는 되죠 —그리고 "
"나머지는 모두 나를 비방하는 녀석이고요! 하하! 당신은 시인과 음악가의 도시에서 적을 만들지 않고는 최고가 될 수 없어요. 하지만 내가 "
"왜 머리 아픈 일들에 관심을 가져야 하죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "ed188fce-38ca-43ab-a5ef-553d8bde3a47"
msgid ""
"\"Our beloved king has run this tournament once in several years since he "
"took the throne. Guests from all over the {g|River Kingdoms}River "
"Kingdoms{/g} come for it, from Daggermark to {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g}! It's a pity "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} didn't honor us with any representatives this year — I "
"guess the Aldori aren't in a very festive mood right now... On the bright "
"side, we get to host you for the first time! And {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} "
"willing, it won't be the last!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 우상이신 이로베티 왕께선, 왕위에 오르신 후 여러 번 이 대회를 개최하셨지요. 대거마크에서 {g|Mivon}미본{/g}까지 "
"{g|River Kingdoms}강의 왕국{/g} 전역에서 손님이 몰려 온답니다! 이런 유서 깊은 대회에 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}"
" 사절단이 자리를 빛내주시지 않다니, 안타까운 일이지요. 뭐, 요즘 알도리 가문 소식을 들어보면 축제를 즐길 기분은 아니겠네요. 그래도 "
"덕분에 당신을 초대할 수 있게 됐으니 잘된 일이죠! {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}께서 반대하시지 않는 한, 이번이 마지막 "
"초대는 아닐 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "38b1ffab-a856-4404-bcd1-af7c9301aa7e"
msgid ""
"\"That depends on what you're looking for. If you're in the mood for "
"pleasant company, well, you've already met me! And if you're in the mood for "
"some schadenfreude, you could listen to the whining of {d|Liacenza}Gasperre "
"Liacenza{/d} — his family lost the {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} crown in a card "
"game. Or maybe Atalia Gitaren, the Headmaster of the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g}, who seems to think her skill at bureaucracy makes her a "
"good bard... And if thrills are what you're after — especially the 'shivers "
"down your spine' kind — try speaking with Kharne Vereel, head of the "
"thieves' guild.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 찾고 있는 것에 따라 다르죠. 유쾌한 친구를 찾는다면 이미 나를 만났고요! 만약 남의 고통을 즐긴다면 {d|Liacenza}"
"가스페레 리아첸자{/d}를 만나 보세요. 그의 가문은 카드 게임으로 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 권력을 잃어버렸으니. {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}의 교장 아탈리아 지타렌은 어때요? 그녀는 자신의 통치력이 자신을 뛰어난 "
"음유시인으로 만들었다고 생각하죠. 등골이 스산한 스릴을 추구한다면, 도둑 길드의 수장 칸 베릴과 이야기 해봐요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "d16012d2-8f52-4194-8636-23f80e6e5283"
msgid "\"Enjoy the celebration!\""
msgstr "\"축하연을 즐기라구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "f1ef77b3-ee40-42a7-88df-a5be3bff6dba"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede's face darkens for a moment, but she quickly regains her sweet "
"smile.{/n} \"Love him or hate him, you can't deny he's a great man! "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} was a boring place before him — only pirates, fences, and "
"other scum did any business in the area. But then King Irovetti came and "
"turned it into the cultural capital of the region! With him in charge, the "
"arts have flourished, and the city's been filled with songs, paintings, and "
"statues. I just pray that {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} breathes the same love "
"of the arts into the withered hearts of some of the other rulers in the "
"region, who'd prefer to squander their resources on saber rattling!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}안나미데의 얼굴은 잠시 어두워졌지만, 이내 달콤한 웃음을 되찾습니다.{/n} \"사랑하거나 증오하거나, 당신도 그가 위인이라는 "
"사실을 부인할 순 없을걸요! 그가 오기 전 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 지루한 장소였어요. 해적, 장물아비, 그 밖의 쓰레기들이 아무 "
"사업이나 해댔죠. 그러나 이로베티 왕이 오자 이곳은 지역의 문화 수도로 바뀌었어요! 그와 함께 예술은 번영했고, 도시는 노래와 그림, "
"그리고 동상으로 가득 차게 되었죠. 나는 그저 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}께서 칼싸움에 자원을 낭비하길 좋아하는 이 지역의 "
"다른 통치자들의 말라 붙은 마음에, 이같은 예술에 대한 사랑을 불어넣으시길 기도할 뿐이고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "71e7e79b-8e9a-46d2-b480-ff0156d7acb3"
msgid ""
"\"Some may say that King Irovetti doesn't have a taste for arts. Any "
"successful person gets haters spreading dirty rumors about them. You should "
"hear the things they say about me, ha ha! Pay it no mind. Our king is a man "
"of exquisite taste, with appreciation for all kinds of art!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 사람들은 이로베티 왕에게 예술에 대한 감각이 없다고 할지도 몰라요. 성공한 사람이라면 누구나 더러운 소문 몇 개쯤은 생겨요. "
"아마 나에 대한 소문도 들었을 테죠. 하하! 신경 쓸 것 없어요. 우리의 왕은 모든 종류의 예술에 대대 절묘한 감각이 있으니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "e62b3d45-c7a5-438e-af04-e05d527f01a7"
msgid ""
"\"Of course he has enemies. Lots of them — just like anyone who's actually "
"accomplished anything in life! Take some of the old trade houses, for "
"example — Liacenza and some others, whom he stripped of their power. They'd "
"love to see him at the bottom of the river, but even now, in their mutual "
"sorry states, they can't manage to work together! There's also Irsei "
"Caelysse, Captain of the Guard — he was just seething with indignation when "
"the king brought new rules to the city. But who wants to listen to the "
"whining of failures like them? Irovetti brought a golden age on "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 그에겐 적이 많죠. 실제로 인생에서 무엇인가를 성취한 사람들 만큼이나요! 옛 무역 회사를 예를 들면, 그에게 권력을 빼앗긴 "
"리아첸자와 다른 몇몇 사람들이 있죠. 그들은 왕을 강 아래로 쫓아버리고 싶어하지만, 지금까지도 그들의 서로간의 사죄 요구 테세로 인해 "
"힘을 합치지 못하죠! 경비대장 얼세이 케일리시도 있어요. 왕이 도시의 새로운 법을 정했을 때, 그는 분노했죠. 그런데 누가 그와 같은 "
"패배자의 투정을 듣고 싶겠어요? 이로베티는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 황금 시대를 불러왔어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "c8606595-82bb-4d13-a806-1fcb7aadf315"
msgid ""
"{n}Annamede purses her lips for a moment, then replies slowly, choosing her "
"words carefully.{/n} \"I'd prefer not to discuss the private life of His "
"Highness with strangers, much less my own. The details of any interactions "
"between us will remain just that — between us. Let's please discuss another "
"topic.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}안나미데는 입술을 살짝 오므리고는, 속으로 할 말을 고르는 듯 느릿하게 대답합니다.{/n} \"낯선 이와 전하의 사생활을 논하고 "
"싶지 않군요. 제 사생활은 말할 것도 없고요. 앞으로 유념해주시리라 믿습니다. 자, 다른 주제로 넘어가지요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a3c6b2e3-f1e3-4488-97b0-8b079ff6fd4a"
msgid ""
"\"Maestro Belavarah! I... well... do you remember me?\" {n}Linzi blurts out, "
"turning bright red.{/n}"
msgstr "\"마에스트로 빌라바라! 나는... 음... 나를 기억해?\" {n}린지는 무심결에 말하고는 붉어집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "aee1b10e-3b99-491b-9fea-f0663aad78f1"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, Linzi! Of course I remember you. You and your nonsense at the poetics "
"exam...\""
msgstr "\"아. 린지! 물론 기억해. 말도 안되는 시를 낭송하던 너를 기억하지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "64afe484-7185-4ef0-910d-7f8ff4957e45"
msgid ""
"\"I hear you have your own publishing house now! I didn't take you for the "
"entrepreneurial sort, but I'm happy you've finally found your calling!\""
msgstr "\"네가 출판사를 가졌다고 들었어! 나는 너를 사업가로 보진 않았는데 네가 맞는 일을 찾아 기쁘군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "a9eaf679-83aa-485e-a15a-ea138e698f55"
msgid ""
"\"I see you've found a comfortable position in {mf|His|Her} Highness's "
"court. Congratulations!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|그의|그녀의} 궁전에서 편안한 자리를 찾은 것 같군. 축하해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "504b8e34-de7c-4d57-ae19-0d508938d908"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes, he did move to your kingdom, didn't he? I'm curious how he "
"portrayed his dismissal. I'd bet it was something like a poem in six verses "
"recounting the tale of a tyrant ousting a poor but honest scientist for "
"telling the truth. The reality is much more mundane. Irovetti didn't fire "
"Eobald — Atalia did. And I have to give it to her — this time, unlike most "
"times, she was completely right.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그래. 그는 네 왕국으로 옮겨 갔지. 그렇지? 그의 해고 장면을 어떻게 묘사했는지 궁금하네. 가난하지만 진실을 말하는 정직한 "
"과학자를 몰아내는 폭군의 이야기를 열거한 여섯 구절의 시처럼 구구절절하겠지. 현실은 훨씬 담백해. 이로베티가 이오발드를 해고한 게 "
"아니야. 아탈리아가 해고했지. 대부분의 경우 달리, 이번에는 나 또한 그녀가 완전히 맞았다고 인정했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "901cd00e-5d1a-4160-984f-7d6df75dfa26"
msgid ""
"\"Wait! I'm sorry, but... I really need to know the truth. Why did Irovetti "
"kick Professor Eobald out of the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐! 미안해요. 하지만... 진실을 정말로 알고 싶어요. 왜 이로베티는 이오발드 교수를 {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}아카데미{/g}에서 쫓아냈죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b79c7ef0-717f-40be-962e-f90a8909446a"
msgid "\"That can't be!\""
msgstr "\"그럴수가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "5a638855-be96-4c0d-ba60-da3aab2c54b0"
msgid ""
"\"He'd planned to return the old man to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} and make Atalia "
"reinstate him into the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}. Or, failing "
"that, he at least wanted to keep him from going to you. Eobald the "
"Insightful is a prominent name. Of course Irovetti would want the teacher "
"serving him, rather than his neighbors!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 그 늙은이를 다시 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}로 돌려보내고, 아탈리아가 그를 다시 {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}아카데미{/g}게 만들려고 계획했어요. 아니면, 적어도 당신에게 가는 것을 막고 싶었을지도 모르죠. 신통한 자 이오발드는 정말 "
"유명하니까요. 물론 이로베티는 선생이 그의 이웃보단 자신에게 봉사하기를 원했을테고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "e1473bbe-db48-48cf-9740-a1ee8def635d"
msgid ""
"\"Well... Eobald is a very fine teacher, of course, but he pays too much "
"attention to how his favorite students perform in class, and not enough to "
"their... extracurricular activities. Why worry if they steal a trinket here "
"or there, or maybe rough someone up on occasion, so long as their poetry and "
"music are exemplary? Predictably, this led to a sad end — what was supposed "
"to be just another innocent joke from one of his favorites, Alondi, led to "
"someone's death. It was an accident, certainly — the kids just "
"underestimated their own strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음... 물론 이오발드는 매우 훌륭한 교사이지만, 그가 좋아하는 학생들이 수업에서 공연하는 데에만 신경쓰고 과외 활동에는 "
"소홀했죠... 그들의 시와 음악이 모범이 되는데, 왜 그들이 여기저기에서 물건을 훔치거나, 누군가에게 거칠게 구는지 걱정하겠어요? 예상한 "
"대로, 슬픈 일이 발생했죠. 그가 가장 좋아하는 학생 중 하나인 알론디의 악의없는 장난이 누군가를 죽이고 말았죠. 사고였을테죠. 확실히, "
"아이들은 자신의 힘을 과소평가하니까요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "ada4b5db-fcc7-450f-905e-e777fc84de06"
msgid ""
"\"She doesn't like to discuss the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy's{/g} "
"internal affairs. Behind that neat facade, there are too many events she's "
"looked the other way on over the years — all in good faith, of course.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}의 속사정에 관한 이야기를 나누고 싶어하지 않죠. 그 깔끔한 외관 "
"뒤에는, 수 년간 그녀가 잘못 처리한 사건들이 너무나 많으니까요. 물론, 의도는 선했겠지만요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "bb16f4c1-b605-43b6-8f80-65f18a72af31"
msgid ""
"\"Atalia expelled the lot of them. And as always, Eobald went to stand up "
"for them... but this time, he discovered that her patience was not "
"boundless. She blamed him, said that he'd let his troublemakers run wild, so "
"he could get out of the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} along with "
"them. She told him she won't tolerate any more bullying, even if it's coming "
"from 'genius' students. I understand it's odd to hear 'won't tolerate' from "
"Atalia Gitaren, but that's what really happened.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아탈리아는 아카데미에서 꽤 많은 학생을 퇴학시켰어요. 이오발드는 그 결정에 항상 반대했고요... 아탈리아의 인내심이 바닥날 때가 "
"됐죠. 함께 쫓겨나고 싶지 않으면 문제아들을 그만 감싸주라고, 이오발드에게 최후통첩을 날린 거예요. 불세출의 '천재'라도, 다른 학생을 "
"괴롭히는 '천재'는 아카데미에 필요 없다는 거죠. 여태 제멋대로 하다가 이제 와서 경고씩이나 하는 게 이상하지만, 아무튼. 아탈리아 "
"지타렌과 이오발드 사이엔 이런 일이 있었답니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "23ec2c0f-f257-4596-ab6a-3afb99040c23"
msgid ""
"{n}Pale, Linzi looks at Annamede with huge eyes, unable to utter a word.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}창백해진 린지는 말을 잇지 못한 채 눈을 크게 뜨고 안나메데를 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "da43862b-b18e-4d07-ad6e-32dcfb19e518"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it... Teacher lied to me all this time? I'm going to learn "
"the truth as soon as we get back to the capital!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없어... 선생님이 계속 거짓말 하셨다고? 수도로 돌아가자마자 진실을 알아야겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "f891912b-6786-44a8-bb87-85d21a7e093a"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not sure you should be thanking me — I see poor Linzi's not too happy "
"with this truth... Hey, come on, girl — cheer up! Being disappointed by "
"people is practically a professional necessity for people like us. Whatever "
"I may have said before, you're not a bad bard. And that means, sometimes you "
"have to face the music!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신이 내게 고마워 할지는 모르겠지만, 불쌍한 린지는 이 진실에 불행한 것 같네요... 여길 봐 — 힘내! 사람들에게 실망하는 것은 "
"우리같은 사람들에겐 특히 불가피한 일일 뿐이야. 내가 전에 말한 적 있을텐데, 너는 나쁜 음유 시인이 아니야. 그리고 그건, 때때로 "
"음악에 맞서야 한다는 얘기고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "97a7d7c8-8f7e-49fc-aac5-ed34acd704a9"
msgid "{n}Linzi gulps and whispers,{/n} \"Th-thank you.\""
msgstr "{n}린지 침을 꿀꺽 삼키고 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"고... 고마워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "ffe0163f-fdfd-4a6e-a995-79f08e0162ba"
msgid ""
"\"Oh? I just hope it isn't about any of the lectures I used to give you at "
"the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}. Go ahead, ask away!\" {n}Annamede "
"smiles encouragingly at Linzi.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"흠? 이번엔 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}시절 네가 수강한 강의에 대한 질문이 아니길 바래. 어서 "
"물어봐!\" {n}안나미데는 린지를 부추기듯 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "6b31eaca-ecd1-493f-b93f-409d439b3eb3"
msgid ""
"{n}Linzi turns bright red, takes a deep breath, and blurts out,{/n} \"Sorry, "
"but... I really need to know the truth! Why did Irovetti kick Professor "
"Eobald out of the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}린지는 얼굴이 붉어졌고, 심호흡을 한 뒤, 내뱉었습니다.{/n}\"미안해. 하지만... 진실을 정말로 알고 싶어. 왜 이로베티는 "
"이오발드 교수를 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}에서 쫓아낸거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5d3765d3-093f-497f-865b-5aaf034c0573"
msgid ""
"\"...He is also an unsurpassed singer, a skilled hunter, an excellent "
"horseman, and able to bake fancy breads while juggling daggers! If you begin "
"on the path of singing the praises of your superiors, dear, at least use "
"your imagination.\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 그는 또한 탁월한 가수이자 숙련된 사냥꾼, 말을 잘 다루고 단도를 저글링하면서 멋진 빵을 구울 수도 있어! 상사에게 아부하려면 "
"적어도 상상력이 필요하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "68bec47c-6e93-4782-a164-aa59da7ac75a"
msgid ""
"\"What am I hearing! A respected scholar, an author of so many books, "
"articles, and memorandums... lied? Unbelievable!\""
msgstr "\"이게 무슨 소리야! 존경받는 학자, 수많은 책, 글, 보고서의 저자라는 것이 거짓말이라고...? 믿을 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "388c672e-42d2-47a6-8bda-a3abe031015c"
msgid ""
"\"Just as behind any nice facade. That's what they're built for, after all.\""
msgstr "\"멋들어진 겉모습의 속사정이지. 그들이 결국 가공한 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0071_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "58a76809-8ac9-4e3f-8f8e-2a7c1162549b"
msgid ""
"\"In the hands of a ruler, even death is political currency... Though none "
"wish to recall that, sooner or later, fate will use it to pay them as well!\""
msgstr ""
"\"통치자의 손에는 죽음조차도 정치적으로 정당화돼... 누구도 그걸 기억하고 싶지는 않겠지만 곧 어느 누구도 죽음을 피해가지 못해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "58fa11f4-d2d3-4b9c-afda-0b180509a6c8"
msgid ""
"\"Have my humble verses so offended you that you still recall their sting? "
"Please, Your Highness! It doesn't behoove a person of your standing to take "
"umbrage against a petty bard. Don't you know the old proverb? The tunes are "
"chosen by the one who pays the piper!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 겸손한 구절들이 너무 날카로워서 아직도 그 상처가 기억나요? 진정해요, 전하! 째째한 음유시인에게 불쾌감을 표현할 위치도 "
"아니시잖아요? 연주자를 고용하는 사람이 노래를 선택한다는 속담 아시나요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AnnamedeBelavarah/Cue_0075_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "f4599c58-9ced-42be-838a-895799d2255c"
msgid ""
"\"Hello, lady Provocateur. Aren't you afraid you'll burn out at work one day?"
"\""
msgstr "\"안녕. 선동가 아가씨. 그러다 과로로 쓰러지겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "eff6808f-c93d-45fc-8877-edfd9f110a12"
msgid "\"How fares the academy?\""
msgstr "\"아카데미는 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d8389c3b-8840-4e7b-b9b3-18143a215cf9"
msgid "\"I hear you're not exactly thrilled by Irovetti's power...\""
msgstr "\"이로베티의 힘에 굴복하지 않는다면서...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "2693c9ce-86bd-42e9-b466-dccf463b8f93"
msgid "\"Who might you recommend I meet here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 누구와 만나야 할지 추천해 줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "2d76422c-9bf7-4a58-b805-7081ba183832"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "0ad4f993-eafb-46fe-a59f-64bbfcceac59"
msgid "\"I get the impression that something's upsetting you.\""
msgstr "\"뭔가가 너를 화나게 한다는 생각이 들어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "ced466be-3b4f-414f-900e-a053967146f9"
msgid "[Attack] \"Down with schools and teachers!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"학교와 선생님들과 함께 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "e30eaa4a-1a09-45f1-904d-eb6ed6928f3e"
msgid ""
"\"What did you mean when you mentioned the circumstances surrounding Eobald "
"the Insightful's dismissal?\""
msgstr "\"신통한 자 이오발드의 해고를 둘러싼 상황에 대해 언급했을 때 무슨 말을 하려던 거였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "601f3e5c-668e-4e6a-8a80-398720cc8151"
msgid "\"Linzi has some interesting news for you...\""
msgstr "\"린지가 흥미로운 소식을 가져왔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "d59a4b19-e917-4367-bd54-7ae1002b7af5"
msgid ""
"\"Annamede Belavarah told us why you expelled Eobald from the academy.\""
msgstr "\"안나미데 빌라바라는 우리에게 왜 네가 아카데미에서 이오발드를 추방했는지 말해주었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ceab9af8-c6ec-40e5-ac20-22878fbf8459"
msgid ""
"\"Greetings, Your Highness! I'm Atalia Gitaren, Headmaster of the {g|Academy "
"of Grand Arts}Academy of Grand Arts{/g}. Welcome to the tournament. Is this "
"your first time here? I'll be honest, I'm delighted to hear what you've done "
"with {kingdomname}! Not so long ago, it was little more than a hole in the "
"ground... but you've brought it real civilization! Bravo!\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까! 저는 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}의 교장 아탈리아 지타렌입니다. 토너먼트에 오신 것을 "
"환영합니다. 이번이 첫 방문이신가요? 솔직히 말해서, 당신이 {kingdomname}에서 무슨 위업을 이루었는지 듣게되어 기뻤습니다! "
"얼마 전까지만 해도, 그곳은 땅 위에 파인 구멍보다 약간 나은 수준이었지만, 당신께서 거기에 진짜 문명을 일궈내셨죠! 대단합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "8e290898-5a74-4ad2-9e21-ba70e4583a38"
msgid "\"Greetings, Your Highness. How do you find the tournament?\""
msgstr "\"안녕하십니까, 전하. 어떻게 대회를 찾아오셨죠?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "d47d714e-5c8b-403a-afaa-8d525a388871"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, Your Highness, but this is defamation. My students and I owe "
"everything we have to King Irovetti. If not for him, the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy of Grand Arts{/g} wouldn't even exist. It would be base "
"ingratitude on my part to engage in any conspiracy against our patron. You "
"must have me confused with {d|Annamede}Annamede Belavarah{/d} — she's "
"certainly always ready to bite the hand that feeds... or caresses.\""
msgstr ""
"\"용서하십시오, 전하. 하지만 이건 명예 훼손입니다. 저희 학생들과 저는 이로베티 왕에게 전부를 빚졌습니다. 그가 없었다면, {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}대 예술 아카데미{/g}는 존재하지도 않았을 겁니다. 제 입장에서, 저희 후원자에 대한 음모를 "
"꾸민다면 은혜를 모르는 일이겠지요. {d|Annamede}안나미데 빌라바라{/d} 때문에 저에 대해 혼동하셨나 보군요. 그녀는 항상 "
"먹이를 주는 주인의 손을 물어 뜯을 준비가 되어있죠... 아니면 애무하거나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "64810c1d-0109-45f8-b91c-caa3205d13e4"
msgid ""
"\"There are many respectable attendees today. You already know King "
"Irovetti, of course. You should be sure to speak with High Priest Drey "
"Yarnes, as well — he's truly a wise and honorable man.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘은 존경받는 사람들이 많이 참석했죠. 물론 이로베티 왕은 알고 계실 테니, 대사제 드레이 얀스와도 이야기해보십시오. 그는 정말로 "
"현명하고 존경할만한 사람입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d5569144-bf49-496e-b72d-9d5ff6776edc"
msgid ""
"\"And if I may give you one piece of advice — beware of Kharne Vereel. He "
"may be business partners with King Irovetti himself, but those who deal with "
"him usually find themselves in a bad way. Since he showed up in the city, "
"our dear captain of the guard, Irsei Caelysse, has so much more work that he-"
"\" {n}Atalia stops short, covering her mouth.{/n} \"Forgive me, I've "
"probably said too much.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 조언 하나를 더 허락하신다면, 칸 베릴을 조심하십시오. 그는 이로베티 왕의 사업 파트너이지만, 그와 같은 작자와 거래하는 "
"사람들은 보통 질이 낮죠. 그가 도시에 나타난 이래로, 우리의 경비대장 얼세이 케일리시는 훨씬 더 많은 일을 해야했고 그래서 그는 — \""
" {n}아탈리아는 말을 멈추고는 입을 막습니다.{/n} \"오 이런. 말을 너무 많이 한 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "26ea5452-f0d3-404b-8f94-7c09688f6de4"
msgid "\"It was a great honor and exquisite pleasure to meet you.\""
msgstr "\"당신을 만나 영광스럽고 즐거웠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "fa4cdb13-9264-4c6f-9089-e04cdbafcb80"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, no, please don't worry. I'm just disappointed that one of our best "
"students — Trebricent of {g|Cordelon}Cordelon{/g} — couldn't be here today. "
"He could be singing in any capital, but the king chose to send him to some "
"backcountry village called {g|Littletown}Littletown{/g}... Of course, His "
"Highness would never squander talent, so I'm sure we'll hear from Trebricent "
"again. But still, I do worry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 제발 걱정하지 않으셔도 됩니다. 저는 우리 학교 최고의 학생 중 한 명이 오늘 참석하지 않았다는데 실망했을 뿐입니다 — 바로 "
"{g|Cordelon}코델론{/g}의 트레브리센트죠. 그는 어떤 수도에서나 노래 부를 수 있을테지만, 왕은 그를 "
"{g|Littletown}리틀타운{/g}이라는 오지 마을로 보냈습니다... 물론, 전하께서 재능을 낭비하지 않으실테니, 트레브리센트를 "
"다시 볼 수 있을 거라 확신합니다. 하지만, 저는 여전히 걱정스럽군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "09032c86-20b6-4020-8c22-87642e1cb635"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, just splendid! If you ever find time to visit {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, I'd "
"gladly give you a tour. We're currently holding an exhibition of our "
"graduates' works. Though it's a pity that... No, no, it's fine. Believe me, "
"we have plenty worth coming to see and hear!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 훌륭합니다! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 들를 시간이 있으시다면, 제가 기꺼이 당신을 안내해드리죠. 현재 저희는 졸업 작품 "
"전시회를 개최 중이니까요. 안타깝지만... 아니, 아니지. 괜찮습니다. 믿어보세요, 저희에겐 보고 들을 것이 정말로 많습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b1d9f609-7e4e-4f4b-aa96-ff371357c03b"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes, Headmaster...\" {n}Linzi puts on an oversweet smile.{/n} \"Not so "
"long ago, Professor\n"
"{d|Eobald}Eobald{/d} the Insightful came to us. It's truly a pity that His "
"Highness King Irovetti had to deprive the academy of such an outstanding "
"teacher! He's writing his memoires of his time at the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g}, you know. I'm sure it'll be an entertaining read for "
"everyone in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} — no, all of {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 그래, 교장...\" {n}린지는 지나치게 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"얼마 전 {d|Eobald}Eobald{/d} 교수가 "
"우리를 방문했어. 이로베티 왕이 자신의 뛰어난 교사를 추방해야 했다는 사실이 정말 유감이야! 그는 {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}아카데미{/g}에서의 추억에 대한 글을 쓰고 있어, 알고 있지. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 모든 사람들에게 재미있는 읽을 "
"거리가 될 것이라고 확신해. 아니, {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g} 전역에서 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "0b4437a6-63d7-4645-9b71-070b07ce5b2d"
msgid ""
"\"A book, you say? How brave of him. I hope he doesn't neglect to include "
"the details of his dismissal.\" {n}Atalia's voice is ice cold and bone "
"dry.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"책이라고? 정말 용기 있군. 그의 해고에 대한 상세한 이유를 빠뜨리지 않고 넣길 바란다.\" {n}아탈리아의 목소리는 차갑고 "
"메말랐습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "b99a5099-607b-4c7c-9d39-e6b5c036f3a5"
msgid ""
"\"What details? What do you mean? Irovetti kicked Professor Eobald out "
"for... just... being too smart, didn't he?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 이유? 무슨 뜻이야? 이로베티는 이오발드 교수를 쫓아냈어. 단지... 너무 똑똑하다는 이유로... 그렇지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "4e759717-68f4-4989-a86d-df5176816d5e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sure that's exactly how he described it. They call him 'the "
"Insightful' for a reason, after all. Anyway, forgive me, but I've no "
"interest in discussing this topic further. If you'd like to exchange idle "
"gossip, I'm sure you can find much more willing and interesting company "
"here. I suspect you know to whom I'm referring.\""
msgstr ""
"\"바로 그렇게 묘사했겠지. 그러니 그가 '신통한 자'라고 불릴테니. 어쨌든, 용서해라. 그러나 나는 이 주제에 대해 더 이상 관심이 "
"없어. 험담을 나누고 싶은거라면, 여기엔 나보다 더 할 말이 많고 흥미로워 할 사람이 있지. 누구를 말하는지는 알거라 믿는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "7cf1ba15-c202-4a70-be71-844a5dfdd356"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me, Your Highness, but I'd prefer not to discuss the subject. If "
"you're truly so interested, I'm sure there are more than a few slanderers "
"who would gladly share all the dirty details with you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"용서하십시오, 전하. 하지만 이 주제에 대해 이야기하고 싶지 않습니다. 정말로 관심이 있으시다면, 함께 더러운 이야기를 기꺼이 나누어 "
"줄 험담꾼이 있을 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "a84d96fc-b1ef-4945-baf1-428d67abfcde"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Professor {d|Eobald}Eobald{/d} found refuge in our capital. And you "
"know what? He's writing his memoires of his time at the {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}Academy{/g}! I'm sure it'll be an entertaining read for everyone in "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} — no, all of {g|Avistan}Avistan{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래! {d|Eobald}이오발드{/d} 교수가 우리 수도로 피난해왔어. 그리고 그거 알아? 그는 {g|Academy of Grand "
"Arts}아카데미{/g}에서의 추억에 대한 글을 쓰고 있지! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 모든 사람들에게 재미있는 읽을 거리가 될 "
"것이라고 확신해 — 아니, {g|Avistan}아비스탄{/g} 전역에서 말이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "c1940b62-5cd0-4ffa-b93d-516b5056a420"
msgid ""
"\"I've no interest in what that individual told you. Please, let's discuss "
"something else.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 사람이 네게 말한 것에는 관심이 없다. 다른 얘기를 해보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/AtaliaGitaren/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2c9619b4-20ab-4db0-9f3e-a3bd36727414"
msgid ""
"\"Trifling hints, veiled accusations... I smell old rivalry and resentment "
"here. You should take note of that, {name} — there may be an advantage in "
"the feud of two mellifluous predators.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사소한 힌트와 숨겨진 비난... 나는 오래된 경쟁과 분노의 냄새가 나는군. 적어둬. {name}. 2마리 포식자가 싸우는 사이 이득을 "
"얻을 수 있다고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/ConcernedGuest_1_String
msgctxt "fefb23e1-9080-485d-9297-118341d16160"
msgid "\"Those pirates are a blight on Pitax!\""
msgstr "\"그 해적들은 피탁스의 해충이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/ConcernedGuest_2_String
msgctxt "67410329-0e6e-48d5-9ef3-387ad3d2ae2c"
msgid "\"Something should be done about those pirates — and soon!\""
msgstr "\"그 해적들에게 조치를 취해야 해. 지금 당장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/ConcernedGuest_3_String
msgctxt "6ef44e50-e15c-450f-8bd8-79269c79f729"
msgid ""
"\"Robbed by pirates... again! Why won't King Irovetti do anything about them?"
"\""
msgstr "\"해적에게 다시 강탈 당하다니! 왜 이로베티 왕은 아무 조치를 취하지 않는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guard_1_String
msgctxt "a603f4ab-7e48-4013-9cd2-e0bd974295fe"
msgid "\"As usual, the masters celebrate while us grunts have to work.\""
msgstr "\"평소대로 우리가 일할 때 우리 주인은 축하하러 갔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guard_2_String
msgctxt "ac8bcbab-9dc0-4f67-a263-4e0ebea2bdfd"
msgid "\"Old Irsei really runs us ragged.\""
msgstr "\"얼세이는 우리를 악착같이 굴려먹어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guard_3_String
msgctxt "4d6779c8-9bba-4fd5-bd15-71e5905ef587"
msgid "\"I hope we'll manage to avoid any duels this year...\""
msgstr "\"올해는 결투를 피할 수 있기를 바라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Daggermark_1_String
msgctxt "bc8fe3d4-e169-4d24-8545-85b9dda08d76"
msgid "\"Your Highness? It's wonderful to finally meet you in person.\""
msgstr "\"마침내 직접 만나게 되어 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Daggermark_2_String
msgctxt "8d295aac-9ef8-41d1-973c-273f1dbbae33"
msgid "\"Ah, {mf|King|Queen} {Name}! We've heard so much about you!\""
msgstr "\"아. {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}! 우리는 너에 대해 많이 들었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Gralton_1_String
msgctxt "6fcd8dd8-3dc2-43ab-bc5a-0600692d871a"
msgid "\"What should I say in the boasting contest? Need to think...\""
msgstr "\"자랑하기 대회에서 뭐라해야 하지? 생각좀 하자...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Gralton_2_String
msgctxt "4b2bb175-7ed2-4722-bab3-9733a08d3ced"
msgid ""
"\"Pitax has always been famous for its wine, but this year's vintage is "
"exceptional!\""
msgstr "\"피탁스는 항상 와인으로 유명했지만 올해의 빈티지는 예외야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Mivon_a1_String
msgctxt "579ca606-ab94-4427-970c-aaf50a598b9a"
msgid ""
"\"A pleasure to meet you, Your Highness! Congratulations on your coronation."
"\""
msgstr "\"만나서 반가워! 대관식을 축하해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Mivon_a2_String
msgctxt "9699b5e4-0ec8-4497-80a2-15be821b003f"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity the hunt you held was ruined. I do hope it wasn't the last one!"
"\""
msgstr "\"네가 붙잡은 사냥감이 망가져 유감이야. 다음에 또 잡겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Mivon_b1_String
msgctxt "acffe63f-5052-49ca-9acc-6e3ec1a22227"
msgid "\"Don't even think about coming near us.\""
msgstr "\"다가오지도 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Mivon_b2_String
msgctxt "02be93f0-8255-4865-9fd7-75191e180daf"
msgid "\"Leave, or I'll call the guards!\""
msgstr "\"가지 않으면 경비를 부르겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Mivon_c1_String
msgctxt "36145f33-cffe-4402-b90d-0c69096baeef"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness, pleased to meet you! I'm Edna Aldori, and this is my "
"sister, Julia.\""
msgstr "\"만나서 기쁘다! 나는 Edna Aldori이다. 그리고 여기는 나의 여동생 Julia다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Mivon_c2_String
msgctxt "156a4cdb-c0db-489c-a5f6-2fe5ff18ffee"
msgid ""
"\"I've wanted to meet you for a while. Perhaps you could also host a "
"tournament sometime?\""
msgstr "\"언젠가 너를 만나고 싶었어. 토너먼트를 주최할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Tymon_1_String
msgctxt "09c6bacd-8a50-431f-9e04-dad87663e610"
msgid ""
"\"Look, it's the {mf|king|queen} of {kingdomname}! It's an honor to meet you!"
"\""
msgstr "\"봐. {kingdomname}의 {mf|왕|여왕}이야! 만나서 영광이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Guest_Tymon_2_String
msgctxt "4e264175-4317-4152-b6f7-6a63a70efee3"
msgid ""
"\"This tournament is a great idea. And Irovetti is such a gallant host!\""
msgstr "\"토너먼트는 좋은 생각이야. 이로베티는 훌륭한 주최자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Visitor_1_String
msgctxt "feaef146-b7f9-4164-89e0-ccde059ba45d"
msgid ""
"\"Look, it's {mf|King|Queen} {Name}! Have you heard what they've been saying "
"about {mf|him|her}?\""
msgstr "\"봐. {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}이야! {mf|그|그녀}에 대한 이야기 들어봤어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Visitor_2_String
msgctxt "7b70bfc1-0b1b-4e13-b4b5-b95b96b30ecf"
msgid "\"I can't wait for the banquet!\""
msgstr "\"연회가 너무 기다려져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Barks/Visitor_3_String
msgctxt "8f2f83cb-6a23-46da-88c3-9672f27162d0"
msgid "\"I wonder who'll win the tournament. My bet's on Daggermark!\""
msgstr "\"토너먼트에서 누가 우승할까. 나는 대거마크에 걸겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "08157ea9-cf70-4627-84bd-f56b79057fde"
msgid "We didn't interfere."
msgstr "간섭하지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "888660c6-74b3-4656-8be4-58a5dfdd06d4"
msgid "We pointed out the cheating to the judges."
msgstr "우리는 심사 위원에게 속임수를 지적했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "cc2d73c9-7c79-4f28-b779-9c5fa3bbb78a"
msgid ""
"We quietly warned the bard that we would shut him up if he kept interfering."
msgstr "간섭을 계속한다면 조용하게 만들어줄 것이라고 음유시인에게 조용히 경고했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9d9fedaa-761e-4236-8cef-5d3e1dcd0e31"
msgid "Murdered a cheating bard at the Rushlight tournament."
msgstr "Rushlight 토너먼트에서 속임수를 쓰는 음유시인을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "37526106-a720-453f-98db-69aa5e3c24f5"
msgid "We snuck up on the bard, stabbed him in the back, and disappeared."
msgstr "우리는 음유시인 뒤에 붙어서 그를 찌르고 사라졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "bd6d2322-bfd2-4e4c-8a88-d3cb73bb3c3e"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "77da5480-d7d4-43bc-b8af-d04840abea4e"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "bfd7e98c-0ccb-4a9c-ae63-665c7a1840ab"
msgid ""
"{mf|He|She} regaled them with tales of our victories over the Stag Lord, the "
"trolls, Vordakai, and Armag."
msgstr "{mf|그|그녀}는 트롤, 보다카이, 아르막, 수사슴 군주 등 승리에 관한 이야기로 그들을 즐겁게 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "6217d1ef-2915-4ba0-986b-371393924e12"
msgid ""
"In response to Annamede's story, {mf||s}he recounted how we dealt with "
"Tartuccio, another one of Irovetti's spies."
msgstr "안나미데의 이야기에 대한 응답으로, 그{mf||녀}는 이로베티의 간첩 중 하나인 타투치오를 처리한 이야기를 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "8e5b6b56-a283-4674-bcc5-089d85a3f3cc"
msgid ""
"{mf|He|She} told the story of the time the baron{mf||ess} was made an "
"honorary goblin."
msgstr "{mf|그|그녀}는 남작이 명예 고블린을 임명한 이야기를 해주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "a1229df7-3717-4302-8dbb-be4e4ec1b820"
msgid ""
"{mf|He|She} described how the baron{mf||ess} had managed to make kobolds and "
"mites worship {mf|his|her} gloves as relics."
msgstr "{mf||여}남작은 자기 장갑을 코볼트와 마이트가 유물로 숭배하게 한 얘기를 해주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "b7a60f10-d323-43bd-b7a0-809bc74cc0a0"
msgid ""
"{mf|He|She} wove an interesting — but entirely fictional! — tale for the "
"audience."
msgstr "{mf|그|그녀}은 흥미롭지만 전부 허구인 이야기를 관객을 위해 가공했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "3559ca84-faa7-4510-878a-3755e3df58fa"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "d9dbcb03-6eb6-443d-b249-205a418d7b74"
msgid "Continue."
msgstr "계속."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "1de816a4-889c-408a-b8f5-1a8a9de1327b"
msgid ""
"The tournament continued with a boasting contest. The first participant, a "
"man from Daggermark, stepped up to the podium and told a raunchy story about "
"{g|SillyHint Halfling}him{/g} sneaking into a temple of "
"{g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} and seducing all the priestesses — including the "
"high priestess — in a single night. The crowd was particularly amused by the "
"suggestive glances he kept casting toward one of the guests from Tymon. She "
"simply smiled mysteriously in response.\n"
"The second participant was a guest from Gralton, who told a completely "
"implausible tale about his travels across other planes, where he battled {g|"
"SillyHint Undead}undead{/g} hordes and defeated a bloodcurdling {g|SillyHint "
"Monstr}monster{/g}. He was an average storyteller at best — he'd be lucky to "
"get a C for that story at the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} — but the "
"listeners were inexplicably elated. Suspicious, we took a closer look at the "
"crowd, and... Of course! We spotted a bard using some tricks of the trade ("
"and likely a little magic) to aid the Gralton man's performance!"
msgstr ""
"대회는 자랑하기 대회가 이어졌습니다. 첫 번째 참가자인 대거마크의 한 남자는 연단 위로 올라가서 {g|SillyHint "
"Halfling}그가{/g} {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}의 신전에 몰래 들어가 한밤 중에 대사제를 포함한 모든 여사제를 "
"유혹한 이야기를 했습니다. 군중은 그가 타이몬의 손님 중 한 명을 향해 계속 외설적인 눈빛을 던지는 모습을 보고 정말 즐거워했습니다. "
"그녀는 대답 대신 신비한 미소를 지었습니다.\n"
"두 번째 참가자는 그랄튼 출신의 게스트로 세계의 반대편을 여행하다 {g|SillyHint Undead}언데드{/g} 군단과 싸우고 오싹한 "
"{g|SillyHint Monstr}괴물{/g}들을 해치운 완전히 믿기지가 않는 이야기를 했습니다. 그는 평범한 이야기꾼이었습니다. 그 "
"이야기로 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}에서 점수를 얻으려면 운이 좋아야 였을 것입니다. 그러나 관객들은 "
"설명할 수 없을 정도로 기뻐했습니다. 의심스럽게 우리는 군중을 면밀히 관찰했는데... 역시나! 우리는 그랄튼 남자의 공연을 돕기 위해 "
"음유시인이 매수를 했는지 마법을 부렸는지 모르겠지만 속임수를 쓴 것을 발견했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "d163b048-de2c-4096-b21d-c9eba3b4dbcc"
msgid ""
"After finishing his story, the guest from Gralton stepped down from the "
"podium to a very loud — and completely undeserved — ovation."
msgstr "그가 이야기를 마친 후 그랄튼의 손님은 연단에서 내려와 당치도 않는 아주 큰 박수 갈채를 받았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "5f5e1f86-58ef-4884-b1cb-b50022fef132"
msgid ""
"The judges were reluctant to believe us, but the cheating was easy to spot "
"once you knew to look for it. Once they'd concluded we were right, the guest "
"from Gralton was disqualified and forced to leave the podium in disgrace."
msgstr ""
"재판관은 우리를 믿기를 꺼렸지만 속임수란 찾으면 알기 쉬운 것입니다. 일단 그들이 우리가 옳았다고 결론을 내리면 그랄튼의 손님은 실격 "
"당하고 불명예스럽게 연단을 떠나야만 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "632ceb55-6094-49ef-92b0-5e92d1529f48"
msgid ""
"It was just a waste of time, though — the judges completely ignored the "
"cheating, and in the time we took trying to convince them, the participant "
"from Gralton finished his story and stepped down from the podium to audience "
"applause."
msgstr ""
"재판관이 부정 행위를 완전히 무시했고 시간 낭비가 되었습니다. 우리가 그들을 설득하려고 시도했을 때 그랄튼 출신의 참가자는 자신의 "
"이야기를 마치고 연단에서 내려오며 관객에게 박수를 받았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "feac257d-0d41-4c20-9caa-26b2d09acad2"
msgid ""
"The bard got the message and quickly disappeared. Without the bard's "
"support, the guest from Gralton immediately lost the audience's approval. As "
"he grew more nervous, he began mumbling and stumbling over his words, and he "
"eventually left the podium among jeers and whistles."
msgstr ""
"음유시인은 메시지를 받고 빠르게 사라졌습니다. 음유시인의 지원이 없어지자 그랄튼의 손님은 즉시 청중의 호응을 잃었습니다. 그가 더 "
"긴장하자 그는 말을 더듬으며 중얼거리기 시작했고 결국 야유와 휘파람 속에 연단을 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "60a02afe-d3d5-4d57-8dde-665f7fa245c6"
msgid ""
"We tried threatening the bard, but he wasn't born yesterday — he started "
"yelling and crying, calling to the guards, to Irovetti, and to all the gods "
"for help. While we were managing that, the participant from Gralton finished "
"his lying without interruption and stepped down from the podium to "
"undeserved applause — and we were disqualified for trying to interfere with "
"an opponent's performance. The indignity of it all!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 음유 시인을 위협하려 했지만 그는 가만있지 않았습니다. 그는 소리를 지르고 울면서 경비원을 부르며 이로베티와 모든 신들에게 도움을 "
"청했습니다. 우리가 그를 처리하는 동안 그랄튼의 참가자는 중단없이 거짓말을 마치고 당치 않는 박수를 받으며 연단에서 물러났습니다. 그리고 "
"우리는 상대방의 성과를 방해하여 실격당했습니다. 정말 치욕스럽습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "8cd9decc-69b2-4e8b-8e30-44dd72356d59"
msgid ""
"The bard collapsed to the ground, choking on his own blood. By the time the "
"crowd noticed, we were long gone. Needless to say, the audience's impression "
"of the Gralton participant's performance was ruined."
msgstr ""
"바드는 땅에 쓰러져 피를 토했습니다. 군중이 알아 차릴 무렵에 우리는 이미 사라졌습니다. 말할 필요도 없이 그랄튼 참가자의 공연에 대한 "
"청중의 반응이 식었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "5535c37b-ae33-4e9f-b4e6-c420992317b1"
msgid ""
"The bard collapsed to the ground, choking on his own blood. The audience's "
"impression of the Gralton participant's performance was ruined, for all the "
"good it did us — someone in the crowd spotted our attack and screamed bloody "
"murder, and guards descended on us from seemingly nowhere. It looked like we "
"were in trouble."
msgstr ""
"바드는 땅에 쓰러져 피를 토했습니다. 말할 필요도 없이 그랄튼 참가자의 공연에 대한 청중의 반응이 식었지만 군중 중 누군가 우리의 공격을 "
"발견하고 비명을 질렀고 어디선가 갑자기 경비병이 튀어나와 모두 소용이 없게 되었습니다. 우리는 곤경에 처한 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "c09508fa-4104-44d4-acb2-94bf636d7a55"
msgid ""
"Then it was {g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} turn. The kingdom's honor was represented "
"by Annamede Belavarah — a sweet-voiced singer whose smile could win over the "
"most withered of hearts. Oh, Annamede... But while her voice was smoother "
"than silk, her words stung like arrows!\n"
"With a soft smile, Annamede told everyone how she'd spent months in our "
"kingdom learning our secrets and instigating a riot! Of course, the honest "
"trade of the bard and the shady dealings of the spy often go hand in hand, "
"but... Oh, Annamede, who could've expected such an ugly blow from such a "
"lovely lady?"
msgstr ""
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 차례였습니다. 왕국의 명예에 관해 안나미데 빌라바라가 연설을 했는데, 그녀의 그 달콤한 미소는 시들어 "
"가는 심장도 뛰어 홀딱 넘어가게 만들었습니다. 오. 안나미데... 그녀의 목소리는 비단보다 더 부드러웠지만 내용은 화살처럼 뾰족했습니다! "
"\n"
"안나미데는 부드러운 미소과 함께, 몇 달 동안 우리 왕국에서 비밀을 캐내고 폭동을 선동했다고 말했습니다! 물론 음유시인한테는 간첩의 "
"이면도 있긴 하지만... 아. 그 아름다운 아가씨에게서 그런 추악한 입담을 누가 예상이나 했을까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "b99beb3f-b122-4300-9f79-103963d042cb"
msgid ""
"It wasn't easy getting the crowd excited for this story. They were all "
"glorious feats, of course, but that was the problem — the audience had "
"already heard them time and time again! {Name} used all the eloquence {mf||s}"
"he could bring to bear to breathe new life into these old stories."
msgstr ""
"군중들이 이야기에 흥미를 느끼게 하는 것은 쉽지 않았습니다. 물론 모두 영광스러운 업적을 말했지만 관객들이 이미 들어 본 이야기라는 것이 "
"문제였습니다! {Name}는 모든 웅변술을 사용하여 오래된 이야기에 새로운 삶을 불어 넣으려 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "f82d6d18-2c5a-4e9c-8a3b-44b3b2d5401f"
msgid ""
"While not exactly a \"glorious feat,\" the story certainly had great "
"material for jokes. The audience likes laughing at simpletons, and {Name} "
"did all {mf||s}he could to have them rolling in the aisles."
msgstr ""
"정확하게 \"영광스러운 공적\"은 아니었지만 이 이야기는 농담에 훌륭한 재료였습니다. 관중들은 단순한 이야기에 웃기를 좋아합니다. "
"{Name}는 관중들의 배꼽을 빠지게 하려고 모든 수단을 동원했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "0c98d9f1-e358-4c16-8f4f-29a8f2a6ab74"
msgid ""
"Looking meaningfully at Annamede, {Name} spoke of the sad fate that befell "
"the last of Irovetti's spies... and what may be in store for any other spies "
"we might come across!"
msgstr ""
"Annamede을 보란듯이 바라보며 {Name}는 이로베티의 첩자들이 처한 슬픈 마지막 운명을 말했고... 아마 이야기 속의 첩자는 "
"우리가 만났을 지도 모릅니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "5be37eb8-7e72-435b-8ea4-eff21c2db044"
msgid ""
"{Name} took a deep breath and began lying enthusiastically. {mf|He|She} "
"started with us supposedly setting off to the snowy woods of "
"{g|Irrisen}Irrisen{/g} in search of the missing queen of witches, Baba Yaga, "
"which led us to another planet entirely, interfering in a war between "
"dragons. We then went through a portal to another world, one full of "
"previously unseen technologies, where we hunted down Baba Yaga's son, an "
"insane monk who had her trapped in a nesting doll... The audience listened "
"on with rapt attention, their mouths hanging open."
msgstr ""
"{Name}는 심호흡을 하면서 열정적으로 거짓말하기 시작했습니다. {mf|그|그녀}는 {g|Irrisen}Irrisen{/g}의 눈 덮인 "
"숲으로 데려가 용과의 전쟁을 방해하다 우리를 다른 행성으로 데려간 바바 야가라는 마녀들을 찾는 이야기로 시작했습니다. 그리고는 우리는 "
"포털을 타고 다른 세계로 날아가 본 적도 없는 기술을 이룩한 세계에서 자신의 어머니를 마트료시카 인형에 가둔 바바 야가의 미친 수도승 "
"아들을 해치웠습니다. 관객은 열렬한 관심으로 입이 벌어진 채 이야기를 들었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "7e95b1f5-cef1-426c-be76-962111e56de4"
msgid ""
"The audience hung on {mf|his|her} every word, sometimes laughing "
"uncontrollably, sometimes holding their breath to avoid missing anything. "
"{Name} finally brought the story to an end, and the viewers gave {mf|him|her}"
" a standing ovation as {mf||s}he left the podium."
msgstr ""
"관중들은 {mf|그의|그녀의} 모든 단어에 귀기울였고 때로는 웃음이 터져나왔고 때로는 숨을 쉬지 않고 무엇이든 놓치지 않으려 했습니다. "
"{Name}가 마침내 이야기를 끝내고 청중들은 {mf|그|그녀}에게 기립 박수를 쳤고 {mf||s}는 연단을 떠났습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "82206404-98a8-4771-b769-c59f5a5c25a9"
msgid ""
"{Name} used all the eloquence {mf||s}he could bring to bear, but the "
"audience barely paid any attention, giving {mf|him|her} little more than "
"polite applause as {mf||s}he left the podium."
msgstr ""
"{Name} 모든 웅변을 사용하여 관객을 이끌려고 했지만 관객은 간신히 관심을 기울였고 연단을 떠났을 때 박수 소리는 더 적어졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "cc41f07b-3d81-4504-91f0-62c42489d715"
msgid ""
"The woman from Tymon, a priestess of {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}, went last. "
"She told stories of her love affairs in faraway countries and on other "
"planes, casually mentioning an unpleasant disease she'd contracted over her "
"journeys that took her a long time to get rid of — hearing that, the "
"participant from Daggermark paled and grabbed at his belt, bringing roaring "
"laughter from the rest of the audience."
msgstr ""
"타이몬 출신의 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g} 여사제가 마지막이었습니다. 그녀는 먼 나라와 다른 차원에서 사랑에 빠진 이야기를 "
"했고 여행 중에 성병에 걸려 치료하느라 애먹었다는 이야기를 언급했고 대거마크의 참가자가 창백해지더니 허리춤을 쥐어 청중이 웃음을 "
"터뜨렸습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "39496abf-74d3-4d03-8adf-bbc7aa6eb8bc"
msgid ""
"And finally, the judges announced the winner — {Name}! {mf|He|She} walked up "
"to the podium to thunderous applause and took another bow."
msgstr ""
"그리고 마지막으로 심사 위원은 수상자를 발표했습니다. {Name}입니다! {mf|그|그녀}는 연단까지 올라가 우뢰 같은 박수를 받으며 "
"예의 바른 인사를 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "393294a2-9d3f-492d-9ccc-cf1499910c4d"
msgid ""
"And finally, the judges announced the winner — Annamede Belavarah! The "
"beautiful singer walked up to the podium to take another bow, casting a "
"vicious glare our way. I was once again amazed by how deceptive appearances "
"can be."
msgstr ""
"그리고 마지막으로 심사 위원은 수상자를 발표했습니다. 안나미데 빌라바라입니다! 아름다운 발표자는 연단까지 올라가 우뢰 같은 박수를 받으며 "
"예의 바른 인사를 했고 사나운 눈으로 우리를 쳐다봤습니다. 나는 그녀의 이중적인 모습에 한차례 놀랐습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "79a1ab09-a96b-4bf1-9776-7a2df13e2e25"
msgid ""
"When Annamede finished and left the stage, it was our turn to perform. And "
"what feats did our participant decide to tell in their performance?"
msgstr "안나미데의 연설이 끝나고 무대에서 나오자, 다음은 우리 차례였습니다. 그리고 우리 참가자는 어떤 솜씨를 부리며 말할까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Boasting/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "efe0277f-8fb7-4828-9c7d-aa59152340b7"
msgid ""
"She described — in surprising and exceptionally critical detail — how much "
"the citizens of our young state suffered under the atrocities of the troll "
"assaults and the magic plague. She never stooped to actual lies, but she "
"made it sound as though our {mf|king|queen} — baron{mf||ess} at the time — "
"was simply drinking and debauching while {mf|his|her} subjects struggled. "
"She made our crusade against Vordakai look like a cunning conquest of "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, and the war with the {g|Tiger Lords}Tiger Lords{/g}"
" was characterized as an irresponsible venture. Talk about cruel and unfair!"
msgstr ""
"그녀는 트롤 공격과 마법 전염병의 잔학 행위로 인해 시민들이 얼마나 많은 고통을 겪었는지 놀라울 정도로 구체적으로 묘사했습니다. 그녀는 "
"결코 사실 같은 거짓에 힘을 빌리지 않았지만 {mf|왕|여왕}, 당시에는 남작은 부하들이 고생할 때 그저 술이나 마셨다는 이야기를 "
"지어냈습니다. 그녀는 보다카이에 대적한 우리의 성전을 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}에 대한 교묘한 정복처럼 묘사했고 {g|Tiger "
"Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}와의 전쟁은 무책임한 모험으로 바꾸었습니다. 잔인하고 불공평하군요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "b1245d85-eac4-48b4-853c-ef774c8a2019"
msgid "We decided to compete honestly."
msgstr "우리는 정직하게 경쟁하기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "7a874189-67c6-433c-b9e6-6f0ea66ef843"
msgid "We tried to cheat by discreetly throwing fish at our opponents!"
msgstr "우리는 상대편에게 물고기를 던져 분위기를 산만하게 만들려 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "7f320cf4-ab51-47f6-ad0a-7bd4c479f316"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b24c25b0-1fd5-49fa-97a7-84751899e795"
msgid "We decided to compete honestly."
msgstr "우리는 정직하게 경쟁하기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "6a43b0e7-771e-4b62-bbd1-387081d10afa"
msgid "We tried to cheat by sneaking a blade into the contest!"
msgstr "우리는 몰래 칼을 들여 부정직한 방법을 쓰기로 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4147207e-90e8-465a-9e23-fb09e2dc710b"
msgid ""
"We noticed a sharpened coin glistening in the Daggermark competitor's mouth, "
"and the Gralton participant had a blade in hand! We exposed the cheaters, "
"leaving us with fewer rivals!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 대거마크 경쟁자의 입 안에 날카로운 동전이 반짝이는 모습을 발견했고 그랄튼 참가자는 손에 칼날을 가지고 있었습니다! 우리는 "
"사기꾼의 정체를 노출시켜 라이벌을 줄였습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "128712b0-a858-4ca8-9bdd-3b2b29f9675e"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "5121eb7d-ce29-4045-bdca-a6ade1b5a83e"
msgid "We decided to compete honestly."
msgstr "우리는 정직하게 경쟁하기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "6402e360-8c43-4a0d-a1b2-6a03b5764919"
msgid "We tried to cheat by slipping some pebbles into our jar!"
msgstr "우리는 항아리에 조약돌 몇개를 넣어 속임수를 쓰기로 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "1422af54-258a-468f-8f2b-3b7de0524329"
msgid "We tried to cheat extensively and get all of our rivals disqualified!"
msgstr "우리는 모든 경쟁자에게 속임수를 써 실격시키려 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "91c8ea6d-595f-45c8-9f03-c6086334b5ed"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "ff5aa874-6241-4b49-8b6c-0116a97dfba7"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "e80d2402-e0e6-45ca-b815-56aef89e7e2e"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "fee583f9-333f-47a4-bc82-487348d1de7b"
msgid ""
"Trumpets sounded over the arena, announcing the commencement of the fisher's "
"triathlon. We were to distinguish ourselves in three sports... if you could "
"call them such! You be the judge, dear reader — the first round was fish "
"carrying, if you can believe it! They built narrow bridges over pits of mud "
"and placed barrels on either end — one side filled with fish, and the other "
"side empty. The goal was to get all the fish from one side to other, "
"barehanded, without falling into the mud — I'm sure this is just what you "
"imagined for a royal tournament! Throwing fish at your opponents was "
"prohibited, but there was one unofficial but well-understood rule in this "
"tournament — \"don't get caught.\" We had to decide which of us would "
"participate... as well as how fair we wanted to play!"
msgstr ""
"어부의 철인 경기가 시작됨을 알리는 트럼펫이 경기장에서 울렸습니다. 우리는 3종 스포츠에서 우리 자신을 나타내야 했습니다. 판단은 독자가 "
"알아서 하기를 바랍니다. 믿기지 않겠지만 첫 라운드는 생선을 운반하는 것이 었습니다! 그들은 진흙탕에 좁은 다리를 만들고 양쪽 끝에 "
"나무통을 놓아 한쪽은 물고기를 채우고 다른 한 쪽은 비웠습니다. 목표는 진흙에 빠지지 않고 한쪽에서 다른쪽으로 맨손으로 모든 물고기를 "
"옮기는 것이었습니다. 귀족의 즐길거리란 이런 것입니다! 상대방에게 물고기를 던지는 것은 금지되었지만 이 대회에서 비공식적이지만 통용되는 "
"규칙이 있었습니다. \"잡히지 말것.\" 우리는 어느 쪽에 참여할 것인지 결정해야 했습니다... 또한 얼마나 공평하게 플레이하고 싶은지도 "
"결정해야 했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "49268db9-b030-45d3-b05c-0265451958a4"
msgid ""
"{Name} quickly realized it would be hard to earn an honest win while "
"everyone else was cheating. The other participants took advantage of the "
"judges' careless attitudes by slyly throwing fish at each other. But their "
"tricks were to no avail — as they continued trying to force each other into "
"the mud, {Name} concentrated on the task at hand and swiftly carried all the "
"fish from one barrel to the other. Victory was ours!"
msgstr ""
"다른 모든 사람들이 속임수를 쓰는 동안 정직한 승리를 얻는 것이 어려울 것이라는 것을 {Name}는 빨리 깨달았습니다. 다른 참가자들은 "
"서로에게 물고기를 교묘히 던지면서 판사의 부주의한 태도를 이용했습니다. 그러나 그들의 속임수는 아무 소용이 없었습니다. 그들이 서로를 "
"진흙 속에 밀어 넣으려고 노력함에 따라 {Name}은 가까이에 있는 작업에 집중하고 모든 물고기를 한 배럴에서 다른 배럴로 신중하게 "
"옮겼습니다. 승리는 우리 것이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "b4c1d633-e4d3-4c63-b7cd-8c2cf4e5779c"
msgid ""
"{Name} quickly realized it would be hard to earn an honest win while "
"everyone else was cheating. {mf|He|She} hadn't even managed to move half of "
"the fish before someone slyly tossed a fish beneath {mf|his|her} feet — "
"{Name} slipped and fell into the mud. We lost the round — but the "
"competition wasn't over!"
msgstr ""
"다른 모든 사람들이 속임수를 쓰는 동안 정직한 승리를 얻는 것이 어려울 것이라는 것을 {Name}는 빨리 깨달았습니다. 누군가 {Name}"
"의 발 밑에 물고기를 교묘하게 던지기 전에도 물고기의 절반을 옮기지 못했습니다. {Name}는 미끄러져서 진흙 속에 빠졌습니다. 우리는 "
"이번에 졌지만 경쟁은 끝나지 않았습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "c070b89e-6729-4a37-8c9a-86aad5ab7cc7"
msgid ""
"Competing honestly among such company would be more embarrassing than "
"losing! As {Name} ran across the bridges with heaps of fish in {mf|his|her} "
"arms, {mf||s}he deftly tossed a fish beneath the feet of the Gralton "
"competitor, who slipped and fell into the mud. Another fish found its way "
"right to the Daggermark competitor's forehead, sending him down alongside "
"the Graltoner. The judges didn't notice a thing — we won the first round!"
msgstr ""
"비열한 경쟁자 사이에서 정직하게 경쟁하는 것은 패배보다 더 당황스러울 것입니다! {Name}은 물고기를 겨드랑이에 끼고 다리 건너편을 "
"달렸고 그랄튼 경쟁자의 발 밑에 솜씨있게 물고기를 던져 그는 슬프게도 진흙 속에 빠졌습니다. 또 다른 물고기는 대거마크 경쟁자의 이마에 "
"떨어져 그랄트인과 함께 떨어졌습니다. 심사 위원은 하나도 알아 차리지 못했습니다. 우리는 1 라운드에서 우승했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "e3a88428-9e18-4951-8a79-61b076d72187"
msgid ""
"The second round was untying knots — competitors would be tied up on poles "
"resembling ship masts, and they had to escape the ropes. We once again had a "
"choice to make."
msgstr ""
"두 번째 라운드는 매듭 풀기였습니다. 경쟁자는 선박 마스트와 같은 기둥에 묶여 있었고 그들은 로프를 벗어나야했습니다. 우리는 다시 한번 "
"선택을 해야 했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "9c0c691d-bcc0-4761-a0bf-99a43a0ecc11"
msgid ""
"The rules of the tournament never said \"don't cheat,\" just \"don't get "
"caught\" — but {Name} couldn't manage it. {mf|He|She} flung a fish into the "
"face of the Tymon participant, sending him into the mud, but {mf|his|her} "
"triumph was short-lived — the judges were already rushing toward us. Our "
"team was removed from the field as the crowd laughed and whistled."
msgstr ""
"토너먼트의 규칙은 결코 \"속이지 마라.\"\"잡히지 말라.\"라고 말하지 않았습니다. 하지만 {Name}은 그럴 수 없었습니다. "
"{mf|그|그녀}는 Tymon 참가자의 얼굴에 물고기를 던져 그를 진흙으로 보냈지만 {mf|그의|그녀의} 승리는 얼마 가지 않았습니다. "
"심사위원은 이미 우리쪽으로 달려오고 있었습니다. 군중들이 웃고 휘파람을 부는 사이 우리 팀은 경기장에서 퇴장당했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "303402b3-200b-4553-bfca-2bb1e96e9d25"
msgid ""
"The mast was tall, the knots were tight, and the ropes stank, but {name} "
"didn't give up — {mf||s}he snaked out of the ties and stood triumphantly "
"before the judges while the other participants were still wriggling in the "
"ropes like flies in a spiderweb. A victory — and an honest one at that!"
msgstr ""
"돛대는 키가 크고 매듭은 단단하고 밧줄은 악취가 났지만 {name}은 포기하지 않았습니다. 그는 다른 참가자가 거미줄에 있는 파리 처럼 "
"밧줄에서 여전히 움직이지 못하는 동안 매듭을 약삭빠르게 빠져나와 심판 앞에 서서 승리했습니다. 정직한 승리입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "03f51a68-920e-4055-a641-cc7d49acc125"
msgid ""
"{Name} dug {mf|his|her} teeth and fingers into the stinking ropes to untie "
"them, but {mf||s}he just couldn't catch up to the competition — while {mf||s}"
"he wriggled around in the ropes like a fly in a spiderweb, the others "
"managed to climb to the ground. We lost that round."
msgstr ""
"{Name}는 이빨로 뜯고 손가락을 집어넣어 냄새가 나는 로프를 풀었습니다만 경쟁자를 따라잡을 수 없었습니다. 그는 거미줄의 파리처럼 "
"밧줄 안에서 빙글빙글 돌았고 다른 무리들은 올라갔습니다. 우리는 그 라운드를 졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "60bfc110-ebab-438e-b461-adf2fc5d226c"
msgid ""
"It's well known that if you can't untie a knot, you just cut it! {Name} "
"stealthily pulled a blade from {mf|his|her} sleeve. While {mf|his|her} "
"competition struggled to escape their bonds, {mf||s}he jumped to the ground "
"and triumphantly walked over to the judges. Not an honest victory, but a "
"victory nonetheless!"
msgstr ""
"매듭을 풀 수 없다면 그냥 잘라버리라는 사실은 잘 알려져 있습니다! {Name}은 은밀히 칼날을 소매에서 꺼냈습니다. 경쟁자가 구속을 "
"탈출하기 위해 애 먹었고 {Name}은 땅에 뛰어올라 심판에게 의기 양양하게 걸어갔습니다. 정직한 승리는 아니지만 승리는 승리입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "e9b6019f-fbc5-4c9c-b0c2-66888cffeb9f"
msgid ""
"The judges escorted the cheaters out of the arena, the crowd laughing and "
"whistling all the while. With a third of the competition gone, {name} easily "
"outpaced the others, untangling the ropes and making {mf|his|her} way to the "
"judges while the others still wriggled in their bonds like flies in a "
"spiderweb."
msgstr ""
"심사위원단은 사기꾼들을 경기장 밖으로 안내했습니다. 군중들은 웃으면서 휘파람을 불었습니다. 경쟁자 중 3 분의 1이 사라지고 {name}"
"은 쉽게 다른 사람들보다 앞서 밧줄을 풀어주고 심판에게 나아가는 동안 다른 사람은 거미줄에 파리처럼 그들의 구속에 곤란을 겪었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "89b53f5a-354d-419f-88a0-10b170751d86"
msgid ""
"The judges escorted the cheaters out of the arena, the crowd laughing and "
"whistling all the while. {Name} had hoped it would be easy to defeat the "
"remaining competition, but it was not to be — {mf||s}he still hung from the "
"pole as the {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} competitor triumphantly walked over to the "
"judges."
msgstr ""
"심사위원단은 사기꾼들을 경기장 밖으로 안내했습니다. 군중들은 웃으면서 휘파람을 불었습니다. {Name}은 남은 경쟁자를 쉽게 이길 거라 "
"생각했지만 그렇지 않았습니다. 기둥에 여전히 매달려 있는 동안 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 경쟁자가 당당하게 심판에게 걸어갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "f979c0be-f2f6-4bfe-b96c-55b8d6be2564"
msgid ""
"We'd lost two rounds out of three. All seemed to be lost — but only if we "
"played fair!"
msgstr "우리는 3판 중 2판을 졌습니다. 정직하게 플레이하면 전부 질 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "0ff3bf40-d67a-4429-a126-2eb9b79e250e"
msgid ""
"Hanging from the pole, {Name} stealthily pulled out a small blade while the "
"judges weren't looking and began cutting the ropes. Unfortunately, the "
"competitor from Daggermark noticed and cried out in protest. Our team was "
"disqualified and escorted out of the arena — all the more disappointing, the "
"eagle-eyed man from Daggermark used the distraction to spit a sharpened coin "
"out of his mouth and cut his own knots!"
msgstr ""
"기둥에서 매달려 {Name}은 은밀히 작은 칼날을 뽑았는데 심판은 보지 않아 로프를 자르기 시작했습니다. 불행히도 대거마크의 경쟁자는 "
"눈치 채고 항의하며 소리쳤습니다. 우리 팀은 실격되고 경기장 밖으로 안내되었습니다. 더 실망스러운 것은 매의 눈 대거마크 경쟁자는 "
"날카로운 동전을 입에서 뱉어 내고 매듭을 잘랐다는 사실입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "e3b6e40e-6620-406c-a6f3-7c736f6d1edb"
msgid "So we won one round, at least. The third would be crucial!"
msgstr "우리는 적어도 한 라운드는 이겼습니다. 세 번째가 승부를 가름합니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "fe3c6a87-3765-4e11-be18-d21678aca3a5"
msgid ""
"We'd won two out of three rounds. We seemed to have our victory in the bag — "
"but with the rivals we were dealing with, there was no time to relax!"
msgstr ""
"3 라운드 중 2 라운드를 우승했습니다. 우리는 승리를 거머쥔 것처럼 보였습니다. 하지만 우리가 상대하고 있던 라이벌들과 함께 휴식할 "
"시간은 없었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "185605c5-d20e-4520-9a56-4a88731c092c"
msgid ""
"The last round of the tournament was diving for river pearls. Huge tubs were "
"filled with mussels in river water, and some empty jars had been placed on "
"sets of scales — we'd have to open the mussels with our bare hands, gather "
"the pearls, and deposit them in our team's jar. Of course, if playing fair "
"wasn't a priority, we could try weighing down the jar with other things as "
"well..."
msgstr ""
"마지막 라운드는 강 진주를 찾기 위한 다이빙이었습니다. 거대한 욕조에는 강물에 담긴 홍합이 채워졌고 일부 비어있는 병은 빈 껍데기가 놓여 "
"있었습니다. 맨손으로 홍합을 열고 진주를 모아서 우리 팀의 병에 넣어야 했습니다. 물론 공정한 플레이가 중요하지 않다면 우리는 다른 "
"것들로 항아리 무게를 재어 볼 수도 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "699759a6-7b9c-47cd-bc3b-2c4eb28e4882"
msgid ""
"{Name} bravely dove into the muddy water and started opening shells, "
"breaking {mf|his|her} nails in the process. {mf|His|Her} jar was soon full "
"of river pearls — and it weighed more than any of our rivals' jars. We'd won "
"the third round!"
msgstr ""
"{Name} 용감하게 물 속으로 뛰어 들어 조개 껍질을 까는 도중 손톱이 부러졌습니다. {mf|그의|그녀의} 항아리는 곧 강 진주로 가득 "
"찼고 우리 라이벌 항아리보다 무거웠니다. 우리는 3 라운드에서 우승했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "4fe6a024-bd8d-41b4-8679-c0948980751f"
msgid ""
"{Name} bravely dove into the muddy water and started opening shells, "
"breaking {mf|his|her} nails in the process. {mf|He|She} put fistfuls of "
"pearls into {mf|his|her} jar as fast as {mf||s}he could, but once time was "
"up, {mf|his|her} jar wasn't the heaviest. We lost the third round."
msgstr ""
"{Name} 용감하게 물 속으로 뛰어 들어 조개 껍질을 까는 도중 손톱이 부러졌습니다. 열심히 한 줌의 진주를 모아 항아리에 채웠지만 "
"시간이 다 되었을 때 {mf|그의|그녀의} 단지가 가장 무거운 것은 아니었습니다. 우리는 3라운드를 졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "881c0587-f1ac-4221-97cd-d638c15fb99c"
msgid ""
"The opaque jars on the scales just begged to hold more than pearls! But the "
"judges were more careful here. As soon as {Name} tried putting just one "
"innocent little pebble into our jar, {mf||s}he was caught red-handed and "
"escorted from the arena, the crowd laughing and whistling all the while. "
"Meanwhile, some of the other participants used the distraction to put "
"handfuls of stones and even nails into their jars."
msgstr ""
"잡히는 것마다 빈 껍데기가 든 항아리이기 일쑤였습니다. 그러나 심판은 여기에서 신중했습니다. {Name}가 단지에 몰래 작은 조약돌 "
"하나만 넣으려고했는데 그 자리에서 붙잡혀 경기장 밖으로 안내되었고 군중들은 웃으면서 휘파람을 불었습니다. 한편 다른 참가자 중 일부는 "
"산만한 틈을 타 돌과 껍데기를 항아리에 넣었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "f016035f-d15e-4a80-a59e-7507b7856975"
msgid ""
"The opaque jars on the scales just begged to hold more than pearls! Our plan "
"was to put stones and mud into our rivals' jars and demand the judges check "
"the contents at the end. Unfortunately, our cunning plan didn't work — as "
"soon as {Name} tried slipping a stone into another team's jar, {mf||s}he was "
"caught red-handed and escorted from the arena, the crowd laughing and "
"whistling all the while."
msgstr ""
"잡히는 것마다 빈 껍데기가 든 항아리이기 일쑤였습니다. 우리의 계획은 경쟁자의 항아리에 돌과 진흙을 넣고 최종적으로 심사 위원에게 "
"내용물을 확인하도록 요구하는 것이 었습니다. 불행히도 우리의 교활한 계획은 성공하지 않았습니다. {Name}은 돌을 다른 팀의 항아리에 "
"넣으려고 했는데 그 자리에서 붙잡혀 경기장 밖으로 안내되었고 군중들은 웃으면서 휘파람을 불었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "2feffaae-7a23-4a0c-a787-3db8890e571a"
msgid ""
"The pinnacle of cunning is to make it seem like everyone else is cheating "
"while coming out completely clean yourself. While each of our rivals tried "
"adding a stone or two to their jars, {Name} didn't hesitate to add a few "
"handfuls of mud — to each of theirs! In the end, our team's jar came out the "
"lightest, but the others were so heavy, the judges decided to check their "
"contents for authenticity. Oh, how the crowd laughed when our opponents' "
"jars poured out stones and mud — while our jar contained only pearls! It was "
"a complete triumph — every team but ours was disqualified, and we were "
"awarded the victory by default!"
msgstr ""
"교활함의 절정은 죄가 없어 보이게끔 행동하는 동안 다른 모든 사람들의 행동을 속임수처럼 보이도록 만드는 것입니다. 우리 경쟁자들이 각각 "
"항아리에 돌 한 두 개를 넣으려고 시도하는 동안 {Name}는 주저 없이 그들의 항아리에 진흙 몇 덩어리를 넣었습니다! 결국 우리 팀의 "
"항아리가 가장 가볍게 나왔지만 다른 항아리는 너무 무거웠습니다. 심사 위원은 내용물을 확인하기로 결정했습니다. 아. 우리의 항아리에는 "
"진주만 들어있었지만 상대방의 항아리를 쏟아 부었을 때 돌과 진흙이 나왔고 군중들은 웃음이 터졌습니다! 완전한 승리였습니다. 모든 팀은 "
"실격 당했고 우리는 부전승을 얻었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "5a1994bc-f52f-4e60-ab50-102894b03d15"
msgid ""
"{Name} bravely dove into the muddy water and started opening shells, "
"breaking {mf|his|her} nails in the process. {mf|He|She} put fistfuls of "
"pearls into {mf|his|her} jar as fast as {mf||s}he could, slipping in an "
"occasional pebble, pinch of sand, or dollop of mud when possible. Once time "
"was up, {mf|his|her} jar was the heaviest. A victory for us!"
msgstr ""
"{Name} 용감하게 물 속으로 뛰어 들어 조개 껍질을 까는 도중 손톱이 부러졌습니다. 열심히 한 줌의 진주를 모아 항아리에 채웠고 "
"재빨리 조약돌, 모래 뭉치, 진흙 덩어리를 넣었습니다. 시간이 다 되었을 때 {mf|그의|그녀의} 단지가 가장 무거운 것이었습니다. "
"승리는 우리 것이었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "c83b150f-121a-4d80-9392-0fdf6c23dcd2"
msgid ""
"Soon, we stood on the pedestal as the judges awarded our team the victory. "
"We were wet, muddy, and smelled of fish — but we grinned with joy all the "
"same."
msgstr ""
"곧 심판이 우리 팀에게 승리를 안겨 주어야 했기 때문에 우리는 단상에 서있었습니다. 우리는 젖었고, 진흙 투성이에 물고기 냄새가 "
"났습니다. 그러나 우리는 기쁨으로 웃었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/BookEvent_Triathlon/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "92a6c678-b1d1-48f9-a061-c7328ebf2725"
msgid ""
"We were wet, muddy, and smelled of fish — and all for nothing. The "
"triathlon's victor was {g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} team. What a disappointment!"
msgstr ""
"우리는 아무것도 얻은 것 없이 젖었고, 진흙 투성이에 물고기 냄새가 났습니다. 삼종 경기의 승리자는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} "
"팀이었습니다. 실망스럽군요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Chest_1_fail_String
msgctxt "94ceb117-b8f9-429e-a689-1e16d8fae1fc"
msgid "\"How unfortunate! Better luck next time.\""
msgstr "\"운이 안 따르는군! 다음엔 대박이 나겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Chest_1_win_String
msgctxt "d90bb634-353e-4497-95bd-bf639aa20f0c"
msgid ""
"\"The first lock is open! Congratulations! But can you open the second?\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 자물쇠가 열렸다! 축하해! 하지만 두 번째는 열 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Chest_2_fail_String
msgctxt "405e97a3-5b1b-4249-b62a-295966b0734a"
msgid ""
"\"Such misfortune! Don't feel bad — there aren't many can open these locks!\""
msgstr "\"안타깝다! 기분 나빠하지 마. 많은 이들이 이 자물쇠를 열 수 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Chest_2_win_String
msgctxt "7b7d54aa-c1d7-48d1-80fc-4c10b47af126"
msgid "\"The second lock's defeated! Only the hardest remains!\""
msgstr "\"두 번째 자물쇠가 열렸다! 가장 어려운 것만 남아 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Chest_3_fail_String
msgctxt "7e626ed0-2b4f-4f31-8d63-6bf0254fbc7d"
msgid "\"The last lock remains undefeated!\""
msgstr "\"마지막 자물쇠는 열어본 자가 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Chest_3_win_String
msgctxt "41fd1f5e-0a1f-4cbf-affb-10cae5b12608"
msgid ""
"\"I can't believe it! {mf|He|She} just popped the last lock — only one in a "
"million could do such a thing!\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없다! {mf|그|그녀}가 마지막 자물쇠를 땄군! 백만 분의 일의 확률이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Contest_start_String
msgctxt "2136ef08-051a-4a7b-9b11-fa2be6685b03"
msgid ""
"\"Let us begin! Your sleight of hand against our most sophisticated devices! "
"Who'll win?\""
msgstr "\"시작하자! 우리의 가장 정교한 장치와 너희의 빠른 손과의 결판을 내자! 누가 이길까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Salesdwarf_1_String
msgctxt "dad46f9d-5c14-4ff8-ad76-6576b9375342"
msgid "\"The best locks from Highhelm! Don't miss your chance to get one!\""
msgstr "\"하이헬름의 최고의 자물쇠! 동나기 전에 하나 사두라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Salesdwarf_2_String
msgctxt "168b9fce-f7d6-456f-bb9e-64761a712a03"
msgid "\"Dwarven locks! No thief can break 'em! Best prices!\""
msgstr "\"이건 드워프 자물쇠다! 도둑이 딸 수는 없어! 가격대 성능이 최고다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/Barks/Salesdwarf_String
msgctxt "4b9efcd6-9920-4590-971c-964ec566851b"
msgid "\"You can buy every lock seen in the contest, and many more!\""
msgstr "\"대회에서 본 모든 자물쇠와 다른 자물쇠도 구입할 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "bbb5ad6d-1b01-4740-a818-9d7262cd4ed5"
msgid "\"What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e8232e3f-8302-49a1-b5d4-5509fb230b0d"
msgid "[Pay 500 gold] \"I'll try to pick the locks.\""
msgstr "[500골드를 지불합니다] \"내가 자물쇠를 따 보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "054f8dcc-de21-466b-befe-b5611424adcf"
msgid "[Attack] \"Swindler! Hack! Scammer! Time to teach you a lesson!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"사기꾼! 젠장! 야바위꾼 같으니! 너에게 교훈을 가르쳐 줄 테다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "3a30df0d-54fc-40d9-a724-fcd771ea7215"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8cb7157b-5618-4977-800b-c568b53c6bfa"
msgid ""
"\"Test your finesse against the finest dwarven locksmithing! Crack the lock, "
"get the prize! Who'll challenge the best dwarven locks of the {g|Five Kings "
"Mountains}Five Kings Mountains{/g}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"가장 정밀한 드워프의 자물쇠 제조법에 기교를 시험해보라고! 자물쇠를 따고 상금을 받아! 누가 {g|Five Kings "
"Mountains}다섯 왕의 산맥{/g}의 가장 훌륭한 드워프 자물쇠에 도전할 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "e26c6a34-9a7f-4eaf-b306-04623b4f4664"
msgid ""
"\"Here comes the conqueror of locks, scourge of chests {mf|him|her}self! "
"Congratulations, it was a splendid victory!\""
msgstr "\"여기에 자물쇠의 정복자, 궤짝 파괴자 {mf|그|그녀}가 왔다! 축하한다. 멋진 승리였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "61d74527-8ec8-4d3d-813c-245c7a6fdd93"
msgid ""
"\"Do you know your way around a lockpick? Why not show off your skills? Here "
"we have three chests, bound with the finest dwarven locks straight from "
"{g|Highhelm}Highhelm{/g}! One attempt is five hundred gold. Open one lock, "
"you get some of your money back. Two locks, and you get back more than you "
"paid. Open all three, and you get the grand prize!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자물쇠 좀 따 봤어? 솜씨 좀 보여주지 않겠나? 여기에 {g|Highhelm}하이헬름{/g}의 가장 뛰어난 드워프가 만든 자물쇠로 "
"잠근 3개의 궤짝이 있다! 한 번의 시도 당 500골드야. 하나의 자물쇠를 열면 돈을 돌려 받게 되지. 두 개의 자물쇠를 열면 보상은 더 "
"많이 돌아와. 세 가지를 모두 열면 큰 상을 준다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "240ba8b2-bed1-4a7f-9549-1aadb8f89eef"
msgid ""
"\"Splendid! Come, come, the table's right here. I wish you the best of luck!"
"\""
msgstr "\"훌륭하군! 이리와. 탁자가 여기 있네. 행운을 빌어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b6688c99-12dd-4cb9-8d71-fe7d9a62bc5c"
msgid "\"Help! Guards!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘! 경비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/ContestHost/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "93b2d510-f9db-42e7-ac3c-ba0708c83ad1"
msgid "\"Have a nice day!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 하루 보내!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/DDActivate_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "472f7599-9f80-4ec3-95b5-8721c6b00047"
msgid "\"Lockpicking Contest\""
msgstr "\"자물쇠 따기 경연대회\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/DDActivate_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "ea01ab1f-2738-493e-996e-e393c5022c8b"
msgid "\"Entry Fee — 500 Gold\""
msgstr "\"입장료 - 500골드\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/dwarven_chest_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "5ed68fa8-a4fa-4c27-911c-3fcd0b503c95"
msgid "Locked Chest"
msgstr "잠긴 상자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/dwarven_chest_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "2db6089a-01d9-404d-b08c-a122e1c3cbaa"
msgid "Average Lock"
msgstr "평범한 잠금장치"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/gnome_chest_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "373320ad-7627-4943-91ac-226d4427a934"
msgid "Locked Chest"
msgstr "잠긴 상자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/gnome_chest_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "bf19f01e-5b1c-468d-b055-70da7fe8a02a"
msgid "Hard Lock"
msgstr "어려운 잠금장치"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/human_chest_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "efb921a5-bd61-4c04-90d4-d97e74c0cefa"
msgid "Locked Chest"
msgstr "잠긴 상자"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DisableDiveceContest/human_chest_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "1ba7ca3a-1774-40b8-a35c-5dc6a925b9f6"
msgid "Simple Lock"
msgstr "단순한 잠금장치"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "41e03346-6c4a-4702-8a92-4f1dd1107eb2"
msgid "\"Who might you recommend I meet here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 누구와 만나야 할지 추천해 줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6520520e-b44c-478f-9380-fbc99b28c6a9"
msgid "\"Do many Pitaxians worship Calistria?\""
msgstr "\"많은 피탁스인들이 칼리스트리아를 숭배하는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2e559be1-0d44-4f01-a9ba-70a9d8db26c0"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Answer_0007_Text_String
msgctxt "608212cf-387d-4e1f-845b-4b9ba0c7e272"
msgid "\"I've heard you're not exactly happy with Irovetti's reign.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티의 통치에 불행하다면서...?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "3b36a8ec-3c9a-4df5-9c75-d5318f9c730f"
msgid "[Attack] \"I hate your cult. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네 숭배가 싫다. 죽어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "ba7a6594-3b6c-4585-8c00-d846122c10c6"
msgid ""
"\"I myself give prayer to Calistria. Please, might I have your blessing?\""
msgstr "\"칼리스트리아께 기도를 올립니다. 축복을 받을 수 있을까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "ab506a91-484b-4f6b-8830-96bad3fec18f"
msgid "\"The gods don't deserve our veneration.\""
msgstr "\"신들은 우리의 존경을 받을 가치가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "5d67e3bd-6091-4075-bb9b-7cea7df46895"
msgid ""
"\"Calistria is the goddess of revenge... I'm sure many mention Irovetti in "
"their prayers to her, and probably not with the kindest words?\""
msgstr ""
"\"칼리스트리아는 복수의 여신이다... 나는 그녀에 대한 기도에서 이로베티에 대한 언급이 많았다고 확신한다. 아마 좋은 말은 아니었을테지?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f569e823-e6c4-4477-8f98-d7bda26dd7b9"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, a new face at the celebration! I'm pleased to meet you. Drey Yarnes, "
"High Priest of {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}, at your disposal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 축하연의 새로운 얼굴이군! 만나게되어 기쁘다. 나는 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}의 고위 사제 드레이 얀스다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "12e7a240-33be-410b-bd26-38b8df1e12fe"
msgid "\"Are you enjoying the festival?\""
msgstr "\"축제는 즐기고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "671951e3-c18a-47d9-bc60-f469ecddcd23"
msgid ""
"\"There are many prominent people here, as usual. My first recommendation "
"would be Maestro {d|Annamede}Annamede{/d}. Many would give their lives to "
"exchange words with her. She's {g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} best singer — and the "
"finest of its women!\""
msgstr ""
"\"평소와 같이 유명한 사람들이 많다. 나의 첫 번째 추천은 마에스트로 {d|Annamede}안나미데{/d}이다. 많은 사람들이 자신의 "
"목숨을 걸고 그녀와 말을 섞으려 하지. 그녀는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 최고의 가수이자 가장 아름다운 여성이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8a4bd3ec-549c-4503-9106-fa57f037fd05"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! She's been the patron goddess of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} since its "
"founding. The goddess likes our joyful town — and its citizens love her in "
"return. If ever you visit Pitax, you would surely enjoy the proud spikes of "
"her cathedral — it's the most beautiful building in the city!\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론! 그녀는 창립 이래 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 수호 여신이셨다. 여신께서는 우리의 즐거운 도시를 좋아하며, 시민들은 "
"보답으로 그녀를 사랑한다. 혹시라도 피탁스를 방문하게 된다면, 대성당의 날카로운 장식을 구경해 봐라. 도시에서 가장 아름다운 건물이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "7897bd14-a4f1-4cc3-9ff1-91b79c30cede"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest looks away.{/n} \"Oh, no, I've no issue with his reign. He's a "
"generous donor, and the celebrations he hosts are beyond praise.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}성직자는 시선을 돌립니다.{/n} \"아니. 나는 그의 통치에 아무런 불만도 없다. 그는 관대한 기부자이며, 그가 여는 축하연은 "
"칭찬이 모자를 정도야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "38734129-8227-4e2a-94fe-5f4415394652"
msgid "\"May the grace of the goddess always be with you!\""
msgstr "\"여신의 은혜가 항상 너와 함께 하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "83a0ee1c-d03b-408b-9a20-0f1531864c99"
msgid ""
"\"The king himself, though... His exorbitant pride is irritating. "
"{g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} dislikes those who would place themselves above "
"the gods — and I wouldn't be surprised if she teaches him a lesson, sooner "
"or later. That I could deal with, though. There's something else that I find "
"harder and harder to tolerate.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왕의 성격 문제겠지만, 그래도... 그의 엄청난 자존심은 짜증이 날 지경이야. {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}께서는 신을 "
"기만하는 자를 싫어하시지. 그녀가 조만간 그에게 교훈을 가르쳐 준다 해도 놀라지 않을 것이야. 그래도 여전히 참을만 하지만... 내가 "
"용납하기가 더 어려워지는 뭔가가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "9d7d1bc7-cd6f-4bed-89b6-cf7e95d34b61"
msgid ""
"\"You see, the goddess patronizes bodily love... but only that given "
"voluntarily. It is sometimes difficult for me to protect our young priests "
"and priestesses from his... unsolicited attentions. I fear to imagine how "
"hard it must be for our beautiful {d|Annamede}Annamede{/d}, or what "
"{d|Atalia}Atalia Gitaren{/d} must deal with. The king is said to often "
"mistake the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} for his personal harem.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알다시피, 여신은 육체적 사랑을 허락하시지만... 그것은 오직 자발적인 경우에 한하지. 때로는 어린 사제와 여사제들을 그의... "
"피하고 싶은 관심으로부터 보호하기가 어렵다. 아름다운 {d|Annamede}안나미데{/d}나 {d|Atalia}아탈리아 지타렌{/d}은 "
"너무나 힘들 거야. 왕은 종종 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}를 그의 개인 하렘으로 착각한다는 비판을 듣는다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "d99af245-fe50-4820-bf22-0bc98e35ebf2"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest ceremoniously places his hand on your head.{/n} \"May our "
"{g|Calistria}lady{/g} help you, if she's so inclined!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제사장은 의식을 위해 손을 머리에 올립니다.{/n} \"이것이 정녕 그분이 뜻이라면야. {g|Calistria}여신{/g}께서 너를 "
"도우시기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "0c7aa47a-a7b1-45b7-8b3f-f77b69840c53"
msgid ""
"\"Is that so? Well, I won't try to convert you. In the end, it's only you "
"who'll suffer for your disbelief, not the gods.\""
msgstr "\"그런가? 글쎄 나는 너를 개종시키지 않을 거야. 결국 불신앙으로 고통받을 사람은, 신이 아니라 너일테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "49519c12-3bd2-40d3-96ad-af9182f59b15"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia smiles at the cleric.{/n} \"Praised be the {g|Calistria}Savored "
"Sting{/g}!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 성직자에게 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"{g|Calistria}가시 돋은 장미{/g}에게 축복을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "10503ced-ad10-4a71-819b-aa24f89cc1e6"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar bares his fangs in a grin.{/n} \"Hail the {g|Calistria}"
"Unquenchable Fire{/g}!\""
msgstr "{n}레곤가르는 송곳니를 드러내며 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"{g|Calistria}불 같은 여자{/g}를 실컷 찬양하라지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "4657b6fc-cde8-441d-bfaa-8c22b4f59f56"
msgid "\"May our {g|Calistria}Lady's{/g} charity never leave us.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Calistria}여신님{/g}의 축복이 결코 우리를 떠나지 않길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "0669dda0-9602-40aa-a049-8cf52c9ec214"
msgid "{n}Harrim mumbles,{/n} \"Vanity... Futility... Vexation of spirit...\""
msgstr "{n}하림이 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"허영심에... 무능하고... 짜증나는 귀신이군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DreyYarnes/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "8110b7ba-f1cf-4573-b9ef-bb2b64d4f8ab"
msgid ""
"\"You are well versed in matters both spiritual and political. Of course, it "
"is not my place to say what people pray to my {g|Calistria}Lady{/g} for... "
"but you're right that many would wish for revenge upon him. To be honest, "
"our temple has only benefited from his rise to power — Irovetti isn't stingy "
"with his donations, and the celebrations he holds are beyond all praise.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 종교적이고 정치적인 문제에 정통하군. 사람들이 {g|Calistria}여신님{/g}에게 기도하는 것을 내가 뭐라 할 수 "
"없어... 하지만 사람들이 그에게 천벌을 받게 하길 기도한다는 네 말은 맞아. 솔직히 말해서 우리 사원은 그의 권력의 상승으로 이익을 "
"얻었다. 이로베티는 기부금에 인색하지 않고 그가 여는 축하연은 칭찬을 초월해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "dcc9b886-81ad-4ebe-bbdb-f62c88df7938"
msgid "[Attack] \"You shouldn't have crossed me.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 내 믿음을 저버려서는 안됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "17519dc3-9007-48d5-84e6-28c03d5fc964"
msgid "\"Forgive me. It was an accident.\""
msgstr "\"용서해. 사고였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2d9fe662-0979-4036-b2c7-8b5de557578c"
msgid "[Give the bully 500 gold] \"Here. For the damage.\""
msgstr "[깡패에게 500골드를 줍니다] \"여기. 손해배상금이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "0c9717dd-0fda-4d8a-b2af-ff3230f99535"
msgid ""
"\"Best not anger me. I've put away more people and monsters than you have "
"bottles over the course of your waste of a life. Get out of here while you "
"still can.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나를 괴롭히지 마라. 네가 일생을 허비하며 비운 병들보다 더 많은 사람과 괴물의 인생을 끝내버렸어. 두 발로 걸을 수 있는 동안 "
"꺼져라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "d9d74422-6c36-4739-8867-9ec007723374"
msgid "[Knock the bully out with a stealthy blow]"
msgstr "[몰래 한 방 먹여 깡패를 기절시킵니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "0ed0003a-125a-425e-bedf-8d1e2b341f7e"
msgid ""
"\"Why, is that Annamede Belavarah herself over there? And it looks like "
"she's calling you!\""
msgstr "\"뭐야, 저거 안나미데 빌라바라 아냐? 그녀가 너를 부르고 있는 것 같은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "0e17aece-ad05-44b1-bbca-e97a7459ba4b"
msgid "\"How did you do it?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그걸 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "6f773ea5-a1d2-4f62-8a17-226d3afa47c8"
msgid "\"Hey! I could've handled him myself!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 나 혼자서 처리할 수 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "06e9ca79-51af-4f5c-9759-cf0a5d33accf"
msgid "\"Thank you, Tristian.\""
msgstr "\"고마워. 트리스티안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "960bcd3f-2e28-408c-a69d-9e2ecc882c8a"
msgid "[Kiss Tristian on the cheek] \"My protector!\""
msgstr "[트리스티안의 뺨에 입맞춥니다] \"너는 나의 보호자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "77fa966a-9f63-46b0-be13-a6d2f94335f0"
msgid ""
"{n}A young man staggers toward you, his expensive doublet wet with wine. As "
"he passes, he brushes shoulders with you and starts yelling, his breath rank "
"with alcohol.{/n} \"Watch yourself! Who do you think you are, you pig?! You "
"tramped on my foot and ruined my doublet, hic! I'm gonna... I demand "
"satisfaction!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}포도주에 젖은 비싼 더블릿을 입은 한 청년이 당신쪽으로 비틀거립니다. 그가 지나갈 때 어깨를 부딪히고는 고함 소리를 내는데 입에서 "
"술냄세가 납니다.{/n} \"조심해! 지금 뭐하는 거야. 이 새끼야? 너 내 발을 밟고 내 옷을 더렵혔겠다! 끅! 배상해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "bd7f3729-927b-4c97-88a9-1edf487b092c"
msgid "\"Uh... Help! Murderrr!\""
msgstr "\"어... 도와줘요. 살인자다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "08c4bdc6-942d-4623-ad11-0586e2deb173"
msgid ""
"\"What? Forgive you? Hic! You bump me, ruin my doublet, and I'm supposed to "
"just forgive you? Who's gonna clean this, huh? It's expensive! And you "
"slopped wine all over it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라구? 용서해 달라고? 끅! 너는 나한테 부딪쳐 놓고 내 옷을 망쳐 놓고 용서해 줄거라고 생각했냐? 누가 이걸 닦을거야. 응? 이거 "
"비싼 거야! 그리고 포도주도 다 흘렸잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "810ce875-0eb2-47f2-9375-20e3cd2430e0"
msgid ""
"\"Well, then, all right. Fine! You got off easy, though!\" {n}The young man "
"takes the money and leaves.{/n}"
msgstr "\"흠. 좋아. 됐어! 저리 꺼져!\" {n}젊은 남자가 돈을 받고 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "d542f978-359c-44ea-bc95-8f7fed1a404b"
msgid ""
"\"I... Uh... Sorry, sorry. Think I — hic! — confused you for someone else... "
"Sorry. My mistake. These things happen...\" {n}Mumbling apologies, the bully "
"disappears.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 어... 미안. 미안. 내가. 끅! 다른 사람하고 착각했군... 미안. 내 실수. 그럴 수도 있지...\" {n}중얼 "
"거리는 사과와 함께 깡패가 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "6b4cdf71-ecab-488d-965d-39c3796b4ad3"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, you're threatening me? Ha ha! I'm... I'll... Single-handed, too! "
"Come on, then, draw your weapon! I... I d-demand satisf- hic!\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 나를 위협하고 있어? 하하! 나... 나는... 한손으로도 너를! 덤벼. 무기를 뽑아라! 나는 배상을... 끅!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "8678ff55-e18f-4660-b2bf-236bfb9e2995"
msgid ""
"{n}No one notices as you drive a swift blow to the bully's solar plexus. It "
"simply seems as though he swayed and leaned on you, after which you "
"graciously helped him step away to lie down in the shade.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 신속한 타격으로 깡패는 충격을 받았지만 아무도 알아 채지 못합니다. 그는 마치 당신에게 흔들려 몸을 기울인 것처럼 보였고 그 "
"후 당신은 그를 그늘진 곳에 친절하게 눕혔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "163f4564-01f9-44df-a53e-458451c8fd33"
msgid ""
"{n}After a swift blow to the solar plexus, the drunkard falls to the ground —"
" but you immediately hear someone scream from behind you, calling for the "
"guards.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 신속한 타격으로 깡패는 충격을 받아 바닥에 쓰러집니다. 당신은 갑자기 누군가가 소리치며 경비를 부르는 소리를 듣습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "60384690-8380-4751-9fd5-0d87eca4b560"
msgid ""
"\"What? Really? Where? Oh... how do I look? Quickly, now! I'm all right? "
"Phew, good. Annamede, my joy! I'll be right there!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라구? 정말? 어디서? 오. 내가 어떻게 보여? 빨리 말해봐! 나 괜찮아? 휴. 좋았어. 내 사랑 안나미데! 바로 거기에 갈 거야!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "399b867b-3ee8-4723-b8de-d976453d1873"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you smooth talk me, hic! I... You ruined my doublet! You jerk!\""
msgstr "\"너 나한테 친한 척 말 걸지 마. 끅! 너... 내 옷을 망쳤어! 버릇 없는 자식!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "669cc582-5a09-4372-85a4-0653222e5076"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian clears his throat, attracting the drunkard's attention.{/n} \"You"
"'ve made a mistake. Move along.\" {n}You barely see the face of the priest "
"behind the edge of his hood, but you glimpse that the corners of his mouth "
"have tensed up.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 목을 가다듬고 술주정뱅이의 관심을 끌었습니다.{/n} \"너는 실수했다. 갈길 가라.\" {n}그의 후드 뒤에서 사제의 "
"얼굴은 보이지 않았지만 입꼬리 주위가 긴장되어 있음을 엿볼 수 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "2b677007-0153-44d3-a576-eb06c73f5b0e"
msgid ""
"\"Wha-a-at? Who the hell are...\" {n}The drunkard focuses his eyes on the "
"priest's face, and then seems to sober up considerably.{/n} \"Oh... S-"
"Sorry... My mistake...\" {n}Turning around, he stumbles away quite "
"quickly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐야? 너 대체 누구야?\" {n}술주정뱅이는 그의 눈을 사제의 얼굴에 집중했고 그 다음에는 술이 상당히 깬 것 같습니다.{/n} "
"\"오... 미안... 내 실수야...\" {n}뒤 돌아서 그는 아주 빨리 비틀거리며 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "17c3d04b-bda0-4620-b8c9-324e750a580d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian gives you a smile.{/n} \"It's just a trifle compared to what "
"you've done for me.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 당신에게 웃음을 건넵니다.{/n} \"네가 나한테 해 준 일에 비하면 그냥 사소한 일이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "85edc7e8-0b95-485a-8c98-0988b0891f04"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian puts his arm around your waist.{/n} \"I'm trying to be. I won't "
"let anything bad happen to you at the festival.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 당신의 허리를 팔로 감싸 안습니다.{/n} \"나는 노력하고 있어. 나는 축제에서 네게 어떤 나쁜 일도 일어나도록 "
"내버려 두지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "9ded61e2-659b-4564-b946-87e381148c65"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian pretends to be very serious.{/n} \"Don't you know? I have very "
"expressive eyes.\" {n}The priest squints his blind eyes and turns the corner "
"of his mouth in a smirk.{/n} \"Seriously, {name}, I'm still a deva. I know "
"how to make a point when I have to.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 매우 진지한 척합니다.{/n} \"너 몰랐어? 내 눈은 아주 표현력이 풍부하지.\" {n}사제는 멀어버린 눈을 가늘게 "
"뜨고 보았고 그의 입가를 능글 맞은 웃음으로 바꿉니다.{/n} \"진짜야. {name}. 나는 아직도 deva야. 나는 한다면 하는 "
"사람이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/DrunkBully/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "8f2d7096-a502-49df-b9d6-a377454f899e"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"No doubt. I just didn't want to see you "
"get your hands dirty on this drunkard.\""
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 고개를 숙입니다.{/n} \"의심하지 마. 나는 그저 네가 술주정뱅이 때문에 손을 더럽히지 않았으면 했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "e2c562e5-5f85-4b44-803a-884811a0779f"
msgid "[Approach the two openly]"
msgstr "[두 사람에게 다가가 말을 겁니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "db3320a5-0f7a-4d17-b8cc-cce8c1efbe80"
msgid "[Eavesdrop from a distance]"
msgstr "[거리를 두고 엿듣습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "fb32e48c-9e74-4a40-8c9d-a1e596f96bef"
msgid "[Creep closer to listen to what they're saying]"
msgstr "[그들이 말하는 것을 듣기 위해 살금살금 다가갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "3132419c-a996-4e44-909a-b8eedb8de94a"
msgid "[Ignore the two men]"
msgstr "[두 사람을 무시합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "aeadfcf4-c3a9-41c0-8a17-034643e20745"
msgid ""
"\"I've helped a lot of people, but most have the decency to introduce "
"themselves to me first.\""
msgstr "\"나는 많은 사람들을 도왔지만 처음에는 내 자신을 소개하는 예의 바른 사람이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "e5c0deb9-264f-4443-b5ae-d7e7507c7235"
msgid "\"Wait, what am I doing now?\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 내가 지금 여기서 뭐하고 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "abb53b8d-2cb4-4b8a-8c67-3affc811ec05"
msgid "\"Who was that you were talking to?\""
msgstr "\"누구에게 말하던 거였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "f7d1e839-f013-48fe-b7cc-3373d392ad25"
msgid "\"What seems to be the problem?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 문제가 있는것 같아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "61af7d01-8204-4036-832d-a9758575f035"
msgid "\"I don't have time for this.\""
msgstr "\"나는 시간이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "6ca7d2f2-900e-4453-8001-75627838958a"
msgid "\"I gather you know each other pretty well?\""
msgstr "\"둘이 서로 잘 아는 사이라지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "e00b57de-707e-480d-8b6a-88c8ddd31cef"
msgid "\"Find somebody else to do the job.\""
msgstr "\"그 일을 할 다른 사람을 찾아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "872f885c-acc1-4bfe-bed3-13cb01eea1ec"
msgid "\"Before I accept, I have questions.\""
msgstr "\"동의하기 전에 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "d454a55c-991c-4eb5-a217-d1863f43f35e"
msgid "\"I am always ready to thwart river pirates. I accept.\""
msgstr "\"나는 언제나 강가 해적을 막을 준비가 되어 있다. 제안을 받아들이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "52b0b5cc-6ca3-43a8-8f7a-a9820598dfe5"
msgid "\"What did you need from me again?\""
msgstr "\"원하는 게 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "f03956dd-821c-4ed1-a69e-50ee4e26bdef"
msgid "\"How many pirates are out there?\""
msgstr "\"얼마나 많은 해적들이 밖에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "544d0a99-4588-41fe-8da3-1dc6ed5584f2"
msgid "\"Why does Talwyn disapprove of this plan?\""
msgstr "\"왜 탈윈이 이 계획을 부인하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "ebfbfa30-9e76-4e4a-b792-485bbaa549a5"
msgid "\"Why hasn't the king acted against the pirates?\""
msgstr "\"왜 왕이 해적들을 상대로 조치를 취하지 않았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "91a50dc4-7d27-4d2b-87dc-fb4cd1bfab3e"
msgid "\"Is there a reward?\""
msgstr "\"보상이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "8ec53dfc-03df-4363-b8e9-9198f47a1a34"
msgid "\"I know enough to make my choice.\""
msgstr "\"정보는 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "1c2fe3c1-dc39-4852-823c-090b2674625d"
msgid "\"I've decided to help you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 돕기로 결심했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "3029a169-eece-4671-b26e-3b93a24c351d"
msgid "\"Between a mortal and an angel, for example?\""
msgstr "\"필멸자와 천사 사이라는 건가. 예를 들면?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "7871c3b1-4ffc-4b47-a79f-e5de8cc3a056"
msgid "\"Shush! Don't interrupt!\""
msgstr "\"쉿! 방해하지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "065e805b-46b2-464d-9f47-f2694b8d38fa"
msgid ""
"{n}Amid the tournament's frivolity, you notice that two men nearby are "
"having a heated but hushed discussion. One wears flashy clothing fit for an "
"entertainer, whereas the other wears the steel armor and red cloak of "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} guard. It's difficult to hear what they're saying.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}시끄러운 토너먼트의 중간에서 근처에 두 사람이 격렬하지만 열띤 토론을 하고 있음을 알게 되었습니다. 하나는 연예인에게 맞는 화려한 "
"옷을 입는 반면 다른 하나는 강철 갑옷과 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 근위대의 빨간색 망토를 입었습니다. 그들이 하는 말을 듣기가 "
"어렵습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "1a96538e-1767-4044-acfb-7289e6e27852"
msgid ""
"{n}The two huddle near one another as they speak, and due to the ambient "
"laughter and music, you can only overhear part of the conversation.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}두 사람은 이야기할 때 서로 가까이 모였고 주변의 웃음과 음악으로 인해 대화의 일부만 엿들을 수 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : TalwynHalmarion
msgctxt "8f94e488-4e65-4547-9b68-5a348b7f2ef8"
msgid ""
"{n}The guard sternly chides the entertainer.{/n} \"...up to, Eimar, but I "
"know that look. You're planning something...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}근위대원은 연예인을 엄하게 꾸짖습니다.{/n} \"...달려 있어. 이마르. 하지만 나는 알아. 너 뭔가 계획하고 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f385a613-18b0-4676-a86a-81528f4a1058"
msgid ""
"{n}Eimar interjects, motioning to the festival.{/n} \"...Talwyn. This "
"celebration? It's just... we had planned for, but... can we really stand by?"
"\" {n}He begins to raise his hand and strike a pose as if preparing to make "
"a bold declaration.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르는 축제에 몸짓하면서 끼어듭니다.{/n} \"...라고. 탈윈. 이 축하연? 여기는 그저... 우리가 계획했었지만 우리가 "
"정말로 할 수 있겠어?\" {n}그는 대담한 말을 하려는 것처럼 손을 들고 포즈를 취하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : TalwynHalmarion
msgctxt "9867c174-1adb-42ae-8758-6434c056625a"
msgid ""
"{n}The guard's hand intercepts Eimar's arm, firmly preventing the "
"entertainer from making a scene.{/n} \"...I've seen it with my own eyes, and "
"it... especially like you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}근위대원의 손은 이마르의 팔을 잡고 연예인이 소란을 피우지 못하게 막습니다.{/n} \"...나는 내 눈으로 그것을 보았어. "
"그건... 너와 같은 사람들 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "50868357-0037-4d31-beed-6615b7fcfce2"
msgid ""
"{n}Eimar says a few comforting words before removing Talwyn's hand from his "
"arm.{/n} \"...{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} needs now is action, and I intend to act.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르는 탈윈의 손을 치우기 전에 몇 가지 위로가 되는 말을 합니다.{/n} \"... {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}가 지금 필요한 "
"것은 행동이고 나는 행동하려고 하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "4f54276c-1831-4f3c-b6bc-12161756b0a7"
msgid ""
"{n}Although the two huddle near one another, their voices only occasionally "
"rising above the ambient laughter and music, you're able to overhear the "
"rest of their conversation.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}두 사람은 이야기할 때 서로 가까이 모였고 희미한 웃음과 음악으로 인해 언성이 높아지는 부분만 엿들을 수 있었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : TalwynHalmarion
msgctxt "dfd4a0a1-4744-46ba-8b05-398f4804086e"
msgid ""
"{n}The guard sternly chides the entertainer.{/n} \"I don't know quite what "
"you're up to, Eimar, but I know that look. You're planning something — "
"something dangerous. This isn't the time; you know he's become harsher about-"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}근위대원은 연예인을 엄하게 꾸짖습니다.{/n} \"...달려 있어. 이마르. 하지만 나는 알아. 너 뭔가 계획하고 있지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "fbdbdc76-81df-48fa-988c-d7be5ebb4df8"
msgid ""
"\"Look around you, Talwyn.\" {n}Eimar interjects.{/n} \"This celebration? "
"It's just more blood and sport to cover for the ongoing troubles, and we've "
"both helped shepherd it along. This isn't the future we had planned for, but "
"it's the one the fates have dealt. Can we really stand by?\" {n}He begins to "
"raise his hand and strike a pose as if preparing to make a bold "
"declaration.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"주위를 둘러봐. 탈윈.\"{n}이마르는 끼어듭니다.{/n} \"이 축하연? 여기는 그저... 우리가 계획했었지만 우리가 정말로 할 수 "
"있겠어?\" {n}그는 대담한 말을 하려는 것처럼 손을 들고 포즈를 취하기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : TalwynHalmarion
msgctxt "b3b0ef6e-9a12-4a97-8e15-085a7376bece"
msgid ""
"{n}The guard's hand intercepts Eimar's arm, firmly preventing the "
"entertainer from making a scene.{/n} \"You know how harsh justice is these "
"days. I've seen it with my own eyes, and it would crush me to see noble "
"intentions harming good people, especially like you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}경비의 손은 이마르의 팔을 잡고 연예인이 소란을 피우지 못하게 막습니다.{/n} \"나는 내 눈으로 그것을 보았어. 그건 고귀한 "
"의도를 위해 좋은 사람을 해치려 하지. 너와 같이 좋은 사람들 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "96f9c3d6-4233-4d9d-b527-f65fa3ad4a97"
msgid ""
"\"I appreciate those feelings. I do.\" {n}Eimar gently removes Talwyn's hand "
"from his arm.{/n} \"But what {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} needs now is action, and I "
"intend to act.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 감정은 고맙게 생각해. 진심이야.\" {n}이마르는 탈윈의 손을 팔에서 부드럽게 떼어냅니다.{/n} \"하지만 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}가 지금 필요한 것은 행동이고 나는 행동하려고 하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "3cd1b917-3868-42ba-922e-602e9a9006a5"
msgid ""
"{n}The entertainer looks up, spots you, and smiles as Talwyn frowns and "
"sadly walks away.{/n} \"It's a rare day that life emulates screenplays, Your "
"Highness. Could it be that heroes have arrived in the people's time of need?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}연예인은 고개를 들어 당신을 발견하고는 웃음을 짓자 탈윈이 눈살을 찌푸리고 슬프게 걸어 나갑니다.{/n} \"인생은 각본처럼 흐르는 "
"일은 드물지. 사람들이 필요로 할 때 시간에 맞춰 영웅이 도착한다는 것이 가능할까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "826d2e09-e16a-4555-bd01-5b19b862601c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, heroism! That's exactly what we do! See that symbol on his clothing? "
"That marks him as a member of the Red Crescent Theater in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}"
". A fellow artist!\" {n}She eagerly extracts her journal.{/n} \"Imagine the "
"stories we could write together!\""
msgstr ""
"\"영웅 놀이라! 그게 우리가하는 일이야. 그의 옷에 그려진 상징이 보여? 그가 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 붉은 초승달 극장의 "
"회원임을 나타내는 표시지. 동료 예술가라는 거야!\" {n}그녀는 열심히 저널을 찾습니다.{/n} \"우리가 함께 쓸 수 있는 이야기를 "
"상상해보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "dfaae1e6-c047-4594-897b-3fe234a9564e"
msgid ""
"{n}The entertainer hastily bows. {/n}\"Ah, my manners! I am Eimar Deschamps, "
"a playwright and stage artist attracted here by King Irovetti's call for "
"theatrical talent. I am also a student of local legends, which is how I "
"recognized you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}연예인은 급하게 절합니다.{/n} \"아. 예절을 차려야지! 나는 이마르 데샹. 이로베티이 연극에 재능있는 자를 불러 왔지만 여기에 "
"흥미를 느낀 극작가이자 무대 예술가이지. 나는 또한 내가 지역의 전설을 연구하는 학생이라 너를 알아봤어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "509eacb7-7688-49a9-90fa-04e279d396a6"
msgid ""
"\"That was sergeant of the guard Talwyn Halmarion.\" {n}Eimar glances "
"briefly in the direction that Talwyn disappeared.{/n} \"He's the finest "
"guardsman I've had the pleasure to meet. That might not seem impressive in "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, but you won't find anyone else with the same love for "
"the country and its people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 근위대 상사 탈윈 할마리온이었어.\" {n}이마르는 탈윈이 사라진 방향으로 잠시 눈짓을 보냅니다.{/n} \"그는 내가 만났던 "
"근위대 중에 최고의 실력을 가진 자야. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서는 두각을 나타낼지 모르지만 너는 국가와 국민에 대한 사랑이 "
"그렇게 깊은 사람을 찾지 못할 걸.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "f3ebf7ef-f16e-43ac-85cf-7d2290bd67a4"
msgid ""
"\"He is my husband, yes, so perhaps I am biased. He's quite protective, and "
"in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} that means keeping your head down and not speaking ill "
"of the king. I can't afford to stay silent, though, and I'd appreciate your "
"help.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 내 남편이야. 그래. 아마도 내 편견일지도 몰라. 그는 통제력이 강한 사람이라 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 있는 사람은 왕 "
"앞에서 머리를 조아리고 왕의 험담을 하면 안돼. 나는 입이 무거운 사람이 아니기도 하고 네 도움이 고맙기도 해서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "eef27c68-f5fd-4483-967e-ab54d8f947d8"
msgid ""
"{n}Eimar smiles and remarks,{/n} \"We've known each other for several years, "
"ever since I immigrated here from {g|Taldor}Taldor{/g}. Even so, he's a "
"member of the guard and wouldn't approve of my plans to help "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} people. That's where you enter the scene.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르는 웃으며 말합니다.{/n} \"내가 {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}에서 여기로 이민 온 이래 우리는 몇 년 동안 서로를 알고 "
"지냈다. 그럼에도 불구하고 그는 경비대라서 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 사람을 도울 계획을 허락하지 않았지. 그 순간 네가 온 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "bd3a06be-f49c-4414-84bb-fad7a2b3db78"
msgid ""
"\"I first arrived here five years ago, answering King Irovetti's call for "
"artists and actors to make {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} a new crucible for the arts. "
"Admittedly, the king dedicated plenty of money to building new theaters and "
"schools. Art only thrives, though, when there are visitors and patrons to "
"pay for it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이로베티 왕이 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 예술혼을 불태우기 위한 장소로 만드려 예술가와 배우를 찾아 5년 전에 처음 여기에 "
"도착했어. 틀림없이 왕은 새로운 극장과 학교를 짓는데 많은 돈을 헌납했지. 예술은 방문객과 후원자가 지불할 때 번성해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "8654533a-1ec8-436b-9dad-6cf190197418"
msgid ""
"\"Now, when the king's soldiers cannot or will not vanquish the villains, "
"what happens in the stories?\" {n}He winks and gestures knowingly.{/n} \"That"
"'s right — heroes step in. Numerous victims have told me of the attacks, and "
"I have pieced together the approximate location of the pirates' camp. If you "
"can ambush and defeat them, traffic will flow, commerce will thrive, and "
"you'll command the adoration of the boatmen, dockworkers, artists, and more. "
"Naturally, I'm prepared to write a play dramatizing your exploits. What do "
"you say?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제, 왕의 병사들이 악당들을 정복 할 수 없거나 하지 않는다면, 이야기에서 어떤 일이 일어날까?\" {n}그는 짐작한다는 윙크와 "
"몸짓을 보냅니다.{/n} \"맞아. 영웅들이 들어서지. 많은 희생자들이 공격에 대해 대화를 나눴고, 해적 야영지의 대략적인 위치를 예상해 "
"보았어. 네가 매복해서 그들을 물리칠 수 있다면 교통이 흐르고 상거래는 번성하게 되어 너는 선원, 항만 노동자, 예술가의 숭배의 대상이 "
"될 거야. 나는 네 영웅담을 만들어 이득을 얻고. 어떻게 생각해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "2a165743-e1f2-43e2-953b-67d6c891ba89"
msgid ""
"\"The wisest protagonist always has questions. What would you like to know?\""
msgstr "\"가장 현명한 주인공은 항상 질문이 있지. 무엇을 알고 싶지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "a539fd8a-2969-46ed-9f60-609f5017011f"
msgid "\"Ah, consider this a little preview. Good hunting!\""
msgstr "\"아. 조금 생각해 봐. 사냥 잘하길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "969a8d2e-cd00-4d1e-8ab4-644a799a7b87"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal unrolls the script and reads a few dozen lines. She winces and "
"grimaces at several points before throwing the parchment to you. {/n}\"Utter "
"drivel. This man is an amateur, and his work is affront to art.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 두루마리를 펼치고 몇 줄을 읽습니다. 그녀는 당신에게 양피지를 던지기 전에 얼굴을 찡그립니다.{/n} \"쓸데없는 말만 "
"늘어놓았군. 이 남자는 아마추어이고 그의 작품은 예술에 대한 모욕이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "661deba0-3647-4946-be35-d6cfa7bfe438"
msgid ""
"{n}Eimar's shoulders slump.{/n} \"I suspect there may be nobody else who can "
"do the job. I hope you reconsider.\""
msgstr "{n}이마르의 어깨가 축 쳐졌습니다.{/n} \"그 일을 할 수 있는 사람은 네가 적임자야. 다시 생각해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "d260f4c5-3894-4802-9b64-ec132fcd3ccb"
msgid "\"What will it be?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "361b9d47-ee45-43a5-aa25-7ce155d1609c"
msgid ""
"\"It varies by the report. The camp could have a few dozen, so you might try "
"to take them by surprise.\""
msgstr "\"보고서에 따라 달라. 야영지는 수 십 개가 될 수 있고, 때문에 그들을 기습해야 할거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "7184fd08-38a1-431b-8938-96939436a9b2"
msgid ""
"\"That's... complicated.\" {n}Eimar sighs.{/n} \"Dispatching the pirates "
"would be a service to {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, yet it would circumvent the king's "
"authority. That makes him look incompetent, and King Irovetti has quite the "
"temper. Anyone making him look bad is at risk, and that includes me. I'm "
"putting Talwyn in a difficult position. If he reports me, I end up "
"imprisoned, no doubt. If he doesn't, his career is at risk. If you succeed, "
"though? Maybe everyone wins.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그게... 복잡해.\" {n}이마르는 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"해적을 죽이는 것은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에게 도움이 "
"될지도 모르지만, 왕의 권위를 침범하는 것이 될 수도 있어. 그로 인해 그는 무능해 보일 거고, 그리고 이로베티 왕은 성질이 난폭해. "
"그의 이미지를 깍는 사람은 위험에 처해지고 나는 그 중에 한 사람이지. 탈윈은 나 때문에 어려운 상황에 처할 것이다. 그가 나를 보고하면 "
"나는 당연히 투옥될 거야. 그가 하지 않는다면 그의 경력은 위험에 처하게 되고. 그래도 네가 성공하면? 어쩌면 모든 사람들이 이길지도 "
"몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "e9aa535d-1c7a-4de3-b5c7-a9eae963fc0f"
msgid ""
"\"That's unclear. It might be a lack of soldiers, or perhaps it's a lack of "
"will. Leaving the pirates alone might also undercut political or economic "
"enemies in some way, but at what cost?\""
msgstr ""
"\"불확실해. 병사가 부족하거나 의지가 부족할 수도 있어. 해적들을 가만히 두는 걸로 정치 또는 경제적 적들을 어느 정도 약화시킬 수도 "
"있겠지. 하지만 어떤 손해를 감수해야하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "8b2a31e3-3fab-4501-bd2a-4df4459a3eb8"
msgid ""
"{n}Eimar laughs nervously.{/n} \"The term 'starving artist' was fairly "
"common in {g|Taldor}Taldor{/g}. Perhaps you haven't heard it before? I do "
"not have much wealth, but I can help you win the people's adoration. I also "
"understand that among the theater's props are a few enchanted items of "
"actual value, so perhaps I can entice you with those?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르는 불안하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"'굶주린 예술가'라는 용어는 {g|Taldor}탈도르{/g}에서는 흔한 말이지. 아마 전에 "
"들어 본 적이 없나 보지? 나는 많은 재산을 가지고 있지 않지만 네가 사람들의 숭배를 얻는 데 도움을 줄 수 있어. 극장의 소도구 중에는 "
"실제 가치가 있는 매력있는 물건이 몇 개 있는데... 관심이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "12ee2f6b-d355-47d2-886c-3f4fbab6f573"
msgid ""
"{n}The corners of Tristian's mouth turn up in what might be a smile.{/n} \"I "
"should have noticed it earlier. Is it not marvelous how love can flourish "
"between anyone?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 입꼬리가 올라가 웃는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"나는 그걸 먼저 알아야 했었는데. 사랑에 국경이 없다는 말은 놀랍지 않아?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "89823490-a241-4e34-a448-4eab23008389"
msgid "{n}Tristian's smile grows wider.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안의 미소가 더 커집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "9d9a7d77-6729-453f-aa6e-d6cc38e1fc4a"
msgid "\"Sorry.\""
msgstr "\"미안.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "474b2a34-2855-4de7-95e8-e19799698446"
msgid ""
"{n}Eimar grins eagerly.{/n} \"Then it's settled! I'll write down the "
"directions real quick, and when you're done, you meet me in "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} so I can hear your account. No doubt the magistrate will "
"be pleased to stop getting piracy complaints, too.\" {n}He draws a roll of "
"parchment from a scroll tube.{/n} \"I hope you'll arrive in time to see my "
"latest production. Speaking of which, I'm already late to oversee its "
"rehearsal.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르는 계속 웃습니다.{/n} \"그러면 정해진 거야! 내가 방향을 어서 적을테니 일이 끝나면 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 "
"만나고 무용담을 전해줘. 치안 판사는 해적질에 대한 민원을 없애는 것에 만족할 거야.\" {n}그는 통에서 두루마리를 꺼냅니다.{/n} "
"\"나의 최신작을 보여줄테니 시간에 맞게 도착했으면 좋겠다. 그래서 말인데 이미 리허설에 늦었군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0070_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0b7062ae-0246-4189-95d0-96a6d464dd11"
msgid ""
"\"Now that's more like it! Let's go crash those pirates! And we'd better not "
"waste time here. I don't like {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, or its people — everyone's "
"always trying to cheat you, or swindle you, or drag you into some other "
"cunning scumbaggery.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래 그거야! 해적들을 격퇴하자고! 여기서 시간을 낭비하지 않는 편이 낫겠어. 나는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}나 그 사람들이 "
"싫어. 모두가 사기꾼이거나 등쳐먹고 사기판에 끌어들이는 작자들이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "920f9efd-3a22-4bc9-a4e1-07d33eb12e38"
msgid ""
"{n}Eimar sidles closer, lowering his voice.{/n} \"And that's where Irovetti "
"has failed. The {g|Pitax River}Pitax River{/g} is our lifeline, connecting "
"us to the outside world. River pirates know it, and they prey upon incoming "
"travelers. You might think the king would thwart these pirates and defend "
"his people, but no, he's only sent escorts to protect key shipments, leaving "
"everyone else to the pirates' depredations. This tournament? It hides how we "
"suffer from the king's inaction.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이마르는 그의 목소리를 낮추면서 가까이 다가옵니다.{/n} \"그곳이 이로베티가 실패한 곳이야. {g|Pitax River}피탁스 "
"강{/g}은 우리를 외부 세계와 연결시키는 생명줄이지. 강가 해적들은 그것을 알고 있어서, 그곳에 도착하는 여행자들을 먹잇감 삼는다. "
"왕이 해적들을 저지하고 자신의 백성을 보호할 거라 생각하겠지만, 아니야. 그는 주요 선적을 보호하기 위해 안내원을 보낼 뿐이고, 다른 "
"모든 이들은 해적들애게 약탈당해. 이 토너먼트? 우리가 왕의 게으름으로 고통받는 것을 숨기기 위한 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Eimar/Cue_0072_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "efc7c015-25b0-4f6f-958c-5ff295ad351a"
msgid ""
"\"He barely opened his mouth before he made my teeth itch, with all his "
"treacle and nonsense!\""
msgstr "\"그는 백성을 어려움에 빠트리지만 아무것도 하지 않는 지도자야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d857a2c8-3a9e-42b8-874a-3f5fb4cab302"
msgid "\"Tell me about yourself.\""
msgstr "\"너 자신에 대해 말해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0005_Text_String
msgctxt "cac0b161-0899-4ba5-a0a9-d7b85900f6eb"
msgid "\"What caused you to lose influence?\""
msgstr "\"무엇 때문에 영향력을 잃었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "9d94aa75-5616-40ee-b549-0d0ba3a3eb92"
msgid "\"The citizens of Pitax seem to love Irovetti.\""
msgstr "\"피탁스의 시민은 이로베티를 사랑하는 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "929bac61-42fa-48b8-b217-8ac40d819a37"
msgid "\"Who might you recommend I meet here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 누구와 만나야 할지 추천해 줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "0cd23b46-41f3-4e2d-a771-d1749f10cc9a"
msgid "\"You said the 'so-called' thieves' guild. What is it he really does?\""
msgstr "\"'소위' 도둑길드라고 했지. 그가 정말로 하는 일이 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f17047c0-76b1-4cf4-84b3-2cf6bd5a2d98"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "05f40c03-ec86-446c-a8f0-70109ac32ad9"
msgid "Started a fight at the Rushlight tournament in Pitax."
msgstr "피탁스에서 러시라이트 토너먼트 시합을 시작했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "a899503c-3d83-4aea-9039-d1f34ee6272e"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You and your family are nothing more than dirty bandits. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너와 너의 가족은 더러운 도둑일 뿐이다. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "96c0a0cc-51a5-49da-b85c-88729eec2189"
msgid "\"Good day, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "65c4972d-509f-4cca-8aa5-25a6e17b0626"
msgid ""
"\"My regards, {mf|King|Queen} {Name}. {d|Liacenza}Gasperre Liacenza{/d}, at "
"your service.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕하십니까, {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}. 저는 {d|Liacenza}가스페레 리아첸자{/d}입니다. 당신을 받듭니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "4c479e2b-7114-42e9-9676-7b0786bce341"
msgid ""
"\"I'm the head of the Liacenza family and master of what remains of the Iron "
"Fox Trade House. Before Irovetti took the crown, it would have been my "
"family receiving you at our house. Alas, we're simply guests at his "
"celebration, now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 리아첸자 가문의 수장이자 강철 여우 무역 회사가 남긴 것들의 주인입니다. 이로베티가 왕관을 취하기 전엔, 저희 가문이 당신과 "
"같은 사람들을 환영했죠. 아아, 저희는 축하연에 온 손님일 뿐입니다. 지금은 말이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0011_Text_String
msgctxt "6ccd4a97-57ea-420c-ae6d-2683712a3085"
msgid ""
"\"It's a dark and sordid story — and I swear I'd give my life to learn the "
"full truth of it. {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} was founded by four families and ruled "
"by their four trade houses for centuries. We quarreled from time to time, of "
"course, and property didn't always change hands peacefully, but none of us "
"would dream of impinging on another family's lawful rights.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어둡고 끔찍한 이야기입니다. 그리고 저는 제 삶에 대한 완전한 진실을 알기 위해 평생을 바칠겁니다. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 "
"네 개의 가문에 의해 설립되었고 수 세기 동안 네 곳의 무역 회사에 의해 통치되었습니다. 물론, 저희는 때때로 싸우기도 했고, 재산의 "
"소유자가 바뀌는 과정이 항상 평화롭지는 못했지만, 우리 중 누구도 다른 가족의 합법적인 권리를 침해할 꿈은 꾸지도 못했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "f260fcf8-22ad-4adb-ab89-798589528d53"
msgid ""
"\"It would seem so, wouldn't it? Yet appearances can be deceiving. Yes, he's "
"made many rich and happy — but there are many more lives that he's dragged "
"through the mud for his own endless celebration. Trust me, there are many "
"who would gladly put an end to his rule, but the king has so many spies that "
"everyone's afraid to even discuss it. Ask the head of his precious {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}, Atalia Gitaren, what she thinks, or maybe "
"High Priest Drey Yarnes — you'll see their mouths shut tighter than an "
"oyster's shell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그런 것 같아보이죠, 안그렇습니까? 그럼에도 외견은 숨길 수 있죠. 맞습니다, 그는 많은 사람들을 부유하고 행복하게 만들었지만, "
"자신의 끝없는 축하연을 위해 진흙탕으로 끌고 간 목숨들이 훨씬 더 많습니다. 믿으십시오, 기꺼이 그의 통치를 끝내고자 하는 자는 많지만, "
"왕에겐 너무나 많은 첩자들이 있기에 저희 모두는 의논조차 마음대로 못합니다. {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}"
"의 교장 아탈리아 지타렌이 어떻게 생각하는지, 아니면 대사제 드레이 얀스에게 물어보십시오. 그들의 입은 굴의 껍데기보다 단단히 닫혀있을 "
"겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "21fc1361-8067-428a-8e39-0f108c335c4e"
msgid ""
"\"I'd do better to tell you whom you should avoid. There's a gloomy, sickly "
"looking gnome wandering about — Kharne Vereel, chief of the so-called "
"thieves' guild. He's Irovetti's primary business partner, and they "
"understand the word 'business' quite broadly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그보다는 피해야 할 사람을 알려드리죠. 암울하고 미친 노움이 돌아다니는데, 칸 베릴이라는 녀석이고, 소위 도둑 길드의 대장입니다. "
"그는 이로베티의 주요 사업 파트너이고, 그들은 '사업'이라는 단어의 의미를 꽤나 광범위하게 사용하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "d9e10d7b-771c-4e47-9091-34da169ec50b"
msgid "\"It was an honor speaking with you, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"이야기해서 기뻤습니다, 전하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "4ac709a4-e79b-4e3b-841f-d7306bbdc03e"
msgid ""
"\"Certainly not picking pockets! The fellow came from {g|Numeria}Numeria{/g} "
"shortly after Irovetti started his reign. I won't lie, the Pitaxian trade "
"houses occasionally made some questionable deals, but before Irovetti, those "
"like Vereel were driven from the city faster than you can say 'first dose is "
"free.' The man's a drug pusher. He sells the bloodbrush extract. They say it "
"enhances all senses extraordinary and evokes vivid visions, but also affects "
"minds and could be toxic in repeated doses. I saw those who overuse it — "
"they could not put three words together. Because of Vereel, half of the "
"city's youth is on his trash.\""
msgstr ""
"\"절대 소매치기 수준이 아닙니다! 이로베티의 지배가 시작된 직후, {g|Numeria}누메리아{/g}에서 그 친구가 왔죠. 피탁스의 "
"무역 회사들이 종종 의문스러운 거래를 했다는 사실은 부정할 수 없지만, 그래도 이로베티 이전에는 베릴같은 놈들이 '처음 한 대는 "
"무료'라고 말하기도 전에 도시에서 쫓겨났었습니다. 그 남자는 마약 밀매범입니다. 핏자루 추출물이란 물건을 판매하죠. 그들은 그 약이 모든 "
"감각을 비약적으로 향상시키고 생생한 시각을 불러 일으킨다고 하지만, 중독되면 정신 건강에 영향을 주고 독성을 나타낼 수도 있습니다. 저는 "
"그것을 과도하게 복용하는 사람들을 보았습니다. 그들은 세 단어 이상 말할 수 없더군요. 베릴 때문에, 도시의 젊은 층의 절반이 그의 "
"쓰레기에 취해 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0016_Text_String
msgctxt "86d4ac4a-2baa-4c43-b7b4-57c7f8ed242d"
msgid ""
"\"And then Irovetti appeared. We underestimated him, thought him nothing "
"more than another adventurer like the thousands of others in the region. He "
"handled matters quickly and chaotically, with assets running through his "
"fingers faster than chips at a card table. His wealth grew rapidly, but he "
"still wasn't a big fish... for a while, at least.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고는 이로베티가 나타났습니다. 저희는 그를 과소평가했고, 그가 그 지역의 수천 명의 다른 모험가와 다를 바 없다고 생각했죠. 그는 "
"카드 테이블에 있는 칩보다 빨리 손가락을 놀리며 재산을 놀리면서 문제를 신속하고 혼돈적으로 처리했습니다. 그의 재산은 빠르게 불어났지만, "
"여전히 대어는 아니었죠... 최소한, 잠시 동안은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0017_Text_String
msgctxt "09865fba-ab80-4068-a0b6-f5f67186a458"
msgid ""
"\"He invited representatives from all the trade houses to play cards. No one "
"really knows exactly what happened, but by morning, he owned most of their "
"assets, including the crown. They suspected a rigged game and sent "
"representatives from the families to discuss the matter with him — and then "
"a wave of disappearances rolled across the city. My brothers, the former "
"kings of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, disappeared, along with many other honorable "
"people — and Irovetti made it clear that the lives of his hostages would "
"depend upon our obedience. He was king, and our wealth and power lay in "
"ruins.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 모든 무역소의 대표를 초대하여 카드 게임을 했습니다. 아무도 무슨 일이 일어날지 알지 못했죠, 그러나 아침이 되자, 그는 왕관을 "
"포함한 그들의 재산 대부분 소유하고 있었습니다. 그들은 게임이 조작되었다 의심하고, 가문 대표를 파견하여 문제를 해결하려 했죠 — 그리고 "
"그 뒤로 도시 전체에 실종자가 우후죽순처럼 생겨났습니다. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 왕이었던 제 형제들은 다른 훌륭한 사람들과 함께 "
"실종되었습니다. 그리고 이로베티는 인질들의 목숨은 저희들의 순종에 달렸다고 선포했죠. 그는 왕이 되었고, 저희의 부와 권력은 끝났습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "3a48477b-3577-4f78-ae97-55b77a66224b"
msgid ""
"\"And Irovetti's pleased as punch about it — the more time the citizens "
"spend in 'altered states,' the fewer questions they ask.\n"
"The gnome also uses his own product — it affects both the body and the mind. "
"He fears his own shadow, seeing deception and trickery everywhere. Those who "
"deal with him hope for fabulous profits, but they more often than not end up "
"at the bottom of the river.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 이로베티는, 시민들이 \"바귄 상태\"로 보내는 시간이 많을수록 그들의 요구 사항이 적어진다는 사실에 기뻐했습니다.\n"
"그 노움또한 자기 물건을 사용합니다. 심신에 모두 영향을 미치죠. 그는 모든 방향에서 기만과 속임수를 보며 자신의 그림자를 두려워하죠. "
"그와 거래하는 사람들은 엄청난 이윤을 기대하지만, 대부분은 강바닥에 가라앉는 것보다 더 끔찍한 결말을 맞을겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "21736b34-82c1-4ebd-8ec9-9a6f668c2ec6"
msgid ""
"\"Take the gold, supply poison to his subjects. Irovetti's soul is black. "
"Black and venomous.\""
msgstr "\"금화를 갈취하고, 백성들에게 독을 퍼뜨린다. 이로베티의 영혼은 시꺼멓군. 흑심과 독기를 품었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "08819638-08b8-402c-adf5-3db73394b074"
msgid ""
"\"Pitax's high society is a notorious snake pit. Not that it's much "
"different from any other high society in the world…\""
msgstr "\"피탁스의 귀족 사회는 악명 높은 구렁텅이야. 이 세계의 다른 귀족 사회와 다를 바는 없지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/GasperreLiacenza/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "908753f5-f79c-42cd-9fa2-0c5eabfa281d"
msgid ""
"\"So this bright celebration is designed to veil the despair of the king's "
"victims? How naive I was, when I praised its merriment! You have my "
"sympathies, honorable Gasperre. I'd lose my mind if someone took my kin "
"hostage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 이 신나는 축하연은 왕의 희생자들의 눈물을 감추기 위한 속임수라고? 축하연을 즐기는 내가 순진했군! 정말 안됐군 가스페레. "
"누가 내 가족을 인질로 삼는다면 미쳐버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Guard-Exit/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "1c356586-7b26-4ecd-a5d8-7facfd7b64d8"
msgid "[Stay at the tournament] \"Of course. It's too early to leave.\""
msgstr "[토너먼트에 머뭅니다] \"물론. 떠나기엔 너무 이르다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Guard-Exit/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "3bb4991d-6133-471c-b0e6-d9e45c98f2ce"
msgid ""
"[Leave the tournament] \"I have to go. I hope everyone has fun without me.\""
msgstr "[토너먼트를 떠납니다] \"나는 가야 한다. 나 없이는 재미있게 보내길 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Guard-Exit/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "a05e2b10-4e38-4672-bde4-4140d86c2b8b"
msgid ""
"\"Leaving, Your Highness? Won't you stay for the banquet? Otherwise, you'll "
"miss the most important part of the celebration!\""
msgstr "\"떠난다고? 연회에는 참석하지 않으려고? 그렇지 않으면 축하 행사에서 가장 중요한 부분을 놓치게 될 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8aa5df30-077a-4776-aaee-1939173587a7"
msgid ""
"\"How about this: you pretend you didn't notice anyone, and I'll spare your "
"lives.\""
msgstr "\"아무도 못 본 척하면 네 목숨은 살려 줄게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "2b3bb1b7-9938-40f1-b5aa-d30f270f5e44"
msgid ""
"\"How dare you! I'm an honored guest of His Highness, and he invited me here!"
"\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 감히! 나는 전하의 영광스러운 손님이고 그는 나를 여기에 초대했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "db8a8807-24a5-44aa-92bb-4019733e9f2a"
msgid ""
"\"Well, looks like I've been caught... But wouldn't you prefer to spend your "
"time counting this thousand gold I have, rather than rush off to turn me in?"
"\""
msgstr "\"여기에 잡힌 것 같군. 내가 수천 골드가 있는데 나를 고발하기 전에 얼마인지 세어보지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "dc739cc6-ed35-4478-8b07-42285991eea8"
msgid "[Attack] \"You should have looked the other way.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"잘못된 결정을 내렸군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "776e45fd-3383-4792-bed8-ce8cdf46e8a6"
msgid "\"I'm aware. He's the one who invited me.\""
msgstr "\"알고 있다. 그는 나를 초대 한 사람이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "c349bd6a-ccda-4c18-b459-e8107b69e386"
msgid "\"Back off peacefully, or I'll make you do so.\""
msgstr "\"얌전히 물러나. 그렇지 않으면 후회하게 해주지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "7302bf2b-0360-4292-bca2-41dadbf05513"
msgid "\"Perhaps a thousand gold will persuade you to let me in?\""
msgstr "\"1천 골드면 나를 들여보내줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "db43e3d5-9024-4872-a0fc-9dc6c2fa88c8"
msgid "\"I think I must be lost. I'll just be going.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가망이 없겠군. 그냥 가겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1a689de6-24bb-4068-a1f4-3e20cfe39a10"
msgid "\"Hey! You can't be here! This is High Highness King Irovetti's camp!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 너는 여기 있을 수 없어! 이브로페티 왕의 캠프라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "842bdbdc-40db-4cc8-9b9f-fc6e6cb17b30"
msgid "\"Hey, who's crawling around there? Stand still, hands in the air!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 거기 기어다니는 녀석 누구지? 일어서서 양 손 들어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "6d17a907-2e92-4ac2-9a14-73636649dfbe"
msgid "\"Guards! Over here! Raise the alarm!\""
msgstr "\"경비! 여기다! 경보를 울려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "e08b0ee7-e926-47b8-a3bc-6ff73cf05bab"
msgid "\"What's this, a bribe? Not a chance. Thieves! Raise the alarm!\""
msgstr "\"이게 뭐야. 뇌물? 어림 없다. 도둑놈들! 경보를 울려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "f9bb1d3c-9d8d-4507-b9d6-d0cb3ce318b0"
msgid "\"Is that a threat?! Raise the alarm!\""
msgstr "\"위협인가? 경보를 울려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "6b98fa42-edd5-4ea7-8c44-2fe43ade1427"
msgid ""
"\"Don't try to confuse us! We'll hand you over to the king and let him "
"decide what to do with you!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 혼란에 빠뜨리지 마라. 너를 왕에게 넘겨 그가 너를 어떻게 처리할지 결정할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "50a1b60c-1d33-4f76-8efc-9c4df3e8e8eb"
msgid ""
"\"We're not supposed to allow anyone in! If the king commands it, we will, "
"but at this point you could be a thief for all we know!\""
msgstr "\"누구도 여기에 와서는 안된다! 왕이 명령한다면 우리는 따라야 하지만 이 시점에서 너는 도둑이 될 수도 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrovettiGuards/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "d5fdb7e5-2504-4a55-b808-9da34bd026d6"
msgid "\"Keep going!\""
msgstr "\"가던 길 가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "13f24525-74d0-4265-a036-8d35bf90ff4d"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti, my friend, it's uncomfortable how much attention you lavish upon "
"me. How about your kingdom? How many bodies are found in Pitax's harbors "
"each year?\""
msgstr ""
"\"이로베티. 내 친구여. 내게 많은 관심을 가져주어 몸둘 바를 모르겠군. 왕국은 어떠하지? 매년 피탁스의 항구에서 시체가 얼마나 발견 "
"되지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "1ba54dda-daf3-4e53-8276-49d0b16373d5"
msgid ""
"\"I'm flattered by your borderline disturbing attention to my persona, but "
"why don't we include you in the discussion as well? For example, I heard an "
"amusing story from some students from your academy...\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 인격에 관심을 가져주어 고맙지만 다른 얘기를 해 보는 거는 어때? 이를테면 네 아카데미의 일부 학생들에 관한 재미있는 이야기를 "
"들었는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "17398e32-e3ed-4fb5-a19e-3390cf27515e"
msgid ""
"\"Your words ooze poison — is this how you show hospitality? If I've "
"offended you in some way, just tell me and I'll offer my apologies.\""
msgstr "\"네 말에서 독이 뚝뚝 떨어지는군. 이게 네가 친절을 베푸는 방식인가? 어떤식으로든 너를 화나게했다면 미안하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "5813fd18-55d8-47ad-a6df-b873a29676e8"
msgid "\"Lies! Lies and slander! I demand you rescind your words!\""
msgstr "\"거짓말! 거짓말쟁이! 네가 한 말을 철회해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "923b956f-5170-4222-8d60-44d641c33bf2"
msgid "[Stay quiet]"
msgstr "[조용히 있습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "81f7343a-b5dd-4dc4-8b0b-14fec3a1494f"
msgid "\"Watch yourself, Irovetti, or you'll regret it!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티. 조심해. 아니면 후회할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "a3588642-4d25-4664-a73c-0caf787512cf"
msgid ""
"\"I hope my victory didn't offend. I do apologize — it's hard to tone down "
"all this talent!\""
msgstr "\"내 승리가 불쾌하지 않았으면 좋겠습니다. 사과드리죠 — 하지만 겸손히 있기는 어렵군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "c08b4ad3-5ca4-4eea-ba7c-3897ddb636b5"
msgid ""
"\"Tiny? Why are you so concerned with the size of my country, Irovetti? Are "
"you perhaps trying to compensate for your size elsewhere?\""
msgstr "\"작은 나라라고? 왜 남의 나라 크기에 관심을 갖고 있지? 네 부위 중 다른 곳에서 크기로 위안을 받으려는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0040_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ada7f42a-22a1-4fba-845d-6f17cac274bd"
msgid "Ignored Irovetti's mockery."
msgstr "이로베티의 조롱을 무시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "9aa63c6a-9fb6-4252-806a-d6d793dbcb6a"
msgid "[Stay quiet]"
msgstr "[조용히 있습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "67a0d5b3-e763-461f-b9f4-86771549ab3d"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness! Dear guests! Attending this tournament was a great honor "
"and a true pleasure. I thank you all for an unforgettable day!\""
msgstr "\"전하! 손님 여러분! 이 대회에 참석하는 것은 큰 영광이자 진정한 기쁨입니다. 잊지 못할 날들을 감사드립니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "66bfd0a1-4f1f-4a4a-8c72-d6bcb635e331"
msgid "\"Irovetti, I tire of your rudeness. To the Abyss with your insults!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티. 너의 무례함에 질리는군. 모욕은 지옥에서나 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "c0c6bbc6-6e9e-4da4-8157-9f6c970e8633"
msgid ""
"\"Awarding yourself the prize? Such a regal thing to do! I applaud you!\""
msgstr "\"자화자찬인가? 참으로 고귀하군! 박수 갈채를 보내주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "3c57a958-bb4c-40ca-9587-2348b777add2"
msgid ""
"\"This is absurd! We won two of the three contests. That prize is ours by "
"right!\""
msgstr "\"말도 안돼! 우리는 세 가지 경연 대회 중 두 번을 이겼어. 상은 우리의 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0058_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a24f5321-97cd-4032-ba6f-d1063257ffd8"
msgid "Ignored Irovetti's mockery."
msgstr "이로베티의 조롱을 무시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "4493a5e1-b8cb-4430-b696-42c916154e02"
msgid "[Stay quiet]"
msgstr "[조용히 있습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "3b4a41d4-9c63-4dc9-bebc-af9a5c0d07da"
msgid ""
"[Show the guests the signet with Irovetti's monogram] \"I too have a most "
"amusing story for you. This ring was given to me by a gnome named Tartuccio, "
"on that bloody night when Swordlord Jamandi Aldori's mansion was attacked..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"[손님들에게 이로베티의 문양을 담은 인장을 보여줍니다] \"나도 재미있는 이야기를 해주지. 이 반지는 소드로드 자만디 알도리의 저택이 "
"공격당했던 그날 밤 타투치오라는 노움에게서 받았지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "385e4f54-2d1f-4d90-981d-e31822e49e04"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you, but I'm not fond of public speaking or ceremonies. I'll remain "
"silent, if you please.\""
msgstr "\"고맙군. 하지만 나는 대중 연설이나 상치례를 좋아하지 않아. 원한다면 나는 침묵할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1d1d463e-8a9c-4278-afaf-4ef47835abf7"
msgid ""
"\"Lords and ladies, another Rushlight tournament has come to an end! I'd "
"like to thank all of you who honored this event with your presence. My "
"friends, I'm happy to see all of you, but I'd like to give a special welcome "
"to one guest who found themselves invited here for the first time! Today we "
"had {Name}, the baron{mf||ess} — no, excuse me, it's {mf|king|queen} now, "
"isn't it? — of a majority of what was once the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen "
"Lands{/g}! Thank you for coming, my darling — I can call you that, right? I "
"thank you with all my heart!\""
msgstr ""
"\"신사 숙녀 여러분, 또 한 번 러시라이트 토너먼트가 끝났습니다! 이 행사를 빛내준 모든 분께 감사를 표하고 싶습니다. 친구들이여, "
"여러분 모두를 만나게 되어 기쁘지만, 여기 처음으로 초청받은 손님 한 명에게 특별히 환영 인사를 하고자 합니다! 오늘 {mf||여}남작 "
"{Name}, 아니죠. 실례합니다. 지금은 {mf|왕|여왕}이시죠? 아무튼, 한때 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}이라 "
"불린 지역의 주권자입니다! 와줘서 고맙습니다, 자기 — 그렇게 불러도 되겠지? 마음을 다해 감사를 전합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "a470b9d4-c67a-4309-98da-ece6b2c64692"
msgid ""
"\"I first learned of {mf|him|her} from my friend Stefano Moskoni. To be "
"honest, his report was less than flattering. Impassable swamps, monsters "
"galloping about, and a complete absence of any valuable resources. 'Nothing "
"more than a dirty hole ruled by another bandit lord, hardly worthy of your "
"attention' — that's what he wrote back then. I'm so happy he was wrong!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 내 친구 스테파노 모스코니에 의해 처음으로 {mf|그|그녀}를 알게 되었습니다. 솔직히 말해서 그의 첫 인상은 별 볼일 "
"없었습니다. 쓸데없는 늪, 출몰하는 괴물과 자원이 없는 땅을 가졌죠. '도적이 지배하는 더러운 소굴과 다를 것이 없어서 쳐다 볼 가치도 "
"없다' — 그 당시 그가 쓴 편지의 내용입니다. 나는 그가 틀렸다는 것이 너무 기쁩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "c29e0018-3089-4a4a-9dab-e2e735a6196e"
msgid ""
"\"Stefano himself seems to have vanished somewhere in {Name}'s domain, "
"unfortunately. Perhaps he met a hydra on his way back, or drowned in the "
"omnipresent mud... Or maybe he just caught the baron{mf||ess} in a bad mood, "
"eh? Ha ha! A joke, a joke. Stefano was a great fellow — it's a pity he "
"joined the many travelers who vanish in those lands each year.\""
msgstr ""
"\"스테파노는 안타깝게도 {Name}의 영토 어딘가에서 사라졌습니다. 아마도 그는 돌아 오는 길에 히드라를 만났거나 수많은 진흙탕 중 한 "
"곳에 빠져 죽었을 것입니다. 아니면 남작이 기분이 나빠 잡아들였을지도요. 하하! 농담입니다. 스테파노는 훌륭한 동료였습니다. 그가 매 년 "
"이 땅에서 사라지는 많은 여행자들 중 한 명이 되어 안타깝군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "75553673-618b-4743-b9b3-8bec91f8caf7"
msgid ""
"\"Truth be told, even now traveling that domain is a less than pleasurable "
"experience. Some roads have appeared, but their safety leaves much to be "
"desired. Take the sad story of poor Tomin Hanvaki from Gralton! He set off "
"to those lands and hasn't been seen since. His brother, Edrist, went to find "
"the poor fellow, and what happened?\""
msgstr ""
"\"진실을 말하자면 지금도 그 영역을 여행한다는 것은 즐거운 경험이 아니랍니다. 도로를 좀 깔았지만, 아직도 위험하지요. 그랄튼에서 온 불쌍한 "
"토민 한바키의 슬픈 이야기를 들어 보십시오! 그곳으로 떠났지만 그 이후로 소식이 없습니다. 그의 형제 에드리스트는 형제를 찾으러 갔지만 "
"무슨 일이 일어났습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "ffc39488-3492-4f4b-96d6-a9cf33dcf1f9"
msgid ""
"\"The baron{mf||ess} found the body in the blink of an eye — almost as "
"though it were stored in {mf|his|her} cellar!\""
msgstr "\"눈 깜빡 할 사이에 남작은 시체를 발견했습니다. 마치 {mf|그|그녀}의 지하 저장고에서 꺼내기라도 한 것처럼요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "7ac800dd-d771-4b2a-a610-8233f6cd6106"
msgid ""
"\"He returned empty-handed! Tomin seems to have vanished into thin air, like "
"hundreds of travelers before him. At least Edrist was lucky, I suppose — he "
"managed to come back alive. That's certainly considered fortunate for those "
"who decide to swing through those lands!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 빈 손으로 돌아왔습니다! 토민은 다른 수백 명의 여행자처럼 허공 속에 사라진 것처럼 보였습니다. 적어도 에드리스트는 운이 "
"좋았다고 생각합니다. 그는 다시 살아 돌아올 수 있었습니다. 그 땅을 돌아다니는 사람 중에서는 억세게 운이 좋은 것이지요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "8bba444b-1ee5-49f7-81d4-dbba5f2c913c"
msgid ""
"\"{Name} ordered him hanged as a spy! Now that's what I call taking care of "
"national security! Take a lesson, there!\""
msgstr "\"{Name}은 그를 스파이로 교수형을 선고했습니다! 그것이 내가 안보라고 부르는 것입니다! 새겨 들으십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "f577de55-023a-4632-9fd3-69c65afdf621"
msgid ""
"\"And the hunt the baron{mf||ess} put on, clearly imitating my tournament? "
"It was beyond description. While guests were out hunting hydras and "
"owlbears, the latter came from behind and ate at the banquet table — along "
"with all the servants! Some celebration, right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 남작이 연 사냥은 내 토너먼트를 모방한 것이 틀림없지요? 설명할 필요도 없습니다. 손님들이 히드라와 아울베어를 사냥하던 중 "
"후발대는 뒤따라 와서 연회 테이블을 열어 그 고기를 먹었습니다. 하인들과 함께 말입니다! 제법 괜찮은 축하연이지 않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "c0f7f451-0e9c-4a66-9203-21b4750b281e"
msgid ""
"\"Our precious Annamede was there — you should have heard the way she "
"described how she was received, if you can call it that! The baron{mf||ess} "
"was so loaded, {mf||s}he mistook her for prey! Poor thing had to crawl away "
"from {mf|him|her} through bushes and swamps!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 소중한 안나메데가 거기 있었죠. 안나메데가 당신의 열렬한 환대를 어떻게 회상하는지 들었어야 했는데! 그걸 환대라고 부를 수 "
"있다면 말이죠. {mf||여}남작은 술에 취해 안나메데를 먹이로 착각했습니다! {mf||여}남작}에게서 도망치기 위해 덤불과 늪을 헤치며 "
"기어와야 했다죠. 안나메데에게 참 안된 일이에요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "d2304d76-396b-4658-8e0c-a2ca12bc05ac"
msgid ""
"\"And how about the Aldori sisters from {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g}? They're here "
"today — ask them how the hunt went! They may have made it to the "
"baron{mf||ess} on their own, but suffice to say, they made it back home in "
"wooden boxes! That was some hunt! Good thing the noble family had enough "
"gold to pay for resurrection!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Mivon}미본{/g}에서 온 알도리 자매는 또 어떻습니까? 오늘 여기 있었으니, 사냥은 어땠는지 물어보십시오! {mf||여}"
"남작의 앞에 서는데까진 성공했지만 그대로 궤짝에 담겨 집으로 돌아갔다고 하면 얼추 이야기가 맞겠군요! 두고두고 기억할 만한 "
"사냥이었습니다! 이 친구들이 귀족이라 다행이지요. 부활 주문에 쓸 돈은 충분하니까요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "a840cf63-cfea-49d5-8032-1abe1b1566c4"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, now, no need to get mad. No harm meant — I'm just sharing amusing "
"anecdotes!\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 화 낼 필요 없어. 악의는 없었어. 나는 그저 재미있는 이야기를 나누는 것일 뿐이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "eeacd996-7c22-4632-9cab-b2c1c88f80a9"
msgid "{n}Grinning triumphantly at you, Irovetti continues.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}승리의 미소를 지으며 이로베티는 계속합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "935655d2-6b47-40da-9945-d20a756bf9b9"
msgid ""
"{n}Irovetti breaks out into a fit of coughing.{/n} \"Right, yes. Ha ha! I "
"did get a bit carried away, didn't I?\""
msgstr "{n}이로베티는 기침을 한 차례 합니다.{/n} \"맞아. 그래. 하하! 내가 약간 흥분했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "ac930324-f255-47db-bb9c-0cd620f1ee4a"
msgid ""
"\"This is still my tournament, if you please. When I visit you, you can talk "
"about whatever you want. Until then, let me continue!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 부탁드리지, 아직 토너먼트는 끝나지 않았다네. 내가 너를 방문할 때 원하는 이야기를 하라고. 그때까지는 계속 말하겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "a4ae9b15-ea0b-4fc7-b5d0-ef9fd9387275"
msgid "\"Um... Yes, well, I believe we've fallen a bit off topic.\""
msgstr "\"음... 그래. 우리가 주제에서 조금 벗어난 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "86478c26-a146-40fe-a93f-01f484f59e6d"
msgid ""
"\"Enough, really! Are you looking to ruin everyone's appetites right before "
"the banquet?\""
msgstr "\"그만해. 진심이야! 연회 직전에 사람들의 식욕을 망치고 싶어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "ce559ee4-434f-431e-b12f-f82f694af972"
msgid ""
"\"No, forgive me. I don't wish to seem impolite! But getting back to the "
"subject...\""
msgstr "\"아니. 용서해. 무례하게 보이고 싶지 않군. 하지만 아까 한 이야기 말인데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "2b86bc25-620b-4975-9d76-7db78ee9dd92"
msgid ""
"\"Poison? What do you mean? We're friends, you and I! I was just looking to "
"share some funny stories with my guests.\""
msgstr "\"독이라고? 무슨 뜻이야? 우린 친구야! 나는 그저 손님들과 재미있는 이야기 나눌 거리를 찾을 뿐이고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "b208705f-9e05-4def-9ae9-f763d8048864"
msgid ""
"\"All I really wanted to get at was that the {mf|king|queen} of {kingdomname}"
" is a personage truly as extraordinary as {mf|his|her} lands, and I'm happy "
"to see {mf|him|her} at this celebration! And now, it's time to announce the "
"winner of the tournament!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 진정으로 말하고 싶었던 것은 {kingdomname}의 {mf|왕|여왕}이 {mf|그의|그녀의} 영토에 과분한 사람이라는 "
"것이며, 축하연에 {mf|그|그녀}가 와주어서 행복합니다! 그리고 이제, 토너먼트의 우승자를 발표할 때입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "a0744ace-ce66-42eb-971a-ece17cf40610"
msgid ""
"\"Please restrain your anger, but this year, the prize will be staying here. "
"The winner of the most contests was the team from {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"분노를 자제 해주세요. 하지만 올해의 상은 움직이지 않겠군요. 경연 대회에서 가장 많이 우승한 것은 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 "
"팀입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "08d85cd5-45e7-43b8-8272-0f13825b9b48"
msgid ""
"\"This year, no one managed to win all three contests. Since the victories "
"all belong to the {kingdomname} and {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, as the chief judge, "
"I'll be rewarding the prize to... Pitax — for their grace and skill!\""
msgstr ""
"\"올해는 아무도 3개의 대회에서 모두 승리하지 못했습니다. 모든 승리를 {kingdomname}와(과) {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}가 "
"가져갔기에 심판으로서 나는 상을... 뛰어난 기량을 발휘한 피탁스에 수여합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "7efd0cea-2440-4446-9461-ff9e51685c27"
msgid ""
"\"This year, all three contests were won by guests from one kingdom. I'm not "
"sure what charms, tricks, or divine intervention helped {mf|him|her}, but..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"올해 세 대회는 모두 한 왕국이 이겼습니다. 매혹, 속임수 또는 신의 개입이 {mf|그|그녀}에게 도움을 주었는지 모르지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "dd19e405-2830-4356-b2f5-9649018cb316"
msgid ""
"\"I must say, I was hoping that this year our debutant, {mf|King|Queen} "
"{Name} of {kingdomname} would show {mf|his|her} worth, but I suppose it "
"would be strange to expect {mf|him|her} to display more talent during the "
"contest than {mf||s}he does ruling {mf|his|her} tiny country!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {kingdomname}의 {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}이(가) 자신의 가치를 보여주리라 기대했건만, 작은 영토를 통치하는 "
"{Name}가 어떻게 자기 재능 이상의 능력을 발휘했는지 의문스럽군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "cb70523a-1270-4016-a4e5-1e2bad3bb75e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh! I'll stop, I'll stop. I'm not trying to anger you. Believe me, I don't "
"want you to start another ugly fight at my celebration!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 그만 할게. 정말이야. 너를 화나게 하려고 한 건 아니었어. 믿어줘 내 축하 행사에서 또 다른 추악한 싸움을 하지는 말아줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "119f249c-1ace-4e57-9466-d7169acd8b7e"
msgid ""
"{n}Irovetti grinds his teeth as the rest of the guests laugh heartily.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}이로베티는 손님들이 진심으로 웃어줄 때 이빨을 갈았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "ee2d9d41-d590-4d21-9c2a-1b4de6517aa7"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, trust me, I don't fall short in lands... or anything else! If you "
"wish, I could give you a personal tour later!\" {n}The guests roar in "
"laughter at Irovetti's words.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"오. 걱정 마. 나는 땅이 부족하거나 하지 않으니... 네가 원한다면 나중에 개인적으로 여행을 시켜주지!\" {n}손님은 이로베티의 "
"말에 웃음 소리를 질렀습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "88eb274c-329f-4b56-b03e-4934ba53ab4f"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, well... Why attract any more attention to a group of losers than they "
"deserve?\""
msgstr "\"오. 그러면 왜 그런 패배자들에게 많은 관심을 끄는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "c4be661e-413e-4d8e-9240-ff6a720e9567"
msgid ""
"{n}Despite Irovetti's efforts to smear you in the eyes of the guests, the "
"audience is elated — your speech garners a hearty round of applause.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}손님들의 눈에는 이로베티가 당신에게 한 방 먹이려고 보였음에도 관객은 기분은 고양되었습니다. 당신의 연설은 박수 갈채를 "
"불러옵니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "abb1d6c6-3952-44c5-a86d-4b93cbc0e246"
msgid ""
"{n}It seems Irovetti's insults and slander had a greater impact on the "
"guests than your congeniality did — your speech is greeted with sideways "
"glances and whispers.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이로베티의 모욕과 중상 모략이 당신의 친절함보다 손님에게 더 큰 영향을 미쳤습니다. 당신의 연설을 사람들은 곁눈질로 보고 속삭이기 "
"시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "f70a555c-dc11-4a3a-ba3c-52b9d79e76e0"
msgid "{n}The guests greet your playful speech with amiable laughter.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}손님들은 즐거운 웃음으로 당신의 장난스런 연설을 환영합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "fab8e8f6-a522-4f9e-9b63-c3c7e199e30d"
msgid ""
"{n}Your speech doesn't go over well with the guests — instead of laugher, "
"you hear only baffled silence.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신의 연설은 손님들과 잘 어울리지 않습니다. 웃음 소리 대신에 당신은 어리둥절한 침묵만을 듣습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0055_Text_String
msgctxt "8b97d0c1-7636-4fe1-8139-cb990bdf1fef"
msgid ""
"\"And now, with the competition over and the prize awarded, let's get on "
"with the main part of the celebration — the banquet! I can hear your "
"stomachs growling from here — let's get to the table! And later, we'll see "
"an unforgettable fireworks show!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 대회가 끝나고 상금이 주어지면 축하 행사의 주요 부분인 연회를 시작합시다! 위장이 여기에서 으르렁거리는 소리가 들리는군요. "
"테이블로 갑시다! 그리고 나중에 잊을 수 없는 불꽃 놀이를 합시다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "f1b0ee66-73f9-4946-a3a2-2cbe64449355"
msgid ""
"\"A joke! I was joking. You won two contests of the three — the prize is "
"rightfully yours!\""
msgstr "\"농담이야! 그냥 농담이었어. 너는 세 번의 대회에서 두 번이나 우승 했어. 우승 상품은 너의 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "14823659-e41f-4362-996c-26112f4a3523"
msgid ""
"\"Oh? Someone's displeased with my judgment? But it's my right, after all!\""
msgstr "\"오! 누군가 내 판단에 불만스러워 하는 건가? 하지만 이건 내 권리야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "7177f47c-fdaf-407b-ab82-a164a94a440e"
msgid ""
"\"Let's hear it for the winner! {Name}, if you please! I know you're not "
"exactly a master of ceremonies, but please try to say something articulate "
"to my guests!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우승자의 말을 들어 봅시다! {Name}! 나와 봐! 네가 소감을 썩 잘말하지는 않는 걸 알지만 내 손님에게 뭐라도 말을 해 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "85209d95-16a4-4295-b44c-e9bc15d5d90a"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha! Just a joke! Please, restrain yourself — no need to be mad! Of "
"course the prize is yours. Here you are, take it — just don't cause a scene, "
"please!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 그냥 농담이야! 네가 참아. 화가 날 필요는 없어! 당연히 상은 네 것이지. 여기 있으니 시비 걸지 마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "c9241e8c-6899-417e-b7a6-987b4673e76f"
msgid ""
"{n}The guests listen to your tale with their mouths agape. Irovetti tries to "
"interrupt you, but everyone's attention is directed at you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}손님들은 입을 벌린 채로 이야기에 귀를 기울입니다. 이로베티는 당신을 방해하려 하지만 모든 사람들의 관심이 당신을 향해 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Results/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "f50ff939-08a2-4f29-a26f-3c29c3186e64"
msgid ""
"\"Ahem, ahem... A most amusing story indeed. Unfortunately, it has little to "
"do with me. True, that rascal Tartuccio was spending my money, but he was "
"acting entirely of his own volition!\" {n}The guests begin whispering to "
"each other, obviously dissatisfied with Irovetti's excuses.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"에헴... 가장 재미있는 이야기로군. 불행히도 나와는 거의 관련이 없다. 그 불량배 타투치오가 내 돈을 쓰고 있었지만 그는 완전히 "
"자신의 의지로 행동했어!\" {n}손님들은 이로베티의 변명에 불만스러운 듯 서로 속삭이기 시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "c0d6a242-7db7-4317-9fd2-b2a69266a84f"
msgid "\"Get your hands off me!\""
msgstr "\"손 치워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e3d67fa3-f0e3-4a49-8dab-220634b68858"
msgid "[Pat Irovetti on the back] \"I'm happy to finally meet you!\""
msgstr "[이로베티의 등을 토닥입니다] \"마침내 만나서 반가워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "6dc0a65a-a17e-499f-9717-1d4b10716384"
msgid ""
"\"Hey there, Irovetti. We've only just met — are you already checking where "
"you want to stick your dagger?\""
msgstr "\"안녕 이로베티. 방금 만났는데 벌써 내 몸 어디를 찌를지 고민하고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d02b0db6-5da5-4232-9c8e-bd636d08e15b"
msgid "\"Watch your tongue, Irovetti.\""
msgstr "\"입 조심해. 이로베티.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "11e40a3b-d320-41d0-a7b5-167eb9014538"
msgid "\"She is beautiful, isn't she? I wouldn't have anyone else beside me!\""
msgstr "\"아름다운 여자긴 하지, 안그래? 작업 거시지 마시지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "70deb40f-8fce-472d-8d1e-7c5fcc1d67d2"
msgid "[Say nothing]"
msgstr "[아무 말도 하지 않습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "b24ff6c3-871b-4fe2-a1a0-8060841e2e5e"
msgid ""
"\"You are the epitome of hospitality, aren't you? But not too long ago your "
"spy nearly killed me! You do remember the one named Tartuccio?\""
msgstr "\"정말 친절하군. 하지만 얼마 전 네 스파이가 거의 나를 죽일 뻔 했어! 타투치오라는 사람을 기억하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8323ad7b-3ced-4079-8d52-85ae28c74116"
msgid ""
"{n}King Irovetti greets you personally. The bulky Kellid is broad shouldered "
"and looks to be somewhere around fifty years of age. His golden crown sits "
"on long greasy hair above a heavily powdered face covered in bristle, and "
"his expensive doublet is stained with oily spots. He guffaws as he squeezes "
"you in a bear hug, enveloping you in the mixed scents of sweat, wine, and "
"expensive perfume.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이로베티 왕은 개인적으로 인사합니다. 덩치 큰 켈리드는 어깨가 넓고 50살 정도 되어 보입니다. 화장을 한 그의 얼굴에는 수염이 나 "
"있고 기름지고 긴 머리에는 황금빛 왕관이 씌워져있으며 그의 비싼 더블렛은 기름 자국이 얼룩져 있습니다. 그는 껄껄 웃으며 당신을 곰과 "
"같은 포옹으로 껴안았고 그에게서 땀, 와인과 비싼 향수가 섞인 냄새가 납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "6cd72c1a-631f-41b8-9da8-660b5acf4523"
msgid ""
"\"Well, my crown-bearing {mf|brother|sister}, welcome to my home! Stuff "
"yourself, drink, be my guest! You've proven yourself in combat, as well as "
"affairs of state — let's see how you do at having fun.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 형제여. 우리 집에 온 것을 환영하네! 내 손님이 되어 마음껏 먹고 마셔주게! 자네는 국가 안보뿐만 아니라 전투에서 실력을 "
"입증했지. 얼마나 잘 노는 지도 지켜 보겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "5c7dcfc6-6a57-46c6-9e1a-c01a4b0ae1c5"
msgid "\"Ha ha ha! Great! I see you have a sharp tongue!\""
msgstr "\"하하하! 대단해! 언변이 대단하군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "499beb0b-7404-4bad-9602-dd830588e3b5"
msgid "\"Easy, easy. I meant no harm!\""
msgstr "\"진정해. 악의는 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "53fe62da-d60d-45b4-8c99-3aff0fe31001"
msgid ""
"\"It's no good for kings and queens to stay in our palaces all the time. We "
"need to meet, be friends with one another... It's all about keeping up "
"neighborly relations, you know?\""
msgstr ""
"\"왕과 여왕이 항상 궁전에 머무르는 것은 좋지 않아. 우린 서로 만나고 친구를 사귀어야지... 이웃 관계를 유지하는 것이 그런 것이지."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "74096039-aa20-4ac7-86e4-d21436d26eec"
msgid ""
"\"So here's the plan. First — the fisher's triathlon. Then a boasting "
"contest, and in the evening — the best part — a drunken melee. In the "
"interim, there'll be a buffet, a fair, jugglers, acrobats, all the usual "
"entertainment. And after the melee, I'll announce the winner, and then we'll "
"have a festive banquet and a fireworks show. Then we just drink till morning "
"or find a tent to crawl into — your own, or someone else's, depending on "
"your luck! By the way... a knockout such as yourself will always be welcome "
"in my tent! Ha ha, just joking, just a joke!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 계획은 다음과 같아. 첫째는 피셔의 철인 3 종 경기야. 그 후에는 저녁의 최고이자 술판을 벌이는 자랑하기 대회야. 중간에 "
"뷔페, 오락거리, 요술쟁이, 곡예사가 있어. 술판을 벌인 후에는 우승자 발표를 하면 축하연과 불꽃 놀이를 진행하지. 그리고는 해가 뜰 "
"때까지 술을 마시고 텐트에 기어들어가면 돼. 네 텐트이건 누군가의 텐트이건 운에 달렸지! 그런데... 너 같이 멋진 녀석은 내 텐트에 "
"언제나 환영이야! 하하! 농담이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "dca75f8e-09ce-44df-93ec-308858594df3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, and one more thing — I'll have to seal your sheath. This is a peaceful "
"celebration, after all, and bullies will be kicked out immediately. Doesn't "
"matter if it's a king who decided to kick up a row or just a shopkeeper. So "
"behave yourself, and don't start any fights while you're here!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 한가지 더. 너의 칼집을 봉인해야 해. 이것은 평화로운 축하이니 폭력을 행한 자는 즉시 쫓겨날 거야. 그게 왕이든 엿장수든 "
"상관없이. 그러니 여기있는 동안은 싸우지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "0bb8abe8-cac2-40cb-9d0f-fc625d9e24cf"
msgid ""
"\"Well, I have to go. If you need anything, talk to Nunzio Arpaia. He's my "
"master of ceremonies, so he's responsible for organizing this mess. Have fun!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 가야겠군. 필요한 것이 있으면 눈치오 아르파이아에게 이야기해라. 축제 책임자이고 이 난장판을 감독했지. 재밌게 놀라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "c1727201-00d2-4e69-8ba8-84bccea683c8"
msgid ""
"{n}Noticing Valerie, Irovetti leers and gives her a raunchy smile.{/n} "
"\"Although I wouldn't mind baring my sword for such a luxurious sheath!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리를 보며 이로베티는 웃으며 그녀에게 추잡한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} \"저런 고급스러운 칼집이라면 내 칼을 집어 넣어도 기분이 "
"나쁘지 않겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "ebe86489-8ce0-4de5-b6c2-a1ff91167902"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie glances at you, alarmed and disappointed, then glares at Irovetti "
"with silent, undisguised contempt.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}발레리가 놀라움과 실망으로 당신을 보고는 조용하고 경멸하는 눈빛으로 이로베티를 노려 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "ba2ba58d-af35-423d-8e73-9087f10fb047"
msgid ""
"\"Aah, of course! Such a pretty flower has already been picked, hasn't it? "
"Who knows, who knows, who will enjoy these plump buds in the future...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 물론이지! 이렇게 예쁜 꽃인데 누군가 꺾었겠지, 아닌가? 하지만 누가 그 통통한 봉오리를 즐기게 될지, 누가 알겠나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a99c6bdb-dc50-4a58-84b9-dd98456cb085"
msgid ""
"\"I assure you, Your Highness, it will not be you.\" {n}Valerie folds her "
"arms across her chest and lifts her chin. You notice her move closer to you "
"ever so slightly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"전하, 확신하지만 당신은 아닐겁니다.\" {n}발레리는 주먹쥔 손을 가슴 위에 올리고 접고 턱을 들어 올립니다. 당신은 그녀의 "
"움직임이 너무나 가깝게 느껴집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "4f8bca58-9c02-4a53-866c-51ec9d9e4327"
msgid ""
"{n}For a moment, you think Valerie is about to hit you. She instead moves "
"away ever so slightly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}잠시 동안 발레리가 당신을 한대 치려고 한다 생각합니다. 대신 그녀는 당신을 휙 지나칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "77580fd8-436e-4c18-b6ea-49e517eb3e36"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive me for interfering into a conversation between illustrious "
"persons. I just meant to inquire — how is my death sentence in absentia? "
"When I inquired about it the last time, you still couldn't determine on the "
"type of execution, honorable sir.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저명한 사람들 사이의 대화를 방해해서 미안하군. 뭐 하나만 물어보자 — 부재중에 내 사형 선고가 어떻게 처리되지? 전에도 물어 "
"봤었는데, 아직도 처형 방식을 결정하지 못했나, 명예로운 선생.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "ffddd94f-dc00-4cb4-9fc0-fa2d1e50ae72"
msgid ""
"\"Aaa, sir Narthropple! Of course, of course, I remember... Well, today is a "
"special day, and I think it will be acceptable to decorate it with a symbol "
"of royal mercy! I officially grant you a pardon and cancel your sentence. "
"But you know, between us, I decided on dismemberment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 나트로플! 물론, 당연히 기억하지... 오늘은 특별한 날이야. 나는 이 축제를 고귀한 자비의 상징으로 장식해야 한다고 믿는다! "
"나는 공식적으로 너를 용서하고 선고를 취하하겠어. 하지만 꼭 알아야겠다면, 비밀인데, 나는 사지 절단을 생각했었지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9c591421-ff0b-405e-9ae4-ab49155fcc28"
msgid ""
"\"What a gloomy, dull place this Rushlight tournament is... How can you not "
"fall into despondence when you see all this ridiculous brightness, pride, "
"vanity?\""
msgstr ""
"\"토너먼트가 이렇게 우울하고 지루한 이벤트였나? 그런 어리석은 영광, 자부심, 허영심을 목격하고서 어떻게 낙담하지 않을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "c5d0351b-da97-480e-82ec-7088b64e18fd"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuccio? The short, purple fellow? Ah, you're bearing a grudge about "
"something that happened years ago! I assure you, that escapade in Lady "
"Jamandi's mansion was entirely his own arrogation. I sent him to spy on her, "
"not to start a battle, or a fire, or a flood for that matter! Now, now, "
"don't be so spiteful! I have invited you here to put all those little "
"grievances behind us, and establish a firm and lasting peace between our "
"kingdoms!\""
msgstr ""
"\"타투치오? 그 짧고 시퍼런 녀석? 몇 년 전에 일어난 일을 원망하고 있다니! 자만디의 대저택에서 일어난 장난은 전적으로 그의 "
"횡포였어. 나는 정보를 캐내라고 보냈지 전투를 벌이거나 불이나 물난리를 일으키라고 보낸 건 아니야! 비아냥거리지 말라고! 나는 지난 날의 "
"섭섭함을 뒤로하고 너희를 초대해서 왕국 간의 평화를 확고히 다지려는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "4aa7e398-3893-4454-a1a6-ea5e438a4818"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Brother|Sister}? What? Why? Ah, it the crown? Hmm... His better.\""
msgstr "\" {mf|형제|자매}? 뭐? 왜? 아. 왕관이라고? 흠... 그가 더 나아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "d351c9be-f368-4169-846a-47aaf0fc2742"
msgid ""
"\"I feel like a child in a sweet shop. Entertainment! Shopping! New trade "
"connections – and the smell of intrigue in the air! Mmm…\""
msgstr ""
"\"사탕 가게에 들어가면 어린 아이가 된 기분이야. 즐길 거리도 있고! 쇼핑도 하고! 새로운 무역 관계를 형성하면 흥미로운 일들이 생길 "
"거야! 음...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Irovetti_Welcome/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "1bbb0c3e-5ddc-4234-9b66-6b3ee29ce6eb"
msgid ""
"\"This place is amazing! Bright tents, music, people smiling and laughing… "
"After all our grim adventures, I've longed for such a holiday with friends!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기는 놀라운 곳이야! 텐트 안은 밝고 음악이 흐르고 사람들은 웃고 떠들고... 악몽 같던 모험이 끝나면 이런 멋진 휴일을 동료들과 "
"보내고 싶었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "5f083737-bc5c-4910-8144-7679eec23d4f"
msgid "\"You don't seem to be enjoying the celebration.\""
msgstr "\"너는 축하연을 즐기고 있는 것 같지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5cb03b7c-f7f1-420b-8189-db28dd67b0a6"
msgid ""
"\"I thought Pitax was a city without laws. Where do the guards come from?\""
msgstr "\"나는 피탁스가 무법 도시라고 생각했어. 경비대는 어디에서 온 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9930e770-6c1e-4187-9853-6c7241932c1e"
msgid "\"Who might you recommend I meet here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 누구와 만나야 할지 추천해 줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0010_Text_String
msgctxt "b2c2eca1-2b32-4189-8fdd-26be60d16330"
msgid "\"I hear you're not pleased with the way Irovetti rules.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티가 통치하는 방식에 만족하지 않는다고 들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "883321c4-c106-4598-9263-9e8e46df3d1c"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "d7cab2d1-828f-4949-8244-45eb19928f67"
msgid "\"Irovetti seems to have a tight grip on his power over the city.\""
msgstr "\"이로베티는 도시를 장악한 듯 하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "be7aeecd-f5b8-48be-b2ed-9bdec06ccf6c"
msgid "[Attack] \"Irovetti's watchdog! I'll kill you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"이로베티의 끄나풀이군! 내가 널 죽일 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ad0fcff8-cdc2-42fa-b81e-a9852c29d8ad"
msgid ""
"{n}An elf in leather armor scans the crowd intently. He seems to be the only "
"one at this celebration not participating. He's also the only one besides "
"the guards whose weapon isn't sealed.{/n} \"Your Highness. Welcome to "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. Irsei Caelysse, Captain of the City Guard, at your "
"service.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}가죽갑옷을 입은 엘프가 군중을 열심히 검사합니다. 그는 이 축하 행사에 참여하지 않은 유일한 자인 것 같습니다. 그는 무장한 경비원 "
"외에 또 다른 무장한 자이기도합니다.{/n} \"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 오신 것을 환영합니다. 도시 경비대장인 얼세이 "
"케일리시입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "3b9ed2e7-ae3b-41bd-8838-88806f8dbb46"
msgid "\"Good day, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 날 되십시오, 전하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "2b083222-9409-42e3-a1f1-e83ad4df79fb"
msgid ""
"\"This celebration is for YOU. For the city guard, it's just another work "
"day. And right now, our work is preventing disruption of the festivities.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 축하연은 당신을 위한 것입니다. 도시 경비대에게는 또 다른 노동의 날일 뿐이죠. 지금 저희는 축제의 방해꾼을 예방하고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "c1d3ea25-7889-4947-b309-d6e36b52b6da"
msgid ""
"\"Even pirates and smugglers have laws of a kind, and they need someone to "
"keep their order. The city guard was created by the trading houses not long "
"after the city was founded. We're paid by the citizens — not all of them "
"like us, but they all understand things are better with us than without us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"해적들과 밀수업자들조차도 그들의 법을 가지고 있으며, 또한 명령을 지킬 누군가도 필요합니다. 도시 경비대는 도시가 세워진 후 오래지 "
"않아 무역소들에 의해 설립되었습니다. 저희는 세금으로 운영됩니다. 그래서 모두가 저희를 좋아하지는 않지만, 경비대가 있는 것이 더 낫다는 "
"건 모두가 알고 있죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a7c50c16-978b-43e6-b93b-8f672d8701c2"
msgid ""
"\"That depends on the purpose of your visit. If you're here on business... "
"well, you already know King Irovetti, of course, but it would be worth your "
"time to speak with Gasperre Liacenza, too. The trading houses may have lost "
"much of their former power, but they're still capable of many things. And if "
"you'd like to partake of our renowned culture, there's Annamede Belavarah, "
"the most famous bard in the city. And Atalia Gitaren as well, Headmaster at "
"the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g}. Just take care — they can't stand "
"one another.\""
msgstr ""
"\"방문 목적에 따라 다를겁니다. 만약 사업차 오셨다면... 뭐, 당신은 이미 이로베티 왕을 알고 있으시니. 하지만 가스페레 리아첸자와도 "
"얘기해보신다면 시간을 더 가치있게 보낼 수 있으실겁니다. 무역 가문들은 과거의 힘을 많이 잃어 버렸습니다만, 여전히 많은 것을 할 수 "
"있습니다. 그리고 저희의 명성있는 문화에 기여하고 싶으시다면, 도시에서 가장 유명한 음유 시인인 안나미데 빌라바라가 있죠. 또한 {g|"
"Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g}의 학장 아탈리아 지타렌도 있고요. 그들이 서로 앙숙인 것만 조심해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "9b27741c-e3cb-4bc5-a95b-db8ad0d1580d"
msgid ""
"{n}The elf looks around carefully.{/n} \"Not so loud. Irovetti has ears "
"everywhere... But if Your Highness must know, so be it. My fellows and I "
"serve the city. Not the crown, not the trading houses, not whoever has the "
"biggest purse — the city. This dump we call {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, and all the "
"poor fools who swarm around it. Former kings understood this — they're the "
"ones who arranged it in the first place. But when Irovetti took charge, he "
"thought the city guard would be his personal cutthroats. And once he "
"realized that wasn't the case, he started doing everything in his power to "
"make our jobs harder.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}엘프는 조심스럽게 주위를 둘러 봅니다.{/n} \"조용히 해주십시오. 모든 곳에 이로베티의 귀가 있으니까요...하지만, 당신께서 "
"아셔야만 하겠다면, 그러죠 뭐. 저와 제 동료들은 도시에 봉사합니다. 왕관도 아니고, 무역소도 아니고, 가장 두터운 재력을 가진 누군가도 "
"아닌, 도시 그 자체를요. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}라 불리는 쓰레기장과, 거기에 모여 사는 가난한 바보들 말입니다. 선대 왕들은 "
"이를 이해하셨죠, 이 땅에 최초로 질서를 세우셨던 분들이시니까요. 그러나 이베로티가 권력을 잡았을 때, 그는 도시 경비대를 개인적인 "
"암살자가 될거라 생각한 것 같습니다. 그리고 그것이 아니라는걸 깨닫자마자, 자신의 온 힘을 쏟아부어 저희 책무를 어렵게 만들기 시작했죠."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "5cad2601-d27a-48ae-82cc-1cb04182c65c"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! The rumors that get around! You know, I recently heard tell of a ghost "
"in the {g|Academy of Grand Arts}Academy{/g} — turned out it was just a "
"withered parquet floor that was squeaking!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하! 주위에 떠돌아 다니는 소문이란! 너는 알다시피 나는 최근에 {g|Academy of Grand Arts}아카데미{/g} 유령에 "
"대해 이야기하는 것을 들었다. 그것은 단지 바짝 마르고 낡은 마루가 삐걱 거리는 거라고 밝혀졌다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "23a644d3-4760-4f87-a6d5-31e956f4466d"
msgid ""
"\"Now he has this personal guard he formed, who are above the law and "
"following the orders of a barbarian. And then there's Kharne Vereel, with "
"his so-called thieves' guild — scumbags flooded the entire city with "
"{g|Numeria}Numerian{/g} drug — bloodbrush extract, the poison that turns "
"people into mindless sheep. Our former kings understood that even "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} needed some bare minimum of order to avoid falling to "
"pieces and floating down the river, but Irovetti seems on track to burn the "
"city to the ground.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 그는 법을 무시하고 야만인의 명령을 받는 개인 경호를 가지고 있습니다. 그리고 칸 베릴과 소위 도둑 길드라 불리는 쓰레기들이 "
"누메리아산 마약인 핏자루 추출물을 들고 몰려왔죠, 이 독은 사람들을 생각없는 양새끼들로 바꿔버립니다. 선대 왕께선 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}조차도 조각조각 나뉘어 강으로 떠내려 가는 걸 막기 위한 최소한의 질서가 필요하단걸 이해하셨지만, 이베로티는 "
"그냥 도시를 불태워 버리려는 것 같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "1ffed582-134a-469a-abee-16244ece4092"
msgid "\"Be careful.\""
msgstr "\"조심하십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "23134caa-ac03-44ac-afe4-734445aa66b1"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes. The trading houses hate him, of course, but... Well, first and "
"foremost, he has hostages. Second, each of the families is afraid to act "
"alone, but they're all incapable of acting together. Gasperre Liacenza tried "
"to unite them, but to no avail. And it's probably for the best, frankly — "
"the last thing we need is combat in the streets. Irovetti can be blamed for "
"many things, but at least he took power quickly and without carnage.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오, 맞습니다. 물론 무역 가문은 그를 싫어하지만... 먼저, 최우선적으로 그에게는 인질이 있습니다. 둘째, 각 가문은 혼자 "
"행동하기를 두려워하지만, 그렇다고 함께 뭉쳐 행동할 능력도 없습니다. 가스페레 리아첸자는 그들을 단결시키려고 했지만 별 소용이 없었죠. "
"그리고, 솔직히 가장 중요한 부분인데, 마지막은 저희가 개입하기 위해선 거리에서의 전투가 필요하다는 점이었죠. 이로베티는 여러 가지로 "
"비난받을 수 있지만, 적어도 그는 학살없이 신속하게 권력을 잡았습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "9b2d3f97-6cd5-4ae9-8ac2-5cbabcd8b34a"
msgid ""
"\"Now Irovetti's enemies have nothing to do but sit around like High Priest "
"Drey Yarnes, praying for {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g} to send her giant holy "
"wasps down to take him away.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 이로베티의 적들에겐 대사제 드레이 얀스처럼 앉아 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}가 거룩한 말벌을 보내어 이로베티를 "
"데려가주길 간절히 비는것 말곤 아무것도 할 게 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "a2538ebd-2c87-4ad4-b2fa-c8f870ed6674"
msgid ""
"\"If your words are true, noble guard — please accept my compassion and "
"admiration. To serve the law and the needs of the people with so much "
"against you, even your own ruler... No deed could be more worthwhile!\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 말이 사실이라면 동정심도 느껴지고 존경스럽기도 하군요. 자신과 자신의 통치자에 반하더라도 법과 공익을 위해 일한다는 것은... "
"어떤 행위도 이보다 가치 있을 수 없죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/IrseiCaelysse/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "457d3d2a-4415-482f-8c3e-2523ad588439"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun frowns, but he nods to the guard affably.{/n} \"Righteous heart, "
"rotten environment. Take care, guard. Your honor will bring woe upon you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 눈살을 찌푸지만 그는 경비원에게 친절하게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"의로운 마음이지만, 환경이 썩었군. 주의를 기울여라. "
"경비. 너의 명예가 골치가 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Items/IrovettiBookPaladin_Name_String
msgctxt "47b4a003-b187-41d2-b0d5-cc6203b57e54"
msgid "\"Paladin's Final Temptation\" by Noel Lionel"
msgstr "\"성기사의 마지막 유혹\" 노엘 라이오넬 씀"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Items/IrovettiBookPaladin_String
msgctxt "5c08bf91-7a17-4790-9ecb-2c61747ff273"
msgid ""
"\"Exhausted, Ugumash fell upon the tangled sheets with the tired grunt. "
"Sweat poured down his forehead and blinded his eyes, already swollen with "
"fatigue and strain. Or was it his tears? He would prefer the sweat — the "
"spicy perspiration of a warrior and a male. Or, better yet, blood — the "
"blood of his enemies, red and hot, shed in the midst of ferocious fight. But "
"reality stood against his wishes, trying to convince him of what he couldn't "
"accept: that he was lying on the silky sheets, languishing of lust like some "
"beardless youngster. All he could do was jump off the bed without delay and "
"flee this nymph who had bewitched him with magic known only to the most "
"lascivious of women.\n"
"Ugumash's empty stomach lurched with hunger. Yes, that was what he needed! "
"He would happily swallow a big piece of meat in the tavern downstairs. The "
"half-orc sat on the edge of the bed and contemptuously spat sticky saliva on "
"the already soiled plank floor, then glanced at his prey.\n"
"Elieira! That damned witch! The long-legged, curvaceous elf was completely "
"nude, hair caught by a bone dragon. She lay on the bed, her finger drawing "
"intricate patterns along her insatiable body. These beckoning gestures "
"clouded Ugumash's mind. He was unable to think any more, and he could not "
"decide which part of his body craved more immediately for satisfaction.\n"
"'I'd heard a thing or two about half-orcs,' Elieira said, adding oil to the "
"flames. 'But from what I can tell, even best of them can't match mighty "
"Irovetti. It seems as though, after His Majesty, there will be no more "
"miracles in my bed. I suppose I'm destined to content myself with mere "
"shadows from now on. But worry not, my warrior…'\n"
"Ugumash had little time to ponder over Elieira's words, as the normal "
"rumbling sounds of the ground floor of the tavern ceased, as though severed "
"with an axe. It was instinct that compelled Ugumash to reach for the curved "
"sword hidden beneath the clothes on the floor, and a moment later, the door "
"to the room flew open and an ominous shadow appeared on the threshold.\n"
"Ugumash grabbed his weapon and straightened himself, looking the stranger up "
"and down. Shadows do not scare half-orcs — it is their appearance that makes "
"others tremble. The stranger, clad in dusty rags, stepped forward to meet "
"him. His eyes flashed with fierce rage from under the hood, but the sword in "
"his hands shone even more dazzling. The half-orc immediately recognized "
"Albaldir's Retribution — how could he not? But how did it end up in the "
"hands of some tramp?! Comprehending the situation seemed an impossible task "
"for the half-orc, but answers were not what he was after anyway — with a "
"roar, he raised his weapon and rushed toward the intruder ... \""
msgstr ""
"\"지쳐버린 우구마시는 신음과 함께 뒤얽힌 시트에 쓰러졌다. 땀이 그의 이마를 흥건히 적셨고 눈에 들어가 피로와 통증으로 부어 올랐다. "
"아니면 눈물인가? 그는 땀을 좋아한다. 전사이자 남자의 뜨거운 땀 말이다. 아니면 피라고 할까. 적의 뜨겁고 붉게 격렬한 전투에서 "
"흘러내리는 것 말이다. 하지만 현실은 자신의 바램에 반해 받아 들일 수 없는 것을 설득하려고 노력했다. 그는 수염없는 애송이처럼 정욕에 "
"넘어가게 하는 부드러운 시트에 누워 있다. 그가 할 수 있는 일은 지체없이 침대에서 뛰어내리고, 가장 음탕하다고 알려진 여자 님프가 매혹 "
"마법을 걸기 전에 도망치는 것 뿐이었다.\n"
"우구마시의 뱃속은 굶주림에 시달렸다. 그게 가장 필요한 것이다! 그는 술집에서 큰 고기 덩이를 행복하게 먹고 싶어했다. 하프오크는 침대 "
"가장자리에 앉아 이미 오염된 판자 바닥에 끈적끈적한 타액을 뱉어버리고 먹이를 훑어 보았다.\n"
"엘리에라! 저주받은 마녀 같으니! 긴 다리에 몸이 굴곡진 님프는 전라의 몸이었고 머리는 용의 뼈로 고정되어 있었다. 그녀는 침대에 누워 "
"그녀의 탐욕스러운 몸을 손가락으로 훑어내렸다. 그 매혹적인 손짓들은 우구마시의 마음을 흐리게 만들었다. 그는 더 이상 생각할 수 없었고 "
"신체의 어느 부분을 즐겨야 할지 결정할 수 없었다.\n"
"'나는 하프 오크에 대해 들은 것이 있어.' 엘리에라는 불꽃에 기름을 넣으면서 말했다. '내가 들은 것이 전부가 아니라도 최고의 "
"하프오크조차 이로베티와는 대적할 수 없다고 말이야. 정말 그렇게 되면 내 침대에서는 더 이상 기적이 일어나지 않을 거야. 나는 이제 내 "
"그림자를 보며 위안을 삼아야겠지. 하지만 걱정하지 마. 나의 전사... '\n"
"우구마시는 엘리에라의 말을 숙고 할 시간이 별로 없었는데, 술집 1층에 일상으로 들리는 잡담 소리가 마치 도끼로 끊긴 것처럼 멈추었기 "
"때문이었다. 우구마시가 옷 아래 숨겨둔 곡도에 본능처럼 손을 가져갔고 방문이 열렸고 불길한 그림자가 문지방에 나타났다.\n"
"우구마시는 무기를 들고 낯선 사람을 위아래로 훑어보며 똑바로 일어섰다. 그림자는 하프오크들을 겁먹게 하지 않았다. 다른 사람들을 떨게하는 "
"것은 그들의 역할이기 때문이다. 먼지가 덮인 누더기 옷을 입은 낯선 사람은 걸어 나왔다. 그의 눈은 후드 아래에서 격렬한 분노로 "
"번쩍였지만 그의 손에 들린 칼은 더욱 눈부셨다. 하프오크는 발더스의 응징임을 인정하지 않을 수 없었다. 역시나 그였다. 부랑자의 손에 "
"끝나버린 결과는 어떠했는가?! 상황을 이해하는 능력은 하프오크에게는 불가능한 일처럼 보였기에 그는 대답을 포기했다. 포효와 함께 그는 "
"무기를 들고 침입자를 향해 달려들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Items/IrovettiPoemAntology_Name_String
msgctxt "5fc5ba19-1e39-49a5-a1ad-4b6bec93307e"
msgid "\"The Lyre and the Sword: An Anthology of Heroic Pitaxian Poetry\""
msgstr "\"리라의 현과 칼: 피탁스 영웅을 숭배하는 시\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Items/IrovettiPoemAntology_String
msgctxt "97552044-f657-4a5d-ad18-fe52a6e9269a"
msgid ""
"\"Dedication\n"
"When we speak of the fine arts of Pitax, we must always keep in mind our "
"great ruler — King Irovetti, our patron and philanthropist. Poetry means "
"Irovetti and Irovetti means poetry, and so it will always be as long as at "
"least one poet still composes stanzas within these blessed lands.\n"
"The poet's heart is like a fluttering goldfinch in the tender arms of a "
"girl, and within Pitax, the heart of every bard reacts to Irovetti's name "
"with that same fluttering. Each rhyme of this anthology was born under the "
"shadow of the wings of our wise King's fatherly love. Each line is imbued "
"with blood shed on the battlefield beneath the victorious royal banner. Each "
"symbol burns with the heat of the defeated enemies of Pitax.\n"
"We create poetry, and our King helps us to capture that elusive imagery. We "
"fight, and our King covers us with an invisible shield. We set out in search "
"for new lands, and our King waters the parched lips of the tired travelers "
"with life-giving moisture.\n"
"Wherever we are, whatever we do, our ruler is always with us. He soars above "
"us like an invisible guardian angel. And with indescribable pride, we "
"dedicate this collection of poems, 'The Lyre and the Sword,' to that Great "
"Patron of Arts, King Irovetti. May His heavenly azure soul flourish along "
"with His unfading mind and His invulnerable body!\""
msgstr ""
"\"봉납\n"
"우리가 피탁스의 순수 예술에 대해 언급할 때 우리는 항상 우리의 후원자이자 자선가인 이로베티 왕의 위대한 통치를 명심해야 합니다. 시는 "
"이로베티를 의미하고 이로베티는 시를 의미하므로 최후의 시인이 남을 때까지 이 축복받은 땅에서 시를 만드는 일은 계속 될 것입니다.\n"
"시인의 마음은 여자의 부드러운 팔 안에서 지저귀는 카나리아 새와 같고 피탁스에서 모든 음유시인의 마음은 똑같은 지저귐으로 이로베티의 "
"이름에 반응합니다. 이 선집의 각 운은 현명한 왕의 아버지 같은 사랑의 날개 아래에서 태어났습니다. 각 구절은 승리의 왕의 깃발 밑에 "
"펼쳐진 전쟁터에서 흘려진 피로 쓰여졌습니다. 각각의 상징은 패배한 적의 열기로 점화됩니다.\n"
"우리는 시를 만들고 우리의 왕은 그 시상을 떠오르도록 도와줍니다. 우리는 싸우며 우리의 왕은 보이지 않는 방패로 우리를 감싸줍니다. "
"우리는 새로운 땅을 찾아 나서고 왕은 피곤한 우리 여행자들의 말라버린 입술에 생명을 주는 수분을 공급합니다.\n"
"우리가 어디에 있든 우리가 무엇을 하든지 통치자는 항상 우리와 함께합니다. 그는 보이지 않는 수호 천사처럼 우리 위에 솟아 오릅니다. "
"그리고 형언 할 수 없는 자부심으로 우리는 이 시집 '리라의 현과 칼'을 예술의 위대한 후원자인 이로베티 왕에게 바칩니다. 그분의 "
"신성하고 푸른 영혼이 신비로운 마음과 상처없는 몸과 함께 번성하게 하소서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Items/PlayScriptExcerpt_Name_String
msgctxt "2346870b-54a2-47ee-8c2f-4cf31c2bea84"
msgid "\"Tearful Are the Skies\" — Excerpt"
msgstr "\"눈물이 하늘이다\"- 발췌"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Items/PlayScriptExcerpt_String
msgctxt "fe7fbabf-ec59-4546-9688-a1f59fad0709"
msgid ""
"\"INTERIOR OF CASTLE'S HALL — NIGHT\n"
"The fat DUKE paces and frets, looking with concern toward a window. A crowd "
"JEERS outside. FOOL sits upon the floor and watches DUKE with concern. FOOL "
"opens his mouth to speak consoling words but then recoils when the DUKE "
"looks at the FOOL irritably.\n"
"Duke:\tRage, hatred, wrath, and spite they shout below\n"
"\tWhat villain must I be to earn such ire?\n"
"Fool:\tYour Grace, protests this humble fool, I swear.\n"
"\tThe folk, they praise your acts w'out lev'ty\n"
"\tFor's not your deeds that draw to eyes their tears.\n"
"\tNay, you they honor with bright confetti.\n"
"\tWhy ask, your Grace, whose policies they loathe?\n"
"\tOne name, oh Duke, that King-\n"
"Duke:\t\t\t\t-Aha! Send word\n"
"\tTo my finest knight, with blade like blazing\n"
"\tJustice, so burning with red righteousness!\n"
"Fool:\tYour Grace, if one so humble might protest?\n"
"Duke:\tSpeak, Fool.\n"
"Fool:\t\tThat warrior man you deem your best?\n"
"\tHas all the noble heart of drunken wolves\n"
"\tWho chase the shepherd's flock while licking lips\n"
"\tAnd claim they drool for want of the sheep's safety.\n"
"Duke:\tFool, of what know you of laws, lands, and ships?\n"
"\tOur king's word has this knight of his esteem,\n"
"\tAnd yet now here you judge a soldier's worth?\n"
"DUKE raises a hand to strike the FOOL.\n"
"Fool:\tNo hon'r claims he when innocent heads roll\n"
"\tAnd your knight hears anguish yet laughs with mirth.\n"
"Duke:\tNo crime is humor.\n"
"Fool:\t\t\tAye, no crime ‘cept when\n"
"\tSir knight snorts mead at jokes of your Grace's girth\n"
"Duke:\tForsooth! Fetch me my blade and cuirass, Fool\n"
"\tAnd serve as squire to my thirsty vengeance!\n"
"DUKE angrily grabs his sword to find the KNIGHT as the FOOL chases after him "
"with a breastplate in hand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"성의 내부 - 밤\n"
"뚱뚱한 군주는 걱정으로 창문을 보며 서성이며 조바심을 냅니다. 창 밖의 군중은 야유를 합니다. 광대는 바닥에 앉아 군주를 보면서 "
"걱정합니다. 광대는 입을 열어 위로하는 말을 하지만 군주가 광대를 짜증스럽게 바라보자 움츠러듭니다.\n"
"군주: 분노, 증오, 분노를 그들이 소리치지만\n"
"이런 악몽과 같은 현실을 야기한 나의 악행은 무엇인가?\n"
"광대:\t 군주시여. 이 겸손한 광대가 한마디 올립니다.\n"
"\t사람들은 당신의 행위를 칭찬합니다.\n"
"\t그들의 눈물은 군주시여 때문이 아닙니다.\n"
"그들은 밝은 색종이를 뿌리며 군주시여를 명예롭게 합니다.\n"
"그들이 싫어하는 통치가 무엇인지 스스로 물어보십시오.\n"
"한 이름을 군주는 떠올렸습니다.\n"
"군주: 아하!\n"
"정의로움으로 타오르며\n"
"빛나는 검을 지닌 내 최고의 기사에게 전하라.\n"
"광대: 군주시여. 감히 한마디 올려도 되겠나이까?\n"
"군주: 그래. 말해 보거라.\n"
"광대: 당신이 최고라고 생각하는 그 남자 전사는.\n"
"술취한 늑대의 모든 고귀한 마음을 가졌습니다.\n"
"입술을 핥으며 양 떼를 쫓는 늑대 말이지요.\n"
"그리고 그들은 양들의 안전을 원해서 침을 흘린다고 주장합니다.\n"
"군주: 광대야. 법률, 토지, 선적 중 너는 무엇을 아느냐.\n"
"짐은 기사를 존경한다.\n"
"그런데 너는 그 군인의 가치를 판단하는 건가?\n"
"군주는 광대을 때리기 위해 손을 듭니다.\n"
"광대: 무고한 자의 머리가 굴러다닐 때 누구도 간언하지 않습니다.\n"
"그리고 기사는 고뇌를 듣지만 비웃음으로 웃습니다.\n"
"군주: 유머는 범죄가 아니다.\n"
"광대: 예. 범죄가 없습니다.\n"
"전하의 농담을 지껄이며 코웃음 칠 때도요.\n"
"군주:고얀 놈들! 내 칼과 흉갑을 가져와라. 광대야!\n"
"그리고 내 굶주린 복수를 할 때 봉사하라!\n"
"군주는 검을 쥐고 기사를 찾고 광대는 그의 흉갑을 들고 따라다닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Items/TrebricentLetter_Name_String
msgctxt "22d6c2ac-0ad0-48ee-9553-0fdef2a6c91d"
msgid "A Letter from Trebricent to the King of Pitax"
msgstr "트레브리선트가 피탁스의 왕께 보내는 편지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Items/TrebricentLetter_String
msgctxt "35b3e694-fda8-41f6-be23-90f66d6b98e1"
msgid ""
"\"Most wise sovereign of the most thriving kingdom!\n"
"I hasten to inform my King that the secret mission with which you graciously "
"entrusted me has reached its destination. This place's name sounds far from "
"the music of heavenly spheres, and never would I dare risk insulting your "
"eyes with the image of ignoble syllables, but for the sake of accuracy, I "
"must inform you of our location. The settlement is called Littletown (and "
"rightly so, I must add).\n"
"The inn we have settled in for the night in is located at the edge of the "
"forest. In the morning, feathered minstrels delight my ears and the ears of "
"my less talented brethren in pen and rhyme, and I am imbued with the grace "
"of loyalty to my King. Though, the same cannot be said of some of the above-"
"mentioned brethren, whose unworthy mouths have the audacity to express "
"dissatisfaction with their fate. As for me, if it be the royal will, I would "
"kneel before you and read my most refined sonnet, inspired by the local "
"nature, which I enjoy at your command.\n"
"I humbly assure you that my King will never be affected by the shadow of "
"doubt over the fairness of the decision to send your obedient servant on "
"such an important mission, which all of us, by the way — and me most of all —"
" are ready to start immediately!\n"
"With my lowest bow to Your Highness,\n"
"Trebricent of Cordelon\""
msgstr ""
"\"번영하는 왕국의 가장 현명한 주인이시여!\n"
"제게 은혜를 베풀어 주어 비밀 임무가 목적지에 이르렀다는 사실을 왕에게 알리기 위해 서둘러야 했습니다. 이 장소의 이름은 천상의 음악과는 "
"거리가 멀고 나는 볼 가치도 없는 내용을 보여 당신의 눈을 모욕할 염두조차 나지 않지만 정확성을 위해서 감히 우리의 위치를 알립니다. "
"정착지는 리틀타운이라고 불립니다 (저는 꼭 덧붙여야 했음을 알립니다).\n"
"우리가 밤에 도착한 여관은 숲의 가장자리에 있습니다. 아침에는 깃털로 장식한 음유시인이 헛간의 불우한 이웃들과 저의 귀를 즐겁게하고 왕에 "
"대한 충성의 명예를 담은 운율이 내 안을 채웁니다. 하지만 위의 언급된 주민 중 일부는 불경한 입을 놀려 자신의 운명에 대한 불만을 감히 "
"표현하는 것으로 보아 저처럼 즐겁지는 않은 것 같습니다. 나에 관해서는 왕의 뜻이라면 당신 앞에 무릎 꿇고 우리 지역에 영감을 받아 쓴 "
"시를 읽어드려 당신의 명령을 기꺼이 따를 것입니다.\n"
"나는 감히 우리 왕께서 올바른 결정을 내리시어 중요한 임무에 우리와 같은 충직한 종을 보내리라 믿어 의심치 않습니다. 우리 모두는 즉시 "
"시작할 준비가 되어 있습니다!\n"
"전하께 절을 올리며, \n"
"코델론의 트레브리센트.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a84c22c5-c82b-486c-a174-59b645fb541f"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "05764c94-d40c-44f4-99d3-340c236ebfbe"
msgid "\"What is it you sell?\""
msgstr "\"너는 무엇을 파는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e3f7e946-cd70-4a5c-8814-962f7cc1952e"
msgid "\"Who might you recommend I meet here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 누구와 만나야 할지 추천해 줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "d77a0d61-b72f-405e-87ce-80c88a5c0bcb"
msgid ""
"\"I've heard few curious words — 'Bloodbrush extract'... and that you're no "
"ordinary salesman, and your wares are far from mundane.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 '핏자루 추출물'이라는 흥미로운 물건에 대해 들었다. 너는 평범한 장사꾼이 아니며, 네가 파는 물건은 평범함과 거리가 멀다는 "
"의미지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "d996e097-1d85-4b96-bc40-a387e572ece8"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "6808707c-a62f-4fd8-9e4d-18e270d23410"
msgid "[Attack] \"Die, you dirty thief!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"죽어라. 더러운 도둑!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "38f6978c-a0cf-44f0-905a-ce3ff2ed0caf"
msgid "\"Have you ever tried this bloodbrush extract?\""
msgstr "\"핏자루 추출물을 사용해 보았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "8471ed8e-33b5-4643-bf8a-bb794ba7ad27"
msgid ""
"\"How about you stay away from that junk, all right? It kills pretty fast, "
"and I need you alive.\""
msgstr "\"그 쓰레기를 버리는 게 어때? 그것은 네 명을 재촉하지만 나는 네가 살아있기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "f3466efb-862c-4543-a184-90d35f0891c3"
msgid "\"That's out of the question. In fact, get away from him!\""
msgstr "\"말도 안 되는군. 그에게서 떨어져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "7e3debfd-479a-42ba-9a3e-18949c1a14c5"
msgid "\"Reg, leave the poor guy alone! Let's go have some wine instead!\""
msgstr "\"레지. 그 불쌍한 사람을 내버려둬! 대신 포도주나 마시자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "a8f109c8-2e46-46e8-a13f-70cf097c78bc"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome's yellow, bloodshot eyes scan the faces in the room nervously. "
"Noticing you, he grabs for his sealed sheath.{/n} \"What?! Who are you? Oh, "
"it's Your Royal Highness? Forgive me, I... I didn't recognize you. An honor. "
"Truly, a huge honor. I'm... I'm Kharne Vereel, a simple salesman.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움의 노랗고 충혈된 눈은 방 안의 사람들을 신경질적으로 탐색합니다. 당신을 알아 차렸을 때 그는 봉인된 칼집을 잡았습니다.{/n} "
"\"음?! 너 누구야? 오. {name}? 용서해줘. 알아보지 못했군. 이렇게 만나다니. 정말 대단한 영광이라구. 나는... 칸 "
"베릴이다. 장사꾼이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "fb9cb85a-610f-4aef-ba52-34bf3eb2218f"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome looks at you, suspicion in his little yellow eyes.{/n} \"You "
"again?! I mean, what can I do for you, Your Highness?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움은 작은 노란 눈으로 당신을 의심스럽게 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"또 너야?! 아니. 내 말은. 너를 위해 내가 뭘 할 수 있을까?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "2ccd7f32-d1e0-4789-9c4d-28dd4933ec67"
msgid ""
"\"I told you already!\" {n}The gnome's voice rises in anger.{/n} \"I'm a "
"simple salesman! Not rich, not noble... Why would a {mf|king|queen} concern "
"{mf|him|her}self with me? {mf|He|She} wouldn't!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 벌써 말했잖아!\" {n}노움의 언성이 분노로 높아집니다.{/n} \"나는 그냥 장사꾼이야! 부자도 아니고 귀족도 아닌데... "
"왜 {mf|왕|여왕}이 나 따위에 관심을 가지는 거야? 절대 그렇지 않을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "cc288870-6be2-45e5-927a-b2bd4b61ce56"
msgid "\"What do you care?! Fish, and the like.\""
msgstr "\"네가 무슨 상관이야?! 물고기 같은 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "39afa98b-f5e4-43d1-a919-637fdc5e9ad7"
msgid ""
"\"No one! Everyone! How should I know?! I'm just a simple salesman. Leave me "
"be!\""
msgstr "\"아무도 아니야! 모두 그래! 내가 어떻게 알았지? 나는 그냥 평범한 장사꾼이야. 나를 내버려 둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "6b3a601e-5118-4875-b5bd-4f7f4d2122b8"
msgid ""
"\"Quiet! Quiet, I say!\" {n}Gripping his sheath tightly, the gnome looks "
"around anxiously before whispering,{/n} \"Too many people here... Too many "
"eyes, ears... You want to talk business, find me out in {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. "
"I... I'll remember you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"조용히 해! 조용하라구!\" {n}칼집을 단단히 잡은 노움은 속삭이기 전에 걱정스럽게 주위를 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"너무 많은 "
"사람들이 여기에 있어... 너무 많은 눈과 귀가 있어... 사업 얘기를 하고 싶으면 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에서 나를 찾아. 너를 "
"기억할게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "33215ff3-8df8-4109-bc48-f9afd4cdc1c6"
msgid "\"Yes, yes, Your Highness. A great honor... Go, have fun!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 알았다고. 가서 재밌게 놀아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3b66a5af-f1df-45ce-98fd-a1c4f0f83781"
msgid ""
"\"You got any of that stuff on you? Just a little bit?\" {n}Regongar "
"whispers suggestively, winking to the gnome.{/n}"
msgstr "\"너 좀 가지고 있어? 조금이라도?\" {n}레곤가르는 무언가 암시하는 것처럼 속삭이며 노움에게 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "43b960e7-75e8-4534-a3bc-6b95158bb6e4"
msgid ""
"\"Nah, never — so that's why I want to try it! Why not? We only live once!\""
msgstr "\"한 번도 없어. 그래서 정말 좋은 거지! 한 번 쯤이야! 우리는 한 번 밖에 살 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "2b7fc47c-44ff-4dbe-8646-cd27026cfe6d"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc mumbles,{/n} \"Yeah, sure you do... Who needs me at all? "
"This way I'd at least die from pleasure, instead of a sword...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프오크가 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"그래. 물론 그렇겠지... 누가 나 따위를 필요로 하지? 최소한 나는 칼 대신에 쾌락으로 죽을 "
"거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "2305c780-068e-4538-8bca-aa872e7f35bf"
msgid ""
"\"Die wherever you want, just keep away from me! I told you, I've got "
"nothing!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 죽든 간에 나에게서 멀리 떨어져! 내가 말했지. 나는 아무것도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "39c1c6b1-7234-42bd-8c58-87fa7a99b8e1"
msgid "\"Fine, fine... just asking!\" {n}Regongar turns away resentfully.{/n}"
msgstr "\"좋아. 좋아... 그냥 물어 본 거야!\" {n}레곤가르는 분개하며 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5208d146-04e9-43f1-aa89-62561159627e"
msgid ""
"\"Wine? Now that's an idea... Ha ha, fine, let's go do it! Ha, gnome, I "
"thought you knew your business! Who turns away buyers?\""
msgstr "\"포도주라고? 좋은 생각이야... 하하. 좋았어. 가자고! 네 사업을 알고 있을 줄 알았어! 장사 안하는 장사꾼이 어딨어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KharneVereel/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "74f5ef59-a9ee-4102-add5-3c67166ba368"
msgid ""
"\"I do! I told you I got nothing! Now leave me alone! Out! Get out of here!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 아무것도 없다고 했잖아! 이제 내버려둬! 나가! 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "885363da-eb2c-4181-b00b-5d7645e4d58d"
msgid "\"It isn't my fault — I was attacked!\""
msgstr "\"그건 내 잘못이 아니야. 나는 공격 당했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "5f23f727-cce1-4219-a04b-0083ba7e0d80"
msgid "\"You don't tell me what to do! I'll fight whoever I want!\""
msgstr "\"나에게 이래라 저래라 말하지 마라! 나는 내가 원하는 사람과 싸울 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "fbe2dd56-cad9-4afc-96f4-4bc0cdc75793"
msgid ""
"\"This is a misunderstanding. There was no fight — I'm sure we can sort "
"everything out here and now.\""
msgstr "\"오해야. 싸움은 없었어. 나는 여기에서 모든 것을 다 정리할 수 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fb122fae-3ef4-40a0-975f-4fc2fea1288b"
msgid ""
"{n}A crowd gathers, attracted by the noise and screams. All the guests "
"brought bodyguards, and you soon find yourself surrounded by a small army — "
"not even counting Irovetti's guard. It isn't long before the king of "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} himself shows up.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}군중이 소음과 비명에 이끌려 모입니다. 손님들은 모두 경호원을 데리고 왔고 곧 당신은 작은 군대에 둘러싸여 있음을 알게 되었습니다. "
"이로베티의 경비를 빼더라도요. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 왕이 나타나기 전에 벌어진 일이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "414b4788-fb93-4ea1-8616-13e1ddfa13b3"
msgid ""
"\"What is this? A fight? At my tournament? Unheard of! Scandalous! A slap in "
"the face — not just to me, but to each of my deeply respected guests! For "
"shame! Disgraceful!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게 뭐야? 싸움이 일어나다니! 그것도 내 토너먼트에서? 들은 적도 없는 이야기인데! 부끄러운 일이 벌어졌군. 이건 나 뿐만 아니라 "
"내 존경받는 손님들에게도 모욕이야! 수치스럽군! 불쾌해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "9ebeccce-0d62-48bc-a251-822c6255e3cc"
msgid ""
"\"A lie! Lying to my face! I already know what happened here — you drew your "
"weapon first, broke my seal! Trampled on the spirit of peace and friendship "
"that has always reigned at my tournaments! Stomped on my trust!\""
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말하지 마! 나의 면전에 대고 거짓말이라니! 무슨 일이 있었는지 벌써 알고 있다. 무기를 꺼내 안전을 위협하다니! 너는 내 "
"토너먼트에서 항상 존재했던 평화와 우정의 정신을 짓밟았다! 너는 내 신뢰를 꺾었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "e72e4f7c-fc02-4dc9-9892-63df7ce22666"
msgid ""
"{n}Irovetti ostentatiously covers his face with his hand.{/n} \"Unheard of. "
"Monstrous! I cannot condone this.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이로베티는 과장하여 그의 얼굴을 손으로 감싸쥡니다.{/n} \"들어본 적도 없다. 이 흉악한 놈아! 나는 이 일을 용납할 수 없다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "a6226005-ff3a-4381-803a-4282a5b55e05"
msgid ""
"{n}He sighs bitterly before loudly announcing,{/n} \"It breaks my heart, but "
"I must take all possible measures to protect my precious guests. Alas, "
"today's celebration was attended by a crowned barbarian — a monster, "
"incapable of peacefully participating in high society. It is with a heavy "
"heart that I must announce that the tournament is canceled. With this "
"monster present, I simply cannot guarantee this celebration won't turn into "
"a bloodbath!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}큰소리로 발표하기 전에 그는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"내 마음이 아프지만 나는 소중한 손님을 보호하기 위해 모든 조치를 취해야 "
"한다. 아아. 오늘 축하 행사에 상류층 사회에 평화를 깨는 불청객이 참석했다. 이 야만인이 계속 머문다면 축하연은 피바다가 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "87b9d03d-e59b-418f-bbb6-a51b55cc4e19"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowd mutters with disappointment as Irovetti nods you toward the "
"exit.{/n} \"Leave. Just leave. We won't stoop to your level by tainting this "
"feast day with further violence. But know this — you are welcome here no "
"longer!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}군중들은 이로베티가 당신을 보고 출구를 향해 끄덕이자 실망스러워 웅성입니다.{/n} \"떠나라. 지금 당장. 너의 장난에 놀아나지 "
"않고 더 이상 폭력 없이 축제의 날을 쉴 것이다. 이것은 알아둬라. 너를 이제 더 이상은 환영하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "75a7f736-4205-4607-a6cd-c1d2a2e7dcac"
msgid ""
"\"No fight, you say? But then why is the seal on your sheath broken? The "
"very seal that has long symbolized the spirit of peace and friendship that "
"reigns over my tournaments! You broke it with your own hand, and along with "
"it, the feeble flower of our trust!\""
msgstr ""
"\"싸우지 말자고? 그런데 왜 칼집의 봉인을 깨었지? 그 봉인은 오랫동안 평화와 우정의 정신을 상징하고 내 토너먼트를 지키는 것이었어! "
"너는 네 손으로 우리 신뢰의 상징을 부수었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "b22a7ee5-d4e8-4eec-8092-6ddbfe6cbb46"
msgid ""
"\"Do you hear that, lords and ladies? Do you hear, my respected guests? You "
"can put a crown on an owlbear, but it will still reveal itself the moment it "
"opens its beak. And the people of {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} found {mf|him|her}, "
"this bloodthirsty beast, worthy of a royal title?\""
msgstr ""
"\"여러분 방금 들으셨습니까? 존경하는 여러분, 들으셨습니까? 아울베어의 머리에 왕관을 씌울 수는 있지만, 부리를 열면 그 본성이 "
"드러날겁니다. 그리고 {mf|그|그녀}를 옹립한 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 여러분, 피에 굶주린 괴물에게 고귀한 작위를 가질 "
"자격이 있다고 보십니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "384bdc18-a384-4e58-81df-e5e6ca30b8ec"
msgid ""
"\"What is this? Thievery? Infiltration? Espionage, here, right in my "
"personal camp? Or an assassination attempt?! Unheard of! Scandalous! A slap "
"in the face — not just to me, but to each of my deeply respected guests! For "
"shame! Disgraceful!\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금 뭐하는 짓이지? 네 놈은 도둑질이나 침입을 하러 온 건가? 아니면 내 캠프에서 첩자 짓을 하거나 암살을 하려고 온 건가?! 이런 "
"짓은 들어 본 적도 없고 수치스럽다! 내 얼굴에 대고 모욕을 하는 것과 다를 바 없어! 수치스럽군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "755c76c3-9acb-4b1d-b5ff-964d9ffa2a4b"
msgid ""
"\"I cannot believe that you, whom I trusted from the bottom of my heart, "
"would betray my trust so! Using the revelry and peace of our friendship to "
"prepare a deadly trap for your host! Tell me — what did you have in store? A "
"dagger? A garrote? Bomb? Poison, perhaps? No, no, don't say a thing — I "
"don't want to know!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 마음 깊숙한 곳에서부터 믿었는데 내 믿음을 져 버렸어! 우정과 평화를 이용하여 주최자를 위험에 빠트리다니! 무엇을 숨기고 "
"있었지? 비수나 독약을 가지고 있었더라도 나는 알고 싶지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "20b6cdae-6ba9-472b-b14e-b0cb104b13ad"
msgid ""
"\"Listen here, you crowned boar! You should be thankful {Name} even showed "
"up at your stinking tournament!\" {n}Regongar spits at Irovetti's feet.{/n} "
"\"Sure, we'll go. The food is shit, and the entertainment's only good for "
"someone who got dropped on their head as a child. But we'll be back, you "
"hear me? And when we are, we'll be sure to cut some royal bacon off you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"들어라 왕관 쓴 돼지 새끼들아! 네 더러운 토너먼트에 모습을 드러낸 {Name}에게 감사해야 한다.\" {n}레곤가르는 이로베티의 발 "
"주위에 침을 뱉습니다.{/n} \"물론. 가고 말고. 음식은 형편 없고 토너먼트는 아이처럼 왕관을 쓴 자에게만 재미있어. 하지만 우리는 "
"돌아올거야. 내 말 들려? 우리가 돌아올 때 비싼 것만 처 먹고 자란 네 몸뚱이를 베어주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "eaff1b95-1e8b-4778-b7c8-8bb66682b75e"
msgid "\"Farewell — and I hope forever!\""
msgstr "\"잘가라! 다시는 보지 말자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/KickedOut/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "f8083f96-67a5-4ce6-ac0d-778bdb3a0bec"
msgid "\"Oh, yes... I see you've found companions worthy of you!\""
msgstr "\"그래... 네게 어울리는 친구로군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "88fdbb93-fdc8-41fe-a270-cf7a0b72275f"
msgid "\"Tell me about the Rushlight tournament.\""
msgstr "\"러시라이트 토너먼트에 관해 대답해봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d3ffad0f-1f9c-4984-a2bd-6ee3202d1620"
msgid "\"What events are on the schedule?\""
msgstr "\"일정은 어떻게 되지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "002f4441-47d2-4700-a26e-e14814789689"
msgid "\"I'm ready to participate in the fisher's triathlon.\""
msgstr "\"어부 3종 경기에 참가하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "221436ca-a3e7-473e-96b8-b019e1101f3b"
msgid "\"I'm ready to participate in the boasting contest.\""
msgstr "\"자랑하기 대회에 참가하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "56142792-b7ed-455b-81dc-2128317f3aee"
msgid "\"I'm ready to participate in the drunken melee.\""
msgstr "\"취권 대회에 참가하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9841d863-ee3b-4101-89dc-b31525704767"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "483c7263-d762-43b3-9f99-7d3bfdf10165"
msgid "[Leave the tournament] \"I'm leaving.\""
msgstr "[토너먼트를 떠납니다] \"나는 가야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "8bd6aa32-c17f-4212-ad07-7c864950c65f"
msgid "\"I've changed my mind. I'll stay.\""
msgstr "\"마음을 바꿨다. 머물 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "1e7d8c54-6659-4c64-bc43-bb5ce39b3272"
msgid "\"Yes, I must leave immediately. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"그래, 나는 당장 떠나야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "dbe06b8b-a66c-491f-8d11-9d740affa2e6"
msgid "\"The tournament is finished, isn't it? I'd like to know who won.\""
msgstr "\"토너먼트가 끝났지? 누가 이겼는지 알고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "057e5f8d-9fa0-48cc-ac9d-805196cb0dc7"
msgid ""
"\"Your Royal Highness, welcome to the Rushlight tournament! My name is "
"Nunzio Arpaia, and I have the honor of being His Highness King Irovetti's "
"master of ceremonies. You could say the organization of this tournament "
"rests on my shoulders. If you need anything, I'm at your disposal!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하, 러시라이트 토너먼트에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 저는 눈치오 아르파이아이며, 이로베티 전하의 진행을 맡는 영광을 얻었습니다. 이 "
"토너먼트의 조직은 저의 책임이라 말할 수 있죠. 필요한 게 있으시다면, 언제든지 말씀해주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "3a63c988-b3d3-447a-9f2a-03e1dc2b91df"
msgid "\"What can I do for you?\""
msgstr "\"무엇이 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "a996f3f1-5b73-4790-9918-2b7387b5f5d5"
msgid ""
"\"The tournament consists of three contests. First, the participants will "
"display their strength and dexterity in the fisher's triathlon, a tribute to "
"local crafts and trades, so to speak. Then we'll be measuring competitors' "
"wits in the boasting contest — there's a reason we're the cultural capital "
"of the region, after all! And finally, the evening will wrap up with some "
"mock combat in the drunken melee. Then His Magesty will announce the winner "
"of the tournament, and we'll all enjoy a festive banquet followed by a "
"splendid fireworks show!\""
msgstr ""
"\"토너먼트는 세 가지 대회로 구성됩니다. 첫째는 어부 3종 경기입니다, 참가자들은 그들의 힘과 민첩함을 겨루게되죠. 지역 장인과 "
"무역인들을 기리기 위해 만들어졌습니다. 그 뒤, 저희는 자랑하기 대회에서 참가자의 재치를 측정하죠, 이는 바로 저희가 문화 수도라 불리는 "
"이유입니다! 마지막으로, 저녁에는 취권 대회에서 한바탕 한 후에 끝납니다. 그러면 전하께서 토너먼트의 승자를 발표하고, 이어서 화려한 "
"불꽃 놀이와 함께 축제 연회를 즐기시면 되죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "10a97355-b881-4d6b-9052-95e52be38ffa"
msgid "\"Let's begin!\""
msgstr "\"시작해 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "b66728ed-14ab-4e21-b1c8-30bb01293db5"
msgid "\"Everyone's ready — let's begin!\""
msgstr "\"준비! 시작!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "dd9c6dcb-3136-47ef-be01-9a324c9c00e8"
msgid "\"Then let's begin — it will be splendid!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 시작하지. 훌륭하겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "6edf30b4-d666-42cd-bbb4-296914063dd7"
msgid "\"I'm always at your service.\""
msgstr "\"기꺼이 돕겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "142b1036-4a02-4865-8d0c-ef37dc579fe8"
msgid ""
"\"Since starting his reign over {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, His Highness King "
"Irovetti has held this tournament once in several years, inviting guests "
"from the high society of nearby kingdoms to attend. Today, we have guests "
"from Daggermark, {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g}, Gralton, and Tymon. Unfortunately, "
"{g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} did not honor us with their representatives this year — "
"it's entirely possible that recent events and the stressful political "
"climate have put them in a less than festive mood. But we're pleased to have "
"Your Highness in attendance for the first — and I hope not the last — time "
"this year!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 통치하기 시작한 이후, 이로베티 전하께서는 몇 년에 한 번 이 대회를 개최하여 이웃 왕국의 고귀한 "
"사람을 초청합니다. 오늘 저희는 대거마크, {g|Mivon}미본{/g}, 그랄튼, 타이몬에서 손님을 맞았습니다. 안타깝게도, "
"{g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}는 최근에 일어났던 사건과 정치적 이슈로 인해 축제에 참가하지 않았죠. 그러나 저희는 당신께서 이번 해에 "
"처음으로 참석하게 되어 기쁩니다. 그리고 이번이 마지막이 아니길 바랍니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "e0602c18-11f9-41af-b62e-5ec0b7c1c201"
msgid ""
"\"Already? But the tournament hasn't concluded yet! You haven't had the "
"chance to see our fireworks display!\""
msgstr "\"벌써 가십니까? 하지만 토너먼트는 아직 끝나지도 않았습니다! 저희 불꽃 놀이의 장관을 목격할 기회도 놓치시겠죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "1eab0f74-a739-4db4-912d-1e7ff17ad67e"
msgid "\"You're too kind, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"정말 친절하시군요, 전하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "a8d50b9f-fd85-4f6e-9674-55c1c2b7db2f"
msgid "\"Such a pity! Well... perhaps next year. Have a safe journey!\""
msgstr "\"안타깝습니다! 내년을 기약해야겠군요. 안전한 여행 되시기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "e3ed0e36-ae2d-412e-a9ce-55e2bb015bf4"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, His Highness is just about to make a speech announcing the winner! "
"Look, everyone's gathering around now!\""
msgstr "\"전하가 우승자를 알리는 연설을 하고 있다. 모두 모이고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "9b6146cc-16bc-4da2-9f01-6c2a5e40ff85"
msgid "\"And what about flyting? I'm good at that!\""
msgstr "\"시 대결은 어때? 나는 시를 잘 짓지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MasterCeremonies/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bc2c675c-20fc-4eea-9887-35890d4fdd87"
msgid ""
"\"Flyting was likely canceled due to my arrival, I suspect. More's the pity —"
" I lost the chance to earn myself a second death sentence!\""
msgstr "\"시 대결은 내가 와서 취소될 가능성이 높다. 더 안타까운 사실은 두 번째 사형 선고를 받을 수 있는 기회를 놓쳤어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Bookmaker_battle_start_String
msgctxt "dc75337f-df78-4e79-8619-1311b49b34ff"
msgid "\"Let the battle commence!\""
msgstr "\"전투를 시작하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Bookmaker_shout_1_String
msgctxt "84a5ef07-bd1f-4896-8c57-cccdf40e7e87"
msgid "\"Come one, come all!\""
msgstr "\"한 명이 오면, 모두가 올지어니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Bookmaker_shout_2_String
msgctxt "7da3ff54-13e2-48db-9577-48fb82025faf"
msgid "\"A battle of spellcasters! Secrets of the unknown!\""
msgstr "\"마법 대결이다! 미지의 비밀이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Bookmaker_shout_3_String
msgctxt "413d20e8-2531-46bf-a54a-dac1a55e83b3"
msgid "\"Place your bets!\""
msgstr "\"돈을 걸어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Bookmaker_win_Myst_String
msgctxt "326bce60-6564-4a96-9b62-41c7f2f5d15f"
msgid "\"The battle is over! Mysteriado wins!\""
msgstr "\"전투가 끝났어! 미스테리아도 승리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Bookmaker_win_Zyn_String
msgctxt "d65f5db9-063c-4acf-8b5e-87169086fb9b"
msgid "\"The battle is over! Zynmyrgya wins!\""
msgstr "\"전투가 끝났어! 준무르과 승리!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Myst_battle_start_String
msgctxt "1e42d4b3-bebe-4bbc-bdf5-dfbfeae3bec7"
msgid "\"May the blaze of the Hells consume my foes!\""
msgstr "\"지옥의 불길이 내 원수를 소탕하기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Myst_lose_String
msgctxt "29e1580f-7942-4763-ab76-4b731ce62545"
msgid "\"My revenge shall make you tremble!\""
msgstr "\"내 복수가 너를 겁먹게 만들 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Myst_win_String
msgctxt "8566e104-1655-4bdb-9957-48738a1a0039"
msgid "\"Such is the power of the inferno!\""
msgstr "\"지옥의 힘이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Prank_Bookmaker_String
msgctxt "cd715901-72e1-4850-8e9f-be80669e2928"
msgid ""
"\"Who dares to interfere in one of our fights? Show yourselves! Let us see "
"your face! No, seriously — show yourselves, or I'll call the guards!\""
msgstr "\"감히 누가 우리의 싸움을 방해하지? 모습을 드러내 정체를 밝혀라! 모습을 드러내지 않으면 경비를 부르겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Prank_Myst_String
msgctxt "eb2bbfa7-872f-418c-99ef-85ce87c37d2c"
msgid ""
"\"The gates of the ninety-nine hells open! Behold, for it comes! ...I said, "
"it comes!\""
msgstr "\"아흔 아홉 개의 지옥의 문이 열린다! 보라. 그것이 온다... 그것이 온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Prank_Zyn_String
msgctxt "fcb82d95-c908-4dc2-8da9-17325f6c1b6f"
msgid "\"Hey! What the hell? What's going on here?!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 뭐하는 짓이야! 무슨 일이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Zyn_battle_start_String
msgctxt "ce47cae4-fa36-4161-a948-6d67d0f28843"
msgid "\"I shall smite you with the fury of an astral tempest!\""
msgstr "\"별빛 폭풍의 분노로 너를 벌하리라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Zyn_lose_String
msgctxt "da18f92c-2560-4de2-bbb9-05831cf26b58"
msgid "\"This won't be our last battle!\""
msgstr "\"전투는 끝나지 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Barks/Zyn_win_String
msgctxt "2739228f-aadc-466c-a0e3-3719a7e054e0"
msgid "\"My victory was foretold in the stars!\""
msgstr "\"내 승리는 별이 예언했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bid_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "ae5002dc-2677-4b3b-9ec5-c2842d773c1e"
msgid "Mephit Battle"
msgstr "메피트 전투"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/BlueTeamBid_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "85c79849-4511-4112-a130-6d0727cae88e"
msgid "\"Bet 500 gold coins on the blue team.\""
msgstr "\"청팀에 500골드 걸겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "b58b647b-a576-4118-8787-2cf8e17af4fb"
msgid "\"What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "25e61b34-ca41-4a72-8466-a81bc8817ad2"
msgid "\"What are the rules of your game?\""
msgstr "\"게임의 규칙은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "531f10a1-ee2e-4963-bc77-046276e843d5"
msgid "[Give 500 gold] \"My bet's on Mysteriado.\""
msgstr "[500골드를 줍니다] \"미스테리아도에 500골드 걸겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9058ba0f-b33a-4c2b-b754-dd20c2a13c22"
msgid "[Give 500 gold] \"My bet's on Zynmyrgya.\""
msgstr "[500골드를 줍니다] \"준무르과에 500골드 걸겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "cbe113e8-d3a1-4995-8611-7fc435ca7f4b"
msgid "[Attack] \"You filthy hacks! I'll teach you a lesson!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"더러운 녀석! 교훈을 가르쳐 주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "35dd2cca-f931-475d-890e-c9d4c90b2df1"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "969608c2-6d7b-4f83-a9da-7d2db08a5c13"
msgid "Prohibited Octavia from pranking the mephit summoners."
msgstr "옥타비아가 메피트 소환사를 괴롭히지 못하게 막습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "f3f26ddf-5810-4ddd-a868-46977d9ab7c3"
msgid ""
"\"Don't. And you'd better return that scroll to whomever you 'found' it from."
"\""
msgstr "\"그러지 마. 누구에게서 가져왔는지 몰라도 그 두루마리를 돌려줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "f8b10af9-0860-412d-bea9-0fe2107275b2"
msgid ""
"\"Let's not. Being thrown out of the tournament is the last thing we need.\""
msgstr "\"그만 두자. 토너먼트에서 쫓겨나는 것이 우리가 필요로 하는 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "8fb6925e-12e5-4271-8820-14544c494812"
msgid "Allowed Octavia to prank the mephit summoners."
msgstr "옥타비아가 메피트 소환사를 괴롭히는 것을 허락합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "e8b3f54a-3b0a-4473-a07f-4a77515ffcd4"
msgid "\"Do whatever you want.\""
msgstr "\"마음대로 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "99958ee2-3b53-493b-b1fb-7979f8d2451e"
msgid "\"Great idea! Go for it!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이야! 재밌겠는 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "710c894c-25ce-4092-a4e5-84f756474041"
msgid ""
"\"Do it! I hope the scroll has something like fireball or poisonous cloud!\""
msgstr "\"해 봐! 두루마리가 파이어볼이나 독성 구름 같은 것이면 좋겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1ae9abda-741d-4539-9b6d-bf3c031f1658"
msgid ""
"\"Come, come, don't be shy! Witness secrets not meant for mortal eyes! An "
"aetherial battle within a vortex of the supernatural! Bets here — place your "
"bets!\""
msgstr ""
"\"어서 와! 한 번 보면 잊혀지지 않을 장면들이 펼쳐지지! 초자연적인 소용돌이 속에서 열렬한 전투가 벌어진다구! 어서 돈을 걸어보지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "e4377055-5300-4db0-bee9-ec0b2c015010"
msgid ""
"\"Oooh, something special indeed! I'd wager you've never seen the like! "
"Before your eyes unfolds an epic battle between the world's greatest "
"spellcasters — Mysteriado, the Devil Tamer of {g|Cheliax}Cheliax{/g}, versus "
"Zynmyrgya, Magistress of the {g|Irrisen}Irrisen{/g} Witches! Who will win? "
"Who would you bet on?\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말 대단한 전투가 될 거야! 네가 결코 보지 못했던 것이라 장담하지! 세계에서 가장 위대한 마법사 {g|Cheliax}첼리악스{/g}"
"의 데블 조련사 미스테리아도와 {g|Irrisen}이리센{/g}의 마녀인 준무르과의 대결이 눈 앞에 펼쳐지지! 누가 이길까? 누구에게 "
"내기를 걸겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "fb204d6c-9ddd-4014-9fb3-3e295b6d3fc0"
msgid ""
"\"You think this just a game? I wouldn't be so sure! The rules for you are "
"simple enough, though — choose one of the spellcasters, and place your bet. "
"If you guess the winner, you double your wager! If you're wrong, the gold is "
"mine.\""
msgstr ""
"\"단지 게임이라고 생각하나? 나는 그렇게 생각하지 않아! 그래도 규칙은 간단하지. 마법사 중 한 명을 선택하고 내기를 하면 돼. 네가 "
"지면 골드는 내 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "04d70984-dfb9-4ff3-8204-f181733e4dd4"
msgid "\"Bets are set — no more bets! Let the battle commence!\""
msgstr "\"베팅이 종료되었어. 더 이상 베팅 하지 마! 전투를 시작하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "9ac38ae4-91fa-4e8d-a005-db6c563abad6"
msgid "\"Help! Guards! Guards!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘! 경비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ece6332b-9a1c-4feb-9c0a-745628e5f51c"
msgid "\"Thank you! Please enjoy the tournament.\""
msgstr "\"고마워! 토너먼트를 즐기라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "9e87987f-e9c3-4d85-903e-43feaae6df98"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, it's you! My apologies, but I'm afraid you're just too lucky. My "
"pockets are empty — you won all I had! So I can't accept any more bets — "
"though you can still enjoy the battle!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오! 너로군! 미안하지만 네가 운이 억세게 좋을까봐 겁나는군. 내 지갑은 비었어. 내 돈을 모두 땄다고! 그래서 나는 더이상 베팅하지 "
"못해. 하지만 전투를 즐기라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ff4dfd23-3b6c-4311-9037-d67987f4bd79"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia moves very close to you and, barely suppressing her laughter, "
"whispers,{/n} \"Some charlatans, huh? Can I teach them a lesson? I... "
"'found' an interesting scroll here. Shall we see how they like it?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신에게 아주 가까이 접근하고는 간신히 웃음이 터지는 것을 참으며 속삭입니다.{/n} \"사기꾼들인데? 내가 그들에게 "
"교훈을 가르쳐 줘도 될까? 내가... 여기에서 흥미로운 두루마리를 발견했거든. 그들이 어떻게 좋아하는지 볼까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5486f320-8e2b-41b6-a172-068a3bb9cb8a"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh, you're so bloodthirsty! No, it's nothing like that — just a harmless "
"joke... Look!\""
msgstr "\"너 너무 잔인한 걸! 아무것도 아니야. 그냥 사소한 장난이야. 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "cd0df340-eea0-459e-ab2b-d861c991d118"
msgid ""
"\"You're such a bore! It's a holiday, have some fun for once in your life! "
"Come on, smile!\""
msgstr "\"너 너무 지루해! 휴일이니 인생을 한 번이라도 재미있게 놀아 봐! 어서! 웃어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/Bookmaker/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e44d70d5-035b-4b67-b16b-b1acfe3a0406"
msgid "{n}Octavia giggles.{/n} \"Let's see what happens!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아가 깔깔거립니다.{/n} \"어떻게 되는지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/MephitBattle/RedTeamBid_ShortDescription_String
msgctxt "e5fed317-eec4-4b10-ac1e-e8c37c7fc7b3"
msgid "\"Bet 500 gold coins on the red team.\""
msgstr "\"적팀에 500골드 걸겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4aee9935-9a28-41af-96a6-85e6cc164625"
msgid "\"You were less polite the last time we spoke.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 마지막으로 얘기했을 때 너 예의가 없었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "79c53d60-5704-497c-96ab-785222349be9"
msgid ""
"\"So we meet again, and not on the battlefield... Assuming this tournament "
"isn't a trap, of course.\""
msgstr "\"전쟁터가 아니라 여기서 다시 만났군... 이 대회가 함정이 아니라는 가정하에 말이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "b9886621-bad3-44a2-aed7-3c21ede3b678"
msgid ""
"\"So Irovetti considers me a rival? I didn't think I'd given him any cause "
"for a feud.\""
msgstr "\"그래서 이로베티는 나를 경쟁자라고 생각하는가? 나는 그와 다툴 이유가 없다고 생각했는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "cb168257-b115-42a6-9932-226e58652856"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't the first year the tournament's been held — why was I just "
"invited this year?\""
msgstr "\"토너먼트가 개최된 건 처음이 아니지. 왜 나는 올해 처음 초청되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "a0e42da9-a941-44ab-bae3-89124deb10f4"
msgid "\"At least you're honest with me. I appreciate the warning.\""
msgstr "\"적어도 솔직히 말해주었군. 경고는 고맙게 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "6f435ced-7392-4f3e-b204-1d67fd37b95e"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "50e39511-1378-44b0-be27-47d00a197923"
msgid "[Attack] \"Your face disgusts me! Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"역겨운 얼굴 치워라! 죽어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "bf15634e-1b62-4f63-bb6a-9998e529b0dc"
msgid ""
"{n}The man standing before you seems to spend a great deal of time "
"perfecting his appearance. His cheeks and forehead are generously powdered, "
"his hair is slicked back, and his carefully waxed mustache curls up "
"rakishly.{/n} \"Why, if it isn't {mf|King|Queen} {Name}! We meet at last. I "
"paid a visit to your kingdom while it was still a barony, but alas, I had no "
"chance to meet you. I'm Stefano Moskoni, confidant to King Irovetti.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 서 있는 남자는 외모를 완성하는 데 많은 시간을 할애하는 것 같습니다. 그의 뺨과 이마는 아낌없이 분칠이 되어있고 그의 "
"머리카락은 매끈하게 뒤로 넘겼고 조심스럽게 왁스칠한 콧수염은 방탕하게 말려 올라갑니다.{/n} \"{mf|왕|여왕} {Name}이시군요! "
"마침내 뵙게 되었습니다. 저는 아직 영지이던 시절 당신의 왕국을 방문한 적이 있지만, 슬프게도 당신을 만날 기회가 없었죠. 저는 스테파노 "
"모스코니이고, 이로베티 왕의 친구입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "866d2ff4-b941-4ca9-93c9-a1db824e4b80"
msgid ""
"{n}Since your last encounter, {d|Stefano}Stefano Moskoni{/d} has put on a "
"little weight, and his appearance has become even more festive. As you "
"approach, a polite smile blooms on his face.{/n} \"Why, if it isn't "
"{mf|King|Queen} {Name}! Please, allow me to congratulate you on your success!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마지막 만남 이래 {d|Stefano}스테파노 모스코니{/d}의 체중은 불었지만, 그의 외모는 더욱 귀티가 흐릅니다. 당신이 접근할 "
"때 그의 얼굴에는 예의 바른 미소가 피어납니다.{/n} \"{mf|왕|여왕} {Name} 아니십니까! 성공을 축하드립니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "a658fffc-e150-47cb-bbf4-d231577a83c8"
msgid "\"How do you like our little celebration?\""
msgstr "\"축하연은 어땠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "6932b9b4-3ccf-4bc1-af2d-6f99a7fab81a"
msgid ""
"\"I concede my mistake — I supposed I'd met a king for a day, whose state "
"would last a few months at best. I'd never imagined you would match my king "
"in dignity, let alone that your country would become a worthy rival for "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 실수를 인정해. 왕이 될지도 모르지만 그 영토가 얼마 가지 않을 거라고 생각했지. 너의 나라가 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 "
"걸맞는 경쟁자가 된 건 물론이고 우리 왕과 맞먹는 존재가 되었다니. 그러리라고는 생각지도 못했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "9d3f2036-60ef-4ca6-8ee3-17cf88444e63"
msgid ""
"\"Of course it's not. It may be hard to believe, but King Irovetti's "
"intentions are quite honest this time. Trust me, he'll make a move sooner or "
"later, but for now, he's invited you for the chance to see a new rival with "
"his own eyes. I'll let you in on a little secret — he actually thinks very "
"highly of you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론 그렇지 않습니다. 믿기 어려우실 수도 있지만, 이로베티 왕의 의도는 이번엔 매우 정직합니다. 조만간 움직이기 시작하겠지만, "
"지금은 새로운 경쟁자를 두 눈으로 보기 위해 당신을 초대한겁니다. 비밀 하나 알려드리죠 — 사실 그는 당신을 매우 높이 평가합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "516b6801-fd88-4157-99d5-2970306f30f0"
msgid ""
"\"I mean no offense when I say this, but both you and your state were, "
"frankly, inconsequential, not significant enough for our attention. But your "
"victory at {g|Brevoy}Brevoy's{/g} border and your subsequent coronation "
"changed all that. In truth, King Irovetti only invites those he's identified "
"as worthy rivals to the tournament.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신을 모욕하려는 생각은 추호도 없습니다만, 당신과 당신의 국가 모두, 솔직히 비중이 크지 않았기에 저희의 주의를 충분히 끌지 "
"못했습니다. 하지만 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g} 국경에서의 승리와 이어진 대관식이 그 모든 것을 바꾸었죠. 사실, 이로베티 왕은 "
"자신이 가치있는 라이벌이라 인정한 자들만 대회에 초대합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "c829249f-d097-43f9-9b0e-e9a26a3aea0f"
msgid ""
"\"The unfortunate reality is that your very existence, along with the "
"strength your kingdom has acquired, is cause enough. What would happen were "
"you to join with {g|Mivon}Mivon{/g} against {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}? Or perhaps "
"you might seek to extend your lands west and not stop at the border. What if "
"merchants from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g} began traveling through your lands, "
"bypassing Pitax entirely? And of course, the most important question...\" {n}"
"Moskoni's grin turns predatory.{/n} \"Do you sit securely on your throne, or "
"does Pitax stand a chance of expanding east?\""
msgstr ""
"\"불행한 것은 당신의 존재 자체와 당신의 왕국이 힘을 얻었다는 사실정도로 충분합니다. 만약 당신이 {g|Mivon}미본{/g}와 "
"결탁해서 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}에 반기를 든다면 어찌될까요? 아니면 당신이 국경에서 멈추지 않고 더욱 서쪽으로 진출하려 할 수도 "
"있고요. 또 브레보이 상인들이 피탁스를 무시한 채 당신의 영토로만 왕래하기 시작하면 어떻게 될까요? 그리고 물론, 가장 중요한 질문은..."
"\" {n}모스코니의 미소는 포식자의 그것으로 변합니다.{/n} \"당신이 왕좌를 굳건히 지킬수 있을까요, 아니면 피탁스의 영토를 "
"동쪽으로 확장 할 기회일까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "4daa13a6-53b2-4971-970c-0e96f7090a1c"
msgid ""
"\"Think nothing of it. I have great interest in seeing how events will "
"unfold.\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 생각하지 마십시오. 저는 사건이 어떻게 전개될 지 큰 관심을 가지고 있으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "046e0606-4e76-418a-baa3-a29ba84f580d"
msgid "\"Until we meet again — and I'm sure we will.\""
msgstr "\"다음에 다시 볼 때 까지 안녕하십시오 — 그리고 그리 될거라 확신합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/StefanoMoskoni/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "de3e3d5e-9fc7-4d9d-8ae6-4d5c6ac18128"
msgid ""
"\"Now that's real talk we have here! Come on, honorable Stefano – sing us "
"another of your sweet political songs.\""
msgstr "\"본격적인 주제로 넘어가는군! 자. 스테파노. 너의 솜씨를 뽐내 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "acf08df8-3553-4100-abc2-f57423f7a4e1"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "3e1733ae-9094-43a2-8f09-82f537ed9e5a"
msgid "\"Not now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "958728a6-ad69-4220-a7c9-dd6f3d22dc57"
msgid ""
"[Buy a sword for Valerie] \"I want you to always smile like you are now.\""
msgstr "[발레리를 위해 칼을 삽니다] \"언제나 그렇게 웃으면 좋겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "585d4265-3fc2-4ed0-9d5f-4cdc2ab60a3a"
msgid "[Ignore]"
msgstr "[무시합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "46e42fa9-5d21-4309-807d-11cbca7d7df3"
msgid "\"See something interesting?\""
msgstr "\"재미있는 걸 보여줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "6dc1f666-a16e-4576-9913-e3258a512070"
msgid "\"Why not buy it?\""
msgstr "\"사 보지 그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "755229f6-eeec-4494-be26-19f6d53f5047"
msgid "\"I see.\""
msgstr "\"알겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "e82c7dbc-cdd0-47d7-b7de-501d70197965"
msgid "\"Swords! Armor! Best {g|Mivon}Mivoni{/g} steel!\""
msgstr "\"칼! 갑옷! 최고의 {g|Mivon}미본{/g} 강철!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "5164300e-1797-4643-af7f-6f09b3528c33"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice Valerie eyeing one of the blades in the vendor's stall, her "
"eyes shining with almost childlike admiration. She can't seem to tear her "
"gaze away from it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리가 상인의 좌판에서 검을 보았을 때 어린아이와 같은 눈빛을 내며 감탄합니다. 그녀는 도저히 눈길을 뗄 수 없었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "683fe64c-b3a7-4633-b64c-ee0c03e13ec4"
msgid "\"Huh? No, nothing special. Just...\""
msgstr "\"예? 아뇨, 대단한 건 아닙니다. 그저...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b5e91c1e-7100-4b73-9ae5-4a57a2c6d91e"
msgid ""
"\"See the proof mark on this sword? It belongs to the master who supplied "
"the training swords to my first swordplay instructor. The first sword I ever "
"held had this mark — I shall likely remember this symbol to the day I die. I "
"never thought I would see this proof mark again.\" {n}Valerie smiles, her "
"eyes hazy with memories.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이 칼에 새겨진 인장이 보이십니까? 저에게 훈련용 칼을 주셨던던 제 첫 검술 스승님의 인장입니다. 제 첫 검에 새겨진 인장은 잊지 "
"못하죠. 이걸 다시 보게 될 줄은 몰랐습니다.\" {n}발레리는 웃었고 그녀의 눈은 추억에 잠겨있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "83b115bc-e596-47b6-b8f2-f586582a2ac3"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, stop. It would be... silly. The gear I have now is much better and "
"more reliable than what I had while learning swordplay. The swordsmith would "
"hardly be pleased to know his work was just lying about when it could be "
"loyally serving someone else.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 그만... 바보 같을 거야. 내가 지금 가지고 있는 장비는 검술을 배우는 동안 가지고 있던 것보다 훨씬 더 견고하고 신뢰할 만 "
"하지. 검을 만든 대장장이는 자신의 작품이 주인을 위해 봉사하지 못하고 팽개쳐 있다는 사실을 알면 슬퍼하겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "be87b266-a720-42ed-b936-c51d0d008a44"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie blushes, embarrassed but happy, as she decisively places her hand "
"on yours as you reach for your coin purse.{/n} \"Thank you, but that is "
"completely unnecessary. The swordsmith would not be pleased to know his work "
"was just lying about when it could be loyally serving someone else.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 금화 지갑에 손을 뻗을 때 발레리는 당황해 하며 얼굴을 붉히지만 지갑을 쥔 당신의 손을 거두고는 기뻐 합니다. {/n} "
"\"감사합니다만, 그건 불필요한 일입니다.이 검을 만든 대장장이는 자신의 작품이 아무도 쓰지 않은 채로 굴러다니는 것을 원하지 않을 "
"것입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "21ce0d0c-1666-4da4-9f3c-af4e91080caf"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie smiles softly.{/n} \"I was just happy to remember those days and "
"have the chance to share the memory with you. I rarely do this. Probably "
"only with you.\" {n}She casts a final glance at the sword, then steps away "
"from the stall.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 부드럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"이렇게 추억을 주군과 함께 나눌 수 있는 것만으로도 기쁘군요. 이런 일은 처음입니다. "
"주군이니까 마음을 놓은 것이겠죠. {n}그녀는 검을 마지막으로 쳐다 본 다음 무기진열대를 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_1/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "0c52f23f-58ca-40ba-827e-91c47b54845c"
msgid "\"So, what might you be interested in?\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 무엇에 관심이 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_2/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "afc0a053-aa74-4e3a-a797-63276029d445"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_2/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "1103bff7-defa-4611-8f73-7bb34b35f484"
msgid "\"Not now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_2/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "2362d2f0-8500-4e13-9ed5-a586cbd2c7d6"
msgid ""
"\"Scrolls! Potions for any taste! The very best, straight from Daggermark!\""
msgstr "\"스크롤 팔아요! 신기한 맛이 나는 포션 팔아요! 대거마크에서 최고의 제품입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2e35a787-4f25-498a-9edb-169ac908ded5"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "22b546b8-a45d-47c9-bf8a-1bfb0a6c89f0"
msgid "\"I need to go.\""
msgstr "\"이만 가봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bd1811be-29cc-45ee-94ed-9a3863131d75"
msgid "Prevented Octavia from stealing a charm from a trader."
msgstr "옥타비아가 상인의 부적을 훔치는 것을 막았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "a225e6ea-e86b-4ea5-b98e-42b9d7f4bfba"
msgid "[Wag a finger at Octavia]"
msgstr "[옥타비아에게 오라고 손가락질합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "248c3504-e3e6-4756-90ea-346cbecbd9cb"
msgid "Bought the charm Octavia intended to steal."
msgstr "옥타비아가 훔치려고 한 부적을 샀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "90ee623c-ad45-4d24-966a-52f03569f891"
msgid ""
"\"My companion has taken a liking to your charm. Would you sell it for, say, "
"50 gold coins?\""
msgstr "\"내 동료가 너의 부적에 호감을 가졌어. 금화 50개면 팔겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bcaa27d4-21af-48c3-bc67-5906fef4c3f3"
msgid "Helped Octavia steal a charm from a trader."
msgstr "옥타비아가 상인의 부적을 훔쳐갈 수 있도록 도와주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "03109f24-403a-49b6-b91f-364679b25ab7"
msgid "[Distract the vendor]"
msgstr "[상인의 집중을 교란합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "71531749-7ad3-45a8-b531-c8dec43da32c"
msgid "Allowed Octavia to steal a charm from a trader."
msgstr "옥타비아가 상인으로부터 부적을 훔치는 것을 허락했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "b73ef8b5-9a07-4307-8aaf-4f70a9efec43"
msgid "[Pretend not to notice]"
msgstr "[못본 척 합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "70e7953c-e4fb-4e1e-8849-1784a5c7f756"
msgid ""
"\"Best wares on the river! Don't waste time asking where they're from — get "
"these deals while they last!\""
msgstr "\"강가에서 가장 좋은 제품입니다! 어디에서 왔는지는 묻지 마쇼. 안 사면 후회할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d2df9195-9b28-4607-8fec-be70d480fac2"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice Octavia's fingers reach for a sparkling charm on the vendor's "
"belt.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아의 손이 상인의 허리띠에서 반짝이는 부적에 닿는 것을 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "140bdfa7-23ee-483e-ae9e-85f30e56cb79"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia pouts, but she moves her hand away from the vendor's property.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 입을 비죽 내밀었지만 상인의 물건에서 손을 뗍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "7ada68aa-d24f-45e9-8b1b-42cebb27c355"
msgid ""
"{n}The vendor gladly takes the gold.{/n} \"Of course, of course! As you "
"wish. Here, please... Ah, that will suit you nicely!\" {n}The vendor smiles "
"as he gives Octavia the trinket.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}상인은 기꺼이 금을 받습니다.{/n} \"당연히 물론 받아야죠! 손님이 원한다면야. 여기 있습니다. 잘 어울릴 겁니다!\" {n}"
"그가 옥타비아에게 악세사리를 주면서 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "62bbae73-8f40-4c02-9c01-0930b7c05320"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia takes the charm from the vendor's hands, fastens it to her belt, "
"and smiles at you.{/n} \"Thank you! It's just lovely. And so are you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 상인의 손에서부터 부적을 받아 허리띠에 단단히 고정시키고 미소짓습니다.{/n} \"고마워! 너무 사랑스러워. 너도 "
"마찬가지야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5bb357fb-f42d-4d83-9bde-4e7e9db2c6c8"
msgid ""
"{n}While you pretend to check the prices of various goods, the charm quietly "
"moves from the vendor's belt to Octavia's pocket. Octavia blows you a "
"kiss.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 다양한 물건의 가격을 확인하는 동안 부적은 조용히 상인의 허리띠에서 옥타비아의 주머니로 이동합니다. 옥타비아가 당신에게 "
"키스를 날립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_3/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "6facf7b5-66ea-4201-a796-9fa89fe17c8e"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia hides the charm in her pocket with a playful smile and turns away "
"as though nothing had happened.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}옥타비아는 주머니에 부적을 숨기고 장난스런 웃음을 짓고는 아무 일도 없었던 것처럼 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "523e26f0-e3b7-4ba2-8667-416074c696a1"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "3a8aad05-c446-4748-8aad-b604b761ade8"
msgid "\"Show me your wares.\""
msgstr "\"파는 물건을 보여줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "338534a7-8bdf-45b0-bf5e-2bd8dc26d866"
msgid "[Attack] \"You little bastard! I'm going to get you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너 개자식! 너를 잡을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "e5d92599-b455-4c68-9b2c-16906902af38"
msgid "\"Not now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 말고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "7bca0b11-a640-495e-85f5-66f8525c2262"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, adventurers! Look at my offers! New wares! In a new bag! All new, all "
"bestest! Only me be old — can't be any bester!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 모험가들이군! 내 물건을 좀 봐! 새로운 물건들이지! 나의 새 가방에 담았어! 모두 새롭고 최고의 제품이야! 나이가 든 것은 나 "
"뿐이야. 저급하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "ea626323-36ed-4da2-bfb4-dc598b3fed2c"
msgid ""
"\"You know! No? Sellers be where fair be! No one be calling us, we come "
"where the buying is! We be profeshional traders!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너도 알 텐데! 몰라? 축제 있는 곳에 장사꾼은 어디에나 있어! 아무도 우리를 부르지 않아도 살 사람이 있으면 우리는 간다고! 우리는 "
"전문 상인들이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "8c97e136-bcc2-46eb-9f96-59ac81a86efe"
msgid "\"You lose then! Be missing such a bargain!\""
msgstr "\"그러면 손해야! 이런 좋은 거래를 놓치다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "bca67d2e-8678-4403-b52e-fa5aeda3f7b8"
msgid "\"Aieee! Stealing and killing!\""
msgstr "\"이야아아! 도둑질과 살육이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Trader_Goblin/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "e38f6578-4195-4af2-8d7e-522765fece9b"
msgid ""
"\"Ha! Look at his pitiful stuff! No much choice for a Hero to buy, eh?\" {n"
"}Nok-Nok eyes the trader's goods with obvious greed, though he still manages "
"to turn around with feigned disdain.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"하! 그 형편 없는 것들을 봐! 영웅이 살 만한 물건은 없다고. 안 그래?\" {n}녹-녹은 탐욕의 눈길로 상인의 물건을 보지만 "
"여전히 경멸스러운 태도를 하고 돌아섭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "649525e7-6a85-420a-b04d-d3ce5acfd587"
msgid ""
"\"I am clearly addressing someone important, but I don't believe we've met.\""
msgstr "\"나는 중요한 사람은 반드시 만나고 있는데, 우리가 만난 적 없다니 믿을 수 없군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "1c6ef1a3-36ff-40a3-b91b-bb08db170be5"
msgid ""
"\"Perhaps Pitax would benefit from somebody who has a history of vanquishing "
"bandits.\""
msgstr "\"아마 피탁스는 도적을 물리치는 누군가에게서 이익을 얻겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "8fee9491-a438-4639-b61e-b7fc888fd576"
msgid "\"A fine day to you.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 하루 보내.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "f5d5a7bd-edd3-4b56-921c-7a6ab6cccbe7"
msgid "\"I overheard you talking about stolen shipments. Is there a problem?\""
msgstr "\"도난당한 선적에 대해 이야기하는 것을 우연히 들었다. 문제가 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c3ef61cd-ca30-403a-8a71-11360fd1f958"
msgid ""
"{n}Several concerned dockworkers crowd around a finely dressed half-elf, who "
"listens to the workers with imperious dignity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}몇몇 염려하는 부두 노동자들은 옷을 차려 입은 하프엘프를 중심으로 모여들었고 고압적인 태도로 노동자들의 이야기를 듣습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "0c431f2c-86ea-47c5-ae4b-42e2f33ea975"
msgid ""
"{n}A bright sash cuts across this man's chest, identifying him as a "
"magistrate of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}. He makes a shallow bow while keeping his "
"head inclined upward, as if being polite while also conveying his "
"superiority.{/n} \"May the king's law guide you at the {g|Rushlight "
"river}Rushlight{/g} Tournament today.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}밝은 띠가 가슴을 가로 질러 두른 것으로 보아 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 치안 판사임을 나타냅니다. 그는 머리를 쳐들면서 낮게 "
"절하는데 마치 그의 우월성을 전하려는 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"왕의 법이 너를 {g|Rushlight river}러시라이트{/g} "
"토너먼트로 인도하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Dockworker_1
msgctxt "6dad5a62-8879-499c-a921-97fe73b6d18b"
msgid ""
"\"It's as we've been tellin' you, judge. This is the third shipment in two "
"months they've stolen from us.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 네게 말한 것과 같습니다, 판사님. 두 달 만에 그들이 세 번째 선적을 훔쳐갔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Dockworker_2
msgctxt "fbbc8b39-9846-4824-9e81-418ec38a5b5f"
msgid ""
"\"Can't keep that up — doesn't matter how good the last year's business "
"been. No cargo means no pay, and no pay means no new shipments!\""
msgstr ""
"\"사업을 계속 할 수는 없었다. 작년의 사업이 얼마나 좋았는지는 중요하지 않다. 화물이 없다면 지불도 없고 그렇다면 새로운 선적도 "
"없겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Dockworker_3
msgctxt "0ab69819-b56b-48e9-871c-f259cbe28b1d"
msgid ""
"\"We asked you about the thefts before, and there's nothing changed. Where's "
"the king's justice, your honor?\""
msgstr "\"이전에도 절도에 관해서 물었지만, 아무것도 바뀌지 않았어요. 왕의 정의는 어디갔습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "9244b3a0-a127-4362-b25c-384fd0d841ad"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-elf patiently motions for silence. {/n}\"It is true that pirates "
"have taken root along the {g|Pitax River}Pitax River{/g} and attacked "
"several shipments heading upriver. The king has-\" {n}he pauses, noticing "
"you for the first time. He adjusts his posture to stand taller and "
"straightens his sash of office before continuing. {/n}\"King Irovetti shall "
"address the problem soon, however he will hear no formal complaints until "
"after the {g|Rushlight river}Rushlight{/g} Tournament. In the meantime, he "
"advises that travelers downriver take care around "
"{g|Littletown}Littletown{/g}. Until then, partake in the festivities and the "
"king's generosity. If anyone has further questions or concerns, I am at your "
"disposal.\"{n} The gathered workers grumble and disperse, barely mollified "
"by this response.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하프엘프는 참을성 있게 조용하라는 손짓을 합니다.{/n} \"해적들이 {g|Pitax River}피탁스 강{/g} 상류로 향하는 "
"여러 화물을 공격했다는건 사실이다. 왕은-\" {n}그는 잠시 멈추고 처음으로 당신을 봅니다. 그는 계속하기 전에 허리를 세워 자신을 커 "
"보이게 하고 가슴을 가로지른 띠를 바로잡습니다.{/n} \"이로베티 왕께서 곧 문제를 해결하시겠지만, {g|Rushlight "
"river}러시라이트{/g} 토너먼트가 끝날 때까진 공식적인 항의를 듣지 못하실 것이다. 동시에, 그는 강 하류를 여행하는 여행자들에게 "
"{g|Littletown}리틀타운{/g} 주위를 조심하라고 조언하셨다. 그때까지는 왕의 관대함을 받아들이고 축제에 참여해라. 누구든지 더 "
"궁금한 점이 있있으면 내가 도와주겠다.\" {n}그 답변은 모여든 노동자들을 진정시키지 못했고, 곧 불평과 불만이 터져나왔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "81239369-2f0c-4581-ae71-2405b8cc4ad9"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-elf motions to his sash.{/n} \"I am the honorable Walsh "
"Celvoway, a magistrate of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, judge of the people's "
"concerns, and executor of the king's justice.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프엘프가 띠를 고쳐두릅니다.{/n} \"저는 월시 켈보웨이입니다. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 치안판사로, 국민들의 어려움을 "
"판단하고 왕의 정의를 집행합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "354934fb-6c58-4f6f-b13d-d6c811bd40c1"
msgid ""
"\"Ah yes, that.\"{n} He sets his teeth into a practiced smile, though his "
"teeth briefly grind together.{/n} \"An outbreak of river piracy has caused "
"some consternation among the citizens. Simply avoid or exercise caution near "
"{g|Littletown}Littletown{/g} in the meantime.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 그렇습니다.\" {n}그는 이빨을 드러내며 억지로 미소를 지어 순간 이빨을 가는 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"강변의 해적 발발로 "
"인해 시민들은 실망을 금치 못했습니다. 그동안 {g|Littletown}리틀타운{/g} 주변은 주의를 기울이거나 피해주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : WalshCelvoway
msgctxt "810e9bfc-19d3-4140-94c4-1d0d9ca227ca"
msgid ""
"\"Let us be clear,\" {n}declares the magistrate, narrowing his eyes with "
"disdain.{/n} \"{g|Pitax}Pitax's{/g} armed forces are entirely capable of "
"handling these criminals. There's no need for would-be heroes or aspiring "
"vigilantes to get involved, much less foreign interests. I recommend "
"enjoying the rest of the festival.\""
msgstr ""
"\"명확하게 하죠.\" {n}치안 판사가 선포하고 그의 눈은 경멸로 좁아집니다.{/n} \"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 경비대는 "
"전적으로 이러한 범죄자를 처리할 수 있습니다. 영웅이나 열정적인 자경단이 참여할 필요가 없으며, 외국인의 관심은 더더욱 필요 없습니다. "
"저는 축제를 즐기시길 권해드리겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "31e271d7-1858-4c86-aba0-fe765955d6c1"
msgid ""
"\"How can he be so deaf to the people's woes? And he calls himself a judge?\""
msgstr "\"국민들의 원성에 어떻게 저리 귀가 먹을 수 있지? 그리고 자신을 판사라고 부른다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "088bc61f-b6be-480f-8a92-c1e2421acd7b"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, a fellow judge. I'm sure this is the most sincere, kindhearted, "
"charitable person you could find around here.\" {n}Jaethal smirks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이봐. 판사 양반. 이 사람이 여기에서 찾을 수있는 가장 성실하고 친절하며 자비로운 사람일 거야.\" {n}제이탈은 "
"능글거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "a5e68bf8-4336-4a37-9e2d-7975ef06fc2f"
msgid ""
"\"I knew a judge once. She spent nights butchering her own kin, then went on "
"to become a zombie. This guy seems fine by comparison!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 알던 판사가 있었는데. 그녀는 자신의 가족을 한밤중에 도살해서 좀비로 만들었지. 좀비들은 이전보다 더 좋아보이더라고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/Rushlight/Walsh/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b981499b-69cc-43fa-90e1-fd575b64ecc9"
msgid ""
"\"I can understand his reluctance to allow foreigners to meddle in his "
"kingdom's affairs. What I cannot understand is such blatant negligence of "
"justice and the safety of his subjects.\""
msgstr ""
"\"외국인들이 자신의 왕국 문제에 개입하는 것을 꺼려한다는 것은 이해할 수 있습니다. 하지만 정의를 눈꼽 만큼도 모르고 국민의 안전에 "
"신경쓰지 않는다는 것은 이해할 수 없군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Barks/EvindraIfAttacked_String
msgctxt "e5bdb80d-02d4-40ca-98f9-b06f7ee56f7c"
msgid ""
"\"You cannot kill the water. If you dry up the stream, it will simply come "
"back with the rain!\""
msgstr "\"너는 물을 죽일 수 없다. 만약 시내를 말려 죽이더라도, 비가 오면 쉬이 수복될 것이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Barks/GardenerBark2_String
msgctxt "85297f53-9300-4e1e-b14d-22f8706c9abe"
msgid "\"No. You shall not touch her.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 그녀에게 손 대지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Barks/GardenerBark3_String
msgctxt "1c92c0d2-bb01-428e-82db-898140d902fe"
msgid "\"I am her guardian. I am her slave. I am her master!\""
msgstr "\"나는 그녀의 수호자이자 노예이다. 나는 그녀의 주인이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Barks/GardenerBark_String
msgctxt "96c8cf37-9b89-49f8-9305-9f52937bf229"
msgid ""
"\"Only King Irovetti may walk this path. You are not him, and so you will "
"die!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티 왕만이 이 길을 걸을 수 있다. 너는 그 사람이 아니므로 죽을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Barks/GuardBark1_String
msgctxt "7f7977a3-3d7f-4260-a006-1ea7df07b715"
msgid "\"Intruders! Kill them!\""
msgstr "\"침입자! 그들을 죽여라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Barks/GuardBark2_String
msgctxt "c5050c31-d291-4b71-b089-2ecfef76728b"
msgid "\"They mustn't reach the lake!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 호수에 도착해서는 안 된다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "92f11b7d-a956-4ebd-963b-ddd5c2d7f863"
msgid "[Dive into the lake]"
msgstr "[호수에 뛰어듭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "47fa2032-937d-495e-a05c-8e617d8dd686"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "62a630a9-bd6e-446f-9523-4185bd47cdbd"
msgid "[Examine the bodies]"
msgstr "[시체들을 조사합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "daffa58f-9d21-4cb5-9bb0-e3eb0321a742"
msgid "[Dive deeper]"
msgstr "[깊숙한 곳으로 뛰어듭니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "87632d89-d3b5-4566-98d0-5b4087b971cf"
msgid "[Return to the surface]"
msgstr "[뭍으로 돌아갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "064ac6c4-edca-40df-8fcf-14afe4c0fc4a"
msgid ""
"{n}The underground lake looks like a silver mirror. The reflections on its "
"surface are so clear that you can make out every wrinkle in your clothes and "
"the individual strands of your hair. What you can't make out, though, is "
"anything that may be hidden beneath the water.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}지하 호수는 은빛 거울처럼 보입니다. 그 표면의 반사는 너무 명확하여 옷의 주름과 머리카락을 비출 수 있습니다. 그러나 당신이 볼 "
"수 없는 것은 물 아래에 숨어 있는 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "e329a1b1-356a-4f0e-a7b7-9bad2a479afd"
msgid ""
"{n}You dive deeper and deeper, pushing yourself until you feel the bottom of "
"the lake beneath your hands, and something more — something metallic. A "
"dagger lies beside the body of a young blond man. The weapon is in perfect "
"condition, despite its submersion. It may be a trick of the mind, but as you "
"leave, the dead man's body shifts, and it seems almost like a nodded "
"farewell, like the man wishes you luck and hopes to be avenged.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 더 깊이 잠수하여 손바닥으로 호수 바닥을 만졌는데 무언가 금속을 만졌습니다. 단검이 젊은 금발의 남자의 몸 옆에 "
"놓여있습니다. 물 속임에도 불구하고 무기는 완벽한 상태입니다. 그것은 속임수 마법일지도 모르지만 당신이 떠날 때 죽은 남자의 시체가 "
"움직였고 마치 남자가 당신에게 행운을 빌고 복수하기를 희망한다는 듯 고개를 끄덕이는 것처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8c785121-4574-4be7-ad37-17a79dd7e642"
msgid ""
"{n}You lack the strength to dive deeper. If this lake hides further secrets, "
"they're doomed to remain undiscovered.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 더 깊이 잠수 할 힘이 없습니다. 이 호수에 비밀이 더 있다면, 알려지지 않은 상태로 남을 운명입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "8b741bb4-89a9-4674-92f2-fadd53e8f063"
msgid ""
"{n}You dive into the lake. You once more notice the silvery quality of the "
"water, as though it's been imbued with light, or perhaps radiates it. But "
"the things hidden by the placid shimmering are horrible. Below your feet, at "
"the bottom of the lake, float at least two dozen corpses. The dead seem to "
"stare at you — some with the empty sockets of hollow skulls, and others with "
"nightmarish dead eyes. One body floats past you, and you feel a small metal "
"object fall into your hand. It looks like a signet ring.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 호수로 뛰어들었습니다. 빛에 반사된 것인지 스스로 빛을 발산하는 것인지, 당신은 한 번 더 물결이 은빛으로 빛나는 것을 "
"목격합니다. 그러나 희미한 반짝임에 숨겨진 것들은 끔찍했습니다. 호수 바닥 당신의 발 아래에 최소한 십여 구의 시체가 떠 있습니다. 죽은 "
"사람이 당신을 응시하는 것처럼 보입니다. 어떤 것은 눈이 거먼 두개골이고 다른 것은 악몽에 나올 것 같은 눈을 가졌습니다. 한 몸이 "
"당신을 지나쳐 떠가고 당신은 작은 금속 물체가 손에 떨어지는 것을 느낍니다. 그것은 인장 반지처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "1427045d-06e4-4e57-ab2a-fc508b565605"
msgid ""
"{n}One of the dead bodies wears a purple belt. Another is clad in a black "
"vest with bright green embroidery... You easily recognize the insignias of "
"the four Trade Houses. There are dead bodies here from all the great "
"families that once ruled Pitax.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}시체 중 하나는 자주색 허리띠를 착용했습니다. 다른 하나는 밝은 녹색 자수를 입힌 검은색 조끼를 입었습니다. 당신은 네 개의 "
"무역소의 휘장임을 쉽게 알아볼 수 있었습니다. 한 때 피탁스를 지배한 가문들의 일원들이 시체로 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6b3a6b05-39fb-41d2-ac2b-733d6b543a92"
msgid ""
"{n}You lack the knowledge necessary to learn much about the dead bodies from "
"just the visible details. You can only assume they were once "
"{g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} nobles.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}눈에 보이는 세부 사항만으로는 시체에 대해 많은 것을 알기 어렵습니다. 당신은 그들이 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 귀족임이었음을 "
"추측 할 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "21fed278-1ea9-4e82-80f8-a67b3a531b2e"
msgid ""
"{n}You dive underwater, back among the corpses floating forlornly in the "
"depths.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 수중으로 뛰어들었고, 깊숙한 물 속에서 쓸쓸하게 떠다니는 시체들을 헤치고 돌아왔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Diving/Cue_0019_Text_1
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "bed8e15c-e48d-49a4-9967-af98478c1c72"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim clasps his hands over his belt and looks around serenely.{/n} "
"\"Such a lovely place... Once, the pointless vanity of life seethed here, "
"but now there is only desolation and calm. Am I the only one who feels it? "
"The beauty of desolation and cold imminence...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 그의 손을 허리띠 위에 올려놓고 평온하게 둘러봅니다.{/n} \"정말 아름다운 곳이군... 일단 삶의 무의미한 허영심이 "
"여기에 있었지만 이제는 적막함과 침착함만이 느껴진다. 나만 그렇게 생각하는 겐가? 적막함과 차가운 절박함의 아름다움이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9f80d831-2e12-400a-8e80-2ff798d7410b"
msgid "\"Who are you? Why do you speak with Nyrissa's voice?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야? 왜 나이리사의 목소리로 말하는거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "dbd66ad0-e9b7-4f20-882b-9c6eecc221b6"
msgid "\"What was the tool Nyrissa spoke of?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 말한 도구는 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3253045a-b1e0-4d05-bc65-0f90264de992"
msgid "Attacked Evindra, a nereid captured by Irovetti."
msgstr "이로베티에 의해 사로잡힌 네레이드 에빈드라을 공격합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "2feb197b-725d-45dc-af90-1ec63fedd5bc"
msgid "[Attack] \"Time to rid the world of one more treacherous creature!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"한 번 더 위험한 괴물을 없애는 시간이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "9ef6d4db-df56-4a8e-8f18-350966bd5e68"
msgid "\"Why would Nyrissa do this to you?\""
msgstr "\"왜 나이리사가 너한테 이렇게 했을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "fbd65f2e-e977-4de5-b909-f0dfb016fce5"
msgid "\"Thank you for sharing this information. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"정보를 공유해주어 고맙다. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "cb553b9e-ed3a-406a-9a73-e57a0c2238e3"
msgid "\"All right. I may have need of further information.\""
msgstr "\"알았어. 추가 정보가 필요할지도 몰라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "c656f1f3-1242-456d-ab07-4488b15a72d6"
msgid "\"No. I don't want agents of Nyrissa in my capital.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 나이리사의 요원을 수도에 두고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "d78ae0cb-f358-434d-abfb-e0c85e640fe8"
msgid "\"Who was that strange halfling that attacked me at the entrance?\""
msgstr "\"입구에서 나를 공격한 그 이상한 하플링은 누구였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "484196db-d9a6-48d6-b4a3-baa8445893fe"
msgid ""
"{n}The beautiful nereid is deathly pale. She shudders as you approach.{/n} "
"\"I know you... You're her hound. I have a message for you.\" {n}The nereid "
"freezes and stares forward with unseeing eyes. When she speaks again, it's "
"not with her voice, but another — one you recognize all too well.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}아름다운 네레이드이는 죽기 직전인 것 같습니다. 그녀는 다가오면서 몸을 떱니다.{/n} \"나는 너를 안다. 너는 그녀의 사냥개야. "
"너에게 알려줄 것이 있다.\" {n}네레이드는 공허한 눈으로 얼어 붙어서 앞을 봅니다. 그녀가 다시 말했을 때 그것은 그녀의 목소리가 "
"아니었고 당신이 너무 잘 아는 것이었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "a3ba204b-8c91-4eaa-90bd-81717d39b3bf"
msgid ""
"\"Just two more to make a thousand. Two more grains, and my cup will be "
"full. I care not who makes it first — you and your lands, my hound, or "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} and its ruler. The time draws near. So enjoy yourselves, "
"or fight, or celebrate your victory — each step you take is one more toward "
"my triumph. Take the tool promised to you. It awaits you here, at the bottom "
"of the lake in the {g|Whiterose Abbey}Abbey{/g}. But bear in mind — my "
"peacock already knows you have revealed his secret. He is terrified, and he "
"will soon make his move.\" {n}Finished speaking, the nereid hugs her "
"shoulders and lowers her head.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"두 알만 있으면 천 개가 달성된다. 두 알만 더 넣으면 나의 잔은 가득 찰 것이다. 너와 너의 나라, 나의 사냥개, 혹은 "
"{g|pitax}피탁스{/g}와 그 지배자 — 누가 먼저 만들지는 신경 쓰지 않는다. 시간이 다가온다. 그러므로 즐기거나, 싸우거나, "
"승리를 축하해라. 네가 한 발자국 더 나아갈 때마다 나의 승리 또한 가까워진다. 너에게 약속한 도구를 가져가라. {g|Whiterose "
"Abbey}수도원{/g}에 있는 호수 밑바닥에서 너를 기다리고 있다. 하지만 염두해 두어라. 나의 공작은 이미 네가 그의 비밀을 드러낸 "
"것을 알고 있다. 그는 두려워하고 있으며, 곧 움직일 것이다.\" {n}말을 마친 네레이드는 움츠려 자신의 어깨를 안고 머리를 "
"숙입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "9be38fd0-3aef-47b0-8980-49dce42280f9"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid lifts her head and stares at you with big blue eyes.{/n} \"I "
"am Evindra. I've spent many years serving my cousin Nyrissa as her living "
"tool, a channel for her voice — and as a gift to her 'peacock,' King "
"Irovetti. Through me, he could communicate with her.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드는 머리를 들어올려 큰 푸른 눈으로 당신을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 에빈드라다. 나는 수 년동안 내 사촌인 나이리사의 "
"목소리를 전달하는 살아있는 도구로써 그녀를 받들었고, 그녀의 '공작새'인 이로베티 왕에게 선물로 넘겨졌다. 나를 통해 그는 그녀와 대화할 "
"수 있었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "b3270099-6c36-4c63-8bf4-344aac1ee9b4"
msgid ""
"\"It is... a long story. Though you surely know much of it already. Long "
"ago, my dear, sweet cousin was different. But then a curse fell upon her, "
"and it changed her completely. It's been a long time since I could recognize "
"Nyrissa, our once proud, brave, and visionary leader. The curse deprived her "
"of her heart, and her first victims were her sisters, the nymphs, and myself."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"말하자면 긴 이야기지. 너는 이미 알고 있을 테지만. 오래 전 내 친애하는 사촌은 달랐다. 하지만 저주가 그녀에게 떨어졌고 그녀를 "
"완전히 바꿔 놓았다. 한 때 우리의 자랑스럽고 용감하고 몽상적인 지도자인 나이리사를 알아보기까지 오랜 시간이 걸렸다. 저주는 그녀의 "
"마음을 빼앗았고 그녀의 첫 희생자는 자매이자 님프인 나 자신이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "c415984a-4448-48a6-a480-582e5e6d88b0"
msgid ""
"\"A dark secret is hidden in these depths — the remains of victims of a "
"treacherous murder. Side by side, they lie at the bottom of the lake — the "
"offspring of four noble {g|Pitax}Pitaxian{/g} families. Liacenza, Cattanei, "
"Vascari, and Strocalle. I know little of the games mortal monarchs play, but "
"I've watched Irovetti for a long time. He fears these bones will be "
"recovered and draw the vengeance of their living relatives. That is why "
"Nyrissa told you where to search for the bodies — she also told him you "
"would come to retrieve them. Two rulers at each other's throats is exactly "
"what she needs. Nyrissa, dear cousin, what have you become...\""
msgstr ""
"\"어두운 비밀이 깊은 곳에서 숨겨져 있다. 반란의 희생자의 유해가 그것이지. {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}의 네 귀족 가문 리아첸자, "
"카타네이, 바스카리, 스트로칼리의 자손들이 나란히 호수 바닥에 누워 있다. 왕좌를 두고 펼치는 게임은 알지 못하지만, 나는 오랫동안 "
"이로베티를 주시했다. 그는 살아있는 친족들이 이 뼈를 찾아 복수를 앞당길까 두려워한다. 그래서 나이리사가 너에게 시체를 찾을 위치를 "
"알려주었다. 또한 그녀는 이로베티에게 네가 그 시체를 찾으러 올 것이라고 말했다. 두 명의 통치자가 서로에게 칼을 겨누는 것이 그녀가 "
"원하는 것이다. 나이리사. 사랑하는 사촌아. 너는 대체 무엇이 된 거니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "f2b9ee8d-63b3-456c-92c6-2970dbc4762b"
msgid ""
"\"Wait, I beg you! Please, take me with you, {mf|King|Queen}. Let me live in "
"your capital. I will repay you by telling you all I know. I... I want to "
"help you. And I want to help Nyrissa, too — if anyone can break the curse, "
"it must be you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠깐. 부탁이다! 나를 데려가 줘. {mf|왕|여왕}. 네 수도에 살도록 허락해줘. 내가 아는 걸 모두 말하고 빚을 갚을 테니. "
"나는... 너를 돕고 싶다. 그리고 나이리사도 돕고 싶다. 누군가가 저주를 깨뜨릴 수 있다면 그것은 너일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "455bae88-795a-43c9-bc7d-687d470a3f3e"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not sure a forgiven traitor has any right to ask this, but... please "
"listen to Evindra. She's endured immense suffering, but it didn't break her. "
"She can help us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"용서받은 반역자가 이 사실을 물을 권리가 있는지 확신할 수는 없지만... 에빈드라에 귀를 기울여라. 그녀는 엄청난 고통을 견뎌 냈지만 "
"그녀는 무너지지 않았다. 그녀는 우리를 도울 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "b54c4d51-adcc-48a8-961c-00f5b25cc541"
msgid ""
"\"I would advise against it. Time and again we have witnessed treachery from "
"those of the {g|First World}First World{/g}. We cannot place trust in their "
"desire to repent and aid us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"감히 조언을 해드리자면, {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 생물들은 배반을 밥 먹듯이 해대는 놈들입니다. 죄를 뉘우치고 "
"우릴 도와준다는 감언이설에 넘어가시면 안 됩니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "8e472dd1-2b43-45a9-858d-b53dd48263b2"
msgid ""
"{n}Evindra frowns and hisses through gritted teeth,{/n} \"The Gardener. That "
"is how he was known. The madman was obsessed with me, and Irovetti exploited "
"that weakness of his to turn him into the most loyal of his guardians. I... "
"do not wish to speak more of him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에빈드라는 악물은 이빨 사이로 위협적인 소리를 내며 찡그럽니다.{/n} \"정원사. 그것이 그의 정체이다. 그 광인은 나에게 사로 "
"잡혔고 이로베티는 그 약점을 이용하여 그를 그의 수호자 중 가장 충직한 하인으로 만들었다. 나는 그를 더 말하고 싶지 않습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "bbf7df3e-6318-4579-840c-03dd91db64f2"
msgid "\"Thank you for your kindness!\""
msgstr "\"고맙다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5b3cada2-f40d-4e4f-bbfe-8bc36df39e6a"
msgid "{n}Tristian nods to you gratefully, as though it were about him.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}트리스티안은 그에 관한 것이라는 듯 감사의 뜻으로 고개를 끄덕였습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "46466122-237c-4695-9ef7-7b7bb358b017"
msgid ""
"\"You did what was right. Believe me, your ability to sleep at night will be "
"a just reward for it.\""
msgstr "\"옳은 일을 했습니다. 당신은 밤에 편히 잘 수 있도록 보상을 받을 자격이 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "d8dc49c9-7a1d-4724-b9a1-0a7781374da6"
msgid "{n}The nereid lowers her head in grief.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}네레이드는 슬픔에 머리를 떨굽니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "ae6fa68e-772e-4d1f-9561-2c4b58cd8453"
msgid ""
"\"So he killed the hostages – but why? It seems so unreasonable. Alive, they "
"were useful, dead, they're nothing.\""
msgstr "\"결국 그가 인질들을 죽였군. 하지만 왜? 이유가 없는 것 같은데. 살아있다면 쓸모있지만 죽었다면 그렇지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "385d3121-0ca9-485b-9532-c48fd8fe7aa8"
msgid ""
"\"He killed the hostages! Oh, their poor families! All this time, they'd "
"hoped and waited…\""
msgstr "\"그가 인질을 죽였군! 불쌍한 가문들! 항상 그들은 돌아오길 기대하며 기다렸겠지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "24331343-1994-4027-8f91-9afce2f7437c"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes, sisterhood and all its benefits.\" {n}Kanerah smiles, but her eyes "
"remain cold.{/n}"
msgstr "\"아. 자매애로군.\"{n}카네라는 웃지만 눈은 냉정합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/EvindraDialog/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "f5494c69-6dc4-4e15-94a1-8b5fb5f635ac"
msgid ""
"\"What kind of monster could do this to her own sisters and cousin?\" {n}"
"Kalikke frowns, shocked.{/n}"
msgstr "\"어떻게 자기의 자매와 친척에게 이런 짓을 할 수 있지?\" {n}칼리케는 충격에 받아 찡그립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Items/DarkwindDagger_Name_String
msgctxt "3c44bb60-6e6c-4761-b4f5-2d37384b0e29"
msgid "Dark Wind"
msgstr "검은 바람"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Items/DarlwindDagger_Description_String
msgctxt "76d4aa23-1c0e-4f55-93d9-c8a14086d2ba"
msgid ""
"This dagger, retrieved from the bottom of the lake in Whiterose Abbey, once "
"belonged to a young man from the Strocalle family, who was murdered at the "
"order of King Irovetti."
msgstr "백장미 수도원의 호수 바닥에서 가져온 이 단검은 이로베티 왕의 명령에 따라 살해 된 스트로칼리 가문의 한 젊은이의 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Items/FoxHeadRing_Description_String
msgctxt "89e1b8d5-1061-4217-a032-9f7d6744b92e"
msgid ""
"The signet on this golden ring depicts a fox's head — the symbol of the "
"Liacenza family and the Iron Fox Trade House of Pitax. The ring previously "
"belonged to one of King Irovetti's victims, and it was found in the lake at "
"Whiterose Abbey."
msgstr ""
"이 황금 반지의 인장에는 여우의 머리 가 새겨져있습니다 — 바로 리아첸자 가문과 피탁스의 강철 여우 무역 회사의 상징입니다. 이 반지는 "
"이전에 이로베티 왕의 희생자 중 한 명인 반지였으며 백장미 수도원의 호수에서 발견되었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c51/WhiteRoseAbbey/Items/FoxHeadRing_Name_String
msgctxt "3da0ccec-ea8c-4d86-92bf-63d9e2113ade"
msgid "Fox Signet Ring"
msgstr "여우 인장 반지"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/1KW_String
msgctxt "9bbc7507-1b42-466f-99df-5d5f25757aca"
msgid "\"You grave-rotted imbecile! You broke it!\""
msgstr "\"이 썩어빠진 녀석! 네가 부수었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/2WM_String
msgctxt "ab9bc08c-35e5-48b1-8aad-4d7248b02d4c"
msgid ""
"\"We did nothing, of the sort, crone. You've destroyed our property with "
"your ignorance of magic.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 아무것도 하지 않았다. 노인네. 너는 마법의 남용으로 우리의 재산을 파괴했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/3KW_String
msgctxt "c9f17da5-5f7d-4e85-9fa5-184f804defb4"
msgid "\"Ignorance?! I'll show you ignorance!\""
msgstr "\"남용이라고? 남용이 뭔지 보여주마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/4WM_String
msgctxt "57b26331-2945-4201-863c-e8eeeca0b140"
msgid "\"You already do. Daily.\""
msgstr "\"너는 그랬다. 매일.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/5KW_String
msgctxt "70ad6026-4b07-42b5-98ba-b8f8080b7c25"
msgid ""
"\"I'll boil your maggots! I'll impale every wriggling piece of you on thorns!"
"\""
msgstr "\"네 구더기를 끓여주마! 너의 꼼지락거리는 모든 것을 가시로 꿰어주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/6WM_String
msgctxt "91e360bf-cdd4-40e0-b972-93578ad7366e"
msgid "\"We will enjoy letting our worms crawl through your skull.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 벌레가 네 두개골을 기어다니는 것을 즐기지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/7KW_String
msgctxt "65bdddd3-01a0-4692-b002-ed4000e70259"
msgid "\"The First Crown is mine! Nyrissa gave it to me!\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관은 내것이다! 나이리사가 나에게 준 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/8WM_String
msgctxt "e5d67377-84af-4476-ba4e-3d157a009daf"
msgid ""
"\"Times change, Knurly Witch. Your influence has waned. The crown is ours.\""
msgstr "\"시간은 흐른다. 옹이 마녀. 너의 영향력은 약화되었다. 왕관은 우리 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/PlayerAttacksKW_String
msgctxt "4278d33e-5995-4073-8de1-06ae8b52d86c"
msgid "\"Impudence! I'll see you groveling in the mud like your worm-lord!\""
msgstr "\"뻔뻔스럽군! 너의 벌레 주인처럼 진흙탕을 기어다니는 너를 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/PlayerAttacksWM_String
msgctxt "ea2f97d6-3c8a-47cb-b42c-ea482baefbed"
msgid ""
"\"Unwise, mortal. Your mistress can't even protect herself from my justice, "
"let alone you.\""
msgstr "\"현명하지 못하구나. 필멸자. 너의 여주인은 내 정의에서 너를 보호할 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/PlayerEnters1WM_String
msgctxt "e64a1ecb-9c4d-4064-aaef-091f70f3e7d4"
msgid "\"Really, Knurly Witch — you seek aid from these pathetic creatures?\""
msgstr "\"정말인가, 옹이 마녀. 이 불쌍한 생물들로부터 도움을 구하는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/PlayerEnters2KW_String
msgctxt "51709dda-96bd-436a-b504-b563ce81f482"
msgid ""
"\"Don't try your mind-games on me, wormface! I know these are your minions!\""
msgstr "\"심리 작전을 시도하지 마라. 벌레녀석! 이것들이 모두 네의 부하인 걸 알고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/ShykaAppearsKWWM_String
msgctxt "73772cc1-d86e-41e5-8b53-487865922234"
msgid "\"Shyka!\""
msgstr "\"샤이카!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/KW_WM_Battle/ShykaAppears_String
msgctxt "e13da785-07f8-424b-a4bf-9c1efeed3ab2"
msgid "\"Hello, children.\""
msgstr "\"안녕.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/SalimBodyDisappears_String
msgctxt "ccdec7dd-20bd-4597-956f-920ec7392840"
msgid ""
"Without warning, Salim's corpse dissolves into thin air, leaving behind only "
"a faint trace of gray dust in the shape of a spiral."
msgstr "경고없이 살림의 시체는 희미한 공기에 녹아 희미한 회색 먼지가 되어 나선 형태의 바람을 남깁니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/SalimIntroduce_String
msgctxt "0bdb6d66-7538-4e03-a928-f24ef97e9f93"
msgid "\"You there! Help me with this thing!\""
msgstr "\"너 거기 있군! 이것 좀 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/SatyrPillarAfterBattleOnce_String
msgctxt "63db50f9-e4fc-4e80-ac76-ff812b4f48df"
msgid ""
"It seems that one of the purple worms smashed the pillar during the battle, "
"breaking the crown shard loose from the stone."
msgstr "퍼플웜 중 하나가 전투 중에 기둥을 박살내어 왕관 모양의 조각이 부숴집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Barks/SatyrPillarEmpty_String
msgctxt "1ee9eab2-be11-4b01-9405-95e3ef7a4870"
msgid "The pillar where the crown piece was embedded."
msgstr "왕관 조각이 새겨진 기둥입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "b480f194-2ec5-4e70-bcea-e7349803ee90"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8c512942-e5a4-4b2c-ae7b-9faaf5dab6c0"
msgid "\"Who is your lady?\""
msgstr "\"너의 여인이 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e71f0bf3-c4df-4e7f-b9ef-ed6ef73f5364"
msgid "\"What do you know about Briar?\""
msgstr "\"찔레에 대해 무엇을 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f30dbdfd-2d97-4c3c-9426-2e15dc6d4cdd"
msgid "Offered to settle the matter with the Horned Hunter peacefully."
msgstr "뿔난 사냥꾼에게 문제를 평화롭게 해결하자고 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d8af21c8-9380-45a6-8e54-c6a9d117ce9f"
msgid ""
"\"I need to go through that portal, but I have no desire to kill you. "
"Perhaps we can come to an arrangement?\""
msgstr "\"나는 그 포털을 지나가야 하지만 너를 죽이고 싶지 않다. 아마 우리는 합의에 도달할 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "47ce27fe-7e41-4abf-8bad-758ed596e7e4"
msgid "[Attack] \"You shouldn't have stood in my way.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내 길을 막지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c9d9d155-c6d4-4a3f-862b-65cbe5840cda"
msgid ""
"{n}The darkness visible behind the slits in the creature's helm is pitch "
"black, but you still feel its gaze upon you — unwavering, probing.{/n} \"Ah, "
"the little {mf|king|queen} from the sand castle. How fares your kingdom? Is "
"there anything left for me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}괴물의 투구에 뚫려있는 구멍에 어두운 것은 칠흑 같이 새까맣고 여전히 당신을 시선을 사로 잡고 있습니다.{/n} \"아. 모래성의 "
"{mf|왕|여왕}로군. 왕국은 벌이가 괜찮은가? 나를 위해 남겨준 것이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "1470056b-e283-47aa-b27f-8ece1c4a823e"
msgid ""
"\"You may call me the Horned Hunter. At any ruler's court, there is a place "
"for the likes of me. You do love hunting, don't you? But I suppose here, in "
"the mortal world, you hunt elk or bears as game. I hound more... impressive "
"beasts for my lady. Ancient monsters, aliens from the outer realms... and "
"self-proclaimed {mf|king|queen}s who would think to challenge us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 나를 뿔난 사냥꾼이라고 부르면 된다. 어느 통치자의 궁정에도 나와 같은 사람을 위한 장소가 있다. 너는 사냥을 좋아하지, "
"안그런가? 내 생각에 필멸의 세상에서는 엘크를 사냥하거나 곰을 재미로 사냥한다고 들었다. 나는 내 아가씨를 위해 더... 인상적인 "
"짐승들을 사냥했다. 고대의 괴물, 다른 행성의 외계인... 그리고 감히 우리에게 도전하는 자칭 {mf|왕|여왕}들.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d0a960b9-87ed-49ba-91dd-fda9c07231ac"
msgid ""
"\"What, you came all this way without knowing whom you would be facing? The "
"self-confidence of mortals always amazes me. It's as though you think you, "
"not I, shall revive in the {g|First World}First World{/g} should trouble "
"arise. I serve my lady Nyrissa, the Lady of the Thousandbreaths. And you are "
"on the threshold of her demesne.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 누구를 대면하는지 모른 채 여기로 왔단 말이냐? 필멸자의 자신감은 항상 나를 깜짝 놀라게 하는군. {g|First World}"
"태초 세계{/g}에서 되살아나는 것이 내가 아니라 너라고 생각하나 본데, 그러면 문제가 생길 것이다. 나는 천 개의 숨결의 여인이자 나의 "
"주인인 나이리사를 섬긴다. 그리고 너는 그녀 영지의 문턱에 발을 들였지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "cef42aae-cae9-4a61-a893-2a0df63c87c6"
msgid ""
"{n}The creature tilts its head and breathes loudly, as though sniffing.{/n} "
"\"Curious. You carry with you what my lady's servants have spent ages "
"searching the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} for. I'll have to report "
"that. Or better yet, I could simply wait a bit and take Briar from your "
"corpse. Do you have a preference?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}생물은 머리를 기울이고 냄새를 맡는 것처럼 큰소리로 호흡합니다.{/n} \"별난 일이군. 너는 내 주인의 하인들이 {g|Stolen "
"Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 수 세기에 걸쳐 찾았던 그 물건을 가지고있다. 나는 그것을 보고할 것이다. 아니면 더 좋은 방법으로, "
"조금 기다렸다가 네 시체에서 찔레를 가져갈 수도 있겠지. 어떤 것이 좋은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "f56bb9d6-ae29-48ea-ba81-40d7ac1dcded"
msgid ""
"\"An arrangement? With me?\" {n}The Horned Hunter shrugs.{/n} \"I wasn't "
"going to fight you anyway. After all, I'm not the guard of this portal. As "
"for the actual guard... well, I don't think it will be interested in making "
"any 'arrangements' with you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"합의를 하자고? 나와?\" {n}뿔난 사냥꾼은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"나는 어쨌든 너와 싸울 예정이 아니었다. 결국 나는 이 "
"포털을 수호자가 아니다. 수호자에 관해서는... 글쎄 나는 그것이 너와 어떠한 '합의'를 하는데에도 관심이 없을 것이라고 생각한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "200a88b1-b66d-4045-8bbe-2e97e25bc282"
msgid ""
"\"What makes you think it is I who stands in your way? I'm the Horned "
"Hunter, not the Guard. If you're so interested in a fight, try defeating "
"that...\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 길을 막은 것이 누구라고 생각하느냐? 나는 수호자가 아닌 뿔난 사냥꾼이다. 싸움에 관심이 있다면, 아것들을 물리쳐라...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "c6fbff39-cb33-44a7-af3f-42702978a3d0"
msgid ""
"{n}...You hear it before you see it. A hoarse, wavering rumble can be heard "
"from all around you. The sound itself moves as though it's alive, washing "
"over you and rolling back, boring into your ears and echoing into the depths "
"of your consciousness. And then...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}... 그것을 보기 전에 당신은 소리를 듣습니다. 주변의 모든 곳에서 쉰 목소리가 들립니다. 소리 자체는 마치 살아있는 것처럼 "
"움직이고 몸을 울리고 뒤에서도 와서 당신의 귀를 꿰뚫고 당신의 의식의 깊은 곳에 울려 퍼집니다. 그리고...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "ae631fa2-2582-4c17-bf3b-7d69248c7bf4"
msgid ""
"\"I know it is no toy for mortals. And I know my mistress will be happy "
"should I bring Briar to her. My mistress is difficult to please, so I value "
"every chance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그것을 필멸자의 장난감이 아니라는 것을 알고 있다. 나는 찔레를 가져와야만 한다. 내 여주인은 까다로워서 나는 모든 기회를 "
"소중하게 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "b5da7b31-d0e3-48f0-a5d9-097678d77949"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, the traitor is here, too. You were a poor servant to "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, and equally disappointing to my mistress. I'll "
"enjoy watching you let down your third {mf|master|mistress}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 여기에도 반역자가 있구나. 너는 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 수하였고, 내 주인님에게도 똑같이 실망을 안겼다. 네가 "
"세 번째 {mf|주인|여주인}아래 쓰러지는 모습을 즐길 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/HornedHunterNearPortal/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d2b31e70-558c-45fc-a224-a54078c01e15"
msgid ""
"\"It is not so difficult. Nyrissa always seems to enjoy the death and "
"destruction she causes.\""
msgstr "\"그렇게 어렵지는 않다. 나이리사는 항상 죽음과 파괴를 일으키는 것을 즐기지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Items/TheFirstCrown_complete_DisplayName_String
msgctxt "ed64f042-7636-4b85-a160-f38d4dd2cb15"
msgid "The First Crown"
msgstr "첫 번째 왕관"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Items/TheFirstCrown_complete_description_String
msgctxt "4f754ebe-9cf9-4287-ad11-a10757be994d"
msgid ""
"This elaborate crown of worked silver and emeralds has a decidedly sylvan "
"theme."
msgstr "은으로 만들고 에메랄드가 박힌 정교한 왕관에는 실반어가 뚜렷하게 새겨져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Items/TheFirstCrown_shard1_description_String
msgctxt "b386be3f-c796-48a6-b312-3989e0470344"
msgid ""
"This fritted piece of silvery metal used to be a part of a florid crown "
"adorned with emeralds and a leaf-and-vine motif."
msgstr "이 은빛 조각은 에메랄드와 나뭇잎과 덩굴이 꾸며진 월계수 왕관의 일부였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Items/TheFirstCrown_shard1_name_String
msgctxt "164cace0-0931-4e99-8946-e67aff3fc8c1"
msgid "First Crown Fragment"
msgstr "첫 번째 왕관의 조각"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8b25c332-7c59-4916-b73f-bb08bc38af96"
msgid "\"I'm nobody's minion.\""
msgstr "\"나는 누구의 수하도 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "4ce2224c-bb5f-447f-9939-05d846f7285a"
msgid "\"Fallen friends? What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"전사한 친구들? 여기 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "da353c6c-9e92-4221-af7e-ecaa1d6d2327"
msgid "\"The Knurly Witch sent me to help you.\""
msgstr "\"옹이 마녀가 나를 보내 너를 돕게 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0007_Text_String
msgctxt "98ecb005-9556-46db-9f5d-6f5df3d1427f"
msgid "\"I'm on the mission from Shyka the Many. Please stand aside.\""
msgstr "\"나는 다수의 샤이카의 임무를 수행하고 있다. 비켜서라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "bea62fd3-dbc7-4ffb-83aa-c0e878eba28c"
msgid "\"I'm here for the crown. Hand it over.\""
msgstr "\"나는 왕관을 찾으러 왔다. 내게 넘겨라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "a2d05766-1298-45c7-8fae-d6e14e36777f"
msgid "[Attack] \"Time to chop some wood!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"가지치기 할 시간이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "b79a649d-ada0-47da-b4dd-bbac27112f32"
msgid "\"I'm just passing through.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그냥 지나가는 길이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0020_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1a3adf4a-0b5f-4e65-bbec-f4ff4f162641"
msgid "Expressed your condolences to the treant."
msgstr "나무의 정령에게 조의를 표합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "0a8a9195-5509-49d7-9b11-65733e4835cf"
msgid "\"I'm sorry for your loss.\""
msgstr "\"애도의 뜻을 표한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "3c88705b-a921-4a36-bf28-fd0d91ec3377"
msgid "\"Why did the Wriggling Man try to steal the crown?\""
msgstr "\"꿈틀거리는 남자는 왜 왕관을 훔치려고 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "4b811306-4b41-459a-86ac-dc88bece3878"
msgid "\"If you hate the crown so much, let me take it to the witch.\""
msgstr "\"왕관이 싫으면 마녀에게 가져가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "c01e019b-0291-4208-86b3-8f17c06b3ea9"
msgid "\"I can't let you return the crown to the Knurly Witch.\""
msgstr "\"왕관을 옹이 마녀에게 돌려보내게 둘 수는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "4c6eb2c7-79cd-483d-8830-ad0e16eacd87"
msgid "\"I'll leave you to it, then.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 네게 맡기겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "c1967f89-5093-4fdd-80f3-a8ea0b1422d1"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8535930a-9171-4cf9-a215-51bd81048dc7"
msgid ""
"{n}The forest here looks blasted apart by a meteorite, complete with fallen "
"trees and a crater at its center. Surrounding the crater are several huge, "
"twisted trees. Suddenly the trees turn to look at you, and a jagged maw "
"opens in one of the trunks. With a voice like creaking wood, the treant "
"says,{/n} \"Who disturbs the prayers to our fallen friends? More of the "
"{d|Wriggling}Wriggling Man's{/d} obscene minions?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여기의 숲은 운석이 떨어져 탄 자국이 있고 나무가 쓰러져 중앙에 분화구가 있습니다. 분화구 주변에는 여러 개의 거대한 엉킨 나무가 "
"있습니다. 갑자기 나무들이 당신을 돌아보고는 톱니 모양의 구멍이 줄기 중 하나에서 열립니다. 나무가 삐걱거리는 소리로 나무 정령이 "
"말합니다.{/n} \"누가 우리의 전사한 친구들에게 기도하는 것을 방해하는 건가? {d|Wriggling}꿈틀거리는 남자{/d}의 더러운 "
"수하인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0002_Text_String
msgctxt "5c4de5bf-98fa-4090-b630-f7011d41f55c"
msgid "\"Who disturbs the prayers to our fallen friends?\""
msgstr "\"누가 우리의 전사한 친구들에게 기도하는 것을 방해하는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "cf1c94a9-9496-409c-aa17-8b95e1570bed"
msgid ""
"\"Then you are not our concern. Leave this place and let us mourn our dead.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 너는 우리의 관심사가 아니다. 이곳을 떠나서 우리가 죽은자를 위해 슬퍼하게 두어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "5043aa4e-ee91-414b-a649-bee05c05f4ee"
msgid ""
"\"The Wriggling Man happened.\"{n} The treant's words are slow and sad. {/n}"
"\"In his attempt to steal the First Crown from our mistress, he broke it. "
"The magic blasted apart this grove — you stand among the corpses of our "
"beloved trees. We must pray for the healing of this place, then return this "
"hateful crown to its rightful owner, the {d|Knurly}Knurly Witch{/d}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"꿈틀거리는 남자의 짓이다.\" {n}나무 정령의 말투는 느리고 슬픕니다.{/n} \"우리의 여왕에게서 첫 번째 왕관을 훔치려고 "
"시도하면서 그가 저질렀다. 마법이 이 숲을 불태웠다. 너는 우리가 사랑하는 나무의 시체 한가운데에 서있는 것이다. 우리는 이 장소의 "
"치유를 위해 기도해야 하며 이 끔찍한 왕관을 정당한 소유자 {d|Knurly}옹이 마녀{/d}에게 넘겨야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0014_Text_String
msgctxt "e98101de-5dfc-47a3-ad7d-a0d911ad5a3d"
msgid ""
"{n}The treant looks puzzled.{/n} \"This is not {g|Shyka}Shyka's{/g} domain. "
"All here bow to Nyrissa, and to our mistress the Knurly Witch. You will "
"leave now, or your blood will water the witch's garden.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나무 정령은 당혹스러워 합니다.{/n} \"여기는 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}의 영토가 아니다. 여기 모두가 나이리사와 우리의 "
"여주인인 옹이 마녀의 것이다. 이제 떠나라. 그렇지 않으면 너의 피가 마녀의 정원에 물들 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "d60968c9-fa68-47b4-a5df-becc7ccd4216"
msgid ""
"{n}The treant glowers.{/n} \"The First Crown rightfully belongs to the "
"Knurly Witch! Your writhing master will never touch it again!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나무 정령은 흥분합니다.{/n} \"첫 번째 왕관은 당연히 옹이 마녀의 것이다! 너의 비틀린 주인은 다시는 손 대지 못할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "a5b9cf6f-e326-4e77-8a2d-1089214658cc"
msgid ""
"\"Then pass and begone.\"{n} The treant turns back to its quiet "
"contemplation of the pit.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그러면 지나가고 사라져라.\" {n}나무 정령은 구덩이에 대한 조용한 묵상으로 돌아갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "14f939cd-ccfe-4dc5-852a-d0950c8a46b7"
msgid ""
"{n}The treant ponders this for several moments. At last, he says,{/n} \"That "
"is wise. You could take the crown to the Knurly Witch for us, while we "
"comfort the grieving forest.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나무 정령은 때때로 숙고합니다. 마침내 그가 말합니다.{/n} \"그것은 현명한 일이다. 네가 왕관을 옹이 마녀에게 가져가면 우리는 "
"슬픔에 가득 찬 숲을 위로할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "8d66dd73-38b1-4d5b-848e-7cb3b4283695"
msgid ""
"{n}The treant frowns.{/n} \"You are not of the witch's brood. You are a rot —"
" an infestation. We will cut you out.\""
msgstr "{n}나무 정령은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"너는 마녀의 자식이 아니야. 너는 썩어빠진 침입자다. 너를 없앨 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "4219583d-6cf4-4ad4-9f61-b395a04af653"
msgid "\"As we are.\" {n}The treant turns back to his prayers.{/n}"
msgstr "\"알겠다.\" {n}나무 정령은 다시 기도합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "e1132cb1-40e1-4483-bfcf-ee81d4d1ca21"
msgid ""
"\"Why does the Wriggling Man do anything? Because he's a vile, disgusting "
"creature who seeks to rob our mistress of her place at the Nymph Queen's "
"side. He is the rot in the wood. A weed to be pulled. The larvae that devour "
"a forest. The Knurly Witch will cure Thousandbreaths of his sickness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"왜 꿈틀거리는 남자는 횡포를 서슴지 않지? 왜냐하면 그는 님프의 여왕 편에서 우리 여주인의 땅을 강탈하려는 사악하고 역겨운 생물이기 "
"때문이다. 그는 나무의 썩은 부위다. 잡초는 뽑아야 한다. 숲을 갉아먹는 벌레다. 옹이 마녀는 천 개의 숨결을 치료할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "6387c28a-4b53-4f7a-b199-15466c8c4ef5"
msgid "\"Then you must be pruned. Your bones will fertilize our forest.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 너는 잘라내져야 한다. 너의 뼈가 우리 숲을 비옥하게 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d1c9f8ba-5f47-4378-b612-8094d7718106"
msgid "\"Poor things! They mourn their burned tree friends so much!\""
msgstr "\"불쌍한 것! 그들은 불타는 나무 친구들을 너무 많이 애도한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0037_Text_String
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "299eef9a-70b6-468c-9d4e-82c9b9edf8e7"
msgid ""
"\"These creatures are much different than the other minions of Nyrissa. They "
"display loyalty to their fallen friends and to their mistress. It would be "
"sad to see them as our enemies.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 생물들은 나이리사의 다른 부하들과 많이 다르다. 그들은 전사한 친구들과 그들의 여주인에게 충성심을 표한다. 그들이 적이 되는 것이 "
"슬프다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "ec8d397b-7eb9-47a6-86b5-f3da1e498d6c"
msgid ""
"\"Talking logs mourn the silent ones, hmm? Heh heh! Hey, stump, wanna see a "
"magic trick? One snap of my fingers, and I'll make a bunch of bushes "
"disappear!\""
msgstr ""
"\"말하는 나뭇가지가 조용한 것을 애도한다고? 하하! 이봐. 그루터기. 마술 하나 보여줄까? 내가 손가락을 튕기면 덤불이 사라질 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/KnurlyAgents/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "9c0067b6-b18f-406b-a543-e384c9eac7e8"
msgid ""
"\"Forest's wounds heal easily. Much harder healing the soul of one who has "
"lost their loved ones.\""
msgstr "\"숲의 상처는 쉽게 치유된다. 사랑하는 이들을 잃어버린 영혼을 치유하는 것은 훨씬 어렵지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d614cb27-b205-469e-babd-67ca40d6a100"
msgid "...stepped into the portal!"
msgstr "...포털에 들어갔습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7a2f7034-d988-4919-b953-f71fb89d3f6c"
msgid ""
"...left the portal for now, leaving to take care of some other surely "
"important business!"
msgstr "...지금 당장은 포탈을 떠나 다른 중요한 일을 위해 떠납니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "17788797-2f08-4b62-a008-9ed39b6d3b7f"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "07c9796a-17e8-4c3d-8437-4891c44d23d3"
msgid ""
"The portal before us gleamed mysteriously. It didn't look at all like the "
"one we saw in the Womb of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, but there was no doubt — "
"this was the way to the {g|Lamashtu}First World{/g}! We barely made it out "
"with our skin the previous time — and not without the help of a mysterious "
"old gnome. What would await us this time? Would we ever see the light of our "
"own world again? Would we ever return to our cozy homes and the happy smiles "
"of our friends? Or would we find ourselves brought to ruins, reduced to "
"bones? Without wasting any time on dark thoughts such as these, the "
"{mf|king|queen} quickly..."
msgstr ""
"우리 앞에 있는 포털은 신비스럽게 빛났습니다. 그것은 우리가 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 자궁에서 보았던 것과 전혀 다르지만, "
"{g|Lamashtu}태초 세계{/g}로 가는 길임은 의심의 여지가 없었습니다! 우리는 신비한 늙은 노움의 도움 없이 간신히 "
"도달했습니다. 이번에 우리에게 무엇이 기다리고 있을까요? 우리는 우리 세계의 빛을 다시 볼 수 있을까요? 우리는 아늑한 집에 돌아가 "
"친구들의 행복한 미소를 볼 수 있을까요? 아니면 우리는 폐허를 발견하고 훗날 누군가 우리의 뼈를 발견할까요? 암담한 생각에 시간을 "
"낭비하지 않고 {mf|왕|여왕}은 서둘러..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "e05f5d34-09c6-4022-9d28-1111bf67a040"
msgid ""
"The {mf|king|queen} turned and looked back one last time, almost as if "
"saying farewell to {mf|his|her} domain, and then rushed forward without fear!"
msgstr "{mf|왕|여왕}는 마치 자신의 영토에 작별 인사하는 것처럼 마지막으로 한 번 더 돌아보고는 두려움 없이 앞으로 나아갔습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "862acebb-e39e-4f34-bda5-77b5a1dc6d94"
msgid ""
"...We had barely crossed the threshold before an invisible magic took our "
"sense of direction from us. Up and down, forward and back, these lost "
"meaning as the portal we stepped through became a hole we were falling into!"
msgstr ""
"...보이지 않는 마술이 우리의 방향 감각을 잃게 하기 전에 우리는 경계를 거의 넘었습니다. 위아래와 앞뒤가 바뀌고 우리가 밟은 포털은 "
"우리가 떨어지는 구멍이 되었습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8a86f964-7eec-48d2-90dd-c7368dc0c71b"
msgid ""
"Each of us reached for the one they most feared to lose or the one they most "
"wanted to hold on to."
msgstr "우리 각자는 잃을 것을 두려워했던 것이나 가장 붙잡고 싶었던 것에 도달했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "90718a2c-5f60-421e-93cd-e5683a7ee71b"
msgid ""
"(Except Harrim — he just folded his hands over his chest, calmly plummeting "
"along with an air of mindful detachment!)"
msgstr "(가슴을 손으로 감싸고 조심스럽게 머리를 숙인 채 평정을 유지하는 하림을 제외하고 말입니다!)"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/PortalToFW_BE/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "1963934a-d55c-45d2-ad59-33c1f4cdea74"
msgid ""
"...But no matter how tightly we clung, the mysterious force tore us from "
"each other, hiding us among clouds of magical fog that swirled around us as "
"it carried us along, all the while leaving us utterly alone, until a light "
"finally glimmered ahead..."
msgstr ""
"...그러나 우리가 아무리 단단히 붙잡았을지라도 불가사의 한 힘은 우리를 소용돌이 치는 구름 사이에 숨겨 서로를 찢어 데려가 버렸고 빛이 "
"마침내 희미해질 때 우리는 홀로 남겨졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4a6de46a-b5ec-4314-aeec-6edf01458866"
msgid "\"I've got it for you. Here you go.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 줄 것이 있다. 여기 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "0f21cd1c-50cf-4746-b6f1-021c5093c981"
msgid "[Lie] \"Sorry, I wasn't able to get it.\""
msgstr "[거짓] \"미안하다, 그것을 찾을 수 없었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "0a06c37b-a390-4bbf-9582-145bc32fd725"
msgid "\"I've got it, but I'm not giving it to you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그것을 가지고 있지만 네게 그것을 주지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1e6e1e55-7c23-4a12-a1a3-91ddb8457a69"
msgid "\"Let's talk price. What's it worth to you?\""
msgstr "\"가격을 얘기하자. 그 물건은 너에게 어떤 가치가 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "f3c71598-45a3-47f3-ac8b-60442a19e6cb"
msgid "\"Did you know there's a ghost tied to it?\""
msgstr "\"귀신들린 물건이라는 것을 알고 있었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "ddfeb55c-99d3-42b8-92d1-5d5eac9e99d3"
msgid "\"Let's talk about it later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 얘기하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b064cde5-2468-46c3-b4af-e4e3bfae5326"
msgid "\"Here you go, Shyka.\""
msgstr "\"여기 있다, 샤이카.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0016_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6acdedb1-05a1-4b7a-8039-63eb6cff8e4b"
msgid "Allowed Salim to take care of the trapped ghost."
msgstr "살림이 갇힌 유령을 손볼 수 있게 허락합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "74d721e6-2abc-4532-bd41-1c06d0377962"
msgid "\"Here, Salim. Have your goddess put Lethoriel to rest.\""
msgstr "\"여기 있다. 살림. 너의 여신께서 레소리엘을 쉬게 하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "003fd817-b1c0-4bb6-8dcc-8bb6f1eaf99c"
msgid "Kept the First Crown."
msgstr "첫 번째 왕관을 가졌습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "1a30d109-5e36-49c6-9637-916d4d8d46b6"
msgid "\"I'm going to keep it.\""
msgstr "\"내가 가지고 있겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "3a50296b-f8b4-4a8d-8493-f49205cd6be6"
msgid "\"I'm going to set the ghost free myself.\""
msgstr "\"나는 유령을 풀어 놓을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "499b800e-a07a-40b1-9e0b-9c728a3ea798"
msgid "\"I need to think about it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 생각해 볼 필요가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "839a1e50-b665-4144-9685-9b6dde667cc9"
msgid "Presented the crown to Shyka right after denying it to her."
msgstr "그녀에게 그것을 부정한 후에 왕관을 샤이카에게 선물합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "295481d1-0748-4b45-a758-883aa1951f22"
msgid "\"I've changed my mind. Here, Shyka — you take it.\""
msgstr "\"마음을 바꿨다. 여기있다, 샤이카. 네가 가져가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "36bc5f01-f465-4f97-bbba-d94434b815b9"
msgid "Decided to free the ghost trapped inside the crown."
msgstr "왕관 안에 갇힌 유령을 풀어 주기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "26f83498-99db-45bf-800b-55779cefb73c"
msgid "[Free the ghost] \"Lethoriel!\""
msgstr "[유령을 풀어줍니다] \"레소리엘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "adf98c62-1972-40b9-96c5-2f0726111cf4"
msgid "\"I've changed my mind.\""
msgstr "\"마음이 바뀌었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "7e8b0bbf-d230-4e07-8058-1d8d6dbf3e60"
msgid "\"I'll do it later.\""
msgstr "\"나중에 할거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "8f76c733-6c87-40a3-96b5-0415ef727c6d"
msgid "\"I'll try!\""
msgstr "\"내가 해 볼게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "39d2ba7a-41f7-4734-b451-4d8ee54ea50a"
msgid "\"What? No way!\""
msgstr "\"뭐야? 안 돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "4da24c80-97eb-4e0b-9da1-7716b1f7a24e"
msgid "\"But I killed you!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 내가 널 죽였어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "3c5d58d8-2002-4017-890e-b529bfca0311"
msgid "\"I've decided what to do with the crown.\""
msgstr "\"나는 왕관을 어떻게 처리해야 할지 결정했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "f503ffa9-4bc1-44bc-86df-cccf99c1e35a"
msgid ""
"{n}You look up to find {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} waiting for you at the edge of the "
"trees, arms crossed.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 나무의 가장자리에서 팔짱을 끼고 당신을 기다리는 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}를 올려다 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "a9bac3ce-ca54-4447-9e2f-5f5a779454f5"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Salim}Salim{/d} stands near the Eldest, his arms crossed. He nods to "
"you but says nothing.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}{d|Salim}살림{/d}이 팔짱을 낀 원로 근처에 서있습니다. 그는 당신에게 끄덕이지만 아무 말도하지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "19472f61-4aab-4d2f-8429-2df745ca560b"
msgid ""
"{n}Despite being dead the last time you saw him, {d|Salim}Salim{/d} now "
"stands in front of you, looking irritated.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 그를 마지막으로 보았을 때 죽었음에도 불구하고 {d|Salim}살림{/d}은 이제 당신 앞에 서있고 짜증이 나 "
"보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "a119296a-5c5f-4034-a5b8-87ec2c79ae02"
msgid "\"Well? Did you get it for us?\""
msgstr "\"음? 네가 우리를 위해 가져왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "53dd7bc2-db26-4144-ace4-db90483116d0"
msgid ""
"\"Well?\" {n}{d|AnotherShyka}Shyka{/d} asks.{/n} \"Did you get it for us?\""
msgstr "\"음? {n}{d|AnotherShyka}샤이카{/d}가 묻습니다.{/n} \"우리를 위해 가져왔어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "9123b43c-3026-4519-afa8-496a98bc02f8"
msgid ""
"{n}As {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} reaches for the crown, Salim steps forward and "
"raises a hand between you. {/n}\"Before you do this, I think you should "
"consider that the ghost tied to this crown is a mortal soul, trapped and "
"kept from its rightful afterlife. As an agent of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, "
"Goddess of Death, I could take the crown to her realm and ensure that the "
"ghost is put to rest safely, as he deserves.\" {n}At Shyka's shocked "
"expression, he laughs.{/n} \"Don't look so surprised! I told you I'd help "
"you locate it, and I did. But putting souls to rest is still my job.\"{n} He "
"turns back to you. {/n}\"So what do you want to do?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 왕관에 손을 대자 살림은 앞으로 나아가서 둘 사이에서 손을 올립니다.{/n} \"이것을하기 전에 "
"나는 이 왕관에 묶여있는 유령이 사후세계로 가지 못하고 갇힌 필멸자의 영혼이라는 것을 말하고 싶다. 죽음의 여신 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 대리인으로서 나는 왕관을 그녀의 영역으로 가져갈 수 있고 유령이 승천할 수 있도록 도울 수 있다."
"\" {n}샤이카의 충격받은 표정을 보고 그는 웃습니다.{/n} \"놀라지 마! 네가 그것을 찾을 수 있도록 도와 줄 것이라고 했고 "
"그렇게 되었어. 하지만 영혼을 쉬게하는 것은 여전히 내 직업이다.\" {n}그는 당신을 돌아 봅니다.{/n} \"그래서 어떻게 하고 싶지?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "7d40f08e-a068-49e3-a50c-89f495225d11"
msgid ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} shakes their head. {/n}\"You really shouldn't lie to "
"an {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, child. I'll let it slide this once — consider my "
"indulgence part of your reward. Now hand over the crown.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 거짓말해서는 안된다. 애송이. 나는 "
"한 번만 봐 줄 것이다. 너의 보상 중 하나는 나의 무관심으로 바꿀 것이다. 이제 왕관을 넘겨라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "7cfb8e07-bfc9-46c8-b889-b84e8fd0517f"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim laughs at {g|Shyka}Shyka's{/g} shocked expression. He grins and "
"claps them on the shoulder.{/n} \"You and your type never learn, do you? You "
"think of us mortals as dogs to be trained, but we can still surprise you.\""
"{n} He turns to you, and his expression sobers. {/n}\"In that case, I have a "
"proposal. The ghost tied to this crown is a mortal soul, trapped and kept "
"from its rightful afterlife. As an agent of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, "
"goddess of death, I could take the crown to her realm and ensure that the "
"ghost is put to rest safely, as he deserves. It's my job, actually.\"{n} He "
"looks you in the eye. {/n}\"So what do you want to do?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}샤이카의 충격받은 표정을 보고 살림은 웃습니다. 그는 씨익 웃고는 손뼉을 칩니다.{/n} \"너와 같은 족속은 배워본 적이 없군? "
"당신은 우리 인간을 훈련받은 개로 생각하지만 우리는 여전히 너를 놀라게 할 수 있다.\" {n}그는 당신에게 돌아섰고 그의 표정은 더욱 "
"진지합니다.{/n} \"이 경우에 나는 제안을 가지고 있다. 이 왕관에 묶여있는 유령이 사후세계로 가지 못하고 갇힌 필멸자의 영혼이다. "
"죽음의 여신 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 대리인으로서 나는 왕관을 그녀의 영역으로 가져갈 수 있고 유령이 승천할 수 있도록 "
"도울 수 있다. 그것이 나의 일이야.\"{n}그는 당신의 눈을 봅니다.{/n} \"그래서 어떻게 하고 싶지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "82c60465-c1e8-4b37-a631-b7b679cab078"
msgid ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} sighs. {/n}\"It's always money with you mortals, isn't "
"it? Measuring your tiny lives in shiny pebbles. Besides, I already told you —"
" giving me the crown will aid you in your quest against Nyrissa. But if you "
"must have a physical reward, so be it.\"{n} The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} reaches "
"into a sleeve and pulls out a bulging sack, showing it to you before "
"stashing it away again. {/n}\"This is yours, in exchange for the crown. Now "
"do we have a deal?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"너희 필멸자는 항상 돈이 문제겠지? 너의 작은 삶을 반짝이는 돌멩이로 "
"측정하지 않나. 이미 말 했을 텐데. 왕관을 주면 나이리사의 뜻을 반대하는 너의 임무를 도울 것이라고. 하지만 네가 물질적인 보상을 "
"기대한다면. 그렇게 해.\" {n}{g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 소매에 손을 넣어 부푼 자루를 꺼내고 당신에게 보여주고는 다시 집어 "
"넣습니다.{/n} \"이것은 왕관과 교환하면 네가 얻을 것이다. 이제 우리는 거래를 할 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "1ee78750-a672-4e22-bc00-55ce245276b1"
msgid ""
"\"Did I know about the ghost?\"{n} {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} smiles. {/n}\"Child, "
"why do you think I wanted it? I'm far too old to be excited about fancy "
"hats. Now are you going to give it to me or not?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 유령에 대해 알고 있었냐고?\" {n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 웃습니다.{/n} \"아이야. 왜 내가 그것을 원한다고 "
"생각하느냐? 나는 너무 늙어 멋진 모자에 흥분하지 않는다. 이제 나에게 그것을 줄 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "078f6725-2132-463c-9c47-80e819674d16"
msgid ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} sighs. {/n}\"You try our patience — and from a time "
"god, that's really saying something. But very well. We'll be here when you "
"return.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"너는 우리의 인내심을 시험하는군. 시간의 신이 존재할 때부터 그것은 "
"정말로 무언가를 말하고 있다는 의미지. 하지만 알겠다. 네가 돌아올 때 우리는 여기에 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "e3410bd3-6715-4350-acdd-19f929d95446"
msgid ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} smile smugly, as they take the crown.{/n} \"We're glad "
"to see that some mortals understand how the world works. As we promised, "
"you've set in motion the events that we think you'll find quite beneficial. "
"The past is not so immutable as Nyrissa believes, nor her cup so full. But "
"here's a little something extra for your trouble.\"{n} The "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} reaches into a sleeve and pulls out a bulging sack, "
"tossing it at your feet. {/n}\"Now if you'll excuse us, we're late for an "
"appointment... or was that early?\"{n} With a thoughtful expression, Shyka "
"wink out of existence.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 그들이 왕관을 가져갈 때 의기양양하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"어떤 필멸자는 세상이 어떻게 돌아가는지를 "
"이해해서 기쁘게 생각한다. 우리가 약속했듯이 너는 네가 유익하다고 생각할 사건을 시작하였다. 과거는 나이리사가 믿는 것처럼 잔이 꽉 차지 "
"않은 것처럼 그렇게 변하지 않았군. 하지만 여기에 너의 문제를 해결하는 작은 선물이 있다.\" {n}{g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 "
"소매에 손을 넣어 부푼 자루를 꺼내고 당신에게 보여주고는 다시 집어 넣습니다.{/n} \"이제 변명하면 약속은 늦을 것이야... 아니면 "
"너무 서둘렀나?\" {n}사려 깊은 표정으로 샤이카는 살짝 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "569ddd9c-66f1-456a-86b4-2dfcd2fb15b1"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim accepts the crown with both hands, bowing slightly.{/n} \"Thank "
"you. I'll see that this soul is laid to rest properly. And I'll put in a "
"good word for you with the goddess's psychopomps — it may be that they can "
"grant you some favor in your battles to come.\"{n} He reaches up, pulls a "
"spiral-marked amulet from the neck of his robe, and promptly disappears.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 양손으로 왕관을 받고 살짝 절합니다.{/n} \"고맙다. 이 영혼이 잘 쉬기를.. 그리고 여신의 정신병자들에게는 너에 대해 "
"좋은 말을 전하겠다. 다가올 전투에서 네게 어떤 도움을 줄 수 있을지도 모른다.\" {n}그는 팔을 올려 나선 모양의 목걸이을 그의 "
"로브에서 꺼내고는 즉시 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0029_Text_String
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "95afa374-8b5e-49c7-baef-d4c91c8681d8"
msgid ""
"{n}Surprisingly, {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} laughs and turns a radiant smile on you. "
"{/n}\"We knew you'd make the right choice. God of the future, remember? "
"Everything's going according to plan. Now if you'll excuse me, We're late "
"for an appointment... or was that early?\"{n} With a thoughtful expression, "
"the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} winks out of existence.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}놀랍게도 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 웃으며 돌아서 당신에게 빛나는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"우리는 네가 올바른 선택을 할 "
"줄 알았다. 미래의 신을 기억하나? 모든 것이 계획에 따라 진행되고 있다. 이제 네가 변명하면 우리는 약속에 늦겠지... 아니면 너무 "
"서둘렀나?\" {n}사려 깊은 표정으로 샤이카는 살짝 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "4590cc94-5ba0-4a0c-9015-7e38131c1374"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim frowns.{/n} \"Keep it? I'd thought better of you. But so be it — in "
"that case, I'm done here.\"{n} He reaches up and pulls a spiral-marked "
"amulet from the neck of his robe.{/n} \"Until next time, {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g},"
"\"{n} he says, and promptly disappears.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"가지고 있어? 더 나은 선택을 기대했건만. 하지만 그렇게 된다면 나는 더 이상 볼 일이 없다.{n}"
"그는 팔을 올려 나선 모양의 목걸이를 그의 로브에서 꺼냅니다.{/n} \"다음에 보자, {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}.\" {n}그는 "
"말하고는 즉시 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "128a8ebb-88ff-4cc4-8832-27b7a0ae8cad"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim frowns.{/n} \"Are you sure? Undeath twists the mind — even ghosts "
"formed from the most innocent souls can be perverted by rage and loss. But..."
"\"{n} He unsheathes his sword and nods his readiness.{/n} \"If you're going "
"to do it, do it now. I'll try to clean up the mess if it goes wrong.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"확실한가? 불사는 정신을 뒤튼다. 가장 무고한 영혼들로 형성된 유령조차도 분노와 상실로 왜곡될 수 "
"있다. 하지만...\" {n}그는 칼을 내리고 준비되었다는 의미로 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"만약 네가 그렇게 한다면 지금 당장해라. "
"잘못되면 내가 뒤처리를 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "c9ad7d4e-ff8b-4fbc-99c2-70b322d55827"
msgid ""
"{n}As you call forth Lethoriel and command him to free himself, the crown "
"crumbles in your hands, and light seems to fade from the forest. The ghost "
"appears above you, twitching and writhing, expression flickering between "
"beatific and savage. Ghostly howls shriek through the trees. Salim looks "
"over to you, eyes wide. {/n}\"He's been a ghost too long — the backlash from "
"the magic is tearing his personality apart! You're the master — only you can "
"affect him. Quick, link your mind with his and lend him your willpower!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 레소리엘을 불러 자신을 해방하라고 명령하자, 왕관이 당신 손에 부수어지고 숲에서 빛이 사라지는 것처럼 보입니다. 유령이 당신 "
"위에 나타나서 기쁨과 난폭함이 뒤바뀌며 몸을 당기기도 하고 뒤틀기도 합니다. 유령의 울부 짖는 소리가 나무를 통해 비명을 지릅니다. "
"살림은 당신의 눈을 쳐다 봅니다.{/n} \"그는 너무 오래 유령이되었다. 마법의 반발로 인격이 찢어지고 있다! 네가 주인이니 너만이 "
"그에게 영향을 미칠 수 있다. 빨리 너의 마음과 그의 마음을 연결해서 의지력을 빌려주어야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "1d038fb1-8b26-4ab4-800a-df17aa09a6a7"
msgid ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} shake their head.{/n} \"While we don't like to "
"prophesy, we can tell you as someone who's seen the future that doing it "
"later would be exceedingly unwise. If you're going to do it, do it now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"우리는 예언하기를 좋아하지 않지만 미래를 보았던 사람으로서 말할 수 "
"있는데 나중에 그렇게 하는 것은 현명하지 않을 것이다. 그렇게 하려면 지금 해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "fe7b9e46-c8e0-41cb-8438-a8e0f63ccf67"
msgid "{n}Salim nods.{/n} \"Fair enough. What's the plan, then?\""
msgstr "{n}살림 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"좋다. 계획은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "42f7dfaa-0afe-4053-bdff-4ca9459bec67"
msgid ""
"{n}A flash flood of memories that aren't your own pours through you — scenes "
"from Lethoriel's past. At last the tide ebbs, and the ghost looks down at "
"you with clear eyes and a kind expression. {/n}\"Thank you. I feel more "
"myself than I have in ages. I will go now, to tend to my forest, and perhaps "
"explore the realms beyond this one.\"{n} His smile turns dangerous. {/n}\"But"
" when you fight Nyrissa's minions... well, just call my name, and I'll do "
"what I can.\"{n} With that, the ghost vanishes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 것이 아닌 레소리엘의 과거의 기억의 홍수가 되어 쏟아집니다. 마침내 홍수는 잦아들며 유령은 맑아진 눈과 친절한 표정으로 "
"당신을 내려다 봅니다.{/n} \"고맙다. 나는 수 세기 동안 내 나이보다 많은 것을 느꼈다. 나는 지금 숲으로 가서 아마도 이 영역 "
"너머의 영역을 탐구할 것이다.\" {n}그의 미소가 위험해집니다.{/n} \"그러나 나이리사의 부하들과 싸울 때... 내 이름을 부르면 "
"내가 할 수있는 일을 다할 것이다.\"{n}그 말을 끝으로 유령은 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "fd8f4ab8-52fc-45a3-9a8f-5edc659eff4b"
msgid ""
"{n}A flash flood of memories that aren't your own pours through you — "
"painful scenes from Lethoriel's past that scour your soul and leave you "
"gasping. When they end, Lethoriel looks down at you with a crazed "
"expression. {/n}\"My kingdom! They've stolen it! But I'll get it back, oh "
"yes...\"{n} With a mad giggle, the ghost vanishes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 것이 아닌 레소리엘의 과거의 기억의 홍수가 되어 쏟아지고, 당신은 숨을 헐떡입니다. 그것이 끝나고 레소리엘은 당신을 광기 "
"가득한 표정으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"나의 왕국을! 그들이 훔쳤다! 그러나 나는 그것을 되찾을 것이다. 물론이지...\" {n}"
"낄낄거리는 소리와 함께 유령은 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "40cab104-04c9-4863-bb16-37a0cb49570e"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim gives you a nod, then touches a spiral amulet around his neck and "
"disappears as well.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}살림은 당신에게 끄덕이고 그의 목에 걸린 나선형 목걸이을 건드리고는 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "f5b02728-9d98-4ff1-8966-9a47b4f69087"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim gives you a disgusted look.{/n} \"Well, that's just great. Looks "
"like I've got a new ghost to hunt down. Thanks a lot.\"{n} Then he touches a "
"spiral amulet around his throat and vanishes as well.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 당신에게 역겨운 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"흠. 대단한 일이군. 나는 사냥을 할 새로운 유령이 생긴 것 같아. 고마워.\" "
"{n}그런 다음 그는 자신의 목 주위에 나선형 목걸이을 건드리며 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Shyka
msgctxt "082a5374-d91a-4cda-848f-ff10a64ffa50"
msgid ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} is the last to leave, looking at you with surprise.{/n}"
" \"That... didn't go the way we expected.\" {n}Then they vanish, leaving you "
"alone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 당신을 놀람으로 쳐다보면서 마지막으로 떠납니다.{/n} \"그건... 우리가 예상했던 것이 아니었다."
"\" {n}그런 다음 그들은 사라졌고 당신만이 남았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "ac82d404-bac7-433b-bf4f-58abe46b06ed"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim frowns. {/n}\"Keep it? Then you're truly no better than Nyrissa's "
"scum. But so be it — in that case, I'm done here.\" {n}He reaches up and "
"pulls a spiral-marked amulet from the neck of his robe. {/n}\"Until next "
"time, {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g},\"{n} he says, and promptly disappears.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 찡그립니다.{/n} \"가지고 있어? 너는 쓰레기 나이리사와 다를 것이 없군. 하지만 그렇게 된다면 나는 더 이상 볼 일이 "
"없다.{n}그는 팔을 올려 나선 모양의 목걸이을 그의 로브에서 꺼냅니다.{/n} \"다음에 보자, {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}.\" "
"{n}그는 말하고는 즉시 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "3c49969d-195b-4b5f-a944-07894b12b361"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe you missed the part where I work for the death goddess. You think "
"the {g|Pharasma}Lady of Graves{/g} gives up her servants that easily?\"{n} "
"He glares at you and shakes his head. {/n}\"But you... Murdering a traveler "
"who's just survived a monster attack? I look forward to watching your "
"inevitable judgment in Pharasma's Court. But until then, I've got a job to "
"do. Let's get on with it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 죽음의 여신을 위해 일한다는 것을 잊어버렸나 보군. {g|Pharasma}무덤의 여인{/g}이 그 종들을 쉽게 포기할 거라 "
"생각하나?\" {n}그는 당신을 노려보고 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"그러나 너는... 괴물 공격에서 살아남았던 여행자를 살해했는가? "
"너를 파라즈마의 심판대에서 피할 수 없는 판단을 보길 바란다. 그러나 그때까지는 해야 할 일이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "0380ce6c-928b-43e8-a0dd-09ecbdf217bf"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim looks at you and shakes his head. With a sigh, he reaches up and "
"touches an amulet around his neck, then promptly disappears.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}Salim은 당신을 보고 머리를 흔듭니다. 한숨과 함께 그는 목에 걸린 목걸이를 만지자 즉시 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : CastleOfKnives_Salim
msgctxt "2a9e39ad-1b29-4378-84a1-2b293619539a"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim accepts the crown with both hands, regarding you with new "
"curiosity.{/n} \"Interesting. You kill a man in cold blood, yet give up a "
"god's favor to lay a ghost to rest.\"{n} He smirks. {/n}\"I'm not sure I'd "
"exactly call us even, but... you made the right choice. I'll the goddess's "
"psychopomps know — it may be that they'll grant you favor in your battles to "
"come.\"{n} He reaches up, pulls a spiral-marked amulet from the neck of his "
"robe, and promptly disappears.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 양손으로 왕관을 받고 호기심으로 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"흥미롭군. 너는 냉혈한 살인마이지만 유령을 승천시키기 위해 신의 "
"은총을 포기했다.\" {n}그는 웃습니다.{/n} \"우리를 같은 자라고 부를지는 확실하지 않지만 너는 옳은 선택을 했다. 여신의 "
"정신병자들에게는 너에 대해 좋은 말을 전하겠다. 다가올 전투에서 네게 어떤 도움을 줄 수 있을지도 모른다.\" {n}그는 팔을 올려 나선 "
"모양의 목걸이을 그의 로브에서 꺼내고는 즉시 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "02a09dcc-0282-47da-a2c2-8e0d8a46aa2b"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} are wise. Let them decide what to do with the "
"crown.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 현명하다. 왕관을 어떻게 처리할지 결정하게 두어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "e198a952-eeb6-4748-b270-70fdb72fbc82"
msgid ""
"\"Let's just keep the bauble! It's valuable, we took it — we should use it "
"for ourselves!\""
msgstr "\"그냥 우리가 가져가자! 이건 귀한 거니 우리를 위해 사용해야 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "665a2a5c-dc46-4083-9829-0c5fd3ed0df0"
msgid ""
"\"What if the poor ghost doesn't want to go to {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} or "
"to {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}? Why don't we set him free and let him decide what to "
"do himself?\""
msgstr ""
"\"만약에 그 불쌍한 유령이 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}나 {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}에게 가고 싶지 않다면? 그를 "
"자유롭게하고 자신이 무엇을 할지 결정하지 두는 것이 좋지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/Resolution/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c90308dd-39dc-4f7a-bc7a-786da905029c"
msgid ""
"\"We have no way of knowing what {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} will do. Can we really "
"trust someone with so many faces, so many personalities? Someone who keeps "
"their plans a mystery? Salim is right — best to give him the crown, let the "
"spirit rest, and restore things to normal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 무엇을 할지 알 수있는 방법이 없다. 많은 얼굴과 자아를 가진 사람을 믿을 수 있는 거야? 비밀에 "
"감추어진 계획을 가진 자들을? 살림이 옳다. 왕관을 주고 영혼을 쉬게 하고 모든 것을 정상으로 되돌리는 것이 가장 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6997b416-375f-4553-a3b7-b5d14d3ae8d4"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "179530f5-cc78-4e44-bd4f-4e4fcd03abf8"
msgid "\"Are you a priest?\""
msgstr "\"너는 사제인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "630f7845-b388-4b24-ae88-5a952afa2339"
msgid "\"If Shyka sent you, why didn't they tell me about it?\""
msgstr "\"샤이카가 너를 보냈다면 왜 그들이 그것에 대해 말해주지 않았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "4c5acbe4-3dfd-4818-860f-c34d22a66698"
msgid "\"What do you know about the First Crown?\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관에 대해 무엇을 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ec4a99b9-ede8-485f-8bd2-f23779548431"
msgid "\"Give me the crown fragment.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 왕관 조각을 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d23e0618-8de0-4231-92b2-0ebb55cec70a"
msgid "Attacked Salim with no good reason."
msgstr "이유는 없지만 살림을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1190e46f-ac2b-4f71-b0ed-a8dd66cbf863"
msgid "[Attack] \"You're still in real trouble!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 정말 큰 곤경에 처해 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "a26d253d-806c-4bdb-8c77-59fce2f74c0c"
msgid "\"I've got to keep moving. Goodbye.\""
msgstr "\"나는 계속 움직여야 해. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "9e7f1ac5-a43b-4c9c-9bde-08e8c14cf854"
msgid "\"Did... did you just curse your own goddess?\""
msgstr "\"너... 너의 여신을 저주한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "30adae47-83d4-4228-938f-10b4718c27cd"
msgid "\"How do you know Shyka?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어떻게 샤이카를 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "4cf0466c-944b-4b11-afd9-17fb0d62d221"
msgid "\"You fight well. Will you join my quest?\""
msgstr "\"너는 잘 싸우는군. 내 임무에 함께하지 않겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "16fe85e7-ef48-4edf-8ee5-204a4be3258a"
msgid "\"Enough about you. I have other questions.\""
msgstr "\"너에 관해서는 충분해. 다른 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "70b46c9c-0773-4d3f-a36d-6366df62c265"
msgid "\"What do you mean 'another one'?\""
msgstr "\"또 다른 것이라니 무엇을 의미하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0031_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5758655d-99e5-4bda-ad69-948eaca3612a"
msgid "Expressed horror when learned about Salim's job."
msgstr "살림의 직업에 대해 알고 나서 끔찍함을 표현합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "2ede9b27-b92c-44a9-ba4a-d566366862e3"
msgid "\"You hunt priests?! That's horrible!\""
msgstr "\"사제들을 사냥한다고? 끔찍해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3b2c3211-db61-4f06-9097-d34bb2c08daa"
msgid "Kept calm when learned about Salim's job."
msgstr "살림의 직업에 대해 알게 되었지만 침착함을 유지합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "f73e9e88-ea4e-41bf-af8c-dfa0d812fedc"
msgid "\"Sounds rough.\""
msgstr "\"듣기 거북하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "75bb0012-80a5-43c2-9e34-cd65ba824e6e"
msgid "Expressed agitation when leared about Salim's job."
msgstr "살림의 직업에 대해 흥미로움을 표현합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "55f2b9e7-1813-471a-9290-0abcffb02fb1"
msgid "\"Killing priests? Sounds like a blast!\""
msgstr "\"사제들을 죽인다고? 멋진걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5f6137d5-6e4f-4048-b0eb-8a9a430ba641"
msgid "Kept calm upon learning about Salim's job."
msgstr "살림의 직업에 대해 들었을 때 평온함을 유지했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "1388c47c-f538-47a0-9b86-ad43e60a7221"
msgid "\"Let's get back to business\"."
msgstr "\"일 얘기를 해 보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0061_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3d5b4a95-b9bb-4903-a817-f33b8fad6f14"
msgid "Berated the radicalism of Salim's homeland."
msgstr "살림 고향의 급진주의를 비판합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "c9ed33cb-bb5f-4cea-8461-a2dda6f023bd"
msgid "\"I'm no fan of the gods, but killing clerics over it goes too far.\""
msgstr "\"나는 신을 믿지는 않지만 성직자를 죽이는 것은 도가 지나치다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0063_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c8301b6a-2d0c-4369-8ee0-9c8fb82c99da"
msgid "Approved of Salim's job."
msgstr "살림의 직업을 인정합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0063_Text
msgctxt "fa0d8927-f09d-4757-a9a2-dd5ea261ec15"
msgid ""
"\"Cruel, but just. These god-slaves shouldn't have come to your country when "
"they knew they weren't welcome.\""
msgstr "\"잔인하지만 대의가 있군. 그 신의 노예들은 환영받지 못한다는 것을 알았다면 너희 나라에 오면 안 된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0065_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "68f61015-5906-4d8d-829f-772979199d83"
msgid "Told Salim to look for lost souls in the Narlmarches."
msgstr "살림에게 날마치에서 길잃은 영혼을 찾아 보라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "cd5ad7df-517b-40d6-8d81-5ad17818bb3a"
msgid ""
"\"You're looking for lost souls? You should visit the ruined village in the "
"Narlmarches.\""
msgstr "\"길잃은 영혼을 찾고 있다고? 날마치에 있는 폐허가 된 마을을 방문해 봐.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b2fa19d3-84e3-4932-9754-fd086c653cd1"
msgid ""
"{n}The robed man nods gratefully at you.{/n} \"Thanks for the help. If "
"{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} haven't sent you, I'd have been in real trouble.\"{n} He "
"frowns. {/n}\"Of course, if Shyka haven't sent me after this stupid shard, I "
"wouldn't have been fighting that overgrown lizard in the first place...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}로브를 걸친 자는 고맙다는 듯 당신에게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"도와 줘서 고마워. {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 너를 "
"보내지 않았다면 나는 정말로 곤경에 빠졌을 것이다.\" {n}그는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"물론 샤이카가 이 멍청한 조각을 얻으러 나를 "
"보내지 않았다면 나는 애초에 거대한 도마뱀과 싸우지 않았을 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f0016a7c-eb86-435c-967a-132fade02ae8"
msgid "\"You're a chatty one, aren't you?\""
msgstr "\"말이 많군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "6b6670fd-a248-446e-a15b-3727bc31096e"
msgid ""
"\"Salim Ghadafar. A... servant of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, so to speak. I "
"owe {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} a favor, so I agreed to help them locate this First "
"Crown. Though it appears the crown is far more than I was originally told. I "
"suppose I shouldn't be surprised. Shyka are as shifty as the damned death "
"goddess.\""
msgstr ""
"\"살림 가다파르. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 종이다. 나는 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}에게 부탁을 받았고, 그들이 첫 "
"번째 왕관을 찾을 수 있도록 동의했다. 왕관은 원래 내가 들었던 것보다 훨씬 더 멀리 있었지만. 나는 놀랄 필요가 없다고 생각한다. "
"샤이카는 저주받은 죽음의 여신처럼 변덕스럽다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "638510ff-bbf6-49c6-9415-f11c8ec20f98"
msgid ""
"{n}The man looks uncomfortable.{/n} \"More of a detective, really. An "
"inquisitor. I track down missing souls for {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, the "
"Lady of Graves.\"{n} He laughs bitterly. {/n}\"And it looks like I just "
"found another one.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그 남자는 불편해 보입니다.{/n} \"사실은 탐정쪽에 더 가깝다. 인퀴지터 말이다. 나는 무덤의 여신 "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}를 위해 길 잃은 영혼을 추적한다.\" {n}그는 씁슬하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"방금 하나 더 찾은 "
"것 같고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "5b0bad8d-ccbc-49e7-ab65-45f7c21723a2"
msgid ""
"\"Who knows why {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} does anything? Perhaps they thought "
"they'd already told you — for a god of time, they find it surprisingly "
"difficult to keep straight what has or hasn't happened yet.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 왜 그런지 누가 알겠어? 아마 그들은 이미 너에게 말한 줄 알았다고 생각했을 것이다 — 시간의 "
"신으로서, 그들은 이미 일어났거나 아직 일어나지 않은 일이 그대로 진행되는게 놀랍도록 어렵다는 걸 알지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0025_Text_String
msgctxt "c3edea23-8115-4b2f-b345-72792cb9f937"
msgid ""
"\"This is the crown of an ancient elven king named Lethoriel, ruler of the "
"first kingdom Nyrissa destroyed. But it's not just his crown—his soul has "
"been tied to it, his ghost forced to serve its owner. While it's broken, "
"he's trapped in there, unable to manifest. But no wonder Nyrissa's cronies "
"want it so bad.\"{n} He shakes his head.{/n} \"Or {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}, for "
"that matter.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 나이리사가 처음 파괴했던 왕국의 통치자 레소리엘이라는 고대 엘프 왕의 왕관이다. 하지만 단순히 그의 왕관일 뿐이 아니지 — "
"그의 영혼이 묶여 있고, 그 유령은 주인을 위해 봉사하도록 강요당했다. 이것이 못쓰게 되었기에, 그가 안에 갖혀서 나타날 수 없었지. "
"그러나 나이리사의 친구들이 그걸 원한다는 것은 의심의 여지가 없다.\" {n}그는 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"또는 "
"{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}도, 같은 이유일 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "228a12a8-ed71-4053-bc3e-cab59858c036"
msgid ""
"\"Straight to the point, aren't you? Well, go on and take it. The damned "
"linnorm swallowed it before I could grab it. I told {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} I'd "
"track it down, but I won't fight you for it. Especially after you just saved "
"my beard.\""
msgstr ""
"\"요점을 말해달라고? 말해줄 테니 한 번 들어 봐라. 이 저주받은 린놈은 내가 잡기 전에 그것을 삼켰다. 나는 "
"{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}에게 추적하겠다고 말했지만, 나는 그것을 위해 너와 싸우지 않을 것이다. 네가 방금 나의 수염을 구한 후에는 "
"더더욱 그렇다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "854e5b22-d88c-4f47-b685-50b116d8f5ba"
msgid ""
"\"Safe travels.\"{n} The man quirks a smile. {/n}\"Though I suspect we'll "
"meet again. That's how things work when {g|Shyka}Shyka's{/g} involved.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안전한 여행 되기를.\" {n}그 남자는 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"우리가 다시 만날지 모르겠지만. {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 "
"연루되어 있다면 항상 그러하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "62b5744a-88d6-4d54-9125-5f49c0aae9db"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim laughs bitterly. {/n}\"I used to hunt priests, back in "
"{g|Rahadoum}Rahadoum{/g}. You know the atheist nation? I was an officer in "
"the Pure Legion. Then I made some bad decisions, and ended up an indentured "
"servant to {g|Pharasma}the Lady of Graves{/g}. Let's just say the situation "
"hasn't been easy on either of us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 씁쓸하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"나는 과거에 {g|Rahadoum}라하둠{/g}에서 사제들을 사냥하곤했다. 그 무신론자 국가를 "
"아는가? 나는 순수한 군단의 장교였다. 나는 몇 가지 나쁜 결정을 내렸고 {g|Pharasma}무덤의 여인{/g}의 노예가 되었지. "
"어느쪽이더라도 쉽지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "ad30d93f-ac02-4b60-bacd-8f6d2bf9a3c0"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} helped me with a job in {g|Thuvia}Thuvia{/g}, "
"once. It's a long story.\""
msgstr ""
"\"한 때 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 {g|Thuvia}쑤비아{/g}에서의 임무를 도와준 적이 있다. 이건 긴 이야기다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "858c2580-0025-4a44-bb11-d99b95174812"
msgid "\"Sorry. Even if my grave-rotted master would allow it, I work alone.\""
msgstr "\"미안하다. 비록 무덤에서 썩어빠진 주인이 그것을 허용하더라도 나는 홀로 일한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "926eacc7-75ab-4dd7-b4be-a13420097bf3"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim gives you a piercing look. {/n}\"Is it? One nation out of hundreds "
"seeks independence from divine shackles, yet you god-slaves keep worming "
"your way in, sowing conflict and dragging people into your endless holy "
"wars. Is it so wrong to want to keep our souls for ourselves?\"{n} He "
"sighs.{/n} \"But you didn't come here to debate philosophy. Take your shard "
"and go.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 당신을 뚫어져라 봅니다.{/n} \"그런가? 수백개의 국가 중 한 국가가 신성한 족쇄로부터 독립을 추구하지만 너희 신의 "
"노예들은 송충이가 잎을 갉아먹듯 갈등의 씨를 뿌리고 사람들을 끝없는 성전에 끌어 들이고 있다. 네가 무신론자라면 분노가 끓어오르지 않나? "
"우리의 영혼을 지키고 싶어하는 것이 그렇게 잘못되었나? \" {n}그는 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"그러나 너는 철학에 대해 토론하기 "
"위해 여기에 오지 않았다. 파편을 가지고 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "a4589a64-d432-418d-b547-a40bd4184367"
msgid ""
"\"You have no idea. Can you imagine what it's like to wake up every morning "
"as the exact thing you despise most?\" {n}Salim shakes his head, then smiles "
"ruefully.{/n} \"I'll say one thing for this job, though: serving {g|Pharasma}"
"the Lady of Graves{/g} means you get to put your thumb in the eye of all the "
"other gods on a pretty regular basis.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 모른다. 네가 가장 경멸하는 일이 똑같은 아침마다 일어나는 것을 상상이나 할 수 있는가?\" {n}살림이 머리를 흔들고 슬픔에 "
"잠긴 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"나는 이 직업에 대해 한 가지 말할 것이다. {g|Pharasma}무덤의 여인{/g}은 꽤나 규칙적인 "
"근거로 다른 신들에게 고통을 준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "648cb509-b0e0-4446-9e0b-dda0ca86e81c"
msgid "\"Don't we all. Well, what is it?\""
msgstr "\"우리 전부는 아니다. 그게 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "e17f99c6-38b1-448d-b8e3-a6f7cd4f6adf"
msgid "{n}Salim nods. {/n}\"Fair enough.\""
msgstr "{n}살림이 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"충분히 공정하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "f22a40b0-fe4b-457c-8650-2601b97f90a0"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim glares.{/n} \"I never killed anyone if I could help it. I was a "
"soldier, with a duty to protect our nation from subversives and terrorists.\""
"{n} He looks you up and down and makes a disgusted noise. {/n}\"And from "
"people like you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}살림이 쏘아봅니다.{/n} \"도울 수 있다면 나는 아무도 죽이지 않았다. 나는 병사였고 우리 나라를 전복하려는 자들과 "
"테러리스트로부터 보호할 의무가 있었다.\" {n}그는 당신을 위아래로 바라보고 끔찍한 소리를 냅니다.{/n} \"그리고 너 같은 "
"사람들에게서 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "b753d557-6ea7-418d-8f1d-7761561969f1"
msgid ""
"\"Meeting an inquisitor of Pharasma in these backwoods? Must be my lucky day."
"\""
msgstr "\"이 미개척지에서 파라즈마의 종교 심판관을 만나다니? 운수 좋은 날이군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0047_Text_String
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "13a64b39-df37-4b8b-b6fd-1382ab1d1c2f"
msgid ""
"\"The king of the first kingdom destroyed by Nyrissa? But that happened "
"millennia ago! The poor soul must have suffered so much...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사에게 파멸당한 첫 번째 왕국의 왕? 하지만 그 일은 수천 년 전에 일어났습니다! 그 불쌍한 영혼은 엄청난 고통을 받았을테죠..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "f0b42bda-2286-4d7b-aa67-cbc1cc4f116e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, nice! I've heard of you. That'd make an awesome chapter in my book! I "
"think I'd start it like this... 'Who was this mysterious man in black robes "
"who fought alongside us against such a dreadful monster?' And then I'd wait "
"to give the answer for a while — let the readers feel the suspense!\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 좋았어! 네 얘기는 들었다. 내 책에서 멋진 장이 될 거야! 그럼 처음은 이렇게 써야지... '그 무시무시한 괴물에 맞서 우리와 "
"싸우던 검은 로브의 사나이는 누구일까?' 그리고 독자들이 긴장감을 느낄 수 있게 잠시 동안 대답하도록 기다릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5adf6476-8f41-4e60-a1d1-3323ed4ce889"
msgid ""
"\"Being a slave to a deity you hate, with no chance of freedom? That's the "
"most terrible fate I can imagine...\""
msgstr "\"네가 싫어하는 신의 노예가 된다는 말은 자유의 기회가 없단 말이겠지? 그건 내가 상상할 수있는 가장 무서운 운명이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c16c7162-eb6b-4d91-ad7f-82b69ce7ce67"
msgid ""
"\"I, too, once drew the attention of a god. Please accept my sincerest "
"sympathy.\""
msgstr "\"나도 한때 신의 관심을 받았다. 나는 정말로 공감이 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0057_Text_String
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "9666aa20-3f4e-41de-8933-77ce08476ef5"
msgid ""
"\"Vanity and madness. Frail creatures fighting over a handful of ancient "
"dust — that is all I see!\""
msgstr "\"허영심과 광기로군. 허약한 생물들이 고대의 먼지 한줌을 얻기 위해 싸우고 있다니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "956ab6ee-15f7-4bd9-9646-ed93b0c7cdff"
msgid "{n}Nok-Nok lets out a single acerbic giggle.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}녹-녹은 신랄한 웃음을 터트립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "2894886a-7d34-4d31-ad01-1540c219fa1d"
msgid ""
"{n}Salim gives you a piercing look.{/n} \"Does it? One nation of hundreds "
"seeks independence from divine shackles, yet those god-slaves keep worming "
"their way in, sowing conflict and dragging others into their endless holy "
"wars. If you're an atheist yourself, doesn't it make you boil with rage? Is "
"it so wrong to wish to keep our souls to ourselves?\" {n}He sighs.{/n} \"But "
"you didn't come here to debate philosophy and theology. Take your shard and "
"go.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}살림은 당신을 뚫어져라 봅니다.{/n} \"그런가? 수백개의 국가 중 한 국가가 신성한 족쇄로부터 독립을 추구하지만 너희 신의 "
"노예들은 송충이가 잎을 갉아먹듯 갈등의 씨를 뿌리고 사람들을 끝없는 성전에 끌어 들이고 있다. 네가 무신론자라면 분노가 끓어오르지 않나? "
"우리의 영혼을 지키고 싶어하는 것이 그렇게 잘못되었나? \" {n}그는 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"그러나 너는 철학에 대해 토론하기 "
"위해 여기에 오지 않았다. 파편을 가지고 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "a27e5702-a594-4698-9ac5-fb562d580a98"
msgid ""
"\"Don't think I enjoyed it. I never killed anyone if I could avoid it. I was "
"a soldier — my duty was to protect our nation from subversives and "
"terrorists. It's not my fault or yours that the gods and their slaves won't "
"leave us alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 즐기지 않았다. 될 수 있다면 살생은 피했다. 나는 병사였고 우리 나라를 전복하려는 자들과 테러리스트로부터 보호할 의무가 "
"있었다. 너의 신과 그의 노예들이 우리를 가만히 두지 않은 것은 내 잘못이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimAfterCombat/Cue_0066_Text
msgctxt "eeb938c9-9cf2-491a-9e57-4da5bcdf3b5a"
msgid "\"Thank you for the advice. I'll be sure to visit it.\""
msgstr "\"조언해 주어서 고맙다. 꼭 방문하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "6c5a2cd2-9695-4840-ae3e-d0d21420dff5"
msgid "[Attack linnorm] \"Hang on! I'm coming!\""
msgstr "[린놈을 공격합니다] \"조금만 버텨! 내가 간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a7b179bb-856c-46bc-8290-0a091e781731"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "0e6fd7a9-9a80-4386-82dc-984aac9720c6"
msgid "\"What is that thing?\""
msgstr "\"그건 뭐였지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5f4651a3-110d-4354-8c96-cf6850edbeed"
msgid "\"What's in it for me?\""
msgstr "\"나에게 어떤 이익이 되는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f42e9561-8783-4fa9-95db-31d2bd41daaf"
msgid "\"I'm looking for a piece of the First Crown.\""
msgstr "\"나는 첫 번째 왕관의 조각을 찾고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e7e7b078-18db-4a6b-9dc3-c96e7cf418dd"
msgid "Ignored an adventurer in need."
msgstr "도움이 필요한 모험가를 무시했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "28276b4d-d10a-44e9-a066-49e1a684a970"
msgid "\"Sorry, not my problem.\""
msgstr "\"미안. 내 문제가 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ed78301b-7bfc-4444-badf-86d14e607c87"
msgid ""
"{n}Just ahead, a man in the dark robes of a Pharasmin priest battles an "
"enormous spiked beast. While he's holding his own with magic and a sword "
"with a melted-looking hilt, the snarling beast has him cornered. Suddenly he "
"catches sight of you.{/n} \"You there! Help me with this thing!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바로 앞에 검은 로브를 입은 파라즈마의 사제가 거대한 가시가 돋은 괴물과 싸웁니다. 그는 마법과 자루가 녹슨듯한 칼을 쥐고 대항하는 "
"동안 으르렁거리는 짐승은 그를 궁지로 몰아넣었습니다. 순간 그는 당신을 발견합니다.{/n} \"너 거기! 이 녀석을 해치우는 걸 도와줘!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "baff4b97-b726-4d49-9398-c80245cc885a"
msgid ""
"\"My name's Salim—you'll excuse me if we forego formal introductions until "
"I'm not fighting for my life!\""
msgstr "\"내 이름은 살림이다. 싸움을 끝내고 정식 인사를 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "26bbbd1d-2c54-46d6-a809-65d999f569b5"
msgid ""
"\"It's a linnorm! A total killing machine! It's mad now, but if it gets "
"frumious, we're all screwed!\""
msgstr "\"이 녀석은 린놈이다! 살인 기계와 다를 바 없다! 지금 화가났지만 조금 더 열을 받으면 우리는 망한 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "1ba8e173-6051-407c-96d1-615318f9a823"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest shoots you an incredulous look.{/n} \"Seriously? This thing's "
"trying to turn me into a dinner! Besides, {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} sent you, "
"right? If so, you're here to help me. So help already!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제사장은 당신에게 믿을 수없는 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"정말인가? 이 녀석이 나를 저녁 식사로 만들려고 하고 있어! 그나저나 "
"{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 너를 보냈지? 그렇다면 나를 돕기 위해 왔군. 어서 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "a3c09231-e7a6-47a2-ac17-2379bc58e0fa"
msgid ""
"\"Well, you're too late!\"{n} The man points to the creature with his "
"sword.{/n} \"The damned linnorm swallowed it before I could grab it. So "
"either we kill this thing and cut the crown out, or we all get digested "
"along with it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 너무 늦었어!\" {n}그 사람은 칼로 그 생물을 지적합니다.{/n} \"이 저주받은 린놈은 내가 잡기 전에 그것을 삼켰다. "
"그래서 우리는 이 녀석을 죽이고 배를 갈라 왕관을 꺼내거나 우리 모두는 그것과 함께 소화된다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SalimBeforeCombat/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "5802ec00-fe1a-4b92-a7a4-66bb1c98213c"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest shakes his head in disgust.{/n} \"And you're what passes for "
"an adventurer these days? Pathetic.\""
msgstr "{n}제사장은 혐오스러운 듯 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"무슨 일을 하며 모험을 하는 거냐? 한심하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Books/Book_1_Text_String
msgctxt "ad714331-1568-4f67-8586-d107eb02801b"
msgid ""
"Publishing house of the temple of Iomedae in Oregent\n"
"\"Today, many know of the Suramgamin Order and respect its teachings, even "
"endorse them. Such was not yet the case, on that memorable day when an "
"unheard-of forest hermit came to a temple of Sarenrae and challenged the "
"high priestess to a debate! This was Avalo, whom none had yet called teacher "
"– a traveling wise man who left Jalmeray in search of wisdom and found it "
"here, in Andoran, while meditating in the Arthfell forest. The revelation he "
"received was as brilliant as it was controversial: according to his "
"philosophy, truth lies not only in venerating the gods of the good and order "
"(and it's curious that while recognizing Erastil, Abadar, Shelyn, Irori, "
"Iomedae and Sarenrae, he at the same time rejects the kinder gods of chaos, "
"such as Desna, or Cayden Cailean). Instead, he pursues the so-called 'Wise "
"Way' – a common principle said to underlie all the teachings of his favored "
"deities. Avalo has defended this philosophy in debates with many theologians "
"from various temples. Only a few of them were converted on the spot, but "
"gradually a circle of loyal disciples formed around him. By turns, this "
"circle grew into the order he calls Suramgamin, which means 'the way of a "
"hero' or, perhaps, 'the way to making the world a better place'. In this "
"book I recount the story of these early debates, including detailed "
"theological comments on the central points of each side...\""
msgstr ""
"오오멘트에 위치한 아이오메데 사원 출판\n"
"\"오늘날 많은 사람들이 슈람가민 단체에 대해 알고, 그 가르침을 존중하며, 심지어 그들을 지지합니다. 이러한 일은 전례가 없었는데, "
"길이 기억될 그 날에 숲속의 은둔자 하나가 서렌레이의 성전에 와서 고위 여사제에게 논쟁을 벌였었습니다! 그는 아발로였는데, 누구도 그를 "
"아직 선생이라고 부르지 않았지만 잘메레이를 떠나 지혜를 찾으러 떠났다가 안도란의 아스펠 숲에서 명상하면서 깨달음을 얻은 자였습니다. 그가 "
"받은 계시는 논쟁의 여지를 일으킬 만큼 훌륭했습니다. 그의 철학에 따르면 진실은 선과 질서의 신들을 숭배하는 것뿐만 아니었습니다 (그리고 "
"에라스틸, 아바다르, 셸린, 이로리, 아이오메데, 서렌레이를 인정하는 동시에 그는 혼돈의 신들 데즈나 혹은 케이든 케일리엔을 배척한다는 "
"점이 흥미롭습니다). 대신에 그는 소위 '현명한 길'을 추구합니다. 그의 공통적인 원리는 자기가 선호하는 신들의 모든 가르침을 "
"뒷받침한다고 말합니다. 아발로는 여러 신전에서 온 많은 신학자들과의 토론에서 이 철학을 옹호했습니다. 그 중 소수 만이 그 자리에서 "
"개종했지만, 점차적으로 그 주위에 충직한 제자들의 모임이 형성되었습니다. 이 원은 차례로 그가 '영웅의 길'또는 아마도 '세계를 더 좋은 "
"곳으로 만드는 길'을 의미하는 슈람가민이라고 부르는 모임으로 성장했습니다. 이 책에서 나는 각 부분의 핵심에 대한 상세한 신학적 논평을 "
"포함하여 초기 토론에 대한 이야기를... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Books/Book_1_Title_String
msgctxt "2fd2b848-2c9c-4a16-8879-a7f8107740a6"
msgid "\"The Great Debates\" by Veylira Illio"
msgstr "베일리라 일리오의 \"위대한 토론\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Books/Book_2_Text_String
msgctxt "e8d3e6c2-fc12-4dc5-bf9c-d0afd0056685"
msgid ""
"\"Ludriggan Vanderlapius and Daughters\" Publishing house\n"
"\"I spent half of my life in a temple of Sarenrae. I served the goddess "
"loyally and blindly, never considering that no one, not even an immortal "
"deity, can walk your path for you. I carried out Sarenrae's will, but never "
"stopped to think about what it was exactly, or what lay behind it, the "
"source of the kind goddess' kindness. Then an unknown preacher came to town, "
"and challenged the senior priests of all the great temples to debates. Some "
"laughed at him, others defamed him, but many, like me, saw the truth in his "
"words. We followed him into the Arthfell forest, where he'd meditated for "
"seven years, gaining insights into truth. The teacher opened my eyes to the "
"Wise Way – the path that the kind gods follow, and the common thread that "
"unifies all their teachings and makes them worthy of veneration. Some "
"understand it through the Phoenix, in burning instincts and a fiery will. "
"Others go the way of the Unicorn or Chameleon, achieving peace in silence. "
"Those who have a powerful voice go the Lion's way, and preach the Wise Way "
"to others. I found enlightenment on the way of the Wolf – in cutting wood, "
"carrying water, and working without thought of thanks...\""
msgstr ""
"\"루드리건 반덜라피우스와 딸들\" 출판사\n"
"\"나는 서렌레이의 성전에서 내 인생의 절반을 보냈다. 나는 여신을 충성스럽고 맹목적으로 섬겼으며, 그 누구도 아닌 불멸의 여신만이 "
"당신의 길을 인도한다고 생각했습니다. 나는 서렌레이의 의지를 수행했지만 친절한 여신님 뒤에 정확히 어떤 것이 있는 건지 항상 "
"궁금했습니다. 알려지지 않은 선교사가 마을에 와서 모든 위대한 성전의 대사제들에게 논쟁을 벌였습니다. 어떤 사람들은 그를 비웃고 나와 "
"같은 대부분의 사람들은 그의 말에 진실을 보았습니다. 우리는 그를 따라 아스펠 숲으로 갔습니다. 그는 7년간 명상하여 진리에 대한 "
"통찰력을 얻었습니다. 선생님은 현명한 길로 가는 저의 눈을 뜨게 하셨습니다. 그것은 여러 신들이 따르는 길이고, 신들의 모든 가르침들이 "
"가진 공통의 맥락이며, 그들이 존경받을 가치가 있도록 만듭니다. 어떤 이들은 불사조를 통해 불타는 본능과 불의 의지로 그것을 이해합니다. "
"다른 이들은 유니콘이나 카멜레온의 길을 걸어가 침묵 속의 평화를 누립니다. 강력한 목소리를 가진 사람들은 사자의 길을 가고 다른 "
"사람들에게 현명한 길을 전파합니다. 나는 나무를 자르거나 물을 길으며 감사함을 생각하지 않고 일하면서 늑대의 길을 걸어 깨달음을 "
"얻었습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Books/Book_2_Title_String
msgctxt "b74b4a59-3ef0-46c1-b4f3-4511ccec9dde"
msgid ""
"\"Five Years in the Depths of the Forest: revelations of a disciple of the "
"teacher Avalo\" by Surya the Wolf"
msgstr "\"깊은 숲속에서 5년: 아발로 선생의 제자의 계시\" - 늑대 수르야가 씀"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d9147700-03ee-411e-89bb-eb512f8eb5df"
msgid "\"I am ready.\""
msgstr "\"나는 준비 됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "f8044f69-0536-4085-b4f2-67f11a4fa2f5"
msgid "Attacked the masters of the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 마스터들을 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "609a1c21-2c97-46c8-a878-f66283ed0d7a"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Verdict? I only wanted one thing: to lure you all to one place! "
"Now you're all going to die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"의견? 나는 한 가지만 바란다. 너희들이 모두 한 곳으로 오기를 말이다! 이제 모두 죽을 차례다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Answer_0025_Text_String
msgctxt "1dbdd8de-3a43-4a3a-820e-e932f54d6390"
msgid "\"I accept.\""
msgstr "\"나는 동의한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Answer_0026_Text_String
msgctxt "8eb18b3a-938a-44b6-aedf-69837c0ce781"
msgid "\"I won't refuse your help, but I don't need any titles.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 도움을 거절하지 않을 것이지만 나는 어떤 자리도 필요하지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Answer_0027_Text_String
msgctxt "906a9850-3e52-4879-b25b-20351b420efb"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"Fools. I only wanted one thing: to lure you all to one place! Now "
"you're all going to die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"멍청한 것들. 나는 한 가지만 바란다. 너희들이 모두 한 곳으로 오기를 말이다! 이제 모두 죽을 차례다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "be863ff1-cc00-4b27-a03e-963c5e7d2b3f"
msgid "\"As you will. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"마음대로 하길. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "705cecc6-8a6e-4a81-8ea8-14a7080a508b"
msgid ""
"{n}The masters of the Suramgamin Order silently watch you approach. Beside "
"the four masters you know, you see a fifth – a nondescript halfling woman in "
"a modest robe.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}슈람가민 단체의 마스터들은 당신이 접근하는 것을 조용히 지켜 봅니다. 당신은 이미 알고있는 4명의 마스터들 옆에 평범한 로브를 입은 "
"하플링 여자를 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "704719bc-88bc-4e76-834e-5c18be0aa3b7"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness, we meet again. Allow me to introduce to you the fifth "
"master whose test you faced. Daksha the Chameleon watched you from afar, and "
"has drawn her own conclusions about how you approached our tests.\""
msgstr ""
"\"다시 만났군. 네가 직면한 시험의 다섯번째 마스터를 소개하겠다. 카멜레온 덕샤는 멀리에서 너를 지켜 보았고, 네가 우리의 시험을 "
"어떻게 대했는지에 대해 자신의 결론을 내렸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : DakshaTheChameleon
msgctxt "9a40db75-00ea-4f90-90c7-6738e0b9a068"
msgid "\"Glad to meet you, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"만나서 반갑다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "8407738b-6a6a-472c-a2f3-e845991fd7a5"
msgid "\"We are ready to announce our verdict. Are you ready to hear it?\""
msgstr "\"우리의 의견을 발표할 준비가 되었다. 한 번 들어볼 텐가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "a3b8e7e9-e9b0-4f01-b4ca-9f416d776e42"
msgid ""
"{n}Before you can draw your weapon, the masters cast a spell, and boundless "
"peace and tranquility descends upon you, making you unable to even lift a "
"finger.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}무기를 꺼내기도 전에 마스터가 주문을 시전했고, 무한한 평화와 평온함이 당신에게 찾아와 손가락조차 들어올릴 수 없게 "
"만들었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "15ce1444-a56e-4b06-adf5-f5e2d1d6ea7b"
msgid ""
"\"All right. I have tested {mf|His|Her} Highness and I testify: {mf|he|she} "
"is worthy.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나는 너를 시험했고 자격이 있음을 간증한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "244dd9a2-23ee-4237-b2e7-a90845d2acdd"
msgid ""
"\"All right. I have tested {mf|His|Her} Highness and I testify: {mf|he|she} "
"is not worthy.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 나는 너를 시험했고 자격이 없음을 간증한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : VisakaTheUnicorn
msgctxt "d2e97082-9b92-4249-a6b3-6ff1473d5253"
msgid "\"W-worthy.\""
msgstr "\"자... 자격이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : PujaTheWolf
msgctxt "87f4120e-3296-4cf7-bd3d-039cf0716ee2"
msgid "\"Quite worthy to me!\""
msgstr "\"나에게도 자격이 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : VidyaTheLion
msgctxt "b13cf02b-2d27-4f22-9659-d57b44eb4189"
msgid "\"I testify: worthy.\""
msgstr "\"자격 있음을 간증한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : DakshaTheChameleon
msgctxt "59192682-0762-41f6-9132-409b0d5735d0"
msgid "\"Worthy.\""
msgstr "\"자격이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : VisakaTheUnicorn
msgctxt "0d01291a-adb4-476c-9794-6530642b694a"
msgid "\"N-Not worthy.\""
msgstr "\"자... 자격이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : PujaTheWolf
msgctxt "ee4de2c4-62d6-4899-813a-73cdae464dd5"
msgid "\"Forgive me but no. Not worthy.\""
msgstr "\"용서해라. 자격이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "14e05dfd-a85a-4b89-9dca-5afa470ff6f2"
msgid "\"I testify: not worthy.\""
msgstr "\"자격 없음을 간증한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : DakshaTheChameleon
msgctxt "c7c8a797-2e89-41af-984c-d5a0ccf7b448"
msgid "\"Not worthy.\""
msgstr "\"자격이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "957da980-f0a7-447c-b6b9-60bd1a4fc38d"
msgid ""
"\"The majority of masters agree. Your Highness, we find you worthy of our "
"aid, and would offer you the title of Protector of the Wise Way. Will you "
"accept it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"대다수의 마스터들이 동의했다. 너는 우리의 도움을 받을 자격이 있으니 현명한 길의 수호자라는 칭호를 제공하겠다. 동의하겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "8cbda03d-394c-4f17-aeb3-1a00713599e4"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, Your Highness. We cannot trust you. The risk is too great that you "
"wouldn't be able to use our gifts, and would only harm yourself and others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아. 우리는 너를 신뢰할 수 없다. 위험이 너무 커서 너는 우리의 선물을 사용할 수 없고 너 자신과 타인에게 해를 끼칠 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "b8b9b6c1-491b-4cbd-9ccc-487d195dae62"
msgid ""
"\"What devious guile... We were ready for this, Your Highness. If that is "
"your will – we shall leave your lands and bother you no further. But first "
"allow us to say: you spoke to us, listened to our sermons and passed our "
"trials. The seed of good may yet sprout in your soul. If ever you step away "
"from evil and set foot upon the Wise Way – we shall accept you with open "
"arms.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떤 악독 한 짓이라도... 우리는 이 일을 위해 준비가 되어있다. 네 의지라면 우리는 너의 땅을 떠나서 더 이상 괴롭히지 않을 "
"것이다. 그러나 한 가지만 말하겠다. 너는 우리에게 말을 걸었고 우리의 설교를 듣고 우리의 시험을 통과했다. 선의 씨앗이 네 영혼에 싹을 "
"틔웠을 것이다. 만일 네가 악에서 멀어지고 현명한 길을 걸으면 우리는 너를 두 팔로 받아들일 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "6743c16e-6a15-48a7-8202-fba3fb827be7"
msgid "{n}The masters of the Suramgamin Order leave solemnly.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}슈람가민 단체의 마스터들은 엄숙하게 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "a847c3b2-de9e-44aa-a3c0-4c5ed32a94cc"
msgid ""
"\"Such unanimity is rare among us. Your Highness, we find you worthy of our "
"aid, and would grant you the title of Protector of the Wise Way. Will you "
"accept it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 사이에서 만장일치는 드물다. 너는 우리의 원조를 받을 자격이 있고 현명한 길의 수호자라는 칭호를 제공하겠다. 동의하겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0030_Text_String
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "83822c70-f98c-481e-9534-38885f801ff7"
msgid ""
"\"Rejoice, brothers and sisters, for today the Wise Way has gained a new "
"protector in this world!\""
msgstr "\"형제 자매들아. 기뻐하라. 오늘 현명한 길은 새로운 보호자를 얻었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0032_Text_String
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "f5077f2d-66f8-4a76-9fb1-6bd8bc45b619"
msgid ""
"\"As you wish. We would not bind you to anything, but be assured, if someday "
"you decide to accept the Wise Way, we shall welcome you with open arms.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 원하는대로. 우리는 너를 속박하지 않을 것이지만 언젠가 현명한 길을 받아들일 결심을 한다면 우리는 너를 두 팔로 맞이할 것이다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "e39a9362-f87c-4a8d-8d7d-f2564320756b"
msgid ""
"\"Nevertheless, please allow me to present you with one gift – the word of "
"truth. We have long meditated, seeking knowledge of the power that opens "
"portals. Here is what was revealed to us. The one you've been fighting since "
"the day you set foot in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, she is not "
"only the fountain of evil, but its greatest victim. As she prepares to sting "
"you with her dagger, a sword hangs above her head, in the hands of another. "
"It is in your power to save her – if you would brave the wrath of those who "
"could make even her tremble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼에도 불구하고 나는 신뢰의 약속으로 너에게 선물할 수있게 해달라. 우리는 포털을 여는 힘에 대한 지식을 구하기 위해 오랫동안 "
"명상해왔다. 여기에 우리에게 계시된 것이 있다. 네가 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 발을 들였을 때부터 싸우던 그녀는 "
"악의 근원 일뿐만 아니라 가장 큰 희생자이기도 하다. 그녀가 단검으로 너를 찌를 준비를 할 때 칼은 그녀의 머리 위에 다른 사람의 손에 "
"쥐어져 있다. 그녀를 구하기 위한 네 힘 속에 있다. 네가 그녀를 떨게 하는 자들의 분노에 용감히 맞설 수 있다면 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "bc8fc168-15ff-421f-8f95-c8c339baee70"
msgid ""
"\"Lo and behold: you managed to deceive us all. Five masters found you "
"worthy – yet all this time you harbored guile in your soul! Thank you, Your "
"Highness. This is a valuable lesson for each of us. Allow us to thank you "
"for it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보라. 너는 우리 모두를 속였다. 다섯 명의 마스터가 너를 자격이 있다 여겼다. 그러나 여태껏 너의 영혼에 거짓이 숨겨왔다. 고맙다. "
"이것은 우리 각자에게 중요한 교훈이다. 우리는 감사함을 전한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0041_Text_String
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "216ba1a7-d01d-4fe8-8167-69e13a00785d"
msgid ""
"\"It's time we keep our promise. We award you with the secret weapon of our "
"order. It is a spell that quells all wrath, pacifies berserkers and binds "
"evil. We are sure you will use it wisely.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 약속을 지킬 때가 되었다. 우리 단체의 비밀 무기를 너에게 주겠다. 모든 분노를 진압하고, 광인들을 안정시키고, 악인을 묶는 "
"마법이다. 네가 현명하게 사용할 거라 믿는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "9303497f-b7c9-4e4b-ac60-7afebe53e166"
msgid ""
"\"Accept our second gift as well. Alas, this world is full of evil and "
"hatred, and you shall have to engage in battle and shed blood more than "
"once. With an easy heart we present you this item that will guard your life."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 두 번째 선물을 받아달라. 아아. 이 세상에는 데몬과 증오가 가득하고 너는 참전하여 피를 흘렸다. 가벼운 마음으로 우리는 너의 "
"생명을 지켜줄 물품을 선물하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0043_Text_String
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "a8ffaf64-d38b-4131-8895-2c371c894f59"
msgid ""
"\"And there is one more gift we offer – the word of truth. We have long "
"meditated, seeking knowledge of the power that opens portals. Here is what "
"was revealed to us. The one you've been fighting since the day you set foot "
"in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, she is not only the fountain of "
"evil, but its greatest victim. As she prepares to sting you with her dagger, "
"a sword hangs above her head, in the hands of another. It is in your power "
"to save her – if you would brave the wrath of those who could make even her "
"tremble.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 한 가지 더 우리가 주는 선물은 신뢰의 약속이다. 우리는 포털을 여는 힘에 대한 지식을 구하기 위해 오랫동안 명상해왔다. "
"여기에 우리에게 계시된 것이 있다. 네가 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 발을 들였을 때부터 싸우던 그녀는 악의 근원 "
"일뿐만 아니라 가장 큰 희생자이기도 하다. 그녀가 단검으로 너를 찌를 준비를 할 때 칼은 그녀의 머리 위에 다른 사람의 손에 쥐어져 "
"있다. 그녀를 구하기 위한 네 힘 속에 있다. 네가 그녀를 떨게 하는 자들의 분노에 용감히 맞설 수 있다면 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "e047b86b-627e-4dc7-8f81-5978b7b0df68"
msgid ""
"\"And now it is time for us to depart your lands. Goodbye, Your Highness, "
"and may your way be always wise.\""
msgstr "\"이제는 우리가 너의 땅을 떠나야 할 때이다. 안녕히. 너의 길이 언제나 현명하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "eec9e064-e036-4a10-9c15-a4c73e785bf5"
msgid ""
"\"We present this to the traces of good that live on in your soul. To that "
"part of you, which your evil side hides behind like a mask. May this item "
"guard your life in battle, and in time free your good side from the fetters "
"of evil.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 너의 영혼이 선의 길로 인도하길 바라며 이것을 선물한다. 선의 길을 걷는다면 너의 악한 본성은 가면처럼 숨어있을 것이다. 이 "
"물품이 너의 생명을 지키고 적절한 시기에 선한 면을 악의 족쇄들로부터 자유롭게 하기를.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "d88f8e70-97c8-4690-bebd-60ee4154e3d2"
msgid ""
"\"Regarding your evil side – the one that still reigns in your soul, as you "
"yourself reign your lands... We present to it this item – as disfigured as "
"itself. Think upon this gift, and remember: so long as you live, hope is not "
"lost. If ever you decide to reject evil and accept truth – you know where to "
"find us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 영토를 지배하듯 악이 너의 영혼을 다스리고 있다... 우리는 이 물품을 선물한다 – 네 영혼속의 그것과 마찬가지로 흉한 것이다. "
"이 선물의 의미를 생각하고 기억하라: 네가 살아있는 한 희망은 꺼지지 않을 것이다. 네가 악을 거부하고 진리를 받아들이기로 결심했다면 "
"우리를 어디에서 찾을지 알 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "4b8d4349-76f6-45fc-bfae-7af0299d6901"
msgid ""
"\"And now farewell. No matter what crooked path you walk, I pray that one "
"day you shall set foot on the Wise Way.\""
msgstr "\"그리고 이제 작별 인사를 하지. 너의 길이 험할지라도 언젠가는 현명한 길을 걷기를 기도하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "8b416140-e86c-4e6c-943d-e2c327688b05"
msgid ""
"\"Lo and behold: you nearly managed to deceive all of us. We tested you and "
"found you worthy – yet all this time you harbored guile in your soul! Thank "
"you, Your Highness. This is a valuable lesson for all of us. Allow us to "
"thank you for it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보라. 너는 우리 모두를 속였다. 우리는 너를 자격이 있다 여겼다. 그러나 여태껏 너의 영혼에 거짓이 숨겨왔다. 고맙다. 이것은 우리 "
"각자에게 중요한 교훈이다. 우리는 감사함을 전한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/FinalVerdict/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "df52ab9f-87e8-4525-9f96-a2abce021daa"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. Show me any order or organization that would not be happy to "
"take a real king or queen into their fold.\""
msgstr "\"물론이다. 진정한 왕이나 여왕을 받아들이길 원치 않는 단체가 있다면 보여줘라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "cdc31aa7-541b-4dab-9559-c7d0eec7f313"
msgid "\"Tell me more about your order.\""
msgstr "\"너희 단체에 대해 더 많이 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "9ff08d06-e905-404a-a7e2-4de80368ad8c"
msgid "\"Kamala the Phoenix – this name doesn't sound elven.\""
msgstr "\"불사조 카말라 – 그 이름은 엘프같지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "6c5fc6c4-648d-4ecb-9722-bca723116989"
msgid ""
"\"It's naive to believe that a ruler of such savage lands could be a "
"pacifist.\""
msgstr "\"그런 야만인 땅의 통치자가 평화 주의자가 될 수 있다고 믿다니 순진하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "936ee7d5-82b1-49b4-bb91-c7316a333c84"
msgid ""
"\"In other words, you people are just hypocrites who prefer someone else to "
"do all the dirty work for you.\""
msgstr "\"다시 말하자면 너희는 너를 위해 누군가 더러운일을 하기를 바라는 위선자일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "1c00c8dd-174a-4e43-a613-9d0898c73cd5"
msgid ""
"\"It's a hard and thankless job you're doing. But I'm glad the world has the "
"likes of you in it.\""
msgstr "\"네가 하는 일은 어렵고 고마운 일이다. 하지만 세상이 너와 같은 자들을 살게 해주어 기쁘게 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description_String
msgctxt "df3525fd-2ad9-4fa1-b01d-4384e7f27fb2"
msgid "Told Kamala your opinion of the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "카말라에게 슈람가민 단체에 대한 당신의 의견을 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "80fd2f4c-7067-43c7-bd4c-84790537a0fc"
msgid ""
"\"Fine words. But this is just another facade, hiding the same base "
"instincts that everyone shares: the drives for power and profit!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 소식이군. 하지만 이건 모두가 같이 느끼는 본성을 숨기는 이면일 뿐이다. 권력과 부를 위한 욕구 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "002640f8-0f91-4dca-be58-c59e10b6a25c"
msgid ""
"\"Peace in Golarion? You are simply insane, to waste your time and effort on "
"an unachievable dream!\""
msgstr "\"골라리온의 평화? 실현하기 어려운 꿈을 위해 시간과 노력을 낭비하다니 미쳤군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "a6efd35b-f7e9-4a10-9cf4-78d2de5007cb"
msgid ""
"\"You can't defeat evil by preaching alone! The good need a good sword to "
"hold back the monsters!\""
msgstr "\"설교만으로는 데몬을 물리칠 수는 없다! 선한 자가 괴물을 몰아내기 위해서는 좋은 검이 필요하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "effc41e3-dcb2-4423-8484-6dcd759a424a"
msgid "\"What do you know about the power behind portals?\""
msgstr "\"포털 너머에 있는 힘에 대해 무엇을 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "e90baea2-8958-454b-89d5-011e4ecb372f"
msgid "\"I'm not going to waste my time on your stupid trials. Get lost!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 어리석은 시험에 시간을 낭비하지 않을 것이다. 꺼져라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0029_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4ed8dd13-7b5f-4d8f-a9b0-6180004bbe75"
msgid "Attacked Kamala from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 카말라를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "df4d32a3-79fd-4f23-8987-b6fc64ba7d3f"
msgid "[Attack] \"I won't suffer the likes of you, not here!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 여기서 너희 같은 부류에게 시달리지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "0adb2ea4-0d43-468d-b15c-0185770676c1"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "26e976f2-b24a-422d-a953-ca930c41aa59"
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations. You have passed my trial. Your will is strong, and it "
"cannot be broken by spells or by the most frightful enemy: the blood-thirsty "
"beast that lurks inside each of us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"축하한다. 너는 시험을 통과했다. 너의 의지는 강해서 주문이나 우리 안에 숨어있는 피에 굶주린 짐승 같은 적도 깰 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "9515c806-8aa3-448c-a9b6-bdf2441102e2"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, you have failed my trial. But do not despair – our force of will "
"sometimes fails even the best of us!\""
msgstr "\"아. 너는 시험을 실패 했다. 하지만 절망하지 마라. 우리 중 가장 강력한 자도 실패할 때가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "82fdb1f3-cefb-41b5-888a-290c7d2cb420"
msgid ""
"{n}Kamala shakes her head.{/n} \"Forgive me, but you have failed my trial. A "
"threat is not as final as violence, but it holds the same poisonous seed. "
"When you sow fear, you reap hatred.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}카말라는 그녀의 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"미안하지만 너는 시험을 실패했다. 위협은 폭력처럼 최종적인 것이 아니지만 같은 "
"독성의 씨앗을 가지고 있다. 두려움을 뿌리면 증오를 거둔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "6ec04539-a8b8-46ef-a7b0-e65d80c5ef18"
msgid ""
"\"I invite you to meet the other masters of the order and pass their trials. "
"Don't be afraid of failure – no one in this world is perfect. But we must be "
"sure that those who we help are worthy. Set off to the {g|Temple of the Elk}"
"Temple of the Elk{/g}. Brother Visaka the Unicorn is awaiting you there for "
"your next trial.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 단체의 다른 선생을 만나 시련을 통과하도록 초대하겠다. 실패를 두려워하지 마라. 이 세상의 어느 누구도 완벽하지 않다. 우리는 "
"도와주는 사람들의 가치 있다는 것을 확신한다. {g|Temple of the Elk}엘크의 성전{/g}으로 가라. 유니콘 비사카가 다음 "
"시험을 기다리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a579daba-eaa0-4957-b6d4-36ea120a89b1"
msgid ""
"\"When I passed all the trials and joined the order, the teacher gave me a "
"new name in the language of his homeland, as is his way. 'Kamala' means "
"'lotus' – a flower that grows from swamp mud but glows with immaculate "
"whiteness. It is a symbol that speaks for itself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 시련을 통과하고 단체에 합류했을 때 그 스승은 그의 길과 마찬가지로 나에게 고향의 언어로 새로운 이름을 주었다. '카말라'는 "
"진흙에서 자라나 티 없이 하얗게 빛나는 '연꽃'을 의미한다. 내 이름은 그 의미를 상징하는 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "173558db-17ea-401a-bacd-10e5eb61fc9b"
msgid ""
"\"As for 'Phoenix' – that's something like a title. It refers to those who "
"have burnt away their primitive instincts and revive pure force of will from "
"their ashes. Before I walked the Wise Way, I did much harm and many stupid "
"things, for I was controlled by the animal inside me. Now that it has no "
"power over me, I follow the path of Law and Good, as shown by the teacher.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불사조는 칭호와 같은 것이다. 원시적 본능을 태워 버리고 그 재로부터 순수한 힘을 되살린다는 의미이다. 내가 현명한 길을 걷기 전에 "
"나는 내 안의 짐승에 이끌려 사람들에게 많은 해를 입히고 바보 같은 짓을 했다. 이제는 내게 영향을 미치지 못하므로 나는 스승이 "
"보여준대로 규범과 선의 길을 따른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "ae355fb6-f751-40be-953c-dba759f05a8c"
msgid ""
"\"Unlike many monastic orders, we do not teach martial arts. The secrets we "
"share are meant for sowing peace and accord, not destruction.\""
msgstr ""
"\"많은 수도원 단체들과 달리 우리는 무술을 가르치지 않는다. 우리가 공유하는 비밀은 파멸이 아니라 평화와 협정을 뿌리기 위한 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "598bccd8-44c8-49c5-b609-de31e2c77826"
msgid ""
"\"We do not ask that you take the same vow of non-violence that we have. "
"There is much evil in the world – and alas, in this age of fire and steel, "
"he who puts down his weapon often becomes food for monsters. Still, we try "
"to help those who do lesser harm. None of us will live to see a peaceful "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} – but we all do our parts to make it possible.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 것과 같은 비폭력의 맹세를 요구하는 것이 아니다. 세상에는 많은 악이 있지만 슬프게도 불과 강철의 시대에서 무기를 내려 놓는 "
"사람은 종종 괴물의 먹이가 된다. 여전히 우리는 해를 입히지 않는 사람들을 돕는다. 우리 누구도 평화로운 "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}을 보며 살 수 없겠지만 언젠가는 보기 위해 각자 최선을 다한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "a8d7b1c3-779a-4a12-95c0-3f6b012235e0"
msgid ""
"\"You will learn more from my brothers and sisters when you find them.\""
msgstr "\"나의 형제 자매를 찾았을 때 너는 더 많이 배울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "083e90bf-18ba-44c2-981b-eddf6545569e"
msgid ""
"\"We are not so naive to hope that our preaching could instantly transform "
"the whole world. We find those whose goals are similar to ours, and aid them "
"in their good deeds. Where is the hypocrisy in that?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 설교가 세상을 바꿀 수 있기를 바랄 만큼 순진한 사람은 아니다. 목표가 비슷한 사람들을 찾고 선한 일을하도록 도울 것이다. "
"이것이 위선인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "22e2e008-9f33-4f5f-bad3-3819973ecd39"
msgid ""
"\"There are more of us than you think. Everyone who tries to do good "
"sometimes feels like a tiny, lonely ship in a storm of pain, violence, and "
"evil. One of our main goals is to unify the vision of all whose good will is "
"strong, that they may act together.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 생각하는 사람보다 많다. 선량한 행동을 시도하는 사람은 때로는 고통과 폭력과 악의 폭풍 속에서 작고 외로운 배처럼 느껴진다. "
"우리의 목표는 선 의지가 강한자들을 모아 함께 행동하는 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "195d423a-e0d2-406b-b6b5-94deac4462fb"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone ascribes to others the very sins {mf|he|she} is most guilty of. I "
"perfectly understand your cynicism. And you – are you able to understand "
"those who think differently from you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 사람은 자기의 죄악을 다른 사람의 탓으로 돌린다. 너의 냉소를 이해한다. 그리고 너는, 자신과 다르게 생각하는 사람들을 이해할 "
"수 있는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "05d06eb2-5e49-462b-8152-455feac85256"
msgid ""
"\"Unachievable? Only those who have walked the path to the very end can be "
"sure of what is possible. Our goal is yet distant, but worthy of spending "
"one's life journey walking towards it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불가능한가? 도착지가 있는 길을 것는 사람은 가능한 것을 확신한다. 우리의 목표는 아직 멀지만 삶의 여정에 쏟을 가치는 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "c760393a-285c-4619-984e-b3fb6b459e64"
msgid ""
"\"Many have thought so. And then, at the moment of truth, they look back at "
"the ruins, the pools of blood they left behind, and ask themselves: was it "
"all truly for the good? Who am I in the eyes of the people – a savior, or "
"just one more among monsters, tormenting each other?\""
msgstr ""
"\"많은 사람들이 그렇게 생각했다. 그리고 진실의 순간에 그들은 폐허와 그들이 남긴 피 웅덩이를 되돌아보고 스스로에게 묻는다. 그것이 "
"진실로 선을 위한 것이었는가? 타인의 시선 속의 나는 누구인가? 구세주? 아니면 단지 서로를 고문하는 괴물 중의 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "a72557b0-6aeb-49d4-b406-4ad8d736762a"
msgid ""
"\"We will share our knowledge with you when you prove you are worthy of our "
"help.\""
msgstr "\"너를 도울 만하다고 여길 때 너와 지식을 공유 할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "c186d097-d095-4d81-972c-a01938bca740"
msgid "\"As you wish, Your Highness. We won't bother you again.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로. 다시는 너를 괴롭히지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "e3da22c5-03aa-4bc6-bdaa-d22dc49a3e31"
msgid ""
"\"What a pity.\" {n}The elf whispers a spell and boundless peace and "
"tranquility descend upon you. Unable to even reach for your weapon, you "
"watch Kamala leave in dignity.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"유감이다.\" {n}엘프는 주문을 속삭였고, 무한한 평화와 평온함이 당신에게 쏟아집니다. 당신은 무기에 손조차 뻗지 못한 채 카말라가 "
"품위있게 떠나는 모습을 바라봤습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "1bc74d3b-1ed4-46b1-a97d-a3412bc1e55a"
msgid "\"So long, Your Highness. May your way be wise.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 안녕히. 너의 길이 현명하길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "84c48d6f-9750-4817-9b18-18acc61a4e34"
msgid ""
"\"Yes! Cannibals, murderers, slavers — you talk to people like those with "
"swords, not words!\""
msgstr "\"맞아요! 식인종, 살인자, 노예 감독관들 — 당신은 그런 부류들과 말이 아닌 칼로 대화하죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Final/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "de691285-0fd9-41b5-9f7a-0af2310f2d2d"
msgid ""
"\"Familiar rhetoric about the internal beast. We should have sent you to the "
"Inconsequent Debates — you'd smooth-talk the Host in the blink of an eye!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내면의 짐승에 대한 솔직한 표현이다. 우리는 너를 비논리 토론회에 파견해야 했다. 너라면 주최자를 눈 깜박 할 사이에 홀렸을 테니까!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "625af87d-28fd-4419-be06-ba85384aad2a"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f94afefc-4206-4c4d-96a8-27ec1841bcf5"
msgid "\"Why were you looking for me?\""
msgstr "\"왜 나를 찾고 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "97d05f4f-b547-48df-9bca-a5b42ed2df09"
msgid "\"What are you doing with these fey?\""
msgstr "\"이 페이들과 뭐하고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "99929f20-6643-4d1f-9cd5-ddc629a17aa6"
msgid "Attacked Kamala from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 카말라를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "fbf3c6dc-0747-4221-ab1b-80915f2ef731"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You shouldn't have looked for me unless you were looking for "
"death.\""
msgstr "[공격합니다] \"죽음을 찾는 것이 아니라면 나를 믿어서는 안되었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "166fe178-805d-4820-a86a-45fc0944b4eb"
msgid "\"I don't have time for your nonsense. Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 너의 말 같지도 않은 이야기는 듣고 싶지 않다. 안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "b1103b7e-d7f8-402c-aaa6-994aaf542152"
msgid "\"Tell me about your order.\""
msgstr "\"너희 단체에 대해 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "6f247165-1664-43f4-acab-b99008245288"
msgid "\"What does this trial consist of?\""
msgstr "\"시험은 어떻게 이루어져 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "a9f15da4-8183-47c9-bad0-5b38fe95d2a0"
msgid "\"I agree to undergo your trial.\""
msgstr "\"너의 시험에 참여하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "f01706d9-00fd-467a-b3d6-7bd6ac4b76b8"
msgid "\"I worship Shelyn. Your words ring familiar and true to me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 셸린을 숭배한다. 네가 하는 말은 친숙하고 믿음이 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "02739f1d-1346-49ac-9256-651adf739b48"
msgid "\"I worship Sarenrae. Your words ring familiar and true to me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 서렌레이를 숭배한다. 네가 하는 말은 친숙하고 믿음이 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "889f0383-5a96-4b23-a321-a121095d3d22"
msgid "\"I worship Irori. Your words ring familiar and true to me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이로리를 숭배한다. 네가 하는 말은 친숙하고 믿음이 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "61e93059-f990-494c-a70e-5a1b901c109b"
msgid "\"I worship Iomedae. Your words ring familiar and true to me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아이오메데를 숭배한다. 네가 하는 말은 친숙하고 믿음이 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "95c9f6f1-f464-4f98-a04a-769188a7f4ea"
msgid "\"I worship Erastil. Your words ring familiar and true to me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 에라스틸을 숭배한다. 네가 하는 말은 친숙하고 믿음이 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "0c46b7c9-812d-4d8b-a10f-5fce62e643bf"
msgid "\"I worship Abadar. Your words ring familiar and true to me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 아바다르를 숭배한다. 네가 하는 말은 친숙하고 믿음이 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "ae097949-8406-41dc-b215-ccfb7af1c8b4"
msgid ""
"\"I worship Asmodeus. You think your philosophy would be of interest to me?\""
msgstr "\"나는 아스모데우스를 숭배한다. 너의 철학이 나에게 흥미로울 것 같나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "d3dbb28d-ca9c-4648-a726-ab67659af90e"
msgid ""
"\"I worship Zon-Kuthon. You think your philosophy would be of interest to me?"
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 존-쿠쏜을 숭배한다. 너의 철학이 나에게 흥미로울 것 같나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "04dee326-4210-411a-bb60-b3659bb3528b"
msgid ""
"\"I worship Urgathoa. You think your philosophy would be of interest to me?\""
msgstr "\"나는 우르가쏘아를 숭배한다. 너의 철학이 나에게 흥미로울 것 같나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "6a7ac305-b167-4c0f-bea4-722160686558"
msgid "\"I'm an atheist. I've no interest in religious orders.\""
msgstr "\"나는 무신론자이다. 종교적인 단체에 관심 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "a4d93d37-2bee-432f-b2ba-6cdb568f2859"
msgid "\"I worship Gorum! Do you really intend to preach pacifism to me?\""
msgstr "\"나는 고룸을 숭배한다. 평화주의 따위를 나에게 설교하려는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "15025ee3-4bfa-4a23-8d60-4f19ad2aac68"
msgid ""
"{n}A satyr and a nymph are watching a dark-skinned elf whose arms are "
"dancing, gracefully making magical gestures in a sort of ritual. Noticing "
"you, she stops her ceremonial dance and greets you with a light bow – "
"respectful and dignified.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스와 님프는 어두운 피부의 엘프가 무기를 들고 우아하고 일종의 의식으로 마법을 쓰기 위해 춤을 추는 모습을 보고 있습니다. "
"당신을 알아채자 그녀는 의식의 춤을 중지하고 위엄있고 경외심이 담긴 가벼운 절을 하며 당신을 맞이합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "80514544-b512-4b68-bf14-faefd2b1c259"
msgid ""
"\"You are {Name}, warrior-{mf|king|queen}, the first to bring peace to the "
"{g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. I sought a meeting with you, and fate has "
"allowed our paths to cross. My name is Kamala.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 처음으로 평화를 가져온 전사 {mf|왕|여왕} {Name}이군. 너와 만나기를 "
"원했고 운명은 우리를 만나도록 도왔다. 내 이름은 카말라이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "1345225d-8928-45dc-9d27-30d64931be96"
msgid ""
"\"Kamala the Phoenix from the Suramgamin Order, humble follower of the Wise "
"Way of teacher Avalo.\""
msgstr "\"스승 아발로가 이끄는 현명한 길의 추종자이자 슈람가민 단체의 일원인 불사조 카말라이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "9d4a916f-7782-4b71-9138-36b34bd86e1d"
msgid ""
"\"Mysterious and sinister events are happening in your lands. The border "
"between worlds grows thin – and someone's hand reaches through it, plotting "
"the deaths of you and your subjects. My brothers and sisters from the "
"Suramgamin Order have come to help you stand firm against this unknown enemy "
"– if you desire our help... And if you pass our trials and prove you are "
"worthy of it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 땅에서 신비하고 사악한 사건이 일어나고 있다. 국가 간의 접점이 얇아지고 악인의 마수가 너와 너의 백성들을 파멸하는 음모를 "
"꾸민다. 슈람가민 단체의 형제 자매들은 알려지지 않은 적으로부터 네가 버틸 수 있도록 도우러 왔다. 만일 당신이 우리의 도움을 원한다면 "
"말이다... 그리고 우리의 시험을 통과해 자신이 합당하다는 것을 증명한다면 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0010_Text_String
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "927e3eea-fe02-43f8-bb73-aa7aabcdf344"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity.\" {n}The elf whispers a spell and boundless peace and "
"tranquility descend upon you. Unable to even reach for your weapon, you "
"watch Kamala leave with dignity, the fey running after her, laughing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"유감이다.\" {n}엘프는 주문을 속삭였고, 무한한 평화와 평온함이 당신에게 쏟아집니다. 당신은 무기에 손조차 뻗지 못한 채 카말라가 "
"품위있게 떠나는 모습을 바라봤습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "5ae9aba3-50c2-4ad5-9ccb-122582276644"
msgid ""
"\"They were brought into this world unwillingly, and their mischievous "
"temper could mean a lot of trouble for the local people. The border between "
"worlds here is thin and feeble, like the worn-out cloth of a monk's frock. I "
"have charmed them to sit still for a bit, while I prepare to send them home."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 이 세상에 떠밀려 왔고 그들의 장난스러운 기질은 지역 사람들을 괴롭힐 수 있다. 세계의 경계는 닳아 없어진 몽크의 옷처럼 얇고 "
"약하다. 나는 그들을 집에 보낼 준비를 하면서 그들에게 마법을 써 달랜다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "5b542785-11f8-4a20-b6ed-894f0b04dd71"
msgid ""
"{n}The Suramgamin Order is relatively unknown, but you've heard stories. "
"They are followers of good and order, whose teacher Avalo, a native of "
"{g|Jalmeray}Jalmeray{/g}, preaches complete non-violence.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}슈람가민 단체는 비교적 알려지지 않았지만 당신은 이야기를 들어본 적이 있습니다. 그들은 선과 질서의 추종자이고 스승인 아발로는 "
"완전한 비폭력을 전하는 {g|Jalmeray}잘메레이{/g} 사람입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "9f4251ed-a54d-417a-afe1-2097afc11bc0"
msgid ""
"{n}You've never heard of this order, or a teacher of wisdom known by this "
"name.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 그런 이름으로 알려진 현자나 교단을 들어본 적이 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "891edb92-764d-41c9-bfdd-cf4706d99a46"
msgid ""
"\"This is unfortunate. Very well, Your Highness, we will trouble you no more."
"\""
msgstr "\"안타깝군. 알겠다. 너를 더 이상 괴롭히지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "efe17e45-8656-428b-b217-d8df308f1d29"
msgid ""
"\"Teacher Avalo founded our order to help people who walk the path of good "
"remain steadfast, and to give those who've lost their way a place to come "
"back to. The backbone of our philosophy is non-violence. This doesn't mean "
"we are helpless, but we believe there is a future when no one in our world "
"will wish to take up weapons against their neighbor.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아발로 스승은 선의 길을 추구하는 사람들을 돕고 길을 잃은 사람들은 돌아올 수 있도록 돕기 위해 단체를 세웠다. 우리 철학의 근본은 "
"비폭력이다. 그건 우리가 무기력하는 걸 의미하는 것이 아니라 우리 세계에서는 아무도 이웃에게 칼을 겨누지 않는 믿음을 의미한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "67a3fa78-d639-4d0b-bd97-6b4254229dc6"
msgid ""
"\"The heart of the way is practice. The ability to subdue anger, negotiate "
"without threat, to quell a conflict before a spark becomes a fire – I "
"imagine the {mf|king|queen} must be familiar with such things? With your "
"permission, I would like to test you – here and now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"방법의 핵심은 실천이다. {mf|왕|여왕}은 분노를 억제하고 위협없이 협상하며 불꽃이 튀어 불이 붙기 전에 갈등을 진압 할 수있는 "
"능력에 익숙한가? 네가 허락하면 여기서 지금 시험을 진행하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "6a6f6ec8-7182-4853-a5f1-062e37db2fa3"
msgid "\"Fine. Let's begin!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 시작하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "97876fc8-9230-4ff2-93dc-ed1a1132c41b"
msgid ""
"\"Look at these fey. I charmed them so they wouldn't interfere while I open "
"a portal into their native world. I will release them now. To pass the "
"trial, you must convince the fey to remain still, while I prepare to send "
"them home. Try to do this without threatening them... And don't let them "
"charm you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 페이들을 보아라. 내가 그들의 세계로 향하는 포털을 열 때 방해하지 않도록 그들을 매료시켰다. 나는 지금 그들을 풀어주겠다. "
"시험을 통과하기 위해서 내가 그들을 집으로 돌려보낼 준비를 하는 동안 너는 페이들이 가만히 있도록 설득해야만 한다. 그들을 위협하지 "
"않도록 해라... 그리고 그들에게 매료당하지 않게 노력해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "0796a6ff-c645-45c2-b191-917c6d0b3dfc"
msgid ""
"\"What? A whole world without fights? Then what would we do? Just lie around "
"and get fat? I'd like to see you try teaching beasts and monsters to be "
"peaceful — and how the peace lovers who follow you would handle them!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 싸움이 없는 세상? 그러면 우리는 무엇을 해야 하지? 거짓말하고 뚱뚱해지면 되는 건가? 나는 네가 짐승과 괴물을 평화롭게 "
"행동하라고 가르치는 것을 보고 싶다. 그리고 네가 추종자들을 어떻게 다루는지도 보고싶군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "e047d561-3c05-4e29-bbda-9e231dbe82f5"
msgid ""
"\"I am not familiar with these teachings, but they sound very similar to "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}'s faith. It is amazing, but I think this is someone "
"who surpasses us in peacefulness.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 가르침에 익숙하지 않지만 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 믿음과 매우 유사하게 들린다. 평화주의에서 우리를 능가하는 "
"사람이 있다니 놀랍다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "88ba911f-5c10-4d24-b246-2481b3a7cc7c"
msgid ""
"\"I hear peace and wisdom in these words. Like the sound of the sea within a "
"shell. If there ever comes a day when the fire of anger fades from the "
"world, I would like to see its dawn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 말에서 평화와 지혜가 들린다. 마치 소라 껍질 안에 들리는 바다 소리 같다. 분노의 불길이 세상에서 사라질 날이 온다면 나는 "
"그날의 새벽을 보고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "e18ae1e8-1517-40d9-bc42-35a2e1065ec9"
msgid ""
"\"Heat cannot be separated from fire, as anger cannot be separated from a "
"living soul. Teaching peace for all is a lie, a dream, or just folly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"열기는 불에서 분리될 수 없듯, 분노는 살아있는 영혼으로부터 분리 될 수 없다. 모든 사람에게 평화를 가르치는 것은 거짓말이거나, "
"망상이거나 어리석음일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "784a3aa5-408b-4a6c-ba82-d64590f425f5"
msgid ""
"\"No wonder! That's one of the deities Master Avalo studied to glean some of "
"the grains of truth he used to build his philosophy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상한 일이 아니다! 그것은 바로 스승 아발로가 자신의 철학을 세울 때 진실의 낱알을 모으기 위해 연구한 신들 중 하나이기 때문이다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "30012338-4421-4d23-ba16-184861781e17"
msgid ""
"\"We know you pray to an evil deity. Still, we wanted to take a look at you "
"and see for ourselves — are you really so evil? Could there yet be seeds of "
"goodness sleeping deep in your soul?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 네가 악한 신에게 기도한다는 것을 알고 있다. 여전히 우리는 당신을 보고 우리를 위해 보려고 한다. 너는 정말 그렇게 악한가? "
"아직 영혼 깊숙한 곳에서 자고 있는 선한 씨앗이 잠자고 있지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "ec9069df-f8b5-4203-8823-298fd7f03486"
msgid ""
"\"It doesn't matter. There are atheists among us, too. We don't blindly "
"follow deities — we simply use their lessons to help us become better people."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"상관 없다. 우리 중에는 무신론자들도 있다. 우리는 맹목적으로 신을 따르지 않는다. 우리는 더 나은 사람들이 될 수 있도록 그들의 "
"교훈을 이용한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_StartQuest/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "deb53b50-f501-4166-b086-b47d01244200"
msgid ""
"\"We know that you pray to the god of war. Still, we wanted to take a look "
"at you and see for ourselves — are you really so dedicated to chaos and "
"destruction? Could there yet be seeds of order sleeping deep in your soul?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 네가 전쟁의 신에게 기도한다는 것을 알고 있다. 여전히 우리는 당신을 보고 우리를 위해 보려고 한다. 너는 정말 그렇게 "
"악한가? 아직 영혼 깊숙한 곳에서 자고 있는 선한 씨앗이 잠자고 있지 않을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6dc97580-8dcc-4865-aad2-5a64cf48df01"
msgid ""
"Threatened the fey during the trial of Kamala from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 카말라가 시험을 진행하는 동안 페이를 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "54e4d694-3d3f-4fad-b028-79279d45df4e"
msgid "\"Sit still or I'll chop your arms and legs off!\""
msgstr "\"얌전히 앉아있지 않으면 팔다리를 잘라주지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a6626aab-bf01-488d-b689-af762f132d7b"
msgid "Attacked the fey during the trial of Kamala from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 카말라가 시험을 진행하는 동안 페이를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "2293b3ee-ff08-4567-9ea6-5f76fb122eee"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'll deal with you once and for all!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너를 진지하게 대하겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "8dda10e7-c769-4e03-826a-2087dbc9f523"
msgid "\"Tell me, who are you and what are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구며 여기서 뭐하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "5f262810-5a6f-4adb-b4f2-96e4502c1145"
msgid ""
"\"You'd better go back to your world. There are some fey-gobbling monsters "
"in these lands. They'll eat you up just like that!\""
msgstr "\"너의 세계로 돌아가는게 좋을 거야. 이 땅에는 페이를 잡아먹는 괴물들이 있어. 너 또한 그것들에게 먹힐 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "a6686045-1049-446f-bb2c-e4411ec2b261"
msgid "\"All right, let's go look at your treasures.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 네 보물을 보자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "1d30aa68-f429-49c4-a066-9f59870fe9f3"
msgid "\"I'd rather hear about your adventures.\""
msgstr "\"너의 모험에 대해 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "6913f32e-3846-45e5-b02e-d543a4160137"
msgid ""
"\"So what? Treasures!? I have plenty of those. You've never seen anything "
"like the stuff I've got!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 뭐? 보물이라고!? 나도 엄청나게 많이 가지고 있어. 너는 내가 가진 물건들을 본 적도 없을 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "c2e9f2eb-097c-439a-b8da-445f2582e3c3"
msgid "\"Go. Safe travels!\""
msgstr "\"가라. 안전한 여행이 되기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0053_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "3984e903-65aa-42c4-bb60-444b88066092"
msgid "Attacked the fey during the trial of Kamala from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 카말라가 시험을 진행하는 동안 페이를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "a959b29b-1d94-4fd4-9e1f-87a99158cfb0"
msgid "[Attack] \"Hell no! I don't forgive such behavior!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"젠장! 안돼! 그런 행동은 용서하지 않아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b8664327-9df0-4039-96dc-c885b1cf6031"
msgid ""
"{n}Kamala lifts the spell from the fey with a graceful gesture, and starts "
"casting another spell to send them home. The nymph and the satyr look at you "
"mischievously – some prank is obviously brewing in their heads.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}카말라는 우아한 동작으로 페이에게 걸었던 주문을 걷어내고, 동시에 다른 주문을 시전하여 집으로 보냅니다. 님프와 사티로스는 당신을 "
"장난스럽게 보았습니다. 분명 그들의 머릿속에선 몇가지 장난이 만들어지는 중입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "1e198822-82a8-43f9-991c-a8d79afb4c89"
msgid ""
"{n}Casting fearful glances at you and your weapon, the fey sit still, "
"waiting for the ritual to end.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}페이는 당신과 당신의 무기에 두려운 눈빛을 보내며 가만히 앉아 의식이 끝나기를 기다립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "44db4a13-d67f-4410-987c-8c198dbc7f31"
msgid "\"You're mean!\""
msgstr "\"비겁한 녀석!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "788b5db5-d747-41a8-996a-0724d2c55229"
msgid "\"Slimeball!\""
msgstr "\"기분나쁜 녀석!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "e96ea704-f7b8-444e-b648-93786c81d97f"
msgid "\"We aren't afraid of you! We aren't – got it? Hahaha!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너를 두려워하지 않아! 알겠어? 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "26e2e1c0-5b4b-42eb-8473-7a6aa04a3178"
msgid ""
"{n}The fey run away, laughing out loud and sticking their tongues at you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}페이는 깔깔거리면서 혀를 당신에게 내밀고는 도망갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "e399fdb2-e99f-4335-808d-03f3bb57ae78"
msgid "\"I am Myrrhine and this is Kinesias. And we are bored!\""
msgstr "\"나는 미르하인이고 여기는 카이네샤스야. 우리는 지루해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "2405506c-5d05-4400-a9aa-350a1b9c7e29"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah right. We sit and talk and tell you things... As if we've nothing "
"better to do!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 맞아. 우리는 앉아서 대화하고 이야기를 나눌거야. 지루한 것보다는 나아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "00e0e13d-960e-4515-81e7-3ba2a3d74b93"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, frightfully bored! Everywhere else it's changing, flickering, like "
"this and like that! But here it's always the same all the time! The trees "
"don't walk, the mountains don't fly... And you're such fools! Hahaha!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래. 끔찍하게 지루했어! 세상은 이것도 저것도 이리저리 바뀌고 깜빡여! 하지만 여기는 항상 똑같아! 나무는 걷지 않고 산도 날지 "
"않아. 그리고 너는 멍청하고! 하하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "8ee9f6c3-c452-4be7-9739-6324b9e874a6"
msgid "\"Everything is so strange here... How do you live here at all?\""
msgstr "\"여기는 모든게 이상하다. 여기서 어떻게 살고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "5ef1a4d0-b645-4fbb-971d-684b526e7c95"
msgid "\"Oh really? Monsters... Big ones? Do they have teeth?\""
msgstr "\"오. 정말인가? 괴물들이라... 얼마나 크기에? 이빨도 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "ba8b922e-58c7-488f-9295-af42251fa98f"
msgid "\"Oh, really? What kind of monsters? I want to see them!\""
msgstr "\"오. 정말인가? 어떤 괴물이야? 보고 싶다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "0158b268-f51f-41c7-aa30-85a66d95b309"
msgid "\"Let's go look for the monsters! You keep sitting here like dummies!\""
msgstr "\"괴물을 찾으러 가자! 여기 인형처럼 앉아있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "abe753f7-2ee2-4a5f-b76c-3f08ef46038e"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, we've had such adventures – you have no idea! Beyond your wildest "
"dreams! For instance, once we had manticore races!\""
msgstr "\"오. 우리는 그런 모험을 했다. 너는 상상도 못할 테지! 네 상상을 뛰어 넘어! 예를 들면 우리에게는 만티코어가 있었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "65e1467c-021c-48f7-98d0-5fd8c2344502"
msgid "\"You won't let them hurt us, will you? Will you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 그들이 우리를 해치게 하지 않을 거지? 그럴 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "a6ccfd84-6ce0-4557-95f9-6e08d89962f7"
msgid ""
"\"We've been sitting here for a hundred million years! We're so bored! Let's "
"go for a walk! We'll show you something wonderful – you'll love it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 1억년 동안 여기 앉아있었어! 우린 너무 지루 해! 우리 산책하자! 너에게 멋진 것을 보여 줄게. 너는 좋아할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "440284f9-98e1-45a6-92a9-025299fb230c"
msgid ""
"\"And you'll be rich! You mortals love treasure, right? There you go! "
"There's plenty of treasure around here. But without us you'll never find it "
"your whole life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 너는 부자가 될 거야! 필멸자는 보물을 사랑해. 그렇지? 저기에 있어! 여기 주변에는 많은 보물이 있다. 그러나 우리 없이는 "
"너 평생 찾지 못할 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "3affb8da-2f2c-4d5a-a1fd-e7ff44cad3c9"
msgid ""
"\"You're so silly and boring! What if it's contagious? What if we become "
"silly and boring just from sitting here with you?\""
msgstr "\"너 멍청하고 지루해. 전염성이 있다면 어쩌지? 너와 앉아있다가 어리석고 지루해지면 어쩌지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "747fe60a-172d-417c-84d4-aa240b6127c7"
msgid "\"What? Hells no! Run away before we catch it!\""
msgstr "\"뭐야? 안돼! 우리가 잡기 전에 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "585a2d3b-bb22-4946-94c1-92f947cc46f9"
msgid "\"It's not far, very close... Over there!\""
msgstr "\"멀지 않아. 아주 가깝다... 저기!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "2011c891-576f-4330-bc59-120d506c96d3"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, they're very close... Tee-hee! Hey, did {mf|he|she} really believe "
"that?\""
msgstr "\"그래. 아주 가까워... 메롱! 너 정말로 그렇게 믿은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "29194c01-331f-4c8c-8c37-61e8ea71bcf1"
msgid "\"{mf|He|She} did! {mf|He|She} did! Oh, what a dummy!\""
msgstr "\"네가 그랬어! {mf|그|그녀}가 그랬어! 정말 멍청하구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "7b958af8-2ba2-46e0-b8a6-36eb6323aae3"
msgid ""
"\"There's not much to tell... We had some adventures! We'd just come to your "
"world, when this mean lady decided to send us back right away!\""
msgstr ""
"\"말할 것도 별로 없어... 우리는 모험을 했지! 이 치사한 아가씨가 바로 우리를 돌려 보내기로 결정했을 때 우리는 너희 세계에 왔어!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "2ed54cc0-7c91-4354-bc8a-46c7cb03fd1f"
msgid "\"Really? And what kind of treasures do you mortals have?\""
msgstr "\"정말이야? 필멸자 주제에 어떤 보물을 가지고 있는데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "513423dd-de41-41f1-b318-11fd58a2a6ad"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah right! What would mortals know of treasures? There's probably nothing "
"worth mentioning in your whole world!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 필멸자들은 보물에 대해 무엇을 알고 있어? 아마도 너희 세계에서는 자랑할 만한 건 없을 걸!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "02203f31-a20d-467d-9235-93bd2c68fa53"
msgid "\"Yes! Just rags, stones and scraps!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 그냥 누더기나 돌 덩어리나 고물이겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "6cdf0311-a8cf-4a33-8cb7-5e587bee9a04"
msgid "\"Show us! Show us! We want to see!\""
msgstr "\"보여줘! 보여줘! 보고 싶어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "35e05e89-1414-4699-b96b-662d254547ae"
msgid ""
"\"Another time we met the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} himself! He gave "
"us a copper coin, half a pie and a silk stocking!\""
msgstr ""
"\"언젠가 우리는 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}을 만났어! 그는 우리에게 구리 동전, 파이 반조각, 실크 스타킹을 주었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "004deab1-378a-49e4-9b2b-96c8f7515034"
msgid ""
"\"And one time, some hunters wandered into us! We danced with them, and we "
"danced, and we danced until we dropped! Oh! But then we got up, and for some "
"reason, they didn't...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 언젠가는 사냥꾼들이 배회하다 우리에게 왔어! 그들은 우리와 함께 춤 추고, 우리도 춤 추고 지칠 때까지 춤췄어! 왜 그랬는지 "
"모르겠지만 우리가 일어났을 때는 그들은 일어나지 못했어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : KamalaThePhoenix
msgctxt "f89cc35c-cc0c-4115-81ce-62937c7944de"
msgid "\"That's it. It's time for you to go home!\""
msgstr "\"그게 다야. 집에 갈 시간이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0046_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "e186ab67-9942-4aa3-af33-3a78b2573337"
msgid ""
"\"No, no! We've only just arrived! We aren't going anywhere!\" {n}The satyr "
"takes out a pan flute and starts playing.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 안돼! 우린 방금 도착했다! 우린 아무데도 가지 않을 거야!\" {n}사티로스가 팬 플루트를 꺼내더니 연주하기 "
"시작합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Satyr
msgctxt "c805b46c-e8fd-4461-a302-58f42f91d9ae"
msgid ""
"{n}You feel drowsy for a moment, but the spell's effects quickly clear. "
"Realizing his spell didn't work, the satyr hides his flute.{/n} \"Um... All "
"right, we should probably go...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 잠시 졸았지만 마법의 효과는 빨리 사라집니다. 그의 주문이 걸리지 않았다는 것을 깨달은 사티로스는 플루트를 숨깁니다.{/n} "
"\"음... 좋아. 이제 가야겠군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "d4c861d5-07e2-4b0a-8a85-8863df0db0b8"
msgid ""
"{n}You feel drowsy. Your eyes close involuntarily, and you can't even move a "
"finger.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}당신은 졸았습니다. 당신의 눈은 무의식적으로 닫히고 손가락을 움직일 수도 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Kamala_Trial/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : PhoenixTrial_Nymph
msgctxt "e1a21096-7b41-48f7-aaf0-632f117e169a"
msgid "\"There's no place like home!\""
msgstr "\"집보다 편한 곳은 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "693fc8cb-50e1-4e7c-b65e-cb128232e614"
msgid "\"You're suddenly much more polite.\""
msgstr "\"갑자기 예의를 차리는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "aa85f8b5-6a5e-44f7-b9f5-89c3dcb2e89c"
msgid "\"Where is this neophyte who was supposed to test me?\""
msgstr "\"새로운 신도가 나를 시험하기로 한 곳은 어디지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5398d95e-7458-4eb5-9fcd-cbf6f73f2af9"
msgid "\"What does your name mean?\""
msgstr "\"당신의 이름은 무엇을 의미하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "48fb6143-b363-443c-b67d-0e532eefb915"
msgid "\"Tell me about your order.\""
msgstr "\"너희 단체에 대해 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "fbcea5a2-1875-4f69-aa25-b2af8f2f02df"
msgid "Attacked Puja from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 푸자를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "c0a04b32-5e41-45d9-b64e-0e17073d1efc"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't need the likes of you here!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너와 같은 녀석이 필요치 않다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "bbc8c1be-e9c5-4875-a28c-618133f45959"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "8cab86aa-d937-401c-b814-53ded87abbb6"
msgid "\"Where does your order come from?\""
msgstr "\"너희 단체는 어디서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "495b9413-d193-4dd6-9fe7-70d1a939b608"
msgid "\"What is your philosophy?\""
msgstr "\"너희의 철학은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "8086b347-b0f8-4b5d-9a02-fccdc5fc9250"
msgid "\"What deity do you venerate?\""
msgstr "\"너는 어떤 신을 숭배하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "310b72d8-c579-412b-838c-e9812fb00032"
msgid "\"What does 'Suramgamin' mean?\""
msgstr "\"'슈람가민'은 무엇을 의미하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "f731a468-931b-47db-b3ef-a2a4bc247d9b"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure you want to help me? My views on the world differ from yours."
"\""
msgstr "\"나를 도울 건가? 세상에 대한 나의 견해는 너와 다르다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "96c0f455-1fae-4281-aa53-fbdae98ae598"
msgid "\"Thank you for your answers.\""
msgstr "\"답변해 주어 고맙군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "99231cb9-82bd-46bd-8a13-6d5c238f7989"
msgid ""
"\"That time I didn't have to wait long! Congratulations, Your Highness – you "
"passed this trial with flying colors!\""
msgstr "\"오래 기다릴 필요가 없었다! 축하한다. 너는 시험을 수월하게 통과했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "97b407ee-307f-494b-9206-5add2bfe5ab1"
msgid ""
"\"You took your time, Your Highness! Unfortunately you didn't pass the trial."
"\""
msgstr "\"시간 낭비였다. 불행히도 너는 시험을 통과하지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "983ff4fb-3355-4686-814d-e52b73821d31"
msgid ""
"\"Now the final trial awaits you. Find my sister, Vidya the Lion. She is "
"somewhere nearby – you need not look far.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 최종 시험이 기다리고 있다. 내 동생 사자 비드야를 찾아라. 그녀는 이 근처 어딘가에 있다. 멀리 가지 않아도 된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8729135c-a745-4774-8807-7e3ab24fc123"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf smiles.{/n} \"Standing right in front of me. Who made you run "
"here day and night without sleep or even rest? It certainly wasn't me! You "
"tested yourself – and with brilliant results!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프는 웃습니다.{/n} \"이게 누군가. 누가 밤낮으로 자지도 쉬지도 못하고 여기로 달려오게 만들었더라? 나는 틀림없이 "
"아니겠지! 너는 자신을 시험했다. 그리고 훌륭한 결과를 얻었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "99bfdf85-aeeb-436d-a2e2-7ad2c963e6e9"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf smiles.{/n} \"Standing right in front of me. This time you were "
"supposed to test yourself. Could you bend your will to follow the road day "
"and night, without sleep or even rest? Alas, you treat yourself too gently!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}드워프는 웃습니다.{/n} \"바로 내 앞에 서 있지 않은가. 이번에는 너 자신을 시험해야 했다. 잠도 휴식도 취하지 못하고 "
"밤낮으로 길을 떠나기 위해 자신의 의지를 꺾을 수 있는가? 아아, 너는 자신을 너무 부드럽게 다루었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "701af65c-f9c8-4850-942f-5a6cfe404449"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive my rudeness. It was a part of the trial. Not everyone is be able "
"to smother their pride and suffer insults from a smug stranger!\""
msgstr "\"내 무례를 용서해라. 시험의 일부였다. 모든 사람이 자만심을 억누르고 콧대높은 이방인의 모욕을 참지는 못한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "29eec1ad-a632-477d-8ad9-96a799a28d02"
msgid ""
"\"Not too smart on your part.\" {n}The dwarf whispers a spell, and boundless "
"peace and tranquility descend upon you. Unable to even reach for your "
"weapon, you watch Puja leave.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네 역할을 다하지 못했다.\" {n}엘프는 주문을 속삭였고, 무한한 평화와 평온함이 당신에게 쏟아집니다. 당신은 무기에 손조차 뻗지 "
"못한 채 카말라가 품위있게 떠나는 모습을 바라봤습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "9f3e9c04-f433-4d27-b270-859c2fb63836"
msgid "\"Safe journey, Your Highness. We will meet again.\""
msgstr "\"안전한 여행 되길. 우리는 다시 만날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "2f50b9a9-f43a-4505-921d-2f320a5c52cc"
msgid ""
"\"I received the name Puja from teacher Avalo. He comes from "
"{g|Jalmeray}Jalmeray{/g}, and gives his disciples names in his native "
"tongue. 'Puja' means 'prayer'. And 'Wolf' is an honorary title. To become a "
"master of an order, one must walk one of the paths of wisdom – the Phoenix, "
"the Unicorn, and so on. The Way of the Wolf is the way of humility, of "
"foregoing pride and personal ambition. Of honest, if sometimes thankless, "
"work for the common good.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 스승 아발로에게서 푸자라는 이름을 받았다. 그는 {g|Jalmeray}잘메레이{/g} 출신으로 그의 제자에게 모국어로 이름을 "
"준다. '푸자'는 '기도'를 의미한다. 그리고 '늑대'는 명예로운 칭호이다. 단체의 선생이 되려면 불사조, 유니콘 등 지혜의 길 중 "
"하나를 따라야 한다. 늑대의 길은 자부심과 개인의 야망에 대한 겸손의 길이다. 고마움을 모른다면 공통의 이익을 위해 일하는 것이 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "9ab1dbff-619b-45f5-b0c9-fcbb08132b0a"
msgid ""
"\"Refusing those who seek knowledge is a sin. What do you wish to know?\""
msgstr "\"지식을 추구하는 사람들을 거절하는 것은 죄이다. 무엇을 알고 싶은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "d9a3b3ef-22bf-4bbd-a8ec-ea73e5856fb0"
msgid ""
"\"It was founded by teacher Avalo. Very little is known of his past – only "
"that he is from {g|Jalmeray}Jalmeray{/g}. Some say he was a criminal and "
"fled the law... These are only rumors, but even if there is truth behind "
"them – well, many in our order used to be villains. Changing one's sinister "
"nature, rising from mere animal existence to goodness and order – this is "
"the backbone of our teaching.\""
msgstr ""
"\"스승 아발로가 설립했다. 그의 과거는 거의 알려지지 않았다. 그가 {g|Jalmeray}잘메레이{/g} 출신이라는 것만 알려져 있다. "
"어떤 사람들은 그가 범법자였고 법을 피해 달아났다고 말한다... 이들은 단지 소문일 뿐이지만, 그것들 일부가 진실이라 하더라도 – 뭐, "
"상관없다. 우리 단체의 많은 자들이 악인이었으니. 금수와 다름없는 존재에서 선량과 질서에 이르기까지 자신의 사악한 본성을 바꾸는 것, "
"이것이 우리의 가르침의 중추이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "73af459d-04c8-4fa9-b512-7d93864fc58e"
msgid ""
"\"It is difficult to translate – there just isn't a suitable word in the "
"common language. 'The way of a hero' is close, but hero is not understood as "
"one who spills more blood than the rest. 'The way of the righteous' perhaps, "
"though still not very exact. If you would forgive such a bulky phrase, it's "
"more precisely \"the way of the person who makes the world a better place'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"번역하기 어렵다. 공용어에는 적당한 단어가 없다. '영웅의 길'이 일반적이지만, 영웅이란 다른 사람보다 더 많은 피를 흘리는 사람으로 "
"여겨지지는 않는다. 여전히 매우 정확한 것이 아니더라도, '정의의 길'이 맞을수도 있다. 길다란 구절이라도 상관없다면, '세상을 더 좋은 "
"곳으로 만드는 사람의 길'이라 하는게 더 정확하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "cd82eb3c-f1f6-490f-a676-3a297b44a947"
msgid ""
"\"To tell the tale... the teacher spent many years meditating in the "
"Arthfell Forest and then showed up out of nowhere at a great temple of "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, and challenged the high priestess to debates about "
"the essence of their faith. He argued thus with many religious leaders, "
"proving that there's a common principle behind the faiths of the different "
"gods of good and order, a common path he called the Wise Way. Disciples came "
"to him. But though there was nothing profane in his words, it seemed that "
"the servants of even the most kind deities don't like it when their "
"congregation is being taken from them.\" {n}The dwarf chuckles sadly.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이야기를 풀어보자면... 스승은 아스펠 숲에서 수 년 동안 명상하다가, 갑자기 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}의 대성전에 나타나 "
"대사제에게 도전하여 그들의 신앙의 본질에 대한 토론을 했다. 그는 많은 종교 지도자들과 마찬가지로 선과 질서를 추구하는 다른 신들의 "
"신앙에는 공통적인 원칙이 있음을 입증하면서 현명한 길이라고 불리는 공통의 길을 주장했다. 제자들이 그를 찾아갔다. 그의 말에는 신성모독이 "
"없었지만 가장 친절한 신들의 종들조차 신도들을 빼앗기는 것을 좋아하지 않았다.\" {n}드워프는 슬프게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "18b4d13a-c55f-489a-a602-3d71f8d385b3"
msgid ""
"\"And thus the teacher returned to the Arthfell, swearing then and there "
"that our order would build no temples of our own. Some of his disciples "
"stayed with him, while others went traveling, spreading his teachings. We "
"are no secret, but don't attract too much attention either. Some tell us to "
"leave, others listen and learn... That is all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 스승은 아스펠로 돌아가서 우리 단체는 성전을 짓지 않기로 맹세했다. 제자 중 일부는 그와 함께 머물렀지만 다른 이들은 여행을 "
"하면서 자신의 가르침을 전파했다. 우리는 비밀이 없지만 너무 많은 주의를 끌지도 않는다. 누군가는 우리에게 떠나라고 하고 누군가는 듣고 "
"배우기도 한다... 이것이 내가 말할 수 있는 전부다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "84112cab-126c-44b0-bb33-f168b76189fe"
msgid ""
"\"The Wise Way. Our teacher discovered it after years of contemplation and "
"meditation. Its common principles of good and order underpin the faiths of "
"all the kind gods. If everyone followed them, the world would know no war, "
"and all would live as one vast family. The core principle of the Wise Way is "
"non-violence. Yes, it can be difficult at times, especially when evil rages "
"all around. But we believe that it is only by pacifying the evil in one's "
"own soul that we are able to defeat monsters.\""
msgstr ""
"\"현명한 길이다. 우리 스승은 수년 동안의 숙고와 명상을 통해 그것을 발견했다. 모든 종류의 신의 신념을 뒷받침하는 선과 질서의 공통된 "
"원리라고 할 수 있다. 모든 사람이 그러한 신념을 따른다면 세계는 전쟁이 존재하지 않을 것이며 모두가 하나로 살아갈 것이다. 현명한 길의 "
"핵심 원리는 비폭력이다. 때로는 어려울 수도 있다. 특히 사악한 분노가 있는 경우에는 더욱 그렇다. 하지만 우리는 자신의 영혼에 악을 "
"달래 우리 안의 괴물을 물리칠 수 있다고 믿는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "809c1eb7-e8e7-4132-8266-193dcb87ac90"
msgid ""
"\"We are not sure – that's why we are testing you! But be assured that even "
"if you harbor evil and hope only to profit from us... If you manage to pass "
"our trials, this surely means there is room in your soul for good. Many of "
"our members were once scoundrels or worse. And each of them is now living "
"proof that the Wise Way is open to all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"확신할 수 없다. 그래서 우리는 너를 시험하고 있다. 하지만 네가 악을 품고 우리에게서 이익을 취하려 하더라도 이것은 확실하다... "
"네가 시험을 통과하면 너의 영혼에 선이 정착할 공간이 있는 것이다. 많은 회원들이 한 때 악당이었다. 그리고 그들 모두가 현명한 길이 "
"모두에게 열려 있다는 산 증거이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "148dab1b-fc43-411c-a00f-8ba35821167b"
msgid ""
"\"We venerate many deities, but swear by none. {g|Shelyn}Shelyn{/g}, "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, {g|Irori}Irori{/g}, {g|Iomedae}Iomedae{/g}, "
"{g|Erastil}Erastil{/g}, {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} – each a fragment of the truth. "
"But only teacher Avalo gathered all the parts together in the teachings of "
"the Wise Way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 많은 신을 숭배하지만 누구에게도 맹세하지 않는다. {g|Shelyn}셸린{/g}, {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}, "
"{g|Irori}이로리{/g}, {g|Iomedae}아이오메데{/g}, {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}, "
"{g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}. 각각이 진실의 조각이다. 그러나 스승 아발로만이 모든 조각을 하나로 모아 현명한 길의 가르침으로 "
"만들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "15825e1d-8345-4f4b-918d-7de0ead21d4e"
msgid "\"As the teacher likes to say – ask and be answered.\""
msgstr "\"스승이 그러했듯, 물어보면 답해주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "886585a4-21ed-4fb3-92f1-636bb7b9a7cd"
msgid ""
"\"Hello again, Your Highness. Congratulations! You not only passed the "
"trial, but you performed it brilliantly! If you walked just a little bit "
"faster, you'd have had to wait for me, not me for you! My sincerest respect!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"다시 만났군. 축하한다! 너는 시험을 통과했을 뿐만 아니라 훌륭하게 수행했다! 조금만 더 빨리 걸었으면 내가 너를 기다리는게 아니라 "
"네가 나를 기다려야 했을 것이다! 진실로 경의를 표한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Ekun_Companion
msgctxt "4c317b2f-a31a-4f50-a396-2617b8990a1d"
msgid ""
"\"A wolf lives for the pack — true. A wolf is humble and not proud — not "
"true.\""
msgstr "\"늑대는 무리를 위해 산다 — 이는 진실이다. 늑대는 겸손하며 자존심이 없다 — 이는 사실이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Puja_End/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ece33b70-1a14-411b-bb67-b43dd43a1b70"
msgid ""
"\"I see wisdom in these words. Perhaps your teachings do not fully match "
"with what I believe and know of the world, but there are many kind things in "
"them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 그 말에서 지혜를 보았습니다. 당신의 가르침은 제가 세상에 대해 믿고 아는 것과 완전히 일치하지는 않지만, 그 안에는 많은 "
"친절이 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "01591a9e-625c-4fef-bc31-f4388b702e3a"
msgid "\"Be polite, dwarf. You're in my domain.\""
msgstr "\"건방 떨지 마라. 드워프. 너는 내 영역에 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "449d71fc-b6f7-4b49-a4c1-21953f973fb9"
msgid "\"What is the next trial?\""
msgstr "\"다음 시험은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5de6be50-d155-43fe-a65c-b6de83327a85"
msgid "Attacked Puja from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 푸자를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "76b485cd-0cf5-448e-887e-d1faf7b8cc9e"
msgid "[Attack] \"I will not let anyone speak to me in this tone!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"누구도 그러한 말투로 나에게 말하게 하지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "99e80da1-46a4-4f48-a6a5-34ad42d8dfa3"
msgid "\"I will go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : PujaTheWolf_TalonPeak
msgctxt "264963ee-b548-48ba-a3a9-475b22cbc813"
msgid ""
"{n}The dwarf standing on the cliff gives you a stern look.{/n} \"Ah, there "
"you are, at last. That was a long wait! Froze my... Ahem! My feet off!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}절벽에 서 있는 드워프는 당신에게 엄한 모습을 보여줍니다.{/n} \"아. 드디어 도착했군. 오래 기다렸다! 에헴... 기다리느라 "
"지쳤다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : PujaTheWolf_TalonPeak
msgctxt "e8eb89cf-2e02-45c3-a4b4-25693f73bb96"
msgid ""
"\"And what are you going to do? Kick me out? Pff! Politeness has to be "
"earned. I don't see a {mf|king|queen} in front of me, but a spoiled child "
"who wants everything done {mf|his|her} way!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 뭘 할 수 있지? 나를 쫓아낼 텐가? 흥! 난 자격 있는 자에게만 예의를 차린다. 내 눈에는 {mf|왕|여왕}이라 할 만한 자가 "
"보이지 않는다. 뭐든 제멋대로 하려는 응석받이는 하나 보이는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : PujaTheWolf_TalonPeak
msgctxt "b16c9130-3442-464d-bceb-d6f266e3be54"
msgid ""
"\"There is none! I don't know what my brothers and sisters think but as far "
"as I'm concerned, you don't deserve trials by masters yet! I'll tell you "
"what: a neophyte should test you first! Set off to the Castle of Knives. And "
"quickly, not like your usual lazy gait!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무것도 없다! 내 형제 자매들이 생각하는 것이 무엇인지 모르겠지만 내가 우려한 대로, 너는 선생들의 시험을 받을 자격이 없다! 하나 "
"말해주지: 새로운 신도가 너를 먼저 시험해야 한다! 칼날의 성으로 가라. 평소처럼 게으른 걸음걸이 말고. 어서 걸으란 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : PujaTheWolf_TalonPeak
msgctxt "e524bb19-90d2-4e52-bf0c-cb2345ac6090"
msgid "\"Go on then, move!\""
msgstr "\"어서! 움직여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : PujaTheWolf_TalonPeak
msgctxt "0790d38f-3f24-4a61-b02a-34f921ce16fc"
msgid ""
"\"Yeah right, {mf|he|she} won't let me...\" {n}The dwarf whispers a spell, "
"and boundless peace and tranquility descend upon you. Unable to even reach "
"for your weapon, you watch Puja leave, mumbling something.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그래 맞아. {mf|그|그녀}는 그렇지 않지...\" {n}드워프는 주문을 속삭였고, 무한한 평화와 평온함이 당신에게 쏟아집니다. "
"당신은 무기에 손조차 뻗지 못한 채 푸자가 무언가를 중얼거리며 떠나는 모습을 바라봤습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "d7b80830-8ca0-4b5a-b14f-081c5492f326"
msgid ""
"\"Do we really have to run around and do what these madmen tell us? Can't I "
"punch him, at least once? Please! You know... to test his convictions!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 정말로 뛰어다니면서 저 미치광이들이 하는 말대로 해야 하는 거야? 한 대만 때려도 돼? 부탁이야! 있잖아... 저 녀석의 "
"신념을 시험해 보자고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Talon_Puja_Start/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "0bd2abd5-b133-4709-9357-ff1ebe7679bc"
msgid ""
"\"When telling us about the trial, Kamala described the ability to subdue "
"anger as being among its conditions. I believe we are now being tested for "
"this very skill.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시험에 대해 이야기할 때, 카말라는 분노를 달랠 수 있는 능력이 시험의 조건 중 하나라고 설명했습니다. 저는 지금 이 기술에 대해 "
"시험을 치루고 있다 믿겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "3c9f1f9b-d0d5-401d-9c50-d39bcf90df31"
msgid "\"Tell me more about your order.\""
msgstr "\"너희 단체에 대해 더 많이 듣고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4b16d033-fba0-422e-a5f9-199c2fe1041a"
msgid "\"What does your name mean?\""
msgstr "\"당신의 이름은 무엇을 의미하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6f9893ed-d9fb-47e4-9aef-e978668a44ab"
msgid "Attacked Visaka from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 비사카를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "8febb8e4-1afc-4c66-b3e9-bfc159479205"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't need the likes of you here!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너와 같은 녀석이 필요치 않다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5f662cb6-eee0-4209-a653-0fc02bdb9a5c"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3f57c26b-13a0-40f4-8241-df4f0ba77725"
msgid "\"You s-succeeded. Congratulations.\""
msgstr "\"성... 성공했군. 축하한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "de9099ba-0b66-4c42-9618-c955452fe9cd"
msgid ""
"\"You f-failed. You c-couldn't resist spilling blood. A pity. But this is "
"not the last trial.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시... 실패했습니다. 다... 당신은 피를 흘리는 것을 참을 수 없었군요. 안타깝군요. 하지만 이것은 마지막 시험이 아닙니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "34b2ee75-780f-4eef-af14-b78331b57ab4"
msgid ""
"\"F-Find brother Puja the W-Wolf on {g|Talon Peak}T-Talon Peak{/g}. He will "
"tell you what to do next.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Talon Peak}바-발톱 봉우리{/g}에서 느-늑대 푸자 형제를 찾으-십시오. 그는 다음에 해야 할 일을 알려줄 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "d187338b-50f4-4c54-ba30-d063136b2e6f"
msgid ""
"\"I, I... I'm n-n-not adept at talking. Ask my brothers and sisters. They "
"can explain b-better than me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나, 나, 나 나는... 말하기에 익숙하지 않습니다. 형제 자매들에게 물어 보세요. 그들이 나보다 더 자... 잘 설명 할 수 "
"있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "9666edad-112a-45a2-a6b0-7e11abd9aae4"
msgid ""
"\"My teacher named me so. It means 'a branch'. And unicorns are th-those "
"who... W-We know how to rein in monsters because...\" {n}Visaka takes a deep "
"breath.{/n} \"You know, I was once a r-r-real monster. B-But I pacified "
"myself. Now my soul is at p-peace, and I s-share this peace with others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"스승님이 나의 이름을 그렇게 지으셨습니다. 강의 '지류'를 뜻하지요. 그리고 유니콘은... 우... 우리는 괴물들을 어.. 억제하는 "
"것을 알고 있기 때문에...\" {n}비사카는 심호흡을 깊게 쉽니다.{/n} \"알다시피 나는 한 때 진정한 괴, 괴... "
"괴물이었습니다. 하, 하지만 나 자신을 진정시켰지요. 이제 내 영혼은 펴, 평화에 있으며 나, 나는 평화를 다른 사람들과 나누고 있습니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "d12ff553-c561-43b4-b359-57ee6460b177"
msgid "\"S-So long, Your Highness. May there be peace in your heart.\""
msgstr "\"아... 안녕히. 마음 속에 평화가 함께하기를.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "883b1593-12af-4c69-84ce-c2ac8f9d290a"
msgid ""
"{n}Visaka casts a spell, and boundless peace and tranquility descend upon "
"you. Unable to even reach for your weapon, you watch Visaka leave.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}비사카는 주문을 외웠고, 무한한 평화와 평온함이 당신에게 쏟아집니다. 당신은 무기에 손조차 뻗지 못한 채 비사카가 떠나는 모습을 "
"바라봤습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ff67384c-336f-4396-b313-95c4679c1857"
msgid ""
"\"Y-You did great. Didn't shed a drop of blood. Very few could do that.\""
msgstr "\"후, 훌륭합니다. 한 방울의 피도 흘리지 않았습니다. 대부분은 할 수 없었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "887e859b-8931-48b1-9e9d-02e4681c8aff"
msgid ""
"\"Rejected the false and found peace... I could tell a similar story about "
"myself.\""
msgstr "\"거짓을 거절하고 평화를 발견했다... 나에 관해 비슷한 이야기를 할 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaEnd/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "552b415d-335a-40ec-9bb1-f156e550720b"
msgid "\"That's a v-very r-radical way to p-pacify oneself, heh heh!\""
msgstr "\"그것은 자기 자신을 펴, 평온하게 하는 매-매우 서-성급한 방법입니다, 헤 헤!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "9736ec85-bb35-414f-ac47-d8e1bfe56cb3"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "f6206770-cc69-4b17-8812-c4e6dd45f798"
msgid "\"What sort of trial is this?\""
msgstr "\"이건 무슨 시험이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "dd555e32-c525-423b-8392-7b23050880c5"
msgid "\"I'm not going to pass your stupid trials. Get out of my kingdom!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 어리석은 시험을 통과하지 않을 것이다. 꺼져라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Answer_0006_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "65d62522-b015-4925-bc51-21831bdd5851"
msgid "Attacked Visaka from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 비사카를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2c8b8ed5-bdcb-4c94-a5e7-13d9333018bd"
msgid "[Attack] \"How about you tell me – are you ready to die?\""
msgstr "[공격] \"내가 물어보지. 죽을 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "b71c7b32-3b1e-474f-90a1-d3852888787c"
msgid ""
"\"And how do you imagine I'm going to face a whole swarm of monsters without "
"killing any of them?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 어떻게 내가 괴물을 하나도 죽이지 않고 그들을 마주할 것이라고 생각하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "7dee7247-f82e-4792-a01e-609804e0048f"
msgid "\"Let's start the trial.\""
msgstr "\"시험을 시작하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "8317fc40-b480-41a3-b848-b43882bda813"
msgid "\"Wait a bit. I wish to prepare.\""
msgstr "\"잠깐만. 준비가 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2e44e5df-3d5b-48e8-9fd5-c98c3f0badfb"
msgid ""
"{n}A man in a ceremonial robe stands near the temple, surrounded by monsters "
"lying still like little sheep. He greets you with a deep bow. His voice is "
"soft, almost a whisper.{/n} \"Your H-Highness. Are you r-ready for the trial?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}근처 성전의 의식용 로브를 입은 남자가 괴물들에게 둘러싸여 작은 양처럼 누워있습니다. 그는 당신에게 깊은 절을 합니다. 그의 "
"목소리는 부드럽지만 속삭이는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"아, 안녕하세요. 시... 시험을 치룰 준비가 되셨습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "afb72517-3d61-43e0-af50-9dce95c963c0"
msgid ""
"\"I am. Every hour. But not b-by your h-hand.\" {n}Visaka casts a spell and "
"boundless peace and tranquility descend upon you. Unable to even reach for "
"your weapon, you watch Visaka leave with the monsters.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그럼요. 항상이지요. 하, 하지만 다... 당신의 손에 죽지는 않을 겁니다.\" {n}비사카는 주문을 외웠고, 무한한 평화와 평온함이 "
"당신에게 쏟아집니다. 당신은 무기에 손조차 뻗지 못한 채 비사카가 떠나는 모습을 바라봤습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "82f2c26c-3ec9-4167-a414-c1b0b8092ba7"
msgid "\"V-Visaka the Unicorn from the Suramgamin Order.\""
msgstr "\"슈람가민 단체의 유니콘 비, 비사카입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "88cf3217-8e19-42cb-a317-674735ef4e8f"
msgid "\"As you s-say.\""
msgstr "\"다, 당신이 말하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "edb2b998-9e66-4499-be86-ddf1ec86f575"
msgid "\"Shall we b-begin?\""
msgstr "\"시, 시작할까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "4caca5ed-f98d-45b5-afb0-c80bce4e7537"
msgid "\"F-Fine.\""
msgstr "\"조... 좋습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "501be070-0f7d-4309-9bdc-399443e38361"
msgid ""
"\"These c-creatures are lost. I will send them home, to the {g|First World}F-"
"First World{/g}. But f-f-first you will have to show you are capable of "
"holding them back without shedding any blood.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 생물들은 기, 길을 잃어 버렸습니다. 나는 그들을 {g|First World}제, 태초 세계{/g}의 집으로 돌려 보낼 것입니다. "
"그러나 머, 머, 먼저 당신이 피를 흘리지 않고 그들을 붙들 수 있음을 보여 주어야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "c4f8187f-0340-4a59-8a40-4c91f09b723a"
msgid ""
"\"I shall lift the s-spell and commence the r-ritual. While I open the "
"portal, you must defend yourself. But you must not kill. If a single one of "
"these creatures dies, you will not p-pass this trial.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 마, 마법을 해제하고 의식을 시... 시작하겠습니다. 내가 포탈을 여는 동안 당신은 스스로를 보호해야 합니다. 그러나 괴물은 "
"죽지 않아야 합니다. 한 마리가 죽으면 이 시험을 토, 통과하지 못할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "1c141168-0452-479f-bf5f-5c06ae16a7f8"
msgid "\"It's up to you. Such is the nature of your trial.\""
msgstr "\"그것은 당신에게 달린 것입니다. 이 시험의 본질입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/TempleElk_VisakaStart/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "b36be00f-5523-4d5e-8b18-0bd391d96ed2"
msgid "\"Let us b-begin.\""
msgstr "\"시, 시작합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d35618d1-332f-4601-8387-83a97924da13"
msgid "\"What does your name mean?\""
msgstr "\"당신의 이름은 무엇을 의미하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "2aac6036-ddeb-4695-b955-d61e2a68521e"
msgid "\"What does the trial consist of?\""
msgstr "\"시험은 어떻게 이루어져 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "eb156ddb-162e-439b-974f-62855e4749b3"
msgid "\"I am ready to pass the trial.\""
msgstr "\"나는 시험을 통과할 준비가 되어있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "bebe7661-eb3b-499e-8a52-eed6bb707c5c"
msgid "\"I'm sick of your trials. Get out of my kingdom at once!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너희 시험에 질렸다. 내 왕국에서 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0a737c3c-6af4-4b3f-9340-9c424fa3000f"
msgid "Attacked Vidya from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 비드야를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "61fa59f9-d144-43ca-835c-c86c04bc5fa8"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've grown tired of this. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 시험이 질렸다. 죽어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "cd12ceff-4680-4cda-abbf-8d89f878b169"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "3fe9cbfb-36f4-4fbd-ad66-81460369abbe"
msgid "\"Shelyn, Irori, Iomedae, Sarenrae, Erastil, Abadar.\""
msgstr "\"셸린, 이로리, 아이오메데, 서렌레이, 에라스틸, 아바다르.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "3a835440-9b31-4bcc-abba-efac42949059"
msgid "\"Erastil, Pharasma, Shelyn, Cayden Cailean, Desna, Sarenrae.\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸, 파라즈마, 셸린, 케이든 케일리엔, 데스나, 서렌레이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "6f796c0d-6ee5-4ab5-b20d-d95cc2aa19c3"
msgid "\"Shelyn, Irori, Rovagug, Sarenrae, Erastil, Asmodeus.\""
msgstr "\"셸린, 이로리, 로바거그, 서렌레이, 에라스틸, 아스모데우스.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "77ef712e-a2af-4b3e-9de4-6da71426d6a8"
msgid "\"From Jalmeray.\""
msgstr "\"잘메레이에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "8fa63667-7955-407a-926d-65a0ae2b8be9"
msgid "\"From Arthfell Forest.\""
msgstr "\"아스펠 숲에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "3c060f73-6ebf-4b2d-97df-a5ae2eebfc9d"
msgid "\"From Absalom.\""
msgstr "\"압살롬에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "ee60854b-86b2-459b-98fd-f3013cea8943"
msgid "\"The way of the hero.\""
msgstr "\"영웅의 길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "c6468bb2-c72f-4cdf-bffd-348e206e7f95"
msgid "\"The Wise Way.\""
msgstr "\"현명한 길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "95600c6e-e05e-4b8a-ab91-d3ca92791cae"
msgid "\"It's impossible to translate into Common.\""
msgstr "\"공용어로 번역하는 것은 불가능하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "1c32ed66-27da-4634-8371-258a783f3c3a"
msgid "\"The Ways of the Phoenix, Unicorn, Wolf and Lion.\""
msgstr "\"불사조, 유니콘, 늑대, 사자의 길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "7be21296-c8de-4fec-a5e1-cd0e6d7ee5b5"
msgid "\"The Ways of the Phoenix, Unicorn, Wolf, Lion, and Chameleon.\""
msgstr "\"불사조, 유니콘, 늑대, 사자, 카멜레온의 길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "e7183b89-33ab-4a57-9009-28acb1c79b64"
msgid "\"The Ways of the Phoenix, Unicorn, Wolf, Lion and Dragon.\""
msgstr "\"불사조, 유니콘, 늑대, 사자, 드래곤의 길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "064538ba-f119-4d1e-8725-79ff67959117"
msgid "\"In Jalmeray.\""
msgstr "\"잘메레이에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "32d5f410-3d4b-47d0-9b29-286834ef25a2"
msgid "\"In Arthfell Forest.\""
msgstr "\"아스펠 숲에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "be72bd25-e677-41a6-9545-643dc148c7ec"
msgid "\"In Narlmarches.\""
msgstr "\"날마치에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "22ab381b-cbd9-4e08-a5c0-214da5f25265"
msgid "\"Set off on a crusade.\""
msgstr "\"십자군 운동을 하였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "25f6c559-6fb0-4a31-b93f-bcc677ffdaae"
msgid "\"Organized debates about faith.\""
msgstr "\"믿음에 관해 논쟁을 준비했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "3bd473d2-7eb0-4ff1-acef-2cab59d62823"
msgid "\"Put his teachings in a book.\""
msgstr "\"그의 가르침을 책에 담았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "134dc4e6-6b64-4ebb-9bf9-a86795fcb63d"
msgid "\"In Arthfell Forest.\""
msgstr "\"아스펠 숲에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "0a1e74ce-2de8-423d-a61b-4a679fe10888"
msgid "\"In Absalom.\""
msgstr "\"압살롬에서.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "ca3615bc-0c6b-41ca-8aca-182a7dcea11d"
msgid "\"Nowhere.\""
msgstr "\"아무 곳도 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0059_Text
msgctxt "0aee096e-4821-4fcb-8b9e-8e5e0fa2da1d"
msgid "\"Where can I learn more about your order?\""
msgstr "\"너희 단체 대해 더 자세히 알 수 있는 곳은 어디지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0066_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f685bdc9-6a34-41cb-95d6-7ae0a36d191a"
msgid "Attacked Vidya from the Suramgamin order."
msgstr "슈람가민 단체의 비드야를 공격했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "820d010a-31d2-48b4-b165-81e98bf36044"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm sick of your stupid questions!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너희 시험에 질렸다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0067_Text
msgctxt "04654a1a-b338-48bd-80c9-abc28df205c6"
msgid "\"The Wise Way.\""
msgstr "\"현명한 길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0068_Text
msgctxt "df039a06-b9e5-4c47-bad9-999ad3b26136"
msgid "\"The Pacifying Fist.\""
msgstr "\"폭력의 평정.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0069_Text
msgctxt "46f1c27b-3831-47f7-92d4-adbe5e69d275"
msgid "\"There are none.\""
msgstr "\"없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "85a7f455-1ce3-45c5-9f9f-1a1880a943f7"
msgid "\"Eliminate villains.\""
msgstr "\"악당을 제거하는 것.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0071_Text
msgctxt "712bf09d-3394-47e0-ba79-08e52fd2583c"
msgid "\"Become more powerful.\""
msgstr "\"더 강해지는 것.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Answer_0072_Text
msgctxt "79b75f3f-2229-4e7a-93ab-64bb50457874"
msgid "\"Make the world a better place.\""
msgstr "\"세상을 더 좋은 곳으로 만드는것.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "a1c3c354-ab94-480f-8c94-747346ba52e9"
msgid ""
"\"Hello, Your Highness. I am Vidya the Lion. Are you ready for your final "
"trial?\""
msgstr "\"안녕한가. 나는 사자 비드야다. 최종 시험을 치를 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "b5c14ade-246d-44d3-855c-b0def354708f"
msgid "\"Hello, Your Highness. Are you ready for your final trial?\""
msgstr "\"안녕한가. 최종 시험을 치를 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "e05abba0-0217-4754-ad82-8a5dd8325d13"
msgid ""
"\"I haven't always had that name. The teacher gave it to me, it means "
"'knowing the truth'. I follow the Lion's Way – it is the way of preaching. I "
"came to understand the teachings of the Wise Way, and learned to declare "
"them loud and clear – like a lion's roar.\""
msgstr ""
"\"항상 그 이름을 지닌 것은 아니다. 스승이 내게 주었다. 그것은 '진리를 아는 것'을 의미한다. 나는 사자의 길을 따른다. 그것은 "
"설교의 길이다. 나는 현명한 길의 가르침을 이해하게 되었고 사자의 포효 소리처럼 그들에게 크고 분명하게 선언하는 법을 배웠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "a3552261-3855-46f8-aafd-7210e3540d82"
msgid "\"As you wish, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "49b5936d-88ee-450d-b6f3-1fb2352ed48f"
msgid ""
"\"You are making a mistake. But so be it.\" {n}Vidya casts a spell and "
"boundless peace and tranquility descend upon you. You watch Vidya leave, "
"unable to even reach for your weapon.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"너는 실수를 저지르고 있다. 하지만 비난하지는 않겠다.\" {n}비드야는 주문을 외웠고, 무한한 평화와 평온함이 당신에게 쏟아집니다. "
"당신은 무기에 손조차 뻗지 못한 채 비드야가 떠나는 모습을 바라봤습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "3abf04bf-9fb9-4d44-8a47-af6a6480b7e5"
msgid "\"May the trial commence. Happy are those who have learned the truth!\""
msgstr "\"시험이 시작될 것이다. 진실을 알게 된 사람들은 행복하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "f9d7f000-3489-46cf-813b-2f11b4219ae2"
msgid ""
"\"My trial is the trial of truth. I will ask you three questions about the "
"Suramgamin Order, to test how much you've learned of us. If you are unsure "
"in your knowledge, do not hasten to commence this trial. First try to learn "
"more about us!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 시험은 진리의 시험이다. 나는 네가 우리에게서 얼마나 많이 배웠는지 시험해보기 위해 슈람가민 단체에 관해 세 가지 질문을 할 "
"것이다. 지식이 확실하지 않다면 시험을 시작하기 위해 서두르지 말기 바란다. 우리에 대해 더 자세히 알아보길 바란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6e0630a3-d223-4281-9056-9402a5d454db"
msgid "\"I will wait for you here.\""
msgstr "\"나는 여기에서 기다릴 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "cfc26878-a146-492d-8111-e7299693f0ab"
msgid "\"Here is my first question.\""
msgstr "\"나의 첫 번째 질문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "69f18ea4-3143-4d1a-acf0-e629ccc5d78b"
msgid "\"Here is my second question.\""
msgstr "\"나의 두 번째 질문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "69d9439e-8a5a-43f3-acb1-84d87408add4"
msgid "\"Here is my final question.\""
msgstr "\"나의 세 번째 질문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "305a34cd-3242-4008-aa5e-6ddac620c17b"
msgid "\"Which gods does our order venerate?\""
msgstr "\"우리 단체가 존경하는 신들은 누군가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "7b593e44-6850-4d90-a7dc-2f8546de2450"
msgid "\"Where did our teacher come from?\""
msgstr "\"우리의 스승은 어디에서 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "35730714-b197-4f0e-bfdc-3f771401844c"
msgid "\"What does the name of our order mean?\""
msgstr "\"우리 단체의 이름은 무엇을 의미하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "510d16bf-d7ab-49e8-a479-7ae2f0a85475"
msgid "\"What paths to achieving a master's title are there in our order?\""
msgstr "\"우리 단체에서 선생의 칭호를 달성하기위한 길은 무엇이 있는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "ab15ddf5-68f6-4e22-9ccf-faa703dc7547"
msgid "\"Where did teacher Avalo meditate as he learned the truth?\""
msgstr "\"아발로 스승이 진실을 알기 위해 어디에서 명상했는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "5483f790-77f9-41f7-b605-30c302c4bdce"
msgid "\"What did teacher Avalo do when he learned the truth?\""
msgstr "\"아발로 선생은 진실을 알았을 때 무엇을 했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "62accc70-79f0-4397-b025-b567fc6e9241"
msgid "\"Where is the main temple of our order?\""
msgstr "\"우리 단체의 성전은 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "8033d6f6-126f-44f5-8be0-7e025ee65527"
msgid ""
"\"What is the name of a martial art that members of our order are taught?\""
msgstr "\"우리 단체 구성원들이 가르치는 무술의 이름은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "156a8e49-9529-4eca-b0cf-462c16d81c12"
msgid "\"What does it mean to go the Way of the Hero?\""
msgstr "\"영웅의 길을 간다는 것은 무엇을 의미하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "ea1db5bd-ae1f-467a-bb1d-269d935d98fd"
msgid "\"Well, Your Highness, you have answered all the questions.\""
msgstr "\"너는 모든 질문에 답했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "7db51d72-0a5b-4950-8748-7ee8f141c336"
msgid ""
"\"In the same place you would go looking for knowledge about anything – in "
"books! What I will ask you is no secret. I'm sure you can easily find books "
"about us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 어떤 것에 대한 지식을 찾을 때 향하는 곳과 같다 – 바로 책이다! 내가 묻는 것은 비밀이 아니다. 너는 우리에 관한 책을 쉽게 "
"찾을 수 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "46606775-e3e0-4968-bf4c-27a74c59b03b"
msgid ""
"\"You learned so much about our order. I am glad: knowledge is the first "
"step to understanding, and understanding opens the path to enlightenment.'"
msgstr "\"너는 우리 단체에 대해 많은 것을 배웠다. 지식은 이해의 첫 걸음이며 이해는 계몽의 길을 열어준다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "ef5e8ac8-b684-4c1b-b5a5-2406b45a9d29"
msgid ""
"\"Unfortunately you have learned far less about us than we've learned about "
"you... But do not despair: a single trial does not tip the balance.\""
msgstr ""
"\"불행히도 우리가 너에 관해 배운 것보다 너는 훨씬 덜 배웠다. 그러나 절망하지 말아라. 한 번의 시험 만이 결과에 영향을 미치지 "
"않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "3e38ea76-101e-49c4-95ba-ddc1323d8bfe"
msgid "\"Correct. We offer our prayers to gods of good and order.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다. 우리는 선과 질서의 신들에게 기도를 드린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "176d5d5b-c04d-44d2-b6b4-c3404a166576"
msgid ""
"\"Close, but not exactly. {g|Cayden Cailean}Cayden Cailean{/g} and "
"{g|Desna}Desna{/g} are kind gods, but their deeds are marred with chaos. "
"Pharasma is indifferent to good or evil, and takes a different path from us. "
"And you forgot to mention {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} and Irori.\""
msgstr ""
"\"비슷하지만 정확히는 아니다. {g|Cayden Cailean}케이든 케일리엔{/g}과 {g|Desna}데즈나{/g}는 친절한 신이지만 "
"그들의 행위는 혼란으로 훼손된다. 파라즈마는 선과 악에 무관심하며 우리와 다른 길을 걷는다. 그리고 너는 {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}"
", 이로리를 언급하는 것을 잊었다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "3c9062cf-e2e5-4701-a21d-073a164bca75"
msgid ""
"\"What? {g|Asmodeus}Asmodeus{/g}? {g|Rovagug}Rovagug{/g}? Your Highness, who "
"do you take us for? No one in our order venerates evil!\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐라고? {g|Asmodeus}아스모데우스{/g}? {g|Rovagug}로바거그{/g}? 도대체 무슨 얘기를 하는 거지? 우리의 단체 "
"중 아무도 악을 숭배하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "d283c1d0-f69b-4238-9009-452d8db58aae"
msgid "\"Correct. That is exactly where he came from to these lands.\""
msgstr "\"맞다. 정확히 그가 그곳에서 이 땅으로 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0074_Text
msgctxt "f37d263f-a262-4bed-8732-6f2c225b8585"
msgid ""
"\"No, he meditated in Arthfell Forest while searching for the truth. "
"Initially he hailed from {g|Jalmeray}Jalmeray{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니다. 그는 진실을 찾고 있는 동안 그는 아스펠 숲에서 명상을 했다. 그는 {g|Jalmeray}잘메레이{/g} 출신이었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0075_Text
msgctxt "24880704-1724-4b8b-a4bb-214b310b6bdf"
msgid ""
"\"No, his homeland is much farther. He came from {g|Jalmeray}Jalmeray{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 그의 조국은 훨씬 멀다. 그는 {g|Jalmeray}잘메레이{/g}에서 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0076_Text
msgctxt "e71725b8-ed61-4e0e-8744-cd255908d83f"
msgid "\"This is true.\""
msgstr "\"사실이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0077_Text
msgctxt "53c0b7a8-5d59-4a2e-b84e-3e59eb6a4236"
msgid ""
"\"No, the Wise Way is a philosophy our order teaches. The name of the order "
"means 'the way of the hero'.\""
msgstr "\"아니다. 현명한 길은 우리 단체가 가르치는 철학이다. 단체의 이름은 '영웅의 길'을 의미한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0078_Text
msgctxt "0f306770-270a-4468-8b93-931716c0103a"
msgid ""
"\"The exact translation might actually be impossible. But it's usually "
"translated as 'the Way of the Hero'.\""
msgstr "\"정확한 번역은 실제로 불가능할 수도 있다. 하지만 일반적으로 '영웅의 길'로 번역된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0079_Text
msgctxt "0bf2bc8e-c6fd-49d2-99d9-9dcd6af180b1"
msgid ""
"\"Very true, but you forgot to mention the Way of the Chameleon. It's an "
"easy mistake: the chameleon's way lies in shadow and silence, away from "
"watchful eyes.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이다. 하지만 카멜레온의 길을 언급하는 것을 잊었다. 쉬운 실수이다. 카멜레온의 길은 침묵과 그림자에 놓여 감시의 눈을 피한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0080_Text
msgctxt "c2be8042-0d66-4c6f-93ac-7b41eabf9c93"
msgid ""
"\"I see you are knowledgeable... Yes, Chameleon masters are not as "
"noticeable, but are no less important than the others.\""
msgstr "\"네가 지식이 있다고 생각한다. 그렇다. 카멜레온 선생은 눈에 띄지 않지만 다른이들 만큼 중요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0081_Text
msgctxt "c551cc98-5bff-4025-b989-681642bcea66"
msgid ""
"\"There is no Way of the Dragon in our order. But there is one you forgot – "
"or perhaps didn't know – the Way of the Chameleon.\""
msgstr "\"우리 단체에 드래곤의 길은 없다. 네가 잊어버린 길은 아마도 몰랐겠지만 카멜레온의 길이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0082_Text
msgctxt "d9562672-6700-47b9-ab5d-59066e7c1ac4"
msgid ""
"\"No, though he was born there. But to seek out the truth, he went to "
"Arthfell Forest – where he still lives to this day.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 그는 그곳에서 태어났다. 하지만 진실을 찾으러 그는 아스펠 숲에 갔고 지금도 살고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0083_Text
msgctxt "a5d4761c-bea3-4c1a-a4aa-aef43b48308c"
msgid "\"Correct. He still lives there, surrounded by his disciples.\""
msgstr "\"맞다. 그는 아직도 제자들에 둘러싸여 살고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0084_Text
msgctxt "710665cd-722d-4cc4-9b4b-6eef6f0a70e6"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Narlmarches}Narlmarches{/g}? Oh no. He meditated in Arthfell Forest."
"\""
msgstr "\"{g|Narlmarches}날마치{/g}라고? 절대 아니다. 그는 아스펠 숲에서 명상을 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0085_Text
msgctxt "0bce56f5-0d93-4a14-a468-73b645b7b004"
msgid ""
"\"Of course not. Teacher Avalo preaches non-violence – how could he set "
"forth to fight? He organized debates about faith.\""
msgstr "\"물론 아니다. 아발로 스승은 비폭력을 설교한다. 어떻게 싸울 준비를 하겠나? 그는 믿음에 관한 토론을 조직했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0086_Text
msgctxt "3fac5323-2ffb-46aa-867c-d107a9802693"
msgid ""
"\"Correct. Many traveled there to prove his words wrong... only to become "
"his followers.\""
msgstr "\"맞다. 많은 사람들이 그의 말이 틀렸다는 것을 증명하기 위해 거기로 여행했다... 하지만 모두 그의 추종자가 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0087_Text
msgctxt "af640cae-c452-4933-8ef9-b28b59acbee6"
msgid ""
"\"Oh no. The revelations of teacher Avalo are recorded in many books, but "
"never by he himself. He organized debates about faith with major religious "
"leaders.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니다. 아발로 스승의 계시는 많은 책에 기록되어 있지만 그가 쓴 책은 없다. 그는 종교 지도자들과의 믿음에 관한 논쟁을 준비했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0088_Text
msgctxt "3f59d4d9-004a-44ca-b684-507f0f165358"
msgid ""
"\"No. The teacher lives there, with a community of disciples – but our order "
"has no temples.\""
msgstr "\"아니다. 스승은 제자 공동체가 있는 곳에서 산다. 우리 단체는 성전이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0089_Text
msgctxt "c8114311-583f-4a2c-b2bc-fa56648e39e4"
msgid "\"No. Our order does not build temples.\""
msgstr "\"아니다. 우리 단체는 성전을 짓지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0090_Text
msgctxt "666367ad-7b5a-4509-910e-cbb75d63afa7"
msgid ""
"\"Correct. We don't build temples, and each of us is free to venerate the "
"gods as they see fit. What's important is to follow the Wise Way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞다. 우리는 성전을 짓지 않으며 우리 각자는 자유롭게 믿고 싶은 신을 숭배 할 수 있다. 중요한 것은 현명한 길을 따라 가야한다는 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0091_Text
msgctxt "98068eb5-1e5b-4ed6-9e0b-f4b25d976fc0"
msgid ""
"\"Incorrect. The Wise Way is not a fighting style, but a dedication to "
"complete non-violence. We do not teach any martial arts.\""
msgstr "\"옳지 않다. 현명한 길은 싸우지 않고 비폭력을 완성하기 위한 헌신이다. 우리는 어떤 무술도 가르치지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0092_Text
msgctxt "5fe608d2-11b3-42b0-b1ec-ee7c0d6418c1"
msgid ""
"\"A fist cannot pacify, just as a sword cannot heal, nor the executioner's "
"axe revive. Our core principle is non-violence. We do not teach any martial "
"arts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"검이 치유 할 수 없고 집행자의 도끼도 죽은자를 되살릴 수 없듯 폭력은 화를 부른다. 우리의 핵심 원칙은 비폭력이며 우리는 무술을 "
"가르치지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0093_Text
msgctxt "7b7f014f-47d5-4a3a-ae6a-75ce3d6a13a4"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed. Our main principle is non-violence. We teach no martial arts.\""
msgstr "\"맞다. 우리의 주된 원칙은 비폭력이며 무술을 가르치지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0094_Text
msgctxt "d62529fd-09ca-4864-8b09-b301fa2c88a3"
msgid ""
"\"He who kills villains only increases their number. No, we call a hero not "
"the one who sheds blood, but the one who makes the world a better place.\""
msgstr ""
"\"악당을 죽이는 사람은 사망자의 수를 늘릴 뿐이다. 우리는 피를 흘리는 자가 아니라 세상을 더 나은 곳으로 만드는 자를 영웅이라고 "
"칭한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0095_Text
msgctxt "a8fc7a41-43c1-47ce-a37f-f4e7b0a4f252"
msgid ""
"\"What is power worth, if it's not applied to a good cause? No, we call a "
"hero one who makes the world a better place.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 일이 생기지 않는다면 힘이 무슨 소용인가? 우리는 세상을 더 나은 곳으로 만드는 자를 영웅이라고 부른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0096_Text
msgctxt "1443fe7b-8b7c-497b-98dd-c436c08e5a5d"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed. We call a hero any one, no matter how weak or strong, who brings "
"even a small measure of good and order to this world.\""
msgstr "\"맞다. 우리는 약하고 강함에 상관 없이, 세상에 선과 질서를 조금이라도 가져다 주는 자를 영웅이라 부른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0097_Text
msgctxt "5303cb75-54e5-44db-ab22-67a6660d6700"
msgid ""
"\"With your permission I shall withdraw. I must to confer with my brothers "
"and sisters. We shall assemble not far from here. Find us to hear our "
"verdict.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 허가함과 함께 철수하겠다. 나는 형제 자매들과 상의해야 한다. 우리는 여기에서 멀지 않은 곳에 모일 것이다. 우리의 평결을 "
"들으려면 우리를 찾길 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0100_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "cb1772ea-0a16-4d7d-9ecf-28a82992f76c"
msgid "\"Ah, so it all ended with a boring theology exam. Not surprising.\""
msgstr "\"아. 모두 지루한 신학 시험으로 끝났군. 놀랍지도 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/SecretsOfSuramgamin/Vidya/Cue_0101_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "2402c408-a4d8-4ad5-80fa-dce825fc49da"
msgid ""
"\"I think it'll be exciting! Everything's so symbolic — lions, unicorns... "
"and the {mf|king|queen} wisely giving one correct answer after another!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 흥미로울 것이라고 생각해! 모든 것이 상징적이야. 사자, 유니콘... 그리고 {mf|왕|여왕}은 현명하게 올바른 답을 타인에게 "
"전하는 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d8f01a7a-77b7-49bb-9de0-64127e9ef198"
msgid "\"Get what for you?\""
msgstr "\"뭐가 필요하다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e96c7126-1941-48dd-bf1d-341d2ccada4e"
msgid "\"Tell me what you want from me.\""
msgstr "\"나한테 원하는게 뭐야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "ffc011ed-c615-4ced-88b0-abc86e8ac80c"
msgid "\"I'll get you the First Crown.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 첫 번째 왕관을 가져다 주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "859132b3-b770-417a-9d97-2de6b7eca54b"
msgid "\"What's the First Crown?\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "74fdd356-c7d6-4236-adf3-116723cada4d"
msgid "\"Where can I find it?\""
msgstr "\"어디서 찾을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "d713f80d-c842-4c41-a30c-a579c5280b26"
msgid "\"What's in it for me?\""
msgstr "\"그게 뭐지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "29504fe0-dcc0-4b7d-aa8f-3ec68cc93790"
msgid "\"Why do you want it?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그걸 원하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "c767fab5-f04b-42e8-b160-c40ca3ef1b59"
msgid "\"I'll do it.\""
msgstr "\"내가 하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "fb3b1958-ea71-4716-85f9-c83de92d8755"
msgid "\"I've got more important things to do.\""
msgstr "\"나는 더 중요한 일이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "1b9c8ada-bce2-4357-aa78-940d3df9a46d"
msgid "\"Enough about that for now.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 그 정도면 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "f798d232-0305-4745-adf0-ca49e1d372fa"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "17f10f36-4789-483c-829b-2965075e8c2f"
msgid "\"Why does your face shift like that?\""
msgstr "\"왜 얼굴이 그렇게 바뀌는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "3f2fb53f-7855-40e1-8f79-5c91b1836d9d"
msgid "\"What does an Eldest want with me?\""
msgstr "\"원로가 나에게 무엇을 원하는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "2528a1f2-5f78-427e-b095-90c230d696de"
msgid "\"Does Nyrissa know you're here?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 네가 여기 있다는 것을 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "b9efafc6-360d-41a3-80bf-beefc36f5c0d"
msgid "\"A pleasure to meet you.\""
msgstr "\"만나서 반갑다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "5deb5365-d1a1-45fd-9e3c-55bcb2447a7a"
msgid "\"Who are those two?\""
msgstr "\"그 둘은 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "c69964b1-57b8-47f0-bfe2-b5dc8a4f5abb"
msgid "\"Who are the Knurly Witch and the Wriggling Man again?\""
msgstr "\"옹이 마녀와 꿈틀거리는 남자가 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "7e2cba08-b535-4907-be86-3bbb86d2cfd7"
msgid "\"Why do they hate each other?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그들은 서로를 싫어하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "49121f9b-52be-482f-bd38-bb0420d6f9e3"
msgid "\"What's the First Crown?\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "bdadb2fa-77b7-46af-833b-140c287dd259"
msgid "\"Did you say he's made of worms?!\""
msgstr "\"그가 벌레로 이루어졌다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "6ba467b6-140c-469b-be97-e8b03a88d573"
msgid "\"I see.\""
msgstr "\"알겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "635e9376-e446-42ff-b3e2-76065883b10f"
msgid "[Attack] \"Here's what I've got for you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"여기 내가 너를 위해 준비한 것이 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "2674cecd-aeaf-4f21-b7a5-355753f47185"
msgid "\"I think we're done here.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 용무가 끝난 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "da63db35-65b1-4b6f-bce7-c9dca4d04758"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't the first time we meet, but I'm still curious — who are you?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 처음 만나는 것은 아니지만 나는 여전히 궁금하군. 너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8a91b699-5018-4992-ac49-cb8acb88a507"
msgid ""
"{n}The figure before you wears gray robes, yet the body beneath them "
"flickers, changing age, gender, and race—one moment an ancient elven man, "
"the next a young human woman, then a tattooed dwarf, and so on. They raise "
"an eyebrow.{/n} \"Well? Did you get it for us?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 회색 로브를 입기 전에 그 형체의 몸 아래는 깜박 거리고 나이, 성별, 인종이 바뀝니다. 한 번은 고대 엘프 남자였다가 "
"다음은 젊은 인간 여자 그리고는 문신을 한 드워프로 바뀝니다. 그들은 의아해 합니다.{/n} \"흠? 우리를 위해 준비했다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "1edf74cc-76c7-4681-a817-b16fc9e5aafc"
msgid "\"Well? Did you get it for us?\""
msgstr "\"흠? 우리를 위해 준비했다고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "8884cbc6-3c07-4cf6-a871-da52e6da1da0"
msgid ""
"\"...oh, that's right. You don't know about that yet, do you? Honestly, we "
"don't know how you people can handle only moving one way through time. But "
"that's beside the point. We need you to retrieve the First Crown for us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 오. 그렇군. 너는 아직 그것에 대해 모르는군? 우리는 사실 너희 사람들이 시간의 한 방향으로 움직이는 방법을 모르겠다. "
"하지만 요점에서 벗어났군. 우리를 위해 첫 번째 왕관을 가져와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "8825d4f9-2664-4ac9-8f3d-b8984ec791f6"
msgid "\"Excellent. We'll be here when you return.\""
msgstr "\"좋다. 네가 돌아올 때 우리는 여기 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "b73a979b-76b9-4c95-8573-b530dbbf4f67"
msgid "{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} shrugs.{/n} \"'Now' is a matter of perspective.\""
msgstr "{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"'지금'은 관점의 문제야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "c89fe8a8-b7bd-4283-bec8-ecc1a3b7470c"
msgid ""
"\"A magical bauble—the enchanted crown of the first king whose kingdom "
"Nyrissa destroyed. She gave it to the Knurly Witch as a token of her regard, "
"but now that the Wriggling Man is the nymph's current favorite, he feels it "
"rightfully belongs to him. They've been fighting over it for weeks.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마법의 보석이다 — 나이리사가 파괴한 왕국의 첫 번째 왕의 마법 왕관이지. 그녀는 옹이 마녀에게 그것을 존경의 표식으로 주었지만, "
"이제는 꿈틀거리는 남자가 그 님프의 사랑을 독차지 했고, 보석이 자신의 것이라 생각하고 있다. 그들은 몇 주 동안 그것을 두고 싸우고 "
"있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "0755fa1d-0d6c-44c8-91c2-b2d456be249d"
msgid ""
"\"In the course of their fighting, the Knurly Witch and Wriggling Man "
"accidentally broke the crown into three pieces, the magical backlash "
"teleporting each piece somewhere within this forest. If we knew exactly "
"where, we wouldn't need you to search for them, would we?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들이 싸우는 과정에서 옹이 마녀와 꿈틀거리는 남자는 실수로 왕관을 세조각으로 부쉈고, 마법의 반발로 인해 조각들이 숲의 어딘가로 "
"순간 이동했다. 우리가 정확한 위치를 알았다면, 우리가 너에게 찾아달라 할 필요도 없었을 테지, 안그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "f1f7c572-897b-43b3-a977-0ffbee879a93"
msgid ""
"\"You're after the self-styled nymph queen, yes? While we won't punish her "
"directly, Nyrissa's recent overreach annoys me. Bring us the crown, and we "
"promise you an easier time overthrowing her.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 자칭 님프의 여왕이라 칭하는 자의 하수인이지? 우리가 그녀를 직접 처벌하지는 않겠지만 나이리사의 최근 과도한 관심은 나를 귀찮게 "
"한다. 우리에게 왕관을 가져오면 그녀를 쉽게 이기도록 도와주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "6025085c-2a14-4e49-84ba-1d801d635db6"
msgid ""
"\"A good rule for surviving the {g|First World}First World{/g} is to never "
"ask a fey lord 'why.' Honestly, most mortals are overjoyed to get a divine "
"quest! Let's just say that the crown has the potential to make significant "
"ripples in this timeline, and we'd like to guide them in a positive "
"direction. We could get it ourselves, of course, but there are...\"{n} "
"{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} waves vaguely. {/n}\"...politics.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 생존을 위한 좋은 규칙은 페이 군주에게 토를 달지 않는 것이다. 대부분의 필멸자들은 "
"신성한 임무를 얻게되어 기뻐했다! 왕관이 시간의 흐름에 상당한 파문을 일으킬 잠재력이 있다고 치자, 그러면 우리는 그것을 긍정적인 "
"방향으로 쓰고자 한다. 물론 우리가 스스로 얻을 수 있지만 거기에는...\" {n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 어렴풋이 "
"가리킵니다.{/n} \"...정치 문제가 엮여있지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "241d07b0-22b5-4669-86eb-5947262a2561"
msgid ""
"\"My, you're the bold one, aren't you? Our form changes because there have "
"been many {g|Shyka}Shykas{/g}, and will be many more. Long ago, we decided "
"to live interspersed rather than sequentially, so that we could each "
"experience all of eternity. It's far more interesting that way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 강한 존재이지? {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}의 존재는 많기에 모습이 변하고 더 많은 존재가 만들어질 것이다. 오래 전에 우리는 "
"순차적으로 존재하기 보다 산재하여 살기로 결심했고 우리 모두 불멸이 되었다. 매우 흥미롭지 않은가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "32cca72d-a5a2-43a8-bb24-611201022936"
msgid ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} gives you a dubious look.{/n} \"Of course you do. "
"After all, why listen to us? We've only seen all of your future timelines.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g} 당신에게 모호한 표정을 짓습니다.{/n} \"물론 너는 그래야 한다. 결국 왜 우리의 말을 들어야 "
"할까? 우리는 미래에 펼쳐질 모든 가능성을 보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "46a34c41-9942-487e-88c6-12bf2a0b2e36"
msgid ""
"\"Our name is {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}, though some call us the Many. We are of "
"the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} — the fey gods of the {g|First World}First World{/g}"
". We embody that which you think of as time, entropy, and reincarnation.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리의 이름은 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}이고 어떤 사람들은 우리를 다수라고 부른다. 우리는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}다. 즉, "
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 페이 신이지. 우리는 네가 시간, 미래의 예측불가능성, 환생이라고 생각하는 것을 실현한다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "67c4d9b3-de06-4e20-9c90-18cbcbf94bdf"
msgid "\"We assure you, the pleasure is ours.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너를 보았고 즐거움은 우리 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "f0d6ee2f-a067-49cd-addc-8a75132fb29c"
msgid ""
"\"What does every god want, child? Quick and obedient service, with a "
"minimum of annoying questions. You mortals often leave something to be "
"desired in that respect, but we hope you'll prove us wrong.\""
msgstr ""
"\"신들이 무엇을 원하는지 아느냐? 성가신 질문은 되도록 하지 않으면서 빠르고 순종적으로 움직이는 것이지. 너희 필멸자는 그런 행동이 "
"존중에서 우러나온다고 생각하는데 너희가 맞기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "0459bd0a-08b9-4c7a-8fac-67c6ecb0252f"
msgid ""
"\"No. And trust us when we say that you'll find it better for all involved "
"if you keep it that way.\""
msgstr "\"아니다. 네가 그렇게 한다면 더 나은 방식을 발견할 것이라는 우리의 말을 믿어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "555ece52-17d9-44f9-83d1-cef17de48c61"
msgid ""
"\"The Knurly Witch and the Wriggling Man are Nyrissa's chief advisors. The "
"witch is a priestess of the hag goddess, twisting plants to her whim. The "
"Wriggling Man was a mortal wizard who sought undeath as a swarm of grave "
"worms. They're Nyrissa's most powerful allies, and they absolutely despise "
"each other. Recently they've been battling over the First Crown.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옹이 마녀와 꿈틀거리는 남자는 나이리사의 수석 보좌관들이다. 마녀는 입맛에 맞게 첩자를 조종하는 해그 여신의 여사제이다. 꿈틀거리는 "
"남자는 불멸을 추구하던 필멸자 마법사였지만 무덤 벌레떼가 되었다. 그들은 나이리사의 가장 강력한 동료이고 서로 앙숙지간이다. 최근에 "
"그들은 첫 번째 왕관을 두고 싸우고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "693af5c3-6cf3-4382-aa70-2456c50816c4"
msgid ""
"\"You do? What a bold statement. We're the god of time, and even we don't "
"see everything.\""
msgstr "\"그런가? 대담하구나. 우리는 시간의 신이지만 모든 미래를 보지는 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "0da7d671-0da5-4702-87d9-a458ddf91c09"
msgid ""
"\"A creature like Nyrissa has no true friends, but she rewards her allies "
"well. Both the Knurly Witch and the Wriggling Man seek to be her right hand, "
"ruling her so-called kingdom by her side. Neither of them are the sharing "
"sort.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사와 같은 괴물은 진정한 친구가 없지만 그녀는 동맹에게 후하게 보상한다. 옹이 마녀와 꿈틀거리는 남자는 그녀의 수족과 같은 "
"존재로 그녀가 왕국이라 부르는 것들을 지배한다. 그 둘은 배타적이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "30abf36c-d0ac-41c0-8be4-91e2c6c4527e"
msgid ""
"\"It's amazing the lengths you mortals will go to avoid death. Honestly, the "
"whole mortality business seems like a hassle—we're glad the {g|First World}"
"First World{/g} doesn't bother.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 필멸자가 죽음을 피하기 위해 갈 길이 놀랍다. 솔직히 필멸자의 일은 번거롭다. 우리는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}"
"가 성가시지 않아서 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "227d1e5f-c768-4088-a2a0-82ecccbbcfcf"
msgid "\"We'll meet again. Or rather, we already have.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 다시 만날 것이다. 아니면 이미 만났을지도 모르지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "21df51c9-3e58-4237-aed5-5d05b2a89b76"
msgid ""
"{n}You suddenly find that you've lost all desire to fight. {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}"
" gives you a patronizing smile.{/n} \"Nyrissa is one thing, but we really "
"wouldn't advise going around attacking actual {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. It's bad "
"for your health.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 갑자기 전의를 잃어버린 것을 알게 됩니다. {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 당신에게 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"나이리사는 "
"하나의 존재이지만 우리는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}를 공격하는 것을 추천하지 않는다. 네 명줄이 짧아질 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "4036f7cc-6993-487b-96e6-daa8042cfeab"
msgid "\"Think on my words. We'll meet again. Or rather, we already have.\""
msgstr "\"내 말을 생각해 보거라. 우리는 다시 만날 것이다. 아니면 이미 만났을지도 모르지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "f5e148ef-ae62-4130-b12a-639718139959"
msgid "\"Won't you even listen to what I have to say?\""
msgstr "\"내가 하는 말을 듣지 않았는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "e4ee9811-d84b-451a-983e-5e7eb37d4e6f"
msgid ""
"\"Our grand old friends, and their grand old habit of speaking in riddles!\""
msgstr "\"그 나이 많은 친구들은 수수께끼를 좋아하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "b53f5757-a1a9-4f93-b7d5-3f67d3e6b857"
msgid ""
"\"Isn't it always the way... 'Go do this job for us while we just chill out "
"here.' Fine, many-snoots! Been there, done that.\""
msgstr "\"항상 같지는 않다... '우리가 여기서 기다리는 동안 이 일을 해라.' 거만한 녀석이 많군. 거만을 떨었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "c9268e4e-9542-4182-87b8-8829750f22c9"
msgid ""
"\"More games of the gods and those who fancy themselves gods. So tiresome.\""
msgstr "\"자신을 신이라 칭하는 자들의 게임이지. 아주 성가시다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "e772aec9-3b1f-4a17-8a3f-6459bde1f6fd"
msgid ""
"\"What is there to be glad of? The creatures of the {g|First World}First "
"World{/g} enjoy their delusions of immortality, but even they are powerless "
"to change the world's final destination. One day, every path will finish, "
"every thread will be cut, and every life will find its end!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전혀 흥미로운 것이 없다. {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}의 생물은 불멸의 망상을 즐기지만 그들은 세계의 최종 목적지를 "
"바꾸지 못한다. 언젠가 모든 길은 끝날 것이고 모든 실이 끊어져 모든 삶은 끝날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/ShykaGivesQuest/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Linzi_Companion
msgctxt "83e78ecc-cfff-42aa-8e74-05adf086facf"
msgid ""
"\"That was fun! I was even hoping for an encore! Why can't it always be like "
"that — our enemies fight each other, and we get to watch them and clap?\""
msgstr ""
"\"재미있구나! 또 다시 보고 싶을 정도다. 언제나 그렇게 될 수는 없는 것인가? 우리의 적들이 서로 싸우는 모습을 보며 박수를 할 수 "
"밖에 없는 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "92d24628-07c7-407f-831b-82012c7e0ee5"
msgid "...the truth, of course!"
msgstr "...진실입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b4d3b19b-a9a1-4634-a54f-14e22fddcca4"
msgid "\"You first — who are you?\""
msgstr "\"우선 너는 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "243f4cce-15a6-4743-836c-be4e06a81175"
msgid "\"Where are we? Let us out of here!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 어디에 있는 거지? 여기서 나가게 해줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "6558ec4f-5ea5-4079-939f-0bade1566a7e"
msgid "Asked him more about his kingdom."
msgstr "그의 왕국에 대해 더 많이 물었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "69a287a9-a2fa-4158-b2fe-cf4a3f04b130"
msgid "Asked him about Nyrissa and his imprisonment."
msgstr "나이리사와 그의 감금에 대해 물었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6f05ef4f-4360-4818-be2d-618d2f354d65"
msgid "Asked him how best to fight Nyrissa and her minions."
msgstr "나이리사와 그녀의 부하들과 싸우는 가장 좋은 방법을 물었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "bdc8707f-d195-4aa4-81e7-dc28cbb93675"
msgid "Told him we were his new masters!"
msgstr "우리가 그의 새로운 주인이라고 말했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "60daad21-f59f-4a7b-b1fe-3cb8098782ec"
msgid "[Close] We ran through the door and left the ghost to his moping."
msgstr "[닫힘]우리는 문으로 달려갔고 유령이 침울하게 두었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "f2bcdff3-3190-4705-965a-fd69619ea457"
msgid "...asked him what the chalice was."
msgstr "... 그 성배가 무엇인지 물었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "d0628a1b-4a2e-4a12-a1e3-0a961fe2d9a9"
msgid "...asked him what he would do if we set him free."
msgstr "... 그를 풀어 주면 무엇을 할 것인지 물었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "e03c142e-4c88-4c9f-ba3b-8f8f8b6aaece"
msgid "[Close] ...said goodbye and got the hells out of there."
msgstr "[닫힘]... 작별 인사를하고 그곳에서 어서 나옵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "be7d0a54-e0f8-4ed5-81c4-346f54164f4f"
msgid "\"Oh yeah, we totally killed them! Stabby-stab!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 우리가 완전히 죽였어! 분노가 넘쳤지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "0c473b92-50c2-459f-9352-853046d7cbc8"
msgid ""
"\"Not yet. That's why we need your help. How can we best fight Nyrissa and "
"her minions?\""
msgstr "\"아직 아니다. 그래서 너의 도움이 필요하다. 나이리사와 그녀의 부하들과 싸우기 위한 최선의 방법은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "a386dcfd-5b7c-431a-a263-ea4b423ffad0"
msgid "...agreed to set him free."
msgstr "... 그를 풀어주는 것을 동의합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "ab40e40a-4e0b-4218-84a4-6d0b75f832eb"
msgid "...refused."
msgstr "... 거절합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "862e7f54-c3e5-48d5-afe3-e6caf8bd6773"
msgid "[Close] ...told him we needed to think about it and got out of there."
msgstr "[닫힘]... 생각해 보겠다고 말하고 그곳에서 나옵니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Answer_0044_Text
msgctxt "f3b7be92-067e-4c27-a6df-01890b9b527d"
msgid "[Close]"
msgstr "[닫습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "e8626960-3dc4-4a5c-82dd-32877e42cad7"
msgid ""
"Listen, you can talk all you want about proper precautions and things best "
"left unknown and blah blah blah. But when someone gives you the disassembled "
"pieces of a magical artifact? I don't care who you are — you put that baby "
"together.\n"
"As the last piece of the First Crown slotted into place, the whole thing "
"started glowing with green light and humming, and that's when things got "
"weird. Before we knew what was happening, we were somewhere else, an "
"indistinct nowhere with misty walls glowing that same green.\n"
"Before us floated an elven man, all dressed up like some sort of king. "
"Except that he wasn't a normal king, because last time I checked elves "
"weren't see-through, and their skin didn't give off wisps of glowing smoke. "
"He stared at us with his blank ghost-eyes and said, \"You're neither witch "
"nor worm. Who are you?\"\n"
"So we told him..."
msgstr ""
"적절한 조치와 비밀로 하는 것이 가장 좋고 또한 다른 많은 조치를 말하는 것도 좋습니다. 하지만 마법의 유물이 분해된 조각을 받으면 "
"어떻겠습니까? 당신이 누구인지는 상관하지 않습니다. 그 유물을 되돌려 놓으십시오.\n"
"첫 번째 왕관의 마지막 부분을 찾아 붙였을 때 모든 것이 초록빛으로 빛나며 웅웅거리기 시작했고 상황이 예상치 못하게 바뀌었습니다. 무슨 "
"일이 일어나고 있는지 깨닫기도 전에 우리는 어딘가로 보내졌고 그곳은 온통 초록빛으로 빛나는 안개가 자욱한 벽으로 둘러싸인 곳이었습니다.\n"
"우리 앞에 엘프 남자가 떠올랐고 그는 마치 왕처럼 차려 입었습니다. 내가 알기로 엘프는 속이 비치지 않고 피부는 빛나는 연기가 "
"흘러나오지도 않았기에 그가 정상적인 왕이 아니라는 것을 알았습니다. 그는 공허한 유령의 눈빛으로 우리를 쳐다 보면서 말했습니다. \"너는 "
"마녀도 벌레도 아니군. 너는 누구냐?\"\n"
"그래서 우리는 그에게 말했습니다..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "17532786-b5c9-46b4-9ad2-5b582824a5df"
msgid ""
"The ghost-king nodded. \"My name is Lethoriel, once called Lethoriel the "
"Wise. You're inside what was my pride, and is now my prison — what you call "
"the First Crown.\" He gave an ugly smile. Behind him, a door manifested in "
"the fog. He gestured to it. \"Don't worry. Unlike me, I suspect you can "
"leave whenever you like.\""
msgstr ""
"유령 왕은 끄덕였습니다. \"내 이름은 레소리엘이다. 한 때 현명한 레소리엘이라고 불렸다. 너는 나의 자존심이었고, 지금은 내 감옥인 첫 "
"번째 왕관 속에 있다.\" 그는 끔찍한 미소를 짓습니다. 그의 뒤에는 안개 속에 문이 보입니다. 그는 그것을 가리킵니다. \"걱정하지 "
"마라. 나와 달리 너는 언제든지 떠날 수 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "94b8e0a3-541a-48ae-a579-1e428c31eda3"
msgid ""
"\"Time is strange here. I don't know how many millennia have passed in your "
"world since Nyrissa destroyed my kingdom of Rushwood, only that all memory "
"of it has been lost, with younger races building nations atop its ashes. My "
"people are long dead and scattered. Only I remain, trapped in this half-"
"life, denied my proper rest and forced to carry out petty tasks for "
"whichever abomination bears my crown. All thanks to the Nymph Queen.\"\n"
"He looked at us expectantly, so we..."
msgstr ""
"\"여기서의 시간은 왜곡되어 흐른다. 나이리사가 러쉬우드의 내 왕국을 파괴한 이래 얼마나 많은 억겁의 시간이 경과했는지 모르겠지만, 모든 "
"기억은 잊혀지고 더 젊은 종족들이 왕국의 잿더미 위에 나라를 세웠다. 나의 백성들은 오래 전에 죽어 먼지가 되었다. 오직 나만이 남아 "
"반쪽짜리 삶을 여기에서 갇혀 보내며, 내가 받아 마땅한 휴식을 취하지 못한 채로, 어떤 혐오물이 내 왕관을 쓰던지 강제로 그것의 하찮은 "
"임무를 도와야하지. 모두 님프 여왕 덕분이다.\"\n"
"그는 무언가 기대하며 우리를 바라 보았습니다. 그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "7ff2278e-9041-434f-820f-2f5a7aca81da"
msgid ""
"\"Time is strange here. I don't know how many millennia have passed in your "
"world since Nyrissa destroyed my kingdom of Rushwood, only that all memory "
"of it has been lost, with you younger races building your nations atop its "
"ashes. My people are long dead and scattered. Only I remain, trapped in this "
"half-life, denied my proper rest and forced to carry out petty tasks for "
"whichever abomination bears my crown. All thanks to the Nymph Queen.\"\n"
"He looked at us expectantly, so we..."
msgstr ""
"\"여기서의 시간은 왜곡되어 흐른다. 나이리사가 러쉬우드의 내 왕국을 파괴한 이래 얼마나 많은 억겁의 시간이 경과했는지 모르겠지만, 모든 "
"기억은 잊혀지고 더 젊은 종족들이 왕국의 잿더미 위에 나라를 세웠다. 나의 백성들은 오래 전에 죽어 먼지가 되었다. 오직 나만이 남아 "
"반쪽짜리 삶을 여기에서 갇혀 보내며, 내가 받아 마땅한 휴식을 취하지 못한 채로, 어떤 혐오물이 내 왕관을 쓰던지 강제로 그것의 하찮은 "
"임무를 도와야하지. 모두 님프 여왕 덕분이다.\"\n"
"그는 무언가 기대하며 우리를 바라 보았습니다. 그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "15827163-5581-47a3-a1eb-e8ed2f0a4a96"
msgid ""
"The ghost's smile looked pained. Behind him, the fog swirled, forming an "
"image of a beautiful forest city. \"Gods, my kingdom! It was a thing of "
"beauty, a forest city that wove the trees into its very walls. But now it's "
"gone, destroyed by Nyrissa and swallowed up by time and the forest.\" He "
"laughed bitterly. \"I believe you know my realm as a part of your so-called "
"{g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. How appropriate! Yet even your oldest "
"books have forgotten me, and I while away the millennia here, bound by "
"Nyrissa as bauble for her servants to squabble over!\"\n"
"So then we..."
msgstr ""
"유령의 미소는 고통스러워 보입니다. 그의 뒤에는 안개가 소용돌이 치며 아름다운 숲 도시의 이미지를 형성했습니다. \"오. 나의 왕국! 내 "
"아름다운 왕국은 나무들이 벽으로 이뤄진 숲의 도시였다. 하지만 이제는 나이리사에 의해 파괴되어 사라져 버렸고 시간과 숲에 의해 삼켜졌다."
"\" 그는 씁쓸하게 웃었습니다. \"나의 영역을 네가 소위 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}이라 말하는 것을 알고 있다. "
"정말 적절한 이름이지 않은가! 너희들의 가장 오래된 책들조차 나를 잊어버렸고, 나는 나이리사에게 붙들려 그녀의 부하들이 얻기위해 다투는 "
"싸구려 전리품이 되어 수천년을 여기서 살았다!\"\n"
"그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0018_Text_String
msgctxt "496e510c-afa9-4502-9185-ef4ad0b7b2b9"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa!\" The ghost snarled, and if we didn't already know he was a "
"ghost, we would have then, his face contorting in ways that would have "
"broken a real elf's skull. Behind him, the fog swirled, forming an image of "
"a beautiful elven city. He jabbed a finger at it. \"Look! See my kingdom? "
"See what she destroyed? All of it, gone! And why? Just to add one more grain "
"of dust to the Nymph Queen's chalice!\" He shrieked, a sound full of madness "
"and sorrow that seemed to stab through our ears and into our brains. \"And "
"now she binds me here, as a bauble for her servants to squabble over!\"\n"
"So then we..."
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사!\" 유령이 이를 갈고 얼굴이 뒤틀리는데 그가 유령이라는 것을 알지 못했다면 진짜 엘프의 해골이 일그러져 부서지는 줄 알았을 "
"것입니다. 그 뒤에 안개가 소용돌이 치며 아름다운 엘프 도시의 이미지를 형성했습니다. 그는 그것에 손가락을 찌릅니다.\"보라! 내 왕국이 "
"보이느냐? 그녀가 무엇을 파괴했는지 보아라. 그 모든 것이 사라져 버렸다. 왜냐고? 그 님프 여왕의 성배에 먼지 한 톨을 넣으려고 한 "
"짓이다!\"그는 광기와 슬픔으로 가득 찬 소리를 질렀고 우리의 귀와 뇌를 찌릅니다. \"그리고 이제 나이리사는 나를 여기에 가두었다, "
"그녀의 부하들이 서로 얻으려고 싸우는 싸구려 전리품으로써!\"\n"
"그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "28a729dd-7a06-400e-9f8d-ecfe4202884d"
msgid ""
"The ghost shook his head. \"I don't know. Only that every time she destroys "
"a kingdom, a new grain of dust falls into her cup. Mine was the first, but "
"there have been so many since...\""
msgstr ""
"유령이 고개를 저었습니다. \"나는 모른다. 그녀가 왕국을 파괴 할 때마다 새로운 티끌이 잔에 떨어지는 것이다. 내 것이 처음 이었고 그 "
"이후로 너무나 많은 왕국이 파괴되었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "1080d067-2d91-446c-a177-31f31968fc25"
msgid ""
"\"New masters?\" The green light in the room throbbed with the ghost's "
"anger, his eyes blazing. But then he smiled. \"Does this at least mean you "
"killed the Knurly Witch and the Wriggling Man? That would be some "
"consolation.\"\n"
"We answered:"
msgstr ""
"\"새로운 주인?\" 방안에 있는 녹색 불빛은 유령의 분노로 찌그러졌고 그의 눈은 타오릅니다. 하지만 그는 웃었습니다. \"최소한 네가 "
"옹이 마녀와 꿈틀거리는 남자를 죽였다는 뜻인가? 그것은 위안이 되는군.\" \n"
"우리는 대답했습니다:"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "2110019a-b2a4-475b-9098-3954ecded1b6"
msgid ""
"The ghost cackled. \"Excellent! Though I'm sure that in no time at all I'll "
"be longing for your death in the same fashion. But very well — what would "
"you have of me?\"\n"
"So we..."
msgstr ""
"유령이 킬킬거립니다.\"훌륭하도다! 나는 역시 너도 죽기를 바란다. 하지만 아주 잘했다. 내게 무엇을 바라는 건가?\"\n"
"그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0031_Text_String
msgctxt "ab229223-f4ac-4dec-84a2-905fb99220b0"
msgid ""
"\"Liars!\" The ghost's face twisted with fury. \"It's not enough that you "
"keep me imprisoned, but you lie to me as well?!\" He screamed, the sound "
"tearing at our sanity. \"Make your demands and begone!\"\n"
"So we..."
msgstr ""
"\"거짓말!\" 유령의 얼굴이 분노로 뒤틀렸습니다. \"나를 감옥에 가두어 두는 것으로 모자라 나에게 거짓말을 하느냐?!\" 그는 비명을 "
"질렀고 우리의 정신을 찢습니다. \"필요한 걸 말하고 당장 사라져라!\"\n"
"그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "de568526-182f-4c37-b9ee-fc229c8563eb"
msgid ""
"The ghost laughed bitterly. \"Fight Nyrissa? Child, if I knew how to kill "
"the Nymph Queen, would I still be trapped in this godsforsaken crown? I "
"can't take any direct action against her, even at the command of my bearer.\""
" He paused, thoughtful. \"Though I suppose... her minions see my crown as a "
"mark of station. The Knurly Witch and the Wriggling Man fight over it "
"incessantly. To see it in someone else's hands might fluster them — cause "
"them to make a mistake at a crucial moment.\" There was another pause, "
"longer this time. At last, in a softer voice, the ghost said, \"Or... once "
"you've left this place, you could command me to destroy this crown and set "
"myself free.\"\n"
"That made us all pause. We looked at each other, silently weighing our "
"options, and then..."
msgstr ""
"유령은 씁쓸하게 웃었습니다. \"나이리사와 싸운다고? 애송이 녀석. 님프 여왕을 죽이는 방법을 알고 있다면 내가 이 신조차 버린 왕관에 "
"갇혀 있겠나? 나는 왕관의 소유자의 명령이라 하더라도 그녀에게 대항할 수 없다.\" 그는 멈추고는 생각에 잠깁니다. \"내 생각에는... "
"그녀의 부하들은 내 왕관을 지위의 상징으로 본다. 옹이 마녀와 꿈틀거리는 남자는 끊임없이 서로 싸운다. 누군가 다른 사람의 손에 왕관이 "
"들어가면 잠시동안 그들을 괴롭혀 당황하게 만들 수 있다.\" 그는 또 다시 멈추고 더 오랫동안 생각합니다. 마침내 부드러운 목소리로 "
"귀신이 말했습니다. \"아니면... 네가 여기서 나가면, 나에게 왕관을 부수고 자유를 되찾으라 명령할 수도 있다.\"\n"
"우리 모두는 멈추었습니다. 우리는 서로를 보면서 조용히 우리의 선택지를 가늠했고..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "c92c73f2-3481-4ded-b590-0396d129e415"
msgid ""
"The ghost laughed bitterly. \"Fight Nyrissa? Child, if I knew how to kill "
"the Nymph Queen, would I still be trapped in this godsforsaken crown? I "
"can't take any direct action against her, even at the command of my bearer.\""
" He paused, thoughtful, then continued in a softer voice, \"Though once "
"you've left this place, you could command me to destroy this crown and set "
"myself free.\"\n"
"That made us all pause. We looked at each other, silently weighing our "
"options, and then..."
msgstr ""
"유령은 씁쓸하게 웃었습니다. \"나이리사와 싸운다고? 애송이 녀석. 님프 여왕을 죽이는 방법을 알고 있다면 내가 이 신조차 버린 왕관에 "
"갇혀 있겠나? 나는 왕관의 소유자의 명령이라 하더라도 그녀에게 대항할 수 없다.\" 그는 멈추고는 생각에 잠기더니, 마침내 부드러운 "
"목소리로 말했습니다.\"그래도 네가 여기서 나가면, 나에게 왕관을 부수고 자유를 되찾으라 명령할 수도 있다.\"\n"
"우리 모두는 멈추었습니다. 우리는 서로를 보면서 조용히 우리의 선택지를 가늠했고..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "8b1310ce-e68c-47a4-865b-197cd4c58937"
msgid ""
"\"Why, I'd... I'd go on to my just rewards, I suppose. Be judged by "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} and join my people in the afterlife.\" The ghost "
"tried to look innocent, but unfortunately for him, we knew better. Innocent "
"or not, he was a ghost—spending a few thousand years stewing in your own "
"rage scrambles your brains. There was no telling what he'd do if we set him "
"free.\n"
"So we..."
msgstr ""
"\"왜 나는... 나는 나의 정당한 보상을 받겠다. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}에게 나를 인도하여 나의 백성들처럼 환생하게 "
"해다오.\"유령은 침착을 유지하려 했지만 불행히도 우리는 잘 알았습니다. 어찌되었건 그는 수 천년 동안 분노에 사로잡혀 머릿속이 "
"뒤죽박죽이 되었습니다. 우리가 그를 자유롭게 한다면 그가 무엇을 할 것인지 알 수 없습니다.\n"
"그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "78b8f696-0077-46e0-9507-2c7bd4ae4999"
msgid ""
"His face softened, and for a moment you could see the kind leader he must "
"have once been. \"Why, I'd... I'd go on to my just rewards, I suppose. Be "
"judged by {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g} and join my people in the afterlife.\"\n"
"So we..."
msgstr ""
"그의 얼굴은 부드러워졌고 잠시 동안 당신은 한때 그의 친절한 지도자의 모습을 볼 수 있었습니다.\"왜 나는... 나는 나의 정당한 보상을 "
"받겠다. {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}에게 나를 인도하여 나의 백성들처럼 환생하게 해다오.\"\n"
"그래서 우리는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0045_knowHowToFree_Text
msgctxt "8a1f16e8-81f3-411c-abc3-f34e8ad86c8d"
msgid ""
"The ghost stared at us. \"Really?\" Slowly, a smile spread across his face. "
"\"I do believe you actually mean that. In that case, all you have to do is "
"speak my name — Lethoriel — and order me to destroy the crown and free "
"myself.\" He frowned. \"You'll need to do it in the presence of someone as "
"powerful as Nyrissa herself — one of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, perhaps — but "
"they're not so terribly hard to find.\" He bowed low, gesturing to the door "
"forming in the mists once more. \"Please, return to your world, with my "
"thanks.\"\n"
"And with that, we passed through the door."
msgstr ""
"유령이 우리를 쳐다 봤습니다. \"정말인가?\" 천천히 미소가 얼굴 전체에 퍼졌습니다. \"나는 네가 약속했다고 믿겠다. 그렇다면 내 "
"이름 레소리엘을 말하여 왕관을 파괴하고 나 자신을 해방하라고 명령하기만 하면 된다.\" 그는 눈살을 찌푸렸습니다. \"나이리사만큼 강력한 "
"존재 앞에서 주문을 외워야 한다. 아마 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}와 같은 존재겠지. 그들은 그렇게 찾기 어렵지 않다. \"그는 낮게 "
"절하며 안개 속에 생긴 문을 가리킵니다.\"이제 너의 세계로 돌아가라. 고맙다.\"\n"
"그리고 우리는 문을 통과했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/TheElvenKing_BookEvent/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "6a9e4881-acb9-49e6-a1de-e979db7a3723"
msgid ""
"The room darkened around us, the ghost's eyes flaring bright like green "
"bonfires. \"So. You're no better than the rest of them, then.\" He began to "
"grow larger, literally expanding with rage. \"In that case, master, allow me "
"to free you from this prison, as you're so unwilling to do for me.\"\n"
"And with that, we were suddenly back in the forest."
msgstr ""
"방은 우리 주위를 어둡게 만들었고 유령의 눈은 초록빛 모닥불처럼 밝게 빛났습니다. \"너는 다른 자들과 똑같다.\" 그의 웃음소리는 더 "
"커지며 말 그대로 분노로 팽창했습니다. \"그렇다면 주인이여, 이 감옥에서 쫓아내는걸 허락해라, 너는 내가 원하는대로 해 줄 의지가 "
"없으니.\"\n"
"그리고 우리는 갑자기 숲으로 돌아 왔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ff8a87d3-f896-4104-bd88-5d53a858bcd9"
msgid "\"What are you doing?\""
msgstr "\"뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0005_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "696eca69-f0f1-4b01-a6d5-5fbbdcca15bc"
msgid "Offered to help the satyr."
msgstr "사티로스를 도와주겠다고 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "3349bf67-44d9-405b-93b2-3eba86cdc14c"
msgid "\"Need some help?\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0cc692fa-2993-4254-a191-ff7375e901ef"
msgid "\"The Knurly Witch says she needs you. I'll handle it from here.\""
msgstr "\"옹이 마녀가 나를 보냈다. 여기서부터 내가 맡겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a83707d3-517b-435f-9e44-0168cdb0a65c"
msgid "\"The Wriggling Man sent us to take over for you.\""
msgstr "\"꿈틀거리는 남자가 우리를 보내 너를 대신하라고 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f799f928-63e7-4e08-88e9-5d9cbd2bf9c1"
msgid "\"In the name of Shyka the Many, step away.\""
msgstr "\"다수의 샤이카의 이름으로 물러나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4df59e7c-efe5-4d88-abd5-0314192079c4"
msgid "[Attack] \"Die, goatboy!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"죽어라. 말 많은 털복숭이!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "ed4267a1-7108-4b88-938a-4897a82dd483"
msgid "\"Sorry to bother you.\""
msgstr "\"귀찮게해서 미안하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "aff6d77b-9d6d-4a5d-97a2-3c02175141ab"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f96f3ba8-af59-4352-ad6f-15a02ceaab60"
msgid ""
"{n}In a clearing ahead, a satyr curses and hacks angrily at a stone pillar, "
"trying to chip free a piece of a crown imbedded incongruously in its "
"surface. Around him, massive purple worms roll and breach in the churned "
"earth. He turns your direction.{/n} \"What? Who are you? No, wait, I don't "
"care — just get lost!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}앞이 트이자 사티로스는 돌 기둥에 화를 내며 발길질하고 표면에 부자연스럽게 박힌 왕관을 떼어내려 합니다. 그의 주위에 거대한 보라색 "
"벌레떼가 기어다니며 들끓습니다. 그는 당신 쪽으로 바라봅니다.{/n} \"뭐야? 너 누구야? 아니. 상관 없다. 그냥 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "986a78db-b9b7-40e3-941f-af1ca7cf88de"
msgid "\"Get lost!\""
msgstr "\"꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "922a404a-6226-450a-94bf-364f3728ee4b"
msgid ""
"\"None of your business! Now get moving before I sick the worms on you!\""
msgstr "\"네 알 바 아니다! 벌레를 끼얹기 전에 저리 가버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "448bc11a-b7f1-4a48-b9af-4c7c7f5991f6"
msgid ""
"\"And have you steal my glory? Not a chance! The Wriggling Man will make me "
"his chief huntsman after this!\" {n}He glares at you suspiciously.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내 영광을 훔치려고? 어림도 없지! 꿈틀거리는 남자가 이것을 쫓으라고 나를 보냈다!\" {n}그는 당신을 의심스러운 눈으로 "
"봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "507f37fa-a564-4ca0-b64f-5f35713390bf"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr looks at you incredulously.{/n} \"That skinbag thinks she can "
"order me around? Tell your hag mistress that Faldrox the Huntsman bows to no "
"one but the Wriggling Man! Worms — attack them!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스가 의심의 눈초리를 보냅니다.{/n} \"쭈글탱이가 나한테 감히 명령을 해? 너. 늙은 주인한테 돌아가서 사냥꾼 팔드록스는 "
"꿈틀거리는 남자에게만 충성한다고 전해라! 벌레들아! 저자를 공격해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "f46623b0-1870-4588-90bd-c96d3e668fea"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr looks at you incredulously.{/n} \"You think I work for that "
"skinbag?! I'd sooner cut off my horns! But you apparently lack my exquisite "
"judge of character. Worms — attack them!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스가 당신을 수상쩍게 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"내가 그 쭈글탱이 밑에서 일한다고?! 차라리 내 뿔을 잘라버리지! 보는 눈 없는 "
"자신을 탓해라. 벌레들아! 저자를 공격해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "7ac122e0-b45f-452e-8da3-9473877945d4"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr's expression crumples, his ears drooping.{/n} \"But why? I was "
"doing such a good job!\" {n}He looks to the worms, then grins darkly.{/n} "
"\"Well, I won't stop you, then. But he can't fault me if the worms "
"accidentally take a little nibble...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스의 표정이 구겨지며 귀는 축 쳐졌습니다.{/n} \"그런데 어째서? 나는 훌륭하게 일을 하고 있었다!\" {n}그는 벌레를 "
"보고 어둡게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그러면 너를 멈추지 않을 것이다. 하지만 우연히 벌레가 조금씩 뜯어 먹었다면 그는 나를 단죄할 수 "
"없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "eb0bb331-caed-402b-a610-24b2f097c218"
msgid ""
"\"Liars! You think you can trick a satyr? You're the crone's toadies! My "
"master's worms will devour your flesh!\""
msgstr "\"거짓말! 사티로스를 속일 수 있다고 생각했어? 노파의 하수인 주제에! 내 주인의 벌레가 너의 살을 파먹을것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "78eff111-072c-4d9b-b7d7-6e3b4c019f88"
msgid ""
"{n}The satyr looks puzzled.{/n} \"{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}? What do the Many have "
"to do with this?\" {n}He grins, showing sharp teeth, and waggles his "
"eyebrows.{/n} \"But nobody messes in the Wriggling Man's business. If the "
"Lord of Time sent you, they must have known what I'd do to you...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}사티로스는 의아해 합니다.{/n} \"{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}? 그 자가 이 걸로 무엇을 하지?\" {n}그는 웃자 날카로운 "
"이빨이 드러나고 눈썹이 올라갑니다.{/n} \"그러나 아무도 꿈틀거리는 남자의 일을 망칠 수 없다. 시간의 신이 너를 보냈다면 내가 "
"너에게 할 일을 알고 계실 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "d55a6ee7-1193-489d-9088-0a07afc55a77"
msgid "\"Not as sorry as you'll be if you don't keep moving!\""
msgstr "\"계속 움직이지 않으면 고맙겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/CastleOfKnivesOutdoor/WrigglingAgents/Cue_0022_dm_crown_Text_String
msgctxt "13680535-f511-4c67-a2d9-943b7fa9c0ed"
msgid ""
"{n}There are plenty of lingering traces of magic from the battle between the "
"Wriggling Man and the Knurly Witch. However, the piece of the First Crown "
"shines brighter than any of them. It's obvious that the First Crown is a "
"remarkable and mysterious magical item.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}꿈틀거리는 남자와 옹이 마녀가 싸우면서 생긴 마법의 흔적이 많이 남아 있습니다. 그러나 첫 번째 왕관의 조각은 무엇보다 더 밝게 "
"빛납니다. 첫 번째 왕관이 놀랍고 신비로운 마법의 물품이라는 것은 명백합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "6cc6abbe-77e7-4fc5-b6a8-0be7a722bf35"
msgid "\"I need loyal and experienced fighters.\""
msgstr "\"나는 충성스럽고 숙련된 전사가 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d0899831-6e50-4797-a75e-beee20815686"
msgid "\"How did you end up here?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 여기까지 오게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c1b480d7-8669-48bf-8ada-62d7b296b856"
msgid "\"Who are these people?\""
msgstr "\"이 자들은 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "a8081f34-77b8-46c8-ba93-709c0a5431ab"
msgid ""
"\"I need your people's help. Scatvi, Ellert, Lash, Crimson Fury — I'd like "
"to welcome you to my party.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너희들의 도움이 필요하다. 나는 Scatvi, Ellert, Lash, Crimson Fury을 내 일행에 초대하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "926caf28-d73b-494d-838a-1f9b9dba847e"
msgid "\"I have to go. Thank you, Anoriel.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야겠다. 고맙다, 아노리엘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "e8ba2a2a-a0d7-4a04-a535-9a1f35f8c3fb"
msgid "\"I need to think this through.\""
msgstr "\"이 일을 곰곰이 좀 생각해 봐야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Barks/Anoriel_HATEOT_1_String
msgctxt "1525072f-e599-418b-ab3b-cbd66604ea53"
msgid "\"{name}! I thought I'd never find you in this House!\""
msgstr "\"{name}! 여기서 만나게 될 줄은 몰랐는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Barks/Anoriel_HATEOT_2_String
msgctxt "c6bb63c3-10aa-45ba-b2b9-30382a458dba"
msgid ""
"\"I and my people came to help you, but the damned portal and even more "
"damned fog had us separated from each other.\""
msgstr "\"나와 내 친구들은 너를 도우러 왔지만 망할 포털에 심지어 망할 안개가 껴서 우리를 갈라놓았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Barks/Anoriel_HATEOT_3_String
msgctxt "876d19e7-1874-42f2-b608-915be5dd5901"
msgid ""
"\"I have to find my people. I'll wait for you at the entrance once I find "
"them!\""
msgstr "\"내 친구들을 찾아야겠다. 그들을 찾고 입구에서 너를 기다리겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : VentureCaptainAnorel
msgctxt "9d0884f0-759e-464b-80c5-b8b1792f5e19"
msgid ""
"\"Hello there.\" {n}Anoriel grins.{/n} \"Fate toys with me, that's for sure. "
"I choose the most remote corner of the world to drink my life away, but then "
"some unknown upstart becomes a {mf|king|queen} right before my eyes. Then "
"the remote corner transforms into a nice kingdom, and I'm running to help "
"Their Highness in a battle against the First World...\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕.\" {n}아노리엘이 웃습니다.{/n} \"운명의 여신의 장난이 틀림 없군. 가장 먼 세상의 언저리에 내 삶을 허비하기 위해 "
"왔는데 어디서 굴러먹은 놈이 왕이 되다니. 그리고는 그 언저리에 있는 시골이 왕국이 되어 태초 세계와 싸우기 위해 왕을 돕고 있군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : VentureCaptainAnorel
msgctxt "9925f3e4-b332-440b-aae6-7639634ef37e"
msgid "\"This mess beats Renchurch hands down.\""
msgstr "\"이 미치광이는 렌 교회를 손쉽게 점령했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0006_Text_String
msgctxt "db4acb1c-9527-4b0d-b882-5942284ecd65"
msgid ""
"\"And I can bring them here! The only sure way to get here was the portal at "
"the Castle of Knives. The location of this place keep changing – it's the "
"First World after all. But now when I'm here, I can summon my friends from "
"Golarion.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 그들을 데려올 수 있었다. 여기에 오는 한 가지 확실한 방법은 칼날의 성의 포털을 이용하는 것이었다. 이 장소의 좌표는 "
"계속해서 변한다. 여기는 태초 세계니까. 하지만 내가 여기에 왔으니, 골라리온의 친구들을 부를 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : VentureCaptainAnorel
msgctxt "ec9a1377-3a90-481e-b79b-fd767ac58282"
msgid ""
"\"We'll find you good mercenaries. I bet many would fight just for the "
"chance to visit the First World!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 용병들을 찾아주지. 많은 이들이 태초 세계에 올 기회를 잡으려 싸우고 있을거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : VentureCaptainAnorel
msgctxt "f60115e8-929e-4dd5-ab96-4b44ac086e65"
msgid ""
"\"I thought you'd need my help, so I gathered the most capable people I "
"could find and followed you to the Castle of Knives. But by the time we "
"arrived, you were already gone, and the portal was surrounded by dead "
"monsters. We then stepped through the portal, only to discover that fey "
"magic does something with time itself here. We followed you through the "
"portal, but arrived before you. The fey be damned!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 도움이 필요할 거라 생각했다. 주위의 사람들을 모아 칼날의 성으로 오게 했다. 우리가 도착했을 때는 너는 이미 사라지고 없었다. "
"포털은 죽은 괴물들 천지였지. 우리는 포털로 진입했고 페이의 마법이 이곳의 시간을 왜곡했음을 발견했다. 우리는 너를 따라 포털에 "
"들어갔지만 너보다 먼저 도착했다. 망할 페이 때문이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : VentureCaptainAnorel
msgctxt "ac85f2b6-62c2-496f-9b41-c369c8c950d9"
msgid ""
"\"Some freaks. I found two of them, drunk, under the tavern's table, and the "
"other two by the road in the ditch.\" {n}Anoriel grins while her friends "
"laugh.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"괴짜들이다. 나는 이들 중 두 명이 주점 탁자 밑에 곯아떨어진걸 발견했고, 다른 두 명은 길가의 배수로에서 발견했지.\" {n}"
"아노리엘은 그녀의 친구들이 웃음을 터트릴 때 씨익 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : VentureCaptainAnorel
msgctxt "3159db9e-951a-412a-b064-7d325cf5aebb"
msgid ""
"\"Alright, alright. This here is Scatvi, the daughter of my late friend "
"Voltar... She's a cleric of Abadar, just like her father. The man with the "
"bow is Ellert. He's a silent type. The Lash is a bard. He can whip you to "
"tears with his words, hence the nickname. Finally, the Crimson Fury "
"specializes in decapitating anyone who isn't quick enough to hide from her. "
"All four stand ready to dispatch a few dozen fey. Just say the word.\""
msgstr ""
"\"알겠다. 여기는 스캇비, 내 오랜 친구 볼타르의 딸이다... 그녀는 그녀의 아버지처럼 아바다르의 성직자이다. 활을 든 남자는 엘럿이고 "
"과묵한 성격이다. 라쉬는 음유시인이고 그의 노래를 들으면 눈물을 쏟을 것이다. 마지막으로 진홍의 분노는 그녀보다 빨리 숨지 못한 것들을 "
"참수하는 여성이다. 넷 모두 말만 하면 페이 수십을 처치하는 건 식은죽 먹기다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "3890b9dd-23fb-4e64-b2f5-88eff4b31e28"
msgid "\"Then I cannot help you. The tutors won't work for free.\""
msgstr "\"그럼 도와주기 어려울 것 같아. 재교육 교사들은 무료로 일하지 않거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Anoriel/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "1ee9834f-84ab-4c47-837b-04657e3aa963"
msgid "\"Certainly.\""
msgstr "\"확실히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/10ALT_Apology_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "f6ad450a-9752-4cac-bed8-3f2c4040b587"
msgid "\"What... what is...\""
msgstr "\"뭐... 뭐야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/10ALT_Apology_2Shyka_String
msgctxt "a8b0498d-741b-4e28-985f-c90cbbf7db48"
msgid "\"What happened, the Laughing Lie? Have you yourself been deceived?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이지? 웃는 거짓말? 자승자박인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/10ALT_Apology_3LK_String
msgctxt "18a53baa-20ba-4c0c-bc21-ddad543eb3e3"
msgid "\"What have you done, the Many?!\""
msgstr "\"샤이카. 무슨 짓을 한 거야?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/10_Apology_1LK_String
msgctxt "0d6743aa-0eb5-4db9-9271-c9bd874ec533"
msgid ""
"\"The performance is over. Let us thank the actors. Reckless mortal heroes — "
"and you, my toy. You have all done precisely what I wanted, how I wanted.\""
msgstr ""
"\"연기가 끝났다. 배우들아 고맙다. 무모한 필멸자 영웅들과 — 그리고 너, 내 장난감아. 내가 원했던 그대로, 원했던 방식으로 "
"행동해주었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/11ALT_Apology_1Shyka_String
msgctxt "b376845c-3998-429e-9a7e-f1a0cdc03d38"
msgid ""
"\"The First Crown has been broken. You do know who was confined inside? The "
"spirit of the first ruler whose kingdom Nyrissa ruined.\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관은 부서졌다. 누가 갇혀 있었는지 알고 있었나? 나이리사가 파괴한 왕국의 첫 번째 통치자의 영혼이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/11ALT_Apology_2Shyka_String
msgctxt "41789b2f-5605-43cf-b7cc-57bf3ebd9051"
msgid ""
"\"Who we are if not the many faces of time? We broke the crown here — and "
"there, many ages ago, when the kingdom of elves was alive.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 시간의 수많은 얼굴들이 아니라면 누구인가? 수 세기 전 엘프의 왕국이 존재했을 때 우리는 왕관을 부수었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/11ALT_Apology_3Shyka_String
msgctxt "c75dda2d-889b-44a7-878f-bd71786dcb75"
msgid ""
"\"The ruler returned to his subjects. The kingdom survived. One grain of "
"dust escaped from the cup.\""
msgstr "\"통치자는 백성들에게 돌아갔다. 왕국은 살아남았다. 먼지 한 톨이 잔에서 빠져 나갔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/11ALT_Apology_4Shyka_String
msgctxt "aead2970-d55d-4d9d-9622-4f6819c58765"
msgid ""
"One out of a thousand — but what a result! Your toy is broken, Lantern King."
"\""
msgstr "천 개 중 하나이지만, 결과는 그렇지 않다! 너의 장난감이 망가졌다. 등불왕. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/11ALT_Apology_5Shyka_String
msgctxt "9055996c-f68d-425e-9d15-fa8f9b8ef2a3"
msgid "\"Nyrissa is no more. Your dusty Eldest is no more.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 더 이상 없다. 티끌에 미친 원로는 더 이상 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/11ALT_Apology_6Shyka_String
msgctxt "11b12e0c-27c8-4ddb-a169-27e911d66a43"
msgid ""
"\"Didn't we improve the performance? An unexpected ending! Everyone loves "
"unexpected endings!\""
msgstr "\"우리 연기가 대단하지 않았나? 예기치 않은 결말이지! 모두가 예상치 못한 결말을 좋아한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/1Apology_wow1_String
msgctxt "20f0f1c6-e2ba-45bf-8d0d-931039e8a74c"
msgid "\"Destined.\""
msgstr "\"운명지어졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/1Apology_wow2_String
msgctxt "9c1248ad-dc45-492d-aa23-f67d1093683e"
msgid "\"Done.\""
msgstr "\"끝났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/1Apology_wow3_String
msgctxt "66804b0c-da58-4823-81dd-616fcd646f3f"
msgid "\"Completed.\""
msgstr "\"완수되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/1Apology_wow4_String
msgctxt "9505a63a-7dcf-4979-a97a-e90607ad3250"
msgid "\"Terminated.\""
msgstr "\"끝이 났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/2Apology_LK1_String
msgctxt "cd239248-1a3e-4946-9cd5-d47009de010a"
msgid ""
"\"So, here you are, trespasser. A thousand years of exile — and you are here."
"\""
msgstr "\"그래서, 여기에 왔군, 침입자. 천 년의 망명 생활을 하고 여기에 왔구나.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/3Apology_wow1_String
msgctxt "033b49b9-8bce-4c7c-b2a8-86e3aa418d36"
msgid "\"Hours.\""
msgstr "\"수시간.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/3Apology_wow2_String
msgctxt "8c423724-d131-4104-8054-9548aabbea45"
msgid "\"Years.\""
msgstr "\"수년.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/3Apology_wow3_String
msgctxt "f48928c6-4470-4049-8708-8110aeb0e9a7"
msgid "\"Ages.\""
msgstr "\"수세기.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/3Apology_wow4_String
msgctxt "f0dc8f44-16b6-4e4e-a201-2b98ca2f1934"
msgid "\"Millennia.\""
msgstr "\"수백만년.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/4Apology_LK1_String
msgctxt "c9299c3d-a3c2-4c5d-b9e0-c548daf06db2"
msgid ""
"\"You wanted to become one of us, one of the Eldest. — To create your own "
"kingdom of Love and Joy, stealing pieces from others' dominions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 우리들 중 하나가, 원로 중 하나가 되고 싶어 했다. — 다른 이들의 영토 조각들을 훔쳐, 사랑과 기쁨의 왕국을 만들고자 했다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/4Apology_LK2_String
msgctxt "464638d0-4923-4b1d-ae80-c008eb2929db"
msgid ""
"\"You have paid for your crime, in bringing us a cup filled with the dust of "
"a thousand ruined kingdoms.\""
msgstr "\"너는 죗값을 치루었고 우리에게 멸망한 왕국 천 개의 티끌을 담아 가져 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/5Apology_wow1_String
msgctxt "fe911f43-9f9c-4507-ac77-ae781f8cb356"
msgid "\"Payment.\""
msgstr "\"지불.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/5Apology_wow2_String
msgctxt "4bf9a7d3-0e29-43e5-8653-6e7c7a93aa55"
msgid "\"Price.\""
msgstr "\"값.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/5Apology_wow3_String
msgctxt "cfbf368f-d760-4304-b236-77c98eaa2f88"
msgid "\"Atonement.\""
msgstr "\"속죄.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/5Apology_wow4_String
msgctxt "61d20a11-1513-4811-8a44-2331bf9dfc5c"
msgid "\"Apology.\""
msgstr "\"사과.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/6Apology_LK1_String
msgctxt "e939fab0-2cff-4bb1-b87a-96f017e5d1b0"
msgid "\"I accept your apology. Please accept this gift as well.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 사죄를 받아들인다. 이 선물도 받아들여라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/6Apology_LK2_String
msgctxt "6f9a3433-446e-4598-b28b-4898a17838aa"
msgid ""
"\"You will become one of the Eldest, Nyrissa. Your journey was long, but now "
"it is over.\""
msgstr "\"너는 원로가 될 것이다, 나이리사. 너의 여정은 길었지만, 이제 끝났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/6Apology_LK3_String
msgctxt "fead95df-a732-44cf-be70-e07c8f41d18d"
msgid ""
"\"You will be the lady of dust, of trampled flowers, of ruined undertakings. "
"From now until forever, this is your dominion.\""
msgstr "\"너는 먼지, 짓밟혀진 꽃, 파괴된 것을 거두는 여신이 될 것이다. 지금부터 영원히, 그것들이 너의 영역이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/6Apology_LK4_String
msgctxt "c8ea6a1d-888d-4b26-b6d1-7e563b8fe47d"
msgid "\"Drink from the cup. The Eldest must drink — and so it shall be.\""
msgstr "\"잔에 있는 것을 마셔라. 원로는 마셔야만 한다 — 그러면 그리 될 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/7Apology_wow1_String
msgctxt "4f373293-4f69-4646-a0b9-4a759ed1f9c7"
msgid "\"Be.\""
msgstr "\"되어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/7Apology_wow2_String
msgctxt "0d99ebc1-08af-480b-a1aa-b168991f135e"
msgid "\"Dust.\""
msgstr "\"먼지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/7Apology_wow3_String
msgctxt "4974721d-ecef-4554-810d-efb9734db402"
msgid "\"Cinder.\""
msgstr "\"숯덩이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/7Apology_wow4_String
msgctxt "cdec84e3-81fb-4abc-9131-8bbf41cd5ea5"
msgid "\"Ashes.\""
msgstr "\"재.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/8Apology_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "66e8b020-5996-4582-a251-83f4234d9d59"
msgid "\"This is my fate, and I will drain it to the dregs.\""
msgstr "\"이것은 내 운명이다, 그리고 나는 찌꺼기까지 마시겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/9Apology_wow1_String
msgctxt "a0bd844b-f17b-48eb-838d-d52d8f87d6ab"
msgid "\"Eldest...\""
msgstr "\"원로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/9Apology_wow2_String
msgctxt "9ae2abd2-7bdd-4d52-a76f-eef7e1050e90"
msgid "\"Eldest...\""
msgstr "\"원로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/9Apology_wow3_String
msgctxt "edb261f8-2a92-470e-9d0a-776da2dbd954"
msgid "\"Eldest...\""
msgstr "\"원로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/APOLOGYCutsceneBarks/9Apology_wow4_String
msgctxt "77058402-d487-4a79-afa8-17e85d036ad3"
msgid "\"Eldest...\""
msgstr "\"원로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/Bark_SoulEater_TwinsTOF_corpseBark_String
msgctxt "f3752074-b39c-41ce-a983-c01dbd143581"
msgid ""
"The soul eater summoned by Nyrissa is nothing but an illusion, a weak "
"reflection of that monster that haunted Kanerah."
msgstr "나이리사가 소환한 영혼포식자는 그저 카네라를 괴롭히던 괴물의 나약한 반영이었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/AmiriNearEvi_String
msgctxt "8fd67f76-b240-4678-befa-f4097209a260"
msgid "\"When are we going to fight? I'm tired of just standing around here.\""
msgstr "\"언제 싸우러갈거야? 기다리다 지쳤다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/EkunAfterTroll_String
msgctxt "60cc8d03-d755-4a12-bade-d9756e971c56"
msgid "\"A good fight. My trust in you was not in vain.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 싸움이다. 너에 대한 나의 신뢰는 헛되지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/EkunNearEvi_String
msgctxt "fda32352-fa27-419f-b8a6-d0b1f3fd1612"
msgid "\"Lead, and I will follow.\""
msgstr "\"앞서라. 따라가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/HarrimNearEvi_String
msgctxt "f11f7255-a232-4fe7-975c-de2b8fc7dc52"
msgid "\"This place is hidden from time, deceiving Groetus. I don't like it.\""
msgstr "\"이 장소는 그로투스를 속이며 시간에서 숨겨져 있다. 나는 그것을 싫어한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/JaethalNearEvi_String
msgctxt "93c44659-23b8-40ba-8adc-23088daef62a"
msgid ""
"\"A delightful dwelling indeed. — But I'm ready to flood it with blood, just "
"say the word!\""
msgstr "\"유쾌한 거주지로군. 하지만 명령만 내리면 피가 넘쳐 홍수를 일으킬 준비가 되어 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/JubilostNearEvi_String
msgctxt "6de3a9c9-4abf-4a7b-b038-45a13b2a8a83"
msgid ""
"\"Just think of it, I'm in the First World, and wasting my time just "
"standing around waiting!\""
msgstr "\"생각해봐라. 나는 태초 세계에 있으면서도 멍하니 서서 시간을 낭비하고있다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/OctaviaNearEvi_String
msgctxt "f1f4aba6-b31c-4df0-8f22-57912ac8edab"
msgid ""
"\"A gloomy place. I hope this will soon be over. We'll save the kingdom, and "
"return home!\""
msgstr "\"우울한 곳이네요. 이번 일이 얼른 끝났으면 좋겠네요. 여느 때처럼 왕국을 위기에서 구하고, 집으로 돌아가자구요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/RegongarNearEvi_String
msgctxt "2959e544-bc9e-404d-aa8b-3652fa7dd044"
msgid ""
"\"Hey, hey, the fun is only getting started! I can't wait for the main event!"
"\""
msgstr "\"어이, 어이. 재미있는 일은 이제 시작되고 있다! 메인 이벤트가 너무 기다려지는군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/TristianNearEvi_String
msgctxt "1a15a548-dbde-4f6a-8e32-74df65fa67f2"
msgid ""
"\"Another of Nyrissa's shelters. Everything here screams of suffering, "
"despair and anger.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사의 또 다른 피난처입니다. 여기있는 모든 존재는 절망과 분노에 빠져 고통 속에 비명을 지릅니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/CompanionBarks/ValerieNearEvi_String
msgctxt "302df0c5-eca0-49f3-b5a7-f2adc3db8bd0"
msgid "\"I am ready for battle. Lead on!\""
msgstr "\"저는 싸울 준비가 되었습니다. 앞장서십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/ElvenKingBark1_String
msgctxt "5657ae75-f911-466a-8a2a-f95f10613bba"
msgid ""
"\"I came, just as I promised. I will stand shoulder to shoulder with you "
"against the monster.\""
msgstr "\"약속한 대로 왔다. 너와 어깨를 나란히 두고 괴물을 상대할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/ElvenKingBark2_String
msgctxt "d082a7ad-eef9-448d-a081-872f431ec865"
msgid "\"Fear me, Nyrissa's servant. I'm here to help finish you!\""
msgstr "\"나이리사의 하인이여. 나를 두려워하라. 널 죽이는걸 돕기 위해 여기 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/HourglassCup_String
msgctxt "648bfd85-7af9-4c38-a175-cd6044fe1a48"
msgid ""
"No matter how innocent or sophisticated the cup known as the Apology may "
"appear, there's the pain and death of a thousand kingdoms inside."
msgstr "사죄라고 불리는 잔의 외견이 아무리 순수하거나 정교할지라도, 거기에는 천 개의 왕국이 겪은 고통과 죽음이 담겨있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/BookcaseFear_String
msgctxt "7abfe257-a68f-40e0-820a-46865486daa3"
msgid "\"Fear\""
msgstr "\"무서움\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/BookcaseLove_String
msgctxt "4b36f4da-6f63-46c0-9f13-25d605750626"
msgid ""
"The charred, broken skeleton of a bookcase. You can barely make out the word "
"on the plate in the upper part: \"Love.\""
msgstr "검게 탄 책장의 껍데기입니다. 책장 윗부분에 있는 단어를 간신히 읽을 수 있었 습니다. \"사랑.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/BookcaseSorrow_String
msgctxt "5330e9bc-1134-457d-b204-4afebcf507b0"
msgid "\"Sorrow\""
msgstr "\"슬픔\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/BookcaseWrath_String
msgctxt "93cabd87-c96d-4fc7-a210-b2c80c3c566c"
msgid "\"Wrath\""
msgstr "\"격노\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/FrozenBoneyardGravestone_Nilak_String
msgctxt "0ce5fe8a-edca-4c67-93ad-10b0cbee9ea8"
msgid "\"Here lies Nilak.\""
msgstr "\"여기 닐락이 잠들다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/FrozenBoneyardGravestone_String
msgctxt "8872f122-a2c9-48de-a4d3-1f9f87bb06af"
msgid "\"Here lies {Name}.\""
msgstr "\"여기 {Name}이 잠들다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/GiantKeanBark1_String
msgctxt "5ecd35c5-d954-472c-a26c-59817553544a"
msgid ""
"\"Fionn, my loathsome brother... all those centuries, all those efforts — "
"and for what?\""
msgstr "\"피온. 나의 역겨운 형제여... 수세기 동안 그 노력들은 무엇을 위해서였는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/GiantKeanBark2_String
msgctxt "0240b9ad-0fb8-47c2-a2a4-cd204e0ae19b"
msgid ""
"\"You are dead, my brother. Killed by these miserable mortal creatures. And "
"I'm free. Finally. Free!\""
msgstr "\"너는 죽었다. 형제여. 이 비참한 필멸자가 너를 죽였다. 이제 나는 자유롭다. 드디어. 자유다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/JabberwockStatue_String
msgctxt "9846443b-e86c-46f5-836d-587a45f76d71"
msgid ""
"A Jabberwock statue — silent, but still frightening. There's something "
"uncanny in the fact that Nyrissa, having been defeated and nearly "
"obliterated by this creature, placed a statue of it in the heart of her home."
msgstr ""
"재버워크 동상 — 조용하지만, 여전히 무섭습니다. 기괴한 사실은 나이리사가 이 괴물에게 패배하여 거의 소멸할 뻔했는데도, 그녀의 집 "
"심장부에 이 동상을 놓았다는 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/Throne_String
msgctxt "5e0acb13-e755-48a5-97b0-0a7a878d0cd9"
msgid ""
"It seems that this ornate and shining throne never saw use by its owner."
msgstr "이 화려하고 빛나는 옥좌엔 주인이 사용한 흔적이 없는 것 같습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/WaterclockToBrake_String
msgctxt "50840052-e790-49e0-bf23-00175594d274"
msgid "Break the Waterclock"
msgstr "물시계를 파괴한다"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/Waterclock_String
msgctxt "5c5c7e50-4da0-4306-88a3-c7d434d04a33"
msgid "A waterclock, similar to the one you found in Whiterose Abbey."
msgstr "백장미 수도원에서 찾은 것과 비슷한 물시계입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NewBarks/Well_String
msgctxt "e362c4f9-6e68-48f1-8e50-a2326a056df1"
msgid "The well radiates magic."
msgstr "우물은 마법을 발산합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NyrissaWhenRaisingDead2_String
msgctxt "93c570d1-52b9-4f84-9ce4-e3c7fa4788c8"
msgid "\"You just hide from me. Even in death.\""
msgstr "\"나에게서 숨을 뿐이구나. 심지어 죽어서도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/NyrissaWhenRaisingDead_String
msgctxt "1a05380a-fde2-47bd-80bc-734d611531e0"
msgid ""
"\"The story won't be complete until we gather all the characters, right?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 모든 등장 인물을 모을 때까지는 이야기가 끝나지 않을 것이다, 그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Barks/SanctumDoor_String
msgctxt "621b1464-860c-43c2-b5ba-0aa95fafe40f"
msgid ""
"The door is covered with a foliage pattern, tender flowers alternating with "
"frightening thorns. There are three narrow keyholes in the middle."
msgstr ""
"문은 단풍 패턴으로 덮여 있으며 부드러운 꽃과 무서운 가시가 번갈아 가며 나타납니다. 가운데 세 개의 좁은 열쇠 구멍이 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/BadFearBook_name_String
msgctxt "1362c745-8369-4838-9f16-3e2c61b32cc9"
msgid "\"The Book of Shackles\""
msgstr "\"족쇄의 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/BadFearBook_text_String
msgctxt "a00798fe-5b71-4b77-b373-a773d7df079b"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are empty, but upon opening it, you see candle lights "
"reflecting on sharpened surgical tools. You hear the moans of Madla Stasek, "
"a peasant who volunteered to go under the knife, the dull voice of Jhod "
"grasping the scalpel, Tristian praying. You unmistakably feel terror filling "
"the room. Madla's fear: she doesn't know if she's going to die from the "
"knives now or the disease later. Jhod's fear: what if he lets down his god "
"and his people again? Tristian's fear: he risks incurring Nyrissa's wrath "
"and never returning to the glowing kingdom of Sarenrae, but he so badly "
"wishes to scream out — 'Don't! Don't torture this woman! I'm guilty! I will "
"tell you all about the seeds!' You feel the echo of all these fears, and you "
"see that the barony is tormented by an unknown affliction that pierces your "
"heart."
msgstr ""
"이 책의 페이지는 비어 있지만 책장을 펼치면 날카로운 수술 용 도구에 비친 예리한 촛불을 볼 수 있습니다. 당신은 자발적으로 수술대에 "
"오른 농민인 매들라 스타섹의 신음을 들었고 메스를 든 조드의 둔한 목소리를 듣습니다. 트리스티안은 기도합니다. 당신은 수술실을 채우는 "
"공포감을 느낍니다. 그녀는 지금 칼에 의해 혹은 질병으로 죽을지 알 수 없는 것이 매들라의 두려움입니다. 그의 신과 그의 사람들을 다시 "
"실망시킬 수도 있다는 것은 조드의 공포입니다. 나이리사의 진노를 초래하고 서렌레이의 빛나는 왕국으로 결코 되돌아 오지 못할 위험이 "
"트리스티안의 두려움이지만 그러나 그는 비명을 지르고 싶습니다. '하지 마! 이 여자를 고문하지 마라! 내가 죄인이다! 너에게 모든 일을 "
"설명하겠다!' 당신은 이 모든 두려움의 메아리를 느끼고 당신의 마음을 꿰뚫는 알려지지 않은 고통에 의해 남작이 괴롭힘 당하는 것을 "
"보았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/BadJoyBook_name_String
msgctxt "89bbec3e-fb98-467a-988e-9b9b8d969f8b"
msgid "\"The Book of Joyless Triumph\""
msgstr "\"비통한 승리의 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/BadJoyBook_text_String
msgctxt "855271a1-6c66-4cca-adf5-a9800f3b6ef4"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are empty, but upon opening it, you see... yourself. You "
"stand over the body of the Stag Lord on that distant day, when the fate of "
"the Stolen Lands — and yours — was decided. She, whom you share your sight "
"with, is laughing wickedly in triumph. You feel her vicious joy, hear her "
"thoughts: \"The hound I let slip has taken the stag. Oh, how proud this new "
"hero must be! How little you know, hound, that your life and your death "
"shall serve the mistress' plans. I need only wait a little while. Allow you "
"your toy crown — then steer you to your death, as I have steered the stag. "
"Yet another grain will fall into the cup. Dust, dust — that is what you are!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"이 책의 페이지는 비어 있지만 책장을 펼치자 당신은... 스스로의 모습을 봅니다. 오래전 도둑맞은 땅과 당신의 운명이 결정되었을 때 "
"당신은 수사슴 군주의 시체 위에 서 있습니다. 당신과 시야를 공유하는 그녀는 승리의 기쁨을 누리며 사악하게 웃고 있습니다. 당신은 그녀의 "
"사악한 기쁨을 느끼고 그녀의 생각을 듣습니다. \"내가 풀은 사냥개가 수사슴을 잡았다. 이 새로운 영웅이 정말 자랑스럽구나! 너의 하찮은 "
"생과 사는 여주인의 계획에 달려있다. 나는 그저 잠시 기다릴 필요가 있다. 너에게 장난감 왕관을 허용한다. 내가 사슴을 조종한 것처럼 "
"너를 죽음으로 인도한다. 그러나 또 다른 재 한덩이가 잔에 떨어질 것이다. 잿덩이들... 그것은 너의 존재이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/BadSadnessBook_name_String
msgctxt "4e823aab-9ff2-4dfe-a85e-7e10992aaa3a"
msgid "\"The Book of Bitterness\""
msgstr "\"괴로움의 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/BadSadnessBook_text_String
msgctxt "cb86017a-13e1-4ea1-8e1c-a42eed8c19b7"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are empty, but upon opening it, you see... an exhausted and "
"mangled nymph, barely recognizable as Nyrissa. She sits on a familiar "
"pedestal — the one you saw during your travels through the First World — "
"holding her knees with one arm and staring into the distance. Dim shadows "
"hover around: the formidable silhouette of a Jabberwock, screams of her "
"sister nymphs, falling under the monster's blows. The bitterness of defeat, "
"the burden of grief and sorrow weigh down on your shoulders with endless "
"despair, and pin you to the ground."
msgstr ""
"이 책의 페이지는 비어 있지만 책장을 펼치자 당신은... 나이리사로 보이는 피곤하고 엉망이 된 님프가 보입니다. 그녀는 태초 세계를 "
"여행하는 동안 보았던 받침대에 앉아 있습니다. 그녀는 한 팔로 무릎을 안고 먼 곳을 응시합니다. 희미한 그림자가 주변에 나타납니다. "
"재버워크의 거대한 그림자, 비명을 지르는 그녀의 자매 님프, 괴물의 일격에 쓰러지는 모습이 그것입니다. 패배의 괴로움과 슬픔과 비통의 "
"짐은 끊임없는 절망이 되어 어깨를 짓눌러 발이 떨어지지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/BadWrathBook_name_String
msgctxt "2680e759-b255-4647-a4c9-0aa4cc8ef6e7"
msgid "\"The Book of Blind Revenge\""
msgstr "\"눈먼 복수의 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/BadWrathBook_text_String
msgctxt "8a1b741b-12cc-44c4-99bc-89bad2481a69"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are empty, but upon opening it, you see the Everblooming "
"Flower in front of you. The embodiment of Nyrissa's blazing wrath, her "
"insane desire to exact revenge upon the whole world, intoxicates your heart "
"with the same madness. Thousands of years of despair, thousands of years of "
"a mangled soul, thousands of years of searching for what was stolen away, "
"lost. The blinding rage is so strong that it feels as though it's your own."
msgstr ""
"이 책의 페이지는 비어 있지만 책장을 펼치자 당신은 눈 앞에 영원히 피는 꽃이 보입니다. 나이리사의 타오르는 격노의 화신은 모든 세계에 "
"복수하려고 하는 그녀의 미친 욕망으로 당신의 마음을 똑같은 광기로 중독시킵니다. 수천 년의 절망, 수천 년의 망가진 영혼, 수천 년 동안 "
"도둑맞은, 잃어버린 것을 찾는 갈망이 느껴집니다. 눈먼 분노는 너무나 강해서 마치 당신의 것처럼 느껴집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GoodFearBook_name_String
msgctxt "96049384-3a01-4c03-a981-d0b51f5cdc2d"
msgid "\"The Book of the Journey\""
msgstr "\"여행의 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GoodFearBook_text_String
msgctxt "1bdddff1-74ee-4f60-9204-4889ee47de01"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are empty, but upon opening it, you see a road. Somewhere "
"far behind is Restov, where you accepted your mission. The Stolen Lands "
"spread open before you. Hills and swamps, ravines and rivers — along with "
"hundreds of cruel cutthroats and thousands of monsters. Will you be able to "
"conquer this land? The uncertainty is humbling, but the fear gives you "
"strength and readies your blood."
msgstr ""
"이 책의 페이지는 비어 있지만 책장을 펼치자 길이 보입니다. 멀리 뒤에 있는 레스토프가 당신의 임무를 받아들였습니다. 도둑맞은 땅이 당신 "
"앞에 펼쳐져 있습니다. 수많은 잔인무도한 자들과 수천 마리의 괴물과 함께 언덕과 늪, 협곡과 강이 보입니다. 당신은 이 땅을 정복할 수 "
"있습니까? 불확실성에 자신이 초라해지지만 두려움은 당신에게 힘을주고 피를 끓게 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GoodJoyBook_name_String
msgctxt "c4ea6427-595f-47ad-a589-815e1fc4ffdd"
msgid "\"The Book of the New Beginning\""
msgstr "\"새로운 시작의 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GoodJoyBook_text_String
msgctxt "745cede0-f827-4e0b-a23f-f29fc1f35a14"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are empty, but upon opening it, you see that clear sunny "
"day when you walked the pavements of your capital for the first time. You "
"hear Kesten showing the way, citizens greeting you politely. The air is "
"filled with expectation and hope: hundreds of people have come, in search of "
"a new home, a new fate. A future. And however vague and uncertain that "
"future might be — at this moment their hearts are filled with joy."
msgstr ""
"이 책의 페이지는 비어 있지만 책장을 펼치자 당신은 맑은 날에 처음으로 수도의 도로를 걸었던 것을 볼 수 있습니다. 케스턴이 길을 "
"알려주는 것을 듣고 시민들이 당신을 정중하게 인사합니다. 공기는 기대와 희망으로 가득 차 있습니다. 새로운 집과 새로운 운명, 미래를 "
"찾아 수많은 사람들이 왔습니다. 미래 말입니다. 그러나 미래가 있을지 알 수 없는 모호하고 불확실한 순간일지라도그들의 마음은 기쁨으로 "
"가득 차 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GoodSadnessBook_name_String
msgctxt "6eec9799-8f0d-4745-9663-443cfd744a38"
msgid "\"The Book of Never Saying Goodbye\""
msgstr "\"작별 인사는 결코 하지 말라 조언하는 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GoodSadnessBook_text_String
msgctxt "4997974a-3292-4506-9afa-704f6740eeb6"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are empty, but upon opening it, you see... Linzi. The "
"daring bard is lying on the cold floor of the House at the Edge of Time, "
"marking the last moments of her life. There's a flash of darkness, and "
"then... strange feelings fill your soul. \"The cover grows heavy. The pages "
"rustle. My voice and the words — the words are now me, and I am the words. "
"What is happening to me? Who am I?\"\n"
"You feel Linzi's astonishment, then understanding, and then sorrow, sweet "
"sorrow. \"The life I know is past. Gone with all its plans and hopes. But "
"this is a new life. The adventure will not end. The story does not end. And "
"what I have lost, I have not lost in vain!\""
msgstr ""
"아무것도 쓰이지 않은 책이지만, 책장을 넘기자... 린지의 모습이 보입니다. 모험을 좋아하던 음유시인은 시간의 끝에 선 집, 차가운 "
"바닥에 누워 인생의 마지막 순간을 기념합니다. 어둠 속에서 잠시 섬광이 번뜩이고는... 이상한 기운이 당신의 영혼을 어루만집니다. "
"\"무거운 책 표지. 페이지는 바스락거리고. 내 목소리, 책 속의 단어가... 나예요. 나는 단어가 되었어요. 내게 무슨 일이 일어난 "
"걸까요? 나는 누구죠?\"\n"
"린지가 몹시 놀라며 상황을 이해하려는 것이 느껴집니다. 곧 린지는 슬픔으로, 행복한 눈물을 흘립니다. \"내가 아는 인생은 과거가 "
"되었어요. 목표도, 바람도 다 옛날이야기가 돼 버렸죠. 하지만 새로운 삶이 시작되고 있어요. 모험은 끝나지 않아요. 이야기는 계속되고요. "
"내가 뒤로 한 모든 것은, 헛되이 잊히지 않을 거예요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GoodWrathBook_name_String
msgctxt "b76d3f0c-1727-4a0a-8374-611af2f78d98"
msgid "\"The Book of Nourishing Rage\""
msgstr "\"불 붙는 분노에 기름을 붓는 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GoodWrathBook_text_String
msgctxt "dd5bc19e-44f8-4b53-80d1-bfcfce586718"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are empty, but upon opening it, you see... King Irovetti. "
"You look at each other through the crimson reflections in a cup of wine. "
"It's the moment before the final battle. Openly or quietly, you've fought "
"for the Stolen Lands from the very beginning. Irovetti tried to take your "
"crown, using Tartuccio and dozens of other agents. And he lost time after "
"time. The king — losing to some upstart! He may not show it, but rage boils "
"in him — a fierce rage that will never let him give up. Is it the same "
"feeling that has led you to victory for so long?"
msgstr ""
"이 책의 페이지는 비어 있지만 책장을 펼치자 당신은... 이로베티 왕이 보입니다. 당신은 와인 잔에 비치는 진홍색 반사를 통해 서로를 "
"보았습니다. 마지막 전투가 있기 직전의 순간입니다. 공개적으로 또는 조용히 당신은 처음부터 도둑맞은 땅을 위해 싸웠습니다. 이로베티는 "
"타투치오와 다른 수십의 대원을 활용하여 당신의 왕관을 가져가려고 했습니다. 그리고 그는 매번 패배했습니다. 그 왕은 신출내기에게 "
"졌습니다! 그는 보여주지는 않았지만 분노가 그 안에서 끓습니다. 결코 포기하지 않을 엄청난 격노입니다. 오랫동안 당신을 승리로 인도했던 "
"느낌과 같습니까?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GreedBook_name_String
msgctxt "6a973ef8-a9ca-4e8d-aab7-7a53c0b3dae6"
msgid "\"THE BOOK OF INCREDIBLE AND SCANDALOUS PARSIMONY\""
msgstr "\"믿을 수 없을 만큼 놀라운 인색함의 책\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/BookQuest/GreedBook_text_String
msgctxt "a29ff015-4abd-4a03-b231-9ab42761e808"
msgid ""
"The book is empty and shows you nothing. But there's some scribbling on the "
"first page: 'If you paid that much money for a knickknack, you are anything "
"but parsimonious!\""
msgstr ""
"이 책은 비어 있으며 아무것도 보여주지 않습니다. 하지만 첫 페이지에는 낙서가 휘갈겨져 있습니다. '아주 작은 것을 위해 돈을 많이 "
"썼다면, 너는 구두쇠가 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "cefe47c0-d171-429c-b94d-bd6ab4b4e8ae"
msgid "\"What is this place?\""
msgstr "\"이곳은 어디야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "82abf95e-ef80-40cf-9fe5-2a91159b1b4d"
msgid "\"I killed you. Why are you here again?\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 죽였다. 왜 또 여기에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "61af025f-0d0f-4666-8e23-d4ced59329ae"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "22b3e784-4e4e-41e6-98e3-83f1ee0d79fc"
msgid "\"Where is Nyrissa?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "a8bad95a-5a0a-459e-b77b-881ca0fd1ff2"
msgid "\"How do I get inside?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 들어가야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "191ab0b5-1c40-499f-b507-bf706bf5b4df"
msgid ""
"\"I saw Linzi talking to Nyrissa here, in the yard. What was it? A vision or "
"an illusion?\""
msgstr "\"나는 린지가 여기에서 나이리사와 이야기하고 있는 것을 보았다. 그것은 무엇이었지? 환영이나 환상인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "300f3b7c-9b50-4ba1-8ed8-7c72cb00d24f"
msgid "\"Why are you helping me?\""
msgstr "\"왜 나를 돕는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0026_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "965b065e-220e-4e15-995a-76c0ffa0bcc9"
msgid "Killed the nereid Evindra when she offered help."
msgstr "도움을 청하는 네레이드 에빈드라를 죽입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "7b92ee96-7bb8-4490-93e7-102b13bc0429"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"I think I've made it clear that I don't want to have anything to "
"do with you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너와 아무 상관이 없다는 것을 분명히 하고 싶군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "620922a1-8b8e-4d9f-8f44-51f0059e82da"
msgid ""
"\"Once I visited Nyrissa's dominion — in a dream. As soon as I got here, a "
"great radiance appeared...\""
msgstr "\"꿈에서 나이리사의 영역을 방문했다. 여기 도착하자마자 큰 빛이 나타났다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6f5c4103-abd0-4415-b801-9418d18a76d3"
msgid "Agreed to an alliance with Evindra."
msgstr "에빈드라와 동맹을 맺습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "8d27f7b1-8926-4838-a070-047c2b5c45de"
msgid "\"Fine, I'll play along. How can you help me?\""
msgstr "\"좋다. 동의하겠다. 나를 어떻게 도와줄 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "1ccd0640-5394-4c50-b674-fcf4eeadc30f"
msgid ""
"\"Evindra, a reflection in the mirror talked to me in the House. It's a "
"human, a wizard, and he had the same lantern you gave me. Do you know "
"anything about him?\""
msgstr ""
"\"에빈드라. 거울 속의 환영이 그 집에서 나에게 말했다. 그것은 인간 마법사였고 네가 나에게 준 랜턴을 가지고 있었다. 그에 대해 아는 "
"것이 있는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "f5d778f0-4a00-43df-b050-3850f6029c19"
msgid ""
"\"The Knurly Witch offered me a deal — her key to Nyrissa's Shrine in return "
"for the Wriggling Man's life.\""
msgstr "\"옹이 마녀가 나에게 제안을 하나 했다 — 꿈틀거리는 남자의 생명을 대가로 나이리사의 성소로 가는 열쇠를 주기로 했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "7952a424-956a-4f56-acc0-d306423823e3"
msgid ""
"\"The Wriggling Man offered me his key from the Shrine in return for the "
"Knurly Witch's life.\""
msgstr "\"꿈틀거리는 남자는 옹이 마녀의 목숨과 성소로 가는 그의 열쇠를 바꾸자고 제안했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "47aa1120-0476-4414-a912-270f83c5028d"
msgid ""
"\"My head is spinning from all your fey dealings. Can you explain again "
"what's going on and what it all means?\""
msgstr "\"페이와의 거래 때문에 머릿속이 복잡하다. 무슨 일이 일어났는지 그것이 무엇을 의미하는지 다시 설명해줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4e1b0066-d887-467f-a1c6-d7cfcc566307"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid seems to be paler than usual, but her blue eyes glow with "
"resolution.{/n} \"{d|c51 Evindra Capital}I{/d} was so afraid you might not "
"get here, but you made it! Although getting here is just a small part of "
"what must be done to survive and win...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드는 평소보다 창백한 것처럼 보이지만 파란 눈은 결심으로 빛납니다.{/n} \"{d|c51 Evindra "
"capital}나는{/d} 네가 여기 오지 않을까봐 두려웠지만 결국에 왔다! 여기에 오는 것이 생존과 승리를 위해 해야할 일 중의 일부에 "
"불과할지라도... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "00f954b0-2365-453c-8d53-f4a5c932740e"
msgid ""
"{n}Evindra the nereid, who you killed at the {g|Whiterose Abbey}Whiterose "
"Abbey{/g}, icily stares at you with her huge blue eyes.{/n} \"So this is it. "
"You are my {d|c51 Evindra Killed}murderer{/d} and my final chance as well. I "
"suspected that you would get here sooner or later. It seems I have no other "
"choice but to help you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드 에빈드라는 {g|Whiterose Abbey}백장미 수도원{/g}에서 당신에게 죽음을 당했지만 거대한 푸른 눈으로 당신을 "
"차갑게 응시합니다.{/n} \"그래서 이게 다야. 너는 {d|c51 Evindra killed}살인자{/d}이고 나의 기회이기도 하다. "
"네가 조만간 여기에 올거라 생각했다. 너를 도울 다른 선택의 여지가 없는 것 같다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "05815d60-09ff-4f00-9da4-c29a386e03d3"
msgid "\"You're back! Do you need a hint or any help?\""
msgstr "\"돌아왔군! 힌트나 도움이 필요한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "64eea8ed-4268-4036-a94a-a0b39d362263"
msgid ""
"\"I see that you... have changed. It's strange, but I feel the ghost of "
"something very familiar — of the former Nyrissa. Nymphs can bestow special "
"powers on those who they care about, but Nyrissa seemed to have lost this "
"ability together with the love that was torn from her heart. And yet... how "
"did you do it? It's her gift, and it ties you to {g|First World}the First "
"World{/g}. It's a thin thread, and a feeble one, but it must allow you to be "
"reborn here, as we are.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 변한 모습이... 보인다. 이상하지만 이전의 나이리사의 아주 친숙한 유령을 느낀다. 님프는 관심있는 사람에게 특별한 능력을 "
"부여할 수 있지만 그녀의 마음에서 사랑을 잃어버린 이후로 나이리사는 이 능력을 함께 잃은 것처럼 보였다. 하지만... 어떻게 했지? 이건 "
"그녀의 능력이고 너와 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 연결한다. 그것은 가늘고 힘없는 실이지만 네가 우리처럼 다시 여기에서 "
"태어나게 한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "0b441328-7e62-40cc-b17d-f5004395fb1f"
msgid ""
"\"Before you continue, remember two things. First — the House is full of "
"phantoms, living memories of what has happened. You can see them but you "
"cannot change the past. Second — the House lives not only in multiple times, "
"but in two... states. I call them 'reality' and 'irreality', although each "
"is real in its way, dangerous in its way, and each has its own secrets. One "
"is {g|First World}the First World{/g} as it is. The other — the world of "
"Nyrissa's thoughts and dreams.\""
msgstr ""
"\"계속하기 전에 두 가지만 기억하길 바란다. 첫째, 이 집은 유령으로 가득 차서 일어난 일에 대한 추억을 가지고 산다. 너는 과거를 볼 "
"수 있지만 바꿀 수는 없다. 둘째, 이 집은 여러번 살 뿐 만 아니라... 두 상태로 산다. 나는 그것을 '현실'과 '부조리'이라 부르고 "
"있는데 모두 실제적이고 위험하고 각각 고유의 비밀을 지니고 있다. 하나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 그것과 같다. "
"다른 하나는 나이리사의 생각과 꿈의 세계이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "cfa544b0-510a-4884-ab72-ed9b71482377"
msgid ""
"\"The sorcerous mist you see here exists in both reality and irreality. It "
"was created by Nyrissa to guard her dominion from invasion. It will hurl you "
"between reality and irreality, and all about, preventing you from reaching "
"the heart of the House and other secret nooks. But I've brought something "
"that will help you. Take this lantern. Light it and hold it high, and the "
"mist will have no power over you. But if you need to step from reality to "
"irreality or back, then hide the lantern and let the mist carry you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기에서 보이는 마법의 안개는 현실과 부조리 모두에 존재한다 .나이리사가 적의 공격으로부터 자신의 지배권을 지키기 위해 만들어졌다. "
"이것은 너를 현실과 부조리 사이에 던져 버릴 것고 이 집의 심장부와 다른 비밀 장소에 진입하는 것을 막을 것이다. 너를 도울 물건을 가져 "
"왔다. 이 등불을 가져가라. 높이 들고 비추면 안개의 영향력이 사라진다. 그러나 현실에서 부조리로 나아가거나 반대로 되돌아 가야 한다면 "
"등불을 숨기고 안개를 따라가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "d817a8ae-a9aa-4020-b04e-c02192ce5571"
msgid ""
"\"You are holding Briar... it's an artifact of great power. Use it wisely!\""
msgstr "\"너는 찔레를 가지고 있군... 그것은 위대한 힘을 가진 유물이다. 현명하게 사용하길 바란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "80855231-c087-49f5-8662-d523309d07ec"
msgid ""
"\"And last piece of advice. An artifact of great power and sorrow, Briar, is "
"hidden somewhere in the House. Find it, and use it wisely!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 마지막 충고를 하겠다. 위대한 힘과 슬픔을 가진 유물 찔레는 이 집 어딘가에 숨겨져 있다. 그것을 찾아 현명하게 사용하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "1244ccca-18ba-4bb1-924c-b8ef3d302b60"
msgid ""
"\"I knew we'd meet {d|c51 Evindra Exiled}again{/d}.\" {n}Evindra the nereid, "
"who you last saw at the {g|Whiterose Abbey}Whiterose Abbey{/g}, is staring "
"at you.{/n} \"Nyrissa has become more and more restless and reckless lately. "
"It was easy to guess that someone was interfering with her plans — and even "
"easier guess who it might be. You are in grave danger, {mf|king|queen}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 {d|c51 Evindra Exiled} 다시{/d} 만날 줄 알았다.\" {n}{g|Whiterose Abbey}백장미 "
"수도원{/g}에서 마지막으로 봤던 네리이드 에빈드라가 당신을 쳐다보고 있습니다.{/n} \"나이리사는 최근에 점점 더 불안해하고 "
"난폭해졌다. 누군가가 그녀의 계획을 방해하고 있는 것이 분명하고 그것이 누구인지 쉽게 짐작할 수 있다. 너는 심각한 위험에 처해있다. "
"{mf|왕|여왕}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "4a3b298d-67c8-41ef-afb7-1d6b258b8336"
msgid ""
"\"It is called the House at the Edge of Time. It's Nyrissa's place of power, "
"her citadel in {g|First World}the First World{/g}. It is frozen in time... "
"and scattered throughout time. There are rooms of eternal 'tomorrow' and "
"rooms where something that happened long ago still lingers. If a random "
"guest took a bite from an apple and left it here a thousand years ago — it "
"would remain unaltered to this day. I know it's difficult to understand for "
"a mortal. Even among us, the children of the First World, only "
"{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}, the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} of Time, can fully comprehend "
"these mysteries.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이곳은 시간의 끝에 선 집이라고 불린다. 나이리사의 권좌이며, {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 존재하는 그녀의 "
"요새이다. 그것은 시간이 멈춘 곳이다... 그리고 시간이 흩어져 있는 곳이기도 하다. 영원한 '내일'의 방과 오래 전에 일어났음에도 "
"여전히 남아있는 방이 있다. 누군가 천 년 전에 사과를 베어물고 여기에 두었다고 하면 오늘날까지도 변하지 않을 것이다. 필멸자에게는 "
"이해하는 것이 어렵다는 것을 알고 있다. 심지어 태초 세계의 자손인 우리들 중에서도, 시간의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}인 "
"{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}만이 이 신비를 완전히 이해할 수있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "f84949b4-2b20-4c74-9dd3-8dd035455659"
msgid ""
"\"Everywhere and nowhere. This is her dominion. Here she may hide in any "
"shadow — and turn any shadow into a weapon. Nyrissa does not prefer open "
"confrontation... she will try to defeat you through her servants, and she "
"won't appear until the end. I suppose, though, that there is one place that "
"is especially important to her. It's a room in the heart of the House, on "
"the second floor — the Shrine where her cup, the Apology, is kept. If you "
"reach this place, Nyrissa will appear. She would have no choice.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 곳이기도 하고 아무곳도 아니기도 하다.\"여기는 그녀의 영역이다. 그녀는 어떤 그림자에서도 숨을 수 있고 그림자를 무기로 바꿀 "
"수 있다. 나이리사는 개방된 전투를 선호하지 않는다... 그녀는 하인들을 이용해 너를 물리치기 위해 노력할 것이고, 마지막까지 나타나지 "
"않을것이다. 그럼에도, 나는 그녀에게 특별히 중요한 장소가 하나 있다고 생각한다. 그것은 이 집 2층의 중앙에 있는 방이다. 그리고 바로 "
"그녀의 잔, 사죄가 보관되어 있는 성소이다. 거기에 도달하면 나이리사가 나타날 것이다. 그녀에게는 선택의 여지가 없을 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "ab92d19d-4d89-471c-a95c-e85395854611"
msgid ""
"\"A memory. The house showed you what happened here in the recent past.\""
msgstr "\"기억이다. 이 집은 최근에 일어난 일을 너에게 보여주었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0021_NyrKnows_Text_String
msgctxt "55260741-fceb-47ad-9441-1c4cd34393b7"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa knows you are here. And she has gathered many — ones she thought "
"were connected to you, those she could reach. All your companions are here — "
"there, inside, trapped by her spell. She seems to enjoy taking from others "
"something that is useful or precious to them...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사는 네가 여기 있다는 것을 알고 있다. 그리고 그녀는 너와 연결되어 있다고 생각되는 많은 것들, 그녀가 접촉할 수있는 것들을 "
"모았다. 너의 친구들은 모두 그녀의 주문에 갇혀 여기에 있다. 그녀는 다른 자들이 소중하다고 생각하는 것들을 빼앗는 것을 즐긴다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0022_NyrKnowsParty_Text_String
msgctxt "0e91de9f-b281-4206-8726-98db54d0a2b0"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa knows that you are here. It was she who made you leave the portal "
"last. She has taken your companions. And not only them, but everyone she "
"thought was connected to you, those she could reach. Nyrissa has a... "
"peculiar sense of justice, if you can call it that. You've taken so many "
"toys from her — her 'skylark', me, Armag, Irovetti... And now she's taken "
"your toys.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사는 네가 여기 있다는 것을 알고 있다. 네가 마지막으로 포털을 떠나게 한 것은 그녀였다. 그녀는 너의 동료를 데려왔다. 그들 "
"뿐만 아니라 그녀가 연결되어 있다고 생각되는 많은 것들, 그녀가 접촉할 수있는 것들을 모았다. 나이리사는... 정의에 관한 특별한 감각이 "
"있다고 할 수 있다. 너는 그녀의 많은 장난감들을 빼앗아 갔다. '종달새', 나, 아르막, 이로베티... 그리고 그녀는 너의 장난감을 "
"가져갔다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "8b9c5e70-fda7-4af7-86a0-0594d0790f80"
msgid ""
"\"There is a well here — magical, just like everything here. It will allow "
"you to get inside the House. Get used to it — here in {g|First World}the "
"First World{/g}, things can have very unexpected uses. Be careful! Nyrissa "
"will know your every step inside, and she will do her best not to let you "
"leave. You — your kingdom — is the last grain of dust for the Apology. There "
"is no way back for her, or for you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기에는 마법의 우물이 있는데 모든 것이 여기에 있다. 우물을 통해 집 안으로 들어갈 수있다. {g|First World}태초 "
"세계{/g}에서는 예기치 않은 일들이 일어나기도 하니 적응해야 한다. 조심해라! 나이리사는 너의 모든 움직임을 알 것이고 네가 떠나지 "
"않도록 최선을 다할 것이다. 너와 네 왕국은 사죄를 위한 마지막 먼지이다. 그녀를 위해 또는 너를 위해 돌아갈 방법이 없다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "7a71a86b-5ece-4f0e-a69d-df3304952c93"
msgid "\"Come back if you need help!\""
msgstr "\"도움이 필요하면 다시 오길 바란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "d729955d-066c-4837-a130-854c70b669d4"
msgid ""
"\"You are in {g|First World}the First World{/g}, and I am its child. Here in "
"our homeland, we don't die forever, but return to life again. The {g|Stolen "
"Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} have always been especially close to the First World, "
"and since they were overwhelmed by the Bloom, the laws of life and death "
"that govern the fey began to work there as well.\n"
"You can try to kill me if you wish. But far better that you listen. You "
"require help, and I need someone who can stop Nyrissa.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 있고, 나는 이 세계의 자손이다. 우리의 고향인 이곳에서, 우리는 영원히 죽지 "
"않고 다시 삶을 되찾는다. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}은 특히나 항상 태초 세계와 가까웠고, 또한 개화에 압도당했기 "
"때문에, 페이를 지배하는 삶과 죽음의 법칙이 똑같이 작용하기 시작했다.\n"
"원한다면 나를 죽일 수 있다. 그러나 내 말을 듣는 것이 훨씬 좋을 것이다. 너는 도움이 필요하고 나는 나이리사를 막을 수 있는 사람이 "
"필요하다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "fcbfc963-9a54-42a7-95a1-9b28cfe4cd1f"
msgid ""
"\"You've been to {g|Whiterose Abbey}Whiterose Abbey{/g}. You've seen what "
"Nyrissa did to me. I know what a monster she's turned into, and can't help "
"wishing with all my heart that I could stop her. It might sound strange, but "
"I'm ready to kill her. I love her too much to see her like this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Whiterose Abbey}백장미 수도원{/g}에 가보았겠지. 나이리사가 나에게 한 것을 보았을 것이다. 나는 그녀가 변한 "
"괴물의 정체를 알고 내 마음을 다해 그녀를 막을 수 있기를 바랄 수 밖에 없었다. 이상하게 들리겠지만 나는 그녀를 죽일 준비가 되어있다. "
"나는 그녀를 너무 많이 사랑해 이렇게 그녀를 만나려 한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "651c9788-318c-4122-a37e-09c90cb9866c"
msgid "\"I'll tell you everything that I know. You must have questions...\""
msgstr "\"내가 아는 모든 것을 말해주겠다. 하고 싶은 질문이 있을 것이다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "cdf8b027-ea92-4d9f-aa35-3a3fc2ed96d3"
msgid ""
"{n}Evindra shakes her head sadly.{/n} \"No. But this House has been the "
"death of many upon many. As for the lantern... I took it once from the body "
"of an unfortunate traveler, who accidentally stumbled into {g|First World}"
"the First World{/g} and died here. But I know well who gives such gifts. "
"It's the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} — one of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, "
"the one whose lips once cursed Nyrissa. It's better if you never meet him.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에빈드라는 머리를 슬프게 저었습니다.{/n} \"아니. 하지만 이 집은 많은 자들의 죽음이 쌓여왔다. 등불에 관해서는... 나는 "
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 발을 들였다가 불행한 여행자의 시체를 우연히 발견했고 거기서 얻었다. 그러나 나는 누가 "
"그런 선물을 주는 지 잘 안다. 그건 {g|Eldest}원로{/g} 중 하나인 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이다. 그는 한 때 "
"나이리사를 저주했다. 그는 만나지 않는 것이 좋다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "75acf800-b4fe-4895-9f38-2e5a1bea4da3"
msgid ""
"\"Do what you feel is right, but I would be three times as careful with "
"either of those two. They are Nyrissa's most loyal servants, who she took to "
"her bosom after she stopped trusting us, her friends and sisters. Their "
"souls are full of evil, just like her soul is now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 느끼는 것은 옳지만 나는 그 둘을 3배는 더 조심스럽게 대할 것이다. 그들은 나이리사의 가장 충성스러운 종이며 그녀가 우리와 "
"그녀의 친구 자매들을 신뢰하는 것을 멈추고 가슴에 품은 자들이다. 지금 그녀의 영혼처럼 그들의 영혼은 악으로 가득 차 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "5b6e1faa-1666-4255-9ea1-c48e8dd6ee1b"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. Ages ago, the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} named the {g|LanternKing}"
"Lantern King{/g} cursed Nyrissa and her closest nymph friends. He stripped "
"them of their immortality and turned their souls to evil. Only I managed to "
"avoid the curse, against all odds.\n"
"Part of Nyrissa's soul, the part that was filled with her good and light, "
"was taken out and turned into an artifact called Briar. The Eldest hid it in "
"the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. Nyrissa's servants tried to find it, "
"but to no avail — only the gnome Tartuccio managed to do it, but you must "
"know more about that than I do.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론이다. 수 세기 전, {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이라는 이름의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 나이리사와 그녀의 가장 "
"친한 친구들을 저주했다. 그는 그들의 불멸을 빼앗고 영혼을 악으로 물들였다. 오직 나만이 어려움을 극복하고 저주를 피할 수 있었다.\n"
"선과 빛으로 차 있는 그녀의 영혼의 한 부분을 떼어 찔레라는 유물로 바뀌었다. 원로는 그것을 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 "
"땅{/g}에 숨겼다. 나이리사의 하인은 그것을 찾으려했지만 아무 소용이 없었다. 오직 노움 타투치오 만이 찾을 수 있었고. 하지만 그 "
"내용은 네가 더 잘 알 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/EvindraFW_Dialog/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "ada05046-1f88-4085-91bb-e4e51067e759"
msgid ""
"\"The curse required that Nyrissa destroy a thousand kingdoms. Each time a "
"kingdom was ruined, a grain of dust fell into a magic cup called the "
"Apology. Now there are nine hundred and ninety nine of them — The number of "
"kingdoms fallen to ruin in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. Your "
"kingdom must be the thousandth. If it falls, Nyrissa will be able to go to "
"the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} and ask for forgiveness for her transgression. "
"Please do not let this happen. The Eldest are cruel gods in my world, and "
"they must not triumph.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저주 받은 나이리사는 천개의 왕국을 파괴해야 했다. 왕국이 파멸할 때마다 먼지 한 톨이 사죄라고 불리는 마법의 잔에 떨어졌다. 지금은 "
"999개가 모였다 — {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에서 멸망한 왕국의 수와 같다. 너의 왕국이 천 번째가 될 것이다. "
"그것이 잔에 떨어지면 나이리사는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 가서 자신의 죄를 사면받을 수 있다. 이 일은 일어나지 않도록 해야 "
"한다. 원로는 우리 세계에서 잔인한 신이니, 그들이 승리하도록 놔둬선 안된다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "06a07e3f-5a78-4b2a-890d-e592998ce05f"
msgid "\"What did you do to Linzi?\""
msgstr "\"린지에게 무슨 짓을 한 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a41f124b-9fd6-422b-b932-eb66de95a2ed"
msgid "\"Get out of my way. I want Nyrissa and I will get to her.\""
msgstr "\"내 길을 막지마. 나는 나이리사를 원하고 나는 그녀에게 갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "8a179b88-2b73-4951-b70a-680e6ef2876e"
msgid "[Attack] \"Nyrissa will pay for everything, and so will her servants!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나이리사는 모든 것을 지불 할 것이고 그녀의 하인도 그렇게 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "98ff47a9-f24c-4b1f-a874-9d6610b043fc"
msgid ""
"{n}The Horned Hunter salutes you.{/n} \"Ah, the {mf|king|queen} of the sand "
"castle. You made it? After defeating the Jabberwock... I have to admit — I'm "
"impressed! But what will you do now? Pick up the silly little bard's body?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}뿔난 사냥꾼이 당신에게 경의를 표합니다.{/n} \"아. 모래성의 {mf|왕|여왕}로군. 결국 해냈나? 재버워크를 격파한 후에... "
"인정하겠다. 나는 감동했다! 그러나 지금은 무엇을 할 거지? 어리석은 음유시인의 시체를 거둘 것인가? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "19b27fee-c733-4f6b-a2bb-3cf243cbf00c"
msgid ""
"{n}The Horned Hunter shrugs, then nods at the breathless body on the "
"floor.{/n} \"She thought she could trick the mistress. Well, she's not the "
"first one, and she won't be the last.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}뿔난 사냥꾼은 어깨를 으쓱하고 바닥에 누운 숨결 없는 몸을 향해 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그녀는 여주인을 속일 수 있다고 생각했다. "
"글쎄. 그녀는 처음이 아니고 마지막이 되지도 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "a6927b41-91b4-4d4f-bdf7-9aa4365ad339"
msgid ""
"\"No, silly creature. It's Nyrissa who wants you. You are the last grain of "
"dust that will fall in the Apology. And I will bring this grain to her!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니다. 어리석은 생물아. 나이리사가 너를 원한다. 너는 사죄에 떨어지는 마지막 먼지다. 그리고 나는 그 알갱이를 그녀에게 가져다 줄 "
"것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "a04e750a-8e24-4a85-a8eb-5e50a6800c7a"
msgid ""
"\"You won't find answers, you'll find death. It's time to fill the "
"mistress's cup!'"
msgstr "\"너는 대답을 찾지 못할 것이고 죽음을 발견할 것이다. 여주인의 잔을 채워야 할 때이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "ca71f1bf-6d39-4fb6-bd9f-dbcd6c59bd40"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia's eyes are filled with tears, but she angrily wipes them away "
"with a jerking motion.{/n} \"You'll pay for this, you hear me?!\""
msgstr "{n}옥타비아의 눈은 눈물로 가득 차 있지만 눈물을 거칠게 닦고는 분노합니다.{/n} \"너는 죗값을 치를 거야. 알겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "92e08b3b-691f-489c-be9a-9b1ffbc29a7b"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri's face is like a stone mask. She almost growls as she speaks.{/n} "
"\"Hold on, carrion. Better yet — call your mistress. You both have a lot to "
"answer for!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리의 얼굴은 돌처럼 굳었습니다. 그녀의 목소리는 말 그대로 으르렁 거립니다.{/n} \"잠깐 썩어빠진 녀석아. 네 여주인을 "
"부르는 게 나을 거다. 둘 다 대답에 답해야 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/HornedHunter_Boss/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Kalikke_Companion
msgctxt "258d33f1-37e3-45a9-861b-d18bd593a094"
msgid ""
"\"No, no… dear Linzi – why?! I feel like I've lost another sister…\" {n}"
"Kalikke covers her face with her hands.{/n}"
msgstr "\"안돼... 안돼... 사랑스러운 린지를 어째서?! 내 여동생이 죽었어…\" {n}칼리케는 손으로 얼굴을 훔칩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d09b7754-8169-4ee2-89fc-d681b8b44f77"
msgid "\"Show me your wares, Issili.\""
msgstr "\"물건을 보여줘. 이실리.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "55698def-94df-4bd5-87a6-441cefd9dfc6"
msgid "\"What is Sinmarket?\""
msgstr "\"죄악의 시장이란 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "71cf27a7-2e7f-4d35-882a-bae89d5919c3"
msgid "\"What will happen if Nyrissa's servants notice you?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사의 하인이 너를 목격하면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "016e2390-8aa6-4f0e-8c62-134b32cf9077"
msgid "[Attack] \"I don't trust wretches like you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 너 같은 비참한 자들을 믿지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "975aae05-143f-4027-922f-0ba16fcd5d09"
msgid "\"I have to go. Grave dangers won't wait!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야만 한다. 중대한 위험은 언제든 찾아온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "fab30759-adb9-409f-9013-b87f64f3a824"
msgid "\"What are these strange books you're selling?\""
msgstr "\"네가 팔고 있는 이 이상한 책들은 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f23e724d-0cf6-4e97-8bb9-6d7147401c04"
msgid ""
"{n}A fey, nimble and bright like a butterfly, waves to you.{/n} \"Hello, "
"hello! I am Issili, messenger from the Tent of Profiteering on Others' "
"Misfortunes — from the Sinmarket! I will be happy to sell you useful "
"potions, scrolls and supplies... at a terribly inflated price. And if you "
"happen to seize something valuable while fighting in the House at the Edge "
"of Time — you can sell it to me. Profiteering on Nyrissa's misfortune is a "
"delightful honor.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나비처럼 민첩하고 밝은 페이가 당신에게 인사합니다.{/n} \"안녕! 안녕! 나는 죄악의 시장에서 온 '다른 사람들의 불행으로 "
"폭리를 취하는 천막'의 전령 이실리야! 너에게 유용한 물약, 두루마리, 보급품을 바가지를 씌워 팔게 되어 너무 기뻐! 만약 시간의 끝에 "
"선 집에서 전투 중에 값진 물건을 얻게 된다면 나에게 팔 수 있어. 나이리사의 불운으로 폭리를 취하는 건 기쁜 영광이야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "74601401-900b-4e43-a446-c33aac69ef13"
msgid ""
"\"Are you aware that fairies are reborn sooner or later after they're "
"killed? When we meet again, there's no way I'm giving you a discount! Or I "
"just won't meet you at all. Your loss!\""
msgstr ""
"\"요정들이 죽은 지 얼마되지 않아 다시 되살아나는 사실을 알고 있어? 우리가 다시 만나면 너에게는 절대 할인을 하지 않을 거야! 아니면 "
"너를 만나지 않을 거야. 명복을 빌어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "6a3bc8e1-ed36-4b1f-983b-6c5ccb686a5c"
msgid ""
"\"Hello again. How are things? I hope you are exhausted and desperate?\""
msgstr "\"또다시 안녕. 요즘 어때? 나는 네가 지쳐서 절망적이었으면 좋겠다?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "8c4abb3b-284a-48e9-bd1d-ee112fd75547"
msgid ""
"\"The best market in {g|First World}the First World{/g} — and I'm not lying, "
"not even a little bit. It's in Palenhyr, where followers of all possible and "
"impossible religions flock. Virtue is only good when it firmly resists "
"temptation — and that's what the Sinmarket is for. They sell everything "
"that's considered sinful by the followers of this or that deity there. "
"Literally — EVERYTHING. From Terrible Art to Unearned Second Chances.\""
msgstr ""
"\"손톱 만큼의 거짓도 없이, {g|First World}태초 세계{/g} 최고의 시장이야. 그곳은 가능하거나 불가능한 모든 종교의 "
"신자들이 몰리는 팔레니르에 있지. 미덕은 유혹에 굳건히 저항할 때만 좋은 거야. 그리고 그게 바로 죄악의 시장이 존재하는 이유지. 그들은 "
"이런 저런 신들의 추종자가 저지른 모든 죄악을 팔아. 말 그대로 모든 것을 말이야. 끔찍한 예술에서부터 제 2의 가능성에 이르기까지 "
"말이지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "3a2995d5-7f0e-4022-9213-40a8b2129d0b"
msgid ""
"\"Our tent is the home to the best vendors at the Sinmarket. Messengers from "
"Profiteering on Others' Misfortunes are always around wherever anyone is in "
"trouble. We help those in need! In a most unscrupulous and sordid manner. So "
"please, be my guest.\" {n}Issili winks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리 천막은 죄악의 시장 최고의 상인들이 모인 본거지야. 남의 불행에서 폭리를 취하는 천막의 전령은 언제 어디서나 곤경에 처한 "
"사람들의 주변에 있어. 우리는 도움이 필요한 사람들을 돕는다! 가장 부도덕하고 냉소적인 방식으로 도와. 그러니까, 내 손님이 되어줘.\" "
"{n}이실리는 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "ab59e365-0f4b-4fd1-a3a0-9b2e1c3a9400"
msgid ""
"\"I will happily sell back to them whatever you take from the House and sell "
"to me!\""
msgstr "\"네가 그 집에서 가져온 것을 되팔게 되어 너무 기뻐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "db4adf3a-41d7-4e71-a46f-23a6b52230d4"
msgid ""
"\"Watch out, don't die — or at least do it near the entrance. I'll come "
"to... um... say goodbye!'"
msgstr "\"조심해. 죽지 말라구. 적어도 입구 근처에서 죽어. 내가 찾아가서... 음... 작별 인사를 할게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "93b4dc56-4ff5-497e-b974-e9ff814e42d8"
msgid ""
"\"Hahaha, I love this trick with 'THE BOOK OF INCREDIBLE AND SCANDALOUS "
"PARSIMONY'! It's the perfect test for picking out a good buyer who's ready "
"to squander some money. I might bring The Complete Collection of Useless "
"Writings for you some time. A third edition, signed by the authors!\""
msgstr ""
"\"하하하. 나는 '믿을 수 없을 만큼 놀라운 인색함의 책'의 속임수가 너무 좋아! 돈을 흥청망청 쓰는 호구를 시험할 완벽한 물건이야. "
"나는 너를 위해 완전히 쓸모 없는 책 모음을 가지고 있어. 이번은 저자의 서명이 들어간 3번째 판본이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "0e753584-bca8-4537-b0c4-8a12a3cf1849"
msgid ""
"\"Some creative souls in our world prefer not to waste time on words. "
"Instead they write feelings directly into their books. And why not? I've "
"read 'The Feeling of Uniqueness' to tatters!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리 세계의 일부 독창적인 영혼은 말장난에 시간을 낭비하지 말라고 해. 대신 그들은 책에 직접 감정을 쓰지. 하지만 나는 좋은걸? "
"나는 누더기의 '독창적인 느낌'을 읽었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Issili(Vendor)/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "5b55dc12-4c44-49c7-b229-5134b432af19"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok lets out a jubilant shriek.{/n} \"There! There! Told you! Said "
"so! Books steal think-thoughts, all of them! You believe me now?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}녹-녹은 기쁨에 비명을 터트립니다.{/n} \"저기! 저기야! 말했잖아! 내가 말했어! 책들은 생각을 훔치는거야! 모두 다! 이제 "
"나를 믿을래?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Items/MirrorSplinter_description_String
msgctxt "7b9321af-7b73-4fdc-a461-124bf8297341"
msgid ""
"A shard of a mirror from the House at the Edge of Time. It glimmers, and the "
"dead wizard's figure keeps appearing in it — along with his transformation "
"into the Wriggling Man."
msgstr ""
"시간의 끝에 선 집의 거울 파편입니다. 그것은 희미하게 빛나며 죽은 마법사의 형상이 그 안에서 계속 나타나 뒤틀린 자로 변합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Items/MirrorSplinter_name_String
msgctxt "cb8db1a3-eaa3-4c42-b48d-797ca64c0f9a"
msgid "Shard of Mirror"
msgstr "거울의 파편"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Items/PantryKey_description_String
msgctxt "8230f0bf-543b-4a9b-a407-916c452b0d2f"
msgid "The Knurly Witch's key to her pantry"
msgstr "그녀의 식료품 창고를 열 수 있는 옹이 마녀의 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Items/PantryKey_name_String
msgctxt "dba9073e-ebae-4b47-8f70-feb5a687fd5e"
msgid "Key to the Pantry"
msgstr "식료품 창고 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Items/SanctumKey_description_String
msgctxt "57b4bb74-62e9-4c80-9399-f8ded91c636b"
msgid ""
"One of the three keys that unlock the Shrine — the heart of the House at the "
"Edge of Time."
msgstr "시간의 끝에 선 집의 중심부에 위치한 성소의 잠금을 해제하는 세 가지 열쇠 중 하나입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Items/SanctumKey_name_String
msgctxt "93aaa503-2749-4637-8b1f-7d15775ce1cc"
msgid "Key to the Shrine"
msgstr "성소의 열쇠"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "f928287a-0308-46cb-9f8a-a12a3c812ea7"
msgid "\"How do I find Nyrissa? Tell me and I won't attack you.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사를 어떻게 찾지? 말해주면 공격하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "1c04254c-8e84-47e8-b7fe-7bd707e488dc"
msgid "\"You... don't look like a dweller of the First World. Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너... 태초 세계의 거주자가 아니군. 너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4be6a02d-ac20-4b4a-abea-6ed078ca10d6"
msgid ""
"\"Creatures like you are called annis hags, and when you and your 'sisters' "
"gather into a coven — it doesn't bode well for anyone else in the area, "
"right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너와 같은 생물들은 애니스 해그라고 불리고, 너와 네 '자매'들이 모여 집회를 열 때는 그 지역의 다른 사람들에게는 나쁜 징조이다. "
"그렇지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "f01cb227-8ba9-4138-9918-5797df8ba32f"
msgid "\"Why are you enemies with the Wriggling Man?\""
msgstr "\"왜 꿈틀거리는 남자와 다투는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f05aa410-3c40-4930-b551-43c4c5cc78ac"
msgid "[Attack] \"A wretch like you deserves only death.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너 같이 불쌍한 녀석은 죽음이 어울린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "e151bb3d-f923-4eb2-8a8f-405366e8f251"
msgid "\"What can you offer me in return for the Crown?\""
msgstr "\"왕관을 돌려주면 나에게 무엇을 해줄 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "387c6ebf-2099-4885-9163-b17ce17d23d2"
msgid "\"Why do you need the First Crown?\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관이 왜 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "a758237a-9f17-4e43-9b11-3abccbb4c825"
msgid ""
"\"You know, I talked to the Wriggling Man. He offered me his key to "
"Nyrissa's Shrine in return for your death.\""
msgstr "\"알다시피 나는 꿈틀거리는 남자와 이야기를 나눴다. 그는 너를 죽이면 보답으로 나이리사의 신전 열쇠를 주겠다고 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "934b1ab4-c6f5-429f-bac3-4d44e4d5ec52"
msgid "\"All right, it's a deal.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 거래하자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "54e05aa0-9b1e-4601-86a7-dca522a51c07"
msgid "\"I have other questions.\""
msgstr "\"나는 다른 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "5407bd75-e245-4064-a5d5-70fed2d6ac31"
msgid "\"All right. Give me the key and you can go.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 열쇠를 주면 가도 돼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "8d5449c2-590c-4cb0-9795-ba09844f728b"
msgid "[Attack] \"Hell no! You will die, Witch.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"안돼! 너는 죽을 거다. 마녀.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "c7043baa-a515-4b43-8485-8854f4b1d7ab"
msgid "\"Let me ask you about something else...\""
msgstr "\"다른 것에 대해 물어 보겠다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "c7ec1688-cfdc-45aa-b69a-f56826890fc3"
msgid ""
"\"I want to ask about your feud with the Wriggling Man and the First Crown..."
"\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관에 얽힌 꿈틀거리는 남자와 너의 불화에 대해 묻고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0041_Text
msgctxt "143ff3d0-fa98-4ef8-87fa-72012f2f5000"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like to make decisions like that on the spur of the moment. I'll "
"think about it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그런 순간에 결정을 내리는 것을 좋아하지 않는다. 생각해 보겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "fed35c09-3f18-4795-bc56-df4bf2e90b90"
msgid "[Attack] \"It's easier to just kill you right now and take your key!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"지금 너를 죽이고 열쇠를 가져가는 것이 더 쉽다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "7af5126b-6f4e-4666-9f4b-510029214ade"
msgid "\"I have to go. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0047_Text
msgctxt "e8df2b1f-c33e-4dd0-ad76-15efa82e6b21"
msgid "\"The Wriggling Man is dead, and I have his key to the Shrine.\""
msgstr "\"꿈틀거리는 남자는 죽었다. 나는 성소의 열쇠를 가지고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "4af6240c-5671-483b-be91-b7ed0300d56c"
msgid ""
"\"I talked to the Wriggling Man. He offered to give me his key if I killed "
"you, and says you lied to me. Who should I believe?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 꿈틀거리는 남자와 이야기를 나눴다. 그는 너의 죽음에 대한 보답으로 그의 열쇠를 주겠다고 했고, 네가 거짓말을 했다고 말했다. "
"나는 누구를 믿어야 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "486da6aa-9c10-418b-8ca9-3daffe45d72e"
msgid "\"Not yet. I have some questions for you.\""
msgstr "\"아직 아니다. 몇 가지 질문이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0053_Text
msgctxt "02bec553-70f2-44cd-a1c3-6e0c05ac484f"
msgid "\"You don't look like Nyrissa's poor prisoner.\""
msgstr "\"너는 나이리사의 불쌍한 포로처럼 보이지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "d5d4cb67-2374-4618-83c4-e7af878021b5"
msgid "\"An amusing story. Let me ask you something else...\""
msgstr "\"재미있는 이야기군. 다른 것을 묻지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0055_Text
msgctxt "f355d531-29c8-4454-8365-3a76a0e0069f"
msgid ""
"\"You belong to a race of dangerous and unpredictable creatures, killers and "
"cannibals — and you're lying to me. I can't say I like any of this, Witch.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 위험하고 예측할 수 없는 살인자와 식인종 같은 종족이다. 게다가 너는 나에게 거짓말을 하고 있다. 어느 것도 마음에 들지 "
"않는다. 이 마녀야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "21122d06-e136-4555-8507-7f54d18fe16b"
msgid "\"You must be not very happy with your service to Nyrissa?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사를 섬겨서 썩 기쁘지는 않은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "8e81768f-e203-41c0-a10b-dd5b03c4337f"
msgid "\"Nyrissa took my companions. Do you know where they are?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 내 친구들을 데려갔다. 그들이 어디에 있는지 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0062_Text
msgctxt "76892f30-46c0-45d0-a1cf-f684f9c3eb4a"
msgid "\"What kind of creature is he?\""
msgstr "\"그는 어떤 종류의 생물인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0064_Text
msgctxt "0a0f452c-59e3-4d08-a68f-d0f29c9701ee"
msgid ""
"\"I gave you a chance for us to part peacefully. Don't you care about your "
"life?\""
msgstr "\"나는 평화롭게 참여할 수있는 기회를 주었다. 살기 싫은 것이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "dd097239-75c4-46f0-ac2c-24402ffb9ba4"
msgid "[Attack] \"You will pay for everything.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"목숨으로 치르거라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0066_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "16603a36-3f4d-4039-a069-ea732681170b"
msgid ""
"Approved of Knurly Witch's cunning methods and threatened her life if she "
"would not join you."
msgstr "옹이 마녀의 교활한 속임수를 칭찬했으며 그녀가 합류하지 않는다면 죽이겠다고 위협했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "8782470e-c044-4737-8adf-76d80a9b141c"
msgid ""
"\"You are a vicious lying wretch, Knurly Witch. And I like it! I can finish "
"you as easily as I defeated your pathetic trap, but I prefer to gain a "
"useful servant. Bow to me — and you shall live.\""
msgstr ""
"\"옹이 마녀, 너는 사악한 거짓말쟁이다. 하지만 마음에 든다! 나는 네 한심한 함정을 피훼한 것처럼 너를 쉽게 끝장낼 수 있다. 그러나 "
"나는 쓸만한 노예를 좋아한다. 나에게 복종해라. 그러면 너는 살 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Answer_0070_Text
msgctxt "e57877fe-6a57-48b7-829e-a376866bbcca"
msgid "\"You lied to me, Witch.\""
msgstr "\"너는 나에게 거짓말을 했다. 마녀.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ebf161a7-a344-4f96-b59f-b54339ec8b03"
msgid ""
"{n}Even groveling, the terrifying creature towers over you. Its dark claws "
"glisten like metal, but the pose doesn't seem threatening. It is more "
"reminiscent of a ruffled bird than a wild animal ready to pounce.{/n} \"So "
"it is you, my little guest! The crone probably frightened you there, near "
"the Castle of Knives? I didn't mean to. It's all because of the Wriggling "
"Man, damn him! He keeps sending disruptors and thieves to me. I turn around "
"and they're standing behind me. I stand up from my bench — and they climb "
"under it!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}천하고 끔찍한 괴물이 당신 위로 솟습니다. 그 짙은 발톱은 금속처럼 빛나지만 자세는 위협적으로 보이지 않습니다. 야생 동물이 "
"뛰어드는 모습 보다는 몸을 부풀린 새가 연상됩니다.{/n} \"작은 손님이로군! 칼날의 성 근처에서 노파가 너에게 겁을 준 것 같은데 "
"맞나? 오해하지 마. 꿈틀거리는 남자 때문이다! 그는 계속해서 훼방꾼과 도둑을 보내고 있다. 내가 돌아서면 그들은 내 뒤에 서 있다. "
"내가 맞서면 그들은 숨어버린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "5bd1e99e-2471-4df2-a851-8d3b7ca9d4b5"
msgid "\"You are back, little guest! So? Did you meet the Wriggling Man?\""
msgstr "\"돌아 왔구나. 작은 손님! 그래서? 꿈틀거리는 남자를 만났는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "f1c24326-a8c6-4242-bf7b-23231d5e6406"
msgid ""
"\"Forgive an old crone her suspicious nature. My life isn't easy, it "
"isn't... By the way, in case you don't know yet, they call me the {d|Knurly}"
"Knurly Witch{/d}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마녀의 의심 많은 성격을 용서해줘. 내 삶은 쉽지 않아. 쉽지 않지... 그런데, 혹시 모를까봐 얘기하는데 그들은 나를 "
"{d|Knurly}옹이 마녀{/d}라 부른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "6daf7401-e6c6-4122-ac6f-23b25d9cbec9"
msgid ""
"{n}The witch shakes her huge head.{/n} \"A lonely old hag. For hundreds of "
"years I lived with my two sisters in the place you call the {g|Stolen Lands}"
"Stolen Lands{/g}. We guarded a magical forest, sheltered treants, shambling "
"mounds, ogres and other wondrous creatures. They praised my sisters and me, "
"calling us the Triune Queen. It was a fine life! But then our forest fell "
"under Lady Nyrissa's gaze, and she reduced it to dust, and made me her "
"servant upon pain of death. I couldn't even think of resisting her...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마녀는 그녀의 큰 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"외로운 늙은 노파라네. 수백 년 동안 나는 두 자매와 함께 네가 {g|Stolen "
"Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}이라 부른 장소에 살았지. 우리는 마법의 숲의 보호 받는 나무 정령, 느릿하게 움직이는 언덕, 오우거와 다른 "
"놀라운 생물을 지켰다. 그들은 나와 내 자매들을 삼위일체 여왕이라고 불렀다. 그것은 훌륭한 삶이었다! 그러나 그 뒤 우리 숲은 나이리사의 "
"눈에 들었고, 그녀는 그곳을 먼지로 만들었으며, 죽음의 고통을 줘 나를 종으로 만들었다. 나는 저항할 생각조차 할 수 없었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "afffc090-c389-43e0-bc3b-7eaae406381a"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, little guest, you want the old Witch to betray her queen? You have no "
"idea what threats she uses to make me serve her. It has been many ages, and "
"I have never dared to raise my head...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 작은 손님. 너는 늙은 마녀가 여왕을 배반하기를 바라는 건가? 그녀가 나를 복종시키기 위해 어떤 위협을 가했는지 너는 모른다. "
"많은 세월이 지났고 나는 머리를 조아리며 산다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "85004141-c78f-4fc6-8a71-33f64682a40e"
msgid ""
"\"I know you {d|c61 Trent Fool}fooled{/d} my servants to take the fragment "
"of the First Crown. Foolish timber! But then again, if I wanted smart "
"servants, I wouldn't have chosen walking logs...\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 첫 번째 왕관의 조각을 가져가기 위해 나의 종을 {d|c61 Trent Fool}속인{/d} 사실을 안다. 어리석은 땔감놈들! "
"하기사 ,내가 똑똑한 종들을 원했다면 걸어다니는 통나무를 선택하지 않았을 테지... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "2e959000-9dcf-4cc3-b72f-b6ce4c341c8e"
msgid ""
"{n}The witch brightens and leans forward, but then slouches again and "
"shrugs.{/n} \"The crown was valuable to me... as a sign of Nyrissa's "
"appreciation. But you aren't here to have tea with the beautiful nymph, are "
"you? What's the point of keeping the Crown if you kill our queen? And if you "
"fail, Nyrissa will take it from your dead body. And perhaps she will give it "
"back to me!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마녀는 밝아져 앞으로 몸을 기대지만 다시 움츠리며 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"왕관은 나에게 가치가 있었다. 나이리사의 감사의 "
"표식으로 말이다. 하지만 너는 아름다운 님프와 함께 차를 마시려고 온 게 아니지? 네가 우리 여왕을 죽이면 왕관을 지키는 것이 무슨 "
"소용인가? 그리고 네가 실패하면 나이리사는 너의 시체에서 그것을 가져올 것이다. 그리고 아마 그것을 나에게 돌려줄 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "8b818415-bf89-4dec-87bf-5b49945763d1"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, if you lived as long as I have in {g|First World}the First World{/g}"
"... The fey see outsiders as curious animals. — Even if you can break their "
"neck in one swoop! Nyrissa gave me the Crown as a mark of distinction. The "
"fey saw that their queen value me, and now they show me respect. But if they "
"decide that I've lost Nyrissa's favor, they'll laugh at me, and make evil "
"jokes as they do. That wriggling offal knew all this — it's why he's always "
"wanted to take the Crown!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 네가 나 만큼 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 오래 살았더라면... 페이는 외부인을 흥미로운 동물로 본다. "
"심지어 손가락을 한 번 튕기기만 해도 네 목을 부러뜨릴 수 있다! 나이리사는 나에게 우수함의 표시로서 왕관을 줬다. 그들의 여왕이 나를 "
"가치있게 여기는 것을 그 페이가 보았고 이제 그들은 나를 존중한다. 그러나 그들이 나이리사의 호의를 잃었다고 결정하면 그들은 나를 비웃고 "
"평소처럼 악한 농담을 할 것이다. 그 꿈틀대는 찌꺼기는 모든 것을 알고 있었다. 그래서 항상 왕관을 가져가고 싶어했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "927885b8-609c-4286-ac11-1bf2ebeb6610"
msgid ""
"\"Wonderful, wonderful! The wriggling offal is hiding somewhere on the top "
"floor. Come back to me when you've kill him. The old witch will help you any "
"way she can... Do you wish to ask me something else?\""
msgstr ""
"\"멋지구나. 멋지다! 꿈틀거리는 찌꺼기 녀석은 꼭대기 층 어딘가에 숨어있다. 그를 죽이고 나에게 돌아와라. 늙은 마녀가 되도록 너를 "
"도울 것이다. 나에게 다른 것을 묻고 싶은가? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "d6542af8-c211-419e-a3f6-1983e628ebd6"
msgid ""
"{n}The witch flashes a cunning smile.{/n} \"Did I tell you we were kind to "
"others? No, no. We lived by our laws, in peace and harmony with each other. "
"And strangers just had to learn to keep away from our forest!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마녀는 교활한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"우리가 다른 사람들에게 친절했단 말을 했나? 아니. 우리는 규칙을 지키며 살았고 서로 "
"화목하고 조화를 이루었다. 그리고 낯선 자들은 숲에서 멀리 떨어져야 했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "523cf26d-a144-4823-970f-65b9788c8ab7"
msgid ""
"\"Don't believe that swarming pile of corpse eaters! He eats and drinks from "
"Nyrissa's hand. He'll promise you anything and then deceive you. Listen to "
"the old woman — kill him without regret, then simply take the key.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 끔찍한 시체 포식 벌레 덩어리를 믿지 마라. 그 녀석은 나이리사의 보살핌에 먹고 마신다. 너에게 무엇이든 약속하고 너를 속일 "
"거다. 이 할멈의 말을 믿어야 한다. 후회 없이 그를 죽이고 열쇠를 가져와라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "f16a816e-80d8-4571-8988-10a989c70541"
msgid "\"Ask away, I like talking to guests...\""
msgstr "\"물어 봐라. 나는 손님들과 이야기하는 것을 좋아한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "a4f73245-8c74-4da0-9f09-f6a3ac75242d"
msgid "\"Ahhh, silly creature! You'll make a nice dinner!\""
msgstr "\"아! 바보 같은 녀석! 너는 좋은 저녁을 먹을 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "e2b3bc36-f33c-4850-8eb5-f2ab35c7faba"
msgid ""
"\"I store the key to Nyrissa's Shrine in my pantry. Which, in its turn, is "
"locked with another key. Oh, where did you put it, old hag...\" {n}The witch "
"searches the pockets of her robe.{/n} \"Here, take it. As you leave my "
"rooms, you'll see the door of the pantry. I also left some useful potions in "
"there. You can take them as well. Woe is me if Nyrissa finds out about it — "
"I'll be feeding the worms myself. So please do your best!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 나이리사의 성소 열쇠를 식료품 창고에 보관하고 있다. 그것은 차례로 다른 열쇠와 맞물려 잠긴다. 그걸 어디에 둔 거야. 이 늙은 "
"노파가...\" {n}마녀는 로브의 주머니를 찾습니다.{/n} \"여기 받아라. 내 방을 떠날 때 식료품 창고의 문이 보일 거야. 거기에 "
"쓸모있는 물약도 남겨 뒀다. 너도 그걸 가져갈 수 있다. 나이리사가 그걸 알아 채면 나는 큰일이 나겠지. 나는 벌레의 먹잇감이 될 거야. "
"그러니 최선을 다하게!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "5e0a7a8d-447f-4e2c-ba48-fd4e869087ec"
msgid ""
"\"I have decided, little guest. I will give you the key if you wish. Listen "
"to the hag — trick this wriggling offal, or better yet kill him! And then... "
"either you beat Nyrissa, or she beats you — I'll be better off without him "
"anyway.\""
msgstr ""
"\"작은 손님아. 나는 결정했다. 원한다면 열쇠를 줄 것이다. 이 할망구의 말을 들어 봐라. 그 꿈틀거리는 찌꺼기를 속이거나 죽이면 더욱 "
"좋다! 그러면 너는 나이리사를 이기거나 아니면 지겠지. 어쨌든 나는 그 녀석이 없다면 더 잘할 거야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "81470705-7d6e-44ab-ae43-09475cf85391"
msgid ""
"\"You saw for yourself! He envies me. Harms me. Wants to drive me out, make "
"me lose Nyrissa's favor. What else would you expect from a walking pile of "
"corpse worms?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 너 자신을 찾았다! 그는 나를 부러워 한다. 나를 해한다. 나를 몰아 내고 나이리사의 은총을 잃게 하려 한다. 걸어다니는 시체 "
"벌레 덩어리에게 무엇을 기대할 수 있겠는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "8eb13b5f-443e-4a1f-b3eb-0aedab82c044"
msgid ""
"\"Ahhh, little guest, you handled my trap? I was hoping to get a dead body. "
"What a pity! Nyrissa will be disappointed. Or perhaps she won't... if I "
"bring her your head.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 작은 손님아, 내 함정을 처리한 게냐? 나는 시체를 얻기를 바랬다. 안타깝구나! 나이리사가 실망할 테지. 아니면 그렇지 "
"않을수도... 내가 그녀에게 네 머리를 가져다준다면 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0034_WitchComplain_Text_String
msgctxt "df0808f7-5b00-4006-a728-f44f76b1bfc0"
msgid ""
"{n}The witch ruffles her coarse hair with her huge clawed palm and "
"mumbles,{/n} \"But a hag like me can't live here. Nyrissa got new favorites, "
"and made me live in the dungeon. She hardly notices me... if I help my "
"little guests a little, it wouldn't be unfair, would it? The Wriggling Man "
"wanted to kill me first!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마녀는 거친 손톱이 달린 손바닥으로 굵은 머리카락을 헝클며 중얼거립니다.{/n} \"하지만 나 같은 마녀는 여기에 살 수 없다. "
"나이리사는 새로운 흥미거리를 얻었고 나를 지하에 살게 했다. 그녀는 나를 거의 보지 않는다... 나의 작은 손님이 조금 도와 준다면 "
"공평할 텐데? 꿈틀거리는 남자는 나를 죽이고 싶어한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "514b7aae-e469-4c03-86e0-8e8ce3f22b63"
msgid ""
"\"I will tell you. There is a special place on the top floor — Nyrissa's "
"Shrine. It's the heart of the House. Her bitter treasure is stored there, "
"which she can never let you have. The door to the Shrine opens with three "
"keys. — One is stored with the Wriggling Man, one with me, and the third is "
"hidden somewhere in the house. I say you kill the horrid wriggling wretch, "
"and take his key Then I'll give you mine after. And then we'll see. Whether "
"you kill Nyrissa or she kills you, you'll have helped me either way.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 네게 말해 주겠다. 꼭대기 층에 특별한 장소가 있다. 바로 나이리사의 성소이지. 이 집의 중심부이다. 그녀의 보물은 거기에 "
"보관되어 있고 절대 네가 들어가지 못하게 막을 것이다. 성소의 문은 세 개의 열쇠로 열린다. — 하나는 꿈틀거리는 남자가 가지고 있고, "
"하나는 나에게 있고, 세 번째는 집 안 어딘가에 숨겨져 있다. 네가 지독한 꿈틀거리는 벌레를 죽여야 열쇠를 가질 수 있다. 그러면 내 "
"열쇠를 너에게 주겠다. 두고 보자. 나이리사를 죽이든 네가 죽든 너는 나를 도운 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "11a8752c-9941-4b70-a7e9-b384a378c569"
msgid ""
"\"Ask away. Old rot like me enjoys talking to someone young and curious...\""
msgstr "\"물어 봐라. 나 같이 오래된 늙은이는 젊고 호기심 많은 사람과 이야기하는 것을 즐긴다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "7dfea05f-b17d-44f9-85e2-c9344cad0c44"
msgid "\"I'm listening.\""
msgstr "\"듣고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "48ca069c-8926-456a-8a80-50822ab958ac"
msgid "\"Come again, little guest! The hag enjoyed your visit...\""
msgstr "\"다시 들려라. 작은 손님아! 이 늙은이는 너의 방문이 즐겁다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "a1a5c8c8-5ba5-4a09-814b-b3ea1b3f60e9"
msgid ""
"\"Think well — and if you decide, come to me with the Wriggling Man's key. "
"I'll know he's dead. And the old hag will give everything to the one who "
"killed the wriggling rot.\""
msgstr ""
"\"잘 생각해 봐라. 결정했다면 꿈틀거리는 남자의 열쇠를 가지고 나에게 와라. 나는 그가 죽었다는 것으로 알고 있겠다. 뒤틀린 시체 벌레 "
"녀석을 죽인 사람에게 노파는 모든 것을 줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "9b642363-8582-4ef9-ac82-a81bf2c84911"
msgid ""
"{n}The eyes of the Knurly Witch kindle with a creepy light.{/n} \"Serves him "
"right! He wanted my Crown! He always made fun of me, even by returning from "
"the dead as a pile of worms! Let him rot now. Yes, let him rot...\" {n}The "
"witch looks at you, shudders a little and fixes her robe anxiously.{/n} "
"\"Ahem... forgive the old hag. She got excited! I must keep my promise...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옹이 마녀의 눈은 소름 끼치는 빛을 발산합니다.{/n} \"나는 그를 올바르게 대접했다! 그는 내 왕관을 원했다! 그는 언제나 나를 "
"조롱하고 심지어 시체에서 벌레 더미로 돌아가서조차도 나를 괴롭혔다. 썩어버리게 두어라. 그래 썩어버리라지...\" {n}마녀는 당신을 "
"조금 떨고는 그녀의 옷을 걱정스럽게 고칩니다.{/n} \"에헴... 늙은 노파를 용서해라. 노파가 흥분했다! 나는 내 약속을 지키겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "9b7d38fa-0d1e-42d1-ad3d-18349d60ab92"
msgid "\"Then ask. The old hag has no secrets from you.\""
msgstr "\"물어 봐라. 늙은 해그는 너에게 비밀이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "30acca7f-7230-4f45-9dfd-a52c686cab58"
msgid ""
"{n}The witch is approaching.{/n} \"You think I'm lying to you, little guest? "
"But you can't know for sure? Will you let your doubts affect your decisions?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마녀가 다가옵니다.{/n} \"너는 내가 거짓말한다고 생각 하니. 작은 손님아? 그러나 확실하지 않지? 의심 때문에 결정에 영향을 "
"미치게 할 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "e15c4119-bffb-4d13-8c69-4cb9a5ce7dc6"
msgid ""
"\"I obey the one who is stronger. If I were five ages younger, I could try "
"to rebel, but it's too late for me now... Poor old witch makes potions as "
"she's told, looks after the House, takes jokes from the pile of worms, and "
"is good for nothing else.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 더 강한 사람에게 복종한다. 내가 오백 살만 더 어렸다면 반역을 시도할 수 있었겠지만, 지금 나애겐 너무 늦었다... 불쌍한 "
"늙은 마녀는 그녀가 원하는 묘약을 만들고, 집을 돌보며, 벌레 더미에게 농담을 받고, 그리고 다른 일에는 아무짝에도 쓸모 없다네. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0060_Text
msgctxt "747f0f81-e865-4401-8af1-40281e208c95"
msgid ""
"\"Ahhh, I shouldn't have wasted time on this idle talk! If you don't want to "
"die quietly, then you'll die a noisy and painful death!\""
msgstr "\"아. 이런 한담을 나누며 시간을 낭비해서는 안된다! 조용히 죽고 싶지 않다면 너는 시끄럽고 고통럽게 죽을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0061_Text
msgctxt "bd6bbea0-40e2-413c-8b04-8e16e69ff2b7"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, my lady hasn't shared prisoners with me for a long time. I would know "
"if they were in my dungeon, and they are not. Look higher, farther. The "
"House at the edge of time is larger than you know — and full of secret nooks "
"and riddles.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 내 여주인은 오랫동안 포로들을 나에게 보냈지 않았다. 그들이 내 지하 감옥에 있었다면 내가 알았을 테지만 그렇지 않았다. 더 "
"멀리 높이 봐라. 시간의 끝에 선 집은 네 생각보다 크다. 은밀한 장소와 수수께끼로 가득차 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "8b0ac842-5f06-41dd-9ce5-79cba4c82335"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, of course I lied! Did you believe my sad tales? Yes, once "
"Nyrissa compelled me to serve her, but I enjoyed doing it. I helped her get "
"rid of enemies, and feasted on their bones. This is not the first time that "
"fools like you have stumbled into my traps. This time I'll finish what I "
"already started with my own hands. Well, I'm happy for the chance to feast "
"again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래! 거짓말 했다! 내 슬픈 이야기를 믿었나? 그래. 한때 나이리사가 나에게 그녀를 섬길 것을 강요했지만 나는 그것을 즐겼다. 나는 "
"그녀의 적을 제거하고 그들의 뼈 위에 잔치를 벌이는 것을 도왔다. 내 함정에 빠져든 것은 네가 처음이 아니다. 이번에는 내 손으로 시작한 "
"것을 끝내겠다. 다시 한 번 잔치를 즐길 기회를 가져 기쁘다! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "d9321312-7be7-4d1a-a4cf-9f8588946c41"
msgid ""
"{n}The Witch's eyes wander, and you watch as spite inwardly struggles with "
"caution and selfishness. Finally, the huge hag starts to speak.{/n} \"If you "
"were one of these spineless dreamers, who care about 'morality' or 'good', "
"then I'd laugh in your face. But you are different... you run to your goal, "
"with no care for the means. You bite quick and deep as a bulette. Perhaps "
"you really will be able to defeat Nyrissa...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}마녀의 눈은 방황하고 당신은 바라보는 한편 내면의 경고와 이기심을 억누르고 있습니다. 마침내 거대한 노파가 말하기 시작합니다.{/n}"
" \"네가 '도덕성'이나 '선'을 염두에 두는 등골 빠진 몽상가라면 나는 너를 비웃을 것이다. 그러나 너는 다르다... 너는 수단에 "
"상관없이 목표를 향해 달린다. 너는 뷸렛처럼 빠르고 깊숙히 물어뜯는 자이다. 아마도 너는 정말로 나이리사를 물리 칠 수 있을 것이다... "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "292a64c5-d373-4dd2-bf23-6f8c16937f3f"
msgid ""
"\"Ha ha ha ha. Many have threatened the Knurly Witch. Few have lived long "
"after!\""
msgstr "\"하하하하. 많은 이들이 옹이 마녀를 위협했다. 하지만 대부분 오래지 않아 죽었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0071_Text
msgctxt "a59bd878-a0e1-421c-89c0-b6758091a283"
msgid ""
"\"I won't dare challenge the fey queen. If you need my service — take the "
"potions I made for her. And my key to the Shrine. I hope I do not see you "
"again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 여왕에게 도전할 수 없다. 필요하다면 그녀를 위해 만든 약물을 가져 가라. 그리고 여기 성소의 열쇠를 가져가라. 너를 다시는 "
"보지 않기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0072_Text
msgctxt "c304b8bb-e6da-4b98-965d-a188591bb213"
msgid ""
"\"Spineless creatures avoiding quarrels. I have only contempt for those who "
"try to make 'peace' and 'good' everywhere!\""
msgstr "\"싸움을 겁내는 등골 빠진 녀석. 나는 '평화'와 '선'을 이룩하려는 자들을 경멸한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0073_Text
msgctxt "b8a9a29f-3081-4a60-8168-6a72d35fcad1"
msgid ""
"\"Ahhh, ugly creature. Believe me, he appears as disgusting to a creature "
"like me as he does to creatures like you! Sometimes a soul doesn't want to "
"leave the world after death. It clings to its rotten body and finally lets "
"corpse worms consume it piece by piece. Yes, yes, the soul divides into a "
"thousand fragments, each living inside a worm!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 그 추악한 생물. 날 믿어라. 나 같은 생물에게도 역겨워 보이는데 너같은 생물에게도 역겨워 보이겠지! 때로는 영혼이 사후에 "
"세상을 떠나기를 원하지 않을 때가 있다. 썩은 몸에 달라 붙어 마침내 시체 벌레가 야금야금 영혼을 파먹게 된다. 그렇다. 영혼은 수천 "
"개의 조각으로 나뉘어졌고, 모든 벌레 안에 하나씩 살고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0076_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "053717aa-63cd-48d0-b043-3abce8e3a955"
msgid ""
"\"It's worse than disgusting. The death of such a creature must surely "
"please {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"역겹다는 말이 부족하다. 그런 생물이 죽는다면 {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}는 분명히 기뻐할 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/KnurlyWitch_HATEOT/Cue_0077_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "657c4251-aaac-4db6-8315-e4cdab55c483"
msgid ""
"\"I thought I knew what it meant to desperately run from death. This is dis-"
"gus-ting.\""
msgstr "\"필사적으로 죽음에서 벗어나려는 것이 무엇인지 이해한 거 같다. 정말 역-겹-다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "59743795-25ec-46b7-bc0f-eb2c86c1e23a"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "c5fa7c46-9b14-401c-9024-7cae8948f714"
msgid "[Attack] \"Whoever you are, you're going down!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네가 누구든 너는 쓰러질 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "5fe3f688-6ca5-4119-8b6f-fb40999af02f"
msgid ""
"{n}The dead Horned Hunter raises his head, easily shakes off the chains and "
"takes a step to you. The ghastly wound on his chest doesn't seem to bother "
"him at all.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}죽은 뿔달린 헌터가 머리를 들더니, 쉽게 체인을 떨쳐 버리고 당신에게 한 걸음 다가옵니다. 가슴에 지독한 상처가 전혀 괴롭지 않은 "
"것처럼 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "5a8e8573-bb5a-45d9-8c71-fe2007311b21"
msgid ""
"{n}The Horned Hunter shakes off the chains slowly, like blades of grass, and "
"moves towards you. His movements are strangely powerful.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}뿔달린 헌터는 천천히 체인을 떨쳐 내고 당신쪽으로 움직입니다. 그의 움직임은 이상하게 강력해 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "c1a2db64-2b90-4ea7-8a2f-df590b3f0ee9"
msgid ""
"\"You've truly, truly upset me, {mf|king|queen} of the sand castle. So much "
"that I find no joy in playing the masquerade any more. Are you ready to look "
"under the mask?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 정말로 나를 화나게 했다. 모래성의 {mf|왕|여왕}이여. 나는 이 가장 무도회가 더 이상 즐겁지 않다. 가면 속의 모습을 볼 "
"준비가 되었나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "0dcaca67-3abe-4617-b080-45a940547450"
msgid ""
"\"You've pleased me, {mf|king|queen} of the sand castle. Now that the "
"performance is almost over, we can take off our masks. Although I'll be sad "
"to part with them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 나를 기쁘게했다. 모래성의 {mf|왕|여왕}이여. 놀이가 거의 끝났으므로 이제 가면을 벗을 수 있다. 가면과 헤어지는 것이 "
"슬프긴 하지만. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "a908b170-146a-49b7-b70e-85aba9d895fd"
msgid ""
"\"I am a voice from another world that you've heard since you first set foot "
"on the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}. A harbinger of doom and change.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 네가 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 처음 발을 들여 놓은 이후로 들었던 다른 세계의 목소리이다. 운명과 "
"변화의 선구자이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "2bc8aba3-317b-4557-b0b8-65b6481b45e8"
msgid ""
"\"I am dust and echo, a memory of the past. I am the one who revealed to you "
"the truth about the Fallen Goddess, who gave you the light capable of "
"dispersing the mist.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 먼지와 메아리, 과거의 기억이다. 타락한 여신에 대한 진실을 너에게 밝힌 자이며, 너에게 안개를 흩어지게 할 수 있는 빛을 준 "
"자이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "95106cbb-0798-4dc7-9a51-6708b2718d00"
msgid ""
"\"I am the one who began this story, and I am the one who will end it. I am "
"the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} of {g|First World}the First World{/g}. I am the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 이야기를 시작한 사람이자 그것을 끝낼 사람이다. 나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 "
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}이다. 나는 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "777a939c-f90e-4534-b50f-2bb04f74e2c8"
msgid ""
"{n}The crowned living flame slowly turns to you, his glowing mask throbbing "
"in rage. His wrath intertwines with the very essence of the surroundings, "
"making the whole world change.{/n} \"To drink without quenching thirst. To "
"climb a mountain that has no peak. I staged the performance, and you left it "
"without a finale. You took away Nyrissa, my precious toy, carefully crafted "
"of despair and wrath. I could reduce you to dust, revive you, and turn to "
"dust once more, here and now. But the universe abhors inelegance. So instead "
"I shall repay you — with your own coin!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}왕관을 쓴 살아있는 불꽃이 천천히 당신을 향하고 그의 빛나는 가면은 분노에 떨고 있습니다. 그의 분노는 주변 환경의 본질과 얽혀 전 "
"세계를 변화시킵니다.{/n} \"갈증을 풀지 않고 마시는 것. 꼭대기가 없는 산을 오르는 것. 나는 공연을 상연했으나, 너는 막을 내리지 "
"않고 떠났다. 너는 절망과 분노로 신중하게 만든 나의 귀중한 장난감 나이리사를 가져갔다. 나는 이 자리에서 바로 너를 가루로 만들고, "
"되살린 다음, 다시 가루로 만들수도 있다. 그러나 우주는 우아하지 못한 행위를 혐오한다. 따라서 그 대신 나는 너의 재산으로 보답할 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "3ec92568-351f-4fac-8f50-8f09816ea810"
msgid ""
"\"You. A creature from the mortal world. You are just one of thousands of "
"waves, born in an ocean of my creation. But you've played your role well. So "
"go, return to your fragile house, live your little toy life. Forget about "
"the nymph Nyrissa and the matters of {g|First World}the First World{/g} — "
"it's the most precious gift I can give to you. And I shall press onward. The "
"finale of my play draws near!\""
msgstr ""
"\"필멸자 세계에서 온 생물이여. 너는 내가 창조한 생명체의 바다에서 태어난 수천 개의 파도 중 하나일 뿐이다. 그러나 너는 네 역할을 "
"잘 수행했다. 그러니 너의 장난감 집으로 돌아가서 소꿉장난을 계속 해라. 님프 나이리사와 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 "
"대한 문제는 잊어라. 너에게 줄 수 있는 가장 소중한 선물이다. 나는 앞으로 나아갈 것이다. 내 연극의 대단원이 가까이 다가온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "56ddbfe2-081b-4b20-95f0-43cb97aa40f9"
msgid ""
"\"You stooped to taking a role at your own theater? How petty of you, "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"너만의 극장에서 자기 배역을 그만 두었나? 하찮구나, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}여. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "71a919cc-a60e-4965-9ab9-a3d715eb1b61"
msgid "\"Run! Of course, that's probably not going to help, but...\""
msgstr "\"달려! 당연히 도움이 안되겠지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c21875fd-ae87-4975-a0de-1119e2323377"
msgid ""
"\"Self-appointed god of {g|First World}the First World{/g} — wasn't it "
"enough for you to witness the hardships to which Nyrissa doomed innocent "
"people, all because of your curse? Leave us alone!\""
msgstr ""
"\"자칭 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 신 — 당신의 저주 때문에, 나이리사가 무고한 자들을 파괴하는 모습을 보는걸로 "
"충분하지 않았습니까? 저희를 내버려두십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "843805b3-cbe6-41ec-b878-2c5409749e96"
msgid "\"So, we defeated the puppet. And now, here's the puppet master.\""
msgstr "\"꼭두각시를 물리쳤더니. 이제는 꼭두각시의 주인이 나타났군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LanternKing_HATEOT/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "f53e76d0-c1d2-4680-b00f-4672a9a54336"
msgid ""
"{n}A terrible power pins you down.{/n} \"Really? Do you not understand how "
"one should behave with those of my rank? Or do you still have no idea who is "
"in front of you?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}끔찍한 힘이 당신을 움직이지 못하게 합니다.{/n} \"진심인가? 나와 같은 자들을 상대하는 방법을 이해하지 못하나? 아니면 아직도 "
"네 앞에 있는 자가 누군지 모르는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS/01LinziFakeTOS_01Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "ce47e0be-cfe5-416f-b45a-375b429478b8"
msgid ""
"\"Welcome, my robin. Greetings from the House at the Edge of Time and its "
"mistress.\""
msgstr "\"환영한다, 내 울새야. 시간의 끝에 선 집과 그 주인이 너를 환영한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS/02LinziFakeTOS_01Linzi_String
msgctxt "eaea5647-a628-4b1a-8847-fcc4dd418e21"
msgid "\"You... you are very... beautiful!\""
msgstr "\"너는... 아주 아름다워!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS/03LinziFakeTOS_01Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "ff5efaac-dc27-43bf-9e4e-8e8c64d4371d"
msgid ""
"\"I know you like stories. I have thousands of them, the kind no one else in "
"the whole world can tell you. Be my guest, little robin. I won't hurt you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 이야기를 좋아한다는 것을 알아. 나에겐 세상 그 누구도 너에게 들려줄 수 없는 수천 가지 이야기가 있단다. 편히 지내거라, 내 "
"울새야. 너를 해치지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS/04LinziFakeTOS_01Linzi_String
msgctxt "68a826ff-3bbf-4d4d-b2be-e58348de88f8"
msgid ""
"\"I... well maybe... just for a little bit... I'd like to hear your own "
"story! To learn first-hand, and put it to paper... a book such as that would "
"surely be the only one in the world!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 어쩌면... 조금만... 너의 이야기를 듣고 싶어! 직접 듣고, 그걸 종이로 옮기면... 분명 세상에서 단 하나뿐인 책이 "
"될거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS/LinziTrueTOS_01Linzi_String
msgctxt "5272db3f-e93f-4d29-a942-a6e929e83bc8"
msgid ""
"\"Misty chamber in the underground floor... misty chamber in the underground "
"floor... you can get where the final key is stored, from there... oh!\""
msgstr "\"지하 층의 안개가 낀 방... 지하 층의 안개가 낀 방... 그곳에서 마지막 열쇠가 보관된 곳으로 갈 수 있다... 오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS/LinziTrueTOS_02Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "88216278-c505-4d33-9bff-0d64964e61d0"
msgid "\"So, my robin thought she could trick me. Tried to spy, didn't you?\""
msgstr "\"그래, 내 울새는 날 속일 수 있다고 생각했구나. 정보를 캐내려 했지, 그렇지 않니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS/LinziTrueTOS_03Linzi_String
msgctxt "2b17ca53-920f-4f6b-b481-081e65e8dbdd"
msgid ""
"\"I... well... yes! Because I'm not a traitor and I don't abandon my friends!"
"\""
msgstr "\"나는... 음... 그래! 왜냐하면 나는 배신자가 아니고 친구들을 버리지도 않기 때문이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS/LinziTrueTOS_04Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "2422ec3e-8fdd-45f5-8a16-018babea1237"
msgid "\"Such loyalty! I know just how to reward it.\""
msgstr "\"충성심이로구나! 나는 그것을 보상하는 방법을 알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6ef0e6fc-9b90-4419-b300-66447113899a"
msgid ""
"… took the unfinished book from her dead hands and clasped it to {mf|his|her}"
" heart like the most cherished treasure in the world."
msgstr "... 미완성 책을 죽은 그녀의 손에서 가져와 세상에서 가장 소중한 보물과 같이 가슴에 품었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "42eb1e9a-12ac-4678-8bfb-4671657511f7"
msgid "… breathed bitterly, \"They're going to pay for this.\""
msgstr "... 씁슬한 한숨을 뱉습니다. \"그들은 이 대가를 치를 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "547baf47-30b2-4f91-9d1c-1a0509c8b8d5"
msgid ""
"… pressed {mf|his|her} lips together stubbornly, ready for further danger."
msgstr "... {mf|그의|그녀의} 입술을 꽉 다물었고 더 위험한 일을 할 준비를 합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "837a5032-315a-4f47-bcb4-265b7b59f2d0"
msgid "… froze in silence."
msgstr "... 침묵 속에서 얼어붙었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "7755e0c8-c1ac-4260-9d3f-aa9c38094bfe"
msgid "\"Linzi?!\""
msgstr "\"린지?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "66b64b91-b467-491f-be95-50179d0d6ed5"
msgid "\"Something is wrong here.\""
msgstr "\"뭔가 잘못 됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "b66f037d-690c-4779-9bc1-910501ab4f2d"
msgid ""
"[Close] \"At least you are still doing what you loved most. And now I have "
"to move on.\""
msgstr "[닫기] \"적어도 너는 여전히 가장 좋아하는 것을 하고 있다. 그리고 나는 계속 나아가야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "d91088a9-4cc8-4659-9026-2dcde8c79e8b"
msgid ""
"[Close] \"A period? The mayhem is just getting started! I hope you're ready "
"to write about all my coming achievements.\""
msgstr "[닫기] \"이게 끝인가? 마침내 아수라장이 시작되고 있다! 앞으로 다가올 내 모든 업적에 대해 쓸 준비가 되었기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "eb3133de-229a-4abd-96d9-b11a6b116c91"
msgid ""
"[Close] \"Forgive me for not saving you, Linzi! I will take you with me and "
"protect you, I promise.\""
msgstr "[닫기] \"린지. 너를 구하지 못한 나를 용서해! 너를 데려가 지켜 줄 거야. 약속해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f2e81079-e6bc-46cf-bd2a-22d9e94b1ca6"
msgid ""
"\"The mistress will deal with you!\"\n"
"Shaking his fist farewell, the Horned Hunter leans heavily against the door "
"that led to the second floor. As if recognizing him, the door opened, "
"allowing Nyrissa's terrifying servant through. He rushes away."
msgstr ""
"\"우리 주인이 너를 상대할 거다!\"\n"
"작별의 뜻으로 주먹을 허공에 휘두른 뿔난 사냥꾼은 두 번째 층으로 향하는 문에 기댑니다. 마치 그를 인식하는 것처럼 문이 열리면서 "
"나이리사의 무서운 하인이 들어가는 것을 허락했습니다. 그는 도망갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "b6b7fc8c-9352-4039-b276-ca2388204799"
msgid ""
"...The bodies of slain satyrs lay by the {mf|King|Queen}'s feet, but the "
"hero{mf||ine}'s eyes were not fixed on them. A little further along, the "
"daring, talented, restless Linzi, loyal chronicler and friend, lay "
"motionless on the ground. She was dead."
msgstr ""
"... 살해된 사티로스의 시신은 {mf|왕|여왕}의 발치에 놓였지만 하지만 영웅의 눈에는 그들에게 고정되어 있지 않았습니다. 조금 더 "
"나아가, 대담하고 재능있고 안절부절하지 못했던 린지. 충성스러운 연대기 기록자이자 친구는 바닥에서 움직이지 않습니다. 그녀는 죽었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "40c0ca03-54b7-47ff-bcb2-b505546fe0bb"
msgid "Realizing what happened, the {mf|King|Queen}..."
msgstr "무슨 일이 일어났는지 깨닫고 {mf|왕|여왕}는..."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "20c67d9c-df78-4d2f-bc6d-20677b40da65"
msgid ""
"... The visions of the House at the Edge of Time have revealed to the "
"{mf|King|Queen} the sad truth: Linzi never betrayed {mf|him|her}! She just "
"wanted to find out Nyrissa's plans. Pretending diligently to be interested "
"and excited, Linzi asked questions and finally discovered that there's a "
"special place in the House at the Edge of Time, a Shrine, where the Apology "
"was kept — a cup holding the dust of almost a thousand kingdoms. If we reach "
"this treasure, the evil nymph will definitely not be able to hide from us "
"any longer!"
msgstr ""
"... 시간의 끝에 선 집의 환영은 {mf|왕|여왕}에게 슬픈 진실을 알려주었습니다. 린지는 결코 배반하지 않았습니다! 그녀는 나이리사의 "
"계획을 알아 내고 싶었습니다. 부지런히 관심있고 흥미를 느낀 듯이 행동한 린지는 질문을 던지다 마침내 시간의 끝에 선 집에 있는 특별한 "
"장소를, 성소의 위치를 발견했습니다. 성소에는 사죄 — 거의 천 개의 왕국들의 먼지를 담고 있는 잔 — 가 보관되어 있습니다. 이 보물에 "
"다다르면 사악한 님프는 더 이상 우리에게서 숨을 수 없습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "985d6549-0625-407f-b657-c30080c28fed"
msgid ""
"The entrance to the Shrine opens with three keys. The Wriggling Man keeps "
"the first key, the Knurly Witch has the second one, and the third one is "
"stored in a secret room on the first floor. To get inside, one must pass "
"through the Mist Chamber in the underground part of the House. Upon "
"discovering all this, Linzi decided to set off and find the third key, to "
"help the {mf|King|Queen}. But she was caught. And murdered. And even her "
"magical ring could not save her. I knew solo missions were not my thing!"
msgstr ""
"성소의 입구는 세 개의 열쇠로 열어야 합니다. 꿈틀거리는 남자가 첫 번째 열쇠를 가지고 있고, 옹이 마녀는 두 번째 열쇠를 가졌으며, 세 "
"번째 열쇠는 1 층의 비밀의 방에 보관되어 있습니다. 내부로 들어가려면 집의 지하실에 있는 안개의 방을 통과해야 합니다. 이 모든 것을 "
"발견하자 린지는 세 번째 열쇠를 찾아서 {mf|왕|여왕}을 돕기로 했었습니다. 그러나 그녀는 붙잡혔습니다. 그리고 살해됐습니다. 그리고 "
"그녀의 마법 반지조차 그녀를 구할 수 없었습니다. 단독 임무는 내 분야가 아니라는 사실을 알고 있었는데!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "0105463b-3e0e-4315-bb57-e901ab747cdd"
msgid ""
"… And then, standing over the body of {mf|his|her} most loyal companion, the "
"{mf|King|Queen} thought, how is it that this very moment is being described "
"in the book, if the author is already dead?"
msgstr ""
"... 그리고 나서, {mf|왕|여왕}은 {mf|그의|그녀의} 가장 충직한 동반자의 시체 곁에 서서 생각했습니다, 작가가 이미 죽었는데, "
"이 순간을 책이 어떻게 묘사할까요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "faecf0b2-224f-4313-9d2f-09d13b836a5d"
msgid ""
"Yes, it's me. Right here, in the book. It's a good thing you found me — and "
"that you can read. I've written all about the key, all right?! You can find "
"it somewhere in the mist... or using the mist... I didn't quite understand "
"it all myself."
msgstr ""
"그래요. 저입니다. 바로 여기 책을 쓰고 있습니다. 당신이 나를 발견하고 읽는 것은 좋은 일입니다. 나는 열쇠에 관해서 모든 것을 "
"썼습니다. 알겠죠?! 당신은 어딘가에서 안개 속에서 그것을 발견 할 수 있습니다... 혹은 안개를 이용하세요... 저는 그것을 완전히 "
"이해하지 못했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "faf5c6d2-b9f0-40d3-8bd5-d30d7de511a9"
msgid ""
"You know, I was so scared when I stood at the door of the House and realized "
"there was no one around! And then I got inside the book. This probably "
"doesn't happen to souls often — even here in {g|First World}the First "
"World{/g}. This is so strange! I can't decide whether it's exciting or sad."
msgstr ""
"내가 집의 문에 서서 주변에 아무도 없다는 것을 깨달았을 때 무서웠어요! 그리고 나는 책 속에 들어있어요. 이것은 아마도 영혼에 자주 "
"발생하는 일이 아닐 겁니다. 심지어 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서도요. 기분이 정말 이상해요! 기쁜 건지 슬픈 건지 "
"감정을 주체할 수가 없어요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "cada0240-7cd0-486b-8ff8-84268327cb10"
msgid ""
"I've been thinking, can books read other books? Otherwise when we defeat "
"everyone and return home I'll be bored. I'll have to live in the library... "
"it's dusty and... maybe you could put me in a display case in the throne "
"room?"
msgstr ""
"생각해 봤는데, 책이 책을 읽을 수 있을까요? 그 많은 적을 죄다 물리쳤으니, 집으로 돌아가면 지루해질 것 같아요. 아마 도서관에서... "
"먼지만 쌓이겠죠... 혹시 알현실 진열대에 저를 넣어주실 수 있나요?"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/LinziTOS_final_BE/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "16e721ec-1cda-4828-8279-c9e960f187c1"
msgid ""
"I... I... I'd sniffle, but can't. Thank you for everything. It was such an "
"exciting adventure! Please don't forget to take me with you wherever you go. "
"I have to know how it all ends! Finish my story. It's too early to put a "
"period on it!"
msgstr ""
"나는... 코를 훌쩍이고 싶지만... 할 수는 없습니다. 정말 답답하군요. 흥미로운 모험이었습니다! 제발 어디를 가든 나를 함께 데려가기 "
"바래요. 결말이 어떻게 끝나는지 알아야 하니까요! 내 이야기를 끝내주세요. 아직 마침표를 찍기에는 일러요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/Barks/EmptyMirror_bark_String
msgctxt "ba091796-51e7-49be-a4c7-55d26309d1c6"
msgid "The mirror is covered with thick mist. It reflects nothing."
msgstr "거울은 두꺼운 안개로 덮여있습니다. 그것은 아무것도 비치지 않습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/Barks/NullMirror_bark_String
msgctxt "8dbc8dff-3c15-4592-a0f4-8677bab509bd"
msgid ""
"The wizard in the mirror keeps clinging to the glass and whispering softly, "
"not noticing you."
msgstr "거울의 마법사는 계속 유리에 달라붙어 부드럽게 속삭이지만 당신을 알아채지 못합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/Barks/RightMirrorAfter_bark_String
msgctxt "cca11f7b-d033-4b14-8e28-c043d8c8d678"
msgid ""
"The reflection of the familiar wizard froze in the mirror. He nods to you as "
"if saying you are on the right track."
msgstr "친숙한 마법사의 반영이 거울 속에서 얼어 붙었습니다. 그는 당신이 옳은 길에 있다고 말하는 것처럼 끄덕입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/Barks/RightMirrorWrong_bark_String
msgctxt "663f1974-3539-46eb-b0d2-002082cbcfaf"
msgid ""
"For a second you see the familiar figure of the young wizard, but the image "
"ripples and disappears."
msgstr "잠깐 동안 젊은 마법사의 익숙한 모습을 볼 수 있지만 잔물결을 나타내며 사라집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/FirstMirror/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "f1b7d0bc-ee55-438a-9ea3-8b9d3b5c8960"
msgid ""
"{n}The mirror comes alive under your touch. Its dark surface is lit by "
"flashes of a battle that happened in this very room, an unknown age ago. A "
"group of warriors in dark clothes are fighting a flock of gargoyles. There "
"are clouds of sorcerous mist in the hallway behind their backs. Suddenly, "
"it's pierced by a ray of light, and the familiar wizard appears on the "
"battlefield, holding a magic lantern in his hand. He is swaying from pain, "
"but looks angry and resolute.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}거울은 당신의 손길로 살아납니다. 어두운 표면은 언제인지 모를 아주 오래 전 이 방에서 일어난 검의 부딪힘에 의해 밝아집니다. "
"어두운 옷을 입은 한 무리의 전사들이 가고일 무리와 싸우고 있습니다. 등 뒤 복도에는 마법의 안개 구름이 있습니다. 갑자기 빛의 광선에 "
"뚫렸고 친숙한 마법사가 손에 마법의 랜턴을 들고 전투에 나타납니다. 그는 고통으로 몸이 흔들리고 있지만 화가 나서 단호해 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/FirstMirror/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "889aede0-52d2-4e4f-ba18-829425617dd6"
msgid ""
"\"We will all die here! Run!\" {n}One of the soldiers screams. Without "
"hesitation, the wizard pushes him right into the gargoyles' claws. As soon "
"as the monsters are distracted with their victim, the wizard envelops the "
"entire group in a spell, and kills them on the spot.{/n} \"Get to the "
"stairs! To the second floor!\" {n}He lights the lantern, and the warriors "
"swiftly retreat into the mist.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"우리 모두 죽을거야! 도망쳐!\" {n}병사들 중 하나가 비명을 지릅니다. 주저없이 마법사는 그를 가고일의 발톱으로 밀어 넣습니다. "
"괴물이 희생자에 의해 산만해지자 마법사는 전체 그룹을 마법으로 감싸고 그 자리에서 모두 죽입니다.{/n} \"계단으로 가! 2 층으로!\""
" {n}그는 랜턴을 비추고 전사들은 신속히 안개 속으로 퇴각합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/FirstMirror/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "a88105c6-64b0-4ae6-b6ac-e5a411a61b50"
msgid ""
"{n}The vision fades. But then another room, and another wizard's reflection "
"appears on the other side of the glass — the one you first spoke to. It nods "
"to you and says quietly,{/n} \"I remember... remember this fight... you are "
"on the right path.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}비전이 사라집니다. 그런데 다른 방에서 또 다른 마법사의 반영이 거울의 다른쪽에 나타납니다. 당신이 처음에 말한 방입니다. 그것은 "
"당신에게 끄덕이고 조용히 말합니다.{/n} \"나는 기억한다...이 싸움을 기억한다... 너는 올바른 길을 가고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a063776e-1778-4cdc-b257-b44a51915146"
msgid "\"Hey! Do you hear me?\""
msgstr "\"이봐. 내 말 들리나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "54bdda42-6b53-4872-8bf7-75fdc9ccb6f6"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5d49e529-bcfa-493d-a787-dbc98147acd7"
msgid "[Leave] \"I don't have time to talk to mirrors.\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"나는 거울과 이야기 할 시간이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4160c0be-06f6-4860-857f-a6310c5302de"
msgid "\"Why is it you called me that? 'Next one'?\""
msgstr "\"왜 나를 그렇게 부른 거지? '다음 사람'이라고?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "fd4d9b8c-c815-4b54-9bb6-dc6d3fb9ff34"
msgid "\"Can I help you in any way?\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 도울 수 있을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "ebaad6ac-9983-4a8d-bba6-b46121c755bb"
msgid "\"Whose reflection are you?\""
msgstr "\"너는 누구지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "66f47b10-6577-4ab9-93dc-296b814e95b7"
msgid "[Leave] \"A difficult matter awaits. Farewell!\""
msgstr "[떠난다] \"어려운 문제가 기다리고 있다. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "e12bed72-375e-40ad-824f-4720ed3cf8e9"
msgid "\"Fine, I'll try.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 노력해 보지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "5c2d25cf-1768-423c-8278-bebb351ad74f"
msgid "\"Forgive me, but I don't need this.\""
msgstr "\"용서해 줘. 하지만 나는 필요 없어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "1a61620e-b758-4449-a830-4413d151afcd"
msgid "\"Where did you get the lantern?\""
msgstr "\"랜턴은 어디서 났지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "28401fb4-763a-49ac-aeb0-d6525f759a5e"
msgid ""
"{n}The mirror before you simply reflects its surroundings. It seems an "
"amazingly mundane decoration for such an insane place as the House at the "
"Edge of Time. That is, except for one strange detail — the mirror reflects "
"the room, the dust rising in rays of light, everything — but you. The moment "
"you realize this, you hear a dull moan from somewhere behind the glass, and "
"someone nearly crashes into the mirror from the other side...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신 앞에 있는 거울은 단순히 그 주변을 반영합니다. 그것은 시간의 끝에 선 집처럼 비정상적인 장소를 놀랍도록 평범한 장식처럼 "
"보이게 합니다. 거울이 방을 비추고 먼지가 빛의 광선을 덮으며 떠오르는 모습은 같지만 당신이 존재한다는 사실 한가지를 제외하고 말입니다. "
"당신이 이것을 깨달은 순간 당신은 유리 뒤의 어딘가에서 흐릿한 신음 소리를 듣게 되고 누군가 거울 반대편에서 거의 충돌할 "
"뻔합니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "5c21b7f0-4fb4-40ba-8240-fddbececf432"
msgid ""
"{n}The reflection — if, of course, it is a reflection — raises his head. "
"It's a human — clearly a wizard. A beautiful young face, pale as death. His "
"dark clothes are charred and bloody. In one hand the wizard is holding a "
"lantern just like yours, and while the other clings to the glass, as if he's "
"trying not to fall.{/n} \"I... I can't... Again and again...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그것은 반영이었습니다. 물론 반영입니다. 그는 머리를 듭니다. 그것은 인간 마법사입니다. 죽음이 보이는 창백하고 아름다운 젊은 "
"얼굴입니다. 그의 어두운 옷은 칠흑같고 피가 묻었습니다. 한 손에는 당신과 똑같은 손전등을 들고 있고 다른 손에는 유리를 짚고 있는데 "
"마치 떨어지지 않으려고 하는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"나는... 나는 할 수 없다... 다시 또 다시...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "9e1dc1c4-2458-4d29-8146-e817f87c34e0"
msgid ""
"{n}The reflection focuses his stare on you and whispers,{/n} \"I hear you, "
"next one...\""
msgstr "{n}반영은 당신과 눈을 맞추고 속삭입니다.{/n} \"네가 들린다. 다음 사람...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "41faac0b-a2ed-4071-8450-eaba7fde5c69"
msgid ""
"\"I know nothing of my true journey. Its end is lost in the darkness, and "
"the beginning is so far away. But I know that you follow in his footsteps. "
"As I once did, you fight to protect your lands from her... from Nyrissa.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 진정한 여행에 대해 나는 아무것도 모른다. 끝은 어둠 속에서 없어지고 시작은 너무 멀다. 그러나 나는 네가 그 발자취를 따라 "
"간다는 것을 안다. 내가 예전에 그랬듯 너는 그녀에게서 너의 영토를 보호하기 위해 싸운다... 나이리사에게서 말이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "095f336d-a213-4cb7-85fd-236218127ecb"
msgid ""
"\"I am what I seem. A reflection stuck in time. I'm the one who was "
"reflected in this mirror, long ago. Probably dead, but I can't disappear. "
"The House at the edge of time stores the moment when he was clinging to his "
"life, wounded, on this very spot, in this very room. And I will remain here "
"in remembrance of him — forever...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 내가 보는 그대로이다. 반영은 시간 속에 갇혔다. 나는 오래 전에 이 거울에 비친 사람이다. 아마도 죽었겠지만 나는 사라지지 "
"않는다. 시간의 끝에 선 집은 자신의 삶에 집착하는 순간과 상처를 입은 이 순간 그리고 이 방을 거울에 담았다. 그리고 나는 그의 기억 "
"속에 영원할 것이다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "80e901a8-ec4c-457f-a941-bbafae861b9b"
msgid ""
"{n}The reflection looks at you with sorrow.{/n} \"I want to be free. I want "
"to cease to be. I have lived for untold ages, feeling only despair, anger, "
"fear of death and defeat — everything that was happening to me at the "
"fateful moment by the mirror. Can you help me? I know you can.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}반사는 슬픔으로 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"나는 자유롭고 싶다. 나는 존재 하는 것을 멈추고 싶다. 나는 말할 수 없을 정도로 오랜 "
"세월을 절망, 분노, 죽음과 패배에 대한 두려움만을 느끼며 살았다. 모든 감정이 거울 속에 비친 운명의 순간이었다. 나를 도와줄 수 "
"있나? 너는 할 수있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "1dd93b6f-7611-4500-af62-a23b5619aec2"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know this. The mirror only stores one moment, and I am but a small "
"fragment of what he was — the real me... I am only what he felt when he fell "
"to his knees before this mirror, wounded. Only what he was thinking in that "
"moment. Pain. Rage. Desire to achieve his goal — whatever it takes!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이것을 모른다. 거울은 단지 한 순간만을 저장하지만 나는 그의 본질의 일부분일 뿐이다. 나의 본체는... 나는 그저 그가 거울 "
"앞에 부상 당해 무릎을 꿇었을 때 느끼는 순간일 뿐이다. 그가 그 순간 느끼는 감정일 뿐이다. 고통. 분노. 그것이 무엇이든 목표를 "
"달성하고자하는 욕망!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "e651615c-9c23-413f-b0ac-1a25e6e7128c"
msgid ""
"\"I know I can have peace if I only learn the end of my story. There are "
"three more mirrors somewhere in the house, which store its fragments. But I "
"am captured by this place and moment, and cannot look for them on my own. If "
"you can do this for me — if you revisit the path that the real me took, and "
"find all three mirrors — then I shall be free.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 내 이야기의 결말을 알게 된다면 안심할 수 있을 것 같다. 그 집의 어딘가에 보관되어 있는 거울이 3개 더 있다. 그러나 나는 "
"이 장소와 순간에 사로 잡혀 스스로 찾아낼 수 없다. 나를 위해 이 일을 해준다면 나의 본체가 걸었던 길을 다시 방문하여 세 거울을 모두 "
"찾아주면 나는 자유로울 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "d529a937-63ea-4f9e-afc2-c8b10c9bc371"
msgid ""
"\"How could I hope...\" {n} Says the reflection softly. A moment later his "
"eyes lose focus. He winces away from the glass, then leaps upon it, clinging "
"to it, repeating the familiar words.{/n} \"I... I can't... again and again "
"I...\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 내가 희망을 가질 수 있나?\" {n}반영은 부드럽게 말합니다. 잠시 후 그의 눈은 초점을 잃습니다. 그는 유리에서 멀어지며 "
"그 위에 뛰어 올라 익숙한 단어들을 반복하면서 거울에 손을 붙이고 있습니다.{/n} \"나는... 나는 계속해서... 할 수 없다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "a9d1644b-91e1-49e7-bcf9-3849be2d1931"
msgid ""
"\"I couldn't be more grateful,\" {n}The reflection whispers.{/n} \"Listen. "
"You have to start from the beginning and touch the mirrors in the same order "
"they once reflected me. If you make a mistake in the order, or touch an "
"empty mirror, you'll have to start over. I can only assume that the next "
"mirror is somewhere near the entrance to the house. But I know nothing more. "
"Please help me... and be careful, or you may become just another reflection "
"in Nyrissa's mirrors.\""
msgstr ""
"\"어떻게 고마움을 표현해야 할지 모르겠다.\" {n}반영이 속삭입니다.{/n} \"잘 들어라. 너는 처음으로 돌아가서 거울들이 나를 "
"비췄던 순서대로 거울을 만져야만 한다. 순서를 헷갈리거나, 비어있는 거울을 만지면, 처음부터 다시 해야만 할 것이다. 나는 오직 다음 "
"거울이 이 집의 입구 근처에 있을거라는 추측만 할 수 있다. 그 이상은 아는게 없다. 제발 나를 도와다오... 그리고 조심해라, 아니면 "
"나이리사의 거울에 갇힌 또 다른 반영이 될 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/NullMirror/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "3fd58031-3759-446e-9135-72bb79c3df41"
msgid ""
"\"It was a gift from someone great, whose power was more vast than I could "
"ever have imagined... but I can tell you no more. I don't remember.\""
msgstr ""
"\"위대한 사람의 선물이었는데 그의 힘은 내가 상상할 수 있는 어떤 것보다 더 광대했다. 그러나 나는 더 이상 말할 수 없다. 나는 "
"기억하지 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/SecondMirror/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ec7a58ab-063b-480d-a308-629d91549065"
msgid ""
"{n}The mirror reacts to your touch, and shows an image from the past. Sounds "
"of battle fade in the distance, the last surviving soldier slumps into the "
"hall and falls, smearing blood from his many wounds upon the floor. The "
"wizard coldly steps over his comrade's body. His ardent gaze is fixed upon "
"one spot — Nyrissa, sitting on the edge of a bench at the back of the room, "
"carelessly dangling her feet.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}거울은 당신의 손길에 반응하고 과거의 이미지를 보여줍니다. 전투의 소리가 멀리서 사라지고 마지막으로 살아남은 병사가 회관에 쓰러져 "
"많은 상처에서 피가 바닥에 번집니다. 마법사는 냉정하게 그의 동료의 몸을 밟습니다. 그의 열렬한 시선은 한 곳에 고정되어 있습니다. "
"나이리사는 방의 뒤쪽 벤치에 앉아 허공에 발길질하고 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/SecondMirror/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "5173d2bd-bfc9-4c02-ab8a-c5a39d4f9cae"
msgid ""
"\"You fooled us, fey queen!\" {n}Says the wizard angrily.{/n} \"You promised "
"us immortality and power, but poured death into our veins and called it "
"elixir. My country is devoured by riots, wizards die unable to defend "
"themselves. But I shall not leave it like this. I've found the road to {g|"
"First World}the First World{/g}. I've come a long way. I've convinced the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} to help me — and I will demand an answer "
"from you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"페이 여왕! 너는 우리를 바보로 만들었다!\" {n}마법사가 화가 나서 말합니다.{/n} \"너는 우리에게 불멸과 권력을 약속했지만, "
"죽음을 우리의 정맥에 쏟아 부었다. 나의 나라는 폭동에 사로잡혔고 마법사들은 스스로를 지키지 못한 채 죽었다. 그러나 나는 이렇게 끝내지 "
"않겠다. 나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}로 향하는 길을 발견했다. 나는 먼 길을 왔다. 나는 "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 나를 도울 거라 확신한다 — 그리고 너에게 대답을 요구할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/SecondMirror/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "dceb7419-02b9-4349-828c-791119c73638"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa laughs.{/n} \"My wild cat — so angry, so hungry for knowledge. "
"I've never thought you'd give up so easily. But you are too late. Terribly, "
"terribly late. The roads of {g|First World}the First World{/g} played a "
"trick on you. You spent almost two hundred years on the road to my door. "
"Your country is in ruins. Your entire order is dead. Even if I release you "
"from the poison in your veins — you'll only return to rule over rock and "
"bone. Look into my mirror and see for yourself!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사가 웃습니다.{/n} \"화나고, 지식에 굶주린 나의 야생 고양이야. 네가 쉽게 포기하지 않을거라 생각했다. 하지만 너무 "
"늦었어. 끔찍히, 끔찍히 늦었다. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}로 향하는 길은 널 위한 속임수였다. 너는 내 문으로 가는 "
"길을 찾기 위해 이백 년을 보냈다. 너의 나라는 폐허가 되었다. 너의 모든 결사단이 죽었다. 내가 너를 풀어주더라도, 너는 바위와 뼈를 "
"지배하기 위해 돌아갈 뿐이다. 내 거울을 보고 네 자신을 들여다 보아라! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/SecondMirror/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "34e7a7ca-c202-49d6-acf0-131b099f6ef8"
msgid ""
"\"You are lying, as you always have...\" {n}Says the wizard, but his voice "
"shows doubt. He turns to the mirror, for some a long moment you seem to meet "
"his stare.\n"
"And then a huge shadow falls upon his face. The creature who cast it is "
"somewhere beyond the mirror. You cannot see it, but you feel the blow of an "
"evil power, striking the wizard down. He doesn't scream or even moan, just "
"drops dead on the floor.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"너는 항상 하던대로 거짓말 하는군...\" {n}마법사의 말이지만, 그의 목소리엔 의심이 묻어나옵니다. 그는 돌아서 거울을 보았고, "
"잠시 동안 당신은 그와 눈을 마주칩니다. \n"
"그리고 거대한 그림자가 그의 얼굴에 떨어집니다. 그것을 던지 생물은 거울 너머 어딘가에 있습니다. 당신은 그것을 볼 수 없지만, 당신은 "
"마법사를 때려 눕힌 사악한 힘의 타격을 느낍니다. 그는 비명을 지르거나 신음조차하지 않고 그냥 바닥에 쓰러집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/SecondMirror/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "6a7c350f-f051-4429-9fc0-21370f3ac9f4"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa gets up from her place and approaches slowly. She gently tucks a "
"strand of the dead wizard's hair behind his ear, then picks up the magic "
"lantern.{/n} \"The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} hasn't forgotten about "
"me. He sends me new amusements.\" {n}Nyrissa looks at the dead wizard and "
"nods to the shadow standing out of sight.{/n} \"You may take the body. Hide "
"the remains in your storage in the dungeon — I don't want to stumble over "
"them somewhere in the house.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 자리에서 일어나 천천히 접근합니다. 그녀는 죽은 마법사의 머리카락을 부드럽게 빗어 귓가로 넘긴 다음 마법 랜턴을 "
"집어듭니다.{/n} \"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 나를 잊지 않았다. 그는 나에게 새로운 장난감을 보냈구나. \" {n}"
"나이리사는 죽은 마법사를 보고 보이지 않는 그림자에게 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"시체를 가져가라. 지하의 네 창고에 시체를 숨겨라. "
"나는 집에서 그것들을 밟고 다니고 싶지 않으니 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/SecondMirror/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "76a79473-404a-442d-befe-b9b6813a34e6"
msgid ""
"{n}The vision fades. A moment later there's the original reflection of the "
"wizard returns.{/n} \"Dead! I'm dead! Why won't the House let go of me? As "
"if the story isn't over yet. Find the final mirror, I beg you!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}환영이 사라집니다. 잠시 후 마법사의 원래 반영이 돌아옵니다.{/n} \"죽었어! 나는 죽었다! 왜 집이 나를 놓아주지 않는 거지? "
"마치 이야기가 끝나지 않은 것 같군. 마지막 거울을 찾아라. 부탁한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d0c1d83f-d0f1-4bc1-9044-5182ced27a6f"
msgid "\"Do you remember everything now?\""
msgstr "\"이제 모든 것을 기억하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4c7b4792-1374-4803-bb7a-d6ad7d51c492"
msgid "\"If you're free now, I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"네가 자유라면 나는 가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "7edbc80a-a9c2-4268-ada6-4e6168006c99"
msgid ""
"{n}The mirror reacts to your touch and shows you the same pantry. The door "
"opens, and the Knurly Witch appears in the doorway. She holds the wizard's "
"gnawed body effortlessly, like a child or a bundle of cloth. Shuffling "
"forward, she hurls him onto one of the shelves, between the potions and the "
"artifacts.{/n} \"What a nice trophy I have today!\" {n}Pleased with herself, "
"the Witch leaves.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}거울은 당신의 손길에 반응하고 동일한 식품 저장고를 보여줍니다. 문이 열리고 옹이 마녀가 출입구에 나타납니다. 그녀는 물어뜯긴 "
"마법사의 시체를 마치 어린 아이나 옷을 든 것처럼 가볍게 들었습니다. 앞으로 걸어가며 그녀는 그를 물약과 유물 사이의 선반 중 하나에 "
"던집니다.{/n} \"오늘은 정말 멋진 전리품을 받았구나!\" {n}홀로 기뻐하며 마녀가 떠납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "1121cb22-88ec-400f-8875-bdc451e6e7f3"
msgid ""
"{n}The mistress seems to have forgotten about her pantry for a long time. "
"The lights remain out, but in the darkness there's the flickering of some "
"artifacts. You see the wizard's body overtaken by a strange swarming. "
"Something is moving and wriggling there... and moaning softly. A long time "
"seems to pass behind the glass before the lights are on again, and the Witch "
"appears in the doorway with Nyrissa.{/n} \"Ah, I bungled it!\" {n}The great "
"hag shakes her head regretfully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}여주인은 오랫동안 식품 저장고를 잊어버린 것 같습니다. 불이 여전히 꺼져 있지만 어둠 속에서 유물 몇 점이 깜빡입니다. 당신은 "
"마법사의 시체를 무언가가 휩쓸어 가는 것을 보았습니다. 뭔가 움직이고 뒤틀리고... 부드럽게 신음합니다. 조명이 다시 켜지 기 전에 오랜 "
"시간이 유리 뒤에서 지나고 마녀는 나이리사와 출입구에 나타납니다.{/n} \"아, 실수했군!\" {n}거대한 마녀는 후회하며 머리를 "
"흔듭니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "b209791a-c9aa-484a-a961-0697f6f86002"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa stares at the moving pile of worms, taking the shape of a human "
"body.{/n} \"Clinging to life so stubbornly... desiring of revenge, or a new "
"chance... to be willing to return to life, even as an ugly monster... Oh, I "
"know this feeling.\" {n}She looks at the Witch.{/n} \"Find a way to erase "
"his memory without destroying his knowledge of magic. He could be very, very "
"useful to me. He'll serve the one who destroyed him, without even knowing "
"what he's doing. Isn't it wonderful?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 벌레 더미가 움직이며 쳐다 보며 사람의 형상을 취하는 것을 봅니다.{/n} \"인생에 집착이 심하구나... 복수를 "
"원하는거냐, 아니면 새로운 기회를 원하는거냐.... 삶에 돌아가려면 추악한 괴물이라도 상관 없다는 건가... 오, 나도 그 느낌 알지.\""
" {n}그녀는 마녀를 봅니다.{/n} \"마법에 대한 지식을 파괴하지 않고 그의 기억을 지우는 방법을 찾아라. 그는 나에게 매우, 매우 "
"유용할 수 있다. 그는 자신이 뭘 하는지도 모르고, 자신을 파괴한 사람에게 봉사 할 것이다. 멋지지 않느냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "38acd110-5f0d-4f90-bced-c0a9d53dc1f2"
msgid ""
"{n}The final moments of the vision show the Wriggling Man trying to make a "
"first step in his horrid new form — and the Knurly Witch bustling around "
"him, discontented. Then everything vanishes. Another moment, and the wizard "
"appears in the place of the horrid creature — the way he looked when he was "
"alive. The reflection stares into the distance, and remains silent for a "
"long time.{/n} \"So that's what it is. That's what it is.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}환영의 마지막 순간은 그의 새로운 끔찍한 형태로 첫 발걸음을 내딛는 꿈틀거리는 남자의 모습,과 그의 주변에서 불만을 터뜨리며 부산히 "
"움직이는 옹이 마녀의 모습을 보여줍니다. 모든 것이 사라집니다. 또 다른 순간 마법사는 무시무시한 창조물의 위치에 나타납니다. 그가 "
"살아있을 때의 모습입니다. 반영은 먼 곳을 응시하며 오랫동안 침묵을 지킵니다.{/n} \"그렇게 된 거였군. 그렇게 된 거였어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "2cbe3ac9-0aea-4615-b992-d0b9185b52a4"
msgid ""
"\"Yes and no. I'll now go into oblivion, but I would like to know that "
"Nyrissa will no longer treat my remains as a toy! Take a shard of this "
"mirror and show it to him — the one they call the Wriggling Man. Let him "
"remember. Let him see how the fey queen laughed at him. And I... I'm leaving "
"forever. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞기도 하고 틀리기도 하다. 나는 이제 망각에 빠지겠지만, 나이리사가 더 이상 내 시체를 장난감으로 대우하는 모습을 보고싶지 않다! "
"이 거울의 파편을 가져다가 꿈틀거리는 남자라고 불리는 자에게 보여주어라. 그가 기억하도록 해라. 페이 여왕이 어떻게 그를 비웃는지 보게 "
"해라. 그리고 나는... 나는 영원히 가겠다. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "a75535ab-efe8-4826-9631-18571a09bce2"
msgid ""
"\"I am free. The same as my real soul. You killed him, didn't you? May "
"oblivion take both of us — this life wasn't worth remembering...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 자유다. 나의 진정한 영혼과 같아. 너는 그를 죽였지, 안그런가? 망각은 우리 둘 모두를 삼킬 거다 — 이 삶은 기억될 가치가 "
"없어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "c169b290-5234-49a8-bee0-d7f5e8a24442"
msgid ""
"\"Many things...\" {n}- says the reflection softly.{/n} \"My name was... "
"though it doesn't matter. I was a member of a wizard order who founded their "
"state in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} a long, long time ago. We "
"subdued this savage land with the power of magic and began to build a new "
"order, one we deemed right. Within the country, the Order had absolute "
"power. Many thought it tyrannical, but so what?\""
msgstr ""
"\"많은 것들...\" {n}환영이 부드럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"내 이름은... 그건 중요하지 않다. 나는 아주 오래 전 {g|"
"Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 설립된 마법사 결사단의 구성원이었다. 우리는 마법의 힘으로 이 야만인 땅을 정복했고 우리가 "
"옳다고 생각한 새로운 질서를 만들기 시작했다. 그 나라에서, 결사단은 절대적인 힘을 가졌었다. 많은 사람들이 압제라고 생각했지만, 뭐 "
"어떤가? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "e6d1620d-f2f8-4773-815a-e4330d410833"
msgid ""
"\"Then Nyrissa came. She charmed us with sweet words, promised to share with "
"us the secrets of {g|First World}the First World{/g}. What wizard would "
"refuse new power and knowledge? We listened to her and paid for it dearly. "
"With one hand she fed us new knowledge which turned deadly, and with the "
"other hand she nurtured troublemakers from the common people. Riots flared "
"up around the country, were cruelly subdued, flared again... and then our "
"best wizards started dying one by one.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 뒤 나이리사가 왔다. 그녀는 달콤한 말로 우리를 매료 시켰고 우리와 함께 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 비밀을 "
"나누겠다고 약속했다. 어떤 마법사가 새로운 힘과 지식을 거절하겠나? 우리는 그녀의 말에 귀를 기울였고, 대가를 치렀다. 한 손으로 그녀는 "
"우리에게 치명적인 새로운 지식을 주었고, 다른 한편으로 그녀는 일반인들의 괴로움을 키웠다. 전국 곳곳에서 폭동이 일어났고, 잔인하게 "
"진압되었다가, 또 다시 일어났고... 결국 우리 최고의 마법사들은 하나씩 죽기 시작했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/MirrorQuest/ThirdMirror/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "9697e49a-8b75-40dd-a5aa-9c1262816331"
msgid ""
"\"I was the heir of the Order's chief, one of the strongest wizards of my "
"generation. I was also foolish enough to be the first to take a magic elixir "
"whose secrets Nyrissa had shared with us. It enhanced a wizard's power for a "
"short time — and also killed him, slowly but inevitably. When the truth was "
"revealed, it became clear that me, and the whole country, that the Order "
"didn't have long to live. I gathered everyone I could for a desperate "
"crusade into {g|First World}the First World{/g}. You've seen how it ended..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 우리 세대의 가장 위대한 마법사 중 한 사람인 마법사 결사단 우두머리의 후계자였다. 또한 나는 나이리사가 우리와 공유한 비밀이 "
"담긴 마법의 묘약을 처음으로 먹은 어리석은 사람이었다. 그것은 마법사의 힘을 단시간에 강화했다 — 또한 천천히, 그러나 필연적으로 "
"마법사를 죽였다. 진실이 드러났을 때 나와 단체, 그리고 나라 전체의 수명은 오래지 않았다. 나는 모든 사람을 모아 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}로 병력을 보냈다. 너는 그것이 어떻게 끝났는지 보았다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "22ad82b0-f645-4c83-9edf-3d2d8946b936"
msgid "\"If you stop attacking me, I won't hurt you.\""
msgstr "\"나를 공격하는 것을 멈추면 너를 해치지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0004_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b48d2df2-6af3-432a-b01d-643b39319054"
msgid "Killed the Horned Hunter while he was chained and helpless."
msgstr "속박당해 무력화된 뿔난 사냥꾼을 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6cf4e2c9-3214-4057-bd7d-5578c00c86b0"
msgid ""
"[Kill the Horned Hunter] \"There is no point in letting the enemy's servant "
"live. Die!\""
msgstr "[뿔난 사냥꾼을 죽입니다] \"적의 하인을 살려봐야 아무런 소용이 없다. 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0008_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8ffd69cc-311b-4e97-a077-ce1647429324"
msgid "Told Nyrissa that you wanted to stop her and save her, not kill her."
msgstr "그녀를 죽이는 것이 아니라 그저 막기를 원한다고 나이리사에게 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "0e80425b-4595-44ae-9175-ff1c0e2d8adb"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not here to kill you — but to stop you. And heal you, if there's any "
"hope of that.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 죽이려고 여기 온 것이 아니라 너를 멈추려 왔다. 나는 희망이 보인다면 너를 치유할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0009_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "ece4a6e4-bac7-4c20-a5c7-9f3a812f6a85"
msgid "Told Nyrissa to surrender."
msgstr "나이리사에게 항복을 권유했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "a8ac553f-14a5-4aaa-b78c-86bd1d432b75"
msgid ""
"\"Call me whatever you want, Nyrissa. But your most loyal servants are "
"defeated, your power is gone. Surrender!\""
msgstr "\"나를 어떻게 불러도 상관 없다. 나이리사. 그러나 네 충성스런 종들은 패배했고 너의 능력은 사라졌다. 항복해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "bcdaed6d-ca6c-4328-b89b-7f80797391a5"
msgid "[Attack] \"Enough talking. Let's end this now!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"얘기는 충분하다. 이제 끝내겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "8394825e-85f5-426f-84ea-c339c6846542"
msgid "Told Nyrissa she should answer for all the evil she'd done."
msgstr "나이리사에게 그녀가 저지른 모든 악을 뉘우쳐야 한다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "bb2b7e45-f6f2-4ca6-b923-4f32d6818702"
msgid ""
"\"You must be punished for your many atrocities. If you have anything to say "
"first — speak now.\""
msgstr "\"너의 많은 잔학 행위로 너는 처벌되어야 한다. 말하고 싶은 것이 있다면 지금 말하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d1b79a8f-cf32-4bd3-a64e-8f41e012669c"
msgid "Offered to spare Nyrissa's life if she would bow to you."
msgstr "당신에게 굴복한다면 나이리사를 살려주겠다고 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "8a7a8458-a0c8-46a9-9ecf-d87f8b9a1de2"
msgid ""
"\"There cannot be two rulers in the Stolen Lands. Bow to me, and I may spare "
"your life.\""
msgstr "\"도둑맞은 땅에는 두 명의 통치자가 있을 수 없다. 나에게 굴복하면 너를 살려주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "9f12bf88-a60a-4f32-880f-bb31e572f01c"
msgid ""
"\"Evil only begets more evil, but there must be a way to stop it. Trust me. "
"Stop. A battle will not solve or help anything.\""
msgstr "\"악은 악을 낳지만 막을 수있는 방법이 있다. 나를 믿어라. 악행을 그만둬라. 전투는 해결도 도움이 되지도 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "7b7791fd-388f-45ab-9a4e-ada99917054f"
msgid "\"Well, since there is no other way — let's settle this in battle.\""
msgstr "\"음. 다른 방법은 없다. 전투로 해결한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "b7fa8b37-8478-4c99-99d5-96f0519b757d"
msgid ""
"{n}The Horned Hunter, chained to a tree, raises his head with difficulty, "
"and fixes his eyes on you.{/n} \"You! The mistress punished me for failing "
"to deal with you. And look — her favorites, the Knurly Witch and the "
"Wriggling Man have also failed!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}뿔난 사냥꾼은 나무에 묶인 채로 힘겹게 머리를 들어 시선을 당신에게 고정시킵니다.{/n} \"너구나! 내가 너를 처리하지 못해 "
"여주인이 나를 처벌했다. 그리고 봐라, 그녀의 충신인 옹이 마녀와 꿈틀거리는 남자도 실패했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "25d37aed-07b5-4e5d-87c3-67d81c4579e9"
msgid ""
"\"Think not of me, {name},\" {n}says the Horned Hunter in a strangely cold "
"voice.{/n} \"Did I not tell you that the shadow behind your back is always "
"Her? And the sound of footsteps in the dark — always Her? Turn around!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 생각하지 마라. {name}.\" {n}뿔난 사냥꾼은 이상하게 차가운 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"네 뒤의 그림자는 항상 "
"그녀라는 걸 말하지 않았나? 그리고 어둠 속에서 나는 발자국 소리는 항상 그녀라는 걸? 뒤돌아 봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "dc59c9bd-b874-4960-a2d9-68cd9318c68b"
msgid ""
"{n}The Horned Hunter twists in his shackles, but in vain — the steel cuts "
"through his body, and dark blood pours from the wound. The creature rattles "
"and rests forever, but with his final breath, speaks in a strangely cold "
"voice:{/n} \"Did I not tell you that the shadow behind your back is always "
"Her? And the sound of footsteps in the dark — always Her? Turn around!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}뿔난 사냥꾼은 속박당한 채로 몸을 뒤틀지만, 아무 소용 없었습니다 — 무기가 그의 몸을 잘라냈고, 상처에서 검은 피가 "
"흘러내렸습니다. 그 생물은 이빨을 딱딱거리다 영원히 휴식을 취하게 되었지만, 그는 마지막 숨에 이상하게도 차가운 목소리로 말합니다.{/n}"
" \"네 뒤의 그림자는 항상 그녀라는 걸 말하지 않았나? 그리고 어둠 속에서 나는 발자국 소리는 항상 그녀라는 걸? 뒤돌아 봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "1a3d10b3-fea5-4a18-baa4-6c3f5062c6ae"
msgid ""
"{n}You can't tell by the nymph's appearance whether she is calm or excited, "
"frightened or angry. Nyrissa barely looks at you. She stops by the Apology "
"and runs a finger along its rim.{/n} \"My hound. You have run so long, to "
"finally meet your mistress.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 외모로 그녀가 평온한지 흥분했는지, 두려워 하는지 화가 났는지 알 수 없습니다. 나이리사는 간신히 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 그녀는 "
"사죄의 옆에 멈추고 가장 자리를 따라 손가락을 움직입니다.{/n} \"내 사냥개야. 너는 오랫동안 달렸고, 마침내 네 여주인을 만났구나."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "a0a708fa-910a-4929-a783-bf957c6c53c3"
msgid ""
"\"What hope do you speak of? There isn't any in the world, nor was there "
"ever. Evil and sorrow are masters of our lives. Let's get this over with. "
"Either I kill you and get the last grain of dust for the Apology — or you "
"kill me and carry the memory of Nyrissa and her despair with you, for the "
"rest of your brief life!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 무슨 희망을 말하고 있느냐? 그것은 이 세상에 존재하지 않고, 존재했던 적도 없다. 악과 슬픔이 우리 삶의 주인이다. 이제 "
"끝내자. 나는 너를 죽이고 사죄를 위한 마지막 먼지 한 톨을 얻는다 — 아니면 네가 나를 죽이고 나이리사의 기억과 그 절망을 간직해라, "
"네 짧은 삶 동안!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "652a8f3a-c49f-43aa-a17b-4ebb979d3428"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, if only you knew what punishment is! But you don't. And you never "
"will. I shall take your life, and transform it into the last grain of dust "
"in my cup!'"
msgstr ""
"\"오, 처벌이 뭔지 네가 알았더라면! 하지만 너는 모를 거야. 앞으로도 절대 모를 거다. 내가 너의 목숨을 빼앗아 내 잔에 들어갈 "
"마지막 티끌로 바꿀 것이니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "7d554489-51d4-40b2-98ec-7348f959675f"
msgid ""
"\"You are still in my kingdom, silly child. And the kingdom is alive while "
"its ruler draws breath. That's true for both of us, isn't it? I won't step "
"back — not now, when you've come to me yourself to fill my cup!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 아직 내 왕국에 있다. 어리석은 아이야. 왕국은 통치자가 숨을 쉬는 동안은 존재한다. 그것은 우리 모두에게 사실이 아닌가? 나는 "
"뒤로 물러서지 않을 것이다. 너의 죽음으로 내 잔을 채우기 전까지는 말이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "912abb5c-ffbe-4017-a05a-ee2cab616e22"
msgid ""
"\"I've seen sunrises on two worlds and sunsets over a thousand kingdoms, "
"silly child. I couldn't bow to a day-fly, even if it is lucky enough to "
"defeat me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 두 개의 세계에서 천 개의 왕국의 흥망성쇠를 보았다, 어리석은 아이야. 나를 이길 만큼 운이 좋더라도, 내가 하루살이에게 무릎 "
"꿇는 일은 없을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "31852700-7222-4920-ad18-578459f362bf"
msgid "\"Run! — Run, my hound. Run to your death!\""
msgstr "\"달려라! 내 사냥개야, 죽음을 향해 달려라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "c1cf9922-3d33-4f76-860d-31be7fe21e8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks at you askance, then drops her head.{/n} \"Oh, if only you "
"could know, {name}... how tired I am... After thousands of years in this "
"insane dance of lies and destruction... can I believe that anything will "
"ever be better again? No, no, it's all in vain! I don't want to fight — but "
"is there anything left to hope for? No future. No life. No redemption.\" {n}"
"Nyrissa lifts her eyes, defeated and broken.{/n} \"I surrender...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 의심의 눈길로 당신을 보고는, 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"오, 네가 만약 알았다면. {name}... 내가 얼마나 "
"피곤했는지... 거짓과 파괴의 미친 춤사위로 수천 년을 보냈는데... 이제와 모든 것이 다시 회복될 것이라고 믿을 수 있을까? 아니, "
"아니야, 전부 소용없어! 나는 싸우고 싶지 않다 — 허면 내가 원했던 무엇이라도 남아있는가? 미래는 없다. 생명도 없다. 구원도 없다.\""
" {n}나이리사는 패배하고 마음이 꺾인 채로 그녀의 눈을 들어올립니다.{/n} \"항복한다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaBeforeBattle_HH/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Nyrissa_HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime
msgctxt "4a3009c4-323d-4fec-95a0-d40872b83c97"
msgid ""
"\"Then goodbye... {name}. Whoever wins, it will be the end of the other!\""
msgstr "\"그럼 작별 인사를 하자... {name}. 누군가 이기면 그건 다른 사람의 끝을 의미한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8415b53e-8868-4be1-a99c-c3f27f0cc358"
msgid ""
"[Give Briar to Nyrissa] \"I want to return what's been taken from you.\""
msgstr "[나이리사에게 찔레를 줍니다] \"나는 네가 빼앗긴 것을 돌려주고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5550cca0-a199-44d1-8600-c951a8b8f353"
msgid ""
"[Offer Nyrissa an alliance] \"The war is over, Nyrissa. Now listen to me — "
"don't humiliate yourself by begging those who cursed you for forgiveness. Be "
"my ally. Together we can achieve many things.\""
msgstr ""
"[나이리사에게 동맹을 제안합니다] \"전쟁은 끝났다. 나이리사. 내 말을 들어봐라. 용서를 위해 너를 저주한 자들에게 간청하며 굴욕감을 "
"느끼지 말아라. 내 동맹이 되어라. 함께하면 많은 것을 이룰 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "f90429e9-090d-44a8-8065-ed58ef2c5e5b"
msgid ""
"[Let Nyrissa go] \"Promise never to invade my lands again — and I'll let you "
"go. One way or another, the thousand grains of dust have been collected. You "
"can take the cup and gain your forgiveness from the Eldest.\""
msgstr ""
"[나이리사를 보냅니다] \"내 땅을 다시는 침범하지 말아라. 그러면 너를 놓아 주겠다. 어떤 방법으로든, 천 개의 먼지가 모였다. 너는 "
"잔을 가져다가 원로에게 용서를 받을 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f1e8bafd-6035-433c-80cc-f55f0ccec583"
msgid ""
"[Finish Nyrissa] \"Your power over the Stolen Lands has ended. Once and for "
"all!\""
msgstr "[나이리사를 끝장냅니다] \"도둑맞은 땅에 대한 너의 힘은 끝이 났다. 영원히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "9ff4f5cb-edf3-4387-8352-968fa51995bf"
msgid ""
"\"Because I care about you. And if there's a chance, even one in a thousand, "
"to return your heart to you, Nyrissa — I want to take it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 너를 걱정하기 때문이다. 그리고 천분의 일이라도 너의 마음을 되돌릴 기회가 있다면 그렇게 하겠다. 나이리사. 나는 그 기회를 "
"얻고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f8bc8d8e-f5d0-464b-8be2-f8ff603308d7"
msgid "Decided to return Briar to Nyrissa, as it seemed the right thing to do."
msgstr "찔레를 원래의 주인인 나이리사에게 돌려주기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "58376138-df7d-4f70-ac1e-bfeb334008e8"
msgid ""
"\"Because I want justice. Briar is a part of your soul, and it has to be "
"returned to you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 정의를 원하기 때문이다. 찔레는 너의 영혼의 일부이며, 너에게 돌아가야만 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f58f9a23-68a6-4521-b492-66c5f1c44175"
msgid "Decided to return Briar to Nyrissa out of curiosity."
msgstr "호기심에 이끌려 찔레를 나이리사에게 돌려주기로 결정했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "52cc32ea-1c41-40a2-8a55-0d9558bfd661"
msgid "\"I'm just curious to see what happens.\""
msgstr "\"나는 어떤 일이 벌어질지 궁금할 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "51ee2434-7638-4a16-b728-f0d0b3050aa3"
msgid "\"You have a chance to talk — before I decide your fate.\""
msgstr "\"내가 네 운명을 결정하기 전에 말할 기회를 주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "b1e4b7bf-3b69-4c42-aa1b-b19c01dd68fa"
msgid ""
"\"I don't like it when 'rules' are imposed on me. My offer still stands.\""
msgstr "\"'규칙'이 내게 강제된다면 나 또한 싫어하겠지. 나의 제안은 여전히 유효하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "6ac7bbaa-6cb8-41b0-859f-d3fddbed1841"
msgid ""
"\"Well, in that case, forget about my offer. I don't want to take any "
"needless risks on account of a creature like you.\""
msgstr "\"뭐, 그렇다면, 내 제안을 잊어버려라. 나는 너 같은 생물 때문에 불필요한 위험을 감수하고 싶지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0032_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4bcb7997-6ea1-4df8-8d79-3370e96668d7"
msgid ""
"Suggested that Nyrissa should admit her guild and seek atonement for it."
msgstr "나이리사가 그녀의 죄를 인정하고 속죄를 구해야 한다고 제안했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "62fae86c-6479-4131-b2ee-20bfc7240521"
msgid ""
"\"You did a lot of harm, Nyrissa, but it's not your fault alone. Now you're "
"you again. Use this chance to atone for your transgressions.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 많은 해를 입혔지만 혼자의 잘못이 아니다. 이제 너는 다시 네가 되었다. 이 기회를 이용하여 자신의 허물을 속죄해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0033_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "a6f124ed-7753-498e-aa76-c24165e035ea"
msgid "Felt obliged to give Nyrissa a chance at redemption."
msgstr "나이리사에게 구원의 기회를 주어야 한다고 느꼈습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "c3ad9e9d-7dbb-41a0-95a9-32490ac1ecc7"
msgid ""
"\"I'll never be able to forgive you for the harm you've done, Nyrissa. But I "
"had to give you a chance to repent.\""
msgstr "\"네가 한 짓을 용서할 수 없을 거다. 나이리사. 하지만 너에게 회개할 기회를 주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0034_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "508d4690-32b7-4343-b76b-317969bb6ce2"
msgid ""
"Told Nyrissa you don't blame her for anything she'd done while part of her "
"soul was missing."
msgstr "그녀의 영혼의 일부가 사라져버린 동안 저지른 일 때문에 나이리사를 비난하지 않는다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "9d1c2677-9ef0-4905-bec1-4e4d564b6d63"
msgid ""
"\"I don't blame you. A part of your soul has been taken, and evil flooded in "
"to fill the gap. But I knew that I could fix it — and I did.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 비난하지 않겠다. 너의 영혼의 일부를 빼았겼고 그 틈을 악이 넘쳐 메웠다. 그러나 나는 고칠 수 있다는 것을 알았고 너를 고쳤다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "4e7c58bf-e8b8-4958-8981-3b214a9fb676"
msgid ""
"\"You are in my heart, Nyrissa. I want to share the road with you, whatever "
"lies ahead of us.\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 마음 속에 있다. 나이리사. 나는 우리 앞에 놓여있는 길이 무엇이든 너와 나누고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "b7e1d351-fdb1-483d-845b-1f16c2e1a341"
msgid "\"I've done all I could for you, and can give you no more.\""
msgstr "\"너를 위해 할 수있는 모든 일을 했고 너에게 더 이상 줄 것이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0043_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "e038d12e-faaf-48b6-872f-11a0158b9b9d"
msgid "Told Nyrissa you don't care about the evil she caused."
msgstr "나이리사에게 그녀가 야기한 악에 대해 걱정하지 않는다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "0aaaec92-00a9-4034-bc8c-f164736f304a"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care about your atrocities, past or future. I'm no righteous "
"{mf|man|woman} myself. I only care about you. We'll be together, and the "
"world will bow to us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 저지르거나 저지를 잔학 행위에 관심이 없다. 나는 의로운 자가 아니다. 나는 그저 네가 걱정된다. 우리는 함께있을 것이고 세상은 "
"우리에게 무릎 꿇을 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "33a61509-f2d6-4e89-963b-d5ab91337124"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa turns her head to the cup and looks as though she can't believe "
"her eyes.{/n} \"My kingdom... my own kingdom... turned to dust... become the "
"thousandth grain for the Apology...\" {n}The nymph tilts back her head and "
"laughs a dull wistful laugh.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 잔을 향해 머리를 들었고 자신의 눈을 믿을 수 없는 듯 바라봅니다.{/n} \"내 왕국... 내 왕국이... 먼지로 "
"변했어...사죄를 채울 천 번째 티끌이 되었어...\" {n}님프는 머리를 뒤로 젖히고 멍청한 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "997169f6-9a87-4e7a-9838-555e5c164de6"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa meets your gaze.{/n} \"Is that... what I think it is? Is that "
"what I feel... or could feel... What's been taken from me... Can it be "
"returned? If it was freely given... If it were freely accepted. If...\" {n}"
"The nymph reaches out and touches Briar. It glows with a soft greenish light "
"under her palm.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 당신과 눈을 마주칩니다.{/n} \"그게... 내가 생각하는 것인가? 그게 내가 느끼는 것... 혹은 느낄 수 있는 "
"것... 내가 빼앗긴 것... 그걸 돌려받을 수 있다고? 그것이 대가없이 주어진다면... 대가없이 받아들여지면... 만약...\" {n}"
"님프가 손을 뻗어 찔레에 닿습니다. 그녀의 손바닥 아래는 부드러운 초록색 빛으로 빛납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d3bdc8a2-f9db-4fbf-bc9b-eeb8a1f01651"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa shakes her head.{/n} \"Your heart knows nothing of love, just "
"like mine. Keep this gift. It is hardly going to change anything.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 고개를 저었습니다.{/n} \"너와 나 사이에는 사랑의 감정이 없잖아. 이 선물을 계속 갖고 있어. 뭘 바꿔 보기에는 "
"너무 늦었어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "f8cac2c4-cc16-432e-9b1f-eef925839f9d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa smiles bitterly.{/n} \"I know you are lying. In your {d|c61 "
"Romance}heart{/d} I can see who it truly belongs to. Save such presents for "
"those you really care about.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 씁쓸하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"거짓말하고 있는거 알아. 네 {d|c61 Romance}마음{/d}이 진실로 누구에게 "
"있는지 볼 수 있어. 정말로 좋아하는 사람을 위해 선물을 아껴둬. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "b7c71002-9e2b-4b34-bb2f-96375caf6f9d"
msgid ""
"\"What does 'justice' mean in matters of the soul? In the games of great "
"powers? In the beating of a living heart? It's just a word, and nothing "
"more. If that's all that moves you — then forget it. I don't need this gift."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"영혼의 문제에서 '정의'는 무엇을 의미하는가? 강대국의 게임에서는? 살아있는 심장이 뛰는 것에서는? 그것은 단지 하나의 단어일 "
"뿐이며, 그 이상도 아니다. 그것이 너를 움직이는 것이라면 잊어 버려라. 이 선물은 필요 없다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "ceb6b13e-c3da-4f1b-a15d-d4940733a9aa"
msgid ""
"\"What love of entertainment and experiment! But I do not judge you harshly. "
"Nevertheless, keep this present. It offers me nothing now. Just like your "
"indifferent curiosity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"흥미와 실험에 대한 사랑이구나! 하지만 너를 비난하지는 않겠다. 그렇지만 이 선물을 지녀라. 지금은 나에게 아무것도 아니다. 너의 "
"무관심한 호기심처럼 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "8087fac5-ce84-4c86-807e-95862b143f8f"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks at Briar with distrust, and reaches out — but doesn't dare "
"touch it.{/n} \"I looked for it for such a long time... So long that I "
"forgot why I needed it. But you... why do you... why do you want to return "
"what I lost to me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 불신과 함께 찔레를 보고, 손을 뻗습니다 — 하지만 감히 만지지 못합니다.{/n} \"나는 오랫동안 그것을 찾았어... "
"왜 나에게 그것이 필요했는지 잊어버릴만큼 오래. 하지만 너... 왜 너는... 내가 잃어버린 것을 돌려주려 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "b2d01dc7-fcfc-47ea-9b01-1bb31187cc53"
msgid ""
"{n}Everything around shudders with the scream of a thousand voices, "
"soundless but trembling. You watch a tiny dot of light, a grain, appear "
"above the Apology — and slowly fall down.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}주변 모든 것들이 소리없이 떨고있는 천 명의 비명 소리와 함께 떨립니다. 당신은 빛의 작은 빛의 점이, 알갱이가 사죄 위에 나타난 "
"것을, 그리고 천천히 떨어지는 것을 보았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "439cbf05-0d67-4652-8aec-d7b413baa5bd"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa tenses like a wild animal who smells her prey.{/n} \"Do you know "
"what you're asking? I'm prisoner in a game of someone else's invention, and "
"I can't break the rules. If I take the slightest risk, the punishment might "
"be terrible for both of us. On the other hand, I have nothing else to lose. "
"Can you say the same?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 먹이 냄새를 맡는 야생 동물처럼 긴장했습니다.{/n} \"네가 무얼 제안했는지 알고 있는가? 나는 다른 누군가의 발명한 "
"게임의 포로이다, 그리고 나는 규칙을 어길 수 없다. 내가 가장 가벼운 위험을 무릅쓰더라도, 우리에게 가해지는 벌은 끔찍할 것이다. "
"한편, 나는 잃을 것이 없다. 과연 너도 그럴까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "3b090edc-2101-4b3a-8d88-9a036a1689df"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks at you askance.{/n} \"Is this... mercy? Or a cruel joke "
"that I do not understand? Let it be! I accept your gift. I'll go to the "
"trial of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} and give them the Apology. It represents "
"thousands of years of insanity. This must end!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 의심스레 당신을 봅니다.{/n} \"이게... 자비인가? 아니면 내가 이해하지 못하는 잔인한 농담인가? 무엇이든! 너의 "
"선물을 받아 들인다. 나는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 심판을 받으러 가서 그들에게 사죄를 주겠다. 이 성배는 수천 년의 광기를 "
"나타낸다. 반드시 끝내야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "95820051-2f39-4795-a97e-6c45f8514911"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa throws back her head and laughs.{/n} \"Let the song end. Let the "
"flame go out. Let flowers die and grasses dry. All that I lived for will end "
"with my life!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 그녀의 머리를 젖히고 웃습니다.{/n} \"노래를 끝내자. 불꽃이 일도록 두어라. 꽃이 시들고 잔디가 마르게 두어라. 내 "
"평생 공들였던 모든 것이 내 삶과 함께 끝날 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "8aa5aed6-5531-4def-a2bc-7add7134c466"
msgid ""
"\"What would you have me do? Ask for forgiveness? Beg for mercy? Oh no, I "
"won't beg. I know better than anyone what it means to lose, and lose "
"everything. I didn't ask the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} for mercy as they laughed "
"at my foolish boldness. I won't ask you either.\n"
"You are my reflection, {name}, just a little luckier. If ever you stand "
"before immense power sweeping away everything you care for — don't bow down, "
"just as I didn't.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 무엇을 할 수 있는가? 용서를 구해야 하나? 자비를 구해야 하나? 오. 나는 자비를 구걸하지 않을 것이다. 잃는 것 혹은 모든 "
"것을 잃어버린다는 것이 무엇을 의미하는지 나는 누구보다 잘 안다. 나는 그들이 내 어리석은 담대함을 비웃을 때 "
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 자비를 구걸하지 않을 것이다. 나는 너에게도 빌지 않을 것이다.\n"
"너는 내 거울이다. {name}. 그저 조금 운이 좋을 뿐이다. 네가 소중히 여기는 모든 것을 휩쓸어 버릴 엄청난 힘 앞에 서 있다면 "
"굴하지 말아라. 내가 그랬듯이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "f330a68d-5467-455b-b67a-ffb3bf0930f1"
msgid ""
"\"I have waited so long for you to be... braver. Well, let us waste no more "
"words. Decide now my fate.\""
msgstr "\"네가 더 용감해지길 기다린 지 오래다. 더 이상 시간 낭비하지 말자. 이제 내 운명을 결정하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "488beec7-ae70-4e6b-b1a9-dc85989fd802"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, what is this? Hearing your voice was like hearing myself, bold and "
"young, unbroken by the curse... I took a risk back then, and was defeated, "
"but must I continue to obey those who destroyed me? No, no, you're right. "
"May the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} be gone, together with his "
"conditions! I won't ask for forgiveness. I will stay with you, my victor. We "
"will see if we can rule the world together!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이게 뭐지? 너의 목소리를 듣는 것은 저주에 의해 망가지지 않았던, 용감하고 젊은 나 자신의 목소리를 듣는 것 같았다... 나는 "
"위험을 무릅썼고, 결국 패배했다, 하지만 나를 파괴한 자들에게 계속 복종해야만 하나? 아니, 아니야, 네가 맞다. "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 요구를 해도 그저 사라지게 두어라! 나는 용서를 구하지 않을 것이다. 나는 승리자인 너와 함께 "
"할 것이다. 우리가 함께 세상을 통치할 수 있는지 보자! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "fb747501-b335-4fbb-a11f-3312006bfa1d"
msgid ""
"\"What difference does it make now? It's useless! I can never take it back!\""
" {n}Nyrissa speaks with sudden rage, but the outburst passes quickly, and "
"she continues in a much calmer voice.{/n} \"Why do you want this? Why do you "
"want to return to me... what I lost?\""
msgstr ""
"\"지금은 어떤 차이가 있지? 소용 없다! 나는 결코 되돌리지 않을 것이다!\" {n}나이리사는 갑작스럽게 분노로 말하지만 분노는 오래지 "
"않아 훨씬 차분한 목소리로 계속합니다.{/n} \"왜 이걸 원하는 거지? 왜 원래의 나로... 돌아가게 하고 싶어하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "890f8afd-8e60-4b9d-86ef-0dea8d034a4d"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa raises her head and looks up at you astonished, as if she's "
"seeing you for the first time. She presses her hand to her heart and "
"freezes, like she's trying to hear it beat. Tears rolling silently from her "
"eyes.{/n} \"What is it... why does it hurt so much, why... to remember... to "
"understand...\n"
"I see it — the pestilence that devoured my beautiful dominion, my dear "
"sisters, friends, neighbors... and all the thousands of creatures it "
"touched. Was it a plague? Poison? No, no... it was me.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 처음으로 당신을 만나는 것처럼 고개를 들고 놀란 듯이 당신을 바라봅니다. 그녀는 손을 가슴에 쥐고 심장 박동을 듣는 "
"것처럼 멈춥니다. 그녀의 눈에서 눈물이 소리없이 떨어집니다.{/n} \"그것은 무엇이지... 왜 그렇게 아프지. 왜... 기억하고... "
"이해해야 하는 걸까...\n"
"나는 보았다. 나의 아름다운 영토, 사랑하는 자매, 친구, 이웃... 그리고 그것이 수천의 생물을 만지는 모습을. 그건 전염병일까? 독? "
"아니. 아니야... 나였어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "e47970b7-22d3-4a34-bfdb-83ab47ee2cb9"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa stands up and looks you in the eye.{/n} \"What if I say I want to "
"deserve your forgiveness? With all the fire and pain burning in my newly "
"awakened heart.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사가 일어서서 당신 눈을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"내가 너의 용서를 받을 자격이 있다고 말하면 어떨까? 내 심장은 새로이 깨어나 "
"타오르는 불로 고통받고 있어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "eed4d1dd-660e-47f8-825d-3b2308d4597a"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph smiles a faint smile.{/n} \"You've given so much — to one who "
"absolutely tormented you since your first meeting...\""
msgstr "{n}님프는 희미한 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"처음 만난 이후로 너를 괴롭힌 나에게 너무 많은 것을 주었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "a0b4506a-5986-41bc-b7d7-52fd30db64da"
msgid ""
"\"I am tormented by pain and guilt. They hide the sun of hope like a storm "
"cloud. Yet I will find the strength to move on. But you... will you help me?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 고통과 죄의식에 시달렸다. 그들은 폭풍의 구름처럼 희망의 태양을 숨긴다. 그러나 나는 앞으로 나아갈 힘을 찾을 것이다.하지만 "
"너는... 나를 도울 수 있겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "cc49ea51-a166-430c-8d81-344bb53e72a4"
msgid ""
"\"Whatever 'we' have in front of us... Has anyone ever touched me in this "
"way?\" {n}Nyrissa laughs musically.{/n} \"My dreams are mine again — and "
"they are a hundred times more wonderful in reality. My heart beats again as "
"it should. And now I see, and I know: I could only accept Briar from one who "
"gave the very thing they took: my love.\""
msgstr ""
"\"'우리' 앞에 놓여있는 것이 무엇이든... 이런 식으로 나를 보듬은 자가 있었나?\" {n}나이리사의 웃음은 활기찹니다.{/n} \"내"
" 꿈은 다시 내 것이 되었고, 실제가 되니 백 배나 더 멋지다. 멈추었던 내 심장은 다시 뛰었어. 이제 나는 이해할 수 있어: 나는 오직 "
"그들이 내게서 가져간 것을 주는 사람에게서만 찔레를 받을 수 있었어: 내 사랑을.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "5a23034c-78d9-408e-bfa9-96151c3d386c"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry...\" {n}Nyrissa whispers.{/n} \"I feel the frosty bite of fall, "
"before my spring has quit its blossoms. But let it be, let it be! It's more "
"than anything I could hope for. At least allow me to thank you. And help "
"you. I want to...\" {n}The nymph stops short.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"미안해...\" {n}나이리사는 속삭입니다.{/n} \"봄 꽃이 피기 전에 서리가 내린 느낌이야. 그러나 그대로 두게 해줘. 억지로 "
"바꾸지 말아줘! 나는 정말 바랄게. 적어도 나는 감사의 마음을 전하고 싶다. 그리고 도와주고 싶어. 나는... \" {n}님프는 잠시 "
"멈춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaFinal/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "033cd4bd-2682-4507-a07e-24b96e51ffc5"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph smiles faintly.{/n} \"I know not what I have done to deserve "
"such a gift, but it warms my wounded heart.\""
msgstr "{n}님프는 희미하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"나는 그런 선물을 받을 자격이 있는지 몰랐지만, 내 상처받은 마음은 따뜻해졌다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ef519d19-e1b9-489b-ac0d-9a87bc3e4998"
msgid "\"I need to understand what happened. This creature, it was...\""
msgstr "\"나는 무슨 일이 일어났는지 알아야겠다. 이 생물은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "128cbcd3-9e58-447c-b268-8ccd17985ac9"
msgid "\"If there is no other way, let's go to the portal.\""
msgstr "\"다른 방법이 없다면 포털로 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "0687dec3-afc6-4e47-8789-7197384f06f9"
msgid ""
"\"I have studied curses for a long time. Their greatest power is not magic, "
"but words. And what is created with words can be defeated with them.\""
msgstr "\"나는 오랫동안 저주를 배웠다. 그들의 위대한 힘은 마법이 아니라 말에 있다. 말과 함께 창조된 것은 말로 이길 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "ac4e4855-985b-4a9f-ab35-5fdd327d46ff"
msgid ""
"\"Have you heard of the gnome Tartuccio? He was cursed, and after his death "
"turned into a kobold named Tartuk. He later told me something amazing: what "
"was meant to humiliate and break him, had instead let him build up strength "
"and find his way. In the curse he found a sort of power.\""
msgstr ""
"\"노움 타투치오에 대해 들어보았나? 그는 저주를 받았고 사망한 후 타툭이라는 코볼트로 바뀌었다. 그는 나중에 나에게 놀라운 것을 말했다:"
" 굴욕을 느끼게 하고 파멸하려는 의도였던 것이, 대신 그에게 힘을 주고 그의 길을 찾게 했다. 저주를 받은 그는 일종의 힘을 발견했다. "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "9f6a8280-e232-4821-95d4-1ed5118352a6"
msgid ""
"\"Remember Armag, your wolf cub? You fed him lies, and used him as a weapon, "
"but he still found it in himself to seize the reins of his own destiny. For "
"thousands of years, you were the hand of fate in the Stolen Lands. Don't you "
"see how much power there is in those who are ready to fight until the end?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 늑대 새끼 아르막을 기억하나? 너는 그에게 거짓말을 하고 그를 무기로 사용했지만, 여전히 그는 자신의 운명을 고수하기 위해 그 "
"자신을 발견했다. 수천 년 동안 너는 도둑맞은 땅의 운명을 좌지우지 했다. 끝날 때까지 싸울 준비가 되어있는 사람들에게 얼마나 많은 힘이 "
"숨겨져 있는지 보이지 않은가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "1674a1e2-f4b8-4169-980e-73bbd06e651f"
msgid ""
"\"Trust me, Nyrissa. We will find a way to free you from the curse and "
"defeat the one who cursed you.\""
msgstr "\"나를 믿어라. 나이리사. 우리는 저주에서 너를 자유롭게하고 너를 저주한 사람을 물리칠 방법을 찾을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "ab27e1f3-40ae-48a1-a0e2-4aa455725b8d"
msgid ""
"\"I have told you everything I know about curses. But wait, there is one "
"more thing... Remember you cursed Vordakai, favorite of the Abaddon lords. "
"He was powerless against the curse, because it used a piece of his essence "
"turned against him. Can this help us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 저주에 대해 아는 것은 너에게 모두 들려주었다. 하지만 잠깐만, 아직 한 가지 더 있다... 네가 나락의 군주들의 충신 "
"보다카이를 저주했던 것을 기억하라. 그는 저주에 무력했는데, 그의 힘의 원천이 그에게 반작용했기 때문이다. 이것이 도움이 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "852d2b6e-c372-4b51-b420-5575b945bbae"
msgid "\"Where does the portal lead?\""
msgstr "\"포털은 어디로 이어졌을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "41fb7aba-9f98-4c71-84e2-d6f218f7ef1c"
msgid "\"I need to look around. I will return to you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 주변을 둘러 보고 싶다. 나는 너에게 돌아갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "c8823fe4-a921-4396-9627-92f8e77e63ad"
msgid ""
"\"Let your unrequited love guide you. Was that how it was said? Think about "
"the words of the curse. Words are the key to everything.\""
msgstr "\"네 조건없는 사랑을 따라가라. 그것이 전부였나? 저주의 말을 생각해 봐. 그 말이 모든 것의 실마리야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "95a1fb2b-56f7-4e86-b04d-9ecf4dc69b91"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know what else I can do to help. Is there no way we can free you "
"from the curse?\""
msgstr "\"나는 내가 도울 수 있는 것이 무엇인지 모르겠다. 너를 저주에서 해방시킬 수 있는 방법이 없을까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "f41972fb-1bac-44a7-a57d-dd646687907a"
msgid ""
"\"The curse cannot be all-powerful. It didn't change Evindra the way it "
"changed you and your Defaced Sisters.\""
msgstr "\"저주는 무적이 아니다. 에빈드라는 너나 얼굴 잃은 자매들처럼 바뀌지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "b0d1dbe9-79f2-4a23-a036-e25166904363"
msgid ""
"\"I told you this for a reason. A curse is not a spell. You are trying to "
"play by its rules, but you need to fight! — Or look for a way to turn its "
"evil power to your benefit.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이 사실을 너에게 이야기했다. 저주는 마법이 아니다. 너는 규칙에 놀아나지만 너는 싸워야 한다! 아니면 그 악의 힘을 너의 "
"이익으로 바꾸는 방법을 찾던가.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "37ae6087-defb-473d-8bd9-069b832a6f9d"
msgid "\"Just fight. One way or another, we will find a solution.\""
msgstr "\"싸워라. 결국에 우리는 해결책을 찾을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "fa3e7c6b-90aa-4e6c-809b-903f2712005b"
msgid ""
"\"If it's not clear how to free you from the spell, let's just fight the "
"Lantern King and make him tell us. Together we'll be able to defeat him, I "
"just know it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 마법으로부터 자유롭게 풀어주는 방법이 명확하지 않다면 등불왕과 싸워 대답을 얻어내자. 우리가 함께하면 그를 이길 수 있다. 나는 "
"알고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8c9b0ee8-a103-4be9-a946-c7837f699b17"
msgid ""
"\"How strange fate can be... A moment ago we were enemies, and now we stand "
"shoulder to shoulder against a demigod. My kingdom is in ruins, my thousand "
"year journey is at a dead-end. — So why do I feel so... alive?\""
msgstr ""
"\"운명의 아이러니란... 한 순간 우리는 원수였고 이제는 우리는 반신에 대항하여 어깨를 나란히 한다. 내 왕국은 폐허가 되었고 천 년의 "
"여행은 막 다른 길에 있다. 그런데 왜 나는... 활력을 느끼지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "3a3a009f-467a-4e96-b292-02e670e0f765"
msgid ""
"\"The warm wind brings a new season, and our life can change the same way.\" "
"{n}Nyrissa looks at you sadly.{/n} \"Your returned my soul to me, {name}. "
"While I, I'm afraid, have led you to your death. None of us can defeat this "
"enemy...\""
msgstr ""
"\"따뜻한 바람은 새로운 계절을 가져오고 우리 삶은 똑같은 방식으로 바뀔 수 있다.\" {n}나이리사는 당신을 슬프게 바라봅니다.{/n} "
"\"네가 내 영혼을 돌려 주었다. {name}. 내가 두려워 하는 동안 나는 너를 죽음으로 인도했다. 우리 중 누구도 이 적을 물리 칠 "
"수 없다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "75538a90-96d2-4ff2-a017-6af2a67c843b"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}. He who cursed me in the past. Are you "
"baffled? That's perfectly natural — few can understand the games of the "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. Even I barely can.\" {n}Nyrissa waves her hands, as if "
"rehearsing a dance move.{/n} \"Our lives are toys for them, our fates a ball "
"of yarn. To knit or to cut, to tie knots or make loops — is there a "
"difference?\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이다. 과거에 나를 저주 한 자이다. 당황스러운가? 정말 자연스러운 것이다. "
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 게임을 이해할 수있는 사람은 거의 없다. 나도 간신히 이해할 수 있었다.\" {n}나이리사는 마치 댄스 "
"연습을 연습하는 것처럼 손을 흔듭니다.{/n} \"우리의 삶은 그들을 위한 장난감이고 우리의 운명은 실타래이다. 뜨개질하거나 자르거나 "
"매듭을 묶거나 고리를 만든다 — 여기에 무슨 차이가 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "d4ef2382-f7d9-4286-b05d-96f07ca9e517"
msgid ""
"\"If only it were so easy! To say, 'Nyrissa, {d|CursesTE}you aren't cursed "
"any more{/d}. You can laugh and love again! Your connection to {g|First "
"World}the First World{/g} is alive and well, and those who are precious to "
"you never faced death...\" {n}The nymph keeps silent for some time, staring "
"off into the distance.{/n} \"But the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} could not destroy "
"Briar, only hide it from me. And now my laughter and my love are with me "
"again. Does this mean the almighty {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} is "
"perhaps not so almighty?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇게 쉬웠더라면! 말해봐, '나이리사, {d|CursesTE}너는 더 이상 저주받지 않았다{/d}. 너는 웃을 수 있고 다시 사랑할 "
"수있다! {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}와 너의 연결이 잘 살아 있고, 너에게 소중한 자들은 결코 죽음에 직면하지 "
"않았다...'\" {n}님프는 잠시 동안 침묵을 유지하며 먼 곳을 응시합니다.{/n} \"하지만 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 찔레를 "
"파괴할 수 없었고, 그저 나에게서 숨길 뿐이다. 그리고 이제 나의 웃음과 사랑이 다시 나와 함께한다. 이것은 전능한 "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 전능하지 않다는 것을 의미하는 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "929509c6-7dee-47d5-b55a-7cdc1962e121"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I recognize the hand of the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}. If anyone "
"could play such a joke on a poor gnome, it would be him. So you said "
"Tartuccio {d|Tartuk TE}wasn't broken{/d} by the burden of the curse? How "
"frustrating that must be for the one who wanted to see him crushed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 손을 보았다. 누군가 불쌍한 노움에게 그런 농담을 한다면 그 자가 틀림 없다. 너는 "
"타투치오라고 말했다. 타투치오가 저주에 의해 {d|Tartuk TE}망가지지 않았다고?{/d} 그가 저주받기를 기대하는 사람에게는 "
"실망스러운 소식이군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "52b91051-31e7-4bca-9b78-61eec9dd6648"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, yes, my wolf cub was {d|Armag TE}strong{/d}. I would not choose a "
"weakling. So what are you suggesting? To learn from the examples of amusing "
"wild beasts?\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 그래. 내 늑대 새끼는 {d|Armag TE}강하다{/d}. 나는 약한 것을 선택하지 않는다. 그래서 너는 무엇을 제안하는 "
"거지? 야생 짐승을 즐겁게 한 경험에서 무엇을 배웠다는 거지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6b4dd9b0-65fe-4a08-93c7-9d5abe5f9009"
msgid ""
"\"You've already done incredible things for me, my spring. Even if I die, "
"I'll die the way I once was, before the curse mangled me. But everything has "
"its limits, and our power does as well. The curse and the one who cursed "
"me... they are stronger than us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신은 이미 내게, 나의 봄이 오도록 놀라운 일을 했다. 내가 죽어도 나는 예전처럼 저주에 망가지기 전의 모습으로 죽을 거다.하지만 "
"모든 것에 한계가 있고 우리의 힘도 그렇다. 저주도 그렇고 나를 저주한 자는... 우리보다 강하다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "773079e3-0f50-4828-9176-954dbf185012"
msgid ""
"\"I was able to curse an ancient almighty creature... maybe that's the hint? "
"Vordakai imbued his own name with a piece of his {d|Vordakai TE}very self{/d}"
". If only we could find anything connected with the {g|LanternKing}Lantern "
"King{/g} in the same way, something that represents him…\" {n}Nyrissa's eyes "
"kindle.{/n} \"You have given me knowledge, and with it hope. I'll find a way "
"to turn them into a weapon against our enemy. There's a terrible battle "
"ahead, but my faith has been rekindled.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 고대의 전능한 생물을 저주할 수 있었다... 아마도 그것이 힌트가 되지 않을까? 보다카이는 자신의 이름을 {d|Vordakai "
"TE}자아{/d}의 일부분에 불어넣었다. 같은 방식으로 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}과 연결된 물건을 찾을 수만 있다면, 그를 "
"대신할 무언가를 찾는다면... \" {n}나이리사의 눈이 빛납니다.{/n} \"너는 내게 지식과 희망을 주었다. 나는 그들을 적에게 "
"맞서는 무기로 만들 수 있는 방법을 찾아 낼 것이다. 앞으로 끔찍한 싸움이 벌어지겠지만, 나의 믿음은 다시 불붙었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "423376d4-1cd7-4fd8-a7ba-4ea3228e098c"
msgid ""
"\"Can I put this vast abyss of sense into words? I'll try. The "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} likes performances. In one of them, you and "
"I turned out to be the main characters. It's little surprise that he was "
"watching you. He likes masks, hints and vague words, the meaning of which is "
"revealed only later. But he didn't like the end of the story, and he wants "
"to rewrite it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 광대한 심연을 말로 표현할 수 있을까? 한 번 말해 보지. {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 공연을 좋아한다. 그들 중 "
"너와 나는 주인공으로 밝혀졌다. 그가 너를 지켜보고 있었다는 것은 놀랍지가 않다. 그는 가면, 힌트, 모호한 단어를 좋아하는데, 그 "
"의미는 나중이 되서야 드러난다. 그러나 그는 그 이야기가 끝나는 걸 좋아하지 않았고, 이를 다시 쓰기를 원한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "85bf7911-b8a8-413e-b3b4-1ea7d0ee6515"
msgid ""
"\"Can't you guess? To your kingdom. The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} is there "
"already... with all his wrath.\""
msgstr "\"모르겠어? 네 왕국에 말이다. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 이미 그곳에 있다... 그의 모든 분노와 함께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "aa5118b9-1d56-4cde-915a-0981fac0529f"
msgid ""
"\"There isn't. But remember — on the other side is your world, not the "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest's{/g}. Each king is stronger on their own land. So let us "
"go. If we've any chance to conquer the unconquerable — it is there, beyond "
"the portal.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그렇지 않다. 그러나 기억해라 — 다른 쪽은 너의 세계이다, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 것이 아니라. 각각의 왕은 자기 땅에서 "
"더 강하다. 그럼 우리는 가겠다. 우리가 그 무적을 정복할 기회가 있다면, 그 또한 거기에, 포탈 너머에 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "ab8708ee-00fc-4d27-a6fe-a0e86aa62dfb"
msgid "\"I will wait for you here. Now don't waste precious time!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 여기서 기다리겠다. 귀중한 시간을 낭비하지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "979b1f85-f714-4a3c-b979-0462bc2b3537"
msgid "\"If you wish to see your kingdom again, we need to hurry.\""
msgstr "\"다시 네 왕국을 보고 싶다면, 우리는 서둘러야만 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "4685cc61-a811-4182-9eae-8239e7500465"
msgid ""
"\"I'm afraid there isn't. But I can help you defeat the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}"
". If I can't be cured, I can at least have my revenge. Right?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 그렇지 않다는 것이 두렵다. 하지만 나는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}를 이기도록 너를 도울 수 있다. 내가 회복될 수 없다면, "
"최소한 나의 복수할 수는 있겠지. 안그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "a808cf68-a408-4928-b710-cfacf0a61bcd"
msgid ""
"\"Oh yes, my grumpy cousin...\" {n}Nyrissa takes a deep breath.{/n} \"Yes, "
"she hasn't changed a bit. Just keeps lecturing me. But she was never as "
"close to me as my sisters. — I think that's what saved her from the curse, "
"not some special mental strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오. 그래. 네 심술 궂은 사촌...\" {n}나이리사는 심호흡을 합니다.{/n} \"그래. 그녀는 조금도 변하지 않았다. 계속 "
"나에게 잔소리 하지. 하지만 나의 자매들처럼 절대로 가까운 사이가 아니었다. 특별한 정신력이 아니라 그게 그녀를 저주에서 구한 것 같다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "828d24cb-4d70-4b29-b886-572c7c2065f2"
msgid ""
"\"But how? How can I do that? Although...\" {n}Nyrissa is suddenly lost in "
"thought.{/n} \"Created with words, defeated with words... find power in "
"ruin... fight, don't play by the rules... It's like I'm trying to find a "
"single ray of light in the darkness! How can I find it?\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 어떻게? 어떻게 내가 할 수 있지? 그럼에도...\" {n}나이리사는 갑자기 혼란에 빠졌습니다.{/n} \"말로 창조를 하고, "
"말로 승리를 하고... 폐허 속에서 힘을 찾아라... 싸워라, 규칙을 지키지 마라... 나는 어둠 속에서 빛 한 줄기를 찾으려고 하는 것 "
"같다! 내가 어떻게 찾지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "cc503910-ca1a-402d-b4e8-41609665b57d"
msgid ""
"\"I remember every line as if I just heard it a moment ago. Can we... turn "
"his joke back on the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}? Play with him as he "
"has played with us?\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 말들이 방금 전에 들었던 것처럼 생생하다. {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}에 관한 농담을 다시 해볼까? 그가 우리에게 "
"장난친 것처럼 그에게 장난을 친다면?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "fb275c1a-6a4a-4799-8a49-3e541461a6df"
msgid ""
"\"We don't just need to find the answer, but overpower the one who put us in "
"this situation. Overpower... or...\""
msgstr "\"우리는 답을 찾을 필요가 없지만 우리를 이 상황에 빠뜨린 자를 압도한다. 압도하거나... 아니면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "f38d00de-ac39-45fb-91dc-ad3b7dad6318"
msgid ""
"\"Just fight the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}!? Ah... Once I challenged them, and "
"saw the death of everything I cherished. Can I take it again? Well, there's "
"no way back, is there? Let's go. It's time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그냥 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}와 싸운다고?! 아... 내가 그들에게 도전했을 때 내가 소중히 한 모든 것의 죽음을 보았다. 그걸 "
"다시 봐야 하나? 뭐, 돌아갈 길은 없어. 그렇지? 가자. 때가 됐다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "42b8e657-ffd1-42d7-b149-b86f2ae01ea6"
msgid ""
"\"That doesn't bode well for either of us. But we've little choice but go "
"through the portal and find out what he has planned.\""
msgstr "\"우리 중 누구에게도 좋은 징조는 아니다. 포털을 통해 그가 계획 한 것을 찾아내는 것 외에는 선택의 여지가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0043_Text
msgctxt "60e03a00-2b89-4b0b-bf90-57a20da5ac7f"
msgid ""
"\"You returned to me what he had taken. We might go forth hand in hand, to "
"build our common future. But now I'm afraid we have no choice but step "
"through the portal and await our sentencing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그가 취한 것을 너는 나에게 되돌려 주었다. 우리는 공통의 미래를 건설하기 위해 손잡고 나아갈 수도 있다. 그러나 포털을 가로 질러 "
"우리의 미래를 기다리는 것 외에 선택의 여지가 없다는 것이 두렵다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/NyrissaIfAlive/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "ae54668b-c568-41ec-8e6e-d07797fbc03b"
msgid ""
"\"We must win. For us! For the blooming land that we can create together. "
"Let us go! Our time has come.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 승리해야 한다! 우리를 위해! 우리가 함께 만들 수있는 번성하는 영토를 위해서. 가자! 우리의 시간이 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ab269665-2b13-4d21-8834-a30f1ba94742"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "10f1c191-dbac-4d92-b5fe-f6c56f712171"
msgid ""
"\"No, I want to know where Nyrissa is and what she's plotting. Tell me, and "
"I'll protect you from her.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 나이리사가 어디에 있고 무엇을 계획하고 있는지 알고 싶다. 말해 줘. 나는 그녀에게서 너를 지켜 줄거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d1da0ab2-b7a5-4606-b19a-04214cbb331a"
msgid "\"I have to go. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b43746ab-f396-4996-ba11-bf4fc7ecf2ce"
msgid "[Attack] \"You serve Nyrissa, so I'll have to kill you. Just in case.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 나이리사를 섬기므로 죽여야 해. 혹시 모르니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "d697d03e-9a62-48f1-b866-941c2c20df5f"
msgid "\"Do you know where Nyrissa is hiding?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 숨어있는 곳을 아는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "c0cf8202-39e8-44db-a7e0-e5cd3347af01"
msgid "\"Tell me about the library. It's rather strange.\""
msgstr "\"도서관에 대해 말해 봐. 조금 이상하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "d8a45342-db07-4ff2-8252-cce7653eab6e"
msgid "\"Yes, that's right. Tell me about the treasure.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다. 보물에 대해 말해달라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "ef599fb8-ec67-4f3e-84fe-9292fb7c83f0"
msgid "[Look into the book]"
msgstr "[책을 들여다 봅니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "4593865f-e76c-4f34-8e5b-8d7bc88cffc1"
msgid "\"Not this time.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 아니야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "0b655e82-1187-4250-8efd-c96878856c34"
msgid "[Use detect magic]"
msgstr "[탐지 마법을 시전합니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "d4fd0a0c-bcdc-49fe-adf4-3b5331bc27f2"
msgid ""
"{n}Water from the broken water-clock flows away in streams — but not all of "
"it. Some freezes indecisively and then assumes the shape of a small winged "
"creature.{/n} \"Why did you break the clock? The mistress will be angry and "
"boil me! If only someone would give her a new clock instead. But it had "
"better be a sun clock or an hourglass. I'm tired of living in the clock, let "
"somebody else watch it. But what if the mistress makes me live in a pot or a "
"kettle?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}깨진 물시계에서 흘러나온 물은 물줄기를 이루었지만 모두 쏟아지지는 않았습니다. 일부는 서서히 얼어 붙고 작은 날개 달린 생물체의 "
"모습을 취합니다.{/n} \"왜 시계를 부수었지? 여주인이 화가 나서 나를 끓여버릴 거야! 누군가가 그녀에게 새로운 시계를 주면 좋겠다. "
"해시계나 모래시계라면 더 좋을 것 같아. 나는 시계에 사는 것이 지겨워. 다른 누군가가 시계를 지켰으면 해. 그러나 여주인이 나를 냄비나 "
"주전자에 살게 한다면 어쩌지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "24db1bb0-9b58-473c-a6f3-b6d953519675"
msgid ""
"\"No, no, don't ask me! I can't disclose my mistress's secrets! She'll "
"punish me. Would you like me to tell you something interesting instead? "
"About the House? {g|First World}The First World{/g}? The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}"
"? The secret treasure?\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 나에게 묻지 마! 나는 여주인의 비밀을 밝힐 수 없다! 그녀가 나를 처벌할 거야. 너에게 재미있는 걸 말하기를 바라? 집에 "
"대해서? {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}는? {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는? 비밀의 보물은? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "630e1573-3eee-4994-83f1-dc297904fe27"
msgid ""
"\"Pludock,\" {n}the creature looks at you devotedly, then stops, apparently "
"realizing that a name is not enough.{/n} \"I am a mephit. The mistress "
"placed me here to watch the clock. The clock is very important for the "
"library. If you don't look at it, you might go on reading forever and forget "
"about everything. {n}It's hard to tell by the mephit's tone whether he's "
"joking or literally means complete oblivion.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"플루독.\" {n}그 생물은 당신을 헌신적으로 바라보고는 멈추고 이름이 적절하지 않다는 것을 깨닫습니다.{/n} \"나는 메피트야. "
"여주인이 시계를 감시하라고 나를 여기에 두었어. 시계는 도서관에서 매우 중요하다. 그것을 보지 않는다면 모든 것을 잊고 책을 영원히 "
"읽어버릴지도 모르니까.\" {n}메피트의 말투가 농담인지 정말로 완전한 망각을 의미하는지 확실하지 않았습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "1cb5546b-adfe-4299-a16d-7cab9f2429b6"
msgid ""
"\"Heh. You don't seem evil. I'll tell you some...\" {n}The Mephit doesn't "
"finish. For a moment you feel the oppressive presence of a mighty power — "
"and then the mephit's body boils, and he turns to steam, screaming "
"desperately.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"헤. 너는 사악해 보이지 않아. 내가 너에게 말해 줄께...\" {n}메피트는 말을 마치지 못했습니다. 잠시 동안 당신은 강력한 "
"힘으로 인해 압박감을 느낍니다. 그리고 메피트의 몸이 끓어올랐고, 필사적인 비명과 함께 수증기가 되었습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "1b231a68-4a5a-48f7-89f1-6c335ffd50d2"
msgid "\"I'm not stupid. I won't tell! Let's talk about books, all right?\""
msgstr "\"나는 바보가 아니다. 나는 말하지 않을 것이다! 책에 대해 이야기하자. 알겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "d5dc70b7-dc61-41f9-93a9-926e3abe08d4"
msgid "\"It's you again! Don't break anything else, okay?\""
msgstr "\"너 또 왔어! 다른 건 부수지 마. 알았지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "02382aef-d3ea-417d-811c-a7de515570fa"
msgid ""
"{n}The mephit leans over to you and whispers mysteriously,{/n} \"The "
"treasure is here, inside the library! But to open the way, you'll need to "
"put the right books into the right bookcases. I'll tell you which ones! "
"There are six books and three bookcases: Wrath, Fear, Sorrow. No one likes "
"to read Sorrow, Wrath and Fear, of course. That's why they hid the treasure "
"behind them. When you find all the books, put the good ones on the top "
"shelves, and the bad ones on the lower shelves. Just like that! And you'll "
"get a treasure! See? I'm so useful — I know so much!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메핏은 당신에게 기대어 신비하게 속삭입니다.{/n} \"도서관 안의 보물은 여기에 있다! 그러나 길을 열려면 적절한 책을 올바른 "
"책장에 넣어야 한다. 나는 어떤 책인지 말해주겠다! 책 6권과 3개의 책꽂이가 있다. 분노, 공포, 슬픔이 그것이다. 누구도 슬픔, "
"격노, 두려움을 읽는 것을 좋아하지 않는다. 그래서 그들이 그것들 뒤에 보물을 숨겼다. 모든 책을 발견하면 책장 위에 좋은 것들을 올리고 "
"나쁜 책은 책장 아래에 놓아라. 그렇게 하면 된다! 그러면 너는 보물을 얻을 거야. 알겠지? 나는 아주 유용해. 나는 정말 똑똑해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "5fa3d8f6-1d5b-406c-b5c8-37a88b64833d"
msgid ""
"\"I've never seen any other libraries. What are they like? Probably "
"bookcases hanging from the ceilings, and mephits living in the fireplace. "
"Let me tell you about this library. It's for our books, ones from {g|First "
"World}the First World{/g}. Other types of books don't like it here and "
"disappear. We have books about everything: joy, triumph, fear... If you want "
"to, you can walk around and read whatever you like. But remember: books "
"about evil and bad things are on the lower shelves. Terrible fear. Vicious "
"joy. Books about good things go on the top shelves!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 다른 도서관을 본적이 없다. 그들은 어떻게 생겼지? 아마도 천장에 매달려있는 책장이 있고 메피트가 벽난로에서 살테지. 이 "
"도서관에 대해 이야기 해줄게. 여기는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 책들을 보관하고 있어. 다른 유형의 서적은 여기를 "
"좋아하지 않아서 사라진다. 여기에는 기쁨, 승리, 두려움 등 모든 것에 관한 책이 있다. 원한다면 걸어다니며 좋아하는 책을 찾아 읽을 "
"수도 있어. 그러나 기억해라. 악한 것과 나쁜 것에 관한 책들이 아래 선반에 있다. 끔찍한 공포. 사악한 기쁨들 말이다. 좋은 것에 관한 "
"책은 선반 꼭대기에 있고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "cfdfd6fa-a4f8-482f-b39a-3c9dc4296688"
msgid ""
"{n}You open the book and see... Octavia. Her eyes are glowing brightly with "
"courage and compassion for those in trouble. Her smile is full of life and "
"joy. Have you ever seen anything more beautiful?{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 책을 열고... 옥타비아를 봅니다. 그녀의 눈은 곤경에 처한 사람들을 위해 용기와 연민으로 밝게 빛나고 있습니다. 그녀의 "
"미소는 삶과 기쁨으로 가득 차 있습니다. 그보다 더 아름다운 것을 있을까요?{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "a0a23248-ea46-44bf-be4b-a12f103073b2"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity you don't like to read... I have no one here to talk to!\""
msgstr "\"네가 책 읽는 것을 좋아하지 않아 유감스럽다... 나는 대화할 사람이 없구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "862e4cf3-d815-4eb1-9958-abded3451a19"
msgid ""
"\"Although the mistress stopped reading books from the top shelves long ago, "
"and many of them were scattered around the house. I barely saved my favorite "
"book — about Beauty.\" {n}The mephit narrows his eyes with a serene look.{/n}"
" \"Vast waves roll under the blue sky! The waterfall is falling, deep into "
"the rainbow! Would you like to read it?\" {n}He carefully fishes out a "
"little book from the pieces of the clock. It doesn't look harmed by water at "
"all. The mephit opens it for you to see, but he's not letting go of it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"여주인이 책장에서 책을 읽지 않은 것이 오래되기에, 많은 책들이 집 안에 흩어져 버렸다. 나는 아름다움에 관한 책을 간직하지 못했어."
"\" {n}메피트는 조용한 시선과 함께 눈을 좁힙니다.{/n} \"광대한 파도가 푸른 하늘 아래 밀려온다! 폭포가 무지개 깊숙히 떨어지고 "
"있다! 읽어보고 싶어?\" {n}그는 조심스럽게 시계 조각에서 작은 책을 꺼냅니다. 물에 전혀 젖지 않았습니다. 메피트는 당신이 볼 수 "
"있도록 열어 주지만 손에서 놓지는 않을 것입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "bf064043-48e5-4eef-aef3-66e9fbcf3050"
msgid ""
"\"There is nothing written here! It's pure magic, causing the 'reader' to "
"have this or that emotion. It's primitive. Tasteless! Pointless, devoid of "
"even the shadow of the author's hand! It's the poorest representation of the "
"idea of 'book' that I've ever seen!\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기엔 아무것도 쓰여 있지 않잖아! 그건 순수하게 마법이다, '독자'에게 이런 저런 감정을 갖게 하지. 원시적인 방식이야. 재미없군! "
"저자의 손 그림자조차 없는 무의미한 책이야! 내가 본 '책' 중 철학이 가장 없잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : NokNok_Companion
msgctxt "0f6d78e8-9cc1-46cc-9662-eb144f3a184c"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin tries to peak in the book and winces, as if splashed with "
"boiling water.{/n} \"Books! Disgusting magic books! Why it shows me these "
"pictures? Why we not burn this li-ba-ry? We kill water beastie and burn "
"everything!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 끓는 물이 튀는 것처럼 책에 올라서 찡그립니다.{/n} \"책들! 마법 책들이 싫어! 왜 이 그림들을 보여준 거야? 이 "
"도서관을 태-우-자. 우리는 저 물의 짐승을 죽이고 모든 것을 태워야 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "20937f0b-c670-45da-b87c-579f25617633"
msgid ""
"\"I like this. I see moonlit meadows, beautiful young boys and girls... I "
"wonder if these books will work outside {g|First World}the First World{/g}? "
"I'd take an edition or two of Beauty with me. And a thick volume of "
"Patience. — Especially if there's one entitled 'Patience for Those "
"Surrounded by Weaklings, Fools, and Wimps'.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이것을 좋아한다. 나는 달빛이 보이는 초원, 아름다운 어린 소년과 소녀들이 보인다...이 책들이 {g|First World}태초 "
"세계{/g} 바깥에서 작동하는지 궁금한걸? 나는 한 두 권의 '아름다움'을 가질 거다. 그리고 두꺼운 '인내'의 책자도. 특히 약자, "
"바보, 겁쟁이에 둘러싸인 사람들을 위한 '인내'란 제목이 붙은 책이 있다면 말이야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "fa570f8a-a1e5-441a-b61d-7837dfdd06e1"
msgid ""
"{n}You open the book and see... Regongar. Looking at him is like watching a "
"living flame, one that is strong, fierce and rebellious.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 책을 열었고... 레곤가르를 봅니다. 그를 바라보는 것은 강하고 격렬하며 반발하는 살아있는 불꽃을 보는 것과 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0033_Text
msgctxt "97a99b62-4aa2-4d77-ae6e-ed152d1072ef"
msgid ""
"{n}You open the book and see... Valerie... Courage and loyalty, steadfast, "
"and willing to face her fate — all of this reflected in her eyes.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 책을 열자... 발레리가 보입니다... 용기와 충성, 확고하고 기꺼이 운명에 맞서고자 하는 것이 그녀의 눈에 반영되어 "
"있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "85de5b02-0435-45c9-b154-5132e35ad3c1"
msgid ""
"{n}You open the book and see... Tristian. He seems woven of sunlight — the "
"light of kindness and selflessness, coming from his soul.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이을 책을 열자... 트리스티안이 보입니다. 그는 햇빛으로 짜여져 있는 사람처럼 보입니다. 친절과 이타심의 빛이 그의 "
"영혼으로부터 빛납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0035_Text
msgctxt "50c30875-00bf-4eb7-af26-bb6fb4bcd03a"
msgid ""
"{n}You open the book and see... Nyrissa. Is that her? The nymph's beautiful "
"face is not disfigured by cruelty and despair — instead joy and endless "
"fascination glow upon it. All the madness of the blooming lands, and the "
"changeability of {g|First World}the First World{/g} are embodied in the "
"nymph's appearance. This is probably what she was like before the curse.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 책을 열자... 나이리사가 보입니다. 그녀가 맞습니까? 님프의 아름다운 얼굴은 잔인함과 절망에 의해 일그러지지 않았습니다 — "
"그 대신 기쁨과 끝없는 매력이 빛납니다. 개화가 일어나는 땅의 모든 광기와 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 변덕스러움이 "
"님프의 외모에 구현되었습니다. 아마도 그녀가 저주를 받기 전 모습 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "96384234-d6af-40d4-8781-745e403b53e2"
msgid ""
"{n}You open the book. A series of vague images flash before you: clouds "
"flowing across the sky, the faces of those you care about or desire, "
"incredible scenes from {g|First World}the First World{/g}, and others from "
"your homeland, more familiar but no less charming.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}책을 엽니다. 일련의 막연한 이미지가 당신 앞에서 깜박입니다. 하늘을 가로 지르는 구름, 당신이 아끼던 혹은 갈망하던 자들의 모습, "
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 믿을 수 없는 광경이 펼쳐졌고 당신의 고향에서 온 사람들은 더 친숙하지만 덜 "
"매력적입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "e07d8a40-a9ce-4b4f-84fa-79933844fca4"
msgid ""
"{n}You open the book and see... Regongar and Octavia. Day and night, the "
"gleaming whiteness of snow and the surface of boiling lava. There is "
"incredible beauty in the contrast, the synergy of opposites.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 책을 열어 보고... 레곤가르과 옥타비아를 봅니다. 낮밤으로 순백의 눈이 반짝이는 모습과 끓는 용암 표면과 같습니다. 대조 "
"속에 놀라운 아름다움과 상극의 시너지 효과가 보입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "634c63fa-c8f5-4297-b585-d31f8efca1ca"
msgid ""
"\"Do you see? Beautiful, beautiful waves! And such a white waterfall!\" {n}"
"Says mephit in awe.{/n}"
msgstr "\"봤어? 아름답고 아름다운 파도야! 그리고 하얀 폭포도 있어!\" {n}경외심에 메피트는 말합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : HATEOT_MephitPludok
msgctxt "582d8890-13cb-45bb-9106-0cc160db6fb2"
msgid ""
"{n}You feel the presence of a powerful spell targeting the mephit. It's "
"obvious that the spell's creator is not the creature itself, but someone "
"much more powerful. It's hard to identify the spell's school of magic or its "
"purpose. You can assume that right now it only provides passive effects, but "
"it could be activated by some trigger or command.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 메피트를 목표로 한 강력한 주문의 존재를 느낍니다. 주문의 창조자는 생물 자체가 아니라 훨씬 더 강력한 존재라는 것이 "
"명백합니다. 마법 학교의 마법인지 혹은 그 목적을 밝히기가 어렵습니다. 지금은 패시브 효과만 제공한다고 가정할 수 있지만 어떤 격발 "
"장치나 명령에 의해 활성화 될 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Pludock/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : Kanerah_Companion
msgctxt "37e8823d-4b13-4083-bb5f-26ab4a7e6985"
msgid ""
"\"Now that's strange. I can't see a thing. Wait... There's the glitter of "
"gems... And the bodies of lovers entwined in a passionate embrace... Ah, now "
"it's gone again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상하군. 아무것도 보이지 않아. 기다려... 보석이 반짝이는군... 열정적으로 껴안은 연인의 몸도 있어... 아. 이제는 사라졌군."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "94e961de-0870-40a0-8c58-6514ff0758b7"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "ccf83986-3cd6-42f8-a6b4-3a4be79813d9"
msgid "\"We've met.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 만났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "d7e22d31-e6c4-435b-ac54-a75e96dc2491"
msgid "\"I can still give you the Crown...\""
msgstr "\"나는 아직도 너에게 크라운을 줄 수 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "a9127fd5-449c-4483-ac5a-b338948ceb06"
msgid ""
"\"I'm surprised you'd talk to me like this. I thought the Eldest were equal "
"to gods here, in the First World.\""
msgstr "\"네가 이런 말을 하는 것이 놀랍다. 태초 세계에서 원로는 신들과 동등하다고 생각했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "228a93a5-9e69-444d-99ab-05157685b7e1"
msgid "\"Why are you here?\""
msgstr "\"왜 여기에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "a4940347-ffa5-4a42-a99d-982e90d03003"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "69e07c59-aa7e-48dc-a8ca-8efc91e546b8"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe you'll tell us what you're planning to do with the First Crown?\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관에 관한 계획에 대해 무엇을 알지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d3af13c2-6d69-4359-8e63-8caeee6a805a"
msgid ""
"Blamed Shyka and the other Eldest for treating people's death and suffering "
"as entertainment."
msgstr "다른 자들의 죽음과 고통을 오락거리로 생각하는 샤이카와 다른 원로들을 비난합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "fbef733b-79d5-4d5c-81ea-19e5988b2e74"
msgid ""
"\"A performance? Were these thousands of thousands of broken lives and "
"deaths just entertainment for you?\""
msgstr "\"공연이라고? 이 수천 수백만의 부서진 삶과 죽음이 단지 너를 위한 오락이었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6b4d360a-3c31-4fb8-8c5b-56841e00b586"
msgid "Called yourself the main character in the show arranged by the Eldest."
msgstr "당신 스스로를 원로가 준비한 쇼의 주인공이라고 불렀습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "9773ffe7-4e8d-47e0-9493-353eb0137e8b"
msgid ""
"\"Then take a front row seat. The ending will be exciting, and I'm the main "
"character.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 앞줄 좌석에 앉아라. 결말은 흥미진진할 거야. 나는 주인공이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0024_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "5bed6602-77bf-4d55-9100-3449179a32b1"
msgid ""
"Wished to have enough power to entertain yourself with the deaths of whole "
"empires."
msgstr "모든 제국의 죽음으로 자신을 즐겁게 할 수 있는 충분한 힘을 갖기 바란다고 말합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "f4d3dff3-8260-4b80-b2d4-fe1c2417bb70"
msgid ""
"\"A performance? I wish I had the power to entertain myself with the deaths "
"of entire empires!\""
msgstr "\"공연? 나는 모든 제국의 죽음으로 나 자신을 즐겁게 할 힘이 있었으면 좋겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "30379323-75ed-472a-a7a9-ba649f0c1f7b"
msgid ""
"{n}A {d|AnotherShyka}figure{/d} hiding in the library's shadows looks "
"somehow blurred, its shape in subtle flux. You hear laughter coming from "
"under the hood.{/n} \"Oh, it's you. How amusing. We thought you'd be taller."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}도서관 그림자에 숨은 {d|AnotherShyka}형체{/d}는 미묘하고 흐릿하게 흐릅니다. 후드 아래에서 웃음 소리가 "
"들립니다.{/n} \"오. 너구나. 이 얼마나 재미있는가. 네가 더 성장했을 거라 생각했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "aaea6077-3547-4f45-a1b8-4c49cacc2af6"
msgid "\"Not yet. It will happen around... yesterday? Or was it a month ago?\""
msgstr "\"아직은 아니다. 이제 일어날 것이다... 어제? 아니면 한달 전에 그랬던가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "67f56b15-9903-4ef1-806c-b09ae1c074f4"
msgid ""
"\"This isn't a good time. But it's all right, you can always give us the "
"Crown in the past, when we come for it! Wait, on second thought, no, you "
"can't. So forget that. But there's a right time for everything.\""
msgstr ""
"\"적절한 때가 아니다. 하지만 괜찮다. 우리가 찾으러 오면 너는 과거에 언제나 왕관을 줄 수 있다! 잠깐. 다시 생각해보니 안되겠다. "
"잊어 버려. 모든 것이 바로잡힐 시간은 올 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "75a19d14-590f-4049-ab71-9e913c3803a7"
msgid ""
"\"We are {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} the Many, the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} of Time. We "
"would tell you more, but we already did that in another timeline. Why should "
"we do it again?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 시간의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}, 다수의 {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}다. 너에게 더 많은 것을 이야기하고 싶지만 이미 "
"다른 시간대에 말해주었다. 왜 우리가 다시해야 하지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "bdf0bc5c-5fe4-4c1a-89d9-62c1700fde72"
msgid ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} laughs musically.{/n} \"But you've spoken with the "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}! Many times. Many, many times.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}의 웃음은 경쾌합니다.{/n} \"하지만 너는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}와 대화를 나눴다! 아주 "
"많이 말이다. 아주, 아주 여러 번 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "9baf51e6-2076-4495-a454-444b19e44a5f"
msgid ""
"\"Long long ago one of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} prepared a performance for "
"the others. You must know the curse. 'Destroy a thousand kingdoms, fill the "
"cup, and you, Nyrissa, will be forgiven!' The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}"
" has always had problems with his sense of proportion — the performance "
"turned out to be overlong, but quite amusing at times. We wouldn't want to "
"miss the finale.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오래 전에 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}중 하나가 다른 사람들을 위한 공연을 준비했다. 너는 저주에 대해 알아야 한다. '천 개의 "
"왕국을 파괴하고 잔을 채우면 나이리사가 용서받을 거야!' {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 항상 비율에 대한 감각에 문제가 "
"있었다 — 공연은 너무 길어졌지만, 때로는 재미있었다. 우리는 피날레를 놓치고 싶지 않다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "69496ec1-8052-4519-8645-20fe1d4b7169"
msgid "\"We will be happy to see you when we meet you again yesterday!\""
msgstr "\"어제 다시 만나면 우리도 기쁠거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "6e5b629a-4f57-4685-b183-0f29257f0579"
msgid ""
"\"Do with the First Crown? What Crown? Ah, wait! So that's why we are going "
"to meet with you yesterday!\" {n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} leans forward a "
"little.{/n} \"With your help I'll be able to pull a great joke. You know we "
"have a special relationship with time, right? We can borrow something from "
"it... and later return the borrowed thing to when we got it from. For "
"example, someone's soul. What if we put it back at the point when it was "
"captured and stolen? What if the elves don't lose their king?\""
msgstr ""
"\"첫 번째 왕관과 함께 한다고? 무슨 왕관? 아. 기다려! 그래서 어제 너와 만나려고 했다!\" {n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 "
"몸을 약간 앞으로 기울입니다.{/n} \"너의 도움으로 나는 큰 장난을 할 수 있을 것이다. 우리가 시간과 특별한 관계가 있음을 알고 "
"있겠지. 우리는 무언가를 빌려서... 나중에 빌린 것을 우리가 가져와 돌려줄 수 있다. 예를 들어 누군가의 영혼이라고 치자. 그것이 "
"포획되어 도난당했을 때 되돌려 놓으면 어떻게 될까? 엘프들이 그들의 왕을 잃지 않으면 어떻게 될까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0020_Text
msgctxt "b12b7974-3271-4f22-999f-0f5090c1ba1c"
msgid ""
"\"When you've lived as long as I have, child, you'll be surprised how much "
"of what was once exciting will leave you yawning of boredom. And new things "
"become terribly funny.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 나 만큼 오래 살았을 때 신나는 일이 나중에 얼마나 지루한지 느끼게 될 것이다. 그리고 새로운 일들은 대단히 재미있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "64286861-1410-49e1-b4bc-3a9b93c224ad"
msgid "\"A self-confident child. We like that!\""
msgstr "\"자신감 넘치는 아이로구나. 우리는 그것을 좋아한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "87c3574d-ad34-470e-96d3-4386fefcb746"
msgid ""
"\"In anyone else's hands this Crown would just be an ornament. But we can do "
"many things with it. That's why you mustn't forget to give it to us... Ah, "
"and you haven't — good! Here's some advice: if you really want to get "
"Nyrissa good — defeat her, but do not kill her. Let her leave with her "
"Apology. A good joke at just the right time... It will make everything much, "
"much more amusing. I hope the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} likes it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"다른 사람들의 손에서 이 왕관은 단지 장식품일 뿐이다. 하지만 우리는 그걸로 많은 것을 할 수 있다. 그것이 네가 그것을 우리에게 "
"주는 것을 잊어서는 안되는 이유다... 아, 그리고 너는 그렇게 하지 않았다 — 좋아! 조언 하나 하지: 나이리사를 온전히 얻고 싶다면 —"
" 그녀를 이기되, 죽이지 마라. 그녀가 사죄를 가지고 떠나게 해라. 적절한 때에 좋은 농담이 있을 것이다... 그것은 모든 것을 훨씬, "
"훨씬 더 재미있게 만들 것이다. {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 좋아했으면 좋겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "da220321-de3f-460e-a791-c88cb7f5877f"
msgid "\"More questions, child?\""
msgstr "\"더 많은 질문이 있는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/Shyka_HATEOT/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "7e30f4af-950b-4480-b34b-62505ab849fe"
msgid ""
"\"The existence of an almost-deity is not so amusing as you seem to think, "
"child. But we are in no mood to lecture you on the matter.\""
msgstr "\"신에 근접한 존재는 네 생각처럼 그렇게 재미있지 않다. 그 문제에 대해 네게 알려줄 기분이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "22eeb9ac-6660-4aba-92a9-8339c225d6d3"
msgid "\"Amiri! What happened?\""
msgstr "\"아미리! 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "eaccf9c3-47f8-490d-b017-dd512f67904b"
msgid "\"Come to your senses! We need to keep going.\""
msgstr "\"정신 차려! 우리는 계속 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2ffa039f-cab9-4f5b-bf2e-aebdc9640a8b"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri kneels down at a frozen gravestone, mumbling something quietly. She "
"barely notices you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}아미리는 얼어붙은 묘비에 무릎을 꿇고 조용히 무언가를 중얼거리고 있습니다. 그녀는 간신히 당신을 알아차립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "b4c19b76-0f3d-423e-9afb-06f3fb0c43a1"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri raises her eyes and looks at you from under her black hair, her "
"expression strange.{/n} \"Do you see the name on the grave? "
"{d|Nilak}Nilak{/d}... I didn't save her. Why does she die, while a mad dog "
"keeps on kicking?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 검은 머리카락 사이로 그녀의 눈을 들어 올려 당신을 보는데 표정이 이상합니다.{/n} \"무덤에 그 이름이 보여? "
"{d|Nilak}닐락{/d}... 나는 그녀를 구하지 못했어. 왜 미친 개가 발악하는 동안 그녀가 죽어야 하는 거지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "4c6c8725-9ba3-414c-b3e5-ab80e6b038f0"
msgid ""
"\"Nothing!\" {n}Amiri snaps, jumping to her feet.{/n} \"I'm just tired of "
"waiting for you, chief, that's what! This witch came by, tried to pour some "
"muck into my ears. There are some snakes that whatever they say it's like a "
"knife in your ribs...\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무것도 아니야!\" {n}아미리가 퉁명스레 말하며 뛰어올라 두 발로 섭니다.{/n} \"너를 기다리는 게 지겨워. 그래서 그랬어! "
"이 마녀가 와서 내 귀에 악담을 퍼부으려고 했어. 뱀이 몇 마리 있는데 그들이 말하길 갈비뼈 안의 칼과 같다고 하더군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8f9d86d4-3e8c-4e28-9014-6cfb116cf002"
msgid ""
"\"Like I mind! Ha! Keep going means keep going! I told you, you are my "
"tribe. Together we'll tear anyone to pieces.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 걱정하듯이! 하! 계속 가라는 건 계속 가라는 의미야! 너는 내 부족이라고 말했지. 우리는 함께 누구든 조각내버릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "3502783d-c707-4b40-922f-42e6b0ab04a2"
msgid ""
"\"No. I'm leaving, {name}. You never really cared about me, so don't cling "
"to me now. You'll thank me later for not dragging you down with me, plague "
"rat that I am...\" {n}Amiri turns around and walks away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 나는 떠날 거야. {name}. 너는 나를 신경쓰지 않았으니 달라붙지 마. 나중에 내가 역병 걸린 쥐처럼 너를 맥빠지게 하지 "
"않은 걸 고마워할 거야. {n}아미리는 돌아서서 걸어 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "6b4bb4be-80db-43a9-82fe-dcb109b919a9"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not going anywhere!\" {n}Amiri snaps.{/n} \"Or maybe I am... I'll go "
"get lost. I only bring grief and {d|Amiri Nilak Sacrifice}death{/d} to those "
"I care about. And don't try to convince me. Everyone has their limit. I've "
"reached mine. I can't go on any more...\" {n}Amiri turns around and walks "
"away.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 아무데도 가지 않을거야!\" {n}아미리가 퉁명스레 말합니다.{/n} \"아니면 어쩌면... 나는 길을 잃을 거야. 내가 소중히 "
"여기는 사람들에게 슬픔과 {d|Amiri Nilak Sacrifice}죽음{/d}만을 가져다 주겠지. 나를 설득하려고 하지 마. 한계라는 "
"것이 있어. 나도 한계에 도달했다. 나는 더 이상 갈 수 없어... \" {n}아미리가 돌아서서 걸어 나갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/CutsceneBarks/1AmiriTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "e83b45e7-9d5b-4912-bd39-2119060f03a5"
msgid ""
"\"What are you looking for here, you... pariah? There is no place for you in "
"your world, and there won't be a place in my dominion!\""
msgstr "\"여기서 무엇을 찾고 있느냐... 외톨이? 세상에 너를 위한 자리는 없고, 내 영토에도 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/CutsceneBarks/2AmiriTOS_1Amiri_String
msgctxt "ec30fe45-e953-4f14-b452-2347394f36e4"
msgid ""
"\"Get out, witch! When my friends find their way here — we'll pluck off your "
"petals!\""
msgstr "\"꺼져. 마녀! 내 친구들이 여기로 오면 너의 꽃잎을 뽑아버릴 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/CutsceneBarks/3AmiriTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "56933ca6-052a-4d67-8334-3a36d360b85e"
msgid ""
"\"Your... friends? Am I hearing it right? You think any of them are still "
"alive?\""
msgstr "\"네 친구라고...? 내 귀가 먹었나? 그들 중 하나라도 아직 살아 있다고 생각하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/CutsceneBarks/4AmiriTOS_1Amiri_String
msgctxt "5985f3d0-75b4-4ffa-850d-10864665c8bb"
msgid "\"Keep talking... I don't believe your tales!\""
msgstr "\"계속 이야기해라. 나는 너의 이야기를 믿지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/CutsceneBarks/5AmiriTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "8254ea6f-99ae-4e2b-90e1-7c324952cefc"
msgid ""
"\"Why would I lie to you? YOU are the reason that everyone you care about "
"dies. YOU get banished from everywhere, like the plague.\""
msgstr "\"내가 왜 너에게 거짓말을 하겠어? 네가 아끼는 사람이 죽는 이유는 '너'다. 너는 전염병처럼 어디서나 추방당한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/AmiriTOS/CutsceneBarks/6AmiriTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "3931cfc3-6764-4269-b6e5-36af26ea83c3"
msgid ""
"\"Your soul is poisoned, like an animal gone mad. I will leave you with "
"that. Farewell...\""
msgstr "\"미쳐버린 짐승처럼 너의 영혼은 중독되었어. 나는 이것과 함께 갈 거야. 안녕히...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c340cd61-622e-4d25-9a98-447e3d73e66e"
msgid "\"What happened?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 된 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0d509b30-659d-4486-bbcc-68be1aa0fc1d"
msgid "\"Let's move on.\""
msgstr "\"계속 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "ff5076c5-0239-4c71-aad2-3ac577413cb5"
msgid "\"All right. Let's kill the troll together!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 함께 트롤을 죽여버리자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f192ac96-4214-4ef5-a183-f8be3ac750c8"
msgid ""
"\"I can't make any promises. We need to defeat Nyrissa. But after that, if "
"we have the time and strength...\""
msgstr "\"나는 어떤 약속도 할 수 없다. 우리는 나이리사를 물리쳐야 한다. 그러나 그 이후에 시간과 힘이 있다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "12c5fb3b-02f0-4b05-b941-50d709582468"
msgid "\"We don't have time for this.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그럴 시간이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "7ca6a9be-75f0-412d-b255-06b9e65dec28"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun stands near the entrance to the troll's lair, tense as a drawn "
"bowstring.{/n} \"{name}. Your journey was long, but I waited, and my wait is "
"over.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 트롤 소굴 입구 근처에 팽팽한 활시위처럼 긴장하여 서있습니다.{/n} \" {name}. 너의 여행은 길었지만 나는 기다렸고 "
"나의 기다림은 끝났다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "5d5f9bf7-c252-4dbc-b79a-7cb7a6ed81c0"
msgid ""
"\"Wait. The witch belched poison, but truth as well. We are in the dwelling "
"of a monster. We ought to destroy it.\""
msgstr "\"기다려. 마녀가 뱉은건 독약이었지만, 역시 진실이기도 하다. 우리는 괴물의 거처에 있다. 우리는 그것을 파괴해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "847a5f3c-4692-4ad9-8d46-93a31777317a"
msgid ""
"\"The witch came to me, poured honeyed poison into my ears. Her words besot "
"the mind. I nearly gave in to them. But I remembered you, and decided to "
"wait.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마녀가 내게로 와서 귀에 달콤한 유혹을 했다. 그녀의 말은 내 마음을 아프게 했다. 나는 거의 굴복할 뻔 했다. 그러나 너를 기억하고 "
"기다리기로 결정했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "9c8fcca8-b7af-432e-8bea-1d5f39cd9a26"
msgid ""
"\"It will be as you decide. The witch is scarier than the troll. She sows "
"death as grain. Defeating her is more important. You lead, I follow.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 결정처럼 될 것이다. 마녀는 트롤보다 무섭다. 그녀는 곡식처럼 죽음을 뿌린다. 그녀를 물리치는 것이 더 중요하다. 네가 안내하면 "
"나는 따라간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "631e5388-74ec-439a-812c-61239676dcfc"
msgid ""
"\"Wise. Rage is a horse dragging a cart down a hill. You must hold its reins "
"tightly.\""
msgstr "\"현명하군. 분노는 수레를 언덕 아래로 끌고 내려가는 말이다. 그 고삐를 단단히 잡아야만 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "2b6e1793-fb5e-42dc-998d-d501a7f5625c"
msgid "\"I follow you. As always.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 따라간다. 언제나처럼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "e9ae5784-3a69-4389-858f-8f1d019762fb"
msgid ""
"\"When it's time to hunt, animals form packs. A pack is led by a leader. You "
"have led me through the path of {d|Ekun Hunt}revenge{/d}, you will lead me "
"from here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사냥할 때가 되면 동물들이 무리짓는다. 무리는 지도자에 의해 이끌린다. 너는 나를 {d|Ekun Hunt}복수{/d}의 길로 "
"인도했고, 여기서 나를 이끌어갈 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "78983556-5fec-402f-b919-fbc84d87a741"
msgid ""
"\"Rage has already led me on the wrong path, but you {d|Ekun Ritual}didn't "
"let{/d} it take control. Your voice in my mind was stronger than the witch's "
"voice. I fight for what is precious and needs protection, not for the sake "
"of fighting. Not to relieve the pain.\""
msgstr ""
"\"분노가 이미 나를 잘못된 길로 인도했지만, 너는 그것이 나를 집어 삼키게 {d|Ekun Ritual}두지 않았다.{/d} 내 마음 속 "
"너의 목소리가 마녀의 목소리보다 강했다. 나는 싸움을 위해서가 아니라 소중하고 보호해야 할 것을 위해 싸운다. 그것은 고통을 덜지 "
"못한다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/CutsceneBarks/1EkunTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "8ea0659e-0c15-4433-940f-9f90528c7906"
msgid ""
"\"What do I see on your face, gloomy traveler? Is that righteous rage, or "
"anger bred by indecisiveness?\""
msgstr "\"왜 그렇게 우울한가. 여행자여? 그것은 의로운 분노인가 아니면 막연한 분노인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/CutsceneBarks/2EkunTOS_1Ekun_String
msgctxt "4411914a-4a74-4cca-bd1d-295fe3f4e499"
msgid ""
"\"Away, witch. Your deceitful words may touch my ears, but not my heart.\""
msgstr "\"물러나라. 마녀야. 너의 속임수는 내 귀에 닿을 수는 있지만 내 마음에는 닿을 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/CutsceneBarks/3EkunTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "2e0312bf-8b4a-4598-a18d-d52e77a15259"
msgid ""
"\"Whose voices do you hear with your heart? Your darling wife? Your little "
"daughter?\""
msgstr "\"너의 마음은 누구의 목소리를 듣자? 사랑하는 아내? 어린 딸?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/CutsceneBarks/4EkunTOS_1Ekun_String
msgctxt "23a3ef9f-7aaf-474b-9609-6554cc464dc3"
msgid "\"Quiet.\""
msgstr "\"조용히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/CutsceneBarks/5EkunTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "96efd275-6803-423d-a847-76e3895419dc"
msgid "\"Do you hear them screaming? Do you hear them calling you for help?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 그들이 소리지르는 것이 들리는가? 그들이 너의 도움을 청하는 소리가 들리나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/EkunTOS/CutsceneBarks/6EkunTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "f8744554-4135-4c1f-a60a-6fd73dc60a04"
msgid ""
"\"Turn around. It is the lair of a monster that's ruined thousands of lives. "
"And who will keep it from ruining a thousand more? Not you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"돌아서라. 수천 명의 목숨을 앗아간 괴물의 은신처가 여기구나. 누가 또 다른 천 명의 희생자가 늘어나는 것을 막을 것인가? 너는 "
"아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "30c74d5c-6542-4efb-93b7-cd35b9e8d90b"
msgid ""
"\"Harrim? I saw Nyrissa trying to trick you into dying, by pretending to be "
"the voice of Groetus...\""
msgstr "\"하림? 나이리사가 그로투스의 목소리를 가장하여 너를 속여 죽이려고 한 보았는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "2b6c4411-b3f7-4c76-bc0b-3a875e2f7871"
msgid "\"We have to go. Are you ready to move?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 가야 해. 이동할 준비가 됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "c8a7a678-72ea-40e4-8e4b-68e863884e33"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim meets you, stroking his beard pensively, and nods calmly as ever, "
"like there's nothing amiss.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}하림은 당신을 만나 턱수염을 가볍게 쓰다듬으며 아무렇지도 않게 조용히 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "1096165c-3809-47c5-812d-84fbdd78c092"
msgid ""
"\"It's true. I am sad to see that I almost gave in, taking her false words "
"for the voice of {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. I almost felt the cold breath of "
"the {g|Boneyard}Boneyard{/g}, but... memories returned to me of the feats we "
"accomplished together. I remembered the lesson you helped me learn.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사실이다. 그녀는 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 목소리를 가장해 나를 속였고, 내가 거의 포기할 뻔했다는게 슬프다. 나는 "
"{g|Boneyard} 뼈무덤{/g}의 차가운 숨결을 느꼈다. 하지만... 우리가 함께 성취한 업적에 대한 추억이 떠올랐다. 너와 함께해 "
"내가 배운 교훈을 기억했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "e7fcfff1-07ad-4d7f-b713-9ea4e1e176a1"
msgid ""
"\"Thanks to you, I felt the great power of chaos and destruction bestowed to "
"me by {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. And I realized the god does not need to take "
"me now. There is a place for me in the world you are building.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고맙네, 자네 덕분에 나는 {g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}가 일으킨 혼돈과 파괴의 위대한 힘을 느꼈다. 그리고 신이 지금 나를 "
"데려갈 필요가 없다는 것을 깨달았다. 네가 만들고 있는 세상에는 나를 위한 장소가 있으니. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "855cbd84-82ef-48cd-baf1-125a8b0cb951"
msgid "\"As never before.\""
msgstr "\"전에 없이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "6e99c4c1-3e21-4daa-ad94-bb1c6a6cd698"
msgid ""
"\"Would {g|Groetus}Groetus{/g} reveal to me the true essence of the circle "
"of making and unmaking, only to drive me from the world? I realized I had "
"given in to a lie meant to take me from my path, and prevent me from helping "
"you confront our old enemy. Then I shook off the deadly torpor and awoke.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}께서, 오직 나를 세상에서 몰아내기 위해 내게 창조와 역창조의 순환의 본질을 보여주었겠는가? 나는 "
"나의 길에서 나를 떼어놓고, 네가 우리의 숙적과 대면하는 것을 방해하기 위한 거짓말임을 깨달았다. 그리고 나는 치명적인 무기력함을 흔들어 "
"깨어났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/0HarrimTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "66096134-fdd4-4689-982e-d1d5fca8c8e4"
msgid ""
"\"Ashes and dust — that's what this dwarf is. It would be amusing to find "
"out how strong his faith is.\""
msgstr "\"재와 먼지 — 그것이 바로 이 드워프이다. 그의 믿음이 얼마나 강한지를 알아낸다면 재미있겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/1HarrimTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "2c3baa8b-bd6e-49d7-ab58-ffbe2943cf2b"
msgid "\"Do you hear me, my loyal servant?\""
msgstr "\"내 충직한 하인아. 내 말이 들리는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/2HarrimTOS_1Harrim_String
msgctxt "6c29f9cd-383a-46d5-97fa-d83e6a032bff"
msgid ""
"\"What... what is this? Do I hear your voice? O Groetus, do you speak to "
"your servant in this lifeless place?\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐... 이게 뭐지? 내가 당신의 목소리를 듣는 겁니까? 오, 그로투스시여, 이 생명이 없는 땅에서 당신의 종에게 말하는 겁니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/3HarrimTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "ab54a499-343e-4df4-8dc9-5cbf4fe4486f"
msgid "\"It is true. Your time has come, Harrim.\""
msgstr "\"사실이다. 너의 시간이 왔다. 하림.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/3HarrimTOS_2Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "88b64549-9123-4c65-a3f3-216171eb0bac"
msgid ""
"\"Do not cling to this miserable world. Let go! Release your life! The "
"Boneyard awaits you. I am waiting.\""
msgstr "\"이 비참한 세계에 집착하지 마라. 떠나라! 너의 인생을 보내주어라! 뼈무덤이 너를 기다린다. 나는 기다리겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/4HarrimTOS_Harrim_String
msgctxt "e68b01f0-ad31-45dc-8761-5b5a612de81c"
msgid ""
"\"I've waited for this moment for long. How comforting it will be to close "
"my eyes and know there is no need to open them again...\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 순간을 오랫동안 기다렸다. 내 눈을 감고 다시 열 필요가 없음을 아는 것이 얼마나 위안이 되는 건지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/4_ALT_HarrimTOS_1Harrim_String
msgctxt "8908301e-8754-427e-9148-535696462a02"
msgid ""
"\"Right... I've long suffocated here, in this world of the blind and foolish."
"\""
msgstr "\"맞다. 나는 눈 멀고 어리석은 세상에서 오랫동안 숨이 막혔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/4_ALT_HarrimTOS_2Harrim_String
msgctxt "9d787dad-e649-42ff-8500-bd13ad8f77fe"
msgid ""
"\"They try to make walls of rules and laws here, foolishly imagining that "
"this will protect them from endless chaos and the inevitable end.\""
msgstr "\"어리석게도 끝없는 혼돈과 피할 수 없는 결말으로부터 보호받을 것이라고 상상하며 그들은 규칙과 법률의 벽을 만들려 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/HarrimTOS/CutsceneBarks/5HarrimTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "2de76eca-eaae-44fa-b1f1-5fe5ee01340d"
msgid ""
"\"You believed in your death so much that you really died, dwarf. Few can "
"boast such powerful beliefs...\""
msgstr "\"너는 너의 죽음을 믿었고 정말로 죽었다. 드워프. 오직 소수만이 그런 강력한 믿음을 자랑할 수 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "0d98681e-7299-4963-bf68-3a6f2ccec332"
msgid "\"What happened to you?\""
msgstr "\"너한테 무슨 일이 생긴 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "cd419edc-d852-4d43-bfd4-cb1b8862011d"
msgid "\"I'm glad that's over with. Let's keep going!\""
msgstr "\"끝나서 다행이야. 계속 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "0095575d-e1bb-4cc8-98ec-c4cf577a0021"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 무슨 일 있었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "7096cae3-9e0e-4505-bd68-3ff3f7110ba1"
msgid "\"Jaethal? How is it that you are here — and alive?\""
msgstr "\"제이탈? 여기 어떻게 살아 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "fadf2e1e-1028-48ac-8cca-a0818735407b"
msgid "\"Tristian? What happened?\""
msgstr "\"트리스티안? 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "25e7510d-bed7-48cc-93bb-72601e9b5296"
msgid "\"I don't want to have anything to do with Jaethal's murderer.\""
msgstr "\"나는 제이탈의 살인자와 아무 관계도 갖고 싶지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "dc61e2ab-83c9-44ed-80ad-b7f91c03a28d"
msgid "\"What's done is done. Let's keep going.\""
msgstr "\"끝난 일은 끝났어. 계속 가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "155b1097-e34a-41cd-b436-8f9c51ad8048"
msgid "\"You're a murderer. I don't want your help!\""
msgstr "\"너는 살인자야. 너의 도움은 필요 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "8f64931f-26eb-4bdb-b672-7b56a08900b3"
msgid "\"Wrong. Get out.\""
msgstr "\"틀렸다. 저리 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "c86e9591-cbfc-48ef-ac3d-97d83715154e"
msgid ""
"\"I think I'll let you stay, but only because I need all the help I can get "
"to fight Nyrissa.\""
msgstr "\"내가 너를 머물게 할 것 같아. 하지만 나이리사와 싸울 수있는 모든 도움이 필요하기 때문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "a638c337-7a15-4262-b9d8-ba8a7309ce56"
msgid "\"Leave. We now go separate ways.\""
msgstr "\"가라. 이제 우리는 서로 다른 길로 나아 간다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "e2b48c1a-607e-4655-8ec4-66e0b220fe4e"
msgid ""
"\"Maybe you're right. You can stay, but only because I'm going to need your "
"prayers.\""
msgstr "\"네가 맞을지도 모르지. 네가 머무를 수는 있다. 하지만 오직 너의 기도가 필요기 때문이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "ff374d23-dfa9-4f05-969b-6a18d5fd7c45"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal tries to pretend nothing happened, but she breathes out, "
"relieved. She literally breathes out — which means she is breathing...{/n} "
"\"Great. Everyone is back together again. I suppose now we can go look for "
"that inventive nymph and deal with her once and for all?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 아무 일도 없었던 척하려고하지만 그녀는 안도의 한숨을 내쉬었습니다. 그녀는 말 그대로 숨을 쉴 수 있었습니다. 즉 그녀가 "
"호흡하고 있음을 의미합니다...{/n} \"좋아. 모두가 다시 함께 돌아왔어. 이제 우리는 그 독창적인 님프를 찾아가서 완전히 맞설 수 "
"있겠지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "345e9cb0-f204-43ce-86df-6080587954f0"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian sighs.{/n} \"I'm ashamed to say it, but I fell for Nyrissa's "
"lies yet again. She fooled me with an illusion, showing Jaethal killing "
"innocent elves. I let rage overwhelm me, which happens to me rarely, as you "
"know. But then... the lessons I learned from you, {name}, were not in vain. "
"I remembered your wisdom and mercy for the innocent souls of the Kingdom of "
"the Cleansed. I remembered how you {d|Jaethal Pharasma}convinced{/d} Jaethal "
"to stop serving Urgathoa for the sake of her daughter's life. This stayed my "
"hand.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"부끄럽습니다만, 저는 나이리사의 거짓말에 다시 한 번 빠져들었습니다. 그녀는 저를 비웃고 "
"제이탈이 무고한 엘프들을 죽이는 것을 보여주었습니다. 분노가 저를 압도했고, 아시는 대로 그런 일은 저에게 흔치 않죠. 하지만... "
"당신에게 배운 교훈은 헛되지 않았습니다, {name}. 저는 정화된 자들의 왕국의 무고한 영혼을 위했던 당신의 지혜와 자비를 "
"기억했습니다. 또한 당신이 어떻게 제이탈에게 딸의 목숨을 위해 우르가쏘아를 섬기길 그만두도록 {d|Jaethal "
"Pharasma}납득시켰는지{/d}도 기억했습니다. 그래서 제 손을 멈출 수 있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "139aeffb-6524-4bc4-9fbe-a389dab2d689"
msgid ""
"\"I was expecting you to ask.\" {n}The elf smiles a contented smile.{/n} "
"\"You see, my elegant {d|Jaethal Pharasma}performance{/d} in the elven camp "
"didn't go unnoticed. When I rejected {g|Urgathoa}Urgathoa's{/g} gift, I "
"mocked my former mistress. There is at least one deity who liked that very, "
"very much. And we have one acquaintance among that deity's chosen who put in "
"a word for me. So I was allowed to return — with a new mission and new "
"goals. I'm not undead any more, but I'm still an inquisitor... An inquisitor "
"of {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 물어보길 기대했다.\" {n}엘프는 만족스런 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"너도 알다시피, 엘프 야영지에서 내가 했던 우아한 {d|"
"Jaethal Pharasma}공연{/d}은 주목받지 못할 수가 없었지. 내가 {g|Urgathoa}우르가쏘아{/g}의 선물을 거절했을 "
"때, 나는 이전의 여주인을 조롱한 거였어. 그 선물을 아주 많이 좋아했던 신이 최소 한 명 쯤은 있었지. 그리고 나에게 참견한 신에게 "
"선택된 자 중에 나와 친분이 있던 자가 있었다. 그래서 나는 새로운 사명과 새로운 목표를 가지고 돌아올 수 있었다. 나는 더 이상 "
"언데드가 아니지만, 나는 여전히 인퀴지터다... {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "a9972557-20e8-4ccd-9370-290026b5d619"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa wove an image of Tristian begging {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} for my "
"death. I might have believed the deception, if I hadn't known this righteous "
"fool can't stop himself from trying to talk sense into everyone, even that "
"stupid fanatic {d|Tristian Ruthgert Persuaded}Ruthgert{/d}. One minor detail:"
" Nyrissa offered me {g|First World}First World{/g} immortality. Tempting, "
"yes, but I didn't fancy falling under the power of a semi-insane nymph. Not "
"to flatter you, {name}, but you're a far more worthy ruler and patron.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사는 트리스티안이 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}에게 나의 죽음을 청하는 모습을 만들어냈다. 나는 그 속임수를 믿을 수도 "
"있었겠지, 만약 이 의로운 바보가 그 바보 같은 광신도 {d|트리스티안 Ruthgert Persuaded}루스거트{/d}를 포함한 "
"모두에게 자비를 베풀라는 말을 멈추지 못했다는 사실을 알지 못했다면 말이지만. 그리고 하나 더, 나이리사는 나에게 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}의 불멸을 제안했다. 솔깃했지, 하지만 나는 반쯤 미친 님프의 힘을 받는 것이 좋지 않았다. 아첨이 아니다, "
"{name}. 그러나 너는 훨씬 더 합당한 통치자이자 동료이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "2556b150-5962-422a-abc2-352b4a6a32da"
msgid ""
"\"As for Tristian... I'm sorry that I accidentally deprived you of this "
"useful tool. I'd be happy to raise him as undead, but "
"{g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g} has already taken the soul. We don't want to "
"wrestle with the Everlight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트리스티안에 관해서는... 내가 이 유용한 도구를 실수로 너에게서 박탈한 것을 유감스럽게 생각한다. 나는 기쁘게 그를 언데드로 만들려 "
"했지만, {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}가 이미 영혼을 취했다. 우리는 영원의 빛과 씨름하고 싶지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "23158cc2-516f-4ec5-b595-42f49ea8dec9"
msgid ""
"As for Tristian... death is a part of the natural circle, and it's not the "
"first time he's walked this road. I'm sorry that I involuntarily deprived "
"you of a useful tool. But he showed once again that he's unreliable and "
"easily manipulated. You have to face Nyrissa with the best — those you can "
"truly rely on.\""
msgstr ""
"트리스티안에 관해서는... 죽음은 자연의 일부이며 그가 이 길을 걷는 것은 처음이 아니다. 나는 너에게서 본의 아니게 유용한 도구를 "
"빼앗아 유감이다. 그러나 그는 신뢰할 수 없고 조종당하기 쉬운 자라는 것을 다시 한번 보여주었다. 너는 나이리사와 맞서기 위해 최고가 "
"필요하다. 그래야 진정으로 의지할 수 있다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "7b9f19c9-42ea-4547-a913-7402f1b79bac"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal shrugs.{/n} \"The naive boy-priest fell for Nyrissa's illusions "
"and attacked me. The nymph tried to fool my mind as well. — She even offered "
"me {g|First World}First World{/g} immortality, can you imagine? She failed, "
"of course. Not to flatter you, {name}, but you are the only leader I'm ready "
"to follow. You have the will and mind worthy of a ruler. It would be "
"inexcusably stupid for me to exchange your favor for the whims of an insane "
"nymph.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"순진한 성직자 꼬마가 나이리사의 환상에 빠져나와 나를 공격했다. 님프는 내 마음을 속이려고 "
"했다. 그녀는 나에게 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g} 불멸을 제안했다. 너는 상상이 가? 그녀는 물론 실패했다. 아첨이 "
"아니야. {name}. 너는 내가 따라야 할 유일한 지도자다. 너는 통치자의 의지와 마음이 있다. 미친 님프의 변덕과 너의 호의를 "
"교환하는 것은 용서할 수 없을 정도로 어리석다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "bfa69c42-409d-48e8-80c4-cc4775ba64a5"
msgid ""
"\"Unwise. You should not squander your companions now, when you're under "
"such desperate circumstances. Right?\""
msgstr "\"어리석군. 어려운 상황에 처했을 때 동료를 낭비해서는 안된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "a49957f6-c36b-4f95-af6f-c2fd6ea78da9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian is kneeling beside Jaethal's motionless body, quietly saying a "
"prayer to {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}. Noticing you, he jumps up.{/n} \"{name}! "
"You found the way! Praised be Sarenrae... I...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 제이탈의 움직이지 않는 몸 옆에 무릎을 꿇고 조용히 {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}에게 기도합니다. 당신을 알아 "
"차리고는 그는 벌떡 일어섭니다.{/n} \"{name}! 길을 찾으셨군요! 서렌레이의 축복이군... 저는... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "18c2db38-f823-431b-99ff-27d5136d87d7"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal is kneeling beside Tristian's body, lazily running her fingers "
"through the dead priest's golden locks.{/n} \"What a pity... he was a "
"nullity in life, but it's sad to see resources wasted so.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 트리스티안의 몸 옆에 무릎을 꿇고 죽은 성직자의 황금 자물쇠에 아주 천천히 그것을 쓰다듬고 있습니다.{/n} \"얼마나 "
"유감스러운 일인가... 그는 인생의 무용지물이었지만 인재를 잃어 너무 슬프다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "2ee45f16-2eba-4619-a01d-2ea0056476ef"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal and Tristian keep their distance from each other. Both of your "
"companions look wearied from a fight, but both are alive. Tristian notices "
"you first.{/n} \"{name}! Praised be {g|Sarenrae}Sarenrae{/g}, you're alive!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈과 트리스티안은 서로 거리를 유지합니다. 당신의 동료 둘 다 싸움에서 지쳐 보이지만 둘 다 살아 있습니다. 트리스티안이 먼저 "
"당신을 알아봅니다.{/n} \"{name}! {g|Sarenrae}서렌레이{/g}께서 지켜주셔 살아계셨군요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "f68239a9-c6f1-446d-ad26-f3c88908572c"
msgid ""
"\"Finally a well-reasoned position. Let's not waste time on idle talk and "
"keep moving.\""
msgstr "\"마침내 모든 것이 바로 되었군. 떠들면서 시간을 낭비하지 말고 계속 움직여야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Jaethal_Companion
msgctxt "8cee5f7e-ecb1-4dd7-8ead-96568ebdc65b"
msgid "\"If you insist...\""
msgstr "\"원하는대로...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "c100ce00-d952-405f-8f44-08ee3514b95b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian frowns but replies, looking you firmly in the eye.{/n} \"Both "
"Jaethal and I fell for Nyrissa's lie. She fooled us with illusions and made "
"us fight each other. And I was stronger. I never expected I...\" {n}Tristian "
"chuckles, tired and sorrowful.{/n} \"I learned many lessons while traveling "
"with you, and resilience was chief among them. Jaethal lacked it...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 눈살을 찌푸리지만 확고하게 눈을 바라보고 대답합니다.{/n} \"제이탈과 저는 나이리사의 거짓말에 빠져 들었습니다. "
"그녀는 환상으로 우리를 속였고 서로 싸우게 만들었습니다. 그리고 저는 더 강해졌습니다. 전혀 예상치 못했죠...\" {n}트리스티안은 "
"피식 웃었지만, 피곤하고 슬퍼 보입니다.{/n} \"저는 당신과 함께 여행하면서 많은 교훈을 얻었고, 절망에서 회복하는 능력은 최고의 "
"교훈이었습니다. 제이탈에겐 그것이 부족했죠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "ec040735-682e-409b-8d61-84dcf465e870"
msgid ""
"\"I want to tell you — this might sound cruel, but I don't regret what "
"happened. I might have been driven by Nyrissa's lies, but for too long I'd "
"turned a blind eye to what a monster Jaethal was, and how much harm she did. "
"You've made it clear many times that indiscriminate forgiveness is not "
"always the best solution. Well, I've learned this lesson.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신에게 말하고 싶은게 있습니다 — 잔인하게 들릴지 모르지만, 저는 이 일을 유감스럽게 생각하지 않습니다. 저는 나이리사의 거짓말에 "
"이끌렸을지 모르지만, 또한 너무 오랫동안 제이탈이 어떤 괴물인지, 얼마나 많은 해를 입혔는지 잊고 있었습니다. 당신은 무차별적 용서가 "
"항상 최선의 해결책은 아니라는 것을 여러번 증명하셨습니다. 이것이 제가 배운 교훈입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "3fe4379b-25e5-48c6-a2d4-7ac7def7d1cc"
msgid ""
"\"But so many questions remain... Jaethal was different when she returned "
"from {d|Jaethal Pharasma}death{/d}. When I killed her she was a living "
"creature, not undead. And the symbols on her weapon... it's marked by "
"{g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}. Could it be that the Lady of Graves gave her a "
"second chance for a more worthy life — only for me to take it? I don't know, "
"and probably never will. But I'll have to live with it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 아직 의문점이 많이 남아 있습니다... 제이탈은 {d|Jaethal Pharasma}죽음{/d}에서 돌아왔을 때와 달랐습니다. "
"제가 그녀를 죽였을 때, 그녀는 언데드가 아니라 살아있는 생물이었습니다. 그녀의 무기에는... {g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}의 "
"상징이 새겨져 있었습니다. 무덤의 여신이 그녀에게 더 가치있는 삶을 위한 두 번째 기회를 주었을까요? 오직 제가 거둬가기만을 바라고? "
"저는 모르겠고, 아마 앞으로도 모르겠죠. 하지만 저는 그걸 짊어지고 살겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "94c3b983-0c22-487e-bc1a-d0b29e1ca0c8"
msgid ""
"\"I... understand. And yet I must ask you — are you sure you're ready to let "
"me go now, when you're facing a battle with Nyrissa? I would like to stay "
"and help you in this fight.\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 이해합니다. 하지만 당신에게 물어봐야겠습니다 — 나이리사와의 전투가 코 앞인데, 당장 저를 떠나보내시려고요? 저는 이번 "
"싸움에서 당신을 돕도싶습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "23eec95b-3d44-4995-b261-d01e218740ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head.{/n} \"Then farewell, {name}. Nonetheless, I'll "
"pray for your success.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"그러면 안녕히, {name}. 그럼에도 불구하고, 당신이 성공하길 기도하겠습니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0038_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "66cfd41a-b445-4aff-bf75-05455691e8a8"
msgid "\"Then let's go — into the storm!\""
msgstr "\"그러면 가시죠, 폭풍 속으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "da607940-a095-47c6-b40d-10e9ac8ad11b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian frowns but replies, looking you firmly in the eye.{/n} \"Both "
"Jaethal and I fell for Nyrissa's lies. She tricked us with illusions and "
"made us fight each other. And I turned out to be the stronger. Death has "
"never been so close to me, but I... I knew I must return to you. No matter "
"what else.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 눈살을 찌푸리지만 확고하게 눈을 바라보고 대답합니다.{/n} \"제이탈과 저는 나이리사의 거짓말에 빠져 들었습니다. "
"그녀는 환상으로 저희를 속였고 서로 싸우게 만들었습니다. 그리고 저는 더 강해졌습니다. 죽음은 제게 가까운 적이 없었지만, 저는...저는 "
"돌아와야만 한다는 것을 알았습니다. 무슨 일이 있어도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/1TrisJaeTOS_1Tristian_String
msgctxt "367ff743-3010-410d-97a3-a9c6ba21226f"
msgid "\"Where... where am I?\""
msgstr "\"여기는... 내가 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/2TrisJaeTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "66be0d20-f179-442a-a2d4-8d187853ea55"
msgid "\"In the cage you wanted to escape so desperately, my little skylark!\""
msgstr "\"우리 안에서 필사적으로 도망치고 싶었구나. 내 작은 종달새야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/3TrisJaeTOS_1Tristian_String
msgctxt "2e0ffd5e-6217-4671-8bbd-c661c3422451"
msgid ""
"\"Kill me, torture me if you want, Nyrissa. But I will serve you no more.\""
msgstr "\"네가 원한다면 날 고문하고 죽여라. 나이리사. 하지만 나는 너를 더 이상 섬기지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/4TrisJaeTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "e00f9727-2d48-4fff-b69d-831bd561d37d"
msgid "\"I don't need your service. I only wanted to know...\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 섬김은 필요하지 않다. 나는 단지 알고 싶었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/4TrisJaeTOS_2ElvenGirl_String
msgctxt "54ea210c-1202-4ed6-a460-1ed499a6ef1a"
msgid "\"No! Please help!\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/5TrisJaeTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "a4ac643c-5825-49fd-ae25-ff39538b5996"
msgid ""
"\"… how you, so devoted to good, could so diligently look the other way, "
"while there was evil happening right under your nose?\""
msgstr "\"... 악이 네 코앞에서 닥칠 때 어떻게 다른 길을 따르며 선에 헌신할 수 있었던 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/5TrisJaeTOS_1Tristian_String
msgctxt "17c198db-6f3c-4120-b3bd-4608bb3150c2"
msgid "\"Jaethal, no! Stop!'"
msgstr "\"제이탈! 안돼! 그만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/5_ALT_TrisJaeTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "a2b6d4eb-e69b-49cc-84a0-3c3611f7399c"
msgid "\"… will you continue to look the other way as you always have?\""
msgstr "\"... 너는 항상 그랬듯이 다른 길을 따를 건가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/5_ALT_TrisJaeTOS_1Tristian_String
msgctxt "ec86f831-bb54-4c75-bdf5-f71bf9d3103e"
msgid "\"No! Whoever you are, leave the poor thing alone!\""
msgstr "\"안돼! 네가 누구라도 그 불쌍한 것을 내버려 둬!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/6TrisJaeTOS_1Jaethal_String
msgctxt "46044566-7bd1-4aa2-9396-311d2649250b"
msgid "\"What happened? Where am I?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이야? 내가 어디에 있는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/7TrisJaeTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "3ce71a91-4c55-4947-bf51-a7dfb5173e9e"
msgid "\"In a place worthy of you, inquisitor.\""
msgstr "\"너에게 걸맞는 곳이다, 인퀴지터.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/7TrisJaeTOS_2Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "9fe083c8-8e16-4262-a0ca-f5068d98100c"
msgid ""
"\"Are you prepared to keep fighting for those who never appreciate you? "
"Those who despise you and think you a monster?\""
msgstr "\"너에게 감사하지 않는 사람들을 위해 계속 싸울 준비가 되어 있나? 너를 경멸하고 괴물이라고 생각하는 사람들에게?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/7_ALT_TrisJaeTOS_2Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "f3d2eee2-642d-4746-bd9d-41193cc485bc"
msgid ""
"\"Do you remember {mf|him|her}, the one who refused to take you as a "
"companion? The would-be baron{mf||ess} who you met in Restov?\""
msgstr "\"네 동료가 되길 거절했던 {mf|남자|여자}를 기억해? 레스토프에서, {mf||여}남작이 되려고 열심히였지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/7_ALT_TrisJaeTOS_3Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "c1f26801-2356-429f-b9a9-53a8bd7ba132"
msgid "\"Look at {mf|his|her} favorites!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|그|그녀}가 좋아하는 것을 봐라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/8TrisJaeTOS_1Tristian_String
msgctxt "80c1d500-bcd2-489d-b96c-245ac6438e4a"
msgid ""
"\"O Sarenrae, give me the strength to overcome evil. Give me the fire to "
"burn the disgusting undead, servant of the fallen goddess!\""
msgstr "\"서렌레이여. 나에게 악을 극복 할 수있는 힘을 주십시오. 제게 타락한 여신의 역겨운 언데드 종을 불태울 힘을 주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JaethalTristianTOS/CutsceneBarks/9TrisJaeTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "3c4ff065-28f4-4c01-8305-78e989991b51"
msgid ""
"\"Bring me the heart of this useless creature, and I will give you new life "
"in the First World!\""
msgstr "\"이 쓸모없는 생명의 심장을 내게 가져 와라. 그러면 태초 세계에서 너에게 새 생명을 줄 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b7450f1d-cf29-4b60-a7fb-5b3895a4d2e0"
msgid "\"Jubilost? Are you alive? I saw Nyrissa trying to kill you.\""
msgstr "\"주빌로스트? 너 살아 있어? 나이리사가 널 죽이려고 하는 걸 봤는데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "7dc5ecfc-64be-4213-bd74-9873e1f589b5"
msgid "\"We have to go.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "847900ba-5bb0-476b-8302-94e9d887c932"
msgid "\"So you let yourself be tempted by Nyrissa...\""
msgstr "\"그래서 너는 나이리사에게 유혹을 참지 못했군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "30de6f25-f042-4a2d-bf75-14867720d15f"
msgid "[Attack] \"I have little patience with Nyrissa's servants.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 나이리사의 부하에게는 자비가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "5c66ae1c-e8bb-4cfc-bf15-d6eed5aae985"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost is writing in his notebook, looking as focused as usual.{/n} \""
"{name}! I didn't expect you to get here so soon. Just a moment, I'm almost "
"finished!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 그의 노트에 글을 쓰고 평소와 같이 집중하여 보고 있습니다.{/n} \"{name}! 나는 네가 이렇게 빨리 올 줄은 "
"몰랐다. 잠깐만. 거의 다 끝났어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "07b556b5-6063-4414-804f-80cfe6335298"
msgid ""
"\"It's amazing that you managed to get here, {name}. I kept hoping that this "
"wasn't going to happen, and bloodshed could be avoided.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 이곳에 와서 놀랍다. {name}. 나는 계속 이런 일이 일어나지 않을 거라고, 유혈 사태는 피할 수 있기를 바랐다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "17212514-7105-4a9f-b494-a132bda1db2a"
msgid ""
"\"But not every death is final. I understood completely how the primal "
"gnomes felt, when I returned to life here, in the House at the Edge of Time. "
"The Host {d|Jubilost Immortal}didn't lie{/d} — I'm connected to {g|First "
"World}the First World{/g}. And this connection is something more than just a "
"chance to die a little less fully than the denizens of the {g|Material Plane}"
"Material Plane{/g}. The First World is now... inside me. It's an eternal, "
"seething, ever-changing. And it protects me from the "
"{g|Bleaching}Bleaching{/g} better than any magic.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 모든 죽음이 막다른 길은 아니지. 나는 이곳, 시간의 끝에 선 집에서 정신을 차렸을 때 원시 노움들이 어떻게 느꼈는지 완전히 "
"이해했다. 주최자는 내게 {d|Jubilost Immortal}거짓말하지 않았어{/d} — 나는{g|First World} 태초 "
"세계{/g}와 연결되었지. 그리고 이 연결은 {g|material plane}물질계{/g}의 녀석들 보다 죽음을 기회가 더 적다는 것 "
"이상을 의미해. 태초 세계는 이제... 내 안에 있다. 그것은 영원하고, 끓고, 끊임없이 변화해. 그리고 그것은 어떤 마법보다 효과적으로 "
"나를 {g|Bleaching}백화{/g}에서 지켜주고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "f0886b99-7033-4c94-91cb-cbbbc9ef3b2f"
msgid ""
"\"But guess who helped me? Xae, our insane ghost friend from the dungeons "
"under the {g|Candlemere}Candlemere{/g}! Though she's not a ghost {d|Jubilost "
"Xae}any more{/d}, and significantly less insane, but who knows... According "
"to her, she never died in a dungeon, but safely opened a portal to {g|First "
"World}the First World{/g} and even regained her immortality.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 누가 나를 도왔는지 알아? 자에, {g|Candlemere}캔들미어{/g} 아래 던전에서 만난 우리의 미친 유령의 친구였어! "
"그녀는 {d|Jubilost Xae}더 이상{/d} 유령이 아니었고 정신도 더 온전해졌지만, 누가 알겠어... 그녀가 말하길, 그녀는 "
"던전에서 사망한 적이 없었지만, {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}로 가는 포털을 안전하게 열었고 심지어 자기 불멸을 "
"되찾았다는군. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "d899e1ba-1041-4faa-9dee-2e54e59c8e33"
msgid ""
"\"But guess who helped me? The unforgettable {d|Jubilost Nyrd}Nyrd "
"Zottenropple{/d}! She seems to be settling into {g|First World}the First "
"World{/g} quite well, and she hopped here like a grasshopper using her "
"teleportation. She dragged my breathless body from under Nyrissa's nose, "
"revived me, and brought back here with a heap of wishes, half-mad stories, "
"and a request that I bring her something she calls books, but which I call "
"kindling.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 누가 나를 도왔는지 알아? {d|Jubilost Nyrd}니르드 조텐로플{/d}을 잊지 않았겠지! 그녀는 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}에 아주 잘 정착하고 있는 것 같아, 그리고 그녀는 순간 이동을 사용하여 메뚜기처럼 여기로 뛰어왔지. 그녀는 "
"나이리사의 코 밑에서 내 숨이 끊어진 시체를 끌고 가서, 나를 소생시켰고, 소원 무더기와, 반쯤은 미친 이야기와, 그녀는 책이라 부르고 "
"나는 불쏘시개라 부르는 것을 가져와 달라는 부탁과 함께 다시 여기로 데려다 놓았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "919c7dfc-1dec-4e7c-94aa-ecb7effdb3b5"
msgid ""
"\"Far from trying! She did kill me! Not that I was unprepared for such an "
"outcome, but it's still an unpleasant and rather painful business. I'm not "
"sure yet if I'm even going to include it in my publications. A painful death "
"is not the sort of experience you want to read about over and over on a "
"rainy evening by the fire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"시도는 무슨! 그녀는 나를 죽였어! 그런 결과는 준비가 되지 않았던 건 아니지만, 여전히 불쾌하고 고통스러웠지. 이 경험을 내 저작에 "
"포함시켜야 할지 아직 확신이 안서는군. 고통스러운 죽음 따위는 비오는 저녁에 모닥불 옆에서 읽고 싶은 내용이 아니니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "2f69ecd6-7c5c-497a-b115-7b1c55546cf6"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. I just can't wait to pay a visit to Lady Nyrissa. I should like "
"to help her become history — both literally and figuratively!\""
msgstr "\"물론. 나이리사를 어서 만나고 싶어. 그녀가 역사의 일부가 되도록 돕는게 기쁘군 — 말과 비유 모든 방면에서 말이지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "3b463dfd-d29d-425d-a0e1-adf62a1ca5c7"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g}, the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} of Time, informed her that "
"for this she has to thank a {mf|king|queen} from {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} "
"and some young — young, just think of it! — gnome named Jubilost. Shyka told "
"Xae that she'd be able to save us in the House at the Edge of Time many "
"thousands of years later. And she did! — She waited, she came, and she saved!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"시간의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g} {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 이를 두고 그녀가 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 "
"{mf|왕|여왕}과 주빌로스트라는 젊은 — 젊다니, 좋을대로 생각하는군! — 노움에게 감사하라고 일러줬어. 샤이카는 자에에게 그녀는 수천 "
"년 후에 우리를 시간의 가장 자리에 선 집에서 구원 할 수 있을 것이라 말했었다는군. 그리고 그녀는 해냈고! 그녀는 기다렸고, 이곳에 "
"왔고, 그리고 날 구해줬어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Jubilost_Companion
msgctxt "37cac94e-0c35-455f-8b15-0af2011d4149"
msgid ""
"\"Strictly speaking, it was threats and blackmail, not temptation. But yes, "
"I gave in. Why not, in the end? If she helps me do what you couldn't — find "
"a solution of gnomes' exodus from {g|First World}the First World{/g} — that "
"would make up for everything else. I might not be comfortable with killing "
"my former companions, but sometimes the ends justify the means!\""
msgstr ""
"\"엄밀히 말하자면, 그것은 위협과 협박이었지 유혹이 아니었다. 하지만 맞아, 나는 넘어갔다. 결국에는 모두 그렇게 되지 않겠어? 그녀가 "
"다른 모든 일을 제쳐두고, 너는 할 수 없는 일 — {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 노움의 이주한 이유를 찾는 것 — 을 "
"도와준다는데. 나는 이전 동료들을 죽이는데 익숙하지 않지만, 때로는 목표가 수단을 정당화한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/1JubilostTOS_1Jubilost_String
msgctxt "5eb2c32f-b292-4a53-b981-3388fbceb68b"
msgid "\"That's not the way I wanted to get to the First World...\""
msgstr "\"이런 방식으로 태초 세계에 오고 싶진 않았는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/2JubilostTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "ef817c06-76a6-4542-9466-42a028a5f657"
msgid ""
"\"You've dreamed of this for a long time, haven't you? To dive into a vortex "
"of wonder and discovery, while your foes tramp the dusty roads of Golarion.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 오랫동안 이것을 꿈꿔 왔지, 그렇지 않나? 골라리온의 적들이 먼지 투성이 도로를 짓밟는 동안, 놀람과 발견의 소용돌이 속으로 "
"뛰어드는 것을 말이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/2JubilostTOS_2Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "488098cc-5b81-4982-b7a0-c9192b5624bd"
msgid ""
"\"The return here, where it all began, the prototype, the precursor of all "
"that is known to mortals... and it lies open before you.\""
msgstr "\"돌아오는 곳, 모든 것의 출발점, 원형, 필멸자들에게 알려진 모든 것의 선도자... 그리고 그것은 너의 앞에 열려있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/2JubilostTOS_3Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "815be3ac-3df6-4e8f-9171-a9134bc3b94d"
msgid ""
"\"But you will need a mighty protector to explore the First World. Accept my "
"help and my blessing.\""
msgstr "\"그러나 태초 세계를 탐험하기 위해서는 강력한 보호자가 필요할거다. 나의 도움과 축복을 받아들여라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/3JubilostTOS_1Jubilost_String
msgctxt "e4e0551c-848d-4793-8147-c703f7065c38"
msgid ""
"\"You do understand that your so-called offer in fact leaves me no choice?\""
msgstr "\"네가 소위 제안이라고 부르는 것에 사실 선택의 여지가 없다는 걸 알고있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/3JubilostTOS_2Jubilost_String
msgctxt "db0db9b4-90f5-4864-96ac-fd6fe680ba03"
msgid ""
"\"I am completely alone in the dominion of a mighty and unpredictable "
"creature. A refusal might cost me my life.\""
msgstr "\"나는 강력하고 예측할 수 없는 생명체의 영토에서 외톨이 신세다. 거절하면 죽겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/4JubilostTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "c1b5aa3f-63c5-451c-bb54-7582736afae6"
msgid "\"So don't refuse.\""
msgstr "\"그러니 거절하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/5JubilostTOS_1Jubilost_String
msgctxt "7de78ec5-6b4a-480d-bf93-dfcdd3df66cf"
msgid ""
"\"And yet I'm saying no. To put it bluntly, you are asking me to betray a "
"friend who I deeply respect. Some friend would I be if I gave in to "
"blackmail!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그럼에도 불구하고 내 대답은 '아니오'다. 한마디로, 너는 내가 진심으로 존중하는 친구를 배반하라는 거잖아? 협박에 넘어간다면 그건 "
"진정한 친구가 아니라 그냥 친구겠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/5_ALT_JubilostTOS_1Jubilost_String
msgctxt "1a947732-010c-456d-8f5f-dcba56a486de"
msgid ""
"\"I cannot refuse. What is more important than knowledge? Especially the "
"kind that the First World can provide?\""
msgstr "\"거부하기 힘들군. 지식보다 더 중요한 것은 없지. 하물며 그 지식이 태초세계의 지식이라면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/JubilostTOS/CutsceneBarks/6JubilostTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "5fd8a377-1932-44e3-a0ff-b594b5faf115"
msgid "\"My protection costs much. But refusing it costs a hundredfold more!\""
msgstr "\"나의 보호 비용은 많이 든다. 하지만 거절에는 비용이 100배 더 들지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "b5d553ba-6479-47c4-9c3d-e2e0c7b24eeb"
msgid "\"What happened to you?\""
msgstr "\"너한테 무슨 일이 생긴 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "af2190de-a82b-4c23-9374-77abeb6e74c1"
msgid "\"Let's go, Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr "\"가자. 녹-녹.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "fb2da1de-73ec-4eaf-ae52-52175570e389"
msgid "\"Are you sure you're all right?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮은 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "ecb5d305-165a-4bbb-8f43-a61d276a9665"
msgid ""
"{n}Nok-Nok's ears perk up as you approach. He looks dirty, and his clothes "
"are in greater disarray than normal. His eyes are also a strange, clear "
"blue, like marbles.{/n} \"There you are, taking your time!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 다가서자 녹-녹의 귀가 쫑긋합니다. 꼴이 아주 말이 아닌데 원래도 그렇지만 평소보다 더합니다. 게다가 눈은 이상하게도 "
"구슬처럼 투명한 푸른색입니다.{/n} \"왔다, 천천히 오라구!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "70e6de90-2205-41ce-b3c6-9c77afa57db4"
msgid ""
"\"Met foul-smelling plant woman with ears. Tried kill me, but Nok-Nok "
"bravely cowered on floor and held breath.\" {n}He puffs up proudly.{/n} \"Old"
" trick, from way back in tribe. Make them think Nok-Nok already dead before "
"they kick and hit more.\" {n}Nok-Nok frowns.{/n} \"Except this time, trick "
"worked.\""
msgstr ""
"\"썩은내 나는 귀쟁이 식물 여자를 만났다. 나를 죽이려고 했지만, 녹-녹은 용감하게 바닥에 웅크리고 숨을 죽였다.\" {n}그는 "
"당당하게 콧바람을 내뿜습니다.{/n} \"예로부터 부족이 쓰던 속임수다. 더 때리고 차기 전에 녹-녹이 이미 죽었다고 생각하게 만든다.\""
" {n}녹-녹이 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"꽤 잘통하는데, 이번엔 안통했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "50e1b5e3-ef8b-4acc-907b-cc175b81c853"
msgid ""
"\"Foul-smelling plant woman with ears no keep kicking or hitting me, and her "
"spell...\" {n}Nok-Nok swallows, lifting the rags from his side to reveal a "
"huge, black scorch mark cutting close to his ribs.{/n} \"Dodge most of it. "
"Made eyes all funny, though.\" {n}He blinks, and some of the red returns... "
"but slowly.{/n} \"Starting see normal again, almost good as new.\""
msgstr ""
"\"썩은내 나는 귀쟁이 식물여자가 계속 때리고 걷어차다가 멈췄다. 그러더니 주문을...\" {n}녹-녹은 옆구리의 누더기를 들어 올려 "
"거의 갈비뼈에 커다랗게 그을린 검은 자국을 드러냈습니다.{/n} \"이래 봬도, 대부분은 피했다.\" {n}그가 눈을 깜빡이자, 서서히 "
"눈에 붉은 빛이 돌아오기 시작합니다.{/n} \"다시 잘 보이기 시작한다, 새거나 마찬가지다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "29b1ac72-bdf8-40fb-b46f-409ec6c65484"
msgid ""
"\"Ready to stab! Point the way, and knife will follow.\" {n}Nok-Nok "
"grins.{/n} \"Plus, now you here. Let's play same game with her, except this "
"time, Nok-Nok has clever plan... keep kicking her when she falls, and make "
"sure she not do same death fake trick Nok-Nok do!\""
msgstr ""
"\"찌르러 가자! 어딜 찌를지 알려주면, 거길 찌른다.\" {n}녹-녹이 웃습니다.{/n} \"게다가, 이제 네가 여기 있다. 그 여자와 "
"똑같은 놀이를 할꺼다. 대신 이번에 녹-녹은 똑똑한 계획이 있다... 그 여자가 넘어지면 계속 걷어찬다, 그리고 녹-녹처럼 죽은 척 "
"하는게 아니란걸 확인한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/1NNTOS_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "a1fa5294-a21a-44ed-b819-41d45b2da451"
msgid "\"And what have we here?\""
msgstr "\"아니, 여기에는 무슨 일이니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/2NNTOS_NokNok_String
msgctxt "0e8ef486-e657-483c-a545-d4d80b7e3623"
msgid "\"Nok... Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr "\"녹... 녹-녹.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/3NNTOS_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "aa32ff3a-e858-409c-a1f0-7c350b13b81b"
msgid "\"Is that the sound of your knees shaking in fear?\""
msgstr "\"그게 공포에 네 오금이 저리는 소리니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/4NNTOS_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "a95cbda6-8aad-4347-9e5f-12d71b481a55"
msgid ""
"\"I took you for a hero... for only a hero would be brave enough to come "
"here. Or are you something else? A shabby, tattered bit of comedy, perhaps?\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너를 영웅이라고 생각해... 여기에 올 만큼 용감하잖아? 영웅이 아니라면... 그 누추하고 너덜너덜한 행색으로 웃기러 온 건가?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/5NNTOS_NokNok_String
msgctxt "ac5444f5-a6fb-4120-a8a3-faf08cdda7b4"
msgid "\"I am hero. Great Hero.\""
msgstr "\"나는 영웅이다. 위대한 영웅.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/6NNTOS_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "8eca901a-b79e-42d6-8b2a-f597045384a0"
msgid "\"Are you? Am I the only one who sees that?\""
msgstr "\"그래? 그렇게 생각하는 건 나 뿐인거 같은데?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/7NNTOS_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "0f3da10a-4164-4728-adcf-0fbff7a87053"
msgid ""
"\"I don't think your master, {name}, sees anything of the sort. Are you not "
"put aside, laughed at, ridiculed... treated as your tribe treated you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 보기엔 네 주인, {name}은(는) 그렇게 생각하지 않는 것 같군. 너희 부족이 너에게 했듯이 무시하거나 비웃고 장난치잖아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/8NNTOS_NokNok_String
msgctxt "bcb53144-0dc1-4661-ba2c-56e5eef1d88e"
msgid ""
"\"No! {name} is a hero, and so I am. Am I. Me. Hero! And I will stop you.\""
msgstr "\"아니! {name}은 영웅이고 나도 그렇다. 나는, 난 영웅이다! 그리고 너를 막을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/NokNokTOS/CutsceneBarks/9NNTOS_Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "acf2c5cb-04e0-4674-93e9-c92239c2246d"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, you contemptuous little thing. You cannot stop me — but if you truly "
"are a hero come to challenge me, then you may join the others who came "
"before — in death.\""
msgstr "\"이 경멸스러운 꼬마 녀석. 너는 나를 막을 수 없어. 그러나 네가 진정한 영웅으로서 나에게 도전한다면 똑같이 죽여주마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6ad274b0-c522-480b-baf7-35fa1a9fb7b7"
msgid ""
"Told Octavia that Nyrissa is the only one responsible for Regongar's death."
msgstr "옥타비아에게 나이리사가 레곤가르가 죽은 유일한 원인이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "385a0625-d8b6-45dd-8861-13d80acfa1cc"
msgid "\"It's Nyrissa's fault all this happened. Hers — not yours!\""
msgstr "\"이 모든 일은 나이리사의 잘못이다. 너의 잘못이 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "59c0fefd-b3bd-4423-987b-5cc3c0853f08"
msgid ""
"\"Regongar did a brave and honorable thing. Respect his choice and do not "
"blame yourself for his death.\""
msgstr "\"레곤가르는 용기있고 명예로운 일을 했다. 그의 선택을 존중하고 그의 죽음을 네 탓이라 비난하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "9e859925-c5ce-40f6-9913-85440d171458"
msgid "Told Octavia you don't care what she did so long as you are together."
msgstr "옥타비아에게 당신이 그녀와 함께 있는 한 그녀가 저지른 일에 상관하지 않는다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b57c23c7-03f7-4932-83be-0bb860d2fdc1"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care what you did. What's important is you're alive and with me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 한 일에 신경 쓰지 않는다. 중요한 것은 네가 살아 있고 나와 함께 있다는 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "fce685c4-3edb-45ec-b87b-9198e1f8f56a"
msgid "\"You were forced to make a terrible choice. That's not your fault.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 끔찍한 선택을 해야 했다. 그건 네 잘못이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0017_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4830b755-dd94-4aa2-ac0d-debc1147053c"
msgid "Told Octavia that in the face of death, everyone stands for themselves."
msgstr "옥타비아에게 죽음을 앞두면 모든 사람들이 스스로를 챙긴다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "f52130dc-c01e-4497-9afa-846d326c40bb"
msgid ""
"\"Of course not. No one can bargain with death. We all must face it along.\""
msgstr "\"물론 아니야. 누구도 죽음을 흥정할 수는 없다. 우리 모두는 그것을 직면해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0018_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "c56613ee-41ac-415d-ace4-bea35e363a20"
msgid "Comforted Octavia in her sorrow."
msgstr "슬픔에 빠진 옥타비아를 위로해주었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "0aa75f11-068f-4233-8b8f-028a538624af"
msgid "\"Please don't cry. I'm here. The evil moment has passed.\""
msgstr "\"울지 마. 내가 여기 있어. 악몽은 지나갔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0019_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "4ccbc79a-72c6-4590-97bf-e743c810474a"
msgid "Told Octavia she was responsible for Regongar's death."
msgstr "옥타비아에게 레곤가르의 죽음은 그녀의 책임이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "bbf99218-9107-45dd-8e77-a8eb835753b7"
msgid ""
"\"True, you are responsible. Regongar certainly didn't deserve to die like "
"that!\""
msgstr "\"맞아. 네 책임이다. 레곤가르는 확실히 그렇게 죽으면 안 되었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0021_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "0138f88e-8efe-4cfd-961d-16764ace9e6e"
msgid "Accused Octavia of lying about Regongar's death."
msgstr "레곤가르의 죽음에 대해 거짓말을 한 옥타비아를 비난했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "14bd65bb-a940-443e-bbbd-a4bbc163cdef"
msgid "\"I think you're lying, and you only wanted to save your skin.\""
msgstr "\"나는 네가 거짓말을 하고 화를 면하기만을 원한다고 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "1bfd7eab-1330-4b0a-a4a3-5adffc4c7567"
msgid "\"I might have been rough. I don't want to lose you.\""
msgstr "\"나는 어쩌면 거칠게 군 것 같아. 너를 잃고 싶지 않아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0025_Text
msgctxt "4fa352c2-c525-4cdc-a03e-515cc33fd7fe"
msgid "\"I don't want to have anything more to do with you. Leave me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너와 더 할 일이 없기를 바란다. 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "0884a7cf-2ddd-4c1e-bae8-f043d0c8ec39"
msgid ""
"\"Octavia would never let you die. Value her sacrifice and don't blame "
"yourself.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아는 결코 너를 죽게 내버려 두지 않을 것이다. 그녀의 희생을 존중하고 네 자신을 비난하지 마.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0038_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "52ef1bbb-1de9-4be4-9cb6-f2294d812d9f"
msgid "Told Regongar that Nyrissa will pay for Octavia's death."
msgstr "레곤가르에게 나이리사가 옥타비아의 죽음에 대가를 치를 것이라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "e737dd79-eae9-4f22-ac44-a63d9d7e6496"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa will pay a very, very high price for Octavia's death, I promise.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 옥타비아의 죽음에 대해 아주 비싼 대가를 지불할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0039_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d85c8ffd-1353-4eb8-825d-699ce74511e4"
msgid "Accused Regongar of leaving Octavia for dead."
msgstr "옥타비아를 죽게 내버려둔 레곤가르를 비난했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "f3c04c04-b27e-4124-9102-f2847d621a59"
msgid "\"Your story sounds like a pathetic excuse. You just let Octavia die!\""
msgstr "\"네가 한 말은 애처로운 변명처럼 들린다. 너는 단지 옥타비아가 죽게 내버려 두었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0042_Text
msgctxt "7d7b5c20-204c-4b73-9aa7-6df49497cda3"
msgid ""
"\"I might have overreacted. Let's go. We face a difficult battle with "
"Nyrissa.\""
msgstr "\"나는 과잉 반응했을지도 모른다. 가자. 우리는 나이리사와의 어려운 전투에 직면해있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "2b7167c5-b865-4030-b339-3d9d14450ad5"
msgid "\"I'm sure of what I said. Leave me.\""
msgstr "\"내가 한 말에 확신한다. 떠나라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0045_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "d272534b-249d-4f12-a4ef-c72d73a5a18f"
msgid "Told Regongar that a single sacrifice is better than two deaths."
msgstr "레곤가르에게 한 명의 희생이 두 명의 죽음보다 낫다고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0045_Text
msgctxt "c66531ae-c1b2-4de2-907a-142f741733a7"
msgid ""
"\"I'm sorry about Octavia, but life is cruel. One of you surviving is better "
"than neither.\""
msgstr "\"옥타비아에게 벌어진 일 대해 유감이지만 인생은 잔인하다. 살아남은 사람은 모두 괴롭다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0046_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "bcc257b8-28d3-4fe7-ad19-4d3d0b2ad78f"
msgid "Told Regongar that you also would have sacrificed Octavia."
msgstr "레곤가르에게 당신이라도 옥타비아를 희생시켰을 거라고 말했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "cccd2efd-e9b6-46ff-ae50-1468c51ff558"
msgid "\"There's nothing to regret. I would do the same thing if I were you.\""
msgstr "\"후회할 것은 없다. 내가 너라면 똑같은 일을 했을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0060_Text
msgctxt "32f8bf0a-fcd9-4adf-acdd-0e67d80a12d1"
msgid "\"Will you tell me what happened?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이 있었는지 말해줄래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Answer_0061_Text
msgctxt "f7dca4af-335f-4b08-b979-d4e904ddc6bb"
msgid ""
"\"It's good we found each other. It's time to keep going — Nyrissa won't "
"wait!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 서로를 발견한 것은 좋은 일이야. 계속 가야할 때다. 나이리사는 기다리지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "87ab1a0a-d721-45da-aa48-9981e7d16dd7"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia turns to you, her face wet with tears. She seems ready to rush to "
"embrace you, but she stops at the last moment.{/n} \"You're here! I... I was "
"afraid I would never see you again. But Reg! He's dead...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아가 당신을 향해 돌아보고는 그녀의 얼굴이 눈물로 젖습니다. 그녀는 당신에게 안기기 위해 준비가 되어있는 것처럼 보였지만 "
"마지막 순간에 멈춥니다.{/n} \"왔구나! 다시는 널 만나지 못할까봐 두려웠어. 하지만 레그가! 그가 죽었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "3cce9e5a-e0b4-4c14-8da1-df10761e3f5c"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar is spinning around, casting spells randomly in all "
"directions.{/n} \"I hate you, I hate you!\" {n}He lets out a belting roar, "
"but noticing you, the half-orc quiets down and freezes, panting.{/n} \"{name}"
"... Here... So at least all this wasn't in vain!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 주위를 빙빙 돌면서 모든 방향으로 무작위로 주문을 시전합니다.{/n} \"네가 싫어! 네가 싫어!\" {n}그는 외침이 "
"터져나오지만 당신을 알아차리고 하프오크는 조용해져 얼어붙어 버리고는 헐떡입니다.{/n} \" {name}... 여기... 적어도 모든 "
"것이 헛되지는 않았어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3a5bd3bf-6565-4d5f-a7e1-1be2ecc3e516"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia looks at you silently for a few moments. Her face is paler than "
"snow.{/n} \"I killed him. Reg. Maestro Janush threw us into burning cages "
"and put a key between us that could only be used once. Only one of us could "
"get out! So I took the key... and opened the lock and got out, while Reg "
"burned alive screaming.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 잠시 당신을 묵묵히 바라봅니다. 그녀의 얼굴은 눈보다 더 창백합니다.{/n} \"내가 그를 죽였어. 마에스트로 자누쉬가 "
"우리를 불타는 우리에 던져 넣었고 한 번만 사용할 수 있는 열쇠를 우리 사이에 던졌다. 우리 중 한 명만 빠져 나올 수 있었어! 그래서 "
"나는 열쇠를 가져다가 자물쇠를 열고 꺼냈고 레그는 산 채로 비명을 질렀어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "609ba577-5d41-44e6-9d95-0f3851293c6c"
msgid ""
"{n}The girl talks hastily, as if trying to get rid of words that were "
"scorching her insides.{/n} \"I woke up in a cage, I saw Reg in another one "
"next to mine. Maestro Janush stood near us... he pointed at the key that lay "
"between the cages, said it could only be used once. And then he set the "
"fire. I tried to open the cages with magic but Reg... grabbed the key... and "
"threw it to me.\" {n}Octavia covers her face with her hands.{/n} \"I yelled "
"that I don't want to escape alone, but he didn't say anything. The flames "
"rose, and hid him from me. And then I took the key and got out...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}소녀는 속이 타오르는 것을 멈추려는 듯 급하게 이야기합니다.{/n} \"나는 우리에서 깨어났다. 내 옆에 또 다른 우리에 레그가 "
"보였어. 마에스트로 자누쉬는 우리 근처에 서 있었고... 그는 우리 사이에 놓인 열쇠를 가리키면서 그것이 한 번만 사용될 수 있다고 "
"말했어. 그리고는 불을 질렀어. 나는 마법과 함께 새장을 열려고 했지만 레그는... 열쇠를 쥐고 그것을 내게 던졌다. \" {n}"
"옥타비아는 손으로 얼굴을 가립니다.{/n} \"나는 혼자 도망 치고 싶지 않다고 외쳤다. 하지만 그는 아무 말도 하지 않았지. 화염이 "
"일어나서 그를 덮쳤고. 그리고 나는 열쇠를 가져와서 빠져나왔어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "92d77c21-8874-419c-b65c-6b84cefdb93d"
msgid ""
"\"The damn witch lured us into a trap! She threw us into burning slave "
"cages, pretended to be Janush, and said there was only one key. And Octavia, "
"silly girl... threw me the key, yelled 'Be happy, Reg!' and ducked into the "
"flames... Why?! Why did this have to happen?!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 망할 마녀가 우리를 함정에 빠트렸다! 그녀는 자누쉬로 가장하여 우리를 불타는 노예 우리에 던지고는 문을 여는 열쇠는 하나 밖에 "
"없다고 말했다. 그리고 옥타비아 바보 같은 계집애가... 열쇠를 던지고 소리쳤다. '행복해야해! 레그!' 그리고 화염에 빠져들었는데... "
"왜? 왜 이런 일이 일어나야만 했지? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "710ef7d8-6d46-46dc-a1f3-1a49d219ff1a"
msgid ""
"\"The damn witch fooled me like a whelp! Pretended to be Janush, locked us "
"in these cages... It was just like {d|OctReg Burn Slaves}back{/d} at the "
"Technic League! There was just one key. I knew I'd be more useful on the "
"outside. — If I got out and survived, I could come find you, and maybe even "
"save Octavia... But I didn't. Blast it all! Something had to be done "
"quickly, you know? You've got to understand!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 망할 마녀가 나를 함정에 빠트렸다! 그녀는 자누쉬로 가장하여 우리를 이 우리에 가두었어... 기술 연맹에서 {d|OctReg "
"Burn Slaves}일어났던 일과{/d} 똑같았어! 거기에는 단 하나의 열쇠만 있었다. 나는 밖에서 더 유용할 줄 알았다. 내가 나가서 "
"살아남는다면 너를 찾았을 테고 심지어 옥타비아를 구할 수도 있었는데... 하지만 나는 그러지 못했다. 모두 태워버려! 어떤 일은 빨리 "
"끝내야해. 알지? 너는 이해할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "de4af8ee-fc6c-4cae-9dd7-60e76faa8c89"
msgid ""
"\"You and I didn't walk so many roads just to fall for such rubbish. With a "
"leader like you, we can face any monster. Let's go, shall we? I can't wait "
"to laugh in that green witch's face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 그런 쓰레기에게 당하지 않을 정도로 많은 길을 걷지는 않았다. 너 같은 지도자가 있다면 우리는 어떤 괴물과도 마주 칠 수있다. "
"가자. 그 녹색 마녀의 얼굴에 비웃는 것을 기다릴 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "a7119681-443d-4d89-9f69-563852596987"
msgid "\"{name}! You're here, you're alive!\""
msgstr "\" {name}! 왔구나! 살아있었구나! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5b7e16a1-5b08-41ab-aa06-256ac5515588"
msgid ""
"\"I thought for a second... — I've {d|OctReg Burn Slaves}turned my back{/d} "
"once on people dying in cages. Reg insisted. When you can do nothing — live. "
"For revenge. For those you'll be able to help someday. For the future. For "
"our future. I couldn't die and leave you facing the final battle alone! So I "
"made the decision. Do you... do you blame me?\""
msgstr ""
"\"잠시 생각을 해봤는데... — 나는 우리에서 죽어가는 사람들에게 {d|OctReg Burn Slaves}등을 돌렸었어. {/d}레그가 "
"말했었지. 아무것도 할 수 없을 때는 살아야 한다고. 복수를 위해. 언젠가 도움을 줄 사람들을 위해서. 미래를 위해서. 우리의 미래를 "
"위해서. 나는 죽을 수 없었고 네가 혼자서 마지막 전투를 마주하게 둘 수 없었어! 그래서 결정을 내렸어. 너... 날 비난할 거야? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "987a9132-0614-4a9d-83c5-9acbc3ff8cf2"
msgid ""
"\"{n}Octavia looks you right in the eye and smiles faintly.{/n} \"When I "
"know you're beside me, I feel strong enough to keep going no matter how "
"tired I am. Let's go. We'll make our enemies answer for everything!\""
msgstr ""
"\" {n}옥타비아는 당신을 눈을 보고 희미하게 미소 지어줍니다.{/n} \"네가 내 옆에 있다는 것을 알 면, 아무리 지쳤어도 계속 갈 "
"수 있을 만큼 강해진 기분을 느껴. 가자. 우리는 적들이 모든 대가를 치르도록 만들어야해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3693023f-a95d-4854-a5f1-0529368120a4"
msgid ""
"\"What?!\" {n}Octavia winces.{/n} \"That's what you really think of me... "
"Would you trust such a liar to keep fighting shoulder to shoulder with you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐?!\" {n}옥타비아가 움찔했습니다.{/n} \"정말로 나를 그렇게 생각하다니... 그런 거짓말쟁이를 믿고 어깨를 나란히 하고 "
"싸울 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "5015f507-235e-41a4-aa94-e94f165684b9"
msgid ""
"\"So you think I should have died instead of him? I am too exhausted to "
"argue. I knew Reg much longer than you, and I'm grieving, but such is life. "
"And it was you who taught me that lesson when you decided not to save {g|"
"Technic League}the Technic League's{/g} slaves from fire. So what now? Will "
"you disown your... companion?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래서 내가 대신 죽어야 한다고 생각한거야? 지쳐서 논쟁할 여지가 없네. 너보다 레그를 훨씬 오래 알았고, 나는 슬픔에 빠졌지만, "
"삶은 그런 거야. 그리고 화재 속의 {g|Technic League}기술 연맹{/g} 노예들을 구하지 않기로 결정했을 때 그런 교훈을 "
"가르쳐 준 건 너야. 그럼 이제 어떡하라구? 네 동료를 져버릴 거야? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "238d8d7e-a877-4c7a-8334-483e192b00ad"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia smiles gratefully.{/n} \"Deep inside I knew you were going to "
"find me. No power could tear us apart, even all of Nyrissa's magic! Now "
"please, let's go. I know a good way to settle my nerves — break the neck of "
"the one who did this to us!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 감사한 듯 미소지었습니다.{/n} \"내면 깊숙한 곳에서 네가 나를 찾을 거라는 것을 알았어. 나이리사의 마법이라도 "
"우리를 찢을 수 있는 힘은 없어. 이제 제발. 가자. 신경을 안정시키는 좋은 방법을 알고 있어. 우리에게 이런 짓을 한 녀석들의 목을 "
"부러뜨려 주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "7c02a2c8-fe8f-4a61-8be5-0edafe8e8906"
msgid ""
"\"You are... right, I think. Reg always knew what he was doing. He defended "
"me as best he could — whenever he could. I will keep living, and I'll do "
"anything I can to make his sacrifice count. I must be strong for Reg's "
"memory... and for us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가... 맞아. 레그는 자기가 하고 있는 일을 항상 알고 있었어. 그는 할 수 있을 때마다 최선을 다해 나를 옹호했지. 나는 "
"살아남을 것이고 그의 희생을 값지게 할수 있는 모든 것을 할 거야. 나는 레그의 기억과 우리를 위해... 강해져야 해. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "d6547250-3868-4c22-a697-0a43871ba636"
msgid ""
"\"I don't know if it's important. To assign blame, I... Let's not talk about "
"it for now. We have a battle to fight, and we have to be stronger than ever. "
"I couldn't save Reg, but I won't let you die. Not for the world!\""
msgstr ""
"\"중요한지 모르겠어. 책임을 묻기에는 나는... 지금은 이야기하지 않겠어. 우리는 싸워야 할 전투가 있어. 그리고 우리는 그 어느 "
"때보다 강해져야 해. 나는 레그를 구할 수 없었어. 하지만 너는 죽게 내버려 두지 않을거야. 세상을 위해서가 아니라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "27b2f6b8-0f46-4860-a08f-0d5d40cb1c1d"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia lowers her head, but a moment later looks up stubbornly.{/n} "
"\"Fine! Farewell, {name}! Now I'm alone in the world. But I will find my way."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 그녀의 머리를 숙이지만 잠시 후 완고하게 보입니다.{/n} \"좋아! 잘있어, {name}! 이제 나는 세계에 혼자야. "
"하지만 내 길을 찾을테야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "255ba499-23c5-475c-ae92-5e7fd1e5301f"
msgid ""
"\"I... understand. It hurts me too, but sometimes pain makes us do things we "
"regret. Let's not talk about Reg for now. Everyone needs time to grieve. "
"Let's go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는... 이해해. 나에게도 상처를 줬으니까. 그러나 때때로 고통은 우리가 후회할 일을 하도록 만들어. 지금은 레그에 대해 이야기하지 "
"말자. 모두가 슬퍼할 시간이 필요해. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0034_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "3263b1d0-5764-465a-96c4-1c1283d05008"
msgid ""
"\"I know. It's just... we'll need time to process everything, but for now "
"let's not dwell. I survived to be with you, to stand shoulder to shoulder "
"with you, against any danger. And I'm ready for anything. Let's go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"알아. 그냥... 우린 모든 것을 잊어버릴 시간이 필요할 거야. 하지만 지금은 생각하면 안돼. 나는 살아남아 너와 함께 있고, 너와 "
"어깨를 나란히 하고 위험에 맞설 거야. 나는 준비가 되어있어. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "e14f9434-1d05-4049-951a-5b04f021eedc"
msgid ""
"\"Reg would say something like that.\" {n}Octavia shakes her head.{/n} \"Well"
", either way, let's not linger. We're back together, that's what's "
"important. Now, let our enemies burn!\""
msgstr ""
"\"레그는 그렇게 말했을 거야.\" {n}옥타비아가 그녀의 머리를 흔듭니다.{/n} \"글쎄, 어느쪽으로든 그만 생각하자. 우리가 다시 "
"만났고 그것이 중요해. 이제 우리 원수를 불태우자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9b52cdd8-cfb0-48cd-b324-1591aeece2a1"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar's eyes flare with such fire that it seems he's ready to sink his "
"teeth into your throat. But the impulse fades quickly, making room for "
"something else. Grief? Frustration?{/n} \"Think whatever you want, say "
"whatever you want. Just decide if you need me or not.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르의 눈은 당신의 목에 그의 이빨을 박을 준비가 되어있다는 듯 눈을 번쩍입니다. 그러나 충동은 빨리 사라져 다른 감정이 들어올 "
"공간을 만듭니다. 고통? 좌절일까요?{/n} \"네가 원하는대로 생각하고 원하는대로 말해. 네가 나를 필요로 하는지만 결정하라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "576a4ca1-4372-4da2-996f-d4f1de540d52"
msgid ""
"\"We woke up in cages, with Maestro Janush standing nearby, looking quite "
"real. He set the cages on fire and tells us there's only one key, and makes "
"us decide which one gets out!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 우리에서 일어났다. 마에스트로 자누시가 근처에 서있었는데 아주 현실적으로 보였다. 그는 우리를 불태우고 키가 하나 밖에 없다고 "
"말하면서 누가 나올지 결정하라고 했어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5d22a394-a470-4e45-980d-e39d703002b9"
msgid ""
"\"But I remember kicking his dead body. I looked at Octavia and I knew that "
"she remembered it too. We've been through everything together — that "
"freaking nymph has no idea! So, we looked at each other — and the fire went "
"out, the cages were open. It was all an illusion. Nyrissa must be very angry "
"we saw through her ploy. She was probably trying to think of a way to make "
"Octavia and me attack each other and leave you without any companions. "
"Wasn't gonna happen!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 나는 그의 시체를 찬 것을 기억한다. 나는 옥타비아를 보았고 그녀도 그것을 기억하고 있다는 것을 안다. 우리는 모든 것을 함께 "
"겪어왔다. 괴물 같은 님프는 아무것도 모른다! 그래서 우리는 서로를 보았다. 그리고 불이 꺼졌고 우리가 열렸다. 모든 것이 환상이었다. "
"나이리사는 계략을 간파당해 매우 화가 났을 것이다. 그녀는 아마도 옥타비아와 내가 서로를 공격하고 어떤 동료도 너에게 남기지 않으려고 "
"시도했을 것이다. 그런 일은 일어나지 않았지만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "dd75e6fb-ec99-4f46-b910-b9a00bf66898"
msgid ""
"\"But we both remembered how Janush ran from us like a scalded dog. And we "
"knew that we could never be separated, ever! Each day that we spent "
"together, and problem we got ourselves out of, gave us the grit and the "
"skill to see through every deception. So I looked at Reg, and he looked at "
"me... and the fire went out and the cages opened. It was all Nyrissa's "
"illusion. She'd pretended to be Janush. But she messed with the wrong team. "
"We didn't come all this way together to die alone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 우리 둘 다 자누시가 우리에게서 불에 데인 개처럼 어떻게 도망갔는지 기억하고 있었어. 그리고 우리는 결코 분리될 수 없다는 "
"것을 알았지! 우리가 함께 보낸 나날과 우리가 함께 빠져나간 문제는 우리에게 속임수를 간파할 기지와 기술을 주었다. 그래서 나는 레지를 "
"보았고 그는 나를 보았어... 불은 꺼지고 우리가 열렸어. 그것은 모두 나이리사의 환상이었지. 그녀는 자누시인 척 했었고. 하지만 그녀는 "
"잘못된 적을 만났어. 우리는 둘 중 하나가 죽어 혼자 남는 방법을 선택하지 않았어. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "8bf4cb8b-9e08-4288-9e43-425691867b7b"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia smiles at you mischievously.{/n} \"I hope you weren't worried "
"about us too much, {name}. There's no trap we couldn't get out of to come "
"find you. Now let's go! — We're back together, all three of us, and no one "
"is going to stop us!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 당신을 향해 장난스럽게 웃습니다.{/n} \"네가 우리를 너무 걱정하지 않았으면 좋겠어, {name}. 우리가 빠져 나올 "
"수 없는 함정은 없지. 이제 가자! 우리 셋 모두 다시 돌아 왔고 아무도 우리를 막을 수 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "79f79dae-c9b3-4e75-bad2-11efa0ea590f"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar chuckles.{/n} \"Well, if that's what you want, then go — let the "
"witch finish you off! I'll get to her on my own later and break her neck. "
"Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 싱긋 웃습니다.{/n} \"글쎄 그게 네가 원하는 거라면 가라. 마녀에게 죽던지! 내가 직접 그녀에게 가서 목을 부러뜨릴 "
"거야. 잘가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9b71310e-5f7a-445c-80dd-3081f5e566ce"
msgid ""
"\"Let's go. We'll have time later to tear at each other's throats. That "
"seems to be exactly what the witch wants!\""
msgstr "\"가자. 서로 헐뜯는 건 나중에 하자고. 그건 마녀가 원했던 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "d42051e2-4e8b-4d3c-85b9-dd5e72d74cbe"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar smirks cruelly.{/n} \"That's what I've always liked about you. "
"Your grit and your strength. The witch was wrong thinking she could tear us "
"apart! Let's go. I'm not one for shedding tears. — I prefer to shed my "
"enemies' blood! Let's go find some! Ha ha!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 잔인하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"그런 점이 언제나 좋았어. 너의 기지와 힘 말이지. 우리를 갈라서게 만들 거라는 마녀의 "
"생각은 틀렸어! 가자. 나는 눈물을 흘리는 사람이 아니야. 나는 적의 피를 흘리는 것을 좋아한다! 어서 적을 찾자고! 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0056_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "1b234df9-68fe-41ad-a77d-9fd9188b6396"
msgid ""
"\"Who wouldn't? Maybe Octavia herself... silly girl, so unlucky.\" {n}"
"Regongar shakes himself like a dog.{/n} \"We live for fighting, for freedom. "
"And while you and I are together — no one can take that from us! Let's go. I "
"need an enemy throat to rip out — or better yet, a few dozen!\""
msgstr ""
"\"누가 그러지 않겠어? 아마도 옥타비아겠지... 어리석은 녀석, 불행한 녀석.\" {n}레곤가르는 개처럼 몸을 텁니다.{/n} \"우리는"
" 자유를 위해 ,싸움을 위해 산다. 그리고 너와 내가 함께 하면 아무도 우리에게서 그것을 가져갈 수 없다! 가자. 나는 적의 목구멍을 "
"꿰뚫고 싶어. 괜찮다면 한 열두 놈쯤이면 좋겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0057_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "7c16ed12-14ba-4f07-bb8c-35e777734869"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar smirks angrily, as if he'd expected these words.{/n} \"Oh yes! "
"Yes, I swear by {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}! You and I are power, {name}. "
"Maybe I'm alive because I wanted to be with you so I got myself out. Let's "
"go. It's time to collect a debt!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 그가 이 말을 기대했던 것처럼 잔인하게 웃습니다.{/n} \"오. 그래! 나는 {g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}"
"에게 맹세했어! 너와 나는 힘이 있다. {name}. 어쩌면 나는 너와 함께하고 싶어서 빠져나와 살은 거일지도 몰라. 가자. 빚을 갚을 "
"시간이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0058_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "5ce7ec9b-2911-43b3-b25c-fd36ea02fa51"
msgid ""
"\"That's not very comforting. But I know what is — the taste of the enemies' "
"blood!\" {n}Regongar's eyes flare.{/n} \"What kind of friend would I be, if "
"I died and left you in trouble? Hell no. They can burn me or tear me to "
"pieces, but I'm with you until the end. Let's go. Let's cover this sorcerous "
"hellhole with corpses. For Octavia and for our future!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 위안이 되지 않는군. 하지만 내가 하나 아는건, 적의 피가 맛있다는 거지!\" {n}레곤가르의 눈은 번쩍입니다.{/n} \"내가 "
"죽어 너를 곤경에 빠뜨리면, 나는 어떤 종류의 친구가 되는 거지? 지옥은 나를 태워 버릴 수도 있고 나를 조각 낼 수도있다. 그러나 나는 "
"끝까지 너와 함께 한다. 가자. 이 마법의 불구덩이를 적들의 시체로 메우자. 옥타비아와 우리의 미래를 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "9e3051a2-407c-46f7-af5e-46a451a14333"
msgid "\"Believe it or not, we are too! Although we almost died, ha ha.\""
msgstr "\"믿거나 말거나, 우리도 마찬가지야! 거의 죽을 뻔 했지만. 하하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "6ce4f495-dadc-489d-a1b8-ab84405b27bf"
msgid "\"We're ready!\""
msgstr "\"우린 준비됐어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "572d3c78-eaab-47a9-87c6-ea444e5cbc1b"
msgid "\"Big time. After a scrap like that, the sky's the limit. Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"정말 대단했어. 그런 싸움을 겪으니 무엇이든 할 수 있을 거 같군. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/CutsceneBarks/1OctRegTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "b39c1d17-d61b-40a5-93ad-e3077e745634"
msgid "\"Why not add some fire?\""
msgstr "\"왜 불을 더 지르지 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/CutsceneBarks/2OctRegTOS_1Oct_String
msgctxt "dee40926-bfc2-4133-8351-e6717e355f8c"
msgid "\"Maestro Janush?!\""
msgstr "\"마에스트로 자누시?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/CutsceneBarks/3OctRegTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "3588fd2b-4af6-471b-bb06-f9ef22932d31"
msgid "\"I'm here, my darling, to teach you another lesson.\""
msgstr "\"나 왔어, 자기. 너에게 또 다른 교훈을 가르치러 왔지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/CutsceneBarks/3OctRegTOS_2Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "9fb2d16c-2bb9-49dd-9b21-7b6e1b5a32d4"
msgid "\"To stop being a slave, it's not enough to escape from slavery.\""
msgstr "\"노예가 되는 것을 그만두려면, 노예 주인으로부터 도망치는 것만으로는 충분하지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/CutsceneBarks/4OctRegTOS_1Reg_String
msgctxt "d422d761-6a9a-435f-875f-7ecf81d7a41b"
msgid "\"Enough flapping your jaw, Janush! Get to business!\""
msgstr "\"지껄이는 것은 충분하다. 자누시! 본론으로 들어가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/CutsceneBarks/5OctRegTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "573785ca-a6be-451d-b376-535c8191f84a"
msgid "\"Do you see this key? It's the only way to open your cages.\""
msgstr "\"이 열쇠가 보이나? 케이지를 여는 유일한 방법이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/CutsceneBarks/5OctRegTOS_2Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "da91c180-215c-4260-bccd-91e999aa2e55"
msgid ""
"\"But there's a problem: after it opens one lock, it breaks. Only one of you "
"can get out. Just one!\""
msgstr "\"하지만 문제가 있다. 하나의 자물쇠를 열면 열쇠는 고장이 난다. 한 명만 빠져나올 수있다. 단 한 명 만!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/OctaviaRegongarTOS/CutsceneBarks/5OctRegTOS_3Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "3d359097-0b0b-4888-8937-7944c1d55fc8"
msgid ""
"\"So you'll have to decide, my darlings. To kill the slave in you, you'll "
"have to kill. — Begin!\""
msgstr "\"그래서 결정해야 할거야. 네 안에 있는 노예를 죽이려면 누군가를 죽여야 해. 시작해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "23ad0b6a-213d-4dcf-bdd4-3d3c203885e5"
msgid "\"Nyrissa seemed very eager for you to serve her...\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 네가 그녀를 섬기길 아주 열망하는 것 같았다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "17b6cd53-dcb5-432c-9a56-4b82d9944246"
msgid "\"Are you ready to keep going?\""
msgstr "\"계속 갈 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "e898aba1-9615-4825-8177-2550abc6c3f5"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks coldly at her monstrous counterpart, lying defeated.{/n} "
"\"This is what 'perfection' is worth.\""
msgstr "{n}발레리는 괴물같은 상대가 패배하여 누워있는 모습을 냉담하게 바라보았습니다.{/n} \" '완벽'이 가치있는 이유이지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "2d62ddf4-f0f1-4ed4-b398-99e7f768ec03"
msgid ""
"\"Her desires were vain and her judgment was wrong. I might not always agree "
"with your decisions, {name}. But having once selected a leader, I will never "
"betray or backstab {mf|him|her}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀의 욕망은 헛되었고 그녀의 판단은 틀렸다. 나는 항상 너의 결정에 동의하지 않을지도 모른다. {name}. 그러나 한 번 지도자를 "
"선택한 이후로 나는 결코 {mf|그|그녀}를 배반하거나 뒤로 물러서지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "3623a913-3bc4-4540-9241-f886bc24a882"
msgid ""
"\"Her desires were vain and her judgment was wrong. Know that I consider it "
"an honor to serve you, and I won't back down, even in the face of death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀의 욕망은 헛되었고 그녀의 판단은 틀렸어. 너를 위해 봉사하는 것이 나의 영광이라고 생각한다. 나는 죽음 앞에서도 물러서지 않을 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Valerie_Companion
msgctxt "40580176-ed8c-416b-a067-8c0716f2e833"
msgid "\"Always.\" {n}Valerie salutes curtly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"항상.\" {n}발레리는 간결하게 경의를 표합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "8c148fed-38dc-4b72-871a-73470450bdec"
msgid ""
"\"Her lies could never reach my heart. You must know this better than anyone."
"\" {n}Valerie smiles faintly.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그녀의 거짓말은 결코 내 마음에 닿을 수 없다. 나는 누구보다 마음이 강하다.\" {n}발레리는 희미하게 웃습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/1ValerieTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "c4d15702-ceaf-4f4e-b216-c84256af129f"
msgid "\"I welcome you to the House at the Edge of Time, my darling one.\""
msgstr "\"시간의 끝에 선 집에 온 것을 환영한다. 내 사랑스러운 것아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/1ValerieTOS_1Valerie_String
msgctxt "c3ca2040-da55-467f-b133-fa4ac4e1a706"
msgid ""
"\"No need for two-faced hospitality. Toxic intent is no less poisonous when "
"phrased politely.\""
msgstr "\"대면은 필요 없다. 정중하게 표현할 때조차 사악한 의도는 해롭다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/3ValerieTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "7774748c-6ba1-47b5-8719-5bcc2d4de350"
msgid ""
"\"And yet I welcome you, and would see you among my assistants. Oh, but why "
"use words if I can show you...\""
msgstr "\"그럼에도 불구하고 나는 너를 환영한다. 내 조수들에게 둘러싸인 너를 보고 싶군. 오. 너에게 보여줄 것이 있는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/3ValerieTOS_2Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "222004f1-b46f-4de7-a6fa-3fd4443ce549"
msgid ""
"\"Your fate was decided before you were born, yet you chose to go your own "
"way — as I once did. And you can achieve so much more!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 태어나기 전에 네 운명은 결정되었지만, 너의 길은 네가 선택하는 것이다 — 내가 그랬듯이. 그리고 너는 훨씬 더 많이 성취할 수 "
"있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/3ValerieTOS_3Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "4158aa47-2465-4040-bd33-13220eb20be4"
msgid ""
"\"Look, as if you're looking in a mirror. This is what I can make of you. A "
"perfect face. A perfect spirit. A perfect warrior.\""
msgstr "\"거울을 보고 있는 것처럼 보아라. 너를 그렇게 만들 수 있다. 완벽한 얼굴, 완전한 정신, 완벽한 전사.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/4ValerieTOS_1Valerie_String
msgctxt "0a83fd14-564c-4a5a-8822-51125f3232e4"
msgid ""
"\"I know how much power you have, Lady Nyrissa. But do not seek my aid in "
"your war on the Stolen Lands.\""
msgstr "\"네가 가진 힘이 얼마나 되는지 알고 있다. 나이리사. 하지만 도둑맞은 땅에서 전쟁을 치를 때 나의 원조를 찾지 말아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/4ValerieTOS_2Valerie_String
msgctxt "7f769346-c8eb-4e95-98b3-1c94ddb7e630"
msgid "\"What perfect spirit would entertain betrayal?\""
msgstr "\"어떤 완벽한 자가 배신을 즐기지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/4ValerieTOS_3Valerie_String
msgctxt "6fb990bd-23c0-4f68-9473-77663147136f"
msgid ""
"\"I serve the {mf|King|Queen}. There is no price that could buy my loyalty!\""
msgstr "\"나는 {mf|왕|여왕}을 섬긴다. 내 충성심을 살 수있는 가격은 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/TestsOfLoyalty/ValerieTOS/CutsceneBarks/5ValerieTOS_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "d1f5da16-978a-47bf-a220-fd9d07c88559"
msgid ""
"\"Then you'll vanish. Even the most beautiful flowers die. Such is life.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 사라져라. 가장 아름다운 꽃조차도 죽는다. 삶이란 그런 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "45f25688-a1a8-4af1-a481-ed92c2d82009"
msgid "\"What manner of creature are you?\""
msgstr "\"도대체 너의 정체는 무엇이냐?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "3d04c822-9f65-4360-8f0d-0dac85de8bdb"
msgid "\"I need the keys to the Shrine. I know you have one of them.\""
msgstr "\"나는 성소의 열쇠가 필요하다. 네가 그 중 하나를 가지고 있다는 것을 안다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "1befff6f-77e7-41a0-9195-4fc580790662"
msgid ""
"\"I need the keys to the Shrine. The Knurly Witch offered me hers in return "
"for your head. I want to hear what you have to say.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 성소의 열쇠가 필요하다. 옹이 마녀는 네 목을 가지고 오면 자기 열쇠를 주겠다고 했지. 네가 어떤 얘기를 할지 궁금하군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "07749995-8db6-4bff-a55c-02e4e9a57bdd"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm afraid I'm not in the mood for talking. Die!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 이야기할 기분이 아니다. 죽어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "cb8b84a5-8d87-4d0f-ad72-842d62dad625"
msgid "\"I should probably go.\""
msgstr "\"아마도 가야겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "b4bdc274-2980-4dda-825d-dccbb75eb6cf"
msgid "\"I want to ask you about the Knurly Witch and the First Crown.\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관과 옹이 마녀에 관해 묻고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "2931ab48-98f6-4397-a3bc-5831aad76208"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa murdered you and now uses you as a servant. Look at this shard. It "
"will show you everything — your past, your death, and your rebirth.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사가 너를 살해하고 이제는 하인으로 이용한다. 이 파편을 보아라. 너의 과거와 죽음, 재탄생... 모든 것을 보여줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "f92f4fcb-e6a2-4fd6-ac26-4eb234e24842"
msgid "\"The Knurly Witch is dead.\""
msgstr "\"옹이 마녀는 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "27657ad7-9e4f-47b7-b55e-c1138f730812"
msgid ""
"\"She's still alive. Allow me to ask you about something else first...\""
msgstr "\"그녀는 아직 살아 있다. 먼저 다른 것에 대해 물어 보겠다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "9ce40ee9-6d38-4744-afb9-300f58c19f7b"
msgid "[Attack] \"I thought about it and decided to finish you!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 생각해 보았고 너를 끝내기로 결정했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0024_Text
msgctxt "2f1698e0-415f-4861-9752-dbafd6dc9315"
msgid "\"Are you always so calm when you meet those attacking the House?\""
msgstr "\"집을 공격하는 자들을 만날 때조차 평온한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "d7fba546-2971-4f56-8acc-3df0ca021307"
msgid "\"Fine. I'll kill the Knurly Witch for you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 너를 위해서 옹이 마녀를 죽일거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "85472e5f-a20b-4011-b8c1-a9bda27ec70b"
msgid "\"I will think about your proposal.\""
msgstr "\"나는 제안에 대해 생각해 볼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "9098c6a3-f1d1-4896-b15e-a2631e1005e7"
msgid "[Attack] \"I think I'd rather kill you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"차라리 널 죽일 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "b1f83b3f-ddc9-45a4-8959-7d4db6cc858b"
msgid "\"Why did you need the First Crown?\""
msgstr "\"첫 번째 왕관이 왜 필요하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "290cede8-21db-4d02-90cc-4ae1d8ddd2fd"
msgid "\"Why are you enemies with the Knurly Witch?\""
msgstr "\"왜 너희들은 옹이 마녀와 함께 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "e22719dd-6897-4686-9276-5755705ac62b"
msgid "\"I have no more questions about this.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이것에 대해 더 이상 질문하지 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "e59018eb-3608-4d00-b8cd-40f3d5e0c79d"
msgid "\"What if I give you the Crown?\""
msgstr "\"내가 너에게 왕관을 준다면?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Answer_0043_Text
msgctxt "0e9846a4-06a7-4347-b734-62c81be23387"
msgid "\"Where can I find the Knurly Witch?\""
msgstr "\"어디에서 옹이 마녀를 찾을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "37c5e02f-3545-4c51-8455-ee177fbda3ac"
msgid ""
"{n}Hundreds of worms make up the body of this foulsome creature, swarming "
"and wriggling restlessly. But the creature doesn't seem alarmed — it turns "
"to you and nods. It seems a gesture of politeness only. — The worms have no "
"eyes, and their common 'body' no true head, only a simulacrum of the form "
"that came before.{/n} \"Hello, guest,\" {n}says the bodiless voice.{/n} "
"\"What do you need from {d|Wriggling}the Wriggling Man{/d}?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}수백 개의 벌레가 모여 이 끔찍한 생물의 몸을 형성했고, 끊임없이 무리짓고 꿈틀거립니다. 그러나 그 생물은 놀란 것 같지 않습니다. "
"그것은 당신을 향해 몸을 돌리고 끄덕입니다. 그것은 공손함의 제스처처럼 보입니다. 벌레에는 눈이 없고 그들의 '몸'은 진짜 머리가 아니며 "
"이전의 형태를 흉내낸 것 뿐입니다.{/n} \"안녕하신가, 손님.\" {n}신체가 없는 목소리가 말합니다.{/n} \"너는 "
"{d|Wriggling}꿈틀거리는 남자{/d}에게 무엇을 원하느냐? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "75b6780e-a23d-4644-ad61-ea2439891af0"
msgid ""
"\"What about our... wish, guest? Does the Knurly Witch still plague the "
"Thousandbreaths with her presence?\""
msgstr "\"우리의... 소원은 어떤가? 옹이 마녀는 여전히 그녀의 존재로 천 개의 숨결을 더럽히고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "db47ea7a-6b5d-4237-b68c-f81daa4f4874"
msgid ""
"{n}The Wriggling Man seems to barely notice you. The worms are wriggling, "
"busy in their communion.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}꿈틀거리는 남자는 간신히 당신을 알아차린 것 같습니다. 벌레들은 뒤틀리며 서로 교감하느라 바쁩니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "129d73f9-16f6-4a70-9cd9-7ed24f8da2d9"
msgid ""
"{n}The worms on the creature's face lazily ball up and untwine again.{/n} "
"\"Ask if you wish. But don't expect us to spend much time on you and your "
"curiosity.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}생물체의 얼굴을 이루는 벌레는 느리게 꼬이더니 다시 풀립니다.{/n} \"원한다면 물어봐라. 그러나 우리가 너의 호기심에 많은 "
"시간을 할애할 것이라고 기대하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "9b752e24-2051-45ed-9026-c196426226be"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, you seem surprised, guest. What disturbs you? Maybe it's our hair, or "
"our accent?\" {n}You hear laughter in the faint voice of the Wriggling Man — "
"or a hundred voices sounding as one.{/n} \"We are a thousand reflections in "
"a thousand shards of a mirror. We were once one creature, a man. Few "
"memories are left from our past life, but we know this person died... and "
"didn't want to accept it. His soul clung to his flesh, even as it fell to "
"rot, and corpse worms devouring the body. And thus we came to be.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 놀란 것 같군, 손님. 무엇이 신경쓰이는가? 우리의 머리카락인가? 아니면 억양?\" {n}당신은 꿈틀거리는 남자의 희미한 웃음 "
"소리를 듣습니다 — 아니면 백 가지 목소리가 하나처럼 들렸을지도 모릅니다.{/n} \"우리는 천 개의 거울 조각에서 천 번 반사되었다. "
"한때 우리는 하나의 남자 인간이었다. 과거의 삶에 대한 몇 가지 추억이 남아 있지만, 우리는 이 사람이 죽었다는 것을 알고 있고 "
"받아들였다. 그의 넋은 썩기 시작한 그의 살덩이에 달라붙었고, 그러하여 시체 벌레가 시체를 먹게 되었다. 그렇게 우리가 탄생하였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "fdeb60a3-b4fd-4022-8cf4-1358efc9e9d9"
msgid ""
"\"What are you hoping to do in the Shrine, foolish creature? Never mind, it "
"matters not. Nyrissa will reduce you to dust the instant you set foot "
"through the door. Should we waste our time talking to a dead {mf|man|woman}?"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"어리석은 생명체여, 이 성소에서 무엇을 바라는가? 신경 쓰지 마라, 중요하지 않으니. 나이리사는 네가 문을 열고 들어서는 순간 너를 "
"먼지로 만들 것이다. 우리가 죽은 사람과 이야기하는데 시간을 낭비해야겠는가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "baadd3ee-ed95-41c6-8450-103d9b823579"
msgid ""
"\"Bold honesty. You are intruding in the dominion of Lady Nyrissa, and "
"making deals with our enemy, the Knurly Witch. What do you expect us to say? "
"'Prepare to become food for worms!'\""
msgstr ""
"\"대담하고 정직하구나. 너는 나이리사의 영역을 침범했고, 우리의 적 옹이 마녀와 거래했다. 우리에게서 무슨 말을을 기대하는 건가? "
"'벌레의 음식이 될 준비나 하라!'\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "6cae521c-02b2-42ba-8210-16c9c79f8dc2"
msgid ""
"{n}The Wriggling man replies with a hundred-voice sigh, full of unconcealed "
"irritation.{/n} \"Do we really have to spend time on this? Well, some new "
"worm food won't hurt...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}꿈틀거리는 남자는 백 개의 목소리로 노골적인 짜증이 가득한 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"우리가 정말로 이것에 시간을 할애해야하는 "
"건가? 뭐. 새로운 벌레 먹이가 상하진 않을테니...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "9b5cbf29-8a47-4683-9614-f79e7d92b3d4"
msgid ""
"\"Be careful on the roads of {g|First World}the First World{/g}, guest. You "
"never know where they might take you.\""
msgstr "\"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 길을 조심해라, 손님. 어디에서 그들이 너를 잡아갈지 모른다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "83f4cd2d-554f-45d5-bde1-dd8dc59729e8"
msgid ""
"\"What an incredible pleasure it is to hear this. You deserve our respect, "
"guest. For this we shall give you a quick and painless death. Nyrissa shall "
"know that I am her most worthy servant and protector!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 말을 듣게 되어 대단히 즐겁군. 너는 우리의 존경심을 받을 자격이 있다. 그러니 우리는 너에게 빠르고 고통없는 죽음을 줄 것이다. "
"나이리사는 내가 가장 가치있는 하인이자 보호자라는 것을 알 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "ab6afd26-92fa-4dea-9549-2ec3eb9c4dbe"
msgid ""
"\"You are trying our patience. We hope at least you're not doing so out of "
"idleness.\""
msgstr "\"너는 우리의 인내심을 시험하고 있다. 적어도 심심해서였다고 하지는 않기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "a0366d84-0546-4d42-be23-7383c6ca15c4"
msgid ""
"{n}A wave passes through the creature's body. The worms arch and twist. It "
"seems this is how the Wriggling Man laughs.{/n} \"When we decide that it's "
"time to kill you, then we will certainly do it. And whether that happens "
"now, in half an hour or in ten years — what's the difference?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}파동이 생물의 몸을 통과합니다. 벌레는 몸을 구부리고 꼬입니다. 이것이 꿈틀거리는 남자가 웃는 방법인 것 같습니다.{/n} \"우리가"
" 너를 죽일 시간이라고 결정하면, 그 때 확실히 너를 죽일 것이다. 그리고 그것이 30분 뒤에 일어나든 10년 뒤에 일어나든, 무슨 "
"차이가 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "ed0fe921-8082-4459-8f3e-d67d05c81b07"
msgid ""
"\"But we like using opportunities. What about an offer? Kill the Knurly "
"Witch, take her key — and you'll get ours. Since you are so eager to rush "
"towards your own death, we won't stop you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 우리는 기회를 이용하고 싶다. 제안은 어떤가? 옹이 마녀를 죽이고 열쇠를 취해라. 그러면 너는 우리 열쇠를 얻을 것이다. 네가 "
"죽음을 향해 서두르니, 우리가 막지는 않겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "8f694da3-d191-4bdc-99ca-827d37f5064c"
msgid "\"Then go and come back. We will wait for you here.\""
msgstr "\"그러면 가라. 너를 기다릴 거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "575d99d0-5fae-45de-a63d-f1dbe783b7d0"
msgid ""
"\"Time flies quickly, guest. Think while you can. Act when you're ready.\""
msgstr "\"시간이 빨리 지나간다. 할 수 있는 동안 생각하라. 준비가 되면 행동하라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "3605eb4e-8de5-46e4-9225-285a2e71b074"
msgid ""
"\"It means nothing by itself. We would like to take it from the corpse of "
"the disgusting witch, or receive it from the gracious hands of Lady Nyrissa."
"\""
msgstr "\"그 자체로는 의미가 없다. 우리는 역겨운 마녀의 시체에서 그것을 뺏어오거나, 나이리사의 은혜로운 손에서 받고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "f0caefda-8c2c-42c7-9a6f-dde98ce89614"
msgid ""
"\"This feud is older than you can imagine. The Knurly Witch has always "
"feared that we would take Lady Nyrissa's affection away from her. She envied "
"us, tried to besmirch us, set traps — until our patience ran out.\" {n}The "
"faint voice stops for a while — and continues with a strange ringing "
"tone.{/n} \"And how can you not hate such a creature? Just the appearance of "
"the witch has always made us very angry, deep inside.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 불화는 네가 상상할 수 있는 것보다 오래되었다. 옹이 마녀는 항상 나이리사의 애정을 우리가 빼앗을까봐 두려워했다. 그녀는 우리를 "
"부러워했고, 우리를 모함했고, 함정을 팠다 — 우리의 인내심이 끝날 때까지. {n}희미한 음성은 잠시 멈췄습니다 — 그리고는 이상하게 "
"울리는 소리로 계속 말합니다.{/n} \"그런 피조물을 어떻게 싫어하지 않을 수 있겠는가? 마녀는 그 외모만으로도 항상 우리를 화나게 "
"만든다, 진심으로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "cf28bf08-fbe8-46f6-838e-fdda8dbaf993"
msgid ""
"\"It's a gift with which Lady Nyrissa marked the Knurly Witch as one of her "
"most worthy servants. This was before our arrival at the House at the Edge "
"of Time. The witch has had her day. We want her death, and we want "
"recognition!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사 아가씨가 옹이 마녀를 가장 가치있는 하인 중 한 명으로 표시한 선물이다. 이것은 우리가 시간의 끝에 선 집에 도착하기 전의 "
"일이었다. 마녀는 이제 은퇴할 시기가 되었지. 우리는 그녀의 죽음을 원하고, 또한 우리는 인정받기를 원한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "c80e8cac-e421-4efe-b1fe-d505e15a14f1"
msgid "\"It's good that you know when to stop. So many don't...\""
msgstr "\"멈추어야 할 때를 아는 것은 좋다. 많은 자들이 그 때를 모르지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "6ce5d8d1-e8af-4839-8f4f-648fdb8d8d78"
msgid ""
"\"What? What do you {d|c61 Mirrors}mean{/d}?\" {n}You feel a strange tension "
"in the Wriggling Man's thousand-voice question. The hand of the macabre "
"creature takes the shard from you. Images flash across the smooth surface of "
"the mirror: a wounded wizard fights at the doorway of the House at the Edge "
"of Time; the wounded wizard confronts Nyrissa, and dies; worms eat the body "
"in the Knurly Witch's pantry. Finally, Nyrissa looks at the newly created "
"worm body and orders the Witch to destroy the wizard's memory of the "
"event.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"뭐? 무슨 {d|c61 Mirrors}말이지{/d}? \" {n}천 개의 목소리로 들리는 꿈틀거리는 남자의 질문에는 이상한 긴장감이 "
"베어있습니다. 끔찍한 생물의 손이 당신에게서 파편을 가져옵니다. 이미지는 거울의 매끄러운 표면을 가로 지르며 번쩍입니다. 상처 입은 "
"마법사가 시간의 끝에 선 집 출입구에서 싸웁니다. 부상당한 마법사는 나이리사와 대결하고 죽습니다. 벌레가 옹이 마녀의 식품 저장고에서 "
"시체를 먹습니다. 마지막으로 나이리사는 새로 만들어진 시체 벌레로 이뤄진 몸을 보고 마녀에게 마법사의 기억을 파괴하라고 명령합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0044_Text
msgctxt "d0bad569-c65f-446b-9b81-352d0eea0baf"
msgid ""
"\"She is hiding in the underground part of the House. In one of the "
"dimensions. You do know we live in two realities here, right? Of course you "
"do — otherwise you wouldn't be here.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀는 집의 지하에 숨어있다. 차원 중 하나에서 말이다. 우리는 여기서 두 가지 현실에서 살아가고 있다는 것을 알고 있겠지? 물론 "
"알고 있겠지 — 그렇지 않으면 너는 여기에 없었을 테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "e0ef0842-eefc-4a90-a944-8d80010f9a16"
msgid ""
"{n}Finally the mirror stops showing pictures from the past, and all that "
"remains is a regular reflection of the Wriggling Man's cruel face — a ball "
"of twitching worms under the shadow of a black hood. The creature's hand "
"starts to tremble.{/n} \"Blinded, fooled... I... we... what happened to me? "
"How did we... I... we... all of us... could let her make a toy out of us?! "
"What have you done, guest. So much pain and anger, we can't hold it back!\" "
"{n}The Wriggling Man shudders — and the next moment falls to pieces. The "
"worms quickly crawl away, and only his black cloak remains lying on the "
"floor.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마침내 거울은 과거의 그림을 보여주는 것을 멈추었고 보이는 것은 꿈틀거리는 남자의 끔찍한 얼굴뿐입니다 — 검은 후드의 그림자 "
"아래에서 벌레가 꼬여 두상을 이룬 모습 말입니다. 생물의 손이 떨리기 시작합니다.{/n} \"눈이 멀고, 바보가 되어서... 나는... "
"우리는... 나에게 무슨 일이 일어났지? 우리는 어떻게... 나... 우리... 우리 모두... 그녀가 우리를 가지고 놀았던 건가?! "
"손님이여, 무슨 짓을 한 거냐. 너무 많은 고통과 분노 때문에, 우리는 더 이상 참을 수 없다!\" {n}꿈틀거리는 남자가 부르르 "
"떨었습니다 — 그리고 다음 순간 조각나서 떨어집니다. 벌레들은 빠르게 기어나갔고, 그의 검은 망토만이 바닥에 남아있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : Harrim_Companion
msgctxt "76bdc28e-68bb-4235-a7bb-c8d5cb693197"
msgid ""
"\"You must be so unhappy. A thousand souls, all communally dragging out a "
"pointless existence, instead of just one...\""
msgstr "\"불행했을테지. 천 개의 영혼이, 공동체가 하나의 존재가 아닌 무의미한 존재를 이끌어 냈다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c61/HouseAtTheEdgeOfTime/WrigglingMan_HATEOT/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "7e0962ac-9a46-4aab-a693-9fcf32b0d10e"
msgid ""
"\"Ugh! How do you even beat that heap up if you need to? They're, you "
"know... crawling away!\""
msgstr "\"윽! 어떻게 그렇게 쌓여있는 것을 때릴 생각을 했지? 저것들은... 말 그대로 기어다니는데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Answer_0007_Text_String
msgctxt "eb8b6874-9359-4657-b342-1c58269687f7"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Answer_0008_Text_String
msgctxt "758a0b2e-91a6-4e11-9639-921186f907d0"
msgid ""
"\"I am preparing for the war and gathering my allies in the capital. Can you "
"get yourself there?\""
msgstr "\"나는 전쟁 준비를 하고 수도에서 나의 동맹을 모으고 있다. 거기에 갈 수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Answer_0009_Text_String
msgctxt "321c65a5-7fec-419a-9ad3-75905de65fda"
msgid "\"We will meet in the capital!\""
msgstr "\"우린 수도에서 만날 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Armag_FW
msgctxt "894506e5-b2a4-4f2e-aec3-56667a14075f"
msgid ""
"{n}Armag is wandering through the mist, scanning the area in search of a "
"threat.{/n} \"Who? Who is here? Show yourself! Friend or foe? If foe — let's "
"fight! If friend — let's talk!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아르막은 안개 속을 헤매고 위험한 것이 없나 그 지역을 수색합니다.{/n} \"누구냐? 누가 있지? 너 자신을 보여라! 친구 또는 "
"적인가? 적이라면 싸우자! 친구라면 얘기하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "cbd62e0f-dd07-4bf3-8d3e-aa5c77589d41"
msgid ""
"{n}Dugath is wandering through the mist, looking around carefully. Seeing "
"you, he hides his weapon and gives you a broad smile.{/n} \"{Name}! You were "
"the one holding the magic lantern that led us from the mist! For some reason "
"I knew it was you. — At least I hoped!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}두가스는 안개를 돌아다니며 조심스럽게 주변을 둘러보고 있습니다. 당신을 보자 그는 무기를 숨기고 넓은 웃음을 짓습니다.{/n} "
"\"{Name}! 너는 마법 등불을 들고 우리를 안개에서 이끌었다! 웬일인지 너라는 것을 알고 있었다. 적어도 희망했지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "b91e67c5-58a9-48ab-81d0-a571d4042b0c"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Brother|Sister}! Praise {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}! It was you who held the "
"guiding light that led Armag from the mist!\""
msgstr ""
"\" {mf|Brother|Sister}! {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이시여 감사합니다! 안내의 빛을 들고 아르막을 안개에서 이끌어 "
"냈구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "2598c79f-a3a3-42a2-835b-12dbde94332c"
msgid ""
"\"{Name}! Praise {g|Gorum}Gorum{/g}! It was you who held the guiding light "
"that led Armag from the mist!\""
msgstr "\" {Name}! {g|Gorum}고룸{/g}이시여 감사합니다! 안내의 빛을 들고 아르막을 안개에서 이끌어 냈구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "9bbeb6bc-330a-405b-96f8-b47ce531b8ac"
msgid ""
"\"Armag found out about the disaster in your kingdom, and set off {d|c41 "
"Chief Armag}to the rescue{/d} immediately. The party was lost in the "
"sorcerous mist. Neither prayers nor curses helped. Evil spirits attacked "
"from the darkness. But Armag saw the light and went towards it. The light of "
"the lantern you are carrying.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아르막은 너의 왕국에 일어난 재앙에 대해 알아냈고 즉시 {d|c41 Chief Armag} 구조대를 {/d} 보냈다. 일행은 암울한 "
"안개 속에서 길을 잃었다. 기도도 저주도 도움이 되지 않았다. 악령이 어둠에서 공격했다. 그러나 아르막은 빛을 보고 그것으로 갔다. 네가 "
"들고 있는 등불의 빛이었지. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "50ab9ba8-5cd8-4e43-9e63-568381fe5ee2"
msgid ""
"\"Armag will not let the magic lantern out of sight. Armag will follow the "
"light, and we will be in the capital soon!\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 마법 랜턴을 보이지 않게 할 것이다. 아르막은 빛을 따라갈 것이고 우리는 곧 수도에 닿게 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "ca160856-b7b6-452f-91c7-c80ab68fe2ed"
msgid "\"Let's fight! And win!\""
msgstr "\"싸워 이기자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "c2aa4959-8ec8-4373-8a76-d936d548c672"
msgid ""
"\"I'm coming to your rescue, of course. {g|Tiger Lords}The Tiger Lords{/g} "
"don't abandon their {d|c41 Chief Ashman}friends{/d} in danger... And I see "
"your trouble is serious. We went to your capital, but got lost in this damn "
"mist, and then we had to fight the phantoms. But when the light of your "
"lantern glimmered through the darkness, I knew we were going to make it out."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너를 구출하러 왔다. {g|Tiger Lords}호랑이 군주{/g}는 위험에 빠진 {d|c41 Chief Ashman}친구"
"{/d}를 버리지 않는다... 그리고 네 문제가 심각하다는 걸 알았다. 우리는 너의 수도에 갔지만이 안개 속에서 길을 잃었다. 그리고 "
"나서 우리는 유령과 싸워야 했다. 그러나 너의 랜턴 빛이 어둠을 비추었을 때 나는 우리가 해낼 것이라는 것을 알고 있었다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "498ca7d5-c8a0-40ef-bbd2-9de658ed39ea"
msgid "\"While you have the lantern — of course. Go, we will follow.\""
msgstr "\"네가 랜턴을 가지고 있는 동안에 우리는 따라갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/ArmagDugathFinal/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "fa57c0c7-e563-4e96-bc2c-f1b41db0d813"
msgid ""
"\"And defend it to the last! We never fought such a strange war until now... "
"But we will not surrender without a fight!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 마지막까지 그것을 지켜라! 우리는 지금까지 그런 이상한 전쟁을 한 번도 치르지 않았다... 그러나 우리는 싸움 없이 항복하지 "
"않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "891915d1-9a1f-4e99-91eb-f338626bd756"
msgid "\"Will you help me in this crisis?\""
msgstr "\"이 위기에서 벗어나게 나를 도울 수 있겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "666c317c-210a-45dd-8484-287af1fd46b0"
msgid "\"Farewell.\""
msgstr "\"안녕히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Answer_0021_Text_String
msgctxt "ed41c732-cf8e-4e0b-b112-bdbc0dde0460"
msgid "\"How did you get here?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Answer_0022_Text_String
msgctxt "56190f3e-a443-46ca-897f-8c5357f73ff7"
msgid "\"I'm gathering my allies at the capital. Can you find the way there?\""
msgstr "\"나는 수도에서 나의 동맹국을 모으고 있다. 수도로 가는 길을 찾아줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Answer_0023_Text_String
msgctxt "19cc3693-209d-4556-af34-7c94ef7bbc52"
msgid "\"We will meet at the capital!\""
msgstr "\"우린 수도에서 만날 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Answer_0042_Text_String
msgctxt "66c92c5c-6b31-456d-bb0c-dd13d5b5c5fc"
msgid "\"What's going on?\""
msgstr "\"무슨 일이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "4d3f89e6-90fb-45cb-b330-a7ff03161179"
msgid ""
"\"There you are! And as always, exactly when you are most needed. Not a "
"minute early, not a minute late!\""
msgstr "\"찾았다! 그리고 항상 그렇듯이 가장 필요할 때 정확하게 오는군. 늦지도 이르지도 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "2d8d169b-374e-40d7-9731-14a2bbe57f40"
msgid ""
"\"It's not the first time you've saved my life! — As {g|Abadar}Abadar{/g} is "
"my witness, I'm even happier to see you now than on the day of the battle "
"with Armag! I've fought people and monsters alike, but none of us were ready "
"for an endless horde of phantoms.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 내 목숨을 구한 것은 처음이 아니다! {g|Abadar}아바다르{/g}가 내 증인이야. 아르막과의 전투를 치르던 날보다 너를 "
"지금 보니 더 행복해! 나는 사람이나 괴물과 싸웠지만 우리 중 누구도 수많은 팬텀과 싸울 준비가 되지는 않았다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0007_Text_String
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "6e79bf06-7046-4dd4-9c56-3dcec5229bf7"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for your help. I cannot lie: we desperately needed it. I've "
"fought people and monsters alike, but none of us were ready for an endless "
"horde of phantoms.\""
msgstr ""
"\"도와줘서 고맙다. 거짓말을 할 수 없어. 도움이 절실히 필요했다. 나는 사람이나 괴물과는 싸워봤지만, 우리 중 누구도 끝없는 유령 "
"군단과 싸울 준비가 되지는 않았었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "573cbadf-94cc-4aab-ad88-9632bf9bb401"
msgid ""
"\"I heard reports of strange happenings in your lands. — So strange that I "
"decided to see for myself, and offer you military {d|c41 Choose "
"Surtova}assistance{/d} if needed. And now I see it's needed indeed.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 땅에서 이상한 일들이 일어났다는 소식을 들었다. 정말 이상해서 직접 보기로 결정하고 필요하다면 너에게 {d|c41 Choose "
"Surtova}지원군{/d}을 보내려고 했다. 그리고 정말로 군대가 필요하다는 것을 알았다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "8f8036f6-ef8c-405c-bc59-23217c0b7665"
msgid ""
"\"I thought you said when we last met that you don't need any assistance? "
"No, I only came to ensure the pestilence that's befallen you is not a threat "
"to our own lands.\""
msgstr ""
"\"마지막으로 만났을 때 도움을 필요로 하지 않는다고 말한 거 같았는데? 아니. 나는 단지 너희 나라에 퍼진 전염병이 우리에게 위협이 "
"되지 않나 확인하러 왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "17a34c51-5307-4fbb-92d3-498808e0ed74"
msgid ""
"\"You've saved my life, and not for the first time. I'm sorry you rejected "
"our alliance. — I'm sure that together we would have achieved much more than "
"we could separately.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 여러 번 내 목숨을 구했군. 네가 우리 동맹을 거부한 것이 유감스럽다. 우리가 함께 할 수 있다면 혼자일 때보다 훨씬 더 많은 "
"것을 성취했을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "cc183dac-8a95-4192-af61-72c5ed6ba2f6"
msgid ""
"\"A pity that on the day we faced Armag you didn't come as quickly as today!"
"\""
msgstr "\"우리가 아르막과 마주했던 날에 오늘처럼 빨리 왔다면 좋았을 텐데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "f9ee03fb-b030-427f-b17d-619c818b78ff"
msgid ""
"\"I heard reports that something strange and frightening is happening in "
"your lands. It is my duty as an {d|c41 Choose Aldori}ally{/d} to help you, "
"so I gathered my best troops and came to your aid. Alas, we became lost in "
"that sorcerous mist, and then those shadows came out of it... I don't know "
"how long we could have held the line — but then a guiding light glimmered "
"through the mist, and soon you appeared.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 땅에서 이상하고 무서운 어떤 일이 일어나고 있다는 소식을 들었다. {d|c41 Choose Aldori}동맹국{/d}으로서 너를 "
"돕는 것이 의무였고, 최고의 군대를 모아서 도우러 왔다. 아아, 우리는 그 마법의 안개 속에서 길을 잃었다. 그리고 그 그림자가 "
"나왔다... 나는 우리가 얼마나 오래 전선을 유지할 수 있을지 몰랐어 — 그러나 안개 속에서 인도의 빛이 비쳤고, 곧 네가 나타났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "fce65989-d198-42af-b913-3c528008ad78"
msgid ""
"\"This mist obscures tracks, and bewilders the senses, but your lantern will "
"show us the way.\""
msgstr "\"이 안개가 길을 숨기고 감각을 무디게 하지만, 너의 등불은 우리에게 길을 보여줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0026_Text_String
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "1054c3d5-de4f-47f9-aa56-4121dd932cdd"
msgid ""
"\"Until then. I can't deny it, this mist had me worried, but now I see you "
"have the situation in hand. I'm sure that together we will overcome this "
"pestilence, whatever it is!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그때까지는. 나는 부인할 수 없다. 이 안개로 걱정했지만 이제는 네가 이 상황을 헤쳐나가는 것을 볼 수 있다. 나는 그것이 무엇이든 "
"간에 함께 이 역병을 극복할 것이라고 확신한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "358dde4a-e13a-40e9-ba27-00beaeaffe5d"
msgid ""
"\"It is not easy to find the way through this sorcerous mist, but with your "
"magic lantern we can do it. Go now, we will follow you.\""
msgstr "\"이 마법의 안개 속에서 길을 발견하는 것은 쉽지 않지만 마법 등불이 있다면 할 수 있다. 네가 가면 따라갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0028_Text_String
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_FW
msgctxt "9d70082c-1a71-4cfb-8bab-cafe89e30f22"
msgid ""
"\"Until then, Your Highness. I don't know what an extraordinary disaster "
"you've brought upon your kingdom, but I see now that you are entirely "
"capable of handling it. Especially with our help!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나중에 보자. 너의 왕국에 찾아온 엄청난 재난이 무엇인지 모르지만 이제는 네가 능숙하게 다룰 수 있는 능력을 보았다. 특히 우리의 "
"도움으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_FW
msgctxt "dbebab04-deec-4751-816f-18f8503ae165"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|His|Her} Highness always comes exactly when needed — not a minute "
"early, not a minute late. One could say punctuality is in {mf|his|her} blood!"
"\""
msgstr "\"너는 언제나 필요할 때 오는군. 1분 1초도 틀림 없이. 시간 엄수자의 피가 너의 몸에 흐르는 것 같다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "222d23c4-6fa1-4538-8628-f11a7a973edf"
msgid ""
"\"I heard reports that something strange and frightening is happening in "
"your lands. I gathered my best troops and came to your aid. Alas, we became "
"lost in that sorcerous mist, and then those shadows came out of it... Praise "
"the gods we stumbled upon {g|House Surtova}Surtova's{/g} army, which was "
"also coming to your aid.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 땅에서 이상하고 무서운 어떤 일이 일어나고 있다는 소식을 들었다. 나의 정예병을 모아 너를 도우러 왔다. 우리는 그 암울한 안개 "
"속에서 길을 잃었다. 그리고 그 그림자가 나왔다. {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}의 군대를 우연히 만났고, 그들도 너를 "
"도우러 왔다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0035_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "248e4e33-0f93-43ae-8d21-6caaac5db855"
msgid ""
"\"Farewell. I won't deny it, that mist worried me. But now I see that you "
"have the situation under control. I'm sure you will handle it without us, as "
"competently as you always have.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안녕히. 나는 부인할 수 없이, 이 안개를 걱정했었다. 하지만 지금 네가 이 상황을 헤쳐나가는 것을 봤다. 나는 네가 항상 그래왔듯 "
"이번 일도 완벽하게 처리할 것이라고 확신한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "0ebbed58-8cc1-44b8-81bf-31d1713d4271"
msgid ""
"\"I heard reports of something strange and frightening happening in your "
"lands. I gathered my best troops and went to the border to discover if it "
"was a {d|c41 Independence}threat to Brevoy{/d}. Alas, we became lost in that "
"sorcerous mist, and then those shadows came out of it... I don't know how "
"long we could have held the line — but then a guiding light glimmered "
"through the mist, and soon you appeared.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너희 땅에서 이상하고 무서운 어떤 일이 일어나고 있다는 소식을 들었다. 나는 정예병을 모아 그것이 {d|c41 Independence}"
"브레보이에 대한 위협{/d}이 되는지 확인하러 왔다. 아아, 우리는 그 마법의 안개 속에서 길을 잃었다. 그리고 그 그림자가 나왔다... "
"나는 우리가 얼마나 오래 전선을 유지할 수 있을지 몰랐어 — 그러나 안개 속에서 인도의 빛이 비쳤고, 곧 네가 나타났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0037_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_FW
msgctxt "76574fc3-d702-46f9-b65a-47ab8a0cbfb4"
msgid ""
"\"It is not easy to find the way through the sorcerous mist, but with your "
"magic lantern we can do it. Go, and we will follow.\""
msgstr "\"이 마법의 안개 속에서 길을 발견하는 것은 쉽지 않지만 마법 등불이 있다면 할 수 있다. 네가 가면 따라갈 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_FW
msgctxt "590b2798-9f81-42fd-a676-96611cf72ffa"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, it was an unexpected but pleasant encounter! A joy, in fact, to see "
"familiar faces here, in the midst of witchery and evil spirits!\""
msgstr "\"그렇다. 예기치 못한 즐거운 만남이었다! 사실 마녀와 사악한 악의 장난 속에서 친숙한 얼굴을 보았던 것은 기쁨이었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0040_Text
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "7ee580f5-83f9-4536-949d-e93504b10a71"
msgid ""
"\"Even {d|c41 Brevoy Neutral}combining{/d} our forces, we had little chance "
"of holding the line for long. Luckily, a guiding light soon glimmered "
"through the mist, and then you appeared.\""
msgstr ""
"\"심지어 우리의 군대를 {d|c41 Brevoy Neutral}결합해도{/d} 우리 군대는 오래 가지 못했을 가능성이 컸다. 다행히도 "
"안개 속을 안내하는 빛이 곧 비추었고 그 때 네가 나타났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0043_Text_String
#. Speaker : JamandiAldori_FW
msgctxt "53915422-a776-4768-919e-7cbcba974189"
msgid ""
"\"We were hoping you could tell us. It must be the spells of the fey — or "
"who else did you manage to enrage? This mist is no mere fog — it bewilders "
"the senses and makes you wander in circles. But phantoms are worse. They "
"appear from out of the mist, and there's no end to them. Shadows of our "
"warriors and barbarians, endlessly repeating a fearful battle, none "
"distinguishing friend and foe...\" {n}Jamandi shivers, as if icy cold wind "
"is blowing at her back.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"네가 우리에게 말해주기를 바랬다. 그것은 페이의 주문임에 틀림 없다. 그렇지 않으면 네가 화를 돋군 자가 누구겠나? 이 안개는 단순한 "
"안개가 아니다. 그것은 감각을 어지럽히고 같은 장소를 방황하게 만든다. 그러나 유령은 더 끔찍하다. 그들은 안개 속에서 나타나고 끝이 "
"없다. 전사들과 야만인들의 그림자들이 끝없이 무서운 전투를 반복하며 친구와 적을 구분하지 않는다...\" {n}자만디는 마치 얼음처럼 "
"차가운 바람이 그녀 뒤에서 불고 있는 것처럼 몸을 떱니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "26519219-5a2c-41b4-bf58-7b361b68b7c7"
msgid ""
"\"Really? So you don't know what's going on in your lands? Well then let me "
"inform you. I don't know what great power you enraged, or whether it's from "
"this world or from another one, but it is capable of creating a vexing mist "
"and obscuring all tracks. This plane is swarming with phantoms. Not the "
"ghosts of the dead, but shadows, reflections of those who fought here on "
"that memorable day. {g|Brevoy}Brevans{/g} and barbarians, walking out of the "
"mist, fighting without distinguishing friend from foe, and dissolving into "
"the mist again — endlessly.\""
msgstr ""
"\"정말인가? 너는 네 땅에서 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는지 모르는가? 그럼 알려주겠다. 네가 얼마나 큰 적을 얻었는지, 또는 그것이 이 "
"세상인지 아니면 다른 세상에서 왔는지는 모르겠지만, 이것은 성가신 안개를 만들어 모든 길을 덮어버린다. 이곳은 유령이 뒤덮었다. 죽은 "
"자의 유령도 아닌 그림자, 전투가 벌어졌던 날의 반영이다. {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 병사들과 야만인들이 안개 속에서 나와 "
"친구나 적을 구별하지 않고 싸우며 안개 속으로 다시 녹아내린다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : NatalaSurtova_FW
msgctxt "5e6a7a51-f35d-47cc-a9db-55669d0c89a0"
msgid "\"Really? So you don't know what is going on in your lands?\""
msgstr "\"정말인가? 너의 땅에서 벌어지는 일이 뭔지 모르나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/BBFW_FinalDialogue/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "993dec8f-3de4-4de1-b284-2f6373479fa7"
msgid ""
"{n}You feel some of your power return. By protecting the border region of "
"your kingdom, you weakened the curse that hangs over you and your "
"followers!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 힘이 돌아왔음을 일부 느낍니다. 당신의 왕국 경계 지역을 보호함으로써 당신과 당신의 추종자들에게 걸려있는 저주를 "
"약화시켰습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Fairies/Fairies_1_String
msgctxt "79cc61f6-720b-4856-99d8-59fe0b05ad67"
msgid ""
"\"Lately these dismal lands are much more fun! Mortals running around, "
"screaming, fussing... What's happened?\""
msgstr ""
"\"최근 이 음침한 땅은 훨씬 더 흥미로워졌어! 필멸자가 필사적으로 뛰어다니고, 소리 지르고, 소란을 피우고... 무슨 일이 벌어졌어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Fairies/Fairies_2_String
msgctxt "1a92f26f-77a0-4676-9d0d-736b2d427d2b"
msgid "\"Why, you don't know? It's the Lantern King's new joke!\""
msgstr "\"몰랐어? 등불왕의 새로운 농담이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Fairies/Fairies_3_String
msgctxt "99180fce-2095-47e8-a77a-2fa51d9480ae"
msgid "\"Seriously? Hahaha, it's so much fun!\""
msgstr "\"진심으로? 하하하. 너무 재미있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Fairies/Fairies_4_String
msgctxt "3bf86aad-2a35-4bda-9e65-6b68ee6dc751"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, he is such a joker! The locals must be thrilled that he's brightened "
"up their humdrum life!\""
msgstr "\"아. 그는 정말 재밌군! 그 주민들은 평범한 삶에서 스릴을 느끼며 살 수 있겠어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Fairies/Fairy_Idle_1_String
msgctxt "dac14b44-5766-4e15-9e32-98f26f855f35"
msgid "\"Oh, look — {race}!\""
msgstr "\"오. 봐. {race}야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Fairies/Fairy_Idle_2_String
msgctxt "9b49a0bf-3737-4d2e-9d04-df6c9b42e5c1"
msgid "\"How do you like the Lantern King's joke? Exciting, isn't it?\""
msgstr "\"등불왕의 농담의 어떤 점이 좋아? 아주 재밌지. 응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Fairies/Fairy_Idle_3_String
msgctxt "857cecca-466e-44fb-9b2a-757a10630908"
msgid "\"Have you ever met the Lantern King? They say he's so... Amazing!\""
msgstr "\"등불왕을 만난 적이 있어? 그들은 그렇게 말하지... 놀랍다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Gwart_Dead_String
msgctxt "293a68b2-7b63-40cb-9107-bdcc779cbc6f"
msgid ""
"This is Gwart, a young warlord of the Tiger Lords. It appears he was coming "
"to help you, but got lost in the mist and was killed by shadows."
msgstr ""
"호랑이 군주의 젊은 군벌 그워트입니다. 그가 당신을 도우려고 왔지만 안개 속에서 길을 잃었고, 그림자에 의해 죽임을 당했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/HelpUs_Jamandi_String
msgctxt "90be0fff-cb2b-4284-b202-ad48a9482513"
msgid "\"{Name}! You're just in time! Help us!\""
msgstr "\"{Name}! 적절한 때에 왔군! 우리를 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/HelpUs_Kassil_String
msgctxt "009fcaa0-f7e4-463c-b7b7-d9faef334b72"
msgid "\"Your Highness! I'm glad to see you again!\""
msgstr "\"너구나! 다시 보니 다행이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/HelpUs_Lander_String
msgctxt "eb9d6ca7-7c1c-4f27-95df-353a4313884f"
msgid ""
"\"What an incredibly precise and very dramatic appearance! A truly royal "
"entrance, I'd say!\""
msgstr "\"정말 놀랍도록 정확하고 극적인 모습이군! 충신의 그 모습이었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/HelpUs_Natala_String
msgctxt "d207fcd5-1f48-439f-880a-dc8863a249a7"
msgid "\"Close the ranks! Help is on the way!\""
msgstr "\"열을 좁혀라! 지원이 온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/HelpUs_Shandra_String
msgctxt "f3302cfc-f801-4968-a4c3-f867434b84ed"
msgid "\"Your Highness! Drive off these phantoms!\""
msgstr "\"왕! 이 유령들을 몰아내줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Armag_String
msgctxt "d061622d-49e1-4f22-832d-7bc6bb20f40b"
msgid "\"Evil spells again. But the pure flame of rage will disperse them!\""
msgstr "\"또 사악한 주문이군. 하지만 분노의 순수한 불꽃앞에 흩어질 뿐이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Barbarian_String
msgctxt "bb06285a-6ffb-4264-993d-7d4a17d5a701"
msgid "\"Your Highness. Tiger Lords are forever your allies.\""
msgstr "\"호랑이 군주는 영원히 너의 동맹이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_BrevoySoldier_String
msgctxt "a590f81d-382a-4956-9c83-a14577cb6f93"
msgid "\"What a creepy place!\""
msgstr "\"이 얼마나 소름 끼치는 장소인가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Dugath_String
msgctxt "08d7daf3-551d-4054-8352-b7d750609b20"
msgid "\"Gorum, don't leave us in this dark hour!\""
msgstr "\"고룸이시여, 힘든 시기에 우리를 떠나지 마십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Jamandi_String
msgctxt "c5ed2b3b-503a-4e25-81a4-29d2eb68dafc"
msgid "\"I have never defeated such enemies. Well, more is yet to come!\""
msgstr "\"결코 그런 적을 물리쳐 본 적이 없었다. 더 많은 적이 아직 오고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Kassil_Advisor_String
msgctxt "37fdbdf8-7ba8-4d7d-a3e0-be8af41fe359"
msgid "\"I set off to Brevoy to get help, and met Lady Jamandi halfway.\""
msgstr "\"나는 브레보이에게 도움을 청했고 중간에 레이디 자만디를 만났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Kassil_String
msgctxt "5f949e82-6f9f-420b-a3f6-379f888a05b6"
msgid "\"Thank the gods for letting us see each other again!\""
msgstr "\"서로를 다시 볼 수있게 해주신 신에게 감사드립니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Lander_String
msgctxt "b1343985-6007-46f8-82f6-3651c01ed1bf"
msgid "\"What if I were among these phantoms now? Ugh.\""
msgstr "\"내가이 유령들 사이에 있었다면 어땠을까? 휴.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Shandra_Advisor_String
msgctxt "c3c0eed2-9a24-46ca-bad3-7a906426b3dd"
msgid "\"I shouldn't have left the capital...\""
msgstr "\"나는 수도를 떠나면 안되었어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Shandra_String
msgctxt "db8ca577-7a56-4de2-ada0-c3146ecd251c"
msgid ""
"\"Your eyes are far more confident now than when we last met. The eyes of a "
"true {mf|king|queen}!\""
msgstr "\"우리가 마지막으로 만났을 때보다 지금 너의 눈은 훨씬 자신감이 있다. {mf|왕|여왕}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/Barks/Idle_Surtova_String
msgctxt "3f782c47-493f-4186-8e69-a2adf97524ef"
msgid ""
"\"You've brought a terrible curse upon your lands. But we will help you "
"break it.\""
msgstr "\"너는 네 땅에 끔찍한 저주를 가져왔다. 하지만 그것을 깨뜨릴 수 있도록 도와 줄 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "a668e28b-a896-4d78-8eaf-03678ba89c45"
msgid "\"Well, well, what are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"이게 누구야. 여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0b44af52-4526-4a69-90fe-feb1d0162914"
msgid ""
"\"I need all the allies I can get. Go with Brevoy's forces to the capital.\""
msgstr "\"나는 얻을 수있는 모든 동료가 필요하다. 브레보이 군대와 함께 수도로 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "18ecde6c-01ed-466a-9b63-d7f47c5db49b"
msgid "\"Don't even think about it, Lander. One betrayal was enough for me.\""
msgstr "\"생각조차 하지 마, 랜더. 배신은 한 번으로 충분했어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "265a6872-951d-418c-9bf7-ed8018ca6753"
msgid "Killed Lander Lebeda. Again."
msgstr "랜더 레베다를 다시 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "35ceeb6a-88b3-4905-a1b2-291bf930df09"
msgid "[Attack] \"I enjoyed killing you last time!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"지난 번에 너를 죽이는 게 즐거웠지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "434b69f1-a2a5-49e2-ac4e-e35fe8c36ffd"
msgid ""
"\"In the First World, I found a spell that kills a person and brings them "
"back to life as a giant slug. I'll be sure to use it on you if you betray me "
"again.\""
msgstr ""
"\"태초 세계에서, 사람을 죽이고 거대한 민달팽이로 다시 태어나게하는 마법을 발견했다. 나를 다시 배반하면 그것을 사용할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4fe68ee6-0c2e-4331-a232-387924fec1b2"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander {g|House Lebeda}Lebeda{/g} salutes you with his sword, and then "
"leans on it casually as best he can, obviously trying to hide how tired he "
"is.{/n} \"There you are! What a {d|c41 Lander Lives}pleasant{/d}, pleasant "
"encounter... Your Highness!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더 {g|House Lebeda}레베다{/g}는 그의 검으로 경의를 표하고 최대한 자연스럽게 몸을 기대며 힘든 기색을 애써 감추려 "
"합니다.{/n} \"너 거기 있었군! 정말 {d|c41 Lander Lives}기쁜{/d} 만남이야... 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "90a0f748-69af-4c5c-9cc1-c2a7011ef7ea"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, that's a fine story. You won't believe the rumors that circulated "
"about you disappearing into the wilderness of the {g|First World}First "
"World{/g}. People said the {mf|King|Queen} stepped into the portal and was "
"lost, while others insisted they saw a giant owlbear carry you off in its "
"claws. I considered your poor, poor kingdom, tormented by woe... left "
"helpless, without a ruler, and... I'm joking, don't look at me like that!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 재밌는 이야기군. 네가 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 광야로 사라졌다는 소문이 퍼진 걸 믿지 못할거야. 사람들은 "
"{mf|왕|여왕}이 포털로 들어서 길을 잃었고, 다른 사람들은 거대한 아울베어가 발톱으로 너를 제거했다는 이야기를 하고 있어. 너의 "
"불쌍한 왕국이 슬픔에 빠져 통치자 없이는 무기력하다고 생각했지... 농담이니까 그런 눈으로 보지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "19c41571-2b5a-4d5a-bf07-050d6003f9e2"
msgid ""
"\"Luckily, I met the {g|House Surtova}Surtova's{/g} troops. I accepted their "
"invitation to join them, all the while fighting off the attempts of our "
"dearest Natala to shrewdly drag me into a dozen or two intrigues. A real "
"professional doesn't lose her grip even in the midst of a {g|First World}"
"First World{/g} invasion, ha ha! Speaking of which, would you like to "
"discuss it somewhere quiet? I'm ready to follow you and offer as much help "
"as I can!\""
msgstr ""
"\"운 좋게도 나는 {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g}의 군대를 만났다. 나탈라가 나를 수많은 음모에 빠뜨리는 동안, 나는 "
"그들의 초대에 응해 합류했다. {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}가 침공할 때도 전문가다운 모습을 잃지 않더군, 하하! 그래서 "
"말인데 어딘가 조용하게 얘기하지 않겠어? 너를 따르고 많은 도움을 줄 준비가 되어있다! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "31a7df5f-5428-4ba0-807e-d09b015f56ad"
msgid ""
"\"Luckily, in the end I met Jamandi's forces. — And we sensibly decided to "
"combine our strengths to repel the phantoms' attack.\n"
"Speaking of which, would you like to discuss the story somewhere quiet? I'm "
"sure we have many things to discuss... and remember the good old times. And "
"I'm eager to help you as much as I can!\""
msgstr ""
"\"운 좋게도, 결국 자만디의 부대를 만났어. 그리고 우리는 유령의 공격을 물리치기 위해 우리의 강점을 결합하기로 결정했지. \n"
"그래서 말인데, 어딘가 조용하게 얘기하지 않겠어? 나는 우리가 할 얘기가 많다고 확신하는데... 그리고 좋은 옛날을 기억해봐. 그리고 "
"내가 할 수 있는 만큼 너를 도우려고 해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "b66bfc8f-8a34-435c-a50a-80b07fd87235"
msgid ""
"\"I knew it! Two {mf|noblemen|noble people} can always come to an agreement!"
"\" {n}Lander seems to catch his breath.{/n} \"And to be honest, I couldn't "
"sit at home and listen to my mother's lectures, with something like this "
"happening nearby...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 알고 있었지! {mf|귀족|귀족}이 두 명이면 항상 합의에 도달하니까!\" {n}랜더는 숨을 참는 것 같습니다.{/n} \"그리고"
" 솔직히 말해서, 근처에서 이런 일이 일어나는데 집에서 앉아서 어머니의 잔소리를 들을 수 없었고...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "161913ef-d47e-40c4-b2dc-c7dc813fb746"
msgid ""
"{n}You notice a glimmer of sincere vexation in Lander's eyes, but he quickly "
"pulls himself together and smiles pretentiously.{/n} \"Well, it was nice to "
"see an old acquaintance! Good luck in your insane battle with the invasion "
"from another world...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더의 눈빛에서 정말로 짜증났음을 보게 되지만 그는 빠르게 이성을 되찾고 웃는 척합니다.{/n} \"음, 아는 사람을 만나서 "
"반가웠어! 다른 세계의 침략자와의 미친 전투에서 행운을 빌어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "4665d776-989b-49fc-a523-c0c55434ffec"
msgid ""
"\"Traditions are important! We should definitely discuss it at our next "
"meeting, shouldn't we?\""
msgstr "\"전통은 중요하지! 반드시 다음 회의에서 논의해야 해. 안그래?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "c0cc3647-ae89-4a59-bd02-da167c1e0ef6"
msgid ""
"{n}Lander ruffles his hair nervously.{/n} \"Actually I really wanted to "
"help. To show my gratitude for the little favor you did of returning my "
"mortal remains to my relatives. But on my way here I got a little lost in "
"the mist, ran around in circles from an horde of phantom barbarians, hid "
"from them in a thorny thicket... ahem, well, it doesn't matter!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}랜더는 불안으로 머리를 헝클어뜨립니다.{/n} \"실제로 나는 정말로 돕고 싶었어. 내 친척에게 내 유골을 돌려주었던 네 호의에 "
"감사함을 표시하고 싶었어. 그러나, 여기 오는 동안 나는 안개 속에서 길을 잃었고, 유령 야만인 무리에게서 도망쳐 가시 덤불 속에 "
"숨었지... 에헴. 그건 중요하지 않고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/BrevoyBorderlandsFW/LanderLebeda/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "e9c8ef51-b9ad-4960-a218-e3ad5f99a0da"
msgid ""
"\"I missed your jokes so much!\" {n}Lander forces a careless laugh but looks "
"at you a bit anxiously.{/n} \"So what do you say, can I join you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 농담이 너무 많이 그리웠어!\" {n}랜더는 경솔한 웃음을 억지로 짓지만 조금 불안해 보입니다.{/n} \"내가 합류하겠다면 "
"뭐라고 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/CollectorBark1_String
msgctxt "553c46b1-10c0-4c24-b586-062a162b631a"
msgid "\"Hurry up! Get out of the city, it's safe outside!\""
msgstr "\"서둘러! 도시에서 나와. 밖이 안전해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/CollectorBark2_String
msgctxt "f35293f0-c77e-49e2-807b-360cb9955bad"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness! Everyone who could be saved has left the city! We should "
"follow them!\""
msgstr "\"전하! 구할 수 있는 모든 사람들이 도시를 떠났습니다. 우리는 그들을 따라가야 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/ElinaBark_String
msgctxt "8f5adb5d-bacc-48ca-a0e9-47df6cbba6a9"
msgid ""
"\"Hurry, girls! Let's hide and wait for the {mf|King|Queen} — {mf|he|she}'ll "
"drive away this pestilence!\""
msgstr "\"서둘러! 숨어서 {mf|왕|여왕}을 기다리자. 왕이 이 전염병을 몰아낼 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/FWBanditBark1_String
msgctxt "27dca740-3ef2-4760-afac-905d79f5af24"
msgid "\"For the Stag Lord! This is going to be fun!\""
msgstr "\"수사슴 군주를 위해! 이것은 재미있을 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/FWBanditBark2_String
msgctxt "802576e1-4485-4fe1-ad4c-ef5c534b7539"
msgid "\"Built your shacks in our fortress? They're ours now!\""
msgstr "\"우리 요새에 판잣집을 세웠어? 이제 우리의 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/FWBanditBark3_String
msgctxt "c9d77fa5-6228-4d5c-b34d-997ef7e13fe2"
msgid "\"So many weaklings! Gut them!\""
msgstr "\"너무 많은 약점이 있어! 태워버려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/FWCitizenBark1_String
msgctxt "f2eab04c-f460-444e-bb80-a1890cc4875e"
msgid "\"Help! He-e-elp!\""
msgstr "\"도와줘! 도, 도와줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/FWCitizenBark2_String
msgctxt "08a3c754-4898-4ace-a2db-2a00b6656465"
msgid "\"Woe is me! I didn't get a chance to pack!\""
msgstr "\"비통하구나! 짐을 꾸릴 기회 조차 없었어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/Barks/FWCitizenBark3_String
msgctxt "79df12b2-a993-4b37-81f8-1e5af73056cf"
msgid "\"There's no time to save your junk! Run! — Run!\""
msgstr "\"네 쓰레기 따위 구할 시간이 없다! 달려!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "d4563fca-1b3c-4115-b0f2-a0c1e1d1df81"
msgid "\"Wait, I thought I killed you already...\""
msgstr "\"잠깐. 너를 이미 죽인 줄 알았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "85ee8f8a-592f-43e8-93a4-304ea9930c4d"
msgid "[Attack] \"I won't let you keep tormenting my city!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"네가 계속 내 도시를 괴롭히지 않게 할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "99de0b01-48d0-42e2-8154-6bd86d89b4eb"
msgid "\"Who are you?\""
msgstr "\"너 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "dd17f085-7b34-4850-ae45-ba4c42e6fabd"
msgid "\"Get out of my way, and I won't hurt you.\""
msgstr "\"내 길을 막지마. 그러면 너를 해치지 않을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "92113693-70f8-4122-85ae-865397133857"
msgid ""
"{n}An old{/n} {d|Nugrah}druid{/d} {n}stands there, swaying a little and "
"mumbling to himself. He looks up at you — and you don't see any gleam of "
"intelligence in his eyes.{/n} \"You! Why did you disobey me? You didn't die! "
"Have you forgotten the rules?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 {/n}{d|Nugrah}드루이드{/d}{n}가 서있고, 비틀거리며 혼잣말을 합니다. 그는 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 당신은 그의 "
"눈빛에서 어떤 총명함도 보지 못합니다.{/n} \"너! 왜 나에게 복종하지 않았지? 너는 죽지 않았어! 규칙을 잊었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "2e354700-5771-4e5c-8a7f-a02b02ffd254"
msgid ""
"{n}Sparks of sense appear in the old man's dim eyes.{/n} \"Yes, yes, you {d|"
"c11 Nugrah killed}did{/d}! But not me. I'm just a shadow of the one you slew."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노인의 희미한 눈에는 감각의 불꽃이 나타납니다.{/n} \"그래. 그래. 네가 {d|c11 Nugrah killed}그랬지!{/d}"
"! 하지만 내가 아니다. 나는 네가 죽인 것의 그림자일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "0b074a53-abc2-4b42-9de6-c7b235c974fe"
msgid ""
"{n}Sparks of sense appear in the old man's dim eyes.{/n} \"You don't "
"remember, no, you don't... An old broken {d|c11 Nugrag left}man{/d}, in a "
"locked room, in the Stag Lord's fortress. No one came to open the door... "
"and he died there of hunger and thirst. You got lucky, of course. If he "
"hadn't perished there, he'd have returned to tear out your throat. Old, old "
"Nugrah... I am his shadow.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노인의 희미한 눈에는 감각의 불꽃이 나타납니다.{/n} \"너는 기억하지 못한다. 기억하지 못해... 늙고 망가진 {d|c11 "
"Nugrag left}남자{/d}는 수사슴 군주의 요새의 잠긴 방에 있었다. 아무도 문을 열고 오지 않았고... 그는 배고픔과 갈증으로 "
"죽었다. 너는 운이 좋았지, 당연해. 그가 거기에서 죽지 않았더라면, 돌아와서 너의 목구멍을 찢어버렸을 테니. 늙고 늙은 누그라... "
"나는 그의 그림자다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "3470fc40-2bc3-4ffa-8aa1-23cd10693a20"
msgid ""
"\"All of us here are restless shadows, longing to regain what life has "
"stripped away from us. We were the dust in the Apology, and now we are here, "
"free, among those we owe for our deaths! It is the time of shadows. The "
"living must stand aside and give place to us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기있는 우리 모두는 우리가 빼앗긴 삶을 되찾기를 갈망하는 잠들지 못한 그림자이다. 우리는 사죄 속의 먼지였고, 이제 우리 죽음에 "
"빚진 사람들 가운데서 자유롭게 살아있다! 그림자의 시간이다. 산 자들은 옆으로 비켜서서 우리의 장소를 마련해라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/FWNugra/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "11c02a08-a600-4e1f-8600-26015c08a5bb"
msgid ""
"{n}The old man laughs madly.{/n} \"You speak when I say. You do as I say. "
"Disobedience leads to punishment!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노인은 미친 듯이 웃습니다.{/n} \"내가 허락할 때 너는 말한다. 너는 내가 말한대로 행동한다. 불복종은 처벌로 이어진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "f8603159-0453-43e6-b355-2bbd39138b35"
msgid "\"What's happening to my capital?\""
msgstr "\"내 수도에서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "05b44472-54e9-4824-9ea6-e367cf5e2c2d"
msgid "[Attack] \"I've always wanted to kill a god...\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 항상 신을 죽이고 싶었다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "0ec3bf24-be7c-4b7a-b305-92c8facc00e4"
msgid "\"And what is my part to be in your performance?\""
msgstr "\"그리고 내 역할은 너의 공연에서 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1ba9d038-e758-409b-9d25-80dd9cac1af4"
msgid ""
"\"I won't surrender so easily. If I have to protect my kingdom, I'll do it.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그렇게 쉽게 항복하지 않을 것이다. 내가 나의 왕국을 보호해야 한다면 그럴 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "28b2111e-d619-49de-9cac-2f05d38b1f6b"
msgid ""
"{n}The sound of a ghostly laughter surrounds you. It comes from everywhere "
"and nowhere, and it's hard to say whether it is more joyous or ominous.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}유령의 웃음 소리가 당신을 둘러쌉니다. 그것은 어디에서나 있고 어디에도 없으며, 그것이 즐거운건지 불길한건지도 말하기 "
"어렵습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : LanternKing_CapitalSuareFW
msgctxt "2078d0c8-5f13-4889-b48b-8259a0a82125"
msgid ""
"\"How wrong I was. What better than an unexpected finale for such a "
"performance? I had to change the setting and the main character, but so what?"
"\" {n}The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} speaks as if you're exchanging "
"civilities over wine. This time he wears another mask — for once almost "
"amiable.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"내가 얼마나 틀렸는지. 이 공연에서 예기치 못한 종막보다 더 좋은게 있겠나? 나는 설정과 주인공을 바꿔야겠다.\" "
"{n}{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 마치 와인을 마시며 사교 활동을 하는 것처럼 말합니다. 이번에 그는 거의 유쾌한 것처럼 "
"또 다른 가면을 착용했습니다. {/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaCapitalSquareFW
msgctxt "861b02b3-f2eb-4b88-8e75-4e720db16098"
msgid ""
"\"Something is wrong. We were supposed to leave {g|First World}the First "
"World{/g}, but...\" {n}The nymph stops short.{/n} \"My cup is broken. The "
"blood and pain of a thousand destroyed kingdoms are oozing from its pieces. "
"I feel them! I do...\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭔가 잘못 됐어. 우린 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 떠나도록 되어 있었지만...\" {n}님프는 잠깐 "
"멈춥니다.{/n} \"내 잔이 깨졌어. 천 개의 파괴된 왕국의 피와 고통이 그 조각에서 흘러 나오고 있다. 나는 그들을 느낀다! "
"느껴져...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : LanternKing_CapitalSuareFW
msgctxt "19cf68d0-46b3-4f96-9ed9-3ea940e20e29"
msgid ""
"\"Don't you see? The city and all your lands have been transferred to {g|"
"First World}the First World{/g}. Shadows of the inhabitants of all its "
"ruined kingdoms have escaped the cup and are taking revenge on the living "
"for all their sad fates. Old enemies arise from the ashes, and forgotten "
"sorrows are reborn. A sad story, but always amusing.\" {n}You hear laughter "
"in the Eldest's voice.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"보지 못했나? 도시와 너의 모든 땅이 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}로 옮겨졌다. 폐허가 된 모든 왕국의 주민들의 "
"그림자가 잔을 탈출하여, 그들의 슬픈 운명을 위해 산 자들에게 복수하고 있다. 오랜 적들이 재에서 다시 나오고, 잊혀진 슬픔이 다시 "
"태어났다. 슬픈 이야기지만 항상 즐겁구나. \" {n}원로의 웃음 소리가 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : LanternKing_CapitalSuareFW
msgctxt "5dec1f77-610d-4311-b36b-08894256a8ae"
msgid ""
"\"The lead role! The {mf|king|queen} must save {mf|his|her} lands, for "
"losing {mf|his|her} crown means losing {mf|his|her} future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"주연이다! {mf|왕|여왕}은 반드시 {mf|그의|그녀의} 땅을 되찾아야 한다, {mf|그|그녀}의 왕관을 잃어버리면 {mf|그|그녀}"
"의 미래도 사라질테니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : LanternKing_CapitalSuareFW
msgctxt "41c7a8ad-a8ad-41e5-8a48-12514e524d68"
msgid ""
"\"Seeds sown long time have sprung. {name}, do you remember an insane old "
"man on the road from {g|Oleg's Trading Post}Trading Post{/g} — our first "
"encounter? I told you back then, \"Once stolen, the land should be "
"reclaimed... Once reclaimed, bound with the claimer shall it be. Bound, "
"merged, joined by unbreakable ties. Claiming the land, claiming its pain, "
"claiming its death.\""
msgstr ""
"\"씨앗이 싹을 틔우기까지는 오랜 시간이 걸린다. {name}, {g|Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g}의 길에서 처음 "
"만났던 미친 노인을, 우리의 첫 만남을 기억하나? 내가 말했지. \"도둑맞은 이상, 그 땅은 수복되어야만 한다... 수복되면, 그것은 "
"주인에게 귀속될 것이다. 끊을 수 없는 유대에 의해 속박되고, 합병되고, 연결된다. 이 땅을 차지하면, 그 고통을 차지하고, 그 죽음을 "
"차지하리라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : LanternKing_CapitalSuareFW
msgctxt "7254fd5d-9e6e-49cd-a15a-a61d93e6d24e"
msgid ""
"\"Fight if you wish, {mf|king|queen}. I'll take my place among the "
"spectators.\""
msgstr "\"네가 원한다면 싸워라, {mf|왕|여왕}. 나는 관중석에 자리를 잡겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaCapitalSquareFW
msgctxt "1dace6b1-9f81-4143-b6b9-eae31c04f64e"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks up.{/n} \"You've toyed with me for a thousand years, "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. Have you not grown bored? I'm still not strong enough "
"to resist you, but I'll never give in. {name}, you have time to banish the "
"affliction and defeat our enemy. Maybe you'll succeed where I have failed. "
"Don't give up!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사가 올려다 봅니다.{/n} \"너는 천 년 동안 나를 가지고 놀았다. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}. 지루하지 않은가? 나는 "
"아직도 너에게 저항할 만큼 강하지 않아, 그러나 절대 포기하지 않을 것이다. {name}, 고통을 없애고 적을 물리칠 시간이다. 어쩌면 "
"너는 내가 실패한 곳에서 성공할 것이다. 포기하지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : LanternKing_CapitalSuareFW
msgctxt "aed85e6a-b666-49a6-aa83-302300a4af26"
msgid ""
"\"I'll leave you with this knowledge. And I think I'll take my old toy, "
"since she was unequal to performance's leading role...\""
msgstr "\"나는 너에게 이 지식을 남기겠다. 그리고 나의 낡은 장난감은 주연 배역에 맞지 않으니 데려가야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaCapitalSquareFW
msgctxt "ab224291-94ad-4b99-bf76-2649b5d2a3d9"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa seems to not notice the Eldest's words, and only looks at you.{/n}"
" \"I know where to look for hope. Find me where the Everblooming Flower "
"blossomed.\"\n"
"{n}She looks at the Lantern King.{/n} \"You have no power over me, Eldest. "
"Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 원로가 한 말을 무시한 채 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"나는 어디에서 희망을 찾을지 알고 있다. 영원히 피는 꽃이 "
"만개하는 곳에서 나를 찾아라.\"\n"
"{n}그녀는 등불왕을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"너는 나를 막지 못한다. 원로. 그럼 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "1d463479-c067-42c8-a1f4-366ab296e331"
msgid "\"{name}, what happened? Are you all right? I... I feel... so weak...\""
msgstr "\" {name}. 무슨 일이야? 괜찮아? 나는... 나는 무기력해... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "5ae7c531-072c-4891-8dc4-dbb82502f3b5"
msgid ""
"\"I... sense the power of the curse. What did you do to us, "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}?!\""
msgstr "\"저는... 저주의 힘이 느껴집니다. 우리에게 무슨 짓을 한 거냐, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : LanternKing_CapitalSuareFW
msgctxt "300d797d-6cd7-4c70-b91e-bcdf0635c638"
msgid "\"I wouldn't expect anything else.\""
msgstr "\"다른건 기대하지도 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CapitalSquareFW/LKatChapterStart/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : LanternKing_CapitalSuareFW
msgctxt "0acd8f84-a5d8-4455-866e-f6431f1d0e50"
msgid ""
"\"A curse for the future {mf|king|queen} — that is what these words were. "
"You are connected to your kingdom, and you will be ruined along with it. "
"Just as Nyrissa's nymph sisters suffered from her curse, so will your "
"followers suffer with you. The {g|First World}First World{/g} is washing "
"over this land like a wave, and it will devour your souls with it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"미래의 {mf|왕|여왕}을 위한 저주 — 그것이 바로 이 말의 뜻이다. 너는 네 왕국과 연결되어 있다, 그리고 너는 왕국과 함께 "
"파괴될 것이다. 나이리사의 님프 자매가 그녀의 저주로 고통받았던 것처럼, 너의 추종자들도 너와 함께 고통받을 것이다. {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}는 파도가 되어 이 땅을 휩쓸 것이며, 너의 영혼또한 삼킬 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/AkirosHub_bark_String
msgctxt "57deb955-c044-4e38-a7f8-be95b9b4c2f9"
msgid ""
"\"A bandit fort, a flourishing city, a cesspool of beasts. This place has a "
"rich history! I admit, I missed it...\""
msgstr "\"산적 요새, 번성한 도시, 짐승의 함정. 이 곳은 풍부한 역사를 가지고 있다! 나는 잊고 있음을 인정한다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/ArmagBroHub_bark_String
msgctxt "66c3e9cf-d1a7-4e2d-8479-c28b6ae687d4"
msgid ""
"\"{mf|Brother|Sister}! Armag is here and will share the trials of battle "
"with you.\""
msgstr "\"{mf|형재|자매}여! 아르막이 여기 있다. 전투의 시련을 너와 공유하겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/ArmagHub_bark_String
msgctxt "f2a78507-ce0a-4fce-a463-380231d7e37c"
msgid "\"Armag remembers his duty. Count on me!\""
msgstr "\"아르막은 의무를 기억한다. 날 믿어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/BanditAdmirersLeader_String
msgctxt "c859faf0-cbe5-4534-9d46-15157fc88b46"
msgid ""
"\"This is not how I imagined life in official service. I thought it would be "
"more peaceful...\""
msgstr "\"이것은 내가 상상했던 관직이 아니다. 나는 더 평화로울 것이라고 생각했는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/BartholomewHub_bark_String
msgctxt "9b395176-00e2-4efb-bcbe-2182578899b4"
msgid "\"I hope this chaos will end soon. I'm too old for such adventures!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 혼란이 곧 끝나기를 바란다. 나는 그러한 모험을 하기에는 너무 늙었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/DarvenHub_bark_String
msgctxt "a97164f3-7236-4926-832f-014ca5922cb9"
msgid "\"I'm repaying the debt. One ruler to another.\""
msgstr "\"나는 빚을 갚고 있다. 한 통치자가 다른 통치자에게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/DefacedSisterHub_bark_String
msgctxt "cc709b26-d392-40bc-a271-c5de63814aa2"
msgid ""
"\"It's so good to breathe the open air and see the sky again! Being locked "
"in a dungeon almost drove me insane.\""
msgstr "\"야외에서 숨을 쉬고 다시 하늘을 보니 너무 좋았어! 던전에 갖혀 있는 건 나를 미치게 만들었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/DugathHub_bark_String
msgctxt "364dd4dc-8b96-472d-b72e-1edcb01432fd"
msgid ""
"\"Gorum sends us a glorious battle — and a fearsome enemy. The hearts of the "
"warriors sing!\""
msgstr "\"고룸은 우리를 영광스러운 전투와 무시무시한 적을 보낸다. 전사의 마음이 노래한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/EvindraHub_bark_String
msgctxt "d156cf48-31a1-43c5-ab0e-e86d52c06df7"
msgid ""
"\"I might be a mere wisp compared to the Eldest, but I'll fight to the end "
"and see the fall of the Lantern King!\""
msgstr "\"나는 원로에 비하면 단순한 위습일지 모르지만, 결국 끝까지 싸울 것이고 등불왕의 몰락을 보게 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/FakeStagLordHub_bark_String
msgctxt "e1653561-88cb-4a00-8433-3c53b6a63364"
msgid ""
"\"From what I'm seeing today, being a bandit is better than being a king!\""
msgstr "\"내가 오늘 본 바로는, 도적으로 사는게 왕이 되는 것보다 낫다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/FalchosHub_bark_String
msgctxt "5e1274c6-7f3c-4efe-8281-32481c77e098"
msgid ""
"\"Never back down in the face of danger, {mf|king|queen}! — And we will be "
"happy to help you!\""
msgstr "\"위험에 직면하지 말아라. {mf|왕|여왕}! 우리는 너를 도와주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/GoblinHub_bark_String
msgctxt "d121c8da-11d1-45ae-a90e-978e89a77e8a"
msgid ""
"\"We come help you, friend! You no angry if we set fire to city a little?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 너를 도우러 왔다. 친구! 우리가 도시에 불을 질렀다면 화낼 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/HargulkaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "72f171dc-9114-44eb-9b16-ac1d839c49ba"
msgid "\"Trobold and King Hargulka help you, {race}! On our word!\""
msgstr "\"트로볼드와 하굴카 왕이 너를 도운다. {race}! 맹세코!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/IloraHub_bark_String
msgctxt "28471640-1c3d-44f3-90ed-630f10c6ebc4"
msgid "\"River Razors at your service! Let's kick some monster butts!\""
msgstr "\"강의 칼날단이 너를 도우러 왔다! 괴물을 혼내주자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/JamandiHub_bark_String
msgctxt "04b66e0d-0dfe-4457-a9d5-60996daf4fca"
msgid ""
"\"A fierce battle awaits us, but we are fighting for a good cause like never "
"before.\""
msgstr "\"치열한 전투가 우리를 기다리고 있지만 우리는 전과는 달리 좋은 목적을 위해 싸우고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/JhodHub_bark_String
msgctxt "cf397d53-72a1-4953-b250-e14ecd522a6d"
msgid "\"Erastil, help us stop this madness...\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이시여. 이 광기를 멈추게 도와주십시오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/KassilHub_bark_String
msgctxt "fb2d6766-be76-4512-8ca0-8c55104b874b"
msgid "\"I'm glad to be among your comrades, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"당신의 전우가 되어 기쁩니다, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/KestenHub_bark_String
msgctxt "bf00d663-4cb6-4971-a394-0ac51f45b792"
msgid ""
"\"It's not the first troubles to fall upon our heads. We'll survive this "
"too, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"이는 우리가 겪는 첫 문제가 아닙니다. 우리는 역시 살아남을 것입니다, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/KoboldChiefHub_bark_String
msgctxt "f7922ff3-8462-4f80-bc13-b43683e5c63e"
msgid "\"Friendsss! Kobold ssstrike your enemy!\""
msgstr "\"이봐아아! 코볼트가 네 적을 공격한다아아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/KressleHub_bark_String
msgctxt "dd4aa257-ec38-4996-8be8-7c36fbe3e761"
msgid ""
"\"I honestly meant to start a peaceful life. Well, it's all right, I can "
"wipe the rust from my axe to help a friend...\""
msgstr "\"나는 솔직히 평화로운 삶을 시작하려고 했다. 음. 괜찮아. 친구를 도우려면 도끼를 좀 갈아야지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/LebedaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "4eed36d9-99ee-4e03-bc6c-6fcb0d692634"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose you might have the impulse to hit me. But that can surely wait "
"until the end of the battle!\""
msgstr "\"나를 때리고 싶은 충동이 있을거라 생각하는데. 하지만 전투가 끝날 때까진 기다려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/LiacenzaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "b74b2f17-66da-43fa-b736-2dd1b319f482"
msgid "\"It's time we turn from prey to hunters!\""
msgstr "\"이제 사냥감에서 사냥꾼으로 바뀔 때이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/LikkaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "09b0de3b-7a97-48c7-b2ab-83651780cda1"
msgid ""
"\"If someone did to our lake what they've done to your city, I'd skin them "
"alive!\""
msgstr "\"누군가가 네 도시에서 한 짓을 우리 호수에 벌인다면, 나는 그들을 산 채로 벗길 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/LizardfolkRattlerHub_bark_String
msgctxt "1eff53ed-083a-417e-a243-1264fdada40b"
msgid ""
"\"Old Kagar and his tribe come to help. Evil spirits ahead, but we not "
"afraid!\""
msgstr "\"늙은 카가르와 그의 부족이 도우러 왔다. 악령들이 앞섰지만 우리는 두려워하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/MaegarHub_bark_String
msgctxt "2f27d742-baef-445f-bcd6-05258bb041de"
msgid ""
"\"The life of an adventurer is full of surprises. Even a war with a First "
"World deity doesn't seem so unlikely.\""
msgstr "\"모험가의 삶은 놀라움으로 가득차 있다. 태초 세계 신과의 전쟁은 그다지 놀랍지 않군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/MelianseHub_bark_String
msgctxt "3e0957d7-220a-47d2-9f84-708c4fe801e5"
msgid ""
"\"Silly jumbos, they build these stony buildings, and then they're surprised "
"to see them broken. Oh well, we'll have to help you!\""
msgstr "\"어리석은 녀석들. 그들은 이 석재 건물들을 지었고 부서진 것을 보고 놀랐다. 우리는 너를 도와야겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/MiteQueenHub_bark_String
msgctxt "10608403-1f47-4fcd-be74-8e355c959b56"
msgid "\"Ally, I help you! Lead my mite to battle! Big fight us come. Sweet!\""
msgstr "\"동맹! 너를 돕는다! 내 아이들을 이끌고 싸우라! 큰 싸움이 온다! 아주 좋아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/MosconiHub_bark_String
msgctxt "5e9b80cc-56ca-4ace-a53f-18f94d3c779d"
msgid ""
"\"Beautiful weather for a battle! Although I admit, I do prefer feasts and "
"hunting...\""
msgstr "\"전투를 위한 아름다운 날씨군! 내가 잔치와 사냥을 더 좋아하긴 하지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/NatalaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "abdad0d2-8e70-4028-9007-e32c057355b1"
msgid ""
"\"Willingness to fight for your dominion no matter the cost, against any "
"enemy — that is the foremost quality of a ruler.\""
msgstr "\"위기에 상관없이 모든 적과 맞서 영토를 위해 싸우겠다는 의지. 그것은 통치자의 가장 중요한 덕목이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/NereidHub_bark_String
msgctxt "0bf43a7c-fe03-4d76-b66d-92173489c0dc"
msgid ""
"\"Well, compared to the Lantern King's pranks, my tricks are just boring...\""
msgstr "\"글쎄, 등불왕의 장난에 비하면 내 장난은 지루해...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/ShandaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "aa6ca485-78f0-4d4a-8b51-7437f266b611"
msgid ""
"\"A fight with a deity from another world is not among my competencies, but "
"the threat must nevertheless be neutralized.\""
msgstr "\"다른 세계의 신과의 싸움은 나의 역량이 아니지만, 그럼에도 위협은 제거되어야만 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/TartukHub_bark_String
msgctxt "c57a94fd-37db-44f3-abce-38f8a907fc30"
msgid ""
"\"If I knew back then, at the ressseption in Ressstov, how it would all "
"end...\""
msgstr "\"레스토프의 환영회때, 그때 내가 알았다면, 이 모든게 어떻게 끝났을까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/TiressiaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "353e29ed-3ed1-4edb-ad51-d5b9445cd465"
msgid "\"So much pain... Like our ruined kingdom on the day it fell...\""
msgstr "\"너무나 고통스럽다... 그 날에 우리의 나라가 폐허가 된 것처럼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/TsannaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "a4a1a0b5-c0f9-4f49-986c-c9873c2e5a7f"
msgid "\"Ominous time, ominous and beautiful...\""
msgstr "\"불길한 시간, 불길하고 아름다운...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/VereelHub_bark_String
msgctxt "f11aa894-b372-43ae-aa13-f92249e7710a"
msgid "\"How did I let myself get into this...\""
msgstr "\"내가 어떻게 이런 일에 빠지게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Allies/VordakaiHub_bark_String
msgctxt "2a4a7c45-e3fd-4aed-9e80-fb0f1d314276"
msgid ""
"\"You have an incredible gift for bringing upon yourself the wrath of great "
"powers.\""
msgstr "\"너는 위대한 힘의 진노를 자신에게 가져다 준 놀라운 재능이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/AmiriHub_bark_String
msgctxt "3ca49b43-10ed-4861-abbc-411cf3a9ce1c"
msgid ""
"\"I'm going to knock the hell out of this flying freak if I get to him! "
"'Lantern King' my spit! Ha!\""
msgstr "\"내가 녀석을 잡는다면 저 날아다니는 괴물을 때려 눕힐 거야! 등불왕 기다려라! 하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/EkunHub_bark_String
msgctxt "5129f81d-b0c5-4ac4-97d3-e2ef29f2b032"
msgid ""
"\"I saw a strong and vibrant forest swept away by fire. Now I see the same "
"happening to a living city.\""
msgstr "\"나는 강하고 활기찬 숲이 불에 휩싸였던 것을 보았다. 이제 살아있는 도시에서 똑같은 일이 일어날 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/HarrimHub_bark_String
msgctxt "5fd50569-8eaf-4ea5-9841-cb8b2e289ae5"
msgid ""
"\"I see chaos and desolation, but there is no truth in this. There is no "
"humility, only useless clamor.\""
msgstr "\"나는 혼란과 황폐를 보지만 이것에는 진리가 없다. 겸손은 없고 쓸모 없는 소동만이 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/JaethalHub_bark_String
msgctxt "1acb5600-ccfc-4c5a-bd70-ecabe1b92093"
msgid ""
"\"Such troubles harden the strong and rid the world of weaklings. I welcome "
"this.\""
msgstr "\"그런 고민은 힘을 굳게하고 약탈의 세계를 없애 준다. 나는 이것을 환영한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/JubilostHub_bark_String
msgctxt "2dc2af49-9cc7-4b4f-8ae1-4ad7fb87906a"
msgid ""
"\"I wanted so much to visit the First World! And now it's come to us "
"instead! But somehow I'm still unhappy...\""
msgstr "\"나는 태초 세계를 방문하기를 너무 원했다! 이제는 그것이 우리에게 왔다! 그러나 나는 아직도 불행하다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/NokNokHub_bark_String
msgctxt "55a35f58-58af-4453-8091-5867f31e8cdb"
msgid "\"Ugh, it's not easy being a hero! I have a headache...\""
msgstr "\"휴. 영웅이 되는 게 쉽지 않아! 머리 아파...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/OctaviaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "96506479-93bf-4d92-8d16-f59a48cbcc83"
msgid ""
"\"The poor people of the city and the kingdom! It seems they haven't lived a "
"day of peace since the moment it was founded.\""
msgstr "\"도시와 왕국의 불쌍한 사람들! 설립 초기부터 평화의 날을 보내지 못한 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/RegongarHub_bark_String
msgctxt "f010204c-3ec4-41f4-a8a9-168a8edcb2ab"
msgid ""
"\"Do we have to wait much longer? I can't wait to try a few spells on those "
"rotten shadows.\""
msgstr "\"우리가 더 오래 기다려야 하나? 나는 이 썩은 그림자 녀석들에게 몇 가지 주문을 시도하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/TristianHub_bark_String
msgctxt "3dff4834-6ed2-4532-b0e6-79721e65b023"
msgid ""
"\"I believe in my heart we will overcome this trial, whatever it takes!\""
msgstr "\"저는 무슨 일이 벌어져도 이 시련을 극복 할 것이라 진심으로 믿습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Companions/ValerieHub_bark_String
msgctxt "c3754950-cda4-4891-91b5-5f5875166ffc"
msgid ""
"\"I've never seen anything more gruesome than the chaos that the Lantern "
"King has created here.\""
msgstr "\"저는 등불왕이 여기에서 초래한 혼돈보다 더 끔찍한 것을 본 적이 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Cutscene/1NyrissaSorry_1Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "b79556f1-e529-4202-9ea9-4b21b7c6b112"
msgid "\"My grumpy cousin…\""
msgstr "\"나의 심술 궂은 사촌이...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Cutscene/1NyrissaSorry_2Evindra_String
msgctxt "2ad9f786-f1a9-4a59-8200-56e5debc1871"
msgid ""
"\"Don't say anything, Nyr. If you started apologizing, we'll be at this for "
"years.\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 말하지 마, 나이리사. 네가 사과하기 시작하면 우린 몇 년 동안 시달릴 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Cutscene/1NyrissaSorry_3DefacedSister_String
msgctxt "ffa4da08-62d7-4557-9a29-12d51a436e07"
msgid ""
"\"…and miss the battle! Better we concern ourselves with the woes of today.\""
msgstr "\"... 그리고 전투가 그리웠다! 오늘의 불행으로 우리 자신을 더 잘 이해했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/ArmagParadeBark_String
msgctxt "9d7a9b56-eaa7-4946-aad9-bb74a887bc6e"
msgid "\"A battle worth being born for...\""
msgstr "\"이 가치 있는 전투는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/GoblinParadeBark_String
msgctxt "68eda232-7d89-467d-8542-6722e635fe39"
msgid "\"Ua-ha-ha, here we go!\""
msgstr "\"우 - 하 - 하! 우리가 간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/JamandiParadeBark_String
msgctxt "6d41a557-c7ad-4a53-b3cd-9996f1bac541"
msgid "\"Focus. This isn't a parade we're going to!\""
msgstr "\"집중해. 우리가 가는 곳은 퍼레이드가 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/JhodParadeBark_String
msgctxt "501f8e64-5101-4213-890d-1c9ecbf9769b"
msgid "\"Protect us Erastil! Let's move!\""
msgstr "\"우리를 지켜라! 움직여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/KestenParadeBark_String
msgctxt "56c4aca5-eb40-4cf9-a3df-08fc170f13f1"
msgid ""
"\"For the {mf|King|Queen} and the kingdom! Fight like it's final last battle!"
"\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}을 위해! 마지막 전투인 것처럼 싸워라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/KoboldParadeBark_String
msgctxt "e52b7401-4ec7-4d1d-a981-302ace89fe1e"
msgid "\"Kobold ssstong, fierccce! All run from kobold!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트는 강하고 날쎄다아아! 모두 코볼트에게서 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/KressleParadeBark_String
msgctxt "df51239b-7315-4ecd-ab0c-f58531537172"
msgid ""
"\"Hell yeah! We're going to have some fun! It's way too soon to retire!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 재미있을 거야! 퇴직하기에는 너무 일러!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/LebedaParadeBark_String
msgctxt "16a9952b-c335-44a5-97c8-429303a0aefe"
msgid ""
"\"I'm going to fight the great battle with such an, ahem, motley crew...\""
msgstr "\"에헴. 그런 잡놈과 위대한 전투를 치르는군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/MelianceParadeBark_String
msgctxt "624b7864-56aa-4e06-ad59-94426b88571d"
msgid "\"Move away, stringbeans!\""
msgstr "\"멀리 떨어져! 길다란 녀석아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/MiteParadeBark_String
msgctxt "60e1e0ae-f4c2-4190-b13c-0da8e05bae3b"
msgid "\"Can I be even bigger hero than I already am? Bigger than today?!\""
msgstr "\"내가 지금보다 더 위대한 영웅이 될 수 있을까? 오늘보다도 더?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Parade/SurtovaParadeBark_String
msgctxt "b7b5094e-2afa-4d16-a009-498112d099f0"
msgid ""
"\"They say repetitive activity wears you down. Well, I've discovered an "
"interesting way to recover from palace intrigue...\""
msgstr "\"그들은 반복적인 활동이 너를 지치게 한다고 말한다. 나는 궁전의 모의로부터 만회하는 흥미로운 방법을 발견했다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Refugee1_String
msgctxt "a8864d78-f23d-47be-a03e-ad79d3f74d3a"
msgid "\"You've got to save the kingdom! Who else if not you?\""
msgstr "\"이 나라를 구해야 해! 당신이 안하면 누가 하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Refugee2_String
msgctxt "a3e65ca0-b128-4fea-9d18-79abbd737aca"
msgid "\"The kingdom is in ruin. All is lost.\""
msgstr "\"왕국은 폐허가 됐어. 다 사라져버렸지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Barks/Refugee3_String
msgctxt "bbbe9a58-a5e3-40e0-aa63-374bf29ff32a"
msgid "\"I want to go home.\""
msgstr "\"집에 가고 싶군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "5df6c6ff-d554-4b9f-b848-793ff1319133"
msgid "\"What forces do I have now?\""
msgstr "\"지금 우리 세력이 얼마나 되나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "261d58d2-f374-4abb-a447-0fea5ee119a8"
msgid "\"What happened to my advisors and subjects?\""
msgstr "\"내 고문과 신하들은 어떻게 된 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "39e037eb-8b4e-4484-af4e-a775e90ea5a3"
msgid ""
"\"Is there a way to free me and my followers from the Lantern King's curse?\""
msgstr "\"등불왕의 저주에서 나와 내 추종자들을 해방시킬 수 있는 방법이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "3115d3b4-3261-414d-b49d-3eb89212e8c6"
msgid "\"I have to go. Time ticks away!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 시간이 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "64d7aee5-e17c-4379-a7fd-b54426d07037"
msgid "\"I'm ready for the final battle. Let us march!\""
msgstr "\"나는 마지막 전투가 준비되었다. 어서 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "0bb69368-b54a-4a3b-89f3-cffed6f3db39"
msgid "\"What's happening to my kingdom?\""
msgstr "\"내 왕국은 어떻게 된 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "f3978b0f-ee42-440e-ab56-361ad73abbf1"
msgid "\"I'm ready for anything. To battle!\""
msgstr "\"나는 무엇이든 준비가 되어 있다. 전투 준비!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "ba381b04-7fe7-4bf4-a057-210a931dd337"
msgid "\"I need more time to prepare.\""
msgstr "\"나는 더 많이 준비해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "120228e2-6f15-4550-b668-a843b3231a89"
msgid "\"I need rest. Can you help?\""
msgstr "\"나는 휴식이 필요해. 도와줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "a9b02908-7822-4dd2-9557-e056e8ca204d"
msgid "\"What can you tell me about the Lantern King?\""
msgstr "\"등불왕에 대해 말해줄 수 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0066_Text
msgctxt "efe283cc-58fa-4521-a774-e660ab40049a"
msgid "\"How do you know so much? Who are you, Storyteller?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 그렇게 많이 알지? 너는 누구야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "615ebb21-7e8a-4d4d-a983-8fdd30d12177"
msgid ""
"{n}The blind old man bows to you gracefully, as if he hadn't just stepped "
"out of battle a moment ago.{/n} \"I'm glad you're all right, Your Highness.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}맹인 노인은 마치 방금 전의 전투에서 방황하지 않은 것처럼 우아하게 당신에게 인사합니다.{/n} \"당신이 괜찮다니 다행입니다, "
"전하.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "68e8ada3-608c-43b1-976b-954270dd8d47"
msgid "\"Yes, Your Highness.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "7e33bf76-ac67-483d-9a8f-6e42c9533556"
msgid ""
"\"Alas, we are short of time. You must act quickly to save your kingdom and "
"yourself from the Worlds Merger — that's what we've named the catastrophe "
"that's befallen us. There are two obstacles that may stand in your way. "
"First — your advisors and subjects are now in various regions across the "
"kingdom, and almost all are under attack by shadows. The power of any land "
"lies in the brave souls that inhabit it. Save them, and you will save "
"yourself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아아, 저희는 시간이 부족합니다. 세계의 합병 — 즉, 저희에게 떨어진 대재앙에서 당신과 당신의 왕국을 구하기 위해 신속히 행동해야만 "
"합니다. 당신의 길에는 두 가지 장애물이 있을겁니다. 먼저, 고문관과 신하들이 이제 왕국 전역의 여러 지역으로 흩어졌으며, 거의 전부가 "
"그림자에 의해 공격 받고 있습니다. 모든 땅의 힘은 그 지역에 사는 용기있는 영혼들에게 달려있지요. 그들을 구하십시오, 그리하여 당신 "
"스스로를 구하십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "3b1b55b2-4504-4113-94ed-3d4441987be8"
msgid ""
"\"I think you'll be interested to know that the portal you used to enter the "
"House at the Edge of Time has come to life again. Your remaining comrades, "
"including the nereid Evindra, passed through it and brought me news about "
"your feats in the {g|First World}First World{/g}. We've been eagerly "
"awaiting your return, but meanwhile we've met the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} and "
"the affliction he's sent.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 시간의 끝에 선 집에 들어가기 위해 사용했던 포털을 다시 가동시키는 방법에 흥미를 느끼시리라 생각합니다. 네레이드 에빈드라를 "
"포함해, 남은 동료들이 포털을 통과해서 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 당신이 이룬 업적 대해 알려주었습니다. 저희는 "
"당신이 돌아오시기를 열렬히 기다렸었지만, 그 전에 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}와 그가 보낸 고통을 마주했죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "a6308d3c-7eba-4d6c-9332-bda65263b601"
msgid ""
"\"The nature of curses is mysterious, Your Highness. I know many stories "
"about them, with happy and unhappy endings, and I can propose the following: "
"to overcome a curse you must harness it. The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} "
"would have you perish with your kingdom — and he has made real that "
"imaginary bond between the land and its ruler, which poets and bards like to "
"talk about so much. But this means that by protecting the kingdom from the "
"Worlds Merger, you will also protect yourself. I think this is the first "
"thing that must be done.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하, 저주의 본질은 신비스럽지요. 저는 그들에 대한 행복하고 불행한 이야기를 많이 알고 있습니다, 그리고 당신께 제안을 하나 "
"드립니다: 저주를 극복하기 위해서는 그것을 활용해야 합니다. {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 당신이 왕국과 함께 멸망하길 "
"바랍니다. 그리고 그는 시인과 바드들이 곧 잘 얘기하고 다니는, 영토와 그 통치자 사이의 상상의 유대감을 현실로 만들었습니다. 그러나 "
"이것은 세계의 합병으로부터 왕국을 보호하는 것이 또한 당신 스스로를 보호한다는 것을 의미이기도 합니다. 저는 이것이 반드시 끝내야만 할 "
"첫 번째 일이라고 생각합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "ba2f9062-eaad-45f3-8e8a-ed073bf869f3"
msgid ""
"\"I sense you have about twenty days. That is as long as your kingdom can {d|"
"c61 Kingdom Normal}withstand{/d} the onslaught of the {g|First World}First "
"World{/g}. Believe me, this is a generous amount of time, considering the "
"affliction we face.\""
msgstr ""
"\"20일 정도 걸릴 것으로 생각합니다. 당신의 왕국이 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 맹공을 {d|c61 Kingdom "
"Normal}버틸 수 있는{/d} 기간입니다. 믿으십시오, 이는 저희가 직면한 상황을 고려하면 상당히 관대한 양입니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "b848fbcf-419d-49f6-b028-9f7f38e922d7"
msgid ""
"\"I feel you have about fifteen days, no more. The pressure of {g|First "
"World}the First World{/g} is imminent. I fear neither you nor {d|c61 Kingdom "
"Poor}your kingdom{/d} can stand much longer.\""
msgstr ""
"\"15일도 더 버티지 못할 거라 생각한다. {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}의 압박은 코 앞에 닥쳤다. 너나 {d|c61 "
"Kingdom Poor} 너의 왕국 {/d}이 오래가지 않을까 두렵다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "9156399a-911d-45d0-aee6-5c75abf3239e"
msgid ""
"\"{g|First World}The First World{/g} is rapidly penetrating the very essence "
"of this world, changing everything at its whim — and this process will soon "
"become irreversible. As I mentioned, after the Worlds Merger everything went "
"mad here, even time and the laws of nature. The greatest danger to you is "
"that the borders of the world of dreams have been destroyed. The visions of "
"the past have become real, and you cannot sleep any more. This is a part of "
"the curse — and one of the most dangerous consequences of your connection to "
"your kingdom.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}는 이 세상의 본질에 빠르게 침투하여, 모든 것을 변덕스럽게 바꾸고 있습니다. 이 과정은 "
"곧 돌이킬 수 없게 되겠죠. 제가 말했듯, 세계의 합병 이후 세상이 뒤죽박죽이 되었고, 시간과 자연의 법칙도 뒤바뀌었습니다. 당신에게 "
"가장 큰 위험은 꿈의 세계의 경계가 파괴되었다는 점입니다. 과거에 대한 환상이 현실화되고, 더 이상 잠을 잘 수 없습니다. 이것은 저주의 "
"일부입니다 — 그리고 당신과 왕국이 연결된 이후 가장 위험한 결과 중 하나입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "c53e290d-7733-4398-8e7d-7ced9859e2cd"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone has found it difficult, especially in the hours after the Worlds "
"Merger began. Those who could keep their sanity and escape are now either "
"hiding or surviving and helping others.\""
msgstr ""
"\"세계의 합병이 시작된 지 몇 시간 만에 모든 사람들이 어려움을 겪었습니다. 정신을 잃지 않고 도망갈 수 있는 사람들은 이제 숨어 "
"있거나 생존하여 다른 사람들을 돕고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0021_Text
msgctxt "14af101d-eaad-444a-8e17-78c483d32dad"
msgid ""
"\"Jhod Kavken gathered the remains of the capital guard and set off to {g|"
"Oleg's Trading Post}Oleg's Trading Post{/g} – to help hold back the shadows "
"that escaped from the cup.\""
msgstr ""
"\"조드 카브켄은 수도 경비대의 남은 병력을 모아 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}올렉의 교역소{/g}로 향했습니다. 잔에서 "
"빠져 나온 그림자를 막는 데 도움이 될 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "74d7662f-732b-442f-a7da-bb2950bb7778"
msgid ""
"\"Kesten {g|House Garess}Garess{/g}, with the remains of the capital guard, "
"has taken up position near {g|Oleg's Trading Post}Oleg's Trading Post{/g}. "
"The shadows of the Stag Lord's bandits that escaped the cup have gathered "
"there, and someone must repel them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"케스턴 {g|House Garess}가레스{/g}는 수도 경비대의 남은 병력을 데리고 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}올렉의 "
"교역소{/g} 근처에 자리 잡았습니다. 잔에서 도망친 수사슴 군주 잔존 세력이 그곳에 모여들었습니다. 누군가 그들을 물리쳐야 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "972a8eab-c867-4478-9d6f-4a32e0e9857c"
msgid ""
"\"Many shadows that escaped the Apology went to {g|Oleg's Trading Post}"
"Oleg's Trading Post{/g}, creating chaos and destruction along their way. "
"Jhod Kavken and Kesten {g|House Garess}Garess{/g} rallied the remains of the "
"guard and struck out to protect our citizens.\""
msgstr ""
"\"사죄를 빠져나온 그림자가 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}올렉의 교역소{/g}로 향했습니다. 그 길에는 혼돈과 파괴가 "
"뒤따랐지요. 조드 카브켄과 케스턴 {g|House Garess}가레스{/g}가 시민들을 보호하기 위해 남은 경비대를 이끌고 그곳으로 "
"진군했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "b49e52f8-608c-4bdb-846e-8265faf6cb62"
msgid ""
"\"Bartholomew Delgado was able to escape the capital, but then he was beset "
"by shadows of trolls from {g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}. They, like all the others, "
"appeared from the broken cup, and come to take revenge for ancient "
"grievances. If Bartholomew is still alive, you should look for him somewhere "
"in the old Trolls' Lair.\""
msgstr ""
"\"바솔로뮤 델가도는 수도를 벗어날 수 있었지만, 그때부터 그는 {g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g}에서 온 트롤들의 그림자에 "
"포위당했습니다. 그들은 다른 것들처럼 깨진 잔에서 나타났고, 고대에 겪었던 고통에 대한 복수를 한다. 바솔로뮤가 아직 살아 있다면, "
"당신은 옛 트롤 소굴의 어딘가에서 그를 찾을 수 있을 겁니다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0025_Text
msgctxt "3f9795a6-38c8-42d5-9251-4a6654a5e7e6"
msgid ""
"\"Tsanna went to {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} Shrine to honor her cruel "
"goddess and seek protection for herself and her pack.\""
msgstr ""
"\"산나는 그녀의 잔인한 여신을 기리고 자신과 자신의 신도를 보호하러 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 성소로 갔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "357ba3e3-fd3c-4b01-81b4-9a7e60562e43"
msgid ""
"\"{d|c31 Maegar Saved}Maegar Varn{/d} must be preparing a final stand at "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}. The city is in dire plight. — An army led by "
"Vordakai's own shadow is besieging it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{d|c31 Maegar Saved}메이가르 반{/d}은 반드시 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}에서 최후의 저항을 준비하고 있을 "
"겁니다. 도시는 심각한 곤경에 처해있습니다. 보다카이의 그림자가 이끄는 군대가 그곳을 포위했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0027_Text
msgctxt "e57b0721-914a-47fe-95b7-af144d26c423"
msgid ""
"\"Your advisor {d|c31 Vordakai Hired}Maegar{/d} went to "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}, but was beset by shadows. I know nothing more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신의 보좌관 {d|c31 Vordakai Hired}메이가르{/d}는 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}로 갔지만, 그림자에게 포위 "
"당했습니다. 더 이상은 알지 못합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "7ec4f179-cbd2-4910-8c0d-c6a29aef9d40"
msgid ""
"\"Your neighbors from Brevoy received word of the woes besetting your "
"kingdom, and went to the border. The Worlds Merger found them as they passed "
"the Flintrock Grassland. They were waylaid by an army of shadows. I can only "
"guess what is happening there now.\""
msgstr ""
"브레보이의 이웃들은 당신의 왕국이 포위되었다는 소식을 듣고 국경으로 갔습니다. 세계의 합병은 그들이 부싯 바위 초원을 지나갈 때 그들을 "
"발견했습니다. 그들은 그림자 군대에 의해 도적질 당했죠. 지금 알 수 있는 소식은 그것 뿐입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0029_Text
msgctxt "d8453315-03c8-409e-b523-1e07b4e31a58"
msgid ""
"\"Some of the citizens we saved were captured the moment Irovetti's shadow "
"emerged from the cup. They say he arrived as if to one of his glamorous "
"receptions, gave a flowery speech and departed for {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} to "
"restore what he had lost. Your governor is probably having a hard time right "
"now. I also heard that a beautiful nereid was captured by a shadow. – It "
"would appear that Evindra is in the hands of her tormentor once more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 구한 시민들의 일부는 잔에서 나온 이로베티의 그림자에 의해 잡혔습니다. 그들은 마치 매혹적인 피로연 중 하나에 도착한 것처럼 "
"아름다운 연설을 하고, {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}로 향해 그가 잃어버린 것을 수복하려 합니다. 당신의 총독은 지금 힘든 시기를 보내고 "
"있을 겁니다. 또한 저는 아름다운 네레이드가 그림자에 사로 잡혔다는 이야기도 들었습니다. – 에빈드라가 다시 한번 악당의 손에 잡힌 것 "
"같습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0030_Text
msgctxt "66af598f-4fe8-4cd5-95e6-69330efcf757"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure, Your Highness? You will have to fight the "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} and all his servants with but a handful of comrades...\""
msgstr ""
"\"확신하십니까, 전하? 당신은 소수의 동료들만 이끌고 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}와 그의 모든 하인들과 싸워야 합니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0031_Text
msgctxt "e568c7b4-8199-42f9-9f5c-c505180f7a6f"
msgid ""
"\"Are you sure, Your Highness? Will the forces you have assembled be enough "
"to overcome the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} and the horde of shadows "
"flooding the capital?\""
msgstr ""
"\"확신하십니까, 전하? 당신이 모은 군대가 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}과 수도를 휩쓰는 그림자 군단을 이길 수 있겠습니까? "
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "a7612ff2-ea1b-428c-8fd3-63a960da34a1"
msgid "\"Of course, Your Highness. My powers are at your service.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다, 전하. 힘 닿는 데까지 돕겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0039_Text
msgctxt "d77f9cc2-a119-4cac-83a2-1d1cbdb9234c"
msgid ""
"\"He is the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} of laughter, mischief, and transformation — "
"the most unpredictable creature of the unpredictable {g|First World}First "
"World{/g}. You will never guess what stands behind his actions. An evil "
"prank might lead to a great good, and a virtuous gift to a terrible tragedy. "
"As far as I can judge by the stories I've heard, the {g|LanternKing}Lantern "
"King{/g} is not an evil creature. But each deity has its role in the "
"structure of the world. Laughter, mischief and transformation is a strange "
"and powerful mixture, and one can only guess how it will affect this fate or "
"that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 웃음, 장난, 변화의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}입니다. 예측할 수 없는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 가장 "
"예측할 수 없는 생물이지요. 그의 행동 뒤에 무슨 의도가 깔려 있는지는 결코 짐작할 수 없을 겁니다. 사악한 장난은 위대하고 좋은 "
"선물로, 그리고 다시 위대한 재앙과 끔찍한 비극으로 이어질 수 있습니다. 제가 들었던 이야기를 통해 추측하자면, "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 악한 생물이 아닙니다. 그러나 각 신은 각 세계에서 역할을 맡죠. 웃음, 장난, 변형은 "
"이상하고 강력한 조합이며, 어떤 영향을 미칠 수 있는지는 짐작할 수밖에 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "d5dd4fd8-4357-4f92-bac9-e640856ef5ff"
msgid "\"I see you are ready. You will make history this day.\""
msgstr "\"준비가 되셨군요. 당신은 오늘 역사를 만드실 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0041_Text
msgctxt "ce07db84-5651-4ccf-b7ec-091836f5f04b"
msgid "\"Of course. Tell me when you are ready.\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다. 준비가 되면 알려주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "10648e22-9aa0-44dd-a8df-442eae523437"
msgid ""
"\"Very well, so be it! Our main forces will march now for the city, Your "
"Highness, and I shall go with them. We will attempt to engage most of the "
"Apology's shadows, and the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King's{/g} minions. Look "
"for me in the city if you need rest! And... good luck!\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋습니다, 그렇게 하시지요! 저희 주력 부대가 도시에 진격할 것입니다, 전하, 그리고 저는 그들과 함께 가겠습니다. 저희는 사죄의 "
"그림자들 대부분과 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 수하들을 처리하겠습니다. 휴식이 필요하시게 되면 도시에서 저를 찾으십시오! "
"그리고... 행운을 빕니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0045_Text
msgctxt "731983db-cbfd-407e-93ec-013e3c8344b5"
msgid ""
"\"Of course you can always count on my help, and the help of your companions "
"and fellow travelers.\""
msgstr "\"물론 언제든지 제 도움과, 당신의 동료와 우호적인 여행자들의 도움을 받으실 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0046_Text
msgctxt "91b417e8-2c5f-4f61-bc77-9922973c7fc6"
msgid ""
"\"The warrior queen Bdaah sends regards to her ally, and is eager to take "
"part in a battle with the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}.\""
msgstr "\"전사 여왕 브다는 그녀의 동맹국에게 인사를 전하며, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}와의 전투에 참여하기를 열망합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0047_Text
msgctxt "22c1a4fa-3233-4c29-9b2e-019d4d4afd01"
msgid "\"Chief Sootscale and his kobolds have come to support their friend.\""
msgstr "\"검댕비늘 족장과 그의 코볼트들이 친구를 지원하기 위해 왔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0048_Text
msgctxt "9144d8c1-16dc-44e0-afa9-f0e653ad1408"
msgid ""
"\"The lizardfolk, who you freed from the power of Count Shimmerglow, have "
"come to the capital and are ready to join your forces in the battle.\""
msgstr "\"당신께서 쉬머글로우 백작에게 해방시켜주셨던 도마뱀인간들이 수도에 왔고, 전투에서 당신의 세력에 합류할 준비가 되었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0049_Text
msgctxt "907c7609-ae9b-4fd1-b58e-c5434a4c1f22"
msgid ""
"\"You managed to make friends among very different creatures – including "
"goblins! Their delegation is ready to join your army.\""
msgstr "\"당신은 고블린을 포함하여 매우 다양한 생물들과 친구를 맺으셨습니다! 그들의 대표단이 군대에 합류할 준비가 되어있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0050_Text
msgctxt "e8b1c66d-68d2-4062-ba4d-485862247f69"
msgid ""
"\"Although all your troubles come from {g|First World}the First World{/g}, "
"some of its dwellers are on your side. Some fey have come and offered help "
"in the battle to come.\""
msgstr ""
"\"당신께서 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에서 일으켰던 모든 문제들에도 불구하고, 일부 거주자들이 당신의 편에 섰습니다. "
"몇몇 페이가 찾아와서 곧 있을 전투에 도움을 주겠다고 했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0051_Text
msgctxt "dc85aa83-17c8-4f8f-bb1e-b0ea6b174492"
msgid ""
"\"Sometimes help comes from unexpected places. A group of former — and not "
"so former – bandits have joined the army.\""
msgstr "\"때로는 예기치 못한 곳에서 도움을 받습니다. 전직과 현직 도적들이 군대에 합류했습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0052_Text
msgctxt "33ebdc4e-fca7-44b2-9f97-1ddf3f5d9769"
msgid ""
"\"{d|c41 Darven Nice}Darven{/d} from Brineheart has come to carry out his "
"duty as an ally.\""
msgstr "\"브라인하트의 {d|c41 Darven Nice}다르벤{/d}이 동맹국으로서의 의무를 수행하러 왔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0053_Text
msgctxt "c737d70c-3411-42bb-abba-60c0b22b11c5"
msgid ""
"\"The nymph Nyrissa, a most unexpected and awaited ally, is ready to share "
"with you all the risks of the coming confrontation with the {g|LanternKing}"
"Lantern King{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"가장 예상치 못했고 또한 기다려왔던 동맹인 님프 나이리사는, 앞으로 다가올 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}과의 충돌에서 "
"위험을 함께 나눌 준비가 되어있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0054_Text
msgctxt "04fc467e-47f2-4886-aadc-491dcac2f6cc"
msgid ""
"\"The army of {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g}, led by its governor, is ready for battle.\""
msgstr "\"총독이 이끄는 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g} 군대는 전투 준비가 끝났습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0055_Text
msgctxt "d05415fe-3bea-476a-bd24-6974bebb3b2e"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Swordlords}Aldori{/g} forces are here. Lady Jamandi and her most "
"loyal officers will lead them in battle.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Swordlords}알도리{/g} 군대가 여기 왔습니다. 자만디 공과 그녀의 가장 충성스러운 장교들이 전투에서 그들을 이끌 "
"것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0056_Text
msgctxt "95dc3162-534c-4b2c-86b3-8cf622ac74bd"
msgid ""
"\"Shandra Mervey and Lady {g|House Surtova}Surtova{/g} have brought soldiers "
"from {g|Brevoy}Brevoy{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"샨드라 머비와 {g|House Surtova}서토바{/g} 부인이 {g|Brevoy}브레보이{/g}의 병력을 이끌고 왔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0057_Text
msgctxt "6292ae10-9820-4357-b83a-2ed31bff5713"
msgid ""
"\"We have unexpected news: none other than Lander {g|House Lebeda}Lebeda{/g} "
"has come to our camp with his people. He is eager to help you in the "
"upcoming battle. This might be an attempt to apologize...\""
msgstr ""
"\"예기치 않은 소식이 있다. 랜더 {g|House Lebeda}레베다{/g}가 그의 병력과 함께 우리 진영에 왔습니다. 그는 다가오는 "
"전투에서 당신을 돕고자 합니다. 사과의 의미인 것 같습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0058_Text
msgctxt "144ffa93-a2f2-486e-8ce3-bb0a7d03ef3f"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}Armag and his warriors{/g} are awaiting your signal to "
"begin the attack.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Tiger Lords}아르막과 그의 전사들{/g}이 공격 신호를 기다리고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0059_Text
msgctxt "2d054563-e5c1-490e-bc63-e2c315f2d935"
msgid ""
"\"{g|Tiger Lords}Dugath and his warriors{/g} have come to support you.\""
msgstr "\"{g|Tiger Lords}두가스와 그의 전사들{/g}이 당신을 도우러 왔습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0061_Text_String
msgctxt "6f92b340-d4e4-4edb-950a-985486a3fe34"
msgid ""
"\"{d|Varn}Maegar Varn{/d} and his people will fight for you as they'd fight "
"for their own lives.\""
msgstr "\"메이가르 반과 그의 백성은 자신의 삶을 위해 싸우는 것처럼 당신을 위해 싸울 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0062_Text
msgctxt "c3bac2e3-09e3-4e50-b097-3f299f2c1858"
msgid "\"Tartuk sent us a few branded trolls to help.\""
msgstr "\"타툭이 저희를 돕기 위해 정예 트롤들을 보냈습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0063_Text
msgctxt "22b4a6af-15ef-4f59-b41b-e82ab1bb2cab"
msgid "\"Hargulka and his trolls are ready to aid us in the coming battle.\""
msgstr "\"하굴카와 그의 트롤들은 다가오는 전투에서 저희를 도울 준비가 되어있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0064_Text
msgctxt "28c49ad5-136d-456c-af4f-f626280d546c"
msgid ""
"\"The capital guard have returned from the {g|Oleg's Trading Post}Trading "
"Post{/g} and await your orders.\""
msgstr "\"수도 경비대가 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g}에서 돌아왔고 당신의 명령을 기다리고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "d0510396-40bd-49a2-afa1-2bb04e6134e3"
msgid ""
"\"Second – while the Worlds Merger is tormenting the kingdom, you will not "
"be able to rest and restore your spells in the normal way. This seems a "
"special gift from the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} — to let you fight for "
"your life, but make it so that fighting leads inevitably to exhaustion and "
"death. But I can guard you from this for a short time. Come to me if you "
"need rest. But be careful — this takes time, and time is not on your side.\""
msgstr ""
"\"둘째, 세계의 합병이 왕국을 괴롭히는 동안, 평소와 같이 쉬면서 주문을 회복할 수는 없을 겁니다. "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 당신을 위해 준비한 선물인 것 같군요 — 당신이 목숨을 걸고 싸우도록, 하지만 전투가 필연적인 "
"고갈과 죽음으로 이어지게 만들도록. 하지만 잠시 동안은 제가 당신을 지킬 수 있습니다. 휴식이 필요하시다면 저에게 오십시오. 그러나 "
"조심하십시오. 휴식 또한 시간이 걸리며, 시간은 당신의 편이 아닙니다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0067_Text
msgctxt "b532d42e-1974-439e-a297-1f59bcbf1498"
msgid ""
"{n}The Storyteller pauses.{/n} \"I... do not know. The crucial knowledge "
"just appeared in my mind, as though someone whispered it into my ear. "
"Yesterday, I had no idea I was capable of wielding such powerful magics or "
"holding such vast knowledge, and look at me now.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이야기꾼이 멈춥니다.{/n} \"저는... 모르겠습니다. 누군가가 제 귀에 속삭이는 것처럼 중요한 지식이 제 머리 속에 "
"나타났습니다. 어제까지, 제가 그렇게 강력한 마법을 휘두르거나 방대한 지식을 지녔을 거라 상상도 못했습니다만, 지금의 저를 보십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0068_Text
msgctxt "752fbdee-843d-41e6-8273-f78297988c35"
msgid ""
"\"One might assume this was due to the experience I acquired while living "
"through my stories... but I doubt that idea. I even doubt now whether I am "
"an elf, or somebody... perhaps something else. However, this mystery is not "
"important just now. We will deal with it after we save your kingdom.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가는 제 이야기를 통해 살아가는 동안 얻은 경험으로 인한 것이라고 생각할 수도 있지만... 저는 그 생각이 의심스럽습니다. 심지어 "
"제가 엘프인지 다른 어떤 것인지조차 의문이죠... 그러나, 지금 당장은 이 수수께끼가 중요하지 않습니다. 저희는 당신의 왕국을 구한 후에 "
"그것을 처리할 것입니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "d24e72e2-ed71-49ff-a8dc-0daec6fc7dff"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, Your Highness...\" {n}The Storyteller stops abruptly and "
"frowns.{/n} \"I feel the presence of a new threat. What is happening?\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론입니다, 전하...\" {n}이야기꾼은 갑자기 멈추고는 찡그립니다.{/n} \"새로운 위협의 존재가 느껴집니다. 무슨 일이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "f02e4054-ce86-42f6-bcd0-cd394d734049"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness! I sense the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King's{/g} curse still "
"lingers over you! The enemy has a sword to your throat, and with a single "
"move can end your life. Yet he waits, for now, enjoying his performance. "
"Beware, he will use the curse to his advantage, as soon as he senses danger. "
"You should lift the effects of Lantern King's curse, by gathering your "
"allies and restoring your kingdom, before you move to challenge him directly."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하! {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 저주가 여전히 당신께 닿는 것이 느껴집니다! 적이 당신의 목에 칼을 들이대고 있고, "
"그가 손가락만 까딱여도 당신의 삶을 앗아갈 수 있습니다. 아직까지, 그는 자기 공연을 즐기면서 기다립니다. 조심하십시오, 그는 저주를 "
"이용해서 위험한 순간에 이득을 볼 것입니다. 그에게 직접 도전하기 전에, 당신은 동맹을 모으고 왕국을 회복함으로써 등불왕의 저주를 "
"극복해야만 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Issili(HubVendor)/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "53390e63-05ab-4be8-b763-147240b4842d"
msgid "\"I want to look at your wares.\""
msgstr "\"너의 물건을 보고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Issili(HubVendor)/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "d143d2a2-73f3-4240-b0e3-97dcd01d7047"
msgid "\"Doesn't it bother you that I killed you?\""
msgstr "\"내가 널 죽인 것이 신경쓰이나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Issili(HubVendor)/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "221bef5f-380c-4275-88bd-111ecb25de77"
msgid "\"Aren't you afraid of enraging the Lantern King by helping me?\""
msgstr "\"나를 돕다가 등불왕의 분노를 살까 두렵지 않나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Issili(HubVendor)/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "37dc9f75-6477-44ed-af54-7b709bbdae28"
msgid "\"I have to go. So long!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Issili(HubVendor)/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "7f257d18-f3d0-4bf5-ae23-dd1b6acd5bb9"
msgid ""
"{n}A familiar fey gives you a broad and innocent smile.{/n} \"Have I told "
"you how much I admire you? Well, I do! You are followed by catastrophe and "
"trouble everywhere you go — and where there's catastrophe and trouble, "
"there's profits, haha!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}익숙한 페이가 당신에게 온화하고 순수한 미소를 지어줍니다.{/n} \"내가 너를 얼마나 존경하는지 말했니? 정말이야! 네가 가는 "
"곳마다 재앙과 고난이 찾아와. 그리고 재앙과 고난이 있는 곳에는 이익이 있지. 하하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Issili(HubVendor)/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "864e56fb-c4fa-4928-907a-17fa95aa4611"
msgid ""
"\"By the way, how about buying the Complete Collection of Useless Writings? "
"I brought it especially for you!\"\n"
"{n}Issili winks.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그런데, 쓸모없는 글쓰기의 완전판을 구입하는 것은 어때? 너를 위해 가져왔어!\" \n"
"{n}이실리가 윙크합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Issili(HubVendor)/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ad4f4cfe-5e0f-4d01-a4ad-ea61596ac120"
msgid ""
"{n}Issili sighs.{/n} \"Just between us, almost every second customer is "
"trying to kill us — just because we're Messengers from Profiteering on "
"Others' Misfortunes!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이실리가 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"너에게만 얘기하는 건데, 거의 매 순간마다 고객이 우리를 죽이려 해 — 우리가 남의 불행에서 "
"폭리를 취하는 천막의 전령이라는 이유만으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Issili(HubVendor)/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "85204ece-70b0-4f86-b6ba-a1af5671caf6"
msgid ""
"\"First of all, I'm not helping you. I'm... so to speak, robbing you blind — "
"and not for the first time. Second, it's a question of professional pride. "
"The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}, I'll have you know, is a patron of the "
"Witchmarket, which is a traveling company that sells anything and "
"everything. In a word, they're my competitors. If you can get the better of "
"their master, I'd be endlessly, immeasurably happy!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우선, 나는 너를 돕는게 아니야. 나는... 말하자면, 너를 등쳐먹는 거야 —그리고 처음도 아니잖아. 둘째로, 그건 직업적인 자부심의 "
"문제야. 알려줄게 하나 있는데, {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 마녀 상회의 후원자야. 걔들은 무엇이든지 얼마든지 파는 "
"보따리상이지. 한마디로, 그들은 내 경쟁자야. 그들의 주인보다 더 좋은 후원자를 얻을 수 있으면, 나는 끝없이, 헤아릴 수 없이 행복할 "
"거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Items/UselessBooks_description_String
msgctxt "b4609602-6cba-4da1-8e44-1d8ef60d583e"
msgid ""
"The book's pages are absolutely empty, except for the first, which boasts a "
"sloppy inscription: \"Feel free to write anything. The title allows for "
"complete creative freedom!\""
msgstr ""
"이 책의 페이지는 완전히 비어 있습니다. 첫 번째 글을 제외하고는... \"아무 내용이나 쓰십시오. 제목은 창의력이 풍부한 사람이 쓰면 "
"더 좋습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/Items/UslessBooks_name_String
msgctxt "55e24f68-639d-4fe6-8cf0-17d6f845ad55"
msgid "\"The Complete Collection of Useless Writings\""
msgstr "\"쓸모없는 글쓰기의 완전판\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "75842ef7-2ead-405d-8ac8-9e624ac316f7"
msgid "\"What will you do when we win?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 이기면 무엇을 할거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "21977be6-4f15-41c4-92ba-69189ab3d58e"
msgid "\"Will you help me in the battle with the Lantern King?\""
msgstr "\"등불왕과의 전투에서 나를 도울 수 있겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "2ca2c55a-2fea-482a-bc3e-8444c94ee9f0"
msgid "\"I see you've made peace with Evindra...\""
msgstr "\"에빈드라랑 화해했다던데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "cf0b7429-115b-4b8a-8311-44d579ce6598"
msgid "\"Did you figure out what we learned from the Eldest?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 원로에게 배운 것을 이해했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c835a691-cef8-4d00-bec3-915f76ac4749"
msgid "\"I have to go. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "a36096d7-3453-4b7d-844c-762e88f0dd38"
msgid ""
"\"So strange. We've been through more than many have in ages, but we've "
"barely ever... talked.\" {n}Nyrissa's soft smile lights up her face like the "
"springtime sun.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"이상하군. 우리는 수 년을 함께 보냈지만, 얘기를 많이 나누지는 않았어...\" {n}나이리사의 부드러운 미소가 봄의 햇볕처럼 그녀의 "
"얼굴을 밝게 비춥니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "21f4ea41-1632-4168-9879-ca4ebb02ee4d"
msgid ""
"\"It pains me to see the wound that the curse has left on your soul. Oh, how "
"I wish it were my burden alone...\""
msgstr "\"저주가 네 영혼에 남긴 상처를 보기가 고통스러워. 차라리 내가 질 짐이었다면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d9853f1c-e30c-475e-8985-152e5b56d2a4"
msgid ""
"\"And my poor {d|c41 Good Sister}sister{/d}...\" {n}Nyrissa stops for a "
"while. It's obviously hard for her to talk about it.{/n} \"I hope our "
"victory over the curse will somehow heal her too. I know I caused harm to "
"thousands of thousands of innocents in {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. I ravaged "
"many lives, even your robin bard — and the guilt burns my heart. But I don't "
"regret anything so much as what I did to my sisters — those who followed me "
"into exile and were ready to share all my pains...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 내 불쌍한 {d|c41 Good Sister}자매{/d}... \" {n}나이리사는 잠시 말을 잇지 못합니다. 그녀가 그에 "
"대해 이야기하는 것은 분명 어려운 일입니다.{/n} \"저주를 이겨내는 게 그 아이도 어떻게든 치유해줬으면 좋겠어. 나는 "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 수천수만 명의 무고한 사람들에게 해를 끼쳤어. 많은 목숨을 앗아갔지. 심지어 너의 울새 바드도. "
"죄책감 때문에 마음이 너무 아파. 하지만 가장 후회되는 건 내가 내 자매들에게 한 짓이야. 나를 따르며 내 모든 고통을 함께 나눌 준비가 "
"되었던 자매들에게...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "cd744aac-694e-4106-b535-aa15315a3fa3"
msgid ""
"\"My grumpy cousin...\" {n}Nyrissa says with both bitterness and tenderness "
"in her voice.{/n} \"She'd never leave me in trouble. She would run to my "
"rescue, scolding me the whole time!\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 심술 궂은 사촌...\" {n}나이리사는 괴로움과 부드러움을 담긴 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \"그 아이는 내가 곤경에 처하면 "
"내버려두지 않을거야. 나를 구하러 달려와서, 내내 나를 꾸짖을 테지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "c0bc652a-ea48-40aa-bb3c-d212ff19adf6"
msgid "\"Of course. I would never abandon you.\""
msgstr "\"물론. 나는 결코 너를 버리지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "486b472b-9909-4693-812a-553f73e435c3"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not looking that far ahead. But you know... I don't want to go back to "
"{g|First World}the First World{/g} — not at all. I'd rather stay here, in "
"the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}, and help heal the wounds I've made. "
"Let my power serve what it was supposed to — creation, joy, and spring.\n"
"Besides,\" {n}Nyrissa whispers,{/n} \"there's someone here I don't want to "
"part with.\""
msgstr ""
"\"거기까진 생각 안해봤어. 근데 너도 알겠지만... 나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 돌아가고 싶지 않아, 전혀. "
"나는 여기 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}에 머무르며 내가 남긴 상처를 치유할 거야. 나는 내 힘을 창조, 기쁨, 봄에 "
"쏟겠어.\n"
"게다가,\" {n}나이리사가 속삭입니다.{/n} \"헤어지기 싫은 사람도 여기 있으니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "d04c21c5-e3ae-48d1-a8ad-fc95ef3eabdf"
msgid "\"Take care. And come back to me...\""
msgstr "\"조심해. 그리고 내 곁에 돌아와줘...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "aa478cbe-f568-406b-9b5a-508002953f13"
msgid ""
"\"I hope so, and I'm preparing for the final battle and what will follow. "
"The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} put weapons in our hands. Now we just have to use "
"them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러길 바라고 있어. 마지막 전투와 그 후의 일들을 준비하고 있지. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 우리 손에 무기를 쥐어 주었으니, "
"이제 그 무기를 사용할 시간이야. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/AmiriPartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "f5e6368e-1310-4d7f-8459-dc0e487b9a2a"
msgid ""
"[Jokingly punch Amiri on the shoulder] \"So, warrior, are you ready to beat "
"the hell out of the Eldest and his minions?\""
msgstr "[농담하며 아미리의 어깨를 두드립니다] \"그래서 전사여. 너는 원로와 그의 부하를 때려눕힐 준비가 되었나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/AmiriPartingDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "11c949dc-a9a9-4c43-8ab3-9bd41b204b23"
msgid "\"Do you want to tell me anything before we set off for battle?\""
msgstr "\"우리가 전투를 시작하기 전에 하고 싶은 말이 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/AmiriPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e9a328d8-a8e1-4dbb-be96-5bdfcbbfa85c"
msgid "\"All right, enough talk. I know you don't like it.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 이야기는 충분하다. 말로 떠드는건 네 취향이 아니니까.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/AmiriPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8416bb27-f336-4228-ae84-9ec54ec30501"
msgid ""
"{n}Amiri ruffles her dark hair with her hand.{/n} \"Ha... We were just "
"getting ready for our last great battle — and now we're doing it again! It's "
"a good thing I decided to follow you back there at Aldori's. You definitely "
"know how to have fun, chief!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}아미리는 손으로 그녀의 검은 머리를 헝클어뜨립니다.{/n} \"하... 아까까지 전투준비를 하고 있었는데. 뭘 또 하라는 거야! "
"알도리 저택에서 널 따라가길 잘했어. 넌 확실히 재미라는게 뭔지 아는 녀석이야, 대장!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/AmiriPartingDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "019e5540-8584-4962-b3a0-4984bba96589"
msgid ""
"\"I do! You're a good chief, and our tribe is all right, and we've been "
"through a lot of good fights! Don't think I'm sucking up or something... "
"it's just that I live like I want now. And that makes me sing inside!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래! 너는 좋은 대장이고, 우리 부족은 괜찮아. 그리고 우리는 여태껏 좋은 싸움을 많이 해왔지! 아첨한다고 생각하지 마... "
"알잖아? 난 당장 내가 살고 싶은 대로 사는 거. 그러면 절로 노래가 나온다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/AmiriPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "80ed1440-9e6d-4f12-b467-e3d76311ed0d"
msgid ""
"{n}The barbarian grins, then returns the friendly jab.{/n} \"Oh no, I'm not "
"ready! Wait, I need to polish my sword — and tie some ribbons to my belt! "
"Then I'll be ready for battle!\" {n}Amiri laughs, pleased with her joke.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}바바리안이 낄낄댔고, 친근하게 당신을 툭 칩니다.{/n} \"오. 아니. 준비 안됐어! 기다려. 내 검을 닦고 허리띠에 리본을 "
"묶어야 해! 그래야 전투 준비를 마친 거야!\" {n}아미리는 웃으며 농담에 만족했습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/AmiriPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "a7feb908-1b04-4259-9594-23afd7b49cf1"
msgid "\"Right! Go on, chief, give the order!\""
msgstr "\"좋아! 대장! 명령을 내려줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/EkunPartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "9407fe2d-3ce0-4ea6-8faf-3f6ac41ac1d1"
msgid ""
"\"I just want to say, you've been a loyal companion, Ekun. It's good to have "
"someone to rely on in such a dark hour.\""
msgstr "\"나는 단지 네가 충성스러운 동료라는 걸 말하고 싶었다. 에쿤. 어둠의 시간에 의지할 사람이 있는 것은 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/EkunPartingDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "fb40a302-9e1d-4aa4-b527-ba0e22a307bc"
msgid "\"Are you afraid of what's ahead?\""
msgstr "\"앞으로의 일이 두려운가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/EkunPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "a8f322b3-a663-4604-9ed2-5bc64123a0a3"
msgid "\"It's time to go. Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"갈 시간이야. 준비 됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/EkunPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "fd4c622b-c7c4-4959-85ce-90bb077ecb2a"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun nods to you briefly. You feel energy and determination in his "
"movements.{/n} \"The curse didn't break you. Good. But we must hurry. This "
"madness must be stopped, once and for all.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에쿤은 간단히 끄덕입니다. 그의 움직임에서 힘과 결단력을 느낍니다.{/n} \"저주가 너를 망가뜨리지 않았군. 다행이다. 하지만 "
"우리는 서둘러야한다. 이 광기는 반드시 확실하게 멈춰야한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/EkunPartingDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "b45f7f6b-929a-4a81-ac14-2963f5a5897c"
msgid ""
"{n}Ekun's face, usually still, brightens with gratitude. He clasps his hand "
"to his heart.{/n} \"Words of a worthy leader are a better reward than honors "
"and gold. We've come a long way. May the ones ahead be longer and lighter.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}항상 무표정이던 에쿤의 얼굴이 감사로 빛납니다. 그는 손으로 가슴을 움켜쥡니다.{/n} \"가치있는 지도자의 말은 명예와 금보다 더 "
"나은 보상이다. 우리는 먼 길을 왔다. 그 길이 더 길어지고 밝아지길.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/EkunPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8cdeea9c-bd38-4698-9310-04779d4a9c88"
msgid ""
"\"No. We are going to fight for our home, for the laughter of children yet "
"to be born. That evil outsider god fights only for his pride. He cannot win."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아니. 우리는 고향을 위해, 아직 태어나지 않은 아이들의 웃음소리를 위해 싸울 것이다. 그 악한 외차원의 신은 자존심만을 위해 "
"싸우지. 그는 이길 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/EkunPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "bd35c7fa-a5aa-4ce8-ab4d-7ec6a0a17fcf"
msgid "\"Lead. I will follow.\""
msgstr "\"앞서라. 따라가겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/HarrimPartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "4fb4f4c4-9473-430f-93b2-96aec86c100c"
msgid ""
"\"I don't even know if this means anything to you, Harrim. But I'm glad "
"you're among my companions.\""
msgstr "\"이것이 너에게 어떤 의미가 있는지 몰라. 하림. 하지만 네가 동료인 것을 기쁘게 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/HarrimPartingDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "7e6b0619-c10c-487a-a8d7-3f203fbf3a7c"
msgid "\"You look so peaceful.\""
msgstr "\"너는 너무 평화롭게 보인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/HarrimPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "042cea17-9bfd-4557-b44f-eea0c9e9cfe0"
msgid "\"We have to go. The Lantern King won't wait...\""
msgstr "\"우리 가야 해. 등불왕은 기다리지 않을 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/HarrimPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2cbca81d-1f8b-43f5-ac64-c18131857509"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim is fiddling with his beard pensively.{/n} \"A menacing hour. A "
"simple mind might see in it the end of times, and the triumph of "
"{g|Groetus}Groetus{/g}. But alas, these are only the games of a foolish "
"deity, wrapped in the vanity of the {g|First World}First World{/g}...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 생각에 잠겨 수염을 만지작거립니다.{/n} \"위협적인 시간이었다. 단순히 생각하면 시간의 끝이며, "
"{g|Groetus}그로투스{/g}의 승리를 볼 수 있을테지. 그러나, 이것들은 자만에 빠진 어리석은 {g|First World}태초 "
"세계{/g}의 신의 게임일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/HarrimPartingDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "b08733c0-0902-49c8-b5be-7bb563e23bb8"
msgid ""
"{n}Harrim looks at you, astonished, as if he's just awakened and opened his "
"eyes.{/n} \"Your words seem strange to me. But something in them warms my "
"old soul...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하림은 놀라서 일어나 눈을 뜬 것처럼 놀랐습니다.{/n} \"너의 말은 내게 이상하게 들리는군. 하지만 그들 안에 있는 뭔가가 내 "
"늙은 영혼을 따뜻하게 한다네...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/HarrimPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "2e2fc5b8-c44b-417b-9e1a-03c9f3777ca4"
msgid ""
"\"This is true. Everything unfolds the best possible way. If we meet our "
"death in the coming battle, it will be a wonderful ending. If we win... "
"although it's a pointless act... I will also be satisfied. It would be wrong "
"to bow to this self-proclaimed {g|LanternKing}'lantern' king{/g}.\"\n"
"{n}Harrim shakes his head with disapproval.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 사실이네. 모든 것이 최선의 방법으로 전개되지. 우리가 다가오는 전투에서 죽음을 만난다면, 멋진 결말이 되겠군. 우리가 "
"이기면... 무의미한 행동일지라도... 나 또한 만족할 것이다. 자칭 {g|LanternKing}'등불'왕{/g}에게 굴복하는 것은 "
"잘못된 일이야.\" \n"
"{n}하림은 불만으로 고개를 젓습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/HarrimPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "75eb0645-6f99-416c-99cf-1316c7015733"
msgid ""
"\"Indeed. We must quench that false light, so it doesn't confuse the souls "
"of those who look on it.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다. 그것을 본 사람들의 영혼이 혼동하지 않도록, 우리가 그 거짓된 빛을 꺼야만 한다네.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JaethalPartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "e3684ea1-d976-456c-81a7-dc848d78e00d"
msgid ""
"\"You know, when I forged an alliance with a mysterious undead companion, I "
"never imagined how valuable you would become, and how much we'd go through "
"together.\""
msgstr ""
"\"있잖아, 신비한 언데드 동지와 동맹을 맺었을 때, 네가 얼마나 소중한 존재가 될지, 우리가 얼마나 오래 함께할지 상상도 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JaethalPartingDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "faa61fe9-caa6-417a-9eb2-8ceec04f6cbd"
msgid ""
"\"Are you afraid of the upcoming battle? You're not one to risk your life "
"for a good cause.\""
msgstr "\"다가오는 전투가 두렵지 않아? 너는 옳은 일에 목숨을 버릴 사람이 아닐텐데.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JaethalPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "6f47196b-891c-434c-b906-4c1cab6c4639"
msgid "\"It's time. A battle with the Eldest awaits.\""
msgstr "\"이제 시간이 되었다. 원로와의 전투가 기다리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JaethalPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "935c67f8-f464-4f45-b33d-0b51b54e9aa7"
msgid ""
"{n}Jaethal stands still, her face calm as glassy water. And yet you feel the "
"tension in her pose, like a drawn bowstring.{/n} \"We're ready to march, are "
"we not? At last. This waiting is exhausting.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}제이탈은 여전히 서있고 그녀의 얼굴은 유리잔의 물처럼 차분합니다. 그럼에도 불구하고 그녀는 당겨진 활시위처럼 동작에서 긴장감을 "
"느낍니다.{/n} \"우리는 행진할 준비가 되어있다, 안그래? 마침내. 기다리다 지치겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JaethalPartingDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "f1d5bfaf-e5fa-4392-bb28-099e227ed942"
msgid ""
"\"It's not the first time I've heard someone praise my skills, but hearing "
"it from you is especially enjoyable. You are an excellent leader. I hope you "
"know that's not flattery — I don't flatter and I'm no good at it. It's just "
"a sign of respect — from one worthy companion to another.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누군가가 내 기술을 칭찬하는 것은 처음이 아니지만, 너에게서 그 말을 듣는 것은 특히 즐겁다. 너는 탁월한 지도자이다. 이게 아첨이 "
"아니라는 것을 알기를 바라지 — 나는 아첨한 것도 아니고 그걸 잘하지도 않으니. 가치있는 동료가 다른 동료에게 하는 존경의 표시일 뿐이다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JaethalPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "880e52ed-c089-4755-95a7-71d34dffb264"
msgid ""
"\"I know the wrath and mercy of true deities. The games of the {g|First "
"World}First World{/g} pretender don't scare me. And yes, you are absolutely "
"right about me. However, I value justified risk and mutually beneficial "
"alliance. No serious goals can be achieved without them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 진짜 신들의 진노와 자비를 안다. {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g} 흉내꾼들의 게임은 두렵지 않아. 그리고 너는 "
"나를 정확히 판단했다. 그러나, 나는 합리적인 위험과 상호 이익이 되는 동맹을 중시한다. 그것들 없이는 중대한 목표를 달성할 수 없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JaethalPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "21884924-5525-4204-85ce-4b014bd07fef"
msgid "\"Point me to the goal. I'll handle the rest... One way or another.\""
msgstr "\"목표를 가리켜라. 내가 나머지를 처리 할 것이다... 어느 쪽이건 간에.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JubilostPartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "b5eb52d9-7dac-4127-b417-58d52f0a1740"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, you haven't always been easy to tolerate, but I'm glad we "
"reached the end of this adventure together.\""
msgstr "\"물론. 항상 용인하는 것이 쉽지는 않았지만, 우리가 모험의 끝에 함께 도달했다는게 기쁘다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JubilostPartingDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e9ad8e77-0735-4e80-9144-c199b7c44d90"
msgid "\"Do you have any regrets?\""
msgstr "\"후회돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JubilostPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "cd3c55b3-e924-485a-a993-2672b0c5f60f"
msgid ""
"\"Well, it's time to get to work. To ask, as you put it, that we be left "
"alone.\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 이제 일할 시간이다. 네가 말했듯이 우리는 홀로남겨질 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JubilostPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "a71c283e-1058-4e0f-995c-c57f519b70e5"
msgid ""
"{n}Jubilost shifts from one foot to the other, either from anxiety or "
"impatience.{/n} \"I look around and I think — should we really have been so "
"eager to get to {g|First World}the First World{/g}? I suppose it's time we "
"ask that he leave our lands alone and take himself back where he comes "
"from...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}주빌로스트는 불안이나 조바심이 나 이리저리 이동합니다.{/n} \"나는 주변을 둘러보며 생각했다 — 우리가 진짜 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}에 가기를 갈망했었나? 나는 지금이 그에게 우리 영토를 내버려두고 왔던 곳으로 돌아가라고 요구해야할 시간이라고 "
"생각해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JubilostPartingDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "99a60efa-a99e-486b-b8fa-46926486ebc4"
msgid ""
"\"Jubilost Narthropple, the most unbearable researcher of "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, at your service!\" {n}Jubilost makes a curt bow, "
"then scratches the back of his head and sighs.{/n} \"We've seen a lot "
"together. I hope you've said that for a reason, and the good memories "
"outweigh the bad ones just a little bit!\""
msgstr ""
"\"주빌로스트 나트로플. {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}에서 가장 참을 수 없는 연구원이 너를 섬긴다!\" {n}주빌로스트는 짧은 "
"인사를 하고 뒷통수를 긁고는 한숨을 쉽니다.{/n} \"우리는 함께 많은 것을 보았어. 좋은 기억이 나쁜 기억보다 살짝 더 많다고 네가 "
"말했으면 좋겠군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JubilostPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8ecbbc27-22ec-4e22-9e69-7752801405cf"
msgid ""
"\"Of course! I never became the hero who saved the entire gnome race! I "
"don't even know how I'll live with myself, knowing that I'm just a famous "
"scientist who visited the {g|First World}First World{/g}, met one of its "
"deities, and defeated another. Assuming we win this battle.\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론! 나는 모든 노움 종족을 구한 영웅이 된 적이 없다! 나는 내가 어떻게 살게 될지조차 몰랐어, 내가 {g|First World}"
"태초 세계{/g}를 방문한 유명한 과학자이고, 그곳의 신들 중 하나를 만나고, 다른 신을 이길지 말야. 우리가 이 전투에서 승리한다고 "
"가정하자고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/JubilostPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "50dba51a-b07f-4f8a-958c-92ac0757339a"
msgid ""
"\"We'll ask them all right! Who can say no to politeness and forcible, "
"explosive arguments?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그들에게 모든 권리를 요구할거야! 누가 공손하고 강력하고 입김이 쎈 자의 말을 거절하겠어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "cf55d801-650a-4255-bb5c-e678a3060c70"
msgid "\"Thanks for standing by me, Nok-Nok.\""
msgstr "\"내 옆에 서줘서 고마워. 녹-녹.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "f9a96a9d-3fad-4e2f-9c28-4015ec07c47d"
msgid "\"I'm ready if you are.\""
msgstr "\"너만 준비 되면 됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a6d3b616-2cdf-48f8-a0c2-861817416f92"
msgid "\"Enough. The battle is ahead.\""
msgstr "\"충분해. 전투가 곧 벌어진다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "a80a109a-f014-440a-b723-6a303ec559ce"
msgid ""
"\"This a crazy road allll way to end, even crazier than how we meet... Now "
"someone try steal OUR city? Nok-Nok say — we go steal it back!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 우리가 겪었던 것보다 더어 미친 광란의 길이다... 이제 누가 '우리' 도시를 훔치려고 한다고? 녹-녹은 말한다. 우리는 "
"그것을 다시 훔쳐간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8a8dfff3-da21-4bd0-a261-a314c1e20761"
msgid "\"It what heroes do. Walk together. Steal together. Stab together.\""
msgstr "\"영웅이 하는 일이다. 함께 걷고. 함께 훔치고. 함께 찌르고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "7a8c7700-8dd4-49a8-ace8-efa1443dbbba"
msgid ""
"\"You show more than how be hero — how be more true self. You teach Nok-Nok "
"how to jester. Use head, but not as club — use to trick enemy. Turn laughter "
"back to stab people.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 영웅이 되는 법 이상을 보여줬다. 진실한 자신이 되는 방법이다. 너는 녹-녹에게 광대가 되는 법을 알려줬다. 곤봉이 아니라 "
"머리를 써서 적을 속인다. 앞으로는 웃고 뒤에서는 찌른다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a4b9698a-c2f1-4a83-bb21-541a53072b87"
msgid ""
"\"And you show me hero path, from goblin king, to great confronting of "
"Munguk, to finding tribe again, and... uh, king-not-king again — hero path "
"keep going. So do we.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 너는 영웅의 길을 보여주었다, 고블린 왕부터 뭉국에 맞섰고, 다시 부족을 되찾고, 그리고... 어, 다시 왕 아닌 왕이다. "
"영웅의 길은 계속 이어진다. 그러니까 우리가 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "f4177f27-0311-4380-87ef-92e8cb593042"
msgid "\"Just like pose in statue!\""
msgstr "\"조각상처럼 포즈를 취해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "cd757121-343a-4cb0-883d-95abc81b0acd"
msgid ""
"\"Pffft — Nok-Nok not let you go alone. Besides... be fun. Nok-Nok never "
"stole a city back before.\""
msgstr "\"흥! 녹-녹은 너 혼자 가게 두지 않는다. 게다가... 재미도 있다. 녹-녹은 한 번도 도시를 훔쳐 본 적이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "062b4150-7492-4166-b184-8d98aee2718a"
msgid ""
"\"This a crazy road allll way to end, even crazier than how we meet... Now "
"someone try steal city of Nok-Nok, King of Jesters? Nok-Nok say — we go "
"jester thief to death!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 우리가 겪었던 것보다 더어 미친 광란의 길이다... 이제 누가 광대의 왕 녹-녹의 도시를 훔치려고 한다고? 녹-녹은 말한다. "
"우리는 죽을 때까지 광대 도둑이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "3d9c0626-4e02-48c9-87ff-f9bcb6b43e59"
msgid ""
"\"Pffft — Nok-Nok not let you go alone. Besides... be fun. Nok-Nok never "
"stole a city back before. Be tale of Jester greater than any Hero!\""
msgstr ""
"\"흥! 녹-녹은 너 혼자 내버려 두지 않는다. 게다가... 재미도 있다. 녹-녹은 한 번도 도시를 훔쳐 본 적이 없다. 어떤 영웅보다 "
"멋진 이야기의 광대가 될 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "1912b563-ec3a-4acd-8c06-a36b56feb6c6"
msgid ""
"\"Nok-Nok never had to be hero — you showed Nok-Nok only had to be Nok-Nok. "
"Jester. Not someone else.\""
msgstr "\"녹-녹은 영웅이 될 필요가 없었다. 녹-녹은 녹-녹이 되어야만 한다고 알려줬다. 어릿광대. 그 누구도 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/NokNokPartingDialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "de66da21-2adf-438f-b5ba-82a2578a3224"
msgid ""
"\"All way from goblin king, to great confronting of Munguk, to finding tribe "
"again, and... uh, king-not-king again — all led to being Jester. But need "
"city back first, or Jester have no place to jester.\""
msgstr ""
"\"여기까지 고블린 왕부터 뭉국까지 맞섰고, 부족을 다시 되찾고, 그리고... 어, 다시 왕 아닌 왕이다 — 모든 일이 광대가 되도록 "
"이끌었다. 하지만 도시를 먼저 되찾아야 한다, 아니면 광대에겐 광대 일을 할 자리가 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "45bf0bda-15e8-425b-be5d-0440d8b5c35b"
msgid "\"You look worried.\""
msgstr "\"너 걱정이 있는 것 같아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "9ed0ce64-6b85-4c13-a346-b08e4858f6e9"
msgid "\"I just wanted to say I'm very glad to have met you, Octavia.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너를 만난 것이 기뻤다. 옥타비아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "2f427ddd-cc37-489e-bf3a-abcb3f391aac"
msgid "\"Well, we have to go. Are you ready for our final test?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 가야 해. 마지막 시험을 치를 준비가 됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "15876000-09f6-461d-b51b-a2bbe02de48c"
msgid ""
"\"I just wanted to tell you one more time how happy I am that we're together."
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 우리가 함께 있는 것이 얼마나 행복했는지 한 번 더 말하고 싶었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "297c6e07-9992-4ce6-9692-3f6ac0798117"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia greets you with an anxious, but cordial and determined look.{/n} "
"\"I can't believe this is happening to us! I didn't think I would be among "
"the heroes from a legend, but here we are. I only hope this legend has a "
"good ending!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아는 걱정스럽지만 따뜻하고 결의에 찬 눈으로 반깁니다.{/n} \"정말 믿을수가 없어요! 제가 전설 속 주인공이 되서 영웅들과 "
"나란히 설 줄이야. 근데 그렇게 됐네요. 이 전설이 좋은 결말을 맞이했으면 좋겠네요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "6ef3747e-48fa-48f2-b931-03ff59de0d16"
msgid ""
"\"I'm just worried about you. And I'm sad about Linzi. It feels better to "
"think that she stayed with us no matter what. But I miss some of the little "
"things, like talking to her in the morning, when we both just crawled out of "
"our tents, still sleepy... Linzi, if you can hear us now, please know that I "
"miss you terribly, you little chatterbox!\n"
"But let's look ahead for the moment. I don't wish to distract you with my "
"worries. I'm ready for battle like never before!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 걱정하고 있었어. 그리고 린지를 추모하고 있었고. 그녀가 우리와 함께 머물렀다고 생각하는 것이 더 좋겠네. 그러나 나는 아침에 "
"천막에서 기어 나갔다가 졸린 채로 그녀와 이야기하는 것과 같은 작은 추억을 그리워 한다. 린지, 지금 우리 목소리가 들린다면, 네가 "
"끔찍하게 그립다는걸 것을 알아줘, 작은 수다쟁이야!\n"
"하지만 이제 앞을 바라봐야해. 나는 내 걱정으로 너를 혼란스럽게하고 싶지 않아. 나는 언제보다도 더 전투 준비가 되어있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "57bc8dd1-04f5-47bf-ac6f-e41af3db3036"
msgid ""
"\"And Reg...\" {n}Octavia closes her eyes for a moment.{/n} \"Never mind. I "
"promised myself I'd be strong, and I will be. For us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 레그...\" {n}옥타비아는 잠시 눈을 감았습니다.{/n} \"걱정하지 마. 나는 강해질 거라고 약속할 게. 강해질 거야. "
"우리를 위해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "19e2b498-f484-4b9b-adc1-05d182b0d743"
msgid ""
"\"Like never before. If I need to defeat a deity to save you from a curse, "
"then I'll do it.\""
msgstr "\"예전보다도 더. 저주에서 너를 구하기 위해 신을 물리칠 필요가 있다면, 나는 물리칠거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "5a2bec73-aa7d-45e8-88ff-89b98d503c72"
msgid ""
"{n}Octavia smiles, and can't help but laugh softly.{/n} \"I wanted to be "
"firm and pretend I'm not moved at all — but of course it's not true! I'm "
"also very happy I met you — and that you don't mind my company!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}옥타비아 웃었고, 부드럽게 웃을 수 밖에 없었습니다.{/n} \"나는 아무렇지도 않게 단호하고 싶었어. 물론 그건 사실이 아니야! "
"나도 너를 만나서 기뻐. 그리고 내 친구를 신경쓰지 않아도 되어 기뻐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "76724521-8a8c-46dd-b694-735f4514e651"
msgid ""
"\"Me too. The three of us had to overcome a lot for this... But I'm glad we "
"stayed together through it all! Now let's prove that it wasn't all in vain!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나도 마찬가지야. 우리 셋은 이것 때문에 많은 것을 극복해야 했어. 하지만 나는 우리 모두가 함께 했기 때문에 기뻐. 이제는 그것이 "
"모두 헛된 것이 아님을 증명하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/OctaviaPartingDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "0aba7052-f59b-43eb-b8b8-c49e84156734"
msgid ""
"\"Me too. I love you, {Name}. Our happiness has cost us much... Now let's "
"prove that it wasn't all in vain!\""
msgstr "\"나도. 사랑해, {Name}. 우리의 행복은 희생을 너무나 많이 치렀어... 그것이 전부가 헛된 것이 아님을 증명하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "2b831c46-545e-45cd-b05b-d797f8d13cd5"
msgid ""
"\"Is there anything you'd like to tell me before we march off to battle?\""
msgstr "\"진군하기 전에 말해주고 싶은 것이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "93c4e4f3-8c28-4d5a-af2f-7385ebc68c7e"
msgid "[Pat Regongar on his shoulder] \"You ready for a fight?\""
msgstr "[레곤가르의 어깨를 두드려 줍니다] \"싸울 준비 됐어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "76a7088d-b1d7-426e-a4b1-0e3303831fd3"
msgid "\"Well, enough words. It's time to act.\""
msgstr "\"말은 충분해. 이제 행동할 때가 됐어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "01b72fd5-748f-42c4-85c7-14bd9fe4d0f2"
msgid "\"I just want you to know — I'm happy we're together.\""
msgstr "\"네가 알았으면 좋겠다 — 나는 우리가 함께 할 수 있어서 행복해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "8d24a569-9a6d-40aa-a00c-bb303d0ca475"
msgid ""
"{n}Regongar raises his weapon in salute. He looks menacing, but a little "
"nervous.{/n} \"Hey, chief! How are you feeling? I can't wait to stretch my "
"legs a little!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레곤가르는 무기로 경례를 합니다. 그는 위협적으로 보이지만 약간 긴장했습니다.{/n} \"이봐. 대장! 기분 어때? 다리를 펴고 "
"싶어 죽겠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "0a526b69-c270-4e6d-a75d-3f9f2cae1555"
msgid "\"Lead on, chief! I'm right behind you!\""
msgstr "\"앞장 서. 대장! 내가 바로 뒤에 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "8feceb74-a087-4032-92cf-798ba075436b"
msgid ""
"\"You've led us through a hundred brawls — you'll lead us through this one! "
"Just don't look back, and use any chance fate throws at us.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 물어온 싸움이 백 번은 되는거 같군. 이번에도 하나 물어왔구만! 돌아 보지 말고, 운명이 우리에게 내려준 모든 기회를 이용하자구."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "ba18a547-5936-4db5-a4d4-31dac4819492"
msgid ""
"\"Some fight! I'm already thinking about the toast for the celebration feast!"
"\" {n}Regongar grins rakishly, cheered by your gesture.{/n} \"We'll deal "
"with this flying fireball nice and quick — then I hope we'll celebrate at "
"least for a couple of weeks!\""
msgstr ""
"\"싸움이군! 나는 축하 잔치에 쓸 건배사를 이미 생각하고 있다!\" {n}레곤가르는 당신의 몸짓에 화답하여 방탕하게 웃습니다.{/n} "
"\"우리는 이 날으는 불덩어리를 친절하고 신속하게 처리하겠지. 그리고 나는 적어도 2주 동안은 축배를 들거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "1357cfcb-78f9-42cf-9750-852df0aafdf8"
msgid ""
"\"This happiness cost us a lot, didn't it? We had to shed so much blood, "
"both ours and others'... The three of us caused each other so much trouble, "
"ha ha ha! But now that's all in the past. You can be sure, I'll fight as "
"thousand devils to hold on to this happiness. I'll burn down the whole {g|"
"First World}First World{/g}... And return. Alive. With you and Octavia.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 행복은 우리에게 많은 희생을 안겨주는군. 우리와 다른 사람들 모두 피를 많이 흘려야 했다. 우리 셋은 많이 싸우기도 했지. "
"하하하! 하지만 이제는 모우 과거야. 나는 이 행복을 막는 천 명의 데블과 싸울 것이다. 나는 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}"
"를 불태울 것이다... 그리고 돌아올 거야. 살아서. 너와 옥타비아와 함께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "c94a3a7b-dbd7-4f1b-b7b7-ea9fae5c6909"
msgid ""
"\"This happiness cost us a lot. And to keep it I'll fight as thousand "
"devils! For you, for all of us... And for those who aren't with us any more. "
"If I have to, I'll burn down the whole {g|First World}First World{/g}! And "
"return. Alive. With you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 행복은 많은 비용이 드는군. 그것을 지키려면 천 명의 데블과 싸워야 할테지! 너와 우리 모두를 위해서... 그리고 우리와 더 이상 "
"함께하지 않는 사람들을 위해서. 가능하다면 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 불태우겠다! 그리고 돌아올 거야. 살아서. 너와 "
"함께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/RegongarPartingDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "40240c08-344a-42b3-bbaa-cfa1fe8521b7"
msgid ""
"{n}The half-orc's grin fades, and he adds softly:{/n} \"I wonder where "
"Octavia is now. Probably in Elysium, feasting with {g|Calistria}Calistria{/g}"
"... I hope she sees us and raises a cup to our victory!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하프오크의 가벼운 웃음기가 사라지고, 부드럽게 말합니다.{/n} \"옥타비아가 지금 어디 있는지 궁금하다. 아마도 일리지움에서 "
"{g|Calistria}칼리스트리아{/g}와 축배를 들고 있겠지... 나는 그녀가 우리를 보고 승리의 축배를 들기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TartukPartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "91a9c821-6b24-4756-8335-0ef25d2ffbef"
msgid ""
"\"I'd never imagined that you and I would be standing shoulder to shoulder "
"in the end.\""
msgstr "\"너와 내가 결국 어깨를 나란히 할 것이라고 상상하지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TartukPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ea6bcd49-e5ba-488e-8582-76d1733d3bc6"
msgid "\"Do you have anything to say to me?\""
msgstr "\"나에게 할 말이 있니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TartukPartingDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "691cd7fc-ff64-4300-9665-f2f5a97c0941"
msgid "\"Enough — it's time to put an end to this Eldest and his minions!\""
msgstr "\"충분해. 원로와 그의 부하들을 끝내야 할 때가 되었다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TartukPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "05ea057f-627e-4381-aae7-7b9db3f4ec5b"
msgid ""
"{n}As you approach, Tartuk tilts his head and looks at you intently with his "
"reptilian eye.{/n} \"Ssso? When isss the battle?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하자 타툭은 그의 머리를 기울이고 파충류의 눈으로 당신을 주의 깊게 봅니다.{/n} \"그래서? 언제 전투가 시작 되는 "
"거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TartukPartingDialog/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "b858e195-6fff-42e8-865d-e4be9ab34765"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold shakes his head.{/n} \"It'sss an honor. You are the sssavior "
"of my kingdom. Now I am the sssavior of yoursss. A little. But ssstill.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트가 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"영광이다! 너는 내 왕국의 구원자다. 나는 너의 왕국의 구원자다. 혼자는 아니지만. "
"유효하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TartukPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "8dc1c86f-19ea-4ed9-9b0a-cfc5caca8d8f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk keeps silent for a few seconds, and then starts speaking in a "
"voice not his own, slow and dull.{/n} \"I wanted to be great. Do sssomething "
"important. If it wasssn't for you, I wouldn't be able to give koboldsss a "
"home. Thank you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 몇 초 동안 침묵을 지키고 평소의 목소리가 아니라 천천히 그리고 둔한 목소리로 말하기 시작합니다.{/n} \"나는 위대하고 "
"싶었다. 중요한 일을 하라. 네가 아니었다면 코볼트에게 집을 줄 수 없었을 것이다. 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TartukPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "fe801707-009d-4171-9e0b-d288578b1f35"
msgid ""
"{n}In return, the purple kobold opens his toothy maw and hisses viciously. "
"Magic sparks run along his clawed fingers — Tartuk is ready for the final "
"battle!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그 답례로 자주색 코볼트는 드러난 이를 열어 악랄하게 쉿쉿하고 소리칩니다. 마법의 불꽃이 그의 발톱을 따라 타오릅니다 — 타툭은 "
"마지막 전투 준비가 되었습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "efb0e1a6-bd13-45f6-9987-df5237f4c89d"
msgid "\"Thank you for supporting me all this time.\""
msgstr "\"나를 항상 도와주어 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "f771fd19-6b6f-4966-af44-b1db3683f563"
msgid ""
"\"Is there anything you'd like to tell me before we march off to battle?\""
msgstr "\"진군하기 전에 말해주고 싶은 것이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "b48d6338-02c9-45a7-998b-93de48580490"
msgid "\"It will be time to march soon. Are you ready?\""
msgstr "\"진군할 시간이야. 준비 됐나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "160e53c1-2f9e-4d76-941a-f0ca380f07a8"
msgid ""
"\"I'm not afraid. Even if everything goes wrong... we will meet in another "
"place.\""
msgstr "\"나는 두렵지 않아. 모든 것이 잘못될지라도... 우리는 다른 곳에서 만나겠지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d5c90218-f374-46e8-b74c-80575a0ad23d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian smiles ever so slightly as you approach.{/n} \"It's good that "
"everything will be over. I have been so afraid that we wouldn't have the "
"time to save you or this tormented kingdom. But now there's just a little "
"further to go, and I believe we can make it.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접근하자 트리스티안이 아주 살짝 미소 짓습니다.{/n} \"모든 일이 끝나서 다행입니다. 당신과 당신의 고통받는 왕국을 구할 "
"시간이 없을까 두려웠죠. 하지만 지금은 조금만 더 가면 되고, 우리가 해낼 수 있다고 믿습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "461aabab-a8b7-43a4-ad65-b5fbf76a1e04"
msgid ""
"\"You exaggerate. I don't think I offer so much support. But I am immensely "
"happy that I can help you in any way I can. This land deserves peace... and "
"all the more so — its ruler.\""
msgstr ""
"\"과찬이시군요. 제가 너무 많은 지원을 한다고 생각하지 않습니다. 하지만 가능한한 당신을 도울 수 있어서 대단히 행복합니다. 이 땅은 "
"평안을 누릴 자격이 있습니다. 그리고 통치자는 더욱 그러하고요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "561ce9bd-8908-484d-bebb-a1e4bcbc0a19"
msgid ""
"\"I didn't want to distract you with such a trifle at this important moment, "
"but let me again thank you for giving me a second chance. I have realized "
"much along my journey, although I'd prefer my awakening hadn't been bought "
"with innocent lives. From now on I will be stricter with myself, and will "
"spend more time helping those who need it.\n"
"And one more thing... I'm not one for inspirational speeches, but let me "
"wish you strength and luck. Your burden is the heaviest of all. May you be "
"equal to the task!\""
msgstr ""
"\"저는 이 중요한 순간에 사소한 일로 당신을 혼란스럽게 하고 싶지 않습니다만, 두 번째 기회를 주어 다시 한번 고맙습니다. 저는 여행을 "
"하는 동안 많은 깨달음을 얻었습니다, 제 깨달음이 무고한 생명들로부터 얻어졌음에도 불구하고요. 이제부터는 스스로에게 더 엄격해져서, "
"필요한 사람들을 돕는 데 더 많은 시간을 할애하겠습니다.\n"
"그리고 한 가지 더... 제가 축사를 할 사람은 아닙니다만, 당신께 힘과 행운이 있길 빕니다. 당신의 짐은 모두의 짐입니다. 당신의 짐이 "
"덜어지길!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "3d38f254-6d49-45a7-8800-1ebb672d5548"
msgid "\"I'm with you until the end, {name}.\""
msgstr "\"끝날 때까지 당신과 함께 하겠습니다, {name}.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "d8ac2dac-e4ca-4b47-baa7-f623852fccf7"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian lowers his head as you approach.{/n} \"{name}.\" {n}The deva "
"runs the tips of his fingers along your shoulder and touches your cheek.{/n} "
"\"This is your last trial, my Queen. Our trial. I hope you won't deny me the "
"honor in this battle to protect the one I love with all my heart.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 다가가자 트리스티안이 머리를 숙입니다.{/n} \"{name}.\" {n}데바는 손가락 끝으로 어깨와 뺨을 "
"어루만집니다.{/n} \"이것은 나의 마지막 시련입니다, 나의 여왕님. 우리의 시련이죠. 내가 이 전투에 참여해 사랑하는 사람을 보호할 "
"명예를 거두지 않기를 바랍니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "fb621be9-6de5-41bd-a3cc-5105468ddbd6"
msgid ""
"\"Shh.\" {n}Tristian takes a step forward, holds you and softly presses your "
"head into his chest.{/n} \"Did you forget? You and I have plans.\" {n}He "
"presses his lips to your forehead for a moment, and then the deva lets go of "
"you.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"쉿.\" {n}트리스티안은 한발짝 나아가서, 당신을 붙잡고 당신의 머리를 부드럽게 그의 가슴에 밀어 넣습니다.{/n} \"잊으셨나요? "
"당신과 나에겐 계획이 있습니다.\" {n}그는 잠시동안 당신의 이마에 입술을 댔습니다, 그 뒤 데바는 당신을 놓아줬습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/TristianPartingDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "56de1a97-9d57-42b1-9a02-70f66854fcc6"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian takes your hand into his.{/n} \"Thank you for appearing in my "
"life and becoming my sunrise after the storm. For the warmth that you've "
"always given with your whole heart... and for the warmth that you will give "
"once all this is over.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안은 그의 손을 자신의 손에 포갭니다.{/n} \"제 인생에 나타나 폭풍 후의 일출이 되어주어 고마워요. 당신이 온 마음을 "
"다해 저에게 나눠준 따뜻함과... 그리고 이 모든 일이 끝난 뒤 당신이 줄 따뜻함에도요\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "5c446d18-2ba9-4110-81bd-a5f80a4b8248"
msgid "\"Valerie, I just want to say, your loyalty means a lot to me.\""
msgstr "\"발레리. 너의 충성이 나에게 많은 것을 의미한다고 말하고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "d35e5d4a-953f-4150-a0eb-3b26391f4660"
msgid "\"Do you have any regrets?\""
msgstr "\"후회돼?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e32f51b9-8028-442d-950c-5c8e53a3d5af"
msgid "\"We have to go. I know I don't even need to ask if you're ready.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 가야만 한다. 나는 준비가 되었는지 물어볼 필요조차 없다는 것을 안다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "6af6e17b-d477-4d1b-bb05-eae6f19fd4a7"
msgid ""
"\"Even if I fall in battle, I'll die happy. I had the finest woman in the "
"world at my side!\""
msgstr "\"내가 전투에서 죽더라도 행복하게 죽을 것이다. 나는 세상에서 가장 멋진 여자를 내 옆에 두었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d9a30093-e61e-4093-9765-59cdf2ef66d5"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie looks determined and focused. Her eyes shine with a special "
"light.{/n} \"I'm just waiting for a signal to attack. There's a great battle "
"ahead, and it will end with a great victory. I believe that more than I've "
"ever believed anything.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 결의를 다지고 집중하는 것처럼 보입니다. 그녀의 눈은 특별한 빛으로 빛납니다.{/n} \"저는 공격 신호를 기다리고 "
"있습니다. 앞으로 큰 싸움이 있을 것이고, 큰 승리로 끝날 것입니다. 저는 당신이 여지껏 제가 믿어본 것 이상으로 확신합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "acdfe152-4da7-4cd6-95cd-21605a1912c0"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie sighs quite heartily and looks down for a moment.{/n} \"I'm glad "
"to hear it. I would never turn away from my duty, no matter what. Yet it's "
"better to enter a dangerous battle with an easy heart — knowing that your "
"sword serves one who truly values your loyalty.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 한숨을 쉬며 잠시 시선을 내립니다.{/n} \"저는 그것을 듣게 되어 기쁩니다. 저는 무슨 일이 있더라도 제 의무를 "
"저버리지 않을 것입니다. 그러나 가벼운 마음으로 위험한 전투에 들어가는 것이 더 좋겠죠. 저의 칼은 당신에게 가장 충성하는 자가 휘두르는 "
"것임을 알아주셥시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "2b94abc3-36b8-438b-891a-d3aebc4526d5"
msgid ""
"\"Every failure. Every fallen comrade. But these regrets cannot undermine my "
"spirit. We learn from our mistakes and harden for times like these.\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 실패. 패배한 모든 동료들. 그러나 이 후회는 제 정신을 약화시킬 수 없습니다. 우리는 이와 같은 때에 실수로부터 배우고 "
"단련합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "21bf9142-20ea-45b5-bfb8-0b545ee1a34d"
msgid ""
"\"And I need not answer. To arms! We will protect this land and free you "
"from this curse. That's why I've taken up my weapons. And I won't put them "
"down until all our plans are fulfilled.\""
msgstr ""
"\"또한 저는 대답할 필요도 없죠! 우리는 이 땅을 지키고 이 저주에서 당신을 자유롭게 할겁니다. 그것이 제가 무기를 든 이유입니다. "
"우리의 모든 계획이 성취될 때까지 무기를 내리지 않겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "45f21e61-37b4-4392-9e09-757c8f5d7ef8"
msgid ""
"{n}A smile blossoms on Valerie's lips when she sees you.{/n} \"I'm waiting "
"for your signal, my king. Together to the end of the world — remember?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그녀가 당신을 볼 때 발레리의 입술에 미소가 생깁니다.{/n} \"당신의 명령을 기다립니다. 세상의 끝까지 함께하자 — 기억하시나요?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "24036350-43ca-42db-b9a1-3f1569b5e358"
msgid ""
"{n}Valerie rolls her eyes jokingly.{/n} \"Has the imminence of the final "
"battle made you a poet? I hope not!\" {n}Valerie leans forward and kisses "
"you.{/n} \"We will come back alive. You and I. And we'll be happy. If I like "
"anything about ballads, it's a good ending. Now let's see this story through!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}발레리는 농담처럼 눈을 굴립니다.{/n} \"마지막 전투가 임박하니 시인이 되셨습니까? 그러지 마십시오!\" {n}발레리가 앞으로 "
"몸을 기울여 당신에게 키스합니다.{/n} \"우리는 다시 살아날 겁니다. 당신과 나. 그리고 우리는 행복할 겁니다. 제가 발라드에서 "
"좋아하는 점이 있다면, 바로 좋은 결말이라는 거죠. 이제 우리 이야기를 보죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/CityGates(Hub)/PartingWords(Companions)/ValeriePartingDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "12d73509-e8e4-4c22-8c34-8bef2ea2f238"
msgid "\"I'll follow you to Hell and to the Abyss. Lead us, my king!\""
msgstr "\"지옥과 심연까지 당신을 따르겠습니다. 앞장서십시오, 나의 왕이시여!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/1KestenJhod_1Kesten_String
msgctxt "bc5e98df-3a16-4b14-87cc-c6f5886c46bf"
msgid "\"Your Highness, we are preparing to repel an attack!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 공격을 격퇴하기 위해 준비하고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/1KestenJhod_2Jhod_String
msgctxt "712719c9-2c60-4139-b7c4-81f9dc0d092f"
msgid "\"Erastil help us! They're coming!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸이시여 도와주소서! 그들이 온다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/1KestenJhod_3Villy_String
msgctxt "ffa99ba0-bc96-4dbb-91b9-e467aae4096d"
msgid "\"There's no battle I can't handle!\""
msgstr "\"내가 감당할 수 없는 전쟁은 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/1VillyBetraying2_String
msgctxt "ab29a934-b4cc-43be-9ec9-24e9faf1090d"
msgid "\"Oh, the rulers of the mortal realms are so smug and careless!\""
msgstr "\"아. 필멸자의 통치자는 짓궂고 부주의하구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/1VillyBetraying_String
msgctxt "77aef785-559d-4828-ac5a-fa2f5c743c88"
msgid ""
"\"You are amazingly gullible for someone who stands against the king of lies "
"and masks, {name}.\""
msgstr "\"거짓과 가면의 왕을 대적하는 사람에게 너는 호구일 뿐이다. {name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/ArmagFight_String
msgctxt "d8045d1c-84b4-4a67-aa44-7058a3523d86"
msgid "\"Attack!! Follow Armag, warriors!\""
msgstr "\"공격! 아르막을 따라가라! 전사들아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/ArmagHub_String
msgctxt "980682f6-31f2-4188-8c2a-0bf7925e7758"
msgid ""
"\"It was a good fight today. Glory for fighters, peace for the fallen.\""
msgstr "\"오늘은 좋은 싸움이었다. 전사에게는 영광이며 전사자들에게는 평화이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BanditsHelping1_String
msgctxt "aba570b4-534f-4145-99e3-57b6902ce33d"
msgid ""
"\"Good thing I brought some lock picking tools. I had a hunch we'd be "
"needing them...\""
msgstr "\"자물쇠 따기 도구를 가져와서 다행이다. 나는 그것들이 필요할 거라 생각했지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BanditsHelping2_String
msgctxt "208a08f4-def1-49c7-a6e7-bf2e820b308c"
msgid ""
"\"Ahey, Your Highness! Come over here! Got all that useful stuff lying "
"around...\""
msgstr "\"너구나! 이리 와봐! 이 근처에 있는 유용한 물건들을 모두 가져 왔어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BanditsHelping3_String
msgctxt "5e7911fb-702b-4508-b734-df0ba2be73f2"
msgid ""
"\"If those flying islands didn't come with a horde of monsters, I'd put a "
"house on one and live there.\""
msgstr "\"만약 그 떠다니는 섬들에 괴물 무리가 없다면 나는 집을 하나 짓고 거기에 살 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BanditsHelping4_String
msgctxt "d824370d-b6b5-4288-98be-033289b51b3c"
msgid "\"I live for fights like these!\""
msgstr "\"이런 싸움을 하려고 인생을 사는 거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BanditsHub1_String
msgctxt "5c118c80-db0a-45d5-abde-00e5803b8ffe"
msgid ""
"\"And how are we supposed to return to peaceful life after this? At lease, "
"I'm grateful Svetlana doesn't see this…\""
msgstr "\"이 난리를 겪고 평화로운 삶으로 어떻게 돌아가지? 스베틀라나는 이걸 보지 못해 다행이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BanditsHub2_String
msgctxt "e331146c-0d25-48e8-9227-3845675f604c"
msgid "\"I can hardly believe our fortress stood somewhere nearby.\""
msgstr "\"나는 우리 요새가 근처에 있다는 것을 믿을 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BanditsHub3_String
msgctxt "bb46b02a-a407-4d07-8a7c-f7a6ce542091"
msgid ""
"\"Where can we get something to drink around here? I'm not complaining, but "
"it makes fighting more fun!\""
msgstr "\"여기서 마실 것을 어디에서 얻을 수 있지? 불평은 안하겠지만 싸움이 더 재미있게 될 거다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BanditsHub4_String
msgctxt "03877f44-524f-4207-863d-8b12bdd81834"
msgid "\"The River Blades are at your service, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"강의 칼날단이 당신을 섬길 것입니다, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Bartholomew_FightingBark_String
msgctxt "2998068d-4972-4d55-93d9-e053536099bd"
msgid "\"Well well well, what have we here... Time to get to work!\""
msgstr "\"이런. 이런. 일할 시간이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Bartholomew_HubBark_String
msgctxt "5ca5d647-f3c2-4d86-bea8-c272511e9b3d"
msgid ""
"\"So many curious magic anomalies around! It's a pity we don't have time for "
"thorough research!\""
msgstr "\"주변에 수상한 마법 징후가 있다! 연구를 할 시간이 없다는 것이 유감이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/BridgeNoFey_String
msgctxt "3b0d3fcb-2967-4178-9d2a-18dfec508680"
msgid ""
"The vines connecting the floating islands appear weak and unreliable. Only "
"fey magic could strengthen them."
msgstr "떠다니는 섬을 덩굴줄기가 연결하고 있지만 약하고 미덥지 않습니다. 이런 것을 가능하게 만드는 건 페이 주술뿐입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Darven_fight_String
msgctxt "5052cb96-804a-4b94-8704-b3285156aad6"
msgid "\"What, you started the big battle without me?\""
msgstr "\"나 없이 전투를 시작했어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Darven_hub_String
msgctxt "4aff3e6d-e5c0-440b-8031-c0d34ce472c0"
msgid "\"And I thought it was I who had complicated relationships…\""
msgstr "\"내가 복잡한 관계를 맺은 사람이라고 생각했다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/Cave1_String
msgctxt "9a52c255-afb2-4f23-8215-1731f56057b8"
msgid "Seems like a stash of smuggled goods."
msgstr "밀수입된 물건의 은닉처처럼 보입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/Cave2_String
msgctxt "3e88bfd3-83a8-4fae-bc5c-2503543376e1"
msgid ""
"The tunnel looks like it was a natural cave, before someone strengthened its "
"ceiling and cleared the main passage."
msgstr "터널은 자연의 동굴처럼 보입니다. 누군가가 천장을 강화하고 주요 통로를 청소하는 것을 제외하고는요."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/Encounter1GuardBark1_String
msgctxt "33ed9960-fce0-4c0d-a0c1-2b32dd998726"
msgid "\"Our {mf|king|queen} is here!\""
msgstr "\"우리의 {mf|왕|여왕} 여기에 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/Encounter1GuardBark2_String
msgctxt "b46c5261-48b5-45cf-adf9-f3e14040bc49"
msgid "\"Your Highness, we're under attack!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 공격받고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/Encounter1GuardBark3_String
msgctxt "eda6b76c-9a49-4c2b-946e-6c64a95b3e74"
msgid "\"They're coming! Get ready!\""
msgstr "\"그들이 오고있어! 준비해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/GuardsAmbush1_String
msgctxt "e1f51dee-ead6-449c-8577-6e4fbeb9b1fb"
msgid "\"Someone, help! I'm injured!\""
msgstr "\"누군가 도와줘! 나는 부상당했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/GuardsAmbush2_String
msgctxt "8bfaf8ab-3cc0-48e0-a2d8-03061fdbfa5b"
msgid "\"We were ambushed...\""
msgstr "\"우리는 매복당했다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/Items/CupShard_desc_String
msgctxt "53e2903a-4e5f-43dc-af87-2c332fdb4137"
msgid ""
"A fragment of the Apology, Nyrissa's goblet that was used to \"measure\" her "
"task of destroying a thousand kingdoms."
msgstr "천 개의 나라를 파괴하는 그녀의 임무를 \"측정\"하는데 사용된 잔인 사죄의 파편입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/Items/CupShard_name_String
msgctxt "3b30db64-2d9a-4a23-b0cc-92db52b9f6b7"
msgid "Fragment of the Apology"
msgstr "사죄의 파편"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/JhodAfterFightOrHub_String
msgctxt "e15bc396-769a-44d4-8214-bd1e206d31a4"
msgid "\"Erastil guides us! We'll put an end to this chaos!\""
msgstr "\"에라스틸께서 우리를 인도하길! 우리는 이 혼란을 끝내겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/KassilFightBark_String
msgctxt "d2af2cd4-40b0-4f8b-beff-7216e7747bdd"
msgid "\"A good fight for Aldori swords!\""
msgstr "\"알도리 검술을 위한 좋은 싸움이군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/KestenAfterFightOrHub_String
msgctxt "5c05bf74-8749-4673-8d35-d6613f9206af"
msgid "\"We've repelled the attack, but the battle is far from over.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 공격을 격퇴했지만 전투는 끝나지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/ShandraFightBark_String
msgctxt "fbaf0bad-779b-454d-8636-4a90ea81d29c"
msgid "\"Not the kind of battle I'm accustomed to, but it could be worse.\""
msgstr "\"익숙한 종류의 전투는 아니지만 더 나쁠 수도있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/TavernNPC1_String
msgctxt "1680f1e5-662d-452c-bcee-a1fb12d7247f"
msgid "\"Oh, hello, Your-r-r — Hic! — ...ness...\""
msgstr "\"오. 안녕. 나는... 괜찮.. 끅!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/TavernNPC2_String
msgctxt "2c8848b7-79c7-49a5-a793-55ae8320246f"
msgid ""
"\"Where did everybody go? It's so lonely here! Well, at least they left beer "
"and wine.\""
msgstr "\"모두들 어디로 갔니? 나 외로워! 그들이 적어도 맥주와 와인을 남겼어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/TavernNPC3_String
msgctxt "15d6992b-1094-4633-938e-05329cc510cc"
msgid ""
"\"Someone in the tavern was always talking about a flying city. And now we "
"have a flying city of our own!\""
msgstr "\"선술집의 누군가는 항상 날으는 도시에 대해 이야기하고 있었다. 이제 우리는 날으는 도시가 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DraftBarks/WerenDegarAfterFightOrHub_String
msgctxt "83d40020-f791-4eae-a68f-224c5338ae55"
msgid ""
"\"Mortals, challenging a fey lord and his godlike powers... Victory seems "
"impossible, and yet we have no choice but to march on.\""
msgstr "\"필멸자여. 페이 군주와 그의 신의 힘에 도전하라. 승리는 불가능한 것처럼 보이지만 우리는 행군할 수 밖에 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DugathFight_String
msgctxt "1b4991b1-2b01-45fd-920f-19462669eaaf"
msgid "\"Gorum, we will make good sacrifices to you today!\""
msgstr "\"고룸이여, 우리는 오늘 당신에게 좋은 제물을 바치겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/DugathHub_String
msgctxt "58935312-91d5-4d24-ba51-2c17bbbe64b0"
msgid "\"The Tiger Lords never retreat. Fear is not our way!\""
msgstr "\"호랑이 군주는 결코 후퇴하지 않는다. 두려움은 우리의 것이 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/EvindraHub_bark_String
msgctxt "688a293c-f035-4c86-9717-079d4e79355f"
msgid ""
"\"So much pain and suffering... I long for the time of careless joy and "
"peace.\""
msgstr "\"많은 고통과 아픔이... 나는 방해 없는 기쁨과 평화의 시간을 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/FeyHelping_bark1_String
msgctxt "64190a52-90ef-4f11-a03f-a1b5a1982b1a"
msgid ""
"\"How can anyone have trouble with such a simple thing as getting from one "
"flying island to another?\""
msgstr "\"한 섬에서 다른 섬으로가는 것과 같은 간단한 일로 어떻게 어려움을 겪을 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/FeyHelping_bark2_String
msgctxt "48a74af2-27e2-4d7a-95ce-cd847e56ce78"
msgid "\"Let me whisper to the flowers. I think I'll be able to help!\""
msgstr "\"내가 꽃에 속삭이겠다. 내가 도울 수 있을 것 같아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/FeyHub_bark1_String
msgctxt "d6b26755-a873-4b0a-a271-dfbbd8bd0e4a"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, Tiressia, we would have missed so many miracles, had we stayed in our "
"forest!\""
msgstr "\"아. 티레시아. 숲에 머물렀다면 많은 기적을 놓쳤을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/FeyHub_bark2_String
msgctxt "ab235dac-0b02-491d-8139-176c64b21622"
msgid ""
"\"A pinch of my world added to yours has made everything much more "
"interesting, hasn't it?\""
msgstr "\"내 세상의 일부가 너의 세상에 더해져 훨씬 더 재미있어졌다. 그렇지 않니?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/FeyHub_bark3_String
msgctxt "73b51cd3-c26e-412e-bdb9-238903d9a9b2"
msgid "\"They taught the ground to fly! Oh, I hope they made the lake fly!\""
msgstr "\"그들은 땅에게 비행을 가르쳤다. 나는 그들이 호수를 날게 만들었으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/GoblinsHub_String
msgctxt "6158aa99-a41a-46c0-bf8d-c146aef47b6f"
msgid "\"We set nothing on fire. Boring!\""
msgstr "\"우리는 아무것도 하지 않았다. 지루하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/GoblinsTrophy1_String
msgctxt "5d2d3558-488b-4e1c-8f52-3b80e87ab712"
msgid "\"Hey friend! We defeat monsters to help!\""
msgstr "\"이봐 친구! 괴물을 물리치고 도와주겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/GoblinsTrophy2_String
msgctxt "9f090932-cb07-4044-9d3d-4a99049d4bfc"
msgid "\"Others not dream such a victory!\""
msgstr "\"다른 사람들은 그런 승리를 꿈꾸지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Hargulka_FightingBark_String
msgctxt "c783e0b1-9d22-4bc4-983b-3ad2bb033713"
msgid "\"{Race}'s foes are Hargulka's foes!\""
msgstr "\"{Race}의 적들은 하굴카의 적이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Hargulka_HubBark_String
msgctxt "f9bf2086-6137-4caf-b224-7319ccbe92c1"
msgid ""
"\"You have a strange life, {race}. A flying stone city, attacking shadows. "
"You kill it and it's gone. Nothing to eat!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이상한 삶을 살았구나. {race}. 비행하는 돌의 도시가 그림자를 공격한다. 너는 그것을 죽이고 그것은 없어진다. 먹을 것이 없다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/JamandiFight_bark_String
msgctxt "170bdc85-fdc1-41db-bba2-0fe108923545"
msgid ""
"\"You're just in time, {name}! We're expecting the attack any minute now!\""
msgstr "\"제 시간에 왔다. {name}! 우리는 지금 공격을 대비하고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/JamansiHub_bark_String
msgctxt "c5675190-0619-4c5f-a328-aeb749140fc1"
msgid ""
"\"I have to admit — I prefer brawling with the First World to Brevan "
"politics.\""
msgstr "\"나는 브레보이의 정치 싸움보다 태초 세계와 싸우는걸 더 좋아한다고 인정해야겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/KoboldHub1_String
msgctxt "06d41461-6c01-41e5-82bd-6a4d44100b46"
msgid "\"Kobold asssault! Kobold attacksss! Kobold victory!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트 공겨억하라! 코볼트 맹고옹하라! 코볼트 승리한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/KoboldHub2_String
msgctxt "1f80f613-54cc-41e7-96f1-2e35271779a7"
msgid "\"Kobold ressst now. Ssso tired.\""
msgstr "\"코볼트 쉬어라아. 너어무 피곤하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/KoboldLoot_String
msgctxt "b3499ee8-dc14-4daf-8327-21356b8f9622"
msgid "\"Friend! Chief sssend you gift!\""
msgstr "\"친구! 대장이 선물을 보냈다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/KoboldTrophy1_String
msgctxt "b57654ff-11fd-468f-9956-425908a87c81"
msgid "\"Kobold sssilent sssneak, then big asssault!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트는 매복한다. 그 다음 공격한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/KoboldTrophy2_String
msgctxt "d24f5f6d-9639-4a6b-a103-ae7ed2dcf746"
msgid "\"Beassst not wake!\""
msgstr "\"괴물은 일어나지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/KoboldTrophy3_String
msgctxt "39e84088-dd27-4749-8a2f-efaf41f9e1ed"
msgid "\"Kobold victory! Glory! Glory!\""
msgstr "\"코볼트 승리한다! 영광! 영광!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/LebedaFight_bark_String
msgctxt "5e3f1301-64d9-402e-9c8c-a0c492487e6c"
msgid "\"A battle like the legends I used to read as a child!\""
msgstr "\"내가 어린 시절 읽었던 전설과 같은 전투였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/LebedaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "6c2a6baa-4ffa-4682-9532-ab7f69593803"
msgid ""
"\"One of those ghost knights started up a conversation with me. But then a "
"few words in — he tried to kill me for some reason!\""
msgstr "\"그 유령 기사들 중 한 명과 대화가 시작되었다. 하지만 몇 마디 섞고 나니, 그가 어떤 이유인지 나를 죽이려고 했다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Liacenza_fight_String
msgctxt "966b149b-f2ee-4d44-980e-1a925865c068"
msgid "\"To arms! Time to remember that Pitax isn't just trade and songs!\""
msgstr "\"전투 준비! 피탁스가 무역과 노래의 도시가 아니라는 것을 기억할 시간이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Liacenza_hub_String
msgctxt "95b05c19-9341-462e-a082-e6bc42ab809c"
msgid ""
"\"My brothers are long gone, but today of all days I miss their advice and "
"support...\""
msgstr "\"내 형제는 오래 전에 갔지만 하필 오늘 그들의 충고와 지원을 놓쳤다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/LizardmanHub_String
msgctxt "665aaab6-3f97-41d9-865f-acebf009ff2f"
msgid ""
"\"Lantern enemy make bad lantern ghosts. Maybe he send unreal Ancestor in "
"our village?\""
msgstr "\"등불 적이 나쁜 등불 유령을 만들었다. 우리 마을에 놀라운 조상을 보낸 걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/MaegarHub_String
msgctxt "30d45c3c-06e1-4342-ba21-11001ff46af7"
msgid "\"A good fight and no paperwork. Oh, I've missed this!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 전투에다가 서류 작업도 없다니. 오, 정말 그리웠어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/MaegarKillingMobs_String
msgctxt "e0a30175-ed95-4ac3-8e59-73ebb6423ac9"
msgid "\"I hope there's still work for my sword!\""
msgstr "\"아직 내 검이 버텨주길 바란다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/MiteBushes1_String
msgctxt "59d53658-f8cc-451b-a35e-5f446664667a"
msgid "\"This forest so big! We could walk more than a day!\""
msgstr "\"이 숲은 너무 커! 우리는 하루 이상 걸을 수도 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/MiteBushes2_String
msgctxt "a1ad9e49-05d6-4456-96b9-d68e531a8dad"
msgid "\"Not even one monster! They fear us and run!\""
msgstr "\"한 괴물조차도 남기지 마라! 그들은 우리를 두려워하고 도망간다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/MiteBushes3_String
msgctxt "07b86754-16e8-42bf-ba3a-35c8c34cc7df"
msgid "\"Mighty army mite go attack!\""
msgstr "\"강대한 군대여. 공격하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/MiteHub1_String
msgctxt "22ac681c-69d2-4ccc-9b58-d387c725b8ca"
msgid "\"Queen cut that bush so majestic! I stand look, can't take eyes off!\""
msgstr "\"여왕은 장엄하게 덤불을 자른다! 나는 서서 눈을 뗄 수가 없다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/MiteHub2_String
msgctxt "52f13b61-cdc2-4d03-a4e0-1ea2c0e4f57a"
msgid ""
"\"Queen save us! Angry bush catch all our army, not let out long time!\""
msgstr "\"여왕은 우리를 구한다! 성난 수풀이 모든 군대를 잡았으니 내버려 두지 마라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/MiteLoot_String
msgctxt "43da03ba-f3cd-4ef7-9376-4ae7aec7bd4a"
msgid "\"Ally! We look for useful thing around, bring you! Honest!\""
msgstr "\"동맹이여! 주변에서 유용한 물건을 찾고 너에게 가져간다! 정직하다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Mosconi_fight_String
msgctxt "8fd1b431-39b3-45c1-b980-668b3996a181"
msgid "\"This is not what I imagined being a governor would look like!\""
msgstr "\"내가 상상한 총독의 모습이 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Mosconi_hub_String
msgctxt "27155f8a-4b8a-49c0-acbc-fbe625c67543"
msgid "\"If I survive, I'll hold an entirely ignoble revelry...\""
msgstr "\"내가 살아남는다면 코가 비뚤어지게 마실 거야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/SurtovaFight_bark_String
msgctxt "2255150e-7bf2-47db-85dd-3acbffbcc817"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, here you are! Right on time. We've rebuffed the first attack of these "
"dark creatures, and we're expecting another one any time.\""
msgstr "\"아. 여기 있군! 늦지 않았군. 우리는 이 어둠의 생물의 첫 번째 공격을 막았고 언제든지 또 다른 공격을 대비하고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/SurtovaHub_bark_String
msgctxt "d3276d4c-103c-4920-a745-e010f4447174"
msgid ""
"\"Let us settle this... diplomatic misunderstanding with the First World, "
"and return to matters of court.\""
msgstr "\"태초 세계와의 외교적 오해를 해결하고 법정 문제로 돌아가자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/TartukAlly_FightingBark_String
msgctxt "69c81bc2-424f-4040-9e9d-b1f64842814f"
msgid "\"Ssstep assside! I need ssspaccce!\""
msgstr "\"비켜! 나는 공간이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/TartukAlly_HubBark_String
msgctxt "31a2ad1a-70fa-455c-9efc-a244d533fd5d"
msgid "\"I look at thisss and think, I'm ssso glad I didn't become a baron!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 문제를 보고 생각해 봤다, 내가 남작이 되지 않은게 너무 기쁘다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/TsannaBarkNoEvindra_String
msgctxt "64782fd2-de7a-4761-9d99-40fc82c20016"
msgid ""
"\"I'm waiting, {mf|king|queen}. Bring Evindra to me if you want Lamashtu's "
"blessing!\""
msgstr "\"나는 기다리는 중이다, {mf|왕|여왕}. 라마슈투의 축복을 원한다면 에빈드라를 내게 데려와라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Veril_fight_String
msgctxt "07253aa9-8187-4adb-91f3-a550d73967cb"
msgid ""
"\"I should've never agreed to be a governor. The less you are seen, the "
"better!\""
msgstr "\"나는 절대로 총독이 되지 말아야 했어. 눈에 뜨이지 않을 수록 더 나은데!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/Veril_hub_String
msgctxt "aecb1538-8773-4aef-9f39-3ea1596eadf7"
msgid "\"Such a sweet, calm moment... I wish it was always like this.\""
msgstr "\"달콤하고 차분한 순간... 항상 이랬으면 좋겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/VordakaiAfterMobs_String
msgctxt "0122f415-661e-4ee2-b178-b17588cfb512"
msgid "\"Keep going, {race}. I will finish... this. And follow.\""
msgstr "\"계속 가라. {race}. 나는 끝낼 것이다... 그리고 따를 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/VordakaiAndMiniboss_String
msgctxt "ed69e490-eb7f-47ee-9c51-5de6f2e577d5"
msgid "\"Those who oppose me — their fate is ash.\""
msgstr "\"나에게 대적하는 것이 누구든지, 그것은 재가 될 운명이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/VordakaiHub_String
msgctxt "4b48fc46-d23d-4486-b8c8-5ce00213c624"
msgid ""
"\"It was so gratifying to assume my true form again. It's a pity I had to "
"return to the mask…\""
msgstr "\"다시 진정한 모습을 드러내서 너무 기뻤다. 가면으로 돌아가야만 한다니 유감스럽군...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/Barks/VordalaiKillingMobs_String
msgctxt "6bbd8361-ee2b-45ba-bad4-a37d02d86633"
msgid ""
"\"Chaos, death, bloodbath. If I could breathe, I would breathe easy here.\""
msgstr "\"혼돈, 죽음, 파괴. 내가 숨쉴 수 있다면, 여기서는 쉽게 호흡할 수 있을거다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "84a450b1-61d1-4121-accc-03f792670841"
msgid "[Give the fragment of the cup to the Storyteller]"
msgstr "[잔의 파편을 이야기꾼에게 전달했습니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "bdfb48ff-acff-4939-b5a6-a676ba1b09dc"
msgid "\"I need rest. Could you help me?\""
msgstr "\"나는 휴식이 필요해. 나를 도와 줄 수 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "d251c6b2-628b-4ea5-8326-e73020ec0b86"
msgid "\"I have to go. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "2cf5045c-4448-4bc3-80dc-28c51f103601"
msgid "\"Do you know where my other allies are?\""
msgstr "\"내 동료가 어디 있는지 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "f4108fab-004d-462d-9477-ebe57e9d6834"
msgid "\"Do you know where to look for fragments of the cup?\""
msgstr "\"잔의 파편을 찾을 곳을 알아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "f884a765-c62d-457f-bc99-cea08edc6c3a"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness — the artifact that you just found is of the utmost "
"importance! It's a fragment of the accursed Apology goblet. Somewhere in the "
"city, a few more still remain. If you can find and deliver these fragments "
"to me, I will try to destroy them... thus weakening the power of the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하 — 당신이 방금 발견한 유물은 매우 중요합니다! 이것은 저주받은 잔인 사죄의 파편입니다. 도시의 어딘가에 몇 개 더 "
"남아있습니다. 이 파편들을 발견해 저에게 가져다 주신다면, 제가 파괴해 보겠습니다... 그러면 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 "
"힘이 약해질 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "d31c3a9f-f5ed-41bb-8f3f-7574ed0e06bc"
msgid ""
"\"The bond between the creation and creator is complicated, almost "
"inconceivable. When the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} created the cup, the "
"material symbol of Nyrissa's curse, he never dreamed that his creation might "
"be used against him. And yet it can be done.\n"
"I have devoted my life to creating and reforging artifacts from ages past. "
"But now I shall have to do the opposite — to reduce one to dust, not to "
"restore it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"창조주와 피조물 사이의 유대는 상상할 수 없을 만큼 복잡합니다. {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 나이리사에게 내린 저주의 "
"물질적인 상징인 그 잔을 만들었을 때, 그의 피조물이 자신을 상대로 사용될 거라고는 꿈도 꾸지 못했을 테죠. 그리고 여전히 그것이 "
"가능합니다.\n"
"저는 과거의 유물을 창조하고 재조하는 일에 헌신해왔습니다. 그러나 지금 저는 그와 반대되는 일을 해야 합니다 — 복원하는 게 아니라, "
"가루로 만드는 것이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "8f35a757-08bd-48b6-9493-72ad25f50ce5"
msgid "\"Your Highness, how can I help?\""
msgstr "\"전하, 어떻게 도와드릴까요?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "5fa19132-6c44-49b4-9d95-785eb0cfe327"
msgid ""
"{n}The Storyteller carefully takes the fragment from your hand and sighs, as "
"if yielding to the inevitable.{/n} \"My hands are trained to create and "
"restore, not to destroy. But in destroying this fragment, we will protect "
"thousands of lives from destruction. It must be done.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이야기꾼은 굴복하는 것처럼 한숨을 쉬며 신중하게 당신의 손에서 조각을 가져옵니다.{/n} \"제 손은 파괴가 아니라 창조하고 "
"복원하도록 훈련받았습니다. 허나 이 파편을 파괴하면, 수천 명의 생명을 파괴로부터 보호할 수 있겠죠. 그러니 해야만 합니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "a8577e42-7968-4906-82dc-b94faeee95da"
msgid ""
"\"Another one, Your Highness? Good... I feel the wall of power that encloses "
"your former residence is slowly melting. Three fragments may be enough to "
"clear a path...\""
msgstr ""
"\"또 하나입니까, 전하? 좋습니다... 당신의 옛 거주지를 둘러싸고 있는 마법의 장벽이 서서히 녹고있는 것이 느껴집니다. 길을 "
"만드는데는 세 조각이면 충분할 겁니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "f26d73cf-2c99-4336-be4e-9a27a95f8760"
msgid ""
"\"A third. Yes, this is the last one... Prepare yourself, Your Highness. "
"With the third fragment, the barriers around your castle will fall. The "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} will be waiting, ready to give you an "
"audience...\""
msgstr ""
"\"세 번째군요. 예, 이것이 마지막입니다... 준비하십시오, 전하. 세 번째 조각과 함께 당신의 성 주변 장벽이 무너질 것입니다. "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 알현 준비를 마치고 기다리고 있을 겁니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "87e8d7a4-b5e6-40ba-9283-7e66fce5d22d"
msgid "\"Of course. But please don't forget that time is running out...\""
msgstr "\"물론입니다. 하지만 시간이 부족하다는 걸 잊지 마십시오...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "2ce16f3a-db3b-4acf-aae2-643c27a5273f"
msgid ""
"\"They are scattered across the islands that the capital has become. This is "
"fortunate in a way — the servants of the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} are "
"also scattered, chasing them. Our task would have been much harder if their "
"forces were assembled here. Don't worry about your allies — you must focus "
"on your mission. They will protect themselves and find a way to rejoin you, "
"sooner or later.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그들은 수도였던 섬 전체에 흩어져 있습니다. 어쩌면 행운일지도 모르죠 — {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 하수인들 또한 "
"그들을 쫓아다니느라 흩어져 있으니까요. 그들의 힘이 여기 모여있었다면, 저희 임무가 훨씬 더 어려웠을 테지요. 동맹들에 대해선 걱정하지 "
"마십시오. 당신은 당신의 임무에 집중하셔야만 합니다. 그들은 스스로를 보호할 수 있고, 머지 않아 합류할 방법을 찾아낼 겁니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/CollectorDialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Collector
msgctxt "0c5d9cfb-be42-4600-a459-41c1c09075fc"
msgid ""
"\"They might be anywhere, Your Highness. Everything is so chaotic that I can "
"barely sense their presence at all.\""
msgstr "\"그것들은 어디에나 있을 수 있습니다. 모든 것이 너무 혼란스럽기 때문에 그들의 존재만을 간신히 느낄 수 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Answer_0003_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "6b185476-d160-4540-b1a0-7be6629cdaba"
msgid "Lured Evindra into Tsanna's trap."
msgstr "에빈드라를 산나의 함정에 끌어들였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "81f4ad5e-d704-4047-9f37-d3c0c59b653c"
msgid ""
"[Lure Evindra into a trap] \"Evindra, my advisor Tsanna needs the advice of "
"someone who knows the First World well. She is up ahead, waiting not far "
"from here. Will you help?\""
msgstr ""
"[에빈드라를 함정에 끌어들였습니다] \"에빈드라. 내 보좌관 산나는 태초 세계를 잘 아는 사람의 조언이 필요하다. 여기서 멀지 않은 "
"곳에서 그녀가 기다리고 있다. 도와주겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "e42dc60a-0e21-409f-82a0-e4efce16422d"
msgid "\"I have to go. Goodbye!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Answer_0007_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "1d5cff1c-ba90-4426-ad8d-fae010682dd9"
msgid "Warned Evindra."
msgstr "에빈드라에게 경고했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "b3896808-875f-461e-8547-aa841bf26271"
msgid ""
"[Warn Evindra] \"I have to warn you — Tsanna, a priestess of Lamashtu, has "
"chosen you as a sacrifice for her goddess.\""
msgstr "[에빈드라에게 경고합니다] \"나는 너에게 경고해야겠다. 라마슈투의 여사제인 산나가 너를 제물로 선택했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Evindra
msgctxt "3710e5e8-a888-438d-a25e-87dcfc9d7383"
msgid ""
"{n}Evindra stops what she's doing and looks up at you with her big sad "
"eyes.{/n} \"Can I do something to help?\""
msgstr "{n}에빈드라는 하고 있는 일을 멈추고 슬픈 눈으로 당신을 바라봅니다.{/n} \"내가 뭔가 도워줘야해?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Evindra
msgctxt "a638f160-2a5f-442e-90b0-6f5d55897c68"
msgid ""
"\"No one truly knows the {g|First World}First World{/g}, even I who was born "
"and raised here. But I will help as well as I can. This is what I'm here for."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"아무도 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}를 잘 알지 못한다, 심지어 여기에서 태어나고 자란 나도 그렇다. 그러나 내가 할 "
"수 있는 한 도울 것이다. 이것이 내가 여기있는 이유이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Evindra
msgctxt "ed747515-40c3-4f5b-b50f-648759c6ee14"
msgid ""
"\"Of course, this is a pointless wish, but nevertheless — please be careful. "
"The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} is the foe of foes. His power can only be matched "
"by his guile...\""
msgstr ""
"\"물론, 이것은 무의미한 소원일 수 있지만, 조심해라. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 적 중의 적이다. 그의 힘은 그의 속임수에 "
"의해서만 맞설 수 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/EvindraDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Evindra
msgctxt "cccc69a3-a50f-47ae-b443-83575ba83c1e"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid flinches.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} sacrifice! I'm sure "
"I would be gone forever, if that horrendous deity claimed my life.\n"
"Thank you for warning me... I will be careful. Anyway, I must live to see "
"your victory over the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} — and see his crown "
"fall!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드는 허둥댑니다.{/n} \"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 제물이라니! 그 무서운 신이 내 삶을 원한다면, 나는 "
"영원히 사라질 것이다.\n"
"경고해주어 고맙다... 조심하겠다. 어쨌든 나는 네가 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}에게 이기는 것을, 그리고 그의 왕관이 "
"떨어지는 꼴을 보기 위해 살아야만 한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/GoblinTraderDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "ae452d76-2e12-429b-8e02-0ef8e88202f1"
msgid "\"Let me see your wares.\""
msgstr "\"네 물건을 보게 해 줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/GoblinTraderDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "680adedb-f9e4-432e-badd-35b0d5fb4141"
msgid "\"How did you get here?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/GoblinTraderDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "07f8771b-34a8-4331-8898-96709e2f8120"
msgid "\"All right, I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/GoblinTraderDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_GoblinTrader
msgctxt "8cd697f5-beca-4671-a7f9-c7718d170509"
msgid ""
"{n}Chwurk happily taps his foot as you approach.{/n} \"Ah, adventurer "
"friend! You help goblins, Chwurk help you! Bring good wares, trade them for "
"nothing!"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 접하자 츄와크는 행복하게 그의 발을 두드립니다.{/n} \"아. 모험가 친구! 너는 고블린을 도왔다. 츄와크는 도와준다! "
"물건을 가져오면 공짜로 교환해준다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/GoblinTraderDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_GoblinTrader
msgctxt "dd9399ad-f81d-4fa7-bb94-429cc11f9fb3"
msgid "\"Come again!\""
msgstr "\"다시 와라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/GoblinTraderDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_GoblinTrader
msgctxt "ba271f65-e0a9-4120-bcaa-a3816a5f5f73"
msgid ""
"{n}The goblin is sincerely surprised by the question.{/n} \"Go-go, my cart "
"push-push, come! Or you think Chwurk can fly, uaha-ha-ha?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}고블린은 그 질문에 진심으로 놀랐습니다.{/n} \"출발 출발하고, 내 수레 밀어 밀어서, 여기 왔지! 아니면 츄와크가 날 수 "
"있다고 생각해? 하하하!?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "057d4f9a-9275-4b1f-8cdd-cf0ad2827ad6"
msgid "\"I'm glad of your return, old friend. I will need your help.\""
msgstr "\"네가 돌아 오니 기쁘다. 오랜 친구. 너의 도움이 필요할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "51e617ab-009c-4dde-9d70-770333e2993e"
msgid "\"Jhod? How can you be here?! — You died!\""
msgstr "\"조드? 당신이 여기에 어떻게 있지? 너는 죽었잖아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "c9b0373f-fa79-4a1b-8cbb-93cdbb985260"
msgid "\"Kesten? But I saw you die...\""
msgstr "\"케스턴? 네가 죽는 걸 봤는데...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "44710b39-9a7b-40bf-8f22-3409802f4fd4"
msgid "\"Thank you for your offer, Sir Weren. I could use your help.\""
msgstr "\"제안에 감사하다, 웨런 경. 나는 네 도움을 받겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "8ac55cae-9062-45df-9b81-70dc419b49d7"
msgid ""
"\"Did you really think you could fool me so easily? You are not a shadow "
"from the cup!\""
msgstr "\"네가 정말 나를 속일 수 있다고 생각했나? 너는 잔의 그림자가 아니야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "70024518-5c07-4acf-8659-8dc66556e296"
msgid ""
"\"Away, shadow! I will never trust an apparition born of the Lantern King's "
"magic.\""
msgstr "\"물럿거라! 그림자! 나는 등불왕의 마법으로 태어난 유령은 결코 믿지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0001_Kesten_FD_Text_String
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Kesten
msgctxt "fbcf4296-de42-4ba7-8931-b8dd88fdb645"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten leans on his sword heavily, but speaks in his usual measured "
"manner.{/n} \"Your Highness, I beg to report. The city is flooded with "
"hostile {g|First World}First World{/g} creatures, and your allies are "
"scattered. It all happened within minutes: we entered the gate, and the "
"ground split open — some went up, some down, and all somehow in complete "
"silence. There's almost no communication between the islands, so our forces "
"are separated and uncoordinated, but we fight as best we can. Also...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 그의 칼에 무겁게 기대지만 평소와 같이 침착한 태도로 말합니다.{/n} \"보고할 것이 있습니다. 도시는 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}의 적대적 생물들로 넘쳐 흐르고, 당신의 동맹들이 흩어져 있습니다. 모든 것이 몇 분 안에 일어났습니다: "
"저희는 문에 들어갔고, 땅이 찢어졌습니다. 어떤 것은 위로 올라 갔고, 어떤 것은 아래로 내려 갔으며, 이 모든 일이 소리 없이 "
"일어났죠. 고립지대 사이로 통신할 수 있는 수단이 거의 없어, 우리 군대는 분리되고 조율되지 않았습니다. 그러나 저희는 최선을 다해 "
"싸우고 있다. 또한...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_JhodShadow
msgctxt "f4691495-25d3-4af7-b02c-c2a3cc94ff20"
msgid ""
"{n}Mumbling unhappily, Jhod steps from behind Kesten's back.{/n} \"You must "
"be watched! See what happens when you're not looked after!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}불행하게 중얼거리며 조드는 케스턴의 뒤에서 걸어나옵니다.{/n} \"너는 반드시 감시당해야 했다! 너를 감시되지 않으니 어떻게 "
"되었는지 보아라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : WerenDegar
msgctxt "677f5b78-af3e-4f3a-b1c8-edb3851bd564"
msgid ""
"{n}The knight makes a brief bow again.{/n} \"My sword is at your disposal. I "
"will stay here for a while and help your people, but I will arrive at once "
"when you face real danger. We shall see much of it on the road ahead.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}기사는 다시 잠깐 인사를 합니다.{/n} \"언제든지 명령을 내려라. 나는 잠시 동안 여기 머물러 사람들을 도울 것이지만, 진짜 "
"위험에 처하면 내가 즉시 도착할 것이다. 우리는 앞으로도 많은 것을 볼 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Jhod
msgctxt "88cc99a0-af9a-4d79-b391-ceb50154eda8"
msgid ""
"{n}Jhod catches his breath.{/n} \"You are a welcome sight, Your Highness. "
"Look what the damned {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} did to the city! As soon as we "
"entered, the ground started trembling silently under our feet, and then it "
"gave way and fell apart! But why am I telling you this — you probably saw "
"the whole thing for yourself... So our team was stuck here, by the gate, "
"together with a whole horde of beasts from the {g|First World}First World{/g}"
". We fought them off somehow, thanks to you — and Erastil! But I don't know "
"what's going on with the others. And also... well, he'll tell you himself!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}조드는 그의 호흡을 가다듬었습니다.{/n} \"잘 오셨습니다, 전하. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 우리 도시에 한 짓을 "
"보십시오! 우리가 들어서자마자 땅은 우리 발 아래서 조용히 떨리기 시작했고, 갑자기 멈추더니 아예 떨어져 나갔습니다! 그런데 왜 내가 "
"당신께 이런말을 했을까요, 당신도 아마 모든 것을 보았을 텐데. 그래서 저희 부대는 문 옆에서 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}"
"의 짐승 무리와 함께 붙어 있었습니다. 저희는 어떻게든 싸웠습니다, 감사하게도 당신과 에라스틸님의 가호가 있어서요! 그러나 다른 "
"사람들에게 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는지 모르겠습니다. 그리고 또한... 뭐, 그가 당신께 말할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_KestenShadow
msgctxt "4b6a3042-9d36-41db-9d96-76716681957d"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten, who stood by silently until this moment, nods to you briefly, and "
"then stares at the ground gloomily.{/n} \"Happy to serve you, Your Grace... "
"I mean — Your Highness!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}이 순간까지 조용히 서있던 케스턴이 간단히 끄덕이고는 우울하게 땅을 응시합니다.{/n} \"당신을 섬겨서 영광입니다, 영주님... "
"아니, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : WerenDegar
msgctxt "658d4969-e059-4419-9218-8014858b76ec"
msgid ""
"\"Allow me to speak for myself, Sir Kesten.\" {n}The knight who helped fend "
"off the attack steps forward and makes a curt, military bow.{/n} \"Greetings"
", Your Highness, I humbly request you hear me out. I come from a duchy you "
"probably haven't heard of, though it's only a day's journey from here. Many "
"ages ago it was destroyed by the fey Nyrissa, and turned into a grain of "
"dust for the sorceress' cursed cup.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 생각을 말할 수 있게 해주십시오.\" {n}공격을 막아내는 데 도움을 준 기사는 앞으로 나아가서 경례를 합니다.{/n} \"내 "
"이야기를 듣기를 청합니다. 아마 이곳에서 하루 정도 밖에 걸리지 않는 거리지만 들어 보지 못했을 공국에서 왔습니다. 수 세기 전 그곳은 "
"나이리사에 의해 파괴되었고, 마법사의 저주받은 잔을 채울 먼지가 되었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_JhodShadow
msgctxt "8712a627-00e8-4511-8551-96b60f1b5a5b"
msgid ""
"\"You can rely on old Jhod, Your Highness! I'll watch over the wounded "
"soldiers here, and then I will catch up with you. The greatest monsters "
"still lie ahead. A priest will come in helpful!\""
msgstr ""
"\"조드에게 의지하십시오! 저는 부상당한 병사들을 지켜보겠습니다. 그리고 나서 당신을 따르겠습니다. 가장 강력한 괴물들이 아직 저 앞에 "
"있습니다. 사제가 필요할 겁니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_JhodShadow
msgctxt "889c05f2-34ec-4020-8b5b-91dd940aab32"
msgid ""
"\"That's all very {d|c22 Kesten saved}true{/d}. But you saw what happened "
"when the cup broke, right? The Stag Lord, Irovetti, and many others from the "
"fallen kingdoms returned from the dead. And I returned along with them. I am "
"a shadow... a memory of the old Jhod Kavken, may {g|Erastil}Erastil{/g} save "
"his soul.\n"
"I wandered around the ruins until I found Kesten — and now you. What else "
"can I do but help you?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그건 전부 {d|c22 Kesten saved}사실입니다{/d}. 하지만 잔이 깨졌을 때 무슨 일이 일어났는지 보지 않으셨습니까? "
"수사슴 군주, 이로베티 등 멸망한 왕국의 죽은 자들이 돌아왔습니다. 그리고 저는 그들과 함께 돌아왔습니다. 저는 그림자입니다.... 예전 "
"조드 카브켄의 기억이겠죠. {g|Erastil}에라스틸{/g}께서 그의 영혼을 구하시길.\n"
"저는 케스턴을 발견할 때까지 유적 주위를 배회했고, 이제는 당신을 만났습니다. 당신을 도울 수밖에 없지 않습니까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_KestenShadow
msgctxt "d887fc33-37b8-4855-9cc9-a2ba8444b752"
msgid ""
"\"{d|c22 Jhod saved}Right.{/d}\" {n}Kesten sighs.{/n} \"Damned fool thing... "
"Never mind — I'm not sorry for any of it! I'm not exactly myself, Your "
"Grace. Did you see the Stag Lord and the others who appeared from the cup? "
"Well, I returned with them. Let the priests decide whether I'm alive or not, "
"but no one has released me from service. I'm here now, helping as best I can."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\" {d|c22 Jhod saved}맞습니다.{/d} \" {n}케스턴이 한숨 쉽니다.{/n} \"바보 같은... 신경 쓰지 마십시오 —"
" 저는 전혀 미안하지 않습니다. 나는 내 자신이 아닙니다. 잔에서 나온 수사슴 군주와 다른 자들을 보셨습니까? 저는 그들과 함께 "
"돌아왔습니다. 제가 살아있는지는 사제가 알겠지만, 제 임무는 누구도 대신하지 못합니다. 저는 지금 할 수 있는 최선을 다하고 있습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : WerenDegar
msgctxt "c03b8b2c-edce-4b5b-8f62-74e0cc809424"
msgid ""
"\"I suppose you've guessed who I am, or rather — what I am. Warriors from "
"all the fallen kingdoms were kept in the cup, and many return as half-mad "
"shadows. I have returned as well. I am the shadow of Sir Weren Degar. But, "
"unlike the other shadows, I have no desire to fight for those who "
"slaughtered my ruler and my people. If you'd allow me, I would help you in "
"your noble cause as best I can.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 누군지 혹은 무엇인지 짐작했을 거라고 생각한다. 멸망한 모든 왕국의 전사들이 잔에 보관되어 있었고, 많은 사람들이 반쯤 미친 "
"그림자로 돌아왔다. 나도 돌아왔다. 웨런 데거의 그림자이다. 다른 그림자와는 달리 내 통치자와 내 백성을 학살한 자를 위해 싸울 생각은 "
"없다. 네가 괜찮다면 최선을 다해 너를 도울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_JhodShadow
msgctxt "631f22dc-c96d-45d1-96dc-b65d5231cdfe"
msgid ""
"{n}The priest hangs his head.{/n} \"Why... where am I going to... ah, fine! "
"I'll look for people in the city. Surely someone needs my help...\"\n"
"{n}He walks away with his head to the ground.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}사제가 고개를 푹 숙입니다.{/n} \"왜... 내가 어디로... 아. 좋아! 도시의 사람들을 찾아보겠습니다. 분명 누군가는 제 "
"도움이 필요하겠죠...\"\n"
"{n}그는 땅에 시선을 고정하고 걸어갑니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_KestenShadow
msgctxt "83e76cc2-ff29-4eb6-9102-962d182b3eac"
msgid ""
"{n}Kesten frowns and shrugs but does not dare argue.{/n} \"As you wish, Your "
"Highness. I'll go then... And look for someone in the city who needs help..."
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}케스턴은 찡그리고 어깨를 으쓱하지만, 토달지 않습니다.{/n} \"당신이 원하는대로, 전하. 그러면 가보겠습니다... 도시에서 "
"도움을 필요로 하는 사람을 찾겠습니다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : WerenDegar
msgctxt "e8f11cf2-b60d-461b-94b4-fe1860521e1b"
msgid ""
"\"I'm impressed with your sharp eyes and deep knowledge, {mf|king|queen}. "
"Though you are not the first mortal ruler to surprise me. And not the first "
"one to die by my sword — for the pleasure of the true king, the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너의 날카로운 안목과 깊은 지식에 깊은 인상을 받았다, {mf|왕|여왕}. 네가 나를 놀라게 한 첫 번째 필멸자 통치자는 "
"아니지만. 그리고 진정한 왕 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 즐거움을 위해서 나의 칼에 의해 죽을 첫 번째 필멸자도 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : WerenDegar
msgctxt "b9e4dd91-1998-485f-84b3-10615412544c"
msgid ""
"\"I understand your suspicions, although I am truly sorry for it. Very well, "
"so long, Your Highness!\""
msgstr "\"몹시 유감이지만, 너의 의심을 이해한다. 좋아, 안녕히, 전하!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_KestenShadow
msgctxt "f50e85ea-a493-4113-a7be-9c742e8e1b99"
msgid ""
"\"Yes, Your Highness! I'll talk to the soldiers now, and then catch up with "
"you. Something strange is happening up ahead. There's some monster lurking "
"around where there used to be a tavern. But we'll help bring it down!\""
msgstr ""
"\"예, 전하! 지금 병사들과 이야기하고 곧 따라가겠습니다. 이상한 일이 일어나고 있습니다. 선술집이 있던 곳 주변에 괴물이 "
"숨어있습니다. 그러나 저희가 그것을 물리치도록 돕겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Kesten
msgctxt "2992ffbd-a61c-4566-af11-165d6d1f00cf"
msgid ""
"\"Your loss, Your Highness. Of course, he wasn't the real Jhod, but he "
"wished us well. All right, then. We need to deal with this disaster — now.\""
msgstr ""
"\"안타깝습니다, 전하. 그는 진짜 조드가 아니었지만, 그는 우리가 무사하길 바랬죠. 좋습니다. 저희는 당장 이 재앙을 처리해야만 합니다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Jhod
msgctxt "a3669add-c927-444c-a4a0-2c3bee558f9d"
msgid ""
"\"That was harsh, Your Highness. But I think you did the right thing. "
"Nothing good can come of the false little god's foul magic. The real Kesten "
"has long been far away from us — and from everything of this world.\""
msgstr ""
"\"힘겨우실테죠, 전하. 하지만 옳은 일을 하셨습니다. 거짓 신의 몹쓸 마법은 좋을 게 없죠. 진짜 케스턴은 오랫동안 우리와 멀리 떨어져 "
"있습니다. 이 세상의 모든 것과도 말이죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "904cfcd6-ad66-4770-a47a-492041177ac1"
msgid "{n}Smoke envelops the grinning shadow, changing its features.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}연기는 웃고 있는 그림자를 감싸며 그 모습을 바꿉니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/KestenJhoddialog/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : WerenDegar
msgctxt "bd15debf-ca05-4043-9e89-c97c23f85460"
msgid ""
"\"I'm impressed with your sharp eyes and deep knowledge, {mf|king|queen}. "
"Though you are not the first mortal ruler to surprise me. And not the first "
"one to die by my sword — for the pleasure of the true king, the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너의 날카로운 안목과 깊은 지식에 깊은 인상을 받았다, {mf|왕|여왕}. 네가 나를 놀라게 한 첫 번째 필멸자 통치자는 "
"아니지만. 그리고 진정한 왕 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 즐거움을 위해서 나의 칼에 의해 죽을 첫 번째 필멸자도 아니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "b858d76a-dd3a-45ba-baf0-7f9be3462461"
msgid ""
"\"My loyalty and duty to the good of my people is stronger than you, Eldest. "
"You cannot take it away.\""
msgstr "\"내 백성에 대한 나의 충성심과 의무는 너보다 강하다, 원로. 너는 그것을 빼앗을 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "6ca797f4-84ad-4699-a86e-ba47455d07c0"
msgid ""
"\"My heart has always belonged to the people, and it always will. Nothing "
"can ever change that.\""
msgstr "\"내 마음은 항상 사람들에게 속해 있고 항상 그럴 것이다. 아무것도 바뀌지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "aefa7230-1522-4f38-8388-e2a32220bd4c"
msgid ""
"\"There are no gods or curses that could take away my thirst for adventure.\""
msgstr "\"내 모험에 대한 갈망은 신도 저주도 없애지 못한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "d33fcf01-34cb-42b7-87bf-923597dbc530"
msgid ""
"\"You are a creature of chaos, Eldest. You know nothing of order, and it's "
"not within your power to destroy it.\""
msgstr "\"너는 혼돈의 생물이다, 원로. 너는 질서에 대해 아무것도 모르고, 너의 힘 또한 질서를 무너뜨리기엔 부족하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "a97c4714-4bb3-4dd7-be96-fa2bc9a987b8"
msgid ""
"\"I never allowed external factors to influence my soul. And I'm not going "
"to start.\""
msgstr "\"나는 외부 요인이 내 영혼에 영향을 미치도록 허락하지 않았다. 그리고 나는 시작하지도 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "a783bfdc-a016-4101-adfd-77f110f2408d"
msgid ""
"\"Very amusing, Eldest. I'll gladly laugh at your joke. And then I'll forget "
"all about it.\""
msgstr "\"매우 재미있군, 원로. 너의 농담에 기꺼이 웃어주지. 그러면 모두 잊을 수 있을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0019_Text
msgctxt "54f53569-f13c-47e8-b03c-294e2b4486ce"
msgid ""
"\"I make the world live by my rules. — And there's no rule about letting you "
"take part of my soul.\""
msgstr "\"나는 세상이 나의 규칙에 따라 돌아가게 한다. 네가 내 영혼에 간섭하는 것은 규칙에 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "93e5ba48-6a6f-4f43-996a-64ca597d0a23"
msgid ""
"\"There is no greater power than the power you have over your own soul. I "
"have it, Eldest, and you do not.\""
msgstr "\"영혼에 담긴 힘보다 더 위대한 힘은 없다. 나에게는 있지만, 원로, 너에게는 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "08039520-320f-41ed-baf1-9e0fbb8a9860"
msgid ""
"\"I can play with others' souls like I'm playing with dolls. Your tricks "
"won't work on me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 인형 놀이처럼 다른 사람의 영혼을 가지고 놀 수 있다. 너의 장난은 나에게 효과가 없을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0022_Text
msgctxt "2b418616-1c9b-48a7-9731-f7b7e2eaa489"
msgid "\"Your words are nothing more than wind. Let them fly away.\""
msgstr "\"너의 말은 바람에 지나지 않다. 날아가게 두어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "8f1b24b6-e9a6-43eb-967c-7090e8b31993"
msgid ""
"\"You love to wreak havoc and play evil pranks, while I care about nothing "
"more than the good of my people. And I know my way is right.\""
msgstr "\"너는 파괴와 사악한 장난을 좋아하지만, 나는 내 국민의 이익이 제일 중요하다. 또한 내 길이 옳다는 사실을 안다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "9a714f31-ee6a-40c6-8930-d03f6536a7de"
msgid ""
"\"I get my power from the endless loyalty of my subjects. Can you make a "
"similar boast?\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 백성들의 끝없는 충성심으로부터 힘을 얻는다. 너 또한 그러한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0029_Text
msgctxt "0de8323c-21fb-410f-a75d-114461d499f6"
msgid ""
"\"My kingdom is strong with its warriors, so it can always protect itself. — "
"And that means I can too — even if I were facing a deity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 왕국에는 강력한 전사들이 있다, 그래서 언제나 스스로를 지킬 수 있다. 그것은 나 또한 그렇다는 의미이다 — 심지어 내가 신과 "
"만나더라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "2d36ec4c-5035-4727-adb4-e79d9673dbaf"
msgid ""
"\"And why do you imagine I told you the truth back then, Eldest of mischief "
"and lies? Perhaps you are the one who was fooled? One who can be fooled so "
"easily has no power over words!\""
msgstr ""
"\"허면 왜 내가 진실을 말했을 거라고 상상했지, 장난과 거짓의 원로여? 바보가 된 것은 네가 아닐까? 이렇게 쉽게 속을 수 있는 자의 "
"말에는 어떤 힘도 담기지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0032_Text
msgctxt "e3f2d80a-9334-4e5b-b719-ce20603e5090"
msgid ""
"\"I might not be a deity, but my kingdom is rich and prosperous. And so is "
"my power.\""
msgstr "\"나는 신이 아니지만, 나의 왕국은 풍족하고 번영했다. 그것이 나의 힘이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "1b6cfcac-274a-4bfd-a344-81cfb4a68cf8"
msgid ""
"\"You talk about yourself so much. But do you have friends or allies, "
"Eldest? I always have someone to lean on, which is why I and my land will "
"survive any hardship.\""
msgstr ""
"\"스스로에 대해 너무 많이 이야기하는군. 원로여, 친구나 동료는 있는가? 나는 언제나 기댈 사람이 있고, 그것은 나와 내 땅이 어떤 "
"어려움에도 살아남을 수 있는 이유다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0034_Text
msgctxt "c7d8dee2-7d47-4d92-8e35-1e9b586362c3"
msgid ""
"\"Don't threaten me, self-proclaimed deity. My kingdom is a true stronghold "
"of faith, and from it I gather my strength.\""
msgstr "\"자칭 신 따위가 나를 위협하지 마라. 나의 왕국은 진정한 믿음의 거점이며, 나는 그로부터 힘을 얻는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "2866f6d8-6c6e-4400-a25f-08f7971e465c"
msgid ""
"\"With all my knowledge of magic, with all the arcane power my country "
"possesses, I have no fear of you, Eldest.\""
msgstr "\"내 모든 마법 지식과, 우리 나라가 가진 모든 비전 역량 덕분에 나는 너를 두려워 할 필요가 없다, 원로\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0036_Text
msgctxt "8ce8b64b-a1c2-45b8-a4ea-031e17d77e71"
msgid ""
"\"I've put much effort into making my state strong against any chaos or "
"threats. My kingdom is a secure stronghold. Even if I were facing a deity.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 나의 영토가 어떤 혼돈이나 위협을 만나도 강해지도록 많은 노력을 기울였다. 나의 왕국은 무적의 요새이다. 심지어 내가 신과 "
"대적하더라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0037_Text
msgctxt "5fbb63a9-dbd2-4e78-9ebb-ed72d737fba9"
msgid ""
"\"Knowledge and inspiration are as powerful as magic. My kingdom's subjects "
"know this full well. We have what it takes to protect ourselves from your "
"evil.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지식과 영감은 마법 만큼이나 강력하다. 내 왕국의 백성들은 이 모든 것을 잘 알고 있다. 우리는 스스로를 악으로부터 보호하기 위해 "
"필요한 것을 가지고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0038_Text
msgctxt "c98b3dbd-6531-467b-8ce1-0efb09005092"
msgid ""
"\"What are you jokes and chaos worth? Being a ruler, I strove to know "
"everything about everyone. That is true power!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 하는 농담과 혼란이 가치가 있나? 통치자로서, 나는 모든 사람의 모든 것을 이해하기 위해 노력했다. 그것이 진정한 힘이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0039_Text
msgctxt "97b19bd8-bb51-421b-b524-6ddb21e18469"
msgid ""
"\"I know enough about divinity to say that you are no deity. Don't try to "
"scare me. You don't possess that sort of power.\""
msgstr ""
"\"신성에 대한 나의 얄팍한 지식만으로도 네가 신이 아니라는 것쯤은 알겠다. 나를 겁주려 하지 마라. 너는 그런 힘을 가지지 못했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0040_Text
msgctxt "6ab6f125-0c6d-45e4-b7d5-5e51e12b7cb3"
msgid ""
"\"I know enough about magic and sorcery, so don't try to threaten me. All "
"you are is the most treacherous monster I've ever had the chance to defeat.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 마법과 주문에 대해 충분히 알고 있다, 그러니 위협하려 하지 말아라. 너는 내가 잡을 수 있는 가장 위험한 괴물일 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0048_Text
msgctxt "69e1a00f-95bd-4622-accc-c32585d7b9f0"
msgid ""
"\"I won't allow such evil to happen. And being what I am, I will retrieve "
"what's been taken from me.\""
msgstr "\"나는 그러한 악행을 허용하지 않을 것이다. 그리고 내가 당한 그대로, 나는 내가 빼앗긴 것들을 돌려받겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "bd83eeaa-0574-455a-931d-dd77994e90c3"
msgid ""
"\"You took not my pillar of strength, but just useful tools. But it's in my "
"power to take them back.\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 힘의 원천이 아닌, 유용한 도구를 가져갔을 뿐이다. 하지만 내 힘은 그것들을 되찾고도 남지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0050_Text
msgctxt "b63757a2-41d3-40a9-9e24-af992068ca0a"
msgid ""
"\"I am beyond your power, Eldest. Yours or anyone else's. But being what I "
"am, I will change what you have done.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너의 능력을 초월했다, 원로. 너를 포함한 누구라도 날 앞설 수 없다. 하지만 내가 당한 그대로, 나는 네가 저지른 짓을 되돌릴 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "84efe103-66ce-4dc6-a883-e598efb21759"
msgid ""
"\"You don't have the right to take anything from me, Eldest. But I have the "
"right to retrieve what's been taken unfairly.\""
msgstr "\"너는 나에게서 어떤 것도 가져갈 권리가 없다. 원로. 하지만 나에겐 불공평하게 빼앗긴 것을 되찾을 권리가 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Answer_0052_Text
msgctxt "6930736c-f8ff-43b4-86e5-df1596917319"
msgid ""
"\"What, is there a rule by which those like you dictate another's will? Even "
"if there is such a rule, I'll break it. I will take back what is mine.\""
msgstr ""
"\"뭐, 너 따위가 다른 사람의 의지를 꺾을 권리가 있나? 그런 규칙이 있더라도, 내가 깨뜨릴 것이다. 나는 내 것들을 되찾겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "b7cacc59-a64b-4d50-8628-0c7506ae0ed1"
msgid ""
"\"Enough!\"\n"
"{n}As soon as the Horned Hunter's body disappears in the fire, the destroyed "
"throne room is flooded with light. The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}, in "
"his true blazing form, appears in the middle of the room. His furious mask "
"is ringed by fire. The games have ended.\n"
"Time freezes like resin, trapping you and the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} in amber "
"light. And this light grows brighter...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그만!\" \n"
"{n}뿔달린 헌터의 시신이 불 속에서 사라지자 마자, 파괴된 보좌 방이 빛으로 넘쳐 흐릅니다. {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 "
"그의 진정한 형태인 불타는 모습을 갖추고 방의 한가운데에 나타납니다. 그의 맹렬한 가면에 불의 고리가 걸려있습니다. 놀이는 끝났습니다. "
"\n"
"시간은 송진처럼 멈추었고 당신과 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}를 호박색 빛 속에 가둡니다. 그리고 이 빛은 더욱 밝아집니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "3614dd4e-586f-4023-99f2-ed23ad016014"
msgid ""
"{n}The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} starts talking. You hear his voice "
"not with your ears — it comes to you through the rays of light, burning and "
"compelling.{/n}\n"
"\"The time for masks is over. You risk challenging an {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, "
"and I accept the challenge. You will fight not a mere embodiment, but my "
"true essence.\n"
"This is my essence: I don't need magic, or servile monsters to destroy you. "
"Words are enough. Yes, words.\n"
"I once told you: words spoken in the right time and place possess the power "
"of a storm. You light-heartedly answered that you know what your power and "
"essence are.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 말하기 시작합니다. 당신은 귀가 아닌 곳으로 그의 목소리를 듣습니다 — 그것은 강렬하게 "
"타오르는 빛의 광선을 통해 들려옵니다.{/n}\n"
"\"가면 놀이는 끝났다. 너는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 도전하는 위험을 감수했다, 그리고 나는 그 도전을 받아들인다. 너는 내 "
"화신이 아니라 내 진정한 본질과 싸울 것이다.\n"
"이것이 나의 본질이다: 나는 너를 파괴하기 위해 마법이나 말을 잘 듣는 괴물을 필요로 하지 않는다. 몇 마디면 충분하다. 그래, 몇 마디."
"\n"
"언젠가 나는 너에게 말했었다: 적절한 시기와 장소에서 말한 단어는 폭풍의 힘을 가지고 있다고. 너는 가벼운 마음으로 네가 알고 있는 네 "
"힘과 본질이 무엇인지 대답했었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "c1d6cd0a-7a2a-40b6-9ec4-3dbad6639d03"
msgid "\"… In duty and the desire to make the world a better place.\""
msgstr "\"… 세상을 더 좋은 곳으로 만들고자 하는 욕망과 의무감이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "1b504b85-e606-435e-8177-6d074517553e"
msgid "\"… In the desire to help people whose grief touches you.\""
msgstr "\"… 네 심금을 울리는 슬픔을 가진 이들을 돕기 위함이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "4bed603d-e0f5-482d-bac3-73a2b149741d"
msgid "\"… In the thirst for adventures.\""
msgstr "\"… 모험에 대한 갈망이라고\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "e06e8b5e-d3bd-4fdc-84ff-7f0782808181"
msgid "\"… In the dedication to bring order to chaos.\""
msgstr "\"… 혼돈 속에 질서를 가져오기 위한 헌신이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "c877d4e8-c30b-4ef8-988c-2fdd46aa6bf2"
msgid "\"… In neutrality and following your way.\""
msgstr "\"… 어느 쪽도 아닌 너의 길을 따르기 위함이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "dbde6c8c-f381-4c1c-93d6-abe652ffa509"
msgid "\"… In jokes and lightness with which they are said.\""
msgstr "\"… 그들 언행의 농담과 가벼움 때문이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "0e23fe89-714d-4aeb-a61e-139fac4c4103"
msgid "\"… In the desire to make the world live by your rules.\""
msgstr "\"… 너의 규칙에 따라 세상을 살고 싶기 때문이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "b12692f4-27cd-4308-b161-5b5656ba6813"
msgid "\"… In thirst for power.\""
msgstr "\"… 힘에 대한 갈망이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "15b62c89-f5c6-41d3-b6ae-23b5190e4b66"
msgid "\"… In the desire to play with others' lives and fates."
msgstr "\"… 다른 사람들의 삶과 운명을 좌지우지하기 위함이라고.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "109b37da-03e6-4f90-8767-62fd29fb9fd2"
msgid ""
"{n}A wave of pain comes crashing down upon you, but recedes quickly. You "
"cannot tell whether you were protected by your words, or something more — "
"the essence of your soul. But the attack of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} was "
"parried.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}고통의 물결이 당신에게 쏟아져 나오지만, 빠르게 사라집니다. 당신은 당신의 말로 보호 받았는지, 혹은 그 이상의 무언가 — 영혼의 "
"본질이 그랬는지 알 수 없었습니다. 그러나 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 공격은 받아 넘겨졌습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "e55b9ad3-0e6c-49d2-88bf-76d18830a776"
msgid ""
"{n}The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} laughs. This laughter — soft, "
"insinuating, almost amiable — is scarier than any nightmare. It resonates "
"with the hot metal splinter — the curse within your soul — making it "
"stronger, slashing at your essence, and taking away something essential that "
"nourishes your power.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 웃습니다. 이 웃음 — 부드럽고, 간사하고, 거의 쾌활하기까지 한 —은 어떤 악몽보다 "
"무섭습니다. 그것은 뜨거운 금속 조각 — 당신의 영혼 속 저주 — 과 공명하여 더욱 강렬해지고, 당신의 본질을 마구 상처내고, 당신의 "
"힘을 키우는 필수적인 것을 제거합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "2eea5c3b-b02b-4295-abf2-372e84eeef13"
msgid ""
"\"Let us continue.\" {n}The Eldest's voice carefully conceals his "
"thoughts.{/n} \"We both wear a crown. But what do you own? A meager patch of "
"land, a few thousand souls? My dominion is chaos and magic, madness and "
"deceit. Your power is nothing compared to mine. And that is why you are "
"helpless before me. You will take my every blow as a divine punishment, as "
"something... imminent.\"\n"
"{n}Yet again you have little time to answer, and this answer is the only "
"thing that can protect you from the {g|Eldest}Eldest's{/g} next blow...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"계속하자.\" {n}원로의 목소리는 그의 생각을 조심스럽게 숨깁니다.{/n} \"우리 둘 다 왕관을 썼다. 하지만 너는 무엇을 가지고 "
"있지? 메마른 땅 한 조각, 수천 명도 채 못되는 영혼들? 나의 영역은 혼돈과 마법, 광기와 기만이다. 너의 능력은 내 것에 비하면 "
"아무것도 아니다. 그리고 이것이 내 앞의 네가 무력한 이유다. 너는 내 모든 타격을 신성한 처벌로써 받아들일 것이다, 무언가... "
"치명적인 것으로.\"\n"
"{n}그러나 이번에도 당신에게 대답할 시간은 없으며, 이 대답이 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 다음 타격에서 당신을 보호할 수 있는 "
"유일한 방법입니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0042_Text
msgctxt "123f853a-c015-43c1-aa1a-1d93d4361605"
msgid ""
"{n}You feel strange, as if wrapped in an invisible veil that protects you "
"from the {g|Eldest}Eldest's{/g} wrath. And its source is yet your curse. It "
"bound you to your kingdom... but through this bond can pass not only pain "
"and death, but power as well.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}마치 보이지 않는 장막에 감싸여 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 진노에서 보호받는 것처럼, 당신은 이상한 기분을 느낍니다. 그리고 "
"그 근원은 당신의 저주입니다. 그것은 당신을 당신의 왕국에 묶어 놓았습니다... 그러나 이 유대를 통해 고통과 죽음 뿐만 아니라, 힘 "
"또한 전달할 수 있습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "597b5f84-bd81-4ef5-985f-29ec67f99df7"
msgid ""
"{n}The mask of the Lantern King alters for a moment. It shows reproach "
"instead of wrath.{/n} \"You would insult me with this? This?\"\n"
"{n}The curse burns inside you, nearly unbearable.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}등불왕의 가면이 잠시 바뀝니다. 그것은 분노 대신 비난을 보여줍니다.{/n} \"그 정도로 날 모욕하려 했나? 그 정도로?\"\n"
"{n}저주가 당신의 내면을 불태웁니다. 견뎌내는 것은 거의 불가능합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "1e4d3ad6-2220-462f-847e-cebf3c9562f1"
msgid ""
"{n}The rays pass through you, pierce you, ruthlessly baring your most "
"intimate secrets, fears, and desires. Something inside of you resonates with "
"the light of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} — your curse. It is like the splinter "
"of an arrow that remains in the wound, a slow weapon crawling toward your "
"heart. As soon as the rays touch it, it begins to heat up, and then burns "
"with intolerable pain.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}광선이 당신을 통과하고, 꿰뚫고, 가장 사적인 비밀과 두려움, 욕망을 무자비하게 드러냅니다. 내면의 무언가가 "
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 빛에 공명합니다 —당신의 저주입니다. 그것은 상처에 남아있는 화살의 파편처럼, 당신의 심장을 향해 천천히 "
"파고드는 무기입니다. 광선이 그것에 닿자 마자, 뜨거워지기 시작했고, 이윽고 참을 수 없는 고통과 함께 타오릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0053_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "663e62fb-35fb-4bc3-ba51-d20785069fed"
msgid ""
"\"I'm curious what you think of me, cursed {mf|king|queen}. Do you see me as "
"a villain, or a simple joker? In truth — well, you will never be able to "
"conceive of the truth. Being an {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} means being one of the "
"many strings that hold the world in place. Being an Eldest means being such "
"a vast and self-sufficient value that one's equals become strangers and "
"one's inferiors are... entirely insignificant. I am an Eldest. Laughter, "
"guile, transformation — that's what I am. And being what I am, I will let "
"you feel a modicum of my loneliness. I will take away your pillar of "
"strength.\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 나를 어떻게 생각하는지 궁금하구나, 저주받은 {mf|왕|여왕}. 내가 악당으로 보이는가? 아니면 단순한 광대로? 사실 — 좋다, "
"너는 결코 진실을 깨닫지 못할 것이다. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 된다는 것은 세상을 평화롭게 만드는 많은 끈 중의 하나라는 것을 "
"의미한다. 원로가 된다는 것은 그만큼 광대하고 가치가 증명된 존재라는 의미이며, 동등한 누군가는 이방인이 되고, 열등한 누군가는... "
"아주 하찮은 무언가라는 뜻이지. 나는 원로이다. 웃음, 속임수, 변형 — 그것이 바로 나다. 그리고 나 자신으로서, 너에게 내 외로움을 "
"조금 느끼게 해주겠다. 나는 네 힘의 원천을 빼앗겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0054_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "fd47a82c-8775-4570-9858-60d2d707e0ef"
msgid ""
"\"You single-handedly survived a battle with a deity. I'm amazed. Though the "
"battle isn't over yet...\""
msgstr "\"너는 혼자의 힘으로 신과 싸웠다. 나는 놀랐다. 아직 전투는 끝나지 않았지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "5db9d3d1-74ee-441b-b4c6-7d8c7603c571"
msgid ""
"\"I remember your answer. The world remembers it too — your answer, your "
"heart, your essence. And now, cursed {mf|king|queen}, I'm taking this part "
"of your soul — as I took away Nyrissa's ability to love. What you called "
"your essence, is yours no more!\"\n"
"{n}The words of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} fly towards you like an arrow, "
"ready to give new force to the curse that already torments you. You have but "
"an instant to reply...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너의 대답을 기억한다. 세상도 그것을 기억한다. 너의 대답, 너의 진심, 너의 본질을. 그리고, 저주받은 {mf|왕|여왕}이여, "
"지금 네 영혼의 일부를 가져가겠다. 나이리사의 사랑하는 능력을 빼앗았던 것처럼. 네가 너의 본질이라고 부른 것은 더 이상 네 것이 아니다!"
"\"\n"
"{n}당신을 괴롭히는 저주를 강화할 준비를 마친 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 말이 당신을 향해 화살처럼 날아옵니다. 당신은 즉각 "
"대답합니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0065_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "149f91c3-be08-4d30-b0ea-630a2e30e017"
msgid ""
"{n}The blinding light flashes away, frightened like a living creature. The "
"blistering metal of the curse cools. It still hurts, but the pain is no "
"longer unbearable. You stand before the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, as before a "
"blazing living star. And he looks at you as if he's seeing you for the first "
"time.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}눈부신 빛이 깜박거리며, 살아있는 생물처럼 두려워합니다. 저주를 담은 맹렬한 금속은 식어버립니다. 그것은 여전히 아프지만, 이제는 "
"견뎌낼 만합니다. 당신은 타오르며 살아있는 별 같은 {g|Eldest}원로{/g} 앞에 서있습니다. 그리고 그는 당신을 처음 만나는 "
"것처럼 쳐다봅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_5_final
msgctxt "1bb43728-bf7d-4185-b8ed-3db99d9ae94d"
msgid ""
"{n}For a while the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} remains silent. You feel "
"in this silence not angry bewilderment, but endless, boundless "
"astonishment.{/n} \"Good. You can play with words. Let us see if you can "
"withstand the heat of my fire!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잠시 동안 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 침묵합니다. 이 침묵 속에서 느끼는 것은 화나 당황이 아니라, 끝없는, 무한한 "
"놀라움입니다.{/n} \"좋아. 말로 나를 갖고 놀았겠다. 내 불길의 열을 견딜 수 있는지 보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0069_Text
msgctxt "f2f0c5ad-860f-4182-b07c-5f8b8f1561dc"
msgid ""
"{n}There is great power in knowledge. It wraps you in an invisible veil, and "
"protects from the {g|Eldest}Eldest's{/g} blow. You feel his fury, but you "
"know that it is not divine wrath, but the emotion of an ancient being — "
"mighty, but not almighty.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}지식에는 큰 힘이 있습니다. 그것은 당신을 보이지 않는 베일로 감쌌고, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 공격에서 당신을 보호합니다. "
"당신은 그의 분노를 느끼지만 그것이 신성한 분노가 아니라 고대 존재의 감정인 것을 압니다. 그것은 강력하지만, 전능하지는 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKBattle/Cue_0070_Text
msgctxt "3b90db83-7d44-4fd8-a19b-4069998d5e83"
msgid ""
"{n}Having lost all support, you face the deity alone. Silence hangs heavy "
"over the ruined throne room.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}모든 조력자를 잃은 채, 당신은 홀로 신과 마주합니다. 이어지는 침묵이 폐허가 된 왕좌의 방을 채웁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "5e6c8320-b2e4-46b5-b32d-e55dec1394c9"
msgid "\"Nyrissa, it's time! Do just as we planned!\""
msgstr "\"나이리사. 지금이야! 계획했던대로 해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "373f60d6-2716-4080-b50c-058a95e1c929"
msgid ""
"\"I will not bow to you, Eldest, don't get your hopes up. Here is my offer: "
"lift the curse, return my kingdom to Golarion, and forget we exist. And I "
"will forget that you exist.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너에게 굴하지 않을 것이다, 원로. 희망을 갖지 마라. 제안이 하나 있다: 저주를 풀고, 내 왕국을 골라리온으로 돌려 보내고, "
"우리의 존재를 잊어라. 우리도 네가 존재한다는 것을 잊을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "13439e83-4b73-4f84-9af1-3841aa2f22a0"
msgid ""
"\"Eternal life and power? The patronage of the Eldest? I like this reward.\""
msgstr "\"영원한 생명과 힘? 원로의 후원? 나는 이 보상이 좋다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "673b24b6-79bc-4987-9eec-65148be0d025"
msgid ""
"\"What will you ask in return for immortality, Eldest? And what exactly do "
"you offer as a reward?\""
msgstr "\"영원 불멸의 대가로 무엇을 바라나? 원로? 보상으로 정확히 무엇을 제안하는거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "df20d569-d541-436e-bfcc-9abc2adeb3e8"
msgid ""
"\"You will not bring your evil here, Eldest. I will fight you for an "
"eternity if I must, to protect what I cherish.\""
msgstr "\"너는 이곳에 네 악의를 가져오지 못할 것이다, 원로. 해야만 한다면, 내가 소중히 여기는 것을 위해 영원히 싸울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "4470847e-bb12-41b2-8569-bb25ddc810da"
msgid "\"You have no power over me, Eldest. Neither does your curse!\""
msgstr "\"너는 나를 장악할 힘이 없다, 원로. 너의 저주도 마찬가지다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0017_Text
msgctxt "ab718818-776b-43d2-8951-6cf1180ec63a"
msgid "[Finish him] \"Are you sure I can't kill you? I think I'll try!\""
msgstr "[마무리한다] \"내가 너를 죽일 수 없다고 확신하나? 시험해 보지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0023_Text
msgctxt "fd6e1962-c700-465a-9236-38bf7bdc9968"
msgid ""
"\"I'll take Nyrissa's offer. Immortality and salvation for my kingdom — but "
"with nothing to do with you, Eldest.\""
msgstr "\"나는 나이리사의 제안을 받아들일 것이다. 나의 왕국의 불멸과 구원을 위해. 그러나 너와는 아무런 상관이 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0046_Text
msgctxt "d0e8ea84-c3d7-4626-9389-5304998446cc"
msgid ""
"\"What about Nyrissa? What will happen to her, if I agree to your offer?\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 어떨까? 네 제안에 동의한다면 그녀는 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0051_Text
msgctxt "ba8b90b4-cb0b-4895-940c-a833d8e0483a"
msgid ""
"\"I will accept the Lantern King's offer, but only to save you, Nyrissa. "
"Life in peace is better than eternal war... even if it's a life apart.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 등불왕의 제안을 받아들일 것이지만, 오직 너를 구하기 위해서야. 나이리사. 평온한 삶은 영원한 전쟁보다 낫다... 심지어 떨어져 "
"있더라도.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0054_Text
msgctxt "eeb5b2ff-f71b-450f-91c6-01aa35a5863e"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa, why do you offer to sacrifice yourself? Even if we cannot kill "
"the Eldest here and now, we will continue to fight!\""
msgstr "\"나이리사. 왜 희생하겠다는 제안을 한 거야? 우리가 여기서 원로를 죽일 수 없다 하더라도, 우리는 계속 싸울 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0056_Text
msgctxt "a42059c3-f68c-414b-be67-69f458505cf7"
msgid ""
"\"I am the only true {mf|king|queen} here. You, Eldest, are no one before "
"me. And your curse is but dust and ash!\""
msgstr "\"나는 이곳의 유일한 {mf|왕|여왕}이다. 원로, 너는 내게 아무것도 아니다. 너의 저주는 먼지와 재일 뿐이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0057_Text
msgctxt "31cf9935-6307-47ee-b398-069e1d16936d"
msgid ""
"\"Eldest, by your curse, the one ruling the kingdom will die with it. But I "
"am no longer the ruler of these lands. You have stolen them from me, and so "
"you will bear the burden of the curse!\""
msgstr ""
"\"원로, 너의 저주에 의해, 왕국을 통치하는 자는 죽을 것이다. 그러나 나는 더 이상 이 땅의 통치자가 아니다. 너는 내 땅을 "
"훔쳐갔고, 따라서 너는 저주의 무게를 질 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0058_Text
msgctxt "e2bb9877-4b45-451f-9645-0d84b7c51e4c"
msgid ""
"\"Eldest, by your curse, all the woes of the kingdom will fall upon the one "
"who rules it. So by my royal power I appoint you ruler of my lands. He who "
"owns the land owns pain and death!\""
msgstr ""
"\"원로, 너의 저주에 의해, 왕국을 통치하는 자는 왕국의 모든 비애를 짊어질 것이다. 그러니 나의 고귀한 권력으로 너를 이 땅의 "
"통치자로 임명하노라. 이 땅을 소유자인 그는 고통과 죽음 또한 소유한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Answer_0065_Text
msgctxt "4ce0ea5c-510d-4058-9be2-ab6a3f300fb5"
msgid "\"What do you suggest, Nyrissa?\""
msgstr "\"무엇을 제안할 건가? 나이리사?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "3068a85e-8e7c-4a2c-ae2d-0c539d0399c4"
msgid ""
"{n}Few have had the chance to see a star die. Spots of cold, lifeless "
"darkness cover the fiery form of the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}, "
"growing, devouring, and with a dull moan, settling onto the ground in a "
"cloud of coal-black dust.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}별이 죽는 것을 볼 기회가 있는 사람은 거의 없었습니다. 차갑고, 생명이 없는 어둠은 불타는 형태의 "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}을 덮어 성장하고, 삼켰으며, 무딘 신음 소리가 들리더니, 석탄 같이 검은 먼지가 땅에서 "
"피어오릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "0d12a16f-8418-4291-ba0e-487730f91098"
msgid ""
"{n}The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} freezes. His light flickers "
"strangely, and his masks begin to change with incredible speed. One breath, "
"and you are looking upon a horrible grimace of wrath; another breath, and "
"it's replaced with playful astonishment; another and it's the mask of "
"fatherly care.{/n} \"Defeat. What a refreshing feeling. I don't remember "
"sensing it for a dozen millennia…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 멈췄습니다. 그의 빛은 이상하게 깜박이고, 그의 가면은 놀라운 속도로 변하기 시작합니다. "
"한 번의 호흡 뒤, 당신은 진노로 끔찍하게 찡그리는 얼굴을 보고있습니다; 다시 한 번 호흡하니, 그것은 흥미로운 놀라움으로 대체됩니다; "
"또 한 번 숨 쉬고 나니, 이번에는 아버지의 자상한 가면입니다.{/n} \"졌다. 기분이 상쾌하다. 내가 수백만 년 동안 언제 패배를 "
"느꼈는지 기억이 안난다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "ab66a056-559e-4326-848e-97db018fc167"
msgid ""
"\"But what's next? How will you end this story, {name}? Listen, I know a "
"good ending — elegant and refined. The hero defeats a deity in battle. "
"Impressed, it grants the victor power and immortality. The hero enters the "
"chambers of the deity, to become his champion and herald — eternal, "
"powerful, equally glorified both in the {g|First World}First World{/g} and "
"in {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}. {mf|His|Her} kingdom, healed from its wounds "
"and flourished under the rule of the immortal champion. A beautiful ending, "
"isn't it, {name}? — And this legend is yours for the asking.\""
msgstr ""
"\"하지만 다음은 무엇인가? 이 이야기를 어떻게 끝낼 건가? {name}? 나는 우아하고 세련된 결말을 안다. 영웅은 전투에서 신을 "
"패배시켰다. 감동한 그것은 승리자에게 힘과 불멸을 부여한다. 영웅은 신의 방으로 들어가서, 그의 투사이자 사자가 된다 — 영원하고, "
"강력하며, {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}와 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g} 양 쪽에서 영광스럽게 기억된다. "
"{mf|그의|그녀의} 왕국은 상처로부터 치유되었으며, 불사의 영웅의 통치하에 번영했다. 아름다운 결말이지, 안그런가, {name}? — "
"그리고 이 전설은 너의 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "20514a77-a84f-4631-9b57-6d82cdc8876b"
msgid ""
"{n}Tense, the nymph takes a step forward and raises her hands in the air. A "
"light flares up between them, and the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King's{/g} "
"mask, which you received from Magdh after your battle with the Jabberwock, "
"slowly appears. One mask looks at the other, and you feel the clashing eyes "
"momentarily paralyze the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}.{/n}\n"
"\"Look into the eyes of your lost image, Lantern King. Look at what you once "
"were, and listen to my words!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}긴장한 채로, 님프는 앞으로 나아가 공중에 손을 들어 올립니다. 그들 사이에서 빛이 폭발하더니, 재버워크와의 전투 이후 마그드에게 "
"받은 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 가면이 천천히 모습을 드러냅니다. 한 가면이 다른 가면을 보았고, 당신은 그 눈싸움이 "
"순간적으로 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}를 마비시켰다고 느낍니다.{/n}\n"
"\"네가 잃어버린 모습을 보아라, 등불왕. 한때 너였던 것을 보아라, 그리고 내 말을 들어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "ff585ef8-2c14-4796-a934-ba117f272234"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa stops, and with her last word, incredible, ice-cold silence fall "
"upon the ravaged throne room. All sounds die, the air leaves your chest "
"without a whisper, and even your heart beats quiet. Yet in this silence, "
"something lives and flashes swiftly — the echo of Nyrissa's words, the echo "
"of her desire to live, to love — and atone for what she's done.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 멈췄습니다, 그리고 그녀의 마지막 말과 함께, 놀랍도록, 얼음처럼 차가운 침묵이 황폐한 왕좌의 방에 내려앉습니다. 모든 "
"소리가 죽고, 공기는 소리도 없이 당신의 폐에서 빠져나가고, 심지어 당신의 심장조차 숨죽인 채 뜁니다. 그러나 이 침묵 속에서, 무언가가 "
"살아나더니 재빠르게 번쩍입니다 — 나이리사가 내뱉은 언령의 메아리, 살고자, 사랑하고자 하는 그녀가 가진 소망의 메아리 — 그리고 그녀의 "
"행위에 대한 속죄의 메아리입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "b8918a13-b25b-437d-b922-8c74a1a6c2c8"
msgid ""
"{n}The echo rolls farther and farther from you, like a wave, catching up the "
"fragments of the cursed cup, sweeping away the shadows of the dead kingdoms. "
"You cannot see it, but with all your being you feel the moment when that "
"echo reaches the farthest boundaries of the kingdom, stops — and then rushes "
"back.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}메아리는 저주받은 잔의 조각을 따라 파도처럼 당신에게서 멀리 멀리 퍼져나가며, 죽은 왕국들의 그림자를 휩쓸고 지나갑니다. 당신은 그 "
"광경을 볼 수 없습니다, 그러나 당신의 모든 것과 함께 당신은 그 메아리가 왕국의 가장 먼 경계에 도달하고, 멈추는 것을 — 이윽고 "
"되돌아옴을 느낍니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "cd4807c8-cd02-4f6f-88d0-b5239d0b6eaf"
msgid ""
"{n}The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} senses the threat, but now it's "
"beyond his power to change anything. He is the focus of the coming wave. And "
"as it strikes, the silence cracks, exploding in a thousand moans and sighs.\n"
"The dust of destroyed kingdoms, the grief of dead souls, thousands of years "
"of pointless destruction, a hopeless search for what was lost — in a "
"heartbeat all crashing down upon the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, impaling his very "
"being, and tearing off his final mask.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 위협을 감지했지만, 이제는 무엇이든 바꾸었던 그의 능력을 넘어섰습니다. 그는 다가오는 "
"파도의 목표입니다. 그리고 파도가 그를 때리자, 천 개의 신음과 한숨이 폭발하며 침묵이 깨집니다.\n"
"파괴된 왕국들의 먼지, 죽은 영혼들의 슬픔, 수천 년간의 무분별한 파괴, 잃어버린 것에 대한 절망적인 수색 — 심장이 한 번 뛰는 사이 "
"그 모든 것들이 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 쏟아져 내렸고, 그의 존재 자체를 꿰뚫었으며, 그의 마지막 가면을 찢습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "75af4f44-e3eb-4a59-bf33-3122e461def8"
msgid ""
"{n}And for this brief moment, you look into the abyss that hides behind the "
"name {g|LanternKing}'Lantern King'{/g}. And what is there? Light? Laughter? "
"Bolts of lightning — or thoughts of an ancient mind, mighty and strange? You "
"haven't the time to comprehend all you see, but you know one thing for true. "
"The Lantern King is cursed.\n"
"The Lantern King is mortal. The punishment he heaped upon Nyrissa has "
"returned to him, and taken his precious immortality.\n"
"It is your turn to speak!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그리고 이 찰나의 순간, 당신은 {g|LanternKing}'등불왕'{/g}의 이름 속에 숨어있는 심연을 들여다봅니다. 거기에 있는 "
"것은 무엇입니까? 빛? 웃음? 벼락? — 아니면 거대하고 이상한, 오래된 존재의 생각? 당신에겐 보이는 모든 것을 이해할 시간이 "
"없습니다, 그러나 진실 한 조각은 깨달았습니다. 등불왕은 저주받았습니다.\n"
"등불왕은 이제 필멸의 존재입니다. 그가 나이리사에게 쌓은 징벌은 그에게 돌아갔고, 그의 귀중한 불멸을 가져갔습니다.\n"
"이제 당신이 말할 차례입니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "0c708855-62a7-4a4e-b1b8-70c2b895d047"
msgid ""
"\"Did I tell you I don't like dying? Well, I don't. Perhaps we should stop "
"this pointless exercise and speak seriously?\""
msgstr ""
"\"내가 죽기를 좋아하지 않는다고 말했나? 그래, 나는 죽기 싫다. 우리가 이 무의미한 싸움을 중단하고 진지하게 이야기할 수 있지 않겠나?"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaEvil
msgctxt "12a8111c-c18e-4793-bc6b-86a180896b80"
msgid ""
"\"Trust the {g|LanternKing}Laughing Lie{/g}? Don't do this. Not after "
"everything you and I have endured because of him. I can give you immortality "
"and power, though not as much as the Lantern King's. Perhaps we won't be "
"able to stand against the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, but... Accept my gift and my "
"patronage, and together we will make him pay for what he's done!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|LanternKing}웃는 거짓말{/g}을 믿으라고? 그러지 마라. 너와 나는 그 자 때문에 모든 것을 견뎌낸 뒤이니. "
"등불왕만큼은 아니지만, 너에게 불멸과 힘을 줄 수 있다. 아마 우리는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 맞서지 못할 거야, 하지만... "
"내 선물과 후원을 받아들여라, 그러면 우리는 함께 그가 저지른 일에 대가를 지불하게 만들 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "4b038220-109e-489b-a651-f45f7ff05c56"
msgid ""
"\"My spring, I beg you, do not listen. There is poison and evil triumph in "
"his words. We may not be able to kill him, but surrendering now is the "
"greatest mistake we could make.\n"
"But even so — let wicked fate strike only me. Do you hear me, "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}? Take me, your favorite toy, and let the {mf|king|queen}"
" and {mf|his|her} kingdom go in peace!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나의 그대여, 간청하건데, 듣지 말아라. 그의 말에 독이 있고 사악한 승리가 있다. 우리가 그를 죽일 수 없을지 모르지만, 지금 "
"항복하는 것은 우리가 할 수있는 가장 큰 실수다.\n"
"그러나 그렇다고 하더라도 — 사악한 운명이 나만을 공격하게 해라. 내 말 듣고있나, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}? 네가 좋아하는 "
"장난감인 나를 데려가라, 그리고 {mf|왕|여왕}과 {mf|그의|그녀의} 왕국은 평화롭게 두어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "edb7ac4e-c96a-462d-a2a7-26c5d7e407b6"
msgid ""
"{n}After you speak, silence falls, deep as a chasm. Light pours from the "
"eyes of the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King's{/g} mask — still the mask of "
"paternal care, though you do not mistake this for what lies hidden behind "
"it.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신이 말한 뒤, 침묵이 깊은 틈으로 떨어집니다. 빛이 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 가면의 눈에서 쏟아져 나옵니다 — "
"여전히 부모의 보살핌의 가면입니다, 당신이 그 뒤에 무엇이 숨겨져 있는지에 대해 실수하지 않았다면 말입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "926912af-f334-4e26-840a-9ded4ef9070b"
msgid ""
"{n}The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} laughs — softly, musically. This laughter seems "
"truly warm and sincere... as strange as this may sound for one who is called "
"the {g|LanternKing}Laughing Lie{/g}.{/n} \"Wonderful. I played one of my "
"best performances... and received a fine assistant for my future "
"entertainments.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 웃습니다. 부드럽게, 음악적으로. {g|LanternKing}웃는 거짓말{/g}이 내는 소리인지 "
"의심스러울 정도로, 웃음은 진정으로 따뜻하고 진지한 것처럼 보입니다.{/n} \"훌륭해. 나는 최고의 공연 중 하나를 끝냈다... 그리고 "
"내 미래의 오락을 위한 훌륭한 조력자를 얻었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0024_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "575e7c65-9a60-4cbf-baaf-5192ccb58bcb"
msgid ""
"{n}The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King's{/g} mask changes again — this time to "
"an image of astonishment.{/n} \"So you plan to entertain me for all "
"eternity? Or do you still think you can outplay me, trespasser?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 가면이 다시 변합니다. 이번에는 놀라움의 이미지가 나타납니다.{/n} \"그래서 너는 "
"나를 영원히 즐겁게 할 것이냐? 아니면 여전히 날 가지고 놀 수 있다고 생각하느냐, 침입자여?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0025_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "7a726520-340c-460c-8270-6405a1a199db"
msgid ""
"\"You are so beneficent, trespasser. I didn't expect to see you like this. I "
"might even accept this sacrifice... but what do you say, {name}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 친절하구나. 침입자. 나는 이걸 기대하지 않았다. 나야 이 희생을 받아들일 수도 있다... 하지만 네 대답은 뭐지? {name}"
"? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0026_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "1d234d7b-613a-41fa-b233-8d1fa64835a1"
msgid ""
"{n}In a measured, ponderous manner, the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} "
"pronounces his words as if reading them.{/n} \"So be it. This performance "
"has run its course. It would be unwise to continue it. Besides, I have no "
"love of dying and returning to life... My fellow {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} are "
"very good at playing especially intricate pranks at that exact moment.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}신중하게, 무거운 분위기를 잡고, {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 책을 읽는 것처럼 그의 낱말을 발음합니다.{/n} "
"\"그렇게 해라. 이 공연은 내용대로 진행했다. 계속하는 것은 현명하지 않을 것이다. 게다가, 나는 죽음과 부활을 좋아하지 않는다... "
"나의 동료 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}들은 특히 이와 같은 순간에 복잡한 장난을 치는 데 매우 능숙하니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0027_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "30fd1478-750b-4e58-a938-5d4d268c7daf"
msgid ""
"\"You were cursed by my will, {mf|King|Queen} {name}, and by my will you are "
"now free from the curse. May the shackles be broken, fetters be loosened, "
"what's been stolen, will be returned, what's been divided, will be made "
"whole again. I say farewell, and release your kingdom to the {g|Material "
"plane}Material Plane{/g}. Go, be glad of your ordinary mortal life. And "
"forget the gods of the {g|First World}First World{/g}. Now they no longer "
"concern you!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 나의 의지로 저주 받았었다, {mf|왕|여왕} {name}. 그리고 나의 의지로 저주에서 해방되었다. 족쇄가 부서지고, 포박이 "
"풀리고, 도난당한 것은 반환되고, 나눠진 것은 다시 하나가 될 것이다. 나는 작별 인사를 하고, 네 왕국을 {g|material "
"plane}물질계{/g}로 돌려보내겠다. 가라, 그리고 평범한 필멸의 삶을 즐겨라. 그리고 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 "
"신들에 대해 잊어버려라. 이제 그들은 더 이상 너에게 간섭하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0028_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "1edd723e-a1c6-4b99-836c-c5cdde97124b"
msgid ""
"\"I release you from the curse, {name}. May the fatal bond between you and "
"your land be destroyed, and another one be born — between you and your new "
"patron. From my light, I bestow light upon you, and from my power — power. "
"May neither death, nor time, nor frailty ever touch you, my champion and "
"herald.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너를 저주에서 풀어주겠다. {name}. 너와 네 영토 사이의 치명적인 유대는 파괴되었고, 너와 네 새로운 후원자 사이에 또 다른 "
"것이 만들어졌다. 내 빛으로, 너에게 빛을 부여하겠다, 그리고 내 힘으로, 힘을 주겠다. 죽음도, 시간도, 노쇠조차도 너에게 미치지 못할 "
"것이다, 나의 투사이자 전령이여.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0029_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "4b386fcd-79d1-46ec-b00d-806ecd42f82f"
msgid ""
"\"Your kingdom will return to {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, {name}. Calm your "
"subjects, and threaten your neighbors if they think you weak and vulnerable. "
"And await my summons. Eternity awaits, and believe me — it will be "
"exciting...\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 왕국은 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}으로 돌아갈 것이다, {name}. 백성들을 진정시켜라, 그리고 네 이웃들이 네가 "
"약하고 연약해졌다고 생각하면 그들을 위협해라. 그리고 나의 소환을 기다려라. 영원이 기다리니, 나를 믿어라 —그것은 흥미로울 것이다..."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0030_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaEvil
msgctxt "b48b6a5a-ee3a-4fd2-ac04-d61699449481"
msgid ""
"\"Pretty words, {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. Save them for our next encounter. You "
"pretend to laugh, but I see how shamed you are, what a deep wound you've "
"suffered this day. It won't be the last, believe me.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아름다운 말이구나, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}. 다음 만남을 위해 아껴두어라. 너는 웃는 척하지만, 얼마나 부끄러워 했는지, 오늘 "
"받은 깊은 상처를 안다. 그것은 마지막이 아닐테지. 나를 믿어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0031_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaEvil
msgctxt "0183a5a4-21b4-4f8b-a837-2062ec6d423e"
msgid ""
"\"{name}, we've come a long way together — first as enemies, then as allies. "
"I mark you with my gift — a bond to the {g|First World}First World{/g}, "
"eternal youth and immortality. We are {mf|the cursed king and queen|two "
"cursed queens}, each in their own kingdom, their own world, but henceforth "
"inextricably entwined. Eternity awaits... and possibly — eternal war with a "
"deceitful deity. But so what? It is our eternity, and perhaps in the end we "
"will rule not kingdoms but whole worlds!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{name}. 우리는 먼 길을 함께 걸어왔다. 처음엔 적이었고, 그리고는 동맹이었다. 너에게 내 선물을 주겠다. {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}와의 유대, 영원한 젊음과 불멸이다. 우리는 각 나라의 {mf|저주받은 왕과 여왕|저주받은 두 여왕}이지만, "
"지금부터는 뗄 수 없는 관계이다. 영원이 기다린다... 그것은 아마도 거짓된 신과의 영원한 전쟁일 것이다. 하지만 뭐 어때? 그것은 "
"우리의 영원이며, 결국 우리는 왕국이 아니라 온 세상을 다스릴 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0032_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "ca290065-b9ec-4db3-9ad3-9382764f407c"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks at you. Her eyes are full of tender sorrow.{/n} \"Farewell, "
"my spring. Let us say goodbye quickly, and end this painful moment. I cannot "
"allow you to be harmed. That is why I must remain to the court of the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} — as safeguard and hostage. I will try to "
"ensure that the {g|Eldest}Eldest's{/g} eyes never again stray to your lands. "
"Remember the sad nymph Nyrissa — or forget, if you wish. There is but one "
"thing I ask of you: be happy!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사가 당신을 쳐다봅니다. 그녀의 눈은 부드러운 슬픔으로 가득합니다.{/n} \"잘 가기를. 나의 그대. 어서 작별 인사를 하고 "
"고통스러운 순간을 끝내줘. 너를 다치게 할 수 없어. 그것이 내가 보호자와 인질이 되어 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 "
"심판대에 남아야 하는 이유야. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 너의 땅을 넘보지 않도록 노력할게. 슬픈 님프 나이리사를 기억해. 원한다면 "
"잊어버려. 내가 너에게 바라는 한 가지가 있다. 행복해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0033_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "159365c6-b23f-4dc8-bd19-7eddfbc5325e"
msgid ""
"\"You made me your puppet, but I have won my freedom.\n"
"You stole the essence of my soul, but now it is returned.\n"
"You cursed me. But I do not accept this curse!\n"
"I reject the path you cut for me.\n"
"I will not be what you would make me.\n"
"I fear no punishment, I will not bow, and I will not turn back.\n"
"I do not seek your forgiveness!\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 나를 꼭두각시로 만들었다, 그러나 나는 자유를 얻었다.\n"
"너는 내 영혼의 본질을 훔쳤다, 그러나 그것은 지금 나에게 있다.\n"
"너는 나를 저주했다. 그러나 나는 저주를 받아들이지 않는다!\n"
"네가 나를 위해 준 길을 거부한다.\n"
"나는 네가 원하는 모습이 되지 않을 것이다.\n"
"나는 처벌을 두려워하지 않고, 너에게 굴복하지 않을 것이고, 되돌아가지 않을 것이다.\n"
"나는 네 용서를 구하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0036_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "48a50968-840e-447f-b1a0-8a81aec5bf2a"
msgid ""
"\"What a clever trick... I promised death to any who claim these lands, and "
"now...\""
msgstr "\"영리한 속임수로군... 나는 이 영토를 차지하는 자들의 죽음을 약속했지만, 지금은...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0038_Text
msgctxt "bde82e34-904e-4a4a-b981-0bcef3ac0aa7"
msgid ""
"{n}This is all the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} is able to say. You feel "
"a heavy burden, invisible and ominous, lift from your shoulders and dash "
"towards your enemy. An enemy who is now, after Nyrissa's words, mortal and "
"vulnerable.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}이것은 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 말할 수 있는 전부였습니다. 당신은 보이지 않고 불길한, 무거운 짐이 당신의 "
"어깨에서 들어올려져 당신의 적에게 달려드는 것을 느낍니다. 나이리사의 말에 따라, 지금의 적은 불멸이 아니며 취약합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0039_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "5de6d7c6-d5ae-427a-a125-a662d6b39846"
msgid ""
"{n}Your curse falls upon the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} like a gravestone. The "
"power that was tearing your soul apart, along with the kingdom, now devours "
"him — and faster than one could imagine. The light flashes out. The power "
"fades. A moment later, all you see is a fiery crown, tumbling to the ground "
"and shattering with a piercing clink.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 저주가 묘비처럼 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 떨어집니다. 왕국과 함께 당신의 영혼을 찢어 놓았던 그 힘은 이제 그를 "
"삼킵니다 — 그리고 그것은 상상할 수 있는 무엇보다 빠릅니다. 빛이 꺼져갑니다. 힘이 사라집니다. 다음 순간, 당신이 본 모든 것은 "
"불타는 왕관 뿐이며, 그것은 땅에서 구르다가 날카로운 쨍 소리와 함께 깨집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0040_Text
msgctxt "a9e02847-e29b-4acd-b3ab-9b87e22bfc45"
msgid ""
"{n}And with this final sound, the ground around you begins to tremble. "
"Nyrissa rushes towards you and clenches your hand. There is no fear in the "
"nymph's eyes, just hope and tenderness. She is the first to realize what's "
"happening. The city and the kingdom are returning to "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}...{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}그리고 마지막 소리와 함께, 당신 주변의 땅이 떨리기 시작합니다. 나이리사가 당신을 향해 달려들어 당신의 손을 움켜쥡니다. 님프의 "
"눈에는 두려움이 없으며, 단지 희망과 부드러움만이 있습니다. 그녀는 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 깨달은 첫 번째 사람입니다. 도시와 왕국이 "
"{g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}으로 돌아가는 중입니다...{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0041_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "e0afb67b-bd2d-4724-98da-4c239ee8417f"
msgid ""
"\"This is not your hour, {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. You've tormented us enough "
"for your cruel entertainments.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 너의 시간이 아니다, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}. 너는 잔인한 오락을 위해 우리를 충분히 괴롭혀왔다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0042_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "99e28115-09e6-4a70-8e6e-da0ab27e0fb5"
msgid ""
"\"How sad it is to hear you, Nyrissa. Thousands years, for nothing. You "
"haven't learned a single lesson — never learned to atone. But what do you "
"say, {name}?\""
msgstr ""
"\"네 말을 듣는 것이 슬프군. 나이리사. 수천 년 동안 헛되었다. 너는 단 한 번의 교훈도 배우지 않았다 — 속죄하는 법을 배우지 "
"않았다. 하지만 너는 뭐라고 말하겠느냐, {name}? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0043_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "eff5fdab-fb2e-4ff7-94f8-3c52b516ebef"
msgid ""
"\"You seem so confident, Nyrissa... I'm intrigued. What is it that you and "
"your chosen one are planning to do with an immortal deity? What power do you "
"have that I do not?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 너무 자신 있어 보이는구나, 나이리사... 흥미가 생겼다. 너와 네가 선택한 자는 불멸의 신에게 무엇을 하려는거냐? 내가 가질 "
"수 없는 어떤 힘을 가지고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0044_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "6527f37e-d56e-4bc4-8627-6f3087b5c556"
msgid ""
"\"That is easy.\" {n}The voice of the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} sounds "
"careless and relaxed, but you cannot say if he is truly calm.{/n} \"I will "
"return your kingdom to {g|Golarion}Golarion{/g}, and strengthen its "
"connection to the {g|First World}First World{/g}. In their homeland, the fey "
"can endlessly return to life, and I will give to you this same gift. And so "
"long as {kingdomname} remains an enclave of the First World, death within "
"its borders will never threaten you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 쉽다.\" {n}{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 목소리는 무심하고 편안하게 들리지만, 그가 정말로 평온한지는 알 수 "
"없습니다.{/n} \"나는 네 왕국을 {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}으로 돌려보낼 것이고, {g|First World}태초 "
"세계{/g}와의 유대를 강화할 것이다. 고향에서, 페이는 끝없이 삶으로 돌아갈 수 있다, 그리고 나는 너에게 같은 선물을 줄 것이다. "
"그리고 {kingdomname}은(는) 태초 세계의 거주지가 되었기에, 그 국경 안에서의 죽음은 결코 너를 위협하지 않을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0045_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "d15b4227-b05f-4de6-aacd-8940f79aeb76"
msgid ""
"\"As for the price... I am not offering you the position of a servant, {name}"
". Believe it or not, I am... lonely. Divine power and immortality are a "
"heavy burden, and to accept it means losing all your friends and companions. "
"But you can find allies and reliable assistants. This is what I'm looking "
"for — a herald and a general, with whom I can share eternity, and together "
"we'll play a thousand wonderful pranks, and spread our power across the {g|"
"First World}First World{/g}, and further... much further.\""
msgstr ""
"\"대가는... 나는 너에게 종의 역할을 제안하는 것이 아니다, {name}. 믿거나 말거나지만, 나는... 외로웠다. 신성한 힘과 "
"불멸은 무거운 짐이며, 그것을 받아들이는 것은 모든 친구와 동행자를 잃는 것을 의미한다. 그러나 너는 동맹국과 신뢰할 수 있는 조력자를 "
"찾을 수 있다. 이것은 내가 찾고 있는 것이다 — 전령과 장군, 영원을 공유할 수 있는 자, 그리고 함께 수천 가지 놀라운 장난을 치고, "
"우리의 힘을 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 보여주고... 더욱... 더 많은 것들을 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0047_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "791e6d88-47db-4e82-8b88-6902de44d4ab"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks at you, astonished.{/n} \"Agree to his offer? Now I regret "
"that my heart can love again! The sound of these words wouldn't hurt so much "
"if I'd remained cold...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 당신을 보고 깜짝 놀랐습니다.{/n} \"그의 제안에 동의하는가? 이제는 내 마음이 다시 사랑할 수 있다는 사실이 "
"유감이다! 내가 차가운 채로 남았다면 단어들의 소리가 그렇게 아프게 들렸을까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0048_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "6e608935-0756-40bb-ab44-a8631e5fe34d"
msgid ""
"{n}In the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King's{/g} voice you detect and insinuating "
"taunt.{/n} \"What is that, trespasser? Don't you want the best for your "
"chosen one? As for you... if {name} agrees to my offer, you may go wherever "
"you wish. I will not bother you again — if you're smart enough to stay out "
"of my sight... and {mf|his|hers}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 도발 섞인 어조를 알아챕니다.{/n} \"뭐지, 침입자? 네가 선택한 사람에게 "
"최선을 다하길 원하지 않는가? 너는... 만약 {name}이(가) 내 제안에 동의한다면, 너는 어디든지 갈 수 있다. 다시는 너를 "
"괴롭히지 않을 것이다 — 만약 네가 나와 {mf|그|그녀}의 눈 앞에서 벗어날 만큼 영리하다면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0049_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "228764d9-a0dd-432e-8e4b-6252355b1b9b"
msgid ""
"\"What do you think? I can let my misguided protege go wherever she likes. "
"But knowing her, I'm doubt she will become a humble exile.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너의 생각은 어떤가? 내가 잘못 가르친 추종자가 좋아하는 곳으로 가도록 할 수는 있다. 그러나 그녀는 겸손한 유배자가 되지는 않을 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0050_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaEvil
msgctxt "9eaeae52-9899-4fca-abc7-07d3d39fac0a"
msgid ""
"\"I won't. I've come too far to go back. It might take me thousands of years "
"and thousands of deaths, but I will find a way to get back at you, "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. Even if {name} betrays our alliance and becomes your "
"puppet.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 하지 않을 것이다. 내가 되돌아가기엔 너무나도 멀리 왔다. 수천 년이 걸리고 수천 명의 죽음을 겪을지 모르지만, 나는 너에게 "
"돌아갈 길을 찾을 것이다, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}. 설사 {name}이(가) 우리의 동맹을 배신하고 그가 네 꼭두각시가 되더라도."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0052_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "1e1d73a4-3acb-4e39-a500-803f9dc04cfc"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph's face turns to stone.{/n} \"I was hoping that we would could "
"do more. To spare us of curses once and for all, and be free. But come what "
"may, we have an eternity ahead, my spring. Perhaps one day we will find the "
"roads that can bring us together again.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프의 얼굴이 돌처럼 변합니다.{/n} \"나는 우리가 더 많은 것을 할 수 있기를 바랐다. 저주에서 한 번 벗어나면 영원히 "
"자유로워질 것이다. 하지만 우리는 영원한 미래가 있을 것이다, 나의 그대여. 언젠가는 우리가 함께 할 수 있는 길을 찾을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0055_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "b09f822e-15a9-4258-94eb-513366213713"
msgid ""
"\"I can't let this happen, my spring. You, your subjects and companions will "
"be hostages in an eternal war with a deity. Let him take me instead, and "
"allow you to live.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이렇게 두지 않을 것이다, 나의 그대여. 너와 너의 부하와 친구들이 신과의 영원한 전쟁에서 인질이 될 것이다. 그가 대신 나를 "
"데려가고, 네 삶을 내버려두게 해줘.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0059_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "37b53381-64df-4c63-bb12-15def3f240fd"
msgid ""
"\"I feel the fire in these words! Hot, and liberating. An eternity of "
"sacrifice — who would have thought...\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 말에서 불이 느껴진다! 뜨겁고 자유로운. 희생의 영원함이라. 누가 생각했을지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0060_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "e9848021-e7a9-41f8-843f-e82af6be28a2"
msgid "\"How strong is your belief in the order of things? How...\""
msgstr "\"사물의 질서에 대한 너의 믿음은 얼마나 강한가? 얼마나...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0061_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "d6611647-6739-4ed0-a70b-ad13da5cf952"
msgid ""
"\"You believe so sincerely that you cannot be touched by greater powers. "
"You...\""
msgstr "\"너의 믿음은 너무 진실하기에 너는 더 강력한 힘에도 영향받지 않는다. 너는...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0062_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "81b32161-850c-41f2-80c7-bc8a5cd85415"
msgid ""
"\"It must be a wonderful life, always being so focused on yourself. For...\""
msgstr "\"반드시 멋진 삶이 될 것이다, 항상 너 자신에게 이목이 집중되고, 항상...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0063_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaEvil
msgctxt "170282a2-d921-47d2-b240-2b5575b49a59"
msgid ""
"\"Ah, really! My hound is a hound again, just no longer mine. I will "
"remember this, {name}. I will. And we will meet again!\""
msgstr ""
"\"아, 정말! 내 사냥개는 다시 사냥개가 되었지만, 더 이상 내 것이 아니다. 나는 이것을 기억할 것이다, {name}. 나는 그럴 "
"것이다. 그리고 우리는 다시 만날 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0064_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "7bf6eda5-eb8e-4943-8862-14cd0a742af8"
msgid "\"So that's your choice? My springtime did not last for long…\""
msgstr "\"그래서 그것이 너의 선택이야? 내 봄은 오래 가지 않았다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0065_Text
msgctxt "719ed8ea-d65e-41d6-9188-9e8ce36586f5"
msgid ""
"{n}But a moment later, right where the {g|Eldest}Eldest's{/g} crown lay "
"burning, another shining image is born. It grows, glowing, turning into a "
"familiar silhouette, wearing a crown.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}하지만 잠시 후, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 왕관이 놓여있던 자리가 불타올라, 또 다른 빛나는 형상이 나타납니다. 그것은 "
"성장하고, 빛나며, 왕관을 쓴 친숙한 실루엣으로 변화합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0066_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaEvil
msgctxt "81673440-aa02-45d7-a54a-cf5b3b8cefdc"
msgid ""
"\"I suggest we do not kneel. We are both cursed, you and I — but so what? "
"The curse can harm you only as much as affliction touches your kingdom. But "
"now, with the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} wounded and bleeding and his henchmen all "
"slain, I can return your state to the {g|Material Plane}Material Plane{/g}. "
"It will heal its wounds, and so will you. I'll create a bond between you and "
"the {g|First World}First World{/g}, granting you immortality — just as the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} promises.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 무릎을 꿇지 않겠다. 우리는 모두 저주받았으니. 하지만 뭐 어때? 저주는 너의 왕국에 고난이 닥칠 때만 너를 해칠 수 있다. "
"그러나 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 부상 당해 피를 흘리고, 모든 심복이 죽었으니, 나는 이제 너희 {g|material "
"plane}물질계{/g}로 갈 거야. 그로써 그것의 상처를 치유하고, 너 또한 그리 될 것이다. 나는 너와 {g|First World}"
"태초 세계{/g} 사이에 유대를 만들어서 불멸을 부여하겠다 — {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 약속한 것처럼.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0067_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_4
msgctxt "642a3e2a-d150-4842-b6f9-f3c98a713a6d"
msgid "\"And what role in all this shall I play, trespasser?\""
msgstr "\"이 모든 일에서 나는 어떤 역할을 해야 하지? 침입자?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKfinal/Cue_0068_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaEvil
msgctxt "9971d1ca-903c-4339-9d83-490624254718"
msgid ""
"\"The role of the vanquished. I know you will hardly accept a defeat, "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. You may try to attack us again. But we defeated you "
"once, and we will do it again if we must. I'm ready to fight you forever if "
"I have to!\" {n}You hear a storm in Nyrissa's voice.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"정복당한 사람의 역할이다. 네가 패배를 받아들이지 않을 것이라는 것을 알고 있다, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}. 너는 다시 우리를 "
"공격할 수도 있다. 그러나 우리는 너를 이미 격파했고 필요한 경우 다시할 것이다. 나는 영원히 싸울 준비가 되어있다!\" {n}나이리사의 "
"목소리가 폭풍 같습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Barks/EvilNyrissaAlmostDead_String
msgctxt "4542d5ab-0bc6-4af6-bcdb-030d48903b06"
msgid "\"My strength is running out, but I will not die today — no!\""
msgstr "\"내 힘이 다 떨어졌지만 오늘은 죽지 않을 거야 — 안돼!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Barks/EvilNyrissaFight_String
msgctxt "4f8243d1-fdc1-445f-bad3-79ae4b2f2142"
msgid "\"I was defeated, but I am unbowed!\""
msgstr "\"나는 패했지만, 굴복하지 않겠다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Barks/GoodNyrissaAlmostDead_String
msgctxt "dbe21cc2-fef1-4fa9-8018-f0c2e652f6d1"
msgid "\"This pain is nothing compared to losing part of my soul.\""
msgstr "\"이 고통은 내 영혼의 일부를 잃는 것에 비하면 아무것도 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Barks/GoodNyrissaFight_String
msgctxt "85b045da-0bfd-4fed-9598-9e99e045b0dc"
msgid "\"For the future! For spring! For the songs of a thousand birds!\""
msgstr "\"미래를 위해서! 봄을 위해! 천 마리 새들의 지저귐을 위해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Barks/LK_fighting_stage1_String
msgctxt "b3ea3921-5e7d-4ac7-96c8-190fe59c44c0"
msgid "\"Oh yes, the time has come. The time of fate and curses.\""
msgstr "\"오. 그래. 시간이 왔다. 운명과 저주의 시간.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Barks/LK_fighting_stage2_String
msgctxt "caced57f-8928-4a0e-81bd-00882f7cfad6"
msgid ""
"\"You don't seem to like my curses. Maybe you'll like my jokes better?\""
msgstr "\"내 저주를 좋아하지 않는 것 같군. 아마도 내 농담을 더 좋아하는 걸까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Barks/LK_fighting_stage3_String
msgctxt "bd5ba9fa-7076-4320-bad7-97d86e3c12fb"
msgid ""
"\"The time for laughter has passed. It's the hour of hunting and chaos.\""
msgstr "\"웃음의 시간은 지나갔다. 이제는 사냥과 혼돈의 시간이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_1
msgctxt "ead4759b-a3a6-40fe-8220-7f945a5b9b60"
msgid ""
"{n}Your footsteps echo from the ceiling of the ravaged throne room. The "
"sound attracts the attention of old Remus, slouching on the steps of the "
"throne. He looks up, shakes his head slightly, as if displeased, but keeps "
"silent. Nothing betrays the mask of a deity in this hunched man.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 발걸음은 황폐한 왕좌의 방 천장을 울립니다. 이 소리는 왕좌에서 구부정하게 일어나는 늙은 레무스의 주목을 이끌었습니다. 그는 "
"올려다보았고, 불쾌한 듯이 고개를 저었지만 침묵을 지킵니다. 구부정한 남자가 신의 가면이라는 것은 의심할 여지가 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "07b1dfc6-fbeb-4f0a-b93c-ea4bd340efc3"
msgid ""
"{n}The rich smell of grass and blooming meadows fills the hall, foretelling "
"Nyrissa's appearance.{/n}\n"
"\"My spring...\" {n}the nymph says softly, as if seeking your support. Then "
"she turns to the figure upon the throne, steps forward and raises her chin "
"proudly.{/n} \"Greetings, {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}! Do you hear the distant {d|"
"c61 Nyrissa TE}thunder{/d}? The time has come. The time to settle everything "
"— once and for all.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}잔디와 꽃피는 초원의 풍부한 냄새가 회관을 채우고 나이리사의 모습이 나타남을 알립니다.{/n}\n"
"\"나의 그대여...\" {n}님프는 마치 당신의 지지를 구하는 것처럼 부드럽게 말합니다. 그런 다음 그녀는 왕위에 오른 자를 향해 "
"돌아, 앞으로 나아가며 자랑스럽게 그녀의 턱을 치켜올립니다.{/n} \"안녕, {g|Eldest}원로{/g}! 멀리서 치는 {d|c61 "
"Nyrissa TE}천둥{/d} 소리가 들리는가? 모든 것을 끝낼 시간이다 — 완전히.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "34b3df7a-6a96-4331-b71b-3a6f78131af6"
msgid ""
"{n}A gust of wind carrying the rich smell of grass foretells Nyrissa's "
"appearance. She looks at you anxiously.{/n} \"We should have {d|c71 No "
"FW}finished{/d} our search... but it's too late now. There's a battle ahead, "
"a horrible battle...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}강한 바람이 초원의 풍부한 냄새를 이끌어 나이리사의 모습이 나타남을 알립니다. 그녀는 당신을 걱정스럽게 봅니다.{/n} \"우리는 "
"수색을 {d|c71 No FW}끝마쳐야{/d} 한다... 하지만 지금은 너무 늦었어. 전투가 앞에 벌어졌다... 끔찍한 전투가...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaEvil
msgctxt "09e5b2f5-dbcd-4f95-b578-ea04f8b259a8"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa appears suddenly beside you, like a bolt of lightning in the "
"night sky.{/n} \"Still hiding behind masks, {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}? Isn't it "
"{d|c61 Nyrissa Evil}time{/d} you cast them away?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}밤하늘에 번개가 친 것처럼, 나이리사가 갑자기 당신 옆에 갑자기 나타납니다.{/n} \"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}, 여전히 가면 "
"뒤에 숨어있구나? 그것들을 벗어던질 {d|c61 Nyrissa Evil}시간{/d}이 되지 않았나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_NyrissaGood
msgctxt "5b5960cf-89cd-45b6-b82f-58a5b207f29d"
msgid ""
"{n}The soft rustling of leaves and babbling of brooks foretell Nyrissa's "
"appearance. She freezes beside you.{/n} \"A horrible battle awaits us, my "
"spring. But I believe it's for the best. We will save {d|c61 Nyrissa "
"Briar}you{/d} and your kingdom. We must.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나뭇잎의 부드렆게 바스락거리는 소리와 시냇물이 졸졸거리는 소리가 나이리사의 등장을 예언합니다. 그녀는 당신 옆에서 가만히 "
"있습니다.{/n} \"나의 그대여, 우리를 기다리고 있는 끔찍한 싸움이 있다. 하지만 그것이 최선이다. 우리는 {d|c61 Nyrissa "
"briar}너를{/d} 구할 것이고, 너의 왕국도 구할 것이다. 반드시.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LanternKing_1
msgctxt "1c1158a2-51b0-418b-ae4c-fcb198c4ba85"
msgid ""
"{n}Remus stands up heavily, unwillingly.{/n} \"Words, words... how little "
"value we attach to them, and how much they truly mean. But I've grown tired "
"of words and prophecies. I will no longer predict chaos and death. Instead I "
"will show them to you. Myself.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}레무스는 마지 못해 일어섰습니다.{/n} \"말, 말... 우리가 그것들을 얼마나 가벼이 여기는지, 또 그들의 진정한 의미가 얼마나 "
"거대한지. 하지만 나는 말과 예언에 지쳤다. 나는 더 이상 혼돈과 죽음을 예측하지 않겠다. 대신에 나는 그것들을 네게 보여줄 것이다. "
"직접.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LKstart/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Tartuk_Companion
msgctxt "7c1595f0-8de5-4680-a370-ee702765563c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk freezes, staring at the lonely figure near the throne.{/n}\n"
"\"That creature... that power... I know it, I ssssee it! 'Rise, my "
"unfortunate jester' — so it sssaid. 'Your performance is not over yet'. And "
"ssso I did…\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭이 얼어붙은 채 옥좌 근처에 외롭게 서있는 자를 응시합니다.{/n}\n"
"\"저 생물... 저 힘... 나는 알아, 내가 봤어!! '일어나라, 내 불운한 광대여.' — 그리고 그렇게 말했다. '너의 공연은 아직 "
"끝나지 않았다'. 그리고 그 말을 따랐다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LizardmanDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "35b07f72-7542-4bf1-aec9-3552650b7277"
msgid "\"What is this livemetal?\""
msgstr "\"움직이는 금속이 무엇이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LizardmanDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0601d8d1-a4fd-41f7-8747-274974bf604f"
msgid "\"Do you know where the 'livemetal' came from?\""
msgstr "\"'움직이는 금속'이 어디에서 왔는지 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LizardmanDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "c0c29540-ecb0-4a50-b8fa-e3fbe02cd17a"
msgid "\"Thanks for the warning. I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"경고해 줘서 고맙다. 나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LizardmanDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "9ba482b5-34d5-4ab9-a231-99ef80fb7bf9"
msgid ""
"\"Warmblood, go careful! Livemetal stand in our way, kill many fellow "
"Longtail.\""
msgstr "\"조심해라, 온혈동물! 움직이는 금속이 우리 길을 막아 서서, 많은 긴꼬리 동료들을 죽인다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LizardmanDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "49098137-e9eb-48e7-b14e-36ff30f0432d"
msgid ""
"\"Black, scary, make much noise. Spells not hurt it. It can heal itself, "
"very strong.\""
msgstr "\"검고 끔찍하고 시끄럽다. 마법은 소용없다. 스스로 회복하고 매우 강하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LizardmanDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "986fb0c4-ad84-48fb-b88f-acabdbcd32eb"
msgid ""
"\"It come from a big broken cup. With it come a warmblood shadow, short, in "
"crown, bush of hair on face. Metal is shadow too, I see! They come from "
"past, and want return them kingdom. Bad when dead shadows walk. They want "
"attack us. Longtail arrows kill warmblood shadow. Metal very angry by this.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것은 커다란 깨진 잔에서 나왔다. 짧고 부스스한 머리에 왕관을 쓴 온혈동물 그림자와 함께 왔다. 금속도 역시 그림자다. 그들은 "
"과거로부터 왔고, 왕국을 돌려받기를 원한다. 죽은 자의 그림자가 걸어다니면 곤란하다. 그들은 우리를 공격하기를 원한다. 긴꼬리의 화살은 "
"온혈동물 그림자를 죽인다. 금속이 이 때문에 매우 화가 났다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LizardmanDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "296f8524-9fab-4ea8-a54f-5d7ad516e2fa"
msgid ""
"\"Warmblood shadow bring it, look like you — short, strong, in a crown. They "
"come out of big broken cup, say return them kingdom, attack us. But we kill "
"warmblood shadow with arrows. Metal we not kill. Now it very angry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"온혈동물 그림자는 너와 비슷하게 생겼다. 짧고, 강하고, 왕관을 썼다. 그들은 커다란 깨진 잔에서 나와, 왕국을 돌려달라 말하고, "
"우리를 공격한다. 하지만 우리는 화살로 온혈동물 그림자를 없앤다. 금속은 우리가 못죽인다. 이제 그것이 매우 화낸다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/LizardmanDialog/Cue_0009_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_LizardfolkRattler
msgctxt "a97e4243-462b-4d81-aba1-77e581391555"
msgid ""
"\"I find this — you take. It make black metal not heal. Longtail can not "
"defeat it, but you can!"
msgstr ""
"\"나는 이것을 발견했다. 받아라. 이것은 검은 금속을 치유하지 못하게 한다. 긴꼬리는 그것을 물리칠 수 없지만, 너는 할 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "f1f6ed6a-9c9d-4726-b388-af764cf46249"
msgid "\"And what kind of sacrifice do I have to make?\""
msgstr "\"나는 어떤 종류의 희생을 해야 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "98e4ab83-c970-4ddd-8d88-85630e82cd80"
msgid "\"Why not? I could use the help.\""
msgstr "\"왜 안돼? 나는 도움을 받겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "5976d64f-1f7a-4f8f-9613-a14d47f52a54"
msgid "\"No. I don't need a blessing from the Mother of Monsters.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 나는 괴물들의 어머니가 내리는 축복이 필요없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Answer_0013_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "354ece7a-8e2a-47b7-9cad-b6ae20f7f2f3"
msgid "Agreed to sacrifice Evindra to Lamashtu."
msgstr "에빈드라를 라마슈투에게 바치는 것에 동의했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "63d2a874-bad8-45d6-bf06-ed3f7a0f3d4d"
msgid "\"All right. I will bring Evindra to you.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 내가 너에게 에빈드라를 데려오겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Answer_0014_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "41c97baa-25b4-4731-9a8e-c759f8c7ded3"
msgid "Refused to make sacrifices to Lamashtu."
msgstr "라마슈투를 위해 제물을 바치기를 거부했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "47b1974d-052b-4857-ad13-0555333b2453"
msgid "\"Tsanna, there will be no sacrifices.\""
msgstr "\"산나. 아무 희생도 없을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Tsanna
msgctxt "4425c525-38b1-445b-b863-7be0ed45e431"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess stands in the middle of a city destroyed by magic, calm as "
"if she were walking in a blooming spring garden. She is clearly enjoying the "
"sight.{/n} \"Here you are, {mf|king|queen}. It's a good time. The time of "
"chaos and living nightmares is the perfect time to appealing to "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}. I can bestow the blessing of my goddess upon you, "
"if you are not afraid, of course...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여사제는 마법에 의해 파괴된 도시의 한가운데에 서있고, 꽃 피는 봄의 정원을 걷는 것처럼 평온합니다. 그녀는 분명히 그 모습을 "
"즐기고 있습니다.{/n} \"여기 있군. {mf|왕|여왕}. 좋은 시간이야. 혼란과 살아있는 악몽의 시간은 "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}에게 호소할 완벽한 시간이다. 나는 내 여신의 축복을 너에게 줄 수도 있다, 물론, 네가 두려워하지 "
"않으면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Tsanna
msgctxt "297c6f66-a182-4168-8365-bebf9b678d4b"
msgid ""
"{n}The screams of the poor nereid still ring in your ears, as Tsanna slowly "
"wipes her knife and points at you meaningfully.{/n} \"A worthy reward for a "
"worthy sacrifice. This ugly creature has been tricking death for a very long "
"time, but no longer will it return. {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} power is with "
"you, {mf|king|queen}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나가 천천히 칼을 닦아 내고 의미심장하게 당신을 지적하는 동안, 불쌍한 네레이드의 비명 소리가 계속 울립니다.{/n} \"가치있는 "
"희생에 대한 가치있는 보상이다. 이 추악한 생물은 오랫동안 죽음을 속였지만, 더 이상 돌아오지 못할 것이다. "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 힘은 너와 함께 한다. {mf|왕|여왕}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Tsanna
msgctxt "c4b3a014-d03d-4447-bfca-8a6c615dc0da"
msgid "\"… are not afraid to pay the price. To make the needed sacrifice.\""
msgstr "\"... 대가를 지불하는 것을 두려워하지 않으면. 필요한 제물을 바치기 위해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Tsanna
msgctxt "d7dfbfea-b2f6-4f7f-9371-b54da20792a5"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity you are still so prejudiced. In this case, I cannot help you. "
"Farewell, {mf|king|queen}!\""
msgstr "\"여전히 편견을 갖고 있는 것은 유감스러운 일이다. 이 경우, 너를 도울 수 없다. 잘 있어라, {mf|왕|여왕}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Amiri_Companion
msgctxt "9e2a9f3c-d373-4a02-a1d6-a631737b8a44"
msgid ""
"\"Right! What if you agree, and grow a wyvern's tail! — On your forehead!\""
msgstr "\"맞아! 동의하면 와이번의 꼬리가 자라겠지! — 너의 이마에!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Tsanna
msgctxt "5b9040a9-a4bd-4f99-b50f-e905a4c028f7"
msgid ""
"\"One worthy of the {g|Lamashtu}Mother of Monsters{/g}. I've already made my "
"choice — bring the nereid Evindra to me. This ugly creature has poisoned the "
"world with her presence for long enough. She will die a final death, without "
"any fey tricks. Her blood will please Lamashtu, and you will be generously "
"rewarded.\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Lamashtu}괴물들의 어머니{/g}께 가치있는 것이다. 나는 이미 내 선택을 했다 — 네레이드 에빈드라를 데려와라. 이 추악한 "
"생물은 세상을 그녀의 존재로 충분히 오랫동안 중독시켰다. 그녀는 이제 어떠한 페이 속임수도 없이 죽을 것이다. 그녀의 피는 라마슈투를 "
"기쁘게 할 것이고, 너는 관대하게 보상받을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Tsanna
msgctxt "02da99d0-b3ae-4881-880d-d491d3993e89"
msgid ""
"\"It's a pity that even now you are not shrewd or brave enough... But I owe "
"you much, and will repay you for your trust. Accept my own blessing since "
"you have rejected {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu's{/g} gift.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 심지어 지금도 날카롭지도 용감하지도 않아 안타깝다... 하지만 나는 너에게 많은 빚을 졌다, 그리고 그 신뢰는 갚을 것이다. "
"{g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 선물을 거부했으니, 나의 축복을 받아 들여라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Tsanna
msgctxt "71cc7146-d8ae-4d01-9cff-b5533222fc7d"
msgid ""
"\"Then accept my blessing, {mf|king|queen}. Along with a touch of the "
"{g|Lamashtu}Mother of Monsters'{/g} power.\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면 내 축복을 받아들여라, {mf|왕|여왕}. {g|Lamashtu}괴물들의 어머니{/g}의 손길과 함께.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : FinalDungeon_Tsanna
msgctxt "2b8f0437-5c88-4116-85a0-479048952833"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna nods, satisfied.{/n} \"I will go up ahead, and wait in a quiet "
"nook. Tell the repulsive wretch to come looking for me, and then — little "
"else will remain to be done. When the sacrifice is complete, you will feel "
"the true power of {g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나는 만족스러운듯 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"나는 앞으로 가 조용한 구석에서 기다릴 것이다. 반항하는 끔찍한 자에게 나를 "
"찾으러 오라고 말해라. 나머지는 끝내지 않을 것이다. 희생이 끝나면 너는 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}의 진정한 힘을 느낄 것이다!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "99cd3cca-c5f6-4323-8e43-9221ba06ffe7"
msgid ""
"\"I beg you, {name}, do not go down this path. We are on the verge of a "
"great battle. Now is perhaps not the time to discuss morals, but I have to "
"say it — don't shed innocent blood! Especially when the priestess of a "
"monstrous deity prompts you to.\""
msgstr ""
"\"간곡히 부탁드립니다, {name}. 이 길을 따르지 마십시오. 우리는 커다란 전투에 직면해 있습니다. 이제는 도덕을 의논할 시간이 "
"아니지만, 저는 꼭 말해야겠습니다. 무고한 피를 흘리지 마십시오! 특히 괴물 여신의 여사제가 당신을 설득한다면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : Octavia_Companion
msgctxt "b26834fb-0626-421b-bf39-753ca6f986a0"
msgid ""
"\"Tsanna's desire to destroy everything beautiful seems to never cease! "
"Evindra is kind and beautiful, unlike the monsters that "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g} loves so much.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아름다운 모든 것을 파괴하려는 산나의 욕망은 결코 멈추지 않을 거야! {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}가 사랑하는 괴물과는 달리, "
"에빈드라는 친절하고 아름다워.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/FinalDungeon(CapitalRuins)/TsannaDialog/Cue_0023_Text
#. Speaker : Regongar_Companion
msgctxt "c14e6751-09d9-4c4b-bb30-8f4035c174cc"
msgid ""
"\"It's all right, she's a fey. She'll spring right back to life after the "
"sacrifice. Or not, ha ha! Who cares.\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아. 그녀는 페이니까. 그녀는 희생된 후 살아서 돌아올 거야. 아니면 죽던가! 하하! 내 알 바 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IllthuliakLair/Barks/Bark_KoboldBark1_String
msgctxt "acb10fce-f7f4-45c8-abd1-75c2cb75e368"
msgid "\"Trap no good. Missstresss will ssscold usss... eat usss!\""
msgstr "\"함정은 좋지 않아. 주인님이 우리를 혼낼 것이다... 우리를 잡아 먹을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IllthuliakLair/Barks/Bark_KoboldBark2_String
msgctxt "d3344c6f-4f17-448e-85ba-d82d43989202"
msgid "\"Ssstrangersss! Ssstrangersss! Run!\""
msgstr "\"낯선자다! 이방인이다! 도망쳐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IllthuliakLair/Barks/CorpseBark1_String
msgctxt "911f05bb-a7d4-43b1-91ac-662b5bd6cb62"
msgid "The body is covered with acid burns."
msgstr "시체는 산에 의해 화상으로 덮여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IllthuliakLair/Barks/Dragon_bark_String
msgctxt "930919ae-976b-4c78-9f1a-44b97faff776"
msgid ""
"\"You must be either very bold or very stupid to come to the lair of "
"Ilthuliak. It makes no difference which — the end is the same for both!\""
msgstr "\"일수리악의 은신처에 오다니, 매우 용감하거나 끔찍히 어리석구나. 차이는 없다. 둘 다 종점은 같을테니!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "2bab53f6-a226-43e1-840a-07cbe3a8e3fc"
msgid "\"Nyrissa is dead.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사는 죽었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "2116586d-6fb9-422c-af50-bd7f73816e1d"
msgid ""
"\"We were able to find common ground. Nyrissa will help us in this war.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 공통점을 찾을 수 있다. 나이리사는 전쟁을 끝내도록 우리를 도울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "5cdb5a8a-6dba-4e31-833c-bf04b5346710"
msgid ""
"\"I destroyed the curse and returned to her what the Eldest took away.\""
msgstr "\"나는 저주를 파괴하고 원로가 가져간 것을 그녀에게 돌려주었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "299e5a75-4c84-4660-b31c-1dd177bacf8c"
msgid "\"This is not the time for talk. Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"지금은 이야기 할 시간이 아니다. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "f0016482-ea9b-4821-9108-8e990a922104"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you! Words cannot describe how happy I am to see you. It's the "
"second time you've risked your life for my freedom... Plus, you've "
"challenged my old enemy — an {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} whose name I won't dare "
"say out loud here. In gratitude for rescuing me, and for his long-awaited "
"defeat, I will provide you with all the help I possibly can.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고마워! 너를 보게 되어 얼마나 기쁜지 설명할 수가 없다. 내 자유를 위해 네가 목숨을 걸은 것이 두 번째이다. 게다가, 너는 내 "
"숙적에게 도전했다 — 나는 그 이름을 입 밖으로 꺼내기도 힘들 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 말이다. 나를 구해준 고마움과, 오랫동안 "
"기다려온 그의 패배를 위해, 내가 할 수 있는 모든 도움을 주겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "f52b3f69-f958-4624-8ba7-bf6004b0c133"
msgid ""
"\"Thank you. I can't say we parted as friends — but for the second time I "
"owe you my freedom. Besides, now we have a common foe — an "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} whose name I won't dare say out loud here. Let's forget "
"our old grudge. In this war I am entirely on your side.\""
msgstr ""
"\"고맙다. 나는 우리가 친구로 헤어졌다고 말할 수는 없지만, 두 번째로 나는 너에게 자유를 빚졌다. 게다가 이제 우리는 공통의 적을 "
"가지고 있다 — {g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 이름은 내가 입 밖으로 꺼내기도 힘든 것이다. 우리의 오래된 원한은 잊자. 이 전쟁에서 "
"나는 전적으로 너의 편이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : GasperreLiacenza_FW
msgctxt "e51a2a36-c00b-4ce1-b682-b9d5ef7e3261"
msgid ""
"{n}Gasperre greets you with a sweeping bow.{/n} \"Thank you for saving my "
"life. You've come once more to free Pitax of a tyrant — and my sword is at "
"your {d|c51 Governor Liacenca}service{/d} again! This time we are threatened "
"not by a simple petty tyrant, but by a god-like monster from another world. "
"But I will fight for my city to the last drop of my blood!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}가스페레는 당신에게 우아하게 절합니다.{/n} \"제 목숨을 구해주어 고맙습니다. 당신은 폭군으로부터 피탁스를 다시 해방했습니다. "
"그리고 저는 다시 당신께 {d|c51 Governor Liacenca}충성합니다{/d}! 이번은 단순한 작은 폭군이 아니라 다른 세계의 "
"신과 같은 괴물이 위협하고 있습니다. 그러나 제 마지막 피 한 방울을 흘릴 때까지 제 도시를 위해 싸우겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : KharneVereel_FW
msgctxt "4654ccb5-74eb-433d-a378-4b77f5ffc77f"
msgid ""
"{n}The gnome's little red eyes wander desperately, his trembling hands "
"searching his pockets for something that is obviously not there.{/n} \"When "
"I saw a whole army of dead Irovetti, I thought — that's it, now you've done "
"it, flipped your lid. But it's not so bad after all! The whole world might "
"have gone mad, but Kharne Vereel! — He's here, safe and sound! Which "
"means... we'll put up a fight. Right? Of course I'm right. Tell me what to "
"do, Your Highness, I'm at your {d|c51 Governor Vereel}command{/d}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}노움의 작은 빨간 눈동자가 절망적으로 떠돌고, 그의 떨리는 손은 주머니를 있지도 않은 물건을 더듬거립니다.{/n} \"내가 죽은 "
"이로베티의 군대를 보았을 때, 마침내 네가 폭발했을 거라고 생각했어. 그러나 결국 그렇게 나쁘지는 않았어! 전 세계가 미쳐 돌아갈지 "
"모르지만 칸 베릴이 여기 무사하게 있다! 그게... 우리는 싸움을 할거야. 맞지? 당연히 내가 옳아. 할 일을 말해줘. 나는 {d|c51 "
"Governor Vereel}네 명령 {/d}을 기다린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : Stefano_FW
msgctxt "ddb33a77-05a5-4bd2-b411-f12d0ec1cc28"
msgid ""
"{n}Stefano shakes the dust from his doublet with a flamboyant gesture and "
"makes a sweeping bow.{/n} \"So, once more you are doing what you love most — "
"the impossible! If anyone else dared to declare war on a godlike creature "
"from the {g|First World}First World{/g}, I would say it was complete "
"insanity. But you — oh, the boring rules of ordinary people aren't written "
"for you! But come what may, your humble {d|c51 Governor Moskoni}servant{/d} "
"is, as always, at your service. Lead, Your Highness! Lead us into the "
"unknown!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}스테파노는 눈부신 제스처로 상의에 붙은 먼지를 털고 활짝 웃습니다.{/n} \"다시 한 번 가장 좋아하는 것을 하고 있군요 — "
"불가능한 일을! 다른 누군가가 감히 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 신과 같은 생물에게 전쟁을 선포한다면, 저는 그것이 "
"완전한 광기라고 말할겁니다. 하지만 평범한 사람들의 지루한 규칙은 당신을 위해 만들어진 것이 아닙니다! 무슨 일이 있더라도, 당신의 "
"겸손한 {d|c51 Governor Moskoni}수하{/d}는 언제든지 준비 되어있습니다. 명령하십시오, 전하! 저희를 미지의 세계로 "
"이끌어주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "91600c44-f827-4f84-9a12-b162a46ef54e"
msgid ""
"{n}Evindra looks at the governor's body in sadness.{/n} \"This poor {d|c51 "
"Governor Nameless}fellow{/d} was loyal to the end — and paid a great price "
"for it. May his sacrifice be not forgotten!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}에빈드라는 슬픔에 빠져 총독의 시신을 봅니다.{/n} \"이 불쌍한 {d|c51 Governor Nameless}친구{/d}는 "
"끝까지 충성을 잃지 않고, 커다란 대가를 치렀지. 이 희생이 잊혀지지 않기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "d068500d-031c-4c82-ad58-7ce4aea3755c"
msgid ""
"\"Pitax has been freed. The chain that binds you to the curse has weakened. "
"But your own freedom and our victory are not yet within our grasp. Let's "
"hurry to the capital — you must prepare for the next step! But first... tell "
"me what became of my sister? How did your encounter at the House at the Edge "
"of Time end?\""
msgstr ""
"\"피탁스는 해방되었다. 너를 저주에 묶는 사슬은 약화되었다. 그러나 자유와 승리는 아직 가지지 못했다. 수도로 서둘러 가야 한다. 다음 "
"단계를 준비해야 한다! 그 전에 내 동생이 무엇이 되었는지 말해 주겠나? 시간의 끝에 선 집에서 어떻게 되었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "5f467a33-74c4-477c-8973-4ce4008b98ba"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid looks down.{/n} \"Oh... I felt it, but didn't want to believe "
"it until... Well, there was hardly a way to destroy the spell that gripped "
"her soul. Dying is probably better than living as a terrible caricature of "
"your former self, an empty vessel, in which the flame of your love has died. "
"Thank you. It saddens me to think she's gone, but you did the right thing.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드는 고개를 떨굽니다.{/n} \"오... 나는 그것을 느꼈지만 믿기를 원하지 않았다... 그녀의 영혼을 사로 잡은 주문을 "
"파괴 할 방법은 거의 없었다. 너의 사랑이 식은 비어있는 예전의 껍데기의 끔찍한 모습으로 살기보다는 죽는 것이 낫다. 고맙다. 그녀가 "
"떠난 것 같아서 슬프지만 너는 옳은 일을했다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "096d972f-58fe-461a-8676-26bf9de4f8df"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid frowns.{/n} \"You've made a terrible mistake. Endless "
"generations of innocents — the same as she's destroyed over the past ages — "
"will pay the price for any help she provides us now. You know as well as I "
"that the curse of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} has transformed her into a "
"monster. How could you unleash this monster?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드는 눈살을 찌푸립니다.{/n} \"너는 끔찍한 실수를 저질렀다. 그녀가 과거에 파괴한 끝없는 세대의 무고한 사람들은 그녀가 "
"지금 우리에게 제공하는 도움을 위해 대가를 치를 것이다. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 그녀를 괴물로 변화시킨 것은 알고 있겠지. "
"어떻게 이 괴물을 풀어줄 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "2165988b-d04e-4a7c-8500-ea54d7fe57dc"
msgid ""
"{n}The nereid holds her hands to her heart.{/n} \"Can it be true! You "
"managed to destroy the curse that tormented her soul for thousands of years? "
"Will I really meet my sister again — the one I remember, the one I love so "
"much?! Oh, {Name}! Not all immortals are capable of the miracles you do. "
"Before now, I'd only hoped we could win in this war, but now I feel certain "
"of victory!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}네레이드는 그녀의 가슴에 손을 얹습니다.{/n} \"말도 안돼! 수천 년 동안 자신의 영혼을 괴롭혔던 저주를 없애 버렸다고? 정말로 "
"내 동생을 다시 만날 수 있을까? 내가 기억하는 너무 많이 사랑하는 동생을? 오, {Name}! 모든 불멸자가 너의 기적을 따라할 수 "
"있는 것은 아니다. 지금까지 이 전쟁에서 승리 할 수 있기를 바라기만 했지만, 지금은 승리를 확신한다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "b2797927-ce2d-4a0e-a428-8dabe0a1aeb6"
msgid ""
"\"You are right. I hope we will have time to talk about it. But if we don't, "
"this conversation would be pointless anyhow. Let's go!\""
msgstr ""
"\"네가 맞다. 우리가 그것에 대해 이야기 할 시간을 가지기를 바란다. 하지만 우리가 하지 않으면 이 대화는 아무리 해도 무의미 할 "
"것이다. 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Evindra_FW
msgctxt "736087fb-511d-4e8a-88d1-03b86c1141b2"
msgid "\"Right, then. Enough talk. It's time to act! Let's go!\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 이제 충분하다. 행동할 시간이야! 가자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/AfterBattle/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "67c9c416-5981-4637-b7b7-4c682f46a1c3"
msgid ""
"{n}You feel some of your powers return to you. By restoring Pitax you "
"weakened the curse hanging over you and your followers!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 힘 중 일부가 당신에게 돌아 오는 것을 느낍니다. 피탁스를 복원하여 당신과 당신의 추종자들에게 걸려있는 저주를 약화 "
"시켰습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Evindra_SaveMe_String
msgctxt "b66980fd-ddcf-412e-af75-884681aeb7d7"
msgid ""
"\"Look, Irovetti, it's {Name}! {mf|He|She} defeated you once — {mf|he|she}"
"'ll do it again!\""
msgstr "\"이봐! 이로베티! {Name}다! {mf|그|그녀}가 너를 한 번 격파했지 — 그리고 다시 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Irovetti_battle_1_String
msgctxt "691253bd-6edd-404c-9a6d-ad8fcbf2024b"
msgid "\"Minstrels will sing about this battle!\""
msgstr "\"음유시인이 이 전투에 대해 노래 할 거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Irovetti_battle_2_String
msgctxt "baa46405-2f97-4e89-b0ae-7d17d3128be9"
msgid "\"You cannot even comprehend my grandeur!\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 웅장함을 이해 할 수도 없어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Irovetti_battle_3_String
msgctxt "f8572520-26f5-48a5-a7e1-249a5c09824e"
msgid "\"A new triumph of the brilliant Irovetti!\""
msgstr "\"총명한 이로베티의 새로운 승리다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Irovetti_battle_4_String
msgctxt "649487f4-70d6-4f9f-9f06-e55415cfe989"
msgid "\"Jealous mediocrity! Get out of my sight!\""
msgstr "\"질투심 많은 하찮은 것! 내 눈 앞에서 나가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Irovetti_battle_5_String
msgctxt "16ec429e-f14c-4523-b685-148fb554e7ab"
msgid "\"You are just a pencil mark in the margins of my epic!\""
msgstr "\"너는 내 서사시의 여백에 있는 연필 자국일 뿐이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Irovetti_dies_String
msgctxt "f1bab7fa-ccc3-4ced-a224-ae2e685ed122"
msgid "\"The legend is... Immortal!\""
msgstr "\"전설은... 불멸이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Zone_blocked_String
msgctxt "c31fd465-c007-463a-be1a-34758044f1c8"
msgid "The hallway is covered by a dense net of vines."
msgstr "복도는 덩굴로 둘러싸여 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Zone_greens_1_String
msgctxt "bab25cb9-61a3-4d1d-8d69-31f91d79ebbf"
msgid "The whole palace is subdued by the lush greenery of the First World."
msgstr "궁전은 태초 세계의 푸르른 수풀에 정복당했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Barks/Zone_greens_2_String
msgctxt "0585b72e-120c-43df-86fa-66eb3c44483a"
msgid "The magic brush is emitting an unworldly honey-sweet fragrance."
msgstr "마법의 수풀은 고귀하고 달콤한 향기를 내뿜고 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "19ed3993-d4dc-4744-a95e-0202ab448fc2"
msgid ""
"\"You think you're a hero? I think you're a common villain... And not the "
"most dangerous I've dispatched.\""
msgstr "\"네가 영웅이라고 생각해? 넌 그냥 흔한 악당일뿐이야... 그리고 내가 맞서본 가장 위험한 악당도 아니지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "3c5680d1-55e6-4bbc-9971-001aeca8d0d5"
msgid ""
"\"Irovetti, what are you babbling on about? What hero, what villain? You're "
"dead! You're not really here!\""
msgstr "\"이로베티. 도대체 뭐라고 주절대는 거야? 무슨 영웅이 악당이 어째? 너는 죽었어! 넌 여기 정말 있지도 않다고!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "f49c6103-617d-4832-bc5b-1f7ca8c1f6ca"
msgid "\"I don't have time for your nonsense. Ready your weapon!\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 너의 말 같지도 않은 이야기는 듣고 싶지 않다. 무기를 들어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "cb912064-23da-4e46-9bfb-cb67ba445982"
msgid ""
"\"There you are. Of course. After all, you couldn't miss it. A mimic cannot "
"exist without a model, nor a villain without a hero. You don't have your own "
"journey, or your own story, for you are merely a chapter in my epic. Without "
"me you simply do not exist!\""
msgstr ""
"\"이제 왔구만. 물론. 결국엔 넌 와야만 했을거야. 복제품이 진품없이 존재하지 않듯이, 악당도 영웅 없이는 존재하지 못하는 법이지. "
"너는 너만의 모험도 이야기도 가지질 못해. 넌 그저 내 원대한 이야기의 일부일뿐이야. 내가 없다면 너도 존재하지 않는거지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "d5051933-1ded-4055-b24f-b73a6e119712"
msgid ""
"\"Do you remember when we last met you said you'd rule my lands...\" {n}"
"Irovetti says in a mocking voice,{/n} \"'for the good of your subjects, "
"wisely and fairly'? So what? Did your ruling bring your subjects much good? "
"Are they satisfied? Are they happy now? Is the toady fairy happy? Is your "
"governor happy, who turned into my foot-rest?\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 마지막으로 만났을 때 내 땅을 지배하겠다고 말한 것을 기억하나?\" {n}이로베티는 조롱하는 목소리로 말합니다.{/n} \""
"'네 백성을 위해 현명하고 공정하게?' 그래서 너는 백성들을 행복하게 만들었나? 그들은 만족하는가? 그들은 행복한가? 아첨꾼 페이는 "
"행복한가? 내 하인이 되어버린 네 총독도 행복한가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "b752dbf2-d835-47db-aaaf-a9c24c77a9dd"
msgid ""
"\"Do you remember – when we last met, you said you'd return "
"{g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} to its citizens? It sounded so noble! But in the end my "
"possessions are returned to me – both Pitax and the toady fairy! Your "
"governor is now my foot-rest. And as for you – it's time you go to oblivion, "
"where you belong!\""
msgstr ""
"\"기억하나, 우리가 마지막으로 만났을 때 {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}를 시민들에게 돌려줄 것이라고 말했던 것을? 정말 고결한 "
"말이었어! 하지만 종국에 내 소유물들은 다시 내게 돌아왔다, 피탁스와 아첨꾼 페이까지! 네 총독은 내 발밑에 있다. 그리고 너로 말할 것 "
"같으면, 이제 네가 속해있던 망각으로 돌아갈 시간이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "27644773-56d6-43ce-900b-a3c2dfc47ba6"
msgid ""
"\"Do you remember when we last met? Remember how you threatened to consign "
"all memory of me to oblivion? How daring you were, how arrogant – and how "
"stupid! {g|Pitax}Pitax{/g} is mine once more. The toady fairy serves me "
"again. Your governor is my foot-rest. And you – what poetic irony! You've "
"once again come here, for me to send you to oblivion where you belong!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 마지막으로 만났을 때를 기억하나? 나에 대한 기억을 모두 지워버리겠다고 한 너의 위협도 기억하나? 이 얼마나 대담하고, 얼마나 "
"오만한지 – 그리고 얼마나 어리석은 자인지! {g|pitax}피탁스{/g}는 또 다시 내 것이 되었다. 아첨꾼 페이도 다시 나를 섬긴다. "
"너의 총독은 내 발 밑에 있지. 그리고 너도 – 이 얼마나 아이러니한가! 네가 속한 망각으로 내던져지기 위해, 너 또한 내 앞에 "
"돌아왔구나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "bfaadfc3-bf46-4355-bced-7b60613bef8a"
msgid ""
"\"Do you remember when we last met? Remember how you promised to make things "
"so rough for my subjects that they would remember me as a benefactor? You "
"shouldn't have said this, for the one great law of this world is the law of "
"poetic irony! Now their benefactor has returned, and your subjects curse "
"you. The toady fairy serves me again. Your governor is my foot-rest. And "
"you... Now you are going to die – and they'll only recall your name when "
"they're talking about me!\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리가 마지막으로 만났던 때를 기억하나? 네가 내 백성들을 가혹하게 대해서 나를 은인으로 기억하게끔 하겠다는 그 약속도 기억하나? 그 "
"말만은 하지 말았어야지. 이 세상의 위대한 법칙중 하나는 시적 아이러니니까! 이제 내 백성들의 은인이 돌아왔고, 네 백성들은 너를 "
"저주한다. 아첨꾼 페이는 또다시 나를 섬긴다. 너의 총독은 내 발 밑에 있다. 그리고 너... 너는 여기서 죽는다 – 그리고 네 이름은 "
"나에 대해 얘기할 때를 제외하면 다시는 불리지 않을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "8c09e14d-8425-4e59-b37f-d4af59b40501"
msgid ""
"\"And what do you think Irovetti is? A sack of skin filled with bones and "
"guts, that once decorated this room so beautifully? Of course not! Irovetti "
"is a legend! And the legend has returned, in all his glory!\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 이로베티가 누구라고 생각하나? 한 때 이 방을 아름답게 장식했던 뼈와 내장으로 가득 찬 피부로 둘러쌓인 한 덩어리인가? 당연히 "
"아니지! 이로베티는 전설이다! 그리고 전설이 모든 영광과 함께 돌아왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "5c9fc703-93ec-4a7b-8f25-5208f8fb292c"
msgid ""
"\"Everyone thinks they are the hero of their own story, and all the others "
"but a crowd. But do you know what makes us different? Your story is a poor "
"joke that's gone on for far too long. Mine is a legend for the ages!\""
msgstr ""
"\"모든 사람들은 자신들이 이야기의 영웅이고, 다른 사람들은 관객일 뿐이라 생각한다. 하지만 우리가 무엇이 다른지 아는가? 너의 이야기는 "
"너무 오랫동안 지속된 불쌍한 농담일 뿐이다. 내 이야기는 수 세기 동안 이어질 전설이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "dddb190d-5295-401e-b052-2f0ce16a5811"
msgid "\"Really. Why do I waste words on someone who will never understand?\""
msgstr "\"사실이다. 왜 내가 이해하지 못할 사람에게 내 말을 낭비했지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "ce300bb6-4ea7-4d94-9f9a-37aff7067aaf"
msgid ""
"\"Look around! I am everything I was, and all that I could be! All the "
"legends composed about me. My glory was too great to fit into one body. Here "
"is Irovetti – wise ruler, Irovetti – invincible warrior, Irovetti – cunning "
"trickster, Irovetti – sacred champion of Calistria... And who are you? No "
"one and nothing. A minor prop I will use to demonstrate my grandeur to the "
"audience!\""
msgstr ""
"\"주변을 둘러봐라! 나는 이전의 나이고 최고의 상태이다! 모든 전설이 나를 위해 쓰여진 것이었다. 나의 영광은 너무 커서 한 몸에 꼭 "
"들어맞지 않았다. 나는 이로베티. 지혜로운 통치자 이로베티. 천하무적의 전사 이로베티. 교활한 사기꾼 이로베티. 칼리스트리아의 신성한 "
"챔피언이다... 그리고 너는 누구인가? 아무것도 아니다. 관객에게 나의 웅대함을 보여주기 위한 사소한 소품일 뿐이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/BeforeBattle/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "dc2509c2-a6a2-49d6-ac82-846882654826"
msgid ""
"\"Well, let us begin! It's time for you to become a part of my history!\""
msgstr "\"좋아, 시작하자! 이제 네가 내 역사의 일부가 될 때가 왔다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Names/IrovettiClone_CasterTough_String
msgctxt "a9755888-b997-40a9-92f3-03f7b6f81581"
msgid "Irovetti the Genius"
msgstr "천재 이로베티"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Names/IrovettiClone_MeleeTough_String
msgctxt "c1e1cafb-b4ae-444f-9da3-f4fb9491eadb"
msgid "Irovetti the Invincible"
msgstr "무적의 이로베티"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Names/IrovettiClone_MeleeWeak_String
msgctxt "0f284c2d-e23c-444d-ac37-8aa4e02159d1"
msgid "Irovetti the Tireless"
msgstr "지칠줄 모르는 이로베티"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Names/IrovettiClone_RangedTough_String
msgctxt "e863d2ac-3fff-44b7-9d6a-2afdf5730764"
msgid "Irovetti the Cunning"
msgstr "교활한 이로베티"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/IrovettiPalaceFW/Names/Irovetti_BOSS_String
msgctxt "ba7ae3a4-515e-4815-95db-1b6e3a4a7c48"
msgid "Irovetti the Great and Wise"
msgstr "위대하고 현명한 이로베티"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "e6ece283-31e8-499e-9088-8869740dddc4"
msgid "\"Snap out of it, Tsanna!\""
msgstr "\"그만해! 산나!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "c54c6b78-00b7-4760-b7bb-c5977eab1c57"
msgid "\"Yes! Grant me Lamashtu's power!\""
msgstr "\"그래! 라마슈투의 힘을 줘!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "83f2c2f0-cd29-401b-8fa1-97ca7abe015d"
msgid "[Attack] \"Death to Lamashtu's abomination!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"라마슈투의 혐오를 샀으니 죽어라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "e06a72dd-9881-424f-9705-719a011e2462"
msgid "\"I need your help in the capital.\""
msgstr "\"수도에서 네 도움이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "6570228d-1203-4fb7-b53d-54c59f575308"
msgid "\"You're scaring me.\""
msgstr "\"너 때문에 놀랐다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "8e1cd317-f964-4403-9218-05da061b0662"
msgid "\"How could you abandon everyone like that?!\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 모두를 그렇게 포기할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "744e266d-1f2f-498a-9471-4d1b1ea23ecf"
msgid "\"I suppose I'll leave you to your insanity.\""
msgstr "\"계속 광기에 빠져있어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Barks/EvemyTsanna_attackbark_String
msgctxt "c87c2514-dc6f-45e1-a898-ec7af16d4755"
msgid ""
"\"Mother of Monsters, give me the strength to free your lands of this filth!"
"\""
msgstr "\"괴물들의 어머니시여 이 더러운 땅을 해방시킬 힘을 주십시오!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "2b86afbd-ee93-4015-a94d-169c3e9c2b46"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna's hair is disheveled, her clothes are covered in dirt and blood. "
"She glares at you fiercely, her eyes filled with bloodthirsty cruelty.{/n} "
"\"The time for empty words and prayers has passed, {name}! Lamashtu requires "
"sacrifice, now or never! Are you ready, mortal? Ready to pay the price for "
"the blessing of the Mother of Beasts?!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나의 머리카락이 흐트러지고 그녀의 옷은 먼지와 피로 뒤덮여있습니다. 그녀는 당신을 맹렬히 바라봤고, 그녀의 눈은 피에 굶주린 "
"잔인함으로 가득 차 있습니다.{/n} \"공허한 말과 기도의 시간이 지났다. {name}! 라마슈투는 지금 당장 희생을 요구한다. "
"준비됐나. 필멸자여? 괴물들의 어머니의 축복을 위한 대가를 지불할 준비가 되었나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "da838c6c-56df-49b8-8e70-b194a4729263"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess casually wipes drops of blood from her chin, smearing red "
"and pink trails across her skin.{/n} \"When I saw the first signs, I left "
"the capital and came here. The voices led me — the voices of those destined "
"to give their lives at the altar! Oh, Lamashtu feasted well this day! The "
"ground will long be wet with the blood my knife has spilled!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}여사제는 자연스럽게 턱에서 나온 피를 닦아 내고 피부는 빨간색과 분홍색의 흔적이 번집니다.{/n} \"첫 징후를 보았을 때 나는 "
"수도를 떠나 여기에 왔다. 목소리가 나를 인도했다. 제단에서 목숨을 바칠 운명인 자들의 목소리! 오, 라마슈투께서는 오늘을 즐기셨다! "
"땅은 내 칼이 흘린 피로 뒤덮였다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "322a2a8e-ec1e-4bb7-872b-128d9bf9a0b1"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess roars with insane laughter, echoed by squeaking from the "
"two-headed rat sticking her snouts out of the folds of Tsanna's clothes.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}여사제는 미친듯이 웃고 그 소리는 그녀 옷에 숨은 머리 둘 달린 쥐가 찍찍거리며 따라합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "afe24595-34d5-4a35-93bd-e1a7bde5f9f4"
msgid ""
"{n}Tsanna's eyes flash angrily.{/n} \"And what would you have me give them? "
"Words of encouragement? Solace in the face of death? No, {name}, I was of "
"more use here — in my goddess's place of power. Speaking of which...\" {n}"
"The priestess licks her lips as though relishing the taste of something.{/n} "
"\"I've done all I can here. It's time to go back.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산나의 눈은 화가 나서 번쩍입니다.{/n} \"그리고 내가 너에게 무엇을 줄까? 격려의 말? 죽음에 직면한 자를 위한 위안? "
"아니다. {name}. 여신의 힘의 장소인 여기에서 나는 더욱 쓸만하다. 말하자면...\" {n}여사제는 마치 뭔가의 맛을 좋아하는 "
"것처럼 그녀의 입술을 핥습니다.{/n} \"내가 할 수 있는 일은 다 했어. 돌아갈 시간이야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "88ade58f-b9c2-4dcf-8526-4877824a7e23"
msgid ""
"{n}The priestess roars with laughter.{/n} \"And where was your fear before, "
"{name}? It's too late for that — you and I are bound with something far "
"stronger than blood or vows. You are mine, {name} — and I, who asked "
"Lamashtu for you, am yours.\" {n}Tsanna's eyes grow glassy as the last of "
"her speech drops almost to a monotone.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}제사장은 웃음 소리를 질렀다.{/n} \"이전의 두려움은 어디에 있나? {name}? 그것은 너무 늦었다 — 너와 나는 피나 "
"맹세보다 훨씬 강한 것으로 묶여있다. 너는 내거야. {name}. 그리고 너를 위해 라마슈투에게 기도한 나는, 너의 것이다.\" {n}"
"그녀의 마지막 한마디는 단조로웠고, 그녀의 눈은 유리처럼 빛납니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/ShrineofLamashtuFW/TsannaFW/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "b6f974fc-76aa-472b-b152-b328495a9109"
msgid ""
"\"Let's go! Lamashtu has had her fill of blood — she has no more need of me "
"here.\" {n}Tsanna strokes the snouts of her two-headed rat, who dives back "
"into the folds of her clothes, before shaking the dust from her lap.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"가자! 라마슈투는 피를 가득 채웠다. 그녀는 더 이상 나를 이곳에서 필요로 하지 않는다.\" {n}산나는 무릎을 더럽히던 머리 둘 "
"달린 쥐의 주둥이를 후려치자 쥐는 그녀의 옷으로 다시 들어갔습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a1a3a95b-6073-45d7-8276-d6d52f8c7b31"
msgid ""
"\"Shyka, Magdh, and the Lost Prince. The Eldest of time, fate and solitude. "
"A truly amusing company has gathered here.\""
msgstr "\"샤이카, 마그드, 그리고 잃어버린 왕자. 운명과 고독의 시간의 원로. 진정으로 재미있는 자들이 이곳에 모였다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "c3082331-6198-442b-8afe-9968b5aca725"
msgid ""
"\"You three are the Eldest who participated in the trial over Nyrissa, is "
"that not so? So her curse is your punishment as well?\""
msgstr "\"너희 셋은 나이리사의 심판에 참여했던 원로가 아닌가? 그녀의 저주도 너희의 처벌인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "4e4e84f4-9d61-40e6-815f-cc53d6333d61"
msgid "\"We need help in confronting the Lantern King and his curse.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 등불왕과 그의 저주에 직면하는데 도움이 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : C71_Nyrissa
msgctxt "e5087ac4-4e56-4534-bf16-59c632a7eaa3"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks back at you, as if urging for support, and keeps speaking "
"with confidence.{/n} \"Why are you here then, the Many? And why did you come "
"to my house? Perhaps this pathetic screech interests you in some way?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 도움을 급히 바라는 것처럼 당신을 뒤돌아보고, 자신 있게 계속 말합니다.{/n} \"왜 여기에 왔지? 샤이카? 왜 나의 "
"집에 왔지? 아마도 이 어처구니 없는 소리가 네 흥미를 가지게 했나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C71_Nyrissa
msgctxt "9c8a19e0-e07d-4ef7-b014-6b8ab2b09f61"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa seems more fragile than she used to be — and more determined. She "
"doesn't turn around, but apparently senses you approaching, straightens her "
"shoulders and breaks the silence.{/n} \"Will the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} hear "
"me out?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 예전보다 더 무너지기 쉬워 보였지만, 의지는 더욱 확고합니다. 그녀는 돌아서지 않지만, 당신이 접근하는 것을 분명히 "
"느끼고 어깨를 곧게 펴고는 침묵을 깨버립니다.{/n} \"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}들아, 내 말 들리는가? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : C71_MagdhTheThree
msgctxt "443afba1-a32b-4db2-8d3c-82eba1a0ae0f"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} will,\" {n}says the figure in a green robe. The "
"whole world shivers slightly at the sound of her voice.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 그러할 것이다.\" {n}녹색 로브를 입은 자가 말합니다. 온 세상이 그녀의 목소리에 약간 "
"흔들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : C71_ShykaTheMany
msgctxt "373364e4-f3b9-4d8f-a4ee-5b29a7ba8344"
msgid ""
"\"Is it worth it?\" {n}Replies the figure in grey-blue, who you recognize as "
"{d|AnotherShyka}Shyka{/d}.{/n} \"There is so much noise in the world. Why do "
"we have to listen to this pathetic screech?\""
msgstr ""
"\"그만한 가치가 있나?\" {n}{d|AnotherShyka}샤이카{/d}라고 생각되는 군청색의 로브를 입은 자가 대답합니다. {/n} "
"\"세상에는 너무 많은 소음이 있다. 왜 우리가 이 애처로운 소리를 들어야 하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : C71_ShykaTheMany
msgctxt "b3007aab-3fc7-4855-94be-21110564b1ef"
msgid ""
"\"You wanted to become one of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, girl. But still you "
"seem to barely understand what we are and what drives us. But enough. Since "
"you are here…\" {n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} turns their head slightly toward "
"you.{/n} \"… ask.\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 되고 싶어 했다. 그러나 아직도 너는 우리가 무엇인지, 무엇이 우리를 이끄는지 이해하지 못하는 "
"것 같다. 그러나 충분하다. 너는 여기에서...\" {n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 머리를 당신쪽으로 약간 돌립니다.{/n} \""
"... 물은 이후로 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : C71_TheLostPrince
msgctxt "b24a53ff-3db0-4596-ba9f-df22eaca3dfa"
msgid ""
"\"This is the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King's{/g} game.\" {n}The dark-haired "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} breaks his silence for the first time. His voice is "
"bleak and unemotional, but there is a note of disapproval in it — so faint "
"that you wonder if you imagined it.{/n} \"We were present, but hardly "
"participated.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이것은 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 게임이다.\" {n}검은 머리의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 처음으로 그의 "
"목소리를 냈습니다. 그의 목소리는 어둡고 감정이 없지만, 비난조의 목소리입니다 — 너무 희미해서 당신의 상상일 뿐인지 궁금해집니다.{/n}"
" \"우리는 여기 왔지만, 거의 참여하지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : C71_MagdhTheThree
msgctxt "e24631a1-dd6b-43b2-99eb-e5b63c7f5cfa"
msgid ""
"\"Transgressions and punishments, questions asked and answers received — an "
"eternal cycle. A great price must be paid for a daring scheme, Nyrissa. "
"However...\" {n}the figure in green pauses{/n} \"... I think the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} asked more of you than was due. Much more.\""
msgstr ""
"\"범법과 처벌. 물어진 질문과 받아진 대답. 그것은 영원한 순환이다. 대담한 계획은 큰 대가를 지불해야 한다, 나이리사. 하지만...\""
" {n}초록 로브를 입은 자가 멈칫합니다.{/n} \"... 내가 생각하기에 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 해야 했던 것보다 "
"너무 많은 것을 요구했다. 너무나 많이.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : C71_MagdhTheThree
msgctxt "7261c00e-7c65-4d06-8800-d13dd94c1ff8"
msgid "\"What makes you think we will help?\""
msgstr "\"왜 우리가 도울 것이라고 생각하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : C71_ShykaTheMany
msgctxt "f530d135-2b4d-4f80-bca8-ad84c597431f"
msgid ""
"\"And we do not. We can scarcely remember a timeline when we weren't annoyed "
"by your vanity, nymph girl. Well, you're lucky that the {g|LanternKing}"
"Lantern King{/g} annoys us even more. So we won't mind... disrupting his "
"plans a little bit.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그리고 우리는 하지 않았다. 우리는 네 허영심에 괴롭혀지지 않은 시간대가 떠오르지 않는다, 님프 소녀야. "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 우리를 더욱 괴롭게 하는 것을 행운으로 알아라. 그러니 우리는 상관 없다... 그의 계획에 "
"조금 혼동을 주는 것은.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : C71_ShykaTheMany
msgctxt "0a59ce9e-e8ee-46ff-92a6-94444cfc8186"
msgid ""
"\"Clever child. We remain gratified by dwellers of the {g|Material Plane}"
"Material Plane{/g}!\" {n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} turns around to the dark-haired "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}.{/n} \"What do you say, Prince? Aren't our guests from "
"{g|Golarion}Golarion{/g} the most amusing creatures? You should come out of "
"your tower and visit these lands... You might even conduct the next "
"Inconsequent Debates!\""
msgstr ""
"\"영리한 아이구나. 우리는 여전히 {g|material plane}물질계{/g}의 거주민들에 만족한다!\" "
"{n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}는 검은 머리카락의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}에게 돌아섭니다.{/n} \"뭐라고 말할 것인가, "
"왕자? {g|Golarion}골라리온{/g}의 손님은 가장 재미있는 생물이 아닌가? 네 탑에서 나와 이 땅을 방문해 봐라... 심지어 "
"네가 다음 비논리 토론회를 주최할지도 모른다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : C71_ShykaTheMany
msgctxt "3cfb671a-7d03-4ebd-afd5-306df1e75048"
msgid ""
"\"Intuition, I suppose.\" {n}{g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} chuckles.{/n} \"Let us stop "
"weaving words. We can help you... even both of you. But help must be "
"deserved. If you wish to start again, start your journey from the end!\""
msgstr ""
"\"직감이다, 내 추측으로는.\" {n}{g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 싱긋 웃습니다.{/n} \"소설 쓰는 것은 그만 두자. 우리는 "
"너를 도울 수있다. 너희 둘 말이다. 그러나 도움은 높이 평가받아 마땅하다. 다시 시작하기를 원한다면, 끝에서 너의 여행을 시작하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : C71_MagdhTheThree
msgctxt "cf600621-2da0-4131-935d-a6ad297d25dd"
msgid ""
"\"Very well, so be it. I know how I can help you, and I know what price I "
"will demand for it. Come to me when you are ready for a trial by fear. I "
"will not be far.\""
msgstr ""
"\"좋다. 나는 너를 도울 수 있는 방법을 알고, 내가 필요로 하는 대가를 안다. 두려움에 대한 시험이 준비되면 와라. 나는 가까이 있을 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : C71_Nyrissa
msgctxt "48077826-63ce-4489-b1b0-e8e95da00701"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks at you with sad blue eyes.{/n} \"It's always difficult to "
"deal with the higher powers. They toy with us, but without their help we "
"wouldn't have a chance against the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}. Let's "
"talk to all three of them and find out what they want!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 슬픈 파란 눈으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다.{/n} \"강한 자를 다루는 것은 언제나 어렵다. 그들은 우리를 장난감처럼 가지고 "
"놀지만, 그들의 도움이 없다면 우리는 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}에게 대적하지 못한다. 세 명 모두와 이야기하고 그들이 "
"원하는 것을 찾아보자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/AllEldestDialog/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : C71_TheLostPrince
msgctxt "b2f8445a-ae15-47f3-9977-902238885ee1"
msgid ""
"{n}Shyka's offer seems to fall on deaf ears. The dark-haired "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} pays no attention, studying the soil beside the toe of "
"his boot.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}샤이카의 제안은 귀머거리들에게 말한 것 같습니다. 검은 머리의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}는 그의 장화에 묻은 흙을 살피면서 "
"아무런 주의를 기울이지 않습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/Barks/1Jabberwock-Jabberwock_String
msgctxt "488575b2-24ea-4d10-955c-68aa51c945d5"
msgid "\"Thousands of years have passed, and here you are again, trespasser.\""
msgstr "\"수천 년이 지났고, 지금 네가 다시 왔다, 침입자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/Barks/2Jabberwock-Jabberwock_String
msgctxt "73821b9c-9d86-415d-b31a-a529e15d7eb0"
msgid "\"I guess some just don't learn their lessons.\""
msgstr "\"어떤 자들은 경험에서 교훈을 얻지 못하는 것 같군.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/Barks/3Jabberwock-Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "b18872df-3b90-41da-8175-1ce86f0e5e14"
msgid ""
"\"You are wrong, mighty Tane. I've learned much. And I'll prove it to you.\""
msgstr "\"네가 틀렸다. 강대한 테인. 나는 많이 배웠다. 그리고 나는 너에게 그것을 증명할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/Barks/4Jabberwock-Nyrissa_String
msgctxt "5a6db889-c3be-4789-8cfe-42991e5099d4"
msgid ""
"\"I lost this battle once, because I was alone. But it's different now. And "
"it's going to be different. We will not bow to the Lantern King.\""
msgstr ""
"\"저번에는 내가 졌다, 내가 혼자였기 때문이었지. 하지만 지금은 다르다. 그리고 그것은 달라질 것이다. 우리는 등불왕에게 굴하지 않을 "
"것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/Barks/JabberwockBark_String
msgctxt "da0526e4-166e-4f06-8bd4-347b9cf623a8"
msgid ""
"\"You have learned nothing, trespasser. And what of you, cursed "
"{mf|king|queen}? Are you ready for one final lesson?\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 아무것도 배우지 못했다, 침입자. 그리고 너는 누구인가, 저주받은 {mf|왕|여왕}? 마지막 교훈을 들을 준비는 되었나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/Barks/NyrissaBark_String
msgctxt "5bab003a-c997-4a1a-9815-259c8612b7cd"
msgid ""
"\"Is it... over? The beast that overthrew me lies breathless at our feet. "
"Come now, my spring — the Eldest awaits!\""
msgstr "\"...끝났어? 날 때려 눕힌 짐승이 우리 발치에 쓰러졌다. 이제 와라. 나의 그대여. 원로가 기다리고 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/Barks/Pond_new_String_1
msgctxt "02ab583c-f271-4919-9a8c-25a7134f630a"
msgid ""
"The pond is deep and the water cold. Though the surface is still, you can "
"hear faint whispers, like someone beneath the water is murmuring sadly to "
"themselves."
msgstr ""
"연못은 깊고 물은 찹니다. 표면은 조용하지만, 물 아래에 있는 누군가가 슬프게 불평하는 것처럼 희미한 속삭임을 들을 수 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ItemsAndActions/Platform_ActionName1_String
msgctxt "f5513c79-06bf-497b-9588-f290587cbdcc"
msgid "[Put the bones on the pedestal]"
msgstr "[제단에 뼈를 올립니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ItemsAndActions/Platform_ActionName2_String
msgctxt "368336de-af85-4c15-9dae-200648a8a019"
msgid "[Take the bird from the pedestal]"
msgstr "[제단에 놓인 새를 가져갑니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "ed2c9e0f-9e5c-41b2-bf27-61cf6c8f52d7"
msgid "\"I'd like to know more about you, Eldest.\""
msgstr "\"원로, 너에 대해 조금 더 알고 싶어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "cb17adae-80a1-41e0-8d52-68d0e2139601"
msgid "\"You were silent when we asked if the Eldest would help us...\""
msgstr "\"원로들이 우리를 도울지 물어봤을 때 너는 침묵했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "0904c8aa-a641-4cd0-b8be-c826b21a7974"
msgid "\"I have to go. So long!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "c5b0c893-a6a5-4867-ab10-e6642522fd72"
msgid "\"How can you 'refuse' a curse?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 저주를 '거절'할 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Answer_0013_Text
msgctxt "91b59a39-59b5-4701-9515-cc4d22e36d77"
msgid ""
"\"And what will happen if the curse remains with the one who created it?\""
msgstr "\"저주가 그걸 만든 사람에게 남아 있다면 어떻게 될까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "546d1e83-0d30-461e-9cac-cc7e4181b73a"
msgid "\"So your advice is to reject the curse? How will that help us?\""
msgstr "\"너의 충고는 저주를 거부하는 것이라고? 그게 어떻게 우리를 도우는 거지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "9796b4b5-204b-4c44-ab5c-2b9ff8087ab2"
msgid ""
"{n}The last of the three {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} remaining in the meadow barely "
"notices you, yet you don't feel arrogance or hostility in his silent "
"indifference.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}세 명의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g} 중 초원에 남은 마지막 사람은 당신에게 거의 관심을 주지 않습니다, 그러나 당신은 그의 "
"조용한 무관심에서 오만함이나 적개심을 느끼지 못합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : C71_Nyrissa
msgctxt "b6216e86-04f7-4841-8ffa-bf671e6b39e3"
msgid ""
"\"The lost prince is the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} of forgotten things, sadness "
"and solitude. He leaves his tower only very rarely, and meddles in the "
"affairs of the other Eldest more rarely still. All the more interesting why "
"he is here. Obviously he's come for a reason...\""
msgstr ""
"\"잃어버린 왕자는 상실, 슬픔, 고독의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}이다. 그는 아주 드물게 자신의 탑을 떠나고, 다른 원로의 일에 "
"간섭하는 일은 더더욱 없다. 그가 여기 온 이유가 더 흥미롭다. 분명히 그에게는 이유가 있다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "c1462e22-6af7-492f-b45a-57ed27efce2f"
msgid ""
"\"I'm known as the Lost Prince. The Lost Prince, a lost {mf|king|queen} — we "
"have something in common, don't we? I am not from {g|First World}the First "
"World{/g}, and am now as far from my home as you are from yours.\" {n}The "
"Prince stops, as if even this short speech exhausted him.{/n} \"I'm sorry if "
"I do not entirely satisfy your curiosity. That is not the act I seek to "
"succeed in.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 잃어버린 왕자로 알려져 있다. 잃어버린 왕자, 잃어버린 {mf|왕|여왕} — 우리는 공통점이 있다. 나는 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g} 출신이 아니다, 그리고 네가 너의 영토에서 떨어져 있듯 나의 집에서 멀리 떨어져 있다.\" {n}왕자는 마치 "
"이 짧은 말조차 피로한 것처럼 멈춥니다.{/n} \"호기심을 완전히 만족시키지 못했다면 미안하다. 그건 내가 바라는 행동이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "a74d5ed7-bc43-45a8-bce9-7277850cfedd"
msgid ""
"{n}The Prince shrugs slightly.{/n} \"A serious conversation abhors crowds. "
"As for your request... different rumors circulate among the children of {g|"
"First World}the First World{/g}. They say the Lost Prince is keen to help "
"those who've lost everything... or nearly everything. I'm afraid that what "
"I'm about to do will do nothing to quelch this ridiculous rumor. I'm going "
"to help you.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}왕자는 약간 어깨를 으쓱합니다.{/n} \"심각한 대화는 군중을 싫어한다. 너의 요청에 따라... 다른 소문이 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}의 아이들에게 돌고 있다. 그들은 잃어버린 왕자가 모든 것을 잃어버린 자들을 도우려고 한다고 말한다... "
"아니면 거의 모든 것을 잃어버린 사람을. 이 우스운 소문을 물리치기 위해 내가 아무것도 하지 않을까 두렵군. 나는 너를 도울 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "71d9381d-e536-4db4-b269-a457b575a826"
msgid ""
"{n}The Prince lifts his eyes from the ground and looks at you, then at "
"Nyrissa and back.{/n} \"You must know much about curses, or you wouldn't be "
"standing before me now. But I'd like to say: a curse is a kind of gift. One "
"party gives it, the other one accepts it. But what happens if the accepting "
"party refuses it? Then the gift will remain with the giver.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}왕자는 시선을 땅바닥에서 들어올리며 당신을 보고는 나이리사와 그 뒤를 봅니다.{/n} \"너는 저주에 대해 많이 알아야만 한다, "
"아니면 내 앞에 서 있지 않는 것이 좋다. 그러나 나는 말하고 싶다: 저주는 일종의 선물이다. 한 쪽은 그것을 주고, 다른 한 쪽은 "
"그것을 받아들인다. 하지만 받아들이는 쪽이 그것을 거절한다면? 선물은 주는 쪽에게 남을 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "3a7d8baa-c1a9-41a4-a50f-11628c94b779"
msgid ""
"\"I have no answer to this question, though I've seen it happen more than "
"once. Many things can influence the outcome. Will, faith, and the powers of "
"the curser and the cursed, are all laid onto a non-existing scale, and one "
"of them tips the balance.\n"
"Ponder this: you must have heard a mortal curse a god at least once. Mortals "
"often curse the higher powers for their troubles, foolishly calling their "
"wrath down upon them. However, such curses never have any effect on "
"{g|Lamashtu}Lamashtu{/g}, or {g|Pharasma}Pharasma{/g}, or the others. Gods "
"simply do not accept them.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 여러 번 그 일을 봤지만, 이 질문에 대해 아무런 대답도 하지 않겠다. 여러 가지 일이 결과에 영향을 줄 수 있다. 의지, "
"믿음, 저주하는 자와 받는 자의 힘은 모두 존재하지 않는 저울에 놓여있고, 하나가 바뀌면 균형이 깨진다.\n"
"깊이 생각해 봐라: 필멸자가 신을 저주했다는 말을 적어도 한 번은 들어봤을 것이다. 필멸자들은 종종 그들의 분란 때문에 강력한 자를 "
"저주하고, 멍청하게 그들의 진노를 산다. 그러나, 그러한 저주는 결코 {g|Lamashtu}라마슈투{/g}, "
"{g|Pharasma}파라즈마{/g}, 그리고 다른 신들에게 영향을 미치지 않는다. 신들은 단순히 그것을 받아들이지 않을 뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "68ea4361-cced-401d-97ad-df128d481921"
msgid ""
"\"He will be cursed.\" {n}The prince says this with the same sad "
"indifference, and yet the words sound frightening, and poignant.{/n} \"That "
"is the order of things: the more involved you are in anything, be it a feud, "
"a friendship or even the relationship between a master and a servant, the "
"more unexpectedly this bond can bind you. This is one of the reasons I "
"prefer non-intrusion and solitude. The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} would "
"also do well to put less effort into his games.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그는 저주받을 것이다.\" {n}왕자는 여전히 슬픈 무관심으로 말하지만, 그 말은 무섭고, 가슴 아프게 들립니다.{/n} \"그것은 "
"사물의 질서이다: 네가 어떤 것과 더 연관되어 있는지, 불화, 친밀함, 심지어는 주종 관계에서도, 더욱 예기치 않게 이 유대가 너를 "
"속박할 수 있다. 그래서 내가 끼어들지 않고 고독을 선호하는 이유이다. {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g} 또한 그의 게임에 더 "
"적은 노력을 기울이는 방식으로 잘한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "0b322ca2-70a4-447f-97d5-1b63237c9f79"
msgid ""
"\"Not only to reject it. To return it to the one who cursed you. Tell him "
"directly that he has no power over you, and let him choke on his own poison."
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"거절할 뿐만 아니다. 저주한 사람에게 돌려주기까지 한다. 그에게 너를 지배할 힘이 없다고 직접 말해라, 그리고 제 꾀에 넘어가도록 "
"만들어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0018_Text
#. Speaker : C71_Nyrissa
msgctxt "b7f41118-0049-4f03-9c2e-3fd9a6f7ffec"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa bows gracefully.{/n} \"Thank you, {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}. We will "
"heed your advice.\""
msgstr "{n}나이리사는 우아하게 인사합니다.{/n} \"고맙다. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}. 우리는 너의 충고를 감사히 받겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/LostPrinceDialog/Cue_0019_Text
msgctxt "75697094-0af1-432e-a616-575c920fa77e"
msgid ""
"{n}The prince nods pensively and lowers his head to the ground once more.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}왕자는 슬쩍 고개를 끄덕이고 다시 땅에 시선을 고정합니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "cf271b97-0c3c-46c0-a2f1-7bfeab1c4411"
msgid "\"The Jabberwock has been defeated, Eldest.\""
msgstr "\"재버워크는 패배했다, 원로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "a54e884d-a2a1-4830-be48-be4129905c59"
msgid "\"You mentioned a trial by fear, Eldest. What do you want from us?\""
msgstr "\"원로, 너는 두려움에 대한 시험이라고 했다. 우리에게서 무엇을 원하나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "e01ddf2c-f424-4b95-b8f6-d3b434cd64bd"
msgid "\"Goodbye!\""
msgstr "\"안녕!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "f0ed0399-d6b3-4381-96ba-5e467ee5eb00"
msgid "\"Where can we find the Jabberwock?\""
msgstr "\"재버워크를 어디서 찾을 수 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "1f362ed9-4f8a-4926-982d-915e1f78bef3"
msgid ""
"{n}The Eldest stands near the edge of the water, watching the circles on the "
"surface, the dashing waves against the shore, and the shadowy currents in "
"the depth. These things seem to tell her much more than you. As you "
"approach, the Eldest looks up for a moment. In her penetrating glance it "
"seems you see your own reflection, an endlessly branching road, a slowly "
"gathering storm. A breath — and the apparition disappears.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}원로는 물의 가장자리에 서서 표면의 파장과 해안을 향한 파도, 물 속의 조류 등을 지켜 보았습니다. 이것들이 당신보다 훨씬 더 많은 "
"것을 말하고 있는 것 같습니다. 당신이 접근하자, 원로가 잠시 바라봅니다. 그녀의 관통하는 눈빛에서 당신은 자신의 반성, 끝없이 분화되는 "
"길, 서서히 모이는 폭풍을 보았던 것 같습니다. 호흡을 하자 그 환영이 사라집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "176a8a20-694b-4feb-9f85-7d02fa51c8a4"
msgid ""
"\"Magdh is the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} of complexity, fate, and triplets. I "
"suppose we are now dealing with one of her three essences. If only we knew "
"which one...\""
msgstr ""
"\"마그드는 복잡성, 운명, 세 쌍둥이의 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}이다. 우리는 지금 그녀의 세 가지 본질 중 하나를 만나는 것 "
"같다. 우리가 어느 쪽인지만 알면...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "78aa7cd9-588f-42d9-80f2-a074eb9536de"
msgid ""
"\"Your fall, Nyrissa, began with a lost battle. The Tane "
"{d|Jabberwok}Jabberwock{/d} overthrew the self-proclaimed queen, and brought "
"her to the trial of the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}. That is why I'm "
"telling you: destroy the monster. This loop must be closed.\"\n"
"{n}Magdh speaks in a calm, measured manner, but you feel something powerful "
"in her indifference: her knowledge of everything that has happened and will "
"soon happen, and her understanding of the fundamental nature of things.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사, 너의 몰락은 너의 패배에서 시작되었다. 테인 {d|Jabberwok}재버워크{/d}는 자칭 여왕이라는 자를 전복했고, "
"그녀에게 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 시련을 겪게 했다. 그래서 괴물을 파괴하라고 말하는 것이다. 이 순환은 닫혀야만 한다."
"\"\n"
"{n}마그드는 평온하고 신중한 태도로 이야기하지만, 그녀의 무관심에서 어떤 강력한 것을 느낍니다: 과거에 일어난 모든 일과 미래에 일어날 "
"모든 일의 지식을, 그리고 그녀와 사물의 기본적 본질에 대한 그녀의 이해 말입니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "f89495db-be0c-465d-9e66-cf0ee4a9b080"
msgid ""
"\"It is well. That echo was long due killed.\n"
"I promised you a reward...\"\n"
"{n}Magdh throws her hands up into the air, and crimson gold radiance kindles "
"between them. A moment later, it forms the shape of a glimmering mask, which "
"looks like one you saw on the face of the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}.\n"
"The mask hangs still in the air, its shape frozen, as befits a mask. And yet "
"you can't shake the feeling there's a watchful, sorrowful, piercing stare "
"behind the empty eye slits, the look of a living creature.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"그렇다. 그 메아리는 오래전에 죽었다. \n"
"나는 너에게 보상을 약속했다...\" \n"
"{n}마그드는 공중에 손을 펼쳤고 그들 사이에 진홍색의 금빛이 발합니다. 잠시 후 그것은 희미한 가면 모양을 형성했고, 그것은 "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 착용하던 것과 비슷해 보였습니다. \n"
"가면은 여전히 허공에 매달려 있으며, 굳어서 가면에 걸맞는 모양이 됩니다. 그럼에도 불구하고 당신은 살아있는 생물체의 모습의 빈 눈 "
"구덩이 뒤에는 조심스럽고, 슬프고, 꿰뚫는 응시가 있다는 느낌을 떨칠 수 없습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "cc0a6bb3-98b2-4591-9140-e4d3c1a6357c"
msgid ""
"\"You must guess what it is. The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} loves "
"masks. Since ancient times he's wandered the planes, assuming the forms of "
"the most unique and unusual creatures. But his own masks are something more. "
"Each of them holds a fraction of his essence.\"\n"
"{n}Magdh's voice becomes dull, as if she is sinking into memory.{/n}\n"
"\"He made this mask long ago, when he was young, as was all {g|First World}"
"the First World{/g}. And, as with many early creations, its author "
"disapproved of it. It betrayed too much compassion, a quality that annoyed "
"the young demigod.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그것이 무엇인지 알겠지. {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 가면을 좋아한다. 옛날부터 그는 가장 독특하고 특이한 생물체의 "
"형태를 취하며 차원들을 배회했다. 그러나 그가 가진 가면에는 무언가가 더 있다. 그들 각각은 그의 본질 일부분을 가지고 있다.\" \n"
"{n}마그드의 목소리는 기억 속에 빠져들 듯이 둔해집니다.{/n}\n"
"\"그는 오래 전에, {g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 초기였던 어린 시절에 이 가면을 만들었다. 그리고 많은 초기 창조물과 "
"마찬가지로, 그것의 창조자는 못마땅해 했다. 그것은 과도한 기대감을 배신했다, 젊은 반신을 화나게 할 정도로 수준 낮았지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "e3f6ef2a-4983-4d58-a964-b6e3312ff956"
msgid ""
"\"Return to me when you have completed the task. I will give you something "
"priceless in exchange — something that can be turned into a terrible weapon "
"against the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}. And if you cannot defeat the "
"monster... then you don't deserve a better fate than the one that the curse "
"promises you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그 일을 끝내면 나에게 돌아와라. 나는 대가로 귀중한 무언가를 주겠다. 그것은 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}에 대항할 "
"무서운 무기가 될 수 있다. 그리고 그 괴물을 물리칠 수 없다면... 저주에 처하는 운명을 벗어나지 못할 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "f062d1d5-fa26-4da1-bdf5-d7a2804e120e"
msgid ""
"\"I summoned the Tane. He will be waiting for you to the south. But be "
"careful, a true Jabberwock is nothing like Nyrissa's pets which you defeated "
"near the Castle of Knives.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 테인을 소환했다. 그는 남쪽에서 너를 기다리고 있을 것이다. 하지만 조심해라. 진짜 재버워크는 네가 칼날의 성에서 물리친 "
"나이리사의 애완 동물처럼 약하지 않다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "2392827b-b4f0-4f8c-bb4e-f05a2086ae6b"
msgid ""
"{n}Magdh nods goodbye to you, and returns to contemplate the circles on the "
"water.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}마그드는 당신에게 작별 인사를 하고, 다시 물의 파장을 보며 깊은 생각에 빠집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaProjection
msgctxt "5cce1fff-af1e-48a5-b6e7-cab2a03c1c61"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa shivers.{/n} \"You ask much, Eldest. To choose between dying from "
"a curse and dying in the claws of a monster. But I believe that what I "
"couldn't do alone, might be possible for two.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 떨었습니다.{/n} \"너는 많은 것을 요구했다, 원로. 저주로 죽는 것과 괴물의 발톱으로 죽는 것 중 하나를 "
"선택하라니. 하지만 내가 홀로 할 수 없었던 것은, 둘이라면 가능할 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaProjection
msgctxt "2d82c12a-3ca8-4523-aebc-d5c36d44bfe5"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa turns to you. Her eyes are shining.{/n} \"We've received more "
"than I could have hoped for. Remember when we spoke of Vordakai? He put a "
"part of his essence into his own name, and the {g|LanternKing}Lantern "
"King{/g} put a fraction of himself into his masks. It is similar to what he "
"did to me, taking a part of my soul and turning it into Briar.\n"
"The Lantern King is much more vulnerable now that we have a grain of his "
"essence. I will find a way to take advantage of this!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사가 당신에게 돌아섭니다. 그리고 그녀의 눈이 반짝입니다.{/n} \"우린 내가 바랬던 것보다 더 많은 것을 받았어. "
"보다카이에 대해 나눴던 말들을 기억해? 보다카이는 자기 본질의 일부를 스스로의 이름에 넣었고 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 "
"보다카이의 가면에 자신의 편린을 선사했어. 내 영혼의 일부를 찔레 속에 넣었던 것과 유사한 일이야.\n"
"우리가 등불왕의 정수 일부를 가지고 있기 때문에, 등불왕은 더욱 취약한 상태야. 나는 이걸 이용할 방법을 찾도록 하지!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/MagdhDialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "5b336b22-3840-4eb4-be00-0d73d4178607"
msgid ""
"\"The {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} threw out the mask and forgot about "
"it, thinking it vanished without a trace. But he wasn't the only "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} susceptible to the vices of youth. Curiosity was my "
"vice. I found the mask and preserved it, hiding it from everyone. And today "
"I'm giving you this ancient treasure.\n"
"Come, Nyrissa. You suffered the first blow. You should be given a chance to "
"strike back. My job here is done. Farewell!\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}은 가면을 버리고는 그것에 대해 잊어 버렸고, 그것이 흔적도 없이 사라졌다고 생각했다. 그러나 "
"그는 젊은 날에 많은 악행을 저지른 유일한 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 아니었다. 호기심은 나의 악덕이었다. 나는 그 가면을 발견하고 "
"보존하여 모든 사람들로부터 숨겼다. 그리고 오늘 나는 이 고대의 보물을 주겠다.\n"
"이리 와라, 나이리사. 너는 선제 공격을 당했었다. 너에게는 반격할 기회가 주어져야 한다. 여기서 내가 할 일은 끝났다. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "3f30e29c-81fb-4b5a-9c91-53763ec29a33"
msgid ""
"[Give the bird to Nyrissa] \"This is the final link in Shyka's riddle.\""
msgstr "[그 새를 나이리사에게 줍니다] \"이것은 샤이카의 수수께끼의 마지막 단서이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "c2d3724f-bf23-45fa-b705-59d453aa9fe8"
msgid "\"Is it even possible? To defeat an Eldest in battle?\""
msgstr "\"가능한 일인가? 원로와 싸워서 이기는 것이?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "cc7a4f01-ba92-41ee-bfd2-f649d7e03e33"
msgid "\"I see. Thanks for the advice.\""
msgstr "\"알겠다. 조언해 주어 고맙다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "126b5115-8f4b-4d9d-b482-682dd68cc65a"
msgid "\"We've heard from the three Eldest. What now?\""
msgstr "\"우리는 세 원로의 말을 들었다. 이제 뭘 하지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "154ac69d-a077-4c94-9c98-ce21da2f2b6e"
msgid "\"You wanted to talk...\""
msgstr "\"너는 얘기하고 싶었었지...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0016_Text
msgctxt "9e15e212-8063-42c4-87b3-fc95d9cca9e7"
msgid "\"Tell me, what are you going to do?\""
msgstr "\"말해봐. 너는 무엇을 할 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0020_Text
msgctxt "7b5d01db-c179-4cc5-b10c-2aecc5e64096"
msgid "\"All right. There must be a quiet nook here somewhere.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 여기 어딘가에 조용한 구석이 있을거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "06930b9a-6dc7-4067-8825-2daff72e03da"
msgid "\"Not now. I'll return to you later.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 아니야, 나중에 너에게 돌아갈 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0026_Text
msgctxt "5248802b-7f62-4505-9079-d63fb4141962"
msgid ""
"\"Be sure. After everything we've been through, nothing is going to stop us."
"\""
msgstr "\"믿어도 된다. 우리는 모든 일을 극복했고, 아무것도 우리를 막을 수 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "d201b704-ccc1-403a-b174-3ba752a6d598"
msgid "\"I see no point in guessing. We will fight, come what may.\""
msgstr "\"의심의 여지가 없다. 무엇이든 우리는 싸울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0030_Text
msgctxt "fc73aa99-0be0-4244-ad42-921413faabe1"
msgid ""
"\"Of course. I'm ready to share an hour with you — or the whole of eternity."
"\""
msgstr "\"물론이다. 나는 너와 시간을 — 또는 영원을 공유할 준비가 되어있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0031_Text
msgctxt "1aac98a6-65b3-4383-8d26-11b6893b9acb"
msgid "\"It's not a good time. We need to concentrate on other things.\""
msgstr "\"좋은 시간이 아니다. 우리는 다른 일에 집중해야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0033_Text
msgctxt "bf670476-e158-4c34-9daa-6a1574ce08b7"
msgid "\"I'll continue my journey.\""
msgstr "\"나는 내 여행을 계속할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Answer_0035_Text
msgctxt "203d8853-bd6c-4451-acbe-ee62bca1df01"
msgid "\"How can I help?\""
msgstr "\"어떻게 도와줄까?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "6e9d8161-6474-44ce-a411-49cf2de38939"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa shivers as if she's cold.{/n} \"Forgive me for leaving you there, "
"in the city. I was afraid the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} would take me "
"by force. When I've finally begun to discover the thread you pointed me "
"towards — how to fight the curse...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 마치 추위에 떠는 듯 떨고 있습니다.{/n} \"도시에서 너를 떠나서 미안해. 나는 "
"{g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 강제로 나를 데려갈까 두려웠어. 내가 마침내, 어떻게 저주와 싸울 수 있는지에 대해 네가 "
"짚어준 단서를 발견하기 시작했을 때 말이야...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "6a2e8696-26b8-4a1c-a48f-359aae493ca2"
msgid ""
"\"A bird... I recognize it. The songbirds of the Thousandbreaths were once "
"famous throughout the entire {g|First World}First World{/g}. I haven't heard "
"them sing for such a long time...\" {n}Nyrissa carefully strokes the bird's "
"shining feathers, and then lets it fly with a graceful gesture.{/n} \"Fly "
"and sing, light your wings. Fly and sing!\""
msgstr ""
"\"새... 기억나. 천 개의 숨결의 명금들은 한 때 {g|First World}태초 세계{/g} 전체에서 유명했어. 나는 오랫동안 "
"그들이 노래하는 것을 듣지 못했어...\" {n}나이리사는 조심스럽게 새의 빛나는 깃털을 쓰다듬고 우아한 몸짓으로 날 수 있게 "
"돕습니다.{/n} \"날고 노래해라, 날개짓을 하거라. 날면서 노래해라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "b3d5a06f-6e7f-4f3b-9212-8b28d0b900e6"
msgid ""
"\"Well, children. Did you like this little journey? The poisoned pond "
"becomes clear and sparkling, and bones turn into a songbird. We look to the "
"past to see the future.\""
msgstr ""
"\"음, 아이야. 이 작은 여정이 즐거웠니? 독이 든 연못은 맑아지고 반짝이고, 뼈는 노래하는 새가 되었다. 우리는 미래를 보기 위해 "
"과거를 보았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "514fdbc8-429e-4365-a141-529d24b0a848"
msgid ""
"\"But let us not waste time. You've planned something very daring — to turn "
"his curse against our self-confident brother, the {g|LanternKing}Lantern "
"King{/g}. But we {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} have been cursed more than once, and "
"more than a thousand times — and as you see, we are untroubled and "
"unconvinced.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그러나 시간을 낭비하지 말아라. 너는 대담한 무언가를 계획했다 — 자존심 강한 우리 형제인 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 "
"저주를 되돌리기 위해서 말이다. 하지만 우리 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}들은 한 번 이상, 천 번 이상의 저주를 받았었다 — 그리고 "
"너도 알다시피, 우리는 영향 받지 않고 설득 당하지 않았다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : C71_ShykaTheMany
msgctxt "f6dd0b96-903c-4438-af16-9901e947cb8c"
msgid ""
"\"We shall tell you this. Most who stumble and fall are entirely sure of "
"themselves the instant before. Thus we tell you — if you wish to curse an "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, do it the moment he falls, the instant that he's lost "
"his footing, and before he regains his balance.\n"
"The surest moment for this is when the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} is "
"defeated in battle.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 이것을 말해줄 수 있다. 비틀거리다 넘어지는 대부분의 사람들은 넘어지기 직전의 순간에는 확신한다. 그러니 우리가 말한다 — "
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}를 저주하려면, 그가 넘어지는 순간, 그가 자신의 발판을 잃는 순간에, 그리고 그가 균형을 회복하기 전에 "
"해라. \n"
"이를 할 수 있는 가장 확실한 순간은 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 전투에서 패배했을 때이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : C71_ShykaTheMany
msgctxt "8a8e9d31-f07d-4777-b070-7e04a3571a0d"
msgid ""
"\"No one is invincible, children. I know it sounds a bit too simple. Defeat "
"a god, then curse him while he's baffled about how you managed to do it! "
"Nonetheless, it's possible. Not to kill an {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} once and for "
"all — but to defeat him for a moment.\""
msgstr ""
"\"누구도 무적이 아니란다, 아이야. 너무 단순하게 들리는 것은 안다. 신을 쓰러뜨리고, 그가 전투에 져서 헐떡일 때 저주를 하라니! "
"그렇다 해도, 가능하다. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}를 영원히 죽이는게 아니라, 잠시 쓰러뜨리는 것뿐이라면.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : C71_ShykaTheMany
msgctxt "97071ee9-8d6f-4d92-bc3a-25adc4172a13"
msgid ""
"\"Most importantly, don't develop a taste for it. Besting one "
"{g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} is enough for a lifetime.\""
msgstr "\"가장 중요한 것은, 그것에 취미를 들이지 마라. {g|Eldest}원로{/g}를 이기는 것은 일생에 한 번으로 충분하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "b285fa9b-b70a-4156-97ad-822d023ea9b5"
msgid "\"We near our purpose. I want to believe all this wasn't in vain...\""
msgstr "\"우리 목적에 가까이 왔다. 나는 이 모든 것이 헛된 일이 아니라고 믿어...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "9bdea605-0a44-495a-b5b1-98aa7f24f311"
msgid ""
"\"I feel the bond between us and the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}, like "
"it's a real thing. He thinks it's harness and reins for misbehaving horses. "
"But I see it as a double-edged sword. And if we manage to get close enough, "
"and defeat him as {g|Shyka}Shyka{/g} said, then we will turn this blade "
"against the one who created it.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 우리와 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g} 사이의 유대감을 진짜처럼 느낀다. 그는 그것을 말도 못 부리는 말고삐라 "
"생각한다. 그러나 나는 그것을 양날의 칼로 본다. 그리고 우리가 충분히 가까이 가서, {g|Shyka}샤이카{/g}가 말했 듯 그를 "
"패배시키면, 우리는 이 칼을 겨누었던 사람에게 겨눌 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "1fde67d8-6371-40f0-a799-146a463b5a31"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks thoughtful, and a little sad.{/n} \"Our mission here is "
"over. But before we go on... I'd like to talk in private. Will you spare "
"some time for me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 생각에 잠겼으며, 약간 슬퍼보입니다.{/n} \"우리의 사명은 끝났다. 계속하기 전에... 나는 개인적으로 이야기하고 "
"싶다. 시간을 내줄 의향이 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0022_Text
msgctxt "8a439b40-ec1b-41b1-b788-b19e31a801e1"
msgid "\"All right. I'll wait.\""
msgstr "\"좋아. 기다릴게.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0023_Text
msgctxt "1bebca93-49ed-4565-adab-a30fbc119042"
msgid ""
"{n}You transport to a quiet meadow. Nyrissa stands quietly for a while, "
"staring off into the distance and gathering her thoughts.{/n} \"The words of "
"the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} may seem whimsical or even senseless, but I think I "
"understood them. I've been cursed for a thousand years, and my memory of it "
"is like a stinging poison. It hurts, but it also allows me to see what was "
"hidden.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 조용한 초원으로 이동합니다. 나이리사는 잠시 동안 조용히 서서 먼 거리를 응시하고 생각을 모읍니다.{/n} \""
"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}의 말은 기발하거나 심지어 무의미해 보일 수도 있지만, 나는 그것들을 이해했다. 나는 천 년 동안 저주를 "
"받았고, 내 기억은 찌르는 독과 같다. 아프지만 거기에 숨겨진 것이 무엇인지를 알 수 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0024_Text
msgctxt "c0fe91d3-5921-44d4-b4e0-bc748a8d927b"
msgid ""
"{n}The nymph finally turns around and looks you in the eye.{/n} \"Over the "
"ages that passed since the curse was placed upon my shoulders, I've almost "
"forgotten how it feels — to fear for someone other than myself. The first "
"spring flowers that break through the icy earth and frigid snow — they "
"always have the hardest time. The suffering of their journey and bravery of "
"their aspiration — that's what I feel. Will we survive what the future "
"holds? Will we survive it together?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}님프는 마침내 돌아서서 당신을 눈을 봅니다.{/n} \"저주가 나를 짓누른 지 수 세기가 지났어, 나는 자신이 아닌 다른 사람을 "
"두려워하는 느낌을 거의 잊어버렸다. 얼어붙은 땅과 차가운 눈을 뚫는 첫 번째 봄 꽃은 항상 가장 힘든 시기를 겪지. 여행의 고통과 포부를 "
"용감히 느끼는 것 — 그것이 내가 느끼는 것이다. 우리는 미래에 살아남을 수 있을까? 함께 살아남을 수 있을까? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0028_Text
msgctxt "103c9b98-1c39-4584-bc3d-cda714b52159"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa nods, to your words or her own thoughts.{/n} \"Then let's not "
"wait for tomorrow. Let us seize the moment — the final hour before the "
"storm. Let's share it together, and everything that awaits us.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 당신의말 인지 자신의 생각인지 모르지만 고개를 끄덕입니다.{/n} \"그러면 내일까지 기다리지 말자. 폭풍이 터지기 전의 "
"마지막 순간을 포착하자. 우리를 기다리고 있는 모든 것을 함께 나누자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0032_Text
msgctxt "fed177e9-5bcf-4a54-a0f5-2afd8df8bc87"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa exhales.{/n} \"As you wish. Then look for me at the camp near the "
"capital. I'll await you there and prepare for the coming battle.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 숨을 내뱉습니다.{/n} \"네가 원하는대로. 수도 근처의 야영지에서 나를 찾아라. 나는 거기에서 기다리고 오는 전투에 "
"대비할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0034_Text
msgctxt "3a9ff3e1-243d-4919-8f88-b295d5ddeae5"
msgid ""
"\"I repeated your words over and over to myself. Everything you told me "
"about the curses. My heart tells me that we're on the right track. But we "
"still don't know enough to challenge such an adversary as the {g|LanternKing}"
"Lantern King{/g}.\n"
"I was hoping the other {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} would help, and recommend some "
"sort of plan. The powers of {g|First World}the First World{/g} are not very "
"friendly towards each other, so we have to at least try.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 너의 말을 계속해서 반복했다. 저주에 대해 나에게 말해준 모든 것을 말이다. 내 마음은 우리가 옳은 길을 가고 있다고 말한다. "
"그러나 우리는 여전히 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}과 같은 적과 싸울 만큼 충분히 알지 못한다.\n"
"나는 다른 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 도움이 될 것이고, 일종의 계획을 추천할 것이란 희망을 품고 있었다. {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}의 강자들은 서로에게 매우 친절하지 않다, 때문에 적어도 시도는 해봐야 한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0036_Text
msgctxt "89f36fa4-a2cf-44e8-b709-c0083465d2a0"
msgid ""
"\"We need to talk to them, all three of them, and do whatever they require, "
"to secure their aid. I'm asking you to do it. I wish to stay in this place "
"for a while... to remember the hour of my curse. But if need be, I will send "
"my visions to you.\""
msgstr ""
"\"우리는 그들 모두와 대화를 하고, 도움을 받기 위해 그들의 요구는 무엇이든 할 필요가 있다. 나는 네가 해줄 것을 요청하고 있다. "
"나는 잠시 동안 이 장소에 머물고 싶다... 저주받았던 시간을 기억하고 싶다. 그러나 필요하다면, 너에게 나의 예지력을 보내겠다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/NyrissaDialog/Cue_0037_Text
msgctxt "3183a6d5-570d-4526-a339-8d97f6e17860"
msgid "{n}The nymph nods and sinks into thought.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}님프는 고개를 끄덕이고 생각에 잠깁니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/PondDialog/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "952b5101-a94a-4d73-a3df-165c002386ec"
msgid ""
"[Pour water from the vessel into the pond] \"This is also a part of the "
"riddle. About fear poisoning the soul with despair.\""
msgstr "[병에 찬 물을 웅덩이에 쏟습니다] \"이것은 또한 수수께끼의 한 부분이다. 두려움은 절망에 빠진 영혼을 중독시킨다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/PondDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6cf2de0b-94b1-4ae8-9614-cd91bf50e63a"
msgid ""
"\"It was part of the riddle of the Lantern King — to poison the pond, that "
"is 'to poison the soul with despair'.\""
msgstr "\"그것은 등불왕의 수수께끼의 일부였다. 연못에 독을 뿌리는 것. 그것은 '영혼을 절망에 빠뜨리는 것'이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/PondDialog/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "c094daef-e630-4597-8a45-5544194f59d1"
msgid "[Leave]"
msgstr "[떠납니다]"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/PondDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "d976a063-0162-45e9-bfcd-4b14b1b435b5"
msgid ""
"{n}Ghostly Nyrissa stands at the edge of the water.{/n} \"This place... I "
"remember it so well. Here I wept over my defeat — after my judgment, after "
"the curse... But everything has changed! The pond seems poisoned...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 유령처럼 물 가장자리에 서 있습니다.{/n} \"이 곳... 나는 아주 잘 기억하고 있다. 이곳에서 패배의 눈물을 "
"흘렸었지, 판결 이후에, 저주 이후에... 하지만 모든 것이 바뀌었다. 연못이 중독된 것 같아...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/PondDialog/Cue_0006_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaProjection
msgctxt "d4d4f018-d0b1-4d64-ad8f-0a63a2639e4a"
msgid ""
"{n}A soft smile touches Nyrissa's lips.{/n} \"I treasure the gift I received "
"from you. — Hope for the better, faith in the future. It's more powerful "
"than any despair.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}부드러운 미소를 나이리사는 입술에 머금습니다.{/n} \"나는 네게서 받은 선물을 소중하게 생각한다. 앞으로 나아갈 희망, 미래에 "
"대한 믿음. 어떤 절망보다도 강력하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/PondDialog/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "dbf5765c-9f84-4115-bd24-37b104213cea"
msgid ""
"{n}In response to your actions and the nymph's words, the water in the pond "
"boils for a moment, then calms down and clears, cleansed of all poison. A "
"set of bird bones materializes in your hands.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신의 행동과 님프의 말에 따라 연못의 물은 잠시동안 끓고 진정되고는 모든 독이 정화됩니다. 새의 뼈 한줌이 당신의 손에 "
"놓여집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/PondDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaProjection
msgctxt "5ec44dd5-6e97-4ac6-8ff9-066898ddde3b"
msgid ""
"\"I'm surprised at how carefully the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g} watched me, and "
"how deeply into my soul he looked. What did he hope to achieve? Just an "
"elaborate performance? Riddles, just riddles...\""
msgstr ""
"\"{g|Eldest}원로{/g}가 얼마나 조심스럽게 나를 지켜봤는지, 또 얼마나 내 영혼 깊은 곳까지 들여다 봤는지 놀라울 따름이야. "
"도대체 그는 뭘 하고 싶었던 걸까? 그냥 정교한 공연인가? 알 수가 없어, 수수께끼로군... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "6c653c3f-83f6-4fe4-9e55-6b229439fb32"
msgid ""
"\"Shyka loves riddles, and I solved one on this very spot once. The final "
"step was waking the wrath of the Everblooming Flower.\""
msgstr ""
"\"샤이카는 수수께끼를 사랑하고, 나는 이 자리에서 수수께끼를 한 번 풀었었지. 마지막 단계는 영원히 피는 꽃의 진노를 깨우는 것이었다."
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "e260cc64-0f84-4713-9df1-c9f5b2f65498"
msgid ""
"\"Once the {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g} told me your story through a "
"riddle. I think Shyka expects that we look at our mistakes, rather than "
"demonstrate our intelligence.\""
msgstr ""
"\"언젠가 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}이 수수께끼를 통해 너에 관한 이야기를 들려줬었다. 나는 샤이카가 우리의 지식을 알고 "
"싶기보다는, 우리가 실수를 들여다보길 기대한다고 생각한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "4823065b-a2d4-4e90-a5c0-94c73d856054"
msgid ""
"\"Let's not tarry, children. We're ready to spoil the {g|LanternKing}Lantern "
"King's{/g} celebration. But the aid of the {g|Eldest}Eldest{/g}, like their "
"wrath, must be earned.\""
msgstr ""
"\"지체하지 말자. 우리는 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 축하연을 망칠 준비가 되었다. 그러나 {g|Eldest}원로{/g}"
"의 도움은 그들의 진노처럼 반드시 구해야 하지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "5dbd4f96-79b0-40cf-aa4f-c040f841c4da"
msgid ""
"\"I want you to do one simple thing. A trifle, one could say. You must go "
"back in time. From the estuary to the source. From the end to the beginning. "
"You have both traveled this way once. It won't be so hard to do it again in "
"the opposite direction. We'll even help you by pointing out where to start. "
"A flower is the end. Move to the beginning!\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 네가 한 가지 간단한 일을 하기를 바란다. 사소한 것이다. 시간을 거슬러 올라갈 필요가 있다. 강어귀에서 근원까지. 처음부터 "
"끝까지. 너희 둘 모두 이 길을 한 번 걸었었다. 반대 방향으로 돌아가는 것은 어렵지 않을 것이다. 시작하는 곳을 알려주어 너를 도울 "
"것이다. 꽃은 끝이다. 처음으로 가라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaProjection
msgctxt "5630d8d9-9e27-4867-a942-4c258c03d675"
msgid "{n}Nyrissa frowns.{/n} \"Go back in time? I don't understand...\""
msgstr "{n}나이리사 싫은 내색을 보입니다.{/n} \"시간을 거슬러? 이해가 안돼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Cue_0008_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaProjection
msgctxt "17d957cb-3426-4073-8e96-ef4d32892449"
msgid ""
"\"Oh, I see... So it's not just about a task or a riddle. Once I heard the "
"Many call the past a beast, capable of devouring a soul. Now they want me to "
"look this monster in the eye.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아. 알았어... 그건 단지 어떤 일이나 수수께끼에 관한 것이 아니야.샤이카가 과거를 영혼을 삼킬 능력이 있는 짐승이라 불렀다고 "
"들었어. 이제 그들은 이 괴물을 직접 눈으로 보길 원한다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaProjection
msgctxt "bdf343e5-ec4c-405c-8cb2-b171a7168c31"
msgid ""
"{n}Nyrissa looks at the Flower.{/n} \"Here I vowed that no one will ever see "
"my tears again. Here I planted a seed of wrath that grew a thousand deaths. "
"Well, hear my new vow, the First of the Worlds. Wrath has no more power over "
"me. If I do turn it into a weapon, it will be against the one who cursed me, "
"and condemned me to such an evil fate!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}나이리사는 '꽃'을 봅니다.{/n} \"여기에서 나는 누구도 내 눈물을 다시 볼 수 없을 거라고 단언했다. 여기에 나는 천 명의 "
"죽음을 키울 분노의 씨앗을 심었다. 내 첫 선언을 들어라. 태초 세계여. 분노는 나를 어쩌지 못한다. 그것을 무기로 바꾸면 나를 저주하고 "
"그런 나쁜 운명을 저지른 자에게 대적하는 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : Tristian_Companion
msgctxt "d2aa5eb0-839c-4a91-a72e-92ef2a2581b9"
msgid ""
"{n}Tristian's unseeing eyes are fixed on the Everblooming Flower.{/n} \"The "
"past can truly be a monster. Where else can we meet its ominous shadow...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트리스티안의 멀어버린 눈은 영원히 피는 꽃에 고정되어 있습니다.{/n} \"과거는 정말로 괴물일 수 있다. 우리는 그러한 불길한 "
"그림자를 어디에서 만날 수 있을까...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/SilverstepGrottoFW/ShykaSilverstepDialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : C71_NyrissaProjection
msgctxt "f361f895-aa0b-44cc-a2f9-435868ea9af0"
msgid ""
"{n}The scintillations around the flower fade away. With them fade the faint "
"feeling of anxiety, and the meadow begins to seem more like a calm and quiet "
"nook. What's even more amazing — right in your hands, a vessel of dark fluid "
"materializes.{/n} \"Look! This must be the next step in the riddle. You've "
"solved it before. Tell me if you know what to do next!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}꽃 주변의 번쩍임이 사라집니다. 그들과 함께 희미한 불안감이 사라지며 초원은 조용해지고 조용하고 차분한 장소로 보이기 시작합니다. "
"더 놀라운 것은... 바로 당신의 손에는 어두운 액체의 용기가 나타납니다.{/n} \"봐! 이건 수수께끼의 다음 단계 일거야. 네가 전에 "
"해결했었지. 다음에 해야 할 일이 있다면 말해봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/BanditsBattleStart_String
msgctxt "142320f3-968d-428b-930d-3516ebdede92"
msgid "\"Aren't you tired of living? We could help with that!\""
msgstr "\"사는 것이 지쳤나? 우리는 죽음을 도울 수 있다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/GuardBark_AfterBattle_String
msgctxt "5de8fee6-2dab-4c4e-b71a-0704de3341ad"
msgid ""
"\"Nice timing, Your Highness! I don't think we could have defended the "
"trading post without you!\""
msgstr "\"전하, 좋은 타이밍입니다! 저희는 당신 없이 무역소를 지킬 수는 없을거라 생각했어요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/GuardBark_BeforeBattle_String
msgctxt "2cb44486-806e-41c4-872e-960c16185a24"
msgid "\"The shadows! They're coming!\""
msgstr "\"그림자! 그들이 오고 있어!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/GuardBark_KingReturn2_String
msgctxt "a42e5429-952a-4755-8ea3-13f34534baa7"
msgid "\"The {mf|king|queen}'s alive! I told you!\""
msgstr "\"{mf|왕|여왕}은 살아있어! 내가 말했지! \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/GuardBark_KingReturn_String
msgctxt "5e3f33c1-aa77-4b59-8f4a-a66288e5c900"
msgid "\"Look! Look!\""
msgstr "\"봐! 봐!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/Oleg_bark_after_String
msgctxt "d65ac10b-52ad-4dc7-9acc-843985a55903"
msgid ""
"\"For now everything is quiet, Your Highness. Can't see any of these "
"creatures.\""
msgstr "\"지금은 모든 것이 조용합니다, 전하. 이 생물들을 여기서 볼 수 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/StagLord_Reinforcement_bark_String
msgctxt "abd5b0e1-c16d-4798-bb33-8feafc2c1334"
msgid "\"Reinforcements! Where are you, for daemon's sake?!\""
msgstr "\"증원군! 어디 있어? 제기랄!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/StagLord_Reinforcement_bark_String_1
msgctxt "f114ebe0-1f6b-468a-9b45-494cdc58602f"
msgid "\"Reinforcements! Where are you, for daemon's sake?!\""
msgstr "\"증원군! 어디 있어? 제기랄!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/Svetlana_bark_KressleAlive_String
msgctxt "a1756a11-d8c8-4c3b-8f86-6585ce66fc85"
msgid ""
"\"It's good my sister was away when all this started. On the other hand, I'm "
"worried about her...\""
msgstr "\"이 모든 일이 시작되면 여동생이 멀리 떨어져 있는 것이 좋아. 다른 한편으로 그녀가 걱정된다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/Barks/Svetlana_bark_String
msgctxt "7c6eceab-0a7a-4ddf-af42-46b1081a14db"
msgid ""
"\"I'm so glad you've returned! A land without a {mf|king|queen} is like a "
"house without a roof.\""
msgstr "\"네가 돌아와 기쁘다! {mf|왕|여왕} 없는 땅은 지붕이 없는 집 같아. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "0e5127ca-8634-4ac7-828e-efc9f3af50e7"
msgid "\"What's going on here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하는 거야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a090cc9f-e547-4156-8e09-b4a113aa4d95"
msgid ""
"\"I'm here to help. Whoever is attacking you, they're as good as dead.\""
msgstr "\"돕기 위해 왔다. 너를 공격하는 사람은 누구나 죽은 사람이나 다름없지.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "ccf41e81-95fb-47b4-93d6-d2f662b67847"
msgid ""
"\"It's time for soldiers to return to the capital, their place is on the "
"front lines.\""
msgstr "\"군인들이 수도로 돌아갈 때가 되었고 그들의 위치는 최전방에 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "6160de28-c7e2-45bd-954e-a6555266c903"
msgid "\"Oleg, how are you holding up? Staying brave?\""
msgstr "\"올렉. 어떻게 버티고 있나? 용감하게 지키는 중인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0001_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_Kesten
msgctxt "5b5c9bfe-80f1-4020-a72b-de2db087a920"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness!\" {n}Kesten looks mortally tired, but his usually gloomy "
"face is bright with joy.{/n} \"I knew you would return. And right on time "
"too!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하!\" {n}케스턴은 몹시 피곤해 보입니다. 그러나 그의 우울한 얼굴은 기쁨으로 밝습니다.{/n} \"당신이 돌아올 줄 "
"알았습니다. 그리고 딱 적절한 시간입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0002_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_Jhod
msgctxt "95d399f3-7880-4370-a307-e2392ff97fa0"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness, at last!\" {n}Jhod is obviously glad to see you, but "
"assumes a stern look.{/n} \"They're running wild here without you! I tried "
"to talk sense into them, but it's exhausting! Some scatter, others try to "
"act like heroes. There's no order at all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하, 오셨군요!\" {n}조드는 분명히 당신을보고 기뻐하지만 엄격한 모습으로 가장합니다.{/n} \"그들은 당신이 없을 때 미친듯이 "
"난폭하게 굴었습니다! 저는 그들과 대화를 하려 했지만 쉽지 않더군요! 몇몇은 흩어지고, 다른 사람들은 영웅처럼 행동하려고 합니다. 전혀 "
"질서가 없습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0005_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_OlegLeveton
msgctxt "a5b71847-af64-4a1c-9546-4e4fdc16b695"
msgid ""
"\"Everything is worse that it might seem, Your Highness.\" {n}A gloomy Oleg "
"joins the conversation.{/n} \"Bandits are preparing to raid us! Just like "
"the good old times — to hell with them! If only they were ordinary bandits — "
"but no, it's evil spirits coming from the mist, and then fading away like "
"mist when you kill them. There hasn't been a single day without an attack.\""
msgstr ""
"\"보이는 모든 것이 나쁩니다.\" {n}우울한 올렉이 대화에 참여합니다.{/n} \"도적 떼가 저희를 습격하려고 준비 중이죠! 때를 "
"만난 물고기 처럼. 엉망이 되었습니다! 보통의 산적이라면 좋겠지만, 아니요, 그들은 안개에서 나오는 악령이며 죽일 때 안개처럼 "
"사라집니다. 공격이 없는 날은 하루도 없었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0007_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_OlegLeveton
msgctxt "e566435e-f01e-41ba-a6d8-3571a6ab3bbe"
msgid ""
"{n}Oleg catches his breath.{/n} \"I guess we've fought them off. Your "
"Highness, the fight seems to have done you good. Forgive my frankness, but "
"when you got here you were looking like the grave. But now you seem all "
"right.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}올렉은 그의 호흡을 잠시 고릅니다.{/n} \"우리가 그들을 물리친 것 같습니다. 전하, 싸움 때문에 고생 좀 하신 것 같군요. "
"솔직해서 죄송하지만, 당신이 여기 오셨을 때 무덤에서 일어난 시체인 줄 알았습니다. 하지만 지금은 괜찮아 보이네요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "e7adea41-ac82-4916-9f04-22090a8c04c0"
msgid ""
"{n}You do feel a surge of energy. Your curse hurts you and your followers "
"more, the more trouble haunts your kingdom. You've lessened its power by "
"restoring peace at the {g|Oleg's Trading Post}trading post{/g} and "
"environs.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}당신은 에너지의 파동을 분명히 느낍니다. 저주가 당신과 추종자를 더 고통스럽게 하면서 왕국에 문제가 더 많이 생깁니다. 당신은 {g|"
"Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g} 및 주변에서 평온을 회복시킴으로써 그 힘을 약화시켰습니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_Kesten
msgctxt "59a215d7-59b1-4fa9-abcc-1b817c005de5"
msgid ""
"\"We won't have to wait. — There they are! All right, Your Highness. "
"Together we'll burn the tails off these vermin!\""
msgstr "\"기다릴 필요가 없었군요. — 저기에 있습니다! 좋아. 전하, 함께 이 해충의 꼬리를 태우시죠!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_Jhod
msgctxt "8282bee1-3654-4819-b8b1-0924a1bd9f25"
msgid ""
"\"Without a doubt! Speaking of which, there they are, Your Highness. It's "
"all right, it's not the first time we've faced wrongdoers!\""
msgstr ""
"\"의심의 여지가 없군! 그래서 말인데, 그들이 저기 있습니다. 전하, 괜찮습니다. 저희가 범법자들과 처음으로 마주 친 것은 아니니까요!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_Jhod
msgctxt "9828f84e-6670-4632-bc2a-5b2477a4a346"
msgid ""
"\"To the capital it is, then. I'll keep an eye on these simpletons. They'll "
"get there safe and sound!\""
msgstr "\"그렇다면, 수도로 가겠습니다. 저는 이 얼간이들을 주시하겠습니다. 그들은 안전하고 건강하게 도착할 것입니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_Kesten
msgctxt "269328af-5b76-40a6-b25b-20146c45aaf8"
msgid ""
"\"Will do, Your Highness! I'll get your guard there safe and sound. We'll "
"stand ready for your orders.\""
msgstr "\"예, 전하! 저는 당신의 경비대를 안전하고 건강하게 데려가겠습니다. 명령만 내려주십시오.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_OlegLeveton
msgctxt "8aaaee8a-d1b9-49aa-a41a-69eb87f2b407"
msgid ""
"\"We must, Your Highness! Looks like there aren't any more of those bottom-"
"feeding bandits in the area. If one wanders in here, I'll handle it myself. "
"When you squish rats and roaches, you need to destroy their nests, not run "
"after separate beasts.\""
msgstr ""
"\"그래야만 했습니다, 전하! 이 지역에 더 이상 쓰레기 도적 떼는 없는 것처럼 보입니다. 한 놈이 여기저기 돌아다니면 제가 "
"처리하겠습니다. 쥐와 바퀴벌레를 박멸하려면, 그들을 쫓을 것이 아니라 둥지를 파괴해야 하죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : FirstWorldOTP_Jhod
msgctxt "996ff0e2-42f6-43e4-8978-17f924606949"
msgid ""
"\"Right!\" {n}Jhod remarks grumpily, but his eyes are shining with joy.{/n} "
"\"I'm so exhausted from trying to talk sense into these simpletons while you "
"were gone. Some of them just scatter, others try to act like heroes. There's "
"no order at all!\""
msgstr ""
"\"맞습니다!\" {n}조드는 심술 궂게 말하지만 그의 눈은 기쁨으로 빛나고 있습니다.{/n} \"당신이 사라졌을 때 얼간이들에게 "
"둘러대느라 지쳤습니다. 그들 중 일부는 흩어졌고, 다른 일부는 영웅처럼 행동하려고 했습니다.전혀 질서가 없죠.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/JhodKesten_dialog/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "cfddb634-5050-4532-a40c-d882f716e1d1"
msgid ""
"{n}The exhausted defenders of the {g|Oleg's Trading Post}trading post{/g} "
"shout with relief, recognizing you.{/n}"
msgstr "{n}지친 {g|Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g}의 수비병들은 당신을 알아보고 안도의 함성을 지릅니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "c04286e7-e4b7-46bc-908b-84bea7d9f1d0"
msgid "\"Your 'dream'? You are talking about Nyrissa, right?\""
msgstr "\"너의 '꿈'? 나이리사에 대해 이야기하고 있는 것이지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "5324c9da-bdc7-41ca-b9ab-5ab00c06706d"
msgid "\"Nyrissa manipulated you. Accept it and rest in peace, shadow.\""
msgstr "\"나이리사가 너를 조종했어. 그걸 받아들이고 평화롭게 잠들어라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "422f1c55-095d-424d-8691-fc5aaf34646c"
msgid ""
"[Attack] \"You are a stranger in this world. I've killed you before, I'll "
"kill you now!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너는 이 세상의 낯선 사람이다. 내가 너를 죽였어. 이번에도 너를 죽일거야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "1e063dc3-552b-4273-9353-895cf2134d30"
msgid "\"You do realize you've been dead for a long time?\""
msgstr "\"너는 오랫동안 네가 죽었다는 것을 알고 있나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "536750b9-42d4-4fde-afa2-d666ea816c32"
msgid ""
"{n}A tall figure in a horned helmet, towering behind the bandits' backs, "
"walks slowly toward you. {/n} \"If it isn't my greatest mistake.\" {n}The "
"Stag Lord rolls his eyes madly.{/n} \"I was sitting in my fortress and "
"drinking. When I should have come here and burned the damn {g|Oleg's Trading "
"Post}trading post{/g} to the ground, along with everyone inside — on the "
"very day you appeared in the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}산적들 뒤에서 우뚝 서있는 뿔이 달린 투구를 쓴 키가 큰 자가 당신쪽으로 천천히 걸어갑니다.{/n} \"내 실수가 아니라면 좋겠군."
"\" {n}수사슴 군주는 눈을 미친 듯이 굴립니다.{/n} \"나는 요새에 앉아 술을 마셨었다. 내가 여기에 와서 저 망할 {g|"
"Oleg's Trading Post}교역소{/g}를 안에 있는 사람들과 함께 태워버렸다. {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}"
"에 네가 나타난 그 날에 말이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "6f243190-af58-4f2a-a84b-15eef87cbd81"
msgid ""
"\"You killed her, right? My dream...\" {n}You hear sincere grief in the "
"shadow's voice.{/n}"
msgstr "\"네가 그녀를 죽였어? 내 꿈...\" {n}그림자의 목소리에 진지한 슬픔이 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "83b7caa8-d0eb-44e1-bc1b-5ea4f5d7ca1a"
msgid ""
"\"She chose you, right? My dream...\" {n}You hear dull melancholy in the "
"shadow's voice.{/n}"
msgstr "\"그녀가 너를 선택했지? 내 꿈...\" {n}그림자의 목소리는 우울한 기색이 들립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "c5cfe21a-f321-4e64-9ce4-a2d20fa924e9"
msgid ""
"\"You spared her life, right? My dream... I doubt she even remembers me, but "
"yet...\""
msgstr "\"너는 그녀의 목숨을 살려 줬지? 내 꿈은... 그녀가 나를 기억이나 할지 모르지만...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "193e0f8b-5484-4279-9291-3057308b508d"
msgid ""
"\"Nyrissa...\" {n}The bandit's crude speech changes imperceptibly.{/n} \"I "
"didn't even know her name. She'd come to me in dreams, and I only knew her "
"as my dream...\""
msgstr ""
"\"나이리사...\" {n}도적의 조잡한 발언은 눈에 띄지 않게 바뀝니다.{/n} \"나는 그녀의 이름조차 몰랐다. 그녀는 꿈 속에서만 "
"나에게 왔고, 나는 그녀를 내 꿈에서만 알았다...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "b74fc71b-2e35-49fc-8cbe-3f79c598e6a2"
msgid ""
"\"Dead? So what? I have my memories, I have my gang, I have two hands to "
"draw a bow. Nothing is stopping me from conquering these lands, as I've done "
"before.\""
msgstr ""
"\"죽었다고? 그래서? 나는 내 기억이 있다. 나는 도적들이 있다. 나는 활을 잡기 위한 두 손을 가지고 있다. 내가 전에 한 것처럼 "
"나의 정복을 멈추게하는 것은 아무것도 없다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "80a6bd54-4e3c-446e-9dd4-b980c7731192"
msgid ""
"\"She did. So what? You can't imagine what I was before she came to me. She "
"gave me purpose. She awakened me. I cast aside the pathetic scumbag I used "
"to call my father, I gathered my people, I cut the throats of a dozen other "
"chiefs, and brought these lands to heel. I wanted to call her my queen...\""
msgstr ""
"\"그녀가 그랬다. 그래서? 그녀가 나에게 오기 전에 내가 무엇인지 상상할 수 없다. 그녀는 내게 목적을 주었다. 그녀는 나를 깨웠다. "
"나는 아버지라고 부르던 비참한 쓰레기를 쫓아버렸다. 나는 내 백성을 모았다. 십여 명의 다른 족장의 목을 베고 이 땅을 굴복시켰다. 나는 "
"그녀를 내 여왕이라고 부르고 싶다... \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "374011dd-99e9-4a61-ab56-80fffcb86ce0"
msgid ""
"\"My dream that never came true. I'm glad I've returned to life, so now I "
"can get revenge on her murderer. Prepare to die a long and painful death, "
"scum!\""
msgstr ""
"\"절대로 실현되지 못한 내 꿈이 실현되었다. 나는 살아서 기쁘고 이제 살인자에 대한 복수를 할 수 있다. 길고 고통스러운 죽음을 "
"준비하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TradingPostFW/StagLord_dialog/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "a5fb06da-4ebc-44c3-b970-502959b99f84"
msgid ""
"{n}The Stag Lord shakes his head, as if banishing a thought.{/n} \"My dream "
"that never came true. So what? I didn't get my queen, but at least I'll get "
"my crown. I'll tear it from your head!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}수사슴은 생각을 떨치는 것처럼 그의 머리를 흔들었습니다.{/n} \"내 꿈은 실현되지 않았다. 그래서? 나는 여왕을 얻지 못했지만 "
"적어도 나는 왕관을 얻을 것이다. 나는 네 머리에서 빼앗을 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0003_Text
msgctxt "d9c203f8-7269-46f8-bad4-33aca9d99141"
msgid "...to the greenish portal leading to Lamashtu's shrine."
msgstr "... 라마슈투 성소에 이르는 초록 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "be02a6fc-b2a4-4da9-91c8-f960abbd8f28"
msgid "...to the bluish portal leading to Varnhold."
msgstr "... 반홀드로 이어지는 푸른 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "4650f99d-3b00-4f74-8583-4e2bcdcf730e"
msgid "...to the shining portal leading to Oleg's Trading Post."
msgstr "... 올렉의 교역소로 이어지는 빛나는 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "607d02f0-0851-4204-b763-dbd66ca7bd76"
msgid "...to the purplish portal leading to the depths of Trobold."
msgstr "... 트로볼드의 중심으로 이어지는 자줏빛 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "6a9662ed-1447-4897-b212-bc693c2b4bea"
msgid ""
"...to the silver portal leading to Irovetti's palace in the heart of Pitax."
msgstr "... 피탁스의 심장부에 있는 이로베티의 궁전으로 이어지는 은색 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "6d5922f9-1616-45be-ac95-7752a385db04"
msgid "...to the reddish portal leading to the Rostland borderlands."
msgstr "... 로스틀랜드 국경 지대로 이어지는 붉은 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0021_Text
msgctxt "a773a62e-325e-410f-afcd-ffeab1248aa2"
msgid "...to the golden portal leading back to the capital."
msgstr "... 수도로 돌아가는 황금 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0027_Text
msgctxt "2fa24881-93de-4de8-bbee-f077275cfe39"
msgid "...to the whitish portal leading to the Everblooming Flower Cradle."
msgstr "... 영원히 피는 꽃의 요람으로 연결되는 하얀 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0028_Text
msgctxt "a93b375f-426a-4db0-8cfd-898b1bc6ce9e"
msgid "...away from the portals of the First World."
msgstr "... 태초 세계의 포털에서 멀리 떨어집니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Answer_0049_Text
msgctxt "efc7f16a-6c00-46d7-8226-bbc117136242"
msgid "… to the black and white portal leading to Sorrowflow."
msgstr "... 슬픔의 폭포로 향하는 하얗고 검은 포털로 향합니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "5d0bb833-d5ea-4364-9cf7-39fa57ea2b42"
msgid ""
"Traveling through a kingdom that's been half \"swallowed\" by the {g|First "
"World}First World{/g} is a dangerous, unpredictable affair, but our "
"hero{mf||ine} didn't have much choice — {mf||s}he had to save {mf|his|her} "
"lands (or at least what was left of them!) as quickly as possible. In the "
"final hour, when every minute counted, {name} decided the only chance was to "
"try something risky and unreliable — magic portals leading through the First "
"World."
msgstr ""
"{g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}에 의해 절반정도 \"삼켜진\" 왕국을 여행하는 것은 위험하고 예측할 수 없는 일이지만, "
"우리의 {mf||여}주인공에게는 선택의 여지가 많지 않았습니다. 그는 자신의 영토를 (또는 그들에게 남겨진 땅이라도!) 어서 구해야 "
"했습니다. 일분일초가 중요한 순간에, {name}에게 유일하게 남은 선택은 위험하고 믿을 수 없는 무언가를 시도하는것 뿐이었습니다 — "
"결국 태초 세계의 마법 포탈을 통과하기로 결정했죠."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "4042e92a-ae0a-408a-a98d-33f79247b568"
msgid "Summoning all {mf|his|her} courage, {name} took a daring step..."
msgstr "용기를 끌어낸 {name}. 그는 대담한 발걸음을 옮겼습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "6409b39f-5694-4311-9cf2-62e56780b2f8"
msgid ""
"Sadly, the vicious {g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}'s curse placed a heavy "
"burden on our leader's shoulders. And yet, even barely standing, {name} "
"wouldn't abandon {mf|his|her} duty!"
msgstr ""
"슬프게도 악의적인 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 저주는 우리 지도자의 어깨에 커다란 짐이 되었습니다. 그리고, 아직 "
"서있기조차도 힘들더라도, {name}은(는) 의무를 포기하지 않을 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "224b608e-e02f-429c-be10-e175b0be1de5"
msgid ""
"After defeating several enemies, our leader felt a surge of energy — the "
"curse was growing weaker! If we could manage to help a few more allies out "
"of trouble, maybe it would be possible to eliminate the curse entirely!"
msgstr ""
"몇 명의 적을 물리 쳤을 때 우리의 지도자는 에너지의 급증을 느꼈습니다. 저주가 점점 약해졌습니다! 우리가 더 많은 동맹국들이 곤경에서 "
"벗어날 수 있도록 도울 수 있다면, 아마도 저주를 완전히 없앨 수 있을 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "b20cf050-947b-43b2-8447-ee233fa5acd4"
msgid ""
"One last step was all that prevented our leader from shaking the "
"{g|LanternKing}Lantern King{/g}'s curse from {mf|his|her} shoulders. Finding "
"and retrieving the last missing piece of the kingdom — that's what drove our "
"hero{mf||ine} onward!"
msgstr ""
"마지막 단계는 우리 지도자가 {g|LanternKing}등불왕{/g}의 저주를 떨쳐내지 못하게 하는 것이었습니다. 마지막으로 잃어버린 "
"왕국의 조각을 찾아 되돌리는 것. 이것이 우리의 영웅을 전진하게 한 원인입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "69334011-9b94-4dae-80e8-e074465ca500"
msgid ""
"Familiar sensations seized the {mf|king|queen} as {mf||s}he stepped into the "
"helpfully opened portal. Strange visions of the {g|First World}First "
"World{/g} surrounded our hero{mf||ine} — then disappeared the moment {mf||s}"
"he reached {mf|his|her} destination and emerged into our reality!"
msgstr ""
"친숙한 감각이 {mf|왕|여왕}의 발걸음이 유용하게 열린 포털로 들어갔을 때 느껴집니다. {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}의 "
"이상한 비전이 우리 영웅을 둘러쌌습니다. 그 순간 그는 사라지고 목적지에 도달하고 우리의 현실에 등장했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Cue_0026_Text
msgctxt "a6451be4-aa69-4bd8-b32d-175970ce8db5"
msgid ""
"The journey to the capital was uneventful — well, as uneventful as possible "
"when you're traveling through the {g|First World}First World{/g}! Luckily "
"avoiding encounters with otherworldly monsters or becoming lost along "
"treacherous paths in another reality, {name} found a suitable portal and was "
"soon standing at the entrance to the capital!"
msgstr ""
"수도로의 여행은 평온한 것이 었습니다. {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}를 여행할 때 이정도면 평온한 것이었습니다! 다행히도 "
"다른 세계의 괴물과의 만남을 피하거나 또 다른 현실에서 배신으로 길을 잃는 것은 피했고 {name}은 적당한 포털을 발견하여 곧 수도 "
"입구에 서있을 것입니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_EndBookevent_String
msgctxt "9f66b8b3-999b-4c6a-80b2-4e48d2fbf7b5"
msgid "Close."
msgstr "닫기."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_FW_01Migration_String
msgctxt "dfe9b6d9-d073-46b8-b167-2b0ea885a83b"
msgid ""
"Have you ever seen flying octopuses? Or hopping turtles? It seems our "
"hero{mf||ine} was fortunate to travel through the {g|First World}First "
"World{/g} during the local denizens' migration season — {mf||s}he was "
"accompanied by these amazing creatures along {mf|his|her} entire journey! "
"The trip was otherwise uneventful, and soon the portal led our "
"{mf|king|queen} exactly where it was supposed to go!"
msgstr ""
"날아다니는 문어를 본 적이 있습니까? 아니면 도약하는 거북은요? 우리의 영웅이 운 좋게도 현지 주민들의 이주 기간 동안 {g|First "
"World}태초 세계{/g}를 여행했습니다. 그{mf||녀}가 여행하는 동안 이 놀라운 생물들이 함께였습니다! 여행은 평온했고, 조만간 "
"포털이 {mf|왕|여왕}을 정확히 어디로 가야하는지 인도했습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_FW_02DancingLights_String
msgctxt "67a4790a-3121-4e8a-b9ac-07dc945e7664"
msgid ""
"The moment our leader entered the portal, {mf||s}he was surrounded by "
"blinding green fireflies as big as a fist! Waving away the annoying insects, "
"{name} entered another portal without noticing. Then another. And another..."
"\n"
"After several hours of torment, {name} managed to find {mf|his|her} way to "
"{mf|his|her} own world and leave the treacherous paths of that strange "
"reality."
msgstr ""
"우리 지도자가 포털에 입장한 순간 그는 주먹만한 눈먼 녹색 반딧불이에게 둘러쌓였습니다! 성가신 곤충을 멀리 떨쳐내며 {name}은 "
"무의식적으로 다른 포털에 입장했습니다. 그리고 다른 포털을. 그리고 또 다른...\n"
"몇 시간의 고통 후에 {name}은 그 이상한 현실에 놓인 위험한 길을 떠나, 그럭저럭 {mf|그|그녀}의 세계로 가는 길을 발견할 수 "
"있었습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_FW_03HelpfulFey_String
msgctxt "194b7f39-50dc-46e7-98d9-9a77aa75d581"
msgid ""
"Being in the {g|First World}First World{/g}, {name} easily found the path to "
"the portal that would take {mf|him|her} to {mf|his|her} destination. Of "
"course, it would have been difficult to do so alone, but our leader was "
"fortunate enough to find a gaggle of playful pixies to help {mf|him|her}. "
"Noticing a foreigner, they decided to display their capacity for nobility "
"and honesty — a rare occurrence for the fey!"
msgstr ""
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}에 있으면서, {name}은 목적지로 가는 포털을 쉽게 발견했습니다. 물론, 혼자서 하는 것은 "
"어려웠을 것이지만, 우리의 지도자는 운 좋게 놀기 좋아하는 픽시 무리를 만나 도움을 받았습니다. 외지인을 알아차리면서, 그들은 고귀함과 "
"정직을 증명하기 위한 그들의 수용력을 보여 주기로 결심했습니다. 페이에게는 드문 사건이니까요!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_FW_04Toad_String
msgctxt "d71aa397-66fe-432b-8c32-d8370f009247"
msgid ""
"Immediately beyond the portal, {name} encountered a fat toad who politely "
"offered her aid. The unexpected guide directed our hero{mf||ine} to the next "
"portal... at least, that's what she pretended she was doing! In reality, the "
"toad lured the {mf|king|queen} into an impassible tangle of extremely tall "
"nettles, then vanished into thin air, laughing all the while. Once {name} "
"finally found the right path and made it to the portal — muttering curses "
"and scratching at nettle stings — almost half the day had gone by."
msgstr ""
"포털 바로 너머에 {name}은 공손하게 원조를 제안한 뚱뚱한 두꺼비를 만났습니다. 예상치 못한 가이드가 우리 영웅을 다음 포털로 "
"인도했지만 그것은 속임수였습니다! 실제로 두꺼비는 {mf|왕|여왕}의 집중력을 흐뜨려 매우 키가 커 지나갈 수 없는 얽힌 쐐기풀로 "
"인도하고는 비웃으며 허공으로 사라졌습니다. {name}은 쐐기풀 가시에 긁히고 욕지거리를 하며 드디어 옳은 길을 발견하고 포털로 향했을 "
"때 거의 반나절이 지나갔습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_FW_05Nightlight_String
msgctxt "783229be-7786-4877-9458-b4cb29e5cefd"
msgid ""
"Finding {mf|him|her}self in the {g|First World}First World{/g}, {name} was "
"stunned by a wondrous vision — a fantastically bright, iridescent shining in "
"the sky! It took the shrewd ruler only a few seconds to realize that the "
"rainbow patterns in the radiant skies were showing the way to the next "
"portal, and it wasn't far at all!"
msgstr ""
"자신이 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g}에 도착한 것을 깨달은 {name}은 하늘에 환상적인 무지개 빛으로 빛나는 놀라운 "
"광경에 깜짝 놀랐습니다! 눈치빠른 통치자가 빛나는 하늘의 무지개 패턴이 다음 포털로 가는 길을 보여주고 있다는 것을 깨닫는 데는 불과 몇 "
"초 밖에 걸리지 않았습니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_FW_06Dweomerkittens_String
msgctxt "907c3dce-adb9-46a6-bb51-ac14a993d90d"
msgid ""
"Entering a portal and landing right in the middle of a clearing where an "
"entire family of dweomercat cubs are playing is no trial for the faint of "
"heart! Our hero{mf||ine} was lucky, though — the little ones had been having "
"their fun without any parental supervision, and when a strange, two-legged "
"creature appeared unexpectedly, they scattered! Without waiting for the "
"caretakers of these scared dweomercat cubs to appear on the \"playground,\" "
"{name} hurried to the next portal and soon arrived in the right place."
msgstr ""
"포털에 들어가자 공터의 한가운데에 떨어졌습니다. 거기에는 듀오머 고양이 새끼들이 놀고 있었고, 그 모습은 심장 발작을 일으켰죠! 우리의 "
"{mf||여}주인공은 운이 좋았습니다 — 부모의 감시 없이 새끼들이 즐겁게 놀고 있었거든요. 그리고 이상하고 두 발로 걷는 동물이 예기치 "
"않게 등장하자, 그들은 흩어졌습니다! 이 겁먹은 듀오머 고양이 새끼들의 부모가 \"놀이터\"에 나타나기를 기다리지 않고, "
"{name}은(는) 다음 포털을 향해 걸음을 재촉했고 곧바로 올바른 장소에 도착했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_FW_07Graveyard_String
msgctxt "d14d7b37-59d1-48c7-ab09-2eb6cb24c0d5"
msgid ""
"This time, the journey through the {g|First World}First World{/g} was not a "
"pleasant one. Trudging through a huge trench filled with enormous linnorm "
"bones is no laughing matter! In another time and place, we would probably "
"have explored this strange boneyard to find out who or what created it, but "
"with the fate of the {g|Stolen Lands}Stolen Lands{/g} on the line, our "
"hero{mf||ine} suppressed {mf|his|her} curiosity and hurried through the next "
"portal to help {mf|his|her} kingdom!"
msgstr ""
"이번 {g|First World} 태초 세계{/g} 여행은 즐거운 것이 아니었습니다. 막대한 린놈의 뼈로 가득 찬 거대한 참호를 돌격하는 "
"일은 즐거운 일이 아닙니다! 다른 시간과 장소에서 우리는 아마도 이 이상한 뼈무덤을 탐험하면 누가 그것을 만들었는지 발견할 수 있었을 "
"것이지만 위태로운 {g|Stolen Lands}도둑맞은 땅{/g}의 운명에 우리의 영웅운 호기심을 억누르고 왕국을 돕기 위해 다음 포털을 "
"향해 서둘러 갑니다!"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TravelPortals/Shared_FW_08Night_String
msgctxt "39bc6ccd-91ae-4c0b-88b5-a3b5717f7026"
msgid ""
"Night in the {g|First World}First World{/g} is an amazing phenomenon, "
"sometimes passing by extremely fast. Before our hero{mf||ine} got to the "
"right portal, the sky overhead had lit and dimmed three times! This didn't "
"keep our adventurer from reaching {mf|his|her} goal, though, and {mf||s}he "
"made it out of the First World uneventfully."
msgstr ""
"{g|First World}태초 세계{/g}의 밤은 놀라운 현상입니다, 때때로 엄청나게 빨리 지나가지요. 우리 영웅이 옳은 포털에 "
"도착하기 전에, 하늘은 3번 밝아지고 어두워지기를 반복합니다! 이 조차도 우리의 모험가가 목표에 도달하는 것을 방해하지 못했으며, "
"그{mf||녀}는 태초 세계를 평온하게 탈출했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/01_Troll_String
msgctxt "cd186a38-f0bf-4521-98bc-3d1b410ee53d"
msgid "\"Cutting not help. Keeps screaming. Crack head open, maybe?\""
msgstr "\"칼질은 도움이 안돼. 소리를 계속 지른단 말이야. 머리를 부셔버리는 게 어때?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/02_Troll_String
msgctxt "0f896c09-93a7-4e9e-8ae0-f2bbe2c926f3"
msgid "\"Head boink. Yes, head boink!\""
msgstr "\"그래. 머리를 부수자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/03_Troll_String
msgctxt "8571e7a0-1dea-4c87-8be6-ed9aebf5f9a0"
msgid "\"No, not work. Wits spill out. No can pick up. We examine.\""
msgstr "\"아니. 효과가 없어. 지혜가 쏟아져 나와. 아무도 집지 못해. 해봤거든.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/04_Sadist_String
msgctxt "ae3baf2e-ed55-418b-9eb6-6a1eade7a29c"
msgid "\"Let go of me, you imbeciles!\""
msgstr "\"나를 놓아 줘! 이 멍청이들아!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/05_Troll_String
msgctxt "a52c63d1-6c7b-40a7-b536-ac0f89c93fde"
msgid ""
"\"Smart. Knows scary words. We soon know why you so smart, then we be smart."
"\""
msgstr "\"똑똑한데. 무서운 단어도 알고 있고. 우리는 왜 네가 그렇게 똑똑한지 곧 알게 돼, 그러면 우리도 똑똑해질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/06_Troll_String
msgctxt "ad460b85-3ac5-4b49-b157-72d786962316"
msgid ""
"\"Wits must be in tongue. Rip out his tongue, then we eat it and get smarts."
"\""
msgstr "\"지혜는 혀에 있어. 혀를 찢어 먹으면, 우리는 영리해질 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/07_Sadist_String
msgctxt "eae1523a-a3ba-4008-9d97-00b1f4cbc324"
msgid "\"Help! Someone, anyone, help!\""
msgstr "\"도와주세요! 누군가 도와주세요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/Bark_TrollSadist1_String
msgctxt "b90fe771-b9a7-4061-8965-2a56d21e3eb4"
msgid "\"Nothing gets him!\""
msgstr "\"아무것도 그를 잡지 못해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/Bark_TrollSadist2_String
msgctxt "710a0ff4-eb32-4292-bd1c-dec0dde98ac2"
msgid "\"We make him count to ten?!\""
msgstr "\"그가 열을 세도록 할까?!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/Bark_TrollSadist3_String
msgctxt "c1630181-b8df-4d98-b195-3629adede3f3"
msgid "\"We must understand how he got so smart, so we be like him.\""
msgstr "\"우리는 그가 어떻게 그렇게 똑똑해졌는지 이해하면 우리도 똑똑해질 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/DeadSadist_bark_String
msgctxt "adfc777f-5874-4f09-b18e-b6c748e09a8b"
msgid ""
"Bartholomew's body is horribly disfigured — especially the head, which is "
"literally cracked open, and the brain is missing."
msgstr "바톨로뮤의 몸은 끔찍하게 변형되어 있습니다. 특히 머리는 말 그대로 열어 놓은 머리가 되어 두뇌가 빠져 있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/Envir_GreenBark_String
msgctxt "d8595c2d-e048-4028-a722-c2a8cf9c9e48"
msgid "A cracked stone is covered by thick greenery."
msgstr "금이 간 돌은 두꺼운 이끼로 덮여있습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/PhaseSpider_Idle01_String
msgctxt "c894429e-2fd2-4abe-be27-467997ab7e47"
msgid "\"Gratitude. Friend. Joy.\""
msgstr "\"감사, 친구, 기쁨.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/PhaseSpider_Idle02_String
msgctxt "a1273d86-d1df-4764-9924-ae2152052811"
msgid "\"Home. Breakthrough. Passage.\""
msgstr "\"홈, 돌파구, 통로.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/PhaseSpider_Idle03_String
msgctxt "8d14097d-96b9-475e-9dfc-aacda2f50717"
msgid "\"Friend. Rescue. Kingdom.\""
msgstr "\"친구, 구조, 왕국.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/Barks/PhaseSpider_attackbark_String
msgctxt "fb06b661-9b54-4b5d-b34d-8b153b27be1b"
msgid "\"Friend. Protection. Rescue!\""
msgstr "\"친구, 보호, 구조!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "159416cb-4704-44a6-9e6c-a4cf16fb9958"
msgid "\"Trobold fell. You don't belong here anymore.\""
msgstr "\"트로볼트가 멸망했다. 너는 더 이상 여기에 속하지 않는다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "a550b90c-5bcd-4ddb-a4d6-4ff77f39b13d"
msgid "\"Weren't you dead?!\""
msgstr "\"너 죽지 않았어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "73bfc6ca-e0da-47ee-a21c-d690417dfa2b"
msgid "\"Where's Hargulka?\""
msgstr "\"하굴카는 어디에 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "febb1dc6-af8f-4fbf-8b07-85a7fb41ff57"
msgid "\"Where's Tartuk?\""
msgstr "\"타툭은 어디 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "5b37b7e3-0a49-4887-a0cb-803b7a2df29c"
msgid "[Attack] \"I cleaned this place out once — I'll just clean it again!\""
msgstr "[공격] \"나는 이 장소를 한 번 청소했다. 그리고 다시 청소할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Answer_0018_Text
msgctxt "9ac50e33-c11c-4e95-a73a-be20f891a56f"
msgid "\"I didn't expect to see your ugly mugs again!\""
msgstr "\"나는 너의 못난 얼굴을 다시 볼 것으로 기대하지 않았다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Cue_0001_Text_String
#. Speaker : Hragulka_FW
msgctxt "cbd093f2-0e1f-4728-8ffb-390d24ee2e13"
msgid ""
"{n}A huge troll slowly lifts his head as you approach, as though shaking off "
"a heavy dream.{/n} \"Who is here? Who comes?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}거대한 트롤은 당신이 접근하자 무거운 꿈을 떨쳐버리려는 것처럼 머리를 천천히 들었습니다.{/n} \"누가 왔어? 누가 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Cue_0004_Text_String
#. Speaker : Tartuk_FW
msgctxt "10417336-ec9b-4837-8c94-b44e667e88ee"
msgid ""
"\"Ssshhh... I hear familiar ssstepsss. Ssstepsss of deathhh. Ssstepsss of "
"evil. But I'm not afraid. I will look deathhh in the eye onccce again. "
"Trobold will ssstand.\""
msgstr ""
"\"쉬... 나는 익숙한 발걸음을 들었다. 죽음의 발걸음... 악의 발걸음... 하지만 나는 두렵지 않아. 나는 다시 눈을 보고 죽음을 "
"볼 것이다. 트로볼드는 견딜 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka_FW
msgctxt "74a2d25f-9205-4f62-99c4-0f9a0b4104ae"
msgid ""
"\"Kobold is afraid. Says over and over times have changed, that I am dead "
"and have to stay dead. It is all right — Hargulka will return the courage "
"borba took from Tartuk. Or strike him dead. No matter. Trobold will stand "
"under Hargulka.\""
msgstr ""
"\"코볼트는 두려워하고 있다. 계속 말을 바꾸는데 내가 죽었다거나 죽은 채로 있어야 한다고 말한다. 괜찮다. 하굴카는 타툭에게서 가져온 "
"용기있는 보바를 돌려줄 것이다. 아니면 그를 때려 죽이겠다. 상관 없다. 트로볼드는 하굴카 밑에서 견딜 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : Tartuk_FW
msgctxt "f4b4b60a-ddd2-4fe4-a890-e0e2c9c65ffd"
msgid ""
"\"Ssstupid troll. Refusesss to obey. Babblesss about a new friend, a new "
"home. I will enssssure Hargulka returnsss to become what he isss sssuposssed "
"to be — ssservant of Tartuk, the one true massster of Trobold!\""
msgstr ""
"\"멍청한 트롤. 받드는 것을 거부한다. 새로운 친구, 새로운 집에 대해 떠들어라... 하굴카는 그가 되고자 하는 것이 될 것이다... "
"트로볼트의 진정한 마스터 타툭의 종 말이다...!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Cue_0015_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka_FW
msgctxt "caeef949-1328-4c90-9862-53c4aa7e165f"
msgid ""
"\"This our home, borba. Home of kobold and troll. You are what does not "
"belong — you and your tribe.\""
msgstr "\"여기 우리 집이다. 보바. 코볼트와 트롤의 집. 너와 너의 부족이 살 곳이 아니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Cue_0016_Text
#. Speaker : Hragulka_FW
msgctxt "0e614fc3-0732-4d31-96d3-34e7aaeff719"
msgid ""
"\"Troll will live forever. Hargulka does not fear you, borba. Borba is food "
"for Trobold's children, not enemy.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤은 영원히 살 것이다. 하굴카는 네놈을 두려워하지 않는다. 보바. 보바는 적이 아니라 트로볼드의 아이들을 위한 음식이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Cue_0017_Text
#. Speaker : Tartuk_FW
msgctxt "54639835-9a8c-4ed2-a82d-1ed93840c348"
msgid ""
"\"You think thisss will ssstop me? I am the ssspirit of revenge! I will "
"avenge fallen Trobold. You were my deathhh — thisss time, I will be yoursss!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"\"너는 이것이 나를 멈추게 할 거라고 생각하나? 나는 복수의 화신이다! 나는 멸망한 트로볼트에게 복수할 것이다. 너는 나의 죽음이었다. "
"이 시간 나는 너의 죽음이 될 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Cue_0019_Text
#. Speaker : Tartuk_FW
msgctxt "27b90ad1-5bcf-41b4-bea1-f618f1f46640"
msgid "\"No more wordsss — I will sssquish thisss bug and ressstore Trobold!\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 말은 그만해라... 나는 이 벌레를 죽이고 트로볼트를 구할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Shared_HargulkaAttacks_String
#. Speaker : Hragulka_FW
msgctxt "b7b35959-d935-45b7-82c6-5c5139249c4f"
msgid ""
"{n}The troll bares his rotten teeth in a horrific grin.{/n} \"Hargulka will "
"free Trobold from new misfortune. Dur borba!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}트롤은 끔찍한 미소를 보이며 그의 썩은 이빨을 드러냅니다.{/n} \"하굴카는 새로운 불행에서 트로볼드를 해방할 것이다. 두르 보바!"
"\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/BeforeBattle_Dialogue/Shared_TartukAttacks_String
#. Speaker : Tartuk_FW
msgctxt "ec40b956-5ae4-42cc-9996-ffe2629336bd"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk hisses rabidly as he begins weaving a spell with the tips of his "
"clawed fingers.{/n} \"You defeated me onccce. Not again. Die, "
"{mf|Baron|Baroness}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 맹렬히 쉭쉭거리며 발톱 끝으로 마법을 짭니다.{/n} \"너는 나를 한 번 꺾었다. 다시는 지지 않는다. 죽어라. "
"{mf|남작|여남작}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "62ca3e68-0f39-46ed-bc86-f7aa753e6777"
msgid "\"What happened here, Hargulka?\""
msgstr "\"여기 무슨 일이 있었지. 하굴카?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "603e05f3-1483-4049-8bd4-2406ebcbfb0f"
msgid "\"Where are your trolls?\""
msgstr "\"너의 트롤은 어디 있나나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "a7e31dff-8e1a-4fa9-a2ca-732cc6963b00"
msgid "\"I helped you save your kingdom — will you help me protect mine?\""
msgstr "\"네가 왕국을 구원하는 것을 도왔다. 내 왕국의 보호를 도울 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "4dcc350f-fa0f-4f71-b33b-da22b8680856"
msgid "\"Get out of my way, and don't meddle.\""
msgstr "\"방해하지 말고 간섭하지 마라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "8be8d755-bebf-48ea-aaba-89e0a01457b7"
msgid "\"Did the other trolls scare you? What happened?\""
msgstr "\"다른 트롤들이 너를 놀라게 했나? 무슨 일이야?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "014f82ab-1982-4df4-bd54-cb09efce3ee0"
msgid "\"Great idea!\""
msgstr "\"좋은 생각이야!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Answer_0015_Text
msgctxt "b3de35e2-3dd0-4652-a1f6-5ca0e0b51855"
msgid "\"Don't you come close to my capital!\""
msgstr "\"내 수도에 가까이 가지마!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "2617ffdd-4d77-4e37-bd26-93310dbf5851"
msgid ""
"{n}The old troll is seated on cold tiles. When he sees you, he stands and "
"roars with joy.{/n} \"Hmm, {race}! You alive!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}늙은 트롤은 차가운 타일 바닥에 앉습니다. 그가 당신을 보았을 때 그는 일어서서 기쁨에 차 울부짖습니다.{/n} \" {race}! "
"살아있었군!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "4a31bf30-6e7a-42a3-a670-096854ff5fa5"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka shifts from one huge foot to the other for a while before "
"finally spreading his huge hands helplessly.{/n} \"Hargulka not know, {name}"
". Trolls lived in peace, no touch borba... now this. As if forest grew "
"inside dungeons. Strange forest... not like ours. Then dead Tartuk and his "
"trolls appeared.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 마침내 그의 거대한 손을 무력하게 내려뜨리기 전에 잠시 동안 한쪽 거대한 발을 다른 발로 옮깁니다.{/n} \"하굴카는 "
"모른다. {name}. 트롤들은 평화롭게 살았고 보바를 건드리지 않았다... 그런데 이렇게 되었다. 마치 숲이 던전 안에서 자란 것 "
"같다. 이상한 숲이다... 우리 것과 달라. 그런 다음 죽은 타툭과 그의 트롤이 나타났다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "b25ebcff-d79d-4d41-afb4-e6eecd9734e9"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka growls in a low, dull tone.{/n} \"Branded trolls. There been "
"none since Tartuk died. These ones strange — no smell, no shadows. Alive, "
"but not really. Tartuk is not real, but real angry. Started hissing about "
"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}, treason, borb- you.\" {n}The old troll lowers his "
"head.{/n} \"Hargulka deceived Tartuk. Said must think and decide. Hargulka "
"waited. Not want to fight all Tartuk's trolls. But not betray you, no!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 낮고 둔한 음색으로 으르렁거립니다.{/n} \"낙인찍힌 트롤들. 타툭이 죽고 사라졌다. 이상한 것들이다. 냄새가 없고 "
"그림자도 없었다. 살아있었지만 산게 아니다. {g|Trobold}트로볼트{/g}, 배신...\" {n}늙은 트롤은 머리를 숙입니다.{/n}"
" \"하굴카는 타툭을 속였다. 생각하고 결정해야 한다고 말했다. 하굴카는 기다렸다. 타툭의 모든 트롤과 싸우고 싶지는 않다. 하지만 너를 "
"배신하지 않는다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "66ace80c-2e3c-473c-a9b5-766d0c6bf9c4"
msgid ""
"\"Many ran away. Others hid. Rest fought Tartuk's trolls. Some stayed alive "
"and ran, and some got eaten. A few agreed with Tartuk, went back to like "
"before.\" {n}Hargulka lets out a rumble of disapproval.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"\"많은 자들이 도망갔다. 다른 자들은 숨었다. 나머지는 타툭의 트롤과 싸웠다. 일부는 살아남아 도망갔고 어떤 자들은 먹혔다. 몇몇이 "
"타툭에게 항복하여 예전처럼 돌아갔다.\" {n}하굴카는 비난으로 으르렁거립니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "de837ac0-7de3-4fce-8e46-290cf45a4814"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka's roar shakes the dungeon walls.{/n} \"Hargulka promised help! "
"Strong word! Hargulka will gather his trolls, go to your city. You protected "
"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g} — we will protect your kingdom!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카의 포효로 지하 감옥 벽이 흔들립니다.{/n}\"하굴카는 도움을 약속했다! 굳은 약속을! 하굴카는 그의 트롤을 모아서 너의 "
"도시로 간다. 너는 {g|Trobold}트로볼드{/g}를 지켰고, 우리는 너의 왕국을 보호할 것이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "31d28d80-d00b-4bad-ac28-fa5d6a055ee5"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka lingers.{/n} \"Leave...? Hargulka want to help... gather an "
"army... go to city and fight your enemies...\""
msgstr "{n}하굴카가 침묵합니다.{/n} \"떠나라...? 하굴카는 군대를 모으고... 도시로 가서 적들과 싸우며 도우고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "aae3c774-906c-42d4-96e4-750827a54441"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka looks at you, clearly confused and... maybe hurt?{/n} \"Hargulka "
"was not lying when he promised friendship. If kingdom does not need trolls, "
"then trolls will save trolls. Farewell, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 당신을 쳐다 봅니다. 분명히 혼란스러워 보였고 상처를 받았을지도 모릅니다.{/n} \"하굴카는 우정을 약속할 때 거짓말을 "
"하지 않았다. 왕국에 트롤이 필요없다면 트롤은 트롤을 구할 것이다. {name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyHragulka_FW/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "75e61cee-3fd5-4713-9545-5a95b4bef0ea"
msgid ""
"{n}Hargulka stands up and straightens his shoulders with a crunching "
"sound.{/n} \"We will crush your enemies! Hargulka gave his word! Strong word!"
"\""
msgstr ""
"{n}하굴카는 일어 서서 소리를 어깨를 펴자 우드득 소리가 납니다.{/n} \"우리는 너의 적을 부숴버릴 것이다! 하굴카는 약속을 했다! "
"굳은 약속을!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "b6bdc014-2f5f-4e3c-9a9e-b51ec0ebd91d"
msgid "\"What happened here?\""
msgstr "\"여기 무슨 일이 있었지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Answer_0005_Text
msgctxt "82bace82-2da4-47b5-aafb-59d65487ba44"
msgid "\"Where are your kobolds?\""
msgstr "\"너의 코볼트는 어디 있나? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "ff8f7eac-8048-431b-9c48-20506d9bb5f6"
msgid "\"Are you all right?\""
msgstr "\"괜찮아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "2df7f6e9-cd37-49a4-9309-ea760f654976"
msgid ""
"\"Tartuk, it's time to help me like I once helped you. Will you and your "
"kobolds help us protect my kingdom?\""
msgstr ""
"\"타툭, 한 때 내가 너를 도왔던 것처럼 나를 도울 시간이다. 너와 너의 코볼트가 우리 왕국을 보호할 수 있게 도와줄 것인가?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "da526bd2-9fb3-433f-8f1c-e064e14c05ba"
msgid ""
"\"Once, long ago, we fought side by side against assassins... Would you join "
"me to fight once more?\""
msgstr "\"한 때, 오래전에, 우리는 암살자들과 나란히 싸웠다... 나를 다시 싸우게 하겠나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "73620086-fd54-41ce-ab16-b068dd3f3947"
msgid "\"Trobold is cleansed. I have to keep going.\""
msgstr "\"트로볼드는 정화되었다. 나는 계속 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0002_Text
msgctxt "f646501d-463f-4fd8-b46a-7f674e8c387d"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk stands from his crouched position as he sees you approach. He "
"looks to have taken a beating, but none of his wounds seem to be serious.{/n}"
" \"{name}? Did you come... for me?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 당신이 접근하는 것을 보면서 쭈그러 앉은 자세에서 일어납니다. 그는 두들겨 맞은 것처럼 보이지만 상처는 심각하지 "
"않습니다.{/n} \"{name}? 너는... 날 위해 온건가? \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "184226de-fb02-47c4-a405-61c45e44a872"
msgid ""
"\"My friendsss will help you protect your home. Asss soon as we're shhhure "
"the dungeon isss safe, I will sssend them to help your cccity. Good luck to "
"usss, {name}.\""
msgstr ""
"\"내 친구들은 네 집을 지킬 때 도움이 될 거다. 던전은 안전하니, 그들을 보내 너의 도시를 지키도록 도울 것이다. 행운을 빈다. "
"{name}. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0012_Text
msgctxt "93425a0a-588f-4c65-a00b-619b3c245375"
msgid "\"I have to go — my sssubjects await me. Good luck to usss, {name}!\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해. 나의 하인들이 나를 기다린다... 행운을 빌어다오... {name}!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "0652c958-7910-476b-8198-e1813afa7579"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk sways silently for a moment before finally clutching his head with "
"a hiss.{/n} \"I remember... but I don't... I usssed to be someone else... "
"But thisss door, it isss locked. I ssscratch and ssscream, hit and bite, but "
"still it isss locked.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 소리 없이 머리를 잠시 흔들더니 마침내 소리를 지르며 머리를 움켜쥐었습니다.{/n} \"나는 기억하지만... 나는 그러지 "
"않았다... 나는 다른 사람이 되고는 했다... 하지만 이 문은... 잠겼다. 나는 긁고 소리지르고 물어뜯고 물었지만 여전히 잠겨있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0014_Text
msgctxt "bb2d34e0-cecc-4155-8544-18dc306f5a9b"
msgid ""
"{n}The kobold hisses wildly.{/n} \"Ssstop tormenting me with your "
"questionsss! I am Tartuk! King of Kobolds! Protector of our kingdom! Tartuk, "
"and no one elssse! And asss for your requessst...\" {n}The shaman stretches "
"his clawed fingers out, weaving a spell.{/n} \"I sssat on my handsss for too "
"long. I will go with you, {name}. I will rip the throat from thossse who did "
"thisss to my kingdom.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}코볼트는 격렬하게 쉭쉭합니다.{/n} \"너의 질문으로 나를 괴롭히지 말아라! 나는 타툭이다! 코볼트왕! 왕국의 수호자! 누구도 "
"아닌 타툭! 그리고 너의 요구를...\" {n}주술사는 앞발을 뻗어 주문을 만듭니다.{/n} \"나는 너무 오랫동안 손 놓고 있었다. "
"나는 너와 함께 갈 것이다. {name}. 나는 내 왕국에 이런 짓을 한 놈들의 목구멍을 찢을 것이다. \""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0015_Text
msgctxt "f5f09c6c-53ba-4aa5-9219-c35a3f09546c"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk lowers his head, and the horse skull he wears shifts down a "
"bit.{/n} \"You gave me a chanccce. Me and the ressst of koboldsss. We will "
"repay you. We will help you protect your kingdom.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 머리를 낮췄고, 그가 착용하는 말의 두개골은 약간 아래로 움직입니다.{/n} \"너는 내게 기회를 주었다... 나와 다른 "
"코볼트에게. 우리는 네게 빚을 갚을 것이다. 우리는 너의 왕국을 보호하도록 도울 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0016_Text
msgctxt "07776f20-df0d-4449-b745-37f6368fe97f"
msgid ""
"{n}Tartuk makes a strange sound — after a moment, you recognize it as the "
"kobold version of a disdainful scoff.{/n} \"Dumb troll. Ssswung hisss paw, "
"threw me againssst the wall. I am tougher than I ssseem.\" {n}The kobold "
"probes his ribs carefully.{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}타툭은 이상한 소리를냅니다. 잠시 후 당신은 그것이 코볼트의 경멸스런 비웃음인 것을 인식합니다.{/n} \"멍청한 트롤. 앞발을 "
"휘둘러 나를 벽에 던져버렸다. 나는 보기보다 강하다...\" {n}코볼트는 그의 갈비뼈를 조심스럽게 만집니다.{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0017_Text
msgctxt "ca1c4f59-cefb-419f-b81a-fe5030375cd7"
msgid ""
"\"They hid when trollsss started trassshing everything! Fear not, {name}, I "
"sssay one word, and they will come out of their cracksss.\""
msgstr ""
"\"트롤들이 모든 것을 망쳤을 때 그들은 숨었다! 두려워하지 마라. {name}. 한 마디 하자면 그들은 그 틈에서 나올 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/FriendlyTartuk_FW/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "58ffcb57-0d49-4413-b9de-2dfa030e6bb7"
msgid ""
"\"I know magic, but thisss... thisss is unfamiliar to me. Asss if a shhhell "
"burssst, and sssomething came rushhhing into thisss world — into "
"{g|Trobold}Trobold{/g}. Hargulka returned to life. Ssstarted demanding the "
"kingdom to himssself. I had to pretend I wasss dead... and wait.\""
msgstr ""
"\"나는 마법을 안다. 그러나 이것은... 나에게 생소하다. 껍데기가 터졌고, 무언가가 세상으로, {g|Trobold}트로볼드{/g}로 "
"몰려들었다. 하굴카는 삶으로 돌아왔다. 왕국을 요구하기 시작했다. 나는 죽은 척하고... 기다려야 했다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0002_Text
msgctxt "d7373cb5-aea4-458c-8810-c3fc5ad596ef"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0004_Text
msgctxt "8bc7e964-0940-45d4-9252-3dcda19d8485"
msgid "\"You came HERE to hide from the violence?\""
msgstr "\"폭력으로부터 숨기 위해 '여기'에 왔나?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "17dcbcce-ced3-4bcf-b41d-88f4bc4da6ea"
msgid "\"I have to go.\""
msgstr "\"나는 가야 해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0010_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "b40c6ffa-b8f2-419d-995d-a2ea9c2e9d9d"
msgid "Remained indifferent to Bartholomew's actions."
msgstr "여전히 바솔로뮤의 행동을 신경쓰지 않았습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0010_Text
msgctxt "77ef908c-2462-4bf6-be3e-a83c1492500c"
msgid ""
"\"I don't care what you were doing here. Get back to the capital — they need "
"your help.\""
msgstr "\"네가 여기서 뭘하고 있었는지 상관하지 않아. 수도로 돌아가라. 네 도움이 필요해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0011_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "06081de1-742d-4ac4-a30d-c5fd670fd5d5"
msgid "Killed Bartholomew."
msgstr "바솔로뮤를 죽였습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0011_Text
msgctxt "136538af-492e-47cf-a50d-db29b2939121"
msgid "[Attack] \"I'm tired of you.\""
msgstr "[공격] \"너한테 지쳤어.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0012_AlignmentShift.Description
msgctxt "f2f6b90c-f456-4c5d-afb2-3bbbd5a0fea5"
msgid "Banished Bartholomew from the kingdom."
msgstr "바솔로뮤를 왕국에서 추방했습니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "6c95e9d1-5bde-4194-8e0e-068610ee3d16"
msgid "\"I'm sick of you. Get out.\""
msgstr "\"나는 너에게 질렸다. 꺼져!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Cue_0001_Text
msgctxt "9c001a3e-2d69-44cf-be0a-a84a3b14e9da"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew squeamishly brushes himself off, then performs a hasty "
"bow.{/n} \"Your Highness! Right on time, as always. Thank you for once again "
"coming to my rescue!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 신중하게 몸을 털어 내고 서둘러 인사합니다.{/n} \"전하! 언제 나처럼 제때에 와 주셨군요. 저를 한번 더 구해 "
"주셔서 감사합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Cue_0005_Text
msgctxt "39fc1fb1-f906-4f53-a13b-3a65b024f90b"
msgid ""
"\"Your Highness, as your loyal subject, I took every possible measure to "
"protect your kingdom's most valuable asset — myself! My knowledge is far too "
"important to just let it vanish upon my death. So I made the executive "
"decision to leave the walls of the capital and come here to hide from all "
"the violence in the city!\""
msgstr ""
"\"전하, 당신의 충성스런 신하로서 전 왕국에서 가장 가치있는 자산인 저를 보호하기 위한 모든 가능한 조치를 취했습니다! 제 지식은 "
"죽음으로 사라지는 것보다 훨씬 중요합니다. 그래서 저는 수도 성곽을 떠나는 중대한 결정을 내려 도시의 모든 폭력으로부터 숨을 수 "
"있었습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Cue_0006_Text
msgctxt "cd911b5f-3765-495a-b523-ebb57cfac936"
msgid ""
"{n}Bartholomew swallows a few times, then sighs.{/n} \"Forgive me, Your "
"Highness. I lied. When all... this... started, I took it for a chance to "
"gain new materials for my research. Taking advantage of the confusion, I "
"returned to where I captured my first troll...\""
msgstr ""
"{n}바솔로뮤는 몇 번 침을 삼키더니, 한숨을 쉬었습니다.{/n} \"죄송합니다. 거짓말했습니다... 이 모든 일이 시작되었을 때... "
"저는 연구를 위한 새로운 자료를 얻을 기회를 얻고자 했습니다. 그 혼란을 이용하여 제가 첫 트롤을 잡은 곳으로 돌아왔죠...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "58625700-0116-47ac-b029-bb4500ea56ac"
msgid ""
"\"...and was captured by these beasts as a result! They seriously thought "
"about cutting my face off to examine my head from the inside! Can you "
"imagine? Cruel, brainless savages!\""
msgstr ""
"\"... 그리고 그 결과 저는 이 짐승들에 의해 잡혔습니다! 그들은 내 머리를 안에서 검사하기 위해 내 얼굴을 잘라낼 생각을 진지하게 "
"했어요! 상상할 수 있겠습니까? 잔인하고 머리가 없는 야만인들!들!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Cue_0009_Text
msgctxt "bd448a6f-3e96-4000-9e64-3799e10a0238"
msgid ""
"\"Well, thank you again for your timely appearance and saving my life! I'll "
"return to the capital immediately — even a city swarming with monsters must "
"be safer than THESE dungeons.\""
msgstr ""
"\"적절하게 나타나 내 목숨을 구해주어 다시 한번 감사합니다. 저는 곧 수도로 돌아가겠습니다. 괴물들로 가득한 도시조차 이 지하 감옥보다 "
"안전할 것 같군요.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/TrollLairFW/SadistFreed/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "d2409692-7bf8-4330-9065-7c2489ca4572"
msgid ""
"\"Oh... Oh! So that's how it is, now, Your Highness? After all my loyal "
"service? Well, then, as you wish — I'll go. Farewell!\""
msgstr "\"오... 오! 어떻게 그럴수가, 전하? 충성의 결과가? 음, 그럼, 당신이 원하는 대로. 전 가겠습니다. 안녕히!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/Barks/Bark_HiddenGrave_Deny_String
msgctxt "bd8997f2-498c-4586-ac65-b107978a4e42"
msgid ""
"The soil here seems loose — if you had a shovel, it would be easy to dig up "
"the grave."
msgstr "여기 토양은 부드러워 보입니다. 삽을 가지고 있다면 무덤을 파내기가 쉬울 것입니다."

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/Barks/Bark_VarnholdFW_Guard01_String
msgctxt "262919b6-b4dc-4467-b015-f6c1c7bd7790"
msgid "\"Thank you, Your Highness. I thought I was done for!\""
msgstr "\"감사합니다. 전 이제 끝장이라고 생각했습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/Barks/Bark_VarnholdFW_Guard02_String
msgctxt "ff0f76b2-f5d1-4021-a7cb-a04dd85ec450"
msgid "\"We need to get to the fort! Varn and his squad are already there!\""
msgstr "\"요새에 가야 합니다! 반과 그의 부대가 거기에 있습니다.!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/Barks/Bark_VarnholdFW_Guard03_String
msgctxt "912d6cdb-caeb-44c7-a21f-4cb504e21100"
msgid ""
"\"Where did these cyclopes come from? I hope Baron Varn can figure it out!\""
msgstr "\"이 싸이클롭스는 어디에서 왔지? 반 남작이 해결할 수 있기를!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/Barks/Bark_VarnholdFW_ZombieCyclopAlly2_String
msgctxt "1a46aa2c-a220-4588-a3d1-0103ff32b446"
msgid ""
"\"I fought when alive; I fight while dead. All in the name of our great lord."
"\""
msgstr "\"나는 살아있을 때 싸웠다; 나는 죽고 나서도 싸운다. 우리의 위대한 군주를 위해.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/Barks/Bark_VarnholdFW_ZombieCyclopAlly3_String
msgctxt "f80e4637-c73e-4e32-b399-0105bd9b33ee"
msgid "\"Vordakai awaits you near the river. Go to our great lord.\""
msgstr "\"보다카이는 강 근처에서 너를 기다리고 있다. 우리의 위대한 군주에게 가라.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/Barks/Bark_VarnholdFW_ZombieCyclopAlly_String
msgctxt "b743a705-5b8b-4874-9daa-774214b5ce72"
msgid "\"The great lord awaits.\""
msgstr "\"위대한 군주가 기다리고 있다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "790856cf-e78c-4d3f-8d5c-5e564187cabb"
msgid "\"What's going on in Varnhold?\""
msgstr "\"반홀드에서 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Answer_0007_Text
msgctxt "be0b8a9d-d319-4ef9-a4cf-7ef0e0fb3673"
msgid "\"Where are the city guards?\""
msgstr "\"도시 경비대는 어디있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Answer_0008_Text
msgctxt "8a0f10e8-e352-470c-8b87-a8c2106116f3"
msgid "\"I need you in the capital!\""
msgstr "\"수도에서 네 도움이 필요해!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "cf9ad474-1b49-4ff0-ac2f-310bd10093e6"
msgid "\"Lead on, Maegar. Let's protect Varnhold!\""
msgstr "\"앞장 서라. 메이가르. 반홀드를 보호하자!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Barks/MaegarAttack_String
msgctxt "95a11458-dec1-47ad-ada0-91d100f2a9b8"
msgid "\"Let's go, everyone! If we survive, drinks are on me!\""
msgstr "\"가자! 모두들! 만약 우리가 살아남으면 술은 내가 산다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Barks/MaegarIdle1_String
msgctxt "1380dec0-59ed-4be5-9f2b-e64807855091"
msgid "\"Don't worry, Your Highness. We'll take care of Varnhold.\""
msgstr "\"걱정마. 우리는 반홀드를 지킬 거야.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Barks/MaegarIdle2_String
msgctxt "5e0da3a8-2ec8-45e4-8fb4-813a8f73adaa"
msgid ""
"\"I hope most of the citizens had time to hide before the cyclopes invaded.\""
msgstr "\"사이클롭스가 침입하기 전에 시민들이 숨을 시간이 있기를 바란다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Barks/MaegarIdle3_String
msgctxt "068fb1a1-da92-4e54-b2c4-c0f8cfd49015"
msgid "\"You're still here? What are you waiting for? Get to the capital!\""
msgstr "\"너 아직 여기 있어? 뭘 기다리고 있어? 수도로 가!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Barks/VordakaiDefend_String
msgctxt "b54129a0-46ef-484c-975b-1df23f471c95"
msgid "\"Come, fool. The soul jar awaits you!\""
msgstr "\"잘왔다, 멍청아. 영혼 항아리가 너를 기다린다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0003_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "c4060f0c-b4d4-4c8c-8f54-92c2a1957e1a"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Varn}Varn{/d} greets you with a broad smile.{/n} \"{name}! Glad to see "
"you with us, Your Highness! Forgive {d|c31 Maegar Saved}me{/d} for leaving "
"the capital without your permission, but I couldn't stay away when your "
"subjects needed help!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}반은 넓은 미소로 당신을 맞이합니다.{/n} \"{name}! 만나서 반갑습니다, 전하! 당신의 허락없이 수도를 떠난 {d|c31 "
"Maegar Saved}나를{/d} 용서하십시오. 하지만 당신의 백성들이 도움을 필요로 할 때 나는 멀리 떨어져 있을 수 없었습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0004_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "d50ff428-7cf2-476d-8e59-318288318007"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar stows his weapon and catches his breath.{/n} \"That was a fine "
"battle! Just like back with my old squad, when we- no, this is no time for "
"war stories. We need to save your kingdom! Let's get to the capital — we'll "
"give those invaders a hammering so good they'll roll to the {g|Pit of Gormuz}"
"Pit of Gormuz{/g}!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 무기를 들고 숨을 들이쉽니다.{/n} \"훌륭한 전투였습니다! 우리의 옛 용병단과 함께 할 때 같군, 그 때 우리가- "
"아니지, 전쟁 이야기를 할 때가 아니군요. 우리는 당신의 왕국을 구해야 합니다! 수도로 가시죠. 우리는 침략자들을 망치로 후려쳐서 {g|"
"Pit of Gormuz}고르무즈의 구덩이{/g}로 넣어버리겠습니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0010_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "4320f390-87f9-4261-9b8d-058228877799"
msgid ""
"\"Madness, is what! These dead cyclopes came out of nowhere and attacked "
"indiscriminately, then Vordakai himself appeared! The guards sent a message "
"to the capital, and they held the line this whole time. Luckily, they were "
"able to hold on until we could make it!\""
msgstr ""
"\"돌아버릴 상황이지! 죽은 사이클롭스들이 어디선가 나와 무차별하게 공격하더니, 보다카이 본인이 나타났습니다! 경비대가 수도로 전령을 "
"보냈고, 이제까지 전선을 유지했습니다. 다행히도, 그들은 우리가 도착할 때까지 버틸 수 있었고요!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0011_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "5ec81536-021e-4d0e-bc71-242352597709"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar's eyes blaze with anger.{/n} \"You can charge me with "
"disobedience, Your Highness, but I couldn't ignore their cry for help! "
"Thanks to me and those who followed, there are far fewer dead, but we still "
"need to destroy their leader!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르의 눈은 분노로 타오릅니다.{/n} \"전하, 명령 불복종으로 나를 가둘 순 있겠지만, 그들의 도움 요청을 무시할 수가 "
"없었습니다! 나와 나를 따라준 이들 덕분에 죽은 사람이 훨씬 적었지만, 우리는 여전히 그들의 지도자를 파괴해야만 합니다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0012_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "4fa210a0-8195-4d2a-bf78-625fca01ca7e"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar solemnly points to the warriors around him.{/n} \"These are all "
"that's left. Our last hope lies with you. Let's send these undead back where "
"they belong — to a deep grave!\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 엄숙하게 주위의 전사들을 가리킵니다.{/n} \"이들이 살아남은 전부입니다. 우리의 마지막 희망은 당신에게 달렸습니다. "
"이 언데드들을 그들이 속한 곳으로 다시 보냅시다. 깊은 무덤 속으로!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0013_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "f0589d59-ef2f-4ae5-b2bd-f340318fee6d"
msgid ""
"{n}{d|Varn}Maegar{/d} shakes his head.{/n} \"Not until we've freed "
"{g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g} of this false Vordakai and his cyclopes.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}{d|Varn}메이가르{/d}가 고개를 저었습니다.{/n} \"우리가 보다카이와 그의 사이클롭스들에게서 "
"{g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}를 해방할 때까지는 안됩니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0014_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "489f3feb-fb39-4dfc-8d22-b9884c83a85b"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar stands up straight, and his mouth curls into a sneer.{/n} \"Just "
"like the old days...\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르는 똑바로 서서 비틀린 미소를 짓습니다.{/n} \"옛날처럼...\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0020_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "b1e77d2e-1110-425a-9738-ff3dbf88f537"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar salutes and half-smiles.{/n} \"Just like the good old times... "
"wait, Your Highness. What's that? Over there!\""
msgstr "{n}메이가르가 반쯤 웃습니다.{/n} \"좋았던 옛날처럼... 잠깐, 신이시여, 저건 뭐지? 저기!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0021_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "464d9ca1-fb01-4a6b-a35a-9d9b5e98f958"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar can't help but smile.{/n} \"My lost friend has returned to me just "
"in time! I'll be happy to introduce you, but it'll have to wait until we've "
"dealt with this Horned Hunter, or Lantern King, or whoever he is.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 마지못해 웃습니다.{/n} \"잃어버린 친구가 때마침 돌아왔군! 기꺼이 소개해 주겠지만, 먼저 뿔난 사냥꾼이나 등불왕, "
"아니면 다른 누구든 처리한 다음이 좋겠습니다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Cue_0022_Text
#. Speaker : VarnholdFW_MaegarVarn
msgctxt "959fb881-30ca-415c-9133-0d0db106aae4"
msgid ""
"{n}Maegar grows grim.{/n} \"This is treachery... I didn't think the fey "
"possessed the power to change a person like this. Or have I been blind all "
"this time, and never noticed the snake beside me?! What a dark turn of "
"events. I have much to think about.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}메이가르는 암울한 기색이 됩니다.{/n} \"이건 배신이야... 페이가 사람을 이런 식으로 홀리는지는 몰랐다. 아니면 내가 지금까지 "
"쭉 장님이었고, 옆에서 도사리는 뱀을 눈치채지 못했던 건가?! 정말 암울하기 짝이 없군. 생각할 게 많아.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VarnAlly/Shared_VarnholdCurseLifted_String
msgctxt "e082c648-4c02-4bee-887b-05dfa2ae469a"
msgid ""
"{n}You feel like you can breathe fully again, like a heavy burden has been "
"lifted from your shoulders. Regaining control of {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g} "
"weakened the curse cast upon you!{/n}"
msgstr ""
"{n}어깨에서 무거운 짐을 들어 올린 것처럼 깊은 숨을 쉴 수 있음을 느낍니다. {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}의 통제권을 되찾자 "
"당신의 저주가 약해졌습니다!{/n}"

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Answer_0006_Text
msgctxt "c7cbd7b0-6b56-4d62-95ab-782b9f543998"
msgid "\"I was looking for you. I need your help in the capital.\""
msgstr "\"너를 찾고 있었다. 수도에서 너의 도움이 필요하다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Answer_0009_Text
msgctxt "603e5e7e-81bf-4ad8-9504-a3d99a6899e4"
msgid "\"What are you doing here?\""
msgstr "\"여기서 뭐하고 있어?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Answer_0012_Text
msgctxt "035e10b5-0970-486d-8d58-6cf132822d8a"
msgid "\"Who's defending the fort?\""
msgstr "\"누가 요새를 지키고 있지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Answer_0014_Text
msgctxt "3049ead5-fe9e-4a3b-8e5a-d23fcf8c26e6"
msgid "\"Let's finish this quickly.\""
msgstr "\"빨리 끝내자.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Barks/MaegarDefend_String
msgctxt "8c5f1f8b-1944-4742-8f3e-f4b9053171ff"
msgid ""
"\"Shoulder to shoulder, lads! Don't let these scoundrels break our ranks!\""
msgstr "\"모여라! 이 악당들이 우리 전열을 흩어버리지 않도록 하라!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Barks/VordakaiAttack_String
msgctxt "d7f32e06-523e-45e3-b4af-1b7d9101f892"
msgid "\"Tremble, worms. I am your death!\""
msgstr "\"두려움에 떨어라, 벌레들아. 나는 너의 죽음이다!\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Barks/VordakaiIdle1_String
msgctxt "84eebf1f-d967-4592-a46b-877c97be9208"
msgid "\"Hmm?\""
msgstr "\"응?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Barks/VordakaiIdle2_String
msgctxt "b79eecae-6cb4-4981-9d25-67f2f8942a3f"
msgid "\"Don't you have to be in the capital?\""
msgstr "\"너는 수도에 있어야 하지 않아?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Barks/VordakaiIdle3_String
msgctxt "bdb35782-6f88-45e6-af3a-304e25757967"
msgid "\"I will destroy the plague sweeping these lands.\""
msgstr "\"나는 이 땅을 휩쓸고 있는 전염병을 파괴할 것이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Cue_0003_Text
msgctxt "3bec1f10-c9d8-4df5-ae8a-615cfe6f641b"
msgid ""
"{n}Shaking off his false image, Vordakai towers above even the other "
"cyclopes that surround him. As you approach, he casually gestures toward "
"you.{/n} \"{name}. Why are you here?\""
msgstr ""
"{n}그의 거짓 모습을 떨쳐버린 보다카이는 주변의 다른 사이클롭스들보다 훨씬 더 눈에 띕니다. 당신이 다가가자, 그는 무심결에 당신을 "
"향해 인사 합니다.{/n} \"{name}. 왜 여기에 왔지?\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Cue_0004_Text
msgctxt "d943310e-9b82-406e-97f5-a19a55b4158e"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai brushes drops of blood from his garment.{/n} \"The final line "
"has been drawn. I am ready to return to your city. It's time to get rid of "
"those who claimed my... your land.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이는 그의 의복에서 흘러내린 피를 닦습니다.{/n} \"마지막 저항을 끝장냈군. 나는 너의 도시로 돌아갈 준비가 되었다. "
"나의... 너의 토지를 차지하려는 자들을 제거할 때가 되었다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Cue_0007_Text
msgctxt "fdab61ec-af24-4ea4-ae1c-8fcb36fa8bde"
msgid ""
"{n}The lich turns his head, and you can feel the gaze of his empty socket "
"looking right through you.{/n} \"An invasion from another world, isn't it? "
"I've heard about this before, but have never seen it personally. I still "
"need this world, so I will help you deal with this trouble.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}리치가 고개를 돌렸고, 텅 빈 눈구멍이 당신을 똑바로 쳐다보는 것을 느낄 수 있습니다.{/n} \"다른 세계에서 침입한 것이지, 안 "
"그런가? 과거에 이런 일에 대해 들어보긴 했지만, 직접 본 적은 없었다. 나는 아직도 이 세상이 필요하다. 그러니 나는 너를 도울 "
"것이다\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Cue_0008_Text
msgctxt "ec26349b-9268-4215-bab0-a05c22afbbb3"
msgid ""
"{n}Vordakai turns his head toward the river.{/n} \"But only after you help "
"me. I want to make mincemeat of this sad excuse for a baron whose {d|c31 "
"Vordakai Hired}image{/d} I assume at your court.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이는 그의 머리를 강쪽으로 돌립니다.{/n} \"그러나 네가 나를 돕는 것이 조건이다. 내가 너의 궁전에서 취하고 있는 남작 "
"{d|c31 Vordakai Hired}형상{/d}을 위해 그 형편없는 것들을 묵사발로 만들고 싶다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Cue_0010_Text
msgctxt "7b984575-5d2d-41dd-8c40-9d58bb7d923d"
msgid ""
"{n}The skin on Vordakai's face tightens, as though he's trying to sneer, but "
"his features remain still.{/n} \"I'm completing what I started on the day of "
"my awakening.\""
msgstr ""
"{n}보다카이의 얼굴 피부가 마치 비웃으려는 듯 당겨지지만, 그의 표정은 그대로입니다.{/n} \"나는 내가 깨어난 날부터 시작했던 일을 "
"끝내겠다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Cue_0011_Text
msgctxt "79cb75ec-b612-4ea7-a7cd-93e1ef70b6cc"
msgid ""
"\"When the turmoil began, I went away — where once the cities of my people "
"were towering. Where a great empire will one day be restored. Where there is "
"no place for a nest of thieves and bandits. I summoned ancient warriors and "
"lay siege on {g|Varnhold}Varnhold{/g}. All that is left is to break the "
"fort's defense.\""
msgstr ""
"\"혼란이 시작된 뒤, 나는 한때 내 백성들의 도시가 우뚝 솟아 있던 곳으로 갔다. 언젠가 위대한 제국이 복구될 곳, 도둑과 도적의 "
"안식처가 없는 곳 말이다. 나는 고대의 전사들을 소환해서 {g|Varnhold}반홀드{/g}를 포위했다. 남은 일은 요새의 수비를 "
"무너뜨리는 것뿐이다.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Cue_0013_Text
msgctxt "295d6c0a-fc90-46d5-af2a-f580b68d3f3e"
msgid ""
"\"This nobody, {d|Varn}Maegar Varn{/d} and his henchmen. Or rather, not they "
"but fakes born by strange magic who consider themselves true mortals. "
"Doesn't matter, I will destroy all of them, once and for all.\""
msgstr ""
"\"이 버러지, 메이가르 반과 그의 부하들이다. 아니, 그들 본인이 아니라 이상한 마법에 의해 태어난, 자기들이 진짜 필멸자라고 생각하는 "
"가짜들일지도. 상관 없다. 나는 그것들 전부를 한꺼번에 파괴할 것이니.\""

#. Mechanics/Blueprints/World/Dialogs/c71/VarnholdFW/VordakaiAlly/Cue_0018_Text
msgctxt "2d6d8f8e-6306-4384-a069-eaf96d536fc5"
msgid "\"Let's go, my servants! Trample our enemies!\""
msgstr "\"가라, 나의 종들이여! 우리의 적들을 짓밟아라!\""
